{"doc_id": "9_7056224352160949789", "text": "on.<td><tr><tr class=\"\"><td id=\"compiler-36\">36<td><td>Unexpected custom directive on <slot> outlet.<td><tr><tr class=\"\"><td id=\"compiler-37\">37<td><td>Mixed v-slot usage on both the component and nested <template>. When there are multiple named slots, all slots should use <template> syntax to avoid scope ambiguity.<td><tr><tr class=\"\"><td id=\"compiler-38\">38<td><td>Duplicate slot names found.", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/error-reference/", "title": "生产环境错误代码参考", "doc_id": "a7512df1c1274172888fbf8b0031b836", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 574, "chunk_index": 9, "_doc_id": "9_7056224352160949789"}}
