{"doc_id": "0_7489559592999158515", "text": "<div><div class=\"VPContentPage\"><main><div><div><div class=\"ThemePage\"><div class=\"ThemeHero\"><div class=\"container\"><h1 class=\"title\">主题<h1><p class=\"lead\">查看主题、UI Kits 和插件。你可以看到我们的合作伙伴是如何用 Vue 构建一个真实世界的应用。<p><div><div><div class=\"ThemeList\"><div class=\"container\"><div class=\"item\"><section class=\"ThemeListItem\"><h2 class=\"title\">Nuxt UI<h2><p class=\"description\"><a href=\"https://ui.nuxt.com/\" class=\"link\" target=\"_blank\">Nuxt UI<a> is an intuitive, open-source UI library for Vue and Nuxt applications.", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/ecosystem/themes.html", "title": "Vue.js", "doc_id": "b24fee633a2748fdad2b836485b0ad46", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 270, "chunk_index": 0, "_doc_id": "0_7489559592999158515"}}
