{"doc_id": "4_4965355213646840017", "text": "mment.<td><tr><tr class=\"\"><td id=\"compiler-17\">17<td><td>Attribute name cannot contain U+0022 (\"), U+0027 ('), and U+003C (<).<td><tr><tr class=\"\"><td id=\"compiler-18\">18<td><td>Unquoted attribute value cannot contain U+0022 (\"), U+0027 ('), U+003C (<), U+003D (=), and U+0060 (`).<td><tr><tr class=\"\"><td id=\"compiler-19\">19<td><td>Attribute name cannot start with '='.<td><tr><tr class=\"\"><td id=\"compiler-20\">20<td><td>Unexpected null character.", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/error-reference/", "title": "生产环境错误代码参考", "doc_id": "9e22d83b81a949cb8d2544213c89d646", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 574, "chunk_index": 4, "_doc_id": "4_4965355213646840017"}}
{"doc_id": "5_1357983143535194512", "text": "cannot start with '='.<td><tr><tr class=\"\"><td id=\"compiler-20\">20<td><td>Unexpected null character.<td><tr><tr class=\"\"><td id=\"compiler-21\">21<td><td>'<?' is allowed only in XML context.<td><tr><tr class=\"\"><td id=\"compiler-22\">22<td><td>Illegal '/' in tags.<td><tr><tr class=\"\"><td id=\"compiler-23\">23<td><td>Invalid end tag.<td><tr><tr class=\"\"><td id=\"compiler-24\">24<td><td>Element is missing end tag.<td><tr><tr class=\"\"><td id=\"compiler-25\">25<td><td>Interpolation end sign was not found.", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/error-reference/", "title": "生产环境错误代码参考", "doc_id": "9e22d83b81a949cb8d2544213c89d646", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 574, "chunk_index": 5, "_doc_id": "5_1357983143535194512"}}
