{"doc_id": "0_6770234215924057058", "text": "<div><div><p>社区有许多优秀的新闻简报 / Vue 相关博客，他们会为你带来 Vue 生态系统中最新的消息和动态。以下是我们收集到的一份较为活跃的不完全列表：<p><p>如果你还知道其他优秀的内容，请使用<a href=\"https://github.com/vuejs/docs/edit/main/src/ecosystem/newsletters.md\" target=\"_blank\">该链接<a>提交一个 pull request！<p><div><div>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/ecosystem/newsletters", "title": "社区新闻简报", "doc_id": "38e92644f5c145748bbf8d01bc7e2d7c", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 10, "chunk_index": 0, "_doc_id": "0_6770234215924057058"}}
{"doc_id": "0_7489559592999158515", "text": "<div><div class=\"VPContentPage\"><main><div><div><div class=\"ThemePage\"><div class=\"ThemeHero\"><div class=\"container\"><h1 class=\"title\">主题<h1><p class=\"lead\">查看主题、UI Kits 和插件。你可以看到我们的合作伙伴是如何用 Vue 构建一个真实世界的应用。<p><div><div><div class=\"ThemeList\"><div class=\"container\"><div class=\"item\"><section class=\"ThemeListItem\"><h2 class=\"title\">Nuxt UI<h2><p class=\"description\"><a href=\"https://ui.nuxt.com/\" class=\"link\" target=\"_blank\">Nuxt UI<a> is an intuitive, open-source UI library for Vue and Nuxt applications.", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/ecosystem/themes.html", "title": "Vue.js", "doc_id": "138054ac61b04e279086060f00d896cc", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 270, "chunk_index": 0, "_doc_id": "0_7489559592999158515"}}
{"doc_id": "1_8514060215786243638", "text": "\" target=\"_blank\">Nuxt UI<a> is an intuitive, open-source UI library for Vue and Nuxt applications. Built with Tailwind CSS and Reka UI, it provides 100+ beautifully crafted, accessible components with a flexible CSS-first design system.<p><section><div><div class=\"item\"><section class=\"ThemeListItem\"><h2 class=\"title\">Creative Tim<h2><p class=\"description\">通过下面由我们的合作伙伴 <a href=\"https://creative-tim.com?affiliate_id=116187\" class=\"link\" target=\"_blank\">Creative Tim<a> 建立的例子，你可以看到一个真实世界的应用是如何建立的，它背后的技术栈，", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/ecosystem/themes.html", "title": "Vue.js", "doc_id": "138054ac61b04e279086060f00d896cc", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 270, "chunk_index": 1, "_doc_id": "1_8514060215786243638"}}
{"doc_id": "2_1353045459065822614", "text": "ffiliate_id=116187\" class=\"link\" target=\"_blank\">Creative Tim<a> 建立的例子，你可以看到一个真实世界的应用是如何建立的，它背后的技术栈，以及你迄今为止学到的大多数概念是如何应用于真实世界的应用。<p><section><div><div class=\"item\"><section class=\"ThemeListItem\"><h2 class=\"title\">MDBootstrap<h2><p class=\"description\">查看下面由我们的合作伙伴 <a href=\"https://mdbootstrap.com/?utm_ref_id=82665\" class=\"link\" target=\"_blank\">MDBootstrap<a> 构建的主题、UI 工具包和插件，了解如何在专业项目中使用 Vue 以及 Bootstrap 等技术。模板和现成的组件可以使你的开发更快、更高效。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/ecosystem/themes.html", "title": "Vue.js", "doc_id": "138054ac61b04e279086060f00d896cc", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 270, "chunk_index": 2, "_doc_id": "2_1353045459065822614"}}
