{"doc_id": "42_6184056297628355174", "text": "hor\" href=\"#splitting-up-the-modules\">​<a><h3><p>随着对这份指南的逐步深入，我们可能需要将代码分割成单独的 JavaScript 文件，以便更容易管理。例如：<p><div class=\"vp-code-block-title\"><p class=\"vp-code-block-title-bar\"><span class=\"vp-code-block-title-text\">index.html<span><p><div class=\"language-html\"> <span class=\"lang\">html<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>div<span><span> id<span><span>=<span><span>\"app\"<span><span>></<span><span>div<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/quick-start.html", "title": "快速上手", "doc_id": "67f18a7c6c2e43af890fc1973d75f794", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 917, "chunk_index": 42, "_doc_id": "42_6184056297628355174"}}
