{"doc_id": "11_6641687466734257689", "text": "r <template> tags.<td><tr><tr class=\"\"><td id=\"compiler-41\">41<td><td>v-model is missing expression.<td><tr><tr class=\"\"><td id=\"compiler-42\">42<td><td>v-model value must be a valid JavaScript member expression.<td><tr><tr class=\"\"><td id=\"compiler-43\">43<td><td>v-model cannot be used on v-for or v-slot scope variables because they are not writable.<td><tr><tr class=\"\"><td id=\"compiler-44\">44<td><td>v-model cannot be used on a prop, because local prop bindings are not writable.", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/error-reference/", "title": "生产环境错误代码参考", "doc_id": "7a236724b5004177a5e61a7ec1f9a708", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 574, "chunk_index": 11, "_doc_id": "11_6641687466734257689"}}
{"doc_id": "12_4180704424972252414", "text": "piler-44\">44<td><td>v-model cannot be used on a prop, because local prop bindings are not writable.\nUse a v-bind binding combined with a v-on listener that emits update:x event instead.<td><tr><tr class=\"\"><td id=\"compiler-45\">45<td><td>v-model cannot be used on a const binding because it is not writable.<td><tr><tr class=\"\"><td id=\"compiler-46\">46<td><td>Error parsing JavaScript expression: <td><tr><tr class=\"\"><td id=\"compiler-47\">47<td><td><KeepAlive> expects exactly one child component.", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/error-reference/", "title": "生产环境错误代码参考", "doc_id": "7a236724b5004177a5e61a7ec1f9a708", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 574, "chunk_index": 12, "_doc_id": "12_4180704424972252414"}}
{"doc_id": "13_5362203888061520969", "text": "<td><tr><tr class=\"\"><td id=\"compiler-47\">47<td><td><KeepAlive> expects exactly one child component.<td><tr><tr class=\"\"><td id=\"compiler-48\">48<td><td>\"prefixIdentifiers\" option is not supported in this build of compiler.<td><tr><tr class=\"\"><td id=\"compiler-49\">49<td><td>ES module mode is not supported in this build of compiler.<td><tr><tr class=\"\"><td id=\"compiler-50\">50<td><td>\"cacheHandlers\" option is only supported when the \"prefixIdentifiers\" option is enabled.", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/error-reference/", "title": "生产环境错误代码参考", "doc_id": "7a236724b5004177a5e61a7ec1f9a708", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 574, "chunk_index": 13, "_doc_id": "13_5362203888061520969"}}
{"doc_id": "14_2444448802200004234", "text": "\">50<td><td>\"cacheHandlers\" option is only supported when the \"prefixIdentifiers\" option is enabled.<td><tr><tr class=\"\"><td id=\"compiler-51\">51<td><td>\"scopeId\" option is only supported in module mode.<td><tr><tr class=\"\"><td id=\"compiler-52\">52<td><td>@vnode-* hooks in templates are no longer supported. Use the vue: prefix instead. For example, @vnode-mounted should be changed to @vue:mounted. @vnode-* hooks support has been removed in 3.4.", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/error-reference/", "title": "生产环境错误代码参考", "doc_id": "7a236724b5004177a5e61a7ec1f9a708", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 574, "chunk_index": 14, "_doc_id": "14_2444448802200004234"}}
{"doc_id": "15_5212026858492394416", "text": "e, @vnode-mounted should be changed to @vue:mounted. @vnode-* hooks support has been removed in 3.4.<td><tr><tr class=\"\"><td id=\"compiler-53\">53<td><td>v-bind with same-name shorthand only allows static argument.<td><tr><tr class=\"\"><td id=\"compiler-54\">54<td><td>v-html is missing expression.<td><tr><tr class=\"\"><td id=\"compiler-55\">55<td><td>v-html will override element children.<td><tr><tr class=\"\"><td id=\"compiler-56\">56<td><td>v-text is missing expression.", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/error-reference/", "title": "生产环境错误代码参考", "doc_id": "7a236724b5004177a5e61a7ec1f9a708", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 574, "chunk_index": 15, "_doc_id": "15_5212026858492394416"}}
{"doc_id": "16_1253281170134259634", "text": "e element children.<td><tr><tr class=\"\"><td id=\"compiler-56\">56<td><td>v-text is missing expression.<td><tr><tr class=\"\"><td id=\"compiler-57\">57<td><td>v-text will override element children.<td><tr><tr class=\"\"><td id=\"compiler-58\">58<td><td>v-model can only be used on <input>,", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/error-reference/", "title": "生产环境错误代码参考", "doc_id": "7a236724b5004177a5e61a7ec1f9a708", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 574, "chunk_index": 16, "_doc_id": "16_1253281170134259634"}}
{"doc_id": "17_8741135101630580753", "text": "t children.<td><tr><tr class=\"\"><td id=\"compiler-58\">58<td><td>v-model can only be used on <input>, <textarea> and <select> elements.<td><tr><tr class=\"\"><td id=\"compiler-59\">59<td><td>v-model argument is not supported on plain elements.<td><tr><tr class=\"\"><td id=\"compiler-60\">60<td><td>v-model cannot be used on file inputs since they are read-only. Use a v-on:change listener instead.<td><tr><tr class=\"\"><td id=\"compiler-61\">61<td><td>Unnecessary value binding used alongside v-model.", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/error-reference/", "title": "生产环境错误代码参考", "doc_id": "7a236724b5004177a5e61a7ec1f9a708", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 574, "chunk_index": 17, "_doc_id": "17_8741135101630580753"}}
{"doc_id": "18_1027317703492061164", "text": "d><tr><tr class=\"\"><td id=\"compiler-61\">61<td><td>Unnecessary value binding used alongside v-model. It will interfere with v-model's behavior.<td><tr><tr class=\"\"><td id=\"compiler-62\">62<td><td>v-show is missing expression.<td><tr><tr class=\"\"><td id=\"compiler-63\">63<td><td><Transition> expects exactly one child element or component.<td><tr><tr class=\"\"><td id=\"compiler-64\">64<td><td>Tags with side effect (<script> and <style>) are ignored in client component templates.<td><tr><tbody><div>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/error-reference/", "title": "生产环境错误代码参考", "doc_id": "7a236724b5004177a5e61a7ec1f9a708", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 574, "chunk_index": 18, "_doc_id": "18_1027317703492061164"}}
