{"doc_id": "44_5071782666120257595", "text": "MyComponent <span><span>from<span><span> './my-component.js'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> createApp<span><span>(MyComponent).<span><span>mount<span><span>(<span><span>'#app'<span><span>)<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/quick-start", "title": "快速上手", "doc_id": "7dec29d3142c41a8ba4c8d4c9f3e2b26", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 917, "chunk_index": 44, "_doc_id": "44_5071782666120257595"}}
{"doc_id": "45_4743042264438322217", "text": "<span><span>(MyComponent).<span><span>mount<span><span>(<span><span>'#app'<span><span>)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>script<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><div><div class=\"options-api\"><div class=\"vp-code-block-title\"><p class=\"vp-code-block-title-bar\"><span class=\"vp-code-block-title-text\">my-component.js<span><p><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/quick-start", "title": "快速上手", "doc_id": "7dec29d3142c41a8ba4c8d4c9f3e2b26", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 917, "chunk_index": 45, "_doc_id": "45_4743042264438322217"}}
{"doc_id": "46_8448299300862641108", "text": "b-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> data<span><span>() {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> return<span><span> { count: <span><span>0<span><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> },<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> template: <span><span>`<div>Count is: {{ count }}</div>`<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/quick-start", "title": "快速上手", "doc_id": "7dec29d3142c41a8ba4c8d4c9f3e2b26", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 917, "chunk_index": 46, "_doc_id": "46_8448299300862641108"}}
{"doc_id": "47_6456473332432435479", "text": "pan>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> template: <span><span>`<div>Count is: {{ count }}</div>`<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span><code><pre><div><div><div><div class=\"composition-api\"><div class=\"vp-code-block-title\"><p class=\"vp-code-block-title-bar\"><span class=\"vp-code-block-title-text\">my-component.js<span><p><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>import<span><span> { ref } <span><span>from<span><span> 'vue'<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/quick-start", "title": "快速上手", "doc_id": "7dec29d3142c41a8ba4c8d4c9f3e2b26", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 917, "chunk_index": 47, "_doc_id": "47_6456473332432435479"}}
{"doc_id": "48_6194872551162012715", "text": "><span class=\"line\"><span>import<span><span> { ref } <span><span>from<span><span> 'vue'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> setup<span><span>() {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> const<span><span> count<span><span> =<span><span> ref<span><span>(<span><span>0<span><span>)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> return<span><span> { count }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> },<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/quick-start", "title": "快速上手", "doc_id": "7dec29d3142c41a8ba4c8d4c9f3e2b26", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 917, "chunk_index": 48, "_doc_id": "48_6194872551162012715"}}
{"doc_id": "49_3568117848921817708", "text": "ass=\"line\"><span> return<span><span> { count }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> },<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> template: <span><span>`<div>Count is: {{ count }}</div>`<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span><code><pre><div><div><div><p>如果直接在浏览器中打开了上面的 <code>index.html<code>，你会发现它抛出了一个错误，因为 ES 模块不能通过 <code>file://<code> 协议工作，也即是当你打开一个本地文件时浏览器使用的协议。<p><p>由于安全原因，ES 模块只能通过 <code>http://<code> 协议工作，也即是浏览器在打开网页时使用的协议。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/quick-start", "title": "快速上手", "doc_id": "7dec29d3142c41a8ba4c8d4c9f3e2b26", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 917, "chunk_index": 49, "_doc_id": "49_3568117848921817708"}}
{"doc_id": "50_3379906242444685030", "text": "code> 协议工作，也即是当你打开一个本地文件时浏览器使用的协议。<p><p>由于安全原因，ES 模块只能通过 <code>http://<code> 协议工作，也即是浏览器在打开网页时使用的协议。为了使 ES 模块在我们的本地机器上工作，我们需要使用本地的 HTTP 服务器，通过 <code>http://<code> 协议来提供 <code>index.html<code>。<p><p>要启动一个本地的 HTTP 服务器，请先安装 <a href=\"https://nodejs.org/zh/\" target=\"_blank\">Node.js<a>，然后通过命令行在 HTML 文件所在文件夹下运行 <code>npx serve<code>。你也可以使用其他任何可以基于正确的 MIME 类型服务静态文件的 HTTP 服务器。<p><p>可能你也注意到了，这里导入的组件模板是内联的 JavaScript 字符串。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/quick-start", "title": "快速上手", "doc_id": "7dec29d3142c41a8ba4c8d4c9f3e2b26", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 917, "chunk_index": 50, "_doc_id": "50_3379906242444685030"}}
{"doc_id": "51_3293000054680122111", "text": "x serve<code>。你也可以使用其他任何可以基于正确的 MIME 类型服务静态文件的 HTTP 服务器。<p><p>可能你也注意到了，这里导入的组件模板是内联的 JavaScript 字符串。如果你正在使用 VS Code，你可以安装 <a href=\"https://marketplace.visualstudio.com/items?itemName=Tobermory.es6-string-html\" target=\"_blank\">es6-string-html<a> 扩展，然后在字符串前加上一个前缀注释 <code>/*html*/<code> 以高亮语法。<p><h2 id=\"next-steps\">下一步 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#next-steps\">​<a><h2><p>如果你尚未阅读<a href=\"/guide/introduction.html\">简介<a>，我们强烈推荐你在移步到后续文档之前返回去阅读一下。<p><div><div>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/quick-start", "title": "快速上手", "doc_id": "7dec29d3142c41a8ba4c8d4c9f3e2b26", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 917, "chunk_index": 51, "_doc_id": "51_3293000054680122111"}}
{"doc_id": "0_7489559592999158515", "text": "<div><div class=\"VPContentPage\"><main><div><div><div class=\"ThemePage\"><div class=\"ThemeHero\"><div class=\"container\"><h1 class=\"title\">主题<h1><p class=\"lead\">查看主题、UI Kits 和插件。你可以看到我们的合作伙伴是如何用 Vue 构建一个真实世界的应用。<p><div><div><div class=\"ThemeList\"><div class=\"container\"><div class=\"item\"><section class=\"ThemeListItem\"><h2 class=\"title\">Nuxt UI<h2><p class=\"description\"><a href=\"https://ui.nuxt.com/\" class=\"link\" target=\"_blank\">Nuxt UI<a> is an intuitive, open-source UI library for Vue and Nuxt applications.", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/ecosystem/themes.html", "title": "Vue.js", "doc_id": "e97f577b82e74544bb05909e55813b36", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 270, "chunk_index": 0, "_doc_id": "0_7489559592999158515"}}
{"doc_id": "1_8514060215786243638", "text": "\" target=\"_blank\">Nuxt UI<a> is an intuitive, open-source UI library for Vue and Nuxt applications. Built with Tailwind CSS and Reka UI, it provides 100+ beautifully crafted, accessible components with a flexible CSS-first design system.<p><section><div><div class=\"item\"><section class=\"ThemeListItem\"><h2 class=\"title\">Creative Tim<h2><p class=\"description\">通过下面由我们的合作伙伴 <a href=\"https://creative-tim.com?affiliate_id=116187\" class=\"link\" target=\"_blank\">Creative Tim<a> 建立的例子，你可以看到一个真实世界的应用是如何建立的，它背后的技术栈，", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/ecosystem/themes.html", "title": "Vue.js", "doc_id": "e97f577b82e74544bb05909e55813b36", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 270, "chunk_index": 1, "_doc_id": "1_8514060215786243638"}}
{"doc_id": "2_1353045459065822614", "text": "ffiliate_id=116187\" class=\"link\" target=\"_blank\">Creative Tim<a> 建立的例子，你可以看到一个真实世界的应用是如何建立的，它背后的技术栈，以及你迄今为止学到的大多数概念是如何应用于真实世界的应用。<p><section><div><div class=\"item\"><section class=\"ThemeListItem\"><h2 class=\"title\">MDBootstrap<h2><p class=\"description\">查看下面由我们的合作伙伴 <a href=\"https://mdbootstrap.com/?utm_ref_id=82665\" class=\"link\" target=\"_blank\">MDBootstrap<a> 构建的主题、UI 工具包和插件，了解如何在专业项目中使用 Vue 以及 Bootstrap 等技术。模板和现成的组件可以使你的开发更快、更高效。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/ecosystem/themes.html", "title": "Vue.js", "doc_id": "e97f577b82e74544bb05909e55813b36", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 270, "chunk_index": 2, "_doc_id": "2_1353045459065822614"}}
{"doc_id": "3_2926646658943480239", "text": "get=\"_blank\">MDBootstrap<a> 构建的主题、UI 工具包和插件，了解如何在专业项目中使用 Vue 以及 Bootstrap 等技术。模板和现成的组件可以使你的开发更快、更高效。<p><section><div><div class=\"item\"><section class=\"ThemeListItem\"><h2 class=\"title\">PrimeVue<h2><p class=\"description\">开源 UI 组件库 <a href=\"https://www.primefaces.org/primevue/?af_id=4218\" class=\"link\" target=\"_blank\">PrimeVue<a> 提供了超过 90 个灵活的组件来构建你的应用！他们有大量不同的组件主题和应用模板，以获得最适合你的外观和感受。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/ecosystem/themes.html", "title": "Vue.js", "doc_id": "e97f577b82e74544bb05909e55813b36", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 270, "chunk_index": 3, "_doc_id": "3_2926646658943480239"}}
{"doc_id": "4_8493355428180853922", "text": "18\" class=\"link\" target=\"_blank\">PrimeVue<a> 提供了超过 90 个灵活的组件来构建你的应用！他们有大量不同的组件主题和应用模板，以获得最适合你的外观和感受。<p><section><div><div class=\"item\"><section class=\"ThemeListItem\"><h2 class=\"title\">Flatlogic<h2><p class=\"description\">看看我们来自 <a href=\"https://flatlogic.com/templates?ref=x-fdkuTAVW\" class=\"link\" target=\"_blank\">Flatlogic<a> 的合作伙伴建立的管理仪表板模板。通过这些主题，你可以看到真正的应用是如何建立的。此外，这些模板将帮助你开始一个新的应用，并节省你的时间和金钱。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/ecosystem/themes.html", "title": "Vue.js", "doc_id": "e97f577b82e74544bb05909e55813b36", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 270, "chunk_index": 4, "_doc_id": "4_8493355428180853922"}}
