{"doc_id": "41_5095124682154216942", "text": "les/pen/YzRyRYM\" target=\"_blank\">CodePen 示例 ><a><p><div><p>你也可以在映射表中添加其他的依赖——但请务必确保你使用的是该库的 ES 模块版本。<p><div class=\"tip custom-block\"><p class=\"custom-block-title\">导入映射表的浏览器支持情况<p><p>导入映射表是一个相对较新的浏览器功能。请确保使用其<a href=\"https://caniuse.com/import-maps\" target=\"_blank\">支持范围<a>内的浏览器。请注意，只有 Safari 16.4 以上版本支持。<p><div><h3 id=\"splitting-up-the-modules\">拆分模块 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#splitting-up-the-modules\">​<a><h3><p>随着对这份指南的逐步深入，我们可能需要将代码分割成单独的 JavaScript 文件，以便更容易管理。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/quick-start", "title": "快速上手", "doc_id": "3d2ac59e2736448cb61eb5ef884c5755", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 917, "chunk_index": 41, "_doc_id": "41_5095124682154216942"}}
{"doc_id": "42_6184056297628355174", "text": "hor\" href=\"#splitting-up-the-modules\">​<a><h3><p>随着对这份指南的逐步深入，我们可能需要将代码分割成单独的 JavaScript 文件，以便更容易管理。例如：<p><div class=\"vp-code-block-title\"><p class=\"vp-code-block-title-bar\"><span class=\"vp-code-block-title-text\">index.html<span><p><div class=\"language-html\"> <span class=\"lang\">html<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>div<span><span> id<span><span>=<span><span>\"app\"<span><span>></<span><span>div<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/quick-start", "title": "快速上手", "doc_id": "3d2ac59e2736448cb61eb5ef884c5755", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 917, "chunk_index": 42, "_doc_id": "42_6184056297628355174"}}
{"doc_id": "43_6171243072278488484", "text": "=<span><span>\"app\"<span><span>></<span><span>div<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>script<span><span> type<span><span>=<span><span>\"module\"<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> import<span><span> { createApp } <span><span>from<span><span> 'vue'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> import<span><span> MyComponent <span><span>from<span><span> './my-component.js'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/quick-start", "title": "快速上手", "doc_id": "3d2ac59e2736448cb61eb5ef884c5755", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 917, "chunk_index": 43, "_doc_id": "43_6171243072278488484"}}
{"doc_id": "44_5071782666120257595", "text": "MyComponent <span><span>from<span><span> './my-component.js'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> createApp<span><span>(MyComponent).<span><span>mount<span><span>(<span><span>'#app'<span><span>)<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/quick-start", "title": "快速上手", "doc_id": "3d2ac59e2736448cb61eb5ef884c5755", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 917, "chunk_index": 44, "_doc_id": "44_5071782666120257595"}}
{"doc_id": "45_4743042264438322217", "text": "<span><span>(MyComponent).<span><span>mount<span><span>(<span><span>'#app'<span><span>)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>script<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><div><div class=\"options-api\"><div class=\"vp-code-block-title\"><p class=\"vp-code-block-title-bar\"><span class=\"vp-code-block-title-text\">my-component.js<span><p><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/quick-start", "title": "快速上手", "doc_id": "3d2ac59e2736448cb61eb5ef884c5755", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 917, "chunk_index": 45, "_doc_id": "45_4743042264438322217"}}
{"doc_id": "46_8448299300862641108", "text": "b-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> data<span><span>() {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> return<span><span> { count: <span><span>0<span><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> },<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> template: <span><span>`<div>Count is: {{ count }}</div>`<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/quick-start", "title": "快速上手", "doc_id": "3d2ac59e2736448cb61eb5ef884c5755", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 917, "chunk_index": 46, "_doc_id": "46_8448299300862641108"}}
{"doc_id": "47_6456473332432435479", "text": "pan>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> template: <span><span>`<div>Count is: {{ count }}</div>`<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span><code><pre><div><div><div><div class=\"composition-api\"><div class=\"vp-code-block-title\"><p class=\"vp-code-block-title-bar\"><span class=\"vp-code-block-title-text\">my-component.js<span><p><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>import<span><span> { ref } <span><span>from<span><span> 'vue'<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/quick-start", "title": "快速上手", "doc_id": "3d2ac59e2736448cb61eb5ef884c5755", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 917, "chunk_index": 47, "_doc_id": "47_6456473332432435479"}}
{"doc_id": "48_6194872551162012715", "text": "><span class=\"line\"><span>import<span><span> { ref } <span><span>from<span><span> 'vue'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> setup<span><span>() {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> const<span><span> count<span><span> =<span><span> ref<span><span>(<span><span>0<span><span>)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> return<span><span> { count }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> },<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/quick-start", "title": "快速上手", "doc_id": "3d2ac59e2736448cb61eb5ef884c5755", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 917, "chunk_index": 48, "_doc_id": "48_6194872551162012715"}}
{"doc_id": "49_3568117848921817708", "text": "ass=\"line\"><span> return<span><span> { count }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> },<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> template: <span><span>`<div>Count is: {{ count }}</div>`<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span><code><pre><div><div><div><p>如果直接在浏览器中打开了上面的 <code>index.html<code>，你会发现它抛出了一个错误，因为 ES 模块不能通过 <code>file://<code> 协议工作，也即是当你打开一个本地文件时浏览器使用的协议。<p><p>由于安全原因，ES 模块只能通过 <code>http://<code> 协议工作，也即是浏览器在打开网页时使用的协议。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/quick-start", "title": "快速上手", "doc_id": "3d2ac59e2736448cb61eb5ef884c5755", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 917, "chunk_index": 49, "_doc_id": "49_3568117848921817708"}}
{"doc_id": "50_3379906242444685030", "text": "code> 协议工作，也即是当你打开一个本地文件时浏览器使用的协议。<p><p>由于安全原因，ES 模块只能通过 <code>http://<code> 协议工作，也即是浏览器在打开网页时使用的协议。为了使 ES 模块在我们的本地机器上工作，我们需要使用本地的 HTTP 服务器，通过 <code>http://<code> 协议来提供 <code>index.html<code>。<p><p>要启动一个本地的 HTTP 服务器，请先安装 <a href=\"https://nodejs.org/zh/\" target=\"_blank\">Node.js<a>，然后通过命令行在 HTML 文件所在文件夹下运行 <code>npx serve<code>。你也可以使用其他任何可以基于正确的 MIME 类型服务静态文件的 HTTP 服务器。<p><p>可能你也注意到了，这里导入的组件模板是内联的 JavaScript 字符串。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/quick-start", "title": "快速上手", "doc_id": "3d2ac59e2736448cb61eb5ef884c5755", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 917, "chunk_index": 50, "_doc_id": "50_3379906242444685030"}}
{"doc_id": "51_3293000054680122111", "text": "x serve<code>。你也可以使用其他任何可以基于正确的 MIME 类型服务静态文件的 HTTP 服务器。<p><p>可能你也注意到了，这里导入的组件模板是内联的 JavaScript 字符串。如果你正在使用 VS Code，你可以安装 <a href=\"https://marketplace.visualstudio.com/items?itemName=Tobermory.es6-string-html\" target=\"_blank\">es6-string-html<a> 扩展，然后在字符串前加上一个前缀注释 <code>/*html*/<code> 以高亮语法。<p><h2 id=\"next-steps\">下一步 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#next-steps\">​<a><h2><p>如果你尚未阅读<a href=\"/guide/introduction.html\">简介<a>，我们强烈推荐你在移步到后续文档之前返回去阅读一下。<p><div><div>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/quick-start", "title": "快速上手", "doc_id": "3d2ac59e2736448cb61eb5ef884c5755", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 917, "chunk_index": 51, "_doc_id": "51_3293000054680122111"}}
{"doc_id": "0_8739093793548807926", "text": "<div><div><h1 id=\"quick-start\">快速上手 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#quick-start\">​<a><h1><h2 id=\"try-vue-online\">线上尝试 Vue <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#try-vue-online\">​<a><h2><ul><li><p>想要快速体验 Vue，你可以直接试试我们的<a href=\"https://play.vuejs.org/#eNo9jcEKwjAMhl/lt5fpQYfXUQfefAMvvRQbddC1pUuHUPrudg4HIcmXjyRZXEM4zYlEJ+T0iEPgXjn6BB8Zhp46WUZWDjCa9f6w9kAkTtH9CRinV4fmRtZ63H20Ztesqiylphqy3R5UYBqD1UyVAPk+9zkvV1CKbCv9poMLiTEfR2/IXpSoXomqZLtti/IFwVtA9A==\" target=\"_blank\">演练场<a>。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/quick-start", "title": "快速上手", "doc_id": "31fc3e24d5574547bc3f8a3e6ed99e74", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 917, "chunk_index": 0, "_doc_id": "0_8739093793548807926"}}
{"doc_id": "1_6144195614111674483", "text": "tesqiylphqy3R5UYBqD1UyVAPk+9zkvV1CKbCv9poMLiTEfR2/IXpSoXomqZLtti/IFwVtA9A==\" target=\"_blank\">演练场<a>。<p><li><li><p>如果你更喜欢不用任何构建的原始 HTML，可以使用 <a href=\"https://jsfiddle.net/yyx990803/2ke1ab0z/\" target=\"_blank\">JSFiddle<a> 入门。<p><li><li><p>如果你已经比较熟悉 Node.js 和构建工具等概念，还可以直接在浏览器中打开 <a href=\"https://vite.new/vue\" target=\"_blank\">StackBlitz<a> 来尝试完整的构建设置。<p><li><li><p>要了解推荐的设置流程，请观看这个互动式 <a href=\"http://scrimba.com/links/vue-quickstart\" target=\"_blank\">Scrimba<a> 教程，它将向你展示如何运行、编辑和部署你的第一个 Vue 应用程序。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/quick-start", "title": "快速上手", "doc_id": "31fc3e24d5574547bc3f8a3e6ed99e74", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 917, "chunk_index": 1, "_doc_id": "1_6144195614111674483"}}
{"doc_id": "2_2540524441130061551", "text": "tp://scrimba.com/links/vue-quickstart\" target=\"_blank\">Scrimba<a> 教程，它将向你展示如何运行、编辑和部署你的第一个 Vue 应用程序。<p><li><ul><h2 id=\"creating-a-vue-application\">创建一个 Vue 应用 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#creating-a-vue-application\">​<a><h2><div class=\"tip custom-block\"><p class=\"custom-block-title\">前提条件<p><ul><li>熟悉命令行<li><li>已安装 <code>^20.19.0 || >=22.12.0<code> 版本的 <a href=\"https://nodejs.org/\" target=\"_blank\">Node.js<a><li><ul><div><p>在本节中，我们将介绍如何在本地搭建 Vue <a href=\"/guide/extras/ways-of-using-vue.html#single-page-application-spa\">单页应用<a>。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/quick-start", "title": "快速上手", "doc_id": "31fc3e24d5574547bc3f8a3e6ed99e74", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 917, "chunk_index": 2, "_doc_id": "2_2540524441130061551"}}
{"doc_id": "3_7273342195995813997", "text": "我们将介绍如何在本地搭建 Vue <a href=\"/guide/extras/ways-of-using-vue.html#single-page-application-spa\">单页应用<a>。创建的项目将使用基于 <a href=\"https://vite.dev\" target=\"_blank\">Vite<a> 的构建设置，并允许我们使用 Vue 的<a href=\"/guide/scaling-up/sfc.html\">单文件组件<a> (SFC)。<p><p>确保你安装了最新版本的 <a href=\"https://nodejs.org/\" target=\"_blank\">Node.js<a>，并且你的当前工作目录正是打算创建项目的目录。在命令行中运行以下命令 (不要带上 <code>$<code> 符号)：<p><p>这一指令将会安装并执行 <a href=\"https://github.com/vuejs/create-vue\" target=\"_blank\">create-vue<a>，它是 Vue 官方的项目脚手架工具。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/quick-start", "title": "快速上手", "doc_id": "31fc3e24d5574547bc3f8a3e6ed99e74", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 917, "chunk_index": 3, "_doc_id": "3_7273342195995813997"}}
{"doc_id": "4_421018333224636190", "text": "安装并执行 <a href=\"https://github.com/vuejs/create-vue\" target=\"_blank\">create-vue<a>，它是 Vue 官方的项目脚手架工具。你将会看到一些诸如 TypeScript 和测试支持之类的可选功能提示：<p><div class=\"language-sh\"><pre><code><span>✔<span> <span>Project name: <span>… <span><<span><span>your-project-name<span><span>><span><span><span>\n<span>✔<span> <span>Add TypeScript? <span>… <span>No<span> / Yes<span><span>\n<span>✔<span> <span>Add JSX Support? <span>… <span>No<span> / Yes<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/quick-start", "title": "快速上手", "doc_id": "31fc3e24d5574547bc3f8a3e6ed99e74", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 917, "chunk_index": 4, "_doc_id": "4_421018333224636190"}}
{"doc_id": "5_1344235459861787", "text": "an> / Yes<span><span>\n<span>✔<span> <span>Add JSX Support? <span>… <span>No<span> / Yes<span><span>\n<span>✔<span> <span>Add Vue Router for Single Page Application development? <span>… <span>No<span> / Yes<span><span>\n<span>✔<span> <span>Add Pinia for state management? <span>… <span>No<span> / Yes<span><span>\n<span>✔<span> <span>Add Vitest for Unit testing? <span>… <span>No<span> / Yes<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/quick-start", "title": "快速上手", "doc_id": "31fc3e24d5574547bc3f8a3e6ed99e74", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 917, "chunk_index": 5, "_doc_id": "5_1344235459861787"}}
{"doc_id": "6_3717353123033584138", "text": "an><span>\n<span>✔<span> <span>Add Vitest for Unit testing? <span>… <span>No<span> / Yes<span><span>\n<span>✔<span> <span>Add an End-to-End Testing Solution? <span>… <span>No<span> / Cypress / Nightwatch / Playwright<span><span>\n<span>✔<span> <span>Add ESLint for code quality? <span>… No / <span>Yes<span><span><span>\n<span>✔<span> <span>Add Prettier for code formatting? <span>… <span>No<span> / Yes<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/quick-start", "title": "快速上手", "doc_id": "31fc3e24d5574547bc3f8a3e6ed99e74", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 917, "chunk_index": 6, "_doc_id": "6_3717353123033584138"}}
{"doc_id": "7_5671962441201706120", "text": "pan>\n<span>✔<span> <span>Add Prettier for code formatting? <span>… <span>No<span> / Yes<span><span>\n<span>✔<span> <span>Add Vue DevTools 7 extension for debugging? (experimental) <span>… <span>No<span> / Yes<span><span>\n<span><span>\n<span>Scaffolding project in ./<span><<span><span>your-project-name<span><span>><span>...<span>\n<span>Done.<span><code><pre><div><p>如果不确定是否要开启某个功能，你可以直接按下回车键选择 <code>No<code>。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/quick-start", "title": "快速上手", "doc_id": "31fc3e24d5574547bc3f8a3e6ed99e74", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 917, "chunk_index": 7, "_doc_id": "7_5671962441201706120"}}
{"doc_id": "8_5231369386140274506", "text": "pan>><span>...<span>\n<span>Done.<span><code><pre><div><p>如果不确定是否要开启某个功能，你可以直接按下回车键选择 <code>No<code>。在项目被创建后，通过以下步骤安装依赖并启动开发服务器：<p><p>你现在应该已经运行起来了你的第一个 Vue 项目！请注意，生成的项目中的示例组件使用的是<a href=\"/guide/introduction.html#composition-api\">组合式 API<a> 和 <code><script setup><code>，而非<a href=\"/guide/introduction.html#options-api\">选项式 API<a>。下面是一些补充提示：<p><p>当你准备将应用发布到生产环境时，请运行：<p><p>此命令会在 <code>./dist<code> 文件夹中为你的应用创建一个生产环境的构建版本。关于将应用上线生产环境的更多内容，请阅读<a href=\"/guide/best-practices/production-deployment.html\">生产环境部署指南<a>。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/quick-start", "title": "快速上手", "doc_id": "31fc3e24d5574547bc3f8a3e6ed99e74", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 917, "chunk_index": 8, "_doc_id": "8_5231369386140274506"}}
{"doc_id": "9_4649954018655347004", "text": "产环境的构建版本。关于将应用上线生产环境的更多内容，请阅读<a href=\"/guide/best-practices/production-deployment.html\">生产环境部署指南<a>。<p><p><a href=\"#next-steps\">下一步><a><p><h2 id=\"using-vue-from-cdn\">通过 CDN 使用 Vue <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#using-vue-from-cdn\">​<a><h2><p>你可以借助 script 标签直接通过 CDN 来使用 Vue：<p><div class=\"language-html\"> <span class=\"lang\">html<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>script<span><span> src<span><span>=<span><span>\"https://unpkg.com/vue@3/dist/vue.global.", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/quick-start", "title": "快速上手", "doc_id": "31fc3e24d5574547bc3f8a3e6ed99e74", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 917, "chunk_index": 9, "_doc_id": "9_4649954018655347004"}}
{"doc_id": "10_8334898017950716439", "text": "<span><span>script<span><span> src<span><span>=<span><span>\"https://unpkg.com/vue@3/dist/vue.global.js\"<span><span>></<span><span>script<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>这里我们使用了 <a href=\"https://unpkg.com/\" target=\"_blank\">unpkg<a>，但你也可以使用任何提供 npm 包服务的 CDN，例如 <a href=\"https://www.jsdelivr.com/package/npm/vue\" target=\"_blank\">jsdelivr<a> 或 <a href=\"https://cdnjs.com/libraries/vue\" target=\"_blank\">cdnjs<a>。当然，你也可以下载此文件并自行提供服务。<p><p>通过 CDN 使用 Vue 时，不涉及“构建步骤”。这使得设置更加简单，并且可以用于增强静态的 HTML 或与后端框架集成。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/quick-start", "title": "快速上手", "doc_id": "31fc3e24d5574547bc3f8a3e6ed99e74", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 917, "chunk_index": 10, "_doc_id": "10_8334898017950716439"}}
{"doc_id": "11_2333828135454653227", "text": "k\">cdnjs<a>。当然，你也可以下载此文件并自行提供服务。<p><p>通过 CDN 使用 Vue 时，不涉及“构建步骤”。这使得设置更加简单，并且可以用于增强静态的 HTML 或与后端框架集成。但是，你将无法使用单文件组件 (SFC) 语法。<p><h3 id=\"using-the-global-build\">使用全局构建版本 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#using-the-global-build\">​<a><h3><p>上面的链接使用了<em>全局构建版本<em>的 Vue，该版本的所有顶层 API 都以属性的形式暴露在了全局的 <code>Vue<code> 对象上。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/quick-start", "title": "快速上手", "doc_id": "31fc3e24d5574547bc3f8a3e6ed99e74", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 917, "chunk_index": 11, "_doc_id": "11_2333828135454653227"}}
{"doc_id": "12_3925567021895496757", "text": "lobal-build\">​<a><h3><p>上面的链接使用了<em>全局构建版本<em>的 Vue，该版本的所有顶层 API 都以属性的形式暴露在了全局的 <code>Vue<code> 对象上。这里有一个使用全局构建版本的例子：<p><div class=\"options-api\"><div class=\"language-html\"> <span class=\"lang\">html<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>script<span><span> src<span><span>=<span><span>\"https://unpkg.com/vue@3/dist/vue.global.js\"<span><span>></<span><span>script<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/quick-start", "title": "快速上手", "doc_id": "31fc3e24d5574547bc3f8a3e6ed99e74", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 917, "chunk_index": 12, "_doc_id": "12_3925567021895496757"}}
{"doc_id": "13_7111085795149836840", "text": "/vue.global.js\"<span><span>></<span><span>script<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>div<span><span> id<span><span>=<span><span>\"app\"<span><span>>{{ message }}</<span><span>div<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>script<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> const<span><span> { <span><span>createApp<span><span> } <span><span>=<span><span> Vue<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/quick-start", "title": "快速上手", "doc_id": "31fc3e24d5574547bc3f8a3e6ed99e74", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 917, "chunk_index": 13, "_doc_id": "13_7111085795149836840"}}
{"doc_id": "14_2513993112247839813", "text": "> const<span><span> { <span><span>createApp<span><span> } <span><span>=<span><span> Vue<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> createApp<span><span>({<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> data<span><span>() {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> return<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> message: <span><span>'Hello Vue!'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/quick-start", "title": "快速上手", "doc_id": "31fc3e24d5574547bc3f8a3e6ed99e74", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 917, "chunk_index": 14, "_doc_id": "14_2513993112247839813"}}
{"doc_id": "15_8775919388489145195", "text": "o Vue!'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }).<span><span>mount<span><span>(<span><span>'#app'<span><span>)<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/quick-start", "title": "快速上手", "doc_id": "31fc3e24d5574547bc3f8a3e6ed99e74", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 917, "chunk_index": 15, "_doc_id": "15_8775919388489145195"}}
{"doc_id": "16_9195884321769100254", "text": "an class=\"line\"><span> }).<span><span>mount<span><span>(<span><span>'#app'<span><span>)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>script<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p><a href=\"https://codepen.io/vuejs-examples/pen/QWJwJLp\" target=\"_blank\">CodePen 示例 ><a><p><div><div class=\"composition-api\"><div class=\"language-html\"> <span class=\"lang\">html<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>script<span><span> src<span><span>=<span><span>\"https://unpkg.com/vue@3/dist/vue.global.js\"<span><span>></<span><span>script<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/quick-start", "title": "快速上手", "doc_id": "31fc3e24d5574547bc3f8a3e6ed99e74", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 917, "chunk_index": 16, "_doc_id": "16_9195884321769100254"}}
