{"doc_id": "20_2367644187634588444", "text": "message<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }).<span><span>mount<span><span>(<span><span>'#app'<span><span>)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>script<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p><a href=\"https://codepen.io/vuejs-examples/pen/eYQpQEG\" target=\"_blank\">CodePen 示例 ><a><p><div class=\"tip custom-block\"><p class=\"custom-block-title\">TIP<p><p>本指南中许多关于组合式 API 的例子将使用 <code><script setup><code> 语法，这需要构建工具。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/quick-start", "title": "快速上手", "doc_id": "447edcfe7fd14824a2af7f51add0e60f", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 917, "chunk_index": 20, "_doc_id": "20_2367644187634588444"}}
