{"doc_id": "0_6931337987864708746", "text": "<div><div class=\"VPContentPage\"><main><div><div><section id=\"highlights\" class=\"vt-box-container\"><div class=\"vt-box\"><h2>易学易用<h2><p> 基于标准 HTML、CSS 和 JavaScript 构建，提供容易上手的 API 和一流的文档。 <p><div><div class=\"vt-box\"><h2>性能出色<h2><p>经过编译器优化、完全响应式的渲染系统，几乎不需要手动优化。<p><div><div class=\"vt-box\"><h2>灵活多变<h2><p> 丰富的、可渐进式集成的生态系统，可以根据应用规模在库和框架间切换自如。 <p><div><section><section id=\"spsrs\"><h2>Platinum Sponsors<h2><h2>Gold Sponsors<h2><section><div><div><main><div><div>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/", "title": "Vue.js - 渐进式 JavaScript 框架", "doc_id": "266c3d0d3aae44d598c3a538cc305d42", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 20, "chunk_index": 0, "_doc_id": "0_6931337987864708746"}}
{"doc_id": "0_4127479288631203291", "text": "<div><div><h1 id=\"introduction\">简介 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#introduction\">​<a><h1><h2 id=\"what-is-vue\">什么是 Vue？ <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#what-is-vue\">​<a><h2><p>Vue (发音为 /vjuː/，类似 <strong>view<strong>) 是一款用于构建用户界面的 JavaScript 框架。它基于标准 HTML、CSS 和 JavaScript 构建，并提供了一套声明式的、组件化的编程模型，帮助你高效地开发用户界面。无论是简单还是复杂的界面，Vue 都可以胜任。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/introduction.html", "title": "简介 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "d9b261e3b936403aa3d102560f41017f", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 608, "chunk_index": 0, "_doc_id": "0_4127479288631203291"}}
{"doc_id": "1_6112975191766698053", "text": "avaScript 框架。它基于标准 HTML、CSS 和 JavaScript 构建，并提供了一套声明式的、组件化的编程模型，帮助你高效地开发用户界面。无论是简单还是复杂的界面，Vue 都可以胜任。<p><p>下面是一个最基本的示例：<p><div class=\"options-api\"><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>import<span><span> { createApp } <span><span>from<span><span> 'vue'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>createApp<span><span>({<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> data<span><span>() {<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/introduction.html", "title": "简介 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "d9b261e3b936403aa3d102560f41017f", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 608, "chunk_index": 1, "_doc_id": "1_6112975191766698053"}}
{"doc_id": "2_6281575735596941529", "text": "span>createApp<span><span>({<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> data<span><span>() {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> return<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> count: <span><span>0<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/introduction.html", "title": "简介 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "d9b261e3b936403aa3d102560f41017f", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 608, "chunk_index": 2, "_doc_id": "2_6281575735596941529"}}
{"doc_id": "3_6701288170461022637", "text": "<span>0<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}).<span><span>mount<span><span>(<span><span>'#app'<span><span>)<span><span><code><pre><div><div><div class=\"composition-api\"><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>import<span><span> { createApp, ref } <span><span>from<span><span> 'vue'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/introduction.html", "title": "简介 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "d9b261e3b936403aa3d102560f41017f", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 608, "chunk_index": 3, "_doc_id": "3_6701288170461022637"}}
{"doc_id": "4_6737014043407137694", "text": "><span> { createApp, ref } <span><span>from<span><span> 'vue'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>createApp<span><span>({<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> setup<span><span>() {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> return<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> count: <span><span>ref<span><span>(<span><span>0<span><span>)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/introduction.html", "title": "简介 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "d9b261e3b936403aa3d102560f41017f", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 608, "chunk_index": 4, "_doc_id": "4_6737014043407137694"}}
{"doc_id": "5_2850525679732555776", "text": "<span>)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}).<span><span>mount<span><span>(<span><span>'#app'<span><span>)<span><span><code><pre><div><div><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>div<span><span> id<span><span>=<span><span>\"app\"<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/introduction.html", "title": "简介 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "d9b261e3b936403aa3d102560f41017f", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 608, "chunk_index": 5, "_doc_id": "5_2850525679732555776"}}
{"doc_id": "6_658195146485496983", "text": "\"line\"><span><<span><span>div<span><span> id<span><span>=<span><span>\"app\"<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>button<span><span> @<span><span>click<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>count<span><span>++<span><span>\"<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> Count is: {{ count }}<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> </<span><span>button<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/introduction.html", "title": "简介 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "d9b261e3b936403aa3d102560f41017f", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 608, "chunk_index": 6, "_doc_id": "6_658195146485496983"}}
{"doc_id": "7_3489775019732504087", "text": "is: {{ count }}<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> </<span><span>button<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>div<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p><strong>结果展示<strong><p><p class=\"demo\"> Count is: 0 <p><p>上面的示例展示了 Vue 的两个核心功能：<p><p>你可能已经有了些疑问——先别急，在后续的文档中我们会详细介绍每一个细节。现在，请继续看下去，以确保你对 Vue 作为一个框架到底提供了什么有一个宏观的了解。<p><div class=\"tip custom-block\"><p class=\"custom-block-title\">预备知识<p><p>文档接下来的内容会假设你对 HTML、CSS 和 JavaScript 已经基本熟悉。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/introduction.html", "title": "简介 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "d9b261e3b936403aa3d102560f41017f", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 608, "chunk_index": 7, "_doc_id": "7_3489775019732504087"}}
{"doc_id": "8_4504753935195162757", "text": "ip custom-block\"><p class=\"custom-block-title\">预备知识<p><p>文档接下来的内容会假设你对 HTML、CSS 和 JavaScript 已经基本熟悉。如果你对前端开发完全陌生，最好不要直接从一个框架开始进行入门学习——最好是掌握了基础知识再回到这里。如有需要，你可以通过这些 <a href=\"https://developer.mozilla.org/zh-CN/docs/Web/JavaScript/A_re-introduction_to_JavaScript\" target=\"_blank\">JavaScript<a>、<a href=\"https://developer.mozilla.org/zh-CN/docs/Learn/HTML/Introduction_to_HTML\" target=\"_blank\">HTML<a> 和 <a href=\"https://developer.mozilla.org/zh-CN/docs/Learn/CSS/First_steps\" target=\"_blank\">CSS<a> 概述来检验你的知识水平。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/introduction.html", "title": "简介 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "d9b261e3b936403aa3d102560f41017f", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 608, "chunk_index": 8, "_doc_id": "8_4504753935195162757"}}
{"doc_id": "9_3569556831482963951", "text": "\"https://developer.mozilla.org/zh-CN/docs/Learn/CSS/First_steps\" target=\"_blank\">CSS<a> 概述来检验你的知识水平。如果之前有其他框架的经验会很有帮助，但也不是必须的。<p><div><h2 id=\"the-progressive-framework\">渐进式框架 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#the-progressive-framework\">​<a><h2><p>Vue 是一个框架，也是一个生态。其功能覆盖了大部分前端开发常见的需求。但 Web 世界是十分多样化的，不同的开发者在 Web 上构建的东西可能在形式和规模上会有很大的不同。考虑到这一点，Vue 的设计非常注重灵活性和“可以被逐步集成”这个特点。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/introduction.html", "title": "简介 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "d9b261e3b936403aa3d102560f41017f", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 608, "chunk_index": 9, "_doc_id": "9_3569556831482963951"}}
{"doc_id": "10_5345023031296746304", "text": "大部分前端开发常见的需求。但 Web 世界是十分多样化的，不同的开发者在 Web 上构建的东西可能在形式和规模上会有很大的不同。考虑到这一点，Vue 的设计非常注重灵活性和“可以被逐步集成”这个特点。根据你的需求场景，你可以用不同的方式使用 Vue：<p><ul><li>无需构建步骤，渐进式增强静态的 HTML<li><li>在任何页面中作为 Web Components 嵌入<li><li>单页应用 (SPA)<li><li>全栈 / 服务端渲染 (SSR)<li><li>Jamstack / 静态站点生成 (SSG)<li><li>开发桌面端、移动端、WebGL，甚至是命令行终端中的界面<li><ul><p>如果你是初学者，可能会觉得这些概念有些复杂。别担心！理解教程和指南的内容只需要具备基础的 HTML 和 JavaScript 知识。即使你不是这些方面的专家，也能够跟得上。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/introduction.html", "title": "简介 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "d9b261e3b936403aa3d102560f41017f", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 608, "chunk_index": 10, "_doc_id": "10_5345023031296746304"}}
{"doc_id": "11_8643987356903315860", "text": "的界面<li><ul><p>如果你是初学者，可能会觉得这些概念有些复杂。别担心！理解教程和指南的内容只需要具备基础的 HTML 和 JavaScript 知识。即使你不是这些方面的专家，也能够跟得上。<p><p>如果你是有经验的开发者，希望了解如何以最合适的方式在项目中引入 Vue，或者是对上述的这些概念感到好奇，我们在<a href=\"/guide/extras/ways-of-using-vue.html\">使用 Vue 的多种方式<a>中讨论了有关它们的更多细节。<p><p>无论再怎么灵活，Vue 的核心知识在所有这些用例中都是通用的。即使你现在只是一个初学者，随着你的不断成长，到未来有能力实现更复杂的项目时，这一路上获得的知识依然会适用。如果你已经是一个老手，你可以根据实际场景来选择使用 Vue 的最佳方式，在各种场景下都可以保持同样的开发效率。这就是为什么我们将 Vue 称为“渐进式框架”：它是一个可以与你共同成长、适应你不同需求的框架。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/introduction.html", "title": "简介 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "d9b261e3b936403aa3d102560f41017f", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 608, "chunk_index": 11, "_doc_id": "11_8643987356903315860"}}
{"doc_id": "12_1585202261752405325", "text": "已经是一个老手，你可以根据实际场景来选择使用 Vue 的最佳方式，在各种场景下都可以保持同样的开发效率。这就是为什么我们将 Vue 称为“渐进式框架”：它是一个可以与你共同成长、适应你不同需求的框架。<p><h2 id=\"single-file-components\">单文件组件 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#single-file-components\">​<a><h2><p>在大多数启用了构建工具的 Vue 项目中，我们可以使用一种类似 HTML 格式的文件来书写 Vue 组件，它被称为<strong>单文件组件<strong> (也被称为 <code>*.vue<code> 文件，英文 Single-File Components，缩写为 <strong>SFC<strong>)。顾名思义，Vue 的单文件组件会将一个组件的逻辑 (JavaScript)，模板 (HTML) 和样式 (CSS) 封装在同一个文件里。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/introduction.html", "title": "简介 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "d9b261e3b936403aa3d102560f41017f", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 608, "chunk_index": 12, "_doc_id": "12_1585202261752405325"}}
{"doc_id": "13_9156202340995962482", "text": "onents，缩写为 <strong>SFC<strong>)。顾名思义，Vue 的单文件组件会将一个组件的逻辑 (JavaScript)，模板 (HTML) 和样式 (CSS) 封装在同一个文件里。下面我们将用单文件组件的格式重写上面的计数器示例：<p><div class=\"options-api\"><div class=\"language-vue\"> <span class=\"lang\">vue<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>script<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> data<span><span>() {<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/introduction.html", "title": "简介 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "d9b261e3b936403aa3d102560f41017f", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 608, "chunk_index": 13, "_doc_id": "13_9156202340995962482"}}
{"doc_id": "14_8996035408590681203", "text": "<span> default<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> data<span><span>() {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> return<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> count: <span><span>0<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>script<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/introduction.html", "title": "简介 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "d9b261e3b936403aa3d102560f41017f", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 608, "chunk_index": 14, "_doc_id": "14_8996035408590681203"}}
{"doc_id": "15_5217776709137560834", "text": ">\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>button<span><span> @click<span><span>=<span><span>\"count++\"<span><span>>Count is: {{ count }}</<span><span>button<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>style<span><span> scoped<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/introduction.html", "title": "简介 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "d9b261e3b936403aa3d102560f41017f", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 608, "chunk_index": 15, "_doc_id": "15_5217776709137560834"}}
{"doc_id": "16_3729663886961408984", "text": "ine\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>style<span><span> scoped<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>button<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> font-weight<span><span>: <span><span>bold<span><span>;<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/introduction.html", "title": "简介 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "d9b261e3b936403aa3d102560f41017f", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 608, "chunk_index": 16, "_doc_id": "16_3729663886961408984"}}
{"doc_id": "17_5011681742335225390", "text": "eight<span><span>: <span><span>bold<span><span>;<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>style<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><div><div class=\"composition-api\"><div class=\"language-vue\"> <span class=\"lang\">vue<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>script<span><span> setup<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>import<span><span> { ref } <span><span>from<span><span> 'vue'<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/introduction.html", "title": "简介 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "d9b261e3b936403aa3d102560f41017f", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 608, "chunk_index": 17, "_doc_id": "17_5011681742335225390"}}
{"doc_id": "18_8503935448359478944", "text": "<span class=\"line\"><span>import<span><span> { ref } <span><span>from<span><span> 'vue'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> count<span><span> =<span><span> ref<span><span>(<span><span>0<span><span>)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>script<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/introduction.html", "title": "简介 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "d9b261e3b936403aa3d102560f41017f", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 608, "chunk_index": 18, "_doc_id": "18_8503935448359478944"}}
{"doc_id": "19_5217776709137560834", "text": ">\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>button<span><span> @click<span><span>=<span><span>\"count++\"<span><span>>Count is: {{ count }}</<span><span>button<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>style<span><span> scoped<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/introduction.html", "title": "简介 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "d9b261e3b936403aa3d102560f41017f", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 608, "chunk_index": 19, "_doc_id": "19_5217776709137560834"}}
{"doc_id": "20_1891699317438408797", "text": "ine\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>style<span><span> scoped<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>button<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> font-weight<span><span>: <span><span>bold<span><span>;<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>style<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><div><p>单文件组件是 Vue 的标志性功能。如果你的用例需要进行构建，我们推荐用它来编写 Vue 组件。你可以在后续相关章节里了解更多关于<a href=\"/guide/scaling-up/sfc.html\">单文件组件的用法及用途<a>。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/introduction.html", "title": "简介 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "d9b261e3b936403aa3d102560f41017f", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 608, "chunk_index": 20, "_doc_id": "20_1891699317438408797"}}
{"doc_id": "21_2116995856208818381", "text": "。如果你的用例需要进行构建，我们推荐用它来编写 Vue 组件。你可以在后续相关章节里了解更多关于<a href=\"/guide/scaling-up/sfc.html\">单文件组件的用法及用途<a>。但你暂时只需要知道 Vue 会帮忙处理所有这些构建工具的配置就好。<p><h2 id=\"api-styles\">API 风格 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#api-styles\">​<a><h2><p>Vue 的组件可以按两种不同的风格书写：<strong>选项式 API<strong> 和<strong>组合式 API<strong>。<p><h3 id=\"options-api\">选项式 API (Options API) <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#options-api\">​<a><h3><p>使用选项式 API，我们可以用包含多个选项的对象来描述组件的逻辑，例如 <code>data<code>、<code>methods<code> 和 <code>mounted<code>。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/introduction.html", "title": "简介 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "d9b261e3b936403aa3d102560f41017f", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 608, "chunk_index": 21, "_doc_id": "21_2116995856208818381"}}
{"doc_id": "22_5816341009927507508", "text": "3><p>使用选项式 API，我们可以用包含多个选项的对象来描述组件的逻辑，例如 <code>data<code>、<code>methods<code> 和 <code>mounted<code>。选项所定义的属性都会暴露在函数内部的 <code>this<code> 上，它会指向当前的组件实例。<p><div class=\"language-vue\"> <span class=\"lang\">vue<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>script<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // data() 返回的属性将会成为响应式的状态<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/introduction.html", "title": "简介 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "d9b261e3b936403aa3d102560f41017f", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 608, "chunk_index": 22, "_doc_id": "22_5816341009927507508"}}
{"doc_id": "23_5110871198659562511", "text": "> default<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // data() 返回的属性将会成为响应式的状态<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 并且暴露在 `this` 上<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> data<span><span>() {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> return<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> count: <span><span>0<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> },<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // methods 是一些用来更改状态与触发更新的函数<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/introduction.html", "title": "简介 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "d9b261e3b936403aa3d102560f41017f", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 608, "chunk_index": 23, "_doc_id": "23_5110871198659562511"}}
{"doc_id": "24_5391054446444788354", "text": "<span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // methods 是一些用来更改状态与触发更新的函数<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 它们可以在模板中作为事件处理器绑定<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> methods: {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> increment<span><span>() {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> this<span><span>.count<span><span>++<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> },<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/introduction.html", "title": "简介 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "d9b261e3b936403aa3d102560f41017f", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 608, "chunk_index": 24, "_doc_id": "24_5391054446444788354"}}
{"doc_id": "25_2200713778624860302", "text": "lass=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> },<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 生命周期钩子会在组件生命周期的各个不同阶段被调用<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 例如这个函数就会在组件挂载完成后被调用<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> mounted<span><span>() {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> console.<span><span>log<span><span>(<span><span>`The initial count is ${<span><span>this<span><span>.<span><span>count<span><span>}.`<span><span>)<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/introduction.html", "title": "简介 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "d9b261e3b936403aa3d102560f41017f", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 608, "chunk_index": 25, "_doc_id": "25_2200713778624860302"}}
{"doc_id": "26_389071068328880655", "text": "l count is ${<span><span>this<span><span>.<span><span>count<span><span>}.`<span><span>)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>script<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/introduction.html", "title": "简介 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "d9b261e3b936403aa3d102560f41017f", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 608, "chunk_index": 26, "_doc_id": "26_389071068328880655"}}
{"doc_id": "27_541216103403332851", "text": ">\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>button<span><span> @click<span><span>=<span><span>\"increment\"<span><span>>Count is: {{ count }}</<span><span>button<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p><a href=\"https://play.vuejs.", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/introduction.html", "title": "简介 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "d9b261e3b936403aa3d102560f41017f", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 608, "chunk_index": 27, "_doc_id": "27_541216103403332851"}}
{"doc_id": "28_3608888119882762481", "text": "<span></<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p><a href=\"https://play.vuejs.org/#\" target=\"_blank\">在演练场中尝试一下<a><p><h3 id=\"composition-api\">组合式 API (Composition API) <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#composition-api\">​<a><h3><p>通过组合式 API，", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/introduction.html", "title": "简介 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "d9b261e3b936403aa3d102560f41017f", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 608, "chunk_index": 28, "_doc_id": "28_3608888119882762481"}}
{"doc_id": "29_1012946298433154706", "text": "pi\">组合式 API (Composition API) <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#composition-api\">​<a><h3><p>通过组合式 API，我们可以使用导入的 API 函数来描述组件逻辑。在单文件组件中，组合式 API 通常会与 <a href=\"/api/sfc-script-setup.html\"><code><script setup><code><a> 搭配使用。这个 <code>setup<code> attribute 是一个标识，告诉 Vue 需要在编译时进行一些处理，让我们可以更简洁地使用组合式 API。比如，<code><script setup><code> 中的导入和顶层变量/函数都能够在模板中直接使用。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/introduction.html", "title": "简介 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "d9b261e3b936403aa3d102560f41017f", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 608, "chunk_index": 29, "_doc_id": "29_1012946298433154706"}}
{"doc_id": "30_3375653807521347994", "text": "是一个标识，告诉 Vue 需要在编译时进行一些处理，让我们可以更简洁地使用组合式 API。比如，<code><script setup><code> 中的导入和顶层变量/函数都能够在模板中直接使用。<p><p>下面是使用了组合式 API 与 <code><script setup><code> 改造后和上面的模板完全一样的组件：<p><div class=\"language-vue\"> <span class=\"lang\">vue<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>script<span><span> setup<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>import<span><span> { ref, onMounted } <span><span>from<span><span> 'vue'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/introduction.html", "title": "简介 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "d9b261e3b936403aa3d102560f41017f", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 608, "chunk_index": 30, "_doc_id": "30_3375653807521347994"}}
{"doc_id": "31_764447443611575223", "text": "><span> { ref, onMounted } <span><span>from<span><span> 'vue'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 响应式状态<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> count<span><span> =<span><span> ref<span><span>(<span><span>0<span><span>)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 用来修改状态、触发更新的函数<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>function<span><span> increment<span><span>() {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> count.value<span><span>++<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/introduction.html", "title": "简介 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "d9b261e3b936403aa3d102560f41017f", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 608, "chunk_index": 31, "_doc_id": "31_764447443611575223"}}
{"doc_id": "32_2501795229610834248", "text": "crement<span><span>() {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> count.value<span><span>++<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 生命周期钩子<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>onMounted<span><span>(() <span><span>=><span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> console.<span><span>log<span><span>(<span><span>`The initial count is ${<span><span>count<span><span>.<span><span>value<span><span>}.`<span><span>)<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/introduction.html", "title": "简介 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "d9b261e3b936403aa3d102560f41017f", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 608, "chunk_index": 32, "_doc_id": "32_2501795229610834248"}}
{"doc_id": "33_159527263553163211", "text": "count is ${<span><span>count<span><span>.<span><span>value<span><span>}.`<span><span>)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>})<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>script<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>button<span><span> @click<span><span>=<span><span>\"increment\"<span><span>>Count is: {{ count }}</<span><span>button<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/introduction.html", "title": "简介 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "d9b261e3b936403aa3d102560f41017f", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 608, "chunk_index": 33, "_doc_id": "33_159527263553163211"}}
{"doc_id": "34_1960455509897212753", "text": "an><span>\"increment\"<span><span>>Count is: {{ count }}</<span><span>button<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p><a href=\"https://play.vuejs.", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/introduction.html", "title": "简介 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "d9b261e3b936403aa3d102560f41017f", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 608, "chunk_index": 34, "_doc_id": "34_1960455509897212753"}}
{"doc_id": "35_5697274069315953210", "text": "<span></<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p><a href=\"https://play.vuejs.org/#\" target=\"_blank\">在演练场中尝试一下<a><p><h3 id=\"which-to-choose\">该选哪一个？", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/introduction.html", "title": "简介 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "d9b261e3b936403aa3d102560f41017f", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 608, "chunk_index": 35, "_doc_id": "35_5697274069315953210"}}
{"doc_id": "36_5351659736095034204", "text": "rIrr5+Z7hnneQnJu6hURvKl3ryL/ARrVkuI=\" target=\"_blank\">在演练场中尝试一下<a><p><h3 id=\"which-to-choose\">该选哪一个？ <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#which-to-choose\">​<a><h3><p>两种 API 风格都能够覆盖大部分的应用场景。它们只是同一个底层系统所提供的两套不同的接口。实际上，选项式 API 是在组合式 API 的基础上实现的！关于 Vue 的基础概念和知识在它们之间都是通用的。<p><p>选项式 API 以“组件实例”的概念为中心 (即上述例子中的 <code>this<code>)，对于有面向对象语言背景的用户来说，这通常与基于类的心智模型更为一致。同时，它将响应性相关的细节抽象出来，并强制按照选项来组织代码，从而对初学者而言更为友好。<p><p>组合式 API 的核心思想是直接在函数作用域内定义响应式状态变量，并将从多个函数中得到的状态组合起来处理复杂问题。这种形式更加自由，也需要你对 Vue 的响应式系统有更深的理解才能高效使用。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/introduction.html", "title": "简介 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "d9b261e3b936403aa3d102560f41017f", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 608, "chunk_index": 36, "_doc_id": "36_5351659736095034204"}}
{"doc_id": "37_3108301155953120779", "text": "p><p>组合式 API 的核心思想是直接在函数作用域内定义响应式状态变量，并将从多个函数中得到的状态组合起来处理复杂问题。这种形式更加自由，也需要你对 Vue 的响应式系统有更深的理解才能高效使用。相应的，它的灵活性也使得组织和重用逻辑的模式变得更加强大。<p><p>在<a href=\"/guide/extras/composition-api-faq.html\">组合式 API FAQ<a> 章节中，你可以了解更多关于这两种 API 风格的对比以及组合式 API 所带来的潜在收益。<p><p>如果你是使用 Vue 的新手，这里是我们的大致建议：<p><p>在学习阶段，你不必只固守一种风格。在接下来的文档中我们会为你提供一系列两种风格的代码供你参考，你可以随时通过左上角的 <strong>API 风格偏好<strong>来做切换。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/introduction.html", "title": "简介 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "d9b261e3b936403aa3d102560f41017f", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 608, "chunk_index": 37, "_doc_id": "37_3108301155953120779"}}
{"doc_id": "38_2966241049480056178", "text": "的大致建议：<p><p>在学习阶段，你不必只固守一种风格。在接下来的文档中我们会为你提供一系列两种风格的代码供你参考，你可以随时通过左上角的 <strong>API 风格偏好<strong>来做切换。<p><h2 id=\"still-got-questions\">还有其他问题？ <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#still-got-questions\">​<a><h2><p>请查看我们的 <a href=\"/about/faq.html\">FAQ<a>。<p><h2 id=\"pick-your-learning-path\">选择你的学习路径 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#pick-your-learning-path\">​<a><h2><p>不同的开发者有不同的学习方式。尽管在可能的情况下，我们推荐你通读所有内容，但你还是可以自由地选择一种自己喜欢的学习路径！<p><div><div>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/introduction.html", "title": "简介 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "d9b261e3b936403aa3d102560f41017f", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 608, "chunk_index": 38, "_doc_id": "38_2966241049480056178"}}
{"doc_id": "0_1298810715737436468", "text": "[Failed to extract content from: https://cn.vuejs.org/tutorial/]", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/tutorial/", "title": "教程 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "f9c9d81c42b646b787d4c54165f2ca9c", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 6, "chunk_index": 0, "_doc_id": "0_1298810715737436468"}}
{"doc_id": "0_2564000114903339191", "text": "[Failed to extract content from: https://cn.vuejs.org/examples/]", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/examples/", "title": "Examples | Vue.js", "doc_id": "94cab4db138644eba54f379f6d0dbceb", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 6, "chunk_index": 0, "_doc_id": "0_2564000114903339191"}}
{"doc_id": "0_8739093793548807926", "text": "<div><div><h1 id=\"quick-start\">快速上手 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#quick-start\">​<a><h1><h2 id=\"try-vue-online\">线上尝试 Vue <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#try-vue-online\">​<a><h2><ul><li><p>想要快速体验 Vue，你可以直接试试我们的<a href=\"https://play.vuejs.org/#eNo9jcEKwjAMhl/lt5fpQYfXUQfefAMvvRQbddC1pUuHUPrudg4HIcmXjyRZXEM4zYlEJ+T0iEPgXjn6BB8Zhp46WUZWDjCa9f6w9kAkTtH9CRinV4fmRtZ63H20Ztesqiylphqy3R5UYBqD1UyVAPk+9zkvV1CKbCv9poMLiTEfR2/IXpSoXomqZLtti/IFwVtA9A==\" target=\"_blank\">演练场<a>。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/quick-start.html", "title": "快速上手", "doc_id": "dec444ccc954405bb049ad6dd5dc9c34", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 917, "chunk_index": 0, "_doc_id": "0_8739093793548807926"}}
{"doc_id": "1_6144195614111674483", "text": "tesqiylphqy3R5UYBqD1UyVAPk+9zkvV1CKbCv9poMLiTEfR2/IXpSoXomqZLtti/IFwVtA9A==\" target=\"_blank\">演练场<a>。<p><li><li><p>如果你更喜欢不用任何构建的原始 HTML，可以使用 <a href=\"https://jsfiddle.net/yyx990803/2ke1ab0z/\" target=\"_blank\">JSFiddle<a> 入门。<p><li><li><p>如果你已经比较熟悉 Node.js 和构建工具等概念，还可以直接在浏览器中打开 <a href=\"https://vite.new/vue\" target=\"_blank\">StackBlitz<a> 来尝试完整的构建设置。<p><li><li><p>要了解推荐的设置流程，请观看这个互动式 <a href=\"http://scrimba.com/links/vue-quickstart\" target=\"_blank\">Scrimba<a> 教程，它将向你展示如何运行、编辑和部署你的第一个 Vue 应用程序。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/quick-start.html", "title": "快速上手", "doc_id": "dec444ccc954405bb049ad6dd5dc9c34", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 917, "chunk_index": 1, "_doc_id": "1_6144195614111674483"}}
{"doc_id": "2_2540524441130061551", "text": "tp://scrimba.com/links/vue-quickstart\" target=\"_blank\">Scrimba<a> 教程，它将向你展示如何运行、编辑和部署你的第一个 Vue 应用程序。<p><li><ul><h2 id=\"creating-a-vue-application\">创建一个 Vue 应用 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#creating-a-vue-application\">​<a><h2><div class=\"tip custom-block\"><p class=\"custom-block-title\">前提条件<p><ul><li>熟悉命令行<li><li>已安装 <code>^20.19.0 || >=22.12.0<code> 版本的 <a href=\"https://nodejs.org/\" target=\"_blank\">Node.js<a><li><ul><div><p>在本节中，我们将介绍如何在本地搭建 Vue <a href=\"/guide/extras/ways-of-using-vue.html#single-page-application-spa\">单页应用<a>。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/quick-start.html", "title": "快速上手", "doc_id": "dec444ccc954405bb049ad6dd5dc9c34", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 917, "chunk_index": 2, "_doc_id": "2_2540524441130061551"}}
{"doc_id": "3_7273342195995813997", "text": "我们将介绍如何在本地搭建 Vue <a href=\"/guide/extras/ways-of-using-vue.html#single-page-application-spa\">单页应用<a>。创建的项目将使用基于 <a href=\"https://vite.dev\" target=\"_blank\">Vite<a> 的构建设置，并允许我们使用 Vue 的<a href=\"/guide/scaling-up/sfc.html\">单文件组件<a> (SFC)。<p><p>确保你安装了最新版本的 <a href=\"https://nodejs.org/\" target=\"_blank\">Node.js<a>，并且你的当前工作目录正是打算创建项目的目录。在命令行中运行以下命令 (不要带上 <code>$<code> 符号)：<p><p>这一指令将会安装并执行 <a href=\"https://github.com/vuejs/create-vue\" target=\"_blank\">create-vue<a>，它是 Vue 官方的项目脚手架工具。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/quick-start.html", "title": "快速上手", "doc_id": "dec444ccc954405bb049ad6dd5dc9c34", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 917, "chunk_index": 3, "_doc_id": "3_7273342195995813997"}}
{"doc_id": "4_421018333224636190", "text": "安装并执行 <a href=\"https://github.com/vuejs/create-vue\" target=\"_blank\">create-vue<a>，它是 Vue 官方的项目脚手架工具。你将会看到一些诸如 TypeScript 和测试支持之类的可选功能提示：<p><div class=\"language-sh\"><pre><code><span>✔<span> <span>Project name: <span>… <span><<span><span>your-project-name<span><span>><span><span><span>\n<span>✔<span> <span>Add TypeScript? <span>… <span>No<span> / Yes<span><span>\n<span>✔<span> <span>Add JSX Support? <span>… <span>No<span> / Yes<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/quick-start.html", "title": "快速上手", "doc_id": "dec444ccc954405bb049ad6dd5dc9c34", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 917, "chunk_index": 4, "_doc_id": "4_421018333224636190"}}
{"doc_id": "5_1344235459861787", "text": "an> / Yes<span><span>\n<span>✔<span> <span>Add JSX Support? <span>… <span>No<span> / Yes<span><span>\n<span>✔<span> <span>Add Vue Router for Single Page Application development? <span>… <span>No<span> / Yes<span><span>\n<span>✔<span> <span>Add Pinia for state management? <span>… <span>No<span> / Yes<span><span>\n<span>✔<span> <span>Add Vitest for Unit testing? <span>… <span>No<span> / Yes<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/quick-start.html", "title": "快速上手", "doc_id": "dec444ccc954405bb049ad6dd5dc9c34", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 917, "chunk_index": 5, "_doc_id": "5_1344235459861787"}}
{"doc_id": "6_3717353123033584138", "text": "an><span>\n<span>✔<span> <span>Add Vitest for Unit testing? <span>… <span>No<span> / Yes<span><span>\n<span>✔<span> <span>Add an End-to-End Testing Solution? <span>… <span>No<span> / Cypress / Nightwatch / Playwright<span><span>\n<span>✔<span> <span>Add ESLint for code quality? <span>… No / <span>Yes<span><span><span>\n<span>✔<span> <span>Add Prettier for code formatting? <span>… <span>No<span> / Yes<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/quick-start.html", "title": "快速上手", "doc_id": "dec444ccc954405bb049ad6dd5dc9c34", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 917, "chunk_index": 6, "_doc_id": "6_3717353123033584138"}}
{"doc_id": "7_5671962441201706120", "text": "pan>\n<span>✔<span> <span>Add Prettier for code formatting? <span>… <span>No<span> / Yes<span><span>\n<span>✔<span> <span>Add Vue DevTools 7 extension for debugging? (experimental) <span>… <span>No<span> / Yes<span><span>\n<span><span>\n<span>Scaffolding project in ./<span><<span><span>your-project-name<span><span>><span>...<span>\n<span>Done.<span><code><pre><div><p>如果不确定是否要开启某个功能，你可以直接按下回车键选择 <code>No<code>。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/quick-start.html", "title": "快速上手", "doc_id": "dec444ccc954405bb049ad6dd5dc9c34", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 917, "chunk_index": 7, "_doc_id": "7_5671962441201706120"}}
{"doc_id": "8_5231369386140274506", "text": "pan>><span>...<span>\n<span>Done.<span><code><pre><div><p>如果不确定是否要开启某个功能，你可以直接按下回车键选择 <code>No<code>。在项目被创建后，通过以下步骤安装依赖并启动开发服务器：<p><p>你现在应该已经运行起来了你的第一个 Vue 项目！请注意，生成的项目中的示例组件使用的是<a href=\"/guide/introduction.html#composition-api\">组合式 API<a> 和 <code><script setup><code>，而非<a href=\"/guide/introduction.html#options-api\">选项式 API<a>。下面是一些补充提示：<p><p>当你准备将应用发布到生产环境时，请运行：<p><p>此命令会在 <code>./dist<code> 文件夹中为你的应用创建一个生产环境的构建版本。关于将应用上线生产环境的更多内容，请阅读<a href=\"/guide/best-practices/production-deployment.html\">生产环境部署指南<a>。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/quick-start.html", "title": "快速上手", "doc_id": "dec444ccc954405bb049ad6dd5dc9c34", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 917, "chunk_index": 8, "_doc_id": "8_5231369386140274506"}}
{"doc_id": "9_4649954018655347004", "text": "产环境的构建版本。关于将应用上线生产环境的更多内容，请阅读<a href=\"/guide/best-practices/production-deployment.html\">生产环境部署指南<a>。<p><p><a href=\"#next-steps\">下一步><a><p><h2 id=\"using-vue-from-cdn\">通过 CDN 使用 Vue <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#using-vue-from-cdn\">​<a><h2><p>你可以借助 script 标签直接通过 CDN 来使用 Vue：<p><div class=\"language-html\"> <span class=\"lang\">html<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>script<span><span> src<span><span>=<span><span>\"https://unpkg.com/vue@3/dist/vue.global.", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/quick-start.html", "title": "快速上手", "doc_id": "dec444ccc954405bb049ad6dd5dc9c34", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 917, "chunk_index": 9, "_doc_id": "9_4649954018655347004"}}
{"doc_id": "10_8334898017950716439", "text": "<span><span>script<span><span> src<span><span>=<span><span>\"https://unpkg.com/vue@3/dist/vue.global.js\"<span><span>></<span><span>script<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>这里我们使用了 <a href=\"https://unpkg.com/\" target=\"_blank\">unpkg<a>，但你也可以使用任何提供 npm 包服务的 CDN，例如 <a href=\"https://www.jsdelivr.com/package/npm/vue\" target=\"_blank\">jsdelivr<a> 或 <a href=\"https://cdnjs.com/libraries/vue\" target=\"_blank\">cdnjs<a>。当然，你也可以下载此文件并自行提供服务。<p><p>通过 CDN 使用 Vue 时，不涉及“构建步骤”。这使得设置更加简单，并且可以用于增强静态的 HTML 或与后端框架集成。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/quick-start.html", "title": "快速上手", "doc_id": "dec444ccc954405bb049ad6dd5dc9c34", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 917, "chunk_index": 10, "_doc_id": "10_8334898017950716439"}}
{"doc_id": "11_2333828135454653227", "text": "k\">cdnjs<a>。当然，你也可以下载此文件并自行提供服务。<p><p>通过 CDN 使用 Vue 时，不涉及“构建步骤”。这使得设置更加简单，并且可以用于增强静态的 HTML 或与后端框架集成。但是，你将无法使用单文件组件 (SFC) 语法。<p><h3 id=\"using-the-global-build\">使用全局构建版本 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#using-the-global-build\">​<a><h3><p>上面的链接使用了<em>全局构建版本<em>的 Vue，该版本的所有顶层 API 都以属性的形式暴露在了全局的 <code>Vue<code> 对象上。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/quick-start.html", "title": "快速上手", "doc_id": "dec444ccc954405bb049ad6dd5dc9c34", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 917, "chunk_index": 11, "_doc_id": "11_2333828135454653227"}}
{"doc_id": "12_3925567021895496757", "text": "lobal-build\">​<a><h3><p>上面的链接使用了<em>全局构建版本<em>的 Vue，该版本的所有顶层 API 都以属性的形式暴露在了全局的 <code>Vue<code> 对象上。这里有一个使用全局构建版本的例子：<p><div class=\"options-api\"><div class=\"language-html\"> <span class=\"lang\">html<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>script<span><span> src<span><span>=<span><span>\"https://unpkg.com/vue@3/dist/vue.global.js\"<span><span>></<span><span>script<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/quick-start.html", "title": "快速上手", "doc_id": "dec444ccc954405bb049ad6dd5dc9c34", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 917, "chunk_index": 12, "_doc_id": "12_3925567021895496757"}}
{"doc_id": "13_7111085795149836840", "text": "/vue.global.js\"<span><span>></<span><span>script<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>div<span><span> id<span><span>=<span><span>\"app\"<span><span>>{{ message }}</<span><span>div<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>script<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> const<span><span> { <span><span>createApp<span><span> } <span><span>=<span><span> Vue<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/quick-start.html", "title": "快速上手", "doc_id": "dec444ccc954405bb049ad6dd5dc9c34", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 917, "chunk_index": 13, "_doc_id": "13_7111085795149836840"}}
