{"doc_id": "0_6933161166671816519", "text": "<div><div class=\"page-hero__lead\"><p> Vue 合作伙伴是 Vue 团队认可提供一流 Vue 咨询和开发服务的机构。如果你的公司有兴趣被列为合作伙伴，请<a href=\"https://airtable.com/shrCQhat57SApJI2l\" target=\"_blank\">在此注册<a>。 <p><div><div>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/partners/", "title": "Vue Partners | Vue.js", "doc_id": "44b095726fcb4658943365a1db8a7b25", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 11, "chunk_index": 0, "_doc_id": "0_6933161166671816519"}}
{"doc_id": "0_7489559592999158515", "text": "<div><div class=\"VPContentPage\"><main><div><div><div class=\"ThemePage\"><div class=\"ThemeHero\"><div class=\"container\"><h1 class=\"title\">主题<h1><p class=\"lead\">查看主题、UI Kits 和插件。你可以看到我们的合作伙伴是如何用 Vue 构建一个真实世界的应用。<p><div><div><div class=\"ThemeList\"><div class=\"container\"><div class=\"item\"><section class=\"ThemeListItem\"><h2 class=\"title\">Nuxt UI<h2><p class=\"description\"><a href=\"https://ui.nuxt.com/\" class=\"link\" target=\"_blank\">Nuxt UI<a> is an intuitive, open-source UI library for Vue and Nuxt applications.", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/ecosystem/themes.html", "title": "Vue.js", "doc_id": "0c4426ffab4c4238ba4e935e1f88cb52", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 270, "chunk_index": 0, "_doc_id": "0_7489559592999158515"}}
{"doc_id": "1_8514060215786243638", "text": "\" target=\"_blank\">Nuxt UI<a> is an intuitive, open-source UI library for Vue and Nuxt applications. Built with Tailwind CSS and Reka UI, it provides 100+ beautifully crafted, accessible components with a flexible CSS-first design system.<p><section><div><div class=\"item\"><section class=\"ThemeListItem\"><h2 class=\"title\">Creative Tim<h2><p class=\"description\">通过下面由我们的合作伙伴 <a href=\"https://creative-tim.com?affiliate_id=116187\" class=\"link\" target=\"_blank\">Creative Tim<a> 建立的例子，你可以看到一个真实世界的应用是如何建立的，它背后的技术栈，", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/ecosystem/themes.html", "title": "Vue.js", "doc_id": "0c4426ffab4c4238ba4e935e1f88cb52", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 270, "chunk_index": 1, "_doc_id": "1_8514060215786243638"}}
