{"doc_id": "41_7561270170668496", "text": "les/pen/YzRyRYM\" target=\"_blank\">CodePen 示例 ><a><p><div><p>你也可以在映射表中添加其他的依赖——但请务必确保你使用的是该库的 ES 模块版本。<p><div class=\"tip custom-block\"><p class=\"custom-block-title\">导入映射表的浏览器支持情况<p><p>导入映射表是一个相对较新的浏览器功能。请确保使用其<a href=\"https://caniuse.com/import-maps\" target=\"_blank\">支持范围<a>内的浏览器。请注意，只有 Safari 16.4 以上版本支持。<p><div><h3 id=\"splitting-up-the-modules\">拆分模块 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#splitting-up-the-modules\">​<a><h3><p>随着对这份指南的逐步深入，我们可能需要将代码分割成单独的 JavaScript 文件，以便更容易管理。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/quick-start.html", "title": "快速上手", "doc_id": "90bc4cd511ff41d18205c9e7c398c749", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 917, "chunk_index": 41, "_doc_id": "41_7561270170668496"}}
{"doc_id": "42_1557305343146626618", "text": "hor\" href=\"#splitting-up-the-modules\">​<a><h3><p>随着对这份指南的逐步深入，我们可能需要将代码分割成单独的 JavaScript 文件，以便更容易管理。例如：<p><div class=\"vp-code-block-title\"><p class=\"vp-code-block-title-bar\"><span class=\"vp-code-block-title-text\">index.html<span><p><div class=\"language-html\"> <span class=\"lang\">html<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>div<span><span> id<span><span>=<span><span>\"app\"<span><span>></<span><span>div<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/quick-start.html", "title": "快速上手", "doc_id": "90bc4cd511ff41d18205c9e7c398c749", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 917, "chunk_index": 42, "_doc_id": "42_1557305343146626618"}}
{"doc_id": "43_3018790104780558633", "text": "=<span><span>\"app\"<span><span>></<span><span>div<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>script<span><span> type<span><span>=<span><span>\"module\"<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> import<span><span> { createApp } <span><span>from<span><span> 'vue'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> import<span><span> MyComponent <span><span>from<span><span> './my-component.js'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/quick-start.html", "title": "快速上手", "doc_id": "90bc4cd511ff41d18205c9e7c398c749", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 917, "chunk_index": 43, "_doc_id": "43_3018790104780558633"}}
{"doc_id": "44_1432323637105060121", "text": "MyComponent <span><span>from<span><span> './my-component.js'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> createApp<span><span>(MyComponent).<span><span>mount<span><span>(<span><span>'#app'<span><span>)<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/quick-start.html", "title": "快速上手", "doc_id": "90bc4cd511ff41d18205c9e7c398c749", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 917, "chunk_index": 44, "_doc_id": "44_1432323637105060121"}}
{"doc_id": "45_4520546739779949213", "text": "<span><span>(MyComponent).<span><span>mount<span><span>(<span><span>'#app'<span><span>)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>script<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><div><div class=\"options-api\"><div class=\"vp-code-block-title\"><p class=\"vp-code-block-title-bar\"><span class=\"vp-code-block-title-text\">my-component.js<span><p><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/quick-start.html", "title": "快速上手", "doc_id": "90bc4cd511ff41d18205c9e7c398c749", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 917, "chunk_index": 45, "_doc_id": "45_4520546739779949213"}}
{"doc_id": "46_5975482108382316559", "text": "b-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> data<span><span>() {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> return<span><span> { count: <span><span>0<span><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> },<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> template: <span><span>`<div>Count is: {{ count }}</div>`<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/quick-start.html", "title": "快速上手", "doc_id": "90bc4cd511ff41d18205c9e7c398c749", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 917, "chunk_index": 46, "_doc_id": "46_5975482108382316559"}}
{"doc_id": "47_3607535431754935336", "text": "pan>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> template: <span><span>`<div>Count is: {{ count }}</div>`<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span><code><pre><div><div><div><div class=\"composition-api\"><div class=\"vp-code-block-title\"><p class=\"vp-code-block-title-bar\"><span class=\"vp-code-block-title-text\">my-component.js<span><p><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>import<span><span> { ref } <span><span>from<span><span> 'vue'<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/quick-start.html", "title": "快速上手", "doc_id": "90bc4cd511ff41d18205c9e7c398c749", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 917, "chunk_index": 47, "_doc_id": "47_3607535431754935336"}}
{"doc_id": "48_9084090421985182031", "text": "><span class=\"line\"><span>import<span><span> { ref } <span><span>from<span><span> 'vue'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> setup<span><span>() {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> const<span><span> count<span><span> =<span><span> ref<span><span>(<span><span>0<span><span>)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> return<span><span> { count }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> },<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/quick-start.html", "title": "快速上手", "doc_id": "90bc4cd511ff41d18205c9e7c398c749", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 917, "chunk_index": 48, "_doc_id": "48_9084090421985182031"}}
{"doc_id": "49_5311120930784951383", "text": "ass=\"line\"><span> return<span><span> { count }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> },<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> template: <span><span>`<div>Count is: {{ count }}</div>`<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span><code><pre><div><div><div><p>如果直接在浏览器中打开了上面的 <code>index.html<code>，你会发现它抛出了一个错误，因为 ES 模块不能通过 <code>file://<code> 协议工作，也即是当你打开一个本地文件时浏览器使用的协议。<p><p>由于安全原因，ES 模块只能通过 <code>http://<code> 协议工作，也即是浏览器在打开网页时使用的协议。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/quick-start.html", "title": "快速上手", "doc_id": "90bc4cd511ff41d18205c9e7c398c749", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 917, "chunk_index": 49, "_doc_id": "49_5311120930784951383"}}
{"doc_id": "50_4399075770499916770", "text": "code> 协议工作，也即是当你打开一个本地文件时浏览器使用的协议。<p><p>由于安全原因，ES 模块只能通过 <code>http://<code> 协议工作，也即是浏览器在打开网页时使用的协议。为了使 ES 模块在我们的本地机器上工作，我们需要使用本地的 HTTP 服务器，通过 <code>http://<code> 协议来提供 <code>index.html<code>。<p><p>要启动一个本地的 HTTP 服务器，请先安装 <a href=\"https://nodejs.org/zh/\" target=\"_blank\">Node.js<a>，然后通过命令行在 HTML 文件所在文件夹下运行 <code>npx serve<code>。你也可以使用其他任何可以基于正确的 MIME 类型服务静态文件的 HTTP 服务器。<p><p>可能你也注意到了，这里导入的组件模板是内联的 JavaScript 字符串。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/quick-start.html", "title": "快速上手", "doc_id": "90bc4cd511ff41d18205c9e7c398c749", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 917, "chunk_index": 50, "_doc_id": "50_4399075770499916770"}}
{"doc_id": "51_2215307921020802873", "text": "x serve<code>。你也可以使用其他任何可以基于正确的 MIME 类型服务静态文件的 HTTP 服务器。<p><p>可能你也注意到了，这里导入的组件模板是内联的 JavaScript 字符串。如果你正在使用 VS Code，你可以安装 <a href=\"https://marketplace.visualstudio.com/items?itemName=Tobermory.es6-string-html\" target=\"_blank\">es6-string-html<a> 扩展，然后在字符串前加上一个前缀注释 <code>/*html*/<code> 以高亮语法。<p><h2 id=\"next-steps\">下一步 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#next-steps\">​<a><h2><p>如果你尚未阅读<a href=\"/guide/introduction.html\">简介<a>，我们强烈推荐你在移步到后续文档之前返回去阅读一下。<p><div><div>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/quick-start.html", "title": "快速上手", "doc_id": "90bc4cd511ff41d18205c9e7c398c749", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 917, "chunk_index": 51, "_doc_id": "51_2215307921020802873"}}
{"doc_id": "0_8747921959927936008", "text": "<div><div><h1 id=\"computed-properties\">计算属性 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#computed-properties\">​<a><h1><p class=\"options-api\"><p><p class=\"composition-api\"><p><h2 id=\"basic-example\">基础示例 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#basic-example\">​<a><h2><p>模板中的表达式虽然方便，但也只能用来做简单的操作。如果在模板中写太多逻辑，会让模板变得臃肿，难以维护。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/computed.html", "title": "计算属性", "doc_id": "782662a1d30141d08863a530fa543fc1", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1092, "chunk_index": 0, "_doc_id": "0_8747921959927936008"}}
{"doc_id": "1_4316772075221996246", "text": "\"header-anchor\" href=\"#basic-example\">​<a><h2><p>模板中的表达式虽然方便，但也只能用来做简单的操作。如果在模板中写太多逻辑，会让模板变得臃肿，难以维护。比如说，我们有这样一个包含嵌套数组的对象：<p><div class=\"options-api\"><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> data<span><span>() {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> return<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> author: {<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/computed.html", "title": "计算属性", "doc_id": "782662a1d30141d08863a530fa543fc1", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1092, "chunk_index": 1, "_doc_id": "1_4316772075221996246"}}
{"doc_id": "2_4208956270549611840", "text": "lass=\"line\"><span> return<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> author: {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> name: <span><span>'John Doe'<span><span>,<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> books: [<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> 'Vue 2 - Advanced Guide'<span><span>,<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> 'Vue 3 - Basic Guide'<span><span>,<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> 'Vue 4 - The Mystery'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> ]<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/computed.html", "title": "计算属性", "doc_id": "782662a1d30141d08863a530fa543fc1", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1092, "chunk_index": 2, "_doc_id": "2_4208956270549611840"}}
{"doc_id": "3_6356056935608821337", "text": "<span class=\"line\"><span> 'Vue 4 - The Mystery'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> ]<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/computed.html", "title": "计算属性", "doc_id": "782662a1d30141d08863a530fa543fc1", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1092, "chunk_index": 3, "_doc_id": "3_6356056935608821337"}}
{"doc_id": "4_1806864361566681434", "text": "span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span><code><pre><div><div><div class=\"composition-api\"><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> author<span><span> =<span><span> reactive<span><span>({<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> name: <span><span>'John Doe'<span><span>,<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/computed.html", "title": "计算属性", "doc_id": "782662a1d30141d08863a530fa543fc1", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1092, "chunk_index": 4, "_doc_id": "4_1806864361566681434"}}
{"doc_id": "5_2546314796080792266", "text": "span>({<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> name: <span><span>'John Doe'<span><span>,<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> books: [<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> 'Vue 2 - Advanced Guide'<span><span>,<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> 'Vue 3 - Basic Guide'<span><span>,<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> 'Vue 4 - The Mystery'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> ]<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/computed.html", "title": "计算属性", "doc_id": "782662a1d30141d08863a530fa543fc1", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1092, "chunk_index": 5, "_doc_id": "5_2546314796080792266"}}
{"doc_id": "6_8702547128432356421", "text": "<span class=\"line\"><span> 'Vue 4 - The Mystery'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> ]<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>})<span><span><code><pre><div><div><p>我们想根据 <code>author<code> 是否已有一些书籍来展示不同的信息：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>p<span><span>>Has published books:</<span><span>p<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/computed.html", "title": "计算属性", "doc_id": "782662a1d30141d08863a530fa543fc1", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1092, "chunk_index": 6, "_doc_id": "6_8702547128432356421"}}
{"doc_id": "7_1091096890288177795", "text": "line\"><span><<span><span>p<span><span>>Has published books:</<span><span>p<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>span<span><span>>{{ author.books.<span><span>length<span><span> ><span><span> 0<span><span> ?<span><span> 'Yes'<span><span> :<span><span> 'No'<span><span> }}</<span><span>span<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>这里的模板看起来有些复杂。我们必须认真看好一会儿才能明白它的计算依赖于 <code>author.books<code>。更重要的是，如果在模板中需要不止一次这样的计算，我们可不想将这样的代码在模板里重复好多遍。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/computed.html", "title": "计算属性", "doc_id": "782662a1d30141d08863a530fa543fc1", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1092, "chunk_index": 7, "_doc_id": "7_1091096890288177795"}}
{"doc_id": "8_7048719449776719791", "text": "起来有些复杂。我们必须认真看好一会儿才能明白它的计算依赖于 <code>author.books<code>。更重要的是，如果在模板中需要不止一次这样的计算，我们可不想将这样的代码在模板里重复好多遍。<p><p>因此我们推荐使用<strong>计算属性<strong>来描述依赖响应式状态的复杂逻辑。这是重构后的示例：<p><div class=\"options-api\"><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> data<span><span>() {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> return<span><span> {<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/computed.html", "title": "计算属性", "doc_id": "782662a1d30141d08863a530fa543fc1", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1092, "chunk_index": 8, "_doc_id": "8_7048719449776719791"}}
{"doc_id": "9_718183231410409088", "text": "><span> data<span><span>() {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> return<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> author: {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> name: <span><span>'John Doe'<span><span>,<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> books: [<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> 'Vue 2 - Advanced Guide'<span><span>,<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> 'Vue 3 - Basic Guide'<span><span>,<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> 'Vue 4 - The Mystery'<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/computed.html", "title": "计算属性", "doc_id": "782662a1d30141d08863a530fa543fc1", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1092, "chunk_index": 9, "_doc_id": "9_718183231410409088"}}
{"doc_id": "10_4220405707480590739", "text": "- Basic Guide'<span><span>,<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> 'Vue 4 - The Mystery'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> ]<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> },<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> computed: {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 一个计算属性的 getter<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> publishedBooksMessage<span><span>() {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // `this` 指向当前组件实例<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/computed.html", "title": "计算属性", "doc_id": "782662a1d30141d08863a530fa543fc1", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1092, "chunk_index": 10, "_doc_id": "10_4220405707480590739"}}
{"doc_id": "11_921164413558642939", "text": "edBooksMessage<span><span>() {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // `this` 指向当前组件实例<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> return<span><span> this<span><span>.author.books.<span><span>length<span><span> ><span><span> 0<span><span> ?<span><span> 'Yes'<span><span> :<span><span> 'No'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/computed.html", "title": "计算属性", "doc_id": "782662a1d30141d08863a530fa543fc1", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1092, "chunk_index": 11, "_doc_id": "11_921164413558642939"}}
{"doc_id": "12_8080142795668353787", "text": "n> 'No'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span><code><pre><div><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>p<span><span>>Has published books:</<span><span>p<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/computed.html", "title": "计算属性", "doc_id": "782662a1d30141d08863a530fa543fc1", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1092, "chunk_index": 12, "_doc_id": "12_8080142795668353787"}}
{"doc_id": "13_9162857921353604740", "text": "line\"><span><<span><span>p<span><span>>Has published books:</<span><span>p<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>span<span><span>>{{ publishedBooksMessage }}</<span><span>span<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p><a href=\"https://play.vuejs.", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/computed.html", "title": "计算属性", "doc_id": "782662a1d30141d08863a530fa543fc1", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1092, "chunk_index": 13, "_doc_id": "13_9162857921353604740"}}
{"doc_id": "14_4287938484602895871", "text": "Message }}</<span><span>span<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p><a href=\"https://play.vuejs.org/#\" target=\"_blank\">在演练场中尝试一下<a><p><p>我们在这里定义了一个计算属性 <code>publishedBooksMessage<code>。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/computed.html", "title": "计算属性", "doc_id": "782662a1d30141d08863a530fa543fc1", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1092, "chunk_index": 14, "_doc_id": "14_4287938484602895871"}}
{"doc_id": "15_2683177151092906610", "text": "WUwXYyi/gdTEpwK\" target=\"_blank\">在演练场中尝试一下<a><p><p>我们在这里定义了一个计算属性 <code>publishedBooksMessage<code>。<p><p>更改此应用的 <code>data<code> 中 <code>books<code> 数组的值后，可以看到 <code>publishedBooksMessage<code> 也会随之改变。<p><p>在模板中使用计算属性的方式和一般的属性并无二致。Vue 会检测到 <code>this.publishedBooksMessage<code> 依赖于 <code>this.author.books<code>，所以当 <code>this.author.books<code> 改变时，任何依赖于 <code>this.publishedBooksMessage<code> 的绑定都将同时更新。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/computed.html", "title": "计算属性", "doc_id": "782662a1d30141d08863a530fa543fc1", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1092, "chunk_index": 15, "_doc_id": "15_2683177151092906610"}}
{"doc_id": "16_5126003676220471726", "text": "<code>，所以当 <code>this.author.books<code> 改变时，任何依赖于 <code>this.publishedBooksMessage<code> 的绑定都将同时更新。<p><p>也可参考：<a href=\"/guide/typescript/options-api.html#typing-computed-properties\">为计算属性标记类型<a> <p><div><div class=\"composition-api\"><div class=\"language-vue\"> <span class=\"lang\">vue<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>script<span><span> setup<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/computed.html", "title": "计算属性", "doc_id": "782662a1d30141d08863a530fa543fc1", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1092, "chunk_index": 16, "_doc_id": "16_5126003676220471726"}}
{"doc_id": "17_6623832548334331738", "text": "code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>script<span><span> setup<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>import<span><span> { reactive, computed } <span><span>from<span><span> 'vue'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> author<span><span> =<span><span> reactive<span><span>({<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> name: <span><span>'John Doe'<span><span>,<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> books: [<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/computed.html", "title": "计算属性", "doc_id": "782662a1d30141d08863a530fa543fc1", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1092, "chunk_index": 17, "_doc_id": "17_6623832548334331738"}}
{"doc_id": "18_5679249734391261727", "text": "ame: <span><span>'John Doe'<span><span>,<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> books: [<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> 'Vue 2 - Advanced Guide'<span><span>,<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> 'Vue 3 - Basic Guide'<span><span>,<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> 'Vue 4 - The Mystery'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> ]<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>})<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 一个计算属性 ref<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/computed.html", "title": "计算属性", "doc_id": "782662a1d30141d08863a530fa543fc1", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1092, "chunk_index": 18, "_doc_id": "18_5679249734391261727"}}
{"doc_id": "19_8160868773829645784", "text": "\"><span>})<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 一个计算属性 ref<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> publishedBooksMessage<span><span> =<span><span> computed<span><span>(() <span><span>=><span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> return<span><span> author.books.<span><span>length<span><span> ><span><span> 0<span><span> ?<span><span> 'Yes'<span><span> :<span><span> 'No'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>})<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/computed.html", "title": "计算属性", "doc_id": "782662a1d30141d08863a530fa543fc1", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1092, "chunk_index": 19, "_doc_id": "19_8160868773829645784"}}
{"doc_id": "20_2829478163738591873", "text": "pan><span> 'Yes'<span><span> :<span><span> 'No'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>})<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>script<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>p<span><span>>Has published books:</<span><span>p<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>span<span><span>>{{ publishedBooksMessage }}</<span><span>span<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/computed.html", "title": "计算属性", "doc_id": "782662a1d30141d08863a530fa543fc1", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1092, "chunk_index": 20, "_doc_id": "20_2829478163738591873"}}
{"doc_id": "21_2038916159705264433", "text": "<span><span>span<span><span>>{{ publishedBooksMessage }}</<span><span>span<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p><a href=\"https://play.vuejs.", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/computed.html", "title": "计算属性", "doc_id": "782662a1d30141d08863a530fa543fc1", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1092, "chunk_index": 21, "_doc_id": "21_2038916159705264433"}}
{"doc_id": "22_2715362009013734211", "text": "<span></<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p><a href=\"https://play.vuejs.org/#\" target=\"_blank\">在演练场中尝试一下<a><p><p>我们在这里定义了一个计算属性 <code>publishedBooksMessage<code>。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/computed.html", "title": "计算属性", "doc_id": "782662a1d30141d08863a530fa543fc1", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1092, "chunk_index": 22, "_doc_id": "22_2715362009013734211"}}
{"doc_id": "23_7147320982767854876", "text": "DjvTfpfSBSbmA==\" target=\"_blank\">在演练场中尝试一下<a><p><p>我们在这里定义了一个计算属性 <code>publishedBooksMessage<code>。<code>computed()<code> 方法期望接收一个 <a href=\"https://developer.mozilla.org/zh-CN/docs/Web/JavaScript/Reference/Functions/get#description\" target=\"_blank\">getter 函数<a>，返回值为一个<strong>计算属性 ref<strong>。和其他一般的 ref 类似，你可以通过 <code>publishedBooksMessage.value<code> 访问计算结果。计算属性 ref 也会在模板中自动解包，因此在模板表达式中引用时无需添加 <code>.value<code>。<p><p>Vue 的计算属性会自动追踪响应式依赖。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/computed.html", "title": "计算属性", "doc_id": "782662a1d30141d08863a530fa543fc1", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1092, "chunk_index": 23, "_doc_id": "23_7147320982767854876"}}
{"doc_id": "24_4423360439704453304", "text": "alue<code> 访问计算结果。计算属性 ref 也会在模板中自动解包，因此在模板表达式中引用时无需添加 <code>.value<code>。<p><p>Vue 的计算属性会自动追踪响应式依赖。它会检测到 <code>publishedBooksMessage<code> 依赖于 <code>author.books<code>，所以当 <code>author.books<code> 改变时，任何依赖于 <code>publishedBooksMessage<code> 的绑定都会同时更新。<p><p>也可参考：<a href=\"/guide/typescript/composition-api.html#typing-computed\">为计算属性标注类型<a> <p><div><h2 id=\"computed-caching-vs-methods\">计算属性缓存 vs 方法 <a class=\"header-anchor\"", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/computed.html", "title": "计算属性", "doc_id": "782662a1d30141d08863a530fa543fc1", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1092, "chunk_index": 24, "_doc_id": "24_4423360439704453304"}}
{"doc_id": "25_375303460169330829", "text": "ed\">为计算属性标注类型<a> <p><div><h2 id=\"computed-caching-vs-methods\">计算属性缓存 vs 方法 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#computed-caching-vs-methods\">​<a><h2><p>你可能注意到我们在表达式中像这样调用一个函数也会获得和计算属性相同的结果：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>p<span><span>>{{ <span><span>calculateBooksMessage<span><span>() }}</<span><span>p<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><div class=\"options-api\"><div class=\"language-js\">", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/computed.html", "title": "计算属性", "doc_id": "782662a1d30141d08863a530fa543fc1", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1092, "chunk_index": 25, "_doc_id": "25_375303460169330829"}}
{"doc_id": "26_4839627209069531283", "text": "><span>p<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><div class=\"options-api\"><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// 组件中<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>methods<span><span>: {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> calculateBooksMessage<span><span>() {<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/computed.html", "title": "计算属性", "doc_id": "782662a1d30141d08863a530fa543fc1", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1092, "chunk_index": 26, "_doc_id": "26_4839627209069531283"}}
{"doc_id": "27_1431006813545185279", "text": "n><span>: {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> calculateBooksMessage<span><span>() {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> return<span><span> this<span><span>.author.books.<span><span>length<span><span> ><span><span> 0<span><span> ?<span><span> 'Yes'<span><span> :<span><span> 'No'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/computed.html", "title": "计算属性", "doc_id": "782662a1d30141d08863a530fa543fc1", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1092, "chunk_index": 27, "_doc_id": "27_1431006813545185279"}}
{"doc_id": "28_7282149679115340910", "text": "pan><span> 'Yes'<span><span> :<span><span> 'No'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span><code><pre><div><div><div class=\"composition-api\"><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// 组件中<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>function<span><span> calculateBooksMessage<span><span>() {<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/computed.html", "title": "计算属性", "doc_id": "782662a1d30141d08863a530fa543fc1", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1092, "chunk_index": 28, "_doc_id": "28_7282149679115340910"}}
{"doc_id": "29_3206505109860265433", "text": "an>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>function<span><span> calculateBooksMessage<span><span>() {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> return<span><span> author.books.<span><span>length<span><span> ><span><span> 0<span><span> ?<span><span> 'Yes'<span><span> :<span><span> 'No'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span><code><pre><div><div><p>若我们将同样的函数定义为一个方法而不是计算属性，两种方式在结果上确实是完全相同的，然而，不同之处在于<strong>计算属性值会基于其响应式依赖被缓存<strong>。一个计算属性仅会在其响应式依赖更新时才重新计算。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/computed.html", "title": "计算属性", "doc_id": "782662a1d30141d08863a530fa543fc1", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1092, "chunk_index": 29, "_doc_id": "29_3206505109860265433"}}
{"doc_id": "30_3808789998756236633", "text": "数定义为一个方法而不是计算属性，两种方式在结果上确实是完全相同的，然而，不同之处在于<strong>计算属性值会基于其响应式依赖被缓存<strong>。一个计算属性仅会在其响应式依赖更新时才重新计算。这意味着只要 <code>author.books<code> 不改变，无论多少次访问 <code>publishedBooksMessage<code> 都会立即返回先前的计算结果，而不用重复执行 getter 函数。<p><p>这也解释了为什么下面的计算属性永远不会更新，因为 <code>Date.now()<code> 并不是一个响应式依赖：<p><div class=\"options-api\"><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>computed<span><span>: {<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/computed.html", "title": "计算属性", "doc_id": "782662a1d30141d08863a530fa543fc1", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1092, "chunk_index": 30, "_doc_id": "30_3808789998756236633"}}
{"doc_id": "31_3871109735655322033", "text": "lass=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>computed<span><span>: {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> now<span><span>() {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> return<span><span> Date.<span><span>now<span><span>()<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/computed.html", "title": "计算属性", "doc_id": "782662a1d30141d08863a530fa543fc1", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1092, "chunk_index": 31, "_doc_id": "31_3871109735655322033"}}
{"doc_id": "32_7185799299171790276", "text": "<span><span> Date.<span><span>now<span><span>()<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span><code><pre><div><div><div class=\"composition-api\"><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> now<span><span> =<span><span> computed<span><span>(() <span><span>=><span><span> Date.<span><span>now<span><span>())<span><span><code><pre><div><div><p>相比之下，方法调用<strong>总是<strong>会在重渲染发生时再次执行函数。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/computed.html", "title": "计算属性", "doc_id": "782662a1d30141d08863a530fa543fc1", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1092, "chunk_index": 32, "_doc_id": "32_7185799299171790276"}}
{"doc_id": "33_1402138535703335782", "text": "pan>now<span><span>())<span><span><code><pre><div><div><p>相比之下，方法调用<strong>总是<strong>会在重渲染发生时再次执行函数。<p><p>为什么需要缓存呢？想象一下我们有一个非常耗性能的计算属性 <code>list<code>，需要循环一个巨大的数组并做许多计算逻辑，并且可能也有其他计算属性依赖于 <code>list<code>。没有缓存的话，我们会重复执行非常多次 <code>list<code> 的 getter，然而这实际上没有必要！如果你确定不需要缓存，那么也可以使用方法调用。<p><h2 id=\"writable-computed\">可写计算属性 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#writable-computed\">​<a><h2><p>计算属性默认是只读的。当你尝试修改一个计算属性时，你会收到一个运行时警告。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/computed.html", "title": "计算属性", "doc_id": "782662a1d30141d08863a530fa543fc1", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1092, "chunk_index": 33, "_doc_id": "33_1402138535703335782"}}
{"doc_id": "34_884928869836783308", "text": "<a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#writable-computed\">​<a><h2><p>计算属性默认是只读的。当你尝试修改一个计算属性时，你会收到一个运行时警告。只在某些特殊场景中你可能才需要用到“可写”的属性，你可以通过同时提供 getter 和 setter 来创建：<p><div class=\"options-api\"><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> data<span><span>() {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> return<span><span> {<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/computed.html", "title": "计算属性", "doc_id": "782662a1d30141d08863a530fa543fc1", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1092, "chunk_index": 34, "_doc_id": "34_884928869836783308"}}
