{"doc_id": "23_7287691733638758215", "text": "activeClass<span><span> =<span><span> ref<span><span>(<span><span>'active'<span><span>)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> errorClass<span><span> =<span><span> ref<span><span>(<span><span>'text-danger'<span><span>)<span><span><code><pre><div><div><div class=\"options-api\"><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>data<span><span>() {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> return<span><span> {<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/class-and-style.html", "title": "Class 与 Style 绑定", "doc_id": "82d16c6b93eb4b32b529f1c9b5520813", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 797, "chunk_index": 23, "_doc_id": "23_7287691733638758215"}}
{"doc_id": "24_4438104151729184136", "text": "\"><span>data<span><span>() {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> return<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> activeClass: <span><span>'active'<span><span>,<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> errorClass: <span><span>'text-danger'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/class-and-style.html", "title": "Class 与 Style 绑定", "doc_id": "82d16c6b93eb4b32b529f1c9b5520813", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 797, "chunk_index": 24, "_doc_id": "24_4438104151729184136"}}
{"doc_id": "25_5138323413347777076", "text": "e\"><span> errorClass: <span><span>'text-danger'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span><code><pre><div><div><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>div<span><span> :<span><span>class<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>[activeClass,", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/class-and-style.html", "title": "Class 与 Style 绑定", "doc_id": "82d16c6b93eb4b32b529f1c9b5520813", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 797, "chunk_index": 25, "_doc_id": "25_5138323413347777076"}}
{"doc_id": "26_8526737577481860483", "text": "><<span><span>div<span><span> :<span><span>class<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>[activeClass, errorClass]<span><span>\"<span><span>></<span><span>div<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>渲染的结果是：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>div<span><span> class<span><span>=<span><span>\"active text-danger\"<span><span>></<span><span>div<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>如果你也想在数组中有条件地渲染某个 class，", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/class-and-style.html", "title": "Class 与 Style 绑定", "doc_id": "82d16c6b93eb4b32b529f1c9b5520813", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 797, "chunk_index": 26, "_doc_id": "26_8526737577481860483"}}
{"doc_id": "27_6798443481203740739", "text": "r\"<span><span>></<span><span>div<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>如果你也想在数组中有条件地渲染某个 class，你可以使用三元表达式：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>div<span><span> :<span><span>class<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>[isActive <span><span>?<span><span> activeClass <span><span>:<span><span> ''<span><span>, errorClass]<span><span>\"<span><span>></<span><span>div<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p><code>errorClass<code> 会一直存在，", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/class-and-style.html", "title": "Class 与 Style 绑定", "doc_id": "82d16c6b93eb4b32b529f1c9b5520813", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 797, "chunk_index": 27, "_doc_id": "27_6798443481203740739"}}
{"doc_id": "28_6874941333466007874", "text": "an><span>></<span><span>div<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p><code>errorClass<code> 会一直存在，但 <code>activeClass<code> 只会在 <code>isActive<code> 为真时才存在。<p><p>然而，这可能在有多个依赖条件的 class 时会有些冗长。因此也可以在数组中嵌套对象：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>div<span><span> :<span><span>class<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>[{ [activeClass]: isActive },", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/class-and-style.html", "title": "Class 与 Style 绑定", "doc_id": "82d16c6b93eb4b32b529f1c9b5520813", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 797, "chunk_index": 28, "_doc_id": "28_6874941333466007874"}}
{"doc_id": "29_3031917037273478688", "text": "v<span><span> :<span><span>class<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>[{ [activeClass]: isActive }, errorClass]<span><span>\"<span><span>></<span><span>div<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><h3 id=\"with-components\">在组件上使用 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#with-components\">​<a><h3><blockquote><p>本节假设你已经有 <a href=\"/guide/essentials/component-basics.html\">Vue 组件<a>的知识基础。如果没有，你也可以暂时跳过，以后再阅读。<p><blockquote><p>对于只有一个根元素的组件，当你使用了 <code>class<code> attribute 时，这些 class 会被添加到根元素上并与该元素上已有的 class 合并。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/class-and-style.html", "title": "Class 与 Style 绑定", "doc_id": "82d16c6b93eb4b32b529f1c9b5520813", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 797, "chunk_index": 29, "_doc_id": "29_3031917037273478688"}}
{"doc_id": "30_8561396916958397278", "text": "blockquote><p>对于只有一个根元素的组件，当你使用了 <code>class<code> attribute 时，这些 class 会被添加到根元素上并与该元素上已有的 class 合并。<p><p>举例来说，如果你声明了一个组件名叫 <code>MyComponent<code>，模板如下：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><!-- 子组件模板 --><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/class-and-style.html", "title": "Class 与 Style 绑定", "doc_id": "82d16c6b93eb4b32b529f1c9b5520813", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 797, "chunk_index": 30, "_doc_id": "30_8561396916958397278"}}
{"doc_id": "31_777931860666390824", "text": "an><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><!-- 子组件模板 --><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>p<span><span> class<span><span>=<span><span>\"foo bar\"<span><span>>Hi!</<span><span>p<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>在使用时添加一些 class：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><!-- 在使用组件时 --><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>MyComponent<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/class-and-style.html", "title": "Class 与 Style 绑定", "doc_id": "82d16c6b93eb4b32b529f1c9b5520813", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 797, "chunk_index": 31, "_doc_id": "31_777931860666390824"}}
{"doc_id": "32_7606014377440295118", "text": "ne\"><span><!-- 在使用组件时 --><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>MyComponent<span><span> class<span><span>=<span><span>\"baz boo\"<span><span> /><span><span><code><pre><div><p>渲染出的 HTML 为：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>p<span><span> class<span><span>=<span><span>\"foo bar baz boo\"<span><span>>Hi!</<span><span>p<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>Class 的绑定也是同样的：<p><div", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/class-and-style.html", "title": "Class 与 Style 绑定", "doc_id": "82d16c6b93eb4b32b529f1c9b5520813", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 797, "chunk_index": 32, "_doc_id": "32_7606014377440295118"}}
{"doc_id": "33_6119239768524189975", "text": "o\"<span><span>>Hi!</<span><span>p<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>Class 的绑定也是同样的：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>MyComponent<span><span> :<span><span>class<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>{ active: isActive }<span><span>\"<span><span> /><span><span><code><pre><div><p>当 <code>isActive<code> 为真时，", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/class-and-style.html", "title": "Class 与 Style 绑定", "doc_id": "82d16c6b93eb4b32b529f1c9b5520813", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 797, "chunk_index": 33, "_doc_id": "33_6119239768524189975"}}
{"doc_id": "34_7647309463507760555", "text": "ve: isActive }<span><span>\"<span><span> /><span><span><code><pre><div><p>当 <code>isActive<code> 为真时，被渲染的 HTML 会是：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>p<span><span> class<span><span>=<span><span>\"foo bar active\"<span><span>>Hi!</<span><span>p<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>如果你的组件有多个根元素，你将需要指定哪个根元素来接收这个 class。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/class-and-style.html", "title": "Class 与 Style 绑定", "doc_id": "82d16c6b93eb4b32b529f1c9b5520813", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 797, "chunk_index": 34, "_doc_id": "34_7647309463507760555"}}
{"doc_id": "35_8228835671453466807", "text": ">>Hi!</<span><span>p<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>如果你的组件有多个根元素，你将需要指定哪个根元素来接收这个 class。你可以通过组件的 <code>$attrs<code> 属性来指定接收的元素：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><!-- MyComponent 模板使用 $attrs 时 --><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/class-and-style.html", "title": "Class 与 Style 绑定", "doc_id": "82d16c6b93eb4b32b529f1c9b5520813", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 797, "chunk_index": 35, "_doc_id": "35_8228835671453466807"}}
{"doc_id": "36_4787616788578513299", "text": "github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><!-- MyComponent 模板使用 $attrs 时 --><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>p<span><span> :<span><span>class<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>$attrs.class<span><span>\"<span><span>>Hi!</<span><span>p<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>span<span><span>>This is a child component</<span><span>span<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/class-and-style.html", "title": "Class 与 Style 绑定", "doc_id": "82d16c6b93eb4b32b529f1c9b5520813", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 797, "chunk_index": 36, "_doc_id": "36_4787616788578513299"}}
{"doc_id": "37_2399916889092090752", "text": "><code><pre><div><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>MyComponent<span><span> class<span><span>=<span><span>\"baz\"<span><span> /><span><span><code><pre><div><p>这将被渲染为：<p><div class=\"language-html\"> <span class=\"lang\">html<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>p<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/class-and-style.html", "title": "Class 与 Style 绑定", "doc_id": "82d16c6b93eb4b32b529f1c9b5520813", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 797, "chunk_index": 37, "_doc_id": "37_2399916889092090752"}}
{"doc_id": "38_6152022432917372082", "text": "an><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>p<span><span> class<span><span>=<span><span>\"baz\"<span><span>>Hi!</<span><span>p<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>span<span><span>>This is a child component</<span><span>span<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>你可以在<a href=\"/guide/components/attrs.html\">透传 Attribute<a> 一章中了解更多组件的 attribute 继承的细节。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/class-and-style.html", "title": "Class 与 Style 绑定", "doc_id": "82d16c6b93eb4b32b529f1c9b5520813", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 797, "chunk_index": 38, "_doc_id": "38_6152022432917372082"}}
{"doc_id": "39_215732399877045740", "text": "><pre><div><p>你可以在<a href=\"/guide/components/attrs.html\">透传 Attribute<a> 一章中了解更多组件的 attribute 继承的细节。<p><h2 id=\"binding-inline-styles\">绑定内联样式 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#binding-inline-styles\">​<a><h2><h3 id=\"binding-to-objects-1\">绑定对象 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#binding-to-objects-1\">​<a><h3><p><code>:style<code> 支持绑定 JavaScript 对象值，", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/class-and-style.html", "title": "Class 与 Style 绑定", "doc_id": "82d16c6b93eb4b32b529f1c9b5520813", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 797, "chunk_index": 39, "_doc_id": "39_215732399877045740"}}
{"doc_id": "40_5839872693455214831", "text": "lass=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#binding-to-objects-1\">​<a><h3><p><code>:style<code> 支持绑定 JavaScript 对象值，对应的是 <a href=\"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/API/HTMLElement/style\" target=\"_blank\">HTML 元素的 <code>style<code> 属性<a>：<p><div class=\"composition-api\"><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> activeColor<span><span> =<span><span> ref<span><span>(<span><span>'red'<span><span>)<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/class-and-style.html", "title": "Class 与 Style 绑定", "doc_id": "82d16c6b93eb4b32b529f1c9b5520813", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 797, "chunk_index": 40, "_doc_id": "40_5839872693455214831"}}
{"doc_id": "41_4137301156453646092", "text": "n> activeColor<span><span> =<span><span> ref<span><span>(<span><span>'red'<span><span>)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> fontSize<span><span> =<span><span> ref<span><span>(<span><span>30<span><span>)<span><span><code><pre><div><div><div class=\"options-api\"><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>data<span><span>() {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> return<span><span> {<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/class-and-style.html", "title": "Class 与 Style 绑定", "doc_id": "82d16c6b93eb4b32b529f1c9b5520813", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 797, "chunk_index": 41, "_doc_id": "41_4137301156453646092"}}
{"doc_id": "42_1235746389411099524", "text": "\"><span>data<span><span>() {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> return<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> activeColor: <span><span>'red'<span><span>,<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> fontSize: <span><span>30<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/class-and-style.html", "title": "Class 与 Style 绑定", "doc_id": "82d16c6b93eb4b32b529f1c9b5520813", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 797, "chunk_index": 42, "_doc_id": "42_1235746389411099524"}}
{"doc_id": "43_1527930713507664282", "text": "an class=\"line\"><span> fontSize: <span><span>30<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span><code><pre><div><div><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>div<span><span> :<span><span>style<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>{ color: activeColor, fontSize: fontSize <span><span>+<span><span> 'px'<span><span> }<span><span>\"<span><span>></<span><span>div<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>尽管推荐使用 camelCase，", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/class-and-style.html", "title": "Class 与 Style 绑定", "doc_id": "82d16c6b93eb4b32b529f1c9b5520813", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 797, "chunk_index": 43, "_doc_id": "43_1527930713507664282"}}
{"doc_id": "44_591768097653500798", "text": "n><span>\"<span><span>></<span><span>div<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>尽管推荐使用 camelCase，但 <code>:style<code> 也支持 kebab-cased 形式的 CSS 属性 key (对应其 CSS 中的实际名称)，", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/class-and-style.html", "title": "Class 与 Style 绑定", "doc_id": "82d16c6b93eb4b32b529f1c9b5520813", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 797, "chunk_index": 44, "_doc_id": "44_591768097653500798"}}
{"doc_id": "45_7124227357941255259", "text": "><pre><div><p>尽管推荐使用 camelCase，但 <code>:style<code> 也支持 kebab-cased 形式的 CSS 属性 key (对应其 CSS 中的实际名称)，例如：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>div<span><span> :<span><span>style<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>{ <span><span>'font-size'<span><span>: fontSize <span><span>+<span><span> 'px'<span><span> }<span><span>\"<span><span>></<span><span>div<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>直接绑定一个样式对象通常是一个好主意，", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/class-and-style.html", "title": "Class 与 Style 绑定", "doc_id": "82d16c6b93eb4b32b529f1c9b5520813", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 797, "chunk_index": 45, "_doc_id": "45_7124227357941255259"}}
{"doc_id": "46_4403408135385569849", "text": "<span>\"<span><span>></<span><span>div<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>直接绑定一个样式对象通常是一个好主意，这样可以使模板更加简洁：<p><div class=\"composition-api\"><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> styleObject<span><span> =<span><span> reactive<span><span>({<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> color: <span><span>'red'<span><span>,<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> fontSize: <span><span>'30px'<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/class-and-style.html", "title": "Class 与 Style 绑定", "doc_id": "82d16c6b93eb4b32b529f1c9b5520813", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 797, "chunk_index": 46, "_doc_id": "46_4403408135385569849"}}
{"doc_id": "47_4200919410927391099", "text": "n>'red'<span><span>,<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> fontSize: <span><span>'30px'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>})<span><span><code><pre><div><div><div class=\"options-api\"><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>data<span><span>() {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> return<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> styleObject: {<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/class-and-style.html", "title": "Class 与 Style 绑定", "doc_id": "82d16c6b93eb4b32b529f1c9b5520813", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 797, "chunk_index": 47, "_doc_id": "47_4200919410927391099"}}
{"doc_id": "48_6388811846662402740", "text": "\"line\"><span> return<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> styleObject: {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> color: <span><span>'red'<span><span>,<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> fontSize: <span><span>'13px'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/class-and-style.html", "title": "Class 与 Style 绑定", "doc_id": "82d16c6b93eb4b32b529f1c9b5520813", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 797, "chunk_index": 48, "_doc_id": "48_6388811846662402740"}}
{"doc_id": "49_8733296471935972324", "text": ">'13px'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span><code><pre><div><div><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>div<span><span> :<span><span>style<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>styleObject<span><span>\"<span><span>></<span><span>div<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>同样的，如果样式对象需要更复杂的逻辑，也可以使用返回样式对象的计算属性。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/class-and-style.html", "title": "Class 与 Style 绑定", "doc_id": "82d16c6b93eb4b32b529f1c9b5520813", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 797, "chunk_index": 49, "_doc_id": "49_8733296471935972324"}}
{"doc_id": "50_7446600006379060854", "text": "n>></<span><span>div<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>同样的，如果样式对象需要更复杂的逻辑，也可以使用返回样式对象的计算属性。<p><p><code>:style<code> 指令也可以和常规的 style attribute 共存，就像 <code>:class<code>。<p><p>模板：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>h1<span><span> style<span><span>=<span><span>\"color: red\"<span><span> :<span><span>style<span><span>=<span><span>\"'font-size:", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/class-and-style.html", "title": "Class 与 Style 绑定", "doc_id": "82d16c6b93eb4b32b529f1c9b5520813", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 797, "chunk_index": 50, "_doc_id": "50_7446600006379060854"}}
{"doc_id": "51_3256130759419466465", "text": "<span>=<span><span>\"color: red\"<span><span> :<span><span>style<span><span>=<span><span>\"'font-size: 1em'\"<span><span>>hello</<span><span>h1<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>这将被渲染为：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>h1<span><span> style<span><span>=<span><span>\"color: red;", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/class-and-style.html", "title": "Class 与 Style 绑定", "doc_id": "82d16c6b93eb4b32b529f1c9b5520813", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 797, "chunk_index": 51, "_doc_id": "51_3256130759419466465"}}
{"doc_id": "52_7114089730802803478", "text": "ode><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>h1<span><span> style<span><span>=<span><span>\"color: red; font-size: 1em;\"<span><span>>hello</<span><span>h1<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><h3 id=\"binding-to-arrays-1\">绑定数组 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#binding-to-arrays-1\">​<a><h3><p>我们还可以给 <code>:style<code> 绑定一个包含多个样式对象的数组。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/class-and-style.html", "title": "Class 与 Style 绑定", "doc_id": "82d16c6b93eb4b32b529f1c9b5520813", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 797, "chunk_index": 52, "_doc_id": "52_7114089730802803478"}}
{"doc_id": "53_900614173093508062", "text": "ss=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#binding-to-arrays-1\">​<a><h3><p>我们还可以给 <code>:style<code> 绑定一个包含多个样式对象的数组。这些对象会被合并后渲染到同一元素上：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>div<span><span> :<span><span>style<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>[baseStyles,", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/class-and-style.html", "title": "Class 与 Style 绑定", "doc_id": "82d16c6b93eb4b32b529f1c9b5520813", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 797, "chunk_index": 53, "_doc_id": "53_900614173093508062"}}
{"doc_id": "54_6675886093697233482", "text": "n><<span><span>div<span><span> :<span><span>style<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>[baseStyles, overridingStyles]<span><span>\"<span><span>></<span><span>div<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><h3 id=\"auto-prefixing\">自动前缀 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#auto-prefixing\">​<a><h3><p>当你在 <code>:style<code> 中使用了需要<a href=\"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Glossary/Vendor_Prefix\" target=\"_blank\">浏览器特殊前缀<a>的 CSS 属性时，Vue 会自动为他们加上相应的前缀。Vue 是在运行时检查该属性是否支持在当前浏览器中使用。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/class-and-style.html", "title": "Class 与 Style 绑定", "doc_id": "82d16c6b93eb4b32b529f1c9b5520813", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 797, "chunk_index": 54, "_doc_id": "54_6675886093697233482"}}
{"doc_id": "55_5845254834841211503", "text": "ry/Vendor_Prefix\" target=\"_blank\">浏览器特殊前缀<a>的 CSS 属性时，Vue 会自动为他们加上相应的前缀。Vue 是在运行时检查该属性是否支持在当前浏览器中使用。如果浏览器不支持某个属性，那么将尝试加上各个浏览器特殊前缀，以找到哪一个是被支持的。<p><h3 id=\"multiple-values\">样式多值 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#multiple-values\">​<a><h3><p>你可以对一个样式属性提供多个 (不同前缀的) 值，", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/class-and-style.html", "title": "Class 与 Style 绑定", "doc_id": "82d16c6b93eb4b32b529f1c9b5520813", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 797, "chunk_index": 55, "_doc_id": "55_5845254834841211503"}}
{"doc_id": "56_661221664167252707", "text": "e-values\">样式多值 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#multiple-values\">​<a><h3><p>你可以对一个样式属性提供多个 (不同前缀的) 值，举例来说：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>div<span><span> :<span><span>style<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>{ display: [<span><span>'-webkit-box'<span><span>, <span><span>'-ms-flexbox'<span><span>, <span><span>'flex'<span><span>] }<span><span>\"<span><span>></<span><span>div<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>数组仅会渲染浏览器支持的最后一个值。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/class-and-style.html", "title": "Class 与 Style 绑定", "doc_id": "82d16c6b93eb4b32b529f1c9b5520813", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 797, "chunk_index": 56, "_doc_id": "56_661221664167252707"}}
{"doc_id": "57_7676311235780596640", "text": "><span>\"<span><span>></<span><span>div<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>数组仅会渲染浏览器支持的最后一个值。在这个示例中，在支持不需要特别前缀的浏览器中都会渲染为 <code>display: flex<code>。<p><div><div>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/class-and-style.html", "title": "Class 与 Style 绑定", "doc_id": "82d16c6b93eb4b32b529f1c9b5520813", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 797, "chunk_index": 57, "_doc_id": "57_7676311235780596640"}}
{"doc_id": "0_7452557201614569240", "text": "<div><div class=\"page-hero__lead\"><p> Vue 合作伙伴是 Vue 团队认可提供一流 Vue 咨询和开发服务的机构。如果你的公司有兴趣被列为合作伙伴，请<a href=\"https://airtable.com/shrCQhat57SApJI2l\" target=\"_blank\">在此注册<a>。 <p><div><div>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/partners/", "title": "Vue Partners | Vue.js", "doc_id": "2e3e82fc01e54a54b2c67d74f2d5f799", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 11, "chunk_index": 0, "_doc_id": "0_7452557201614569240"}}
{"doc_id": "0_5709068416316787050", "text": "<div><div><h1 id=\"conditional-rendering\">条件渲染 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#conditional-rendering\">​<a><h1><h2 id=\"v-if\"><code>v-if<code> <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#v-if\">​<a><h2><p><code>v-if<code> 指令用于条件性地渲染一块内容。这块内容只会在指令的表达式返回真值时才被渲染。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/conditional.html", "title": "条件渲染", "doc_id": "cac13c66898c48f0879688adf76f0e5f", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 231, "chunk_index": 0, "_doc_id": "0_5709068416316787050"}}
{"doc_id": "1_6077545550877399793", "text": "lass=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#v-if\">​<a><h2><p><code>v-if<code> 指令用于条件性地渲染一块内容。这块内容只会在指令的表达式返回真值时才被渲染。<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>h1<span><span> v-if<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>awesome<span><span>\"<span><span>>Vue is awesome!</<span><span>h1<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><h2 id=\"v-else\"><code>v-else<code> <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#v-else\">​<a><h2><p>你也可以使用 <code>v-else<code> 为 <code>v-if<code> 添加一个“else 区块”。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/conditional.html", "title": "条件渲染", "doc_id": "cac13c66898c48f0879688adf76f0e5f", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 231, "chunk_index": 1, "_doc_id": "1_6077545550877399793"}}
{"doc_id": "2_1086228263200433639", "text": "header-anchor\" href=\"#v-else\">​<a><h2><p>你也可以使用 <code>v-else<code> 为 <code>v-if<code> 添加一个“else 区块”。<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>button<span><span> @<span><span>click<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>awesome <span><span>=<span><span> !<span><span>awesome<span><span>\"<span><span>>Toggle</<span><span>button<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/conditional.html", "title": "条件渲染", "doc_id": "cac13c66898c48f0879688adf76f0e5f", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 231, "chunk_index": 2, "_doc_id": "2_1086228263200433639"}}
{"doc_id": "3_5463399280063786632", "text": "n><span>\"<span><span>>Toggle</<span><span>button<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>h1<span><span> v-if<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>awesome<span><span>\"<span><span>>Vue is awesome!</<span><span>h1<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/conditional.html", "title": "条件渲染", "doc_id": "cac13c66898c48f0879688adf76f0e5f", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 231, "chunk_index": 3, "_doc_id": "3_5463399280063786632"}}
{"doc_id": "4_5036282556521064136", "text": "pan><span>awesome<span><span>\"<span><span>>Vue is awesome!</<span><span>h1<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>h1<span><span> v-else<span><span>>Oh no 😢</<span><span>h1<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p class=\"demo\"> Toggle <h1>Vue is awesome!<h1><p><p>一个 <code>v-else<code> 元素必须跟在一个 <code>v-if<code> 或者 <code>v-else-if<code> 元素后面，否则它将不会被识别。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/conditional.html", "title": "条件渲染", "doc_id": "cac13c66898c48f0879688adf76f0e5f", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 231, "chunk_index": 4, "_doc_id": "4_5036282556521064136"}}
{"doc_id": "5_6470065671902392547", "text": "e!<h1><p><p>一个 <code>v-else<code> 元素必须跟在一个 <code>v-if<code> 或者 <code>v-else-if<code> 元素后面，否则它将不会被识别。<p><h2 id=\"v-else-if\"><code>v-else-if<code> <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#v-else-if\">​<a><h2><p>顾名思义，<code>v-else-if<code> 提供的是相应于 <code>v-if<code> 的“else if 区块”。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/conditional.html", "title": "条件渲染", "doc_id": "cac13c66898c48f0879688adf76f0e5f", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 231, "chunk_index": 5, "_doc_id": "5_6470065671902392547"}}
{"doc_id": "6_4456437635671843967", "text": "hor\" href=\"#v-else-if\">​<a><h2><p>顾名思义，<code>v-else-if<code> 提供的是相应于 <code>v-if<code> 的“else if 区块”。它可以连续多次重复使用：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>div<span><span> v-if<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>type <span><span>===<span><span> 'A'\"<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> A<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>div<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/conditional.html", "title": "条件渲染", "doc_id": "cac13c66898c48f0879688adf76f0e5f", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 231, "chunk_index": 6, "_doc_id": "6_4456437635671843967"}}
{"doc_id": "7_8417354723302496740", "text": "ass=\"line\"><span> A<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>div<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>div<span><span> v-else-if<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>type <span><span>===<span><span> 'B'\"<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> B<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>div<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/conditional.html", "title": "条件渲染", "doc_id": "cac13c66898c48f0879688adf76f0e5f", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 231, "chunk_index": 7, "_doc_id": "7_8417354723302496740"}}
{"doc_id": "8_8793500316179075104", "text": "ass=\"line\"><span> B<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>div<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>div<span><span> v-else-if<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>type <span><span>===<span><span> 'C'\"<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> C<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>div<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>div<span><span> v-else<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> Not A/B/C<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/conditional.html", "title": "条件渲染", "doc_id": "cac13c66898c48f0879688adf76f0e5f", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 231, "chunk_index": 8, "_doc_id": "8_8793500316179075104"}}
{"doc_id": "9_1198233870396478108", "text": "pan>div<span><span> v-else<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> Not A/B/C<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>div<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>和 <code>v-else<code> 类似，一个使用 <code>v-else-if<code> 的元素必须紧跟在一个 <code>v-if<code> 或一个 <code>v-else-if<code> 元素后面。<p><h2 id=\"v-if-on-template\"><code><template><code> 上的 <code>v-if<code> <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#v-if-on-template\">​<a><h2><p>因为 <code>v-if<code> 是一个指令，他必须依附于某个元素。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/conditional.html", "title": "条件渲染", "doc_id": "cac13c66898c48f0879688adf76f0e5f", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 231, "chunk_index": 9, "_doc_id": "9_1198233870396478108"}}
{"doc_id": "10_4238284237479212331", "text": "> <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#v-if-on-template\">​<a><h2><p>因为 <code>v-if<code> 是一个指令，他必须依附于某个元素。但如果我们想要切换不止一个元素呢？在这种情况下我们可以在一个 <code><template><code> 元素上使用 <code>v-if<code>，这只是一个不可见的包装器元素，最后渲染的结果并不会包含这个 <code><template><code> 元素。<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>template<span><span> v-if<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>ok<span><span>\"<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/conditional.html", "title": "条件渲染", "doc_id": "cac13c66898c48f0879688adf76f0e5f", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 231, "chunk_index": 10, "_doc_id": "10_4238284237479212331"}}
{"doc_id": "11_4783379719535182023", "text": "late<span><span> v-if<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>ok<span><span>\"<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>h1<span><span>>Title</<span><span>h1<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>p<span><span>>Paragraph 1</<span><span>p<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>p<span><span>>Paragraph 2</<span><span>p<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/conditional.html", "title": "条件渲染", "doc_id": "cac13c66898c48f0879688adf76f0e5f", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 231, "chunk_index": 11, "_doc_id": "11_4783379719535182023"}}
{"doc_id": "12_2268172886026471772", "text": "class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>p<span><span>>Paragraph 2</<span><span>p<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p><code>v-else<code> 和 <code>v-else-if<code> 也可以在 <code><template><code> 上使用。<p><h2 id=\"v-show\"><code>v-show<code> <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#v-show\">​<a><h2><p>另一个可以用来按条件显示一个元素的指令是 <code>v-show<code>。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/conditional.html", "title": "条件渲染", "doc_id": "cac13c66898c48f0879688adf76f0e5f", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 231, "chunk_index": 12, "_doc_id": "12_2268172886026471772"}}
{"doc_id": "13_7784539620027266283", "text": "ow<code> <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#v-show\">​<a><h2><p>另一个可以用来按条件显示一个元素的指令是 <code>v-show<code>。其用法基本一样：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>h1<span><span> v-show<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>ok<span><span>\"<span><span>>Hello!</<span><span>h1<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>不同之处在于 <code>v-show<code> 会在 DOM 渲染中保留该元素；<code>v-show<code> 仅切换了该元素上名为 <code>display<code> 的 CSS 属性。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/conditional.html", "title": "条件渲染", "doc_id": "cac13c66898c48f0879688adf76f0e5f", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 231, "chunk_index": 13, "_doc_id": "13_7784539620027266283"}}
{"doc_id": "14_8492667857483605534", "text": "同之处在于 <code>v-show<code> 会在 DOM 渲染中保留该元素；<code>v-show<code> 仅切换了该元素上名为 <code>display<code> 的 CSS 属性。<p><p><code>v-show<code> 不支持在 <code><template><code> 元素上使用，也不能和 <code>v-else<code> 搭配使用。<p><h2 id=\"v-if-vs-v-show\"><code>v-if<code> vs. <code>v-show<code> <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#v-if-vs-v-show\">​<a><h2><p><code>v-if<code> 是“真实的”按条件渲染，因为它确保了在切换时，条件区块内的事件监听器和子组件都会被销毁与重建。<p><p><code>v-if<code> 也是<strong>惰性<strong>的：如果在初次渲染时条件值为 false，则不会做任何事。条件区块只有当条件首次变为 true 时才被渲染。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/conditional.html", "title": "条件渲染", "doc_id": "cac13c66898c48f0879688adf76f0e5f", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 231, "chunk_index": 14, "_doc_id": "14_8492667857483605534"}}
{"doc_id": "15_2906025087616906978", "text": "重建。<p><p><code>v-if<code> 也是<strong>惰性<strong>的：如果在初次渲染时条件值为 false，则不会做任何事。条件区块只有当条件首次变为 true 时才被渲染。<p><p>相比之下，<code>v-show<code> 简单许多，元素无论初始条件如何，始终会被渲染，只有 CSS <code>display<code> 属性会被切换。<p><p>总的来说，<code>v-if<code> 有更高的切换开销，而 <code>v-show<code> 有更高的初始渲染开销。因此，如果需要频繁切换，则使用 <code>v-show<code> 较好；如果在运行时绑定条件很少改变，则 <code>v-if<code> 会更合适。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/conditional.html", "title": "条件渲染", "doc_id": "cac13c66898c48f0879688adf76f0e5f", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 231, "chunk_index": 15, "_doc_id": "15_2906025087616906978"}}
{"doc_id": "16_9202055278129823482", "text": "-show<code> 有更高的初始渲染开销。因此，如果需要频繁切换，则使用 <code>v-show<code> 较好；如果在运行时绑定条件很少改变，则 <code>v-if<code> 会更合适。<p><h2 id=\"v-if-with-v-for\"><code>v-if<code> 和 <code>v-for<code> <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#v-if-with-v-for\">​<a><h2><p>当 <code>v-if<code> 和 <code>v-for<code> 同时存在于一个元素上的时候，<code>v-if<code> 会首先被执行。请查看<a href=\"./list.html#v-for-with-v-if\">列表渲染指南<a>获取更多细节。<p><div class=\"warning custom-block\"><p class=\"custom-block-title\">警告<p><p>同时使用 <code>v-if<code> 和 <code>v-for<code> 是<strong>不推荐的<strong>，因为这样二者的优先级不明显。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/conditional.html", "title": "条件渲染", "doc_id": "cac13c66898c48f0879688adf76f0e5f", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 231, "chunk_index": 16, "_doc_id": "16_9202055278129823482"}}
{"doc_id": "17_3140912694476409958", "text": "-block-title\">警告<p><p>同时使用 <code>v-if<code> 和 <code>v-for<code> 是<strong>不推荐的<strong>，因为这样二者的优先级不明显。请查看<a href=\"./list.html#v-for-with-v-if\">列表渲染指南<a>获得更多信息。<p><div><div><div>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/conditional.html", "title": "条件渲染", "doc_id": "cac13c66898c48f0879688adf76f0e5f", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 231, "chunk_index": 17, "_doc_id": "17_3140912694476409958"}}
{"doc_id": "0_3072679641340775823", "text": "<div><div><h1 id=\"list-rendering\">列表渲染 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#list-rendering\">​<a><h1><h2 id=\"v-for\"><code>v-for<code> <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#v-for\">​<a><h2><p>我们可以使用 <code>v-for<code> 指令基于一个数组来渲染一个列表。<code>v-for<code> 指令的值需要使用 <code>item in items<code> 形式的特殊语法，其中 <code>items<code> 是源数据的数组，", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/list.html", "title": "列表渲染", "doc_id": "964ebb3210d342089e651e64215beb47", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1081, "chunk_index": 0, "_doc_id": "0_3072679641340775823"}}
{"doc_id": "1_4149579802439068151", "text": "数组来渲染一个列表。<code>v-for<code> 指令的值需要使用 <code>item in items<code> 形式的特殊语法，其中 <code>items<code> 是源数据的数组，而 <code>item<code> 是迭代项的<strong>别名<strong>：<p><div class=\"composition-api\"><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> items<span><span> =<span><span> ref<span><span>([{ message: <span><span>'Foo'<span><span> },", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/list.html", "title": "列表渲染", "doc_id": "964ebb3210d342089e651e64215beb47", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1081, "chunk_index": 1, "_doc_id": "1_4149579802439068151"}}
{"doc_id": "2_858280215110150292", "text": "<span> items<span><span> =<span><span> ref<span><span>([{ message: <span><span>'Foo'<span><span> }, { message: <span><span>'Bar'<span><span> }])<span><span><code><pre><div><div><div class=\"options-api\"><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>data<span><span>() {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> return<span><span> {<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/list.html", "title": "列表渲染", "doc_id": "964ebb3210d342089e651e64215beb47", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1081, "chunk_index": 2, "_doc_id": "2_858280215110150292"}}
{"doc_id": "3_3782369628291117566", "text": "\"><span>data<span><span>() {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> return<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> items: [{ message: <span><span>'Foo'<span><span> }, { message: <span><span>'Bar'<span><span> }]<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/list.html", "title": "列表渲染", "doc_id": "964ebb3210d342089e651e64215beb47", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1081, "chunk_index": 3, "_doc_id": "3_3782369628291117566"}}
{"doc_id": "4_80806306319906152", "text": "}, { message: <span><span>'Bar'<span><span> }]<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span><code><pre><div><div><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>li<span><span> v-for<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>item <span><span>in<span><span> items<span><span>\"<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> {{ item.message }}<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/list.html", "title": "列表渲染", "doc_id": "964ebb3210d342089e651e64215beb47", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1081, "chunk_index": 4, "_doc_id": "4_80806306319906152"}}
