{"doc_id": "6_3427846991771477673", "text": "rentMessage<span><span> =<span><span> ref<span><span>(<span><span>'Parent'<span><span>)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> items<span><span> =<span><span> ref<span><span>([{ message: <span><span>'Foo'<span><span> }, { message: <span><span>'Bar'<span><span> }])<span><span><code><pre><div><div><div class=\"options-api\"><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>data<span><span>() {<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/list.html", "title": "列表渲染", "doc_id": "964ebb3210d342089e651e64215beb47", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1081, "chunk_index": 6, "_doc_id": "6_3427846991771477673"}}
