{"doc_id": "13_3548138506715827095", "text": "s=\"line\"><span> console.<span><span>log<span><span>(parentMessage, item.message, index)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>})<span><span><code><pre><div><p>注意 <code>v-for<code> 是如何对应 <code>forEach<code> 回调的函数签名的。实际上，你也可以在定义 <code>v-for<code> 的变量别名时使用解构，和解构函数参数类似：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>li<span><span> v-for<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>{ message } <span><span>in<span><span> items<span><span>\"<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/list.html", "title": "列表渲染", "doc_id": "964ebb3210d342089e651e64215beb47", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1081, "chunk_index": 13, "_doc_id": "13_3548138506715827095"}}
