{"doc_id": "15_3114274721571004863", "text": "n><span>({ message }, index) <span><span>in<span><span> items<span><span>\"<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> {{ message }} {{ index }}<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/list.html", "title": "列表渲染", "doc_id": "964ebb3210d342089e651e64215beb47", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1081, "chunk_index": 15, "_doc_id": "15_3114274721571004863"}}
{"doc_id": "16_5712246263470078173", "text": "an><span>\"<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> {{ message }} {{ index }}<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>li<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>对于多层嵌套的 <code>v-for<code>，作用域的工作方式和函数的作用域很类似。每个 <code>v-for<code> 作用域都可以访问到父级作用域：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>li<span><span> v-for<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>item <span><span>in<span><span> items<span><span>\"<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/list.html", "title": "列表渲染", "doc_id": "964ebb3210d342089e651e64215beb47", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1081, "chunk_index": 16, "_doc_id": "16_5712246263470078173"}}
