{"doc_id": "19_9175506693507729472", "text": "n><span>li<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>你也可以使用 <code>of<code> 作为分隔符来替代 <code>in<code>，这更接近 JavaScript 的迭代器语法：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>div<span><span> v-for<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>item <span><span>of<span><span> items<span><span>\"<span><span>></<span><span>div<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><h2 id=\"v-for-with-an-object\"><code>v-for<code> 与对象 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#v-for-with-an-object\">​<a><h2><p>你也可以使用 <code>v-for<code> 来遍历一个对象的所有属性。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/list.html", "title": "列表渲染", "doc_id": "964ebb3210d342089e651e64215beb47", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1081, "chunk_index": 19, "_doc_id": "19_9175506693507729472"}}
{"doc_id": "20_5936744382061686823", "text": "class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#v-for-with-an-object\">​<a><h2><p>你也可以使用 <code>v-for<code> 来遍历一个对象的所有属性。遍历的顺序会基于对该对象调用 <code>Object.values()<code> 的返回值来决定。<p><div class=\"composition-api\"><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> myObject<span><span> =<span><span> reactive<span><span>({<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> title: <span><span>'How to do lists in Vue'<span><span>,<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/list.html", "title": "列表渲染", "doc_id": "964ebb3210d342089e651e64215beb47", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1081, "chunk_index": 20, "_doc_id": "20_5936744382061686823"}}
{"doc_id": "21_3888548522560820303", "text": "pan>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> title: <span><span>'How to do lists in Vue'<span><span>,<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> author: <span><span>'Jane Doe'<span><span>,<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> publishedAt: <span><span>'2016-04-10'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>})<span><span><code><pre><div><div><div class=\"options-api\"><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>data<span><span>() {<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/list.html", "title": "列表渲染", "doc_id": "964ebb3210d342089e651e64215beb47", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1081, "chunk_index": 21, "_doc_id": "21_3888548522560820303"}}
