{"doc_id": "24_2593659276415360107", "text": "\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>ul<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>li<span><span> v-for<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>value <span><span>in<span><span> myObject<span><span>\"<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> {{ value }}<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> </<span><span>li<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/list.html", "title": "列表渲染", "doc_id": "964ebb3210d342089e651e64215beb47", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1081, "chunk_index": 24, "_doc_id": "24_2593659276415360107"}}
{"doc_id": "25_1578959659384977566", "text": "><span> {{ value }}<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> </<span><span>li<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>ul<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>可以通过提供第二个参数表示属性名 (例如 key)：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>li<span><span> v-for<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>(value, key) <span><span>in<span><span> myObject<span><span>\"<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/list.html", "title": "列表渲染", "doc_id": "964ebb3210d342089e651e64215beb47", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1081, "chunk_index": 25, "_doc_id": "25_1578959659384977566"}}
{"doc_id": "26_7856196709673289790", "text": "\"<span><span>(value, key) <span><span>in<span><span> myObject<span><span>\"<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> {{ key }}: {{ value }}<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/list.html", "title": "列表渲染", "doc_id": "964ebb3210d342089e651e64215beb47", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1081, "chunk_index": 26, "_doc_id": "26_7856196709673289790"}}
{"doc_id": "27_8247810116344950158", "text": "<span><span>\"<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> {{ key }}: {{ value }}<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>li<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>第三个参数表示位置索引：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>li<span><span> v-for<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>(value, key, index) <span><span>in<span><span> myObject<span><span>\"<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/list.html", "title": "列表渲染", "doc_id": "964ebb3210d342089e651e64215beb47", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1081, "chunk_index": 27, "_doc_id": "27_8247810116344950158"}}
{"doc_id": "28_5405897897078972039", "text": "<span>(value, key, index) <span><span>in<span><span> myObject<span><span>\"<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> {{ index }}. {{ key }}: {{ value }}<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>li<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><h2 id=\"v-for-with-a-range\">在 <code>v-for<code> 里使用范围值 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#v-for-with-a-range\">​<a><h2><p><code>v-for<code> 可以直接接受一个整数值。在这种用例中，会将该模板基于 <code>1...n<code> 的取值范围重复多次。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/list.html", "title": "列表渲染", "doc_id": "964ebb3210d342089e651e64215beb47", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1081, "chunk_index": 28, "_doc_id": "28_5405897897078972039"}}
{"doc_id": "29_122979931438768994", "text": "r-with-a-range\">​<a><h2><p><code>v-for<code> 可以直接接受一个整数值。在这种用例中，会将该模板基于 <code>1...n<code> 的取值范围重复多次。<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>span<span><span> v-for<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>n <span><span>in<span><span> 10<span><span>\"<span><span>>{{ n }}</<span><span>span<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>注意此处 <code>n<code> 的初值是从 <code>1<code> 开始而非 <code>0<code>。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/list.html", "title": "列表渲染", "doc_id": "964ebb3210d342089e651e64215beb47", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1081, "chunk_index": 29, "_doc_id": "29_122979931438768994"}}
{"doc_id": "30_8297424535503083900", "text": "pan><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>注意此处 <code>n<code> 的初值是从 <code>1<code> 开始而非 <code>0<code>。<p><h2 id=\"v-for-on-template\"><code><template><code> 上的 <code>v-for<code> <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#v-for-on-template\">​<a><h2><p>与模板上的 <code>v-if<code> 类似，你也可以在 <code><template><code> 标签上使用 <code>v-for<code> 来渲染一个包含多个元素的块。例如：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>ul<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/list.html", "title": "列表渲染", "doc_id": "964ebb3210d342089e651e64215beb47", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1081, "chunk_index": 30, "_doc_id": "30_8297424535503083900"}}
{"doc_id": "31_8990344387774517892", "text": "\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>ul<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>template<span><span> v-for<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>item <span><span>in<span><span> items<span><span>\"<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>li<span><span>>{{ item.msg }}</<span><span>li<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/list.html", "title": "列表渲染", "doc_id": "964ebb3210d342089e651e64215beb47", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1081, "chunk_index": 31, "_doc_id": "31_8990344387774517892"}}
{"doc_id": "32_9048055427486653072", "text": "s=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>li<span><span>>{{ item.msg }}</<span><span>li<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>li<span><span> class<span><span>=<span><span>\"divider\"<span><span> role<span><span>=<span><span>\"presentation\"<span><span>></<span><span>li<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> </<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/list.html", "title": "列表渲染", "doc_id": "964ebb3210d342089e651e64215beb47", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1081, "chunk_index": 32, "_doc_id": "32_9048055427486653072"}}
{"doc_id": "33_3315895061020911663", "text": "<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> </<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>ul<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><h2 id=\"v-for-with-v-if\"><code>v-for<code> 与 <code>v-if<code> <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#v-for-with-v-if\">​<a><h2><p>当它们同时存在于一个节点上时，<code>v-if<code> 比 <code>v-for<code> 的优先级更高。这意味着 <code>v-if<code> 的条件将无法访问到 <code>v-for<code> 作用域内定义的变量别名：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><!--<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/list.html", "title": "列表渲染", "doc_id": "964ebb3210d342089e651e64215beb47", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1081, "chunk_index": 33, "_doc_id": "33_3315895061020911663"}}
{"doc_id": "34_8901542421981009322", "text": "emplate<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><!--<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> 这会抛出一个错误，因为属性 todo 此时<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> 没有在该实例上定义<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>--><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/list.html", "title": "列表渲染", "doc_id": "964ebb3210d342089e651e64215beb47", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1081, "chunk_index": 34, "_doc_id": "34_8901542421981009322"}}
{"doc_id": "35_4318384051605757628", "text": "pan><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> 没有在该实例上定义<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>--><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>li<span><span> v-for<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>todo <span><span>in<span><span> todos<span><span>\"<span><span> v-if<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>!<span><span>todo.isComplete<span><span>\"<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> {{ todo.name }}<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/list.html", "title": "列表渲染", "doc_id": "964ebb3210d342089e651e64215beb47", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1081, "chunk_index": 35, "_doc_id": "35_4318384051605757628"}}
{"doc_id": "36_51222554576565688", "text": "omplete<span><span>\"<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> {{ todo.name }}<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>li<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>在外先包装一层 <code><template><code> 再在其上使用 <code>v-for<code> 可以解决这个问题 (这也更加明显易读)：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>template<span><span> v-for<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>todo <span><span>in<span><span> todos<span><span>\"<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/list.html", "title": "列表渲染", "doc_id": "964ebb3210d342089e651e64215beb47", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1081, "chunk_index": 36, "_doc_id": "36_51222554576565688"}}
{"doc_id": "37_3292393375933010403", "text": "span><span>\"<span><span>todo <span><span>in<span><span> todos<span><span>\"<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>li<span><span> v-if<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>!<span><span>todo.isComplete<span><span>\"<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> {{ todo.name }}<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> </<span><span>li<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/list.html", "title": "列表渲染", "doc_id": "964ebb3210d342089e651e64215beb47", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1081, "chunk_index": 37, "_doc_id": "37_3292393375933010403"}}
{"doc_id": "38_3106612263747189113", "text": "an> {{ todo.name }}<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> </<span><span>li<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><div class=\"warning custom-block\"><p class=\"custom-block-title\">注意<p><p>同时使用 <code>v-if<code> 和 <code>v-for<code> 是<strong>不推荐的<strong>，因为这样二者的优先级不明显。<p><p>两种常见的情况可能导致这种用法：<p><ul><li><p>过滤列表中的项目 (例如，<code>v-for=\"user in users\" v-if=\"user.isActive\"<code>)。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/list.html", "title": "列表渲染", "doc_id": "964ebb3210d342089e651e64215beb47", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1081, "chunk_index": 38, "_doc_id": "38_3106612263747189113"}}
{"doc_id": "39_7476720183816587270", "text": ">两种常见的情况可能导致这种用法：<p><ul><li><p>过滤列表中的项目 (例如，<code>v-for=\"user in users\" v-if=\"user.isActive\"<code>)。在这种情况下，可以用一个新的计算属性来替换 <code>users<code>，该属性返回过滤后的列表 (例如 <code>activeUsers<code>)。<p><li><li><p>避免渲染应该隐藏的列表 (例如 <code>v-for=\"user in users\" v-if=\"shouldShowUsers\"<code>)。在这种情况下，将 <code>v-if<code> 移至容器元素 (如 <code>ul<code>、<code>ol<code>)。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/list.html", "title": "列表渲染", "doc_id": "964ebb3210d342089e651e64215beb47", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1081, "chunk_index": 39, "_doc_id": "39_7476720183816587270"}}
{"doc_id": "40_6403766015559181351", "text": "s\" v-if=\"shouldShowUsers\"<code>)。在这种情况下，将 <code>v-if<code> 移至容器元素 (如 <code>ul<code>、<code>ol<code>)。<p><li><ul><div><h2 id=\"maintaining-state-with-key\">通过 key 管理状态 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#maintaining-state-with-key\">​<a><h2><p>Vue 默认按照“就地更新”的策略来更新通过 <code>v-for<code> 渲染的元素列表。当数据项的顺序改变时，Vue 不会随之移动 DOM 元素的顺序，而是就地更新每个元素，确保它们在原本指定的索引位置上渲染。<p><p>默认模式是高效的，但<strong>只适用于列表渲染输出的结果不依赖子组件状态或者临时 DOM 状态 (例如表单输入值) 的情况<strong>。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/list.html", "title": "列表渲染", "doc_id": "964ebb3210d342089e651e64215beb47", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1081, "chunk_index": 40, "_doc_id": "40_6403766015559181351"}}
{"doc_id": "41_6632030842751464029", "text": "元素，确保它们在原本指定的索引位置上渲染。<p><p>默认模式是高效的，但<strong>只适用于列表渲染输出的结果不依赖子组件状态或者临时 DOM 状态 (例如表单输入值) 的情况<strong>。<p><p>为了给 Vue 一个提示，以便它可以跟踪每个节点的标识，从而重用和重新排序现有的元素，你需要为每个元素对应的块提供一个唯一的 <code>key<code> attribute：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>div<span><span> v-for<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>item <span><span>in<span><span> items<span><span>\"<span><span> :<span><span>key<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>item.id<span><span>\"<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/list.html", "title": "列表渲染", "doc_id": "964ebb3210d342089e651e64215beb47", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1081, "chunk_index": 41, "_doc_id": "41_6632030842751464029"}}
{"doc_id": "42_3535023705084569588", "text": ":<span><span>key<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>item.id<span><span>\"<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <!-- 内容 --><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>div<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>当你使用 <code><template v-for><code> 时，", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/list.html", "title": "列表渲染", "doc_id": "964ebb3210d342089e651e64215beb47", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1081, "chunk_index": 42, "_doc_id": "42_3535023705084569588"}}
{"doc_id": "43_249893855415273396", "text": "an></<span><span>div<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>当你使用 <code><template v-for><code> 时，<code>key<code> 应该被放置在这个 <code><template><code> 容器上：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>template<span><span> v-for<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>todo <span><span>in<span><span> todos<span><span>\"<span><span> :<span><span>key<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>todo.name<span><span>\"<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/list.html", "title": "列表渲染", "doc_id": "964ebb3210d342089e651e64215beb47", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1081, "chunk_index": 43, "_doc_id": "43_249893855415273396"}}
{"doc_id": "44_944499345712292499", "text": "span><span>key<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>todo.name<span><span>\"<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>li<span><span>>{{ todo.name }}</<span><span>li<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><div class=\"tip custom-block\"><p class=\"custom-block-title\">注意<p><p><code>key<code> 在这里是一个通过 <code>v-bind<code> 绑定的特殊 attribute。请不要和<a href=\"#v-for-with-an-object\">在 <code>v-for<code> 中使用对象<a>里所提到的对象属性名相混淆。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/list.html", "title": "列表渲染", "doc_id": "964ebb3210d342089e651e64215beb47", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1081, "chunk_index": 44, "_doc_id": "44_944499345712292499"}}
{"doc_id": "45_834672940450070321", "text": "code> 绑定的特殊 attribute。请不要和<a href=\"#v-for-with-an-object\">在 <code>v-for<code> 中使用对象<a>里所提到的对象属性名相混淆。<p><div><p>推荐在任何可行的时候为 <code>v-for<code> 提供一个 <code>key<code> attribute，除非所迭代的 DOM 内容非常简单 (例如：不包含组件或有状态的 DOM 元素)，或者你想有意采用默认行为来提高性能。<p><p><code>key<code> 绑定的值期望是一个基础类型的值，例如字符串或 number 类型。不要用对象作为 <code>v-for<code> 的 key。关于 <code>key<code> attribute 的更多用途细节，请参阅 <a href=\"/api/built-in-special-attributes.html#key\"><code>key<code> API 文档<a>。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/list.html", "title": "列表渲染", "doc_id": "964ebb3210d342089e651e64215beb47", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1081, "chunk_index": 45, "_doc_id": "45_834672940450070321"}}
{"doc_id": "46_5542745675091959510", "text": "attribute 的更多用途细节，请参阅 <a href=\"/api/built-in-special-attributes.html#key\"><code>key<code> API 文档<a>。<p><h2 id=\"v-for-with-a-component\">组件上使用 <code>v-for<code> <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#v-for-with-a-component\">​<a><h2><blockquote><p>这一小节假设你已了解<a href=\"/guide/essentials/component-basics.html\">组件<a>的相关知识，或者你也可以先跳过这里，之后再回来看。<p><blockquote><p>我们可以直接在组件上使用 <code>v-for<code>，", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/list.html", "title": "列表渲染", "doc_id": "964ebb3210d342089e651e64215beb47", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1081, "chunk_index": 46, "_doc_id": "46_5542745675091959510"}}
{"doc_id": "47_3094216998978268528", "text": "mponent-basics.html\">组件<a>的相关知识，或者你也可以先跳过这里，之后再回来看。<p><blockquote><p>我们可以直接在组件上使用 <code>v-for<code>，和在一般的元素上使用没有区别 (别忘记提供一个 <code>key<code>)：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>MyComponent<span><span> v-for<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>item <span><span>in<span><span> items<span><span>\"<span><span> :<span><span>key<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>item.id<span><span>\"<span><span> /><span><span><code><pre><div><p>但是，", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/list.html", "title": "列表渲染", "doc_id": "964ebb3210d342089e651e64215beb47", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1081, "chunk_index": 47, "_doc_id": "47_3094216998978268528"}}
{"doc_id": "48_3216765180830790387", "text": "span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>item.id<span><span>\"<span><span> /><span><span><code><pre><div><p>但是，这不会自动将任何数据传递给组件，因为组件有自己独立的作用域。为了将迭代后的数据传递到组件中，我们还需要传递 props：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>MyComponent<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> v-for<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>(item, index) <span><span>in<span><span> items<span><span>\"<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/list.html", "title": "列表渲染", "doc_id": "964ebb3210d342089e651e64215beb47", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1081, "chunk_index": 48, "_doc_id": "48_3216765180830790387"}}
{"doc_id": "49_4160086158230333895", "text": "n>=<span><span>\"<span><span>(item, index) <span><span>in<span><span> items<span><span>\"<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> :<span><span>item<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>item<span><span>\"<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> :<span><span>index<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>index<span><span>\"<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> :<span><span>key<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>item.id<span><span>\"<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/list.html", "title": "列表渲染", "doc_id": "964ebb3210d342089e651e64215beb47", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1081, "chunk_index": 49, "_doc_id": "49_4160086158230333895"}}
{"doc_id": "50_4684799687285183493", "text": "line\"><span> :<span><span>key<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>item.id<span><span>\"<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>/><span><span><code><pre><div><p>不自动将 <code>item<code> 注入组件的原因是，这会使组件与 <code>v-for<code> 的工作方式紧密耦合。明确其数据的来源可以使组件在其他情况下重用。<p><h2 id=\"array-change-detection\">数组变化侦测 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#array-change-detection\">​<a><h2><h3 id=\"mutation-methods\">变更方法 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#mutation-methods\">​<a><h3><p>Vue 能够侦听响应式数组的变更方法，并在它们被调用时触发相关的更新。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/list.html", "title": "列表渲染", "doc_id": "964ebb3210d342089e651e64215beb47", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1081, "chunk_index": 50, "_doc_id": "50_4684799687285183493"}}
{"doc_id": "51_92971715435898199", "text": "更方法 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#mutation-methods\">​<a><h3><p>Vue 能够侦听响应式数组的变更方法，并在它们被调用时触发相关的更新。这些变更方法包括：<p><ul><li><code>push()<code><li><li><code>pop()<code><li><li><code>shift()<code><li><li><code>unshift()<code><li><li><code>splice()<code><li><li><code>sort()<code><li><li><code>reverse()<code><li><ul><h3 id=\"replacing-an-array\">替换一个数组 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#replacing-an-array\">​<a><h3><p>变更方法，顾名思义，就是会对调用它们的原数组进行变更。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/list.html", "title": "列表渲染", "doc_id": "964ebb3210d342089e651e64215beb47", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1081, "chunk_index": 51, "_doc_id": "51_92971715435898199"}}
{"doc_id": "52_366520456277389969", "text": "y\">替换一个数组 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#replacing-an-array\">​<a><h3><p>变更方法，顾名思义，就是会对调用它们的原数组进行变更。相对地，也有一些不可变 (immutable) 方法，例如 <code>filter()<code>，<code>concat()<code> 和 <code>slice()<code>，这些都不会更改原数组，而总是<strong>返回一个新数组<strong>。当遇到的是非变更方法时，我们需要将旧的数组替换为新的：<p><div class=\"composition-api\"><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// `items` 是一个数组的 ref<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>items.", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/list.html", "title": "列表渲染", "doc_id": "964ebb3210d342089e651e64215beb47", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1081, "chunk_index": 52, "_doc_id": "52_366520456277389969"}}
{"doc_id": "53_2153976052235849609", "text": "de\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// `items` 是一个数组的 ref<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>items.value <span><span>=<span><span> items.value.<span><span>filter<span><span>((<span><span>item<span><span>) <span><span>=><span><span> item.message.", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/list.html", "title": "列表渲染", "doc_id": "964ebb3210d342089e651e64215beb47", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1081, "chunk_index": 53, "_doc_id": "53_2153976052235849609"}}
{"doc_id": "54_3862304535606709888", "text": "pan><span>filter<span><span>((<span><span>item<span><span>) <span><span>=><span><span> item.message.<span><span>match<span><span>(<span><span>/<span><span>Foo<span><span>/<span><span>))<span><span><code><pre><div><div><div class=\"options-api\"><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>this<span><span>.items <span><span>=<span><span> this<span><span>.items.", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/list.html", "title": "列表渲染", "doc_id": "964ebb3210d342089e651e64215beb47", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1081, "chunk_index": 54, "_doc_id": "54_3862304535606709888"}}
{"doc_id": "55_8353381481391440595", "text": "de><span class=\"line\"><span>this<span><span>.items <span><span>=<span><span> this<span><span>.items.<span><span>filter<span><span>((<span><span>item<span><span>) <span><span>=><span><span> item.message.<span><span>match<span><span>(<span><span>/<span><span>Foo<span><span>/<span><span>))<span><span><code><pre><div><div><p>你可能认为这将导致 Vue 丢弃现有的 DOM 并重新渲染整个列表——幸运的是，情况并非如此。Vue 实现了一些巧妙的方法来最大化对 DOM 元素的重用，因此用另一个包含部分重叠对象的数组来做替换，仍会是一种非常高效的操作。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/list.html", "title": "列表渲染", "doc_id": "964ebb3210d342089e651e64215beb47", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1081, "chunk_index": 55, "_doc_id": "55_8353381481391440595"}}
{"doc_id": "56_200815129242512938", "text": "e 丢弃现有的 DOM 并重新渲染整个列表——幸运的是，情况并非如此。Vue 实现了一些巧妙的方法来最大化对 DOM 元素的重用，因此用另一个包含部分重叠对象的数组来做替换，仍会是一种非常高效的操作。<p><h2 id=\"displaying-filtered-sorted-results\">展示过滤或排序后的结果 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#displaying-filtered-sorted-results\">​<a><h2><p>有时，我们希望显示数组经过过滤或排序后的内容，而不实际变更或重置原始数据。在这种情况下，你可以创建返回已过滤或已排序数组的计算属性。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/list.html", "title": "列表渲染", "doc_id": "964ebb3210d342089e651e64215beb47", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1081, "chunk_index": 56, "_doc_id": "56_200815129242512938"}}
{"doc_id": "57_4185326367753878505", "text": "ltered-sorted-results\">​<a><h2><p>有时，我们希望显示数组经过过滤或排序后的内容，而不实际变更或重置原始数据。在这种情况下，你可以创建返回已过滤或已排序数组的计算属性。<p><p>举例来说：<p><div class=\"composition-api\"><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> numbers<span><span> =<span><span> ref<span><span>([<span><span>1<span><span>, <span><span>2<span><span>, <span><span>3<span><span>, <span><span>4<span><span>, <span><span>5<span><span>])<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/list.html", "title": "列表渲染", "doc_id": "964ebb3210d342089e651e64215beb47", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1081, "chunk_index": 57, "_doc_id": "57_4185326367753878505"}}
{"doc_id": "58_8332200226057013641", "text": "span>, <span><span>4<span><span>, <span><span>5<span><span>])<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> evenNumbers<span><span> =<span><span> computed<span><span>(() <span><span>=><span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> return<span><span> numbers.value.<span><span>filter<span><span>((<span><span>n<span><span>) <span><span>=><span><span> n <span><span>%<span><span> 2<span><span> ===<span><span> 0<span><span>)<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/list.html", "title": "列表渲染", "doc_id": "964ebb3210d342089e651e64215beb47", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1081, "chunk_index": 58, "_doc_id": "58_8332200226057013641"}}
