{"doc_id": "63_3890958697012543445", "text": "n><span>li<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>在计算属性不可行的情况下 (例如在多层嵌套的 <code>v-for<code> 循环中)，你可以使用以下方法：<p><div class=\"composition-api\"><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> sets<span><span> =<span><span> ref<span><span>([<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/list.html", "title": "列表渲染", "doc_id": "964ebb3210d342089e651e64215beb47", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1081, "chunk_index": 63, "_doc_id": "63_3890958697012543445"}}
{"doc_id": "64_357345792174074578", "text": "n class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> sets<span><span> =<span><span> ref<span><span>([<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> [<span><span>1<span><span>, <span><span>2<span><span>, <span><span>3<span><span>, <span><span>4<span><span>, <span><span>5<span><span>],<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> [<span><span>6<span><span>, <span><span>7<span><span>, <span><span>8<span><span>, <span><span>9<span><span>, <span><span>10<span><span>]<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>])<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/list.html", "title": "列表渲染", "doc_id": "964ebb3210d342089e651e64215beb47", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1081, "chunk_index": 64, "_doc_id": "64_357345792174074578"}}
