{"doc_id": "71_4615510616479612635", "text": "even<span><span>(numbers)<span><span>\"<span><span>>{{ n }}</<span><span>li<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>ul<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>在计算属性中使用 <code>reverse()<code> 和 <code>sort()<code> 的时候务必小心！这两个方法将变更原始数组，计算函数中不应该这么做。请在调用这些方法之前创建一个原数组的副本：<p><div class=\"language-diff\"> <span class=\"lang\">diff<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>- return numbers.reverse()<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/list.html", "title": "列表渲染", "doc_id": "964ebb3210d342089e651e64215beb47", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1081, "chunk_index": 71, "_doc_id": "71_4615510616479612635"}}
{"doc_id": "72_1729702475534096786", "text": "s=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>- return numbers.reverse()<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>+ return [...numbers].reverse()<span><span><code><pre><div><div><div>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/list.html", "title": "列表渲染", "doc_id": "964ebb3210d342089e651e64215beb47", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1081, "chunk_index": 72, "_doc_id": "72_1729702475534096786"}}
{"doc_id": "0_4824541397428717254", "text": "<div><div class=\"VPContentPage\"><main><div><div><div class=\"ThemePage\"><div class=\"ThemeHero\"><div class=\"container\"><h1 class=\"title\">主题<h1><p class=\"lead\">查看主题、UI Kits 和插件。你可以看到我们的合作伙伴是如何用 Vue 构建一个真实世界的应用。<p><div><div><div class=\"ThemeList\"><div class=\"container\"><div class=\"item\"><section class=\"ThemeListItem\"><h2 class=\"title\">Nuxt UI<h2><p class=\"description\"><a href=\"https://ui.nuxt.com/\" class=\"link\" target=\"_blank\">Nuxt UI<a> is an intuitive, open-source UI library for Vue and Nuxt applications.", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/ecosystem/themes.html", "title": "Vue.js", "doc_id": "4521d3f6acc04d679026736c1c71919f", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 270, "chunk_index": 0, "_doc_id": "0_4824541397428717254"}}
{"doc_id": "1_7011859860691419569", "text": "\" target=\"_blank\">Nuxt UI<a> is an intuitive, open-source UI library for Vue and Nuxt applications. Built with Tailwind CSS and Reka UI, it provides 100+ beautifully crafted, accessible components with a flexible CSS-first design system.<p><section><div><div class=\"item\"><section class=\"ThemeListItem\"><h2 class=\"title\">Creative Tim<h2><p class=\"description\">通过下面由我们的合作伙伴 <a href=\"https://creative-tim.com?affiliate_id=116187\" class=\"link\" target=\"_blank\">Creative Tim<a> 建立的例子，你可以看到一个真实世界的应用是如何建立的，它背后的技术栈，", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/ecosystem/themes.html", "title": "Vue.js", "doc_id": "4521d3f6acc04d679026736c1c71919f", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 270, "chunk_index": 1, "_doc_id": "1_7011859860691419569"}}
{"doc_id": "2_6653716609067713284", "text": "ffiliate_id=116187\" class=\"link\" target=\"_blank\">Creative Tim<a> 建立的例子，你可以看到一个真实世界的应用是如何建立的，它背后的技术栈，以及你迄今为止学到的大多数概念是如何应用于真实世界的应用。<p><section><div><div class=\"item\"><section class=\"ThemeListItem\"><h2 class=\"title\">MDBootstrap<h2><p class=\"description\">查看下面由我们的合作伙伴 <a href=\"https://mdbootstrap.com/?utm_ref_id=82665\" class=\"link\" target=\"_blank\">MDBootstrap<a> 构建的主题、UI 工具包和插件，了解如何在专业项目中使用 Vue 以及 Bootstrap 等技术。模板和现成的组件可以使你的开发更快、更高效。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/ecosystem/themes.html", "title": "Vue.js", "doc_id": "4521d3f6acc04d679026736c1c71919f", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 270, "chunk_index": 2, "_doc_id": "2_6653716609067713284"}}
{"doc_id": "3_5346129600799560902", "text": "get=\"_blank\">MDBootstrap<a> 构建的主题、UI 工具包和插件，了解如何在专业项目中使用 Vue 以及 Bootstrap 等技术。模板和现成的组件可以使你的开发更快、更高效。<p><section><div><div class=\"item\"><section class=\"ThemeListItem\"><h2 class=\"title\">PrimeVue<h2><p class=\"description\">开源 UI 组件库 <a href=\"https://www.primefaces.org/primevue/?af_id=4218\" class=\"link\" target=\"_blank\">PrimeVue<a> 提供了超过 90 个灵活的组件来构建你的应用！他们有大量不同的组件主题和应用模板，以获得最适合你的外观和感受。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/ecosystem/themes.html", "title": "Vue.js", "doc_id": "4521d3f6acc04d679026736c1c71919f", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 270, "chunk_index": 3, "_doc_id": "3_5346129600799560902"}}
{"doc_id": "4_5986981669052201493", "text": "18\" class=\"link\" target=\"_blank\">PrimeVue<a> 提供了超过 90 个灵活的组件来构建你的应用！他们有大量不同的组件主题和应用模板，以获得最适合你的外观和感受。<p><section><div><div class=\"item\"><section class=\"ThemeListItem\"><h2 class=\"title\">Flatlogic<h2><p class=\"description\">看看我们来自 <a href=\"https://flatlogic.com/templates?ref=x-fdkuTAVW\" class=\"link\" target=\"_blank\">Flatlogic<a> 的合作伙伴建立的管理仪表板模板。通过这些主题，你可以看到真正的应用是如何建立的。此外，这些模板将帮助你开始一个新的应用，并节省你的时间和金钱。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/ecosystem/themes.html", "title": "Vue.js", "doc_id": "4521d3f6acc04d679026736c1c71919f", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 270, "chunk_index": 4, "_doc_id": "4_5986981669052201493"}}
