{"doc_id": "23_6578053514897795774", "text": "\" target=\"_blank\">在演练场中尝试一下<a><p><h3 id=\"watch-source-types\">侦听数据源类型 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#watch-source-types\">​<a><h3><p><code>watch<code> 的第一个参数可以是不同形式的“数据源”：它可以是一个 ref", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/watchers.html", "title": "侦听器 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "09ba7d1f575f43daa13e9f70e6004ab1", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1820, "chunk_index": 23, "_doc_id": "23_6578053514897795774"}}
{"doc_id": "24_1909357720500918148", "text": "ader-anchor\" href=\"#watch-source-types\">​<a><h3><p><code>watch<code> 的第一个参数可以是不同形式的“数据源”：它可以是一个 ref (包括计算属性)、一个响应式对象、一个 <a href=\"https://developer.mozilla.org/zh-CN/docs/Web/JavaScript/Reference/Functions/get#description\" target=\"_blank\">getter 函数<a>、或多个数据源组成的数组：<p><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> x<span><span> =<span><span> ref<span><span>(<span><span>0<span><span>)<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/watchers.html", "title": "侦听器 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "09ba7d1f575f43daa13e9f70e6004ab1", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1820, "chunk_index": 24, "_doc_id": "24_1909357720500918148"}}
{"doc_id": "25_8891439728184004739", "text": "onst<span><span> x<span><span> =<span><span> ref<span><span>(<span><span>0<span><span>)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> y<span><span> =<span><span> ref<span><span>(<span><span>0<span><span>)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 单个 ref<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>watch<span><span>(x, (<span><span>newX<span><span>) <span><span>=><span><span> {<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/watchers.html", "title": "侦听器 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "09ba7d1f575f43daa13e9f70e6004ab1", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1820, "chunk_index": 25, "_doc_id": "25_8891439728184004739"}}
{"doc_id": "26_4567949394954771242", "text": "><span>watch<span><span>(x, (<span><span>newX<span><span>) <span><span>=><span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> console.<span><span>log<span><span>(<span><span>`x is ${<span><span>newX<span><span>}`<span><span>)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>})<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// getter 函数<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>watch<span><span>(<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/watchers.html", "title": "侦听器 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "09ba7d1f575f43daa13e9f70e6004ab1", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1820, "chunk_index": 26, "_doc_id": "26_4567949394954771242"}}
{"doc_id": "27_7836676015730953735", "text": "class=\"line\"><span>// getter 函数<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>watch<span><span>(<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> () <span><span>=><span><span> x.value <span><span>+<span><span> y.value,<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> (<span><span>sum<span><span>) <span><span>=><span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> console.<span><span>log<span><span>(<span><span>`sum of x + y is: ${<span><span>sum<span><span>}`<span><span>)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/watchers.html", "title": "侦听器 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "09ba7d1f575f43daa13e9f70e6004ab1", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1820, "chunk_index": 27, "_doc_id": "27_7836676015730953735"}}
{"doc_id": "28_3211753319774349639", "text": "s: ${<span><span>sum<span><span>}`<span><span>)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 多个来源组成的数组<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>watch<span><span>([x, () <span><span>=><span><span> y.value], ([<span><span>newX<span><span>, <span><span>newY<span><span>]) <span><span>=><span><span> {<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/watchers.html", "title": "侦听器 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "09ba7d1f575f43daa13e9f70e6004ab1", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1820, "chunk_index": 28, "_doc_id": "28_3211753319774349639"}}
{"doc_id": "29_7214526515774269905", "text": "pan><span>newX<span><span>, <span><span>newY<span><span>]) <span><span>=><span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> console.<span><span>log<span><span>(<span><span>`x is ${<span><span>newX<span><span>} and y is ${<span><span>newY<span><span>}`<span><span>)<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/watchers.html", "title": "侦听器 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "09ba7d1f575f43daa13e9f70e6004ab1", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1820, "chunk_index": 29, "_doc_id": "29_7214526515774269905"}}
{"doc_id": "30_3849014012127706421", "text": "${<span><span>newX<span><span>} and y is ${<span><span>newY<span><span>}`<span><span>)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>})<span><span><code><pre><div><p>注意，你不能直接侦听响应式对象的属性值，例如：<p><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> obj<span><span> =<span><span> reactive<span><span>({ count: <span><span>0<span><span> })<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/watchers.html", "title": "侦听器 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "09ba7d1f575f43daa13e9f70e6004ab1", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1820, "chunk_index": 30, "_doc_id": "30_3849014012127706421"}}
{"doc_id": "31_8853504006961949092", "text": "n> reactive<span><span>({ count: <span><span>0<span><span> })<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 错误，因为 watch() 得到的参数是一个 number<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>watch<span><span>(obj.count, (<span><span>count<span><span>) <span><span>=><span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> console.<span><span>log<span><span>(<span><span>`Count is: ${<span><span>count<span><span>}`<span><span>)<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/watchers.html", "title": "侦听器 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "09ba7d1f575f43daa13e9f70e6004ab1", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1820, "chunk_index": 31, "_doc_id": "31_8853504006961949092"}}
{"doc_id": "32_3658945002680791961", "text": "n>log<span><span>(<span><span>`Count is: ${<span><span>count<span><span>}`<span><span>)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>})<span><span><code><pre><div><p>这里需要用一个返回该属性的 getter 函数：<p><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// 提供一个 getter 函数<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>watch<span><span>(<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> () <span><span>=><span><span> obj.count,<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/watchers.html", "title": "侦听器 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "09ba7d1f575f43daa13e9f70e6004ab1", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1820, "chunk_index": 32, "_doc_id": "32_3658945002680791961"}}
{"doc_id": "33_5798298488735506221", "text": "><span>(<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> () <span><span>=><span><span> obj.count,<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> (<span><span>count<span><span>) <span><span>=><span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> console.<span><span>log<span><span>(<span><span>`Count is: ${<span><span>count<span><span>}`<span><span>)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/watchers.html", "title": "侦听器 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "09ba7d1f575f43daa13e9f70e6004ab1", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1820, "chunk_index": 33, "_doc_id": "33_5798298488735506221"}}
{"doc_id": "34_2798997806214040529", "text": "${<span><span>count<span><span>}`<span><span>)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>)<span><span><code><pre><div><div><h2 id=\"deep-watchers\">深层侦听器 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#deep-watchers\">​<a><h2><div class=\"options-api\"><p><code>watch<code> 默认是浅层的：被侦听的属性，仅在被赋新值时，才会触发回调函数——而嵌套属性的变化不会触发。如果想侦听所有嵌套的变更，你需要深层侦听器：<p><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/watchers.html", "title": "侦听器 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "09ba7d1f575f43daa13e9f70e6004ab1", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1820, "chunk_index": 34, "_doc_id": "34_2798997806214040529"}}
{"doc_id": "35_1152367199937532017", "text": "b-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> watch: {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> someObject: {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> handler<span><span>(<span><span>newValue<span><span>, <span><span>oldValue<span><span>) {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 注意：在嵌套的变更中，<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 只要没有替换对象本身，<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 那么这里的 `newValue` 和 `oldValue` 相同<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/watchers.html", "title": "侦听器 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "09ba7d1f575f43daa13e9f70e6004ab1", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1820, "chunk_index": 35, "_doc_id": "35_1152367199937532017"}}
{"doc_id": "36_2397623612538685010", "text": "/ 只要没有替换对象本身，<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 那么这里的 `newValue` 和 `oldValue` 相同<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> },<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> deep: <span><span>true<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/watchers.html", "title": "侦听器 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "09ba7d1f575f43daa13e9f70e6004ab1", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1820, "chunk_index": 36, "_doc_id": "36_2397623612538685010"}}
{"doc_id": "37_6857828643343298254", "text": "an>true<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span><code><pre><div><div><div class=\"composition-api\"><p>直接给 <code>watch()<code> 传入一个响应式对象，会隐式地创建一个深层侦听器——该回调函数在所有嵌套的变更时都会被触发：<p><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> obj<span><span> =<span><span> reactive<span><span>({ count: <span><span>0<span><span> })<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/watchers.html", "title": "侦听器 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "09ba7d1f575f43daa13e9f70e6004ab1", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1820, "chunk_index": 37, "_doc_id": "37_6857828643343298254"}}
{"doc_id": "38_4522773388915061910", "text": "bj<span><span> =<span><span> reactive<span><span>({ count: <span><span>0<span><span> })<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>watch<span><span>(obj, (<span><span>newValue<span><span>, <span><span>oldValue<span><span>) <span><span>=><span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 在嵌套的属性变更时触发<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 注意：`newValue` 此处和 `oldValue` 是相等的<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 因为它们是同一个对象！<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>})<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/watchers.html", "title": "侦听器 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "09ba7d1f575f43daa13e9f70e6004ab1", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1820, "chunk_index": 38, "_doc_id": "38_4522773388915061910"}}
{"doc_id": "39_2777806298371155408", "text": "<span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 因为它们是同一个对象！<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>})<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>obj.count<span><span>++<span><span><code><pre><div><p>相比之下，一个返回响应式对象的 getter 函数，只有在返回不同的对象时，才会触发回调：<p><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>watch<span><span>(<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> () <span><span>=><span><span> state.someObject,<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/watchers.html", "title": "侦听器 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "09ba7d1f575f43daa13e9f70e6004ab1", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1820, "chunk_index": 39, "_doc_id": "39_2777806298371155408"}}
{"doc_id": "40_3777574565671472393", "text": "(<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> () <span><span>=><span><span> state.someObject,<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> () <span><span>=><span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 仅当 state.someObject 被替换时触发<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/watchers.html", "title": "侦听器 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "09ba7d1f575f43daa13e9f70e6004ab1", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1820, "chunk_index": 40, "_doc_id": "40_3777574565671472393"}}
{"doc_id": "41_9141698069410931465", "text": "ass=\"line\"><span> // 仅当 state.someObject 被替换时触发<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>)<span><span><code><pre><div><p>你也可以给上面这个例子显式地加上 <code>deep<code> 选项，强制转成深层侦听器：<p><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>watch<span><span>(<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> () <span><span>=><span><span> state.someObject,<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/watchers.html", "title": "侦听器 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "09ba7d1f575f43daa13e9f70e6004ab1", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1820, "chunk_index": 41, "_doc_id": "41_9141698069410931465"}}
{"doc_id": "42_5897992014657464451", "text": "(<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> () <span><span>=><span><span> state.someObject,<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> (<span><span>newValue<span><span>, <span><span>oldValue<span><span>) <span><span>=><span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 注意：`newValue` 此处和 `oldValue` 是相等的<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // *除非* state.someObject 被整个替换了<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> },<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> { deep: <span><span>true<span><span> }<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/watchers.html", "title": "侦听器 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "09ba7d1f575f43daa13e9f70e6004ab1", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1820, "chunk_index": 42, "_doc_id": "42_5897992014657464451"}}
{"doc_id": "43_1769075039248640285", "text": "><span> },<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> { deep: <span><span>true<span><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>)<span><span><code><pre><div><div><p>在 Vue 3.5+ 中，<code>deep<code> 选项还可以是一个数字，表示最大遍历深度——即 Vue 应该遍历对象嵌套属性的级数。<p><div class=\"warning custom-block\"><p class=\"custom-block-title\">谨慎使用<p><p>深度侦听需要遍历被侦听对象中的所有嵌套的属性，当用于大型数据结构时，开销很大。因此请只在必要时才使用它，并且要留意性能。<p><div><h2 id=\"eager-watchers\">即时回调的侦听器 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#eager-watchers\">​<a><h2><p><code>watch<code> 默认是懒执行的：仅当数据源变化时，才会执行回调。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/watchers.html", "title": "侦听器 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "09ba7d1f575f43daa13e9f70e6004ab1", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1820, "chunk_index": 43, "_doc_id": "43_1769075039248640285"}}
{"doc_id": "44_4019140683698758883", "text": "a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#eager-watchers\">​<a><h2><p><code>watch<code> 默认是懒执行的：仅当数据源变化时，才会执行回调。但在某些场景中，我们希望在创建侦听器时，立即执行一遍回调。举例来说，我们想请求一些初始数据，然后在相关状态更改时重新请求数据。<p><div class=\"options-api\"><p>我们可以用一个对象来声明侦听器，这个对象有 <code>handler<code> 方法和 <code>immediate: true<code> 选项，这样便能强制回调函数立即执行：<p><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // ...<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/watchers.html", "title": "侦听器 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "09ba7d1f575f43daa13e9f70e6004ab1", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1820, "chunk_index": 44, "_doc_id": "44_4019140683698758883"}}
{"doc_id": "45_5747345442646270526", "text": "n>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // ...<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> watch: {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> question: {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> handler<span><span>(<span><span>newQuestion<span><span>) {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 在组件实例创建时会立即调用<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> },<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 强制立即执行回调<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> immediate: <span><span>true<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/watchers.html", "title": "侦听器 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "09ba7d1f575f43daa13e9f70e6004ab1", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1820, "chunk_index": 45, "_doc_id": "45_5747345442646270526"}}
{"doc_id": "46_8564558153401602292", "text": "e\"><span> // 强制立即执行回调<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> immediate: <span><span>true<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // ...<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/watchers.html", "title": "侦听器 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "09ba7d1f575f43daa13e9f70e6004ab1", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1820, "chunk_index": 46, "_doc_id": "46_8564558153401602292"}}
{"doc_id": "47_1545849120251054355", "text": "}<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // ...<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span><code><pre><div><p>回调函数的初次执行就发生在 <code>created<code> 钩子之前。Vue 此时已经处理了 <code>data<code>、<code>computed<code> 和 <code>methods<code> 选项，所以这些属性在第一次调用时就是可用的。<p><div><div class=\"composition-api\"><p>我们可以通过传入 <code>immediate: true<code> 选项来强制侦听器的回调立即执行：<p><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>watch<span><span>(<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/watchers.html", "title": "侦听器 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "09ba7d1f575f43daa13e9f70e6004ab1", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1820, "chunk_index": 47, "_doc_id": "47_1545849120251054355"}}
{"doc_id": "48_3957520166291810022", "text": "pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>watch<span><span>(<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> source,<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> (<span><span>newValue<span><span>, <span><span>oldValue<span><span>) <span><span>=><span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 立即执行，且当 `source` 改变时再次执行<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> },<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> { immediate: <span><span>true<span><span> }<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/watchers.html", "title": "侦听器 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "09ba7d1f575f43daa13e9f70e6004ab1", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1820, "chunk_index": 48, "_doc_id": "48_3957520166291810022"}}
{"doc_id": "49_8220832634195808445", "text": "n> },<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> { immediate: <span><span>true<span><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>)<span><span><code><pre><div><div><h2 id=\"once-watchers\">一次性侦听器 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#once-watchers\">​<a><h2><p>每当被侦听源发生变化时，侦听器的回调就会执行。如果希望回调只在源变化时触发一次，请使用 <code>once: true<code> 选项。<p><div class=\"options-api\"><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/watchers.html", "title": "侦听器 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "09ba7d1f575f43daa13e9f70e6004ab1", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1820, "chunk_index": 49, "_doc_id": "49_8220832634195808445"}}
{"doc_id": "50_4318331708477905234", "text": "b-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> watch: {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> source: {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> handler<span><span>(<span><span>newValue<span><span>, <span><span>oldValue<span><span>) {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 当 `source` 变化时，仅触发一次<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> },<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> once: <span><span>true<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/watchers.html", "title": "侦听器 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "09ba7d1f575f43daa13e9f70e6004ab1", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1820, "chunk_index": 50, "_doc_id": "50_4318331708477905234"}}
{"doc_id": "51_328317829937907065", "text": "pan class=\"line\"><span> },<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> once: <span><span>true<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span><code><pre><div><div><div class=\"composition-api\"><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>watch<span><span>(<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> source,<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/watchers.html", "title": "侦听器 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "09ba7d1f575f43daa13e9f70e6004ab1", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1820, "chunk_index": 51, "_doc_id": "51_328317829937907065"}}
{"doc_id": "52_48937465598348270", "text": "pan class=\"line\"><span>watch<span><span>(<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> source,<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> (<span><span>newValue<span><span>, <span><span>oldValue<span><span>) <span><span>=><span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 当 `source` 变化时，仅触发一次<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> },<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> { once: <span><span>true<span><span> }<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/watchers.html", "title": "侦听器 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "09ba7d1f575f43daa13e9f70e6004ab1", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1820, "chunk_index": 52, "_doc_id": "52_48937465598348270"}}
{"doc_id": "53_5080847436467298711", "text": "><span> },<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> { once: <span><span>true<span><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>)<span><span><code><pre><div><div><div class=\"composition-api\"><h2 id=\"watcheffect\"><code>watchEffect()<code> <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#watcheffect\">​<a><h2><p>侦听器的回调使用与源完全相同的响应式状态是很常见的。例如下面的代码，在每当 <code>todoId<code> 的引用发生变化时使用侦听器来加载一个远程资源：<p><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> todoId<span><span> =<span><span> ref<span><span>(<span><span>1<span><span>)<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/watchers.html", "title": "侦听器 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "09ba7d1f575f43daa13e9f70e6004ab1", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1820, "chunk_index": 53, "_doc_id": "53_5080847436467298711"}}
{"doc_id": "54_7592479502924910826", "text": "span><span> todoId<span><span> =<span><span> ref<span><span>(<span><span>1<span><span>)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> data<span><span> =<span><span> ref<span><span>(<span><span>null<span><span>)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>watch<span><span>(<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> todoId,<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> async<span><span> () <span><span>=><span><span> {<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/watchers.html", "title": "侦听器 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "09ba7d1f575f43daa13e9f70e6004ab1", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1820, "chunk_index": 54, "_doc_id": "54_7592479502924910826"}}
{"doc_id": "55_6340384974445393993", "text": "span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> async<span><span> () <span><span>=><span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> const<span><span> response<span><span> =<span><span> await<span><span> fetch<span><span>(<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> `https://jsonplaceholder.typicode.com/todos/${<span><span>todoId<span><span>.<span><span>value<span><span>}`<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> )<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/watchers.html", "title": "侦听器 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "09ba7d1f575f43daa13e9f70e6004ab1", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1820, "chunk_index": 55, "_doc_id": "55_6340384974445393993"}}
{"doc_id": "56_2093498830043228334", "text": "oId<span><span>.<span><span>value<span><span>}`<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> )<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> data.value <span><span>=<span><span> await<span><span> response.<span><span>json<span><span>()<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> },<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> { immediate: <span><span>true<span><span> }<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/watchers.html", "title": "侦听器 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "09ba7d1f575f43daa13e9f70e6004ab1", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1820, "chunk_index": 56, "_doc_id": "56_2093498830043228334"}}
{"doc_id": "57_2045434011371297471", "text": "n> },<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> { immediate: <span><span>true<span><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>)<span><span><code><pre><div><p>特别是注意侦听器是如何两次使用 <code>todoId<code> 的，一次是作为源，另一次是在回调中。<p><p>我们可以用 <a href=\"/api/reactivity-core.html#watcheffect\"><code>watchEffect<code> 函数<a> 来简化上面的代码。<code>watchEffect()<code> 允许我们自动跟踪回调的响应式依赖。上面的侦听器可以重写为：<p><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>watchEffect<span><span>(<span><span>async<span><span> () <span><span>=><span><span> {<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/watchers.html", "title": "侦听器 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "09ba7d1f575f43daa13e9f70e6004ab1", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1820, "chunk_index": 57, "_doc_id": "57_2045434011371297471"}}
{"doc_id": "58_7395994246640953491", "text": "n>watchEffect<span><span>(<span><span>async<span><span> () <span><span>=><span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> const<span><span> response<span><span> =<span><span> await<span><span> fetch<span><span>(<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> `https://jsonplaceholder.typicode.com/todos/${<span><span>todoId<span><span>.<span><span>value<span><span>}`<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> )<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/watchers.html", "title": "侦听器 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "09ba7d1f575f43daa13e9f70e6004ab1", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1820, "chunk_index": 58, "_doc_id": "58_7395994246640953491"}}
{"doc_id": "59_79715792621714725", "text": "oId<span><span>.<span><span>value<span><span>}`<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> )<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> data.value <span><span>=<span><span> await<span><span> response.<span><span>json<span><span>()<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>})<span><span><code><pre><div><p>这个例子中，回调会立即执行，不需要指定 <code>immediate: true<code>。在执行期间，它会自动追踪 <code>todoId.value<code> 作为依赖(和计算属性类似)。每当 <code>todoId.value<code> 变化时，回调会再次执行。有了 <code>watchEffect()<code>，我们不再需要明确传递 <code>todoId<code> 作为源值。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/watchers.html", "title": "侦听器 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "09ba7d1f575f43daa13e9f70e6004ab1", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1820, "chunk_index": 59, "_doc_id": "59_79715792621714725"}}
{"doc_id": "60_5559104143076591121", "text": "code>todoId.value<code> 变化时，回调会再次执行。有了 <code>watchEffect()<code>，我们不再需要明确传递 <code>todoId<code> 作为源值。<p><p>你可以参考一下<a href=\"/examples/#fetching-data\">这个例子<a>的 <code>watchEffect<code> 和响应式的数据请求的操作。<p><p>对于这种只有一个依赖项的例子来说，<code>watchEffect()<code> 的好处相对较小。但是对于有多个依赖项的侦听器来说，使用 <code>watchEffect()<code> 可以消除手动维护依赖列表的负担。此外，如果你需要侦听一个嵌套数据结构中的几个属性，<code>watchEffect()<code> 可能会比深度侦听器更有效，因为它将只跟踪回调中被使用到的属性，而不是递归地跟踪所有的属性。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/watchers.html", "title": "侦听器 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "09ba7d1f575f43daa13e9f70e6004ab1", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1820, "chunk_index": 60, "_doc_id": "60_5559104143076591121"}}
{"doc_id": "61_8411423936281700376", "text": "的负担。此外，如果你需要侦听一个嵌套数据结构中的几个属性，<code>watchEffect()<code> 可能会比深度侦听器更有效，因为它将只跟踪回调中被使用到的属性，而不是递归地跟踪所有的属性。<p><div class=\"tip custom-block\"><p class=\"custom-block-title\">TIP<p><p><code>watchEffect<code> 仅会在其<strong>同步<strong>执行期间，才追踪依赖。在使用异步回调时，只有在第一个 <code>await<code> 正常工作前访问到的属性才会被追踪。<p><div><h3 id=\"watch-vs-watcheffect\"><code>watch<code> vs. <code>watchEffect<code> <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#watch-vs-watcheffect\">​<a><h3><p><code>watch<code> 和 <code>watchEffect<code> 都能响应式地执行有副作用的回调。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/watchers.html", "title": "侦听器 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "09ba7d1f575f43daa13e9f70e6004ab1", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1820, "chunk_index": 61, "_doc_id": "61_8411423936281700376"}}
{"doc_id": "62_319600699713013996", "text": "href=\"#watch-vs-watcheffect\">​<a><h3><p><code>watch<code> 和 <code>watchEffect<code> 都能响应式地执行有副作用的回调。它们之间的主要区别是追踪响应式依赖的方式：<p><div><h2 id=\"side-effect-cleanup\">副作用清理 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#side-effect-cleanup\">​<a><h2><p>有时我们可能会在侦听器中执行副作用，例如异步请求：<p><div class=\"composition-api\"><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>watch<span><span>(id, (<span><span>newId<span><span>) <span><span>=><span><span> {<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/watchers.html", "title": "侦听器 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "09ba7d1f575f43daa13e9f70e6004ab1", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1820, "chunk_index": 62, "_doc_id": "62_319600699713013996"}}
{"doc_id": "63_1147443347125482733", "text": "span>watch<span><span>(id, (<span><span>newId<span><span>) <span><span>=><span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> fetch<span><span>(<span><span>`/api/${<span><span>newId<span><span>}`<span><span>).<span><span>then<span><span>(() <span><span>=><span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 回调逻辑<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> })<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/watchers.html", "title": "侦听器 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "09ba7d1f575f43daa13e9f70e6004ab1", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1820, "chunk_index": 63, "_doc_id": "63_1147443347125482733"}}
{"doc_id": "64_3531903688353201806", "text": "<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 回调逻辑<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> })<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>})<span><span><code><pre><div><div><div class=\"options-api\"><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> watch: {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> id<span><span>(<span><span>newId<span><span>) {<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/watchers.html", "title": "侦听器 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "09ba7d1f575f43daa13e9f70e6004ab1", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1820, "chunk_index": 64, "_doc_id": "64_3531903688353201806"}}
{"doc_id": "65_1960723313339711806", "text": "{<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> id<span><span>(<span><span>newId<span><span>) {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> fetch<span><span>(<span><span>`/api/${<span><span>newId<span><span>}`<span><span>).<span><span>then<span><span>(() <span><span>=><span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 回调逻辑<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> })<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/watchers.html", "title": "侦听器 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "09ba7d1f575f43daa13e9f70e6004ab1", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1820, "chunk_index": 65, "_doc_id": "65_1960723313339711806"}}
{"doc_id": "66_4044592271574484810", "text": "pan> })<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span><code><pre><div><div><p>但是如果在请求完成之前 <code>id<code> 发生了变化怎么办？当上一个请求完成时，它仍会使用已经过时的 ID 值触发回调。理想情况下，我们希望能够在 <code>id<code> 变为新值时取消过时的请求。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/watchers.html", "title": "侦听器 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "09ba7d1f575f43daa13e9f70e6004ab1", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1820, "chunk_index": 66, "_doc_id": "66_4044592271574484810"}}
{"doc_id": "67_4770553798620790268", "text": "成之前 <code>id<code> 发生了变化怎么办？当上一个请求完成时，它仍会使用已经过时的 ID 值触发回调。理想情况下，我们希望能够在 <code>id<code> 变为新值时取消过时的请求。<p><p>我们可以使用 <a href=\"/api/reactivity-core.html#onwatchercleanup\"><code>onWatcherCleanup()<code><a> API 来注册一个清理函数，当侦听器失效并准备重新运行时会被调用：<p><div class=\"composition-api\"><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>import<span><span> { watch, onWatcherCleanup } <span><span>from<span><span> 'vue'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/watchers.html", "title": "侦听器 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "09ba7d1f575f43daa13e9f70e6004ab1", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1820, "chunk_index": 67, "_doc_id": "67_4770553798620790268"}}
{"doc_id": "68_253675431819225757", "text": "watch, onWatcherCleanup } <span><span>from<span><span> 'vue'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>watch<span><span>(id, (<span><span>newId<span><span>) <span><span>=><span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> const<span><span> controller<span><span> =<span><span> new<span><span> AbortController<span><span>()<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/watchers.html", "title": "侦听器 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "09ba7d1f575f43daa13e9f70e6004ab1", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1820, "chunk_index": 68, "_doc_id": "68_253675431819225757"}}
{"doc_id": "69_7462608890993303187", "text": "> =<span><span> new<span><span> AbortController<span><span>()<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> fetch<span><span>(<span><span>`/api/${<span><span>newId<span><span>}`<span><span>, { signal: controller.signal }).<span><span>then<span><span>(() <span><span>=><span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 回调逻辑<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> })<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/watchers.html", "title": "侦听器 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "09ba7d1f575f43daa13e9f70e6004ab1", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1820, "chunk_index": 69, "_doc_id": "69_7462608890993303187"}}
{"doc_id": "70_3237211259504055582", "text": "line\"><span> // 回调逻辑<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> })<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line highlighted\"><span> onWatcherCleanup<span><span>(() <span><span>=><span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line highlighted\"><span> // 终止过期请求<span><span>\n<span class=\"line highlighted\"><span> controller.<span><span>abort<span><span>()<span><span>\n<span class=\"line highlighted\"><span> })<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/watchers.html", "title": "侦听器 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "09ba7d1f575f43daa13e9f70e6004ab1", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1820, "chunk_index": 70, "_doc_id": "70_3237211259504055582"}}
{"doc_id": "71_6868327485054999163", "text": "er.<span><span>abort<span><span>()<span><span>\n<span class=\"line highlighted\"><span> })<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>})<span><span><code><pre><div><div><div class=\"options-api\"><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>import<span><span> { onWatcherCleanup } <span><span>from<span><span> 'vue'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/watchers.html", "title": "侦听器 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "09ba7d1f575f43daa13e9f70e6004ab1", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1820, "chunk_index": 71, "_doc_id": "71_6868327485054999163"}}
{"doc_id": "72_2096462738787425099", "text": "n class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> watch: {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> id<span><span>(<span><span>newId<span><span>) {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> const<span><span> controller<span><span> =<span><span> new<span><span> AbortController<span><span>()<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/watchers.html", "title": "侦听器 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "09ba7d1f575f43daa13e9f70e6004ab1", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1820, "chunk_index": 72, "_doc_id": "72_2096462738787425099"}}
