{"doc_id": "75_7554906955318418559", "text": "pan> })<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span><code><pre><div><div><p>请注意，<code>onWatcherCleanup<code> 仅在 Vue 3.5+ 中支持，并且必须在 <code>watchEffect<code> 效果函数或 <code>watch<code> 回调函数的同步执行期间调用：你不能在异步函数的 <code>await<code> 语句之后调用它。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/watchers.html", "title": "侦听器 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "09ba7d1f575f43daa13e9f70e6004ab1", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1820, "chunk_index": 75, "_doc_id": "75_7554906955318418559"}}
{"doc_id": "76_2198995105051314504", "text": "在 <code>watchEffect<code> 效果函数或 <code>watch<code> 回调函数的同步执行期间调用：你不能在异步函数的 <code>await<code> 语句之后调用它。<p><p>作为替代，<code>onCleanup<code> 函数还作为第三个参数传递给侦听器回调<span class=\"composition-api\">，以及 <code>watchEffect<code> 作用函数的第一个参数<span>：<p><div class=\"composition-api\"><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>watch<span><span>(id, (<span><span>newId<span><span>, <span><span>oldId<span><span>, <span><span>onCleanup<span><span>) <span><span>=><span><span> {<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/watchers.html", "title": "侦听器 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "09ba7d1f575f43daa13e9f70e6004ab1", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1820, "chunk_index": 76, "_doc_id": "76_2198995105051314504"}}
{"doc_id": "77_6932612367383586915", "text": "span>oldId<span><span>, <span><span>onCleanup<span><span>) <span><span>=><span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // ...<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> onCleanup<span><span>(() <span><span>=><span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 清理逻辑<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> })<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>})<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/watchers.html", "title": "侦听器 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "09ba7d1f575f43daa13e9f70e6004ab1", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1820, "chunk_index": 77, "_doc_id": "77_6932612367383586915"}}
{"doc_id": "78_3446881452870931283", "text": "lass=\"line\"><span> })<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>})<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>watchEffect<span><span>((<span><span>onCleanup<span><span>) <span><span>=><span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // ...<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> onCleanup<span><span>(() <span><span>=><span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 清理逻辑<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> })<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/watchers.html", "title": "侦听器 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "09ba7d1f575f43daa13e9f70e6004ab1", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1820, "chunk_index": 78, "_doc_id": "78_3446881452870931283"}}
{"doc_id": "79_1891032223929022819", "text": "<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 清理逻辑<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> })<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>})<span><span><code><pre><div><div><div class=\"options-api\"><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> watch: {<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/watchers.html", "title": "侦听器 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "09ba7d1f575f43daa13e9f70e6004ab1", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1820, "chunk_index": 79, "_doc_id": "79_1891032223929022819"}}
{"doc_id": "80_1181742276617776411", "text": "export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> watch: {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> id<span><span>(<span><span>newId<span><span>, <span><span>oldId<span><span>, <span><span>onCleanup<span><span>) {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // ...<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> onCleanup<span><span>(() <span><span>=><span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 清理逻辑<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> })<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/watchers.html", "title": "侦听器 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "09ba7d1f575f43daa13e9f70e6004ab1", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1820, "chunk_index": 80, "_doc_id": "80_1181742276617776411"}}
{"doc_id": "81_5808367013752199774", "text": "<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 清理逻辑<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> })<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span><code><pre><div><div><p>这在 3.5 之前的版本有效。此外，通过函数参数传递的 <code>onCleanup<code> 与侦听器实例相绑定，因此不受 <code>onWatcherCleanup<code> 的同步限制。<p><h2 id=\"callback-flush-timing\">回调的触发时机 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#callback-flush-timing\">​<a><h2><p>当你更改了响应式状态，它可能会同时触发 Vue 组件更新和侦听器回调。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/watchers.html", "title": "侦听器 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "09ba7d1f575f43daa13e9f70e6004ab1", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1820, "chunk_index": 81, "_doc_id": "81_5808367013752199774"}}
{"doc_id": "82_8358062641383275831", "text": "a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#callback-flush-timing\">​<a><h2><p>当你更改了响应式状态，它可能会同时触发 Vue 组件更新和侦听器回调。<p><p>类似于组件更新，用户创建的侦听器回调函数也会被批量处理以避免重复调用。例如，如果我们同步将一千个项目推入被侦听的数组中，我们可能不希望侦听器触发一千次。<p><p>默认情况下，侦听器回调会在父组件更新 (如有) <strong>之后<strong>、所属组件的 DOM 更新<strong>之前<strong>被调用。这意味着如果你尝试在侦听器回调中访问所属组件的 DOM，那么 DOM 将处于更新前的状态。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/watchers.html", "title": "侦听器 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "09ba7d1f575f43daa13e9f70e6004ab1", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1820, "chunk_index": 82, "_doc_id": "82_8358062641383275831"}}
{"doc_id": "83_1536190336104091774", "text": ") <strong>之后<strong>、所属组件的 DOM 更新<strong>之前<strong>被调用。这意味着如果你尝试在侦听器回调中访问所属组件的 DOM，那么 DOM 将处于更新前的状态。<p><h3 id=\"post-watchers\">Post Watchers <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#post-watchers\">​<a><h3><p>如果想在侦听器回调中能访问被 Vue 更新<strong>之后<strong>的所属组件的 DOM，你需要指明 <code>flush: 'post'<code> 选项：<p><div class=\"options-api\"><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/watchers.html", "title": "侦听器 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "09ba7d1f575f43daa13e9f70e6004ab1", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1820, "chunk_index": 83, "_doc_id": "83_1536190336104091774"}}
{"doc_id": "84_8006828121545592015", "text": "b-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // ...<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> watch: {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> key: {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> handler<span><span>() {},<span><span>\n<span class=\"line highlighted\"><span> flush: <span><span>'post'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/watchers.html", "title": "侦听器 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "09ba7d1f575f43daa13e9f70e6004ab1", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1820, "chunk_index": 84, "_doc_id": "84_8006828121545592015"}}
{"doc_id": "85_1802022835735837482", "text": ">'post'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span><code><pre><div><div><div class=\"composition-api\"><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>watch<span><span>(source, callback, {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line highlighted\"><span> flush: <span><span>'post'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>})<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/watchers.html", "title": "侦听器 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "09ba7d1f575f43daa13e9f70e6004ab1", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1820, "chunk_index": 85, "_doc_id": "85_1802022835735837482"}}
{"doc_id": "86_5501546182149804475", "text": "h: <span><span>'post'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>})<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>watchEffect<span><span>(callback, {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line highlighted\"><span> flush: <span><span>'post'<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/watchers.html", "title": "侦听器 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "09ba7d1f575f43daa13e9f70e6004ab1", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1820, "chunk_index": 86, "_doc_id": "86_5501546182149804475"}}
{"doc_id": "87_6780530212959671565", "text": "callback, {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line highlighted\"><span> flush: <span><span>'post'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>})<span><span><code><pre><div><p>后置刷新的 <code>watchEffect()<code> 有个更方便的别名 <code>watchPostEffect()<code>：<p><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>import<span><span> { watchPostEffect } <span><span>from<span><span> 'vue'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/watchers.html", "title": "侦听器 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "09ba7d1f575f43daa13e9f70e6004ab1", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1820, "chunk_index": 87, "_doc_id": "87_6780530212959671565"}}
{"doc_id": "88_899334560268360838", "text": "<span> { watchPostEffect } <span><span>from<span><span> 'vue'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>watchPostEffect<span><span>(() <span><span>=><span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> /* 在 Vue 更新后执行 */<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/watchers.html", "title": "侦听器 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "09ba7d1f575f43daa13e9f70e6004ab1", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1820, "chunk_index": 88, "_doc_id": "88_899334560268360838"}}
{"doc_id": "89_8138877855785850917", "text": "() <span><span>=><span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> /* 在 Vue 更新后执行 */<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>})<span><span><code><pre><div><div><h3 id=\"sync-watchers\">同步侦听器 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#sync-watchers\">​<a><h3><p>你还可以创建一个同步触发的侦听器，它会在 Vue 进行任何更新之前触发：<p><div class=\"options-api\"><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/watchers.html", "title": "侦听器 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "09ba7d1f575f43daa13e9f70e6004ab1", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1820, "chunk_index": 89, "_doc_id": "89_8138877855785850917"}}
{"doc_id": "90_2933458754176453616", "text": "b-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // ...<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> watch: {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> key: {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> handler<span><span>() {},<span><span>\n<span class=\"line highlighted\"><span> flush: <span><span>'sync'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/watchers.html", "title": "侦听器 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "09ba7d1f575f43daa13e9f70e6004ab1", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1820, "chunk_index": 90, "_doc_id": "90_2933458754176453616"}}
{"doc_id": "91_2997442349802652199", "text": ">'sync'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span><code><pre><div><div><div class=\"composition-api\"><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>watch<span><span>(source, callback, {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line highlighted\"><span> flush: <span><span>'sync'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>})<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/watchers.html", "title": "侦听器 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "09ba7d1f575f43daa13e9f70e6004ab1", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1820, "chunk_index": 91, "_doc_id": "91_2997442349802652199"}}
{"doc_id": "92_1617987064689747149", "text": "h: <span><span>'sync'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>})<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>watchEffect<span><span>(callback, {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line highlighted\"><span> flush: <span><span>'sync'<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/watchers.html", "title": "侦听器 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "09ba7d1f575f43daa13e9f70e6004ab1", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1820, "chunk_index": 92, "_doc_id": "92_1617987064689747149"}}
{"doc_id": "93_5094062509747875878", "text": "callback, {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line highlighted\"><span> flush: <span><span>'sync'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>})<span><span><code><pre><div><p>同步触发的 <code>watchEffect()<code> 有个更方便的别名 <code>watchSyncEffect()<code>：<p><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>import<span><span> { watchSyncEffect } <span><span>from<span><span> 'vue'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/watchers.html", "title": "侦听器 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "09ba7d1f575f43daa13e9f70e6004ab1", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1820, "chunk_index": 93, "_doc_id": "93_5094062509747875878"}}
{"doc_id": "94_6408632620688581904", "text": "<span> { watchSyncEffect } <span><span>from<span><span> 'vue'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>watchSyncEffect<span><span>(() <span><span>=><span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> /* 在响应式数据变化时同步执行 */<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>})<span><span><code><pre><div><div><div class=\"warning custom-block\"><p class=\"custom-block-title\">谨慎使用<p><p>同步侦听器不会进行批处理，每当检测到响应式数据发生变化时就会触发。可以使用它来监视简单的布尔值，但应避免在可能多次同步修改的数据源 (如数组) 上使用。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/watchers.html", "title": "侦听器 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "09ba7d1f575f43daa13e9f70e6004ab1", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1820, "chunk_index": 94, "_doc_id": "94_6408632620688581904"}}
{"doc_id": "95_3213905673039209187", "text": "-block-title\">谨慎使用<p><p>同步侦听器不会进行批处理，每当检测到响应式数据发生变化时就会触发。可以使用它来监视简单的布尔值，但应避免在可能多次同步修改的数据源 (如数组) 上使用。<p><div><div class=\"options-api\"><h2 id=\"this-watch\"><code>this.$watch()<code> <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#this-watch\">​<a><h2><p>我们也可以使用组件实例的 <a href=\"/api/component-instance.html#watch\"><code>$watch()<code> 方法<a>来命令式地创建一个侦听器：<p><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/watchers.html", "title": "侦听器 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "09ba7d1f575f43daa13e9f70e6004ab1", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1820, "chunk_index": 95, "_doc_id": "95_3213905673039209187"}}
{"doc_id": "96_546344134481696260", "text": "b-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> created<span><span>() {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> this<span><span>.<span><span>$watch<span><span>(<span><span>'question'<span><span>, (<span><span>newQuestion<span><span>) <span><span>=><span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // ...<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> })<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/watchers.html", "title": "侦听器 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "09ba7d1f575f43daa13e9f70e6004ab1", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1820, "chunk_index": 96, "_doc_id": "96_546344134481696260"}}
{"doc_id": "97_8733308854000909257", "text": "// ...<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> })<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span><code><pre><div><p>如果要在特定条件下设置一个侦听器，或者只侦听响应用户交互的内容，这方法很有用。它还允许你提前停止该侦听器。<p><div><h2 id=\"stopping-a-watcher\">停止侦听器 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#stopping-a-watcher\">​<a><h2><div class=\"options-api\"><p>用 <code>watch<code> 选项或者 <code>$watch()<code> 实例方法声明的侦听器，会在宿主组件卸载时自动停止。因此，在大多数场景下，你无需关心怎么停止它。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/watchers.html", "title": "侦听器 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "09ba7d1f575f43daa13e9f70e6004ab1", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1820, "chunk_index": 97, "_doc_id": "97_8733308854000909257"}}
{"doc_id": "98_1526768805369131764", "text": "pi\"><p>用 <code>watch<code> 选项或者 <code>$watch()<code> 实例方法声明的侦听器，会在宿主组件卸载时自动停止。因此，在大多数场景下，你无需关心怎么停止它。<p><p>在少数情况下，你的确需要在组件卸载之前就停止一个侦听器，这时可以调用 <code>$watch()<code> API 返回的函数：<p><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> unwatch<span><span> =<span><span> this<span><span>.<span><span>$watch<span><span>(<span><span>'foo'<span><span>, callback)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/watchers.html", "title": "侦听器 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "09ba7d1f575f43daa13e9f70e6004ab1", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1820, "chunk_index": 98, "_doc_id": "98_1526768805369131764"}}
{"doc_id": "99_4008092854334555178", "text": "n>$watch<span><span>(<span><span>'foo'<span><span>, callback)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// ...当该侦听器不再需要时<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>unwatch<span><span>()<span><span><code><pre><div><div><div class=\"composition-api\"><p>在 <code>setup()<code> 或 <code><script setup><code> 中用同步语句创建的侦听器，会自动绑定到宿主组件实例上，并且会在宿主组件卸载时自动停止。因此，在大多数情况下，你无需关心怎么停止一个侦听器。<p><p>一个关键点是，侦听器必须用<strong>同步<strong>语句创建：如果用异步回调创建一个侦听器，那么它不会绑定到当前组件上，你必须手动停止它，以防内存泄漏。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/watchers.html", "title": "侦听器 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "09ba7d1f575f43daa13e9f70e6004ab1", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1820, "chunk_index": 99, "_doc_id": "99_4008092854334555178"}}
{"doc_id": "100_3925187799078654362", "text": "需关心怎么停止一个侦听器。<p><p>一个关键点是，侦听器必须用<strong>同步<strong>语句创建：如果用异步回调创建一个侦听器，那么它不会绑定到当前组件上，你必须手动停止它，以防内存泄漏。如下方这个例子：<p><div class=\"language-vue\"> <span class=\"lang\">vue<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>script<span><span> setup<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>import<span><span> { watchEffect } <span><span>from<span><span> 'vue'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 它会自动停止<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/watchers.html", "title": "侦听器 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "09ba7d1f575f43daa13e9f70e6004ab1", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1820, "chunk_index": 100, "_doc_id": "100_3925187799078654362"}}
{"doc_id": "101_3694847225004817914", "text": "n><span> 'vue'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 它会自动停止<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>watchEffect<span><span>(() <span><span>=><span><span> {})<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// ...这个则不会！<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>setTimeout<span><span>(() <span><span>=><span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> watchEffect<span><span>(() <span><span>=><span><span> {})<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/watchers.html", "title": "侦听器 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "09ba7d1f575f43daa13e9f70e6004ab1", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1820, "chunk_index": 101, "_doc_id": "101_3694847225004817914"}}
{"doc_id": "102_308465451608052874", "text": "an>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> watchEffect<span><span>(() <span><span>=><span><span> {})<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}, <span><span>100<span><span>)<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/watchers.html", "title": "侦听器 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "09ba7d1f575f43daa13e9f70e6004ab1", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1820, "chunk_index": 102, "_doc_id": "102_308465451608052874"}}
{"doc_id": "103_620384722685676509", "text": "=><span><span> {})<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}, <span><span>100<span><span>)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>script<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>要手动停止一个侦听器，请调用 <code>watch<code> 或 <code>watchEffect<code> 返回的函数：<p><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> unwatch<span><span> =<span><span> watchEffect<span><span>(() <span><span>=><span><span> {})<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/watchers.html", "title": "侦听器 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "09ba7d1f575f43daa13e9f70e6004ab1", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1820, "chunk_index": 103, "_doc_id": "103_620384722685676509"}}
{"doc_id": "104_2592888737714626437", "text": "tch<span><span> =<span><span> watchEffect<span><span>(() <span><span>=><span><span> {})<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// ...当该侦听器不再需要时<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>unwatch<span><span>()<span><span><code><pre><div><p>注意，需要异步创建侦听器的情况很少，请尽可能选择同步创建。如果需要等待一些异步数据，你可以使用条件式的侦听逻辑：<p><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// 需要异步请求得到的数据<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/watchers.html", "title": "侦听器 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "09ba7d1f575f43daa13e9f70e6004ab1", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1820, "chunk_index": 104, "_doc_id": "104_2592888737714626437"}}
{"doc_id": "105_2665131544803171949", "text": "an><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// 需要异步请求得到的数据<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> data<span><span> =<span><span> ref<span><span>(<span><span>null<span><span>)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>watchEffect<span><span>(() <span><span>=><span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> if<span><span> (data.value) {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 数据加载后执行某些操作...<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/watchers.html", "title": "侦听器 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "09ba7d1f575f43daa13e9f70e6004ab1", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1820, "chunk_index": 105, "_doc_id": "105_2665131544803171949"}}
{"doc_id": "106_7701807181527845407", "text": "> if<span><span> (data.value) {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 数据加载后执行某些操作...<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>})<span><span><code><pre><div><div><div><div>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/watchers.html", "title": "侦听器 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "09ba7d1f575f43daa13e9f70e6004ab1", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1820, "chunk_index": 106, "_doc_id": "106_7701807181527845407"}}
{"doc_id": "0_5419037363222304878", "text": "<div><div><h1 id=\"releases\">版本发布 <h1><p> 正在检测最新版本…… <p><p>完整的过往发布记录可以在 <a href=\"https://github.com/vuejs/core/blob/main/CHANGELOG.md\" target=\"_blank\">GitHub<a> 查阅。<p><h2 id=\"release-cycle\">发布周期 <h2><p>Vue 并没有固定的发布周期。<p><ul><li><p>补丁版本 (patch releases) 发布会及时按需进行。<p><li><li><p>小版本 (minor releases) 发布总是会包含一些新特性，发布周期通常会在 3~6 个月之间，并会经历 beta 预发布阶段。<p><li><li><p>大版本 (major releases) 发布会提前知会，且经历早期讨论和 alpha、beta 等预发布阶段。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/about/releases.html", "title": "版本发布", "doc_id": "303ab2951e994d839648f72c72151f7c", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 118, "chunk_index": 0, "_doc_id": "0_5419037363222304878"}}
{"doc_id": "1_1706107622007247218", "text": "通常会在 3~6 个月之间，并会经历 beta 预发布阶段。<p><li><li><p>大版本 (major releases) 发布会提前知会，且经历早期讨论和 alpha、beta 等预发布阶段。<p><li><ul><h2 id=\"semantic-versioning-edge-cases\">语义化版本控制的特殊情况 <h2><p>Vue 的发布会遵循<a href=\"https://semver.org/\" target=\"_blank\">语义化版本控制<a>，同时伴随一些特殊情况。<p><h3 id=\"typescript-definitions\">TypeScript 类型声明 <h3><p>我们可能会在<strong>小版本<strong>发布之间包含 TypeScript 类型声明的不兼容变更，因为：<p><ol><li><p>有的时候 TypeScript 自身会在其小版本之间发布不兼容变更，我们不得不为了支持更新版本的 TypeScript 而调整自身的类型定义。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/about/releases.html", "title": "版本发布", "doc_id": "303ab2951e994d839648f72c72151f7c", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 118, "chunk_index": 1, "_doc_id": "1_1706107622007247218"}}
{"doc_id": "2_8399820342849439307", "text": "类型声明的不兼容变更，因为：<p><ol><li><p>有的时候 TypeScript 自身会在其小版本之间发布不兼容变更，我们不得不为了支持更新版本的 TypeScript 而调整自身的类型定义。<p><li><li><p>我们也会偶尔需要使用最新版本的 TypeScript 中才可用的特性，并提升 TypeScript 的最低版本要求。<p><li><ol><p>如果你正在使用 TypeScript，则可以使用一个语义化版本的范围来锁住当前的小版本，并在 Vue 新的小版本发布时进行手动升级。<p><h3 id=\"compiled-code-compatibility-with-older-runtime\">编译后的代码和旧版运行时之间的兼容性 <h3><p>较新<strong>小版本<strong>的 Vue 编译器可能会生成与较旧小版本的 Vue 运行时不兼容的代码。例如，由 Vue 3.2 编译器生成的代码可能不完全兼容 Vue 3.1 的运行时。<p><p>只有库的作者需要考虑这个问题，因为编译器版本和运行时版本在应用中总是相同的。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/about/releases.html", "title": "版本发布", "doc_id": "303ab2951e994d839648f72c72151f7c", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 118, "chunk_index": 2, "_doc_id": "2_8399820342849439307"}}
{"doc_id": "3_8322779299616144015", "text": "Vue 运行时不兼容的代码。例如，由 Vue 3.2 编译器生成的代码可能不完全兼容 Vue 3.1 的运行时。<p><p>只有库的作者需要考虑这个问题，因为编译器版本和运行时版本在应用中总是相同的。只有当你把预编译的 Vue 组件代码发布为一个包，而用户在一个使用旧版本 Vue 的项目中使用它时，才会发生版本不匹配。因此，你的包可能需要明确声明 Vue 的最低小版本要求。<p><h2 id=\"pre-releases\">预发布版本 <h2><p>小版本发布通常会经历不定量的 beta 版。而大版本发布则会经历 alpha 和 beta 阶段。<p><p>此外，我们每周都会从 GitHub 上的 <code>main<code> 和 <code>minor<code> 分支发布金丝雀版本。它们将作为不同的软件包发布以避免稳定通道的 npm 元数据变得臃肿。你可以分别通过 <code>npx install-vue@canary<code> 或 <code>npx install-vue@canary-minor<code> 安装它们。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/about/releases.html", "title": "版本发布", "doc_id": "303ab2951e994d839648f72c72151f7c", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 118, "chunk_index": 3, "_doc_id": "3_8322779299616144015"}}
{"doc_id": "4_1862522210797738527", "text": "元数据变得臃肿。你可以分别通过 <code>npx install-vue@canary<code> 或 <code>npx install-vue@canary-minor<code> 安装它们。<p><p>预发布版本 (pre releases) 是为了进行集成/稳定性测试，并让早期用户为不稳定的功能提供反馈。请不要在生产中使用预发布版本。所有的预发布版本都被认为是不稳定的，并且可能会在两者之间产生不兼容变更，所以在使用预发布版本时，一定要精确锁定版本号。<p><h2 id=\"deprecations\">废弃的特性 <h2><p>我们可能会定期废弃那些在新的小版本中拥有更新更好的替代品的功能。被废弃的功能仍将继续工作，但会在进入废弃状态后的下一个大版本中被删除。<p><h2 id=\"rfcs\">RFC <h2><p>具有可观表层 API 的新特性和 Vue 的重大变更都将经历<strong>意见征集<strong> (RFC) 流程。RFC 流程的目的是为新功能进入该框架提供一个一致且可控的路径，并给用户一个机会参与设计过程并提供反馈。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/about/releases.html", "title": "版本发布", "doc_id": "303ab2951e994d839648f72c72151f7c", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 118, "chunk_index": 4, "_doc_id": "4_1862522210797738527"}}
{"doc_id": "5_5586257172247424440", "text": "新特性和 Vue 的重大变更都将经历<strong>意见征集<strong> (RFC) 流程。RFC 流程的目的是为新功能进入该框架提供一个一致且可控的路径，并给用户一个机会参与设计过程并提供反馈。<p><p>该 RFC 流程会在 GitHub 上的 <a href=\"https://github.com/vuejs/rfcs\" target=\"_blank\">vuejs/rfcs<a> 仓库进行。<p><h2 id=\"experimental-features\">试验性特性 <h2><p>有些特性在 Vue 的稳定版本中已经发布并被记录了，但被标记为试验性的。试验性特性通常与某些 RFC 讨论相关联，这些讨论中的大部分设计问题已经在理论上得到了解决，但仍缺乏来自真实实践的反馈。<p><p>试验性特性的目的是允许用户通过在生产环境中测试它们来提供反馈，而不必使用不稳定的 Vue 版本。试验性特性本身是被认为不稳定的，只能以某种受控的方式使用，且该特性可预期地会在任何发布类型中发生变化。<p><div><div>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/about/releases.html", "title": "版本发布", "doc_id": "303ab2951e994d839648f72c72151f7c", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 118, "chunk_index": 5, "_doc_id": "5_5586257172247424440"}}
{"doc_id": "0_5839064835071171507", "text": "[Failed to extract content from: https://cn.vuejs.org/examples/]", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/examples/", "title": "Examples | Vue.js", "doc_id": "e8f9e538bbb346cca5f819b5d99451d7", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 6, "chunk_index": 0, "_doc_id": "0_5839064835071171507"}}
{"doc_id": "0_6195690396277888618", "text": "<div><div><h1 id=\"introduction\">简介 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#introduction\">​<a><h1><h2 id=\"what-is-vue\">什么是 Vue？ <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#what-is-vue\">​<a><h2><p>Vue (发音为 /vjuː/，类似 <strong>view<strong>) 是一款用于构建用户界面的 JavaScript 框架。它基于标准 HTML、CSS 和 JavaScript 构建，并提供了一套声明式的、组件化的编程模型，帮助你高效地开发用户界面。无论是简单还是复杂的界面，Vue 都可以胜任。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/introduction.html", "title": "简介 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "4172f63dda174f5cb3d4733a7b23c538", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 608, "chunk_index": 0, "_doc_id": "0_6195690396277888618"}}
{"doc_id": "1_2310898484692219515", "text": "avaScript 框架。它基于标准 HTML、CSS 和 JavaScript 构建，并提供了一套声明式的、组件化的编程模型，帮助你高效地开发用户界面。无论是简单还是复杂的界面，Vue 都可以胜任。<p><p>下面是一个最基本的示例：<p><div class=\"options-api\"><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>import<span><span> { createApp } <span><span>from<span><span> 'vue'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>createApp<span><span>({<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> data<span><span>() {<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/introduction.html", "title": "简介 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "4172f63dda174f5cb3d4733a7b23c538", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 608, "chunk_index": 1, "_doc_id": "1_2310898484692219515"}}
{"doc_id": "2_9088306374990737604", "text": "span>createApp<span><span>({<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> data<span><span>() {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> return<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> count: <span><span>0<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/introduction.html", "title": "简介 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "4172f63dda174f5cb3d4733a7b23c538", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 608, "chunk_index": 2, "_doc_id": "2_9088306374990737604"}}
{"doc_id": "3_4137586470103774591", "text": "<span>0<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}).<span><span>mount<span><span>(<span><span>'#app'<span><span>)<span><span><code><pre><div><div><div class=\"composition-api\"><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>import<span><span> { createApp, ref } <span><span>from<span><span> 'vue'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/introduction.html", "title": "简介 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "4172f63dda174f5cb3d4733a7b23c538", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 608, "chunk_index": 3, "_doc_id": "3_4137586470103774591"}}
{"doc_id": "4_6823495640349235277", "text": "><span> { createApp, ref } <span><span>from<span><span> 'vue'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>createApp<span><span>({<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> setup<span><span>() {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> return<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> count: <span><span>ref<span><span>(<span><span>0<span><span>)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/introduction.html", "title": "简介 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "4172f63dda174f5cb3d4733a7b23c538", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 608, "chunk_index": 4, "_doc_id": "4_6823495640349235277"}}
{"doc_id": "5_7663912033941130300", "text": "<span>)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}).<span><span>mount<span><span>(<span><span>'#app'<span><span>)<span><span><code><pre><div><div><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>div<span><span> id<span><span>=<span><span>\"app\"<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/introduction.html", "title": "简介 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "4172f63dda174f5cb3d4733a7b23c538", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 608, "chunk_index": 5, "_doc_id": "5_7663912033941130300"}}
{"doc_id": "6_2778405578743970960", "text": "\"line\"><span><<span><span>div<span><span> id<span><span>=<span><span>\"app\"<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>button<span><span> @<span><span>click<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>count<span><span>++<span><span>\"<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> Count is: {{ count }}<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> </<span><span>button<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/introduction.html", "title": "简介 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "4172f63dda174f5cb3d4733a7b23c538", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 608, "chunk_index": 6, "_doc_id": "6_2778405578743970960"}}
{"doc_id": "7_1884745853012702980", "text": "is: {{ count }}<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> </<span><span>button<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>div<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p><strong>结果展示<strong><p><p class=\"demo\"> Count is: 0 <p><p>上面的示例展示了 Vue 的两个核心功能：<p><p>你可能已经有了些疑问——先别急，在后续的文档中我们会详细介绍每一个细节。现在，请继续看下去，以确保你对 Vue 作为一个框架到底提供了什么有一个宏观的了解。<p><div class=\"tip custom-block\"><p class=\"custom-block-title\">预备知识<p><p>文档接下来的内容会假设你对 HTML、CSS 和 JavaScript 已经基本熟悉。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/introduction.html", "title": "简介 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "4172f63dda174f5cb3d4733a7b23c538", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 608, "chunk_index": 7, "_doc_id": "7_1884745853012702980"}}
{"doc_id": "8_7395723620062868592", "text": "ip custom-block\"><p class=\"custom-block-title\">预备知识<p><p>文档接下来的内容会假设你对 HTML、CSS 和 JavaScript 已经基本熟悉。如果你对前端开发完全陌生，最好不要直接从一个框架开始进行入门学习——最好是掌握了基础知识再回到这里。如有需要，你可以通过这些 <a href=\"https://developer.mozilla.org/zh-CN/docs/Web/JavaScript/A_re-introduction_to_JavaScript\" target=\"_blank\">JavaScript<a>、<a href=\"https://developer.mozilla.org/zh-CN/docs/Learn/HTML/Introduction_to_HTML\" target=\"_blank\">HTML<a> 和 <a href=\"https://developer.mozilla.org/zh-CN/docs/Learn/CSS/First_steps\" target=\"_blank\">CSS<a> 概述来检验你的知识水平。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/introduction.html", "title": "简介 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "4172f63dda174f5cb3d4733a7b23c538", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 608, "chunk_index": 8, "_doc_id": "8_7395723620062868592"}}
{"doc_id": "9_4378384526126207920", "text": "\"https://developer.mozilla.org/zh-CN/docs/Learn/CSS/First_steps\" target=\"_blank\">CSS<a> 概述来检验你的知识水平。如果之前有其他框架的经验会很有帮助，但也不是必须的。<p><div><h2 id=\"the-progressive-framework\">渐进式框架 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#the-progressive-framework\">​<a><h2><p>Vue 是一个框架，也是一个生态。其功能覆盖了大部分前端开发常见的需求。但 Web 世界是十分多样化的，不同的开发者在 Web 上构建的东西可能在形式和规模上会有很大的不同。考虑到这一点，Vue 的设计非常注重灵活性和“可以被逐步集成”这个特点。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/introduction.html", "title": "简介 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "4172f63dda174f5cb3d4733a7b23c538", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 608, "chunk_index": 9, "_doc_id": "9_4378384526126207920"}}
{"doc_id": "10_6469574026980243246", "text": "大部分前端开发常见的需求。但 Web 世界是十分多样化的，不同的开发者在 Web 上构建的东西可能在形式和规模上会有很大的不同。考虑到这一点，Vue 的设计非常注重灵活性和“可以被逐步集成”这个特点。根据你的需求场景，你可以用不同的方式使用 Vue：<p><ul><li>无需构建步骤，渐进式增强静态的 HTML<li><li>在任何页面中作为 Web Components 嵌入<li><li>单页应用 (SPA)<li><li>全栈 / 服务端渲染 (SSR)<li><li>Jamstack / 静态站点生成 (SSG)<li><li>开发桌面端、移动端、WebGL，甚至是命令行终端中的界面<li><ul><p>如果你是初学者，可能会觉得这些概念有些复杂。别担心！理解教程和指南的内容只需要具备基础的 HTML 和 JavaScript 知识。即使你不是这些方面的专家，也能够跟得上。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/introduction.html", "title": "简介 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "4172f63dda174f5cb3d4733a7b23c538", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 608, "chunk_index": 10, "_doc_id": "10_6469574026980243246"}}
{"doc_id": "11_4640243842580244956", "text": "的界面<li><ul><p>如果你是初学者，可能会觉得这些概念有些复杂。别担心！理解教程和指南的内容只需要具备基础的 HTML 和 JavaScript 知识。即使你不是这些方面的专家，也能够跟得上。<p><p>如果你是有经验的开发者，希望了解如何以最合适的方式在项目中引入 Vue，或者是对上述的这些概念感到好奇，我们在<a href=\"/guide/extras/ways-of-using-vue.html\">使用 Vue 的多种方式<a>中讨论了有关它们的更多细节。<p><p>无论再怎么灵活，Vue 的核心知识在所有这些用例中都是通用的。即使你现在只是一个初学者，随着你的不断成长，到未来有能力实现更复杂的项目时，这一路上获得的知识依然会适用。如果你已经是一个老手，你可以根据实际场景来选择使用 Vue 的最佳方式，在各种场景下都可以保持同样的开发效率。这就是为什么我们将 Vue 称为“渐进式框架”：它是一个可以与你共同成长、适应你不同需求的框架。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/introduction.html", "title": "简介 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "4172f63dda174f5cb3d4733a7b23c538", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 608, "chunk_index": 11, "_doc_id": "11_4640243842580244956"}}
{"doc_id": "12_2529682173667876941", "text": "已经是一个老手，你可以根据实际场景来选择使用 Vue 的最佳方式，在各种场景下都可以保持同样的开发效率。这就是为什么我们将 Vue 称为“渐进式框架”：它是一个可以与你共同成长、适应你不同需求的框架。<p><h2 id=\"single-file-components\">单文件组件 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#single-file-components\">​<a><h2><p>在大多数启用了构建工具的 Vue 项目中，我们可以使用一种类似 HTML 格式的文件来书写 Vue 组件，它被称为<strong>单文件组件<strong> (也被称为 <code>*.vue<code> 文件，英文 Single-File Components，缩写为 <strong>SFC<strong>)。顾名思义，Vue 的单文件组件会将一个组件的逻辑 (JavaScript)，模板 (HTML) 和样式 (CSS) 封装在同一个文件里。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/introduction.html", "title": "简介 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "4172f63dda174f5cb3d4733a7b23c538", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 608, "chunk_index": 12, "_doc_id": "12_2529682173667876941"}}
{"doc_id": "13_5617914003319960098", "text": "onents，缩写为 <strong>SFC<strong>)。顾名思义，Vue 的单文件组件会将一个组件的逻辑 (JavaScript)，模板 (HTML) 和样式 (CSS) 封装在同一个文件里。下面我们将用单文件组件的格式重写上面的计数器示例：<p><div class=\"options-api\"><div class=\"language-vue\"> <span class=\"lang\">vue<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>script<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> data<span><span>() {<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/introduction.html", "title": "简介 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "4172f63dda174f5cb3d4733a7b23c538", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 608, "chunk_index": 13, "_doc_id": "13_5617914003319960098"}}
{"doc_id": "14_8565640116576850227", "text": "<span> default<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> data<span><span>() {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> return<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> count: <span><span>0<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>script<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/introduction.html", "title": "简介 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "4172f63dda174f5cb3d4733a7b23c538", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 608, "chunk_index": 14, "_doc_id": "14_8565640116576850227"}}
{"doc_id": "15_6260419395909631856", "text": ">\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>button<span><span> @click<span><span>=<span><span>\"count++\"<span><span>>Count is: {{ count }}</<span><span>button<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>style<span><span> scoped<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/introduction.html", "title": "简介 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "4172f63dda174f5cb3d4733a7b23c538", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 608, "chunk_index": 15, "_doc_id": "15_6260419395909631856"}}
{"doc_id": "16_4175312891501675067", "text": "ine\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>style<span><span> scoped<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>button<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> font-weight<span><span>: <span><span>bold<span><span>;<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/introduction.html", "title": "简介 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "4172f63dda174f5cb3d4733a7b23c538", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 608, "chunk_index": 16, "_doc_id": "16_4175312891501675067"}}
{"doc_id": "17_4813006113887291885", "text": "eight<span><span>: <span><span>bold<span><span>;<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>style<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><div><div class=\"composition-api\"><div class=\"language-vue\"> <span class=\"lang\">vue<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>script<span><span> setup<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>import<span><span> { ref } <span><span>from<span><span> 'vue'<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/introduction.html", "title": "简介 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "4172f63dda174f5cb3d4733a7b23c538", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 608, "chunk_index": 17, "_doc_id": "17_4813006113887291885"}}
{"doc_id": "18_1836124839863404144", "text": "<span class=\"line\"><span>import<span><span> { ref } <span><span>from<span><span> 'vue'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> count<span><span> =<span><span> ref<span><span>(<span><span>0<span><span>)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>script<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/introduction.html", "title": "简介 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "4172f63dda174f5cb3d4733a7b23c538", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 608, "chunk_index": 18, "_doc_id": "18_1836124839863404144"}}
{"doc_id": "19_6260419395909631856", "text": ">\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>button<span><span> @click<span><span>=<span><span>\"count++\"<span><span>>Count is: {{ count }}</<span><span>button<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>style<span><span> scoped<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/introduction.html", "title": "简介 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "4172f63dda174f5cb3d4733a7b23c538", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 608, "chunk_index": 19, "_doc_id": "19_6260419395909631856"}}
{"doc_id": "20_8949425938603497908", "text": "ine\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>style<span><span> scoped<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>button<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> font-weight<span><span>: <span><span>bold<span><span>;<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>style<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><div><p>单文件组件是 Vue 的标志性功能。如果你的用例需要进行构建，我们推荐用它来编写 Vue 组件。你可以在后续相关章节里了解更多关于<a href=\"/guide/scaling-up/sfc.html\">单文件组件的用法及用途<a>。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/introduction.html", "title": "简介 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "4172f63dda174f5cb3d4733a7b23c538", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 608, "chunk_index": 20, "_doc_id": "20_8949425938603497908"}}
{"doc_id": "21_5674691541579578437", "text": "。如果你的用例需要进行构建，我们推荐用它来编写 Vue 组件。你可以在后续相关章节里了解更多关于<a href=\"/guide/scaling-up/sfc.html\">单文件组件的用法及用途<a>。但你暂时只需要知道 Vue 会帮忙处理所有这些构建工具的配置就好。<p><h2 id=\"api-styles\">API 风格 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#api-styles\">​<a><h2><p>Vue 的组件可以按两种不同的风格书写：<strong>选项式 API<strong> 和<strong>组合式 API<strong>。<p><h3 id=\"options-api\">选项式 API (Options API) <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#options-api\">​<a><h3><p>使用选项式 API，我们可以用包含多个选项的对象来描述组件的逻辑，例如 <code>data<code>、<code>methods<code> 和 <code>mounted<code>。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/introduction.html", "title": "简介 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "4172f63dda174f5cb3d4733a7b23c538", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 608, "chunk_index": 21, "_doc_id": "21_5674691541579578437"}}
{"doc_id": "22_2215028053069610680", "text": "3><p>使用选项式 API，我们可以用包含多个选项的对象来描述组件的逻辑，例如 <code>data<code>、<code>methods<code> 和 <code>mounted<code>。选项所定义的属性都会暴露在函数内部的 <code>this<code> 上，它会指向当前的组件实例。<p><div class=\"language-vue\"> <span class=\"lang\">vue<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>script<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // data() 返回的属性将会成为响应式的状态<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/introduction.html", "title": "简介 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "4172f63dda174f5cb3d4733a7b23c538", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 608, "chunk_index": 22, "_doc_id": "22_2215028053069610680"}}
{"doc_id": "23_7683725257088490179", "text": "> default<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // data() 返回的属性将会成为响应式的状态<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 并且暴露在 `this` 上<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> data<span><span>() {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> return<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> count: <span><span>0<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> },<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // methods 是一些用来更改状态与触发更新的函数<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/introduction.html", "title": "简介 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "4172f63dda174f5cb3d4733a7b23c538", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 608, "chunk_index": 23, "_doc_id": "23_7683725257088490179"}}
{"doc_id": "24_8301187445160809254", "text": "<span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // methods 是一些用来更改状态与触发更新的函数<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 它们可以在模板中作为事件处理器绑定<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> methods: {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> increment<span><span>() {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> this<span><span>.count<span><span>++<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> },<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/introduction.html", "title": "简介 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "4172f63dda174f5cb3d4733a7b23c538", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 608, "chunk_index": 24, "_doc_id": "24_8301187445160809254"}}
{"doc_id": "25_3637227316009041358", "text": "lass=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> },<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 生命周期钩子会在组件生命周期的各个不同阶段被调用<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 例如这个函数就会在组件挂载完成后被调用<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> mounted<span><span>() {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> console.<span><span>log<span><span>(<span><span>`The initial count is ${<span><span>this<span><span>.<span><span>count<span><span>}.`<span><span>)<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/introduction.html", "title": "简介 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "4172f63dda174f5cb3d4733a7b23c538", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 608, "chunk_index": 25, "_doc_id": "25_3637227316009041358"}}
{"doc_id": "26_8069774467973902824", "text": "l count is ${<span><span>this<span><span>.<span><span>count<span><span>}.`<span><span>)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>script<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/introduction.html", "title": "简介 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "4172f63dda174f5cb3d4733a7b23c538", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 608, "chunk_index": 26, "_doc_id": "26_8069774467973902824"}}
{"doc_id": "27_4142232790080792802", "text": ">\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>button<span><span> @click<span><span>=<span><span>\"increment\"<span><span>>Count is: {{ count }}</<span><span>button<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p><a href=\"https://play.vuejs.", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/introduction.html", "title": "简介 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "4172f63dda174f5cb3d4733a7b23c538", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 608, "chunk_index": 27, "_doc_id": "27_4142232790080792802"}}
{"doc_id": "28_2213952547221158404", "text": "<span></<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p><a href=\"https://play.vuejs.org/#\" target=\"_blank\">在演练场中尝试一下<a><p><h3 id=\"composition-api\">组合式 API (Composition API) <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#composition-api\">​<a><h3><p>通过组合式 API，", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/introduction.html", "title": "简介 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "4172f63dda174f5cb3d4733a7b23c538", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 608, "chunk_index": 28, "_doc_id": "28_2213952547221158404"}}
{"doc_id": "29_1651189994659790155", "text": "pi\">组合式 API (Composition API) <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#composition-api\">​<a><h3><p>通过组合式 API，我们可以使用导入的 API 函数来描述组件逻辑。在单文件组件中，组合式 API 通常会与 <a href=\"/api/sfc-script-setup.html\"><code><script setup><code><a> 搭配使用。这个 <code>setup<code> attribute 是一个标识，告诉 Vue 需要在编译时进行一些处理，让我们可以更简洁地使用组合式 API。比如，<code><script setup><code> 中的导入和顶层变量/函数都能够在模板中直接使用。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/introduction.html", "title": "简介 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "4172f63dda174f5cb3d4733a7b23c538", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 608, "chunk_index": 29, "_doc_id": "29_1651189994659790155"}}
{"doc_id": "30_5612223095310491903", "text": "是一个标识，告诉 Vue 需要在编译时进行一些处理，让我们可以更简洁地使用组合式 API。比如，<code><script setup><code> 中的导入和顶层变量/函数都能够在模板中直接使用。<p><p>下面是使用了组合式 API 与 <code><script setup><code> 改造后和上面的模板完全一样的组件：<p><div class=\"language-vue\"> <span class=\"lang\">vue<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>script<span><span> setup<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>import<span><span> { ref, onMounted } <span><span>from<span><span> 'vue'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/introduction.html", "title": "简介 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "4172f63dda174f5cb3d4733a7b23c538", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 608, "chunk_index": 30, "_doc_id": "30_5612223095310491903"}}
{"doc_id": "31_7884051637221108308", "text": "><span> { ref, onMounted } <span><span>from<span><span> 'vue'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 响应式状态<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> count<span><span> =<span><span> ref<span><span>(<span><span>0<span><span>)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 用来修改状态、触发更新的函数<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>function<span><span> increment<span><span>() {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> count.value<span><span>++<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/introduction.html", "title": "简介 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "4172f63dda174f5cb3d4733a7b23c538", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 608, "chunk_index": 31, "_doc_id": "31_7884051637221108308"}}
{"doc_id": "32_348882740248355580", "text": "crement<span><span>() {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> count.value<span><span>++<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 生命周期钩子<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>onMounted<span><span>(() <span><span>=><span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> console.<span><span>log<span><span>(<span><span>`The initial count is ${<span><span>count<span><span>.<span><span>value<span><span>}.`<span><span>)<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/introduction.html", "title": "简介 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "4172f63dda174f5cb3d4733a7b23c538", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 608, "chunk_index": 32, "_doc_id": "32_348882740248355580"}}
{"doc_id": "33_5907192768914987514", "text": "count is ${<span><span>count<span><span>.<span><span>value<span><span>}.`<span><span>)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>})<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>script<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>button<span><span> @click<span><span>=<span><span>\"increment\"<span><span>>Count is: {{ count }}</<span><span>button<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/introduction.html", "title": "简介 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "4172f63dda174f5cb3d4733a7b23c538", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 608, "chunk_index": 33, "_doc_id": "33_5907192768914987514"}}
{"doc_id": "34_6320785963014803155", "text": "an><span>\"increment\"<span><span>>Count is: {{ count }}</<span><span>button<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p><a href=\"https://play.vuejs.", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/introduction.html", "title": "简介 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "4172f63dda174f5cb3d4733a7b23c538", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 608, "chunk_index": 34, "_doc_id": "34_6320785963014803155"}}
{"doc_id": "35_7956677031619130184", "text": "<span></<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p><a href=\"https://play.vuejs.org/#\" target=\"_blank\">在演练场中尝试一下<a><p><h3 id=\"which-to-choose\">该选哪一个？", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/introduction.html", "title": "简介 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "4172f63dda174f5cb3d4733a7b23c538", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 608, "chunk_index": 35, "_doc_id": "35_7956677031619130184"}}
{"doc_id": "36_4418537480255177406", "text": "rIrr5+Z7hnneQnJu6hURvKl3ryL/ARrVkuI=\" target=\"_blank\">在演练场中尝试一下<a><p><h3 id=\"which-to-choose\">该选哪一个？ <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#which-to-choose\">​<a><h3><p>两种 API 风格都能够覆盖大部分的应用场景。它们只是同一个底层系统所提供的两套不同的接口。实际上，选项式 API 是在组合式 API 的基础上实现的！关于 Vue 的基础概念和知识在它们之间都是通用的。<p><p>选项式 API 以“组件实例”的概念为中心 (即上述例子中的 <code>this<code>)，对于有面向对象语言背景的用户来说，这通常与基于类的心智模型更为一致。同时，它将响应性相关的细节抽象出来，并强制按照选项来组织代码，从而对初学者而言更为友好。<p><p>组合式 API 的核心思想是直接在函数作用域内定义响应式状态变量，并将从多个函数中得到的状态组合起来处理复杂问题。这种形式更加自由，也需要你对 Vue 的响应式系统有更深的理解才能高效使用。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/introduction.html", "title": "简介 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "4172f63dda174f5cb3d4733a7b23c538", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 608, "chunk_index": 36, "_doc_id": "36_4418537480255177406"}}
{"doc_id": "37_6591830192225633564", "text": "p><p>组合式 API 的核心思想是直接在函数作用域内定义响应式状态变量，并将从多个函数中得到的状态组合起来处理复杂问题。这种形式更加自由，也需要你对 Vue 的响应式系统有更深的理解才能高效使用。相应的，它的灵活性也使得组织和重用逻辑的模式变得更加强大。<p><p>在<a href=\"/guide/extras/composition-api-faq.html\">组合式 API FAQ<a> 章节中，你可以了解更多关于这两种 API 风格的对比以及组合式 API 所带来的潜在收益。<p><p>如果你是使用 Vue 的新手，这里是我们的大致建议：<p><p>在学习阶段，你不必只固守一种风格。在接下来的文档中我们会为你提供一系列两种风格的代码供你参考，你可以随时通过左上角的 <strong>API 风格偏好<strong>来做切换。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/introduction.html", "title": "简介 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "4172f63dda174f5cb3d4733a7b23c538", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 608, "chunk_index": 37, "_doc_id": "37_6591830192225633564"}}
{"doc_id": "38_8922799502895209953", "text": "的大致建议：<p><p>在学习阶段，你不必只固守一种风格。在接下来的文档中我们会为你提供一系列两种风格的代码供你参考，你可以随时通过左上角的 <strong>API 风格偏好<strong>来做切换。<p><h2 id=\"still-got-questions\">还有其他问题？ <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#still-got-questions\">​<a><h2><p>请查看我们的 <a href=\"/about/faq.html\">FAQ<a>。<p><h2 id=\"pick-your-learning-path\">选择你的学习路径 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#pick-your-learning-path\">​<a><h2><p>不同的开发者有不同的学习方式。尽管在可能的情况下，我们推荐你通读所有内容，但你还是可以自由地选择一种自己喜欢的学习路径！<p><div><div>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/introduction.html", "title": "简介 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "4172f63dda174f5cb3d4733a7b23c538", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 608, "chunk_index": 38, "_doc_id": "38_8922799502895209953"}}
{"doc_id": "0_187890297484196346", "text": "<div><div><h1 id=\"template-refs\">模板引用 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#template-refs\">​<a><h1><p>虽然 Vue 的声明性渲染模型为你抽象了大部分对 DOM 的直接操作，但在某些情况下，我们仍然需要直接访问底层 DOM 元素。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/template-refs.html", "title": "模板引用", "doc_id": "025c58054be24d51b54c66c356bf3b15", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 925, "chunk_index": 0, "_doc_id": "0_187890297484196346"}}
{"doc_id": "1_1050504288609067005", "text": "or\" href=\"#template-refs\">​<a><h1><p>虽然 Vue 的声明性渲染模型为你抽象了大部分对 DOM 的直接操作，但在某些情况下，我们仍然需要直接访问底层 DOM 元素。要实现这一点，我们可以使用特殊的 <code>ref<code> attribute：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>input<span><span> ref<span><span>=<span><span>\"input\"<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p><code>ref<code> 是一个特殊的 attribute，和 <code>v-for<code> 章节中提到的 <code>key<code> 类似。它允许我们在一个特定的 DOM 元素或子组件实例被挂载后，获得对它的直接引用。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/template-refs.html", "title": "模板引用", "doc_id": "025c58054be24d51b54c66c356bf3b15", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 925, "chunk_index": 1, "_doc_id": "1_1050504288609067005"}}
{"doc_id": "2_6804180024460934227", "text": "个特殊的 attribute，和 <code>v-for<code> 章节中提到的 <code>key<code> 类似。它允许我们在一个特定的 DOM 元素或子组件实例被挂载后，获得对它的直接引用。这可能很有用，比如说在组件挂载时将焦点设置到一个 input 元素上，或在一个元素上初始化一个第三方库。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/template-refs.html", "title": "模板引用", "doc_id": "025c58054be24d51b54c66c356bf3b15", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 925, "chunk_index": 2, "_doc_id": "2_6804180024460934227"}}
{"doc_id": "3_5493128099699721937", "text": "code> 类似。它允许我们在一个特定的 DOM 元素或子组件实例被挂载后，获得对它的直接引用。这可能很有用，比如说在组件挂载时将焦点设置到一个 input 元素上，或在一个元素上初始化一个第三方库。<p><h2 id=\"accessing-the-refs\">访问模板引用 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#accessing-the-refs\">​<a><h2><div class=\"composition-api\"><p>要在组合式 API 中获取引用，我们可以使用辅助函数 <a href=\"/api/composition-api-helpers.html#usetemplateref\"><code>useTemplateRef()<code><a> ：<p><div class=\"language-vue\"> <span class=\"lang\">vue<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>script<span><span> setup<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/template-refs.html", "title": "模板引用", "doc_id": "025c58054be24d51b54c66c356bf3b15", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 925, "chunk_index": 3, "_doc_id": "3_5493128099699721937"}}
{"doc_id": "4_6790361041967877804", "text": "code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>script<span><span> setup<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>import<span><span> { useTemplateRef, onMounted } <span><span>from<span><span> 'vue'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 第一个参数必须与模板中的 ref 值匹配<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> input<span><span> =<span><span> useTemplateRef<span><span>(<span><span>'my-input'<span><span>)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/template-refs.html", "title": "模板引用", "doc_id": "025c58054be24d51b54c66c356bf3b15", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 925, "chunk_index": 4, "_doc_id": "4_6790361041967877804"}}
{"doc_id": "5_3278264099824832226", "text": "seTemplateRef<span><span>(<span><span>'my-input'<span><span>)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>onMounted<span><span>(() <span><span>=><span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> input.value.<span><span>focus<span><span>()<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>})<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>script<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/template-refs.html", "title": "模板引用", "doc_id": "025c58054be24d51b54c66c356bf3b15", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 925, "chunk_index": 5, "_doc_id": "5_3278264099824832226"}}
{"doc_id": "6_8109240510946639597", "text": ">\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>input<span><span> ref<span><span>=<span><span>\"my-input\"<span><span> /><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/template-refs.html", "title": "模板引用", "doc_id": "025c58054be24d51b54c66c356bf3b15", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 925, "chunk_index": 6, "_doc_id": "6_8109240510946639597"}}
{"doc_id": "7_6276000136437298225", "text": "n> <<span><span>input<span><span> ref<span><span>=<span><span>\"my-input\"<span><span> /><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>在使用 TypeScript 时，Vue 的 IDE 支持和 <code>vue-tsc<code> 将根据匹配的 <code>ref<code> attribute 所用的元素或组件自动推断 <code>input.value<code> 的类型。<p> 3.5 前的用法 <p>在 3.5 之前的版本尚未引入 <code>useTemplateRef()<code>，我们需要声明一个与模板里 ref attribute 匹配的引用：<p><div class=\"language-vue\"> <span class=\"lang\">vue<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>script<span><span> setup<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/template-refs.html", "title": "模板引用", "doc_id": "025c58054be24d51b54c66c356bf3b15", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 925, "chunk_index": 7, "_doc_id": "7_6276000136437298225"}}
{"doc_id": "8_675599828964256704", "text": "code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>script<span><span> setup<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>import<span><span> { ref, onMounted } <span><span>from<span><span> 'vue'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 声明一个 ref 来存放该元素的引用<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 必须和模板里的 ref 同名<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> input<span><span> =<span><span> ref<span><span>(<span><span>null<span><span>)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/template-refs.html", "title": "模板引用", "doc_id": "025c58054be24d51b54c66c356bf3b15", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 925, "chunk_index": 8, "_doc_id": "8_675599828964256704"}}
{"doc_id": "9_6516844369771447664", "text": "> =<span><span> ref<span><span>(<span><span>null<span><span>)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>onMounted<span><span>(() <span><span>=><span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> input.value.<span><span>focus<span><span>()<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>})<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>script<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/template-refs.html", "title": "模板引用", "doc_id": "025c58054be24d51b54c66c356bf3b15", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 925, "chunk_index": 9, "_doc_id": "9_6516844369771447664"}}
{"doc_id": "10_8040204268809912146", "text": ">\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>input<span><span> ref<span><span>=<span><span>\"input\"<span><span> /><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/template-refs.html", "title": "模板引用", "doc_id": "025c58054be24d51b54c66c356bf3b15", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 925, "chunk_index": 10, "_doc_id": "10_8040204268809912146"}}
{"doc_id": "11_3433679233904899655", "text": "span> <<span><span>input<span><span> ref<span><span>=<span><span>\"input\"<span><span> /><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>如果不使用 <code><script setup><code>，需确保从 <code>setup()<code> 返回 ref：<p><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> setup<span><span>() {<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/template-refs.html", "title": "模板引用", "doc_id": "025c58054be24d51b54c66c356bf3b15", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 925, "chunk_index": 11, "_doc_id": "11_3433679233904899655"}}
{"doc_id": "12_3386666652778040315", "text": "span> default<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> setup<span><span>() {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> const<span><span> input<span><span> =<span><span> ref<span><span>(<span><span>null<span><span>)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // ...<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> return<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line highlighted\"><span> input<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/template-refs.html", "title": "模板引用", "doc_id": "025c58054be24d51b54c66c356bf3b15", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 925, "chunk_index": 12, "_doc_id": "12_3386666652778040315"}}
{"doc_id": "13_7053555309571768166", "text": "> input<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span><code><pre><div> <div><div class=\"options-api\"><p>挂载结束后引用都会被暴露在 <code>this.$refs<code> 之上：<p><div class=\"language-vue\"> <span class=\"lang\">vue<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>script<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/template-refs.html", "title": "模板引用", "doc_id": "025c58054be24d51b54c66c356bf3b15", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 925, "chunk_index": 13, "_doc_id": "13_7053555309571768166"}}
{"doc_id": "14_6732932019664810102", "text": "n><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> mounted<span><span>() {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> this<span><span>.$refs.input.<span><span>focus<span><span>()<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>script<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/template-refs.html", "title": "模板引用", "doc_id": "025c58054be24d51b54c66c356bf3b15", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 925, "chunk_index": 14, "_doc_id": "14_6732932019664810102"}}
{"doc_id": "15_2014190967801356245", "text": ">\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>input<span><span> ref<span><span>=<span><span>\"input\"<span><span> /><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><div><p>注意，你只可以<strong>在组件挂载后<strong>才能访问模板引用。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/template-refs.html", "title": "模板引用", "doc_id": "025c58054be24d51b54c66c356bf3b15", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 925, "chunk_index": 15, "_doc_id": "15_2014190967801356245"}}
{"doc_id": "16_409642800014804795", "text": "span>template<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><div><p>注意，你只可以<strong>在组件挂载后<strong>才能访问模板引用。如果你想在模板中的表达式上访问 <span class=\"options-api\"><code>$refs.input<code><span><span class=\"composition-api\"><code>input<code><span>，在初次渲染时会是 <span class=\"options-api\"><code>undefined<code><span><span class=\"composition-api\"><code>null<code><span>。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/template-refs.html", "title": "模板引用", "doc_id": "025c58054be24d51b54c66c356bf3b15", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 925, "chunk_index": 16, "_doc_id": "16_409642800014804795"}}
{"doc_id": "17_6485920035257473827", "text": "class=\"options-api\"><code>undefined<code><span><span class=\"composition-api\"><code>null<code><span>。这是因为在初次渲染前这个元素还不存在呢！<p><div class=\"composition-api\"><p>如果你需要侦听一个模板引用 ref 的变化，确保考虑到其值为 <code>null<code> 的情况：<p><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>watchEffect<span><span>(() <span><span>=><span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> if<span><span> (input.value) {<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/template-refs.html", "title": "模板引用", "doc_id": "025c58054be24d51b54c66c356bf3b15", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 925, "chunk_index": 17, "_doc_id": "17_6485920035257473827"}}
{"doc_id": "18_2251686832121083177", "text": "n>=><span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> if<span><span> (input.value) {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> input.value.<span><span>focus<span><span>()<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> } <span><span>else<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 此时还未挂载，或此元素已经被卸载(例如通过 v-if 控制)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/template-refs.html", "title": "模板引用", "doc_id": "025c58054be24d51b54c66c356bf3b15", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 925, "chunk_index": 18, "_doc_id": "18_2251686832121083177"}}
{"doc_id": "19_8877713329814903092", "text": "\"line\"><span> // 此时还未挂载，或此元素已经被卸载(例如通过 v-if 控制)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>})<span><span><code><pre><div><p>也可参考：<a href=\"/guide/typescript/composition-api.html#typing-template-refs\">为模板引用标注类型<a> <p><div><h2 id=\"ref-on-component\">组件上的 ref <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#ref-on-component\">​<a><h2><blockquote><p>这一小节假设你已了解<a href=\"/guide/essentials/component-basics.html\">组件<a>的相关知识，或者你也可以先跳过这里，之后再回来看。<p><blockquote><p>模板引用也可以被用在一个子组件上。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/template-refs.html", "title": "模板引用", "doc_id": "025c58054be24d51b54c66c356bf3b15", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 925, "chunk_index": 19, "_doc_id": "19_8877713329814903092"}}
{"doc_id": "20_7393005561386737394", "text": "/essentials/component-basics.html\">组件<a>的相关知识，或者你也可以先跳过这里，之后再回来看。<p><blockquote><p>模板引用也可以被用在一个子组件上。这种情况下引用中获得的值是组件实例：<p><div class=\"composition-api\"><div class=\"language-vue\"> <span class=\"lang\">vue<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>script<span><span> setup<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>import<span><span> { useTemplateRef, onMounted } <span><span>from<span><span> 'vue'<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/template-refs.html", "title": "模板引用", "doc_id": "025c58054be24d51b54c66c356bf3b15", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 925, "chunk_index": 20, "_doc_id": "20_7393005561386737394"}}
{"doc_id": "21_2944999607223077702", "text": "pan>import<span><span> { useTemplateRef, onMounted } <span><span>from<span><span> 'vue'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>import<span><span> Child <span><span>from<span><span> './Child.vue'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> childRef<span><span> =<span><span> useTemplateRef<span><span>(<span><span>'child'<span><span>)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>onMounted<span><span>(() <span><span>=><span><span> {<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/template-refs.html", "title": "模板引用", "doc_id": "025c58054be24d51b54c66c356bf3b15", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 925, "chunk_index": 21, "_doc_id": "21_2944999607223077702"}}
{"doc_id": "22_1228885406994679395", "text": "\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>onMounted<span><span>(() <span><span>=><span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // childRef.value 将持有 <Child /> 的实例<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>})<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>script<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>Child<span><span> ref<span><span>=<span><span>\"child\"<span><span> /><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/template-refs.html", "title": "模板引用", "doc_id": "025c58054be24d51b54c66c356bf3b15", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 925, "chunk_index": 22, "_doc_id": "22_1228885406994679395"}}
{"doc_id": "23_6305521678126847044", "text": "span> <<span><span>Child<span><span> ref<span><span>=<span><span>\"child\"<span><span> /><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div> 3.5 前的用法 <div class=\"language-vue\"> <span class=\"lang\">vue<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>script<span><span> setup<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>import<span><span> { ref, onMounted } <span><span>from<span><span> 'vue'<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/template-refs.html", "title": "模板引用", "doc_id": "025c58054be24d51b54c66c356bf3b15", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 925, "chunk_index": 23, "_doc_id": "23_6305521678126847044"}}
{"doc_id": "24_1608721402355882770", "text": "s=\"line\"><span>import<span><span> { ref, onMounted } <span><span>from<span><span> 'vue'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>import<span><span> Child <span><span>from<span><span> './Child.vue'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> child<span><span> =<span><span> ref<span><span>(<span><span>null<span><span>)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>onMounted<span><span>(() <span><span>=><span><span> {<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/template-refs.html", "title": "模板引用", "doc_id": "025c58054be24d51b54c66c356bf3b15", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 925, "chunk_index": 24, "_doc_id": "24_1608721402355882770"}}
{"doc_id": "25_8528033438982621577", "text": "\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>onMounted<span><span>(() <span><span>=><span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // child.value 是 <Child /> 组件的实例<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>})<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>script<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>Child<span><span> ref<span><span>=<span><span>\"child\"<span><span> /><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/template-refs.html", "title": "模板引用", "doc_id": "025c58054be24d51b54c66c356bf3b15", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 925, "chunk_index": 25, "_doc_id": "25_8528033438982621577"}}
{"doc_id": "26_7555544021447752757", "text": "span> <<span><span>Child<span><span> ref<span><span>=<span><span>\"child\"<span><span> /><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div> <div><div class=\"options-api\"><div class=\"language-vue\"> <span class=\"lang\">vue<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>script<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>import<span><span> Child <span><span>from<span><span> './Child.vue'<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/template-refs.html", "title": "模板引用", "doc_id": "025c58054be24d51b54c66c356bf3b15", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 925, "chunk_index": 26, "_doc_id": "26_7555544021447752757"}}
{"doc_id": "27_190338742469244308", "text": "class=\"line\"><span>import<span><span> Child <span><span>from<span><span> './Child.vue'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> components: {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> Child<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> },<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> mounted<span><span>() {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // this.$refs.child 是 <Child /> 组件的实例<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/template-refs.html", "title": "模板引用", "doc_id": "025c58054be24d51b54c66c356bf3b15", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 925, "chunk_index": 27, "_doc_id": "27_190338742469244308"}}
{"doc_id": "28_2345784413418720738", "text": "><span>() {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // this.$refs.child 是 <Child /> 组件的实例<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>script<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>Child<span><span> ref<span><span>=<span><span>\"child\"<span><span> /><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/template-refs.html", "title": "模板引用", "doc_id": "025c58054be24d51b54c66c356bf3b15", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 925, "chunk_index": 28, "_doc_id": "28_2345784413418720738"}}
{"doc_id": "29_6567584932432339805", "text": "span> <<span><span>Child<span><span> ref<span><span>=<span><span>\"child\"<span><span> /><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><div><p>如果一个子组件使用的是选项式 API <span class=\"composition-api\">或没有使用 <code><script setup><code><span>，被引用的组件实例和该子组件的 <code>this<code> 完全一致，这意味着父组件对子组件的每一个属性和方法都有完全的访问权。这使得在父组件和子组件之间创建紧密耦合的实现细节变得很容易，当然也因此，应该只在绝对需要时才使用组件引用。大多数情况下，你应该首先使用标准的 props 和 emit 接口来实现父子组件交互。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/template-refs.html", "title": "模板引用", "doc_id": "025c58054be24d51b54c66c356bf3b15", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 925, "chunk_index": 29, "_doc_id": "29_6567584932432339805"}}
{"doc_id": "30_5136024892768308137", "text": "访问权。这使得在父组件和子组件之间创建紧密耦合的实现细节变得很容易，当然也因此，应该只在绝对需要时才使用组件引用。大多数情况下，你应该首先使用标准的 props 和 emit 接口来实现父子组件交互。<p><div class=\"composition-api\"><p>有一个例外的情况，使用了 <code><script setup><code> 的组件是<strong>默认私有<strong>的：一个父组件无法访问到一个使用了 <code><script setup><code> 的子组件中的任何东西，除非子组件在其中通过 <code>defineExpose<code> 宏显式暴露：<p><div class=\"language-vue\"> <span class=\"lang\">vue<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>script<span><span> setup<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/template-refs.html", "title": "模板引用", "doc_id": "025c58054be24d51b54c66c356bf3b15", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 925, "chunk_index": 30, "_doc_id": "30_5136024892768308137"}}
{"doc_id": "31_4850490497595138759", "text": "code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>script<span><span> setup<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>import<span><span> { ref } <span><span>from<span><span> 'vue'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> a<span><span> =<span><span> 1<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> b<span><span> =<span><span> ref<span><span>(<span><span>2<span><span>)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/template-refs.html", "title": "模板引用", "doc_id": "025c58054be24d51b54c66c356bf3b15", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 925, "chunk_index": 31, "_doc_id": "31_4850490497595138759"}}
{"doc_id": "32_1497452430151904097", "text": "pan> =<span><span> ref<span><span>(<span><span>2<span><span>)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 像 defineExpose 这样的编译器宏不需要导入<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>defineExpose<span><span>({<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> a,<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> b<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>})<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/template-refs.html", "title": "模板引用", "doc_id": "025c58054be24d51b54c66c356bf3b15", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 925, "chunk_index": 32, "_doc_id": "32_1497452430151904097"}}
{"doc_id": "33_2772685774520691488", "text": "pan> a,<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> b<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>})<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>script<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>当父组件通过模板引用获取到了该组件的实例时，得到的实例类型为 <code>{ a: number, b: number }<code> (ref 都会自动解包，和一般的实例一样)。<p><p>请注意，defineExpose 必须在任何 await 操作之前调用。否则，在 await 操作后暴露的属性和方法将无法访问。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/template-refs.html", "title": "模板引用", "doc_id": "025c58054be24d51b54c66c356bf3b15", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 925, "chunk_index": 33, "_doc_id": "33_2772685774520691488"}}
{"doc_id": "34_4220225756000211027", "text": "}<code> (ref 都会自动解包，和一般的实例一样)。<p><p>请注意，defineExpose 必须在任何 await 操作之前调用。否则，在 await 操作后暴露的属性和方法将无法访问。<p><p>TypeScript 用户请参考：<a href=\"/guide/typescript/composition-api.html#typing-component-template-refs\">为组件的模板引用标注类型<a> <p><div><div class=\"options-api\"><p><code>expose<code> 选项可以用于限制对子组件实例的访问：<p><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/template-refs.html", "title": "模板引用", "doc_id": "025c58054be24d51b54c66c356bf3b15", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 925, "chunk_index": 34, "_doc_id": "34_4220225756000211027"}}
{"doc_id": "35_5602341708941451104", "text": "b-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> expose: [<span><span>'publicData'<span><span>, <span><span>'publicMethod'<span><span>],<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> data<span><span>() {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> return<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> publicData: <span><span>'foo'<span><span>,<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> privateData: <span><span>'bar'<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/template-refs.html", "title": "模板引用", "doc_id": "025c58054be24d51b54c66c356bf3b15", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 925, "chunk_index": 35, "_doc_id": "35_5602341708941451104"}}
{"doc_id": "36_6708111039339802615", "text": "'foo'<span><span>,<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> privateData: <span><span>'bar'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> },<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> methods: {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> publicMethod<span><span>() {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> /* ... */<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> },<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> privateMethod<span><span>() {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> /* ... */<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/template-refs.html", "title": "模板引用", "doc_id": "025c58054be24d51b54c66c356bf3b15", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 925, "chunk_index": 36, "_doc_id": "36_6708111039339802615"}}
{"doc_id": "37_1770938288881547423", "text": "e\"><span> privateMethod<span><span>() {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> /* ... */<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span><code><pre><div><p>在上面这个例子中，父组件通过模板引用访问到子组件实例后，仅能访问 <code>publicData<code> 和 <code>publicMethod<code>。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/template-refs.html", "title": "模板引用", "doc_id": "025c58054be24d51b54c66c356bf3b15", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 925, "chunk_index": 37, "_doc_id": "37_1770938288881547423"}}
{"doc_id": "38_7484938618139072895", "text": "ode><pre><div><p>在上面这个例子中，父组件通过模板引用访问到子组件实例后，仅能访问 <code>publicData<code> 和 <code>publicMethod<code>。<p><div><h2 id=\"refs-inside-v-for\"><code>v-for<code> 中的模板引用 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#refs-inside-v-for\">​<a><h2><blockquote><p>需要 v3.5 及以上版本<p><blockquote><div class=\"composition-api\"><p>当在 <code>v-for<code> 中使用模板引用时，对应的 ref 中包含的值是一个数组，它将在元素被挂载后包含对应整个列表的所有元素：<p><div class=\"language-vue\"> <span class=\"lang\">vue<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>script<span><span> setup<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/template-refs.html", "title": "模板引用", "doc_id": "025c58054be24d51b54c66c356bf3b15", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 925, "chunk_index": 38, "_doc_id": "38_7484938618139072895"}}
{"doc_id": "39_3903938335479349421", "text": "code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>script<span><span> setup<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>import<span><span> { ref, useTemplateRef, onMounted } <span><span>from<span><span> 'vue'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> list<span><span> =<span><span> ref<span><span>([<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> /* ... */<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>])<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/template-refs.html", "title": "模板引用", "doc_id": "025c58054be24d51b54c66c356bf3b15", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 925, "chunk_index": 39, "_doc_id": "39_3903938335479349421"}}
{"doc_id": "40_3519094215605743630", "text": "ine\"><span> /* ... */<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>])<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> itemRefs<span><span> =<span><span> useTemplateRef<span><span>(<span><span>'items'<span><span>)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>onMounted<span><span>(() <span><span>=><span><span> console.<span><span>log<span><span>(itemRefs.value))<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>script<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/template-refs.html", "title": "模板引用", "doc_id": "025c58054be24d51b54c66c356bf3b15", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 925, "chunk_index": 40, "_doc_id": "40_3519094215605743630"}}
