{"doc_id": "0_7997277426200407516", "text": "<div><div><h1 id=\"props\">Props <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#props\">​<a><h1><blockquote><p>此章节假设你已经看过了<a href=\"/guide/essentials/component-basics.html\">组件基础<a>。若你还不了解组件是什么，请先阅读该章节。<p><blockquote><h2 id=\"props-declaration\">Props 声明 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#props-declaration\">​<a><h2><p>一个组件需要显式声明它所接受的 props，这样 Vue 才能知道外部传入的哪些是 props，哪些是透传 attribute (关于透传 attribute，我们会在<a href=\"/guide/components/attrs.html\">专门的章节<a>中讨论)。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/props.html", "title": "Props | Vue.js", "doc_id": "4c70ae4e69d64e2cae75714b8158ad6a", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 2081, "chunk_index": 0, "_doc_id": "0_7997277426200407516"}}
{"doc_id": "1_4659166209906717205", "text": "入的哪些是 props，哪些是透传 attribute (关于透传 attribute，我们会在<a href=\"/guide/components/attrs.html\">专门的章节<a>中讨论)。<p><div class=\"composition-api\"><p>在使用 <code><script setup><code> 的单文件组件中，props 可以使用 <code>defineProps()<code> 宏来声明：<p><div class=\"language-vue\"> <span class=\"lang\">vue<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>script<span><span> setup<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/props.html", "title": "Props | Vue.js", "doc_id": "4c70ae4e69d64e2cae75714b8158ad6a", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 2081, "chunk_index": 1, "_doc_id": "1_4659166209906717205"}}
{"doc_id": "2_4811252791999850582", "text": "code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>script<span><span> setup<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> props<span><span> =<span><span> defineProps<span><span>([<span><span>'foo'<span><span>])<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>console.<span><span>log<span><span>(props.foo)<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/props.html", "title": "Props | Vue.js", "doc_id": "4c70ae4e69d64e2cae75714b8158ad6a", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 2081, "chunk_index": 2, "_doc_id": "2_4811252791999850582"}}
{"doc_id": "3_5069749877813421686", "text": "s=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>console.<span><span>log<span><span>(props.foo)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>script<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>在没有使用 <code><script setup><code> 的组件中，props 可以使用 <a href=\"/api/options-state.html#props\"><code>props<code><a> 选项来声明：<p><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/props.html", "title": "Props | Vue.js", "doc_id": "4c70ae4e69d64e2cae75714b8158ad6a", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 2081, "chunk_index": 3, "_doc_id": "3_5069749877813421686"}}
{"doc_id": "4_163794263408574210", "text": "b-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> props: [<span><span>'foo'<span><span>],<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> setup<span><span>(<span><span>props<span><span>) {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // setup() 接收 props 作为第一个参数<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> console.<span><span>log<span><span>(props.foo)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/props.html", "title": "Props | Vue.js", "doc_id": "4c70ae4e69d64e2cae75714b8158ad6a", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 2081, "chunk_index": 4, "_doc_id": "4_163794263408574210"}}
{"doc_id": "5_3963795509999203630", "text": "console.<span><span>log<span><span>(props.foo)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span><code><pre><div><p>注意传递给 <code>defineProps()<code> 的参数和提供给 <code>props<code> 选项的值是相同的，两种声明方式背后其实使用的都是 props 选项。<p><div><div class=\"options-api\"><p>props 需要使用 <a href=\"/api/options-state.html#props\"><code>props<code><a> 选项来定义：<p><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/props.html", "title": "Props | Vue.js", "doc_id": "4c70ae4e69d64e2cae75714b8158ad6a", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 2081, "chunk_index": 5, "_doc_id": "5_3963795509999203630"}}
{"doc_id": "6_4909558168512893725", "text": "b-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> props: [<span><span>'foo'<span><span>],<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> created<span><span>() {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // props 会暴露到 `this` 上<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> console.<span><span>log<span><span>(<span><span>this<span><span>.foo)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/props.html", "title": "Props | Vue.js", "doc_id": "4c70ae4e69d64e2cae75714b8158ad6a", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 2081, "chunk_index": 6, "_doc_id": "6_4909558168512893725"}}
{"doc_id": "7_263801264527123905", "text": "g<span><span>(<span><span>this<span><span>.foo)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span><code><pre><div><div><p>除了使用字符串数组来声明 props 外，还可以使用对象的形式：<p><div class=\"options-api\"><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> props: {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> title: String,<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/props.html", "title": "Props | Vue.js", "doc_id": "4c70ae4e69d64e2cae75714b8158ad6a", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 2081, "chunk_index": 7, "_doc_id": "7_263801264527123905"}}
{"doc_id": "8_8220426314726599309", "text": "<span class=\"line\"><span> props: {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> title: String,<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> likes: Number<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span><code><pre><div><div><div class=\"composition-api\"><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// 使用 <script setup><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>defineProps<span><span>({<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/props.html", "title": "Props | Vue.js", "doc_id": "4c70ae4e69d64e2cae75714b8158ad6a", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 2081, "chunk_index": 8, "_doc_id": "8_8220426314726599309"}}
{"doc_id": "9_2107444144207970623", "text": "pan>// 使用 <script setup><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>defineProps<span><span>({<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> title: String,<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> likes: Number<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>})<span><span><code><pre><div><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// 非 <script setup><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/props.html", "title": "Props | Vue.js", "doc_id": "4c70ae4e69d64e2cae75714b8158ad6a", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 2081, "chunk_index": 9, "_doc_id": "9_2107444144207970623"}}
{"doc_id": "10_4887208757082729855", "text": "pt setup><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> props: {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> title: String,<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> likes: Number<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span><code><pre><div><div><p>对于以对象形式声明的每个属性，key 是 prop 的名称，而值则是该 prop 预期类型的构造函数。比如，如果要求一个 prop 的值是 <code>number<code> 类型，则可使用 <code>Number<code> 构造函数作为其声明的值。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/props.html", "title": "Props | Vue.js", "doc_id": "4c70ae4e69d64e2cae75714b8158ad6a", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 2081, "chunk_index": 10, "_doc_id": "10_4887208757082729855"}}
{"doc_id": "11_1803987137704775905", "text": "称，而值则是该 prop 预期类型的构造函数。比如，如果要求一个 prop 的值是 <code>number<code> 类型，则可使用 <code>Number<code> 构造函数作为其声明的值。<p><p>对象形式的 props 声明不仅可以一定程度上作为组件的文档，而且如果其他开发者在使用你的组件时传递了错误的类型，也会在浏览器控制台中抛出警告。我们将在本章节稍后进一步讨论有关 <a href=\"#prop-validation\">prop 校验<a>的更多细节。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/props.html", "title": "Props | Vue.js", "doc_id": "4c70ae4e69d64e2cae75714b8158ad6a", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 2081, "chunk_index": 11, "_doc_id": "11_1803987137704775905"}}
{"doc_id": "12_4622268638747681917", "text": "且如果其他开发者在使用你的组件时传递了错误的类型，也会在浏览器控制台中抛出警告。我们将在本章节稍后进一步讨论有关 <a href=\"#prop-validation\">prop 校验<a>的更多细节。<p><div class=\"composition-api\"><p>如果你正在搭配 TypeScript 使用 <code><script setup><code>，也可以使用类型标注来声明 props：<p><div class=\"language-vue\"> <span class=\"lang\">vue<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>script<span><span> setup<span><span> lang<span><span>=<span><span>\"ts\"<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>defineProps<span><span><{<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/props.html", "title": "Props | Vue.js", "doc_id": "4c70ae4e69d64e2cae75714b8158ad6a", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 2081, "chunk_index": 12, "_doc_id": "12_4622268638747681917"}}
{"doc_id": "13_5661751846730669640", "text": "><span>\"ts\"<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>defineProps<span><span><{<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> title<span><span>?:<span><span> string<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> likes<span><span>?:<span><span> number<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}>()<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>script<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>更多关于基于类型的声明的细节请参考<a href=\"/guide/typescript/composition-api.html#typing-component-props\">组件 props 类型标注<a>。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/props.html", "title": "Props | Vue.js", "doc_id": "4c70ae4e69d64e2cae75714b8158ad6a", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 2081, "chunk_index": 13, "_doc_id": "13_5661751846730669640"}}
{"doc_id": "14_2349806029128496365", "text": "类型的声明的细节请参考<a href=\"/guide/typescript/composition-api.html#typing-component-props\">组件 props 类型标注<a>。 <p><div><div class=\"composition-api\"><h2 id=\"reactive-props-destructure\">响应式 Props 解构 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#reactive-props-destructure\" class=\"vt-badge\">​<a><h2><p>Vue 的响应系统基于属性访问跟踪状态的使用情况。例如，在计算属性或侦听器中访问 <code>props.foo<code> 时，<code>foo<code> 属性将被跟踪为依赖项。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/props.html", "title": "Props | Vue.js", "doc_id": "4c70ae4e69d64e2cae75714b8158ad6a", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 2081, "chunk_index": 14, "_doc_id": "14_2349806029128496365"}}
{"doc_id": "15_7046958154009306974", "text": "><h2><p>Vue 的响应系统基于属性访问跟踪状态的使用情况。例如，在计算属性或侦听器中访问 <code>props.foo<code> 时，<code>foo<code> 属性将被跟踪为依赖项。<p><p>因此，在以下代码的情况下：<p><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> { <span><span>foo<span><span> } <span><span>=<span><span> defineProps<span><span>([<span><span>'foo'<span><span>])<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>watchEffect<span><span>(() <span><span>=><span><span> {<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/props.html", "title": "Props | Vue.js", "doc_id": "4c70ae4e69d64e2cae75714b8158ad6a", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 2081, "chunk_index": 15, "_doc_id": "15_7046958154009306974"}}
{"doc_id": "16_7863464839228601081", "text": "<span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>watchEffect<span><span>(() <span><span>=><span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 在 3.5 之前只运行一次<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 在 3.5+ 中在 \"foo\" prop 变化时重新执行<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> console.<span><span>log<span><span>(foo)<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/props.html", "title": "Props | Vue.js", "doc_id": "4c70ae4e69d64e2cae75714b8158ad6a", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 2081, "chunk_index": 16, "_doc_id": "16_7863464839228601081"}}
{"doc_id": "17_6505616375189088236", "text": "变化时重新执行<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> console.<span><span>log<span><span>(foo)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>})<span><span><code><pre><div><p>在 3.4 及以下版本，<code>foo<code> 是一个实际的常量，永远不会改变。在 3.5 及以上版本，当在同一个 <code><script setup><code> 代码块中访问由 <code>defineProps<code> 解构的变量时，Vue 编译器会自动在前面添加 <code>props.<code>。因此，上面的代码等同于以下代码：<p><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> props<span><span> =<span><span> defineProps<span><span>([<span><span>'foo'<span><span>])<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/props.html", "title": "Props | Vue.js", "doc_id": "4c70ae4e69d64e2cae75714b8158ad6a", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 2081, "chunk_index": 17, "_doc_id": "17_6505616375189088236"}}
{"doc_id": "18_2836336191603754990", "text": "rops<span><span> =<span><span> defineProps<span><span>([<span><span>'foo'<span><span>])<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>watchEffect<span><span>(() <span><span>=><span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // `foo` 由编译器转换为 `props.foo`<span><span>\n<span class=\"line highlighted\"><span> console.<span><span>log<span><span>(props.foo)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>})<span><span><code><pre><div><p>此外，你可以使用 JavaScript 原生的默认值语法声明 props 默认值。这在使用基于类型的 props 声明时特别有用。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/props.html", "title": "Props | Vue.js", "doc_id": "4c70ae4e69d64e2cae75714b8158ad6a", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 2081, "chunk_index": 18, "_doc_id": "18_2836336191603754990"}}
{"doc_id": "19_1978996945073355891", "text": "n>})<span><span><code><pre><div><p>此外，你可以使用 JavaScript 原生的默认值语法声明 props 默认值。这在使用基于类型的 props 声明时特别有用。<p><div class=\"language-ts\"> <span class=\"lang\">ts<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> { <span><span>foo<span><span> =<span><span> 'hello'<span><span> } <span><span>=<span><span> defineProps<span><span><{ <span><span>foo<span><span>?:<span><span> string<span><span> }>()<span><span><code><pre><div><p>如果你希望在 IDE 中在解构的 props 和普通变量之间有更多视觉上的区分，Vue 的 VSCode 扩展提供了一个设置来启用解构 props 的内联提示。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/props.html", "title": "Props | Vue.js", "doc_id": "4c70ae4e69d64e2cae75714b8158ad6a", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 2081, "chunk_index": 19, "_doc_id": "19_1978996945073355891"}}
{"doc_id": "20_5194110621831335949", "text": "><code><pre><div><p>如果你希望在 IDE 中在解构的 props 和普通变量之间有更多视觉上的区分，Vue 的 VSCode 扩展提供了一个设置来启用解构 props 的内联提示。<p><h3 id=\"passing-destructured-props-into-functions\">将解构的 props 传递到函数中 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#passing-destructured-props-into-functions\">​<a><h3><p>当我们将解构的 prop 传递到函数中时，例如：<p><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> { <span><span>foo<span><span> } <span><span>=<span><span> defineProps<span><span>([<span><span>'foo'<span><span>])<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/props.html", "title": "Props | Vue.js", "doc_id": "4c70ae4e69d64e2cae75714b8158ad6a", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 2081, "chunk_index": 20, "_doc_id": "20_5194110621831335949"}}
{"doc_id": "21_4915098720332868545", "text": "n> } <span><span>=<span><span> defineProps<span><span>([<span><span>'foo'<span><span>])<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>watch<span><span>(foo, <span><span>/* ... */<span><span>)<span><span><code><pre><div><p>这并不会按预期工作，因为它等价于 <code>watch(props.foo, ...)<code>——我们给 <code>watch<code> 传递的是一个值而不是响应式数据源。实际上，Vue 的编译器会捕捉这种情况并发出警告。<p><p>与使用 <code>watch(() => props.foo, ...)<code> 来侦听普通 prop 类似，", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/props.html", "title": "Props | Vue.js", "doc_id": "4c70ae4e69d64e2cae75714b8158ad6a", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 2081, "chunk_index": 21, "_doc_id": "21_4915098720332868545"}}
{"doc_id": "22_2174990024158954778", "text": "值而不是响应式数据源。实际上，Vue 的编译器会捕捉这种情况并发出警告。<p><p>与使用 <code>watch(() => props.foo, ...)<code> 来侦听普通 prop 类似，我们也可以通过将其包装在 getter 中来侦听解构的 prop：<p><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>watch<span><span>(() <span><span>=><span><span> foo, <span><span>/* ... */<span><span>)<span><span><code><pre><div><p>此外，当我们需要传递解构的 prop 到外部函数中并保持响应性时，", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/props.html", "title": "Props | Vue.js", "doc_id": "4c70ae4e69d64e2cae75714b8158ad6a", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 2081, "chunk_index": 22, "_doc_id": "22_2174990024158954778"}}
{"doc_id": "23_4550515833432324059", "text": ", <span><span>/* ... */<span><span>)<span><span><code><pre><div><p>此外，当我们需要传递解构的 prop 到外部函数中并保持响应性时，这是推荐做法：<p><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>useComposable<span><span>(() <span><span>=><span><span> foo)<span><span><code><pre><div><p>外部函数可以调用 getter (或使用 <a href=\"/api/reactivity-utilities.html#tovalue\">toValue<a> 进行规范化) 来追踪提供的 prop 变更。例如，在计算属性或侦听器的 getter 中。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/props.html", "title": "Props | Vue.js", "doc_id": "4c70ae4e69d64e2cae75714b8158ad6a", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 2081, "chunk_index": 23, "_doc_id": "23_4550515833432324059"}}
{"doc_id": "24_1708679417015848443", "text": "ef=\"/api/reactivity-utilities.html#tovalue\">toValue<a> 进行规范化) 来追踪提供的 prop 变更。例如，在计算属性或侦听器的 getter 中。<p><div><h2 id=\"prop-passing-details\">传递 prop 的细节 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#prop-passing-details\">​<a><h2><h3 id=\"prop-name-casing\">Prop 名字格式 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#prop-name-casing\">​<a><h3><p>如果一个 prop 的名字很长，应使用 camelCase 形式，因为它们是合法的 JavaScript 标识符，可以直接在模板的表达式中使用，也可以避免在作为属性 key 名时必须加上引号。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/props.html", "title": "Props | Vue.js", "doc_id": "4c70ae4e69d64e2cae75714b8158ad6a", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 2081, "chunk_index": 24, "_doc_id": "24_1708679417015848443"}}
{"doc_id": "25_8318734424024361059", "text": "><p>如果一个 prop 的名字很长，应使用 camelCase 形式，因为它们是合法的 JavaScript 标识符，可以直接在模板的表达式中使用，也可以避免在作为属性 key 名时必须加上引号。<p><div class=\"composition-api\"><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>defineProps<span><span>({<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> greetingMessage: String<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/props.html", "title": "Props | Vue.js", "doc_id": "4c70ae4e69d64e2cae75714b8158ad6a", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 2081, "chunk_index": 25, "_doc_id": "25_8318734424024361059"}}
{"doc_id": "26_7585280665598674252", "text": "defineProps<span><span>({<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> greetingMessage: String<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>})<span><span><code><pre><div><div><div class=\"options-api\"><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> props: {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> greetingMessage: String<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/props.html", "title": "Props | Vue.js", "doc_id": "4c70ae4e69d64e2cae75714b8158ad6a", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 2081, "chunk_index": 26, "_doc_id": "26_7585280665598674252"}}
{"doc_id": "27_8659111333416015951", "text": "pan class=\"line\"><span> greetingMessage: String<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span><code><pre><div><div><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>span<span><span>>{{ greetingMessage }}</<span><span>span<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>虽然理论上你也可以在向子组件传递 props 时使用 camelCase 形式 (使用 <a href=\"/guide/essentials/component-basics.html#in-dom-template-parsing-caveats\">DOM 内模板<a>时例外)，", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/props.html", "title": "Props | Vue.js", "doc_id": "4c70ae4e69d64e2cae75714b8158ad6a", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 2081, "chunk_index": 27, "_doc_id": "27_8659111333416015951"}}
{"doc_id": "28_3580301065877768917", "text": "使用 <a href=\"/guide/essentials/component-basics.html#in-dom-template-parsing-caveats\">DOM 内模板<a>时例外)，但实际上为了和 HTML attribute 对齐，", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/props.html", "title": "Props | Vue.js", "doc_id": "4c70ae4e69d64e2cae75714b8158ad6a", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 2081, "chunk_index": 28, "_doc_id": "28_3580301065877768917"}}
{"doc_id": "29_2660342272239121685", "text": "als/component-basics.html#in-dom-template-parsing-caveats\">DOM 内模板<a>时例外)，但实际上为了和 HTML attribute 对齐，我们通常会将其写为 kebab-case 形式：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>MyComponent<span><span> greeting-message<span><span>=<span><span>\"hello\"<span><span> /><span><span><code><pre><div><p>对于组件名我们推荐使用 <a href=\"/guide/components/registration.html#component-name-casing\">PascalCase<a>，因为这提高了模板的可读性，", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/props.html", "title": "Props | Vue.js", "doc_id": "4c70ae4e69d64e2cae75714b8158ad6a", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 2081, "chunk_index": 29, "_doc_id": "29_2660342272239121685"}}
{"doc_id": "30_7584928141687209251", "text": "推荐使用 <a href=\"/guide/components/registration.html#component-name-casing\">PascalCase<a>，因为这提高了模板的可读性，能帮助我们区分 Vue 组件和原生 HTML 元素。然而对于传递 props 来说，使用 camelCase 并没有太多优势，因此我们推荐更贴近 HTML 的书写风格。<p><h3 id=\"static-vs-dynamic-props\">静态 vs. 动态 Props <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#static-vs-dynamic-props\">​<a><h3><p>至此，", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/props.html", "title": "Props | Vue.js", "doc_id": "4c70ae4e69d64e2cae75714b8158ad6a", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 2081, "chunk_index": 30, "_doc_id": "30_7584928141687209251"}}
{"doc_id": "31_7614672280641776723", "text": "namic-props\">静态 vs. 动态 Props <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#static-vs-dynamic-props\">​<a><h3><p>至此，你已经见过了很多像这样的静态值形式的 props：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>BlogPost<span><span> title<span><span>=<span><span>\"My journey with Vue\"<span><span> /><span><span><code><pre><div><p>相应地，", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/props.html", "title": "Props | Vue.js", "doc_id": "4c70ae4e69d64e2cae75714b8158ad6a", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 2081, "chunk_index": 31, "_doc_id": "31_7614672280641776723"}}
{"doc_id": "32_7070257695235280248", "text": "itle<span><span>=<span><span>\"My journey with Vue\"<span><span> /><span><span><code><pre><div><p>相应地，还有使用 <code>v-bind<code> 或缩写 <code>:<code> 来进行动态绑定的 props：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><!-- 根据一个变量的值动态传入 --><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>BlogPost<span><span> :<span><span>title<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>post.title<span><span>\"<span><span> /><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/props.html", "title": "Props | Vue.js", "doc_id": "4c70ae4e69d64e2cae75714b8158ad6a", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 2081, "chunk_index": 32, "_doc_id": "32_7070257695235280248"}}
{"doc_id": "33_4535813765226963238", "text": "<span>title<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>post.title<span><span>\"<span><span> /><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><!-- 根据一个更复杂表达式的值动态传入 --><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/props.html", "title": "Props | Vue.js", "doc_id": "4c70ae4e69d64e2cae75714b8158ad6a", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 2081, "chunk_index": 33, "_doc_id": "33_4535813765226963238"}}
{"doc_id": "34_1564634446268682097", "text": "pan><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><!-- 根据一个更复杂表达式的值动态传入 --><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>BlogPost<span><span> :<span><span>title<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>post.title <span><span>+<span><span> ' by '<span><span> +<span><span> post.author.name<span><span>\"<span><span> /><span><span><code><pre><div><h3 id=\"passing-different-value-types\">传递不同的值类型 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#passing-different-value-types\">​<a><h3><p>在上述的两个例子中，我们只传入了字符串值，但实际上<strong>任何<strong>类型的值都可以作为 props 的值被传递。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/props.html", "title": "Props | Vue.js", "doc_id": "4c70ae4e69d64e2cae75714b8158ad6a", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 2081, "chunk_index": 34, "_doc_id": "34_1564634446268682097"}}
{"doc_id": "35_6787612195849415998", "text": "-different-value-types\">​<a><h3><p>在上述的两个例子中，我们只传入了字符串值，但实际上<strong>任何<strong>类型的值都可以作为 props 的值被传递。<p><h4 id=\"number\">Number <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#number\">​<a><h4><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><!-- 虽然 `42` 是个常量，我们还是需要使用 v-bind --><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><!-- 因为这是一个 JavaScript 表达式而不是一个字符串 --><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/props.html", "title": "Props | Vue.js", "doc_id": "4c70ae4e69d64e2cae75714b8158ad6a", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 2081, "chunk_index": 35, "_doc_id": "35_6787612195849415998"}}
{"doc_id": "36_520065462401553536", "text": "v-bind --><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><!-- 因为这是一个 JavaScript 表达式而不是一个字符串 --><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>BlogPost<span><span> :<span><span>likes<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>42<span><span>\"<span><span> /><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><!-- 根据一个变量的值动态传入 --><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/props.html", "title": "Props | Vue.js", "doc_id": "4c70ae4e69d64e2cae75714b8158ad6a", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 2081, "chunk_index": 36, "_doc_id": "36_520065462401553536"}}
{"doc_id": "37_275972917196062007", "text": "/><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><!-- 根据一个变量的值动态传入 --><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>BlogPost<span><span> :<span><span>likes<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>post.likes<span><span>\"<span><span> /><span><span><code><pre><div><h4 id=\"boolean\">Boolean <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#boolean\">​<a><h4><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><!-- 仅写上 prop 但不传值，会隐式转换为 `true` --><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/props.html", "title": "Props | Vue.js", "doc_id": "4c70ae4e69d64e2cae75714b8158ad6a", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 2081, "chunk_index": 37, "_doc_id": "37_275972917196062007"}}
{"doc_id": "38_3931468284517535968", "text": "ithub-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><!-- 仅写上 prop 但不传值，会隐式转换为 `true` --><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>BlogPost<span><span> is-published<span><span> /><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><!-- 虽然 `false` 是静态的值，我们还是需要使用 v-bind --><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><!-- 因为这是一个 JavaScript 表达式而不是一个字符串 --><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/props.html", "title": "Props | Vue.js", "doc_id": "4c70ae4e69d64e2cae75714b8158ad6a", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 2081, "chunk_index": 38, "_doc_id": "38_3931468284517535968"}}
{"doc_id": "39_5528812262561389940", "text": "v-bind --><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><!-- 因为这是一个 JavaScript 表达式而不是一个字符串 --><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>BlogPost<span><span> :<span><span>is-published<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>false<span><span>\"<span><span> /><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><!-- 根据一个变量的值动态传入 --><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/props.html", "title": "Props | Vue.js", "doc_id": "4c70ae4e69d64e2cae75714b8158ad6a", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 2081, "chunk_index": 39, "_doc_id": "39_5528812262561389940"}}
{"doc_id": "40_6546181014830212284", "text": "/><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><!-- 根据一个变量的值动态传入 --><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>BlogPost<span><span> :<span><span>is-published<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>post.isPublished<span><span>\"<span><span> /><span><span><code><pre><div><h4 id=\"array\">Array <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#array\">​<a><h4><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><!-- 虽然这个数组是个常量，我们还是需要使用 v-bind --><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/props.html", "title": "Props | Vue.js", "doc_id": "4c70ae4e69d64e2cae75714b8158ad6a", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 2081, "chunk_index": 40, "_doc_id": "40_6546181014830212284"}}
{"doc_id": "41_8854499679550882781", "text": "github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><!-- 虽然这个数组是个常量，我们还是需要使用 v-bind --><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><!-- 因为这是一个 JavaScript 表达式而不是一个字符串 --><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>BlogPost<span><span> :<span><span>comment-ids<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>[<span><span>234<span><span>, <span><span>266<span><span>, <span><span>273<span><span>]<span><span>\"<span><span> /><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><!-- 根据一个变量的值动态传入 --><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/props.html", "title": "Props | Vue.js", "doc_id": "4c70ae4e69d64e2cae75714b8158ad6a", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 2081, "chunk_index": 41, "_doc_id": "41_8854499679550882781"}}
{"doc_id": "42_7730902136426170036", "text": "/><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><!-- 根据一个变量的值动态传入 --><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>BlogPost<span><span> :<span><span>comment-ids<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>post.commentIds<span><span>\"<span><span> /><span><span><code><pre><div><h4 id=\"object\">Object <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#object\">​<a><h4><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><!-- 虽然这个对象字面量是个常量，我们还是需要使用 v-bind --><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/props.html", "title": "Props | Vue.js", "doc_id": "4c70ae4e69d64e2cae75714b8158ad6a", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 2081, "chunk_index": 42, "_doc_id": "42_7730902136426170036"}}
{"doc_id": "43_5006927007237022382", "text": "hub-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><!-- 虽然这个对象字面量是个常量，我们还是需要使用 v-bind --><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><!-- 因为这是一个 JavaScript 表达式而不是一个字符串 --><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>BlogPost<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> :<span><span>author<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>{<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> name: <span><span>'Veronica'<span><span>,<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> company: <span><span>'Veridian Dynamics'<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/props.html", "title": "Props | Vue.js", "doc_id": "4c70ae4e69d64e2cae75714b8158ad6a", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 2081, "chunk_index": 43, "_doc_id": "43_5006927007237022382"}}
{"doc_id": "44_1975460193188171906", "text": "><span>,<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> company: <span><span>'Veridian Dynamics'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\"<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> /><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><!-- 根据一个变量的值动态传入 --><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/props.html", "title": "Props | Vue.js", "doc_id": "4c70ae4e69d64e2cae75714b8158ad6a", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 2081, "chunk_index": 44, "_doc_id": "44_1975460193188171906"}}
{"doc_id": "45_3806778936305592787", "text": "/><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><!-- 根据一个变量的值动态传入 --><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>BlogPost<span><span> :<span><span>author<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>post.author<span><span>\"<span><span> /><span><span><code><pre><div><h3 id=\"binding-multiple-properties-using-an-object\">使用一个对象绑定多个 prop <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#binding-multiple-properties-using-an-object\">​<a><h3><p>如果你想要将一个对象的所有属性都当作 props 传入，", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/props.html", "title": "Props | Vue.js", "doc_id": "4c70ae4e69d64e2cae75714b8158ad6a", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 2081, "chunk_index": 45, "_doc_id": "45_3806778936305592787"}}
{"doc_id": "46_7241390891978472784", "text": "-anchor\" href=\"#binding-multiple-properties-using-an-object\">​<a><h3><p>如果你想要将一个对象的所有属性都当作 props 传入，你可以使用<a href=\"/guide/essentials/template-syntax.html#dynamically-binding-multiple-attributes\">没有参数的 <code>v-bind<code><a>，即只使用 <code>v-bind<code> 而非 <code>:prop-name<code>。例如，这里有一个 <code>post<code> 对象：<p><div class=\"options-api\"><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/props.html", "title": "Props | Vue.js", "doc_id": "4c70ae4e69d64e2cae75714b8158ad6a", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 2081, "chunk_index": 46, "_doc_id": "46_7241390891978472784"}}
{"doc_id": "47_286776656105920245", "text": "b-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> data<span><span>() {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> return<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> post: {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> id: <span><span>1<span><span>,<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> title: <span><span>'My Journey with Vue'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/props.html", "title": "Props | Vue.js", "doc_id": "4c70ae4e69d64e2cae75714b8158ad6a", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 2081, "chunk_index": 47, "_doc_id": "47_286776656105920245"}}
{"doc_id": "48_829726603984334557", "text": "th Vue'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span><code><pre><div><div><div class=\"composition-api\"><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> post<span><span> =<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> id: <span><span>1<span><span>,<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/props.html", "title": "Props | Vue.js", "doc_id": "4c70ae4e69d64e2cae75714b8158ad6a", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 2081, "chunk_index": 48, "_doc_id": "48_829726603984334557"}}
{"doc_id": "49_7073306619629347990", "text": "n> =<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> id: <span><span>1<span><span>,<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> title: <span><span>'My Journey with Vue'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span><code><pre><div><div><p>以及下面的模板：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>BlogPost<span><span> v-bind<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>post<span><span>\"<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/props.html", "title": "Props | Vue.js", "doc_id": "4c70ae4e69d64e2cae75714b8158ad6a", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 2081, "chunk_index": 49, "_doc_id": "49_7073306619629347990"}}
{"doc_id": "50_7842186109244603457", "text": "span>BlogPost<span><span> v-bind<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>post<span><span>\"<span><span> /><span><span><code><pre><div><p>而这实际上等价于：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>BlogPost<span><span> :<span><span>id<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>post.id<span><span>\"<span><span> :<span><span>title<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>post.", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/props.html", "title": "Props | Vue.js", "doc_id": "4c70ae4e69d64e2cae75714b8158ad6a", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 2081, "chunk_index": 50, "_doc_id": "50_7842186109244603457"}}
{"doc_id": "51_240400299707707533", "text": "<span>post.id<span><span>\"<span><span> :<span><span>title<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>post.title<span><span>\"<span><span> /><span><span><code><pre><div><h2 id=\"one-way-data-flow\">单向数据流 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#one-way-data-flow\">​<a><h2><p>所有的 props 都遵循着<strong>单向绑定<strong>原则，props 因父组件的更新而变化，自然地将新的状态向下流往子组件，而不会逆向传递。这避免了子组件意外修改父组件的状态的情况，不然应用的数据流将很容易变得混乱而难以理解。<p><p>另外，每次父组件更新后，所有的子组件中的 props 都会被更新到最新值，这意味着你<strong>不应该<strong>在子组件中去更改一个 prop。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/props.html", "title": "Props | Vue.js", "doc_id": "4c70ae4e69d64e2cae75714b8158ad6a", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 2081, "chunk_index": 51, "_doc_id": "51_240400299707707533"}}
{"doc_id": "52_4774912858492914181", "text": "数据流将很容易变得混乱而难以理解。<p><p>另外，每次父组件更新后，所有的子组件中的 props 都会被更新到最新值，这意味着你<strong>不应该<strong>在子组件中去更改一个 prop。若你这么做了，Vue 会在控制台上向你抛出警告：<p><div class=\"composition-api\"><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> props<span><span> =<span><span> defineProps<span><span>([<span><span>'foo'<span><span>])<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// ❌ 警告！prop 是只读的！<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/props.html", "title": "Props | Vue.js", "doc_id": "4c70ae4e69d64e2cae75714b8158ad6a", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 2081, "chunk_index": 52, "_doc_id": "52_4774912858492914181"}}
{"doc_id": "53_3597413813655200266", "text": "an>])<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// ❌ 警告！prop 是只读的！<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>props.foo <span><span>=<span><span> 'bar'<span><span><code><pre><div><div><div class=\"options-api\"><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> props: [<span><span>'foo'<span><span>],<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/props.html", "title": "Props | Vue.js", "doc_id": "4c70ae4e69d64e2cae75714b8158ad6a", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 2081, "chunk_index": 53, "_doc_id": "53_3597413813655200266"}}
{"doc_id": "54_6216908736416252476", "text": "><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> props: [<span><span>'foo'<span><span>],<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> created<span><span>() {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // ❌ 警告！prop 是只读的！<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> this<span><span>.foo <span><span>=<span><span> 'bar'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/props.html", "title": "Props | Vue.js", "doc_id": "4c70ae4e69d64e2cae75714b8158ad6a", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 2081, "chunk_index": 54, "_doc_id": "54_6216908736416252476"}}
{"doc_id": "55_3223858941782546962", "text": "span><span>.foo <span><span>=<span><span> 'bar'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span><code><pre><div><div><p>导致你想要更改一个 prop 的需求通常来源于以下两种场景：<p><ol><li><p><strong>prop 被用于传入初始值；而子组件想在之后将其作为一个局部数据属性<strong>。在这种情况下，最好是新定义一个局部数据属性，从 props 上获取初始值即可：<p><div class=\"composition-api\"><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> props<span><span> =<span><span> defineProps<span><span>([<span><span>'initialCounter'<span><span>])<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/props.html", "title": "Props | Vue.js", "doc_id": "4c70ae4e69d64e2cae75714b8158ad6a", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 2081, "chunk_index": 55, "_doc_id": "55_3223858941782546962"}}
{"doc_id": "56_7391863755429110718", "text": "span> =<span><span> defineProps<span><span>([<span><span>'initialCounter'<span><span>])<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 计数器只是将 props.initialCounter 作为初始值<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 像下面这样做就使 prop 和后续更新无关了<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/props.html", "title": "Props | Vue.js", "doc_id": "4c70ae4e69d64e2cae75714b8158ad6a", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 2081, "chunk_index": 56, "_doc_id": "56_7391863755429110718"}}
{"doc_id": "57_4350034462246369213", "text": "ops.initialCounter 作为初始值<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 像下面这样做就使 prop 和后续更新无关了<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> counter<span><span> =<span><span> ref<span><span>(props.initialCounter)<span><span><code><pre><div><div><div class=\"options-api\"><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/props.html", "title": "Props | Vue.js", "doc_id": "4c70ae4e69d64e2cae75714b8158ad6a", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 2081, "chunk_index": 57, "_doc_id": "57_4350034462246369213"}}
{"doc_id": "58_568165139559512735", "text": "b-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> props: [<span><span>'initialCounter'<span><span>],<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> data<span><span>() {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> return<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 计数器只是将 this.initialCounter 作为初始值<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 像下面这样做就使 prop 和后续更新无关了<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/props.html", "title": "Props | Vue.js", "doc_id": "4c70ae4e69d64e2cae75714b8158ad6a", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 2081, "chunk_index": 58, "_doc_id": "58_568165139559512735"}}
{"doc_id": "59_1277601631029201050", "text": "is.initialCounter 作为初始值<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 像下面这样做就使 prop 和后续更新无关了<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> counter: <span><span>this<span><span>.initialCounter<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/props.html", "title": "Props | Vue.js", "doc_id": "4c70ae4e69d64e2cae75714b8158ad6a", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 2081, "chunk_index": 59, "_doc_id": "59_1277601631029201050"}}
{"doc_id": "60_18187330090394074", "text": "Counter<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span><code><pre><div><div><li><li><p><strong>需要对传入的 prop 值做进一步的转换<strong>。在这种情况中，最好是基于该 prop 值定义一个计算属性：<p><div class=\"composition-api\"><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> props<span><span> =<span><span> defineProps<span><span>([<span><span>'size'<span><span>])<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/props.html", "title": "Props | Vue.js", "doc_id": "4c70ae4e69d64e2cae75714b8158ad6a", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 2081, "chunk_index": 60, "_doc_id": "60_18187330090394074"}}
{"doc_id": "61_4445951951327496886", "text": "ops<span><span> =<span><span> defineProps<span><span>([<span><span>'size'<span><span>])<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 该 prop 变更时计算属性也会自动更新<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/props.html", "title": "Props | Vue.js", "doc_id": "4c70ae4e69d64e2cae75714b8158ad6a", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 2081, "chunk_index": 61, "_doc_id": "61_4445951951327496886"}}
{"doc_id": "62_1825259539356337155", "text": "<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 该 prop 变更时计算属性也会自动更新<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> normalizedSize<span><span> =<span><span> computed<span><span>(() <span><span>=><span><span> props.size.<span><span>trim<span><span>().<span><span>toLowerCase<span><span>())<span><span><code><pre><div><div><div class=\"options-api\"><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/props.html", "title": "Props | Vue.js", "doc_id": "4c70ae4e69d64e2cae75714b8158ad6a", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 2081, "chunk_index": 62, "_doc_id": "62_1825259539356337155"}}
{"doc_id": "63_1755962365448565878", "text": "b-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> props: [<span><span>'size'<span><span>],<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> computed: {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 该 prop 变更时计算属性也会自动更新<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> normalizedSize<span><span>() {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> return<span><span> this<span><span>.size.<span><span>trim<span><span>().<span><span>toLowerCase<span><span>()<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/props.html", "title": "Props | Vue.js", "doc_id": "4c70ae4e69d64e2cae75714b8158ad6a", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 2081, "chunk_index": 63, "_doc_id": "63_1755962365448565878"}}
{"doc_id": "64_5980375204559569176", "text": "s<span><span>.size.<span><span>trim<span><span>().<span><span>toLowerCase<span><span>()<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span><code><pre><div><div><li><ol><h3 id=\"mutating-object-array-props\">更改对象 / 数组类型的 props <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#mutating-object-array-props\">​<a><h3><p>当对象或数组作为 props 被传入时，虽然子组件无法更改 props 绑定，但仍然<strong>可以<strong>更改对象或数组内部的值。这是因为 JavaScript 的对象和数组是按引用传递，对 Vue 来说，阻止这种更改需要付出的代价异常昂贵。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/props.html", "title": "Props | Vue.js", "doc_id": "4c70ae4e69d64e2cae75714b8158ad6a", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 2081, "chunk_index": 64, "_doc_id": "64_5980375204559569176"}}
{"doc_id": "65_4605764562080582880", "text": "改 props 绑定，但仍然<strong>可以<strong>更改对象或数组内部的值。这是因为 JavaScript 的对象和数组是按引用传递，对 Vue 来说，阻止这种更改需要付出的代价异常昂贵。<p><p>这种更改的主要缺陷是它允许了子组件以某种不明显的方式影响父组件的状态，可能会使数据流在将来变得更难以理解。在最佳实践中，你应该尽可能避免这样的更改，除非父子组件在设计上本来就需要紧密耦合。在大多数场景下，子组件应该<a href=\"/guide/components/events.html\">抛出一个事件<a>来通知父组件做出改变。<p><h2 id=\"prop-validation\">Prop 校验 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#prop-validation\">​<a><h2><p>Vue 组件可以更细致地声明对传入的 props 的校验要求。比如我们上面已经看到过的类型声明，如果传入的值不满足类型要求，Vue 会在浏览器控制台中抛出警告来提醒使用者。这在开发给其他开发者使用的组件时非常有用。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/props.html", "title": "Props | Vue.js", "doc_id": "4c70ae4e69d64e2cae75714b8158ad6a", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 2081, "chunk_index": 65, "_doc_id": "65_4605764562080582880"}}
{"doc_id": "66_870696117254813465", "text": "以更细致地声明对传入的 props 的校验要求。比如我们上面已经看到过的类型声明，如果传入的值不满足类型要求，Vue 会在浏览器控制台中抛出警告来提醒使用者。这在开发给其他开发者使用的组件时非常有用。<p><p>要声明对 props 的校验，你可以向 <span class=\"composition-api\"><code>defineProps()<code> 宏<span><span class=\"options-api\"><code>props<code> 选项<span>提供一个带有 props 校验选项的对象，例如：<p><div class=\"composition-api\"><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>defineProps<span><span>({<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 基础类型检查<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/props.html", "title": "Props | Vue.js", "doc_id": "4c70ae4e69d64e2cae75714b8158ad6a", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 2081, "chunk_index": 66, "_doc_id": "66_870696117254813465"}}
{"doc_id": "67_1992983745966526303", "text": "=\"line\"><span>defineProps<span><span>({<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 基础类型检查<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // (给出 `null` 和 `undefined` 值则会跳过任何类型检查)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> propA: Number,<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 多种可能的类型<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> propB: [String, Number],<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 必传，且为 String 类型<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> propC: {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> type: String,<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/props.html", "title": "Props | Vue.js", "doc_id": "4c70ae4e69d64e2cae75714b8158ad6a", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 2081, "chunk_index": 67, "_doc_id": "67_1992983745966526303"}}
{"doc_id": "68_7989532248443330754", "text": "<span class=\"line\"><span> propC: {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> type: String,<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> required: <span><span>true<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> },<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 必传但可为 null 的字符串<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> propD: {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> type: [String, <span><span>null<span><span>],<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> required: <span><span>true<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> },<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/props.html", "title": "Props | Vue.js", "doc_id": "4c70ae4e69d64e2cae75714b8158ad6a", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 2081, "chunk_index": 68, "_doc_id": "68_7989532248443330754"}}
{"doc_id": "69_2539239570476485442", "text": "class=\"line\"><span> required: <span><span>true<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> },<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // Number 类型的默认值<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> propE: {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> type: Number,<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> default: <span><span>100<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> },<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 对象类型的默认值<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> propF: {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> type: Object,<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/props.html", "title": "Props | Vue.js", "doc_id": "4c70ae4e69d64e2cae75714b8158ad6a", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 2081, "chunk_index": 69, "_doc_id": "69_2539239570476485442"}}
{"doc_id": "70_4765934980854582277", "text": "<span class=\"line\"><span> propF: {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> type: Object,<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 对象或数组的默认值<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 必须从一个工厂函数返回。<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 该函数接收组件所接收到的原始 prop 作为参数。<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> default<span><span>(<span><span>rawProps<span><span>) {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> return<span><span> { message: <span><span>'hello'<span><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/props.html", "title": "Props | Vue.js", "doc_id": "4c70ae4e69d64e2cae75714b8158ad6a", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 2081, "chunk_index": 70, "_doc_id": "70_4765934980854582277"}}
{"doc_id": "71_8521054138371664234", "text": "n> { message: <span><span>'hello'<span><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> },<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 自定义类型校验函数<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 在 3.4+ 中完整的 props 作为第二个参数传入<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> propG: {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> validator<span><span>(<span><span>value<span><span>, <span><span>props<span><span>) {<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/props.html", "title": "Props | Vue.js", "doc_id": "4c70ae4e69d64e2cae75714b8158ad6a", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 2081, "chunk_index": 71, "_doc_id": "71_8521054138371664234"}}
{"doc_id": "72_9140473634410212128", "text": "> validator<span><span>(<span><span>value<span><span>, <span><span>props<span><span>) {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // The value must match one of these strings<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> return<span><span> [<span><span>'success'<span><span>, <span><span>'warning'<span><span>, <span><span>'danger'<span><span>].<span><span>includes<span><span>(value)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> },<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/props.html", "title": "Props | Vue.js", "doc_id": "4c70ae4e69d64e2cae75714b8158ad6a", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 2081, "chunk_index": 72, "_doc_id": "72_9140473634410212128"}}
{"doc_id": "73_3230279229704121596", "text": "value)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> },<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 函数类型的默认值<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> propH: {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> type: Function,<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 不像对象或数组的默认，这不是一个<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 工厂函数。这会是一个用来作为默认值的函数<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> default<span><span>() {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> return<span><span> 'Default function'<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/props.html", "title": "Props | Vue.js", "doc_id": "4c70ae4e69d64e2cae75714b8158ad6a", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 2081, "chunk_index": 73, "_doc_id": "73_3230279229704121596"}}
{"doc_id": "74_4055975118569474863", "text": "><span>() {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> return<span><span> 'Default function'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/props.html", "title": "Props | Vue.js", "doc_id": "4c70ae4e69d64e2cae75714b8158ad6a", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 2081, "chunk_index": 74, "_doc_id": "74_4055975118569474863"}}
{"doc_id": "75_7926562274288255371", "text": "nction'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>})<span><span><code><pre><div><div class=\"tip custom-block\"><p class=\"custom-block-title\">TIP<p><p><code>defineProps()<code> 宏中的参数<strong>不可以访问 <code><script setup><code> 中定义的其他变量<strong>，因为在编译时整个表达式都会被移到外部的函数中。<p><div><div><div class=\"options-api\"><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/props.html", "title": "Props | Vue.js", "doc_id": "4c70ae4e69d64e2cae75714b8158ad6a", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 2081, "chunk_index": 75, "_doc_id": "75_7926562274288255371"}}
{"doc_id": "76_1258725036785490163", "text": "b-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> props: {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 基础类型检查<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // (给出 `null` 和 `undefined` 值则会跳过任何类型检查)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> propA: Number,<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 多种可能的类型<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> propB: [String, Number],<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 必传，且为 String 类型<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/props.html", "title": "Props | Vue.js", "doc_id": "4c70ae4e69d64e2cae75714b8158ad6a", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 2081, "chunk_index": 76, "_doc_id": "76_1258725036785490163"}}
{"doc_id": "77_6555997529577072718", "text": "span> propB: [String, Number],<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 必传，且为 String 类型<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> propC: {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> type: String,<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> required: <span><span>true<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> },<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 必传但可为 null 的字符串<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> propD: {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> type: [String, <span><span>null<span><span>],<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/props.html", "title": "Props | Vue.js", "doc_id": "4c70ae4e69d64e2cae75714b8158ad6a", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 2081, "chunk_index": 77, "_doc_id": "77_6555997529577072718"}}
{"doc_id": "78_5280788927469086483", "text": ": {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> type: [String, <span><span>null<span><span>],<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> required: <span><span>true<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> },<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // Number 类型的默认值<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> propE: {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> type: Number,<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> default: <span><span>100<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> },<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/props.html", "title": "Props | Vue.js", "doc_id": "4c70ae4e69d64e2cae75714b8158ad6a", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 2081, "chunk_index": 78, "_doc_id": "78_5280788927469086483"}}
{"doc_id": "79_7453597373619727903", "text": "n class=\"line\"><span> default: <span><span>100<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> },<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 对象类型的默认值<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> propF: {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> type: Object,<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 对象或者数组应当用工厂函数返回。<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 工厂函数会收到组件所接收的原始 props<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 作为参数<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> default<span><span>(<span><span>rawProps<span><span>) {<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/props.html", "title": "Props | Vue.js", "doc_id": "4c70ae4e69d64e2cae75714b8158ad6a", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 2081, "chunk_index": 79, "_doc_id": "79_7453597373619727903"}}
{"doc_id": "80_3924137475669948960", "text": "span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> default<span><span>(<span><span>rawProps<span><span>) {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> return<span><span> { message: <span><span>'hello'<span><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> },<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 自定义类型校验函数<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 在 3.4+ 中完整的 props 作为第二个参数传入<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> propG: {<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/props.html", "title": "Props | Vue.js", "doc_id": "4c70ae4e69d64e2cae75714b8158ad6a", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 2081, "chunk_index": 80, "_doc_id": "80_3924137475669948960"}}
{"doc_id": "81_5833806378058301768", "text": "e\"><span> // 在 3.4+ 中完整的 props 作为第二个参数传入<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> propG: {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> validator<span><span>(<span><span>value<span><span>, <span><span>props<span><span>) {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // The value must match one of these strings<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> return<span><span> [<span><span>'success'<span><span>, <span><span>'warning'<span><span>, <span><span>'danger'<span><span>].<span><span>includes<span><span>(value)<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/props.html", "title": "Props | Vue.js", "doc_id": "4c70ae4e69d64e2cae75714b8158ad6a", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 2081, "chunk_index": 81, "_doc_id": "81_5833806378058301768"}}
{"doc_id": "82_8413451661071107716", "text": "<span><span>, <span><span>'danger'<span><span>].<span><span>includes<span><span>(value)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> },<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 函数类型的默认值<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> propH: {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> type: Function,<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 不像对象或数组的默认，这不是一个<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 工厂函数。这会是一个用来作为默认值的函数<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/props.html", "title": "Props | Vue.js", "doc_id": "4c70ae4e69d64e2cae75714b8158ad6a", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 2081, "chunk_index": 82, "_doc_id": "82_8413451661071107716"}}
{"doc_id": "83_9204418390972895934", "text": "span> // 不像对象或数组的默认，这不是一个<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 工厂函数。这会是一个用来作为默认值的函数<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> default<span><span>() {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> return<span><span> 'Default function'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span><code><pre><div><div><p>一些补充细节：<p><ul><li><p>所有 prop 默认都是可选的，除非声明了 <code>required: true<code>。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/props.html", "title": "Props | Vue.js", "doc_id": "4c70ae4e69d64e2cae75714b8158ad6a", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 2081, "chunk_index": 83, "_doc_id": "83_9204418390972895934"}}
{"doc_id": "84_609627579659566045", "text": "<span><code><pre><div><div><p>一些补充细节：<p><ul><li><p>所有 prop 默认都是可选的，除非声明了 <code>required: true<code>。<p><li><li><p>除 <code>Boolean<code> 外的未传递的可选 prop 将会有一个默认值 <code>undefined<code>。<p><li><li><p><code>Boolean<code> 类型的未传递 prop 将被转换为 <code>false<code>。这可以通过为它设置 <code>default<code> 来更改——例如：设置为 <code>default: undefined<code> 将与非布尔类型的 prop 的行为保持一致。<p><li><li><p>如果声明了 <code>default<code> 值，那么在 prop 的值被解析为 <code>undefined<code> 时，无论 prop 是未被传递还是显式指明的 <code>undefined<code>，都会改为 <code>default<code> 值。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/props.html", "title": "Props | Vue.js", "doc_id": "4c70ae4e69d64e2cae75714b8158ad6a", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 2081, "chunk_index": 84, "_doc_id": "84_609627579659566045"}}
{"doc_id": "85_3385435876546230539", "text": "值被解析为 <code>undefined<code> 时，无论 prop 是未被传递还是显式指明的 <code>undefined<code>，都会改为 <code>default<code> 值。<p><li><ul><p>当 prop 的校验失败后，Vue 会抛出一个控制台警告 (在开发模式下)。<p><div class=\"composition-api\"><p>如果使用了<a href=\"/api/sfc-script-setup.html#type-only-props-emit-declarations\">基于类型的 prop 声明<a> ，Vue 会尽最大努力在运行时按照 prop 的类型标注进行编译。举例来说，<code>defineProps<{ msg: string }><code> 会被编译为 <code>{ msg: { type: String, required: true }}<code>。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/props.html", "title": "Props | Vue.js", "doc_id": "4c70ae4e69d64e2cae75714b8158ad6a", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 2081, "chunk_index": 85, "_doc_id": "85_3385435876546230539"}}
{"doc_id": "86_7520024200877605268", "text": "<code>defineProps<{ msg: string }><code> 会被编译为 <code>{ msg: { type: String, required: true }}<code>。<p><div><div class=\"options-api\"><div class=\"tip custom-block\"><p class=\"custom-block-title\">注意<p><p>注意 prop 的校验是在组件实例被创建<strong>之前<strong>，所以实例的属性 (比如 <code>data<code>、<code>computed<code> 等) 将在 <code>default<code> 或 <code>validator<code> 函数中不可用。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/props.html", "title": "Props | Vue.js", "doc_id": "4c70ae4e69d64e2cae75714b8158ad6a", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 2081, "chunk_index": 86, "_doc_id": "86_7520024200877605268"}}
{"doc_id": "87_3208432022644435096", "text": "(比如 <code>data<code>、<code>computed<code> 等) 将在 <code>default<code> 或 <code>validator<code> 函数中不可用。<p><div><div><h3 id=\"runtime-type-checks\">运行时类型检查 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#runtime-type-checks\">​<a><h3><p>校验选项中的 <code>type<code> 可以是下列这些原生构造函数：<p><ul><li><code>String<code><li><li><code>Number<code><li><li><code>Boolean<code><li><li><code>Array<code><li><li><code>Object<code><li><li><code>Date<code><li><li><code>Function<code><li><li><code>Symbol<code><li><li><code>Error<code><li><ul><p>另外，<code>type<code> 也可以是自定义的类或构造函数，Vue 将会通过 <code>instanceof<code> 来检查类型是否匹配。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/props.html", "title": "Props | Vue.js", "doc_id": "4c70ae4e69d64e2cae75714b8158ad6a", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 2081, "chunk_index": 87, "_doc_id": "87_3208432022644435096"}}
{"doc_id": "88_3547477452708246195", "text": ">Error<code><li><ul><p>另外，<code>type<code> 也可以是自定义的类或构造函数，Vue 将会通过 <code>instanceof<code> 来检查类型是否匹配。例如下面这个类：<p><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>class<span><span> Person<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> constructor<span><span>(<span><span>firstName<span><span>, <span><span>lastName<span><span>) {<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/props.html", "title": "Props | Vue.js", "doc_id": "4c70ae4e69d64e2cae75714b8158ad6a", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 2081, "chunk_index": 88, "_doc_id": "88_3547477452708246195"}}
{"doc_id": "89_3013308831611300100", "text": "ctor<span><span>(<span><span>firstName<span><span>, <span><span>lastName<span><span>) {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> this<span><span>.firstName <span><span>=<span><span> firstName<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> this<span><span>.lastName <span><span>=<span><span> lastName<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/props.html", "title": "Props | Vue.js", "doc_id": "4c70ae4e69d64e2cae75714b8158ad6a", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 2081, "chunk_index": 89, "_doc_id": "89_3013308831611300100"}}
{"doc_id": "90_6959519931107541151", "text": "an>.lastName <span><span>=<span><span> lastName<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span><code><pre><div><p>你可以将其作为一个 prop 的类型：<p><div class=\"composition-api\"><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>defineProps<span><span>({<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> author: Person<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/props.html", "title": "Props | Vue.js", "doc_id": "4c70ae4e69d64e2cae75714b8158ad6a", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 2081, "chunk_index": 90, "_doc_id": "90_6959519931107541151"}}
{"doc_id": "91_1354775305855684364", "text": "e\"><span>defineProps<span><span>({<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> author: Person<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>})<span><span><code><pre><div><div><div class=\"options-api\"><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> props: {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> author: Person<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/props.html", "title": "Props | Vue.js", "doc_id": "4c70ae4e69d64e2cae75714b8158ad6a", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 2081, "chunk_index": 91, "_doc_id": "91_1354775305855684364"}}
{"doc_id": "92_6451900920029013352", "text": "<span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> author: Person<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span><code><pre><div><div><p>Vue 会通过 <code>instanceof Person<code> 来校验 <code>author<code> prop 的值是否是 <code>Person<code> 类的一个实例。<p><h3 id=\"nullable-type\">可为 null 的类型 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#nullable-type\">​<a><h3><p>如果该类型是必传但可为 null 的，你可以用一个包含 <code>null<code> 的数组语法：<p><div class=\"composition-api\"><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>defineProps<span><span>({<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/props.html", "title": "Props | Vue.js", "doc_id": "4c70ae4e69d64e2cae75714b8158ad6a", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 2081, "chunk_index": 92, "_doc_id": "92_6451900920029013352"}}
{"doc_id": "93_3947046202752426589", "text": "ss=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>defineProps<span><span>({<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> id: {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> type: [String, <span><span>null<span><span>],<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> required: <span><span>true<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/props.html", "title": "Props | Vue.js", "doc_id": "4c70ae4e69d64e2cae75714b8158ad6a", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 2081, "chunk_index": 93, "_doc_id": "93_3947046202752426589"}}
{"doc_id": "94_1793160921394360438", "text": "class=\"line\"><span> required: <span><span>true<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>})<span><span><code><pre><div><div><div class=\"options-api\"><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> props: {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> id: {<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/props.html", "title": "Props | Vue.js", "doc_id": "4c70ae4e69d64e2cae75714b8158ad6a", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 2081, "chunk_index": 94, "_doc_id": "94_1793160921394360438"}}
{"doc_id": "95_3263729180716651388", "text": "n><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> props: {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> id: {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> type: [String, <span><span>null<span><span>],<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> required: <span><span>true<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span><code><pre><div><div><p>注意如果 <code>type<code> 仅为 <code>null<code> 而非使用数组语法，它将允许任何类型。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/props.html", "title": "Props | Vue.js", "doc_id": "4c70ae4e69d64e2cae75714b8158ad6a", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 2081, "chunk_index": 95, "_doc_id": "95_3263729180716651388"}}
{"doc_id": "96_9175642146163628682", "text": "an>}<span><span><code><pre><div><div><p>注意如果 <code>type<code> 仅为 <code>null<code> 而非使用数组语法，它将允许任何类型。<p><h2 id=\"boolean-casting\">Boolean 类型转换 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#boolean-casting\">​<a><h2><p>为了更贴近原生 boolean attributes 的行为，声明为 <code>Boolean<code> 类型的 props 有特别的类型转换规则。以带有如下声明的 <code><MyComponent><code> 组件为例：<p><div class=\"composition-api\"><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>defineProps<span><span>({<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/props.html", "title": "Props | Vue.js", "doc_id": "4c70ae4e69d64e2cae75714b8158ad6a", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 2081, "chunk_index": 96, "_doc_id": "96_9175642146163628682"}}
{"doc_id": "97_5883624662489543703", "text": "ss=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>defineProps<span><span>({<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> disabled: Boolean<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>})<span><span><code><pre><div><div><div class=\"options-api\"><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> props: {<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/props.html", "title": "Props | Vue.js", "doc_id": "4c70ae4e69d64e2cae75714b8158ad6a", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 2081, "chunk_index": 97, "_doc_id": "97_5883624662489543703"}}
{"doc_id": "98_5588663588887450259", "text": "export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> props: {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> disabled: Boolean<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span><code><pre><div><div><p>该组件可以被这样使用：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><!-- 等同于传入 :disabled=\"true\" --><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/props.html", "title": "Props | Vue.js", "doc_id": "4c70ae4e69d64e2cae75714b8158ad6a", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 2081, "chunk_index": 98, "_doc_id": "98_5588663588887450259"}}
{"doc_id": "99_1271811863950605138", "text": "iki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><!-- 等同于传入 :disabled=\"true\" --><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>MyComponent<span><span> disabled<span><span> /><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><!-- 等同于传入 :disabled=\"false\" --><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/props.html", "title": "Props | Vue.js", "doc_id": "4c70ae4e69d64e2cae75714b8158ad6a", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 2081, "chunk_index": 99, "_doc_id": "99_1271811863950605138"}}
{"doc_id": "100_6841778020582537389", "text": "an>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><!-- 等同于传入 :disabled=\"false\" --><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>MyComponent<span><span> /><span><span><code><pre><div><p>当一个 prop 被声明为允许多种类型时，<code>Boolean<code> 的转换规则也将被应用。然而，当同时允许 <code>String<code> 和 <code>Boolean<code> 时，有一种边缘情况——只有当 <code>Boolean<code> 出现在 <code>String<code> 之前时，<code>Boolean<code> 转换规则才适用：<p><div class=\"composition-api\"><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// disabled 将被转换为 true<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/props.html", "title": "Props | Vue.js", "doc_id": "4c70ae4e69d64e2cae75714b8158ad6a", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 2081, "chunk_index": 100, "_doc_id": "100_6841778020582537389"}}
{"doc_id": "101_1332454273963993026", "text": "class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// disabled 将被转换为 true<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>defineProps<span><span>({<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> disabled: [Boolean, Number]<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>})<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// disabled 将被转换为 true<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>defineProps<span><span>({<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> disabled: [Boolean, String]<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/props.html", "title": "Props | Vue.js", "doc_id": "4c70ae4e69d64e2cae75714b8158ad6a", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 2081, "chunk_index": 101, "_doc_id": "101_1332454273963993026"}}
{"doc_id": "102_673532601203583819", "text": "neProps<span><span>({<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> disabled: [Boolean, String]<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>})<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// disabled 将被转换为 true<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>defineProps<span><span>({<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> disabled: [Number, Boolean]<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>})<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// disabled 将被解析为空字符串 (disabled=\"\")<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/props.html", "title": "Props | Vue.js", "doc_id": "4c70ae4e69d64e2cae75714b8158ad6a", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 2081, "chunk_index": 102, "_doc_id": "102_673532601203583819"}}
{"doc_id": "103_6712520169721565781", "text": "<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// disabled 将被解析为空字符串 (disabled=\"\")<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>defineProps<span><span>({<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> disabled: [String, Boolean]<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>})<span><span><code><pre><div><div><div class=\"options-api\"><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// disabled 将被转换为 true<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/props.html", "title": "Props | Vue.js", "doc_id": "4c70ae4e69d64e2cae75714b8158ad6a", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 2081, "chunk_index": 103, "_doc_id": "103_6712520169721565781"}}
{"doc_id": "104_5173569795872596206", "text": "class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// disabled 将被转换为 true<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> props: {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> disabled: [Boolean, Number]<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// disabled 将被转换为 true<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/props.html", "title": "Props | Vue.js", "doc_id": "4c70ae4e69d64e2cae75714b8158ad6a", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 2081, "chunk_index": 104, "_doc_id": "104_5173569795872596206"}}
{"doc_id": "105_6497465279505256804", "text": "}<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// disabled 将被转换为 true<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> props: {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> disabled: [Boolean, String]<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// disabled 将被转换为 true<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/props.html", "title": "Props | Vue.js", "doc_id": "4c70ae4e69d64e2cae75714b8158ad6a", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 2081, "chunk_index": 105, "_doc_id": "105_6497465279505256804"}}
{"doc_id": "106_4270645465759558697", "text": "}<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// disabled 将被转换为 true<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> props: {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> disabled: [Number, Boolean]<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// disabled 将被解析为空字符串 (disabled=\"\")<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/props.html", "title": "Props | Vue.js", "doc_id": "4c70ae4e69d64e2cae75714b8158ad6a", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 2081, "chunk_index": 106, "_doc_id": "106_4270645465759558697"}}
{"doc_id": "107_7771597026923751434", "text": "<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// disabled 将被解析为空字符串 (disabled=\"\")<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> props: {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> disabled: [String, Boolean]<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span><code><pre><div><div><div><div>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/props.html", "title": "Props | Vue.js", "doc_id": "4c70ae4e69d64e2cae75714b8158ad6a", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 2081, "chunk_index": 107, "_doc_id": "107_7771597026923751434"}}
{"doc_id": "0_7452557201614569240", "text": "<div><div class=\"page-hero__lead\"><p> Vue 合作伙伴是 Vue 团队认可提供一流 Vue 咨询和开发服务的机构。如果你的公司有兴趣被列为合作伙伴，请<a href=\"https://airtable.com/shrCQhat57SApJI2l\" target=\"_blank\">在此注册<a>。 <p><div><div>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/partners/", "title": "Vue Partners | Vue.js", "doc_id": "65b139a665464b47856ab3fc9a91cf7e", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 11, "chunk_index": 0, "_doc_id": "0_7452557201614569240"}}
{"doc_id": "0_7299487137074432126", "text": "<div><div><h1 id=\"creating-a-vue-application\">创建一个 Vue 应用 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#creating-a-vue-application\">​<a><h1><h2 id=\"the-application-instance\">应用实例 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#the-application-instance\">​<a><h2><p>每个 Vue 应用都是通过 <a href=\"/api/application.", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/application.html", "title": "创建一个 Vue 应用", "doc_id": "0fc322aa787540088982fb0341debda5", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 286, "chunk_index": 0, "_doc_id": "0_7299487137074432126"}}
{"doc_id": "1_5739038844151039650", "text": "\"header-anchor\" href=\"#the-application-instance\">​<a><h2><p>每个 Vue 应用都是通过 <a href=\"/api/application.html#createapp\"><code>createApp<code><a> 函数创建一个新的 <strong>应用实例<strong>：<p><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>import<span><span> { createApp } <span><span>from<span><span> 'vue'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> app<span><span> =<span><span> createApp<span><span>({<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/application.html", "title": "创建一个 Vue 应用", "doc_id": "0fc322aa787540088982fb0341debda5", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 286, "chunk_index": 1, "_doc_id": "1_5739038844151039650"}}
{"doc_id": "2_5857530151548335498", "text": "ss=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> app<span><span> =<span><span> createApp<span><span>({<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> /* 根组件选项 */<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/application.html", "title": "创建一个 Vue 应用", "doc_id": "0fc322aa787540088982fb0341debda5", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 286, "chunk_index": 2, "_doc_id": "2_5857530151548335498"}}
{"doc_id": "3_4932158576152434563", "text": "=<span><span> createApp<span><span>({<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> /* 根组件选项 */<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>})<span><span><code><pre><div><h2 id=\"the-root-component\">根组件 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#the-root-component\">​<a><h2><p>我们传入 <code>createApp<code> 的对象实际上是一个组件，每个应用都需要一个“根组件”，其他组件将作为其子组件。<p><p>如果你使用的是单文件组件，我们可以直接从另一个文件中导入根组件。<p><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>import<span><span> { createApp } <span><span>from<span><span> 'vue'<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/application.html", "title": "创建一个 Vue 应用", "doc_id": "0fc322aa787540088982fb0341debda5", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 286, "chunk_index": 3, "_doc_id": "3_4932158576152434563"}}
{"doc_id": "4_1023390738168108224", "text": "class=\"line\"><span>import<span><span> { createApp } <span><span>from<span><span> 'vue'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 从一个单文件组件中导入根组件<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>import<span><span> App <span><span>from<span><span> './App.vue'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/application.html", "title": "创建一个 Vue 应用", "doc_id": "0fc322aa787540088982fb0341debda5", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 286, "chunk_index": 4, "_doc_id": "4_1023390738168108224"}}
{"doc_id": "5_4909432774801920301", "text": "port<span><span> App <span><span>from<span><span> './App.vue'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> app<span><span> =<span><span> createApp<span><span>(App)<span><span><code><pre><div><p>虽然本指南中的许多示例只需要一个组件，但大多数真实的应用都是由一棵嵌套的、可重用的组件树组成的。例如，一个待办事项 (Todos) 应用的组件树可能是这样的：<p><div class=\"language-\"> <span class=\"lang\"><span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>App (root component)<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/application.html", "title": "创建一个 Vue 应用", "doc_id": "0fc322aa787540088982fb0341debda5", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 286, "chunk_index": 5, "_doc_id": "5_4909432774801920301"}}
{"doc_id": "6_1967914402890586474", "text": "e class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>App (root component)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>├─ TodoList<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│ └─ TodoItem<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│ ├─ TodoDeleteButton<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│ └─ TodoEditButton<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>└─ TodoFooter<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> ├─ TodoClearButton<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/application.html", "title": "创建一个 Vue 应用", "doc_id": "0fc322aa787540088982fb0341debda5", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 286, "chunk_index": 6, "_doc_id": "6_1967914402890586474"}}
{"doc_id": "7_8331430467628380535", "text": "ass=\"line\"><span>└─ TodoFooter<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> ├─ TodoClearButton<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> └─ TodoStatistics<span><span><code><pre><div><p>我们会在指南的后续章节中讨论如何定义和组合多个组件。在那之前，我们得先关注一个组件内到底发生了什么。<p><h2 id=\"mounting-the-app\">挂载应用 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#mounting-the-app\">​<a><h2><p>应用实例必须在调用了 <code>.mount()<code> 方法后才会渲染出来。该方法接收一个“容器”参数，可以是一个实际的 DOM 元素或是一个 CSS 选择器字符串：<p><p>应用根组件的内容将会被渲染在容器元素里面。容器元素自己将<strong>不会<strong>被视为应用的一部分。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/application.html", "title": "创建一个 Vue 应用", "doc_id": "0fc322aa787540088982fb0341debda5", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 286, "chunk_index": 7, "_doc_id": "7_8331430467628380535"}}
{"doc_id": "8_4149407455004337217", "text": "“容器”参数，可以是一个实际的 DOM 元素或是一个 CSS 选择器字符串：<p><p>应用根组件的内容将会被渲染在容器元素里面。容器元素自己将<strong>不会<strong>被视为应用的一部分。<p><p><code>.mount()<code> 方法应该始终在整个应用配置和资源注册完成后被调用。同时请注意，不同于其他资源注册方法，它的返回值是根组件实例而非应用实例。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/application.html", "title": "创建一个 Vue 应用", "doc_id": "0fc322aa787540088982fb0341debda5", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 286, "chunk_index": 8, "_doc_id": "8_4149407455004337217"}}
{"doc_id": "9_2003591130699699742", "text": "g>被视为应用的一部分。<p><p><code>.mount()<code> 方法应该始终在整个应用配置和资源注册完成后被调用。同时请注意，不同于其他资源注册方法，它的返回值是根组件实例而非应用实例。<p><h3 id=\"in-dom-root-component-template\">DOM 中的根组件模板 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#in-dom-root-component-template\">​<a><h3><p>根组件的模板通常是组件本身的一部分，但也可以直接通过在挂载容器内编写模板来单独提供：<p><div class=\"language-html\"> <span class=\"lang\">html<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>div<span><span> id<span><span>=<span><span>\"app\"<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/application.html", "title": "创建一个 Vue 应用", "doc_id": "0fc322aa787540088982fb0341debda5", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 286, "chunk_index": 9, "_doc_id": "9_2003591130699699742"}}
{"doc_id": "10_2482567637016109415", "text": "\"line\"><span><<span><span>div<span><span> id<span><span>=<span><span>\"app\"<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>button<span><span> @click<span><span>=<span><span>\"count++\"<span><span>>{{ count }}</<span><span>button<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/application.html", "title": "创建一个 Vue 应用", "doc_id": "0fc322aa787540088982fb0341debda5", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 286, "chunk_index": 10, "_doc_id": "10_2482567637016109415"}}
{"doc_id": "11_3990973030697476551", "text": "n><span>=<span><span>\"count++\"<span><span>>{{ count }}</<span><span>button<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>div<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>import<span><span> { createApp } <span><span>from<span><span> 'vue'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/application.html", "title": "创建一个 Vue 应用", "doc_id": "0fc322aa787540088982fb0341debda5", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 286, "chunk_index": 11, "_doc_id": "11_3990973030697476551"}}
{"doc_id": "12_2172804723044773893", "text": "<span><span> { createApp } <span><span>from<span><span> 'vue'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> app<span><span> =<span><span> createApp<span><span>({<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> data<span><span>() {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> return<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> count: <span><span>0<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>})<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/application.html", "title": "创建一个 Vue 应用", "doc_id": "0fc322aa787540088982fb0341debda5", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 286, "chunk_index": 12, "_doc_id": "12_2172804723044773893"}}
{"doc_id": "13_6248742031151782630", "text": "span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>})<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>app.<span><span>mount<span><span>(<span><span>'#app'<span><span>)<span><span><code><pre><div><p>当根组件没有设置 <code>template<code> 选项时，Vue 将自动使用容器的 <code>innerHTML<code> 作为模板。<p><p>DOM 内模板通常用于<a href=\"/guide/quick-start.html#using-vue-from-cdn\">无构建步骤<a>的 Vue 应用程序。它们也可以与服务器端框架一起使用，其中根模板可能是由服务器动态生成的。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/application.html", "title": "创建一个 Vue 应用", "doc_id": "0fc322aa787540088982fb0341debda5", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 286, "chunk_index": 13, "_doc_id": "13_6248742031151782630"}}
{"doc_id": "14_4597997680852951073", "text": "=\"/guide/quick-start.html#using-vue-from-cdn\">无构建步骤<a>的 Vue 应用程序。它们也可以与服务器端框架一起使用，其中根模板可能是由服务器动态生成的。<p><h2 id=\"app-configurations\">应用配置 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#app-configurations\">​<a><h2><p>应用实例会暴露一个 <code>.config<code> 对象允许我们配置一些应用级的选项，例如定义一个应用级的错误处理器，用来捕获所有子组件上的错误：<p><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>app.config.<span><span>errorHandler<span><span> =<span><span> (<span><span>err<span><span>) <span><span>=><span><span> {<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/application.html", "title": "创建一个 Vue 应用", "doc_id": "0fc322aa787540088982fb0341debda5", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 286, "chunk_index": 14, "_doc_id": "14_4597997680852951073"}}
{"doc_id": "15_2683918553123818622", "text": "er<span><span> =<span><span> (<span><span>err<span><span>) <span><span>=><span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> /* 处理错误 */<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/application.html", "title": "创建一个 Vue 应用", "doc_id": "0fc322aa787540088982fb0341debda5", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 286, "chunk_index": 15, "_doc_id": "15_2683918553123818622"}}
{"doc_id": "16_6383469181865390871", "text": "n><span>) <span><span>=><span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> /* 处理错误 */<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span><code><pre><div><p>应用实例还提供了一些方法来注册应用范围内可用的资源，例如注册一个组件：<p><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>app.<span><span>component<span><span>(<span><span>'TodoDeleteButton'<span><span>, TodoDeleteButton)<span><span><code><pre><div><p>这使得 <code>TodoDeleteButton<code> 在应用的任何地方都是可用的。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/application.html", "title": "创建一个 Vue 应用", "doc_id": "0fc322aa787540088982fb0341debda5", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 286, "chunk_index": 16, "_doc_id": "16_6383469181865390871"}}
{"doc_id": "17_7844183464265763032", "text": "an>, TodoDeleteButton)<span><span><code><pre><div><p>这使得 <code>TodoDeleteButton<code> 在应用的任何地方都是可用的。我们会在指南的后续章节中讨论关于组件和其他资源的注册。你也可以在 <a href=\"/api/application.html\">API 参考<a>中浏览应用实例 API 的完整列表。<p><p>确保在挂载应用实例之前完成所有应用配置！<p><h2 id=\"multiple-application-instances\">多个应用实例 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#multiple-application-instances\">​<a><h2><p>应用实例并不只限于一个。<code>createApp<code> API 允许你在同一个页面中创建多个共存的 Vue 应用，而且每个应用都拥有自己的用于配置和全局资源的作用域。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/application.html", "title": "创建一个 Vue 应用", "doc_id": "0fc322aa787540088982fb0341debda5", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 286, "chunk_index": 17, "_doc_id": "17_7844183464265763032"}}
{"doc_id": "18_4970461550075892419", "text": "​<a><h2><p>应用实例并不只限于一个。<code>createApp<code> API 允许你在同一个页面中创建多个共存的 Vue 应用，而且每个应用都拥有自己的用于配置和全局资源的作用域。<p><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> app1<span><span> =<span><span> createApp<span><span>({<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> /* ... */<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>})<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>app1.<span><span>mount<span><span>(<span><span>'#container-1'<span><span>)<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/application.html", "title": "创建一个 Vue 应用", "doc_id": "0fc322aa787540088982fb0341debda5", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 286, "chunk_index": 18, "_doc_id": "18_4970461550075892419"}}
{"doc_id": "19_3318177435214664293", "text": "\"line\"><span>app1.<span><span>mount<span><span>(<span><span>'#container-1'<span><span>)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> app2<span><span> =<span><span> createApp<span><span>({<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> /* ... */<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>})<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/application.html", "title": "创建一个 Vue 应用", "doc_id": "0fc322aa787540088982fb0341debda5", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 286, "chunk_index": 19, "_doc_id": "19_3318177435214664293"}}
{"doc_id": "20_8073274575733250175", "text": "span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> /* ... */<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>})<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>app2.<span><span>mount<span><span>(<span><span>'#container-2'<span><span>)<span><span><code><pre><div><p>如果你正在使用 Vue 来增强服务端渲染 HTML，并且只想要 Vue 去控制一个大型页面中特殊的一小部分，应避免将一个单独的 Vue 应用实例挂载到整个页面上，而是应该创建多个小的应用实例，将它们分别挂载到所需的元素上去。<p><div><div>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/application.html", "title": "创建一个 Vue 应用", "doc_id": "0fc322aa787540088982fb0341debda5", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 286, "chunk_index": 20, "_doc_id": "20_8073274575733250175"}}
{"doc_id": "0_7947830250089872336", "text": "<div><div><h1 id=\"component-events\">组件事件 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#component-events\">​<a><h1><blockquote><p>此章节假设你已经看过了<a href=\"/guide/essentials/component-basics.html\">组件基础<a>。若你还不了解组件是什么，请先阅读该章节。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/events.html", "title": "组件事件", "doc_id": "b3c047a297394084934f54262c750582", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 701, "chunk_index": 0, "_doc_id": "0_7947830250089872336"}}
{"doc_id": "1_1925715789069984435", "text": "ckquote><p>此章节假设你已经看过了<a href=\"/guide/essentials/component-basics.html\">组件基础<a>。若你还不了解组件是什么，请先阅读该章节。<p><blockquote><h2 id=\"emitting-and-listening-to-events\">触发与监听事件 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#emitting-and-listening-to-events\">​<a><h2><p>在组件的模板表达式中，可以直接使用 <code>$emit<code> 方法触发自定义事件 (例如：在 <code>v-on<code> 的处理函数中)：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><!-- MyComponent --><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/events.html", "title": "组件事件", "doc_id": "b3c047a297394084934f54262c750582", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 701, "chunk_index": 1, "_doc_id": "1_1925715789069984435"}}
{"doc_id": "2_4863483707954186379", "text": "e class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><!-- MyComponent --><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>button<span><span> @<span><span>click<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>$emit<span><span>(<span><span>'someEvent'<span><span>)<span><span>\"<span><span>>Click Me</<span><span>button<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><div class=\"options-api\"><p><code>$emit()<code> 方法在组件实例上也同样以 <code>this.", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/events.html", "title": "组件事件", "doc_id": "b3c047a297394084934f54262c750582", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 701, "chunk_index": 2, "_doc_id": "2_4863483707954186379"}}
{"doc_id": "3_5415907077960514517", "text": "<span><span><code><pre><div><div class=\"options-api\"><p><code>$emit()<code> 方法在组件实例上也同样以 <code>this.$emit()<code> 的形式可用：<p><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> methods: {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> submit<span><span>() {<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/events.html", "title": "组件事件", "doc_id": "b3c047a297394084934f54262c750582", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 701, "chunk_index": 3, "_doc_id": "3_5415907077960514517"}}
{"doc_id": "4_7622821171873088149", "text": "s=\"line\"><span> methods: {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> submit<span><span>() {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> this<span><span>.<span><span>$emit<span><span>(<span><span>'someEvent'<span><span>)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/events.html", "title": "组件事件", "doc_id": "b3c047a297394084934f54262c750582", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 701, "chunk_index": 4, "_doc_id": "4_7622821171873088149"}}
{"doc_id": "5_145154535991486513", "text": "<span>)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span><code><pre><div><div><p>父组件可以通过 <code>v-on<code> (缩写为 <code>@<code>) 来监听事件：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>MyComponent<span><span> @<span><span>some-event<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>callback<span><span>\"<span><span> /><span><span><code><pre><div><p>同样，", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/events.html", "title": "组件事件", "doc_id": "b3c047a297394084934f54262c750582", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 701, "chunk_index": 5, "_doc_id": "5_145154535991486513"}}
{"doc_id": "6_7978789133694273960", "text": "pan>=<span><span>\"<span><span>callback<span><span>\"<span><span> /><span><span><code><pre><div><p>同样，组件的事件监听器也支持 <code>.once<code> 修饰符：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>MyComponent<span><span> @<span><span>some-event<span><span>.<span><span>once<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>callback<span><span>\"<span><span> /><span><span><code><pre><div><p>像组件与 prop 一样，事件的名字也提供了自动的格式转换。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/events.html", "title": "组件事件", "doc_id": "b3c047a297394084934f54262c750582", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 701, "chunk_index": 6, "_doc_id": "6_7978789133694273960"}}
{"doc_id": "7_8253050367132744660", "text": "an>callback<span><span>\"<span><span> /><span><span><code><pre><div><p>像组件与 prop 一样，事件的名字也提供了自动的格式转换。注意这里我们触发了一个以 camelCase 形式命名的事件，但在父组件中可以使用 kebab-case 形式来监听。与 <a href=\"/guide/components/props.html#prop-name-casing\">prop 大小写格式<a>一样，在模板中我们也推荐使用 kebab-case 形式来编写监听器。<p><div class=\"tip custom-block\"><p class=\"custom-block-title\">TIP<p><p>和原生 DOM 事件不一样，组件触发的事件<strong>没有冒泡机制<strong>。你只能监听直接子组件触发的事件。平级组件或是跨越多层嵌套的组件间通信，应使用一个外部的事件总线，或是使用一个<a href=\"/guide/scaling-up/state-management.html\">全局状态管理方案<a>。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/events.html", "title": "组件事件", "doc_id": "b3c047a297394084934f54262c750582", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 701, "chunk_index": 7, "_doc_id": "7_8253050367132744660"}}
{"doc_id": "8_7373248019745001912", "text": "平级组件或是跨越多层嵌套的组件间通信，应使用一个外部的事件总线，或是使用一个<a href=\"/guide/scaling-up/state-management.html\">全局状态管理方案<a>。<p><div><h2 id=\"event-arguments\">事件参数 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#event-arguments\">​<a><h2><p>有时候我们会需要在触发事件时附带一个特定的值。举例来说，我们想要 <code><BlogPost><code> 组件来管理文本会缩放得多大。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/events.html", "title": "组件事件", "doc_id": "b3c047a297394084934f54262c750582", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 701, "chunk_index": 8, "_doc_id": "8_7373248019745001912"}}
{"doc_id": "9_12775550530783540", "text": "\"#event-arguments\">​<a><h2><p>有时候我们会需要在触发事件时附带一个特定的值。举例来说，我们想要 <code><BlogPost><code> 组件来管理文本会缩放得多大。在这个场景下，我们可以给 <code>$emit<code> 提供一个额外的参数：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>button<span><span> @<span><span>click<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>$emit<span><span>(<span><span>'increaseBy'<span><span>, <span><span>1<span><span>)<span><span>\"<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/events.html", "title": "组件事件", "doc_id": "b3c047a297394084934f54262c750582", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 701, "chunk_index": 9, "_doc_id": "9_12775550530783540"}}
{"doc_id": "10_2227048413351762146", "text": "an><span>'increaseBy'<span><span>, <span><span>1<span><span>)<span><span>\"<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> Increase by 1<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>button<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>然后我们在父组件中监听事件，我们可以先简单写一个内联的箭头函数作为监听器，", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/events.html", "title": "组件事件", "doc_id": "b3c047a297394084934f54262c750582", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 701, "chunk_index": 10, "_doc_id": "10_2227048413351762146"}}
{"doc_id": "11_5357161121192202842", "text": "/<span><span>button<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>然后我们在父组件中监听事件，我们可以先简单写一个内联的箭头函数作为监听器，此函数会接收到事件附带的参数：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>MyButton<span><span> @<span><span>increase-by<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>(<span><span>n<span><span>) <span><span>=><span><span> count <span><span>+=<span><span> n<span><span>\"<span><span> /><span><span><code><pre><div><p>或者，", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/events.html", "title": "组件事件", "doc_id": "b3c047a297394084934f54262c750582", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 701, "chunk_index": 11, "_doc_id": "11_5357161121192202842"}}
{"doc_id": "12_5537785689500618589", "text": "an> count <span><span>+=<span><span> n<span><span>\"<span><span> /><span><span><code><pre><div><p>或者，也可以用一个组件方法来作为事件处理函数：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>MyButton<span><span> @<span><span>increase-by<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>increaseCount<span><span>\"<span><span> /><span><span><code><pre><div><p>该方法也会接收到事件所传递的参数：<p><div class=\"options-api\"><div class=\"language-js\"> <span", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/events.html", "title": "组件事件", "doc_id": "b3c047a297394084934f54262c750582", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 701, "chunk_index": 12, "_doc_id": "12_5537785689500618589"}}
{"doc_id": "13_4648013114658377461", "text": "pan><code><pre><div><p>该方法也会接收到事件所传递的参数：<p><div class=\"options-api\"><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>methods<span><span>: {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> increaseCount<span><span>(n) {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> this<span><span>.count <span><span>+=<span><span> n<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/events.html", "title": "组件事件", "doc_id": "b3c047a297394084934f54262c750582", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 701, "chunk_index": 13, "_doc_id": "13_4648013114658377461"}}
{"doc_id": "14_1220008093612350568", "text": "<span><span>.count <span><span>+=<span><span> n<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span><code><pre><div><div><div class=\"composition-api\"><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>function<span><span> increaseCount<span><span>(<span><span>n<span><span>) {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> count.value <span><span>+=<span><span> n<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/events.html", "title": "组件事件", "doc_id": "b3c047a297394084934f54262c750582", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 701, "chunk_index": 14, "_doc_id": "14_1220008093612350568"}}
{"doc_id": "15_2052206382301511491", "text": "span>) {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> count.value <span><span>+=<span><span> n<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span><code><pre><div><div><div class=\"tip custom-block\"><p class=\"custom-block-title\">TIP<p><p>所有传入 <code>$emit()<code> 的额外参数都会被直接传向监听器。举例来说，<code>$emit('foo', 1, 2, 3)<code> 触发后，监听器函数将会收到这三个参数值。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/events.html", "title": "组件事件", "doc_id": "b3c047a297394084934f54262c750582", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 701, "chunk_index": 15, "_doc_id": "15_2052206382301511491"}}
{"doc_id": "16_1609338186950525833", "text": "所有传入 <code>$emit()<code> 的额外参数都会被直接传向监听器。举例来说，<code>$emit('foo', 1, 2, 3)<code> 触发后，监听器函数将会收到这三个参数值。<p><div><h2 id=\"declaring-emitted-events\">声明触发的事件 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#declaring-emitted-events\">​<a><h2><p>组件可以显式地通过 <span class=\"composition-api\"><a href=\"/api/sfc-script-setup.html#defineprops-defineemits\"><code>defineEmits()<code><a> 宏<span><span class=\"options-api\"><a href=\"/api/options-state.", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/events.html", "title": "组件事件", "doc_id": "b3c047a297394084934f54262c750582", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 701, "chunk_index": 16, "_doc_id": "16_1609338186950525833"}}
{"doc_id": "17_4545276332320757040", "text": "ineemits\"><code>defineEmits()<code><a> 宏<span><span class=\"options-api\"><a href=\"/api/options-state.html#emits\"><code>emits<code><a> 选项<span>来声明它要触发的事件：<p><div class=\"composition-api\"><div class=\"language-vue\"> <span class=\"lang\">vue<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>script<span><span> setup<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>defineEmits<span><span>([<span><span>'inFocus'<span><span>, <span><span>'submit'<span><span>])<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/events.html", "title": "组件事件", "doc_id": "b3c047a297394084934f54262c750582", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 701, "chunk_index": 17, "_doc_id": "17_4545276332320757040"}}
{"doc_id": "18_2214634513545731065", "text": "mits<span><span>([<span><span>'inFocus'<span><span>, <span><span>'submit'<span><span>])<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>script<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>我们在 <code><template><code> 中使用的 <code>$emit<code> 方法不能在组件的 <code><script setup><code> 部分中使用，但 <code>defineEmits()<code> 会返回一个相同作用的函数供我们使用：<p><div class=\"language-vue\"> <span class=\"lang\">vue<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>script<span><span> setup<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/events.html", "title": "组件事件", "doc_id": "b3c047a297394084934f54262c750582", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 701, "chunk_index": 18, "_doc_id": "18_2214634513545731065"}}
{"doc_id": "19_6001830829379809830", "text": "code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>script<span><span> setup<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> emit<span><span> =<span><span> defineEmits<span><span>([<span><span>'inFocus'<span><span>, <span><span>'submit'<span><span>])<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>function<span><span> buttonClick<span><span>() {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> emit<span><span>(<span><span>'submit'<span><span>)<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/events.html", "title": "组件事件", "doc_id": "b3c047a297394084934f54262c750582", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 701, "chunk_index": 19, "_doc_id": "19_6001830829379809830"}}
{"doc_id": "20_875866210064375680", "text": "pan><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> emit<span><span>(<span><span>'submit'<span><span>)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>script<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p><code>defineEmits()<code> 宏<strong>不能<strong>在子函数中使用。如上所示，它必须直接放置在 <code><script setup><code> 的顶级作用域下。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/events.html", "title": "组件事件", "doc_id": "b3c047a297394084934f54262c750582", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 701, "chunk_index": 20, "_doc_id": "20_875866210064375680"}}
{"doc_id": "21_734417910248621867", "text": "ode>defineEmits()<code> 宏<strong>不能<strong>在子函数中使用。如上所示，它必须直接放置在 <code><script setup><code> 的顶级作用域下。<p><p>如果你显式地使用了 <code>setup<code> 函数而不是 <code><script setup><code>，则事件需要通过 <a href=\"/api/options-state.html#emits\"><code>emits<code><a> 选项来定义，<code>emit<code> 函数也被暴露在 <code>setup()<code> 的上下文对象上：<p><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/events.html", "title": "组件事件", "doc_id": "b3c047a297394084934f54262c750582", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 701, "chunk_index": 21, "_doc_id": "21_734417910248621867"}}
{"doc_id": "22_6950238574499859797", "text": "b-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> emits: [<span><span>'inFocus'<span><span>, <span><span>'submit'<span><span>],<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> setup<span><span>(<span><span>props<span><span>, <span><span>ctx<span><span>) {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> ctx.<span><span>emit<span><span>(<span><span>'submit'<span><span>)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/events.html", "title": "组件事件", "doc_id": "b3c047a297394084934f54262c750582", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 701, "chunk_index": 22, "_doc_id": "22_6950238574499859797"}}
{"doc_id": "23_8402321463437163834", "text": "t<span><span>(<span><span>'submit'<span><span>)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span><code><pre><div><p>与 <code>setup()<code> 上下文对象中的其他属性一样，<code>emit<code> 可以安全地被解构：<p><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/events.html", "title": "组件事件", "doc_id": "b3c047a297394084934f54262c750582", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 701, "chunk_index": 23, "_doc_id": "23_8402321463437163834"}}
{"doc_id": "24_7904565311737105680", "text": "b-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> emits: [<span><span>'inFocus'<span><span>, <span><span>'submit'<span><span>],<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> setup<span><span>(<span><span>props<span><span>, { <span><span>emit<span><span> }) {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> emit<span><span>(<span><span>'submit'<span><span>)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/events.html", "title": "组件事件", "doc_id": "b3c047a297394084934f54262c750582", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 701, "chunk_index": 24, "_doc_id": "24_7904565311737105680"}}
{"doc_id": "25_3967613753333422048", "text": "t<span><span>(<span><span>'submit'<span><span>)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span><code><pre><div><div><div class=\"options-api\"><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> emits: [<span><span>'inFocus'<span><span>, <span><span>'submit'<span><span>]<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/events.html", "title": "组件事件", "doc_id": "b3c047a297394084934f54262c750582", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 701, "chunk_index": 25, "_doc_id": "25_3967613753333422048"}}
{"doc_id": "26_3547581837318075936", "text": "ne\"><span> emits: [<span><span>'inFocus'<span><span>, <span><span>'submit'<span><span>]<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span><code><pre><div><div><p>这个 <code>emits<code> 选项和 <code>defineEmits()<code> 宏还支持对象语法。通过 TypeScript 为参数指定类型，它允许我们对触发事件的参数进行验证：<p><div class=\"composition-api\"><div class=\"language-vue\"> <span class=\"lang\">vue<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>script<span><span> setup<span><span> lang<span><span>=<span><span>\"ts\"<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/events.html", "title": "组件事件", "doc_id": "b3c047a297394084934f54262c750582", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 701, "chunk_index": 26, "_doc_id": "26_3547581837318075936"}}
{"doc_id": "27_2172347180685892412", "text": "pan>script<span><span> setup<span><span> lang<span><span>=<span><span>\"ts\"<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> emit<span><span> =<span><span> defineEmits<span><span>({<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> submit<span><span>(<span><span>payload<span><span>:<span><span> { <span><span>email<span><span>:<span><span> string<span><span>, <span><span>password<span><span>:<span><span> string<span><span> }) {<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/events.html", "title": "组件事件", "doc_id": "b3c047a297394084934f54262c750582", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 701, "chunk_index": 27, "_doc_id": "27_2172347180685892412"}}
{"doc_id": "28_8388432751134898997", "text": "ring<span><span>, <span><span>password<span><span>:<span><span> string<span><span> }) {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 通过返回值为 `true` 还是为 `false` 来判断<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 验证是否通过<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>})<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/events.html", "title": "组件事件", "doc_id": "b3c047a297394084934f54262c750582", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 701, "chunk_index": 28, "_doc_id": "28_8388432751134898997"}}
{"doc_id": "29_8064531861643924510", "text": "验证是否通过<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>})<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>script<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>如果你正在搭配 TypeScript 使用 <code><script setup><code>，也可以使用纯类型标注来声明触发的事件：<p><div class=\"language-vue\"> <span class=\"lang\">vue<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>script<span><span> setup<span><span> lang<span><span>=<span><span>\"ts\"<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/events.html", "title": "组件事件", "doc_id": "b3c047a297394084934f54262c750582", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 701, "chunk_index": 29, "_doc_id": "29_8064531861643924510"}}
{"doc_id": "30_281181796724375801", "text": "pan>script<span><span> setup<span><span> lang<span><span>=<span><span>\"ts\"<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> emit<span><span> =<span><span> defineEmits<span><span><{<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> (<span><span>e<span><span>:<span><span> 'change'<span><span>, <span><span>id<span><span>:<span><span> number<span><span>)<span><span>:<span><span> void<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/events.html", "title": "组件事件", "doc_id": "b3c047a297394084934f54262c750582", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 701, "chunk_index": 30, "_doc_id": "30_281181796724375801"}}
{"doc_id": "31_487354661756935893", "text": "pan><span>id<span><span>:<span><span> number<span><span>)<span><span>:<span><span> void<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> (<span><span>e<span><span>:<span><span> 'update'<span><span>, <span><span>value<span><span>:<span><span> string<span><span>)<span><span>:<span><span> void<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}>()<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/events.html", "title": "组件事件", "doc_id": "b3c047a297394084934f54262c750582", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 701, "chunk_index": 31, "_doc_id": "31_487354661756935893"}}
{"doc_id": "32_1675047424101397011", "text": "ng<span><span>)<span><span>:<span><span> void<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}>()<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>script<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>TypeScript 用户请参考：<a href=\"/guide/typescript/composition-api.html#typing-component-emits\">如何为组件所抛出事件标注类型<a> <p><div><div class=\"options-api\"><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/events.html", "title": "组件事件", "doc_id": "b3c047a297394084934f54262c750582", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 701, "chunk_index": 32, "_doc_id": "32_1675047424101397011"}}
{"doc_id": "33_8980210595037744559", "text": "b-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> emits: {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> submit<span><span>(<span><span>payload<span><span>:<span><span> { <span><span>email<span><span>:<span><span> string<span><span>, <span><span>password<span><span>:<span><span> string<span><span> }) {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 通过返回值为 `true` 还是为 `false` 来判断<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 验证是否通过<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/events.html", "title": "组件事件", "doc_id": "b3c047a297394084934f54262c750582", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 701, "chunk_index": 33, "_doc_id": "33_8980210595037744559"}}
{"doc_id": "34_3879180586265776235", "text": "<span> // 通过返回值为 `true` 还是为 `false` 来判断<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 验证是否通过<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span><code><pre><div><p>TypeScript 用户请参考：<a href=\"/guide/typescript/options-api.html#typing-component-emits\">如何为组件所抛出的事件标注类型<a>。 <p><div><p>尽管事件声明是可选的，我们还是推荐你完整地声明所有要触发的事件，以此在代码中作为文档记录组件的用法。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/events.html", "title": "组件事件", "doc_id": "b3c047a297394084934f54262c750582", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 701, "chunk_index": 34, "_doc_id": "34_3879180586265776235"}}
{"doc_id": "35_1996700548555534793", "text": "g-component-emits\">如何为组件所抛出的事件标注类型<a>。 <p><div><p>尽管事件声明是可选的，我们还是推荐你完整地声明所有要触发的事件，以此在代码中作为文档记录组件的用法。同时，事件声明能让 Vue 更好地将事件和<a href=\"/guide/components/attrs.html#v-on-listener-inheritance\">透传 attribute<a> 作出区分，从而避免一些由第三方代码触发的自定义 DOM 事件所导致的边界情况。<p><div class=\"tip custom-block\"><p class=\"custom-block-title\">TIP<p><p>如果一个原生事件的名字 (例如 <code>click<code>) 被定义在 <code>emits<code> 选项中，则监听器只会监听组件触发的 <code>click<code> 事件而不会再响应原生的 <code>click<code> 事件。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/events.html", "title": "组件事件", "doc_id": "b3c047a297394084934f54262c750582", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 701, "chunk_index": 35, "_doc_id": "35_1996700548555534793"}}
{"doc_id": "36_1863216110543544776", "text": "<code>) 被定义在 <code>emits<code> 选项中，则监听器只会监听组件触发的 <code>click<code> 事件而不会再响应原生的 <code>click<code> 事件。<p><div><h2 id=\"events-validation\">事件校验 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#events-validation\">​<a><h2><p>和对 props 添加类型校验的方式类似，所有触发的事件也可以使用对象形式来描述。<p><p>要为事件添加校验，那么事件可以被赋值为一个函数，接受的参数就是抛出事件时传入 <span class=\"options-api\"><code>this.$emit<code><span><span class=\"composition-api\"><code>emit<code><span> 的内容，返回一个布尔值来表明事件是否合法。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/events.html", "title": "组件事件", "doc_id": "b3c047a297394084934f54262c750582", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 701, "chunk_index": 36, "_doc_id": "36_1863216110543544776"}}
{"doc_id": "37_847069264854407687", "text": "ode>this.$emit<code><span><span class=\"composition-api\"><code>emit<code><span> 的内容，返回一个布尔值来表明事件是否合法。<p><div class=\"composition-api\"><div class=\"language-vue\"> <span class=\"lang\">vue<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>script<span><span> setup<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> emit<span><span> =<span><span> defineEmits<span><span>({<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 没有校验<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/events.html", "title": "组件事件", "doc_id": "b3c047a297394084934f54262c750582", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 701, "chunk_index": 37, "_doc_id": "37_847069264854407687"}}
{"doc_id": "38_5030646408278340754", "text": "> =<span><span> defineEmits<span><span>({<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 没有校验<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> click: <span><span>null<span><span>,<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 校验 submit 事件<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> submit<span><span>: ({ <span><span>email<span><span>, <span><span>password<span><span> }) <span><span>=><span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> if<span><span> (email <span><span>&&<span><span> password) {<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/events.html", "title": "组件事件", "doc_id": "b3c047a297394084934f54262c750582", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 701, "chunk_index": 38, "_doc_id": "38_5030646408278340754"}}
{"doc_id": "39_6068873729474119671", "text": "<span class=\"line\"><span> if<span><span> (email <span><span>&&<span><span> password) {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> return<span><span> true<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> } <span><span>else<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> console.<span><span>warn<span><span>(<span><span>'Invalid submit event payload!'<span><span>)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> return<span><span> false<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/events.html", "title": "组件事件", "doc_id": "b3c047a297394084934f54262c750582", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 701, "chunk_index": 39, "_doc_id": "39_6068873729474119671"}}
{"doc_id": "40_2909335485730947610", "text": "> false<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>})<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>function<span><span> submitForm<span><span>(<span><span>email<span><span>, <span><span>password<span><span>) {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> emit<span><span>(<span><span>'submit'<span><span>, { email, password })<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/events.html", "title": "组件事件", "doc_id": "b3c047a297394084934f54262c750582", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 701, "chunk_index": 40, "_doc_id": "40_2909335485730947610"}}
{"doc_id": "41_620792350015689225", "text": "<span>'submit'<span><span>, { email, password })<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>script<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><div><div class=\"options-api\"><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> emits: {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 没有校验<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/events.html", "title": "组件事件", "doc_id": "b3c047a297394084934f54262c750582", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 701, "chunk_index": 41, "_doc_id": "41_620792350015689225"}}
{"doc_id": "42_4230916275839323949", "text": "<span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> emits: {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 没有校验<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> click: <span><span>null<span><span>,<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 校验 submit 事件<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> submit<span><span>: ({ <span><span>email<span><span>, <span><span>password<span><span> }) <span><span>=><span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> if<span><span> (email <span><span>&&<span><span> password) {<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/events.html", "title": "组件事件", "doc_id": "b3c047a297394084934f54262c750582", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 701, "chunk_index": 42, "_doc_id": "42_4230916275839323949"}}
{"doc_id": "43_6068873729474119671", "text": "<span class=\"line\"><span> if<span><span> (email <span><span>&&<span><span> password) {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> return<span><span> true<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> } <span><span>else<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> console.<span><span>warn<span><span>(<span><span>'Invalid submit event payload!'<span><span>)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> return<span><span> false<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/events.html", "title": "组件事件", "doc_id": "b3c047a297394084934f54262c750582", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 701, "chunk_index": 43, "_doc_id": "43_6068873729474119671"}}
{"doc_id": "44_7690283179693454634", "text": "> false<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> },<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> methods: {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> submitForm<span><span>(<span><span>email<span><span>, <span><span>password<span><span>) {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> this<span><span>.<span><span>$emit<span><span>(<span><span>'submit'<span><span>, { email, password })<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/events.html", "title": "组件事件", "doc_id": "b3c047a297394084934f54262c750582", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 701, "chunk_index": 44, "_doc_id": "44_7690283179693454634"}}
{"doc_id": "45_3135628071287955309", "text": "span>'submit'<span><span>, { email, password })<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span><code><pre><div><div><div><div>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/events.html", "title": "组件事件", "doc_id": "b3c047a297394084934f54262c750582", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 701, "chunk_index": 45, "_doc_id": "45_3135628071287955309"}}
{"doc_id": "0_8561768129441602770", "text": "<div><div><h2 id=\"try-it-online\">在线尝试 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#try-it-online\">​<a><h2><p>你不需要在机器上安装任何东西，也可以尝试基于单文件组件的 Vue 开发体验。我们提供了一个在线的演练场，可以在浏览器中访问：<p><p>在报告 Bug 时，我们也建议使用这些在线演练场来提供最小化重现。<p><h2 id=\"project-scaffolding\">项目脚手架 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#project-scaffolding\">​<a><h2><h3 id=\"vite\">Vite <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#vite\">​<a><h3><p><a href=\"https://cn.vitejs.dev/\" target=\"_blank\">Vite<a> 是一个轻量级的、速度极快的构建工具，对 Vue 单文件组件提供第一优先级支持。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/scaling-up/tooling.html", "title": "工具链 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "7444aea6193f4d349a86fad25417d89f", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 305, "chunk_index": 0, "_doc_id": "0_8561768129441602770"}}
{"doc_id": "1_3938966392995444797", "text": "><p><a href=\"https://cn.vitejs.dev/\" target=\"_blank\">Vite<a> 是一个轻量级的、速度极快的构建工具，对 Vue 单文件组件提供第一优先级支持。作者是尤雨溪，同时也是 Vue 的作者！<p><p>要使用 Vite 来创建一个 Vue 项目，非常简单：<p><p>这个命令会安装和执行 <a href=\"https://github.com/vuejs/create-vue\" target=\"_blank\">create-vue<a>，它是 Vue 提供的官方脚手架工具。跟随命令行的提示继续操作即可。<p><p>上面提到的两种在线演练场也支持将文件作为一个 Vite 项目下载。<p><h3 id=\"vue-cli\">Vue CLI <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#vue-cli\">​<a><h3><p><a href=\"https://cli.vuejs.org/zh/\" target=\"_blank\">Vue CLI<a> 是官方提供的基于 Webpack 的 Vue 工具链，它现在处于维护模式。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/scaling-up/tooling.html", "title": "工具链 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "7444aea6193f4d349a86fad25417d89f", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 305, "chunk_index": 1, "_doc_id": "1_3938966392995444797"}}
{"doc_id": "2_6649774511310869637", "text": "<a href=\"https://cli.vuejs.org/zh/\" target=\"_blank\">Vue CLI<a> 是官方提供的基于 Webpack 的 Vue 工具链，它现在处于维护模式。我们建议使用 Vite 开始新的项目，除非你依赖特定的 Webpack 的特性。在大多数情况下，Vite 将提供更优秀的开发体验。<p><p>关于从 Vue CLI 迁移到 Vite 的资源：<p><h3 id=\"note-on-in-browser-template-compilation\">浏览器内模板编译注意事项 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#note-on-in-browser-template-compilation\">​<a><h3><p>当以无构建步骤方式使用 Vue 时，组件模板要么是写在页面的 HTML 中，要么是内联的 JavaScript 字符串。在这些场景中，为了执行动态模板编译，Vue 需要将模板编译器运行在浏览器中。相对的，如果我们使用了构建步骤，由于提前编译了模板，那么就无须再在浏览器中运行了。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/scaling-up/tooling.html", "title": "工具链 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "7444aea6193f4d349a86fad25417d89f", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 305, "chunk_index": 2, "_doc_id": "2_6649774511310869637"}}
{"doc_id": "3_3719842794789192945", "text": "么是内联的 JavaScript 字符串。在这些场景中，为了执行动态模板编译，Vue 需要将模板编译器运行在浏览器中。相对的，如果我们使用了构建步骤，由于提前编译了模板，那么就无须再在浏览器中运行了。为了减小打包出的客户端代码体积，Vue 提供了<a href=\"https://unpkg.com/browse/vue@3/dist/\" target=\"_blank\">多种格式的“构建文件”<a>以适配不同场景下的优化需求。<p><p>默认的工具链中都会使用仅含运行时的版本，因为所有单文件组件中的模板都已经被预编译了。如果因为某些原因，在有构建步骤时，你仍需要浏览器内的模板编译，你可以更改构建工具配置，将 <code>vue<code> 改为相应的版本 <code>vue/dist/vue.esm-bundler.js<code>。<p><p>如果你需要一种更轻量级，不依赖构建步骤的替代方案，也可以看看 <a href=\"https://github.com/vuejs/petite-vue\" target=\"_blank\">petite-vue<a>。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/scaling-up/tooling.html", "title": "工具链 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "7444aea6193f4d349a86fad25417d89f", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 305, "chunk_index": 3, "_doc_id": "3_3719842794789192945"}}
{"doc_id": "4_6673512300272495963", "text": "更轻量级，不依赖构建步骤的替代方案，也可以看看 <a href=\"https://github.com/vuejs/petite-vue\" target=\"_blank\">petite-vue<a>。<p><h2 id=\"ide-support\">IDE 支持 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#ide-support\">​<a><h2><ul><li><p>推荐使用的 IDE 是 <a href=\"https://code.visualstudio.com/\" target=\"_blank\">VS Code<a>，配合 <a href=\"https://marketplace.visualstudio.com/items?itemName=Vue.volar\" target=\"_blank\">Vue - Official 扩展<a> (之前是 Volar)。该插件提供了语法高亮、TypeScript 支持，以及模板内表达式与组件 props 的智能提示。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/scaling-up/tooling.html", "title": "工具链 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "7444aea6193f4d349a86fad25417d89f", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 305, "chunk_index": 4, "_doc_id": "4_6673512300272495963"}}
{"doc_id": "5_850211256668284130", "text": "\" target=\"_blank\">Vue - Official 扩展<a> (之前是 Volar)。该插件提供了语法高亮、TypeScript 支持，以及模板内表达式与组件 props 的智能提示。<p><div class=\"tip custom-block\"><p class=\"custom-block-title\">TIP<p><p>Vue - Official 取代了我们之前为 Vue 2 提供的官方 VS Code 扩展 <a href=\"https://marketplace.visualstudio.com/items?itemName=octref.vetur\" target=\"_blank\">Vetur<a>。如果你之前已经安装了 Vetur，请确保在 Vue 3 的项目中禁用它。<p><div><li><li><p><a href=\"https://www.jetbrains.com/webstorm/\" target=\"_blank\">WebStorm<a> 同样也为 Vue 的单文件组件提供了很好的内置支持。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/scaling-up/tooling.html", "title": "工具链 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "7444aea6193f4d349a86fad25417d89f", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 305, "chunk_index": 5, "_doc_id": "5_850211256668284130"}}
{"doc_id": "6_6257349486169924598", "text": "<a href=\"https://www.jetbrains.com/webstorm/\" target=\"_blank\">WebStorm<a> 同样也为 Vue 的单文件组件提供了很好的内置支持。<p><li><li><p>其他支持<a href=\"https://microsoft.github.io/language-server-protocol/\" target=\"_blank\">语言服务协议<a> (LSP) 的 IDE 也可以通过 LSP 享受到 Volar 所提供的核心功能：<p><li><ul><p>Vue 的浏览器开发者插件使我们可以浏览一个 Vue 应用的组件树，查看各个组件的状态，追踪状态管理的事件，还可以进行组件性能分析。<p><p> <p><h2 id=\"typescript\">TypeScript <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#typescript\">​<a><h2><p>具体细节请参考章节：<a href=\"/guide/typescript/overview.html\">配合 TypeScript 使用 Vue<a>。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/scaling-up/tooling.html", "title": "工具链 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "7444aea6193f4d349a86fad25417d89f", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 305, "chunk_index": 6, "_doc_id": "6_6257349486169924598"}}
{"doc_id": "7_1035897951101773801", "text": "#typescript\">​<a><h2><p>具体细节请参考章节：<a href=\"/guide/typescript/overview.html\">配合 TypeScript 使用 Vue<a>。<p><h2 id=\"testing\">测试 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#testing\">​<a><h2><p>具体细节请参考章节：<a href=\"/guide/scaling-up/testing.html\">测试指南<a>。<p><ul><li><p><a href=\"https://www.cypress.io/\" target=\"_blank\">Cypress<a> 推荐用于 E2E 测试。也可以通过 <a href=\"https://docs.cypress.io/guides/component-testing/introduction\" target=\"_blank\">Cypress 组件测试运行器<a>来给 Vue 单文件组件作单文件组件测试。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/scaling-up/tooling.html", "title": "工具链 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "7444aea6193f4d349a86fad25417d89f", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 305, "chunk_index": 7, "_doc_id": "7_1035897951101773801"}}
{"doc_id": "8_533107716899957824", "text": "ss.io/guides/component-testing/introduction\" target=\"_blank\">Cypress 组件测试运行器<a>来给 Vue 单文件组件作单文件组件测试。<p><li><li><p><a href=\"https://vitest.dev/\" target=\"_blank\">Vitest<a> 是一个追求更快运行速度的测试运行器，由 Vue / Vite 团队成员开发。主要针对基于 Vite 的应用设计，可以为组件提供即时响应的测试反馈。<p><li><li><p><a href=\"https://jestjs.io/\" target=\"_blank\">Jest<a> 可以通过 <a href=\"https://github.com/sodatea/vite-jest\" target=\"_blank\">vite-jest<a> 配合 Vite 使用。不过只推荐在你已经有一套基于 Jest 的测试集、且想要迁移到基于 Vite 的开发配置时使用，因为 Vitest 也能够提供类似的功能，且后者与 Vite 的集成更方便高效。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/scaling-up/tooling.html", "title": "工具链 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "7444aea6193f4d349a86fad25417d89f", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 305, "chunk_index": 8, "_doc_id": "8_533107716899957824"}}
{"doc_id": "9_4647244664851778036", "text": "配合 Vite 使用。不过只推荐在你已经有一套基于 Jest 的测试集、且想要迁移到基于 Vite 的开发配置时使用，因为 Vitest 也能够提供类似的功能，且后者与 Vite 的集成更方便高效。<p><li><ul><h2 id=\"linting\">代码规范 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#linting\">​<a><h2><p>Vue 团队维护着 <a href=\"https://github.com/vuejs/eslint-plugin-vue\" target=\"_blank\">eslint-plugin-vue<a> 项目，它是一个 <a href=\"https://eslint.org/\" target=\"_blank\">ESLint<a> 插件，会提供单文件组件相关规则的定义。<p><p>之前使用 Vue CLI 的用户可能习惯于通过 webpack loader 来配置规范检查器。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/scaling-up/tooling.html", "title": "工具链 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "7444aea6193f4d349a86fad25417d89f", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 305, "chunk_index": 9, "_doc_id": "9_4647244664851778036"}}
{"doc_id": "10_8461260261176732768", "text": "target=\"_blank\">ESLint<a> 插件，会提供单文件组件相关规则的定义。<p><p>之前使用 Vue CLI 的用户可能习惯于通过 webpack loader 来配置规范检查器。然而，若基于 Vite 构建，我们一般推荐：<p><ol><li><p><code>npm install -D eslint eslint-plugin-vue<code>，然后遵照 <code>eslint-plugin-vue<code> 的<a href=\"https://eslint.vuejs.org/user-guide/#usage\" target=\"_blank\">指引<a>进行配置。<p><li><li><p>启用 ESLint IDE 插件，比如 <a href=\"https://marketplace.visualstudio.com/items?itemName=dbaeumer.vscode-eslint\" target=\"_blank\">ESLint for VS Code<a>，然后你就可以在开发时获得规范检查器的反馈。这同时也避免了启动开发服务器时不必要的规范检查。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/scaling-up/tooling.html", "title": "工具链 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "7444aea6193f4d349a86fad25417d89f", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 305, "chunk_index": 10, "_doc_id": "10_8461260261176732768"}}
{"doc_id": "11_8557585091975594236", "text": "r.vscode-eslint\" target=\"_blank\">ESLint for VS Code<a>，然后你就可以在开发时获得规范检查器的反馈。这同时也避免了启动开发服务器时不必要的规范检查。<p><li><li><p>将 ESLint 格式检查作为一个生产构建的步骤，保证你可以在最终打包时获得完整的规范检查反馈。<p><li><li><p>(可选) 启用类似 <a href=\"https://github.com/okonet/lint-staged\" target=\"_blank\">lint-staged<a> 一类的工具在 git commit 提交时自动执行规范检查。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/scaling-up/tooling.html", "title": "工具链 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "7444aea6193f4d349a86fad25417d89f", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 305, "chunk_index": 11, "_doc_id": "11_8557585091975594236"}}
{"doc_id": "12_188598488424187596", "text": "https://github.com/okonet/lint-staged\" target=\"_blank\">lint-staged<a> 一类的工具在 git commit 提交时自动执行规范检查。<p><li><ol><h2 id=\"formatting\">格式化 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#formatting\">​<a><h2><h2 id=\"sfc-custom-block-integrations\">单文件组件自定义块集成 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#sfc-custom-block-integrations\">​<a><h2><p>自定义块被编译成导入到同一 Vue 文件的不同请求查询。这取决于底层构建工具如何处理这类导入请求。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/scaling-up/tooling.html", "title": "工具链 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "7444aea6193f4d349a86fad25417d89f", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 305, "chunk_index": 12, "_doc_id": "12_188598488424187596"}}
{"doc_id": "13_1782505880171250790", "text": "\" href=\"#sfc-custom-block-integrations\">​<a><h2><p>自定义块被编译成导入到同一 Vue 文件的不同请求查询。这取决于底层构建工具如何处理这类导入请求。<p><h2 id=\"lower-level-packages\">底层库 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#lower-level-packages\">​<a><h2><h3 id=\"vue-compiler-sfc\"><code>@vue/compiler-sfc<code> <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#vue-compiler-sfc\">​<a><h3><p>这个包是 Vue 核心 monorepo 的一部分，并始终和 <code>vue<code> 主包版本号保持一致。它已经成为 <code>vue<code> 主包的一个依赖并代理到了 <code>vue/compiler-sfc<code> 目录下，因此你无需单独安装它。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/scaling-up/tooling.html", "title": "工具链 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "7444aea6193f4d349a86fad25417d89f", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 305, "chunk_index": 13, "_doc_id": "13_1782505880171250790"}}
{"doc_id": "14_8016246418075659930", "text": ">vue<code> 主包版本号保持一致。它已经成为 <code>vue<code> 主包的一个依赖并代理到了 <code>vue/compiler-sfc<code> 目录下，因此你无需单独安装它。<p><p>这个包本身提供了处理 Vue 单文件组件的底层的功能，并只适用于需要支持 Vue 单文件组件相关工具链的开发者。<p><div class=\"tip custom-block\"><p class=\"custom-block-title\">TIP<p><p>请始终选择通过 <code>vue/compiler-sfc<code> 的深度导入来使用这个包，因为这样可以确保其与 Vue 运行时版本同步。<p><div><h3 id=\"vitejs-plugin-vue\"><code>@vitejs/plugin-vue<code> <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#vitejs-plugin-vue\">​<a><h3><p>为 Vite 提供 Vue 单文件组件支持的官方插件。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/scaling-up/tooling.html", "title": "工具链 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "7444aea6193f4d349a86fad25417d89f", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 305, "chunk_index": 14, "_doc_id": "14_8016246418075659930"}}
{"doc_id": "15_3821344556873396901", "text": "-vue<code> <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#vitejs-plugin-vue\">​<a><h3><p>为 Vite 提供 Vue 单文件组件支持的官方插件。<p><h3 id=\"vue-loader\"><code>vue-loader<code> <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#vue-loader\">​<a><h3><p>为 webpack 提供 Vue 单文件组件支持的官方 loader。如果你正在使用 Vue CLI，也可以看看<a href=\"https://cli.vuejs.org/zh/guide/webpack.html#%E4%BF%AE%E6%94%B9-loader-%E9%80%89%E9%A1%B9\" target=\"_blank\">如何在 Vue CLI 中更改 <code>vue-loader<code> 选项的文档<a>。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/scaling-up/tooling.html", "title": "工具链 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "7444aea6193f4d349a86fad25417d89f", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 305, "chunk_index": 15, "_doc_id": "15_3821344556873396901"}}
{"doc_id": "16_1543186519161528913", "text": "E6%94%B9-loader-%E9%80%89%E9%A1%B9\" target=\"_blank\">如何在 Vue CLI 中更改 <code>vue-loader<code> 选项的文档<a>。<p><h2 id=\"other-online-playgrounds\">其他在线演练场 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#other-online-playgrounds\">​<a><h2><div><div>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/scaling-up/tooling.html", "title": "工具链 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "7444aea6193f4d349a86fad25417d89f", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 305, "chunk_index": 16, "_doc_id": "16_1543186519161528913"}}
{"doc_id": "0_4824541397428717254", "text": "<div><div class=\"VPContentPage\"><main><div><div><div class=\"ThemePage\"><div class=\"ThemeHero\"><div class=\"container\"><h1 class=\"title\">主题<h1><p class=\"lead\">查看主题、UI Kits 和插件。你可以看到我们的合作伙伴是如何用 Vue 构建一个真实世界的应用。<p><div><div><div class=\"ThemeList\"><div class=\"container\"><div class=\"item\"><section class=\"ThemeListItem\"><h2 class=\"title\">Nuxt UI<h2><p class=\"description\"><a href=\"https://ui.nuxt.com/\" class=\"link\" target=\"_blank\">Nuxt UI<a> is an intuitive, open-source UI library for Vue and Nuxt applications.", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/ecosystem/themes.html", "title": "Vue.js", "doc_id": "657e8b61532349a5a30378ca8ca862e1", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 270, "chunk_index": 0, "_doc_id": "0_4824541397428717254"}}
{"doc_id": "1_7011859860691419569", "text": "\" target=\"_blank\">Nuxt UI<a> is an intuitive, open-source UI library for Vue and Nuxt applications. Built with Tailwind CSS and Reka UI, it provides 100+ beautifully crafted, accessible components with a flexible CSS-first design system.<p><section><div><div class=\"item\"><section class=\"ThemeListItem\"><h2 class=\"title\">Creative Tim<h2><p class=\"description\">通过下面由我们的合作伙伴 <a href=\"https://creative-tim.com?affiliate_id=116187\" class=\"link\" target=\"_blank\">Creative Tim<a> 建立的例子，你可以看到一个真实世界的应用是如何建立的，它背后的技术栈，", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/ecosystem/themes.html", "title": "Vue.js", "doc_id": "657e8b61532349a5a30378ca8ca862e1", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 270, "chunk_index": 1, "_doc_id": "1_7011859860691419569"}}
{"doc_id": "2_6653716609067713284", "text": "ffiliate_id=116187\" class=\"link\" target=\"_blank\">Creative Tim<a> 建立的例子，你可以看到一个真实世界的应用是如何建立的，它背后的技术栈，以及你迄今为止学到的大多数概念是如何应用于真实世界的应用。<p><section><div><div class=\"item\"><section class=\"ThemeListItem\"><h2 class=\"title\">MDBootstrap<h2><p class=\"description\">查看下面由我们的合作伙伴 <a href=\"https://mdbootstrap.com/?utm_ref_id=82665\" class=\"link\" target=\"_blank\">MDBootstrap<a> 构建的主题、UI 工具包和插件，了解如何在专业项目中使用 Vue 以及 Bootstrap 等技术。模板和现成的组件可以使你的开发更快、更高效。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/ecosystem/themes.html", "title": "Vue.js", "doc_id": "657e8b61532349a5a30378ca8ca862e1", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 270, "chunk_index": 2, "_doc_id": "2_6653716609067713284"}}
{"doc_id": "3_5346129600799560902", "text": "get=\"_blank\">MDBootstrap<a> 构建的主题、UI 工具包和插件，了解如何在专业项目中使用 Vue 以及 Bootstrap 等技术。模板和现成的组件可以使你的开发更快、更高效。<p><section><div><div class=\"item\"><section class=\"ThemeListItem\"><h2 class=\"title\">PrimeVue<h2><p class=\"description\">开源 UI 组件库 <a href=\"https://www.primefaces.org/primevue/?af_id=4218\" class=\"link\" target=\"_blank\">PrimeVue<a> 提供了超过 90 个灵活的组件来构建你的应用！他们有大量不同的组件主题和应用模板，以获得最适合你的外观和感受。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/ecosystem/themes.html", "title": "Vue.js", "doc_id": "657e8b61532349a5a30378ca8ca862e1", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 270, "chunk_index": 3, "_doc_id": "3_5346129600799560902"}}
