{"doc_id": "78_828455552840931558", "text": "<span></<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p><a href=\"https://play.vuejs.org/#\"", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/v-model.html", "title": "组件 v-model", "doc_id": "8b81e76bd9b94402baf6355edd4f37ab", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1636, "chunk_index": 78, "_doc_id": "78_828455552840931558"}}
{"doc_id": "79_5562949708624391187", "text": "3RF7PTn1l8lTIdhbXp1/CmhOeJRNHLupv4eIaXyItPdJEFD7R8NM0Ce/d/ZCTtESnzlVZXhP/vHbeZaT0tPdf59uONfx7mDVM=\" target=\"_blank\">在演练场中尝试一下<a><p><div><h2 id=\"handling-v-model-modifiers\">处理 <code>v-model<code> 修饰符 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#handling-v-model-modifiers\">​<a><h2><p>在学习输入绑定时，我们知道了 <code>v-model<code> 有一些<a href=\"/guide/essentials/forms.html#modifiers\">内置的修饰符<a>，例如 <code>.trim<code>，<code>.number<code> 和 <code>.lazy<code>。在某些场景下，你可能想要一个自定义组件的 <code>v-model<code> 支持自定义的修饰符。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/v-model.html", "title": "组件 v-model", "doc_id": "8b81e76bd9b94402baf6355edd4f37ab", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1636, "chunk_index": 79, "_doc_id": "79_5562949708624391187"}}
{"doc_id": "80_2409894749513238429", "text": "im<code>，<code>.number<code> 和 <code>.lazy<code>。在某些场景下，你可能想要一个自定义组件的 <code>v-model<code> 支持自定义的修饰符。<p><p>我们来创建一个自定义的修饰符 <code>capitalize<code>，", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/v-model.html", "title": "组件 v-model", "doc_id": "8b81e76bd9b94402baf6355edd4f37ab", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1636, "chunk_index": 80, "_doc_id": "80_2409894749513238429"}}
{"doc_id": "81_7178402222096362479", "text": "ode>。在某些场景下，你可能想要一个自定义组件的 <code>v-model<code> 支持自定义的修饰符。<p><p>我们来创建一个自定义的修饰符 <code>capitalize<code>，它会自动将 <code>v-model<code> 绑定输入的字符串值第一个字母转为大写：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>MyComponent<span><span> v-model<span><span>.<span><span>capitalize<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>myText<span><span>\"<span><span> /><span><span><code><pre><div><div class=\"composition-api\"><p>通过像这样解构 <code>defineModel()<code> 的返回值，", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/v-model.html", "title": "组件 v-model", "doc_id": "8b81e76bd9b94402baf6355edd4f37ab", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1636, "chunk_index": 81, "_doc_id": "81_7178402222096362479"}}
{"doc_id": "82_3122183627696881146", "text": "><span><span><code><pre><div><div class=\"composition-api\"><p>通过像这样解构 <code>defineModel()<code> 的返回值，可以在子组件中访问添加到组件 <code>v-model<code> 的修饰符：<p><div class=\"language-vue\"> <span class=\"lang\">vue<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>script<span><span> setup<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> [<span><span>model<span><span>, <span><span>modifiers<span><span>] <span><span>=<span><span> defineModel<span><span>()<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/v-model.html", "title": "组件 v-model", "doc_id": "8b81e76bd9b94402baf6355edd4f37ab", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1636, "chunk_index": 82, "_doc_id": "82_3122183627696881146"}}
{"doc_id": "83_7579629064925435024", "text": "<span><span>modifiers<span><span>] <span><span>=<span><span> defineModel<span><span>()<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line highlighted\"><span>console.<span><span>log<span><span>(modifiers) <span><span>// { capitalize: true }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>script<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/v-model.html", "title": "组件 v-model", "doc_id": "8b81e76bd9b94402baf6355edd4f37ab", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1636, "chunk_index": 83, "_doc_id": "83_7579629064925435024"}}
{"doc_id": "84_3266777626012225737", "text": ">\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>input<span><span> type<span><span>=<span><span>\"text\"<span><span> v-model<span><span>=<span><span>\"model\"<span><span> /><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/v-model.html", "title": "组件 v-model", "doc_id": "8b81e76bd9b94402baf6355edd4f37ab", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1636, "chunk_index": 84, "_doc_id": "84_3266777626012225737"}}
{"doc_id": "85_4458685431742446585", "text": ">=<span><span>\"text\"<span><span> v-model<span><span>=<span><span>\"model\"<span><span> /><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>为了能够基于修饰符选择性地调节值的读取和写入方式，我们可以给 <code>defineModel()<code> 传入 <code>get<code> 和 <code>set<code> 这两个选项。这两个选项在从模型引用中读取或设置值时会接收到当前的值，并且它们都应该返回一个经过处理的新值。下面是一个例子，展示了如何利用 <code>set<code> 选项来应用 <code>capitalize<code> (首字母大写) 修饰符：<p><div class=\"language-vue\"> <span class=\"lang\">vue<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>script<span><span> setup<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/v-model.html", "title": "组件 v-model", "doc_id": "8b81e76bd9b94402baf6355edd4f37ab", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1636, "chunk_index": 85, "_doc_id": "85_4458685431742446585"}}
{"doc_id": "86_317281494027195639", "text": "code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>script<span><span> setup<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> [<span><span>model<span><span>, <span><span>modifiers<span><span>] <span><span>=<span><span> defineModel<span><span>({<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> set<span><span>(<span><span>value<span><span>) {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line highlighted\"><span> if<span><span> (modifiers.capitalize) {<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/v-model.html", "title": "组件 v-model", "doc_id": "8b81e76bd9b94402baf6355edd4f37ab", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1636, "chunk_index": 86, "_doc_id": "86_317281494027195639"}}
{"doc_id": "87_4057698797108311111", "text": "an><span>\n<span class=\"line highlighted\"><span> if<span><span> (modifiers.capitalize) {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line highlighted\"><span> return<span><span> value.<span><span>charAt<span><span>(<span><span>0<span><span>).<span><span>toUpperCase<span><span>() <span><span>+<span><span> value.<span><span>slice<span><span>(<span><span>1<span><span>)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line highlighted\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> return<span><span> value<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/v-model.html", "title": "组件 v-model", "doc_id": "8b81e76bd9b94402baf6355edd4f37ab", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1636, "chunk_index": 87, "_doc_id": "87_4057698797108311111"}}
