{"doc_id": "99_7579425811978689527", "text": "<div class=\"options-api\"><p>添加到组件 <code>v-model<code> 的修饰符将通过 <code>modelModifiers<code> prop 提供给组件。在下面的示例中，我们创建了一个包含 <code>modelModifiers<code> prop 的组件，该 prop 默认为空对象：<p><div class=\"language-vue\"> <span class=\"lang\">vue<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>script<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> props: {<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/v-model.html", "title": "组件 v-model", "doc_id": "8b81e76bd9b94402baf6355edd4f37ab", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1636, "chunk_index": 99, "_doc_id": "99_7579425811978689527"}}
{"doc_id": "100_3573658683602627010", "text": "export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> props: {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> modelValue: String,<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> modelModifiers: {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> default<span><span>: () <span><span>=><span><span> ({})<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> },<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> emits: [<span><span>'update:modelValue'<span><span>],<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/v-model.html", "title": "组件 v-model", "doc_id": "8b81e76bd9b94402baf6355edd4f37ab", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1636, "chunk_index": 100, "_doc_id": "100_3573658683602627010"}}
{"doc_id": "101_1781290157853370183", "text": "><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> emits: [<span><span>'update:modelValue'<span><span>],<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> created<span><span>() {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line highlighted\"><span> console.<span><span>log<span><span>(<span><span>this<span><span>.modelModifiers) <span><span>// { capitalize: true }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>script<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/v-model.html", "title": "组件 v-model", "doc_id": "8b81e76bd9b94402baf6355edd4f37ab", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1636, "chunk_index": 101, "_doc_id": "101_1781290157853370183"}}
{"doc_id": "102_5821130595547667609", "text": "n>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>script<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>input<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> type<span><span>=<span><span>\"text\"<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> :value<span><span>=<span><span>\"modelValue\"<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> @input<span><span>=<span><span>\"$emit('update:modelValue', $event.target.value)\"<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/v-model.html", "title": "组件 v-model", "doc_id": "8b81e76bd9b94402baf6355edd4f37ab", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1636, "chunk_index": 102, "_doc_id": "102_5821130595547667609"}}
{"doc_id": "103_8733724994937324687", "text": "<span> @input<span><span>=<span><span>\"$emit('update:modelValue', $event.target.value)\"<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> /><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>请注意，该组件的 <code>modelModifiers<code> prop 包含 <code>capitalize<code> 且值为 <code>true<code> ——因为它是在 <code>v-model.capitalize=\"myText\"<code> 这个 <code>v-model<code> 绑定上设置的。<p><p>现在我们已经为组件配置了 prop，我们可以检查 <code>modelModifiers<code> 对象的键并编写一个处理程序来更改抛出的值。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/v-model.html", "title": "组件 v-model", "doc_id": "8b81e76bd9b94402baf6355edd4f37ab", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1636, "chunk_index": 103, "_doc_id": "103_8733724994937324687"}}
{"doc_id": "104_6696181759618566302", "text": "v-model<code> 绑定上设置的。<p><p>现在我们已经为组件配置了 prop，我们可以检查 <code>modelModifiers<code> 对象的键并编写一个处理程序来更改抛出的值。在下面的代码中，每当 <code><input /><code> 元素触发 <code>input<code> 事件时，我们都会将首字母大写。<p><div class=\"language-vue\"> <span class=\"lang\">vue<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>script<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> props: {<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/v-model.html", "title": "组件 v-model", "doc_id": "8b81e76bd9b94402baf6355edd4f37ab", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1636, "chunk_index": 104, "_doc_id": "104_6696181759618566302"}}
{"doc_id": "105_3573658683602627010", "text": "export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> props: {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> modelValue: String,<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> modelModifiers: {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> default<span><span>: () <span><span>=><span><span> ({})<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> },<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> emits: [<span><span>'update:modelValue'<span><span>],<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/v-model.html", "title": "组件 v-model", "doc_id": "8b81e76bd9b94402baf6355edd4f37ab", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1636, "chunk_index": 105, "_doc_id": "105_3573658683602627010"}}
{"doc_id": "106_7968940064487267413", "text": "><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> emits: [<span><span>'update:modelValue'<span><span>],<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> methods: {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> emitValue<span><span>(<span><span>e<span><span>) {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> let<span><span> value <span><span>=<span><span> e.target.value<span><span>\n<span class=\"line highlighted\"><span> if<span><span> (<span><span>this<span><span>.modelModifiers.capitalize) {<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/v-model.html", "title": "组件 v-model", "doc_id": "8b81e76bd9b94402baf6355edd4f37ab", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1636, "chunk_index": 106, "_doc_id": "106_7968940064487267413"}}
{"doc_id": "107_4617139860119703224", "text": "ghted\"><span> if<span><span> (<span><span>this<span><span>.modelModifiers.capitalize) {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line highlighted\"><span> value <span><span>=<span><span> value.<span><span>charAt<span><span>(<span><span>0<span><span>).<span><span>toUpperCase<span><span>() <span><span>+<span><span> value.<span><span>slice<span><span>(<span><span>1<span><span>)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line highlighted\"><span> }<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/v-model.html", "title": "组件 v-model", "doc_id": "8b81e76bd9b94402baf6355edd4f37ab", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1636, "chunk_index": 107, "_doc_id": "107_4617139860119703224"}}
