{"doc_id": "112_6453824039551522222", "text": "<h3 id=\"modifiers-for-v-model-with-arguments\">带参数的 <code>v-model<code> 修饰符 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#modifiers-for-v-model-with-arguments\">​<a><h3><div class=\"options-api\"><p>对于又有参数又有修饰符的 <code>v-model<code> 绑定，生成的 prop 名将是 <code>arg + \"Modifiers\"<code>。举例来说：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>MyComponent<span><span> v-model<span><span>:<span><span>title<span><span>.", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/v-model.html", "title": "组件 v-model", "doc_id": "8b81e76bd9b94402baf6355edd4f37ab", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1636, "chunk_index": 112, "_doc_id": "112_6453824039551522222"}}
