{"doc_id": "129_6517365676116261666", "text": "meModifiers) <span><span>// { uppercase: true }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>script<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><div><div><div>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/v-model.html", "title": "组件 v-model", "doc_id": "8b81e76bd9b94402baf6355edd4f37ab", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1636, "chunk_index": 129, "_doc_id": "129_6517365676116261666"}}
{"doc_id": "0_8585989225161559701", "text": "<div><div><h1 id=\"template-syntax\">模板语法 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#template-syntax\">​<a><h1><p>Vue 使用一种基于 HTML 的模板语法，使我们能够声明式地将其组件实例的数据绑定到呈现的 DOM 上。所有的 Vue 模板都是语法层面合法的 HTML，可以被符合规范的浏览器和 HTML 解析器解析。<p><p>在底层机制中，Vue 会将模板编译成高度优化的 JavaScript 代码。结合响应式系统，当应用状态变更时，Vue 能够智能地推导出需要重新渲染的组件的最少数量，并应用最少的 DOM 操作。<p><p>如果你对虚拟 DOM 的概念比较熟悉，并且偏好直接使用 JavaScript，你也可以结合可选的 JSX 支持<a href=\"/guide/extras/render-function.html\">直接手写渲染函数<a>而不采用模板。但请注意，这将不会享受到和模板同等级别的编译时优化。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/template-syntax.html", "title": "模板语法", "doc_id": "580320197d0c40d9883347cb32424825", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 738, "chunk_index": 0, "_doc_id": "0_8585989225161559701"}}
{"doc_id": "1_3617100732271221356", "text": "合可选的 JSX 支持<a href=\"/guide/extras/render-function.html\">直接手写渲染函数<a>而不采用模板。但请注意，这将不会享受到和模板同等级别的编译时优化。<p><h2 id=\"text-interpolation\">文本插值 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#text-interpolation\">​<a><h2><p>最基本的数据绑定形式是文本插值，", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/template-syntax.html", "title": "模板语法", "doc_id": "580320197d0c40d9883347cb32424825", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 738, "chunk_index": 1, "_doc_id": "1_3617100732271221356"}}
{"doc_id": "2_304282983875560594", "text": "-interpolation\">文本插值 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#text-interpolation\">​<a><h2><p>最基本的数据绑定形式是文本插值，它使用的是“Mustache”语法 (即双大括号)：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>span<span><span>>Message: {{ msg }}</<span><span>span<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>双大括号标签会被替换为<a href=\"/guide/essentials/reactivity-fundamentals.html#declaring-reactive-state\">相应组件实例中<a> <code>msg<code> 属性的值。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/template-syntax.html", "title": "模板语法", "doc_id": "580320197d0c40d9883347cb32424825", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 738, "chunk_index": 2, "_doc_id": "2_304282983875560594"}}
{"doc_id": "3_4005400230351559990", "text": "e/essentials/reactivity-fundamentals.html#declaring-reactive-state\">相应组件实例中<a> <code>msg<code> 属性的值。同时每次 <code>msg<code> 属性更改时它也会同步更新。<p><h2 id=\"raw-html\">原始 HTML <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#raw-html\">​<a><h2><p>双大括号会将数据解释为纯文本，而不是 HTML。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/template-syntax.html", "title": "模板语法", "doc_id": "580320197d0c40d9883347cb32424825", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 738, "chunk_index": 3, "_doc_id": "3_4005400230351559990"}}
{"doc_id": "4_155141419434213969", "text": "id=\"raw-html\">原始 HTML <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#raw-html\">​<a><h2><p>双大括号会将数据解释为纯文本，而不是 HTML。若想插入 HTML，你需要使用 <a href=\"/api/built-in-directives.html#v-html\"><code>v-html<code> 指令<a>：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>p<span><span>>Using text interpolation: {{ rawHtml }}</<span><span>p<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/template-syntax.html", "title": "模板语法", "doc_id": "580320197d0c40d9883347cb32424825", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 738, "chunk_index": 4, "_doc_id": "4_155141419434213969"}}
{"doc_id": "5_3268458130074696661", "text": "<span>p<span><span>>Using text interpolation: {{ rawHtml }}</<span><span>p<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>p<span><span>>Using v-html directive: <<span><span>span<span><span> v-html<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>rawHtml<span><span>\"<span><span>></<span><span>span<span><span>></<span><span>p<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><div class=\"demo\"><p>Using text interpolation: <span style=\"color: red\">This should be red.</span><p><p>Using v-html directive: <span><span>This should be red.<span><span><p><div><p>这里我们遇到了一个新的概念。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/template-syntax.html", "title": "模板语法", "doc_id": "580320197d0c40d9883347cb32424825", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 738, "chunk_index": 5, "_doc_id": "5_3268458130074696661"}}
{"doc_id": "6_7838335656697435802", "text": "n><p><p>Using v-html directive: <span><span>This should be red.<span><span><p><div><p>这里我们遇到了一个新的概念。这里看到的 <code>v-html<code> attribute 被称为一个<strong>指令<strong>。指令由 <code>v-<code> 作为前缀，表明它们是一些由 Vue 提供的特殊 attribute，你可能已经猜到了，它们将为渲染的 DOM 应用特殊的响应式行为。这里我们做的事情简单来说就是：在当前组件实例上，将此元素的 innerHTML 与 <code>rawHtml<code> 属性保持同步。<p><p><code>span<code> 的内容将会被替换为 <code>rawHtml<code> 属性的值，插值为纯 HTML——数据绑定将会被忽略。注意，你不能使用 <code>v-html<code> 来拼接组合模板，因为 Vue 不是一个基于字符串的模板引擎。在使用 Vue 时，应当使用组件作为 UI 重用和组合的基本单元。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/template-syntax.html", "title": "模板语法", "doc_id": "580320197d0c40d9883347cb32424825", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 738, "chunk_index": 6, "_doc_id": "6_7838335656697435802"}}
{"doc_id": "7_8335048227099785067", "text": "据绑定将会被忽略。注意，你不能使用 <code>v-html<code> 来拼接组合模板，因为 Vue 不是一个基于字符串的模板引擎。在使用 Vue 时，应当使用组件作为 UI 重用和组合的基本单元。<p><div class=\"warning custom-block\"><p class=\"custom-block-title\">安全警告<p><p>在网站上动态渲染任意 HTML 是非常危险的，因为这非常容易造成 <a href=\"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E8%B7%A8%E7%B6%B2%E7%AB%99%E6%8C%87%E4%BB%A4%E7%A2%BC\" target=\"_blank\">XSS 漏洞<a>。请仅在内容安全可信时再使用 <code>v-html<code>，并且<strong>永远不要<strong>使用用户提供的 HTML 内容。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/template-syntax.html", "title": "模板语法", "doc_id": "580320197d0c40d9883347cb32424825", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 738, "chunk_index": 7, "_doc_id": "7_8335048227099785067"}}
{"doc_id": "8_7271065341368322123", "text": "C\" target=\"_blank\">XSS 漏洞<a>。请仅在内容安全可信时再使用 <code>v-html<code>，并且<strong>永远不要<strong>使用用户提供的 HTML 内容。<p><div><h2 id=\"attribute-bindings\">Attribute 绑定 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#attribute-bindings\">​<a><h2><p>双大括号不能在 HTML attributes 中使用。想要响应式地绑定一个 attribute，", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/template-syntax.html", "title": "模板语法", "doc_id": "580320197d0c40d9883347cb32424825", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 738, "chunk_index": 8, "_doc_id": "8_7271065341368322123"}}
{"doc_id": "9_7028905430630775995", "text": "ader-anchor\" href=\"#attribute-bindings\">​<a><h2><p>双大括号不能在 HTML attributes 中使用。想要响应式地绑定一个 attribute，应该使用 <a href=\"/api/built-in-directives.html#v-bind\"><code>v-bind<code> 指令<a>：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>div<span><span> v-bind<span><span>:<span><span>id<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>dynamicId<span><span>\"<span><span>></<span><span>div<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p><code>v-bind<code> 指令指示 Vue 将元素的 <code>id<code> attribute 与组件的 <code>dynamicId<code> 属性保持一致。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/template-syntax.html", "title": "模板语法", "doc_id": "580320197d0c40d9883347cb32424825", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 738, "chunk_index": 9, "_doc_id": "9_7028905430630775995"}}
{"doc_id": "10_2863645510760426373", "text": "<div><p><code>v-bind<code> 指令指示 Vue 将元素的 <code>id<code> attribute 与组件的 <code>dynamicId<code> 属性保持一致。如果绑定的值是 <code>null<code> 或者 <code>undefined<code>，那么该 attribute 将会从渲染的元素上移除。<p><h3 id=\"shorthand\">简写 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#shorthand\">​<a><h3><p>因为 <code>v-bind<code> 非常常用，", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/template-syntax.html", "title": "模板语法", "doc_id": "580320197d0c40d9883347cb32424825", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 738, "chunk_index": 10, "_doc_id": "10_2863645510760426373"}}
{"doc_id": "11_7211560417365116633", "text": "id=\"shorthand\">简写 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#shorthand\">​<a><h3><p>因为 <code>v-bind<code> 非常常用，我们提供了特定的简写语法：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>div<span><span> :<span><span>id<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>dynamicId<span><span>\"<span><span>></<span><span>div<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>开头为 <code>:<code> 的 attribute 可能和一般的 HTML attribute 看起来不太一样，", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/template-syntax.html", "title": "模板语法", "doc_id": "580320197d0c40d9883347cb32424825", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 738, "chunk_index": 11, "_doc_id": "11_7211560417365116633"}}
{"doc_id": "12_2148312405458535670", "text": "n><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>开头为 <code>:<code> 的 attribute 可能和一般的 HTML attribute 看起来不太一样，但它的确是合法的 attribute 名称字符，并且所有支持 Vue 的浏览器都能正确解析它。此外，他们不会出现在最终渲染的 DOM 中。简写语法是可选的，但相信在你了解了它更多的用处后，你应该会更喜欢它。<p><blockquote><p>接下来的指引中，我们都将在示例中使用简写语法，因为这是在实际开发中更常见的用法。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/template-syntax.html", "title": "模板语法", "doc_id": "580320197d0c40d9883347cb32424825", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 738, "chunk_index": 12, "_doc_id": "12_2148312405458535670"}}
{"doc_id": "13_4641773024550085647", "text": "的 DOM 中。简写语法是可选的，但相信在你了解了它更多的用处后，你应该会更喜欢它。<p><blockquote><p>接下来的指引中，我们都将在示例中使用简写语法，因为这是在实际开发中更常见的用法。<p><blockquote><h3 id=\"same-name-shorthand\">同名简写 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#same-name-shorthand\">​<a><h3><p>如果 attribute 的名称与绑定的 JavaScript 变量的名称相同，那么可以进一步简化语法，省略 attribute 值：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><!-- 与 :id=\"id\" 相同 --><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/template-syntax.html", "title": "模板语法", "doc_id": "580320197d0c40d9883347cb32424825", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 738, "chunk_index": 13, "_doc_id": "13_4641773024550085647"}}
{"doc_id": "14_7652705260428084836", "text": "class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><!-- 与 :id=\"id\" 相同 --><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>div<span><span> :<span><span>id<span><span>></<span><span>div<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><!-- 这也同样有效 --><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>div<span><span> v-bind:id<span><span>></<span><span>div<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>这与在 JavaScript 中声明对象时使用的属性简写语法类似。请注意，这是一个只在 Vue 3.4 及以上版本中可用的特性。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/template-syntax.html", "title": "模板语法", "doc_id": "580320197d0c40d9883347cb32424825", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 738, "chunk_index": 14, "_doc_id": "14_7652705260428084836"}}
{"doc_id": "15_5189186733736556670", "text": "pan>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>这与在 JavaScript 中声明对象时使用的属性简写语法类似。请注意，这是一个只在 Vue 3.4 及以上版本中可用的特性。<p><h3 id=\"boolean-attributes\">布尔型 Attribute <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#boolean-attributes\">​<a><h3><p><a href=\"https://developer.mozilla.org/zh-CN/docs/Web/HTML/Attributes#%E5%B8%83%E5%B0%94%E5%80%BC%E5%B1%9E%E6%80%A7\" target=\"_blank\">布尔型 attribute<a> 依据 true / false 值来决定 attribute 是否应该存在于该元素上。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/template-syntax.html", "title": "模板语法", "doc_id": "580320197d0c40d9883347cb32424825", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 738, "chunk_index": 15, "_doc_id": "15_5189186733736556670"}}
{"doc_id": "16_5046358970694682461", "text": "0%BC%E5%B1%9E%E6%80%A7\" target=\"_blank\">布尔型 attribute<a> 依据 true / false 值来决定 attribute 是否应该存在于该元素上。<a href=\"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/HTML/Attributes/disabled\" target=\"_blank\"><code>disabled<code><a> 就是最常见的例子之一。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/template-syntax.html", "title": "模板语法", "doc_id": "580320197d0c40d9883347cb32424825", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 738, "chunk_index": 16, "_doc_id": "16_5046358970694682461"}}
{"doc_id": "17_5909979257262227339", "text": "lla.org/en-US/docs/Web/HTML/Attributes/disabled\" target=\"_blank\"><code>disabled<code><a> 就是最常见的例子之一。<p><p><code>v-bind<code> 在这种场景下的行为略有不同：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>button<span><span> :<span><span>disabled<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>isButtonDisabled<span><span>\"<span><span>>Button</<span><span>button<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>当 <code>isButtonDisabled<code> 为<a href=\"https://developer.", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/template-syntax.html", "title": "模板语法", "doc_id": "580320197d0c40d9883347cb32424825", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 738, "chunk_index": 17, "_doc_id": "17_5909979257262227339"}}
{"doc_id": "18_4623954227667322125", "text": "an><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>当 <code>isButtonDisabled<code> 为<a href=\"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Glossary/Truthy\" target=\"_blank\">真值<a>或一个空字符串 (即 <code><button disabled=\"\"><code>) 时，元素会包含这个 <code>disabled<code> attribute。而当其为其他<a href=\"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Glossary/Falsy\" target=\"_blank\">假值<a>时 attribute 将被忽略。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/template-syntax.html", "title": "模板语法", "doc_id": "580320197d0c40d9883347cb32424825", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 738, "chunk_index": 18, "_doc_id": "18_4623954227667322125"}}
{"doc_id": "19_4138018215506963994", "text": "ref=\"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Glossary/Falsy\" target=\"_blank\">假值<a>时 attribute 将被忽略。<p><h3 id=\"dynamically-binding-multiple-attributes\">动态绑定多个值 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#dynamically-binding-multiple-attributes\">​<a><h3><p>如果你有像这样的一个包含多个 attribute 的 JavaScript 对象：<p><div class=\"composition-api\"><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> objectOfAttrs<span><span> =<span><span> {<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/template-syntax.html", "title": "模板语法", "doc_id": "580320197d0c40d9883347cb32424825", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 738, "chunk_index": 19, "_doc_id": "19_4138018215506963994"}}
{"doc_id": "20_1482538778059814158", "text": "de><span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> objectOfAttrs<span><span> =<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> id: <span><span>'container'<span><span>,<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> class: <span><span>'wrapper'<span><span>,<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> style: <span><span>'background-color:green'<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/template-syntax.html", "title": "模板语法", "doc_id": "580320197d0c40d9883347cb32424825", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 738, "chunk_index": 20, "_doc_id": "20_1482538778059814158"}}
{"doc_id": "21_4015731777424238938", "text": "pan>,<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> style: <span><span>'background-color:green'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span><code><pre><div><div><div class=\"options-api\"><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>data<span><span>() {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> return<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> objectOfAttrs: {<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/template-syntax.html", "title": "模板语法", "doc_id": "580320197d0c40d9883347cb32424825", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 738, "chunk_index": 21, "_doc_id": "21_4015731777424238938"}}
{"doc_id": "22_5159909608776615375", "text": "ine\"><span> return<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> objectOfAttrs: {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> id: <span><span>'container'<span><span>,<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> class: <span><span>'wrapper'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span><code><pre><div><div><p>通过不带参数的 <code>v-bind<code>，", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/template-syntax.html", "title": "模板语法", "doc_id": "580320197d0c40d9883347cb32424825", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 738, "chunk_index": 22, "_doc_id": "22_5159909608776615375"}}
{"doc_id": "23_4037809972049490826", "text": "pan><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span><code><pre><div><div><p>通过不带参数的 <code>v-bind<code>，你可以将它们绑定到单个元素上：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>div<span><span> v-bind<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>objectOfAttrs<span><span>\"<span><span>></<span><span>div<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><h2 id=\"using-javascript-expressions\">使用 JavaScript 表达式 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#using-javascript-expressions\">​<a><h2><p>至此，", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/template-syntax.html", "title": "模板语法", "doc_id": "580320197d0c40d9883347cb32424825", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 738, "chunk_index": 23, "_doc_id": "23_4037809972049490826"}}
{"doc_id": "24_961221647697423329", "text": "ions\">使用 JavaScript 表达式 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#using-javascript-expressions\">​<a><h2><p>至此，我们仅在模板中绑定了一些简单的属性名。但是 Vue 实际上在所有的数据绑定中都支持完整的 JavaScript 表达式：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>{{ number <span><span>+<span><span> 1<span><span> }}<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>{{ ok <span><span>?<span><span> 'YES'<span><span> :<span><span> 'NO'<span><span> }}<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/template-syntax.html", "title": "模板语法", "doc_id": "580320197d0c40d9883347cb32424825", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 738, "chunk_index": 24, "_doc_id": "24_961221647697423329"}}
{"doc_id": "25_1442327648137627753", "text": "pan>{{ ok <span><span>?<span><span> 'YES'<span><span> :<span><span> 'NO'<span><span> }}<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>{{ message.<span><span>split<span><span>(<span><span>''<span><span>).<span><span>reverse<span><span>().<span><span>join<span><span>(<span><span>''<span><span>) }}<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/template-syntax.html", "title": "模板语法", "doc_id": "580320197d0c40d9883347cb32424825", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 738, "chunk_index": 25, "_doc_id": "25_1442327648137627753"}}
{"doc_id": "26_6323341531991225181", "text": ").<span><span>join<span><span>(<span><span>''<span><span>) }}<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>div<span><span> :<span><span>id<span><span>=<span><span>\"`list-${<span><span>id<span><span>}`\"<span><span>></<span><span>div<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>这些表达式都会被作为 JavaScript ，以当前组件实例为作用域解析执行。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/template-syntax.html", "title": "模板语法", "doc_id": "580320197d0c40d9883347cb32424825", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 738, "chunk_index": 26, "_doc_id": "26_6323341531991225181"}}
{"doc_id": "27_8569574928491943009", "text": "</<span><span>div<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>这些表达式都会被作为 JavaScript ，以当前组件实例为作用域解析执行。<p><p>在 Vue 模板内，JavaScript 表达式可以被使用在如下场景上：<p><ul><li>在文本插值中 (双大括号)<li><li>在任何 Vue 指令 (以 <code>v-<code> 开头的特殊 attribute) attribute 的值中<li><ul><h3 id=\"expressions-only\">仅支持表达式 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#expressions-only\">​<a><h3><p>每个绑定仅支持<strong>单一表达式<strong>，也就是一段能够被求值的 JavaScript 代码。一个简单的判断方法是是否可以合法地写在 <code>return<code> 后面。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/template-syntax.html", "title": "模板语法", "doc_id": "580320197d0c40d9883347cb32424825", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 738, "chunk_index": 27, "_doc_id": "27_8569574928491943009"}}
{"doc_id": "28_8923244968711841917", "text": "<p>每个绑定仅支持<strong>单一表达式<strong>，也就是一段能够被求值的 JavaScript 代码。一个简单的判断方法是是否可以合法地写在 <code>return<code> 后面。<p><p>因此，下面的例子都是<strong>无效<strong>的：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><!-- 这是一个语句，而非表达式 --><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>{{ var a <span><span>=<span><span> 1<span><span> }}<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><!-- 条件控制也不支持，请使用三元表达式 --><span><span>\n<span", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/template-syntax.html", "title": "模板语法", "doc_id": "580320197d0c40d9883347cb32424825", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 738, "chunk_index": 28, "_doc_id": "28_8923244968711841917"}}
{"doc_id": "29_4729177751907837266", "text": "an>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><!-- 条件控制也不支持，请使用三元表达式 --><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>{{ <span><span>if<span><span> (ok) { return message } }}<span><span><code><pre><div><h3 id=\"calling-functions\">调用函数 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#calling-functions\">​<a><h3><p>可以在绑定的表达式中使用一个组件暴露的方法：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>time<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/template-syntax.html", "title": "模板语法", "doc_id": "580320197d0c40d9883347cb32424825", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 738, "chunk_index": 29, "_doc_id": "29_4729177751907837266"}}
{"doc_id": "30_3380120995708070259", "text": "<pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>time<span><span> :<span><span>title<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>toTitleDate<span><span>(date)<span><span>\"<span><span> :<span><span>datetime<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>date<span><span>\"<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> {{ <span><span>formatDate<span><span>(date) }}<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/template-syntax.html", "title": "模板语法", "doc_id": "580320197d0c40d9883347cb32424825", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 738, "chunk_index": 30, "_doc_id": "30_3380120995708070259"}}
{"doc_id": "31_1694538190302580174", "text": ">><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> {{ <span><span>formatDate<span><span>(date) }}<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>time<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><div class=\"tip custom-block\"><p class=\"custom-block-title\">TIP<p><p>绑定在表达式中的方法在组件每次更新时都会被重新调用，因此<strong>不<strong>应该产生任何副作用，比如改变数据或触发异步操作。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/template-syntax.html", "title": "模板语法", "doc_id": "580320197d0c40d9883347cb32424825", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 738, "chunk_index": 31, "_doc_id": "31_1694538190302580174"}}
{"doc_id": "32_2313795025730777063", "text": "=\"custom-block-title\">TIP<p><p>绑定在表达式中的方法在组件每次更新时都会被重新调用，因此<strong>不<strong>应该产生任何副作用，比如改变数据或触发异步操作。<p><div><h3 id=\"restricted-globals-access\">受限的全局访问 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#restricted-globals-access\">​<a><h3><p>模板中的表达式将被沙盒化，仅能够访问到<a href=\"https://github.com/vuejs/core/blob/main/packages/shared/src/globalsAllowList.ts#L3\" target=\"_blank\">有限的全局对象列表<a>。该列表中会暴露常用的内置全局对象，比如 <code>Math<code> 和 <code>Date<code>。<p><p>没有显式包含在列表中的全局对象将不能在模板内表达式中访问，例如用户附加在 <code>window<code> 上的属性。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/template-syntax.html", "title": "模板语法", "doc_id": "580320197d0c40d9883347cb32424825", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 738, "chunk_index": 32, "_doc_id": "32_2313795025730777063"}}
{"doc_id": "33_5384792503285511490", "text": "de>Math<code> 和 <code>Date<code>。<p><p>没有显式包含在列表中的全局对象将不能在模板内表达式中访问，例如用户附加在 <code>window<code> 上的属性。然而，你也可以自行在 <a href=\"/api/application.html#app-config-globalproperties\"><code>app.config.globalProperties<code><a> 上显式地添加它们，供所有的 Vue 表达式使用。<p><h2 id=\"directives\">指令 Directives <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#directives\">​<a><h2><p>指令是带有 <code>v-<code> 前缀的特殊 attribute。Vue 提供了许多<a href=\"/api/built-in-directives.html\">内置指令<a>，包括上面我们所介绍的 <code>v-bind<code> 和 <code>v-html<code>。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/template-syntax.html", "title": "模板语法", "doc_id": "580320197d0c40d9883347cb32424825", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 738, "chunk_index": 33, "_doc_id": "33_5384792503285511490"}}
{"doc_id": "34_949015012471646499", "text": "多<a href=\"/api/built-in-directives.html\">内置指令<a>，包括上面我们所介绍的 <code>v-bind<code> 和 <code>v-html<code>。<p><p>指令 attribute 的期望值为一个 JavaScript 表达式 (除了少数几个例外，即之后要讨论到的 <code>v-for<code>、<code>v-on<code> 和 <code>v-slot<code>)。一个指令的任务是在其表达式的值变化时响应式地更新 DOM。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/template-syntax.html", "title": "模板语法", "doc_id": "580320197d0c40d9883347cb32424825", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 738, "chunk_index": 34, "_doc_id": "34_949015012471646499"}}
{"doc_id": "35_4843740913735282332", "text": "几个例外，即之后要讨论到的 <code>v-for<code>、<code>v-on<code> 和 <code>v-slot<code>)。一个指令的任务是在其表达式的值变化时响应式地更新 DOM。以 <a href=\"/api/built-in-directives.html#v-if\"><code>v-if<code><a> 为例：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>p<span><span> v-if<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>seen<span><span>\"<span><span>>Now you see me</<span><span>p<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>这里，<code>v-if<code> 指令会基于表达式 <code>seen<code> 的值的真假来移除/插入该 <code><p><code> 元素。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/template-syntax.html", "title": "模板语法", "doc_id": "580320197d0c40d9883347cb32424825", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 738, "chunk_index": 35, "_doc_id": "35_4843740913735282332"}}
{"doc_id": "36_160657921385881323", "text": "an><code><pre><div><p>这里，<code>v-if<code> 指令会基于表达式 <code>seen<code> 的值的真假来移除/插入该 <code><p><code> 元素。<p><h3 id=\"arguments\">参数 Arguments <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#arguments\">​<a><h3><p>某些指令会需要一个“参数”，在指令名后通过一个冒号隔开做标识。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/template-syntax.html", "title": "模板语法", "doc_id": "580320197d0c40d9883347cb32424825", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 738, "chunk_index": 36, "_doc_id": "36_160657921385881323"}}
{"doc_id": "37_2730953823920556614", "text": "\">参数 Arguments <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#arguments\">​<a><h3><p>某些指令会需要一个“参数”，在指令名后通过一个冒号隔开做标识。例如用 <code>v-bind<code> 指令来响应式地更新一个 HTML attribute：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>a<span><span> v-bind<span><span>:<span><span>href<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>url<span><span>\"<span><span>> ... </<span><span>a<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/template-syntax.html", "title": "模板语法", "doc_id": "580320197d0c40d9883347cb32424825", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 738, "chunk_index": 37, "_doc_id": "37_2730953823920556614"}}
{"doc_id": "38_3301427948526502762", "text": "rl<span><span>\"<span><span>> ... </<span><span>a<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><!-- 简写 --><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>a<span><span> :<span><span>href<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>url<span><span>\"<span><span>> ... </<span><span>a<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>这里 <code>href<code> 就是一个参数，它告诉 <code>v-bind<code> 指令将表达式 <code>url<code> 的值绑定到元素的 <code>href<code> attribute 上。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/template-syntax.html", "title": "模板语法", "doc_id": "580320197d0c40d9883347cb32424825", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 738, "chunk_index": 38, "_doc_id": "38_3301427948526502762"}}
{"doc_id": "39_8348062602804068399", "text": "ef<code> 就是一个参数，它告诉 <code>v-bind<code> 指令将表达式 <code>url<code> 的值绑定到元素的 <code>href<code> attribute 上。在简写中，参数前的一切 (例如 <code>v-bind:<code>) 都会被缩略为一个 <code>:<code> 字符。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/template-syntax.html", "title": "模板语法", "doc_id": "580320197d0c40d9883347cb32424825", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 738, "chunk_index": 39, "_doc_id": "39_8348062602804068399"}}
{"doc_id": "40_4977292237396961945", "text": "值绑定到元素的 <code>href<code> attribute 上。在简写中，参数前的一切 (例如 <code>v-bind:<code>) 都会被缩略为一个 <code>:<code> 字符。<p><p>另一个例子是 <code>v-on<code> 指令，它将监听 DOM 事件：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>a<span><span> v-on<span><span>:<span><span>click<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>doSomething<span><span>\"<span><span>> ... </<span><span>a<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/template-syntax.html", "title": "模板语法", "doc_id": "580320197d0c40d9883347cb32424825", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 738, "chunk_index": 40, "_doc_id": "40_4977292237396961945"}}
{"doc_id": "41_405082890360080917", "text": "ng<span><span>\"<span><span>> ... </<span><span>a<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><!-- 简写 --><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>a<span><span> @<span><span>click<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>doSomething<span><span>\"<span><span>> ... </<span><span>a<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>这里的参数是要监听的事件名称：<code>click<code>。<code>v-on<code> 有一个相应的缩写，即 <code>@<code> 字符。我们之后也会讨论关于事件处理的更多细节。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/template-syntax.html", "title": "模板语法", "doc_id": "580320197d0c40d9883347cb32424825", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 738, "chunk_index": 41, "_doc_id": "41_405082890360080917"}}
{"doc_id": "42_8395680462762607424", "text": "p>这里的参数是要监听的事件名称：<code>click<code>。<code>v-on<code> 有一个相应的缩写，即 <code>@<code> 字符。我们之后也会讨论关于事件处理的更多细节。<p><h3 id=\"dynamic-arguments\">动态参数 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#dynamic-arguments\">​<a><h3><p>同样在指令参数上也可以使用一个 JavaScript 表达式，需要包含在一对方括号内：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><!--<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>注意，参数表达式有一些约束，<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/template-syntax.html", "title": "模板语法", "doc_id": "580320197d0c40d9883347cb32424825", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 738, "chunk_index": 42, "_doc_id": "42_8395680462762607424"}}
{"doc_id": "43_123835012924166975", "text": "<code><span class=\"line\"><span><!--<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>注意，参数表达式有一些约束，<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>参见下面“动态参数值的限制”与“动态参数语法的限制”章节的解释<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>--><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>a<span><span> v-bind:<span><span>[<span><span>attributeName<span><span>]=<span><span>\"url\"<span><span>> ... </<span><span>a<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><!-- 简写 --><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/template-syntax.html", "title": "模板语法", "doc_id": "580320197d0c40d9883347cb32424825", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 738, "chunk_index": 43, "_doc_id": "43_123835012924166975"}}
{"doc_id": "44_8960555186631027121", "text": "span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><!-- 简写 --><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>a<span><span> :[<span><span>attributeName<span><span>]=<span><span>\"url\"<span><span>> ... </<span><span>a<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>这里的 <code>attributeName<code> 会作为一个 JavaScript 表达式被动态执行，计算得到的值会被用作最终的参数。举例来说，如果你的组件实例有一个数据属性 <code>attributeName<code>，其值为 <code>\"href\"<code>，那么这个绑定就等价于 <code>v-bind:href<code>。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/template-syntax.html", "title": "模板语法", "doc_id": "580320197d0c40d9883347cb32424825", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 738, "chunk_index": 44, "_doc_id": "44_8960555186631027121"}}
{"doc_id": "45_7396395357718860207", "text": "如果你的组件实例有一个数据属性 <code>attributeName<code>，其值为 <code>\"href\"<code>，那么这个绑定就等价于 <code>v-bind:href<code>。<p><p>相似地，你还可以将一个函数绑定到动态的事件名称上：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>a<span><span> v-on:<span><span>[<span><span>eventName<span><span>]=<span><span>\"doSomething\"<span><span>> ... </<span><span>a<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><!-- 简写 --><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/template-syntax.html", "title": "模板语法", "doc_id": "580320197d0c40d9883347cb32424825", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 738, "chunk_index": 45, "_doc_id": "45_7396395357718860207"}}
{"doc_id": "46_3011664507430116420", "text": "span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><!-- 简写 --><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>a<span><span> @[<span><span>eventName<span><span>]=<span><span>\"doSomething\"<span><span>> ... </<span><span>a<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>在此示例中，当 <code>eventName<code> 的值是 <code>\"focus\"<code> 时，<code>v-on:[eventName]<code> 就等价于 <code>v-on:focus<code>。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/template-syntax.html", "title": "模板语法", "doc_id": "580320197d0c40d9883347cb32424825", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 738, "chunk_index": 46, "_doc_id": "46_3011664507430116420"}}
{"doc_id": "47_3600853051009308196", "text": ">eventName<code> 的值是 <code>\"focus\"<code> 时，<code>v-on:[eventName]<code> 就等价于 <code>v-on:focus<code>。<p><h4 id=\"dynamic-argument-value-constraints\">动态参数值的限制 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#dynamic-argument-value-constraints\">​<a><h4><p>动态参数中表达式的值应当是一个字符串，或者是 <code>null<code>。特殊值 <code>null<code> 意为显式移除该绑定。其他非字符串的值会触发警告。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/template-syntax.html", "title": "模板语法", "doc_id": "580320197d0c40d9883347cb32424825", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 738, "chunk_index": 47, "_doc_id": "47_3600853051009308196"}}
{"doc_id": "48_4455311252715123065", "text": "ts\">​<a><h4><p>动态参数中表达式的值应当是一个字符串，或者是 <code>null<code>。特殊值 <code>null<code> 意为显式移除该绑定。其他非字符串的值会触发警告。<p><h4 id=\"dynamic-argument-syntax-constraints\">动态参数语法的限制 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#dynamic-argument-syntax-constraints\">​<a><h4><p>动态参数表达式因为某些字符的缘故有一些语法限制，比如空格和引号，在 HTML attribute 名称中都是不合法的。例如下面的示例：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><!-- 这会触发一个编译器警告 --><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/template-syntax.html", "title": "模板语法", "doc_id": "580320197d0c40d9883347cb32424825", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 738, "chunk_index": 48, "_doc_id": "48_4455311252715123065"}}
{"doc_id": "49_5843136460438613663", "text": "e class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><!-- 这会触发一个编译器警告 --><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>a<span><span> :[<span><span>'foo'<span><span> + <span><span>bar<span><span>]=<span><span>\"value\"<span><span>> ... </<span><span>a<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>如果你需要传入一个复杂的动态参数，我们推荐使用<a href=\"./computed.html\">计算属性<a>替换复杂的表达式，也是 Vue 最基础的概念之一，我们很快就会讲到。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/template-syntax.html", "title": "模板语法", "doc_id": "580320197d0c40d9883347cb32424825", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 738, "chunk_index": 49, "_doc_id": "49_5843136460438613663"}}
{"doc_id": "50_1625911858500356917", "text": "e><div><p>如果你需要传入一个复杂的动态参数，我们推荐使用<a href=\"./computed.html\">计算属性<a>替换复杂的表达式，也是 Vue 最基础的概念之一，我们很快就会讲到。<p><p>当使用 DOM 内嵌模板 (直接写在 HTML 文件里的模板) 时，我们需要避免在名称中使用大写字母，因为浏览器会强制将其转换为小写：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>a<span><span> :[<span><span>someAttr<span><span>]=<span><span>\"value\"<span><span>> ... </<span><span>a<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>上面的例子将会在 DOM 内嵌模板中被转换为 <code>:[someattr]<code>。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/template-syntax.html", "title": "模板语法", "doc_id": "580320197d0c40d9883347cb32424825", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 738, "chunk_index": 50, "_doc_id": "50_1625911858500356917"}}
{"doc_id": "51_6042312197531238589", "text": "n><span>a<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>上面的例子将会在 DOM 内嵌模板中被转换为 <code>:[someattr]<code>。如果你的组件拥有 “someAttr” 属性而非 “someattr”，这段代码将不会工作。单文件组件内的模板<strong>不<strong>受此限制。<p><h3 id=\"modifiers\">修饰符 Modifiers <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#modifiers\">​<a><h3><p>修饰符是以点开头的特殊后缀，表明指令需要以一些特殊的方式被绑定。例如 <code>.prevent<code> 修饰符会告知 <code>v-on<code> 指令对触发的事件调用 <code>event.", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/template-syntax.html", "title": "模板语法", "doc_id": "580320197d0c40d9883347cb32424825", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 738, "chunk_index": 51, "_doc_id": "51_6042312197531238589"}}
{"doc_id": "52_1859412508114081045", "text": "是以点开头的特殊后缀，表明指令需要以一些特殊的方式被绑定。例如 <code>.prevent<code> 修饰符会告知 <code>v-on<code> 指令对触发的事件调用 <code>event.preventDefault()<code>：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>form<span><span> @<span><span>submit<span><span>.<span><span>prevent<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>onSubmit<span><span>\"<span><span>>...</<span><span>form<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>之后在讲到 <a href=\"./event-handling.", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/template-syntax.html", "title": "模板语法", "doc_id": "580320197d0c40d9883347cb32424825", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 738, "chunk_index": 52, "_doc_id": "52_1859412508114081045"}}
{"doc_id": "53_4338598961289480875", "text": "n>>...</<span><span>form<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>之后在讲到 <a href=\"./event-handling.html#event-modifiers\"><code>v-on<code><a> 和 <a href=\"./forms.html#modifiers\"><code>v-model<code><a> 的功能时，你将会看到其他修饰符的例子。<p><p>最后，在这里你可以直观地看到完整的指令语法：<p><p> <p><div><div>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/template-syntax.html", "title": "模板语法", "doc_id": "580320197d0c40d9883347cb32424825", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 738, "chunk_index": 53, "_doc_id": "53_4338598961289480875"}}
{"doc_id": "0_2346348767338170403", "text": "<div><div><p>社区有许多优秀的新闻简报 / Vue 相关博客，他们会为你带来 Vue 生态系统中最新的消息和动态。以下是我们收集到的一份较为活跃的不完全列表：<p><p>如果你还知道其他优秀的内容，请使用<a href=\"https://github.com/vuejs/docs/edit/main/src/ecosystem/newsletters.md\" target=\"_blank\">该链接<a>提交一个 pull request！<p><div><div>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/ecosystem/newsletters.html", "title": "社区新闻简报", "doc_id": "3c97ff35855e4ccb95d257e6a4222d98", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 10, "chunk_index": 0, "_doc_id": "0_2346348767338170403"}}
{"doc_id": "0_8561768129441602770", "text": "<div><div><h2 id=\"try-it-online\">在线尝试 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#try-it-online\">​<a><h2><p>你不需要在机器上安装任何东西，也可以尝试基于单文件组件的 Vue 开发体验。我们提供了一个在线的演练场，可以在浏览器中访问：<p><p>在报告 Bug 时，我们也建议使用这些在线演练场来提供最小化重现。<p><h2 id=\"project-scaffolding\">项目脚手架 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#project-scaffolding\">​<a><h2><h3 id=\"vite\">Vite <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#vite\">​<a><h3><p><a href=\"https://cn.vitejs.dev/\" target=\"_blank\">Vite<a> 是一个轻量级的、速度极快的构建工具，对 Vue 单文件组件提供第一优先级支持。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/scaling-up/tooling.html", "title": "工具链 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "ee5cdba9170a4aafb92b996a7a48354b", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 305, "chunk_index": 0, "_doc_id": "0_8561768129441602770"}}
{"doc_id": "1_3938966392995444797", "text": "><p><a href=\"https://cn.vitejs.dev/\" target=\"_blank\">Vite<a> 是一个轻量级的、速度极快的构建工具，对 Vue 单文件组件提供第一优先级支持。作者是尤雨溪，同时也是 Vue 的作者！<p><p>要使用 Vite 来创建一个 Vue 项目，非常简单：<p><p>这个命令会安装和执行 <a href=\"https://github.com/vuejs/create-vue\" target=\"_blank\">create-vue<a>，它是 Vue 提供的官方脚手架工具。跟随命令行的提示继续操作即可。<p><p>上面提到的两种在线演练场也支持将文件作为一个 Vite 项目下载。<p><h3 id=\"vue-cli\">Vue CLI <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#vue-cli\">​<a><h3><p><a href=\"https://cli.vuejs.org/zh/\" target=\"_blank\">Vue CLI<a> 是官方提供的基于 Webpack 的 Vue 工具链，它现在处于维护模式。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/scaling-up/tooling.html", "title": "工具链 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "ee5cdba9170a4aafb92b996a7a48354b", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 305, "chunk_index": 1, "_doc_id": "1_3938966392995444797"}}
{"doc_id": "2_6649774511310869637", "text": "<a href=\"https://cli.vuejs.org/zh/\" target=\"_blank\">Vue CLI<a> 是官方提供的基于 Webpack 的 Vue 工具链，它现在处于维护模式。我们建议使用 Vite 开始新的项目，除非你依赖特定的 Webpack 的特性。在大多数情况下，Vite 将提供更优秀的开发体验。<p><p>关于从 Vue CLI 迁移到 Vite 的资源：<p><h3 id=\"note-on-in-browser-template-compilation\">浏览器内模板编译注意事项 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#note-on-in-browser-template-compilation\">​<a><h3><p>当以无构建步骤方式使用 Vue 时，组件模板要么是写在页面的 HTML 中，要么是内联的 JavaScript 字符串。在这些场景中，为了执行动态模板编译，Vue 需要将模板编译器运行在浏览器中。相对的，如果我们使用了构建步骤，由于提前编译了模板，那么就无须再在浏览器中运行了。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/scaling-up/tooling.html", "title": "工具链 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "ee5cdba9170a4aafb92b996a7a48354b", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 305, "chunk_index": 2, "_doc_id": "2_6649774511310869637"}}
{"doc_id": "3_3719842794789192945", "text": "么是内联的 JavaScript 字符串。在这些场景中，为了执行动态模板编译，Vue 需要将模板编译器运行在浏览器中。相对的，如果我们使用了构建步骤，由于提前编译了模板，那么就无须再在浏览器中运行了。为了减小打包出的客户端代码体积，Vue 提供了<a href=\"https://unpkg.com/browse/vue@3/dist/\" target=\"_blank\">多种格式的“构建文件”<a>以适配不同场景下的优化需求。<p><p>默认的工具链中都会使用仅含运行时的版本，因为所有单文件组件中的模板都已经被预编译了。如果因为某些原因，在有构建步骤时，你仍需要浏览器内的模板编译，你可以更改构建工具配置，将 <code>vue<code> 改为相应的版本 <code>vue/dist/vue.esm-bundler.js<code>。<p><p>如果你需要一种更轻量级，不依赖构建步骤的替代方案，也可以看看 <a href=\"https://github.com/vuejs/petite-vue\" target=\"_blank\">petite-vue<a>。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/scaling-up/tooling.html", "title": "工具链 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "ee5cdba9170a4aafb92b996a7a48354b", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 305, "chunk_index": 3, "_doc_id": "3_3719842794789192945"}}
{"doc_id": "4_6673512300272495963", "text": "更轻量级，不依赖构建步骤的替代方案，也可以看看 <a href=\"https://github.com/vuejs/petite-vue\" target=\"_blank\">petite-vue<a>。<p><h2 id=\"ide-support\">IDE 支持 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#ide-support\">​<a><h2><ul><li><p>推荐使用的 IDE 是 <a href=\"https://code.visualstudio.com/\" target=\"_blank\">VS Code<a>，配合 <a href=\"https://marketplace.visualstudio.com/items?itemName=Vue.volar\" target=\"_blank\">Vue - Official 扩展<a> (之前是 Volar)。该插件提供了语法高亮、TypeScript 支持，以及模板内表达式与组件 props 的智能提示。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/scaling-up/tooling.html", "title": "工具链 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "ee5cdba9170a4aafb92b996a7a48354b", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 305, "chunk_index": 4, "_doc_id": "4_6673512300272495963"}}
{"doc_id": "5_850211256668284130", "text": "\" target=\"_blank\">Vue - Official 扩展<a> (之前是 Volar)。该插件提供了语法高亮、TypeScript 支持，以及模板内表达式与组件 props 的智能提示。<p><div class=\"tip custom-block\"><p class=\"custom-block-title\">TIP<p><p>Vue - Official 取代了我们之前为 Vue 2 提供的官方 VS Code 扩展 <a href=\"https://marketplace.visualstudio.com/items?itemName=octref.vetur\" target=\"_blank\">Vetur<a>。如果你之前已经安装了 Vetur，请确保在 Vue 3 的项目中禁用它。<p><div><li><li><p><a href=\"https://www.jetbrains.com/webstorm/\" target=\"_blank\">WebStorm<a> 同样也为 Vue 的单文件组件提供了很好的内置支持。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/scaling-up/tooling.html", "title": "工具链 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "ee5cdba9170a4aafb92b996a7a48354b", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 305, "chunk_index": 5, "_doc_id": "5_850211256668284130"}}
{"doc_id": "6_6257349486169924598", "text": "<a href=\"https://www.jetbrains.com/webstorm/\" target=\"_blank\">WebStorm<a> 同样也为 Vue 的单文件组件提供了很好的内置支持。<p><li><li><p>其他支持<a href=\"https://microsoft.github.io/language-server-protocol/\" target=\"_blank\">语言服务协议<a> (LSP) 的 IDE 也可以通过 LSP 享受到 Volar 所提供的核心功能：<p><li><ul><p>Vue 的浏览器开发者插件使我们可以浏览一个 Vue 应用的组件树，查看各个组件的状态，追踪状态管理的事件，还可以进行组件性能分析。<p><p> <p><h2 id=\"typescript\">TypeScript <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#typescript\">​<a><h2><p>具体细节请参考章节：<a href=\"/guide/typescript/overview.html\">配合 TypeScript 使用 Vue<a>。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/scaling-up/tooling.html", "title": "工具链 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "ee5cdba9170a4aafb92b996a7a48354b", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 305, "chunk_index": 6, "_doc_id": "6_6257349486169924598"}}
{"doc_id": "7_1035897951101773801", "text": "#typescript\">​<a><h2><p>具体细节请参考章节：<a href=\"/guide/typescript/overview.html\">配合 TypeScript 使用 Vue<a>。<p><h2 id=\"testing\">测试 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#testing\">​<a><h2><p>具体细节请参考章节：<a href=\"/guide/scaling-up/testing.html\">测试指南<a>。<p><ul><li><p><a href=\"https://www.cypress.io/\" target=\"_blank\">Cypress<a> 推荐用于 E2E 测试。也可以通过 <a href=\"https://docs.cypress.io/guides/component-testing/introduction\" target=\"_blank\">Cypress 组件测试运行器<a>来给 Vue 单文件组件作单文件组件测试。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/scaling-up/tooling.html", "title": "工具链 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "ee5cdba9170a4aafb92b996a7a48354b", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 305, "chunk_index": 7, "_doc_id": "7_1035897951101773801"}}
{"doc_id": "8_533107716899957824", "text": "ss.io/guides/component-testing/introduction\" target=\"_blank\">Cypress 组件测试运行器<a>来给 Vue 单文件组件作单文件组件测试。<p><li><li><p><a href=\"https://vitest.dev/\" target=\"_blank\">Vitest<a> 是一个追求更快运行速度的测试运行器，由 Vue / Vite 团队成员开发。主要针对基于 Vite 的应用设计，可以为组件提供即时响应的测试反馈。<p><li><li><p><a href=\"https://jestjs.io/\" target=\"_blank\">Jest<a> 可以通过 <a href=\"https://github.com/sodatea/vite-jest\" target=\"_blank\">vite-jest<a> 配合 Vite 使用。不过只推荐在你已经有一套基于 Jest 的测试集、且想要迁移到基于 Vite 的开发配置时使用，因为 Vitest 也能够提供类似的功能，且后者与 Vite 的集成更方便高效。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/scaling-up/tooling.html", "title": "工具链 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "ee5cdba9170a4aafb92b996a7a48354b", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 305, "chunk_index": 8, "_doc_id": "8_533107716899957824"}}
{"doc_id": "9_4647244664851778036", "text": "配合 Vite 使用。不过只推荐在你已经有一套基于 Jest 的测试集、且想要迁移到基于 Vite 的开发配置时使用，因为 Vitest 也能够提供类似的功能，且后者与 Vite 的集成更方便高效。<p><li><ul><h2 id=\"linting\">代码规范 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#linting\">​<a><h2><p>Vue 团队维护着 <a href=\"https://github.com/vuejs/eslint-plugin-vue\" target=\"_blank\">eslint-plugin-vue<a> 项目，它是一个 <a href=\"https://eslint.org/\" target=\"_blank\">ESLint<a> 插件，会提供单文件组件相关规则的定义。<p><p>之前使用 Vue CLI 的用户可能习惯于通过 webpack loader 来配置规范检查器。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/scaling-up/tooling.html", "title": "工具链 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "ee5cdba9170a4aafb92b996a7a48354b", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 305, "chunk_index": 9, "_doc_id": "9_4647244664851778036"}}
{"doc_id": "10_8461260261176732768", "text": "target=\"_blank\">ESLint<a> 插件，会提供单文件组件相关规则的定义。<p><p>之前使用 Vue CLI 的用户可能习惯于通过 webpack loader 来配置规范检查器。然而，若基于 Vite 构建，我们一般推荐：<p><ol><li><p><code>npm install -D eslint eslint-plugin-vue<code>，然后遵照 <code>eslint-plugin-vue<code> 的<a href=\"https://eslint.vuejs.org/user-guide/#usage\" target=\"_blank\">指引<a>进行配置。<p><li><li><p>启用 ESLint IDE 插件，比如 <a href=\"https://marketplace.visualstudio.com/items?itemName=dbaeumer.vscode-eslint\" target=\"_blank\">ESLint for VS Code<a>，然后你就可以在开发时获得规范检查器的反馈。这同时也避免了启动开发服务器时不必要的规范检查。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/scaling-up/tooling.html", "title": "工具链 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "ee5cdba9170a4aafb92b996a7a48354b", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 305, "chunk_index": 10, "_doc_id": "10_8461260261176732768"}}
{"doc_id": "11_8557585091975594236", "text": "r.vscode-eslint\" target=\"_blank\">ESLint for VS Code<a>，然后你就可以在开发时获得规范检查器的反馈。这同时也避免了启动开发服务器时不必要的规范检查。<p><li><li><p>将 ESLint 格式检查作为一个生产构建的步骤，保证你可以在最终打包时获得完整的规范检查反馈。<p><li><li><p>(可选) 启用类似 <a href=\"https://github.com/okonet/lint-staged\" target=\"_blank\">lint-staged<a> 一类的工具在 git commit 提交时自动执行规范检查。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/scaling-up/tooling.html", "title": "工具链 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "ee5cdba9170a4aafb92b996a7a48354b", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 305, "chunk_index": 11, "_doc_id": "11_8557585091975594236"}}
{"doc_id": "12_188598488424187596", "text": "https://github.com/okonet/lint-staged\" target=\"_blank\">lint-staged<a> 一类的工具在 git commit 提交时自动执行规范检查。<p><li><ol><h2 id=\"formatting\">格式化 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#formatting\">​<a><h2><h2 id=\"sfc-custom-block-integrations\">单文件组件自定义块集成 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#sfc-custom-block-integrations\">​<a><h2><p>自定义块被编译成导入到同一 Vue 文件的不同请求查询。这取决于底层构建工具如何处理这类导入请求。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/scaling-up/tooling.html", "title": "工具链 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "ee5cdba9170a4aafb92b996a7a48354b", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 305, "chunk_index": 12, "_doc_id": "12_188598488424187596"}}
{"doc_id": "13_1782505880171250790", "text": "\" href=\"#sfc-custom-block-integrations\">​<a><h2><p>自定义块被编译成导入到同一 Vue 文件的不同请求查询。这取决于底层构建工具如何处理这类导入请求。<p><h2 id=\"lower-level-packages\">底层库 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#lower-level-packages\">​<a><h2><h3 id=\"vue-compiler-sfc\"><code>@vue/compiler-sfc<code> <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#vue-compiler-sfc\">​<a><h3><p>这个包是 Vue 核心 monorepo 的一部分，并始终和 <code>vue<code> 主包版本号保持一致。它已经成为 <code>vue<code> 主包的一个依赖并代理到了 <code>vue/compiler-sfc<code> 目录下，因此你无需单独安装它。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/scaling-up/tooling.html", "title": "工具链 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "ee5cdba9170a4aafb92b996a7a48354b", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 305, "chunk_index": 13, "_doc_id": "13_1782505880171250790"}}
{"doc_id": "14_8016246418075659930", "text": ">vue<code> 主包版本号保持一致。它已经成为 <code>vue<code> 主包的一个依赖并代理到了 <code>vue/compiler-sfc<code> 目录下，因此你无需单独安装它。<p><p>这个包本身提供了处理 Vue 单文件组件的底层的功能，并只适用于需要支持 Vue 单文件组件相关工具链的开发者。<p><div class=\"tip custom-block\"><p class=\"custom-block-title\">TIP<p><p>请始终选择通过 <code>vue/compiler-sfc<code> 的深度导入来使用这个包，因为这样可以确保其与 Vue 运行时版本同步。<p><div><h3 id=\"vitejs-plugin-vue\"><code>@vitejs/plugin-vue<code> <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#vitejs-plugin-vue\">​<a><h3><p>为 Vite 提供 Vue 单文件组件支持的官方插件。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/scaling-up/tooling.html", "title": "工具链 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "ee5cdba9170a4aafb92b996a7a48354b", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 305, "chunk_index": 14, "_doc_id": "14_8016246418075659930"}}
{"doc_id": "15_3821344556873396901", "text": "-vue<code> <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#vitejs-plugin-vue\">​<a><h3><p>为 Vite 提供 Vue 单文件组件支持的官方插件。<p><h3 id=\"vue-loader\"><code>vue-loader<code> <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#vue-loader\">​<a><h3><p>为 webpack 提供 Vue 单文件组件支持的官方 loader。如果你正在使用 Vue CLI，也可以看看<a href=\"https://cli.vuejs.org/zh/guide/webpack.html#%E4%BF%AE%E6%94%B9-loader-%E9%80%89%E9%A1%B9\" target=\"_blank\">如何在 Vue CLI 中更改 <code>vue-loader<code> 选项的文档<a>。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/scaling-up/tooling.html", "title": "工具链 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "ee5cdba9170a4aafb92b996a7a48354b", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 305, "chunk_index": 15, "_doc_id": "15_3821344556873396901"}}
{"doc_id": "16_1543186519161528913", "text": "E6%94%B9-loader-%E9%80%89%E9%A1%B9\" target=\"_blank\">如何在 Vue CLI 中更改 <code>vue-loader<code> 选项的文档<a>。<p><h2 id=\"other-online-playgrounds\">其他在线演练场 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#other-online-playgrounds\">​<a><h2><div><div>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/scaling-up/tooling.html", "title": "工具链 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "ee5cdba9170a4aafb92b996a7a48354b", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 305, "chunk_index": 16, "_doc_id": "16_1543186519161528913"}}
{"doc_id": "0_3570151000554450431", "text": "<div><div><h1 id=\"reactivity-fundamentals\">响应式基础 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#reactivity-fundamentals\">​<a><h1><div class=\"tip custom-block\"><p class=\"custom-block-title\">API 参考<p><p>本页和后面很多页面中都分别包含了选项式 API 和组合式 API 的示例代码。现在你选择的是 <span class=\"options-api\">选项式 API<span><span class=\"composition-api\">组合式 API<span>。你可以使用左侧侧边栏顶部的“API 风格偏好”开关在 API 风格之间切换。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/reactivity-fundamentals.html", "title": "响应式基础", "doc_id": "eecacb073fb44a328c83c77868f3472d", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1619, "chunk_index": 0, "_doc_id": "0_3570151000554450431"}}
{"doc_id": "1_4285707292777933288", "text": "api\">选项式 API<span><span class=\"composition-api\">组合式 API<span>。你可以使用左侧侧边栏顶部的“API 风格偏好”开关在 API 风格之间切换。<p><div><div class=\"options-api\"><h2 id=\"declaring-reactive-state\">声明响应式状态 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#declaring-reactive-state\">​<a><h2><p>选用选项式 API 时，会用 <code>data<code> 选项来声明组件的响应式状态。此选项的值应为返回一个对象的函数。Vue 将在创建新组件实例的时候调用此函数，并将函数返回的对象用响应式系统进行包装。此对象的所有顶层属性都会被代理到组件实例 (即方法和生命周期钩子中的 <code>this<code>) 上。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/reactivity-fundamentals.html", "title": "响应式基础", "doc_id": "eecacb073fb44a328c83c77868f3472d", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1619, "chunk_index": 1, "_doc_id": "1_4285707292777933288"}}
{"doc_id": "2_296302117613639386", "text": "函数。Vue 将在创建新组件实例的时候调用此函数，并将函数返回的对象用响应式系统进行包装。此对象的所有顶层属性都会被代理到组件实例 (即方法和生命周期钩子中的 <code>this<code>) 上。<p><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line highlighted\"><span> data<span><span>() {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line highlighted\"><span> return<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line highlighted\"><span> count: <span><span>1<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/reactivity-fundamentals.html", "title": "响应式基础", "doc_id": "eecacb073fb44a328c83c77868f3472d", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1619, "chunk_index": 2, "_doc_id": "2_296302117613639386"}}
{"doc_id": "3_3130083502027602715", "text": "rn<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line highlighted\"><span> count: <span><span>1<span><span>\n<span class=\"line highlighted\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line highlighted\"><span> },<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // `mounted` 是生命周期钩子，之后我们会讲到<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> mounted<span><span>() {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // `this` 指向当前组件实例<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/reactivity-fundamentals.html", "title": "响应式基础", "doc_id": "eecacb073fb44a328c83c77868f3472d", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1619, "chunk_index": 3, "_doc_id": "3_3130083502027602715"}}
{"doc_id": "4_1443926754256026523", "text": "<span> mounted<span><span>() {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // `this` 指向当前组件实例<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> console.<span><span>log<span><span>(<span><span>this<span><span>.count) <span><span>// => 1<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 数据属性也可以被更改<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> this<span><span>.count <span><span>=<span><span> 2<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/reactivity-fundamentals.html", "title": "响应式基础", "doc_id": "eecacb073fb44a328c83c77868f3472d", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1619, "chunk_index": 4, "_doc_id": "4_1443926754256026523"}}
{"doc_id": "5_8652568874845460149", "text": "s<span><span>.count <span><span>=<span><span> 2<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span><code><pre><div><p><a href=\"https://play.vuejs.org/#\" target=\"_blank\">在演练场中尝试一下<a><p><p>这些实例上的属性仅在实例首次创建时被添加，因此你需要确保它们都出现在 <code>data<code> 函数返回的对象上。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/reactivity-fundamentals.html", "title": "响应式基础", "doc_id": "eecacb073fb44a328c83c77868f3472d", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1619, "chunk_index": 5, "_doc_id": "5_8652568874845460149"}}
{"doc_id": "6_1085799064057047567", "text": "yI=\" target=\"_blank\">在演练场中尝试一下<a><p><p>这些实例上的属性仅在实例首次创建时被添加，因此你需要确保它们都出现在 <code>data<code> 函数返回的对象上。若所需的值还未准备好，在必要时也可以使用 <code>null<code>、<code>undefined<code> 或者其他一些值占位。<p><p>虽然也可以不在 <code>data<code> 上定义，直接向组件实例添加新属性，但这个属性将无法触发响应式更新。<p><p>Vue 在组件实例上暴露的内置 API 使用 <code>$<code> 作为前缀。它同时也为内部属性保留 <code>_<code> 前缀。因此，你应该避免在顶层 <code>data<code> 上使用任何以这些字符作前缀的属性。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/reactivity-fundamentals.html", "title": "响应式基础", "doc_id": "eecacb073fb44a328c83c77868f3472d", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1619, "chunk_index": 6, "_doc_id": "6_1085799064057047567"}}
{"doc_id": "7_6665763013256584193", "text": "PI 使用 <code>$<code> 作为前缀。它同时也为内部属性保留 <code>_<code> 前缀。因此，你应该避免在顶层 <code>data<code> 上使用任何以这些字符作前缀的属性。<p><h3 id=\"reactive-proxy-vs-original\">响应式代理 vs. 原始值 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#reactive-proxy-vs-original\">​<a><h3><p>在 Vue 3 中，数据是基于 <a href=\"https://developer.mozilla.org/zh-CN/docs/Web/JavaScript/Reference/Global_Objects/Proxy\" target=\"_blank\">JavaScript Proxy (代理)<a> 实现响应式的。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/reactivity-fundamentals.html", "title": "响应式基础", "doc_id": "eecacb073fb44a328c83c77868f3472d", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1619, "chunk_index": 7, "_doc_id": "7_6665763013256584193"}}
{"doc_id": "8_5828007382849353736", "text": "docs/Web/JavaScript/Reference/Global_Objects/Proxy\" target=\"_blank\">JavaScript Proxy (代理)<a> 实现响应式的。使用过 Vue 2 的用户可能需要注意下面这样的边界情况：<p><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> data<span><span>() {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> return<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> someObject: {}<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/reactivity-fundamentals.html", "title": "响应式基础", "doc_id": "eecacb073fb44a328c83c77868f3472d", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1619, "chunk_index": 8, "_doc_id": "8_5828007382849353736"}}
{"doc_id": "9_2297425794022852602", "text": "\"line\"><span> return<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> someObject: {}<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> },<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> mounted<span><span>() {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> const<span><span> newObject<span><span> =<span><span> {}<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> this<span><span>.someObject <span><span>=<span><span> newObject<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/reactivity-fundamentals.html", "title": "响应式基础", "doc_id": "eecacb073fb44a328c83c77868f3472d", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1619, "chunk_index": 9, "_doc_id": "9_2297425794022852602"}}
{"doc_id": "10_594634454365026572", "text": "is<span><span>.someObject <span><span>=<span><span> newObject<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> console.<span><span>log<span><span>(newObject <span><span>===<span><span> this<span><span>.someObject) <span><span>// false<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span><code><pre><div><p>当你在赋值后再访问 <code>this.someObject<code>，此值已经是原来的 <code>newObject<code> 的一个响应式代理。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/reactivity-fundamentals.html", "title": "响应式基础", "doc_id": "eecacb073fb44a328c83c77868f3472d", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1619, "chunk_index": 10, "_doc_id": "10_594634454365026572"}}
{"doc_id": "11_5031788801837384868", "text": "an><code><pre><div><p>当你在赋值后再访问 <code>this.someObject<code>，此值已经是原来的 <code>newObject<code> 的一个响应式代理。<strong>与 Vue 2 不同的是，这里原始的 <code>newObject<code> 不会变为响应式：请确保始终通过 <code>this<code> 来访问响应式状态。<strong><p><div><div class=\"composition-api\"><h2 id=\"declaring-reactive-state-1\">声明响应式状态 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#declaring-reactive-state-1\">​<a><h2><h3 id=\"ref\"><code>ref()<code> <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#ref\">​<a><h3><p>在组合式 API 中，", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/reactivity-fundamentals.html", "title": "响应式基础", "doc_id": "eecacb073fb44a328c83c77868f3472d", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1619, "chunk_index": 11, "_doc_id": "11_5031788801837384868"}}
{"doc_id": "12_124585374127273506", "text": "\">​<a><h2><h3 id=\"ref\"><code>ref()<code> <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#ref\">​<a><h3><p>在组合式 API 中，推荐使用 <a href=\"/api/reactivity-core.html#ref\"><code>ref()<code><a> 函数来声明响应式状态：<p><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>import<span><span> { ref } <span><span>from<span><span> 'vue'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/reactivity-fundamentals.html", "title": "响应式基础", "doc_id": "eecacb073fb44a328c83c77868f3472d", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1619, "chunk_index": 12, "_doc_id": "12_124585374127273506"}}
{"doc_id": "13_7173021052555063265", "text": "import<span><span> { ref } <span><span>from<span><span> 'vue'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> count<span><span> =<span><span> ref<span><span>(<span><span>0<span><span>)<span><span><code><pre><div><p><code>ref()<code> 接收参数，并将其包裹在一个带有 <code>.value<code> 属性的 ref 对象中返回：<p><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> count<span><span> =<span><span> ref<span><span>(<span><span>0<span><span>)<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/reactivity-fundamentals.html", "title": "响应式基础", "doc_id": "eecacb073fb44a328c83c77868f3472d", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1619, "chunk_index": 13, "_doc_id": "13_7173021052555063265"}}
{"doc_id": "14_4838855586423087486", "text": "<span><span> count<span><span> =<span><span> ref<span><span>(<span><span>0<span><span>)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>console.<span><span>log<span><span>(count) <span><span>// { value: 0 }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>console.<span><span>log<span><span>(count.value) <span><span>// 0<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>count.value<span><span>++<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/reactivity-fundamentals.html", "title": "响应式基础", "doc_id": "eecacb073fb44a328c83c77868f3472d", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1619, "chunk_index": 14, "_doc_id": "14_4838855586423087486"}}
{"doc_id": "15_562580493285459848", "text": "pan><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>count.value<span><span>++<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>console.<span><span>log<span><span>(count.value) <span><span>// 1<span><span><code><pre><div><blockquote><p>参考：<a href=\"/guide/typescript/composition-api.html#typing-ref\">为 refs 标注类型<a> <p><blockquote><p>要在组件模板中访问 ref，请从组件的 <code>setup()<code> 函数中声明并返回它们：<p><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>import<span><span> { ref } <span><span>from<span><span> 'vue'<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/reactivity-fundamentals.html", "title": "响应式基础", "doc_id": "eecacb073fb44a328c83c77868f3472d", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1619, "chunk_index": 15, "_doc_id": "15_562580493285459848"}}
{"doc_id": "16_2959856932000548595", "text": "><span class=\"line\"><span>import<span><span> { ref } <span><span>from<span><span> 'vue'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // `setup` 是一个特殊的钩子，专门用于组合式 API。<span><span>\n<span class=\"line highlighted\"><span> setup<span><span>() {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> const<span><span> count<span><span> =<span><span> ref<span><span>(<span><span>0<span><span>)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/reactivity-fundamentals.html", "title": "响应式基础", "doc_id": "eecacb073fb44a328c83c77868f3472d", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1619, "chunk_index": 16, "_doc_id": "16_2959856932000548595"}}
{"doc_id": "17_8634966028728468880", "text": "pan> =<span><span> ref<span><span>(<span><span>0<span><span>)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 将 ref 暴露给模板<span><span>\n<span class=\"line highlighted\"><span> return<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line highlighted\"><span> count<span><span>\n<span class=\"line highlighted\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/reactivity-fundamentals.html", "title": "响应式基础", "doc_id": "eecacb073fb44a328c83c77868f3472d", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1619, "chunk_index": 17, "_doc_id": "17_8634966028728468880"}}
{"doc_id": "18_477151642126469988", "text": "><span>\n<span class=\"line highlighted\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span><code><pre><div><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>div<span><span>>{{ count }}</<span><span>div<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>注意，在模板中使用 ref 时，我们<strong>不<strong>需要附加 <code>.value<code>。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/reactivity-fundamentals.html", "title": "响应式基础", "doc_id": "eecacb073fb44a328c83c77868f3472d", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1619, "chunk_index": 18, "_doc_id": "18_477151642126469988"}}
{"doc_id": "19_6295880291615194941", "text": "an><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>注意，在模板中使用 ref 时，我们<strong>不<strong>需要附加 <code>.value<code>。为了方便起见，当在模板中使用时，ref 会自动解包 (有一些<a href=\"#caveat-when-unwrapping-in-templates\">注意事项<a>)。<p><p>你也可以直接在事件监听器中改变一个 ref：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line highlighted\"><span><<span><span>button<span><span> @<span><span>click<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>count<span><span>++<span><span>\"<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/reactivity-fundamentals.html", "title": "响应式基础", "doc_id": "eecacb073fb44a328c83c77868f3472d", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1619, "chunk_index": 19, "_doc_id": "19_6295880291615194941"}}
{"doc_id": "20_656799848309925137", "text": "lick<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>count<span><span>++<span><span>\"<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> {{ count }}<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>button<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>对于更复杂的逻辑，我们可以在同一作用域内声明更改 ref 的函数，并将它们作为方法与状态一起公开：<p><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>import<span><span> { ref } <span><span>from<span><span> 'vue'<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/reactivity-fundamentals.html", "title": "响应式基础", "doc_id": "eecacb073fb44a328c83c77868f3472d", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1619, "chunk_index": 20, "_doc_id": "20_656799848309925137"}}
{"doc_id": "21_7379941025504502655", "text": "><span class=\"line\"><span>import<span><span> { ref } <span><span>from<span><span> 'vue'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> setup<span><span>() {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> const<span><span> count<span><span> =<span><span> ref<span><span>(<span><span>0<span><span>)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/reactivity-fundamentals.html", "title": "响应式基础", "doc_id": "eecacb073fb44a328c83c77868f3472d", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1619, "chunk_index": 21, "_doc_id": "21_7379941025504502655"}}
{"doc_id": "22_794204439799131582", "text": "pan> =<span><span> ref<span><span>(<span><span>0<span><span>)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line highlighted\"><span> function<span><span> increment<span><span>() {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line highlighted\"><span> // 在 JavaScript 中需要 .value<span><span>\n<span class=\"line highlighted\"><span> count.value<span><span>++<span><span>\n<span class=\"line highlighted\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 不要忘记同时暴露 increment 函数<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/reactivity-fundamentals.html", "title": "响应式基础", "doc_id": "eecacb073fb44a328c83c77868f3472d", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1619, "chunk_index": 22, "_doc_id": "22_794204439799131582"}}
{"doc_id": "23_8425114941368180873", "text": "pan><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 不要忘记同时暴露 increment 函数<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> return<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> count,<span><span>\n<span class=\"line highlighted\"><span> increment<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/reactivity-fundamentals.html", "title": "响应式基础", "doc_id": "eecacb073fb44a328c83c77868f3472d", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1619, "chunk_index": 23, "_doc_id": "23_8425114941368180873"}}
{"doc_id": "24_6231756711612977405", "text": "crement<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span><code><pre><div><p>然后，暴露的方法可以被用作事件监听器：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line highlighted\"><span><<span><span>button<span><span> @<span><span>click<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>increment<span><span>\"<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> {{ count }}<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/reactivity-fundamentals.html", "title": "响应式基础", "doc_id": "eecacb073fb44a328c83c77868f3472d", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1619, "chunk_index": 24, "_doc_id": "24_6231756711612977405"}}
{"doc_id": "25_2162302265299533955", "text": "n>increment<span><span>\"<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> {{ count }}<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>button<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>这里是 <a href=\"https://codepen.io/vuejs-examples/pen/WNYbaqo\" target=\"_blank\">Codepen<a> 上的例子，没有使用任何构建工具。<p><h3 id=\"script-setup\"><code><script setup><code> <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#script-setup\">​<a><h3><p>在 <code>setup()<code> 函数中手动暴露大量的状态和方法非常繁琐。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/reactivity-fundamentals.html", "title": "响应式基础", "doc_id": "eecacb073fb44a328c83c77868f3472d", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1619, "chunk_index": 25, "_doc_id": "25_2162302265299533955"}}
{"doc_id": "26_4136105692260126616", "text": "<a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#script-setup\">​<a><h3><p>在 <code>setup()<code> 函数中手动暴露大量的状态和方法非常繁琐。幸运的是，我们可以通过使用<a href=\"/guide/scaling-up/sfc.html\">单文件组件 (SFC)<a> 来避免这种情况。我们可以使用 <code><script setup><code> 来大幅度地简化代码：<p><div class=\"language-vue\"> <span class=\"lang\">vue<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line highlighted\"><span><<span><span>script<span><span> setup<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/reactivity-fundamentals.html", "title": "响应式基础", "doc_id": "eecacb073fb44a328c83c77868f3472d", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1619, "chunk_index": 26, "_doc_id": "26_4136105692260126616"}}
{"doc_id": "27_7567050404190594562", "text": "<span class=\"line highlighted\"><span><<span><span>script<span><span> setup<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>import<span><span> { ref } <span><span>from<span><span> 'vue'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> count<span><span> =<span><span> ref<span><span>(<span><span>0<span><span>)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>function<span><span> increment<span><span>() {<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/reactivity-fundamentals.html", "title": "响应式基础", "doc_id": "eecacb073fb44a328c83c77868f3472d", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1619, "chunk_index": 27, "_doc_id": "27_7567050404190594562"}}
{"doc_id": "28_1713736486623848395", "text": "s=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>function<span><span> increment<span><span>() {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> count.value<span><span>++<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>script<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>button<span><span> @click<span><span>=<span><span>\"increment\"<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/reactivity-fundamentals.html", "title": "响应式基础", "doc_id": "eecacb073fb44a328c83c77868f3472d", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1619, "chunk_index": 28, "_doc_id": "28_1713736486623848395"}}
{"doc_id": "29_4923459022992782519", "text": "<<span><span>button<span><span> @click<span><span>=<span><span>\"increment\"<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> {{ count }}<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> </<span><span>button<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/reactivity-fundamentals.html", "title": "响应式基础", "doc_id": "eecacb073fb44a328c83c77868f3472d", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1619, "chunk_index": 29, "_doc_id": "29_4923459022992782519"}}
{"doc_id": "30_5125661711777699259", "text": "an> {{ count }}<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> </<span><span>button<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p><a href=\"https://play.vuejs.org/#eNo9jUEKgzAQRa8yZKMiaNcllvYe2dgwQqiZhDhxE3L3jrW4/DPvv1/UK8Zhz6juSm82uciwIef4MOR8DImhQMIFKiwpeGgEbQwZsoE2BhsyMUwH0d66475ksuwCgSOb0CNx20ExBCc77POase8NVUN6PBdlSwKjj+vMKAlAvzOzWJ52dfYzGXXpjPoBAKX856uopDGeFfnq8XKp+gWq4FAi\" target=\"_blank\">在演练场中尝试一下<a><p><p><code><script setup><code> 中的顶层的导入、声明的变量和函数可在同一组件的模板中直接使用。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/reactivity-fundamentals.html", "title": "响应式基础", "doc_id": "eecacb073fb44a328c83c77868f3472d", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1619, "chunk_index": 30, "_doc_id": "30_5125661711777699259"}}
{"doc_id": "31_6595469508733404184", "text": "Wq4FAi\" target=\"_blank\">在演练场中尝试一下<a><p><p><code><script setup><code> 中的顶层的导入、声明的变量和函数可在同一组件的模板中直接使用。你可以理解为模板是在同一作用域内声明的一个 JavaScript 函数——它自然可以访问与它一起声明的所有内容。<p><div class=\"tip custom-block\"><p class=\"custom-block-title\">TIP<p><p>在指南的后续章节中，我们基本上都会在组合式 API 示例中使用单文件组件 + <code><script setup><code> 的语法，因为大多数 Vue 开发者都会这样使用。<p><p>如果你没有使用单文件组件，你仍然可以在 <a href=\"/api/composition-api-setup.html\"><code>setup()<code><a> 选项中使用组合式 API。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/reactivity-fundamentals.html", "title": "响应式基础", "doc_id": "eecacb073fb44a328c83c77868f3472d", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1619, "chunk_index": 31, "_doc_id": "31_6595469508733404184"}}
{"doc_id": "32_8115472930559512047", "text": "p>如果你没有使用单文件组件，你仍然可以在 <a href=\"/api/composition-api-setup.html\"><code>setup()<code><a> 选项中使用组合式 API。<p><div><h3 id=\"why-refs\">为什么要使用 ref？ <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#why-refs\">​<a><h3><p>你可能会好奇：为什么我们需要使用带有 <code>.value<code> 的 ref，而不是普通的变量？为了解释这一点，我们需要简单地讨论一下 Vue 的响应式系统是如何工作的。<p><p>当你在模板中使用了一个 ref，然后改变了这个 ref 的值时，Vue 会自动检测到这个变化，并且相应地更新 DOM。这是通过一个基于依赖追踪的响应式系统实现的。当一个组件首次渲染时，Vue 会<strong>追踪<strong>在渲染过程中使用的每一个 ref。然后，当一个 ref 被修改时，它会<strong>触发<strong>追踪它的组件的一次重新渲染。<p><p>在标准的 JavaScript 中，检测普通变量的访问或修改是行不通的。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/reactivity-fundamentals.html", "title": "响应式基础", "doc_id": "eecacb073fb44a328c83c77868f3472d", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1619, "chunk_index": 32, "_doc_id": "32_8115472930559512047"}}
{"doc_id": "33_2542215316325867300", "text": "每一个 ref。然后，当一个 ref 被修改时，它会<strong>触发<strong>追踪它的组件的一次重新渲染。<p><p>在标准的 JavaScript 中，检测普通变量的访问或修改是行不通的。然而，我们可以通过 getter 和 setter 方法来拦截对象属性的 get 和 set 操作。<p><p>该 <code>.value<code> 属性给予了 Vue 一个机会来检测 ref 何时被访问或修改。在其内部，Vue 在它的 getter 中执行追踪，在它的 setter 中执行触发。从概念上讲，你可以将 ref 看作是一个像这样的对象：<p><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// 伪代码，不是真正的实现<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/reactivity-fundamentals.html", "title": "响应式基础", "doc_id": "eecacb073fb44a328c83c77868f3472d", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1619, "chunk_index": 33, "_doc_id": "33_2542215316325867300"}}
{"doc_id": "34_6731274998268812842", "text": "an><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// 伪代码，不是真正的实现<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> myRef<span><span> =<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> _value: <span><span>0<span><span>,<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> get<span><span> value<span><span>() {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> track<span><span>()<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> return<span><span> this<span><span>._value<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/reactivity-fundamentals.html", "title": "响应式基础", "doc_id": "eecacb073fb44a328c83c77868f3472d", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1619, "chunk_index": 34, "_doc_id": "34_6731274998268812842"}}
{"doc_id": "35_8768362080450548467", "text": "pan>()<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> return<span><span> this<span><span>._value<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> },<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> set<span><span> value<span><span>(<span><span>newValue<span><span>) {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> this<span><span>._value <span><span>=<span><span> newValue<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> trigger<span><span>()<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/reactivity-fundamentals.html", "title": "响应式基础", "doc_id": "eecacb073fb44a328c83c77868f3472d", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1619, "chunk_index": 35, "_doc_id": "35_8768362080450548467"}}
{"doc_id": "36_6693554926121556931", "text": "<span class=\"line\"><span> trigger<span><span>()<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span><code><pre><div><p>另一个 ref 的好处是，与普通变量不同，你可以将 ref 传递给函数，同时保留对最新值和响应式连接的访问。当将复杂的逻辑重构为可重用的代码时，这将非常有用。<p><p>该响应性系统在<a href=\"/guide/extras/reactivity-in-depth.html\">深入响应式系统<a>章节中有更详细的讨论。<p><div><div class=\"options-api\"><h2 id=\"declaring-methods\">声明方法 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#declaring-methods\">​<a><h2><p>要为组件添加方法，我们需要用到 <code>methods<code> 选项。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/reactivity-fundamentals.html", "title": "响应式基础", "doc_id": "eecacb073fb44a328c83c77868f3472d", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1619, "chunk_index": 36, "_doc_id": "36_6693554926121556931"}}
{"doc_id": "37_5578616520549832529", "text": "a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#declaring-methods\">​<a><h2><p>要为组件添加方法，我们需要用到 <code>methods<code> 选项。它应该是一个包含所有方法的对象：<p><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> data<span><span>() {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> return<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> count: <span><span>0<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/reactivity-fundamentals.html", "title": "响应式基础", "doc_id": "eecacb073fb44a328c83c77868f3472d", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1619, "chunk_index": 37, "_doc_id": "37_5578616520549832529"}}
{"doc_id": "38_6198132194265773222", "text": "<span class=\"line\"><span> count: <span><span>0<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> },<span><span>\n<span class=\"line highlighted\"><span> methods: {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line highlighted\"><span> increment<span><span>() {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line highlighted\"><span> this<span><span>.count<span><span>++<span><span>\n<span class=\"line highlighted\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line highlighted\"><span> },<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/reactivity-fundamentals.html", "title": "响应式基础", "doc_id": "eecacb073fb44a328c83c77868f3472d", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1619, "chunk_index": 38, "_doc_id": "38_6198132194265773222"}}
{"doc_id": "39_1654250374675806102", "text": "class=\"line highlighted\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line highlighted\"><span> },<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> mounted<span><span>() {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 在其他方法或是生命周期中也可以调用方法<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> this<span><span>.<span><span>increment<span><span>()<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/reactivity-fundamentals.html", "title": "响应式基础", "doc_id": "eecacb073fb44a328c83c77868f3472d", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1619, "chunk_index": 39, "_doc_id": "39_1654250374675806102"}}
{"doc_id": "40_743138601942614996", "text": "span><span>.<span><span>increment<span><span>()<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span><code><pre><div><p>Vue 自动为 <code>methods<code> 中的方法绑定了永远指向组件实例的 <code>this<code>。这确保了方法在作为事件监听器或回调函数时始终保持正确的 <code>this<code>。你不应该在定义 <code>methods<code> 时使用箭头函数，因为箭头函数没有自己的 <code>this<code> 上下文。<p><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/reactivity-fundamentals.html", "title": "响应式基础", "doc_id": "eecacb073fb44a328c83c77868f3472d", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1619, "chunk_index": 40, "_doc_id": "40_743138601942614996"}}
{"doc_id": "41_2308354468593016612", "text": "b-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> methods: {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> increment<span><span>: () <span><span>=><span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 反例：无法访问此处的 `this`!<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span><code><pre><div><p>和组件实例上的其他属性一样，方法也可以在模板上被访问。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/reactivity-fundamentals.html", "title": "响应式基础", "doc_id": "eecacb073fb44a328c83c77868f3472d", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1619, "chunk_index": 41, "_doc_id": "41_2308354468593016612"}}
{"doc_id": "42_6991233998243711930", "text": "> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span><code><pre><div><p>和组件实例上的其他属性一样，方法也可以在模板上被访问。在模板中它们常常被用作事件监听器：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>button<span><span> @<span><span>click<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>increment<span><span>\"<span><span>>{{ count }}</<span><span>button<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p><a href=\"https://play.vuejs.", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/reactivity-fundamentals.html", "title": "响应式基础", "doc_id": "eecacb073fb44a328c83c77868f3472d", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1619, "chunk_index": 42, "_doc_id": "42_6991233998243711930"}}
{"doc_id": "43_2750493967941912444", "text": "count }}</<span><span>button<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p><a href=\"https://play.vuejs.org/#eNplj9EKwyAMRX8l+LSx0e65uLL9hy+dZlTWqtg4BuK/z1baDgZicsPJgUR2d656B2QN45P02lErDH6c9QQKn10YCKIwAKqj7nAsPYBHCt6sCUDaYKiBS8lpLuk8/yNSb9XUrKg20uOIhnYXAPV6qhbF6fRvmOeodn6hfzwLKkx+vN5OyIFwdENHmBMAfwQia+AmBy1fV8E2gWBtjOUASInXBcxLvN4MLH0BCe1i4Q==\" target=\"_blank\">在演练场中尝试一下<a><p><p>在上面的例子中，<code>increment<code> 方法会在 <code><button><code> 被点击时调用。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/reactivity-fundamentals.html", "title": "响应式基础", "doc_id": "eecacb073fb44a328c83c77868f3472d", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1619, "chunk_index": 43, "_doc_id": "43_2750493967941912444"}}
{"doc_id": "44_2796450488856337183", "text": "=\" target=\"_blank\">在演练场中尝试一下<a><p><p>在上面的例子中，<code>increment<code> 方法会在 <code><button><code> 被点击时调用。<p><div><h3 id=\"deep-reactivity\">深层响应性 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#deep-reactivity\">​<a><h3><div class=\"options-api\"><p>在 Vue 中，默认情况下，状态是深度响应的。这意味着当改变嵌套对象或数组时，这些变化也会被检测到：<p><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> data<span><span>() {<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/reactivity-fundamentals.html", "title": "响应式基础", "doc_id": "eecacb073fb44a328c83c77868f3472d", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1619, "chunk_index": 44, "_doc_id": "44_2796450488856337183"}}
{"doc_id": "45_5645469343777659287", "text": "<span> default<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> data<span><span>() {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> return<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> obj: {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> nested: { count: <span><span>0<span><span> },<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> arr: [<span><span>'foo'<span><span>, <span><span>'bar'<span><span>]<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/reactivity-fundamentals.html", "title": "响应式基础", "doc_id": "eecacb073fb44a328c83c77868f3472d", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1619, "chunk_index": 45, "_doc_id": "45_5645469343777659287"}}
{"doc_id": "46_2693089106610546374", "text": "<span>]<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> },<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> methods: {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> mutateDeeply<span><span>() {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 以下都会按照期望工作<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> this<span><span>.obj.nested.count<span><span>++<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/reactivity-fundamentals.html", "title": "响应式基础", "doc_id": "eecacb073fb44a328c83c77868f3472d", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1619, "chunk_index": 46, "_doc_id": "46_2693089106610546374"}}
{"doc_id": "47_5689548827077005798", "text": "作<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> this<span><span>.obj.nested.count<span><span>++<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> this<span><span>.obj.arr.<span><span>push<span><span>(<span><span>'baz'<span><span>)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/reactivity-fundamentals.html", "title": "响应式基础", "doc_id": "eecacb073fb44a328c83c77868f3472d", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1619, "chunk_index": 47, "_doc_id": "47_5689548827077005798"}}
{"doc_id": "48_7660783178856935883", "text": "<span>)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span><code><pre><div><div><div class=\"composition-api\"><p>Ref 可以持有任何类型的值，包括深层嵌套的对象、数组或者 JavaScript 内置的数据结构，比如 <code>Map<code>。<p><p>Ref 会使它的值具有深层响应性。这意味着即使改变嵌套对象或数组时，变化也会被检测到：<p><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>import<span><span> { ref } <span><span>from<span><span> 'vue'<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/reactivity-fundamentals.html", "title": "响应式基础", "doc_id": "eecacb073fb44a328c83c77868f3472d", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1619, "chunk_index": 48, "_doc_id": "48_7660783178856935883"}}
{"doc_id": "49_1902687415745954718", "text": "><span class=\"line\"><span>import<span><span> { ref } <span><span>from<span><span> 'vue'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> obj<span><span> =<span><span> ref<span><span>({<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> nested: { count: <span><span>0<span><span> },<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> arr: [<span><span>'foo'<span><span>, <span><span>'bar'<span><span>]<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>})<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/reactivity-fundamentals.html", "title": "响应式基础", "doc_id": "eecacb073fb44a328c83c77868f3472d", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1619, "chunk_index": 49, "_doc_id": "49_1902687415745954718"}}
{"doc_id": "50_6573129769740290449", "text": "an>'bar'<span><span>]<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>})<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>function<span><span> mutateDeeply<span><span>() {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 以下都会按照期望工作<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> obj.value.nested.count<span><span>++<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> obj.value.arr.<span><span>push<span><span>(<span><span>'baz'<span><span>)<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/reactivity-fundamentals.html", "title": "响应式基础", "doc_id": "eecacb073fb44a328c83c77868f3472d", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1619, "chunk_index": 50, "_doc_id": "50_6573129769740290449"}}
{"doc_id": "51_1441282639663801857", "text": "\"line\"><span> obj.value.arr.<span><span>push<span><span>(<span><span>'baz'<span><span>)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span><code><pre><div><p>非原始值将通过 <a href=\"#reactive\"><code>reactive()<code><a> 转换为响应式代理，该函数将在后面讨论。<p><p>也可以通过 <a href=\"/api/reactivity-advanced.html#shallowref\">shallow ref<a> 来放弃深层响应性。对于浅层 ref，只有 <code>.value<code> 的访问会被追踪。浅层 ref 可以用于避免对大型数据的响应性开销来优化性能、或者有外部库管理其内部状态的情况。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/reactivity-fundamentals.html", "title": "响应式基础", "doc_id": "eecacb073fb44a328c83c77868f3472d", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1619, "chunk_index": 51, "_doc_id": "51_1441282639663801857"}}
{"doc_id": "52_8177961115470708524", "text": "f<a> 来放弃深层响应性。对于浅层 ref，只有 <code>.value<code> 的访问会被追踪。浅层 ref 可以用于避免对大型数据的响应性开销来优化性能、或者有外部库管理其内部状态的情况。<p><p>阅读更多：<p><div><h3 id=\"dom-update-timing\">DOM 更新时机 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#dom-update-timing\">​<a><h3><p>当你修改了响应式状态时，DOM 会被自动更新。但是需要注意的是，DOM 更新不是同步的。Vue 会在“next tick”更新周期中缓冲所有状态的修改，以确保不管你进行了多少次状态修改，每个组件都只会被更新一次。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/reactivity-fundamentals.html", "title": "响应式基础", "doc_id": "eecacb073fb44a328c83c77868f3472d", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1619, "chunk_index": 52, "_doc_id": "52_8177961115470708524"}}
{"doc_id": "53_1397718978214125990", "text": "应式状态时，DOM 会被自动更新。但是需要注意的是，DOM 更新不是同步的。Vue 会在“next tick”更新周期中缓冲所有状态的修改，以确保不管你进行了多少次状态修改，每个组件都只会被更新一次。<p><p>要等待 DOM 更新完成后再执行额外的代码，可以使用 <a href=\"/api/general.html#nexttick\">nextTick()<a> 全局 API：<p><div class=\"composition-api\"><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>import<span><span> { nextTick } <span><span>from<span><span> 'vue'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/reactivity-fundamentals.html", "title": "响应式基础", "doc_id": "eecacb073fb44a328c83c77868f3472d", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1619, "chunk_index": 53, "_doc_id": "53_1397718978214125990"}}
{"doc_id": "54_4839051003309454075", "text": "t<span><span> { nextTick } <span><span>from<span><span> 'vue'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>async<span><span> function<span><span> increment<span><span>() {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> count.value<span><span>++<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> await<span><span> nextTick<span><span>()<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 现在 DOM 已经更新了<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/reactivity-fundamentals.html", "title": "响应式基础", "doc_id": "eecacb073fb44a328c83c77868f3472d", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1619, "chunk_index": 54, "_doc_id": "54_4839051003309454075"}}
{"doc_id": "55_3147310053614699635", "text": "pan><span> nextTick<span><span>()<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 现在 DOM 已经更新了<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span><code><pre><div><div><div class=\"options-api\"><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>import<span><span> { nextTick } <span><span>from<span><span> 'vue'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/reactivity-fundamentals.html", "title": "响应式基础", "doc_id": "eecacb073fb44a328c83c77868f3472d", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1619, "chunk_index": 55, "_doc_id": "55_3147310053614699635"}}
{"doc_id": "56_5267951364263725317", "text": "n class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> methods: {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> async<span><span> increment<span><span>() {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> this<span><span>.count<span><span>++<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> await<span><span> nextTick<span><span>()<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 现在 DOM 已经更新了<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/reactivity-fundamentals.html", "title": "响应式基础", "doc_id": "eecacb073fb44a328c83c77868f3472d", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1619, "chunk_index": 56, "_doc_id": "56_5267951364263725317"}}
{"doc_id": "57_5480258613968316891", "text": "span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 现在 DOM 已经更新了<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/reactivity-fundamentals.html", "title": "响应式基础", "doc_id": "eecacb073fb44a328c83c77868f3472d", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1619, "chunk_index": 57, "_doc_id": "57_5480258613968316891"}}
{"doc_id": "58_5474045902212576748", "text": "M 已经更新了<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span><code><pre><div><div><div class=\"composition-api\"><h2 id=\"reactive\"><code>reactive()<code> <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#reactive\">​<a><h2><p>还有另一种声明响应式状态的方式，即使用 <code>reactive()<code> API。与将内部值包装在特殊对象中的 ref 不同，<code>reactive()<code> 将使对象本身具有响应性：<p><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>import<span><span> { reactive } <span><span>from<span><span> 'vue'<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/reactivity-fundamentals.html", "title": "响应式基础", "doc_id": "eecacb073fb44a328c83c77868f3472d", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1619, "chunk_index": 58, "_doc_id": "58_5474045902212576748"}}
{"doc_id": "59_778228012978716166", "text": "n class=\"line\"><span>import<span><span> { reactive } <span><span>from<span><span> 'vue'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> state<span><span> =<span><span> reactive<span><span>({ count: <span><span>0<span><span> })<span><span><code><pre><div><blockquote><p>参考：<a href=\"/guide/typescript/composition-api.", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/reactivity-fundamentals.html", "title": "响应式基础", "doc_id": "eecacb073fb44a328c83c77868f3472d", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1619, "chunk_index": 59, "_doc_id": "59_778228012978716166"}}
{"doc_id": "60_6870084752003812277", "text": "n><span> })<span><span><code><pre><div><blockquote><p>参考：<a href=\"/guide/typescript/composition-api.html#typing-reactive\">为 <code>reactive()<code> 标注类型<a> <p><blockquote><p>在模板中使用：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>button<span><span> @<span><span>click<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>state.count<span><span>++<span><span>\"<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/reactivity-fundamentals.html", "title": "响应式基础", "doc_id": "eecacb073fb44a328c83c77868f3472d", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1619, "chunk_index": 60, "_doc_id": "60_6870084752003812277"}}
{"doc_id": "61_5228140354846526934", "text": "pan><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>state.count<span><span>++<span><span>\"<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> {{ state.count }}<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>button<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>响应式对象是 <a href=\"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/JavaScript/Reference/Global_Objects/Proxy\" target=\"_blank\">JavaScript 代理<a>，其行为就和普通对象一样。不同的是，Vue 能够拦截对响应式对象所有属性的访问和修改，以便进行依赖追踪和触发更新。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/reactivity-fundamentals.html", "title": "响应式基础", "doc_id": "eecacb073fb44a328c83c77868f3472d", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1619, "chunk_index": 61, "_doc_id": "61_5228140354846526934"}}
{"doc_id": "62_1147155228110716341", "text": "cts/Proxy\" target=\"_blank\">JavaScript 代理<a>，其行为就和普通对象一样。不同的是，Vue 能够拦截对响应式对象所有属性的访问和修改，以便进行依赖追踪和触发更新。<p><p><code>reactive()<code> 将深层地转换对象：当访问嵌套对象时，它们也会被 <code>reactive()<code> 包装。当 ref 的值是一个对象时，<code>ref()<code> 也会在内部调用它。与浅层 ref 类似，这里也有一个 <a href=\"/api/reactivity-advanced.html#shallowreactive\"><code>shallowReactive()<code><a> API 可以选择退出深层响应性。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/reactivity-fundamentals.html", "title": "响应式基础", "doc_id": "eecacb073fb44a328c83c77868f3472d", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1619, "chunk_index": 62, "_doc_id": "62_1147155228110716341"}}
{"doc_id": "63_116019749435263080", "text": "ef=\"/api/reactivity-advanced.html#shallowreactive\"><code>shallowReactive()<code><a> API 可以选择退出深层响应性。<p><h3 id=\"reactive-proxy-vs-original-1\">Reactive Proxy vs. Original <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#reactive-proxy-vs-original-1\">​<a><h3><p>值得注意的是，<code>reactive()<code> 返回的是一个原始对象的 <a href=\"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/JavaScript/Reference/Global_Objects/Proxy\" target=\"_blank\">Proxy<a>，它和原始对象是不相等的：<p><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> raw<span><span> =<span><span> {}<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/reactivity-fundamentals.html", "title": "响应式基础", "doc_id": "eecacb073fb44a328c83c77868f3472d", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1619, "chunk_index": 63, "_doc_id": "63_116019749435263080"}}
{"doc_id": "64_5447516047066987055", "text": "code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> raw<span><span> =<span><span> {}<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> proxy<span><span> =<span><span> reactive<span><span>(raw)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 代理对象和原始对象不是全等的<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/reactivity-fundamentals.html", "title": "响应式基础", "doc_id": "eecacb073fb44a328c83c77868f3472d", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1619, "chunk_index": 64, "_doc_id": "64_5447516047066987055"}}
{"doc_id": "65_3361022164194218577", "text": ">(raw)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 代理对象和原始对象不是全等的<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>console.<span><span>log<span><span>(proxy <span><span>===<span><span> raw) <span><span>// false<span><span><code><pre><div><p>只有代理对象是响应式的，更改原始对象不会触发更新。因此，使用 Vue 的响应式系统的最佳实践是<strong>仅使用你声明对象的代理版本<strong>。<p><p>为保证访问代理的一致性，对同一个原始对象调用 <code>reactive()<code> 会总是返回同样的代理对象，而对一个已存在的代理对象调用 <code>reactive()<code> 会返回其本身：<p><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// 在同一个对象上调用 reactive() 会返回相同的代理<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/reactivity-fundamentals.html", "title": "响应式基础", "doc_id": "eecacb073fb44a328c83c77868f3472d", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1619, "chunk_index": 65, "_doc_id": "65_3361022164194218577"}}
{"doc_id": "66_1268520419194051947", "text": "ki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// 在同一个对象上调用 reactive() 会返回相同的代理<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>console.<span><span>log<span><span>(<span><span>reactive<span><span>(raw) <span><span>===<span><span> proxy) <span><span>// true<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 在一个代理上调用 reactive() 会返回它自己<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/reactivity-fundamentals.html", "title": "响应式基础", "doc_id": "eecacb073fb44a328c83c77868f3472d", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1619, "chunk_index": 66, "_doc_id": "66_1268520419194051947"}}
{"doc_id": "67_8409110211611791600", "text": "<span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 在一个代理上调用 reactive() 会返回它自己<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>console.<span><span>log<span><span>(<span><span>reactive<span><span>(proxy) <span><span>===<span><span> proxy) <span><span>// true<span><span><code><pre><div><p>这个规则对嵌套对象也适用。依靠深层响应性，响应式对象内的嵌套对象依然是代理：<p><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> proxy<span><span> =<span><span> reactive<span><span>({})<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/reactivity-fundamentals.html", "title": "响应式基础", "doc_id": "eecacb073fb44a328c83c77868f3472d", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1619, "chunk_index": 67, "_doc_id": "67_8409110211611791600"}}
{"doc_id": "68_7331354312539216884", "text": "\"line\"><span>const<span><span> proxy<span><span> =<span><span> reactive<span><span>({})<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> raw<span><span> =<span><span> {}<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>proxy.nested <span><span>=<span><span> raw<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>console.<span><span>log<span><span>(proxy.", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/reactivity-fundamentals.html", "title": "响应式基础", "doc_id": "eecacb073fb44a328c83c77868f3472d", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1619, "chunk_index": 68, "_doc_id": "68_7331354312539216884"}}
{"doc_id": "69_1035313487705994959", "text": "<span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>console.<span><span>log<span><span>(proxy.nested <span><span>===<span><span> raw) <span><span>// false<span><span><code><pre><div><h3 id=\"limitations-of-reactive\"><code>reactive()<code> 的局限性 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#limitations-of-reactive\">​<a><h3><p><code>reactive()<code> API 有一些局限性：<p><ol><li><p><strong>有限的值类型<strong>：它只能用于对象类型 (对象、数组和如 <code>Map<code>、<code>Set<code> 这样的<a href=\"https://developer.mozilla.", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/reactivity-fundamentals.html", "title": "响应式基础", "doc_id": "eecacb073fb44a328c83c77868f3472d", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1619, "chunk_index": 69, "_doc_id": "69_1035313487705994959"}}
{"doc_id": "70_563475844196147868", "text": "类型<strong>：它只能用于对象类型 (对象、数组和如 <code>Map<code>、<code>Set<code> 这样的<a href=\"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/JavaScript/Reference/Global_Objects#keyed_collections\" target=\"_blank\">集合类型<a>)。它不能持有如 <code>string<code>、<code>number<code> 或 <code>boolean<code> 这样的<a href=\"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Glossary/Primitive\" target=\"_blank\">原始类型<a>。<p><li><li><p><strong>不能替换整个对象<strong>：由于 Vue 的响应式跟踪是通过属性访问实现的，因此我们必须始终保持对响应式对象的相同引用。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/reactivity-fundamentals.html", "title": "响应式基础", "doc_id": "eecacb073fb44a328c83c77868f3472d", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1619, "chunk_index": 70, "_doc_id": "70_563475844196147868"}}
{"doc_id": "71_493816847522635205", "text": "blank\">原始类型<a>。<p><li><li><p><strong>不能替换整个对象<strong>：由于 Vue 的响应式跟踪是通过属性访问实现的，因此我们必须始终保持对响应式对象的相同引用。这意味着我们不能轻易地“替换”响应式对象，因为这样的话与第一个引用的响应性连接将丢失：<p><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>let<span><span> state <span><span>=<span><span> reactive<span><span>({ count: <span><span>0<span><span> })<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 上面的 ({ count: 0 }) 引用将不再被追踪<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/reactivity-fundamentals.html", "title": "响应式基础", "doc_id": "eecacb073fb44a328c83c77868f3472d", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1619, "chunk_index": 71, "_doc_id": "71_493816847522635205"}}
{"doc_id": "72_3957510707679440393", "text": "span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 上面的 ({ count: 0 }) 引用将不再被追踪<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// (响应性连接已丢失！)<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/reactivity-fundamentals.html", "title": "响应式基础", "doc_id": "eecacb073fb44a328c83c77868f3472d", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1619, "chunk_index": 72, "_doc_id": "72_3957510707679440393"}}
{"doc_id": "73_2651301991686434118", "text": "span>// 上面的 ({ count: 0 }) 引用将不再被追踪<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// (响应性连接已丢失！)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>state <span><span>=<span><span> reactive<span><span>({ count: <span><span>1<span><span> })<span><span><code><pre><div><li><li><p><strong>对解构操作不友好<strong>：当我们将响应式对象的原始类型属性解构为本地变量时，或者将该属性传递给函数时，我们将丢失响应性连接：<p><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> state<span><span> =<span><span> reactive<span><span>({ count: <span><span>0<span><span> })<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/reactivity-fundamentals.html", "title": "响应式基础", "doc_id": "eecacb073fb44a328c83c77868f3472d", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1619, "chunk_index": 73, "_doc_id": "73_2651301991686434118"}}
{"doc_id": "74_3801073224335681179", "text": "te<span><span> =<span><span> reactive<span><span>({ count: <span><span>0<span><span> })<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 当解构时，count 已经与 state.count 断开连接<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>let<span><span> { count } <span><span>=<span><span> state<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 不会影响原始的 state<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>count<span><span>++<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 该函数接收到的是一个普通的数字<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/reactivity-fundamentals.html", "title": "响应式基础", "doc_id": "eecacb073fb44a328c83c77868f3472d", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1619, "chunk_index": 74, "_doc_id": "74_3801073224335681179"}}
{"doc_id": "75_1076551758698761683", "text": "an>++<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 该函数接收到的是一个普通的数字<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 并且无法追踪 state.count 的变化<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 我们必须传入整个对象以保持响应性<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>callSomeFunction<span><span>(state.count)<span><span><code><pre><div><li><ol><p>由于这些限制，我们建议使用 <code>ref()<code> 作为声明响应式状态的主要 API。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/reactivity-fundamentals.html", "title": "响应式基础", "doc_id": "eecacb073fb44a328c83c77868f3472d", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1619, "chunk_index": 75, "_doc_id": "75_1076551758698761683"}}
{"doc_id": "76_7670602626293329478", "text": "state.count)<span><span><code><pre><div><li><ol><p>由于这些限制，我们建议使用 <code>ref()<code> 作为声明响应式状态的主要 API。<p><h2 id=\"additional-ref-unwrapping-details\">额外的 ref 解包细节 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#additional-ref-unwrapping-details\">​<a><h2><h3 id=\"ref-unwrapping-as-reactive-object-property\">作为 reactive 对象的属性 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#ref-unwrapping-as-reactive-object-property\">​<a><h3><p>一个 ref 会在作为响应式对象的属性被访问或修改时自动解包。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/reactivity-fundamentals.html", "title": "响应式基础", "doc_id": "eecacb073fb44a328c83c77868f3472d", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1619, "chunk_index": 76, "_doc_id": "76_7670602626293329478"}}
{"doc_id": "77_5937655557662152627", "text": "nchor\" href=\"#ref-unwrapping-as-reactive-object-property\">​<a><h3><p>一个 ref 会在作为响应式对象的属性被访问或修改时自动解包。换句话说，它的行为就像一个普通的属性：<p><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> count<span><span> =<span><span> ref<span><span>(<span><span>0<span><span>)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> state<span><span> =<span><span> reactive<span><span>({<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> count<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/reactivity-fundamentals.html", "title": "响应式基础", "doc_id": "eecacb073fb44a328c83c77868f3472d", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1619, "chunk_index": 77, "_doc_id": "77_5937655557662152627"}}
{"doc_id": "78_8890239294603355357", "text": "<span> =<span><span> reactive<span><span>({<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> count<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>})<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>console.<span><span>log<span><span>(state.count) <span><span>// 0<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>state.count <span><span>=<span><span> 1<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/reactivity-fundamentals.html", "title": "响应式基础", "doc_id": "eecacb073fb44a328c83c77868f3472d", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1619, "chunk_index": 78, "_doc_id": "78_8890239294603355357"}}
{"doc_id": "79_4888873307874698424", "text": "an class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>state.count <span><span>=<span><span> 1<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>console.<span><span>log<span><span>(count.value) <span><span>// 1<span><span><code><pre><div><p>如果将一个新的 ref 赋值给一个关联了已有 ref 的属性，那么它会替换掉旧的 ref：<p><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> otherCount<span><span> =<span><span> ref<span><span>(<span><span>2<span><span>)<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/reactivity-fundamentals.html", "title": "响应式基础", "doc_id": "eecacb073fb44a328c83c77868f3472d", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1619, "chunk_index": 79, "_doc_id": "79_4888873307874698424"}}
{"doc_id": "80_6394332739655957404", "text": "><span> otherCount<span><span> =<span><span> ref<span><span>(<span><span>2<span><span>)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>state.count <span><span>=<span><span> otherCount<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>console.<span><span>log<span><span>(state.count) <span><span>// 2<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 原始 ref 现在已经和 state.count 失去联系<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/reactivity-fundamentals.html", "title": "响应式基础", "doc_id": "eecacb073fb44a328c83c77868f3472d", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1619, "chunk_index": 80, "_doc_id": "80_6394332739655957404"}}
{"doc_id": "81_7285113295993370582", "text": "<span><span>// 2<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 原始 ref 现在已经和 state.count 失去联系<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>console.<span><span>log<span><span>(count.value) <span><span>// 1<span><span><code><pre><div><p>只有当嵌套在一个深层响应式对象内时，才会发生 ref 解包。当其作为<a href=\"/api/reactivity-advanced.html#shallowreactive\">浅层响应式对象<a>的属性被访问时不会解包。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/reactivity-fundamentals.html", "title": "响应式基础", "doc_id": "eecacb073fb44a328c83c77868f3472d", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1619, "chunk_index": 81, "_doc_id": "81_7285113295993370582"}}
{"doc_id": "82_1417214600449763909", "text": "式对象内时，才会发生 ref 解包。当其作为<a href=\"/api/reactivity-advanced.html#shallowreactive\">浅层响应式对象<a>的属性被访问时不会解包。<p><h3 id=\"caveat-in-arrays-and-collections\">数组和集合的注意事项 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#caveat-in-arrays-and-collections\">​<a><h3><p>与 reactive 对象不同的是，当 ref 作为响应式数组或原生集合类型 (如 <code>Map<code>) 中的元素被访问时，它<strong>不会<strong>被解包：<p><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> books<span><span> =<span><span> reactive<span><span>([<span><span>ref<span><span>(<span><span>'Vue 3 Guide'<span><span>)])<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/reactivity-fundamentals.html", "title": "响应式基础", "doc_id": "eecacb073fb44a328c83c77868f3472d", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1619, "chunk_index": 82, "_doc_id": "82_1417214600449763909"}}
{"doc_id": "83_2954635432054899536", "text": "ctive<span><span>([<span><span>ref<span><span>(<span><span>'Vue 3 Guide'<span><span>)])<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 这里需要 .value<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>console.<span><span>log<span><span>(books[<span><span>0<span><span>].value)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/reactivity-fundamentals.html", "title": "响应式基础", "doc_id": "eecacb073fb44a328c83c77868f3472d", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1619, "chunk_index": 83, "_doc_id": "83_2954635432054899536"}}
{"doc_id": "84_4104159563909524340", "text": "<span>log<span><span>(books[<span><span>0<span><span>].value)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> map<span><span> =<span><span> reactive<span><span>(<span><span>new<span><span> Map<span><span>([[<span><span>'count'<span><span>, <span><span>ref<span><span>(<span><span>0<span><span>)]]))<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 这里需要 .value<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/reactivity-fundamentals.html", "title": "响应式基础", "doc_id": "eecacb073fb44a328c83c77868f3472d", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1619, "chunk_index": 84, "_doc_id": "84_4104159563909524340"}}
{"doc_id": "85_8948404666472992201", "text": "pan>(<span><span>0<span><span>)]]))<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 这里需要 .value<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>console.<span><span>log<span><span>(map.<span><span>get<span><span>(<span><span>'count'<span><span>).value)<span><span><code><pre><div><h3 id=\"caveat-when-unwrapping-in-templates\">在模板中解包的注意事项 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#caveat-when-unwrapping-in-templates\">​<a><h3><p>在模板渲染上下文中，只有顶级的 ref 属性才会被解包。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/reactivity-fundamentals.html", "title": "响应式基础", "doc_id": "eecacb073fb44a328c83c77868f3472d", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1619, "chunk_index": 85, "_doc_id": "85_8948404666472992201"}}
{"doc_id": "86_5482234490790124572", "text": "=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#caveat-when-unwrapping-in-templates\">​<a><h3><p>在模板渲染上下文中，只有顶级的 ref 属性才会被解包。<p><p>在下面的例子中，<code>count<code> 和 <code>object<code> 是顶级属性，但 <code>object.id<code> 不是：<p><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> count<span><span> =<span><span> ref<span><span>(<span><span>0<span><span>)<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/reactivity-fundamentals.html", "title": "响应式基础", "doc_id": "eecacb073fb44a328c83c77868f3472d", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1619, "chunk_index": 86, "_doc_id": "86_5482234490790124572"}}
{"doc_id": "87_4914187055241797253", "text": "<span><span> count<span><span> =<span><span> ref<span><span>(<span><span>0<span><span>)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> object<span><span> =<span><span> { id: <span><span>ref<span><span>(<span><span>1<span><span>) }<span><span><code><pre><div><p>因此，", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/reactivity-fundamentals.html", "title": "响应式基础", "doc_id": "eecacb073fb44a328c83c77868f3472d", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1619, "chunk_index": 87, "_doc_id": "87_4914187055241797253"}}
{"doc_id": "88_8687969331086476204", "text": "an> { id: <span><span>ref<span><span>(<span><span>1<span><span>) }<span><span><code><pre><div><p>因此，这个表达式按预期工作：<p><p>...但这个<strong>不会<strong>：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>{{ object.id <span><span>+<span><span> 1<span><span> }}<span><span><code><pre><div><p>渲染的结果将是 <code>[object Object]1<code>，因为在计算表达式时 <code>object.id<code> 没有被解包，仍然是一个 ref 对象。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/reactivity-fundamentals.html", "title": "响应式基础", "doc_id": "eecacb073fb44a328c83c77868f3472d", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1619, "chunk_index": 88, "_doc_id": "88_8687969331086476204"}}
{"doc_id": "89_4030367475241098863", "text": "pre><div><p>渲染的结果将是 <code>[object Object]1<code>，因为在计算表达式时 <code>object.id<code> 没有被解包，仍然是一个 ref 对象。为了解决这个问题，我们可以将 <code>id<code> 解构为一个顶级属性：<p><p>现在渲染的结果将是 <code>2<code>。<p><p>另一个需要注意的点是，如果 ref 是文本插值的最终计算值 (即 <code>{{ }}<code> 标签)，那么它将被解包，因此以下内容将渲染为 <code>1<code>：<p><p>该特性仅仅是文本插值的一个便利特性，等价于 <code>{{ object.id.value }}<code>。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/reactivity-fundamentals.html", "title": "响应式基础", "doc_id": "eecacb073fb44a328c83c77868f3472d", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1619, "chunk_index": 89, "_doc_id": "89_4030367475241098863"}}
{"doc_id": "90_5721980670206095091", "text": "标签)，那么它将被解包，因此以下内容将渲染为 <code>1<code>：<p><p>该特性仅仅是文本插值的一个便利特性，等价于 <code>{{ object.id.value }}<code>。<p><div><div class=\"options-api\"><h3 id=\"stateful-methods\">有状态方法 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#stateful-methods\">​<a><h3><p>在某些情况下，我们可能需要动态地创建一个方法函数，比如创建一个预置防抖的事件处理器：<p><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>import<span><span> { debounce } <span><span>from<span><span> 'lodash-es'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/reactivity-fundamentals.html", "title": "响应式基础", "doc_id": "eecacb073fb44a328c83c77868f3472d", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1619, "chunk_index": 90, "_doc_id": "90_5721980670206095091"}}
{"doc_id": "91_660429093374110433", "text": "><span> { debounce } <span><span>from<span><span> 'lodash-es'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> methods: {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 使用 Lodash 的防抖函数<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> click: <span><span>debounce<span><span>(<span><span>function<span><span> () {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // ... 对点击的响应 ...<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/reactivity-fundamentals.html", "title": "响应式基础", "doc_id": "eecacb073fb44a328c83c77868f3472d", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1619, "chunk_index": 91, "_doc_id": "91_660429093374110433"}}
{"doc_id": "92_4474001627068171750", "text": "<span>function<span><span> () {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // ... 对点击的响应 ...<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }, <span><span>500<span><span>)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/reactivity-fundamentals.html", "title": "响应式基础", "doc_id": "eecacb073fb44a328c83c77868f3472d", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1619, "chunk_index": 92, "_doc_id": "92_4474001627068171750"}}
{"doc_id": "93_616411788352890585", "text": "s=\"line\"><span> }, <span><span>500<span><span>)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span><code><pre><div><p>不过这种方法对于被重用的组件来说是有问题的，因为这个预置防抖的函数是<strong>有状态的<strong>：它在运行时维护着一个内部状态。如果多个组件实例都共享这同一个预置防抖的函数，那么它们之间将会互相影响。<p><p>要保持每个组件实例的防抖函数都彼此独立，我们可以改为在 <code>created<code> 生命周期钩子中创建这个预置防抖的函数：<p><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/reactivity-fundamentals.html", "title": "响应式基础", "doc_id": "eecacb073fb44a328c83c77868f3472d", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1619, "chunk_index": 93, "_doc_id": "93_616411788352890585"}}
{"doc_id": "94_3868345736450631674", "text": "b-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> created<span><span>() {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 每个实例都有了自己的预置防抖的处理函数<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> this<span><span>.debouncedClick <span><span>=<span><span> _.<span><span>debounce<span><span>(<span><span>this<span><span>.click, <span><span>500<span><span>)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> },<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/reactivity-fundamentals.html", "title": "响应式基础", "doc_id": "eecacb073fb44a328c83c77868f3472d", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1619, "chunk_index": 94, "_doc_id": "94_3868345736450631674"}}
{"doc_id": "95_5654433323560582219", "text": "pan><span>.click, <span><span>500<span><span>)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> },<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> unmounted<span><span>() {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 最好是在组件卸载时<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 清除掉防抖计时器<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> this<span><span>.debouncedClick.<span><span>cancel<span><span>()<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> },<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> methods: {<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/reactivity-fundamentals.html", "title": "响应式基础", "doc_id": "eecacb073fb44a328c83c77868f3472d", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1619, "chunk_index": 95, "_doc_id": "95_5654433323560582219"}}
{"doc_id": "96_586253811766783216", "text": "an><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> },<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> methods: {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> click<span><span>() {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // ... 对点击的响应 ...<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span><code><pre><div><div><div><div>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/reactivity-fundamentals.html", "title": "响应式基础", "doc_id": "eecacb073fb44a328c83c77868f3472d", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1619, "chunk_index": 96, "_doc_id": "96_586253811766783216"}}
{"doc_id": "0_5105222090429891315", "text": "<div><div><h1 id=\"fallthrough-attributes\">透传 Attributes <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#fallthrough-attributes\">​<a><h1><blockquote><p>此章节假设你已经看过了<a href=\"/guide/essentials/component-basics.html\">组件基础<a>。若你还不了解组件是什么，请先阅读该章节。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/attrs.html", "title": "透传 Attributes", "doc_id": "22ce7f1973f442aeb0f1d8cf071719c0", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 473, "chunk_index": 0, "_doc_id": "0_5105222090429891315"}}
{"doc_id": "1_2271079055195421513", "text": "ckquote><p>此章节假设你已经看过了<a href=\"/guide/essentials/component-basics.html\">组件基础<a>。若你还不了解组件是什么，请先阅读该章节。<p><blockquote><h2 id=\"attribute-inheritance\">Attributes 继承 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#attribute-inheritance\">​<a><h2><p>“透传 attribute”指的是传递给一个组件，却没有被该组件声明为 <a href=\"./props.html\">props<a> 或 <a href=\"./events.html#defining-custom-events\">emits<a> 的 attribute 或者 <code>v-on<code> 事件监听器。最常见的例子就是 <code>class<code>、<code>style<code> 和 <code>id<code>。<p><p>当一个组件以单个元素为根作渲染时，透传的 attribute 会自动被添加到根元素上。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/attrs.html", "title": "透传 Attributes", "doc_id": "22ce7f1973f442aeb0f1d8cf071719c0", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 473, "chunk_index": 1, "_doc_id": "1_2271079055195421513"}}
{"doc_id": "2_3312899051460455927", "text": "ode>class<code>、<code>style<code> 和 <code>id<code>。<p><p>当一个组件以单个元素为根作渲染时，透传的 attribute 会自动被添加到根元素上。举例来说，假如我们有一个 <code><MyButton><code> 组件，它的模板长这样：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><!-- <MyButton> 的模板 --><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>button<span><span>>Click Me</<span><span>button<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>一个父组件使用了这个组件，并且传入了 <code>class<code>：<p><div", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/attrs.html", "title": "透传 Attributes", "doc_id": "22ce7f1973f442aeb0f1d8cf071719c0", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 473, "chunk_index": 2, "_doc_id": "2_3312899051460455927"}}
{"doc_id": "3_3139694658375780992", "text": "span>button<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>一个父组件使用了这个组件，并且传入了 <code>class<code>：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>MyButton<span><span> class<span><span>=<span><span>\"large\"<span><span> /><span><span><code><pre><div><p>最后渲染出的 DOM 结果是：<p><div class=\"language-html\"> <span class=\"lang\">html<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/attrs.html", "title": "透传 Attributes", "doc_id": "22ce7f1973f442aeb0f1d8cf071719c0", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 473, "chunk_index": 3, "_doc_id": "3_3139694658375780992"}}
{"doc_id": "4_8589871266512320090", "text": "ss=\"language-html\"> <span class=\"lang\">html<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>button<span><span> class<span><span>=<span><span>\"large\"<span><span>>Click Me</<span><span>button<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>这里，<code><MyButton><code> 并没有将 <code>class<code> 声明为一个它所接受的 prop，所以 <code>class<code> 被视作透传 attribute，自动透传到了 <code><MyButton><code> 的根元素上。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/attrs.html", "title": "透传 Attributes", "doc_id": "22ce7f1973f442aeb0f1d8cf071719c0", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 473, "chunk_index": 4, "_doc_id": "4_8589871266512320090"}}
{"doc_id": "5_8892247353788233203", "text": "lass<code> 声明为一个它所接受的 prop，所以 <code>class<code> 被视作透传 attribute，自动透传到了 <code><MyButton><code> 的根元素上。<p><h3 id=\"class-and-style-merging\">对 <code>class<code> 和 <code>style<code> 的合并 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#class-and-style-merging\">​<a><h3><p>如果一个子组件的根元素已经有了 <code>class<code> 或 <code>style<code> attribute，它会和从父组件上继承的值合并。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/attrs.html", "title": "透传 Attributes", "doc_id": "22ce7f1973f442aeb0f1d8cf071719c0", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 473, "chunk_index": 5, "_doc_id": "5_8892247353788233203"}}
{"doc_id": "6_846907709151754657", "text": "-merging\">​<a><h3><p>如果一个子组件的根元素已经有了 <code>class<code> 或 <code>style<code> attribute，它会和从父组件上继承的值合并。如果我们将之前的 <code><MyButton><code> 组件的模板改成这样：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><!-- <MyButton> 的模板 --><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>button<span><span> class<span><span>=<span><span>\"btn\"<span><span>>Click Me</<span><span>button<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>则最后渲染出的 DOM", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/attrs.html", "title": "透传 Attributes", "doc_id": "22ce7f1973f442aeb0f1d8cf071719c0", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 473, "chunk_index": 6, "_doc_id": "6_846907709151754657"}}
{"doc_id": "7_8365172332295209131", "text": "tn\"<span><span>>Click Me</<span><span>button<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>则最后渲染出的 DOM 结果会变成：<p><div class=\"language-html\"> <span class=\"lang\">html<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>button<span><span> class<span><span>=<span><span>\"btn large\"<span><span>>Click Me</<span><span>button<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><h3 id=\"v-on-listener-inheritance\"><code>v-on<code> 监听器继承 <a class=\"header-anchor\"", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/attrs.html", "title": "透传 Attributes", "doc_id": "22ce7f1973f442aeb0f1d8cf071719c0", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 473, "chunk_index": 7, "_doc_id": "7_8365172332295209131"}}
{"doc_id": "8_6679375095439147088", "text": "><code><pre><div><h3 id=\"v-on-listener-inheritance\"><code>v-on<code> 监听器继承 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#v-on-listener-inheritance\">​<a><h3><p>同样的规则也适用于 <code>v-on<code> 事件监听器：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>MyButton<span><span> @<span><span>click<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>onClick<span><span>\"<span><span> /><span><span><code><pre><div><p><code>click<code> 监听器会被添加到", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/attrs.html", "title": "透传 Attributes", "doc_id": "22ce7f1973f442aeb0f1d8cf071719c0", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 473, "chunk_index": 8, "_doc_id": "8_6679375095439147088"}}
{"doc_id": "9_7869079609280438397", "text": "><span>onClick<span><span>\"<span><span> /><span><span><code><pre><div><p><code>click<code> 监听器会被添加到 <code><MyButton><code> 的根元素，即那个原生的 <code><button><code> 元素之上。当原生的 <code><button><code> 被点击，会触发父组件的 <code>onClick<code> 方法。同样的，如果原生 <code>button<code> 元素自身也通过 <code>v-on<code> 绑定了一个事件监听器，则这个监听器和从父组件继承的监听器都会被触发。<p><h3 id=\"nested-component-inheritance\">深层组件继承 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#nested-component-inheritance\">​<a><h3><p>有些情况下一个组件会在根节点上渲染另一个组件。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/attrs.html", "title": "透传 Attributes", "doc_id": "22ce7f1973f442aeb0f1d8cf071719c0", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 473, "chunk_index": 9, "_doc_id": "9_7869079609280438397"}}
{"doc_id": "10_6544917143067507986", "text": "件继承 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#nested-component-inheritance\">​<a><h3><p>有些情况下一个组件会在根节点上渲染另一个组件。例如，我们重构一下 <code><MyButton><code>，让它在根节点上渲染 <code><BaseButton><code>：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><!-- <MyButton/> 的模板，只是渲染另一个组件 --><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/attrs.html", "title": "透传 Attributes", "doc_id": "22ce7f1973f442aeb0f1d8cf071719c0", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 473, "chunk_index": 10, "_doc_id": "10_6544917143067507986"}}
{"doc_id": "11_3285946623720870267", "text": "github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><!-- <MyButton/> 的模板，只是渲染另一个组件 --><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>BaseButton<span><span> /><span><span><code><pre><div><p>此时 <code><MyButton><code> 接收的透传 attribute 会直接继续传给 <code><BaseButton><code>。<p><p>请注意：<p><ol><li><p>透传的 attribute 不会包含 <code><MyButton><code> 上声明过的 props 或是针对 <code>emits<code> 声明事件的 <code>v-on<code> 侦听函数，换句话说，声明过的 props 和侦听函数被 <code><MyButton><code>“消费”了。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/attrs.html", "title": "透传 Attributes", "doc_id": "22ce7f1973f442aeb0f1d8cf071719c0", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 473, "chunk_index": 11, "_doc_id": "11_3285946623720870267"}}
{"doc_id": "12_7307241838565645370", "text": "针对 <code>emits<code> 声明事件的 <code>v-on<code> 侦听函数，换句话说，声明过的 props 和侦听函数被 <code><MyButton><code>“消费”了。<p><li><li><p>透传的 attribute 若符合声明，也可以作为 props 传入 <code><BaseButton><code>。<p><li><ol><h2 id=\"disabling-attribute-inheritance\">禁用 Attributes 继承 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#disabling-attribute-inheritance\">​<a><h2><p>如果你<strong>不想要<strong>一个组件自动地继承 attribute，你可以在组件选项中设置 <code>inheritAttrs: false<code>。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/attrs.html", "title": "透传 Attributes", "doc_id": "22ce7f1973f442aeb0f1d8cf071719c0", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 473, "chunk_index": 12, "_doc_id": "12_7307241838565645370"}}
{"doc_id": "13_8064180446144372461", "text": "e\">​<a><h2><p>如果你<strong>不想要<strong>一个组件自动地继承 attribute，你可以在组件选项中设置 <code>inheritAttrs: false<code>。<p><div class=\"composition-api\"><p>从 3.3 开始你也可以直接在 <code><script setup><code> 中使用 <a href=\"/api/sfc-script-setup.html#defineoptions\"><code>defineOptions<code><a>：<p><div class=\"language-vue\"> <span class=\"lang\">vue<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>script<span><span> setup<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/attrs.html", "title": "透传 Attributes", "doc_id": "22ce7f1973f442aeb0f1d8cf071719c0", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 473, "chunk_index": 13, "_doc_id": "13_8064180446144372461"}}
{"doc_id": "14_7132622456940786187", "text": "code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>script<span><span> setup<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>defineOptions<span><span>({<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> inheritAttrs: <span><span>false<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>})<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// ...setup 逻辑<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>script<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><div><p>最常见的需要禁用 attribute 继承的场景就是 attribute 需要应用在根节点以外的其他元素上。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/attrs.html", "title": "透传 Attributes", "doc_id": "22ce7f1973f442aeb0f1d8cf071719c0", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 473, "chunk_index": 14, "_doc_id": "14_7132622456940786187"}}
{"doc_id": "15_3253789116062425570", "text": "an><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><div><p>最常见的需要禁用 attribute 继承的场景就是 attribute 需要应用在根节点以外的其他元素上。通过设置 <code>inheritAttrs<code> 选项为 <code>false<code>，你可以完全控制透传进来的 attribute 被如何使用。<p><p>这些透传进来的 attribute 可以在模板的表达式中直接用 <code>$attrs<code> 访问到。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/attrs.html", "title": "透传 Attributes", "doc_id": "22ce7f1973f442aeb0f1d8cf071719c0", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 473, "chunk_index": 15, "_doc_id": "15_3253789116062425570"}}
{"doc_id": "16_4764713083967151516", "text": "lse<code>，你可以完全控制透传进来的 attribute 被如何使用。<p><p>这些透传进来的 attribute 可以在模板的表达式中直接用 <code>$attrs<code> 访问到。<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>span<span><span>>Fallthrough attribute: {{ $attrs }}</<span><span>span<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>这个 <code>$attrs<code> 对象包含了除组件所声明的 <code>props<code> 和 <code>emits<code> 之外的所有其他 attribute，例如 <code>class<code>，<code>style<code>，<code>v-on<code> 监听器等等。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/attrs.html", "title": "透传 Attributes", "doc_id": "22ce7f1973f442aeb0f1d8cf071719c0", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 473, "chunk_index": 16, "_doc_id": "16_4764713083967151516"}}
{"doc_id": "17_3360365578102973291", "text": "和 <code>emits<code> 之外的所有其他 attribute，例如 <code>class<code>，<code>style<code>，<code>v-on<code> 监听器等等。<p><p>有几点需要注意：<p><p>现在我们要再次使用一下<a href=\"#attribute-inheritance\">之前小节<a>中的 <code><MyButton><code> 组件例子。有时候我们可能为了样式，需要在 <code><button><code> 元素外包装一层 <code><div><code>：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>div<span><span> class<span><span>=<span><span>\"btn-wrapper\"<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/attrs.html", "title": "透传 Attributes", "doc_id": "22ce7f1973f442aeb0f1d8cf071719c0", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 473, "chunk_index": 17, "_doc_id": "17_3360365578102973291"}}
{"doc_id": "18_1605757601373366819", "text": "n><<span><span>div<span><span> class<span><span>=<span><span>\"btn-wrapper\"<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>button<span><span> class<span><span>=<span><span>\"btn\"<span><span>>Click Me</<span><span>button<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>div<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>我们想要所有像 <code>class<code> 和 <code>v-on<code> 监听器这样的透传 attribute 都应用在内部的 <code><button><code> 上而不是外层的 <code><div><code> 上。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/attrs.html", "title": "透传 Attributes", "doc_id": "22ce7f1973f442aeb0f1d8cf071719c0", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 473, "chunk_index": 18, "_doc_id": "18_1605757601373366819"}}
{"doc_id": "19_4035997978356348706", "text": "ode> 和 <code>v-on<code> 监听器这样的透传 attribute 都应用在内部的 <code><button><code> 上而不是外层的 <code><div><code> 上。我们可以通过设定 <code>inheritAttrs: false<code> 和使用 <code>v-bind=\"$attrs\"<code> 来实现：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>div<span><span> class<span><span>=<span><span>\"btn-wrapper\"<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/attrs.html", "title": "透传 Attributes", "doc_id": "22ce7f1973f442aeb0f1d8cf071719c0", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 473, "chunk_index": 19, "_doc_id": "19_4035997978356348706"}}
{"doc_id": "20_6918965250354788266", "text": "n><<span><span>div<span><span> class<span><span>=<span><span>\"btn-wrapper\"<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line highlighted\"><span> <<span><span>button<span><span> class<span><span>=<span><span>\"btn\"<span><span> v-bind<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>$attrs<span><span>\"<span><span>>Click Me</<span><span>button<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/attrs.html", "title": "透传 Attributes", "doc_id": "22ce7f1973f442aeb0f1d8cf071719c0", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 473, "chunk_index": 20, "_doc_id": "20_6918965250354788266"}}
{"doc_id": "21_1733263252071480182", "text": ">\"<span><span>$attrs<span><span>\"<span><span>>Click Me</<span><span>button<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>div<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>小提示：<a href=\"/guide/essentials/template-syntax.html#dynamically-binding-multiple-attributes\">没有参数的 <code>v-bind<code><a> 会将一个对象的所有属性都作为 attribute 应用到目标元素上。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/attrs.html", "title": "透传 Attributes", "doc_id": "22ce7f1973f442aeb0f1d8cf071719c0", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 473, "chunk_index": 21, "_doc_id": "21_1733263252071480182"}}
{"doc_id": "22_5589928958333438088", "text": "amically-binding-multiple-attributes\">没有参数的 <code>v-bind<code><a> 会将一个对象的所有属性都作为 attribute 应用到目标元素上。<p><h2 id=\"attribute-inheritance-on-multiple-root-nodes\">多根节点的 Attributes 继承 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#attribute-inheritance-on-multiple-root-nodes\">​<a><h2><p>和单根节点组件有所不同，有着多个根节点的组件没有自动 attribute 透传行为。如果 <code>$attrs<code> 没有被显式绑定，将会抛出一个运行时警告。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/attrs.html", "title": "透传 Attributes", "doc_id": "22ce7f1973f442aeb0f1d8cf071719c0", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 473, "chunk_index": 22, "_doc_id": "22_5589928958333438088"}}
{"doc_id": "23_3119916824940215524", "text": "des\">​<a><h2><p>和单根节点组件有所不同，有着多个根节点的组件没有自动 attribute 透传行为。如果 <code>$attrs<code> 没有被显式绑定，将会抛出一个运行时警告。<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>CustomLayout<span><span> id<span><span>=<span><span>\"custom-layout\"<span><span> @<span><span>click<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>changeValue<span><span>\"<span><span> /><span><span><code><pre><div><p>如果 <code><CustomLayout><code> 有下面这样的多根节点模板，由于 Vue 不知道要将 attribute 透传到哪里，所以会抛出一个警告。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/attrs.html", "title": "透传 Attributes", "doc_id": "22ce7f1973f442aeb0f1d8cf071719c0", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 473, "chunk_index": 23, "_doc_id": "23_3119916824940215524"}}
{"doc_id": "24_2727602922100039867", "text": "code><pre><div><p>如果 <code><CustomLayout><code> 有下面这样的多根节点模板，由于 Vue 不知道要将 attribute 透传到哪里，所以会抛出一个警告。<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>header<span><span>>...</<span><span>header<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>main<span><span>>...</<span><span>main<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/attrs.html", "title": "透传 Attributes", "doc_id": "22ce7f1973f442aeb0f1d8cf071719c0", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 473, "chunk_index": 24, "_doc_id": "24_2727602922100039867"}}
{"doc_id": "25_1277687099501042579", "text": "pan class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>main<span><span>>...</<span><span>main<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>footer<span><span>>...</<span><span>footer<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>如果 <code>$attrs<code> 被显式绑定，则不会有警告：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>header<span><span>>...</<span><span>header<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/attrs.html", "title": "透传 Attributes", "doc_id": "22ce7f1973f442aeb0f1d8cf071719c0", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 473, "chunk_index": 25, "_doc_id": "25_1277687099501042579"}}
{"doc_id": "26_478576025250697038", "text": "class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>header<span><span>>...</<span><span>header<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line highlighted\"><span><<span><span>main<span><span> v-bind<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>$attrs<span><span>\"<span><span>>...</<span><span>main<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/attrs.html", "title": "透传 Attributes", "doc_id": "22ce7f1973f442aeb0f1d8cf071719c0", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 473, "chunk_index": 26, "_doc_id": "26_478576025250697038"}}
{"doc_id": "27_1310929412612030375", "text": "n><span>\"<span><span>$attrs<span><span>\"<span><span>>...</<span><span>main<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>footer<span><span>>...</<span><span>footer<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><h2 id=\"accessing-fallthrough-attributes-in-javascript\">在 JavaScript 中访问透传 Attributes <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#accessing-fallthrough-attributes-in-javascript\">​<a><h2><div class=\"composition-api\"><p>如果需要，", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/attrs.html", "title": "透传 Attributes", "doc_id": "22ce7f1973f442aeb0f1d8cf071719c0", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 473, "chunk_index": 27, "_doc_id": "27_1310929412612030375"}}
{"doc_id": "28_2375766932655020739", "text": "href=\"#accessing-fallthrough-attributes-in-javascript\">​<a><h2><div class=\"composition-api\"><p>如果需要，你可以在 <code><script setup><code> 中使用 <code>useAttrs()<code> API 来访问一个组件的所有透传 attribute：<p><div class=\"language-vue\"> <span class=\"lang\">vue<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>script<span><span> setup<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>import<span><span> { useAttrs } <span><span>from<span><span> 'vue'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/attrs.html", "title": "透传 Attributes", "doc_id": "22ce7f1973f442aeb0f1d8cf071719c0", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 473, "chunk_index": 28, "_doc_id": "28_2375766932655020739"}}
{"doc_id": "29_3902334199975340889", "text": "t<span><span> { useAttrs } <span><span>from<span><span> 'vue'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> attrs<span><span> =<span><span> useAttrs<span><span>()<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/attrs.html", "title": "透传 Attributes", "doc_id": "22ce7f1973f442aeb0f1d8cf071719c0", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 473, "chunk_index": 29, "_doc_id": "29_3902334199975340889"}}
{"doc_id": "30_2669635146763188430", "text": "s=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> attrs<span><span> =<span><span> useAttrs<span><span>()<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>script<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>如果没有使用 <code><script setup><code>，<code>attrs<code> 会作为 <code>setup()<code> 上下文对象的一个属性暴露：<p><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/attrs.html", "title": "透传 Attributes", "doc_id": "22ce7f1973f442aeb0f1d8cf071719c0", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 473, "chunk_index": 30, "_doc_id": "30_2669635146763188430"}}
{"doc_id": "31_7275232369446233633", "text": "b-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> setup<span><span>(<span><span>props<span><span>, <span><span>ctx<span><span>) {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 透传 attribute 被暴露为 ctx.attrs<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> console.<span><span>log<span><span>(ctx.attrs)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/attrs.html", "title": "透传 Attributes", "doc_id": "22ce7f1973f442aeb0f1d8cf071719c0", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 473, "chunk_index": 31, "_doc_id": "31_7275232369446233633"}}
{"doc_id": "32_5803736118797366", "text": "console.<span><span>log<span><span>(ctx.attrs)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span><code><pre><div><p>需要注意的是，虽然这里的 <code>attrs<code> 对象总是反映为最新的透传 attribute，但它并不是响应式的 (考虑到性能因素)。你不能通过侦听器去监听它的变化。如果你需要响应性，可以使用 prop。或者你也可以使用 <code>onUpdated()<code> 使得在每次更新时结合最新的 <code>attrs<code> 执行副作用。<p><div><div class=\"options-api\"><p>如果需要，你可以通过 <code>$attrs<code> 这个实例属性来访问组件的所有透传 attribute：<p><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/attrs.html", "title": "透传 Attributes", "doc_id": "22ce7f1973f442aeb0f1d8cf071719c0", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 473, "chunk_index": 32, "_doc_id": "32_5803736118797366"}}
{"doc_id": "33_5152623560546120179", "text": "b-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> created<span><span>() {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> console.<span><span>log<span><span>(<span><span>this<span><span>.$attrs)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span><code><pre><div><div><div><div>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/attrs.html", "title": "透传 Attributes", "doc_id": "22ce7f1973f442aeb0f1d8cf071719c0", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 473, "chunk_index": 33, "_doc_id": "33_5152623560546120179"}}
{"doc_id": "0_1021139101018104612", "text": "<div><div><h1 id=\"frequently-asked-questions\">常见问题 <h1><h2 id=\"who-maintains-vue\">谁在维护 Vue？ <h2><p>Vue 是一个独立的社区驱动的项目。它是由<a href=\"https://twitter.com/yuxiyou\" target=\"_blank\">尤雨溪<a>在 2014 年作为其个人项目创建的。今天，Vue 由<a href=\"/about/team.html\">来自世界各地的全职成员和志愿者组成的团队<a>积极活跃地维护着，并由尤雨溪担任项目负责人。你可以在<a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=OrxmtDw4pVI\" target=\"_blank\">这部纪录片<a>中了解更多关于 Vue 的故事。<p><p>自 2016 年以来，Vue 的发展主要是通过赞助来保障的，我们在财务上是可持续的。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/about/faq.html", "title": "常见问题", "doc_id": "340b2c3b6baf4285b081c96c665a4927", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 370, "chunk_index": 0, "_doc_id": "0_1021139101018104612"}}
{"doc_id": "1_5657176289485268273", "text": "rxmtDw4pVI\" target=\"_blank\">这部纪录片<a>中了解更多关于 Vue 的故事。<p><p>自 2016 年以来，Vue 的发展主要是通过赞助来保障的，我们在财务上是可持续的。如果你或你的企业从 Vue 中受益，请考虑<a href=\"/sponsor/\">赞助<a>我们，以支持 Vue 的发展！<p><h2 id=\"what-s-the-difference-between-vue-2-and-vue-3\">Vue 2 和 Vue 3 之间的区别是什么？ <h2><p>Vue 3 是 Vue 当前的最新主版本。它包含了一些 Vue 2 中没有的新特性 (比如 Teleport、Suspense，以及多根元素模板)。同时它也包含了一些与 Vue 2 非兼容性的变更。细节文档请参考 <a href=\"https://v3-migration.vuejs.org/zh/\" target=\"_blank\">Vue 3 迁移指南<a>。<p><p>尽管存在差异，但大多数 Vue API 在两个大版本之间是共享的，所以你的大部分 Vue 2 知识将继续在 Vue 3 中发挥作用。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/about/faq.html", "title": "常见问题", "doc_id": "340b2c3b6baf4285b081c96c665a4927", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 370, "chunk_index": 1, "_doc_id": "1_5657176289485268273"}}
{"doc_id": "2_8609103698558488269", "text": "rget=\"_blank\">Vue 3 迁移指南<a>。<p><p>尽管存在差异，但大多数 Vue API 在两个大版本之间是共享的，所以你的大部分 Vue 2 知识将继续在 Vue 3 中发挥作用。需要注意的是，组合式 API 原本是一个 Vue 3 独有的特性，但目前已兼容至 Vue 2 且在 <a href=\"https://github.com/vuejs/vue/blob/main/CHANGELOG.md#270-2022-07-01\" target=\"_blank\">Vue 2.7<a> 中可用。<p><p>总的来说，Vue 3 提供了更小的包体积、更好的性能、更好的可扩展性和更好的 TypeScript/IDE 支持。如果你现在要开始一个新项目，我们推荐你选择 Vue 3。但也仍然存在一些考虑使用 Vue 2 的理由：<p><ul><li>你需要支持 IE11。Vue 3 用到了一些 IE11 不支持的现代 JavaScript 特性。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/about/faq.html", "title": "常见问题", "doc_id": "340b2c3b6baf4285b081c96c665a4927", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 370, "chunk_index": 2, "_doc_id": "2_8609103698558488269"}}
{"doc_id": "3_6179090910027756381", "text": "项目，我们推荐你选择 Vue 3。但也仍然存在一些考虑使用 Vue 2 的理由：<p><ul><li>你需要支持 IE11。Vue 3 用到了一些 IE11 不支持的现代 JavaScript 特性。<li><ul><p>如果你打算将现有的 Vue 2 应用迁移到 Vue 3，请查阅<a href=\"https://v3-migration.vuejs.org/zh/\" target=\"_blank\">迁移指南<a>。<p><h2 id=\"is-vue-2-still-supported\">Vue 2 仍在维护吗？ <h2><p>Vue 2 在 2022 年 6 月发布了最后一个小版本 (2.7)。目前 Vue 2 已经进入维护模式：它将不再提供新特性，但从 2.7 的发布日期开始的 18 个月内，它将继续针对重大错误修复和安全更新进行发布。这意味着 <strong>Vue 2 已在 2023 年 12 月 31 日到达它的截止维护日期<strong>。<p><p>我们相信这为大多数的生态系统提供了足够长的时间来迁移到 Vue 3。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/about/faq.html", "title": "常见问题", "doc_id": "340b2c3b6baf4285b081c96c665a4927", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 370, "chunk_index": 3, "_doc_id": "3_6179090910027756381"}}
{"doc_id": "4_7598843727434061129", "text": "发布。这意味着 <strong>Vue 2 已在 2023 年 12 月 31 日到达它的截止维护日期<strong>。<p><p>我们相信这为大多数的生态系统提供了足够长的时间来迁移到 Vue 3。然而，我们也理解可能会有无法在此时间轴上升级的团队或项目仍需满足其安全及合规需求。我们正在与业内专家合作为有这种需求的团队提供 Vue 2 的扩展支持——如果您的团队预期在 2023 年底之后仍然需要使用 Vue 2，请确保提前计划，详见 <a href=\"https://v2.vuejs.org/lts/\" target=\"_blank\">Vue 2 延长 LTS<a>。<p><h2 id=\"what-license-does-vue-use\">Vue 使用什么开源协议？ <h2><p>Vue 是完全免费的开源项目，且基于 <a href=\"https://opensource.org/licenses/MIT\" target=\"_blank\">MIT License<a> 发布。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/about/faq.html", "title": "常见问题", "doc_id": "340b2c3b6baf4285b081c96c665a4927", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 370, "chunk_index": 4, "_doc_id": "4_7598843727434061129"}}
{"doc_id": "5_3462730411018230980", "text": ">Vue 是完全免费的开源项目，且基于 <a href=\"https://opensource.org/licenses/MIT\" target=\"_blank\">MIT License<a> 发布。<p><h2 id=\"what-browsers-does-vue-support\">Vue 支持哪些浏览器？ <h2><p>最新版本的 Vue (3.x) 只支持<a href=\"https://caniuse.com/es2016\" target=\"_blank\">原生支持 ES2016 的浏览器<a>。这并不包括 IE11。Vue 3.x 使用的 ES2016 功能无法在旧版本的浏览器中进行兼容，如果你需要支持旧版本的浏览器，请使用 Vue 2.x 替代。<p><h2 id=\"is-vue-reliable\">Vue 可靠吗？ <h2><p>Vue 是一个成熟的、经历了无数实战考验的框架。它是目前生产环境中使用最广泛的 JavaScript 框架之一，在全球拥有超过 150 万用户，并且在 npm 上的月下载量超过 1000 万次。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/about/faq.html", "title": "常见问题", "doc_id": "340b2c3b6baf4285b081c96c665a4927", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 370, "chunk_index": 5, "_doc_id": "5_3462730411018230980"}}
{"doc_id": "6_2801360785827270684", "text": "<p>Vue 是一个成熟的、经历了无数实战考验的框架。它是目前生产环境中使用最广泛的 JavaScript 框架之一，在全球拥有超过 150 万用户，并且在 npm 上的月下载量超过 1000 万次。<p><p>Vue 被世界各地知名且多元的组织在生产环境中使用，包括 Wikimedia 基金会、美国宇航局、苹果、谷歌、微软、GitLab、Zoom、腾讯、微博、哔哩哔哩、快手等等。<p><h2 id=\"is-vue-fast\">Vue 速度快吗？ <h2><p>Vue 3 是性能最强的主流前端框架之一，可以轻松处理大多数 web 应用的场景，并且几乎不需要手动优化。<p><p>跑分方面，Vue 在 <a href=\"https://krausest.github.io/js-framework-benchmark/current.html\" target=\"_blank\">js-framework-benchmark<a> 中的表现比 React 和 Angular 要好得多。在该基准测试中，它还与一些生产环境下最快级别的非虚拟 DOM 框架并驾齐驱。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/about/faq.html", "title": "常见问题", "doc_id": "340b2c3b6baf4285b081c96c665a4927", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 370, "chunk_index": 6, "_doc_id": "6_2801360785827270684"}}
{"doc_id": "7_7968785886864686121", "text": "\"_blank\">js-framework-benchmark<a> 中的表现比 React 和 Angular 要好得多。在该基准测试中，它还与一些生产环境下最快级别的非虚拟 DOM 框架并驾齐驱。<p><p>请注意，像上面这样的跑分的侧重点在于原始渲染性能在特定情况下的优化，因此不能完全代表真实世界的性能结果。如果你更关心页面加载性能，欢迎用 <a href=\"https://www.webpagetest.org/lighthouse\" target=\"_blank\">WebPageTest<a> 或是 <a href=\"https://pagespeed.web.dev/\" target=\"_blank\">PageSpeed Insights<a> 来测试本站。本文档站是一个完全由 Vue 本身构建，通过静态生成预渲染，并在客户端进行 hydration 的单页应用。它在模拟 4 倍 CPU 降速的 Moto G4 + 低速 4G 网络的情况下依然能获得 100 分的性能得分。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/about/faq.html", "title": "常见问题", "doc_id": "340b2c3b6baf4285b081c96c665a4927", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 370, "chunk_index": 7, "_doc_id": "7_7968785886864686121"}}
{"doc_id": "8_7982000587496304414", "text": "Vue 本身构建，通过静态生成预渲染，并在客户端进行 hydration 的单页应用。它在模拟 4 倍 CPU 降速的 Moto G4 + 低速 4G 网络的情况下依然能获得 100 分的性能得分。<p><p>你可以在<a href=\"/guide/extras/rendering-mechanism.html\">渲染机制<a>章节了解更多关于 Vue 如何自动优化运行时性能的信息，也可以在<a href=\"/guide/best-practices/performance.html\">性能优化指南<a>中了解如何在特别苛刻的情况下优化 Vue 应用。<p><h2 id=\"is-vue-lightweight\">Vue 体积小吗？ <h2><p>当你通过构建工具使用时，Vue 的许多 API 都是可以<a href=\"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Glossary/Tree_shaking\" target=\"_blank\">“tree-shake”<a>的。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/about/faq.html", "title": "常见问题", "doc_id": "340b2c3b6baf4285b081c96c665a4927", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 370, "chunk_index": 8, "_doc_id": "8_7982000587496304414"}}
{"doc_id": "9_1439375786539627253", "text": "f=\"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Glossary/Tree_shaking\" target=\"_blank\">“tree-shake”<a>的。例如，如果你不使用内置的 <code><Transition><code> 组件，它就不会被包含在最终的生产环境包里。<p><p>对于一个 Vue 的最少 API 使用的 hello world 应用来说，配合最小化和 brotli 压缩，其基线大小只有 <strong>16kb<strong> 左右。但实际的应用大小取决于你使用了多少框架的可选特性。在极端情况下，如果一个应用使用了 Vue 提供的每一个特性，那么总的运行时大小大约为 <strong>27kb<strong>。<p><p>如果不通过构建工具使用 Vue，我们不仅失去了 tree-shaking，而且还必须将模板编译器加载到浏览器。这就使包体积增大到了 <strong>41kb<strong> 左右。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/about/faq.html", "title": "常见问题", "doc_id": "340b2c3b6baf4285b081c96c665a4927", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 370, "chunk_index": 9, "_doc_id": "9_1439375786539627253"}}
{"doc_id": "10_5047554578441468401", "text": "ng>。<p><p>如果不通过构建工具使用 Vue，我们不仅失去了 tree-shaking，而且还必须将模板编译器加载到浏览器。这就使包体积增大到了 <strong>41kb<strong> 左右。因此，如果你为了渐进式增强在没有构建步骤的情况下使用 Vue，则可以考虑使用 <a href=\"https://github.com/vuejs/petite-vue\" target=\"_blank\">petite-vue<a> (仅 <strong>6kb<strong>) 来代替。<p><p>一些诸如 Svelte 的框架使用了一种为单个组件产生极轻量级输出的编译策略。然而，<a href=\"https://github.com/yyx990803/vue-svelte-size-analysis\" target=\"_blank\">我们的研究<a>表明，包大小的差异在很大程度上取决于应用中的组件数量。虽然 Vue 的基线大小更重，但它生成的每个组件的代码更少。在现实的场景中，Vue 应用很可能最终会更轻。<p><h2 id=\"does-vue-scale\">Vue 能胜任大规模场景吗？ <h2><p>是的。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/about/faq.html", "title": "常见问题", "doc_id": "340b2c3b6baf4285b081c96c665a4927", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 370, "chunk_index": 10, "_doc_id": "10_5047554578441468401"}}
{"doc_id": "11_8614945295647327991", "text": "e 的基线大小更重，但它生成的每个组件的代码更少。在现实的场景中，Vue 应用很可能最终会更轻。<p><h2 id=\"does-vue-scale\">Vue 能胜任大规模场景吗？ <h2><p>是的。尽管有一种误解是 Vue 只适用于简单的场景，但其实 Vue 完全有能力处理大规模的应用：<p><ul><li><p><a href=\"/guide/scaling-up/sfc.html\">单文件组件<a>提供了一个模块化的开发模型，让应用的不同部分能够被隔离开发。<p><li><li><p><a href=\"/guide/reusability/composables.html\">组合式 API<a> 提供一流的 TypeScript 集成，并为组织、提取和重用复杂逻辑提供了简洁的模式。<p><li><li><p><a href=\"/guide/scaling-up/tooling.html\">全面的工具链支持<a>使得开发体验在应用增长的过程中依然可以保持平滑。<p><li><li><p>较低的入门门槛和优秀的文档能够显著降低新手开发者的入职和培训成本。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/about/faq.html", "title": "常见问题", "doc_id": "340b2c3b6baf4285b081c96c665a4927", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 370, "chunk_index": 11, "_doc_id": "11_8614945295647327991"}}
{"doc_id": "12_2850911167100387802", "text": "-up/tooling.html\">全面的工具链支持<a>使得开发体验在应用增长的过程中依然可以保持平滑。<p><li><li><p>较低的入门门槛和优秀的文档能够显著降低新手开发者的入职和培训成本。<p><li><ul><h2 id=\"how-do-i-contribute-to-vue\">我可以为 Vue 做贡献吗？ <h2><p>非常欢迎！请阅读我们的<a href=\"/about/community-guide.html\">社区指南<a>。<p><h2 id=\"should-i-use-options-api-or-composition-api\">我应该使用选项式 API 还是组合式 API？ <h2><p>如果你是 Vue 的新手，我们在<a href=\"/guide/introduction.html#which-to-choose\">这里<a>提供了一个两者之间宏观的比较。<p><p>如果你过去使用过选项式 API 且正在评估组合式 API，可以查阅<a href=\"/guide/extras/composition-api-faq.html\">组合式 API 常见问题<a>。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/about/faq.html", "title": "常见问题", "doc_id": "340b2c3b6baf4285b081c96c665a4927", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 370, "chunk_index": 12, "_doc_id": "12_2850911167100387802"}}
{"doc_id": "13_2271312953065645086", "text": "p>如果你过去使用过选项式 API 且正在评估组合式 API，可以查阅<a href=\"/guide/extras/composition-api-faq.html\">组合式 API 常见问题<a>。<p><h2 id=\"should-i-use-javascript-or-typescript-with-vue\">用 Vue 的时候应该选 JS 还是 TS？ <h2><p>虽然 Vue 本身是用 TypeScript 实现的，并提供一流的 TypeScript 支持，但它并不强制要求用户使用 TypeScript。<p><p>在向 Vue 添加新特性时，对 TypeScript 的支持是一个重要的考虑因素。即使你自己不使用 TypeScript，考虑了 TypeScript 支持的 API 设计也通常更容易被 IDE 和静态分析工具分析，因此这对大家都有好处。Vue 的 API 设计也尽可能在 JavaScript 和 TypeScript 中以相同的方式工作。<p><p>选用 TypeScript 会涉及在上手复杂性和长期可维护性收益之间作出权衡。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/about/faq.html", "title": "常见问题", "doc_id": "340b2c3b6baf4285b081c96c665a4927", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 370, "chunk_index": 13, "_doc_id": "13_2271312953065645086"}}
{"doc_id": "14_5637622150580175759", "text": "好处。Vue 的 API 设计也尽可能在 JavaScript 和 TypeScript 中以相同的方式工作。<p><p>选用 TypeScript 会涉及在上手复杂性和长期可维护性收益之间作出权衡。这种权衡是否合理取决于你的团队背景和项目规模，但 Vue 并不会真正成为影响这一决定的因素。<p><h2 id=\"how-does-vue-compare-to-web-components\">Vue 相比于 Web Components 究竟如何？ <h2><p>Vue 是在 Web Components 出现之前被创建的，Vue 在某些方面的设计 (例如插槽) 受到了 Web Components 模型的启发。<p><p>Web Components 规范相对底层一些，因为它们是以自定义元素为中心的。作为一个框架，Vue 解决了更多上层的问题，如高效的 DOM 渲染、响应式状态管理、工具链、客户端路由和服务器端渲染等。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/about/faq.html", "title": "常见问题", "doc_id": "340b2c3b6baf4285b081c96c665a4927", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 370, "chunk_index": 14, "_doc_id": "14_5637622150580175759"}}
{"doc_id": "15_7670832135784698208", "text": "Web Components 规范相对底层一些，因为它们是以自定义元素为中心的。作为一个框架，Vue 解决了更多上层的问题，如高效的 DOM 渲染、响应式状态管理、工具链、客户端路由和服务器端渲染等。<p><p>Vue 完全支持在 Vue 组件中使用原生自定义元素，也支持将 Vue 组件导出为原生自定义元素——请参阅 <a href=\"/guide/extras/web-components.html\">Vue 和 Web Components 指南<a>以了解更多细节。<p><div><div>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/about/faq.html", "title": "常见问题", "doc_id": "340b2c3b6baf4285b081c96c665a4927", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 370, "chunk_index": 15, "_doc_id": "15_7670832135784698208"}}
{"doc_id": "0_2346348767338170403", "text": "<div><div><p>社区有许多优秀的新闻简报 / Vue 相关博客，他们会为你带来 Vue 生态系统中最新的消息和动态。以下是我们收集到的一份较为活跃的不完全列表：<p><p>如果你还知道其他优秀的内容，请使用<a href=\"https://github.com/vuejs/docs/edit/main/src/ecosystem/newsletters.md\" target=\"_blank\">该链接<a>提交一个 pull request！<p><div><div>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/ecosystem/newsletters.html", "title": "社区新闻简报", "doc_id": "3c6275ce21754576a59d8e177e40555e", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 10, "chunk_index": 0, "_doc_id": "0_2346348767338170403"}}
{"doc_id": "0_8747921959927936008", "text": "<div><div><h1 id=\"computed-properties\">计算属性 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#computed-properties\">​<a><h1><p class=\"options-api\"><p><p class=\"composition-api\"><p><h2 id=\"basic-example\">基础示例 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#basic-example\">​<a><h2><p>模板中的表达式虽然方便，但也只能用来做简单的操作。如果在模板中写太多逻辑，会让模板变得臃肿，难以维护。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/computed.html", "title": "计算属性", "doc_id": "8acaf991f91b4a03895985efe72b5214", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1092, "chunk_index": 0, "_doc_id": "0_8747921959927936008"}}
{"doc_id": "1_4316772075221996246", "text": "\"header-anchor\" href=\"#basic-example\">​<a><h2><p>模板中的表达式虽然方便，但也只能用来做简单的操作。如果在模板中写太多逻辑，会让模板变得臃肿，难以维护。比如说，我们有这样一个包含嵌套数组的对象：<p><div class=\"options-api\"><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> data<span><span>() {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> return<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> author: {<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/computed.html", "title": "计算属性", "doc_id": "8acaf991f91b4a03895985efe72b5214", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1092, "chunk_index": 1, "_doc_id": "1_4316772075221996246"}}
{"doc_id": "2_4208956270549611840", "text": "lass=\"line\"><span> return<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> author: {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> name: <span><span>'John Doe'<span><span>,<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> books: [<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> 'Vue 2 - Advanced Guide'<span><span>,<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> 'Vue 3 - Basic Guide'<span><span>,<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> 'Vue 4 - The Mystery'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> ]<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/computed.html", "title": "计算属性", "doc_id": "8acaf991f91b4a03895985efe72b5214", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1092, "chunk_index": 2, "_doc_id": "2_4208956270549611840"}}
{"doc_id": "3_6356056935608821337", "text": "<span class=\"line\"><span> 'Vue 4 - The Mystery'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> ]<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/computed.html", "title": "计算属性", "doc_id": "8acaf991f91b4a03895985efe72b5214", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1092, "chunk_index": 3, "_doc_id": "3_6356056935608821337"}}
{"doc_id": "4_1806864361566681434", "text": "span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span><code><pre><div><div><div class=\"composition-api\"><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> author<span><span> =<span><span> reactive<span><span>({<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> name: <span><span>'John Doe'<span><span>,<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/computed.html", "title": "计算属性", "doc_id": "8acaf991f91b4a03895985efe72b5214", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1092, "chunk_index": 4, "_doc_id": "4_1806864361566681434"}}
{"doc_id": "5_2546314796080792266", "text": "span>({<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> name: <span><span>'John Doe'<span><span>,<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> books: [<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> 'Vue 2 - Advanced Guide'<span><span>,<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> 'Vue 3 - Basic Guide'<span><span>,<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> 'Vue 4 - The Mystery'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> ]<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/computed.html", "title": "计算属性", "doc_id": "8acaf991f91b4a03895985efe72b5214", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1092, "chunk_index": 5, "_doc_id": "5_2546314796080792266"}}
{"doc_id": "6_8702547128432356421", "text": "<span class=\"line\"><span> 'Vue 4 - The Mystery'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> ]<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>})<span><span><code><pre><div><div><p>我们想根据 <code>author<code> 是否已有一些书籍来展示不同的信息：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>p<span><span>>Has published books:</<span><span>p<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/computed.html", "title": "计算属性", "doc_id": "8acaf991f91b4a03895985efe72b5214", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1092, "chunk_index": 6, "_doc_id": "6_8702547128432356421"}}
{"doc_id": "7_1091096890288177795", "text": "line\"><span><<span><span>p<span><span>>Has published books:</<span><span>p<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>span<span><span>>{{ author.books.<span><span>length<span><span> ><span><span> 0<span><span> ?<span><span> 'Yes'<span><span> :<span><span> 'No'<span><span> }}</<span><span>span<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>这里的模板看起来有些复杂。我们必须认真看好一会儿才能明白它的计算依赖于 <code>author.books<code>。更重要的是，如果在模板中需要不止一次这样的计算，我们可不想将这样的代码在模板里重复好多遍。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/computed.html", "title": "计算属性", "doc_id": "8acaf991f91b4a03895985efe72b5214", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1092, "chunk_index": 7, "_doc_id": "7_1091096890288177795"}}
{"doc_id": "8_7048719449776719791", "text": "起来有些复杂。我们必须认真看好一会儿才能明白它的计算依赖于 <code>author.books<code>。更重要的是，如果在模板中需要不止一次这样的计算，我们可不想将这样的代码在模板里重复好多遍。<p><p>因此我们推荐使用<strong>计算属性<strong>来描述依赖响应式状态的复杂逻辑。这是重构后的示例：<p><div class=\"options-api\"><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> data<span><span>() {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> return<span><span> {<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/computed.html", "title": "计算属性", "doc_id": "8acaf991f91b4a03895985efe72b5214", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1092, "chunk_index": 8, "_doc_id": "8_7048719449776719791"}}
{"doc_id": "9_718183231410409088", "text": "><span> data<span><span>() {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> return<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> author: {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> name: <span><span>'John Doe'<span><span>,<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> books: [<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> 'Vue 2 - Advanced Guide'<span><span>,<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> 'Vue 3 - Basic Guide'<span><span>,<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> 'Vue 4 - The Mystery'<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/computed.html", "title": "计算属性", "doc_id": "8acaf991f91b4a03895985efe72b5214", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1092, "chunk_index": 9, "_doc_id": "9_718183231410409088"}}
{"doc_id": "10_4220405707480590739", "text": "- Basic Guide'<span><span>,<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> 'Vue 4 - The Mystery'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> ]<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> },<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> computed: {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 一个计算属性的 getter<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> publishedBooksMessage<span><span>() {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // `this` 指向当前组件实例<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/computed.html", "title": "计算属性", "doc_id": "8acaf991f91b4a03895985efe72b5214", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1092, "chunk_index": 10, "_doc_id": "10_4220405707480590739"}}
{"doc_id": "11_921164413558642939", "text": "edBooksMessage<span><span>() {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // `this` 指向当前组件实例<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> return<span><span> this<span><span>.author.books.<span><span>length<span><span> ><span><span> 0<span><span> ?<span><span> 'Yes'<span><span> :<span><span> 'No'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/computed.html", "title": "计算属性", "doc_id": "8acaf991f91b4a03895985efe72b5214", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1092, "chunk_index": 11, "_doc_id": "11_921164413558642939"}}
{"doc_id": "12_8080142795668353787", "text": "n> 'No'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span><code><pre><div><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>p<span><span>>Has published books:</<span><span>p<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/computed.html", "title": "计算属性", "doc_id": "8acaf991f91b4a03895985efe72b5214", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1092, "chunk_index": 12, "_doc_id": "12_8080142795668353787"}}
{"doc_id": "13_9162857921353604740", "text": "line\"><span><<span><span>p<span><span>>Has published books:</<span><span>p<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>span<span><span>>{{ publishedBooksMessage }}</<span><span>span<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p><a href=\"https://play.vuejs.", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/computed.html", "title": "计算属性", "doc_id": "8acaf991f91b4a03895985efe72b5214", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1092, "chunk_index": 13, "_doc_id": "13_9162857921353604740"}}
{"doc_id": "14_4287938484602895871", "text": "Message }}</<span><span>span<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p><a href=\"https://play.vuejs.org/#\" target=\"_blank\">在演练场中尝试一下<a><p><p>我们在这里定义了一个计算属性 <code>publishedBooksMessage<code>。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/computed.html", "title": "计算属性", "doc_id": "8acaf991f91b4a03895985efe72b5214", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1092, "chunk_index": 14, "_doc_id": "14_4287938484602895871"}}
{"doc_id": "15_2683177151092906610", "text": "WUwXYyi/gdTEpwK\" target=\"_blank\">在演练场中尝试一下<a><p><p>我们在这里定义了一个计算属性 <code>publishedBooksMessage<code>。<p><p>更改此应用的 <code>data<code> 中 <code>books<code> 数组的值后，可以看到 <code>publishedBooksMessage<code> 也会随之改变。<p><p>在模板中使用计算属性的方式和一般的属性并无二致。Vue 会检测到 <code>this.publishedBooksMessage<code> 依赖于 <code>this.author.books<code>，所以当 <code>this.author.books<code> 改变时，任何依赖于 <code>this.publishedBooksMessage<code> 的绑定都将同时更新。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/computed.html", "title": "计算属性", "doc_id": "8acaf991f91b4a03895985efe72b5214", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1092, "chunk_index": 15, "_doc_id": "15_2683177151092906610"}}
{"doc_id": "16_5126003676220471726", "text": "<code>，所以当 <code>this.author.books<code> 改变时，任何依赖于 <code>this.publishedBooksMessage<code> 的绑定都将同时更新。<p><p>也可参考：<a href=\"/guide/typescript/options-api.html#typing-computed-properties\">为计算属性标记类型<a> <p><div><div class=\"composition-api\"><div class=\"language-vue\"> <span class=\"lang\">vue<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>script<span><span> setup<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/computed.html", "title": "计算属性", "doc_id": "8acaf991f91b4a03895985efe72b5214", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1092, "chunk_index": 16, "_doc_id": "16_5126003676220471726"}}
{"doc_id": "17_6623832548334331738", "text": "code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>script<span><span> setup<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>import<span><span> { reactive, computed } <span><span>from<span><span> 'vue'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> author<span><span> =<span><span> reactive<span><span>({<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> name: <span><span>'John Doe'<span><span>,<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> books: [<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/computed.html", "title": "计算属性", "doc_id": "8acaf991f91b4a03895985efe72b5214", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1092, "chunk_index": 17, "_doc_id": "17_6623832548334331738"}}
{"doc_id": "18_5679249734391261727", "text": "ame: <span><span>'John Doe'<span><span>,<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> books: [<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> 'Vue 2 - Advanced Guide'<span><span>,<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> 'Vue 3 - Basic Guide'<span><span>,<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> 'Vue 4 - The Mystery'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> ]<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>})<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 一个计算属性 ref<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/computed.html", "title": "计算属性", "doc_id": "8acaf991f91b4a03895985efe72b5214", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1092, "chunk_index": 18, "_doc_id": "18_5679249734391261727"}}
{"doc_id": "19_8160868773829645784", "text": "\"><span>})<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 一个计算属性 ref<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> publishedBooksMessage<span><span> =<span><span> computed<span><span>(() <span><span>=><span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> return<span><span> author.books.<span><span>length<span><span> ><span><span> 0<span><span> ?<span><span> 'Yes'<span><span> :<span><span> 'No'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>})<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/computed.html", "title": "计算属性", "doc_id": "8acaf991f91b4a03895985efe72b5214", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1092, "chunk_index": 19, "_doc_id": "19_8160868773829645784"}}
{"doc_id": "20_2829478163738591873", "text": "pan><span> 'Yes'<span><span> :<span><span> 'No'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>})<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>script<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>p<span><span>>Has published books:</<span><span>p<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>span<span><span>>{{ publishedBooksMessage }}</<span><span>span<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/computed.html", "title": "计算属性", "doc_id": "8acaf991f91b4a03895985efe72b5214", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1092, "chunk_index": 20, "_doc_id": "20_2829478163738591873"}}
{"doc_id": "21_2038916159705264433", "text": "<span><span>span<span><span>>{{ publishedBooksMessage }}</<span><span>span<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p><a href=\"https://play.vuejs.", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/computed.html", "title": "计算属性", "doc_id": "8acaf991f91b4a03895985efe72b5214", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1092, "chunk_index": 21, "_doc_id": "21_2038916159705264433"}}
{"doc_id": "22_2715362009013734211", "text": "<span></<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p><a href=\"https://play.vuejs.org/#\" target=\"_blank\">在演练场中尝试一下<a><p><p>我们在这里定义了一个计算属性 <code>publishedBooksMessage<code>。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/computed.html", "title": "计算属性", "doc_id": "8acaf991f91b4a03895985efe72b5214", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1092, "chunk_index": 22, "_doc_id": "22_2715362009013734211"}}
{"doc_id": "23_7147320982767854876", "text": "DjvTfpfSBSbmA==\" target=\"_blank\">在演练场中尝试一下<a><p><p>我们在这里定义了一个计算属性 <code>publishedBooksMessage<code>。<code>computed()<code> 方法期望接收一个 <a href=\"https://developer.mozilla.org/zh-CN/docs/Web/JavaScript/Reference/Functions/get#description\" target=\"_blank\">getter 函数<a>，返回值为一个<strong>计算属性 ref<strong>。和其他一般的 ref 类似，你可以通过 <code>publishedBooksMessage.value<code> 访问计算结果。计算属性 ref 也会在模板中自动解包，因此在模板表达式中引用时无需添加 <code>.value<code>。<p><p>Vue 的计算属性会自动追踪响应式依赖。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/computed.html", "title": "计算属性", "doc_id": "8acaf991f91b4a03895985efe72b5214", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1092, "chunk_index": 23, "_doc_id": "23_7147320982767854876"}}
{"doc_id": "24_4423360439704453304", "text": "alue<code> 访问计算结果。计算属性 ref 也会在模板中自动解包，因此在模板表达式中引用时无需添加 <code>.value<code>。<p><p>Vue 的计算属性会自动追踪响应式依赖。它会检测到 <code>publishedBooksMessage<code> 依赖于 <code>author.books<code>，所以当 <code>author.books<code> 改变时，任何依赖于 <code>publishedBooksMessage<code> 的绑定都会同时更新。<p><p>也可参考：<a href=\"/guide/typescript/composition-api.html#typing-computed\">为计算属性标注类型<a> <p><div><h2 id=\"computed-caching-vs-methods\">计算属性缓存 vs 方法 <a class=\"header-anchor\"", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/computed.html", "title": "计算属性", "doc_id": "8acaf991f91b4a03895985efe72b5214", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1092, "chunk_index": 24, "_doc_id": "24_4423360439704453304"}}
{"doc_id": "25_375303460169330829", "text": "ed\">为计算属性标注类型<a> <p><div><h2 id=\"computed-caching-vs-methods\">计算属性缓存 vs 方法 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#computed-caching-vs-methods\">​<a><h2><p>你可能注意到我们在表达式中像这样调用一个函数也会获得和计算属性相同的结果：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>p<span><span>>{{ <span><span>calculateBooksMessage<span><span>() }}</<span><span>p<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><div class=\"options-api\"><div class=\"language-js\">", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/computed.html", "title": "计算属性", "doc_id": "8acaf991f91b4a03895985efe72b5214", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1092, "chunk_index": 25, "_doc_id": "25_375303460169330829"}}
{"doc_id": "26_4839627209069531283", "text": "><span>p<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><div class=\"options-api\"><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// 组件中<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>methods<span><span>: {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> calculateBooksMessage<span><span>() {<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/computed.html", "title": "计算属性", "doc_id": "8acaf991f91b4a03895985efe72b5214", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1092, "chunk_index": 26, "_doc_id": "26_4839627209069531283"}}
{"doc_id": "27_1431006813545185279", "text": "n><span>: {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> calculateBooksMessage<span><span>() {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> return<span><span> this<span><span>.author.books.<span><span>length<span><span> ><span><span> 0<span><span> ?<span><span> 'Yes'<span><span> :<span><span> 'No'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/computed.html", "title": "计算属性", "doc_id": "8acaf991f91b4a03895985efe72b5214", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1092, "chunk_index": 27, "_doc_id": "27_1431006813545185279"}}
{"doc_id": "28_7282149679115340910", "text": "pan><span> 'Yes'<span><span> :<span><span> 'No'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span><code><pre><div><div><div class=\"composition-api\"><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// 组件中<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>function<span><span> calculateBooksMessage<span><span>() {<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/computed.html", "title": "计算属性", "doc_id": "8acaf991f91b4a03895985efe72b5214", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1092, "chunk_index": 28, "_doc_id": "28_7282149679115340910"}}
{"doc_id": "29_3206505109860265433", "text": "an>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>function<span><span> calculateBooksMessage<span><span>() {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> return<span><span> author.books.<span><span>length<span><span> ><span><span> 0<span><span> ?<span><span> 'Yes'<span><span> :<span><span> 'No'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span><code><pre><div><div><p>若我们将同样的函数定义为一个方法而不是计算属性，两种方式在结果上确实是完全相同的，然而，不同之处在于<strong>计算属性值会基于其响应式依赖被缓存<strong>。一个计算属性仅会在其响应式依赖更新时才重新计算。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/computed.html", "title": "计算属性", "doc_id": "8acaf991f91b4a03895985efe72b5214", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1092, "chunk_index": 29, "_doc_id": "29_3206505109860265433"}}
{"doc_id": "30_3808789998756236633", "text": "数定义为一个方法而不是计算属性，两种方式在结果上确实是完全相同的，然而，不同之处在于<strong>计算属性值会基于其响应式依赖被缓存<strong>。一个计算属性仅会在其响应式依赖更新时才重新计算。这意味着只要 <code>author.books<code> 不改变，无论多少次访问 <code>publishedBooksMessage<code> 都会立即返回先前的计算结果，而不用重复执行 getter 函数。<p><p>这也解释了为什么下面的计算属性永远不会更新，因为 <code>Date.now()<code> 并不是一个响应式依赖：<p><div class=\"options-api\"><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>computed<span><span>: {<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/computed.html", "title": "计算属性", "doc_id": "8acaf991f91b4a03895985efe72b5214", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1092, "chunk_index": 30, "_doc_id": "30_3808789998756236633"}}
{"doc_id": "31_3871109735655322033", "text": "lass=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>computed<span><span>: {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> now<span><span>() {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> return<span><span> Date.<span><span>now<span><span>()<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/computed.html", "title": "计算属性", "doc_id": "8acaf991f91b4a03895985efe72b5214", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1092, "chunk_index": 31, "_doc_id": "31_3871109735655322033"}}
{"doc_id": "32_7185799299171790276", "text": "<span><span> Date.<span><span>now<span><span>()<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span><code><pre><div><div><div class=\"composition-api\"><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> now<span><span> =<span><span> computed<span><span>(() <span><span>=><span><span> Date.<span><span>now<span><span>())<span><span><code><pre><div><div><p>相比之下，方法调用<strong>总是<strong>会在重渲染发生时再次执行函数。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/computed.html", "title": "计算属性", "doc_id": "8acaf991f91b4a03895985efe72b5214", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1092, "chunk_index": 32, "_doc_id": "32_7185799299171790276"}}
{"doc_id": "33_1402138535703335782", "text": "pan>now<span><span>())<span><span><code><pre><div><div><p>相比之下，方法调用<strong>总是<strong>会在重渲染发生时再次执行函数。<p><p>为什么需要缓存呢？想象一下我们有一个非常耗性能的计算属性 <code>list<code>，需要循环一个巨大的数组并做许多计算逻辑，并且可能也有其他计算属性依赖于 <code>list<code>。没有缓存的话，我们会重复执行非常多次 <code>list<code> 的 getter，然而这实际上没有必要！如果你确定不需要缓存，那么也可以使用方法调用。<p><h2 id=\"writable-computed\">可写计算属性 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#writable-computed\">​<a><h2><p>计算属性默认是只读的。当你尝试修改一个计算属性时，你会收到一个运行时警告。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/computed.html", "title": "计算属性", "doc_id": "8acaf991f91b4a03895985efe72b5214", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1092, "chunk_index": 33, "_doc_id": "33_1402138535703335782"}}
{"doc_id": "34_884928869836783308", "text": "<a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#writable-computed\">​<a><h2><p>计算属性默认是只读的。当你尝试修改一个计算属性时，你会收到一个运行时警告。只在某些特殊场景中你可能才需要用到“可写”的属性，你可以通过同时提供 getter 和 setter 来创建：<p><div class=\"options-api\"><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> data<span><span>() {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> return<span><span> {<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/computed.html", "title": "计算属性", "doc_id": "8acaf991f91b4a03895985efe72b5214", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1092, "chunk_index": 34, "_doc_id": "34_884928869836783308"}}
