{"doc_id": "19_823767893372535896", "text": "classObject<span><span>() {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> return<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> active: <span><span>this<span><span>.isActive <span><span>&&<span><span> !<span><span>this<span><span>.error,<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> 'text-danger'<span><span>: <span><span>this<span><span>.error <span><span>&&<span><span> this<span><span>.error.type <span><span>===<span><span> 'fatal'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/class-and-style.html", "title": "Class 与 Style 绑定", "doc_id": "8d59d3e81c434f02ac9d99b1df7eb1d9", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 797, "chunk_index": 19, "_doc_id": "19_823767893372535896"}}
