{"doc_id": "21_8434144400046515134", "text": "><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>div<span><span> :<span><span>class<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>classObject<span><span>\"<span><span>></<span><span>div<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><h3 id=\"binding-to-arrays\">绑定数组 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#binding-to-arrays\">​<a><h3><p>我们可以给 <code>:class<code> 绑定一个数组来渲染多个 CSS class：<p><div class=\"composition-api\"><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/class-and-style.html", "title": "Class 与 Style 绑定", "doc_id": "8d59d3e81c434f02ac9d99b1df7eb1d9", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 797, "chunk_index": 21, "_doc_id": "21_8434144400046515134"}}
{"doc_id": "22_5943950127970187529", "text": "composition-api\"><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> activeClass<span><span> =<span><span> ref<span><span>(<span><span>'active'<span><span>)<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/class-and-style.html", "title": "Class 与 Style 绑定", "doc_id": "8d59d3e81c434f02ac9d99b1df7eb1d9", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 797, "chunk_index": 22, "_doc_id": "22_5943950127970187529"}}
{"doc_id": "23_7287691733638758215", "text": "activeClass<span><span> =<span><span> ref<span><span>(<span><span>'active'<span><span>)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> errorClass<span><span> =<span><span> ref<span><span>(<span><span>'text-danger'<span><span>)<span><span><code><pre><div><div><div class=\"options-api\"><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>data<span><span>() {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> return<span><span> {<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/class-and-style.html", "title": "Class 与 Style 绑定", "doc_id": "8d59d3e81c434f02ac9d99b1df7eb1d9", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 797, "chunk_index": 23, "_doc_id": "23_7287691733638758215"}}
{"doc_id": "24_4438104151729184136", "text": "\"><span>data<span><span>() {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> return<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> activeClass: <span><span>'active'<span><span>,<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> errorClass: <span><span>'text-danger'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/class-and-style.html", "title": "Class 与 Style 绑定", "doc_id": "8d59d3e81c434f02ac9d99b1df7eb1d9", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 797, "chunk_index": 24, "_doc_id": "24_4438104151729184136"}}
{"doc_id": "25_5138323413347777076", "text": "e\"><span> errorClass: <span><span>'text-danger'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span><code><pre><div><div><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>div<span><span> :<span><span>class<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>[activeClass,", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/class-and-style.html", "title": "Class 与 Style 绑定", "doc_id": "8d59d3e81c434f02ac9d99b1df7eb1d9", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 797, "chunk_index": 25, "_doc_id": "25_5138323413347777076"}}
{"doc_id": "26_8526737577481860483", "text": "><<span><span>div<span><span> :<span><span>class<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>[activeClass, errorClass]<span><span>\"<span><span>></<span><span>div<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>渲染的结果是：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>div<span><span> class<span><span>=<span><span>\"active text-danger\"<span><span>></<span><span>div<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>如果你也想在数组中有条件地渲染某个 class，", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/class-and-style.html", "title": "Class 与 Style 绑定", "doc_id": "8d59d3e81c434f02ac9d99b1df7eb1d9", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 797, "chunk_index": 26, "_doc_id": "26_8526737577481860483"}}
{"doc_id": "27_6798443481203740739", "text": "r\"<span><span>></<span><span>div<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>如果你也想在数组中有条件地渲染某个 class，你可以使用三元表达式：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>div<span><span> :<span><span>class<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>[isActive <span><span>?<span><span> activeClass <span><span>:<span><span> ''<span><span>, errorClass]<span><span>\"<span><span>></<span><span>div<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p><code>errorClass<code> 会一直存在，", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/class-and-style.html", "title": "Class 与 Style 绑定", "doc_id": "8d59d3e81c434f02ac9d99b1df7eb1d9", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 797, "chunk_index": 27, "_doc_id": "27_6798443481203740739"}}
{"doc_id": "28_6874941333466007874", "text": "an><span>></<span><span>div<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p><code>errorClass<code> 会一直存在，但 <code>activeClass<code> 只会在 <code>isActive<code> 为真时才存在。<p><p>然而，这可能在有多个依赖条件的 class 时会有些冗长。因此也可以在数组中嵌套对象：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>div<span><span> :<span><span>class<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>[{ [activeClass]: isActive },", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/class-and-style.html", "title": "Class 与 Style 绑定", "doc_id": "8d59d3e81c434f02ac9d99b1df7eb1d9", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 797, "chunk_index": 28, "_doc_id": "28_6874941333466007874"}}
{"doc_id": "29_3031917037273478688", "text": "v<span><span> :<span><span>class<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>[{ [activeClass]: isActive }, errorClass]<span><span>\"<span><span>></<span><span>div<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><h3 id=\"with-components\">在组件上使用 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#with-components\">​<a><h3><blockquote><p>本节假设你已经有 <a href=\"/guide/essentials/component-basics.html\">Vue 组件<a>的知识基础。如果没有，你也可以暂时跳过，以后再阅读。<p><blockquote><p>对于只有一个根元素的组件，当你使用了 <code>class<code> attribute 时，这些 class 会被添加到根元素上并与该元素上已有的 class 合并。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/class-and-style.html", "title": "Class 与 Style 绑定", "doc_id": "8d59d3e81c434f02ac9d99b1df7eb1d9", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 797, "chunk_index": 29, "_doc_id": "29_3031917037273478688"}}
{"doc_id": "30_8561396916958397278", "text": "blockquote><p>对于只有一个根元素的组件，当你使用了 <code>class<code> attribute 时，这些 class 会被添加到根元素上并与该元素上已有的 class 合并。<p><p>举例来说，如果你声明了一个组件名叫 <code>MyComponent<code>，模板如下：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><!-- 子组件模板 --><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/class-and-style.html", "title": "Class 与 Style 绑定", "doc_id": "8d59d3e81c434f02ac9d99b1df7eb1d9", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 797, "chunk_index": 30, "_doc_id": "30_8561396916958397278"}}
{"doc_id": "31_777931860666390824", "text": "an><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><!-- 子组件模板 --><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>p<span><span> class<span><span>=<span><span>\"foo bar\"<span><span>>Hi!</<span><span>p<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>在使用时添加一些 class：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><!-- 在使用组件时 --><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>MyComponent<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/class-and-style.html", "title": "Class 与 Style 绑定", "doc_id": "8d59d3e81c434f02ac9d99b1df7eb1d9", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 797, "chunk_index": 31, "_doc_id": "31_777931860666390824"}}
{"doc_id": "32_7606014377440295118", "text": "ne\"><span><!-- 在使用组件时 --><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>MyComponent<span><span> class<span><span>=<span><span>\"baz boo\"<span><span> /><span><span><code><pre><div><p>渲染出的 HTML 为：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>p<span><span> class<span><span>=<span><span>\"foo bar baz boo\"<span><span>>Hi!</<span><span>p<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>Class 的绑定也是同样的：<p><div", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/class-and-style.html", "title": "Class 与 Style 绑定", "doc_id": "8d59d3e81c434f02ac9d99b1df7eb1d9", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 797, "chunk_index": 32, "_doc_id": "32_7606014377440295118"}}
{"doc_id": "33_6119239768524189975", "text": "o\"<span><span>>Hi!</<span><span>p<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>Class 的绑定也是同样的：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>MyComponent<span><span> :<span><span>class<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>{ active: isActive }<span><span>\"<span><span> /><span><span><code><pre><div><p>当 <code>isActive<code> 为真时，", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/class-and-style.html", "title": "Class 与 Style 绑定", "doc_id": "8d59d3e81c434f02ac9d99b1df7eb1d9", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 797, "chunk_index": 33, "_doc_id": "33_6119239768524189975"}}
{"doc_id": "34_7647309463507760555", "text": "ve: isActive }<span><span>\"<span><span> /><span><span><code><pre><div><p>当 <code>isActive<code> 为真时，被渲染的 HTML 会是：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>p<span><span> class<span><span>=<span><span>\"foo bar active\"<span><span>>Hi!</<span><span>p<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>如果你的组件有多个根元素，你将需要指定哪个根元素来接收这个 class。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/class-and-style.html", "title": "Class 与 Style 绑定", "doc_id": "8d59d3e81c434f02ac9d99b1df7eb1d9", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 797, "chunk_index": 34, "_doc_id": "34_7647309463507760555"}}
{"doc_id": "35_8228835671453466807", "text": ">>Hi!</<span><span>p<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>如果你的组件有多个根元素，你将需要指定哪个根元素来接收这个 class。你可以通过组件的 <code>$attrs<code> 属性来指定接收的元素：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><!-- MyComponent 模板使用 $attrs 时 --><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/class-and-style.html", "title": "Class 与 Style 绑定", "doc_id": "8d59d3e81c434f02ac9d99b1df7eb1d9", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 797, "chunk_index": 35, "_doc_id": "35_8228835671453466807"}}
{"doc_id": "36_4787616788578513299", "text": "github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><!-- MyComponent 模板使用 $attrs 时 --><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>p<span><span> :<span><span>class<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>$attrs.class<span><span>\"<span><span>>Hi!</<span><span>p<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>span<span><span>>This is a child component</<span><span>span<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/class-and-style.html", "title": "Class 与 Style 绑定", "doc_id": "8d59d3e81c434f02ac9d99b1df7eb1d9", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 797, "chunk_index": 36, "_doc_id": "36_4787616788578513299"}}
{"doc_id": "37_2399916889092090752", "text": "><code><pre><div><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>MyComponent<span><span> class<span><span>=<span><span>\"baz\"<span><span> /><span><span><code><pre><div><p>这将被渲染为：<p><div class=\"language-html\"> <span class=\"lang\">html<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>p<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/class-and-style.html", "title": "Class 与 Style 绑定", "doc_id": "8d59d3e81c434f02ac9d99b1df7eb1d9", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 797, "chunk_index": 37, "_doc_id": "37_2399916889092090752"}}
{"doc_id": "38_6152022432917372082", "text": "an><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>p<span><span> class<span><span>=<span><span>\"baz\"<span><span>>Hi!</<span><span>p<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>span<span><span>>This is a child component</<span><span>span<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>你可以在<a href=\"/guide/components/attrs.html\">透传 Attribute<a> 一章中了解更多组件的 attribute 继承的细节。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/class-and-style.html", "title": "Class 与 Style 绑定", "doc_id": "8d59d3e81c434f02ac9d99b1df7eb1d9", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 797, "chunk_index": 38, "_doc_id": "38_6152022432917372082"}}
{"doc_id": "39_215732399877045740", "text": "><pre><div><p>你可以在<a href=\"/guide/components/attrs.html\">透传 Attribute<a> 一章中了解更多组件的 attribute 继承的细节。<p><h2 id=\"binding-inline-styles\">绑定内联样式 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#binding-inline-styles\">​<a><h2><h3 id=\"binding-to-objects-1\">绑定对象 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#binding-to-objects-1\">​<a><h3><p><code>:style<code> 支持绑定 JavaScript 对象值，", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/class-and-style.html", "title": "Class 与 Style 绑定", "doc_id": "8d59d3e81c434f02ac9d99b1df7eb1d9", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 797, "chunk_index": 39, "_doc_id": "39_215732399877045740"}}
{"doc_id": "40_5839872693455214831", "text": "lass=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#binding-to-objects-1\">​<a><h3><p><code>:style<code> 支持绑定 JavaScript 对象值，对应的是 <a href=\"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/API/HTMLElement/style\" target=\"_blank\">HTML 元素的 <code>style<code> 属性<a>：<p><div class=\"composition-api\"><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> activeColor<span><span> =<span><span> ref<span><span>(<span><span>'red'<span><span>)<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/class-and-style.html", "title": "Class 与 Style 绑定", "doc_id": "8d59d3e81c434f02ac9d99b1df7eb1d9", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 797, "chunk_index": 40, "_doc_id": "40_5839872693455214831"}}
{"doc_id": "41_4137301156453646092", "text": "n> activeColor<span><span> =<span><span> ref<span><span>(<span><span>'red'<span><span>)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> fontSize<span><span> =<span><span> ref<span><span>(<span><span>30<span><span>)<span><span><code><pre><div><div><div class=\"options-api\"><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>data<span><span>() {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> return<span><span> {<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/class-and-style.html", "title": "Class 与 Style 绑定", "doc_id": "8d59d3e81c434f02ac9d99b1df7eb1d9", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 797, "chunk_index": 41, "_doc_id": "41_4137301156453646092"}}
{"doc_id": "42_1235746389411099524", "text": "\"><span>data<span><span>() {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> return<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> activeColor: <span><span>'red'<span><span>,<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> fontSize: <span><span>30<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/class-and-style.html", "title": "Class 与 Style 绑定", "doc_id": "8d59d3e81c434f02ac9d99b1df7eb1d9", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 797, "chunk_index": 42, "_doc_id": "42_1235746389411099524"}}
{"doc_id": "43_1527930713507664282", "text": "an class=\"line\"><span> fontSize: <span><span>30<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span><code><pre><div><div><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>div<span><span> :<span><span>style<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>{ color: activeColor, fontSize: fontSize <span><span>+<span><span> 'px'<span><span> }<span><span>\"<span><span>></<span><span>div<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>尽管推荐使用 camelCase，", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/class-and-style.html", "title": "Class 与 Style 绑定", "doc_id": "8d59d3e81c434f02ac9d99b1df7eb1d9", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 797, "chunk_index": 43, "_doc_id": "43_1527930713507664282"}}
{"doc_id": "44_591768097653500798", "text": "n><span>\"<span><span>></<span><span>div<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>尽管推荐使用 camelCase，但 <code>:style<code> 也支持 kebab-cased 形式的 CSS 属性 key (对应其 CSS 中的实际名称)，", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/class-and-style.html", "title": "Class 与 Style 绑定", "doc_id": "8d59d3e81c434f02ac9d99b1df7eb1d9", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 797, "chunk_index": 44, "_doc_id": "44_591768097653500798"}}
{"doc_id": "45_7124227357941255259", "text": "><pre><div><p>尽管推荐使用 camelCase，但 <code>:style<code> 也支持 kebab-cased 形式的 CSS 属性 key (对应其 CSS 中的实际名称)，例如：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>div<span><span> :<span><span>style<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>{ <span><span>'font-size'<span><span>: fontSize <span><span>+<span><span> 'px'<span><span> }<span><span>\"<span><span>></<span><span>div<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>直接绑定一个样式对象通常是一个好主意，", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/class-and-style.html", "title": "Class 与 Style 绑定", "doc_id": "8d59d3e81c434f02ac9d99b1df7eb1d9", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 797, "chunk_index": 45, "_doc_id": "45_7124227357941255259"}}
{"doc_id": "46_4403408135385569849", "text": "<span>\"<span><span>></<span><span>div<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>直接绑定一个样式对象通常是一个好主意，这样可以使模板更加简洁：<p><div class=\"composition-api\"><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> styleObject<span><span> =<span><span> reactive<span><span>({<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> color: <span><span>'red'<span><span>,<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> fontSize: <span><span>'30px'<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/class-and-style.html", "title": "Class 与 Style 绑定", "doc_id": "8d59d3e81c434f02ac9d99b1df7eb1d9", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 797, "chunk_index": 46, "_doc_id": "46_4403408135385569849"}}
{"doc_id": "47_4200919410927391099", "text": "n>'red'<span><span>,<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> fontSize: <span><span>'30px'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>})<span><span><code><pre><div><div><div class=\"options-api\"><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>data<span><span>() {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> return<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> styleObject: {<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/class-and-style.html", "title": "Class 与 Style 绑定", "doc_id": "8d59d3e81c434f02ac9d99b1df7eb1d9", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 797, "chunk_index": 47, "_doc_id": "47_4200919410927391099"}}
{"doc_id": "48_6388811846662402740", "text": "\"line\"><span> return<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> styleObject: {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> color: <span><span>'red'<span><span>,<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> fontSize: <span><span>'13px'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/class-and-style.html", "title": "Class 与 Style 绑定", "doc_id": "8d59d3e81c434f02ac9d99b1df7eb1d9", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 797, "chunk_index": 48, "_doc_id": "48_6388811846662402740"}}
{"doc_id": "49_8733296471935972324", "text": ">'13px'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span><code><pre><div><div><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>div<span><span> :<span><span>style<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>styleObject<span><span>\"<span><span>></<span><span>div<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>同样的，如果样式对象需要更复杂的逻辑，也可以使用返回样式对象的计算属性。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/class-and-style.html", "title": "Class 与 Style 绑定", "doc_id": "8d59d3e81c434f02ac9d99b1df7eb1d9", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 797, "chunk_index": 49, "_doc_id": "49_8733296471935972324"}}
{"doc_id": "50_7446600006379060854", "text": "n>></<span><span>div<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>同样的，如果样式对象需要更复杂的逻辑，也可以使用返回样式对象的计算属性。<p><p><code>:style<code> 指令也可以和常规的 style attribute 共存，就像 <code>:class<code>。<p><p>模板：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>h1<span><span> style<span><span>=<span><span>\"color: red\"<span><span> :<span><span>style<span><span>=<span><span>\"'font-size:", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/class-and-style.html", "title": "Class 与 Style 绑定", "doc_id": "8d59d3e81c434f02ac9d99b1df7eb1d9", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 797, "chunk_index": 50, "_doc_id": "50_7446600006379060854"}}
{"doc_id": "51_3256130759419466465", "text": "<span>=<span><span>\"color: red\"<span><span> :<span><span>style<span><span>=<span><span>\"'font-size: 1em'\"<span><span>>hello</<span><span>h1<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>这将被渲染为：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>h1<span><span> style<span><span>=<span><span>\"color: red;", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/class-and-style.html", "title": "Class 与 Style 绑定", "doc_id": "8d59d3e81c434f02ac9d99b1df7eb1d9", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 797, "chunk_index": 51, "_doc_id": "51_3256130759419466465"}}
{"doc_id": "52_7114089730802803478", "text": "ode><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>h1<span><span> style<span><span>=<span><span>\"color: red; font-size: 1em;\"<span><span>>hello</<span><span>h1<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><h3 id=\"binding-to-arrays-1\">绑定数组 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#binding-to-arrays-1\">​<a><h3><p>我们还可以给 <code>:style<code> 绑定一个包含多个样式对象的数组。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/class-and-style.html", "title": "Class 与 Style 绑定", "doc_id": "8d59d3e81c434f02ac9d99b1df7eb1d9", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 797, "chunk_index": 52, "_doc_id": "52_7114089730802803478"}}
{"doc_id": "53_900614173093508062", "text": "ss=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#binding-to-arrays-1\">​<a><h3><p>我们还可以给 <code>:style<code> 绑定一个包含多个样式对象的数组。这些对象会被合并后渲染到同一元素上：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>div<span><span> :<span><span>style<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>[baseStyles,", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/class-and-style.html", "title": "Class 与 Style 绑定", "doc_id": "8d59d3e81c434f02ac9d99b1df7eb1d9", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 797, "chunk_index": 53, "_doc_id": "53_900614173093508062"}}
{"doc_id": "54_6675886093697233482", "text": "n><<span><span>div<span><span> :<span><span>style<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>[baseStyles, overridingStyles]<span><span>\"<span><span>></<span><span>div<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><h3 id=\"auto-prefixing\">自动前缀 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#auto-prefixing\">​<a><h3><p>当你在 <code>:style<code> 中使用了需要<a href=\"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Glossary/Vendor_Prefix\" target=\"_blank\">浏览器特殊前缀<a>的 CSS 属性时，Vue 会自动为他们加上相应的前缀。Vue 是在运行时检查该属性是否支持在当前浏览器中使用。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/class-and-style.html", "title": "Class 与 Style 绑定", "doc_id": "8d59d3e81c434f02ac9d99b1df7eb1d9", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 797, "chunk_index": 54, "_doc_id": "54_6675886093697233482"}}
{"doc_id": "55_5845254834841211503", "text": "ry/Vendor_Prefix\" target=\"_blank\">浏览器特殊前缀<a>的 CSS 属性时，Vue 会自动为他们加上相应的前缀。Vue 是在运行时检查该属性是否支持在当前浏览器中使用。如果浏览器不支持某个属性，那么将尝试加上各个浏览器特殊前缀，以找到哪一个是被支持的。<p><h3 id=\"multiple-values\">样式多值 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#multiple-values\">​<a><h3><p>你可以对一个样式属性提供多个 (不同前缀的) 值，", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/class-and-style.html", "title": "Class 与 Style 绑定", "doc_id": "8d59d3e81c434f02ac9d99b1df7eb1d9", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 797, "chunk_index": 55, "_doc_id": "55_5845254834841211503"}}
{"doc_id": "56_661221664167252707", "text": "e-values\">样式多值 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#multiple-values\">​<a><h3><p>你可以对一个样式属性提供多个 (不同前缀的) 值，举例来说：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>div<span><span> :<span><span>style<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>{ display: [<span><span>'-webkit-box'<span><span>, <span><span>'-ms-flexbox'<span><span>, <span><span>'flex'<span><span>] }<span><span>\"<span><span>></<span><span>div<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>数组仅会渲染浏览器支持的最后一个值。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/class-and-style.html", "title": "Class 与 Style 绑定", "doc_id": "8d59d3e81c434f02ac9d99b1df7eb1d9", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 797, "chunk_index": 56, "_doc_id": "56_661221664167252707"}}
{"doc_id": "57_7676311235780596640", "text": "><span>\"<span><span>></<span><span>div<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>数组仅会渲染浏览器支持的最后一个值。在这个示例中，在支持不需要特别前缀的浏览器中都会渲染为 <code>display: flex<code>。<p><div><div>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/class-and-style.html", "title": "Class 与 Style 绑定", "doc_id": "8d59d3e81c434f02ac9d99b1df7eb1d9", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 797, "chunk_index": 57, "_doc_id": "57_7676311235780596640"}}
{"doc_id": "0_1021139101018104612", "text": "<div><div><h1 id=\"frequently-asked-questions\">常见问题 <h1><h2 id=\"who-maintains-vue\">谁在维护 Vue？ <h2><p>Vue 是一个独立的社区驱动的项目。它是由<a href=\"https://twitter.com/yuxiyou\" target=\"_blank\">尤雨溪<a>在 2014 年作为其个人项目创建的。今天，Vue 由<a href=\"/about/team.html\">来自世界各地的全职成员和志愿者组成的团队<a>积极活跃地维护着，并由尤雨溪担任项目负责人。你可以在<a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=OrxmtDw4pVI\" target=\"_blank\">这部纪录片<a>中了解更多关于 Vue 的故事。<p><p>自 2016 年以来，Vue 的发展主要是通过赞助来保障的，我们在财务上是可持续的。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/about/faq.html", "title": "常见问题", "doc_id": "2a096eed1e174c269e265170f0f787d7", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 370, "chunk_index": 0, "_doc_id": "0_1021139101018104612"}}
{"doc_id": "1_5657176289485268273", "text": "rxmtDw4pVI\" target=\"_blank\">这部纪录片<a>中了解更多关于 Vue 的故事。<p><p>自 2016 年以来，Vue 的发展主要是通过赞助来保障的，我们在财务上是可持续的。如果你或你的企业从 Vue 中受益，请考虑<a href=\"/sponsor/\">赞助<a>我们，以支持 Vue 的发展！<p><h2 id=\"what-s-the-difference-between-vue-2-and-vue-3\">Vue 2 和 Vue 3 之间的区别是什么？ <h2><p>Vue 3 是 Vue 当前的最新主版本。它包含了一些 Vue 2 中没有的新特性 (比如 Teleport、Suspense，以及多根元素模板)。同时它也包含了一些与 Vue 2 非兼容性的变更。细节文档请参考 <a href=\"https://v3-migration.vuejs.org/zh/\" target=\"_blank\">Vue 3 迁移指南<a>。<p><p>尽管存在差异，但大多数 Vue API 在两个大版本之间是共享的，所以你的大部分 Vue 2 知识将继续在 Vue 3 中发挥作用。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/about/faq.html", "title": "常见问题", "doc_id": "2a096eed1e174c269e265170f0f787d7", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 370, "chunk_index": 1, "_doc_id": "1_5657176289485268273"}}
{"doc_id": "2_8609103698558488269", "text": "rget=\"_blank\">Vue 3 迁移指南<a>。<p><p>尽管存在差异，但大多数 Vue API 在两个大版本之间是共享的，所以你的大部分 Vue 2 知识将继续在 Vue 3 中发挥作用。需要注意的是，组合式 API 原本是一个 Vue 3 独有的特性，但目前已兼容至 Vue 2 且在 <a href=\"https://github.com/vuejs/vue/blob/main/CHANGELOG.md#270-2022-07-01\" target=\"_blank\">Vue 2.7<a> 中可用。<p><p>总的来说，Vue 3 提供了更小的包体积、更好的性能、更好的可扩展性和更好的 TypeScript/IDE 支持。如果你现在要开始一个新项目，我们推荐你选择 Vue 3。但也仍然存在一些考虑使用 Vue 2 的理由：<p><ul><li>你需要支持 IE11。Vue 3 用到了一些 IE11 不支持的现代 JavaScript 特性。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/about/faq.html", "title": "常见问题", "doc_id": "2a096eed1e174c269e265170f0f787d7", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 370, "chunk_index": 2, "_doc_id": "2_8609103698558488269"}}
{"doc_id": "3_6179090910027756381", "text": "项目，我们推荐你选择 Vue 3。但也仍然存在一些考虑使用 Vue 2 的理由：<p><ul><li>你需要支持 IE11。Vue 3 用到了一些 IE11 不支持的现代 JavaScript 特性。<li><ul><p>如果你打算将现有的 Vue 2 应用迁移到 Vue 3，请查阅<a href=\"https://v3-migration.vuejs.org/zh/\" target=\"_blank\">迁移指南<a>。<p><h2 id=\"is-vue-2-still-supported\">Vue 2 仍在维护吗？ <h2><p>Vue 2 在 2022 年 6 月发布了最后一个小版本 (2.7)。目前 Vue 2 已经进入维护模式：它将不再提供新特性，但从 2.7 的发布日期开始的 18 个月内，它将继续针对重大错误修复和安全更新进行发布。这意味着 <strong>Vue 2 已在 2023 年 12 月 31 日到达它的截止维护日期<strong>。<p><p>我们相信这为大多数的生态系统提供了足够长的时间来迁移到 Vue 3。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/about/faq.html", "title": "常见问题", "doc_id": "2a096eed1e174c269e265170f0f787d7", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 370, "chunk_index": 3, "_doc_id": "3_6179090910027756381"}}
{"doc_id": "4_7598843727434061129", "text": "发布。这意味着 <strong>Vue 2 已在 2023 年 12 月 31 日到达它的截止维护日期<strong>。<p><p>我们相信这为大多数的生态系统提供了足够长的时间来迁移到 Vue 3。然而，我们也理解可能会有无法在此时间轴上升级的团队或项目仍需满足其安全及合规需求。我们正在与业内专家合作为有这种需求的团队提供 Vue 2 的扩展支持——如果您的团队预期在 2023 年底之后仍然需要使用 Vue 2，请确保提前计划，详见 <a href=\"https://v2.vuejs.org/lts/\" target=\"_blank\">Vue 2 延长 LTS<a>。<p><h2 id=\"what-license-does-vue-use\">Vue 使用什么开源协议？ <h2><p>Vue 是完全免费的开源项目，且基于 <a href=\"https://opensource.org/licenses/MIT\" target=\"_blank\">MIT License<a> 发布。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/about/faq.html", "title": "常见问题", "doc_id": "2a096eed1e174c269e265170f0f787d7", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 370, "chunk_index": 4, "_doc_id": "4_7598843727434061129"}}
{"doc_id": "5_3462730411018230980", "text": ">Vue 是完全免费的开源项目，且基于 <a href=\"https://opensource.org/licenses/MIT\" target=\"_blank\">MIT License<a> 发布。<p><h2 id=\"what-browsers-does-vue-support\">Vue 支持哪些浏览器？ <h2><p>最新版本的 Vue (3.x) 只支持<a href=\"https://caniuse.com/es2016\" target=\"_blank\">原生支持 ES2016 的浏览器<a>。这并不包括 IE11。Vue 3.x 使用的 ES2016 功能无法在旧版本的浏览器中进行兼容，如果你需要支持旧版本的浏览器，请使用 Vue 2.x 替代。<p><h2 id=\"is-vue-reliable\">Vue 可靠吗？ <h2><p>Vue 是一个成熟的、经历了无数实战考验的框架。它是目前生产环境中使用最广泛的 JavaScript 框架之一，在全球拥有超过 150 万用户，并且在 npm 上的月下载量超过 1000 万次。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/about/faq.html", "title": "常见问题", "doc_id": "2a096eed1e174c269e265170f0f787d7", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 370, "chunk_index": 5, "_doc_id": "5_3462730411018230980"}}
{"doc_id": "6_2801360785827270684", "text": "<p>Vue 是一个成熟的、经历了无数实战考验的框架。它是目前生产环境中使用最广泛的 JavaScript 框架之一，在全球拥有超过 150 万用户，并且在 npm 上的月下载量超过 1000 万次。<p><p>Vue 被世界各地知名且多元的组织在生产环境中使用，包括 Wikimedia 基金会、美国宇航局、苹果、谷歌、微软、GitLab、Zoom、腾讯、微博、哔哩哔哩、快手等等。<p><h2 id=\"is-vue-fast\">Vue 速度快吗？ <h2><p>Vue 3 是性能最强的主流前端框架之一，可以轻松处理大多数 web 应用的场景，并且几乎不需要手动优化。<p><p>跑分方面，Vue 在 <a href=\"https://krausest.github.io/js-framework-benchmark/current.html\" target=\"_blank\">js-framework-benchmark<a> 中的表现比 React 和 Angular 要好得多。在该基准测试中，它还与一些生产环境下最快级别的非虚拟 DOM 框架并驾齐驱。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/about/faq.html", "title": "常见问题", "doc_id": "2a096eed1e174c269e265170f0f787d7", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 370, "chunk_index": 6, "_doc_id": "6_2801360785827270684"}}
{"doc_id": "7_7968785886864686121", "text": "\"_blank\">js-framework-benchmark<a> 中的表现比 React 和 Angular 要好得多。在该基准测试中，它还与一些生产环境下最快级别的非虚拟 DOM 框架并驾齐驱。<p><p>请注意，像上面这样的跑分的侧重点在于原始渲染性能在特定情况下的优化，因此不能完全代表真实世界的性能结果。如果你更关心页面加载性能，欢迎用 <a href=\"https://www.webpagetest.org/lighthouse\" target=\"_blank\">WebPageTest<a> 或是 <a href=\"https://pagespeed.web.dev/\" target=\"_blank\">PageSpeed Insights<a> 来测试本站。本文档站是一个完全由 Vue 本身构建，通过静态生成预渲染，并在客户端进行 hydration 的单页应用。它在模拟 4 倍 CPU 降速的 Moto G4 + 低速 4G 网络的情况下依然能获得 100 分的性能得分。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/about/faq.html", "title": "常见问题", "doc_id": "2a096eed1e174c269e265170f0f787d7", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 370, "chunk_index": 7, "_doc_id": "7_7968785886864686121"}}
{"doc_id": "8_7982000587496304414", "text": "Vue 本身构建，通过静态生成预渲染，并在客户端进行 hydration 的单页应用。它在模拟 4 倍 CPU 降速的 Moto G4 + 低速 4G 网络的情况下依然能获得 100 分的性能得分。<p><p>你可以在<a href=\"/guide/extras/rendering-mechanism.html\">渲染机制<a>章节了解更多关于 Vue 如何自动优化运行时性能的信息，也可以在<a href=\"/guide/best-practices/performance.html\">性能优化指南<a>中了解如何在特别苛刻的情况下优化 Vue 应用。<p><h2 id=\"is-vue-lightweight\">Vue 体积小吗？ <h2><p>当你通过构建工具使用时，Vue 的许多 API 都是可以<a href=\"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Glossary/Tree_shaking\" target=\"_blank\">“tree-shake”<a>的。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/about/faq.html", "title": "常见问题", "doc_id": "2a096eed1e174c269e265170f0f787d7", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 370, "chunk_index": 8, "_doc_id": "8_7982000587496304414"}}
{"doc_id": "9_1439375786539627253", "text": "f=\"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Glossary/Tree_shaking\" target=\"_blank\">“tree-shake”<a>的。例如，如果你不使用内置的 <code><Transition><code> 组件，它就不会被包含在最终的生产环境包里。<p><p>对于一个 Vue 的最少 API 使用的 hello world 应用来说，配合最小化和 brotli 压缩，其基线大小只有 <strong>16kb<strong> 左右。但实际的应用大小取决于你使用了多少框架的可选特性。在极端情况下，如果一个应用使用了 Vue 提供的每一个特性，那么总的运行时大小大约为 <strong>27kb<strong>。<p><p>如果不通过构建工具使用 Vue，我们不仅失去了 tree-shaking，而且还必须将模板编译器加载到浏览器。这就使包体积增大到了 <strong>41kb<strong> 左右。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/about/faq.html", "title": "常见问题", "doc_id": "2a096eed1e174c269e265170f0f787d7", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 370, "chunk_index": 9, "_doc_id": "9_1439375786539627253"}}
{"doc_id": "10_5047554578441468401", "text": "ng>。<p><p>如果不通过构建工具使用 Vue，我们不仅失去了 tree-shaking，而且还必须将模板编译器加载到浏览器。这就使包体积增大到了 <strong>41kb<strong> 左右。因此，如果你为了渐进式增强在没有构建步骤的情况下使用 Vue，则可以考虑使用 <a href=\"https://github.com/vuejs/petite-vue\" target=\"_blank\">petite-vue<a> (仅 <strong>6kb<strong>) 来代替。<p><p>一些诸如 Svelte 的框架使用了一种为单个组件产生极轻量级输出的编译策略。然而，<a href=\"https://github.com/yyx990803/vue-svelte-size-analysis\" target=\"_blank\">我们的研究<a>表明，包大小的差异在很大程度上取决于应用中的组件数量。虽然 Vue 的基线大小更重，但它生成的每个组件的代码更少。在现实的场景中，Vue 应用很可能最终会更轻。<p><h2 id=\"does-vue-scale\">Vue 能胜任大规模场景吗？ <h2><p>是的。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/about/faq.html", "title": "常见问题", "doc_id": "2a096eed1e174c269e265170f0f787d7", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 370, "chunk_index": 10, "_doc_id": "10_5047554578441468401"}}
{"doc_id": "11_8614945295647327991", "text": "e 的基线大小更重，但它生成的每个组件的代码更少。在现实的场景中，Vue 应用很可能最终会更轻。<p><h2 id=\"does-vue-scale\">Vue 能胜任大规模场景吗？ <h2><p>是的。尽管有一种误解是 Vue 只适用于简单的场景，但其实 Vue 完全有能力处理大规模的应用：<p><ul><li><p><a href=\"/guide/scaling-up/sfc.html\">单文件组件<a>提供了一个模块化的开发模型，让应用的不同部分能够被隔离开发。<p><li><li><p><a href=\"/guide/reusability/composables.html\">组合式 API<a> 提供一流的 TypeScript 集成，并为组织、提取和重用复杂逻辑提供了简洁的模式。<p><li><li><p><a href=\"/guide/scaling-up/tooling.html\">全面的工具链支持<a>使得开发体验在应用增长的过程中依然可以保持平滑。<p><li><li><p>较低的入门门槛和优秀的文档能够显著降低新手开发者的入职和培训成本。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/about/faq.html", "title": "常见问题", "doc_id": "2a096eed1e174c269e265170f0f787d7", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 370, "chunk_index": 11, "_doc_id": "11_8614945295647327991"}}
{"doc_id": "12_2850911167100387802", "text": "-up/tooling.html\">全面的工具链支持<a>使得开发体验在应用增长的过程中依然可以保持平滑。<p><li><li><p>较低的入门门槛和优秀的文档能够显著降低新手开发者的入职和培训成本。<p><li><ul><h2 id=\"how-do-i-contribute-to-vue\">我可以为 Vue 做贡献吗？ <h2><p>非常欢迎！请阅读我们的<a href=\"/about/community-guide.html\">社区指南<a>。<p><h2 id=\"should-i-use-options-api-or-composition-api\">我应该使用选项式 API 还是组合式 API？ <h2><p>如果你是 Vue 的新手，我们在<a href=\"/guide/introduction.html#which-to-choose\">这里<a>提供了一个两者之间宏观的比较。<p><p>如果你过去使用过选项式 API 且正在评估组合式 API，可以查阅<a href=\"/guide/extras/composition-api-faq.html\">组合式 API 常见问题<a>。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/about/faq.html", "title": "常见问题", "doc_id": "2a096eed1e174c269e265170f0f787d7", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 370, "chunk_index": 12, "_doc_id": "12_2850911167100387802"}}
{"doc_id": "13_2271312953065645086", "text": "p>如果你过去使用过选项式 API 且正在评估组合式 API，可以查阅<a href=\"/guide/extras/composition-api-faq.html\">组合式 API 常见问题<a>。<p><h2 id=\"should-i-use-javascript-or-typescript-with-vue\">用 Vue 的时候应该选 JS 还是 TS？ <h2><p>虽然 Vue 本身是用 TypeScript 实现的，并提供一流的 TypeScript 支持，但它并不强制要求用户使用 TypeScript。<p><p>在向 Vue 添加新特性时，对 TypeScript 的支持是一个重要的考虑因素。即使你自己不使用 TypeScript，考虑了 TypeScript 支持的 API 设计也通常更容易被 IDE 和静态分析工具分析，因此这对大家都有好处。Vue 的 API 设计也尽可能在 JavaScript 和 TypeScript 中以相同的方式工作。<p><p>选用 TypeScript 会涉及在上手复杂性和长期可维护性收益之间作出权衡。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/about/faq.html", "title": "常见问题", "doc_id": "2a096eed1e174c269e265170f0f787d7", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 370, "chunk_index": 13, "_doc_id": "13_2271312953065645086"}}
{"doc_id": "14_5637622150580175759", "text": "好处。Vue 的 API 设计也尽可能在 JavaScript 和 TypeScript 中以相同的方式工作。<p><p>选用 TypeScript 会涉及在上手复杂性和长期可维护性收益之间作出权衡。这种权衡是否合理取决于你的团队背景和项目规模，但 Vue 并不会真正成为影响这一决定的因素。<p><h2 id=\"how-does-vue-compare-to-web-components\">Vue 相比于 Web Components 究竟如何？ <h2><p>Vue 是在 Web Components 出现之前被创建的，Vue 在某些方面的设计 (例如插槽) 受到了 Web Components 模型的启发。<p><p>Web Components 规范相对底层一些，因为它们是以自定义元素为中心的。作为一个框架，Vue 解决了更多上层的问题，如高效的 DOM 渲染、响应式状态管理、工具链、客户端路由和服务器端渲染等。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/about/faq.html", "title": "常见问题", "doc_id": "2a096eed1e174c269e265170f0f787d7", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 370, "chunk_index": 14, "_doc_id": "14_5637622150580175759"}}
{"doc_id": "15_7670832135784698208", "text": "Web Components 规范相对底层一些，因为它们是以自定义元素为中心的。作为一个框架，Vue 解决了更多上层的问题，如高效的 DOM 渲染、响应式状态管理、工具链、客户端路由和服务器端渲染等。<p><p>Vue 完全支持在 Vue 组件中使用原生自定义元素，也支持将 Vue 组件导出为原生自定义元素——请参阅 <a href=\"/guide/extras/web-components.html\">Vue 和 Web Components 指南<a>以了解更多细节。<p><div><div>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/about/faq.html", "title": "常见问题", "doc_id": "2a096eed1e174c269e265170f0f787d7", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 370, "chunk_index": 15, "_doc_id": "15_7670832135784698208"}}
{"doc_id": "0_5709068416316787050", "text": "<div><div><h1 id=\"conditional-rendering\">条件渲染 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#conditional-rendering\">​<a><h1><h2 id=\"v-if\"><code>v-if<code> <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#v-if\">​<a><h2><p><code>v-if<code> 指令用于条件性地渲染一块内容。这块内容只会在指令的表达式返回真值时才被渲染。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/conditional.html", "title": "条件渲染", "doc_id": "a1582857bd0342a4bfce33532cf832fe", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 231, "chunk_index": 0, "_doc_id": "0_5709068416316787050"}}
{"doc_id": "1_6077545550877399793", "text": "lass=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#v-if\">​<a><h2><p><code>v-if<code> 指令用于条件性地渲染一块内容。这块内容只会在指令的表达式返回真值时才被渲染。<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>h1<span><span> v-if<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>awesome<span><span>\"<span><span>>Vue is awesome!</<span><span>h1<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><h2 id=\"v-else\"><code>v-else<code> <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#v-else\">​<a><h2><p>你也可以使用 <code>v-else<code> 为 <code>v-if<code> 添加一个“else 区块”。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/conditional.html", "title": "条件渲染", "doc_id": "a1582857bd0342a4bfce33532cf832fe", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 231, "chunk_index": 1, "_doc_id": "1_6077545550877399793"}}
{"doc_id": "2_1086228263200433639", "text": "header-anchor\" href=\"#v-else\">​<a><h2><p>你也可以使用 <code>v-else<code> 为 <code>v-if<code> 添加一个“else 区块”。<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>button<span><span> @<span><span>click<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>awesome <span><span>=<span><span> !<span><span>awesome<span><span>\"<span><span>>Toggle</<span><span>button<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/conditional.html", "title": "条件渲染", "doc_id": "a1582857bd0342a4bfce33532cf832fe", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 231, "chunk_index": 2, "_doc_id": "2_1086228263200433639"}}
{"doc_id": "3_5463399280063786632", "text": "n><span>\"<span><span>>Toggle</<span><span>button<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>h1<span><span> v-if<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>awesome<span><span>\"<span><span>>Vue is awesome!</<span><span>h1<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/conditional.html", "title": "条件渲染", "doc_id": "a1582857bd0342a4bfce33532cf832fe", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 231, "chunk_index": 3, "_doc_id": "3_5463399280063786632"}}
{"doc_id": "4_5036282556521064136", "text": "pan><span>awesome<span><span>\"<span><span>>Vue is awesome!</<span><span>h1<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>h1<span><span> v-else<span><span>>Oh no 😢</<span><span>h1<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p class=\"demo\"> Toggle <h1>Vue is awesome!<h1><p><p>一个 <code>v-else<code> 元素必须跟在一个 <code>v-if<code> 或者 <code>v-else-if<code> 元素后面，否则它将不会被识别。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/conditional.html", "title": "条件渲染", "doc_id": "a1582857bd0342a4bfce33532cf832fe", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 231, "chunk_index": 4, "_doc_id": "4_5036282556521064136"}}
{"doc_id": "5_6470065671902392547", "text": "e!<h1><p><p>一个 <code>v-else<code> 元素必须跟在一个 <code>v-if<code> 或者 <code>v-else-if<code> 元素后面，否则它将不会被识别。<p><h2 id=\"v-else-if\"><code>v-else-if<code> <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#v-else-if\">​<a><h2><p>顾名思义，<code>v-else-if<code> 提供的是相应于 <code>v-if<code> 的“else if 区块”。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/conditional.html", "title": "条件渲染", "doc_id": "a1582857bd0342a4bfce33532cf832fe", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 231, "chunk_index": 5, "_doc_id": "5_6470065671902392547"}}
{"doc_id": "6_4456437635671843967", "text": "hor\" href=\"#v-else-if\">​<a><h2><p>顾名思义，<code>v-else-if<code> 提供的是相应于 <code>v-if<code> 的“else if 区块”。它可以连续多次重复使用：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>div<span><span> v-if<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>type <span><span>===<span><span> 'A'\"<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> A<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>div<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/conditional.html", "title": "条件渲染", "doc_id": "a1582857bd0342a4bfce33532cf832fe", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 231, "chunk_index": 6, "_doc_id": "6_4456437635671843967"}}
{"doc_id": "7_8417354723302496740", "text": "ass=\"line\"><span> A<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>div<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>div<span><span> v-else-if<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>type <span><span>===<span><span> 'B'\"<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> B<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>div<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/conditional.html", "title": "条件渲染", "doc_id": "a1582857bd0342a4bfce33532cf832fe", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 231, "chunk_index": 7, "_doc_id": "7_8417354723302496740"}}
{"doc_id": "8_8793500316179075104", "text": "ass=\"line\"><span> B<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>div<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>div<span><span> v-else-if<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>type <span><span>===<span><span> 'C'\"<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> C<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>div<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>div<span><span> v-else<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> Not A/B/C<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/conditional.html", "title": "条件渲染", "doc_id": "a1582857bd0342a4bfce33532cf832fe", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 231, "chunk_index": 8, "_doc_id": "8_8793500316179075104"}}
{"doc_id": "9_1198233870396478108", "text": "pan>div<span><span> v-else<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> Not A/B/C<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>div<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>和 <code>v-else<code> 类似，一个使用 <code>v-else-if<code> 的元素必须紧跟在一个 <code>v-if<code> 或一个 <code>v-else-if<code> 元素后面。<p><h2 id=\"v-if-on-template\"><code><template><code> 上的 <code>v-if<code> <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#v-if-on-template\">​<a><h2><p>因为 <code>v-if<code> 是一个指令，他必须依附于某个元素。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/conditional.html", "title": "条件渲染", "doc_id": "a1582857bd0342a4bfce33532cf832fe", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 231, "chunk_index": 9, "_doc_id": "9_1198233870396478108"}}
{"doc_id": "10_4238284237479212331", "text": "> <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#v-if-on-template\">​<a><h2><p>因为 <code>v-if<code> 是一个指令，他必须依附于某个元素。但如果我们想要切换不止一个元素呢？在这种情况下我们可以在一个 <code><template><code> 元素上使用 <code>v-if<code>，这只是一个不可见的包装器元素，最后渲染的结果并不会包含这个 <code><template><code> 元素。<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>template<span><span> v-if<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>ok<span><span>\"<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/conditional.html", "title": "条件渲染", "doc_id": "a1582857bd0342a4bfce33532cf832fe", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 231, "chunk_index": 10, "_doc_id": "10_4238284237479212331"}}
{"doc_id": "11_4783379719535182023", "text": "late<span><span> v-if<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>ok<span><span>\"<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>h1<span><span>>Title</<span><span>h1<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>p<span><span>>Paragraph 1</<span><span>p<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>p<span><span>>Paragraph 2</<span><span>p<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/conditional.html", "title": "条件渲染", "doc_id": "a1582857bd0342a4bfce33532cf832fe", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 231, "chunk_index": 11, "_doc_id": "11_4783379719535182023"}}
{"doc_id": "12_2268172886026471772", "text": "class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>p<span><span>>Paragraph 2</<span><span>p<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p><code>v-else<code> 和 <code>v-else-if<code> 也可以在 <code><template><code> 上使用。<p><h2 id=\"v-show\"><code>v-show<code> <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#v-show\">​<a><h2><p>另一个可以用来按条件显示一个元素的指令是 <code>v-show<code>。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/conditional.html", "title": "条件渲染", "doc_id": "a1582857bd0342a4bfce33532cf832fe", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 231, "chunk_index": 12, "_doc_id": "12_2268172886026471772"}}
{"doc_id": "13_7784539620027266283", "text": "ow<code> <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#v-show\">​<a><h2><p>另一个可以用来按条件显示一个元素的指令是 <code>v-show<code>。其用法基本一样：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>h1<span><span> v-show<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>ok<span><span>\"<span><span>>Hello!</<span><span>h1<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>不同之处在于 <code>v-show<code> 会在 DOM 渲染中保留该元素；<code>v-show<code> 仅切换了该元素上名为 <code>display<code> 的 CSS 属性。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/conditional.html", "title": "条件渲染", "doc_id": "a1582857bd0342a4bfce33532cf832fe", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 231, "chunk_index": 13, "_doc_id": "13_7784539620027266283"}}
{"doc_id": "14_8492667857483605534", "text": "同之处在于 <code>v-show<code> 会在 DOM 渲染中保留该元素；<code>v-show<code> 仅切换了该元素上名为 <code>display<code> 的 CSS 属性。<p><p><code>v-show<code> 不支持在 <code><template><code> 元素上使用，也不能和 <code>v-else<code> 搭配使用。<p><h2 id=\"v-if-vs-v-show\"><code>v-if<code> vs. <code>v-show<code> <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#v-if-vs-v-show\">​<a><h2><p><code>v-if<code> 是“真实的”按条件渲染，因为它确保了在切换时，条件区块内的事件监听器和子组件都会被销毁与重建。<p><p><code>v-if<code> 也是<strong>惰性<strong>的：如果在初次渲染时条件值为 false，则不会做任何事。条件区块只有当条件首次变为 true 时才被渲染。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/conditional.html", "title": "条件渲染", "doc_id": "a1582857bd0342a4bfce33532cf832fe", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 231, "chunk_index": 14, "_doc_id": "14_8492667857483605534"}}
{"doc_id": "15_2906025087616906978", "text": "重建。<p><p><code>v-if<code> 也是<strong>惰性<strong>的：如果在初次渲染时条件值为 false，则不会做任何事。条件区块只有当条件首次变为 true 时才被渲染。<p><p>相比之下，<code>v-show<code> 简单许多，元素无论初始条件如何，始终会被渲染，只有 CSS <code>display<code> 属性会被切换。<p><p>总的来说，<code>v-if<code> 有更高的切换开销，而 <code>v-show<code> 有更高的初始渲染开销。因此，如果需要频繁切换，则使用 <code>v-show<code> 较好；如果在运行时绑定条件很少改变，则 <code>v-if<code> 会更合适。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/conditional.html", "title": "条件渲染", "doc_id": "a1582857bd0342a4bfce33532cf832fe", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 231, "chunk_index": 15, "_doc_id": "15_2906025087616906978"}}
{"doc_id": "16_9202055278129823482", "text": "-show<code> 有更高的初始渲染开销。因此，如果需要频繁切换，则使用 <code>v-show<code> 较好；如果在运行时绑定条件很少改变，则 <code>v-if<code> 会更合适。<p><h2 id=\"v-if-with-v-for\"><code>v-if<code> 和 <code>v-for<code> <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#v-if-with-v-for\">​<a><h2><p>当 <code>v-if<code> 和 <code>v-for<code> 同时存在于一个元素上的时候，<code>v-if<code> 会首先被执行。请查看<a href=\"./list.html#v-for-with-v-if\">列表渲染指南<a>获取更多细节。<p><div class=\"warning custom-block\"><p class=\"custom-block-title\">警告<p><p>同时使用 <code>v-if<code> 和 <code>v-for<code> 是<strong>不推荐的<strong>，因为这样二者的优先级不明显。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/conditional.html", "title": "条件渲染", "doc_id": "a1582857bd0342a4bfce33532cf832fe", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 231, "chunk_index": 16, "_doc_id": "16_9202055278129823482"}}
{"doc_id": "17_3140912694476409958", "text": "-block-title\">警告<p><p>同时使用 <code>v-if<code> 和 <code>v-for<code> 是<strong>不推荐的<strong>，因为这样二者的优先级不明显。请查看<a href=\"./list.html#v-for-with-v-if\">列表渲染指南<a>获得更多信息。<p><div><div><div>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/conditional.html", "title": "条件渲染", "doc_id": "a1582857bd0342a4bfce33532cf832fe", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 231, "chunk_index": 17, "_doc_id": "17_3140912694476409958"}}
{"doc_id": "0_4556440867082369321", "text": "<div><div><h1 id=\"provide-inject\">依赖注入 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#provide-inject\">​<a><h1><blockquote><p>此章节假设你已经看过了<a href=\"/guide/essentials/component-basics.html\">组件基础<a>。若你还不了解组件是什么，请先阅读该章节。<p><blockquote><h2 id=\"prop-drilling\">Prop 逐级透传问题 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#prop-drilling\">​<a><h2><p>通常情况下，当我们需要从父组件向子组件传递数据时，会使用 <a href=\"/guide/components/props.html\">props<a>。想象一下这样的结构：有一些多层级嵌套的组件，形成了一棵巨大的组件树，而某个深层的子组件需要一个较远的祖先组件中的部分数据。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/provide-inject.html", "title": "依赖注入", "doc_id": "f9bd54578e44463f8c2e169e1fcf2428", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1007, "chunk_index": 0, "_doc_id": "0_4556440867082369321"}}
{"doc_id": "1_6607825997689216660", "text": "/guide/components/props.html\">props<a>。想象一下这样的结构：有一些多层级嵌套的组件，形成了一棵巨大的组件树，而某个深层的子组件需要一个较远的祖先组件中的部分数据。在这种情况下，如果仅使用 props 则必须将其沿着组件链逐级传递下去，这会非常麻烦：<p><p> <p><p>注意，虽然这里的 <code><Footer><code> 组件可能根本不关心这些 props，但为了使 <code><DeepChild><code> 能访问到它们，仍然需要定义并向下传递。如果组件链路非常长，可能会影响到更多这条路上的组件。这一问题被称为“prop 逐级透传”，显然是我们希望尽量避免的情况。<p><p><code>provide<code> 和 <code>inject<code> 可以帮助我们解决这一问题 <a href=\"#footnote-1\">[1]<a> 。一个父组件相对于其所有的后代组件，会作为<strong>依赖提供者<strong>。任何后代的组件树，无论层级有多深，都可以<strong>注入<strong>由父组件提供给整条链路的依赖。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/provide-inject.html", "title": "依赖注入", "doc_id": "f9bd54578e44463f8c2e169e1fcf2428", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1007, "chunk_index": 1, "_doc_id": "1_6607825997689216660"}}
{"doc_id": "2_9115300076605782602", "text": "<a> 。一个父组件相对于其所有的后代组件，会作为<strong>依赖提供者<strong>。任何后代的组件树，无论层级有多深，都可以<strong>注入<strong>由父组件提供给整条链路的依赖。<p><p> <p><h2 id=\"provide\">Provide (提供) <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#provide\">​<a><h2><div class=\"composition-api\"><p>要为组件后代提供数据，需要使用到 <a href=\"/api/composition-api-dependency-injection.html#provide\"><code>provide()<code><a> 函数：<p><div class=\"language-vue\"> <span class=\"lang\">vue<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>script<span><span> setup<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/provide-inject.html", "title": "依赖注入", "doc_id": "f9bd54578e44463f8c2e169e1fcf2428", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1007, "chunk_index": 2, "_doc_id": "2_9115300076605782602"}}
{"doc_id": "3_1321032296179199588", "text": "code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>script<span><span> setup<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>import<span><span> { provide } <span><span>from<span><span> 'vue'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>provide<span><span>(<span><span>/* 注入名 */<span><span> 'message'<span><span>, <span><span>/* 值 */<span><span> 'hello!'<span><span>)<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/provide-inject.html", "title": "依赖注入", "doc_id": "f9bd54578e44463f8c2e169e1fcf2428", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1007, "chunk_index": 3, "_doc_id": "3_1321032296179199588"}}
{"doc_id": "4_1311347232032437842", "text": "pan><span> 'message'<span><span>, <span><span>/* 值 */<span><span> 'hello!'<span><span>)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>script<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>如果不使用 <code><script setup><code>，请确保 <code>provide()<code> 是在 <code>setup()<code> 同步调用的：<p><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>import<span><span> { provide } <span><span>from<span><span> 'vue'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/provide-inject.html", "title": "依赖注入", "doc_id": "f9bd54578e44463f8c2e169e1fcf2428", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1007, "chunk_index": 4, "_doc_id": "4_1311347232032437842"}}
{"doc_id": "5_3978944963857970627", "text": "rt<span><span> { provide } <span><span>from<span><span> 'vue'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> setup<span><span>() {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> provide<span><span>(<span><span>/* 注入名 */<span><span> 'message'<span><span>, <span><span>/* 值 */<span><span> 'hello!'<span><span>)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/provide-inject.html", "title": "依赖注入", "doc_id": "f9bd54578e44463f8c2e169e1fcf2428", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1007, "chunk_index": 5, "_doc_id": "5_3978944963857970627"}}
{"doc_id": "6_9073210691122351295", "text": "<span>/* 值 */<span><span> 'hello!'<span><span>)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span><code><pre><div><p><code>provide()<code> 函数接收两个参数。第一个参数被称为<strong>注入名<strong>，可以是一个字符串或是一个 <code>Symbol<code>。后代组件会用注入名来查找期望注入的值。一个组件可以多次调用 <code>provide()<code>，使用不同的注入名，注入不同的依赖值。<p><p>第二个参数是提供的值，值可以是任意类型，包括响应式的状态，比如一个 ref：<p><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>import<span><span> { ref, provide } <span><span>from<span><span> 'vue'<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/provide-inject.html", "title": "依赖注入", "doc_id": "f9bd54578e44463f8c2e169e1fcf2428", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1007, "chunk_index": 6, "_doc_id": "6_9073210691122351295"}}
{"doc_id": "7_4049564577826970634", "text": "ass=\"line\"><span>import<span><span> { ref, provide } <span><span>from<span><span> 'vue'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> count<span><span> =<span><span> ref<span><span>(<span><span>0<span><span>)<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/provide-inject.html", "title": "依赖注入", "doc_id": "f9bd54578e44463f8c2e169e1fcf2428", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1007, "chunk_index": 7, "_doc_id": "7_4049564577826970634"}}
{"doc_id": "8_8568520239705013621", "text": "<span><span> count<span><span> =<span><span> ref<span><span>(<span><span>0<span><span>)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>provide<span><span>(<span><span>'key'<span><span>, count)<span><span><code><pre><div><p>提供的响应式状态使后代组件可以由此和提供者建立响应式的联系。<p><div><div class=\"options-api\"><p>要为组件后代提供数据，需要使用到 <a href=\"/api/options-composition.html#provide\"><code>provide<code><a> 选项：<p><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/provide-inject.html", "title": "依赖注入", "doc_id": "f9bd54578e44463f8c2e169e1fcf2428", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1007, "chunk_index": 8, "_doc_id": "8_8568520239705013621"}}
{"doc_id": "9_2470242073759825200", "text": "b-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> provide: {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> message: <span><span>'hello!'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/provide-inject.html", "title": "依赖注入", "doc_id": "f9bd54578e44463f8c2e169e1fcf2428", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1007, "chunk_index": 9, "_doc_id": "9_2470242073759825200"}}
{"doc_id": "10_2871719382001142887", "text": "ass=\"line\"><span> message: <span><span>'hello!'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span><code><pre><div><p>对于 <code>provide<code> 对象上的每一个属性，后代组件会用其 key 为注入名查找期望注入的值，属性的值就是要提供的数据。<p><p>如果我们需要提供依赖当前组件实例的状态 (比如那些由 <code>data()<code> 定义的数据属性)，那么可以以函数形式使用 <code>provide<code>：<p><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/provide-inject.html", "title": "依赖注入", "doc_id": "f9bd54578e44463f8c2e169e1fcf2428", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1007, "chunk_index": 10, "_doc_id": "10_2871719382001142887"}}
{"doc_id": "11_3724530633310163747", "text": "b-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> data<span><span>() {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> return<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> message: <span><span>'hello!'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> },<span><span>\n<span class=\"line highlighted\"><span> provide<span><span>() {<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/provide-inject.html", "title": "依赖注入", "doc_id": "f9bd54578e44463f8c2e169e1fcf2428", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1007, "chunk_index": 11, "_doc_id": "11_3724530633310163747"}}
{"doc_id": "12_8709405706441977564", "text": "ne\"><span> },<span><span>\n<span class=\"line highlighted\"><span> provide<span><span>() {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line highlighted\"><span> // 使用函数的形式，可以访问到 `this`<span><span>\n<span class=\"line highlighted\"><span> return<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line highlighted\"><span> message: <span><span>this<span><span>.message<span><span>\n<span class=\"line highlighted\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line highlighted\"><span> }<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/provide-inject.html", "title": "依赖注入", "doc_id": "f9bd54578e44463f8c2e169e1fcf2428", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1007, "chunk_index": 12, "_doc_id": "12_8709405706441977564"}}
{"doc_id": "13_3214472782456866241", "text": "n class=\"line highlighted\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line highlighted\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span><code><pre><div><p>然而，请注意这<strong>不会<strong>使注入保持响应性。我们会在后续小节中讨论如何<a href=\"#working-with-reactivity\">让注入转变为响应式<a>。<p><div><h2 id=\"app-level-provide\">应用层 Provide <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#app-level-provide\">​<a><h2><p>除了在一个组件中提供依赖，我们还可以在整个应用层面提供依赖：<p><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>import<span><span> { createApp } <span><span>from<span><span> 'vue'<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/provide-inject.html", "title": "依赖注入", "doc_id": "f9bd54578e44463f8c2e169e1fcf2428", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1007, "chunk_index": 13, "_doc_id": "13_3214472782456866241"}}
{"doc_id": "14_5262679173132022058", "text": "class=\"line\"><span>import<span><span> { createApp } <span><span>from<span><span> 'vue'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> app<span><span> =<span><span> createApp<span><span>({})<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>app.<span><span>provide<span><span>(<span><span>/* 注入名 */<span><span> 'message'<span><span>, <span><span>/* 值 */<span><span> 'hello!'<span><span>)<span><span><code><pre><div><p>在应用级别提供的数据在该应用内的所有组件中都可以注入。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/provide-inject.html", "title": "依赖注入", "doc_id": "f9bd54578e44463f8c2e169e1fcf2428", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1007, "chunk_index": 14, "_doc_id": "14_5262679173132022058"}}
{"doc_id": "15_5097924213559876301", "text": ">/* 值 */<span><span> 'hello!'<span><span>)<span><span><code><pre><div><p>在应用级别提供的数据在该应用内的所有组件中都可以注入。这在你编写<a href=\"/guide/reusability/plugins.html\">插件<a>时会特别有用，因为插件一般都不会使用组件形式来提供值。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/provide-inject.html", "title": "依赖注入", "doc_id": "f9bd54578e44463f8c2e169e1fcf2428", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1007, "chunk_index": 15, "_doc_id": "15_5097924213559876301"}}
{"doc_id": "16_5430421675657726960", "text": "供的数据在该应用内的所有组件中都可以注入。这在你编写<a href=\"/guide/reusability/plugins.html\">插件<a>时会特别有用，因为插件一般都不会使用组件形式来提供值。<p><h2 id=\"inject\">Inject (注入) <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#inject\">​<a><h2><div class=\"composition-api\"><p>要注入上层组件提供的数据，需使用 <a href=\"/api/composition-api-dependency-injection.html#inject\"><code>inject()<code><a> 函数：<p><div class=\"language-vue\"> <span class=\"lang\">vue<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>script<span><span> setup<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/provide-inject.html", "title": "依赖注入", "doc_id": "f9bd54578e44463f8c2e169e1fcf2428", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1007, "chunk_index": 16, "_doc_id": "16_5430421675657726960"}}
{"doc_id": "17_3771487207527315157", "text": "code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>script<span><span> setup<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>import<span><span> { inject } <span><span>from<span><span> 'vue'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> message<span><span> =<span><span> inject<span><span>(<span><span>'message'<span><span>)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>script<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>如果有多个父组件提供了相同键的数据，注入将解析为组件链上最近的父组件所注入的值。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/provide-inject.html", "title": "依赖注入", "doc_id": "f9bd54578e44463f8c2e169e1fcf2428", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1007, "chunk_index": 17, "_doc_id": "17_3771487207527315157"}}
{"doc_id": "18_1396250050635964792", "text": "pan><span>script<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>如果有多个父组件提供了相同键的数据，注入将解析为组件链上最近的父组件所注入的值。<p><p>如果提供的值是一个 ref，注入进来的会是该 ref 对象，而<strong>不会<strong>自动解包为其内部的值。这使得注入方组件能够通过 ref 对象保持了和供给方的响应性链接。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/provide-inject.html", "title": "依赖注入", "doc_id": "f9bd54578e44463f8c2e169e1fcf2428", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1007, "chunk_index": 18, "_doc_id": "18_1396250050635964792"}}
{"doc_id": "19_8412704328910413941", "text": "。<p><p>如果提供的值是一个 ref，注入进来的会是该 ref 对象，而<strong>不会<strong>自动解包为其内部的值。这使得注入方组件能够通过 ref 对象保持了和供给方的响应性链接。<p><p><a href=\"https://play.vuejs.org/#\" target=\"_blank\">带有响应性的 provide + inject 完整示例<a><p><p>同样的，", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/provide-inject.html", "title": "依赖注入", "doc_id": "f9bd54578e44463f8c2e169e1fcf2428", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1007, "chunk_index": 19, "_doc_id": "19_8412704328910413941"}}
{"doc_id": "20_3974292990184950658", "text": "PLECXa9NKdD/a6QTTtGnP88LgiXJtYv4BaLHhvg==\" target=\"_blank\">带有响应性的 provide + inject 完整示例<a><p><p>同样的，如果没有使用 <code><script setup><code>，<code>inject()<code> 需要在 <code>setup()<code> 内同步调用：<p><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>import<span><span> { inject } <span><span>from<span><span> 'vue'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/provide-inject.html", "title": "依赖注入", "doc_id": "f9bd54578e44463f8c2e169e1fcf2428", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1007, "chunk_index": 20, "_doc_id": "20_3974292990184950658"}}
{"doc_id": "21_732629801381522126", "text": "n class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> setup<span><span>() {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> const<span><span> message<span><span> =<span><span> inject<span><span>(<span><span>'message'<span><span>)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> return<span><span> { message }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/provide-inject.html", "title": "依赖注入", "doc_id": "f9bd54578e44463f8c2e169e1fcf2428", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1007, "chunk_index": 21, "_doc_id": "21_732629801381522126"}}
{"doc_id": "22_8852155093259070232", "text": "ss=\"line\"><span> return<span><span> { message }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span><code><pre><div><div><div class=\"options-api\"><p>要注入上层组件提供的数据，需使用 <a href=\"/api/options-composition.html#inject\"><code>inject<code><a> 选项来声明：<p><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/provide-inject.html", "title": "依赖注入", "doc_id": "f9bd54578e44463f8c2e169e1fcf2428", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1007, "chunk_index": 22, "_doc_id": "22_8852155093259070232"}}
{"doc_id": "23_6626201705543152876", "text": "b-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> inject: [<span><span>'message'<span><span>],<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> created<span><span>() {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> console.<span><span>log<span><span>(<span><span>this<span><span>.message) <span><span>// injected value<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/provide-inject.html", "title": "依赖注入", "doc_id": "f9bd54578e44463f8c2e169e1fcf2428", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1007, "chunk_index": 23, "_doc_id": "23_6626201705543152876"}}
{"doc_id": "24_1219134250480382551", "text": "n><span>.message) <span><span>// injected value<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span><code><pre><div><p>注入会在组件自身的状态<strong>之前<strong>被解析，因此你可以在 <code>data()<code> 中访问到注入的属性：<p><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> inject: [<span><span>'message'<span><span>],<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/provide-inject.html", "title": "依赖注入", "doc_id": "f9bd54578e44463f8c2e169e1fcf2428", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1007, "chunk_index": 24, "_doc_id": "24_1219134250480382551"}}
{"doc_id": "25_4928278972046649229", "text": "n> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> inject: [<span><span>'message'<span><span>],<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> data<span><span>() {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> return<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 基于注入值的初始数据<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> fullMessage: <span><span>this<span><span>.message<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/provide-inject.html", "title": "依赖注入", "doc_id": "f9bd54578e44463f8c2e169e1fcf2428", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1007, "chunk_index": 25, "_doc_id": "25_4928278972046649229"}}
{"doc_id": "26_4299621919306070629", "text": "message<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span><code><pre><div><p>如果有多个父组件提供了相同键的数据，注入将解析为组件链上最近的父组件所注入的值。<p><p><a href=\"https://play.vuejs.", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/provide-inject.html", "title": "依赖注入", "doc_id": "f9bd54578e44463f8c2e169e1fcf2428", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1007, "chunk_index": 26, "_doc_id": "26_4299621919306070629"}}
{"doc_id": "27_3458534550524434605", "text": "><span><code><pre><div><p>如果有多个父组件提供了相同键的数据，注入将解析为组件链上最近的父组件所注入的值。<p><p><a href=\"https://play.vuejs.org/#\" target=\"_blank\">完整的 provide + inject 示例<a><p><h3 id=\"injection-aliasing\">注入别名 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#injection-aliasing\">​<a><h3><p>当以数组形式使用 <code>inject<code>，", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/provide-inject.html", "title": "依赖注入", "doc_id": "f9bd54578e44463f8c2e169e1fcf2428", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1007, "chunk_index": 27, "_doc_id": "27_3458534550524434605"}}
{"doc_id": "28_6005451827706781644", "text": "ng\">注入别名 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#injection-aliasing\">​<a><h3><p>当以数组形式使用 <code>inject<code>，注入的属性会以同名的 key 暴露到组件实例上。在上面的例子中，提供的属性名为 <code>\"message\"<code>，注入后以 <code>this.message<code> 的形式暴露。访问的本地属性名和注入名是相同的。<p><p>如果我们想要用一个不同的本地属性名注入该属性，我们需要在 <code>inject<code> 选项的属性上使用对象的形式：<p><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> inject: {<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/provide-inject.html", "title": "依赖注入", "doc_id": "f9bd54578e44463f8c2e169e1fcf2428", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1007, "chunk_index": 28, "_doc_id": "28_6005451827706781644"}}
{"doc_id": "29_88300503530919134", "text": "xport<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> inject: {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> /* 本地属性名 */<span><span> localMessage: {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> from: <span><span>/* 注入来源名 */<span><span> 'message'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span><code><pre><div><p>这里，组件本地化了原注入名 <code>\"message\"<code> 所提供的属性，并将其暴露为 <code>this.localMessage<code>。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/provide-inject.html", "title": "依赖注入", "doc_id": "f9bd54578e44463f8c2e169e1fcf2428", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1007, "chunk_index": 29, "_doc_id": "29_88300503530919134"}}
{"doc_id": "30_6790039255724862007", "text": "><code><pre><div><p>这里，组件本地化了原注入名 <code>\"message\"<code> 所提供的属性，并将其暴露为 <code>this.localMessage<code>。<p><div><h3 id=\"injection-default-values\">注入默认值 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#injection-default-values\">​<a><h3><p>默认情况下，<code>inject<code> 假设传入的注入名会被某个祖先链上的组件提供。如果该注入名的确没有任何组件提供，则会抛出一个运行时警告。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/provide-inject.html", "title": "依赖注入", "doc_id": "f9bd54578e44463f8c2e169e1fcf2428", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1007, "chunk_index": 30, "_doc_id": "30_6790039255724862007"}}
{"doc_id": "31_3648808778418456906", "text": "ault-values\">​<a><h3><p>默认情况下，<code>inject<code> 假设传入的注入名会被某个祖先链上的组件提供。如果该注入名的确没有任何组件提供，则会抛出一个运行时警告。<p><p>如果在注入一个值时不要求必须有提供者，那么我们应该声明一个默认值，和 props 类似：<p><div class=\"composition-api\"><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// 如果没有祖先组件提供 \"message\"<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// `value` 会是 \"这是默认值\"<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/provide-inject.html", "title": "依赖注入", "doc_id": "f9bd54578e44463f8c2e169e1fcf2428", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1007, "chunk_index": 31, "_doc_id": "31_3648808778418456906"}}
{"doc_id": "32_3315453201895694816", "text": "span>// 如果没有祖先组件提供 \"message\"<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// `value` 会是 \"这是默认值\"<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> value<span><span> =<span><span> inject<span><span>(<span><span>'message'<span><span>, <span><span>'这是默认值'<span><span>)<span><span><code><pre><div><p>在一些场景中，默认值可能需要通过调用一个函数或初始化一个类来取得。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/provide-inject.html", "title": "依赖注入", "doc_id": "f9bd54578e44463f8c2e169e1fcf2428", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1007, "chunk_index": 32, "_doc_id": "32_3315453201895694816"}}
{"doc_id": "33_8767073895124729531", "text": "n>, <span><span>'这是默认值'<span><span>)<span><span><code><pre><div><p>在一些场景中，默认值可能需要通过调用一个函数或初始化一个类来取得。为了避免在用不到默认值的情况下进行不必要的计算或产生副作用，我们可以使用工厂函数来创建默认值：<p><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> value<span><span> =<span><span> inject<span><span>(<span><span>'key'<span><span>, () <span><span>=><span><span> new<span><span> ExpensiveClass<span><span>(), <span><span>true<span><span>)<span><span><code><pre><div><p>第三个参数表示默认值应该被当作一个工厂函数。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/provide-inject.html", "title": "依赖注入", "doc_id": "f9bd54578e44463f8c2e169e1fcf2428", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1007, "chunk_index": 33, "_doc_id": "33_8767073895124729531"}}
{"doc_id": "34_5949059911508260987", "text": "ss<span><span>(), <span><span>true<span><span>)<span><span><code><pre><div><p>第三个参数表示默认值应该被当作一个工厂函数。<p><div><div class=\"options-api\"><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 当声明注入的默认值时<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 必须使用对象形式<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> inject: {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> message: {<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/provide-inject.html", "title": "依赖注入", "doc_id": "f9bd54578e44463f8c2e169e1fcf2428", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1007, "chunk_index": 34, "_doc_id": "34_5949059911508260987"}}
{"doc_id": "35_157602532113718051", "text": "n>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> inject: {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> message: {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> from: <span><span>'message'<span><span>, <span><span>// 当与原注入名同名时，这个属性是可选的<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> default: <span><span>'default value'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> },<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> user: {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 对于非基础类型数据，如果创建开销比较大，或是需要确保每个组件实例<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 需要独立数据的，请使用工厂函数<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/provide-inject.html", "title": "依赖注入", "doc_id": "f9bd54578e44463f8c2e169e1fcf2428", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1007, "chunk_index": 35, "_doc_id": "35_157602532113718051"}}
{"doc_id": "36_739505548221506472", "text": "非基础类型数据，如果创建开销比较大，或是需要确保每个组件实例<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 需要独立数据的，请使用工厂函数<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> default<span><span>: () <span><span>=><span><span> ({ name: <span><span>'John'<span><span> })<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/provide-inject.html", "title": "依赖注入", "doc_id": "f9bd54578e44463f8c2e169e1fcf2428", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1007, "chunk_index": 36, "_doc_id": "36_739505548221506472"}}
{"doc_id": "37_3084572115727257095", "text": "pan> })<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span><code><pre><div><div><h2 id=\"working-with-reactivity\">和响应式数据配合使用 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#working-with-reactivity\">​<a><h2><div class=\"composition-api\"><p>当提供 / 注入响应式的数据时，<strong>建议尽可能将任何对响应式状态的变更都保持在供给方组件中<strong>。这样可以确保所提供状态的声明和变更操作都内聚在同一个组件内，使其更容易维护。<p><p>有的时候，我们可能需要在注入方组件中更改数据。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/provide-inject.html", "title": "依赖注入", "doc_id": "f9bd54578e44463f8c2e169e1fcf2428", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1007, "chunk_index": 37, "_doc_id": "37_3084572115727257095"}}
{"doc_id": "38_5281260873277670546", "text": "可能将任何对响应式状态的变更都保持在供给方组件中<strong>。这样可以确保所提供状态的声明和变更操作都内聚在同一个组件内，使其更容易维护。<p><p>有的时候，我们可能需要在注入方组件中更改数据。在这种情况下，我们推荐在供给方组件内声明并提供一个更改数据的方法函数：<p><div class=\"language-vue\"> <span class=\"lang\">vue<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><!-- 在供给方组件内 --><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>script<span><span> setup<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>import<span><span> { provide, ref } <span><span>from<span><span> 'vue'<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/provide-inject.html", "title": "依赖注入", "doc_id": "f9bd54578e44463f8c2e169e1fcf2428", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1007, "chunk_index": 38, "_doc_id": "38_5281260873277670546"}}
{"doc_id": "39_8810718204573910920", "text": "ass=\"line\"><span>import<span><span> { provide, ref } <span><span>from<span><span> 'vue'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> location<span><span> =<span><span> ref<span><span>(<span><span>'North Pole'<span><span>)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line highlighted\"><span>function<span><span> updateLocation<span><span>() {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line highlighted\"><span> location.value <span><span>=<span><span> 'South Pole'<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/provide-inject.html", "title": "依赖注入", "doc_id": "f9bd54578e44463f8c2e169e1fcf2428", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1007, "chunk_index": 39, "_doc_id": "39_8810718204573910920"}}
{"doc_id": "40_3814859609639290327", "text": "n class=\"line highlighted\"><span> location.value <span><span>=<span><span> 'South Pole'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line highlighted\"><span>}<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>provide<span><span>(<span><span>'location'<span><span>, {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> location,<span><span>\n<span class=\"line highlighted\"><span> updateLocation<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>})<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/provide-inject.html", "title": "依赖注入", "doc_id": "f9bd54578e44463f8c2e169e1fcf2428", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1007, "chunk_index": 40, "_doc_id": "40_3814859609639290327"}}
{"doc_id": "41_4148531814564383140", "text": "class=\"line highlighted\"><span> updateLocation<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>})<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>script<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><div class=\"language-vue\"> <span class=\"lang\">vue<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><!-- 在注入方组件 --><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>script<span><span> setup<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/provide-inject.html", "title": "依赖注入", "doc_id": "f9bd54578e44463f8c2e169e1fcf2428", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1007, "chunk_index": 41, "_doc_id": "41_4148531814564383140"}}
{"doc_id": "42_6428307337074781643", "text": "span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>script<span><span> setup<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>import<span><span> { inject } <span><span>from<span><span> 'vue'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line highlighted\"><span>const<span><span> { <span><span>location<span><span>, <span><span>updateLocation<span><span> } <span><span>=<span><span> inject<span><span>(<span><span>'location'<span><span>)<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/provide-inject.html", "title": "依赖注入", "doc_id": "f9bd54578e44463f8c2e169e1fcf2428", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1007, "chunk_index": 42, "_doc_id": "42_6428307337074781643"}}
{"doc_id": "43_5878191223136464716", "text": "pan> } <span><span>=<span><span> inject<span><span>(<span><span>'location'<span><span>)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>script<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>button<span><span> @click<span><span>=<span><span>\"updateLocation\"<span><span>>{{ location }}</<span><span>button<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/provide-inject.html", "title": "依赖注入", "doc_id": "f9bd54578e44463f8c2e169e1fcf2428", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1007, "chunk_index": 43, "_doc_id": "43_5878191223136464716"}}
{"doc_id": "44_2289143964759996723", "text": "span><span>\"updateLocation\"<span><span>>{{ location }}</<span><span>button<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>最后，如果你想确保提供的数据不能被注入方的组件更改，你可以使用 <a href=\"/api/reactivity-core.html#readonly\"><code>readonly()<code><a> 来包装提供的值。<p><div class=\"language-vue\"> <span class=\"lang\">vue<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>script<span><span> setup<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/provide-inject.html", "title": "依赖注入", "doc_id": "f9bd54578e44463f8c2e169e1fcf2428", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1007, "chunk_index": 44, "_doc_id": "44_2289143964759996723"}}
{"doc_id": "45_5259415534938173131", "text": "code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>script<span><span> setup<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>import<span><span> { ref, provide, readonly } <span><span>from<span><span> 'vue'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> count<span><span> =<span><span> ref<span><span>(<span><span>0<span><span>)<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/provide-inject.html", "title": "依赖注入", "doc_id": "f9bd54578e44463f8c2e169e1fcf2428", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1007, "chunk_index": 45, "_doc_id": "45_5259415534938173131"}}
{"doc_id": "46_5246698434832030663", "text": "<span><span> count<span><span> =<span><span> ref<span><span>(<span><span>0<span><span>)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>provide<span><span>(<span><span>'read-only-count'<span><span>, <span><span>readonly<span><span>(count))<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/provide-inject.html", "title": "依赖注入", "doc_id": "f9bd54578e44463f8c2e169e1fcf2428", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1007, "chunk_index": 46, "_doc_id": "46_5246698434832030663"}}
{"doc_id": "47_3431326965431880885", "text": "an>(<span><span>'read-only-count'<span><span>, <span><span>readonly<span><span>(count))<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>script<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><div><div class=\"options-api\"><p>为保证注入方和供给方之间的响应性链接，我们需要使用 <a href=\"/api/reactivity-core.html#computed\">computed()<a> 函数提供一个计算属性：<p><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>import<span><span> { computed } <span><span>from<span><span> 'vue'<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/provide-inject.html", "title": "依赖注入", "doc_id": "f9bd54578e44463f8c2e169e1fcf2428", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1007, "chunk_index": 47, "_doc_id": "47_3431326965431880885"}}
{"doc_id": "48_9178849029443264729", "text": "n class=\"line\"><span>import<span><span> { computed } <span><span>from<span><span> 'vue'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> data<span><span>() {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> return<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> message: <span><span>'hello!'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> },<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/provide-inject.html", "title": "依赖注入", "doc_id": "f9bd54578e44463f8c2e169e1fcf2428", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1007, "chunk_index": 48, "_doc_id": "48_9178849029443264729"}}
{"doc_id": "49_8602792018542272202", "text": "ello!'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> },<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> provide<span><span>() {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> return<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 显式提供一个计算属性<span><span>\n<span class=\"line highlighted\"><span> message: <span><span>computed<span><span>(() <span><span>=><span><span> this<span><span>.message)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/provide-inject.html", "title": "依赖注入", "doc_id": "f9bd54578e44463f8c2e169e1fcf2428", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1007, "chunk_index": 49, "_doc_id": "49_8602792018542272202"}}
{"doc_id": "50_4386275552621247416", "text": "essage)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span><code><pre><div><p><a href=\"https://play.vuejs.", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/provide-inject.html", "title": "依赖注入", "doc_id": "f9bd54578e44463f8c2e169e1fcf2428", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1007, "chunk_index": 50, "_doc_id": "50_4386275552621247416"}}
{"doc_id": "51_4693897432114759619", "text": "}<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span><code><pre><div><p><a href=\"https://play.vuejs.org/#\" target=\"_blank\">带有响应性的 provide + inject 完整示例<a><p><p><code>computed()<code> 函数常用于组合式 API 风格的组件中，", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/provide-inject.html", "title": "依赖注入", "doc_id": "f9bd54578e44463f8c2e169e1fcf2428", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1007, "chunk_index": 51, "_doc_id": "51_4693897432114759619"}}
{"doc_id": "52_6206346323614652736", "text": "==\" target=\"_blank\">带有响应性的 provide + inject 完整示例<a><p><p><code>computed()<code> 函数常用于组合式 API 风格的组件中，但它同样还可以用于补充选项式 API 风格的某些用例。你可以通过阅读<a href=\"/guide/essentials/reactivity-fundamentals.html\">响应式系统基础<a>和<a href=\"/guide/essentials/computed.html\">计算属性<a>两个章节了解更多组合式的 API 风格。<p><div><h2 id=\"working-with-symbol-keys\">使用 Symbol 作注入名 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#working-with-symbol-keys\">​<a><h2><p>至此，我们已经了解了如何使用字符串作为注入名。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/provide-inject.html", "title": "依赖注入", "doc_id": "f9bd54578e44463f8c2e169e1fcf2428", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1007, "chunk_index": 52, "_doc_id": "52_6206346323614652736"}}
{"doc_id": "53_5018960733618776890", "text": "ol 作注入名 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#working-with-symbol-keys\">​<a><h2><p>至此，我们已经了解了如何使用字符串作为注入名。但如果你正在构建大型的应用，包含非常多的依赖提供，或者你正在编写提供给其他开发者使用的组件库，建议最好使用 <a href=\"https://developer.mozilla.org/zh-CN/docs/Web/JavaScript/Reference/Global_Objects/Symbol\" target=\"_blank\">Symbol<a> 来作为注入名以避免潜在的冲突。<p><p>我们通常推荐在一个单独的文件中导出这些注入名 Symbol：<p><div class=\"vp-code-block-title\"><p class=\"vp-code-block-title-bar\"><span class=\"vp-code-block-title-text\">keys.", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/provide-inject.html", "title": "依赖注入", "doc_id": "f9bd54578e44463f8c2e169e1fcf2428", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1007, "chunk_index": 53, "_doc_id": "53_5018960733618776890"}}
{"doc_id": "54_5781269610029535337", "text": "vp-code-block-title\"><p class=\"vp-code-block-title-bar\"><span class=\"vp-code-block-title-text\">keys.js<span><p><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> const<span><span> myInjectionKey<span><span> =<span><span> Symbol<span><span>()<span><span><code><pre><div><div><div class=\"composition-api\"><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// 在供给方组件中<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/provide-inject.html", "title": "依赖注入", "doc_id": "f9bd54578e44463f8c2e169e1fcf2428", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1007, "chunk_index": 54, "_doc_id": "54_5781269610029535337"}}
{"doc_id": "55_5939687222374693748", "text": "s<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// 在供给方组件中<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>import<span><span> { provide } <span><span>from<span><span> 'vue'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>import<span><span> { myInjectionKey } <span><span>from<span><span> './keys.js'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>provide<span><span>(myInjectionKey, { <span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> /* 要提供的数据 */<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/provide-inject.html", "title": "依赖注入", "doc_id": "f9bd54578e44463f8c2e169e1fcf2428", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1007, "chunk_index": 55, "_doc_id": "55_5939687222374693748"}}
{"doc_id": "56_5324284834900174308", "text": "ovide<span><span>(myInjectionKey, { <span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> /* 要提供的数据 */<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>})<span><span><code><pre><div><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// 注入方组件<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>import<span><span> { inject } <span><span>from<span><span> 'vue'<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/provide-inject.html", "title": "依赖注入", "doc_id": "f9bd54578e44463f8c2e169e1fcf2428", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1007, "chunk_index": 56, "_doc_id": "56_5324284834900174308"}}
{"doc_id": "57_7830396158627303272", "text": "pan class=\"line\"><span>import<span><span> { inject } <span><span>from<span><span> 'vue'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>import<span><span> { myInjectionKey } <span><span>from<span><span> './keys.js'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/provide-inject.html", "title": "依赖注入", "doc_id": "f9bd54578e44463f8c2e169e1fcf2428", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1007, "chunk_index": 57, "_doc_id": "57_7830396158627303272"}}
{"doc_id": "58_7279878486791890139", "text": "> { myInjectionKey } <span><span>from<span><span> './keys.js'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> injected<span><span> =<span><span> inject<span><span>(myInjectionKey)<span><span><code><pre><div><p>TypeScript 用户请参考：<a href=\"/guide/typescript/composition-api.html#typing-provide-inject\">为 Provide / Inject 标注类型<a> <p><div><div class=\"options-api\"><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// 在供给方组件中<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/provide-inject.html", "title": "依赖注入", "doc_id": "f9bd54578e44463f8c2e169e1fcf2428", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1007, "chunk_index": 58, "_doc_id": "58_7279878486791890139"}}
{"doc_id": "59_1401697421817419671", "text": "s<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// 在供给方组件中<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>import<span><span> { myInjectionKey } <span><span>from<span><span> './keys.js'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> provide<span><span>() {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> return<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> [myInjectionKey]: {<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/provide-inject.html", "title": "依赖注入", "doc_id": "f9bd54578e44463f8c2e169e1fcf2428", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1007, "chunk_index": 59, "_doc_id": "59_1401697421817419671"}}
{"doc_id": "60_2282470967772867771", "text": "\"><span> return<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> [myInjectionKey]: {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> /* 要提供的数据 */<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span><code><pre><div><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// 注入方组件<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/provide-inject.html", "title": "依赖注入", "doc_id": "f9bd54578e44463f8c2e169e1fcf2428", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1007, "chunk_index": 60, "_doc_id": "60_2282470967772867771"}}
{"doc_id": "61_8645739802729222650", "text": ">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// 注入方组件<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>import<span><span> { myInjectionKey } <span><span>from<span><span> './keys.js'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> inject: {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> injected: { from: myInjectionKey }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/provide-inject.html", "title": "依赖注入", "doc_id": "f9bd54578e44463f8c2e169e1fcf2428", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1007, "chunk_index": 61, "_doc_id": "61_8645739802729222650"}}
{"doc_id": "62_1233900771983568542", "text": "line\"><span> injected: { from: myInjectionKey }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span><code><pre><div><div> <p><strong>译者注<strong><p><p><a id=\"footnote-1\"><a>[1] 在本章及后续章节中，“<strong>提供<strong>”将成为对应 Provide 的一个专有概念<p><div><div>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/provide-inject.html", "title": "依赖注入", "doc_id": "f9bd54578e44463f8c2e169e1fcf2428", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1007, "chunk_index": 62, "_doc_id": "62_1233900771983568542"}}
{"doc_id": "0_2232845751336771022", "text": "<div><div class=\"VPContentPage\"><main><div><div><div class=\"TeamPage\"><div class=\"TeamHero\"><div class=\"container\"><h1 class=\"title\">认识团队<h1><p class=\"lead\">Vue 及其生态系统发展的背后是一个国际化的团队，以下是部分团员的个人信息。<p><p class=\"action\"><a class=\"vt-link link\" href=\"https://github.com/vuejs/governance/blob/master/Team-Charter.md\" target=\"_blank\">了解更多团队信息 <a><p><div><div><section class=\"TeamList\"><div class=\"container\"><div class=\"info\"><h2 class=\"title\">核心团队成员<h2><p class=\"lead\">核心团队成员是那些积极参与维护一个或多个核心项目的人。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/about/team.html", "title": "Vue 工作团队", "doc_id": "5d873993ae384df7bc0b68d0e248b0e3", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 36, "chunk_index": 0, "_doc_id": "0_2232845751336771022"}}
{"doc_id": "1_5054929758340395243", "text": "container\"><div class=\"info\"><h2 class=\"title\">核心团队成员<h2><p class=\"lead\">核心团队成员是那些积极参与维护一个或多个核心项目的人。他们对 Vue 的生态系统做出了重大贡献，并对项目及其用户的成功做出了长期的承诺。<p><div><p class=\"members\"><p><div><section><section class=\"TeamList\"><div class=\"container\"><div class=\"info\"><h2 class=\"title\">名誉核心团队<h2><p class=\"lead\">我们在此致敬过去曾做出过突出贡献的不再活跃的团队成员。<p><div><p class=\"members\"><p><div><section><section class=\"TeamList\"><div class=\"container\"><div class=\"info\"><h2 class=\"title\">社区伙伴<h2><p class=\"lead\">一些 Vue 的社区成员让这里变得更加丰富多彩，有必要在此特别提及。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/about/team.html", "title": "Vue 工作团队", "doc_id": "5d873993ae384df7bc0b68d0e248b0e3", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 36, "chunk_index": 1, "_doc_id": "1_5054929758340395243"}}
{"doc_id": "2_6489074163547477285", "text": "iner\"><div class=\"info\"><h2 class=\"title\">社区伙伴<h2><p class=\"lead\">一些 Vue 的社区成员让这里变得更加丰富多彩，有必要在此特别提及。我们与这些主要合作伙伴建立了更加亲密的关系，经常与他们就即将到来的功能和新闻展开协作。<p><div><p class=\"members\"><p><div><section><div><div><div><main><div><div>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/about/team.html", "title": "Vue 工作团队", "doc_id": "5d873993ae384df7bc0b68d0e248b0e3", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 36, "chunk_index": 2, "_doc_id": "2_6489074163547477285"}}
{"doc_id": "0_5419037363222304878", "text": "<div><div><h1 id=\"releases\">版本发布 <h1><p> 正在检测最新版本…… <p><p>完整的过往发布记录可以在 <a href=\"https://github.com/vuejs/core/blob/main/CHANGELOG.md\" target=\"_blank\">GitHub<a> 查阅。<p><h2 id=\"release-cycle\">发布周期 <h2><p>Vue 并没有固定的发布周期。<p><ul><li><p>补丁版本 (patch releases) 发布会及时按需进行。<p><li><li><p>小版本 (minor releases) 发布总是会包含一些新特性，发布周期通常会在 3~6 个月之间，并会经历 beta 预发布阶段。<p><li><li><p>大版本 (major releases) 发布会提前知会，且经历早期讨论和 alpha、beta 等预发布阶段。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/about/releases.html", "title": "版本发布", "doc_id": "d351f7efe16e4af3bde2f53614310c51", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 118, "chunk_index": 0, "_doc_id": "0_5419037363222304878"}}
{"doc_id": "1_1706107622007247218", "text": "通常会在 3~6 个月之间，并会经历 beta 预发布阶段。<p><li><li><p>大版本 (major releases) 发布会提前知会，且经历早期讨论和 alpha、beta 等预发布阶段。<p><li><ul><h2 id=\"semantic-versioning-edge-cases\">语义化版本控制的特殊情况 <h2><p>Vue 的发布会遵循<a href=\"https://semver.org/\" target=\"_blank\">语义化版本控制<a>，同时伴随一些特殊情况。<p><h3 id=\"typescript-definitions\">TypeScript 类型声明 <h3><p>我们可能会在<strong>小版本<strong>发布之间包含 TypeScript 类型声明的不兼容变更，因为：<p><ol><li><p>有的时候 TypeScript 自身会在其小版本之间发布不兼容变更，我们不得不为了支持更新版本的 TypeScript 而调整自身的类型定义。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/about/releases.html", "title": "版本发布", "doc_id": "d351f7efe16e4af3bde2f53614310c51", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 118, "chunk_index": 1, "_doc_id": "1_1706107622007247218"}}
{"doc_id": "2_8399820342849439307", "text": "类型声明的不兼容变更，因为：<p><ol><li><p>有的时候 TypeScript 自身会在其小版本之间发布不兼容变更，我们不得不为了支持更新版本的 TypeScript 而调整自身的类型定义。<p><li><li><p>我们也会偶尔需要使用最新版本的 TypeScript 中才可用的特性，并提升 TypeScript 的最低版本要求。<p><li><ol><p>如果你正在使用 TypeScript，则可以使用一个语义化版本的范围来锁住当前的小版本，并在 Vue 新的小版本发布时进行手动升级。<p><h3 id=\"compiled-code-compatibility-with-older-runtime\">编译后的代码和旧版运行时之间的兼容性 <h3><p>较新<strong>小版本<strong>的 Vue 编译器可能会生成与较旧小版本的 Vue 运行时不兼容的代码。例如，由 Vue 3.2 编译器生成的代码可能不完全兼容 Vue 3.1 的运行时。<p><p>只有库的作者需要考虑这个问题，因为编译器版本和运行时版本在应用中总是相同的。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/about/releases.html", "title": "版本发布", "doc_id": "d351f7efe16e4af3bde2f53614310c51", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 118, "chunk_index": 2, "_doc_id": "2_8399820342849439307"}}
{"doc_id": "3_8322779299616144015", "text": "Vue 运行时不兼容的代码。例如，由 Vue 3.2 编译器生成的代码可能不完全兼容 Vue 3.1 的运行时。<p><p>只有库的作者需要考虑这个问题，因为编译器版本和运行时版本在应用中总是相同的。只有当你把预编译的 Vue 组件代码发布为一个包，而用户在一个使用旧版本 Vue 的项目中使用它时，才会发生版本不匹配。因此，你的包可能需要明确声明 Vue 的最低小版本要求。<p><h2 id=\"pre-releases\">预发布版本 <h2><p>小版本发布通常会经历不定量的 beta 版。而大版本发布则会经历 alpha 和 beta 阶段。<p><p>此外，我们每周都会从 GitHub 上的 <code>main<code> 和 <code>minor<code> 分支发布金丝雀版本。它们将作为不同的软件包发布以避免稳定通道的 npm 元数据变得臃肿。你可以分别通过 <code>npx install-vue@canary<code> 或 <code>npx install-vue@canary-minor<code> 安装它们。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/about/releases.html", "title": "版本发布", "doc_id": "d351f7efe16e4af3bde2f53614310c51", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 118, "chunk_index": 3, "_doc_id": "3_8322779299616144015"}}
{"doc_id": "4_1862522210797738527", "text": "元数据变得臃肿。你可以分别通过 <code>npx install-vue@canary<code> 或 <code>npx install-vue@canary-minor<code> 安装它们。<p><p>预发布版本 (pre releases) 是为了进行集成/稳定性测试，并让早期用户为不稳定的功能提供反馈。请不要在生产中使用预发布版本。所有的预发布版本都被认为是不稳定的，并且可能会在两者之间产生不兼容变更，所以在使用预发布版本时，一定要精确锁定版本号。<p><h2 id=\"deprecations\">废弃的特性 <h2><p>我们可能会定期废弃那些在新的小版本中拥有更新更好的替代品的功能。被废弃的功能仍将继续工作，但会在进入废弃状态后的下一个大版本中被删除。<p><h2 id=\"rfcs\">RFC <h2><p>具有可观表层 API 的新特性和 Vue 的重大变更都将经历<strong>意见征集<strong> (RFC) 流程。RFC 流程的目的是为新功能进入该框架提供一个一致且可控的路径，并给用户一个机会参与设计过程并提供反馈。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/about/releases.html", "title": "版本发布", "doc_id": "d351f7efe16e4af3bde2f53614310c51", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 118, "chunk_index": 4, "_doc_id": "4_1862522210797738527"}}
{"doc_id": "5_5586257172247424440", "text": "新特性和 Vue 的重大变更都将经历<strong>意见征集<strong> (RFC) 流程。RFC 流程的目的是为新功能进入该框架提供一个一致且可控的路径，并给用户一个机会参与设计过程并提供反馈。<p><p>该 RFC 流程会在 GitHub 上的 <a href=\"https://github.com/vuejs/rfcs\" target=\"_blank\">vuejs/rfcs<a> 仓库进行。<p><h2 id=\"experimental-features\">试验性特性 <h2><p>有些特性在 Vue 的稳定版本中已经发布并被记录了，但被标记为试验性的。试验性特性通常与某些 RFC 讨论相关联，这些讨论中的大部分设计问题已经在理论上得到了解决，但仍缺乏来自真实实践的反馈。<p><p>试验性特性的目的是允许用户通过在生产环境中测试它们来提供反馈，而不必使用不稳定的 Vue 版本。试验性特性本身是被认为不稳定的，只能以某种受控的方式使用，且该特性可预期地会在任何发布类型中发生变化。<p><div><div>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/about/releases.html", "title": "版本发布", "doc_id": "d351f7efe16e4af3bde2f53614310c51", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 118, "chunk_index": 5, "_doc_id": "5_5586257172247424440"}}
{"doc_id": "0_5419037363222304878", "text": "<div><div><h1 id=\"releases\">版本发布 <h1><p> 正在检测最新版本…… <p><p>完整的过往发布记录可以在 <a href=\"https://github.com/vuejs/core/blob/main/CHANGELOG.md\" target=\"_blank\">GitHub<a> 查阅。<p><h2 id=\"release-cycle\">发布周期 <h2><p>Vue 并没有固定的发布周期。<p><ul><li><p>补丁版本 (patch releases) 发布会及时按需进行。<p><li><li><p>小版本 (minor releases) 发布总是会包含一些新特性，发布周期通常会在 3~6 个月之间，并会经历 beta 预发布阶段。<p><li><li><p>大版本 (major releases) 发布会提前知会，且经历早期讨论和 alpha、beta 等预发布阶段。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/about/releases.html", "title": "版本发布", "doc_id": "ce7743c1801c4632a03f4f4a082151f6", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 118, "chunk_index": 0, "_doc_id": "0_5419037363222304878"}}
{"doc_id": "1_1706107622007247218", "text": "通常会在 3~6 个月之间，并会经历 beta 预发布阶段。<p><li><li><p>大版本 (major releases) 发布会提前知会，且经历早期讨论和 alpha、beta 等预发布阶段。<p><li><ul><h2 id=\"semantic-versioning-edge-cases\">语义化版本控制的特殊情况 <h2><p>Vue 的发布会遵循<a href=\"https://semver.org/\" target=\"_blank\">语义化版本控制<a>，同时伴随一些特殊情况。<p><h3 id=\"typescript-definitions\">TypeScript 类型声明 <h3><p>我们可能会在<strong>小版本<strong>发布之间包含 TypeScript 类型声明的不兼容变更，因为：<p><ol><li><p>有的时候 TypeScript 自身会在其小版本之间发布不兼容变更，我们不得不为了支持更新版本的 TypeScript 而调整自身的类型定义。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/about/releases.html", "title": "版本发布", "doc_id": "ce7743c1801c4632a03f4f4a082151f6", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 118, "chunk_index": 1, "_doc_id": "1_1706107622007247218"}}
{"doc_id": "2_8399820342849439307", "text": "类型声明的不兼容变更，因为：<p><ol><li><p>有的时候 TypeScript 自身会在其小版本之间发布不兼容变更，我们不得不为了支持更新版本的 TypeScript 而调整自身的类型定义。<p><li><li><p>我们也会偶尔需要使用最新版本的 TypeScript 中才可用的特性，并提升 TypeScript 的最低版本要求。<p><li><ol><p>如果你正在使用 TypeScript，则可以使用一个语义化版本的范围来锁住当前的小版本，并在 Vue 新的小版本发布时进行手动升级。<p><h3 id=\"compiled-code-compatibility-with-older-runtime\">编译后的代码和旧版运行时之间的兼容性 <h3><p>较新<strong>小版本<strong>的 Vue 编译器可能会生成与较旧小版本的 Vue 运行时不兼容的代码。例如，由 Vue 3.2 编译器生成的代码可能不完全兼容 Vue 3.1 的运行时。<p><p>只有库的作者需要考虑这个问题，因为编译器版本和运行时版本在应用中总是相同的。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/about/releases.html", "title": "版本发布", "doc_id": "ce7743c1801c4632a03f4f4a082151f6", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 118, "chunk_index": 2, "_doc_id": "2_8399820342849439307"}}
{"doc_id": "3_8322779299616144015", "text": "Vue 运行时不兼容的代码。例如，由 Vue 3.2 编译器生成的代码可能不完全兼容 Vue 3.1 的运行时。<p><p>只有库的作者需要考虑这个问题，因为编译器版本和运行时版本在应用中总是相同的。只有当你把预编译的 Vue 组件代码发布为一个包，而用户在一个使用旧版本 Vue 的项目中使用它时，才会发生版本不匹配。因此，你的包可能需要明确声明 Vue 的最低小版本要求。<p><h2 id=\"pre-releases\">预发布版本 <h2><p>小版本发布通常会经历不定量的 beta 版。而大版本发布则会经历 alpha 和 beta 阶段。<p><p>此外，我们每周都会从 GitHub 上的 <code>main<code> 和 <code>minor<code> 分支发布金丝雀版本。它们将作为不同的软件包发布以避免稳定通道的 npm 元数据变得臃肿。你可以分别通过 <code>npx install-vue@canary<code> 或 <code>npx install-vue@canary-minor<code> 安装它们。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/about/releases.html", "title": "版本发布", "doc_id": "ce7743c1801c4632a03f4f4a082151f6", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 118, "chunk_index": 3, "_doc_id": "3_8322779299616144015"}}
{"doc_id": "4_1862522210797738527", "text": "元数据变得臃肿。你可以分别通过 <code>npx install-vue@canary<code> 或 <code>npx install-vue@canary-minor<code> 安装它们。<p><p>预发布版本 (pre releases) 是为了进行集成/稳定性测试，并让早期用户为不稳定的功能提供反馈。请不要在生产中使用预发布版本。所有的预发布版本都被认为是不稳定的，并且可能会在两者之间产生不兼容变更，所以在使用预发布版本时，一定要精确锁定版本号。<p><h2 id=\"deprecations\">废弃的特性 <h2><p>我们可能会定期废弃那些在新的小版本中拥有更新更好的替代品的功能。被废弃的功能仍将继续工作，但会在进入废弃状态后的下一个大版本中被删除。<p><h2 id=\"rfcs\">RFC <h2><p>具有可观表层 API 的新特性和 Vue 的重大变更都将经历<strong>意见征集<strong> (RFC) 流程。RFC 流程的目的是为新功能进入该框架提供一个一致且可控的路径，并给用户一个机会参与设计过程并提供反馈。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/about/releases.html", "title": "版本发布", "doc_id": "ce7743c1801c4632a03f4f4a082151f6", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 118, "chunk_index": 4, "_doc_id": "4_1862522210797738527"}}
{"doc_id": "5_5586257172247424440", "text": "新特性和 Vue 的重大变更都将经历<strong>意见征集<strong> (RFC) 流程。RFC 流程的目的是为新功能进入该框架提供一个一致且可控的路径，并给用户一个机会参与设计过程并提供反馈。<p><p>该 RFC 流程会在 GitHub 上的 <a href=\"https://github.com/vuejs/rfcs\" target=\"_blank\">vuejs/rfcs<a> 仓库进行。<p><h2 id=\"experimental-features\">试验性特性 <h2><p>有些特性在 Vue 的稳定版本中已经发布并被记录了，但被标记为试验性的。试验性特性通常与某些 RFC 讨论相关联，这些讨论中的大部分设计问题已经在理论上得到了解决，但仍缺乏来自真实实践的反馈。<p><p>试验性特性的目的是允许用户通过在生产环境中测试它们来提供反馈，而不必使用不稳定的 Vue 版本。试验性特性本身是被认为不稳定的，只能以某种受控的方式使用，且该特性可预期地会在任何发布类型中发生变化。<p><div><div>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/about/releases.html", "title": "版本发布", "doc_id": "ce7743c1801c4632a03f4f4a082151f6", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 118, "chunk_index": 5, "_doc_id": "5_5586257172247424440"}}
{"doc_id": "0_1969936741880072315", "text": "<div><div><h1 id=\"async-components\">异步组件 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#async-components\">​<a><h1><h2 id=\"basic-usage\">基本用法 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#basic-usage\">​<a><h2><p>在大型项目中，我们可能需要拆分应用为更小的块，并仅在需要时再从服务器加载相关组件。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/async.html", "title": "异步组件", "doc_id": "236247391c074d52886e74175c571d75", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 580, "chunk_index": 0, "_doc_id": "0_1969936741880072315"}}
{"doc_id": "1_984807678331797409", "text": "用法 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#basic-usage\">​<a><h2><p>在大型项目中，我们可能需要拆分应用为更小的块，并仅在需要时再从服务器加载相关组件。Vue 提供了 <a href=\"/api/general.html#defineasynccomponent\"><code>defineAsyncComponent<code><a> 方法来实现此功能：<p><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>import<span><span> { defineAsyncComponent } <span><span>from<span><span> 'vue'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/async.html", "title": "异步组件", "doc_id": "236247391c074d52886e74175c571d75", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 580, "chunk_index": 1, "_doc_id": "1_984807678331797409"}}
{"doc_id": "2_6238201894731450304", "text": "> { defineAsyncComponent } <span><span>from<span><span> 'vue'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> AsyncComp<span><span> =<span><span> defineAsyncComponent<span><span>(() <span><span>=><span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> return<span><span> new<span><span> Promise<span><span>((<span><span>resolve<span><span>, <span><span>reject<span><span>) <span><span>=><span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // ...从服务器获取组件<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/async.html", "title": "异步组件", "doc_id": "236247391c074d52886e74175c571d75", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 580, "chunk_index": 2, "_doc_id": "2_6238201894731450304"}}
{"doc_id": "3_1806788844694558208", "text": "pan>) <span><span>=><span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // ...从服务器获取组件<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> resolve<span><span>(<span><span>/* 获取到的组件 */<span><span>)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> })<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>})<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// ... 像使用其他一般组件一样使用 `AsyncComp`<span><span><code><pre><div><p>如你所见，<code>defineAsyncComponent<code> 方法接收一个返回 Promise 的加载函数。这个 Promise 的 <code>resolve<code> 回调方法应该在从服务器获得组件定义时调用。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/async.html", "title": "异步组件", "doc_id": "236247391c074d52886e74175c571d75", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 580, "chunk_index": 3, "_doc_id": "3_1806788844694558208"}}
{"doc_id": "4_8069452222285977201", "text": "neAsyncComponent<code> 方法接收一个返回 Promise 的加载函数。这个 Promise 的 <code>resolve<code> 回调方法应该在从服务器获得组件定义时调用。你也可以调用 <code>reject(reason)<code> 表明加载失败。<p><p><a href=\"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/JavaScript/Reference/Operators/import\" target=\"_blank\">ES 模块动态导入<a>也会返回一个 Promise，所以多数情况下我们会将它和 <code>defineAsyncComponent<code> 搭配使用。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/async.html", "title": "异步组件", "doc_id": "236247391c074d52886e74175c571d75", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 580, "chunk_index": 4, "_doc_id": "4_8069452222285977201"}}
{"doc_id": "5_6671841207802540603", "text": "ort\" target=\"_blank\">ES 模块动态导入<a>也会返回一个 Promise，所以多数情况下我们会将它和 <code>defineAsyncComponent<code> 搭配使用。类似 Vite 和 Webpack 这样的构建工具也支持此语法 (并且会将它们作为打包时的代码分割点)，因此我们也可以用它来导入 Vue 单文件组件：<p><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>import<span><span> { defineAsyncComponent } <span><span>from<span><span> 'vue'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/async.html", "title": "异步组件", "doc_id": "236247391c074d52886e74175c571d75", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 580, "chunk_index": 5, "_doc_id": "5_6671841207802540603"}}
{"doc_id": "6_6592429422233407430", "text": "> { defineAsyncComponent } <span><span>from<span><span> 'vue'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> AsyncComp<span><span> =<span><span> defineAsyncComponent<span><span>(() <span><span>=><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> import<span><span>(<span><span>'./components/MyComponent.vue'<span><span>)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>)<span><span><code><pre><div><p>最后得到的 <code>AsyncComp<code> 是一个外层包装过的组件，仅在页面需要它渲染时才会调用加载内部实际组件的函数。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/async.html", "title": "异步组件", "doc_id": "236247391c074d52886e74175c571d75", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 580, "chunk_index": 6, "_doc_id": "6_6592429422233407430"}}
{"doc_id": "7_5611824015759879734", "text": "n>)<span><span><code><pre><div><p>最后得到的 <code>AsyncComp<code> 是一个外层包装过的组件，仅在页面需要它渲染时才会调用加载内部实际组件的函数。它会将接收到的 props 和插槽传给内部组件，所以你可以使用这个异步的包装组件无缝地替换原始组件，同时实现延迟加载。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/async.html", "title": "异步组件", "doc_id": "236247391c074d52886e74175c571d75", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 580, "chunk_index": 7, "_doc_id": "7_5611824015759879734"}}
{"doc_id": "8_5162095910960041318", "text": "e> 是一个外层包装过的组件，仅在页面需要它渲染时才会调用加载内部实际组件的函数。它会将接收到的 props 和插槽传给内部组件，所以你可以使用这个异步的包装组件无缝地替换原始组件，同时实现延迟加载。<p><p>与普通组件一样，异步组件可以使用 <code>app.component()<code> <a href=\"/guide/components/registration.html#global-registration\">全局注册<a>：<p><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>app.<span><span>component<span><span>(<span><span>'MyComponent'<span><span>, <span><span>defineAsyncComponent<span><span>(() <span><span>=><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/async.html", "title": "异步组件", "doc_id": "236247391c074d52886e74175c571d75", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 580, "chunk_index": 8, "_doc_id": "8_5162095910960041318"}}
{"doc_id": "9_546855582751972947", "text": "yComponent'<span><span>, <span><span>defineAsyncComponent<span><span>(() <span><span>=><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> import<span><span>(<span><span>'./components/MyComponent.vue'<span><span>)<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/async.html", "title": "异步组件", "doc_id": "236247391c074d52886e74175c571d75", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 580, "chunk_index": 9, "_doc_id": "9_546855582751972947"}}
{"doc_id": "10_316867596798766012", "text": "line\"><span> import<span><span>(<span><span>'./components/MyComponent.vue'<span><span>)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>))<span><span><code><pre><div><div class=\"options-api\"><p>你也可以在<a href=\"/guide/components/registration.html#local-registration\">局部注册组件<a>时使用 <code>defineAsyncComponent<code>：<p><div class=\"language-vue\"> <span class=\"lang\">vue<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>script<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/async.html", "title": "异步组件", "doc_id": "236247391c074d52886e74175c571d75", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 580, "chunk_index": 10, "_doc_id": "10_316867596798766012"}}
{"doc_id": "11_7549813908242681584", "text": "ki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>script<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>import<span><span> { defineAsyncComponent } <span><span>from<span><span> 'vue'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> components: {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> AdminPage: <span><span>defineAsyncComponent<span><span>(() <span><span>=><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/async.html", "title": "异步组件", "doc_id": "236247391c074d52886e74175c571d75", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 580, "chunk_index": 11, "_doc_id": "11_7549813908242681584"}}
{"doc_id": "12_4184945416539855455", "text": "\"line\"><span> AdminPage: <span><span>defineAsyncComponent<span><span>(() <span><span>=><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> import<span><span>(<span><span>'./components/AdminPageComponent.vue'<span><span>)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> )<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>script<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/async.html", "title": "异步组件", "doc_id": "236247391c074d52886e74175c571d75", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 580, "chunk_index": 12, "_doc_id": "12_4184945416539855455"}}
{"doc_id": "13_3256889195307910329", "text": ">\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>AdminPage<span><span> /><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><div><div class=\"composition-api\"><p>也可以直接在父组件中定义它们：<p><div class=\"language-vue\"> <span class=\"lang\">vue<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>script<span><span> setup<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/async.html", "title": "异步组件", "doc_id": "236247391c074d52886e74175c571d75", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 580, "chunk_index": 13, "_doc_id": "13_3256889195307910329"}}
{"doc_id": "14_1247083694481146005", "text": "code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>script<span><span> setup<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>import<span><span> { defineAsyncComponent } <span><span>from<span><span> 'vue'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> AdminPage<span><span> =<span><span> defineAsyncComponent<span><span>(() <span><span>=><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> import<span><span>(<span><span>'./components/AdminPageComponent.vue'<span><span>)<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/async.html", "title": "异步组件", "doc_id": "236247391c074d52886e74175c571d75", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 580, "chunk_index": 14, "_doc_id": "14_1247083694481146005"}}
{"doc_id": "15_3346848428176805625", "text": "span> import<span><span>(<span><span>'./components/AdminPageComponent.vue'<span><span>)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>script<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>AdminPage<span><span> /><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/async.html", "title": "异步组件", "doc_id": "236247391c074d52886e74175c571d75", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 580, "chunk_index": 15, "_doc_id": "15_3346848428176805625"}}
{"doc_id": "16_7194985206163469938", "text": "pan><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>AdminPage<span><span> /><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><div><h2 id=\"loading-and-error-states\">加载与错误状态 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#loading-and-error-states\">​<a><h2><p>异步操作不可避免地会涉及到加载和错误状态，因此 <code>defineAsyncComponent()<code> 也支持在高级选项中处理这些状态：<p><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> AsyncComp<span><span> =<span><span> defineAsyncComponent<span><span>({<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/async.html", "title": "异步组件", "doc_id": "236247391c074d52886e74175c571d75", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 580, "chunk_index": 16, "_doc_id": "16_7194985206163469938"}}
{"doc_id": "17_1787657044172563312", "text": "onst<span><span> AsyncComp<span><span> =<span><span> defineAsyncComponent<span><span>({<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 加载函数<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> loader<span><span>: () <span><span>=><span><span> import<span><span>(<span><span>'./Foo.vue'<span><span>),<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 加载异步组件时使用的组件<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> loadingComponent: LoadingComponent,<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 展示加载组件前的延迟时间，默认为 200ms<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/async.html", "title": "异步组件", "doc_id": "236247391c074d52886e74175c571d75", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 580, "chunk_index": 17, "_doc_id": "17_1787657044172563312"}}
{"doc_id": "18_7099918119423038387", "text": "nent: LoadingComponent,<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 展示加载组件前的延迟时间，默认为 200ms<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> delay: <span><span>200<span><span>,<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 加载失败后展示的组件<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> errorComponent: ErrorComponent,<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 如果提供了一个 timeout 时间限制，并超时了<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 也会显示这里配置的报错组件，默认值是：Infinity<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/async.html", "title": "异步组件", "doc_id": "236247391c074d52886e74175c571d75", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 580, "chunk_index": 18, "_doc_id": "18_7099918119423038387"}}
{"doc_id": "19_4631692882998379268", "text": "timeout 时间限制，并超时了<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 也会显示这里配置的报错组件，默认值是：Infinity<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> timeout: <span><span>3000<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>})<span><span><code><pre><div><p>如果提供了一个加载组件，它将在内部组件加载时先行显示。在加载组件显示之前有一个默认的 200ms 延迟——这是因为在网络状况较好时，加载完成得很快，加载组件和最终组件之间的替换太快可能产生闪烁，反而影响用户感受。<p><p>如果提供了一个报错组件，则它会在加载器函数返回的 Promise 抛错时被渲染。你还可以指定一个超时时间，在请求耗时超过指定时间时也会渲染报错组件。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/async.html", "title": "异步组件", "doc_id": "236247391c074d52886e74175c571d75", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 580, "chunk_index": 19, "_doc_id": "19_4631692882998379268"}}
{"doc_id": "20_2321041359925837916", "text": "替换太快可能产生闪烁，反而影响用户感受。<p><p>如果提供了一个报错组件，则它会在加载器函数返回的 Promise 抛错时被渲染。你还可以指定一个超时时间，在请求耗时超过指定时间时也会渲染报错组件。<p><h2 id=\"lazy-hydration\">惰性激活 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#lazy-hydration\" class=\"vt-badge\">​<a><h2><blockquote><p>如果你正在使用<a href=\"/guide/scaling-up/ssr.html\">服务器端渲染<a>，这一部分才会适用。<p><blockquote><p>在 Vue 3.5+ 中，异步组件可以通过提供激活策略来控制何时进行激活。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/async.html", "title": "异步组件", "doc_id": "236247391c074d52886e74175c571d75", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 580, "chunk_index": 20, "_doc_id": "20_2321041359925837916"}}
{"doc_id": "21_6218002547465597392", "text": "uide/scaling-up/ssr.html\">服务器端渲染<a>，这一部分才会适用。<p><blockquote><p>在 Vue 3.5+ 中，异步组件可以通过提供激活策略来控制何时进行激活。<p><h3 id=\"hydrate-on-idle\">在空闲时进行激活 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#hydrate-on-idle\">​<a><h3><p>通过 <code>requestIdleCallback<code> 进行激活：<p><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>import<span><span> { defineAsyncComponent, hydrateOnIdle } <span><span>from<span><span> 'vue'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/async.html", "title": "异步组件", "doc_id": "236247391c074d52886e74175c571d75", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 580, "chunk_index": 21, "_doc_id": "21_6218002547465597392"}}
{"doc_id": "22_6389481957173886323", "text": "Component, hydrateOnIdle } <span><span>from<span><span> 'vue'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> AsyncComp<span><span> =<span><span> defineAsyncComponent<span><span>({<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> loader<span><span>: () <span><span>=><span><span> import<span><span>(<span><span>'./Comp.vue'<span><span>),<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> hydrate: <span><span>hydrateOnIdle<span><span>(<span><span>/* 传递可选的最大超时 */<span><span>)<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/async.html", "title": "异步组件", "doc_id": "236247391c074d52886e74175c571d75", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 580, "chunk_index": 22, "_doc_id": "22_6389481957173886323"}}
{"doc_id": "23_4813384932142075700", "text": "hydrate: <span><span>hydrateOnIdle<span><span>(<span><span>/* 传递可选的最大超时 */<span><span>)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>})<span><span><code><pre><div><h3 id=\"hydrate-on-visible\">在可见时激活 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#hydrate-on-visible\">​<a><h3><p>通过 <code>IntersectionObserver<code> 在元素变为可见时进行激活。<p><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>import<span><span> { defineAsyncComponent, hydrateOnVisible } <span><span>from<span><span> 'vue'<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/async.html", "title": "异步组件", "doc_id": "236247391c074d52886e74175c571d75", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 580, "chunk_index": 23, "_doc_id": "23_4813384932142075700"}}
{"doc_id": "24_8941994296404670678", "text": "an><span> { defineAsyncComponent, hydrateOnVisible } <span><span>from<span><span> 'vue'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> AsyncComp<span><span> =<span><span> defineAsyncComponent<span><span>({<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> loader<span><span>: () <span><span>=><span><span> import<span><span>(<span><span>'./Comp.vue'<span><span>),<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> hydrate: <span><span>hydrateOnVisible<span><span>()<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/async.html", "title": "异步组件", "doc_id": "236247391c074d52886e74175c571d75", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 580, "chunk_index": 24, "_doc_id": "24_8941994296404670678"}}
{"doc_id": "25_7184934600613381527", "text": "an><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> hydrate: <span><span>hydrateOnVisible<span><span>()<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>})<span><span><code><pre><div><p>可以选择传递一个侦听器的选项对象值：<p><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>hydrateOnVisible<span><span>({ rootMargin: <span><span>'100px'<span><span> })<span><span><code><pre><div><p>当指定的媒体查询匹配时进行激活。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/async.html", "title": "异步组件", "doc_id": "236247391c074d52886e74175c571d75", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 580, "chunk_index": 25, "_doc_id": "25_7184934600613381527"}}
{"doc_id": "26_1690958253585381531", "text": "pan>({ rootMargin: <span><span>'100px'<span><span> })<span><span><code><pre><div><p>当指定的媒体查询匹配时进行激活。<p><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>import<span><span> { defineAsyncComponent, hydrateOnMediaQuery } <span><span>from<span><span> 'vue'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> AsyncComp<span><span> =<span><span> defineAsyncComponent<span><span>({<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/async.html", "title": "异步组件", "doc_id": "236247391c074d52886e74175c571d75", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 580, "chunk_index": 26, "_doc_id": "26_1690958253585381531"}}
{"doc_id": "27_8572833992986550340", "text": "onst<span><span> AsyncComp<span><span> =<span><span> defineAsyncComponent<span><span>({<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> loader<span><span>: () <span><span>=><span><span> import<span><span>(<span><span>'./Comp.vue'<span><span>),<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> hydrate: <span><span>hydrateOnMediaQuery<span><span>(<span><span>'(max-width:500px)'<span><span>)<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/async.html", "title": "异步组件", "doc_id": "236247391c074d52886e74175c571d75", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 580, "chunk_index": 27, "_doc_id": "27_8572833992986550340"}}
{"doc_id": "28_3519811941850580036", "text": "span><span>hydrateOnMediaQuery<span><span>(<span><span>'(max-width:500px)'<span><span>)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>})<span><span><code><pre><div><h3 id=\"hydrate-on-interaction\">交互时激活 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#hydrate-on-interaction\">​<a><h3><p>当组件元素上触发指定事件时进行激活。完成激活后，触发激活的事件也将被重放。<p><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>import<span><span> { defineAsyncComponent, hydrateOnInteraction } <span><span>from<span><span> 'vue'<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/async.html", "title": "异步组件", "doc_id": "236247391c074d52886e74175c571d75", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 580, "chunk_index": 28, "_doc_id": "28_3519811941850580036"}}
{"doc_id": "29_6381053991299095595", "text": "span> { defineAsyncComponent, hydrateOnInteraction } <span><span>from<span><span> 'vue'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> AsyncComp<span><span> =<span><span> defineAsyncComponent<span><span>({<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> loader<span><span>: () <span><span>=><span><span> import<span><span>(<span><span>'./Comp.vue'<span><span>),<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/async.html", "title": "异步组件", "doc_id": "236247391c074d52886e74175c571d75", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 580, "chunk_index": 29, "_doc_id": "29_6381053991299095595"}}
{"doc_id": "30_6235223752337554727", "text": "() <span><span>=><span><span> import<span><span>(<span><span>'./Comp.vue'<span><span>),<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> hydrate: <span><span>hydrateOnInteraction<span><span>(<span><span>'click'<span><span>)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>})<span><span><code><pre><div><p>也可以是多个事件类型的列表：<p><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>hydrateOnInteraction<span><span>([<span><span>'wheel'<span><span>,", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/async.html", "title": "异步组件", "doc_id": "236247391c074d52886e74175c571d75", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 580, "chunk_index": 30, "_doc_id": "30_6235223752337554727"}}
{"doc_id": "31_1053643826930618168", "text": "\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>hydrateOnInteraction<span><span>([<span><span>'wheel'<span><span>, <span><span>'mouseover'<span><span>])<span><span><code><pre><div><h3 id=\"custom-strategy\">自定义策略 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#custom-strategy\">​<a><h3><div class=\"language-ts\"> <span class=\"lang\">ts<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>import<span><span> { defineAsyncComponent,", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/async.html", "title": "异步组件", "doc_id": "236247391c074d52886e74175c571d75", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 580, "chunk_index": 31, "_doc_id": "31_1053643826930618168"}}
{"doc_id": "32_8042071455179106774", "text": "hiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>import<span><span> { defineAsyncComponent, <span><span>type<span><span> HydrationStrategy } <span><span>from<span><span> 'vue'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> myStrategy<span><span>:<span><span> HydrationStrategy<span><span> =<span><span> (<span><span>hydrate<span><span>, <span><span>forEachElement<span><span>) <span><span>=><span><span> {<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/async.html", "title": "异步组件", "doc_id": "236247391c074d52886e74175c571d75", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 580, "chunk_index": 32, "_doc_id": "32_8042071455179106774"}}
{"doc_id": "33_301825415560836359", "text": "drate<span><span>, <span><span>forEachElement<span><span>) <span><span>=><span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // forEachElement 是一个遍历组件未激活的 DOM 中所有根元素的辅助函数，<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 因为根元素可能是一个片段而非单个元素<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> forEachElement<span><span>(<span><span>el<span><span> =><span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // ...<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> })<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 准备好时调用 `hydrate`<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/async.html", "title": "异步组件", "doc_id": "236247391c074d52886e74175c571d75", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 580, "chunk_index": 33, "_doc_id": "33_301825415560836359"}}
{"doc_id": "34_5657911031742829856", "text": "<span class=\"line\"><span> })<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 准备好时调用 `hydrate`<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> hydrate<span><span>()<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> return<span><span> () <span><span>=><span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 如必要，返回一个销毁函数<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/async.html", "title": "异步组件", "doc_id": "236247391c074d52886e74175c571d75", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 580, "chunk_index": 34, "_doc_id": "34_5657911031742829856"}}
{"doc_id": "35_4597116728225034005", "text": "class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> AsyncComp<span><span> =<span><span> defineAsyncComponent<span><span>({<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> loader<span><span>: () <span><span>=><span><span> import<span><span>(<span><span>'./Comp.vue'<span><span>),<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> hydrate: myStrategy<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/async.html", "title": "异步组件", "doc_id": "236247391c074d52886e74175c571d75", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 580, "chunk_index": 35, "_doc_id": "35_4597116728225034005"}}
{"doc_id": "36_2395395866444149657", "text": "an>'./Comp.vue'<span><span>),<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> hydrate: myStrategy<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>})<span><span><code><pre><div><h2 id=\"using-with-suspense\">搭配 Suspense 使用 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#using-with-suspense\">​<a><h2><p>异步组件可以搭配内置的 <code><Suspense><code> 组件一起使用，若想了解 <code><Suspense><code> 和异步组件之间交互，请参阅 <a href=\"/guide/built-ins/suspense.html\"><code><Suspense><code><a> 章节。<p><div><div>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/async.html", "title": "异步组件", "doc_id": "236247391c074d52886e74175c571d75", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 580, "chunk_index": 36, "_doc_id": "36_2395395866444149657"}}
{"doc_id": "0_7655677861508998429", "text": "<div><div><p>Vue.js 的社区正在急速增长中，如果你正在阅读本文，这说明你大概已经准备好加入 Vue.js 社区了。欢迎！<p><p>现在让我们来解答你能从社区中获得什么以及你能为社区做什么。<p><h2 id=\"resources\">资源 <h2><h3 id=\"code-of-conduct\">行为规范 <h3><p>我们的<a href=\"/about/coc.html\">行为规范<a>作为一份指南，旨在帮助我们和我们所参与的技术社区变得更加充实。<p><h3 id=\"stay-in-the-know\">保持关注 <h3><h3 id=\"get-support\">获得帮助 <h3><ul><li><a href=\"https://discord.com/invite/vue\" target=\"_blank\">Discord 聊天室<a>：一个 Vue 开发者相互认识和实时聊天的地方。<li><li><a href=\"https://forum.vuejs.org/\" target=\"_blank\">论坛<a>：咨询与 Vue 及其生态的相关问题的最佳地点。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/about/community-guide.html", "title": "社区指南", "doc_id": "d9b5937a55bd47b5b803a37a40856435", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 130, "chunk_index": 0, "_doc_id": "0_7655677861508998429"}}
{"doc_id": "1_559840741909798593", "text": "互认识和实时聊天的地方。<li><li><a href=\"https://forum.vuejs.org/\" target=\"_blank\">论坛<a>：咨询与 Vue 及其生态的相关问题的最佳地点。<li><li><a href=\"https://dev.to/t/vue\" target=\"_blank\">DEV 社区<a>：在 Dev.to 分享与讨论 Vue 的相关话题。<li><li><a href=\"https://events.vuejs.org/meetups\" target=\"_blank\">Meetup<a>：想在当地找到像你一样的 Vue.js 爱好者吗？有兴趣成为社区领袖吗？这里就有你所需要的支持和帮助！<li><li><a href=\"https://github.com/vuejs\" target=\"_blank\">GitHub<a>：如果你想报告 bug 或者提出新特性需求，欢迎来 GitHub 提交 issue。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/about/community-guide.html", "title": "社区指南", "doc_id": "d9b5937a55bd47b5b803a37a40856435", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 130, "chunk_index": 1, "_doc_id": "1_559840741909798593"}}
{"doc_id": "2_3340456219563095956", "text": "href=\"https://github.com/vuejs\" target=\"_blank\">GitHub<a>：如果你想报告 bug 或者提出新特性需求，欢迎来 GitHub 提交 issue。我们也非常欢迎 pull request！<li><li><a href=\"https://twitter.com/i/communities/1516368750634840064\" target=\"_blank\">Twitter 社区 (非官方)<a>：一个 Twitter 社区，在那里你可以认识其他 Vue 爱好者、获得帮助或讨论 Vue 的相关话题。<li><ul><h3 id=\"explore-the-ecosystem\">探索生态 <h3><h2 id=\"what-you-can-do\">参与方式 <h2><h3 id=\"help-fellow-users\">帮助同伴用户 <h3><p>贡献代码并不是对 Vue 社区的唯一贡献形式。在 Discord 或论坛上为 Vue 的同伴回答问题也是一种非常有价值的贡献。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/about/community-guide.html", "title": "社区指南", "doc_id": "d9b5937a55bd47b5b803a37a40856435", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 130, "chunk_index": 2, "_doc_id": "2_3340456219563095956"}}
{"doc_id": "3_8800242440078861777", "text": "id=\"help-fellow-users\">帮助同伴用户 <h3><p>贡献代码并不是对 Vue 社区的唯一贡献形式。在 Discord 或论坛上为 Vue 的同伴回答问题也是一种非常有价值的贡献。<p><h3 id=\"help-triage-issues\">协助分流 Issue <h3><p>分流 issue 意味着收集缺失的信息、重现问题、验证问题的有效性并调查问题的原因等。<p><p>我们每天都会在 <a href=\"https://github.com/vuejs\" target=\"_blank\">GitHub 仓库<a>收到许多 issue。和我们的用户数量相比，我们的精力是非常有限的，所以光是 issue 的分流就会花费团队大量的精力。通过帮助我们分流这些 issue，你可以帮助我们变得更有效率，使我们能够把时间花在更优先的工作上。<p><p>你不必以修复问题为目的来分流这些 issue (尽管那也很好)。分享你的调查结果，例如导致该错误的提交记录，已经为我们节省了大量的时间。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/about/community-guide.html", "title": "社区指南", "doc_id": "d9b5937a55bd47b5b803a37a40856435", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 130, "chunk_index": 3, "_doc_id": "3_8800242440078861777"}}
{"doc_id": "4_4395672328039817329", "text": "们变得更有效率，使我们能够把时间花在更优先的工作上。<p><p>你不必以修复问题为目的来分流这些 issue (尽管那也很好)。分享你的调查结果，例如导致该错误的提交记录，已经为我们节省了大量的时间。<p><h3 id=\"contribute-code\">贡献代码 <h3><p>贡献错误修复或新特性是你能做出的最直接的贡献形式。<p><p>Vue 核心库提供了一份<a href=\"https://github.com/vuejs/core/blob/main/.github/contributing.md\" target=\"_blank\">贡献指南<a>，其中包含 pull request 指南以及有关构建设置和上层架构的信息。其他子项目的仓库也可能会包含它们自己的贡献指南——请确保在提交 pull request 之前阅读它们。<p><p>错误修复是我们随时欢迎的。而对于新特性来说，最好先在 <a href=\"https://github.com/vuejs/rfcs/discussions\" target=\"_blank\">RFC 仓库<a>中讨论用例和实现细节。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/about/community-guide.html", "title": "社区指南", "doc_id": "d9b5937a55bd47b5b803a37a40856435", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 130, "chunk_index": 4, "_doc_id": "4_4395672328039817329"}}
{"doc_id": "5_2036404619333952937", "text": "于新特性来说，最好先在 <a href=\"https://github.com/vuejs/rfcs/discussions\" target=\"_blank\">RFC 仓库<a>中讨论用例和实现细节。<p><h3 id=\"share-and-build-your-experience\">分享 (并积累) 经验 <h3><p>除了在论坛或聊天室回答问题、分享资源外，还有一些其他的方式可以分享并增长你的见识：<p><ul><li><strong>开发学习资料<strong>。我们常说教学相长。如果你正在用 Vue 做一些有趣的事情，你可以写一篇博客、组织研讨会、甚至创建一个 gist 分享到社交平台上：这些都能加强你的专项知识。<li><li><strong>关注 (watch) 你关心的仓库<strong>。这样无论何时该仓库有新的动静，你都会第一时间收到通知，得到关于正在进行的讨论以及即将到来的新特性的新鲜情报。这是超棒的积累专业知识的方法，你最终将会有能力来解决问题 (issue) 并提交 pull request。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/about/community-guide.html", "title": "社区指南", "doc_id": "d9b5937a55bd47b5b803a37a40856435", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 130, "chunk_index": 5, "_doc_id": "5_2036404619333952937"}}
{"doc_id": "6_7056876969185154106", "text": "库有新的动静，你都会第一时间收到通知，得到关于正在进行的讨论以及即将到来的新特性的新鲜情报。这是超棒的积累专业知识的方法，你最终将会有能力来解决问题 (issue) 并提交 pull request。<li><ul><h3 id=\"translate-docs\">翻译文档 <h3><p>我希望现在你正在使用你的首选语言阅读这篇文档，如果不是，你愿意帮助我们翻译它吗？<p><p>请参阅<a href=\"/translations/\">翻译指南<a>，了解如何参与的细节。<p><p>在社区中，你可以做很多事情来帮助 Vue 的发展：<p><ul><li><strong>参加当地的 meetup<strong>。不论是准备一个话题还是组织一个 workshop，你都可以通过帮助新老 Vue 开发者的发展来为社区带来很多价值。<li><li><strong>自己组织 meetup<strong>。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/about/community-guide.html", "title": "社区指南", "doc_id": "d9b5937a55bd47b5b803a37a40856435", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 130, "chunk_index": 6, "_doc_id": "6_7056876969185154106"}}
{"doc_id": "7_3301478203043017908", "text": "trong>。不论是准备一个话题还是组织一个 workshop，你都可以通过帮助新老 Vue 开发者的发展来为社区带来很多价值。<li><li><strong>自己组织 meetup<strong>。如果你所在的地方没有人组织 meetup，你可以自己组织起来！要善用 <a href=\"https://events.vuejs.org/resources/#getting-started\" target=\"_blank\">events.vuejs.org 的资源<a>！<li><li><strong>帮助 meetup 组织者<strong>。举办活动向来是众人拾柴火焰高，不妨主动搭把手，协助当地组织者将每场活动办得圆满成功。<li><ul><p>对于如何参与当地的 Vue 社区，如果你有任何问题，请联系 <a href=\"https://www.twitter.com/vuejs_events\" target=\"_blank\">@Vuejs_Events<a>！<p><div><div>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/about/community-guide.html", "title": "社区指南", "doc_id": "d9b5937a55bd47b5b803a37a40856435", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 130, "chunk_index": 7, "_doc_id": "7_3301478203043017908"}}
{"doc_id": "0_3072679641340775823", "text": "<div><div><h1 id=\"list-rendering\">列表渲染 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#list-rendering\">​<a><h1><h2 id=\"v-for\"><code>v-for<code> <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#v-for\">​<a><h2><p>我们可以使用 <code>v-for<code> 指令基于一个数组来渲染一个列表。<code>v-for<code> 指令的值需要使用 <code>item in items<code> 形式的特殊语法，其中 <code>items<code> 是源数据的数组，", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/list.html", "title": "列表渲染", "doc_id": "0543928516c14d2491652c536e7b1731", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1081, "chunk_index": 0, "_doc_id": "0_3072679641340775823"}}
{"doc_id": "1_4149579802439068151", "text": "数组来渲染一个列表。<code>v-for<code> 指令的值需要使用 <code>item in items<code> 形式的特殊语法，其中 <code>items<code> 是源数据的数组，而 <code>item<code> 是迭代项的<strong>别名<strong>：<p><div class=\"composition-api\"><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> items<span><span> =<span><span> ref<span><span>([{ message: <span><span>'Foo'<span><span> },", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/list.html", "title": "列表渲染", "doc_id": "0543928516c14d2491652c536e7b1731", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1081, "chunk_index": 1, "_doc_id": "1_4149579802439068151"}}
{"doc_id": "2_858280215110150292", "text": "<span> items<span><span> =<span><span> ref<span><span>([{ message: <span><span>'Foo'<span><span> }, { message: <span><span>'Bar'<span><span> }])<span><span><code><pre><div><div><div class=\"options-api\"><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>data<span><span>() {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> return<span><span> {<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/list.html", "title": "列表渲染", "doc_id": "0543928516c14d2491652c536e7b1731", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1081, "chunk_index": 2, "_doc_id": "2_858280215110150292"}}
{"doc_id": "3_3782369628291117566", "text": "\"><span>data<span><span>() {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> return<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> items: [{ message: <span><span>'Foo'<span><span> }, { message: <span><span>'Bar'<span><span> }]<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/list.html", "title": "列表渲染", "doc_id": "0543928516c14d2491652c536e7b1731", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1081, "chunk_index": 3, "_doc_id": "3_3782369628291117566"}}
{"doc_id": "4_80806306319906152", "text": "}, { message: <span><span>'Bar'<span><span> }]<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span><code><pre><div><div><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>li<span><span> v-for<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>item <span><span>in<span><span> items<span><span>\"<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> {{ item.message }}<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/list.html", "title": "列表渲染", "doc_id": "0543928516c14d2491652c536e7b1731", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1081, "chunk_index": 4, "_doc_id": "4_80806306319906152"}}
{"doc_id": "5_8508559986526172759", "text": "tems<span><span>\"<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> {{ item.message }}<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>li<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>在 <code>v-for<code> 块中可以完整地访问父作用域内的属性和变量。<code>v-for<code> 也支持使用可选的第二个参数表示当前项的位置索引。<p><div class=\"composition-api\"><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> parentMessage<span><span> =<span><span> ref<span><span>(<span><span>'Parent'<span><span>)<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/list.html", "title": "列表渲染", "doc_id": "0543928516c14d2491652c536e7b1731", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1081, "chunk_index": 5, "_doc_id": "5_8508559986526172759"}}
{"doc_id": "6_3427846991771477673", "text": "rentMessage<span><span> =<span><span> ref<span><span>(<span><span>'Parent'<span><span>)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> items<span><span> =<span><span> ref<span><span>([{ message: <span><span>'Foo'<span><span> }, { message: <span><span>'Bar'<span><span> }])<span><span><code><pre><div><div><div class=\"options-api\"><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>data<span><span>() {<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/list.html", "title": "列表渲染", "doc_id": "0543928516c14d2491652c536e7b1731", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1081, "chunk_index": 6, "_doc_id": "6_3427846991771477673"}}
{"doc_id": "7_445428890234722628", "text": "e class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>data<span><span>() {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> return<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> parentMessage: <span><span>'Parent'<span><span>,<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> items: [{ message: <span><span>'Foo'<span><span> }, { message: <span><span>'Bar'<span><span> }]<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/list.html", "title": "列表渲染", "doc_id": "0543928516c14d2491652c536e7b1731", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1081, "chunk_index": 7, "_doc_id": "7_445428890234722628"}}
{"doc_id": "8_5843566149035610580", "text": "}, { message: <span><span>'Bar'<span><span> }]<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span><code><pre><div><div><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>li<span><span> v-for<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>(item, index) <span><span>in<span><span> items<span><span>\"<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/list.html", "title": "列表渲染", "doc_id": "0543928516c14d2491652c536e7b1731", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1081, "chunk_index": 8, "_doc_id": "8_5843566149035610580"}}
{"doc_id": "9_360996519395507707", "text": "n>\"<span><span>(item, index) <span><span>in<span><span> items<span><span>\"<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> {{ parentMessage }} - {{ index }} - {{ item.message }}<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/list.html", "title": "列表渲染", "doc_id": "0543928516c14d2491652c536e7b1731", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1081, "chunk_index": 9, "_doc_id": "9_360996519395507707"}}
{"doc_id": "10_7166796884677831795", "text": "<span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> {{ parentMessage }} - {{ index }} - {{ item.message }}<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>li<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p class=\"demo\"><li>Parent - 0 - Foo<li><li>Parent - 1 - Bar<li><p><p><code>v-for<code> 变量的作用域和下面的 JavaScript 代码很类似：<p><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> parentMessage<span><span> =<span><span> 'Parent'<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/list.html", "title": "列表渲染", "doc_id": "0543928516c14d2491652c536e7b1731", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1081, "chunk_index": 10, "_doc_id": "10_7166796884677831795"}}
{"doc_id": "11_998431837198565884", "text": "n class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> parentMessage<span><span> =<span><span> 'Parent'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> items<span><span> =<span><span> [<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> /* ... */<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>]<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>items.<span><span>forEach<span><span>((<span><span>item<span><span>, <span><span>index<span><span>) <span><span>=><span><span> {<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/list.html", "title": "列表渲染", "doc_id": "0543928516c14d2491652c536e7b1731", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1081, "chunk_index": 11, "_doc_id": "11_998431837198565884"}}
{"doc_id": "12_5699276968677539448", "text": "pan><span>item<span><span>, <span><span>index<span><span>) <span><span>=><span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 可以访问外层的 `parentMessage`<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 而 `item` 和 `index` 只在这个作用域可用<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> console.<span><span>log<span><span>(parentMessage, item.message, index)<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/list.html", "title": "列表渲染", "doc_id": "0543928516c14d2491652c536e7b1731", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1081, "chunk_index": 12, "_doc_id": "12_5699276968677539448"}}
{"doc_id": "13_3548138506715827095", "text": "s=\"line\"><span> console.<span><span>log<span><span>(parentMessage, item.message, index)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>})<span><span><code><pre><div><p>注意 <code>v-for<code> 是如何对应 <code>forEach<code> 回调的函数签名的。实际上，你也可以在定义 <code>v-for<code> 的变量别名时使用解构，和解构函数参数类似：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>li<span><span> v-for<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>{ message } <span><span>in<span><span> items<span><span>\"<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/list.html", "title": "列表渲染", "doc_id": "0543928516c14d2491652c536e7b1731", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1081, "chunk_index": 13, "_doc_id": "13_3548138506715827095"}}
{"doc_id": "14_5618518134042812887", "text": "pan>\"<span><span>{ message } <span><span>in<span><span> items<span><span>\"<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> {{ message }}<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>li<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><!-- 有 index 索引时 --><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>li<span><span> v-for<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>({ message }, index) <span><span>in<span><span> items<span><span>\"<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/list.html", "title": "列表渲染", "doc_id": "0543928516c14d2491652c536e7b1731", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1081, "chunk_index": 14, "_doc_id": "14_5618518134042812887"}}
{"doc_id": "15_3114274721571004863", "text": "n><span>({ message }, index) <span><span>in<span><span> items<span><span>\"<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> {{ message }} {{ index }}<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/list.html", "title": "列表渲染", "doc_id": "0543928516c14d2491652c536e7b1731", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1081, "chunk_index": 15, "_doc_id": "15_3114274721571004863"}}
{"doc_id": "16_5712246263470078173", "text": "an><span>\"<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> {{ message }} {{ index }}<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>li<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>对于多层嵌套的 <code>v-for<code>，作用域的工作方式和函数的作用域很类似。每个 <code>v-for<code> 作用域都可以访问到父级作用域：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>li<span><span> v-for<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>item <span><span>in<span><span> items<span><span>\"<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/list.html", "title": "列表渲染", "doc_id": "0543928516c14d2491652c536e7b1731", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1081, "chunk_index": 16, "_doc_id": "16_5712246263470078173"}}
{"doc_id": "17_5113483378012140865", "text": "span><span>\"<span><span>item <span><span>in<span><span> items<span><span>\"<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>span<span><span> v-for<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>childItem <span><span>in<span><span> item.children<span><span>\"<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> {{ item.message }} {{ childItem }}<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> </<span><span>span<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/list.html", "title": "列表渲染", "doc_id": "0543928516c14d2491652c536e7b1731", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1081, "chunk_index": 17, "_doc_id": "17_5113483378012140865"}}
