{"doc_id": "40_1441523871573970120", "text": "><span> } <span><span>=<span><span> useFetch<span><span>(<span><span>'...'<span><span>)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>script<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><h3 id=\"accepting-reactive-state\">接收响应式状态 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#accepting-reactive-state\">​<a><h3><p><code>useFetch()<code> 接收一个静态 URL 字符串作为输入——因此它只会执行一次 fetch 并且就此结束。如果我们想要在 URL 改变时重新 fetch 呢？为了实现这一点，我们需要将响应式状态传入组合式函数，并让它基于传入的状态来创建执行操作的侦听器。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/reusability/composables.html", "title": "组合式函数", "doc_id": "e014623fac644fe8817bec282f544979", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1263, "chunk_index": 40, "_doc_id": "40_1441523871573970120"}}
{"doc_id": "41_2964937317425989972", "text": "入——因此它只会执行一次 fetch 并且就此结束。如果我们想要在 URL 改变时重新 fetch 呢？为了实现这一点，我们需要将响应式状态传入组合式函数，并让它基于传入的状态来创建执行操作的侦听器。<p><p>举例来说，<code>useFetch()<code> 应该能够接收一个 ref：<p><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> url<span><span> =<span><span> ref<span><span>(<span><span>'/initial-url'<span><span>)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/reusability/composables.html", "title": "组合式函数", "doc_id": "e014623fac644fe8817bec282f544979", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1263, "chunk_index": 41, "_doc_id": "41_2964937317425989972"}}
{"doc_id": "42_7749112327368586537", "text": "span> ref<span><span>(<span><span>'/initial-url'<span><span>)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> { <span><span>data<span><span>, <span><span>error<span><span> } <span><span>=<span><span> useFetch<span><span>(url)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 这将会重新触发 fetch<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/reusability/composables.html", "title": "组合式函数", "doc_id": "e014623fac644fe8817bec282f544979", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1263, "chunk_index": 42, "_doc_id": "42_7749112327368586537"}}
{"doc_id": "43_1839466148303137266", "text": "n>(url)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 这将会重新触发 fetch<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>url.value <span><span>=<span><span> '/new-url'<span><span><code><pre><div><p>或者接收一个 <a href=\"https://developer.mozilla.org/zh-CN/docs/Web/JavaScript/Reference/Functions/get#description\" target=\"_blank\">getter 函数<a>：<p><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// 当 props.id 改变时重新 fetch<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/reusability/composables.html", "title": "组合式函数", "doc_id": "e014623fac644fe8817bec282f544979", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1263, "chunk_index": 43, "_doc_id": "43_1839466148303137266"}}
{"doc_id": "44_3591558657743901899", "text": "ss=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// 当 props.id 改变时重新 fetch<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> { <span><span>data<span><span>, <span><span>error<span><span> } <span><span>=<span><span> useFetch<span><span>(() <span><span>=><span><span> `/posts/${<span><span>props<span><span>.<span><span>id<span><span>}`<span><span>)<span><span><code><pre><div><p>我们可以用 <a href=\"/api/reactivity-core.", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/reusability/composables.html", "title": "组合式函数", "doc_id": "e014623fac644fe8817bec282f544979", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1263, "chunk_index": 44, "_doc_id": "44_3591558657743901899"}}
{"doc_id": "45_687725853132639836", "text": "pan>id<span><span>}`<span><span>)<span><span><code><pre><div><p>我们可以用 <a href=\"/api/reactivity-core.html#watcheffect\"><code>watchEffect()<code><a> 和 <a href=\"/api/reactivity-utilities.html#tovalue\"><code>toValue()<code><a> API 来重构我们现有的实现：<p><div class=\"vp-code-block-title\"><p class=\"vp-code-block-title-bar\"><span class=\"vp-code-block-title-text\">fetch.", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/reusability/composables.html", "title": "组合式函数", "doc_id": "e014623fac644fe8817bec282f544979", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1263, "chunk_index": 45, "_doc_id": "45_687725853132639836"}}
{"doc_id": "46_430605421353036873", "text": "p-code-block-title\"><p class=\"vp-code-block-title-bar\"><span class=\"vp-code-block-title-text\">fetch.js<span><p><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>import<span><span> { ref, watchEffect, toValue } <span><span>from<span><span> 'vue'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> function<span><span> useFetch<span><span>(<span><span>url<span><span>) {<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/reusability/composables.html", "title": "组合式函数", "doc_id": "e014623fac644fe8817bec282f544979", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1263, "chunk_index": 46, "_doc_id": "46_430605421353036873"}}
{"doc_id": "47_833256414604089420", "text": "rt<span><span> function<span><span> useFetch<span><span>(<span><span>url<span><span>) {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> const<span><span> data<span><span> =<span><span> ref<span><span>(<span><span>null<span><span>)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> const<span><span> error<span><span> =<span><span> ref<span><span>(<span><span>null<span><span>)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/reusability/composables.html", "title": "组合式函数", "doc_id": "e014623fac644fe8817bec282f544979", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1263, "chunk_index": 47, "_doc_id": "47_833256414604089420"}}
{"doc_id": "48_6532499675383463527", "text": "> =<span><span> ref<span><span>(<span><span>null<span><span>)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line highlighted\"><span> const<span><span> fetchData<span><span> =<span><span> () <span><span>=><span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // reset state before fetching..<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> data.value <span><span>=<span><span> null<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> error.value <span><span>=<span><span> null<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/reusability/composables.html", "title": "组合式函数", "doc_id": "e014623fac644fe8817bec282f544979", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1263, "chunk_index": 48, "_doc_id": "48_6532499675383463527"}}
{"doc_id": "49_7836961692675498431", "text": "lass=\"line\"><span> error.value <span><span>=<span><span> null<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line highlighted\"><span> fetch<span><span>(<span><span>toValue<span><span>(url))<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> .<span><span>then<span><span>((<span><span>res<span><span>) <span><span>=><span><span> res.<span><span>json<span><span>())<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/reusability/composables.html", "title": "组合式函数", "doc_id": "e014623fac644fe8817bec282f544979", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1263, "chunk_index": 49, "_doc_id": "49_7836961692675498431"}}
{"doc_id": "50_5307774176487255235", "text": "n><span>res<span><span>) <span><span>=><span><span> res.<span><span>json<span><span>())<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> .<span><span>then<span><span>((<span><span>json<span><span>) <span><span>=><span><span> (data.value <span><span>=<span><span> json))<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> .<span><span>catch<span><span>((<span><span>err<span><span>) <span><span>=><span><span> (error.value <span><span>=<span><span> err))<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/reusability/composables.html", "title": "组合式函数", "doc_id": "e014623fac644fe8817bec282f544979", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1263, "chunk_index": 50, "_doc_id": "50_5307774176487255235"}}
{"doc_id": "51_9047596840494910470", "text": "n>=<span><span> err))<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> watchEffect<span><span>(() <span><span>=><span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> fetchData<span><span>()<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> })<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> return<span><span> { data, error }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span><code><pre><div><div><p><code>toValue()<code> 是一个在 3.3 版本中新增的 API。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/reusability/composables.html", "title": "组合式函数", "doc_id": "e014623fac644fe8817bec282f544979", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1263, "chunk_index": 51, "_doc_id": "51_9047596840494910470"}}
{"doc_id": "52_3201825017226479740", "text": "n class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span><code><pre><div><div><p><code>toValue()<code> 是一个在 3.3 版本中新增的 API。它的设计目的是将 ref 或 getter 规范化为值。如果参数是 ref，它会返回 ref 的值；如果参数是函数，它会调用函数并返回其返回值。否则，它会原样返回参数。它的工作方式类似于 <a href=\"/api/reactivity-utilities.html#unref\"><code>unref()<code><a>，但对函数有特殊处理。<p><p>注意 <code>toValue(url)<code> 是在 <code>watchEffect<code> 回调函数的<strong>内部<strong>调用的。这确保了在 <code>toValue()<code> 规范化期间访问的任何响应式依赖项都会被侦听器跟踪。<p><p>这个版本的 <code>useFetch()<code> 现在能接收静态 URL 字符串、ref 和 getter，使其更加灵活。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/reusability/composables.html", "title": "组合式函数", "doc_id": "e014623fac644fe8817bec282f544979", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1263, "chunk_index": 52, "_doc_id": "52_3201825017226479740"}}
{"doc_id": "53_7981095457476285452", "text": "de> 规范化期间访问的任何响应式依赖项都会被侦听器跟踪。<p><p>这个版本的 <code>useFetch()<code> 现在能接收静态 URL 字符串、ref 和 getter，使其更加灵活。watch effect 会立即运行，并且会跟踪 <code>toValue(url)<code> 期间访问的任何依赖项。如果没有跟踪到依赖项 (例如 url 已经是字符串)，则 effect 只会运行一次；否则，它将在跟踪到的任何依赖项更改时重新运行。<p><p>这是<a href=\"https://play.vuejs.org/#eNp9Vdtu20YQ/ZUpUUA0qpAOjL4YktCbC7Rom8BN8sSHrMihtfZql9iLZEHgv2dml6SpxMiDIWkuZ+acmR2fs1+7rjgEzG6zlaut7Dw49KHbVFruO2M9nMFiu4Ta7LvgsYEeWmv2sKCkxSwoOPwTfb2b/EU5mopHR5GVro12HrbC4UerYA2Lnfeduy3LR2d0p0SNO6MatIU/dbI2DRZUtPSmMa4kgJQuG8qkjvLF28XVaAwRb2wx", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/reusability/composables.html", "title": "组合式函数", "doc_id": "e014623fac644fe8817bec282f544979", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1263, "chunk_index": 53, "_doc_id": "53_7981095457476285452"}}
{"doc_id": "54_2674048546848608730", "text": "", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/reusability/composables.html", "title": "组合式函数", "doc_id": "e014623fac644fe8817bec282f544979", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1263, "chunk_index": 54, "_doc_id": "54_2674048546848608730"}}
{"doc_id": "55_411911089811691074", "text": "", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/reusability/composables.html", "title": "组合式函数", "doc_id": "e014623fac644fe8817bec282f544979", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1263, "chunk_index": 55, "_doc_id": "55_411911089811691074"}}
{"doc_id": "56_2262418578848554976", "text": "JOcjTXe+obScHwaAi82lo9dC/q/wuyINjrwbuC5uZrS4WAQeyTN9ftOXIVwy537iecoX92kR4q/F1UvqIMsSbq6vo5XF6ekCeEcTauVDFJpuQESvMv53IBXadx3r4KqMrt0w0kwoZY5/R5u3AZejvd5h/fSK/dE9s63K3vN7tQesssnnhX1An9x3//+Hz/R9cu5NExRFf8d5zyIF7jGF/RZ0Q23P4mK3f8XLRmfhg7t79qjdSIobjXLE+Cqju/b7d6i/tHtT3MQ8VrH/Ahstp5A=\" target=\"_blank\">更新后的 <code>useFetch()<code><a>，为了便于演示，添加了人为延迟和随机错误。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/reusability/composables.html", "title": "组合式函数", "doc_id": "e014623fac644fe8817bec282f544979", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1263, "chunk_index": 56, "_doc_id": "56_2262418578848554976"}}
{"doc_id": "57_2469967445909762540", "text": "Cqju/b7d6i/tHtT3MQ8VrH/Ahstp5A=\" target=\"_blank\">更新后的 <code>useFetch()<code><a>，为了便于演示，添加了人为延迟和随机错误。<p><h2 id=\"conventions-and-best-practices\">约定和最佳实践 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#conventions-and-best-practices\">​<a><h2><h3 id=\"naming\">命名 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#naming\">​<a><h3><p>组合式函数约定用驼峰命名法命名，并以“use”作为开头。<p><h3 id=\"input-arguments\">输入参数 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#input-arguments\">​<a><h3><p>即便不依赖于 ref 或 getter 的响应性，组合式函数也可以接收它们作为参数。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/reusability/composables.html", "title": "组合式函数", "doc_id": "e014623fac644fe8817bec282f544979", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1263, "chunk_index": 57, "_doc_id": "57_2469967445909762540"}}
{"doc_id": "58_5131283951938799070", "text": "class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#input-arguments\">​<a><h3><p>即便不依赖于 ref 或 getter 的响应性，组合式函数也可以接收它们作为参数。如果你正在编写一个可能被其他开发者使用的组合式函数，最好处理一下输入参数是 ref 或 getter 而非原始值的情况。可以利用 <a href=\"/api/reactivity-utilities.html#tovalue\"><code>toValue()<code><a> 工具函数来实现：<p><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>import<span><span> { toValue } <span><span>from<span><span> 'vue'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/reusability/composables.html", "title": "组合式函数", "doc_id": "e014623fac644fe8817bec282f544979", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1263, "chunk_index": 58, "_doc_id": "58_5131283951938799070"}}
{"doc_id": "59_2395215089892064427", "text": "rt<span><span> { toValue } <span><span>from<span><span> 'vue'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>function<span><span> useFeature<span><span>(<span><span>maybeRefOrGetter<span><span>) {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 如果 maybeRefOrGetter 是一个 ref 或 getter，<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 将返回它的规范化值。<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 否则原样返回。<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/reusability/composables.html", "title": "组合式函数", "doc_id": "e014623fac644fe8817bec282f544979", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1263, "chunk_index": 59, "_doc_id": "59_2395215089892064427"}}
{"doc_id": "60_3919981922212827771", "text": "span class=\"line\"><span> // 将返回它的规范化值。<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 否则原样返回。<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> const<span><span> value<span><span> =<span><span> toValue<span><span>(maybeRefOrGetter)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span><code><pre><div><p>如果你的组合式函数在输入参数是 ref 或 getter 的情况下创建了响应式 effect，为了让它能够被正确追踪，请确保要么使用 <code>watch()<code> 显式地监视 ref 或 getter，要么在 <code>watchEffect()<code> 中调用 <code>toValue()<code>。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/reusability/composables.html", "title": "组合式函数", "doc_id": "e014623fac644fe8817bec282f544979", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1263, "chunk_index": 60, "_doc_id": "60_3919981922212827771"}}
{"doc_id": "61_5982222763182358611", "text": "要么使用 <code>watch()<code> 显式地监视 ref 或 getter，要么在 <code>watchEffect()<code> 中调用 <code>toValue()<code>。<p><p><a href=\"#accepting-reactive-state\">前面讨论过的 useFetch() 实现<a>提供了一个接受 ref、getter 或普通值作为输入参数的组合式函数的具体示例。<p><h3 id=\"return-values\">返回值 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#return-values\">​<a><h3><p>你可能已经注意到了，我们一直在组合式函数中使用 <code>ref()<code> 而不是 <code>reactive()<code>。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/reusability/composables.html", "title": "组合式函数", "doc_id": "e014623fac644fe8817bec282f544979", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1263, "chunk_index": 61, "_doc_id": "61_5982222763182358611"}}
{"doc_id": "62_273390955220886806", "text": "ef=\"#return-values\">​<a><h3><p>你可能已经注意到了，我们一直在组合式函数中使用 <code>ref()<code> 而不是 <code>reactive()<code>。我们推荐的约定是组合式函数始终返回一个包含多个 ref 的普通的非响应式对象，这样该对象在组件中被解构为 ref 之后仍可以保持响应性：<p><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// x 和 y 是两个 ref<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/reusability/composables.html", "title": "组合式函数", "doc_id": "e014623fac644fe8817bec282f544979", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1263, "chunk_index": 62, "_doc_id": "62_273390955220886806"}}
{"doc_id": "63_1330107100301496429", "text": "><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// x 和 y 是两个 ref<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> { <span><span>x<span><span>, <span><span>y<span><span> } <span><span>=<span><span> useMouse<span><span>()<span><span><code><pre><div><p>从组合式函数返回一个响应式对象会导致在对象解构过程中丢失与组合式函数内状态的响应性连接。与之相反，ref 则可以维持这一响应性连接。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/reusability/composables.html", "title": "组合式函数", "doc_id": "e014623fac644fe8817bec282f544979", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1263, "chunk_index": 63, "_doc_id": "63_1330107100301496429"}}
{"doc_id": "64_2546825558767937527", "text": ">()<span><span><code><pre><div><p>从组合式函数返回一个响应式对象会导致在对象解构过程中丢失与组合式函数内状态的响应性连接。与之相反，ref 则可以维持这一响应性连接。<p><p>如果你更希望以对象属性的形式来使用组合式函数中返回的状态，你可以将返回的对象用 <code>reactive()<code> 包装一次，这样其中的 ref 会被自动解包，例如：<p><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> mouse<span><span> =<span><span> reactive<span><span>(<span><span>useMouse<span><span>())<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// mouse.x 链接到了原来的 x ref<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/reusability/composables.html", "title": "组合式函数", "doc_id": "e014623fac644fe8817bec282f544979", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1263, "chunk_index": 64, "_doc_id": "64_2546825558767937527"}}
{"doc_id": "65_7746980827904477513", "text": "n>useMouse<span><span>())<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// mouse.x 链接到了原来的 x ref<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>console.<span><span>log<span><span>(mouse.x)<span><span><code><pre><div><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>Mouse position is at: {{ mouse.x }}, {{ mouse.y }}<span><span><code><pre><div><h3 id=\"side-effects\">副作用 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#side-effects\">​<a><h3><p>在组合式函数中的确可以执行副作用 (例如：添加 DOM 事件监听器或者请求数据)，", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/reusability/composables.html", "title": "组合式函数", "doc_id": "e014623fac644fe8817bec282f544979", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1263, "chunk_index": 65, "_doc_id": "65_7746980827904477513"}}
{"doc_id": "66_6343510775512791048", "text": "用 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#side-effects\">​<a><h3><p>在组合式函数中的确可以执行副作用 (例如：添加 DOM 事件监听器或者请求数据)，但请注意以下规则：<p><ul><li><p>如果你的应用用到了<a href=\"/guide/scaling-up/ssr.html\">服务端渲染<a> (SSR)，请确保在组件挂载后才调用的生命周期钩子中执行 DOM 相关的副作用，例如：<code>onMounted()<code>。这些钩子仅会在浏览器中被调用，因此可以确保能访问到 DOM。<p><li><li><p>确保在 <code>onUnmounted()<code> 时清理副作用。举例来说，如果一个组合式函数设置了一个事件监听器，它就应该在 <code>onUnmounted()<code> 中被移除 (就像我们在 <code>useMouse()<code> 示例中看到的一样)。当然也可以像之前的 <code>useEventListener()<code> 示例那样，使用一个组合式函数来自动帮你做这些事。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/reusability/composables.html", "title": "组合式函数", "doc_id": "e014623fac644fe8817bec282f544979", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1263, "chunk_index": 66, "_doc_id": "66_6343510775512791048"}}
{"doc_id": "67_3692173275816274969", "text": "在 <code>useMouse()<code> 示例中看到的一样)。当然也可以像之前的 <code>useEventListener()<code> 示例那样，使用一个组合式函数来自动帮你做这些事。<p><li><ul><h3 id=\"usage-restrictions\">使用限制 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#usage-restrictions\">​<a><h3><p>组合式函数只能在 <code><script setup><code> 或 <code>setup()<code> 钩子中被调用。在这些上下文中，它们也只能被<strong>同步<strong>调用。在某些情况下，你也可以在像 <code>onMounted()<code> 这样的生命周期钩子中调用它们。<p><p>这些限制很重要，因为这些是 Vue 用于确定当前活跃的组件实例的上下文。访问活跃的组件实例很有必要，这样才能：<p><ol><li><p>将生命周期钩子注册到该组件实例上<p><li><li><p>将计算属性和监听器注册到该组件实例上，以便在该组件被卸载时停止监听，避免内存泄漏。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/reusability/composables.html", "title": "组合式函数", "doc_id": "e014623fac644fe8817bec282f544979", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1263, "chunk_index": 67, "_doc_id": "67_3692173275816274969"}}
{"doc_id": "68_5882736219967426741", "text": "的组件实例很有必要，这样才能：<p><ol><li><p>将生命周期钩子注册到该组件实例上<p><li><li><p>将计算属性和监听器注册到该组件实例上，以便在该组件被卸载时停止监听，避免内存泄漏。<p><li><ol><div class=\"tip custom-block\"><p class=\"custom-block-title\">TIP<p><p><code><script setup><code> 是唯一在调用 <code>await<code> <strong>之后<strong>仍可调用组合式函数的地方。编译器会在异步操作之后自动为你恢复当前的组件实例。<p><div><h2 id=\"extracting-composables-for-code-organization\">通过抽取组合式函数改善代码结构 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#extracting-composables-for-code-organization\">​<a><h2><p>抽取组合式函数不仅是为了复用，也是为了代码组织。随着组件复杂度的增高，你可能会最终发现组件多得难以查询和理解。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/reusability/composables.html", "title": "组合式函数", "doc_id": "e014623fac644fe8817bec282f544979", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1263, "chunk_index": 68, "_doc_id": "68_5882736219967426741"}}
{"doc_id": "69_1775578702472373271", "text": "omposables-for-code-organization\">​<a><h2><p>抽取组合式函数不仅是为了复用，也是为了代码组织。随着组件复杂度的增高，你可能会最终发现组件多得难以查询和理解。组合式 API 会给予你足够的灵活性，让你可以基于逻辑问题将组件代码拆分成更小的函数：<p><div class=\"language-vue\"> <span class=\"lang\">vue<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>script<span><span> setup<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>import<span><span> { useFeatureA } <span><span>from<span><span> './featureA.js'<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/reusability/composables.html", "title": "组合式函数", "doc_id": "e014623fac644fe8817bec282f544979", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1263, "chunk_index": 69, "_doc_id": "69_1775578702472373271"}}
{"doc_id": "70_6269961318611715010", "text": "\"><span>import<span><span> { useFeatureA } <span><span>from<span><span> './featureA.js'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>import<span><span> { useFeatureB } <span><span>from<span><span> './featureB.js'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>import<span><span> { useFeatureC } <span><span>from<span><span> './featureC.js'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/reusability/composables.html", "title": "组合式函数", "doc_id": "e014623fac644fe8817bec282f544979", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1263, "chunk_index": 70, "_doc_id": "70_6269961318611715010"}}
{"doc_id": "71_4611284842490079050", "text": "{ useFeatureC } <span><span>from<span><span> './featureC.js'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> { <span><span>foo<span><span>, <span><span>bar<span><span> } <span><span>=<span><span> useFeatureA<span><span>()<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> { <span><span>baz<span><span> } <span><span>=<span><span> useFeatureB<span><span>(foo)<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/reusability/composables.html", "title": "组合式函数", "doc_id": "e014623fac644fe8817bec282f544979", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1263, "chunk_index": 71, "_doc_id": "71_4611284842490079050"}}
{"doc_id": "72_3625886597960807421", "text": "{ <span><span>baz<span><span> } <span><span>=<span><span> useFeatureB<span><span>(foo)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> { <span><span>qux<span><span> } <span><span>=<span><span> useFeatureC<span><span>(baz)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>script<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>在某种程度上，你可以将这些提取出的组合式函数看作是可以相互通信的组件范围内的服务。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/reusability/composables.html", "title": "组合式函数", "doc_id": "e014623fac644fe8817bec282f544979", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1263, "chunk_index": 72, "_doc_id": "72_3625886597960807421"}}
{"doc_id": "73_2888896990343657556", "text": "an><span>script<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>在某种程度上，你可以将这些提取出的组合式函数看作是可以相互通信的组件范围内的服务。<p><h2 id=\"using-composables-in-options-api\">在选项式 API 中使用组合式函数 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#using-composables-in-options-api\">​<a><h2><p>如果你正在使用选项式 API，组合式函数必须在 <code>setup()<code> 中调用。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/reusability/composables.html", "title": "组合式函数", "doc_id": "e014623fac644fe8817bec282f544979", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1263, "chunk_index": 73, "_doc_id": "73_2888896990343657556"}}
{"doc_id": "74_9175962782806008139", "text": "href=\"#using-composables-in-options-api\">​<a><h2><p>如果你正在使用选项式 API，组合式函数必须在 <code>setup()<code> 中调用。且其返回的绑定必须在 <code>setup()<code> 中返回，以便暴露给 <code>this<code> 及其模板：<p><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>import<span><span> { useMouse } <span><span>from<span><span> './mouse.js'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>import<span><span> { useFetch } <span><span>from<span><span> './fetch.js'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/reusability/composables.html", "title": "组合式函数", "doc_id": "e014623fac644fe8817bec282f544979", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1263, "chunk_index": 74, "_doc_id": "74_9175962782806008139"}}
{"doc_id": "75_6864817038471051148", "text": "<span> { useFetch } <span><span>from<span><span> './fetch.js'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> setup<span><span>() {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> const<span><span> { <span><span>x<span><span>, <span><span>y<span><span> } <span><span>=<span><span> useMouse<span><span>()<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/reusability/composables.html", "title": "组合式函数", "doc_id": "e014623fac644fe8817bec282f544979", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1263, "chunk_index": 75, "_doc_id": "75_6864817038471051148"}}
{"doc_id": "76_4099952000819616056", "text": "an><span>, <span><span>y<span><span> } <span><span>=<span><span> useMouse<span><span>()<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> const<span><span> { <span><span>data<span><span>, <span><span>error<span><span> } <span><span>=<span><span> useFetch<span><span>(<span><span>'...'<span><span>)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> return<span><span> { x, y, data, error }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> },<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> mounted<span><span>() {<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/reusability/composables.html", "title": "组合式函数", "doc_id": "e014623fac644fe8817bec282f544979", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1263, "chunk_index": 76, "_doc_id": "76_4099952000819616056"}}
{"doc_id": "77_38320362631925842", "text": "an class=\"line\"><span> },<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> mounted<span><span>() {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // setup() 暴露的属性可以在通过 `this` 访问到<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> console.<span><span>log<span><span>(<span><span>this<span><span>.x)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // ...其他选项<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/reusability/composables.html", "title": "组合式函数", "doc_id": "e014623fac644fe8817bec282f544979", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1263, "chunk_index": 77, "_doc_id": "77_38320362631925842"}}
{"doc_id": "78_5700109037037057365", "text": "pan><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // ...其他选项<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span><code><pre><div><h2 id=\"comparisons-with-other-techniques\">与其他模式的比较 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#comparisons-with-other-techniques\">​<a><h2><h3 id=\"vs-mixins\">和 Mixin 的对比 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#vs-mixins\">​<a><h3><p>Vue 2 的用户可能会对 <a href=\"/api/options-composition.html#mixins\">mixins<a> 选项比较熟悉。它也让我们能够把组件逻辑提取到可复用的单元里。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/reusability/composables.html", "title": "组合式函数", "doc_id": "e014623fac644fe8817bec282f544979", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1263, "chunk_index": 78, "_doc_id": "78_5700109037037057365"}}
{"doc_id": "79_5080123897646010684", "text": "ue 2 的用户可能会对 <a href=\"/api/options-composition.html#mixins\">mixins<a> 选项比较熟悉。它也让我们能够把组件逻辑提取到可复用的单元里。然而 mixins 有三个主要的短板：<p><ol><li><p><strong>不清晰的数据来源<strong>：当使用了多个 mixin 时，实例上的数据属性来自哪个 mixin 变得不清晰，这使追溯实现和理解组件行为变得困难。这也是我们推荐在组合式函数中使用 ref + 解构模式的理由：让属性的来源在消费组件时一目了然。<p><li><li><p><strong>命名空间冲突<strong>：多个来自不同作者的 mixin 可能会注册相同的属性名，造成命名冲突。若使用组合式函数，你可以通过在解构变量时对变量进行重命名来避免相同的键名。<p><li><li><p><strong>隐式的跨 mixin 交流<strong>：多个 mixin 需要依赖共享的属性名来进行相互作用，这使得它们隐性地耦合在一起。而一个组合式函数的返回值可以作为另一个组合式函数的参数被传入，像普通函数那样。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/reusability/composables.html", "title": "组合式函数", "doc_id": "e014623fac644fe8817bec282f544979", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1263, "chunk_index": 79, "_doc_id": "79_5080123897646010684"}}
{"doc_id": "80_4821228682190819331", "text": "的跨 mixin 交流<strong>：多个 mixin 需要依赖共享的属性名来进行相互作用，这使得它们隐性地耦合在一起。而一个组合式函数的返回值可以作为另一个组合式函数的参数被传入，像普通函数那样。<p><li><ol><p>基于上述理由，我们不再推荐在 Vue 3 中继续使用 mixin。保留该功能只是为了项目迁移的需求和照顾熟悉它的用户。<p><h3 id=\"vs-renderless-components\">和无渲染组件的对比 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#vs-renderless-components\">​<a><h3><p>在组件插槽一章中，我们讨论过了基于作用域插槽的<a href=\"/guide/components/slots.html#renderless-components\">无渲染组件<a>。我们甚至用它实现了一样的鼠标追踪器示例。<p><p>组合式函数相对于无渲染组件的主要优势是：组合式函数不会产生额外的组件实例开销。当在整个应用中使用时，由无渲染组件产生的额外组件实例会带来无法忽视的性能开销。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/reusability/composables.html", "title": "组合式函数", "doc_id": "e014623fac644fe8817bec282f544979", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1263, "chunk_index": 80, "_doc_id": "80_4821228682190819331"}}
{"doc_id": "81_1043122677701176133", "text": "用它实现了一样的鼠标追踪器示例。<p><p>组合式函数相对于无渲染组件的主要优势是：组合式函数不会产生额外的组件实例开销。当在整个应用中使用时，由无渲染组件产生的额外组件实例会带来无法忽视的性能开销。<p><p>我们推荐在纯逻辑复用时使用组合式函数，在需要同时复用逻辑和视图布局时使用无渲染组件。<p><h3 id=\"vs-react-hooks\">和 React Hooks 的对比 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#vs-react-hooks\">​<a><h3><p>如果你有 React 的开发经验，你可能注意到组合式函数和自定义 React hooks 非常相似。组合式 API 的一部分灵感正来自于 React hooks，Vue 的组合式函数也的确在逻辑组合能力上与 React hooks 相近。然而，Vue 的组合式函数是基于 Vue 细粒度的响应性系统，这和 React hooks 的执行模型有本质上的不同。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/reusability/composables.html", "title": "组合式函数", "doc_id": "e014623fac644fe8817bec282f544979", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1263, "chunk_index": 81, "_doc_id": "81_1043122677701176133"}}
{"doc_id": "82_8622037736974326919", "text": "ks，Vue 的组合式函数也的确在逻辑组合能力上与 React hooks 相近。然而，Vue 的组合式函数是基于 Vue 细粒度的响应性系统，这和 React hooks 的执行模型有本质上的不同。这一话题在<a href=\"/guide/extras/composition-api-faq.html#comparison-with-react-hooks\">组合式 API 的常见问题<a>中有更细致的讨论。<p><h2 id=\"further-reading\">延伸阅读 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#further-reading\">​<a><h2><div><div>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/reusability/composables.html", "title": "组合式函数", "doc_id": "e014623fac644fe8817bec282f544979", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1263, "chunk_index": 82, "_doc_id": "82_8622037736974326919"}}
{"doc_id": "0_8892860752954102206", "text": "<div><div><h1 id=\"code-of-conduct\">行为规范 <h1><h2 id=\"our-pledge\">我们的承诺 <h2><p>为了营造一个开放和欢迎的环境，作为贡献者和维护者，我们承诺为每个参与我们的项目和社区的人提供无骚扰的体验，无论年龄、体型、残疾、种族、性别特征、性别认同和性别表达、经验水平、教育程度、社会经济地位、国籍、个人外表、种族、宗教、政党或性别认同和取向。然而，请注意，宗教、政治派别或其他意识形态归属不能为我们在本行为准则中列出的不可接受的行为提供豁免。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/about/coc.html", "title": "行为规范", "doc_id": "620b1bf7129f47eeb4d80778a2ac1361", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 29, "chunk_index": 0, "_doc_id": "0_8892860752954102206"}}
{"doc_id": "1_1433161254159040998", "text": "认同和性别表达、经验水平、教育程度、社会经济地位、国籍、个人外表、种族、宗教、政党或性别认同和取向。然而，请注意，宗教、政治派别或其他意识形态归属不能为我们在本行为准则中列出的不可接受的行为提供豁免。<p><h2 id=\"our-standards\">我们的标准 <h2><p>有助于创造积极环境的行为包括：<p><ul><li>使用欢迎和包容的语言<li><li>尊重不同的观点和经历<li><li>优雅地接受建设性批评<li><li>关注社区利益<li><li>对其他社区成员表现出同理心<li><ul><p>参与者不可接受的行为包括：<p><ul><li>使用性相关的语言或图像以及令人反感的性关注或挑逗<li><li>挑衅、侮辱性/贬损性评论、人身或政治攻击<li><li>进行公开或私下的骚扰<li><li>未经明确许可，公开他人的私人信息，如实际地址或电子地址<li><li>其他在专业环境中可能被合理认为不合适的行为<li><ul><h2 id=\"our-responsibilities\">我们的责任 <h2><p>项目维护人员负责明确可接受行为的标准，并有责任对任何不可接受的行为采取适当和公平的纠正措施。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/about/coc.html", "title": "行为规范", "doc_id": "620b1bf7129f47eeb4d80778a2ac1361", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 29, "chunk_index": 1, "_doc_id": "1_1433161254159040998"}}
{"doc_id": "2_3033294184740843324", "text": "的行为<li><ul><h2 id=\"our-responsibilities\">我们的责任 <h2><p>项目维护人员负责明确可接受行为的标准，并有责任对任何不可接受的行为采取适当和公平的纠正措施。<p><p>项目维护者有权利和责任删除、编辑或拒绝不符合本行为准则的评论、提交、代码、wiki 编辑、问题和其他贡献，或暂时/永久禁止任何贡献者作出其他被认为不适当、威胁、冒犯或有害的行为。<p><h2 id=\"scope\">范围 <h2><p>当个人代表项目或其社区时，本行为准则同时适用于项目空间和公共空间。代表项目或社区的例子包括使用项目官方的电子邮件地址、通过官方社交媒体帐户发布信息、或在线上或线下活动中担任指定代表。代表项目的含义也可以由项目维护人员进一步定义和明确。<p><h2 id=\"enforcement\">执行 <h2><p>辱骂、骚扰或其他不可接受的行为可以通过 <a href=\"mailto:community@vuejs.org\" target=\"_blank\">community@vuejs.org<a> 联系项目团队来举报。所有的投诉都将被审查和调查，并根据具体情况作出必要和适当的回应。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/about/coc.html", "title": "行为规范", "doc_id": "620b1bf7129f47eeb4d80778a2ac1361", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 29, "chunk_index": 2, "_doc_id": "2_3033294184740843324"}}
{"doc_id": "3_5973290353647657973", "text": "mmunity@vuejs.org\" target=\"_blank\">community@vuejs.org<a> 联系项目团队来举报。所有的投诉都将被审查和调查，并根据具体情况作出必要和适当的回应。项目组有义务对事件的举报者保密。具体执行政策的进一步详情可另行公布。<p><p>项目维护者如果不遵守或善意地执行行为准则，可能会面临由其他的项目领导成员所决定的暂时或永久的不利后果。<p><h2 id=\"attribution\">归属 <h2><p>该行为准则改编自《<a href=\"https://www.contributor-covenant.org/\" target=\"_blank\">Contributor Covenant<a>》<a href=\"https://www.contributor-covenant.org/version/1/4/code-of-conduct.html\" target=\"_blank\">1.4 版本<a>。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/about/coc.html", "title": "行为规范", "doc_id": "620b1bf7129f47eeb4d80778a2ac1361", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 29, "chunk_index": 3, "_doc_id": "3_5973290353647657973"}}
{"doc_id": "4_4044055181780039276", "text": "f=\"https://www.contributor-covenant.org/version/1/4/code-of-conduct.html\" target=\"_blank\">1.4 版本<a>。<p><p>有关该行为准则的常见问题见 <a href=\"https://www.contributor-covenant.org/faq\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.contributor-covenant.org/faq<a><p><div><div>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/about/coc.html", "title": "行为规范", "doc_id": "620b1bf7129f47eeb4d80778a2ac1361", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 29, "chunk_index": 4, "_doc_id": "4_4044055181780039276"}}
{"doc_id": "0_4936996115793506973", "text": "<div><div><h1 id=\"custom-directives\">自定义指令 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#custom-directives\">​<a><h1><h2 id=\"introduction\">介绍 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#introduction\">​<a><h2><p>除了 Vue 内置的一系列指令 (比如 <code>v-model<code> 或 <code>v-show<code>) 之外，Vue 还允许你注册自定义的指令 (Custom Directives)。<p><p>我们已经介绍了两种在 Vue 中重用代码的方式：<a href=\"/guide/essentials/component-basics.html\">组件<a>和<a href=\"./composables.html\">组合式函数<a>。组件是主要的构建模块，而组合式函数则侧重于有状态的逻辑。另一方面，自定义指令主要是为了重用涉及普通元素的底层 DOM 访问的逻辑。<p><p>一个自定义指令由一个包含类似组件生命周期钩子的对象来定义。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/reusability/custom-directives.html", "title": "自定义指令", "doc_id": "da7fa3d981f5483f89e8b982e548d350", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 650, "chunk_index": 0, "_doc_id": "0_4936996115793506973"}}
{"doc_id": "1_4576225682316773330", "text": "组件是主要的构建模块，而组合式函数则侧重于有状态的逻辑。另一方面，自定义指令主要是为了重用涉及普通元素的底层 DOM 访问的逻辑。<p><p>一个自定义指令由一个包含类似组件生命周期钩子的对象来定义。钩子函数会接收到指令所绑定元素作为其参数。下面是一个自定义指令的例子，当 Vue 将元素插入到 DOM 中后，该指令会将一个 class 添加到元素中：<p><div class=\"composition-api\"><div class=\"language-vue\"> <span class=\"lang\">vue<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>script<span><span> setup<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 在模板中启用 v-highlight<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/reusability/custom-directives.html", "title": "自定义指令", "doc_id": "da7fa3d981f5483f89e8b982e548d350", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 650, "chunk_index": 1, "_doc_id": "1_4576225682316773330"}}
{"doc_id": "2_2265665949377366890", "text": "an><span> setup<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 在模板中启用 v-highlight<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> vHighlight<span><span> =<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> mounted<span><span>: (<span><span>el<span><span>) <span><span>=><span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> el.classList.<span><span>add<span><span>(<span><span>'is-highlight'<span><span>)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/reusability/custom-directives.html", "title": "自定义指令", "doc_id": "da7fa3d981f5483f89e8b982e548d350", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 650, "chunk_index": 2, "_doc_id": "2_2265665949377366890"}}
{"doc_id": "3_3793479932205133206", "text": "><span>)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>script<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>p<span><span> v-highlight<span><span>>This sentence is important!</<span><span>p<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/reusability/custom-directives.html", "title": "自定义指令", "doc_id": "da7fa3d981f5483f89e8b982e548d350", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 650, "chunk_index": 3, "_doc_id": "3_3793479932205133206"}}
{"doc_id": "4_4326071410793857437", "text": "><span> v-highlight<span><span>>This sentence is important!</<span><span>p<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><div><div class=\"options-api\"><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> highlight<span><span> =<span><span> {<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/reusability/custom-directives.html", "title": "自定义指令", "doc_id": "da7fa3d981f5483f89e8b982e548d350", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 650, "chunk_index": 4, "_doc_id": "4_4326071410793857437"}}
{"doc_id": "5_300359654357300350", "text": "><code><span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> highlight<span><span> =<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> mounted<span><span>: (<span><span>el<span><span>) <span><span>=><span><span> el.classList.<span><span>add<span><span>(<span><span>'is-highlight'<span><span>)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> directives: {<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/reusability/custom-directives.html", "title": "自定义指令", "doc_id": "da7fa3d981f5483f89e8b982e548d350", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 650, "chunk_index": 5, "_doc_id": "5_300359654357300350"}}
{"doc_id": "6_1397375880177926015", "text": "t<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> directives: {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 在模板中启用 v-highlight<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> highlight<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/reusability/custom-directives.html", "title": "自定义指令", "doc_id": "da7fa3d981f5483f89e8b982e548d350", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 650, "chunk_index": 6, "_doc_id": "6_1397375880177926015"}}
{"doc_id": "7_4471367492866326138", "text": "span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> highlight<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span><code><pre><div><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>p<span><span> v-highlight<span><span>>This sentence is important!</<span><span>p<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><div><div class=\"demo\"><p>This sentence is important!<p><div><div class=\"composition-api\"><p>在 <code><script setup><code> 中，任何以 <code>v<code> 开头的驼峰式命名的变量都可以当作自定义指令使用。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/reusability/custom-directives.html", "title": "自定义指令", "doc_id": "da7fa3d981f5483f89e8b982e548d350", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 650, "chunk_index": 7, "_doc_id": "7_4471367492866326138"}}
{"doc_id": "8_3806090618611181558", "text": "class=\"composition-api\"><p>在 <code><script setup><code> 中，任何以 <code>v<code> 开头的驼峰式命名的变量都可以当作自定义指令使用。在上述例子中，<code>vHighlight<code> 可以在模板中以 <code>v-highlight<code> 的形式使用。<p><p>在不使用 <code><script setup><code> 的情况下，自定义指令需要通过 <code>directives<code> 选项注册：<p><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> setup<span><span>() {<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/reusability/custom-directives.html", "title": "自定义指令", "doc_id": "da7fa3d981f5483f89e8b982e548d350", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 650, "chunk_index": 8, "_doc_id": "8_3806090618611181558"}}
{"doc_id": "9_3864125965280497274", "text": "span> default<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> setup<span><span>() {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> /*...*/<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> },<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> directives: {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 在模板中启用 v-highlight<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> highlight: {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> /* ... */<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/reusability/custom-directives.html", "title": "自定义指令", "doc_id": "da7fa3d981f5483f89e8b982e548d350", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 650, "chunk_index": 9, "_doc_id": "9_3864125965280497274"}}
{"doc_id": "10_4571149499379582031", "text": "... */<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span><code><pre><div><div><div class=\"options-api\"><p>和组件类似，自定义指令在模板中使用前必须先注册。在上面的例子中，我们使用 <code>directives<code> 选项完成了指令的局部注册。<p><div><p>将一个自定义指令全局注册到应用层级也是一种常见的做法：<p><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> app<span><span> =<span><span> createApp<span><span>({})<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/reusability/custom-directives.html", "title": "自定义指令", "doc_id": "da7fa3d981f5483f89e8b982e548d350", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 650, "chunk_index": 10, "_doc_id": "10_4571149499379582031"}}
{"doc_id": "11_305538269856170579", "text": "=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> app<span><span> =<span><span> createApp<span><span>({})<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 使 v-highlight 在所有组件中都可用<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>app.<span><span>directive<span><span>(<span><span>'highlight'<span><span>, {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> /* ... */<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>})<span><span><code><pre><div><p>通过扩展 <code>vue<code> 中的 <code>ComponentCustomProperties<code> 接口，可以为自定义的全局指令添加类型。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/reusability/custom-directives.html", "title": "自定义指令", "doc_id": "da7fa3d981f5483f89e8b982e548d350", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 650, "chunk_index": 11, "_doc_id": "11_305538269856170579"}}
{"doc_id": "12_1802672745088788783", "text": "<code><pre><div><p>通过扩展 <code>vue<code> 中的 <code>ComponentCustomProperties<code> 接口，可以为自定义的全局指令添加类型。<p><p>更多细节参考：<a href=\"/guide/typescript/composition-api.html#typing-global-custom-directives\">为自定义全局指令添加类型<a> <p><h2 id=\"when-to-use\">自定义指令的使用时机 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#when-to-use\">​<a><h2><p>只有当所需功能只能通过直接的 DOM 操作来实现时，才应该使用自定义指令。<p><p>一个常见例子是使元素获取焦点的 <code>v-focus<code> 指令。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/reusability/custom-directives.html", "title": "自定义指令", "doc_id": "da7fa3d981f5483f89e8b982e548d350", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 650, "chunk_index": 12, "_doc_id": "12_1802672745088788783"}}
{"doc_id": "13_4595826270812293981", "text": "o-use\">​<a><h2><p>只有当所需功能只能通过直接的 DOM 操作来实现时，才应该使用自定义指令。<p><p>一个常见例子是使元素获取焦点的 <code>v-focus<code> 指令。<p><div class=\"composition-api\"><div class=\"language-vue\"> <span class=\"lang\">vue<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>script<span><span> setup<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 在模板中启用 v-focus<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> vFocus<span><span> =<span><span> {<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/reusability/custom-directives.html", "title": "自定义指令", "doc_id": "da7fa3d981f5483f89e8b982e548d350", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 650, "chunk_index": 13, "_doc_id": "13_4595826270812293981"}}
{"doc_id": "14_276853647708462936", "text": "an><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> vFocus<span><span> =<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> mounted<span><span>: (<span><span>el<span><span>) <span><span>=><span><span> el.<span><span>focus<span><span>()<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>script<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/reusability/custom-directives.html", "title": "自定义指令", "doc_id": "da7fa3d981f5483f89e8b982e548d350", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 650, "chunk_index": 14, "_doc_id": "14_276853647708462936"}}
{"doc_id": "15_7759366352279599518", "text": ">\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>input<span><span> v-focus<span><span> /><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><div><div class=\"options-api\"><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> focus<span><span> =<span><span> {<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/reusability/custom-directives.html", "title": "自定义指令", "doc_id": "da7fa3d981f5483f89e8b982e548d350", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 650, "chunk_index": 15, "_doc_id": "15_7759366352279599518"}}
{"doc_id": "16_3134244627004408784", "text": "ode\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> focus<span><span> =<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> mounted<span><span>: (<span><span>el<span><span>) <span><span>=><span><span> el.<span><span>focus<span><span>()<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> directives: {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 在模板中启用 v-focus<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/reusability/custom-directives.html", "title": "自定义指令", "doc_id": "da7fa3d981f5483f89e8b982e548d350", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 650, "chunk_index": 16, "_doc_id": "16_3134244627004408784"}}
{"doc_id": "17_6650299634259822072", "text": "ass=\"line\"><span> directives: {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 在模板中启用 v-focus<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> focus<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/reusability/custom-directives.html", "title": "自定义指令", "doc_id": "da7fa3d981f5483f89e8b982e548d350", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 650, "chunk_index": 17, "_doc_id": "17_6650299634259822072"}}
{"doc_id": "18_3010723294224767608", "text": "cus<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> focus<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span><code><pre><div><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>input<span><span> v-focus<span><span> /><span><span><code><pre><div><div><p>该指令比 <code>autofocus<code> 属性更有用，因为它不仅在页面加载时有效，而且在 Vue 动态插入元素时也有效！<p><p>建议尽可能使用 <code>v-bind<code> 等内置指令声明模板，因为它们更高效，对服务端渲染也更友好。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/reusability/custom-directives.html", "title": "自定义指令", "doc_id": "da7fa3d981f5483f89e8b982e548d350", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 650, "chunk_index": 18, "_doc_id": "18_3010723294224767608"}}
{"doc_id": "19_2361924872320388882", "text": "性更有用，因为它不仅在页面加载时有效，而且在 Vue 动态插入元素时也有效！<p><p>建议尽可能使用 <code>v-bind<code> 等内置指令声明模板，因为它们更高效，对服务端渲染也更友好。<p><h2 id=\"directive-hooks\">指令钩子 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#directive-hooks\">​<a><h2><p>一个指令的定义对象可以提供几种钩子函数 (都是可选的)：<p><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> myDirective<span><span> =<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 在绑定元素的 attribute 前<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/reusability/custom-directives.html", "title": "自定义指令", "doc_id": "da7fa3d981f5483f89e8b982e548d350", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 650, "chunk_index": 19, "_doc_id": "19_2361924872320388882"}}
{"doc_id": "20_8471838246390527593", "text": "span><span> =<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 在绑定元素的 attribute 前<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 或事件监听器应用前调用<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> created<span><span>(<span><span>el<span><span>, <span><span>binding<span><span>, <span><span>vnode<span><span>) {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 下面会介绍各个参数的细节<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> },<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 在元素被插入到 DOM 前调用<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/reusability/custom-directives.html", "title": "自定义指令", "doc_id": "da7fa3d981f5483f89e8b982e548d350", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 650, "chunk_index": 20, "_doc_id": "20_8471838246390527593"}}
{"doc_id": "21_3365889527089085230", "text": ">\n<span class=\"line\"><span> },<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 在元素被插入到 DOM 前调用<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> beforeMount<span><span>(<span><span>el<span><span>, <span><span>binding<span><span>, <span><span>vnode<span><span>) {},<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 在绑定元素的父组件<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 及他自己的所有子节点都挂载完成后调用<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/reusability/custom-directives.html", "title": "自定义指令", "doc_id": "da7fa3d981f5483f89e8b982e548d350", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 650, "chunk_index": 21, "_doc_id": "21_3365889527089085230"}}
{"doc_id": "22_8842081860751451888", "text": "=\"line\"><span> // 在绑定元素的父组件<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 及他自己的所有子节点都挂载完成后调用<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> mounted<span><span>(<span><span>el<span><span>, <span><span>binding<span><span>, <span><span>vnode<span><span>) {},<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 绑定元素的父组件更新前调用<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> beforeUpdate<span><span>(<span><span>el<span><span>, <span><span>binding<span><span>, <span><span>vnode<span><span>, <span><span>prevVnode<span><span>) {},<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/reusability/custom-directives.html", "title": "自定义指令", "doc_id": "da7fa3d981f5483f89e8b982e548d350", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 650, "chunk_index": 22, "_doc_id": "22_8842081860751451888"}}
{"doc_id": "23_5253205252361059428", "text": "ding<span><span>, <span><span>vnode<span><span>, <span><span>prevVnode<span><span>) {},<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 在绑定元素的父组件<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 及他自己的所有子节点都更新后调用<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> updated<span><span>(<span><span>el<span><span>, <span><span>binding<span><span>, <span><span>vnode<span><span>, <span><span>prevVnode<span><span>) {},<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 绑定元素的父组件卸载前调用<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/reusability/custom-directives.html", "title": "自定义指令", "doc_id": "da7fa3d981f5483f89e8b982e548d350", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 650, "chunk_index": 23, "_doc_id": "23_5253205252361059428"}}
{"doc_id": "24_208827483997569662", "text": "<span>prevVnode<span><span>) {},<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 绑定元素的父组件卸载前调用<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> beforeUnmount<span><span>(<span><span>el<span><span>, <span><span>binding<span><span>, <span><span>vnode<span><span>) {},<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 绑定元素的父组件卸载后调用<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> unmounted<span><span>(<span><span>el<span><span>, <span><span>binding<span><span>, <span><span>vnode<span><span>) {}<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/reusability/custom-directives.html", "title": "自定义指令", "doc_id": "da7fa3d981f5483f89e8b982e548d350", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 650, "chunk_index": 24, "_doc_id": "24_208827483997569662"}}
{"doc_id": "25_9030883566198232201", "text": "span>el<span><span>, <span><span>binding<span><span>, <span><span>vnode<span><span>) {}<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span><code><pre><div><h3 id=\"hook-arguments\">钩子参数 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#hook-arguments\">​<a><h3><p>指令的钩子会传递以下几种参数：<p><p>举例来说，", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/reusability/custom-directives.html", "title": "自定义指令", "doc_id": "da7fa3d981f5483f89e8b982e548d350", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 650, "chunk_index": 25, "_doc_id": "25_9030883566198232201"}}
{"doc_id": "26_6749895163955012619", "text": "rguments\">钩子参数 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#hook-arguments\">​<a><h3><p>指令的钩子会传递以下几种参数：<p><p>举例来说，像下面这样使用指令：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>div<span><span> v-example<span><span>:<span><span>foo<span><span>.<span><span>bar<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>baz<span><span>\"<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p><code>binding<code> 参数会是一个这样的对象：<p><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>{<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/reusability/custom-directives.html", "title": "自定义指令", "doc_id": "da7fa3d981f5483f89e8b982e548d350", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 650, "chunk_index": 26, "_doc_id": "26_6749895163955012619"}}
{"doc_id": "27_6085814655305516967", "text": "=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>{<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> arg<span><span>: <span><span>'foo'<span><span>,<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> modifiers<span><span>: { <span><span>bar<span><span>: <span><span>true<span><span> },<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> value<span><span>: <span><span>/* `baz` 的值 */<span><span>,<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> oldValue<span><span>: <span><span>/* 上一次更新时 `baz` 的值 */<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/reusability/custom-directives.html", "title": "自定义指令", "doc_id": "da7fa3d981f5483f89e8b982e548d350", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 650, "chunk_index": 27, "_doc_id": "27_6085814655305516967"}}
{"doc_id": "28_47753632511962328", "text": "span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> oldValue<span><span>: <span><span>/* 上一次更新时 `baz` 的值 */<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span><code><pre><div><p>和内置指令类似，自定义指令的参数也可以是动态的。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/reusability/custom-directives.html", "title": "自定义指令", "doc_id": "da7fa3d981f5483f89e8b982e548d350", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 650, "chunk_index": 28, "_doc_id": "28_47753632511962328"}}
{"doc_id": "29_4472410106953711706", "text": "的值 */<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span><code><pre><div><p>和内置指令类似，自定义指令的参数也可以是动态的。举例来说：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>div<span><span> v-example:<span><span>[<span><span>arg<span><span>]=<span><span>\"value\"<span><span>></<span><span>div<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>这里指令的参数会基于组件的 <code>arg<code> 数据属性响应式地更新。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/reusability/custom-directives.html", "title": "自定义指令", "doc_id": "da7fa3d981f5483f89e8b982e548d350", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 650, "chunk_index": 29, "_doc_id": "29_4472410106953711706"}}
{"doc_id": "30_1749559985005093124", "text": "<span><span>div<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>这里指令的参数会基于组件的 <code>arg<code> 数据属性响应式地更新。<p><div class=\"tip custom-block\"><p class=\"custom-block-title\">Note<p><p>除了 <code>el<code> 外，其他参数都是只读的，不要更改它们。若你需要在不同的钩子间共享信息，推荐通过元素的 <a href=\"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/API/HTMLElement/dataset\" target=\"_blank\">dataset<a> attribute 实现。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/reusability/custom-directives.html", "title": "自定义指令", "doc_id": "da7fa3d981f5483f89e8b982e548d350", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 650, "chunk_index": 30, "_doc_id": "30_1749559985005093124"}}
{"doc_id": "31_6092583910737958366", "text": "veloper.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/API/HTMLElement/dataset\" target=\"_blank\">dataset<a> attribute 实现。<p><div><h2 id=\"function-shorthand\">简化形式 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#function-shorthand\">​<a><h2><p>对于自定义指令来说，一个很常见的情况是仅仅需要在 <code>mounted<code> 和 <code>updated<code> 上实现相同的行为，除此之外并不需要其他钩子。这种情况下我们可以直接用一个函数来定义指令，", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/reusability/custom-directives.html", "title": "自定义指令", "doc_id": "da7fa3d981f5483f89e8b982e548d350", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 650, "chunk_index": 31, "_doc_id": "31_6092583910737958366"}}
{"doc_id": "32_1588792238883662359", "text": "个很常见的情况是仅仅需要在 <code>mounted<code> 和 <code>updated<code> 上实现相同的行为，除此之外并不需要其他钩子。这种情况下我们可以直接用一个函数来定义指令，如下所示：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>div<span><span> v-color<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>color<span><span>\"<span><span>></<span><span>div<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>app.<span><span>directive<span><span>(<span><span>'color'<span><span>,", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/reusability/custom-directives.html", "title": "自定义指令", "doc_id": "da7fa3d981f5483f89e8b982e548d350", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 650, "chunk_index": 32, "_doc_id": "32_1588792238883662359"}}
{"doc_id": "33_3162558646259435978", "text": "ode><span class=\"line\"><span>app.<span><span>directive<span><span>(<span><span>'color'<span><span>, (<span><span>el<span><span>, <span><span>binding<span><span>) <span><span>=><span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 这会在 `mounted` 和 `updated` 时都调用<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> el.style.color <span><span>=<span><span> binding.value<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/reusability/custom-directives.html", "title": "自定义指令", "doc_id": "da7fa3d981f5483f89e8b982e548d350", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 650, "chunk_index": 33, "_doc_id": "33_3162558646259435978"}}
{"doc_id": "34_1739609004948198872", "text": "<span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> el.style.color <span><span>=<span><span> binding.value<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>})<span><span><code><pre><div><h2 id=\"object-literals\">对象字面量 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#object-literals\">​<a><h2><p>如果你的指令需要多个值，你可以向它传递一个 JavaScript 对象字面量。别忘了，指令也可以接收任何合法的 JavaScript 表达式。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/reusability/custom-directives.html", "title": "自定义指令", "doc_id": "da7fa3d981f5483f89e8b982e548d350", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 650, "chunk_index": 34, "_doc_id": "34_1739609004948198872"}}
{"doc_id": "35_321160523916089893", "text": "#object-literals\">​<a><h2><p>如果你的指令需要多个值，你可以向它传递一个 JavaScript 对象字面量。别忘了，指令也可以接收任何合法的 JavaScript 表达式。<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>div<span><span> v-demo<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>{ color: <span><span>'white'<span><span>,", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/reusability/custom-directives.html", "title": "自定义指令", "doc_id": "da7fa3d981f5483f89e8b982e548d350", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 650, "chunk_index": 35, "_doc_id": "35_321160523916089893"}}
{"doc_id": "36_2040525059463013105", "text": "v<span><span> v-demo<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>{ color: <span><span>'white'<span><span>, text: <span><span>'hello!'<span><span> }<span><span>\"<span><span>></<span><span>div<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>app.<span><span>directive<span><span>(<span><span>'demo'<span><span>, (<span><span>el<span><span>,", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/reusability/custom-directives.html", "title": "自定义指令", "doc_id": "da7fa3d981f5483f89e8b982e548d350", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 650, "chunk_index": 36, "_doc_id": "36_2040525059463013105"}}
{"doc_id": "37_5807342873054669086", "text": ">app.<span><span>directive<span><span>(<span><span>'demo'<span><span>, (<span><span>el<span><span>, <span><span>binding<span><span>) <span><span>=><span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> console.<span><span>log<span><span>(binding.value.color) <span><span>// => \"white\"<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> console.<span><span>log<span><span>(binding.value.text) <span><span>// => \"hello!\"<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/reusability/custom-directives.html", "title": "自定义指令", "doc_id": "da7fa3d981f5483f89e8b982e548d350", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 650, "chunk_index": 37, "_doc_id": "37_5807342873054669086"}}
{"doc_id": "38_1455251841568813712", "text": "pan> console.<span><span>log<span><span>(binding.value.text) <span><span>// => \"hello!\"<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>})<span><span><code><pre><div><h2 id=\"usage-on-components\">在组件上使用 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#usage-on-components\">​<a><h2><div class=\"warning custom-block\"><p class=\"custom-block-title\">不推荐<p><p>不推荐在组件上使用自定义指令。当组件具有多个根节点时可能会出现预期外的行为。<p><div><p>当在组件上使用自定义指令时，它会始终应用于组件的根节点，和<a href=\"/guide/components/attrs.html\">透传 attributes<a> 类似。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/reusability/custom-directives.html", "title": "自定义指令", "doc_id": "da7fa3d981f5483f89e8b982e548d350", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 650, "chunk_index": 38, "_doc_id": "38_1455251841568813712"}}
{"doc_id": "39_7972617647991826527", "text": "。<p><div><p>当在组件上使用自定义指令时，它会始终应用于组件的根节点，和<a href=\"/guide/components/attrs.html\">透传 attributes<a> 类似。<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>MyComponent<span><span> v-demo<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>test<span><span>\"<span><span> /><span><span><code><pre><div><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><!-- MyComponent 的模板 --><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/reusability/custom-directives.html", "title": "自定义指令", "doc_id": "da7fa3d981f5483f89e8b982e548d350", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 650, "chunk_index": 39, "_doc_id": "39_7972617647991826527"}}
{"doc_id": "40_8257586658403397699", "text": "ass=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><!-- MyComponent 的模板 --><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>div<span><span>> <span><span><!-- v-demo 指令会被应用在此处 --><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>span<span><span>>My component content</<span><span>span<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/reusability/custom-directives.html", "title": "自定义指令", "doc_id": "da7fa3d981f5483f89e8b982e548d350", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 650, "chunk_index": 40, "_doc_id": "40_8257586658403397699"}}
{"doc_id": "41_1648436935771564615", "text": "span> <<span><span>span<span><span>>My component content</<span><span>span<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>div<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>需要注意的是组件可能含有多个根节点。当应用到一个多根组件时，指令将会被忽略且抛出一个警告。和 attribute 不同，指令不能通过 <code>v-bind=\"$attrs\"<code> 来传递给一个不同的元素。<p><div><div>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/reusability/custom-directives.html", "title": "自定义指令", "doc_id": "da7fa3d981f5483f89e8b982e548d350", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 650, "chunk_index": 41, "_doc_id": "41_1648436935771564615"}}
{"doc_id": "0_3239685570043369149", "text": "<div><div><h1 id=\"vue.js-privacy-policy\">Vue.js 隐私政策 <h1><blockquote><p>生效日期：2024 年 5 月 3 日<p><blockquote><p>本隐私政策描述了 Vue.js 组织 (以下简称“Vue”、“我们”或“我们的”) 在本网站 (<a href=\"https://vuejs.org\" target=\"_blank\">https://vuejs.org<a>) 及我们的开源相关网站 (以下统称“网站”)，以及在本网站上向您提供的任何内容、相关文档、信息和服务 (例如教程、支持开发者工作流的工具、资源访问等) (统称“服务”) 上处理您的信息的做法。本隐私政策阐述了我们如何处理个人信息来支持我们的服务。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/about/privacy.html", "title": "Vue.js 隐私政策", "doc_id": "664c502a75b84fdaa8a63914e4de5620", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 94, "chunk_index": 0, "_doc_id": "0_3239685570043369149"}}
{"doc_id": "1_1422288174851264185", "text": "以及在本网站上向您提供的任何内容、相关文档、信息和服务 (例如教程、支持开发者工作流的工具、资源访问等) (统称“服务”) 上处理您的信息的做法。本隐私政策阐述了我们如何处理个人信息来支持我们的服务。<p><p>为了明确起见，本隐私政策不适用于以下情况：<p><ol><li><p>在 GitHub (<a href=\"https://github.com/\" target=\"_blank\">https://github.com/<a>) 上使用的开源代码、文档或规范，这些都受适用的开源许可证条款的约束；<p><li><li><p>在 GitHub 上参与开源项目的 PR、Issue 以及任何其他交互或功能，这些都受 GitHub 的条款和条件的约束；<p><li><li><p>我们在 NPM (<a href=\"https://npmjs.com/\" target=\"_blank\">https://npmjs.com/<a>) 上发布的包的使用统计数据，这些数据受 NPM 的条款和条件的约束；<p><li><li><p>我们发布的浏览器/IDE 扩展的使用统计数据，这些数据由浏览器/IDE 供应商收集，并受供应商各自的条款和条件的约束。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/about/privacy.html", "title": "Vue.js 隐私政策", "doc_id": "664c502a75b84fdaa8a63914e4de5620", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 94, "chunk_index": 1, "_doc_id": "1_1422288174851264185"}}
{"doc_id": "2_3541848633533397073", "text": "使用统计数据，这些数据受 NPM 的条款和条件的约束；<p><li><li><p>我们发布的浏览器/IDE 扩展的使用统计数据，这些数据由浏览器/IDE 供应商收集，并受供应商各自的条款和条件的约束。<p><li><ol><h2 id=\"what-kinds-of-information-do-we-collect\">我们收集哪些信息？ <h2><p>我们<strong>不会<strong>通过我们的网站、发布的 npm 包或浏览器/IDE 扩展收集或存储任何类型的个人数据。<p><p>我们可能会通过集成在我们网站上的第三方服务收集匿名化数据：<p><ul><li><p><strong>访问者数据<strong>：我们的网站分析由 <a href=\"https://usefathom.com/\" target=\"_blank\">Fathom Analytics<a> 驱动，该服务不使用 cookies，并且遵守 GDPR、ePrivacy (包括 PECR)、COPPA 和 CCPA。使用这种隐私友好型的网站分析软件，您的 IP 地址仅被短暂处理，我们 (运营此网站的团队) 无法识别您的身份。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/about/privacy.html", "title": "Vue.js 隐私政策", "doc_id": "664c502a75b84fdaa8a63914e4de5620", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 94, "chunk_index": 2, "_doc_id": "2_3541848633533397073"}}
{"doc_id": "3_2538234009474853128", "text": "es，并且遵守 GDPR、ePrivacy (包括 PECR)、COPPA 和 CCPA。使用这种隐私友好型的网站分析软件，您的 IP 地址仅被短暂处理，我们 (运营此网站的团队) 无法识别您的身份。根据 CCPA，您的个人信息将被去标识化。您可以在 Fathom Analytics 的网站上了解更多相关信息。<p><li><li><p><strong>搜索功能的使用数据<strong>：我们的搜索功能由 <a href=\"https://docsearch.algolia.com/\" target=\"_blank\">Algolia DocSearch<a> 驱动，该服务不进行任何形式的用户追踪或指纹识别，也不使用 cookies。Algolia 的服务符合 GDPR、CCPA 标准，并获得 TRUSTe 认证。<p><li><ul><h2 id=\"how-do-we-use-information\">我们如何使用信息？ <h2><p>我们收集上述数据的唯一目的是以最符合隐私保护的方式了解我们网站的流量和使用情况，从而不断提升我们的网站和文档的质量。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/about/privacy.html", "title": "Vue.js 隐私政策", "doc_id": "664c502a75b84fdaa8a63914e4de5620", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 94, "chunk_index": 3, "_doc_id": "3_2538234009474853128"}}
{"doc_id": "4_944651953602848220", "text": "w-do-we-use-information\">我们如何使用信息？ <h2><p>我们收集上述数据的唯一目的是以最符合隐私保护的方式了解我们网站的流量和使用情况，从而不断提升我们的网站和文档的质量。根据 GDPR 法律依据的“第 6 条第 1 款 (f) 项；我们持续改进网站和业务的合法利益。”，我们不会长期存储任何个人数据。<p><h2 id=\"data-retention\">数据保留 <h2><p>我们收集的所有数据都存储在上述第三方服务中，并受到各自服务的数据保留政策的约束。<p><h2 id=\"questions\">咨询 <h2><p>如果您对本隐私政策或我们的做法有任何疑问，请通过电子邮件 <a href=\"mailto:hello@vuejs.org\" target=\"_blank\">hello@vuejs.org<a> 与我们联系。<p><div><div>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/about/privacy.html", "title": "Vue.js 隐私政策", "doc_id": "664c502a75b84fdaa8a63914e4de5620", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 94, "chunk_index": 4, "_doc_id": "4_944651953602848220"}}
{"doc_id": "0_3239685570043369149", "text": "<div><div><h1 id=\"vue.js-privacy-policy\">Vue.js 隐私政策 <h1><blockquote><p>生效日期：2024 年 5 月 3 日<p><blockquote><p>本隐私政策描述了 Vue.js 组织 (以下简称“Vue”、“我们”或“我们的”) 在本网站 (<a href=\"https://vuejs.org\" target=\"_blank\">https://vuejs.org<a>) 及我们的开源相关网站 (以下统称“网站”)，以及在本网站上向您提供的任何内容、相关文档、信息和服务 (例如教程、支持开发者工作流的工具、资源访问等) (统称“服务”) 上处理您的信息的做法。本隐私政策阐述了我们如何处理个人信息来支持我们的服务。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/about/privacy.html", "title": "Vue.js 隐私政策", "doc_id": "e1a3afc1901f46f193a8656ce40bbeca", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 94, "chunk_index": 0, "_doc_id": "0_3239685570043369149"}}
{"doc_id": "1_1422288174851264185", "text": "以及在本网站上向您提供的任何内容、相关文档、信息和服务 (例如教程、支持开发者工作流的工具、资源访问等) (统称“服务”) 上处理您的信息的做法。本隐私政策阐述了我们如何处理个人信息来支持我们的服务。<p><p>为了明确起见，本隐私政策不适用于以下情况：<p><ol><li><p>在 GitHub (<a href=\"https://github.com/\" target=\"_blank\">https://github.com/<a>) 上使用的开源代码、文档或规范，这些都受适用的开源许可证条款的约束；<p><li><li><p>在 GitHub 上参与开源项目的 PR、Issue 以及任何其他交互或功能，这些都受 GitHub 的条款和条件的约束；<p><li><li><p>我们在 NPM (<a href=\"https://npmjs.com/\" target=\"_blank\">https://npmjs.com/<a>) 上发布的包的使用统计数据，这些数据受 NPM 的条款和条件的约束；<p><li><li><p>我们发布的浏览器/IDE 扩展的使用统计数据，这些数据由浏览器/IDE 供应商收集，并受供应商各自的条款和条件的约束。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/about/privacy.html", "title": "Vue.js 隐私政策", "doc_id": "e1a3afc1901f46f193a8656ce40bbeca", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 94, "chunk_index": 1, "_doc_id": "1_1422288174851264185"}}
{"doc_id": "2_3541848633533397073", "text": "使用统计数据，这些数据受 NPM 的条款和条件的约束；<p><li><li><p>我们发布的浏览器/IDE 扩展的使用统计数据，这些数据由浏览器/IDE 供应商收集，并受供应商各自的条款和条件的约束。<p><li><ol><h2 id=\"what-kinds-of-information-do-we-collect\">我们收集哪些信息？ <h2><p>我们<strong>不会<strong>通过我们的网站、发布的 npm 包或浏览器/IDE 扩展收集或存储任何类型的个人数据。<p><p>我们可能会通过集成在我们网站上的第三方服务收集匿名化数据：<p><ul><li><p><strong>访问者数据<strong>：我们的网站分析由 <a href=\"https://usefathom.com/\" target=\"_blank\">Fathom Analytics<a> 驱动，该服务不使用 cookies，并且遵守 GDPR、ePrivacy (包括 PECR)、COPPA 和 CCPA。使用这种隐私友好型的网站分析软件，您的 IP 地址仅被短暂处理，我们 (运营此网站的团队) 无法识别您的身份。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/about/privacy.html", "title": "Vue.js 隐私政策", "doc_id": "e1a3afc1901f46f193a8656ce40bbeca", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 94, "chunk_index": 2, "_doc_id": "2_3541848633533397073"}}
{"doc_id": "3_2538234009474853128", "text": "es，并且遵守 GDPR、ePrivacy (包括 PECR)、COPPA 和 CCPA。使用这种隐私友好型的网站分析软件，您的 IP 地址仅被短暂处理，我们 (运营此网站的团队) 无法识别您的身份。根据 CCPA，您的个人信息将被去标识化。您可以在 Fathom Analytics 的网站上了解更多相关信息。<p><li><li><p><strong>搜索功能的使用数据<strong>：我们的搜索功能由 <a href=\"https://docsearch.algolia.com/\" target=\"_blank\">Algolia DocSearch<a> 驱动，该服务不进行任何形式的用户追踪或指纹识别，也不使用 cookies。Algolia 的服务符合 GDPR、CCPA 标准，并获得 TRUSTe 认证。<p><li><ul><h2 id=\"how-do-we-use-information\">我们如何使用信息？ <h2><p>我们收集上述数据的唯一目的是以最符合隐私保护的方式了解我们网站的流量和使用情况，从而不断提升我们的网站和文档的质量。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/about/privacy.html", "title": "Vue.js 隐私政策", "doc_id": "e1a3afc1901f46f193a8656ce40bbeca", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 94, "chunk_index": 3, "_doc_id": "3_2538234009474853128"}}
{"doc_id": "4_944651953602848220", "text": "w-do-we-use-information\">我们如何使用信息？ <h2><p>我们收集上述数据的唯一目的是以最符合隐私保护的方式了解我们网站的流量和使用情况，从而不断提升我们的网站和文档的质量。根据 GDPR 法律依据的“第 6 条第 1 款 (f) 项；我们持续改进网站和业务的合法利益。”，我们不会长期存储任何个人数据。<p><h2 id=\"data-retention\">数据保留 <h2><p>我们收集的所有数据都存储在上述第三方服务中，并受到各自服务的数据保留政策的约束。<p><h2 id=\"questions\">咨询 <h2><p>如果您对本隐私政策或我们的做法有任何疑问，请通过电子邮件 <a href=\"mailto:hello@vuejs.org\" target=\"_blank\">hello@vuejs.org<a> 与我们联系。<p><div><div>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/about/privacy.html", "title": "Vue.js 隐私政策", "doc_id": "e1a3afc1901f46f193a8656ce40bbeca", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 94, "chunk_index": 4, "_doc_id": "4_944651953602848220"}}
{"doc_id": "0_7867820844582027062", "text": "<div><div><h1 id=\"event-handling\">事件处理 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#event-handling\">​<a><h1><h2 id=\"listening-to-events\">监听事件 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#listening-to-events\">​<a><h2><p>我们可以使用 <code>v-on<code> 指令 (简写为 <code>@<code>) 来监听 DOM 事件，并在事件触发时执行对应的 JavaScript。用法：<code>v-on:click=\"handler\"<code> 或 <code>@click=\"handler\"<code>。<p><p>事件处理器 (handler) 的值可以是：<p><ol><li><p><strong>内联事件处理器<strong>：事件被触发时执行的内联 JavaScript 语句 (与 <code>onclick<code> 类似)。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/event-handling.html", "title": "事件处理", "doc_id": "627b3617f28e4be688cb1e8d829c9d74", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 709, "chunk_index": 0, "_doc_id": "0_7867820844582027062"}}
{"doc_id": "1_3538307593229178680", "text": "r) 的值可以是：<p><ol><li><p><strong>内联事件处理器<strong>：事件被触发时执行的内联 JavaScript 语句 (与 <code>onclick<code> 类似)。<p><li><li><p><strong>方法事件处理器<strong>：一个指向组件上定义的方法的属性名或是路径。<p><li><ol><h2 id=\"inline-handlers\">内联事件处理器 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#inline-handlers\">​<a><h2><p>内联事件处理器通常用于简单场景，例如：<p><div class=\"options-api\"><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>data<span><span>() {<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/event-handling.html", "title": "事件处理", "doc_id": "627b3617f28e4be688cb1e8d829c9d74", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 709, "chunk_index": 1, "_doc_id": "1_3538307593229178680"}}
{"doc_id": "2_515156128503650922", "text": "e class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>data<span><span>() {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> return<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> count: <span><span>0<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/event-handling.html", "title": "事件处理", "doc_id": "627b3617f28e4be688cb1e8d829c9d74", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 709, "chunk_index": 2, "_doc_id": "2_515156128503650922"}}
{"doc_id": "3_8213401573255986401", "text": "<span class=\"line\"><span> count: <span><span>0<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span><code><pre><div><div><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>button<span><span> @<span><span>click<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>count<span><span>++<span><span>\"<span><span>>Add 1</<span><span>button<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/event-handling.html", "title": "事件处理", "doc_id": "627b3617f28e4be688cb1e8d829c9d74", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 709, "chunk_index": 3, "_doc_id": "3_8213401573255986401"}}
{"doc_id": "4_3745315831035925963", "text": "pan>count<span><span>++<span><span>\"<span><span>>Add 1</<span><span>button<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>p<span><span>>Count is: {{ count }}</<span><span>p<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><h2 id=\"method-handlers\">方法事件处理器 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#method-handlers\">​<a><h2><p>随着事件处理器的逻辑变得愈发复杂，内联代码方式变得不够灵活。因此 <code>v-on<code> 也可以接受一个方法名或对某个方法的调用。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/event-handling.html", "title": "事件处理", "doc_id": "627b3617f28e4be688cb1e8d829c9d74", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 709, "chunk_index": 4, "_doc_id": "4_3745315831035925963"}}
{"doc_id": "5_6696401361945149438", "text": "\"#method-handlers\">​<a><h2><p>随着事件处理器的逻辑变得愈发复杂，内联代码方式变得不够灵活。因此 <code>v-on<code> 也可以接受一个方法名或对某个方法的调用。<p><p>举例来说：<p><div class=\"composition-api\"><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> name<span><span> =<span><span> ref<span><span>(<span><span>'Vue.js'<span><span>)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>function<span><span> greet<span><span>(<span><span>event<span><span>) {<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/event-handling.html", "title": "事件处理", "doc_id": "627b3617f28e4be688cb1e8d829c9d74", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 709, "chunk_index": 5, "_doc_id": "5_6696401361945149438"}}
{"doc_id": "6_5644892483110067258", "text": "ss=\"line\"><span>function<span><span> greet<span><span>(<span><span>event<span><span>) {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> alert<span><span>(<span><span>`Hello ${<span><span>name<span><span>.<span><span>value<span><span>}!`<span><span>)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // `event` 是 DOM 原生事件<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> if<span><span> (event) {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> alert<span><span>(event.target.tagName)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/event-handling.html", "title": "事件处理", "doc_id": "627b3617f28e4be688cb1e8d829c9d74", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 709, "chunk_index": 6, "_doc_id": "6_5644892483110067258"}}
{"doc_id": "7_4318329511687281929", "text": "><span> alert<span><span>(event.target.tagName)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span><code><pre><div><div><div class=\"options-api\"><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>data<span><span>() {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> return<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> name: <span><span>'Vue.js'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/event-handling.html", "title": "事件处理", "doc_id": "627b3617f28e4be688cb1e8d829c9d74", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 709, "chunk_index": 7, "_doc_id": "7_4318329511687281929"}}
{"doc_id": "8_4988595710212045272", "text": "class=\"line\"><span> name: <span><span>'Vue.js'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>},<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>methods<span><span>: {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> greet<span><span>(event) {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 方法中的 `this` 指向当前活跃的组件实例<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> alert<span><span>(<span><span>`Hello ${<span><span>this<span><span>.<span><span>name<span><span>}!`<span><span>)<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/event-handling.html", "title": "事件处理", "doc_id": "627b3617f28e4be688cb1e8d829c9d74", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 709, "chunk_index": 8, "_doc_id": "8_4988595710212045272"}}
{"doc_id": "9_315523787392942931", "text": "span>`Hello ${<span><span>this<span><span>.<span><span>name<span><span>}!`<span><span>)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // `event` 是 DOM 原生事件<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> if<span><span> (event) {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> alert<span><span>(event.target.tagName)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/event-handling.html", "title": "事件处理", "doc_id": "627b3617f28e4be688cb1e8d829c9d74", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 709, "chunk_index": 9, "_doc_id": "9_315523787392942931"}}
{"doc_id": "10_1403993998336451253", "text": "agName)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span><code><pre><div><div><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><!-- `greet` 是上面定义过的方法名 --><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/event-handling.html", "title": "事件处理", "doc_id": "627b3617f28e4be688cb1e8d829c9d74", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 709, "chunk_index": 10, "_doc_id": "10_1403993998336451253"}}
{"doc_id": "11_7322567489751065732", "text": "=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><!-- `greet` 是上面定义过的方法名 --><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>button<span><span> @<span><span>click<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>greet<span><span>\"<span><span>>Greet</<span><span>button<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>方法事件处理器会自动接收原生 DOM 事件并触发执行。在上面的例子中，我们能够通过被触发事件的 <code>event.target<code> 访问到该 DOM 元素。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/event-handling.html", "title": "事件处理", "doc_id": "627b3617f28e4be688cb1e8d829c9d74", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 709, "chunk_index": 11, "_doc_id": "11_7322567489751065732"}}
{"doc_id": "12_7221011271418396194", "text": "e><pre><div><p>方法事件处理器会自动接收原生 DOM 事件并触发执行。在上面的例子中，我们能够通过被触发事件的 <code>event.target<code> 访问到该 DOM 元素。<p><h3 id=\"method-vs-inline-detection\">方法与内联事件判断 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#method-vs-inline-detection\">​<a><h3><p>模板编译器会通过检查 <code>v-on<code> 的值是否是合法的 JavaScript 标识符或属性访问路径来断定是何种形式的事件处理器。举例来说，<code>foo<code>、<code>foo.bar<code> 和 <code>foo['bar']<code> 会被视为方法事件处理器，而 <code>foo()<code> 和 <code>count++<code> 会被视为内联事件处理器。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/event-handling.html", "title": "事件处理", "doc_id": "627b3617f28e4be688cb1e8d829c9d74", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 709, "chunk_index": 12, "_doc_id": "12_7221011271418396194"}}
{"doc_id": "13_5030482254736199170", "text": "ar<code> 和 <code>foo['bar']<code> 会被视为方法事件处理器，而 <code>foo()<code> 和 <code>count++<code> 会被视为内联事件处理器。<p><h2 id=\"calling-methods-in-inline-handlers\">在内联处理器中调用方法 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#calling-methods-in-inline-handlers\">​<a><h2><p>除了直接绑定方法名，你还可以在内联事件处理器中调用方法。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/event-handling.html", "title": "事件处理", "doc_id": "627b3617f28e4be688cb1e8d829c9d74", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 709, "chunk_index": 13, "_doc_id": "13_5030482254736199170"}}
{"doc_id": "14_240350735568294957", "text": "s=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#calling-methods-in-inline-handlers\">​<a><h2><p>除了直接绑定方法名，你还可以在内联事件处理器中调用方法。这允许我们向方法传入自定义参数以代替原生事件：<p><div class=\"composition-api\"><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>function<span><span> say<span><span>(<span><span>message<span><span>) {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> alert<span><span>(message)<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/event-handling.html", "title": "事件处理", "doc_id": "627b3617f28e4be688cb1e8d829c9d74", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 709, "chunk_index": 14, "_doc_id": "14_240350735568294957"}}
{"doc_id": "15_4411765744362741341", "text": "message<span><span>) {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> alert<span><span>(message)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span><code><pre><div><div><div class=\"options-api\"><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>methods<span><span>: {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> say<span><span>(message) {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> alert<span><span>(message)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/event-handling.html", "title": "事件处理", "doc_id": "627b3617f28e4be688cb1e8d829c9d74", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 709, "chunk_index": 15, "_doc_id": "15_4411765744362741341"}}
{"doc_id": "16_3865815886795287119", "text": "class=\"line\"><span> alert<span><span>(message)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span><code><pre><div><div><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>button<span><span> @<span><span>click<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>say<span><span>(<span><span>'hello'<span><span>)<span><span>\"<span><span>>Say hello</<span><span>button<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/event-handling.html", "title": "事件处理", "doc_id": "627b3617f28e4be688cb1e8d829c9d74", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 709, "chunk_index": 16, "_doc_id": "16_3865815886795287119"}}
{"doc_id": "17_8859170774942416539", "text": "hello'<span><span>)<span><span>\"<span><span>>Say hello</<span><span>button<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>button<span><span> @<span><span>click<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>say<span><span>(<span><span>'bye'<span><span>)<span><span>\"<span><span>>Say bye</<span><span>button<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><h2 id=\"accessing-event-argument-in-inline-handlers\">在内联事件处理器中访问事件参数 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#accessing-event-argument-in-inline-handlers\">​<a><h2><p>有时我们需要在内联事件处理器中访问原生 DOM 事件。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/event-handling.html", "title": "事件处理", "doc_id": "627b3617f28e4be688cb1e8d829c9d74", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 709, "chunk_index": 17, "_doc_id": "17_8859170774942416539"}}
{"doc_id": "18_1304757944695248030", "text": "r-anchor\" href=\"#accessing-event-argument-in-inline-handlers\">​<a><h2><p>有时我们需要在内联事件处理器中访问原生 DOM 事件。你可以向该处理器方法传入一个特殊的 <code>$event<code> 变量，或者使用内联箭头函数：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><!-- 使用特殊的 $event 变量 --><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/event-handling.html", "title": "事件处理", "doc_id": "627b3617f28e4be688cb1e8d829c9d74", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 709, "chunk_index": 18, "_doc_id": "18_1304757944695248030"}}
{"doc_id": "19_4767391062064817621", "text": "ass=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><!-- 使用特殊的 $event 变量 --><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>button<span><span> @<span><span>click<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>warn<span><span>(<span><span>'Form cannot be submitted yet.'<span><span>, $event)<span><span>\"<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> Submit<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>button<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/event-handling.html", "title": "事件处理", "doc_id": "627b3617f28e4be688cb1e8d829c9d74", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 709, "chunk_index": 19, "_doc_id": "19_4767391062064817621"}}
{"doc_id": "20_2646100391258416984", "text": "n>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>button<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><!-- 使用内联箭头函数 --><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>button<span><span> @<span><span>click<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>(<span><span>event<span><span>) <span><span>=><span><span> warn<span><span>(<span><span>'Form cannot be submitted yet.'<span><span>, event)<span><span>\"<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> Submit<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/event-handling.html", "title": "事件处理", "doc_id": "627b3617f28e4be688cb1e8d829c9d74", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 709, "chunk_index": 20, "_doc_id": "20_2646100391258416984"}}
{"doc_id": "21_6752718060993507791", "text": "n><span>, event)<span><span>\"<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> Submit<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>button<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><div class=\"composition-api\"><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>function<span><span> warn<span><span>(<span><span>message<span><span>, <span><span>event<span><span>) {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 这里可以访问原生事件<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/event-handling.html", "title": "事件处理", "doc_id": "627b3617f28e4be688cb1e8d829c9d74", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 709, "chunk_index": 21, "_doc_id": "21_6752718060993507791"}}
{"doc_id": "22_7320111849001625302", "text": ">, <span><span>event<span><span>) {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 这里可以访问原生事件<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> if<span><span> (event) {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> event.<span><span>preventDefault<span><span>()<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> alert<span><span>(message)<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/event-handling.html", "title": "事件处理", "doc_id": "627b3617f28e4be688cb1e8d829c9d74", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 709, "chunk_index": 22, "_doc_id": "22_7320111849001625302"}}
{"doc_id": "23_3186352740300757839", "text": "class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> alert<span><span>(message)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span><code><pre><div><div><div class=\"options-api\"><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>methods<span><span>: {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> warn<span><span>(message, event) {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 这里可以访问 DOM 原生事件<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/event-handling.html", "title": "事件处理", "doc_id": "627b3617f28e4be688cb1e8d829c9d74", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 709, "chunk_index": 23, "_doc_id": "23_3186352740300757839"}}
{"doc_id": "24_472462205026902894", "text": "<span><span>(message, event) {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 这里可以访问 DOM 原生事件<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> if<span><span> (event) {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> event.<span><span>preventDefault<span><span>()<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> alert<span><span>(message)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/event-handling.html", "title": "事件处理", "doc_id": "627b3617f28e4be688cb1e8d829c9d74", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 709, "chunk_index": 24, "_doc_id": "24_472462205026902894"}}
{"doc_id": "25_9194884614426350211", "text": "class=\"line\"><span> alert<span><span>(message)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span><code><pre><div><div><h2 id=\"event-modifiers\">事件修饰符 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#event-modifiers\">​<a><h2><p>在处理事件时调用 <code>event.preventDefault()<code> 或 <code>event.stopPropagation()<code> 是很常见的。尽管我们可以直接在方法内调用，但如果方法能更专注于数据逻辑而不用去处理 DOM 事件的细节会更好。<p><p>为解决这一问题，Vue 为 <code>v-on<code> 提供了<strong>事件修饰符<strong>。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/event-handling.html", "title": "事件处理", "doc_id": "627b3617f28e4be688cb1e8d829c9d74", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 709, "chunk_index": 25, "_doc_id": "25_9194884614426350211"}}
{"doc_id": "26_1240739010459110935", "text": "内调用，但如果方法能更专注于数据逻辑而不用去处理 DOM 事件的细节会更好。<p><p>为解决这一问题，Vue 为 <code>v-on<code> 提供了<strong>事件修饰符<strong>。修饰符是用 <code>.<code> 表示的指令后缀，包含以下这些：<p><ul><li><code>.stop<code><li><li><code>.prevent<code><li><li><code>.self<code><li><li><code>.capture<code><li><li><code>.once<code><li><li><code>.passive<code><li><ul><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><!-- 单击事件将停止传递 --><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/event-handling.html", "title": "事件处理", "doc_id": "627b3617f28e4be688cb1e8d829c9d74", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 709, "chunk_index": 26, "_doc_id": "26_1240739010459110935"}}
{"doc_id": "27_1881092480506048004", "text": "pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><!-- 单击事件将停止传递 --><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>a<span><span> @<span><span>click<span><span>.<span><span>stop<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>doThis<span><span>\"<span><span>></<span><span>a<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><!-- 提交事件将不再重新加载页面 --><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/event-handling.html", "title": "事件处理", "doc_id": "627b3617f28e4be688cb1e8d829c9d74", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 709, "chunk_index": 27, "_doc_id": "27_1881092480506048004"}}
{"doc_id": "28_3829733701692045538", "text": "><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><!-- 提交事件将不再重新加载页面 --><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>form<span><span> @<span><span>submit<span><span>.<span><span>prevent<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>onSubmit<span><span>\"<span><span>></<span><span>form<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><!-- 修饰语可以使用链式书写 --><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/event-handling.html", "title": "事件处理", "doc_id": "627b3617f28e4be688cb1e8d829c9d74", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 709, "chunk_index": 28, "_doc_id": "28_3829733701692045538"}}
{"doc_id": "29_6030509326980040510", "text": "n>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><!-- 修饰语可以使用链式书写 --><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>a<span><span> @<span><span>click<span><span>.stop.<span><span>prevent<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>doThat<span><span>\"<span><span>></<span><span>a<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><!-- 也可以只有修饰符 --><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/event-handling.html", "title": "事件处理", "doc_id": "627b3617f28e4be688cb1e8d829c9d74", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 709, "chunk_index": 29, "_doc_id": "29_6030509326980040510"}}
{"doc_id": "30_160404779727621920", "text": "span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><!-- 也可以只有修饰符 --><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>form<span><span> @<span><span>submit<span><span>.<span><span>prevent<span><span>></<span><span>form<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><!-- 仅当 event.target 是元素本身时才会触发事件处理器 --><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><!-- 例如：事件处理器不来自子元素 --><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/event-handling.html", "title": "事件处理", "doc_id": "627b3617f28e4be688cb1e8d829c9d74", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 709, "chunk_index": 30, "_doc_id": "30_160404779727621920"}}
{"doc_id": "31_285239318976812231", "text": "target 是元素本身时才会触发事件处理器 --><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><!-- 例如：事件处理器不来自子元素 --><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>div<span><span> @<span><span>click<span><span>.<span><span>self<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>doThat<span><span>\"<span><span>>...</<span><span>div<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><div class=\"tip custom-block\"><p class=\"custom-block-title\">TIP<p><p>使用修饰符时需要注意调用顺序，因为相关代码是以相同的顺序生成的。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/event-handling.html", "title": "事件处理", "doc_id": "627b3617f28e4be688cb1e8d829c9d74", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 709, "chunk_index": 31, "_doc_id": "31_285239318976812231"}}
{"doc_id": "32_4571101272818338624", "text": "div class=\"tip custom-block\"><p class=\"custom-block-title\">TIP<p><p>使用修饰符时需要注意调用顺序，因为相关代码是以相同的顺序生成的。因此使用 <code>@click.prevent.self<code> 会阻止<strong>元素及其子元素的所有点击事件的默认行为<strong>，而 <code>@click.self.prevent<code> 则只会阻止对元素本身的点击事件的默认行为。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/event-handling.html", "title": "事件处理", "doc_id": "627b3617f28e4be688cb1e8d829c9d74", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 709, "chunk_index": 32, "_doc_id": "32_4571101272818338624"}}
{"doc_id": "33_5686436558263837344", "text": "code> 会阻止<strong>元素及其子元素的所有点击事件的默认行为<strong>，而 <code>@click.self.prevent<code> 则只会阻止对元素本身的点击事件的默认行为。<p><div><p><code>.capture<code>、<code>.once<code> 和 <code>.passive<code> 修饰符与<a href=\"https://developer.mozilla.org/zh-CN/docs/Web/API/EventTarget/addEventListener#options\" target=\"_blank\">原生 <code>addEventListener<code> 事件<a>相对应：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><!-- 添加事件监听器时，使用 `capture` 捕获模式 --><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/event-handling.html", "title": "事件处理", "doc_id": "627b3617f28e4be688cb1e8d829c9d74", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 709, "chunk_index": 33, "_doc_id": "33_5686436558263837344"}}
{"doc_id": "34_1660497690933803880", "text": "github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><!-- 添加事件监听器时，使用 `capture` 捕获模式 --><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><!-- 例如：指向内部元素的事件，在被内部元素处理前，先被外部处理 --><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>div<span><span> @<span><span>click<span><span>.<span><span>capture<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>doThis<span><span>\"<span><span>>...</<span><span>div<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><!-- 点击事件最多被触发一次 --><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/event-handling.html", "title": "事件处理", "doc_id": "627b3617f28e4be688cb1e8d829c9d74", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 709, "chunk_index": 34, "_doc_id": "34_1660497690933803880"}}
{"doc_id": "35_3178564984038924181", "text": "n>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><!-- 点击事件最多被触发一次 --><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>a<span><span> @<span><span>click<span><span>.<span><span>once<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>doThis<span><span>\"<span><span>></<span><span>a<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><!-- 滚动事件的默认行为 (scrolling) 将立即发生而非等待 `onScroll` 完成 --><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><!-- 以防其中包含 `event.preventDefault()` --><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/event-handling.html", "title": "事件处理", "doc_id": "627b3617f28e4be688cb1e8d829c9d74", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 709, "chunk_index": 35, "_doc_id": "35_3178564984038924181"}}
{"doc_id": "36_7365080218564425648", "text": "l` 完成 --><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><!-- 以防其中包含 `event.preventDefault()` --><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>div<span><span> @<span><span>scroll<span><span>.<span><span>passive<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>onScroll<span><span>\"<span><span>>...</<span><span>div<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p><code>.passive<code> 修饰符一般用于触摸事件的监听器，可以用来<a href=\"https://developer.mozilla.org/zh-CN/docs/Web/API/EventTarget/addEventListener#%E4%BD%BF%E7%94%A8_passive_%E6%94%B9%E5%96%84%E6%BB%9A%E5%B1%8F%E6%80%A7%E8%83%BD\" target=\"_blank\">改善移动端设备的滚屏性能<a>。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/event-handling.html", "title": "事件处理", "doc_id": "627b3617f28e4be688cb1e8d829c9d74", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 709, "chunk_index": 36, "_doc_id": "36_7365080218564425648"}}
{"doc_id": "37_5637395649592482075", "text": "%A8_passive_%E6%94%B9%E5%96%84%E6%BB%9A%E5%B1%8F%E6%80%A7%E8%83%BD\" target=\"_blank\">改善移动端设备的滚屏性能<a>。<p><div class=\"tip custom-block\"><p class=\"custom-block-title\">TIP<p><p>请勿同时使用 <code>.passive<code> 和 <code>.prevent<code>，因为 <code>.passive<code> 已经向浏览器表明了你<em>不想<em>阻止事件的默认行为。如果你这么做了，则 <code>.prevent<code> 会被忽略，并且浏览器会抛出警告。<p><div><h2 id=\"key-modifiers\">按键修饰符 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#key-modifiers\">​<a><h2><p>在监听键盘事件时，我们经常需要检查特定的按键。Vue 允许在 <code>v-on<code> 或 <code>@<code> 监听按键事件时添加按键修饰符。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/event-handling.html", "title": "事件处理", "doc_id": "627b3617f28e4be688cb1e8d829c9d74", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 709, "chunk_index": 37, "_doc_id": "37_5637395649592482075"}}
{"doc_id": "38_920823208074977121", "text": "odifiers\">​<a><h2><p>在监听键盘事件时，我们经常需要检查特定的按键。Vue 允许在 <code>v-on<code> 或 <code>@<code> 监听按键事件时添加按键修饰符。<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><!-- 仅在 `key` 为 `Enter` 时调用 `submit` --><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/event-handling.html", "title": "事件处理", "doc_id": "627b3617f28e4be688cb1e8d829c9d74", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 709, "chunk_index": 38, "_doc_id": "38_920823208074977121"}}
{"doc_id": "39_4442884869104294114", "text": "b-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><!-- 仅在 `key` 为 `Enter` 时调用 `submit` --><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>input<span><span> @<span><span>keyup<span><span>.<span><span>enter<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>submit<span><span>\"<span><span> /><span><span><code><pre><div><p>你可以直接使用 <a href=\"https://developer.mozilla.org/zh-CN/docs/Web/API/UI_Events/Keyboard_event_key_values\" target=\"_blank\"><code>KeyboardEvent.key<code><a> 暴露的按键名称作为修饰符，但需要转为 kebab-case 形式。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/event-handling.html", "title": "事件处理", "doc_id": "627b3617f28e4be688cb1e8d829c9d74", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 709, "chunk_index": 39, "_doc_id": "39_4442884869104294114"}}
{"doc_id": "40_4446118655593958746", "text": "event_key_values\" target=\"_blank\"><code>KeyboardEvent.key<code><a> 暴露的按键名称作为修饰符，但需要转为 kebab-case 形式。<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>input<span><span> @<span><span>keyup<span><span>.<span><span>page-down<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>onPageDown<span><span>\"<span><span> /><span><span><code><pre><div><p>在上面的例子中，仅会在 <code>$event.key<code> 为 <code>'PageDown'<code> 时调用事件处理。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/event-handling.html", "title": "事件处理", "doc_id": "627b3617f28e4be688cb1e8d829c9d74", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 709, "chunk_index": 40, "_doc_id": "40_4446118655593958746"}}
{"doc_id": "41_1503041275021494040", "text": "><span><span><code><pre><div><p>在上面的例子中，仅会在 <code>$event.key<code> 为 <code>'PageDown'<code> 时调用事件处理。<p><h3 id=\"key-aliases\">按键别名 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#key-aliases\">​<a><h3><p>Vue 为一些常用的按键提供了别名：<p><ul><li><code>.enter<code><li><li><code>.tab<code><li><li><code>.delete<code> (捕获“Delete”和“Backspace”两个按键)<li><li><code>.esc<code><li><li><code>.space<code><li><li><code>.up<code><li><li><code>.down<code><li><li><code>.left<code><li><li><code>.right<code><li><ul><h3 id=\"system-modifier-keys\">系统按键修饰符 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#system-modifier-keys\">​<a><h3><p>你可以使用以下系统按键修饰符来触发鼠标或键盘事件监听器，", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/event-handling.html", "title": "事件处理", "doc_id": "627b3617f28e4be688cb1e8d829c9d74", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 709, "chunk_index": 41, "_doc_id": "41_1503041275021494040"}}
{"doc_id": "42_1969555153751387113", "text": "统按键修饰符 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#system-modifier-keys\">​<a><h3><p>你可以使用以下系统按键修饰符来触发鼠标或键盘事件监听器，只有当按键被按下时才会触发。<p><div class=\"tip custom-block\"><p class=\"custom-block-title\">注意<p><p>在 Mac 键盘上，meta 是 Command 键 (⌘)。在 Windows 键盘上，meta 键是 Windows 键 (⊞)。在 Sun 微机系统键盘上，meta 是钻石键 (◆)。在某些键盘上，特别是 MIT 和 Lisp 机器的键盘及其后代版本的键盘，如 Knight 键盘，space-cadet 键盘，meta 都被标记为“META”。在 Symbolics 键盘上，meta 也被标识为“META”或“Meta”。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/event-handling.html", "title": "事件处理", "doc_id": "627b3617f28e4be688cb1e8d829c9d74", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 709, "chunk_index": 42, "_doc_id": "42_1969555153751387113"}}
{"doc_id": "43_8603571635273530133", "text": "机器的键盘及其后代版本的键盘，如 Knight 键盘，space-cadet 键盘，meta 都被标记为“META”。在 Symbolics 键盘上，meta 也被标识为“META”或“Meta”。<p><div><p>举例来说：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><!-- Alt + Enter --><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>input<span><span> @<span><span>keyup<span><span>.alt.<span><span>enter<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>clear<span><span>\"<span><span> /><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/event-handling.html", "title": "事件处理", "doc_id": "627b3617f28e4be688cb1e8d829c9d74", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 709, "chunk_index": 43, "_doc_id": "43_8603571635273530133"}}
{"doc_id": "44_3778153900786321776", "text": "n>=<span><span>\"<span><span>clear<span><span>\"<span><span> /><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><!-- Ctrl + 点击 --><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>div<span><span> @<span><span>click<span><span>.<span><span>ctrl<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>doSomething<span><span>\"<span><span>>Do something</<span><span>div<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><div class=\"tip custom-block\"><p class=\"custom-block-title\">TIP<p><p>请注意，系统按键修饰符和常规按键不同。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/event-handling.html", "title": "事件处理", "doc_id": "627b3617f28e4be688cb1e8d829c9d74", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 709, "chunk_index": 44, "_doc_id": "44_3778153900786321776"}}
{"doc_id": "45_8740288117420565931", "text": "e><pre><div><div class=\"tip custom-block\"><p class=\"custom-block-title\">TIP<p><p>请注意，系统按键修饰符和常规按键不同。与 <code>keyup<code> 事件一起使用时，该按键必须在事件发出时处于按下状态。换句话说，<code>keyup.ctrl<code> 只会在你仍然按住 <code>ctrl<code> 但松开了另一个键时被触发。若你单独松开 <code>ctrl<code> 键将不会触发。<p><div><h3 id=\"exact-modifier\"><code>.exact<code> 修饰符 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#exact-modifier\">​<a><h3><p><code>.exact<code> 修饰符允许精确控制触发事件所需的系统修饰符的组合。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/event-handling.html", "title": "事件处理", "doc_id": "627b3617f28e4be688cb1e8d829c9d74", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 709, "chunk_index": 45, "_doc_id": "45_8740288117420565931"}}
{"doc_id": "46_6249912959882939153", "text": "class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#exact-modifier\">​<a><h3><p><code>.exact<code> 修饰符允许精确控制触发事件所需的系统修饰符的组合。<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><!-- 当按下 Ctrl 时，即使同时按下 Alt 或 Shift 也会触发 --><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/event-handling.html", "title": "事件处理", "doc_id": "627b3617f28e4be688cb1e8d829c9d74", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 709, "chunk_index": 46, "_doc_id": "46_6249912959882939153"}}
{"doc_id": "47_2770732500258364649", "text": "ark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><!-- 当按下 Ctrl 时，即使同时按下 Alt 或 Shift 也会触发 --><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>button<span><span> @<span><span>click<span><span>.<span><span>ctrl<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>onClick<span><span>\"<span><span>>A</<span><span>button<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><!-- 仅当按下 Ctrl 且未按任何其他键时才会触发 --><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/event-handling.html", "title": "事件处理", "doc_id": "627b3617f28e4be688cb1e8d829c9d74", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 709, "chunk_index": 47, "_doc_id": "47_2770732500258364649"}}
{"doc_id": "48_2490619117039505084", "text": "an>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><!-- 仅当按下 Ctrl 且未按任何其他键时才会触发 --><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>button<span><span> @<span><span>click<span><span>.ctrl.<span><span>exact<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>onCtrlClick<span><span>\"<span><span>>A</<span><span>button<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><!-- 仅当没有按下任何系统按键时触发 --><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/event-handling.html", "title": "事件处理", "doc_id": "627b3617f28e4be688cb1e8d829c9d74", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 709, "chunk_index": 48, "_doc_id": "48_2490619117039505084"}}
{"doc_id": "49_5929280453634442555", "text": "span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><!-- 仅当没有按下任何系统按键时触发 --><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>button<span><span> @<span><span>click<span><span>.<span><span>exact<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>onClick<span><span>\"<span><span>>A</<span><span>button<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><h2 id=\"mouse-button-modifiers\">鼠标按键修饰符 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#mouse-button-modifiers\">​<a><h2><p>这些修饰符将处理程序限定为由特定鼠标按键触发的事件。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/event-handling.html", "title": "事件处理", "doc_id": "627b3617f28e4be688cb1e8d829c9d74", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 709, "chunk_index": 49, "_doc_id": "49_5929280453634442555"}}
{"doc_id": "50_8785278575943738751", "text": "标按键修饰符 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#mouse-button-modifiers\">​<a><h2><p>这些修饰符将处理程序限定为由特定鼠标按键触发的事件。<p><p>但请注意，<code>.left<code>，<code>.right<code> 和 <code>.middle<code> 这些修饰符名称是基于常见的右手用鼠标布局设定的，但实际上它们分别指代设备事件触发器的“主”、“次”，“辅助”，而非实际的物理按键。因此，对于左手用鼠标布局而言，“主”按键在物理上可能是右边的按键，但却会触发 <code>.left<code> 修饰符对应的处理程序。又或者，触控板可能通过单指点击触发 <code>.left<code> 处理程序，通过双指点击触发 <code>.right<code> 处理程序，通过三指点击触发 <code>.middle<code> 处理程序。同样，产生“鼠标”事件的其他设备和事件源，也可能具有与“左”，“右”完全无关的触发模式。<p><div><div>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/event-handling.html", "title": "事件处理", "doc_id": "627b3617f28e4be688cb1e8d829c9d74", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 709, "chunk_index": 50, "_doc_id": "50_8785278575943738751"}}
{"doc_id": "0_3740280299223569500", "text": "<div><div><p>Vue.js 是采用 MIT 许可的开源项目，使用完全免费。<p><p>维护这样一个庞大的生态系统和为项目开发新功能所需的巨大努力，只有在我们的赞助者慷慨的财务支持下才得以持续。<p><h2 id=\"中国区赞助渠道\">中国区赞助渠道 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#%E4%B8%AD%E5%9B%BD%E5%8C%BA%E8%B5%9E%E5%8A%A9%E6%B8%A0%E9%81%93\">​<a><h2><p>来自国内的开发者或公司可以通过<a href=\"https://afdian.com/a/evanyou\" target=\"_blank\">爱发电<a>平台来支持 Vue.js 的开发。爱发电上的赞助等级和本页下面列出的赞助等级是一一对应的。<p><p>如果你对等级、支付流程或赞助商曝光数据有疑问，请联系 <a href=\"mailto:sponsor@vuejs.org?subject=Vue.js%20sponsorship%20inquiry\" target=\"_blank\">sponsor@vuejs.org<a>。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/sponsor/", "title": "成为 Vue.js 的赞助者", "doc_id": "c50f7e335e594d04aee9b753d30ff6da", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 189, "chunk_index": 0, "_doc_id": "0_3740280299223569500"}}
{"doc_id": "1_309725792657487359", "text": "ilto:sponsor@vuejs.org?subject=Vue.js%20sponsorship%20inquiry\" target=\"_blank\">sponsor@vuejs.org<a>。<p><p>通过我们的网站和 GitHub 项目 README，赞助 Vue 可让你在全球超过 <strong>200 万<strong>的 Vue 开发人员面前大显身手。这不仅能直接产生潜在客户，还能提高你作为一家重视开源的企业的品牌知名度。对于为开发人员打造产品的公司来说，这是一笔无形但极其重要的资产，因为它能提高你的转换率。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/sponsor/", "title": "成为 Vue.js 的赞助者", "doc_id": "c50f7e335e594d04aee9b753d30ff6da", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 189, "chunk_index": 1, "_doc_id": "1_309725792657487359"}}
{"doc_id": "2_84431490097294136", "text": "ng>的 Vue 开发人员面前大显身手。这不仅能直接产生潜在客户，还能提高你作为一家重视开源的企业的品牌知名度。对于为开发人员打造产品的公司来说，这是一笔无形但极其重要的资产，因为它能提高你的转换率。<p><p>其中<strong>中国区铂金赞助商<strong>是仅针对本站 (cn.vuejs.org) 的赞助位级别，包含以下权益：<p><ol><li><a href=\"/\">cn.vuejs.org<a> 首屏无需滚动可见的 logo 展示位：<li><ol><p> <p><ol><li>所有内容页面的侧边栏上的明显的 logo 展示位：<li><ol><p> <p><ol><li>在 <a href=\"https://github.com/vuejs/core\" target=\"_blank\"><code>vuejs/core<code><a> 和 <a href=\"https://github.com/vuejs/core\" target=\"_blank\"><code>vuejs/vue<code><a> 的 README 上明显的 logo 展示位。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/sponsor/", "title": "成为 Vue.js 的赞助者", "doc_id": "c50f7e335e594d04aee9b753d30ff6da", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 189, "chunk_index": 2, "_doc_id": "2_84431490097294136"}}
{"doc_id": "3_5356329148191715874", "text": "ref=\"https://github.com/vuejs/core\" target=\"_blank\"><code>vuejs/vue<code><a> 的 README 上明显的 logo 展示位。<li><ol><p>此赞助位同样可以通过<a href=\"https://afdian.net/a/evanyou\" target=\"_blank\">爱发电<a>来订阅。如果您对此赞助位感兴趣但还抱有疑问，请致信 <a href=\"mailto:sponsor@vuejs.org\" target=\"_blank\">sponsor@vuejs.org<a> 咨询具体事宜。<p><p>如果您想要在国际站放置赞助 logo，则更建议通过 <a href=\"https://github.com/sponsors/yyx990803\" target=\"_blank\">GitHub Sponsors<a> 或 <a href=\"https://opencollective.com/vuejs\" target=\"_blank\">OpenCollective<a> 用美元进行赞助。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/sponsor/", "title": "成为 Vue.js 的赞助者", "doc_id": "c50f7e335e594d04aee9b753d30ff6da", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 189, "chunk_index": 3, "_doc_id": "3_5356329148191715874"}}
{"doc_id": "4_3217121987133171390", "text": "Sponsors<a> 或 <a href=\"https://opencollective.com/vuejs\" target=\"_blank\">OpenCollective<a> 用美元进行赞助。赞助发票可以通过 GitHub 的支付系统获得。我们同时接受每月定期的赞助和一次性的捐赠。定期的赞助有权获得<a href=\"#tier-benefits\">赞助等级<a>中提供的 logo 展示位。<p><p>赞助 Vue 可以让你通过我们的网站和 GitHub 项目的 README 在全球超过 <strong>170 万<strong>的 Vue 开发者面前获得巨大曝光。此外，支持开源项目可以提高你的品牌声誉，这对任何与开发者互动的公司来说都是重要的资产。<p><p>如果你正在使用 Vue 来构建一款创收的产品，那么赞助 Vue 的开发是很有商业意义的。<strong>它可以确保你的产品所依赖的项目保持在健康和积极的维护状态<strong>。在 Vue 社区的曝光和积极的品牌形象也会使你更容易吸引和招募 Vue 开发者。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/sponsor/", "title": "成为 Vue.js 的赞助者", "doc_id": "c50f7e335e594d04aee9b753d30ff6da", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 189, "chunk_index": 4, "_doc_id": "4_3217121987133171390"}}
{"doc_id": "5_7802618932852670137", "text": "ue 的开发是很有商业意义的。<strong>它可以确保你的产品所依赖的项目保持在健康和积极的维护状态<strong>。在 Vue 社区的曝光和积极的品牌形象也会使你更容易吸引和招募 Vue 开发者。<p><p>如果你正在建立一个面向开发者的产品，你将通过赞助曝光获得高质量的流量，因为我们的访问者都是开发者。这样的赞助还可以建立品牌知名度，提高转化率。<p><p>如果你是个人用户，并且享受到了 Vue 带给你的生产力，请考虑捐赠以示感谢——就当是偶尔请我们喝杯咖啡。我们的许多团队成员都通过 GitHub Sponsors 接受赞助和捐赠。在我们的<a href=\"/about/team.html\">团队页面<a>上，你可以找到每个团队成员的个人资料，及其“赞助”按钮。<p><p>你也可以尝试说服你的雇主以企业的名义赞助 Vue。这可能并不容易，但企业赞助通常会对开放源码软件项目的可持续性产生比个人捐赠大得多的影响，所以如果你能够做到，这对我们的帮助会更大。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/sponsor/", "title": "成为 Vue.js 的赞助者", "doc_id": "c50f7e335e594d04aee9b753d30ff6da", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 189, "chunk_index": 5, "_doc_id": "5_7802618932852670137"}}
{"doc_id": "6_2672699693258232653", "text": "”按钮。<p><p>你也可以尝试说服你的雇主以企业的名义赞助 Vue。这可能并不容易，但企业赞助通常会对开放源码软件项目的可持续性产生比个人捐赠大得多的影响，所以如果你能够做到，这对我们的帮助会更大。<p><h2 id=\"tier-benefits\">赞助等级 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#tier-benefits\">​<a><h2><p><strong>以下赞助等级均仅针对我们面向国际用户的英文版网站 vuejs.org。<strong><p><ul><li><strong>全球特别赞助商<strong>： <li><li><strong>铂金赞助商 (2,000 美元/月)<strong>： <li><li><strong>金牌赞助商 (500 美元/月)<strong>： <ul><li><a href=\"https://vuejs.org\" target=\"_blank\">vuejs.org<a> 首页大号的 logo 展示位。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/sponsor/", "title": "成为 Vue.js 的赞助者", "doc_id": "c50f7e335e594d04aee9b753d30ff6da", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 189, "chunk_index": 6, "_doc_id": "6_2672699693258232653"}}
{"doc_id": "7_1118670364330435517", "text": "(500 美元/月)<strong>： <ul><li><a href=\"https://vuejs.org\" target=\"_blank\">vuejs.org<a> 首页大号的 logo 展示位。<li><li>在 <code>vuejs/core<code> 和 <code>vuejs/vue<code> 的 README 上大号的 logo 展示位。<li><ul><li><li><strong>银牌赞助商 (250 美元/月)<strong>： <ul><li>在 <code>vuejs/core<code> 和 <code>vuejs/vue<code> 的 <code>BACKERS.md<code> 文件上中号的 logo 展示位。<li><ul><li><li><strong>铜牌赞助商 (100 美元/月)<strong>： <ul><li>在 <code>vuejs/core<code> 和 <code>vuejs/vue<code> 的 <code>BACKERS.md<code> 文件上小号的 logo 展示位。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/sponsor/", "title": "成为 Vue.js 的赞助者", "doc_id": "c50f7e335e594d04aee9b753d30ff6da", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 189, "chunk_index": 7, "_doc_id": "7_1118670364330435517"}}
{"doc_id": "8_4507339735068310586", "text": "： <ul><li>在 <code>vuejs/core<code> 和 <code>vuejs/vue<code> 的 <code>BACKERS.md<code> 文件上小号的 logo 展示位。<li><ul><li><li><strong>慷慨支持者 (50 美元/月)<strong>： <ul><li>在 <code>vuejs/core<code> 和 <code>vuejs/vue<code> 的 <code>BACKERS.md<code> 文件上的名单上，且在其他个人支持者的位置之前。<li><ul><li><li><strong>个人支持者 (5 美元/月)<strong>： <ul><li>在 <code>vuejs/core<code> 和 <code>vuejs/vue<code> 的 <code>BACKERS.md<code> 文件上的名单上。<li><ul><li><ul><p class=\"spsr-container special page\"><p><h3 id=\"platinum\">铂金赞助商 <a class=\"header-anchor\"", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/sponsor/", "title": "成为 Vue.js 的赞助者", "doc_id": "c50f7e335e594d04aee9b753d30ff6da", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 189, "chunk_index": 8, "_doc_id": "8_4507339735068310586"}}
{"doc_id": "9_1413867139422260531", "text": "><li><ul><p class=\"spsr-container special page\"><p><h3 id=\"platinum\">铂金赞助商 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#platinum\">​<a><h3><p class=\"spsr-container platinum page\"><p><h3 id=\"platinum-china\">铂金赞助商 (中国区) <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#platinum-china\">​<a><h3><p class=\"spsr-container special page\"><p><h3 id=\"gold\">金牌赞助商 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#gold\">​<a><h3><p class=\"spsr-container gold page\"><p><h3 id=\"silver\">银牌赞助商 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#silver\">​<a><h3><p class=\"spsr-container silver", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/sponsor/", "title": "成为 Vue.js 的赞助者", "doc_id": "c50f7e335e594d04aee9b753d30ff6da", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 189, "chunk_index": 9, "_doc_id": "9_1413867139422260531"}}
{"doc_id": "10_2176941297081230990", "text": "3 id=\"silver\">银牌赞助商 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#silver\">​<a><h3><p class=\"spsr-container silver page\"><p><div><div>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/sponsor/", "title": "成为 Vue.js 的赞助者", "doc_id": "c50f7e335e594d04aee9b753d30ff6da", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 189, "chunk_index": 10, "_doc_id": "10_2176941297081230990"}}
{"doc_id": "0_9156409863713439776", "text": "<div><div><h1 id=\"plugins\">插件 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#plugins\">​<a><h1><h2 id=\"introduction\">介绍 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#introduction\">​<a><h2><p>插件 (Plugins) 是一种能为 Vue 添加全局功能的工具代码。下面是如何安装一个插件的示例：<p><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>import<span><span> { createApp } <span><span>from<span><span> 'vue'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/reusability/plugins.html", "title": "插件 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "988eec7ba73e46f0b01c8d6ca01ca381", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 378, "chunk_index": 0, "_doc_id": "0_9156409863713439776"}}
{"doc_id": "1_9085899629983010793", "text": "<span><span> { createApp } <span><span>from<span><span> 'vue'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> app<span><span> =<span><span> createApp<span><span>({})<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>app.<span><span>use<span><span>(myPlugin, {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> /* 可选的选项 */<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/reusability/plugins.html", "title": "插件 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "988eec7ba73e46f0b01c8d6ca01ca381", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 378, "chunk_index": 1, "_doc_id": "1_9085899629983010793"}}
{"doc_id": "2_3374929691453360183", "text": "pan><span>use<span><span>(myPlugin, {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> /* 可选的选项 */<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>})<span><span><code><pre><div><p>一个插件可以是一个拥有 <code>install()<code> 方法的对象，也可以直接是一个安装函数本身。安装函数会接收到安装它的<a href=\"/api/application.html\">应用实例<a>和传递给 <code>app.use()<code> 的额外选项作为参数：<p><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> myPlugin<span><span> =<span><span> {<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/reusability/plugins.html", "title": "插件 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "988eec7ba73e46f0b01c8d6ca01ca381", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 378, "chunk_index": 2, "_doc_id": "2_3374929691453360183"}}
{"doc_id": "3_416382935403796471", "text": "\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> myPlugin<span><span> =<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> install<span><span>(<span><span>app<span><span>, <span><span>options<span><span>) {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 配置此应用<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/reusability/plugins.html", "title": "插件 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "988eec7ba73e46f0b01c8d6ca01ca381", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 378, "chunk_index": 3, "_doc_id": "3_416382935403796471"}}
{"doc_id": "4_3544679810014737843", "text": "<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 配置此应用<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span><code><pre><div><p>插件没有严格定义的使用范围，但是插件发挥作用的常见场景主要包括以下几种：<p><ol><li><p>通过 <a href=\"/api/application.html#app-component\"><code>app.component()<code><a> 和 <a href=\"/api/application.html#app-directive\"><code>app.directive()<code><a> 注册一到多个全局组件或自定义指令。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/reusability/plugins.html", "title": "插件 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "988eec7ba73e46f0b01c8d6ca01ca381", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 378, "chunk_index": 4, "_doc_id": "4_3544679810014737843"}}
{"doc_id": "5_4246401145153986171", "text": "<a> 和 <a href=\"/api/application.html#app-directive\"><code>app.directive()<code><a> 注册一到多个全局组件或自定义指令。<p><li><li><p>通过 <a href=\"/api/application.html#app-provide\"><code>app.provide()<code><a> 使一个资源<a href=\"/guide/components/provide-inject.html\">可被注入<a>进整个应用。<p><li><li><p>向 <a href=\"/api/application.html#app-config-globalproperties\"><code>app.config.globalProperties<code><a> 中添加一些全局实例属性或方法<p><li><li><p>一个可能上述三种都包含了的功能库 (例如 <a href=\"https://github.com/vuejs/vue-router-next\" target=\"_blank\">vue-router<a>)。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/reusability/plugins.html", "title": "插件 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "988eec7ba73e46f0b01c8d6ca01ca381", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 378, "chunk_index": 5, "_doc_id": "5_4246401145153986171"}}
{"doc_id": "6_7092477495929906801", "text": "能上述三种都包含了的功能库 (例如 <a href=\"https://github.com/vuejs/vue-router-next\" target=\"_blank\">vue-router<a>)。<p><li><ol><h2 id=\"writing-a-plugin\">编写一个插件 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#writing-a-plugin\">​<a><h2><p>为了更好地理解如何构建 Vue.js 插件，我们可以试着写一个简单的 <code>i18n<code> (<a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Internationalization_and_localization\" target=\"_blank\">国际化 (Internationalization)<a> 的缩写) 插件。<p><p>让我们从设置插件对象开始。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/reusability/plugins.html", "title": "插件 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "988eec7ba73e46f0b01c8d6ca01ca381", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 378, "chunk_index": 6, "_doc_id": "6_7092477495929906801"}}
{"doc_id": "7_2294151971993937169", "text": "lization_and_localization\" target=\"_blank\">国际化 (Internationalization)<a> 的缩写) 插件。<p><p>让我们从设置插件对象开始。建议在一个单独的文件中创建并导出它，以保证更好地管理逻辑，如下所示：<p><div class=\"vp-code-block-title\"><p class=\"vp-code-block-title-bar\"><span class=\"vp-code-block-title-text\">plugins/i18n.js<span><p><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/reusability/plugins.html", "title": "插件 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "988eec7ba73e46f0b01c8d6ca01ca381", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 378, "chunk_index": 7, "_doc_id": "7_2294151971993937169"}}
{"doc_id": "8_3580437134999047433", "text": "b-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> install<span><span>: (<span><span>app<span><span>, <span><span>options<span><span>) <span><span>=><span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 在这里编写插件代码<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span><code><pre><div><div><p>我们希望有一个翻译函数，这个函数接收一个以 <code>.<code> 作为分隔符的 <code>key<code> 字符串，用来在用户提供的翻译字典中查找对应语言的文本。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/reusability/plugins.html", "title": "插件 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "988eec7ba73e46f0b01c8d6ca01ca381", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 378, "chunk_index": 8, "_doc_id": "8_3580437134999047433"}}
{"doc_id": "9_1122899782572828748", "text": "><div><div><p>我们希望有一个翻译函数，这个函数接收一个以 <code>.<code> 作为分隔符的 <code>key<code> 字符串，用来在用户提供的翻译字典中查找对应语言的文本。期望的使用方式如下：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>h1<span><span>>{{ <span><span>$translate<span><span>(<span><span>'greetings.hello'<span><span>) }}</<span><span>h1<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>这个函数应当能够在任意模板中被全局调用。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/reusability/plugins.html", "title": "插件 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "988eec7ba73e46f0b01c8d6ca01ca381", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 378, "chunk_index": 9, "_doc_id": "9_1122899782572828748"}}
{"doc_id": "10_5705557936894747324", "text": "llo'<span><span>) }}</<span><span>h1<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>这个函数应当能够在任意模板中被全局调用。这一点可以通过在插件中将它添加到 <code>app.config.globalProperties<code> 上来实现：<p><div class=\"vp-code-block-title\"><p class=\"vp-code-block-title-bar\"><span class=\"vp-code-block-title-text\">plugins/i18n.js<span><p><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/reusability/plugins.html", "title": "插件 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "988eec7ba73e46f0b01c8d6ca01ca381", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 378, "chunk_index": 10, "_doc_id": "10_5705557936894747324"}}
{"doc_id": "11_3536719242354412608", "text": "b-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> install<span><span>: (<span><span>app<span><span>, <span><span>options<span><span>) <span><span>=><span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line highlighted\"><span> // 注入一个全局可用的 $translate() 方法<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/reusability/plugins.html", "title": "插件 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "988eec7ba73e46f0b01c8d6ca01ca381", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 378, "chunk_index": 11, "_doc_id": "11_3536719242354412608"}}
{"doc_id": "12_4837349727779318903", "text": "<span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line highlighted\"><span> // 注入一个全局可用的 $translate() 方法<span><span>\n<span class=\"line highlighted\"><span> app.config.globalProperties.<span><span>$translate<span><span> =<span><span> (<span><span>key<span><span>) <span><span>=><span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line highlighted\"><span> // 获取 `options` 对象的深层属性<span><span>\n<span class=\"line highlighted\"><span> // 使用 `key` 作为索引<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/reusability/plugins.html", "title": "插件 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "988eec7ba73e46f0b01c8d6ca01ca381", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 378, "chunk_index": 12, "_doc_id": "12_4837349727779318903"}}
{"doc_id": "13_7261485880680994903", "text": "获取 `options` 对象的深层属性<span><span>\n<span class=\"line highlighted\"><span> // 使用 `key` 作为索引<span><span>\n<span class=\"line highlighted\"><span> return<span><span> key.<span><span>split<span><span>(<span><span>'.'<span><span>).<span><span>reduce<span><span>((<span><span>o<span><span>, <span><span>i<span><span>) <span><span>=><span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line highlighted\"><span> if<span><span> (o) <span><span>return<span><span> o[i]<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/reusability/plugins.html", "title": "插件 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "988eec7ba73e46f0b01c8d6ca01ca381", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 378, "chunk_index": 13, "_doc_id": "13_7261485880680994903"}}
{"doc_id": "14_8786014986502264295", "text": "class=\"line highlighted\"><span> if<span><span> (o) <span><span>return<span><span> o[i]<span><span>\n<span class=\"line highlighted\"><span> }, options)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line highlighted\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/reusability/plugins.html", "title": "插件 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "988eec7ba73e46f0b01c8d6ca01ca381", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 378, "chunk_index": 14, "_doc_id": "14_8786014986502264295"}}
{"doc_id": "15_5571986517150937184", "text": "><span>\n<span class=\"line highlighted\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span><code><pre><div><div><p>我们的 <code>$translate<code> 函数会接收一个例如 <code>greetings.hello<code> 的字符串，在用户提供的翻译字典中查找，并返回翻译得到的值。<p><p>用于查找的翻译字典对象则应当在插件被安装时作为 <code>app.use()<code> 的额外参数被传入：<p><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>import<span><span> i18nPlugin <span><span>from<span><span> './plugins/i18n'<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/reusability/plugins.html", "title": "插件 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "988eec7ba73e46f0b01c8d6ca01ca381", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 378, "chunk_index": 15, "_doc_id": "15_5571986517150937184"}}
{"doc_id": "16_1026203998712371700", "text": "line\"><span>import<span><span> i18nPlugin <span><span>from<span><span> './plugins/i18n'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>app.<span><span>use<span><span>(i18nPlugin, {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> greetings: {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> hello: <span><span>'Bonjour!'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/reusability/plugins.html", "title": "插件 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "988eec7ba73e46f0b01c8d6ca01ca381", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 378, "chunk_index": 16, "_doc_id": "16_1026203998712371700"}}
{"doc_id": "17_1395000501564248002", "text": "ass=\"line\"><span> hello: <span><span>'Bonjour!'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>})<span><span><code><pre><div><p>这样，我们一开始的表达式 <code>$translate('greetings.hello')<code> 就会在运行时被替换为 <code>Bonjour!<code> 了。<p><p>TypeScript 用户请参考：<a href=\"/guide/typescript/options-api.html#augmenting-global-properties\">扩展全局属性<a> <p><div class=\"tip custom-block\"><p class=\"custom-block-title\">TIP<p><p>请谨慎使用全局属性，如果在整个应用中使用不同插件注入的太多全局属性，很容易让应用变得难以理解和维护。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/reusability/plugins.html", "title": "插件 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "988eec7ba73e46f0b01c8d6ca01ca381", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 378, "chunk_index": 17, "_doc_id": "17_1395000501564248002"}}
{"doc_id": "18_5102605589634443041", "text": "tom-block\"><p class=\"custom-block-title\">TIP<p><p>请谨慎使用全局属性，如果在整个应用中使用不同插件注入的太多全局属性，很容易让应用变得难以理解和维护。<p><div><h3 id=\"provide-inject-with-plugins\">插件中的 Provide / Inject <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#provide-inject-with-plugins\">​<a><h3><p>在插件中，我们可以通过 <code>provide<code> 来为插件用户提供访问某个函数或属性的能力。举例来说，我们可以将插件接收到的 <code>options<code> 参数提供给整个应用，让任何组件都能使用这个翻译字典对象。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/reusability/plugins.html", "title": "插件 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "988eec7ba73e46f0b01c8d6ca01ca381", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 378, "chunk_index": 18, "_doc_id": "18_5102605589634443041"}}
{"doc_id": "19_7068142497550008731", "text": "provide<code> 来为插件用户提供访问某个函数或属性的能力。举例来说，我们可以将插件接收到的 <code>options<code> 参数提供给整个应用，让任何组件都能使用这个翻译字典对象。<p><div class=\"vp-code-block-title\"><p class=\"vp-code-block-title-bar\"><span class=\"vp-code-block-title-text\">plugins/i18n.js<span><p><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/reusability/plugins.html", "title": "插件 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "988eec7ba73e46f0b01c8d6ca01ca381", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 378, "chunk_index": 19, "_doc_id": "19_7068142497550008731"}}
{"doc_id": "20_3800879259054431984", "text": "b-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> install<span><span>: (<span><span>app<span><span>, <span><span>options<span><span>) <span><span>=><span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line highlighted\"><span> app.<span><span>provide<span><span>(<span><span>'i18n'<span><span>, options)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/reusability/plugins.html", "title": "插件 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "988eec7ba73e46f0b01c8d6ca01ca381", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 378, "chunk_index": 20, "_doc_id": "20_3800879259054431984"}}
{"doc_id": "21_7334704036411695462", "text": "<span>(<span><span>'i18n'<span><span>, options)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span><code><pre><div><div><p>现在，插件用户就可以在他们的组件中以 <code>i18n<code> 为 key 注入并访问插件的选项对象了。<p><div class=\"composition-api\"><div class=\"language-vue\"> <span class=\"lang\">vue<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>script<span><span> setup<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/reusability/plugins.html", "title": "插件 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "988eec7ba73e46f0b01c8d6ca01ca381", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 378, "chunk_index": 21, "_doc_id": "21_7334704036411695462"}}
{"doc_id": "22_6108058491823397978", "text": "code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>script<span><span> setup<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>import<span><span> { inject } <span><span>from<span><span> 'vue'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line highlighted\"><span>const<span><span> i18n<span><span> =<span><span> inject<span><span>(<span><span>'i18n'<span><span>)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>console.<span><span>log<span><span>(i18n.greetings.hello)<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/reusability/plugins.html", "title": "插件 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "988eec7ba73e46f0b01c8d6ca01ca381", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 378, "chunk_index": 22, "_doc_id": "22_6108058491823397978"}}
{"doc_id": "23_3829606015929164516", "text": "pan>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>console.<span><span>log<span><span>(i18n.greetings.hello)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>script<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><div><div class=\"options-api\"><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line highlighted\"><span> inject: [<span><span>'i18n'<span><span>],<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/reusability/plugins.html", "title": "插件 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "988eec7ba73e46f0b01c8d6ca01ca381", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 378, "chunk_index": 23, "_doc_id": "23_3829606015929164516"}}
{"doc_id": "24_3339583222648423302", "text": "><span>\n<span class=\"line highlighted\"><span> inject: [<span><span>'i18n'<span><span>],<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> created<span><span>() {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> console.<span><span>log<span><span>(<span><span>this<span><span>.i18n.greetings.hello)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/reusability/plugins.html", "title": "插件 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "988eec7ba73e46f0b01c8d6ca01ca381", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 378, "chunk_index": 24, "_doc_id": "24_3339583222648423302"}}
{"doc_id": "25_8578304339949412281", "text": "an><span>this<span><span>.i18n.greetings.hello)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span><code><pre><div><div><h3 id=\"为-npm-打包\">为 NPM 打包 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#%E4%B8%BA-npm-%E6%89%93%E5%8C%85\">​<a><h3><p>如果你想进一步打包并发布插件给他人使用，请参阅 <a href=\"https://vite.dev/guide/build.html#library-mode\" target=\"_blank\">Vite 库模式<a>。<p><div><div>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/reusability/plugins.html", "title": "插件 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "988eec7ba73e46f0b01c8d6ca01ca381", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 378, "chunk_index": 25, "_doc_id": "25_8578304339949412281"}}
{"doc_id": "0_3740280299223569500", "text": "<div><div><p>Vue.js 是采用 MIT 许可的开源项目，使用完全免费。<p><p>维护这样一个庞大的生态系统和为项目开发新功能所需的巨大努力，只有在我们的赞助者慷慨的财务支持下才得以持续。<p><h2 id=\"中国区赞助渠道\">中国区赞助渠道 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#%E4%B8%AD%E5%9B%BD%E5%8C%BA%E8%B5%9E%E5%8A%A9%E6%B8%A0%E9%81%93\">​<a><h2><p>来自国内的开发者或公司可以通过<a href=\"https://afdian.com/a/evanyou\" target=\"_blank\">爱发电<a>平台来支持 Vue.js 的开发。爱发电上的赞助等级和本页下面列出的赞助等级是一一对应的。<p><p>如果你对等级、支付流程或赞助商曝光数据有疑问，请联系 <a href=\"mailto:sponsor@vuejs.org?subject=Vue.js%20sponsorship%20inquiry\" target=\"_blank\">sponsor@vuejs.org<a>。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/sponsor/", "title": "成为 Vue.js 的赞助者", "doc_id": "a8b4f143b57e45329a1855c52440899b", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 189, "chunk_index": 0, "_doc_id": "0_3740280299223569500"}}
{"doc_id": "1_309725792657487359", "text": "ilto:sponsor@vuejs.org?subject=Vue.js%20sponsorship%20inquiry\" target=\"_blank\">sponsor@vuejs.org<a>。<p><p>通过我们的网站和 GitHub 项目 README，赞助 Vue 可让你在全球超过 <strong>200 万<strong>的 Vue 开发人员面前大显身手。这不仅能直接产生潜在客户，还能提高你作为一家重视开源的企业的品牌知名度。对于为开发人员打造产品的公司来说，这是一笔无形但极其重要的资产，因为它能提高你的转换率。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/sponsor/", "title": "成为 Vue.js 的赞助者", "doc_id": "a8b4f143b57e45329a1855c52440899b", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 189, "chunk_index": 1, "_doc_id": "1_309725792657487359"}}
{"doc_id": "2_84431490097294136", "text": "ng>的 Vue 开发人员面前大显身手。这不仅能直接产生潜在客户，还能提高你作为一家重视开源的企业的品牌知名度。对于为开发人员打造产品的公司来说，这是一笔无形但极其重要的资产，因为它能提高你的转换率。<p><p>其中<strong>中国区铂金赞助商<strong>是仅针对本站 (cn.vuejs.org) 的赞助位级别，包含以下权益：<p><ol><li><a href=\"/\">cn.vuejs.org<a> 首屏无需滚动可见的 logo 展示位：<li><ol><p> <p><ol><li>所有内容页面的侧边栏上的明显的 logo 展示位：<li><ol><p> <p><ol><li>在 <a href=\"https://github.com/vuejs/core\" target=\"_blank\"><code>vuejs/core<code><a> 和 <a href=\"https://github.com/vuejs/core\" target=\"_blank\"><code>vuejs/vue<code><a> 的 README 上明显的 logo 展示位。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/sponsor/", "title": "成为 Vue.js 的赞助者", "doc_id": "a8b4f143b57e45329a1855c52440899b", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 189, "chunk_index": 2, "_doc_id": "2_84431490097294136"}}
{"doc_id": "3_5356329148191715874", "text": "ref=\"https://github.com/vuejs/core\" target=\"_blank\"><code>vuejs/vue<code><a> 的 README 上明显的 logo 展示位。<li><ol><p>此赞助位同样可以通过<a href=\"https://afdian.net/a/evanyou\" target=\"_blank\">爱发电<a>来订阅。如果您对此赞助位感兴趣但还抱有疑问，请致信 <a href=\"mailto:sponsor@vuejs.org\" target=\"_blank\">sponsor@vuejs.org<a> 咨询具体事宜。<p><p>如果您想要在国际站放置赞助 logo，则更建议通过 <a href=\"https://github.com/sponsors/yyx990803\" target=\"_blank\">GitHub Sponsors<a> 或 <a href=\"https://opencollective.com/vuejs\" target=\"_blank\">OpenCollective<a> 用美元进行赞助。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/sponsor/", "title": "成为 Vue.js 的赞助者", "doc_id": "a8b4f143b57e45329a1855c52440899b", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 189, "chunk_index": 3, "_doc_id": "3_5356329148191715874"}}
{"doc_id": "4_3217121987133171390", "text": "Sponsors<a> 或 <a href=\"https://opencollective.com/vuejs\" target=\"_blank\">OpenCollective<a> 用美元进行赞助。赞助发票可以通过 GitHub 的支付系统获得。我们同时接受每月定期的赞助和一次性的捐赠。定期的赞助有权获得<a href=\"#tier-benefits\">赞助等级<a>中提供的 logo 展示位。<p><p>赞助 Vue 可以让你通过我们的网站和 GitHub 项目的 README 在全球超过 <strong>170 万<strong>的 Vue 开发者面前获得巨大曝光。此外，支持开源项目可以提高你的品牌声誉，这对任何与开发者互动的公司来说都是重要的资产。<p><p>如果你正在使用 Vue 来构建一款创收的产品，那么赞助 Vue 的开发是很有商业意义的。<strong>它可以确保你的产品所依赖的项目保持在健康和积极的维护状态<strong>。在 Vue 社区的曝光和积极的品牌形象也会使你更容易吸引和招募 Vue 开发者。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/sponsor/", "title": "成为 Vue.js 的赞助者", "doc_id": "a8b4f143b57e45329a1855c52440899b", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 189, "chunk_index": 4, "_doc_id": "4_3217121987133171390"}}
{"doc_id": "5_7802618932852670137", "text": "ue 的开发是很有商业意义的。<strong>它可以确保你的产品所依赖的项目保持在健康和积极的维护状态<strong>。在 Vue 社区的曝光和积极的品牌形象也会使你更容易吸引和招募 Vue 开发者。<p><p>如果你正在建立一个面向开发者的产品，你将通过赞助曝光获得高质量的流量，因为我们的访问者都是开发者。这样的赞助还可以建立品牌知名度，提高转化率。<p><p>如果你是个人用户，并且享受到了 Vue 带给你的生产力，请考虑捐赠以示感谢——就当是偶尔请我们喝杯咖啡。我们的许多团队成员都通过 GitHub Sponsors 接受赞助和捐赠。在我们的<a href=\"/about/team.html\">团队页面<a>上，你可以找到每个团队成员的个人资料，及其“赞助”按钮。<p><p>你也可以尝试说服你的雇主以企业的名义赞助 Vue。这可能并不容易，但企业赞助通常会对开放源码软件项目的可持续性产生比个人捐赠大得多的影响，所以如果你能够做到，这对我们的帮助会更大。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/sponsor/", "title": "成为 Vue.js 的赞助者", "doc_id": "a8b4f143b57e45329a1855c52440899b", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 189, "chunk_index": 5, "_doc_id": "5_7802618932852670137"}}
{"doc_id": "6_2672699693258232653", "text": "”按钮。<p><p>你也可以尝试说服你的雇主以企业的名义赞助 Vue。这可能并不容易，但企业赞助通常会对开放源码软件项目的可持续性产生比个人捐赠大得多的影响，所以如果你能够做到，这对我们的帮助会更大。<p><h2 id=\"tier-benefits\">赞助等级 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#tier-benefits\">​<a><h2><p><strong>以下赞助等级均仅针对我们面向国际用户的英文版网站 vuejs.org。<strong><p><ul><li><strong>全球特别赞助商<strong>： <li><li><strong>铂金赞助商 (2,000 美元/月)<strong>： <li><li><strong>金牌赞助商 (500 美元/月)<strong>： <ul><li><a href=\"https://vuejs.org\" target=\"_blank\">vuejs.org<a> 首页大号的 logo 展示位。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/sponsor/", "title": "成为 Vue.js 的赞助者", "doc_id": "a8b4f143b57e45329a1855c52440899b", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 189, "chunk_index": 6, "_doc_id": "6_2672699693258232653"}}
{"doc_id": "7_1118670364330435517", "text": "(500 美元/月)<strong>： <ul><li><a href=\"https://vuejs.org\" target=\"_blank\">vuejs.org<a> 首页大号的 logo 展示位。<li><li>在 <code>vuejs/core<code> 和 <code>vuejs/vue<code> 的 README 上大号的 logo 展示位。<li><ul><li><li><strong>银牌赞助商 (250 美元/月)<strong>： <ul><li>在 <code>vuejs/core<code> 和 <code>vuejs/vue<code> 的 <code>BACKERS.md<code> 文件上中号的 logo 展示位。<li><ul><li><li><strong>铜牌赞助商 (100 美元/月)<strong>： <ul><li>在 <code>vuejs/core<code> 和 <code>vuejs/vue<code> 的 <code>BACKERS.md<code> 文件上小号的 logo 展示位。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/sponsor/", "title": "成为 Vue.js 的赞助者", "doc_id": "a8b4f143b57e45329a1855c52440899b", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 189, "chunk_index": 7, "_doc_id": "7_1118670364330435517"}}
{"doc_id": "8_4507339735068310586", "text": "： <ul><li>在 <code>vuejs/core<code> 和 <code>vuejs/vue<code> 的 <code>BACKERS.md<code> 文件上小号的 logo 展示位。<li><ul><li><li><strong>慷慨支持者 (50 美元/月)<strong>： <ul><li>在 <code>vuejs/core<code> 和 <code>vuejs/vue<code> 的 <code>BACKERS.md<code> 文件上的名单上，且在其他个人支持者的位置之前。<li><ul><li><li><strong>个人支持者 (5 美元/月)<strong>： <ul><li>在 <code>vuejs/core<code> 和 <code>vuejs/vue<code> 的 <code>BACKERS.md<code> 文件上的名单上。<li><ul><li><ul><p class=\"spsr-container special page\"><p><h3 id=\"platinum\">铂金赞助商 <a class=\"header-anchor\"", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/sponsor/", "title": "成为 Vue.js 的赞助者", "doc_id": "a8b4f143b57e45329a1855c52440899b", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 189, "chunk_index": 8, "_doc_id": "8_4507339735068310586"}}
{"doc_id": "9_1413867139422260531", "text": "><li><ul><p class=\"spsr-container special page\"><p><h3 id=\"platinum\">铂金赞助商 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#platinum\">​<a><h3><p class=\"spsr-container platinum page\"><p><h3 id=\"platinum-china\">铂金赞助商 (中国区) <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#platinum-china\">​<a><h3><p class=\"spsr-container special page\"><p><h3 id=\"gold\">金牌赞助商 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#gold\">​<a><h3><p class=\"spsr-container gold page\"><p><h3 id=\"silver\">银牌赞助商 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#silver\">​<a><h3><p class=\"spsr-container silver", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/sponsor/", "title": "成为 Vue.js 的赞助者", "doc_id": "a8b4f143b57e45329a1855c52440899b", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 189, "chunk_index": 9, "_doc_id": "9_1413867139422260531"}}
{"doc_id": "10_2176941297081230990", "text": "3 id=\"silver\">银牌赞助商 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#silver\">​<a><h3><p class=\"spsr-container silver page\"><p><div><div>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/sponsor/", "title": "成为 Vue.js 的赞助者", "doc_id": "a8b4f143b57e45329a1855c52440899b", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 189, "chunk_index": 10, "_doc_id": "10_2176941297081230990"}}
{"doc_id": "0_8467981841934067824", "text": "<div><div><h1 id=\"transition\">Transition <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#transition\">​<a><h1><p>Vue 提供了两个内置组件，可以帮助你制作基于状态变化的过渡和动画：<p><p>除了这两个组件，我们也可以通过其他技术手段来应用动画，比如切换 CSS class 或用状态绑定样式来驱动动画。这些其他的方法会在<a href=\"/guide/extras/animation.html\">动画技巧<a>章节中展开。<p><h2 id=\"the-transition-component\"><code><Transition><code> 组件 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#the-transition-component\">​<a><h2><p><code><Transition><code> 是一个内置组件，这意味着它在任意别的组件中都可以被使用，无需注册。它可以将进入和离开动画应用到通过默认插槽传递给它的元素或组件上。进入或离开可以由以下的条件之一触发：<p><ul><li>由", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/transition.html", "title": "Transition | Vue.js", "doc_id": "accf566f306c4b42b1ebe10455a24700", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1496, "chunk_index": 0, "_doc_id": "0_8467981841934067824"}}
{"doc_id": "1_5588558747475527668", "text": "de> 是一个内置组件，这意味着它在任意别的组件中都可以被使用，无需注册。它可以将进入和离开动画应用到通过默认插槽传递给它的元素或组件上。进入或离开可以由以下的条件之一触发：<p><ul><li>由 <code>v-if<code> 所触发的切换<li><li>由 <code>v-show<code> 所触发的切换<li><li>由特殊元素 <code><component><code> 切换的动态组件<li><li>改变特殊的 <code>key<code> 属性<li><ul><p>以下是最基本用法的示例：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>button<span><span> @<span><span>click<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>show", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/transition.html", "title": "Transition | Vue.js", "doc_id": "accf566f306c4b42b1ebe10455a24700", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1496, "chunk_index": 1, "_doc_id": "1_5588558747475527668"}}
{"doc_id": "2_8561560647092155725", "text": "><span><<span><span>button<span><span> @<span><span>click<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>show <span><span>=<span><span> !<span><span>show<span><span>\"<span><span>>Toggle</<span><span>button<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>Transition<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>p<span><span> v-if<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>show<span><span>\"<span><span>>hello</<span><span>p<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/transition.html", "title": "Transition | Vue.js", "doc_id": "accf566f306c4b42b1ebe10455a24700", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1496, "chunk_index": 2, "_doc_id": "2_8561560647092155725"}}
{"doc_id": "3_9071841483440123769", "text": "span><span>\"<span><span>show<span><span>\"<span><span>>hello</<span><span>p<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>Transition<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><div class=\"language-css\"> <span class=\"lang\">css<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>/* 下面我们会解释这些 class 是做什么的 */<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>.v-enter-active<span><span>,<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>.v-leave-active<span><span> {<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/transition.html", "title": "Transition | Vue.js", "doc_id": "accf566f306c4b42b1ebe10455a24700", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1496, "chunk_index": 3, "_doc_id": "3_9071841483440123769"}}
{"doc_id": "4_6347913501385113514", "text": "-active<span><span>,<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>.v-leave-active<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> transition<span><span>: opacity <span><span>0.5<span><span>s<span><span> ease<span><span>;<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>.v-enter-from<span><span>,<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>.v-leave-to<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> opacity<span><span>: <span><span>0<span><span>;<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/transition.html", "title": "Transition | Vue.js", "doc_id": "accf566f306c4b42b1ebe10455a24700", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1496, "chunk_index": 4, "_doc_id": "4_6347913501385113514"}}
{"doc_id": "5_6309955168331021219", "text": "{<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> opacity<span><span>: <span><span>0<span><span>;<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span><code><pre><div><div class=\"tip custom-block\"><p class=\"custom-block-title\">TIP<p><p><code><Transition><code> 仅支持单个元素或组件作为其插槽内容。如果内容是一个组件，这个组件必须仅有一个根元素。<p><div><p>当一个 <code><Transition><code> 组件中的元素被插入或移除时，会发生下面这些事情：<p><ol><li><p>Vue 会自动检测目标元素是否应用了 CSS 过渡或动画。如果是，则一些 <a href=\"#transition-classes\">CSS 过渡 class<a> 会在适当的时机被添加和移除。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/transition.html", "title": "Transition | Vue.js", "doc_id": "accf566f306c4b42b1ebe10455a24700", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1496, "chunk_index": 5, "_doc_id": "5_6309955168331021219"}}
{"doc_id": "6_4717575409271632678", "text": "<p>Vue 会自动检测目标元素是否应用了 CSS 过渡或动画。如果是，则一些 <a href=\"#transition-classes\">CSS 过渡 class<a> 会在适当的时机被添加和移除。<p><li><li><p>如果有作为监听器的 <a href=\"#javascript-hooks\">JavaScript 钩子<a>，这些钩子函数会在适当时机被调用。<p><li><li><p>如果没有探测到 CSS 过渡或动画、也没有提供 JavaScript 钩子，那么 DOM 的插入、删除操作将在浏览器的下一个动画帧后执行。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/transition.html", "title": "Transition | Vue.js", "doc_id": "accf566f306c4b42b1ebe10455a24700", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1496, "chunk_index": 6, "_doc_id": "6_4717575409271632678"}}
{"doc_id": "7_338711562849986240", "text": "，这些钩子函数会在适当时机被调用。<p><li><li><p>如果没有探测到 CSS 过渡或动画、也没有提供 JavaScript 钩子，那么 DOM 的插入、删除操作将在浏览器的下一个动画帧后执行。<p><li><ol><h2 id=\"css-based-transitions\">基于 CSS 的过渡效果 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#css-based-transitions\">​<a><h2><h3 id=\"transition-classes\">CSS 过渡 class <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#transition-classes\">​<a><h3><p>一共有 6 个应用于进入与离开过渡效果的 CSS class。<p><p> <p><ol><li><p><code>v-enter-from<code>：进入动画的起始状态。在元素插入之前添加，在元素插入完成后的下一帧移除。<p><li><li><p><code>v-enter-active<code>：进入动画的生效状态。应用于整个进入动画阶段。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/transition.html", "title": "Transition | Vue.js", "doc_id": "accf566f306c4b42b1ebe10455a24700", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1496, "chunk_index": 7, "_doc_id": "7_338711562849986240"}}
{"doc_id": "8_2756814679089051902", "text": ">：进入动画的起始状态。在元素插入之前添加，在元素插入完成后的下一帧移除。<p><li><li><p><code>v-enter-active<code>：进入动画的生效状态。应用于整个进入动画阶段。在元素被插入之前添加，在过渡或动画完成之后移除。这个 class 可以被用来定义进入动画的持续时间、延迟与速度曲线类型。<p><li><li><p><code>v-enter-to<code>：进入动画的结束状态。在元素插入完成后的下一帧被添加 (也就是 <code>v-enter-from<code> 被移除的同时)，在过渡或动画完成之后移除。<p><li><li><p><code>v-leave-from<code>：离开动画的起始状态。在离开过渡效果被触发时立即添加，在一帧后被移除。<p><li><li><p><code>v-leave-active<code>：离开动画的生效状态。应用于整个离开动画阶段。在离开过渡效果被触发时立即添加，在过渡或动画完成之后移除。这个 class 可以被用来定义离开动画的持续时间、延迟与速度曲线类型。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/transition.html", "title": "Transition | Vue.js", "doc_id": "accf566f306c4b42b1ebe10455a24700", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1496, "chunk_index": 8, "_doc_id": "8_2756814679089051902"}}
{"doc_id": "9_5827360382190076011", "text": "active<code>：离开动画的生效状态。应用于整个离开动画阶段。在离开过渡效果被触发时立即添加，在过渡或动画完成之后移除。这个 class 可以被用来定义离开动画的持续时间、延迟与速度曲线类型。<p><li><li><p><code>v-leave-to<code>：离开动画的结束状态。在一个离开动画被触发后的下一帧被添加 (也就是 <code>v-leave-from<code> 被移除的同时)，在过渡或动画完成之后移除。<p><li><ol><p><code>v-enter-active<code> 和 <code>v-leave-active<code> 给我们提供了为进入和离开动画指定不同速度曲线的能力，我们将在下面的小节中看到一个示例。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/transition.html", "title": "Transition | Vue.js", "doc_id": "accf566f306c4b42b1ebe10455a24700", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1496, "chunk_index": 9, "_doc_id": "9_5827360382190076011"}}
{"doc_id": "10_139603806124380782", "text": "><code>v-enter-active<code> 和 <code>v-leave-active<code> 给我们提供了为进入和离开动画指定不同速度曲线的能力，我们将在下面的小节中看到一个示例。<p><h3 id=\"named-transitions\">为过渡效果命名 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#named-transitions\">​<a><h3><p>我们可以给 <code><Transition><code> 组件传一个 <code>name<code> prop 来声明一个过渡效果名：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>Transition<span><span> name<span><span>=<span><span>\"fade\"<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/transition.html", "title": "Transition | Vue.js", "doc_id": "accf566f306c4b42b1ebe10455a24700", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1496, "chunk_index": 10, "_doc_id": "10_139603806124380782"}}
{"doc_id": "11_6998711790743445374", "text": "an><<span><span>Transition<span><span> name<span><span>=<span><span>\"fade\"<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> ...<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/transition.html", "title": "Transition | Vue.js", "doc_id": "accf566f306c4b42b1ebe10455a24700", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1496, "chunk_index": 11, "_doc_id": "11_6998711790743445374"}}
{"doc_id": "12_5202810404440570393", "text": "e<span><span>=<span><span>\"fade\"<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> ...<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>Transition<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>对于一个有名字的过渡效果，对它起作用的过渡 class 会以其名字而不是 <code>v<code> 作为前缀。比如，上方例子中被应用的 class 将会是 <code>fade-enter-active<code> 而不是 <code>v-enter-active<code>。这个“fade”过渡的 class 应该是这样：<p><div class=\"language-css\"> <span class=\"lang\">css<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>.fade-enter-active<span><span>,<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/transition.html", "title": "Transition | Vue.js", "doc_id": "accf566f306c4b42b1ebe10455a24700", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1496, "chunk_index": 12, "_doc_id": "12_5202810404440570393"}}
{"doc_id": "13_4513188545132730450", "text": "iki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>.fade-enter-active<span><span>,<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>.fade-leave-active<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> transition<span><span>: opacity <span><span>0.5<span><span>s<span><span> ease<span><span>;<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>.fade-enter-from<span><span>,<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>.fade-leave-to<span><span> {<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/transition.html", "title": "Transition | Vue.js", "doc_id": "accf566f306c4b42b1ebe10455a24700", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1496, "chunk_index": 13, "_doc_id": "13_4513188545132730450"}}
{"doc_id": "14_7768966974828748254", "text": "ter-from<span><span>,<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>.fade-leave-to<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> opacity<span><span>: <span><span>0<span><span>;<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/transition.html", "title": "Transition | Vue.js", "doc_id": "accf566f306c4b42b1ebe10455a24700", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1496, "chunk_index": 14, "_doc_id": "14_7768966974828748254"}}
{"doc_id": "15_8100999396790678586", "text": "{<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> opacity<span><span>: <span><span>0<span><span>;<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span><code><pre><div><h3 id=\"css-transitions\">CSS 的 transition <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#css-transitions\">​<a><h3><p><code><Transition><code> 一般都会搭配<a href=\"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/CSS/CSS_Transitions/Using_CSS_transitions\" target=\"_blank\">原生 CSS 过渡<a>一起使用，正如你在上面的例子中所看到的那样。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/transition.html", "title": "Transition | Vue.js", "doc_id": "accf566f306c4b42b1ebe10455a24700", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1496, "chunk_index": 15, "_doc_id": "15_8100999396790678586"}}
{"doc_id": "16_3982018251442493759", "text": "cs/Web/CSS/CSS_Transitions/Using_CSS_transitions\" target=\"_blank\">原生 CSS 过渡<a>一起使用，正如你在上面的例子中所看到的那样。这个 <code>transition<code> CSS 属性是一个简写形式，使我们可以一次定义一个过渡的各个方面，包括需要执行动画的属性、持续时间和<a href=\"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/CSS/easing-function\" target=\"_blank\">速度曲线<a>。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/transition.html", "title": "Transition | Vue.js", "doc_id": "accf566f306c4b42b1ebe10455a24700", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1496, "chunk_index": 16, "_doc_id": "16_3982018251442493759"}}
{"doc_id": "17_879769564371021801", "text": "和<a href=\"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/CSS/easing-function\" target=\"_blank\">速度曲线<a>。<p><p>下面是一个更高级的例子，它使用了不同的持续时间和速度曲线来过渡多个属性：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>Transition<span><span> name<span><span>=<span><span>\"slide-fade\"<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/transition.html", "title": "Transition | Vue.js", "doc_id": "accf566f306c4b42b1ebe10455a24700", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1496, "chunk_index": 17, "_doc_id": "17_879769564371021801"}}
{"doc_id": "18_4982099243294632273", "text": "pan><span>Transition<span><span> name<span><span>=<span><span>\"slide-fade\"<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>p<span><span> v-if<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>show<span><span>\"<span><span>>hello</<span><span>p<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>Transition<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><div class=\"language-css\"> <span class=\"lang\">css<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>/*<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/transition.html", "title": "Transition | Vue.js", "doc_id": "accf566f306c4b42b1ebe10455a24700", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1496, "chunk_index": 18, "_doc_id": "18_4982099243294632273"}}
{"doc_id": "19_6941440197094911466", "text": "lang\">css<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>/*<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> 进入和离开动画可以使用不同<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> 持续时间和速度曲线。<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>*/<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>.slide-fade-enter-active<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> transition<span><span>: <span><span>all<span><span> 0.3<span><span>s<span><span> ease-out<span><span>;<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/transition.html", "title": "Transition | Vue.js", "doc_id": "accf566f306c4b42b1ebe10455a24700", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1496, "chunk_index": 19, "_doc_id": "19_6941440197094911466"}}
{"doc_id": "20_5718532518635320734", "text": "3<span><span>s<span><span> ease-out<span><span>;<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>.slide-fade-leave-active<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> transition<span><span>: <span><span>all<span><span> 0.8<span><span>s<span><span> cubic-bezier<span><span>(<span><span>1<span><span>, <span><span>0.5<span><span>, <span><span>0.8<span><span>, <span><span>1<span><span>);<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/transition.html", "title": "Transition | Vue.js", "doc_id": "accf566f306c4b42b1ebe10455a24700", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1496, "chunk_index": 20, "_doc_id": "20_5718532518635320734"}}
{"doc_id": "21_3551732625177024532", "text": "pan>0.8<span><span>, <span><span>1<span><span>);<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>.slide-fade-enter-from<span><span>,<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>.slide-fade-leave-to<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> transform<span><span>: <span><span>translateX<span><span>(<span><span>20<span><span>px<span><span>);<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> opacity<span><span>: <span><span>0<span><span>;<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/transition.html", "title": "Transition | Vue.js", "doc_id": "accf566f306c4b42b1ebe10455a24700", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1496, "chunk_index": 21, "_doc_id": "21_3551732625177024532"}}
{"doc_id": "22_5154326489638797419", "text": ";<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> opacity<span><span>: <span><span>0<span><span>;<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span><code><pre><div><h3 id=\"css-animations\">CSS 的 animation <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#css-animations\">​<a><h3><p><a href=\"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/CSS/CSS_Animations/Using_CSS_animations\" target=\"_blank\">原生 CSS 动画<a>和 CSS transition 的应用方式基本上是相同的，只有一点不同，那就是 <code>*-enter-from<code> 不是在元素插入后立即移除，而是在一个 <code>animationend<code> 事件触发时被移除。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/transition.html", "title": "Transition | Vue.js", "doc_id": "accf566f306c4b42b1ebe10455a24700", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1496, "chunk_index": 22, "_doc_id": "22_5154326489638797419"}}
{"doc_id": "23_1793566606025405735", "text": "用方式基本上是相同的，只有一点不同，那就是 <code>*-enter-from<code> 不是在元素插入后立即移除，而是在一个 <code>animationend<code> 事件触发时被移除。<p><p>对于大多数的 CSS 动画，我们可以简单地在 <code>*-enter-active<code> 和 <code>*-leave-active<code> class 下声明它们。下面是一个示例：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>Transition<span><span> name<span><span>=<span><span>\"bounce\"<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/transition.html", "title": "Transition | Vue.js", "doc_id": "accf566f306c4b42b1ebe10455a24700", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1496, "chunk_index": 23, "_doc_id": "23_1793566606025405735"}}
{"doc_id": "24_7337011950338925813", "text": "><<span><span>Transition<span><span> name<span><span>=<span><span>\"bounce\"<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>p<span><span> v-if<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>show<span><span>\"<span><span> style<span><span>=<span><span>\"text-align: center;\"<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> Hello here is some bouncy text!<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> </<span><span>p<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/transition.html", "title": "Transition | Vue.js", "doc_id": "accf566f306c4b42b1ebe10455a24700", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1496, "chunk_index": 24, "_doc_id": "24_7337011950338925813"}}
{"doc_id": "25_627988197131856419", "text": "is some bouncy text!<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> </<span><span>p<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>Transition<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><div class=\"language-css\"> <span class=\"lang\">css<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>.bounce-enter-active<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> animation<span><span>: bounce-in <span><span>0.5<span><span>s<span><span>;<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/transition.html", "title": "Transition | Vue.js", "doc_id": "accf566f306c4b42b1ebe10455a24700", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1496, "chunk_index": 25, "_doc_id": "25_627988197131856419"}}
{"doc_id": "26_4893921542749193444", "text": "line\"><span> animation<span><span>: bounce-in <span><span>0.5<span><span>s<span><span>;<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>.bounce-leave-active<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> animation<span><span>: bounce-in <span><span>0.5<span><span>s<span><span> reverse<span><span>;<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>@keyframes<span><span> bounce-in<span><span> {<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/transition.html", "title": "Transition | Vue.js", "doc_id": "accf566f306c4b42b1ebe10455a24700", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1496, "chunk_index": 26, "_doc_id": "26_4893921542749193444"}}
{"doc_id": "27_8303599777005647929", "text": "n>}<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>@keyframes<span><span> bounce-in<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> 0%<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> transform<span><span>: <span><span>scale<span><span>(<span><span>0<span><span>);<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> 50%<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> transform<span><span>: <span><span>scale<span><span>(<span><span>1.25<span><span>);<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/transition.html", "title": "Transition | Vue.js", "doc_id": "accf566f306c4b42b1ebe10455a24700", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1496, "chunk_index": 27, "_doc_id": "27_8303599777005647929"}}
{"doc_id": "28_5297768019859005799", "text": "an> transform<span><span>: <span><span>scale<span><span>(<span><span>1.25<span><span>);<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> 100%<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> transform<span><span>: <span><span>scale<span><span>(<span><span>1<span><span>);<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span><code><pre><div><div class=\"demo\"> Toggle <p> Hello here is some bouncy text!", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/transition.html", "title": "Transition | Vue.js", "doc_id": "accf566f306c4b42b1ebe10455a24700", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1496, "chunk_index": 28, "_doc_id": "28_5297768019859005799"}}
{"doc_id": "29_452228200065062920", "text": "e\"><span>}<span><span><code><pre><div><div class=\"demo\"> Toggle <p> Hello here is some bouncy text! <p><div><h3 id=\"custom-transition-classes\">自定义过渡 class <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#custom-transition-classes\">​<a><h3><p>你也可以向 <code><Transition><code> 传递以下的 props 来指定自定义的过渡 class：<p><ul><li><code>enter-from-class<code><li><li><code>enter-active-class<code><li><li><code>enter-to-class<code><li><li><code>leave-from-class<code><li><li><code>leave-active-class<code><li><li><code>leave-to-class<code><li><ul><p>你传入的这些 class 会覆盖相应阶段的默认 class 名。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/transition.html", "title": "Transition | Vue.js", "doc_id": "accf566f306c4b42b1ebe10455a24700", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1496, "chunk_index": 29, "_doc_id": "29_452228200065062920"}}
{"doc_id": "30_1325635383846361411", "text": "eave-active-class<code><li><li><code>leave-to-class<code><li><ul><p>你传入的这些 class 会覆盖相应阶段的默认 class 名。这个功能在你想要在 Vue 的动画机制下集成其他的第三方 CSS 动画库时非常有用，比如 <a href=\"https://daneden.github.io/animate.css/\" target=\"_blank\">Animate.css<a>：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><!-- 假设你已经在页面中引入了 Animate.css --><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>Transition<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/transition.html", "title": "Transition | Vue.js", "doc_id": "accf566f306c4b42b1ebe10455a24700", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1496, "chunk_index": 30, "_doc_id": "30_1325635383846361411"}}
{"doc_id": "31_7361464434484588573", "text": "你已经在页面中引入了 Animate.css --><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>Transition<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> name<span><span>=<span><span>\"custom-classes\"<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> enter-active-class<span><span>=<span><span>\"animate__animated animate__tada\"<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> leave-active-class<span><span>=<span><span>\"animate__animated animate__bounceOutRight\"<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/transition.html", "title": "Transition | Vue.js", "doc_id": "accf566f306c4b42b1ebe10455a24700", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1496, "chunk_index": 31, "_doc_id": "31_7361464434484588573"}}
{"doc_id": "32_6938974746561698417", "text": "span>\"animate__animated animate__bounceOutRight\"<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>p<span><span> v-if<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>show<span><span>\"<span><span>>hello</<span><span>p<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/transition.html", "title": "Transition | Vue.js", "doc_id": "accf566f306c4b42b1ebe10455a24700", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1496, "chunk_index": 32, "_doc_id": "32_6938974746561698417"}}
{"doc_id": "33_7702468078696166829", "text": "span><span>\"<span><span>show<span><span>\"<span><span>>hello</<span><span>p<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>Transition<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><h3 id=\"using-transitions-and-animations-together\">同时使用 transition 和 animation <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#using-transitions-and-animations-together\">​<a><h3><p>Vue 需要附加事件监听器，以便知道过渡何时结束。可以是 <code>transitionend<code> 或 <code>animationend<code>，这取决于你所应用的 CSS 规则。如果你仅仅使用二者的其中之一，Vue 可以自动探测到正确的类型。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/transition.html", "title": "Transition | Vue.js", "doc_id": "accf566f306c4b42b1ebe10455a24700", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1496, "chunk_index": 33, "_doc_id": "33_7702468078696166829"}}
{"doc_id": "34_479159171458494971", "text": "ode>transitionend<code> 或 <code>animationend<code>，这取决于你所应用的 CSS 规则。如果你仅仅使用二者的其中之一，Vue 可以自动探测到正确的类型。<p><p>然而在某些场景中，你或许想要在同一个元素上同时使用它们两个。举例来说，Vue 触发了一个 CSS 动画，同时鼠标悬停触发另一个 CSS 过渡。此时你需要显式地传入 <code>type<code> prop 来声明，告诉 Vue 需要关心哪种类型，传入的值是 <code>animation<code> 或 <code>transition<code>：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>Transition<span><span> type<span><span>=<span><span>\"animation\"<span><span>>..", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/transition.html", "title": "Transition | Vue.js", "doc_id": "accf566f306c4b42b1ebe10455a24700", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1496, "chunk_index": 34, "_doc_id": "34_479159171458494971"}}
{"doc_id": "35_6701089490036599690", "text": "e\"><span><<span><span>Transition<span><span> type<span><span>=<span><span>\"animation\"<span><span>>...</<span><span>Transition<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><h3 id=\"nested-transitions-and-explicit-transition-durations\">深层级过渡与显式过渡时长 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#nested-transitions-and-explicit-transition-durations\">​<a><h3><p>尽管过渡 class 仅能应用在 <code><Transition><code> 的直接子元素上，我们还是可以使用深层级的 CSS 选择器，", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/transition.html", "title": "Transition | Vue.js", "doc_id": "accf566f306c4b42b1ebe10455a24700", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1496, "chunk_index": 35, "_doc_id": "35_6701089490036599690"}}
{"doc_id": "36_3573072055035230494", "text": "sition-durations\">​<a><h3><p>尽管过渡 class 仅能应用在 <code><Transition><code> 的直接子元素上，我们还是可以使用深层级的 CSS 选择器，在深层级的元素上触发过渡效果：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>Transition<span><span> name<span><span>=<span><span>\"nested\"<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/transition.html", "title": "Transition | Vue.js", "doc_id": "accf566f306c4b42b1ebe10455a24700", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1496, "chunk_index": 36, "_doc_id": "36_3573072055035230494"}}
{"doc_id": "37_6757668644498075124", "text": "><<span><span>Transition<span><span> name<span><span>=<span><span>\"nested\"<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>div<span><span> v-if<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>show<span><span>\"<span><span> class<span><span>=<span><span>\"outer\"<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>div<span><span> class<span><span>=<span><span>\"inner\"<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> Hello<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/transition.html", "title": "Transition | Vue.js", "doc_id": "accf566f306c4b42b1ebe10455a24700", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1496, "chunk_index": 37, "_doc_id": "37_6757668644498075124"}}
{"doc_id": "38_3166388456849004133", "text": "pan><span>=<span><span>\"inner\"<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> Hello<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> </<span><span>div<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> </<span><span>div<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>Transition<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><div class=\"language-css\"> <span class=\"lang\">css<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>/* 应用于嵌套元素的规则 */<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/transition.html", "title": "Transition | Vue.js", "doc_id": "accf566f306c4b42b1ebe10455a24700", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1496, "chunk_index": 38, "_doc_id": "38_3166388456849004133"}}
{"doc_id": "39_6672908835206104437", "text": "><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>/* 应用于嵌套元素的规则 */<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>.nested-enter-active<span><span> .inner<span><span>,<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>.nested-leave-active<span><span> .inner<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> transition<span><span>: <span><span>all<span><span> 0.3<span><span>s<span><span> ease-in-out<span><span>;<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/transition.html", "title": "Transition | Vue.js", "doc_id": "accf566f306c4b42b1ebe10455a24700", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1496, "chunk_index": 39, "_doc_id": "39_6672908835206104437"}}
{"doc_id": "40_8556398391727901966", "text": "se-in-out<span><span>;<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>.nested-enter-from<span><span> .inner<span><span>,<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>.nested-leave-to<span><span> .inner<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> transform<span><span>: <span><span>translateX<span><span>(<span><span>30<span><span>px<span><span>);<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> opacity<span><span>: <span><span>0<span><span>;<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/transition.html", "title": "Transition | Vue.js", "doc_id": "accf566f306c4b42b1ebe10455a24700", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1496, "chunk_index": 40, "_doc_id": "40_8556398391727901966"}}
{"doc_id": "41_7345047624238228354", "text": ";<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> opacity<span><span>: <span><span>0<span><span>;<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>/* ... 省略了其他必要的 CSS */<span><span><code><pre><div><p>我们甚至可以在深层元素上添加一个过渡延迟，从而创建一个带渐进延迟的动画序列：<p><div class=\"language-css\"> <span class=\"lang\">css<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>/* 延迟嵌套元素的进入以获得交错效果 */<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/transition.html", "title": "Transition | Vue.js", "doc_id": "accf566f306c4b42b1ebe10455a24700", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1496, "chunk_index": 41, "_doc_id": "41_7345047624238228354"}}
{"doc_id": "42_2109631079413702662", "text": "class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>/* 延迟嵌套元素的进入以获得交错效果 */<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>.nested-enter-active<span><span> .inner<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line highlighted\"><span> transition-delay<span><span>: <span><span>0.25<span><span>s<span><span>;<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span><code><pre><div><p>然而，这会带来一个小问题。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/transition.html", "title": "Transition | Vue.js", "doc_id": "accf566f306c4b42b1ebe10455a24700", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1496, "chunk_index": 42, "_doc_id": "42_2109631079413702662"}}
{"doc_id": "43_2574492564678331412", "text": "an>s<span><span>;<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span><code><pre><div><p>然而，这会带来一个小问题。默认情况下，<code><Transition><code> 组件会通过监听过渡根元素上的<strong>第一个<strong> <code>transitionend<code> 或者 <code>animationend<code> 事件来尝试自动判断过渡何时结束。而在嵌套的过渡中，期望的行为应该是等待所有内部元素的过渡完成。<p><p>在这种情况下，你可以通过向 <code><Transition><code> 组件传入 <code>duration<code> prop 来显式指定过渡的持续时间 (以毫秒为单位)。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/transition.html", "title": "Transition | Vue.js", "doc_id": "accf566f306c4b42b1ebe10455a24700", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1496, "chunk_index": 43, "_doc_id": "43_2574492564678331412"}}
{"doc_id": "44_8839576733860042666", "text": "成。<p><p>在这种情况下，你可以通过向 <code><Transition><code> 组件传入 <code>duration<code> prop 来显式指定过渡的持续时间 (以毫秒为单位)。总持续时间应该匹配延迟加上内部元素的过渡持续时间：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>Transition<span><span> :<span><span>duration<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>550<span><span>\"<span><span>>...</<span><span>Transition<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p><a href=\"https://play.vuejs.org/#eNqVVd9v0zAQ/leO8LAfr", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/transition.html", "title": "Transition | Vue.js", "doc_id": "accf566f306c4b42b1ebe10455a24700", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1496, "chunk_index": 44, "_doc_id": "44_8839576733860042666"}}
{"doc_id": "45_2482366750268952531", "text": "on<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p><a href=\"https://play.vuejs.org/#", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/transition.html", "title": "Transition | Vue.js", "doc_id": "accf566f306c4b42b1ebe10455a24700", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1496, "chunk_index": 45, "_doc_id": "45_2482366750268952531"}}
{"doc_id": "46_8581649663999166871", "text": "", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/transition.html", "title": "Transition | Vue.js", "doc_id": "accf566f306c4b42b1ebe10455a24700", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1496, "chunk_index": 46, "_doc_id": "46_8581649663999166871"}}
{"doc_id": "47_551354260470909958", "text": "VhiEVJ7GftHZTganUZ56EYLL3FykjhL195MlMM7qxXdmEGDPOG6boRE86UJVPMki+p4H01WLz4Fm78hSdBo5xXy+yfsd3bpbXny1SA1M8c82fgcMyW66L75/hmXtN44a120ktDPOL+h1bL1HCPsA42DaPdwge3HcO/TOCb2ZumQJtA15Yl65Crg84S+BdfPtL6lezY8C3GkZ7L6Bc1zNR0=\" target=\"_blank\">在演练场中尝试一下<a><p><p>如果有必要的话，你也可以用对象的形式传入，", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/transition.html", "title": "Transition | Vue.js", "doc_id": "accf566f306c4b42b1ebe10455a24700", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1496, "chunk_index": 47, "_doc_id": "47_551354260470909958"}}
{"doc_id": "48_8973442325270134574", "text": "tA15Yl65Crg84S+BdfPtL6lezY8C3GkZ7L6Bc1zNR0=\" target=\"_blank\">在演练场中尝试一下<a><p><p>如果有必要的话，你也可以用对象的形式传入，分开指定进入和离开所需的时间：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>Transition<span><span> :<span><span>duration<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>{ enter: <span><span>500<span><span>,", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/transition.html", "title": "Transition | Vue.js", "doc_id": "accf566f306c4b42b1ebe10455a24700", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1496, "chunk_index": 48, "_doc_id": "48_8973442325270134574"}}
{"doc_id": "49_528348088976463451", "text": "n> :<span><span>duration<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>{ enter: <span><span>500<span><span>, leave: <span><span>800<span><span> }<span><span>\"<span><span>>...</<span><span>Transition<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><h3 id=\"performance-considerations\">性能考量 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#performance-considerations\">​<a><h3><p>你可能注意到我们上面例子中展示的动画所用到的 CSS 属性大多是 <code>transform<code> 和 <code>opacity<code> 之类的。用这些属性制作动画非常高效，因为：<p><ol><li><p>他们在动画过程中不会影响到 DOM 结构，因此不会每一帧都触发昂贵的 CSS 布局重新计算。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/transition.html", "title": "Transition | Vue.js", "doc_id": "accf566f306c4b42b1ebe10455a24700", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1496, "chunk_index": 49, "_doc_id": "49_528348088976463451"}}
{"doc_id": "50_9034906497311894044", "text": "code>opacity<code> 之类的。用这些属性制作动画非常高效，因为：<p><ol><li><p>他们在动画过程中不会影响到 DOM 结构，因此不会每一帧都触发昂贵的 CSS 布局重新计算。<p><li><li><p>大多数的现代浏览器都可以在执行 <code>transform<code> 动画时利用 GPU 进行硬件加速。<p><li><ol><p>相比之下，像 <code>height<code> 或者 <code>margin<code> 这样的属性会触发 CSS 布局变动，因此执行它们的动画效果更昂贵，需要谨慎使用。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/transition.html", "title": "Transition | Vue.js", "doc_id": "accf566f306c4b42b1ebe10455a24700", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1496, "chunk_index": 50, "_doc_id": "50_9034906497311894044"}}
{"doc_id": "51_8329313472395862575", "text": "><li><ol><p>相比之下，像 <code>height<code> 或者 <code>margin<code> 这样的属性会触发 CSS 布局变动，因此执行它们的动画效果更昂贵，需要谨慎使用。<p><h2 id=\"javascript-hooks\">JavaScript 钩子 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#javascript-hooks\">​<a><h2><p>你可以通过监听 <code><Transition><code> 组件事件的方式在过渡过程中挂上钩子函数：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>Transition<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/transition.html", "title": "Transition | Vue.js", "doc_id": "accf566f306c4b42b1ebe10455a24700", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1496, "chunk_index": 51, "_doc_id": "51_8329313472395862575"}}
{"doc_id": "52_380478850216114742", "text": "lass=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>Transition<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> @<span><span>before-enter<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>onBeforeEnter<span><span>\"<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> @<span><span>enter<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>onEnter<span><span>\"<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> @<span><span>after-enter<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>onAfterEnter<span><span>\"<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/transition.html", "title": "Transition | Vue.js", "doc_id": "accf566f306c4b42b1ebe10455a24700", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1496, "chunk_index": 52, "_doc_id": "52_380478850216114742"}}
{"doc_id": "53_3198307764226648086", "text": "@<span><span>after-enter<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>onAfterEnter<span><span>\"<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> @<span><span>enter-cancelled<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>onEnterCancelled<span><span>\"<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> @<span><span>before-leave<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>onBeforeLeave<span><span>\"<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> @<span><span>leave<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>onLeave<span><span>\"<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/transition.html", "title": "Transition | Vue.js", "doc_id": "accf566f306c4b42b1ebe10455a24700", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1496, "chunk_index": 53, "_doc_id": "53_3198307764226648086"}}
{"doc_id": "54_2035870883246565603", "text": "ne\"><span> @<span><span>leave<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>onLeave<span><span>\"<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> @<span><span>after-leave<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>onAfterLeave<span><span>\"<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> @<span><span>leave-cancelled<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>onLeaveCancelled<span><span>\"<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <!-- ... --><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/transition.html", "title": "Transition | Vue.js", "doc_id": "accf566f306c4b42b1ebe10455a24700", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1496, "chunk_index": 54, "_doc_id": "54_2035870883246565603"}}
{"doc_id": "55_2643819430073256573", "text": "an><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <!-- ... --><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>Transition<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><div class=\"composition-api\"><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// 在元素被插入到 DOM 之前被调用<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 用这个来设置元素的 \"enter-from\" 状态<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/transition.html", "title": "Transition | Vue.js", "doc_id": "accf566f306c4b42b1ebe10455a24700", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1496, "chunk_index": 55, "_doc_id": "55_2643819430073256573"}}
{"doc_id": "56_3630484507886500990", "text": ">// 在元素被插入到 DOM 之前被调用<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 用这个来设置元素的 \"enter-from\" 状态<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>function<span><span> onBeforeEnter<span><span>(<span><span>el<span><span>) {}<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 在元素被插入到 DOM 之后的下一帧被调用<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 用这个来开始进入动画<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>function<span><span> onEnter<span><span>(<span><span>el<span><span>, <span><span>done<span><span>) {<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/transition.html", "title": "Transition | Vue.js", "doc_id": "accf566f306c4b42b1ebe10455a24700", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1496, "chunk_index": 56, "_doc_id": "56_3630484507886500990"}}
{"doc_id": "57_1053555267352795560", "text": "><span> onEnter<span><span>(<span><span>el<span><span>, <span><span>done<span><span>) {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 调用回调函数 done 表示过渡结束<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 如果与 CSS 结合使用，则这个回调是可选参数<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> done<span><span>()<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 当进入过渡完成时调用。<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/transition.html", "title": "Transition | Vue.js", "doc_id": "accf566f306c4b42b1ebe10455a24700", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1496, "chunk_index": 57, "_doc_id": "57_1053555267352795560"}}
{"doc_id": "58_5713755735495725366", "text": "\"><span>}<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 当进入过渡完成时调用。<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>function<span><span> onAfterEnter<span><span>(<span><span>el<span><span>) {}<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 当进入过渡在完成之前被取消时调用<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>function<span><span> onEnterCancelled<span><span>(<span><span>el<span><span>) {}<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 在 leave 钩子之前调用<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/transition.html", "title": "Transition | Vue.js", "doc_id": "accf566f306c4b42b1ebe10455a24700", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1496, "chunk_index": 58, "_doc_id": "58_5713755735495725366"}}
{"doc_id": "59_96515083574357661", "text": "n>) {}<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 在 leave 钩子之前调用<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 大多数时候，你应该只会用到 leave 钩子<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>function<span><span> onBeforeLeave<span><span>(<span><span>el<span><span>) {}<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 在离开过渡开始时调用<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 用这个来开始离开动画<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/transition.html", "title": "Transition | Vue.js", "doc_id": "accf566f306c4b42b1ebe10455a24700", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1496, "chunk_index": 59, "_doc_id": "59_96515083574357661"}}
{"doc_id": "60_9043737715221652740", "text": "pan class=\"line\"><span>// 在离开过渡开始时调用<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 用这个来开始离开动画<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>function<span><span> onLeave<span><span>(<span><span>el<span><span>, <span><span>done<span><span>) {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 调用回调函数 done 表示过渡结束<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 如果与 CSS 结合使用，则这个回调是可选参数<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> done<span><span>()<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/transition.html", "title": "Transition | Vue.js", "doc_id": "accf566f306c4b42b1ebe10455a24700", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1496, "chunk_index": 60, "_doc_id": "60_9043737715221652740"}}
{"doc_id": "61_4231121452451364329", "text": "an> done<span><span>()<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 在离开过渡完成、<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 且元素已从 DOM 中移除时调用<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>function<span><span> onAfterLeave<span><span>(<span><span>el<span><span>) {}<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 仅在 v-show 过渡中可用<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/transition.html", "title": "Transition | Vue.js", "doc_id": "accf566f306c4b42b1ebe10455a24700", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1496, "chunk_index": 61, "_doc_id": "61_4231121452451364329"}}
