{"doc_id": "63_649695462185701123", "text": "n>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // ...<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> methods: {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 在元素被插入到 DOM 之前被调用<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 用这个来设置元素的 \"enter-from\" 状态<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> onBeforeEnter<span><span>(<span><span>el<span><span>) {},<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 在元素被插入到 DOM 之后的下一帧被调用<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 用这个来开始进入动画<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/transition.html", "title": "Transition | Vue.js", "doc_id": "accf566f306c4b42b1ebe10455a24700", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1496, "chunk_index": 63, "_doc_id": "63_649695462185701123"}}
{"doc_id": "64_1256747520024349801", "text": "ne\"><span> // 在元素被插入到 DOM 之后的下一帧被调用<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 用这个来开始进入动画<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> onEnter<span><span>(<span><span>el<span><span>, <span><span>done<span><span>) {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 调用回调函数 done 表示过渡结束<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 如果与 CSS 结合使用，则这个回调是可选参数<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> done<span><span>()<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> },<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/transition.html", "title": "Transition | Vue.js", "doc_id": "accf566f306c4b42b1ebe10455a24700", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1496, "chunk_index": 64, "_doc_id": "64_1256747520024349801"}}
{"doc_id": "65_2219497949010599797", "text": "> done<span><span>()<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> },<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 当进入过渡完成时调用。<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> onAfterEnter<span><span>(<span><span>el<span><span>) {},<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 当进入过渡在完成之前被取消时调用<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> onEnterCancelled<span><span>(<span><span>el<span><span>) {},<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/transition.html", "title": "Transition | Vue.js", "doc_id": "accf566f306c4b42b1ebe10455a24700", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1496, "chunk_index": 65, "_doc_id": "65_2219497949010599797"}}
{"doc_id": "66_5012233691114779506", "text": "onEnterCancelled<span><span>(<span><span>el<span><span>) {},<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 在 leave 钩子之前调用<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 大多数时候，你应该只会用到 leave 钩子<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> onBeforeLeave<span><span>(<span><span>el<span><span>) {},<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 在离开过渡开始时调用<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 用这个来开始离开动画<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/transition.html", "title": "Transition | Vue.js", "doc_id": "accf566f306c4b42b1ebe10455a24700", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1496, "chunk_index": 66, "_doc_id": "66_5012233691114779506"}}
{"doc_id": "67_7553999889044161850", "text": "n class=\"line\"><span> // 在离开过渡开始时调用<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 用这个来开始离开动画<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> onLeave<span><span>(<span><span>el<span><span>, <span><span>done<span><span>) {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 调用回调函数 done 表示过渡结束<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 如果与 CSS 结合使用，则这个回调是可选参数<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> done<span><span>()<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> },<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/transition.html", "title": "Transition | Vue.js", "doc_id": "accf566f306c4b42b1ebe10455a24700", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1496, "chunk_index": 67, "_doc_id": "67_7553999889044161850"}}
{"doc_id": "68_276330940044829109", "text": "> done<span><span>()<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> },<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 在离开过渡完成、<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 且元素已从 DOM 中移除时调用<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> onAfterLeave<span><span>(<span><span>el<span><span>) {},<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 仅在 v-show 过渡中可用<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> onLeaveCancelled<span><span>(<span><span>el<span><span>) {}<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/transition.html", "title": "Transition | Vue.js", "doc_id": "accf566f306c4b42b1ebe10455a24700", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1496, "chunk_index": 68, "_doc_id": "68_276330940044829109"}}
{"doc_id": "69_2683745487046540999", "text": ">\n<span class=\"line\"><span> onLeaveCancelled<span><span>(<span><span>el<span><span>) {}<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/transition.html", "title": "Transition | Vue.js", "doc_id": "accf566f306c4b42b1ebe10455a24700", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1496, "chunk_index": 69, "_doc_id": "69_2683745487046540999"}}
{"doc_id": "70_6856853347986226359", "text": "lled<span><span>(<span><span>el<span><span>) {}<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span><code><pre><div><div><p>这些钩子可以与 CSS 过渡或动画结合使用，也可以单独使用。<p><p>在使用仅由 JavaScript 执行的动画时，最好是添加一个 <code>:css=\"false\"<code> prop。这显式地向 Vue 表明可以跳过对 CSS 过渡的自动探测。除了性能稍好一些之外，还可以防止 CSS 规则意外地干扰过渡效果：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>Transition<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/transition.html", "title": "Transition | Vue.js", "doc_id": "accf566f306c4b42b1ebe10455a24700", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1496, "chunk_index": 70, "_doc_id": "70_6856853347986226359"}}
{"doc_id": "71_1911640603527884413", "text": "lass=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>Transition<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> ...<span><span>\n<span class=\"line highlighted\"><span> :<span><span>css<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>false<span><span>\"<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> ...<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>Transition<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>在有了 <code>:css=\"false\"<code> 后，我们就自己全权负责控制什么时候过渡结束了。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/transition.html", "title": "Transition | Vue.js", "doc_id": "accf566f306c4b42b1ebe10455a24700", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1496, "chunk_index": 71, "_doc_id": "71_1911640603527884413"}}
{"doc_id": "72_4754013406803684594", "text": "tion<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>在有了 <code>:css=\"false\"<code> 后，我们就自己全权负责控制什么时候过渡结束了。这种情况下对于 <code>@enter<code> 和 <code>@leave<code> 钩子来说，回调函数 <code>done<code> 就是必须的。否则，钩子将被同步调用，过渡将立即完成。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/transition.html", "title": "Transition | Vue.js", "doc_id": "accf566f306c4b42b1ebe10455a24700", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1496, "chunk_index": 72, "_doc_id": "72_4754013406803684594"}}
{"doc_id": "73_3553428350490270845", "text": "种情况下对于 <code>@enter<code> 和 <code>@leave<code> 钩子来说，回调函数 <code>done<code> 就是必须的。否则，钩子将被同步调用，过渡将立即完成。<p><p>这里是使用 <a href=\"https://gsap.com/\" target=\"_blank\">GSAP 库<a>执行动画的一个示例，你也可以使用任何你想要的库，比如 <a href=\"https://animejs.com/\" target=\"_blank\">Anime.js<a> 或者 <a href=\"https://motion.dev/\" target=\"_blank\">Motion One<a>：<p><h2 id=\"reusable-transitions\">可复用过渡效果 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#reusable-transitions\">​<a><h2><p>得益于 Vue 的组件系统，过渡效果是可以被封装复用的。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/transition.html", "title": "Transition | Vue.js", "doc_id": "accf566f306c4b42b1ebe10455a24700", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1496, "chunk_index": 73, "_doc_id": "73_3553428350490270845"}}
{"doc_id": "74_5077162381111389146", "text": "复用过渡效果 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#reusable-transitions\">​<a><h2><p>得益于 Vue 的组件系统，过渡效果是可以被封装复用的。要创建一个可被复用的过渡，我们需要为 <code><Transition><code> 组件创建一个包装组件，并向内传入插槽内容：<p><div class=\"vp-code-block-title\"><p class=\"vp-code-block-title-bar\"><span class=\"vp-code-block-title-text\">MyTransition.vue<span><p><div class=\"language-vue\"> <span class=\"lang\">vue<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>script<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/transition.html", "title": "Transition | Vue.js", "doc_id": "accf566f306c4b42b1ebe10455a24700", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1496, "chunk_index": 74, "_doc_id": "74_5077162381111389146"}}
{"doc_id": "75_3478190894920111019", "text": "ki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>script<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// JavaScript 钩子逻辑...<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>script<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line highlighted\"><span> <!-- 包装内置的 Transition 组件 --><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>Transition<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/transition.html", "title": "Transition | Vue.js", "doc_id": "accf566f306c4b42b1ebe10455a24700", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1496, "chunk_index": 75, "_doc_id": "75_3478190894920111019"}}
{"doc_id": "76_6387094583025086564", "text": "- 包装内置的 Transition 组件 --><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>Transition<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> name<span><span>=<span><span>\"my-transition\"<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> @enter<span><span>=<span><span>\"onEnter\"<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> @leave<span><span>=<span><span>\"onLeave\"<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>slot<span><span>></<span><span>slot<span><span>> <span><span><!-- 向内传递插槽内容 --><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/transition.html", "title": "Transition | Vue.js", "doc_id": "accf566f306c4b42b1ebe10455a24700", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1496, "chunk_index": 76, "_doc_id": "76_6387094583025086564"}}
{"doc_id": "77_3820839984234778715", "text": "an><span>slot<span><span>></<span><span>slot<span><span>> <span><span><!-- 向内传递插槽内容 --><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> </<span><span>Transition<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>style<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>/*<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> 必要的 CSS...<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> 注意：避免在这里使用 <style scoped><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/transition.html", "title": "Transition | Vue.js", "doc_id": "accf566f306c4b42b1ebe10455a24700", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1496, "chunk_index": 77, "_doc_id": "77_3820839984234778715"}}
{"doc_id": "78_7674713318088926894", "text": "line\"><span> 必要的 CSS...<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> 注意：避免在这里使用 <style scoped><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> 因为那不会应用到插槽内容上<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>*/<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/transition.html", "title": "Transition | Vue.js", "doc_id": "accf566f306c4b42b1ebe10455a24700", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1496, "chunk_index": 78, "_doc_id": "78_7674713318088926894"}}
{"doc_id": "79_4177182494649088755", "text": "><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> 因为那不会应用到插槽内容上<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>*/<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>style<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><div><p>现在 <code>MyTransition<code> 可以在导入后像内置组件那样使用了：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>MyTransition<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/transition.html", "title": "Transition | Vue.js", "doc_id": "accf566f306c4b42b1ebe10455a24700", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1496, "chunk_index": 79, "_doc_id": "79_4177182494649088755"}}
{"doc_id": "80_8251730226580289699", "text": "hub-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>MyTransition<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>div<span><span> v-if<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>show<span><span>\"<span><span>>Hello</<span><span>div<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/transition.html", "title": "Transition | Vue.js", "doc_id": "accf566f306c4b42b1ebe10455a24700", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1496, "chunk_index": 80, "_doc_id": "80_8251730226580289699"}}
{"doc_id": "81_9021155498471056870", "text": "an><span>\"<span><span>show<span><span>\"<span><span>>Hello</<span><span>div<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>MyTransition<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><h2 id=\"transition-on-appear\">出现时过渡 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#transition-on-appear\">​<a><h2><p>如果你想在某个节点初次渲染时应用一个过渡效果，你可以添加 <code>appear<code> prop：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>Transition<span><span> appear<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/transition.html", "title": "Transition | Vue.js", "doc_id": "accf566f306c4b42b1ebe10455a24700", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1496, "chunk_index": 81, "_doc_id": "81_9021155498471056870"}}
{"doc_id": "82_3018034618132246983", "text": "><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>Transition<span><span> appear<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> ...<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>Transition<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><h2 id=\"transition-between-elements\">元素间过渡 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#transition-between-elements\">​<a><h2><p>除了通过 <code>v-if<code> / <code>v-show<code> 切换一个元素，我们也可以通过 <code>v-if<code> / <code>v-else<code> / <code>v-else-if<code> 在几个组件间进行切换，", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/transition.html", "title": "Transition | Vue.js", "doc_id": "accf566f306c4b42b1ebe10455a24700", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1496, "chunk_index": 82, "_doc_id": "82_3018034618132246983"}}
{"doc_id": "83_4102038940510081797", "text": "-show<code> 切换一个元素，我们也可以通过 <code>v-if<code> / <code>v-else<code> / <code>v-else-if<code> 在几个组件间进行切换，只要确保任一时刻只会有一个元素被渲染即可：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>Transition<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/transition.html", "title": "Transition | Vue.js", "doc_id": "accf566f306c4b42b1ebe10455a24700", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1496, "chunk_index": 83, "_doc_id": "83_4102038940510081797"}}
{"doc_id": "84_6311032331496635504", "text": "ithub-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>Transition<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>button<span><span> v-if<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>docState <span><span>===<span><span> 'saved'\"<span><span>>Edit</<span><span>button<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/transition.html", "title": "Transition | Vue.js", "doc_id": "accf566f306c4b42b1ebe10455a24700", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1496, "chunk_index": 84, "_doc_id": "84_6311032331496635504"}}
{"doc_id": "85_3783855597502818195", "text": "<span><span>===<span><span> 'saved'\"<span><span>>Edit</<span><span>button<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>button<span><span> v-else-if<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>docState <span><span>===<span><span> 'edited'\"<span><span>>Save</<span><span>button<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/transition.html", "title": "Transition | Vue.js", "doc_id": "accf566f306c4b42b1ebe10455a24700", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1496, "chunk_index": 85, "_doc_id": "85_3783855597502818195"}}
{"doc_id": "86_4783729213267066455", "text": "<span><span>===<span><span> 'edited'\"<span><span>>Save</<span><span>button<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>button<span><span> v-else-if<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>docState <span><span>===<span><span> 'editing'\"<span><span>>Cancel</<span><span>button<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/transition.html", "title": "Transition | Vue.js", "doc_id": "accf566f306c4b42b1ebe10455a24700", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1496, "chunk_index": 86, "_doc_id": "86_4783729213267066455"}}
{"doc_id": "87_4872768282276259771", "text": "an><span>===<span><span> 'editing'\"<span><span>>Cancel</<span><span>button<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>Transition<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><div class=\"demo transition-demo\"><span>Click to cycle through states: <span><p class=\"btn-container\"> Edit <p><div><p><a href=\"https://play.vuejs.org/#eNqdk8tu2zAQRX9loI0SoLLcFN2ostEi6BekmwLa0NTYJkKRBDkSYhj+9wxJO3ZegBGu+Lhz7syQ3Bd/nJtNIxZN0QbplSMISKNbdkYNznqCPXhcwwHW3g5QsrTsTGekNYGgt/KBBCEsouimDGLCvrztTFtnGGN4QTg4zbK4oj", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/transition.html", "title": "Transition | Vue.js", "doc_id": "accf566f306c4b42b1ebe10455a24700", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1496, "chunk_index": 87, "_doc_id": "87_4872768282276259771"}}
{"doc_id": "88_8298220698345370691", "text": "", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/transition.html", "title": "Transition | Vue.js", "doc_id": "accf566f306c4b42b1ebe10455a24700", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1496, "chunk_index": 88, "_doc_id": "88_8298220698345370691"}}
{"doc_id": "89_3080372862138271291", "text": "PTU6jQEPpKyMj8dnmgkQs+HmQcvVTIQK1hPrv7GQAFt9eO9Bk6fZ8Ub52Qiri8eUo+4dbWD02exh79v/nBP+H2PStnwz/jelJ1geKvk/peHJ4BoRZYow==\" target=\"_blank\">在演练场中尝试一下<a><p><h2 id=\"transition-modes\">过渡模式 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#transition-modes\">​<a><h2><p>在之前的例子中，进入和离开的元素都是在同时开始动画的，因此我们不得不将它们设为 <code>position: absolute<code> 以避免二者同时存在时出现的布局问题。<p><p>然而，很多情况下这可能并不符合需求。我们可能想要先执行离开动画，然后在其完成<strong>之后<strong>再执行元素的进入动画。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/transition.html", "title": "Transition | Vue.js", "doc_id": "accf566f306c4b42b1ebe10455a24700", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1496, "chunk_index": 89, "_doc_id": "89_3080372862138271291"}}
{"doc_id": "90_6730047476093643202", "text": "te<code> 以避免二者同时存在时出现的布局问题。<p><p>然而，很多情况下这可能并不符合需求。我们可能想要先执行离开动画，然后在其完成<strong>之后<strong>再执行元素的进入动画。手动编排这样的动画是非常复杂的，好在我们可以通过向 <code><Transition><code> 传入一个 <code>mode<code> prop 来实现这个行为：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>Transition<span><span> mode<span><span>=<span><span>\"out-in\"<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> ...<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/transition.html", "title": "Transition | Vue.js", "doc_id": "accf566f306c4b42b1ebe10455a24700", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1496, "chunk_index": 90, "_doc_id": "90_6730047476093643202"}}
{"doc_id": "91_7090846994262791447", "text": "span><span>=<span><span>\"out-in\"<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> ...<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>Transition<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>将之前的例子改为 <code>mode=\"out-in\"<code> 后是这样：<p><div class=\"demo transition-demo\"><span>Click to cycle through states: <span><p class=\"btn-container\"> Edit <p><div><p><code><Transition><code> 也支持 <code>mode=\"in-out\"<code>，虽然这并不常用。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/transition.html", "title": "Transition | Vue.js", "doc_id": "accf566f306c4b42b1ebe10455a24700", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1496, "chunk_index": 91, "_doc_id": "91_7090846994262791447"}}
{"doc_id": "92_1347797697686295738", "text": "ass=\"btn-container\"> Edit <p><div><p><code><Transition><code> 也支持 <code>mode=\"in-out\"<code>，虽然这并不常用。<p><h2 id=\"transition-between-components\">组件间过渡 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#transition-between-components\">​<a><h2><p><code><Transition><code> 也可以作用于<a href=\"/guide/essentials/component-basics.", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/transition.html", "title": "Transition | Vue.js", "doc_id": "accf566f306c4b42b1ebe10455a24700", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1496, "chunk_index": 92, "_doc_id": "92_1347797697686295738"}}
{"doc_id": "93_7624481364446748869", "text": "n-components\">​<a><h2><p><code><Transition><code> 也可以作用于<a href=\"/guide/essentials/component-basics.html#dynamic-components\">动态组件<a>之间的切换：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>Transition<span><span> name<span><span>=<span><span>\"fade\"<span><span> mode<span><span>=<span><span>\"out-in\"<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/transition.html", "title": "Transition | Vue.js", "doc_id": "accf566f306c4b42b1ebe10455a24700", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1496, "chunk_index": 93, "_doc_id": "93_7624481364446748869"}}
{"doc_id": "94_4040794830437958767", "text": "span>=<span><span>\"fade\"<span><span> mode<span><span>=<span><span>\"out-in\"<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>component<span><span> :<span><span>is<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>activeComponent<span><span>\"<span><span>></<span><span>component<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/transition.html", "title": "Transition | Vue.js", "doc_id": "accf566f306c4b42b1ebe10455a24700", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1496, "chunk_index": 94, "_doc_id": "94_4040794830437958767"}}
{"doc_id": "95_6529327316203247440", "text": "pan><span>activeComponent<span><span>\"<span><span>></<span><span>component<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>Transition<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><h2 id=\"dynamic-transitions\">动态过渡 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#dynamic-transitions\">​<a><h2><p><code><Transition><code> 的 props (比如 <code>name<code>) 也可以是动态的！", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/transition.html", "title": "Transition | Vue.js", "doc_id": "accf566f306c4b42b1ebe10455a24700", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1496, "chunk_index": 95, "_doc_id": "95_6529327316203247440"}}
{"doc_id": "96_4893165499726654303", "text": "ef=\"#dynamic-transitions\">​<a><h2><p><code><Transition><code> 的 props (比如 <code>name<code>) 也可以是动态的！这让我们可以根据状态变化动态地应用不同类型的过渡：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>Transition<span><span> :<span><span>name<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>transitionName<span><span>\"<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <!-- ... --><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/transition.html", "title": "Transition | Vue.js", "doc_id": "accf566f306c4b42b1ebe10455a24700", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1496, "chunk_index": 96, "_doc_id": "96_4893165499726654303"}}
{"doc_id": "97_7670066627722329196", "text": "sitionName<span><span>\"<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <!-- ... --><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>Transition<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>这个特性的用处是可以提前定义好多组 CSS 过渡或动画的 class，然后在它们之间动态切换。<p><p>你也可以根据你的组件的当前状态在 JavaScript 过渡钩子中应用不同的行为。最后，创建动态过渡的终极方式还是创建<a href=\"#reusable-transitions\">可复用的过渡组件<a>，并让这些组件根据动态的 props 来改变过渡的效果。掌握了这些技巧后，就真的只有你想不到，没有做不到的了。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/transition.html", "title": "Transition | Vue.js", "doc_id": "accf566f306c4b42b1ebe10455a24700", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1496, "chunk_index": 97, "_doc_id": "97_7670066627722329196"}}
{"doc_id": "98_6162255785426490009", "text": "创建<a href=\"#reusable-transitions\">可复用的过渡组件<a>，并让这些组件根据动态的 props 来改变过渡的效果。掌握了这些技巧后，就真的只有你想不到，没有做不到的了。<p><h2 id=\"transitions-with-the-key-attribute\">使用 Key Attribute 过渡 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#transitions-with-the-key-attribute\">​<a><h2><p>有时为了触发过渡，你需要强制重新渲染 DOM 元素。<p><p>以计数器组件为例：<p><div class=\"composition-api\"><div class=\"language-vue\"> <span class=\"lang\">vue<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>script<span><span> setup<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/transition.html", "title": "Transition | Vue.js", "doc_id": "accf566f306c4b42b1ebe10455a24700", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1496, "chunk_index": 98, "_doc_id": "98_6162255785426490009"}}
{"doc_id": "99_8202154052025057618", "text": "code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>script<span><span> setup<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>import<span><span> { ref } <span><span>from<span><span> 'vue'<span><span>;<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> count<span><span> =<span><span> ref<span><span>(<span><span>0<span><span>);<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/transition.html", "title": "Transition | Vue.js", "doc_id": "accf566f306c4b42b1ebe10455a24700", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1496, "chunk_index": 99, "_doc_id": "99_8202154052025057618"}}
{"doc_id": "100_6474532782430997103", "text": "an> =<span><span> ref<span><span>(<span><span>0<span><span>);<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>setInterval<span><span>(() <span><span>=><span><span> count.value<span><span>++<span><span>, <span><span>1000<span><span>);<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>script<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>Transition<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/transition.html", "title": "Transition | Vue.js", "doc_id": "accf566f306c4b42b1ebe10455a24700", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1496, "chunk_index": 100, "_doc_id": "100_6474532782430997103"}}
{"doc_id": "101_4457352765584183891", "text": "span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>Transition<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>span<span><span> :key<span><span>=<span><span>\"count\"<span><span>>{{ count }}</<span><span>span<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> </<span><span>Transition<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/transition.html", "title": "Transition | Vue.js", "doc_id": "accf566f306c4b42b1ebe10455a24700", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1496, "chunk_index": 101, "_doc_id": "101_4457352765584183891"}}
{"doc_id": "102_5468443059089553973", "text": "pan><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> </<span><span>Transition<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><div><div class=\"options-api\"><div class=\"language-vue\"> <span class=\"lang\">vue<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>script<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/transition.html", "title": "Transition | Vue.js", "doc_id": "accf566f306c4b42b1ebe10455a24700", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1496, "chunk_index": 102, "_doc_id": "102_5468443059089553973"}}
{"doc_id": "103_9146286879450965686", "text": "n><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> data<span><span>() {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> return<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> count: <span><span>1<span><span>,<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> interval: <span><span>null<span><span> <span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> },<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> mounted<span><span>() {<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/transition.html", "title": "Transition | Vue.js", "doc_id": "accf566f306c4b42b1ebe10455a24700", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1496, "chunk_index": 103, "_doc_id": "103_9146286879450965686"}}
{"doc_id": "104_7497629229146460101", "text": "an class=\"line\"><span> },<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> mounted<span><span>() {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> this<span><span>.interval <span><span>=<span><span> setInterval<span><span>(() <span><span>=><span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> this<span><span>.count<span><span>++<span><span>;<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }, <span><span>1000<span><span>)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> },<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/transition.html", "title": "Transition | Vue.js", "doc_id": "accf566f306c4b42b1ebe10455a24700", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1496, "chunk_index": 104, "_doc_id": "104_7497629229146460101"}}
{"doc_id": "105_8268935776809589815", "text": "\"line\"><span> }, <span><span>1000<span><span>)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> },<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> beforeDestroy<span><span>() {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> clearInterval<span><span>(<span><span>this<span><span>.interval)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>script<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/transition.html", "title": "Transition | Vue.js", "doc_id": "accf566f306c4b42b1ebe10455a24700", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1496, "chunk_index": 105, "_doc_id": "105_8268935776809589815"}}
{"doc_id": "106_6916673441267420107", "text": "n>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>script<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>Transition<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>span<span><span> :key<span><span>=<span><span>\"count\"<span><span>>{{ count }}</<span><span>span<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> </<span><span>Transition<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/transition.html", "title": "Transition | Vue.js", "doc_id": "accf566f306c4b42b1ebe10455a24700", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1496, "chunk_index": 106, "_doc_id": "106_6916673441267420107"}}
{"doc_id": "107_8481314625245442111", "text": "pan><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> </<span><span>Transition<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><div><p>如果不使用 <code>key<code> attribute，则只有文本节点会被更新，因此不会发生过渡。但是，有了 <code>key<code> 属性，Vue 就知道在 <code>count<code> 改变时创建一个新的 <code>span<code> 元素，因此 <code>Transition<code> 组件有两个不同的元素在它们之间进行过渡。<p>\n<p><strong>参考<strong><p><div><div>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/transition.html", "title": "Transition | Vue.js", "doc_id": "accf566f306c4b42b1ebe10455a24700", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1496, "chunk_index": 107, "_doc_id": "107_8481314625245442111"}}
{"doc_id": "0_6195690396277888618", "text": "<div><div><h1 id=\"introduction\">简介 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#introduction\">​<a><h1><h2 id=\"what-is-vue\">什么是 Vue？ <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#what-is-vue\">​<a><h2><p>Vue (发音为 /vjuː/，类似 <strong>view<strong>) 是一款用于构建用户界面的 JavaScript 框架。它基于标准 HTML、CSS 和 JavaScript 构建，并提供了一套声明式的、组件化的编程模型，帮助你高效地开发用户界面。无论是简单还是复杂的界面，Vue 都可以胜任。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/introduction.html#api-styles", "title": "简介 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "d88f39f1c00d42f39fdb3b5a89849546", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 608, "chunk_index": 0, "_doc_id": "0_6195690396277888618"}}
{"doc_id": "1_2310898484692219515", "text": "avaScript 框架。它基于标准 HTML、CSS 和 JavaScript 构建，并提供了一套声明式的、组件化的编程模型，帮助你高效地开发用户界面。无论是简单还是复杂的界面，Vue 都可以胜任。<p><p>下面是一个最基本的示例：<p><div class=\"options-api\"><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>import<span><span> { createApp } <span><span>from<span><span> 'vue'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>createApp<span><span>({<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> data<span><span>() {<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/introduction.html#api-styles", "title": "简介 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "d88f39f1c00d42f39fdb3b5a89849546", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 608, "chunk_index": 1, "_doc_id": "1_2310898484692219515"}}
{"doc_id": "2_9088306374990737604", "text": "span>createApp<span><span>({<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> data<span><span>() {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> return<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> count: <span><span>0<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/introduction.html#api-styles", "title": "简介 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "d88f39f1c00d42f39fdb3b5a89849546", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 608, "chunk_index": 2, "_doc_id": "2_9088306374990737604"}}
{"doc_id": "3_4137586470103774591", "text": "<span>0<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}).<span><span>mount<span><span>(<span><span>'#app'<span><span>)<span><span><code><pre><div><div><div class=\"composition-api\"><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>import<span><span> { createApp, ref } <span><span>from<span><span> 'vue'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/introduction.html#api-styles", "title": "简介 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "d88f39f1c00d42f39fdb3b5a89849546", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 608, "chunk_index": 3, "_doc_id": "3_4137586470103774591"}}
{"doc_id": "4_6823495640349235277", "text": "><span> { createApp, ref } <span><span>from<span><span> 'vue'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>createApp<span><span>({<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> setup<span><span>() {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> return<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> count: <span><span>ref<span><span>(<span><span>0<span><span>)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/introduction.html#api-styles", "title": "简介 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "d88f39f1c00d42f39fdb3b5a89849546", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 608, "chunk_index": 4, "_doc_id": "4_6823495640349235277"}}
{"doc_id": "5_7663912033941130300", "text": "<span>)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}).<span><span>mount<span><span>(<span><span>'#app'<span><span>)<span><span><code><pre><div><div><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>div<span><span> id<span><span>=<span><span>\"app\"<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/introduction.html#api-styles", "title": "简介 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "d88f39f1c00d42f39fdb3b5a89849546", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 608, "chunk_index": 5, "_doc_id": "5_7663912033941130300"}}
{"doc_id": "6_2778405578743970960", "text": "\"line\"><span><<span><span>div<span><span> id<span><span>=<span><span>\"app\"<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>button<span><span> @<span><span>click<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>count<span><span>++<span><span>\"<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> Count is: {{ count }}<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> </<span><span>button<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/introduction.html#api-styles", "title": "简介 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "d88f39f1c00d42f39fdb3b5a89849546", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 608, "chunk_index": 6, "_doc_id": "6_2778405578743970960"}}
{"doc_id": "7_1884745853012702980", "text": "is: {{ count }}<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> </<span><span>button<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>div<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p><strong>结果展示<strong><p><p class=\"demo\"> Count is: 0 <p><p>上面的示例展示了 Vue 的两个核心功能：<p><p>你可能已经有了些疑问——先别急，在后续的文档中我们会详细介绍每一个细节。现在，请继续看下去，以确保你对 Vue 作为一个框架到底提供了什么有一个宏观的了解。<p><div class=\"tip custom-block\"><p class=\"custom-block-title\">预备知识<p><p>文档接下来的内容会假设你对 HTML、CSS 和 JavaScript 已经基本熟悉。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/introduction.html#api-styles", "title": "简介 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "d88f39f1c00d42f39fdb3b5a89849546", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 608, "chunk_index": 7, "_doc_id": "7_1884745853012702980"}}
{"doc_id": "8_7395723620062868592", "text": "ip custom-block\"><p class=\"custom-block-title\">预备知识<p><p>文档接下来的内容会假设你对 HTML、CSS 和 JavaScript 已经基本熟悉。如果你对前端开发完全陌生，最好不要直接从一个框架开始进行入门学习——最好是掌握了基础知识再回到这里。如有需要，你可以通过这些 <a href=\"https://developer.mozilla.org/zh-CN/docs/Web/JavaScript/A_re-introduction_to_JavaScript\" target=\"_blank\">JavaScript<a>、<a href=\"https://developer.mozilla.org/zh-CN/docs/Learn/HTML/Introduction_to_HTML\" target=\"_blank\">HTML<a> 和 <a href=\"https://developer.mozilla.org/zh-CN/docs/Learn/CSS/First_steps\" target=\"_blank\">CSS<a> 概述来检验你的知识水平。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/introduction.html#api-styles", "title": "简介 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "d88f39f1c00d42f39fdb3b5a89849546", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 608, "chunk_index": 8, "_doc_id": "8_7395723620062868592"}}
{"doc_id": "9_4378384526126207920", "text": "\"https://developer.mozilla.org/zh-CN/docs/Learn/CSS/First_steps\" target=\"_blank\">CSS<a> 概述来检验你的知识水平。如果之前有其他框架的经验会很有帮助，但也不是必须的。<p><div><h2 id=\"the-progressive-framework\">渐进式框架 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#the-progressive-framework\">​<a><h2><p>Vue 是一个框架，也是一个生态。其功能覆盖了大部分前端开发常见的需求。但 Web 世界是十分多样化的，不同的开发者在 Web 上构建的东西可能在形式和规模上会有很大的不同。考虑到这一点，Vue 的设计非常注重灵活性和“可以被逐步集成”这个特点。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/introduction.html#api-styles", "title": "简介 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "d88f39f1c00d42f39fdb3b5a89849546", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 608, "chunk_index": 9, "_doc_id": "9_4378384526126207920"}}
{"doc_id": "10_6469574026980243246", "text": "大部分前端开发常见的需求。但 Web 世界是十分多样化的，不同的开发者在 Web 上构建的东西可能在形式和规模上会有很大的不同。考虑到这一点，Vue 的设计非常注重灵活性和“可以被逐步集成”这个特点。根据你的需求场景，你可以用不同的方式使用 Vue：<p><ul><li>无需构建步骤，渐进式增强静态的 HTML<li><li>在任何页面中作为 Web Components 嵌入<li><li>单页应用 (SPA)<li><li>全栈 / 服务端渲染 (SSR)<li><li>Jamstack / 静态站点生成 (SSG)<li><li>开发桌面端、移动端、WebGL，甚至是命令行终端中的界面<li><ul><p>如果你是初学者，可能会觉得这些概念有些复杂。别担心！理解教程和指南的内容只需要具备基础的 HTML 和 JavaScript 知识。即使你不是这些方面的专家，也能够跟得上。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/introduction.html#api-styles", "title": "简介 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "d88f39f1c00d42f39fdb3b5a89849546", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 608, "chunk_index": 10, "_doc_id": "10_6469574026980243246"}}
{"doc_id": "11_4640243842580244956", "text": "的界面<li><ul><p>如果你是初学者，可能会觉得这些概念有些复杂。别担心！理解教程和指南的内容只需要具备基础的 HTML 和 JavaScript 知识。即使你不是这些方面的专家，也能够跟得上。<p><p>如果你是有经验的开发者，希望了解如何以最合适的方式在项目中引入 Vue，或者是对上述的这些概念感到好奇，我们在<a href=\"/guide/extras/ways-of-using-vue.html\">使用 Vue 的多种方式<a>中讨论了有关它们的更多细节。<p><p>无论再怎么灵活，Vue 的核心知识在所有这些用例中都是通用的。即使你现在只是一个初学者，随着你的不断成长，到未来有能力实现更复杂的项目时，这一路上获得的知识依然会适用。如果你已经是一个老手，你可以根据实际场景来选择使用 Vue 的最佳方式，在各种场景下都可以保持同样的开发效率。这就是为什么我们将 Vue 称为“渐进式框架”：它是一个可以与你共同成长、适应你不同需求的框架。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/introduction.html#api-styles", "title": "简介 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "d88f39f1c00d42f39fdb3b5a89849546", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 608, "chunk_index": 11, "_doc_id": "11_4640243842580244956"}}
{"doc_id": "12_2529682173667876941", "text": "已经是一个老手，你可以根据实际场景来选择使用 Vue 的最佳方式，在各种场景下都可以保持同样的开发效率。这就是为什么我们将 Vue 称为“渐进式框架”：它是一个可以与你共同成长、适应你不同需求的框架。<p><h2 id=\"single-file-components\">单文件组件 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#single-file-components\">​<a><h2><p>在大多数启用了构建工具的 Vue 项目中，我们可以使用一种类似 HTML 格式的文件来书写 Vue 组件，它被称为<strong>单文件组件<strong> (也被称为 <code>*.vue<code> 文件，英文 Single-File Components，缩写为 <strong>SFC<strong>)。顾名思义，Vue 的单文件组件会将一个组件的逻辑 (JavaScript)，模板 (HTML) 和样式 (CSS) 封装在同一个文件里。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/introduction.html#api-styles", "title": "简介 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "d88f39f1c00d42f39fdb3b5a89849546", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 608, "chunk_index": 12, "_doc_id": "12_2529682173667876941"}}
{"doc_id": "13_5617914003319960098", "text": "onents，缩写为 <strong>SFC<strong>)。顾名思义，Vue 的单文件组件会将一个组件的逻辑 (JavaScript)，模板 (HTML) 和样式 (CSS) 封装在同一个文件里。下面我们将用单文件组件的格式重写上面的计数器示例：<p><div class=\"options-api\"><div class=\"language-vue\"> <span class=\"lang\">vue<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>script<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> data<span><span>() {<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/introduction.html#api-styles", "title": "简介 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "d88f39f1c00d42f39fdb3b5a89849546", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 608, "chunk_index": 13, "_doc_id": "13_5617914003319960098"}}
{"doc_id": "14_8565640116576850227", "text": "<span> default<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> data<span><span>() {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> return<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> count: <span><span>0<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>script<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/introduction.html#api-styles", "title": "简介 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "d88f39f1c00d42f39fdb3b5a89849546", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 608, "chunk_index": 14, "_doc_id": "14_8565640116576850227"}}
{"doc_id": "15_6260419395909631856", "text": ">\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>button<span><span> @click<span><span>=<span><span>\"count++\"<span><span>>Count is: {{ count }}</<span><span>button<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>style<span><span> scoped<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/introduction.html#api-styles", "title": "简介 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "d88f39f1c00d42f39fdb3b5a89849546", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 608, "chunk_index": 15, "_doc_id": "15_6260419395909631856"}}
{"doc_id": "16_4175312891501675067", "text": "ine\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>style<span><span> scoped<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>button<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> font-weight<span><span>: <span><span>bold<span><span>;<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/introduction.html#api-styles", "title": "简介 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "d88f39f1c00d42f39fdb3b5a89849546", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 608, "chunk_index": 16, "_doc_id": "16_4175312891501675067"}}
{"doc_id": "17_4813006113887291885", "text": "eight<span><span>: <span><span>bold<span><span>;<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>style<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><div><div class=\"composition-api\"><div class=\"language-vue\"> <span class=\"lang\">vue<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>script<span><span> setup<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>import<span><span> { ref } <span><span>from<span><span> 'vue'<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/introduction.html#api-styles", "title": "简介 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "d88f39f1c00d42f39fdb3b5a89849546", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 608, "chunk_index": 17, "_doc_id": "17_4813006113887291885"}}
{"doc_id": "18_1836124839863404144", "text": "<span class=\"line\"><span>import<span><span> { ref } <span><span>from<span><span> 'vue'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> count<span><span> =<span><span> ref<span><span>(<span><span>0<span><span>)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>script<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/introduction.html#api-styles", "title": "简介 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "d88f39f1c00d42f39fdb3b5a89849546", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 608, "chunk_index": 18, "_doc_id": "18_1836124839863404144"}}
{"doc_id": "19_6260419395909631856", "text": ">\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>button<span><span> @click<span><span>=<span><span>\"count++\"<span><span>>Count is: {{ count }}</<span><span>button<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>style<span><span> scoped<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/introduction.html#api-styles", "title": "简介 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "d88f39f1c00d42f39fdb3b5a89849546", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 608, "chunk_index": 19, "_doc_id": "19_6260419395909631856"}}
{"doc_id": "20_8949425938603497908", "text": "ine\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>style<span><span> scoped<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>button<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> font-weight<span><span>: <span><span>bold<span><span>;<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>style<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><div><p>单文件组件是 Vue 的标志性功能。如果你的用例需要进行构建，我们推荐用它来编写 Vue 组件。你可以在后续相关章节里了解更多关于<a href=\"/guide/scaling-up/sfc.html\">单文件组件的用法及用途<a>。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/introduction.html#api-styles", "title": "简介 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "d88f39f1c00d42f39fdb3b5a89849546", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 608, "chunk_index": 20, "_doc_id": "20_8949425938603497908"}}
{"doc_id": "21_5674691541579578437", "text": "。如果你的用例需要进行构建，我们推荐用它来编写 Vue 组件。你可以在后续相关章节里了解更多关于<a href=\"/guide/scaling-up/sfc.html\">单文件组件的用法及用途<a>。但你暂时只需要知道 Vue 会帮忙处理所有这些构建工具的配置就好。<p><h2 id=\"api-styles\">API 风格 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#api-styles\">​<a><h2><p>Vue 的组件可以按两种不同的风格书写：<strong>选项式 API<strong> 和<strong>组合式 API<strong>。<p><h3 id=\"options-api\">选项式 API (Options API) <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#options-api\">​<a><h3><p>使用选项式 API，我们可以用包含多个选项的对象来描述组件的逻辑，例如 <code>data<code>、<code>methods<code> 和 <code>mounted<code>。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/introduction.html#api-styles", "title": "简介 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "d88f39f1c00d42f39fdb3b5a89849546", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 608, "chunk_index": 21, "_doc_id": "21_5674691541579578437"}}
{"doc_id": "22_2215028053069610680", "text": "3><p>使用选项式 API，我们可以用包含多个选项的对象来描述组件的逻辑，例如 <code>data<code>、<code>methods<code> 和 <code>mounted<code>。选项所定义的属性都会暴露在函数内部的 <code>this<code> 上，它会指向当前的组件实例。<p><div class=\"language-vue\"> <span class=\"lang\">vue<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>script<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // data() 返回的属性将会成为响应式的状态<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/introduction.html#api-styles", "title": "简介 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "d88f39f1c00d42f39fdb3b5a89849546", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 608, "chunk_index": 22, "_doc_id": "22_2215028053069610680"}}
{"doc_id": "23_7683725257088490179", "text": "> default<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // data() 返回的属性将会成为响应式的状态<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 并且暴露在 `this` 上<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> data<span><span>() {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> return<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> count: <span><span>0<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> },<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // methods 是一些用来更改状态与触发更新的函数<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/introduction.html#api-styles", "title": "简介 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "d88f39f1c00d42f39fdb3b5a89849546", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 608, "chunk_index": 23, "_doc_id": "23_7683725257088490179"}}
{"doc_id": "24_8301187445160809254", "text": "<span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // methods 是一些用来更改状态与触发更新的函数<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 它们可以在模板中作为事件处理器绑定<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> methods: {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> increment<span><span>() {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> this<span><span>.count<span><span>++<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> },<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/introduction.html#api-styles", "title": "简介 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "d88f39f1c00d42f39fdb3b5a89849546", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 608, "chunk_index": 24, "_doc_id": "24_8301187445160809254"}}
{"doc_id": "25_3637227316009041358", "text": "lass=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> },<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 生命周期钩子会在组件生命周期的各个不同阶段被调用<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 例如这个函数就会在组件挂载完成后被调用<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> mounted<span><span>() {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> console.<span><span>log<span><span>(<span><span>`The initial count is ${<span><span>this<span><span>.<span><span>count<span><span>}.`<span><span>)<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/introduction.html#api-styles", "title": "简介 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "d88f39f1c00d42f39fdb3b5a89849546", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 608, "chunk_index": 25, "_doc_id": "25_3637227316009041358"}}
{"doc_id": "26_8069774467973902824", "text": "l count is ${<span><span>this<span><span>.<span><span>count<span><span>}.`<span><span>)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>script<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/introduction.html#api-styles", "title": "简介 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "d88f39f1c00d42f39fdb3b5a89849546", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 608, "chunk_index": 26, "_doc_id": "26_8069774467973902824"}}
{"doc_id": "27_4142232790080792802", "text": ">\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>button<span><span> @click<span><span>=<span><span>\"increment\"<span><span>>Count is: {{ count }}</<span><span>button<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p><a href=\"https://play.vuejs.", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/introduction.html#api-styles", "title": "简介 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "d88f39f1c00d42f39fdb3b5a89849546", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 608, "chunk_index": 27, "_doc_id": "27_4142232790080792802"}}
{"doc_id": "28_2213952547221158404", "text": "<span></<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p><a href=\"https://play.vuejs.org/#\" target=\"_blank\">在演练场中尝试一下<a><p><h3 id=\"composition-api\">组合式 API (Composition API) <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#composition-api\">​<a><h3><p>通过组合式 API，", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/introduction.html#api-styles", "title": "简介 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "d88f39f1c00d42f39fdb3b5a89849546", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 608, "chunk_index": 28, "_doc_id": "28_2213952547221158404"}}
{"doc_id": "29_1651189994659790155", "text": "pi\">组合式 API (Composition API) <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#composition-api\">​<a><h3><p>通过组合式 API，我们可以使用导入的 API 函数来描述组件逻辑。在单文件组件中，组合式 API 通常会与 <a href=\"/api/sfc-script-setup.html\"><code><script setup><code><a> 搭配使用。这个 <code>setup<code> attribute 是一个标识，告诉 Vue 需要在编译时进行一些处理，让我们可以更简洁地使用组合式 API。比如，<code><script setup><code> 中的导入和顶层变量/函数都能够在模板中直接使用。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/introduction.html#api-styles", "title": "简介 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "d88f39f1c00d42f39fdb3b5a89849546", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 608, "chunk_index": 29, "_doc_id": "29_1651189994659790155"}}
{"doc_id": "30_5612223095310491903", "text": "是一个标识，告诉 Vue 需要在编译时进行一些处理，让我们可以更简洁地使用组合式 API。比如，<code><script setup><code> 中的导入和顶层变量/函数都能够在模板中直接使用。<p><p>下面是使用了组合式 API 与 <code><script setup><code> 改造后和上面的模板完全一样的组件：<p><div class=\"language-vue\"> <span class=\"lang\">vue<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>script<span><span> setup<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>import<span><span> { ref, onMounted } <span><span>from<span><span> 'vue'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/introduction.html#api-styles", "title": "简介 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "d88f39f1c00d42f39fdb3b5a89849546", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 608, "chunk_index": 30, "_doc_id": "30_5612223095310491903"}}
{"doc_id": "31_7884051637221108308", "text": "><span> { ref, onMounted } <span><span>from<span><span> 'vue'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 响应式状态<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> count<span><span> =<span><span> ref<span><span>(<span><span>0<span><span>)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 用来修改状态、触发更新的函数<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>function<span><span> increment<span><span>() {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> count.value<span><span>++<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/introduction.html#api-styles", "title": "简介 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "d88f39f1c00d42f39fdb3b5a89849546", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 608, "chunk_index": 31, "_doc_id": "31_7884051637221108308"}}
{"doc_id": "32_348882740248355580", "text": "crement<span><span>() {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> count.value<span><span>++<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 生命周期钩子<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>onMounted<span><span>(() <span><span>=><span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> console.<span><span>log<span><span>(<span><span>`The initial count is ${<span><span>count<span><span>.<span><span>value<span><span>}.`<span><span>)<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/introduction.html#api-styles", "title": "简介 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "d88f39f1c00d42f39fdb3b5a89849546", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 608, "chunk_index": 32, "_doc_id": "32_348882740248355580"}}
{"doc_id": "33_5907192768914987514", "text": "count is ${<span><span>count<span><span>.<span><span>value<span><span>}.`<span><span>)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>})<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>script<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>button<span><span> @click<span><span>=<span><span>\"increment\"<span><span>>Count is: {{ count }}</<span><span>button<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/introduction.html#api-styles", "title": "简介 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "d88f39f1c00d42f39fdb3b5a89849546", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 608, "chunk_index": 33, "_doc_id": "33_5907192768914987514"}}
{"doc_id": "34_6320785963014803155", "text": "an><span>\"increment\"<span><span>>Count is: {{ count }}</<span><span>button<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p><a href=\"https://play.vuejs.", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/introduction.html#api-styles", "title": "简介 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "d88f39f1c00d42f39fdb3b5a89849546", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 608, "chunk_index": 34, "_doc_id": "34_6320785963014803155"}}
{"doc_id": "35_7956677031619130184", "text": "<span></<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p><a href=\"https://play.vuejs.org/#\" target=\"_blank\">在演练场中尝试一下<a><p><h3 id=\"which-to-choose\">该选哪一个？", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/introduction.html#api-styles", "title": "简介 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "d88f39f1c00d42f39fdb3b5a89849546", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 608, "chunk_index": 35, "_doc_id": "35_7956677031619130184"}}
{"doc_id": "36_4418537480255177406", "text": "rIrr5+Z7hnneQnJu6hURvKl3ryL/ARrVkuI=\" target=\"_blank\">在演练场中尝试一下<a><p><h3 id=\"which-to-choose\">该选哪一个？ <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#which-to-choose\">​<a><h3><p>两种 API 风格都能够覆盖大部分的应用场景。它们只是同一个底层系统所提供的两套不同的接口。实际上，选项式 API 是在组合式 API 的基础上实现的！关于 Vue 的基础概念和知识在它们之间都是通用的。<p><p>选项式 API 以“组件实例”的概念为中心 (即上述例子中的 <code>this<code>)，对于有面向对象语言背景的用户来说，这通常与基于类的心智模型更为一致。同时，它将响应性相关的细节抽象出来，并强制按照选项来组织代码，从而对初学者而言更为友好。<p><p>组合式 API 的核心思想是直接在函数作用域内定义响应式状态变量，并将从多个函数中得到的状态组合起来处理复杂问题。这种形式更加自由，也需要你对 Vue 的响应式系统有更深的理解才能高效使用。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/introduction.html#api-styles", "title": "简介 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "d88f39f1c00d42f39fdb3b5a89849546", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 608, "chunk_index": 36, "_doc_id": "36_4418537480255177406"}}
{"doc_id": "37_6591830192225633564", "text": "p><p>组合式 API 的核心思想是直接在函数作用域内定义响应式状态变量，并将从多个函数中得到的状态组合起来处理复杂问题。这种形式更加自由，也需要你对 Vue 的响应式系统有更深的理解才能高效使用。相应的，它的灵活性也使得组织和重用逻辑的模式变得更加强大。<p><p>在<a href=\"/guide/extras/composition-api-faq.html\">组合式 API FAQ<a> 章节中，你可以了解更多关于这两种 API 风格的对比以及组合式 API 所带来的潜在收益。<p><p>如果你是使用 Vue 的新手，这里是我们的大致建议：<p><p>在学习阶段，你不必只固守一种风格。在接下来的文档中我们会为你提供一系列两种风格的代码供你参考，你可以随时通过左上角的 <strong>API 风格偏好<strong>来做切换。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/introduction.html#api-styles", "title": "简介 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "d88f39f1c00d42f39fdb3b5a89849546", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 608, "chunk_index": 37, "_doc_id": "37_6591830192225633564"}}
{"doc_id": "38_8922799502895209953", "text": "的大致建议：<p><p>在学习阶段，你不必只固守一种风格。在接下来的文档中我们会为你提供一系列两种风格的代码供你参考，你可以随时通过左上角的 <strong>API 风格偏好<strong>来做切换。<p><h2 id=\"still-got-questions\">还有其他问题？ <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#still-got-questions\">​<a><h2><p>请查看我们的 <a href=\"/about/faq.html\">FAQ<a>。<p><h2 id=\"pick-your-learning-path\">选择你的学习路径 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#pick-your-learning-path\">​<a><h2><p>不同的开发者有不同的学习方式。尽管在可能的情况下，我们推荐你通读所有内容，但你还是可以自由地选择一种自己喜欢的学习路径！<p><div><div>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/introduction.html#api-styles", "title": "简介 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "d88f39f1c00d42f39fdb3b5a89849546", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 608, "chunk_index": 38, "_doc_id": "38_8922799502895209953"}}
{"doc_id": "0_3341087903909421872", "text": "<div><div><h1 id=\"form-input-bindings\">表单输入绑定 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#form-input-bindings\">​<a><h1><p>在前端处理表单时，我们常常需要将表单输入框的内容同步给 JavaScript 中相应的变量。手动连接值绑定和更改事件监听器可能会很麻烦：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>input<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> :<span><span>value<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>text<span><span>\"<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/forms.html", "title": "表单输入绑定", "doc_id": "13c92f8edd764e929f47f6f54c29e00e", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 829, "chunk_index": 0, "_doc_id": "0_3341087903909421872"}}
{"doc_id": "1_3641339052302571928", "text": "\"line\"><span> :<span><span>value<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>text<span><span>\"<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> @<span><span>input<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>event<span><span> =><span><span> text <span><span>=<span><span> event.target.", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/forms.html", "title": "表单输入绑定", "doc_id": "13c92f8edd764e929f47f6f54c29e00e", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 829, "chunk_index": 1, "_doc_id": "1_3641339052302571928"}}
{"doc_id": "2_253875158273147579", "text": "pan><span>\"<span><span>event<span><span> =><span><span> text <span><span>=<span><span> event.target.value<span><span>\"<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p><code>v-model<code> 指令帮我们简化了这一步骤：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>input<span><span> v-model<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>text<span><span>\"<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>另外，<code>v-model<code> 还可以用于各种不同类型的输入，", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/forms.html", "title": "表单输入绑定", "doc_id": "13c92f8edd764e929f47f6f54c29e00e", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 829, "chunk_index": 2, "_doc_id": "2_253875158273147579"}}
{"doc_id": "3_1163447404215918813", "text": ">text<span><span>\"<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>另外，<code>v-model<code> 还可以用于各种不同类型的输入，<code><textarea><code>、<code><select><code> 元素。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/forms.html", "title": "表单输入绑定", "doc_id": "13c92f8edd764e929f47f6f54c29e00e", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 829, "chunk_index": 3, "_doc_id": "3_1163447404215918813"}}
{"doc_id": "4_7380933201847730474", "text": "e><pre><div><p>另外，<code>v-model<code> 还可以用于各种不同类型的输入，<code><textarea><code>、<code><select><code> 元素。它会根据所使用的元素自动使用对应的 DOM 属性和事件组合：<p><ul><li>文本类型的 <code><input><code> 和 <code><textarea><code> 元素会绑定 <code>value<code> property 并侦听 <code>input<code> 事件；<li><li><code><input type=\"checkbox\"><code> 和 <code><input type=\"radio\"><code> 会绑定 <code>checked<code> property 并侦听 <code>change<code> 事件；<li><li><code><select><code> 会绑定 <code>value<code> property 并侦听 <code>change<code> 事件。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/forms.html", "title": "表单输入绑定", "doc_id": "13c92f8edd764e929f47f6f54c29e00e", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 829, "chunk_index": 4, "_doc_id": "4_7380933201847730474"}}
{"doc_id": "5_5440706390359119007", "text": "ange<code> 事件；<li><li><code><select><code> 会绑定 <code>value<code> property 并侦听 <code>change<code> 事件。<li><ul><div class=\"tip custom-block\"><p class=\"custom-block-title\">注意<p><p><code>v-model<code> 会忽略任何表单元素上初始的 <code>value<code>、<code>checked<code> 或 <code>selected<code> attribute。它将始终将当前绑定的 JavaScript 状态视为数据的正确来源。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/forms.html", "title": "表单输入绑定", "doc_id": "13c92f8edd764e929f47f6f54c29e00e", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 829, "chunk_index": 5, "_doc_id": "5_5440706390359119007"}}
{"doc_id": "6_6424024299532887064", "text": ">value<code>、<code>checked<code> 或 <code>selected<code> attribute。它将始终将当前绑定的 JavaScript 状态视为数据的正确来源。你应该在 JavaScript 中使用<span class=\"options-api\"><a href=\"/api/options-state.html#data\"><code>data<code><a> 选项<span><span class=\"composition-api\"><a href=\"/api/reactivity-core.html#reactivity-api-core\">响应式系统的 API<a><span>来声明该初始值。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/forms.html", "title": "表单输入绑定", "doc_id": "13c92f8edd764e929f47f6f54c29e00e", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 829, "chunk_index": 6, "_doc_id": "6_6424024299532887064"}}
{"doc_id": "7_4777991693740135493", "text": "composition-api\"><a href=\"/api/reactivity-core.html#reactivity-api-core\">响应式系统的 API<a><span>来声明该初始值。<p><div><h2 id=\"basic-usage\">基本用法 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#basic-usage\">​<a><h2><h3 id=\"text\">文本 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#text\">​<a><h3><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>p<span><span>>Message is: {{ message }}</<span><span>p<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/forms.html", "title": "表单输入绑定", "doc_id": "13c92f8edd764e929f47f6f54c29e00e", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 829, "chunk_index": 7, "_doc_id": "7_4777991693740135493"}}
{"doc_id": "8_759306434887467502", "text": "><span><<span><span>p<span><span>>Message is: {{ message }}</<span><span>p<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>input<span><span> v-model<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>message<span><span>\"<span><span> placeholder<span><span>=<span><span>\"edit me\"<span><span> /><span><span><code><pre><div><p><span id=\"vmodel-ime-tip\"><span><p><div class=\"tip custom-block\"><p class=\"custom-block-title\">注意<p><p>对于需要使用 <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Input_method\" target=\"_blank\">IME<a> 的语言 (中文，日文和韩文等)，你会发现 <code>v-model<code> 不会在 IME 输入还在拼字阶段时触发更新。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/forms.html", "title": "表单输入绑定", "doc_id": "13c92f8edd764e929f47f6f54c29e00e", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 829, "chunk_index": 8, "_doc_id": "8_759306434887467502"}}
{"doc_id": "9_1322147664109379704", "text": "Input_method\" target=\"_blank\">IME<a> 的语言 (中文，日文和韩文等)，你会发现 <code>v-model<code> 不会在 IME 输入还在拼字阶段时触发更新。如果你的确想在拼字阶段也触发更新，请直接使用自己的 <code>input<code> 事件监听器和 <code>value<code> 绑定而不要使用 <code>v-model<code>。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/forms.html", "title": "表单输入绑定", "doc_id": "13c92f8edd764e929f47f6f54c29e00e", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 829, "chunk_index": 9, "_doc_id": "9_1322147664109379704"}}
{"doc_id": "10_6324349659645685497", "text": "更新。如果你的确想在拼字阶段也触发更新，请直接使用自己的 <code>input<code> 事件监听器和 <code>value<code> 绑定而不要使用 <code>v-model<code>。<p><div><h3 id=\"multiline-text\">多行文本 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#multiline-text\">​<a><h3><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>span<span><span>>Multiline message is:</<span><span>span<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/forms.html", "title": "表单输入绑定", "doc_id": "13c92f8edd764e929f47f6f54c29e00e", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 829, "chunk_index": 10, "_doc_id": "10_6324349659645685497"}}
{"doc_id": "11_8910197174079951738", "text": "span><<span><span>span<span><span>>Multiline message is:</<span><span>span<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>p<span><span> style<span><span>=<span><span>\"white-space: pre-line;\"<span><span>>{{ message }}</<span><span>p<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/forms.html", "title": "表单输入绑定", "doc_id": "13c92f8edd764e929f47f6f54c29e00e", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 829, "chunk_index": 11, "_doc_id": "11_8910197174079951738"}}
{"doc_id": "12_123509372482692920", "text": "an><span>\"white-space: pre-line;\"<span><span>>{{ message }}</<span><span>p<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>textarea<span><span> v-model<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>message<span><span>\"<span><span> placeholder<span><span>=<span><span>\"add multiple lines\"<span><span>></<span><span>textarea<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>注意在 <code><textarea><code> 中是不支持插值表达式的。请使用 <code>v-model<code> 来替代：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><!-- 错误 --><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/forms.html", "title": "表单输入绑定", "doc_id": "13c92f8edd764e929f47f6f54c29e00e", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 829, "chunk_index": 12, "_doc_id": "12_123509372482692920"}}
{"doc_id": "13_2794453302303288055", "text": "<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><!-- 错误 --><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>textarea<span><span>>{{ text }}</<span><span>textarea<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><!-- 正确 --><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/forms.html", "title": "表单输入绑定", "doc_id": "13c92f8edd764e929f47f6f54c29e00e", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 829, "chunk_index": 13, "_doc_id": "13_2794453302303288055"}}
{"doc_id": "14_3243606597517273968", "text": "span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><!-- 正确 --><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>textarea<span><span> v-model<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>text<span><span>\"<span><span>></<span><span>textarea<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><h3 id=\"checkbox\">复选框 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#checkbox\">​<a><h3><p>单一的复选框，", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/forms.html", "title": "表单输入绑定", "doc_id": "13c92f8edd764e929f47f6f54c29e00e", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 829, "chunk_index": 14, "_doc_id": "14_3243606597517273968"}}
{"doc_id": "15_2884381592325834208", "text": "n><code><pre><div><h3 id=\"checkbox\">复选框 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#checkbox\">​<a><h3><p>单一的复选框，绑定布尔类型值：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>input<span><span> type<span><span>=<span><span>\"checkbox\"<span><span> id<span><span>=<span><span>\"checkbox\"<span><span> v-model<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>checked<span><span>\"<span><span> /><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/forms.html", "title": "表单输入绑定", "doc_id": "13c92f8edd764e929f47f6f54c29e00e", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 829, "chunk_index": 15, "_doc_id": "15_2884381592325834208"}}
