{"doc_id": "30_3321598845804203235", "text": "><span> v-model<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>picked<span><span>\"<span><span> /><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>label<span><span> for<span><span>=<span><span>\"two\"<span><span>>Two</<span><span>label<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><h3 id=\"select\">选择器 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#select\">​<a><h3><p>单个选择器的示例如下：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>div<span><span>>Selected: {{ selected }}</<span><span>div<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/forms.html", "title": "表单输入绑定", "doc_id": "13c92f8edd764e929f47f6f54c29e00e", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 829, "chunk_index": 30, "_doc_id": "30_3321598845804203235"}}
{"doc_id": "31_3374216930659706604", "text": "pan><<span><span>div<span><span>>Selected: {{ selected }}</<span><span>div<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>select<span><span> v-model<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>selected<span><span>\"<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>option<span><span> disabled<span><span> value<span><span>=<span><span>\"\"<span><span>>Please select one</<span><span>option<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/forms.html", "title": "表单输入绑定", "doc_id": "13c92f8edd764e929f47f6f54c29e00e", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 829, "chunk_index": 31, "_doc_id": "31_3374216930659706604"}}
{"doc_id": "32_743078491789175591", "text": "an><span>=<span><span>\"\"<span><span>>Please select one</<span><span>option<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>option<span><span>>A</<span><span>option<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>option<span><span>>B</<span><span>option<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>option<span><span>>C</<span><span>option<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/forms.html", "title": "表单输入绑定", "doc_id": "13c92f8edd764e929f47f6f54c29e00e", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 829, "chunk_index": 32, "_doc_id": "32_743078491789175591"}}
{"doc_id": "33_8432758070995471387", "text": "class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>option<span><span>>C</<span><span>option<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>select<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><div class=\"demo\"><p>Selected: <p> Please select one A B C <div><div class=\"tip custom-block\"><p class=\"custom-block-title\">注意<p><p>如果 <code>v-model<code> 表达式的初始值不匹配任何一个选择项，<code><select><code> 元素会渲染成一个“未选择”的状态。在 iOS 上，这将导致用户无法选择第一项，因为 iOS 在这种情况下不会触发一个 change 事件。因此，我们建议提供一个空值的禁用选项，如上面的例子所示。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/forms.html", "title": "表单输入绑定", "doc_id": "13c92f8edd764e929f47f6f54c29e00e", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 829, "chunk_index": 33, "_doc_id": "33_8432758070995471387"}}
{"doc_id": "34_650154488897221132", "text": "e> 元素会渲染成一个“未选择”的状态。在 iOS 上，这将导致用户无法选择第一项，因为 iOS 在这种情况下不会触发一个 change 事件。因此，我们建议提供一个空值的禁用选项，如上面的例子所示。<p><div><p>多选 (值绑定到一个数组)：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>div<span><span>>Selected: {{ selected }}</<span><span>div<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/forms.html", "title": "表单输入绑定", "doc_id": "13c92f8edd764e929f47f6f54c29e00e", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 829, "chunk_index": 34, "_doc_id": "34_650154488897221132"}}
{"doc_id": "35_3888747318477279268", "text": "<span>>Selected: {{ selected }}</<span><span>div<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>select<span><span> v-model<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>selected<span><span>\"<span><span> multiple<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>option<span><span>>A</<span><span>option<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>option<span><span>>B</<span><span>option<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/forms.html", "title": "表单输入绑定", "doc_id": "13c92f8edd764e929f47f6f54c29e00e", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 829, "chunk_index": 35, "_doc_id": "35_3888747318477279268"}}
{"doc_id": "36_6590768242472941105", "text": "class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>option<span><span>>B</<span><span>option<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>option<span><span>>C</<span><span>option<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/forms.html", "title": "表单输入绑定", "doc_id": "13c92f8edd764e929f47f6f54c29e00e", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 829, "chunk_index": 36, "_doc_id": "36_6590768242472941105"}}
{"doc_id": "37_7069260846486435994", "text": "class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>option<span><span>>C</<span><span>option<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>select<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>选择器的选项可以使用 <code>v-for<code> 动态渲染：<p><div class=\"composition-api\"><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> selected<span><span> =<span><span> ref<span><span>(<span><span>'A'<span><span>)<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/forms.html", "title": "表单输入绑定", "doc_id": "13c92f8edd764e929f47f6f54c29e00e", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 829, "chunk_index": 37, "_doc_id": "37_7069260846486435994"}}
{"doc_id": "38_6950026605262869958", "text": "><span> selected<span><span> =<span><span> ref<span><span>(<span><span>'A'<span><span>)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> options<span><span> =<span><span> ref<span><span>([<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> { text: <span><span>'One'<span><span>, value: <span><span>'A'<span><span> },<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> { text: <span><span>'Two'<span><span>, value: <span><span>'B'<span><span> },<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/forms.html", "title": "表单输入绑定", "doc_id": "13c92f8edd764e929f47f6f54c29e00e", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 829, "chunk_index": 38, "_doc_id": "38_6950026605262869958"}}
{"doc_id": "39_9176076690874222921", "text": "ne\"><span> { text: <span><span>'Two'<span><span>, value: <span><span>'B'<span><span> },<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> { text: <span><span>'Three'<span><span>, value: <span><span>'C'<span><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>])<span><span><code><pre><div><div><div class=\"options-api\"><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/forms.html", "title": "表单输入绑定", "doc_id": "13c92f8edd764e929f47f6f54c29e00e", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 829, "chunk_index": 39, "_doc_id": "39_9176076690874222921"}}
