{"doc_id": "41_4661571960629542809", "text": "ne\"><span> { text: <span><span>'One'<span><span>, value: <span><span>'A'<span><span> },<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> { text: <span><span>'Two'<span><span>, value: <span><span>'B'<span><span> },<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> { text: <span><span>'Three'<span><span>, value: <span><span>'C'<span><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> ]<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/forms.html", "title": "表单输入绑定", "doc_id": "13c92f8edd764e929f47f6f54c29e00e", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 829, "chunk_index": 41, "_doc_id": "41_4661571960629542809"}}
{"doc_id": "42_44344638928604641", "text": "span> ]<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span><code><pre><div><div><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>div<span><span>>Selected: {{ selected }}</<span><span>div<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/forms.html", "title": "表单输入绑定", "doc_id": "13c92f8edd764e929f47f6f54c29e00e", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 829, "chunk_index": 42, "_doc_id": "42_44344638928604641"}}
{"doc_id": "43_6966802927717523347", "text": "<span>>Selected: {{ selected }}</<span><span>div<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>select<span><span> v-model<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>selected<span><span>\"<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/forms.html", "title": "表单输入绑定", "doc_id": "13c92f8edd764e929f47f6f54c29e00e", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 829, "chunk_index": 43, "_doc_id": "43_6966802927717523347"}}
{"doc_id": "44_2160236185762131872", "text": "><span> v-model<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>selected<span><span>\"<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>option<span><span> v-for<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>option <span><span>in<span><span> options<span><span>\"<span><span> :<span><span>value<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>option.value<span><span>\"<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> {{ option.text }}<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> </<span><span>option<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/forms.html", "title": "表单输入绑定", "doc_id": "13c92f8edd764e929f47f6f54c29e00e", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 829, "chunk_index": 44, "_doc_id": "44_2160236185762131872"}}
{"doc_id": "45_4625663533342611307", "text": "option.text }}<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> </<span><span>option<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>select<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><h2 id=\"value-bindings\">值绑定 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#value-bindings\">​<a><h2><p>对于单选按钮，复选框和选择器选项，<code>v-model<code> 绑定的值通常是静态的字符串 (或者对复选框是布尔值)：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><!-- `picked` 在被选择时是字符串 \"a\" --><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/forms.html", "title": "表单输入绑定", "doc_id": "13c92f8edd764e929f47f6f54c29e00e", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 829, "chunk_index": 45, "_doc_id": "45_4625663533342611307"}}
{"doc_id": "46_1491958996088587702", "text": "iki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><!-- `picked` 在被选择时是字符串 \"a\" --><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>input<span><span> type<span><span>=<span><span>\"radio\"<span><span> v-model<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>picked<span><span>\"<span><span> value<span><span>=<span><span>\"a\"<span><span> /><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><!-- `toggle` 只会为 true 或 false --><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/forms.html", "title": "表单输入绑定", "doc_id": "13c92f8edd764e929f47f6f54c29e00e", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 829, "chunk_index": 46, "_doc_id": "46_1491958996088587702"}}
{"doc_id": "47_1599337092932424995", "text": ">\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><!-- `toggle` 只会为 true 或 false --><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>input<span><span> type<span><span>=<span><span>\"checkbox\"<span><span> v-model<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>toggle<span><span>\"<span><span> /><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><!-- `selected` 在第一项被选中时为字符串 \"abc\" --><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/forms.html", "title": "表单输入绑定", "doc_id": "13c92f8edd764e929f47f6f54c29e00e", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 829, "chunk_index": 47, "_doc_id": "47_1599337092932424995"}}
{"doc_id": "48_4516899933937185165", "text": "pan class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><!-- `selected` 在第一项被选中时为字符串 \"abc\" --><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>select<span><span> v-model<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>selected<span><span>\"<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>option<span><span> value<span><span>=<span><span>\"abc\"<span><span>>ABC</<span><span>option<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/forms.html", "title": "表单输入绑定", "doc_id": "13c92f8edd764e929f47f6f54c29e00e", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 829, "chunk_index": 48, "_doc_id": "48_4516899933937185165"}}
{"doc_id": "49_4804816261872586231", "text": "n> value<span><span>=<span><span>\"abc\"<span><span>>ABC</<span><span>option<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>select<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>但有时我们可能希望将该值绑定到当前组件实例上的动态数据。这可以通过使用 <code>v-bind<code> 来实现。此外，使用 <code>v-bind<code> 还使我们可以将选项值绑定为非字符串的数据类型。<p><h3 id=\"checkbox-1\">复选框 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#checkbox-1\">​<a><h3><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>input<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/forms.html", "title": "表单输入绑定", "doc_id": "13c92f8edd764e929f47f6f54c29e00e", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 829, "chunk_index": 49, "_doc_id": "49_4804816261872586231"}}
{"doc_id": "50_5872471772621411940", "text": "pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>input<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> type<span><span>=<span><span>\"checkbox\"<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> v-model<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>toggle<span><span>\"<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> true-value<span><span>=<span><span>\"yes\"<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/forms.html", "title": "表单输入绑定", "doc_id": "13c92f8edd764e929f47f6f54c29e00e", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 829, "chunk_index": 50, "_doc_id": "50_5872471772621411940"}}
{"doc_id": "51_9038177686909214517", "text": "><span>\"<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> true-value<span><span>=<span><span>\"yes\"<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> false-value<span><span>=<span><span>\"no\"<span><span> /><span><span><code><pre><div><p><code>true-value<code> 和 <code>false-value<code> 是 Vue 特有的 attributes，仅支持和 <code>v-model<code> 配套使用。这里 <code>toggle<code> 属性的值会在选中时被设为 <code>'yes'<code>，取消选择时设为 <code>'no'<code>。你同样可以通过 <code>v-bind<code> 将其绑定为其他动态值：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>input<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/forms.html", "title": "表单输入绑定", "doc_id": "13c92f8edd764e929f47f6f54c29e00e", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 829, "chunk_index": 51, "_doc_id": "51_9038177686909214517"}}
{"doc_id": "52_8243531881666867414", "text": "pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>input<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> type<span><span>=<span><span>\"checkbox\"<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> v-model<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>toggle<span><span>\"<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> :<span><span>true-value<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>dynamicTrueValue<span><span>\"<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/forms.html", "title": "表单输入绑定", "doc_id": "13c92f8edd764e929f47f6f54c29e00e", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 829, "chunk_index": 52, "_doc_id": "52_8243531881666867414"}}
{"doc_id": "53_8392675714700886106", "text": "pan><span>true-value<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>dynamicTrueValue<span><span>\"<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> :<span><span>false-value<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>dynamicFalseValue<span><span>\"<span><span> /><span><span><code><pre><div><div class=\"tip custom-block\"><p class=\"custom-block-title\">提示<p><p><code>true-value<code> 和 <code>false-value<code> attributes 不会影响 <code>value<code> attribute，因为浏览器在表单提交时，并不会包含未选择的复选框。为了保证这两个值 (例如：“yes”和“no”) 的其中之一被表单提交，请使用单选按钮作为替代。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/forms.html", "title": "表单输入绑定", "doc_id": "13c92f8edd764e929f47f6f54c29e00e", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 829, "chunk_index": 53, "_doc_id": "53_8392675714700886106"}}
{"doc_id": "54_8599543601462879905", "text": "code>value<code> attribute，因为浏览器在表单提交时，并不会包含未选择的复选框。为了保证这两个值 (例如：“yes”和“no”) 的其中之一被表单提交，请使用单选按钮作为替代。<p><div><h3 id=\"radio-1\">单选按钮 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#radio-1\">​<a><h3><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>input<span><span> type<span><span>=<span><span>\"radio\"<span><span> v-model<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>pick<span><span>\"<span><span> :<span><span>value<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>first<span><span>\"<span><span> /><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/forms.html", "title": "表单输入绑定", "doc_id": "13c92f8edd764e929f47f6f54c29e00e", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 829, "chunk_index": 54, "_doc_id": "54_8599543601462879905"}}
{"doc_id": "55_8852398809463960548", "text": "span><span>value<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>first<span><span>\"<span><span> /><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>input<span><span> type<span><span>=<span><span>\"radio\"<span><span> v-model<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>pick<span><span>\"<span><span> :<span><span>value<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>second<span><span>\"<span><span> /><span><span><code><pre><div><p><code>pick<code> 会在第一个按钮选中时被设为 <code>first<code>，在第二个按钮选中时被设为 <code>second<code>。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/forms.html", "title": "表单输入绑定", "doc_id": "13c92f8edd764e929f47f6f54c29e00e", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 829, "chunk_index": 55, "_doc_id": "55_8852398809463960548"}}
{"doc_id": "56_6837825606629661804", "text": "<code><pre><div><p><code>pick<code> 会在第一个按钮选中时被设为 <code>first<code>，在第二个按钮选中时被设为 <code>second<code>。<p><h3 id=\"select-options-2\">选择器选项 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#select-options-2\">​<a><h3><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>select<span><span> v-model<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>selected<span><span>\"<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <!-- 内联对象字面量 --><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/forms.html", "title": "表单输入绑定", "doc_id": "13c92f8edd764e929f47f6f54c29e00e", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 829, "chunk_index": 56, "_doc_id": "56_6837825606629661804"}}
{"doc_id": "57_4187504005458726436", "text": "lected<span><span>\"<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <!-- 内联对象字面量 --><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>option<span><span> :<span><span>value<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>{ number: <span><span>123<span><span> }<span><span>\"<span><span>>123</<span><span>option<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/forms.html", "title": "表单输入绑定", "doc_id": "13c92f8edd764e929f47f6f54c29e00e", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 829, "chunk_index": 57, "_doc_id": "57_4187504005458726436"}}
{"doc_id": "58_4363163013300137991", "text": "n><span>123<span><span> }<span><span>\"<span><span>>123</<span><span>option<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>select<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p><code>v-model<code> 同样也支持非字符串类型的值绑定！在上面这个例子中，当某个选项被选中，<code>selected<code> 会被设为该对象字面量值 <code>{ number: 123 }<code>。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/forms.html", "title": "表单输入绑定", "doc_id": "13c92f8edd764e929f47f6f54c29e00e", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 829, "chunk_index": 58, "_doc_id": "58_4363163013300137991"}}
{"doc_id": "59_9222603496018571749", "text": "ode> 同样也支持非字符串类型的值绑定！在上面这个例子中，当某个选项被选中，<code>selected<code> 会被设为该对象字面量值 <code>{ number: 123 }<code>。<p><h2 id=\"modifiers\">修饰符 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#modifiers\">​<a><h2><h3 id=\"lazy\"><code>.lazy<code> <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#lazy\">​<a><h3><p>默认情况下，<code>v-model<code> 会在每次 <code>input<code> 事件后更新数据 (<a href=\"#vmodel-ime-tip\">IME 拼字阶段的状态<a>例外)。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/forms.html", "title": "表单输入绑定", "doc_id": "13c92f8edd764e929f47f6f54c29e00e", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 829, "chunk_index": 59, "_doc_id": "59_9222603496018571749"}}
{"doc_id": "60_9023995752819755318", "text": "情况下，<code>v-model<code> 会在每次 <code>input<code> 事件后更新数据 (<a href=\"#vmodel-ime-tip\">IME 拼字阶段的状态<a>例外)。你可以添加 <code>lazy<code> 修饰符来改为在每次 <code>change<code> 事件后更新数据：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><!-- 在 \"change\" 事件后同步更新而不是 \"input\" --><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/forms.html", "title": "表单输入绑定", "doc_id": "13c92f8edd764e929f47f6f54c29e00e", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 829, "chunk_index": 60, "_doc_id": "60_9023995752819755318"}}
{"doc_id": "61_5916603584711563678", "text": "hub-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><!-- 在 \"change\" 事件后同步更新而不是 \"input\" --><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>input<span><span> v-model<span><span>.<span><span>lazy<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>msg<span><span>\"<span><span> /><span><span><code><pre><div><h3 id=\"number\"><code>.number<code> <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#number\">​<a><h3><p>如果你想让用户输入自动转换为数字，", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/forms.html", "title": "表单输入绑定", "doc_id": "13c92f8edd764e929f47f6f54c29e00e", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 829, "chunk_index": 61, "_doc_id": "61_5916603584711563678"}}
{"doc_id": "62_1225263467570232425", "text": "id=\"number\"><code>.number<code> <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#number\">​<a><h3><p>如果你想让用户输入自动转换为数字，你可以在 <code>v-model<code> 后添加 <code>.number<code> 修饰符来管理输入：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>input<span><span> v-model<span><span>.<span><span>number<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>age<span><span>\"<span><span> /><span><span><code><pre><div><p>如果该值无法被 <code>parseFloat()<code> 处理，那么将返回原始值。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/forms.html", "title": "表单输入绑定", "doc_id": "13c92f8edd764e929f47f6f54c29e00e", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 829, "chunk_index": 62, "_doc_id": "62_1225263467570232425"}}
{"doc_id": "63_6944292010025734005", "text": "n><span>\"<span><span> /><span><span><code><pre><div><p>如果该值无法被 <code>parseFloat()<code> 处理，那么将返回原始值。特别是当输入为空时 (例如用户清空输入字段之后)，会返回一个空字符串。这种行为与 <a href=\"https://developer.mozilla.org/zh-CN/docs/Web/API/HTMLInputElement#valueasnumber\" target=\"_blank\">DOM 属性 valueAsNumber<a> 有所不同。<p><p><code>number<code> 修饰符会在输入框有 <code>type=\"number\"<code> 时自动启用。<p><h3 id=\"trim\"><code>.trim<code> <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#trim\">​<a><h3><p>如果你想要默认自动去除用户输入内容中两端的空格，", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/forms.html", "title": "表单输入绑定", "doc_id": "13c92f8edd764e929f47f6f54c29e00e", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 829, "chunk_index": 63, "_doc_id": "63_6944292010025734005"}}
{"doc_id": "64_1761929301982348985", "text": "d=\"trim\"><code>.trim<code> <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#trim\">​<a><h3><p>如果你想要默认自动去除用户输入内容中两端的空格，你可以在 <code>v-model<code> 后添加 <code>.trim<code> 修饰符：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>input<span><span> v-model<span><span>.<span><span>trim<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>msg<span><span>\"<span><span> /><span><span><code><pre><div><h2 id=\"v-model-with-components\">组件上的 <code>v-model<code> <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#v-model-with-components\">​<a><h2><blockquote><p>如果你还不熟悉 Vue 的组件，", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/forms.html", "title": "表单输入绑定", "doc_id": "13c92f8edd764e929f47f6f54c29e00e", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 829, "chunk_index": 64, "_doc_id": "64_1761929301982348985"}}
{"doc_id": "65_4759932296835725111", "text": "de> <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#v-model-with-components\">​<a><h2><blockquote><p>如果你还不熟悉 Vue 的组件，那么现在可以跳过这个部分。<p><blockquote><p>HTML 的内置表单输入类型并不总能满足所有需求。幸运的是，我们可以使用 Vue 构建具有自定义行为的可复用输入组件，并且这些输入组件也支持 <code>v-model<code>！要了解更多关于此的内容，请在组件指引中阅读<a href=\"/guide/components/v-model.html\">配合 <code>v-model<code> 使用<a>。<p><div><div>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/forms.html", "title": "表单输入绑定", "doc_id": "13c92f8edd764e929f47f6f54c29e00e", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 829, "chunk_index": 65, "_doc_id": "65_4759932296835725111"}}
{"doc_id": "0_6195690396277888618", "text": "<div><div><h1 id=\"introduction\">简介 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#introduction\">​<a><h1><h2 id=\"what-is-vue\">什么是 Vue？ <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#what-is-vue\">​<a><h2><p>Vue (发音为 /vjuː/，类似 <strong>view<strong>) 是一款用于构建用户界面的 JavaScript 框架。它基于标准 HTML、CSS 和 JavaScript 构建，并提供了一套声明式的、组件化的编程模型，帮助你高效地开发用户界面。无论是简单还是复杂的界面，Vue 都可以胜任。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/introduction.html#api-styles", "title": "简介 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "7a2b0276a71641fa98bd864ffdb23add", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 608, "chunk_index": 0, "_doc_id": "0_6195690396277888618"}}
{"doc_id": "1_2310898484692219515", "text": "avaScript 框架。它基于标准 HTML、CSS 和 JavaScript 构建，并提供了一套声明式的、组件化的编程模型，帮助你高效地开发用户界面。无论是简单还是复杂的界面，Vue 都可以胜任。<p><p>下面是一个最基本的示例：<p><div class=\"options-api\"><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>import<span><span> { createApp } <span><span>from<span><span> 'vue'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>createApp<span><span>({<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> data<span><span>() {<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/introduction.html#api-styles", "title": "简介 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "7a2b0276a71641fa98bd864ffdb23add", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 608, "chunk_index": 1, "_doc_id": "1_2310898484692219515"}}
{"doc_id": "2_9088306374990737604", "text": "span>createApp<span><span>({<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> data<span><span>() {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> return<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> count: <span><span>0<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/introduction.html#api-styles", "title": "简介 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "7a2b0276a71641fa98bd864ffdb23add", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 608, "chunk_index": 2, "_doc_id": "2_9088306374990737604"}}
{"doc_id": "3_4137586470103774591", "text": "<span>0<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}).<span><span>mount<span><span>(<span><span>'#app'<span><span>)<span><span><code><pre><div><div><div class=\"composition-api\"><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>import<span><span> { createApp, ref } <span><span>from<span><span> 'vue'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/introduction.html#api-styles", "title": "简介 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "7a2b0276a71641fa98bd864ffdb23add", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 608, "chunk_index": 3, "_doc_id": "3_4137586470103774591"}}
{"doc_id": "4_6823495640349235277", "text": "><span> { createApp, ref } <span><span>from<span><span> 'vue'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>createApp<span><span>({<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> setup<span><span>() {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> return<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> count: <span><span>ref<span><span>(<span><span>0<span><span>)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/introduction.html#api-styles", "title": "简介 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "7a2b0276a71641fa98bd864ffdb23add", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 608, "chunk_index": 4, "_doc_id": "4_6823495640349235277"}}
{"doc_id": "5_7663912033941130300", "text": "<span>)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}).<span><span>mount<span><span>(<span><span>'#app'<span><span>)<span><span><code><pre><div><div><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>div<span><span> id<span><span>=<span><span>\"app\"<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/introduction.html#api-styles", "title": "简介 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "7a2b0276a71641fa98bd864ffdb23add", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 608, "chunk_index": 5, "_doc_id": "5_7663912033941130300"}}
{"doc_id": "6_2778405578743970960", "text": "\"line\"><span><<span><span>div<span><span> id<span><span>=<span><span>\"app\"<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>button<span><span> @<span><span>click<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>count<span><span>++<span><span>\"<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> Count is: {{ count }}<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> </<span><span>button<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/introduction.html#api-styles", "title": "简介 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "7a2b0276a71641fa98bd864ffdb23add", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 608, "chunk_index": 6, "_doc_id": "6_2778405578743970960"}}
{"doc_id": "7_1884745853012702980", "text": "is: {{ count }}<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> </<span><span>button<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>div<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p><strong>结果展示<strong><p><p class=\"demo\"> Count is: 0 <p><p>上面的示例展示了 Vue 的两个核心功能：<p><p>你可能已经有了些疑问——先别急，在后续的文档中我们会详细介绍每一个细节。现在，请继续看下去，以确保你对 Vue 作为一个框架到底提供了什么有一个宏观的了解。<p><div class=\"tip custom-block\"><p class=\"custom-block-title\">预备知识<p><p>文档接下来的内容会假设你对 HTML、CSS 和 JavaScript 已经基本熟悉。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/introduction.html#api-styles", "title": "简介 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "7a2b0276a71641fa98bd864ffdb23add", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 608, "chunk_index": 7, "_doc_id": "7_1884745853012702980"}}
{"doc_id": "8_7395723620062868592", "text": "ip custom-block\"><p class=\"custom-block-title\">预备知识<p><p>文档接下来的内容会假设你对 HTML、CSS 和 JavaScript 已经基本熟悉。如果你对前端开发完全陌生，最好不要直接从一个框架开始进行入门学习——最好是掌握了基础知识再回到这里。如有需要，你可以通过这些 <a href=\"https://developer.mozilla.org/zh-CN/docs/Web/JavaScript/A_re-introduction_to_JavaScript\" target=\"_blank\">JavaScript<a>、<a href=\"https://developer.mozilla.org/zh-CN/docs/Learn/HTML/Introduction_to_HTML\" target=\"_blank\">HTML<a> 和 <a href=\"https://developer.mozilla.org/zh-CN/docs/Learn/CSS/First_steps\" target=\"_blank\">CSS<a> 概述来检验你的知识水平。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/introduction.html#api-styles", "title": "简介 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "7a2b0276a71641fa98bd864ffdb23add", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 608, "chunk_index": 8, "_doc_id": "8_7395723620062868592"}}
{"doc_id": "9_4378384526126207920", "text": "\"https://developer.mozilla.org/zh-CN/docs/Learn/CSS/First_steps\" target=\"_blank\">CSS<a> 概述来检验你的知识水平。如果之前有其他框架的经验会很有帮助，但也不是必须的。<p><div><h2 id=\"the-progressive-framework\">渐进式框架 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#the-progressive-framework\">​<a><h2><p>Vue 是一个框架，也是一个生态。其功能覆盖了大部分前端开发常见的需求。但 Web 世界是十分多样化的，不同的开发者在 Web 上构建的东西可能在形式和规模上会有很大的不同。考虑到这一点，Vue 的设计非常注重灵活性和“可以被逐步集成”这个特点。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/introduction.html#api-styles", "title": "简介 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "7a2b0276a71641fa98bd864ffdb23add", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 608, "chunk_index": 9, "_doc_id": "9_4378384526126207920"}}
{"doc_id": "10_6469574026980243246", "text": "大部分前端开发常见的需求。但 Web 世界是十分多样化的，不同的开发者在 Web 上构建的东西可能在形式和规模上会有很大的不同。考虑到这一点，Vue 的设计非常注重灵活性和“可以被逐步集成”这个特点。根据你的需求场景，你可以用不同的方式使用 Vue：<p><ul><li>无需构建步骤，渐进式增强静态的 HTML<li><li>在任何页面中作为 Web Components 嵌入<li><li>单页应用 (SPA)<li><li>全栈 / 服务端渲染 (SSR)<li><li>Jamstack / 静态站点生成 (SSG)<li><li>开发桌面端、移动端、WebGL，甚至是命令行终端中的界面<li><ul><p>如果你是初学者，可能会觉得这些概念有些复杂。别担心！理解教程和指南的内容只需要具备基础的 HTML 和 JavaScript 知识。即使你不是这些方面的专家，也能够跟得上。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/introduction.html#api-styles", "title": "简介 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "7a2b0276a71641fa98bd864ffdb23add", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 608, "chunk_index": 10, "_doc_id": "10_6469574026980243246"}}
{"doc_id": "11_4640243842580244956", "text": "的界面<li><ul><p>如果你是初学者，可能会觉得这些概念有些复杂。别担心！理解教程和指南的内容只需要具备基础的 HTML 和 JavaScript 知识。即使你不是这些方面的专家，也能够跟得上。<p><p>如果你是有经验的开发者，希望了解如何以最合适的方式在项目中引入 Vue，或者是对上述的这些概念感到好奇，我们在<a href=\"/guide/extras/ways-of-using-vue.html\">使用 Vue 的多种方式<a>中讨论了有关它们的更多细节。<p><p>无论再怎么灵活，Vue 的核心知识在所有这些用例中都是通用的。即使你现在只是一个初学者，随着你的不断成长，到未来有能力实现更复杂的项目时，这一路上获得的知识依然会适用。如果你已经是一个老手，你可以根据实际场景来选择使用 Vue 的最佳方式，在各种场景下都可以保持同样的开发效率。这就是为什么我们将 Vue 称为“渐进式框架”：它是一个可以与你共同成长、适应你不同需求的框架。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/introduction.html#api-styles", "title": "简介 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "7a2b0276a71641fa98bd864ffdb23add", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 608, "chunk_index": 11, "_doc_id": "11_4640243842580244956"}}
{"doc_id": "12_2529682173667876941", "text": "已经是一个老手，你可以根据实际场景来选择使用 Vue 的最佳方式，在各种场景下都可以保持同样的开发效率。这就是为什么我们将 Vue 称为“渐进式框架”：它是一个可以与你共同成长、适应你不同需求的框架。<p><h2 id=\"single-file-components\">单文件组件 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#single-file-components\">​<a><h2><p>在大多数启用了构建工具的 Vue 项目中，我们可以使用一种类似 HTML 格式的文件来书写 Vue 组件，它被称为<strong>单文件组件<strong> (也被称为 <code>*.vue<code> 文件，英文 Single-File Components，缩写为 <strong>SFC<strong>)。顾名思义，Vue 的单文件组件会将一个组件的逻辑 (JavaScript)，模板 (HTML) 和样式 (CSS) 封装在同一个文件里。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/introduction.html#api-styles", "title": "简介 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "7a2b0276a71641fa98bd864ffdb23add", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 608, "chunk_index": 12, "_doc_id": "12_2529682173667876941"}}
{"doc_id": "13_5617914003319960098", "text": "onents，缩写为 <strong>SFC<strong>)。顾名思义，Vue 的单文件组件会将一个组件的逻辑 (JavaScript)，模板 (HTML) 和样式 (CSS) 封装在同一个文件里。下面我们将用单文件组件的格式重写上面的计数器示例：<p><div class=\"options-api\"><div class=\"language-vue\"> <span class=\"lang\">vue<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>script<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> data<span><span>() {<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/introduction.html#api-styles", "title": "简介 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "7a2b0276a71641fa98bd864ffdb23add", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 608, "chunk_index": 13, "_doc_id": "13_5617914003319960098"}}
{"doc_id": "14_8565640116576850227", "text": "<span> default<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> data<span><span>() {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> return<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> count: <span><span>0<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>script<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/introduction.html#api-styles", "title": "简介 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "7a2b0276a71641fa98bd864ffdb23add", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 608, "chunk_index": 14, "_doc_id": "14_8565640116576850227"}}
{"doc_id": "15_6260419395909631856", "text": ">\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>button<span><span> @click<span><span>=<span><span>\"count++\"<span><span>>Count is: {{ count }}</<span><span>button<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>style<span><span> scoped<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/introduction.html#api-styles", "title": "简介 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "7a2b0276a71641fa98bd864ffdb23add", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 608, "chunk_index": 15, "_doc_id": "15_6260419395909631856"}}
{"doc_id": "16_4175312891501675067", "text": "ine\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>style<span><span> scoped<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>button<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> font-weight<span><span>: <span><span>bold<span><span>;<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/introduction.html#api-styles", "title": "简介 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "7a2b0276a71641fa98bd864ffdb23add", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 608, "chunk_index": 16, "_doc_id": "16_4175312891501675067"}}
{"doc_id": "17_4813006113887291885", "text": "eight<span><span>: <span><span>bold<span><span>;<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>style<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><div><div class=\"composition-api\"><div class=\"language-vue\"> <span class=\"lang\">vue<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>script<span><span> setup<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>import<span><span> { ref } <span><span>from<span><span> 'vue'<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/introduction.html#api-styles", "title": "简介 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "7a2b0276a71641fa98bd864ffdb23add", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 608, "chunk_index": 17, "_doc_id": "17_4813006113887291885"}}
{"doc_id": "18_1836124839863404144", "text": "<span class=\"line\"><span>import<span><span> { ref } <span><span>from<span><span> 'vue'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> count<span><span> =<span><span> ref<span><span>(<span><span>0<span><span>)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>script<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/introduction.html#api-styles", "title": "简介 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "7a2b0276a71641fa98bd864ffdb23add", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 608, "chunk_index": 18, "_doc_id": "18_1836124839863404144"}}
{"doc_id": "19_6260419395909631856", "text": ">\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>button<span><span> @click<span><span>=<span><span>\"count++\"<span><span>>Count is: {{ count }}</<span><span>button<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>style<span><span> scoped<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/introduction.html#api-styles", "title": "简介 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "7a2b0276a71641fa98bd864ffdb23add", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 608, "chunk_index": 19, "_doc_id": "19_6260419395909631856"}}
{"doc_id": "20_8949425938603497908", "text": "ine\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>style<span><span> scoped<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>button<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> font-weight<span><span>: <span><span>bold<span><span>;<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>style<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><div><p>单文件组件是 Vue 的标志性功能。如果你的用例需要进行构建，我们推荐用它来编写 Vue 组件。你可以在后续相关章节里了解更多关于<a href=\"/guide/scaling-up/sfc.html\">单文件组件的用法及用途<a>。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/introduction.html#api-styles", "title": "简介 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "7a2b0276a71641fa98bd864ffdb23add", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 608, "chunk_index": 20, "_doc_id": "20_8949425938603497908"}}
{"doc_id": "21_5674691541579578437", "text": "。如果你的用例需要进行构建，我们推荐用它来编写 Vue 组件。你可以在后续相关章节里了解更多关于<a href=\"/guide/scaling-up/sfc.html\">单文件组件的用法及用途<a>。但你暂时只需要知道 Vue 会帮忙处理所有这些构建工具的配置就好。<p><h2 id=\"api-styles\">API 风格 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#api-styles\">​<a><h2><p>Vue 的组件可以按两种不同的风格书写：<strong>选项式 API<strong> 和<strong>组合式 API<strong>。<p><h3 id=\"options-api\">选项式 API (Options API) <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#options-api\">​<a><h3><p>使用选项式 API，我们可以用包含多个选项的对象来描述组件的逻辑，例如 <code>data<code>、<code>methods<code> 和 <code>mounted<code>。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/introduction.html#api-styles", "title": "简介 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "7a2b0276a71641fa98bd864ffdb23add", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 608, "chunk_index": 21, "_doc_id": "21_5674691541579578437"}}
{"doc_id": "22_2215028053069610680", "text": "3><p>使用选项式 API，我们可以用包含多个选项的对象来描述组件的逻辑，例如 <code>data<code>、<code>methods<code> 和 <code>mounted<code>。选项所定义的属性都会暴露在函数内部的 <code>this<code> 上，它会指向当前的组件实例。<p><div class=\"language-vue\"> <span class=\"lang\">vue<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>script<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // data() 返回的属性将会成为响应式的状态<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/introduction.html#api-styles", "title": "简介 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "7a2b0276a71641fa98bd864ffdb23add", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 608, "chunk_index": 22, "_doc_id": "22_2215028053069610680"}}
{"doc_id": "23_7683725257088490179", "text": "> default<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // data() 返回的属性将会成为响应式的状态<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 并且暴露在 `this` 上<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> data<span><span>() {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> return<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> count: <span><span>0<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> },<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // methods 是一些用来更改状态与触发更新的函数<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/introduction.html#api-styles", "title": "简介 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "7a2b0276a71641fa98bd864ffdb23add", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 608, "chunk_index": 23, "_doc_id": "23_7683725257088490179"}}
{"doc_id": "24_8301187445160809254", "text": "<span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // methods 是一些用来更改状态与触发更新的函数<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 它们可以在模板中作为事件处理器绑定<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> methods: {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> increment<span><span>() {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> this<span><span>.count<span><span>++<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> },<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/introduction.html#api-styles", "title": "简介 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "7a2b0276a71641fa98bd864ffdb23add", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 608, "chunk_index": 24, "_doc_id": "24_8301187445160809254"}}
{"doc_id": "25_3637227316009041358", "text": "lass=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> },<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 生命周期钩子会在组件生命周期的各个不同阶段被调用<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 例如这个函数就会在组件挂载完成后被调用<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> mounted<span><span>() {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> console.<span><span>log<span><span>(<span><span>`The initial count is ${<span><span>this<span><span>.<span><span>count<span><span>}.`<span><span>)<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/introduction.html#api-styles", "title": "简介 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "7a2b0276a71641fa98bd864ffdb23add", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 608, "chunk_index": 25, "_doc_id": "25_3637227316009041358"}}
{"doc_id": "26_8069774467973902824", "text": "l count is ${<span><span>this<span><span>.<span><span>count<span><span>}.`<span><span>)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>script<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/introduction.html#api-styles", "title": "简介 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "7a2b0276a71641fa98bd864ffdb23add", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 608, "chunk_index": 26, "_doc_id": "26_8069774467973902824"}}
{"doc_id": "27_4142232790080792802", "text": ">\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>button<span><span> @click<span><span>=<span><span>\"increment\"<span><span>>Count is: {{ count }}</<span><span>button<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p><a href=\"https://play.vuejs.", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/introduction.html#api-styles", "title": "简介 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "7a2b0276a71641fa98bd864ffdb23add", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 608, "chunk_index": 27, "_doc_id": "27_4142232790080792802"}}
{"doc_id": "28_2213952547221158404", "text": "<span></<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p><a href=\"https://play.vuejs.org/#\" target=\"_blank\">在演练场中尝试一下<a><p><h3 id=\"composition-api\">组合式 API (Composition API) <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#composition-api\">​<a><h3><p>通过组合式 API，", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/introduction.html#api-styles", "title": "简介 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "7a2b0276a71641fa98bd864ffdb23add", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 608, "chunk_index": 28, "_doc_id": "28_2213952547221158404"}}
{"doc_id": "29_1651189994659790155", "text": "pi\">组合式 API (Composition API) <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#composition-api\">​<a><h3><p>通过组合式 API，我们可以使用导入的 API 函数来描述组件逻辑。在单文件组件中，组合式 API 通常会与 <a href=\"/api/sfc-script-setup.html\"><code><script setup><code><a> 搭配使用。这个 <code>setup<code> attribute 是一个标识，告诉 Vue 需要在编译时进行一些处理，让我们可以更简洁地使用组合式 API。比如，<code><script setup><code> 中的导入和顶层变量/函数都能够在模板中直接使用。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/introduction.html#api-styles", "title": "简介 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "7a2b0276a71641fa98bd864ffdb23add", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 608, "chunk_index": 29, "_doc_id": "29_1651189994659790155"}}
{"doc_id": "30_5612223095310491903", "text": "是一个标识，告诉 Vue 需要在编译时进行一些处理，让我们可以更简洁地使用组合式 API。比如，<code><script setup><code> 中的导入和顶层变量/函数都能够在模板中直接使用。<p><p>下面是使用了组合式 API 与 <code><script setup><code> 改造后和上面的模板完全一样的组件：<p><div class=\"language-vue\"> <span class=\"lang\">vue<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>script<span><span> setup<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>import<span><span> { ref, onMounted } <span><span>from<span><span> 'vue'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/introduction.html#api-styles", "title": "简介 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "7a2b0276a71641fa98bd864ffdb23add", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 608, "chunk_index": 30, "_doc_id": "30_5612223095310491903"}}
{"doc_id": "31_7884051637221108308", "text": "><span> { ref, onMounted } <span><span>from<span><span> 'vue'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 响应式状态<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> count<span><span> =<span><span> ref<span><span>(<span><span>0<span><span>)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 用来修改状态、触发更新的函数<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>function<span><span> increment<span><span>() {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> count.value<span><span>++<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/introduction.html#api-styles", "title": "简介 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "7a2b0276a71641fa98bd864ffdb23add", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 608, "chunk_index": 31, "_doc_id": "31_7884051637221108308"}}
{"doc_id": "32_348882740248355580", "text": "crement<span><span>() {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> count.value<span><span>++<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 生命周期钩子<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>onMounted<span><span>(() <span><span>=><span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> console.<span><span>log<span><span>(<span><span>`The initial count is ${<span><span>count<span><span>.<span><span>value<span><span>}.`<span><span>)<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/introduction.html#api-styles", "title": "简介 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "7a2b0276a71641fa98bd864ffdb23add", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 608, "chunk_index": 32, "_doc_id": "32_348882740248355580"}}
{"doc_id": "33_5907192768914987514", "text": "count is ${<span><span>count<span><span>.<span><span>value<span><span>}.`<span><span>)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>})<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>script<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>button<span><span> @click<span><span>=<span><span>\"increment\"<span><span>>Count is: {{ count }}</<span><span>button<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/introduction.html#api-styles", "title": "简介 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "7a2b0276a71641fa98bd864ffdb23add", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 608, "chunk_index": 33, "_doc_id": "33_5907192768914987514"}}
{"doc_id": "34_6320785963014803155", "text": "an><span>\"increment\"<span><span>>Count is: {{ count }}</<span><span>button<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p><a href=\"https://play.vuejs.", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/introduction.html#api-styles", "title": "简介 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "7a2b0276a71641fa98bd864ffdb23add", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 608, "chunk_index": 34, "_doc_id": "34_6320785963014803155"}}
{"doc_id": "35_7956677031619130184", "text": "<span></<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p><a href=\"https://play.vuejs.org/#\" target=\"_blank\">在演练场中尝试一下<a><p><h3 id=\"which-to-choose\">该选哪一个？", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/introduction.html#api-styles", "title": "简介 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "7a2b0276a71641fa98bd864ffdb23add", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 608, "chunk_index": 35, "_doc_id": "35_7956677031619130184"}}
{"doc_id": "36_4418537480255177406", "text": "rIrr5+Z7hnneQnJu6hURvKl3ryL/ARrVkuI=\" target=\"_blank\">在演练场中尝试一下<a><p><h3 id=\"which-to-choose\">该选哪一个？ <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#which-to-choose\">​<a><h3><p>两种 API 风格都能够覆盖大部分的应用场景。它们只是同一个底层系统所提供的两套不同的接口。实际上，选项式 API 是在组合式 API 的基础上实现的！关于 Vue 的基础概念和知识在它们之间都是通用的。<p><p>选项式 API 以“组件实例”的概念为中心 (即上述例子中的 <code>this<code>)，对于有面向对象语言背景的用户来说，这通常与基于类的心智模型更为一致。同时，它将响应性相关的细节抽象出来，并强制按照选项来组织代码，从而对初学者而言更为友好。<p><p>组合式 API 的核心思想是直接在函数作用域内定义响应式状态变量，并将从多个函数中得到的状态组合起来处理复杂问题。这种形式更加自由，也需要你对 Vue 的响应式系统有更深的理解才能高效使用。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/introduction.html#api-styles", "title": "简介 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "7a2b0276a71641fa98bd864ffdb23add", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 608, "chunk_index": 36, "_doc_id": "36_4418537480255177406"}}
{"doc_id": "37_6591830192225633564", "text": "p><p>组合式 API 的核心思想是直接在函数作用域内定义响应式状态变量，并将从多个函数中得到的状态组合起来处理复杂问题。这种形式更加自由，也需要你对 Vue 的响应式系统有更深的理解才能高效使用。相应的，它的灵活性也使得组织和重用逻辑的模式变得更加强大。<p><p>在<a href=\"/guide/extras/composition-api-faq.html\">组合式 API FAQ<a> 章节中，你可以了解更多关于这两种 API 风格的对比以及组合式 API 所带来的潜在收益。<p><p>如果你是使用 Vue 的新手，这里是我们的大致建议：<p><p>在学习阶段，你不必只固守一种风格。在接下来的文档中我们会为你提供一系列两种风格的代码供你参考，你可以随时通过左上角的 <strong>API 风格偏好<strong>来做切换。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/introduction.html#api-styles", "title": "简介 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "7a2b0276a71641fa98bd864ffdb23add", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 608, "chunk_index": 37, "_doc_id": "37_6591830192225633564"}}
{"doc_id": "38_8922799502895209953", "text": "的大致建议：<p><p>在学习阶段，你不必只固守一种风格。在接下来的文档中我们会为你提供一系列两种风格的代码供你参考，你可以随时通过左上角的 <strong>API 风格偏好<strong>来做切换。<p><h2 id=\"still-got-questions\">还有其他问题？ <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#still-got-questions\">​<a><h2><p>请查看我们的 <a href=\"/about/faq.html\">FAQ<a>。<p><h2 id=\"pick-your-learning-path\">选择你的学习路径 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#pick-your-learning-path\">​<a><h2><p>不同的开发者有不同的学习方式。尽管在可能的情况下，我们推荐你通读所有内容，但你还是可以自由地选择一种自己喜欢的学习路径！<p><div><div>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/introduction.html#api-styles", "title": "简介 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "7a2b0276a71641fa98bd864ffdb23add", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 608, "chunk_index": 38, "_doc_id": "38_8922799502895209953"}}
{"doc_id": "0_4514014591718619665", "text": "<div><div><h1 id=\"transitiongroup\">TransitionGroup <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#transitiongroup\">​<a><h1><p><code><TransitionGroup><code> 是一个内置组件，用于对 <code>v-for<code> 列表中的元素或组件的插入、移除和顺序改变添加动画效果。<p><h2 id=\"differences-from-transition\">和 <code><Transition><code> 的区别 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#differences-from-transition\">​<a><h2><p><code><TransitionGroup><code> 支持和 <code><Transition><code> 基本相同的 props、CSS 过渡 class 和 JavaScript 钩子监听器，但有以下几点区别：<p><ul><li><p>默认情况下，它不会渲染一个容器元素。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/transition-group.html", "title": "TransitionGroup | Vue.js", "doc_id": "de6e9c717f18464d88404a575fb379b6", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 306, "chunk_index": 0, "_doc_id": "0_4514014591718619665"}}
{"doc_id": "1_2400070267131954004", "text": "nsition><code> 基本相同的 props、CSS 过渡 class 和 JavaScript 钩子监听器，但有以下几点区别：<p><ul><li><p>默认情况下，它不会渲染一个容器元素。但你可以通过传入 <code>tag<code> prop 来指定一个元素作为容器元素来渲染。<p><li><li><p><a href=\"./transition.html#transition-modes\">过渡模式<a>在这里不可用，因为我们不再是在互斥的元素之间进行切换。<p><li><li><p>列表中的每个元素都<strong>必须<strong>有一个独一无二的 <code>key<code> attribute。<p><li><li><p>CSS 过渡 class 会被应用在列表内的元素上，<strong>而不是<strong>容器元素上。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/transition-group.html", "title": "TransitionGroup | Vue.js", "doc_id": "de6e9c717f18464d88404a575fb379b6", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 306, "chunk_index": 1, "_doc_id": "1_2400070267131954004"}}
{"doc_id": "2_6904266375694332298", "text": "有一个独一无二的 <code>key<code> attribute。<p><li><li><p>CSS 过渡 class 会被应用在列表内的元素上，<strong>而不是<strong>容器元素上。<p><li><ul><div class=\"tip custom-block\"><p class=\"custom-block-title\">TIP<p><p>当在 <a href=\"/guide/essentials/component-basics.html#in-dom-template-parsing-caveats\">DOM 内模板<a>中使用时，组件名需要写为 <code><transition-group><code>。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/transition-group.html", "title": "TransitionGroup | Vue.js", "doc_id": "de6e9c717f18464d88404a575fb379b6", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 306, "chunk_index": 2, "_doc_id": "2_6904266375694332298"}}
{"doc_id": "3_4486852926042184865", "text": "-basics.html#in-dom-template-parsing-caveats\">DOM 内模板<a>中使用时，组件名需要写为 <code><transition-group><code>。<p><div><h2 id=\"enter-leave-transitions\">进入 / 离开动画 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#enter-leave-transitions\">​<a><h2><p>这里是 <code><TransitionGroup><code> 对一个 <code>v-for<code> 列表添加进入 / 离开动画的示例：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>TransitionGroup<span><span> name<span><span>=<span><span>\"list\"<span><span> tag<span><span>=<span><span>\"ul\"<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/transition-group.html", "title": "TransitionGroup | Vue.js", "doc_id": "de6e9c717f18464d88404a575fb379b6", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 306, "chunk_index": 3, "_doc_id": "3_4486852926042184865"}}
{"doc_id": "4_6057197341509128545", "text": "pan><span>=<span><span>\"list\"<span><span> tag<span><span>=<span><span>\"ul\"<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>li<span><span> v-for<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>item <span><span>in<span><span> items<span><span>\"<span><span> :<span><span>key<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>item<span><span>\"<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> {{ item }}<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> </<span><span>li<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/transition-group.html", "title": "TransitionGroup | Vue.js", "doc_id": "de6e9c717f18464d88404a575fb379b6", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 306, "chunk_index": 4, "_doc_id": "4_6057197341509128545"}}
{"doc_id": "5_7408484230846532430", "text": "\"><span> {{ item }}<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> </<span><span>li<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>TransitionGroup<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><div class=\"language-css\"> <span class=\"lang\">css<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>.list-enter-active<span><span>,<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>.list-leave-active<span><span> {<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/transition-group.html", "title": "TransitionGroup | Vue.js", "doc_id": "de6e9c717f18464d88404a575fb379b6", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 306, "chunk_index": 5, "_doc_id": "5_7408484230846532430"}}
{"doc_id": "6_7934826525312403997", "text": "tive<span><span>,<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>.list-leave-active<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> transition<span><span>: <span><span>all<span><span> 0.5<span><span>s<span><span> ease<span><span>;<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>.list-enter-from<span><span>,<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>.list-leave-to<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> opacity<span><span>: <span><span>0<span><span>;<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/transition-group.html", "title": "TransitionGroup | Vue.js", "doc_id": "de6e9c717f18464d88404a575fb379b6", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 306, "chunk_index": 6, "_doc_id": "6_7934826525312403997"}}
{"doc_id": "7_1855543228609076189", "text": "{<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> opacity<span><span>: <span><span>0<span><span>;<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> transform<span><span>: <span><span>translateX<span><span>(<span><span>30<span><span>px<span><span>);<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/transition-group.html", "title": "TransitionGroup | Vue.js", "doc_id": "de6e9c717f18464d88404a575fb379b6", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 306, "chunk_index": 7, "_doc_id": "7_1855543228609076189"}}
{"doc_id": "8_5273630262158899686", "text": "n><span>: <span><span>translateX<span><span>(<span><span>30<span><span>px<span><span>);<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span><code><pre><div><h2 id=\"move-transitions\">移动动画 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#move-transitions\">​<a><h2><p>上面的示例有一些明显的缺陷：当某一项被插入或移除时，它周围的元素会立即发生“跳跃”而不是平稳地移动。我们可以通过添加一些额外的 CSS 规则来解决这个问题：<p><div class=\"language-css\"> <span class=\"lang\">css<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line highlighted\"><span>.list-move<span><span>, <span><span>/* 对移动中的元素应用的过渡 */<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/transition-group.html", "title": "TransitionGroup | Vue.js", "doc_id": "de6e9c717f18464d88404a575fb379b6", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 306, "chunk_index": 8, "_doc_id": "8_5273630262158899686"}}
{"doc_id": "9_2785081120684608117", "text": "n class=\"line highlighted\"><span>.list-move<span><span>, <span><span>/* 对移动中的元素应用的过渡 */<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>.list-enter-active<span><span>,<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>.list-leave-active<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> transition<span><span>: <span><span>all<span><span> 0.5<span><span>s<span><span> ease<span><span>;<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>.list-enter-from<span><span>,<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/transition-group.html", "title": "TransitionGroup | Vue.js", "doc_id": "de6e9c717f18464d88404a575fb379b6", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 306, "chunk_index": 9, "_doc_id": "9_2785081120684608117"}}
{"doc_id": "10_8531640093077522828", "text": "<span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>.list-enter-from<span><span>,<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>.list-leave-to<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> opacity<span><span>: <span><span>0<span><span>;<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> transform<span><span>: <span><span>translateX<span><span>(<span><span>30<span><span>px<span><span>);<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/transition-group.html", "title": "TransitionGroup | Vue.js", "doc_id": "de6e9c717f18464d88404a575fb379b6", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 306, "chunk_index": 10, "_doc_id": "10_8531640093077522828"}}
{"doc_id": "11_2770781496471757691", "text": "<span>px<span><span>);<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line highlighted\"><span>/* 确保将离开的元素从布局流中删除<span><span>\n<span class=\"line highlighted\"><span> 以便能够正确地计算移动的动画。 */<span><span>\n<span class=\"line highlighted\"><span>.list-leave-active<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line highlighted\"><span> position<span><span>: <span><span>absolute<span><span>;<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/transition-group.html", "title": "TransitionGroup | Vue.js", "doc_id": "de6e9c717f18464d88404a575fb379b6", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 306, "chunk_index": 11, "_doc_id": "11_2770781496471757691"}}
{"doc_id": "12_2430353585370365797", "text": "class=\"line highlighted\"><span> position<span><span>: <span><span>absolute<span><span>;<span><span>\n<span class=\"line highlighted\"><span>}<span><span><code><pre><div><p>现在它看起来好多了，甚至对整个列表执行洗牌的动画也都非常流畅：<p><p><a href=\"/examples/#list-transition\">完整的示例<a><p><h3 id=\"custom-transitiongroup-classes\">自定义过渡组 class <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#custom-transitiongroup-classes\">​<a><h3><p>你还可以通过向 <code><TransitionGroup><code> 传递 <code>moveClass<code> prop 为移动元素指定自定义过渡 class，类似于<a href=\"/guide/built-ins/transition.html#custom-transition-classes\">自定义过渡 class<a>。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/transition-group.html", "title": "TransitionGroup | Vue.js", "doc_id": "de6e9c717f18464d88404a575fb379b6", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 306, "chunk_index": 12, "_doc_id": "12_2430353585370365797"}}
{"doc_id": "13_3206638181786586874", "text": "定自定义过渡 class，类似于<a href=\"/guide/built-ins/transition.html#custom-transition-classes\">自定义过渡 class<a>。<p><h2 id=\"staggering-list-transitions\">渐进延迟列表动画 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#staggering-list-transitions\">​<a><h2><p>通过在 JavaScript 钩子中读取元素的 data attribute，我们可以实现带渐进延迟的列表动画。首先，我们把每一个元素的索引渲染为该元素上的一个 data attribute：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>TransitionGroup<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/transition-group.html", "title": "TransitionGroup | Vue.js", "doc_id": "de6e9c717f18464d88404a575fb379b6", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 306, "chunk_index": 13, "_doc_id": "13_3206638181786586874"}}
{"doc_id": "14_3305835891848157904", "text": "\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>TransitionGroup<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> tag<span><span>=<span><span>\"ul\"<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> :<span><span>css<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>false<span><span>\"<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> @<span><span>before-enter<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>onBeforeEnter<span><span>\"<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/transition-group.html", "title": "TransitionGroup | Vue.js", "doc_id": "de6e9c717f18464d88404a575fb379b6", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 306, "chunk_index": 14, "_doc_id": "14_3305835891848157904"}}
{"doc_id": "15_4899801130297471545", "text": "span><span>before-enter<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>onBeforeEnter<span><span>\"<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> @<span><span>enter<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>onEnter<span><span>\"<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> @<span><span>leave<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>onLeave<span><span>\"<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>li<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/transition-group.html", "title": "TransitionGroup | Vue.js", "doc_id": "de6e9c717f18464d88404a575fb379b6", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 306, "chunk_index": 15, "_doc_id": "15_4899801130297471545"}}
{"doc_id": "16_7400260294152264680", "text": "<span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>li<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> v-for<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>(item, index) <span><span>in<span><span> computedList<span><span>\"<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> :<span><span>key<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>item.msg<span><span>\"<span><span>\n<span class=\"line highlighted\"><span> :<span><span>data-index<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>index<span><span>\"<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/transition-group.html", "title": "TransitionGroup | Vue.js", "doc_id": "de6e9c717f18464d88404a575fb379b6", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 306, "chunk_index": 16, "_doc_id": "16_7400260294152264680"}}
{"doc_id": "17_3642384476877518193", "text": "><span> :<span><span>data-index<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>index<span><span>\"<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> ><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> {{ item.msg }}<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> </<span><span>li<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/transition-group.html", "title": "TransitionGroup | Vue.js", "doc_id": "de6e9c717f18464d88404a575fb379b6", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 306, "chunk_index": 17, "_doc_id": "17_3642384476877518193"}}
{"doc_id": "18_5170250745508780354", "text": "pan> {{ item.msg }}<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> </<span><span>li<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>TransitionGroup<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>接着，在 JavaScript 钩子中，我们基于当前元素的 data attribute 对该元素的进场动画添加一个延迟。以下是一个基于 <a href=\"https://gsap.com/\" target=\"_blank\">GSAP library<a> 的动画示例：<p><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>function<span><span> onEnter<span><span>(<span><span>el<span><span>, <span><span>done<span><span>) {<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/transition-group.html", "title": "TransitionGroup | Vue.js", "doc_id": "de6e9c717f18464d88404a575fb379b6", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 306, "chunk_index": 18, "_doc_id": "18_5170250745508780354"}}
{"doc_id": "19_5018598575436779432", "text": "><span> onEnter<span><span>(<span><span>el<span><span>, <span><span>done<span><span>) {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> gsap.<span><span>to<span><span>(el, {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> opacity: <span><span>1<span><span>,<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> height: <span><span>'1.6em'<span><span>,<span><span>\n<span class=\"line highlighted\"><span> delay: el.dataset.index <span><span>*<span><span> 0.15<span><span>,<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> onComplete: done<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/transition-group.html", "title": "TransitionGroup | Vue.js", "doc_id": "de6e9c717f18464d88404a575fb379b6", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 306, "chunk_index": 19, "_doc_id": "19_5018598575436779432"}}
{"doc_id": "20_4493975790337992471", "text": ">*<span><span> 0.15<span><span>,<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> onComplete: done<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> })<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span><code><pre><div>\n<p><strong>参考<strong><p><div><div>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/transition-group.html", "title": "TransitionGroup | Vue.js", "doc_id": "de6e9c717f18464d88404a575fb379b6", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 306, "chunk_index": 20, "_doc_id": "20_4493975790337992471"}}
{"doc_id": "0_4989804403213058759", "text": "<div><div><h1 id=\"keepalive\">KeepAlive <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#keepalive\">​<a><h1><p><code><KeepAlive><code> 是一个内置组件，它的功能是在多个组件间动态切换时缓存被移除的组件实例。<p><h2 id=\"basic-usage\">基本使用 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#basic-usage\">​<a><h2><p>在组件基础章节中，", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/keep-alive.html", "title": "KeepAlive | Vue.js", "doc_id": "70c6eaf854cc447d94948e3a0a961082", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 290, "chunk_index": 0, "_doc_id": "0_4989804403213058759"}}
{"doc_id": "1_6148776128071863362", "text": "的组件实例。<p><h2 id=\"basic-usage\">基本使用 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#basic-usage\">​<a><h2><p>在组件基础章节中，我们已经介绍了通过特殊的 <code><component><code> 元素来实现<a href=\"/guide/essentials/component-basics.html#dynamic-components\">动态组件<a>的用法：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>component<span><span> :<span><span>is<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>activeComponent<span><span>\"<span><span> /><span><span><code><pre><div><p>默认情况下，", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/keep-alive.html", "title": "KeepAlive | Vue.js", "doc_id": "70c6eaf854cc447d94948e3a0a961082", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 290, "chunk_index": 1, "_doc_id": "1_6148776128071863362"}}
{"doc_id": "2_3997623110509074729", "text": "><span>\"<span><span>activeComponent<span><span>\"<span><span> /><span><span><code><pre><div><p>默认情况下，一个组件实例在被替换掉后会被销毁。这会导致它丢失其中所有已变化的状态——当这个组件再一次被显示时，会创建一个只带有初始状态的新实例。<p><p>在下面的例子中，你会看到两个有状态的组件——A 有一个计数器，而 B 有一个通过 <code>v-model<code> 同步 input 框输入内容的文字展示。尝试先更改一下任意一个组件的状态，然后切走，再切回来：<p><p>你会发现在切回来之后，之前已更改的状态都被重置了。<p><p>在切换时创建新的组件实例通常是有意义的，但在这个例子中，我们的确想要组件能在被“切走”的时候保留它们的状态。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/keep-alive.html", "title": "KeepAlive | Vue.js", "doc_id": "70c6eaf854cc447d94948e3a0a961082", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 290, "chunk_index": 2, "_doc_id": "2_3997623110509074729"}}
{"doc_id": "3_420059748672566840", "text": "后切走，再切回来：<p><p>你会发现在切回来之后，之前已更改的状态都被重置了。<p><p>在切换时创建新的组件实例通常是有意义的，但在这个例子中，我们的确想要组件能在被“切走”的时候保留它们的状态。要解决这个问题，我们可以用 <code><KeepAlive><code> 内置组件将这些动态组件包装起来：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><!-- 非活跃的组件将会被缓存！ --><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>KeepAlive<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/keep-alive.html", "title": "KeepAlive | Vue.js", "doc_id": "70c6eaf854cc447d94948e3a0a961082", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 290, "chunk_index": 3, "_doc_id": "3_420059748672566840"}}
{"doc_id": "4_6455751273208590143", "text": "跃的组件将会被缓存！ --><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>KeepAlive<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>component<span><span> :<span><span>is<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>activeComponent<span><span>\"<span><span> /><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/keep-alive.html", "title": "KeepAlive | Vue.js", "doc_id": "70c6eaf854cc447d94948e3a0a961082", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 290, "chunk_index": 4, "_doc_id": "4_6455751273208590143"}}
{"doc_id": "5_2383290219144296124", "text": "pan>is<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>activeComponent<span><span>\"<span><span> /><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>KeepAlive<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>现在，在组件切换时状态也能被保留了：<p><div class=\"tip custom-block\"><p class=\"custom-block-title\">TIP<p><p>在 <a href=\"/guide/essentials/component-basics.html#in-dom-template-parsing-caveats\">DOM 内模板<a>中使用时，它应该被写为 <code><keep-alive><code>。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/keep-alive.html", "title": "KeepAlive | Vue.js", "doc_id": "70c6eaf854cc447d94948e3a0a961082", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 290, "chunk_index": 5, "_doc_id": "5_2383290219144296124"}}
{"doc_id": "6_7612219892049010372", "text": "mponent-basics.html#in-dom-template-parsing-caveats\">DOM 内模板<a>中使用时，它应该被写为 <code><keep-alive><code>。<p><div><h2 id=\"include-exclude\">包含/排除 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#include-exclude\">​<a><h2><p><code><KeepAlive><code> 默认会缓存内部的所有组件实例，但我们可以通过 <code>include<code> 和 <code>exclude<code> prop 来定制该行为。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/keep-alive.html", "title": "KeepAlive | Vue.js", "doc_id": "70c6eaf854cc447d94948e3a0a961082", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 290, "chunk_index": 6, "_doc_id": "6_7612219892049010372"}}
{"doc_id": "7_482111824719089712", "text": "code><KeepAlive><code> 默认会缓存内部的所有组件实例，但我们可以通过 <code>include<code> 和 <code>exclude<code> prop 来定制该行为。这两个 prop 的值都可以是一个以英文逗号分隔的字符串、一个正则表达式，或是包含这两种类型的一个数组：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><!-- 以英文逗号分隔的字符串 --><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>KeepAlive<span><span> include<span><span>=<span><span>\"a,b\"<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/keep-alive.html", "title": "KeepAlive | Vue.js", "doc_id": "70c6eaf854cc447d94948e3a0a961082", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 290, "chunk_index": 7, "_doc_id": "7_482111824719089712"}}
{"doc_id": "8_1482144287194012486", "text": "n><<span><span>KeepAlive<span><span> include<span><span>=<span><span>\"a,b\"<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>component<span><span> :<span><span>is<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>view<span><span>\"<span><span> /><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>KeepAlive<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><!-- 正则表达式 (需使用 `v-bind`) --><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/keep-alive.html", "title": "KeepAlive | Vue.js", "doc_id": "70c6eaf854cc447d94948e3a0a961082", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 290, "chunk_index": 8, "_doc_id": "8_1482144287194012486"}}
{"doc_id": "9_2687098795849672736", "text": "<span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><!-- 正则表达式 (需使用 `v-bind`) --><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>KeepAlive<span><span> :<span><span>include<span><span>=<span><span>\"/<span><span>a<span><span>|<span><span>b<span><span>/\"<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>component<span><span> :<span><span>is<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>view<span><span>\"<span><span> /><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/keep-alive.html", "title": "KeepAlive | Vue.js", "doc_id": "70c6eaf854cc447d94948e3a0a961082", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 290, "chunk_index": 9, "_doc_id": "9_2687098795849672736"}}
{"doc_id": "10_4659088121219042983", "text": "> :<span><span>is<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>view<span><span>\"<span><span> /><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>KeepAlive<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><!-- 数组 (需使用 `v-bind`) --><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>KeepAlive<span><span> :<span><span>include<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>[<span><span>'a'<span><span>, <span><span>'b'<span><span>]<span><span>\"<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/keep-alive.html", "title": "KeepAlive | Vue.js", "doc_id": "70c6eaf854cc447d94948e3a0a961082", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 290, "chunk_index": 10, "_doc_id": "10_4659088121219042983"}}
{"doc_id": "11_8697693222707296300", "text": "an>[<span><span>'a'<span><span>, <span><span>'b'<span><span>]<span><span>\"<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>component<span><span> :<span><span>is<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>view<span><span>\"<span><span> /><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>KeepAlive<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>它会根据组件的 <a href=\"/api/options-misc.html#name\"><code>name<code><a> 选项进行匹配，所以组件如果想要条件性地被 <code>KeepAlive<code> 缓存，就必须显式声明一个 <code>name<code> 选项。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/keep-alive.html", "title": "KeepAlive | Vue.js", "doc_id": "70c6eaf854cc447d94948e3a0a961082", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 290, "chunk_index": 11, "_doc_id": "11_8697693222707296300"}}
{"doc_id": "12_7499406190585333616", "text": "me\"><code>name<code><a> 选项进行匹配，所以组件如果想要条件性地被 <code>KeepAlive<code> 缓存，就必须显式声明一个 <code>name<code> 选项。<p><div class=\"tip custom-block\"><p class=\"custom-block-title\">TIP<p><p>在 3.2.34 或以上的版本中，使用 <code><script setup><code> 的单文件组件会自动根据文件名生成对应的 <code>name<code> 选项，无需再手动声明。<p><div><h2 id=\"max-cached-instances\">最大缓存实例数 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#max-cached-instances\">​<a><h2><p>我们可以通过传入 <code>max<code> prop 来限制可被缓存的最大组件实例数。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/keep-alive.html", "title": "KeepAlive | Vue.js", "doc_id": "70c6eaf854cc447d94948e3a0a961082", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 290, "chunk_index": 12, "_doc_id": "12_7499406190585333616"}}
{"doc_id": "13_2806937603747017131", "text": "eader-anchor\" href=\"#max-cached-instances\">​<a><h2><p>我们可以通过传入 <code>max<code> prop 来限制可被缓存的最大组件实例数。<code><KeepAlive><code> 的行为在指定了 <code>max<code> 后类似一个 <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Cache_replacement_policies#Least_recently_used_(LRU)\" target=\"_blank\">LRU 缓存<a>：如果缓存的实例数量即将超过指定的那个最大数量，则最久没有被访问的缓存实例将被销毁，以便为新的实例腾出空间。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/keep-alive.html", "title": "KeepAlive | Vue.js", "doc_id": "70c6eaf854cc447d94948e3a0a961082", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 290, "chunk_index": 13, "_doc_id": "13_2806937603747017131"}}
{"doc_id": "14_1877110604149465783", "text": "recently_used_(LRU)\" target=\"_blank\">LRU 缓存<a>：如果缓存的实例数量即将超过指定的那个最大数量，则最久没有被访问的缓存实例将被销毁，以便为新的实例腾出空间。<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>KeepAlive<span><span> :<span><span>max<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>10<span><span>\"<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/keep-alive.html", "title": "KeepAlive | Vue.js", "doc_id": "70c6eaf854cc447d94948e3a0a961082", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 290, "chunk_index": 14, "_doc_id": "14_1877110604149465783"}}
{"doc_id": "15_14652681894071931", "text": "pan> :<span><span>max<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>10<span><span>\"<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>component<span><span> :<span><span>is<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>activeComponent<span><span>\"<span><span> /><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/keep-alive.html", "title": "KeepAlive | Vue.js", "doc_id": "70c6eaf854cc447d94948e3a0a961082", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 290, "chunk_index": 15, "_doc_id": "15_14652681894071931"}}
{"doc_id": "16_5883685302939283313", "text": "pan>is<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>activeComponent<span><span>\"<span><span> /><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>KeepAlive<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><h2 id=\"lifecycle-of-cached-instance\">缓存实例的生命周期 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#lifecycle-of-cached-instance\">​<a><h2><p>当一个组件实例从 DOM 上移除但因为被 <code><KeepAlive><code> 缓存而仍作为组件树的一部分时，它将变为<strong>不活跃<strong>状态而不是被卸载。当一个组件实例作为缓存树的一部分插入到 DOM 中时，它将重新<strong>被激活<strong>。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/keep-alive.html", "title": "KeepAlive | Vue.js", "doc_id": "70c6eaf854cc447d94948e3a0a961082", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 290, "chunk_index": 16, "_doc_id": "16_5883685302939283313"}}
{"doc_id": "17_981361515142587378", "text": "> 缓存而仍作为组件树的一部分时，它将变为<strong>不活跃<strong>状态而不是被卸载。当一个组件实例作为缓存树的一部分插入到 DOM 中时，它将重新<strong>被激活<strong>。<p><div class=\"composition-api\"><p>一个持续存在的组件可以通过 <a href=\"/api/composition-api-lifecycle.html#onactivated\"><code>onActivated()<code><a> 和 <a href=\"/api/composition-api-lifecycle.html#ondeactivated\"><code>onDeactivated()<code><a> 注册相应的两个状态的生命周期钩子：<p><div class=\"language-vue\"> <span class=\"lang\">vue<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>script<span><span> setup<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/keep-alive.html", "title": "KeepAlive | Vue.js", "doc_id": "70c6eaf854cc447d94948e3a0a961082", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 290, "chunk_index": 17, "_doc_id": "17_981361515142587378"}}
{"doc_id": "18_3124383691955215687", "text": "code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>script<span><span> setup<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>import<span><span> { onActivated, onDeactivated } <span><span>from<span><span> 'vue'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>onActivated<span><span>(() <span><span>=><span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 调用时机为首次挂载<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 以及每次从缓存中被重新插入时<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>})<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/keep-alive.html", "title": "KeepAlive | Vue.js", "doc_id": "70c6eaf854cc447d94948e3a0a961082", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 290, "chunk_index": 18, "_doc_id": "18_3124383691955215687"}}
{"doc_id": "19_6688858546604246095", "text": "an>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 以及每次从缓存中被重新插入时<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>})<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>onDeactivated<span><span>(() <span><span>=><span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 在从 DOM 上移除、进入缓存<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 以及组件卸载时调用<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>})<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/keep-alive.html", "title": "KeepAlive | Vue.js", "doc_id": "70c6eaf854cc447d94948e3a0a961082", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 290, "chunk_index": 19, "_doc_id": "19_6688858546604246095"}}
{"doc_id": "20_119287060650951431", "text": "n><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 以及组件卸载时调用<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>})<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>script<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><div><div class=\"options-api\"><p>一个持续存在的组件可以通过 <a href=\"/api/options-lifecycle.html#activated\"><code>activated<code><a> 和 <a href=\"/api/options-lifecycle.html#deactivated\"><code>deactivated<code><a> 选项来注册相应的两个状态的生命周期钩子：<p><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/keep-alive.html", "title": "KeepAlive | Vue.js", "doc_id": "70c6eaf854cc447d94948e3a0a961082", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 290, "chunk_index": 20, "_doc_id": "20_119287060650951431"}}
{"doc_id": "21_7278274509844647179", "text": "b-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> activated<span><span>() {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 在首次挂载、<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 以及每次从缓存中被重新插入的时候调用<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> },<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> deactivated<span><span>() {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 在从 DOM 上移除、进入缓存<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 以及组件卸载时调用<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/keep-alive.html", "title": "KeepAlive | Vue.js", "doc_id": "70c6eaf854cc447d94948e3a0a961082", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 290, "chunk_index": 21, "_doc_id": "21_7278274509844647179"}}
{"doc_id": "22_4448178115110755540", "text": "ass=\"line\"><span> // 在从 DOM 上移除、进入缓存<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 以及组件卸载时调用<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span><code><pre><div><div><p>请注意：<p>\n<p><strong>参考<strong><p><div><div>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/keep-alive.html", "title": "KeepAlive | Vue.js", "doc_id": "70c6eaf854cc447d94948e3a0a961082", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 290, "chunk_index": 22, "_doc_id": "22_4448178115110755540"}}
{"doc_id": "0_2171539062694586745", "text": "<div><div><h1 id=\"watchers\">侦听器 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#watchers\">​<a><h1><h2 id=\"basic-example\">基本示例 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#basic-example\">​<a><h2><p>计算属性允许我们声明性地计算衍生值。然而在有些情况下，我们需要在状态变化时执行一些“副作用”：例如更改 DOM，或是根据异步操作的结果去修改另一处的状态。<p><div class=\"options-api\"><p>在选项式 API 中，我们可以使用 <a href=\"/api/options-state.html#watch\"><code>watch<code> 选项<a>在每次响应式属性发生变化时触发一个函数。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/watchers.html", "title": "侦听器 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "7b1bb8d36fb1441997af8af7b7909e93", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1820, "chunk_index": 0, "_doc_id": "0_2171539062694586745"}}
{"doc_id": "1_5184651458687588984", "text": "选项式 API 中，我们可以使用 <a href=\"/api/options-state.html#watch\"><code>watch<code> 选项<a>在每次响应式属性发生变化时触发一个函数。<p><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> data<span><span>() {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> return<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> question: <span><span>''<span><span>,<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/watchers.html", "title": "侦听器 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "7b1bb8d36fb1441997af8af7b7909e93", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1820, "chunk_index": 1, "_doc_id": "1_5184651458687588984"}}
{"doc_id": "2_8865211840363752122", "text": "an><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> question: <span><span>''<span><span>,<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> answer: <span><span>'Questions usually contain a question mark. ;-)'<span><span>,<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> loading: <span><span>false<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> },<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> watch: {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 每当 question 改变时，这个函数就会执行<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/watchers.html", "title": "侦听器 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "7b1bb8d36fb1441997af8af7b7909e93", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1820, "chunk_index": 2, "_doc_id": "2_8865211840363752122"}}
{"doc_id": "3_8636084091898279834", "text": "line\"><span> watch: {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 每当 question 改变时，这个函数就会执行<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> question<span><span>(<span><span>newQuestion<span><span>, <span><span>oldQuestion<span><span>) {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> if<span><span> (newQuestion.<span><span>includes<span><span>(<span><span>'?'<span><span>)) {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> this<span><span>.<span><span>getAnswer<span><span>()<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/watchers.html", "title": "侦听器 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "7b1bb8d36fb1441997af8af7b7909e93", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1820, "chunk_index": 3, "_doc_id": "3_8636084091898279834"}}
{"doc_id": "4_2912662949712064574", "text": "span><span>.<span><span>getAnswer<span><span>()<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> },<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> methods: {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> async<span><span> getAnswer<span><span>() {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> this<span><span>.loading <span><span>=<span><span> true<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> this<span><span>.answer <span><span>=<span><span> 'Thinking...'<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/watchers.html", "title": "侦听器 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "7b1bb8d36fb1441997af8af7b7909e93", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1820, "chunk_index": 4, "_doc_id": "4_2912662949712064574"}}
{"doc_id": "5_6992163455167036790", "text": "pan class=\"line\"><span> this<span><span>.answer <span><span>=<span><span> 'Thinking...'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> try<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> const<span><span> res<span><span> =<span><span> await<span><span> fetch<span><span>(<span><span>'https://yesno.wtf/api'<span><span>)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> this<span><span>.answer <span><span>=<span><span> (<span><span>await<span><span> res.<span><span>json<span><span>()).answer<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/watchers.html", "title": "侦听器 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "7b1bb8d36fb1441997af8af7b7909e93", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1820, "chunk_index": 5, "_doc_id": "5_6992163455167036790"}}
{"doc_id": "6_2571001493427023568", "text": "=<span><span> (<span><span>await<span><span> res.<span><span>json<span><span>()).answer<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> } <span><span>catch<span><span> (error) {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> this<span><span>.answer <span><span>=<span><span> 'Error! Could not reach the API. '<span><span> +<span><span> error<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> } <span><span>finally<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> this<span><span>.loading <span><span>=<span><span> false<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/watchers.html", "title": "侦听器 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "7b1bb8d36fb1441997af8af7b7909e93", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1820, "chunk_index": 6, "_doc_id": "6_2571001493427023568"}}
{"doc_id": "7_2531908382505042553", "text": "pan>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> this<span><span>.loading <span><span>=<span><span> false<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span><code><pre><div><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>p<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> Ask a yes/no question:<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/watchers.html", "title": "侦听器 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "7b1bb8d36fb1441997af8af7b7909e93", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1820, "chunk_index": 7, "_doc_id": "7_2531908382505042553"}}
{"doc_id": "8_6794769241391437734", "text": "<span><span>p<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> Ask a yes/no question:<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>input<span><span> v-model<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>question<span><span>\"<span><span> :<span><span>disabled<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>loading<span><span>\"<span><span> /><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>p<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/watchers.html", "title": "侦听器 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "7b1bb8d36fb1441997af8af7b7909e93", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1820, "chunk_index": 8, "_doc_id": "8_6794769241391437734"}}
{"doc_id": "9_8180709950499342814", "text": "span>\"<span><span> /><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>p<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>p<span><span>>{{ answer }}</<span><span>p<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p><a href=\"https://play.vuejs.org/#eNp9VE1v2zAM/SucLnaw1D70lqUbsiKH7rB1W4++aDYdq5ElTx9xgiD/fbT8lXZFAQO2+Mgn8pH0mW2aJjl4ZCu2trkRjfucKTw22jgosOReOjhnCqDgjseL/hvAoPNGjSeAvx6tE1qtIIqWo5Er26Ih088BteCt51KeINfKcaGAT5FQc7NP4NPNYiaQmhdC7VZQcmlxMF+61yUcWu7yajVmkabQVqjwgGZmzSuudmiX4CphofQqD+ZWSAnGqz5y", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/watchers.html", "title": "侦听器 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "7b1bb8d36fb1441997af8af7b7909e93", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1820, "chunk_index": 9, "_doc_id": "9_8180709950499342814"}}
