{"doc_id": "23_6578053514897795774", "text": "\" target=\"_blank\">在演练场中尝试一下<a><p><h3 id=\"watch-source-types\">侦听数据源类型 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#watch-source-types\">​<a><h3><p><code>watch<code> 的第一个参数可以是不同形式的“数据源”：它可以是一个 ref", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/watchers.html", "title": "侦听器 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "7b1bb8d36fb1441997af8af7b7909e93", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1820, "chunk_index": 23, "_doc_id": "23_6578053514897795774"}}
{"doc_id": "24_1909357720500918148", "text": "ader-anchor\" href=\"#watch-source-types\">​<a><h3><p><code>watch<code> 的第一个参数可以是不同形式的“数据源”：它可以是一个 ref (包括计算属性)、一个响应式对象、一个 <a href=\"https://developer.mozilla.org/zh-CN/docs/Web/JavaScript/Reference/Functions/get#description\" target=\"_blank\">getter 函数<a>、或多个数据源组成的数组：<p><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> x<span><span> =<span><span> ref<span><span>(<span><span>0<span><span>)<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/watchers.html", "title": "侦听器 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "7b1bb8d36fb1441997af8af7b7909e93", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1820, "chunk_index": 24, "_doc_id": "24_1909357720500918148"}}
{"doc_id": "25_8891439728184004739", "text": "onst<span><span> x<span><span> =<span><span> ref<span><span>(<span><span>0<span><span>)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> y<span><span> =<span><span> ref<span><span>(<span><span>0<span><span>)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 单个 ref<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>watch<span><span>(x, (<span><span>newX<span><span>) <span><span>=><span><span> {<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/watchers.html", "title": "侦听器 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "7b1bb8d36fb1441997af8af7b7909e93", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1820, "chunk_index": 25, "_doc_id": "25_8891439728184004739"}}
{"doc_id": "26_4567949394954771242", "text": "><span>watch<span><span>(x, (<span><span>newX<span><span>) <span><span>=><span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> console.<span><span>log<span><span>(<span><span>`x is ${<span><span>newX<span><span>}`<span><span>)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>})<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// getter 函数<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>watch<span><span>(<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/watchers.html", "title": "侦听器 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "7b1bb8d36fb1441997af8af7b7909e93", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1820, "chunk_index": 26, "_doc_id": "26_4567949394954771242"}}
{"doc_id": "27_7836676015730953735", "text": "class=\"line\"><span>// getter 函数<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>watch<span><span>(<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> () <span><span>=><span><span> x.value <span><span>+<span><span> y.value,<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> (<span><span>sum<span><span>) <span><span>=><span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> console.<span><span>log<span><span>(<span><span>`sum of x + y is: ${<span><span>sum<span><span>}`<span><span>)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/watchers.html", "title": "侦听器 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "7b1bb8d36fb1441997af8af7b7909e93", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1820, "chunk_index": 27, "_doc_id": "27_7836676015730953735"}}
{"doc_id": "28_3211753319774349639", "text": "s: ${<span><span>sum<span><span>}`<span><span>)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 多个来源组成的数组<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>watch<span><span>([x, () <span><span>=><span><span> y.value], ([<span><span>newX<span><span>, <span><span>newY<span><span>]) <span><span>=><span><span> {<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/watchers.html", "title": "侦听器 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "7b1bb8d36fb1441997af8af7b7909e93", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1820, "chunk_index": 28, "_doc_id": "28_3211753319774349639"}}
{"doc_id": "29_7214526515774269905", "text": "pan><span>newX<span><span>, <span><span>newY<span><span>]) <span><span>=><span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> console.<span><span>log<span><span>(<span><span>`x is ${<span><span>newX<span><span>} and y is ${<span><span>newY<span><span>}`<span><span>)<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/watchers.html", "title": "侦听器 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "7b1bb8d36fb1441997af8af7b7909e93", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1820, "chunk_index": 29, "_doc_id": "29_7214526515774269905"}}
{"doc_id": "30_3849014012127706421", "text": "${<span><span>newX<span><span>} and y is ${<span><span>newY<span><span>}`<span><span>)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>})<span><span><code><pre><div><p>注意，你不能直接侦听响应式对象的属性值，例如：<p><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> obj<span><span> =<span><span> reactive<span><span>({ count: <span><span>0<span><span> })<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/watchers.html", "title": "侦听器 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "7b1bb8d36fb1441997af8af7b7909e93", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1820, "chunk_index": 30, "_doc_id": "30_3849014012127706421"}}
{"doc_id": "31_8853504006961949092", "text": "n> reactive<span><span>({ count: <span><span>0<span><span> })<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 错误，因为 watch() 得到的参数是一个 number<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>watch<span><span>(obj.count, (<span><span>count<span><span>) <span><span>=><span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> console.<span><span>log<span><span>(<span><span>`Count is: ${<span><span>count<span><span>}`<span><span>)<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/watchers.html", "title": "侦听器 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "7b1bb8d36fb1441997af8af7b7909e93", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1820, "chunk_index": 31, "_doc_id": "31_8853504006961949092"}}
{"doc_id": "32_3658945002680791961", "text": "n>log<span><span>(<span><span>`Count is: ${<span><span>count<span><span>}`<span><span>)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>})<span><span><code><pre><div><p>这里需要用一个返回该属性的 getter 函数：<p><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// 提供一个 getter 函数<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>watch<span><span>(<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> () <span><span>=><span><span> obj.count,<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/watchers.html", "title": "侦听器 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "7b1bb8d36fb1441997af8af7b7909e93", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1820, "chunk_index": 32, "_doc_id": "32_3658945002680791961"}}
{"doc_id": "33_5798298488735506221", "text": "><span>(<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> () <span><span>=><span><span> obj.count,<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> (<span><span>count<span><span>) <span><span>=><span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> console.<span><span>log<span><span>(<span><span>`Count is: ${<span><span>count<span><span>}`<span><span>)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/watchers.html", "title": "侦听器 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "7b1bb8d36fb1441997af8af7b7909e93", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1820, "chunk_index": 33, "_doc_id": "33_5798298488735506221"}}
{"doc_id": "34_2798997806214040529", "text": "${<span><span>count<span><span>}`<span><span>)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>)<span><span><code><pre><div><div><h2 id=\"deep-watchers\">深层侦听器 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#deep-watchers\">​<a><h2><div class=\"options-api\"><p><code>watch<code> 默认是浅层的：被侦听的属性，仅在被赋新值时，才会触发回调函数——而嵌套属性的变化不会触发。如果想侦听所有嵌套的变更，你需要深层侦听器：<p><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/watchers.html", "title": "侦听器 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "7b1bb8d36fb1441997af8af7b7909e93", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1820, "chunk_index": 34, "_doc_id": "34_2798997806214040529"}}
{"doc_id": "35_1152367199937532017", "text": "b-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> watch: {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> someObject: {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> handler<span><span>(<span><span>newValue<span><span>, <span><span>oldValue<span><span>) {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 注意：在嵌套的变更中，<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 只要没有替换对象本身，<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 那么这里的 `newValue` 和 `oldValue` 相同<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/watchers.html", "title": "侦听器 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "7b1bb8d36fb1441997af8af7b7909e93", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1820, "chunk_index": 35, "_doc_id": "35_1152367199937532017"}}
{"doc_id": "36_2397623612538685010", "text": "/ 只要没有替换对象本身，<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 那么这里的 `newValue` 和 `oldValue` 相同<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> },<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> deep: <span><span>true<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/watchers.html", "title": "侦听器 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "7b1bb8d36fb1441997af8af7b7909e93", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1820, "chunk_index": 36, "_doc_id": "36_2397623612538685010"}}
{"doc_id": "37_6857828643343298254", "text": "an>true<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span><code><pre><div><div><div class=\"composition-api\"><p>直接给 <code>watch()<code> 传入一个响应式对象，会隐式地创建一个深层侦听器——该回调函数在所有嵌套的变更时都会被触发：<p><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> obj<span><span> =<span><span> reactive<span><span>({ count: <span><span>0<span><span> })<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/watchers.html", "title": "侦听器 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "7b1bb8d36fb1441997af8af7b7909e93", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1820, "chunk_index": 37, "_doc_id": "37_6857828643343298254"}}
{"doc_id": "38_4522773388915061910", "text": "bj<span><span> =<span><span> reactive<span><span>({ count: <span><span>0<span><span> })<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>watch<span><span>(obj, (<span><span>newValue<span><span>, <span><span>oldValue<span><span>) <span><span>=><span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 在嵌套的属性变更时触发<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 注意：`newValue` 此处和 `oldValue` 是相等的<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 因为它们是同一个对象！<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>})<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/watchers.html", "title": "侦听器 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "7b1bb8d36fb1441997af8af7b7909e93", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1820, "chunk_index": 38, "_doc_id": "38_4522773388915061910"}}
{"doc_id": "39_2777806298371155408", "text": "<span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 因为它们是同一个对象！<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>})<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>obj.count<span><span>++<span><span><code><pre><div><p>相比之下，一个返回响应式对象的 getter 函数，只有在返回不同的对象时，才会触发回调：<p><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>watch<span><span>(<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> () <span><span>=><span><span> state.someObject,<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/watchers.html", "title": "侦听器 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "7b1bb8d36fb1441997af8af7b7909e93", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1820, "chunk_index": 39, "_doc_id": "39_2777806298371155408"}}
{"doc_id": "40_3777574565671472393", "text": "(<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> () <span><span>=><span><span> state.someObject,<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> () <span><span>=><span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 仅当 state.someObject 被替换时触发<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/watchers.html", "title": "侦听器 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "7b1bb8d36fb1441997af8af7b7909e93", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1820, "chunk_index": 40, "_doc_id": "40_3777574565671472393"}}
{"doc_id": "41_9141698069410931465", "text": "ass=\"line\"><span> // 仅当 state.someObject 被替换时触发<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>)<span><span><code><pre><div><p>你也可以给上面这个例子显式地加上 <code>deep<code> 选项，强制转成深层侦听器：<p><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>watch<span><span>(<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> () <span><span>=><span><span> state.someObject,<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/watchers.html", "title": "侦听器 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "7b1bb8d36fb1441997af8af7b7909e93", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1820, "chunk_index": 41, "_doc_id": "41_9141698069410931465"}}
{"doc_id": "42_5897992014657464451", "text": "(<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> () <span><span>=><span><span> state.someObject,<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> (<span><span>newValue<span><span>, <span><span>oldValue<span><span>) <span><span>=><span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 注意：`newValue` 此处和 `oldValue` 是相等的<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // *除非* state.someObject 被整个替换了<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> },<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> { deep: <span><span>true<span><span> }<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/watchers.html", "title": "侦听器 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "7b1bb8d36fb1441997af8af7b7909e93", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1820, "chunk_index": 42, "_doc_id": "42_5897992014657464451"}}
{"doc_id": "43_1769075039248640285", "text": "><span> },<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> { deep: <span><span>true<span><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>)<span><span><code><pre><div><div><p>在 Vue 3.5+ 中，<code>deep<code> 选项还可以是一个数字，表示最大遍历深度——即 Vue 应该遍历对象嵌套属性的级数。<p><div class=\"warning custom-block\"><p class=\"custom-block-title\">谨慎使用<p><p>深度侦听需要遍历被侦听对象中的所有嵌套的属性，当用于大型数据结构时，开销很大。因此请只在必要时才使用它，并且要留意性能。<p><div><h2 id=\"eager-watchers\">即时回调的侦听器 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#eager-watchers\">​<a><h2><p><code>watch<code> 默认是懒执行的：仅当数据源变化时，才会执行回调。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/watchers.html", "title": "侦听器 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "7b1bb8d36fb1441997af8af7b7909e93", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1820, "chunk_index": 43, "_doc_id": "43_1769075039248640285"}}
{"doc_id": "44_4019140683698758883", "text": "a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#eager-watchers\">​<a><h2><p><code>watch<code> 默认是懒执行的：仅当数据源变化时，才会执行回调。但在某些场景中，我们希望在创建侦听器时，立即执行一遍回调。举例来说，我们想请求一些初始数据，然后在相关状态更改时重新请求数据。<p><div class=\"options-api\"><p>我们可以用一个对象来声明侦听器，这个对象有 <code>handler<code> 方法和 <code>immediate: true<code> 选项，这样便能强制回调函数立即执行：<p><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // ...<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/watchers.html", "title": "侦听器 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "7b1bb8d36fb1441997af8af7b7909e93", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1820, "chunk_index": 44, "_doc_id": "44_4019140683698758883"}}
{"doc_id": "45_5747345442646270526", "text": "n>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // ...<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> watch: {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> question: {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> handler<span><span>(<span><span>newQuestion<span><span>) {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 在组件实例创建时会立即调用<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> },<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 强制立即执行回调<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> immediate: <span><span>true<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/watchers.html", "title": "侦听器 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "7b1bb8d36fb1441997af8af7b7909e93", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1820, "chunk_index": 45, "_doc_id": "45_5747345442646270526"}}
{"doc_id": "46_8564558153401602292", "text": "e\"><span> // 强制立即执行回调<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> immediate: <span><span>true<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // ...<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/watchers.html", "title": "侦听器 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "7b1bb8d36fb1441997af8af7b7909e93", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1820, "chunk_index": 46, "_doc_id": "46_8564558153401602292"}}
{"doc_id": "47_1545849120251054355", "text": "}<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // ...<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span><code><pre><div><p>回调函数的初次执行就发生在 <code>created<code> 钩子之前。Vue 此时已经处理了 <code>data<code>、<code>computed<code> 和 <code>methods<code> 选项，所以这些属性在第一次调用时就是可用的。<p><div><div class=\"composition-api\"><p>我们可以通过传入 <code>immediate: true<code> 选项来强制侦听器的回调立即执行：<p><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>watch<span><span>(<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/watchers.html", "title": "侦听器 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "7b1bb8d36fb1441997af8af7b7909e93", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1820, "chunk_index": 47, "_doc_id": "47_1545849120251054355"}}
{"doc_id": "48_3957520166291810022", "text": "pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>watch<span><span>(<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> source,<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> (<span><span>newValue<span><span>, <span><span>oldValue<span><span>) <span><span>=><span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 立即执行，且当 `source` 改变时再次执行<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> },<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> { immediate: <span><span>true<span><span> }<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/watchers.html", "title": "侦听器 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "7b1bb8d36fb1441997af8af7b7909e93", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1820, "chunk_index": 48, "_doc_id": "48_3957520166291810022"}}
{"doc_id": "49_8220832634195808445", "text": "n> },<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> { immediate: <span><span>true<span><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>)<span><span><code><pre><div><div><h2 id=\"once-watchers\">一次性侦听器 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#once-watchers\">​<a><h2><p>每当被侦听源发生变化时，侦听器的回调就会执行。如果希望回调只在源变化时触发一次，请使用 <code>once: true<code> 选项。<p><div class=\"options-api\"><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/watchers.html", "title": "侦听器 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "7b1bb8d36fb1441997af8af7b7909e93", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1820, "chunk_index": 49, "_doc_id": "49_8220832634195808445"}}
{"doc_id": "50_4318331708477905234", "text": "b-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> watch: {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> source: {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> handler<span><span>(<span><span>newValue<span><span>, <span><span>oldValue<span><span>) {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 当 `source` 变化时，仅触发一次<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> },<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> once: <span><span>true<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/watchers.html", "title": "侦听器 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "7b1bb8d36fb1441997af8af7b7909e93", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1820, "chunk_index": 50, "_doc_id": "50_4318331708477905234"}}
{"doc_id": "51_328317829937907065", "text": "pan class=\"line\"><span> },<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> once: <span><span>true<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span><code><pre><div><div><div class=\"composition-api\"><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>watch<span><span>(<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> source,<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/watchers.html", "title": "侦听器 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "7b1bb8d36fb1441997af8af7b7909e93", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1820, "chunk_index": 51, "_doc_id": "51_328317829937907065"}}
{"doc_id": "52_48937465598348270", "text": "pan class=\"line\"><span>watch<span><span>(<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> source,<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> (<span><span>newValue<span><span>, <span><span>oldValue<span><span>) <span><span>=><span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 当 `source` 变化时，仅触发一次<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> },<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> { once: <span><span>true<span><span> }<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/watchers.html", "title": "侦听器 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "7b1bb8d36fb1441997af8af7b7909e93", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1820, "chunk_index": 52, "_doc_id": "52_48937465598348270"}}
{"doc_id": "53_5080847436467298711", "text": "><span> },<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> { once: <span><span>true<span><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>)<span><span><code><pre><div><div><div class=\"composition-api\"><h2 id=\"watcheffect\"><code>watchEffect()<code> <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#watcheffect\">​<a><h2><p>侦听器的回调使用与源完全相同的响应式状态是很常见的。例如下面的代码，在每当 <code>todoId<code> 的引用发生变化时使用侦听器来加载一个远程资源：<p><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> todoId<span><span> =<span><span> ref<span><span>(<span><span>1<span><span>)<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/watchers.html", "title": "侦听器 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "7b1bb8d36fb1441997af8af7b7909e93", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1820, "chunk_index": 53, "_doc_id": "53_5080847436467298711"}}
{"doc_id": "54_7592479502924910826", "text": "span><span> todoId<span><span> =<span><span> ref<span><span>(<span><span>1<span><span>)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> data<span><span> =<span><span> ref<span><span>(<span><span>null<span><span>)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>watch<span><span>(<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> todoId,<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> async<span><span> () <span><span>=><span><span> {<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/watchers.html", "title": "侦听器 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "7b1bb8d36fb1441997af8af7b7909e93", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1820, "chunk_index": 54, "_doc_id": "54_7592479502924910826"}}
{"doc_id": "55_6340384974445393993", "text": "span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> async<span><span> () <span><span>=><span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> const<span><span> response<span><span> =<span><span> await<span><span> fetch<span><span>(<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> `https://jsonplaceholder.typicode.com/todos/${<span><span>todoId<span><span>.<span><span>value<span><span>}`<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> )<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/watchers.html", "title": "侦听器 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "7b1bb8d36fb1441997af8af7b7909e93", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1820, "chunk_index": 55, "_doc_id": "55_6340384974445393993"}}
{"doc_id": "56_2093498830043228334", "text": "oId<span><span>.<span><span>value<span><span>}`<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> )<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> data.value <span><span>=<span><span> await<span><span> response.<span><span>json<span><span>()<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> },<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> { immediate: <span><span>true<span><span> }<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/watchers.html", "title": "侦听器 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "7b1bb8d36fb1441997af8af7b7909e93", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1820, "chunk_index": 56, "_doc_id": "56_2093498830043228334"}}
{"doc_id": "57_2045434011371297471", "text": "n> },<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> { immediate: <span><span>true<span><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>)<span><span><code><pre><div><p>特别是注意侦听器是如何两次使用 <code>todoId<code> 的，一次是作为源，另一次是在回调中。<p><p>我们可以用 <a href=\"/api/reactivity-core.html#watcheffect\"><code>watchEffect<code> 函数<a> 来简化上面的代码。<code>watchEffect()<code> 允许我们自动跟踪回调的响应式依赖。上面的侦听器可以重写为：<p><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>watchEffect<span><span>(<span><span>async<span><span> () <span><span>=><span><span> {<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/watchers.html", "title": "侦听器 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "7b1bb8d36fb1441997af8af7b7909e93", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1820, "chunk_index": 57, "_doc_id": "57_2045434011371297471"}}
{"doc_id": "58_7395994246640953491", "text": "n>watchEffect<span><span>(<span><span>async<span><span> () <span><span>=><span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> const<span><span> response<span><span> =<span><span> await<span><span> fetch<span><span>(<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> `https://jsonplaceholder.typicode.com/todos/${<span><span>todoId<span><span>.<span><span>value<span><span>}`<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> )<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/watchers.html", "title": "侦听器 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "7b1bb8d36fb1441997af8af7b7909e93", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1820, "chunk_index": 58, "_doc_id": "58_7395994246640953491"}}
{"doc_id": "59_79715792621714725", "text": "oId<span><span>.<span><span>value<span><span>}`<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> )<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> data.value <span><span>=<span><span> await<span><span> response.<span><span>json<span><span>()<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>})<span><span><code><pre><div><p>这个例子中，回调会立即执行，不需要指定 <code>immediate: true<code>。在执行期间，它会自动追踪 <code>todoId.value<code> 作为依赖(和计算属性类似)。每当 <code>todoId.value<code> 变化时，回调会再次执行。有了 <code>watchEffect()<code>，我们不再需要明确传递 <code>todoId<code> 作为源值。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/watchers.html", "title": "侦听器 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "7b1bb8d36fb1441997af8af7b7909e93", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1820, "chunk_index": 59, "_doc_id": "59_79715792621714725"}}
{"doc_id": "60_5559104143076591121", "text": "code>todoId.value<code> 变化时，回调会再次执行。有了 <code>watchEffect()<code>，我们不再需要明确传递 <code>todoId<code> 作为源值。<p><p>你可以参考一下<a href=\"/examples/#fetching-data\">这个例子<a>的 <code>watchEffect<code> 和响应式的数据请求的操作。<p><p>对于这种只有一个依赖项的例子来说，<code>watchEffect()<code> 的好处相对较小。但是对于有多个依赖项的侦听器来说，使用 <code>watchEffect()<code> 可以消除手动维护依赖列表的负担。此外，如果你需要侦听一个嵌套数据结构中的几个属性，<code>watchEffect()<code> 可能会比深度侦听器更有效，因为它将只跟踪回调中被使用到的属性，而不是递归地跟踪所有的属性。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/watchers.html", "title": "侦听器 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "7b1bb8d36fb1441997af8af7b7909e93", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1820, "chunk_index": 60, "_doc_id": "60_5559104143076591121"}}
{"doc_id": "61_8411423936281700376", "text": "的负担。此外，如果你需要侦听一个嵌套数据结构中的几个属性，<code>watchEffect()<code> 可能会比深度侦听器更有效，因为它将只跟踪回调中被使用到的属性，而不是递归地跟踪所有的属性。<p><div class=\"tip custom-block\"><p class=\"custom-block-title\">TIP<p><p><code>watchEffect<code> 仅会在其<strong>同步<strong>执行期间，才追踪依赖。在使用异步回调时，只有在第一个 <code>await<code> 正常工作前访问到的属性才会被追踪。<p><div><h3 id=\"watch-vs-watcheffect\"><code>watch<code> vs. <code>watchEffect<code> <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#watch-vs-watcheffect\">​<a><h3><p><code>watch<code> 和 <code>watchEffect<code> 都能响应式地执行有副作用的回调。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/watchers.html", "title": "侦听器 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "7b1bb8d36fb1441997af8af7b7909e93", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1820, "chunk_index": 61, "_doc_id": "61_8411423936281700376"}}
{"doc_id": "62_319600699713013996", "text": "href=\"#watch-vs-watcheffect\">​<a><h3><p><code>watch<code> 和 <code>watchEffect<code> 都能响应式地执行有副作用的回调。它们之间的主要区别是追踪响应式依赖的方式：<p><div><h2 id=\"side-effect-cleanup\">副作用清理 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#side-effect-cleanup\">​<a><h2><p>有时我们可能会在侦听器中执行副作用，例如异步请求：<p><div class=\"composition-api\"><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>watch<span><span>(id, (<span><span>newId<span><span>) <span><span>=><span><span> {<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/watchers.html", "title": "侦听器 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "7b1bb8d36fb1441997af8af7b7909e93", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1820, "chunk_index": 62, "_doc_id": "62_319600699713013996"}}
{"doc_id": "63_1147443347125482733", "text": "span>watch<span><span>(id, (<span><span>newId<span><span>) <span><span>=><span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> fetch<span><span>(<span><span>`/api/${<span><span>newId<span><span>}`<span><span>).<span><span>then<span><span>(() <span><span>=><span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 回调逻辑<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> })<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/watchers.html", "title": "侦听器 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "7b1bb8d36fb1441997af8af7b7909e93", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1820, "chunk_index": 63, "_doc_id": "63_1147443347125482733"}}
{"doc_id": "64_3531903688353201806", "text": "<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 回调逻辑<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> })<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>})<span><span><code><pre><div><div><div class=\"options-api\"><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> watch: {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> id<span><span>(<span><span>newId<span><span>) {<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/watchers.html", "title": "侦听器 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "7b1bb8d36fb1441997af8af7b7909e93", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1820, "chunk_index": 64, "_doc_id": "64_3531903688353201806"}}
{"doc_id": "65_1960723313339711806", "text": "{<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> id<span><span>(<span><span>newId<span><span>) {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> fetch<span><span>(<span><span>`/api/${<span><span>newId<span><span>}`<span><span>).<span><span>then<span><span>(() <span><span>=><span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 回调逻辑<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> })<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/watchers.html", "title": "侦听器 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "7b1bb8d36fb1441997af8af7b7909e93", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1820, "chunk_index": 65, "_doc_id": "65_1960723313339711806"}}
{"doc_id": "66_4044592271574484810", "text": "pan> })<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span><code><pre><div><div><p>但是如果在请求完成之前 <code>id<code> 发生了变化怎么办？当上一个请求完成时，它仍会使用已经过时的 ID 值触发回调。理想情况下，我们希望能够在 <code>id<code> 变为新值时取消过时的请求。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/watchers.html", "title": "侦听器 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "7b1bb8d36fb1441997af8af7b7909e93", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1820, "chunk_index": 66, "_doc_id": "66_4044592271574484810"}}
{"doc_id": "67_4770553798620790268", "text": "成之前 <code>id<code> 发生了变化怎么办？当上一个请求完成时，它仍会使用已经过时的 ID 值触发回调。理想情况下，我们希望能够在 <code>id<code> 变为新值时取消过时的请求。<p><p>我们可以使用 <a href=\"/api/reactivity-core.html#onwatchercleanup\"><code>onWatcherCleanup()<code><a> API 来注册一个清理函数，当侦听器失效并准备重新运行时会被调用：<p><div class=\"composition-api\"><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>import<span><span> { watch, onWatcherCleanup } <span><span>from<span><span> 'vue'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/watchers.html", "title": "侦听器 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "7b1bb8d36fb1441997af8af7b7909e93", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1820, "chunk_index": 67, "_doc_id": "67_4770553798620790268"}}
{"doc_id": "68_253675431819225757", "text": "watch, onWatcherCleanup } <span><span>from<span><span> 'vue'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>watch<span><span>(id, (<span><span>newId<span><span>) <span><span>=><span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> const<span><span> controller<span><span> =<span><span> new<span><span> AbortController<span><span>()<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/watchers.html", "title": "侦听器 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "7b1bb8d36fb1441997af8af7b7909e93", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1820, "chunk_index": 68, "_doc_id": "68_253675431819225757"}}
{"doc_id": "69_7462608890993303187", "text": "> =<span><span> new<span><span> AbortController<span><span>()<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> fetch<span><span>(<span><span>`/api/${<span><span>newId<span><span>}`<span><span>, { signal: controller.signal }).<span><span>then<span><span>(() <span><span>=><span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 回调逻辑<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> })<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/watchers.html", "title": "侦听器 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "7b1bb8d36fb1441997af8af7b7909e93", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1820, "chunk_index": 69, "_doc_id": "69_7462608890993303187"}}
{"doc_id": "70_3237211259504055582", "text": "line\"><span> // 回调逻辑<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> })<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line highlighted\"><span> onWatcherCleanup<span><span>(() <span><span>=><span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line highlighted\"><span> // 终止过期请求<span><span>\n<span class=\"line highlighted\"><span> controller.<span><span>abort<span><span>()<span><span>\n<span class=\"line highlighted\"><span> })<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/watchers.html", "title": "侦听器 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "7b1bb8d36fb1441997af8af7b7909e93", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1820, "chunk_index": 70, "_doc_id": "70_3237211259504055582"}}
{"doc_id": "71_6868327485054999163", "text": "er.<span><span>abort<span><span>()<span><span>\n<span class=\"line highlighted\"><span> })<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>})<span><span><code><pre><div><div><div class=\"options-api\"><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>import<span><span> { onWatcherCleanup } <span><span>from<span><span> 'vue'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/watchers.html", "title": "侦听器 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "7b1bb8d36fb1441997af8af7b7909e93", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1820, "chunk_index": 71, "_doc_id": "71_6868327485054999163"}}
{"doc_id": "72_2096462738787425099", "text": "n class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> watch: {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> id<span><span>(<span><span>newId<span><span>) {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> const<span><span> controller<span><span> =<span><span> new<span><span> AbortController<span><span>()<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/watchers.html", "title": "侦听器 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "7b1bb8d36fb1441997af8af7b7909e93", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1820, "chunk_index": 72, "_doc_id": "72_2096462738787425099"}}
{"doc_id": "73_7462608890993303187", "text": "> =<span><span> new<span><span> AbortController<span><span>()<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> fetch<span><span>(<span><span>`/api/${<span><span>newId<span><span>}`<span><span>, { signal: controller.signal }).<span><span>then<span><span>(() <span><span>=><span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 回调逻辑<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> })<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/watchers.html", "title": "侦听器 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "7b1bb8d36fb1441997af8af7b7909e93", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1820, "chunk_index": 73, "_doc_id": "73_7462608890993303187"}}
{"doc_id": "74_164430920211200094", "text": "line\"><span> // 回调逻辑<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> })<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line highlighted\"><span> onWatcherCleanup<span><span>(() <span><span>=><span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line highlighted\"><span> // 终止过期请求<span><span>\n<span class=\"line highlighted\"><span> controller.<span><span>abort<span><span>()<span><span>\n<span class=\"line highlighted\"><span> })<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/watchers.html", "title": "侦听器 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "7b1bb8d36fb1441997af8af7b7909e93", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1820, "chunk_index": 74, "_doc_id": "74_164430920211200094"}}
{"doc_id": "75_7554906955318418559", "text": "pan> })<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span><code><pre><div><div><p>请注意，<code>onWatcherCleanup<code> 仅在 Vue 3.5+ 中支持，并且必须在 <code>watchEffect<code> 效果函数或 <code>watch<code> 回调函数的同步执行期间调用：你不能在异步函数的 <code>await<code> 语句之后调用它。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/watchers.html", "title": "侦听器 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "7b1bb8d36fb1441997af8af7b7909e93", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1820, "chunk_index": 75, "_doc_id": "75_7554906955318418559"}}
{"doc_id": "76_2198995105051314504", "text": "在 <code>watchEffect<code> 效果函数或 <code>watch<code> 回调函数的同步执行期间调用：你不能在异步函数的 <code>await<code> 语句之后调用它。<p><p>作为替代，<code>onCleanup<code> 函数还作为第三个参数传递给侦听器回调<span class=\"composition-api\">，以及 <code>watchEffect<code> 作用函数的第一个参数<span>：<p><div class=\"composition-api\"><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>watch<span><span>(id, (<span><span>newId<span><span>, <span><span>oldId<span><span>, <span><span>onCleanup<span><span>) <span><span>=><span><span> {<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/watchers.html", "title": "侦听器 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "7b1bb8d36fb1441997af8af7b7909e93", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1820, "chunk_index": 76, "_doc_id": "76_2198995105051314504"}}
{"doc_id": "77_6932612367383586915", "text": "span>oldId<span><span>, <span><span>onCleanup<span><span>) <span><span>=><span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // ...<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> onCleanup<span><span>(() <span><span>=><span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 清理逻辑<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> })<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>})<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/watchers.html", "title": "侦听器 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "7b1bb8d36fb1441997af8af7b7909e93", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1820, "chunk_index": 77, "_doc_id": "77_6932612367383586915"}}
{"doc_id": "78_3446881452870931283", "text": "lass=\"line\"><span> })<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>})<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>watchEffect<span><span>((<span><span>onCleanup<span><span>) <span><span>=><span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // ...<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> onCleanup<span><span>(() <span><span>=><span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 清理逻辑<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> })<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/watchers.html", "title": "侦听器 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "7b1bb8d36fb1441997af8af7b7909e93", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1820, "chunk_index": 78, "_doc_id": "78_3446881452870931283"}}
{"doc_id": "79_1891032223929022819", "text": "<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 清理逻辑<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> })<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>})<span><span><code><pre><div><div><div class=\"options-api\"><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> watch: {<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/watchers.html", "title": "侦听器 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "7b1bb8d36fb1441997af8af7b7909e93", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1820, "chunk_index": 79, "_doc_id": "79_1891032223929022819"}}
{"doc_id": "80_1181742276617776411", "text": "export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> watch: {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> id<span><span>(<span><span>newId<span><span>, <span><span>oldId<span><span>, <span><span>onCleanup<span><span>) {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // ...<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> onCleanup<span><span>(() <span><span>=><span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 清理逻辑<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> })<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/watchers.html", "title": "侦听器 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "7b1bb8d36fb1441997af8af7b7909e93", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1820, "chunk_index": 80, "_doc_id": "80_1181742276617776411"}}
{"doc_id": "81_5808367013752199774", "text": "<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 清理逻辑<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> })<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span><code><pre><div><div><p>这在 3.5 之前的版本有效。此外，通过函数参数传递的 <code>onCleanup<code> 与侦听器实例相绑定，因此不受 <code>onWatcherCleanup<code> 的同步限制。<p><h2 id=\"callback-flush-timing\">回调的触发时机 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#callback-flush-timing\">​<a><h2><p>当你更改了响应式状态，它可能会同时触发 Vue 组件更新和侦听器回调。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/watchers.html", "title": "侦听器 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "7b1bb8d36fb1441997af8af7b7909e93", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1820, "chunk_index": 81, "_doc_id": "81_5808367013752199774"}}
{"doc_id": "82_8358062641383275831", "text": "a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#callback-flush-timing\">​<a><h2><p>当你更改了响应式状态，它可能会同时触发 Vue 组件更新和侦听器回调。<p><p>类似于组件更新，用户创建的侦听器回调函数也会被批量处理以避免重复调用。例如，如果我们同步将一千个项目推入被侦听的数组中，我们可能不希望侦听器触发一千次。<p><p>默认情况下，侦听器回调会在父组件更新 (如有) <strong>之后<strong>、所属组件的 DOM 更新<strong>之前<strong>被调用。这意味着如果你尝试在侦听器回调中访问所属组件的 DOM，那么 DOM 将处于更新前的状态。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/watchers.html", "title": "侦听器 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "7b1bb8d36fb1441997af8af7b7909e93", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1820, "chunk_index": 82, "_doc_id": "82_8358062641383275831"}}
{"doc_id": "83_1536190336104091774", "text": ") <strong>之后<strong>、所属组件的 DOM 更新<strong>之前<strong>被调用。这意味着如果你尝试在侦听器回调中访问所属组件的 DOM，那么 DOM 将处于更新前的状态。<p><h3 id=\"post-watchers\">Post Watchers <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#post-watchers\">​<a><h3><p>如果想在侦听器回调中能访问被 Vue 更新<strong>之后<strong>的所属组件的 DOM，你需要指明 <code>flush: 'post'<code> 选项：<p><div class=\"options-api\"><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/watchers.html", "title": "侦听器 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "7b1bb8d36fb1441997af8af7b7909e93", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1820, "chunk_index": 83, "_doc_id": "83_1536190336104091774"}}
{"doc_id": "84_8006828121545592015", "text": "b-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // ...<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> watch: {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> key: {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> handler<span><span>() {},<span><span>\n<span class=\"line highlighted\"><span> flush: <span><span>'post'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/watchers.html", "title": "侦听器 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "7b1bb8d36fb1441997af8af7b7909e93", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1820, "chunk_index": 84, "_doc_id": "84_8006828121545592015"}}
{"doc_id": "85_1802022835735837482", "text": ">'post'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span><code><pre><div><div><div class=\"composition-api\"><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>watch<span><span>(source, callback, {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line highlighted\"><span> flush: <span><span>'post'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>})<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/watchers.html", "title": "侦听器 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "7b1bb8d36fb1441997af8af7b7909e93", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1820, "chunk_index": 85, "_doc_id": "85_1802022835735837482"}}
{"doc_id": "86_5501546182149804475", "text": "h: <span><span>'post'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>})<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>watchEffect<span><span>(callback, {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line highlighted\"><span> flush: <span><span>'post'<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/watchers.html", "title": "侦听器 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "7b1bb8d36fb1441997af8af7b7909e93", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1820, "chunk_index": 86, "_doc_id": "86_5501546182149804475"}}
{"doc_id": "87_6780530212959671565", "text": "callback, {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line highlighted\"><span> flush: <span><span>'post'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>})<span><span><code><pre><div><p>后置刷新的 <code>watchEffect()<code> 有个更方便的别名 <code>watchPostEffect()<code>：<p><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>import<span><span> { watchPostEffect } <span><span>from<span><span> 'vue'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/watchers.html", "title": "侦听器 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "7b1bb8d36fb1441997af8af7b7909e93", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1820, "chunk_index": 87, "_doc_id": "87_6780530212959671565"}}
{"doc_id": "88_899334560268360838", "text": "<span> { watchPostEffect } <span><span>from<span><span> 'vue'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>watchPostEffect<span><span>(() <span><span>=><span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> /* 在 Vue 更新后执行 */<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/watchers.html", "title": "侦听器 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "7b1bb8d36fb1441997af8af7b7909e93", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1820, "chunk_index": 88, "_doc_id": "88_899334560268360838"}}
{"doc_id": "89_8138877855785850917", "text": "() <span><span>=><span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> /* 在 Vue 更新后执行 */<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>})<span><span><code><pre><div><div><h3 id=\"sync-watchers\">同步侦听器 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#sync-watchers\">​<a><h3><p>你还可以创建一个同步触发的侦听器，它会在 Vue 进行任何更新之前触发：<p><div class=\"options-api\"><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/watchers.html", "title": "侦听器 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "7b1bb8d36fb1441997af8af7b7909e93", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1820, "chunk_index": 89, "_doc_id": "89_8138877855785850917"}}
{"doc_id": "90_2933458754176453616", "text": "b-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // ...<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> watch: {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> key: {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> handler<span><span>() {},<span><span>\n<span class=\"line highlighted\"><span> flush: <span><span>'sync'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/watchers.html", "title": "侦听器 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "7b1bb8d36fb1441997af8af7b7909e93", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1820, "chunk_index": 90, "_doc_id": "90_2933458754176453616"}}
{"doc_id": "91_2997442349802652199", "text": ">'sync'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span><code><pre><div><div><div class=\"composition-api\"><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>watch<span><span>(source, callback, {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line highlighted\"><span> flush: <span><span>'sync'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>})<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/watchers.html", "title": "侦听器 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "7b1bb8d36fb1441997af8af7b7909e93", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1820, "chunk_index": 91, "_doc_id": "91_2997442349802652199"}}
{"doc_id": "92_1617987064689747149", "text": "h: <span><span>'sync'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>})<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>watchEffect<span><span>(callback, {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line highlighted\"><span> flush: <span><span>'sync'<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/watchers.html", "title": "侦听器 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "7b1bb8d36fb1441997af8af7b7909e93", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1820, "chunk_index": 92, "_doc_id": "92_1617987064689747149"}}
{"doc_id": "93_5094062509747875878", "text": "callback, {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line highlighted\"><span> flush: <span><span>'sync'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>})<span><span><code><pre><div><p>同步触发的 <code>watchEffect()<code> 有个更方便的别名 <code>watchSyncEffect()<code>：<p><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>import<span><span> { watchSyncEffect } <span><span>from<span><span> 'vue'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/watchers.html", "title": "侦听器 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "7b1bb8d36fb1441997af8af7b7909e93", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1820, "chunk_index": 93, "_doc_id": "93_5094062509747875878"}}
{"doc_id": "94_6408632620688581904", "text": "<span> { watchSyncEffect } <span><span>from<span><span> 'vue'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>watchSyncEffect<span><span>(() <span><span>=><span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> /* 在响应式数据变化时同步执行 */<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>})<span><span><code><pre><div><div><div class=\"warning custom-block\"><p class=\"custom-block-title\">谨慎使用<p><p>同步侦听器不会进行批处理，每当检测到响应式数据发生变化时就会触发。可以使用它来监视简单的布尔值，但应避免在可能多次同步修改的数据源 (如数组) 上使用。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/watchers.html", "title": "侦听器 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "7b1bb8d36fb1441997af8af7b7909e93", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1820, "chunk_index": 94, "_doc_id": "94_6408632620688581904"}}
{"doc_id": "95_3213905673039209187", "text": "-block-title\">谨慎使用<p><p>同步侦听器不会进行批处理，每当检测到响应式数据发生变化时就会触发。可以使用它来监视简单的布尔值，但应避免在可能多次同步修改的数据源 (如数组) 上使用。<p><div><div class=\"options-api\"><h2 id=\"this-watch\"><code>this.$watch()<code> <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#this-watch\">​<a><h2><p>我们也可以使用组件实例的 <a href=\"/api/component-instance.html#watch\"><code>$watch()<code> 方法<a>来命令式地创建一个侦听器：<p><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/watchers.html", "title": "侦听器 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "7b1bb8d36fb1441997af8af7b7909e93", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1820, "chunk_index": 95, "_doc_id": "95_3213905673039209187"}}
{"doc_id": "96_546344134481696260", "text": "b-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> created<span><span>() {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> this<span><span>.<span><span>$watch<span><span>(<span><span>'question'<span><span>, (<span><span>newQuestion<span><span>) <span><span>=><span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // ...<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> })<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/watchers.html", "title": "侦听器 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "7b1bb8d36fb1441997af8af7b7909e93", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1820, "chunk_index": 96, "_doc_id": "96_546344134481696260"}}
{"doc_id": "97_8733308854000909257", "text": "// ...<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> })<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span><code><pre><div><p>如果要在特定条件下设置一个侦听器，或者只侦听响应用户交互的内容，这方法很有用。它还允许你提前停止该侦听器。<p><div><h2 id=\"stopping-a-watcher\">停止侦听器 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#stopping-a-watcher\">​<a><h2><div class=\"options-api\"><p>用 <code>watch<code> 选项或者 <code>$watch()<code> 实例方法声明的侦听器，会在宿主组件卸载时自动停止。因此，在大多数场景下，你无需关心怎么停止它。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/watchers.html", "title": "侦听器 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "7b1bb8d36fb1441997af8af7b7909e93", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1820, "chunk_index": 97, "_doc_id": "97_8733308854000909257"}}
{"doc_id": "98_1526768805369131764", "text": "pi\"><p>用 <code>watch<code> 选项或者 <code>$watch()<code> 实例方法声明的侦听器，会在宿主组件卸载时自动停止。因此，在大多数场景下，你无需关心怎么停止它。<p><p>在少数情况下，你的确需要在组件卸载之前就停止一个侦听器，这时可以调用 <code>$watch()<code> API 返回的函数：<p><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> unwatch<span><span> =<span><span> this<span><span>.<span><span>$watch<span><span>(<span><span>'foo'<span><span>, callback)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/watchers.html", "title": "侦听器 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "7b1bb8d36fb1441997af8af7b7909e93", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1820, "chunk_index": 98, "_doc_id": "98_1526768805369131764"}}
{"doc_id": "99_4008092854334555178", "text": "n>$watch<span><span>(<span><span>'foo'<span><span>, callback)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// ...当该侦听器不再需要时<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>unwatch<span><span>()<span><span><code><pre><div><div><div class=\"composition-api\"><p>在 <code>setup()<code> 或 <code><script setup><code> 中用同步语句创建的侦听器，会自动绑定到宿主组件实例上，并且会在宿主组件卸载时自动停止。因此，在大多数情况下，你无需关心怎么停止一个侦听器。<p><p>一个关键点是，侦听器必须用<strong>同步<strong>语句创建：如果用异步回调创建一个侦听器，那么它不会绑定到当前组件上，你必须手动停止它，以防内存泄漏。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/watchers.html", "title": "侦听器 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "7b1bb8d36fb1441997af8af7b7909e93", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1820, "chunk_index": 99, "_doc_id": "99_4008092854334555178"}}
{"doc_id": "100_3925187799078654362", "text": "需关心怎么停止一个侦听器。<p><p>一个关键点是，侦听器必须用<strong>同步<strong>语句创建：如果用异步回调创建一个侦听器，那么它不会绑定到当前组件上，你必须手动停止它，以防内存泄漏。如下方这个例子：<p><div class=\"language-vue\"> <span class=\"lang\">vue<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>script<span><span> setup<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>import<span><span> { watchEffect } <span><span>from<span><span> 'vue'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 它会自动停止<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/watchers.html", "title": "侦听器 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "7b1bb8d36fb1441997af8af7b7909e93", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1820, "chunk_index": 100, "_doc_id": "100_3925187799078654362"}}
{"doc_id": "101_3694847225004817914", "text": "n><span> 'vue'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 它会自动停止<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>watchEffect<span><span>(() <span><span>=><span><span> {})<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// ...这个则不会！<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>setTimeout<span><span>(() <span><span>=><span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> watchEffect<span><span>(() <span><span>=><span><span> {})<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/watchers.html", "title": "侦听器 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "7b1bb8d36fb1441997af8af7b7909e93", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1820, "chunk_index": 101, "_doc_id": "101_3694847225004817914"}}
{"doc_id": "102_308465451608052874", "text": "an>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> watchEffect<span><span>(() <span><span>=><span><span> {})<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}, <span><span>100<span><span>)<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/watchers.html", "title": "侦听器 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "7b1bb8d36fb1441997af8af7b7909e93", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1820, "chunk_index": 102, "_doc_id": "102_308465451608052874"}}
{"doc_id": "103_620384722685676509", "text": "=><span><span> {})<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}, <span><span>100<span><span>)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>script<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>要手动停止一个侦听器，请调用 <code>watch<code> 或 <code>watchEffect<code> 返回的函数：<p><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> unwatch<span><span> =<span><span> watchEffect<span><span>(() <span><span>=><span><span> {})<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/watchers.html", "title": "侦听器 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "7b1bb8d36fb1441997af8af7b7909e93", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1820, "chunk_index": 103, "_doc_id": "103_620384722685676509"}}
{"doc_id": "104_2592888737714626437", "text": "tch<span><span> =<span><span> watchEffect<span><span>(() <span><span>=><span><span> {})<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// ...当该侦听器不再需要时<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>unwatch<span><span>()<span><span><code><pre><div><p>注意，需要异步创建侦听器的情况很少，请尽可能选择同步创建。如果需要等待一些异步数据，你可以使用条件式的侦听逻辑：<p><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// 需要异步请求得到的数据<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/watchers.html", "title": "侦听器 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "7b1bb8d36fb1441997af8af7b7909e93", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1820, "chunk_index": 104, "_doc_id": "104_2592888737714626437"}}
{"doc_id": "105_2665131544803171949", "text": "an><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// 需要异步请求得到的数据<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> data<span><span> =<span><span> ref<span><span>(<span><span>null<span><span>)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>watchEffect<span><span>(() <span><span>=><span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> if<span><span> (data.value) {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 数据加载后执行某些操作...<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/watchers.html", "title": "侦听器 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "7b1bb8d36fb1441997af8af7b7909e93", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1820, "chunk_index": 105, "_doc_id": "105_2665131544803171949"}}
{"doc_id": "106_7701807181527845407", "text": "> if<span><span> (data.value) {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 数据加载后执行某些操作...<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>})<span><span><code><pre><div><div><div><div>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/watchers.html", "title": "侦听器 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "7b1bb8d36fb1441997af8af7b7909e93", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1820, "chunk_index": 106, "_doc_id": "106_7701807181527845407"}}
{"doc_id": "0_7299487137074432126", "text": "<div><div><h1 id=\"creating-a-vue-application\">创建一个 Vue 应用 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#creating-a-vue-application\">​<a><h1><h2 id=\"the-application-instance\">应用实例 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#the-application-instance\">​<a><h2><p>每个 Vue 应用都是通过 <a href=\"/api/application.", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/application.html", "title": "创建一个 Vue 应用", "doc_id": "cfaa26eecb6e4836ae455fa2d6ac0a84", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 286, "chunk_index": 0, "_doc_id": "0_7299487137074432126"}}
{"doc_id": "1_5739038844151039650", "text": "\"header-anchor\" href=\"#the-application-instance\">​<a><h2><p>每个 Vue 应用都是通过 <a href=\"/api/application.html#createapp\"><code>createApp<code><a> 函数创建一个新的 <strong>应用实例<strong>：<p><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>import<span><span> { createApp } <span><span>from<span><span> 'vue'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> app<span><span> =<span><span> createApp<span><span>({<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/application.html", "title": "创建一个 Vue 应用", "doc_id": "cfaa26eecb6e4836ae455fa2d6ac0a84", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 286, "chunk_index": 1, "_doc_id": "1_5739038844151039650"}}
{"doc_id": "2_5857530151548335498", "text": "ss=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> app<span><span> =<span><span> createApp<span><span>({<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> /* 根组件选项 */<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/application.html", "title": "创建一个 Vue 应用", "doc_id": "cfaa26eecb6e4836ae455fa2d6ac0a84", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 286, "chunk_index": 2, "_doc_id": "2_5857530151548335498"}}
{"doc_id": "3_4932158576152434563", "text": "=<span><span> createApp<span><span>({<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> /* 根组件选项 */<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>})<span><span><code><pre><div><h2 id=\"the-root-component\">根组件 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#the-root-component\">​<a><h2><p>我们传入 <code>createApp<code> 的对象实际上是一个组件，每个应用都需要一个“根组件”，其他组件将作为其子组件。<p><p>如果你使用的是单文件组件，我们可以直接从另一个文件中导入根组件。<p><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>import<span><span> { createApp } <span><span>from<span><span> 'vue'<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/application.html", "title": "创建一个 Vue 应用", "doc_id": "cfaa26eecb6e4836ae455fa2d6ac0a84", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 286, "chunk_index": 3, "_doc_id": "3_4932158576152434563"}}
{"doc_id": "4_1023390738168108224", "text": "class=\"line\"><span>import<span><span> { createApp } <span><span>from<span><span> 'vue'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 从一个单文件组件中导入根组件<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>import<span><span> App <span><span>from<span><span> './App.vue'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/application.html", "title": "创建一个 Vue 应用", "doc_id": "cfaa26eecb6e4836ae455fa2d6ac0a84", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 286, "chunk_index": 4, "_doc_id": "4_1023390738168108224"}}
{"doc_id": "5_4909432774801920301", "text": "port<span><span> App <span><span>from<span><span> './App.vue'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> app<span><span> =<span><span> createApp<span><span>(App)<span><span><code><pre><div><p>虽然本指南中的许多示例只需要一个组件，但大多数真实的应用都是由一棵嵌套的、可重用的组件树组成的。例如，一个待办事项 (Todos) 应用的组件树可能是这样的：<p><div class=\"language-\"> <span class=\"lang\"><span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>App (root component)<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/application.html", "title": "创建一个 Vue 应用", "doc_id": "cfaa26eecb6e4836ae455fa2d6ac0a84", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 286, "chunk_index": 5, "_doc_id": "5_4909432774801920301"}}
{"doc_id": "6_1967914402890586474", "text": "e class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>App (root component)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>├─ TodoList<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│ └─ TodoItem<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│ ├─ TodoDeleteButton<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│ └─ TodoEditButton<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>└─ TodoFooter<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> ├─ TodoClearButton<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/application.html", "title": "创建一个 Vue 应用", "doc_id": "cfaa26eecb6e4836ae455fa2d6ac0a84", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 286, "chunk_index": 6, "_doc_id": "6_1967914402890586474"}}
{"doc_id": "7_8331430467628380535", "text": "ass=\"line\"><span>└─ TodoFooter<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> ├─ TodoClearButton<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> └─ TodoStatistics<span><span><code><pre><div><p>我们会在指南的后续章节中讨论如何定义和组合多个组件。在那之前，我们得先关注一个组件内到底发生了什么。<p><h2 id=\"mounting-the-app\">挂载应用 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#mounting-the-app\">​<a><h2><p>应用实例必须在调用了 <code>.mount()<code> 方法后才会渲染出来。该方法接收一个“容器”参数，可以是一个实际的 DOM 元素或是一个 CSS 选择器字符串：<p><p>应用根组件的内容将会被渲染在容器元素里面。容器元素自己将<strong>不会<strong>被视为应用的一部分。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/application.html", "title": "创建一个 Vue 应用", "doc_id": "cfaa26eecb6e4836ae455fa2d6ac0a84", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 286, "chunk_index": 7, "_doc_id": "7_8331430467628380535"}}
{"doc_id": "8_4149407455004337217", "text": "“容器”参数，可以是一个实际的 DOM 元素或是一个 CSS 选择器字符串：<p><p>应用根组件的内容将会被渲染在容器元素里面。容器元素自己将<strong>不会<strong>被视为应用的一部分。<p><p><code>.mount()<code> 方法应该始终在整个应用配置和资源注册完成后被调用。同时请注意，不同于其他资源注册方法，它的返回值是根组件实例而非应用实例。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/application.html", "title": "创建一个 Vue 应用", "doc_id": "cfaa26eecb6e4836ae455fa2d6ac0a84", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 286, "chunk_index": 8, "_doc_id": "8_4149407455004337217"}}
{"doc_id": "9_2003591130699699742", "text": "g>被视为应用的一部分。<p><p><code>.mount()<code> 方法应该始终在整个应用配置和资源注册完成后被调用。同时请注意，不同于其他资源注册方法，它的返回值是根组件实例而非应用实例。<p><h3 id=\"in-dom-root-component-template\">DOM 中的根组件模板 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#in-dom-root-component-template\">​<a><h3><p>根组件的模板通常是组件本身的一部分，但也可以直接通过在挂载容器内编写模板来单独提供：<p><div class=\"language-html\"> <span class=\"lang\">html<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>div<span><span> id<span><span>=<span><span>\"app\"<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/application.html", "title": "创建一个 Vue 应用", "doc_id": "cfaa26eecb6e4836ae455fa2d6ac0a84", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 286, "chunk_index": 9, "_doc_id": "9_2003591130699699742"}}
{"doc_id": "10_2482567637016109415", "text": "\"line\"><span><<span><span>div<span><span> id<span><span>=<span><span>\"app\"<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>button<span><span> @click<span><span>=<span><span>\"count++\"<span><span>>{{ count }}</<span><span>button<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/application.html", "title": "创建一个 Vue 应用", "doc_id": "cfaa26eecb6e4836ae455fa2d6ac0a84", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 286, "chunk_index": 10, "_doc_id": "10_2482567637016109415"}}
{"doc_id": "11_3990973030697476551", "text": "n><span>=<span><span>\"count++\"<span><span>>{{ count }}</<span><span>button<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>div<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>import<span><span> { createApp } <span><span>from<span><span> 'vue'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/application.html", "title": "创建一个 Vue 应用", "doc_id": "cfaa26eecb6e4836ae455fa2d6ac0a84", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 286, "chunk_index": 11, "_doc_id": "11_3990973030697476551"}}
{"doc_id": "12_2172804723044773893", "text": "<span><span> { createApp } <span><span>from<span><span> 'vue'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> app<span><span> =<span><span> createApp<span><span>({<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> data<span><span>() {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> return<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> count: <span><span>0<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>})<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/application.html", "title": "创建一个 Vue 应用", "doc_id": "cfaa26eecb6e4836ae455fa2d6ac0a84", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 286, "chunk_index": 12, "_doc_id": "12_2172804723044773893"}}
{"doc_id": "13_6248742031151782630", "text": "span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>})<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>app.<span><span>mount<span><span>(<span><span>'#app'<span><span>)<span><span><code><pre><div><p>当根组件没有设置 <code>template<code> 选项时，Vue 将自动使用容器的 <code>innerHTML<code> 作为模板。<p><p>DOM 内模板通常用于<a href=\"/guide/quick-start.html#using-vue-from-cdn\">无构建步骤<a>的 Vue 应用程序。它们也可以与服务器端框架一起使用，其中根模板可能是由服务器动态生成的。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/application.html", "title": "创建一个 Vue 应用", "doc_id": "cfaa26eecb6e4836ae455fa2d6ac0a84", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 286, "chunk_index": 13, "_doc_id": "13_6248742031151782630"}}
{"doc_id": "14_4597997680852951073", "text": "=\"/guide/quick-start.html#using-vue-from-cdn\">无构建步骤<a>的 Vue 应用程序。它们也可以与服务器端框架一起使用，其中根模板可能是由服务器动态生成的。<p><h2 id=\"app-configurations\">应用配置 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#app-configurations\">​<a><h2><p>应用实例会暴露一个 <code>.config<code> 对象允许我们配置一些应用级的选项，例如定义一个应用级的错误处理器，用来捕获所有子组件上的错误：<p><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>app.config.<span><span>errorHandler<span><span> =<span><span> (<span><span>err<span><span>) <span><span>=><span><span> {<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/application.html", "title": "创建一个 Vue 应用", "doc_id": "cfaa26eecb6e4836ae455fa2d6ac0a84", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 286, "chunk_index": 14, "_doc_id": "14_4597997680852951073"}}
{"doc_id": "15_2683918553123818622", "text": "er<span><span> =<span><span> (<span><span>err<span><span>) <span><span>=><span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> /* 处理错误 */<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/application.html", "title": "创建一个 Vue 应用", "doc_id": "cfaa26eecb6e4836ae455fa2d6ac0a84", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 286, "chunk_index": 15, "_doc_id": "15_2683918553123818622"}}
{"doc_id": "16_6383469181865390871", "text": "n><span>) <span><span>=><span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> /* 处理错误 */<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span><code><pre><div><p>应用实例还提供了一些方法来注册应用范围内可用的资源，例如注册一个组件：<p><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>app.<span><span>component<span><span>(<span><span>'TodoDeleteButton'<span><span>, TodoDeleteButton)<span><span><code><pre><div><p>这使得 <code>TodoDeleteButton<code> 在应用的任何地方都是可用的。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/application.html", "title": "创建一个 Vue 应用", "doc_id": "cfaa26eecb6e4836ae455fa2d6ac0a84", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 286, "chunk_index": 16, "_doc_id": "16_6383469181865390871"}}
{"doc_id": "17_7844183464265763032", "text": "an>, TodoDeleteButton)<span><span><code><pre><div><p>这使得 <code>TodoDeleteButton<code> 在应用的任何地方都是可用的。我们会在指南的后续章节中讨论关于组件和其他资源的注册。你也可以在 <a href=\"/api/application.html\">API 参考<a>中浏览应用实例 API 的完整列表。<p><p>确保在挂载应用实例之前完成所有应用配置！<p><h2 id=\"multiple-application-instances\">多个应用实例 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#multiple-application-instances\">​<a><h2><p>应用实例并不只限于一个。<code>createApp<code> API 允许你在同一个页面中创建多个共存的 Vue 应用，而且每个应用都拥有自己的用于配置和全局资源的作用域。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/application.html", "title": "创建一个 Vue 应用", "doc_id": "cfaa26eecb6e4836ae455fa2d6ac0a84", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 286, "chunk_index": 17, "_doc_id": "17_7844183464265763032"}}
{"doc_id": "18_4970461550075892419", "text": "​<a><h2><p>应用实例并不只限于一个。<code>createApp<code> API 允许你在同一个页面中创建多个共存的 Vue 应用，而且每个应用都拥有自己的用于配置和全局资源的作用域。<p><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> app1<span><span> =<span><span> createApp<span><span>({<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> /* ... */<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>})<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>app1.<span><span>mount<span><span>(<span><span>'#container-1'<span><span>)<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/application.html", "title": "创建一个 Vue 应用", "doc_id": "cfaa26eecb6e4836ae455fa2d6ac0a84", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 286, "chunk_index": 18, "_doc_id": "18_4970461550075892419"}}
{"doc_id": "19_3318177435214664293", "text": "\"line\"><span>app1.<span><span>mount<span><span>(<span><span>'#container-1'<span><span>)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> app2<span><span> =<span><span> createApp<span><span>({<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> /* ... */<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>})<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/application.html", "title": "创建一个 Vue 应用", "doc_id": "cfaa26eecb6e4836ae455fa2d6ac0a84", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 286, "chunk_index": 19, "_doc_id": "19_3318177435214664293"}}
{"doc_id": "20_8073274575733250175", "text": "span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> /* ... */<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>})<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>app2.<span><span>mount<span><span>(<span><span>'#container-2'<span><span>)<span><span><code><pre><div><p>如果你正在使用 Vue 来增强服务端渲染 HTML，并且只想要 Vue 去控制一个大型页面中特殊的一小部分，应避免将一个单独的 Vue 应用实例挂载到整个页面上，而是应该创建多个小的应用实例，将它们分别挂载到所需的元素上去。<p><div><div>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/application.html", "title": "创建一个 Vue 应用", "doc_id": "cfaa26eecb6e4836ae455fa2d6ac0a84", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 286, "chunk_index": 20, "_doc_id": "20_8073274575733250175"}}
{"doc_id": "0_1872354660258675435", "text": "<div><div><h1 id=\"teleport\">Teleport <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#teleport\">​<a><h1><p><code><Teleport><code> 是一个内置组件，它可以将一个组件内部的一部分模板“传送”到该组件的 DOM 结构外层的位置去。<p><h2 id=\"basic-usage\">基本用法 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#basic-usage\">​<a><h2><p>有时我们可能会遇到这样的场景：一个组件模板的一部分在逻辑上从属于该组件，但从整个应用视图的角度来看，它在 DOM 中应该被渲染在其他地方，甚至在整个 Vue 应用外部。<p><p>这类场景最常见的例子就是全屏的模态框。理想情况下，我们希望触发模态框的按钮和模态框本身的代码是在同一个单文件组件中，因为它们都与组件的开关状态有关。但这意味着该模态框将与按钮一起渲染在应用 DOM 结构里很深的地方。这会导致该模态框的 CSS 布局代码很难写。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/teleport.html", "title": "Teleport | Vue.js", "doc_id": "4bcae69d32764414a4ab000654a8b76c", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 499, "chunk_index": 0, "_doc_id": "0_1872354660258675435"}}
{"doc_id": "1_8197479905737174282", "text": "发模态框的按钮和模态框本身的代码是在同一个单文件组件中，因为它们都与组件的开关状态有关。但这意味着该模态框将与按钮一起渲染在应用 DOM 结构里很深的地方。这会导致该模态框的 CSS 布局代码很难写。<p><p>试想下面这样的 HTML 结构：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>div<span><span> class<span><span>=<span><span>\"outer\"<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>h3<span><span>>Tooltips with Vue 3 Teleport</<span><span>h3<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/teleport.html", "title": "Teleport | Vue.js", "doc_id": "4bcae69d32764414a4ab000654a8b76c", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 499, "chunk_index": 1, "_doc_id": "1_8197479905737174282"}}
{"doc_id": "2_3261222381242028904", "text": "> <<span><span>h3<span><span>>Tooltips with Vue 3 Teleport</<span><span>h3<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>div<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>MyModal<span><span> /><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> </<span><span>div<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/teleport.html", "title": "Teleport | Vue.js", "doc_id": "4bcae69d32764414a4ab000654a8b76c", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 499, "chunk_index": 2, "_doc_id": "2_3261222381242028904"}}
{"doc_id": "3_8579725532235724701", "text": "dal<span><span> /><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> </<span><span>div<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>div<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>接下来我们来看看 <code><MyModal><code> 的实现：<p><div class=\"composition-api\"><div class=\"language-vue\"> <span class=\"lang\">vue<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>script<span><span> setup<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/teleport.html", "title": "Teleport | Vue.js", "doc_id": "4bcae69d32764414a4ab000654a8b76c", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 499, "chunk_index": 3, "_doc_id": "3_8579725532235724701"}}
{"doc_id": "4_7314357496413587111", "text": "code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>script<span><span> setup<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>import<span><span> { ref } <span><span>from<span><span> 'vue'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> open<span><span> =<span><span> ref<span><span>(<span><span>false<span><span>)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>script<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/teleport.html", "title": "Teleport | Vue.js", "doc_id": "4bcae69d32764414a4ab000654a8b76c", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 499, "chunk_index": 4, "_doc_id": "4_7314357496413587111"}}
{"doc_id": "5_3803937200978341222", "text": "n>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>script<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>button<span><span> @click<span><span>=<span><span>\"open = true\"<span><span>>Open Modal</<span><span>button<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/teleport.html", "title": "Teleport | Vue.js", "doc_id": "4bcae69d32764414a4ab000654a8b76c", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 499, "chunk_index": 5, "_doc_id": "5_3803937200978341222"}}
{"doc_id": "6_4030246923630153211", "text": "true\"<span><span>>Open Modal</<span><span>button<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>div<span><span> v-if<span><span>=<span><span>\"open\"<span><span> class<span><span>=<span><span>\"modal\"<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>p<span><span>>Hello from the modal!</<span><span>p<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/teleport.html", "title": "Teleport | Vue.js", "doc_id": "4bcae69d32764414a4ab000654a8b76c", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 499, "chunk_index": 6, "_doc_id": "6_4030246923630153211"}}
{"doc_id": "7_8838074581535168165", "text": "ne\"><span> <<span><span>p<span><span>>Hello from the modal!</<span><span>p<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>button<span><span> @click<span><span>=<span><span>\"open = false\"<span><span>>Close</<span><span>button<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> </<span><span>div<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/teleport.html", "title": "Teleport | Vue.js", "doc_id": "4bcae69d32764414a4ab000654a8b76c", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 499, "chunk_index": 7, "_doc_id": "7_8838074581535168165"}}
{"doc_id": "8_4299088596187064994", "text": "<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>style<span><span> scoped<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>.modal<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> position<span><span>: <span><span>fixed<span><span>;<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> z-index<span><span>: <span><span>999<span><span>;<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/teleport.html", "title": "Teleport | Vue.js", "doc_id": "4bcae69d32764414a4ab000654a8b76c", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 499, "chunk_index": 8, "_doc_id": "8_4299088596187064994"}}
