{"doc_id": "12_3803937200978341222", "text": "n>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>script<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>button<span><span> @click<span><span>=<span><span>\"open = true\"<span><span>>Open Modal</<span><span>button<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/teleport.html", "title": "Teleport | Vue.js", "doc_id": "4bcae69d32764414a4ab000654a8b76c", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 499, "chunk_index": 12, "_doc_id": "12_3803937200978341222"}}
{"doc_id": "13_4030246923630153211", "text": "true\"<span><span>>Open Modal</<span><span>button<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>div<span><span> v-if<span><span>=<span><span>\"open\"<span><span> class<span><span>=<span><span>\"modal\"<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>p<span><span>>Hello from the modal!</<span><span>p<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/teleport.html", "title": "Teleport | Vue.js", "doc_id": "4bcae69d32764414a4ab000654a8b76c", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 499, "chunk_index": 13, "_doc_id": "13_4030246923630153211"}}
{"doc_id": "14_8838074581535168165", "text": "ne\"><span> <<span><span>p<span><span>>Hello from the modal!</<span><span>p<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>button<span><span> @click<span><span>=<span><span>\"open = false\"<span><span>>Close</<span><span>button<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> </<span><span>div<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/teleport.html", "title": "Teleport | Vue.js", "doc_id": "4bcae69d32764414a4ab000654a8b76c", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 499, "chunk_index": 14, "_doc_id": "14_8838074581535168165"}}
{"doc_id": "15_4299088596187064994", "text": "<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>style<span><span> scoped<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>.modal<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> position<span><span>: <span><span>fixed<span><span>;<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> z-index<span><span>: <span><span>999<span><span>;<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/teleport.html", "title": "Teleport | Vue.js", "doc_id": "4bcae69d32764414a4ab000654a8b76c", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 499, "chunk_index": 15, "_doc_id": "15_4299088596187064994"}}
{"doc_id": "16_5276304524727516728", "text": "span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> z-index<span><span>: <span><span>999<span><span>;<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> top<span><span>: <span><span>20<span><span>%<span><span>;<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> left<span><span>: <span><span>50<span><span>%<span><span>;<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> width<span><span>: <span><span>300<span><span>px<span><span>;<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> margin-left<span><span>: <span><span>-150<span><span>px<span><span>;<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/teleport.html", "title": "Teleport | Vue.js", "doc_id": "4bcae69d32764414a4ab000654a8b76c", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 499, "chunk_index": 16, "_doc_id": "16_5276304524727516728"}}
{"doc_id": "17_2138541593701655148", "text": "lass=\"line\"><span> margin-left<span><span>: <span><span>-150<span><span>px<span><span>;<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>style<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><div><p>这个组件中有一个 <code><button><code> 按钮来触发打开模态框，和一个 class 名为 <code>.modal<code> 的 <code><div><code>，它包含了模态框的内容和一个用来关闭的按钮。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/teleport.html", "title": "Teleport | Vue.js", "doc_id": "4bcae69d32764414a4ab000654a8b76c", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 499, "chunk_index": 17, "_doc_id": "17_2138541593701655148"}}
{"doc_id": "18_4103088448465787159", "text": "><button><code> 按钮来触发打开模态框，和一个 class 名为 <code>.modal<code> 的 <code><div><code>，它包含了模态框的内容和一个用来关闭的按钮。<p><p>当在初始 HTML 结构中使用这个组件时，会有一些潜在的问题：<p><ul><li><p><code>position: fixed<code> 能够相对于浏览器窗口放置有一个条件，那就是不能有任何祖先元素设置了 <code>transform<code>、<code>perspective<code> 或者 <code>filter<code> 样式属性。也就是说如果我们想要用 CSS <code>transform<code> 为祖先节点 <code><div class=\"outer\"><code> 设置动画，就会不小心破坏模态框的布局！<p><li><li><p>这个模态框的 <code>z-index<code> 受限于它的容器元素。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/teleport.html", "title": "Teleport | Vue.js", "doc_id": "4bcae69d32764414a4ab000654a8b76c", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 499, "chunk_index": 18, "_doc_id": "18_4103088448465787159"}}
{"doc_id": "19_7277594916299547876", "text": "ode><div class=\"outer\"><code> 设置动画，就会不小心破坏模态框的布局！<p><li><li><p>这个模态框的 <code>z-index<code> 受限于它的容器元素。如果有其他元素与 <code><div class=\"outer\"><code> 重叠并有更高的 <code>z-index<code>，则它会覆盖住我们的模态框。<p><li><ul><p><code><Teleport><code> 提供了一个更简单的方式来解决此类问题，让我们不需要再顾虑 DOM 结构的问题。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/teleport.html", "title": "Teleport | Vue.js", "doc_id": "4bcae69d32764414a4ab000654a8b76c", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 499, "chunk_index": 19, "_doc_id": "19_7277594916299547876"}}
{"doc_id": "20_63204550681915483", "text": "ndex<code>，则它会覆盖住我们的模态框。<p><li><ul><p><code><Teleport><code> 提供了一个更简单的方式来解决此类问题，让我们不需要再顾虑 DOM 结构的问题。让我们用 <code><Teleport><code> 改写一下 <code><MyModal><code>：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>button<span><span> @<span><span>click<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>open <span><span>=<span><span> true<span><span>\"<span><span>>Open Modal</<span><span>button<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/teleport.html", "title": "Teleport | Vue.js", "doc_id": "4bcae69d32764414a4ab000654a8b76c", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 499, "chunk_index": 20, "_doc_id": "20_63204550681915483"}}
{"doc_id": "21_6115896099899045788", "text": "=<span><span> true<span><span>\"<span><span>>Open Modal</<span><span>button<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line highlighted\"><span><<span><span>Teleport<span><span> to<span><span>=<span><span>\"body\"<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>div<span><span> v-if<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>open<span><span>\"<span><span> class<span><span>=<span><span>\"modal\"<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/teleport.html", "title": "Teleport | Vue.js", "doc_id": "4bcae69d32764414a4ab000654a8b76c", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 499, "chunk_index": 21, "_doc_id": "21_6115896099899045788"}}
{"doc_id": "22_1931816876576135088", "text": "><span>open<span><span>\"<span><span> class<span><span>=<span><span>\"modal\"<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>p<span><span>>Hello from the modal!</<span><span>p<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>button<span><span> @<span><span>click<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>open <span><span>=<span><span> false<span><span>\"<span><span>>Close</<span><span>button<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> </<span><span>div<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/teleport.html", "title": "Teleport | Vue.js", "doc_id": "4bcae69d32764414a4ab000654a8b76c", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 499, "chunk_index": 22, "_doc_id": "22_1931816876576135088"}}
{"doc_id": "23_2473442268127090519", "text": "utton<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> </<span><span>div<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line highlighted\"><span></<span><span>Teleport<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p><code><Teleport><code> 接收一个 <code>to<code> prop 来指定传送的目标。<code>to<code> 的值可以是一个 CSS 选择器字符串，也可以是一个 DOM 元素对象。这段代码的作用就是告诉 Vue“把以下模板片段<strong>传送到 <code>body<code><strong> 标签下”。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/teleport.html", "title": "Teleport | Vue.js", "doc_id": "4bcae69d32764414a4ab000654a8b76c", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 499, "chunk_index": 23, "_doc_id": "23_2473442268127090519"}}
{"doc_id": "24_3336211715893338750", "text": "的值可以是一个 CSS 选择器字符串，也可以是一个 DOM 元素对象。这段代码的作用就是告诉 Vue“把以下模板片段<strong>传送到 <code>body<code><strong> 标签下”。<p><p>你可以点击下面这个按钮，然后通过浏览器的开发者工具，在 <code><body><code> 标签下找到模态框元素：<p><p class=\"demo\"> Open Modal <p><p>我们也可以将 <code><Teleport><code> 和 <a href=\"./transition.html\"><code><Transition><code><a> 结合使用来创建一个带动画的模态框。你可以看看<a href=\"/examples/#modal\">这个示例<a>。<p><div class=\"tip custom-block\"><p class=\"custom-block-title\">TIP<p><p><code><Teleport><code> 挂载时，传送的 <code>to<code> 目标必须已经存在于 DOM 中。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/teleport.html", "title": "Teleport | Vue.js", "doc_id": "4bcae69d32764414a4ab000654a8b76c", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 499, "chunk_index": 24, "_doc_id": "24_3336211715893338750"}}
{"doc_id": "25_2760063786951050267", "text": "p class=\"custom-block-title\">TIP<p><p><code><Teleport><code> 挂载时，传送的 <code>to<code> 目标必须已经存在于 DOM 中。理想情况下，这应该是整个 Vue 应用 DOM 树外部的一个元素。如果目标元素也是由 Vue 渲染的，你需要确保在挂载 <code><Teleport><code> 之前先挂载该元素。<p><div><h2 id=\"using-with-components\">搭配组件使用 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#using-with-components\">​<a><h2><p><code><Teleport><code> 只改变了渲染的 DOM 结构，它不会影响组件间的逻辑关系。也就是说，如果 <code><Teleport><code> 包含了一个组件，那么该组件始终和这个使用了 <code><Teleport><code> 的组件保持逻辑上的父子关系。传入的 props 和触发的事件也会照常工作。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/teleport.html", "title": "Teleport | Vue.js", "doc_id": "4bcae69d32764414a4ab000654a8b76c", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 499, "chunk_index": 25, "_doc_id": "25_2760063786951050267"}}
{"doc_id": "26_8311015158220981121", "text": "><Teleport><code> 包含了一个组件，那么该组件始终和这个使用了 <code><Teleport><code> 的组件保持逻辑上的父子关系。传入的 props 和触发的事件也会照常工作。<p><p>这也意味着来自父组件的注入也会按预期工作，子组件将在 Vue Devtools 中嵌套在父级组件下面，而不是放在实际内容移动到的地方。<p><h2 id=\"disabling-teleport\">禁用 Teleport <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#disabling-teleport\">​<a><h2><p>在某些场景下可能需要视情况禁用 <code><Teleport><code>。举例来说，我们想要在桌面端将一个组件当做浮层来渲染，但在移动端则当作行内组件。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/teleport.html", "title": "Teleport | Vue.js", "doc_id": "4bcae69d32764414a4ab000654a8b76c", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 499, "chunk_index": 26, "_doc_id": "26_8311015158220981121"}}
{"doc_id": "27_382597706747285377", "text": "-teleport\">​<a><h2><p>在某些场景下可能需要视情况禁用 <code><Teleport><code>。举例来说，我们想要在桌面端将一个组件当做浮层来渲染，但在移动端则当作行内组件。我们可以通过对 <code><Teleport><code> 动态地传入一个 <code>disabled<code> prop 来处理这两种不同情况：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>Teleport<span><span> :<span><span>disabled<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>isMobile<span><span>\"<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> ...<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/teleport.html", "title": "Teleport | Vue.js", "doc_id": "4bcae69d32764414a4ab000654a8b76c", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 499, "chunk_index": 27, "_doc_id": "27_382597706747285377"}}
{"doc_id": "28_770564375134674489", "text": "span><span>isMobile<span><span>\"<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> ...<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>Teleport<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>然后我们可以动态地更新 <code>isMobile<code>。<p><h2 id=\"multiple-teleports-on-the-same-target\">多个 Teleport 共享目标 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#multiple-teleports-on-the-same-target\">​<a><h2><p>一个可重用的 <code><Modal><code> 组件可能同时存在多个实例。对于此类场景，多个 <code><Teleport><code> 组件可以将其内容挂载在同一个目标元素上，而顺序就是简单的顺次追加，后挂载的将排在目标元素下更后面的位置上，但都在目标元素中。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/teleport.html", "title": "Teleport | Vue.js", "doc_id": "4bcae69d32764414a4ab000654a8b76c", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 499, "chunk_index": 28, "_doc_id": "28_770564375134674489"}}
{"doc_id": "29_2245584490002913250", "text": "多个实例。对于此类场景，多个 <code><Teleport><code> 组件可以将其内容挂载在同一个目标元素上，而顺序就是简单的顺次追加，后挂载的将排在目标元素下更后面的位置上，但都在目标元素中。<p><p>比如下面这样的用例：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>Teleport<span><span> to<span><span>=<span><span>\"#modals\"<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>div<span><span>>A</<span><span>div<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/teleport.html", "title": "Teleport | Vue.js", "doc_id": "4bcae69d32764414a4ab000654a8b76c", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 499, "chunk_index": 29, "_doc_id": "29_2245584490002913250"}}
{"doc_id": "30_2657427322557772266", "text": "<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>div<span><span>>A</<span><span>div<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>Teleport<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>Teleport<span><span> to<span><span>=<span><span>\"#modals\"<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>div<span><span>>B</<span><span>div<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/teleport.html", "title": "Teleport | Vue.js", "doc_id": "4bcae69d32764414a4ab000654a8b76c", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 499, "chunk_index": 30, "_doc_id": "30_2657427322557772266"}}
{"doc_id": "31_4158406518065568770", "text": "<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>div<span><span>>B</<span><span>div<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>Teleport<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>渲染的结果为：<p><div class=\"language-html\"> <span class=\"lang\">html<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>div<span><span> id<span><span>=<span><span>\"modals\"<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/teleport.html", "title": "Teleport | Vue.js", "doc_id": "4bcae69d32764414a4ab000654a8b76c", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 499, "chunk_index": 31, "_doc_id": "31_4158406518065568770"}}
{"doc_id": "32_1006782497935358832", "text": "ne\"><span><<span><span>div<span><span> id<span><span>=<span><span>\"modals\"<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>div<span><span>>A</<span><span>div<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>div<span><span>>B</<span><span>div<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/teleport.html", "title": "Teleport | Vue.js", "doc_id": "4bcae69d32764414a4ab000654a8b76c", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 499, "chunk_index": 32, "_doc_id": "32_1006782497935358832"}}
{"doc_id": "33_4219797626989430887", "text": "<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>div<span><span>>B</<span><span>div<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>div<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><h2 id=\"deferred-teleport\">延迟解析的 Teleport <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#deferred-teleport\" class=\"vt-badge\">​<a><h2><p>在 Vue 3.5 及更高版本中，我们可以使用 <code>defer<code> prop 推迟 Teleport 的目标解析，直到应用的其他部分挂载。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/teleport.html", "title": "Teleport | Vue.js", "doc_id": "4bcae69d32764414a4ab000654a8b76c", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 499, "chunk_index": 33, "_doc_id": "33_4219797626989430887"}}
{"doc_id": "34_5478697078731106347", "text": "=\"vt-badge\">​<a><h2><p>在 Vue 3.5 及更高版本中，我们可以使用 <code>defer<code> prop 推迟 Teleport 的目标解析，直到应用的其他部分挂载。这允许 Teleport 将由 Vue 渲染且位于组件树之后部分的容器元素作为目标：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>Teleport<span><span> defer<span><span> to<span><span>=<span><span>\"#late-div\"<span><span>>...</<span><span>Teleport<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/teleport.html", "title": "Teleport | Vue.js", "doc_id": "4bcae69d32764414a4ab000654a8b76c", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 499, "chunk_index": 34, "_doc_id": "34_5478697078731106347"}}
{"doc_id": "35_7127428576923443696", "text": "#late-div\"<span><span>>...</<span><span>Teleport<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><!-- 稍后出现于模板中的某处 --><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>div<span><span> id<span><span>=<span><span>\"late-div\"<span><span>></<span><span>div<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>请注意，目标元素必须与 Teleport 在同一个挂载/更新周期内渲染，即如果 <code><div><code> 在一秒后才挂载，Teleport 仍然会报错。延迟 Teleport 的原理与 <code>mounted<code> 生命周期钩子类似。<p>\n<p><strong>参考<strong><p><div><div>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/teleport.html", "title": "Teleport | Vue.js", "doc_id": "4bcae69d32764414a4ab000654a8b76c", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 499, "chunk_index": 35, "_doc_id": "35_7127428576923443696"}}
{"doc_id": "0_7299487137074432126", "text": "<div><div><h1 id=\"creating-a-vue-application\">创建一个 Vue 应用 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#creating-a-vue-application\">​<a><h1><h2 id=\"the-application-instance\">应用实例 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#the-application-instance\">​<a><h2><p>每个 Vue 应用都是通过 <a href=\"/api/application.", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/application.html", "title": "创建一个 Vue 应用", "doc_id": "7e7cfebc80fa4f2587d89e493b07d317", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 286, "chunk_index": 0, "_doc_id": "0_7299487137074432126"}}
{"doc_id": "1_5739038844151039650", "text": "\"header-anchor\" href=\"#the-application-instance\">​<a><h2><p>每个 Vue 应用都是通过 <a href=\"/api/application.html#createapp\"><code>createApp<code><a> 函数创建一个新的 <strong>应用实例<strong>：<p><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>import<span><span> { createApp } <span><span>from<span><span> 'vue'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> app<span><span> =<span><span> createApp<span><span>({<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/application.html", "title": "创建一个 Vue 应用", "doc_id": "7e7cfebc80fa4f2587d89e493b07d317", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 286, "chunk_index": 1, "_doc_id": "1_5739038844151039650"}}
{"doc_id": "2_5857530151548335498", "text": "ss=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> app<span><span> =<span><span> createApp<span><span>({<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> /* 根组件选项 */<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/application.html", "title": "创建一个 Vue 应用", "doc_id": "7e7cfebc80fa4f2587d89e493b07d317", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 286, "chunk_index": 2, "_doc_id": "2_5857530151548335498"}}
{"doc_id": "3_4932158576152434563", "text": "=<span><span> createApp<span><span>({<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> /* 根组件选项 */<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>})<span><span><code><pre><div><h2 id=\"the-root-component\">根组件 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#the-root-component\">​<a><h2><p>我们传入 <code>createApp<code> 的对象实际上是一个组件，每个应用都需要一个“根组件”，其他组件将作为其子组件。<p><p>如果你使用的是单文件组件，我们可以直接从另一个文件中导入根组件。<p><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>import<span><span> { createApp } <span><span>from<span><span> 'vue'<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/application.html", "title": "创建一个 Vue 应用", "doc_id": "7e7cfebc80fa4f2587d89e493b07d317", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 286, "chunk_index": 3, "_doc_id": "3_4932158576152434563"}}
{"doc_id": "4_1023390738168108224", "text": "class=\"line\"><span>import<span><span> { createApp } <span><span>from<span><span> 'vue'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 从一个单文件组件中导入根组件<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>import<span><span> App <span><span>from<span><span> './App.vue'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/application.html", "title": "创建一个 Vue 应用", "doc_id": "7e7cfebc80fa4f2587d89e493b07d317", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 286, "chunk_index": 4, "_doc_id": "4_1023390738168108224"}}
{"doc_id": "5_4909432774801920301", "text": "port<span><span> App <span><span>from<span><span> './App.vue'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> app<span><span> =<span><span> createApp<span><span>(App)<span><span><code><pre><div><p>虽然本指南中的许多示例只需要一个组件，但大多数真实的应用都是由一棵嵌套的、可重用的组件树组成的。例如，一个待办事项 (Todos) 应用的组件树可能是这样的：<p><div class=\"language-\"> <span class=\"lang\"><span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>App (root component)<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/application.html", "title": "创建一个 Vue 应用", "doc_id": "7e7cfebc80fa4f2587d89e493b07d317", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 286, "chunk_index": 5, "_doc_id": "5_4909432774801920301"}}
{"doc_id": "6_1967914402890586474", "text": "e class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>App (root component)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>├─ TodoList<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│ └─ TodoItem<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│ ├─ TodoDeleteButton<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│ └─ TodoEditButton<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>└─ TodoFooter<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> ├─ TodoClearButton<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/application.html", "title": "创建一个 Vue 应用", "doc_id": "7e7cfebc80fa4f2587d89e493b07d317", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 286, "chunk_index": 6, "_doc_id": "6_1967914402890586474"}}
{"doc_id": "7_8331430467628380535", "text": "ass=\"line\"><span>└─ TodoFooter<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> ├─ TodoClearButton<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> └─ TodoStatistics<span><span><code><pre><div><p>我们会在指南的后续章节中讨论如何定义和组合多个组件。在那之前，我们得先关注一个组件内到底发生了什么。<p><h2 id=\"mounting-the-app\">挂载应用 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#mounting-the-app\">​<a><h2><p>应用实例必须在调用了 <code>.mount()<code> 方法后才会渲染出来。该方法接收一个“容器”参数，可以是一个实际的 DOM 元素或是一个 CSS 选择器字符串：<p><p>应用根组件的内容将会被渲染在容器元素里面。容器元素自己将<strong>不会<strong>被视为应用的一部分。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/application.html", "title": "创建一个 Vue 应用", "doc_id": "7e7cfebc80fa4f2587d89e493b07d317", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 286, "chunk_index": 7, "_doc_id": "7_8331430467628380535"}}
{"doc_id": "8_4149407455004337217", "text": "“容器”参数，可以是一个实际的 DOM 元素或是一个 CSS 选择器字符串：<p><p>应用根组件的内容将会被渲染在容器元素里面。容器元素自己将<strong>不会<strong>被视为应用的一部分。<p><p><code>.mount()<code> 方法应该始终在整个应用配置和资源注册完成后被调用。同时请注意，不同于其他资源注册方法，它的返回值是根组件实例而非应用实例。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/application.html", "title": "创建一个 Vue 应用", "doc_id": "7e7cfebc80fa4f2587d89e493b07d317", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 286, "chunk_index": 8, "_doc_id": "8_4149407455004337217"}}
{"doc_id": "9_2003591130699699742", "text": "g>被视为应用的一部分。<p><p><code>.mount()<code> 方法应该始终在整个应用配置和资源注册完成后被调用。同时请注意，不同于其他资源注册方法，它的返回值是根组件实例而非应用实例。<p><h3 id=\"in-dom-root-component-template\">DOM 中的根组件模板 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#in-dom-root-component-template\">​<a><h3><p>根组件的模板通常是组件本身的一部分，但也可以直接通过在挂载容器内编写模板来单独提供：<p><div class=\"language-html\"> <span class=\"lang\">html<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>div<span><span> id<span><span>=<span><span>\"app\"<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/application.html", "title": "创建一个 Vue 应用", "doc_id": "7e7cfebc80fa4f2587d89e493b07d317", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 286, "chunk_index": 9, "_doc_id": "9_2003591130699699742"}}
{"doc_id": "10_2482567637016109415", "text": "\"line\"><span><<span><span>div<span><span> id<span><span>=<span><span>\"app\"<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>button<span><span> @click<span><span>=<span><span>\"count++\"<span><span>>{{ count }}</<span><span>button<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/application.html", "title": "创建一个 Vue 应用", "doc_id": "7e7cfebc80fa4f2587d89e493b07d317", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 286, "chunk_index": 10, "_doc_id": "10_2482567637016109415"}}
{"doc_id": "11_3990973030697476551", "text": "n><span>=<span><span>\"count++\"<span><span>>{{ count }}</<span><span>button<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>div<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>import<span><span> { createApp } <span><span>from<span><span> 'vue'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/application.html", "title": "创建一个 Vue 应用", "doc_id": "7e7cfebc80fa4f2587d89e493b07d317", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 286, "chunk_index": 11, "_doc_id": "11_3990973030697476551"}}
{"doc_id": "12_2172804723044773893", "text": "<span><span> { createApp } <span><span>from<span><span> 'vue'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> app<span><span> =<span><span> createApp<span><span>({<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> data<span><span>() {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> return<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> count: <span><span>0<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>})<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/application.html", "title": "创建一个 Vue 应用", "doc_id": "7e7cfebc80fa4f2587d89e493b07d317", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 286, "chunk_index": 12, "_doc_id": "12_2172804723044773893"}}
{"doc_id": "13_6248742031151782630", "text": "span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>})<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>app.<span><span>mount<span><span>(<span><span>'#app'<span><span>)<span><span><code><pre><div><p>当根组件没有设置 <code>template<code> 选项时，Vue 将自动使用容器的 <code>innerHTML<code> 作为模板。<p><p>DOM 内模板通常用于<a href=\"/guide/quick-start.html#using-vue-from-cdn\">无构建步骤<a>的 Vue 应用程序。它们也可以与服务器端框架一起使用，其中根模板可能是由服务器动态生成的。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/application.html", "title": "创建一个 Vue 应用", "doc_id": "7e7cfebc80fa4f2587d89e493b07d317", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 286, "chunk_index": 13, "_doc_id": "13_6248742031151782630"}}
{"doc_id": "14_4597997680852951073", "text": "=\"/guide/quick-start.html#using-vue-from-cdn\">无构建步骤<a>的 Vue 应用程序。它们也可以与服务器端框架一起使用，其中根模板可能是由服务器动态生成的。<p><h2 id=\"app-configurations\">应用配置 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#app-configurations\">​<a><h2><p>应用实例会暴露一个 <code>.config<code> 对象允许我们配置一些应用级的选项，例如定义一个应用级的错误处理器，用来捕获所有子组件上的错误：<p><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>app.config.<span><span>errorHandler<span><span> =<span><span> (<span><span>err<span><span>) <span><span>=><span><span> {<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/application.html", "title": "创建一个 Vue 应用", "doc_id": "7e7cfebc80fa4f2587d89e493b07d317", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 286, "chunk_index": 14, "_doc_id": "14_4597997680852951073"}}
{"doc_id": "15_2683918553123818622", "text": "er<span><span> =<span><span> (<span><span>err<span><span>) <span><span>=><span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> /* 处理错误 */<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/application.html", "title": "创建一个 Vue 应用", "doc_id": "7e7cfebc80fa4f2587d89e493b07d317", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 286, "chunk_index": 15, "_doc_id": "15_2683918553123818622"}}
{"doc_id": "16_6383469181865390871", "text": "n><span>) <span><span>=><span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> /* 处理错误 */<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span><code><pre><div><p>应用实例还提供了一些方法来注册应用范围内可用的资源，例如注册一个组件：<p><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>app.<span><span>component<span><span>(<span><span>'TodoDeleteButton'<span><span>, TodoDeleteButton)<span><span><code><pre><div><p>这使得 <code>TodoDeleteButton<code> 在应用的任何地方都是可用的。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/application.html", "title": "创建一个 Vue 应用", "doc_id": "7e7cfebc80fa4f2587d89e493b07d317", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 286, "chunk_index": 16, "_doc_id": "16_6383469181865390871"}}
{"doc_id": "17_7844183464265763032", "text": "an>, TodoDeleteButton)<span><span><code><pre><div><p>这使得 <code>TodoDeleteButton<code> 在应用的任何地方都是可用的。我们会在指南的后续章节中讨论关于组件和其他资源的注册。你也可以在 <a href=\"/api/application.html\">API 参考<a>中浏览应用实例 API 的完整列表。<p><p>确保在挂载应用实例之前完成所有应用配置！<p><h2 id=\"multiple-application-instances\">多个应用实例 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#multiple-application-instances\">​<a><h2><p>应用实例并不只限于一个。<code>createApp<code> API 允许你在同一个页面中创建多个共存的 Vue 应用，而且每个应用都拥有自己的用于配置和全局资源的作用域。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/application.html", "title": "创建一个 Vue 应用", "doc_id": "7e7cfebc80fa4f2587d89e493b07d317", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 286, "chunk_index": 17, "_doc_id": "17_7844183464265763032"}}
{"doc_id": "18_4970461550075892419", "text": "​<a><h2><p>应用实例并不只限于一个。<code>createApp<code> API 允许你在同一个页面中创建多个共存的 Vue 应用，而且每个应用都拥有自己的用于配置和全局资源的作用域。<p><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> app1<span><span> =<span><span> createApp<span><span>({<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> /* ... */<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>})<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>app1.<span><span>mount<span><span>(<span><span>'#container-1'<span><span>)<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/application.html", "title": "创建一个 Vue 应用", "doc_id": "7e7cfebc80fa4f2587d89e493b07d317", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 286, "chunk_index": 18, "_doc_id": "18_4970461550075892419"}}
{"doc_id": "19_3318177435214664293", "text": "\"line\"><span>app1.<span><span>mount<span><span>(<span><span>'#container-1'<span><span>)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> app2<span><span> =<span><span> createApp<span><span>({<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> /* ... */<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>})<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/application.html", "title": "创建一个 Vue 应用", "doc_id": "7e7cfebc80fa4f2587d89e493b07d317", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 286, "chunk_index": 19, "_doc_id": "19_3318177435214664293"}}
{"doc_id": "20_8073274575733250175", "text": "span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> /* ... */<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>})<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>app2.<span><span>mount<span><span>(<span><span>'#container-2'<span><span>)<span><span><code><pre><div><p>如果你正在使用 Vue 来增强服务端渲染 HTML，并且只想要 Vue 去控制一个大型页面中特殊的一小部分，应避免将一个单独的 Vue 应用实例挂载到整个页面上，而是应该创建多个小的应用实例，将它们分别挂载到所需的元素上去。<p><div><div>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/application.html", "title": "创建一个 Vue 应用", "doc_id": "7e7cfebc80fa4f2587d89e493b07d317", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 286, "chunk_index": 20, "_doc_id": "20_8073274575733250175"}}
{"doc_id": "0_8585989225161559701", "text": "<div><div><h1 id=\"template-syntax\">模板语法 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#template-syntax\">​<a><h1><p>Vue 使用一种基于 HTML 的模板语法，使我们能够声明式地将其组件实例的数据绑定到呈现的 DOM 上。所有的 Vue 模板都是语法层面合法的 HTML，可以被符合规范的浏览器和 HTML 解析器解析。<p><p>在底层机制中，Vue 会将模板编译成高度优化的 JavaScript 代码。结合响应式系统，当应用状态变更时，Vue 能够智能地推导出需要重新渲染的组件的最少数量，并应用最少的 DOM 操作。<p><p>如果你对虚拟 DOM 的概念比较熟悉，并且偏好直接使用 JavaScript，你也可以结合可选的 JSX 支持<a href=\"/guide/extras/render-function.html\">直接手写渲染函数<a>而不采用模板。但请注意，这将不会享受到和模板同等级别的编译时优化。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/template-syntax.html", "title": "模板语法", "doc_id": "533d637096d74d8ebe9d0bcceeff9e4f", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 738, "chunk_index": 0, "_doc_id": "0_8585989225161559701"}}
{"doc_id": "1_3617100732271221356", "text": "合可选的 JSX 支持<a href=\"/guide/extras/render-function.html\">直接手写渲染函数<a>而不采用模板。但请注意，这将不会享受到和模板同等级别的编译时优化。<p><h2 id=\"text-interpolation\">文本插值 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#text-interpolation\">​<a><h2><p>最基本的数据绑定形式是文本插值，", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/template-syntax.html", "title": "模板语法", "doc_id": "533d637096d74d8ebe9d0bcceeff9e4f", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 738, "chunk_index": 1, "_doc_id": "1_3617100732271221356"}}
{"doc_id": "2_304282983875560594", "text": "-interpolation\">文本插值 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#text-interpolation\">​<a><h2><p>最基本的数据绑定形式是文本插值，它使用的是“Mustache”语法 (即双大括号)：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>span<span><span>>Message: {{ msg }}</<span><span>span<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>双大括号标签会被替换为<a href=\"/guide/essentials/reactivity-fundamentals.html#declaring-reactive-state\">相应组件实例中<a> <code>msg<code> 属性的值。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/template-syntax.html", "title": "模板语法", "doc_id": "533d637096d74d8ebe9d0bcceeff9e4f", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 738, "chunk_index": 2, "_doc_id": "2_304282983875560594"}}
{"doc_id": "3_4005400230351559990", "text": "e/essentials/reactivity-fundamentals.html#declaring-reactive-state\">相应组件实例中<a> <code>msg<code> 属性的值。同时每次 <code>msg<code> 属性更改时它也会同步更新。<p><h2 id=\"raw-html\">原始 HTML <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#raw-html\">​<a><h2><p>双大括号会将数据解释为纯文本，而不是 HTML。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/template-syntax.html", "title": "模板语法", "doc_id": "533d637096d74d8ebe9d0bcceeff9e4f", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 738, "chunk_index": 3, "_doc_id": "3_4005400230351559990"}}
{"doc_id": "4_155141419434213969", "text": "id=\"raw-html\">原始 HTML <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#raw-html\">​<a><h2><p>双大括号会将数据解释为纯文本，而不是 HTML。若想插入 HTML，你需要使用 <a href=\"/api/built-in-directives.html#v-html\"><code>v-html<code> 指令<a>：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>p<span><span>>Using text interpolation: {{ rawHtml }}</<span><span>p<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/template-syntax.html", "title": "模板语法", "doc_id": "533d637096d74d8ebe9d0bcceeff9e4f", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 738, "chunk_index": 4, "_doc_id": "4_155141419434213969"}}
{"doc_id": "5_3268458130074696661", "text": "<span>p<span><span>>Using text interpolation: {{ rawHtml }}</<span><span>p<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>p<span><span>>Using v-html directive: <<span><span>span<span><span> v-html<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>rawHtml<span><span>\"<span><span>></<span><span>span<span><span>></<span><span>p<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><div class=\"demo\"><p>Using text interpolation: <span style=\"color: red\">This should be red.</span><p><p>Using v-html directive: <span><span>This should be red.<span><span><p><div><p>这里我们遇到了一个新的概念。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/template-syntax.html", "title": "模板语法", "doc_id": "533d637096d74d8ebe9d0bcceeff9e4f", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 738, "chunk_index": 5, "_doc_id": "5_3268458130074696661"}}
{"doc_id": "6_7838335656697435802", "text": "n><p><p>Using v-html directive: <span><span>This should be red.<span><span><p><div><p>这里我们遇到了一个新的概念。这里看到的 <code>v-html<code> attribute 被称为一个<strong>指令<strong>。指令由 <code>v-<code> 作为前缀，表明它们是一些由 Vue 提供的特殊 attribute，你可能已经猜到了，它们将为渲染的 DOM 应用特殊的响应式行为。这里我们做的事情简单来说就是：在当前组件实例上，将此元素的 innerHTML 与 <code>rawHtml<code> 属性保持同步。<p><p><code>span<code> 的内容将会被替换为 <code>rawHtml<code> 属性的值，插值为纯 HTML——数据绑定将会被忽略。注意，你不能使用 <code>v-html<code> 来拼接组合模板，因为 Vue 不是一个基于字符串的模板引擎。在使用 Vue 时，应当使用组件作为 UI 重用和组合的基本单元。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/template-syntax.html", "title": "模板语法", "doc_id": "533d637096d74d8ebe9d0bcceeff9e4f", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 738, "chunk_index": 6, "_doc_id": "6_7838335656697435802"}}
{"doc_id": "7_8335048227099785067", "text": "据绑定将会被忽略。注意，你不能使用 <code>v-html<code> 来拼接组合模板，因为 Vue 不是一个基于字符串的模板引擎。在使用 Vue 时，应当使用组件作为 UI 重用和组合的基本单元。<p><div class=\"warning custom-block\"><p class=\"custom-block-title\">安全警告<p><p>在网站上动态渲染任意 HTML 是非常危险的，因为这非常容易造成 <a href=\"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E8%B7%A8%E7%B6%B2%E7%AB%99%E6%8C%87%E4%BB%A4%E7%A2%BC\" target=\"_blank\">XSS 漏洞<a>。请仅在内容安全可信时再使用 <code>v-html<code>，并且<strong>永远不要<strong>使用用户提供的 HTML 内容。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/template-syntax.html", "title": "模板语法", "doc_id": "533d637096d74d8ebe9d0bcceeff9e4f", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 738, "chunk_index": 7, "_doc_id": "7_8335048227099785067"}}
{"doc_id": "8_7271065341368322123", "text": "C\" target=\"_blank\">XSS 漏洞<a>。请仅在内容安全可信时再使用 <code>v-html<code>，并且<strong>永远不要<strong>使用用户提供的 HTML 内容。<p><div><h2 id=\"attribute-bindings\">Attribute 绑定 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#attribute-bindings\">​<a><h2><p>双大括号不能在 HTML attributes 中使用。想要响应式地绑定一个 attribute，", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/template-syntax.html", "title": "模板语法", "doc_id": "533d637096d74d8ebe9d0bcceeff9e4f", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 738, "chunk_index": 8, "_doc_id": "8_7271065341368322123"}}
{"doc_id": "9_7028905430630775995", "text": "ader-anchor\" href=\"#attribute-bindings\">​<a><h2><p>双大括号不能在 HTML attributes 中使用。想要响应式地绑定一个 attribute，应该使用 <a href=\"/api/built-in-directives.html#v-bind\"><code>v-bind<code> 指令<a>：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>div<span><span> v-bind<span><span>:<span><span>id<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>dynamicId<span><span>\"<span><span>></<span><span>div<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p><code>v-bind<code> 指令指示 Vue 将元素的 <code>id<code> attribute 与组件的 <code>dynamicId<code> 属性保持一致。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/template-syntax.html", "title": "模板语法", "doc_id": "533d637096d74d8ebe9d0bcceeff9e4f", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 738, "chunk_index": 9, "_doc_id": "9_7028905430630775995"}}
{"doc_id": "10_2863645510760426373", "text": "<div><p><code>v-bind<code> 指令指示 Vue 将元素的 <code>id<code> attribute 与组件的 <code>dynamicId<code> 属性保持一致。如果绑定的值是 <code>null<code> 或者 <code>undefined<code>，那么该 attribute 将会从渲染的元素上移除。<p><h3 id=\"shorthand\">简写 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#shorthand\">​<a><h3><p>因为 <code>v-bind<code> 非常常用，", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/template-syntax.html", "title": "模板语法", "doc_id": "533d637096d74d8ebe9d0bcceeff9e4f", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 738, "chunk_index": 10, "_doc_id": "10_2863645510760426373"}}
{"doc_id": "11_7211560417365116633", "text": "id=\"shorthand\">简写 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#shorthand\">​<a><h3><p>因为 <code>v-bind<code> 非常常用，我们提供了特定的简写语法：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>div<span><span> :<span><span>id<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>dynamicId<span><span>\"<span><span>></<span><span>div<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>开头为 <code>:<code> 的 attribute 可能和一般的 HTML attribute 看起来不太一样，", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/template-syntax.html", "title": "模板语法", "doc_id": "533d637096d74d8ebe9d0bcceeff9e4f", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 738, "chunk_index": 11, "_doc_id": "11_7211560417365116633"}}
{"doc_id": "12_2148312405458535670", "text": "n><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>开头为 <code>:<code> 的 attribute 可能和一般的 HTML attribute 看起来不太一样，但它的确是合法的 attribute 名称字符，并且所有支持 Vue 的浏览器都能正确解析它。此外，他们不会出现在最终渲染的 DOM 中。简写语法是可选的，但相信在你了解了它更多的用处后，你应该会更喜欢它。<p><blockquote><p>接下来的指引中，我们都将在示例中使用简写语法，因为这是在实际开发中更常见的用法。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/template-syntax.html", "title": "模板语法", "doc_id": "533d637096d74d8ebe9d0bcceeff9e4f", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 738, "chunk_index": 12, "_doc_id": "12_2148312405458535670"}}
{"doc_id": "13_4641773024550085647", "text": "的 DOM 中。简写语法是可选的，但相信在你了解了它更多的用处后，你应该会更喜欢它。<p><blockquote><p>接下来的指引中，我们都将在示例中使用简写语法，因为这是在实际开发中更常见的用法。<p><blockquote><h3 id=\"same-name-shorthand\">同名简写 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#same-name-shorthand\">​<a><h3><p>如果 attribute 的名称与绑定的 JavaScript 变量的名称相同，那么可以进一步简化语法，省略 attribute 值：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><!-- 与 :id=\"id\" 相同 --><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/template-syntax.html", "title": "模板语法", "doc_id": "533d637096d74d8ebe9d0bcceeff9e4f", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 738, "chunk_index": 13, "_doc_id": "13_4641773024550085647"}}
{"doc_id": "14_7652705260428084836", "text": "class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><!-- 与 :id=\"id\" 相同 --><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>div<span><span> :<span><span>id<span><span>></<span><span>div<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><!-- 这也同样有效 --><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>div<span><span> v-bind:id<span><span>></<span><span>div<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>这与在 JavaScript 中声明对象时使用的属性简写语法类似。请注意，这是一个只在 Vue 3.4 及以上版本中可用的特性。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/template-syntax.html", "title": "模板语法", "doc_id": "533d637096d74d8ebe9d0bcceeff9e4f", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 738, "chunk_index": 14, "_doc_id": "14_7652705260428084836"}}
{"doc_id": "15_5189186733736556670", "text": "pan>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>这与在 JavaScript 中声明对象时使用的属性简写语法类似。请注意，这是一个只在 Vue 3.4 及以上版本中可用的特性。<p><h3 id=\"boolean-attributes\">布尔型 Attribute <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#boolean-attributes\">​<a><h3><p><a href=\"https://developer.mozilla.org/zh-CN/docs/Web/HTML/Attributes#%E5%B8%83%E5%B0%94%E5%80%BC%E5%B1%9E%E6%80%A7\" target=\"_blank\">布尔型 attribute<a> 依据 true / false 值来决定 attribute 是否应该存在于该元素上。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/template-syntax.html", "title": "模板语法", "doc_id": "533d637096d74d8ebe9d0bcceeff9e4f", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 738, "chunk_index": 15, "_doc_id": "15_5189186733736556670"}}
{"doc_id": "16_5046358970694682461", "text": "0%BC%E5%B1%9E%E6%80%A7\" target=\"_blank\">布尔型 attribute<a> 依据 true / false 值来决定 attribute 是否应该存在于该元素上。<a href=\"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/HTML/Attributes/disabled\" target=\"_blank\"><code>disabled<code><a> 就是最常见的例子之一。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/template-syntax.html", "title": "模板语法", "doc_id": "533d637096d74d8ebe9d0bcceeff9e4f", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 738, "chunk_index": 16, "_doc_id": "16_5046358970694682461"}}
{"doc_id": "17_5909979257262227339", "text": "lla.org/en-US/docs/Web/HTML/Attributes/disabled\" target=\"_blank\"><code>disabled<code><a> 就是最常见的例子之一。<p><p><code>v-bind<code> 在这种场景下的行为略有不同：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>button<span><span> :<span><span>disabled<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>isButtonDisabled<span><span>\"<span><span>>Button</<span><span>button<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>当 <code>isButtonDisabled<code> 为<a href=\"https://developer.", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/template-syntax.html", "title": "模板语法", "doc_id": "533d637096d74d8ebe9d0bcceeff9e4f", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 738, "chunk_index": 17, "_doc_id": "17_5909979257262227339"}}
{"doc_id": "18_4623954227667322125", "text": "an><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>当 <code>isButtonDisabled<code> 为<a href=\"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Glossary/Truthy\" target=\"_blank\">真值<a>或一个空字符串 (即 <code><button disabled=\"\"><code>) 时，元素会包含这个 <code>disabled<code> attribute。而当其为其他<a href=\"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Glossary/Falsy\" target=\"_blank\">假值<a>时 attribute 将被忽略。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/template-syntax.html", "title": "模板语法", "doc_id": "533d637096d74d8ebe9d0bcceeff9e4f", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 738, "chunk_index": 18, "_doc_id": "18_4623954227667322125"}}
{"doc_id": "19_4138018215506963994", "text": "ref=\"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Glossary/Falsy\" target=\"_blank\">假值<a>时 attribute 将被忽略。<p><h3 id=\"dynamically-binding-multiple-attributes\">动态绑定多个值 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#dynamically-binding-multiple-attributes\">​<a><h3><p>如果你有像这样的一个包含多个 attribute 的 JavaScript 对象：<p><div class=\"composition-api\"><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> objectOfAttrs<span><span> =<span><span> {<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/template-syntax.html", "title": "模板语法", "doc_id": "533d637096d74d8ebe9d0bcceeff9e4f", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 738, "chunk_index": 19, "_doc_id": "19_4138018215506963994"}}
{"doc_id": "20_1482538778059814158", "text": "de><span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> objectOfAttrs<span><span> =<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> id: <span><span>'container'<span><span>,<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> class: <span><span>'wrapper'<span><span>,<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> style: <span><span>'background-color:green'<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/template-syntax.html", "title": "模板语法", "doc_id": "533d637096d74d8ebe9d0bcceeff9e4f", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 738, "chunk_index": 20, "_doc_id": "20_1482538778059814158"}}
{"doc_id": "21_4015731777424238938", "text": "pan>,<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> style: <span><span>'background-color:green'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span><code><pre><div><div><div class=\"options-api\"><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>data<span><span>() {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> return<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> objectOfAttrs: {<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/template-syntax.html", "title": "模板语法", "doc_id": "533d637096d74d8ebe9d0bcceeff9e4f", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 738, "chunk_index": 21, "_doc_id": "21_4015731777424238938"}}
{"doc_id": "22_5159909608776615375", "text": "ine\"><span> return<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> objectOfAttrs: {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> id: <span><span>'container'<span><span>,<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> class: <span><span>'wrapper'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span><code><pre><div><div><p>通过不带参数的 <code>v-bind<code>，", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/template-syntax.html", "title": "模板语法", "doc_id": "533d637096d74d8ebe9d0bcceeff9e4f", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 738, "chunk_index": 22, "_doc_id": "22_5159909608776615375"}}
{"doc_id": "23_4037809972049490826", "text": "pan><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span><code><pre><div><div><p>通过不带参数的 <code>v-bind<code>，你可以将它们绑定到单个元素上：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>div<span><span> v-bind<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>objectOfAttrs<span><span>\"<span><span>></<span><span>div<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><h2 id=\"using-javascript-expressions\">使用 JavaScript 表达式 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#using-javascript-expressions\">​<a><h2><p>至此，", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/template-syntax.html", "title": "模板语法", "doc_id": "533d637096d74d8ebe9d0bcceeff9e4f", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 738, "chunk_index": 23, "_doc_id": "23_4037809972049490826"}}
{"doc_id": "24_961221647697423329", "text": "ions\">使用 JavaScript 表达式 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#using-javascript-expressions\">​<a><h2><p>至此，我们仅在模板中绑定了一些简单的属性名。但是 Vue 实际上在所有的数据绑定中都支持完整的 JavaScript 表达式：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>{{ number <span><span>+<span><span> 1<span><span> }}<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>{{ ok <span><span>?<span><span> 'YES'<span><span> :<span><span> 'NO'<span><span> }}<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/template-syntax.html", "title": "模板语法", "doc_id": "533d637096d74d8ebe9d0bcceeff9e4f", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 738, "chunk_index": 24, "_doc_id": "24_961221647697423329"}}
{"doc_id": "25_1442327648137627753", "text": "pan>{{ ok <span><span>?<span><span> 'YES'<span><span> :<span><span> 'NO'<span><span> }}<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>{{ message.<span><span>split<span><span>(<span><span>''<span><span>).<span><span>reverse<span><span>().<span><span>join<span><span>(<span><span>''<span><span>) }}<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/template-syntax.html", "title": "模板语法", "doc_id": "533d637096d74d8ebe9d0bcceeff9e4f", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 738, "chunk_index": 25, "_doc_id": "25_1442327648137627753"}}
{"doc_id": "26_6323341531991225181", "text": ").<span><span>join<span><span>(<span><span>''<span><span>) }}<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>div<span><span> :<span><span>id<span><span>=<span><span>\"`list-${<span><span>id<span><span>}`\"<span><span>></<span><span>div<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>这些表达式都会被作为 JavaScript ，以当前组件实例为作用域解析执行。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/template-syntax.html", "title": "模板语法", "doc_id": "533d637096d74d8ebe9d0bcceeff9e4f", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 738, "chunk_index": 26, "_doc_id": "26_6323341531991225181"}}
{"doc_id": "27_8569574928491943009", "text": "</<span><span>div<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>这些表达式都会被作为 JavaScript ，以当前组件实例为作用域解析执行。<p><p>在 Vue 模板内，JavaScript 表达式可以被使用在如下场景上：<p><ul><li>在文本插值中 (双大括号)<li><li>在任何 Vue 指令 (以 <code>v-<code> 开头的特殊 attribute) attribute 的值中<li><ul><h3 id=\"expressions-only\">仅支持表达式 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#expressions-only\">​<a><h3><p>每个绑定仅支持<strong>单一表达式<strong>，也就是一段能够被求值的 JavaScript 代码。一个简单的判断方法是是否可以合法地写在 <code>return<code> 后面。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/template-syntax.html", "title": "模板语法", "doc_id": "533d637096d74d8ebe9d0bcceeff9e4f", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 738, "chunk_index": 27, "_doc_id": "27_8569574928491943009"}}
{"doc_id": "28_8923244968711841917", "text": "<p>每个绑定仅支持<strong>单一表达式<strong>，也就是一段能够被求值的 JavaScript 代码。一个简单的判断方法是是否可以合法地写在 <code>return<code> 后面。<p><p>因此，下面的例子都是<strong>无效<strong>的：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><!-- 这是一个语句，而非表达式 --><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>{{ var a <span><span>=<span><span> 1<span><span> }}<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><!-- 条件控制也不支持，请使用三元表达式 --><span><span>\n<span", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/template-syntax.html", "title": "模板语法", "doc_id": "533d637096d74d8ebe9d0bcceeff9e4f", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 738, "chunk_index": 28, "_doc_id": "28_8923244968711841917"}}
{"doc_id": "29_4729177751907837266", "text": "an>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><!-- 条件控制也不支持，请使用三元表达式 --><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>{{ <span><span>if<span><span> (ok) { return message } }}<span><span><code><pre><div><h3 id=\"calling-functions\">调用函数 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#calling-functions\">​<a><h3><p>可以在绑定的表达式中使用一个组件暴露的方法：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>time<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/template-syntax.html", "title": "模板语法", "doc_id": "533d637096d74d8ebe9d0bcceeff9e4f", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 738, "chunk_index": 29, "_doc_id": "29_4729177751907837266"}}
{"doc_id": "30_3380120995708070259", "text": "<pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>time<span><span> :<span><span>title<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>toTitleDate<span><span>(date)<span><span>\"<span><span> :<span><span>datetime<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>date<span><span>\"<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> {{ <span><span>formatDate<span><span>(date) }}<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/template-syntax.html", "title": "模板语法", "doc_id": "533d637096d74d8ebe9d0bcceeff9e4f", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 738, "chunk_index": 30, "_doc_id": "30_3380120995708070259"}}
{"doc_id": "31_1694538190302580174", "text": ">><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> {{ <span><span>formatDate<span><span>(date) }}<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>time<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><div class=\"tip custom-block\"><p class=\"custom-block-title\">TIP<p><p>绑定在表达式中的方法在组件每次更新时都会被重新调用，因此<strong>不<strong>应该产生任何副作用，比如改变数据或触发异步操作。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/template-syntax.html", "title": "模板语法", "doc_id": "533d637096d74d8ebe9d0bcceeff9e4f", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 738, "chunk_index": 31, "_doc_id": "31_1694538190302580174"}}
{"doc_id": "32_2313795025730777063", "text": "=\"custom-block-title\">TIP<p><p>绑定在表达式中的方法在组件每次更新时都会被重新调用，因此<strong>不<strong>应该产生任何副作用，比如改变数据或触发异步操作。<p><div><h3 id=\"restricted-globals-access\">受限的全局访问 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#restricted-globals-access\">​<a><h3><p>模板中的表达式将被沙盒化，仅能够访问到<a href=\"https://github.com/vuejs/core/blob/main/packages/shared/src/globalsAllowList.ts#L3\" target=\"_blank\">有限的全局对象列表<a>。该列表中会暴露常用的内置全局对象，比如 <code>Math<code> 和 <code>Date<code>。<p><p>没有显式包含在列表中的全局对象将不能在模板内表达式中访问，例如用户附加在 <code>window<code> 上的属性。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/template-syntax.html", "title": "模板语法", "doc_id": "533d637096d74d8ebe9d0bcceeff9e4f", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 738, "chunk_index": 32, "_doc_id": "32_2313795025730777063"}}
{"doc_id": "33_5384792503285511490", "text": "de>Math<code> 和 <code>Date<code>。<p><p>没有显式包含在列表中的全局对象将不能在模板内表达式中访问，例如用户附加在 <code>window<code> 上的属性。然而，你也可以自行在 <a href=\"/api/application.html#app-config-globalproperties\"><code>app.config.globalProperties<code><a> 上显式地添加它们，供所有的 Vue 表达式使用。<p><h2 id=\"directives\">指令 Directives <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#directives\">​<a><h2><p>指令是带有 <code>v-<code> 前缀的特殊 attribute。Vue 提供了许多<a href=\"/api/built-in-directives.html\">内置指令<a>，包括上面我们所介绍的 <code>v-bind<code> 和 <code>v-html<code>。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/template-syntax.html", "title": "模板语法", "doc_id": "533d637096d74d8ebe9d0bcceeff9e4f", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 738, "chunk_index": 33, "_doc_id": "33_5384792503285511490"}}
{"doc_id": "34_949015012471646499", "text": "多<a href=\"/api/built-in-directives.html\">内置指令<a>，包括上面我们所介绍的 <code>v-bind<code> 和 <code>v-html<code>。<p><p>指令 attribute 的期望值为一个 JavaScript 表达式 (除了少数几个例外，即之后要讨论到的 <code>v-for<code>、<code>v-on<code> 和 <code>v-slot<code>)。一个指令的任务是在其表达式的值变化时响应式地更新 DOM。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/template-syntax.html", "title": "模板语法", "doc_id": "533d637096d74d8ebe9d0bcceeff9e4f", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 738, "chunk_index": 34, "_doc_id": "34_949015012471646499"}}
{"doc_id": "35_4843740913735282332", "text": "几个例外，即之后要讨论到的 <code>v-for<code>、<code>v-on<code> 和 <code>v-slot<code>)。一个指令的任务是在其表达式的值变化时响应式地更新 DOM。以 <a href=\"/api/built-in-directives.html#v-if\"><code>v-if<code><a> 为例：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>p<span><span> v-if<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>seen<span><span>\"<span><span>>Now you see me</<span><span>p<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>这里，<code>v-if<code> 指令会基于表达式 <code>seen<code> 的值的真假来移除/插入该 <code><p><code> 元素。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/template-syntax.html", "title": "模板语法", "doc_id": "533d637096d74d8ebe9d0bcceeff9e4f", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 738, "chunk_index": 35, "_doc_id": "35_4843740913735282332"}}
{"doc_id": "36_160657921385881323", "text": "an><code><pre><div><p>这里，<code>v-if<code> 指令会基于表达式 <code>seen<code> 的值的真假来移除/插入该 <code><p><code> 元素。<p><h3 id=\"arguments\">参数 Arguments <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#arguments\">​<a><h3><p>某些指令会需要一个“参数”，在指令名后通过一个冒号隔开做标识。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/template-syntax.html", "title": "模板语法", "doc_id": "533d637096d74d8ebe9d0bcceeff9e4f", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 738, "chunk_index": 36, "_doc_id": "36_160657921385881323"}}
{"doc_id": "37_2730953823920556614", "text": "\">参数 Arguments <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#arguments\">​<a><h3><p>某些指令会需要一个“参数”，在指令名后通过一个冒号隔开做标识。例如用 <code>v-bind<code> 指令来响应式地更新一个 HTML attribute：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>a<span><span> v-bind<span><span>:<span><span>href<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>url<span><span>\"<span><span>> ... </<span><span>a<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/template-syntax.html", "title": "模板语法", "doc_id": "533d637096d74d8ebe9d0bcceeff9e4f", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 738, "chunk_index": 37, "_doc_id": "37_2730953823920556614"}}
{"doc_id": "38_3301427948526502762", "text": "rl<span><span>\"<span><span>> ... </<span><span>a<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><!-- 简写 --><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>a<span><span> :<span><span>href<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>url<span><span>\"<span><span>> ... </<span><span>a<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>这里 <code>href<code> 就是一个参数，它告诉 <code>v-bind<code> 指令将表达式 <code>url<code> 的值绑定到元素的 <code>href<code> attribute 上。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/template-syntax.html", "title": "模板语法", "doc_id": "533d637096d74d8ebe9d0bcceeff9e4f", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 738, "chunk_index": 38, "_doc_id": "38_3301427948526502762"}}
{"doc_id": "39_8348062602804068399", "text": "ef<code> 就是一个参数，它告诉 <code>v-bind<code> 指令将表达式 <code>url<code> 的值绑定到元素的 <code>href<code> attribute 上。在简写中，参数前的一切 (例如 <code>v-bind:<code>) 都会被缩略为一个 <code>:<code> 字符。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/template-syntax.html", "title": "模板语法", "doc_id": "533d637096d74d8ebe9d0bcceeff9e4f", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 738, "chunk_index": 39, "_doc_id": "39_8348062602804068399"}}
{"doc_id": "40_4977292237396961945", "text": "值绑定到元素的 <code>href<code> attribute 上。在简写中，参数前的一切 (例如 <code>v-bind:<code>) 都会被缩略为一个 <code>:<code> 字符。<p><p>另一个例子是 <code>v-on<code> 指令，它将监听 DOM 事件：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>a<span><span> v-on<span><span>:<span><span>click<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>doSomething<span><span>\"<span><span>> ... </<span><span>a<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/template-syntax.html", "title": "模板语法", "doc_id": "533d637096d74d8ebe9d0bcceeff9e4f", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 738, "chunk_index": 40, "_doc_id": "40_4977292237396961945"}}
{"doc_id": "41_405082890360080917", "text": "ng<span><span>\"<span><span>> ... </<span><span>a<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><!-- 简写 --><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>a<span><span> @<span><span>click<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>doSomething<span><span>\"<span><span>> ... </<span><span>a<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>这里的参数是要监听的事件名称：<code>click<code>。<code>v-on<code> 有一个相应的缩写，即 <code>@<code> 字符。我们之后也会讨论关于事件处理的更多细节。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/template-syntax.html", "title": "模板语法", "doc_id": "533d637096d74d8ebe9d0bcceeff9e4f", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 738, "chunk_index": 41, "_doc_id": "41_405082890360080917"}}
{"doc_id": "42_8395680462762607424", "text": "p>这里的参数是要监听的事件名称：<code>click<code>。<code>v-on<code> 有一个相应的缩写，即 <code>@<code> 字符。我们之后也会讨论关于事件处理的更多细节。<p><h3 id=\"dynamic-arguments\">动态参数 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#dynamic-arguments\">​<a><h3><p>同样在指令参数上也可以使用一个 JavaScript 表达式，需要包含在一对方括号内：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><!--<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>注意，参数表达式有一些约束，<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/template-syntax.html", "title": "模板语法", "doc_id": "533d637096d74d8ebe9d0bcceeff9e4f", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 738, "chunk_index": 42, "_doc_id": "42_8395680462762607424"}}
{"doc_id": "43_123835012924166975", "text": "<code><span class=\"line\"><span><!--<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>注意，参数表达式有一些约束，<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>参见下面“动态参数值的限制”与“动态参数语法的限制”章节的解释<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>--><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>a<span><span> v-bind:<span><span>[<span><span>attributeName<span><span>]=<span><span>\"url\"<span><span>> ... </<span><span>a<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><!-- 简写 --><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/template-syntax.html", "title": "模板语法", "doc_id": "533d637096d74d8ebe9d0bcceeff9e4f", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 738, "chunk_index": 43, "_doc_id": "43_123835012924166975"}}
{"doc_id": "44_8960555186631027121", "text": "span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><!-- 简写 --><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>a<span><span> :[<span><span>attributeName<span><span>]=<span><span>\"url\"<span><span>> ... </<span><span>a<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>这里的 <code>attributeName<code> 会作为一个 JavaScript 表达式被动态执行，计算得到的值会被用作最终的参数。举例来说，如果你的组件实例有一个数据属性 <code>attributeName<code>，其值为 <code>\"href\"<code>，那么这个绑定就等价于 <code>v-bind:href<code>。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/template-syntax.html", "title": "模板语法", "doc_id": "533d637096d74d8ebe9d0bcceeff9e4f", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 738, "chunk_index": 44, "_doc_id": "44_8960555186631027121"}}
{"doc_id": "45_7396395357718860207", "text": "如果你的组件实例有一个数据属性 <code>attributeName<code>，其值为 <code>\"href\"<code>，那么这个绑定就等价于 <code>v-bind:href<code>。<p><p>相似地，你还可以将一个函数绑定到动态的事件名称上：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>a<span><span> v-on:<span><span>[<span><span>eventName<span><span>]=<span><span>\"doSomething\"<span><span>> ... </<span><span>a<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><!-- 简写 --><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/template-syntax.html", "title": "模板语法", "doc_id": "533d637096d74d8ebe9d0bcceeff9e4f", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 738, "chunk_index": 45, "_doc_id": "45_7396395357718860207"}}
{"doc_id": "46_3011664507430116420", "text": "span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><!-- 简写 --><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>a<span><span> @[<span><span>eventName<span><span>]=<span><span>\"doSomething\"<span><span>> ... </<span><span>a<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>在此示例中，当 <code>eventName<code> 的值是 <code>\"focus\"<code> 时，<code>v-on:[eventName]<code> 就等价于 <code>v-on:focus<code>。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/template-syntax.html", "title": "模板语法", "doc_id": "533d637096d74d8ebe9d0bcceeff9e4f", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 738, "chunk_index": 46, "_doc_id": "46_3011664507430116420"}}
{"doc_id": "47_3600853051009308196", "text": ">eventName<code> 的值是 <code>\"focus\"<code> 时，<code>v-on:[eventName]<code> 就等价于 <code>v-on:focus<code>。<p><h4 id=\"dynamic-argument-value-constraints\">动态参数值的限制 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#dynamic-argument-value-constraints\">​<a><h4><p>动态参数中表达式的值应当是一个字符串，或者是 <code>null<code>。特殊值 <code>null<code> 意为显式移除该绑定。其他非字符串的值会触发警告。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/template-syntax.html", "title": "模板语法", "doc_id": "533d637096d74d8ebe9d0bcceeff9e4f", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 738, "chunk_index": 47, "_doc_id": "47_3600853051009308196"}}
{"doc_id": "48_4455311252715123065", "text": "ts\">​<a><h4><p>动态参数中表达式的值应当是一个字符串，或者是 <code>null<code>。特殊值 <code>null<code> 意为显式移除该绑定。其他非字符串的值会触发警告。<p><h4 id=\"dynamic-argument-syntax-constraints\">动态参数语法的限制 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#dynamic-argument-syntax-constraints\">​<a><h4><p>动态参数表达式因为某些字符的缘故有一些语法限制，比如空格和引号，在 HTML attribute 名称中都是不合法的。例如下面的示例：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><!-- 这会触发一个编译器警告 --><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/template-syntax.html", "title": "模板语法", "doc_id": "533d637096d74d8ebe9d0bcceeff9e4f", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 738, "chunk_index": 48, "_doc_id": "48_4455311252715123065"}}
{"doc_id": "49_5843136460438613663", "text": "e class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><!-- 这会触发一个编译器警告 --><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>a<span><span> :[<span><span>'foo'<span><span> + <span><span>bar<span><span>]=<span><span>\"value\"<span><span>> ... </<span><span>a<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>如果你需要传入一个复杂的动态参数，我们推荐使用<a href=\"./computed.html\">计算属性<a>替换复杂的表达式，也是 Vue 最基础的概念之一，我们很快就会讲到。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/template-syntax.html", "title": "模板语法", "doc_id": "533d637096d74d8ebe9d0bcceeff9e4f", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 738, "chunk_index": 49, "_doc_id": "49_5843136460438613663"}}
{"doc_id": "50_1625911858500356917", "text": "e><div><p>如果你需要传入一个复杂的动态参数，我们推荐使用<a href=\"./computed.html\">计算属性<a>替换复杂的表达式，也是 Vue 最基础的概念之一，我们很快就会讲到。<p><p>当使用 DOM 内嵌模板 (直接写在 HTML 文件里的模板) 时，我们需要避免在名称中使用大写字母，因为浏览器会强制将其转换为小写：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>a<span><span> :[<span><span>someAttr<span><span>]=<span><span>\"value\"<span><span>> ... </<span><span>a<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>上面的例子将会在 DOM 内嵌模板中被转换为 <code>:[someattr]<code>。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/template-syntax.html", "title": "模板语法", "doc_id": "533d637096d74d8ebe9d0bcceeff9e4f", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 738, "chunk_index": 50, "_doc_id": "50_1625911858500356917"}}
{"doc_id": "51_6042312197531238589", "text": "n><span>a<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>上面的例子将会在 DOM 内嵌模板中被转换为 <code>:[someattr]<code>。如果你的组件拥有 “someAttr” 属性而非 “someattr”，这段代码将不会工作。单文件组件内的模板<strong>不<strong>受此限制。<p><h3 id=\"modifiers\">修饰符 Modifiers <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#modifiers\">​<a><h3><p>修饰符是以点开头的特殊后缀，表明指令需要以一些特殊的方式被绑定。例如 <code>.prevent<code> 修饰符会告知 <code>v-on<code> 指令对触发的事件调用 <code>event.", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/template-syntax.html", "title": "模板语法", "doc_id": "533d637096d74d8ebe9d0bcceeff9e4f", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 738, "chunk_index": 51, "_doc_id": "51_6042312197531238589"}}
{"doc_id": "52_1859412508114081045", "text": "是以点开头的特殊后缀，表明指令需要以一些特殊的方式被绑定。例如 <code>.prevent<code> 修饰符会告知 <code>v-on<code> 指令对触发的事件调用 <code>event.preventDefault()<code>：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>form<span><span> @<span><span>submit<span><span>.<span><span>prevent<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>onSubmit<span><span>\"<span><span>>...</<span><span>form<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>之后在讲到 <a href=\"./event-handling.", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/template-syntax.html", "title": "模板语法", "doc_id": "533d637096d74d8ebe9d0bcceeff9e4f", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 738, "chunk_index": 52, "_doc_id": "52_1859412508114081045"}}
{"doc_id": "53_4338598961289480875", "text": "n>>...</<span><span>form<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>之后在讲到 <a href=\"./event-handling.html#event-modifiers\"><code>v-on<code><a> 和 <a href=\"./forms.html#modifiers\"><code>v-model<code><a> 的功能时，你将会看到其他修饰符的例子。<p><p>最后，在这里你可以直观地看到完整的指令语法：<p><p> <p><div><div>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/template-syntax.html", "title": "模板语法", "doc_id": "533d637096d74d8ebe9d0bcceeff9e4f", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 738, "chunk_index": 53, "_doc_id": "53_4338598961289480875"}}
{"doc_id": "0_8585989225161559701", "text": "<div><div><h1 id=\"template-syntax\">模板语法 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#template-syntax\">​<a><h1><p>Vue 使用一种基于 HTML 的模板语法，使我们能够声明式地将其组件实例的数据绑定到呈现的 DOM 上。所有的 Vue 模板都是语法层面合法的 HTML，可以被符合规范的浏览器和 HTML 解析器解析。<p><p>在底层机制中，Vue 会将模板编译成高度优化的 JavaScript 代码。结合响应式系统，当应用状态变更时，Vue 能够智能地推导出需要重新渲染的组件的最少数量，并应用最少的 DOM 操作。<p><p>如果你对虚拟 DOM 的概念比较熟悉，并且偏好直接使用 JavaScript，你也可以结合可选的 JSX 支持<a href=\"/guide/extras/render-function.html\">直接手写渲染函数<a>而不采用模板。但请注意，这将不会享受到和模板同等级别的编译时优化。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/template-syntax.html", "title": "模板语法", "doc_id": "8d575bbcedb54e0fbd277639c31c2310", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 738, "chunk_index": 0, "_doc_id": "0_8585989225161559701"}}
{"doc_id": "1_3617100732271221356", "text": "合可选的 JSX 支持<a href=\"/guide/extras/render-function.html\">直接手写渲染函数<a>而不采用模板。但请注意，这将不会享受到和模板同等级别的编译时优化。<p><h2 id=\"text-interpolation\">文本插值 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#text-interpolation\">​<a><h2><p>最基本的数据绑定形式是文本插值，", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/template-syntax.html", "title": "模板语法", "doc_id": "8d575bbcedb54e0fbd277639c31c2310", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 738, "chunk_index": 1, "_doc_id": "1_3617100732271221356"}}
{"doc_id": "2_304282983875560594", "text": "-interpolation\">文本插值 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#text-interpolation\">​<a><h2><p>最基本的数据绑定形式是文本插值，它使用的是“Mustache”语法 (即双大括号)：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>span<span><span>>Message: {{ msg }}</<span><span>span<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>双大括号标签会被替换为<a href=\"/guide/essentials/reactivity-fundamentals.html#declaring-reactive-state\">相应组件实例中<a> <code>msg<code> 属性的值。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/template-syntax.html", "title": "模板语法", "doc_id": "8d575bbcedb54e0fbd277639c31c2310", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 738, "chunk_index": 2, "_doc_id": "2_304282983875560594"}}
{"doc_id": "3_4005400230351559990", "text": "e/essentials/reactivity-fundamentals.html#declaring-reactive-state\">相应组件实例中<a> <code>msg<code> 属性的值。同时每次 <code>msg<code> 属性更改时它也会同步更新。<p><h2 id=\"raw-html\">原始 HTML <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#raw-html\">​<a><h2><p>双大括号会将数据解释为纯文本，而不是 HTML。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/template-syntax.html", "title": "模板语法", "doc_id": "8d575bbcedb54e0fbd277639c31c2310", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 738, "chunk_index": 3, "_doc_id": "3_4005400230351559990"}}
{"doc_id": "4_155141419434213969", "text": "id=\"raw-html\">原始 HTML <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#raw-html\">​<a><h2><p>双大括号会将数据解释为纯文本，而不是 HTML。若想插入 HTML，你需要使用 <a href=\"/api/built-in-directives.html#v-html\"><code>v-html<code> 指令<a>：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>p<span><span>>Using text interpolation: {{ rawHtml }}</<span><span>p<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/template-syntax.html", "title": "模板语法", "doc_id": "8d575bbcedb54e0fbd277639c31c2310", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 738, "chunk_index": 4, "_doc_id": "4_155141419434213969"}}
{"doc_id": "5_3268458130074696661", "text": "<span>p<span><span>>Using text interpolation: {{ rawHtml }}</<span><span>p<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>p<span><span>>Using v-html directive: <<span><span>span<span><span> v-html<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>rawHtml<span><span>\"<span><span>></<span><span>span<span><span>></<span><span>p<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><div class=\"demo\"><p>Using text interpolation: <span style=\"color: red\">This should be red.</span><p><p>Using v-html directive: <span><span>This should be red.<span><span><p><div><p>这里我们遇到了一个新的概念。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/template-syntax.html", "title": "模板语法", "doc_id": "8d575bbcedb54e0fbd277639c31c2310", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 738, "chunk_index": 5, "_doc_id": "5_3268458130074696661"}}
{"doc_id": "6_7838335656697435802", "text": "n><p><p>Using v-html directive: <span><span>This should be red.<span><span><p><div><p>这里我们遇到了一个新的概念。这里看到的 <code>v-html<code> attribute 被称为一个<strong>指令<strong>。指令由 <code>v-<code> 作为前缀，表明它们是一些由 Vue 提供的特殊 attribute，你可能已经猜到了，它们将为渲染的 DOM 应用特殊的响应式行为。这里我们做的事情简单来说就是：在当前组件实例上，将此元素的 innerHTML 与 <code>rawHtml<code> 属性保持同步。<p><p><code>span<code> 的内容将会被替换为 <code>rawHtml<code> 属性的值，插值为纯 HTML——数据绑定将会被忽略。注意，你不能使用 <code>v-html<code> 来拼接组合模板，因为 Vue 不是一个基于字符串的模板引擎。在使用 Vue 时，应当使用组件作为 UI 重用和组合的基本单元。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/template-syntax.html", "title": "模板语法", "doc_id": "8d575bbcedb54e0fbd277639c31c2310", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 738, "chunk_index": 6, "_doc_id": "6_7838335656697435802"}}
{"doc_id": "7_8335048227099785067", "text": "据绑定将会被忽略。注意，你不能使用 <code>v-html<code> 来拼接组合模板，因为 Vue 不是一个基于字符串的模板引擎。在使用 Vue 时，应当使用组件作为 UI 重用和组合的基本单元。<p><div class=\"warning custom-block\"><p class=\"custom-block-title\">安全警告<p><p>在网站上动态渲染任意 HTML 是非常危险的，因为这非常容易造成 <a href=\"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E8%B7%A8%E7%B6%B2%E7%AB%99%E6%8C%87%E4%BB%A4%E7%A2%BC\" target=\"_blank\">XSS 漏洞<a>。请仅在内容安全可信时再使用 <code>v-html<code>，并且<strong>永远不要<strong>使用用户提供的 HTML 内容。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/template-syntax.html", "title": "模板语法", "doc_id": "8d575bbcedb54e0fbd277639c31c2310", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 738, "chunk_index": 7, "_doc_id": "7_8335048227099785067"}}
{"doc_id": "8_7271065341368322123", "text": "C\" target=\"_blank\">XSS 漏洞<a>。请仅在内容安全可信时再使用 <code>v-html<code>，并且<strong>永远不要<strong>使用用户提供的 HTML 内容。<p><div><h2 id=\"attribute-bindings\">Attribute 绑定 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#attribute-bindings\">​<a><h2><p>双大括号不能在 HTML attributes 中使用。想要响应式地绑定一个 attribute，", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/template-syntax.html", "title": "模板语法", "doc_id": "8d575bbcedb54e0fbd277639c31c2310", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 738, "chunk_index": 8, "_doc_id": "8_7271065341368322123"}}
{"doc_id": "9_7028905430630775995", "text": "ader-anchor\" href=\"#attribute-bindings\">​<a><h2><p>双大括号不能在 HTML attributes 中使用。想要响应式地绑定一个 attribute，应该使用 <a href=\"/api/built-in-directives.html#v-bind\"><code>v-bind<code> 指令<a>：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>div<span><span> v-bind<span><span>:<span><span>id<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>dynamicId<span><span>\"<span><span>></<span><span>div<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p><code>v-bind<code> 指令指示 Vue 将元素的 <code>id<code> attribute 与组件的 <code>dynamicId<code> 属性保持一致。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/template-syntax.html", "title": "模板语法", "doc_id": "8d575bbcedb54e0fbd277639c31c2310", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 738, "chunk_index": 9, "_doc_id": "9_7028905430630775995"}}
{"doc_id": "10_2863645510760426373", "text": "<div><p><code>v-bind<code> 指令指示 Vue 将元素的 <code>id<code> attribute 与组件的 <code>dynamicId<code> 属性保持一致。如果绑定的值是 <code>null<code> 或者 <code>undefined<code>，那么该 attribute 将会从渲染的元素上移除。<p><h3 id=\"shorthand\">简写 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#shorthand\">​<a><h3><p>因为 <code>v-bind<code> 非常常用，", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/template-syntax.html", "title": "模板语法", "doc_id": "8d575bbcedb54e0fbd277639c31c2310", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 738, "chunk_index": 10, "_doc_id": "10_2863645510760426373"}}
{"doc_id": "11_7211560417365116633", "text": "id=\"shorthand\">简写 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#shorthand\">​<a><h3><p>因为 <code>v-bind<code> 非常常用，我们提供了特定的简写语法：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>div<span><span> :<span><span>id<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>dynamicId<span><span>\"<span><span>></<span><span>div<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>开头为 <code>:<code> 的 attribute 可能和一般的 HTML attribute 看起来不太一样，", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/template-syntax.html", "title": "模板语法", "doc_id": "8d575bbcedb54e0fbd277639c31c2310", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 738, "chunk_index": 11, "_doc_id": "11_7211560417365116633"}}
{"doc_id": "12_2148312405458535670", "text": "n><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>开头为 <code>:<code> 的 attribute 可能和一般的 HTML attribute 看起来不太一样，但它的确是合法的 attribute 名称字符，并且所有支持 Vue 的浏览器都能正确解析它。此外，他们不会出现在最终渲染的 DOM 中。简写语法是可选的，但相信在你了解了它更多的用处后，你应该会更喜欢它。<p><blockquote><p>接下来的指引中，我们都将在示例中使用简写语法，因为这是在实际开发中更常见的用法。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/template-syntax.html", "title": "模板语法", "doc_id": "8d575bbcedb54e0fbd277639c31c2310", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 738, "chunk_index": 12, "_doc_id": "12_2148312405458535670"}}
{"doc_id": "13_4641773024550085647", "text": "的 DOM 中。简写语法是可选的，但相信在你了解了它更多的用处后，你应该会更喜欢它。<p><blockquote><p>接下来的指引中，我们都将在示例中使用简写语法，因为这是在实际开发中更常见的用法。<p><blockquote><h3 id=\"same-name-shorthand\">同名简写 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#same-name-shorthand\">​<a><h3><p>如果 attribute 的名称与绑定的 JavaScript 变量的名称相同，那么可以进一步简化语法，省略 attribute 值：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><!-- 与 :id=\"id\" 相同 --><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/template-syntax.html", "title": "模板语法", "doc_id": "8d575bbcedb54e0fbd277639c31c2310", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 738, "chunk_index": 13, "_doc_id": "13_4641773024550085647"}}
{"doc_id": "14_7652705260428084836", "text": "class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><!-- 与 :id=\"id\" 相同 --><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>div<span><span> :<span><span>id<span><span>></<span><span>div<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><!-- 这也同样有效 --><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>div<span><span> v-bind:id<span><span>></<span><span>div<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>这与在 JavaScript 中声明对象时使用的属性简写语法类似。请注意，这是一个只在 Vue 3.4 及以上版本中可用的特性。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/template-syntax.html", "title": "模板语法", "doc_id": "8d575bbcedb54e0fbd277639c31c2310", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 738, "chunk_index": 14, "_doc_id": "14_7652705260428084836"}}
{"doc_id": "15_5189186733736556670", "text": "pan>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>这与在 JavaScript 中声明对象时使用的属性简写语法类似。请注意，这是一个只在 Vue 3.4 及以上版本中可用的特性。<p><h3 id=\"boolean-attributes\">布尔型 Attribute <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#boolean-attributes\">​<a><h3><p><a href=\"https://developer.mozilla.org/zh-CN/docs/Web/HTML/Attributes#%E5%B8%83%E5%B0%94%E5%80%BC%E5%B1%9E%E6%80%A7\" target=\"_blank\">布尔型 attribute<a> 依据 true / false 值来决定 attribute 是否应该存在于该元素上。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/template-syntax.html", "title": "模板语法", "doc_id": "8d575bbcedb54e0fbd277639c31c2310", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 738, "chunk_index": 15, "_doc_id": "15_5189186733736556670"}}
{"doc_id": "16_5046358970694682461", "text": "0%BC%E5%B1%9E%E6%80%A7\" target=\"_blank\">布尔型 attribute<a> 依据 true / false 值来决定 attribute 是否应该存在于该元素上。<a href=\"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/HTML/Attributes/disabled\" target=\"_blank\"><code>disabled<code><a> 就是最常见的例子之一。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/template-syntax.html", "title": "模板语法", "doc_id": "8d575bbcedb54e0fbd277639c31c2310", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 738, "chunk_index": 16, "_doc_id": "16_5046358970694682461"}}
{"doc_id": "17_5909979257262227339", "text": "lla.org/en-US/docs/Web/HTML/Attributes/disabled\" target=\"_blank\"><code>disabled<code><a> 就是最常见的例子之一。<p><p><code>v-bind<code> 在这种场景下的行为略有不同：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>button<span><span> :<span><span>disabled<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>isButtonDisabled<span><span>\"<span><span>>Button</<span><span>button<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>当 <code>isButtonDisabled<code> 为<a href=\"https://developer.", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/template-syntax.html", "title": "模板语法", "doc_id": "8d575bbcedb54e0fbd277639c31c2310", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 738, "chunk_index": 17, "_doc_id": "17_5909979257262227339"}}
{"doc_id": "18_4623954227667322125", "text": "an><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>当 <code>isButtonDisabled<code> 为<a href=\"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Glossary/Truthy\" target=\"_blank\">真值<a>或一个空字符串 (即 <code><button disabled=\"\"><code>) 时，元素会包含这个 <code>disabled<code> attribute。而当其为其他<a href=\"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Glossary/Falsy\" target=\"_blank\">假值<a>时 attribute 将被忽略。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/template-syntax.html", "title": "模板语法", "doc_id": "8d575bbcedb54e0fbd277639c31c2310", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 738, "chunk_index": 18, "_doc_id": "18_4623954227667322125"}}
{"doc_id": "19_4138018215506963994", "text": "ref=\"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Glossary/Falsy\" target=\"_blank\">假值<a>时 attribute 将被忽略。<p><h3 id=\"dynamically-binding-multiple-attributes\">动态绑定多个值 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#dynamically-binding-multiple-attributes\">​<a><h3><p>如果你有像这样的一个包含多个 attribute 的 JavaScript 对象：<p><div class=\"composition-api\"><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> objectOfAttrs<span><span> =<span><span> {<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/template-syntax.html", "title": "模板语法", "doc_id": "8d575bbcedb54e0fbd277639c31c2310", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 738, "chunk_index": 19, "_doc_id": "19_4138018215506963994"}}
{"doc_id": "20_1482538778059814158", "text": "de><span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> objectOfAttrs<span><span> =<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> id: <span><span>'container'<span><span>,<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> class: <span><span>'wrapper'<span><span>,<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> style: <span><span>'background-color:green'<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/template-syntax.html", "title": "模板语法", "doc_id": "8d575bbcedb54e0fbd277639c31c2310", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 738, "chunk_index": 20, "_doc_id": "20_1482538778059814158"}}
{"doc_id": "21_4015731777424238938", "text": "pan>,<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> style: <span><span>'background-color:green'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span><code><pre><div><div><div class=\"options-api\"><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>data<span><span>() {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> return<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> objectOfAttrs: {<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/template-syntax.html", "title": "模板语法", "doc_id": "8d575bbcedb54e0fbd277639c31c2310", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 738, "chunk_index": 21, "_doc_id": "21_4015731777424238938"}}
{"doc_id": "22_5159909608776615375", "text": "ine\"><span> return<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> objectOfAttrs: {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> id: <span><span>'container'<span><span>,<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> class: <span><span>'wrapper'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span><code><pre><div><div><p>通过不带参数的 <code>v-bind<code>，", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/template-syntax.html", "title": "模板语法", "doc_id": "8d575bbcedb54e0fbd277639c31c2310", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 738, "chunk_index": 22, "_doc_id": "22_5159909608776615375"}}
{"doc_id": "23_4037809972049490826", "text": "pan><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span><code><pre><div><div><p>通过不带参数的 <code>v-bind<code>，你可以将它们绑定到单个元素上：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>div<span><span> v-bind<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>objectOfAttrs<span><span>\"<span><span>></<span><span>div<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><h2 id=\"using-javascript-expressions\">使用 JavaScript 表达式 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#using-javascript-expressions\">​<a><h2><p>至此，", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/template-syntax.html", "title": "模板语法", "doc_id": "8d575bbcedb54e0fbd277639c31c2310", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 738, "chunk_index": 23, "_doc_id": "23_4037809972049490826"}}
{"doc_id": "24_961221647697423329", "text": "ions\">使用 JavaScript 表达式 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#using-javascript-expressions\">​<a><h2><p>至此，我们仅在模板中绑定了一些简单的属性名。但是 Vue 实际上在所有的数据绑定中都支持完整的 JavaScript 表达式：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>{{ number <span><span>+<span><span> 1<span><span> }}<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>{{ ok <span><span>?<span><span> 'YES'<span><span> :<span><span> 'NO'<span><span> }}<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/template-syntax.html", "title": "模板语法", "doc_id": "8d575bbcedb54e0fbd277639c31c2310", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 738, "chunk_index": 24, "_doc_id": "24_961221647697423329"}}
{"doc_id": "25_1442327648137627753", "text": "pan>{{ ok <span><span>?<span><span> 'YES'<span><span> :<span><span> 'NO'<span><span> }}<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>{{ message.<span><span>split<span><span>(<span><span>''<span><span>).<span><span>reverse<span><span>().<span><span>join<span><span>(<span><span>''<span><span>) }}<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/template-syntax.html", "title": "模板语法", "doc_id": "8d575bbcedb54e0fbd277639c31c2310", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 738, "chunk_index": 25, "_doc_id": "25_1442327648137627753"}}
{"doc_id": "26_6323341531991225181", "text": ").<span><span>join<span><span>(<span><span>''<span><span>) }}<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>div<span><span> :<span><span>id<span><span>=<span><span>\"`list-${<span><span>id<span><span>}`\"<span><span>></<span><span>div<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>这些表达式都会被作为 JavaScript ，以当前组件实例为作用域解析执行。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/template-syntax.html", "title": "模板语法", "doc_id": "8d575bbcedb54e0fbd277639c31c2310", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 738, "chunk_index": 26, "_doc_id": "26_6323341531991225181"}}
{"doc_id": "27_8569574928491943009", "text": "</<span><span>div<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>这些表达式都会被作为 JavaScript ，以当前组件实例为作用域解析执行。<p><p>在 Vue 模板内，JavaScript 表达式可以被使用在如下场景上：<p><ul><li>在文本插值中 (双大括号)<li><li>在任何 Vue 指令 (以 <code>v-<code> 开头的特殊 attribute) attribute 的值中<li><ul><h3 id=\"expressions-only\">仅支持表达式 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#expressions-only\">​<a><h3><p>每个绑定仅支持<strong>单一表达式<strong>，也就是一段能够被求值的 JavaScript 代码。一个简单的判断方法是是否可以合法地写在 <code>return<code> 后面。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/template-syntax.html", "title": "模板语法", "doc_id": "8d575bbcedb54e0fbd277639c31c2310", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 738, "chunk_index": 27, "_doc_id": "27_8569574928491943009"}}
{"doc_id": "28_8923244968711841917", "text": "<p>每个绑定仅支持<strong>单一表达式<strong>，也就是一段能够被求值的 JavaScript 代码。一个简单的判断方法是是否可以合法地写在 <code>return<code> 后面。<p><p>因此，下面的例子都是<strong>无效<strong>的：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><!-- 这是一个语句，而非表达式 --><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>{{ var a <span><span>=<span><span> 1<span><span> }}<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><!-- 条件控制也不支持，请使用三元表达式 --><span><span>\n<span", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/template-syntax.html", "title": "模板语法", "doc_id": "8d575bbcedb54e0fbd277639c31c2310", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 738, "chunk_index": 28, "_doc_id": "28_8923244968711841917"}}
{"doc_id": "29_4729177751907837266", "text": "an>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><!-- 条件控制也不支持，请使用三元表达式 --><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>{{ <span><span>if<span><span> (ok) { return message } }}<span><span><code><pre><div><h3 id=\"calling-functions\">调用函数 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#calling-functions\">​<a><h3><p>可以在绑定的表达式中使用一个组件暴露的方法：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>time<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/template-syntax.html", "title": "模板语法", "doc_id": "8d575bbcedb54e0fbd277639c31c2310", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 738, "chunk_index": 29, "_doc_id": "29_4729177751907837266"}}
{"doc_id": "30_3380120995708070259", "text": "<pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>time<span><span> :<span><span>title<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>toTitleDate<span><span>(date)<span><span>\"<span><span> :<span><span>datetime<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>date<span><span>\"<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> {{ <span><span>formatDate<span><span>(date) }}<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/template-syntax.html", "title": "模板语法", "doc_id": "8d575bbcedb54e0fbd277639c31c2310", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 738, "chunk_index": 30, "_doc_id": "30_3380120995708070259"}}
{"doc_id": "31_1694538190302580174", "text": ">><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> {{ <span><span>formatDate<span><span>(date) }}<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>time<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><div class=\"tip custom-block\"><p class=\"custom-block-title\">TIP<p><p>绑定在表达式中的方法在组件每次更新时都会被重新调用，因此<strong>不<strong>应该产生任何副作用，比如改变数据或触发异步操作。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/template-syntax.html", "title": "模板语法", "doc_id": "8d575bbcedb54e0fbd277639c31c2310", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 738, "chunk_index": 31, "_doc_id": "31_1694538190302580174"}}
{"doc_id": "32_2313795025730777063", "text": "=\"custom-block-title\">TIP<p><p>绑定在表达式中的方法在组件每次更新时都会被重新调用，因此<strong>不<strong>应该产生任何副作用，比如改变数据或触发异步操作。<p><div><h3 id=\"restricted-globals-access\">受限的全局访问 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#restricted-globals-access\">​<a><h3><p>模板中的表达式将被沙盒化，仅能够访问到<a href=\"https://github.com/vuejs/core/blob/main/packages/shared/src/globalsAllowList.ts#L3\" target=\"_blank\">有限的全局对象列表<a>。该列表中会暴露常用的内置全局对象，比如 <code>Math<code> 和 <code>Date<code>。<p><p>没有显式包含在列表中的全局对象将不能在模板内表达式中访问，例如用户附加在 <code>window<code> 上的属性。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/template-syntax.html", "title": "模板语法", "doc_id": "8d575bbcedb54e0fbd277639c31c2310", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 738, "chunk_index": 32, "_doc_id": "32_2313795025730777063"}}
{"doc_id": "33_5384792503285511490", "text": "de>Math<code> 和 <code>Date<code>。<p><p>没有显式包含在列表中的全局对象将不能在模板内表达式中访问，例如用户附加在 <code>window<code> 上的属性。然而，你也可以自行在 <a href=\"/api/application.html#app-config-globalproperties\"><code>app.config.globalProperties<code><a> 上显式地添加它们，供所有的 Vue 表达式使用。<p><h2 id=\"directives\">指令 Directives <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#directives\">​<a><h2><p>指令是带有 <code>v-<code> 前缀的特殊 attribute。Vue 提供了许多<a href=\"/api/built-in-directives.html\">内置指令<a>，包括上面我们所介绍的 <code>v-bind<code> 和 <code>v-html<code>。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/template-syntax.html", "title": "模板语法", "doc_id": "8d575bbcedb54e0fbd277639c31c2310", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 738, "chunk_index": 33, "_doc_id": "33_5384792503285511490"}}
{"doc_id": "34_949015012471646499", "text": "多<a href=\"/api/built-in-directives.html\">内置指令<a>，包括上面我们所介绍的 <code>v-bind<code> 和 <code>v-html<code>。<p><p>指令 attribute 的期望值为一个 JavaScript 表达式 (除了少数几个例外，即之后要讨论到的 <code>v-for<code>、<code>v-on<code> 和 <code>v-slot<code>)。一个指令的任务是在其表达式的值变化时响应式地更新 DOM。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/template-syntax.html", "title": "模板语法", "doc_id": "8d575bbcedb54e0fbd277639c31c2310", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 738, "chunk_index": 34, "_doc_id": "34_949015012471646499"}}
{"doc_id": "35_4843740913735282332", "text": "几个例外，即之后要讨论到的 <code>v-for<code>、<code>v-on<code> 和 <code>v-slot<code>)。一个指令的任务是在其表达式的值变化时响应式地更新 DOM。以 <a href=\"/api/built-in-directives.html#v-if\"><code>v-if<code><a> 为例：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>p<span><span> v-if<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>seen<span><span>\"<span><span>>Now you see me</<span><span>p<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>这里，<code>v-if<code> 指令会基于表达式 <code>seen<code> 的值的真假来移除/插入该 <code><p><code> 元素。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/template-syntax.html", "title": "模板语法", "doc_id": "8d575bbcedb54e0fbd277639c31c2310", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 738, "chunk_index": 35, "_doc_id": "35_4843740913735282332"}}
{"doc_id": "36_160657921385881323", "text": "an><code><pre><div><p>这里，<code>v-if<code> 指令会基于表达式 <code>seen<code> 的值的真假来移除/插入该 <code><p><code> 元素。<p><h3 id=\"arguments\">参数 Arguments <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#arguments\">​<a><h3><p>某些指令会需要一个“参数”，在指令名后通过一个冒号隔开做标识。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/template-syntax.html", "title": "模板语法", "doc_id": "8d575bbcedb54e0fbd277639c31c2310", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 738, "chunk_index": 36, "_doc_id": "36_160657921385881323"}}
{"doc_id": "37_2730953823920556614", "text": "\">参数 Arguments <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#arguments\">​<a><h3><p>某些指令会需要一个“参数”，在指令名后通过一个冒号隔开做标识。例如用 <code>v-bind<code> 指令来响应式地更新一个 HTML attribute：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>a<span><span> v-bind<span><span>:<span><span>href<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>url<span><span>\"<span><span>> ... </<span><span>a<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/template-syntax.html", "title": "模板语法", "doc_id": "8d575bbcedb54e0fbd277639c31c2310", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 738, "chunk_index": 37, "_doc_id": "37_2730953823920556614"}}
{"doc_id": "38_3301427948526502762", "text": "rl<span><span>\"<span><span>> ... </<span><span>a<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><!-- 简写 --><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>a<span><span> :<span><span>href<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>url<span><span>\"<span><span>> ... </<span><span>a<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>这里 <code>href<code> 就是一个参数，它告诉 <code>v-bind<code> 指令将表达式 <code>url<code> 的值绑定到元素的 <code>href<code> attribute 上。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/template-syntax.html", "title": "模板语法", "doc_id": "8d575bbcedb54e0fbd277639c31c2310", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 738, "chunk_index": 38, "_doc_id": "38_3301427948526502762"}}
{"doc_id": "39_8348062602804068399", "text": "ef<code> 就是一个参数，它告诉 <code>v-bind<code> 指令将表达式 <code>url<code> 的值绑定到元素的 <code>href<code> attribute 上。在简写中，参数前的一切 (例如 <code>v-bind:<code>) 都会被缩略为一个 <code>:<code> 字符。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/template-syntax.html", "title": "模板语法", "doc_id": "8d575bbcedb54e0fbd277639c31c2310", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 738, "chunk_index": 39, "_doc_id": "39_8348062602804068399"}}
{"doc_id": "40_4977292237396961945", "text": "值绑定到元素的 <code>href<code> attribute 上。在简写中，参数前的一切 (例如 <code>v-bind:<code>) 都会被缩略为一个 <code>:<code> 字符。<p><p>另一个例子是 <code>v-on<code> 指令，它将监听 DOM 事件：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>a<span><span> v-on<span><span>:<span><span>click<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>doSomething<span><span>\"<span><span>> ... </<span><span>a<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/template-syntax.html", "title": "模板语法", "doc_id": "8d575bbcedb54e0fbd277639c31c2310", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 738, "chunk_index": 40, "_doc_id": "40_4977292237396961945"}}
{"doc_id": "41_405082890360080917", "text": "ng<span><span>\"<span><span>> ... </<span><span>a<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><!-- 简写 --><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>a<span><span> @<span><span>click<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>doSomething<span><span>\"<span><span>> ... </<span><span>a<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>这里的参数是要监听的事件名称：<code>click<code>。<code>v-on<code> 有一个相应的缩写，即 <code>@<code> 字符。我们之后也会讨论关于事件处理的更多细节。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/template-syntax.html", "title": "模板语法", "doc_id": "8d575bbcedb54e0fbd277639c31c2310", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 738, "chunk_index": 41, "_doc_id": "41_405082890360080917"}}
{"doc_id": "42_8395680462762607424", "text": "p>这里的参数是要监听的事件名称：<code>click<code>。<code>v-on<code> 有一个相应的缩写，即 <code>@<code> 字符。我们之后也会讨论关于事件处理的更多细节。<p><h3 id=\"dynamic-arguments\">动态参数 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#dynamic-arguments\">​<a><h3><p>同样在指令参数上也可以使用一个 JavaScript 表达式，需要包含在一对方括号内：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><!--<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>注意，参数表达式有一些约束，<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/template-syntax.html", "title": "模板语法", "doc_id": "8d575bbcedb54e0fbd277639c31c2310", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 738, "chunk_index": 42, "_doc_id": "42_8395680462762607424"}}
{"doc_id": "43_123835012924166975", "text": "<code><span class=\"line\"><span><!--<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>注意，参数表达式有一些约束，<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>参见下面“动态参数值的限制”与“动态参数语法的限制”章节的解释<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>--><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>a<span><span> v-bind:<span><span>[<span><span>attributeName<span><span>]=<span><span>\"url\"<span><span>> ... </<span><span>a<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><!-- 简写 --><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/template-syntax.html", "title": "模板语法", "doc_id": "8d575bbcedb54e0fbd277639c31c2310", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 738, "chunk_index": 43, "_doc_id": "43_123835012924166975"}}
{"doc_id": "44_8960555186631027121", "text": "span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><!-- 简写 --><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>a<span><span> :[<span><span>attributeName<span><span>]=<span><span>\"url\"<span><span>> ... </<span><span>a<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>这里的 <code>attributeName<code> 会作为一个 JavaScript 表达式被动态执行，计算得到的值会被用作最终的参数。举例来说，如果你的组件实例有一个数据属性 <code>attributeName<code>，其值为 <code>\"href\"<code>，那么这个绑定就等价于 <code>v-bind:href<code>。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/template-syntax.html", "title": "模板语法", "doc_id": "8d575bbcedb54e0fbd277639c31c2310", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 738, "chunk_index": 44, "_doc_id": "44_8960555186631027121"}}
{"doc_id": "45_7396395357718860207", "text": "如果你的组件实例有一个数据属性 <code>attributeName<code>，其值为 <code>\"href\"<code>，那么这个绑定就等价于 <code>v-bind:href<code>。<p><p>相似地，你还可以将一个函数绑定到动态的事件名称上：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>a<span><span> v-on:<span><span>[<span><span>eventName<span><span>]=<span><span>\"doSomething\"<span><span>> ... </<span><span>a<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><!-- 简写 --><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/template-syntax.html", "title": "模板语法", "doc_id": "8d575bbcedb54e0fbd277639c31c2310", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 738, "chunk_index": 45, "_doc_id": "45_7396395357718860207"}}
{"doc_id": "46_3011664507430116420", "text": "span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><!-- 简写 --><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>a<span><span> @[<span><span>eventName<span><span>]=<span><span>\"doSomething\"<span><span>> ... </<span><span>a<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>在此示例中，当 <code>eventName<code> 的值是 <code>\"focus\"<code> 时，<code>v-on:[eventName]<code> 就等价于 <code>v-on:focus<code>。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/template-syntax.html", "title": "模板语法", "doc_id": "8d575bbcedb54e0fbd277639c31c2310", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 738, "chunk_index": 46, "_doc_id": "46_3011664507430116420"}}
{"doc_id": "47_3600853051009308196", "text": ">eventName<code> 的值是 <code>\"focus\"<code> 时，<code>v-on:[eventName]<code> 就等价于 <code>v-on:focus<code>。<p><h4 id=\"dynamic-argument-value-constraints\">动态参数值的限制 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#dynamic-argument-value-constraints\">​<a><h4><p>动态参数中表达式的值应当是一个字符串，或者是 <code>null<code>。特殊值 <code>null<code> 意为显式移除该绑定。其他非字符串的值会触发警告。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/template-syntax.html", "title": "模板语法", "doc_id": "8d575bbcedb54e0fbd277639c31c2310", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 738, "chunk_index": 47, "_doc_id": "47_3600853051009308196"}}
{"doc_id": "48_4455311252715123065", "text": "ts\">​<a><h4><p>动态参数中表达式的值应当是一个字符串，或者是 <code>null<code>。特殊值 <code>null<code> 意为显式移除该绑定。其他非字符串的值会触发警告。<p><h4 id=\"dynamic-argument-syntax-constraints\">动态参数语法的限制 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#dynamic-argument-syntax-constraints\">​<a><h4><p>动态参数表达式因为某些字符的缘故有一些语法限制，比如空格和引号，在 HTML attribute 名称中都是不合法的。例如下面的示例：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><!-- 这会触发一个编译器警告 --><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/template-syntax.html", "title": "模板语法", "doc_id": "8d575bbcedb54e0fbd277639c31c2310", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 738, "chunk_index": 48, "_doc_id": "48_4455311252715123065"}}
{"doc_id": "49_5843136460438613663", "text": "e class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><!-- 这会触发一个编译器警告 --><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>a<span><span> :[<span><span>'foo'<span><span> + <span><span>bar<span><span>]=<span><span>\"value\"<span><span>> ... </<span><span>a<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>如果你需要传入一个复杂的动态参数，我们推荐使用<a href=\"./computed.html\">计算属性<a>替换复杂的表达式，也是 Vue 最基础的概念之一，我们很快就会讲到。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/template-syntax.html", "title": "模板语法", "doc_id": "8d575bbcedb54e0fbd277639c31c2310", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 738, "chunk_index": 49, "_doc_id": "49_5843136460438613663"}}
{"doc_id": "50_1625911858500356917", "text": "e><div><p>如果你需要传入一个复杂的动态参数，我们推荐使用<a href=\"./computed.html\">计算属性<a>替换复杂的表达式，也是 Vue 最基础的概念之一，我们很快就会讲到。<p><p>当使用 DOM 内嵌模板 (直接写在 HTML 文件里的模板) 时，我们需要避免在名称中使用大写字母，因为浏览器会强制将其转换为小写：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>a<span><span> :[<span><span>someAttr<span><span>]=<span><span>\"value\"<span><span>> ... </<span><span>a<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>上面的例子将会在 DOM 内嵌模板中被转换为 <code>:[someattr]<code>。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/template-syntax.html", "title": "模板语法", "doc_id": "8d575bbcedb54e0fbd277639c31c2310", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 738, "chunk_index": 50, "_doc_id": "50_1625911858500356917"}}
{"doc_id": "51_6042312197531238589", "text": "n><span>a<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>上面的例子将会在 DOM 内嵌模板中被转换为 <code>:[someattr]<code>。如果你的组件拥有 “someAttr” 属性而非 “someattr”，这段代码将不会工作。单文件组件内的模板<strong>不<strong>受此限制。<p><h3 id=\"modifiers\">修饰符 Modifiers <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#modifiers\">​<a><h3><p>修饰符是以点开头的特殊后缀，表明指令需要以一些特殊的方式被绑定。例如 <code>.prevent<code> 修饰符会告知 <code>v-on<code> 指令对触发的事件调用 <code>event.", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/template-syntax.html", "title": "模板语法", "doc_id": "8d575bbcedb54e0fbd277639c31c2310", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 738, "chunk_index": 51, "_doc_id": "51_6042312197531238589"}}
{"doc_id": "52_1859412508114081045", "text": "是以点开头的特殊后缀，表明指令需要以一些特殊的方式被绑定。例如 <code>.prevent<code> 修饰符会告知 <code>v-on<code> 指令对触发的事件调用 <code>event.preventDefault()<code>：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>form<span><span> @<span><span>submit<span><span>.<span><span>prevent<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>onSubmit<span><span>\"<span><span>>...</<span><span>form<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>之后在讲到 <a href=\"./event-handling.", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/template-syntax.html", "title": "模板语法", "doc_id": "8d575bbcedb54e0fbd277639c31c2310", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 738, "chunk_index": 52, "_doc_id": "52_1859412508114081045"}}
{"doc_id": "53_4338598961289480875", "text": "n>>...</<span><span>form<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>之后在讲到 <a href=\"./event-handling.html#event-modifiers\"><code>v-on<code><a> 和 <a href=\"./forms.html#modifiers\"><code>v-model<code><a> 的功能时，你将会看到其他修饰符的例子。<p><p>最后，在这里你可以直观地看到完整的指令语法：<p><p> <p><div><div>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/template-syntax.html", "title": "模板语法", "doc_id": "8d575bbcedb54e0fbd277639c31c2310", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 738, "chunk_index": 53, "_doc_id": "53_4338598961289480875"}}
{"doc_id": "0_3570151000554450431", "text": "<div><div><h1 id=\"reactivity-fundamentals\">响应式基础 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#reactivity-fundamentals\">​<a><h1><div class=\"tip custom-block\"><p class=\"custom-block-title\">API 参考<p><p>本页和后面很多页面中都分别包含了选项式 API 和组合式 API 的示例代码。现在你选择的是 <span class=\"options-api\">选项式 API<span><span class=\"composition-api\">组合式 API<span>。你可以使用左侧侧边栏顶部的“API 风格偏好”开关在 API 风格之间切换。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/reactivity-fundamentals.html", "title": "响应式基础", "doc_id": "281e348f306c43648df39d7d3d30363d", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1619, "chunk_index": 0, "_doc_id": "0_3570151000554450431"}}
{"doc_id": "1_4285707292777933288", "text": "api\">选项式 API<span><span class=\"composition-api\">组合式 API<span>。你可以使用左侧侧边栏顶部的“API 风格偏好”开关在 API 风格之间切换。<p><div><div class=\"options-api\"><h2 id=\"declaring-reactive-state\">声明响应式状态 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#declaring-reactive-state\">​<a><h2><p>选用选项式 API 时，会用 <code>data<code> 选项来声明组件的响应式状态。此选项的值应为返回一个对象的函数。Vue 将在创建新组件实例的时候调用此函数，并将函数返回的对象用响应式系统进行包装。此对象的所有顶层属性都会被代理到组件实例 (即方法和生命周期钩子中的 <code>this<code>) 上。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/reactivity-fundamentals.html", "title": "响应式基础", "doc_id": "281e348f306c43648df39d7d3d30363d", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1619, "chunk_index": 1, "_doc_id": "1_4285707292777933288"}}
{"doc_id": "2_296302117613639386", "text": "函数。Vue 将在创建新组件实例的时候调用此函数，并将函数返回的对象用响应式系统进行包装。此对象的所有顶层属性都会被代理到组件实例 (即方法和生命周期钩子中的 <code>this<code>) 上。<p><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line highlighted\"><span> data<span><span>() {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line highlighted\"><span> return<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line highlighted\"><span> count: <span><span>1<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/reactivity-fundamentals.html", "title": "响应式基础", "doc_id": "281e348f306c43648df39d7d3d30363d", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1619, "chunk_index": 2, "_doc_id": "2_296302117613639386"}}
{"doc_id": "3_3130083502027602715", "text": "rn<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line highlighted\"><span> count: <span><span>1<span><span>\n<span class=\"line highlighted\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line highlighted\"><span> },<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // `mounted` 是生命周期钩子，之后我们会讲到<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> mounted<span><span>() {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // `this` 指向当前组件实例<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/reactivity-fundamentals.html", "title": "响应式基础", "doc_id": "281e348f306c43648df39d7d3d30363d", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1619, "chunk_index": 3, "_doc_id": "3_3130083502027602715"}}
{"doc_id": "4_1443926754256026523", "text": "<span> mounted<span><span>() {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // `this` 指向当前组件实例<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> console.<span><span>log<span><span>(<span><span>this<span><span>.count) <span><span>// => 1<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 数据属性也可以被更改<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> this<span><span>.count <span><span>=<span><span> 2<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/reactivity-fundamentals.html", "title": "响应式基础", "doc_id": "281e348f306c43648df39d7d3d30363d", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1619, "chunk_index": 4, "_doc_id": "4_1443926754256026523"}}
{"doc_id": "5_8652568874845460149", "text": "s<span><span>.count <span><span>=<span><span> 2<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span><code><pre><div><p><a href=\"https://play.vuejs.org/#\" target=\"_blank\">在演练场中尝试一下<a><p><p>这些实例上的属性仅在实例首次创建时被添加，因此你需要确保它们都出现在 <code>data<code> 函数返回的对象上。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/reactivity-fundamentals.html", "title": "响应式基础", "doc_id": "281e348f306c43648df39d7d3d30363d", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1619, "chunk_index": 5, "_doc_id": "5_8652568874845460149"}}
{"doc_id": "6_1085799064057047567", "text": "yI=\" target=\"_blank\">在演练场中尝试一下<a><p><p>这些实例上的属性仅在实例首次创建时被添加，因此你需要确保它们都出现在 <code>data<code> 函数返回的对象上。若所需的值还未准备好，在必要时也可以使用 <code>null<code>、<code>undefined<code> 或者其他一些值占位。<p><p>虽然也可以不在 <code>data<code> 上定义，直接向组件实例添加新属性，但这个属性将无法触发响应式更新。<p><p>Vue 在组件实例上暴露的内置 API 使用 <code>$<code> 作为前缀。它同时也为内部属性保留 <code>_<code> 前缀。因此，你应该避免在顶层 <code>data<code> 上使用任何以这些字符作前缀的属性。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/reactivity-fundamentals.html", "title": "响应式基础", "doc_id": "281e348f306c43648df39d7d3d30363d", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1619, "chunk_index": 6, "_doc_id": "6_1085799064057047567"}}
{"doc_id": "7_6665763013256584193", "text": "PI 使用 <code>$<code> 作为前缀。它同时也为内部属性保留 <code>_<code> 前缀。因此，你应该避免在顶层 <code>data<code> 上使用任何以这些字符作前缀的属性。<p><h3 id=\"reactive-proxy-vs-original\">响应式代理 vs. 原始值 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#reactive-proxy-vs-original\">​<a><h3><p>在 Vue 3 中，数据是基于 <a href=\"https://developer.mozilla.org/zh-CN/docs/Web/JavaScript/Reference/Global_Objects/Proxy\" target=\"_blank\">JavaScript Proxy (代理)<a> 实现响应式的。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/reactivity-fundamentals.html", "title": "响应式基础", "doc_id": "281e348f306c43648df39d7d3d30363d", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1619, "chunk_index": 7, "_doc_id": "7_6665763013256584193"}}
{"doc_id": "8_5828007382849353736", "text": "docs/Web/JavaScript/Reference/Global_Objects/Proxy\" target=\"_blank\">JavaScript Proxy (代理)<a> 实现响应式的。使用过 Vue 2 的用户可能需要注意下面这样的边界情况：<p><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> data<span><span>() {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> return<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> someObject: {}<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/reactivity-fundamentals.html", "title": "响应式基础", "doc_id": "281e348f306c43648df39d7d3d30363d", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1619, "chunk_index": 8, "_doc_id": "8_5828007382849353736"}}
{"doc_id": "9_2297425794022852602", "text": "\"line\"><span> return<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> someObject: {}<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> },<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> mounted<span><span>() {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> const<span><span> newObject<span><span> =<span><span> {}<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> this<span><span>.someObject <span><span>=<span><span> newObject<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/reactivity-fundamentals.html", "title": "响应式基础", "doc_id": "281e348f306c43648df39d7d3d30363d", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1619, "chunk_index": 9, "_doc_id": "9_2297425794022852602"}}
{"doc_id": "10_594634454365026572", "text": "is<span><span>.someObject <span><span>=<span><span> newObject<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> console.<span><span>log<span><span>(newObject <span><span>===<span><span> this<span><span>.someObject) <span><span>// false<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span><code><pre><div><p>当你在赋值后再访问 <code>this.someObject<code>，此值已经是原来的 <code>newObject<code> 的一个响应式代理。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/reactivity-fundamentals.html", "title": "响应式基础", "doc_id": "281e348f306c43648df39d7d3d30363d", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1619, "chunk_index": 10, "_doc_id": "10_594634454365026572"}}
{"doc_id": "11_5031788801837384868", "text": "an><code><pre><div><p>当你在赋值后再访问 <code>this.someObject<code>，此值已经是原来的 <code>newObject<code> 的一个响应式代理。<strong>与 Vue 2 不同的是，这里原始的 <code>newObject<code> 不会变为响应式：请确保始终通过 <code>this<code> 来访问响应式状态。<strong><p><div><div class=\"composition-api\"><h2 id=\"declaring-reactive-state-1\">声明响应式状态 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#declaring-reactive-state-1\">​<a><h2><h3 id=\"ref\"><code>ref()<code> <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#ref\">​<a><h3><p>在组合式 API 中，", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/reactivity-fundamentals.html", "title": "响应式基础", "doc_id": "281e348f306c43648df39d7d3d30363d", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1619, "chunk_index": 11, "_doc_id": "11_5031788801837384868"}}
{"doc_id": "12_124585374127273506", "text": "\">​<a><h2><h3 id=\"ref\"><code>ref()<code> <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#ref\">​<a><h3><p>在组合式 API 中，推荐使用 <a href=\"/api/reactivity-core.html#ref\"><code>ref()<code><a> 函数来声明响应式状态：<p><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>import<span><span> { ref } <span><span>from<span><span> 'vue'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/reactivity-fundamentals.html", "title": "响应式基础", "doc_id": "281e348f306c43648df39d7d3d30363d", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1619, "chunk_index": 12, "_doc_id": "12_124585374127273506"}}
{"doc_id": "13_7173021052555063265", "text": "import<span><span> { ref } <span><span>from<span><span> 'vue'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> count<span><span> =<span><span> ref<span><span>(<span><span>0<span><span>)<span><span><code><pre><div><p><code>ref()<code> 接收参数，并将其包裹在一个带有 <code>.value<code> 属性的 ref 对象中返回：<p><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> count<span><span> =<span><span> ref<span><span>(<span><span>0<span><span>)<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/reactivity-fundamentals.html", "title": "响应式基础", "doc_id": "281e348f306c43648df39d7d3d30363d", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1619, "chunk_index": 13, "_doc_id": "13_7173021052555063265"}}
{"doc_id": "14_4838855586423087486", "text": "<span><span> count<span><span> =<span><span> ref<span><span>(<span><span>0<span><span>)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>console.<span><span>log<span><span>(count) <span><span>// { value: 0 }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>console.<span><span>log<span><span>(count.value) <span><span>// 0<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>count.value<span><span>++<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/reactivity-fundamentals.html", "title": "响应式基础", "doc_id": "281e348f306c43648df39d7d3d30363d", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1619, "chunk_index": 14, "_doc_id": "14_4838855586423087486"}}
{"doc_id": "15_562580493285459848", "text": "pan><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>count.value<span><span>++<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>console.<span><span>log<span><span>(count.value) <span><span>// 1<span><span><code><pre><div><blockquote><p>参考：<a href=\"/guide/typescript/composition-api.html#typing-ref\">为 refs 标注类型<a> <p><blockquote><p>要在组件模板中访问 ref，请从组件的 <code>setup()<code> 函数中声明并返回它们：<p><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>import<span><span> { ref } <span><span>from<span><span> 'vue'<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/reactivity-fundamentals.html", "title": "响应式基础", "doc_id": "281e348f306c43648df39d7d3d30363d", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1619, "chunk_index": 15, "_doc_id": "15_562580493285459848"}}
{"doc_id": "16_2959856932000548595", "text": "><span class=\"line\"><span>import<span><span> { ref } <span><span>from<span><span> 'vue'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // `setup` 是一个特殊的钩子，专门用于组合式 API。<span><span>\n<span class=\"line highlighted\"><span> setup<span><span>() {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> const<span><span> count<span><span> =<span><span> ref<span><span>(<span><span>0<span><span>)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/reactivity-fundamentals.html", "title": "响应式基础", "doc_id": "281e348f306c43648df39d7d3d30363d", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1619, "chunk_index": 16, "_doc_id": "16_2959856932000548595"}}
{"doc_id": "17_8634966028728468880", "text": "pan> =<span><span> ref<span><span>(<span><span>0<span><span>)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 将 ref 暴露给模板<span><span>\n<span class=\"line highlighted\"><span> return<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line highlighted\"><span> count<span><span>\n<span class=\"line highlighted\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/reactivity-fundamentals.html", "title": "响应式基础", "doc_id": "281e348f306c43648df39d7d3d30363d", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1619, "chunk_index": 17, "_doc_id": "17_8634966028728468880"}}
{"doc_id": "18_477151642126469988", "text": "><span>\n<span class=\"line highlighted\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span><code><pre><div><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>div<span><span>>{{ count }}</<span><span>div<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>注意，在模板中使用 ref 时，我们<strong>不<strong>需要附加 <code>.value<code>。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/reactivity-fundamentals.html", "title": "响应式基础", "doc_id": "281e348f306c43648df39d7d3d30363d", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1619, "chunk_index": 18, "_doc_id": "18_477151642126469988"}}
{"doc_id": "19_6295880291615194941", "text": "an><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>注意，在模板中使用 ref 时，我们<strong>不<strong>需要附加 <code>.value<code>。为了方便起见，当在模板中使用时，ref 会自动解包 (有一些<a href=\"#caveat-when-unwrapping-in-templates\">注意事项<a>)。<p><p>你也可以直接在事件监听器中改变一个 ref：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line highlighted\"><span><<span><span>button<span><span> @<span><span>click<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>count<span><span>++<span><span>\"<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/reactivity-fundamentals.html", "title": "响应式基础", "doc_id": "281e348f306c43648df39d7d3d30363d", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1619, "chunk_index": 19, "_doc_id": "19_6295880291615194941"}}
{"doc_id": "20_656799848309925137", "text": "lick<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>count<span><span>++<span><span>\"<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> {{ count }}<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>button<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>对于更复杂的逻辑，我们可以在同一作用域内声明更改 ref 的函数，并将它们作为方法与状态一起公开：<p><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>import<span><span> { ref } <span><span>from<span><span> 'vue'<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/reactivity-fundamentals.html", "title": "响应式基础", "doc_id": "281e348f306c43648df39d7d3d30363d", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1619, "chunk_index": 20, "_doc_id": "20_656799848309925137"}}
{"doc_id": "21_7379941025504502655", "text": "><span class=\"line\"><span>import<span><span> { ref } <span><span>from<span><span> 'vue'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> setup<span><span>() {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> const<span><span> count<span><span> =<span><span> ref<span><span>(<span><span>0<span><span>)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/reactivity-fundamentals.html", "title": "响应式基础", "doc_id": "281e348f306c43648df39d7d3d30363d", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1619, "chunk_index": 21, "_doc_id": "21_7379941025504502655"}}
{"doc_id": "22_794204439799131582", "text": "pan> =<span><span> ref<span><span>(<span><span>0<span><span>)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line highlighted\"><span> function<span><span> increment<span><span>() {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line highlighted\"><span> // 在 JavaScript 中需要 .value<span><span>\n<span class=\"line highlighted\"><span> count.value<span><span>++<span><span>\n<span class=\"line highlighted\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 不要忘记同时暴露 increment 函数<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/reactivity-fundamentals.html", "title": "响应式基础", "doc_id": "281e348f306c43648df39d7d3d30363d", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1619, "chunk_index": 22, "_doc_id": "22_794204439799131582"}}
{"doc_id": "23_8425114941368180873", "text": "pan><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 不要忘记同时暴露 increment 函数<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> return<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> count,<span><span>\n<span class=\"line highlighted\"><span> increment<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/reactivity-fundamentals.html", "title": "响应式基础", "doc_id": "281e348f306c43648df39d7d3d30363d", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1619, "chunk_index": 23, "_doc_id": "23_8425114941368180873"}}
{"doc_id": "24_6231756711612977405", "text": "crement<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span><code><pre><div><p>然后，暴露的方法可以被用作事件监听器：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line highlighted\"><span><<span><span>button<span><span> @<span><span>click<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>increment<span><span>\"<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> {{ count }}<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/reactivity-fundamentals.html", "title": "响应式基础", "doc_id": "281e348f306c43648df39d7d3d30363d", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1619, "chunk_index": 24, "_doc_id": "24_6231756711612977405"}}
{"doc_id": "25_2162302265299533955", "text": "n>increment<span><span>\"<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> {{ count }}<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>button<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>这里是 <a href=\"https://codepen.io/vuejs-examples/pen/WNYbaqo\" target=\"_blank\">Codepen<a> 上的例子，没有使用任何构建工具。<p><h3 id=\"script-setup\"><code><script setup><code> <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#script-setup\">​<a><h3><p>在 <code>setup()<code> 函数中手动暴露大量的状态和方法非常繁琐。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/reactivity-fundamentals.html", "title": "响应式基础", "doc_id": "281e348f306c43648df39d7d3d30363d", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1619, "chunk_index": 25, "_doc_id": "25_2162302265299533955"}}
{"doc_id": "26_4136105692260126616", "text": "<a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#script-setup\">​<a><h3><p>在 <code>setup()<code> 函数中手动暴露大量的状态和方法非常繁琐。幸运的是，我们可以通过使用<a href=\"/guide/scaling-up/sfc.html\">单文件组件 (SFC)<a> 来避免这种情况。我们可以使用 <code><script setup><code> 来大幅度地简化代码：<p><div class=\"language-vue\"> <span class=\"lang\">vue<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line highlighted\"><span><<span><span>script<span><span> setup<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/reactivity-fundamentals.html", "title": "响应式基础", "doc_id": "281e348f306c43648df39d7d3d30363d", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1619, "chunk_index": 26, "_doc_id": "26_4136105692260126616"}}
{"doc_id": "27_7567050404190594562", "text": "<span class=\"line highlighted\"><span><<span><span>script<span><span> setup<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>import<span><span> { ref } <span><span>from<span><span> 'vue'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> count<span><span> =<span><span> ref<span><span>(<span><span>0<span><span>)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>function<span><span> increment<span><span>() {<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/reactivity-fundamentals.html", "title": "响应式基础", "doc_id": "281e348f306c43648df39d7d3d30363d", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1619, "chunk_index": 27, "_doc_id": "27_7567050404190594562"}}
{"doc_id": "28_1713736486623848395", "text": "s=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>function<span><span> increment<span><span>() {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> count.value<span><span>++<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>script<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>button<span><span> @click<span><span>=<span><span>\"increment\"<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/reactivity-fundamentals.html", "title": "响应式基础", "doc_id": "281e348f306c43648df39d7d3d30363d", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1619, "chunk_index": 28, "_doc_id": "28_1713736486623848395"}}
{"doc_id": "29_4923459022992782519", "text": "<<span><span>button<span><span> @click<span><span>=<span><span>\"increment\"<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> {{ count }}<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> </<span><span>button<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/reactivity-fundamentals.html", "title": "响应式基础", "doc_id": "281e348f306c43648df39d7d3d30363d", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1619, "chunk_index": 29, "_doc_id": "29_4923459022992782519"}}
{"doc_id": "30_5125661711777699259", "text": "an> {{ count }}<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> </<span><span>button<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p><a href=\"https://play.vuejs.org/#eNo9jUEKgzAQRa8yZKMiaNcllvYe2dgwQqiZhDhxE3L3jrW4/DPvv1/UK8Zhz6juSm82uciwIef4MOR8DImhQMIFKiwpeGgEbQwZsoE2BhsyMUwH0d66475ksuwCgSOb0CNx20ExBCc77POase8NVUN6PBdlSwKjj+vMKAlAvzOzWJ52dfYzGXXpjPoBAKX856uopDGeFfnq8XKp+gWq4FAi\" target=\"_blank\">在演练场中尝试一下<a><p><p><code><script setup><code> 中的顶层的导入、声明的变量和函数可在同一组件的模板中直接使用。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/reactivity-fundamentals.html", "title": "响应式基础", "doc_id": "281e348f306c43648df39d7d3d30363d", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1619, "chunk_index": 30, "_doc_id": "30_5125661711777699259"}}
{"doc_id": "31_6595469508733404184", "text": "Wq4FAi\" target=\"_blank\">在演练场中尝试一下<a><p><p><code><script setup><code> 中的顶层的导入、声明的变量和函数可在同一组件的模板中直接使用。你可以理解为模板是在同一作用域内声明的一个 JavaScript 函数——它自然可以访问与它一起声明的所有内容。<p><div class=\"tip custom-block\"><p class=\"custom-block-title\">TIP<p><p>在指南的后续章节中，我们基本上都会在组合式 API 示例中使用单文件组件 + <code><script setup><code> 的语法，因为大多数 Vue 开发者都会这样使用。<p><p>如果你没有使用单文件组件，你仍然可以在 <a href=\"/api/composition-api-setup.html\"><code>setup()<code><a> 选项中使用组合式 API。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/reactivity-fundamentals.html", "title": "响应式基础", "doc_id": "281e348f306c43648df39d7d3d30363d", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1619, "chunk_index": 31, "_doc_id": "31_6595469508733404184"}}
{"doc_id": "32_8115472930559512047", "text": "p>如果你没有使用单文件组件，你仍然可以在 <a href=\"/api/composition-api-setup.html\"><code>setup()<code><a> 选项中使用组合式 API。<p><div><h3 id=\"why-refs\">为什么要使用 ref？ <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#why-refs\">​<a><h3><p>你可能会好奇：为什么我们需要使用带有 <code>.value<code> 的 ref，而不是普通的变量？为了解释这一点，我们需要简单地讨论一下 Vue 的响应式系统是如何工作的。<p><p>当你在模板中使用了一个 ref，然后改变了这个 ref 的值时，Vue 会自动检测到这个变化，并且相应地更新 DOM。这是通过一个基于依赖追踪的响应式系统实现的。当一个组件首次渲染时，Vue 会<strong>追踪<strong>在渲染过程中使用的每一个 ref。然后，当一个 ref 被修改时，它会<strong>触发<strong>追踪它的组件的一次重新渲染。<p><p>在标准的 JavaScript 中，检测普通变量的访问或修改是行不通的。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/reactivity-fundamentals.html", "title": "响应式基础", "doc_id": "281e348f306c43648df39d7d3d30363d", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1619, "chunk_index": 32, "_doc_id": "32_8115472930559512047"}}
{"doc_id": "33_2542215316325867300", "text": "每一个 ref。然后，当一个 ref 被修改时，它会<strong>触发<strong>追踪它的组件的一次重新渲染。<p><p>在标准的 JavaScript 中，检测普通变量的访问或修改是行不通的。然而，我们可以通过 getter 和 setter 方法来拦截对象属性的 get 和 set 操作。<p><p>该 <code>.value<code> 属性给予了 Vue 一个机会来检测 ref 何时被访问或修改。在其内部，Vue 在它的 getter 中执行追踪，在它的 setter 中执行触发。从概念上讲，你可以将 ref 看作是一个像这样的对象：<p><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// 伪代码，不是真正的实现<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/reactivity-fundamentals.html", "title": "响应式基础", "doc_id": "281e348f306c43648df39d7d3d30363d", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1619, "chunk_index": 33, "_doc_id": "33_2542215316325867300"}}
{"doc_id": "34_6731274998268812842", "text": "an><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// 伪代码，不是真正的实现<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> myRef<span><span> =<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> _value: <span><span>0<span><span>,<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> get<span><span> value<span><span>() {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> track<span><span>()<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> return<span><span> this<span><span>._value<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/reactivity-fundamentals.html", "title": "响应式基础", "doc_id": "281e348f306c43648df39d7d3d30363d", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1619, "chunk_index": 34, "_doc_id": "34_6731274998268812842"}}
{"doc_id": "35_8768362080450548467", "text": "pan>()<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> return<span><span> this<span><span>._value<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> },<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> set<span><span> value<span><span>(<span><span>newValue<span><span>) {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> this<span><span>._value <span><span>=<span><span> newValue<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> trigger<span><span>()<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/reactivity-fundamentals.html", "title": "响应式基础", "doc_id": "281e348f306c43648df39d7d3d30363d", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1619, "chunk_index": 35, "_doc_id": "35_8768362080450548467"}}
{"doc_id": "36_6693554926121556931", "text": "<span class=\"line\"><span> trigger<span><span>()<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span><code><pre><div><p>另一个 ref 的好处是，与普通变量不同，你可以将 ref 传递给函数，同时保留对最新值和响应式连接的访问。当将复杂的逻辑重构为可重用的代码时，这将非常有用。<p><p>该响应性系统在<a href=\"/guide/extras/reactivity-in-depth.html\">深入响应式系统<a>章节中有更详细的讨论。<p><div><div class=\"options-api\"><h2 id=\"declaring-methods\">声明方法 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#declaring-methods\">​<a><h2><p>要为组件添加方法，我们需要用到 <code>methods<code> 选项。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/reactivity-fundamentals.html", "title": "响应式基础", "doc_id": "281e348f306c43648df39d7d3d30363d", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1619, "chunk_index": 36, "_doc_id": "36_6693554926121556931"}}
{"doc_id": "37_5578616520549832529", "text": "a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#declaring-methods\">​<a><h2><p>要为组件添加方法，我们需要用到 <code>methods<code> 选项。它应该是一个包含所有方法的对象：<p><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> data<span><span>() {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> return<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> count: <span><span>0<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/reactivity-fundamentals.html", "title": "响应式基础", "doc_id": "281e348f306c43648df39d7d3d30363d", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1619, "chunk_index": 37, "_doc_id": "37_5578616520549832529"}}
{"doc_id": "38_6198132194265773222", "text": "<span class=\"line\"><span> count: <span><span>0<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> },<span><span>\n<span class=\"line highlighted\"><span> methods: {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line highlighted\"><span> increment<span><span>() {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line highlighted\"><span> this<span><span>.count<span><span>++<span><span>\n<span class=\"line highlighted\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line highlighted\"><span> },<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/reactivity-fundamentals.html", "title": "响应式基础", "doc_id": "281e348f306c43648df39d7d3d30363d", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1619, "chunk_index": 38, "_doc_id": "38_6198132194265773222"}}
{"doc_id": "39_1654250374675806102", "text": "class=\"line highlighted\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line highlighted\"><span> },<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> mounted<span><span>() {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 在其他方法或是生命周期中也可以调用方法<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> this<span><span>.<span><span>increment<span><span>()<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/reactivity-fundamentals.html", "title": "响应式基础", "doc_id": "281e348f306c43648df39d7d3d30363d", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1619, "chunk_index": 39, "_doc_id": "39_1654250374675806102"}}
{"doc_id": "40_743138601942614996", "text": "span><span>.<span><span>increment<span><span>()<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span><code><pre><div><p>Vue 自动为 <code>methods<code> 中的方法绑定了永远指向组件实例的 <code>this<code>。这确保了方法在作为事件监听器或回调函数时始终保持正确的 <code>this<code>。你不应该在定义 <code>methods<code> 时使用箭头函数，因为箭头函数没有自己的 <code>this<code> 上下文。<p><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/reactivity-fundamentals.html", "title": "响应式基础", "doc_id": "281e348f306c43648df39d7d3d30363d", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1619, "chunk_index": 40, "_doc_id": "40_743138601942614996"}}
{"doc_id": "41_2308354468593016612", "text": "b-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> methods: {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> increment<span><span>: () <span><span>=><span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 反例：无法访问此处的 `this`!<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span><code><pre><div><p>和组件实例上的其他属性一样，方法也可以在模板上被访问。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/reactivity-fundamentals.html", "title": "响应式基础", "doc_id": "281e348f306c43648df39d7d3d30363d", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1619, "chunk_index": 41, "_doc_id": "41_2308354468593016612"}}
{"doc_id": "42_6991233998243711930", "text": "> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span><code><pre><div><p>和组件实例上的其他属性一样，方法也可以在模板上被访问。在模板中它们常常被用作事件监听器：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>button<span><span> @<span><span>click<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>increment<span><span>\"<span><span>>{{ count }}</<span><span>button<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p><a href=\"https://play.vuejs.", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/reactivity-fundamentals.html", "title": "响应式基础", "doc_id": "281e348f306c43648df39d7d3d30363d", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1619, "chunk_index": 42, "_doc_id": "42_6991233998243711930"}}
{"doc_id": "43_2750493967941912444", "text": "count }}</<span><span>button<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p><a href=\"https://play.vuejs.org/#eNplj9EKwyAMRX8l+LSx0e65uLL9hy+dZlTWqtg4BuK/z1baDgZicsPJgUR2d656B2QN45P02lErDH6c9QQKn10YCKIwAKqj7nAsPYBHCt6sCUDaYKiBS8lpLuk8/yNSb9XUrKg20uOIhnYXAPV6qhbF6fRvmOeodn6hfzwLKkx+vN5OyIFwdENHmBMAfwQia+AmBy1fV8E2gWBtjOUASInXBcxLvN4MLH0BCe1i4Q==\" target=\"_blank\">在演练场中尝试一下<a><p><p>在上面的例子中，<code>increment<code> 方法会在 <code><button><code> 被点击时调用。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/reactivity-fundamentals.html", "title": "响应式基础", "doc_id": "281e348f306c43648df39d7d3d30363d", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1619, "chunk_index": 43, "_doc_id": "43_2750493967941912444"}}
{"doc_id": "44_2796450488856337183", "text": "=\" target=\"_blank\">在演练场中尝试一下<a><p><p>在上面的例子中，<code>increment<code> 方法会在 <code><button><code> 被点击时调用。<p><div><h3 id=\"deep-reactivity\">深层响应性 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#deep-reactivity\">​<a><h3><div class=\"options-api\"><p>在 Vue 中，默认情况下，状态是深度响应的。这意味着当改变嵌套对象或数组时，这些变化也会被检测到：<p><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> data<span><span>() {<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/reactivity-fundamentals.html", "title": "响应式基础", "doc_id": "281e348f306c43648df39d7d3d30363d", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1619, "chunk_index": 44, "_doc_id": "44_2796450488856337183"}}
{"doc_id": "45_5645469343777659287", "text": "<span> default<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> data<span><span>() {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> return<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> obj: {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> nested: { count: <span><span>0<span><span> },<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> arr: [<span><span>'foo'<span><span>, <span><span>'bar'<span><span>]<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/reactivity-fundamentals.html", "title": "响应式基础", "doc_id": "281e348f306c43648df39d7d3d30363d", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1619, "chunk_index": 45, "_doc_id": "45_5645469343777659287"}}
{"doc_id": "46_2693089106610546374", "text": "<span>]<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> },<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> methods: {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> mutateDeeply<span><span>() {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 以下都会按照期望工作<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> this<span><span>.obj.nested.count<span><span>++<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/reactivity-fundamentals.html", "title": "响应式基础", "doc_id": "281e348f306c43648df39d7d3d30363d", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1619, "chunk_index": 46, "_doc_id": "46_2693089106610546374"}}
{"doc_id": "47_5689548827077005798", "text": "作<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> this<span><span>.obj.nested.count<span><span>++<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> this<span><span>.obj.arr.<span><span>push<span><span>(<span><span>'baz'<span><span>)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/reactivity-fundamentals.html", "title": "响应式基础", "doc_id": "281e348f306c43648df39d7d3d30363d", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1619, "chunk_index": 47, "_doc_id": "47_5689548827077005798"}}
{"doc_id": "48_7660783178856935883", "text": "<span>)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span><code><pre><div><div><div class=\"composition-api\"><p>Ref 可以持有任何类型的值，包括深层嵌套的对象、数组或者 JavaScript 内置的数据结构，比如 <code>Map<code>。<p><p>Ref 会使它的值具有深层响应性。这意味着即使改变嵌套对象或数组时，变化也会被检测到：<p><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>import<span><span> { ref } <span><span>from<span><span> 'vue'<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/reactivity-fundamentals.html", "title": "响应式基础", "doc_id": "281e348f306c43648df39d7d3d30363d", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1619, "chunk_index": 48, "_doc_id": "48_7660783178856935883"}}
{"doc_id": "49_1902687415745954718", "text": "><span class=\"line\"><span>import<span><span> { ref } <span><span>from<span><span> 'vue'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> obj<span><span> =<span><span> ref<span><span>({<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> nested: { count: <span><span>0<span><span> },<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> arr: [<span><span>'foo'<span><span>, <span><span>'bar'<span><span>]<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>})<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/reactivity-fundamentals.html", "title": "响应式基础", "doc_id": "281e348f306c43648df39d7d3d30363d", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1619, "chunk_index": 49, "_doc_id": "49_1902687415745954718"}}
{"doc_id": "50_6573129769740290449", "text": "an>'bar'<span><span>]<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>})<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>function<span><span> mutateDeeply<span><span>() {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 以下都会按照期望工作<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> obj.value.nested.count<span><span>++<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> obj.value.arr.<span><span>push<span><span>(<span><span>'baz'<span><span>)<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/reactivity-fundamentals.html", "title": "响应式基础", "doc_id": "281e348f306c43648df39d7d3d30363d", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1619, "chunk_index": 50, "_doc_id": "50_6573129769740290449"}}
{"doc_id": "51_1441282639663801857", "text": "\"line\"><span> obj.value.arr.<span><span>push<span><span>(<span><span>'baz'<span><span>)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span><code><pre><div><p>非原始值将通过 <a href=\"#reactive\"><code>reactive()<code><a> 转换为响应式代理，该函数将在后面讨论。<p><p>也可以通过 <a href=\"/api/reactivity-advanced.html#shallowref\">shallow ref<a> 来放弃深层响应性。对于浅层 ref，只有 <code>.value<code> 的访问会被追踪。浅层 ref 可以用于避免对大型数据的响应性开销来优化性能、或者有外部库管理其内部状态的情况。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/reactivity-fundamentals.html", "title": "响应式基础", "doc_id": "281e348f306c43648df39d7d3d30363d", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1619, "chunk_index": 51, "_doc_id": "51_1441282639663801857"}}
{"doc_id": "52_8177961115470708524", "text": "f<a> 来放弃深层响应性。对于浅层 ref，只有 <code>.value<code> 的访问会被追踪。浅层 ref 可以用于避免对大型数据的响应性开销来优化性能、或者有外部库管理其内部状态的情况。<p><p>阅读更多：<p><div><h3 id=\"dom-update-timing\">DOM 更新时机 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#dom-update-timing\">​<a><h3><p>当你修改了响应式状态时，DOM 会被自动更新。但是需要注意的是，DOM 更新不是同步的。Vue 会在“next tick”更新周期中缓冲所有状态的修改，以确保不管你进行了多少次状态修改，每个组件都只会被更新一次。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/reactivity-fundamentals.html", "title": "响应式基础", "doc_id": "281e348f306c43648df39d7d3d30363d", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1619, "chunk_index": 52, "_doc_id": "52_8177961115470708524"}}
{"doc_id": "53_1397718978214125990", "text": "应式状态时，DOM 会被自动更新。但是需要注意的是，DOM 更新不是同步的。Vue 会在“next tick”更新周期中缓冲所有状态的修改，以确保不管你进行了多少次状态修改，每个组件都只会被更新一次。<p><p>要等待 DOM 更新完成后再执行额外的代码，可以使用 <a href=\"/api/general.html#nexttick\">nextTick()<a> 全局 API：<p><div class=\"composition-api\"><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>import<span><span> { nextTick } <span><span>from<span><span> 'vue'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/reactivity-fundamentals.html", "title": "响应式基础", "doc_id": "281e348f306c43648df39d7d3d30363d", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1619, "chunk_index": 53, "_doc_id": "53_1397718978214125990"}}
{"doc_id": "54_4839051003309454075", "text": "t<span><span> { nextTick } <span><span>from<span><span> 'vue'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>async<span><span> function<span><span> increment<span><span>() {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> count.value<span><span>++<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> await<span><span> nextTick<span><span>()<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 现在 DOM 已经更新了<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/reactivity-fundamentals.html", "title": "响应式基础", "doc_id": "281e348f306c43648df39d7d3d30363d", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1619, "chunk_index": 54, "_doc_id": "54_4839051003309454075"}}
{"doc_id": "55_3147310053614699635", "text": "pan><span> nextTick<span><span>()<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 现在 DOM 已经更新了<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span><code><pre><div><div><div class=\"options-api\"><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>import<span><span> { nextTick } <span><span>from<span><span> 'vue'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/reactivity-fundamentals.html", "title": "响应式基础", "doc_id": "281e348f306c43648df39d7d3d30363d", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1619, "chunk_index": 55, "_doc_id": "55_3147310053614699635"}}
{"doc_id": "56_5267951364263725317", "text": "n class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> methods: {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> async<span><span> increment<span><span>() {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> this<span><span>.count<span><span>++<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> await<span><span> nextTick<span><span>()<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 现在 DOM 已经更新了<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/reactivity-fundamentals.html", "title": "响应式基础", "doc_id": "281e348f306c43648df39d7d3d30363d", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1619, "chunk_index": 56, "_doc_id": "56_5267951364263725317"}}
{"doc_id": "57_5480258613968316891", "text": "span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 现在 DOM 已经更新了<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/reactivity-fundamentals.html", "title": "响应式基础", "doc_id": "281e348f306c43648df39d7d3d30363d", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1619, "chunk_index": 57, "_doc_id": "57_5480258613968316891"}}
{"doc_id": "58_5474045902212576748", "text": "M 已经更新了<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span><code><pre><div><div><div class=\"composition-api\"><h2 id=\"reactive\"><code>reactive()<code> <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#reactive\">​<a><h2><p>还有另一种声明响应式状态的方式，即使用 <code>reactive()<code> API。与将内部值包装在特殊对象中的 ref 不同，<code>reactive()<code> 将使对象本身具有响应性：<p><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>import<span><span> { reactive } <span><span>from<span><span> 'vue'<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/reactivity-fundamentals.html", "title": "响应式基础", "doc_id": "281e348f306c43648df39d7d3d30363d", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1619, "chunk_index": 58, "_doc_id": "58_5474045902212576748"}}
{"doc_id": "59_778228012978716166", "text": "n class=\"line\"><span>import<span><span> { reactive } <span><span>from<span><span> 'vue'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> state<span><span> =<span><span> reactive<span><span>({ count: <span><span>0<span><span> })<span><span><code><pre><div><blockquote><p>参考：<a href=\"/guide/typescript/composition-api.", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/reactivity-fundamentals.html", "title": "响应式基础", "doc_id": "281e348f306c43648df39d7d3d30363d", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1619, "chunk_index": 59, "_doc_id": "59_778228012978716166"}}
{"doc_id": "60_6870084752003812277", "text": "n><span> })<span><span><code><pre><div><blockquote><p>参考：<a href=\"/guide/typescript/composition-api.html#typing-reactive\">为 <code>reactive()<code> 标注类型<a> <p><blockquote><p>在模板中使用：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>button<span><span> @<span><span>click<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>state.count<span><span>++<span><span>\"<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/reactivity-fundamentals.html", "title": "响应式基础", "doc_id": "281e348f306c43648df39d7d3d30363d", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1619, "chunk_index": 60, "_doc_id": "60_6870084752003812277"}}
{"doc_id": "61_5228140354846526934", "text": "pan><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>state.count<span><span>++<span><span>\"<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> {{ state.count }}<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>button<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>响应式对象是 <a href=\"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/JavaScript/Reference/Global_Objects/Proxy\" target=\"_blank\">JavaScript 代理<a>，其行为就和普通对象一样。不同的是，Vue 能够拦截对响应式对象所有属性的访问和修改，以便进行依赖追踪和触发更新。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/reactivity-fundamentals.html", "title": "响应式基础", "doc_id": "281e348f306c43648df39d7d3d30363d", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1619, "chunk_index": 61, "_doc_id": "61_5228140354846526934"}}
{"doc_id": "62_1147155228110716341", "text": "cts/Proxy\" target=\"_blank\">JavaScript 代理<a>，其行为就和普通对象一样。不同的是，Vue 能够拦截对响应式对象所有属性的访问和修改，以便进行依赖追踪和触发更新。<p><p><code>reactive()<code> 将深层地转换对象：当访问嵌套对象时，它们也会被 <code>reactive()<code> 包装。当 ref 的值是一个对象时，<code>ref()<code> 也会在内部调用它。与浅层 ref 类似，这里也有一个 <a href=\"/api/reactivity-advanced.html#shallowreactive\"><code>shallowReactive()<code><a> API 可以选择退出深层响应性。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/reactivity-fundamentals.html", "title": "响应式基础", "doc_id": "281e348f306c43648df39d7d3d30363d", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1619, "chunk_index": 62, "_doc_id": "62_1147155228110716341"}}
{"doc_id": "63_116019749435263080", "text": "ef=\"/api/reactivity-advanced.html#shallowreactive\"><code>shallowReactive()<code><a> API 可以选择退出深层响应性。<p><h3 id=\"reactive-proxy-vs-original-1\">Reactive Proxy vs. Original <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#reactive-proxy-vs-original-1\">​<a><h3><p>值得注意的是，<code>reactive()<code> 返回的是一个原始对象的 <a href=\"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/JavaScript/Reference/Global_Objects/Proxy\" target=\"_blank\">Proxy<a>，它和原始对象是不相等的：<p><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> raw<span><span> =<span><span> {}<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/reactivity-fundamentals.html", "title": "响应式基础", "doc_id": "281e348f306c43648df39d7d3d30363d", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1619, "chunk_index": 63, "_doc_id": "63_116019749435263080"}}
{"doc_id": "64_5447516047066987055", "text": "code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> raw<span><span> =<span><span> {}<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> proxy<span><span> =<span><span> reactive<span><span>(raw)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 代理对象和原始对象不是全等的<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/reactivity-fundamentals.html", "title": "响应式基础", "doc_id": "281e348f306c43648df39d7d3d30363d", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1619, "chunk_index": 64, "_doc_id": "64_5447516047066987055"}}
{"doc_id": "65_3361022164194218577", "text": ">(raw)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 代理对象和原始对象不是全等的<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>console.<span><span>log<span><span>(proxy <span><span>===<span><span> raw) <span><span>// false<span><span><code><pre><div><p>只有代理对象是响应式的，更改原始对象不会触发更新。因此，使用 Vue 的响应式系统的最佳实践是<strong>仅使用你声明对象的代理版本<strong>。<p><p>为保证访问代理的一致性，对同一个原始对象调用 <code>reactive()<code> 会总是返回同样的代理对象，而对一个已存在的代理对象调用 <code>reactive()<code> 会返回其本身：<p><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// 在同一个对象上调用 reactive() 会返回相同的代理<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/reactivity-fundamentals.html", "title": "响应式基础", "doc_id": "281e348f306c43648df39d7d3d30363d", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1619, "chunk_index": 65, "_doc_id": "65_3361022164194218577"}}
{"doc_id": "66_1268520419194051947", "text": "ki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// 在同一个对象上调用 reactive() 会返回相同的代理<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>console.<span><span>log<span><span>(<span><span>reactive<span><span>(raw) <span><span>===<span><span> proxy) <span><span>// true<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 在一个代理上调用 reactive() 会返回它自己<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/reactivity-fundamentals.html", "title": "响应式基础", "doc_id": "281e348f306c43648df39d7d3d30363d", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1619, "chunk_index": 66, "_doc_id": "66_1268520419194051947"}}
{"doc_id": "67_8409110211611791600", "text": "<span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 在一个代理上调用 reactive() 会返回它自己<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>console.<span><span>log<span><span>(<span><span>reactive<span><span>(proxy) <span><span>===<span><span> proxy) <span><span>// true<span><span><code><pre><div><p>这个规则对嵌套对象也适用。依靠深层响应性，响应式对象内的嵌套对象依然是代理：<p><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> proxy<span><span> =<span><span> reactive<span><span>({})<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/reactivity-fundamentals.html", "title": "响应式基础", "doc_id": "281e348f306c43648df39d7d3d30363d", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1619, "chunk_index": 67, "_doc_id": "67_8409110211611791600"}}
{"doc_id": "68_7331354312539216884", "text": "\"line\"><span>const<span><span> proxy<span><span> =<span><span> reactive<span><span>({})<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> raw<span><span> =<span><span> {}<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>proxy.nested <span><span>=<span><span> raw<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>console.<span><span>log<span><span>(proxy.", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/reactivity-fundamentals.html", "title": "响应式基础", "doc_id": "281e348f306c43648df39d7d3d30363d", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1619, "chunk_index": 68, "_doc_id": "68_7331354312539216884"}}
{"doc_id": "69_1035313487705994959", "text": "<span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>console.<span><span>log<span><span>(proxy.nested <span><span>===<span><span> raw) <span><span>// false<span><span><code><pre><div><h3 id=\"limitations-of-reactive\"><code>reactive()<code> 的局限性 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#limitations-of-reactive\">​<a><h3><p><code>reactive()<code> API 有一些局限性：<p><ol><li><p><strong>有限的值类型<strong>：它只能用于对象类型 (对象、数组和如 <code>Map<code>、<code>Set<code> 这样的<a href=\"https://developer.mozilla.", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/reactivity-fundamentals.html", "title": "响应式基础", "doc_id": "281e348f306c43648df39d7d3d30363d", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1619, "chunk_index": 69, "_doc_id": "69_1035313487705994959"}}
{"doc_id": "70_563475844196147868", "text": "类型<strong>：它只能用于对象类型 (对象、数组和如 <code>Map<code>、<code>Set<code> 这样的<a href=\"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/JavaScript/Reference/Global_Objects#keyed_collections\" target=\"_blank\">集合类型<a>)。它不能持有如 <code>string<code>、<code>number<code> 或 <code>boolean<code> 这样的<a href=\"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Glossary/Primitive\" target=\"_blank\">原始类型<a>。<p><li><li><p><strong>不能替换整个对象<strong>：由于 Vue 的响应式跟踪是通过属性访问实现的，因此我们必须始终保持对响应式对象的相同引用。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/reactivity-fundamentals.html", "title": "响应式基础", "doc_id": "281e348f306c43648df39d7d3d30363d", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1619, "chunk_index": 70, "_doc_id": "70_563475844196147868"}}
{"doc_id": "71_493816847522635205", "text": "blank\">原始类型<a>。<p><li><li><p><strong>不能替换整个对象<strong>：由于 Vue 的响应式跟踪是通过属性访问实现的，因此我们必须始终保持对响应式对象的相同引用。这意味着我们不能轻易地“替换”响应式对象，因为这样的话与第一个引用的响应性连接将丢失：<p><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>let<span><span> state <span><span>=<span><span> reactive<span><span>({ count: <span><span>0<span><span> })<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 上面的 ({ count: 0 }) 引用将不再被追踪<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/reactivity-fundamentals.html", "title": "响应式基础", "doc_id": "281e348f306c43648df39d7d3d30363d", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1619, "chunk_index": 71, "_doc_id": "71_493816847522635205"}}
{"doc_id": "72_3957510707679440393", "text": "span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 上面的 ({ count: 0 }) 引用将不再被追踪<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// (响应性连接已丢失！)<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/reactivity-fundamentals.html", "title": "响应式基础", "doc_id": "281e348f306c43648df39d7d3d30363d", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1619, "chunk_index": 72, "_doc_id": "72_3957510707679440393"}}
{"doc_id": "73_2651301991686434118", "text": "span>// 上面的 ({ count: 0 }) 引用将不再被追踪<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// (响应性连接已丢失！)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>state <span><span>=<span><span> reactive<span><span>({ count: <span><span>1<span><span> })<span><span><code><pre><div><li><li><p><strong>对解构操作不友好<strong>：当我们将响应式对象的原始类型属性解构为本地变量时，或者将该属性传递给函数时，我们将丢失响应性连接：<p><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> state<span><span> =<span><span> reactive<span><span>({ count: <span><span>0<span><span> })<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/reactivity-fundamentals.html", "title": "响应式基础", "doc_id": "281e348f306c43648df39d7d3d30363d", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1619, "chunk_index": 73, "_doc_id": "73_2651301991686434118"}}
{"doc_id": "74_3801073224335681179", "text": "te<span><span> =<span><span> reactive<span><span>({ count: <span><span>0<span><span> })<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 当解构时，count 已经与 state.count 断开连接<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>let<span><span> { count } <span><span>=<span><span> state<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 不会影响原始的 state<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>count<span><span>++<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 该函数接收到的是一个普通的数字<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/reactivity-fundamentals.html", "title": "响应式基础", "doc_id": "281e348f306c43648df39d7d3d30363d", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1619, "chunk_index": 74, "_doc_id": "74_3801073224335681179"}}
{"doc_id": "75_1076551758698761683", "text": "an>++<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 该函数接收到的是一个普通的数字<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 并且无法追踪 state.count 的变化<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 我们必须传入整个对象以保持响应性<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>callSomeFunction<span><span>(state.count)<span><span><code><pre><div><li><ol><p>由于这些限制，我们建议使用 <code>ref()<code> 作为声明响应式状态的主要 API。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/reactivity-fundamentals.html", "title": "响应式基础", "doc_id": "281e348f306c43648df39d7d3d30363d", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1619, "chunk_index": 75, "_doc_id": "75_1076551758698761683"}}
{"doc_id": "76_7670602626293329478", "text": "state.count)<span><span><code><pre><div><li><ol><p>由于这些限制，我们建议使用 <code>ref()<code> 作为声明响应式状态的主要 API。<p><h2 id=\"additional-ref-unwrapping-details\">额外的 ref 解包细节 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#additional-ref-unwrapping-details\">​<a><h2><h3 id=\"ref-unwrapping-as-reactive-object-property\">作为 reactive 对象的属性 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#ref-unwrapping-as-reactive-object-property\">​<a><h3><p>一个 ref 会在作为响应式对象的属性被访问或修改时自动解包。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/reactivity-fundamentals.html", "title": "响应式基础", "doc_id": "281e348f306c43648df39d7d3d30363d", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1619, "chunk_index": 76, "_doc_id": "76_7670602626293329478"}}
{"doc_id": "77_5937655557662152627", "text": "nchor\" href=\"#ref-unwrapping-as-reactive-object-property\">​<a><h3><p>一个 ref 会在作为响应式对象的属性被访问或修改时自动解包。换句话说，它的行为就像一个普通的属性：<p><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> count<span><span> =<span><span> ref<span><span>(<span><span>0<span><span>)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> state<span><span> =<span><span> reactive<span><span>({<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> count<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/reactivity-fundamentals.html", "title": "响应式基础", "doc_id": "281e348f306c43648df39d7d3d30363d", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1619, "chunk_index": 77, "_doc_id": "77_5937655557662152627"}}
{"doc_id": "78_8890239294603355357", "text": "<span> =<span><span> reactive<span><span>({<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> count<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>})<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>console.<span><span>log<span><span>(state.count) <span><span>// 0<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>state.count <span><span>=<span><span> 1<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/reactivity-fundamentals.html", "title": "响应式基础", "doc_id": "281e348f306c43648df39d7d3d30363d", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1619, "chunk_index": 78, "_doc_id": "78_8890239294603355357"}}
{"doc_id": "79_4888873307874698424", "text": "an class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>state.count <span><span>=<span><span> 1<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>console.<span><span>log<span><span>(count.value) <span><span>// 1<span><span><code><pre><div><p>如果将一个新的 ref 赋值给一个关联了已有 ref 的属性，那么它会替换掉旧的 ref：<p><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> otherCount<span><span> =<span><span> ref<span><span>(<span><span>2<span><span>)<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/reactivity-fundamentals.html", "title": "响应式基础", "doc_id": "281e348f306c43648df39d7d3d30363d", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1619, "chunk_index": 79, "_doc_id": "79_4888873307874698424"}}
{"doc_id": "80_6394332739655957404", "text": "><span> otherCount<span><span> =<span><span> ref<span><span>(<span><span>2<span><span>)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>state.count <span><span>=<span><span> otherCount<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>console.<span><span>log<span><span>(state.count) <span><span>// 2<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 原始 ref 现在已经和 state.count 失去联系<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/reactivity-fundamentals.html", "title": "响应式基础", "doc_id": "281e348f306c43648df39d7d3d30363d", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1619, "chunk_index": 80, "_doc_id": "80_6394332739655957404"}}
{"doc_id": "81_7285113295993370582", "text": "<span><span>// 2<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 原始 ref 现在已经和 state.count 失去联系<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>console.<span><span>log<span><span>(count.value) <span><span>// 1<span><span><code><pre><div><p>只有当嵌套在一个深层响应式对象内时，才会发生 ref 解包。当其作为<a href=\"/api/reactivity-advanced.html#shallowreactive\">浅层响应式对象<a>的属性被访问时不会解包。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/reactivity-fundamentals.html", "title": "响应式基础", "doc_id": "281e348f306c43648df39d7d3d30363d", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1619, "chunk_index": 81, "_doc_id": "81_7285113295993370582"}}
{"doc_id": "82_1417214600449763909", "text": "式对象内时，才会发生 ref 解包。当其作为<a href=\"/api/reactivity-advanced.html#shallowreactive\">浅层响应式对象<a>的属性被访问时不会解包。<p><h3 id=\"caveat-in-arrays-and-collections\">数组和集合的注意事项 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#caveat-in-arrays-and-collections\">​<a><h3><p>与 reactive 对象不同的是，当 ref 作为响应式数组或原生集合类型 (如 <code>Map<code>) 中的元素被访问时，它<strong>不会<strong>被解包：<p><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> books<span><span> =<span><span> reactive<span><span>([<span><span>ref<span><span>(<span><span>'Vue 3 Guide'<span><span>)])<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/reactivity-fundamentals.html", "title": "响应式基础", "doc_id": "281e348f306c43648df39d7d3d30363d", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1619, "chunk_index": 82, "_doc_id": "82_1417214600449763909"}}
{"doc_id": "83_2954635432054899536", "text": "ctive<span><span>([<span><span>ref<span><span>(<span><span>'Vue 3 Guide'<span><span>)])<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 这里需要 .value<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>console.<span><span>log<span><span>(books[<span><span>0<span><span>].value)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/reactivity-fundamentals.html", "title": "响应式基础", "doc_id": "281e348f306c43648df39d7d3d30363d", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1619, "chunk_index": 83, "_doc_id": "83_2954635432054899536"}}
{"doc_id": "84_4104159563909524340", "text": "<span>log<span><span>(books[<span><span>0<span><span>].value)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> map<span><span> =<span><span> reactive<span><span>(<span><span>new<span><span> Map<span><span>([[<span><span>'count'<span><span>, <span><span>ref<span><span>(<span><span>0<span><span>)]]))<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 这里需要 .value<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/reactivity-fundamentals.html", "title": "响应式基础", "doc_id": "281e348f306c43648df39d7d3d30363d", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1619, "chunk_index": 84, "_doc_id": "84_4104159563909524340"}}
{"doc_id": "85_8948404666472992201", "text": "pan>(<span><span>0<span><span>)]]))<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 这里需要 .value<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>console.<span><span>log<span><span>(map.<span><span>get<span><span>(<span><span>'count'<span><span>).value)<span><span><code><pre><div><h3 id=\"caveat-when-unwrapping-in-templates\">在模板中解包的注意事项 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#caveat-when-unwrapping-in-templates\">​<a><h3><p>在模板渲染上下文中，只有顶级的 ref 属性才会被解包。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/reactivity-fundamentals.html", "title": "响应式基础", "doc_id": "281e348f306c43648df39d7d3d30363d", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1619, "chunk_index": 85, "_doc_id": "85_8948404666472992201"}}
{"doc_id": "86_5482234490790124572", "text": "=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#caveat-when-unwrapping-in-templates\">​<a><h3><p>在模板渲染上下文中，只有顶级的 ref 属性才会被解包。<p><p>在下面的例子中，<code>count<code> 和 <code>object<code> 是顶级属性，但 <code>object.id<code> 不是：<p><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> count<span><span> =<span><span> ref<span><span>(<span><span>0<span><span>)<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/reactivity-fundamentals.html", "title": "响应式基础", "doc_id": "281e348f306c43648df39d7d3d30363d", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1619, "chunk_index": 86, "_doc_id": "86_5482234490790124572"}}
{"doc_id": "87_4914187055241797253", "text": "<span><span> count<span><span> =<span><span> ref<span><span>(<span><span>0<span><span>)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> object<span><span> =<span><span> { id: <span><span>ref<span><span>(<span><span>1<span><span>) }<span><span><code><pre><div><p>因此，", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/reactivity-fundamentals.html", "title": "响应式基础", "doc_id": "281e348f306c43648df39d7d3d30363d", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1619, "chunk_index": 87, "_doc_id": "87_4914187055241797253"}}
{"doc_id": "88_8687969331086476204", "text": "an> { id: <span><span>ref<span><span>(<span><span>1<span><span>) }<span><span><code><pre><div><p>因此，这个表达式按预期工作：<p><p>...但这个<strong>不会<strong>：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>{{ object.id <span><span>+<span><span> 1<span><span> }}<span><span><code><pre><div><p>渲染的结果将是 <code>[object Object]1<code>，因为在计算表达式时 <code>object.id<code> 没有被解包，仍然是一个 ref 对象。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/reactivity-fundamentals.html", "title": "响应式基础", "doc_id": "281e348f306c43648df39d7d3d30363d", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1619, "chunk_index": 88, "_doc_id": "88_8687969331086476204"}}
{"doc_id": "89_4030367475241098863", "text": "pre><div><p>渲染的结果将是 <code>[object Object]1<code>，因为在计算表达式时 <code>object.id<code> 没有被解包，仍然是一个 ref 对象。为了解决这个问题，我们可以将 <code>id<code> 解构为一个顶级属性：<p><p>现在渲染的结果将是 <code>2<code>。<p><p>另一个需要注意的点是，如果 ref 是文本插值的最终计算值 (即 <code>{{ }}<code> 标签)，那么它将被解包，因此以下内容将渲染为 <code>1<code>：<p><p>该特性仅仅是文本插值的一个便利特性，等价于 <code>{{ object.id.value }}<code>。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/reactivity-fundamentals.html", "title": "响应式基础", "doc_id": "281e348f306c43648df39d7d3d30363d", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1619, "chunk_index": 89, "_doc_id": "89_4030367475241098863"}}
{"doc_id": "90_5721980670206095091", "text": "标签)，那么它将被解包，因此以下内容将渲染为 <code>1<code>：<p><p>该特性仅仅是文本插值的一个便利特性，等价于 <code>{{ object.id.value }}<code>。<p><div><div class=\"options-api\"><h3 id=\"stateful-methods\">有状态方法 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#stateful-methods\">​<a><h3><p>在某些情况下，我们可能需要动态地创建一个方法函数，比如创建一个预置防抖的事件处理器：<p><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>import<span><span> { debounce } <span><span>from<span><span> 'lodash-es'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/reactivity-fundamentals.html", "title": "响应式基础", "doc_id": "281e348f306c43648df39d7d3d30363d", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1619, "chunk_index": 90, "_doc_id": "90_5721980670206095091"}}
{"doc_id": "91_660429093374110433", "text": "><span> { debounce } <span><span>from<span><span> 'lodash-es'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> methods: {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 使用 Lodash 的防抖函数<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> click: <span><span>debounce<span><span>(<span><span>function<span><span> () {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // ... 对点击的响应 ...<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/reactivity-fundamentals.html", "title": "响应式基础", "doc_id": "281e348f306c43648df39d7d3d30363d", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1619, "chunk_index": 91, "_doc_id": "91_660429093374110433"}}
{"doc_id": "92_4474001627068171750", "text": "<span>function<span><span> () {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // ... 对点击的响应 ...<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }, <span><span>500<span><span>)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/reactivity-fundamentals.html", "title": "响应式基础", "doc_id": "281e348f306c43648df39d7d3d30363d", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1619, "chunk_index": 92, "_doc_id": "92_4474001627068171750"}}
{"doc_id": "93_616411788352890585", "text": "s=\"line\"><span> }, <span><span>500<span><span>)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span><code><pre><div><p>不过这种方法对于被重用的组件来说是有问题的，因为这个预置防抖的函数是<strong>有状态的<strong>：它在运行时维护着一个内部状态。如果多个组件实例都共享这同一个预置防抖的函数，那么它们之间将会互相影响。<p><p>要保持每个组件实例的防抖函数都彼此独立，我们可以改为在 <code>created<code> 生命周期钩子中创建这个预置防抖的函数：<p><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/reactivity-fundamentals.html", "title": "响应式基础", "doc_id": "281e348f306c43648df39d7d3d30363d", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1619, "chunk_index": 93, "_doc_id": "93_616411788352890585"}}
{"doc_id": "94_3868345736450631674", "text": "b-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> created<span><span>() {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 每个实例都有了自己的预置防抖的处理函数<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> this<span><span>.debouncedClick <span><span>=<span><span> _.<span><span>debounce<span><span>(<span><span>this<span><span>.click, <span><span>500<span><span>)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> },<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/reactivity-fundamentals.html", "title": "响应式基础", "doc_id": "281e348f306c43648df39d7d3d30363d", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1619, "chunk_index": 94, "_doc_id": "94_3868345736450631674"}}
{"doc_id": "95_5654433323560582219", "text": "pan><span>.click, <span><span>500<span><span>)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> },<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> unmounted<span><span>() {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 最好是在组件卸载时<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 清除掉防抖计时器<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> this<span><span>.debouncedClick.<span><span>cancel<span><span>()<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> },<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> methods: {<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/reactivity-fundamentals.html", "title": "响应式基础", "doc_id": "281e348f306c43648df39d7d3d30363d", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1619, "chunk_index": 95, "_doc_id": "95_5654433323560582219"}}
{"doc_id": "96_586253811766783216", "text": "an><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> },<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> methods: {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> click<span><span>() {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // ... 对点击的响应 ...<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span><code><pre><div><div><div><div>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/reactivity-fundamentals.html", "title": "响应式基础", "doc_id": "281e348f306c43648df39d7d3d30363d", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1619, "chunk_index": 96, "_doc_id": "96_586253811766783216"}}
{"doc_id": "0_8930555472029035998", "text": "<div><div><h1 id=\"suspense\">Suspense <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#suspense\">​<a><h1><div class=\"warning custom-block\"><p class=\"custom-block-title\">实验性功能<p><p><code><Suspense><code> 是一项实验性功能。它不一定会最终成为稳定功能，并且在稳定之前相关 API 也可能会发生变化。<p><div><p><code><Suspense><code> 是一个内置组件，用来在组件树中协调对异步依赖的处理。它让我们可以在组件树上层等待下层的多个嵌套异步依赖项解析完成，并可以在等待时渲染一个加载状态。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/suspense.html", "title": "Suspense | Vue.js", "doc_id": "4580a786b3a9403b9e8c8cd6b1b4dd12", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 430, "chunk_index": 0, "_doc_id": "0_8930555472029035998"}}
{"doc_id": "1_5553195131892730434", "text": "><p><code><Suspense><code> 是一个内置组件，用来在组件树中协调对异步依赖的处理。它让我们可以在组件树上层等待下层的多个嵌套异步依赖项解析完成，并可以在等待时渲染一个加载状态。<p><h2 id=\"async-dependencies\">异步依赖 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#async-dependencies\">​<a><h2><p>要了解 <code><Suspense><code> 所解决的问题和它是如何与异步依赖进行交互的，我们需要想象这样一种组件层级结构：<p><div class=\"language-\"> <span class=\"lang\"><span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><Suspense><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>└─ <Dashboard><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/suspense.html", "title": "Suspense | Vue.js", "doc_id": "4580a786b3a9403b9e8c8cd6b1b4dd12", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 430, "chunk_index": 1, "_doc_id": "1_5553195131892730434"}}
{"doc_id": "2_638916597463458443", "text": "<span class=\"line\"><span><Suspense><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>└─ <Dashboard><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> ├─ <Profile><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> │ └─ <FriendStatus> (组件有异步的 setup())<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> └─ <Content><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> ├─ <ActivityFeed> (异步组件)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> └─ <Stats> (异步组件)<span><span><code><pre><div><p>在这个组件树中有多个嵌套组件，要渲染出它们，首先得解析一些异步资源。如果没有 <code><Suspense><code>，则它们每个都需要处理自己的加载、报错和完成状态。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/suspense.html", "title": "Suspense | Vue.js", "doc_id": "4580a786b3a9403b9e8c8cd6b1b4dd12", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 430, "chunk_index": 2, "_doc_id": "2_638916597463458443"}}
{"doc_id": "3_7850095938296487016", "text": "><pre><div><p>在这个组件树中有多个嵌套组件，要渲染出它们，首先得解析一些异步资源。如果没有 <code><Suspense><code>，则它们每个都需要处理自己的加载、报错和完成状态。在最坏的情况下，我们可能会在页面上看到三个旋转的加载态，在不同的时间显示出内容。<p><p>有了 <code><Suspense><code> 组件后，我们就可以在等待整个多层级组件树中的各个异步依赖获取结果时，在顶层展示出加载中或加载失败的状态。<p><p><code><Suspense><code> 可以等待的异步依赖有两种：<p><ol><li><p>带有异步 <code>setup()<code> 钩子的组件。这也包含了使用 <code><script setup><code> 时有顶层 <code>await<code> 表达式的组件。<p><li><li><p><a href=\"/guide/components/async.html\">异步组件<a>。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/suspense.html", "title": "Suspense | Vue.js", "doc_id": "4580a786b3a9403b9e8c8cd6b1b4dd12", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 430, "chunk_index": 3, "_doc_id": "3_7850095938296487016"}}
{"doc_id": "4_3768508510854132486", "text": "p><code> 时有顶层 <code>await<code> 表达式的组件。<p><li><li><p><a href=\"/guide/components/async.html\">异步组件<a>。<p><li><ol><h3 id=\"async-setup\"><code>async setup()<code> <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#async-setup\">​<a><h3><p>组合式 API 中组件的 <code>setup()<code> 钩子可以是异步的：<p><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/suspense.html", "title": "Suspense | Vue.js", "doc_id": "4580a786b3a9403b9e8c8cd6b1b4dd12", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 430, "chunk_index": 4, "_doc_id": "4_3768508510854132486"}}
{"doc_id": "5_5331231178164304227", "text": "b-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> async<span><span> setup<span><span>() {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> const<span><span> res<span><span> =<span><span> await<span><span> fetch<span><span>(<span><span>...<span><span>)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> const<span><span> posts<span><span> =<span><span> await<span><span> res.<span><span>json<span><span>()<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/suspense.html", "title": "Suspense | Vue.js", "doc_id": "4580a786b3a9403b9e8c8cd6b1b4dd12", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 430, "chunk_index": 5, "_doc_id": "5_5331231178164304227"}}
{"doc_id": "6_5373855569612234154", "text": "n> posts<span><span> =<span><span> await<span><span> res.<span><span>json<span><span>()<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> return<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> posts<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/suspense.html", "title": "Suspense | Vue.js", "doc_id": "4580a786b3a9403b9e8c8cd6b1b4dd12", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 430, "chunk_index": 6, "_doc_id": "6_5373855569612234154"}}
{"doc_id": "7_5997916386233734785", "text": "> posts<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span><code><pre><div><p>如果使用 <code><script setup><code>，那么顶层 <code>await<code> 表达式会自动让该组件成为一个异步依赖：<p><div class=\"language-vue\"> <span class=\"lang\">vue<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>script<span><span> setup<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/suspense.html", "title": "Suspense | Vue.js", "doc_id": "4580a786b3a9403b9e8c8cd6b1b4dd12", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 430, "chunk_index": 7, "_doc_id": "7_5997916386233734785"}}
{"doc_id": "8_8779417898818991954", "text": "code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>script<span><span> setup<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> res<span><span> =<span><span> await<span><span> fetch<span><span>(<span><span>...<span><span>)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> posts<span><span> =<span><span> await<span><span> res.<span><span>json<span><span>()<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>script<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/suspense.html", "title": "Suspense | Vue.js", "doc_id": "4580a786b3a9403b9e8c8cd6b1b4dd12", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 430, "chunk_index": 8, "_doc_id": "8_8779417898818991954"}}
{"doc_id": "9_259441288904318418", "text": "n>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>script<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> {{ posts }}<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><h3 id=\"async-components\">异步组件 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#async-components\">​<a><h3><p>异步组件默认就是<strong>“suspensible”<strong>的。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/suspense.html", "title": "Suspense | Vue.js", "doc_id": "4580a786b3a9403b9e8c8cd6b1b4dd12", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 430, "chunk_index": 9, "_doc_id": "9_259441288904318418"}}
{"doc_id": "10_1834606161497013657", "text": "<a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#async-components\">​<a><h3><p>异步组件默认就是<strong>“suspensible”<strong>的。这意味着如果组件关系链上有一个 <code><Suspense><code>，那么这个异步组件就会被当作这个 <code><Suspense><code> 的一个异步依赖。在这种情况下，加载状态是由 <code><Suspense><code> 控制，而该组件自己的加载、报错、延时和超时等选项都将被忽略。<p><p>异步组件也可以通过在选项中指定 <code>suspensible: false<code> 表明不用 <code>Suspense<code> 控制，并让组件始终自己控制其加载状态。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/suspense.html", "title": "Suspense | Vue.js", "doc_id": "4580a786b3a9403b9e8c8cd6b1b4dd12", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 430, "chunk_index": 10, "_doc_id": "10_1834606161497013657"}}
{"doc_id": "11_1634648598034662506", "text": "略。<p><p>异步组件也可以通过在选项中指定 <code>suspensible: false<code> 表明不用 <code>Suspense<code> 控制，并让组件始终自己控制其加载状态。<p><h2 id=\"loading-state\">加载中状态 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#loading-state\">​<a><h2><p><code><Suspense><code> 组件有两个插槽：<code>#default<code> 和 <code>#fallback<code>。两个插槽都只允许<strong>一个<strong>直接子节点。在可能的时候都将显示默认插槽中的节点。否则将显示后备插槽中的节点。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/suspense.html", "title": "Suspense | Vue.js", "doc_id": "4580a786b3a9403b9e8c8cd6b1b4dd12", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 430, "chunk_index": 11, "_doc_id": "11_1634648598034662506"}}
{"doc_id": "12_8845491060877457554", "text": "ault<code> 和 <code>#fallback<code>。两个插槽都只允许<strong>一个<strong>直接子节点。在可能的时候都将显示默认插槽中的节点。否则将显示后备插槽中的节点。<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>Suspense<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <!-- 具有深层异步依赖的组件 --><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>Dashboard<span><span> /><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/suspense.html", "title": "Suspense | Vue.js", "doc_id": "4580a786b3a9403b9e8c8cd6b1b4dd12", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 430, "chunk_index": 12, "_doc_id": "12_8845491060877457554"}}
{"doc_id": "13_2492921074030183503", "text": "pan class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>Dashboard<span><span> /><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <!-- 在 #fallback 插槽中显示 “正在加载中” --><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>template<span><span> #<span><span>fallback<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> Loading...<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> </<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/suspense.html", "title": "Suspense | Vue.js", "doc_id": "4580a786b3a9403b9e8c8cd6b1b4dd12", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 430, "chunk_index": 13, "_doc_id": "13_2492921074030183503"}}
{"doc_id": "14_5431004411272436362", "text": "n> Loading...<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> </<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>Suspense<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>在初始渲染时，<code><Suspense><code> 将在内存中渲染其默认的插槽内容。如果在这个过程中遇到任何异步依赖，则会进入<strong>挂起<strong>状态。在挂起状态期间，展示的是后备内容。当所有遇到的异步依赖都完成后，<code><Suspense><code> 会进入<strong>完成<strong>状态，并将展示出默认插槽的内容。<p><p>如果在初次渲染时没有遇到异步依赖，<code><Suspense><code> 会直接进入完成状态。<p><p>进入完成状态后，只有当默认插槽的根节点被替换时，<code><Suspense><code> 才会回到挂起状态。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/suspense.html", "title": "Suspense | Vue.js", "doc_id": "4580a786b3a9403b9e8c8cd6b1b4dd12", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 430, "chunk_index": 14, "_doc_id": "14_5431004411272436362"}}
{"doc_id": "15_2573853757167132058", "text": "异步依赖，<code><Suspense><code> 会直接进入完成状态。<p><p>进入完成状态后，只有当默认插槽的根节点被替换时，<code><Suspense><code> 才会回到挂起状态。组件树中新的更深层次的异步依赖<strong>不会<strong>造成 <code><Suspense><code> 回退到挂起状态。<p><p>发生回退时，后备内容不会立即展示出来。相反，<code><Suspense><code> 在等待新内容和异步依赖完成时，会展示之前 <code>#default<code> 插槽的内容。这个行为可以通过一个 <code>timeout<code> prop 进行配置：在等待渲染新内容耗时超过 <code>timeout<code> 毫秒之后，<code><Suspense><code> 将会切换为展示后备内容。若 <code>timeout<code> 值为 <code>0<code> 将导致在替换默认内容时立即显示后备内容。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/suspense.html", "title": "Suspense | Vue.js", "doc_id": "4580a786b3a9403b9e8c8cd6b1b4dd12", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 430, "chunk_index": 15, "_doc_id": "15_2573853757167132058"}}
{"doc_id": "16_4401841080243237907", "text": "毫秒之后，<code><Suspense><code> 将会切换为展示后备内容。若 <code>timeout<code> 值为 <code>0<code> 将导致在替换默认内容时立即显示后备内容。<p><h2 id=\"events\">事件 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#events\">​<a><h2><p><code><Suspense><code> 组件会触发三个事件：<code>pending<code>、<code>resolve<code> 和 <code>fallback<code>。<code>pending<code> 事件是在进入挂起状态时触发。<code>resolve<code> 事件是在 <code>default<code> 插槽完成获取新内容时触发。<code>fallback<code> 事件则是在 <code>fallback<code> 插槽的内容显示时触发。<p><p>例如，可以使用这些事件在加载新组件时在之前的 DOM 最上层显示一个加载指示器。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/suspense.html", "title": "Suspense | Vue.js", "doc_id": "4580a786b3a9403b9e8c8cd6b1b4dd12", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 430, "chunk_index": 16, "_doc_id": "16_4401841080243237907"}}
{"doc_id": "17_7527075774309921226", "text": ">fallback<code> 事件则是在 <code>fallback<code> 插槽的内容显示时触发。<p><p>例如，可以使用这些事件在加载新组件时在之前的 DOM 最上层显示一个加载指示器。<p><h2 id=\"error-handling\">错误处理 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#error-handling\">​<a><h2><p><code><Suspense><code> 组件自身目前还不提供错误处理，不过你可以使用 <a href=\"/api/options-lifecycle.html#errorcaptured\"><code>errorCaptured<code><a> 选项或者 <a href=\"/api/composition-api-lifecycle.html#onerrorcaptured\"><code>onErrorCaptured()<code><a> 钩子，在使用到 <code><Suspense><code> 的父组件中捕获和处理异步错误。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/suspense.html", "title": "Suspense | Vue.js", "doc_id": "4580a786b3a9403b9e8c8cd6b1b4dd12", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 430, "chunk_index": 17, "_doc_id": "17_7527075774309921226"}}
{"doc_id": "18_3867542961174262338", "text": "tml#onerrorcaptured\"><code>onErrorCaptured()<code><a> 钩子，在使用到 <code><Suspense><code> 的父组件中捕获和处理异步错误。<p><h2 id=\"combining-with-other-components\">和其他组件结合 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#combining-with-other-components\">​<a><h2><p>我们常常会将 <code><Suspense><code> 和 <a href=\"./transition.html\"><code><Transition><code><a>、<a href=\"./keep-alive.html\"><code><KeepAlive><code><a> 等组件结合。要保证这些组件都能正常工作，嵌套的顺序非常重要。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/suspense.html", "title": "Suspense | Vue.js", "doc_id": "4580a786b3a9403b9e8c8cd6b1b4dd12", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 430, "chunk_index": 18, "_doc_id": "18_3867542961174262338"}}
{"doc_id": "19_9005199285917206351", "text": "tion><code><a>、<a href=\"./keep-alive.html\"><code><KeepAlive><code><a> 等组件结合。要保证这些组件都能正常工作，嵌套的顺序非常重要。<p><p>另外，这些组件都通常与 <a href=\"https://router.vuejs.org/zh/\" target=\"_blank\">Vue Router<a> 中的 <code><RouterView><code> 组件结合使用。<p><p>下面的示例展示了如何嵌套这些组件，使它们都能按照预期的方式运行。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/suspense.html", "title": "Suspense | Vue.js", "doc_id": "4580a786b3a9403b9e8c8cd6b1b4dd12", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 430, "chunk_index": 19, "_doc_id": "19_9005199285917206351"}}
{"doc_id": "20_5858680744353374693", "text": "get=\"_blank\">Vue Router<a> 中的 <code><RouterView><code> 组件结合使用。<p><p>下面的示例展示了如何嵌套这些组件，使它们都能按照预期的方式运行。若想组合得更简单，你也可以删除一些你不需要的组件：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>RouterView<span><span> v-slot<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>{ Component }<span><span>\"<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/suspense.html", "title": "Suspense | Vue.js", "doc_id": "4580a786b3a9403b9e8c8cd6b1b4dd12", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 430, "chunk_index": 20, "_doc_id": "20_5858680744353374693"}}
{"doc_id": "21_4491328777215365149", "text": "an> v-slot<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>{ Component }<span><span>\"<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>template<span><span> v-if<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>Component<span><span>\"<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>Transition<span><span> mode<span><span>=<span><span>\"out-in\"<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>KeepAlive<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/suspense.html", "title": "Suspense | Vue.js", "doc_id": "4580a786b3a9403b9e8c8cd6b1b4dd12", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 430, "chunk_index": 21, "_doc_id": "21_4491328777215365149"}}
{"doc_id": "22_8498155406450072164", "text": "<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>KeepAlive<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>Suspense<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <!-- 主要内容 --><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>component<span><span> :<span><span>is<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>Component<span><span>\"<span><span>></<span><span>component<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <!-- 加载中状态 --><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/suspense.html", "title": "Suspense | Vue.js", "doc_id": "4580a786b3a9403b9e8c8cd6b1b4dd12", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 430, "chunk_index": 22, "_doc_id": "22_8498155406450072164"}}
{"doc_id": "23_2450593356924474126", "text": "><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <!-- 加载中状态 --><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>template<span><span> #<span><span>fallback<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> 正在加载...<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> </<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> </<span><span>Suspense<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> </<span><span>KeepAlive<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/suspense.html", "title": "Suspense | Vue.js", "doc_id": "4580a786b3a9403b9e8c8cd6b1b4dd12", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 430, "chunk_index": 23, "_doc_id": "23_2450593356924474126"}}
{"doc_id": "24_8335017539134725692", "text": "span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> </<span><span>KeepAlive<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> </<span><span>Transition<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> </<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>RouterView<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>Vue Router 使用动态导入对<a href=\"https://router.vuejs.org/zh/guide/advanced/lazy-loading.html\" target=\"_blank\">懒加载组件<a>进行了内置支持。这些与异步组件不同，目前他们不会触发 <code><Suspense><code>。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/suspense.html", "title": "Suspense | Vue.js", "doc_id": "4580a786b3a9403b9e8c8cd6b1b4dd12", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 430, "chunk_index": 24, "_doc_id": "24_8335017539134725692"}}
{"doc_id": "25_1458617164548125054", "text": "vanced/lazy-loading.html\" target=\"_blank\">懒加载组件<a>进行了内置支持。这些与异步组件不同，目前他们不会触发 <code><Suspense><code>。但是，它们仍然可以有异步组件作为后代，这些组件可以照常触发 <code><Suspense><code>。<p><h2 id=\"nested-suspense\">嵌套使用 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#nested-suspense\">​<a><h2><p>当我们有多个类似于下方的异步组件 (常见于嵌套或基于布局的路由) 时：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>Suspense<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/suspense.html", "title": "Suspense | Vue.js", "doc_id": "4580a786b3a9403b9e8c8cd6b1b4dd12", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 430, "chunk_index": 25, "_doc_id": "25_1458617164548125054"}}
{"doc_id": "26_6409602298536486847", "text": "github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>Suspense<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>component<span><span> :<span><span>is<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>DynamicAsyncOuter<span><span>\"<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>component<span><span> :<span><span>is<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>DynamicAsyncInner<span><span>\"<span><span> /><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/suspense.html", "title": "Suspense | Vue.js", "doc_id": "4580a786b3a9403b9e8c8cd6b1b4dd12", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 430, "chunk_index": 26, "_doc_id": "26_6409602298536486847"}}
{"doc_id": "27_4526948954876209293", "text": "n>is<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>DynamicAsyncInner<span><span>\"<span><span> /><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> </<span><span>component<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>Suspense<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p><code><Suspense><code> 创建了一个边界，它将如预期的那样解析树下的所有异步组件。然而，当我们更改 <code>DynamicAsyncOuter<code> 时，<code><Suspense><code> 会正确地等待它，但当我们更改 <code>DynamicAsyncInner<code> 时，嵌套的 <code>DynamicAsyncInner<code> 会呈现为一个空节点，直到它被解析为止 (而不是之前的节点或回退插槽)。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/suspense.html", "title": "Suspense | Vue.js", "doc_id": "4580a786b3a9403b9e8c8cd6b1b4dd12", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 430, "chunk_index": 27, "_doc_id": "27_4526948954876209293"}}
{"doc_id": "28_6657100692385178833", "text": "code>DynamicAsyncInner<code> 时，嵌套的 <code>DynamicAsyncInner<code> 会呈现为一个空节点，直到它被解析为止 (而不是之前的节点或回退插槽)。<p><p>为了解决这个问题，我们可以使用嵌套的方法来处理嵌套组件的补丁，就像这样：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>Suspense<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>component<span><span> :<span><span>is<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>DynamicAsyncOuter<span><span>\"<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/suspense.html", "title": "Suspense | Vue.js", "doc_id": "4580a786b3a9403b9e8c8cd6b1b4dd12", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 430, "chunk_index": 28, "_doc_id": "28_6657100692385178833"}}
{"doc_id": "29_2207064322263481129", "text": "pan>is<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>DynamicAsyncOuter<span><span>\"<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>Suspense<span><span> suspensible<span><span>> <span><span><!-- 像这样 --><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>component<span><span> :<span><span>is<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>DynamicAsyncInner<span><span>\"<span><span> /><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> </<span><span>Suspense<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/suspense.html", "title": "Suspense | Vue.js", "doc_id": "4580a786b3a9403b9e8c8cd6b1b4dd12", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 430, "chunk_index": 29, "_doc_id": "29_2207064322263481129"}}
{"doc_id": "30_2989984377426145078", "text": "pan><span> /><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> </<span><span>Suspense<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> </<span><span>component<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/suspense.html", "title": "Suspense | Vue.js", "doc_id": "4580a786b3a9403b9e8c8cd6b1b4dd12", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 430, "chunk_index": 30, "_doc_id": "30_2989984377426145078"}}
{"doc_id": "31_1325150874717698194", "text": "span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> </<span><span>component<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>Suspense<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>如果你不设置 <code>suspensible<code> 属性，内部的 <code><Suspense><code> 将被父级 <code><Suspense><code> 视为同步组件。这意味着它将会有自己的回退插槽，如果两个 <code>Dynamic<code> 组件同时被修改，则当子 <code><Suspense><code> 加载其自己的依赖关系树时，可能会出现空节点和多个修补周期，这可能不是理想情况。设置后，所有异步依赖项处理都会交给父级 <code><Suspense><code> (包括发出的事件)，而内部 <code><Suspense><code> 仅充当依赖项解析和修补的另一个边界。<p>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/suspense.html", "title": "Suspense | Vue.js", "doc_id": "4580a786b3a9403b9e8c8cd6b1b4dd12", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 430, "chunk_index": 31, "_doc_id": "31_1325150874717698194"}}
{"doc_id": "32_5513005994398883276", "text": "后，所有异步依赖项处理都会交给父级 <code><Suspense><code> (包括发出的事件)，而内部 <code><Suspense><code> 仅充当依赖项解析和修补的另一个边界。<p>\n<p><strong>参考<strong><p><div><div>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/suspense.html", "title": "Suspense | Vue.js", "doc_id": "4580a786b3a9403b9e8c8cd6b1b4dd12", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 430, "chunk_index": 32, "_doc_id": "32_5513005994398883276"}}
{"doc_id": "0_187890297484196346", "text": "<div><div><h1 id=\"template-refs\">模板引用 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#template-refs\">​<a><h1><p>虽然 Vue 的声明性渲染模型为你抽象了大部分对 DOM 的直接操作，但在某些情况下，我们仍然需要直接访问底层 DOM 元素。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/template-refs.html", "title": "模板引用", "doc_id": "b03f6f94fd6547fdb4a1ca6347e53e57", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 925, "chunk_index": 0, "_doc_id": "0_187890297484196346"}}
{"doc_id": "1_1050504288609067005", "text": "or\" href=\"#template-refs\">​<a><h1><p>虽然 Vue 的声明性渲染模型为你抽象了大部分对 DOM 的直接操作，但在某些情况下，我们仍然需要直接访问底层 DOM 元素。要实现这一点，我们可以使用特殊的 <code>ref<code> attribute：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>input<span><span> ref<span><span>=<span><span>\"input\"<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p><code>ref<code> 是一个特殊的 attribute，和 <code>v-for<code> 章节中提到的 <code>key<code> 类似。它允许我们在一个特定的 DOM 元素或子组件实例被挂载后，获得对它的直接引用。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/template-refs.html", "title": "模板引用", "doc_id": "b03f6f94fd6547fdb4a1ca6347e53e57", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 925, "chunk_index": 1, "_doc_id": "1_1050504288609067005"}}
{"doc_id": "2_6804180024460934227", "text": "个特殊的 attribute，和 <code>v-for<code> 章节中提到的 <code>key<code> 类似。它允许我们在一个特定的 DOM 元素或子组件实例被挂载后，获得对它的直接引用。这可能很有用，比如说在组件挂载时将焦点设置到一个 input 元素上，或在一个元素上初始化一个第三方库。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/template-refs.html", "title": "模板引用", "doc_id": "b03f6f94fd6547fdb4a1ca6347e53e57", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 925, "chunk_index": 2, "_doc_id": "2_6804180024460934227"}}
{"doc_id": "3_5493128099699721937", "text": "code> 类似。它允许我们在一个特定的 DOM 元素或子组件实例被挂载后，获得对它的直接引用。这可能很有用，比如说在组件挂载时将焦点设置到一个 input 元素上，或在一个元素上初始化一个第三方库。<p><h2 id=\"accessing-the-refs\">访问模板引用 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#accessing-the-refs\">​<a><h2><div class=\"composition-api\"><p>要在组合式 API 中获取引用，我们可以使用辅助函数 <a href=\"/api/composition-api-helpers.html#usetemplateref\"><code>useTemplateRef()<code><a> ：<p><div class=\"language-vue\"> <span class=\"lang\">vue<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>script<span><span> setup<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/template-refs.html", "title": "模板引用", "doc_id": "b03f6f94fd6547fdb4a1ca6347e53e57", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 925, "chunk_index": 3, "_doc_id": "3_5493128099699721937"}}
{"doc_id": "4_6790361041967877804", "text": "code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>script<span><span> setup<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>import<span><span> { useTemplateRef, onMounted } <span><span>from<span><span> 'vue'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 第一个参数必须与模板中的 ref 值匹配<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> input<span><span> =<span><span> useTemplateRef<span><span>(<span><span>'my-input'<span><span>)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/template-refs.html", "title": "模板引用", "doc_id": "b03f6f94fd6547fdb4a1ca6347e53e57", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 925, "chunk_index": 4, "_doc_id": "4_6790361041967877804"}}
{"doc_id": "5_3278264099824832226", "text": "seTemplateRef<span><span>(<span><span>'my-input'<span><span>)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>onMounted<span><span>(() <span><span>=><span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> input.value.<span><span>focus<span><span>()<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>})<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>script<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/template-refs.html", "title": "模板引用", "doc_id": "b03f6f94fd6547fdb4a1ca6347e53e57", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 925, "chunk_index": 5, "_doc_id": "5_3278264099824832226"}}
{"doc_id": "6_8109240510946639597", "text": ">\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>input<span><span> ref<span><span>=<span><span>\"my-input\"<span><span> /><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/template-refs.html", "title": "模板引用", "doc_id": "b03f6f94fd6547fdb4a1ca6347e53e57", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 925, "chunk_index": 6, "_doc_id": "6_8109240510946639597"}}
{"doc_id": "7_6276000136437298225", "text": "n> <<span><span>input<span><span> ref<span><span>=<span><span>\"my-input\"<span><span> /><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>在使用 TypeScript 时，Vue 的 IDE 支持和 <code>vue-tsc<code> 将根据匹配的 <code>ref<code> attribute 所用的元素或组件自动推断 <code>input.value<code> 的类型。<p> 3.5 前的用法 <p>在 3.5 之前的版本尚未引入 <code>useTemplateRef()<code>，我们需要声明一个与模板里 ref attribute 匹配的引用：<p><div class=\"language-vue\"> <span class=\"lang\">vue<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>script<span><span> setup<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/template-refs.html", "title": "模板引用", "doc_id": "b03f6f94fd6547fdb4a1ca6347e53e57", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 925, "chunk_index": 7, "_doc_id": "7_6276000136437298225"}}
{"doc_id": "8_675599828964256704", "text": "code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>script<span><span> setup<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>import<span><span> { ref, onMounted } <span><span>from<span><span> 'vue'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 声明一个 ref 来存放该元素的引用<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 必须和模板里的 ref 同名<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> input<span><span> =<span><span> ref<span><span>(<span><span>null<span><span>)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/template-refs.html", "title": "模板引用", "doc_id": "b03f6f94fd6547fdb4a1ca6347e53e57", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 925, "chunk_index": 8, "_doc_id": "8_675599828964256704"}}
{"doc_id": "9_6516844369771447664", "text": "> =<span><span> ref<span><span>(<span><span>null<span><span>)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>onMounted<span><span>(() <span><span>=><span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> input.value.<span><span>focus<span><span>()<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>})<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>script<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/template-refs.html", "title": "模板引用", "doc_id": "b03f6f94fd6547fdb4a1ca6347e53e57", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 925, "chunk_index": 9, "_doc_id": "9_6516844369771447664"}}
{"doc_id": "10_8040204268809912146", "text": ">\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>input<span><span> ref<span><span>=<span><span>\"input\"<span><span> /><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/template-refs.html", "title": "模板引用", "doc_id": "b03f6f94fd6547fdb4a1ca6347e53e57", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 925, "chunk_index": 10, "_doc_id": "10_8040204268809912146"}}
{"doc_id": "11_3433679233904899655", "text": "span> <<span><span>input<span><span> ref<span><span>=<span><span>\"input\"<span><span> /><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>如果不使用 <code><script setup><code>，需确保从 <code>setup()<code> 返回 ref：<p><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> setup<span><span>() {<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/template-refs.html", "title": "模板引用", "doc_id": "b03f6f94fd6547fdb4a1ca6347e53e57", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 925, "chunk_index": 11, "_doc_id": "11_3433679233904899655"}}
{"doc_id": "12_3386666652778040315", "text": "span> default<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> setup<span><span>() {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> const<span><span> input<span><span> =<span><span> ref<span><span>(<span><span>null<span><span>)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // ...<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> return<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line highlighted\"><span> input<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/template-refs.html", "title": "模板引用", "doc_id": "b03f6f94fd6547fdb4a1ca6347e53e57", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 925, "chunk_index": 12, "_doc_id": "12_3386666652778040315"}}
{"doc_id": "13_7053555309571768166", "text": "> input<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span><code><pre><div> <div><div class=\"options-api\"><p>挂载结束后引用都会被暴露在 <code>this.$refs<code> 之上：<p><div class=\"language-vue\"> <span class=\"lang\">vue<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>script<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/template-refs.html", "title": "模板引用", "doc_id": "b03f6f94fd6547fdb4a1ca6347e53e57", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 925, "chunk_index": 13, "_doc_id": "13_7053555309571768166"}}
{"doc_id": "14_6732932019664810102", "text": "n><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> mounted<span><span>() {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> this<span><span>.$refs.input.<span><span>focus<span><span>()<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>script<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/template-refs.html", "title": "模板引用", "doc_id": "b03f6f94fd6547fdb4a1ca6347e53e57", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 925, "chunk_index": 14, "_doc_id": "14_6732932019664810102"}}
{"doc_id": "15_2014190967801356245", "text": ">\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>input<span><span> ref<span><span>=<span><span>\"input\"<span><span> /><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><div><p>注意，你只可以<strong>在组件挂载后<strong>才能访问模板引用。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/template-refs.html", "title": "模板引用", "doc_id": "b03f6f94fd6547fdb4a1ca6347e53e57", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 925, "chunk_index": 15, "_doc_id": "15_2014190967801356245"}}
{"doc_id": "16_409642800014804795", "text": "span>template<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><div><p>注意，你只可以<strong>在组件挂载后<strong>才能访问模板引用。如果你想在模板中的表达式上访问 <span class=\"options-api\"><code>$refs.input<code><span><span class=\"composition-api\"><code>input<code><span>，在初次渲染时会是 <span class=\"options-api\"><code>undefined<code><span><span class=\"composition-api\"><code>null<code><span>。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/template-refs.html", "title": "模板引用", "doc_id": "b03f6f94fd6547fdb4a1ca6347e53e57", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 925, "chunk_index": 16, "_doc_id": "16_409642800014804795"}}
{"doc_id": "17_6485920035257473827", "text": "class=\"options-api\"><code>undefined<code><span><span class=\"composition-api\"><code>null<code><span>。这是因为在初次渲染前这个元素还不存在呢！<p><div class=\"composition-api\"><p>如果你需要侦听一个模板引用 ref 的变化，确保考虑到其值为 <code>null<code> 的情况：<p><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>watchEffect<span><span>(() <span><span>=><span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> if<span><span> (input.value) {<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/template-refs.html", "title": "模板引用", "doc_id": "b03f6f94fd6547fdb4a1ca6347e53e57", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 925, "chunk_index": 17, "_doc_id": "17_6485920035257473827"}}
{"doc_id": "18_2251686832121083177", "text": "n>=><span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> if<span><span> (input.value) {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> input.value.<span><span>focus<span><span>()<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> } <span><span>else<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 此时还未挂载，或此元素已经被卸载(例如通过 v-if 控制)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/template-refs.html", "title": "模板引用", "doc_id": "b03f6f94fd6547fdb4a1ca6347e53e57", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 925, "chunk_index": 18, "_doc_id": "18_2251686832121083177"}}
{"doc_id": "19_8877713329814903092", "text": "\"line\"><span> // 此时还未挂载，或此元素已经被卸载(例如通过 v-if 控制)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>})<span><span><code><pre><div><p>也可参考：<a href=\"/guide/typescript/composition-api.html#typing-template-refs\">为模板引用标注类型<a> <p><div><h2 id=\"ref-on-component\">组件上的 ref <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#ref-on-component\">​<a><h2><blockquote><p>这一小节假设你已了解<a href=\"/guide/essentials/component-basics.html\">组件<a>的相关知识，或者你也可以先跳过这里，之后再回来看。<p><blockquote><p>模板引用也可以被用在一个子组件上。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/template-refs.html", "title": "模板引用", "doc_id": "b03f6f94fd6547fdb4a1ca6347e53e57", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 925, "chunk_index": 19, "_doc_id": "19_8877713329814903092"}}
{"doc_id": "20_7393005561386737394", "text": "/essentials/component-basics.html\">组件<a>的相关知识，或者你也可以先跳过这里，之后再回来看。<p><blockquote><p>模板引用也可以被用在一个子组件上。这种情况下引用中获得的值是组件实例：<p><div class=\"composition-api\"><div class=\"language-vue\"> <span class=\"lang\">vue<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>script<span><span> setup<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>import<span><span> { useTemplateRef, onMounted } <span><span>from<span><span> 'vue'<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/template-refs.html", "title": "模板引用", "doc_id": "b03f6f94fd6547fdb4a1ca6347e53e57", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 925, "chunk_index": 20, "_doc_id": "20_7393005561386737394"}}
{"doc_id": "21_2944999607223077702", "text": "pan>import<span><span> { useTemplateRef, onMounted } <span><span>from<span><span> 'vue'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>import<span><span> Child <span><span>from<span><span> './Child.vue'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> childRef<span><span> =<span><span> useTemplateRef<span><span>(<span><span>'child'<span><span>)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>onMounted<span><span>(() <span><span>=><span><span> {<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/template-refs.html", "title": "模板引用", "doc_id": "b03f6f94fd6547fdb4a1ca6347e53e57", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 925, "chunk_index": 21, "_doc_id": "21_2944999607223077702"}}
{"doc_id": "22_1228885406994679395", "text": "\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>onMounted<span><span>(() <span><span>=><span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // childRef.value 将持有 <Child /> 的实例<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>})<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>script<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>Child<span><span> ref<span><span>=<span><span>\"child\"<span><span> /><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/template-refs.html", "title": "模板引用", "doc_id": "b03f6f94fd6547fdb4a1ca6347e53e57", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 925, "chunk_index": 22, "_doc_id": "22_1228885406994679395"}}
{"doc_id": "23_6305521678126847044", "text": "span> <<span><span>Child<span><span> ref<span><span>=<span><span>\"child\"<span><span> /><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div> 3.5 前的用法 <div class=\"language-vue\"> <span class=\"lang\">vue<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>script<span><span> setup<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>import<span><span> { ref, onMounted } <span><span>from<span><span> 'vue'<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/template-refs.html", "title": "模板引用", "doc_id": "b03f6f94fd6547fdb4a1ca6347e53e57", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 925, "chunk_index": 23, "_doc_id": "23_6305521678126847044"}}
{"doc_id": "24_1608721402355882770", "text": "s=\"line\"><span>import<span><span> { ref, onMounted } <span><span>from<span><span> 'vue'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>import<span><span> Child <span><span>from<span><span> './Child.vue'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> child<span><span> =<span><span> ref<span><span>(<span><span>null<span><span>)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>onMounted<span><span>(() <span><span>=><span><span> {<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/template-refs.html", "title": "模板引用", "doc_id": "b03f6f94fd6547fdb4a1ca6347e53e57", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 925, "chunk_index": 24, "_doc_id": "24_1608721402355882770"}}
{"doc_id": "25_8528033438982621577", "text": "\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>onMounted<span><span>(() <span><span>=><span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // child.value 是 <Child /> 组件的实例<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>})<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>script<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>Child<span><span> ref<span><span>=<span><span>\"child\"<span><span> /><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/template-refs.html", "title": "模板引用", "doc_id": "b03f6f94fd6547fdb4a1ca6347e53e57", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 925, "chunk_index": 25, "_doc_id": "25_8528033438982621577"}}
{"doc_id": "26_7555544021447752757", "text": "span> <<span><span>Child<span><span> ref<span><span>=<span><span>\"child\"<span><span> /><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div> <div><div class=\"options-api\"><div class=\"language-vue\"> <span class=\"lang\">vue<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>script<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>import<span><span> Child <span><span>from<span><span> './Child.vue'<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/template-refs.html", "title": "模板引用", "doc_id": "b03f6f94fd6547fdb4a1ca6347e53e57", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 925, "chunk_index": 26, "_doc_id": "26_7555544021447752757"}}
{"doc_id": "27_190338742469244308", "text": "class=\"line\"><span>import<span><span> Child <span><span>from<span><span> './Child.vue'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> components: {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> Child<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> },<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> mounted<span><span>() {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // this.$refs.child 是 <Child /> 组件的实例<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/template-refs.html", "title": "模板引用", "doc_id": "b03f6f94fd6547fdb4a1ca6347e53e57", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 925, "chunk_index": 27, "_doc_id": "27_190338742469244308"}}
{"doc_id": "28_2345784413418720738", "text": "><span>() {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // this.$refs.child 是 <Child /> 组件的实例<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>script<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>Child<span><span> ref<span><span>=<span><span>\"child\"<span><span> /><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/template-refs.html", "title": "模板引用", "doc_id": "b03f6f94fd6547fdb4a1ca6347e53e57", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 925, "chunk_index": 28, "_doc_id": "28_2345784413418720738"}}
{"doc_id": "29_6567584932432339805", "text": "span> <<span><span>Child<span><span> ref<span><span>=<span><span>\"child\"<span><span> /><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><div><p>如果一个子组件使用的是选项式 API <span class=\"composition-api\">或没有使用 <code><script setup><code><span>，被引用的组件实例和该子组件的 <code>this<code> 完全一致，这意味着父组件对子组件的每一个属性和方法都有完全的访问权。这使得在父组件和子组件之间创建紧密耦合的实现细节变得很容易，当然也因此，应该只在绝对需要时才使用组件引用。大多数情况下，你应该首先使用标准的 props 和 emit 接口来实现父子组件交互。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/template-refs.html", "title": "模板引用", "doc_id": "b03f6f94fd6547fdb4a1ca6347e53e57", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 925, "chunk_index": 29, "_doc_id": "29_6567584932432339805"}}
{"doc_id": "30_5136024892768308137", "text": "访问权。这使得在父组件和子组件之间创建紧密耦合的实现细节变得很容易，当然也因此，应该只在绝对需要时才使用组件引用。大多数情况下，你应该首先使用标准的 props 和 emit 接口来实现父子组件交互。<p><div class=\"composition-api\"><p>有一个例外的情况，使用了 <code><script setup><code> 的组件是<strong>默认私有<strong>的：一个父组件无法访问到一个使用了 <code><script setup><code> 的子组件中的任何东西，除非子组件在其中通过 <code>defineExpose<code> 宏显式暴露：<p><div class=\"language-vue\"> <span class=\"lang\">vue<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>script<span><span> setup<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/template-refs.html", "title": "模板引用", "doc_id": "b03f6f94fd6547fdb4a1ca6347e53e57", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 925, "chunk_index": 30, "_doc_id": "30_5136024892768308137"}}
{"doc_id": "31_4850490497595138759", "text": "code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>script<span><span> setup<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>import<span><span> { ref } <span><span>from<span><span> 'vue'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> a<span><span> =<span><span> 1<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> b<span><span> =<span><span> ref<span><span>(<span><span>2<span><span>)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/template-refs.html", "title": "模板引用", "doc_id": "b03f6f94fd6547fdb4a1ca6347e53e57", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 925, "chunk_index": 31, "_doc_id": "31_4850490497595138759"}}
{"doc_id": "32_1497452430151904097", "text": "pan> =<span><span> ref<span><span>(<span><span>2<span><span>)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 像 defineExpose 这样的编译器宏不需要导入<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>defineExpose<span><span>({<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> a,<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> b<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>})<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/template-refs.html", "title": "模板引用", "doc_id": "b03f6f94fd6547fdb4a1ca6347e53e57", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 925, "chunk_index": 32, "_doc_id": "32_1497452430151904097"}}
{"doc_id": "33_2772685774520691488", "text": "pan> a,<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> b<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>})<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>script<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>当父组件通过模板引用获取到了该组件的实例时，得到的实例类型为 <code>{ a: number, b: number }<code> (ref 都会自动解包，和一般的实例一样)。<p><p>请注意，defineExpose 必须在任何 await 操作之前调用。否则，在 await 操作后暴露的属性和方法将无法访问。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/template-refs.html", "title": "模板引用", "doc_id": "b03f6f94fd6547fdb4a1ca6347e53e57", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 925, "chunk_index": 33, "_doc_id": "33_2772685774520691488"}}
{"doc_id": "34_4220225756000211027", "text": "}<code> (ref 都会自动解包，和一般的实例一样)。<p><p>请注意，defineExpose 必须在任何 await 操作之前调用。否则，在 await 操作后暴露的属性和方法将无法访问。<p><p>TypeScript 用户请参考：<a href=\"/guide/typescript/composition-api.html#typing-component-template-refs\">为组件的模板引用标注类型<a> <p><div><div class=\"options-api\"><p><code>expose<code> 选项可以用于限制对子组件实例的访问：<p><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/template-refs.html", "title": "模板引用", "doc_id": "b03f6f94fd6547fdb4a1ca6347e53e57", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 925, "chunk_index": 34, "_doc_id": "34_4220225756000211027"}}
{"doc_id": "35_5602341708941451104", "text": "b-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> expose: [<span><span>'publicData'<span><span>, <span><span>'publicMethod'<span><span>],<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> data<span><span>() {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> return<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> publicData: <span><span>'foo'<span><span>,<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> privateData: <span><span>'bar'<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/template-refs.html", "title": "模板引用", "doc_id": "b03f6f94fd6547fdb4a1ca6347e53e57", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 925, "chunk_index": 35, "_doc_id": "35_5602341708941451104"}}
{"doc_id": "36_6708111039339802615", "text": "'foo'<span><span>,<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> privateData: <span><span>'bar'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> },<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> methods: {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> publicMethod<span><span>() {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> /* ... */<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> },<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> privateMethod<span><span>() {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> /* ... */<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/template-refs.html", "title": "模板引用", "doc_id": "b03f6f94fd6547fdb4a1ca6347e53e57", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 925, "chunk_index": 36, "_doc_id": "36_6708111039339802615"}}
{"doc_id": "37_1770938288881547423", "text": "e\"><span> privateMethod<span><span>() {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> /* ... */<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span><code><pre><div><p>在上面这个例子中，父组件通过模板引用访问到子组件实例后，仅能访问 <code>publicData<code> 和 <code>publicMethod<code>。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/template-refs.html", "title": "模板引用", "doc_id": "b03f6f94fd6547fdb4a1ca6347e53e57", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 925, "chunk_index": 37, "_doc_id": "37_1770938288881547423"}}
{"doc_id": "38_7484938618139072895", "text": "ode><pre><div><p>在上面这个例子中，父组件通过模板引用访问到子组件实例后，仅能访问 <code>publicData<code> 和 <code>publicMethod<code>。<p><div><h2 id=\"refs-inside-v-for\"><code>v-for<code> 中的模板引用 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#refs-inside-v-for\">​<a><h2><blockquote><p>需要 v3.5 及以上版本<p><blockquote><div class=\"composition-api\"><p>当在 <code>v-for<code> 中使用模板引用时，对应的 ref 中包含的值是一个数组，它将在元素被挂载后包含对应整个列表的所有元素：<p><div class=\"language-vue\"> <span class=\"lang\">vue<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>script<span><span> setup<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/template-refs.html", "title": "模板引用", "doc_id": "b03f6f94fd6547fdb4a1ca6347e53e57", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 925, "chunk_index": 38, "_doc_id": "38_7484938618139072895"}}
{"doc_id": "39_3903938335479349421", "text": "code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>script<span><span> setup<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>import<span><span> { ref, useTemplateRef, onMounted } <span><span>from<span><span> 'vue'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> list<span><span> =<span><span> ref<span><span>([<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> /* ... */<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>])<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/template-refs.html", "title": "模板引用", "doc_id": "b03f6f94fd6547fdb4a1ca6347e53e57", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 925, "chunk_index": 39, "_doc_id": "39_3903938335479349421"}}
{"doc_id": "40_3519094215605743630", "text": "ine\"><span> /* ... */<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>])<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> itemRefs<span><span> =<span><span> useTemplateRef<span><span>(<span><span>'items'<span><span>)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>onMounted<span><span>(() <span><span>=><span><span> console.<span><span>log<span><span>(itemRefs.value))<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>script<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/template-refs.html", "title": "模板引用", "doc_id": "b03f6f94fd6547fdb4a1ca6347e53e57", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 925, "chunk_index": 40, "_doc_id": "40_3519094215605743630"}}
{"doc_id": "41_4422625751181675986", "text": "itemRefs.value))<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>script<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>ul<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>li<span><span> v-for<span><span>=<span><span>\"item in list\"<span><span> ref<span><span>=<span><span>\"items\"<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> {{ item }}<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/template-refs.html", "title": "模板引用", "doc_id": "b03f6f94fd6547fdb4a1ca6347e53e57", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 925, "chunk_index": 41, "_doc_id": "41_4422625751181675986"}}
