{"doc_id": "49_1169143296730844713", "text": "pan>li<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> </<span><span>ul<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div> <div><div class=\"options-api\"><p>当在 <code>v-for<code> 中使用模板引用时，相应的引用中包含的值是一个数组：<p><div class=\"language-vue\"> <span class=\"lang\">vue<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>script<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/template-refs.html", "title": "模板引用", "doc_id": "b03f6f94fd6547fdb4a1ca6347e53e57", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 925, "chunk_index": 49, "_doc_id": "49_1169143296730844713"}}
