{"doc_id": "51_6408200386770212120", "text": "pan> ]<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> },<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> mounted<span><span>() {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> console.<span><span>log<span><span>(<span><span>this<span><span>.$refs.items)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>script<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/template-refs.html", "title": "模板引用", "doc_id": "b03f6f94fd6547fdb4a1ca6347e53e57", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 925, "chunk_index": 51, "_doc_id": "51_6408200386770212120"}}
{"doc_id": "52_265968043857177190", "text": "n>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>script<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>ul<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>li<span><span> v-for<span><span>=<span><span>\"item in list\"<span><span> ref<span><span>=<span><span>\"items\"<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> {{ item }}<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/template-refs.html", "title": "模板引用", "doc_id": "b03f6f94fd6547fdb4a1ca6347e53e57", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 925, "chunk_index": 52, "_doc_id": "52_265968043857177190"}}
{"doc_id": "53_8087377693721382942", "text": "span>=<span><span>\"items\"<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> {{ item }}<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> </<span><span>li<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> </<span><span>ul<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/template-refs.html", "title": "模板引用", "doc_id": "b03f6f94fd6547fdb4a1ca6347e53e57", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 925, "chunk_index": 53, "_doc_id": "53_8087377693721382942"}}
{"doc_id": "54_1405660041175631961", "text": "pan>li<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> </<span><span>ul<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p><a href=\"https://play.vuejs.org/#eNpFjk0KwjAQha/yCC4Uaou6kyp4DuOi2KkGYhKSiQildzdNa4WQmTc/37xeXJwr35HEUdTh7pXjszT0cdYzWuqaqBm9NEDbcLPeTDngiaM3PwVoFfiI667AvsDhNpWHMQzF+L9sNEztH3C3JlhNpbaPNT9VKFeeulAqplfY5D1p0qurxVQSqel0w5QUUEedY8q0wnvbWX+SYgRAmWxIiuSzm4tBinkc6HvkuSE7TIBKq4lZZWhdLZfE8AWp4l3T\" target=\"_blank\">在演练场中尝试一下<a><p><div><p>应该注意的是，ref 数组<strong>并不<strong>保证与源数组相同的顺序。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/template-refs.html", "title": "模板引用", "doc_id": "b03f6f94fd6547fdb4a1ca6347e53e57", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 925, "chunk_index": 54, "_doc_id": "54_1405660041175631961"}}
{"doc_id": "55_2727669934334012265", "text": "ZWhdLZfE8AWp4l3T\" target=\"_blank\">在演练场中尝试一下<a><p><div><p>应该注意的是，ref 数组<strong>并不<strong>保证与源数组相同的顺序。<p><h2 id=\"function-refs\">函数模板引用 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#function-refs\">​<a><h2><p>除了使用字符串值作名字，<code>ref<code> attribute 还可以绑定为一个函数，会在每次组件更新时都被调用。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/template-refs.html", "title": "模板引用", "doc_id": "b03f6f94fd6547fdb4a1ca6347e53e57", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 925, "chunk_index": 55, "_doc_id": "55_2727669934334012265"}}
{"doc_id": "56_1638871132634877798", "text": "or\" href=\"#function-refs\">​<a><h2><p>除了使用字符串值作名字，<code>ref<code> attribute 还可以绑定为一个函数，会在每次组件更新时都被调用。该函数会收到元素引用作为其第一个参数：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>input<span><span> :<span><span>ref<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>(<span><span>el<span><span>) <span><span>=><span><span> { <span><span>/* 将 el 赋值给一个数据属性或 ref 变量 */<span><span> }<span><span>\"<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>注意我们这里需要使用动态的 <code>:ref<code> 绑定才能够传入一个函数。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/template-refs.html", "title": "模板引用", "doc_id": "b03f6f94fd6547fdb4a1ca6347e53e57", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 925, "chunk_index": 56, "_doc_id": "56_1638871132634877798"}}
{"doc_id": "57_47437118997647339", "text": "<span><span>\"<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>注意我们这里需要使用动态的 <code>:ref<code> 绑定才能够传入一个函数。当绑定的元素被卸载时，函数也会被调用一次，此时的 <code>el<code> 参数会是 <code>null<code>。你当然也可以绑定一个组件方法而不是内联函数。<p><div><div>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/template-refs.html", "title": "模板引用", "doc_id": "b03f6f94fd6547fdb4a1ca6347e53e57", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 925, "chunk_index": 57, "_doc_id": "57_47437118997647339"}}
{"doc_id": "0_3570151000554450431", "text": "<div><div><h1 id=\"reactivity-fundamentals\">响应式基础 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#reactivity-fundamentals\">​<a><h1><div class=\"tip custom-block\"><p class=\"custom-block-title\">API 参考<p><p>本页和后面很多页面中都分别包含了选项式 API 和组合式 API 的示例代码。现在你选择的是 <span class=\"options-api\">选项式 API<span><span class=\"composition-api\">组合式 API<span>。你可以使用左侧侧边栏顶部的“API 风格偏好”开关在 API 风格之间切换。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/reactivity-fundamentals.html", "title": "响应式基础", "doc_id": "e7e89473aa6241edbf34a1dff1430d9d", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1619, "chunk_index": 0, "_doc_id": "0_3570151000554450431"}}
{"doc_id": "1_4285707292777933288", "text": "api\">选项式 API<span><span class=\"composition-api\">组合式 API<span>。你可以使用左侧侧边栏顶部的“API 风格偏好”开关在 API 风格之间切换。<p><div><div class=\"options-api\"><h2 id=\"declaring-reactive-state\">声明响应式状态 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#declaring-reactive-state\">​<a><h2><p>选用选项式 API 时，会用 <code>data<code> 选项来声明组件的响应式状态。此选项的值应为返回一个对象的函数。Vue 将在创建新组件实例的时候调用此函数，并将函数返回的对象用响应式系统进行包装。此对象的所有顶层属性都会被代理到组件实例 (即方法和生命周期钩子中的 <code>this<code>) 上。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/reactivity-fundamentals.html", "title": "响应式基础", "doc_id": "e7e89473aa6241edbf34a1dff1430d9d", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1619, "chunk_index": 1, "_doc_id": "1_4285707292777933288"}}
{"doc_id": "2_296302117613639386", "text": "函数。Vue 将在创建新组件实例的时候调用此函数，并将函数返回的对象用响应式系统进行包装。此对象的所有顶层属性都会被代理到组件实例 (即方法和生命周期钩子中的 <code>this<code>) 上。<p><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line highlighted\"><span> data<span><span>() {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line highlighted\"><span> return<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line highlighted\"><span> count: <span><span>1<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/reactivity-fundamentals.html", "title": "响应式基础", "doc_id": "e7e89473aa6241edbf34a1dff1430d9d", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1619, "chunk_index": 2, "_doc_id": "2_296302117613639386"}}
{"doc_id": "3_3130083502027602715", "text": "rn<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line highlighted\"><span> count: <span><span>1<span><span>\n<span class=\"line highlighted\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line highlighted\"><span> },<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // `mounted` 是生命周期钩子，之后我们会讲到<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> mounted<span><span>() {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // `this` 指向当前组件实例<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/reactivity-fundamentals.html", "title": "响应式基础", "doc_id": "e7e89473aa6241edbf34a1dff1430d9d", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1619, "chunk_index": 3, "_doc_id": "3_3130083502027602715"}}
{"doc_id": "4_1443926754256026523", "text": "<span> mounted<span><span>() {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // `this` 指向当前组件实例<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> console.<span><span>log<span><span>(<span><span>this<span><span>.count) <span><span>// => 1<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 数据属性也可以被更改<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> this<span><span>.count <span><span>=<span><span> 2<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/reactivity-fundamentals.html", "title": "响应式基础", "doc_id": "e7e89473aa6241edbf34a1dff1430d9d", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1619, "chunk_index": 4, "_doc_id": "4_1443926754256026523"}}
{"doc_id": "5_8652568874845460149", "text": "s<span><span>.count <span><span>=<span><span> 2<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span><code><pre><div><p><a href=\"https://play.vuejs.org/#\" target=\"_blank\">在演练场中尝试一下<a><p><p>这些实例上的属性仅在实例首次创建时被添加，因此你需要确保它们都出现在 <code>data<code> 函数返回的对象上。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/reactivity-fundamentals.html", "title": "响应式基础", "doc_id": "e7e89473aa6241edbf34a1dff1430d9d", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1619, "chunk_index": 5, "_doc_id": "5_8652568874845460149"}}
{"doc_id": "6_1085799064057047567", "text": "yI=\" target=\"_blank\">在演练场中尝试一下<a><p><p>这些实例上的属性仅在实例首次创建时被添加，因此你需要确保它们都出现在 <code>data<code> 函数返回的对象上。若所需的值还未准备好，在必要时也可以使用 <code>null<code>、<code>undefined<code> 或者其他一些值占位。<p><p>虽然也可以不在 <code>data<code> 上定义，直接向组件实例添加新属性，但这个属性将无法触发响应式更新。<p><p>Vue 在组件实例上暴露的内置 API 使用 <code>$<code> 作为前缀。它同时也为内部属性保留 <code>_<code> 前缀。因此，你应该避免在顶层 <code>data<code> 上使用任何以这些字符作前缀的属性。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/reactivity-fundamentals.html", "title": "响应式基础", "doc_id": "e7e89473aa6241edbf34a1dff1430d9d", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1619, "chunk_index": 6, "_doc_id": "6_1085799064057047567"}}
{"doc_id": "7_6665763013256584193", "text": "PI 使用 <code>$<code> 作为前缀。它同时也为内部属性保留 <code>_<code> 前缀。因此，你应该避免在顶层 <code>data<code> 上使用任何以这些字符作前缀的属性。<p><h3 id=\"reactive-proxy-vs-original\">响应式代理 vs. 原始值 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#reactive-proxy-vs-original\">​<a><h3><p>在 Vue 3 中，数据是基于 <a href=\"https://developer.mozilla.org/zh-CN/docs/Web/JavaScript/Reference/Global_Objects/Proxy\" target=\"_blank\">JavaScript Proxy (代理)<a> 实现响应式的。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/reactivity-fundamentals.html", "title": "响应式基础", "doc_id": "e7e89473aa6241edbf34a1dff1430d9d", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1619, "chunk_index": 7, "_doc_id": "7_6665763013256584193"}}
{"doc_id": "8_5828007382849353736", "text": "docs/Web/JavaScript/Reference/Global_Objects/Proxy\" target=\"_blank\">JavaScript Proxy (代理)<a> 实现响应式的。使用过 Vue 2 的用户可能需要注意下面这样的边界情况：<p><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> data<span><span>() {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> return<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> someObject: {}<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/reactivity-fundamentals.html", "title": "响应式基础", "doc_id": "e7e89473aa6241edbf34a1dff1430d9d", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1619, "chunk_index": 8, "_doc_id": "8_5828007382849353736"}}
{"doc_id": "9_2297425794022852602", "text": "\"line\"><span> return<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> someObject: {}<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> },<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> mounted<span><span>() {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> const<span><span> newObject<span><span> =<span><span> {}<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> this<span><span>.someObject <span><span>=<span><span> newObject<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/reactivity-fundamentals.html", "title": "响应式基础", "doc_id": "e7e89473aa6241edbf34a1dff1430d9d", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1619, "chunk_index": 9, "_doc_id": "9_2297425794022852602"}}
{"doc_id": "10_594634454365026572", "text": "is<span><span>.someObject <span><span>=<span><span> newObject<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> console.<span><span>log<span><span>(newObject <span><span>===<span><span> this<span><span>.someObject) <span><span>// false<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span><code><pre><div><p>当你在赋值后再访问 <code>this.someObject<code>，此值已经是原来的 <code>newObject<code> 的一个响应式代理。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/reactivity-fundamentals.html", "title": "响应式基础", "doc_id": "e7e89473aa6241edbf34a1dff1430d9d", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1619, "chunk_index": 10, "_doc_id": "10_594634454365026572"}}
{"doc_id": "11_5031788801837384868", "text": "an><code><pre><div><p>当你在赋值后再访问 <code>this.someObject<code>，此值已经是原来的 <code>newObject<code> 的一个响应式代理。<strong>与 Vue 2 不同的是，这里原始的 <code>newObject<code> 不会变为响应式：请确保始终通过 <code>this<code> 来访问响应式状态。<strong><p><div><div class=\"composition-api\"><h2 id=\"declaring-reactive-state-1\">声明响应式状态 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#declaring-reactive-state-1\">​<a><h2><h3 id=\"ref\"><code>ref()<code> <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#ref\">​<a><h3><p>在组合式 API 中，", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/reactivity-fundamentals.html", "title": "响应式基础", "doc_id": "e7e89473aa6241edbf34a1dff1430d9d", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1619, "chunk_index": 11, "_doc_id": "11_5031788801837384868"}}
{"doc_id": "12_124585374127273506", "text": "\">​<a><h2><h3 id=\"ref\"><code>ref()<code> <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#ref\">​<a><h3><p>在组合式 API 中，推荐使用 <a href=\"/api/reactivity-core.html#ref\"><code>ref()<code><a> 函数来声明响应式状态：<p><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>import<span><span> { ref } <span><span>from<span><span> 'vue'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/reactivity-fundamentals.html", "title": "响应式基础", "doc_id": "e7e89473aa6241edbf34a1dff1430d9d", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1619, "chunk_index": 12, "_doc_id": "12_124585374127273506"}}
{"doc_id": "13_7173021052555063265", "text": "import<span><span> { ref } <span><span>from<span><span> 'vue'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> count<span><span> =<span><span> ref<span><span>(<span><span>0<span><span>)<span><span><code><pre><div><p><code>ref()<code> 接收参数，并将其包裹在一个带有 <code>.value<code> 属性的 ref 对象中返回：<p><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> count<span><span> =<span><span> ref<span><span>(<span><span>0<span><span>)<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/reactivity-fundamentals.html", "title": "响应式基础", "doc_id": "e7e89473aa6241edbf34a1dff1430d9d", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1619, "chunk_index": 13, "_doc_id": "13_7173021052555063265"}}
{"doc_id": "14_4838855586423087486", "text": "<span><span> count<span><span> =<span><span> ref<span><span>(<span><span>0<span><span>)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>console.<span><span>log<span><span>(count) <span><span>// { value: 0 }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>console.<span><span>log<span><span>(count.value) <span><span>// 0<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>count.value<span><span>++<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/reactivity-fundamentals.html", "title": "响应式基础", "doc_id": "e7e89473aa6241edbf34a1dff1430d9d", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1619, "chunk_index": 14, "_doc_id": "14_4838855586423087486"}}
{"doc_id": "15_562580493285459848", "text": "pan><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>count.value<span><span>++<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>console.<span><span>log<span><span>(count.value) <span><span>// 1<span><span><code><pre><div><blockquote><p>参考：<a href=\"/guide/typescript/composition-api.html#typing-ref\">为 refs 标注类型<a> <p><blockquote><p>要在组件模板中访问 ref，请从组件的 <code>setup()<code> 函数中声明并返回它们：<p><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>import<span><span> { ref } <span><span>from<span><span> 'vue'<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/reactivity-fundamentals.html", "title": "响应式基础", "doc_id": "e7e89473aa6241edbf34a1dff1430d9d", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1619, "chunk_index": 15, "_doc_id": "15_562580493285459848"}}
{"doc_id": "16_2959856932000548595", "text": "><span class=\"line\"><span>import<span><span> { ref } <span><span>from<span><span> 'vue'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // `setup` 是一个特殊的钩子，专门用于组合式 API。<span><span>\n<span class=\"line highlighted\"><span> setup<span><span>() {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> const<span><span> count<span><span> =<span><span> ref<span><span>(<span><span>0<span><span>)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/reactivity-fundamentals.html", "title": "响应式基础", "doc_id": "e7e89473aa6241edbf34a1dff1430d9d", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1619, "chunk_index": 16, "_doc_id": "16_2959856932000548595"}}
{"doc_id": "17_8634966028728468880", "text": "pan> =<span><span> ref<span><span>(<span><span>0<span><span>)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 将 ref 暴露给模板<span><span>\n<span class=\"line highlighted\"><span> return<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line highlighted\"><span> count<span><span>\n<span class=\"line highlighted\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/reactivity-fundamentals.html", "title": "响应式基础", "doc_id": "e7e89473aa6241edbf34a1dff1430d9d", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1619, "chunk_index": 17, "_doc_id": "17_8634966028728468880"}}
{"doc_id": "18_477151642126469988", "text": "><span>\n<span class=\"line highlighted\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span><code><pre><div><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>div<span><span>>{{ count }}</<span><span>div<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>注意，在模板中使用 ref 时，我们<strong>不<strong>需要附加 <code>.value<code>。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/reactivity-fundamentals.html", "title": "响应式基础", "doc_id": "e7e89473aa6241edbf34a1dff1430d9d", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1619, "chunk_index": 18, "_doc_id": "18_477151642126469988"}}
{"doc_id": "19_6295880291615194941", "text": "an><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>注意，在模板中使用 ref 时，我们<strong>不<strong>需要附加 <code>.value<code>。为了方便起见，当在模板中使用时，ref 会自动解包 (有一些<a href=\"#caveat-when-unwrapping-in-templates\">注意事项<a>)。<p><p>你也可以直接在事件监听器中改变一个 ref：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line highlighted\"><span><<span><span>button<span><span> @<span><span>click<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>count<span><span>++<span><span>\"<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/reactivity-fundamentals.html", "title": "响应式基础", "doc_id": "e7e89473aa6241edbf34a1dff1430d9d", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1619, "chunk_index": 19, "_doc_id": "19_6295880291615194941"}}
{"doc_id": "20_656799848309925137", "text": "lick<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>count<span><span>++<span><span>\"<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> {{ count }}<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>button<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>对于更复杂的逻辑，我们可以在同一作用域内声明更改 ref 的函数，并将它们作为方法与状态一起公开：<p><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>import<span><span> { ref } <span><span>from<span><span> 'vue'<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/reactivity-fundamentals.html", "title": "响应式基础", "doc_id": "e7e89473aa6241edbf34a1dff1430d9d", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1619, "chunk_index": 20, "_doc_id": "20_656799848309925137"}}
{"doc_id": "21_7379941025504502655", "text": "><span class=\"line\"><span>import<span><span> { ref } <span><span>from<span><span> 'vue'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> setup<span><span>() {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> const<span><span> count<span><span> =<span><span> ref<span><span>(<span><span>0<span><span>)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/reactivity-fundamentals.html", "title": "响应式基础", "doc_id": "e7e89473aa6241edbf34a1dff1430d9d", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1619, "chunk_index": 21, "_doc_id": "21_7379941025504502655"}}
{"doc_id": "22_794204439799131582", "text": "pan> =<span><span> ref<span><span>(<span><span>0<span><span>)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line highlighted\"><span> function<span><span> increment<span><span>() {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line highlighted\"><span> // 在 JavaScript 中需要 .value<span><span>\n<span class=\"line highlighted\"><span> count.value<span><span>++<span><span>\n<span class=\"line highlighted\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 不要忘记同时暴露 increment 函数<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/reactivity-fundamentals.html", "title": "响应式基础", "doc_id": "e7e89473aa6241edbf34a1dff1430d9d", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1619, "chunk_index": 22, "_doc_id": "22_794204439799131582"}}
{"doc_id": "23_8425114941368180873", "text": "pan><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 不要忘记同时暴露 increment 函数<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> return<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> count,<span><span>\n<span class=\"line highlighted\"><span> increment<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/reactivity-fundamentals.html", "title": "响应式基础", "doc_id": "e7e89473aa6241edbf34a1dff1430d9d", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1619, "chunk_index": 23, "_doc_id": "23_8425114941368180873"}}
{"doc_id": "24_6231756711612977405", "text": "crement<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span><code><pre><div><p>然后，暴露的方法可以被用作事件监听器：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line highlighted\"><span><<span><span>button<span><span> @<span><span>click<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>increment<span><span>\"<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> {{ count }}<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/reactivity-fundamentals.html", "title": "响应式基础", "doc_id": "e7e89473aa6241edbf34a1dff1430d9d", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1619, "chunk_index": 24, "_doc_id": "24_6231756711612977405"}}
{"doc_id": "25_2162302265299533955", "text": "n>increment<span><span>\"<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> {{ count }}<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>button<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>这里是 <a href=\"https://codepen.io/vuejs-examples/pen/WNYbaqo\" target=\"_blank\">Codepen<a> 上的例子，没有使用任何构建工具。<p><h3 id=\"script-setup\"><code><script setup><code> <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#script-setup\">​<a><h3><p>在 <code>setup()<code> 函数中手动暴露大量的状态和方法非常繁琐。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/reactivity-fundamentals.html", "title": "响应式基础", "doc_id": "e7e89473aa6241edbf34a1dff1430d9d", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1619, "chunk_index": 25, "_doc_id": "25_2162302265299533955"}}
{"doc_id": "26_4136105692260126616", "text": "<a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#script-setup\">​<a><h3><p>在 <code>setup()<code> 函数中手动暴露大量的状态和方法非常繁琐。幸运的是，我们可以通过使用<a href=\"/guide/scaling-up/sfc.html\">单文件组件 (SFC)<a> 来避免这种情况。我们可以使用 <code><script setup><code> 来大幅度地简化代码：<p><div class=\"language-vue\"> <span class=\"lang\">vue<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line highlighted\"><span><<span><span>script<span><span> setup<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/reactivity-fundamentals.html", "title": "响应式基础", "doc_id": "e7e89473aa6241edbf34a1dff1430d9d", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1619, "chunk_index": 26, "_doc_id": "26_4136105692260126616"}}
{"doc_id": "27_7567050404190594562", "text": "<span class=\"line highlighted\"><span><<span><span>script<span><span> setup<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>import<span><span> { ref } <span><span>from<span><span> 'vue'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> count<span><span> =<span><span> ref<span><span>(<span><span>0<span><span>)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>function<span><span> increment<span><span>() {<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/reactivity-fundamentals.html", "title": "响应式基础", "doc_id": "e7e89473aa6241edbf34a1dff1430d9d", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1619, "chunk_index": 27, "_doc_id": "27_7567050404190594562"}}
{"doc_id": "28_1713736486623848395", "text": "s=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>function<span><span> increment<span><span>() {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> count.value<span><span>++<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>script<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>button<span><span> @click<span><span>=<span><span>\"increment\"<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/reactivity-fundamentals.html", "title": "响应式基础", "doc_id": "e7e89473aa6241edbf34a1dff1430d9d", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1619, "chunk_index": 28, "_doc_id": "28_1713736486623848395"}}
{"doc_id": "29_4923459022992782519", "text": "<<span><span>button<span><span> @click<span><span>=<span><span>\"increment\"<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> {{ count }}<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> </<span><span>button<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/reactivity-fundamentals.html", "title": "响应式基础", "doc_id": "e7e89473aa6241edbf34a1dff1430d9d", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1619, "chunk_index": 29, "_doc_id": "29_4923459022992782519"}}
{"doc_id": "30_5125661711777699259", "text": "an> {{ count }}<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> </<span><span>button<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p><a href=\"https://play.vuejs.org/#eNo9jUEKgzAQRa8yZKMiaNcllvYe2dgwQqiZhDhxE3L3jrW4/DPvv1/UK8Zhz6juSm82uciwIef4MOR8DImhQMIFKiwpeGgEbQwZsoE2BhsyMUwH0d66475ksuwCgSOb0CNx20ExBCc77POase8NVUN6PBdlSwKjj+vMKAlAvzOzWJ52dfYzGXXpjPoBAKX856uopDGeFfnq8XKp+gWq4FAi\" target=\"_blank\">在演练场中尝试一下<a><p><p><code><script setup><code> 中的顶层的导入、声明的变量和函数可在同一组件的模板中直接使用。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/reactivity-fundamentals.html", "title": "响应式基础", "doc_id": "e7e89473aa6241edbf34a1dff1430d9d", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1619, "chunk_index": 30, "_doc_id": "30_5125661711777699259"}}
{"doc_id": "31_6595469508733404184", "text": "Wq4FAi\" target=\"_blank\">在演练场中尝试一下<a><p><p><code><script setup><code> 中的顶层的导入、声明的变量和函数可在同一组件的模板中直接使用。你可以理解为模板是在同一作用域内声明的一个 JavaScript 函数——它自然可以访问与它一起声明的所有内容。<p><div class=\"tip custom-block\"><p class=\"custom-block-title\">TIP<p><p>在指南的后续章节中，我们基本上都会在组合式 API 示例中使用单文件组件 + <code><script setup><code> 的语法，因为大多数 Vue 开发者都会这样使用。<p><p>如果你没有使用单文件组件，你仍然可以在 <a href=\"/api/composition-api-setup.html\"><code>setup()<code><a> 选项中使用组合式 API。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/reactivity-fundamentals.html", "title": "响应式基础", "doc_id": "e7e89473aa6241edbf34a1dff1430d9d", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1619, "chunk_index": 31, "_doc_id": "31_6595469508733404184"}}
{"doc_id": "32_8115472930559512047", "text": "p>如果你没有使用单文件组件，你仍然可以在 <a href=\"/api/composition-api-setup.html\"><code>setup()<code><a> 选项中使用组合式 API。<p><div><h3 id=\"why-refs\">为什么要使用 ref？ <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#why-refs\">​<a><h3><p>你可能会好奇：为什么我们需要使用带有 <code>.value<code> 的 ref，而不是普通的变量？为了解释这一点，我们需要简单地讨论一下 Vue 的响应式系统是如何工作的。<p><p>当你在模板中使用了一个 ref，然后改变了这个 ref 的值时，Vue 会自动检测到这个变化，并且相应地更新 DOM。这是通过一个基于依赖追踪的响应式系统实现的。当一个组件首次渲染时，Vue 会<strong>追踪<strong>在渲染过程中使用的每一个 ref。然后，当一个 ref 被修改时，它会<strong>触发<strong>追踪它的组件的一次重新渲染。<p><p>在标准的 JavaScript 中，检测普通变量的访问或修改是行不通的。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/reactivity-fundamentals.html", "title": "响应式基础", "doc_id": "e7e89473aa6241edbf34a1dff1430d9d", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1619, "chunk_index": 32, "_doc_id": "32_8115472930559512047"}}
{"doc_id": "33_2542215316325867300", "text": "每一个 ref。然后，当一个 ref 被修改时，它会<strong>触发<strong>追踪它的组件的一次重新渲染。<p><p>在标准的 JavaScript 中，检测普通变量的访问或修改是行不通的。然而，我们可以通过 getter 和 setter 方法来拦截对象属性的 get 和 set 操作。<p><p>该 <code>.value<code> 属性给予了 Vue 一个机会来检测 ref 何时被访问或修改。在其内部，Vue 在它的 getter 中执行追踪，在它的 setter 中执行触发。从概念上讲，你可以将 ref 看作是一个像这样的对象：<p><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// 伪代码，不是真正的实现<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/reactivity-fundamentals.html", "title": "响应式基础", "doc_id": "e7e89473aa6241edbf34a1dff1430d9d", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1619, "chunk_index": 33, "_doc_id": "33_2542215316325867300"}}
{"doc_id": "34_6731274998268812842", "text": "an><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// 伪代码，不是真正的实现<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> myRef<span><span> =<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> _value: <span><span>0<span><span>,<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> get<span><span> value<span><span>() {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> track<span><span>()<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> return<span><span> this<span><span>._value<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/reactivity-fundamentals.html", "title": "响应式基础", "doc_id": "e7e89473aa6241edbf34a1dff1430d9d", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1619, "chunk_index": 34, "_doc_id": "34_6731274998268812842"}}
{"doc_id": "35_8768362080450548467", "text": "pan>()<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> return<span><span> this<span><span>._value<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> },<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> set<span><span> value<span><span>(<span><span>newValue<span><span>) {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> this<span><span>._value <span><span>=<span><span> newValue<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> trigger<span><span>()<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/reactivity-fundamentals.html", "title": "响应式基础", "doc_id": "e7e89473aa6241edbf34a1dff1430d9d", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1619, "chunk_index": 35, "_doc_id": "35_8768362080450548467"}}
{"doc_id": "36_6693554926121556931", "text": "<span class=\"line\"><span> trigger<span><span>()<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span><code><pre><div><p>另一个 ref 的好处是，与普通变量不同，你可以将 ref 传递给函数，同时保留对最新值和响应式连接的访问。当将复杂的逻辑重构为可重用的代码时，这将非常有用。<p><p>该响应性系统在<a href=\"/guide/extras/reactivity-in-depth.html\">深入响应式系统<a>章节中有更详细的讨论。<p><div><div class=\"options-api\"><h2 id=\"declaring-methods\">声明方法 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#declaring-methods\">​<a><h2><p>要为组件添加方法，我们需要用到 <code>methods<code> 选项。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/reactivity-fundamentals.html", "title": "响应式基础", "doc_id": "e7e89473aa6241edbf34a1dff1430d9d", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1619, "chunk_index": 36, "_doc_id": "36_6693554926121556931"}}
{"doc_id": "37_5578616520549832529", "text": "a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#declaring-methods\">​<a><h2><p>要为组件添加方法，我们需要用到 <code>methods<code> 选项。它应该是一个包含所有方法的对象：<p><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> data<span><span>() {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> return<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> count: <span><span>0<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/reactivity-fundamentals.html", "title": "响应式基础", "doc_id": "e7e89473aa6241edbf34a1dff1430d9d", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1619, "chunk_index": 37, "_doc_id": "37_5578616520549832529"}}
{"doc_id": "38_6198132194265773222", "text": "<span class=\"line\"><span> count: <span><span>0<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> },<span><span>\n<span class=\"line highlighted\"><span> methods: {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line highlighted\"><span> increment<span><span>() {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line highlighted\"><span> this<span><span>.count<span><span>++<span><span>\n<span class=\"line highlighted\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line highlighted\"><span> },<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/reactivity-fundamentals.html", "title": "响应式基础", "doc_id": "e7e89473aa6241edbf34a1dff1430d9d", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1619, "chunk_index": 38, "_doc_id": "38_6198132194265773222"}}
{"doc_id": "39_1654250374675806102", "text": "class=\"line highlighted\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line highlighted\"><span> },<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> mounted<span><span>() {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 在其他方法或是生命周期中也可以调用方法<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> this<span><span>.<span><span>increment<span><span>()<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/reactivity-fundamentals.html", "title": "响应式基础", "doc_id": "e7e89473aa6241edbf34a1dff1430d9d", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1619, "chunk_index": 39, "_doc_id": "39_1654250374675806102"}}
{"doc_id": "40_743138601942614996", "text": "span><span>.<span><span>increment<span><span>()<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span><code><pre><div><p>Vue 自动为 <code>methods<code> 中的方法绑定了永远指向组件实例的 <code>this<code>。这确保了方法在作为事件监听器或回调函数时始终保持正确的 <code>this<code>。你不应该在定义 <code>methods<code> 时使用箭头函数，因为箭头函数没有自己的 <code>this<code> 上下文。<p><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/reactivity-fundamentals.html", "title": "响应式基础", "doc_id": "e7e89473aa6241edbf34a1dff1430d9d", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1619, "chunk_index": 40, "_doc_id": "40_743138601942614996"}}
{"doc_id": "41_2308354468593016612", "text": "b-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> methods: {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> increment<span><span>: () <span><span>=><span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 反例：无法访问此处的 `this`!<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span><code><pre><div><p>和组件实例上的其他属性一样，方法也可以在模板上被访问。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/reactivity-fundamentals.html", "title": "响应式基础", "doc_id": "e7e89473aa6241edbf34a1dff1430d9d", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1619, "chunk_index": 41, "_doc_id": "41_2308354468593016612"}}
{"doc_id": "42_6991233998243711930", "text": "> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span><code><pre><div><p>和组件实例上的其他属性一样，方法也可以在模板上被访问。在模板中它们常常被用作事件监听器：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>button<span><span> @<span><span>click<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>increment<span><span>\"<span><span>>{{ count }}</<span><span>button<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p><a href=\"https://play.vuejs.", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/reactivity-fundamentals.html", "title": "响应式基础", "doc_id": "e7e89473aa6241edbf34a1dff1430d9d", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1619, "chunk_index": 42, "_doc_id": "42_6991233998243711930"}}
{"doc_id": "43_2750493967941912444", "text": "count }}</<span><span>button<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p><a href=\"https://play.vuejs.org/#eNplj9EKwyAMRX8l+LSx0e65uLL9hy+dZlTWqtg4BuK/z1baDgZicsPJgUR2d656B2QN45P02lErDH6c9QQKn10YCKIwAKqj7nAsPYBHCt6sCUDaYKiBS8lpLuk8/yNSb9XUrKg20uOIhnYXAPV6qhbF6fRvmOeodn6hfzwLKkx+vN5OyIFwdENHmBMAfwQia+AmBy1fV8E2gWBtjOUASInXBcxLvN4MLH0BCe1i4Q==\" target=\"_blank\">在演练场中尝试一下<a><p><p>在上面的例子中，<code>increment<code> 方法会在 <code><button><code> 被点击时调用。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/reactivity-fundamentals.html", "title": "响应式基础", "doc_id": "e7e89473aa6241edbf34a1dff1430d9d", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1619, "chunk_index": 43, "_doc_id": "43_2750493967941912444"}}
{"doc_id": "44_2796450488856337183", "text": "=\" target=\"_blank\">在演练场中尝试一下<a><p><p>在上面的例子中，<code>increment<code> 方法会在 <code><button><code> 被点击时调用。<p><div><h3 id=\"deep-reactivity\">深层响应性 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#deep-reactivity\">​<a><h3><div class=\"options-api\"><p>在 Vue 中，默认情况下，状态是深度响应的。这意味着当改变嵌套对象或数组时，这些变化也会被检测到：<p><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> data<span><span>() {<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/reactivity-fundamentals.html", "title": "响应式基础", "doc_id": "e7e89473aa6241edbf34a1dff1430d9d", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1619, "chunk_index": 44, "_doc_id": "44_2796450488856337183"}}
{"doc_id": "45_5645469343777659287", "text": "<span> default<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> data<span><span>() {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> return<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> obj: {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> nested: { count: <span><span>0<span><span> },<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> arr: [<span><span>'foo'<span><span>, <span><span>'bar'<span><span>]<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/reactivity-fundamentals.html", "title": "响应式基础", "doc_id": "e7e89473aa6241edbf34a1dff1430d9d", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1619, "chunk_index": 45, "_doc_id": "45_5645469343777659287"}}
{"doc_id": "46_2693089106610546374", "text": "<span>]<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> },<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> methods: {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> mutateDeeply<span><span>() {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 以下都会按照期望工作<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> this<span><span>.obj.nested.count<span><span>++<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/reactivity-fundamentals.html", "title": "响应式基础", "doc_id": "e7e89473aa6241edbf34a1dff1430d9d", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1619, "chunk_index": 46, "_doc_id": "46_2693089106610546374"}}
{"doc_id": "47_5689548827077005798", "text": "作<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> this<span><span>.obj.nested.count<span><span>++<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> this<span><span>.obj.arr.<span><span>push<span><span>(<span><span>'baz'<span><span>)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/reactivity-fundamentals.html", "title": "响应式基础", "doc_id": "e7e89473aa6241edbf34a1dff1430d9d", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1619, "chunk_index": 47, "_doc_id": "47_5689548827077005798"}}
{"doc_id": "48_7660783178856935883", "text": "<span>)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span><code><pre><div><div><div class=\"composition-api\"><p>Ref 可以持有任何类型的值，包括深层嵌套的对象、数组或者 JavaScript 内置的数据结构，比如 <code>Map<code>。<p><p>Ref 会使它的值具有深层响应性。这意味着即使改变嵌套对象或数组时，变化也会被检测到：<p><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>import<span><span> { ref } <span><span>from<span><span> 'vue'<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/reactivity-fundamentals.html", "title": "响应式基础", "doc_id": "e7e89473aa6241edbf34a1dff1430d9d", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1619, "chunk_index": 48, "_doc_id": "48_7660783178856935883"}}
{"doc_id": "49_1902687415745954718", "text": "><span class=\"line\"><span>import<span><span> { ref } <span><span>from<span><span> 'vue'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> obj<span><span> =<span><span> ref<span><span>({<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> nested: { count: <span><span>0<span><span> },<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> arr: [<span><span>'foo'<span><span>, <span><span>'bar'<span><span>]<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>})<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/reactivity-fundamentals.html", "title": "响应式基础", "doc_id": "e7e89473aa6241edbf34a1dff1430d9d", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1619, "chunk_index": 49, "_doc_id": "49_1902687415745954718"}}
{"doc_id": "50_6573129769740290449", "text": "an>'bar'<span><span>]<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>})<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>function<span><span> mutateDeeply<span><span>() {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 以下都会按照期望工作<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> obj.value.nested.count<span><span>++<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> obj.value.arr.<span><span>push<span><span>(<span><span>'baz'<span><span>)<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/reactivity-fundamentals.html", "title": "响应式基础", "doc_id": "e7e89473aa6241edbf34a1dff1430d9d", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1619, "chunk_index": 50, "_doc_id": "50_6573129769740290449"}}
{"doc_id": "51_1441282639663801857", "text": "\"line\"><span> obj.value.arr.<span><span>push<span><span>(<span><span>'baz'<span><span>)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span><code><pre><div><p>非原始值将通过 <a href=\"#reactive\"><code>reactive()<code><a> 转换为响应式代理，该函数将在后面讨论。<p><p>也可以通过 <a href=\"/api/reactivity-advanced.html#shallowref\">shallow ref<a> 来放弃深层响应性。对于浅层 ref，只有 <code>.value<code> 的访问会被追踪。浅层 ref 可以用于避免对大型数据的响应性开销来优化性能、或者有外部库管理其内部状态的情况。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/reactivity-fundamentals.html", "title": "响应式基础", "doc_id": "e7e89473aa6241edbf34a1dff1430d9d", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1619, "chunk_index": 51, "_doc_id": "51_1441282639663801857"}}
{"doc_id": "52_8177961115470708524", "text": "f<a> 来放弃深层响应性。对于浅层 ref，只有 <code>.value<code> 的访问会被追踪。浅层 ref 可以用于避免对大型数据的响应性开销来优化性能、或者有外部库管理其内部状态的情况。<p><p>阅读更多：<p><div><h3 id=\"dom-update-timing\">DOM 更新时机 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#dom-update-timing\">​<a><h3><p>当你修改了响应式状态时，DOM 会被自动更新。但是需要注意的是，DOM 更新不是同步的。Vue 会在“next tick”更新周期中缓冲所有状态的修改，以确保不管你进行了多少次状态修改，每个组件都只会被更新一次。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/reactivity-fundamentals.html", "title": "响应式基础", "doc_id": "e7e89473aa6241edbf34a1dff1430d9d", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1619, "chunk_index": 52, "_doc_id": "52_8177961115470708524"}}
{"doc_id": "53_1397718978214125990", "text": "应式状态时，DOM 会被自动更新。但是需要注意的是，DOM 更新不是同步的。Vue 会在“next tick”更新周期中缓冲所有状态的修改，以确保不管你进行了多少次状态修改，每个组件都只会被更新一次。<p><p>要等待 DOM 更新完成后再执行额外的代码，可以使用 <a href=\"/api/general.html#nexttick\">nextTick()<a> 全局 API：<p><div class=\"composition-api\"><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>import<span><span> { nextTick } <span><span>from<span><span> 'vue'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/reactivity-fundamentals.html", "title": "响应式基础", "doc_id": "e7e89473aa6241edbf34a1dff1430d9d", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1619, "chunk_index": 53, "_doc_id": "53_1397718978214125990"}}
{"doc_id": "54_4839051003309454075", "text": "t<span><span> { nextTick } <span><span>from<span><span> 'vue'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>async<span><span> function<span><span> increment<span><span>() {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> count.value<span><span>++<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> await<span><span> nextTick<span><span>()<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 现在 DOM 已经更新了<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/reactivity-fundamentals.html", "title": "响应式基础", "doc_id": "e7e89473aa6241edbf34a1dff1430d9d", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1619, "chunk_index": 54, "_doc_id": "54_4839051003309454075"}}
{"doc_id": "55_3147310053614699635", "text": "pan><span> nextTick<span><span>()<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 现在 DOM 已经更新了<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span><code><pre><div><div><div class=\"options-api\"><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>import<span><span> { nextTick } <span><span>from<span><span> 'vue'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/reactivity-fundamentals.html", "title": "响应式基础", "doc_id": "e7e89473aa6241edbf34a1dff1430d9d", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1619, "chunk_index": 55, "_doc_id": "55_3147310053614699635"}}
{"doc_id": "56_5267951364263725317", "text": "n class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> methods: {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> async<span><span> increment<span><span>() {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> this<span><span>.count<span><span>++<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> await<span><span> nextTick<span><span>()<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 现在 DOM 已经更新了<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/reactivity-fundamentals.html", "title": "响应式基础", "doc_id": "e7e89473aa6241edbf34a1dff1430d9d", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1619, "chunk_index": 56, "_doc_id": "56_5267951364263725317"}}
{"doc_id": "57_5480258613968316891", "text": "span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 现在 DOM 已经更新了<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/reactivity-fundamentals.html", "title": "响应式基础", "doc_id": "e7e89473aa6241edbf34a1dff1430d9d", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1619, "chunk_index": 57, "_doc_id": "57_5480258613968316891"}}
{"doc_id": "58_5474045902212576748", "text": "M 已经更新了<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span><code><pre><div><div><div class=\"composition-api\"><h2 id=\"reactive\"><code>reactive()<code> <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#reactive\">​<a><h2><p>还有另一种声明响应式状态的方式，即使用 <code>reactive()<code> API。与将内部值包装在特殊对象中的 ref 不同，<code>reactive()<code> 将使对象本身具有响应性：<p><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>import<span><span> { reactive } <span><span>from<span><span> 'vue'<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/reactivity-fundamentals.html", "title": "响应式基础", "doc_id": "e7e89473aa6241edbf34a1dff1430d9d", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1619, "chunk_index": 58, "_doc_id": "58_5474045902212576748"}}
{"doc_id": "59_778228012978716166", "text": "n class=\"line\"><span>import<span><span> { reactive } <span><span>from<span><span> 'vue'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> state<span><span> =<span><span> reactive<span><span>({ count: <span><span>0<span><span> })<span><span><code><pre><div><blockquote><p>参考：<a href=\"/guide/typescript/composition-api.", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/reactivity-fundamentals.html", "title": "响应式基础", "doc_id": "e7e89473aa6241edbf34a1dff1430d9d", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1619, "chunk_index": 59, "_doc_id": "59_778228012978716166"}}
{"doc_id": "60_6870084752003812277", "text": "n><span> })<span><span><code><pre><div><blockquote><p>参考：<a href=\"/guide/typescript/composition-api.html#typing-reactive\">为 <code>reactive()<code> 标注类型<a> <p><blockquote><p>在模板中使用：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>button<span><span> @<span><span>click<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>state.count<span><span>++<span><span>\"<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/reactivity-fundamentals.html", "title": "响应式基础", "doc_id": "e7e89473aa6241edbf34a1dff1430d9d", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1619, "chunk_index": 60, "_doc_id": "60_6870084752003812277"}}
{"doc_id": "61_5228140354846526934", "text": "pan><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>state.count<span><span>++<span><span>\"<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> {{ state.count }}<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>button<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>响应式对象是 <a href=\"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/JavaScript/Reference/Global_Objects/Proxy\" target=\"_blank\">JavaScript 代理<a>，其行为就和普通对象一样。不同的是，Vue 能够拦截对响应式对象所有属性的访问和修改，以便进行依赖追踪和触发更新。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/reactivity-fundamentals.html", "title": "响应式基础", "doc_id": "e7e89473aa6241edbf34a1dff1430d9d", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1619, "chunk_index": 61, "_doc_id": "61_5228140354846526934"}}
{"doc_id": "62_1147155228110716341", "text": "cts/Proxy\" target=\"_blank\">JavaScript 代理<a>，其行为就和普通对象一样。不同的是，Vue 能够拦截对响应式对象所有属性的访问和修改，以便进行依赖追踪和触发更新。<p><p><code>reactive()<code> 将深层地转换对象：当访问嵌套对象时，它们也会被 <code>reactive()<code> 包装。当 ref 的值是一个对象时，<code>ref()<code> 也会在内部调用它。与浅层 ref 类似，这里也有一个 <a href=\"/api/reactivity-advanced.html#shallowreactive\"><code>shallowReactive()<code><a> API 可以选择退出深层响应性。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/reactivity-fundamentals.html", "title": "响应式基础", "doc_id": "e7e89473aa6241edbf34a1dff1430d9d", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1619, "chunk_index": 62, "_doc_id": "62_1147155228110716341"}}
{"doc_id": "63_116019749435263080", "text": "ef=\"/api/reactivity-advanced.html#shallowreactive\"><code>shallowReactive()<code><a> API 可以选择退出深层响应性。<p><h3 id=\"reactive-proxy-vs-original-1\">Reactive Proxy vs. Original <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#reactive-proxy-vs-original-1\">​<a><h3><p>值得注意的是，<code>reactive()<code> 返回的是一个原始对象的 <a href=\"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/JavaScript/Reference/Global_Objects/Proxy\" target=\"_blank\">Proxy<a>，它和原始对象是不相等的：<p><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> raw<span><span> =<span><span> {}<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/reactivity-fundamentals.html", "title": "响应式基础", "doc_id": "e7e89473aa6241edbf34a1dff1430d9d", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1619, "chunk_index": 63, "_doc_id": "63_116019749435263080"}}
{"doc_id": "64_5447516047066987055", "text": "code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> raw<span><span> =<span><span> {}<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> proxy<span><span> =<span><span> reactive<span><span>(raw)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 代理对象和原始对象不是全等的<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/reactivity-fundamentals.html", "title": "响应式基础", "doc_id": "e7e89473aa6241edbf34a1dff1430d9d", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1619, "chunk_index": 64, "_doc_id": "64_5447516047066987055"}}
{"doc_id": "65_3361022164194218577", "text": ">(raw)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 代理对象和原始对象不是全等的<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>console.<span><span>log<span><span>(proxy <span><span>===<span><span> raw) <span><span>// false<span><span><code><pre><div><p>只有代理对象是响应式的，更改原始对象不会触发更新。因此，使用 Vue 的响应式系统的最佳实践是<strong>仅使用你声明对象的代理版本<strong>。<p><p>为保证访问代理的一致性，对同一个原始对象调用 <code>reactive()<code> 会总是返回同样的代理对象，而对一个已存在的代理对象调用 <code>reactive()<code> 会返回其本身：<p><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// 在同一个对象上调用 reactive() 会返回相同的代理<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/reactivity-fundamentals.html", "title": "响应式基础", "doc_id": "e7e89473aa6241edbf34a1dff1430d9d", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1619, "chunk_index": 65, "_doc_id": "65_3361022164194218577"}}
{"doc_id": "66_1268520419194051947", "text": "ki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// 在同一个对象上调用 reactive() 会返回相同的代理<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>console.<span><span>log<span><span>(<span><span>reactive<span><span>(raw) <span><span>===<span><span> proxy) <span><span>// true<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 在一个代理上调用 reactive() 会返回它自己<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/reactivity-fundamentals.html", "title": "响应式基础", "doc_id": "e7e89473aa6241edbf34a1dff1430d9d", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1619, "chunk_index": 66, "_doc_id": "66_1268520419194051947"}}
{"doc_id": "67_8409110211611791600", "text": "<span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 在一个代理上调用 reactive() 会返回它自己<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>console.<span><span>log<span><span>(<span><span>reactive<span><span>(proxy) <span><span>===<span><span> proxy) <span><span>// true<span><span><code><pre><div><p>这个规则对嵌套对象也适用。依靠深层响应性，响应式对象内的嵌套对象依然是代理：<p><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> proxy<span><span> =<span><span> reactive<span><span>({})<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/reactivity-fundamentals.html", "title": "响应式基础", "doc_id": "e7e89473aa6241edbf34a1dff1430d9d", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1619, "chunk_index": 67, "_doc_id": "67_8409110211611791600"}}
{"doc_id": "68_7331354312539216884", "text": "\"line\"><span>const<span><span> proxy<span><span> =<span><span> reactive<span><span>({})<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> raw<span><span> =<span><span> {}<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>proxy.nested <span><span>=<span><span> raw<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>console.<span><span>log<span><span>(proxy.", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/reactivity-fundamentals.html", "title": "响应式基础", "doc_id": "e7e89473aa6241edbf34a1dff1430d9d", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1619, "chunk_index": 68, "_doc_id": "68_7331354312539216884"}}
{"doc_id": "69_1035313487705994959", "text": "<span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>console.<span><span>log<span><span>(proxy.nested <span><span>===<span><span> raw) <span><span>// false<span><span><code><pre><div><h3 id=\"limitations-of-reactive\"><code>reactive()<code> 的局限性 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#limitations-of-reactive\">​<a><h3><p><code>reactive()<code> API 有一些局限性：<p><ol><li><p><strong>有限的值类型<strong>：它只能用于对象类型 (对象、数组和如 <code>Map<code>、<code>Set<code> 这样的<a href=\"https://developer.mozilla.", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/reactivity-fundamentals.html", "title": "响应式基础", "doc_id": "e7e89473aa6241edbf34a1dff1430d9d", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1619, "chunk_index": 69, "_doc_id": "69_1035313487705994959"}}
{"doc_id": "70_563475844196147868", "text": "类型<strong>：它只能用于对象类型 (对象、数组和如 <code>Map<code>、<code>Set<code> 这样的<a href=\"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/JavaScript/Reference/Global_Objects#keyed_collections\" target=\"_blank\">集合类型<a>)。它不能持有如 <code>string<code>、<code>number<code> 或 <code>boolean<code> 这样的<a href=\"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Glossary/Primitive\" target=\"_blank\">原始类型<a>。<p><li><li><p><strong>不能替换整个对象<strong>：由于 Vue 的响应式跟踪是通过属性访问实现的，因此我们必须始终保持对响应式对象的相同引用。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/reactivity-fundamentals.html", "title": "响应式基础", "doc_id": "e7e89473aa6241edbf34a1dff1430d9d", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1619, "chunk_index": 70, "_doc_id": "70_563475844196147868"}}
{"doc_id": "71_493816847522635205", "text": "blank\">原始类型<a>。<p><li><li><p><strong>不能替换整个对象<strong>：由于 Vue 的响应式跟踪是通过属性访问实现的，因此我们必须始终保持对响应式对象的相同引用。这意味着我们不能轻易地“替换”响应式对象，因为这样的话与第一个引用的响应性连接将丢失：<p><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>let<span><span> state <span><span>=<span><span> reactive<span><span>({ count: <span><span>0<span><span> })<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 上面的 ({ count: 0 }) 引用将不再被追踪<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/reactivity-fundamentals.html", "title": "响应式基础", "doc_id": "e7e89473aa6241edbf34a1dff1430d9d", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1619, "chunk_index": 71, "_doc_id": "71_493816847522635205"}}
{"doc_id": "72_3957510707679440393", "text": "span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 上面的 ({ count: 0 }) 引用将不再被追踪<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// (响应性连接已丢失！)<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/reactivity-fundamentals.html", "title": "响应式基础", "doc_id": "e7e89473aa6241edbf34a1dff1430d9d", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1619, "chunk_index": 72, "_doc_id": "72_3957510707679440393"}}
{"doc_id": "73_2651301991686434118", "text": "span>// 上面的 ({ count: 0 }) 引用将不再被追踪<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// (响应性连接已丢失！)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>state <span><span>=<span><span> reactive<span><span>({ count: <span><span>1<span><span> })<span><span><code><pre><div><li><li><p><strong>对解构操作不友好<strong>：当我们将响应式对象的原始类型属性解构为本地变量时，或者将该属性传递给函数时，我们将丢失响应性连接：<p><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> state<span><span> =<span><span> reactive<span><span>({ count: <span><span>0<span><span> })<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/reactivity-fundamentals.html", "title": "响应式基础", "doc_id": "e7e89473aa6241edbf34a1dff1430d9d", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1619, "chunk_index": 73, "_doc_id": "73_2651301991686434118"}}
{"doc_id": "74_3801073224335681179", "text": "te<span><span> =<span><span> reactive<span><span>({ count: <span><span>0<span><span> })<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 当解构时，count 已经与 state.count 断开连接<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>let<span><span> { count } <span><span>=<span><span> state<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 不会影响原始的 state<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>count<span><span>++<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 该函数接收到的是一个普通的数字<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/reactivity-fundamentals.html", "title": "响应式基础", "doc_id": "e7e89473aa6241edbf34a1dff1430d9d", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1619, "chunk_index": 74, "_doc_id": "74_3801073224335681179"}}
{"doc_id": "75_1076551758698761683", "text": "an>++<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 该函数接收到的是一个普通的数字<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 并且无法追踪 state.count 的变化<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 我们必须传入整个对象以保持响应性<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>callSomeFunction<span><span>(state.count)<span><span><code><pre><div><li><ol><p>由于这些限制，我们建议使用 <code>ref()<code> 作为声明响应式状态的主要 API。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/reactivity-fundamentals.html", "title": "响应式基础", "doc_id": "e7e89473aa6241edbf34a1dff1430d9d", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1619, "chunk_index": 75, "_doc_id": "75_1076551758698761683"}}
{"doc_id": "76_7670602626293329478", "text": "state.count)<span><span><code><pre><div><li><ol><p>由于这些限制，我们建议使用 <code>ref()<code> 作为声明响应式状态的主要 API。<p><h2 id=\"additional-ref-unwrapping-details\">额外的 ref 解包细节 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#additional-ref-unwrapping-details\">​<a><h2><h3 id=\"ref-unwrapping-as-reactive-object-property\">作为 reactive 对象的属性 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#ref-unwrapping-as-reactive-object-property\">​<a><h3><p>一个 ref 会在作为响应式对象的属性被访问或修改时自动解包。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/reactivity-fundamentals.html", "title": "响应式基础", "doc_id": "e7e89473aa6241edbf34a1dff1430d9d", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1619, "chunk_index": 76, "_doc_id": "76_7670602626293329478"}}
{"doc_id": "77_5937655557662152627", "text": "nchor\" href=\"#ref-unwrapping-as-reactive-object-property\">​<a><h3><p>一个 ref 会在作为响应式对象的属性被访问或修改时自动解包。换句话说，它的行为就像一个普通的属性：<p><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> count<span><span> =<span><span> ref<span><span>(<span><span>0<span><span>)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> state<span><span> =<span><span> reactive<span><span>({<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> count<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/reactivity-fundamentals.html", "title": "响应式基础", "doc_id": "e7e89473aa6241edbf34a1dff1430d9d", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1619, "chunk_index": 77, "_doc_id": "77_5937655557662152627"}}
{"doc_id": "78_8890239294603355357", "text": "<span> =<span><span> reactive<span><span>({<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> count<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>})<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>console.<span><span>log<span><span>(state.count) <span><span>// 0<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>state.count <span><span>=<span><span> 1<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/reactivity-fundamentals.html", "title": "响应式基础", "doc_id": "e7e89473aa6241edbf34a1dff1430d9d", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1619, "chunk_index": 78, "_doc_id": "78_8890239294603355357"}}
{"doc_id": "79_4888873307874698424", "text": "an class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>state.count <span><span>=<span><span> 1<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>console.<span><span>log<span><span>(count.value) <span><span>// 1<span><span><code><pre><div><p>如果将一个新的 ref 赋值给一个关联了已有 ref 的属性，那么它会替换掉旧的 ref：<p><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> otherCount<span><span> =<span><span> ref<span><span>(<span><span>2<span><span>)<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/reactivity-fundamentals.html", "title": "响应式基础", "doc_id": "e7e89473aa6241edbf34a1dff1430d9d", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1619, "chunk_index": 79, "_doc_id": "79_4888873307874698424"}}
{"doc_id": "80_6394332739655957404", "text": "><span> otherCount<span><span> =<span><span> ref<span><span>(<span><span>2<span><span>)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>state.count <span><span>=<span><span> otherCount<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>console.<span><span>log<span><span>(state.count) <span><span>// 2<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 原始 ref 现在已经和 state.count 失去联系<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/reactivity-fundamentals.html", "title": "响应式基础", "doc_id": "e7e89473aa6241edbf34a1dff1430d9d", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1619, "chunk_index": 80, "_doc_id": "80_6394332739655957404"}}
{"doc_id": "81_7285113295993370582", "text": "<span><span>// 2<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 原始 ref 现在已经和 state.count 失去联系<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>console.<span><span>log<span><span>(count.value) <span><span>// 1<span><span><code><pre><div><p>只有当嵌套在一个深层响应式对象内时，才会发生 ref 解包。当其作为<a href=\"/api/reactivity-advanced.html#shallowreactive\">浅层响应式对象<a>的属性被访问时不会解包。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/reactivity-fundamentals.html", "title": "响应式基础", "doc_id": "e7e89473aa6241edbf34a1dff1430d9d", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1619, "chunk_index": 81, "_doc_id": "81_7285113295993370582"}}
{"doc_id": "82_1417214600449763909", "text": "式对象内时，才会发生 ref 解包。当其作为<a href=\"/api/reactivity-advanced.html#shallowreactive\">浅层响应式对象<a>的属性被访问时不会解包。<p><h3 id=\"caveat-in-arrays-and-collections\">数组和集合的注意事项 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#caveat-in-arrays-and-collections\">​<a><h3><p>与 reactive 对象不同的是，当 ref 作为响应式数组或原生集合类型 (如 <code>Map<code>) 中的元素被访问时，它<strong>不会<strong>被解包：<p><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> books<span><span> =<span><span> reactive<span><span>([<span><span>ref<span><span>(<span><span>'Vue 3 Guide'<span><span>)])<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/reactivity-fundamentals.html", "title": "响应式基础", "doc_id": "e7e89473aa6241edbf34a1dff1430d9d", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1619, "chunk_index": 82, "_doc_id": "82_1417214600449763909"}}
{"doc_id": "83_2954635432054899536", "text": "ctive<span><span>([<span><span>ref<span><span>(<span><span>'Vue 3 Guide'<span><span>)])<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 这里需要 .value<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>console.<span><span>log<span><span>(books[<span><span>0<span><span>].value)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/reactivity-fundamentals.html", "title": "响应式基础", "doc_id": "e7e89473aa6241edbf34a1dff1430d9d", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1619, "chunk_index": 83, "_doc_id": "83_2954635432054899536"}}
{"doc_id": "84_4104159563909524340", "text": "<span>log<span><span>(books[<span><span>0<span><span>].value)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> map<span><span> =<span><span> reactive<span><span>(<span><span>new<span><span> Map<span><span>([[<span><span>'count'<span><span>, <span><span>ref<span><span>(<span><span>0<span><span>)]]))<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 这里需要 .value<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/reactivity-fundamentals.html", "title": "响应式基础", "doc_id": "e7e89473aa6241edbf34a1dff1430d9d", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1619, "chunk_index": 84, "_doc_id": "84_4104159563909524340"}}
{"doc_id": "85_8948404666472992201", "text": "pan>(<span><span>0<span><span>)]]))<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 这里需要 .value<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>console.<span><span>log<span><span>(map.<span><span>get<span><span>(<span><span>'count'<span><span>).value)<span><span><code><pre><div><h3 id=\"caveat-when-unwrapping-in-templates\">在模板中解包的注意事项 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#caveat-when-unwrapping-in-templates\">​<a><h3><p>在模板渲染上下文中，只有顶级的 ref 属性才会被解包。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/reactivity-fundamentals.html", "title": "响应式基础", "doc_id": "e7e89473aa6241edbf34a1dff1430d9d", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1619, "chunk_index": 85, "_doc_id": "85_8948404666472992201"}}
{"doc_id": "86_5482234490790124572", "text": "=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#caveat-when-unwrapping-in-templates\">​<a><h3><p>在模板渲染上下文中，只有顶级的 ref 属性才会被解包。<p><p>在下面的例子中，<code>count<code> 和 <code>object<code> 是顶级属性，但 <code>object.id<code> 不是：<p><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> count<span><span> =<span><span> ref<span><span>(<span><span>0<span><span>)<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/reactivity-fundamentals.html", "title": "响应式基础", "doc_id": "e7e89473aa6241edbf34a1dff1430d9d", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1619, "chunk_index": 86, "_doc_id": "86_5482234490790124572"}}
{"doc_id": "87_4914187055241797253", "text": "<span><span> count<span><span> =<span><span> ref<span><span>(<span><span>0<span><span>)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> object<span><span> =<span><span> { id: <span><span>ref<span><span>(<span><span>1<span><span>) }<span><span><code><pre><div><p>因此，", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/reactivity-fundamentals.html", "title": "响应式基础", "doc_id": "e7e89473aa6241edbf34a1dff1430d9d", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1619, "chunk_index": 87, "_doc_id": "87_4914187055241797253"}}
{"doc_id": "88_8687969331086476204", "text": "an> { id: <span><span>ref<span><span>(<span><span>1<span><span>) }<span><span><code><pre><div><p>因此，这个表达式按预期工作：<p><p>...但这个<strong>不会<strong>：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>{{ object.id <span><span>+<span><span> 1<span><span> }}<span><span><code><pre><div><p>渲染的结果将是 <code>[object Object]1<code>，因为在计算表达式时 <code>object.id<code> 没有被解包，仍然是一个 ref 对象。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/reactivity-fundamentals.html", "title": "响应式基础", "doc_id": "e7e89473aa6241edbf34a1dff1430d9d", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1619, "chunk_index": 88, "_doc_id": "88_8687969331086476204"}}
{"doc_id": "89_4030367475241098863", "text": "pre><div><p>渲染的结果将是 <code>[object Object]1<code>，因为在计算表达式时 <code>object.id<code> 没有被解包，仍然是一个 ref 对象。为了解决这个问题，我们可以将 <code>id<code> 解构为一个顶级属性：<p><p>现在渲染的结果将是 <code>2<code>。<p><p>另一个需要注意的点是，如果 ref 是文本插值的最终计算值 (即 <code>{{ }}<code> 标签)，那么它将被解包，因此以下内容将渲染为 <code>1<code>：<p><p>该特性仅仅是文本插值的一个便利特性，等价于 <code>{{ object.id.value }}<code>。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/reactivity-fundamentals.html", "title": "响应式基础", "doc_id": "e7e89473aa6241edbf34a1dff1430d9d", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1619, "chunk_index": 89, "_doc_id": "89_4030367475241098863"}}
{"doc_id": "90_5721980670206095091", "text": "标签)，那么它将被解包，因此以下内容将渲染为 <code>1<code>：<p><p>该特性仅仅是文本插值的一个便利特性，等价于 <code>{{ object.id.value }}<code>。<p><div><div class=\"options-api\"><h3 id=\"stateful-methods\">有状态方法 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#stateful-methods\">​<a><h3><p>在某些情况下，我们可能需要动态地创建一个方法函数，比如创建一个预置防抖的事件处理器：<p><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>import<span><span> { debounce } <span><span>from<span><span> 'lodash-es'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/reactivity-fundamentals.html", "title": "响应式基础", "doc_id": "e7e89473aa6241edbf34a1dff1430d9d", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1619, "chunk_index": 90, "_doc_id": "90_5721980670206095091"}}
{"doc_id": "91_660429093374110433", "text": "><span> { debounce } <span><span>from<span><span> 'lodash-es'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> methods: {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 使用 Lodash 的防抖函数<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> click: <span><span>debounce<span><span>(<span><span>function<span><span> () {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // ... 对点击的响应 ...<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/reactivity-fundamentals.html", "title": "响应式基础", "doc_id": "e7e89473aa6241edbf34a1dff1430d9d", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1619, "chunk_index": 91, "_doc_id": "91_660429093374110433"}}
{"doc_id": "92_4474001627068171750", "text": "<span>function<span><span> () {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // ... 对点击的响应 ...<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }, <span><span>500<span><span>)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/reactivity-fundamentals.html", "title": "响应式基础", "doc_id": "e7e89473aa6241edbf34a1dff1430d9d", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1619, "chunk_index": 92, "_doc_id": "92_4474001627068171750"}}
{"doc_id": "93_616411788352890585", "text": "s=\"line\"><span> }, <span><span>500<span><span>)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span><code><pre><div><p>不过这种方法对于被重用的组件来说是有问题的，因为这个预置防抖的函数是<strong>有状态的<strong>：它在运行时维护着一个内部状态。如果多个组件实例都共享这同一个预置防抖的函数，那么它们之间将会互相影响。<p><p>要保持每个组件实例的防抖函数都彼此独立，我们可以改为在 <code>created<code> 生命周期钩子中创建这个预置防抖的函数：<p><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/reactivity-fundamentals.html", "title": "响应式基础", "doc_id": "e7e89473aa6241edbf34a1dff1430d9d", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1619, "chunk_index": 93, "_doc_id": "93_616411788352890585"}}
{"doc_id": "94_3868345736450631674", "text": "b-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> created<span><span>() {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 每个实例都有了自己的预置防抖的处理函数<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> this<span><span>.debouncedClick <span><span>=<span><span> _.<span><span>debounce<span><span>(<span><span>this<span><span>.click, <span><span>500<span><span>)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> },<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/reactivity-fundamentals.html", "title": "响应式基础", "doc_id": "e7e89473aa6241edbf34a1dff1430d9d", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1619, "chunk_index": 94, "_doc_id": "94_3868345736450631674"}}
{"doc_id": "95_5654433323560582219", "text": "pan><span>.click, <span><span>500<span><span>)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> },<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> unmounted<span><span>() {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 最好是在组件卸载时<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 清除掉防抖计时器<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> this<span><span>.debouncedClick.<span><span>cancel<span><span>()<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> },<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> methods: {<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/reactivity-fundamentals.html", "title": "响应式基础", "doc_id": "e7e89473aa6241edbf34a1dff1430d9d", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1619, "chunk_index": 95, "_doc_id": "95_5654433323560582219"}}
{"doc_id": "96_586253811766783216", "text": "an><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> },<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> methods: {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> click<span><span>() {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // ... 对点击的响应 ...<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span><code><pre><div><div><div><div>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/reactivity-fundamentals.html", "title": "响应式基础", "doc_id": "e7e89473aa6241edbf34a1dff1430d9d", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1619, "chunk_index": 96, "_doc_id": "96_586253811766783216"}}
{"doc_id": "0_8747921959927936008", "text": "<div><div><h1 id=\"computed-properties\">计算属性 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#computed-properties\">​<a><h1><p class=\"options-api\"><p><p class=\"composition-api\"><p><h2 id=\"basic-example\">基础示例 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#basic-example\">​<a><h2><p>模板中的表达式虽然方便，但也只能用来做简单的操作。如果在模板中写太多逻辑，会让模板变得臃肿，难以维护。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/computed.html", "title": "计算属性", "doc_id": "92df6bbf616147caa4da60bfd5b23202", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1092, "chunk_index": 0, "_doc_id": "0_8747921959927936008"}}
{"doc_id": "1_4316772075221996246", "text": "\"header-anchor\" href=\"#basic-example\">​<a><h2><p>模板中的表达式虽然方便，但也只能用来做简单的操作。如果在模板中写太多逻辑，会让模板变得臃肿，难以维护。比如说，我们有这样一个包含嵌套数组的对象：<p><div class=\"options-api\"><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> data<span><span>() {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> return<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> author: {<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/computed.html", "title": "计算属性", "doc_id": "92df6bbf616147caa4da60bfd5b23202", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1092, "chunk_index": 1, "_doc_id": "1_4316772075221996246"}}
{"doc_id": "2_4208956270549611840", "text": "lass=\"line\"><span> return<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> author: {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> name: <span><span>'John Doe'<span><span>,<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> books: [<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> 'Vue 2 - Advanced Guide'<span><span>,<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> 'Vue 3 - Basic Guide'<span><span>,<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> 'Vue 4 - The Mystery'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> ]<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/computed.html", "title": "计算属性", "doc_id": "92df6bbf616147caa4da60bfd5b23202", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1092, "chunk_index": 2, "_doc_id": "2_4208956270549611840"}}
{"doc_id": "3_6356056935608821337", "text": "<span class=\"line\"><span> 'Vue 4 - The Mystery'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> ]<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/computed.html", "title": "计算属性", "doc_id": "92df6bbf616147caa4da60bfd5b23202", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1092, "chunk_index": 3, "_doc_id": "3_6356056935608821337"}}
{"doc_id": "4_1806864361566681434", "text": "span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span><code><pre><div><div><div class=\"composition-api\"><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> author<span><span> =<span><span> reactive<span><span>({<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> name: <span><span>'John Doe'<span><span>,<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/computed.html", "title": "计算属性", "doc_id": "92df6bbf616147caa4da60bfd5b23202", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1092, "chunk_index": 4, "_doc_id": "4_1806864361566681434"}}
{"doc_id": "5_2546314796080792266", "text": "span>({<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> name: <span><span>'John Doe'<span><span>,<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> books: [<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> 'Vue 2 - Advanced Guide'<span><span>,<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> 'Vue 3 - Basic Guide'<span><span>,<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> 'Vue 4 - The Mystery'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> ]<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/computed.html", "title": "计算属性", "doc_id": "92df6bbf616147caa4da60bfd5b23202", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1092, "chunk_index": 5, "_doc_id": "5_2546314796080792266"}}
{"doc_id": "6_8702547128432356421", "text": "<span class=\"line\"><span> 'Vue 4 - The Mystery'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> ]<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>})<span><span><code><pre><div><div><p>我们想根据 <code>author<code> 是否已有一些书籍来展示不同的信息：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>p<span><span>>Has published books:</<span><span>p<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/computed.html", "title": "计算属性", "doc_id": "92df6bbf616147caa4da60bfd5b23202", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1092, "chunk_index": 6, "_doc_id": "6_8702547128432356421"}}
{"doc_id": "7_1091096890288177795", "text": "line\"><span><<span><span>p<span><span>>Has published books:</<span><span>p<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>span<span><span>>{{ author.books.<span><span>length<span><span> ><span><span> 0<span><span> ?<span><span> 'Yes'<span><span> :<span><span> 'No'<span><span> }}</<span><span>span<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>这里的模板看起来有些复杂。我们必须认真看好一会儿才能明白它的计算依赖于 <code>author.books<code>。更重要的是，如果在模板中需要不止一次这样的计算，我们可不想将这样的代码在模板里重复好多遍。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/computed.html", "title": "计算属性", "doc_id": "92df6bbf616147caa4da60bfd5b23202", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1092, "chunk_index": 7, "_doc_id": "7_1091096890288177795"}}
{"doc_id": "8_7048719449776719791", "text": "起来有些复杂。我们必须认真看好一会儿才能明白它的计算依赖于 <code>author.books<code>。更重要的是，如果在模板中需要不止一次这样的计算，我们可不想将这样的代码在模板里重复好多遍。<p><p>因此我们推荐使用<strong>计算属性<strong>来描述依赖响应式状态的复杂逻辑。这是重构后的示例：<p><div class=\"options-api\"><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> data<span><span>() {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> return<span><span> {<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/computed.html", "title": "计算属性", "doc_id": "92df6bbf616147caa4da60bfd5b23202", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1092, "chunk_index": 8, "_doc_id": "8_7048719449776719791"}}
{"doc_id": "9_718183231410409088", "text": "><span> data<span><span>() {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> return<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> author: {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> name: <span><span>'John Doe'<span><span>,<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> books: [<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> 'Vue 2 - Advanced Guide'<span><span>,<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> 'Vue 3 - Basic Guide'<span><span>,<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> 'Vue 4 - The Mystery'<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/computed.html", "title": "计算属性", "doc_id": "92df6bbf616147caa4da60bfd5b23202", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1092, "chunk_index": 9, "_doc_id": "9_718183231410409088"}}
{"doc_id": "10_4220405707480590739", "text": "- Basic Guide'<span><span>,<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> 'Vue 4 - The Mystery'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> ]<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> },<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> computed: {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 一个计算属性的 getter<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> publishedBooksMessage<span><span>() {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // `this` 指向当前组件实例<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/computed.html", "title": "计算属性", "doc_id": "92df6bbf616147caa4da60bfd5b23202", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1092, "chunk_index": 10, "_doc_id": "10_4220405707480590739"}}
{"doc_id": "11_921164413558642939", "text": "edBooksMessage<span><span>() {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // `this` 指向当前组件实例<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> return<span><span> this<span><span>.author.books.<span><span>length<span><span> ><span><span> 0<span><span> ?<span><span> 'Yes'<span><span> :<span><span> 'No'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/computed.html", "title": "计算属性", "doc_id": "92df6bbf616147caa4da60bfd5b23202", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1092, "chunk_index": 11, "_doc_id": "11_921164413558642939"}}
{"doc_id": "12_8080142795668353787", "text": "n> 'No'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span><code><pre><div><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>p<span><span>>Has published books:</<span><span>p<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/computed.html", "title": "计算属性", "doc_id": "92df6bbf616147caa4da60bfd5b23202", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1092, "chunk_index": 12, "_doc_id": "12_8080142795668353787"}}
{"doc_id": "13_9162857921353604740", "text": "line\"><span><<span><span>p<span><span>>Has published books:</<span><span>p<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>span<span><span>>{{ publishedBooksMessage }}</<span><span>span<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p><a href=\"https://play.vuejs.", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/computed.html", "title": "计算属性", "doc_id": "92df6bbf616147caa4da60bfd5b23202", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1092, "chunk_index": 13, "_doc_id": "13_9162857921353604740"}}
{"doc_id": "14_4287938484602895871", "text": "Message }}</<span><span>span<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p><a href=\"https://play.vuejs.org/#\" target=\"_blank\">在演练场中尝试一下<a><p><p>我们在这里定义了一个计算属性 <code>publishedBooksMessage<code>。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/computed.html", "title": "计算属性", "doc_id": "92df6bbf616147caa4da60bfd5b23202", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1092, "chunk_index": 14, "_doc_id": "14_4287938484602895871"}}
{"doc_id": "15_2683177151092906610", "text": "WUwXYyi/gdTEpwK\" target=\"_blank\">在演练场中尝试一下<a><p><p>我们在这里定义了一个计算属性 <code>publishedBooksMessage<code>。<p><p>更改此应用的 <code>data<code> 中 <code>books<code> 数组的值后，可以看到 <code>publishedBooksMessage<code> 也会随之改变。<p><p>在模板中使用计算属性的方式和一般的属性并无二致。Vue 会检测到 <code>this.publishedBooksMessage<code> 依赖于 <code>this.author.books<code>，所以当 <code>this.author.books<code> 改变时，任何依赖于 <code>this.publishedBooksMessage<code> 的绑定都将同时更新。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/computed.html", "title": "计算属性", "doc_id": "92df6bbf616147caa4da60bfd5b23202", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1092, "chunk_index": 15, "_doc_id": "15_2683177151092906610"}}
{"doc_id": "16_5126003676220471726", "text": "<code>，所以当 <code>this.author.books<code> 改变时，任何依赖于 <code>this.publishedBooksMessage<code> 的绑定都将同时更新。<p><p>也可参考：<a href=\"/guide/typescript/options-api.html#typing-computed-properties\">为计算属性标记类型<a> <p><div><div class=\"composition-api\"><div class=\"language-vue\"> <span class=\"lang\">vue<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>script<span><span> setup<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/computed.html", "title": "计算属性", "doc_id": "92df6bbf616147caa4da60bfd5b23202", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1092, "chunk_index": 16, "_doc_id": "16_5126003676220471726"}}
{"doc_id": "17_6623832548334331738", "text": "code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>script<span><span> setup<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>import<span><span> { reactive, computed } <span><span>from<span><span> 'vue'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> author<span><span> =<span><span> reactive<span><span>({<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> name: <span><span>'John Doe'<span><span>,<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> books: [<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/computed.html", "title": "计算属性", "doc_id": "92df6bbf616147caa4da60bfd5b23202", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1092, "chunk_index": 17, "_doc_id": "17_6623832548334331738"}}
{"doc_id": "18_5679249734391261727", "text": "ame: <span><span>'John Doe'<span><span>,<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> books: [<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> 'Vue 2 - Advanced Guide'<span><span>,<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> 'Vue 3 - Basic Guide'<span><span>,<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> 'Vue 4 - The Mystery'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> ]<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>})<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 一个计算属性 ref<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/computed.html", "title": "计算属性", "doc_id": "92df6bbf616147caa4da60bfd5b23202", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1092, "chunk_index": 18, "_doc_id": "18_5679249734391261727"}}
{"doc_id": "19_8160868773829645784", "text": "\"><span>})<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 一个计算属性 ref<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> publishedBooksMessage<span><span> =<span><span> computed<span><span>(() <span><span>=><span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> return<span><span> author.books.<span><span>length<span><span> ><span><span> 0<span><span> ?<span><span> 'Yes'<span><span> :<span><span> 'No'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>})<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/computed.html", "title": "计算属性", "doc_id": "92df6bbf616147caa4da60bfd5b23202", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1092, "chunk_index": 19, "_doc_id": "19_8160868773829645784"}}
{"doc_id": "20_2829478163738591873", "text": "pan><span> 'Yes'<span><span> :<span><span> 'No'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>})<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>script<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>p<span><span>>Has published books:</<span><span>p<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>span<span><span>>{{ publishedBooksMessage }}</<span><span>span<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/computed.html", "title": "计算属性", "doc_id": "92df6bbf616147caa4da60bfd5b23202", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1092, "chunk_index": 20, "_doc_id": "20_2829478163738591873"}}
{"doc_id": "21_2038916159705264433", "text": "<span><span>span<span><span>>{{ publishedBooksMessage }}</<span><span>span<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p><a href=\"https://play.vuejs.", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/computed.html", "title": "计算属性", "doc_id": "92df6bbf616147caa4da60bfd5b23202", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1092, "chunk_index": 21, "_doc_id": "21_2038916159705264433"}}
{"doc_id": "22_2715362009013734211", "text": "<span></<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p><a href=\"https://play.vuejs.org/#\" target=\"_blank\">在演练场中尝试一下<a><p><p>我们在这里定义了一个计算属性 <code>publishedBooksMessage<code>。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/computed.html", "title": "计算属性", "doc_id": "92df6bbf616147caa4da60bfd5b23202", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1092, "chunk_index": 22, "_doc_id": "22_2715362009013734211"}}
{"doc_id": "23_7147320982767854876", "text": "DjvTfpfSBSbmA==\" target=\"_blank\">在演练场中尝试一下<a><p><p>我们在这里定义了一个计算属性 <code>publishedBooksMessage<code>。<code>computed()<code> 方法期望接收一个 <a href=\"https://developer.mozilla.org/zh-CN/docs/Web/JavaScript/Reference/Functions/get#description\" target=\"_blank\">getter 函数<a>，返回值为一个<strong>计算属性 ref<strong>。和其他一般的 ref 类似，你可以通过 <code>publishedBooksMessage.value<code> 访问计算结果。计算属性 ref 也会在模板中自动解包，因此在模板表达式中引用时无需添加 <code>.value<code>。<p><p>Vue 的计算属性会自动追踪响应式依赖。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/computed.html", "title": "计算属性", "doc_id": "92df6bbf616147caa4da60bfd5b23202", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1092, "chunk_index": 23, "_doc_id": "23_7147320982767854876"}}
{"doc_id": "24_4423360439704453304", "text": "alue<code> 访问计算结果。计算属性 ref 也会在模板中自动解包，因此在模板表达式中引用时无需添加 <code>.value<code>。<p><p>Vue 的计算属性会自动追踪响应式依赖。它会检测到 <code>publishedBooksMessage<code> 依赖于 <code>author.books<code>，所以当 <code>author.books<code> 改变时，任何依赖于 <code>publishedBooksMessage<code> 的绑定都会同时更新。<p><p>也可参考：<a href=\"/guide/typescript/composition-api.html#typing-computed\">为计算属性标注类型<a> <p><div><h2 id=\"computed-caching-vs-methods\">计算属性缓存 vs 方法 <a class=\"header-anchor\"", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/computed.html", "title": "计算属性", "doc_id": "92df6bbf616147caa4da60bfd5b23202", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1092, "chunk_index": 24, "_doc_id": "24_4423360439704453304"}}
{"doc_id": "25_375303460169330829", "text": "ed\">为计算属性标注类型<a> <p><div><h2 id=\"computed-caching-vs-methods\">计算属性缓存 vs 方法 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#computed-caching-vs-methods\">​<a><h2><p>你可能注意到我们在表达式中像这样调用一个函数也会获得和计算属性相同的结果：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>p<span><span>>{{ <span><span>calculateBooksMessage<span><span>() }}</<span><span>p<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><div class=\"options-api\"><div class=\"language-js\">", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/computed.html", "title": "计算属性", "doc_id": "92df6bbf616147caa4da60bfd5b23202", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1092, "chunk_index": 25, "_doc_id": "25_375303460169330829"}}
{"doc_id": "26_4839627209069531283", "text": "><span>p<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><div class=\"options-api\"><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// 组件中<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>methods<span><span>: {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> calculateBooksMessage<span><span>() {<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/computed.html", "title": "计算属性", "doc_id": "92df6bbf616147caa4da60bfd5b23202", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1092, "chunk_index": 26, "_doc_id": "26_4839627209069531283"}}
{"doc_id": "27_1431006813545185279", "text": "n><span>: {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> calculateBooksMessage<span><span>() {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> return<span><span> this<span><span>.author.books.<span><span>length<span><span> ><span><span> 0<span><span> ?<span><span> 'Yes'<span><span> :<span><span> 'No'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/computed.html", "title": "计算属性", "doc_id": "92df6bbf616147caa4da60bfd5b23202", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1092, "chunk_index": 27, "_doc_id": "27_1431006813545185279"}}
{"doc_id": "28_7282149679115340910", "text": "pan><span> 'Yes'<span><span> :<span><span> 'No'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span><code><pre><div><div><div class=\"composition-api\"><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// 组件中<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>function<span><span> calculateBooksMessage<span><span>() {<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/computed.html", "title": "计算属性", "doc_id": "92df6bbf616147caa4da60bfd5b23202", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1092, "chunk_index": 28, "_doc_id": "28_7282149679115340910"}}
{"doc_id": "29_3206505109860265433", "text": "an>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>function<span><span> calculateBooksMessage<span><span>() {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> return<span><span> author.books.<span><span>length<span><span> ><span><span> 0<span><span> ?<span><span> 'Yes'<span><span> :<span><span> 'No'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span><code><pre><div><div><p>若我们将同样的函数定义为一个方法而不是计算属性，两种方式在结果上确实是完全相同的，然而，不同之处在于<strong>计算属性值会基于其响应式依赖被缓存<strong>。一个计算属性仅会在其响应式依赖更新时才重新计算。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/computed.html", "title": "计算属性", "doc_id": "92df6bbf616147caa4da60bfd5b23202", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1092, "chunk_index": 29, "_doc_id": "29_3206505109860265433"}}
{"doc_id": "30_3808789998756236633", "text": "数定义为一个方法而不是计算属性，两种方式在结果上确实是完全相同的，然而，不同之处在于<strong>计算属性值会基于其响应式依赖被缓存<strong>。一个计算属性仅会在其响应式依赖更新时才重新计算。这意味着只要 <code>author.books<code> 不改变，无论多少次访问 <code>publishedBooksMessage<code> 都会立即返回先前的计算结果，而不用重复执行 getter 函数。<p><p>这也解释了为什么下面的计算属性永远不会更新，因为 <code>Date.now()<code> 并不是一个响应式依赖：<p><div class=\"options-api\"><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>computed<span><span>: {<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/computed.html", "title": "计算属性", "doc_id": "92df6bbf616147caa4da60bfd5b23202", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1092, "chunk_index": 30, "_doc_id": "30_3808789998756236633"}}
{"doc_id": "31_3871109735655322033", "text": "lass=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>computed<span><span>: {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> now<span><span>() {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> return<span><span> Date.<span><span>now<span><span>()<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/computed.html", "title": "计算属性", "doc_id": "92df6bbf616147caa4da60bfd5b23202", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1092, "chunk_index": 31, "_doc_id": "31_3871109735655322033"}}
{"doc_id": "32_7185799299171790276", "text": "<span><span> Date.<span><span>now<span><span>()<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span><code><pre><div><div><div class=\"composition-api\"><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> now<span><span> =<span><span> computed<span><span>(() <span><span>=><span><span> Date.<span><span>now<span><span>())<span><span><code><pre><div><div><p>相比之下，方法调用<strong>总是<strong>会在重渲染发生时再次执行函数。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/computed.html", "title": "计算属性", "doc_id": "92df6bbf616147caa4da60bfd5b23202", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1092, "chunk_index": 32, "_doc_id": "32_7185799299171790276"}}
{"doc_id": "33_1402138535703335782", "text": "pan>now<span><span>())<span><span><code><pre><div><div><p>相比之下，方法调用<strong>总是<strong>会在重渲染发生时再次执行函数。<p><p>为什么需要缓存呢？想象一下我们有一个非常耗性能的计算属性 <code>list<code>，需要循环一个巨大的数组并做许多计算逻辑，并且可能也有其他计算属性依赖于 <code>list<code>。没有缓存的话，我们会重复执行非常多次 <code>list<code> 的 getter，然而这实际上没有必要！如果你确定不需要缓存，那么也可以使用方法调用。<p><h2 id=\"writable-computed\">可写计算属性 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#writable-computed\">​<a><h2><p>计算属性默认是只读的。当你尝试修改一个计算属性时，你会收到一个运行时警告。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/computed.html", "title": "计算属性", "doc_id": "92df6bbf616147caa4da60bfd5b23202", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1092, "chunk_index": 33, "_doc_id": "33_1402138535703335782"}}
{"doc_id": "34_884928869836783308", "text": "<a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#writable-computed\">​<a><h2><p>计算属性默认是只读的。当你尝试修改一个计算属性时，你会收到一个运行时警告。只在某些特殊场景中你可能才需要用到“可写”的属性，你可以通过同时提供 getter 和 setter 来创建：<p><div class=\"options-api\"><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> data<span><span>() {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> return<span><span> {<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/computed.html", "title": "计算属性", "doc_id": "92df6bbf616147caa4da60bfd5b23202", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1092, "chunk_index": 34, "_doc_id": "34_884928869836783308"}}
{"doc_id": "35_1386353008684130704", "text": "><span> data<span><span>() {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> return<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> firstName: <span><span>'John'<span><span>,<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> lastName: <span><span>'Doe'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> },<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> computed: {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> fullName: {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // getter<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/computed.html", "title": "计算属性", "doc_id": "92df6bbf616147caa4da60bfd5b23202", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1092, "chunk_index": 35, "_doc_id": "35_1386353008684130704"}}
{"doc_id": "36_8439338464033068554", "text": ">\n<span class=\"line\"><span> fullName: {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // getter<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> get<span><span>() {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> return<span><span> this<span><span>.firstName <span><span>+<span><span> ' '<span><span> +<span><span> this<span><span>.lastName<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> },<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // setter<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> set<span><span>(<span><span>newValue<span><span>) {<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/computed.html", "title": "计算属性", "doc_id": "92df6bbf616147caa4da60bfd5b23202", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1092, "chunk_index": 36, "_doc_id": "36_8439338464033068554"}}
{"doc_id": "37_2563644795412381534", "text": "an><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> set<span><span>(<span><span>newValue<span><span>) {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 注意：我们这里使用的是解构赋值语法<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> [<span><span>this<span><span>.firstName, <span><span>this<span><span>.lastName] <span><span>=<span><span> newValue.<span><span>split<span><span>(<span><span>' '<span><span>)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/computed.html", "title": "计算属性", "doc_id": "92df6bbf616147caa4da60bfd5b23202", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1092, "chunk_index": 37, "_doc_id": "37_2563644795412381534"}}
{"doc_id": "38_3715094018363342917", "text": "span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span><code><pre><div><p>现在当你再运行 <code>this.fullName = 'John Doe'<code> 时，setter 会被调用而 <code>this.firstName<code> 和 <code>this.lastName<code> 会随之更新。<p><div><div class=\"composition-api\"><div class=\"language-vue\"> <span class=\"lang\">vue<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>script<span><span> setup<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/computed.html", "title": "计算属性", "doc_id": "92df6bbf616147caa4da60bfd5b23202", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1092, "chunk_index": 38, "_doc_id": "38_3715094018363342917"}}
