{"doc_id": "41_6572832365277195609", "text": "firstName.value <span><span>+<span><span> ' '<span><span> +<span><span> lastName.value<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> },<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // setter<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> set<span><span>(<span><span>newValue<span><span>) {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 注意：我们这里使用的是解构赋值语法<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> [firstName.value, lastName.value] <span><span>=<span><span> newValue.<span><span>split<span><span>(<span><span>' '<span><span>)<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/computed.html", "title": "计算属性", "doc_id": "92df6bbf616147caa4da60bfd5b23202", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1092, "chunk_index": 41, "_doc_id": "41_6572832365277195609"}}
