{"doc_id": "43_6394628892031984629", "text": "fullName.value = 'John Doe'<code> 时，setter 会被调用而 <code>firstName<code> 和 <code>lastName<code> 会随之更新。<p><div><h2 id=\"previous\">获取上一个值 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#previous\">​<a><h2><p class=\"options-api\"> 如果需要，可以通过访问计算属性的 getter 的第二个参数来获取计算属性返回的上一个值： <p><p class=\"composition-api\"> 如果需要，可以通过访问计算属性的 getter 的第一个参数来获取计算属性返回的上一个值： <p><div class=\"options-api\"><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/computed.html", "title": "计算属性", "doc_id": "92df6bbf616147caa4da60bfd5b23202", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1092, "chunk_index": 43, "_doc_id": "43_6394628892031984629"}}
{"doc_id": "44_4917258770817943275", "text": "b-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> data<span><span>() {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> return<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> count: <span><span>2<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> },<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> computed: {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 这个计算属性在 count 的值小于或等于 3 时，将返回 count 的值。<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/computed.html", "title": "计算属性", "doc_id": "92df6bbf616147caa4da60bfd5b23202", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1092, "chunk_index": 44, "_doc_id": "44_4917258770817943275"}}
{"doc_id": "45_3612174345236722428", "text": "ted: {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 这个计算属性在 count 的值小于或等于 3 时，将返回 count 的值。<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 当 count 的值大于等于 4 时，将会返回满足我们条件的最后一个值<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 直到 count 的值再次小于或等于 3 为止。<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> alwaysSmall<span><span>(<span><span>_<span><span>, <span><span>previous<span><span>) {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> if<span><span> (<span><span>this<span><span>.count <span><span><=<span><span> 3<span><span>) {<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/computed.html", "title": "计算属性", "doc_id": "92df6bbf616147caa4da60bfd5b23202", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1092, "chunk_index": 45, "_doc_id": "45_3612174345236722428"}}
{"doc_id": "46_915490540245308716", "text": "><span> (<span><span>this<span><span>.count <span><span><=<span><span> 3<span><span>) {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> return<span><span> this<span><span>.count<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> return<span><span> previous<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/computed.html", "title": "计算属性", "doc_id": "92df6bbf616147caa4da60bfd5b23202", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1092, "chunk_index": 46, "_doc_id": "46_915490540245308716"}}
{"doc_id": "47_6753408834670589825", "text": "revious<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span><code><pre><div><div><div class=\"composition-api\"><div class=\"language-vue\"> <span class=\"lang\">vue<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>script<span><span> setup<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>import<span><span> { ref, computed } <span><span>from<span><span> 'vue'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/computed.html", "title": "计算属性", "doc_id": "92df6bbf616147caa4da60bfd5b23202", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1092, "chunk_index": 47, "_doc_id": "47_6753408834670589825"}}
{"doc_id": "48_7908181079647903077", "text": "n><span> { ref, computed } <span><span>from<span><span> 'vue'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> count<span><span> =<span><span> ref<span><span>(<span><span>2<span><span>)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 这个计算属性在 count 的值小于或等于 3 时，将返回 count 的值。<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 当 count 的值大于等于 4 时，将会返回满足我们条件的最后一个值<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 直到 count 的值再次小于或等于 3 为止。<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/computed.html", "title": "计算属性", "doc_id": "92df6bbf616147caa4da60bfd5b23202", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1092, "chunk_index": 48, "_doc_id": "48_7908181079647903077"}}
{"doc_id": "49_1823486151904222035", "text": "于 4 时，将会返回满足我们条件的最后一个值<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 直到 count 的值再次小于或等于 3 为止。<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> alwaysSmall<span><span> =<span><span> computed<span><span>((<span><span>previous<span><span>) <span><span>=><span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> if<span><span> (count.value <span><span><=<span><span> 3<span><span>) {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> return<span><span> count.value<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/computed.html", "title": "计算属性", "doc_id": "92df6bbf616147caa4da60bfd5b23202", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1092, "chunk_index": 49, "_doc_id": "49_1823486151904222035"}}
