{"doc_id": "8_2731515688531594353", "text": "span>{ active: isActive, <span><span>'text-danger'<span><span>: hasError }<span><span>\"<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>></<span><span>div<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>渲染的结果会是：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>div<span><span> class<span><span>=<span><span>\"static active\"<span><span>></<span><span>div<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>当 <code>isActive<code> 或者 <code>hasError<code> 改变时，class 列表会随之更新。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/class-and-style.html", "title": "Class 与 Style 绑定", "doc_id": "b6ae63a461fa4928b6b168ba4115acbd", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 797, "chunk_index": 8, "_doc_id": "8_2731515688531594353"}}
{"doc_id": "9_2586728573003327069", "text": "an>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>当 <code>isActive<code> 或者 <code>hasError<code> 改变时，class 列表会随之更新。举例来说，如果 <code>hasError<code> 变为 <code>true<code>，class 列表也会变成 <code>\"static active text-danger\"<code>。<p><p>绑定的对象并不一定需要写成内联字面量的形式，也可以直接绑定一个对象：<p><div class=\"composition-api\"><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> classObject<span><span> =<span><span> reactive<span><span>({<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/class-and-style.html", "title": "Class 与 Style 绑定", "doc_id": "b6ae63a461fa4928b6b168ba4115acbd", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 797, "chunk_index": 9, "_doc_id": "9_2586728573003327069"}}
{"doc_id": "10_4286768172945305159", "text": "e\"><span>const<span><span> classObject<span><span> =<span><span> reactive<span><span>({<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> active: <span><span>true<span><span>,<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> 'text-danger'<span><span>: <span><span>false<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>})<span><span><code><pre><div><div><div class=\"options-api\"><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>data<span><span>() {<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/class-and-style.html", "title": "Class 与 Style 绑定", "doc_id": "b6ae63a461fa4928b6b168ba4115acbd", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 797, "chunk_index": 10, "_doc_id": "10_4286768172945305159"}}
