{"doc_id": "21_8434144400046515134", "text": "><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>div<span><span> :<span><span>class<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>classObject<span><span>\"<span><span>></<span><span>div<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><h3 id=\"binding-to-arrays\">绑定数组 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#binding-to-arrays\">​<a><h3><p>我们可以给 <code>:class<code> 绑定一个数组来渲染多个 CSS class：<p><div class=\"composition-api\"><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/class-and-style.html", "title": "Class 与 Style 绑定", "doc_id": "b6ae63a461fa4928b6b168ba4115acbd", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 797, "chunk_index": 21, "_doc_id": "21_8434144400046515134"}}
