{"doc_id": "23_7287691733638758215", "text": "activeClass<span><span> =<span><span> ref<span><span>(<span><span>'active'<span><span>)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> errorClass<span><span> =<span><span> ref<span><span>(<span><span>'text-danger'<span><span>)<span><span><code><pre><div><div><div class=\"options-api\"><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>data<span><span>() {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> return<span><span> {<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/class-and-style.html", "title": "Class 与 Style 绑定", "doc_id": "b6ae63a461fa4928b6b168ba4115acbd", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 797, "chunk_index": 23, "_doc_id": "23_7287691733638758215"}}
{"doc_id": "24_4438104151729184136", "text": "\"><span>data<span><span>() {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> return<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> activeClass: <span><span>'active'<span><span>,<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> errorClass: <span><span>'text-danger'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/class-and-style.html", "title": "Class 与 Style 绑定", "doc_id": "b6ae63a461fa4928b6b168ba4115acbd", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 797, "chunk_index": 24, "_doc_id": "24_4438104151729184136"}}
{"doc_id": "25_5138323413347777076", "text": "e\"><span> errorClass: <span><span>'text-danger'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span><code><pre><div><div><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>div<span><span> :<span><span>class<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>[activeClass,", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/class-and-style.html", "title": "Class 与 Style 绑定", "doc_id": "b6ae63a461fa4928b6b168ba4115acbd", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 797, "chunk_index": 25, "_doc_id": "25_5138323413347777076"}}
{"doc_id": "26_8526737577481860483", "text": "><<span><span>div<span><span> :<span><span>class<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>[activeClass, errorClass]<span><span>\"<span><span>></<span><span>div<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>渲染的结果是：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>div<span><span> class<span><span>=<span><span>\"active text-danger\"<span><span>></<span><span>div<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>如果你也想在数组中有条件地渲染某个 class，", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/class-and-style.html", "title": "Class 与 Style 绑定", "doc_id": "b6ae63a461fa4928b6b168ba4115acbd", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 797, "chunk_index": 26, "_doc_id": "26_8526737577481860483"}}
{"doc_id": "27_6798443481203740739", "text": "r\"<span><span>></<span><span>div<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>如果你也想在数组中有条件地渲染某个 class，你可以使用三元表达式：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>div<span><span> :<span><span>class<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>[isActive <span><span>?<span><span> activeClass <span><span>:<span><span> ''<span><span>, errorClass]<span><span>\"<span><span>></<span><span>div<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p><code>errorClass<code> 会一直存在，", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/class-and-style.html", "title": "Class 与 Style 绑定", "doc_id": "b6ae63a461fa4928b6b168ba4115acbd", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 797, "chunk_index": 27, "_doc_id": "27_6798443481203740739"}}
{"doc_id": "28_6874941333466007874", "text": "an><span>></<span><span>div<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p><code>errorClass<code> 会一直存在，但 <code>activeClass<code> 只会在 <code>isActive<code> 为真时才存在。<p><p>然而，这可能在有多个依赖条件的 class 时会有些冗长。因此也可以在数组中嵌套对象：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>div<span><span> :<span><span>class<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>[{ [activeClass]: isActive },", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/class-and-style.html", "title": "Class 与 Style 绑定", "doc_id": "b6ae63a461fa4928b6b168ba4115acbd", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 797, "chunk_index": 28, "_doc_id": "28_6874941333466007874"}}
{"doc_id": "29_3031917037273478688", "text": "v<span><span> :<span><span>class<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>[{ [activeClass]: isActive }, errorClass]<span><span>\"<span><span>></<span><span>div<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><h3 id=\"with-components\">在组件上使用 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#with-components\">​<a><h3><blockquote><p>本节假设你已经有 <a href=\"/guide/essentials/component-basics.html\">Vue 组件<a>的知识基础。如果没有，你也可以暂时跳过，以后再阅读。<p><blockquote><p>对于只有一个根元素的组件，当你使用了 <code>class<code> attribute 时，这些 class 会被添加到根元素上并与该元素上已有的 class 合并。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/class-and-style.html", "title": "Class 与 Style 绑定", "doc_id": "b6ae63a461fa4928b6b168ba4115acbd", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 797, "chunk_index": 29, "_doc_id": "29_3031917037273478688"}}
{"doc_id": "30_8561396916958397278", "text": "blockquote><p>对于只有一个根元素的组件，当你使用了 <code>class<code> attribute 时，这些 class 会被添加到根元素上并与该元素上已有的 class 合并。<p><p>举例来说，如果你声明了一个组件名叫 <code>MyComponent<code>，模板如下：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><!-- 子组件模板 --><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/class-and-style.html", "title": "Class 与 Style 绑定", "doc_id": "b6ae63a461fa4928b6b168ba4115acbd", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 797, "chunk_index": 30, "_doc_id": "30_8561396916958397278"}}
{"doc_id": "31_777931860666390824", "text": "an><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><!-- 子组件模板 --><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>p<span><span> class<span><span>=<span><span>\"foo bar\"<span><span>>Hi!</<span><span>p<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>在使用时添加一些 class：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><!-- 在使用组件时 --><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>MyComponent<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/class-and-style.html", "title": "Class 与 Style 绑定", "doc_id": "b6ae63a461fa4928b6b168ba4115acbd", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 797, "chunk_index": 31, "_doc_id": "31_777931860666390824"}}
{"doc_id": "32_7606014377440295118", "text": "ne\"><span><!-- 在使用组件时 --><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>MyComponent<span><span> class<span><span>=<span><span>\"baz boo\"<span><span> /><span><span><code><pre><div><p>渲染出的 HTML 为：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>p<span><span> class<span><span>=<span><span>\"foo bar baz boo\"<span><span>>Hi!</<span><span>p<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>Class 的绑定也是同样的：<p><div", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/class-and-style.html", "title": "Class 与 Style 绑定", "doc_id": "b6ae63a461fa4928b6b168ba4115acbd", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 797, "chunk_index": 32, "_doc_id": "32_7606014377440295118"}}
{"doc_id": "33_6119239768524189975", "text": "o\"<span><span>>Hi!</<span><span>p<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>Class 的绑定也是同样的：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>MyComponent<span><span> :<span><span>class<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>{ active: isActive }<span><span>\"<span><span> /><span><span><code><pre><div><p>当 <code>isActive<code> 为真时，", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/class-and-style.html", "title": "Class 与 Style 绑定", "doc_id": "b6ae63a461fa4928b6b168ba4115acbd", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 797, "chunk_index": 33, "_doc_id": "33_6119239768524189975"}}
{"doc_id": "34_7647309463507760555", "text": "ve: isActive }<span><span>\"<span><span> /><span><span><code><pre><div><p>当 <code>isActive<code> 为真时，被渲染的 HTML 会是：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>p<span><span> class<span><span>=<span><span>\"foo bar active\"<span><span>>Hi!</<span><span>p<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>如果你的组件有多个根元素，你将需要指定哪个根元素来接收这个 class。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/class-and-style.html", "title": "Class 与 Style 绑定", "doc_id": "b6ae63a461fa4928b6b168ba4115acbd", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 797, "chunk_index": 34, "_doc_id": "34_7647309463507760555"}}
{"doc_id": "35_8228835671453466807", "text": ">>Hi!</<span><span>p<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>如果你的组件有多个根元素，你将需要指定哪个根元素来接收这个 class。你可以通过组件的 <code>$attrs<code> 属性来指定接收的元素：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><!-- MyComponent 模板使用 $attrs 时 --><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/class-and-style.html", "title": "Class 与 Style 绑定", "doc_id": "b6ae63a461fa4928b6b168ba4115acbd", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 797, "chunk_index": 35, "_doc_id": "35_8228835671453466807"}}
{"doc_id": "36_4787616788578513299", "text": "github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><!-- MyComponent 模板使用 $attrs 时 --><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>p<span><span> :<span><span>class<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>$attrs.class<span><span>\"<span><span>>Hi!</<span><span>p<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>span<span><span>>This is a child component</<span><span>span<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/class-and-style.html", "title": "Class 与 Style 绑定", "doc_id": "b6ae63a461fa4928b6b168ba4115acbd", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 797, "chunk_index": 36, "_doc_id": "36_4787616788578513299"}}
{"doc_id": "37_2399916889092090752", "text": "><code><pre><div><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>MyComponent<span><span> class<span><span>=<span><span>\"baz\"<span><span> /><span><span><code><pre><div><p>这将被渲染为：<p><div class=\"language-html\"> <span class=\"lang\">html<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>p<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/class-and-style.html", "title": "Class 与 Style 绑定", "doc_id": "b6ae63a461fa4928b6b168ba4115acbd", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 797, "chunk_index": 37, "_doc_id": "37_2399916889092090752"}}
{"doc_id": "38_6152022432917372082", "text": "an><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>p<span><span> class<span><span>=<span><span>\"baz\"<span><span>>Hi!</<span><span>p<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>span<span><span>>This is a child component</<span><span>span<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>你可以在<a href=\"/guide/components/attrs.html\">透传 Attribute<a> 一章中了解更多组件的 attribute 继承的细节。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/class-and-style.html", "title": "Class 与 Style 绑定", "doc_id": "b6ae63a461fa4928b6b168ba4115acbd", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 797, "chunk_index": 38, "_doc_id": "38_6152022432917372082"}}
{"doc_id": "39_215732399877045740", "text": "><pre><div><p>你可以在<a href=\"/guide/components/attrs.html\">透传 Attribute<a> 一章中了解更多组件的 attribute 继承的细节。<p><h2 id=\"binding-inline-styles\">绑定内联样式 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#binding-inline-styles\">​<a><h2><h3 id=\"binding-to-objects-1\">绑定对象 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#binding-to-objects-1\">​<a><h3><p><code>:style<code> 支持绑定 JavaScript 对象值，", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/class-and-style.html", "title": "Class 与 Style 绑定", "doc_id": "b6ae63a461fa4928b6b168ba4115acbd", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 797, "chunk_index": 39, "_doc_id": "39_215732399877045740"}}
{"doc_id": "40_5839872693455214831", "text": "lass=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#binding-to-objects-1\">​<a><h3><p><code>:style<code> 支持绑定 JavaScript 对象值，对应的是 <a href=\"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/API/HTMLElement/style\" target=\"_blank\">HTML 元素的 <code>style<code> 属性<a>：<p><div class=\"composition-api\"><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> activeColor<span><span> =<span><span> ref<span><span>(<span><span>'red'<span><span>)<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/class-and-style.html", "title": "Class 与 Style 绑定", "doc_id": "b6ae63a461fa4928b6b168ba4115acbd", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 797, "chunk_index": 40, "_doc_id": "40_5839872693455214831"}}
{"doc_id": "41_4137301156453646092", "text": "n> activeColor<span><span> =<span><span> ref<span><span>(<span><span>'red'<span><span>)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> fontSize<span><span> =<span><span> ref<span><span>(<span><span>30<span><span>)<span><span><code><pre><div><div><div class=\"options-api\"><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>data<span><span>() {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> return<span><span> {<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/class-and-style.html", "title": "Class 与 Style 绑定", "doc_id": "b6ae63a461fa4928b6b168ba4115acbd", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 797, "chunk_index": 41, "_doc_id": "41_4137301156453646092"}}
{"doc_id": "42_1235746389411099524", "text": "\"><span>data<span><span>() {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> return<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> activeColor: <span><span>'red'<span><span>,<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> fontSize: <span><span>30<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/class-and-style.html", "title": "Class 与 Style 绑定", "doc_id": "b6ae63a461fa4928b6b168ba4115acbd", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 797, "chunk_index": 42, "_doc_id": "42_1235746389411099524"}}
{"doc_id": "43_1527930713507664282", "text": "an class=\"line\"><span> fontSize: <span><span>30<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span><code><pre><div><div><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>div<span><span> :<span><span>style<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>{ color: activeColor, fontSize: fontSize <span><span>+<span><span> 'px'<span><span> }<span><span>\"<span><span>></<span><span>div<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>尽管推荐使用 camelCase，", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/class-and-style.html", "title": "Class 与 Style 绑定", "doc_id": "b6ae63a461fa4928b6b168ba4115acbd", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 797, "chunk_index": 43, "_doc_id": "43_1527930713507664282"}}
{"doc_id": "44_591768097653500798", "text": "n><span>\"<span><span>></<span><span>div<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>尽管推荐使用 camelCase，但 <code>:style<code> 也支持 kebab-cased 形式的 CSS 属性 key (对应其 CSS 中的实际名称)，", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/class-and-style.html", "title": "Class 与 Style 绑定", "doc_id": "b6ae63a461fa4928b6b168ba4115acbd", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 797, "chunk_index": 44, "_doc_id": "44_591768097653500798"}}
{"doc_id": "45_7124227357941255259", "text": "><pre><div><p>尽管推荐使用 camelCase，但 <code>:style<code> 也支持 kebab-cased 形式的 CSS 属性 key (对应其 CSS 中的实际名称)，例如：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>div<span><span> :<span><span>style<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>{ <span><span>'font-size'<span><span>: fontSize <span><span>+<span><span> 'px'<span><span> }<span><span>\"<span><span>></<span><span>div<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>直接绑定一个样式对象通常是一个好主意，", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/class-and-style.html", "title": "Class 与 Style 绑定", "doc_id": "b6ae63a461fa4928b6b168ba4115acbd", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 797, "chunk_index": 45, "_doc_id": "45_7124227357941255259"}}
{"doc_id": "46_4403408135385569849", "text": "<span>\"<span><span>></<span><span>div<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>直接绑定一个样式对象通常是一个好主意，这样可以使模板更加简洁：<p><div class=\"composition-api\"><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> styleObject<span><span> =<span><span> reactive<span><span>({<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> color: <span><span>'red'<span><span>,<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> fontSize: <span><span>'30px'<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/class-and-style.html", "title": "Class 与 Style 绑定", "doc_id": "b6ae63a461fa4928b6b168ba4115acbd", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 797, "chunk_index": 46, "_doc_id": "46_4403408135385569849"}}
{"doc_id": "47_4200919410927391099", "text": "n>'red'<span><span>,<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> fontSize: <span><span>'30px'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>})<span><span><code><pre><div><div><div class=\"options-api\"><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>data<span><span>() {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> return<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> styleObject: {<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/class-and-style.html", "title": "Class 与 Style 绑定", "doc_id": "b6ae63a461fa4928b6b168ba4115acbd", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 797, "chunk_index": 47, "_doc_id": "47_4200919410927391099"}}
{"doc_id": "48_6388811846662402740", "text": "\"line\"><span> return<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> styleObject: {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> color: <span><span>'red'<span><span>,<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> fontSize: <span><span>'13px'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/class-and-style.html", "title": "Class 与 Style 绑定", "doc_id": "b6ae63a461fa4928b6b168ba4115acbd", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 797, "chunk_index": 48, "_doc_id": "48_6388811846662402740"}}
{"doc_id": "49_8733296471935972324", "text": ">'13px'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span><code><pre><div><div><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>div<span><span> :<span><span>style<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>styleObject<span><span>\"<span><span>></<span><span>div<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>同样的，如果样式对象需要更复杂的逻辑，也可以使用返回样式对象的计算属性。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/class-and-style.html", "title": "Class 与 Style 绑定", "doc_id": "b6ae63a461fa4928b6b168ba4115acbd", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 797, "chunk_index": 49, "_doc_id": "49_8733296471935972324"}}
{"doc_id": "50_7446600006379060854", "text": "n>></<span><span>div<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>同样的，如果样式对象需要更复杂的逻辑，也可以使用返回样式对象的计算属性。<p><p><code>:style<code> 指令也可以和常规的 style attribute 共存，就像 <code>:class<code>。<p><p>模板：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>h1<span><span> style<span><span>=<span><span>\"color: red\"<span><span> :<span><span>style<span><span>=<span><span>\"'font-size:", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/class-and-style.html", "title": "Class 与 Style 绑定", "doc_id": "b6ae63a461fa4928b6b168ba4115acbd", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 797, "chunk_index": 50, "_doc_id": "50_7446600006379060854"}}
{"doc_id": "51_3256130759419466465", "text": "<span>=<span><span>\"color: red\"<span><span> :<span><span>style<span><span>=<span><span>\"'font-size: 1em'\"<span><span>>hello</<span><span>h1<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>这将被渲染为：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>h1<span><span> style<span><span>=<span><span>\"color: red;", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/class-and-style.html", "title": "Class 与 Style 绑定", "doc_id": "b6ae63a461fa4928b6b168ba4115acbd", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 797, "chunk_index": 51, "_doc_id": "51_3256130759419466465"}}
{"doc_id": "52_7114089730802803478", "text": "ode><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>h1<span><span> style<span><span>=<span><span>\"color: red; font-size: 1em;\"<span><span>>hello</<span><span>h1<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><h3 id=\"binding-to-arrays-1\">绑定数组 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#binding-to-arrays-1\">​<a><h3><p>我们还可以给 <code>:style<code> 绑定一个包含多个样式对象的数组。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/class-and-style.html", "title": "Class 与 Style 绑定", "doc_id": "b6ae63a461fa4928b6b168ba4115acbd", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 797, "chunk_index": 52, "_doc_id": "52_7114089730802803478"}}
{"doc_id": "53_900614173093508062", "text": "ss=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#binding-to-arrays-1\">​<a><h3><p>我们还可以给 <code>:style<code> 绑定一个包含多个样式对象的数组。这些对象会被合并后渲染到同一元素上：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>div<span><span> :<span><span>style<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>[baseStyles,", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/class-and-style.html", "title": "Class 与 Style 绑定", "doc_id": "b6ae63a461fa4928b6b168ba4115acbd", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 797, "chunk_index": 53, "_doc_id": "53_900614173093508062"}}
{"doc_id": "54_6675886093697233482", "text": "n><<span><span>div<span><span> :<span><span>style<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>[baseStyles, overridingStyles]<span><span>\"<span><span>></<span><span>div<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><h3 id=\"auto-prefixing\">自动前缀 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#auto-prefixing\">​<a><h3><p>当你在 <code>:style<code> 中使用了需要<a href=\"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Glossary/Vendor_Prefix\" target=\"_blank\">浏览器特殊前缀<a>的 CSS 属性时，Vue 会自动为他们加上相应的前缀。Vue 是在运行时检查该属性是否支持在当前浏览器中使用。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/class-and-style.html", "title": "Class 与 Style 绑定", "doc_id": "b6ae63a461fa4928b6b168ba4115acbd", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 797, "chunk_index": 54, "_doc_id": "54_6675886093697233482"}}
{"doc_id": "55_5845254834841211503", "text": "ry/Vendor_Prefix\" target=\"_blank\">浏览器特殊前缀<a>的 CSS 属性时，Vue 会自动为他们加上相应的前缀。Vue 是在运行时检查该属性是否支持在当前浏览器中使用。如果浏览器不支持某个属性，那么将尝试加上各个浏览器特殊前缀，以找到哪一个是被支持的。<p><h3 id=\"multiple-values\">样式多值 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#multiple-values\">​<a><h3><p>你可以对一个样式属性提供多个 (不同前缀的) 值，", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/class-and-style.html", "title": "Class 与 Style 绑定", "doc_id": "b6ae63a461fa4928b6b168ba4115acbd", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 797, "chunk_index": 55, "_doc_id": "55_5845254834841211503"}}
{"doc_id": "56_661221664167252707", "text": "e-values\">样式多值 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#multiple-values\">​<a><h3><p>你可以对一个样式属性提供多个 (不同前缀的) 值，举例来说：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>div<span><span> :<span><span>style<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>{ display: [<span><span>'-webkit-box'<span><span>, <span><span>'-ms-flexbox'<span><span>, <span><span>'flex'<span><span>] }<span><span>\"<span><span>></<span><span>div<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>数组仅会渲染浏览器支持的最后一个值。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/class-and-style.html", "title": "Class 与 Style 绑定", "doc_id": "b6ae63a461fa4928b6b168ba4115acbd", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 797, "chunk_index": 56, "_doc_id": "56_661221664167252707"}}
{"doc_id": "57_7676311235780596640", "text": "><span>\"<span><span>></<span><span>div<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>数组仅会渲染浏览器支持的最后一个值。在这个示例中，在支持不需要特别前缀的浏览器中都会渲染为 <code>display: flex<code>。<p><div><div>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/class-and-style.html", "title": "Class 与 Style 绑定", "doc_id": "b6ae63a461fa4928b6b168ba4115acbd", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 797, "chunk_index": 57, "_doc_id": "57_7676311235780596640"}}
{"doc_id": "0_8747921959927936008", "text": "<div><div><h1 id=\"computed-properties\">计算属性 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#computed-properties\">​<a><h1><p class=\"options-api\"><p><p class=\"composition-api\"><p><h2 id=\"basic-example\">基础示例 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#basic-example\">​<a><h2><p>模板中的表达式虽然方便，但也只能用来做简单的操作。如果在模板中写太多逻辑，会让模板变得臃肿，难以维护。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/computed.html", "title": "计算属性", "doc_id": "f1692558a10846d4a5e80aa1bb6a8138", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1092, "chunk_index": 0, "_doc_id": "0_8747921959927936008"}}
{"doc_id": "1_4316772075221996246", "text": "\"header-anchor\" href=\"#basic-example\">​<a><h2><p>模板中的表达式虽然方便，但也只能用来做简单的操作。如果在模板中写太多逻辑，会让模板变得臃肿，难以维护。比如说，我们有这样一个包含嵌套数组的对象：<p><div class=\"options-api\"><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> data<span><span>() {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> return<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> author: {<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/computed.html", "title": "计算属性", "doc_id": "f1692558a10846d4a5e80aa1bb6a8138", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1092, "chunk_index": 1, "_doc_id": "1_4316772075221996246"}}
{"doc_id": "2_4208956270549611840", "text": "lass=\"line\"><span> return<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> author: {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> name: <span><span>'John Doe'<span><span>,<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> books: [<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> 'Vue 2 - Advanced Guide'<span><span>,<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> 'Vue 3 - Basic Guide'<span><span>,<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> 'Vue 4 - The Mystery'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> ]<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/computed.html", "title": "计算属性", "doc_id": "f1692558a10846d4a5e80aa1bb6a8138", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1092, "chunk_index": 2, "_doc_id": "2_4208956270549611840"}}
{"doc_id": "3_6356056935608821337", "text": "<span class=\"line\"><span> 'Vue 4 - The Mystery'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> ]<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/computed.html", "title": "计算属性", "doc_id": "f1692558a10846d4a5e80aa1bb6a8138", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1092, "chunk_index": 3, "_doc_id": "3_6356056935608821337"}}
{"doc_id": "4_1806864361566681434", "text": "span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span><code><pre><div><div><div class=\"composition-api\"><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> author<span><span> =<span><span> reactive<span><span>({<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> name: <span><span>'John Doe'<span><span>,<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/computed.html", "title": "计算属性", "doc_id": "f1692558a10846d4a5e80aa1bb6a8138", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1092, "chunk_index": 4, "_doc_id": "4_1806864361566681434"}}
{"doc_id": "5_2546314796080792266", "text": "span>({<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> name: <span><span>'John Doe'<span><span>,<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> books: [<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> 'Vue 2 - Advanced Guide'<span><span>,<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> 'Vue 3 - Basic Guide'<span><span>,<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> 'Vue 4 - The Mystery'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> ]<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/computed.html", "title": "计算属性", "doc_id": "f1692558a10846d4a5e80aa1bb6a8138", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1092, "chunk_index": 5, "_doc_id": "5_2546314796080792266"}}
{"doc_id": "6_8702547128432356421", "text": "<span class=\"line\"><span> 'Vue 4 - The Mystery'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> ]<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>})<span><span><code><pre><div><div><p>我们想根据 <code>author<code> 是否已有一些书籍来展示不同的信息：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>p<span><span>>Has published books:</<span><span>p<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/computed.html", "title": "计算属性", "doc_id": "f1692558a10846d4a5e80aa1bb6a8138", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1092, "chunk_index": 6, "_doc_id": "6_8702547128432356421"}}
{"doc_id": "7_1091096890288177795", "text": "line\"><span><<span><span>p<span><span>>Has published books:</<span><span>p<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>span<span><span>>{{ author.books.<span><span>length<span><span> ><span><span> 0<span><span> ?<span><span> 'Yes'<span><span> :<span><span> 'No'<span><span> }}</<span><span>span<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>这里的模板看起来有些复杂。我们必须认真看好一会儿才能明白它的计算依赖于 <code>author.books<code>。更重要的是，如果在模板中需要不止一次这样的计算，我们可不想将这样的代码在模板里重复好多遍。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/computed.html", "title": "计算属性", "doc_id": "f1692558a10846d4a5e80aa1bb6a8138", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1092, "chunk_index": 7, "_doc_id": "7_1091096890288177795"}}
{"doc_id": "8_7048719449776719791", "text": "起来有些复杂。我们必须认真看好一会儿才能明白它的计算依赖于 <code>author.books<code>。更重要的是，如果在模板中需要不止一次这样的计算，我们可不想将这样的代码在模板里重复好多遍。<p><p>因此我们推荐使用<strong>计算属性<strong>来描述依赖响应式状态的复杂逻辑。这是重构后的示例：<p><div class=\"options-api\"><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> data<span><span>() {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> return<span><span> {<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/computed.html", "title": "计算属性", "doc_id": "f1692558a10846d4a5e80aa1bb6a8138", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1092, "chunk_index": 8, "_doc_id": "8_7048719449776719791"}}
{"doc_id": "9_718183231410409088", "text": "><span> data<span><span>() {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> return<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> author: {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> name: <span><span>'John Doe'<span><span>,<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> books: [<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> 'Vue 2 - Advanced Guide'<span><span>,<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> 'Vue 3 - Basic Guide'<span><span>,<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> 'Vue 4 - The Mystery'<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/computed.html", "title": "计算属性", "doc_id": "f1692558a10846d4a5e80aa1bb6a8138", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1092, "chunk_index": 9, "_doc_id": "9_718183231410409088"}}
{"doc_id": "10_4220405707480590739", "text": "- Basic Guide'<span><span>,<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> 'Vue 4 - The Mystery'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> ]<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> },<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> computed: {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 一个计算属性的 getter<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> publishedBooksMessage<span><span>() {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // `this` 指向当前组件实例<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/computed.html", "title": "计算属性", "doc_id": "f1692558a10846d4a5e80aa1bb6a8138", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1092, "chunk_index": 10, "_doc_id": "10_4220405707480590739"}}
{"doc_id": "11_921164413558642939", "text": "edBooksMessage<span><span>() {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // `this` 指向当前组件实例<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> return<span><span> this<span><span>.author.books.<span><span>length<span><span> ><span><span> 0<span><span> ?<span><span> 'Yes'<span><span> :<span><span> 'No'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/computed.html", "title": "计算属性", "doc_id": "f1692558a10846d4a5e80aa1bb6a8138", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1092, "chunk_index": 11, "_doc_id": "11_921164413558642939"}}
{"doc_id": "12_8080142795668353787", "text": "n> 'No'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span><code><pre><div><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>p<span><span>>Has published books:</<span><span>p<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/computed.html", "title": "计算属性", "doc_id": "f1692558a10846d4a5e80aa1bb6a8138", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1092, "chunk_index": 12, "_doc_id": "12_8080142795668353787"}}
{"doc_id": "13_9162857921353604740", "text": "line\"><span><<span><span>p<span><span>>Has published books:</<span><span>p<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>span<span><span>>{{ publishedBooksMessage }}</<span><span>span<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p><a href=\"https://play.vuejs.", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/computed.html", "title": "计算属性", "doc_id": "f1692558a10846d4a5e80aa1bb6a8138", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1092, "chunk_index": 13, "_doc_id": "13_9162857921353604740"}}
{"doc_id": "14_4287938484602895871", "text": "Message }}</<span><span>span<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p><a href=\"https://play.vuejs.org/#\" target=\"_blank\">在演练场中尝试一下<a><p><p>我们在这里定义了一个计算属性 <code>publishedBooksMessage<code>。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/computed.html", "title": "计算属性", "doc_id": "f1692558a10846d4a5e80aa1bb6a8138", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1092, "chunk_index": 14, "_doc_id": "14_4287938484602895871"}}
{"doc_id": "15_2683177151092906610", "text": "WUwXYyi/gdTEpwK\" target=\"_blank\">在演练场中尝试一下<a><p><p>我们在这里定义了一个计算属性 <code>publishedBooksMessage<code>。<p><p>更改此应用的 <code>data<code> 中 <code>books<code> 数组的值后，可以看到 <code>publishedBooksMessage<code> 也会随之改变。<p><p>在模板中使用计算属性的方式和一般的属性并无二致。Vue 会检测到 <code>this.publishedBooksMessage<code> 依赖于 <code>this.author.books<code>，所以当 <code>this.author.books<code> 改变时，任何依赖于 <code>this.publishedBooksMessage<code> 的绑定都将同时更新。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/computed.html", "title": "计算属性", "doc_id": "f1692558a10846d4a5e80aa1bb6a8138", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1092, "chunk_index": 15, "_doc_id": "15_2683177151092906610"}}
{"doc_id": "16_5126003676220471726", "text": "<code>，所以当 <code>this.author.books<code> 改变时，任何依赖于 <code>this.publishedBooksMessage<code> 的绑定都将同时更新。<p><p>也可参考：<a href=\"/guide/typescript/options-api.html#typing-computed-properties\">为计算属性标记类型<a> <p><div><div class=\"composition-api\"><div class=\"language-vue\"> <span class=\"lang\">vue<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>script<span><span> setup<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/computed.html", "title": "计算属性", "doc_id": "f1692558a10846d4a5e80aa1bb6a8138", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1092, "chunk_index": 16, "_doc_id": "16_5126003676220471726"}}
{"doc_id": "17_6623832548334331738", "text": "code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>script<span><span> setup<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>import<span><span> { reactive, computed } <span><span>from<span><span> 'vue'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> author<span><span> =<span><span> reactive<span><span>({<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> name: <span><span>'John Doe'<span><span>,<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> books: [<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/computed.html", "title": "计算属性", "doc_id": "f1692558a10846d4a5e80aa1bb6a8138", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1092, "chunk_index": 17, "_doc_id": "17_6623832548334331738"}}
{"doc_id": "18_5679249734391261727", "text": "ame: <span><span>'John Doe'<span><span>,<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> books: [<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> 'Vue 2 - Advanced Guide'<span><span>,<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> 'Vue 3 - Basic Guide'<span><span>,<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> 'Vue 4 - The Mystery'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> ]<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>})<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 一个计算属性 ref<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/computed.html", "title": "计算属性", "doc_id": "f1692558a10846d4a5e80aa1bb6a8138", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1092, "chunk_index": 18, "_doc_id": "18_5679249734391261727"}}
{"doc_id": "19_8160868773829645784", "text": "\"><span>})<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 一个计算属性 ref<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> publishedBooksMessage<span><span> =<span><span> computed<span><span>(() <span><span>=><span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> return<span><span> author.books.<span><span>length<span><span> ><span><span> 0<span><span> ?<span><span> 'Yes'<span><span> :<span><span> 'No'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>})<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/computed.html", "title": "计算属性", "doc_id": "f1692558a10846d4a5e80aa1bb6a8138", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1092, "chunk_index": 19, "_doc_id": "19_8160868773829645784"}}
{"doc_id": "20_2829478163738591873", "text": "pan><span> 'Yes'<span><span> :<span><span> 'No'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>})<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>script<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>p<span><span>>Has published books:</<span><span>p<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>span<span><span>>{{ publishedBooksMessage }}</<span><span>span<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/computed.html", "title": "计算属性", "doc_id": "f1692558a10846d4a5e80aa1bb6a8138", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1092, "chunk_index": 20, "_doc_id": "20_2829478163738591873"}}
{"doc_id": "21_2038916159705264433", "text": "<span><span>span<span><span>>{{ publishedBooksMessage }}</<span><span>span<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p><a href=\"https://play.vuejs.", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/computed.html", "title": "计算属性", "doc_id": "f1692558a10846d4a5e80aa1bb6a8138", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1092, "chunk_index": 21, "_doc_id": "21_2038916159705264433"}}
{"doc_id": "22_2715362009013734211", "text": "<span></<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p><a href=\"https://play.vuejs.org/#\" target=\"_blank\">在演练场中尝试一下<a><p><p>我们在这里定义了一个计算属性 <code>publishedBooksMessage<code>。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/computed.html", "title": "计算属性", "doc_id": "f1692558a10846d4a5e80aa1bb6a8138", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1092, "chunk_index": 22, "_doc_id": "22_2715362009013734211"}}
{"doc_id": "23_7147320982767854876", "text": "DjvTfpfSBSbmA==\" target=\"_blank\">在演练场中尝试一下<a><p><p>我们在这里定义了一个计算属性 <code>publishedBooksMessage<code>。<code>computed()<code> 方法期望接收一个 <a href=\"https://developer.mozilla.org/zh-CN/docs/Web/JavaScript/Reference/Functions/get#description\" target=\"_blank\">getter 函数<a>，返回值为一个<strong>计算属性 ref<strong>。和其他一般的 ref 类似，你可以通过 <code>publishedBooksMessage.value<code> 访问计算结果。计算属性 ref 也会在模板中自动解包，因此在模板表达式中引用时无需添加 <code>.value<code>。<p><p>Vue 的计算属性会自动追踪响应式依赖。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/computed.html", "title": "计算属性", "doc_id": "f1692558a10846d4a5e80aa1bb6a8138", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1092, "chunk_index": 23, "_doc_id": "23_7147320982767854876"}}
{"doc_id": "24_4423360439704453304", "text": "alue<code> 访问计算结果。计算属性 ref 也会在模板中自动解包，因此在模板表达式中引用时无需添加 <code>.value<code>。<p><p>Vue 的计算属性会自动追踪响应式依赖。它会检测到 <code>publishedBooksMessage<code> 依赖于 <code>author.books<code>，所以当 <code>author.books<code> 改变时，任何依赖于 <code>publishedBooksMessage<code> 的绑定都会同时更新。<p><p>也可参考：<a href=\"/guide/typescript/composition-api.html#typing-computed\">为计算属性标注类型<a> <p><div><h2 id=\"computed-caching-vs-methods\">计算属性缓存 vs 方法 <a class=\"header-anchor\"", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/computed.html", "title": "计算属性", "doc_id": "f1692558a10846d4a5e80aa1bb6a8138", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1092, "chunk_index": 24, "_doc_id": "24_4423360439704453304"}}
{"doc_id": "25_375303460169330829", "text": "ed\">为计算属性标注类型<a> <p><div><h2 id=\"computed-caching-vs-methods\">计算属性缓存 vs 方法 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#computed-caching-vs-methods\">​<a><h2><p>你可能注意到我们在表达式中像这样调用一个函数也会获得和计算属性相同的结果：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>p<span><span>>{{ <span><span>calculateBooksMessage<span><span>() }}</<span><span>p<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><div class=\"options-api\"><div class=\"language-js\">", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/computed.html", "title": "计算属性", "doc_id": "f1692558a10846d4a5e80aa1bb6a8138", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1092, "chunk_index": 25, "_doc_id": "25_375303460169330829"}}
{"doc_id": "26_4839627209069531283", "text": "><span>p<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><div class=\"options-api\"><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// 组件中<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>methods<span><span>: {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> calculateBooksMessage<span><span>() {<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/computed.html", "title": "计算属性", "doc_id": "f1692558a10846d4a5e80aa1bb6a8138", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1092, "chunk_index": 26, "_doc_id": "26_4839627209069531283"}}
{"doc_id": "27_1431006813545185279", "text": "n><span>: {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> calculateBooksMessage<span><span>() {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> return<span><span> this<span><span>.author.books.<span><span>length<span><span> ><span><span> 0<span><span> ?<span><span> 'Yes'<span><span> :<span><span> 'No'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/computed.html", "title": "计算属性", "doc_id": "f1692558a10846d4a5e80aa1bb6a8138", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1092, "chunk_index": 27, "_doc_id": "27_1431006813545185279"}}
{"doc_id": "28_7282149679115340910", "text": "pan><span> 'Yes'<span><span> :<span><span> 'No'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span><code><pre><div><div><div class=\"composition-api\"><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// 组件中<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>function<span><span> calculateBooksMessage<span><span>() {<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/computed.html", "title": "计算属性", "doc_id": "f1692558a10846d4a5e80aa1bb6a8138", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1092, "chunk_index": 28, "_doc_id": "28_7282149679115340910"}}
{"doc_id": "29_3206505109860265433", "text": "an>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>function<span><span> calculateBooksMessage<span><span>() {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> return<span><span> author.books.<span><span>length<span><span> ><span><span> 0<span><span> ?<span><span> 'Yes'<span><span> :<span><span> 'No'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span><code><pre><div><div><p>若我们将同样的函数定义为一个方法而不是计算属性，两种方式在结果上确实是完全相同的，然而，不同之处在于<strong>计算属性值会基于其响应式依赖被缓存<strong>。一个计算属性仅会在其响应式依赖更新时才重新计算。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/computed.html", "title": "计算属性", "doc_id": "f1692558a10846d4a5e80aa1bb6a8138", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1092, "chunk_index": 29, "_doc_id": "29_3206505109860265433"}}
{"doc_id": "30_3808789998756236633", "text": "数定义为一个方法而不是计算属性，两种方式在结果上确实是完全相同的，然而，不同之处在于<strong>计算属性值会基于其响应式依赖被缓存<strong>。一个计算属性仅会在其响应式依赖更新时才重新计算。这意味着只要 <code>author.books<code> 不改变，无论多少次访问 <code>publishedBooksMessage<code> 都会立即返回先前的计算结果，而不用重复执行 getter 函数。<p><p>这也解释了为什么下面的计算属性永远不会更新，因为 <code>Date.now()<code> 并不是一个响应式依赖：<p><div class=\"options-api\"><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>computed<span><span>: {<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/computed.html", "title": "计算属性", "doc_id": "f1692558a10846d4a5e80aa1bb6a8138", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1092, "chunk_index": 30, "_doc_id": "30_3808789998756236633"}}
{"doc_id": "31_3871109735655322033", "text": "lass=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>computed<span><span>: {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> now<span><span>() {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> return<span><span> Date.<span><span>now<span><span>()<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/computed.html", "title": "计算属性", "doc_id": "f1692558a10846d4a5e80aa1bb6a8138", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1092, "chunk_index": 31, "_doc_id": "31_3871109735655322033"}}
{"doc_id": "32_7185799299171790276", "text": "<span><span> Date.<span><span>now<span><span>()<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span><code><pre><div><div><div class=\"composition-api\"><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> now<span><span> =<span><span> computed<span><span>(() <span><span>=><span><span> Date.<span><span>now<span><span>())<span><span><code><pre><div><div><p>相比之下，方法调用<strong>总是<strong>会在重渲染发生时再次执行函数。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/computed.html", "title": "计算属性", "doc_id": "f1692558a10846d4a5e80aa1bb6a8138", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1092, "chunk_index": 32, "_doc_id": "32_7185799299171790276"}}
{"doc_id": "33_1402138535703335782", "text": "pan>now<span><span>())<span><span><code><pre><div><div><p>相比之下，方法调用<strong>总是<strong>会在重渲染发生时再次执行函数。<p><p>为什么需要缓存呢？想象一下我们有一个非常耗性能的计算属性 <code>list<code>，需要循环一个巨大的数组并做许多计算逻辑，并且可能也有其他计算属性依赖于 <code>list<code>。没有缓存的话，我们会重复执行非常多次 <code>list<code> 的 getter，然而这实际上没有必要！如果你确定不需要缓存，那么也可以使用方法调用。<p><h2 id=\"writable-computed\">可写计算属性 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#writable-computed\">​<a><h2><p>计算属性默认是只读的。当你尝试修改一个计算属性时，你会收到一个运行时警告。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/computed.html", "title": "计算属性", "doc_id": "f1692558a10846d4a5e80aa1bb6a8138", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1092, "chunk_index": 33, "_doc_id": "33_1402138535703335782"}}
{"doc_id": "34_884928869836783308", "text": "<a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#writable-computed\">​<a><h2><p>计算属性默认是只读的。当你尝试修改一个计算属性时，你会收到一个运行时警告。只在某些特殊场景中你可能才需要用到“可写”的属性，你可以通过同时提供 getter 和 setter 来创建：<p><div class=\"options-api\"><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> data<span><span>() {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> return<span><span> {<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/computed.html", "title": "计算属性", "doc_id": "f1692558a10846d4a5e80aa1bb6a8138", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1092, "chunk_index": 34, "_doc_id": "34_884928869836783308"}}
{"doc_id": "35_1386353008684130704", "text": "><span> data<span><span>() {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> return<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> firstName: <span><span>'John'<span><span>,<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> lastName: <span><span>'Doe'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> },<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> computed: {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> fullName: {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // getter<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/computed.html", "title": "计算属性", "doc_id": "f1692558a10846d4a5e80aa1bb6a8138", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1092, "chunk_index": 35, "_doc_id": "35_1386353008684130704"}}
{"doc_id": "36_8439338464033068554", "text": ">\n<span class=\"line\"><span> fullName: {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // getter<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> get<span><span>() {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> return<span><span> this<span><span>.firstName <span><span>+<span><span> ' '<span><span> +<span><span> this<span><span>.lastName<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> },<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // setter<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> set<span><span>(<span><span>newValue<span><span>) {<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/computed.html", "title": "计算属性", "doc_id": "f1692558a10846d4a5e80aa1bb6a8138", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1092, "chunk_index": 36, "_doc_id": "36_8439338464033068554"}}
{"doc_id": "37_2563644795412381534", "text": "an><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> set<span><span>(<span><span>newValue<span><span>) {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 注意：我们这里使用的是解构赋值语法<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> [<span><span>this<span><span>.firstName, <span><span>this<span><span>.lastName] <span><span>=<span><span> newValue.<span><span>split<span><span>(<span><span>' '<span><span>)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/computed.html", "title": "计算属性", "doc_id": "f1692558a10846d4a5e80aa1bb6a8138", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1092, "chunk_index": 37, "_doc_id": "37_2563644795412381534"}}
{"doc_id": "38_3715094018363342917", "text": "span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span><code><pre><div><p>现在当你再运行 <code>this.fullName = 'John Doe'<code> 时，setter 会被调用而 <code>this.firstName<code> 和 <code>this.lastName<code> 会随之更新。<p><div><div class=\"composition-api\"><div class=\"language-vue\"> <span class=\"lang\">vue<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>script<span><span> setup<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/computed.html", "title": "计算属性", "doc_id": "f1692558a10846d4a5e80aa1bb6a8138", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1092, "chunk_index": 38, "_doc_id": "38_3715094018363342917"}}
{"doc_id": "39_6084024540999655736", "text": "code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>script<span><span> setup<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>import<span><span> { ref, computed } <span><span>from<span><span> 'vue'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> firstName<span><span> =<span><span> ref<span><span>(<span><span>'John'<span><span>)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> lastName<span><span> =<span><span> ref<span><span>(<span><span>'Doe'<span><span>)<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/computed.html", "title": "计算属性", "doc_id": "f1692558a10846d4a5e80aa1bb6a8138", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1092, "chunk_index": 39, "_doc_id": "39_6084024540999655736"}}
{"doc_id": "40_2804647995560980824", "text": "span> lastName<span><span> =<span><span> ref<span><span>(<span><span>'Doe'<span><span>)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> fullName<span><span> =<span><span> computed<span><span>({<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // getter<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> get<span><span>() {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> return<span><span> firstName.value <span><span>+<span><span> ' '<span><span> +<span><span> lastName.value<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/computed.html", "title": "计算属性", "doc_id": "f1692558a10846d4a5e80aa1bb6a8138", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1092, "chunk_index": 40, "_doc_id": "40_2804647995560980824"}}
{"doc_id": "41_6572832365277195609", "text": "firstName.value <span><span>+<span><span> ' '<span><span> +<span><span> lastName.value<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> },<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // setter<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> set<span><span>(<span><span>newValue<span><span>) {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 注意：我们这里使用的是解构赋值语法<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> [firstName.value, lastName.value] <span><span>=<span><span> newValue.<span><span>split<span><span>(<span><span>' '<span><span>)<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/computed.html", "title": "计算属性", "doc_id": "f1692558a10846d4a5e80aa1bb6a8138", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1092, "chunk_index": 41, "_doc_id": "41_6572832365277195609"}}
{"doc_id": "42_6824558876027202291", "text": "<span>=<span><span> newValue.<span><span>split<span><span>(<span><span>' '<span><span>)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>})<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>script<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>现在当你再运行 <code>fullName.value = 'John Doe'<code> 时，setter 会被调用而 <code>firstName<code> 和 <code>lastName<code> 会随之更新。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/computed.html", "title": "计算属性", "doc_id": "f1692558a10846d4a5e80aa1bb6a8138", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1092, "chunk_index": 42, "_doc_id": "42_6824558876027202291"}}
{"doc_id": "43_6394628892031984629", "text": "fullName.value = 'John Doe'<code> 时，setter 会被调用而 <code>firstName<code> 和 <code>lastName<code> 会随之更新。<p><div><h2 id=\"previous\">获取上一个值 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#previous\">​<a><h2><p class=\"options-api\"> 如果需要，可以通过访问计算属性的 getter 的第二个参数来获取计算属性返回的上一个值： <p><p class=\"composition-api\"> 如果需要，可以通过访问计算属性的 getter 的第一个参数来获取计算属性返回的上一个值： <p><div class=\"options-api\"><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/computed.html", "title": "计算属性", "doc_id": "f1692558a10846d4a5e80aa1bb6a8138", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1092, "chunk_index": 43, "_doc_id": "43_6394628892031984629"}}
