{"doc_id": "45_3612174345236722428", "text": "ted: {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 这个计算属性在 count 的值小于或等于 3 时，将返回 count 的值。<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 当 count 的值大于等于 4 时，将会返回满足我们条件的最后一个值<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 直到 count 的值再次小于或等于 3 为止。<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> alwaysSmall<span><span>(<span><span>_<span><span>, <span><span>previous<span><span>) {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> if<span><span> (<span><span>this<span><span>.count <span><span><=<span><span> 3<span><span>) {<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/computed.html", "title": "计算属性", "doc_id": "f1692558a10846d4a5e80aa1bb6a8138", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1092, "chunk_index": 45, "_doc_id": "45_3612174345236722428"}}
