{"doc_id": "48_7908181079647903077", "text": "n><span> { ref, computed } <span><span>from<span><span> 'vue'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> count<span><span> =<span><span> ref<span><span>(<span><span>2<span><span>)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 这个计算属性在 count 的值小于或等于 3 时，将返回 count 的值。<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 当 count 的值大于等于 4 时，将会返回满足我们条件的最后一个值<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 直到 count 的值再次小于或等于 3 为止。<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/computed.html", "title": "计算属性", "doc_id": "f1692558a10846d4a5e80aa1bb6a8138", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1092, "chunk_index": 48, "_doc_id": "48_7908181079647903077"}}
{"doc_id": "49_1823486151904222035", "text": "于 4 时，将会返回满足我们条件的最后一个值<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 直到 count 的值再次小于或等于 3 为止。<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> alwaysSmall<span><span> =<span><span> computed<span><span>((<span><span>previous<span><span>) <span><span>=><span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> if<span><span> (count.value <span><span><=<span><span> 3<span><span>) {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> return<span><span> count.value<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/computed.html", "title": "计算属性", "doc_id": "f1692558a10846d4a5e80aa1bb6a8138", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1092, "chunk_index": 49, "_doc_id": "49_1823486151904222035"}}
{"doc_id": "50_1250944529414622753", "text": "ss=\"line\"><span> return<span><span> count.value<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> return<span><span> previous<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>})<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/computed.html", "title": "计算属性", "doc_id": "f1692558a10846d4a5e80aa1bb6a8138", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1092, "chunk_index": 50, "_doc_id": "50_1250944529414622753"}}
