{"doc_id": "54_3717029525594921996", "text": "his<span><span>.count<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> return<span><span> previous;<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> },<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> set<span><span>(<span><span>newValue<span><span>) {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> this<span><span>.count <span><span>=<span><span> newValue <span><span>*<span><span> 2<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/computed.html", "title": "计算属性", "doc_id": "f1692558a10846d4a5e80aa1bb6a8138", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1092, "chunk_index": 54, "_doc_id": "54_3717029525594921996"}}
