{"doc_id": "56_7162133922029801000", "text": "code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>script<span><span> setup<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>import<span><span> { ref, computed } <span><span>from<span><span> 'vue'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> count<span><span> =<span><span> ref<span><span>(<span><span>2<span><span>)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> alwaysSmall<span><span> =<span><span> computed<span><span>({<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/computed.html", "title": "计算属性", "doc_id": "f1692558a10846d4a5e80aa1bb6a8138", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1092, "chunk_index": 56, "_doc_id": "56_7162133922029801000"}}
{"doc_id": "57_8307880236792320205", "text": "e\"><span>const<span><span> alwaysSmall<span><span> =<span><span> computed<span><span>({<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> get<span><span>(<span><span>previous<span><span>) {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> if<span><span> (count.value <span><span><=<span><span> 3<span><span>) {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> return<span><span> count.value<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> return<span><span> previous<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/computed.html", "title": "计算属性", "doc_id": "f1692558a10846d4a5e80aa1bb6a8138", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1092, "chunk_index": 57, "_doc_id": "57_8307880236792320205"}}
{"doc_id": "58_7585717756248239196", "text": "><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> return<span><span> previous<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> },<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> set<span><span>(<span><span>newValue<span><span>) {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> count.value <span><span>=<span><span> newValue <span><span>*<span><span> 2<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>})<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/computed.html", "title": "计算属性", "doc_id": "f1692558a10846d4a5e80aa1bb6a8138", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1092, "chunk_index": 58, "_doc_id": "58_7585717756248239196"}}
{"doc_id": "59_6836656599464056615", "text": "span> 2<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>})<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>script<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><div><h2 id=\"best-practices\">最佳实践 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#best-practices\">​<a><h2><h3 id=\"getters-should-be-side-effect-free\">Getter 不应有副作用 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#getters-should-be-side-effect-free\">​<a><h3><p>计算属性的 getter 应只做计算而没有任何其他的副作用，这一点非常重要，请务必牢记。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/computed.html", "title": "计算属性", "doc_id": "f1692558a10846d4a5e80aa1bb6a8138", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1092, "chunk_index": 59, "_doc_id": "59_6836656599464056615"}}
{"doc_id": "60_2745072022843477912", "text": "\" href=\"#getters-should-be-side-effect-free\">​<a><h3><p>计算属性的 getter 应只做计算而没有任何其他的副作用，这一点非常重要，请务必牢记。举例来说，<strong>不要改变其他状态、在 getter 中做异步请求或者更改 DOM<strong>！一个计算属性的声明中描述的是如何根据其他值派生一个值。因此 getter 的职责应该仅为计算和返回该值。在之后的指引中我们会讨论如何使用<a href=\"./watchers.html\">侦听器<a>根据其他响应式状态的变更来创建副作用。<p><h3 id=\"avoid-mutating-computed-value\">避免直接修改计算属性值 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#avoid-mutating-computed-value\">​<a><h3><p>从计算属性返回的值是派生状态。可以把它看作是一个“临时快照”，每当源状态发生变化时，就会创建一个新的快照。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/computed.html", "title": "计算属性", "doc_id": "f1692558a10846d4a5e80aa1bb6a8138", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1092, "chunk_index": 60, "_doc_id": "60_2745072022843477912"}}
{"doc_id": "61_2184661166779394966", "text": "ef=\"#avoid-mutating-computed-value\">​<a><h3><p>从计算属性返回的值是派生状态。可以把它看作是一个“临时快照”，每当源状态发生变化时，就会创建一个新的快照。更改快照是没有意义的，因此计算属性的返回值应该被视为只读的，并且永远不应该被更改——应该更新它所依赖的源状态以触发新的计算。<p><div><div>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/computed.html", "title": "计算属性", "doc_id": "f1692558a10846d4a5e80aa1bb6a8138", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1092, "chunk_index": 61, "_doc_id": "61_2184661166779394966"}}
{"doc_id": "0_3584387159555560064", "text": "<div><div><h1 id=\"single-file-components\">单文件组件 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#single-file-components\">​<a><h1><h2 id=\"introduction\">介绍 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#introduction\">​<a><h2><p>Vue 的单文件组件 (即 <code>*.vue<code> 文件，英文 Single-File Component，简称 <strong>SFC<strong>) 是一种特殊的文件格式，使我们能够将一个 Vue 组件的模板、逻辑与样式封装在单个文件中。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/scaling-up/sfc.html", "title": "单文件组件", "doc_id": "98bc0b04ccf24ea1a755957cc97479d5", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 256, "chunk_index": 0, "_doc_id": "0_3584387159555560064"}}
{"doc_id": "1_5904563641090635914", "text": "de> 文件，英文 Single-File Component，简称 <strong>SFC<strong>) 是一种特殊的文件格式，使我们能够将一个 Vue 组件的模板、逻辑与样式封装在单个文件中。下面是一个单文件组件的示例：<p><div class=\"options-api\"><div class=\"language-vue\"> <span class=\"lang\">vue<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>script<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> data<span><span>() {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> return<span><span> {<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/scaling-up/sfc.html", "title": "单文件组件", "doc_id": "98bc0b04ccf24ea1a755957cc97479d5", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 256, "chunk_index": 1, "_doc_id": "1_5904563641090635914"}}
{"doc_id": "2_676455179148210906", "text": "><span> data<span><span>() {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> return<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> greeting: <span><span>'Hello World!'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>script<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/scaling-up/sfc.html", "title": "单文件组件", "doc_id": "98bc0b04ccf24ea1a755957cc97479d5", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 256, "chunk_index": 2, "_doc_id": "2_676455179148210906"}}
{"doc_id": "3_6090515951954311560", "text": ">\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>p<span><span> class<span><span>=<span><span>\"greeting\"<span><span>>{{ greeting }}</<span><span>p<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>style<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>.greeting<span><span> {<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/scaling-up/sfc.html", "title": "单文件组件", "doc_id": "98bc0b04ccf24ea1a755957cc97479d5", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 256, "chunk_index": 3, "_doc_id": "3_6090515951954311560"}}
{"doc_id": "4_4212903995423187599", "text": "n><span>style<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>.greeting<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> color<span><span>: <span><span>red<span><span>;<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> font-weight<span><span>: <span><span>bold<span><span>;<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/scaling-up/sfc.html", "title": "单文件组件", "doc_id": "98bc0b04ccf24ea1a755957cc97479d5", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 256, "chunk_index": 4, "_doc_id": "4_4212903995423187599"}}
{"doc_id": "5_4813006113887291885", "text": "eight<span><span>: <span><span>bold<span><span>;<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>style<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><div><div class=\"composition-api\"><div class=\"language-vue\"> <span class=\"lang\">vue<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>script<span><span> setup<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>import<span><span> { ref } <span><span>from<span><span> 'vue'<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/scaling-up/sfc.html", "title": "单文件组件", "doc_id": "98bc0b04ccf24ea1a755957cc97479d5", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 256, "chunk_index": 5, "_doc_id": "5_4813006113887291885"}}
{"doc_id": "6_60222202543017870", "text": "<span class=\"line\"><span>import<span><span> { ref } <span><span>from<span><span> 'vue'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> greeting<span><span> =<span><span> ref<span><span>(<span><span>'Hello World!'<span><span>)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>script<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/scaling-up/sfc.html", "title": "单文件组件", "doc_id": "98bc0b04ccf24ea1a755957cc97479d5", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 256, "chunk_index": 6, "_doc_id": "6_60222202543017870"}}
{"doc_id": "7_6090515951954311560", "text": ">\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>p<span><span> class<span><span>=<span><span>\"greeting\"<span><span>>{{ greeting }}</<span><span>p<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>style<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>.greeting<span><span> {<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/scaling-up/sfc.html", "title": "单文件组件", "doc_id": "98bc0b04ccf24ea1a755957cc97479d5", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 256, "chunk_index": 7, "_doc_id": "7_6090515951954311560"}}
{"doc_id": "8_2153783516035028828", "text": "n><span>style<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>.greeting<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> color<span><span>: <span><span>red<span><span>;<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> font-weight<span><span>: <span><span>bold<span><span>;<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>style<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><div><p>如你所见，Vue 的单文件组件是网页开发中 HTML、CSS 和 JavaScript 三种语言经典组合的自然延伸。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/scaling-up/sfc.html", "title": "单文件组件", "doc_id": "98bc0b04ccf24ea1a755957cc97479d5", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 256, "chunk_index": 8, "_doc_id": "8_2153783516035028828"}}
{"doc_id": "9_1504590802246030107", "text": "span>><span><span><code><pre><div><div><p>如你所见，Vue 的单文件组件是网页开发中 HTML、CSS 和 JavaScript 三种语言经典组合的自然延伸。<code><template><code>、<code><script><code> 和 <code><style><code> 三个块在同一个文件中封装、组合了组件的视图、逻辑和样式。完整的语法定义可以查阅<a href=\"/api/sfc-spec.html\">单文件组件语法说明<a>。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/scaling-up/sfc.html", "title": "单文件组件", "doc_id": "98bc0b04ccf24ea1a755957cc97479d5", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 256, "chunk_index": 9, "_doc_id": "9_1504590802246030107"}}
{"doc_id": "10_7264279733046433801", "text": "code><style><code> 三个块在同一个文件中封装、组合了组件的视图、逻辑和样式。完整的语法定义可以查阅<a href=\"/api/sfc-spec.html\">单文件组件语法说明<a>。<p><h2 id=\"why-sfc\">为什么要使用单文件组件 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#why-sfc\">​<a><h2><p>使用单文件组件必须使用构建工具，但作为回报带来了以下优点：<p><p>单文件组件是 Vue 框架提供的一个功能，并且在下列场景中都是官方推荐的项目组织方式：<p><ul><li>单页面应用 (SPA)<li><li>静态站点生成 (SSG)<li><li>任何值得引入构建步骤以获得更好的开发体验 (DX) 的项目<li><ul><p>当然，在一些轻量级场景下使用单文件组件会显得有些杀鸡用牛刀。因此 Vue 同样也可以在无构建步骤的情况下以纯 JavaScript 方式使用。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/scaling-up/sfc.html", "title": "单文件组件", "doc_id": "98bc0b04ccf24ea1a755957cc97479d5", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 256, "chunk_index": 10, "_doc_id": "10_7264279733046433801"}}
{"doc_id": "11_4177514796086955104", "text": "获得更好的开发体验 (DX) 的项目<li><ul><p>当然，在一些轻量级场景下使用单文件组件会显得有些杀鸡用牛刀。因此 Vue 同样也可以在无构建步骤的情况下以纯 JavaScript 方式使用。如果你的用例只需要给静态 HTML 添加一些简单的交互，你可以看看 <a href=\"https://github.com/vuejs/petite-vue\" target=\"_blank\">petite-vue<a>，它是一个 6 kB 左右、预优化过的 Vue 子集，更适合渐进式增强的需求。<p><h2 id=\"how-it-works\">单文件组件是如何工作的 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#how-it-works\">​<a><h2><p>Vue 单文件组件是一个框架指定的文件格式，因此必须交由 <a href=\"https://github.com/vuejs/core/tree/main/packages/compiler-sfc\" target=\"_blank\">@vue/compiler-sfc<a> 编译为标准的 JavaScript 和 CSS，", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/scaling-up/sfc.html", "title": "单文件组件", "doc_id": "98bc0b04ccf24ea1a755957cc97479d5", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 256, "chunk_index": 11, "_doc_id": "11_4177514796086955104"}}
{"doc_id": "12_4669932154311836796", "text": "/core/tree/main/packages/compiler-sfc\" target=\"_blank\">@vue/compiler-sfc<a> 编译为标准的 JavaScript 和 CSS，一个编译后的单文件组件是一个标准的 JavaScript(ES) 模块，这也意味着在构建配置正确的前提下，你可以像导入其他 ES 模块一样导入单文件组件：<p><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>import<span><span> MyComponent <span><span>from<span><span> './MyComponent.vue'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/scaling-up/sfc.html", "title": "单文件组件", "doc_id": "98bc0b04ccf24ea1a755957cc97479d5", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 256, "chunk_index": 12, "_doc_id": "12_4669932154311836796"}}
{"doc_id": "13_7593979449652273742", "text": "n class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> components: {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> MyComponent<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span><code><pre><div><p>单文件组件中的 <code><style><code> 标签一般会在开发时注入成原生的 <code><style><code> 标签以支持热更新，而生产环境下它们会被抽取、合并成单独的 CSS 文件。<p><p>你可以在 <a href=\"https://play.vuejs.org/\" target=\"_blank\">Vue 单文件组件演练场<a>中实际使用一下单文件组件，同时可以看到它们最终被编译后的样子。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/scaling-up/sfc.html", "title": "单文件组件", "doc_id": "98bc0b04ccf24ea1a755957cc97479d5", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 256, "chunk_index": 13, "_doc_id": "13_7593979449652273742"}}
{"doc_id": "14_2668162872365937160", "text": "可以在 <a href=\"https://play.vuejs.org/\" target=\"_blank\">Vue 单文件组件演练场<a>中实际使用一下单文件组件，同时可以看到它们最终被编译后的样子。<p><p>在实际项目中，我们一般会使用集成了单文件组件编译器的构建工具，比如 <a href=\"https://cn.vitejs.dev/\" target=\"_blank\">Vite<a> 或者 <a href=\"https://cli.vuejs.org/zh/\" target=\"_blank\">Vue CLI<a> (基于 <a href=\"https://webpack.js.org/\" target=\"_blank\">webpack<a>)，Vue 官方也提供了脚手架工具来帮助你尽可能快速地上手开发单文件组件。更多细节请查看<a href=\"/guide/scaling-up/tooling.html\">单文件组件工具链<a>章节。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/scaling-up/sfc.html", "title": "单文件组件", "doc_id": "98bc0b04ccf24ea1a755957cc97479d5", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 256, "chunk_index": 14, "_doc_id": "14_2668162872365937160"}}
{"doc_id": "15_1891549839648477526", "text": ">)，Vue 官方也提供了脚手架工具来帮助你尽可能快速地上手开发单文件组件。更多细节请查看<a href=\"/guide/scaling-up/tooling.html\">单文件组件工具链<a>章节。<p><h2 id=\"what-about-separation-of-concerns\">如何看待关注点分离？ <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#what-about-separation-of-concerns\">​<a><h2><p>一些有着传统 Web 开发背景的用户可能会因为单文件组件将不同的关注点集合在一处而有所顾虑，觉得 HTML/CSS/JS 应当是分离开的！<p><p>要回答这个问题，我们必须对这一点达成共识：<strong>前端开发的关注点不是完全基于文件类型分离的<strong>。前端工程化的最终目的都是为了能够更好地维护代码。关注点分离不应该是教条式地将其视为文件类型的区别和分离，仅仅这样并不够帮我们在日益复杂的前端应用的背景下提高开发效率。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/scaling-up/sfc.html", "title": "单文件组件", "doc_id": "98bc0b04ccf24ea1a755957cc97479d5", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 256, "chunk_index": 15, "_doc_id": "15_1891549839648477526"}}
{"doc_id": "16_5012689592418377534", "text": "于文件类型分离的<strong>。前端工程化的最终目的都是为了能够更好地维护代码。关注点分离不应该是教条式地将其视为文件类型的区别和分离，仅仅这样并不够帮我们在日益复杂的前端应用的背景下提高开发效率。<p><p>在现代的 UI 开发中，我们发现与其将代码库划分为三个巨大的层，相互交织在一起，不如将它们划分为松散耦合的组件，再按需组合起来。在一个组件中，其模板、逻辑和样式本就是有内在联系的、是耦合的，将它们放在一起，实际上使组件更有内聚性和可维护性。<p><p>即使你不喜欢单文件组件这样的形式而仍然选择拆分单独的 JavaScript 和 CSS 文件，也没关系，你还是可以通过<a href=\"/api/sfc-spec.html#src-imports\">资源导入<a>功能获得热更新和预编译等功能的支持。<p><div><div>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/scaling-up/sfc.html", "title": "单文件组件", "doc_id": "98bc0b04ccf24ea1a755957cc97479d5", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 256, "chunk_index": 16, "_doc_id": "16_5012689592418377534"}}
{"doc_id": "0_5709068416316787050", "text": "<div><div><h1 id=\"conditional-rendering\">条件渲染 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#conditional-rendering\">​<a><h1><h2 id=\"v-if\"><code>v-if<code> <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#v-if\">​<a><h2><p><code>v-if<code> 指令用于条件性地渲染一块内容。这块内容只会在指令的表达式返回真值时才被渲染。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/conditional.html", "title": "条件渲染", "doc_id": "8fc32b4ed0d9489b83f54ca432318e18", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 231, "chunk_index": 0, "_doc_id": "0_5709068416316787050"}}
{"doc_id": "1_6077545550877399793", "text": "lass=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#v-if\">​<a><h2><p><code>v-if<code> 指令用于条件性地渲染一块内容。这块内容只会在指令的表达式返回真值时才被渲染。<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>h1<span><span> v-if<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>awesome<span><span>\"<span><span>>Vue is awesome!</<span><span>h1<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><h2 id=\"v-else\"><code>v-else<code> <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#v-else\">​<a><h2><p>你也可以使用 <code>v-else<code> 为 <code>v-if<code> 添加一个“else 区块”。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/conditional.html", "title": "条件渲染", "doc_id": "8fc32b4ed0d9489b83f54ca432318e18", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 231, "chunk_index": 1, "_doc_id": "1_6077545550877399793"}}
{"doc_id": "2_1086228263200433639", "text": "header-anchor\" href=\"#v-else\">​<a><h2><p>你也可以使用 <code>v-else<code> 为 <code>v-if<code> 添加一个“else 区块”。<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>button<span><span> @<span><span>click<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>awesome <span><span>=<span><span> !<span><span>awesome<span><span>\"<span><span>>Toggle</<span><span>button<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/conditional.html", "title": "条件渲染", "doc_id": "8fc32b4ed0d9489b83f54ca432318e18", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 231, "chunk_index": 2, "_doc_id": "2_1086228263200433639"}}
{"doc_id": "3_5463399280063786632", "text": "n><span>\"<span><span>>Toggle</<span><span>button<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>h1<span><span> v-if<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>awesome<span><span>\"<span><span>>Vue is awesome!</<span><span>h1<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/conditional.html", "title": "条件渲染", "doc_id": "8fc32b4ed0d9489b83f54ca432318e18", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 231, "chunk_index": 3, "_doc_id": "3_5463399280063786632"}}
{"doc_id": "4_5036282556521064136", "text": "pan><span>awesome<span><span>\"<span><span>>Vue is awesome!</<span><span>h1<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>h1<span><span> v-else<span><span>>Oh no 😢</<span><span>h1<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p class=\"demo\"> Toggle <h1>Vue is awesome!<h1><p><p>一个 <code>v-else<code> 元素必须跟在一个 <code>v-if<code> 或者 <code>v-else-if<code> 元素后面，否则它将不会被识别。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/conditional.html", "title": "条件渲染", "doc_id": "8fc32b4ed0d9489b83f54ca432318e18", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 231, "chunk_index": 4, "_doc_id": "4_5036282556521064136"}}
{"doc_id": "5_6470065671902392547", "text": "e!<h1><p><p>一个 <code>v-else<code> 元素必须跟在一个 <code>v-if<code> 或者 <code>v-else-if<code> 元素后面，否则它将不会被识别。<p><h2 id=\"v-else-if\"><code>v-else-if<code> <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#v-else-if\">​<a><h2><p>顾名思义，<code>v-else-if<code> 提供的是相应于 <code>v-if<code> 的“else if 区块”。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/conditional.html", "title": "条件渲染", "doc_id": "8fc32b4ed0d9489b83f54ca432318e18", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 231, "chunk_index": 5, "_doc_id": "5_6470065671902392547"}}
{"doc_id": "6_4456437635671843967", "text": "hor\" href=\"#v-else-if\">​<a><h2><p>顾名思义，<code>v-else-if<code> 提供的是相应于 <code>v-if<code> 的“else if 区块”。它可以连续多次重复使用：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>div<span><span> v-if<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>type <span><span>===<span><span> 'A'\"<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> A<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>div<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/conditional.html", "title": "条件渲染", "doc_id": "8fc32b4ed0d9489b83f54ca432318e18", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 231, "chunk_index": 6, "_doc_id": "6_4456437635671843967"}}
{"doc_id": "7_8417354723302496740", "text": "ass=\"line\"><span> A<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>div<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>div<span><span> v-else-if<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>type <span><span>===<span><span> 'B'\"<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> B<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>div<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/conditional.html", "title": "条件渲染", "doc_id": "8fc32b4ed0d9489b83f54ca432318e18", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 231, "chunk_index": 7, "_doc_id": "7_8417354723302496740"}}
{"doc_id": "8_8793500316179075104", "text": "ass=\"line\"><span> B<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>div<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>div<span><span> v-else-if<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>type <span><span>===<span><span> 'C'\"<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> C<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>div<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>div<span><span> v-else<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> Not A/B/C<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/conditional.html", "title": "条件渲染", "doc_id": "8fc32b4ed0d9489b83f54ca432318e18", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 231, "chunk_index": 8, "_doc_id": "8_8793500316179075104"}}
{"doc_id": "9_1198233870396478108", "text": "pan>div<span><span> v-else<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> Not A/B/C<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>div<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>和 <code>v-else<code> 类似，一个使用 <code>v-else-if<code> 的元素必须紧跟在一个 <code>v-if<code> 或一个 <code>v-else-if<code> 元素后面。<p><h2 id=\"v-if-on-template\"><code><template><code> 上的 <code>v-if<code> <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#v-if-on-template\">​<a><h2><p>因为 <code>v-if<code> 是一个指令，他必须依附于某个元素。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/conditional.html", "title": "条件渲染", "doc_id": "8fc32b4ed0d9489b83f54ca432318e18", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 231, "chunk_index": 9, "_doc_id": "9_1198233870396478108"}}
{"doc_id": "10_4238284237479212331", "text": "> <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#v-if-on-template\">​<a><h2><p>因为 <code>v-if<code> 是一个指令，他必须依附于某个元素。但如果我们想要切换不止一个元素呢？在这种情况下我们可以在一个 <code><template><code> 元素上使用 <code>v-if<code>，这只是一个不可见的包装器元素，最后渲染的结果并不会包含这个 <code><template><code> 元素。<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>template<span><span> v-if<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>ok<span><span>\"<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/conditional.html", "title": "条件渲染", "doc_id": "8fc32b4ed0d9489b83f54ca432318e18", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 231, "chunk_index": 10, "_doc_id": "10_4238284237479212331"}}
{"doc_id": "11_4783379719535182023", "text": "late<span><span> v-if<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>ok<span><span>\"<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>h1<span><span>>Title</<span><span>h1<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>p<span><span>>Paragraph 1</<span><span>p<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>p<span><span>>Paragraph 2</<span><span>p<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/conditional.html", "title": "条件渲染", "doc_id": "8fc32b4ed0d9489b83f54ca432318e18", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 231, "chunk_index": 11, "_doc_id": "11_4783379719535182023"}}
{"doc_id": "12_2268172886026471772", "text": "class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>p<span><span>>Paragraph 2</<span><span>p<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p><code>v-else<code> 和 <code>v-else-if<code> 也可以在 <code><template><code> 上使用。<p><h2 id=\"v-show\"><code>v-show<code> <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#v-show\">​<a><h2><p>另一个可以用来按条件显示一个元素的指令是 <code>v-show<code>。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/conditional.html", "title": "条件渲染", "doc_id": "8fc32b4ed0d9489b83f54ca432318e18", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 231, "chunk_index": 12, "_doc_id": "12_2268172886026471772"}}
{"doc_id": "13_7784539620027266283", "text": "ow<code> <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#v-show\">​<a><h2><p>另一个可以用来按条件显示一个元素的指令是 <code>v-show<code>。其用法基本一样：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>h1<span><span> v-show<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>ok<span><span>\"<span><span>>Hello!</<span><span>h1<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>不同之处在于 <code>v-show<code> 会在 DOM 渲染中保留该元素；<code>v-show<code> 仅切换了该元素上名为 <code>display<code> 的 CSS 属性。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/conditional.html", "title": "条件渲染", "doc_id": "8fc32b4ed0d9489b83f54ca432318e18", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 231, "chunk_index": 13, "_doc_id": "13_7784539620027266283"}}
{"doc_id": "14_8492667857483605534", "text": "同之处在于 <code>v-show<code> 会在 DOM 渲染中保留该元素；<code>v-show<code> 仅切换了该元素上名为 <code>display<code> 的 CSS 属性。<p><p><code>v-show<code> 不支持在 <code><template><code> 元素上使用，也不能和 <code>v-else<code> 搭配使用。<p><h2 id=\"v-if-vs-v-show\"><code>v-if<code> vs. <code>v-show<code> <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#v-if-vs-v-show\">​<a><h2><p><code>v-if<code> 是“真实的”按条件渲染，因为它确保了在切换时，条件区块内的事件监听器和子组件都会被销毁与重建。<p><p><code>v-if<code> 也是<strong>惰性<strong>的：如果在初次渲染时条件值为 false，则不会做任何事。条件区块只有当条件首次变为 true 时才被渲染。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/conditional.html", "title": "条件渲染", "doc_id": "8fc32b4ed0d9489b83f54ca432318e18", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 231, "chunk_index": 14, "_doc_id": "14_8492667857483605534"}}
{"doc_id": "15_2906025087616906978", "text": "重建。<p><p><code>v-if<code> 也是<strong>惰性<strong>的：如果在初次渲染时条件值为 false，则不会做任何事。条件区块只有当条件首次变为 true 时才被渲染。<p><p>相比之下，<code>v-show<code> 简单许多，元素无论初始条件如何，始终会被渲染，只有 CSS <code>display<code> 属性会被切换。<p><p>总的来说，<code>v-if<code> 有更高的切换开销，而 <code>v-show<code> 有更高的初始渲染开销。因此，如果需要频繁切换，则使用 <code>v-show<code> 较好；如果在运行时绑定条件很少改变，则 <code>v-if<code> 会更合适。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/conditional.html", "title": "条件渲染", "doc_id": "8fc32b4ed0d9489b83f54ca432318e18", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 231, "chunk_index": 15, "_doc_id": "15_2906025087616906978"}}
{"doc_id": "16_9202055278129823482", "text": "-show<code> 有更高的初始渲染开销。因此，如果需要频繁切换，则使用 <code>v-show<code> 较好；如果在运行时绑定条件很少改变，则 <code>v-if<code> 会更合适。<p><h2 id=\"v-if-with-v-for\"><code>v-if<code> 和 <code>v-for<code> <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#v-if-with-v-for\">​<a><h2><p>当 <code>v-if<code> 和 <code>v-for<code> 同时存在于一个元素上的时候，<code>v-if<code> 会首先被执行。请查看<a href=\"./list.html#v-for-with-v-if\">列表渲染指南<a>获取更多细节。<p><div class=\"warning custom-block\"><p class=\"custom-block-title\">警告<p><p>同时使用 <code>v-if<code> 和 <code>v-for<code> 是<strong>不推荐的<strong>，因为这样二者的优先级不明显。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/conditional.html", "title": "条件渲染", "doc_id": "8fc32b4ed0d9489b83f54ca432318e18", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 231, "chunk_index": 16, "_doc_id": "16_9202055278129823482"}}
{"doc_id": "17_3140912694476409958", "text": "-block-title\">警告<p><p>同时使用 <code>v-if<code> 和 <code>v-for<code> 是<strong>不推荐的<strong>，因为这样二者的优先级不明显。请查看<a href=\"./list.html#v-for-with-v-if\">列表渲染指南<a>获得更多信息。<p><div><div><div>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/conditional.html", "title": "条件渲染", "doc_id": "8fc32b4ed0d9489b83f54ca432318e18", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 231, "chunk_index": 17, "_doc_id": "17_3140912694476409958"}}
{"doc_id": "0_4900662168778154573", "text": "<div><div><h1 id=\"lifecycle-hooks\">生命周期钩子 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#lifecycle-hooks\">​<a><h1><p>每个 Vue 组件实例在创建时都需要经历一系列的初始化步骤，比如设置好数据侦听，编译模板，挂载实例到 DOM，以及在数据改变时更新 DOM。在此过程中，它也会运行被称为生命周期钩子的函数，让开发者有机会在特定阶段运行自己的代码。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/lifecycle.html", "title": "生命周期钩子", "doc_id": "05238366d9114a668896be48841afc86", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 153, "chunk_index": 0, "_doc_id": "0_4900662168778154573"}}
{"doc_id": "1_9019146722672963611", "text": "时都需要经历一系列的初始化步骤，比如设置好数据侦听，编译模板，挂载实例到 DOM，以及在数据改变时更新 DOM。在此过程中，它也会运行被称为生命周期钩子的函数，让开发者有机会在特定阶段运行自己的代码。<p><h2 id=\"registering-lifecycle-hooks\">注册周期钩子 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#registering-lifecycle-hooks\">​<a><h2><p>举例来说，<span class=\"composition-api\"><code>onMounted<code><span><span class=\"options-api\"><code>mounted<code><span> 钩子可以用来在组件完成初始渲染并创建 DOM 节点后运行代码：<p><div class=\"composition-api\"><div class=\"language-vue\"> <span class=\"lang\">vue<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>script<span><span> setup<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/lifecycle.html", "title": "生命周期钩子", "doc_id": "05238366d9114a668896be48841afc86", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 153, "chunk_index": 1, "_doc_id": "1_9019146722672963611"}}
{"doc_id": "2_6937383886353120719", "text": "code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>script<span><span> setup<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>import<span><span> { onMounted } <span><span>from<span><span> 'vue'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>onMounted<span><span>(() <span><span>=><span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> console.<span><span>log<span><span>(<span><span>`the component is now mounted.`<span><span>)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>})<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/lifecycle.html", "title": "生命周期钩子", "doc_id": "05238366d9114a668896be48841afc86", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 153, "chunk_index": 2, "_doc_id": "2_6937383886353120719"}}
{"doc_id": "3_5073452115678995636", "text": "an>`the component is now mounted.`<span><span>)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>})<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>script<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><div><div class=\"options-api\"><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> mounted<span><span>() {<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/lifecycle.html", "title": "生命周期钩子", "doc_id": "05238366d9114a668896be48841afc86", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 153, "chunk_index": 3, "_doc_id": "3_5073452115678995636"}}
{"doc_id": "4_6409164493923969919", "text": "an> default<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> mounted<span><span>() {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> console.<span><span>log<span><span>(<span><span>`the component is now mounted.`<span><span>)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/lifecycle.html", "title": "生命周期钩子", "doc_id": "05238366d9114a668896be48841afc86", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 153, "chunk_index": 4, "_doc_id": "4_6409164493923969919"}}
{"doc_id": "5_4761011013430517720", "text": "an>`the component is now mounted.`<span><span>)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span><code><pre><div><div><p>还有其他一些钩子，会在实例生命周期的不同阶段被调用，最常用的是 <span class=\"composition-api\"><a href=\"/api/composition-api-lifecycle.html#onmounted\"><code>onMounted<code><a>、<a href=\"/api/composition-api-lifecycle.html#onupdated\"><code>onUpdated<code><a> 和 <a href=\"/api/composition-api-lifecycle.html#onunmounted\"><code>onUnmounted<code><a>。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/lifecycle.html", "title": "生命周期钩子", "doc_id": "05238366d9114a668896be48841afc86", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 153, "chunk_index": 5, "_doc_id": "5_4761011013430517720"}}
{"doc_id": "6_7520661789666895625", "text": "ted<code><a> 和 <a href=\"/api/composition-api-lifecycle.html#onunmounted\"><code>onUnmounted<code><a>。所有生命周期钩子的完整参考及其用法请参考 <a href=\"/api/composition-api-lifecycle.html\">API 索引<a>。<span><span class=\"options-api\"><a href=\"/api/options-lifecycle.html#mounted\"><code>mounted<code><a>、<a href=\"/api/options-lifecycle.html#updated\"><code>updated<code><a> 和 <a href=\"/api/options-lifecycle.html#unmounted\"><code>unmounted<code><a>。<span><p><div class=\"options-api\"><p>所有生命周期钩子函数的 <code>this<code> 上下文都会自动指向当前调用它的组件实例。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/lifecycle.html", "title": "生命周期钩子", "doc_id": "05238366d9114a668896be48841afc86", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 153, "chunk_index": 6, "_doc_id": "6_7520661789666895625"}}
{"doc_id": "7_4451238153199963050", "text": "nted<code><a>。<span><p><div class=\"options-api\"><p>所有生命周期钩子函数的 <code>this<code> 上下文都会自动指向当前调用它的组件实例。注意：避免用箭头函数来定义生命周期钩子，因为如果这样的话你将无法在函数中通过 <code>this<code> 获取组件实例。<p><div><div class=\"composition-api\"><p>当调用 <code>onMounted<code> 时，Vue 会自动将回调函数注册到当前正被初始化的组件实例上。这意味着这些钩子应当在组件初始化时被<strong>同步<strong>注册。例如，请不要这样做：<p><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>setTimeout<span><span>(() <span><span>=><span><span> {<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/lifecycle.html", "title": "生命周期钩子", "doc_id": "05238366d9114a668896be48841afc86", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 153, "chunk_index": 7, "_doc_id": "7_4451238153199963050"}}
{"doc_id": "8_7537503690678890856", "text": "\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>setTimeout<span><span>(() <span><span>=><span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> onMounted<span><span>(() <span><span>=><span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 异步注册时当前组件实例已丢失<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 这将不会正常工作<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> })<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/lifecycle.html", "title": "生命周期钩子", "doc_id": "05238366d9114a668896be48841afc86", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 153, "chunk_index": 8, "_doc_id": "8_7537503690678890856"}}
{"doc_id": "9_5386048969135426807", "text": "n><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 这将不会正常工作<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> })<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}, <span><span>100<span><span>)<span><span><code><pre><div><p>注意这并不意味着对 <code>onMounted<code> 的调用必须放在 <code>setup()<code> 或 <code><script setup><code> 内的词法上下文中。<code>onMounted()<code> 也可以在一个外部函数中调用，只要调用栈是同步的，且最终起源自 <code>setup()<code> 就可以。<p><div><h2 id=\"lifecycle-diagram\">生命周期图示 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#lifecycle-diagram\">​<a><h2><p>下面是实例生命周期的图表。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/lifecycle.html", "title": "生命周期钩子", "doc_id": "05238366d9114a668896be48841afc86", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 153, "chunk_index": 9, "_doc_id": "9_5386048969135426807"}}
{"doc_id": "10_9131136729315712800", "text": "ifecycle-diagram\">生命周期图示 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#lifecycle-diagram\">​<a><h2><p>下面是实例生命周期的图表。你现在并不需要完全理解图中的所有内容，但以后它将是一个有用的参考。<p><p> <p><p>有关所有生命周期钩子及其各自用例的详细信息，请参考<span class=\"composition-api\"><a href=\"/api/composition-api-lifecycle.html\">生命周期钩子 API 索引<a><span><span class=\"options-api\"><a href=\"/api/options-lifecycle.html\">生命周期钩子 API 索引<a><span>。<p><div><div>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/lifecycle.html", "title": "生命周期钩子", "doc_id": "05238366d9114a668896be48841afc86", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 153, "chunk_index": 10, "_doc_id": "10_9131136729315712800"}}
{"doc_id": "0_2239228992484047734", "text": "<div><div><h1 id=\"component-registration\">组件注册 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#component-registration\">​<a><h1><blockquote><p>此章节假设你已经看过了<a href=\"/guide/essentials/component-basics.html\">组件基础<a>。若你还不了解组件是什么，请先阅读该章节。<p><blockquote><p>一个 Vue 组件在使用前需要先被“注册”，这样 Vue 才能在渲染模板时找到其对应的实现。组件注册有两种方式：全局注册和局部注册。<p><h2 id=\"global-registration\">全局注册 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#global-registration\">​<a><h2><p>我们可以使用 <a href=\"/guide/essentials/application.html\">Vue 应用实例<a>的 <code>.component()<code> 方法，让组件在当前 Vue 应用中全局可用。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/registration.html", "title": "组件注册", "doc_id": "0a6dbf9a93804724ad0ad927411d5f3f", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 328, "chunk_index": 0, "_doc_id": "0_2239228992484047734"}}
{"doc_id": "1_18069431095068288", "text": "ef=\"/guide/essentials/application.html\">Vue 应用实例<a>的 <code>.component()<code> 方法，让组件在当前 Vue 应用中全局可用。<p><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>import<span><span> { createApp } <span><span>from<span><span> 'vue'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> app<span><span> =<span><span> createApp<span><span>({})<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/registration.html", "title": "组件注册", "doc_id": "0a6dbf9a93804724ad0ad927411d5f3f", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 328, "chunk_index": 1, "_doc_id": "1_18069431095068288"}}
{"doc_id": "2_3480362485467260311", "text": "span> app<span><span> =<span><span> createApp<span><span>({})<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>app.<span><span>component<span><span>(<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 注册的名字<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> 'MyComponent'<span><span>,<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 组件的实现<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> /* ... */<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/registration.html", "title": "组件注册", "doc_id": "0a6dbf9a93804724ad0ad927411d5f3f", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 328, "chunk_index": 2, "_doc_id": "2_3480362485467260311"}}
{"doc_id": "3_1975476251979953161", "text": "span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> /* ... */<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>)<span><span><code><pre><div><p>如果使用单文件组件，你可以注册被导入的 <code>.vue<code> 文件：<p><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>import<span><span> MyComponent <span><span>from<span><span> './App.vue'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/registration.html", "title": "组件注册", "doc_id": "0a6dbf9a93804724ad0ad927411d5f3f", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 328, "chunk_index": 3, "_doc_id": "3_1975476251979953161"}}
{"doc_id": "4_3661771424110590034", "text": "n><span> MyComponent <span><span>from<span><span> './App.vue'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>app.<span><span>component<span><span>(<span><span>'MyComponent'<span><span>, MyComponent)<span><span><code><pre><div><p><code>.component()<code> 方法可以被链式调用：<p><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>app<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/registration.html", "title": "组件注册", "doc_id": "0a6dbf9a93804724ad0ad927411d5f3f", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 328, "chunk_index": 4, "_doc_id": "4_3661771424110590034"}}
{"doc_id": "5_5343692204238314236", "text": "lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>app<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> .<span><span>component<span><span>(<span><span>'ComponentA'<span><span>, ComponentA)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> .<span><span>component<span><span>(<span><span>'ComponentB'<span><span>, ComponentB)<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/registration.html", "title": "组件注册", "doc_id": "0a6dbf9a93804724ad0ad927411d5f3f", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 328, "chunk_index": 5, "_doc_id": "5_5343692204238314236"}}
{"doc_id": "6_3426662589542621905", "text": "n> .<span><span>component<span><span>(<span><span>'ComponentB'<span><span>, ComponentB)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> .<span><span>component<span><span>(<span><span>'ComponentC'<span><span>, ComponentC)<span><span><code><pre><div><p>全局注册的组件可以在此应用的任意组件的模板中使用：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><!-- 这在当前应用的任意组件中都可用 --><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/registration.html", "title": "组件注册", "doc_id": "0a6dbf9a93804724ad0ad927411d5f3f", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 328, "chunk_index": 6, "_doc_id": "6_3426662589542621905"}}
{"doc_id": "7_2563488028626611498", "text": "ass=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><!-- 这在当前应用的任意组件中都可用 --><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>ComponentA<span><span>/><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>ComponentB<span><span>/><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>ComponentC<span><span>/><span><span><code><pre><div><p>所有的子组件也可以使用全局注册的组件，这意味着这三个组件也都可以在<em>彼此内部<em>使用。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/registration.html", "title": "组件注册", "doc_id": "0a6dbf9a93804724ad0ad927411d5f3f", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 328, "chunk_index": 7, "_doc_id": "7_2563488028626611498"}}
{"doc_id": "8_3076847348273302462", "text": "ponentC<span><span>/><span><span><code><pre><div><p>所有的子组件也可以使用全局注册的组件，这意味着这三个组件也都可以在<em>彼此内部<em>使用。<p><h2 id=\"local-registration\">局部注册 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#local-registration\">​<a><h2><p>全局注册虽然很方便，但有以下几个问题：<p><ol><li><p>全局注册，但并没有被使用的组件无法在生产打包时被自动移除 (也叫“tree-shaking”)。如果你全局注册了一个组件，即使它并没有被实际使用，它仍然会出现在打包后的 JS 文件中。<p><li><li><p>全局注册在大型项目中使项目的依赖关系变得不那么明确。在父组件中使用子组件时，不太容易定位子组件的实现。和使用过多的全局变量一样，这可能会影响应用长期的可维护性。<p><li><ol><p>相比之下，局部注册的组件需要在使用它的父组件中显式导入，并且只能在该父组件中使用。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/registration.html", "title": "组件注册", "doc_id": "0a6dbf9a93804724ad0ad927411d5f3f", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 328, "chunk_index": 8, "_doc_id": "8_3076847348273302462"}}
{"doc_id": "9_2481032955495198935", "text": "件时，不太容易定位子组件的实现。和使用过多的全局变量一样，这可能会影响应用长期的可维护性。<p><li><ol><p>相比之下，局部注册的组件需要在使用它的父组件中显式导入，并且只能在该父组件中使用。它的优点是使组件之间的依赖关系更加明确，并且对 tree-shaking 更加友好。<p><div class=\"composition-api\"><p>在使用 <code><script setup><code> 的单文件组件中，导入的组件可以直接在模板中使用，无需注册：<p><div class=\"language-vue\"> <span class=\"lang\">vue<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>script<span><span> setup<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/registration.html", "title": "组件注册", "doc_id": "0a6dbf9a93804724ad0ad927411d5f3f", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 328, "chunk_index": 9, "_doc_id": "9_2481032955495198935"}}
{"doc_id": "10_710777954203186984", "text": "code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>script<span><span> setup<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>import<span><span> ComponentA <span><span>from<span><span> './ComponentA.vue'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>script<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>ComponentA<span><span> /><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/registration.html", "title": "组件注册", "doc_id": "0a6dbf9a93804724ad0ad927411d5f3f", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 328, "chunk_index": 10, "_doc_id": "10_710777954203186984"}}
{"doc_id": "11_3949554194201488819", "text": "an><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>ComponentA<span><span> /><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>如果没有使用 <code><script setup><code>，则需要使用 <code>components<code> 选项来显式注册：<p><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>import<span><span> ComponentA <span><span>from<span><span> './ComponentA.js'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/registration.html", "title": "组件注册", "doc_id": "0a6dbf9a93804724ad0ad927411d5f3f", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 328, "chunk_index": 11, "_doc_id": "11_3949554194201488819"}}
{"doc_id": "12_2546067945202640631", "text": "an> ComponentA <span><span>from<span><span> './ComponentA.js'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> components: {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> ComponentA<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> },<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> setup<span><span>() {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // ...<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/registration.html", "title": "组件注册", "doc_id": "0a6dbf9a93804724ad0ad927411d5f3f", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 328, "chunk_index": 12, "_doc_id": "12_2546067945202640631"}}
{"doc_id": "13_494581805575123986", "text": "{<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // ...<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span><code><pre><div><div><div class=\"options-api\"><p>局部注册需要使用 <code>components<code> 选项：<p><div class=\"language-vue\"> <span class=\"lang\">vue<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>script<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>import<span><span> ComponentA <span><span>from<span><span> './ComponentA.vue'<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/registration.html", "title": "组件注册", "doc_id": "0a6dbf9a93804724ad0ad927411d5f3f", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 328, "chunk_index": 13, "_doc_id": "13_494581805575123986"}}
{"doc_id": "14_3501886349879127989", "text": "ne\"><span>import<span><span> ComponentA <span><span>from<span><span> './ComponentA.vue'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> components: {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> ComponentA<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>script<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/registration.html", "title": "组件注册", "doc_id": "0a6dbf9a93804724ad0ad927411d5f3f", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 328, "chunk_index": 14, "_doc_id": "14_3501886349879127989"}}
{"doc_id": "15_2707773816189966078", "text": "n>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>script<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>ComponentA<span><span> /><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/registration.html", "title": "组件注册", "doc_id": "0a6dbf9a93804724ad0ad927411d5f3f", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 328, "chunk_index": 15, "_doc_id": "15_2707773816189966078"}}
{"doc_id": "16_5734202013123315706", "text": "an><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>ComponentA<span><span> /><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><div><p>对于每个 <code>components<code> 对象里的属性，它们的 key 名就是注册的组件名，而值就是相应组件的实现。上面的例子中使用的是 ES2015 的缩写语法，等价于：<p><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/registration.html", "title": "组件注册", "doc_id": "0a6dbf9a93804724ad0ad927411d5f3f", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 328, "chunk_index": 16, "_doc_id": "16_5734202013123315706"}}
{"doc_id": "17_8304087341481418758", "text": "b-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> components: {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> ComponentA: ComponentA<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // ...<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span><code><pre><div><p>请注意：<strong>局部注册的组件在后代组件中<i>不<i>可用<strong>。在这个例子中，<code>ComponentA<code> 注册后仅在当前组件可用，而在任何的子组件或更深层的子组件中都不可用。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/registration.html", "title": "组件注册", "doc_id": "0a6dbf9a93804724ad0ad927411d5f3f", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 328, "chunk_index": 17, "_doc_id": "17_8304087341481418758"}}
{"doc_id": "18_4860453493985931268", "text": "rong>局部注册的组件在后代组件中<i>不<i>可用<strong>。在这个例子中，<code>ComponentA<code> 注册后仅在当前组件可用，而在任何的子组件或更深层的子组件中都不可用。<p><h2 id=\"component-name-casing\">组件名格式 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#component-name-casing\">​<a><h2><p>在整个指引中，我们都使用 PascalCase 作为组件名的注册格式，这是因为：<p><ol><li><p>PascalCase 是合法的 JavaScript 标识符。这使得在 JavaScript 中导入和注册组件都很容易，同时 IDE 也能提供较好的自动补全。<p><li><li><p><code><PascalCase /><code> 在模板中更明显地表明了这是一个 Vue 组件，而不是原生 HTML 元素。同时也能够将 Vue 组件和自定义元素 (web components) 区分开来。<p><li><ol><p>在单文件组件和内联字符串模板中，我们都推荐这样做。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/registration.html", "title": "组件注册", "doc_id": "0a6dbf9a93804724ad0ad927411d5f3f", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 328, "chunk_index": 18, "_doc_id": "18_4860453493985931268"}}
{"doc_id": "19_3827768307960617511", "text": "e 组件，而不是原生 HTML 元素。同时也能够将 Vue 组件和自定义元素 (web components) 区分开来。<p><li><ol><p>在单文件组件和内联字符串模板中，我们都推荐这样做。但是，PascalCase 的标签名在 DOM 内模板中是不可用的，详情参见 <a href=\"/guide/essentials/component-basics.html#in-dom-template-parsing-caveats\">DOM 内模板解析注意事项<a>。<p><p>为了方便，Vue 支持将模板中使用 kebab-case 的标签解析为使用 PascalCase 注册的组件。这意味着一个以 <code>MyComponent<code> 为名注册的组件，在模板 (或由 Vue 渲染的 HTML 元素) 中可以通过 <code><MyComponent><code> 或 <code><my-component><code> 引用。这让我们能够使用同样的 JavaScript 组件注册代码来配合不同来源的模板。<p><div><div>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/registration.html", "title": "组件注册", "doc_id": "0a6dbf9a93804724ad0ad927411d5f3f", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 328, "chunk_index": 19, "_doc_id": "19_3827768307960617511"}}
{"doc_id": "0_3072679641340775823", "text": "<div><div><h1 id=\"list-rendering\">列表渲染 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#list-rendering\">​<a><h1><h2 id=\"v-for\"><code>v-for<code> <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#v-for\">​<a><h2><p>我们可以使用 <code>v-for<code> 指令基于一个数组来渲染一个列表。<code>v-for<code> 指令的值需要使用 <code>item in items<code> 形式的特殊语法，其中 <code>items<code> 是源数据的数组，", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/list.html", "title": "列表渲染", "doc_id": "2e19846da261447dabac0df9909413cb", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1081, "chunk_index": 0, "_doc_id": "0_3072679641340775823"}}
{"doc_id": "1_4149579802439068151", "text": "数组来渲染一个列表。<code>v-for<code> 指令的值需要使用 <code>item in items<code> 形式的特殊语法，其中 <code>items<code> 是源数据的数组，而 <code>item<code> 是迭代项的<strong>别名<strong>：<p><div class=\"composition-api\"><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> items<span><span> =<span><span> ref<span><span>([{ message: <span><span>'Foo'<span><span> },", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/list.html", "title": "列表渲染", "doc_id": "2e19846da261447dabac0df9909413cb", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1081, "chunk_index": 1, "_doc_id": "1_4149579802439068151"}}
{"doc_id": "2_858280215110150292", "text": "<span> items<span><span> =<span><span> ref<span><span>([{ message: <span><span>'Foo'<span><span> }, { message: <span><span>'Bar'<span><span> }])<span><span><code><pre><div><div><div class=\"options-api\"><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>data<span><span>() {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> return<span><span> {<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/list.html", "title": "列表渲染", "doc_id": "2e19846da261447dabac0df9909413cb", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1081, "chunk_index": 2, "_doc_id": "2_858280215110150292"}}
{"doc_id": "3_3782369628291117566", "text": "\"><span>data<span><span>() {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> return<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> items: [{ message: <span><span>'Foo'<span><span> }, { message: <span><span>'Bar'<span><span> }]<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/list.html", "title": "列表渲染", "doc_id": "2e19846da261447dabac0df9909413cb", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1081, "chunk_index": 3, "_doc_id": "3_3782369628291117566"}}
{"doc_id": "4_80806306319906152", "text": "}, { message: <span><span>'Bar'<span><span> }]<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span><code><pre><div><div><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>li<span><span> v-for<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>item <span><span>in<span><span> items<span><span>\"<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> {{ item.message }}<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/list.html", "title": "列表渲染", "doc_id": "2e19846da261447dabac0df9909413cb", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1081, "chunk_index": 4, "_doc_id": "4_80806306319906152"}}
{"doc_id": "5_8508559986526172759", "text": "tems<span><span>\"<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> {{ item.message }}<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>li<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>在 <code>v-for<code> 块中可以完整地访问父作用域内的属性和变量。<code>v-for<code> 也支持使用可选的第二个参数表示当前项的位置索引。<p><div class=\"composition-api\"><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> parentMessage<span><span> =<span><span> ref<span><span>(<span><span>'Parent'<span><span>)<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/list.html", "title": "列表渲染", "doc_id": "2e19846da261447dabac0df9909413cb", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1081, "chunk_index": 5, "_doc_id": "5_8508559986526172759"}}
{"doc_id": "6_3427846991771477673", "text": "rentMessage<span><span> =<span><span> ref<span><span>(<span><span>'Parent'<span><span>)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> items<span><span> =<span><span> ref<span><span>([{ message: <span><span>'Foo'<span><span> }, { message: <span><span>'Bar'<span><span> }])<span><span><code><pre><div><div><div class=\"options-api\"><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>data<span><span>() {<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/list.html", "title": "列表渲染", "doc_id": "2e19846da261447dabac0df9909413cb", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1081, "chunk_index": 6, "_doc_id": "6_3427846991771477673"}}
{"doc_id": "7_445428890234722628", "text": "e class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>data<span><span>() {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> return<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> parentMessage: <span><span>'Parent'<span><span>,<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> items: [{ message: <span><span>'Foo'<span><span> }, { message: <span><span>'Bar'<span><span> }]<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/list.html", "title": "列表渲染", "doc_id": "2e19846da261447dabac0df9909413cb", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1081, "chunk_index": 7, "_doc_id": "7_445428890234722628"}}
{"doc_id": "8_5843566149035610580", "text": "}, { message: <span><span>'Bar'<span><span> }]<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span><code><pre><div><div><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>li<span><span> v-for<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>(item, index) <span><span>in<span><span> items<span><span>\"<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/list.html", "title": "列表渲染", "doc_id": "2e19846da261447dabac0df9909413cb", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1081, "chunk_index": 8, "_doc_id": "8_5843566149035610580"}}
{"doc_id": "9_360996519395507707", "text": "n>\"<span><span>(item, index) <span><span>in<span><span> items<span><span>\"<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> {{ parentMessage }} - {{ index }} - {{ item.message }}<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/list.html", "title": "列表渲染", "doc_id": "2e19846da261447dabac0df9909413cb", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1081, "chunk_index": 9, "_doc_id": "9_360996519395507707"}}
{"doc_id": "10_7166796884677831795", "text": "<span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> {{ parentMessage }} - {{ index }} - {{ item.message }}<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>li<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p class=\"demo\"><li>Parent - 0 - Foo<li><li>Parent - 1 - Bar<li><p><p><code>v-for<code> 变量的作用域和下面的 JavaScript 代码很类似：<p><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> parentMessage<span><span> =<span><span> 'Parent'<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/list.html", "title": "列表渲染", "doc_id": "2e19846da261447dabac0df9909413cb", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1081, "chunk_index": 10, "_doc_id": "10_7166796884677831795"}}
{"doc_id": "11_998431837198565884", "text": "n class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> parentMessage<span><span> =<span><span> 'Parent'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> items<span><span> =<span><span> [<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> /* ... */<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>]<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>items.<span><span>forEach<span><span>((<span><span>item<span><span>, <span><span>index<span><span>) <span><span>=><span><span> {<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/list.html", "title": "列表渲染", "doc_id": "2e19846da261447dabac0df9909413cb", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1081, "chunk_index": 11, "_doc_id": "11_998431837198565884"}}
{"doc_id": "12_5699276968677539448", "text": "pan><span>item<span><span>, <span><span>index<span><span>) <span><span>=><span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 可以访问外层的 `parentMessage`<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 而 `item` 和 `index` 只在这个作用域可用<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> console.<span><span>log<span><span>(parentMessage, item.message, index)<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/list.html", "title": "列表渲染", "doc_id": "2e19846da261447dabac0df9909413cb", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1081, "chunk_index": 12, "_doc_id": "12_5699276968677539448"}}
{"doc_id": "13_3548138506715827095", "text": "s=\"line\"><span> console.<span><span>log<span><span>(parentMessage, item.message, index)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>})<span><span><code><pre><div><p>注意 <code>v-for<code> 是如何对应 <code>forEach<code> 回调的函数签名的。实际上，你也可以在定义 <code>v-for<code> 的变量别名时使用解构，和解构函数参数类似：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>li<span><span> v-for<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>{ message } <span><span>in<span><span> items<span><span>\"<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/list.html", "title": "列表渲染", "doc_id": "2e19846da261447dabac0df9909413cb", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1081, "chunk_index": 13, "_doc_id": "13_3548138506715827095"}}
{"doc_id": "14_5618518134042812887", "text": "pan>\"<span><span>{ message } <span><span>in<span><span> items<span><span>\"<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> {{ message }}<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>li<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><!-- 有 index 索引时 --><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>li<span><span> v-for<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>({ message }, index) <span><span>in<span><span> items<span><span>\"<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/list.html", "title": "列表渲染", "doc_id": "2e19846da261447dabac0df9909413cb", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1081, "chunk_index": 14, "_doc_id": "14_5618518134042812887"}}
{"doc_id": "15_3114274721571004863", "text": "n><span>({ message }, index) <span><span>in<span><span> items<span><span>\"<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> {{ message }} {{ index }}<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/list.html", "title": "列表渲染", "doc_id": "2e19846da261447dabac0df9909413cb", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1081, "chunk_index": 15, "_doc_id": "15_3114274721571004863"}}
{"doc_id": "16_5712246263470078173", "text": "an><span>\"<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> {{ message }} {{ index }}<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>li<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>对于多层嵌套的 <code>v-for<code>，作用域的工作方式和函数的作用域很类似。每个 <code>v-for<code> 作用域都可以访问到父级作用域：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>li<span><span> v-for<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>item <span><span>in<span><span> items<span><span>\"<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/list.html", "title": "列表渲染", "doc_id": "2e19846da261447dabac0df9909413cb", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1081, "chunk_index": 16, "_doc_id": "16_5712246263470078173"}}
{"doc_id": "17_5113483378012140865", "text": "span><span>\"<span><span>item <span><span>in<span><span> items<span><span>\"<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>span<span><span> v-for<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>childItem <span><span>in<span><span> item.children<span><span>\"<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> {{ item.message }} {{ childItem }}<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> </<span><span>span<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/list.html", "title": "列表渲染", "doc_id": "2e19846da261447dabac0df9909413cb", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1081, "chunk_index": 17, "_doc_id": "17_5113483378012140865"}}
{"doc_id": "18_941578455867656155", "text": "} {{ childItem }}<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> </<span><span>span<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>li<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>你也可以使用 <code>of<code> 作为分隔符来替代 <code>in<code>，", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/list.html", "title": "列表渲染", "doc_id": "2e19846da261447dabac0df9909413cb", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1081, "chunk_index": 18, "_doc_id": "18_941578455867656155"}}
{"doc_id": "19_9175506693507729472", "text": "n><span>li<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>你也可以使用 <code>of<code> 作为分隔符来替代 <code>in<code>，这更接近 JavaScript 的迭代器语法：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>div<span><span> v-for<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>item <span><span>of<span><span> items<span><span>\"<span><span>></<span><span>div<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><h2 id=\"v-for-with-an-object\"><code>v-for<code> 与对象 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#v-for-with-an-object\">​<a><h2><p>你也可以使用 <code>v-for<code> 来遍历一个对象的所有属性。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/list.html", "title": "列表渲染", "doc_id": "2e19846da261447dabac0df9909413cb", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1081, "chunk_index": 19, "_doc_id": "19_9175506693507729472"}}
{"doc_id": "20_5936744382061686823", "text": "class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#v-for-with-an-object\">​<a><h2><p>你也可以使用 <code>v-for<code> 来遍历一个对象的所有属性。遍历的顺序会基于对该对象调用 <code>Object.values()<code> 的返回值来决定。<p><div class=\"composition-api\"><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> myObject<span><span> =<span><span> reactive<span><span>({<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> title: <span><span>'How to do lists in Vue'<span><span>,<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/list.html", "title": "列表渲染", "doc_id": "2e19846da261447dabac0df9909413cb", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1081, "chunk_index": 20, "_doc_id": "20_5936744382061686823"}}
{"doc_id": "21_3888548522560820303", "text": "pan>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> title: <span><span>'How to do lists in Vue'<span><span>,<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> author: <span><span>'Jane Doe'<span><span>,<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> publishedAt: <span><span>'2016-04-10'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>})<span><span><code><pre><div><div><div class=\"options-api\"><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>data<span><span>() {<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/list.html", "title": "列表渲染", "doc_id": "2e19846da261447dabac0df9909413cb", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1081, "chunk_index": 21, "_doc_id": "21_3888548522560820303"}}
{"doc_id": "22_6416051267749310384", "text": "e class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>data<span><span>() {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> return<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> myObject: {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> title: <span><span>'How to do lists in Vue'<span><span>,<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> author: <span><span>'Jane Doe'<span><span>,<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> publishedAt: <span><span>'2016-04-10'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/list.html", "title": "列表渲染", "doc_id": "2e19846da261447dabac0df9909413cb", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1081, "chunk_index": 22, "_doc_id": "22_6416051267749310384"}}
{"doc_id": "23_8998204434595556630", "text": "e\"><span> publishedAt: <span><span>'2016-04-10'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span><code><pre><div><div><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>ul<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/list.html", "title": "列表渲染", "doc_id": "2e19846da261447dabac0df9909413cb", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1081, "chunk_index": 23, "_doc_id": "23_8998204434595556630"}}
{"doc_id": "24_2593659276415360107", "text": "\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>ul<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>li<span><span> v-for<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>value <span><span>in<span><span> myObject<span><span>\"<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> {{ value }}<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> </<span><span>li<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/list.html", "title": "列表渲染", "doc_id": "2e19846da261447dabac0df9909413cb", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1081, "chunk_index": 24, "_doc_id": "24_2593659276415360107"}}
{"doc_id": "25_1578959659384977566", "text": "><span> {{ value }}<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> </<span><span>li<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>ul<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>可以通过提供第二个参数表示属性名 (例如 key)：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>li<span><span> v-for<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>(value, key) <span><span>in<span><span> myObject<span><span>\"<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/list.html", "title": "列表渲染", "doc_id": "2e19846da261447dabac0df9909413cb", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1081, "chunk_index": 25, "_doc_id": "25_1578959659384977566"}}
{"doc_id": "26_7856196709673289790", "text": "\"<span><span>(value, key) <span><span>in<span><span> myObject<span><span>\"<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> {{ key }}: {{ value }}<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/list.html", "title": "列表渲染", "doc_id": "2e19846da261447dabac0df9909413cb", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1081, "chunk_index": 26, "_doc_id": "26_7856196709673289790"}}
{"doc_id": "27_8247810116344950158", "text": "<span><span>\"<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> {{ key }}: {{ value }}<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>li<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>第三个参数表示位置索引：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>li<span><span> v-for<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>(value, key, index) <span><span>in<span><span> myObject<span><span>\"<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/list.html", "title": "列表渲染", "doc_id": "2e19846da261447dabac0df9909413cb", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1081, "chunk_index": 27, "_doc_id": "27_8247810116344950158"}}
{"doc_id": "28_5405897897078972039", "text": "<span>(value, key, index) <span><span>in<span><span> myObject<span><span>\"<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> {{ index }}. {{ key }}: {{ value }}<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>li<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><h2 id=\"v-for-with-a-range\">在 <code>v-for<code> 里使用范围值 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#v-for-with-a-range\">​<a><h2><p><code>v-for<code> 可以直接接受一个整数值。在这种用例中，会将该模板基于 <code>1...n<code> 的取值范围重复多次。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/list.html", "title": "列表渲染", "doc_id": "2e19846da261447dabac0df9909413cb", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1081, "chunk_index": 28, "_doc_id": "28_5405897897078972039"}}
{"doc_id": "29_122979931438768994", "text": "r-with-a-range\">​<a><h2><p><code>v-for<code> 可以直接接受一个整数值。在这种用例中，会将该模板基于 <code>1...n<code> 的取值范围重复多次。<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>span<span><span> v-for<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>n <span><span>in<span><span> 10<span><span>\"<span><span>>{{ n }}</<span><span>span<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>注意此处 <code>n<code> 的初值是从 <code>1<code> 开始而非 <code>0<code>。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/list.html", "title": "列表渲染", "doc_id": "2e19846da261447dabac0df9909413cb", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1081, "chunk_index": 29, "_doc_id": "29_122979931438768994"}}
{"doc_id": "30_8297424535503083900", "text": "pan><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>注意此处 <code>n<code> 的初值是从 <code>1<code> 开始而非 <code>0<code>。<p><h2 id=\"v-for-on-template\"><code><template><code> 上的 <code>v-for<code> <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#v-for-on-template\">​<a><h2><p>与模板上的 <code>v-if<code> 类似，你也可以在 <code><template><code> 标签上使用 <code>v-for<code> 来渲染一个包含多个元素的块。例如：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>ul<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/list.html", "title": "列表渲染", "doc_id": "2e19846da261447dabac0df9909413cb", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1081, "chunk_index": 30, "_doc_id": "30_8297424535503083900"}}
{"doc_id": "31_8990344387774517892", "text": "\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>ul<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>template<span><span> v-for<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>item <span><span>in<span><span> items<span><span>\"<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>li<span><span>>{{ item.msg }}</<span><span>li<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/list.html", "title": "列表渲染", "doc_id": "2e19846da261447dabac0df9909413cb", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1081, "chunk_index": 31, "_doc_id": "31_8990344387774517892"}}
{"doc_id": "32_9048055427486653072", "text": "s=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>li<span><span>>{{ item.msg }}</<span><span>li<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>li<span><span> class<span><span>=<span><span>\"divider\"<span><span> role<span><span>=<span><span>\"presentation\"<span><span>></<span><span>li<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> </<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/list.html", "title": "列表渲染", "doc_id": "2e19846da261447dabac0df9909413cb", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1081, "chunk_index": 32, "_doc_id": "32_9048055427486653072"}}
{"doc_id": "33_3315895061020911663", "text": "<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> </<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>ul<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><h2 id=\"v-for-with-v-if\"><code>v-for<code> 与 <code>v-if<code> <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#v-for-with-v-if\">​<a><h2><p>当它们同时存在于一个节点上时，<code>v-if<code> 比 <code>v-for<code> 的优先级更高。这意味着 <code>v-if<code> 的条件将无法访问到 <code>v-for<code> 作用域内定义的变量别名：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><!--<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/list.html", "title": "列表渲染", "doc_id": "2e19846da261447dabac0df9909413cb", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1081, "chunk_index": 33, "_doc_id": "33_3315895061020911663"}}
{"doc_id": "34_8901542421981009322", "text": "emplate<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><!--<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> 这会抛出一个错误，因为属性 todo 此时<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> 没有在该实例上定义<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>--><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/list.html", "title": "列表渲染", "doc_id": "2e19846da261447dabac0df9909413cb", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1081, "chunk_index": 34, "_doc_id": "34_8901542421981009322"}}
{"doc_id": "35_4318384051605757628", "text": "pan><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> 没有在该实例上定义<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>--><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>li<span><span> v-for<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>todo <span><span>in<span><span> todos<span><span>\"<span><span> v-if<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>!<span><span>todo.isComplete<span><span>\"<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> {{ todo.name }}<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/list.html", "title": "列表渲染", "doc_id": "2e19846da261447dabac0df9909413cb", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1081, "chunk_index": 35, "_doc_id": "35_4318384051605757628"}}
{"doc_id": "36_51222554576565688", "text": "omplete<span><span>\"<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> {{ todo.name }}<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>li<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>在外先包装一层 <code><template><code> 再在其上使用 <code>v-for<code> 可以解决这个问题 (这也更加明显易读)：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>template<span><span> v-for<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>todo <span><span>in<span><span> todos<span><span>\"<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/list.html", "title": "列表渲染", "doc_id": "2e19846da261447dabac0df9909413cb", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1081, "chunk_index": 36, "_doc_id": "36_51222554576565688"}}
{"doc_id": "37_3292393375933010403", "text": "span><span>\"<span><span>todo <span><span>in<span><span> todos<span><span>\"<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>li<span><span> v-if<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>!<span><span>todo.isComplete<span><span>\"<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> {{ todo.name }}<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> </<span><span>li<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/list.html", "title": "列表渲染", "doc_id": "2e19846da261447dabac0df9909413cb", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1081, "chunk_index": 37, "_doc_id": "37_3292393375933010403"}}
{"doc_id": "38_3106612263747189113", "text": "an> {{ todo.name }}<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> </<span><span>li<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><div class=\"warning custom-block\"><p class=\"custom-block-title\">注意<p><p>同时使用 <code>v-if<code> 和 <code>v-for<code> 是<strong>不推荐的<strong>，因为这样二者的优先级不明显。<p><p>两种常见的情况可能导致这种用法：<p><ul><li><p>过滤列表中的项目 (例如，<code>v-for=\"user in users\" v-if=\"user.isActive\"<code>)。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/list.html", "title": "列表渲染", "doc_id": "2e19846da261447dabac0df9909413cb", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1081, "chunk_index": 38, "_doc_id": "38_3106612263747189113"}}
{"doc_id": "39_7476720183816587270", "text": ">两种常见的情况可能导致这种用法：<p><ul><li><p>过滤列表中的项目 (例如，<code>v-for=\"user in users\" v-if=\"user.isActive\"<code>)。在这种情况下，可以用一个新的计算属性来替换 <code>users<code>，该属性返回过滤后的列表 (例如 <code>activeUsers<code>)。<p><li><li><p>避免渲染应该隐藏的列表 (例如 <code>v-for=\"user in users\" v-if=\"shouldShowUsers\"<code>)。在这种情况下，将 <code>v-if<code> 移至容器元素 (如 <code>ul<code>、<code>ol<code>)。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/list.html", "title": "列表渲染", "doc_id": "2e19846da261447dabac0df9909413cb", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1081, "chunk_index": 39, "_doc_id": "39_7476720183816587270"}}
{"doc_id": "40_6403766015559181351", "text": "s\" v-if=\"shouldShowUsers\"<code>)。在这种情况下，将 <code>v-if<code> 移至容器元素 (如 <code>ul<code>、<code>ol<code>)。<p><li><ul><div><h2 id=\"maintaining-state-with-key\">通过 key 管理状态 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#maintaining-state-with-key\">​<a><h2><p>Vue 默认按照“就地更新”的策略来更新通过 <code>v-for<code> 渲染的元素列表。当数据项的顺序改变时，Vue 不会随之移动 DOM 元素的顺序，而是就地更新每个元素，确保它们在原本指定的索引位置上渲染。<p><p>默认模式是高效的，但<strong>只适用于列表渲染输出的结果不依赖子组件状态或者临时 DOM 状态 (例如表单输入值) 的情况<strong>。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/list.html", "title": "列表渲染", "doc_id": "2e19846da261447dabac0df9909413cb", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1081, "chunk_index": 40, "_doc_id": "40_6403766015559181351"}}
{"doc_id": "41_6632030842751464029", "text": "元素，确保它们在原本指定的索引位置上渲染。<p><p>默认模式是高效的，但<strong>只适用于列表渲染输出的结果不依赖子组件状态或者临时 DOM 状态 (例如表单输入值) 的情况<strong>。<p><p>为了给 Vue 一个提示，以便它可以跟踪每个节点的标识，从而重用和重新排序现有的元素，你需要为每个元素对应的块提供一个唯一的 <code>key<code> attribute：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>div<span><span> v-for<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>item <span><span>in<span><span> items<span><span>\"<span><span> :<span><span>key<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>item.id<span><span>\"<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/list.html", "title": "列表渲染", "doc_id": "2e19846da261447dabac0df9909413cb", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1081, "chunk_index": 41, "_doc_id": "41_6632030842751464029"}}
{"doc_id": "42_3535023705084569588", "text": ":<span><span>key<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>item.id<span><span>\"<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <!-- 内容 --><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>div<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>当你使用 <code><template v-for><code> 时，", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/list.html", "title": "列表渲染", "doc_id": "2e19846da261447dabac0df9909413cb", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1081, "chunk_index": 42, "_doc_id": "42_3535023705084569588"}}
{"doc_id": "43_249893855415273396", "text": "an></<span><span>div<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>当你使用 <code><template v-for><code> 时，<code>key<code> 应该被放置在这个 <code><template><code> 容器上：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>template<span><span> v-for<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>todo <span><span>in<span><span> todos<span><span>\"<span><span> :<span><span>key<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>todo.name<span><span>\"<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/list.html", "title": "列表渲染", "doc_id": "2e19846da261447dabac0df9909413cb", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1081, "chunk_index": 43, "_doc_id": "43_249893855415273396"}}
{"doc_id": "44_944499345712292499", "text": "span><span>key<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>todo.name<span><span>\"<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>li<span><span>>{{ todo.name }}</<span><span>li<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><div class=\"tip custom-block\"><p class=\"custom-block-title\">注意<p><p><code>key<code> 在这里是一个通过 <code>v-bind<code> 绑定的特殊 attribute。请不要和<a href=\"#v-for-with-an-object\">在 <code>v-for<code> 中使用对象<a>里所提到的对象属性名相混淆。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/list.html", "title": "列表渲染", "doc_id": "2e19846da261447dabac0df9909413cb", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1081, "chunk_index": 44, "_doc_id": "44_944499345712292499"}}
{"doc_id": "45_834672940450070321", "text": "code> 绑定的特殊 attribute。请不要和<a href=\"#v-for-with-an-object\">在 <code>v-for<code> 中使用对象<a>里所提到的对象属性名相混淆。<p><div><p>推荐在任何可行的时候为 <code>v-for<code> 提供一个 <code>key<code> attribute，除非所迭代的 DOM 内容非常简单 (例如：不包含组件或有状态的 DOM 元素)，或者你想有意采用默认行为来提高性能。<p><p><code>key<code> 绑定的值期望是一个基础类型的值，例如字符串或 number 类型。不要用对象作为 <code>v-for<code> 的 key。关于 <code>key<code> attribute 的更多用途细节，请参阅 <a href=\"/api/built-in-special-attributes.html#key\"><code>key<code> API 文档<a>。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/list.html", "title": "列表渲染", "doc_id": "2e19846da261447dabac0df9909413cb", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1081, "chunk_index": 45, "_doc_id": "45_834672940450070321"}}
{"doc_id": "46_5542745675091959510", "text": "attribute 的更多用途细节，请参阅 <a href=\"/api/built-in-special-attributes.html#key\"><code>key<code> API 文档<a>。<p><h2 id=\"v-for-with-a-component\">组件上使用 <code>v-for<code> <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#v-for-with-a-component\">​<a><h2><blockquote><p>这一小节假设你已了解<a href=\"/guide/essentials/component-basics.html\">组件<a>的相关知识，或者你也可以先跳过这里，之后再回来看。<p><blockquote><p>我们可以直接在组件上使用 <code>v-for<code>，", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/list.html", "title": "列表渲染", "doc_id": "2e19846da261447dabac0df9909413cb", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1081, "chunk_index": 46, "_doc_id": "46_5542745675091959510"}}
{"doc_id": "47_3094216998978268528", "text": "mponent-basics.html\">组件<a>的相关知识，或者你也可以先跳过这里，之后再回来看。<p><blockquote><p>我们可以直接在组件上使用 <code>v-for<code>，和在一般的元素上使用没有区别 (别忘记提供一个 <code>key<code>)：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>MyComponent<span><span> v-for<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>item <span><span>in<span><span> items<span><span>\"<span><span> :<span><span>key<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>item.id<span><span>\"<span><span> /><span><span><code><pre><div><p>但是，", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/list.html", "title": "列表渲染", "doc_id": "2e19846da261447dabac0df9909413cb", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1081, "chunk_index": 47, "_doc_id": "47_3094216998978268528"}}
{"doc_id": "48_3216765180830790387", "text": "span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>item.id<span><span>\"<span><span> /><span><span><code><pre><div><p>但是，这不会自动将任何数据传递给组件，因为组件有自己独立的作用域。为了将迭代后的数据传递到组件中，我们还需要传递 props：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>MyComponent<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> v-for<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>(item, index) <span><span>in<span><span> items<span><span>\"<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/list.html", "title": "列表渲染", "doc_id": "2e19846da261447dabac0df9909413cb", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1081, "chunk_index": 48, "_doc_id": "48_3216765180830790387"}}
{"doc_id": "49_4160086158230333895", "text": "n>=<span><span>\"<span><span>(item, index) <span><span>in<span><span> items<span><span>\"<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> :<span><span>item<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>item<span><span>\"<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> :<span><span>index<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>index<span><span>\"<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> :<span><span>key<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>item.id<span><span>\"<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/list.html", "title": "列表渲染", "doc_id": "2e19846da261447dabac0df9909413cb", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1081, "chunk_index": 49, "_doc_id": "49_4160086158230333895"}}
{"doc_id": "50_4684799687285183493", "text": "line\"><span> :<span><span>key<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>item.id<span><span>\"<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>/><span><span><code><pre><div><p>不自动将 <code>item<code> 注入组件的原因是，这会使组件与 <code>v-for<code> 的工作方式紧密耦合。明确其数据的来源可以使组件在其他情况下重用。<p><h2 id=\"array-change-detection\">数组变化侦测 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#array-change-detection\">​<a><h2><h3 id=\"mutation-methods\">变更方法 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#mutation-methods\">​<a><h3><p>Vue 能够侦听响应式数组的变更方法，并在它们被调用时触发相关的更新。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/list.html", "title": "列表渲染", "doc_id": "2e19846da261447dabac0df9909413cb", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1081, "chunk_index": 50, "_doc_id": "50_4684799687285183493"}}
{"doc_id": "51_92971715435898199", "text": "更方法 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#mutation-methods\">​<a><h3><p>Vue 能够侦听响应式数组的变更方法，并在它们被调用时触发相关的更新。这些变更方法包括：<p><ul><li><code>push()<code><li><li><code>pop()<code><li><li><code>shift()<code><li><li><code>unshift()<code><li><li><code>splice()<code><li><li><code>sort()<code><li><li><code>reverse()<code><li><ul><h3 id=\"replacing-an-array\">替换一个数组 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#replacing-an-array\">​<a><h3><p>变更方法，顾名思义，就是会对调用它们的原数组进行变更。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/list.html", "title": "列表渲染", "doc_id": "2e19846da261447dabac0df9909413cb", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1081, "chunk_index": 51, "_doc_id": "51_92971715435898199"}}
{"doc_id": "52_366520456277389969", "text": "y\">替换一个数组 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#replacing-an-array\">​<a><h3><p>变更方法，顾名思义，就是会对调用它们的原数组进行变更。相对地，也有一些不可变 (immutable) 方法，例如 <code>filter()<code>，<code>concat()<code> 和 <code>slice()<code>，这些都不会更改原数组，而总是<strong>返回一个新数组<strong>。当遇到的是非变更方法时，我们需要将旧的数组替换为新的：<p><div class=\"composition-api\"><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// `items` 是一个数组的 ref<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>items.", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/list.html", "title": "列表渲染", "doc_id": "2e19846da261447dabac0df9909413cb", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1081, "chunk_index": 52, "_doc_id": "52_366520456277389969"}}
{"doc_id": "53_2153976052235849609", "text": "de\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// `items` 是一个数组的 ref<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>items.value <span><span>=<span><span> items.value.<span><span>filter<span><span>((<span><span>item<span><span>) <span><span>=><span><span> item.message.", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/list.html", "title": "列表渲染", "doc_id": "2e19846da261447dabac0df9909413cb", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1081, "chunk_index": 53, "_doc_id": "53_2153976052235849609"}}
{"doc_id": "54_3862304535606709888", "text": "pan><span>filter<span><span>((<span><span>item<span><span>) <span><span>=><span><span> item.message.<span><span>match<span><span>(<span><span>/<span><span>Foo<span><span>/<span><span>))<span><span><code><pre><div><div><div class=\"options-api\"><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>this<span><span>.items <span><span>=<span><span> this<span><span>.items.", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/list.html", "title": "列表渲染", "doc_id": "2e19846da261447dabac0df9909413cb", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1081, "chunk_index": 54, "_doc_id": "54_3862304535606709888"}}
{"doc_id": "55_8353381481391440595", "text": "de><span class=\"line\"><span>this<span><span>.items <span><span>=<span><span> this<span><span>.items.<span><span>filter<span><span>((<span><span>item<span><span>) <span><span>=><span><span> item.message.<span><span>match<span><span>(<span><span>/<span><span>Foo<span><span>/<span><span>))<span><span><code><pre><div><div><p>你可能认为这将导致 Vue 丢弃现有的 DOM 并重新渲染整个列表——幸运的是，情况并非如此。Vue 实现了一些巧妙的方法来最大化对 DOM 元素的重用，因此用另一个包含部分重叠对象的数组来做替换，仍会是一种非常高效的操作。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/list.html", "title": "列表渲染", "doc_id": "2e19846da261447dabac0df9909413cb", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1081, "chunk_index": 55, "_doc_id": "55_8353381481391440595"}}
{"doc_id": "56_200815129242512938", "text": "e 丢弃现有的 DOM 并重新渲染整个列表——幸运的是，情况并非如此。Vue 实现了一些巧妙的方法来最大化对 DOM 元素的重用，因此用另一个包含部分重叠对象的数组来做替换，仍会是一种非常高效的操作。<p><h2 id=\"displaying-filtered-sorted-results\">展示过滤或排序后的结果 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#displaying-filtered-sorted-results\">​<a><h2><p>有时，我们希望显示数组经过过滤或排序后的内容，而不实际变更或重置原始数据。在这种情况下，你可以创建返回已过滤或已排序数组的计算属性。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/list.html", "title": "列表渲染", "doc_id": "2e19846da261447dabac0df9909413cb", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1081, "chunk_index": 56, "_doc_id": "56_200815129242512938"}}
{"doc_id": "57_4185326367753878505", "text": "ltered-sorted-results\">​<a><h2><p>有时，我们希望显示数组经过过滤或排序后的内容，而不实际变更或重置原始数据。在这种情况下，你可以创建返回已过滤或已排序数组的计算属性。<p><p>举例来说：<p><div class=\"composition-api\"><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> numbers<span><span> =<span><span> ref<span><span>([<span><span>1<span><span>, <span><span>2<span><span>, <span><span>3<span><span>, <span><span>4<span><span>, <span><span>5<span><span>])<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/list.html", "title": "列表渲染", "doc_id": "2e19846da261447dabac0df9909413cb", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1081, "chunk_index": 57, "_doc_id": "57_4185326367753878505"}}
{"doc_id": "58_8332200226057013641", "text": "span>, <span><span>4<span><span>, <span><span>5<span><span>])<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> evenNumbers<span><span> =<span><span> computed<span><span>(() <span><span>=><span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> return<span><span> numbers.value.<span><span>filter<span><span>((<span><span>n<span><span>) <span><span>=><span><span> n <span><span>%<span><span> 2<span><span> ===<span><span> 0<span><span>)<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/list.html", "title": "列表渲染", "doc_id": "2e19846da261447dabac0df9909413cb", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1081, "chunk_index": 58, "_doc_id": "58_8332200226057013641"}}
{"doc_id": "59_6125212641823832747", "text": "=><span><span> n <span><span>%<span><span> 2<span><span> ===<span><span> 0<span><span>)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>})<span><span><code><pre><div><div><div class=\"options-api\"><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>data<span><span>() {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> return<span><span> {<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/list.html", "title": "列表渲染", "doc_id": "2e19846da261447dabac0df9909413cb", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1081, "chunk_index": 59, "_doc_id": "59_6125212641823832747"}}
{"doc_id": "60_5943186744650127021", "text": "\"><span>data<span><span>() {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> return<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> numbers: [<span><span>1<span><span>, <span><span>2<span><span>, <span><span>3<span><span>, <span><span>4<span><span>, <span><span>5<span><span>]<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>},<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>computed<span><span>: {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> evenNumbers<span><span>() {<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/list.html", "title": "列表渲染", "doc_id": "2e19846da261447dabac0df9909413cb", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1081, "chunk_index": 60, "_doc_id": "60_5943186744650127021"}}
{"doc_id": "61_8619816454585837738", "text": "mputed<span><span>: {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> evenNumbers<span><span>() {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> return<span><span> this<span><span>.numbers.<span><span>filter<span><span>(<span><span>n<span><span> =><span><span> n <span><span>%<span><span> 2<span><span> ===<span><span> 0<span><span>)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/list.html", "title": "列表渲染", "doc_id": "2e19846da261447dabac0df9909413cb", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1081, "chunk_index": 61, "_doc_id": "61_8619816454585837738"}}
{"doc_id": "62_6598667421124500450", "text": "n> 2<span><span> ===<span><span> 0<span><span>)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span><code><pre><div><div><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>li<span><span> v-for<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>n <span><span>in<span><span> evenNumbers<span><span>\"<span><span>>{{ n }}</<span><span>li<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>在计算属性不可行的情况下 (例如在多层嵌套的 <code>v-for<code> 循环中)，", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/list.html", "title": "列表渲染", "doc_id": "2e19846da261447dabac0df9909413cb", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1081, "chunk_index": 62, "_doc_id": "62_6598667421124500450"}}
{"doc_id": "63_3890958697012543445", "text": "n><span>li<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>在计算属性不可行的情况下 (例如在多层嵌套的 <code>v-for<code> 循环中)，你可以使用以下方法：<p><div class=\"composition-api\"><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> sets<span><span> =<span><span> ref<span><span>([<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/list.html", "title": "列表渲染", "doc_id": "2e19846da261447dabac0df9909413cb", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1081, "chunk_index": 63, "_doc_id": "63_3890958697012543445"}}
{"doc_id": "64_357345792174074578", "text": "n class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> sets<span><span> =<span><span> ref<span><span>([<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> [<span><span>1<span><span>, <span><span>2<span><span>, <span><span>3<span><span>, <span><span>4<span><span>, <span><span>5<span><span>],<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> [<span><span>6<span><span>, <span><span>7<span><span>, <span><span>8<span><span>, <span><span>9<span><span>, <span><span>10<span><span>]<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>])<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/list.html", "title": "列表渲染", "doc_id": "2e19846da261447dabac0df9909413cb", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1081, "chunk_index": 64, "_doc_id": "64_357345792174074578"}}
{"doc_id": "65_8485555958933350975", "text": "span>9<span><span>, <span><span>10<span><span>]<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>])<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>function<span><span> even<span><span>(<span><span>numbers<span><span>) {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> return<span><span> numbers.<span><span>filter<span><span>((<span><span>number<span><span>) <span><span>=><span><span> number <span><span>%<span><span> 2<span><span> ===<span><span> 0<span><span>)<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/list.html", "title": "列表渲染", "doc_id": "2e19846da261447dabac0df9909413cb", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1081, "chunk_index": 65, "_doc_id": "65_8485555958933350975"}}
