{"doc_id": "71_4615510616479612635", "text": "even<span><span>(numbers)<span><span>\"<span><span>>{{ n }}</<span><span>li<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>ul<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>在计算属性中使用 <code>reverse()<code> 和 <code>sort()<code> 的时候务必小心！这两个方法将变更原始数组，计算函数中不应该这么做。请在调用这些方法之前创建一个原数组的副本：<p><div class=\"language-diff\"> <span class=\"lang\">diff<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>- return numbers.reverse()<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/list.html", "title": "列表渲染", "doc_id": "2e19846da261447dabac0df9909413cb", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1081, "chunk_index": 71, "_doc_id": "71_4615510616479612635"}}
{"doc_id": "72_1729702475534096786", "text": "s=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>- return numbers.reverse()<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>+ return [...numbers].reverse()<span><span><code><pre><div><div><div>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/list.html", "title": "列表渲染", "doc_id": "2e19846da261447dabac0df9909413cb", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1081, "chunk_index": 72, "_doc_id": "72_1729702475534096786"}}
{"doc_id": "0_734584512330508212", "text": "<div><div><h1 id=\"class-and-style-bindings\">Class 与 Style 绑定 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#class-and-style-bindings\">​<a><h1><p>数据绑定的一个常见需求场景是操纵元素的 CSS class 列表和内联样式。因为 <code>class<code> 和 <code>style<code> 都是 attribute，我们可以和其他 attribute 一样使用 <code>v-bind<code> 将它们和动态的字符串绑定。但是，在处理比较复杂的绑定时，通过拼接生成字符串是麻烦且易出错的。因此，Vue 专门为 <code>class<code> 和 <code>style<code> 的 <code>v-bind<code> 用法提供了特殊的功能增强。除了字符串外，表达式的值也可以是对象或数组。<p><h2 id=\"binding-html-classes\">绑定 HTML class <a class=\"header-anchor\"", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/class-and-style.html", "title": "Class 与 Style 绑定", "doc_id": "768d205c54fe4a179e8e603a21801000", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 797, "chunk_index": 0, "_doc_id": "0_734584512330508212"}}
{"doc_id": "1_597954815941686560", "text": "的功能增强。除了字符串外，表达式的值也可以是对象或数组。<p><h2 id=\"binding-html-classes\">绑定 HTML class <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#binding-html-classes\">​<a><h2><h3 id=\"binding-to-objects\">绑定对象 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#binding-to-objects\">​<a><h3><p>我们可以给 <code>:class<code> (<code>v-bind:class<code> 的缩写) 传递一个对象来动态切换 class：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>div<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/class-and-style.html", "title": "Class 与 Style 绑定", "doc_id": "768d205c54fe4a179e8e603a21801000", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 797, "chunk_index": 1, "_doc_id": "1_597954815941686560"}}
{"doc_id": "2_2666086225288142162", "text": "><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>div<span><span> :<span><span>class<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>{ active: isActive }<span><span>\"<span><span>></<span><span>div<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>上面的语法表示 <code>active<code> 是否存在取决于数据属性 <code>isActive<code> 的<a href=\"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Glossary/Truthy\" target=\"_blank\">真假值<a>。<p><p>你可以在对象中写多个字段来操作多个 class。此外，<code>:class<code> 指令也可以和一般的 <code>class<code> attribute 共存。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/class-and-style.html", "title": "Class 与 Style 绑定", "doc_id": "768d205c54fe4a179e8e603a21801000", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 797, "chunk_index": 2, "_doc_id": "2_2666086225288142162"}}
{"doc_id": "3_5964135936635237841", "text": "真假值<a>。<p><p>你可以在对象中写多个字段来操作多个 class。此外，<code>:class<code> 指令也可以和一般的 <code>class<code> attribute 共存。举例来说，下面这样的状态：<p><div class=\"composition-api\"><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> isActive<span><span> =<span><span> ref<span><span>(<span><span>true<span><span>)<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/class-and-style.html", "title": "Class 与 Style 绑定", "doc_id": "768d205c54fe4a179e8e603a21801000", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 797, "chunk_index": 3, "_doc_id": "3_5964135936635237841"}}
{"doc_id": "4_7412097866390408402", "text": "<span> isActive<span><span> =<span><span> ref<span><span>(<span><span>true<span><span>)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> hasError<span><span> =<span><span> ref<span><span>(<span><span>false<span><span>)<span><span><code><pre><div><div><div class=\"options-api\"><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>data<span><span>() {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> return<span><span> {<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/class-and-style.html", "title": "Class 与 Style 绑定", "doc_id": "768d205c54fe4a179e8e603a21801000", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 797, "chunk_index": 4, "_doc_id": "4_7412097866390408402"}}
{"doc_id": "5_1274288942395957713", "text": "\"><span>data<span><span>() {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> return<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> isActive: <span><span>true<span><span>,<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> hasError: <span><span>false<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/class-and-style.html", "title": "Class 与 Style 绑定", "doc_id": "768d205c54fe4a179e8e603a21801000", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 797, "chunk_index": 5, "_doc_id": "5_1274288942395957713"}}
{"doc_id": "6_5479003255530477579", "text": "class=\"line\"><span> hasError: <span><span>false<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span><code><pre><div><div><p>配合以下模板：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>div<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> class<span><span>=<span><span>\"static\"<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/class-and-style.html", "title": "Class 与 Style 绑定", "doc_id": "768d205c54fe4a179e8e603a21801000", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 797, "chunk_index": 6, "_doc_id": "6_5479003255530477579"}}
{"doc_id": "7_3855693260378572675", "text": "><span>div<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> class<span><span>=<span><span>\"static\"<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> :<span><span>class<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>{ active: isActive, <span><span>'text-danger'<span><span>: hasError }<span><span>\"<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/class-and-style.html", "title": "Class 与 Style 绑定", "doc_id": "768d205c54fe4a179e8e603a21801000", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 797, "chunk_index": 7, "_doc_id": "7_3855693260378572675"}}
{"doc_id": "8_2731515688531594353", "text": "span>{ active: isActive, <span><span>'text-danger'<span><span>: hasError }<span><span>\"<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>></<span><span>div<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>渲染的结果会是：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>div<span><span> class<span><span>=<span><span>\"static active\"<span><span>></<span><span>div<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>当 <code>isActive<code> 或者 <code>hasError<code> 改变时，class 列表会随之更新。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/class-and-style.html", "title": "Class 与 Style 绑定", "doc_id": "768d205c54fe4a179e8e603a21801000", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 797, "chunk_index": 8, "_doc_id": "8_2731515688531594353"}}
{"doc_id": "9_2586728573003327069", "text": "an>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>当 <code>isActive<code> 或者 <code>hasError<code> 改变时，class 列表会随之更新。举例来说，如果 <code>hasError<code> 变为 <code>true<code>，class 列表也会变成 <code>\"static active text-danger\"<code>。<p><p>绑定的对象并不一定需要写成内联字面量的形式，也可以直接绑定一个对象：<p><div class=\"composition-api\"><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> classObject<span><span> =<span><span> reactive<span><span>({<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/class-and-style.html", "title": "Class 与 Style 绑定", "doc_id": "768d205c54fe4a179e8e603a21801000", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 797, "chunk_index": 9, "_doc_id": "9_2586728573003327069"}}
{"doc_id": "10_4286768172945305159", "text": "e\"><span>const<span><span> classObject<span><span> =<span><span> reactive<span><span>({<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> active: <span><span>true<span><span>,<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> 'text-danger'<span><span>: <span><span>false<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>})<span><span><code><pre><div><div><div class=\"options-api\"><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>data<span><span>() {<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/class-and-style.html", "title": "Class 与 Style 绑定", "doc_id": "768d205c54fe4a179e8e603a21801000", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 797, "chunk_index": 10, "_doc_id": "10_4286768172945305159"}}
{"doc_id": "11_1192037600641513214", "text": "e class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>data<span><span>() {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> return<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> classObject: {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> active: <span><span>true<span><span>,<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> 'text-danger'<span><span>: <span><span>false<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/class-and-style.html", "title": "Class 与 Style 绑定", "doc_id": "768d205c54fe4a179e8e603a21801000", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 797, "chunk_index": 11, "_doc_id": "11_1192037600641513214"}}
