{"doc_id": "13_8154212720220780270", "text": "/<span><span>div<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>这将渲染：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>div<span><span> class<span><span>=<span><span>\"active\"<span><span>></<span><span>div<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>我们也可以绑定一个返回对象的<a href=\"./computed.html\">计算属性<a>。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/class-and-style.html", "title": "Class 与 Style 绑定", "doc_id": "768d205c54fe4a179e8e603a21801000", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 797, "chunk_index": 13, "_doc_id": "13_8154212720220780270"}}
