{"doc_id": "16_4211912236033078460", "text": "sObject<span><span> =<span><span> computed<span><span>(() <span><span>=><span><span> ({<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> active: isActive.value <span><span>&&<span><span> !<span><span>error.value,<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> 'text-danger'<span><span>: error.value <span><span>&&<span><span> error.value.type <span><span>===<span><span> 'fatal'<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/class-and-style.html", "title": "Class 与 Style 绑定", "doc_id": "768d205c54fe4a179e8e603a21801000", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 797, "chunk_index": 16, "_doc_id": "16_4211912236033078460"}}
