{"doc_id": "23_7287691733638758215", "text": "activeClass<span><span> =<span><span> ref<span><span>(<span><span>'active'<span><span>)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> errorClass<span><span> =<span><span> ref<span><span>(<span><span>'text-danger'<span><span>)<span><span><code><pre><div><div><div class=\"options-api\"><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>data<span><span>() {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> return<span><span> {<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/class-and-style.html", "title": "Class 与 Style 绑定", "doc_id": "768d205c54fe4a179e8e603a21801000", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 797, "chunk_index": 23, "_doc_id": "23_7287691733638758215"}}
{"doc_id": "24_4438104151729184136", "text": "\"><span>data<span><span>() {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> return<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> activeClass: <span><span>'active'<span><span>,<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> errorClass: <span><span>'text-danger'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/class-and-style.html", "title": "Class 与 Style 绑定", "doc_id": "768d205c54fe4a179e8e603a21801000", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 797, "chunk_index": 24, "_doc_id": "24_4438104151729184136"}}
{"doc_id": "25_5138323413347777076", "text": "e\"><span> errorClass: <span><span>'text-danger'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span><code><pre><div><div><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>div<span><span> :<span><span>class<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>[activeClass,", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/class-and-style.html", "title": "Class 与 Style 绑定", "doc_id": "768d205c54fe4a179e8e603a21801000", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 797, "chunk_index": 25, "_doc_id": "25_5138323413347777076"}}
{"doc_id": "26_8526737577481860483", "text": "><<span><span>div<span><span> :<span><span>class<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>[activeClass, errorClass]<span><span>\"<span><span>></<span><span>div<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>渲染的结果是：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>div<span><span> class<span><span>=<span><span>\"active text-danger\"<span><span>></<span><span>div<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>如果你也想在数组中有条件地渲染某个 class，", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/class-and-style.html", "title": "Class 与 Style 绑定", "doc_id": "768d205c54fe4a179e8e603a21801000", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 797, "chunk_index": 26, "_doc_id": "26_8526737577481860483"}}
{"doc_id": "27_6798443481203740739", "text": "r\"<span><span>></<span><span>div<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>如果你也想在数组中有条件地渲染某个 class，你可以使用三元表达式：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>div<span><span> :<span><span>class<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>[isActive <span><span>?<span><span> activeClass <span><span>:<span><span> ''<span><span>, errorClass]<span><span>\"<span><span>></<span><span>div<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p><code>errorClass<code> 会一直存在，", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/class-and-style.html", "title": "Class 与 Style 绑定", "doc_id": "768d205c54fe4a179e8e603a21801000", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 797, "chunk_index": 27, "_doc_id": "27_6798443481203740739"}}
{"doc_id": "28_6874941333466007874", "text": "an><span>></<span><span>div<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p><code>errorClass<code> 会一直存在，但 <code>activeClass<code> 只会在 <code>isActive<code> 为真时才存在。<p><p>然而，这可能在有多个依赖条件的 class 时会有些冗长。因此也可以在数组中嵌套对象：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>div<span><span> :<span><span>class<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>[{ [activeClass]: isActive },", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/class-and-style.html", "title": "Class 与 Style 绑定", "doc_id": "768d205c54fe4a179e8e603a21801000", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 797, "chunk_index": 28, "_doc_id": "28_6874941333466007874"}}
{"doc_id": "29_3031917037273478688", "text": "v<span><span> :<span><span>class<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>[{ [activeClass]: isActive }, errorClass]<span><span>\"<span><span>></<span><span>div<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><h3 id=\"with-components\">在组件上使用 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#with-components\">​<a><h3><blockquote><p>本节假设你已经有 <a href=\"/guide/essentials/component-basics.html\">Vue 组件<a>的知识基础。如果没有，你也可以暂时跳过，以后再阅读。<p><blockquote><p>对于只有一个根元素的组件，当你使用了 <code>class<code> attribute 时，这些 class 会被添加到根元素上并与该元素上已有的 class 合并。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/class-and-style.html", "title": "Class 与 Style 绑定", "doc_id": "768d205c54fe4a179e8e603a21801000", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 797, "chunk_index": 29, "_doc_id": "29_3031917037273478688"}}
{"doc_id": "30_8561396916958397278", "text": "blockquote><p>对于只有一个根元素的组件，当你使用了 <code>class<code> attribute 时，这些 class 会被添加到根元素上并与该元素上已有的 class 合并。<p><p>举例来说，如果你声明了一个组件名叫 <code>MyComponent<code>，模板如下：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><!-- 子组件模板 --><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/class-and-style.html", "title": "Class 与 Style 绑定", "doc_id": "768d205c54fe4a179e8e603a21801000", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 797, "chunk_index": 30, "_doc_id": "30_8561396916958397278"}}
{"doc_id": "31_777931860666390824", "text": "an><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><!-- 子组件模板 --><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>p<span><span> class<span><span>=<span><span>\"foo bar\"<span><span>>Hi!</<span><span>p<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>在使用时添加一些 class：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><!-- 在使用组件时 --><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>MyComponent<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/class-and-style.html", "title": "Class 与 Style 绑定", "doc_id": "768d205c54fe4a179e8e603a21801000", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 797, "chunk_index": 31, "_doc_id": "31_777931860666390824"}}
{"doc_id": "32_7606014377440295118", "text": "ne\"><span><!-- 在使用组件时 --><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>MyComponent<span><span> class<span><span>=<span><span>\"baz boo\"<span><span> /><span><span><code><pre><div><p>渲染出的 HTML 为：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>p<span><span> class<span><span>=<span><span>\"foo bar baz boo\"<span><span>>Hi!</<span><span>p<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>Class 的绑定也是同样的：<p><div", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/class-and-style.html", "title": "Class 与 Style 绑定", "doc_id": "768d205c54fe4a179e8e603a21801000", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 797, "chunk_index": 32, "_doc_id": "32_7606014377440295118"}}
{"doc_id": "33_6119239768524189975", "text": "o\"<span><span>>Hi!</<span><span>p<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>Class 的绑定也是同样的：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>MyComponent<span><span> :<span><span>class<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>{ active: isActive }<span><span>\"<span><span> /><span><span><code><pre><div><p>当 <code>isActive<code> 为真时，", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/class-and-style.html", "title": "Class 与 Style 绑定", "doc_id": "768d205c54fe4a179e8e603a21801000", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 797, "chunk_index": 33, "_doc_id": "33_6119239768524189975"}}
{"doc_id": "34_7647309463507760555", "text": "ve: isActive }<span><span>\"<span><span> /><span><span><code><pre><div><p>当 <code>isActive<code> 为真时，被渲染的 HTML 会是：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>p<span><span> class<span><span>=<span><span>\"foo bar active\"<span><span>>Hi!</<span><span>p<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>如果你的组件有多个根元素，你将需要指定哪个根元素来接收这个 class。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/class-and-style.html", "title": "Class 与 Style 绑定", "doc_id": "768d205c54fe4a179e8e603a21801000", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 797, "chunk_index": 34, "_doc_id": "34_7647309463507760555"}}
{"doc_id": "35_8228835671453466807", "text": ">>Hi!</<span><span>p<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>如果你的组件有多个根元素，你将需要指定哪个根元素来接收这个 class。你可以通过组件的 <code>$attrs<code> 属性来指定接收的元素：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><!-- MyComponent 模板使用 $attrs 时 --><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/class-and-style.html", "title": "Class 与 Style 绑定", "doc_id": "768d205c54fe4a179e8e603a21801000", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 797, "chunk_index": 35, "_doc_id": "35_8228835671453466807"}}
{"doc_id": "36_4787616788578513299", "text": "github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><!-- MyComponent 模板使用 $attrs 时 --><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>p<span><span> :<span><span>class<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>$attrs.class<span><span>\"<span><span>>Hi!</<span><span>p<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>span<span><span>>This is a child component</<span><span>span<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/class-and-style.html", "title": "Class 与 Style 绑定", "doc_id": "768d205c54fe4a179e8e603a21801000", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 797, "chunk_index": 36, "_doc_id": "36_4787616788578513299"}}
{"doc_id": "37_2399916889092090752", "text": "><code><pre><div><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>MyComponent<span><span> class<span><span>=<span><span>\"baz\"<span><span> /><span><span><code><pre><div><p>这将被渲染为：<p><div class=\"language-html\"> <span class=\"lang\">html<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>p<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/class-and-style.html", "title": "Class 与 Style 绑定", "doc_id": "768d205c54fe4a179e8e603a21801000", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 797, "chunk_index": 37, "_doc_id": "37_2399916889092090752"}}
{"doc_id": "38_6152022432917372082", "text": "an><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>p<span><span> class<span><span>=<span><span>\"baz\"<span><span>>Hi!</<span><span>p<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>span<span><span>>This is a child component</<span><span>span<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>你可以在<a href=\"/guide/components/attrs.html\">透传 Attribute<a> 一章中了解更多组件的 attribute 继承的细节。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/class-and-style.html", "title": "Class 与 Style 绑定", "doc_id": "768d205c54fe4a179e8e603a21801000", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 797, "chunk_index": 38, "_doc_id": "38_6152022432917372082"}}
{"doc_id": "39_215732399877045740", "text": "><pre><div><p>你可以在<a href=\"/guide/components/attrs.html\">透传 Attribute<a> 一章中了解更多组件的 attribute 继承的细节。<p><h2 id=\"binding-inline-styles\">绑定内联样式 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#binding-inline-styles\">​<a><h2><h3 id=\"binding-to-objects-1\">绑定对象 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#binding-to-objects-1\">​<a><h3><p><code>:style<code> 支持绑定 JavaScript 对象值，", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/class-and-style.html", "title": "Class 与 Style 绑定", "doc_id": "768d205c54fe4a179e8e603a21801000", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 797, "chunk_index": 39, "_doc_id": "39_215732399877045740"}}
{"doc_id": "40_5839872693455214831", "text": "lass=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#binding-to-objects-1\">​<a><h3><p><code>:style<code> 支持绑定 JavaScript 对象值，对应的是 <a href=\"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/API/HTMLElement/style\" target=\"_blank\">HTML 元素的 <code>style<code> 属性<a>：<p><div class=\"composition-api\"><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> activeColor<span><span> =<span><span> ref<span><span>(<span><span>'red'<span><span>)<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/class-and-style.html", "title": "Class 与 Style 绑定", "doc_id": "768d205c54fe4a179e8e603a21801000", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 797, "chunk_index": 40, "_doc_id": "40_5839872693455214831"}}
{"doc_id": "41_4137301156453646092", "text": "n> activeColor<span><span> =<span><span> ref<span><span>(<span><span>'red'<span><span>)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> fontSize<span><span> =<span><span> ref<span><span>(<span><span>30<span><span>)<span><span><code><pre><div><div><div class=\"options-api\"><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>data<span><span>() {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> return<span><span> {<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/class-and-style.html", "title": "Class 与 Style 绑定", "doc_id": "768d205c54fe4a179e8e603a21801000", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 797, "chunk_index": 41, "_doc_id": "41_4137301156453646092"}}
{"doc_id": "42_1235746389411099524", "text": "\"><span>data<span><span>() {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> return<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> activeColor: <span><span>'red'<span><span>,<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> fontSize: <span><span>30<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/class-and-style.html", "title": "Class 与 Style 绑定", "doc_id": "768d205c54fe4a179e8e603a21801000", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 797, "chunk_index": 42, "_doc_id": "42_1235746389411099524"}}
{"doc_id": "43_1527930713507664282", "text": "an class=\"line\"><span> fontSize: <span><span>30<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span><code><pre><div><div><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>div<span><span> :<span><span>style<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>{ color: activeColor, fontSize: fontSize <span><span>+<span><span> 'px'<span><span> }<span><span>\"<span><span>></<span><span>div<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>尽管推荐使用 camelCase，", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/class-and-style.html", "title": "Class 与 Style 绑定", "doc_id": "768d205c54fe4a179e8e603a21801000", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 797, "chunk_index": 43, "_doc_id": "43_1527930713507664282"}}
{"doc_id": "44_591768097653500798", "text": "n><span>\"<span><span>></<span><span>div<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>尽管推荐使用 camelCase，但 <code>:style<code> 也支持 kebab-cased 形式的 CSS 属性 key (对应其 CSS 中的实际名称)，", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/class-and-style.html", "title": "Class 与 Style 绑定", "doc_id": "768d205c54fe4a179e8e603a21801000", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 797, "chunk_index": 44, "_doc_id": "44_591768097653500798"}}
{"doc_id": "45_7124227357941255259", "text": "><pre><div><p>尽管推荐使用 camelCase，但 <code>:style<code> 也支持 kebab-cased 形式的 CSS 属性 key (对应其 CSS 中的实际名称)，例如：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>div<span><span> :<span><span>style<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>{ <span><span>'font-size'<span><span>: fontSize <span><span>+<span><span> 'px'<span><span> }<span><span>\"<span><span>></<span><span>div<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>直接绑定一个样式对象通常是一个好主意，", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/class-and-style.html", "title": "Class 与 Style 绑定", "doc_id": "768d205c54fe4a179e8e603a21801000", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 797, "chunk_index": 45, "_doc_id": "45_7124227357941255259"}}
{"doc_id": "46_4403408135385569849", "text": "<span>\"<span><span>></<span><span>div<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>直接绑定一个样式对象通常是一个好主意，这样可以使模板更加简洁：<p><div class=\"composition-api\"><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> styleObject<span><span> =<span><span> reactive<span><span>({<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> color: <span><span>'red'<span><span>,<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> fontSize: <span><span>'30px'<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/class-and-style.html", "title": "Class 与 Style 绑定", "doc_id": "768d205c54fe4a179e8e603a21801000", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 797, "chunk_index": 46, "_doc_id": "46_4403408135385569849"}}
{"doc_id": "47_4200919410927391099", "text": "n>'red'<span><span>,<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> fontSize: <span><span>'30px'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>})<span><span><code><pre><div><div><div class=\"options-api\"><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>data<span><span>() {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> return<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> styleObject: {<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/class-and-style.html", "title": "Class 与 Style 绑定", "doc_id": "768d205c54fe4a179e8e603a21801000", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 797, "chunk_index": 47, "_doc_id": "47_4200919410927391099"}}
{"doc_id": "48_6388811846662402740", "text": "\"line\"><span> return<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> styleObject: {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> color: <span><span>'red'<span><span>,<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> fontSize: <span><span>'13px'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/class-and-style.html", "title": "Class 与 Style 绑定", "doc_id": "768d205c54fe4a179e8e603a21801000", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 797, "chunk_index": 48, "_doc_id": "48_6388811846662402740"}}
{"doc_id": "49_8733296471935972324", "text": ">'13px'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span><code><pre><div><div><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>div<span><span> :<span><span>style<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>styleObject<span><span>\"<span><span>></<span><span>div<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>同样的，如果样式对象需要更复杂的逻辑，也可以使用返回样式对象的计算属性。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/class-and-style.html", "title": "Class 与 Style 绑定", "doc_id": "768d205c54fe4a179e8e603a21801000", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 797, "chunk_index": 49, "_doc_id": "49_8733296471935972324"}}
{"doc_id": "50_7446600006379060854", "text": "n>></<span><span>div<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>同样的，如果样式对象需要更复杂的逻辑，也可以使用返回样式对象的计算属性。<p><p><code>:style<code> 指令也可以和常规的 style attribute 共存，就像 <code>:class<code>。<p><p>模板：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>h1<span><span> style<span><span>=<span><span>\"color: red\"<span><span> :<span><span>style<span><span>=<span><span>\"'font-size:", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/class-and-style.html", "title": "Class 与 Style 绑定", "doc_id": "768d205c54fe4a179e8e603a21801000", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 797, "chunk_index": 50, "_doc_id": "50_7446600006379060854"}}
{"doc_id": "51_3256130759419466465", "text": "<span>=<span><span>\"color: red\"<span><span> :<span><span>style<span><span>=<span><span>\"'font-size: 1em'\"<span><span>>hello</<span><span>h1<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>这将被渲染为：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>h1<span><span> style<span><span>=<span><span>\"color: red;", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/class-and-style.html", "title": "Class 与 Style 绑定", "doc_id": "768d205c54fe4a179e8e603a21801000", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 797, "chunk_index": 51, "_doc_id": "51_3256130759419466465"}}
{"doc_id": "52_7114089730802803478", "text": "ode><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>h1<span><span> style<span><span>=<span><span>\"color: red; font-size: 1em;\"<span><span>>hello</<span><span>h1<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><h3 id=\"binding-to-arrays-1\">绑定数组 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#binding-to-arrays-1\">​<a><h3><p>我们还可以给 <code>:style<code> 绑定一个包含多个样式对象的数组。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/class-and-style.html", "title": "Class 与 Style 绑定", "doc_id": "768d205c54fe4a179e8e603a21801000", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 797, "chunk_index": 52, "_doc_id": "52_7114089730802803478"}}
{"doc_id": "53_900614173093508062", "text": "ss=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#binding-to-arrays-1\">​<a><h3><p>我们还可以给 <code>:style<code> 绑定一个包含多个样式对象的数组。这些对象会被合并后渲染到同一元素上：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>div<span><span> :<span><span>style<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>[baseStyles,", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/class-and-style.html", "title": "Class 与 Style 绑定", "doc_id": "768d205c54fe4a179e8e603a21801000", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 797, "chunk_index": 53, "_doc_id": "53_900614173093508062"}}
{"doc_id": "54_6675886093697233482", "text": "n><<span><span>div<span><span> :<span><span>style<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>[baseStyles, overridingStyles]<span><span>\"<span><span>></<span><span>div<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><h3 id=\"auto-prefixing\">自动前缀 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#auto-prefixing\">​<a><h3><p>当你在 <code>:style<code> 中使用了需要<a href=\"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Glossary/Vendor_Prefix\" target=\"_blank\">浏览器特殊前缀<a>的 CSS 属性时，Vue 会自动为他们加上相应的前缀。Vue 是在运行时检查该属性是否支持在当前浏览器中使用。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/class-and-style.html", "title": "Class 与 Style 绑定", "doc_id": "768d205c54fe4a179e8e603a21801000", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 797, "chunk_index": 54, "_doc_id": "54_6675886093697233482"}}
{"doc_id": "55_5845254834841211503", "text": "ry/Vendor_Prefix\" target=\"_blank\">浏览器特殊前缀<a>的 CSS 属性时，Vue 会自动为他们加上相应的前缀。Vue 是在运行时检查该属性是否支持在当前浏览器中使用。如果浏览器不支持某个属性，那么将尝试加上各个浏览器特殊前缀，以找到哪一个是被支持的。<p><h3 id=\"multiple-values\">样式多值 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#multiple-values\">​<a><h3><p>你可以对一个样式属性提供多个 (不同前缀的) 值，", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/class-and-style.html", "title": "Class 与 Style 绑定", "doc_id": "768d205c54fe4a179e8e603a21801000", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 797, "chunk_index": 55, "_doc_id": "55_5845254834841211503"}}
{"doc_id": "56_661221664167252707", "text": "e-values\">样式多值 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#multiple-values\">​<a><h3><p>你可以对一个样式属性提供多个 (不同前缀的) 值，举例来说：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>div<span><span> :<span><span>style<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>{ display: [<span><span>'-webkit-box'<span><span>, <span><span>'-ms-flexbox'<span><span>, <span><span>'flex'<span><span>] }<span><span>\"<span><span>></<span><span>div<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>数组仅会渲染浏览器支持的最后一个值。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/class-and-style.html", "title": "Class 与 Style 绑定", "doc_id": "768d205c54fe4a179e8e603a21801000", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 797, "chunk_index": 56, "_doc_id": "56_661221664167252707"}}
{"doc_id": "57_7676311235780596640", "text": "><span>\"<span><span>></<span><span>div<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>数组仅会渲染浏览器支持的最后一个值。在这个示例中，在支持不需要特别前缀的浏览器中都会渲染为 <code>display: flex<code>。<p><div><div>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/class-and-style.html", "title": "Class 与 Style 绑定", "doc_id": "768d205c54fe4a179e8e603a21801000", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 797, "chunk_index": 57, "_doc_id": "57_7676311235780596640"}}
{"doc_id": "0_7997277426200407516", "text": "<div><div><h1 id=\"props\">Props <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#props\">​<a><h1><blockquote><p>此章节假设你已经看过了<a href=\"/guide/essentials/component-basics.html\">组件基础<a>。若你还不了解组件是什么，请先阅读该章节。<p><blockquote><h2 id=\"props-declaration\">Props 声明 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#props-declaration\">​<a><h2><p>一个组件需要显式声明它所接受的 props，这样 Vue 才能知道外部传入的哪些是 props，哪些是透传 attribute (关于透传 attribute，我们会在<a href=\"/guide/components/attrs.html\">专门的章节<a>中讨论)。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/props.html", "title": "Props | Vue.js", "doc_id": "1f08b4bcf9b643dbb5aab571f7b84a37", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 2081, "chunk_index": 0, "_doc_id": "0_7997277426200407516"}}
{"doc_id": "1_4659166209906717205", "text": "入的哪些是 props，哪些是透传 attribute (关于透传 attribute，我们会在<a href=\"/guide/components/attrs.html\">专门的章节<a>中讨论)。<p><div class=\"composition-api\"><p>在使用 <code><script setup><code> 的单文件组件中，props 可以使用 <code>defineProps()<code> 宏来声明：<p><div class=\"language-vue\"> <span class=\"lang\">vue<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>script<span><span> setup<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/props.html", "title": "Props | Vue.js", "doc_id": "1f08b4bcf9b643dbb5aab571f7b84a37", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 2081, "chunk_index": 1, "_doc_id": "1_4659166209906717205"}}
{"doc_id": "2_4811252791999850582", "text": "code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>script<span><span> setup<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> props<span><span> =<span><span> defineProps<span><span>([<span><span>'foo'<span><span>])<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>console.<span><span>log<span><span>(props.foo)<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/props.html", "title": "Props | Vue.js", "doc_id": "1f08b4bcf9b643dbb5aab571f7b84a37", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 2081, "chunk_index": 2, "_doc_id": "2_4811252791999850582"}}
{"doc_id": "3_5069749877813421686", "text": "s=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>console.<span><span>log<span><span>(props.foo)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>script<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>在没有使用 <code><script setup><code> 的组件中，props 可以使用 <a href=\"/api/options-state.html#props\"><code>props<code><a> 选项来声明：<p><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/props.html", "title": "Props | Vue.js", "doc_id": "1f08b4bcf9b643dbb5aab571f7b84a37", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 2081, "chunk_index": 3, "_doc_id": "3_5069749877813421686"}}
{"doc_id": "4_163794263408574210", "text": "b-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> props: [<span><span>'foo'<span><span>],<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> setup<span><span>(<span><span>props<span><span>) {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // setup() 接收 props 作为第一个参数<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> console.<span><span>log<span><span>(props.foo)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/props.html", "title": "Props | Vue.js", "doc_id": "1f08b4bcf9b643dbb5aab571f7b84a37", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 2081, "chunk_index": 4, "_doc_id": "4_163794263408574210"}}
{"doc_id": "5_3963795509999203630", "text": "console.<span><span>log<span><span>(props.foo)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span><code><pre><div><p>注意传递给 <code>defineProps()<code> 的参数和提供给 <code>props<code> 选项的值是相同的，两种声明方式背后其实使用的都是 props 选项。<p><div><div class=\"options-api\"><p>props 需要使用 <a href=\"/api/options-state.html#props\"><code>props<code><a> 选项来定义：<p><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/props.html", "title": "Props | Vue.js", "doc_id": "1f08b4bcf9b643dbb5aab571f7b84a37", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 2081, "chunk_index": 5, "_doc_id": "5_3963795509999203630"}}
{"doc_id": "6_4909558168512893725", "text": "b-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> props: [<span><span>'foo'<span><span>],<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> created<span><span>() {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // props 会暴露到 `this` 上<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> console.<span><span>log<span><span>(<span><span>this<span><span>.foo)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/props.html", "title": "Props | Vue.js", "doc_id": "1f08b4bcf9b643dbb5aab571f7b84a37", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 2081, "chunk_index": 6, "_doc_id": "6_4909558168512893725"}}
{"doc_id": "7_263801264527123905", "text": "g<span><span>(<span><span>this<span><span>.foo)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span><code><pre><div><div><p>除了使用字符串数组来声明 props 外，还可以使用对象的形式：<p><div class=\"options-api\"><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> props: {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> title: String,<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/props.html", "title": "Props | Vue.js", "doc_id": "1f08b4bcf9b643dbb5aab571f7b84a37", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 2081, "chunk_index": 7, "_doc_id": "7_263801264527123905"}}
{"doc_id": "8_8220426314726599309", "text": "<span class=\"line\"><span> props: {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> title: String,<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> likes: Number<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span><code><pre><div><div><div class=\"composition-api\"><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// 使用 <script setup><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>defineProps<span><span>({<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/props.html", "title": "Props | Vue.js", "doc_id": "1f08b4bcf9b643dbb5aab571f7b84a37", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 2081, "chunk_index": 8, "_doc_id": "8_8220426314726599309"}}
{"doc_id": "9_2107444144207970623", "text": "pan>// 使用 <script setup><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>defineProps<span><span>({<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> title: String,<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> likes: Number<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>})<span><span><code><pre><div><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// 非 <script setup><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/props.html", "title": "Props | Vue.js", "doc_id": "1f08b4bcf9b643dbb5aab571f7b84a37", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 2081, "chunk_index": 9, "_doc_id": "9_2107444144207970623"}}
{"doc_id": "10_4887208757082729855", "text": "pt setup><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> props: {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> title: String,<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> likes: Number<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span><code><pre><div><div><p>对于以对象形式声明的每个属性，key 是 prop 的名称，而值则是该 prop 预期类型的构造函数。比如，如果要求一个 prop 的值是 <code>number<code> 类型，则可使用 <code>Number<code> 构造函数作为其声明的值。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/props.html", "title": "Props | Vue.js", "doc_id": "1f08b4bcf9b643dbb5aab571f7b84a37", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 2081, "chunk_index": 10, "_doc_id": "10_4887208757082729855"}}
{"doc_id": "11_1803987137704775905", "text": "称，而值则是该 prop 预期类型的构造函数。比如，如果要求一个 prop 的值是 <code>number<code> 类型，则可使用 <code>Number<code> 构造函数作为其声明的值。<p><p>对象形式的 props 声明不仅可以一定程度上作为组件的文档，而且如果其他开发者在使用你的组件时传递了错误的类型，也会在浏览器控制台中抛出警告。我们将在本章节稍后进一步讨论有关 <a href=\"#prop-validation\">prop 校验<a>的更多细节。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/props.html", "title": "Props | Vue.js", "doc_id": "1f08b4bcf9b643dbb5aab571f7b84a37", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 2081, "chunk_index": 11, "_doc_id": "11_1803987137704775905"}}
{"doc_id": "12_4622268638747681917", "text": "且如果其他开发者在使用你的组件时传递了错误的类型，也会在浏览器控制台中抛出警告。我们将在本章节稍后进一步讨论有关 <a href=\"#prop-validation\">prop 校验<a>的更多细节。<p><div class=\"composition-api\"><p>如果你正在搭配 TypeScript 使用 <code><script setup><code>，也可以使用类型标注来声明 props：<p><div class=\"language-vue\"> <span class=\"lang\">vue<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>script<span><span> setup<span><span> lang<span><span>=<span><span>\"ts\"<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>defineProps<span><span><{<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/props.html", "title": "Props | Vue.js", "doc_id": "1f08b4bcf9b643dbb5aab571f7b84a37", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 2081, "chunk_index": 12, "_doc_id": "12_4622268638747681917"}}
{"doc_id": "13_5661751846730669640", "text": "><span>\"ts\"<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>defineProps<span><span><{<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> title<span><span>?:<span><span> string<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> likes<span><span>?:<span><span> number<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}>()<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>script<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>更多关于基于类型的声明的细节请参考<a href=\"/guide/typescript/composition-api.html#typing-component-props\">组件 props 类型标注<a>。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/props.html", "title": "Props | Vue.js", "doc_id": "1f08b4bcf9b643dbb5aab571f7b84a37", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 2081, "chunk_index": 13, "_doc_id": "13_5661751846730669640"}}
{"doc_id": "14_2349806029128496365", "text": "类型的声明的细节请参考<a href=\"/guide/typescript/composition-api.html#typing-component-props\">组件 props 类型标注<a>。 <p><div><div class=\"composition-api\"><h2 id=\"reactive-props-destructure\">响应式 Props 解构 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#reactive-props-destructure\" class=\"vt-badge\">​<a><h2><p>Vue 的响应系统基于属性访问跟踪状态的使用情况。例如，在计算属性或侦听器中访问 <code>props.foo<code> 时，<code>foo<code> 属性将被跟踪为依赖项。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/props.html", "title": "Props | Vue.js", "doc_id": "1f08b4bcf9b643dbb5aab571f7b84a37", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 2081, "chunk_index": 14, "_doc_id": "14_2349806029128496365"}}
{"doc_id": "15_7046958154009306974", "text": "><h2><p>Vue 的响应系统基于属性访问跟踪状态的使用情况。例如，在计算属性或侦听器中访问 <code>props.foo<code> 时，<code>foo<code> 属性将被跟踪为依赖项。<p><p>因此，在以下代码的情况下：<p><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> { <span><span>foo<span><span> } <span><span>=<span><span> defineProps<span><span>([<span><span>'foo'<span><span>])<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>watchEffect<span><span>(() <span><span>=><span><span> {<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/props.html", "title": "Props | Vue.js", "doc_id": "1f08b4bcf9b643dbb5aab571f7b84a37", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 2081, "chunk_index": 15, "_doc_id": "15_7046958154009306974"}}
{"doc_id": "16_7863464839228601081", "text": "<span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>watchEffect<span><span>(() <span><span>=><span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 在 3.5 之前只运行一次<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 在 3.5+ 中在 \"foo\" prop 变化时重新执行<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> console.<span><span>log<span><span>(foo)<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/props.html", "title": "Props | Vue.js", "doc_id": "1f08b4bcf9b643dbb5aab571f7b84a37", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 2081, "chunk_index": 16, "_doc_id": "16_7863464839228601081"}}
{"doc_id": "17_6505616375189088236", "text": "变化时重新执行<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> console.<span><span>log<span><span>(foo)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>})<span><span><code><pre><div><p>在 3.4 及以下版本，<code>foo<code> 是一个实际的常量，永远不会改变。在 3.5 及以上版本，当在同一个 <code><script setup><code> 代码块中访问由 <code>defineProps<code> 解构的变量时，Vue 编译器会自动在前面添加 <code>props.<code>。因此，上面的代码等同于以下代码：<p><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> props<span><span> =<span><span> defineProps<span><span>([<span><span>'foo'<span><span>])<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/props.html", "title": "Props | Vue.js", "doc_id": "1f08b4bcf9b643dbb5aab571f7b84a37", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 2081, "chunk_index": 17, "_doc_id": "17_6505616375189088236"}}
{"doc_id": "18_2836336191603754990", "text": "rops<span><span> =<span><span> defineProps<span><span>([<span><span>'foo'<span><span>])<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>watchEffect<span><span>(() <span><span>=><span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // `foo` 由编译器转换为 `props.foo`<span><span>\n<span class=\"line highlighted\"><span> console.<span><span>log<span><span>(props.foo)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>})<span><span><code><pre><div><p>此外，你可以使用 JavaScript 原生的默认值语法声明 props 默认值。这在使用基于类型的 props 声明时特别有用。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/props.html", "title": "Props | Vue.js", "doc_id": "1f08b4bcf9b643dbb5aab571f7b84a37", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 2081, "chunk_index": 18, "_doc_id": "18_2836336191603754990"}}
{"doc_id": "19_1978996945073355891", "text": "n>})<span><span><code><pre><div><p>此外，你可以使用 JavaScript 原生的默认值语法声明 props 默认值。这在使用基于类型的 props 声明时特别有用。<p><div class=\"language-ts\"> <span class=\"lang\">ts<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> { <span><span>foo<span><span> =<span><span> 'hello'<span><span> } <span><span>=<span><span> defineProps<span><span><{ <span><span>foo<span><span>?:<span><span> string<span><span> }>()<span><span><code><pre><div><p>如果你希望在 IDE 中在解构的 props 和普通变量之间有更多视觉上的区分，Vue 的 VSCode 扩展提供了一个设置来启用解构 props 的内联提示。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/props.html", "title": "Props | Vue.js", "doc_id": "1f08b4bcf9b643dbb5aab571f7b84a37", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 2081, "chunk_index": 19, "_doc_id": "19_1978996945073355891"}}
{"doc_id": "20_5194110621831335949", "text": "><code><pre><div><p>如果你希望在 IDE 中在解构的 props 和普通变量之间有更多视觉上的区分，Vue 的 VSCode 扩展提供了一个设置来启用解构 props 的内联提示。<p><h3 id=\"passing-destructured-props-into-functions\">将解构的 props 传递到函数中 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#passing-destructured-props-into-functions\">​<a><h3><p>当我们将解构的 prop 传递到函数中时，例如：<p><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> { <span><span>foo<span><span> } <span><span>=<span><span> defineProps<span><span>([<span><span>'foo'<span><span>])<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/props.html", "title": "Props | Vue.js", "doc_id": "1f08b4bcf9b643dbb5aab571f7b84a37", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 2081, "chunk_index": 20, "_doc_id": "20_5194110621831335949"}}
{"doc_id": "21_4915098720332868545", "text": "n> } <span><span>=<span><span> defineProps<span><span>([<span><span>'foo'<span><span>])<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>watch<span><span>(foo, <span><span>/* ... */<span><span>)<span><span><code><pre><div><p>这并不会按预期工作，因为它等价于 <code>watch(props.foo, ...)<code>——我们给 <code>watch<code> 传递的是一个值而不是响应式数据源。实际上，Vue 的编译器会捕捉这种情况并发出警告。<p><p>与使用 <code>watch(() => props.foo, ...)<code> 来侦听普通 prop 类似，", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/props.html", "title": "Props | Vue.js", "doc_id": "1f08b4bcf9b643dbb5aab571f7b84a37", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 2081, "chunk_index": 21, "_doc_id": "21_4915098720332868545"}}
{"doc_id": "22_2174990024158954778", "text": "值而不是响应式数据源。实际上，Vue 的编译器会捕捉这种情况并发出警告。<p><p>与使用 <code>watch(() => props.foo, ...)<code> 来侦听普通 prop 类似，我们也可以通过将其包装在 getter 中来侦听解构的 prop：<p><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>watch<span><span>(() <span><span>=><span><span> foo, <span><span>/* ... */<span><span>)<span><span><code><pre><div><p>此外，当我们需要传递解构的 prop 到外部函数中并保持响应性时，", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/props.html", "title": "Props | Vue.js", "doc_id": "1f08b4bcf9b643dbb5aab571f7b84a37", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 2081, "chunk_index": 22, "_doc_id": "22_2174990024158954778"}}
{"doc_id": "23_4550515833432324059", "text": ", <span><span>/* ... */<span><span>)<span><span><code><pre><div><p>此外，当我们需要传递解构的 prop 到外部函数中并保持响应性时，这是推荐做法：<p><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>useComposable<span><span>(() <span><span>=><span><span> foo)<span><span><code><pre><div><p>外部函数可以调用 getter (或使用 <a href=\"/api/reactivity-utilities.html#tovalue\">toValue<a> 进行规范化) 来追踪提供的 prop 变更。例如，在计算属性或侦听器的 getter 中。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/props.html", "title": "Props | Vue.js", "doc_id": "1f08b4bcf9b643dbb5aab571f7b84a37", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 2081, "chunk_index": 23, "_doc_id": "23_4550515833432324059"}}
{"doc_id": "24_1708679417015848443", "text": "ef=\"/api/reactivity-utilities.html#tovalue\">toValue<a> 进行规范化) 来追踪提供的 prop 变更。例如，在计算属性或侦听器的 getter 中。<p><div><h2 id=\"prop-passing-details\">传递 prop 的细节 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#prop-passing-details\">​<a><h2><h3 id=\"prop-name-casing\">Prop 名字格式 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#prop-name-casing\">​<a><h3><p>如果一个 prop 的名字很长，应使用 camelCase 形式，因为它们是合法的 JavaScript 标识符，可以直接在模板的表达式中使用，也可以避免在作为属性 key 名时必须加上引号。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/props.html", "title": "Props | Vue.js", "doc_id": "1f08b4bcf9b643dbb5aab571f7b84a37", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 2081, "chunk_index": 24, "_doc_id": "24_1708679417015848443"}}
{"doc_id": "25_8318734424024361059", "text": "><p>如果一个 prop 的名字很长，应使用 camelCase 形式，因为它们是合法的 JavaScript 标识符，可以直接在模板的表达式中使用，也可以避免在作为属性 key 名时必须加上引号。<p><div class=\"composition-api\"><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>defineProps<span><span>({<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> greetingMessage: String<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/props.html", "title": "Props | Vue.js", "doc_id": "1f08b4bcf9b643dbb5aab571f7b84a37", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 2081, "chunk_index": 25, "_doc_id": "25_8318734424024361059"}}
{"doc_id": "26_7585280665598674252", "text": "defineProps<span><span>({<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> greetingMessage: String<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>})<span><span><code><pre><div><div><div class=\"options-api\"><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> props: {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> greetingMessage: String<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/props.html", "title": "Props | Vue.js", "doc_id": "1f08b4bcf9b643dbb5aab571f7b84a37", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 2081, "chunk_index": 26, "_doc_id": "26_7585280665598674252"}}
{"doc_id": "27_8659111333416015951", "text": "pan class=\"line\"><span> greetingMessage: String<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span><code><pre><div><div><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>span<span><span>>{{ greetingMessage }}</<span><span>span<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>虽然理论上你也可以在向子组件传递 props 时使用 camelCase 形式 (使用 <a href=\"/guide/essentials/component-basics.html#in-dom-template-parsing-caveats\">DOM 内模板<a>时例外)，", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/props.html", "title": "Props | Vue.js", "doc_id": "1f08b4bcf9b643dbb5aab571f7b84a37", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 2081, "chunk_index": 27, "_doc_id": "27_8659111333416015951"}}
{"doc_id": "28_3580301065877768917", "text": "使用 <a href=\"/guide/essentials/component-basics.html#in-dom-template-parsing-caveats\">DOM 内模板<a>时例外)，但实际上为了和 HTML attribute 对齐，", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/props.html", "title": "Props | Vue.js", "doc_id": "1f08b4bcf9b643dbb5aab571f7b84a37", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 2081, "chunk_index": 28, "_doc_id": "28_3580301065877768917"}}
{"doc_id": "29_2660342272239121685", "text": "als/component-basics.html#in-dom-template-parsing-caveats\">DOM 内模板<a>时例外)，但实际上为了和 HTML attribute 对齐，我们通常会将其写为 kebab-case 形式：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>MyComponent<span><span> greeting-message<span><span>=<span><span>\"hello\"<span><span> /><span><span><code><pre><div><p>对于组件名我们推荐使用 <a href=\"/guide/components/registration.html#component-name-casing\">PascalCase<a>，因为这提高了模板的可读性，", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/props.html", "title": "Props | Vue.js", "doc_id": "1f08b4bcf9b643dbb5aab571f7b84a37", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 2081, "chunk_index": 29, "_doc_id": "29_2660342272239121685"}}
{"doc_id": "30_7584928141687209251", "text": "推荐使用 <a href=\"/guide/components/registration.html#component-name-casing\">PascalCase<a>，因为这提高了模板的可读性，能帮助我们区分 Vue 组件和原生 HTML 元素。然而对于传递 props 来说，使用 camelCase 并没有太多优势，因此我们推荐更贴近 HTML 的书写风格。<p><h3 id=\"static-vs-dynamic-props\">静态 vs. 动态 Props <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#static-vs-dynamic-props\">​<a><h3><p>至此，", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/props.html", "title": "Props | Vue.js", "doc_id": "1f08b4bcf9b643dbb5aab571f7b84a37", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 2081, "chunk_index": 30, "_doc_id": "30_7584928141687209251"}}
{"doc_id": "31_7614672280641776723", "text": "namic-props\">静态 vs. 动态 Props <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#static-vs-dynamic-props\">​<a><h3><p>至此，你已经见过了很多像这样的静态值形式的 props：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>BlogPost<span><span> title<span><span>=<span><span>\"My journey with Vue\"<span><span> /><span><span><code><pre><div><p>相应地，", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/props.html", "title": "Props | Vue.js", "doc_id": "1f08b4bcf9b643dbb5aab571f7b84a37", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 2081, "chunk_index": 31, "_doc_id": "31_7614672280641776723"}}
{"doc_id": "32_7070257695235280248", "text": "itle<span><span>=<span><span>\"My journey with Vue\"<span><span> /><span><span><code><pre><div><p>相应地，还有使用 <code>v-bind<code> 或缩写 <code>:<code> 来进行动态绑定的 props：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><!-- 根据一个变量的值动态传入 --><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>BlogPost<span><span> :<span><span>title<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>post.title<span><span>\"<span><span> /><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/props.html", "title": "Props | Vue.js", "doc_id": "1f08b4bcf9b643dbb5aab571f7b84a37", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 2081, "chunk_index": 32, "_doc_id": "32_7070257695235280248"}}
{"doc_id": "33_4535813765226963238", "text": "<span>title<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>post.title<span><span>\"<span><span> /><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><!-- 根据一个更复杂表达式的值动态传入 --><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/props.html", "title": "Props | Vue.js", "doc_id": "1f08b4bcf9b643dbb5aab571f7b84a37", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 2081, "chunk_index": 33, "_doc_id": "33_4535813765226963238"}}
{"doc_id": "34_1564634446268682097", "text": "pan><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><!-- 根据一个更复杂表达式的值动态传入 --><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>BlogPost<span><span> :<span><span>title<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>post.title <span><span>+<span><span> ' by '<span><span> +<span><span> post.author.name<span><span>\"<span><span> /><span><span><code><pre><div><h3 id=\"passing-different-value-types\">传递不同的值类型 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#passing-different-value-types\">​<a><h3><p>在上述的两个例子中，我们只传入了字符串值，但实际上<strong>任何<strong>类型的值都可以作为 props 的值被传递。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/props.html", "title": "Props | Vue.js", "doc_id": "1f08b4bcf9b643dbb5aab571f7b84a37", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 2081, "chunk_index": 34, "_doc_id": "34_1564634446268682097"}}
{"doc_id": "35_6787612195849415998", "text": "-different-value-types\">​<a><h3><p>在上述的两个例子中，我们只传入了字符串值，但实际上<strong>任何<strong>类型的值都可以作为 props 的值被传递。<p><h4 id=\"number\">Number <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#number\">​<a><h4><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><!-- 虽然 `42` 是个常量，我们还是需要使用 v-bind --><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><!-- 因为这是一个 JavaScript 表达式而不是一个字符串 --><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/props.html", "title": "Props | Vue.js", "doc_id": "1f08b4bcf9b643dbb5aab571f7b84a37", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 2081, "chunk_index": 35, "_doc_id": "35_6787612195849415998"}}
{"doc_id": "36_520065462401553536", "text": "v-bind --><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><!-- 因为这是一个 JavaScript 表达式而不是一个字符串 --><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>BlogPost<span><span> :<span><span>likes<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>42<span><span>\"<span><span> /><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><!-- 根据一个变量的值动态传入 --><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/props.html", "title": "Props | Vue.js", "doc_id": "1f08b4bcf9b643dbb5aab571f7b84a37", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 2081, "chunk_index": 36, "_doc_id": "36_520065462401553536"}}
{"doc_id": "37_275972917196062007", "text": "/><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><!-- 根据一个变量的值动态传入 --><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>BlogPost<span><span> :<span><span>likes<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>post.likes<span><span>\"<span><span> /><span><span><code><pre><div><h4 id=\"boolean\">Boolean <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#boolean\">​<a><h4><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><!-- 仅写上 prop 但不传值，会隐式转换为 `true` --><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/props.html", "title": "Props | Vue.js", "doc_id": "1f08b4bcf9b643dbb5aab571f7b84a37", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 2081, "chunk_index": 37, "_doc_id": "37_275972917196062007"}}
{"doc_id": "38_3931468284517535968", "text": "ithub-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><!-- 仅写上 prop 但不传值，会隐式转换为 `true` --><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>BlogPost<span><span> is-published<span><span> /><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><!-- 虽然 `false` 是静态的值，我们还是需要使用 v-bind --><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><!-- 因为这是一个 JavaScript 表达式而不是一个字符串 --><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/props.html", "title": "Props | Vue.js", "doc_id": "1f08b4bcf9b643dbb5aab571f7b84a37", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 2081, "chunk_index": 38, "_doc_id": "38_3931468284517535968"}}
{"doc_id": "39_5528812262561389940", "text": "v-bind --><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><!-- 因为这是一个 JavaScript 表达式而不是一个字符串 --><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>BlogPost<span><span> :<span><span>is-published<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>false<span><span>\"<span><span> /><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><!-- 根据一个变量的值动态传入 --><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/props.html", "title": "Props | Vue.js", "doc_id": "1f08b4bcf9b643dbb5aab571f7b84a37", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 2081, "chunk_index": 39, "_doc_id": "39_5528812262561389940"}}
{"doc_id": "40_6546181014830212284", "text": "/><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><!-- 根据一个变量的值动态传入 --><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>BlogPost<span><span> :<span><span>is-published<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>post.isPublished<span><span>\"<span><span> /><span><span><code><pre><div><h4 id=\"array\">Array <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#array\">​<a><h4><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><!-- 虽然这个数组是个常量，我们还是需要使用 v-bind --><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/props.html", "title": "Props | Vue.js", "doc_id": "1f08b4bcf9b643dbb5aab571f7b84a37", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 2081, "chunk_index": 40, "_doc_id": "40_6546181014830212284"}}
{"doc_id": "41_8854499679550882781", "text": "github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><!-- 虽然这个数组是个常量，我们还是需要使用 v-bind --><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><!-- 因为这是一个 JavaScript 表达式而不是一个字符串 --><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>BlogPost<span><span> :<span><span>comment-ids<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>[<span><span>234<span><span>, <span><span>266<span><span>, <span><span>273<span><span>]<span><span>\"<span><span> /><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><!-- 根据一个变量的值动态传入 --><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/props.html", "title": "Props | Vue.js", "doc_id": "1f08b4bcf9b643dbb5aab571f7b84a37", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 2081, "chunk_index": 41, "_doc_id": "41_8854499679550882781"}}
{"doc_id": "42_7730902136426170036", "text": "/><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><!-- 根据一个变量的值动态传入 --><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>BlogPost<span><span> :<span><span>comment-ids<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>post.commentIds<span><span>\"<span><span> /><span><span><code><pre><div><h4 id=\"object\">Object <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#object\">​<a><h4><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><!-- 虽然这个对象字面量是个常量，我们还是需要使用 v-bind --><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/props.html", "title": "Props | Vue.js", "doc_id": "1f08b4bcf9b643dbb5aab571f7b84a37", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 2081, "chunk_index": 42, "_doc_id": "42_7730902136426170036"}}
{"doc_id": "43_5006927007237022382", "text": "hub-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><!-- 虽然这个对象字面量是个常量，我们还是需要使用 v-bind --><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><!-- 因为这是一个 JavaScript 表达式而不是一个字符串 --><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>BlogPost<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> :<span><span>author<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>{<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> name: <span><span>'Veronica'<span><span>,<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> company: <span><span>'Veridian Dynamics'<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/props.html", "title": "Props | Vue.js", "doc_id": "1f08b4bcf9b643dbb5aab571f7b84a37", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 2081, "chunk_index": 43, "_doc_id": "43_5006927007237022382"}}
{"doc_id": "44_1975460193188171906", "text": "><span>,<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> company: <span><span>'Veridian Dynamics'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\"<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> /><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><!-- 根据一个变量的值动态传入 --><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/props.html", "title": "Props | Vue.js", "doc_id": "1f08b4bcf9b643dbb5aab571f7b84a37", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 2081, "chunk_index": 44, "_doc_id": "44_1975460193188171906"}}
{"doc_id": "45_3806778936305592787", "text": "/><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><!-- 根据一个变量的值动态传入 --><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>BlogPost<span><span> :<span><span>author<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>post.author<span><span>\"<span><span> /><span><span><code><pre><div><h3 id=\"binding-multiple-properties-using-an-object\">使用一个对象绑定多个 prop <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#binding-multiple-properties-using-an-object\">​<a><h3><p>如果你想要将一个对象的所有属性都当作 props 传入，", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/props.html", "title": "Props | Vue.js", "doc_id": "1f08b4bcf9b643dbb5aab571f7b84a37", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 2081, "chunk_index": 45, "_doc_id": "45_3806778936305592787"}}
{"doc_id": "46_7241390891978472784", "text": "-anchor\" href=\"#binding-multiple-properties-using-an-object\">​<a><h3><p>如果你想要将一个对象的所有属性都当作 props 传入，你可以使用<a href=\"/guide/essentials/template-syntax.html#dynamically-binding-multiple-attributes\">没有参数的 <code>v-bind<code><a>，即只使用 <code>v-bind<code> 而非 <code>:prop-name<code>。例如，这里有一个 <code>post<code> 对象：<p><div class=\"options-api\"><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/props.html", "title": "Props | Vue.js", "doc_id": "1f08b4bcf9b643dbb5aab571f7b84a37", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 2081, "chunk_index": 46, "_doc_id": "46_7241390891978472784"}}
{"doc_id": "47_286776656105920245", "text": "b-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> data<span><span>() {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> return<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> post: {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> id: <span><span>1<span><span>,<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> title: <span><span>'My Journey with Vue'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/props.html", "title": "Props | Vue.js", "doc_id": "1f08b4bcf9b643dbb5aab571f7b84a37", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 2081, "chunk_index": 47, "_doc_id": "47_286776656105920245"}}
{"doc_id": "48_829726603984334557", "text": "th Vue'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span><code><pre><div><div><div class=\"composition-api\"><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> post<span><span> =<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> id: <span><span>1<span><span>,<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/props.html", "title": "Props | Vue.js", "doc_id": "1f08b4bcf9b643dbb5aab571f7b84a37", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 2081, "chunk_index": 48, "_doc_id": "48_829726603984334557"}}
{"doc_id": "49_7073306619629347990", "text": "n> =<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> id: <span><span>1<span><span>,<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> title: <span><span>'My Journey with Vue'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span><code><pre><div><div><p>以及下面的模板：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>BlogPost<span><span> v-bind<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>post<span><span>\"<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/props.html", "title": "Props | Vue.js", "doc_id": "1f08b4bcf9b643dbb5aab571f7b84a37", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 2081, "chunk_index": 49, "_doc_id": "49_7073306619629347990"}}
{"doc_id": "50_7842186109244603457", "text": "span>BlogPost<span><span> v-bind<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>post<span><span>\"<span><span> /><span><span><code><pre><div><p>而这实际上等价于：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>BlogPost<span><span> :<span><span>id<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>post.id<span><span>\"<span><span> :<span><span>title<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>post.", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/props.html", "title": "Props | Vue.js", "doc_id": "1f08b4bcf9b643dbb5aab571f7b84a37", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 2081, "chunk_index": 50, "_doc_id": "50_7842186109244603457"}}
{"doc_id": "51_240400299707707533", "text": "<span>post.id<span><span>\"<span><span> :<span><span>title<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>post.title<span><span>\"<span><span> /><span><span><code><pre><div><h2 id=\"one-way-data-flow\">单向数据流 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#one-way-data-flow\">​<a><h2><p>所有的 props 都遵循着<strong>单向绑定<strong>原则，props 因父组件的更新而变化，自然地将新的状态向下流往子组件，而不会逆向传递。这避免了子组件意外修改父组件的状态的情况，不然应用的数据流将很容易变得混乱而难以理解。<p><p>另外，每次父组件更新后，所有的子组件中的 props 都会被更新到最新值，这意味着你<strong>不应该<strong>在子组件中去更改一个 prop。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/props.html", "title": "Props | Vue.js", "doc_id": "1f08b4bcf9b643dbb5aab571f7b84a37", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 2081, "chunk_index": 51, "_doc_id": "51_240400299707707533"}}
{"doc_id": "52_4774912858492914181", "text": "数据流将很容易变得混乱而难以理解。<p><p>另外，每次父组件更新后，所有的子组件中的 props 都会被更新到最新值，这意味着你<strong>不应该<strong>在子组件中去更改一个 prop。若你这么做了，Vue 会在控制台上向你抛出警告：<p><div class=\"composition-api\"><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> props<span><span> =<span><span> defineProps<span><span>([<span><span>'foo'<span><span>])<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// ❌ 警告！prop 是只读的！<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/props.html", "title": "Props | Vue.js", "doc_id": "1f08b4bcf9b643dbb5aab571f7b84a37", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 2081, "chunk_index": 52, "_doc_id": "52_4774912858492914181"}}
{"doc_id": "53_3597413813655200266", "text": "an>])<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// ❌ 警告！prop 是只读的！<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>props.foo <span><span>=<span><span> 'bar'<span><span><code><pre><div><div><div class=\"options-api\"><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> props: [<span><span>'foo'<span><span>],<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/props.html", "title": "Props | Vue.js", "doc_id": "1f08b4bcf9b643dbb5aab571f7b84a37", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 2081, "chunk_index": 53, "_doc_id": "53_3597413813655200266"}}
{"doc_id": "54_6216908736416252476", "text": "><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> props: [<span><span>'foo'<span><span>],<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> created<span><span>() {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // ❌ 警告！prop 是只读的！<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> this<span><span>.foo <span><span>=<span><span> 'bar'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/props.html", "title": "Props | Vue.js", "doc_id": "1f08b4bcf9b643dbb5aab571f7b84a37", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 2081, "chunk_index": 54, "_doc_id": "54_6216908736416252476"}}
{"doc_id": "55_3223858941782546962", "text": "span><span>.foo <span><span>=<span><span> 'bar'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span><code><pre><div><div><p>导致你想要更改一个 prop 的需求通常来源于以下两种场景：<p><ol><li><p><strong>prop 被用于传入初始值；而子组件想在之后将其作为一个局部数据属性<strong>。在这种情况下，最好是新定义一个局部数据属性，从 props 上获取初始值即可：<p><div class=\"composition-api\"><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> props<span><span> =<span><span> defineProps<span><span>([<span><span>'initialCounter'<span><span>])<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/props.html", "title": "Props | Vue.js", "doc_id": "1f08b4bcf9b643dbb5aab571f7b84a37", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 2081, "chunk_index": 55, "_doc_id": "55_3223858941782546962"}}
{"doc_id": "56_7391863755429110718", "text": "span> =<span><span> defineProps<span><span>([<span><span>'initialCounter'<span><span>])<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 计数器只是将 props.initialCounter 作为初始值<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 像下面这样做就使 prop 和后续更新无关了<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/props.html", "title": "Props | Vue.js", "doc_id": "1f08b4bcf9b643dbb5aab571f7b84a37", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 2081, "chunk_index": 56, "_doc_id": "56_7391863755429110718"}}
{"doc_id": "57_4350034462246369213", "text": "ops.initialCounter 作为初始值<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 像下面这样做就使 prop 和后续更新无关了<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> counter<span><span> =<span><span> ref<span><span>(props.initialCounter)<span><span><code><pre><div><div><div class=\"options-api\"><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/props.html", "title": "Props | Vue.js", "doc_id": "1f08b4bcf9b643dbb5aab571f7b84a37", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 2081, "chunk_index": 57, "_doc_id": "57_4350034462246369213"}}
{"doc_id": "58_568165139559512735", "text": "b-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> props: [<span><span>'initialCounter'<span><span>],<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> data<span><span>() {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> return<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 计数器只是将 this.initialCounter 作为初始值<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 像下面这样做就使 prop 和后续更新无关了<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/props.html", "title": "Props | Vue.js", "doc_id": "1f08b4bcf9b643dbb5aab571f7b84a37", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 2081, "chunk_index": 58, "_doc_id": "58_568165139559512735"}}
{"doc_id": "59_1277601631029201050", "text": "is.initialCounter 作为初始值<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 像下面这样做就使 prop 和后续更新无关了<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> counter: <span><span>this<span><span>.initialCounter<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/props.html", "title": "Props | Vue.js", "doc_id": "1f08b4bcf9b643dbb5aab571f7b84a37", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 2081, "chunk_index": 59, "_doc_id": "59_1277601631029201050"}}
{"doc_id": "60_18187330090394074", "text": "Counter<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span><code><pre><div><div><li><li><p><strong>需要对传入的 prop 值做进一步的转换<strong>。在这种情况中，最好是基于该 prop 值定义一个计算属性：<p><div class=\"composition-api\"><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> props<span><span> =<span><span> defineProps<span><span>([<span><span>'size'<span><span>])<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/props.html", "title": "Props | Vue.js", "doc_id": "1f08b4bcf9b643dbb5aab571f7b84a37", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 2081, "chunk_index": 60, "_doc_id": "60_18187330090394074"}}
{"doc_id": "61_4445951951327496886", "text": "ops<span><span> =<span><span> defineProps<span><span>([<span><span>'size'<span><span>])<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 该 prop 变更时计算属性也会自动更新<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/props.html", "title": "Props | Vue.js", "doc_id": "1f08b4bcf9b643dbb5aab571f7b84a37", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 2081, "chunk_index": 61, "_doc_id": "61_4445951951327496886"}}
{"doc_id": "62_1825259539356337155", "text": "<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 该 prop 变更时计算属性也会自动更新<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> normalizedSize<span><span> =<span><span> computed<span><span>(() <span><span>=><span><span> props.size.<span><span>trim<span><span>().<span><span>toLowerCase<span><span>())<span><span><code><pre><div><div><div class=\"options-api\"><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/props.html", "title": "Props | Vue.js", "doc_id": "1f08b4bcf9b643dbb5aab571f7b84a37", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 2081, "chunk_index": 62, "_doc_id": "62_1825259539356337155"}}
{"doc_id": "63_1755962365448565878", "text": "b-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> props: [<span><span>'size'<span><span>],<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> computed: {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 该 prop 变更时计算属性也会自动更新<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> normalizedSize<span><span>() {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> return<span><span> this<span><span>.size.<span><span>trim<span><span>().<span><span>toLowerCase<span><span>()<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/props.html", "title": "Props | Vue.js", "doc_id": "1f08b4bcf9b643dbb5aab571f7b84a37", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 2081, "chunk_index": 63, "_doc_id": "63_1755962365448565878"}}
{"doc_id": "64_5980375204559569176", "text": "s<span><span>.size.<span><span>trim<span><span>().<span><span>toLowerCase<span><span>()<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span><code><pre><div><div><li><ol><h3 id=\"mutating-object-array-props\">更改对象 / 数组类型的 props <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#mutating-object-array-props\">​<a><h3><p>当对象或数组作为 props 被传入时，虽然子组件无法更改 props 绑定，但仍然<strong>可以<strong>更改对象或数组内部的值。这是因为 JavaScript 的对象和数组是按引用传递，对 Vue 来说，阻止这种更改需要付出的代价异常昂贵。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/props.html", "title": "Props | Vue.js", "doc_id": "1f08b4bcf9b643dbb5aab571f7b84a37", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 2081, "chunk_index": 64, "_doc_id": "64_5980375204559569176"}}
{"doc_id": "65_4605764562080582880", "text": "改 props 绑定，但仍然<strong>可以<strong>更改对象或数组内部的值。这是因为 JavaScript 的对象和数组是按引用传递，对 Vue 来说，阻止这种更改需要付出的代价异常昂贵。<p><p>这种更改的主要缺陷是它允许了子组件以某种不明显的方式影响父组件的状态，可能会使数据流在将来变得更难以理解。在最佳实践中，你应该尽可能避免这样的更改，除非父子组件在设计上本来就需要紧密耦合。在大多数场景下，子组件应该<a href=\"/guide/components/events.html\">抛出一个事件<a>来通知父组件做出改变。<p><h2 id=\"prop-validation\">Prop 校验 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#prop-validation\">​<a><h2><p>Vue 组件可以更细致地声明对传入的 props 的校验要求。比如我们上面已经看到过的类型声明，如果传入的值不满足类型要求，Vue 会在浏览器控制台中抛出警告来提醒使用者。这在开发给其他开发者使用的组件时非常有用。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/props.html", "title": "Props | Vue.js", "doc_id": "1f08b4bcf9b643dbb5aab571f7b84a37", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 2081, "chunk_index": 65, "_doc_id": "65_4605764562080582880"}}
{"doc_id": "66_870696117254813465", "text": "以更细致地声明对传入的 props 的校验要求。比如我们上面已经看到过的类型声明，如果传入的值不满足类型要求，Vue 会在浏览器控制台中抛出警告来提醒使用者。这在开发给其他开发者使用的组件时非常有用。<p><p>要声明对 props 的校验，你可以向 <span class=\"composition-api\"><code>defineProps()<code> 宏<span><span class=\"options-api\"><code>props<code> 选项<span>提供一个带有 props 校验选项的对象，例如：<p><div class=\"composition-api\"><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>defineProps<span><span>({<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 基础类型检查<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/props.html", "title": "Props | Vue.js", "doc_id": "1f08b4bcf9b643dbb5aab571f7b84a37", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 2081, "chunk_index": 66, "_doc_id": "66_870696117254813465"}}
{"doc_id": "67_1992983745966526303", "text": "=\"line\"><span>defineProps<span><span>({<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 基础类型检查<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // (给出 `null` 和 `undefined` 值则会跳过任何类型检查)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> propA: Number,<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 多种可能的类型<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> propB: [String, Number],<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 必传，且为 String 类型<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> propC: {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> type: String,<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/props.html", "title": "Props | Vue.js", "doc_id": "1f08b4bcf9b643dbb5aab571f7b84a37", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 2081, "chunk_index": 67, "_doc_id": "67_1992983745966526303"}}
{"doc_id": "68_7989532248443330754", "text": "<span class=\"line\"><span> propC: {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> type: String,<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> required: <span><span>true<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> },<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 必传但可为 null 的字符串<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> propD: {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> type: [String, <span><span>null<span><span>],<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> required: <span><span>true<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> },<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/props.html", "title": "Props | Vue.js", "doc_id": "1f08b4bcf9b643dbb5aab571f7b84a37", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 2081, "chunk_index": 68, "_doc_id": "68_7989532248443330754"}}
{"doc_id": "69_2539239570476485442", "text": "class=\"line\"><span> required: <span><span>true<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> },<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // Number 类型的默认值<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> propE: {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> type: Number,<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> default: <span><span>100<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> },<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 对象类型的默认值<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> propF: {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> type: Object,<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/props.html", "title": "Props | Vue.js", "doc_id": "1f08b4bcf9b643dbb5aab571f7b84a37", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 2081, "chunk_index": 69, "_doc_id": "69_2539239570476485442"}}
{"doc_id": "70_4765934980854582277", "text": "<span class=\"line\"><span> propF: {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> type: Object,<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 对象或数组的默认值<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 必须从一个工厂函数返回。<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 该函数接收组件所接收到的原始 prop 作为参数。<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> default<span><span>(<span><span>rawProps<span><span>) {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> return<span><span> { message: <span><span>'hello'<span><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/props.html", "title": "Props | Vue.js", "doc_id": "1f08b4bcf9b643dbb5aab571f7b84a37", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 2081, "chunk_index": 70, "_doc_id": "70_4765934980854582277"}}
{"doc_id": "71_8521054138371664234", "text": "n> { message: <span><span>'hello'<span><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> },<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 自定义类型校验函数<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 在 3.4+ 中完整的 props 作为第二个参数传入<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> propG: {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> validator<span><span>(<span><span>value<span><span>, <span><span>props<span><span>) {<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/props.html", "title": "Props | Vue.js", "doc_id": "1f08b4bcf9b643dbb5aab571f7b84a37", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 2081, "chunk_index": 71, "_doc_id": "71_8521054138371664234"}}
{"doc_id": "72_9140473634410212128", "text": "> validator<span><span>(<span><span>value<span><span>, <span><span>props<span><span>) {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // The value must match one of these strings<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> return<span><span> [<span><span>'success'<span><span>, <span><span>'warning'<span><span>, <span><span>'danger'<span><span>].<span><span>includes<span><span>(value)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> },<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/props.html", "title": "Props | Vue.js", "doc_id": "1f08b4bcf9b643dbb5aab571f7b84a37", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 2081, "chunk_index": 72, "_doc_id": "72_9140473634410212128"}}
{"doc_id": "73_3230279229704121596", "text": "value)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> },<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 函数类型的默认值<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> propH: {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> type: Function,<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 不像对象或数组的默认，这不是一个<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 工厂函数。这会是一个用来作为默认值的函数<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> default<span><span>() {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> return<span><span> 'Default function'<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/props.html", "title": "Props | Vue.js", "doc_id": "1f08b4bcf9b643dbb5aab571f7b84a37", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 2081, "chunk_index": 73, "_doc_id": "73_3230279229704121596"}}
{"doc_id": "74_4055975118569474863", "text": "><span>() {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> return<span><span> 'Default function'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/props.html", "title": "Props | Vue.js", "doc_id": "1f08b4bcf9b643dbb5aab571f7b84a37", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 2081, "chunk_index": 74, "_doc_id": "74_4055975118569474863"}}
{"doc_id": "75_7926562274288255371", "text": "nction'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>})<span><span><code><pre><div><div class=\"tip custom-block\"><p class=\"custom-block-title\">TIP<p><p><code>defineProps()<code> 宏中的参数<strong>不可以访问 <code><script setup><code> 中定义的其他变量<strong>，因为在编译时整个表达式都会被移到外部的函数中。<p><div><div><div class=\"options-api\"><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/props.html", "title": "Props | Vue.js", "doc_id": "1f08b4bcf9b643dbb5aab571f7b84a37", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 2081, "chunk_index": 75, "_doc_id": "75_7926562274288255371"}}
{"doc_id": "76_1258725036785490163", "text": "b-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> props: {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 基础类型检查<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // (给出 `null` 和 `undefined` 值则会跳过任何类型检查)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> propA: Number,<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 多种可能的类型<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> propB: [String, Number],<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 必传，且为 String 类型<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/props.html", "title": "Props | Vue.js", "doc_id": "1f08b4bcf9b643dbb5aab571f7b84a37", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 2081, "chunk_index": 76, "_doc_id": "76_1258725036785490163"}}
{"doc_id": "77_6555997529577072718", "text": "span> propB: [String, Number],<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 必传，且为 String 类型<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> propC: {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> type: String,<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> required: <span><span>true<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> },<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 必传但可为 null 的字符串<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> propD: {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> type: [String, <span><span>null<span><span>],<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/props.html", "title": "Props | Vue.js", "doc_id": "1f08b4bcf9b643dbb5aab571f7b84a37", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 2081, "chunk_index": 77, "_doc_id": "77_6555997529577072718"}}
{"doc_id": "78_5280788927469086483", "text": ": {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> type: [String, <span><span>null<span><span>],<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> required: <span><span>true<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> },<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // Number 类型的默认值<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> propE: {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> type: Number,<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> default: <span><span>100<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> },<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/props.html", "title": "Props | Vue.js", "doc_id": "1f08b4bcf9b643dbb5aab571f7b84a37", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 2081, "chunk_index": 78, "_doc_id": "78_5280788927469086483"}}
{"doc_id": "79_7453597373619727903", "text": "n class=\"line\"><span> default: <span><span>100<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> },<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 对象类型的默认值<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> propF: {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> type: Object,<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 对象或者数组应当用工厂函数返回。<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 工厂函数会收到组件所接收的原始 props<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 作为参数<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> default<span><span>(<span><span>rawProps<span><span>) {<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/props.html", "title": "Props | Vue.js", "doc_id": "1f08b4bcf9b643dbb5aab571f7b84a37", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 2081, "chunk_index": 79, "_doc_id": "79_7453597373619727903"}}
{"doc_id": "80_3924137475669948960", "text": "span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> default<span><span>(<span><span>rawProps<span><span>) {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> return<span><span> { message: <span><span>'hello'<span><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> },<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 自定义类型校验函数<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 在 3.4+ 中完整的 props 作为第二个参数传入<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> propG: {<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/props.html", "title": "Props | Vue.js", "doc_id": "1f08b4bcf9b643dbb5aab571f7b84a37", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 2081, "chunk_index": 80, "_doc_id": "80_3924137475669948960"}}
{"doc_id": "81_5833806378058301768", "text": "e\"><span> // 在 3.4+ 中完整的 props 作为第二个参数传入<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> propG: {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> validator<span><span>(<span><span>value<span><span>, <span><span>props<span><span>) {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // The value must match one of these strings<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> return<span><span> [<span><span>'success'<span><span>, <span><span>'warning'<span><span>, <span><span>'danger'<span><span>].<span><span>includes<span><span>(value)<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/props.html", "title": "Props | Vue.js", "doc_id": "1f08b4bcf9b643dbb5aab571f7b84a37", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 2081, "chunk_index": 81, "_doc_id": "81_5833806378058301768"}}
{"doc_id": "82_8413451661071107716", "text": "<span><span>, <span><span>'danger'<span><span>].<span><span>includes<span><span>(value)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> },<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 函数类型的默认值<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> propH: {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> type: Function,<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 不像对象或数组的默认，这不是一个<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 工厂函数。这会是一个用来作为默认值的函数<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/props.html", "title": "Props | Vue.js", "doc_id": "1f08b4bcf9b643dbb5aab571f7b84a37", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 2081, "chunk_index": 82, "_doc_id": "82_8413451661071107716"}}
{"doc_id": "83_9204418390972895934", "text": "span> // 不像对象或数组的默认，这不是一个<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 工厂函数。这会是一个用来作为默认值的函数<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> default<span><span>() {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> return<span><span> 'Default function'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span><code><pre><div><div><p>一些补充细节：<p><ul><li><p>所有 prop 默认都是可选的，除非声明了 <code>required: true<code>。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/props.html", "title": "Props | Vue.js", "doc_id": "1f08b4bcf9b643dbb5aab571f7b84a37", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 2081, "chunk_index": 83, "_doc_id": "83_9204418390972895934"}}
{"doc_id": "84_609627579659566045", "text": "<span><code><pre><div><div><p>一些补充细节：<p><ul><li><p>所有 prop 默认都是可选的，除非声明了 <code>required: true<code>。<p><li><li><p>除 <code>Boolean<code> 外的未传递的可选 prop 将会有一个默认值 <code>undefined<code>。<p><li><li><p><code>Boolean<code> 类型的未传递 prop 将被转换为 <code>false<code>。这可以通过为它设置 <code>default<code> 来更改——例如：设置为 <code>default: undefined<code> 将与非布尔类型的 prop 的行为保持一致。<p><li><li><p>如果声明了 <code>default<code> 值，那么在 prop 的值被解析为 <code>undefined<code> 时，无论 prop 是未被传递还是显式指明的 <code>undefined<code>，都会改为 <code>default<code> 值。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/props.html", "title": "Props | Vue.js", "doc_id": "1f08b4bcf9b643dbb5aab571f7b84a37", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 2081, "chunk_index": 84, "_doc_id": "84_609627579659566045"}}
{"doc_id": "85_3385435876546230539", "text": "值被解析为 <code>undefined<code> 时，无论 prop 是未被传递还是显式指明的 <code>undefined<code>，都会改为 <code>default<code> 值。<p><li><ul><p>当 prop 的校验失败后，Vue 会抛出一个控制台警告 (在开发模式下)。<p><div class=\"composition-api\"><p>如果使用了<a href=\"/api/sfc-script-setup.html#type-only-props-emit-declarations\">基于类型的 prop 声明<a> ，Vue 会尽最大努力在运行时按照 prop 的类型标注进行编译。举例来说，<code>defineProps<{ msg: string }><code> 会被编译为 <code>{ msg: { type: String, required: true }}<code>。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/props.html", "title": "Props | Vue.js", "doc_id": "1f08b4bcf9b643dbb5aab571f7b84a37", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 2081, "chunk_index": 85, "_doc_id": "85_3385435876546230539"}}
{"doc_id": "86_7520024200877605268", "text": "<code>defineProps<{ msg: string }><code> 会被编译为 <code>{ msg: { type: String, required: true }}<code>。<p><div><div class=\"options-api\"><div class=\"tip custom-block\"><p class=\"custom-block-title\">注意<p><p>注意 prop 的校验是在组件实例被创建<strong>之前<strong>，所以实例的属性 (比如 <code>data<code>、<code>computed<code> 等) 将在 <code>default<code> 或 <code>validator<code> 函数中不可用。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/props.html", "title": "Props | Vue.js", "doc_id": "1f08b4bcf9b643dbb5aab571f7b84a37", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 2081, "chunk_index": 86, "_doc_id": "86_7520024200877605268"}}
{"doc_id": "87_3208432022644435096", "text": "(比如 <code>data<code>、<code>computed<code> 等) 将在 <code>default<code> 或 <code>validator<code> 函数中不可用。<p><div><div><h3 id=\"runtime-type-checks\">运行时类型检查 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#runtime-type-checks\">​<a><h3><p>校验选项中的 <code>type<code> 可以是下列这些原生构造函数：<p><ul><li><code>String<code><li><li><code>Number<code><li><li><code>Boolean<code><li><li><code>Array<code><li><li><code>Object<code><li><li><code>Date<code><li><li><code>Function<code><li><li><code>Symbol<code><li><li><code>Error<code><li><ul><p>另外，<code>type<code> 也可以是自定义的类或构造函数，Vue 将会通过 <code>instanceof<code> 来检查类型是否匹配。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/props.html", "title": "Props | Vue.js", "doc_id": "1f08b4bcf9b643dbb5aab571f7b84a37", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 2081, "chunk_index": 87, "_doc_id": "87_3208432022644435096"}}
{"doc_id": "88_3547477452708246195", "text": ">Error<code><li><ul><p>另外，<code>type<code> 也可以是自定义的类或构造函数，Vue 将会通过 <code>instanceof<code> 来检查类型是否匹配。例如下面这个类：<p><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>class<span><span> Person<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> constructor<span><span>(<span><span>firstName<span><span>, <span><span>lastName<span><span>) {<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/props.html", "title": "Props | Vue.js", "doc_id": "1f08b4bcf9b643dbb5aab571f7b84a37", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 2081, "chunk_index": 88, "_doc_id": "88_3547477452708246195"}}
{"doc_id": "89_3013308831611300100", "text": "ctor<span><span>(<span><span>firstName<span><span>, <span><span>lastName<span><span>) {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> this<span><span>.firstName <span><span>=<span><span> firstName<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> this<span><span>.lastName <span><span>=<span><span> lastName<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/props.html", "title": "Props | Vue.js", "doc_id": "1f08b4bcf9b643dbb5aab571f7b84a37", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 2081, "chunk_index": 89, "_doc_id": "89_3013308831611300100"}}
{"doc_id": "90_6959519931107541151", "text": "an>.lastName <span><span>=<span><span> lastName<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span><code><pre><div><p>你可以将其作为一个 prop 的类型：<p><div class=\"composition-api\"><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>defineProps<span><span>({<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> author: Person<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/props.html", "title": "Props | Vue.js", "doc_id": "1f08b4bcf9b643dbb5aab571f7b84a37", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 2081, "chunk_index": 90, "_doc_id": "90_6959519931107541151"}}
{"doc_id": "91_1354775305855684364", "text": "e\"><span>defineProps<span><span>({<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> author: Person<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>})<span><span><code><pre><div><div><div class=\"options-api\"><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> props: {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> author: Person<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/props.html", "title": "Props | Vue.js", "doc_id": "1f08b4bcf9b643dbb5aab571f7b84a37", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 2081, "chunk_index": 91, "_doc_id": "91_1354775305855684364"}}
{"doc_id": "92_6451900920029013352", "text": "<span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> author: Person<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span><code><pre><div><div><p>Vue 会通过 <code>instanceof Person<code> 来校验 <code>author<code> prop 的值是否是 <code>Person<code> 类的一个实例。<p><h3 id=\"nullable-type\">可为 null 的类型 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#nullable-type\">​<a><h3><p>如果该类型是必传但可为 null 的，你可以用一个包含 <code>null<code> 的数组语法：<p><div class=\"composition-api\"><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>defineProps<span><span>({<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/props.html", "title": "Props | Vue.js", "doc_id": "1f08b4bcf9b643dbb5aab571f7b84a37", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 2081, "chunk_index": 92, "_doc_id": "92_6451900920029013352"}}
{"doc_id": "93_3947046202752426589", "text": "ss=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>defineProps<span><span>({<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> id: {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> type: [String, <span><span>null<span><span>],<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> required: <span><span>true<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/props.html", "title": "Props | Vue.js", "doc_id": "1f08b4bcf9b643dbb5aab571f7b84a37", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 2081, "chunk_index": 93, "_doc_id": "93_3947046202752426589"}}
{"doc_id": "94_1793160921394360438", "text": "class=\"line\"><span> required: <span><span>true<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>})<span><span><code><pre><div><div><div class=\"options-api\"><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> props: {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> id: {<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/props.html", "title": "Props | Vue.js", "doc_id": "1f08b4bcf9b643dbb5aab571f7b84a37", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 2081, "chunk_index": 94, "_doc_id": "94_1793160921394360438"}}
{"doc_id": "95_3263729180716651388", "text": "n><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> props: {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> id: {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> type: [String, <span><span>null<span><span>],<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> required: <span><span>true<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span><code><pre><div><div><p>注意如果 <code>type<code> 仅为 <code>null<code> 而非使用数组语法，它将允许任何类型。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/props.html", "title": "Props | Vue.js", "doc_id": "1f08b4bcf9b643dbb5aab571f7b84a37", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 2081, "chunk_index": 95, "_doc_id": "95_3263729180716651388"}}
{"doc_id": "96_9175642146163628682", "text": "an>}<span><span><code><pre><div><div><p>注意如果 <code>type<code> 仅为 <code>null<code> 而非使用数组语法，它将允许任何类型。<p><h2 id=\"boolean-casting\">Boolean 类型转换 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#boolean-casting\">​<a><h2><p>为了更贴近原生 boolean attributes 的行为，声明为 <code>Boolean<code> 类型的 props 有特别的类型转换规则。以带有如下声明的 <code><MyComponent><code> 组件为例：<p><div class=\"composition-api\"><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>defineProps<span><span>({<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/props.html", "title": "Props | Vue.js", "doc_id": "1f08b4bcf9b643dbb5aab571f7b84a37", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 2081, "chunk_index": 96, "_doc_id": "96_9175642146163628682"}}
{"doc_id": "97_5883624662489543703", "text": "ss=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>defineProps<span><span>({<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> disabled: Boolean<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>})<span><span><code><pre><div><div><div class=\"options-api\"><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> props: {<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/props.html", "title": "Props | Vue.js", "doc_id": "1f08b4bcf9b643dbb5aab571f7b84a37", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 2081, "chunk_index": 97, "_doc_id": "97_5883624662489543703"}}
{"doc_id": "98_5588663588887450259", "text": "export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> props: {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> disabled: Boolean<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span><code><pre><div><div><p>该组件可以被这样使用：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><!-- 等同于传入 :disabled=\"true\" --><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/props.html", "title": "Props | Vue.js", "doc_id": "1f08b4bcf9b643dbb5aab571f7b84a37", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 2081, "chunk_index": 98, "_doc_id": "98_5588663588887450259"}}
{"doc_id": "99_1271811863950605138", "text": "iki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><!-- 等同于传入 :disabled=\"true\" --><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>MyComponent<span><span> disabled<span><span> /><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><!-- 等同于传入 :disabled=\"false\" --><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/props.html", "title": "Props | Vue.js", "doc_id": "1f08b4bcf9b643dbb5aab571f7b84a37", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 2081, "chunk_index": 99, "_doc_id": "99_1271811863950605138"}}
{"doc_id": "100_6841778020582537389", "text": "an>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><!-- 等同于传入 :disabled=\"false\" --><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>MyComponent<span><span> /><span><span><code><pre><div><p>当一个 prop 被声明为允许多种类型时，<code>Boolean<code> 的转换规则也将被应用。然而，当同时允许 <code>String<code> 和 <code>Boolean<code> 时，有一种边缘情况——只有当 <code>Boolean<code> 出现在 <code>String<code> 之前时，<code>Boolean<code> 转换规则才适用：<p><div class=\"composition-api\"><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// disabled 将被转换为 true<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/props.html", "title": "Props | Vue.js", "doc_id": "1f08b4bcf9b643dbb5aab571f7b84a37", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 2081, "chunk_index": 100, "_doc_id": "100_6841778020582537389"}}
{"doc_id": "101_1332454273963993026", "text": "class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// disabled 将被转换为 true<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>defineProps<span><span>({<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> disabled: [Boolean, Number]<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>})<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// disabled 将被转换为 true<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>defineProps<span><span>({<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> disabled: [Boolean, String]<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/props.html", "title": "Props | Vue.js", "doc_id": "1f08b4bcf9b643dbb5aab571f7b84a37", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 2081, "chunk_index": 101, "_doc_id": "101_1332454273963993026"}}
{"doc_id": "102_673532601203583819", "text": "neProps<span><span>({<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> disabled: [Boolean, String]<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>})<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// disabled 将被转换为 true<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>defineProps<span><span>({<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> disabled: [Number, Boolean]<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>})<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// disabled 将被解析为空字符串 (disabled=\"\")<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/props.html", "title": "Props | Vue.js", "doc_id": "1f08b4bcf9b643dbb5aab571f7b84a37", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 2081, "chunk_index": 102, "_doc_id": "102_673532601203583819"}}
{"doc_id": "103_6712520169721565781", "text": "<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// disabled 将被解析为空字符串 (disabled=\"\")<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>defineProps<span><span>({<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> disabled: [String, Boolean]<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>})<span><span><code><pre><div><div><div class=\"options-api\"><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// disabled 将被转换为 true<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/props.html", "title": "Props | Vue.js", "doc_id": "1f08b4bcf9b643dbb5aab571f7b84a37", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 2081, "chunk_index": 103, "_doc_id": "103_6712520169721565781"}}
{"doc_id": "104_5173569795872596206", "text": "class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// disabled 将被转换为 true<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> props: {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> disabled: [Boolean, Number]<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// disabled 将被转换为 true<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/props.html", "title": "Props | Vue.js", "doc_id": "1f08b4bcf9b643dbb5aab571f7b84a37", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 2081, "chunk_index": 104, "_doc_id": "104_5173569795872596206"}}
{"doc_id": "105_6497465279505256804", "text": "}<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// disabled 将被转换为 true<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> props: {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> disabled: [Boolean, String]<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// disabled 将被转换为 true<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/props.html", "title": "Props | Vue.js", "doc_id": "1f08b4bcf9b643dbb5aab571f7b84a37", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 2081, "chunk_index": 105, "_doc_id": "105_6497465279505256804"}}
{"doc_id": "106_4270645465759558697", "text": "}<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// disabled 将被转换为 true<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> props: {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> disabled: [Number, Boolean]<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// disabled 将被解析为空字符串 (disabled=\"\")<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/props.html", "title": "Props | Vue.js", "doc_id": "1f08b4bcf9b643dbb5aab571f7b84a37", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 2081, "chunk_index": 106, "_doc_id": "106_4270645465759558697"}}
{"doc_id": "107_7771597026923751434", "text": "<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// disabled 将被解析为空字符串 (disabled=\"\")<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> props: {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> disabled: [String, Boolean]<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span><code><pre><div><div><div><div>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/props.html", "title": "Props | Vue.js", "doc_id": "1f08b4bcf9b643dbb5aab571f7b84a37", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 2081, "chunk_index": 107, "_doc_id": "107_7771597026923751434"}}
{"doc_id": "0_7867820844582027062", "text": "<div><div><h1 id=\"event-handling\">事件处理 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#event-handling\">​<a><h1><h2 id=\"listening-to-events\">监听事件 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#listening-to-events\">​<a><h2><p>我们可以使用 <code>v-on<code> 指令 (简写为 <code>@<code>) 来监听 DOM 事件，并在事件触发时执行对应的 JavaScript。用法：<code>v-on:click=\"handler\"<code> 或 <code>@click=\"handler\"<code>。<p><p>事件处理器 (handler) 的值可以是：<p><ol><li><p><strong>内联事件处理器<strong>：事件被触发时执行的内联 JavaScript 语句 (与 <code>onclick<code> 类似)。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/event-handling.html", "title": "事件处理", "doc_id": "6b5f6666d269449387359e23f1026019", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 709, "chunk_index": 0, "_doc_id": "0_7867820844582027062"}}
{"doc_id": "1_3538307593229178680", "text": "r) 的值可以是：<p><ol><li><p><strong>内联事件处理器<strong>：事件被触发时执行的内联 JavaScript 语句 (与 <code>onclick<code> 类似)。<p><li><li><p><strong>方法事件处理器<strong>：一个指向组件上定义的方法的属性名或是路径。<p><li><ol><h2 id=\"inline-handlers\">内联事件处理器 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#inline-handlers\">​<a><h2><p>内联事件处理器通常用于简单场景，例如：<p><div class=\"options-api\"><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>data<span><span>() {<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/event-handling.html", "title": "事件处理", "doc_id": "6b5f6666d269449387359e23f1026019", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 709, "chunk_index": 1, "_doc_id": "1_3538307593229178680"}}
{"doc_id": "2_515156128503650922", "text": "e class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>data<span><span>() {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> return<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> count: <span><span>0<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/event-handling.html", "title": "事件处理", "doc_id": "6b5f6666d269449387359e23f1026019", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 709, "chunk_index": 2, "_doc_id": "2_515156128503650922"}}
{"doc_id": "3_8213401573255986401", "text": "<span class=\"line\"><span> count: <span><span>0<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span><code><pre><div><div><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>button<span><span> @<span><span>click<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>count<span><span>++<span><span>\"<span><span>>Add 1</<span><span>button<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/event-handling.html", "title": "事件处理", "doc_id": "6b5f6666d269449387359e23f1026019", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 709, "chunk_index": 3, "_doc_id": "3_8213401573255986401"}}
{"doc_id": "4_3745315831035925963", "text": "pan>count<span><span>++<span><span>\"<span><span>>Add 1</<span><span>button<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>p<span><span>>Count is: {{ count }}</<span><span>p<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><h2 id=\"method-handlers\">方法事件处理器 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#method-handlers\">​<a><h2><p>随着事件处理器的逻辑变得愈发复杂，内联代码方式变得不够灵活。因此 <code>v-on<code> 也可以接受一个方法名或对某个方法的调用。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/event-handling.html", "title": "事件处理", "doc_id": "6b5f6666d269449387359e23f1026019", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 709, "chunk_index": 4, "_doc_id": "4_3745315831035925963"}}
{"doc_id": "5_6696401361945149438", "text": "\"#method-handlers\">​<a><h2><p>随着事件处理器的逻辑变得愈发复杂，内联代码方式变得不够灵活。因此 <code>v-on<code> 也可以接受一个方法名或对某个方法的调用。<p><p>举例来说：<p><div class=\"composition-api\"><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> name<span><span> =<span><span> ref<span><span>(<span><span>'Vue.js'<span><span>)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>function<span><span> greet<span><span>(<span><span>event<span><span>) {<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/event-handling.html", "title": "事件处理", "doc_id": "6b5f6666d269449387359e23f1026019", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 709, "chunk_index": 5, "_doc_id": "5_6696401361945149438"}}
{"doc_id": "6_5644892483110067258", "text": "ss=\"line\"><span>function<span><span> greet<span><span>(<span><span>event<span><span>) {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> alert<span><span>(<span><span>`Hello ${<span><span>name<span><span>.<span><span>value<span><span>}!`<span><span>)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // `event` 是 DOM 原生事件<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> if<span><span> (event) {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> alert<span><span>(event.target.tagName)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/event-handling.html", "title": "事件处理", "doc_id": "6b5f6666d269449387359e23f1026019", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 709, "chunk_index": 6, "_doc_id": "6_5644892483110067258"}}
{"doc_id": "7_4318329511687281929", "text": "><span> alert<span><span>(event.target.tagName)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span><code><pre><div><div><div class=\"options-api\"><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>data<span><span>() {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> return<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> name: <span><span>'Vue.js'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/event-handling.html", "title": "事件处理", "doc_id": "6b5f6666d269449387359e23f1026019", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 709, "chunk_index": 7, "_doc_id": "7_4318329511687281929"}}
{"doc_id": "8_4988595710212045272", "text": "class=\"line\"><span> name: <span><span>'Vue.js'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>},<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>methods<span><span>: {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> greet<span><span>(event) {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 方法中的 `this` 指向当前活跃的组件实例<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> alert<span><span>(<span><span>`Hello ${<span><span>this<span><span>.<span><span>name<span><span>}!`<span><span>)<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/event-handling.html", "title": "事件处理", "doc_id": "6b5f6666d269449387359e23f1026019", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 709, "chunk_index": 8, "_doc_id": "8_4988595710212045272"}}
{"doc_id": "9_315523787392942931", "text": "span>`Hello ${<span><span>this<span><span>.<span><span>name<span><span>}!`<span><span>)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // `event` 是 DOM 原生事件<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> if<span><span> (event) {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> alert<span><span>(event.target.tagName)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/event-handling.html", "title": "事件处理", "doc_id": "6b5f6666d269449387359e23f1026019", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 709, "chunk_index": 9, "_doc_id": "9_315523787392942931"}}
{"doc_id": "10_1403993998336451253", "text": "agName)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span><code><pre><div><div><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><!-- `greet` 是上面定义过的方法名 --><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/event-handling.html", "title": "事件处理", "doc_id": "6b5f6666d269449387359e23f1026019", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 709, "chunk_index": 10, "_doc_id": "10_1403993998336451253"}}
{"doc_id": "11_7322567489751065732", "text": "=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><!-- `greet` 是上面定义过的方法名 --><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>button<span><span> @<span><span>click<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>greet<span><span>\"<span><span>>Greet</<span><span>button<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>方法事件处理器会自动接收原生 DOM 事件并触发执行。在上面的例子中，我们能够通过被触发事件的 <code>event.target<code> 访问到该 DOM 元素。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/event-handling.html", "title": "事件处理", "doc_id": "6b5f6666d269449387359e23f1026019", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 709, "chunk_index": 11, "_doc_id": "11_7322567489751065732"}}
{"doc_id": "12_7221011271418396194", "text": "e><pre><div><p>方法事件处理器会自动接收原生 DOM 事件并触发执行。在上面的例子中，我们能够通过被触发事件的 <code>event.target<code> 访问到该 DOM 元素。<p><h3 id=\"method-vs-inline-detection\">方法与内联事件判断 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#method-vs-inline-detection\">​<a><h3><p>模板编译器会通过检查 <code>v-on<code> 的值是否是合法的 JavaScript 标识符或属性访问路径来断定是何种形式的事件处理器。举例来说，<code>foo<code>、<code>foo.bar<code> 和 <code>foo['bar']<code> 会被视为方法事件处理器，而 <code>foo()<code> 和 <code>count++<code> 会被视为内联事件处理器。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/event-handling.html", "title": "事件处理", "doc_id": "6b5f6666d269449387359e23f1026019", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 709, "chunk_index": 12, "_doc_id": "12_7221011271418396194"}}
{"doc_id": "13_5030482254736199170", "text": "ar<code> 和 <code>foo['bar']<code> 会被视为方法事件处理器，而 <code>foo()<code> 和 <code>count++<code> 会被视为内联事件处理器。<p><h2 id=\"calling-methods-in-inline-handlers\">在内联处理器中调用方法 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#calling-methods-in-inline-handlers\">​<a><h2><p>除了直接绑定方法名，你还可以在内联事件处理器中调用方法。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/event-handling.html", "title": "事件处理", "doc_id": "6b5f6666d269449387359e23f1026019", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 709, "chunk_index": 13, "_doc_id": "13_5030482254736199170"}}
{"doc_id": "14_240350735568294957", "text": "s=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#calling-methods-in-inline-handlers\">​<a><h2><p>除了直接绑定方法名，你还可以在内联事件处理器中调用方法。这允许我们向方法传入自定义参数以代替原生事件：<p><div class=\"composition-api\"><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>function<span><span> say<span><span>(<span><span>message<span><span>) {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> alert<span><span>(message)<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/event-handling.html", "title": "事件处理", "doc_id": "6b5f6666d269449387359e23f1026019", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 709, "chunk_index": 14, "_doc_id": "14_240350735568294957"}}
{"doc_id": "15_4411765744362741341", "text": "message<span><span>) {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> alert<span><span>(message)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span><code><pre><div><div><div class=\"options-api\"><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>methods<span><span>: {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> say<span><span>(message) {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> alert<span><span>(message)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/event-handling.html", "title": "事件处理", "doc_id": "6b5f6666d269449387359e23f1026019", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 709, "chunk_index": 15, "_doc_id": "15_4411765744362741341"}}
{"doc_id": "16_3865815886795287119", "text": "class=\"line\"><span> alert<span><span>(message)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span><code><pre><div><div><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>button<span><span> @<span><span>click<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>say<span><span>(<span><span>'hello'<span><span>)<span><span>\"<span><span>>Say hello</<span><span>button<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/event-handling.html", "title": "事件处理", "doc_id": "6b5f6666d269449387359e23f1026019", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 709, "chunk_index": 16, "_doc_id": "16_3865815886795287119"}}
{"doc_id": "17_8859170774942416539", "text": "hello'<span><span>)<span><span>\"<span><span>>Say hello</<span><span>button<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>button<span><span> @<span><span>click<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>say<span><span>(<span><span>'bye'<span><span>)<span><span>\"<span><span>>Say bye</<span><span>button<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><h2 id=\"accessing-event-argument-in-inline-handlers\">在内联事件处理器中访问事件参数 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#accessing-event-argument-in-inline-handlers\">​<a><h2><p>有时我们需要在内联事件处理器中访问原生 DOM 事件。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/event-handling.html", "title": "事件处理", "doc_id": "6b5f6666d269449387359e23f1026019", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 709, "chunk_index": 17, "_doc_id": "17_8859170774942416539"}}
{"doc_id": "18_1304757944695248030", "text": "r-anchor\" href=\"#accessing-event-argument-in-inline-handlers\">​<a><h2><p>有时我们需要在内联事件处理器中访问原生 DOM 事件。你可以向该处理器方法传入一个特殊的 <code>$event<code> 变量，或者使用内联箭头函数：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><!-- 使用特殊的 $event 变量 --><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/event-handling.html", "title": "事件处理", "doc_id": "6b5f6666d269449387359e23f1026019", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 709, "chunk_index": 18, "_doc_id": "18_1304757944695248030"}}
{"doc_id": "19_4767391062064817621", "text": "ass=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><!-- 使用特殊的 $event 变量 --><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>button<span><span> @<span><span>click<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>warn<span><span>(<span><span>'Form cannot be submitted yet.'<span><span>, $event)<span><span>\"<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> Submit<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>button<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/event-handling.html", "title": "事件处理", "doc_id": "6b5f6666d269449387359e23f1026019", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 709, "chunk_index": 19, "_doc_id": "19_4767391062064817621"}}
{"doc_id": "20_2646100391258416984", "text": "n>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>button<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><!-- 使用内联箭头函数 --><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>button<span><span> @<span><span>click<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>(<span><span>event<span><span>) <span><span>=><span><span> warn<span><span>(<span><span>'Form cannot be submitted yet.'<span><span>, event)<span><span>\"<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> Submit<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/event-handling.html", "title": "事件处理", "doc_id": "6b5f6666d269449387359e23f1026019", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 709, "chunk_index": 20, "_doc_id": "20_2646100391258416984"}}
{"doc_id": "21_6752718060993507791", "text": "n><span>, event)<span><span>\"<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> Submit<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>button<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><div class=\"composition-api\"><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>function<span><span> warn<span><span>(<span><span>message<span><span>, <span><span>event<span><span>) {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 这里可以访问原生事件<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/event-handling.html", "title": "事件处理", "doc_id": "6b5f6666d269449387359e23f1026019", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 709, "chunk_index": 21, "_doc_id": "21_6752718060993507791"}}
{"doc_id": "22_7320111849001625302", "text": ">, <span><span>event<span><span>) {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 这里可以访问原生事件<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> if<span><span> (event) {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> event.<span><span>preventDefault<span><span>()<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> alert<span><span>(message)<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/event-handling.html", "title": "事件处理", "doc_id": "6b5f6666d269449387359e23f1026019", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 709, "chunk_index": 22, "_doc_id": "22_7320111849001625302"}}
{"doc_id": "23_3186352740300757839", "text": "class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> alert<span><span>(message)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span><code><pre><div><div><div class=\"options-api\"><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>methods<span><span>: {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> warn<span><span>(message, event) {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 这里可以访问 DOM 原生事件<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/event-handling.html", "title": "事件处理", "doc_id": "6b5f6666d269449387359e23f1026019", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 709, "chunk_index": 23, "_doc_id": "23_3186352740300757839"}}
{"doc_id": "24_472462205026902894", "text": "<span><span>(message, event) {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 这里可以访问 DOM 原生事件<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> if<span><span> (event) {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> event.<span><span>preventDefault<span><span>()<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> alert<span><span>(message)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/event-handling.html", "title": "事件处理", "doc_id": "6b5f6666d269449387359e23f1026019", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 709, "chunk_index": 24, "_doc_id": "24_472462205026902894"}}
{"doc_id": "25_9194884614426350211", "text": "class=\"line\"><span> alert<span><span>(message)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span><code><pre><div><div><h2 id=\"event-modifiers\">事件修饰符 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#event-modifiers\">​<a><h2><p>在处理事件时调用 <code>event.preventDefault()<code> 或 <code>event.stopPropagation()<code> 是很常见的。尽管我们可以直接在方法内调用，但如果方法能更专注于数据逻辑而不用去处理 DOM 事件的细节会更好。<p><p>为解决这一问题，Vue 为 <code>v-on<code> 提供了<strong>事件修饰符<strong>。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/event-handling.html", "title": "事件处理", "doc_id": "6b5f6666d269449387359e23f1026019", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 709, "chunk_index": 25, "_doc_id": "25_9194884614426350211"}}
{"doc_id": "26_1240739010459110935", "text": "内调用，但如果方法能更专注于数据逻辑而不用去处理 DOM 事件的细节会更好。<p><p>为解决这一问题，Vue 为 <code>v-on<code> 提供了<strong>事件修饰符<strong>。修饰符是用 <code>.<code> 表示的指令后缀，包含以下这些：<p><ul><li><code>.stop<code><li><li><code>.prevent<code><li><li><code>.self<code><li><li><code>.capture<code><li><li><code>.once<code><li><li><code>.passive<code><li><ul><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><!-- 单击事件将停止传递 --><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/event-handling.html", "title": "事件处理", "doc_id": "6b5f6666d269449387359e23f1026019", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 709, "chunk_index": 26, "_doc_id": "26_1240739010459110935"}}
{"doc_id": "27_1881092480506048004", "text": "pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><!-- 单击事件将停止传递 --><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>a<span><span> @<span><span>click<span><span>.<span><span>stop<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>doThis<span><span>\"<span><span>></<span><span>a<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><!-- 提交事件将不再重新加载页面 --><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/event-handling.html", "title": "事件处理", "doc_id": "6b5f6666d269449387359e23f1026019", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 709, "chunk_index": 27, "_doc_id": "27_1881092480506048004"}}
{"doc_id": "28_3829733701692045538", "text": "><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><!-- 提交事件将不再重新加载页面 --><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>form<span><span> @<span><span>submit<span><span>.<span><span>prevent<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>onSubmit<span><span>\"<span><span>></<span><span>form<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><!-- 修饰语可以使用链式书写 --><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/event-handling.html", "title": "事件处理", "doc_id": "6b5f6666d269449387359e23f1026019", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 709, "chunk_index": 28, "_doc_id": "28_3829733701692045538"}}
{"doc_id": "29_6030509326980040510", "text": "n>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><!-- 修饰语可以使用链式书写 --><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>a<span><span> @<span><span>click<span><span>.stop.<span><span>prevent<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>doThat<span><span>\"<span><span>></<span><span>a<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><!-- 也可以只有修饰符 --><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/event-handling.html", "title": "事件处理", "doc_id": "6b5f6666d269449387359e23f1026019", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 709, "chunk_index": 29, "_doc_id": "29_6030509326980040510"}}
{"doc_id": "30_160404779727621920", "text": "span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><!-- 也可以只有修饰符 --><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>form<span><span> @<span><span>submit<span><span>.<span><span>prevent<span><span>></<span><span>form<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><!-- 仅当 event.target 是元素本身时才会触发事件处理器 --><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><!-- 例如：事件处理器不来自子元素 --><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/event-handling.html", "title": "事件处理", "doc_id": "6b5f6666d269449387359e23f1026019", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 709, "chunk_index": 30, "_doc_id": "30_160404779727621920"}}
{"doc_id": "31_285239318976812231", "text": "target 是元素本身时才会触发事件处理器 --><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><!-- 例如：事件处理器不来自子元素 --><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>div<span><span> @<span><span>click<span><span>.<span><span>self<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>doThat<span><span>\"<span><span>>...</<span><span>div<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><div class=\"tip custom-block\"><p class=\"custom-block-title\">TIP<p><p>使用修饰符时需要注意调用顺序，因为相关代码是以相同的顺序生成的。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/event-handling.html", "title": "事件处理", "doc_id": "6b5f6666d269449387359e23f1026019", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 709, "chunk_index": 31, "_doc_id": "31_285239318976812231"}}
{"doc_id": "32_4571101272818338624", "text": "div class=\"tip custom-block\"><p class=\"custom-block-title\">TIP<p><p>使用修饰符时需要注意调用顺序，因为相关代码是以相同的顺序生成的。因此使用 <code>@click.prevent.self<code> 会阻止<strong>元素及其子元素的所有点击事件的默认行为<strong>，而 <code>@click.self.prevent<code> 则只会阻止对元素本身的点击事件的默认行为。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/event-handling.html", "title": "事件处理", "doc_id": "6b5f6666d269449387359e23f1026019", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 709, "chunk_index": 32, "_doc_id": "32_4571101272818338624"}}
{"doc_id": "33_5686436558263837344", "text": "code> 会阻止<strong>元素及其子元素的所有点击事件的默认行为<strong>，而 <code>@click.self.prevent<code> 则只会阻止对元素本身的点击事件的默认行为。<p><div><p><code>.capture<code>、<code>.once<code> 和 <code>.passive<code> 修饰符与<a href=\"https://developer.mozilla.org/zh-CN/docs/Web/API/EventTarget/addEventListener#options\" target=\"_blank\">原生 <code>addEventListener<code> 事件<a>相对应：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><!-- 添加事件监听器时，使用 `capture` 捕获模式 --><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/event-handling.html", "title": "事件处理", "doc_id": "6b5f6666d269449387359e23f1026019", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 709, "chunk_index": 33, "_doc_id": "33_5686436558263837344"}}
{"doc_id": "34_1660497690933803880", "text": "github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><!-- 添加事件监听器时，使用 `capture` 捕获模式 --><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><!-- 例如：指向内部元素的事件，在被内部元素处理前，先被外部处理 --><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>div<span><span> @<span><span>click<span><span>.<span><span>capture<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>doThis<span><span>\"<span><span>>...</<span><span>div<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><!-- 点击事件最多被触发一次 --><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/event-handling.html", "title": "事件处理", "doc_id": "6b5f6666d269449387359e23f1026019", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 709, "chunk_index": 34, "_doc_id": "34_1660497690933803880"}}
{"doc_id": "35_3178564984038924181", "text": "n>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><!-- 点击事件最多被触发一次 --><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>a<span><span> @<span><span>click<span><span>.<span><span>once<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>doThis<span><span>\"<span><span>></<span><span>a<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><!-- 滚动事件的默认行为 (scrolling) 将立即发生而非等待 `onScroll` 完成 --><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><!-- 以防其中包含 `event.preventDefault()` --><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/event-handling.html", "title": "事件处理", "doc_id": "6b5f6666d269449387359e23f1026019", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 709, "chunk_index": 35, "_doc_id": "35_3178564984038924181"}}
{"doc_id": "36_7365080218564425648", "text": "l` 完成 --><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><!-- 以防其中包含 `event.preventDefault()` --><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>div<span><span> @<span><span>scroll<span><span>.<span><span>passive<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>onScroll<span><span>\"<span><span>>...</<span><span>div<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p><code>.passive<code> 修饰符一般用于触摸事件的监听器，可以用来<a href=\"https://developer.mozilla.org/zh-CN/docs/Web/API/EventTarget/addEventListener#%E4%BD%BF%E7%94%A8_passive_%E6%94%B9%E5%96%84%E6%BB%9A%E5%B1%8F%E6%80%A7%E8%83%BD\" target=\"_blank\">改善移动端设备的滚屏性能<a>。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/event-handling.html", "title": "事件处理", "doc_id": "6b5f6666d269449387359e23f1026019", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 709, "chunk_index": 36, "_doc_id": "36_7365080218564425648"}}
{"doc_id": "37_5637395649592482075", "text": "%A8_passive_%E6%94%B9%E5%96%84%E6%BB%9A%E5%B1%8F%E6%80%A7%E8%83%BD\" target=\"_blank\">改善移动端设备的滚屏性能<a>。<p><div class=\"tip custom-block\"><p class=\"custom-block-title\">TIP<p><p>请勿同时使用 <code>.passive<code> 和 <code>.prevent<code>，因为 <code>.passive<code> 已经向浏览器表明了你<em>不想<em>阻止事件的默认行为。如果你这么做了，则 <code>.prevent<code> 会被忽略，并且浏览器会抛出警告。<p><div><h2 id=\"key-modifiers\">按键修饰符 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#key-modifiers\">​<a><h2><p>在监听键盘事件时，我们经常需要检查特定的按键。Vue 允许在 <code>v-on<code> 或 <code>@<code> 监听按键事件时添加按键修饰符。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/event-handling.html", "title": "事件处理", "doc_id": "6b5f6666d269449387359e23f1026019", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 709, "chunk_index": 37, "_doc_id": "37_5637395649592482075"}}
{"doc_id": "38_920823208074977121", "text": "odifiers\">​<a><h2><p>在监听键盘事件时，我们经常需要检查特定的按键。Vue 允许在 <code>v-on<code> 或 <code>@<code> 监听按键事件时添加按键修饰符。<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><!-- 仅在 `key` 为 `Enter` 时调用 `submit` --><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/event-handling.html", "title": "事件处理", "doc_id": "6b5f6666d269449387359e23f1026019", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 709, "chunk_index": 38, "_doc_id": "38_920823208074977121"}}
{"doc_id": "39_4442884869104294114", "text": "b-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><!-- 仅在 `key` 为 `Enter` 时调用 `submit` --><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>input<span><span> @<span><span>keyup<span><span>.<span><span>enter<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>submit<span><span>\"<span><span> /><span><span><code><pre><div><p>你可以直接使用 <a href=\"https://developer.mozilla.org/zh-CN/docs/Web/API/UI_Events/Keyboard_event_key_values\" target=\"_blank\"><code>KeyboardEvent.key<code><a> 暴露的按键名称作为修饰符，但需要转为 kebab-case 形式。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/event-handling.html", "title": "事件处理", "doc_id": "6b5f6666d269449387359e23f1026019", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 709, "chunk_index": 39, "_doc_id": "39_4442884869104294114"}}
{"doc_id": "40_4446118655593958746", "text": "event_key_values\" target=\"_blank\"><code>KeyboardEvent.key<code><a> 暴露的按键名称作为修饰符，但需要转为 kebab-case 形式。<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>input<span><span> @<span><span>keyup<span><span>.<span><span>page-down<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>onPageDown<span><span>\"<span><span> /><span><span><code><pre><div><p>在上面的例子中，仅会在 <code>$event.key<code> 为 <code>'PageDown'<code> 时调用事件处理。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/event-handling.html", "title": "事件处理", "doc_id": "6b5f6666d269449387359e23f1026019", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 709, "chunk_index": 40, "_doc_id": "40_4446118655593958746"}}
{"doc_id": "41_1503041275021494040", "text": "><span><span><code><pre><div><p>在上面的例子中，仅会在 <code>$event.key<code> 为 <code>'PageDown'<code> 时调用事件处理。<p><h3 id=\"key-aliases\">按键别名 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#key-aliases\">​<a><h3><p>Vue 为一些常用的按键提供了别名：<p><ul><li><code>.enter<code><li><li><code>.tab<code><li><li><code>.delete<code> (捕获“Delete”和“Backspace”两个按键)<li><li><code>.esc<code><li><li><code>.space<code><li><li><code>.up<code><li><li><code>.down<code><li><li><code>.left<code><li><li><code>.right<code><li><ul><h3 id=\"system-modifier-keys\">系统按键修饰符 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#system-modifier-keys\">​<a><h3><p>你可以使用以下系统按键修饰符来触发鼠标或键盘事件监听器，", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/event-handling.html", "title": "事件处理", "doc_id": "6b5f6666d269449387359e23f1026019", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 709, "chunk_index": 41, "_doc_id": "41_1503041275021494040"}}
{"doc_id": "42_1969555153751387113", "text": "统按键修饰符 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#system-modifier-keys\">​<a><h3><p>你可以使用以下系统按键修饰符来触发鼠标或键盘事件监听器，只有当按键被按下时才会触发。<p><div class=\"tip custom-block\"><p class=\"custom-block-title\">注意<p><p>在 Mac 键盘上，meta 是 Command 键 (⌘)。在 Windows 键盘上，meta 键是 Windows 键 (⊞)。在 Sun 微机系统键盘上，meta 是钻石键 (◆)。在某些键盘上，特别是 MIT 和 Lisp 机器的键盘及其后代版本的键盘，如 Knight 键盘，space-cadet 键盘，meta 都被标记为“META”。在 Symbolics 键盘上，meta 也被标识为“META”或“Meta”。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/event-handling.html", "title": "事件处理", "doc_id": "6b5f6666d269449387359e23f1026019", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 709, "chunk_index": 42, "_doc_id": "42_1969555153751387113"}}
{"doc_id": "43_8603571635273530133", "text": "机器的键盘及其后代版本的键盘，如 Knight 键盘，space-cadet 键盘，meta 都被标记为“META”。在 Symbolics 键盘上，meta 也被标识为“META”或“Meta”。<p><div><p>举例来说：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><!-- Alt + Enter --><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>input<span><span> @<span><span>keyup<span><span>.alt.<span><span>enter<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>clear<span><span>\"<span><span> /><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/event-handling.html", "title": "事件处理", "doc_id": "6b5f6666d269449387359e23f1026019", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 709, "chunk_index": 43, "_doc_id": "43_8603571635273530133"}}
{"doc_id": "44_3778153900786321776", "text": "n>=<span><span>\"<span><span>clear<span><span>\"<span><span> /><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><!-- Ctrl + 点击 --><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>div<span><span> @<span><span>click<span><span>.<span><span>ctrl<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>doSomething<span><span>\"<span><span>>Do something</<span><span>div<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><div class=\"tip custom-block\"><p class=\"custom-block-title\">TIP<p><p>请注意，系统按键修饰符和常规按键不同。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/event-handling.html", "title": "事件处理", "doc_id": "6b5f6666d269449387359e23f1026019", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 709, "chunk_index": 44, "_doc_id": "44_3778153900786321776"}}
{"doc_id": "45_8740288117420565931", "text": "e><pre><div><div class=\"tip custom-block\"><p class=\"custom-block-title\">TIP<p><p>请注意，系统按键修饰符和常规按键不同。与 <code>keyup<code> 事件一起使用时，该按键必须在事件发出时处于按下状态。换句话说，<code>keyup.ctrl<code> 只会在你仍然按住 <code>ctrl<code> 但松开了另一个键时被触发。若你单独松开 <code>ctrl<code> 键将不会触发。<p><div><h3 id=\"exact-modifier\"><code>.exact<code> 修饰符 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#exact-modifier\">​<a><h3><p><code>.exact<code> 修饰符允许精确控制触发事件所需的系统修饰符的组合。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/event-handling.html", "title": "事件处理", "doc_id": "6b5f6666d269449387359e23f1026019", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 709, "chunk_index": 45, "_doc_id": "45_8740288117420565931"}}
{"doc_id": "46_6249912959882939153", "text": "class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#exact-modifier\">​<a><h3><p><code>.exact<code> 修饰符允许精确控制触发事件所需的系统修饰符的组合。<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><!-- 当按下 Ctrl 时，即使同时按下 Alt 或 Shift 也会触发 --><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/event-handling.html", "title": "事件处理", "doc_id": "6b5f6666d269449387359e23f1026019", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 709, "chunk_index": 46, "_doc_id": "46_6249912959882939153"}}
{"doc_id": "47_2770732500258364649", "text": "ark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><!-- 当按下 Ctrl 时，即使同时按下 Alt 或 Shift 也会触发 --><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>button<span><span> @<span><span>click<span><span>.<span><span>ctrl<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>onClick<span><span>\"<span><span>>A</<span><span>button<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><!-- 仅当按下 Ctrl 且未按任何其他键时才会触发 --><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/event-handling.html", "title": "事件处理", "doc_id": "6b5f6666d269449387359e23f1026019", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 709, "chunk_index": 47, "_doc_id": "47_2770732500258364649"}}
{"doc_id": "48_2490619117039505084", "text": "an>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><!-- 仅当按下 Ctrl 且未按任何其他键时才会触发 --><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>button<span><span> @<span><span>click<span><span>.ctrl.<span><span>exact<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>onCtrlClick<span><span>\"<span><span>>A</<span><span>button<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><!-- 仅当没有按下任何系统按键时触发 --><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/event-handling.html", "title": "事件处理", "doc_id": "6b5f6666d269449387359e23f1026019", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 709, "chunk_index": 48, "_doc_id": "48_2490619117039505084"}}
{"doc_id": "49_5929280453634442555", "text": "span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><!-- 仅当没有按下任何系统按键时触发 --><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>button<span><span> @<span><span>click<span><span>.<span><span>exact<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>onClick<span><span>\"<span><span>>A</<span><span>button<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><h2 id=\"mouse-button-modifiers\">鼠标按键修饰符 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#mouse-button-modifiers\">​<a><h2><p>这些修饰符将处理程序限定为由特定鼠标按键触发的事件。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/event-handling.html", "title": "事件处理", "doc_id": "6b5f6666d269449387359e23f1026019", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 709, "chunk_index": 49, "_doc_id": "49_5929280453634442555"}}
{"doc_id": "50_8785278575943738751", "text": "标按键修饰符 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#mouse-button-modifiers\">​<a><h2><p>这些修饰符将处理程序限定为由特定鼠标按键触发的事件。<p><p>但请注意，<code>.left<code>，<code>.right<code> 和 <code>.middle<code> 这些修饰符名称是基于常见的右手用鼠标布局设定的，但实际上它们分别指代设备事件触发器的“主”、“次”，“辅助”，而非实际的物理按键。因此，对于左手用鼠标布局而言，“主”按键在物理上可能是右边的按键，但却会触发 <code>.left<code> 修饰符对应的处理程序。又或者，触控板可能通过单指点击触发 <code>.left<code> 处理程序，通过双指点击触发 <code>.right<code> 处理程序，通过三指点击触发 <code>.middle<code> 处理程序。同样，产生“鼠标”事件的其他设备和事件源，也可能具有与“左”，“右”完全无关的触发模式。<p><div><div>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/event-handling.html", "title": "事件处理", "doc_id": "6b5f6666d269449387359e23f1026019", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 709, "chunk_index": 50, "_doc_id": "50_8785278575943738751"}}
{"doc_id": "0_5709068416316787050", "text": "<div><div><h1 id=\"conditional-rendering\">条件渲染 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#conditional-rendering\">​<a><h1><h2 id=\"v-if\"><code>v-if<code> <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#v-if\">​<a><h2><p><code>v-if<code> 指令用于条件性地渲染一块内容。这块内容只会在指令的表达式返回真值时才被渲染。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/conditional.html", "title": "条件渲染", "doc_id": "fac0275729614cbe8e9991500ca66afb", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 231, "chunk_index": 0, "_doc_id": "0_5709068416316787050"}}
{"doc_id": "1_6077545550877399793", "text": "lass=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#v-if\">​<a><h2><p><code>v-if<code> 指令用于条件性地渲染一块内容。这块内容只会在指令的表达式返回真值时才被渲染。<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>h1<span><span> v-if<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>awesome<span><span>\"<span><span>>Vue is awesome!</<span><span>h1<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><h2 id=\"v-else\"><code>v-else<code> <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#v-else\">​<a><h2><p>你也可以使用 <code>v-else<code> 为 <code>v-if<code> 添加一个“else 区块”。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/conditional.html", "title": "条件渲染", "doc_id": "fac0275729614cbe8e9991500ca66afb", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 231, "chunk_index": 1, "_doc_id": "1_6077545550877399793"}}
{"doc_id": "2_1086228263200433639", "text": "header-anchor\" href=\"#v-else\">​<a><h2><p>你也可以使用 <code>v-else<code> 为 <code>v-if<code> 添加一个“else 区块”。<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>button<span><span> @<span><span>click<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>awesome <span><span>=<span><span> !<span><span>awesome<span><span>\"<span><span>>Toggle</<span><span>button<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/conditional.html", "title": "条件渲染", "doc_id": "fac0275729614cbe8e9991500ca66afb", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 231, "chunk_index": 2, "_doc_id": "2_1086228263200433639"}}
{"doc_id": "3_5463399280063786632", "text": "n><span>\"<span><span>>Toggle</<span><span>button<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>h1<span><span> v-if<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>awesome<span><span>\"<span><span>>Vue is awesome!</<span><span>h1<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/conditional.html", "title": "条件渲染", "doc_id": "fac0275729614cbe8e9991500ca66afb", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 231, "chunk_index": 3, "_doc_id": "3_5463399280063786632"}}
{"doc_id": "4_5036282556521064136", "text": "pan><span>awesome<span><span>\"<span><span>>Vue is awesome!</<span><span>h1<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>h1<span><span> v-else<span><span>>Oh no 😢</<span><span>h1<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p class=\"demo\"> Toggle <h1>Vue is awesome!<h1><p><p>一个 <code>v-else<code> 元素必须跟在一个 <code>v-if<code> 或者 <code>v-else-if<code> 元素后面，否则它将不会被识别。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/conditional.html", "title": "条件渲染", "doc_id": "fac0275729614cbe8e9991500ca66afb", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 231, "chunk_index": 4, "_doc_id": "4_5036282556521064136"}}
{"doc_id": "5_6470065671902392547", "text": "e!<h1><p><p>一个 <code>v-else<code> 元素必须跟在一个 <code>v-if<code> 或者 <code>v-else-if<code> 元素后面，否则它将不会被识别。<p><h2 id=\"v-else-if\"><code>v-else-if<code> <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#v-else-if\">​<a><h2><p>顾名思义，<code>v-else-if<code> 提供的是相应于 <code>v-if<code> 的“else if 区块”。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/conditional.html", "title": "条件渲染", "doc_id": "fac0275729614cbe8e9991500ca66afb", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 231, "chunk_index": 5, "_doc_id": "5_6470065671902392547"}}
{"doc_id": "6_4456437635671843967", "text": "hor\" href=\"#v-else-if\">​<a><h2><p>顾名思义，<code>v-else-if<code> 提供的是相应于 <code>v-if<code> 的“else if 区块”。它可以连续多次重复使用：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>div<span><span> v-if<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>type <span><span>===<span><span> 'A'\"<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> A<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>div<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/conditional.html", "title": "条件渲染", "doc_id": "fac0275729614cbe8e9991500ca66afb", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 231, "chunk_index": 6, "_doc_id": "6_4456437635671843967"}}
{"doc_id": "7_8417354723302496740", "text": "ass=\"line\"><span> A<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>div<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>div<span><span> v-else-if<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>type <span><span>===<span><span> 'B'\"<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> B<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>div<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/conditional.html", "title": "条件渲染", "doc_id": "fac0275729614cbe8e9991500ca66afb", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 231, "chunk_index": 7, "_doc_id": "7_8417354723302496740"}}
{"doc_id": "8_8793500316179075104", "text": "ass=\"line\"><span> B<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>div<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>div<span><span> v-else-if<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>type <span><span>===<span><span> 'C'\"<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> C<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>div<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>div<span><span> v-else<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> Not A/B/C<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/conditional.html", "title": "条件渲染", "doc_id": "fac0275729614cbe8e9991500ca66afb", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 231, "chunk_index": 8, "_doc_id": "8_8793500316179075104"}}
{"doc_id": "9_1198233870396478108", "text": "pan>div<span><span> v-else<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> Not A/B/C<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>div<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>和 <code>v-else<code> 类似，一个使用 <code>v-else-if<code> 的元素必须紧跟在一个 <code>v-if<code> 或一个 <code>v-else-if<code> 元素后面。<p><h2 id=\"v-if-on-template\"><code><template><code> 上的 <code>v-if<code> <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#v-if-on-template\">​<a><h2><p>因为 <code>v-if<code> 是一个指令，他必须依附于某个元素。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/conditional.html", "title": "条件渲染", "doc_id": "fac0275729614cbe8e9991500ca66afb", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 231, "chunk_index": 9, "_doc_id": "9_1198233870396478108"}}
{"doc_id": "10_4238284237479212331", "text": "> <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#v-if-on-template\">​<a><h2><p>因为 <code>v-if<code> 是一个指令，他必须依附于某个元素。但如果我们想要切换不止一个元素呢？在这种情况下我们可以在一个 <code><template><code> 元素上使用 <code>v-if<code>，这只是一个不可见的包装器元素，最后渲染的结果并不会包含这个 <code><template><code> 元素。<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>template<span><span> v-if<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>ok<span><span>\"<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/conditional.html", "title": "条件渲染", "doc_id": "fac0275729614cbe8e9991500ca66afb", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 231, "chunk_index": 10, "_doc_id": "10_4238284237479212331"}}
{"doc_id": "11_4783379719535182023", "text": "late<span><span> v-if<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>ok<span><span>\"<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>h1<span><span>>Title</<span><span>h1<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>p<span><span>>Paragraph 1</<span><span>p<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>p<span><span>>Paragraph 2</<span><span>p<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/conditional.html", "title": "条件渲染", "doc_id": "fac0275729614cbe8e9991500ca66afb", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 231, "chunk_index": 11, "_doc_id": "11_4783379719535182023"}}
{"doc_id": "12_2268172886026471772", "text": "class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>p<span><span>>Paragraph 2</<span><span>p<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p><code>v-else<code> 和 <code>v-else-if<code> 也可以在 <code><template><code> 上使用。<p><h2 id=\"v-show\"><code>v-show<code> <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#v-show\">​<a><h2><p>另一个可以用来按条件显示一个元素的指令是 <code>v-show<code>。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/conditional.html", "title": "条件渲染", "doc_id": "fac0275729614cbe8e9991500ca66afb", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 231, "chunk_index": 12, "_doc_id": "12_2268172886026471772"}}
{"doc_id": "13_7784539620027266283", "text": "ow<code> <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#v-show\">​<a><h2><p>另一个可以用来按条件显示一个元素的指令是 <code>v-show<code>。其用法基本一样：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>h1<span><span> v-show<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>ok<span><span>\"<span><span>>Hello!</<span><span>h1<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>不同之处在于 <code>v-show<code> 会在 DOM 渲染中保留该元素；<code>v-show<code> 仅切换了该元素上名为 <code>display<code> 的 CSS 属性。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/conditional.html", "title": "条件渲染", "doc_id": "fac0275729614cbe8e9991500ca66afb", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 231, "chunk_index": 13, "_doc_id": "13_7784539620027266283"}}
{"doc_id": "14_8492667857483605534", "text": "同之处在于 <code>v-show<code> 会在 DOM 渲染中保留该元素；<code>v-show<code> 仅切换了该元素上名为 <code>display<code> 的 CSS 属性。<p><p><code>v-show<code> 不支持在 <code><template><code> 元素上使用，也不能和 <code>v-else<code> 搭配使用。<p><h2 id=\"v-if-vs-v-show\"><code>v-if<code> vs. <code>v-show<code> <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#v-if-vs-v-show\">​<a><h2><p><code>v-if<code> 是“真实的”按条件渲染，因为它确保了在切换时，条件区块内的事件监听器和子组件都会被销毁与重建。<p><p><code>v-if<code> 也是<strong>惰性<strong>的：如果在初次渲染时条件值为 false，则不会做任何事。条件区块只有当条件首次变为 true 时才被渲染。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/conditional.html", "title": "条件渲染", "doc_id": "fac0275729614cbe8e9991500ca66afb", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 231, "chunk_index": 14, "_doc_id": "14_8492667857483605534"}}
{"doc_id": "15_2906025087616906978", "text": "重建。<p><p><code>v-if<code> 也是<strong>惰性<strong>的：如果在初次渲染时条件值为 false，则不会做任何事。条件区块只有当条件首次变为 true 时才被渲染。<p><p>相比之下，<code>v-show<code> 简单许多，元素无论初始条件如何，始终会被渲染，只有 CSS <code>display<code> 属性会被切换。<p><p>总的来说，<code>v-if<code> 有更高的切换开销，而 <code>v-show<code> 有更高的初始渲染开销。因此，如果需要频繁切换，则使用 <code>v-show<code> 较好；如果在运行时绑定条件很少改变，则 <code>v-if<code> 会更合适。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/conditional.html", "title": "条件渲染", "doc_id": "fac0275729614cbe8e9991500ca66afb", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 231, "chunk_index": 15, "_doc_id": "15_2906025087616906978"}}
{"doc_id": "16_9202055278129823482", "text": "-show<code> 有更高的初始渲染开销。因此，如果需要频繁切换，则使用 <code>v-show<code> 较好；如果在运行时绑定条件很少改变，则 <code>v-if<code> 会更合适。<p><h2 id=\"v-if-with-v-for\"><code>v-if<code> 和 <code>v-for<code> <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#v-if-with-v-for\">​<a><h2><p>当 <code>v-if<code> 和 <code>v-for<code> 同时存在于一个元素上的时候，<code>v-if<code> 会首先被执行。请查看<a href=\"./list.html#v-for-with-v-if\">列表渲染指南<a>获取更多细节。<p><div class=\"warning custom-block\"><p class=\"custom-block-title\">警告<p><p>同时使用 <code>v-if<code> 和 <code>v-for<code> 是<strong>不推荐的<strong>，因为这样二者的优先级不明显。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/conditional.html", "title": "条件渲染", "doc_id": "fac0275729614cbe8e9991500ca66afb", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 231, "chunk_index": 16, "_doc_id": "16_9202055278129823482"}}
{"doc_id": "17_3140912694476409958", "text": "-block-title\">警告<p><p>同时使用 <code>v-if<code> 和 <code>v-for<code> 是<strong>不推荐的<strong>，因为这样二者的优先级不明显。请查看<a href=\"./list.html#v-for-with-v-if\">列表渲染指南<a>获得更多信息。<p><div><div><div>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/conditional.html", "title": "条件渲染", "doc_id": "fac0275729614cbe8e9991500ca66afb", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 231, "chunk_index": 17, "_doc_id": "17_3140912694476409958"}}
{"doc_id": "0_3341087903909421872", "text": "<div><div><h1 id=\"form-input-bindings\">表单输入绑定 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#form-input-bindings\">​<a><h1><p>在前端处理表单时，我们常常需要将表单输入框的内容同步给 JavaScript 中相应的变量。手动连接值绑定和更改事件监听器可能会很麻烦：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>input<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> :<span><span>value<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>text<span><span>\"<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/forms.html", "title": "表单输入绑定", "doc_id": "30a7800a51404e758bc84ac6049ef7aa", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 829, "chunk_index": 0, "_doc_id": "0_3341087903909421872"}}
{"doc_id": "1_3641339052302571928", "text": "\"line\"><span> :<span><span>value<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>text<span><span>\"<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> @<span><span>input<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>event<span><span> =><span><span> text <span><span>=<span><span> event.target.", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/forms.html", "title": "表单输入绑定", "doc_id": "30a7800a51404e758bc84ac6049ef7aa", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 829, "chunk_index": 1, "_doc_id": "1_3641339052302571928"}}
{"doc_id": "2_253875158273147579", "text": "pan><span>\"<span><span>event<span><span> =><span><span> text <span><span>=<span><span> event.target.value<span><span>\"<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p><code>v-model<code> 指令帮我们简化了这一步骤：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>input<span><span> v-model<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>text<span><span>\"<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>另外，<code>v-model<code> 还可以用于各种不同类型的输入，", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/forms.html", "title": "表单输入绑定", "doc_id": "30a7800a51404e758bc84ac6049ef7aa", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 829, "chunk_index": 2, "_doc_id": "2_253875158273147579"}}
{"doc_id": "3_1163447404215918813", "text": ">text<span><span>\"<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>另外，<code>v-model<code> 还可以用于各种不同类型的输入，<code><textarea><code>、<code><select><code> 元素。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/forms.html", "title": "表单输入绑定", "doc_id": "30a7800a51404e758bc84ac6049ef7aa", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 829, "chunk_index": 3, "_doc_id": "3_1163447404215918813"}}
{"doc_id": "4_7380933201847730474", "text": "e><pre><div><p>另外，<code>v-model<code> 还可以用于各种不同类型的输入，<code><textarea><code>、<code><select><code> 元素。它会根据所使用的元素自动使用对应的 DOM 属性和事件组合：<p><ul><li>文本类型的 <code><input><code> 和 <code><textarea><code> 元素会绑定 <code>value<code> property 并侦听 <code>input<code> 事件；<li><li><code><input type=\"checkbox\"><code> 和 <code><input type=\"radio\"><code> 会绑定 <code>checked<code> property 并侦听 <code>change<code> 事件；<li><li><code><select><code> 会绑定 <code>value<code> property 并侦听 <code>change<code> 事件。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/forms.html", "title": "表单输入绑定", "doc_id": "30a7800a51404e758bc84ac6049ef7aa", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 829, "chunk_index": 4, "_doc_id": "4_7380933201847730474"}}
{"doc_id": "5_5440706390359119007", "text": "ange<code> 事件；<li><li><code><select><code> 会绑定 <code>value<code> property 并侦听 <code>change<code> 事件。<li><ul><div class=\"tip custom-block\"><p class=\"custom-block-title\">注意<p><p><code>v-model<code> 会忽略任何表单元素上初始的 <code>value<code>、<code>checked<code> 或 <code>selected<code> attribute。它将始终将当前绑定的 JavaScript 状态视为数据的正确来源。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/forms.html", "title": "表单输入绑定", "doc_id": "30a7800a51404e758bc84ac6049ef7aa", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 829, "chunk_index": 5, "_doc_id": "5_5440706390359119007"}}
{"doc_id": "6_6424024299532887064", "text": ">value<code>、<code>checked<code> 或 <code>selected<code> attribute。它将始终将当前绑定的 JavaScript 状态视为数据的正确来源。你应该在 JavaScript 中使用<span class=\"options-api\"><a href=\"/api/options-state.html#data\"><code>data<code><a> 选项<span><span class=\"composition-api\"><a href=\"/api/reactivity-core.html#reactivity-api-core\">响应式系统的 API<a><span>来声明该初始值。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/forms.html", "title": "表单输入绑定", "doc_id": "30a7800a51404e758bc84ac6049ef7aa", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 829, "chunk_index": 6, "_doc_id": "6_6424024299532887064"}}
{"doc_id": "7_4777991693740135493", "text": "composition-api\"><a href=\"/api/reactivity-core.html#reactivity-api-core\">响应式系统的 API<a><span>来声明该初始值。<p><div><h2 id=\"basic-usage\">基本用法 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#basic-usage\">​<a><h2><h3 id=\"text\">文本 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#text\">​<a><h3><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>p<span><span>>Message is: {{ message }}</<span><span>p<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/forms.html", "title": "表单输入绑定", "doc_id": "30a7800a51404e758bc84ac6049ef7aa", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 829, "chunk_index": 7, "_doc_id": "7_4777991693740135493"}}
{"doc_id": "8_759306434887467502", "text": "><span><<span><span>p<span><span>>Message is: {{ message }}</<span><span>p<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>input<span><span> v-model<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>message<span><span>\"<span><span> placeholder<span><span>=<span><span>\"edit me\"<span><span> /><span><span><code><pre><div><p><span id=\"vmodel-ime-tip\"><span><p><div class=\"tip custom-block\"><p class=\"custom-block-title\">注意<p><p>对于需要使用 <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Input_method\" target=\"_blank\">IME<a> 的语言 (中文，日文和韩文等)，你会发现 <code>v-model<code> 不会在 IME 输入还在拼字阶段时触发更新。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/forms.html", "title": "表单输入绑定", "doc_id": "30a7800a51404e758bc84ac6049ef7aa", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 829, "chunk_index": 8, "_doc_id": "8_759306434887467502"}}
{"doc_id": "9_1322147664109379704", "text": "Input_method\" target=\"_blank\">IME<a> 的语言 (中文，日文和韩文等)，你会发现 <code>v-model<code> 不会在 IME 输入还在拼字阶段时触发更新。如果你的确想在拼字阶段也触发更新，请直接使用自己的 <code>input<code> 事件监听器和 <code>value<code> 绑定而不要使用 <code>v-model<code>。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/forms.html", "title": "表单输入绑定", "doc_id": "30a7800a51404e758bc84ac6049ef7aa", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 829, "chunk_index": 9, "_doc_id": "9_1322147664109379704"}}
{"doc_id": "10_6324349659645685497", "text": "更新。如果你的确想在拼字阶段也触发更新，请直接使用自己的 <code>input<code> 事件监听器和 <code>value<code> 绑定而不要使用 <code>v-model<code>。<p><div><h3 id=\"multiline-text\">多行文本 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#multiline-text\">​<a><h3><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>span<span><span>>Multiline message is:</<span><span>span<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/forms.html", "title": "表单输入绑定", "doc_id": "30a7800a51404e758bc84ac6049ef7aa", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 829, "chunk_index": 10, "_doc_id": "10_6324349659645685497"}}
{"doc_id": "11_8910197174079951738", "text": "span><<span><span>span<span><span>>Multiline message is:</<span><span>span<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>p<span><span> style<span><span>=<span><span>\"white-space: pre-line;\"<span><span>>{{ message }}</<span><span>p<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/forms.html", "title": "表单输入绑定", "doc_id": "30a7800a51404e758bc84ac6049ef7aa", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 829, "chunk_index": 11, "_doc_id": "11_8910197174079951738"}}
{"doc_id": "12_123509372482692920", "text": "an><span>\"white-space: pre-line;\"<span><span>>{{ message }}</<span><span>p<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>textarea<span><span> v-model<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>message<span><span>\"<span><span> placeholder<span><span>=<span><span>\"add multiple lines\"<span><span>></<span><span>textarea<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>注意在 <code><textarea><code> 中是不支持插值表达式的。请使用 <code>v-model<code> 来替代：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><!-- 错误 --><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/forms.html", "title": "表单输入绑定", "doc_id": "30a7800a51404e758bc84ac6049ef7aa", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 829, "chunk_index": 12, "_doc_id": "12_123509372482692920"}}
{"doc_id": "13_2794453302303288055", "text": "<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><!-- 错误 --><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>textarea<span><span>>{{ text }}</<span><span>textarea<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><!-- 正确 --><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/forms.html", "title": "表单输入绑定", "doc_id": "30a7800a51404e758bc84ac6049ef7aa", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 829, "chunk_index": 13, "_doc_id": "13_2794453302303288055"}}
