{"doc_id": "30_3321598845804203235", "text": "><span> v-model<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>picked<span><span>\"<span><span> /><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>label<span><span> for<span><span>=<span><span>\"two\"<span><span>>Two</<span><span>label<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><h3 id=\"select\">选择器 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#select\">​<a><h3><p>单个选择器的示例如下：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>div<span><span>>Selected: {{ selected }}</<span><span>div<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/forms.html", "title": "表单输入绑定", "doc_id": "30a7800a51404e758bc84ac6049ef7aa", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 829, "chunk_index": 30, "_doc_id": "30_3321598845804203235"}}
