{"doc_id": "32_743078491789175591", "text": "an><span>=<span><span>\"\"<span><span>>Please select one</<span><span>option<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>option<span><span>>A</<span><span>option<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>option<span><span>>B</<span><span>option<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>option<span><span>>C</<span><span>option<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/forms.html", "title": "表单输入绑定", "doc_id": "30a7800a51404e758bc84ac6049ef7aa", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 829, "chunk_index": 32, "_doc_id": "32_743078491789175591"}}
{"doc_id": "33_8432758070995471387", "text": "class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>option<span><span>>C</<span><span>option<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>select<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><div class=\"demo\"><p>Selected: <p> Please select one A B C <div><div class=\"tip custom-block\"><p class=\"custom-block-title\">注意<p><p>如果 <code>v-model<code> 表达式的初始值不匹配任何一个选择项，<code><select><code> 元素会渲染成一个“未选择”的状态。在 iOS 上，这将导致用户无法选择第一项，因为 iOS 在这种情况下不会触发一个 change 事件。因此，我们建议提供一个空值的禁用选项，如上面的例子所示。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/forms.html", "title": "表单输入绑定", "doc_id": "30a7800a51404e758bc84ac6049ef7aa", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 829, "chunk_index": 33, "_doc_id": "33_8432758070995471387"}}
{"doc_id": "34_650154488897221132", "text": "e> 元素会渲染成一个“未选择”的状态。在 iOS 上，这将导致用户无法选择第一项，因为 iOS 在这种情况下不会触发一个 change 事件。因此，我们建议提供一个空值的禁用选项，如上面的例子所示。<p><div><p>多选 (值绑定到一个数组)：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>div<span><span>>Selected: {{ selected }}</<span><span>div<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/forms.html", "title": "表单输入绑定", "doc_id": "30a7800a51404e758bc84ac6049ef7aa", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 829, "chunk_index": 34, "_doc_id": "34_650154488897221132"}}
