{"doc_id": "37_7069260846486435994", "text": "class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>option<span><span>>C</<span><span>option<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>select<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>选择器的选项可以使用 <code>v-for<code> 动态渲染：<p><div class=\"composition-api\"><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> selected<span><span> =<span><span> ref<span><span>(<span><span>'A'<span><span>)<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/forms.html", "title": "表单输入绑定", "doc_id": "30a7800a51404e758bc84ac6049ef7aa", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 829, "chunk_index": 37, "_doc_id": "37_7069260846486435994"}}
{"doc_id": "38_6950026605262869958", "text": "><span> selected<span><span> =<span><span> ref<span><span>(<span><span>'A'<span><span>)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> options<span><span> =<span><span> ref<span><span>([<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> { text: <span><span>'One'<span><span>, value: <span><span>'A'<span><span> },<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> { text: <span><span>'Two'<span><span>, value: <span><span>'B'<span><span> },<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/forms.html", "title": "表单输入绑定", "doc_id": "30a7800a51404e758bc84ac6049ef7aa", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 829, "chunk_index": 38, "_doc_id": "38_6950026605262869958"}}
{"doc_id": "39_9176076690874222921", "text": "ne\"><span> { text: <span><span>'Two'<span><span>, value: <span><span>'B'<span><span> },<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> { text: <span><span>'Three'<span><span>, value: <span><span>'C'<span><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>])<span><span><code><pre><div><div><div class=\"options-api\"><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/forms.html", "title": "表单输入绑定", "doc_id": "30a7800a51404e758bc84ac6049ef7aa", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 829, "chunk_index": 39, "_doc_id": "39_9176076690874222921"}}
{"doc_id": "40_3144969331778783017", "text": "b-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> data<span><span>() {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> return<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> selected: <span><span>'A'<span><span>,<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> options: [<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> { text: <span><span>'One'<span><span>, value: <span><span>'A'<span><span> },<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/forms.html", "title": "表单输入绑定", "doc_id": "30a7800a51404e758bc84ac6049ef7aa", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 829, "chunk_index": 40, "_doc_id": "40_3144969331778783017"}}
{"doc_id": "41_4661571960629542809", "text": "ne\"><span> { text: <span><span>'One'<span><span>, value: <span><span>'A'<span><span> },<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> { text: <span><span>'Two'<span><span>, value: <span><span>'B'<span><span> },<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> { text: <span><span>'Three'<span><span>, value: <span><span>'C'<span><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> ]<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/forms.html", "title": "表单输入绑定", "doc_id": "30a7800a51404e758bc84ac6049ef7aa", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 829, "chunk_index": 41, "_doc_id": "41_4661571960629542809"}}
{"doc_id": "42_44344638928604641", "text": "span> ]<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span><code><pre><div><div><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>div<span><span>>Selected: {{ selected }}</<span><span>div<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/forms.html", "title": "表单输入绑定", "doc_id": "30a7800a51404e758bc84ac6049ef7aa", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 829, "chunk_index": 42, "_doc_id": "42_44344638928604641"}}
{"doc_id": "43_6966802927717523347", "text": "<span>>Selected: {{ selected }}</<span><span>div<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>select<span><span> v-model<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>selected<span><span>\"<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/forms.html", "title": "表单输入绑定", "doc_id": "30a7800a51404e758bc84ac6049ef7aa", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 829, "chunk_index": 43, "_doc_id": "43_6966802927717523347"}}
{"doc_id": "44_2160236185762131872", "text": "><span> v-model<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>selected<span><span>\"<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>option<span><span> v-for<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>option <span><span>in<span><span> options<span><span>\"<span><span> :<span><span>value<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>option.value<span><span>\"<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> {{ option.text }}<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> </<span><span>option<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/forms.html", "title": "表单输入绑定", "doc_id": "30a7800a51404e758bc84ac6049ef7aa", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 829, "chunk_index": 44, "_doc_id": "44_2160236185762131872"}}
{"doc_id": "45_4625663533342611307", "text": "option.text }}<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> </<span><span>option<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>select<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><h2 id=\"value-bindings\">值绑定 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#value-bindings\">​<a><h2><p>对于单选按钮，复选框和选择器选项，<code>v-model<code> 绑定的值通常是静态的字符串 (或者对复选框是布尔值)：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><!-- `picked` 在被选择时是字符串 \"a\" --><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/forms.html", "title": "表单输入绑定", "doc_id": "30a7800a51404e758bc84ac6049ef7aa", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 829, "chunk_index": 45, "_doc_id": "45_4625663533342611307"}}
{"doc_id": "46_1491958996088587702", "text": "iki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><!-- `picked` 在被选择时是字符串 \"a\" --><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>input<span><span> type<span><span>=<span><span>\"radio\"<span><span> v-model<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>picked<span><span>\"<span><span> value<span><span>=<span><span>\"a\"<span><span> /><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><!-- `toggle` 只会为 true 或 false --><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/forms.html", "title": "表单输入绑定", "doc_id": "30a7800a51404e758bc84ac6049ef7aa", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 829, "chunk_index": 46, "_doc_id": "46_1491958996088587702"}}
{"doc_id": "47_1599337092932424995", "text": ">\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><!-- `toggle` 只会为 true 或 false --><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>input<span><span> type<span><span>=<span><span>\"checkbox\"<span><span> v-model<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>toggle<span><span>\"<span><span> /><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><!-- `selected` 在第一项被选中时为字符串 \"abc\" --><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/forms.html", "title": "表单输入绑定", "doc_id": "30a7800a51404e758bc84ac6049ef7aa", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 829, "chunk_index": 47, "_doc_id": "47_1599337092932424995"}}
{"doc_id": "48_4516899933937185165", "text": "pan class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><!-- `selected` 在第一项被选中时为字符串 \"abc\" --><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>select<span><span> v-model<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>selected<span><span>\"<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>option<span><span> value<span><span>=<span><span>\"abc\"<span><span>>ABC</<span><span>option<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/forms.html", "title": "表单输入绑定", "doc_id": "30a7800a51404e758bc84ac6049ef7aa", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 829, "chunk_index": 48, "_doc_id": "48_4516899933937185165"}}
{"doc_id": "49_4804816261872586231", "text": "n> value<span><span>=<span><span>\"abc\"<span><span>>ABC</<span><span>option<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>select<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>但有时我们可能希望将该值绑定到当前组件实例上的动态数据。这可以通过使用 <code>v-bind<code> 来实现。此外，使用 <code>v-bind<code> 还使我们可以将选项值绑定为非字符串的数据类型。<p><h3 id=\"checkbox-1\">复选框 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#checkbox-1\">​<a><h3><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>input<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/forms.html", "title": "表单输入绑定", "doc_id": "30a7800a51404e758bc84ac6049ef7aa", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 829, "chunk_index": 49, "_doc_id": "49_4804816261872586231"}}
{"doc_id": "50_5872471772621411940", "text": "pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>input<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> type<span><span>=<span><span>\"checkbox\"<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> v-model<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>toggle<span><span>\"<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> true-value<span><span>=<span><span>\"yes\"<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/forms.html", "title": "表单输入绑定", "doc_id": "30a7800a51404e758bc84ac6049ef7aa", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 829, "chunk_index": 50, "_doc_id": "50_5872471772621411940"}}
{"doc_id": "51_9038177686909214517", "text": "><span>\"<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> true-value<span><span>=<span><span>\"yes\"<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> false-value<span><span>=<span><span>\"no\"<span><span> /><span><span><code><pre><div><p><code>true-value<code> 和 <code>false-value<code> 是 Vue 特有的 attributes，仅支持和 <code>v-model<code> 配套使用。这里 <code>toggle<code> 属性的值会在选中时被设为 <code>'yes'<code>，取消选择时设为 <code>'no'<code>。你同样可以通过 <code>v-bind<code> 将其绑定为其他动态值：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>input<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/forms.html", "title": "表单输入绑定", "doc_id": "30a7800a51404e758bc84ac6049ef7aa", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 829, "chunk_index": 51, "_doc_id": "51_9038177686909214517"}}
{"doc_id": "52_8243531881666867414", "text": "pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>input<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> type<span><span>=<span><span>\"checkbox\"<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> v-model<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>toggle<span><span>\"<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> :<span><span>true-value<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>dynamicTrueValue<span><span>\"<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/forms.html", "title": "表单输入绑定", "doc_id": "30a7800a51404e758bc84ac6049ef7aa", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 829, "chunk_index": 52, "_doc_id": "52_8243531881666867414"}}
{"doc_id": "53_8392675714700886106", "text": "pan><span>true-value<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>dynamicTrueValue<span><span>\"<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> :<span><span>false-value<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>dynamicFalseValue<span><span>\"<span><span> /><span><span><code><pre><div><div class=\"tip custom-block\"><p class=\"custom-block-title\">提示<p><p><code>true-value<code> 和 <code>false-value<code> attributes 不会影响 <code>value<code> attribute，因为浏览器在表单提交时，并不会包含未选择的复选框。为了保证这两个值 (例如：“yes”和“no”) 的其中之一被表单提交，请使用单选按钮作为替代。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/forms.html", "title": "表单输入绑定", "doc_id": "30a7800a51404e758bc84ac6049ef7aa", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 829, "chunk_index": 53, "_doc_id": "53_8392675714700886106"}}
{"doc_id": "54_8599543601462879905", "text": "code>value<code> attribute，因为浏览器在表单提交时，并不会包含未选择的复选框。为了保证这两个值 (例如：“yes”和“no”) 的其中之一被表单提交，请使用单选按钮作为替代。<p><div><h3 id=\"radio-1\">单选按钮 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#radio-1\">​<a><h3><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>input<span><span> type<span><span>=<span><span>\"radio\"<span><span> v-model<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>pick<span><span>\"<span><span> :<span><span>value<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>first<span><span>\"<span><span> /><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/forms.html", "title": "表单输入绑定", "doc_id": "30a7800a51404e758bc84ac6049ef7aa", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 829, "chunk_index": 54, "_doc_id": "54_8599543601462879905"}}
{"doc_id": "55_8852398809463960548", "text": "span><span>value<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>first<span><span>\"<span><span> /><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>input<span><span> type<span><span>=<span><span>\"radio\"<span><span> v-model<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>pick<span><span>\"<span><span> :<span><span>value<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>second<span><span>\"<span><span> /><span><span><code><pre><div><p><code>pick<code> 会在第一个按钮选中时被设为 <code>first<code>，在第二个按钮选中时被设为 <code>second<code>。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/forms.html", "title": "表单输入绑定", "doc_id": "30a7800a51404e758bc84ac6049ef7aa", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 829, "chunk_index": 55, "_doc_id": "55_8852398809463960548"}}
{"doc_id": "56_6837825606629661804", "text": "<code><pre><div><p><code>pick<code> 会在第一个按钮选中时被设为 <code>first<code>，在第二个按钮选中时被设为 <code>second<code>。<p><h3 id=\"select-options-2\">选择器选项 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#select-options-2\">​<a><h3><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>select<span><span> v-model<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>selected<span><span>\"<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <!-- 内联对象字面量 --><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/forms.html", "title": "表单输入绑定", "doc_id": "30a7800a51404e758bc84ac6049ef7aa", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 829, "chunk_index": 56, "_doc_id": "56_6837825606629661804"}}
{"doc_id": "57_4187504005458726436", "text": "lected<span><span>\"<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <!-- 内联对象字面量 --><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>option<span><span> :<span><span>value<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>{ number: <span><span>123<span><span> }<span><span>\"<span><span>>123</<span><span>option<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/forms.html", "title": "表单输入绑定", "doc_id": "30a7800a51404e758bc84ac6049ef7aa", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 829, "chunk_index": 57, "_doc_id": "57_4187504005458726436"}}
{"doc_id": "58_4363163013300137991", "text": "n><span>123<span><span> }<span><span>\"<span><span>>123</<span><span>option<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>select<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p><code>v-model<code> 同样也支持非字符串类型的值绑定！在上面这个例子中，当某个选项被选中，<code>selected<code> 会被设为该对象字面量值 <code>{ number: 123 }<code>。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/forms.html", "title": "表单输入绑定", "doc_id": "30a7800a51404e758bc84ac6049ef7aa", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 829, "chunk_index": 58, "_doc_id": "58_4363163013300137991"}}
{"doc_id": "59_9222603496018571749", "text": "ode> 同样也支持非字符串类型的值绑定！在上面这个例子中，当某个选项被选中，<code>selected<code> 会被设为该对象字面量值 <code>{ number: 123 }<code>。<p><h2 id=\"modifiers\">修饰符 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#modifiers\">​<a><h2><h3 id=\"lazy\"><code>.lazy<code> <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#lazy\">​<a><h3><p>默认情况下，<code>v-model<code> 会在每次 <code>input<code> 事件后更新数据 (<a href=\"#vmodel-ime-tip\">IME 拼字阶段的状态<a>例外)。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/forms.html", "title": "表单输入绑定", "doc_id": "30a7800a51404e758bc84ac6049ef7aa", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 829, "chunk_index": 59, "_doc_id": "59_9222603496018571749"}}
{"doc_id": "60_9023995752819755318", "text": "情况下，<code>v-model<code> 会在每次 <code>input<code> 事件后更新数据 (<a href=\"#vmodel-ime-tip\">IME 拼字阶段的状态<a>例外)。你可以添加 <code>lazy<code> 修饰符来改为在每次 <code>change<code> 事件后更新数据：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><!-- 在 \"change\" 事件后同步更新而不是 \"input\" --><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/forms.html", "title": "表单输入绑定", "doc_id": "30a7800a51404e758bc84ac6049ef7aa", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 829, "chunk_index": 60, "_doc_id": "60_9023995752819755318"}}
{"doc_id": "61_5916603584711563678", "text": "hub-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><!-- 在 \"change\" 事件后同步更新而不是 \"input\" --><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>input<span><span> v-model<span><span>.<span><span>lazy<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>msg<span><span>\"<span><span> /><span><span><code><pre><div><h3 id=\"number\"><code>.number<code> <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#number\">​<a><h3><p>如果你想让用户输入自动转换为数字，", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/forms.html", "title": "表单输入绑定", "doc_id": "30a7800a51404e758bc84ac6049ef7aa", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 829, "chunk_index": 61, "_doc_id": "61_5916603584711563678"}}
{"doc_id": "62_1225263467570232425", "text": "id=\"number\"><code>.number<code> <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#number\">​<a><h3><p>如果你想让用户输入自动转换为数字，你可以在 <code>v-model<code> 后添加 <code>.number<code> 修饰符来管理输入：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>input<span><span> v-model<span><span>.<span><span>number<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>age<span><span>\"<span><span> /><span><span><code><pre><div><p>如果该值无法被 <code>parseFloat()<code> 处理，那么将返回原始值。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/forms.html", "title": "表单输入绑定", "doc_id": "30a7800a51404e758bc84ac6049ef7aa", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 829, "chunk_index": 62, "_doc_id": "62_1225263467570232425"}}
{"doc_id": "63_6944292010025734005", "text": "n><span>\"<span><span> /><span><span><code><pre><div><p>如果该值无法被 <code>parseFloat()<code> 处理，那么将返回原始值。特别是当输入为空时 (例如用户清空输入字段之后)，会返回一个空字符串。这种行为与 <a href=\"https://developer.mozilla.org/zh-CN/docs/Web/API/HTMLInputElement#valueasnumber\" target=\"_blank\">DOM 属性 valueAsNumber<a> 有所不同。<p><p><code>number<code> 修饰符会在输入框有 <code>type=\"number\"<code> 时自动启用。<p><h3 id=\"trim\"><code>.trim<code> <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#trim\">​<a><h3><p>如果你想要默认自动去除用户输入内容中两端的空格，", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/forms.html", "title": "表单输入绑定", "doc_id": "30a7800a51404e758bc84ac6049ef7aa", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 829, "chunk_index": 63, "_doc_id": "63_6944292010025734005"}}
{"doc_id": "64_1761929301982348985", "text": "d=\"trim\"><code>.trim<code> <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#trim\">​<a><h3><p>如果你想要默认自动去除用户输入内容中两端的空格，你可以在 <code>v-model<code> 后添加 <code>.trim<code> 修饰符：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>input<span><span> v-model<span><span>.<span><span>trim<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>msg<span><span>\"<span><span> /><span><span><code><pre><div><h2 id=\"v-model-with-components\">组件上的 <code>v-model<code> <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#v-model-with-components\">​<a><h2><blockquote><p>如果你还不熟悉 Vue 的组件，", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/forms.html", "title": "表单输入绑定", "doc_id": "30a7800a51404e758bc84ac6049ef7aa", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 829, "chunk_index": 64, "_doc_id": "64_1761929301982348985"}}
{"doc_id": "65_4759932296835725111", "text": "de> <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#v-model-with-components\">​<a><h2><blockquote><p>如果你还不熟悉 Vue 的组件，那么现在可以跳过这个部分。<p><blockquote><p>HTML 的内置表单输入类型并不总能满足所有需求。幸运的是，我们可以使用 Vue 构建具有自定义行为的可复用输入组件，并且这些输入组件也支持 <code>v-model<code>！要了解更多关于此的内容，请在组件指引中阅读<a href=\"/guide/components/v-model.html\">配合 <code>v-model<code> 使用<a>。<p><div><div>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/forms.html", "title": "表单输入绑定", "doc_id": "30a7800a51404e758bc84ac6049ef7aa", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 829, "chunk_index": 65, "_doc_id": "65_4759932296835725111"}}
{"doc_id": "0_7947830250089872336", "text": "<div><div><h1 id=\"component-events\">组件事件 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#component-events\">​<a><h1><blockquote><p>此章节假设你已经看过了<a href=\"/guide/essentials/component-basics.html\">组件基础<a>。若你还不了解组件是什么，请先阅读该章节。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/events.html", "title": "组件事件", "doc_id": "e211b1ec7d884200b02a51c101e6bffa", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 701, "chunk_index": 0, "_doc_id": "0_7947830250089872336"}}
{"doc_id": "1_1925715789069984435", "text": "ckquote><p>此章节假设你已经看过了<a href=\"/guide/essentials/component-basics.html\">组件基础<a>。若你还不了解组件是什么，请先阅读该章节。<p><blockquote><h2 id=\"emitting-and-listening-to-events\">触发与监听事件 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#emitting-and-listening-to-events\">​<a><h2><p>在组件的模板表达式中，可以直接使用 <code>$emit<code> 方法触发自定义事件 (例如：在 <code>v-on<code> 的处理函数中)：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><!-- MyComponent --><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/events.html", "title": "组件事件", "doc_id": "e211b1ec7d884200b02a51c101e6bffa", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 701, "chunk_index": 1, "_doc_id": "1_1925715789069984435"}}
{"doc_id": "2_4863483707954186379", "text": "e class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><!-- MyComponent --><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>button<span><span> @<span><span>click<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>$emit<span><span>(<span><span>'someEvent'<span><span>)<span><span>\"<span><span>>Click Me</<span><span>button<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><div class=\"options-api\"><p><code>$emit()<code> 方法在组件实例上也同样以 <code>this.", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/events.html", "title": "组件事件", "doc_id": "e211b1ec7d884200b02a51c101e6bffa", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 701, "chunk_index": 2, "_doc_id": "2_4863483707954186379"}}
{"doc_id": "3_5415907077960514517", "text": "<span><span><code><pre><div><div class=\"options-api\"><p><code>$emit()<code> 方法在组件实例上也同样以 <code>this.$emit()<code> 的形式可用：<p><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> methods: {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> submit<span><span>() {<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/events.html", "title": "组件事件", "doc_id": "e211b1ec7d884200b02a51c101e6bffa", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 701, "chunk_index": 3, "_doc_id": "3_5415907077960514517"}}
{"doc_id": "4_7622821171873088149", "text": "s=\"line\"><span> methods: {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> submit<span><span>() {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> this<span><span>.<span><span>$emit<span><span>(<span><span>'someEvent'<span><span>)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/events.html", "title": "组件事件", "doc_id": "e211b1ec7d884200b02a51c101e6bffa", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 701, "chunk_index": 4, "_doc_id": "4_7622821171873088149"}}
{"doc_id": "5_145154535991486513", "text": "<span>)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span><code><pre><div><div><p>父组件可以通过 <code>v-on<code> (缩写为 <code>@<code>) 来监听事件：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>MyComponent<span><span> @<span><span>some-event<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>callback<span><span>\"<span><span> /><span><span><code><pre><div><p>同样，", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/events.html", "title": "组件事件", "doc_id": "e211b1ec7d884200b02a51c101e6bffa", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 701, "chunk_index": 5, "_doc_id": "5_145154535991486513"}}
{"doc_id": "6_7978789133694273960", "text": "pan>=<span><span>\"<span><span>callback<span><span>\"<span><span> /><span><span><code><pre><div><p>同样，组件的事件监听器也支持 <code>.once<code> 修饰符：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>MyComponent<span><span> @<span><span>some-event<span><span>.<span><span>once<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>callback<span><span>\"<span><span> /><span><span><code><pre><div><p>像组件与 prop 一样，事件的名字也提供了自动的格式转换。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/events.html", "title": "组件事件", "doc_id": "e211b1ec7d884200b02a51c101e6bffa", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 701, "chunk_index": 6, "_doc_id": "6_7978789133694273960"}}
{"doc_id": "7_8253050367132744660", "text": "an>callback<span><span>\"<span><span> /><span><span><code><pre><div><p>像组件与 prop 一样，事件的名字也提供了自动的格式转换。注意这里我们触发了一个以 camelCase 形式命名的事件，但在父组件中可以使用 kebab-case 形式来监听。与 <a href=\"/guide/components/props.html#prop-name-casing\">prop 大小写格式<a>一样，在模板中我们也推荐使用 kebab-case 形式来编写监听器。<p><div class=\"tip custom-block\"><p class=\"custom-block-title\">TIP<p><p>和原生 DOM 事件不一样，组件触发的事件<strong>没有冒泡机制<strong>。你只能监听直接子组件触发的事件。平级组件或是跨越多层嵌套的组件间通信，应使用一个外部的事件总线，或是使用一个<a href=\"/guide/scaling-up/state-management.html\">全局状态管理方案<a>。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/events.html", "title": "组件事件", "doc_id": "e211b1ec7d884200b02a51c101e6bffa", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 701, "chunk_index": 7, "_doc_id": "7_8253050367132744660"}}
{"doc_id": "8_7373248019745001912", "text": "平级组件或是跨越多层嵌套的组件间通信，应使用一个外部的事件总线，或是使用一个<a href=\"/guide/scaling-up/state-management.html\">全局状态管理方案<a>。<p><div><h2 id=\"event-arguments\">事件参数 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#event-arguments\">​<a><h2><p>有时候我们会需要在触发事件时附带一个特定的值。举例来说，我们想要 <code><BlogPost><code> 组件来管理文本会缩放得多大。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/events.html", "title": "组件事件", "doc_id": "e211b1ec7d884200b02a51c101e6bffa", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 701, "chunk_index": 8, "_doc_id": "8_7373248019745001912"}}
{"doc_id": "9_12775550530783540", "text": "\"#event-arguments\">​<a><h2><p>有时候我们会需要在触发事件时附带一个特定的值。举例来说，我们想要 <code><BlogPost><code> 组件来管理文本会缩放得多大。在这个场景下，我们可以给 <code>$emit<code> 提供一个额外的参数：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>button<span><span> @<span><span>click<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>$emit<span><span>(<span><span>'increaseBy'<span><span>, <span><span>1<span><span>)<span><span>\"<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/events.html", "title": "组件事件", "doc_id": "e211b1ec7d884200b02a51c101e6bffa", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 701, "chunk_index": 9, "_doc_id": "9_12775550530783540"}}
{"doc_id": "10_2227048413351762146", "text": "an><span>'increaseBy'<span><span>, <span><span>1<span><span>)<span><span>\"<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> Increase by 1<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>button<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>然后我们在父组件中监听事件，我们可以先简单写一个内联的箭头函数作为监听器，", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/events.html", "title": "组件事件", "doc_id": "e211b1ec7d884200b02a51c101e6bffa", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 701, "chunk_index": 10, "_doc_id": "10_2227048413351762146"}}
{"doc_id": "11_5357161121192202842", "text": "/<span><span>button<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>然后我们在父组件中监听事件，我们可以先简单写一个内联的箭头函数作为监听器，此函数会接收到事件附带的参数：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>MyButton<span><span> @<span><span>increase-by<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>(<span><span>n<span><span>) <span><span>=><span><span> count <span><span>+=<span><span> n<span><span>\"<span><span> /><span><span><code><pre><div><p>或者，", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/events.html", "title": "组件事件", "doc_id": "e211b1ec7d884200b02a51c101e6bffa", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 701, "chunk_index": 11, "_doc_id": "11_5357161121192202842"}}
{"doc_id": "12_5537785689500618589", "text": "an> count <span><span>+=<span><span> n<span><span>\"<span><span> /><span><span><code><pre><div><p>或者，也可以用一个组件方法来作为事件处理函数：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>MyButton<span><span> @<span><span>increase-by<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>increaseCount<span><span>\"<span><span> /><span><span><code><pre><div><p>该方法也会接收到事件所传递的参数：<p><div class=\"options-api\"><div class=\"language-js\"> <span", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/events.html", "title": "组件事件", "doc_id": "e211b1ec7d884200b02a51c101e6bffa", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 701, "chunk_index": 12, "_doc_id": "12_5537785689500618589"}}
{"doc_id": "13_4648013114658377461", "text": "pan><code><pre><div><p>该方法也会接收到事件所传递的参数：<p><div class=\"options-api\"><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>methods<span><span>: {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> increaseCount<span><span>(n) {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> this<span><span>.count <span><span>+=<span><span> n<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/events.html", "title": "组件事件", "doc_id": "e211b1ec7d884200b02a51c101e6bffa", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 701, "chunk_index": 13, "_doc_id": "13_4648013114658377461"}}
{"doc_id": "14_1220008093612350568", "text": "<span><span>.count <span><span>+=<span><span> n<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span><code><pre><div><div><div class=\"composition-api\"><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>function<span><span> increaseCount<span><span>(<span><span>n<span><span>) {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> count.value <span><span>+=<span><span> n<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/events.html", "title": "组件事件", "doc_id": "e211b1ec7d884200b02a51c101e6bffa", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 701, "chunk_index": 14, "_doc_id": "14_1220008093612350568"}}
{"doc_id": "15_2052206382301511491", "text": "span>) {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> count.value <span><span>+=<span><span> n<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span><code><pre><div><div><div class=\"tip custom-block\"><p class=\"custom-block-title\">TIP<p><p>所有传入 <code>$emit()<code> 的额外参数都会被直接传向监听器。举例来说，<code>$emit('foo', 1, 2, 3)<code> 触发后，监听器函数将会收到这三个参数值。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/events.html", "title": "组件事件", "doc_id": "e211b1ec7d884200b02a51c101e6bffa", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 701, "chunk_index": 15, "_doc_id": "15_2052206382301511491"}}
{"doc_id": "16_1609338186950525833", "text": "所有传入 <code>$emit()<code> 的额外参数都会被直接传向监听器。举例来说，<code>$emit('foo', 1, 2, 3)<code> 触发后，监听器函数将会收到这三个参数值。<p><div><h2 id=\"declaring-emitted-events\">声明触发的事件 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#declaring-emitted-events\">​<a><h2><p>组件可以显式地通过 <span class=\"composition-api\"><a href=\"/api/sfc-script-setup.html#defineprops-defineemits\"><code>defineEmits()<code><a> 宏<span><span class=\"options-api\"><a href=\"/api/options-state.", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/events.html", "title": "组件事件", "doc_id": "e211b1ec7d884200b02a51c101e6bffa", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 701, "chunk_index": 16, "_doc_id": "16_1609338186950525833"}}
{"doc_id": "17_4545276332320757040", "text": "ineemits\"><code>defineEmits()<code><a> 宏<span><span class=\"options-api\"><a href=\"/api/options-state.html#emits\"><code>emits<code><a> 选项<span>来声明它要触发的事件：<p><div class=\"composition-api\"><div class=\"language-vue\"> <span class=\"lang\">vue<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>script<span><span> setup<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>defineEmits<span><span>([<span><span>'inFocus'<span><span>, <span><span>'submit'<span><span>])<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/events.html", "title": "组件事件", "doc_id": "e211b1ec7d884200b02a51c101e6bffa", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 701, "chunk_index": 17, "_doc_id": "17_4545276332320757040"}}
{"doc_id": "18_2214634513545731065", "text": "mits<span><span>([<span><span>'inFocus'<span><span>, <span><span>'submit'<span><span>])<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>script<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>我们在 <code><template><code> 中使用的 <code>$emit<code> 方法不能在组件的 <code><script setup><code> 部分中使用，但 <code>defineEmits()<code> 会返回一个相同作用的函数供我们使用：<p><div class=\"language-vue\"> <span class=\"lang\">vue<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>script<span><span> setup<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/events.html", "title": "组件事件", "doc_id": "e211b1ec7d884200b02a51c101e6bffa", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 701, "chunk_index": 18, "_doc_id": "18_2214634513545731065"}}
{"doc_id": "19_6001830829379809830", "text": "code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>script<span><span> setup<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> emit<span><span> =<span><span> defineEmits<span><span>([<span><span>'inFocus'<span><span>, <span><span>'submit'<span><span>])<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>function<span><span> buttonClick<span><span>() {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> emit<span><span>(<span><span>'submit'<span><span>)<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/events.html", "title": "组件事件", "doc_id": "e211b1ec7d884200b02a51c101e6bffa", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 701, "chunk_index": 19, "_doc_id": "19_6001830829379809830"}}
{"doc_id": "20_875866210064375680", "text": "pan><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> emit<span><span>(<span><span>'submit'<span><span>)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>script<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p><code>defineEmits()<code> 宏<strong>不能<strong>在子函数中使用。如上所示，它必须直接放置在 <code><script setup><code> 的顶级作用域下。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/events.html", "title": "组件事件", "doc_id": "e211b1ec7d884200b02a51c101e6bffa", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 701, "chunk_index": 20, "_doc_id": "20_875866210064375680"}}
{"doc_id": "21_734417910248621867", "text": "ode>defineEmits()<code> 宏<strong>不能<strong>在子函数中使用。如上所示，它必须直接放置在 <code><script setup><code> 的顶级作用域下。<p><p>如果你显式地使用了 <code>setup<code> 函数而不是 <code><script setup><code>，则事件需要通过 <a href=\"/api/options-state.html#emits\"><code>emits<code><a> 选项来定义，<code>emit<code> 函数也被暴露在 <code>setup()<code> 的上下文对象上：<p><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/events.html", "title": "组件事件", "doc_id": "e211b1ec7d884200b02a51c101e6bffa", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 701, "chunk_index": 21, "_doc_id": "21_734417910248621867"}}
{"doc_id": "22_6950238574499859797", "text": "b-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> emits: [<span><span>'inFocus'<span><span>, <span><span>'submit'<span><span>],<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> setup<span><span>(<span><span>props<span><span>, <span><span>ctx<span><span>) {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> ctx.<span><span>emit<span><span>(<span><span>'submit'<span><span>)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/events.html", "title": "组件事件", "doc_id": "e211b1ec7d884200b02a51c101e6bffa", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 701, "chunk_index": 22, "_doc_id": "22_6950238574499859797"}}
{"doc_id": "23_8402321463437163834", "text": "t<span><span>(<span><span>'submit'<span><span>)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span><code><pre><div><p>与 <code>setup()<code> 上下文对象中的其他属性一样，<code>emit<code> 可以安全地被解构：<p><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/events.html", "title": "组件事件", "doc_id": "e211b1ec7d884200b02a51c101e6bffa", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 701, "chunk_index": 23, "_doc_id": "23_8402321463437163834"}}
