{"doc_id": "71_4615510616479612635", "text": "even<span><span>(numbers)<span><span>\"<span><span>>{{ n }}</<span><span>li<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>ul<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>在计算属性中使用 <code>reverse()<code> 和 <code>sort()<code> 的时候务必小心！这两个方法将变更原始数组，计算函数中不应该这么做。请在调用这些方法之前创建一个原数组的副本：<p><div class=\"language-diff\"> <span class=\"lang\">diff<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>- return numbers.reverse()<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/list.html", "title": "列表渲染", "doc_id": "dcc84a14932d48898445387cdd3ed420", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1081, "chunk_index": 71, "_doc_id": "71_4615510616479612635"}}
