{"doc_id": "0_2171539062694586745", "text": "<div><div><h1 id=\"watchers\">侦听器 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#watchers\">​<a><h1><h2 id=\"basic-example\">基本示例 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#basic-example\">​<a><h2><p>计算属性允许我们声明性地计算衍生值。然而在有些情况下，我们需要在状态变化时执行一些“副作用”：例如更改 DOM，或是根据异步操作的结果去修改另一处的状态。<p><div class=\"options-api\"><p>在选项式 API 中，我们可以使用 <a href=\"/api/options-state.html#watch\"><code>watch<code> 选项<a>在每次响应式属性发生变化时触发一个函数。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/watchers.html", "title": "侦听器 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "b242160ebdc44d76bc935fb5e9ea6339", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1820, "chunk_index": 0, "_doc_id": "0_2171539062694586745"}}
{"doc_id": "1_5184651458687588984", "text": "选项式 API 中，我们可以使用 <a href=\"/api/options-state.html#watch\"><code>watch<code> 选项<a>在每次响应式属性发生变化时触发一个函数。<p><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> data<span><span>() {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> return<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> question: <span><span>''<span><span>,<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/watchers.html", "title": "侦听器 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "b242160ebdc44d76bc935fb5e9ea6339", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1820, "chunk_index": 1, "_doc_id": "1_5184651458687588984"}}
{"doc_id": "2_8865211840363752122", "text": "an><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> question: <span><span>''<span><span>,<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> answer: <span><span>'Questions usually contain a question mark. ;-)'<span><span>,<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> loading: <span><span>false<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> },<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> watch: {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 每当 question 改变时，这个函数就会执行<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/watchers.html", "title": "侦听器 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "b242160ebdc44d76bc935fb5e9ea6339", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1820, "chunk_index": 2, "_doc_id": "2_8865211840363752122"}}
{"doc_id": "3_8636084091898279834", "text": "line\"><span> watch: {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 每当 question 改变时，这个函数就会执行<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> question<span><span>(<span><span>newQuestion<span><span>, <span><span>oldQuestion<span><span>) {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> if<span><span> (newQuestion.<span><span>includes<span><span>(<span><span>'?'<span><span>)) {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> this<span><span>.<span><span>getAnswer<span><span>()<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/watchers.html", "title": "侦听器 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "b242160ebdc44d76bc935fb5e9ea6339", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1820, "chunk_index": 3, "_doc_id": "3_8636084091898279834"}}
