{"doc_id": "99_7579425811978689527", "text": "<div class=\"options-api\"><p>添加到组件 <code>v-model<code> 的修饰符将通过 <code>modelModifiers<code> prop 提供给组件。在下面的示例中，我们创建了一个包含 <code>modelModifiers<code> prop 的组件，该 prop 默认为空对象：<p><div class=\"language-vue\"> <span class=\"lang\">vue<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>script<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> props: {<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/v-model.html", "title": "组件 v-model", "doc_id": "e5a6b5a7baae4b688591173d9eb47bf3", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1636, "chunk_index": 99, "_doc_id": "99_7579425811978689527"}}
{"doc_id": "100_3573658683602627010", "text": "export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> props: {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> modelValue: String,<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> modelModifiers: {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> default<span><span>: () <span><span>=><span><span> ({})<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> },<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> emits: [<span><span>'update:modelValue'<span><span>],<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/v-model.html", "title": "组件 v-model", "doc_id": "e5a6b5a7baae4b688591173d9eb47bf3", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1636, "chunk_index": 100, "_doc_id": "100_3573658683602627010"}}
