{"doc_id": "127_7982185861767739698", "text": "<span class=\"line\"><span> },<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> lastNameModifiers: {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> default<span><span>: () <span><span>=><span><span> ({})<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> },<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> emits: [<span><span>'update:firstName'<span><span>, <span><span>'update:lastName'<span><span>],<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> created<span><span>() {<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/v-model.html", "title": "组件 v-model", "doc_id": "e5a6b5a7baae4b688591173d9eb47bf3", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1636, "chunk_index": 127, "_doc_id": "127_7982185861767739698"}}
{"doc_id": "128_4218585709635154780", "text": "e:lastName'<span><span>],<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> created<span><span>() {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line highlighted\"><span> console.<span><span>log<span><span>(<span><span>this<span><span>.firstNameModifiers) <span><span>// { capitalize: true }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line highlighted\"><span> console.<span><span>log<span><span>(<span><span>this<span><span>.lastNameModifiers) <span><span>// { uppercase: true }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/v-model.html", "title": "组件 v-model", "doc_id": "e5a6b5a7baae4b688591173d9eb47bf3", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1636, "chunk_index": 128, "_doc_id": "128_4218585709635154780"}}
{"doc_id": "129_6517365676116261666", "text": "meModifiers) <span><span>// { uppercase: true }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>script<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><div><div><div>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/v-model.html", "title": "组件 v-model", "doc_id": "e5a6b5a7baae4b688591173d9eb47bf3", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1636, "chunk_index": 129, "_doc_id": "129_6517365676116261666"}}
{"doc_id": "0_7867820844582027062", "text": "<div><div><h1 id=\"event-handling\">事件处理 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#event-handling\">​<a><h1><h2 id=\"listening-to-events\">监听事件 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#listening-to-events\">​<a><h2><p>我们可以使用 <code>v-on<code> 指令 (简写为 <code>@<code>) 来监听 DOM 事件，并在事件触发时执行对应的 JavaScript。用法：<code>v-on:click=\"handler\"<code> 或 <code>@click=\"handler\"<code>。<p><p>事件处理器 (handler) 的值可以是：<p><ol><li><p><strong>内联事件处理器<strong>：事件被触发时执行的内联 JavaScript 语句 (与 <code>onclick<code> 类似)。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/event-handling.html", "title": "事件处理", "doc_id": "e76b6964cb604b50a1298a2cc661663e", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 709, "chunk_index": 0, "_doc_id": "0_7867820844582027062"}}
{"doc_id": "1_3538307593229178680", "text": "r) 的值可以是：<p><ol><li><p><strong>内联事件处理器<strong>：事件被触发时执行的内联 JavaScript 语句 (与 <code>onclick<code> 类似)。<p><li><li><p><strong>方法事件处理器<strong>：一个指向组件上定义的方法的属性名或是路径。<p><li><ol><h2 id=\"inline-handlers\">内联事件处理器 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#inline-handlers\">​<a><h2><p>内联事件处理器通常用于简单场景，例如：<p><div class=\"options-api\"><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>data<span><span>() {<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/event-handling.html", "title": "事件处理", "doc_id": "e76b6964cb604b50a1298a2cc661663e", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 709, "chunk_index": 1, "_doc_id": "1_3538307593229178680"}}
{"doc_id": "2_515156128503650922", "text": "e class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>data<span><span>() {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> return<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> count: <span><span>0<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/event-handling.html", "title": "事件处理", "doc_id": "e76b6964cb604b50a1298a2cc661663e", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 709, "chunk_index": 2, "_doc_id": "2_515156128503650922"}}
{"doc_id": "3_8213401573255986401", "text": "<span class=\"line\"><span> count: <span><span>0<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span><code><pre><div><div><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>button<span><span> @<span><span>click<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>count<span><span>++<span><span>\"<span><span>>Add 1</<span><span>button<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/event-handling.html", "title": "事件处理", "doc_id": "e76b6964cb604b50a1298a2cc661663e", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 709, "chunk_index": 3, "_doc_id": "3_8213401573255986401"}}
{"doc_id": "4_3745315831035925963", "text": "pan>count<span><span>++<span><span>\"<span><span>>Add 1</<span><span>button<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>p<span><span>>Count is: {{ count }}</<span><span>p<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><h2 id=\"method-handlers\">方法事件处理器 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#method-handlers\">​<a><h2><p>随着事件处理器的逻辑变得愈发复杂，内联代码方式变得不够灵活。因此 <code>v-on<code> 也可以接受一个方法名或对某个方法的调用。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/event-handling.html", "title": "事件处理", "doc_id": "e76b6964cb604b50a1298a2cc661663e", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 709, "chunk_index": 4, "_doc_id": "4_3745315831035925963"}}
{"doc_id": "5_6696401361945149438", "text": "\"#method-handlers\">​<a><h2><p>随着事件处理器的逻辑变得愈发复杂，内联代码方式变得不够灵活。因此 <code>v-on<code> 也可以接受一个方法名或对某个方法的调用。<p><p>举例来说：<p><div class=\"composition-api\"><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> name<span><span> =<span><span> ref<span><span>(<span><span>'Vue.js'<span><span>)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>function<span><span> greet<span><span>(<span><span>event<span><span>) {<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/event-handling.html", "title": "事件处理", "doc_id": "e76b6964cb604b50a1298a2cc661663e", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 709, "chunk_index": 5, "_doc_id": "5_6696401361945149438"}}
{"doc_id": "6_5644892483110067258", "text": "ss=\"line\"><span>function<span><span> greet<span><span>(<span><span>event<span><span>) {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> alert<span><span>(<span><span>`Hello ${<span><span>name<span><span>.<span><span>value<span><span>}!`<span><span>)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // `event` 是 DOM 原生事件<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> if<span><span> (event) {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> alert<span><span>(event.target.tagName)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/event-handling.html", "title": "事件处理", "doc_id": "e76b6964cb604b50a1298a2cc661663e", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 709, "chunk_index": 6, "_doc_id": "6_5644892483110067258"}}
{"doc_id": "7_4318329511687281929", "text": "><span> alert<span><span>(event.target.tagName)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span><code><pre><div><div><div class=\"options-api\"><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>data<span><span>() {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> return<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> name: <span><span>'Vue.js'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/event-handling.html", "title": "事件处理", "doc_id": "e76b6964cb604b50a1298a2cc661663e", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 709, "chunk_index": 7, "_doc_id": "7_4318329511687281929"}}
{"doc_id": "8_4988595710212045272", "text": "class=\"line\"><span> name: <span><span>'Vue.js'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>},<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>methods<span><span>: {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> greet<span><span>(event) {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 方法中的 `this` 指向当前活跃的组件实例<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> alert<span><span>(<span><span>`Hello ${<span><span>this<span><span>.<span><span>name<span><span>}!`<span><span>)<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/event-handling.html", "title": "事件处理", "doc_id": "e76b6964cb604b50a1298a2cc661663e", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 709, "chunk_index": 8, "_doc_id": "8_4988595710212045272"}}
{"doc_id": "9_315523787392942931", "text": "span>`Hello ${<span><span>this<span><span>.<span><span>name<span><span>}!`<span><span>)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // `event` 是 DOM 原生事件<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> if<span><span> (event) {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> alert<span><span>(event.target.tagName)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/event-handling.html", "title": "事件处理", "doc_id": "e76b6964cb604b50a1298a2cc661663e", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 709, "chunk_index": 9, "_doc_id": "9_315523787392942931"}}
{"doc_id": "10_1403993998336451253", "text": "agName)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span><code><pre><div><div><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><!-- `greet` 是上面定义过的方法名 --><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/event-handling.html", "title": "事件处理", "doc_id": "e76b6964cb604b50a1298a2cc661663e", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 709, "chunk_index": 10, "_doc_id": "10_1403993998336451253"}}
{"doc_id": "11_7322567489751065732", "text": "=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><!-- `greet` 是上面定义过的方法名 --><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>button<span><span> @<span><span>click<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>greet<span><span>\"<span><span>>Greet</<span><span>button<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>方法事件处理器会自动接收原生 DOM 事件并触发执行。在上面的例子中，我们能够通过被触发事件的 <code>event.target<code> 访问到该 DOM 元素。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/event-handling.html", "title": "事件处理", "doc_id": "e76b6964cb604b50a1298a2cc661663e", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 709, "chunk_index": 11, "_doc_id": "11_7322567489751065732"}}
{"doc_id": "12_7221011271418396194", "text": "e><pre><div><p>方法事件处理器会自动接收原生 DOM 事件并触发执行。在上面的例子中，我们能够通过被触发事件的 <code>event.target<code> 访问到该 DOM 元素。<p><h3 id=\"method-vs-inline-detection\">方法与内联事件判断 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#method-vs-inline-detection\">​<a><h3><p>模板编译器会通过检查 <code>v-on<code> 的值是否是合法的 JavaScript 标识符或属性访问路径来断定是何种形式的事件处理器。举例来说，<code>foo<code>、<code>foo.bar<code> 和 <code>foo['bar']<code> 会被视为方法事件处理器，而 <code>foo()<code> 和 <code>count++<code> 会被视为内联事件处理器。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/event-handling.html", "title": "事件处理", "doc_id": "e76b6964cb604b50a1298a2cc661663e", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 709, "chunk_index": 12, "_doc_id": "12_7221011271418396194"}}
{"doc_id": "13_5030482254736199170", "text": "ar<code> 和 <code>foo['bar']<code> 会被视为方法事件处理器，而 <code>foo()<code> 和 <code>count++<code> 会被视为内联事件处理器。<p><h2 id=\"calling-methods-in-inline-handlers\">在内联处理器中调用方法 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#calling-methods-in-inline-handlers\">​<a><h2><p>除了直接绑定方法名，你还可以在内联事件处理器中调用方法。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/event-handling.html", "title": "事件处理", "doc_id": "e76b6964cb604b50a1298a2cc661663e", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 709, "chunk_index": 13, "_doc_id": "13_5030482254736199170"}}
{"doc_id": "14_240350735568294957", "text": "s=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#calling-methods-in-inline-handlers\">​<a><h2><p>除了直接绑定方法名，你还可以在内联事件处理器中调用方法。这允许我们向方法传入自定义参数以代替原生事件：<p><div class=\"composition-api\"><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>function<span><span> say<span><span>(<span><span>message<span><span>) {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> alert<span><span>(message)<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/event-handling.html", "title": "事件处理", "doc_id": "e76b6964cb604b50a1298a2cc661663e", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 709, "chunk_index": 14, "_doc_id": "14_240350735568294957"}}
{"doc_id": "15_4411765744362741341", "text": "message<span><span>) {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> alert<span><span>(message)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span><code><pre><div><div><div class=\"options-api\"><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>methods<span><span>: {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> say<span><span>(message) {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> alert<span><span>(message)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/event-handling.html", "title": "事件处理", "doc_id": "e76b6964cb604b50a1298a2cc661663e", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 709, "chunk_index": 15, "_doc_id": "15_4411765744362741341"}}
{"doc_id": "16_3865815886795287119", "text": "class=\"line\"><span> alert<span><span>(message)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span><code><pre><div><div><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>button<span><span> @<span><span>click<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>say<span><span>(<span><span>'hello'<span><span>)<span><span>\"<span><span>>Say hello</<span><span>button<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/event-handling.html", "title": "事件处理", "doc_id": "e76b6964cb604b50a1298a2cc661663e", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 709, "chunk_index": 16, "_doc_id": "16_3865815886795287119"}}
{"doc_id": "17_8859170774942416539", "text": "hello'<span><span>)<span><span>\"<span><span>>Say hello</<span><span>button<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>button<span><span> @<span><span>click<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>say<span><span>(<span><span>'bye'<span><span>)<span><span>\"<span><span>>Say bye</<span><span>button<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><h2 id=\"accessing-event-argument-in-inline-handlers\">在内联事件处理器中访问事件参数 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#accessing-event-argument-in-inline-handlers\">​<a><h2><p>有时我们需要在内联事件处理器中访问原生 DOM 事件。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/event-handling.html", "title": "事件处理", "doc_id": "e76b6964cb604b50a1298a2cc661663e", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 709, "chunk_index": 17, "_doc_id": "17_8859170774942416539"}}
{"doc_id": "18_1304757944695248030", "text": "r-anchor\" href=\"#accessing-event-argument-in-inline-handlers\">​<a><h2><p>有时我们需要在内联事件处理器中访问原生 DOM 事件。你可以向该处理器方法传入一个特殊的 <code>$event<code> 变量，或者使用内联箭头函数：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><!-- 使用特殊的 $event 变量 --><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/event-handling.html", "title": "事件处理", "doc_id": "e76b6964cb604b50a1298a2cc661663e", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 709, "chunk_index": 18, "_doc_id": "18_1304757944695248030"}}
{"doc_id": "19_4767391062064817621", "text": "ass=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><!-- 使用特殊的 $event 变量 --><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>button<span><span> @<span><span>click<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>warn<span><span>(<span><span>'Form cannot be submitted yet.'<span><span>, $event)<span><span>\"<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> Submit<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>button<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/event-handling.html", "title": "事件处理", "doc_id": "e76b6964cb604b50a1298a2cc661663e", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 709, "chunk_index": 19, "_doc_id": "19_4767391062064817621"}}
{"doc_id": "20_2646100391258416984", "text": "n>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>button<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><!-- 使用内联箭头函数 --><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>button<span><span> @<span><span>click<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>(<span><span>event<span><span>) <span><span>=><span><span> warn<span><span>(<span><span>'Form cannot be submitted yet.'<span><span>, event)<span><span>\"<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> Submit<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/event-handling.html", "title": "事件处理", "doc_id": "e76b6964cb604b50a1298a2cc661663e", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 709, "chunk_index": 20, "_doc_id": "20_2646100391258416984"}}
{"doc_id": "21_6752718060993507791", "text": "n><span>, event)<span><span>\"<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> Submit<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>button<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><div class=\"composition-api\"><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>function<span><span> warn<span><span>(<span><span>message<span><span>, <span><span>event<span><span>) {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 这里可以访问原生事件<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/event-handling.html", "title": "事件处理", "doc_id": "e76b6964cb604b50a1298a2cc661663e", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 709, "chunk_index": 21, "_doc_id": "21_6752718060993507791"}}
{"doc_id": "22_7320111849001625302", "text": ">, <span><span>event<span><span>) {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 这里可以访问原生事件<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> if<span><span> (event) {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> event.<span><span>preventDefault<span><span>()<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> alert<span><span>(message)<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/event-handling.html", "title": "事件处理", "doc_id": "e76b6964cb604b50a1298a2cc661663e", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 709, "chunk_index": 22, "_doc_id": "22_7320111849001625302"}}
{"doc_id": "23_3186352740300757839", "text": "class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> alert<span><span>(message)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span><code><pre><div><div><div class=\"options-api\"><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>methods<span><span>: {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> warn<span><span>(message, event) {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 这里可以访问 DOM 原生事件<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/event-handling.html", "title": "事件处理", "doc_id": "e76b6964cb604b50a1298a2cc661663e", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 709, "chunk_index": 23, "_doc_id": "23_3186352740300757839"}}
{"doc_id": "24_472462205026902894", "text": "<span><span>(message, event) {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 这里可以访问 DOM 原生事件<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> if<span><span> (event) {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> event.<span><span>preventDefault<span><span>()<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> alert<span><span>(message)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/event-handling.html", "title": "事件处理", "doc_id": "e76b6964cb604b50a1298a2cc661663e", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 709, "chunk_index": 24, "_doc_id": "24_472462205026902894"}}
{"doc_id": "25_9194884614426350211", "text": "class=\"line\"><span> alert<span><span>(message)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span><code><pre><div><div><h2 id=\"event-modifiers\">事件修饰符 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#event-modifiers\">​<a><h2><p>在处理事件时调用 <code>event.preventDefault()<code> 或 <code>event.stopPropagation()<code> 是很常见的。尽管我们可以直接在方法内调用，但如果方法能更专注于数据逻辑而不用去处理 DOM 事件的细节会更好。<p><p>为解决这一问题，Vue 为 <code>v-on<code> 提供了<strong>事件修饰符<strong>。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/event-handling.html", "title": "事件处理", "doc_id": "e76b6964cb604b50a1298a2cc661663e", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 709, "chunk_index": 25, "_doc_id": "25_9194884614426350211"}}
{"doc_id": "26_1240739010459110935", "text": "内调用，但如果方法能更专注于数据逻辑而不用去处理 DOM 事件的细节会更好。<p><p>为解决这一问题，Vue 为 <code>v-on<code> 提供了<strong>事件修饰符<strong>。修饰符是用 <code>.<code> 表示的指令后缀，包含以下这些：<p><ul><li><code>.stop<code><li><li><code>.prevent<code><li><li><code>.self<code><li><li><code>.capture<code><li><li><code>.once<code><li><li><code>.passive<code><li><ul><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><!-- 单击事件将停止传递 --><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/event-handling.html", "title": "事件处理", "doc_id": "e76b6964cb604b50a1298a2cc661663e", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 709, "chunk_index": 26, "_doc_id": "26_1240739010459110935"}}
{"doc_id": "27_1881092480506048004", "text": "pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><!-- 单击事件将停止传递 --><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>a<span><span> @<span><span>click<span><span>.<span><span>stop<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>doThis<span><span>\"<span><span>></<span><span>a<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><!-- 提交事件将不再重新加载页面 --><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/event-handling.html", "title": "事件处理", "doc_id": "e76b6964cb604b50a1298a2cc661663e", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 709, "chunk_index": 27, "_doc_id": "27_1881092480506048004"}}
{"doc_id": "28_3829733701692045538", "text": "><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><!-- 提交事件将不再重新加载页面 --><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>form<span><span> @<span><span>submit<span><span>.<span><span>prevent<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>onSubmit<span><span>\"<span><span>></<span><span>form<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><!-- 修饰语可以使用链式书写 --><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/event-handling.html", "title": "事件处理", "doc_id": "e76b6964cb604b50a1298a2cc661663e", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 709, "chunk_index": 28, "_doc_id": "28_3829733701692045538"}}
{"doc_id": "29_6030509326980040510", "text": "n>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><!-- 修饰语可以使用链式书写 --><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>a<span><span> @<span><span>click<span><span>.stop.<span><span>prevent<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>doThat<span><span>\"<span><span>></<span><span>a<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><!-- 也可以只有修饰符 --><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/event-handling.html", "title": "事件处理", "doc_id": "e76b6964cb604b50a1298a2cc661663e", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 709, "chunk_index": 29, "_doc_id": "29_6030509326980040510"}}
{"doc_id": "30_160404779727621920", "text": "span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><!-- 也可以只有修饰符 --><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>form<span><span> @<span><span>submit<span><span>.<span><span>prevent<span><span>></<span><span>form<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><!-- 仅当 event.target 是元素本身时才会触发事件处理器 --><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><!-- 例如：事件处理器不来自子元素 --><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/event-handling.html", "title": "事件处理", "doc_id": "e76b6964cb604b50a1298a2cc661663e", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 709, "chunk_index": 30, "_doc_id": "30_160404779727621920"}}
{"doc_id": "31_285239318976812231", "text": "target 是元素本身时才会触发事件处理器 --><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><!-- 例如：事件处理器不来自子元素 --><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>div<span><span> @<span><span>click<span><span>.<span><span>self<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>doThat<span><span>\"<span><span>>...</<span><span>div<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><div class=\"tip custom-block\"><p class=\"custom-block-title\">TIP<p><p>使用修饰符时需要注意调用顺序，因为相关代码是以相同的顺序生成的。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/event-handling.html", "title": "事件处理", "doc_id": "e76b6964cb604b50a1298a2cc661663e", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 709, "chunk_index": 31, "_doc_id": "31_285239318976812231"}}
{"doc_id": "32_4571101272818338624", "text": "div class=\"tip custom-block\"><p class=\"custom-block-title\">TIP<p><p>使用修饰符时需要注意调用顺序，因为相关代码是以相同的顺序生成的。因此使用 <code>@click.prevent.self<code> 会阻止<strong>元素及其子元素的所有点击事件的默认行为<strong>，而 <code>@click.self.prevent<code> 则只会阻止对元素本身的点击事件的默认行为。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/event-handling.html", "title": "事件处理", "doc_id": "e76b6964cb604b50a1298a2cc661663e", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 709, "chunk_index": 32, "_doc_id": "32_4571101272818338624"}}
{"doc_id": "33_5686436558263837344", "text": "code> 会阻止<strong>元素及其子元素的所有点击事件的默认行为<strong>，而 <code>@click.self.prevent<code> 则只会阻止对元素本身的点击事件的默认行为。<p><div><p><code>.capture<code>、<code>.once<code> 和 <code>.passive<code> 修饰符与<a href=\"https://developer.mozilla.org/zh-CN/docs/Web/API/EventTarget/addEventListener#options\" target=\"_blank\">原生 <code>addEventListener<code> 事件<a>相对应：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><!-- 添加事件监听器时，使用 `capture` 捕获模式 --><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/event-handling.html", "title": "事件处理", "doc_id": "e76b6964cb604b50a1298a2cc661663e", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 709, "chunk_index": 33, "_doc_id": "33_5686436558263837344"}}
{"doc_id": "34_1660497690933803880", "text": "github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><!-- 添加事件监听器时，使用 `capture` 捕获模式 --><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><!-- 例如：指向内部元素的事件，在被内部元素处理前，先被外部处理 --><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>div<span><span> @<span><span>click<span><span>.<span><span>capture<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>doThis<span><span>\"<span><span>>...</<span><span>div<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><!-- 点击事件最多被触发一次 --><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/event-handling.html", "title": "事件处理", "doc_id": "e76b6964cb604b50a1298a2cc661663e", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 709, "chunk_index": 34, "_doc_id": "34_1660497690933803880"}}
{"doc_id": "35_3178564984038924181", "text": "n>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><!-- 点击事件最多被触发一次 --><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>a<span><span> @<span><span>click<span><span>.<span><span>once<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>doThis<span><span>\"<span><span>></<span><span>a<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><!-- 滚动事件的默认行为 (scrolling) 将立即发生而非等待 `onScroll` 完成 --><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><!-- 以防其中包含 `event.preventDefault()` --><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/event-handling.html", "title": "事件处理", "doc_id": "e76b6964cb604b50a1298a2cc661663e", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 709, "chunk_index": 35, "_doc_id": "35_3178564984038924181"}}
{"doc_id": "36_7365080218564425648", "text": "l` 完成 --><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><!-- 以防其中包含 `event.preventDefault()` --><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>div<span><span> @<span><span>scroll<span><span>.<span><span>passive<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>onScroll<span><span>\"<span><span>>...</<span><span>div<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p><code>.passive<code> 修饰符一般用于触摸事件的监听器，可以用来<a href=\"https://developer.mozilla.org/zh-CN/docs/Web/API/EventTarget/addEventListener#%E4%BD%BF%E7%94%A8_passive_%E6%94%B9%E5%96%84%E6%BB%9A%E5%B1%8F%E6%80%A7%E8%83%BD\" target=\"_blank\">改善移动端设备的滚屏性能<a>。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/event-handling.html", "title": "事件处理", "doc_id": "e76b6964cb604b50a1298a2cc661663e", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 709, "chunk_index": 36, "_doc_id": "36_7365080218564425648"}}
{"doc_id": "37_5637395649592482075", "text": "%A8_passive_%E6%94%B9%E5%96%84%E6%BB%9A%E5%B1%8F%E6%80%A7%E8%83%BD\" target=\"_blank\">改善移动端设备的滚屏性能<a>。<p><div class=\"tip custom-block\"><p class=\"custom-block-title\">TIP<p><p>请勿同时使用 <code>.passive<code> 和 <code>.prevent<code>，因为 <code>.passive<code> 已经向浏览器表明了你<em>不想<em>阻止事件的默认行为。如果你这么做了，则 <code>.prevent<code> 会被忽略，并且浏览器会抛出警告。<p><div><h2 id=\"key-modifiers\">按键修饰符 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#key-modifiers\">​<a><h2><p>在监听键盘事件时，我们经常需要检查特定的按键。Vue 允许在 <code>v-on<code> 或 <code>@<code> 监听按键事件时添加按键修饰符。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/event-handling.html", "title": "事件处理", "doc_id": "e76b6964cb604b50a1298a2cc661663e", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 709, "chunk_index": 37, "_doc_id": "37_5637395649592482075"}}
{"doc_id": "38_920823208074977121", "text": "odifiers\">​<a><h2><p>在监听键盘事件时，我们经常需要检查特定的按键。Vue 允许在 <code>v-on<code> 或 <code>@<code> 监听按键事件时添加按键修饰符。<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><!-- 仅在 `key` 为 `Enter` 时调用 `submit` --><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/event-handling.html", "title": "事件处理", "doc_id": "e76b6964cb604b50a1298a2cc661663e", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 709, "chunk_index": 38, "_doc_id": "38_920823208074977121"}}
{"doc_id": "39_4442884869104294114", "text": "b-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><!-- 仅在 `key` 为 `Enter` 时调用 `submit` --><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>input<span><span> @<span><span>keyup<span><span>.<span><span>enter<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>submit<span><span>\"<span><span> /><span><span><code><pre><div><p>你可以直接使用 <a href=\"https://developer.mozilla.org/zh-CN/docs/Web/API/UI_Events/Keyboard_event_key_values\" target=\"_blank\"><code>KeyboardEvent.key<code><a> 暴露的按键名称作为修饰符，但需要转为 kebab-case 形式。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/event-handling.html", "title": "事件处理", "doc_id": "e76b6964cb604b50a1298a2cc661663e", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 709, "chunk_index": 39, "_doc_id": "39_4442884869104294114"}}
{"doc_id": "40_4446118655593958746", "text": "event_key_values\" target=\"_blank\"><code>KeyboardEvent.key<code><a> 暴露的按键名称作为修饰符，但需要转为 kebab-case 形式。<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>input<span><span> @<span><span>keyup<span><span>.<span><span>page-down<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>onPageDown<span><span>\"<span><span> /><span><span><code><pre><div><p>在上面的例子中，仅会在 <code>$event.key<code> 为 <code>'PageDown'<code> 时调用事件处理。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/event-handling.html", "title": "事件处理", "doc_id": "e76b6964cb604b50a1298a2cc661663e", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 709, "chunk_index": 40, "_doc_id": "40_4446118655593958746"}}
{"doc_id": "41_1503041275021494040", "text": "><span><span><code><pre><div><p>在上面的例子中，仅会在 <code>$event.key<code> 为 <code>'PageDown'<code> 时调用事件处理。<p><h3 id=\"key-aliases\">按键别名 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#key-aliases\">​<a><h3><p>Vue 为一些常用的按键提供了别名：<p><ul><li><code>.enter<code><li><li><code>.tab<code><li><li><code>.delete<code> (捕获“Delete”和“Backspace”两个按键)<li><li><code>.esc<code><li><li><code>.space<code><li><li><code>.up<code><li><li><code>.down<code><li><li><code>.left<code><li><li><code>.right<code><li><ul><h3 id=\"system-modifier-keys\">系统按键修饰符 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#system-modifier-keys\">​<a><h3><p>你可以使用以下系统按键修饰符来触发鼠标或键盘事件监听器，", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/event-handling.html", "title": "事件处理", "doc_id": "e76b6964cb604b50a1298a2cc661663e", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 709, "chunk_index": 41, "_doc_id": "41_1503041275021494040"}}
{"doc_id": "42_1969555153751387113", "text": "统按键修饰符 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#system-modifier-keys\">​<a><h3><p>你可以使用以下系统按键修饰符来触发鼠标或键盘事件监听器，只有当按键被按下时才会触发。<p><div class=\"tip custom-block\"><p class=\"custom-block-title\">注意<p><p>在 Mac 键盘上，meta 是 Command 键 (⌘)。在 Windows 键盘上，meta 键是 Windows 键 (⊞)。在 Sun 微机系统键盘上，meta 是钻石键 (◆)。在某些键盘上，特别是 MIT 和 Lisp 机器的键盘及其后代版本的键盘，如 Knight 键盘，space-cadet 键盘，meta 都被标记为“META”。在 Symbolics 键盘上，meta 也被标识为“META”或“Meta”。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/event-handling.html", "title": "事件处理", "doc_id": "e76b6964cb604b50a1298a2cc661663e", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 709, "chunk_index": 42, "_doc_id": "42_1969555153751387113"}}
{"doc_id": "43_8603571635273530133", "text": "机器的键盘及其后代版本的键盘，如 Knight 键盘，space-cadet 键盘，meta 都被标记为“META”。在 Symbolics 键盘上，meta 也被标识为“META”或“Meta”。<p><div><p>举例来说：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><!-- Alt + Enter --><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>input<span><span> @<span><span>keyup<span><span>.alt.<span><span>enter<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>clear<span><span>\"<span><span> /><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/event-handling.html", "title": "事件处理", "doc_id": "e76b6964cb604b50a1298a2cc661663e", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 709, "chunk_index": 43, "_doc_id": "43_8603571635273530133"}}
{"doc_id": "44_3778153900786321776", "text": "n>=<span><span>\"<span><span>clear<span><span>\"<span><span> /><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><!-- Ctrl + 点击 --><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>div<span><span> @<span><span>click<span><span>.<span><span>ctrl<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>doSomething<span><span>\"<span><span>>Do something</<span><span>div<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><div class=\"tip custom-block\"><p class=\"custom-block-title\">TIP<p><p>请注意，系统按键修饰符和常规按键不同。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/event-handling.html", "title": "事件处理", "doc_id": "e76b6964cb604b50a1298a2cc661663e", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 709, "chunk_index": 44, "_doc_id": "44_3778153900786321776"}}
{"doc_id": "45_8740288117420565931", "text": "e><pre><div><div class=\"tip custom-block\"><p class=\"custom-block-title\">TIP<p><p>请注意，系统按键修饰符和常规按键不同。与 <code>keyup<code> 事件一起使用时，该按键必须在事件发出时处于按下状态。换句话说，<code>keyup.ctrl<code> 只会在你仍然按住 <code>ctrl<code> 但松开了另一个键时被触发。若你单独松开 <code>ctrl<code> 键将不会触发。<p><div><h3 id=\"exact-modifier\"><code>.exact<code> 修饰符 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#exact-modifier\">​<a><h3><p><code>.exact<code> 修饰符允许精确控制触发事件所需的系统修饰符的组合。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/event-handling.html", "title": "事件处理", "doc_id": "e76b6964cb604b50a1298a2cc661663e", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 709, "chunk_index": 45, "_doc_id": "45_8740288117420565931"}}
{"doc_id": "46_6249912959882939153", "text": "class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#exact-modifier\">​<a><h3><p><code>.exact<code> 修饰符允许精确控制触发事件所需的系统修饰符的组合。<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><!-- 当按下 Ctrl 时，即使同时按下 Alt 或 Shift 也会触发 --><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/event-handling.html", "title": "事件处理", "doc_id": "e76b6964cb604b50a1298a2cc661663e", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 709, "chunk_index": 46, "_doc_id": "46_6249912959882939153"}}
{"doc_id": "47_2770732500258364649", "text": "ark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><!-- 当按下 Ctrl 时，即使同时按下 Alt 或 Shift 也会触发 --><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>button<span><span> @<span><span>click<span><span>.<span><span>ctrl<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>onClick<span><span>\"<span><span>>A</<span><span>button<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><!-- 仅当按下 Ctrl 且未按任何其他键时才会触发 --><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/event-handling.html", "title": "事件处理", "doc_id": "e76b6964cb604b50a1298a2cc661663e", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 709, "chunk_index": 47, "_doc_id": "47_2770732500258364649"}}
{"doc_id": "48_2490619117039505084", "text": "an>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><!-- 仅当按下 Ctrl 且未按任何其他键时才会触发 --><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>button<span><span> @<span><span>click<span><span>.ctrl.<span><span>exact<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>onCtrlClick<span><span>\"<span><span>>A</<span><span>button<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><!-- 仅当没有按下任何系统按键时触发 --><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/event-handling.html", "title": "事件处理", "doc_id": "e76b6964cb604b50a1298a2cc661663e", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 709, "chunk_index": 48, "_doc_id": "48_2490619117039505084"}}
{"doc_id": "49_5929280453634442555", "text": "span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><!-- 仅当没有按下任何系统按键时触发 --><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>button<span><span> @<span><span>click<span><span>.<span><span>exact<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>onClick<span><span>\"<span><span>>A</<span><span>button<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><h2 id=\"mouse-button-modifiers\">鼠标按键修饰符 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#mouse-button-modifiers\">​<a><h2><p>这些修饰符将处理程序限定为由特定鼠标按键触发的事件。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/event-handling.html", "title": "事件处理", "doc_id": "e76b6964cb604b50a1298a2cc661663e", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 709, "chunk_index": 49, "_doc_id": "49_5929280453634442555"}}
{"doc_id": "50_8785278575943738751", "text": "标按键修饰符 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#mouse-button-modifiers\">​<a><h2><p>这些修饰符将处理程序限定为由特定鼠标按键触发的事件。<p><p>但请注意，<code>.left<code>，<code>.right<code> 和 <code>.middle<code> 这些修饰符名称是基于常见的右手用鼠标布局设定的，但实际上它们分别指代设备事件触发器的“主”、“次”，“辅助”，而非实际的物理按键。因此，对于左手用鼠标布局而言，“主”按键在物理上可能是右边的按键，但却会触发 <code>.left<code> 修饰符对应的处理程序。又或者，触控板可能通过单指点击触发 <code>.left<code> 处理程序，通过双指点击触发 <code>.right<code> 处理程序，通过三指点击触发 <code>.middle<code> 处理程序。同样，产生“鼠标”事件的其他设备和事件源，也可能具有与“左”，“右”完全无关的触发模式。<p><div><div>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/event-handling.html", "title": "事件处理", "doc_id": "e76b6964cb604b50a1298a2cc661663e", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 709, "chunk_index": 50, "_doc_id": "50_8785278575943738751"}}
{"doc_id": "0_187890297484196346", "text": "<div><div><h1 id=\"template-refs\">模板引用 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#template-refs\">​<a><h1><p>虽然 Vue 的声明性渲染模型为你抽象了大部分对 DOM 的直接操作，但在某些情况下，我们仍然需要直接访问底层 DOM 元素。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/template-refs.html", "title": "模板引用", "doc_id": "d311304389cf40309581ad60643e7774", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 925, "chunk_index": 0, "_doc_id": "0_187890297484196346"}}
{"doc_id": "1_1050504288609067005", "text": "or\" href=\"#template-refs\">​<a><h1><p>虽然 Vue 的声明性渲染模型为你抽象了大部分对 DOM 的直接操作，但在某些情况下，我们仍然需要直接访问底层 DOM 元素。要实现这一点，我们可以使用特殊的 <code>ref<code> attribute：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>input<span><span> ref<span><span>=<span><span>\"input\"<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p><code>ref<code> 是一个特殊的 attribute，和 <code>v-for<code> 章节中提到的 <code>key<code> 类似。它允许我们在一个特定的 DOM 元素或子组件实例被挂载后，获得对它的直接引用。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/template-refs.html", "title": "模板引用", "doc_id": "d311304389cf40309581ad60643e7774", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 925, "chunk_index": 1, "_doc_id": "1_1050504288609067005"}}
{"doc_id": "2_6804180024460934227", "text": "个特殊的 attribute，和 <code>v-for<code> 章节中提到的 <code>key<code> 类似。它允许我们在一个特定的 DOM 元素或子组件实例被挂载后，获得对它的直接引用。这可能很有用，比如说在组件挂载时将焦点设置到一个 input 元素上，或在一个元素上初始化一个第三方库。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/template-refs.html", "title": "模板引用", "doc_id": "d311304389cf40309581ad60643e7774", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 925, "chunk_index": 2, "_doc_id": "2_6804180024460934227"}}
{"doc_id": "3_5493128099699721937", "text": "code> 类似。它允许我们在一个特定的 DOM 元素或子组件实例被挂载后，获得对它的直接引用。这可能很有用，比如说在组件挂载时将焦点设置到一个 input 元素上，或在一个元素上初始化一个第三方库。<p><h2 id=\"accessing-the-refs\">访问模板引用 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#accessing-the-refs\">​<a><h2><div class=\"composition-api\"><p>要在组合式 API 中获取引用，我们可以使用辅助函数 <a href=\"/api/composition-api-helpers.html#usetemplateref\"><code>useTemplateRef()<code><a> ：<p><div class=\"language-vue\"> <span class=\"lang\">vue<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>script<span><span> setup<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/template-refs.html", "title": "模板引用", "doc_id": "d311304389cf40309581ad60643e7774", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 925, "chunk_index": 3, "_doc_id": "3_5493128099699721937"}}
{"doc_id": "4_6790361041967877804", "text": "code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>script<span><span> setup<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>import<span><span> { useTemplateRef, onMounted } <span><span>from<span><span> 'vue'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 第一个参数必须与模板中的 ref 值匹配<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> input<span><span> =<span><span> useTemplateRef<span><span>(<span><span>'my-input'<span><span>)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/template-refs.html", "title": "模板引用", "doc_id": "d311304389cf40309581ad60643e7774", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 925, "chunk_index": 4, "_doc_id": "4_6790361041967877804"}}
{"doc_id": "5_3278264099824832226", "text": "seTemplateRef<span><span>(<span><span>'my-input'<span><span>)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>onMounted<span><span>(() <span><span>=><span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> input.value.<span><span>focus<span><span>()<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>})<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>script<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/template-refs.html", "title": "模板引用", "doc_id": "d311304389cf40309581ad60643e7774", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 925, "chunk_index": 5, "_doc_id": "5_3278264099824832226"}}
{"doc_id": "6_8109240510946639597", "text": ">\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>input<span><span> ref<span><span>=<span><span>\"my-input\"<span><span> /><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/template-refs.html", "title": "模板引用", "doc_id": "d311304389cf40309581ad60643e7774", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 925, "chunk_index": 6, "_doc_id": "6_8109240510946639597"}}
{"doc_id": "7_6276000136437298225", "text": "n> <<span><span>input<span><span> ref<span><span>=<span><span>\"my-input\"<span><span> /><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>在使用 TypeScript 时，Vue 的 IDE 支持和 <code>vue-tsc<code> 将根据匹配的 <code>ref<code> attribute 所用的元素或组件自动推断 <code>input.value<code> 的类型。<p> 3.5 前的用法 <p>在 3.5 之前的版本尚未引入 <code>useTemplateRef()<code>，我们需要声明一个与模板里 ref attribute 匹配的引用：<p><div class=\"language-vue\"> <span class=\"lang\">vue<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>script<span><span> setup<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/template-refs.html", "title": "模板引用", "doc_id": "d311304389cf40309581ad60643e7774", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 925, "chunk_index": 7, "_doc_id": "7_6276000136437298225"}}
{"doc_id": "8_675599828964256704", "text": "code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>script<span><span> setup<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>import<span><span> { ref, onMounted } <span><span>from<span><span> 'vue'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 声明一个 ref 来存放该元素的引用<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 必须和模板里的 ref 同名<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> input<span><span> =<span><span> ref<span><span>(<span><span>null<span><span>)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/template-refs.html", "title": "模板引用", "doc_id": "d311304389cf40309581ad60643e7774", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 925, "chunk_index": 8, "_doc_id": "8_675599828964256704"}}
{"doc_id": "9_6516844369771447664", "text": "> =<span><span> ref<span><span>(<span><span>null<span><span>)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>onMounted<span><span>(() <span><span>=><span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> input.value.<span><span>focus<span><span>()<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>})<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>script<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/template-refs.html", "title": "模板引用", "doc_id": "d311304389cf40309581ad60643e7774", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 925, "chunk_index": 9, "_doc_id": "9_6516844369771447664"}}
{"doc_id": "10_8040204268809912146", "text": ">\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>input<span><span> ref<span><span>=<span><span>\"input\"<span><span> /><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/template-refs.html", "title": "模板引用", "doc_id": "d311304389cf40309581ad60643e7774", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 925, "chunk_index": 10, "_doc_id": "10_8040204268809912146"}}
{"doc_id": "11_3433679233904899655", "text": "span> <<span><span>input<span><span> ref<span><span>=<span><span>\"input\"<span><span> /><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>如果不使用 <code><script setup><code>，需确保从 <code>setup()<code> 返回 ref：<p><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> setup<span><span>() {<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/template-refs.html", "title": "模板引用", "doc_id": "d311304389cf40309581ad60643e7774", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 925, "chunk_index": 11, "_doc_id": "11_3433679233904899655"}}
{"doc_id": "12_3386666652778040315", "text": "span> default<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> setup<span><span>() {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> const<span><span> input<span><span> =<span><span> ref<span><span>(<span><span>null<span><span>)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // ...<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> return<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line highlighted\"><span> input<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/template-refs.html", "title": "模板引用", "doc_id": "d311304389cf40309581ad60643e7774", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 925, "chunk_index": 12, "_doc_id": "12_3386666652778040315"}}
{"doc_id": "13_7053555309571768166", "text": "> input<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span><code><pre><div> <div><div class=\"options-api\"><p>挂载结束后引用都会被暴露在 <code>this.$refs<code> 之上：<p><div class=\"language-vue\"> <span class=\"lang\">vue<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>script<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/template-refs.html", "title": "模板引用", "doc_id": "d311304389cf40309581ad60643e7774", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 925, "chunk_index": 13, "_doc_id": "13_7053555309571768166"}}
{"doc_id": "14_6732932019664810102", "text": "n><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> mounted<span><span>() {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> this<span><span>.$refs.input.<span><span>focus<span><span>()<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>script<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/template-refs.html", "title": "模板引用", "doc_id": "d311304389cf40309581ad60643e7774", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 925, "chunk_index": 14, "_doc_id": "14_6732932019664810102"}}
{"doc_id": "15_2014190967801356245", "text": ">\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>input<span><span> ref<span><span>=<span><span>\"input\"<span><span> /><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><div><p>注意，你只可以<strong>在组件挂载后<strong>才能访问模板引用。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/template-refs.html", "title": "模板引用", "doc_id": "d311304389cf40309581ad60643e7774", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 925, "chunk_index": 15, "_doc_id": "15_2014190967801356245"}}
{"doc_id": "16_409642800014804795", "text": "span>template<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><div><p>注意，你只可以<strong>在组件挂载后<strong>才能访问模板引用。如果你想在模板中的表达式上访问 <span class=\"options-api\"><code>$refs.input<code><span><span class=\"composition-api\"><code>input<code><span>，在初次渲染时会是 <span class=\"options-api\"><code>undefined<code><span><span class=\"composition-api\"><code>null<code><span>。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/template-refs.html", "title": "模板引用", "doc_id": "d311304389cf40309581ad60643e7774", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 925, "chunk_index": 16, "_doc_id": "16_409642800014804795"}}
{"doc_id": "17_6485920035257473827", "text": "class=\"options-api\"><code>undefined<code><span><span class=\"composition-api\"><code>null<code><span>。这是因为在初次渲染前这个元素还不存在呢！<p><div class=\"composition-api\"><p>如果你需要侦听一个模板引用 ref 的变化，确保考虑到其值为 <code>null<code> 的情况：<p><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>watchEffect<span><span>(() <span><span>=><span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> if<span><span> (input.value) {<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/template-refs.html", "title": "模板引用", "doc_id": "d311304389cf40309581ad60643e7774", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 925, "chunk_index": 17, "_doc_id": "17_6485920035257473827"}}
{"doc_id": "18_2251686832121083177", "text": "n>=><span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> if<span><span> (input.value) {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> input.value.<span><span>focus<span><span>()<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> } <span><span>else<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 此时还未挂载，或此元素已经被卸载(例如通过 v-if 控制)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/template-refs.html", "title": "模板引用", "doc_id": "d311304389cf40309581ad60643e7774", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 925, "chunk_index": 18, "_doc_id": "18_2251686832121083177"}}
{"doc_id": "19_8877713329814903092", "text": "\"line\"><span> // 此时还未挂载，或此元素已经被卸载(例如通过 v-if 控制)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>})<span><span><code><pre><div><p>也可参考：<a href=\"/guide/typescript/composition-api.html#typing-template-refs\">为模板引用标注类型<a> <p><div><h2 id=\"ref-on-component\">组件上的 ref <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#ref-on-component\">​<a><h2><blockquote><p>这一小节假设你已了解<a href=\"/guide/essentials/component-basics.html\">组件<a>的相关知识，或者你也可以先跳过这里，之后再回来看。<p><blockquote><p>模板引用也可以被用在一个子组件上。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/template-refs.html", "title": "模板引用", "doc_id": "d311304389cf40309581ad60643e7774", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 925, "chunk_index": 19, "_doc_id": "19_8877713329814903092"}}
{"doc_id": "20_7393005561386737394", "text": "/essentials/component-basics.html\">组件<a>的相关知识，或者你也可以先跳过这里，之后再回来看。<p><blockquote><p>模板引用也可以被用在一个子组件上。这种情况下引用中获得的值是组件实例：<p><div class=\"composition-api\"><div class=\"language-vue\"> <span class=\"lang\">vue<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>script<span><span> setup<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>import<span><span> { useTemplateRef, onMounted } <span><span>from<span><span> 'vue'<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/template-refs.html", "title": "模板引用", "doc_id": "d311304389cf40309581ad60643e7774", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 925, "chunk_index": 20, "_doc_id": "20_7393005561386737394"}}
{"doc_id": "21_2944999607223077702", "text": "pan>import<span><span> { useTemplateRef, onMounted } <span><span>from<span><span> 'vue'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>import<span><span> Child <span><span>from<span><span> './Child.vue'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> childRef<span><span> =<span><span> useTemplateRef<span><span>(<span><span>'child'<span><span>)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>onMounted<span><span>(() <span><span>=><span><span> {<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/template-refs.html", "title": "模板引用", "doc_id": "d311304389cf40309581ad60643e7774", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 925, "chunk_index": 21, "_doc_id": "21_2944999607223077702"}}
{"doc_id": "22_1228885406994679395", "text": "\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>onMounted<span><span>(() <span><span>=><span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // childRef.value 将持有 <Child /> 的实例<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>})<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>script<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>Child<span><span> ref<span><span>=<span><span>\"child\"<span><span> /><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/template-refs.html", "title": "模板引用", "doc_id": "d311304389cf40309581ad60643e7774", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 925, "chunk_index": 22, "_doc_id": "22_1228885406994679395"}}
{"doc_id": "23_6305521678126847044", "text": "span> <<span><span>Child<span><span> ref<span><span>=<span><span>\"child\"<span><span> /><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div> 3.5 前的用法 <div class=\"language-vue\"> <span class=\"lang\">vue<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>script<span><span> setup<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>import<span><span> { ref, onMounted } <span><span>from<span><span> 'vue'<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/template-refs.html", "title": "模板引用", "doc_id": "d311304389cf40309581ad60643e7774", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 925, "chunk_index": 23, "_doc_id": "23_6305521678126847044"}}
{"doc_id": "24_1608721402355882770", "text": "s=\"line\"><span>import<span><span> { ref, onMounted } <span><span>from<span><span> 'vue'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>import<span><span> Child <span><span>from<span><span> './Child.vue'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> child<span><span> =<span><span> ref<span><span>(<span><span>null<span><span>)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>onMounted<span><span>(() <span><span>=><span><span> {<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/template-refs.html", "title": "模板引用", "doc_id": "d311304389cf40309581ad60643e7774", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 925, "chunk_index": 24, "_doc_id": "24_1608721402355882770"}}
{"doc_id": "25_8528033438982621577", "text": "\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>onMounted<span><span>(() <span><span>=><span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // child.value 是 <Child /> 组件的实例<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>})<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>script<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>Child<span><span> ref<span><span>=<span><span>\"child\"<span><span> /><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/template-refs.html", "title": "模板引用", "doc_id": "d311304389cf40309581ad60643e7774", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 925, "chunk_index": 25, "_doc_id": "25_8528033438982621577"}}
{"doc_id": "26_7555544021447752757", "text": "span> <<span><span>Child<span><span> ref<span><span>=<span><span>\"child\"<span><span> /><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div> <div><div class=\"options-api\"><div class=\"language-vue\"> <span class=\"lang\">vue<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>script<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>import<span><span> Child <span><span>from<span><span> './Child.vue'<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/template-refs.html", "title": "模板引用", "doc_id": "d311304389cf40309581ad60643e7774", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 925, "chunk_index": 26, "_doc_id": "26_7555544021447752757"}}
{"doc_id": "27_190338742469244308", "text": "class=\"line\"><span>import<span><span> Child <span><span>from<span><span> './Child.vue'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> components: {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> Child<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> },<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> mounted<span><span>() {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // this.$refs.child 是 <Child /> 组件的实例<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/template-refs.html", "title": "模板引用", "doc_id": "d311304389cf40309581ad60643e7774", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 925, "chunk_index": 27, "_doc_id": "27_190338742469244308"}}
{"doc_id": "28_2345784413418720738", "text": "><span>() {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // this.$refs.child 是 <Child /> 组件的实例<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>script<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>Child<span><span> ref<span><span>=<span><span>\"child\"<span><span> /><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/template-refs.html", "title": "模板引用", "doc_id": "d311304389cf40309581ad60643e7774", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 925, "chunk_index": 28, "_doc_id": "28_2345784413418720738"}}
{"doc_id": "29_6567584932432339805", "text": "span> <<span><span>Child<span><span> ref<span><span>=<span><span>\"child\"<span><span> /><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><div><p>如果一个子组件使用的是选项式 API <span class=\"composition-api\">或没有使用 <code><script setup><code><span>，被引用的组件实例和该子组件的 <code>this<code> 完全一致，这意味着父组件对子组件的每一个属性和方法都有完全的访问权。这使得在父组件和子组件之间创建紧密耦合的实现细节变得很容易，当然也因此，应该只在绝对需要时才使用组件引用。大多数情况下，你应该首先使用标准的 props 和 emit 接口来实现父子组件交互。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/template-refs.html", "title": "模板引用", "doc_id": "d311304389cf40309581ad60643e7774", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 925, "chunk_index": 29, "_doc_id": "29_6567584932432339805"}}
{"doc_id": "30_5136024892768308137", "text": "访问权。这使得在父组件和子组件之间创建紧密耦合的实现细节变得很容易，当然也因此，应该只在绝对需要时才使用组件引用。大多数情况下，你应该首先使用标准的 props 和 emit 接口来实现父子组件交互。<p><div class=\"composition-api\"><p>有一个例外的情况，使用了 <code><script setup><code> 的组件是<strong>默认私有<strong>的：一个父组件无法访问到一个使用了 <code><script setup><code> 的子组件中的任何东西，除非子组件在其中通过 <code>defineExpose<code> 宏显式暴露：<p><div class=\"language-vue\"> <span class=\"lang\">vue<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>script<span><span> setup<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/template-refs.html", "title": "模板引用", "doc_id": "d311304389cf40309581ad60643e7774", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 925, "chunk_index": 30, "_doc_id": "30_5136024892768308137"}}
{"doc_id": "31_4850490497595138759", "text": "code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>script<span><span> setup<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>import<span><span> { ref } <span><span>from<span><span> 'vue'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> a<span><span> =<span><span> 1<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> b<span><span> =<span><span> ref<span><span>(<span><span>2<span><span>)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/template-refs.html", "title": "模板引用", "doc_id": "d311304389cf40309581ad60643e7774", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 925, "chunk_index": 31, "_doc_id": "31_4850490497595138759"}}
{"doc_id": "32_1497452430151904097", "text": "pan> =<span><span> ref<span><span>(<span><span>2<span><span>)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 像 defineExpose 这样的编译器宏不需要导入<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>defineExpose<span><span>({<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> a,<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> b<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>})<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/template-refs.html", "title": "模板引用", "doc_id": "d311304389cf40309581ad60643e7774", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 925, "chunk_index": 32, "_doc_id": "32_1497452430151904097"}}
{"doc_id": "33_2772685774520691488", "text": "pan> a,<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> b<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>})<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>script<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>当父组件通过模板引用获取到了该组件的实例时，得到的实例类型为 <code>{ a: number, b: number }<code> (ref 都会自动解包，和一般的实例一样)。<p><p>请注意，defineExpose 必须在任何 await 操作之前调用。否则，在 await 操作后暴露的属性和方法将无法访问。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/template-refs.html", "title": "模板引用", "doc_id": "d311304389cf40309581ad60643e7774", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 925, "chunk_index": 33, "_doc_id": "33_2772685774520691488"}}
{"doc_id": "34_4220225756000211027", "text": "}<code> (ref 都会自动解包，和一般的实例一样)。<p><p>请注意，defineExpose 必须在任何 await 操作之前调用。否则，在 await 操作后暴露的属性和方法将无法访问。<p><p>TypeScript 用户请参考：<a href=\"/guide/typescript/composition-api.html#typing-component-template-refs\">为组件的模板引用标注类型<a> <p><div><div class=\"options-api\"><p><code>expose<code> 选项可以用于限制对子组件实例的访问：<p><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/template-refs.html", "title": "模板引用", "doc_id": "d311304389cf40309581ad60643e7774", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 925, "chunk_index": 34, "_doc_id": "34_4220225756000211027"}}
{"doc_id": "35_5602341708941451104", "text": "b-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> expose: [<span><span>'publicData'<span><span>, <span><span>'publicMethod'<span><span>],<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> data<span><span>() {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> return<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> publicData: <span><span>'foo'<span><span>,<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> privateData: <span><span>'bar'<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/template-refs.html", "title": "模板引用", "doc_id": "d311304389cf40309581ad60643e7774", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 925, "chunk_index": 35, "_doc_id": "35_5602341708941451104"}}
{"doc_id": "36_6708111039339802615", "text": "'foo'<span><span>,<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> privateData: <span><span>'bar'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> },<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> methods: {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> publicMethod<span><span>() {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> /* ... */<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> },<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> privateMethod<span><span>() {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> /* ... */<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/template-refs.html", "title": "模板引用", "doc_id": "d311304389cf40309581ad60643e7774", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 925, "chunk_index": 36, "_doc_id": "36_6708111039339802615"}}
{"doc_id": "37_1770938288881547423", "text": "e\"><span> privateMethod<span><span>() {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> /* ... */<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span><code><pre><div><p>在上面这个例子中，父组件通过模板引用访问到子组件实例后，仅能访问 <code>publicData<code> 和 <code>publicMethod<code>。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/template-refs.html", "title": "模板引用", "doc_id": "d311304389cf40309581ad60643e7774", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 925, "chunk_index": 37, "_doc_id": "37_1770938288881547423"}}
{"doc_id": "38_7484938618139072895", "text": "ode><pre><div><p>在上面这个例子中，父组件通过模板引用访问到子组件实例后，仅能访问 <code>publicData<code> 和 <code>publicMethod<code>。<p><div><h2 id=\"refs-inside-v-for\"><code>v-for<code> 中的模板引用 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#refs-inside-v-for\">​<a><h2><blockquote><p>需要 v3.5 及以上版本<p><blockquote><div class=\"composition-api\"><p>当在 <code>v-for<code> 中使用模板引用时，对应的 ref 中包含的值是一个数组，它将在元素被挂载后包含对应整个列表的所有元素：<p><div class=\"language-vue\"> <span class=\"lang\">vue<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>script<span><span> setup<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/template-refs.html", "title": "模板引用", "doc_id": "d311304389cf40309581ad60643e7774", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 925, "chunk_index": 38, "_doc_id": "38_7484938618139072895"}}
{"doc_id": "39_3903938335479349421", "text": "code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>script<span><span> setup<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>import<span><span> { ref, useTemplateRef, onMounted } <span><span>from<span><span> 'vue'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> list<span><span> =<span><span> ref<span><span>([<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> /* ... */<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>])<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/template-refs.html", "title": "模板引用", "doc_id": "d311304389cf40309581ad60643e7774", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 925, "chunk_index": 39, "_doc_id": "39_3903938335479349421"}}
{"doc_id": "40_3519094215605743630", "text": "ine\"><span> /* ... */<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>])<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> itemRefs<span><span> =<span><span> useTemplateRef<span><span>(<span><span>'items'<span><span>)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>onMounted<span><span>(() <span><span>=><span><span> console.<span><span>log<span><span>(itemRefs.value))<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>script<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/template-refs.html", "title": "模板引用", "doc_id": "d311304389cf40309581ad60643e7774", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 925, "chunk_index": 40, "_doc_id": "40_3519094215605743630"}}
{"doc_id": "41_4422625751181675986", "text": "itemRefs.value))<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>script<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>ul<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>li<span><span> v-for<span><span>=<span><span>\"item in list\"<span><span> ref<span><span>=<span><span>\"items\"<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> {{ item }}<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/template-refs.html", "title": "模板引用", "doc_id": "d311304389cf40309581ad60643e7774", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 925, "chunk_index": 41, "_doc_id": "41_4422625751181675986"}}
