{"doc_id": "52_265968043857177190", "text": "n>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>script<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>ul<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>li<span><span> v-for<span><span>=<span><span>\"item in list\"<span><span> ref<span><span>=<span><span>\"items\"<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> {{ item }}<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/template-refs.html", "title": "模板引用", "doc_id": "d311304389cf40309581ad60643e7774", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 925, "chunk_index": 52, "_doc_id": "52_265968043857177190"}}
{"doc_id": "53_8087377693721382942", "text": "span>=<span><span>\"items\"<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> {{ item }}<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> </<span><span>li<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> </<span><span>ul<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/template-refs.html", "title": "模板引用", "doc_id": "d311304389cf40309581ad60643e7774", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 925, "chunk_index": 53, "_doc_id": "53_8087377693721382942"}}
{"doc_id": "54_1405660041175631961", "text": "pan>li<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> </<span><span>ul<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p><a href=\"https://play.vuejs.org/#eNpFjk0KwjAQha/yCC4Uaou6kyp4DuOi2KkGYhKSiQildzdNa4WQmTc/37xeXJwr35HEUdTh7pXjszT0cdYzWuqaqBm9NEDbcLPeTDngiaM3PwVoFfiI667AvsDhNpWHMQzF+L9sNEztH3C3JlhNpbaPNT9VKFeeulAqplfY5D1p0qurxVQSqel0w5QUUEedY8q0wnvbWX+SYgRAmWxIiuSzm4tBinkc6HvkuSE7TIBKq4lZZWhdLZfE8AWp4l3T\" target=\"_blank\">在演练场中尝试一下<a><p><div><p>应该注意的是，ref 数组<strong>并不<strong>保证与源数组相同的顺序。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/template-refs.html", "title": "模板引用", "doc_id": "d311304389cf40309581ad60643e7774", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 925, "chunk_index": 54, "_doc_id": "54_1405660041175631961"}}
{"doc_id": "55_2727669934334012265", "text": "ZWhdLZfE8AWp4l3T\" target=\"_blank\">在演练场中尝试一下<a><p><div><p>应该注意的是，ref 数组<strong>并不<strong>保证与源数组相同的顺序。<p><h2 id=\"function-refs\">函数模板引用 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#function-refs\">​<a><h2><p>除了使用字符串值作名字，<code>ref<code> attribute 还可以绑定为一个函数，会在每次组件更新时都被调用。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/template-refs.html", "title": "模板引用", "doc_id": "d311304389cf40309581ad60643e7774", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 925, "chunk_index": 55, "_doc_id": "55_2727669934334012265"}}
{"doc_id": "56_1638871132634877798", "text": "or\" href=\"#function-refs\">​<a><h2><p>除了使用字符串值作名字，<code>ref<code> attribute 还可以绑定为一个函数，会在每次组件更新时都被调用。该函数会收到元素引用作为其第一个参数：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>input<span><span> :<span><span>ref<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>(<span><span>el<span><span>) <span><span>=><span><span> { <span><span>/* 将 el 赋值给一个数据属性或 ref 变量 */<span><span> }<span><span>\"<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>注意我们这里需要使用动态的 <code>:ref<code> 绑定才能够传入一个函数。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/template-refs.html", "title": "模板引用", "doc_id": "d311304389cf40309581ad60643e7774", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 925, "chunk_index": 56, "_doc_id": "56_1638871132634877798"}}
{"doc_id": "57_47437118997647339", "text": "<span><span>\"<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>注意我们这里需要使用动态的 <code>:ref<code> 绑定才能够传入一个函数。当绑定的元素被卸载时，函数也会被调用一次，此时的 <code>el<code> 参数会是 <code>null<code>。你当然也可以绑定一个组件方法而不是内联函数。<p><div><div>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/template-refs.html", "title": "模板引用", "doc_id": "d311304389cf40309581ad60643e7774", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 925, "chunk_index": 57, "_doc_id": "57_47437118997647339"}}
{"doc_id": "0_5105222090429891315", "text": "<div><div><h1 id=\"fallthrough-attributes\">透传 Attributes <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#fallthrough-attributes\">​<a><h1><blockquote><p>此章节假设你已经看过了<a href=\"/guide/essentials/component-basics.html\">组件基础<a>。若你还不了解组件是什么，请先阅读该章节。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/attrs.html", "title": "透传 Attributes", "doc_id": "c3d75f94dbd14a788a3a93991feec5d8", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 473, "chunk_index": 0, "_doc_id": "0_5105222090429891315"}}
{"doc_id": "1_2271079055195421513", "text": "ckquote><p>此章节假设你已经看过了<a href=\"/guide/essentials/component-basics.html\">组件基础<a>。若你还不了解组件是什么，请先阅读该章节。<p><blockquote><h2 id=\"attribute-inheritance\">Attributes 继承 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#attribute-inheritance\">​<a><h2><p>“透传 attribute”指的是传递给一个组件，却没有被该组件声明为 <a href=\"./props.html\">props<a> 或 <a href=\"./events.html#defining-custom-events\">emits<a> 的 attribute 或者 <code>v-on<code> 事件监听器。最常见的例子就是 <code>class<code>、<code>style<code> 和 <code>id<code>。<p><p>当一个组件以单个元素为根作渲染时，透传的 attribute 会自动被添加到根元素上。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/attrs.html", "title": "透传 Attributes", "doc_id": "c3d75f94dbd14a788a3a93991feec5d8", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 473, "chunk_index": 1, "_doc_id": "1_2271079055195421513"}}
{"doc_id": "2_3312899051460455927", "text": "ode>class<code>、<code>style<code> 和 <code>id<code>。<p><p>当一个组件以单个元素为根作渲染时，透传的 attribute 会自动被添加到根元素上。举例来说，假如我们有一个 <code><MyButton><code> 组件，它的模板长这样：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><!-- <MyButton> 的模板 --><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>button<span><span>>Click Me</<span><span>button<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>一个父组件使用了这个组件，并且传入了 <code>class<code>：<p><div", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/attrs.html", "title": "透传 Attributes", "doc_id": "c3d75f94dbd14a788a3a93991feec5d8", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 473, "chunk_index": 2, "_doc_id": "2_3312899051460455927"}}
{"doc_id": "3_3139694658375780992", "text": "span>button<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>一个父组件使用了这个组件，并且传入了 <code>class<code>：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>MyButton<span><span> class<span><span>=<span><span>\"large\"<span><span> /><span><span><code><pre><div><p>最后渲染出的 DOM 结果是：<p><div class=\"language-html\"> <span class=\"lang\">html<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/attrs.html", "title": "透传 Attributes", "doc_id": "c3d75f94dbd14a788a3a93991feec5d8", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 473, "chunk_index": 3, "_doc_id": "3_3139694658375780992"}}
{"doc_id": "4_8589871266512320090", "text": "ss=\"language-html\"> <span class=\"lang\">html<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>button<span><span> class<span><span>=<span><span>\"large\"<span><span>>Click Me</<span><span>button<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>这里，<code><MyButton><code> 并没有将 <code>class<code> 声明为一个它所接受的 prop，所以 <code>class<code> 被视作透传 attribute，自动透传到了 <code><MyButton><code> 的根元素上。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/attrs.html", "title": "透传 Attributes", "doc_id": "c3d75f94dbd14a788a3a93991feec5d8", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 473, "chunk_index": 4, "_doc_id": "4_8589871266512320090"}}
{"doc_id": "5_8892247353788233203", "text": "lass<code> 声明为一个它所接受的 prop，所以 <code>class<code> 被视作透传 attribute，自动透传到了 <code><MyButton><code> 的根元素上。<p><h3 id=\"class-and-style-merging\">对 <code>class<code> 和 <code>style<code> 的合并 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#class-and-style-merging\">​<a><h3><p>如果一个子组件的根元素已经有了 <code>class<code> 或 <code>style<code> attribute，它会和从父组件上继承的值合并。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/attrs.html", "title": "透传 Attributes", "doc_id": "c3d75f94dbd14a788a3a93991feec5d8", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 473, "chunk_index": 5, "_doc_id": "5_8892247353788233203"}}
{"doc_id": "6_846907709151754657", "text": "-merging\">​<a><h3><p>如果一个子组件的根元素已经有了 <code>class<code> 或 <code>style<code> attribute，它会和从父组件上继承的值合并。如果我们将之前的 <code><MyButton><code> 组件的模板改成这样：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><!-- <MyButton> 的模板 --><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>button<span><span> class<span><span>=<span><span>\"btn\"<span><span>>Click Me</<span><span>button<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>则最后渲染出的 DOM", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/attrs.html", "title": "透传 Attributes", "doc_id": "c3d75f94dbd14a788a3a93991feec5d8", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 473, "chunk_index": 6, "_doc_id": "6_846907709151754657"}}
{"doc_id": "7_8365172332295209131", "text": "tn\"<span><span>>Click Me</<span><span>button<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>则最后渲染出的 DOM 结果会变成：<p><div class=\"language-html\"> <span class=\"lang\">html<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>button<span><span> class<span><span>=<span><span>\"btn large\"<span><span>>Click Me</<span><span>button<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><h3 id=\"v-on-listener-inheritance\"><code>v-on<code> 监听器继承 <a class=\"header-anchor\"", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/attrs.html", "title": "透传 Attributes", "doc_id": "c3d75f94dbd14a788a3a93991feec5d8", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 473, "chunk_index": 7, "_doc_id": "7_8365172332295209131"}}
{"doc_id": "8_6679375095439147088", "text": "><code><pre><div><h3 id=\"v-on-listener-inheritance\"><code>v-on<code> 监听器继承 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#v-on-listener-inheritance\">​<a><h3><p>同样的规则也适用于 <code>v-on<code> 事件监听器：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>MyButton<span><span> @<span><span>click<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>onClick<span><span>\"<span><span> /><span><span><code><pre><div><p><code>click<code> 监听器会被添加到", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/attrs.html", "title": "透传 Attributes", "doc_id": "c3d75f94dbd14a788a3a93991feec5d8", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 473, "chunk_index": 8, "_doc_id": "8_6679375095439147088"}}
{"doc_id": "9_7869079609280438397", "text": "><span>onClick<span><span>\"<span><span> /><span><span><code><pre><div><p><code>click<code> 监听器会被添加到 <code><MyButton><code> 的根元素，即那个原生的 <code><button><code> 元素之上。当原生的 <code><button><code> 被点击，会触发父组件的 <code>onClick<code> 方法。同样的，如果原生 <code>button<code> 元素自身也通过 <code>v-on<code> 绑定了一个事件监听器，则这个监听器和从父组件继承的监听器都会被触发。<p><h3 id=\"nested-component-inheritance\">深层组件继承 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#nested-component-inheritance\">​<a><h3><p>有些情况下一个组件会在根节点上渲染另一个组件。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/attrs.html", "title": "透传 Attributes", "doc_id": "c3d75f94dbd14a788a3a93991feec5d8", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 473, "chunk_index": 9, "_doc_id": "9_7869079609280438397"}}
{"doc_id": "10_6544917143067507986", "text": "件继承 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#nested-component-inheritance\">​<a><h3><p>有些情况下一个组件会在根节点上渲染另一个组件。例如，我们重构一下 <code><MyButton><code>，让它在根节点上渲染 <code><BaseButton><code>：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><!-- <MyButton/> 的模板，只是渲染另一个组件 --><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/attrs.html", "title": "透传 Attributes", "doc_id": "c3d75f94dbd14a788a3a93991feec5d8", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 473, "chunk_index": 10, "_doc_id": "10_6544917143067507986"}}
{"doc_id": "11_3285946623720870267", "text": "github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><!-- <MyButton/> 的模板，只是渲染另一个组件 --><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>BaseButton<span><span> /><span><span><code><pre><div><p>此时 <code><MyButton><code> 接收的透传 attribute 会直接继续传给 <code><BaseButton><code>。<p><p>请注意：<p><ol><li><p>透传的 attribute 不会包含 <code><MyButton><code> 上声明过的 props 或是针对 <code>emits<code> 声明事件的 <code>v-on<code> 侦听函数，换句话说，声明过的 props 和侦听函数被 <code><MyButton><code>“消费”了。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/attrs.html", "title": "透传 Attributes", "doc_id": "c3d75f94dbd14a788a3a93991feec5d8", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 473, "chunk_index": 11, "_doc_id": "11_3285946623720870267"}}
{"doc_id": "12_7307241838565645370", "text": "针对 <code>emits<code> 声明事件的 <code>v-on<code> 侦听函数，换句话说，声明过的 props 和侦听函数被 <code><MyButton><code>“消费”了。<p><li><li><p>透传的 attribute 若符合声明，也可以作为 props 传入 <code><BaseButton><code>。<p><li><ol><h2 id=\"disabling-attribute-inheritance\">禁用 Attributes 继承 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#disabling-attribute-inheritance\">​<a><h2><p>如果你<strong>不想要<strong>一个组件自动地继承 attribute，你可以在组件选项中设置 <code>inheritAttrs: false<code>。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/attrs.html", "title": "透传 Attributes", "doc_id": "c3d75f94dbd14a788a3a93991feec5d8", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 473, "chunk_index": 12, "_doc_id": "12_7307241838565645370"}}
{"doc_id": "13_8064180446144372461", "text": "e\">​<a><h2><p>如果你<strong>不想要<strong>一个组件自动地继承 attribute，你可以在组件选项中设置 <code>inheritAttrs: false<code>。<p><div class=\"composition-api\"><p>从 3.3 开始你也可以直接在 <code><script setup><code> 中使用 <a href=\"/api/sfc-script-setup.html#defineoptions\"><code>defineOptions<code><a>：<p><div class=\"language-vue\"> <span class=\"lang\">vue<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>script<span><span> setup<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/attrs.html", "title": "透传 Attributes", "doc_id": "c3d75f94dbd14a788a3a93991feec5d8", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 473, "chunk_index": 13, "_doc_id": "13_8064180446144372461"}}
{"doc_id": "14_7132622456940786187", "text": "code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>script<span><span> setup<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>defineOptions<span><span>({<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> inheritAttrs: <span><span>false<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>})<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// ...setup 逻辑<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>script<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><div><p>最常见的需要禁用 attribute 继承的场景就是 attribute 需要应用在根节点以外的其他元素上。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/attrs.html", "title": "透传 Attributes", "doc_id": "c3d75f94dbd14a788a3a93991feec5d8", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 473, "chunk_index": 14, "_doc_id": "14_7132622456940786187"}}
{"doc_id": "15_3253789116062425570", "text": "an><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><div><p>最常见的需要禁用 attribute 继承的场景就是 attribute 需要应用在根节点以外的其他元素上。通过设置 <code>inheritAttrs<code> 选项为 <code>false<code>，你可以完全控制透传进来的 attribute 被如何使用。<p><p>这些透传进来的 attribute 可以在模板的表达式中直接用 <code>$attrs<code> 访问到。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/attrs.html", "title": "透传 Attributes", "doc_id": "c3d75f94dbd14a788a3a93991feec5d8", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 473, "chunk_index": 15, "_doc_id": "15_3253789116062425570"}}
{"doc_id": "16_4764713083967151516", "text": "lse<code>，你可以完全控制透传进来的 attribute 被如何使用。<p><p>这些透传进来的 attribute 可以在模板的表达式中直接用 <code>$attrs<code> 访问到。<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>span<span><span>>Fallthrough attribute: {{ $attrs }}</<span><span>span<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>这个 <code>$attrs<code> 对象包含了除组件所声明的 <code>props<code> 和 <code>emits<code> 之外的所有其他 attribute，例如 <code>class<code>，<code>style<code>，<code>v-on<code> 监听器等等。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/attrs.html", "title": "透传 Attributes", "doc_id": "c3d75f94dbd14a788a3a93991feec5d8", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 473, "chunk_index": 16, "_doc_id": "16_4764713083967151516"}}
{"doc_id": "17_3360365578102973291", "text": "和 <code>emits<code> 之外的所有其他 attribute，例如 <code>class<code>，<code>style<code>，<code>v-on<code> 监听器等等。<p><p>有几点需要注意：<p><p>现在我们要再次使用一下<a href=\"#attribute-inheritance\">之前小节<a>中的 <code><MyButton><code> 组件例子。有时候我们可能为了样式，需要在 <code><button><code> 元素外包装一层 <code><div><code>：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>div<span><span> class<span><span>=<span><span>\"btn-wrapper\"<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/attrs.html", "title": "透传 Attributes", "doc_id": "c3d75f94dbd14a788a3a93991feec5d8", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 473, "chunk_index": 17, "_doc_id": "17_3360365578102973291"}}
{"doc_id": "18_1605757601373366819", "text": "n><<span><span>div<span><span> class<span><span>=<span><span>\"btn-wrapper\"<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>button<span><span> class<span><span>=<span><span>\"btn\"<span><span>>Click Me</<span><span>button<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>div<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>我们想要所有像 <code>class<code> 和 <code>v-on<code> 监听器这样的透传 attribute 都应用在内部的 <code><button><code> 上而不是外层的 <code><div><code> 上。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/attrs.html", "title": "透传 Attributes", "doc_id": "c3d75f94dbd14a788a3a93991feec5d8", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 473, "chunk_index": 18, "_doc_id": "18_1605757601373366819"}}
{"doc_id": "19_4035997978356348706", "text": "ode> 和 <code>v-on<code> 监听器这样的透传 attribute 都应用在内部的 <code><button><code> 上而不是外层的 <code><div><code> 上。我们可以通过设定 <code>inheritAttrs: false<code> 和使用 <code>v-bind=\"$attrs\"<code> 来实现：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>div<span><span> class<span><span>=<span><span>\"btn-wrapper\"<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/attrs.html", "title": "透传 Attributes", "doc_id": "c3d75f94dbd14a788a3a93991feec5d8", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 473, "chunk_index": 19, "_doc_id": "19_4035997978356348706"}}
{"doc_id": "20_6918965250354788266", "text": "n><<span><span>div<span><span> class<span><span>=<span><span>\"btn-wrapper\"<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line highlighted\"><span> <<span><span>button<span><span> class<span><span>=<span><span>\"btn\"<span><span> v-bind<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>$attrs<span><span>\"<span><span>>Click Me</<span><span>button<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/attrs.html", "title": "透传 Attributes", "doc_id": "c3d75f94dbd14a788a3a93991feec5d8", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 473, "chunk_index": 20, "_doc_id": "20_6918965250354788266"}}
{"doc_id": "21_1733263252071480182", "text": ">\"<span><span>$attrs<span><span>\"<span><span>>Click Me</<span><span>button<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>div<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>小提示：<a href=\"/guide/essentials/template-syntax.html#dynamically-binding-multiple-attributes\">没有参数的 <code>v-bind<code><a> 会将一个对象的所有属性都作为 attribute 应用到目标元素上。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/attrs.html", "title": "透传 Attributes", "doc_id": "c3d75f94dbd14a788a3a93991feec5d8", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 473, "chunk_index": 21, "_doc_id": "21_1733263252071480182"}}
{"doc_id": "22_5589928958333438088", "text": "amically-binding-multiple-attributes\">没有参数的 <code>v-bind<code><a> 会将一个对象的所有属性都作为 attribute 应用到目标元素上。<p><h2 id=\"attribute-inheritance-on-multiple-root-nodes\">多根节点的 Attributes 继承 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#attribute-inheritance-on-multiple-root-nodes\">​<a><h2><p>和单根节点组件有所不同，有着多个根节点的组件没有自动 attribute 透传行为。如果 <code>$attrs<code> 没有被显式绑定，将会抛出一个运行时警告。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/attrs.html", "title": "透传 Attributes", "doc_id": "c3d75f94dbd14a788a3a93991feec5d8", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 473, "chunk_index": 22, "_doc_id": "22_5589928958333438088"}}
{"doc_id": "23_3119916824940215524", "text": "des\">​<a><h2><p>和单根节点组件有所不同，有着多个根节点的组件没有自动 attribute 透传行为。如果 <code>$attrs<code> 没有被显式绑定，将会抛出一个运行时警告。<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>CustomLayout<span><span> id<span><span>=<span><span>\"custom-layout\"<span><span> @<span><span>click<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>changeValue<span><span>\"<span><span> /><span><span><code><pre><div><p>如果 <code><CustomLayout><code> 有下面这样的多根节点模板，由于 Vue 不知道要将 attribute 透传到哪里，所以会抛出一个警告。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/attrs.html", "title": "透传 Attributes", "doc_id": "c3d75f94dbd14a788a3a93991feec5d8", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 473, "chunk_index": 23, "_doc_id": "23_3119916824940215524"}}
{"doc_id": "24_2727602922100039867", "text": "code><pre><div><p>如果 <code><CustomLayout><code> 有下面这样的多根节点模板，由于 Vue 不知道要将 attribute 透传到哪里，所以会抛出一个警告。<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>header<span><span>>...</<span><span>header<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>main<span><span>>...</<span><span>main<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/attrs.html", "title": "透传 Attributes", "doc_id": "c3d75f94dbd14a788a3a93991feec5d8", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 473, "chunk_index": 24, "_doc_id": "24_2727602922100039867"}}
{"doc_id": "25_1277687099501042579", "text": "pan class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>main<span><span>>...</<span><span>main<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>footer<span><span>>...</<span><span>footer<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>如果 <code>$attrs<code> 被显式绑定，则不会有警告：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>header<span><span>>...</<span><span>header<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/attrs.html", "title": "透传 Attributes", "doc_id": "c3d75f94dbd14a788a3a93991feec5d8", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 473, "chunk_index": 25, "_doc_id": "25_1277687099501042579"}}
{"doc_id": "26_478576025250697038", "text": "class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>header<span><span>>...</<span><span>header<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line highlighted\"><span><<span><span>main<span><span> v-bind<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>$attrs<span><span>\"<span><span>>...</<span><span>main<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/attrs.html", "title": "透传 Attributes", "doc_id": "c3d75f94dbd14a788a3a93991feec5d8", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 473, "chunk_index": 26, "_doc_id": "26_478576025250697038"}}
{"doc_id": "27_1310929412612030375", "text": "n><span>\"<span><span>$attrs<span><span>\"<span><span>>...</<span><span>main<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>footer<span><span>>...</<span><span>footer<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><h2 id=\"accessing-fallthrough-attributes-in-javascript\">在 JavaScript 中访问透传 Attributes <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#accessing-fallthrough-attributes-in-javascript\">​<a><h2><div class=\"composition-api\"><p>如果需要，", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/attrs.html", "title": "透传 Attributes", "doc_id": "c3d75f94dbd14a788a3a93991feec5d8", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 473, "chunk_index": 27, "_doc_id": "27_1310929412612030375"}}
{"doc_id": "28_2375766932655020739", "text": "href=\"#accessing-fallthrough-attributes-in-javascript\">​<a><h2><div class=\"composition-api\"><p>如果需要，你可以在 <code><script setup><code> 中使用 <code>useAttrs()<code> API 来访问一个组件的所有透传 attribute：<p><div class=\"language-vue\"> <span class=\"lang\">vue<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>script<span><span> setup<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>import<span><span> { useAttrs } <span><span>from<span><span> 'vue'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/attrs.html", "title": "透传 Attributes", "doc_id": "c3d75f94dbd14a788a3a93991feec5d8", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 473, "chunk_index": 28, "_doc_id": "28_2375766932655020739"}}
{"doc_id": "29_3902334199975340889", "text": "t<span><span> { useAttrs } <span><span>from<span><span> 'vue'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> attrs<span><span> =<span><span> useAttrs<span><span>()<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/attrs.html", "title": "透传 Attributes", "doc_id": "c3d75f94dbd14a788a3a93991feec5d8", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 473, "chunk_index": 29, "_doc_id": "29_3902334199975340889"}}
{"doc_id": "30_2669635146763188430", "text": "s=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> attrs<span><span> =<span><span> useAttrs<span><span>()<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>script<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>如果没有使用 <code><script setup><code>，<code>attrs<code> 会作为 <code>setup()<code> 上下文对象的一个属性暴露：<p><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/attrs.html", "title": "透传 Attributes", "doc_id": "c3d75f94dbd14a788a3a93991feec5d8", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 473, "chunk_index": 30, "_doc_id": "30_2669635146763188430"}}
{"doc_id": "31_7275232369446233633", "text": "b-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> setup<span><span>(<span><span>props<span><span>, <span><span>ctx<span><span>) {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 透传 attribute 被暴露为 ctx.attrs<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> console.<span><span>log<span><span>(ctx.attrs)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/attrs.html", "title": "透传 Attributes", "doc_id": "c3d75f94dbd14a788a3a93991feec5d8", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 473, "chunk_index": 31, "_doc_id": "31_7275232369446233633"}}
{"doc_id": "32_5803736118797366", "text": "console.<span><span>log<span><span>(ctx.attrs)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span><code><pre><div><p>需要注意的是，虽然这里的 <code>attrs<code> 对象总是反映为最新的透传 attribute，但它并不是响应式的 (考虑到性能因素)。你不能通过侦听器去监听它的变化。如果你需要响应性，可以使用 prop。或者你也可以使用 <code>onUpdated()<code> 使得在每次更新时结合最新的 <code>attrs<code> 执行副作用。<p><div><div class=\"options-api\"><p>如果需要，你可以通过 <code>$attrs<code> 这个实例属性来访问组件的所有透传 attribute：<p><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/attrs.html", "title": "透传 Attributes", "doc_id": "c3d75f94dbd14a788a3a93991feec5d8", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 473, "chunk_index": 32, "_doc_id": "32_5803736118797366"}}
{"doc_id": "33_5152623560546120179", "text": "b-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> created<span><span>() {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> console.<span><span>log<span><span>(<span><span>this<span><span>.$attrs)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span><code><pre><div><div><div><div>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/attrs.html", "title": "透传 Attributes", "doc_id": "c3d75f94dbd14a788a3a93991feec5d8", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 473, "chunk_index": 33, "_doc_id": "33_5152623560546120179"}}
{"doc_id": "0_3341087903909421872", "text": "<div><div><h1 id=\"form-input-bindings\">表单输入绑定 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#form-input-bindings\">​<a><h1><p>在前端处理表单时，我们常常需要将表单输入框的内容同步给 JavaScript 中相应的变量。手动连接值绑定和更改事件监听器可能会很麻烦：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>input<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> :<span><span>value<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>text<span><span>\"<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/forms.html", "title": "表单输入绑定", "doc_id": "3e8b03474f3a4349a27d6b747b304e85", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 829, "chunk_index": 0, "_doc_id": "0_3341087903909421872"}}
{"doc_id": "1_3641339052302571928", "text": "\"line\"><span> :<span><span>value<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>text<span><span>\"<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> @<span><span>input<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>event<span><span> =><span><span> text <span><span>=<span><span> event.target.", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/forms.html", "title": "表单输入绑定", "doc_id": "3e8b03474f3a4349a27d6b747b304e85", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 829, "chunk_index": 1, "_doc_id": "1_3641339052302571928"}}
{"doc_id": "2_253875158273147579", "text": "pan><span>\"<span><span>event<span><span> =><span><span> text <span><span>=<span><span> event.target.value<span><span>\"<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p><code>v-model<code> 指令帮我们简化了这一步骤：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>input<span><span> v-model<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>text<span><span>\"<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>另外，<code>v-model<code> 还可以用于各种不同类型的输入，", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/forms.html", "title": "表单输入绑定", "doc_id": "3e8b03474f3a4349a27d6b747b304e85", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 829, "chunk_index": 2, "_doc_id": "2_253875158273147579"}}
{"doc_id": "3_1163447404215918813", "text": ">text<span><span>\"<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>另外，<code>v-model<code> 还可以用于各种不同类型的输入，<code><textarea><code>、<code><select><code> 元素。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/forms.html", "title": "表单输入绑定", "doc_id": "3e8b03474f3a4349a27d6b747b304e85", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 829, "chunk_index": 3, "_doc_id": "3_1163447404215918813"}}
{"doc_id": "4_7380933201847730474", "text": "e><pre><div><p>另外，<code>v-model<code> 还可以用于各种不同类型的输入，<code><textarea><code>、<code><select><code> 元素。它会根据所使用的元素自动使用对应的 DOM 属性和事件组合：<p><ul><li>文本类型的 <code><input><code> 和 <code><textarea><code> 元素会绑定 <code>value<code> property 并侦听 <code>input<code> 事件；<li><li><code><input type=\"checkbox\"><code> 和 <code><input type=\"radio\"><code> 会绑定 <code>checked<code> property 并侦听 <code>change<code> 事件；<li><li><code><select><code> 会绑定 <code>value<code> property 并侦听 <code>change<code> 事件。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/forms.html", "title": "表单输入绑定", "doc_id": "3e8b03474f3a4349a27d6b747b304e85", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 829, "chunk_index": 4, "_doc_id": "4_7380933201847730474"}}
{"doc_id": "5_5440706390359119007", "text": "ange<code> 事件；<li><li><code><select><code> 会绑定 <code>value<code> property 并侦听 <code>change<code> 事件。<li><ul><div class=\"tip custom-block\"><p class=\"custom-block-title\">注意<p><p><code>v-model<code> 会忽略任何表单元素上初始的 <code>value<code>、<code>checked<code> 或 <code>selected<code> attribute。它将始终将当前绑定的 JavaScript 状态视为数据的正确来源。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/forms.html", "title": "表单输入绑定", "doc_id": "3e8b03474f3a4349a27d6b747b304e85", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 829, "chunk_index": 5, "_doc_id": "5_5440706390359119007"}}
{"doc_id": "6_6424024299532887064", "text": ">value<code>、<code>checked<code> 或 <code>selected<code> attribute。它将始终将当前绑定的 JavaScript 状态视为数据的正确来源。你应该在 JavaScript 中使用<span class=\"options-api\"><a href=\"/api/options-state.html#data\"><code>data<code><a> 选项<span><span class=\"composition-api\"><a href=\"/api/reactivity-core.html#reactivity-api-core\">响应式系统的 API<a><span>来声明该初始值。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/forms.html", "title": "表单输入绑定", "doc_id": "3e8b03474f3a4349a27d6b747b304e85", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 829, "chunk_index": 6, "_doc_id": "6_6424024299532887064"}}
{"doc_id": "7_4777991693740135493", "text": "composition-api\"><a href=\"/api/reactivity-core.html#reactivity-api-core\">响应式系统的 API<a><span>来声明该初始值。<p><div><h2 id=\"basic-usage\">基本用法 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#basic-usage\">​<a><h2><h3 id=\"text\">文本 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#text\">​<a><h3><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>p<span><span>>Message is: {{ message }}</<span><span>p<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/forms.html", "title": "表单输入绑定", "doc_id": "3e8b03474f3a4349a27d6b747b304e85", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 829, "chunk_index": 7, "_doc_id": "7_4777991693740135493"}}
{"doc_id": "8_759306434887467502", "text": "><span><<span><span>p<span><span>>Message is: {{ message }}</<span><span>p<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>input<span><span> v-model<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>message<span><span>\"<span><span> placeholder<span><span>=<span><span>\"edit me\"<span><span> /><span><span><code><pre><div><p><span id=\"vmodel-ime-tip\"><span><p><div class=\"tip custom-block\"><p class=\"custom-block-title\">注意<p><p>对于需要使用 <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Input_method\" target=\"_blank\">IME<a> 的语言 (中文，日文和韩文等)，你会发现 <code>v-model<code> 不会在 IME 输入还在拼字阶段时触发更新。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/forms.html", "title": "表单输入绑定", "doc_id": "3e8b03474f3a4349a27d6b747b304e85", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 829, "chunk_index": 8, "_doc_id": "8_759306434887467502"}}
{"doc_id": "9_1322147664109379704", "text": "Input_method\" target=\"_blank\">IME<a> 的语言 (中文，日文和韩文等)，你会发现 <code>v-model<code> 不会在 IME 输入还在拼字阶段时触发更新。如果你的确想在拼字阶段也触发更新，请直接使用自己的 <code>input<code> 事件监听器和 <code>value<code> 绑定而不要使用 <code>v-model<code>。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/forms.html", "title": "表单输入绑定", "doc_id": "3e8b03474f3a4349a27d6b747b304e85", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 829, "chunk_index": 9, "_doc_id": "9_1322147664109379704"}}
{"doc_id": "10_6324349659645685497", "text": "更新。如果你的确想在拼字阶段也触发更新，请直接使用自己的 <code>input<code> 事件监听器和 <code>value<code> 绑定而不要使用 <code>v-model<code>。<p><div><h3 id=\"multiline-text\">多行文本 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#multiline-text\">​<a><h3><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>span<span><span>>Multiline message is:</<span><span>span<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/forms.html", "title": "表单输入绑定", "doc_id": "3e8b03474f3a4349a27d6b747b304e85", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 829, "chunk_index": 10, "_doc_id": "10_6324349659645685497"}}
{"doc_id": "11_8910197174079951738", "text": "span><<span><span>span<span><span>>Multiline message is:</<span><span>span<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>p<span><span> style<span><span>=<span><span>\"white-space: pre-line;\"<span><span>>{{ message }}</<span><span>p<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/forms.html", "title": "表单输入绑定", "doc_id": "3e8b03474f3a4349a27d6b747b304e85", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 829, "chunk_index": 11, "_doc_id": "11_8910197174079951738"}}
{"doc_id": "12_123509372482692920", "text": "an><span>\"white-space: pre-line;\"<span><span>>{{ message }}</<span><span>p<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>textarea<span><span> v-model<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>message<span><span>\"<span><span> placeholder<span><span>=<span><span>\"add multiple lines\"<span><span>></<span><span>textarea<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>注意在 <code><textarea><code> 中是不支持插值表达式的。请使用 <code>v-model<code> 来替代：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><!-- 错误 --><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/forms.html", "title": "表单输入绑定", "doc_id": "3e8b03474f3a4349a27d6b747b304e85", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 829, "chunk_index": 12, "_doc_id": "12_123509372482692920"}}
{"doc_id": "13_2794453302303288055", "text": "<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><!-- 错误 --><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>textarea<span><span>>{{ text }}</<span><span>textarea<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><!-- 正确 --><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/forms.html", "title": "表单输入绑定", "doc_id": "3e8b03474f3a4349a27d6b747b304e85", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 829, "chunk_index": 13, "_doc_id": "13_2794453302303288055"}}
