{"doc_id": "30_3321598845804203235", "text": "><span> v-model<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>picked<span><span>\"<span><span> /><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>label<span><span> for<span><span>=<span><span>\"two\"<span><span>>Two</<span><span>label<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><h3 id=\"select\">选择器 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#select\">​<a><h3><p>单个选择器的示例如下：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>div<span><span>>Selected: {{ selected }}</<span><span>div<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/forms.html", "title": "表单输入绑定", "doc_id": "3e8b03474f3a4349a27d6b747b304e85", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 829, "chunk_index": 30, "_doc_id": "30_3321598845804203235"}}
{"doc_id": "31_3374216930659706604", "text": "pan><<span><span>div<span><span>>Selected: {{ selected }}</<span><span>div<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>select<span><span> v-model<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>selected<span><span>\"<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>option<span><span> disabled<span><span> value<span><span>=<span><span>\"\"<span><span>>Please select one</<span><span>option<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/forms.html", "title": "表单输入绑定", "doc_id": "3e8b03474f3a4349a27d6b747b304e85", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 829, "chunk_index": 31, "_doc_id": "31_3374216930659706604"}}
{"doc_id": "32_743078491789175591", "text": "an><span>=<span><span>\"\"<span><span>>Please select one</<span><span>option<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>option<span><span>>A</<span><span>option<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>option<span><span>>B</<span><span>option<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>option<span><span>>C</<span><span>option<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/forms.html", "title": "表单输入绑定", "doc_id": "3e8b03474f3a4349a27d6b747b304e85", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 829, "chunk_index": 32, "_doc_id": "32_743078491789175591"}}
{"doc_id": "33_8432758070995471387", "text": "class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>option<span><span>>C</<span><span>option<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>select<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><div class=\"demo\"><p>Selected: <p> Please select one A B C <div><div class=\"tip custom-block\"><p class=\"custom-block-title\">注意<p><p>如果 <code>v-model<code> 表达式的初始值不匹配任何一个选择项，<code><select><code> 元素会渲染成一个“未选择”的状态。在 iOS 上，这将导致用户无法选择第一项，因为 iOS 在这种情况下不会触发一个 change 事件。因此，我们建议提供一个空值的禁用选项，如上面的例子所示。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/forms.html", "title": "表单输入绑定", "doc_id": "3e8b03474f3a4349a27d6b747b304e85", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 829, "chunk_index": 33, "_doc_id": "33_8432758070995471387"}}
{"doc_id": "34_650154488897221132", "text": "e> 元素会渲染成一个“未选择”的状态。在 iOS 上，这将导致用户无法选择第一项，因为 iOS 在这种情况下不会触发一个 change 事件。因此，我们建议提供一个空值的禁用选项，如上面的例子所示。<p><div><p>多选 (值绑定到一个数组)：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>div<span><span>>Selected: {{ selected }}</<span><span>div<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/forms.html", "title": "表单输入绑定", "doc_id": "3e8b03474f3a4349a27d6b747b304e85", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 829, "chunk_index": 34, "_doc_id": "34_650154488897221132"}}
{"doc_id": "35_3888747318477279268", "text": "<span>>Selected: {{ selected }}</<span><span>div<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>select<span><span> v-model<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>selected<span><span>\"<span><span> multiple<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>option<span><span>>A</<span><span>option<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>option<span><span>>B</<span><span>option<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/forms.html", "title": "表单输入绑定", "doc_id": "3e8b03474f3a4349a27d6b747b304e85", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 829, "chunk_index": 35, "_doc_id": "35_3888747318477279268"}}
{"doc_id": "36_6590768242472941105", "text": "class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>option<span><span>>B</<span><span>option<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>option<span><span>>C</<span><span>option<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/forms.html", "title": "表单输入绑定", "doc_id": "3e8b03474f3a4349a27d6b747b304e85", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 829, "chunk_index": 36, "_doc_id": "36_6590768242472941105"}}
{"doc_id": "37_7069260846486435994", "text": "class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>option<span><span>>C</<span><span>option<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>select<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>选择器的选项可以使用 <code>v-for<code> 动态渲染：<p><div class=\"composition-api\"><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> selected<span><span> =<span><span> ref<span><span>(<span><span>'A'<span><span>)<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/forms.html", "title": "表单输入绑定", "doc_id": "3e8b03474f3a4349a27d6b747b304e85", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 829, "chunk_index": 37, "_doc_id": "37_7069260846486435994"}}
{"doc_id": "38_6950026605262869958", "text": "><span> selected<span><span> =<span><span> ref<span><span>(<span><span>'A'<span><span>)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> options<span><span> =<span><span> ref<span><span>([<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> { text: <span><span>'One'<span><span>, value: <span><span>'A'<span><span> },<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> { text: <span><span>'Two'<span><span>, value: <span><span>'B'<span><span> },<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/forms.html", "title": "表单输入绑定", "doc_id": "3e8b03474f3a4349a27d6b747b304e85", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 829, "chunk_index": 38, "_doc_id": "38_6950026605262869958"}}
{"doc_id": "39_9176076690874222921", "text": "ne\"><span> { text: <span><span>'Two'<span><span>, value: <span><span>'B'<span><span> },<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> { text: <span><span>'Three'<span><span>, value: <span><span>'C'<span><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>])<span><span><code><pre><div><div><div class=\"options-api\"><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/forms.html", "title": "表单输入绑定", "doc_id": "3e8b03474f3a4349a27d6b747b304e85", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 829, "chunk_index": 39, "_doc_id": "39_9176076690874222921"}}
{"doc_id": "40_3144969331778783017", "text": "b-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> data<span><span>() {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> return<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> selected: <span><span>'A'<span><span>,<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> options: [<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> { text: <span><span>'One'<span><span>, value: <span><span>'A'<span><span> },<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/forms.html", "title": "表单输入绑定", "doc_id": "3e8b03474f3a4349a27d6b747b304e85", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 829, "chunk_index": 40, "_doc_id": "40_3144969331778783017"}}
{"doc_id": "41_4661571960629542809", "text": "ne\"><span> { text: <span><span>'One'<span><span>, value: <span><span>'A'<span><span> },<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> { text: <span><span>'Two'<span><span>, value: <span><span>'B'<span><span> },<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> { text: <span><span>'Three'<span><span>, value: <span><span>'C'<span><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> ]<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/forms.html", "title": "表单输入绑定", "doc_id": "3e8b03474f3a4349a27d6b747b304e85", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 829, "chunk_index": 41, "_doc_id": "41_4661571960629542809"}}
{"doc_id": "42_44344638928604641", "text": "span> ]<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span><code><pre><div><div><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>div<span><span>>Selected: {{ selected }}</<span><span>div<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/forms.html", "title": "表单输入绑定", "doc_id": "3e8b03474f3a4349a27d6b747b304e85", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 829, "chunk_index": 42, "_doc_id": "42_44344638928604641"}}
{"doc_id": "43_6966802927717523347", "text": "<span>>Selected: {{ selected }}</<span><span>div<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>select<span><span> v-model<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>selected<span><span>\"<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/forms.html", "title": "表单输入绑定", "doc_id": "3e8b03474f3a4349a27d6b747b304e85", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 829, "chunk_index": 43, "_doc_id": "43_6966802927717523347"}}
{"doc_id": "44_2160236185762131872", "text": "><span> v-model<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>selected<span><span>\"<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>option<span><span> v-for<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>option <span><span>in<span><span> options<span><span>\"<span><span> :<span><span>value<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>option.value<span><span>\"<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> {{ option.text }}<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> </<span><span>option<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/forms.html", "title": "表单输入绑定", "doc_id": "3e8b03474f3a4349a27d6b747b304e85", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 829, "chunk_index": 44, "_doc_id": "44_2160236185762131872"}}
{"doc_id": "45_4625663533342611307", "text": "option.text }}<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> </<span><span>option<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>select<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><h2 id=\"value-bindings\">值绑定 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#value-bindings\">​<a><h2><p>对于单选按钮，复选框和选择器选项，<code>v-model<code> 绑定的值通常是静态的字符串 (或者对复选框是布尔值)：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><!-- `picked` 在被选择时是字符串 \"a\" --><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/forms.html", "title": "表单输入绑定", "doc_id": "3e8b03474f3a4349a27d6b747b304e85", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 829, "chunk_index": 45, "_doc_id": "45_4625663533342611307"}}
{"doc_id": "46_1491958996088587702", "text": "iki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><!-- `picked` 在被选择时是字符串 \"a\" --><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>input<span><span> type<span><span>=<span><span>\"radio\"<span><span> v-model<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>picked<span><span>\"<span><span> value<span><span>=<span><span>\"a\"<span><span> /><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><!-- `toggle` 只会为 true 或 false --><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/forms.html", "title": "表单输入绑定", "doc_id": "3e8b03474f3a4349a27d6b747b304e85", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 829, "chunk_index": 46, "_doc_id": "46_1491958996088587702"}}
{"doc_id": "47_1599337092932424995", "text": ">\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><!-- `toggle` 只会为 true 或 false --><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>input<span><span> type<span><span>=<span><span>\"checkbox\"<span><span> v-model<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>toggle<span><span>\"<span><span> /><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><!-- `selected` 在第一项被选中时为字符串 \"abc\" --><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/forms.html", "title": "表单输入绑定", "doc_id": "3e8b03474f3a4349a27d6b747b304e85", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 829, "chunk_index": 47, "_doc_id": "47_1599337092932424995"}}
{"doc_id": "48_4516899933937185165", "text": "pan class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><!-- `selected` 在第一项被选中时为字符串 \"abc\" --><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>select<span><span> v-model<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>selected<span><span>\"<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>option<span><span> value<span><span>=<span><span>\"abc\"<span><span>>ABC</<span><span>option<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/forms.html", "title": "表单输入绑定", "doc_id": "3e8b03474f3a4349a27d6b747b304e85", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 829, "chunk_index": 48, "_doc_id": "48_4516899933937185165"}}
{"doc_id": "49_4804816261872586231", "text": "n> value<span><span>=<span><span>\"abc\"<span><span>>ABC</<span><span>option<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>select<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>但有时我们可能希望将该值绑定到当前组件实例上的动态数据。这可以通过使用 <code>v-bind<code> 来实现。此外，使用 <code>v-bind<code> 还使我们可以将选项值绑定为非字符串的数据类型。<p><h3 id=\"checkbox-1\">复选框 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#checkbox-1\">​<a><h3><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>input<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/forms.html", "title": "表单输入绑定", "doc_id": "3e8b03474f3a4349a27d6b747b304e85", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 829, "chunk_index": 49, "_doc_id": "49_4804816261872586231"}}
{"doc_id": "50_5872471772621411940", "text": "pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>input<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> type<span><span>=<span><span>\"checkbox\"<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> v-model<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>toggle<span><span>\"<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> true-value<span><span>=<span><span>\"yes\"<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/forms.html", "title": "表单输入绑定", "doc_id": "3e8b03474f3a4349a27d6b747b304e85", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 829, "chunk_index": 50, "_doc_id": "50_5872471772621411940"}}
{"doc_id": "51_9038177686909214517", "text": "><span>\"<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> true-value<span><span>=<span><span>\"yes\"<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> false-value<span><span>=<span><span>\"no\"<span><span> /><span><span><code><pre><div><p><code>true-value<code> 和 <code>false-value<code> 是 Vue 特有的 attributes，仅支持和 <code>v-model<code> 配套使用。这里 <code>toggle<code> 属性的值会在选中时被设为 <code>'yes'<code>，取消选择时设为 <code>'no'<code>。你同样可以通过 <code>v-bind<code> 将其绑定为其他动态值：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>input<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/forms.html", "title": "表单输入绑定", "doc_id": "3e8b03474f3a4349a27d6b747b304e85", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 829, "chunk_index": 51, "_doc_id": "51_9038177686909214517"}}
{"doc_id": "52_8243531881666867414", "text": "pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>input<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> type<span><span>=<span><span>\"checkbox\"<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> v-model<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>toggle<span><span>\"<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> :<span><span>true-value<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>dynamicTrueValue<span><span>\"<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/forms.html", "title": "表单输入绑定", "doc_id": "3e8b03474f3a4349a27d6b747b304e85", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 829, "chunk_index": 52, "_doc_id": "52_8243531881666867414"}}
{"doc_id": "53_8392675714700886106", "text": "pan><span>true-value<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>dynamicTrueValue<span><span>\"<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> :<span><span>false-value<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>dynamicFalseValue<span><span>\"<span><span> /><span><span><code><pre><div><div class=\"tip custom-block\"><p class=\"custom-block-title\">提示<p><p><code>true-value<code> 和 <code>false-value<code> attributes 不会影响 <code>value<code> attribute，因为浏览器在表单提交时，并不会包含未选择的复选框。为了保证这两个值 (例如：“yes”和“no”) 的其中之一被表单提交，请使用单选按钮作为替代。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/forms.html", "title": "表单输入绑定", "doc_id": "3e8b03474f3a4349a27d6b747b304e85", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 829, "chunk_index": 53, "_doc_id": "53_8392675714700886106"}}
{"doc_id": "54_8599543601462879905", "text": "code>value<code> attribute，因为浏览器在表单提交时，并不会包含未选择的复选框。为了保证这两个值 (例如：“yes”和“no”) 的其中之一被表单提交，请使用单选按钮作为替代。<p><div><h3 id=\"radio-1\">单选按钮 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#radio-1\">​<a><h3><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>input<span><span> type<span><span>=<span><span>\"radio\"<span><span> v-model<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>pick<span><span>\"<span><span> :<span><span>value<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>first<span><span>\"<span><span> /><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/forms.html", "title": "表单输入绑定", "doc_id": "3e8b03474f3a4349a27d6b747b304e85", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 829, "chunk_index": 54, "_doc_id": "54_8599543601462879905"}}
{"doc_id": "55_8852398809463960548", "text": "span><span>value<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>first<span><span>\"<span><span> /><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>input<span><span> type<span><span>=<span><span>\"radio\"<span><span> v-model<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>pick<span><span>\"<span><span> :<span><span>value<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>second<span><span>\"<span><span> /><span><span><code><pre><div><p><code>pick<code> 会在第一个按钮选中时被设为 <code>first<code>，在第二个按钮选中时被设为 <code>second<code>。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/forms.html", "title": "表单输入绑定", "doc_id": "3e8b03474f3a4349a27d6b747b304e85", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 829, "chunk_index": 55, "_doc_id": "55_8852398809463960548"}}
{"doc_id": "56_6837825606629661804", "text": "<code><pre><div><p><code>pick<code> 会在第一个按钮选中时被设为 <code>first<code>，在第二个按钮选中时被设为 <code>second<code>。<p><h3 id=\"select-options-2\">选择器选项 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#select-options-2\">​<a><h3><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>select<span><span> v-model<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>selected<span><span>\"<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <!-- 内联对象字面量 --><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/forms.html", "title": "表单输入绑定", "doc_id": "3e8b03474f3a4349a27d6b747b304e85", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 829, "chunk_index": 56, "_doc_id": "56_6837825606629661804"}}
{"doc_id": "57_4187504005458726436", "text": "lected<span><span>\"<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <!-- 内联对象字面量 --><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>option<span><span> :<span><span>value<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>{ number: <span><span>123<span><span> }<span><span>\"<span><span>>123</<span><span>option<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/forms.html", "title": "表单输入绑定", "doc_id": "3e8b03474f3a4349a27d6b747b304e85", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 829, "chunk_index": 57, "_doc_id": "57_4187504005458726436"}}
{"doc_id": "58_4363163013300137991", "text": "n><span>123<span><span> }<span><span>\"<span><span>>123</<span><span>option<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>select<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p><code>v-model<code> 同样也支持非字符串类型的值绑定！在上面这个例子中，当某个选项被选中，<code>selected<code> 会被设为该对象字面量值 <code>{ number: 123 }<code>。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/forms.html", "title": "表单输入绑定", "doc_id": "3e8b03474f3a4349a27d6b747b304e85", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 829, "chunk_index": 58, "_doc_id": "58_4363163013300137991"}}
{"doc_id": "59_9222603496018571749", "text": "ode> 同样也支持非字符串类型的值绑定！在上面这个例子中，当某个选项被选中，<code>selected<code> 会被设为该对象字面量值 <code>{ number: 123 }<code>。<p><h2 id=\"modifiers\">修饰符 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#modifiers\">​<a><h2><h3 id=\"lazy\"><code>.lazy<code> <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#lazy\">​<a><h3><p>默认情况下，<code>v-model<code> 会在每次 <code>input<code> 事件后更新数据 (<a href=\"#vmodel-ime-tip\">IME 拼字阶段的状态<a>例外)。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/forms.html", "title": "表单输入绑定", "doc_id": "3e8b03474f3a4349a27d6b747b304e85", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 829, "chunk_index": 59, "_doc_id": "59_9222603496018571749"}}
{"doc_id": "60_9023995752819755318", "text": "情况下，<code>v-model<code> 会在每次 <code>input<code> 事件后更新数据 (<a href=\"#vmodel-ime-tip\">IME 拼字阶段的状态<a>例外)。你可以添加 <code>lazy<code> 修饰符来改为在每次 <code>change<code> 事件后更新数据：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><!-- 在 \"change\" 事件后同步更新而不是 \"input\" --><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/forms.html", "title": "表单输入绑定", "doc_id": "3e8b03474f3a4349a27d6b747b304e85", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 829, "chunk_index": 60, "_doc_id": "60_9023995752819755318"}}
{"doc_id": "61_5916603584711563678", "text": "hub-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><!-- 在 \"change\" 事件后同步更新而不是 \"input\" --><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>input<span><span> v-model<span><span>.<span><span>lazy<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>msg<span><span>\"<span><span> /><span><span><code><pre><div><h3 id=\"number\"><code>.number<code> <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#number\">​<a><h3><p>如果你想让用户输入自动转换为数字，", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/forms.html", "title": "表单输入绑定", "doc_id": "3e8b03474f3a4349a27d6b747b304e85", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 829, "chunk_index": 61, "_doc_id": "61_5916603584711563678"}}
{"doc_id": "62_1225263467570232425", "text": "id=\"number\"><code>.number<code> <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#number\">​<a><h3><p>如果你想让用户输入自动转换为数字，你可以在 <code>v-model<code> 后添加 <code>.number<code> 修饰符来管理输入：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>input<span><span> v-model<span><span>.<span><span>number<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>age<span><span>\"<span><span> /><span><span><code><pre><div><p>如果该值无法被 <code>parseFloat()<code> 处理，那么将返回原始值。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/forms.html", "title": "表单输入绑定", "doc_id": "3e8b03474f3a4349a27d6b747b304e85", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 829, "chunk_index": 62, "_doc_id": "62_1225263467570232425"}}
{"doc_id": "63_6944292010025734005", "text": "n><span>\"<span><span> /><span><span><code><pre><div><p>如果该值无法被 <code>parseFloat()<code> 处理，那么将返回原始值。特别是当输入为空时 (例如用户清空输入字段之后)，会返回一个空字符串。这种行为与 <a href=\"https://developer.mozilla.org/zh-CN/docs/Web/API/HTMLInputElement#valueasnumber\" target=\"_blank\">DOM 属性 valueAsNumber<a> 有所不同。<p><p><code>number<code> 修饰符会在输入框有 <code>type=\"number\"<code> 时自动启用。<p><h3 id=\"trim\"><code>.trim<code> <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#trim\">​<a><h3><p>如果你想要默认自动去除用户输入内容中两端的空格，", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/forms.html", "title": "表单输入绑定", "doc_id": "3e8b03474f3a4349a27d6b747b304e85", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 829, "chunk_index": 63, "_doc_id": "63_6944292010025734005"}}
{"doc_id": "64_1761929301982348985", "text": "d=\"trim\"><code>.trim<code> <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#trim\">​<a><h3><p>如果你想要默认自动去除用户输入内容中两端的空格，你可以在 <code>v-model<code> 后添加 <code>.trim<code> 修饰符：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>input<span><span> v-model<span><span>.<span><span>trim<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>msg<span><span>\"<span><span> /><span><span><code><pre><div><h2 id=\"v-model-with-components\">组件上的 <code>v-model<code> <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#v-model-with-components\">​<a><h2><blockquote><p>如果你还不熟悉 Vue 的组件，", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/forms.html", "title": "表单输入绑定", "doc_id": "3e8b03474f3a4349a27d6b747b304e85", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 829, "chunk_index": 64, "_doc_id": "64_1761929301982348985"}}
{"doc_id": "65_4759932296835725111", "text": "de> <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#v-model-with-components\">​<a><h2><blockquote><p>如果你还不熟悉 Vue 的组件，那么现在可以跳过这个部分。<p><blockquote><p>HTML 的内置表单输入类型并不总能满足所有需求。幸运的是，我们可以使用 Vue 构建具有自定义行为的可复用输入组件，并且这些输入组件也支持 <code>v-model<code>！要了解更多关于此的内容，请在组件指引中阅读<a href=\"/guide/components/v-model.html\">配合 <code>v-model<code> 使用<a>。<p><div><div>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/forms.html", "title": "表单输入绑定", "doc_id": "3e8b03474f3a4349a27d6b747b304e85", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 829, "chunk_index": 65, "_doc_id": "65_4759932296835725111"}}
{"doc_id": "0_2612167172246208728", "text": "<div><div><h1 id=\"slots\">插槽 Slots <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#slots\">​<a><h1><blockquote><p>此章节假设你已经看过了<a href=\"/guide/essentials/component-basics.html\">组件基础<a>。若你还不了解组件是什么，请先阅读该章节。<p><blockquote><h2 id=\"slot-content-and-outlet\">插槽内容与出口 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#slot-content-and-outlet\">​<a><h2><p>在之前的章节中，我们已经了解到组件能够接收任意类型的 JavaScript 值作为 props，但组件要如何接收模板内容呢？在某些场景中，我们可能想要为子组件传递一些模板片段，让子组件在它们的组件中渲染这些片段。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/slots.html", "title": "插槽 Slots", "doc_id": "ac000bac450b4f8b9f22a7775b89e8e8", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1189, "chunk_index": 0, "_doc_id": "0_2612167172246208728"}}
{"doc_id": "1_1820952586860339980", "text": "中，我们已经了解到组件能够接收任意类型的 JavaScript 值作为 props，但组件要如何接收模板内容呢？在某些场景中，我们可能想要为子组件传递一些模板片段，让子组件在它们的组件中渲染这些片段。<p><p>举例来说，这里有一个 <code><FancyButton><code> 组件，可以像这样使用：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>FancyButton<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line highlighted\"><span> Click me! <span><span><!-- 插槽内容 --><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/slots.html", "title": "插槽 Slots", "doc_id": "ac000bac450b4f8b9f22a7775b89e8e8", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1189, "chunk_index": 1, "_doc_id": "1_1820952586860339980"}}
{"doc_id": "2_5082987607370797357", "text": "><span><span>\n<span class=\"line highlighted\"><span> Click me! <span><span><!-- 插槽内容 --><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>FancyButton<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>而 <code><FancyButton><code> 的模板是这样的：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>button<span><span> class<span><span>=<span><span>\"fancy-btn\"<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/slots.html", "title": "插槽 Slots", "doc_id": "ac000bac450b4f8b9f22a7775b89e8e8", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1189, "chunk_index": 2, "_doc_id": "2_5082987607370797357"}}
{"doc_id": "3_3057525729266976668", "text": "><<span><span>button<span><span> class<span><span>=<span><span>\"fancy-btn\"<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line highlighted\"><span> <<span><span>slot<span><span>></<span><span>slot<span><span>> <span><span><!-- 插槽出口 --><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>button<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p><code><slot><code> 元素是一个<strong>插槽出口<strong> (slot outlet)，标示了父元素提供的<strong>插槽内容<strong> (slot content) 将在哪里被渲染。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/slots.html", "title": "插槽 Slots", "doc_id": "ac000bac450b4f8b9f22a7775b89e8e8", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1189, "chunk_index": 3, "_doc_id": "3_3057525729266976668"}}
{"doc_id": "4_7256300376872166431", "text": "<code> 元素是一个<strong>插槽出口<strong> (slot outlet)，标示了父元素提供的<strong>插槽内容<strong> (slot content) 将在哪里被渲染。<p><p> <p><p>最终渲染出的 DOM 是这样：<p><div class=\"language-html\"> <span class=\"lang\">html<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>button<span><span> class<span><span>=<span><span>\"fancy-btn\"<span><span>>Click me!</<span><span>button<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>通过使用插槽，<code><FancyButton><code> 仅负责渲染外层的 <code><button><code> (以及相应的样式)，而其内部的内容由父组件提供。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/slots.html", "title": "插槽 Slots", "doc_id": "ac000bac450b4f8b9f22a7775b89e8e8", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1189, "chunk_index": 4, "_doc_id": "4_7256300376872166431"}}
{"doc_id": "5_4662270320587612061", "text": "<pre><div><p>通过使用插槽，<code><FancyButton><code> 仅负责渲染外层的 <code><button><code> (以及相应的样式)，而其内部的内容由父组件提供。<p><p>理解插槽的另一种方式是和下面的 JavaScript 函数作类比，其概念是类似的：<p><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// 父元素传入插槽内容<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>FancyButton<span><span>(<span><span>'Click me!'<span><span>)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// FancyButton 在自己的模板中渲染插槽内容<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/slots.html", "title": "插槽 Slots", "doc_id": "ac000bac450b4f8b9f22a7775b89e8e8", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1189, "chunk_index": 5, "_doc_id": "5_4662270320587612061"}}
{"doc_id": "6_441024895909192690", "text": "><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// FancyButton 在自己的模板中渲染插槽内容<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>function<span><span> FancyButton<span><span>(<span><span>slotContent<span><span>) {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> return<span><span> `<button class=\"fancy-btn\"><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> ${<span><span>slotContent<span><span>}<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> </button>`<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/slots.html", "title": "插槽 Slots", "doc_id": "ac000bac450b4f8b9f22a7775b89e8e8", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1189, "chunk_index": 6, "_doc_id": "6_441024895909192690"}}
{"doc_id": "7_2521013449603793169", "text": "${<span><span>slotContent<span><span>}<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> </button>`<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span><code><pre><div><p>插槽内容可以是任意合法的模板内容，不局限于文本。例如我们可以传入多个元素，甚至是组件：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>FancyButton<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/slots.html", "title": "插槽 Slots", "doc_id": "ac000bac450b4f8b9f22a7775b89e8e8", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1189, "chunk_index": 7, "_doc_id": "7_2521013449603793169"}}
{"doc_id": "8_8463249108659257948", "text": "thub-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>FancyButton<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>span<span><span> style<span><span>=<span><span>\"color:red\"<span><span>>Click me!</<span><span>span<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>AwesomeIcon<span><span> name<span><span>=<span><span>\"plus\"<span><span> /><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/slots.html", "title": "插槽 Slots", "doc_id": "ac000bac450b4f8b9f22a7775b89e8e8", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1189, "chunk_index": 8, "_doc_id": "8_8463249108659257948"}}
{"doc_id": "9_5047478743245750948", "text": "<<span><span>AwesomeIcon<span><span> name<span><span>=<span><span>\"plus\"<span><span> /><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>FancyButton<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>通过使用插槽，<code><FancyButton><code> 组件更加灵活和具有可复用性。现在组件可以用在不同的地方渲染各异的内容，但同时还保证都具有相同的样式。<p><p>Vue 组件的插槽机制是受<a href=\"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/HTML/Element/slot\" target=\"_blank\">原生 Web Component <code><slot><code> 元素<a>的启发而诞生，同时还做了一些功能拓展，这些拓展的功能我们后面会学习到。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/slots.html", "title": "插槽 Slots", "doc_id": "ac000bac450b4f8b9f22a7775b89e8e8", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1189, "chunk_index": 9, "_doc_id": "9_5047478743245750948"}}
{"doc_id": "10_8218686546726675249", "text": "t/slot\" target=\"_blank\">原生 Web Component <code><slot><code> 元素<a>的启发而诞生，同时还做了一些功能拓展，这些拓展的功能我们后面会学习到。<p><h2 id=\"render-scope\">渲染作用域 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#render-scope\">​<a><h2><p>插槽内容可以访问到父组件的数据作用域，因为插槽内容本身是在父组件模板中定义的。举例来说：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>span<span><span>>{{ message }}</<span><span>span<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/slots.html", "title": "插槽 Slots", "doc_id": "ac000bac450b4f8b9f22a7775b89e8e8", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1189, "chunk_index": 10, "_doc_id": "10_8218686546726675249"}}
{"doc_id": "11_3772340381748381098", "text": "\"line\"><span><<span><span>span<span><span>>{{ message }}</<span><span>span<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>FancyButton<span><span>>{{ message }}</<span><span>FancyButton<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>这里的两个 <span><code>{{ message }}<code><span> 插值表达式渲染的内容都是一样的。<p><p>插槽内容<strong>无法访问<strong>子组件的数据。Vue 模板中的表达式只能访问其定义时所处的作用域，这和 JavaScript 的词法作用域规则是一致的。换言之：<p><blockquote><p>父组件模板中的表达式只能访问父组件的作用域；子组件模板中的表达式只能访问子组件的作用域。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/slots.html", "title": "插槽 Slots", "doc_id": "ac000bac450b4f8b9f22a7775b89e8e8", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1189, "chunk_index": 11, "_doc_id": "11_3772340381748381098"}}
{"doc_id": "12_2617403192001882382", "text": "所处的作用域，这和 JavaScript 的词法作用域规则是一致的。换言之：<p><blockquote><p>父组件模板中的表达式只能访问父组件的作用域；子组件模板中的表达式只能访问子组件的作用域。<p><blockquote><h2 id=\"fallback-content\">默认内容 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#fallback-content\">​<a><h2><p>在外部没有提供任何内容的情况下，可以为插槽指定默认内容。比如有这样一个 <code><SubmitButton><code> 组件：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>button<span><span> type<span><span>=<span><span>\"submit\"<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/slots.html", "title": "插槽 Slots", "doc_id": "ac000bac450b4f8b9f22a7775b89e8e8", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1189, "chunk_index": 12, "_doc_id": "12_2617403192001882382"}}
{"doc_id": "13_4691609522296481674", "text": "span><<span><span>button<span><span> type<span><span>=<span><span>\"submit\"<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>slot<span><span>></<span><span>slot<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/slots.html", "title": "插槽 Slots", "doc_id": "ac000bac450b4f8b9f22a7775b89e8e8", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1189, "chunk_index": 13, "_doc_id": "13_4691609522296481674"}}
{"doc_id": "14_4451867424968246545", "text": "<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>slot<span><span>></<span><span>slot<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>button<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>如果我们想在父组件没有提供任何插槽内容时在 <code><button><code> 内渲染“Submit”，只需要将“Submit”写在 <code><slot><code> 标签之间来作为默认内容：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>button<span><span> type<span><span>=<span><span>\"submit\"<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/slots.html", "title": "插槽 Slots", "doc_id": "ac000bac450b4f8b9f22a7775b89e8e8", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1189, "chunk_index": 14, "_doc_id": "14_4451867424968246545"}}
{"doc_id": "15_5508565170476550040", "text": "span><<span><span>button<span><span> type<span><span>=<span><span>\"submit\"<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>slot<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line highlighted\"><span> Submit <span><span><!-- 默认内容 --><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> </<span><span>slot<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>button<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>现在，当我们在父组件中使用 <code><SubmitButton><code> 且没有提供任何插槽内容时：<p><p>“Submit”将会被作为默认内容渲染：<p><div", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/slots.html", "title": "插槽 Slots", "doc_id": "ac000bac450b4f8b9f22a7775b89e8e8", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1189, "chunk_index": 15, "_doc_id": "15_5508565170476550040"}}
{"doc_id": "16_193215304439877225", "text": "pre><div><p>现在，当我们在父组件中使用 <code><SubmitButton><code> 且没有提供任何插槽内容时：<p><p>“Submit”将会被作为默认内容渲染：<p><div class=\"language-html\"> <span class=\"lang\">html<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>button<span><span> type<span><span>=<span><span>\"submit\"<span><span>>Submit</<span><span>button<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>但如果我们提供了插槽内容：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/slots.html", "title": "插槽 Slots", "doc_id": "ac000bac450b4f8b9f22a7775b89e8e8", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1189, "chunk_index": 16, "_doc_id": "16_193215304439877225"}}
{"doc_id": "17_1694824141776352732", "text": "uage-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>SubmitButton<span><span>>Save</<span><span>SubmitButton<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>那么被显式提供的内容会取代默认内容：<p><div class=\"language-html\"> <span class=\"lang\">html<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>button<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/slots.html", "title": "插槽 Slots", "doc_id": "ac000bac450b4f8b9f22a7775b89e8e8", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1189, "chunk_index": 17, "_doc_id": "17_1694824141776352732"}}
{"doc_id": "18_8189129283479816442", "text": "re class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>button<span><span> type<span><span>=<span><span>\"submit\"<span><span>>Save</<span><span>button<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><h2 id=\"named-slots\">具名插槽 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#named-slots\">​<a><h2><p>有时在一个组件中包含多个插槽出口是很有用的。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/slots.html", "title": "插槽 Slots", "doc_id": "ac000bac450b4f8b9f22a7775b89e8e8", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1189, "chunk_index": 18, "_doc_id": "18_8189129283479816442"}}
{"doc_id": "19_3751714379602986259", "text": "id=\"named-slots\">具名插槽 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#named-slots\">​<a><h2><p>有时在一个组件中包含多个插槽出口是很有用的。举例来说，在一个 <code><BaseLayout><code> 组件中，有如下模板：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>div<span><span> class<span><span>=<span><span>\"container\"<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>header<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <!-- 标题内容放这里 --><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/slots.html", "title": "插槽 Slots", "doc_id": "ac000bac450b4f8b9f22a7775b89e8e8", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1189, "chunk_index": 19, "_doc_id": "19_3751714379602986259"}}
{"doc_id": "20_7043848162580366249", "text": "<<span><span>header<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <!-- 标题内容放这里 --><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> </<span><span>header<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>main<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <!-- 主要内容放这里 --><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> </<span><span>main<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>footer<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <!-- 底部内容放这里 --><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/slots.html", "title": "插槽 Slots", "doc_id": "ac000bac450b4f8b9f22a7775b89e8e8", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1189, "chunk_index": 20, "_doc_id": "20_7043848162580366249"}}
{"doc_id": "21_4758295454222331043", "text": "<<span><span>footer<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <!-- 底部内容放这里 --><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> </<span><span>footer<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/slots.html", "title": "插槽 Slots", "doc_id": "ac000bac450b4f8b9f22a7775b89e8e8", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1189, "chunk_index": 21, "_doc_id": "21_4758295454222331043"}}
{"doc_id": "22_6980563681549693772", "text": "!-- 底部内容放这里 --><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> </<span><span>footer<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>div<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>对于这种场景，<code><slot><code> 元素可以有一个特殊的 attribute <code>name<code>，用来给各个插槽分配唯一的 ID，以确定每一处要渲染的内容：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>div<span><span> class<span><span>=<span><span>\"container\"<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/slots.html", "title": "插槽 Slots", "doc_id": "ac000bac450b4f8b9f22a7775b89e8e8", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1189, "chunk_index": 22, "_doc_id": "22_6980563681549693772"}}
{"doc_id": "23_1522760028333411565", "text": "pan><<span><span>div<span><span> class<span><span>=<span><span>\"container\"<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>header<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>slot<span><span> name<span><span>=<span><span>\"header\"<span><span>></<span><span>slot<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> </<span><span>header<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>main<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/slots.html", "title": "插槽 Slots", "doc_id": "ac000bac450b4f8b9f22a7775b89e8e8", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1189, "chunk_index": 23, "_doc_id": "23_1522760028333411565"}}
{"doc_id": "24_3377685496559527482", "text": "eader<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>main<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>slot<span><span>></<span><span>slot<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> </<span><span>main<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>footer<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>slot<span><span> name<span><span>=<span><span>\"footer\"<span><span>></<span><span>slot<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/slots.html", "title": "插槽 Slots", "doc_id": "ac000bac450b4f8b9f22a7775b89e8e8", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1189, "chunk_index": 24, "_doc_id": "24_3377685496559527482"}}
{"doc_id": "25_7672024035451430087", "text": "span> name<span><span>=<span><span>\"footer\"<span><span>></<span><span>slot<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> </<span><span>footer<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>div<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>这类带 <code>name<code> 的插槽被称为具名插槽 (named slots)。没有提供 <code>name<code> 的 <code><slot><code> 出口会隐式地命名为“default”。<p><p>在父组件中使用 <code><BaseLayout><code> 时，我们需要一种方式将多个插槽内容传入到各自目标插槽的出口。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/slots.html", "title": "插槽 Slots", "doc_id": "ac000bac450b4f8b9f22a7775b89e8e8", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1189, "chunk_index": 25, "_doc_id": "25_7672024035451430087"}}
{"doc_id": "26_2806008495220502826", "text": "slot><code> 出口会隐式地命名为“default”。<p><p>在父组件中使用 <code><BaseLayout><code> 时，我们需要一种方式将多个插槽内容传入到各自目标插槽的出口。此时就需要用到<strong>具名插槽<strong>了：<p><p>要为具名插槽传入内容，我们需要使用一个含 <code>v-slot<code> 指令的 <code><template><code> 元素，并将目标插槽的名字传给该指令：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>BaseLayout<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>template<span><span> v-slot:header<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/slots.html", "title": "插槽 Slots", "doc_id": "ac000bac450b4f8b9f22a7775b89e8e8", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1189, "chunk_index": 26, "_doc_id": "26_2806008495220502826"}}
{"doc_id": "27_298618691456181575", "text": "<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>template<span><span> v-slot:header<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <!-- header 插槽的内容放这里 --><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> </<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/slots.html", "title": "插槽 Slots", "doc_id": "ac000bac450b4f8b9f22a7775b89e8e8", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1189, "chunk_index": 27, "_doc_id": "27_298618691456181575"}}
{"doc_id": "28_7558365644413112402", "text": "插槽的内容放这里 --><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> </<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>BaseLayout<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p><code>v-slot<code> 有对应的简写 <code>#<code>，因此 <code><template v-slot:header><code> 可以简写为 <code><template #header><code>。其意思就是“将这部分模板片段传入子组件的 header 插槽中”。<p><p> <p><p>下面我们给出完整的、向 <code><BaseLayout><code> 传递插槽内容的代码，指令均使用的是缩写形式：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>BaseLayout<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/slots.html", "title": "插槽 Slots", "doc_id": "ac000bac450b4f8b9f22a7775b89e8e8", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1189, "chunk_index": 28, "_doc_id": "28_7558365644413112402"}}
{"doc_id": "29_3261621805291761491", "text": "ithub-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>BaseLayout<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>template<span><span> #<span><span>header<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>h1<span><span>>Here might be a page title</<span><span>h1<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> </<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/slots.html", "title": "插槽 Slots", "doc_id": "ac000bac450b4f8b9f22a7775b89e8e8", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1189, "chunk_index": 29, "_doc_id": "29_3261621805291761491"}}
{"doc_id": "30_4995213617788304869", "text": "<span class=\"line\"><span> </<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>template<span><span> #<span><span>default<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>p<span><span>>A paragraph for the main content.</<span><span>p<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>p<span><span>>And another one.</<span><span>p<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/slots.html", "title": "插槽 Slots", "doc_id": "ac000bac450b4f8b9f22a7775b89e8e8", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1189, "chunk_index": 30, "_doc_id": "30_4995213617788304869"}}
{"doc_id": "31_8223053091218597382", "text": "s=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>p<span><span>>And another one.</<span><span>p<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> </<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>template<span><span> #<span><span>footer<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>p<span><span>>Here's some contact info</<span><span>p<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> </<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/slots.html", "title": "插槽 Slots", "doc_id": "ac000bac450b4f8b9f22a7775b89e8e8", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1189, "chunk_index": 31, "_doc_id": "31_8223053091218597382"}}
{"doc_id": "32_4469180609353397453", "text": "<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> </<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>BaseLayout<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>当一个组件同时接收默认插槽和具名插槽时，所有位于顶级的非 <code><template><code> 节点都被隐式地视为默认插槽的内容。所以上面也可以写成：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>BaseLayout<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/slots.html", "title": "插槽 Slots", "doc_id": "ac000bac450b4f8b9f22a7775b89e8e8", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1189, "chunk_index": 32, "_doc_id": "32_4469180609353397453"}}
{"doc_id": "33_5124639432426565497", "text": "ithub-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>BaseLayout<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>template<span><span> #<span><span>header<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>h1<span><span>>Here might be a page title</<span><span>h1<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> </<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <!-- 隐式的默认插槽 --><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/slots.html", "title": "插槽 Slots", "doc_id": "ac000bac450b4f8b9f22a7775b89e8e8", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1189, "chunk_index": 33, "_doc_id": "33_5124639432426565497"}}
{"doc_id": "34_9099971946167761219", "text": "span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <!-- 隐式的默认插槽 --><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>p<span><span>>A paragraph for the main content.</<span><span>p<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>p<span><span>>And another one.</<span><span>p<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>template<span><span> #<span><span>footer<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/slots.html", "title": "插槽 Slots", "doc_id": "ac000bac450b4f8b9f22a7775b89e8e8", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1189, "chunk_index": 34, "_doc_id": "34_9099971946167761219"}}
{"doc_id": "35_3800390386362704329", "text": "class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>template<span><span> #<span><span>footer<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>p<span><span>>Here's some contact info</<span><span>p<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> </<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/slots.html", "title": "插槽 Slots", "doc_id": "ac000bac450b4f8b9f22a7775b89e8e8", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1189, "chunk_index": 35, "_doc_id": "35_3800390386362704329"}}
{"doc_id": "36_4625231570211305035", "text": "<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> </<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>BaseLayout<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>现在 <code><template><code> 元素中的所有内容都将被传递到相应的插槽。最终渲染出的 HTML 如下：<p><div class=\"language-html\"> <span class=\"lang\">html<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>div<span><span> class<span><span>=<span><span>\"container\"<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/slots.html", "title": "插槽 Slots", "doc_id": "ac000bac450b4f8b9f22a7775b89e8e8", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1189, "chunk_index": 36, "_doc_id": "36_4625231570211305035"}}
{"doc_id": "37_2835503834306729370", "text": "pan><<span><span>div<span><span> class<span><span>=<span><span>\"container\"<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>header<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>h1<span><span>>Here might be a page title</<span><span>h1<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> </<span><span>header<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>main<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/slots.html", "title": "插槽 Slots", "doc_id": "ac000bac450b4f8b9f22a7775b89e8e8", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1189, "chunk_index": 37, "_doc_id": "37_2835503834306729370"}}
{"doc_id": "38_1421600089181449272", "text": "eader<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>main<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>p<span><span>>A paragraph for the main content.</<span><span>p<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>p<span><span>>And another one.</<span><span>p<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> </<span><span>main<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>footer<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/slots.html", "title": "插槽 Slots", "doc_id": "ac000bac450b4f8b9f22a7775b89e8e8", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1189, "chunk_index": 38, "_doc_id": "38_1421600089181449272"}}
{"doc_id": "39_3455904084583977695", "text": "ain<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>footer<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>p<span><span>>Here's some contact info</<span><span>p<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> </<span><span>footer<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/slots.html", "title": "插槽 Slots", "doc_id": "ac000bac450b4f8b9f22a7775b89e8e8", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1189, "chunk_index": 39, "_doc_id": "39_3455904084583977695"}}
{"doc_id": "40_1279466876910602776", "text": ">p<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> </<span><span>footer<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>div<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>使用 JavaScript 函数来类比可能更有助于你来理解具名插槽：<p><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// 传入不同的内容给不同名字的插槽<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>BaseLayout<span><span>({<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/slots.html", "title": "插槽 Slots", "doc_id": "ac000bac450b4f8b9f22a7775b89e8e8", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1189, "chunk_index": 40, "_doc_id": "40_1279466876910602776"}}
{"doc_id": "41_2712858874297428136", "text": "><span>// 传入不同的内容给不同名字的插槽<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>BaseLayout<span><span>({<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> header: <span><span>`...`<span><span>,<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> default: <span><span>`...`<span><span>,<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> footer: <span><span>`...`<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>})<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// <BaseLayout> 渲染插槽内容到对应位置<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/slots.html", "title": "插槽 Slots", "doc_id": "ac000bac450b4f8b9f22a7775b89e8e8", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1189, "chunk_index": 41, "_doc_id": "41_2712858874297428136"}}
{"doc_id": "42_2806044476242891823", "text": "n><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// <BaseLayout> 渲染插槽内容到对应位置<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>function<span><span> BaseLayout<span><span>(<span><span>slots<span><span>) {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> return<span><span> `<div class=\"container\"><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <header>${<span><span>slots<span><span>.<span><span>header<span><span>}</header><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/slots.html", "title": "插槽 Slots", "doc_id": "ac000bac450b4f8b9f22a7775b89e8e8", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1189, "chunk_index": 42, "_doc_id": "42_2806044476242891823"}}
{"doc_id": "43_6591011192919315763", "text": "<span> <header>${<span><span>slots<span><span>.<span><span>header<span><span>}</header><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <main>${<span><span>slots<span><span>.<span><span>default<span><span>}</main><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <footer>${<span><span>slots<span><span>.<span><span>footer<span><span>}</footer><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> </div>`<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/slots.html", "title": "插槽 Slots", "doc_id": "ac000bac450b4f8b9f22a7775b89e8e8", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1189, "chunk_index": 43, "_doc_id": "43_6591011192919315763"}}
{"doc_id": "44_3766939819233703522", "text": ".<span><span>footer<span><span>}</footer><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> </div>`<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span><code><pre><div><h2 id=\"conditional-slots\">条件插槽 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#conditional-slots\">​<a><h2><p>有时你需要根据内容是否被传入了插槽来渲染某些内容。<p><p>你可以结合使用 <a href=\"/api/component-instance.html#slots\">$slots<a> 属性与 <a href=\"/guide/essentials/conditional.html#v-if\">v-if<a> 来实现。<p><p>在下面的示例中，我们定义了一个卡片组件，它拥有三个条件插槽：<code>header<code>、<code>footer<code> 和 <code>default<code>。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/slots.html", "title": "插槽 Slots", "doc_id": "ac000bac450b4f8b9f22a7775b89e8e8", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1189, "chunk_index": 44, "_doc_id": "44_3766939819233703522"}}
{"doc_id": "45_6608695541065287063", "text": "来实现。<p><p>在下面的示例中，我们定义了一个卡片组件，它拥有三个条件插槽：<code>header<code>、<code>footer<code> 和 <code>default<code>。 当 header、footer 或 default 的内容存在时，我们希望包装它以提供额外的样式：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>div<span><span> class<span><span>=<span><span>\"card\"<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/slots.html", "title": "插槽 Slots", "doc_id": "ac000bac450b4f8b9f22a7775b89e8e8", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1189, "chunk_index": 45, "_doc_id": "45_6608695541065287063"}}
{"doc_id": "46_4589272685073683235", "text": "\"><span> <<span><span>div<span><span> class<span><span>=<span><span>\"card\"<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>div<span><span> v-if<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>$slots.header<span><span>\"<span><span> class<span><span>=<span><span>\"card-header\"<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>slot<span><span> name<span><span>=<span><span>\"header\"<span><span> /><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> </<span><span>div<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/slots.html", "title": "插槽 Slots", "doc_id": "ac000bac450b4f8b9f22a7775b89e8e8", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1189, "chunk_index": 46, "_doc_id": "46_4589272685073683235"}}
{"doc_id": "47_2894293287210363795", "text": "er\"<span><span> /><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> </<span><span>div<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>div<span><span> v-if<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>$slots.default<span><span>\"<span><span> class<span><span>=<span><span>\"card-content\"<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>slot<span><span> /><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> </<span><span>div<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/slots.html", "title": "插槽 Slots", "doc_id": "ac000bac450b4f8b9f22a7775b89e8e8", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1189, "chunk_index": 47, "_doc_id": "47_2894293287210363795"}}
{"doc_id": "48_3086395988139286957", "text": "lot<span><span> /><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> </<span><span>div<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>div<span><span> v-if<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>$slots.footer<span><span>\"<span><span> class<span><span>=<span><span>\"card-footer\"<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>slot<span><span> name<span><span>=<span><span>\"footer\"<span><span> /><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/slots.html", "title": "插槽 Slots", "doc_id": "ac000bac450b4f8b9f22a7775b89e8e8", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1189, "chunk_index": 48, "_doc_id": "48_3086395988139286957"}}
{"doc_id": "49_6770078743520446811", "text": "pan> <<span><span>slot<span><span> name<span><span>=<span><span>\"footer\"<span><span> /><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> </<span><span>div<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> </<span><span>div<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p><a href=\"https://play.vuejs.org/#eNqVVMtu2zAQ/BWCLZBLIjVoTq4aoA1yaA9t0eaoCy2tJcYUSZCUKyPwv2dJioplOw4C+EDuzM4+ONYT/aZ1tumBLmhhK8O1IxZcr29LyTutjCN3zNRkZVRHLrLcXzz9opRFHvnIxIuDTgvmAG+EFJ", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/slots.html", "title": "插槽 Slots", "doc_id": "ac000bac450b4f8b9f22a7775b89e8e8", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1189, "chunk_index": 49, "_doc_id": "49_6770078743520446811"}}
{"doc_id": "50_6807311819869698840", "text": "", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/slots.html", "title": "插槽 Slots", "doc_id": "ac000bac450b4f8b9f22a7775b89e8e8", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1189, "chunk_index": 50, "_doc_id": "50_6807311819869698840"}}
{"doc_id": "51_3442277221299267711", "text": "qBj1YoZ7NosJLOEq5S9OXtPZtI1gFSppx8engUHs+vVhq9eVhq9ORRrXdpRyseSqfo6SmmnONK6XTw9yis24q448wXSG+0VAb3sSDXeiBoDV6TpWDV+ktENatrdMGCfAoBfL1JYNzzpINJjVFoJ9yKUKho19ul6OFQ6UYPx1rjIpPYeXIc/vXCgjetawzbni0dPnhhJ3T3DMVSruI=\" target=\"_blank\">在演练场中尝试一下<a><p><h2 id=\"dynamic-slot-names\">动态插槽名 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#dynamic-slot-names\">​<a><h2><p><a href=\"/guide/essentials/template-syntax.html#dynamic-arguments\">动态指令参数<a>在 <code>v-slot<code> 上也是有效的，", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/slots.html", "title": "插槽 Slots", "doc_id": "ac000bac450b4f8b9f22a7775b89e8e8", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1189, "chunk_index": 51, "_doc_id": "51_3442277221299267711"}}
{"doc_id": "52_8497716788437471883", "text": "ref=\"/guide/essentials/template-syntax.html#dynamic-arguments\">动态指令参数<a>在 <code>v-slot<code> 上也是有效的，即可以定义下面这样的动态插槽名：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>base-layout<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>template<span><span> v-slot:<span><span>[<span><span>dynamicSlotName<span><span>]><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> ...<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/slots.html", "title": "插槽 Slots", "doc_id": "ac000bac450b4f8b9f22a7775b89e8e8", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1189, "chunk_index": 52, "_doc_id": "52_8497716788437471883"}}
{"doc_id": "53_2109635592528369860", "text": "an>[<span><span>dynamicSlotName<span><span>]><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> ...<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> </<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <!-- 缩写为 --><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>template<span><span> #[<span><span>dynamicSlotName<span><span>]><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> ...<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> </<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/slots.html", "title": "插槽 Slots", "doc_id": "ac000bac450b4f8b9f22a7775b89e8e8", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1189, "chunk_index": 53, "_doc_id": "53_2109635592528369860"}}
{"doc_id": "54_2928924391463601391", "text": "e\"><span> ...<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> </<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>base-layout<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>注意这里的表达式和动态指令参数受相同的<a href=\"/guide/essentials/template-syntax.html#dynamic-argument-syntax-constraints\">语法限制<a>。<p><h2 id=\"scoped-slots\">作用域插槽 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#scoped-slots\">​<a><h2><p>在上面的<a href=\"#render-scope\">渲染作用域<a>中我们讨论到，插槽的内容无法访问到子组件的状态。<p><p>然而在某些场景下插槽的内容可能想要同时使用父组件域内和子组件域内的数据。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/slots.html", "title": "插槽 Slots", "doc_id": "ac000bac450b4f8b9f22a7775b89e8e8", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1189, "chunk_index": 54, "_doc_id": "54_2928924391463601391"}}
{"doc_id": "55_1292979515305606038", "text": "面的<a href=\"#render-scope\">渲染作用域<a>中我们讨论到，插槽的内容无法访问到子组件的状态。<p><p>然而在某些场景下插槽的内容可能想要同时使用父组件域内和子组件域内的数据。要做到这一点，我们需要一种方法来让子组件在渲染时将一部分数据提供给插槽。<p><p>我们也确实有办法这么做！可以像对组件传递 props 那样，向一个插槽的出口上传递 attributes：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><!-- <MyComponent> 的模板 --><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>div<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/slots.html", "title": "插槽 Slots", "doc_id": "ac000bac450b4f8b9f22a7775b89e8e8", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1189, "chunk_index": 55, "_doc_id": "55_1292979515305606038"}}
{"doc_id": "56_2924770071152049663", "text": "MyComponent> 的模板 --><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>div<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>slot<span><span> :<span><span>text<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>greetingMessage<span><span>\"<span><span> :<span><span>count<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>1<span><span>\"<span><span>></<span><span>slot<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/slots.html", "title": "插槽 Slots", "doc_id": "ac000bac450b4f8b9f22a7775b89e8e8", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1189, "chunk_index": 56, "_doc_id": "56_2924770071152049663"}}
{"doc_id": "57_4566623013946335809", "text": "an>=<span><span>\"<span><span>1<span><span>\"<span><span>></<span><span>slot<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>div<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>当需要接收插槽 props 时，默认插槽和具名插槽的使用方式有一些小区别。下面我们将先展示默认插槽如何接受 props，通过子组件标签上的 <code>v-slot<code> 指令，直接接收到了一个插槽 props 对象：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>MyComponent<span><span> v-slot<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>slotProps<span><span>\"<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/slots.html", "title": "插槽 Slots", "doc_id": "ac000bac450b4f8b9f22a7775b89e8e8", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1189, "chunk_index": 57, "_doc_id": "57_4566623013946335809"}}
{"doc_id": "58_8951018244585701018", "text": "><span> v-slot<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>slotProps<span><span>\"<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> {{ slotProps.text }} {{ slotProps.count }}<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/slots.html", "title": "插槽 Slots", "doc_id": "ac000bac450b4f8b9f22a7775b89e8e8", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1189, "chunk_index": 58, "_doc_id": "58_8951018244585701018"}}
{"doc_id": "59_5430573477658447810", "text": "span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> {{ slotProps.text }} {{ slotProps.count }}<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>MyComponent<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p> <p><p>子组件传入插槽的 props 作为了 <code>v-slot<code> 指令的值，可以在插槽内的表达式中访问。<p><p>你可以将作用域插槽类比为一个传入子组件的函数。子组件会将相应的 props 作为参数传给它：<p><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>MyComponent<span><span>({<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/slots.html", "title": "插槽 Slots", "doc_id": "ac000bac450b4f8b9f22a7775b89e8e8", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1189, "chunk_index": 59, "_doc_id": "59_5430573477658447810"}}
{"doc_id": "60_3273410103538245350", "text": "ss=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>MyComponent<span><span>({<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 类比默认插槽，将其想成一个函数<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> default<span><span>: (<span><span>slotProps<span><span>) <span><span>=><span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> return<span><span> `${<span><span>slotProps<span><span>.<span><span>text<span><span>} ${<span><span>slotProps<span><span>.<span><span>count<span><span>}`<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/slots.html", "title": "插槽 Slots", "doc_id": "ac000bac450b4f8b9f22a7775b89e8e8", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1189, "chunk_index": 60, "_doc_id": "60_3273410103538245350"}}
{"doc_id": "61_8000041002890462014", "text": "n>text<span><span>} ${<span><span>slotProps<span><span>.<span><span>count<span><span>}`<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>})<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>function<span><span> MyComponent<span><span>(<span><span>slots<span><span>) {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> const<span><span> greetingMessage<span><span> =<span><span> 'hello'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> return<span><span> `<div>${<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/slots.html", "title": "插槽 Slots", "doc_id": "ac000bac450b4f8b9f22a7775b89e8e8", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1189, "chunk_index": 61, "_doc_id": "61_8000041002890462014"}}
{"doc_id": "62_8118136902086794935", "text": "=<span><span> 'hello'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> return<span><span> `<div>${<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 在插槽函数调用时传入 props<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> slots<span><span>.<span><span>default<span><span>({ text: <span><span>greetingMessage<span><span>, count: <span><span>1<span><span> })<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }</div>`<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/slots.html", "title": "插槽 Slots", "doc_id": "ac000bac450b4f8b9f22a7775b89e8e8", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1189, "chunk_index": 62, "_doc_id": "62_8118136902086794935"}}
{"doc_id": "63_7511632171638303715", "text": "an>, count: <span><span>1<span><span> })<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }</div>`<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span><code><pre><div><p>实际上，这已经和作用域插槽的最终代码编译结果、以及手动编写<a href=\"/guide/extras/render-function.html\">渲染函数<a>时使用作用域插槽的方式非常类似了。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/slots.html", "title": "插槽 Slots", "doc_id": "ac000bac450b4f8b9f22a7775b89e8e8", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1189, "chunk_index": 63, "_doc_id": "63_7511632171638303715"}}
{"doc_id": "64_9097771443262379112", "text": "p>实际上，这已经和作用域插槽的最终代码编译结果、以及手动编写<a href=\"/guide/extras/render-function.html\">渲染函数<a>时使用作用域插槽的方式非常类似了。<p><p><code>v-slot=\"slotProps\"<code> 可以类比这里的函数签名，和函数的参数类似，我们也可以在 <code>v-slot<code> 中使用解构：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>MyComponent<span><span> v-slot<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>{ text, count }<span><span>\"<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/slots.html", "title": "插槽 Slots", "doc_id": "ac000bac450b4f8b9f22a7775b89e8e8", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1189, "chunk_index": 64, "_doc_id": "64_9097771443262379112"}}
{"doc_id": "65_1183018282829355120", "text": "> v-slot<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>{ text, count }<span><span>\"<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> {{ text }} {{ count }}<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/slots.html", "title": "插槽 Slots", "doc_id": "ac000bac450b4f8b9f22a7775b89e8e8", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1189, "chunk_index": 65, "_doc_id": "65_1183018282829355120"}}
{"doc_id": "66_7316452978105213620", "text": "<span><span>\"<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> {{ text }} {{ count }}<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>MyComponent<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><h3 id=\"named-scoped-slots\">具名作用域插槽 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#named-scoped-slots\">​<a><h3><p>具名作用域插槽的工作方式也是类似的，插槽 props 可以作为 <code>v-slot<code> 指令的值被访问到：<code>v-slot:name=\"slotProps\"<code>。当使用缩写时是这样：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>MyComponent<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/slots.html", "title": "插槽 Slots", "doc_id": "ac000bac450b4f8b9f22a7775b89e8e8", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1189, "chunk_index": 66, "_doc_id": "66_7316452978105213620"}}
{"doc_id": "67_8192390734901011593", "text": "thub-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>MyComponent<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>template<span><span> #<span><span>header<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>headerProps<span><span>\"<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> {{ headerProps }}<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> </<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/slots.html", "title": "插槽 Slots", "doc_id": "ac000bac450b4f8b9f22a7775b89e8e8", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1189, "chunk_index": 67, "_doc_id": "67_8192390734901011593"}}
{"doc_id": "68_7350275995834116325", "text": "<span class=\"line\"><span> </<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>template<span><span> #<span><span>default<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>defaultProps<span><span>\"<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> {{ defaultProps }}<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> </<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/slots.html", "title": "插槽 Slots", "doc_id": "ac000bac450b4f8b9f22a7775b89e8e8", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1189, "chunk_index": 68, "_doc_id": "68_7350275995834116325"}}
{"doc_id": "69_665753166145881720", "text": "<span class=\"line\"><span> </<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>template<span><span> #<span><span>footer<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>footerProps<span><span>\"<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> {{ footerProps }}<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> </<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/slots.html", "title": "插槽 Slots", "doc_id": "ac000bac450b4f8b9f22a7775b89e8e8", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1189, "chunk_index": 69, "_doc_id": "69_665753166145881720"}}
{"doc_id": "70_904290198063612116", "text": "ooterProps }}<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> </<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>MyComponent<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>向具名插槽中传入 props：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>slot<span><span> name<span><span>=<span><span>\"header\"<span><span> message<span><span>=<span><span>\"hello\"<span><span>></<span><span>slot<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>注意插槽上的 <code>name<code> 是一个 Vue 特别保留的 attribute，不会作为 props 传递给插槽。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/slots.html", "title": "插槽 Slots", "doc_id": "ac000bac450b4f8b9f22a7775b89e8e8", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1189, "chunk_index": 70, "_doc_id": "70_904290198063612116"}}
{"doc_id": "71_1137421186178600342", "text": "an>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>注意插槽上的 <code>name<code> 是一个 Vue 特别保留的 attribute，不会作为 props 传递给插槽。因此最终 <code>headerProps<code> 的结果是 <code>{ message: 'hello' }<code>。<p><p>如果你同时使用了具名插槽与默认插槽，则需要为默认插槽使用显式的 <code><template><code> 标签。尝试直接为组件添加 <code>v-slot<code> 指令将导致编译错误。这是为了避免因默认插槽的 props 的作用域而困惑。举例：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><!-- <MyComponent> template --><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/slots.html", "title": "插槽 Slots", "doc_id": "ac000bac450b4f8b9f22a7775b89e8e8", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1189, "chunk_index": 71, "_doc_id": "71_1137421186178600342"}}
{"doc_id": "72_7967322839349837051", "text": "iki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><!-- <MyComponent> template --><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>div<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>slot<span><span> :<span><span>message<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>hello<span><span>\"<span><span>></<span><span>slot<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>slot<span><span> name<span><span>=<span><span>\"footer\"<span><span> /><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/slots.html", "title": "插槽 Slots", "doc_id": "ac000bac450b4f8b9f22a7775b89e8e8", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1189, "chunk_index": 72, "_doc_id": "72_7967322839349837051"}}
{"doc_id": "73_8950610865472731735", "text": "pan> <<span><span>slot<span><span> name<span><span>=<span><span>\"footer\"<span><span> /><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>div<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><!-- 该模板无法编译 --><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>MyComponent<span><span> v-slot<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>{ message }<span><span>\"<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/slots.html", "title": "插槽 Slots", "doc_id": "ac000bac450b4f8b9f22a7775b89e8e8", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1189, "chunk_index": 73, "_doc_id": "73_8950610865472731735"}}
{"doc_id": "74_2136765512494850389", "text": "span> v-slot<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>{ message }<span><span>\"<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>p<span><span>>{{ message }}</<span><span>p<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>template<span><span> #<span><span>footer<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <!-- message 属于默认插槽，此处不可用 --><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>p<span><span>>{{ message }}</<span><span>p<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/slots.html", "title": "插槽 Slots", "doc_id": "ac000bac450b4f8b9f22a7775b89e8e8", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1189, "chunk_index": 74, "_doc_id": "74_2136765512494850389"}}
{"doc_id": "75_3232539912238555147", "text": "lass=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>p<span><span>>{{ message }}</<span><span>p<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> </<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/slots.html", "title": "插槽 Slots", "doc_id": "ac000bac450b4f8b9f22a7775b89e8e8", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1189, "chunk_index": 75, "_doc_id": "75_3232539912238555147"}}
{"doc_id": "76_1352900998794500819", "text": "<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> </<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>MyComponent<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>为默认插槽使用显式的 <code><template><code> 标签有助于更清晰地指出 <code>message<code> 属性在其他插槽中不可用：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>MyComponent<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/slots.html", "title": "插槽 Slots", "doc_id": "ac000bac450b4f8b9f22a7775b89e8e8", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1189, "chunk_index": 76, "_doc_id": "76_1352900998794500819"}}
{"doc_id": "77_3226184358338039712", "text": "thub-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>MyComponent<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <!-- 使用显式的默认插槽 --><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>template<span><span> #<span><span>default<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>{ message }<span><span>\"<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>p<span><span>>{{ message }}</<span><span>p<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> </<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/slots.html", "title": "插槽 Slots", "doc_id": "ac000bac450b4f8b9f22a7775b89e8e8", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1189, "chunk_index": 77, "_doc_id": "77_3226184358338039712"}}
{"doc_id": "78_796234962905809230", "text": "<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> </<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>template<span><span> #<span><span>footer<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>p<span><span>>Here's some contact info</<span><span>p<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> </<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/slots.html", "title": "插槽 Slots", "doc_id": "ac000bac450b4f8b9f22a7775b89e8e8", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1189, "chunk_index": 78, "_doc_id": "78_796234962905809230"}}
{"doc_id": "79_5435478734730536287", "text": "<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> </<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>MyComponent<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><h3 id=\"fancy-list-example\">高级列表组件示例 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#fancy-list-example\">​<a><h3><p>你可能想问什么样的场景才适合用到作用域插槽，这里我们来看一个 <code><FancyList><code> 组件的例子。它会渲染一个列表，并同时会封装一些加载远端数据的逻辑、使用数据进行列表渲染、或者是像分页或无限滚动这样更进阶的功能。然而我们希望它能够保留足够的灵活性，将对单个列表元素内容和样式的控制权留给使用它的父组件。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/slots.html", "title": "插槽 Slots", "doc_id": "ac000bac450b4f8b9f22a7775b89e8e8", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1189, "chunk_index": 79, "_doc_id": "79_5435478734730536287"}}
{"doc_id": "80_7108243676027170247", "text": "染一个列表，并同时会封装一些加载远端数据的逻辑、使用数据进行列表渲染、或者是像分页或无限滚动这样更进阶的功能。然而我们希望它能够保留足够的灵活性，将对单个列表元素内容和样式的控制权留给使用它的父组件。我们期望的用法可能是这样的：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>FancyList<span><span> :<span><span>api-url<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>url<span><span>\"<span><span> :<span><span>per-page<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>10<span><span>\"<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/slots.html", "title": "插槽 Slots", "doc_id": "ac000bac450b4f8b9f22a7775b89e8e8", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1189, "chunk_index": 80, "_doc_id": "80_7108243676027170247"}}
{"doc_id": "81_4330204458476711598", "text": ":<span><span>per-page<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>10<span><span>\"<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>template<span><span> #<span><span>item<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>{ body, username, likes }<span><span>\"<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>div<span><span> class<span><span>=<span><span>\"item\"<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>p<span><span>>{{ body }}</<span><span>p<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/slots.html", "title": "插槽 Slots", "doc_id": "ac000bac450b4f8b9f22a7775b89e8e8", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1189, "chunk_index": 81, "_doc_id": "81_4330204458476711598"}}
{"doc_id": "82_7471379873277379801", "text": "n class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>p<span><span>>{{ body }}</<span><span>p<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>p<span><span>>by {{ username }} | {{ likes }} likes</<span><span>p<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> </<span><span>div<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> </<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/slots.html", "title": "插槽 Slots", "doc_id": "ac000bac450b4f8b9f22a7775b89e8e8", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1189, "chunk_index": 82, "_doc_id": "82_7471379873277379801"}}
{"doc_id": "83_4884055315744255187", "text": "<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> </<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>FancyList<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>在 <code><FancyList><code> 之中，我们可以多次渲染 <code><slot><code> 并每次都提供不同的数据 (注意我们这里使用了 <code>v-bind<code> 来传递插槽的 props)：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>ul<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/slots.html", "title": "插槽 Slots", "doc_id": "ac000bac450b4f8b9f22a7775b89e8e8", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1189, "chunk_index": 83, "_doc_id": "83_4884055315744255187"}}
{"doc_id": "84_6507230389206157939", "text": "\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>ul<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>li<span><span> v-for<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>item <span><span>in<span><span> items<span><span>\"<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>slot<span><span> name<span><span>=<span><span>\"item\"<span><span> v-bind<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>item<span><span>\"<span><span>></<span><span>slot<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/slots.html", "title": "插槽 Slots", "doc_id": "ac000bac450b4f8b9f22a7775b89e8e8", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1189, "chunk_index": 84, "_doc_id": "84_6507230389206157939"}}
{"doc_id": "85_4120351225051841746", "text": "=<span><span>\"<span><span>item<span><span>\"<span><span>></<span><span>slot<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> </<span><span>li<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>ul<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><h3 id=\"renderless-components\">无渲染组件 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#renderless-components\">​<a><h3><p>上面的 <code><FancyList><code> 案例同时封装了可重用的逻辑 (数据获取、分页等) 和视图输出，但也将部分视图输出通过作用域插槽交给了消费者组件来管理。<p><p>如果我们将这个概念拓展一下，可以想象的是，一些组件可能只包括了逻辑而不需要自己渲染内容，视图输出通过作用域插槽全权交给了消费者组件。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/slots.html", "title": "插槽 Slots", "doc_id": "ac000bac450b4f8b9f22a7775b89e8e8", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1189, "chunk_index": 85, "_doc_id": "85_4120351225051841746"}}
{"doc_id": "86_8165841364465939907", "text": "但也将部分视图输出通过作用域插槽交给了消费者组件来管理。<p><p>如果我们将这个概念拓展一下，可以想象的是，一些组件可能只包括了逻辑而不需要自己渲染内容，视图输出通过作用域插槽全权交给了消费者组件。我们将这种类型的组件称为<strong>无渲染组件<strong>。<p><p>这里有一个无渲染组件的例子，一个封装了追踪当前鼠标位置逻辑的组件：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>MouseTracker<span><span> v-slot<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>{ x, y }<span><span>\"<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> Mouse is at: {{ x }}, {{ y }}<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/slots.html", "title": "插槽 Slots", "doc_id": "ac000bac450b4f8b9f22a7775b89e8e8", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1189, "chunk_index": 86, "_doc_id": "86_8165841364465939907"}}
{"doc_id": "87_9165839515917101886", "text": "span>\"<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> Mouse is at: {{ x }}, {{ y }}<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>MouseTracker<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>虽然这个模式很有趣，但大部分能用无渲染组件实现的功能都可以通过组合式 API 以另一种更高效的方式实现，并且还不会带来额外组件嵌套的开销。之后我们会在<a href=\"/guide/reusability/composables.html\">组合式函数<a>一章中介绍如何更高效地实现追踪鼠标位置的功能。<p><p>尽管如此，作用域插槽在需要<strong>同时<strong>封装逻辑、组合视图界面时还是很有用，就像上面的 <code><FancyList><code> 组件那样。<p><div><div>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/slots.html", "title": "插槽 Slots", "doc_id": "ac000bac450b4f8b9f22a7775b89e8e8", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1189, "chunk_index": 87, "_doc_id": "87_9165839515917101886"}}
{"doc_id": "0_3713259517114822140", "text": "<div><div><h1 id=\"components-basics\">组件基础 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#components-basics\">​<a><h1><p>组件允许我们将 UI 划分为独立的、可重用的部分，并且可以对每个部分进行单独的思考。在实际应用中，组件常常被组织成一个层层嵌套的树状结构：<p><p> <p><p>这和我们嵌套 HTML 元素的方式类似，Vue 实现了自己的组件模型，使我们可以在每个组件内封装自定义内容与逻辑。Vue 同样也能很好地配合原生 Web Component。如果你想知道 Vue 组件与原生 Web Components 之间的关系，可以<a href=\"/guide/extras/web-components.html\">阅读此章节<a>。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/component-basics.html", "title": "组件基础", "doc_id": "fbf0aaed852546a7ae4c9e24956d36f8", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1435, "chunk_index": 0, "_doc_id": "0_3713259517114822140"}}
{"doc_id": "1_6284815017684631539", "text": "ponent。如果你想知道 Vue 组件与原生 Web Components 之间的关系，可以<a href=\"/guide/extras/web-components.html\">阅读此章节<a>。<p><h2 id=\"defining-a-component\">定义一个组件 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#defining-a-component\">​<a><h2><p>当使用构建步骤时，我们一般会将 Vue 组件定义在一个单独的 <code>.vue<code> 文件中，这被叫做<a href=\"/guide/scaling-up/sfc.html\">单文件组件<a> (简称 SFC)：<p><div class=\"options-api\"><div class=\"language-vue\"> <span class=\"lang\">vue<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>script<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/component-basics.html", "title": "组件基础", "doc_id": "fbf0aaed852546a7ae4c9e24956d36f8", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1435, "chunk_index": 1, "_doc_id": "1_6284815017684631539"}}
{"doc_id": "2_4617379097410737872", "text": "ki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>script<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> data<span><span>() {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> return<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> count: <span><span>0<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/component-basics.html", "title": "组件基础", "doc_id": "fbf0aaed852546a7ae4c9e24956d36f8", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1435, "chunk_index": 2, "_doc_id": "2_4617379097410737872"}}
{"doc_id": "3_3129532914414393979", "text": "<span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>script<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>button<span><span> @click<span><span>=<span><span>\"count++\"<span><span>>You clicked me {{ count }} times.</<span><span>button<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/component-basics.html", "title": "组件基础", "doc_id": "fbf0aaed852546a7ae4c9e24956d36f8", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1435, "chunk_index": 3, "_doc_id": "3_3129532914414393979"}}
{"doc_id": "4_4259816410561271182", "text": "count++\"<span><span>>You clicked me {{ count }} times.</<span><span>button<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><div><div class=\"composition-api\"><div class=\"language-vue\"> <span class=\"lang\">vue<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>script<span><span> setup<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>import<span><span> { ref } <span><span>from<span><span> 'vue'<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/component-basics.html", "title": "组件基础", "doc_id": "fbf0aaed852546a7ae4c9e24956d36f8", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1435, "chunk_index": 4, "_doc_id": "4_4259816410561271182"}}
{"doc_id": "5_8816981913887874702", "text": "<span class=\"line\"><span>import<span><span> { ref } <span><span>from<span><span> 'vue'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> count<span><span> =<span><span> ref<span><span>(<span><span>0<span><span>)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>script<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/component-basics.html", "title": "组件基础", "doc_id": "fbf0aaed852546a7ae4c9e24956d36f8", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1435, "chunk_index": 5, "_doc_id": "5_8816981913887874702"}}
{"doc_id": "6_1191324694857929144", "text": ">\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>button<span><span> @click<span><span>=<span><span>\"count++\"<span><span>>You clicked me {{ count }} times.</<span><span>button<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/component-basics.html", "title": "组件基础", "doc_id": "fbf0aaed852546a7ae4c9e24956d36f8", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1435, "chunk_index": 6, "_doc_id": "6_1191324694857929144"}}
{"doc_id": "7_5933427822755982883", "text": "count++\"<span><span>>You clicked me {{ count }} times.</<span><span>button<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><div><p>当不使用构建步骤时，一个 Vue 组件以一个包含 Vue 特定选项的 JavaScript 对象来定义：<p><div class=\"options-api\"><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> data<span><span>() {<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/component-basics.html", "title": "组件基础", "doc_id": "fbf0aaed852546a7ae4c9e24956d36f8", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1435, "chunk_index": 7, "_doc_id": "7_5933427822755982883"}}
{"doc_id": "8_4063953995865814007", "text": "<span> default<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> data<span><span>() {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> return<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> count: <span><span>0<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> },<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> template: <span><span>`<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <button @click=\"count++\"><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> You clicked me {{ count }} times.<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/component-basics.html", "title": "组件基础", "doc_id": "fbf0aaed852546a7ae4c9e24956d36f8", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1435, "chunk_index": 8, "_doc_id": "8_4063953995865814007"}}
{"doc_id": "9_7056088093854843241", "text": "lick=\"count++\"><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> You clicked me {{ count }} times.<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> </button>`<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span><code><pre><div><div><div class=\"composition-api\"><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>import<span><span> { ref } <span><span>from<span><span> 'vue'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/component-basics.html", "title": "组件基础", "doc_id": "fbf0aaed852546a7ae4c9e24956d36f8", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1435, "chunk_index": 9, "_doc_id": "9_7056088093854843241"}}
{"doc_id": "10_3773177717714026811", "text": "import<span><span> { ref } <span><span>from<span><span> 'vue'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> setup<span><span>() {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> const<span><span> count<span><span> =<span><span> ref<span><span>(<span><span>0<span><span>)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> return<span><span> { count }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> },<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/component-basics.html", "title": "组件基础", "doc_id": "fbf0aaed852546a7ae4c9e24956d36f8", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1435, "chunk_index": 10, "_doc_id": "10_3773177717714026811"}}
{"doc_id": "11_4664258254777225551", "text": "ass=\"line\"><span> return<span><span> { count }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> },<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> template: <span><span>`<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <button @click=\"count++\"><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> You clicked me {{ count }} times.<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> </button>`<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 也可以针对一个 DOM 内联模板：<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // template: '#my-template-element'<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/component-basics.html", "title": "组件基础", "doc_id": "fbf0aaed852546a7ae4c9e24956d36f8", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1435, "chunk_index": 11, "_doc_id": "11_4664258254777225551"}}
{"doc_id": "12_7039703080006858912", "text": "对一个 DOM 内联模板：<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // template: '#my-template-element'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span><code><pre><div><div><p>这里的模板是一个内联的 JavaScript 字符串，Vue 将会在运行时编译它。你也可以使用 ID 选择器来指向一个元素 (通常是原生的 <code><template><code> 元素)，Vue 将会使用其内容作为模板来源。<p><p>上面的例子中定义了一个组件，并在一个 <code>.js<code> 文件里默认导出了它自己，但你也可以通过具名导出在一个文件中导出多个组件。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/component-basics.html", "title": "组件基础", "doc_id": "fbf0aaed852546a7ae4c9e24956d36f8", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1435, "chunk_index": 12, "_doc_id": "12_7039703080006858912"}}
{"doc_id": "13_2662119555982128925", "text": "元素)，Vue 将会使用其内容作为模板来源。<p><p>上面的例子中定义了一个组件，并在一个 <code>.js<code> 文件里默认导出了它自己，但你也可以通过具名导出在一个文件中导出多个组件。<p><h2 id=\"using-a-component\">使用组件 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#using-a-component\">​<a><h2><div class=\"tip custom-block\"><p class=\"custom-block-title\">TIP<p><p>我们会在接下来的指引中使用单文件组件语法，无论你是否使用构建步骤，组件相关的概念都是相同的。<a href=\"/examples/\">示例<a>一节中展示了两种场景中的组件使用情况。<p><div><p>要使用一个子组件，我们需要在父组件中导入它。假设我们把计数器组件放在了一个叫做 <code>ButtonCounter.vue<code> 的文件中，这个组件将会以默认导出的形式被暴露给外部。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/component-basics.html", "title": "组件基础", "doc_id": "fbf0aaed852546a7ae4c9e24956d36f8", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1435, "chunk_index": 13, "_doc_id": "13_2662119555982128925"}}
{"doc_id": "14_4141765333058076843", "text": "><p>要使用一个子组件，我们需要在父组件中导入它。假设我们把计数器组件放在了一个叫做 <code>ButtonCounter.vue<code> 的文件中，这个组件将会以默认导出的形式被暴露给外部。<p><div class=\"options-api\"><div class=\"language-vue\"> <span class=\"lang\">vue<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>script<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>import<span><span> ButtonCounter <span><span>from<span><span> './ButtonCounter.vue'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/component-basics.html", "title": "组件基础", "doc_id": "fbf0aaed852546a7ae4c9e24956d36f8", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1435, "chunk_index": 14, "_doc_id": "14_4141765333058076843"}}
{"doc_id": "15_419600292116660626", "text": "tonCounter <span><span>from<span><span> './ButtonCounter.vue'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> components: {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> ButtonCounter<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>script<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/component-basics.html", "title": "组件基础", "doc_id": "fbf0aaed852546a7ae4c9e24956d36f8", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1435, "chunk_index": 15, "_doc_id": "15_419600292116660626"}}
{"doc_id": "16_7022152230913962120", "text": "n>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>script<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>h1<span><span>>Here is a child component!</<span><span>h1<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>ButtonCounter<span><span> /><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/component-basics.html", "title": "组件基础", "doc_id": "fbf0aaed852546a7ae4c9e24956d36f8", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1435, "chunk_index": 16, "_doc_id": "16_7022152230913962120"}}
{"doc_id": "17_1907070346582364381", "text": "<span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>ButtonCounter<span><span> /><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>若要将导入的组件暴露给模板，我们需要在 <code>components<code> 选项上<a href=\"/guide/components/registration.html\">注册<a>它。这个组件将会以其注册时的名字作为模板中的标签名。<p><div><div class=\"composition-api\"><div class=\"language-vue\"> <span class=\"lang\">vue<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>script<span><span> setup<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/component-basics.html", "title": "组件基础", "doc_id": "fbf0aaed852546a7ae4c9e24956d36f8", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1435, "chunk_index": 17, "_doc_id": "17_1907070346582364381"}}
{"doc_id": "18_4193899361286922782", "text": "code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>script<span><span> setup<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>import<span><span> ButtonCounter <span><span>from<span><span> './ButtonCounter.vue'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>script<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>h1<span><span>>Here is a child component!</<span><span>h1<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/component-basics.html", "title": "组件基础", "doc_id": "fbf0aaed852546a7ae4c9e24956d36f8", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1435, "chunk_index": 18, "_doc_id": "18_4193899361286922782"}}
{"doc_id": "19_3865294576953144475", "text": "an> <<span><span>h1<span><span>>Here is a child component!</<span><span>h1<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>ButtonCounter<span><span> /><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>通过 <code><script setup><code>，导入的组件都在模板中直接可用。<p><div><p>当然，你也可以全局地注册一个组件，使得它在当前应用中的任何组件上都可以使用，而不需要额外再导入。关于组件的全局注册和局部注册两种方式的利弊，我们放在了<a href=\"/guide/components/registration.html\">组件注册<a>这一章节中专门讨论。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/component-basics.html", "title": "组件基础", "doc_id": "fbf0aaed852546a7ae4c9e24956d36f8", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1435, "chunk_index": 19, "_doc_id": "19_3865294576953144475"}}
{"doc_id": "20_7473601379751430048", "text": "而不需要额外再导入。关于组件的全局注册和局部注册两种方式的利弊，我们放在了<a href=\"/guide/components/registration.html\">组件注册<a>这一章节中专门讨论。<p><p>组件可以被重用任意多次：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>h1<span><span>>Here is a child component!</<span><span>h1<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>ButtonCounter<span><span> /><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>ButtonCounter<span><span> /><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/component-basics.html", "title": "组件基础", "doc_id": "fbf0aaed852546a7ae4c9e24956d36f8", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1435, "chunk_index": 20, "_doc_id": "20_7473601379751430048"}}
{"doc_id": "21_7377893093567560848", "text": "span> /><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>ButtonCounter<span><span> /><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>ButtonCounter<span><span> /><span><span><code><pre><div><p>你会注意到，每当点击这些按钮时，每一个组件都维护着自己的状态，是不同的 <code>count<code>。这是因为每当你使用一个组件，就创建了一个新的<strong>实例<strong>。<p><p>在单文件组件中，推荐为子组件使用 <code>PascalCase<code> 的标签名，以此来和原生的 HTML 元素作区分。虽然原生 HTML 标签名是不区分大小写的，但 Vue 单文件组件是可以在编译中区分大小写的。我们也可以使用 <code>/><code> 来关闭一个标签。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/component-basics.html", "title": "组件基础", "doc_id": "fbf0aaed852546a7ae4c9e24956d36f8", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1435, "chunk_index": 21, "_doc_id": "21_7377893093567560848"}}
{"doc_id": "22_9010891216010930595", "text": "签名，以此来和原生的 HTML 元素作区分。虽然原生 HTML 标签名是不区分大小写的，但 Vue 单文件组件是可以在编译中区分大小写的。我们也可以使用 <code>/><code> 来关闭一个标签。<p><p>如果你是直接在 DOM 中书写模板 (例如原生 <code><template><code> 元素的内容)，模板的编译需要遵从浏览器中 HTML 的解析行为。在这种情况下，你应该需要使用 <code>kebab-case<code> 形式并显式地关闭这些组件的标签。<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><!-- 如果是在 DOM 中书写该模板 --><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/component-basics.html", "title": "组件基础", "doc_id": "fbf0aaed852546a7ae4c9e24956d36f8", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1435, "chunk_index": 22, "_doc_id": "22_9010891216010930595"}}
{"doc_id": "23_4828732774945675342", "text": "ass=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><!-- 如果是在 DOM 中书写该模板 --><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>button-counter<span><span>></<span><span>button-counter<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>button-counter<span><span>></<span><span>button-counter<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/component-basics.html", "title": "组件基础", "doc_id": "fbf0aaed852546a7ae4c9e24956d36f8", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1435, "chunk_index": 23, "_doc_id": "23_4828732774945675342"}}
{"doc_id": "24_7804097522884838698", "text": "<span><<span><span>button-counter<span><span>></<span><span>button-counter<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>button-counter<span><span>></<span><span>button-counter<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>请看 <a href=\"#in-dom-template-parsing-caveats\">DOM 内模板解析注意事项<a>了解更多细节。<p><h2 id=\"passing-props\">传递 props <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#passing-props\">​<a><h2><p>如果我们正在构建一个博客，我们可能需要一个表示博客文章的组件。我们希望所有的博客文章分享相同的视觉布局，但有不同的内容。要实现这样的效果自然必须向组件中传递数据，例如每篇文章标题和内容，这就会使用到 props。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/component-basics.html", "title": "组件基础", "doc_id": "fbf0aaed852546a7ae4c9e24956d36f8", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1435, "chunk_index": 24, "_doc_id": "24_7804097522884838698"}}
{"doc_id": "25_7273789052243300590", "text": "构建一个博客，我们可能需要一个表示博客文章的组件。我们希望所有的博客文章分享相同的视觉布局，但有不同的内容。要实现这样的效果自然必须向组件中传递数据，例如每篇文章标题和内容，这就会使用到 props。<p><p>Props 是一种特别的 attributes，你可以在组件上声明注册。要传递给博客文章组件一个标题，我们必须在组件的 props 列表上声明它。这里要用到 <span class=\"options-api\"><a href=\"/api/options-state.html#props\"><code>props<code><a> 选项<span><span class=\"composition-api\"><a href=\"/api/sfc-script-setup.", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/component-basics.html", "title": "组件基础", "doc_id": "fbf0aaed852546a7ae4c9e24956d36f8", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1435, "chunk_index": 25, "_doc_id": "25_7273789052243300590"}}
{"doc_id": "26_7803946508752830967", "text": "ml#props\"><code>props<code><a> 选项<span><span class=\"composition-api\"><a href=\"/api/sfc-script-setup.html#defineprops-defineemits\"><code>defineProps<code><a> 宏<span>：<p><div class=\"options-api\"><div class=\"vp-code-block-title\"><p class=\"vp-code-block-title-bar\"><span class=\"vp-code-block-title-text\">BlogPost.vue<span><p><div class=\"language-vue\"> <span class=\"lang\">vue<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>script<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/component-basics.html", "title": "组件基础", "doc_id": "fbf0aaed852546a7ae4c9e24956d36f8", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1435, "chunk_index": 26, "_doc_id": "26_7803946508752830967"}}
{"doc_id": "27_2185265040857532172", "text": "ki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>script<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> props: [<span><span>'title'<span><span>]<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>script<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/component-basics.html", "title": "组件基础", "doc_id": "fbf0aaed852546a7ae4c9e24956d36f8", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1435, "chunk_index": 27, "_doc_id": "27_2185265040857532172"}}
{"doc_id": "28_9108013908168160902", "text": ">\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>h4<span><span>>{{ title }}</<span><span>h4<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><div><p>当一个值被传递给 prop 时，它将成为该组件实例上的一个属性。该属性的值可以像其他组件属性一样，在模板和组件的 <code>this<code> 上下文中访问。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/component-basics.html", "title": "组件基础", "doc_id": "fbf0aaed852546a7ae4c9e24956d36f8", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1435, "chunk_index": 28, "_doc_id": "28_9108013908168160902"}}
{"doc_id": "29_415531984362324350", "text": "><pre><div><div><p>当一个值被传递给 prop 时，它将成为该组件实例上的一个属性。该属性的值可以像其他组件属性一样，在模板和组件的 <code>this<code> 上下文中访问。<p><div><div class=\"composition-api\"><div class=\"vp-code-block-title\"><p class=\"vp-code-block-title-bar\"><span class=\"vp-code-block-title-text\">BlogPost.vue<span><p><div class=\"language-vue\"> <span class=\"lang\">vue<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>script<span><span> setup<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/component-basics.html", "title": "组件基础", "doc_id": "fbf0aaed852546a7ae4c9e24956d36f8", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1435, "chunk_index": 29, "_doc_id": "29_415531984362324350"}}
{"doc_id": "30_297661772757306367", "text": "code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>script<span><span> setup<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>defineProps<span><span>([<span><span>'title'<span><span>])<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>script<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>h4<span><span>>{{ title }}</<span><span>h4<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/component-basics.html", "title": "组件基础", "doc_id": "fbf0aaed852546a7ae4c9e24956d36f8", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1435, "chunk_index": 30, "_doc_id": "30_297661772757306367"}}
{"doc_id": "31_8599394007695676799", "text": "lass=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>h4<span><span>>{{ title }}</<span><span>h4<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><div><p><code>defineProps<code> 是一个仅 <code><script setup><code> 中可用的编译宏命令，并不需要显式地导入。声明的 props 会自动暴露给模板。<code>defineProps<code> 会返回一个对象，其中包含了可以传递给组件的所有 props：<p><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> props<span><span> =<span><span> defineProps<span><span>([<span><span>'title'<span><span>])<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/component-basics.html", "title": "组件基础", "doc_id": "fbf0aaed852546a7ae4c9e24956d36f8", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1435, "chunk_index": 31, "_doc_id": "31_8599394007695676799"}}
{"doc_id": "32_8527659523179110117", "text": "ps<span><span> =<span><span> defineProps<span><span>([<span><span>'title'<span><span>])<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>console.<span><span>log<span><span>(props.title)<span><span><code><pre><div><p>TypeScript 用户请参考：<a href=\"/guide/typescript/composition-api.html#typing-component-props\">为组件 props 标注类型<a> <p><p>如果你没有使用 <code><script setup><code>，props 必须以 <code>props<code> 选项的方式声明，props 对象会作为 <code>setup()<code> 函数的第一个参数被传入：<p><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/component-basics.html", "title": "组件基础", "doc_id": "fbf0aaed852546a7ae4c9e24956d36f8", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1435, "chunk_index": 32, "_doc_id": "32_8527659523179110117"}}
{"doc_id": "33_8856813710888891957", "text": "b-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> props: [<span><span>'title'<span><span>],<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> setup<span><span>(<span><span>props<span><span>) {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> console.<span><span>log<span><span>(props.title)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/component-basics.html", "title": "组件基础", "doc_id": "fbf0aaed852546a7ae4c9e24956d36f8", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1435, "chunk_index": 33, "_doc_id": "33_8856813710888891957"}}
{"doc_id": "34_6126711510278272372", "text": "onsole.<span><span>log<span><span>(props.title)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span><code><pre><div><div><p>一个组件可以有任意多的 props，默认情况下，所有 prop 都接受任意类型的值。<p><p>当一个 prop 被注册后，可以像这样以自定义 attribute 的形式传递数据给它：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>BlogPost<span><span> title<span><span>=<span><span>\"My journey with Vue\"<span><span> /><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/component-basics.html", "title": "组件基础", "doc_id": "fbf0aaed852546a7ae4c9e24956d36f8", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1435, "chunk_index": 34, "_doc_id": "34_6126711510278272372"}}
{"doc_id": "35_1233891982407990411", "text": "BlogPost<span><span> title<span><span>=<span><span>\"My journey with Vue\"<span><span> /><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>BlogPost<span><span> title<span><span>=<span><span>\"Blogging with Vue\"<span><span> /><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/component-basics.html", "title": "组件基础", "doc_id": "fbf0aaed852546a7ae4c9e24956d36f8", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1435, "chunk_index": 35, "_doc_id": "35_1233891982407990411"}}
{"doc_id": "36_6705566671977642545", "text": "n>BlogPost<span><span> title<span><span>=<span><span>\"Blogging with Vue\"<span><span> /><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>BlogPost<span><span> title<span><span>=<span><span>\"Why Vue is so fun\"<span><span> /><span><span><code><pre><div><p>在实际应用中，我们可能在父组件中会有如下的一个博客文章数组：<p><div class=\"options-api\"><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/component-basics.html", "title": "组件基础", "doc_id": "fbf0aaed852546a7ae4c9e24956d36f8", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1435, "chunk_index": 36, "_doc_id": "36_6705566671977642545"}}
{"doc_id": "37_4368696462873126566", "text": "b-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // ...<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> data<span><span>() {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> return<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> posts: [<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> { id: <span><span>1<span><span>, title: <span><span>'My journey with Vue'<span><span> },<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/component-basics.html", "title": "组件基础", "doc_id": "fbf0aaed852546a7ae4c9e24956d36f8", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1435, "chunk_index": 37, "_doc_id": "37_4368696462873126566"}}
{"doc_id": "38_3234580353625028797", "text": "id: <span><span>1<span><span>, title: <span><span>'My journey with Vue'<span><span> },<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> { id: <span><span>2<span><span>, title: <span><span>'Blogging with Vue'<span><span> },<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> { id: <span><span>3<span><span>, title: <span><span>'Why Vue is so fun'<span><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> ]<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/component-basics.html", "title": "组件基础", "doc_id": "fbf0aaed852546a7ae4c9e24956d36f8", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1435, "chunk_index": 38, "_doc_id": "38_3234580353625028797"}}
{"doc_id": "39_3014007383978163159", "text": "span> ]<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span><code><pre><div><div><div class=\"composition-api\"><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> posts<span><span> =<span><span> ref<span><span>([<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/component-basics.html", "title": "组件基础", "doc_id": "fbf0aaed852546a7ae4c9e24956d36f8", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1435, "chunk_index": 39, "_doc_id": "39_3014007383978163159"}}
{"doc_id": "40_2249535254723281207", "text": "class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> posts<span><span> =<span><span> ref<span><span>([<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> { id: <span><span>1<span><span>, title: <span><span>'My journey with Vue'<span><span> },<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> { id: <span><span>2<span><span>, title: <span><span>'Blogging with Vue'<span><span> },<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> { id: <span><span>3<span><span>, title: <span><span>'Why Vue is so fun'<span><span> }<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/component-basics.html", "title": "组件基础", "doc_id": "fbf0aaed852546a7ae4c9e24956d36f8", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1435, "chunk_index": 40, "_doc_id": "40_2249535254723281207"}}
{"doc_id": "41_4320875518489605436", "text": "> { id: <span><span>3<span><span>, title: <span><span>'Why Vue is so fun'<span><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>])<span><span><code><pre><div><div><p>这种情况下，我们可以使用 <code>v-for<code> 来渲染它们：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>BlogPost<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> v-for<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>post <span><span>in<span><span> posts<span><span>\"<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/component-basics.html", "title": "组件基础", "doc_id": "fbf0aaed852546a7ae4c9e24956d36f8", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1435, "chunk_index": 41, "_doc_id": "41_4320875518489605436"}}
{"doc_id": "42_735018821129067657", "text": "span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>post <span><span>in<span><span> posts<span><span>\"<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> :<span><span>key<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>post.id<span><span>\"<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> :<span><span>title<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>post.title<span><span>\"<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/component-basics.html", "title": "组件基础", "doc_id": "fbf0aaed852546a7ae4c9e24956d36f8", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1435, "chunk_index": 42, "_doc_id": "42_735018821129067657"}}
{"doc_id": "43_8537707308323488440", "text": "><span> :<span><span>title<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>post.title<span><span>\"<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> /><span><span><code><pre><div><p>留意我们是如何使用 <a href=\"/api/built-in-directives.html#v-bind\"><code>v-bind<code> 语法<a> (<code>:title=\"post.title\"<code>) 来传递动态 prop 值的。当事先不知道要渲染的确切内容时，这一点特别有用。<p><p>以上就是目前你需要了解的关于 props 的全部了。如果你看完本章节后还想知道更多细节，我们推荐你深入阅读关于 props 的<a href=\"/guide/components/props.html\">完整指引<a>。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/component-basics.html", "title": "组件基础", "doc_id": "fbf0aaed852546a7ae4c9e24956d36f8", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1435, "chunk_index": 43, "_doc_id": "43_8537707308323488440"}}
{"doc_id": "44_1653513873841317272", "text": "解的关于 props 的全部了。如果你看完本章节后还想知道更多细节，我们推荐你深入阅读关于 props 的<a href=\"/guide/components/props.html\">完整指引<a>。<p><h2 id=\"listening-to-events\">监听事件 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#listening-to-events\">​<a><h2><p>让我们继续关注我们的 <code><BlogPost><code> 组件。我们会发现有时候它需要与父组件进行交互。例如，要在此处实现无障碍访问的需求，将博客文章的文字能够放大，而页面的其余部分仍使用默认字号。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/component-basics.html", "title": "组件基础", "doc_id": "fbf0aaed852546a7ae4c9e24956d36f8", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1435, "chunk_index": 44, "_doc_id": "44_1653513873841317272"}}
{"doc_id": "45_840213051266511487", "text": "续关注我们的 <code><BlogPost><code> 组件。我们会发现有时候它需要与父组件进行交互。例如，要在此处实现无障碍访问的需求，将博客文章的文字能够放大，而页面的其余部分仍使用默认字号。<p><p>在父组件中，我们可以添加一个 <code>postFontSize<code> <span class=\"options-api\">数据属性<span><span class=\"composition-api\">ref <span>来实现这个效果：<p><div class=\"options-api\"><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>data<span><span>() {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> return<span><span> {<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/component-basics.html", "title": "组件基础", "doc_id": "fbf0aaed852546a7ae4c9e24956d36f8", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1435, "chunk_index": 45, "_doc_id": "45_840213051266511487"}}
{"doc_id": "46_6077250483810574807", "text": "\"><span>data<span><span>() {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> return<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> posts: [<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> /* ... */<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> ],<span><span>\n<span class=\"line highlighted\"><span> postFontSize: <span><span>1<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/component-basics.html", "title": "组件基础", "doc_id": "fbf0aaed852546a7ae4c9e24956d36f8", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1435, "chunk_index": 46, "_doc_id": "46_6077250483810574807"}}
{"doc_id": "47_8863474327405219380", "text": "highlighted\"><span> postFontSize: <span><span>1<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span><code><pre><div><div><div class=\"composition-api\"><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> posts<span><span> =<span><span> ref<span><span>([<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> /* ... */<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>])<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/component-basics.html", "title": "组件基础", "doc_id": "fbf0aaed852546a7ae4c9e24956d36f8", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1435, "chunk_index": 47, "_doc_id": "47_8863474327405219380"}}
{"doc_id": "48_3084288025436882878", "text": "span> /* ... */<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>])<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line highlighted\"><span>const<span><span> postFontSize<span><span> =<span><span> ref<span><span>(<span><span>1<span><span>)<span><span><code><pre><div><div><p>在模板中用它来控制所有博客文章的字体大小：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line highlighted\"><span><<span><span>div<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/component-basics.html", "title": "组件基础", "doc_id": "fbf0aaed852546a7ae4c9e24956d36f8", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1435, "chunk_index": 48, "_doc_id": "48_3084288025436882878"}}
{"doc_id": "49_2596555493711054676", "text": "\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line highlighted\"><span><<span><span>div<span><span> :<span><span>style<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>{ fontSize: postFontSize <span><span>+<span><span> 'em'<span><span> }<span><span>\"<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>BlogPost<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> v-for<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>post <span><span>in<span><span> posts<span><span>\"<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/component-basics.html", "title": "组件基础", "doc_id": "fbf0aaed852546a7ae4c9e24956d36f8", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1435, "chunk_index": 49, "_doc_id": "49_2596555493711054676"}}
{"doc_id": "50_5677132627845453329", "text": "span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>post <span><span>in<span><span> posts<span><span>\"<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> :<span><span>key<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>post.id<span><span>\"<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> :<span><span>title<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>post.title<span><span>\"<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> /><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/component-basics.html", "title": "组件基础", "doc_id": "fbf0aaed852546a7ae4c9e24956d36f8", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1435, "chunk_index": 50, "_doc_id": "50_5677132627845453329"}}
{"doc_id": "51_5131497947858440188", "text": "pan><span>\"<span><span>post.title<span><span>\"<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> /><span><span>\n<span class=\"line highlighted\"><span></<span><span>div<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>然后，给 <code><BlogPost><code> 组件添加一个按钮：<p><div class=\"vp-code-block-title\"><p class=\"vp-code-block-title-bar\"><span class=\"vp-code-block-title-text\">BlogPost.vue<span><p><div class=\"language-vue\"> <span class=\"lang\">vue<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><!-- 省略了 <script> --><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/component-basics.html", "title": "组件基础", "doc_id": "fbf0aaed852546a7ae4c9e24956d36f8", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1435, "chunk_index": 51, "_doc_id": "51_5131497947858440188"}}
{"doc_id": "52_1830894505447308718", "text": "class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><!-- 省略了 <script> --><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>div<span><span> class<span><span>=<span><span>\"blog-post\"<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>h4<span><span>>{{ title }}</<span><span>h4<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/component-basics.html", "title": "组件基础", "doc_id": "fbf0aaed852546a7ae4c9e24956d36f8", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1435, "chunk_index": 52, "_doc_id": "52_1830894505447308718"}}
{"doc_id": "53_4588144800660941234", "text": "lass=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>h4<span><span>>{{ title }}</<span><span>h4<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line highlighted\"><span> <<span><span>button<span><span>>Enlarge text</<span><span>button<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> </<span><span>div<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/component-basics.html", "title": "组件基础", "doc_id": "fbf0aaed852546a7ae4c9e24956d36f8", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1435, "chunk_index": 53, "_doc_id": "53_4588144800660941234"}}
{"doc_id": "54_5115322977801746863", "text": "utton<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> </<span><span>div<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><div><p>这个按钮目前还没有做任何事情，我们想要点击这个按钮来告诉父组件它应该放大所有博客文章的文字。要解决这个问题，组件实例提供了一个自定义事件系统。父组件可以通过 <code>v-on<code> 或 <code>@<code> 来选择性地监听子组件上抛的事件，就像监听原生 DOM 事件那样：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>BlogPost<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/component-basics.html", "title": "组件基础", "doc_id": "fbf0aaed852546a7ae4c9e24956d36f8", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1435, "chunk_index": 54, "_doc_id": "54_5115322977801746863"}}
{"doc_id": "55_7634635464983469315", "text": "class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>BlogPost<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> ...<span><span>\n<span class=\"line highlighted\"><span> @<span><span>enlarge-text<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>postFontSize <span><span>+=<span><span> 0.1<span><span>\"<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/component-basics.html", "title": "组件基础", "doc_id": "fbf0aaed852546a7ae4c9e24956d36f8", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1435, "chunk_index": 55, "_doc_id": "55_7634635464983469315"}}
{"doc_id": "56_1334278889825208294", "text": "span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>postFontSize <span><span>+=<span><span> 0.1<span><span>\"<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> /><span><span><code><pre><div><p>子组件可以通过调用内置的 <a href=\"/api/component-instance.html#emit\"><strong><code>$emit<code><strong> 方法<a>，通过传入事件名称来抛出一个事件：<p><div class=\"vp-code-block-title\"><p class=\"vp-code-block-title-bar\"><span class=\"vp-code-block-title-text\">BlogPost.vue<span><p><div class=\"language-vue\"> <span class=\"lang\">vue<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><!-- 省略了 <script> --><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/component-basics.html", "title": "组件基础", "doc_id": "fbf0aaed852546a7ae4c9e24956d36f8", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1435, "chunk_index": 56, "_doc_id": "56_1334278889825208294"}}
{"doc_id": "57_1830894505447308718", "text": "class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><!-- 省略了 <script> --><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>div<span><span> class<span><span>=<span><span>\"blog-post\"<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>h4<span><span>>{{ title }}</<span><span>h4<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/component-basics.html", "title": "组件基础", "doc_id": "fbf0aaed852546a7ae4c9e24956d36f8", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1435, "chunk_index": 57, "_doc_id": "57_1830894505447308718"}}
{"doc_id": "58_4189937234693658504", "text": "lass=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>h4<span><span>>{{ title }}</<span><span>h4<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line highlighted\"><span> <<span><span>button<span><span> @click<span><span>=<span><span>\"$emit('enlarge-text')\"<span><span>>Enlarge text</<span><span>button<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> </<span><span>div<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/component-basics.html", "title": "组件基础", "doc_id": "fbf0aaed852546a7ae4c9e24956d36f8", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1435, "chunk_index": 58, "_doc_id": "58_4189937234693658504"}}
{"doc_id": "59_2944750298167801831", "text": "utton<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> </<span><span>div<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><div><p>因为有了 <code>@enlarge-text=\"postFontSize += 0.1\"<code> 的监听，父组件会接收这一事件，从而更新 <code>postFontSize<code> 的值。<p><p>我们可以通过 <span class=\"options-api\"><a href=\"/api/options-state.html#emits\"><code>emits<code><a> 选项<span><span class=\"composition-api\"><a href=\"/api/sfc-script-setup.", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/component-basics.html", "title": "组件基础", "doc_id": "fbf0aaed852546a7ae4c9e24956d36f8", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1435, "chunk_index": 59, "_doc_id": "59_2944750298167801831"}}
{"doc_id": "60_2904071814620765212", "text": "ml#emits\"><code>emits<code><a> 选项<span><span class=\"composition-api\"><a href=\"/api/sfc-script-setup.html#defineprops-defineemits\"><code>defineEmits<code><a> 宏<span>来声明需要抛出的事件：<p><div class=\"options-api\"><div class=\"vp-code-block-title\"><p class=\"vp-code-block-title-bar\"><span class=\"vp-code-block-title-text\">BlogPost.vue<span><p><div class=\"language-vue\"> <span class=\"lang\">vue<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>script<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/component-basics.html", "title": "组件基础", "doc_id": "fbf0aaed852546a7ae4c9e24956d36f8", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1435, "chunk_index": 60, "_doc_id": "60_2904071814620765212"}}
{"doc_id": "61_846357132676306352", "text": "ki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>script<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> props: [<span><span>'title'<span><span>],<span><span>\n<span class=\"line highlighted\"><span> emits: [<span><span>'enlarge-text'<span><span>]<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/component-basics.html", "title": "组件基础", "doc_id": "fbf0aaed852546a7ae4c9e24956d36f8", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1435, "chunk_index": 61, "_doc_id": "61_846357132676306352"}}
{"doc_id": "62_5415216629725432731", "text": "emits: [<span><span>'enlarge-text'<span><span>]<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>script<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><div><div><div class=\"composition-api\"><div class=\"vp-code-block-title\"><p class=\"vp-code-block-title-bar\"><span class=\"vp-code-block-title-text\">BlogPost.vue<span><p><div class=\"language-vue\"> <span class=\"lang\">vue<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>script<span><span> setup<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/component-basics.html", "title": "组件基础", "doc_id": "fbf0aaed852546a7ae4c9e24956d36f8", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1435, "chunk_index": 62, "_doc_id": "62_5415216629725432731"}}
{"doc_id": "63_5055258167843542940", "text": "code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>script<span><span> setup<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>defineProps<span><span>([<span><span>'title'<span><span>])<span><span>\n<span class=\"line highlighted\"><span>defineEmits<span><span>([<span><span>'enlarge-text'<span><span>])<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>script<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><div><div><p>这声明了一个组件可能触发的所有事件，还可以对事件的参数进行<a href=\"/guide/components/events.html#validate-emitted-events\">验证<a>。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/component-basics.html", "title": "组件基础", "doc_id": "fbf0aaed852546a7ae4c9e24956d36f8", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1435, "chunk_index": 63, "_doc_id": "63_5055258167843542940"}}
{"doc_id": "64_2012779471362824303", "text": ">这声明了一个组件可能触发的所有事件，还可以对事件的参数进行<a href=\"/guide/components/events.html#validate-emitted-events\">验证<a>。同时，这还可以让 Vue 避免将它们作为原生事件监听器隐式地应用于子组件的根元素。<p><div class=\"composition-api\"><p>和 <code>defineProps<code> 类似，<code>defineEmits<code> 仅可用于 <code><script setup><code> 之中，并且不需要导入，它返回一个等同于 <code>$emit<code> 方法的 <code>emit<code> 函数。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/component-basics.html", "title": "组件基础", "doc_id": "fbf0aaed852546a7ae4c9e24956d36f8", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1435, "chunk_index": 64, "_doc_id": "64_2012779471362824303"}}
{"doc_id": "65_7454451474091135967", "text": "code> 仅可用于 <code><script setup><code> 之中，并且不需要导入，它返回一个等同于 <code>$emit<code> 方法的 <code>emit<code> 函数。它可以被用于在组件的 <code><script setup><code> 中抛出事件，因为此处无法直接访问 <code>$emit<code>：<p><div class=\"language-vue\"> <span class=\"lang\">vue<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>script<span><span> setup<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/component-basics.html", "title": "组件基础", "doc_id": "fbf0aaed852546a7ae4c9e24956d36f8", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1435, "chunk_index": 65, "_doc_id": "65_7454451474091135967"}}
{"doc_id": "66_895597275714869903", "text": "code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>script<span><span> setup<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> emit<span><span> =<span><span> defineEmits<span><span>([<span><span>'enlarge-text'<span><span>])<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>emit<span><span>(<span><span>'enlarge-text'<span><span>)<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/component-basics.html", "title": "组件基础", "doc_id": "fbf0aaed852546a7ae4c9e24956d36f8", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1435, "chunk_index": 66, "_doc_id": "66_895597275714869903"}}
{"doc_id": "67_2916839797218528927", "text": "span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>emit<span><span>(<span><span>'enlarge-text'<span><span>)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>script<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>TypeScript 用户请参考：<a href=\"/guide/typescript/composition-api.html#typing-component-emits\">为组件 emits 标注类型<a> <p><p>如果你没有在使用 <code><script setup><code>，你可以通过 <code>emits<code> 选项定义组件会抛出的事件。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/component-basics.html", "title": "组件基础", "doc_id": "fbf0aaed852546a7ae4c9e24956d36f8", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1435, "chunk_index": 67, "_doc_id": "67_2916839797218528927"}}
{"doc_id": "68_1084301207989934139", "text": "s\">为组件 emits 标注类型<a> <p><p>如果你没有在使用 <code><script setup><code>，你可以通过 <code>emits<code> 选项定义组件会抛出的事件。你可以从 <code>setup()<code> 函数的第二个参数，即 setup 上下文对象上访问到 <code>emit<code> 函数：<p><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> emits: [<span><span>'enlarge-text'<span><span>],<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/component-basics.html", "title": "组件基础", "doc_id": "fbf0aaed852546a7ae4c9e24956d36f8", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1435, "chunk_index": 68, "_doc_id": "68_1084301207989934139"}}
{"doc_id": "69_64886790489052851", "text": "<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> emits: [<span><span>'enlarge-text'<span><span>],<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> setup<span><span>(<span><span>props<span><span>, <span><span>ctx<span><span>) {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> ctx.<span><span>emit<span><span>(<span><span>'enlarge-text'<span><span>)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/component-basics.html", "title": "组件基础", "doc_id": "fbf0aaed852546a7ae4c9e24956d36f8", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1435, "chunk_index": 69, "_doc_id": "69_64886790489052851"}}
{"doc_id": "70_1124196023492883761", "text": "><span>(<span><span>'enlarge-text'<span><span>)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span><code><pre><div><div><p>以上就是目前你需要了解的关于组件自定义事件的所有知识了。如果你看完本章节后还想知道更多细节，请深入阅读<a href=\"/guide/components/events.html\">组件事件<a>章节。<p><h2 id=\"content-distribution-with-slots\">通过插槽来分配内容 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#content-distribution-with-slots\">​<a><h2><p>一些情况下我们会希望能和 HTML 元素一样向组件中传递内容：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>AlertBox<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/component-basics.html", "title": "组件基础", "doc_id": "fbf0aaed852546a7ae4c9e24956d36f8", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1435, "chunk_index": 70, "_doc_id": "70_1124196023492883761"}}
{"doc_id": "71_5848407321557977732", "text": "github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>AlertBox<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> Something bad happened.<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>AlertBox<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>我们期望能渲染成这样：<p><div class=\"danger custom-block\"><p class=\"custom-block-title\">This is an Error for Demo Purposes<p><p>Something bad happened.", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/component-basics.html", "title": "组件基础", "doc_id": "fbf0aaed852546a7ae4c9e24956d36f8", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1435, "chunk_index": 71, "_doc_id": "71_5848407321557977732"}}
{"doc_id": "72_410841216913856208", "text": "block\"><p class=\"custom-block-title\">This is an Error for Demo Purposes<p><p>Something bad happened.<p><div><p>这可以通过 Vue 的自定义 <code><slot><code> 元素来实现：<p><div class=\"vp-code-block-title\"><p class=\"vp-code-block-title-bar\"><span class=\"vp-code-block-title-text\">AlertBox.vue<span><p><div class=\"language-vue\"> <span class=\"lang\">vue<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/component-basics.html", "title": "组件基础", "doc_id": "fbf0aaed852546a7ae4c9e24956d36f8", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1435, "chunk_index": 72, "_doc_id": "72_410841216913856208"}}
{"doc_id": "73_7037824732067798750", "text": "github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>div<span><span> class<span><span>=<span><span>\"alert-box\"<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>strong<span><span>>This is an Error for Demo Purposes</<span><span>strong<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line highlighted\"><span> <<span><span>slot<span><span> /<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/component-basics.html", "title": "组件基础", "doc_id": "fbf0aaed852546a7ae4c9e24956d36f8", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1435, "chunk_index": 73, "_doc_id": "73_7037824732067798750"}}
{"doc_id": "74_39301280316074890", "text": "pan>\n<span class=\"line highlighted\"><span> <<span><span>slot<span><span> /<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> </<span><span>div<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>style<span><span> scoped<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>.alert-box<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> /* ... */<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/component-basics.html", "title": "组件基础", "doc_id": "fbf0aaed852546a7ae4c9e24956d36f8", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1435, "chunk_index": 74, "_doc_id": "74_39301280316074890"}}
{"doc_id": "75_5613159957567655404", "text": "<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> /* ... */<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>style<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><div><p>如上所示，我们使用 <code><slot><code> 作为一个占位符，父组件传递进来的内容就会渲染在这里。<p><p>以上就是目前你需要了解的关于插槽的所有知识了。如果你看完本章节后还想知道更多细节，请深入阅读<a href=\"/guide/components/slots.html\">组件插槽<a>章节。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/component-basics.html", "title": "组件基础", "doc_id": "fbf0aaed852546a7ae4c9e24956d36f8", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1435, "chunk_index": 75, "_doc_id": "75_5613159957567655404"}}
{"doc_id": "76_115521361159954599", "text": "p><p>以上就是目前你需要了解的关于插槽的所有知识了。如果你看完本章节后还想知道更多细节，请深入阅读<a href=\"/guide/components/slots.html\">组件插槽<a>章节。<p><h2 id=\"dynamic-components\">动态组件 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#dynamic-components\">​<a><h2><p>有些场景会需要在两个组件间来回切换，比如 Tab 界面：<p><p>上面的例子是通过 Vue 的 <code><component><code> 元素和特殊的 <code>is<code> attribute 实现的：<p><div class=\"options-api\"><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><!-- currentTab 改变时组件也改变 --><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/component-basics.html", "title": "组件基础", "doc_id": "fbf0aaed852546a7ae4c9e24956d36f8", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1435, "chunk_index": 76, "_doc_id": "76_115521361159954599"}}
{"doc_id": "77_6980704853883007538", "text": "\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><!-- currentTab 改变时组件也改变 --><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>component<span><span> :<span><span>is<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>currentTab<span><span>\"<span><span>></<span><span>component<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><div><div class=\"composition-api\"><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><!-- currentTab 改变时组件也改变 --><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/component-basics.html", "title": "组件基础", "doc_id": "fbf0aaed852546a7ae4c9e24956d36f8", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1435, "chunk_index": 77, "_doc_id": "77_6980704853883007538"}}
{"doc_id": "78_7934639976932658510", "text": "\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><!-- currentTab 改变时组件也改变 --><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>component<span><span> :<span><span>is<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>tabs[currentTab]<span><span>\"<span><span>></<span><span>component<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><div><p>在上面的例子中，被传给 <code>:is<code> 的值可以是以下几种：<p><p>你也可以使用 <code>is<code> attribute 来创建一般的 HTML 元素。<p><p>当使用 <code><component :is=\"...\"><code> 来在多个组件间作切换时，被切换掉的组件会被卸载。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/component-basics.html", "title": "组件基础", "doc_id": "fbf0aaed852546a7ae4c9e24956d36f8", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1435, "chunk_index": 78, "_doc_id": "78_7934639976932658510"}}
{"doc_id": "79_8872940003232371718", "text": "<code> attribute 来创建一般的 HTML 元素。<p><p>当使用 <code><component :is=\"...\"><code> 来在多个组件间作切换时，被切换掉的组件会被卸载。我们可以通过 <a href=\"/guide/built-ins/keep-alive.html\"><code><KeepAlive><code> 组件<a>强制被切换掉的组件仍然保持“存活”的状态。<p><h2 id=\"in-dom-template-parsing-caveats\">DOM 内模板解析注意事项 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#in-dom-template-parsing-caveats\">​<a><h2><p>如果你想在 DOM 中直接书写 Vue 模板，Vue 则必须从 DOM 中获取模板字符串。由于浏览器的原生 HTML 解析行为限制，有一些需要注意的事项。<p><div class=\"tip custom-block\"><p class=\"custom-block-title\">TIP<p><p>请注意下面讨论只适用于直接在 DOM 中编写模板的情况。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/component-basics.html", "title": "组件基础", "doc_id": "fbf0aaed852546a7ae4c9e24956d36f8", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1435, "chunk_index": 79, "_doc_id": "79_8872940003232371718"}}
{"doc_id": "80_8490540526196780692", "text": "<p><div class=\"tip custom-block\"><p class=\"custom-block-title\">TIP<p><p>请注意下面讨论只适用于直接在 DOM 中编写模板的情况。如果你使用来自以下来源的字符串模板，就不需要顾虑这些限制了：<p><ul><li>单文件组件<li><li>内联模板字符串 (例如 <code>template: '...'<code>)<li><li><code><script type=\"text/x-template\"><code><li><ul><div><h3 id=\"case-insensitivity\">大小写区分 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#case-insensitivity\">​<a><h3><p>HTML 标签和属性名称是不分大小写的，所以浏览器会把任何大写的字符解释为小写。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/component-basics.html", "title": "组件基础", "doc_id": "fbf0aaed852546a7ae4c9e24956d36f8", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1435, "chunk_index": 80, "_doc_id": "80_8490540526196780692"}}
{"doc_id": "81_8087412739666951047", "text": "class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#case-insensitivity\">​<a><h3><p>HTML 标签和属性名称是不分大小写的，所以浏览器会把任何大写的字符解释为小写。这意味着当你使用 DOM 内的模板时，无论是 PascalCase 形式的组件名称、camelCase 形式的 prop 名称还是 v-on 的事件名称，都需要转换为相应等价的 kebab-case (短横线连字符) 形式：<p><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// JavaScript 中的 camelCase<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> BlogPost<span><span> =<span><span> {<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/component-basics.html", "title": "组件基础", "doc_id": "fbf0aaed852546a7ae4c9e24956d36f8", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1435, "chunk_index": 81, "_doc_id": "81_8087412739666951047"}}
{"doc_id": "82_2339012852910950682", "text": "><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> BlogPost<span><span> =<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> props: [<span><span>'postTitle'<span><span>],<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> emits: [<span><span>'updatePost'<span><span>],<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> template: <span><span>`<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <h3>{{ postTitle }}</h3><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> `<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/component-basics.html", "title": "组件基础", "doc_id": "fbf0aaed852546a7ae4c9e24956d36f8", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1435, "chunk_index": 82, "_doc_id": "82_2339012852910950682"}}
{"doc_id": "83_3234111217219660227", "text": "an class=\"line\"><span> <h3>{{ postTitle }}</h3><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> `<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span><code><pre><div><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><!-- HTML 中的 kebab-case --><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/component-basics.html", "title": "组件基础", "doc_id": "fbf0aaed852546a7ae4c9e24956d36f8", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1435, "chunk_index": 83, "_doc_id": "83_3234111217219660227"}}
{"doc_id": "84_3679637824018350728", "text": "=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><!-- HTML 中的 kebab-case --><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>blog-post<span><span> post-title<span><span>=<span><span>\"hello!\"<span><span> @<span><span>update-post<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>onUpdatePost<span><span>\"<span><span>></<span><span>blog-post<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>我们在上面的例子中已经使用过了闭合标签 (self-closing tag)：<p><p>这是因为 Vue 的模板解析器支持任意标签使用 <code>/><code> 作为标签关闭的标志。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/component-basics.html", "title": "组件基础", "doc_id": "fbf0aaed852546a7ae4c9e24956d36f8", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1435, "chunk_index": 84, "_doc_id": "84_3679637824018350728"}}
{"doc_id": "85_9046405471586444940", "text": "iv><p>我们在上面的例子中已经使用过了闭合标签 (self-closing tag)：<p><p>这是因为 Vue 的模板解析器支持任意标签使用 <code>/><code> 作为标签关闭的标志。<p><p>然而在 DOM 内模板中，我们必须显式地写出关闭标签：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>my-component<span><span>></<span><span>my-component<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>这是由于 HTML 只允许<a href=\"https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/syntax.html#void-elements\" target=\"_blank\">一小部分特殊的元素<a>省略其关闭标签，最常见的就是 <code><input><code> 和 <code><img><code>。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/component-basics.html", "title": "组件基础", "doc_id": "fbf0aaed852546a7ae4c9e24956d36f8", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1435, "chunk_index": 85, "_doc_id": "85_9046405471586444940"}}
{"doc_id": "86_4303025886443299219", "text": "l#void-elements\" target=\"_blank\">一小部分特殊的元素<a>省略其关闭标签，最常见的就是 <code><input><code> 和 <code><img><code>。对于其他的元素来说，如果你省略了关闭标签，原生的 HTML 解析器会认为开启的标签永远没有结束，用下面这个代码片段举例来说：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>my-component<span><span> /> <span><span><!-- 我们想要在这里关闭标签... --><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/component-basics.html", "title": "组件基础", "doc_id": "fbf0aaed852546a7ae4c9e24956d36f8", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1435, "chunk_index": 86, "_doc_id": "86_4303025886443299219"}}
{"doc_id": "87_444288545757701199", "text": "ine\"><span><<span><span>my-component<span><span> /> <span><span><!-- 我们想要在这里关闭标签... --><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>span<span><span>>hello</<span><span>span<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>将被解析为：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>my-component<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/component-basics.html", "title": "组件基础", "doc_id": "fbf0aaed852546a7ae4c9e24956d36f8", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1435, "chunk_index": 87, "_doc_id": "87_444288545757701199"}}
{"doc_id": "88_4629246629012381135", "text": "hub-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>my-component<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>span<span><span>>hello</<span><span>span<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/component-basics.html", "title": "组件基础", "doc_id": "fbf0aaed852546a7ae4c9e24956d36f8", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1435, "chunk_index": 88, "_doc_id": "88_4629246629012381135"}}
{"doc_id": "89_2272758310792882561", "text": "class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>span<span><span>>hello</<span><span>span<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>my-component<span><span>> <span><span><!-- 但浏览器会在这里关闭标签 --><span><span><code><pre><div><h3 id=\"element-placement-restrictions\">元素位置限制 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#element-placement-restrictions\">​<a><h3><p>某些 HTML 元素对于放在其中的元素类型有限制，例如 <code><ul><code>，<code><ol><code>，<code><table><code> 和 <code><select><code>，相应的，某些元素仅在放置于特定元素中时才会显示，例如 <code><li><code>，<code><tr><code> 和 <code><option><code>。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/component-basics.html", "title": "组件基础", "doc_id": "fbf0aaed852546a7ae4c9e24956d36f8", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1435, "chunk_index": 89, "_doc_id": "89_2272758310792882561"}}
{"doc_id": "90_4977133338642509741", "text": "><select><code>，相应的，某些元素仅在放置于特定元素中时才会显示，例如 <code><li><code>，<code><tr><code> 和 <code><option><code>。<p><p>这将导致在使用带有此类限制元素的组件时出现问题。例如：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>table<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>blog-post-row<span><span>></<span><span>blog-post-row<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/component-basics.html", "title": "组件基础", "doc_id": "fbf0aaed852546a7ae4c9e24956d36f8", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1435, "chunk_index": 90, "_doc_id": "90_4977133338642509741"}}
{"doc_id": "91_199856941044699415", "text": "><span> <<span><span>blog-post-row<span><span>></<span><span>blog-post-row<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>table<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>自定义的组件 <code><blog-post-row><code> 将作为无效的内容被忽略，因而在最终呈现的输出中造成错误。我们可以使用特殊的 <a href=\"/api/built-in-special-attributes.html#is\"><code>is<code> attribute<a> 作为一种解决方案：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>table<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/component-basics.html", "title": "组件基础", "doc_id": "fbf0aaed852546a7ae4c9e24956d36f8", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1435, "chunk_index": 91, "_doc_id": "91_199856941044699415"}}
{"doc_id": "92_7426894886658306101", "text": "iki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>table<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>tr<span><span> is<span><span>=<span><span>\"vue:blog-post-row\"<span><span>></<span><span>tr<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>table<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><div class=\"tip custom-block\"><p class=\"custom-block-title\">TIP<p><p>当使用在原生 HTML 元素上时，<code>is<code> 的值必须加上前缀 <code>vue:<code> 才可以被解析为一个 Vue 组件。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/component-basics.html", "title": "组件基础", "doc_id": "fbf0aaed852546a7ae4c9e24956d36f8", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1435, "chunk_index": 92, "_doc_id": "92_7426894886658306101"}}
{"doc_id": "93_5539160818341189434", "text": "om-block-title\">TIP<p><p>当使用在原生 HTML 元素上时，<code>is<code> 的值必须加上前缀 <code>vue:<code> 才可以被解析为一个 Vue 组件。这一点是必要的，为了避免和原生的<a href=\"https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/custom-elements.html#custom-elements-customized-builtin-example\" target=\"_blank\">自定义内置元素<a>相混淆。<p><div><p>以上就是你需要了解的关于 DOM 内模板解析的所有注意事项，同时也是 Vue <em>基础<em>部分的所有内容。祝贺你！虽然还有很多需要学习的，但你可以先暂停一下，去用 Vue 做一些有趣的东西，或者研究一些<a href=\"/examples/\">示例<a>。<p><p>完成了本页的阅读后，回顾一下你刚才所学到的知识，如果还想知道更多细节，我们推荐你继续阅读关于组件的完整指引。<p><div><div>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/component-basics.html", "title": "组件基础", "doc_id": "fbf0aaed852546a7ae4c9e24956d36f8", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1435, "chunk_index": 93, "_doc_id": "93_5539160818341189434"}}
{"doc_id": "0_2171539062694586745", "text": "<div><div><h1 id=\"watchers\">侦听器 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#watchers\">​<a><h1><h2 id=\"basic-example\">基本示例 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#basic-example\">​<a><h2><p>计算属性允许我们声明性地计算衍生值。然而在有些情况下，我们需要在状态变化时执行一些“副作用”：例如更改 DOM，或是根据异步操作的结果去修改另一处的状态。<p><div class=\"options-api\"><p>在选项式 API 中，我们可以使用 <a href=\"/api/options-state.html#watch\"><code>watch<code> 选项<a>在每次响应式属性发生变化时触发一个函数。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/watchers.html", "title": "侦听器 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "b9881ac7c683440a9e6f428f48edd38f", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1820, "chunk_index": 0, "_doc_id": "0_2171539062694586745"}}
{"doc_id": "1_5184651458687588984", "text": "选项式 API 中，我们可以使用 <a href=\"/api/options-state.html#watch\"><code>watch<code> 选项<a>在每次响应式属性发生变化时触发一个函数。<p><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> data<span><span>() {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> return<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> question: <span><span>''<span><span>,<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/watchers.html", "title": "侦听器 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "b9881ac7c683440a9e6f428f48edd38f", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1820, "chunk_index": 1, "_doc_id": "1_5184651458687588984"}}
{"doc_id": "2_8865211840363752122", "text": "an><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> question: <span><span>''<span><span>,<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> answer: <span><span>'Questions usually contain a question mark. ;-)'<span><span>,<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> loading: <span><span>false<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> },<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> watch: {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 每当 question 改变时，这个函数就会执行<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/watchers.html", "title": "侦听器 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "b9881ac7c683440a9e6f428f48edd38f", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1820, "chunk_index": 2, "_doc_id": "2_8865211840363752122"}}
{"doc_id": "3_8636084091898279834", "text": "line\"><span> watch: {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 每当 question 改变时，这个函数就会执行<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> question<span><span>(<span><span>newQuestion<span><span>, <span><span>oldQuestion<span><span>) {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> if<span><span> (newQuestion.<span><span>includes<span><span>(<span><span>'?'<span><span>)) {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> this<span><span>.<span><span>getAnswer<span><span>()<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/watchers.html", "title": "侦听器 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "b9881ac7c683440a9e6f428f48edd38f", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1820, "chunk_index": 3, "_doc_id": "3_8636084091898279834"}}
{"doc_id": "4_2912662949712064574", "text": "span><span>.<span><span>getAnswer<span><span>()<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> },<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> methods: {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> async<span><span> getAnswer<span><span>() {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> this<span><span>.loading <span><span>=<span><span> true<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> this<span><span>.answer <span><span>=<span><span> 'Thinking...'<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/watchers.html", "title": "侦听器 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "b9881ac7c683440a9e6f428f48edd38f", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1820, "chunk_index": 4, "_doc_id": "4_2912662949712064574"}}
{"doc_id": "5_6992163455167036790", "text": "pan class=\"line\"><span> this<span><span>.answer <span><span>=<span><span> 'Thinking...'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> try<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> const<span><span> res<span><span> =<span><span> await<span><span> fetch<span><span>(<span><span>'https://yesno.wtf/api'<span><span>)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> this<span><span>.answer <span><span>=<span><span> (<span><span>await<span><span> res.<span><span>json<span><span>()).answer<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/watchers.html", "title": "侦听器 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "b9881ac7c683440a9e6f428f48edd38f", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1820, "chunk_index": 5, "_doc_id": "5_6992163455167036790"}}
{"doc_id": "6_2571001493427023568", "text": "=<span><span> (<span><span>await<span><span> res.<span><span>json<span><span>()).answer<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> } <span><span>catch<span><span> (error) {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> this<span><span>.answer <span><span>=<span><span> 'Error! Could not reach the API. '<span><span> +<span><span> error<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> } <span><span>finally<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> this<span><span>.loading <span><span>=<span><span> false<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/watchers.html", "title": "侦听器 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "b9881ac7c683440a9e6f428f48edd38f", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1820, "chunk_index": 6, "_doc_id": "6_2571001493427023568"}}
{"doc_id": "7_2531908382505042553", "text": "pan>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> this<span><span>.loading <span><span>=<span><span> false<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span><code><pre><div><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>p<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> Ask a yes/no question:<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/watchers.html", "title": "侦听器 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "b9881ac7c683440a9e6f428f48edd38f", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1820, "chunk_index": 7, "_doc_id": "7_2531908382505042553"}}
{"doc_id": "8_6794769241391437734", "text": "<span><span>p<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> Ask a yes/no question:<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>input<span><span> v-model<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>question<span><span>\"<span><span> :<span><span>disabled<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>loading<span><span>\"<span><span> /><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>p<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/watchers.html", "title": "侦听器 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "b9881ac7c683440a9e6f428f48edd38f", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1820, "chunk_index": 8, "_doc_id": "8_6794769241391437734"}}
{"doc_id": "9_8180709950499342814", "text": "span>\"<span><span> /><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>p<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>p<span><span>>{{ answer }}</<span><span>p<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p><a href=\"https://play.vuejs.org/#eNp9VE1v2zAM/SucLnaw1D70lqUbsiKH7rB1W4++aDYdq5ElTx9xgiD/fbT8lXZFAQO2+Mgn8pH0mW2aJjl4ZCu2trkRjfucKTw22jgosOReOjhnCqDgjseL/hvAoPNGjSeAvx6tE1qtIIqWo5Er26Ih088BteCt51KeINfKcaGAT5FQc7NP4NPNYiaQmhdC7VZQcmlxMF+61yUcWu7yajVmkabQVqjwgGZmzSuudmiX4CphofQqD+ZWSAnGqz5y", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/watchers.html", "title": "侦听器 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "b9881ac7c683440a9e6f428f48edd38f", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1820, "chunk_index": 9, "_doc_id": "9_8180709950499342814"}}
