{"doc_id": "23_6578053514897795774", "text": "\" target=\"_blank\">在演练场中尝试一下<a><p><h3 id=\"watch-source-types\">侦听数据源类型 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#watch-source-types\">​<a><h3><p><code>watch<code> 的第一个参数可以是不同形式的“数据源”：它可以是一个 ref", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/watchers.html", "title": "侦听器 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "b9881ac7c683440a9e6f428f48edd38f", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1820, "chunk_index": 23, "_doc_id": "23_6578053514897795774"}}
{"doc_id": "24_1909357720500918148", "text": "ader-anchor\" href=\"#watch-source-types\">​<a><h3><p><code>watch<code> 的第一个参数可以是不同形式的“数据源”：它可以是一个 ref (包括计算属性)、一个响应式对象、一个 <a href=\"https://developer.mozilla.org/zh-CN/docs/Web/JavaScript/Reference/Functions/get#description\" target=\"_blank\">getter 函数<a>、或多个数据源组成的数组：<p><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> x<span><span> =<span><span> ref<span><span>(<span><span>0<span><span>)<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/watchers.html", "title": "侦听器 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "b9881ac7c683440a9e6f428f48edd38f", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1820, "chunk_index": 24, "_doc_id": "24_1909357720500918148"}}
{"doc_id": "25_8891439728184004739", "text": "onst<span><span> x<span><span> =<span><span> ref<span><span>(<span><span>0<span><span>)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> y<span><span> =<span><span> ref<span><span>(<span><span>0<span><span>)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 单个 ref<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>watch<span><span>(x, (<span><span>newX<span><span>) <span><span>=><span><span> {<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/watchers.html", "title": "侦听器 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "b9881ac7c683440a9e6f428f48edd38f", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1820, "chunk_index": 25, "_doc_id": "25_8891439728184004739"}}
{"doc_id": "26_4567949394954771242", "text": "><span>watch<span><span>(x, (<span><span>newX<span><span>) <span><span>=><span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> console.<span><span>log<span><span>(<span><span>`x is ${<span><span>newX<span><span>}`<span><span>)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>})<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// getter 函数<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>watch<span><span>(<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/watchers.html", "title": "侦听器 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "b9881ac7c683440a9e6f428f48edd38f", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1820, "chunk_index": 26, "_doc_id": "26_4567949394954771242"}}
{"doc_id": "27_7836676015730953735", "text": "class=\"line\"><span>// getter 函数<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>watch<span><span>(<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> () <span><span>=><span><span> x.value <span><span>+<span><span> y.value,<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> (<span><span>sum<span><span>) <span><span>=><span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> console.<span><span>log<span><span>(<span><span>`sum of x + y is: ${<span><span>sum<span><span>}`<span><span>)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/watchers.html", "title": "侦听器 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "b9881ac7c683440a9e6f428f48edd38f", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1820, "chunk_index": 27, "_doc_id": "27_7836676015730953735"}}
{"doc_id": "28_3211753319774349639", "text": "s: ${<span><span>sum<span><span>}`<span><span>)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 多个来源组成的数组<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>watch<span><span>([x, () <span><span>=><span><span> y.value], ([<span><span>newX<span><span>, <span><span>newY<span><span>]) <span><span>=><span><span> {<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/watchers.html", "title": "侦听器 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "b9881ac7c683440a9e6f428f48edd38f", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1820, "chunk_index": 28, "_doc_id": "28_3211753319774349639"}}
{"doc_id": "29_7214526515774269905", "text": "pan><span>newX<span><span>, <span><span>newY<span><span>]) <span><span>=><span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> console.<span><span>log<span><span>(<span><span>`x is ${<span><span>newX<span><span>} and y is ${<span><span>newY<span><span>}`<span><span>)<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/watchers.html", "title": "侦听器 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "b9881ac7c683440a9e6f428f48edd38f", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1820, "chunk_index": 29, "_doc_id": "29_7214526515774269905"}}
{"doc_id": "30_3849014012127706421", "text": "${<span><span>newX<span><span>} and y is ${<span><span>newY<span><span>}`<span><span>)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>})<span><span><code><pre><div><p>注意，你不能直接侦听响应式对象的属性值，例如：<p><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> obj<span><span> =<span><span> reactive<span><span>({ count: <span><span>0<span><span> })<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/watchers.html", "title": "侦听器 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "b9881ac7c683440a9e6f428f48edd38f", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1820, "chunk_index": 30, "_doc_id": "30_3849014012127706421"}}
{"doc_id": "31_8853504006961949092", "text": "n> reactive<span><span>({ count: <span><span>0<span><span> })<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 错误，因为 watch() 得到的参数是一个 number<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>watch<span><span>(obj.count, (<span><span>count<span><span>) <span><span>=><span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> console.<span><span>log<span><span>(<span><span>`Count is: ${<span><span>count<span><span>}`<span><span>)<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/watchers.html", "title": "侦听器 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "b9881ac7c683440a9e6f428f48edd38f", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1820, "chunk_index": 31, "_doc_id": "31_8853504006961949092"}}
{"doc_id": "32_3658945002680791961", "text": "n>log<span><span>(<span><span>`Count is: ${<span><span>count<span><span>}`<span><span>)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>})<span><span><code><pre><div><p>这里需要用一个返回该属性的 getter 函数：<p><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// 提供一个 getter 函数<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>watch<span><span>(<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> () <span><span>=><span><span> obj.count,<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/watchers.html", "title": "侦听器 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "b9881ac7c683440a9e6f428f48edd38f", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1820, "chunk_index": 32, "_doc_id": "32_3658945002680791961"}}
{"doc_id": "33_5798298488735506221", "text": "><span>(<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> () <span><span>=><span><span> obj.count,<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> (<span><span>count<span><span>) <span><span>=><span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> console.<span><span>log<span><span>(<span><span>`Count is: ${<span><span>count<span><span>}`<span><span>)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/watchers.html", "title": "侦听器 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "b9881ac7c683440a9e6f428f48edd38f", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1820, "chunk_index": 33, "_doc_id": "33_5798298488735506221"}}
{"doc_id": "34_2798997806214040529", "text": "${<span><span>count<span><span>}`<span><span>)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>)<span><span><code><pre><div><div><h2 id=\"deep-watchers\">深层侦听器 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#deep-watchers\">​<a><h2><div class=\"options-api\"><p><code>watch<code> 默认是浅层的：被侦听的属性，仅在被赋新值时，才会触发回调函数——而嵌套属性的变化不会触发。如果想侦听所有嵌套的变更，你需要深层侦听器：<p><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/watchers.html", "title": "侦听器 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "b9881ac7c683440a9e6f428f48edd38f", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1820, "chunk_index": 34, "_doc_id": "34_2798997806214040529"}}
{"doc_id": "35_1152367199937532017", "text": "b-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> watch: {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> someObject: {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> handler<span><span>(<span><span>newValue<span><span>, <span><span>oldValue<span><span>) {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 注意：在嵌套的变更中，<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 只要没有替换对象本身，<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 那么这里的 `newValue` 和 `oldValue` 相同<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/watchers.html", "title": "侦听器 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "b9881ac7c683440a9e6f428f48edd38f", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1820, "chunk_index": 35, "_doc_id": "35_1152367199937532017"}}
{"doc_id": "36_2397623612538685010", "text": "/ 只要没有替换对象本身，<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 那么这里的 `newValue` 和 `oldValue` 相同<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> },<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> deep: <span><span>true<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/watchers.html", "title": "侦听器 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "b9881ac7c683440a9e6f428f48edd38f", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1820, "chunk_index": 36, "_doc_id": "36_2397623612538685010"}}
{"doc_id": "37_6857828643343298254", "text": "an>true<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span><code><pre><div><div><div class=\"composition-api\"><p>直接给 <code>watch()<code> 传入一个响应式对象，会隐式地创建一个深层侦听器——该回调函数在所有嵌套的变更时都会被触发：<p><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> obj<span><span> =<span><span> reactive<span><span>({ count: <span><span>0<span><span> })<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/watchers.html", "title": "侦听器 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "b9881ac7c683440a9e6f428f48edd38f", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1820, "chunk_index": 37, "_doc_id": "37_6857828643343298254"}}
{"doc_id": "38_4522773388915061910", "text": "bj<span><span> =<span><span> reactive<span><span>({ count: <span><span>0<span><span> })<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>watch<span><span>(obj, (<span><span>newValue<span><span>, <span><span>oldValue<span><span>) <span><span>=><span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 在嵌套的属性变更时触发<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 注意：`newValue` 此处和 `oldValue` 是相等的<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 因为它们是同一个对象！<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>})<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/watchers.html", "title": "侦听器 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "b9881ac7c683440a9e6f428f48edd38f", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1820, "chunk_index": 38, "_doc_id": "38_4522773388915061910"}}
{"doc_id": "39_2777806298371155408", "text": "<span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 因为它们是同一个对象！<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>})<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>obj.count<span><span>++<span><span><code><pre><div><p>相比之下，一个返回响应式对象的 getter 函数，只有在返回不同的对象时，才会触发回调：<p><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>watch<span><span>(<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> () <span><span>=><span><span> state.someObject,<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/watchers.html", "title": "侦听器 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "b9881ac7c683440a9e6f428f48edd38f", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1820, "chunk_index": 39, "_doc_id": "39_2777806298371155408"}}
{"doc_id": "40_3777574565671472393", "text": "(<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> () <span><span>=><span><span> state.someObject,<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> () <span><span>=><span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 仅当 state.someObject 被替换时触发<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/watchers.html", "title": "侦听器 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "b9881ac7c683440a9e6f428f48edd38f", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1820, "chunk_index": 40, "_doc_id": "40_3777574565671472393"}}
{"doc_id": "41_9141698069410931465", "text": "ass=\"line\"><span> // 仅当 state.someObject 被替换时触发<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>)<span><span><code><pre><div><p>你也可以给上面这个例子显式地加上 <code>deep<code> 选项，强制转成深层侦听器：<p><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>watch<span><span>(<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> () <span><span>=><span><span> state.someObject,<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/watchers.html", "title": "侦听器 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "b9881ac7c683440a9e6f428f48edd38f", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1820, "chunk_index": 41, "_doc_id": "41_9141698069410931465"}}
{"doc_id": "42_5897992014657464451", "text": "(<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> () <span><span>=><span><span> state.someObject,<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> (<span><span>newValue<span><span>, <span><span>oldValue<span><span>) <span><span>=><span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 注意：`newValue` 此处和 `oldValue` 是相等的<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // *除非* state.someObject 被整个替换了<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> },<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> { deep: <span><span>true<span><span> }<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/watchers.html", "title": "侦听器 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "b9881ac7c683440a9e6f428f48edd38f", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1820, "chunk_index": 42, "_doc_id": "42_5897992014657464451"}}
{"doc_id": "43_1769075039248640285", "text": "><span> },<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> { deep: <span><span>true<span><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>)<span><span><code><pre><div><div><p>在 Vue 3.5+ 中，<code>deep<code> 选项还可以是一个数字，表示最大遍历深度——即 Vue 应该遍历对象嵌套属性的级数。<p><div class=\"warning custom-block\"><p class=\"custom-block-title\">谨慎使用<p><p>深度侦听需要遍历被侦听对象中的所有嵌套的属性，当用于大型数据结构时，开销很大。因此请只在必要时才使用它，并且要留意性能。<p><div><h2 id=\"eager-watchers\">即时回调的侦听器 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#eager-watchers\">​<a><h2><p><code>watch<code> 默认是懒执行的：仅当数据源变化时，才会执行回调。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/watchers.html", "title": "侦听器 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "b9881ac7c683440a9e6f428f48edd38f", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1820, "chunk_index": 43, "_doc_id": "43_1769075039248640285"}}
{"doc_id": "44_4019140683698758883", "text": "a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#eager-watchers\">​<a><h2><p><code>watch<code> 默认是懒执行的：仅当数据源变化时，才会执行回调。但在某些场景中，我们希望在创建侦听器时，立即执行一遍回调。举例来说，我们想请求一些初始数据，然后在相关状态更改时重新请求数据。<p><div class=\"options-api\"><p>我们可以用一个对象来声明侦听器，这个对象有 <code>handler<code> 方法和 <code>immediate: true<code> 选项，这样便能强制回调函数立即执行：<p><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // ...<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/watchers.html", "title": "侦听器 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "b9881ac7c683440a9e6f428f48edd38f", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1820, "chunk_index": 44, "_doc_id": "44_4019140683698758883"}}
{"doc_id": "45_5747345442646270526", "text": "n>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // ...<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> watch: {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> question: {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> handler<span><span>(<span><span>newQuestion<span><span>) {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 在组件实例创建时会立即调用<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> },<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 强制立即执行回调<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> immediate: <span><span>true<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/watchers.html", "title": "侦听器 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "b9881ac7c683440a9e6f428f48edd38f", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1820, "chunk_index": 45, "_doc_id": "45_5747345442646270526"}}
{"doc_id": "46_8564558153401602292", "text": "e\"><span> // 强制立即执行回调<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> immediate: <span><span>true<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // ...<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/watchers.html", "title": "侦听器 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "b9881ac7c683440a9e6f428f48edd38f", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1820, "chunk_index": 46, "_doc_id": "46_8564558153401602292"}}
{"doc_id": "47_1545849120251054355", "text": "}<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // ...<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span><code><pre><div><p>回调函数的初次执行就发生在 <code>created<code> 钩子之前。Vue 此时已经处理了 <code>data<code>、<code>computed<code> 和 <code>methods<code> 选项，所以这些属性在第一次调用时就是可用的。<p><div><div class=\"composition-api\"><p>我们可以通过传入 <code>immediate: true<code> 选项来强制侦听器的回调立即执行：<p><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>watch<span><span>(<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/watchers.html", "title": "侦听器 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "b9881ac7c683440a9e6f428f48edd38f", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1820, "chunk_index": 47, "_doc_id": "47_1545849120251054355"}}
{"doc_id": "48_3957520166291810022", "text": "pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>watch<span><span>(<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> source,<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> (<span><span>newValue<span><span>, <span><span>oldValue<span><span>) <span><span>=><span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 立即执行，且当 `source` 改变时再次执行<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> },<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> { immediate: <span><span>true<span><span> }<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/watchers.html", "title": "侦听器 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "b9881ac7c683440a9e6f428f48edd38f", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1820, "chunk_index": 48, "_doc_id": "48_3957520166291810022"}}
{"doc_id": "49_8220832634195808445", "text": "n> },<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> { immediate: <span><span>true<span><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>)<span><span><code><pre><div><div><h2 id=\"once-watchers\">一次性侦听器 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#once-watchers\">​<a><h2><p>每当被侦听源发生变化时，侦听器的回调就会执行。如果希望回调只在源变化时触发一次，请使用 <code>once: true<code> 选项。<p><div class=\"options-api\"><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/watchers.html", "title": "侦听器 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "b9881ac7c683440a9e6f428f48edd38f", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1820, "chunk_index": 49, "_doc_id": "49_8220832634195808445"}}
{"doc_id": "50_4318331708477905234", "text": "b-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> watch: {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> source: {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> handler<span><span>(<span><span>newValue<span><span>, <span><span>oldValue<span><span>) {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 当 `source` 变化时，仅触发一次<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> },<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> once: <span><span>true<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/watchers.html", "title": "侦听器 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "b9881ac7c683440a9e6f428f48edd38f", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1820, "chunk_index": 50, "_doc_id": "50_4318331708477905234"}}
{"doc_id": "51_328317829937907065", "text": "pan class=\"line\"><span> },<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> once: <span><span>true<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span><code><pre><div><div><div class=\"composition-api\"><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>watch<span><span>(<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> source,<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/watchers.html", "title": "侦听器 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "b9881ac7c683440a9e6f428f48edd38f", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1820, "chunk_index": 51, "_doc_id": "51_328317829937907065"}}
{"doc_id": "52_48937465598348270", "text": "pan class=\"line\"><span>watch<span><span>(<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> source,<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> (<span><span>newValue<span><span>, <span><span>oldValue<span><span>) <span><span>=><span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 当 `source` 变化时，仅触发一次<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> },<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> { once: <span><span>true<span><span> }<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/watchers.html", "title": "侦听器 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "b9881ac7c683440a9e6f428f48edd38f", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1820, "chunk_index": 52, "_doc_id": "52_48937465598348270"}}
{"doc_id": "53_5080847436467298711", "text": "><span> },<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> { once: <span><span>true<span><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>)<span><span><code><pre><div><div><div class=\"composition-api\"><h2 id=\"watcheffect\"><code>watchEffect()<code> <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#watcheffect\">​<a><h2><p>侦听器的回调使用与源完全相同的响应式状态是很常见的。例如下面的代码，在每当 <code>todoId<code> 的引用发生变化时使用侦听器来加载一个远程资源：<p><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> todoId<span><span> =<span><span> ref<span><span>(<span><span>1<span><span>)<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/watchers.html", "title": "侦听器 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "b9881ac7c683440a9e6f428f48edd38f", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1820, "chunk_index": 53, "_doc_id": "53_5080847436467298711"}}
{"doc_id": "54_7592479502924910826", "text": "span><span> todoId<span><span> =<span><span> ref<span><span>(<span><span>1<span><span>)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> data<span><span> =<span><span> ref<span><span>(<span><span>null<span><span>)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>watch<span><span>(<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> todoId,<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> async<span><span> () <span><span>=><span><span> {<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/watchers.html", "title": "侦听器 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "b9881ac7c683440a9e6f428f48edd38f", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1820, "chunk_index": 54, "_doc_id": "54_7592479502924910826"}}
{"doc_id": "55_6340384974445393993", "text": "span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> async<span><span> () <span><span>=><span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> const<span><span> response<span><span> =<span><span> await<span><span> fetch<span><span>(<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> `https://jsonplaceholder.typicode.com/todos/${<span><span>todoId<span><span>.<span><span>value<span><span>}`<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> )<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/watchers.html", "title": "侦听器 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "b9881ac7c683440a9e6f428f48edd38f", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1820, "chunk_index": 55, "_doc_id": "55_6340384974445393993"}}
{"doc_id": "56_2093498830043228334", "text": "oId<span><span>.<span><span>value<span><span>}`<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> )<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> data.value <span><span>=<span><span> await<span><span> response.<span><span>json<span><span>()<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> },<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> { immediate: <span><span>true<span><span> }<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/watchers.html", "title": "侦听器 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "b9881ac7c683440a9e6f428f48edd38f", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1820, "chunk_index": 56, "_doc_id": "56_2093498830043228334"}}
{"doc_id": "57_2045434011371297471", "text": "n> },<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> { immediate: <span><span>true<span><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>)<span><span><code><pre><div><p>特别是注意侦听器是如何两次使用 <code>todoId<code> 的，一次是作为源，另一次是在回调中。<p><p>我们可以用 <a href=\"/api/reactivity-core.html#watcheffect\"><code>watchEffect<code> 函数<a> 来简化上面的代码。<code>watchEffect()<code> 允许我们自动跟踪回调的响应式依赖。上面的侦听器可以重写为：<p><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>watchEffect<span><span>(<span><span>async<span><span> () <span><span>=><span><span> {<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/watchers.html", "title": "侦听器 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "b9881ac7c683440a9e6f428f48edd38f", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1820, "chunk_index": 57, "_doc_id": "57_2045434011371297471"}}
{"doc_id": "58_7395994246640953491", "text": "n>watchEffect<span><span>(<span><span>async<span><span> () <span><span>=><span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> const<span><span> response<span><span> =<span><span> await<span><span> fetch<span><span>(<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> `https://jsonplaceholder.typicode.com/todos/${<span><span>todoId<span><span>.<span><span>value<span><span>}`<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> )<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/watchers.html", "title": "侦听器 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "b9881ac7c683440a9e6f428f48edd38f", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1820, "chunk_index": 58, "_doc_id": "58_7395994246640953491"}}
{"doc_id": "59_79715792621714725", "text": "oId<span><span>.<span><span>value<span><span>}`<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> )<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> data.value <span><span>=<span><span> await<span><span> response.<span><span>json<span><span>()<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>})<span><span><code><pre><div><p>这个例子中，回调会立即执行，不需要指定 <code>immediate: true<code>。在执行期间，它会自动追踪 <code>todoId.value<code> 作为依赖(和计算属性类似)。每当 <code>todoId.value<code> 变化时，回调会再次执行。有了 <code>watchEffect()<code>，我们不再需要明确传递 <code>todoId<code> 作为源值。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/watchers.html", "title": "侦听器 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "b9881ac7c683440a9e6f428f48edd38f", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1820, "chunk_index": 59, "_doc_id": "59_79715792621714725"}}
{"doc_id": "60_5559104143076591121", "text": "code>todoId.value<code> 变化时，回调会再次执行。有了 <code>watchEffect()<code>，我们不再需要明确传递 <code>todoId<code> 作为源值。<p><p>你可以参考一下<a href=\"/examples/#fetching-data\">这个例子<a>的 <code>watchEffect<code> 和响应式的数据请求的操作。<p><p>对于这种只有一个依赖项的例子来说，<code>watchEffect()<code> 的好处相对较小。但是对于有多个依赖项的侦听器来说，使用 <code>watchEffect()<code> 可以消除手动维护依赖列表的负担。此外，如果你需要侦听一个嵌套数据结构中的几个属性，<code>watchEffect()<code> 可能会比深度侦听器更有效，因为它将只跟踪回调中被使用到的属性，而不是递归地跟踪所有的属性。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/watchers.html", "title": "侦听器 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "b9881ac7c683440a9e6f428f48edd38f", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1820, "chunk_index": 60, "_doc_id": "60_5559104143076591121"}}
{"doc_id": "61_8411423936281700376", "text": "的负担。此外，如果你需要侦听一个嵌套数据结构中的几个属性，<code>watchEffect()<code> 可能会比深度侦听器更有效，因为它将只跟踪回调中被使用到的属性，而不是递归地跟踪所有的属性。<p><div class=\"tip custom-block\"><p class=\"custom-block-title\">TIP<p><p><code>watchEffect<code> 仅会在其<strong>同步<strong>执行期间，才追踪依赖。在使用异步回调时，只有在第一个 <code>await<code> 正常工作前访问到的属性才会被追踪。<p><div><h3 id=\"watch-vs-watcheffect\"><code>watch<code> vs. <code>watchEffect<code> <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#watch-vs-watcheffect\">​<a><h3><p><code>watch<code> 和 <code>watchEffect<code> 都能响应式地执行有副作用的回调。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/watchers.html", "title": "侦听器 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "b9881ac7c683440a9e6f428f48edd38f", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1820, "chunk_index": 61, "_doc_id": "61_8411423936281700376"}}
{"doc_id": "62_319600699713013996", "text": "href=\"#watch-vs-watcheffect\">​<a><h3><p><code>watch<code> 和 <code>watchEffect<code> 都能响应式地执行有副作用的回调。它们之间的主要区别是追踪响应式依赖的方式：<p><div><h2 id=\"side-effect-cleanup\">副作用清理 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#side-effect-cleanup\">​<a><h2><p>有时我们可能会在侦听器中执行副作用，例如异步请求：<p><div class=\"composition-api\"><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>watch<span><span>(id, (<span><span>newId<span><span>) <span><span>=><span><span> {<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/watchers.html", "title": "侦听器 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "b9881ac7c683440a9e6f428f48edd38f", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1820, "chunk_index": 62, "_doc_id": "62_319600699713013996"}}
{"doc_id": "63_1147443347125482733", "text": "span>watch<span><span>(id, (<span><span>newId<span><span>) <span><span>=><span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> fetch<span><span>(<span><span>`/api/${<span><span>newId<span><span>}`<span><span>).<span><span>then<span><span>(() <span><span>=><span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 回调逻辑<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> })<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/watchers.html", "title": "侦听器 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "b9881ac7c683440a9e6f428f48edd38f", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1820, "chunk_index": 63, "_doc_id": "63_1147443347125482733"}}
{"doc_id": "64_3531903688353201806", "text": "<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 回调逻辑<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> })<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>})<span><span><code><pre><div><div><div class=\"options-api\"><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> watch: {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> id<span><span>(<span><span>newId<span><span>) {<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/watchers.html", "title": "侦听器 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "b9881ac7c683440a9e6f428f48edd38f", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1820, "chunk_index": 64, "_doc_id": "64_3531903688353201806"}}
{"doc_id": "65_1960723313339711806", "text": "{<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> id<span><span>(<span><span>newId<span><span>) {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> fetch<span><span>(<span><span>`/api/${<span><span>newId<span><span>}`<span><span>).<span><span>then<span><span>(() <span><span>=><span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 回调逻辑<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> })<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/watchers.html", "title": "侦听器 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "b9881ac7c683440a9e6f428f48edd38f", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1820, "chunk_index": 65, "_doc_id": "65_1960723313339711806"}}
{"doc_id": "66_4044592271574484810", "text": "pan> })<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span><code><pre><div><div><p>但是如果在请求完成之前 <code>id<code> 发生了变化怎么办？当上一个请求完成时，它仍会使用已经过时的 ID 值触发回调。理想情况下，我们希望能够在 <code>id<code> 变为新值时取消过时的请求。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/watchers.html", "title": "侦听器 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "b9881ac7c683440a9e6f428f48edd38f", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1820, "chunk_index": 66, "_doc_id": "66_4044592271574484810"}}
{"doc_id": "67_4770553798620790268", "text": "成之前 <code>id<code> 发生了变化怎么办？当上一个请求完成时，它仍会使用已经过时的 ID 值触发回调。理想情况下，我们希望能够在 <code>id<code> 变为新值时取消过时的请求。<p><p>我们可以使用 <a href=\"/api/reactivity-core.html#onwatchercleanup\"><code>onWatcherCleanup()<code><a> API 来注册一个清理函数，当侦听器失效并准备重新运行时会被调用：<p><div class=\"composition-api\"><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>import<span><span> { watch, onWatcherCleanup } <span><span>from<span><span> 'vue'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/watchers.html", "title": "侦听器 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "b9881ac7c683440a9e6f428f48edd38f", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1820, "chunk_index": 67, "_doc_id": "67_4770553798620790268"}}
{"doc_id": "68_253675431819225757", "text": "watch, onWatcherCleanup } <span><span>from<span><span> 'vue'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>watch<span><span>(id, (<span><span>newId<span><span>) <span><span>=><span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> const<span><span> controller<span><span> =<span><span> new<span><span> AbortController<span><span>()<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/watchers.html", "title": "侦听器 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "b9881ac7c683440a9e6f428f48edd38f", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1820, "chunk_index": 68, "_doc_id": "68_253675431819225757"}}
{"doc_id": "69_7462608890993303187", "text": "> =<span><span> new<span><span> AbortController<span><span>()<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> fetch<span><span>(<span><span>`/api/${<span><span>newId<span><span>}`<span><span>, { signal: controller.signal }).<span><span>then<span><span>(() <span><span>=><span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 回调逻辑<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> })<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/watchers.html", "title": "侦听器 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "b9881ac7c683440a9e6f428f48edd38f", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1820, "chunk_index": 69, "_doc_id": "69_7462608890993303187"}}
{"doc_id": "70_3237211259504055582", "text": "line\"><span> // 回调逻辑<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> })<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line highlighted\"><span> onWatcherCleanup<span><span>(() <span><span>=><span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line highlighted\"><span> // 终止过期请求<span><span>\n<span class=\"line highlighted\"><span> controller.<span><span>abort<span><span>()<span><span>\n<span class=\"line highlighted\"><span> })<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/watchers.html", "title": "侦听器 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "b9881ac7c683440a9e6f428f48edd38f", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1820, "chunk_index": 70, "_doc_id": "70_3237211259504055582"}}
{"doc_id": "71_6868327485054999163", "text": "er.<span><span>abort<span><span>()<span><span>\n<span class=\"line highlighted\"><span> })<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>})<span><span><code><pre><div><div><div class=\"options-api\"><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>import<span><span> { onWatcherCleanup } <span><span>from<span><span> 'vue'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/watchers.html", "title": "侦听器 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "b9881ac7c683440a9e6f428f48edd38f", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1820, "chunk_index": 71, "_doc_id": "71_6868327485054999163"}}
{"doc_id": "72_2096462738787425099", "text": "n class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> watch: {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> id<span><span>(<span><span>newId<span><span>) {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> const<span><span> controller<span><span> =<span><span> new<span><span> AbortController<span><span>()<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/watchers.html", "title": "侦听器 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "b9881ac7c683440a9e6f428f48edd38f", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1820, "chunk_index": 72, "_doc_id": "72_2096462738787425099"}}
{"doc_id": "73_7462608890993303187", "text": "> =<span><span> new<span><span> AbortController<span><span>()<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> fetch<span><span>(<span><span>`/api/${<span><span>newId<span><span>}`<span><span>, { signal: controller.signal }).<span><span>then<span><span>(() <span><span>=><span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 回调逻辑<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> })<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/watchers.html", "title": "侦听器 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "b9881ac7c683440a9e6f428f48edd38f", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1820, "chunk_index": 73, "_doc_id": "73_7462608890993303187"}}
{"doc_id": "74_164430920211200094", "text": "line\"><span> // 回调逻辑<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> })<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line highlighted\"><span> onWatcherCleanup<span><span>(() <span><span>=><span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line highlighted\"><span> // 终止过期请求<span><span>\n<span class=\"line highlighted\"><span> controller.<span><span>abort<span><span>()<span><span>\n<span class=\"line highlighted\"><span> })<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/watchers.html", "title": "侦听器 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "b9881ac7c683440a9e6f428f48edd38f", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1820, "chunk_index": 74, "_doc_id": "74_164430920211200094"}}
{"doc_id": "75_7554906955318418559", "text": "pan> })<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span><code><pre><div><div><p>请注意，<code>onWatcherCleanup<code> 仅在 Vue 3.5+ 中支持，并且必须在 <code>watchEffect<code> 效果函数或 <code>watch<code> 回调函数的同步执行期间调用：你不能在异步函数的 <code>await<code> 语句之后调用它。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/watchers.html", "title": "侦听器 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "b9881ac7c683440a9e6f428f48edd38f", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1820, "chunk_index": 75, "_doc_id": "75_7554906955318418559"}}
{"doc_id": "76_2198995105051314504", "text": "在 <code>watchEffect<code> 效果函数或 <code>watch<code> 回调函数的同步执行期间调用：你不能在异步函数的 <code>await<code> 语句之后调用它。<p><p>作为替代，<code>onCleanup<code> 函数还作为第三个参数传递给侦听器回调<span class=\"composition-api\">，以及 <code>watchEffect<code> 作用函数的第一个参数<span>：<p><div class=\"composition-api\"><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>watch<span><span>(id, (<span><span>newId<span><span>, <span><span>oldId<span><span>, <span><span>onCleanup<span><span>) <span><span>=><span><span> {<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/watchers.html", "title": "侦听器 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "b9881ac7c683440a9e6f428f48edd38f", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1820, "chunk_index": 76, "_doc_id": "76_2198995105051314504"}}
{"doc_id": "77_6932612367383586915", "text": "span>oldId<span><span>, <span><span>onCleanup<span><span>) <span><span>=><span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // ...<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> onCleanup<span><span>(() <span><span>=><span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 清理逻辑<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> })<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>})<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/watchers.html", "title": "侦听器 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "b9881ac7c683440a9e6f428f48edd38f", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1820, "chunk_index": 77, "_doc_id": "77_6932612367383586915"}}
{"doc_id": "78_3446881452870931283", "text": "lass=\"line\"><span> })<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>})<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>watchEffect<span><span>((<span><span>onCleanup<span><span>) <span><span>=><span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // ...<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> onCleanup<span><span>(() <span><span>=><span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 清理逻辑<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> })<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/watchers.html", "title": "侦听器 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "b9881ac7c683440a9e6f428f48edd38f", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1820, "chunk_index": 78, "_doc_id": "78_3446881452870931283"}}
{"doc_id": "79_1891032223929022819", "text": "<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 清理逻辑<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> })<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>})<span><span><code><pre><div><div><div class=\"options-api\"><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> watch: {<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/watchers.html", "title": "侦听器 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "b9881ac7c683440a9e6f428f48edd38f", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1820, "chunk_index": 79, "_doc_id": "79_1891032223929022819"}}
{"doc_id": "80_1181742276617776411", "text": "export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> watch: {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> id<span><span>(<span><span>newId<span><span>, <span><span>oldId<span><span>, <span><span>onCleanup<span><span>) {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // ...<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> onCleanup<span><span>(() <span><span>=><span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 清理逻辑<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> })<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/watchers.html", "title": "侦听器 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "b9881ac7c683440a9e6f428f48edd38f", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1820, "chunk_index": 80, "_doc_id": "80_1181742276617776411"}}
{"doc_id": "81_5808367013752199774", "text": "<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 清理逻辑<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> })<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span><code><pre><div><div><p>这在 3.5 之前的版本有效。此外，通过函数参数传递的 <code>onCleanup<code> 与侦听器实例相绑定，因此不受 <code>onWatcherCleanup<code> 的同步限制。<p><h2 id=\"callback-flush-timing\">回调的触发时机 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#callback-flush-timing\">​<a><h2><p>当你更改了响应式状态，它可能会同时触发 Vue 组件更新和侦听器回调。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/watchers.html", "title": "侦听器 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "b9881ac7c683440a9e6f428f48edd38f", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1820, "chunk_index": 81, "_doc_id": "81_5808367013752199774"}}
{"doc_id": "82_8358062641383275831", "text": "a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#callback-flush-timing\">​<a><h2><p>当你更改了响应式状态，它可能会同时触发 Vue 组件更新和侦听器回调。<p><p>类似于组件更新，用户创建的侦听器回调函数也会被批量处理以避免重复调用。例如，如果我们同步将一千个项目推入被侦听的数组中，我们可能不希望侦听器触发一千次。<p><p>默认情况下，侦听器回调会在父组件更新 (如有) <strong>之后<strong>、所属组件的 DOM 更新<strong>之前<strong>被调用。这意味着如果你尝试在侦听器回调中访问所属组件的 DOM，那么 DOM 将处于更新前的状态。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/watchers.html", "title": "侦听器 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "b9881ac7c683440a9e6f428f48edd38f", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1820, "chunk_index": 82, "_doc_id": "82_8358062641383275831"}}
{"doc_id": "83_1536190336104091774", "text": ") <strong>之后<strong>、所属组件的 DOM 更新<strong>之前<strong>被调用。这意味着如果你尝试在侦听器回调中访问所属组件的 DOM，那么 DOM 将处于更新前的状态。<p><h3 id=\"post-watchers\">Post Watchers <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#post-watchers\">​<a><h3><p>如果想在侦听器回调中能访问被 Vue 更新<strong>之后<strong>的所属组件的 DOM，你需要指明 <code>flush: 'post'<code> 选项：<p><div class=\"options-api\"><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/watchers.html", "title": "侦听器 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "b9881ac7c683440a9e6f428f48edd38f", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1820, "chunk_index": 83, "_doc_id": "83_1536190336104091774"}}
{"doc_id": "84_8006828121545592015", "text": "b-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // ...<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> watch: {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> key: {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> handler<span><span>() {},<span><span>\n<span class=\"line highlighted\"><span> flush: <span><span>'post'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/watchers.html", "title": "侦听器 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "b9881ac7c683440a9e6f428f48edd38f", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1820, "chunk_index": 84, "_doc_id": "84_8006828121545592015"}}
{"doc_id": "85_1802022835735837482", "text": ">'post'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span><code><pre><div><div><div class=\"composition-api\"><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>watch<span><span>(source, callback, {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line highlighted\"><span> flush: <span><span>'post'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>})<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/watchers.html", "title": "侦听器 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "b9881ac7c683440a9e6f428f48edd38f", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1820, "chunk_index": 85, "_doc_id": "85_1802022835735837482"}}
{"doc_id": "86_5501546182149804475", "text": "h: <span><span>'post'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>})<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>watchEffect<span><span>(callback, {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line highlighted\"><span> flush: <span><span>'post'<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/watchers.html", "title": "侦听器 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "b9881ac7c683440a9e6f428f48edd38f", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1820, "chunk_index": 86, "_doc_id": "86_5501546182149804475"}}
{"doc_id": "87_6780530212959671565", "text": "callback, {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line highlighted\"><span> flush: <span><span>'post'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>})<span><span><code><pre><div><p>后置刷新的 <code>watchEffect()<code> 有个更方便的别名 <code>watchPostEffect()<code>：<p><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>import<span><span> { watchPostEffect } <span><span>from<span><span> 'vue'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/watchers.html", "title": "侦听器 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "b9881ac7c683440a9e6f428f48edd38f", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1820, "chunk_index": 87, "_doc_id": "87_6780530212959671565"}}
{"doc_id": "88_899334560268360838", "text": "<span> { watchPostEffect } <span><span>from<span><span> 'vue'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>watchPostEffect<span><span>(() <span><span>=><span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> /* 在 Vue 更新后执行 */<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/watchers.html", "title": "侦听器 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "b9881ac7c683440a9e6f428f48edd38f", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1820, "chunk_index": 88, "_doc_id": "88_899334560268360838"}}
{"doc_id": "89_8138877855785850917", "text": "() <span><span>=><span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> /* 在 Vue 更新后执行 */<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>})<span><span><code><pre><div><div><h3 id=\"sync-watchers\">同步侦听器 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#sync-watchers\">​<a><h3><p>你还可以创建一个同步触发的侦听器，它会在 Vue 进行任何更新之前触发：<p><div class=\"options-api\"><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/watchers.html", "title": "侦听器 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "b9881ac7c683440a9e6f428f48edd38f", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1820, "chunk_index": 89, "_doc_id": "89_8138877855785850917"}}
{"doc_id": "90_2933458754176453616", "text": "b-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // ...<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> watch: {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> key: {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> handler<span><span>() {},<span><span>\n<span class=\"line highlighted\"><span> flush: <span><span>'sync'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/watchers.html", "title": "侦听器 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "b9881ac7c683440a9e6f428f48edd38f", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1820, "chunk_index": 90, "_doc_id": "90_2933458754176453616"}}
{"doc_id": "91_2997442349802652199", "text": ">'sync'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span><code><pre><div><div><div class=\"composition-api\"><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>watch<span><span>(source, callback, {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line highlighted\"><span> flush: <span><span>'sync'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>})<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/watchers.html", "title": "侦听器 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "b9881ac7c683440a9e6f428f48edd38f", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1820, "chunk_index": 91, "_doc_id": "91_2997442349802652199"}}
{"doc_id": "92_1617987064689747149", "text": "h: <span><span>'sync'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>})<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>watchEffect<span><span>(callback, {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line highlighted\"><span> flush: <span><span>'sync'<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/watchers.html", "title": "侦听器 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "b9881ac7c683440a9e6f428f48edd38f", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1820, "chunk_index": 92, "_doc_id": "92_1617987064689747149"}}
{"doc_id": "93_5094062509747875878", "text": "callback, {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line highlighted\"><span> flush: <span><span>'sync'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>})<span><span><code><pre><div><p>同步触发的 <code>watchEffect()<code> 有个更方便的别名 <code>watchSyncEffect()<code>：<p><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>import<span><span> { watchSyncEffect } <span><span>from<span><span> 'vue'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/watchers.html", "title": "侦听器 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "b9881ac7c683440a9e6f428f48edd38f", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1820, "chunk_index": 93, "_doc_id": "93_5094062509747875878"}}
{"doc_id": "94_6408632620688581904", "text": "<span> { watchSyncEffect } <span><span>from<span><span> 'vue'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>watchSyncEffect<span><span>(() <span><span>=><span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> /* 在响应式数据变化时同步执行 */<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>})<span><span><code><pre><div><div><div class=\"warning custom-block\"><p class=\"custom-block-title\">谨慎使用<p><p>同步侦听器不会进行批处理，每当检测到响应式数据发生变化时就会触发。可以使用它来监视简单的布尔值，但应避免在可能多次同步修改的数据源 (如数组) 上使用。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/watchers.html", "title": "侦听器 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "b9881ac7c683440a9e6f428f48edd38f", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1820, "chunk_index": 94, "_doc_id": "94_6408632620688581904"}}
{"doc_id": "95_3213905673039209187", "text": "-block-title\">谨慎使用<p><p>同步侦听器不会进行批处理，每当检测到响应式数据发生变化时就会触发。可以使用它来监视简单的布尔值，但应避免在可能多次同步修改的数据源 (如数组) 上使用。<p><div><div class=\"options-api\"><h2 id=\"this-watch\"><code>this.$watch()<code> <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#this-watch\">​<a><h2><p>我们也可以使用组件实例的 <a href=\"/api/component-instance.html#watch\"><code>$watch()<code> 方法<a>来命令式地创建一个侦听器：<p><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/watchers.html", "title": "侦听器 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "b9881ac7c683440a9e6f428f48edd38f", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1820, "chunk_index": 95, "_doc_id": "95_3213905673039209187"}}
{"doc_id": "96_546344134481696260", "text": "b-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> created<span><span>() {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> this<span><span>.<span><span>$watch<span><span>(<span><span>'question'<span><span>, (<span><span>newQuestion<span><span>) <span><span>=><span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // ...<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> })<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/watchers.html", "title": "侦听器 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "b9881ac7c683440a9e6f428f48edd38f", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1820, "chunk_index": 96, "_doc_id": "96_546344134481696260"}}
{"doc_id": "97_8733308854000909257", "text": "// ...<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> })<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span><code><pre><div><p>如果要在特定条件下设置一个侦听器，或者只侦听响应用户交互的内容，这方法很有用。它还允许你提前停止该侦听器。<p><div><h2 id=\"stopping-a-watcher\">停止侦听器 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#stopping-a-watcher\">​<a><h2><div class=\"options-api\"><p>用 <code>watch<code> 选项或者 <code>$watch()<code> 实例方法声明的侦听器，会在宿主组件卸载时自动停止。因此，在大多数场景下，你无需关心怎么停止它。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/watchers.html", "title": "侦听器 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "b9881ac7c683440a9e6f428f48edd38f", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1820, "chunk_index": 97, "_doc_id": "97_8733308854000909257"}}
{"doc_id": "98_1526768805369131764", "text": "pi\"><p>用 <code>watch<code> 选项或者 <code>$watch()<code> 实例方法声明的侦听器，会在宿主组件卸载时自动停止。因此，在大多数场景下，你无需关心怎么停止它。<p><p>在少数情况下，你的确需要在组件卸载之前就停止一个侦听器，这时可以调用 <code>$watch()<code> API 返回的函数：<p><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> unwatch<span><span> =<span><span> this<span><span>.<span><span>$watch<span><span>(<span><span>'foo'<span><span>, callback)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/watchers.html", "title": "侦听器 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "b9881ac7c683440a9e6f428f48edd38f", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1820, "chunk_index": 98, "_doc_id": "98_1526768805369131764"}}
{"doc_id": "99_4008092854334555178", "text": "n>$watch<span><span>(<span><span>'foo'<span><span>, callback)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// ...当该侦听器不再需要时<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>unwatch<span><span>()<span><span><code><pre><div><div><div class=\"composition-api\"><p>在 <code>setup()<code> 或 <code><script setup><code> 中用同步语句创建的侦听器，会自动绑定到宿主组件实例上，并且会在宿主组件卸载时自动停止。因此，在大多数情况下，你无需关心怎么停止一个侦听器。<p><p>一个关键点是，侦听器必须用<strong>同步<strong>语句创建：如果用异步回调创建一个侦听器，那么它不会绑定到当前组件上，你必须手动停止它，以防内存泄漏。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/watchers.html", "title": "侦听器 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "b9881ac7c683440a9e6f428f48edd38f", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1820, "chunk_index": 99, "_doc_id": "99_4008092854334555178"}}
{"doc_id": "100_3925187799078654362", "text": "需关心怎么停止一个侦听器。<p><p>一个关键点是，侦听器必须用<strong>同步<strong>语句创建：如果用异步回调创建一个侦听器，那么它不会绑定到当前组件上，你必须手动停止它，以防内存泄漏。如下方这个例子：<p><div class=\"language-vue\"> <span class=\"lang\">vue<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>script<span><span> setup<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>import<span><span> { watchEffect } <span><span>from<span><span> 'vue'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 它会自动停止<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/watchers.html", "title": "侦听器 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "b9881ac7c683440a9e6f428f48edd38f", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1820, "chunk_index": 100, "_doc_id": "100_3925187799078654362"}}
{"doc_id": "101_3694847225004817914", "text": "n><span> 'vue'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 它会自动停止<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>watchEffect<span><span>(() <span><span>=><span><span> {})<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// ...这个则不会！<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>setTimeout<span><span>(() <span><span>=><span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> watchEffect<span><span>(() <span><span>=><span><span> {})<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/watchers.html", "title": "侦听器 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "b9881ac7c683440a9e6f428f48edd38f", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1820, "chunk_index": 101, "_doc_id": "101_3694847225004817914"}}
{"doc_id": "102_308465451608052874", "text": "an>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> watchEffect<span><span>(() <span><span>=><span><span> {})<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}, <span><span>100<span><span>)<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/watchers.html", "title": "侦听器 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "b9881ac7c683440a9e6f428f48edd38f", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1820, "chunk_index": 102, "_doc_id": "102_308465451608052874"}}
{"doc_id": "103_620384722685676509", "text": "=><span><span> {})<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}, <span><span>100<span><span>)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>script<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>要手动停止一个侦听器，请调用 <code>watch<code> 或 <code>watchEffect<code> 返回的函数：<p><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> unwatch<span><span> =<span><span> watchEffect<span><span>(() <span><span>=><span><span> {})<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/watchers.html", "title": "侦听器 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "b9881ac7c683440a9e6f428f48edd38f", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1820, "chunk_index": 103, "_doc_id": "103_620384722685676509"}}
{"doc_id": "104_2592888737714626437", "text": "tch<span><span> =<span><span> watchEffect<span><span>(() <span><span>=><span><span> {})<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// ...当该侦听器不再需要时<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>unwatch<span><span>()<span><span><code><pre><div><p>注意，需要异步创建侦听器的情况很少，请尽可能选择同步创建。如果需要等待一些异步数据，你可以使用条件式的侦听逻辑：<p><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// 需要异步请求得到的数据<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/watchers.html", "title": "侦听器 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "b9881ac7c683440a9e6f428f48edd38f", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1820, "chunk_index": 104, "_doc_id": "104_2592888737714626437"}}
{"doc_id": "105_2665131544803171949", "text": "an><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// 需要异步请求得到的数据<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> data<span><span> =<span><span> ref<span><span>(<span><span>null<span><span>)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>watchEffect<span><span>(() <span><span>=><span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> if<span><span> (data.value) {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 数据加载后执行某些操作...<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/watchers.html", "title": "侦听器 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "b9881ac7c683440a9e6f428f48edd38f", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1820, "chunk_index": 105, "_doc_id": "105_2665131544803171949"}}
{"doc_id": "106_7701807181527845407", "text": "> if<span><span> (data.value) {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 数据加载后执行某些操作...<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>})<span><span><code><pre><div><div><div><div>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/watchers.html", "title": "侦听器 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "b9881ac7c683440a9e6f428f48edd38f", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1820, "chunk_index": 106, "_doc_id": "106_7701807181527845407"}}
{"doc_id": "0_4556440867082369321", "text": "<div><div><h1 id=\"provide-inject\">依赖注入 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#provide-inject\">​<a><h1><blockquote><p>此章节假设你已经看过了<a href=\"/guide/essentials/component-basics.html\">组件基础<a>。若你还不了解组件是什么，请先阅读该章节。<p><blockquote><h2 id=\"prop-drilling\">Prop 逐级透传问题 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#prop-drilling\">​<a><h2><p>通常情况下，当我们需要从父组件向子组件传递数据时，会使用 <a href=\"/guide/components/props.html\">props<a>。想象一下这样的结构：有一些多层级嵌套的组件，形成了一棵巨大的组件树，而某个深层的子组件需要一个较远的祖先组件中的部分数据。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/provide-inject.html", "title": "依赖注入", "doc_id": "65b0dde4e47a4c9f8b5853d6579b3b39", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1007, "chunk_index": 0, "_doc_id": "0_4556440867082369321"}}
{"doc_id": "1_6607825997689216660", "text": "/guide/components/props.html\">props<a>。想象一下这样的结构：有一些多层级嵌套的组件，形成了一棵巨大的组件树，而某个深层的子组件需要一个较远的祖先组件中的部分数据。在这种情况下，如果仅使用 props 则必须将其沿着组件链逐级传递下去，这会非常麻烦：<p><p> <p><p>注意，虽然这里的 <code><Footer><code> 组件可能根本不关心这些 props，但为了使 <code><DeepChild><code> 能访问到它们，仍然需要定义并向下传递。如果组件链路非常长，可能会影响到更多这条路上的组件。这一问题被称为“prop 逐级透传”，显然是我们希望尽量避免的情况。<p><p><code>provide<code> 和 <code>inject<code> 可以帮助我们解决这一问题 <a href=\"#footnote-1\">[1]<a> 。一个父组件相对于其所有的后代组件，会作为<strong>依赖提供者<strong>。任何后代的组件树，无论层级有多深，都可以<strong>注入<strong>由父组件提供给整条链路的依赖。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/provide-inject.html", "title": "依赖注入", "doc_id": "65b0dde4e47a4c9f8b5853d6579b3b39", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1007, "chunk_index": 1, "_doc_id": "1_6607825997689216660"}}
{"doc_id": "2_9115300076605782602", "text": "<a> 。一个父组件相对于其所有的后代组件，会作为<strong>依赖提供者<strong>。任何后代的组件树，无论层级有多深，都可以<strong>注入<strong>由父组件提供给整条链路的依赖。<p><p> <p><h2 id=\"provide\">Provide (提供) <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#provide\">​<a><h2><div class=\"composition-api\"><p>要为组件后代提供数据，需要使用到 <a href=\"/api/composition-api-dependency-injection.html#provide\"><code>provide()<code><a> 函数：<p><div class=\"language-vue\"> <span class=\"lang\">vue<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>script<span><span> setup<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/provide-inject.html", "title": "依赖注入", "doc_id": "65b0dde4e47a4c9f8b5853d6579b3b39", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1007, "chunk_index": 2, "_doc_id": "2_9115300076605782602"}}
{"doc_id": "3_1321032296179199588", "text": "code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>script<span><span> setup<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>import<span><span> { provide } <span><span>from<span><span> 'vue'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>provide<span><span>(<span><span>/* 注入名 */<span><span> 'message'<span><span>, <span><span>/* 值 */<span><span> 'hello!'<span><span>)<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/provide-inject.html", "title": "依赖注入", "doc_id": "65b0dde4e47a4c9f8b5853d6579b3b39", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1007, "chunk_index": 3, "_doc_id": "3_1321032296179199588"}}
{"doc_id": "4_1311347232032437842", "text": "pan><span> 'message'<span><span>, <span><span>/* 值 */<span><span> 'hello!'<span><span>)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>script<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>如果不使用 <code><script setup><code>，请确保 <code>provide()<code> 是在 <code>setup()<code> 同步调用的：<p><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>import<span><span> { provide } <span><span>from<span><span> 'vue'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/provide-inject.html", "title": "依赖注入", "doc_id": "65b0dde4e47a4c9f8b5853d6579b3b39", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1007, "chunk_index": 4, "_doc_id": "4_1311347232032437842"}}
{"doc_id": "5_3978944963857970627", "text": "rt<span><span> { provide } <span><span>from<span><span> 'vue'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> setup<span><span>() {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> provide<span><span>(<span><span>/* 注入名 */<span><span> 'message'<span><span>, <span><span>/* 值 */<span><span> 'hello!'<span><span>)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/provide-inject.html", "title": "依赖注入", "doc_id": "65b0dde4e47a4c9f8b5853d6579b3b39", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1007, "chunk_index": 5, "_doc_id": "5_3978944963857970627"}}
{"doc_id": "6_9073210691122351295", "text": "<span>/* 值 */<span><span> 'hello!'<span><span>)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span><code><pre><div><p><code>provide()<code> 函数接收两个参数。第一个参数被称为<strong>注入名<strong>，可以是一个字符串或是一个 <code>Symbol<code>。后代组件会用注入名来查找期望注入的值。一个组件可以多次调用 <code>provide()<code>，使用不同的注入名，注入不同的依赖值。<p><p>第二个参数是提供的值，值可以是任意类型，包括响应式的状态，比如一个 ref：<p><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>import<span><span> { ref, provide } <span><span>from<span><span> 'vue'<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/provide-inject.html", "title": "依赖注入", "doc_id": "65b0dde4e47a4c9f8b5853d6579b3b39", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1007, "chunk_index": 6, "_doc_id": "6_9073210691122351295"}}
{"doc_id": "7_4049564577826970634", "text": "ass=\"line\"><span>import<span><span> { ref, provide } <span><span>from<span><span> 'vue'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> count<span><span> =<span><span> ref<span><span>(<span><span>0<span><span>)<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/provide-inject.html", "title": "依赖注入", "doc_id": "65b0dde4e47a4c9f8b5853d6579b3b39", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1007, "chunk_index": 7, "_doc_id": "7_4049564577826970634"}}
{"doc_id": "8_8568520239705013621", "text": "<span><span> count<span><span> =<span><span> ref<span><span>(<span><span>0<span><span>)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>provide<span><span>(<span><span>'key'<span><span>, count)<span><span><code><pre><div><p>提供的响应式状态使后代组件可以由此和提供者建立响应式的联系。<p><div><div class=\"options-api\"><p>要为组件后代提供数据，需要使用到 <a href=\"/api/options-composition.html#provide\"><code>provide<code><a> 选项：<p><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/provide-inject.html", "title": "依赖注入", "doc_id": "65b0dde4e47a4c9f8b5853d6579b3b39", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1007, "chunk_index": 8, "_doc_id": "8_8568520239705013621"}}
{"doc_id": "9_2470242073759825200", "text": "b-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> provide: {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> message: <span><span>'hello!'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/provide-inject.html", "title": "依赖注入", "doc_id": "65b0dde4e47a4c9f8b5853d6579b3b39", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1007, "chunk_index": 9, "_doc_id": "9_2470242073759825200"}}
{"doc_id": "10_2871719382001142887", "text": "ass=\"line\"><span> message: <span><span>'hello!'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span><code><pre><div><p>对于 <code>provide<code> 对象上的每一个属性，后代组件会用其 key 为注入名查找期望注入的值，属性的值就是要提供的数据。<p><p>如果我们需要提供依赖当前组件实例的状态 (比如那些由 <code>data()<code> 定义的数据属性)，那么可以以函数形式使用 <code>provide<code>：<p><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/provide-inject.html", "title": "依赖注入", "doc_id": "65b0dde4e47a4c9f8b5853d6579b3b39", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1007, "chunk_index": 10, "_doc_id": "10_2871719382001142887"}}
{"doc_id": "11_3724530633310163747", "text": "b-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> data<span><span>() {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> return<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> message: <span><span>'hello!'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> },<span><span>\n<span class=\"line highlighted\"><span> provide<span><span>() {<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/provide-inject.html", "title": "依赖注入", "doc_id": "65b0dde4e47a4c9f8b5853d6579b3b39", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1007, "chunk_index": 11, "_doc_id": "11_3724530633310163747"}}
{"doc_id": "12_8709405706441977564", "text": "ne\"><span> },<span><span>\n<span class=\"line highlighted\"><span> provide<span><span>() {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line highlighted\"><span> // 使用函数的形式，可以访问到 `this`<span><span>\n<span class=\"line highlighted\"><span> return<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line highlighted\"><span> message: <span><span>this<span><span>.message<span><span>\n<span class=\"line highlighted\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line highlighted\"><span> }<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/provide-inject.html", "title": "依赖注入", "doc_id": "65b0dde4e47a4c9f8b5853d6579b3b39", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1007, "chunk_index": 12, "_doc_id": "12_8709405706441977564"}}
{"doc_id": "13_3214472782456866241", "text": "n class=\"line highlighted\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line highlighted\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span><code><pre><div><p>然而，请注意这<strong>不会<strong>使注入保持响应性。我们会在后续小节中讨论如何<a href=\"#working-with-reactivity\">让注入转变为响应式<a>。<p><div><h2 id=\"app-level-provide\">应用层 Provide <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#app-level-provide\">​<a><h2><p>除了在一个组件中提供依赖，我们还可以在整个应用层面提供依赖：<p><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>import<span><span> { createApp } <span><span>from<span><span> 'vue'<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/provide-inject.html", "title": "依赖注入", "doc_id": "65b0dde4e47a4c9f8b5853d6579b3b39", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1007, "chunk_index": 13, "_doc_id": "13_3214472782456866241"}}
{"doc_id": "14_5262679173132022058", "text": "class=\"line\"><span>import<span><span> { createApp } <span><span>from<span><span> 'vue'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> app<span><span> =<span><span> createApp<span><span>({})<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>app.<span><span>provide<span><span>(<span><span>/* 注入名 */<span><span> 'message'<span><span>, <span><span>/* 值 */<span><span> 'hello!'<span><span>)<span><span><code><pre><div><p>在应用级别提供的数据在该应用内的所有组件中都可以注入。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/provide-inject.html", "title": "依赖注入", "doc_id": "65b0dde4e47a4c9f8b5853d6579b3b39", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1007, "chunk_index": 14, "_doc_id": "14_5262679173132022058"}}
{"doc_id": "15_5097924213559876301", "text": ">/* 值 */<span><span> 'hello!'<span><span>)<span><span><code><pre><div><p>在应用级别提供的数据在该应用内的所有组件中都可以注入。这在你编写<a href=\"/guide/reusability/plugins.html\">插件<a>时会特别有用，因为插件一般都不会使用组件形式来提供值。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/provide-inject.html", "title": "依赖注入", "doc_id": "65b0dde4e47a4c9f8b5853d6579b3b39", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1007, "chunk_index": 15, "_doc_id": "15_5097924213559876301"}}
{"doc_id": "16_5430421675657726960", "text": "供的数据在该应用内的所有组件中都可以注入。这在你编写<a href=\"/guide/reusability/plugins.html\">插件<a>时会特别有用，因为插件一般都不会使用组件形式来提供值。<p><h2 id=\"inject\">Inject (注入) <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#inject\">​<a><h2><div class=\"composition-api\"><p>要注入上层组件提供的数据，需使用 <a href=\"/api/composition-api-dependency-injection.html#inject\"><code>inject()<code><a> 函数：<p><div class=\"language-vue\"> <span class=\"lang\">vue<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>script<span><span> setup<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/provide-inject.html", "title": "依赖注入", "doc_id": "65b0dde4e47a4c9f8b5853d6579b3b39", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1007, "chunk_index": 16, "_doc_id": "16_5430421675657726960"}}
{"doc_id": "17_3771487207527315157", "text": "code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>script<span><span> setup<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>import<span><span> { inject } <span><span>from<span><span> 'vue'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> message<span><span> =<span><span> inject<span><span>(<span><span>'message'<span><span>)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>script<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>如果有多个父组件提供了相同键的数据，注入将解析为组件链上最近的父组件所注入的值。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/provide-inject.html", "title": "依赖注入", "doc_id": "65b0dde4e47a4c9f8b5853d6579b3b39", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1007, "chunk_index": 17, "_doc_id": "17_3771487207527315157"}}
{"doc_id": "18_1396250050635964792", "text": "pan><span>script<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>如果有多个父组件提供了相同键的数据，注入将解析为组件链上最近的父组件所注入的值。<p><p>如果提供的值是一个 ref，注入进来的会是该 ref 对象，而<strong>不会<strong>自动解包为其内部的值。这使得注入方组件能够通过 ref 对象保持了和供给方的响应性链接。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/provide-inject.html", "title": "依赖注入", "doc_id": "65b0dde4e47a4c9f8b5853d6579b3b39", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1007, "chunk_index": 18, "_doc_id": "18_1396250050635964792"}}
{"doc_id": "19_8412704328910413941", "text": "。<p><p>如果提供的值是一个 ref，注入进来的会是该 ref 对象，而<strong>不会<strong>自动解包为其内部的值。这使得注入方组件能够通过 ref 对象保持了和供给方的响应性链接。<p><p><a href=\"https://play.vuejs.org/#\" target=\"_blank\">带有响应性的 provide + inject 完整示例<a><p><p>同样的，", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/provide-inject.html", "title": "依赖注入", "doc_id": "65b0dde4e47a4c9f8b5853d6579b3b39", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1007, "chunk_index": 19, "_doc_id": "19_8412704328910413941"}}
{"doc_id": "20_3974292990184950658", "text": "PLECXa9NKdD/a6QTTtGnP88LgiXJtYv4BaLHhvg==\" target=\"_blank\">带有响应性的 provide + inject 完整示例<a><p><p>同样的，如果没有使用 <code><script setup><code>，<code>inject()<code> 需要在 <code>setup()<code> 内同步调用：<p><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>import<span><span> { inject } <span><span>from<span><span> 'vue'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/provide-inject.html", "title": "依赖注入", "doc_id": "65b0dde4e47a4c9f8b5853d6579b3b39", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1007, "chunk_index": 20, "_doc_id": "20_3974292990184950658"}}
{"doc_id": "21_732629801381522126", "text": "n class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> setup<span><span>() {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> const<span><span> message<span><span> =<span><span> inject<span><span>(<span><span>'message'<span><span>)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> return<span><span> { message }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/provide-inject.html", "title": "依赖注入", "doc_id": "65b0dde4e47a4c9f8b5853d6579b3b39", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1007, "chunk_index": 21, "_doc_id": "21_732629801381522126"}}
{"doc_id": "22_8852155093259070232", "text": "ss=\"line\"><span> return<span><span> { message }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span><code><pre><div><div><div class=\"options-api\"><p>要注入上层组件提供的数据，需使用 <a href=\"/api/options-composition.html#inject\"><code>inject<code><a> 选项来声明：<p><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/provide-inject.html", "title": "依赖注入", "doc_id": "65b0dde4e47a4c9f8b5853d6579b3b39", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1007, "chunk_index": 22, "_doc_id": "22_8852155093259070232"}}
{"doc_id": "23_6626201705543152876", "text": "b-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> inject: [<span><span>'message'<span><span>],<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> created<span><span>() {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> console.<span><span>log<span><span>(<span><span>this<span><span>.message) <span><span>// injected value<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/provide-inject.html", "title": "依赖注入", "doc_id": "65b0dde4e47a4c9f8b5853d6579b3b39", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1007, "chunk_index": 23, "_doc_id": "23_6626201705543152876"}}
{"doc_id": "24_1219134250480382551", "text": "n><span>.message) <span><span>// injected value<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span><code><pre><div><p>注入会在组件自身的状态<strong>之前<strong>被解析，因此你可以在 <code>data()<code> 中访问到注入的属性：<p><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> inject: [<span><span>'message'<span><span>],<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/provide-inject.html", "title": "依赖注入", "doc_id": "65b0dde4e47a4c9f8b5853d6579b3b39", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1007, "chunk_index": 24, "_doc_id": "24_1219134250480382551"}}
{"doc_id": "25_4928278972046649229", "text": "n> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> inject: [<span><span>'message'<span><span>],<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> data<span><span>() {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> return<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 基于注入值的初始数据<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> fullMessage: <span><span>this<span><span>.message<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/provide-inject.html", "title": "依赖注入", "doc_id": "65b0dde4e47a4c9f8b5853d6579b3b39", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1007, "chunk_index": 25, "_doc_id": "25_4928278972046649229"}}
{"doc_id": "26_4299621919306070629", "text": "message<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span><code><pre><div><p>如果有多个父组件提供了相同键的数据，注入将解析为组件链上最近的父组件所注入的值。<p><p><a href=\"https://play.vuejs.", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/provide-inject.html", "title": "依赖注入", "doc_id": "65b0dde4e47a4c9f8b5853d6579b3b39", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1007, "chunk_index": 26, "_doc_id": "26_4299621919306070629"}}
{"doc_id": "27_3458534550524434605", "text": "><span><code><pre><div><p>如果有多个父组件提供了相同键的数据，注入将解析为组件链上最近的父组件所注入的值。<p><p><a href=\"https://play.vuejs.org/#\" target=\"_blank\">完整的 provide + inject 示例<a><p><h3 id=\"injection-aliasing\">注入别名 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#injection-aliasing\">​<a><h3><p>当以数组形式使用 <code>inject<code>，", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/provide-inject.html", "title": "依赖注入", "doc_id": "65b0dde4e47a4c9f8b5853d6579b3b39", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1007, "chunk_index": 27, "_doc_id": "27_3458534550524434605"}}
{"doc_id": "28_6005451827706781644", "text": "ng\">注入别名 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#injection-aliasing\">​<a><h3><p>当以数组形式使用 <code>inject<code>，注入的属性会以同名的 key 暴露到组件实例上。在上面的例子中，提供的属性名为 <code>\"message\"<code>，注入后以 <code>this.message<code> 的形式暴露。访问的本地属性名和注入名是相同的。<p><p>如果我们想要用一个不同的本地属性名注入该属性，我们需要在 <code>inject<code> 选项的属性上使用对象的形式：<p><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> inject: {<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/provide-inject.html", "title": "依赖注入", "doc_id": "65b0dde4e47a4c9f8b5853d6579b3b39", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1007, "chunk_index": 28, "_doc_id": "28_6005451827706781644"}}
{"doc_id": "29_88300503530919134", "text": "xport<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> inject: {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> /* 本地属性名 */<span><span> localMessage: {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> from: <span><span>/* 注入来源名 */<span><span> 'message'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span><code><pre><div><p>这里，组件本地化了原注入名 <code>\"message\"<code> 所提供的属性，并将其暴露为 <code>this.localMessage<code>。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/provide-inject.html", "title": "依赖注入", "doc_id": "65b0dde4e47a4c9f8b5853d6579b3b39", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1007, "chunk_index": 29, "_doc_id": "29_88300503530919134"}}
{"doc_id": "30_6790039255724862007", "text": "><code><pre><div><p>这里，组件本地化了原注入名 <code>\"message\"<code> 所提供的属性，并将其暴露为 <code>this.localMessage<code>。<p><div><h3 id=\"injection-default-values\">注入默认值 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#injection-default-values\">​<a><h3><p>默认情况下，<code>inject<code> 假设传入的注入名会被某个祖先链上的组件提供。如果该注入名的确没有任何组件提供，则会抛出一个运行时警告。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/provide-inject.html", "title": "依赖注入", "doc_id": "65b0dde4e47a4c9f8b5853d6579b3b39", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1007, "chunk_index": 30, "_doc_id": "30_6790039255724862007"}}
{"doc_id": "31_3648808778418456906", "text": "ault-values\">​<a><h3><p>默认情况下，<code>inject<code> 假设传入的注入名会被某个祖先链上的组件提供。如果该注入名的确没有任何组件提供，则会抛出一个运行时警告。<p><p>如果在注入一个值时不要求必须有提供者，那么我们应该声明一个默认值，和 props 类似：<p><div class=\"composition-api\"><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// 如果没有祖先组件提供 \"message\"<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// `value` 会是 \"这是默认值\"<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/provide-inject.html", "title": "依赖注入", "doc_id": "65b0dde4e47a4c9f8b5853d6579b3b39", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1007, "chunk_index": 31, "_doc_id": "31_3648808778418456906"}}
{"doc_id": "32_3315453201895694816", "text": "span>// 如果没有祖先组件提供 \"message\"<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// `value` 会是 \"这是默认值\"<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> value<span><span> =<span><span> inject<span><span>(<span><span>'message'<span><span>, <span><span>'这是默认值'<span><span>)<span><span><code><pre><div><p>在一些场景中，默认值可能需要通过调用一个函数或初始化一个类来取得。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/provide-inject.html", "title": "依赖注入", "doc_id": "65b0dde4e47a4c9f8b5853d6579b3b39", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1007, "chunk_index": 32, "_doc_id": "32_3315453201895694816"}}
{"doc_id": "33_8767073895124729531", "text": "n>, <span><span>'这是默认值'<span><span>)<span><span><code><pre><div><p>在一些场景中，默认值可能需要通过调用一个函数或初始化一个类来取得。为了避免在用不到默认值的情况下进行不必要的计算或产生副作用，我们可以使用工厂函数来创建默认值：<p><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> value<span><span> =<span><span> inject<span><span>(<span><span>'key'<span><span>, () <span><span>=><span><span> new<span><span> ExpensiveClass<span><span>(), <span><span>true<span><span>)<span><span><code><pre><div><p>第三个参数表示默认值应该被当作一个工厂函数。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/provide-inject.html", "title": "依赖注入", "doc_id": "65b0dde4e47a4c9f8b5853d6579b3b39", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1007, "chunk_index": 33, "_doc_id": "33_8767073895124729531"}}
{"doc_id": "34_5949059911508260987", "text": "ss<span><span>(), <span><span>true<span><span>)<span><span><code><pre><div><p>第三个参数表示默认值应该被当作一个工厂函数。<p><div><div class=\"options-api\"><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 当声明注入的默认值时<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 必须使用对象形式<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> inject: {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> message: {<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/provide-inject.html", "title": "依赖注入", "doc_id": "65b0dde4e47a4c9f8b5853d6579b3b39", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1007, "chunk_index": 34, "_doc_id": "34_5949059911508260987"}}
{"doc_id": "35_157602532113718051", "text": "n>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> inject: {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> message: {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> from: <span><span>'message'<span><span>, <span><span>// 当与原注入名同名时，这个属性是可选的<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> default: <span><span>'default value'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> },<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> user: {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 对于非基础类型数据，如果创建开销比较大，或是需要确保每个组件实例<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 需要独立数据的，请使用工厂函数<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/provide-inject.html", "title": "依赖注入", "doc_id": "65b0dde4e47a4c9f8b5853d6579b3b39", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1007, "chunk_index": 35, "_doc_id": "35_157602532113718051"}}
{"doc_id": "36_739505548221506472", "text": "非基础类型数据，如果创建开销比较大，或是需要确保每个组件实例<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 需要独立数据的，请使用工厂函数<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> default<span><span>: () <span><span>=><span><span> ({ name: <span><span>'John'<span><span> })<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/provide-inject.html", "title": "依赖注入", "doc_id": "65b0dde4e47a4c9f8b5853d6579b3b39", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1007, "chunk_index": 36, "_doc_id": "36_739505548221506472"}}
{"doc_id": "37_3084572115727257095", "text": "pan> })<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span><code><pre><div><div><h2 id=\"working-with-reactivity\">和响应式数据配合使用 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#working-with-reactivity\">​<a><h2><div class=\"composition-api\"><p>当提供 / 注入响应式的数据时，<strong>建议尽可能将任何对响应式状态的变更都保持在供给方组件中<strong>。这样可以确保所提供状态的声明和变更操作都内聚在同一个组件内，使其更容易维护。<p><p>有的时候，我们可能需要在注入方组件中更改数据。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/provide-inject.html", "title": "依赖注入", "doc_id": "65b0dde4e47a4c9f8b5853d6579b3b39", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1007, "chunk_index": 37, "_doc_id": "37_3084572115727257095"}}
{"doc_id": "38_5281260873277670546", "text": "可能将任何对响应式状态的变更都保持在供给方组件中<strong>。这样可以确保所提供状态的声明和变更操作都内聚在同一个组件内，使其更容易维护。<p><p>有的时候，我们可能需要在注入方组件中更改数据。在这种情况下，我们推荐在供给方组件内声明并提供一个更改数据的方法函数：<p><div class=\"language-vue\"> <span class=\"lang\">vue<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><!-- 在供给方组件内 --><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>script<span><span> setup<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>import<span><span> { provide, ref } <span><span>from<span><span> 'vue'<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/provide-inject.html", "title": "依赖注入", "doc_id": "65b0dde4e47a4c9f8b5853d6579b3b39", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1007, "chunk_index": 38, "_doc_id": "38_5281260873277670546"}}
{"doc_id": "39_8810718204573910920", "text": "ass=\"line\"><span>import<span><span> { provide, ref } <span><span>from<span><span> 'vue'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> location<span><span> =<span><span> ref<span><span>(<span><span>'North Pole'<span><span>)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line highlighted\"><span>function<span><span> updateLocation<span><span>() {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line highlighted\"><span> location.value <span><span>=<span><span> 'South Pole'<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/provide-inject.html", "title": "依赖注入", "doc_id": "65b0dde4e47a4c9f8b5853d6579b3b39", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1007, "chunk_index": 39, "_doc_id": "39_8810718204573910920"}}
{"doc_id": "40_3814859609639290327", "text": "n class=\"line highlighted\"><span> location.value <span><span>=<span><span> 'South Pole'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line highlighted\"><span>}<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>provide<span><span>(<span><span>'location'<span><span>, {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> location,<span><span>\n<span class=\"line highlighted\"><span> updateLocation<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>})<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/provide-inject.html", "title": "依赖注入", "doc_id": "65b0dde4e47a4c9f8b5853d6579b3b39", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1007, "chunk_index": 40, "_doc_id": "40_3814859609639290327"}}
{"doc_id": "41_4148531814564383140", "text": "class=\"line highlighted\"><span> updateLocation<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>})<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>script<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><div class=\"language-vue\"> <span class=\"lang\">vue<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><!-- 在注入方组件 --><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>script<span><span> setup<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/provide-inject.html", "title": "依赖注入", "doc_id": "65b0dde4e47a4c9f8b5853d6579b3b39", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1007, "chunk_index": 41, "_doc_id": "41_4148531814564383140"}}
