{"doc_id": "45_5259415534938173131", "text": "code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>script<span><span> setup<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>import<span><span> { ref, provide, readonly } <span><span>from<span><span> 'vue'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> count<span><span> =<span><span> ref<span><span>(<span><span>0<span><span>)<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/provide-inject.html", "title": "依赖注入", "doc_id": "65b0dde4e47a4c9f8b5853d6579b3b39", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1007, "chunk_index": 45, "_doc_id": "45_5259415534938173131"}}
{"doc_id": "46_5246698434832030663", "text": "<span><span> count<span><span> =<span><span> ref<span><span>(<span><span>0<span><span>)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>provide<span><span>(<span><span>'read-only-count'<span><span>, <span><span>readonly<span><span>(count))<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/provide-inject.html", "title": "依赖注入", "doc_id": "65b0dde4e47a4c9f8b5853d6579b3b39", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1007, "chunk_index": 46, "_doc_id": "46_5246698434832030663"}}
{"doc_id": "47_3431326965431880885", "text": "an>(<span><span>'read-only-count'<span><span>, <span><span>readonly<span><span>(count))<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>script<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><div><div class=\"options-api\"><p>为保证注入方和供给方之间的响应性链接，我们需要使用 <a href=\"/api/reactivity-core.html#computed\">computed()<a> 函数提供一个计算属性：<p><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>import<span><span> { computed } <span><span>from<span><span> 'vue'<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/provide-inject.html", "title": "依赖注入", "doc_id": "65b0dde4e47a4c9f8b5853d6579b3b39", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1007, "chunk_index": 47, "_doc_id": "47_3431326965431880885"}}
{"doc_id": "48_9178849029443264729", "text": "n class=\"line\"><span>import<span><span> { computed } <span><span>from<span><span> 'vue'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> data<span><span>() {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> return<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> message: <span><span>'hello!'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> },<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/provide-inject.html", "title": "依赖注入", "doc_id": "65b0dde4e47a4c9f8b5853d6579b3b39", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1007, "chunk_index": 48, "_doc_id": "48_9178849029443264729"}}
{"doc_id": "49_8602792018542272202", "text": "ello!'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> },<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> provide<span><span>() {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> return<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 显式提供一个计算属性<span><span>\n<span class=\"line highlighted\"><span> message: <span><span>computed<span><span>(() <span><span>=><span><span> this<span><span>.message)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/provide-inject.html", "title": "依赖注入", "doc_id": "65b0dde4e47a4c9f8b5853d6579b3b39", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1007, "chunk_index": 49, "_doc_id": "49_8602792018542272202"}}
