{"doc_id": "52_6206346323614652736", "text": "==\" target=\"_blank\">带有响应性的 provide + inject 完整示例<a><p><p><code>computed()<code> 函数常用于组合式 API 风格的组件中，但它同样还可以用于补充选项式 API 风格的某些用例。你可以通过阅读<a href=\"/guide/essentials/reactivity-fundamentals.html\">响应式系统基础<a>和<a href=\"/guide/essentials/computed.html\">计算属性<a>两个章节了解更多组合式的 API 风格。<p><div><h2 id=\"working-with-symbol-keys\">使用 Symbol 作注入名 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#working-with-symbol-keys\">​<a><h2><p>至此，我们已经了解了如何使用字符串作为注入名。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/provide-inject.html", "title": "依赖注入", "doc_id": "65b0dde4e47a4c9f8b5853d6579b3b39", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1007, "chunk_index": 52, "_doc_id": "52_6206346323614652736"}}
{"doc_id": "53_5018960733618776890", "text": "ol 作注入名 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#working-with-symbol-keys\">​<a><h2><p>至此，我们已经了解了如何使用字符串作为注入名。但如果你正在构建大型的应用，包含非常多的依赖提供，或者你正在编写提供给其他开发者使用的组件库，建议最好使用 <a href=\"https://developer.mozilla.org/zh-CN/docs/Web/JavaScript/Reference/Global_Objects/Symbol\" target=\"_blank\">Symbol<a> 来作为注入名以避免潜在的冲突。<p><p>我们通常推荐在一个单独的文件中导出这些注入名 Symbol：<p><div class=\"vp-code-block-title\"><p class=\"vp-code-block-title-bar\"><span class=\"vp-code-block-title-text\">keys.", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/provide-inject.html", "title": "依赖注入", "doc_id": "65b0dde4e47a4c9f8b5853d6579b3b39", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1007, "chunk_index": 53, "_doc_id": "53_5018960733618776890"}}
{"doc_id": "54_5781269610029535337", "text": "vp-code-block-title\"><p class=\"vp-code-block-title-bar\"><span class=\"vp-code-block-title-text\">keys.js<span><p><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> const<span><span> myInjectionKey<span><span> =<span><span> Symbol<span><span>()<span><span><code><pre><div><div><div class=\"composition-api\"><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// 在供给方组件中<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/provide-inject.html", "title": "依赖注入", "doc_id": "65b0dde4e47a4c9f8b5853d6579b3b39", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1007, "chunk_index": 54, "_doc_id": "54_5781269610029535337"}}
{"doc_id": "55_5939687222374693748", "text": "s<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// 在供给方组件中<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>import<span><span> { provide } <span><span>from<span><span> 'vue'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>import<span><span> { myInjectionKey } <span><span>from<span><span> './keys.js'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>provide<span><span>(myInjectionKey, { <span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> /* 要提供的数据 */<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/provide-inject.html", "title": "依赖注入", "doc_id": "65b0dde4e47a4c9f8b5853d6579b3b39", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1007, "chunk_index": 55, "_doc_id": "55_5939687222374693748"}}
{"doc_id": "56_5324284834900174308", "text": "ovide<span><span>(myInjectionKey, { <span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> /* 要提供的数据 */<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>})<span><span><code><pre><div><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// 注入方组件<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>import<span><span> { inject } <span><span>from<span><span> 'vue'<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/provide-inject.html", "title": "依赖注入", "doc_id": "65b0dde4e47a4c9f8b5853d6579b3b39", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1007, "chunk_index": 56, "_doc_id": "56_5324284834900174308"}}
{"doc_id": "57_7830396158627303272", "text": "pan class=\"line\"><span>import<span><span> { inject } <span><span>from<span><span> 'vue'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>import<span><span> { myInjectionKey } <span><span>from<span><span> './keys.js'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/provide-inject.html", "title": "依赖注入", "doc_id": "65b0dde4e47a4c9f8b5853d6579b3b39", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1007, "chunk_index": 57, "_doc_id": "57_7830396158627303272"}}
{"doc_id": "58_7279878486791890139", "text": "> { myInjectionKey } <span><span>from<span><span> './keys.js'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> injected<span><span> =<span><span> inject<span><span>(myInjectionKey)<span><span><code><pre><div><p>TypeScript 用户请参考：<a href=\"/guide/typescript/composition-api.html#typing-provide-inject\">为 Provide / Inject 标注类型<a> <p><div><div class=\"options-api\"><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// 在供给方组件中<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/provide-inject.html", "title": "依赖注入", "doc_id": "65b0dde4e47a4c9f8b5853d6579b3b39", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1007, "chunk_index": 58, "_doc_id": "58_7279878486791890139"}}
{"doc_id": "59_1401697421817419671", "text": "s<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// 在供给方组件中<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>import<span><span> { myInjectionKey } <span><span>from<span><span> './keys.js'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> provide<span><span>() {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> return<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> [myInjectionKey]: {<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/provide-inject.html", "title": "依赖注入", "doc_id": "65b0dde4e47a4c9f8b5853d6579b3b39", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1007, "chunk_index": 59, "_doc_id": "59_1401697421817419671"}}
{"doc_id": "60_2282470967772867771", "text": "\"><span> return<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> [myInjectionKey]: {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> /* 要提供的数据 */<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span><code><pre><div><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// 注入方组件<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/provide-inject.html", "title": "依赖注入", "doc_id": "65b0dde4e47a4c9f8b5853d6579b3b39", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1007, "chunk_index": 60, "_doc_id": "60_2282470967772867771"}}
{"doc_id": "61_8645739802729222650", "text": ">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// 注入方组件<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>import<span><span> { myInjectionKey } <span><span>from<span><span> './keys.js'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> inject: {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> injected: { from: myInjectionKey }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/provide-inject.html", "title": "依赖注入", "doc_id": "65b0dde4e47a4c9f8b5853d6579b3b39", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1007, "chunk_index": 61, "_doc_id": "61_8645739802729222650"}}
{"doc_id": "62_1233900771983568542", "text": "line\"><span> injected: { from: myInjectionKey }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span><code><pre><div><div> <p><strong>译者注<strong><p><p><a id=\"footnote-1\"><a>[1] 在本章及后续章节中，“<strong>提供<strong>”将成为对应 Provide 的一个专有概念<p><div><div>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/provide-inject.html", "title": "依赖注入", "doc_id": "65b0dde4e47a4c9f8b5853d6579b3b39", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1007, "chunk_index": 62, "_doc_id": "62_1233900771983568542"}}
{"doc_id": "0_4900662168778154573", "text": "<div><div><h1 id=\"lifecycle-hooks\">生命周期钩子 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#lifecycle-hooks\">​<a><h1><p>每个 Vue 组件实例在创建时都需要经历一系列的初始化步骤，比如设置好数据侦听，编译模板，挂载实例到 DOM，以及在数据改变时更新 DOM。在此过程中，它也会运行被称为生命周期钩子的函数，让开发者有机会在特定阶段运行自己的代码。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/lifecycle.html", "title": "生命周期钩子", "doc_id": "e64e60c2b5604918b0b8cf1414865a69", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 153, "chunk_index": 0, "_doc_id": "0_4900662168778154573"}}
{"doc_id": "1_9019146722672963611", "text": "时都需要经历一系列的初始化步骤，比如设置好数据侦听，编译模板，挂载实例到 DOM，以及在数据改变时更新 DOM。在此过程中，它也会运行被称为生命周期钩子的函数，让开发者有机会在特定阶段运行自己的代码。<p><h2 id=\"registering-lifecycle-hooks\">注册周期钩子 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#registering-lifecycle-hooks\">​<a><h2><p>举例来说，<span class=\"composition-api\"><code>onMounted<code><span><span class=\"options-api\"><code>mounted<code><span> 钩子可以用来在组件完成初始渲染并创建 DOM 节点后运行代码：<p><div class=\"composition-api\"><div class=\"language-vue\"> <span class=\"lang\">vue<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>script<span><span> setup<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/lifecycle.html", "title": "生命周期钩子", "doc_id": "e64e60c2b5604918b0b8cf1414865a69", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 153, "chunk_index": 1, "_doc_id": "1_9019146722672963611"}}
{"doc_id": "2_6937383886353120719", "text": "code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>script<span><span> setup<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>import<span><span> { onMounted } <span><span>from<span><span> 'vue'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>onMounted<span><span>(() <span><span>=><span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> console.<span><span>log<span><span>(<span><span>`the component is now mounted.`<span><span>)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>})<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/lifecycle.html", "title": "生命周期钩子", "doc_id": "e64e60c2b5604918b0b8cf1414865a69", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 153, "chunk_index": 2, "_doc_id": "2_6937383886353120719"}}
{"doc_id": "3_5073452115678995636", "text": "an>`the component is now mounted.`<span><span>)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>})<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>script<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><div><div class=\"options-api\"><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> mounted<span><span>() {<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/lifecycle.html", "title": "生命周期钩子", "doc_id": "e64e60c2b5604918b0b8cf1414865a69", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 153, "chunk_index": 3, "_doc_id": "3_5073452115678995636"}}
{"doc_id": "4_6409164493923969919", "text": "an> default<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> mounted<span><span>() {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> console.<span><span>log<span><span>(<span><span>`the component is now mounted.`<span><span>)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/lifecycle.html", "title": "生命周期钩子", "doc_id": "e64e60c2b5604918b0b8cf1414865a69", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 153, "chunk_index": 4, "_doc_id": "4_6409164493923969919"}}
{"doc_id": "5_4761011013430517720", "text": "an>`the component is now mounted.`<span><span>)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span><code><pre><div><div><p>还有其他一些钩子，会在实例生命周期的不同阶段被调用，最常用的是 <span class=\"composition-api\"><a href=\"/api/composition-api-lifecycle.html#onmounted\"><code>onMounted<code><a>、<a href=\"/api/composition-api-lifecycle.html#onupdated\"><code>onUpdated<code><a> 和 <a href=\"/api/composition-api-lifecycle.html#onunmounted\"><code>onUnmounted<code><a>。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/lifecycle.html", "title": "生命周期钩子", "doc_id": "e64e60c2b5604918b0b8cf1414865a69", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 153, "chunk_index": 5, "_doc_id": "5_4761011013430517720"}}
{"doc_id": "6_7520661789666895625", "text": "ted<code><a> 和 <a href=\"/api/composition-api-lifecycle.html#onunmounted\"><code>onUnmounted<code><a>。所有生命周期钩子的完整参考及其用法请参考 <a href=\"/api/composition-api-lifecycle.html\">API 索引<a>。<span><span class=\"options-api\"><a href=\"/api/options-lifecycle.html#mounted\"><code>mounted<code><a>、<a href=\"/api/options-lifecycle.html#updated\"><code>updated<code><a> 和 <a href=\"/api/options-lifecycle.html#unmounted\"><code>unmounted<code><a>。<span><p><div class=\"options-api\"><p>所有生命周期钩子函数的 <code>this<code> 上下文都会自动指向当前调用它的组件实例。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/lifecycle.html", "title": "生命周期钩子", "doc_id": "e64e60c2b5604918b0b8cf1414865a69", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 153, "chunk_index": 6, "_doc_id": "6_7520661789666895625"}}
{"doc_id": "7_4451238153199963050", "text": "nted<code><a>。<span><p><div class=\"options-api\"><p>所有生命周期钩子函数的 <code>this<code> 上下文都会自动指向当前调用它的组件实例。注意：避免用箭头函数来定义生命周期钩子，因为如果这样的话你将无法在函数中通过 <code>this<code> 获取组件实例。<p><div><div class=\"composition-api\"><p>当调用 <code>onMounted<code> 时，Vue 会自动将回调函数注册到当前正被初始化的组件实例上。这意味着这些钩子应当在组件初始化时被<strong>同步<strong>注册。例如，请不要这样做：<p><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>setTimeout<span><span>(() <span><span>=><span><span> {<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/lifecycle.html", "title": "生命周期钩子", "doc_id": "e64e60c2b5604918b0b8cf1414865a69", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 153, "chunk_index": 7, "_doc_id": "7_4451238153199963050"}}
{"doc_id": "8_7537503690678890856", "text": "\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>setTimeout<span><span>(() <span><span>=><span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> onMounted<span><span>(() <span><span>=><span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 异步注册时当前组件实例已丢失<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 这将不会正常工作<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> })<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/lifecycle.html", "title": "生命周期钩子", "doc_id": "e64e60c2b5604918b0b8cf1414865a69", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 153, "chunk_index": 8, "_doc_id": "8_7537503690678890856"}}
{"doc_id": "9_5386048969135426807", "text": "n><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 这将不会正常工作<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> })<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}, <span><span>100<span><span>)<span><span><code><pre><div><p>注意这并不意味着对 <code>onMounted<code> 的调用必须放在 <code>setup()<code> 或 <code><script setup><code> 内的词法上下文中。<code>onMounted()<code> 也可以在一个外部函数中调用，只要调用栈是同步的，且最终起源自 <code>setup()<code> 就可以。<p><div><h2 id=\"lifecycle-diagram\">生命周期图示 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#lifecycle-diagram\">​<a><h2><p>下面是实例生命周期的图表。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/lifecycle.html", "title": "生命周期钩子", "doc_id": "e64e60c2b5604918b0b8cf1414865a69", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 153, "chunk_index": 9, "_doc_id": "9_5386048969135426807"}}
{"doc_id": "10_9131136729315712800", "text": "ifecycle-diagram\">生命周期图示 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#lifecycle-diagram\">​<a><h2><p>下面是实例生命周期的图表。你现在并不需要完全理解图中的所有内容，但以后它将是一个有用的参考。<p><p> <p><p>有关所有生命周期钩子及其各自用例的详细信息，请参考<span class=\"composition-api\"><a href=\"/api/composition-api-lifecycle.html\">生命周期钩子 API 索引<a><span><span class=\"options-api\"><a href=\"/api/options-lifecycle.html\">生命周期钩子 API 索引<a><span>。<p><div><div>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/lifecycle.html", "title": "生命周期钩子", "doc_id": "e64e60c2b5604918b0b8cf1414865a69", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 153, "chunk_index": 10, "_doc_id": "10_9131136729315712800"}}
{"doc_id": "0_187890297484196346", "text": "<div><div><h1 id=\"template-refs\">模板引用 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#template-refs\">​<a><h1><p>虽然 Vue 的声明性渲染模型为你抽象了大部分对 DOM 的直接操作，但在某些情况下，我们仍然需要直接访问底层 DOM 元素。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/template-refs.html", "title": "模板引用", "doc_id": "a467167aa6b74f81a670ed911b8b89d6", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 925, "chunk_index": 0, "_doc_id": "0_187890297484196346"}}
{"doc_id": "1_1050504288609067005", "text": "or\" href=\"#template-refs\">​<a><h1><p>虽然 Vue 的声明性渲染模型为你抽象了大部分对 DOM 的直接操作，但在某些情况下，我们仍然需要直接访问底层 DOM 元素。要实现这一点，我们可以使用特殊的 <code>ref<code> attribute：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>input<span><span> ref<span><span>=<span><span>\"input\"<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p><code>ref<code> 是一个特殊的 attribute，和 <code>v-for<code> 章节中提到的 <code>key<code> 类似。它允许我们在一个特定的 DOM 元素或子组件实例被挂载后，获得对它的直接引用。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/template-refs.html", "title": "模板引用", "doc_id": "a467167aa6b74f81a670ed911b8b89d6", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 925, "chunk_index": 1, "_doc_id": "1_1050504288609067005"}}
{"doc_id": "2_6804180024460934227", "text": "个特殊的 attribute，和 <code>v-for<code> 章节中提到的 <code>key<code> 类似。它允许我们在一个特定的 DOM 元素或子组件实例被挂载后，获得对它的直接引用。这可能很有用，比如说在组件挂载时将焦点设置到一个 input 元素上，或在一个元素上初始化一个第三方库。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/template-refs.html", "title": "模板引用", "doc_id": "a467167aa6b74f81a670ed911b8b89d6", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 925, "chunk_index": 2, "_doc_id": "2_6804180024460934227"}}
{"doc_id": "3_5493128099699721937", "text": "code> 类似。它允许我们在一个特定的 DOM 元素或子组件实例被挂载后，获得对它的直接引用。这可能很有用，比如说在组件挂载时将焦点设置到一个 input 元素上，或在一个元素上初始化一个第三方库。<p><h2 id=\"accessing-the-refs\">访问模板引用 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#accessing-the-refs\">​<a><h2><div class=\"composition-api\"><p>要在组合式 API 中获取引用，我们可以使用辅助函数 <a href=\"/api/composition-api-helpers.html#usetemplateref\"><code>useTemplateRef()<code><a> ：<p><div class=\"language-vue\"> <span class=\"lang\">vue<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>script<span><span> setup<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/template-refs.html", "title": "模板引用", "doc_id": "a467167aa6b74f81a670ed911b8b89d6", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 925, "chunk_index": 3, "_doc_id": "3_5493128099699721937"}}
{"doc_id": "4_6790361041967877804", "text": "code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>script<span><span> setup<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>import<span><span> { useTemplateRef, onMounted } <span><span>from<span><span> 'vue'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 第一个参数必须与模板中的 ref 值匹配<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> input<span><span> =<span><span> useTemplateRef<span><span>(<span><span>'my-input'<span><span>)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/template-refs.html", "title": "模板引用", "doc_id": "a467167aa6b74f81a670ed911b8b89d6", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 925, "chunk_index": 4, "_doc_id": "4_6790361041967877804"}}
{"doc_id": "5_3278264099824832226", "text": "seTemplateRef<span><span>(<span><span>'my-input'<span><span>)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>onMounted<span><span>(() <span><span>=><span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> input.value.<span><span>focus<span><span>()<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>})<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>script<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/template-refs.html", "title": "模板引用", "doc_id": "a467167aa6b74f81a670ed911b8b89d6", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 925, "chunk_index": 5, "_doc_id": "5_3278264099824832226"}}
{"doc_id": "6_8109240510946639597", "text": ">\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>input<span><span> ref<span><span>=<span><span>\"my-input\"<span><span> /><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/template-refs.html", "title": "模板引用", "doc_id": "a467167aa6b74f81a670ed911b8b89d6", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 925, "chunk_index": 6, "_doc_id": "6_8109240510946639597"}}
{"doc_id": "7_6276000136437298225", "text": "n> <<span><span>input<span><span> ref<span><span>=<span><span>\"my-input\"<span><span> /><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>在使用 TypeScript 时，Vue 的 IDE 支持和 <code>vue-tsc<code> 将根据匹配的 <code>ref<code> attribute 所用的元素或组件自动推断 <code>input.value<code> 的类型。<p> 3.5 前的用法 <p>在 3.5 之前的版本尚未引入 <code>useTemplateRef()<code>，我们需要声明一个与模板里 ref attribute 匹配的引用：<p><div class=\"language-vue\"> <span class=\"lang\">vue<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>script<span><span> setup<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/template-refs.html", "title": "模板引用", "doc_id": "a467167aa6b74f81a670ed911b8b89d6", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 925, "chunk_index": 7, "_doc_id": "7_6276000136437298225"}}
{"doc_id": "8_675599828964256704", "text": "code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>script<span><span> setup<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>import<span><span> { ref, onMounted } <span><span>from<span><span> 'vue'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 声明一个 ref 来存放该元素的引用<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 必须和模板里的 ref 同名<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> input<span><span> =<span><span> ref<span><span>(<span><span>null<span><span>)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/template-refs.html", "title": "模板引用", "doc_id": "a467167aa6b74f81a670ed911b8b89d6", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 925, "chunk_index": 8, "_doc_id": "8_675599828964256704"}}
{"doc_id": "9_6516844369771447664", "text": "> =<span><span> ref<span><span>(<span><span>null<span><span>)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>onMounted<span><span>(() <span><span>=><span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> input.value.<span><span>focus<span><span>()<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>})<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>script<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/template-refs.html", "title": "模板引用", "doc_id": "a467167aa6b74f81a670ed911b8b89d6", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 925, "chunk_index": 9, "_doc_id": "9_6516844369771447664"}}
{"doc_id": "10_8040204268809912146", "text": ">\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>input<span><span> ref<span><span>=<span><span>\"input\"<span><span> /><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/template-refs.html", "title": "模板引用", "doc_id": "a467167aa6b74f81a670ed911b8b89d6", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 925, "chunk_index": 10, "_doc_id": "10_8040204268809912146"}}
{"doc_id": "11_3433679233904899655", "text": "span> <<span><span>input<span><span> ref<span><span>=<span><span>\"input\"<span><span> /><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>如果不使用 <code><script setup><code>，需确保从 <code>setup()<code> 返回 ref：<p><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> setup<span><span>() {<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/template-refs.html", "title": "模板引用", "doc_id": "a467167aa6b74f81a670ed911b8b89d6", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 925, "chunk_index": 11, "_doc_id": "11_3433679233904899655"}}
{"doc_id": "12_3386666652778040315", "text": "span> default<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> setup<span><span>() {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> const<span><span> input<span><span> =<span><span> ref<span><span>(<span><span>null<span><span>)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // ...<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> return<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line highlighted\"><span> input<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/template-refs.html", "title": "模板引用", "doc_id": "a467167aa6b74f81a670ed911b8b89d6", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 925, "chunk_index": 12, "_doc_id": "12_3386666652778040315"}}
{"doc_id": "13_7053555309571768166", "text": "> input<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span><code><pre><div> <div><div class=\"options-api\"><p>挂载结束后引用都会被暴露在 <code>this.$refs<code> 之上：<p><div class=\"language-vue\"> <span class=\"lang\">vue<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>script<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/template-refs.html", "title": "模板引用", "doc_id": "a467167aa6b74f81a670ed911b8b89d6", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 925, "chunk_index": 13, "_doc_id": "13_7053555309571768166"}}
{"doc_id": "14_6732932019664810102", "text": "n><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> mounted<span><span>() {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> this<span><span>.$refs.input.<span><span>focus<span><span>()<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>script<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/template-refs.html", "title": "模板引用", "doc_id": "a467167aa6b74f81a670ed911b8b89d6", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 925, "chunk_index": 14, "_doc_id": "14_6732932019664810102"}}
{"doc_id": "15_2014190967801356245", "text": ">\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>input<span><span> ref<span><span>=<span><span>\"input\"<span><span> /><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><div><p>注意，你只可以<strong>在组件挂载后<strong>才能访问模板引用。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/template-refs.html", "title": "模板引用", "doc_id": "a467167aa6b74f81a670ed911b8b89d6", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 925, "chunk_index": 15, "_doc_id": "15_2014190967801356245"}}
{"doc_id": "16_409642800014804795", "text": "span>template<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><div><p>注意，你只可以<strong>在组件挂载后<strong>才能访问模板引用。如果你想在模板中的表达式上访问 <span class=\"options-api\"><code>$refs.input<code><span><span class=\"composition-api\"><code>input<code><span>，在初次渲染时会是 <span class=\"options-api\"><code>undefined<code><span><span class=\"composition-api\"><code>null<code><span>。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/template-refs.html", "title": "模板引用", "doc_id": "a467167aa6b74f81a670ed911b8b89d6", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 925, "chunk_index": 16, "_doc_id": "16_409642800014804795"}}
{"doc_id": "17_6485920035257473827", "text": "class=\"options-api\"><code>undefined<code><span><span class=\"composition-api\"><code>null<code><span>。这是因为在初次渲染前这个元素还不存在呢！<p><div class=\"composition-api\"><p>如果你需要侦听一个模板引用 ref 的变化，确保考虑到其值为 <code>null<code> 的情况：<p><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>watchEffect<span><span>(() <span><span>=><span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> if<span><span> (input.value) {<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/template-refs.html", "title": "模板引用", "doc_id": "a467167aa6b74f81a670ed911b8b89d6", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 925, "chunk_index": 17, "_doc_id": "17_6485920035257473827"}}
{"doc_id": "18_2251686832121083177", "text": "n>=><span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> if<span><span> (input.value) {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> input.value.<span><span>focus<span><span>()<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> } <span><span>else<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 此时还未挂载，或此元素已经被卸载(例如通过 v-if 控制)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/template-refs.html", "title": "模板引用", "doc_id": "a467167aa6b74f81a670ed911b8b89d6", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 925, "chunk_index": 18, "_doc_id": "18_2251686832121083177"}}
{"doc_id": "19_8877713329814903092", "text": "\"line\"><span> // 此时还未挂载，或此元素已经被卸载(例如通过 v-if 控制)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>})<span><span><code><pre><div><p>也可参考：<a href=\"/guide/typescript/composition-api.html#typing-template-refs\">为模板引用标注类型<a> <p><div><h2 id=\"ref-on-component\">组件上的 ref <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#ref-on-component\">​<a><h2><blockquote><p>这一小节假设你已了解<a href=\"/guide/essentials/component-basics.html\">组件<a>的相关知识，或者你也可以先跳过这里，之后再回来看。<p><blockquote><p>模板引用也可以被用在一个子组件上。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/template-refs.html", "title": "模板引用", "doc_id": "a467167aa6b74f81a670ed911b8b89d6", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 925, "chunk_index": 19, "_doc_id": "19_8877713329814903092"}}
{"doc_id": "20_7393005561386737394", "text": "/essentials/component-basics.html\">组件<a>的相关知识，或者你也可以先跳过这里，之后再回来看。<p><blockquote><p>模板引用也可以被用在一个子组件上。这种情况下引用中获得的值是组件实例：<p><div class=\"composition-api\"><div class=\"language-vue\"> <span class=\"lang\">vue<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>script<span><span> setup<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>import<span><span> { useTemplateRef, onMounted } <span><span>from<span><span> 'vue'<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/template-refs.html", "title": "模板引用", "doc_id": "a467167aa6b74f81a670ed911b8b89d6", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 925, "chunk_index": 20, "_doc_id": "20_7393005561386737394"}}
{"doc_id": "21_2944999607223077702", "text": "pan>import<span><span> { useTemplateRef, onMounted } <span><span>from<span><span> 'vue'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>import<span><span> Child <span><span>from<span><span> './Child.vue'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> childRef<span><span> =<span><span> useTemplateRef<span><span>(<span><span>'child'<span><span>)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>onMounted<span><span>(() <span><span>=><span><span> {<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/template-refs.html", "title": "模板引用", "doc_id": "a467167aa6b74f81a670ed911b8b89d6", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 925, "chunk_index": 21, "_doc_id": "21_2944999607223077702"}}
{"doc_id": "22_1228885406994679395", "text": "\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>onMounted<span><span>(() <span><span>=><span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // childRef.value 将持有 <Child /> 的实例<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>})<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>script<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>Child<span><span> ref<span><span>=<span><span>\"child\"<span><span> /><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/template-refs.html", "title": "模板引用", "doc_id": "a467167aa6b74f81a670ed911b8b89d6", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 925, "chunk_index": 22, "_doc_id": "22_1228885406994679395"}}
{"doc_id": "23_6305521678126847044", "text": "span> <<span><span>Child<span><span> ref<span><span>=<span><span>\"child\"<span><span> /><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div> 3.5 前的用法 <div class=\"language-vue\"> <span class=\"lang\">vue<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>script<span><span> setup<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>import<span><span> { ref, onMounted } <span><span>from<span><span> 'vue'<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/template-refs.html", "title": "模板引用", "doc_id": "a467167aa6b74f81a670ed911b8b89d6", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 925, "chunk_index": 23, "_doc_id": "23_6305521678126847044"}}
{"doc_id": "24_1608721402355882770", "text": "s=\"line\"><span>import<span><span> { ref, onMounted } <span><span>from<span><span> 'vue'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>import<span><span> Child <span><span>from<span><span> './Child.vue'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> child<span><span> =<span><span> ref<span><span>(<span><span>null<span><span>)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>onMounted<span><span>(() <span><span>=><span><span> {<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/template-refs.html", "title": "模板引用", "doc_id": "a467167aa6b74f81a670ed911b8b89d6", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 925, "chunk_index": 24, "_doc_id": "24_1608721402355882770"}}
{"doc_id": "25_8528033438982621577", "text": "\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>onMounted<span><span>(() <span><span>=><span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // child.value 是 <Child /> 组件的实例<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>})<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>script<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>Child<span><span> ref<span><span>=<span><span>\"child\"<span><span> /><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/template-refs.html", "title": "模板引用", "doc_id": "a467167aa6b74f81a670ed911b8b89d6", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 925, "chunk_index": 25, "_doc_id": "25_8528033438982621577"}}
{"doc_id": "26_7555544021447752757", "text": "span> <<span><span>Child<span><span> ref<span><span>=<span><span>\"child\"<span><span> /><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div> <div><div class=\"options-api\"><div class=\"language-vue\"> <span class=\"lang\">vue<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>script<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>import<span><span> Child <span><span>from<span><span> './Child.vue'<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/template-refs.html", "title": "模板引用", "doc_id": "a467167aa6b74f81a670ed911b8b89d6", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 925, "chunk_index": 26, "_doc_id": "26_7555544021447752757"}}
{"doc_id": "27_190338742469244308", "text": "class=\"line\"><span>import<span><span> Child <span><span>from<span><span> './Child.vue'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> components: {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> Child<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> },<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> mounted<span><span>() {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // this.$refs.child 是 <Child /> 组件的实例<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/template-refs.html", "title": "模板引用", "doc_id": "a467167aa6b74f81a670ed911b8b89d6", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 925, "chunk_index": 27, "_doc_id": "27_190338742469244308"}}
{"doc_id": "28_2345784413418720738", "text": "><span>() {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // this.$refs.child 是 <Child /> 组件的实例<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>script<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>Child<span><span> ref<span><span>=<span><span>\"child\"<span><span> /><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/template-refs.html", "title": "模板引用", "doc_id": "a467167aa6b74f81a670ed911b8b89d6", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 925, "chunk_index": 28, "_doc_id": "28_2345784413418720738"}}
{"doc_id": "29_6567584932432339805", "text": "span> <<span><span>Child<span><span> ref<span><span>=<span><span>\"child\"<span><span> /><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><div><p>如果一个子组件使用的是选项式 API <span class=\"composition-api\">或没有使用 <code><script setup><code><span>，被引用的组件实例和该子组件的 <code>this<code> 完全一致，这意味着父组件对子组件的每一个属性和方法都有完全的访问权。这使得在父组件和子组件之间创建紧密耦合的实现细节变得很容易，当然也因此，应该只在绝对需要时才使用组件引用。大多数情况下，你应该首先使用标准的 props 和 emit 接口来实现父子组件交互。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/template-refs.html", "title": "模板引用", "doc_id": "a467167aa6b74f81a670ed911b8b89d6", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 925, "chunk_index": 29, "_doc_id": "29_6567584932432339805"}}
{"doc_id": "30_5136024892768308137", "text": "访问权。这使得在父组件和子组件之间创建紧密耦合的实现细节变得很容易，当然也因此，应该只在绝对需要时才使用组件引用。大多数情况下，你应该首先使用标准的 props 和 emit 接口来实现父子组件交互。<p><div class=\"composition-api\"><p>有一个例外的情况，使用了 <code><script setup><code> 的组件是<strong>默认私有<strong>的：一个父组件无法访问到一个使用了 <code><script setup><code> 的子组件中的任何东西，除非子组件在其中通过 <code>defineExpose<code> 宏显式暴露：<p><div class=\"language-vue\"> <span class=\"lang\">vue<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>script<span><span> setup<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/template-refs.html", "title": "模板引用", "doc_id": "a467167aa6b74f81a670ed911b8b89d6", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 925, "chunk_index": 30, "_doc_id": "30_5136024892768308137"}}
{"doc_id": "31_4850490497595138759", "text": "code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>script<span><span> setup<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>import<span><span> { ref } <span><span>from<span><span> 'vue'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> a<span><span> =<span><span> 1<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> b<span><span> =<span><span> ref<span><span>(<span><span>2<span><span>)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/template-refs.html", "title": "模板引用", "doc_id": "a467167aa6b74f81a670ed911b8b89d6", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 925, "chunk_index": 31, "_doc_id": "31_4850490497595138759"}}
{"doc_id": "32_1497452430151904097", "text": "pan> =<span><span> ref<span><span>(<span><span>2<span><span>)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 像 defineExpose 这样的编译器宏不需要导入<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>defineExpose<span><span>({<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> a,<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> b<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>})<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/template-refs.html", "title": "模板引用", "doc_id": "a467167aa6b74f81a670ed911b8b89d6", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 925, "chunk_index": 32, "_doc_id": "32_1497452430151904097"}}
{"doc_id": "33_2772685774520691488", "text": "pan> a,<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> b<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>})<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>script<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>当父组件通过模板引用获取到了该组件的实例时，得到的实例类型为 <code>{ a: number, b: number }<code> (ref 都会自动解包，和一般的实例一样)。<p><p>请注意，defineExpose 必须在任何 await 操作之前调用。否则，在 await 操作后暴露的属性和方法将无法访问。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/template-refs.html", "title": "模板引用", "doc_id": "a467167aa6b74f81a670ed911b8b89d6", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 925, "chunk_index": 33, "_doc_id": "33_2772685774520691488"}}
{"doc_id": "34_4220225756000211027", "text": "}<code> (ref 都会自动解包，和一般的实例一样)。<p><p>请注意，defineExpose 必须在任何 await 操作之前调用。否则，在 await 操作后暴露的属性和方法将无法访问。<p><p>TypeScript 用户请参考：<a href=\"/guide/typescript/composition-api.html#typing-component-template-refs\">为组件的模板引用标注类型<a> <p><div><div class=\"options-api\"><p><code>expose<code> 选项可以用于限制对子组件实例的访问：<p><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/template-refs.html", "title": "模板引用", "doc_id": "a467167aa6b74f81a670ed911b8b89d6", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 925, "chunk_index": 34, "_doc_id": "34_4220225756000211027"}}
{"doc_id": "35_5602341708941451104", "text": "b-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> expose: [<span><span>'publicData'<span><span>, <span><span>'publicMethod'<span><span>],<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> data<span><span>() {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> return<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> publicData: <span><span>'foo'<span><span>,<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> privateData: <span><span>'bar'<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/template-refs.html", "title": "模板引用", "doc_id": "a467167aa6b74f81a670ed911b8b89d6", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 925, "chunk_index": 35, "_doc_id": "35_5602341708941451104"}}
{"doc_id": "36_6708111039339802615", "text": "'foo'<span><span>,<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> privateData: <span><span>'bar'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> },<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> methods: {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> publicMethod<span><span>() {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> /* ... */<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> },<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> privateMethod<span><span>() {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> /* ... */<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/template-refs.html", "title": "模板引用", "doc_id": "a467167aa6b74f81a670ed911b8b89d6", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 925, "chunk_index": 36, "_doc_id": "36_6708111039339802615"}}
{"doc_id": "37_1770938288881547423", "text": "e\"><span> privateMethod<span><span>() {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> /* ... */<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span><code><pre><div><p>在上面这个例子中，父组件通过模板引用访问到子组件实例后，仅能访问 <code>publicData<code> 和 <code>publicMethod<code>。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/template-refs.html", "title": "模板引用", "doc_id": "a467167aa6b74f81a670ed911b8b89d6", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 925, "chunk_index": 37, "_doc_id": "37_1770938288881547423"}}
{"doc_id": "38_7484938618139072895", "text": "ode><pre><div><p>在上面这个例子中，父组件通过模板引用访问到子组件实例后，仅能访问 <code>publicData<code> 和 <code>publicMethod<code>。<p><div><h2 id=\"refs-inside-v-for\"><code>v-for<code> 中的模板引用 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#refs-inside-v-for\">​<a><h2><blockquote><p>需要 v3.5 及以上版本<p><blockquote><div class=\"composition-api\"><p>当在 <code>v-for<code> 中使用模板引用时，对应的 ref 中包含的值是一个数组，它将在元素被挂载后包含对应整个列表的所有元素：<p><div class=\"language-vue\"> <span class=\"lang\">vue<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>script<span><span> setup<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/template-refs.html", "title": "模板引用", "doc_id": "a467167aa6b74f81a670ed911b8b89d6", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 925, "chunk_index": 38, "_doc_id": "38_7484938618139072895"}}
{"doc_id": "39_3903938335479349421", "text": "code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>script<span><span> setup<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>import<span><span> { ref, useTemplateRef, onMounted } <span><span>from<span><span> 'vue'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> list<span><span> =<span><span> ref<span><span>([<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> /* ... */<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>])<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/template-refs.html", "title": "模板引用", "doc_id": "a467167aa6b74f81a670ed911b8b89d6", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 925, "chunk_index": 39, "_doc_id": "39_3903938335479349421"}}
{"doc_id": "40_3519094215605743630", "text": "ine\"><span> /* ... */<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>])<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> itemRefs<span><span> =<span><span> useTemplateRef<span><span>(<span><span>'items'<span><span>)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>onMounted<span><span>(() <span><span>=><span><span> console.<span><span>log<span><span>(itemRefs.value))<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>script<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/template-refs.html", "title": "模板引用", "doc_id": "a467167aa6b74f81a670ed911b8b89d6", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 925, "chunk_index": 40, "_doc_id": "40_3519094215605743630"}}
