{"doc_id": "44_4304194284003533596", "text": "byEuHZ+wvt6Ays9TJIYl8A5+i0DHHGjvYQ1JLGPuOlaR/TpRFqvXCzHR2BO5iKg0Zmm/ic0W2ZXrB+Gve2uEt1dJKs/QXbwePE\" target=\"_blank\">在演练场中尝试一下<a><p> 3.5 前的用法 <p>在 3.5 版本以前，<code>useTemplateRef()<code> 尚未引入，需要声明一个与模板引用 attribute 同名的 ref。该 ref 的值需要是一个数组。<p><div class=\"language-vue\"> <span class=\"lang\">vue<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>script<span><span> setup<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/template-refs.html", "title": "模板引用", "doc_id": "a467167aa6b74f81a670ed911b8b89d6", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 925, "chunk_index": 44, "_doc_id": "44_4304194284003533596"}}
