{"doc_id": "52_265968043857177190", "text": "n>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>script<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>ul<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>li<span><span> v-for<span><span>=<span><span>\"item in list\"<span><span> ref<span><span>=<span><span>\"items\"<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> {{ item }}<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/template-refs.html", "title": "模板引用", "doc_id": "a467167aa6b74f81a670ed911b8b89d6", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 925, "chunk_index": 52, "_doc_id": "52_265968043857177190"}}
{"doc_id": "53_8087377693721382942", "text": "span>=<span><span>\"items\"<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> {{ item }}<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> </<span><span>li<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> </<span><span>ul<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/template-refs.html", "title": "模板引用", "doc_id": "a467167aa6b74f81a670ed911b8b89d6", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 925, "chunk_index": 53, "_doc_id": "53_8087377693721382942"}}
{"doc_id": "54_1405660041175631961", "text": "pan>li<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> </<span><span>ul<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p><a href=\"https://play.vuejs.org/#eNpFjk0KwjAQha/yCC4Uaou6kyp4DuOi2KkGYhKSiQildzdNa4WQmTc/37xeXJwr35HEUdTh7pXjszT0cdYzWuqaqBm9NEDbcLPeTDngiaM3PwVoFfiI667AvsDhNpWHMQzF+L9sNEztH3C3JlhNpbaPNT9VKFeeulAqplfY5D1p0qurxVQSqel0w5QUUEedY8q0wnvbWX+SYgRAmWxIiuSzm4tBinkc6HvkuSE7TIBKq4lZZWhdLZfE8AWp4l3T\" target=\"_blank\">在演练场中尝试一下<a><p><div><p>应该注意的是，ref 数组<strong>并不<strong>保证与源数组相同的顺序。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/template-refs.html", "title": "模板引用", "doc_id": "a467167aa6b74f81a670ed911b8b89d6", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 925, "chunk_index": 54, "_doc_id": "54_1405660041175631961"}}
{"doc_id": "55_2727669934334012265", "text": "ZWhdLZfE8AWp4l3T\" target=\"_blank\">在演练场中尝试一下<a><p><div><p>应该注意的是，ref 数组<strong>并不<strong>保证与源数组相同的顺序。<p><h2 id=\"function-refs\">函数模板引用 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#function-refs\">​<a><h2><p>除了使用字符串值作名字，<code>ref<code> attribute 还可以绑定为一个函数，会在每次组件更新时都被调用。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/template-refs.html", "title": "模板引用", "doc_id": "a467167aa6b74f81a670ed911b8b89d6", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 925, "chunk_index": 55, "_doc_id": "55_2727669934334012265"}}
{"doc_id": "56_1638871132634877798", "text": "or\" href=\"#function-refs\">​<a><h2><p>除了使用字符串值作名字，<code>ref<code> attribute 还可以绑定为一个函数，会在每次组件更新时都被调用。该函数会收到元素引用作为其第一个参数：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>input<span><span> :<span><span>ref<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>(<span><span>el<span><span>) <span><span>=><span><span> { <span><span>/* 将 el 赋值给一个数据属性或 ref 变量 */<span><span> }<span><span>\"<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>注意我们这里需要使用动态的 <code>:ref<code> 绑定才能够传入一个函数。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/template-refs.html", "title": "模板引用", "doc_id": "a467167aa6b74f81a670ed911b8b89d6", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 925, "chunk_index": 56, "_doc_id": "56_1638871132634877798"}}
{"doc_id": "57_47437118997647339", "text": "<span><span>\"<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>注意我们这里需要使用动态的 <code>:ref<code> 绑定才能够传入一个函数。当绑定的元素被卸载时，函数也会被调用一次，此时的 <code>el<code> 参数会是 <code>null<code>。你当然也可以绑定一个组件方法而不是内联函数。<p><div><div>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/template-refs.html", "title": "模板引用", "doc_id": "a467167aa6b74f81a670ed911b8b89d6", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 925, "chunk_index": 57, "_doc_id": "57_47437118997647339"}}
{"doc_id": "0_1969936741880072315", "text": "<div><div><h1 id=\"async-components\">异步组件 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#async-components\">​<a><h1><h2 id=\"basic-usage\">基本用法 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#basic-usage\">​<a><h2><p>在大型项目中，我们可能需要拆分应用为更小的块，并仅在需要时再从服务器加载相关组件。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/async.html", "title": "异步组件", "doc_id": "87ad2787ccf748b0a72b2abecc2b95a3", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 580, "chunk_index": 0, "_doc_id": "0_1969936741880072315"}}
{"doc_id": "1_984807678331797409", "text": "用法 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#basic-usage\">​<a><h2><p>在大型项目中，我们可能需要拆分应用为更小的块，并仅在需要时再从服务器加载相关组件。Vue 提供了 <a href=\"/api/general.html#defineasynccomponent\"><code>defineAsyncComponent<code><a> 方法来实现此功能：<p><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>import<span><span> { defineAsyncComponent } <span><span>from<span><span> 'vue'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/async.html", "title": "异步组件", "doc_id": "87ad2787ccf748b0a72b2abecc2b95a3", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 580, "chunk_index": 1, "_doc_id": "1_984807678331797409"}}
{"doc_id": "2_6238201894731450304", "text": "> { defineAsyncComponent } <span><span>from<span><span> 'vue'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> AsyncComp<span><span> =<span><span> defineAsyncComponent<span><span>(() <span><span>=><span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> return<span><span> new<span><span> Promise<span><span>((<span><span>resolve<span><span>, <span><span>reject<span><span>) <span><span>=><span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // ...从服务器获取组件<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/async.html", "title": "异步组件", "doc_id": "87ad2787ccf748b0a72b2abecc2b95a3", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 580, "chunk_index": 2, "_doc_id": "2_6238201894731450304"}}
{"doc_id": "3_1806788844694558208", "text": "pan>) <span><span>=><span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // ...从服务器获取组件<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> resolve<span><span>(<span><span>/* 获取到的组件 */<span><span>)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> })<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>})<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// ... 像使用其他一般组件一样使用 `AsyncComp`<span><span><code><pre><div><p>如你所见，<code>defineAsyncComponent<code> 方法接收一个返回 Promise 的加载函数。这个 Promise 的 <code>resolve<code> 回调方法应该在从服务器获得组件定义时调用。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/async.html", "title": "异步组件", "doc_id": "87ad2787ccf748b0a72b2abecc2b95a3", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 580, "chunk_index": 3, "_doc_id": "3_1806788844694558208"}}
{"doc_id": "4_8069452222285977201", "text": "neAsyncComponent<code> 方法接收一个返回 Promise 的加载函数。这个 Promise 的 <code>resolve<code> 回调方法应该在从服务器获得组件定义时调用。你也可以调用 <code>reject(reason)<code> 表明加载失败。<p><p><a href=\"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/JavaScript/Reference/Operators/import\" target=\"_blank\">ES 模块动态导入<a>也会返回一个 Promise，所以多数情况下我们会将它和 <code>defineAsyncComponent<code> 搭配使用。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/async.html", "title": "异步组件", "doc_id": "87ad2787ccf748b0a72b2abecc2b95a3", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 580, "chunk_index": 4, "_doc_id": "4_8069452222285977201"}}
{"doc_id": "5_6671841207802540603", "text": "ort\" target=\"_blank\">ES 模块动态导入<a>也会返回一个 Promise，所以多数情况下我们会将它和 <code>defineAsyncComponent<code> 搭配使用。类似 Vite 和 Webpack 这样的构建工具也支持此语法 (并且会将它们作为打包时的代码分割点)，因此我们也可以用它来导入 Vue 单文件组件：<p><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>import<span><span> { defineAsyncComponent } <span><span>from<span><span> 'vue'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/async.html", "title": "异步组件", "doc_id": "87ad2787ccf748b0a72b2abecc2b95a3", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 580, "chunk_index": 5, "_doc_id": "5_6671841207802540603"}}
{"doc_id": "6_6592429422233407430", "text": "> { defineAsyncComponent } <span><span>from<span><span> 'vue'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> AsyncComp<span><span> =<span><span> defineAsyncComponent<span><span>(() <span><span>=><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> import<span><span>(<span><span>'./components/MyComponent.vue'<span><span>)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>)<span><span><code><pre><div><p>最后得到的 <code>AsyncComp<code> 是一个外层包装过的组件，仅在页面需要它渲染时才会调用加载内部实际组件的函数。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/async.html", "title": "异步组件", "doc_id": "87ad2787ccf748b0a72b2abecc2b95a3", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 580, "chunk_index": 6, "_doc_id": "6_6592429422233407430"}}
{"doc_id": "7_5611824015759879734", "text": "n>)<span><span><code><pre><div><p>最后得到的 <code>AsyncComp<code> 是一个外层包装过的组件，仅在页面需要它渲染时才会调用加载内部实际组件的函数。它会将接收到的 props 和插槽传给内部组件，所以你可以使用这个异步的包装组件无缝地替换原始组件，同时实现延迟加载。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/async.html", "title": "异步组件", "doc_id": "87ad2787ccf748b0a72b2abecc2b95a3", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 580, "chunk_index": 7, "_doc_id": "7_5611824015759879734"}}
{"doc_id": "8_5162095910960041318", "text": "e> 是一个外层包装过的组件，仅在页面需要它渲染时才会调用加载内部实际组件的函数。它会将接收到的 props 和插槽传给内部组件，所以你可以使用这个异步的包装组件无缝地替换原始组件，同时实现延迟加载。<p><p>与普通组件一样，异步组件可以使用 <code>app.component()<code> <a href=\"/guide/components/registration.html#global-registration\">全局注册<a>：<p><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>app.<span><span>component<span><span>(<span><span>'MyComponent'<span><span>, <span><span>defineAsyncComponent<span><span>(() <span><span>=><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/async.html", "title": "异步组件", "doc_id": "87ad2787ccf748b0a72b2abecc2b95a3", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 580, "chunk_index": 8, "_doc_id": "8_5162095910960041318"}}
{"doc_id": "9_546855582751972947", "text": "yComponent'<span><span>, <span><span>defineAsyncComponent<span><span>(() <span><span>=><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> import<span><span>(<span><span>'./components/MyComponent.vue'<span><span>)<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/async.html", "title": "异步组件", "doc_id": "87ad2787ccf748b0a72b2abecc2b95a3", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 580, "chunk_index": 9, "_doc_id": "9_546855582751972947"}}
{"doc_id": "10_316867596798766012", "text": "line\"><span> import<span><span>(<span><span>'./components/MyComponent.vue'<span><span>)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>))<span><span><code><pre><div><div class=\"options-api\"><p>你也可以在<a href=\"/guide/components/registration.html#local-registration\">局部注册组件<a>时使用 <code>defineAsyncComponent<code>：<p><div class=\"language-vue\"> <span class=\"lang\">vue<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>script<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/async.html", "title": "异步组件", "doc_id": "87ad2787ccf748b0a72b2abecc2b95a3", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 580, "chunk_index": 10, "_doc_id": "10_316867596798766012"}}
{"doc_id": "11_7549813908242681584", "text": "ki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>script<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>import<span><span> { defineAsyncComponent } <span><span>from<span><span> 'vue'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> components: {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> AdminPage: <span><span>defineAsyncComponent<span><span>(() <span><span>=><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/async.html", "title": "异步组件", "doc_id": "87ad2787ccf748b0a72b2abecc2b95a3", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 580, "chunk_index": 11, "_doc_id": "11_7549813908242681584"}}
{"doc_id": "12_4184945416539855455", "text": "\"line\"><span> AdminPage: <span><span>defineAsyncComponent<span><span>(() <span><span>=><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> import<span><span>(<span><span>'./components/AdminPageComponent.vue'<span><span>)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> )<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>script<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/async.html", "title": "异步组件", "doc_id": "87ad2787ccf748b0a72b2abecc2b95a3", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 580, "chunk_index": 12, "_doc_id": "12_4184945416539855455"}}
{"doc_id": "13_3256889195307910329", "text": ">\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>AdminPage<span><span> /><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><div><div class=\"composition-api\"><p>也可以直接在父组件中定义它们：<p><div class=\"language-vue\"> <span class=\"lang\">vue<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>script<span><span> setup<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/async.html", "title": "异步组件", "doc_id": "87ad2787ccf748b0a72b2abecc2b95a3", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 580, "chunk_index": 13, "_doc_id": "13_3256889195307910329"}}
{"doc_id": "14_1247083694481146005", "text": "code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>script<span><span> setup<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>import<span><span> { defineAsyncComponent } <span><span>from<span><span> 'vue'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> AdminPage<span><span> =<span><span> defineAsyncComponent<span><span>(() <span><span>=><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> import<span><span>(<span><span>'./components/AdminPageComponent.vue'<span><span>)<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/async.html", "title": "异步组件", "doc_id": "87ad2787ccf748b0a72b2abecc2b95a3", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 580, "chunk_index": 14, "_doc_id": "14_1247083694481146005"}}
{"doc_id": "15_3346848428176805625", "text": "span> import<span><span>(<span><span>'./components/AdminPageComponent.vue'<span><span>)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>script<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>AdminPage<span><span> /><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/async.html", "title": "异步组件", "doc_id": "87ad2787ccf748b0a72b2abecc2b95a3", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 580, "chunk_index": 15, "_doc_id": "15_3346848428176805625"}}
{"doc_id": "16_7194985206163469938", "text": "pan><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>AdminPage<span><span> /><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><div><h2 id=\"loading-and-error-states\">加载与错误状态 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#loading-and-error-states\">​<a><h2><p>异步操作不可避免地会涉及到加载和错误状态，因此 <code>defineAsyncComponent()<code> 也支持在高级选项中处理这些状态：<p><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> AsyncComp<span><span> =<span><span> defineAsyncComponent<span><span>({<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/async.html", "title": "异步组件", "doc_id": "87ad2787ccf748b0a72b2abecc2b95a3", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 580, "chunk_index": 16, "_doc_id": "16_7194985206163469938"}}
{"doc_id": "17_1787657044172563312", "text": "onst<span><span> AsyncComp<span><span> =<span><span> defineAsyncComponent<span><span>({<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 加载函数<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> loader<span><span>: () <span><span>=><span><span> import<span><span>(<span><span>'./Foo.vue'<span><span>),<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 加载异步组件时使用的组件<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> loadingComponent: LoadingComponent,<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 展示加载组件前的延迟时间，默认为 200ms<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/async.html", "title": "异步组件", "doc_id": "87ad2787ccf748b0a72b2abecc2b95a3", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 580, "chunk_index": 17, "_doc_id": "17_1787657044172563312"}}
{"doc_id": "18_7099918119423038387", "text": "nent: LoadingComponent,<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 展示加载组件前的延迟时间，默认为 200ms<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> delay: <span><span>200<span><span>,<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 加载失败后展示的组件<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> errorComponent: ErrorComponent,<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 如果提供了一个 timeout 时间限制，并超时了<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 也会显示这里配置的报错组件，默认值是：Infinity<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/async.html", "title": "异步组件", "doc_id": "87ad2787ccf748b0a72b2abecc2b95a3", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 580, "chunk_index": 18, "_doc_id": "18_7099918119423038387"}}
{"doc_id": "19_4631692882998379268", "text": "timeout 时间限制，并超时了<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 也会显示这里配置的报错组件，默认值是：Infinity<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> timeout: <span><span>3000<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>})<span><span><code><pre><div><p>如果提供了一个加载组件，它将在内部组件加载时先行显示。在加载组件显示之前有一个默认的 200ms 延迟——这是因为在网络状况较好时，加载完成得很快，加载组件和最终组件之间的替换太快可能产生闪烁，反而影响用户感受。<p><p>如果提供了一个报错组件，则它会在加载器函数返回的 Promise 抛错时被渲染。你还可以指定一个超时时间，在请求耗时超过指定时间时也会渲染报错组件。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/async.html", "title": "异步组件", "doc_id": "87ad2787ccf748b0a72b2abecc2b95a3", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 580, "chunk_index": 19, "_doc_id": "19_4631692882998379268"}}
{"doc_id": "20_2321041359925837916", "text": "替换太快可能产生闪烁，反而影响用户感受。<p><p>如果提供了一个报错组件，则它会在加载器函数返回的 Promise 抛错时被渲染。你还可以指定一个超时时间，在请求耗时超过指定时间时也会渲染报错组件。<p><h2 id=\"lazy-hydration\">惰性激活 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#lazy-hydration\" class=\"vt-badge\">​<a><h2><blockquote><p>如果你正在使用<a href=\"/guide/scaling-up/ssr.html\">服务器端渲染<a>，这一部分才会适用。<p><blockquote><p>在 Vue 3.5+ 中，异步组件可以通过提供激活策略来控制何时进行激活。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/async.html", "title": "异步组件", "doc_id": "87ad2787ccf748b0a72b2abecc2b95a3", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 580, "chunk_index": 20, "_doc_id": "20_2321041359925837916"}}
{"doc_id": "21_6218002547465597392", "text": "uide/scaling-up/ssr.html\">服务器端渲染<a>，这一部分才会适用。<p><blockquote><p>在 Vue 3.5+ 中，异步组件可以通过提供激活策略来控制何时进行激活。<p><h3 id=\"hydrate-on-idle\">在空闲时进行激活 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#hydrate-on-idle\">​<a><h3><p>通过 <code>requestIdleCallback<code> 进行激活：<p><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>import<span><span> { defineAsyncComponent, hydrateOnIdle } <span><span>from<span><span> 'vue'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/async.html", "title": "异步组件", "doc_id": "87ad2787ccf748b0a72b2abecc2b95a3", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 580, "chunk_index": 21, "_doc_id": "21_6218002547465597392"}}
{"doc_id": "22_6389481957173886323", "text": "Component, hydrateOnIdle } <span><span>from<span><span> 'vue'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> AsyncComp<span><span> =<span><span> defineAsyncComponent<span><span>({<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> loader<span><span>: () <span><span>=><span><span> import<span><span>(<span><span>'./Comp.vue'<span><span>),<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> hydrate: <span><span>hydrateOnIdle<span><span>(<span><span>/* 传递可选的最大超时 */<span><span>)<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/async.html", "title": "异步组件", "doc_id": "87ad2787ccf748b0a72b2abecc2b95a3", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 580, "chunk_index": 22, "_doc_id": "22_6389481957173886323"}}
{"doc_id": "23_4813384932142075700", "text": "hydrate: <span><span>hydrateOnIdle<span><span>(<span><span>/* 传递可选的最大超时 */<span><span>)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>})<span><span><code><pre><div><h3 id=\"hydrate-on-visible\">在可见时激活 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#hydrate-on-visible\">​<a><h3><p>通过 <code>IntersectionObserver<code> 在元素变为可见时进行激活。<p><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>import<span><span> { defineAsyncComponent, hydrateOnVisible } <span><span>from<span><span> 'vue'<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/async.html", "title": "异步组件", "doc_id": "87ad2787ccf748b0a72b2abecc2b95a3", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 580, "chunk_index": 23, "_doc_id": "23_4813384932142075700"}}
{"doc_id": "24_8941994296404670678", "text": "an><span> { defineAsyncComponent, hydrateOnVisible } <span><span>from<span><span> 'vue'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> AsyncComp<span><span> =<span><span> defineAsyncComponent<span><span>({<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> loader<span><span>: () <span><span>=><span><span> import<span><span>(<span><span>'./Comp.vue'<span><span>),<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> hydrate: <span><span>hydrateOnVisible<span><span>()<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/async.html", "title": "异步组件", "doc_id": "87ad2787ccf748b0a72b2abecc2b95a3", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 580, "chunk_index": 24, "_doc_id": "24_8941994296404670678"}}
{"doc_id": "25_7184934600613381527", "text": "an><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> hydrate: <span><span>hydrateOnVisible<span><span>()<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>})<span><span><code><pre><div><p>可以选择传递一个侦听器的选项对象值：<p><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>hydrateOnVisible<span><span>({ rootMargin: <span><span>'100px'<span><span> })<span><span><code><pre><div><p>当指定的媒体查询匹配时进行激活。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/async.html", "title": "异步组件", "doc_id": "87ad2787ccf748b0a72b2abecc2b95a3", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 580, "chunk_index": 25, "_doc_id": "25_7184934600613381527"}}
{"doc_id": "26_1690958253585381531", "text": "pan>({ rootMargin: <span><span>'100px'<span><span> })<span><span><code><pre><div><p>当指定的媒体查询匹配时进行激活。<p><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>import<span><span> { defineAsyncComponent, hydrateOnMediaQuery } <span><span>from<span><span> 'vue'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> AsyncComp<span><span> =<span><span> defineAsyncComponent<span><span>({<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/async.html", "title": "异步组件", "doc_id": "87ad2787ccf748b0a72b2abecc2b95a3", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 580, "chunk_index": 26, "_doc_id": "26_1690958253585381531"}}
{"doc_id": "27_8572833992986550340", "text": "onst<span><span> AsyncComp<span><span> =<span><span> defineAsyncComponent<span><span>({<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> loader<span><span>: () <span><span>=><span><span> import<span><span>(<span><span>'./Comp.vue'<span><span>),<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> hydrate: <span><span>hydrateOnMediaQuery<span><span>(<span><span>'(max-width:500px)'<span><span>)<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/async.html", "title": "异步组件", "doc_id": "87ad2787ccf748b0a72b2abecc2b95a3", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 580, "chunk_index": 27, "_doc_id": "27_8572833992986550340"}}
{"doc_id": "28_3519811941850580036", "text": "span><span>hydrateOnMediaQuery<span><span>(<span><span>'(max-width:500px)'<span><span>)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>})<span><span><code><pre><div><h3 id=\"hydrate-on-interaction\">交互时激活 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#hydrate-on-interaction\">​<a><h3><p>当组件元素上触发指定事件时进行激活。完成激活后，触发激活的事件也将被重放。<p><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>import<span><span> { defineAsyncComponent, hydrateOnInteraction } <span><span>from<span><span> 'vue'<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/async.html", "title": "异步组件", "doc_id": "87ad2787ccf748b0a72b2abecc2b95a3", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 580, "chunk_index": 28, "_doc_id": "28_3519811941850580036"}}
{"doc_id": "29_6381053991299095595", "text": "span> { defineAsyncComponent, hydrateOnInteraction } <span><span>from<span><span> 'vue'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> AsyncComp<span><span> =<span><span> defineAsyncComponent<span><span>({<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> loader<span><span>: () <span><span>=><span><span> import<span><span>(<span><span>'./Comp.vue'<span><span>),<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/async.html", "title": "异步组件", "doc_id": "87ad2787ccf748b0a72b2abecc2b95a3", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 580, "chunk_index": 29, "_doc_id": "29_6381053991299095595"}}
{"doc_id": "30_6235223752337554727", "text": "() <span><span>=><span><span> import<span><span>(<span><span>'./Comp.vue'<span><span>),<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> hydrate: <span><span>hydrateOnInteraction<span><span>(<span><span>'click'<span><span>)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>})<span><span><code><pre><div><p>也可以是多个事件类型的列表：<p><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>hydrateOnInteraction<span><span>([<span><span>'wheel'<span><span>,", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/async.html", "title": "异步组件", "doc_id": "87ad2787ccf748b0a72b2abecc2b95a3", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 580, "chunk_index": 30, "_doc_id": "30_6235223752337554727"}}
{"doc_id": "31_1053643826930618168", "text": "\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>hydrateOnInteraction<span><span>([<span><span>'wheel'<span><span>, <span><span>'mouseover'<span><span>])<span><span><code><pre><div><h3 id=\"custom-strategy\">自定义策略 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#custom-strategy\">​<a><h3><div class=\"language-ts\"> <span class=\"lang\">ts<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>import<span><span> { defineAsyncComponent,", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/async.html", "title": "异步组件", "doc_id": "87ad2787ccf748b0a72b2abecc2b95a3", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 580, "chunk_index": 31, "_doc_id": "31_1053643826930618168"}}
{"doc_id": "32_8042071455179106774", "text": "hiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>import<span><span> { defineAsyncComponent, <span><span>type<span><span> HydrationStrategy } <span><span>from<span><span> 'vue'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> myStrategy<span><span>:<span><span> HydrationStrategy<span><span> =<span><span> (<span><span>hydrate<span><span>, <span><span>forEachElement<span><span>) <span><span>=><span><span> {<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/async.html", "title": "异步组件", "doc_id": "87ad2787ccf748b0a72b2abecc2b95a3", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 580, "chunk_index": 32, "_doc_id": "32_8042071455179106774"}}
{"doc_id": "33_301825415560836359", "text": "drate<span><span>, <span><span>forEachElement<span><span>) <span><span>=><span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // forEachElement 是一个遍历组件未激活的 DOM 中所有根元素的辅助函数，<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 因为根元素可能是一个片段而非单个元素<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> forEachElement<span><span>(<span><span>el<span><span> =><span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // ...<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> })<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 准备好时调用 `hydrate`<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/async.html", "title": "异步组件", "doc_id": "87ad2787ccf748b0a72b2abecc2b95a3", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 580, "chunk_index": 33, "_doc_id": "33_301825415560836359"}}
{"doc_id": "34_5657911031742829856", "text": "<span class=\"line\"><span> })<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 准备好时调用 `hydrate`<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> hydrate<span><span>()<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> return<span><span> () <span><span>=><span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 如必要，返回一个销毁函数<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/async.html", "title": "异步组件", "doc_id": "87ad2787ccf748b0a72b2abecc2b95a3", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 580, "chunk_index": 34, "_doc_id": "34_5657911031742829856"}}
{"doc_id": "35_4597116728225034005", "text": "class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> AsyncComp<span><span> =<span><span> defineAsyncComponent<span><span>({<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> loader<span><span>: () <span><span>=><span><span> import<span><span>(<span><span>'./Comp.vue'<span><span>),<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> hydrate: myStrategy<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/async.html", "title": "异步组件", "doc_id": "87ad2787ccf748b0a72b2abecc2b95a3", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 580, "chunk_index": 35, "_doc_id": "35_4597116728225034005"}}
{"doc_id": "36_2395395866444149657", "text": "an>'./Comp.vue'<span><span>),<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> hydrate: myStrategy<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>})<span><span><code><pre><div><h2 id=\"using-with-suspense\">搭配 Suspense 使用 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#using-with-suspense\">​<a><h2><p>异步组件可以搭配内置的 <code><Suspense><code> 组件一起使用，若想了解 <code><Suspense><code> 和异步组件之间交互，请参阅 <a href=\"/guide/built-ins/suspense.html\"><code><Suspense><code><a> 章节。<p><div><div>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/async.html", "title": "异步组件", "doc_id": "87ad2787ccf748b0a72b2abecc2b95a3", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 580, "chunk_index": 36, "_doc_id": "36_2395395866444149657"}}
{"doc_id": "0_2239228992484047734", "text": "<div><div><h1 id=\"component-registration\">组件注册 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#component-registration\">​<a><h1><blockquote><p>此章节假设你已经看过了<a href=\"/guide/essentials/component-basics.html\">组件基础<a>。若你还不了解组件是什么，请先阅读该章节。<p><blockquote><p>一个 Vue 组件在使用前需要先被“注册”，这样 Vue 才能在渲染模板时找到其对应的实现。组件注册有两种方式：全局注册和局部注册。<p><h2 id=\"global-registration\">全局注册 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#global-registration\">​<a><h2><p>我们可以使用 <a href=\"/guide/essentials/application.html\">Vue 应用实例<a>的 <code>.component()<code> 方法，让组件在当前 Vue 应用中全局可用。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/registration.html", "title": "组件注册", "doc_id": "5cec5d777cc34c1c9dc6edc2d0e758b2", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 328, "chunk_index": 0, "_doc_id": "0_2239228992484047734"}}
{"doc_id": "1_18069431095068288", "text": "ef=\"/guide/essentials/application.html\">Vue 应用实例<a>的 <code>.component()<code> 方法，让组件在当前 Vue 应用中全局可用。<p><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>import<span><span> { createApp } <span><span>from<span><span> 'vue'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> app<span><span> =<span><span> createApp<span><span>({})<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/registration.html", "title": "组件注册", "doc_id": "5cec5d777cc34c1c9dc6edc2d0e758b2", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 328, "chunk_index": 1, "_doc_id": "1_18069431095068288"}}
{"doc_id": "2_3480362485467260311", "text": "span> app<span><span> =<span><span> createApp<span><span>({})<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>app.<span><span>component<span><span>(<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 注册的名字<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> 'MyComponent'<span><span>,<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 组件的实现<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> /* ... */<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/registration.html", "title": "组件注册", "doc_id": "5cec5d777cc34c1c9dc6edc2d0e758b2", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 328, "chunk_index": 2, "_doc_id": "2_3480362485467260311"}}
{"doc_id": "3_1975476251979953161", "text": "span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> /* ... */<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>)<span><span><code><pre><div><p>如果使用单文件组件，你可以注册被导入的 <code>.vue<code> 文件：<p><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>import<span><span> MyComponent <span><span>from<span><span> './App.vue'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/registration.html", "title": "组件注册", "doc_id": "5cec5d777cc34c1c9dc6edc2d0e758b2", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 328, "chunk_index": 3, "_doc_id": "3_1975476251979953161"}}
{"doc_id": "4_3661771424110590034", "text": "n><span> MyComponent <span><span>from<span><span> './App.vue'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>app.<span><span>component<span><span>(<span><span>'MyComponent'<span><span>, MyComponent)<span><span><code><pre><div><p><code>.component()<code> 方法可以被链式调用：<p><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>app<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/registration.html", "title": "组件注册", "doc_id": "5cec5d777cc34c1c9dc6edc2d0e758b2", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 328, "chunk_index": 4, "_doc_id": "4_3661771424110590034"}}
{"doc_id": "5_5343692204238314236", "text": "lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>app<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> .<span><span>component<span><span>(<span><span>'ComponentA'<span><span>, ComponentA)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> .<span><span>component<span><span>(<span><span>'ComponentB'<span><span>, ComponentB)<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/registration.html", "title": "组件注册", "doc_id": "5cec5d777cc34c1c9dc6edc2d0e758b2", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 328, "chunk_index": 5, "_doc_id": "5_5343692204238314236"}}
{"doc_id": "6_3426662589542621905", "text": "n> .<span><span>component<span><span>(<span><span>'ComponentB'<span><span>, ComponentB)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> .<span><span>component<span><span>(<span><span>'ComponentC'<span><span>, ComponentC)<span><span><code><pre><div><p>全局注册的组件可以在此应用的任意组件的模板中使用：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><!-- 这在当前应用的任意组件中都可用 --><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/registration.html", "title": "组件注册", "doc_id": "5cec5d777cc34c1c9dc6edc2d0e758b2", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 328, "chunk_index": 6, "_doc_id": "6_3426662589542621905"}}
{"doc_id": "7_2563488028626611498", "text": "ass=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><!-- 这在当前应用的任意组件中都可用 --><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>ComponentA<span><span>/><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>ComponentB<span><span>/><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>ComponentC<span><span>/><span><span><code><pre><div><p>所有的子组件也可以使用全局注册的组件，这意味着这三个组件也都可以在<em>彼此内部<em>使用。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/registration.html", "title": "组件注册", "doc_id": "5cec5d777cc34c1c9dc6edc2d0e758b2", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 328, "chunk_index": 7, "_doc_id": "7_2563488028626611498"}}
{"doc_id": "8_3076847348273302462", "text": "ponentC<span><span>/><span><span><code><pre><div><p>所有的子组件也可以使用全局注册的组件，这意味着这三个组件也都可以在<em>彼此内部<em>使用。<p><h2 id=\"local-registration\">局部注册 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#local-registration\">​<a><h2><p>全局注册虽然很方便，但有以下几个问题：<p><ol><li><p>全局注册，但并没有被使用的组件无法在生产打包时被自动移除 (也叫“tree-shaking”)。如果你全局注册了一个组件，即使它并没有被实际使用，它仍然会出现在打包后的 JS 文件中。<p><li><li><p>全局注册在大型项目中使项目的依赖关系变得不那么明确。在父组件中使用子组件时，不太容易定位子组件的实现。和使用过多的全局变量一样，这可能会影响应用长期的可维护性。<p><li><ol><p>相比之下，局部注册的组件需要在使用它的父组件中显式导入，并且只能在该父组件中使用。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/registration.html", "title": "组件注册", "doc_id": "5cec5d777cc34c1c9dc6edc2d0e758b2", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 328, "chunk_index": 8, "_doc_id": "8_3076847348273302462"}}
{"doc_id": "9_2481032955495198935", "text": "件时，不太容易定位子组件的实现。和使用过多的全局变量一样，这可能会影响应用长期的可维护性。<p><li><ol><p>相比之下，局部注册的组件需要在使用它的父组件中显式导入，并且只能在该父组件中使用。它的优点是使组件之间的依赖关系更加明确，并且对 tree-shaking 更加友好。<p><div class=\"composition-api\"><p>在使用 <code><script setup><code> 的单文件组件中，导入的组件可以直接在模板中使用，无需注册：<p><div class=\"language-vue\"> <span class=\"lang\">vue<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>script<span><span> setup<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/registration.html", "title": "组件注册", "doc_id": "5cec5d777cc34c1c9dc6edc2d0e758b2", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 328, "chunk_index": 9, "_doc_id": "9_2481032955495198935"}}
{"doc_id": "10_710777954203186984", "text": "code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>script<span><span> setup<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>import<span><span> ComponentA <span><span>from<span><span> './ComponentA.vue'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>script<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>ComponentA<span><span> /><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/registration.html", "title": "组件注册", "doc_id": "5cec5d777cc34c1c9dc6edc2d0e758b2", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 328, "chunk_index": 10, "_doc_id": "10_710777954203186984"}}
{"doc_id": "11_3949554194201488819", "text": "an><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>ComponentA<span><span> /><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>如果没有使用 <code><script setup><code>，则需要使用 <code>components<code> 选项来显式注册：<p><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>import<span><span> ComponentA <span><span>from<span><span> './ComponentA.js'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/registration.html", "title": "组件注册", "doc_id": "5cec5d777cc34c1c9dc6edc2d0e758b2", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 328, "chunk_index": 11, "_doc_id": "11_3949554194201488819"}}
{"doc_id": "12_2546067945202640631", "text": "an> ComponentA <span><span>from<span><span> './ComponentA.js'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> components: {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> ComponentA<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> },<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> setup<span><span>() {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // ...<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/registration.html", "title": "组件注册", "doc_id": "5cec5d777cc34c1c9dc6edc2d0e758b2", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 328, "chunk_index": 12, "_doc_id": "12_2546067945202640631"}}
{"doc_id": "13_494581805575123986", "text": "{<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // ...<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span><code><pre><div><div><div class=\"options-api\"><p>局部注册需要使用 <code>components<code> 选项：<p><div class=\"language-vue\"> <span class=\"lang\">vue<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>script<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>import<span><span> ComponentA <span><span>from<span><span> './ComponentA.vue'<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/registration.html", "title": "组件注册", "doc_id": "5cec5d777cc34c1c9dc6edc2d0e758b2", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 328, "chunk_index": 13, "_doc_id": "13_494581805575123986"}}
{"doc_id": "14_3501886349879127989", "text": "ne\"><span>import<span><span> ComponentA <span><span>from<span><span> './ComponentA.vue'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> components: {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> ComponentA<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>script<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/registration.html", "title": "组件注册", "doc_id": "5cec5d777cc34c1c9dc6edc2d0e758b2", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 328, "chunk_index": 14, "_doc_id": "14_3501886349879127989"}}
{"doc_id": "15_2707773816189966078", "text": "n>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>script<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>ComponentA<span><span> /><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/registration.html", "title": "组件注册", "doc_id": "5cec5d777cc34c1c9dc6edc2d0e758b2", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 328, "chunk_index": 15, "_doc_id": "15_2707773816189966078"}}
{"doc_id": "16_5734202013123315706", "text": "an><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>ComponentA<span><span> /><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><div><p>对于每个 <code>components<code> 对象里的属性，它们的 key 名就是注册的组件名，而值就是相应组件的实现。上面的例子中使用的是 ES2015 的缩写语法，等价于：<p><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/registration.html", "title": "组件注册", "doc_id": "5cec5d777cc34c1c9dc6edc2d0e758b2", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 328, "chunk_index": 16, "_doc_id": "16_5734202013123315706"}}
{"doc_id": "17_8304087341481418758", "text": "b-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> components: {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> ComponentA: ComponentA<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // ...<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span><code><pre><div><p>请注意：<strong>局部注册的组件在后代组件中<i>不<i>可用<strong>。在这个例子中，<code>ComponentA<code> 注册后仅在当前组件可用，而在任何的子组件或更深层的子组件中都不可用。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/registration.html", "title": "组件注册", "doc_id": "5cec5d777cc34c1c9dc6edc2d0e758b2", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 328, "chunk_index": 17, "_doc_id": "17_8304087341481418758"}}
{"doc_id": "18_4860453493985931268", "text": "rong>局部注册的组件在后代组件中<i>不<i>可用<strong>。在这个例子中，<code>ComponentA<code> 注册后仅在当前组件可用，而在任何的子组件或更深层的子组件中都不可用。<p><h2 id=\"component-name-casing\">组件名格式 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#component-name-casing\">​<a><h2><p>在整个指引中，我们都使用 PascalCase 作为组件名的注册格式，这是因为：<p><ol><li><p>PascalCase 是合法的 JavaScript 标识符。这使得在 JavaScript 中导入和注册组件都很容易，同时 IDE 也能提供较好的自动补全。<p><li><li><p><code><PascalCase /><code> 在模板中更明显地表明了这是一个 Vue 组件，而不是原生 HTML 元素。同时也能够将 Vue 组件和自定义元素 (web components) 区分开来。<p><li><ol><p>在单文件组件和内联字符串模板中，我们都推荐这样做。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/registration.html", "title": "组件注册", "doc_id": "5cec5d777cc34c1c9dc6edc2d0e758b2", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 328, "chunk_index": 18, "_doc_id": "18_4860453493985931268"}}
{"doc_id": "19_3827768307960617511", "text": "e 组件，而不是原生 HTML 元素。同时也能够将 Vue 组件和自定义元素 (web components) 区分开来。<p><li><ol><p>在单文件组件和内联字符串模板中，我们都推荐这样做。但是，PascalCase 的标签名在 DOM 内模板中是不可用的，详情参见 <a href=\"/guide/essentials/component-basics.html#in-dom-template-parsing-caveats\">DOM 内模板解析注意事项<a>。<p><p>为了方便，Vue 支持将模板中使用 kebab-case 的标签解析为使用 PascalCase 注册的组件。这意味着一个以 <code>MyComponent<code> 为名注册的组件，在模板 (或由 Vue 渲染的 HTML 元素) 中可以通过 <code><MyComponent><code> 或 <code><my-component><code> 引用。这让我们能够使用同样的 JavaScript 组件注册代码来配合不同来源的模板。<p><div><div>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/registration.html", "title": "组件注册", "doc_id": "5cec5d777cc34c1c9dc6edc2d0e758b2", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 328, "chunk_index": 19, "_doc_id": "19_3827768307960617511"}}
{"doc_id": "0_3713259517114822140", "text": "<div><div><h1 id=\"components-basics\">组件基础 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#components-basics\">​<a><h1><p>组件允许我们将 UI 划分为独立的、可重用的部分，并且可以对每个部分进行单独的思考。在实际应用中，组件常常被组织成一个层层嵌套的树状结构：<p><p> <p><p>这和我们嵌套 HTML 元素的方式类似，Vue 实现了自己的组件模型，使我们可以在每个组件内封装自定义内容与逻辑。Vue 同样也能很好地配合原生 Web Component。如果你想知道 Vue 组件与原生 Web Components 之间的关系，可以<a href=\"/guide/extras/web-components.html\">阅读此章节<a>。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/component-basics.html", "title": "组件基础", "doc_id": "402155331bb14b77b7e0b3b9ce28c09f", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1435, "chunk_index": 0, "_doc_id": "0_3713259517114822140"}}
{"doc_id": "1_6284815017684631539", "text": "ponent。如果你想知道 Vue 组件与原生 Web Components 之间的关系，可以<a href=\"/guide/extras/web-components.html\">阅读此章节<a>。<p><h2 id=\"defining-a-component\">定义一个组件 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#defining-a-component\">​<a><h2><p>当使用构建步骤时，我们一般会将 Vue 组件定义在一个单独的 <code>.vue<code> 文件中，这被叫做<a href=\"/guide/scaling-up/sfc.html\">单文件组件<a> (简称 SFC)：<p><div class=\"options-api\"><div class=\"language-vue\"> <span class=\"lang\">vue<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>script<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/component-basics.html", "title": "组件基础", "doc_id": "402155331bb14b77b7e0b3b9ce28c09f", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1435, "chunk_index": 1, "_doc_id": "1_6284815017684631539"}}
{"doc_id": "2_4617379097410737872", "text": "ki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>script<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> data<span><span>() {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> return<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> count: <span><span>0<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/component-basics.html", "title": "组件基础", "doc_id": "402155331bb14b77b7e0b3b9ce28c09f", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1435, "chunk_index": 2, "_doc_id": "2_4617379097410737872"}}
{"doc_id": "3_3129532914414393979", "text": "<span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>script<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>button<span><span> @click<span><span>=<span><span>\"count++\"<span><span>>You clicked me {{ count }} times.</<span><span>button<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/component-basics.html", "title": "组件基础", "doc_id": "402155331bb14b77b7e0b3b9ce28c09f", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1435, "chunk_index": 3, "_doc_id": "3_3129532914414393979"}}
{"doc_id": "4_4259816410561271182", "text": "count++\"<span><span>>You clicked me {{ count }} times.</<span><span>button<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><div><div class=\"composition-api\"><div class=\"language-vue\"> <span class=\"lang\">vue<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>script<span><span> setup<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>import<span><span> { ref } <span><span>from<span><span> 'vue'<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/component-basics.html", "title": "组件基础", "doc_id": "402155331bb14b77b7e0b3b9ce28c09f", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1435, "chunk_index": 4, "_doc_id": "4_4259816410561271182"}}
{"doc_id": "5_8816981913887874702", "text": "<span class=\"line\"><span>import<span><span> { ref } <span><span>from<span><span> 'vue'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> count<span><span> =<span><span> ref<span><span>(<span><span>0<span><span>)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>script<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/component-basics.html", "title": "组件基础", "doc_id": "402155331bb14b77b7e0b3b9ce28c09f", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1435, "chunk_index": 5, "_doc_id": "5_8816981913887874702"}}
{"doc_id": "6_1191324694857929144", "text": ">\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>button<span><span> @click<span><span>=<span><span>\"count++\"<span><span>>You clicked me {{ count }} times.</<span><span>button<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/component-basics.html", "title": "组件基础", "doc_id": "402155331bb14b77b7e0b3b9ce28c09f", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1435, "chunk_index": 6, "_doc_id": "6_1191324694857929144"}}
{"doc_id": "7_5933427822755982883", "text": "count++\"<span><span>>You clicked me {{ count }} times.</<span><span>button<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><div><p>当不使用构建步骤时，一个 Vue 组件以一个包含 Vue 特定选项的 JavaScript 对象来定义：<p><div class=\"options-api\"><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> data<span><span>() {<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/component-basics.html", "title": "组件基础", "doc_id": "402155331bb14b77b7e0b3b9ce28c09f", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1435, "chunk_index": 7, "_doc_id": "7_5933427822755982883"}}
{"doc_id": "8_4063953995865814007", "text": "<span> default<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> data<span><span>() {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> return<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> count: <span><span>0<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> },<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> template: <span><span>`<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <button @click=\"count++\"><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> You clicked me {{ count }} times.<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/component-basics.html", "title": "组件基础", "doc_id": "402155331bb14b77b7e0b3b9ce28c09f", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1435, "chunk_index": 8, "_doc_id": "8_4063953995865814007"}}
{"doc_id": "9_7056088093854843241", "text": "lick=\"count++\"><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> You clicked me {{ count }} times.<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> </button>`<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span><code><pre><div><div><div class=\"composition-api\"><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>import<span><span> { ref } <span><span>from<span><span> 'vue'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/component-basics.html", "title": "组件基础", "doc_id": "402155331bb14b77b7e0b3b9ce28c09f", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1435, "chunk_index": 9, "_doc_id": "9_7056088093854843241"}}
{"doc_id": "10_3773177717714026811", "text": "import<span><span> { ref } <span><span>from<span><span> 'vue'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> setup<span><span>() {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> const<span><span> count<span><span> =<span><span> ref<span><span>(<span><span>0<span><span>)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> return<span><span> { count }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> },<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/component-basics.html", "title": "组件基础", "doc_id": "402155331bb14b77b7e0b3b9ce28c09f", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1435, "chunk_index": 10, "_doc_id": "10_3773177717714026811"}}
{"doc_id": "11_4664258254777225551", "text": "ass=\"line\"><span> return<span><span> { count }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> },<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> template: <span><span>`<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <button @click=\"count++\"><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> You clicked me {{ count }} times.<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> </button>`<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 也可以针对一个 DOM 内联模板：<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // template: '#my-template-element'<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/component-basics.html", "title": "组件基础", "doc_id": "402155331bb14b77b7e0b3b9ce28c09f", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1435, "chunk_index": 11, "_doc_id": "11_4664258254777225551"}}
{"doc_id": "12_7039703080006858912", "text": "对一个 DOM 内联模板：<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // template: '#my-template-element'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span><code><pre><div><div><p>这里的模板是一个内联的 JavaScript 字符串，Vue 将会在运行时编译它。你也可以使用 ID 选择器来指向一个元素 (通常是原生的 <code><template><code> 元素)，Vue 将会使用其内容作为模板来源。<p><p>上面的例子中定义了一个组件，并在一个 <code>.js<code> 文件里默认导出了它自己，但你也可以通过具名导出在一个文件中导出多个组件。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/component-basics.html", "title": "组件基础", "doc_id": "402155331bb14b77b7e0b3b9ce28c09f", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1435, "chunk_index": 12, "_doc_id": "12_7039703080006858912"}}
{"doc_id": "13_2662119555982128925", "text": "元素)，Vue 将会使用其内容作为模板来源。<p><p>上面的例子中定义了一个组件，并在一个 <code>.js<code> 文件里默认导出了它自己，但你也可以通过具名导出在一个文件中导出多个组件。<p><h2 id=\"using-a-component\">使用组件 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#using-a-component\">​<a><h2><div class=\"tip custom-block\"><p class=\"custom-block-title\">TIP<p><p>我们会在接下来的指引中使用单文件组件语法，无论你是否使用构建步骤，组件相关的概念都是相同的。<a href=\"/examples/\">示例<a>一节中展示了两种场景中的组件使用情况。<p><div><p>要使用一个子组件，我们需要在父组件中导入它。假设我们把计数器组件放在了一个叫做 <code>ButtonCounter.vue<code> 的文件中，这个组件将会以默认导出的形式被暴露给外部。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/component-basics.html", "title": "组件基础", "doc_id": "402155331bb14b77b7e0b3b9ce28c09f", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1435, "chunk_index": 13, "_doc_id": "13_2662119555982128925"}}
{"doc_id": "14_4141765333058076843", "text": "><p>要使用一个子组件，我们需要在父组件中导入它。假设我们把计数器组件放在了一个叫做 <code>ButtonCounter.vue<code> 的文件中，这个组件将会以默认导出的形式被暴露给外部。<p><div class=\"options-api\"><div class=\"language-vue\"> <span class=\"lang\">vue<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>script<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>import<span><span> ButtonCounter <span><span>from<span><span> './ButtonCounter.vue'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/component-basics.html", "title": "组件基础", "doc_id": "402155331bb14b77b7e0b3b9ce28c09f", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1435, "chunk_index": 14, "_doc_id": "14_4141765333058076843"}}
{"doc_id": "15_419600292116660626", "text": "tonCounter <span><span>from<span><span> './ButtonCounter.vue'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> components: {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> ButtonCounter<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>script<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/component-basics.html", "title": "组件基础", "doc_id": "402155331bb14b77b7e0b3b9ce28c09f", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1435, "chunk_index": 15, "_doc_id": "15_419600292116660626"}}
{"doc_id": "16_7022152230913962120", "text": "n>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>script<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>h1<span><span>>Here is a child component!</<span><span>h1<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>ButtonCounter<span><span> /><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/component-basics.html", "title": "组件基础", "doc_id": "402155331bb14b77b7e0b3b9ce28c09f", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1435, "chunk_index": 16, "_doc_id": "16_7022152230913962120"}}
{"doc_id": "17_1907070346582364381", "text": "<span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>ButtonCounter<span><span> /><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>若要将导入的组件暴露给模板，我们需要在 <code>components<code> 选项上<a href=\"/guide/components/registration.html\">注册<a>它。这个组件将会以其注册时的名字作为模板中的标签名。<p><div><div class=\"composition-api\"><div class=\"language-vue\"> <span class=\"lang\">vue<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>script<span><span> setup<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/component-basics.html", "title": "组件基础", "doc_id": "402155331bb14b77b7e0b3b9ce28c09f", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1435, "chunk_index": 17, "_doc_id": "17_1907070346582364381"}}
{"doc_id": "18_4193899361286922782", "text": "code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>script<span><span> setup<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>import<span><span> ButtonCounter <span><span>from<span><span> './ButtonCounter.vue'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>script<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>h1<span><span>>Here is a child component!</<span><span>h1<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/component-basics.html", "title": "组件基础", "doc_id": "402155331bb14b77b7e0b3b9ce28c09f", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1435, "chunk_index": 18, "_doc_id": "18_4193899361286922782"}}
{"doc_id": "19_3865294576953144475", "text": "an> <<span><span>h1<span><span>>Here is a child component!</<span><span>h1<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>ButtonCounter<span><span> /><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>通过 <code><script setup><code>，导入的组件都在模板中直接可用。<p><div><p>当然，你也可以全局地注册一个组件，使得它在当前应用中的任何组件上都可以使用，而不需要额外再导入。关于组件的全局注册和局部注册两种方式的利弊，我们放在了<a href=\"/guide/components/registration.html\">组件注册<a>这一章节中专门讨论。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/component-basics.html", "title": "组件基础", "doc_id": "402155331bb14b77b7e0b3b9ce28c09f", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1435, "chunk_index": 19, "_doc_id": "19_3865294576953144475"}}
{"doc_id": "20_7473601379751430048", "text": "而不需要额外再导入。关于组件的全局注册和局部注册两种方式的利弊，我们放在了<a href=\"/guide/components/registration.html\">组件注册<a>这一章节中专门讨论。<p><p>组件可以被重用任意多次：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>h1<span><span>>Here is a child component!</<span><span>h1<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>ButtonCounter<span><span> /><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>ButtonCounter<span><span> /><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/component-basics.html", "title": "组件基础", "doc_id": "402155331bb14b77b7e0b3b9ce28c09f", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1435, "chunk_index": 20, "_doc_id": "20_7473601379751430048"}}
{"doc_id": "21_7377893093567560848", "text": "span> /><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>ButtonCounter<span><span> /><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>ButtonCounter<span><span> /><span><span><code><pre><div><p>你会注意到，每当点击这些按钮时，每一个组件都维护着自己的状态，是不同的 <code>count<code>。这是因为每当你使用一个组件，就创建了一个新的<strong>实例<strong>。<p><p>在单文件组件中，推荐为子组件使用 <code>PascalCase<code> 的标签名，以此来和原生的 HTML 元素作区分。虽然原生 HTML 标签名是不区分大小写的，但 Vue 单文件组件是可以在编译中区分大小写的。我们也可以使用 <code>/><code> 来关闭一个标签。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/component-basics.html", "title": "组件基础", "doc_id": "402155331bb14b77b7e0b3b9ce28c09f", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1435, "chunk_index": 21, "_doc_id": "21_7377893093567560848"}}
{"doc_id": "22_9010891216010930595", "text": "签名，以此来和原生的 HTML 元素作区分。虽然原生 HTML 标签名是不区分大小写的，但 Vue 单文件组件是可以在编译中区分大小写的。我们也可以使用 <code>/><code> 来关闭一个标签。<p><p>如果你是直接在 DOM 中书写模板 (例如原生 <code><template><code> 元素的内容)，模板的编译需要遵从浏览器中 HTML 的解析行为。在这种情况下，你应该需要使用 <code>kebab-case<code> 形式并显式地关闭这些组件的标签。<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><!-- 如果是在 DOM 中书写该模板 --><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/component-basics.html", "title": "组件基础", "doc_id": "402155331bb14b77b7e0b3b9ce28c09f", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1435, "chunk_index": 22, "_doc_id": "22_9010891216010930595"}}
{"doc_id": "23_4828732774945675342", "text": "ass=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><!-- 如果是在 DOM 中书写该模板 --><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>button-counter<span><span>></<span><span>button-counter<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>button-counter<span><span>></<span><span>button-counter<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/component-basics.html", "title": "组件基础", "doc_id": "402155331bb14b77b7e0b3b9ce28c09f", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1435, "chunk_index": 23, "_doc_id": "23_4828732774945675342"}}
{"doc_id": "24_7804097522884838698", "text": "<span><<span><span>button-counter<span><span>></<span><span>button-counter<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>button-counter<span><span>></<span><span>button-counter<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>请看 <a href=\"#in-dom-template-parsing-caveats\">DOM 内模板解析注意事项<a>了解更多细节。<p><h2 id=\"passing-props\">传递 props <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#passing-props\">​<a><h2><p>如果我们正在构建一个博客，我们可能需要一个表示博客文章的组件。我们希望所有的博客文章分享相同的视觉布局，但有不同的内容。要实现这样的效果自然必须向组件中传递数据，例如每篇文章标题和内容，这就会使用到 props。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/component-basics.html", "title": "组件基础", "doc_id": "402155331bb14b77b7e0b3b9ce28c09f", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1435, "chunk_index": 24, "_doc_id": "24_7804097522884838698"}}
{"doc_id": "25_7273789052243300590", "text": "构建一个博客，我们可能需要一个表示博客文章的组件。我们希望所有的博客文章分享相同的视觉布局，但有不同的内容。要实现这样的效果自然必须向组件中传递数据，例如每篇文章标题和内容，这就会使用到 props。<p><p>Props 是一种特别的 attributes，你可以在组件上声明注册。要传递给博客文章组件一个标题，我们必须在组件的 props 列表上声明它。这里要用到 <span class=\"options-api\"><a href=\"/api/options-state.html#props\"><code>props<code><a> 选项<span><span class=\"composition-api\"><a href=\"/api/sfc-script-setup.", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/component-basics.html", "title": "组件基础", "doc_id": "402155331bb14b77b7e0b3b9ce28c09f", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1435, "chunk_index": 25, "_doc_id": "25_7273789052243300590"}}
{"doc_id": "26_7803946508752830967", "text": "ml#props\"><code>props<code><a> 选项<span><span class=\"composition-api\"><a href=\"/api/sfc-script-setup.html#defineprops-defineemits\"><code>defineProps<code><a> 宏<span>：<p><div class=\"options-api\"><div class=\"vp-code-block-title\"><p class=\"vp-code-block-title-bar\"><span class=\"vp-code-block-title-text\">BlogPost.vue<span><p><div class=\"language-vue\"> <span class=\"lang\">vue<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>script<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/component-basics.html", "title": "组件基础", "doc_id": "402155331bb14b77b7e0b3b9ce28c09f", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1435, "chunk_index": 26, "_doc_id": "26_7803946508752830967"}}
{"doc_id": "27_2185265040857532172", "text": "ki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>script<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> props: [<span><span>'title'<span><span>]<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>script<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/component-basics.html", "title": "组件基础", "doc_id": "402155331bb14b77b7e0b3b9ce28c09f", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1435, "chunk_index": 27, "_doc_id": "27_2185265040857532172"}}
{"doc_id": "28_9108013908168160902", "text": ">\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>h4<span><span>>{{ title }}</<span><span>h4<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><div><p>当一个值被传递给 prop 时，它将成为该组件实例上的一个属性。该属性的值可以像其他组件属性一样，在模板和组件的 <code>this<code> 上下文中访问。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/component-basics.html", "title": "组件基础", "doc_id": "402155331bb14b77b7e0b3b9ce28c09f", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1435, "chunk_index": 28, "_doc_id": "28_9108013908168160902"}}
{"doc_id": "29_415531984362324350", "text": "><pre><div><div><p>当一个值被传递给 prop 时，它将成为该组件实例上的一个属性。该属性的值可以像其他组件属性一样，在模板和组件的 <code>this<code> 上下文中访问。<p><div><div class=\"composition-api\"><div class=\"vp-code-block-title\"><p class=\"vp-code-block-title-bar\"><span class=\"vp-code-block-title-text\">BlogPost.vue<span><p><div class=\"language-vue\"> <span class=\"lang\">vue<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>script<span><span> setup<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/component-basics.html", "title": "组件基础", "doc_id": "402155331bb14b77b7e0b3b9ce28c09f", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1435, "chunk_index": 29, "_doc_id": "29_415531984362324350"}}
{"doc_id": "30_297661772757306367", "text": "code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>script<span><span> setup<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>defineProps<span><span>([<span><span>'title'<span><span>])<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>script<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>h4<span><span>>{{ title }}</<span><span>h4<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/component-basics.html", "title": "组件基础", "doc_id": "402155331bb14b77b7e0b3b9ce28c09f", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1435, "chunk_index": 30, "_doc_id": "30_297661772757306367"}}
{"doc_id": "31_8599394007695676799", "text": "lass=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>h4<span><span>>{{ title }}</<span><span>h4<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><div><p><code>defineProps<code> 是一个仅 <code><script setup><code> 中可用的编译宏命令，并不需要显式地导入。声明的 props 会自动暴露给模板。<code>defineProps<code> 会返回一个对象，其中包含了可以传递给组件的所有 props：<p><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> props<span><span> =<span><span> defineProps<span><span>([<span><span>'title'<span><span>])<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/component-basics.html", "title": "组件基础", "doc_id": "402155331bb14b77b7e0b3b9ce28c09f", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1435, "chunk_index": 31, "_doc_id": "31_8599394007695676799"}}
{"doc_id": "32_8527659523179110117", "text": "ps<span><span> =<span><span> defineProps<span><span>([<span><span>'title'<span><span>])<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>console.<span><span>log<span><span>(props.title)<span><span><code><pre><div><p>TypeScript 用户请参考：<a href=\"/guide/typescript/composition-api.html#typing-component-props\">为组件 props 标注类型<a> <p><p>如果你没有使用 <code><script setup><code>，props 必须以 <code>props<code> 选项的方式声明，props 对象会作为 <code>setup()<code> 函数的第一个参数被传入：<p><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/component-basics.html", "title": "组件基础", "doc_id": "402155331bb14b77b7e0b3b9ce28c09f", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1435, "chunk_index": 32, "_doc_id": "32_8527659523179110117"}}
{"doc_id": "33_8856813710888891957", "text": "b-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> props: [<span><span>'title'<span><span>],<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> setup<span><span>(<span><span>props<span><span>) {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> console.<span><span>log<span><span>(props.title)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/component-basics.html", "title": "组件基础", "doc_id": "402155331bb14b77b7e0b3b9ce28c09f", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1435, "chunk_index": 33, "_doc_id": "33_8856813710888891957"}}
{"doc_id": "34_6126711510278272372", "text": "onsole.<span><span>log<span><span>(props.title)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span><code><pre><div><div><p>一个组件可以有任意多的 props，默认情况下，所有 prop 都接受任意类型的值。<p><p>当一个 prop 被注册后，可以像这样以自定义 attribute 的形式传递数据给它：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>BlogPost<span><span> title<span><span>=<span><span>\"My journey with Vue\"<span><span> /><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/component-basics.html", "title": "组件基础", "doc_id": "402155331bb14b77b7e0b3b9ce28c09f", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1435, "chunk_index": 34, "_doc_id": "34_6126711510278272372"}}
{"doc_id": "35_1233891982407990411", "text": "BlogPost<span><span> title<span><span>=<span><span>\"My journey with Vue\"<span><span> /><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>BlogPost<span><span> title<span><span>=<span><span>\"Blogging with Vue\"<span><span> /><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/component-basics.html", "title": "组件基础", "doc_id": "402155331bb14b77b7e0b3b9ce28c09f", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1435, "chunk_index": 35, "_doc_id": "35_1233891982407990411"}}
{"doc_id": "36_6705566671977642545", "text": "n>BlogPost<span><span> title<span><span>=<span><span>\"Blogging with Vue\"<span><span> /><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>BlogPost<span><span> title<span><span>=<span><span>\"Why Vue is so fun\"<span><span> /><span><span><code><pre><div><p>在实际应用中，我们可能在父组件中会有如下的一个博客文章数组：<p><div class=\"options-api\"><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/component-basics.html", "title": "组件基础", "doc_id": "402155331bb14b77b7e0b3b9ce28c09f", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1435, "chunk_index": 36, "_doc_id": "36_6705566671977642545"}}
{"doc_id": "37_4368696462873126566", "text": "b-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // ...<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> data<span><span>() {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> return<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> posts: [<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> { id: <span><span>1<span><span>, title: <span><span>'My journey with Vue'<span><span> },<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/component-basics.html", "title": "组件基础", "doc_id": "402155331bb14b77b7e0b3b9ce28c09f", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1435, "chunk_index": 37, "_doc_id": "37_4368696462873126566"}}
{"doc_id": "38_3234580353625028797", "text": "id: <span><span>1<span><span>, title: <span><span>'My journey with Vue'<span><span> },<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> { id: <span><span>2<span><span>, title: <span><span>'Blogging with Vue'<span><span> },<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> { id: <span><span>3<span><span>, title: <span><span>'Why Vue is so fun'<span><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> ]<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/component-basics.html", "title": "组件基础", "doc_id": "402155331bb14b77b7e0b3b9ce28c09f", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1435, "chunk_index": 38, "_doc_id": "38_3234580353625028797"}}
{"doc_id": "39_3014007383978163159", "text": "span> ]<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span><code><pre><div><div><div class=\"composition-api\"><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> posts<span><span> =<span><span> ref<span><span>([<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/component-basics.html", "title": "组件基础", "doc_id": "402155331bb14b77b7e0b3b9ce28c09f", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1435, "chunk_index": 39, "_doc_id": "39_3014007383978163159"}}
{"doc_id": "40_2249535254723281207", "text": "class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> posts<span><span> =<span><span> ref<span><span>([<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> { id: <span><span>1<span><span>, title: <span><span>'My journey with Vue'<span><span> },<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> { id: <span><span>2<span><span>, title: <span><span>'Blogging with Vue'<span><span> },<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> { id: <span><span>3<span><span>, title: <span><span>'Why Vue is so fun'<span><span> }<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/component-basics.html", "title": "组件基础", "doc_id": "402155331bb14b77b7e0b3b9ce28c09f", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1435, "chunk_index": 40, "_doc_id": "40_2249535254723281207"}}
{"doc_id": "41_4320875518489605436", "text": "> { id: <span><span>3<span><span>, title: <span><span>'Why Vue is so fun'<span><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>])<span><span><code><pre><div><div><p>这种情况下，我们可以使用 <code>v-for<code> 来渲染它们：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>BlogPost<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> v-for<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>post <span><span>in<span><span> posts<span><span>\"<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/component-basics.html", "title": "组件基础", "doc_id": "402155331bb14b77b7e0b3b9ce28c09f", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1435, "chunk_index": 41, "_doc_id": "41_4320875518489605436"}}
{"doc_id": "42_735018821129067657", "text": "span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>post <span><span>in<span><span> posts<span><span>\"<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> :<span><span>key<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>post.id<span><span>\"<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> :<span><span>title<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>post.title<span><span>\"<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/component-basics.html", "title": "组件基础", "doc_id": "402155331bb14b77b7e0b3b9ce28c09f", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1435, "chunk_index": 42, "_doc_id": "42_735018821129067657"}}
{"doc_id": "43_8537707308323488440", "text": "><span> :<span><span>title<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>post.title<span><span>\"<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> /><span><span><code><pre><div><p>留意我们是如何使用 <a href=\"/api/built-in-directives.html#v-bind\"><code>v-bind<code> 语法<a> (<code>:title=\"post.title\"<code>) 来传递动态 prop 值的。当事先不知道要渲染的确切内容时，这一点特别有用。<p><p>以上就是目前你需要了解的关于 props 的全部了。如果你看完本章节后还想知道更多细节，我们推荐你深入阅读关于 props 的<a href=\"/guide/components/props.html\">完整指引<a>。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/component-basics.html", "title": "组件基础", "doc_id": "402155331bb14b77b7e0b3b9ce28c09f", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1435, "chunk_index": 43, "_doc_id": "43_8537707308323488440"}}
{"doc_id": "44_1653513873841317272", "text": "解的关于 props 的全部了。如果你看完本章节后还想知道更多细节，我们推荐你深入阅读关于 props 的<a href=\"/guide/components/props.html\">完整指引<a>。<p><h2 id=\"listening-to-events\">监听事件 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#listening-to-events\">​<a><h2><p>让我们继续关注我们的 <code><BlogPost><code> 组件。我们会发现有时候它需要与父组件进行交互。例如，要在此处实现无障碍访问的需求，将博客文章的文字能够放大，而页面的其余部分仍使用默认字号。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/component-basics.html", "title": "组件基础", "doc_id": "402155331bb14b77b7e0b3b9ce28c09f", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1435, "chunk_index": 44, "_doc_id": "44_1653513873841317272"}}
{"doc_id": "45_840213051266511487", "text": "续关注我们的 <code><BlogPost><code> 组件。我们会发现有时候它需要与父组件进行交互。例如，要在此处实现无障碍访问的需求，将博客文章的文字能够放大，而页面的其余部分仍使用默认字号。<p><p>在父组件中，我们可以添加一个 <code>postFontSize<code> <span class=\"options-api\">数据属性<span><span class=\"composition-api\">ref <span>来实现这个效果：<p><div class=\"options-api\"><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>data<span><span>() {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> return<span><span> {<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/component-basics.html", "title": "组件基础", "doc_id": "402155331bb14b77b7e0b3b9ce28c09f", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1435, "chunk_index": 45, "_doc_id": "45_840213051266511487"}}
{"doc_id": "46_6077250483810574807", "text": "\"><span>data<span><span>() {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> return<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> posts: [<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> /* ... */<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> ],<span><span>\n<span class=\"line highlighted\"><span> postFontSize: <span><span>1<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/component-basics.html", "title": "组件基础", "doc_id": "402155331bb14b77b7e0b3b9ce28c09f", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1435, "chunk_index": 46, "_doc_id": "46_6077250483810574807"}}
{"doc_id": "47_8863474327405219380", "text": "highlighted\"><span> postFontSize: <span><span>1<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span><code><pre><div><div><div class=\"composition-api\"><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> posts<span><span> =<span><span> ref<span><span>([<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> /* ... */<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>])<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/component-basics.html", "title": "组件基础", "doc_id": "402155331bb14b77b7e0b3b9ce28c09f", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1435, "chunk_index": 47, "_doc_id": "47_8863474327405219380"}}
{"doc_id": "48_3084288025436882878", "text": "span> /* ... */<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>])<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line highlighted\"><span>const<span><span> postFontSize<span><span> =<span><span> ref<span><span>(<span><span>1<span><span>)<span><span><code><pre><div><div><p>在模板中用它来控制所有博客文章的字体大小：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line highlighted\"><span><<span><span>div<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/component-basics.html", "title": "组件基础", "doc_id": "402155331bb14b77b7e0b3b9ce28c09f", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1435, "chunk_index": 48, "_doc_id": "48_3084288025436882878"}}
{"doc_id": "49_2596555493711054676", "text": "\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line highlighted\"><span><<span><span>div<span><span> :<span><span>style<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>{ fontSize: postFontSize <span><span>+<span><span> 'em'<span><span> }<span><span>\"<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>BlogPost<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> v-for<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>post <span><span>in<span><span> posts<span><span>\"<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/component-basics.html", "title": "组件基础", "doc_id": "402155331bb14b77b7e0b3b9ce28c09f", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1435, "chunk_index": 49, "_doc_id": "49_2596555493711054676"}}
{"doc_id": "50_5677132627845453329", "text": "span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>post <span><span>in<span><span> posts<span><span>\"<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> :<span><span>key<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>post.id<span><span>\"<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> :<span><span>title<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>post.title<span><span>\"<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> /><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/component-basics.html", "title": "组件基础", "doc_id": "402155331bb14b77b7e0b3b9ce28c09f", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1435, "chunk_index": 50, "_doc_id": "50_5677132627845453329"}}
{"doc_id": "51_5131497947858440188", "text": "pan><span>\"<span><span>post.title<span><span>\"<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> /><span><span>\n<span class=\"line highlighted\"><span></<span><span>div<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>然后，给 <code><BlogPost><code> 组件添加一个按钮：<p><div class=\"vp-code-block-title\"><p class=\"vp-code-block-title-bar\"><span class=\"vp-code-block-title-text\">BlogPost.vue<span><p><div class=\"language-vue\"> <span class=\"lang\">vue<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><!-- 省略了 <script> --><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/component-basics.html", "title": "组件基础", "doc_id": "402155331bb14b77b7e0b3b9ce28c09f", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1435, "chunk_index": 51, "_doc_id": "51_5131497947858440188"}}
{"doc_id": "52_1830894505447308718", "text": "class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><!-- 省略了 <script> --><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>div<span><span> class<span><span>=<span><span>\"blog-post\"<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>h4<span><span>>{{ title }}</<span><span>h4<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/component-basics.html", "title": "组件基础", "doc_id": "402155331bb14b77b7e0b3b9ce28c09f", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1435, "chunk_index": 52, "_doc_id": "52_1830894505447308718"}}
{"doc_id": "53_4588144800660941234", "text": "lass=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>h4<span><span>>{{ title }}</<span><span>h4<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line highlighted\"><span> <<span><span>button<span><span>>Enlarge text</<span><span>button<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> </<span><span>div<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/component-basics.html", "title": "组件基础", "doc_id": "402155331bb14b77b7e0b3b9ce28c09f", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1435, "chunk_index": 53, "_doc_id": "53_4588144800660941234"}}
{"doc_id": "54_5115322977801746863", "text": "utton<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> </<span><span>div<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><div><p>这个按钮目前还没有做任何事情，我们想要点击这个按钮来告诉父组件它应该放大所有博客文章的文字。要解决这个问题，组件实例提供了一个自定义事件系统。父组件可以通过 <code>v-on<code> 或 <code>@<code> 来选择性地监听子组件上抛的事件，就像监听原生 DOM 事件那样：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>BlogPost<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/component-basics.html", "title": "组件基础", "doc_id": "402155331bb14b77b7e0b3b9ce28c09f", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1435, "chunk_index": 54, "_doc_id": "54_5115322977801746863"}}
{"doc_id": "55_7634635464983469315", "text": "class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>BlogPost<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> ...<span><span>\n<span class=\"line highlighted\"><span> @<span><span>enlarge-text<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>postFontSize <span><span>+=<span><span> 0.1<span><span>\"<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/component-basics.html", "title": "组件基础", "doc_id": "402155331bb14b77b7e0b3b9ce28c09f", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1435, "chunk_index": 55, "_doc_id": "55_7634635464983469315"}}
{"doc_id": "56_1334278889825208294", "text": "span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>postFontSize <span><span>+=<span><span> 0.1<span><span>\"<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> /><span><span><code><pre><div><p>子组件可以通过调用内置的 <a href=\"/api/component-instance.html#emit\"><strong><code>$emit<code><strong> 方法<a>，通过传入事件名称来抛出一个事件：<p><div class=\"vp-code-block-title\"><p class=\"vp-code-block-title-bar\"><span class=\"vp-code-block-title-text\">BlogPost.vue<span><p><div class=\"language-vue\"> <span class=\"lang\">vue<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><!-- 省略了 <script> --><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/component-basics.html", "title": "组件基础", "doc_id": "402155331bb14b77b7e0b3b9ce28c09f", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1435, "chunk_index": 56, "_doc_id": "56_1334278889825208294"}}
{"doc_id": "57_1830894505447308718", "text": "class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><!-- 省略了 <script> --><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>div<span><span> class<span><span>=<span><span>\"blog-post\"<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>h4<span><span>>{{ title }}</<span><span>h4<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/component-basics.html", "title": "组件基础", "doc_id": "402155331bb14b77b7e0b3b9ce28c09f", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1435, "chunk_index": 57, "_doc_id": "57_1830894505447308718"}}
{"doc_id": "58_4189937234693658504", "text": "lass=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>h4<span><span>>{{ title }}</<span><span>h4<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line highlighted\"><span> <<span><span>button<span><span> @click<span><span>=<span><span>\"$emit('enlarge-text')\"<span><span>>Enlarge text</<span><span>button<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> </<span><span>div<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/component-basics.html", "title": "组件基础", "doc_id": "402155331bb14b77b7e0b3b9ce28c09f", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1435, "chunk_index": 58, "_doc_id": "58_4189937234693658504"}}
{"doc_id": "59_2944750298167801831", "text": "utton<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> </<span><span>div<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><div><p>因为有了 <code>@enlarge-text=\"postFontSize += 0.1\"<code> 的监听，父组件会接收这一事件，从而更新 <code>postFontSize<code> 的值。<p><p>我们可以通过 <span class=\"options-api\"><a href=\"/api/options-state.html#emits\"><code>emits<code><a> 选项<span><span class=\"composition-api\"><a href=\"/api/sfc-script-setup.", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/component-basics.html", "title": "组件基础", "doc_id": "402155331bb14b77b7e0b3b9ce28c09f", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1435, "chunk_index": 59, "_doc_id": "59_2944750298167801831"}}
{"doc_id": "60_2904071814620765212", "text": "ml#emits\"><code>emits<code><a> 选项<span><span class=\"composition-api\"><a href=\"/api/sfc-script-setup.html#defineprops-defineemits\"><code>defineEmits<code><a> 宏<span>来声明需要抛出的事件：<p><div class=\"options-api\"><div class=\"vp-code-block-title\"><p class=\"vp-code-block-title-bar\"><span class=\"vp-code-block-title-text\">BlogPost.vue<span><p><div class=\"language-vue\"> <span class=\"lang\">vue<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>script<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/component-basics.html", "title": "组件基础", "doc_id": "402155331bb14b77b7e0b3b9ce28c09f", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1435, "chunk_index": 60, "_doc_id": "60_2904071814620765212"}}
{"doc_id": "61_846357132676306352", "text": "ki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>script<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> props: [<span><span>'title'<span><span>],<span><span>\n<span class=\"line highlighted\"><span> emits: [<span><span>'enlarge-text'<span><span>]<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/component-basics.html", "title": "组件基础", "doc_id": "402155331bb14b77b7e0b3b9ce28c09f", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1435, "chunk_index": 61, "_doc_id": "61_846357132676306352"}}
{"doc_id": "62_5415216629725432731", "text": "emits: [<span><span>'enlarge-text'<span><span>]<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>script<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><div><div><div class=\"composition-api\"><div class=\"vp-code-block-title\"><p class=\"vp-code-block-title-bar\"><span class=\"vp-code-block-title-text\">BlogPost.vue<span><p><div class=\"language-vue\"> <span class=\"lang\">vue<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>script<span><span> setup<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/component-basics.html", "title": "组件基础", "doc_id": "402155331bb14b77b7e0b3b9ce28c09f", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1435, "chunk_index": 62, "_doc_id": "62_5415216629725432731"}}
{"doc_id": "63_5055258167843542940", "text": "code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>script<span><span> setup<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>defineProps<span><span>([<span><span>'title'<span><span>])<span><span>\n<span class=\"line highlighted\"><span>defineEmits<span><span>([<span><span>'enlarge-text'<span><span>])<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>script<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><div><div><p>这声明了一个组件可能触发的所有事件，还可以对事件的参数进行<a href=\"/guide/components/events.html#validate-emitted-events\">验证<a>。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/component-basics.html", "title": "组件基础", "doc_id": "402155331bb14b77b7e0b3b9ce28c09f", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1435, "chunk_index": 63, "_doc_id": "63_5055258167843542940"}}
{"doc_id": "64_2012779471362824303", "text": ">这声明了一个组件可能触发的所有事件，还可以对事件的参数进行<a href=\"/guide/components/events.html#validate-emitted-events\">验证<a>。同时，这还可以让 Vue 避免将它们作为原生事件监听器隐式地应用于子组件的根元素。<p><div class=\"composition-api\"><p>和 <code>defineProps<code> 类似，<code>defineEmits<code> 仅可用于 <code><script setup><code> 之中，并且不需要导入，它返回一个等同于 <code>$emit<code> 方法的 <code>emit<code> 函数。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/component-basics.html", "title": "组件基础", "doc_id": "402155331bb14b77b7e0b3b9ce28c09f", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1435, "chunk_index": 64, "_doc_id": "64_2012779471362824303"}}
{"doc_id": "65_7454451474091135967", "text": "code> 仅可用于 <code><script setup><code> 之中，并且不需要导入，它返回一个等同于 <code>$emit<code> 方法的 <code>emit<code> 函数。它可以被用于在组件的 <code><script setup><code> 中抛出事件，因为此处无法直接访问 <code>$emit<code>：<p><div class=\"language-vue\"> <span class=\"lang\">vue<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>script<span><span> setup<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/component-basics.html", "title": "组件基础", "doc_id": "402155331bb14b77b7e0b3b9ce28c09f", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1435, "chunk_index": 65, "_doc_id": "65_7454451474091135967"}}
{"doc_id": "66_895597275714869903", "text": "code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>script<span><span> setup<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> emit<span><span> =<span><span> defineEmits<span><span>([<span><span>'enlarge-text'<span><span>])<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>emit<span><span>(<span><span>'enlarge-text'<span><span>)<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/component-basics.html", "title": "组件基础", "doc_id": "402155331bb14b77b7e0b3b9ce28c09f", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1435, "chunk_index": 66, "_doc_id": "66_895597275714869903"}}
{"doc_id": "67_2916839797218528927", "text": "span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>emit<span><span>(<span><span>'enlarge-text'<span><span>)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>script<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>TypeScript 用户请参考：<a href=\"/guide/typescript/composition-api.html#typing-component-emits\">为组件 emits 标注类型<a> <p><p>如果你没有在使用 <code><script setup><code>，你可以通过 <code>emits<code> 选项定义组件会抛出的事件。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/component-basics.html", "title": "组件基础", "doc_id": "402155331bb14b77b7e0b3b9ce28c09f", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1435, "chunk_index": 67, "_doc_id": "67_2916839797218528927"}}
{"doc_id": "68_1084301207989934139", "text": "s\">为组件 emits 标注类型<a> <p><p>如果你没有在使用 <code><script setup><code>，你可以通过 <code>emits<code> 选项定义组件会抛出的事件。你可以从 <code>setup()<code> 函数的第二个参数，即 setup 上下文对象上访问到 <code>emit<code> 函数：<p><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> emits: [<span><span>'enlarge-text'<span><span>],<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/component-basics.html", "title": "组件基础", "doc_id": "402155331bb14b77b7e0b3b9ce28c09f", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1435, "chunk_index": 68, "_doc_id": "68_1084301207989934139"}}
{"doc_id": "69_64886790489052851", "text": "<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> emits: [<span><span>'enlarge-text'<span><span>],<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> setup<span><span>(<span><span>props<span><span>, <span><span>ctx<span><span>) {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> ctx.<span><span>emit<span><span>(<span><span>'enlarge-text'<span><span>)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/component-basics.html", "title": "组件基础", "doc_id": "402155331bb14b77b7e0b3b9ce28c09f", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1435, "chunk_index": 69, "_doc_id": "69_64886790489052851"}}
{"doc_id": "70_1124196023492883761", "text": "><span>(<span><span>'enlarge-text'<span><span>)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span><code><pre><div><div><p>以上就是目前你需要了解的关于组件自定义事件的所有知识了。如果你看完本章节后还想知道更多细节，请深入阅读<a href=\"/guide/components/events.html\">组件事件<a>章节。<p><h2 id=\"content-distribution-with-slots\">通过插槽来分配内容 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#content-distribution-with-slots\">​<a><h2><p>一些情况下我们会希望能和 HTML 元素一样向组件中传递内容：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>AlertBox<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/component-basics.html", "title": "组件基础", "doc_id": "402155331bb14b77b7e0b3b9ce28c09f", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1435, "chunk_index": 70, "_doc_id": "70_1124196023492883761"}}
{"doc_id": "71_5848407321557977732", "text": "github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>AlertBox<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> Something bad happened.<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>AlertBox<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>我们期望能渲染成这样：<p><div class=\"danger custom-block\"><p class=\"custom-block-title\">This is an Error for Demo Purposes<p><p>Something bad happened.", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/component-basics.html", "title": "组件基础", "doc_id": "402155331bb14b77b7e0b3b9ce28c09f", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1435, "chunk_index": 71, "_doc_id": "71_5848407321557977732"}}
{"doc_id": "72_410841216913856208", "text": "block\"><p class=\"custom-block-title\">This is an Error for Demo Purposes<p><p>Something bad happened.<p><div><p>这可以通过 Vue 的自定义 <code><slot><code> 元素来实现：<p><div class=\"vp-code-block-title\"><p class=\"vp-code-block-title-bar\"><span class=\"vp-code-block-title-text\">AlertBox.vue<span><p><div class=\"language-vue\"> <span class=\"lang\">vue<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/component-basics.html", "title": "组件基础", "doc_id": "402155331bb14b77b7e0b3b9ce28c09f", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1435, "chunk_index": 72, "_doc_id": "72_410841216913856208"}}
{"doc_id": "73_7037824732067798750", "text": "github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>div<span><span> class<span><span>=<span><span>\"alert-box\"<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>strong<span><span>>This is an Error for Demo Purposes</<span><span>strong<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line highlighted\"><span> <<span><span>slot<span><span> /<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/component-basics.html", "title": "组件基础", "doc_id": "402155331bb14b77b7e0b3b9ce28c09f", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1435, "chunk_index": 73, "_doc_id": "73_7037824732067798750"}}
{"doc_id": "74_39301280316074890", "text": "pan>\n<span class=\"line highlighted\"><span> <<span><span>slot<span><span> /<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> </<span><span>div<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>style<span><span> scoped<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>.alert-box<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> /* ... */<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/component-basics.html", "title": "组件基础", "doc_id": "402155331bb14b77b7e0b3b9ce28c09f", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1435, "chunk_index": 74, "_doc_id": "74_39301280316074890"}}
{"doc_id": "75_5613159957567655404", "text": "<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> /* ... */<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>style<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><div><p>如上所示，我们使用 <code><slot><code> 作为一个占位符，父组件传递进来的内容就会渲染在这里。<p><p>以上就是目前你需要了解的关于插槽的所有知识了。如果你看完本章节后还想知道更多细节，请深入阅读<a href=\"/guide/components/slots.html\">组件插槽<a>章节。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/component-basics.html", "title": "组件基础", "doc_id": "402155331bb14b77b7e0b3b9ce28c09f", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1435, "chunk_index": 75, "_doc_id": "75_5613159957567655404"}}
{"doc_id": "76_115521361159954599", "text": "p><p>以上就是目前你需要了解的关于插槽的所有知识了。如果你看完本章节后还想知道更多细节，请深入阅读<a href=\"/guide/components/slots.html\">组件插槽<a>章节。<p><h2 id=\"dynamic-components\">动态组件 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#dynamic-components\">​<a><h2><p>有些场景会需要在两个组件间来回切换，比如 Tab 界面：<p><p>上面的例子是通过 Vue 的 <code><component><code> 元素和特殊的 <code>is<code> attribute 实现的：<p><div class=\"options-api\"><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><!-- currentTab 改变时组件也改变 --><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/component-basics.html", "title": "组件基础", "doc_id": "402155331bb14b77b7e0b3b9ce28c09f", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1435, "chunk_index": 76, "_doc_id": "76_115521361159954599"}}
{"doc_id": "77_6980704853883007538", "text": "\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><!-- currentTab 改变时组件也改变 --><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>component<span><span> :<span><span>is<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>currentTab<span><span>\"<span><span>></<span><span>component<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><div><div class=\"composition-api\"><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><!-- currentTab 改变时组件也改变 --><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/component-basics.html", "title": "组件基础", "doc_id": "402155331bb14b77b7e0b3b9ce28c09f", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1435, "chunk_index": 77, "_doc_id": "77_6980704853883007538"}}
{"doc_id": "78_7934639976932658510", "text": "\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><!-- currentTab 改变时组件也改变 --><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>component<span><span> :<span><span>is<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>tabs[currentTab]<span><span>\"<span><span>></<span><span>component<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><div><p>在上面的例子中，被传给 <code>:is<code> 的值可以是以下几种：<p><p>你也可以使用 <code>is<code> attribute 来创建一般的 HTML 元素。<p><p>当使用 <code><component :is=\"...\"><code> 来在多个组件间作切换时，被切换掉的组件会被卸载。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/component-basics.html", "title": "组件基础", "doc_id": "402155331bb14b77b7e0b3b9ce28c09f", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1435, "chunk_index": 78, "_doc_id": "78_7934639976932658510"}}
{"doc_id": "79_8872940003232371718", "text": "<code> attribute 来创建一般的 HTML 元素。<p><p>当使用 <code><component :is=\"...\"><code> 来在多个组件间作切换时，被切换掉的组件会被卸载。我们可以通过 <a href=\"/guide/built-ins/keep-alive.html\"><code><KeepAlive><code> 组件<a>强制被切换掉的组件仍然保持“存活”的状态。<p><h2 id=\"in-dom-template-parsing-caveats\">DOM 内模板解析注意事项 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#in-dom-template-parsing-caveats\">​<a><h2><p>如果你想在 DOM 中直接书写 Vue 模板，Vue 则必须从 DOM 中获取模板字符串。由于浏览器的原生 HTML 解析行为限制，有一些需要注意的事项。<p><div class=\"tip custom-block\"><p class=\"custom-block-title\">TIP<p><p>请注意下面讨论只适用于直接在 DOM 中编写模板的情况。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/component-basics.html", "title": "组件基础", "doc_id": "402155331bb14b77b7e0b3b9ce28c09f", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1435, "chunk_index": 79, "_doc_id": "79_8872940003232371718"}}
{"doc_id": "80_8490540526196780692", "text": "<p><div class=\"tip custom-block\"><p class=\"custom-block-title\">TIP<p><p>请注意下面讨论只适用于直接在 DOM 中编写模板的情况。如果你使用来自以下来源的字符串模板，就不需要顾虑这些限制了：<p><ul><li>单文件组件<li><li>内联模板字符串 (例如 <code>template: '...'<code>)<li><li><code><script type=\"text/x-template\"><code><li><ul><div><h3 id=\"case-insensitivity\">大小写区分 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#case-insensitivity\">​<a><h3><p>HTML 标签和属性名称是不分大小写的，所以浏览器会把任何大写的字符解释为小写。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/component-basics.html", "title": "组件基础", "doc_id": "402155331bb14b77b7e0b3b9ce28c09f", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1435, "chunk_index": 80, "_doc_id": "80_8490540526196780692"}}
{"doc_id": "81_8087412739666951047", "text": "class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#case-insensitivity\">​<a><h3><p>HTML 标签和属性名称是不分大小写的，所以浏览器会把任何大写的字符解释为小写。这意味着当你使用 DOM 内的模板时，无论是 PascalCase 形式的组件名称、camelCase 形式的 prop 名称还是 v-on 的事件名称，都需要转换为相应等价的 kebab-case (短横线连字符) 形式：<p><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// JavaScript 中的 camelCase<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> BlogPost<span><span> =<span><span> {<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/component-basics.html", "title": "组件基础", "doc_id": "402155331bb14b77b7e0b3b9ce28c09f", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1435, "chunk_index": 81, "_doc_id": "81_8087412739666951047"}}
{"doc_id": "82_2339012852910950682", "text": "><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> BlogPost<span><span> =<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> props: [<span><span>'postTitle'<span><span>],<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> emits: [<span><span>'updatePost'<span><span>],<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> template: <span><span>`<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <h3>{{ postTitle }}</h3><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> `<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/component-basics.html", "title": "组件基础", "doc_id": "402155331bb14b77b7e0b3b9ce28c09f", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1435, "chunk_index": 82, "_doc_id": "82_2339012852910950682"}}
{"doc_id": "83_3234111217219660227", "text": "an class=\"line\"><span> <h3>{{ postTitle }}</h3><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> `<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span><code><pre><div><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><!-- HTML 中的 kebab-case --><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/component-basics.html", "title": "组件基础", "doc_id": "402155331bb14b77b7e0b3b9ce28c09f", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1435, "chunk_index": 83, "_doc_id": "83_3234111217219660227"}}
{"doc_id": "84_3679637824018350728", "text": "=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><!-- HTML 中的 kebab-case --><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>blog-post<span><span> post-title<span><span>=<span><span>\"hello!\"<span><span> @<span><span>update-post<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>onUpdatePost<span><span>\"<span><span>></<span><span>blog-post<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>我们在上面的例子中已经使用过了闭合标签 (self-closing tag)：<p><p>这是因为 Vue 的模板解析器支持任意标签使用 <code>/><code> 作为标签关闭的标志。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/component-basics.html", "title": "组件基础", "doc_id": "402155331bb14b77b7e0b3b9ce28c09f", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1435, "chunk_index": 84, "_doc_id": "84_3679637824018350728"}}
{"doc_id": "85_9046405471586444940", "text": "iv><p>我们在上面的例子中已经使用过了闭合标签 (self-closing tag)：<p><p>这是因为 Vue 的模板解析器支持任意标签使用 <code>/><code> 作为标签关闭的标志。<p><p>然而在 DOM 内模板中，我们必须显式地写出关闭标签：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>my-component<span><span>></<span><span>my-component<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>这是由于 HTML 只允许<a href=\"https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/syntax.html#void-elements\" target=\"_blank\">一小部分特殊的元素<a>省略其关闭标签，最常见的就是 <code><input><code> 和 <code><img><code>。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/component-basics.html", "title": "组件基础", "doc_id": "402155331bb14b77b7e0b3b9ce28c09f", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1435, "chunk_index": 85, "_doc_id": "85_9046405471586444940"}}
{"doc_id": "86_4303025886443299219", "text": "l#void-elements\" target=\"_blank\">一小部分特殊的元素<a>省略其关闭标签，最常见的就是 <code><input><code> 和 <code><img><code>。对于其他的元素来说，如果你省略了关闭标签，原生的 HTML 解析器会认为开启的标签永远没有结束，用下面这个代码片段举例来说：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>my-component<span><span> /> <span><span><!-- 我们想要在这里关闭标签... --><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/component-basics.html", "title": "组件基础", "doc_id": "402155331bb14b77b7e0b3b9ce28c09f", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1435, "chunk_index": 86, "_doc_id": "86_4303025886443299219"}}
{"doc_id": "87_444288545757701199", "text": "ine\"><span><<span><span>my-component<span><span> /> <span><span><!-- 我们想要在这里关闭标签... --><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>span<span><span>>hello</<span><span>span<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>将被解析为：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>my-component<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/component-basics.html", "title": "组件基础", "doc_id": "402155331bb14b77b7e0b3b9ce28c09f", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1435, "chunk_index": 87, "_doc_id": "87_444288545757701199"}}
{"doc_id": "88_4629246629012381135", "text": "hub-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>my-component<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>span<span><span>>hello</<span><span>span<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/component-basics.html", "title": "组件基础", "doc_id": "402155331bb14b77b7e0b3b9ce28c09f", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1435, "chunk_index": 88, "_doc_id": "88_4629246629012381135"}}
{"doc_id": "89_2272758310792882561", "text": "class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>span<span><span>>hello</<span><span>span<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>my-component<span><span>> <span><span><!-- 但浏览器会在这里关闭标签 --><span><span><code><pre><div><h3 id=\"element-placement-restrictions\">元素位置限制 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#element-placement-restrictions\">​<a><h3><p>某些 HTML 元素对于放在其中的元素类型有限制，例如 <code><ul><code>，<code><ol><code>，<code><table><code> 和 <code><select><code>，相应的，某些元素仅在放置于特定元素中时才会显示，例如 <code><li><code>，<code><tr><code> 和 <code><option><code>。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/component-basics.html", "title": "组件基础", "doc_id": "402155331bb14b77b7e0b3b9ce28c09f", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1435, "chunk_index": 89, "_doc_id": "89_2272758310792882561"}}
{"doc_id": "90_4977133338642509741", "text": "><select><code>，相应的，某些元素仅在放置于特定元素中时才会显示，例如 <code><li><code>，<code><tr><code> 和 <code><option><code>。<p><p>这将导致在使用带有此类限制元素的组件时出现问题。例如：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>table<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>blog-post-row<span><span>></<span><span>blog-post-row<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/component-basics.html", "title": "组件基础", "doc_id": "402155331bb14b77b7e0b3b9ce28c09f", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1435, "chunk_index": 90, "_doc_id": "90_4977133338642509741"}}
{"doc_id": "91_199856941044699415", "text": "><span> <<span><span>blog-post-row<span><span>></<span><span>blog-post-row<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>table<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>自定义的组件 <code><blog-post-row><code> 将作为无效的内容被忽略，因而在最终呈现的输出中造成错误。我们可以使用特殊的 <a href=\"/api/built-in-special-attributes.html#is\"><code>is<code> attribute<a> 作为一种解决方案：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>table<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/component-basics.html", "title": "组件基础", "doc_id": "402155331bb14b77b7e0b3b9ce28c09f", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1435, "chunk_index": 91, "_doc_id": "91_199856941044699415"}}
{"doc_id": "92_7426894886658306101", "text": "iki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>table<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>tr<span><span> is<span><span>=<span><span>\"vue:blog-post-row\"<span><span>></<span><span>tr<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>table<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><div class=\"tip custom-block\"><p class=\"custom-block-title\">TIP<p><p>当使用在原生 HTML 元素上时，<code>is<code> 的值必须加上前缀 <code>vue:<code> 才可以被解析为一个 Vue 组件。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/component-basics.html", "title": "组件基础", "doc_id": "402155331bb14b77b7e0b3b9ce28c09f", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1435, "chunk_index": 92, "_doc_id": "92_7426894886658306101"}}
{"doc_id": "93_5539160818341189434", "text": "om-block-title\">TIP<p><p>当使用在原生 HTML 元素上时，<code>is<code> 的值必须加上前缀 <code>vue:<code> 才可以被解析为一个 Vue 组件。这一点是必要的，为了避免和原生的<a href=\"https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/custom-elements.html#custom-elements-customized-builtin-example\" target=\"_blank\">自定义内置元素<a>相混淆。<p><div><p>以上就是你需要了解的关于 DOM 内模板解析的所有注意事项，同时也是 Vue <em>基础<em>部分的所有内容。祝贺你！虽然还有很多需要学习的，但你可以先暂停一下，去用 Vue 做一些有趣的东西，或者研究一些<a href=\"/examples/\">示例<a>。<p><p>完成了本页的阅读后，回顾一下你刚才所学到的知识，如果还想知道更多细节，我们推荐你继续阅读关于组件的完整指引。<p><div><div>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/component-basics.html", "title": "组件基础", "doc_id": "402155331bb14b77b7e0b3b9ce28c09f", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1435, "chunk_index": 93, "_doc_id": "93_5539160818341189434"}}
{"doc_id": "0_5930693022822569690", "text": "<div><div><h1 id=\"composables\">组合式函数 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#composables\">​<a><h1><div class=\"tip custom-block\"><p class=\"custom-block-title\">TIP<p><p>此章节假设你已经对组合式 API 有了基本的了解。如果你只学习过选项式 API，你可以使用左侧边栏上方的切换按钮将 API 风格切换为组合式 API 后，重新阅读<a href=\"/guide/essentials/reactivity-fundamentals.html\">响应性基础<a>和<a href=\"/guide/essentials/lifecycle.html\">生命周期钩子<a>两个章节。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/reusability/composables.html", "title": "组合式函数", "doc_id": "905d9404bbdd43d490e8ca4732c36d8d", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1263, "chunk_index": 0, "_doc_id": "0_5930693022822569690"}}
{"doc_id": "1_8300494895423891949", "text": "als/reactivity-fundamentals.html\">响应性基础<a>和<a href=\"/guide/essentials/lifecycle.html\">生命周期钩子<a>两个章节。<p><div><h2 id=\"what-is-a-composable\">什么是“组合式函数”？ <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#what-is-a-composable\">​<a><h2><p>在 Vue 应用的概念中，“组合式函数”(Composables) 是一个利用 Vue 的组合式 API 来封装和复用<strong>有状态逻辑<strong>的函数。<p><p>当构建前端应用时，我们常常需要复用公共任务的逻辑。例如为了在不同地方格式化时间，我们可能会抽取一个可复用的日期格式化函数。这个函数封装了<strong>无状态的逻辑<strong>：它在接收一些输入后立刻返回所期望的输出。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/reusability/composables.html", "title": "组合式函数", "doc_id": "905d9404bbdd43d490e8ca4732c36d8d", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1263, "chunk_index": 1, "_doc_id": "1_8300494895423891949"}}
{"doc_id": "2_7104429178137707608", "text": "常常需要复用公共任务的逻辑。例如为了在不同地方格式化时间，我们可能会抽取一个可复用的日期格式化函数。这个函数封装了<strong>无状态的逻辑<strong>：它在接收一些输入后立刻返回所期望的输出。复用无状态逻辑的库有很多，比如你可能已经用过的 <a href=\"https://lodash.com/\" target=\"_blank\">lodash<a> 或是 <a href=\"https://date-fns.org/\" target=\"_blank\">date-fns<a>。<p><p>相比之下，有状态逻辑负责管理会随时间而变化的状态。一个简单的例子是跟踪当前鼠标在页面中的位置。在实际应用中，也可能是像触摸手势或与数据库的连接状态这样的更复杂的逻辑。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/reusability/composables.html", "title": "组合式函数", "doc_id": "905d9404bbdd43d490e8ca4732c36d8d", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1263, "chunk_index": 2, "_doc_id": "2_7104429178137707608"}}
{"doc_id": "3_699266774475478755", "text": "ate-fns<a>。<p><p>相比之下，有状态逻辑负责管理会随时间而变化的状态。一个简单的例子是跟踪当前鼠标在页面中的位置。在实际应用中，也可能是像触摸手势或与数据库的连接状态这样的更复杂的逻辑。<p><h2 id=\"mouse-tracker-example\">鼠标跟踪器示例 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#mouse-tracker-example\">​<a><h2><p>如果我们要直接在组件中使用组合式 API 实现鼠标跟踪功能，它会是这样的：<p><div class=\"vp-code-block-title\"><p class=\"vp-code-block-title-bar\"><span class=\"vp-code-block-title-text\">MouseComponent.vue<span><p><div class=\"language-vue\"> <span class=\"lang\">vue<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>script<span><span> setup<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/reusability/composables.html", "title": "组合式函数", "doc_id": "905d9404bbdd43d490e8ca4732c36d8d", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1263, "chunk_index": 3, "_doc_id": "3_699266774475478755"}}
{"doc_id": "4_8658540025614466989", "text": "code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>script<span><span> setup<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>import<span><span> { ref, onMounted, onUnmounted } <span><span>from<span><span> 'vue'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> x<span><span> =<span><span> ref<span><span>(<span><span>0<span><span>)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> y<span><span> =<span><span> ref<span><span>(<span><span>0<span><span>)<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/reusability/composables.html", "title": "组合式函数", "doc_id": "905d9404bbdd43d490e8ca4732c36d8d", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1263, "chunk_index": 4, "_doc_id": "4_8658540025614466989"}}
{"doc_id": "5_3237110903005723024", "text": "onst<span><span> y<span><span> =<span><span> ref<span><span>(<span><span>0<span><span>)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>function<span><span> update<span><span>(<span><span>event<span><span>) {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> x.value <span><span>=<span><span> event.pageX<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> y.value <span><span>=<span><span> event.pageY<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/reusability/composables.html", "title": "组合式函数", "doc_id": "905d9404bbdd43d490e8ca4732c36d8d", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1263, "chunk_index": 5, "_doc_id": "5_3237110903005723024"}}
{"doc_id": "6_7564593860135505209", "text": "pan><span> event.pageY<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>onMounted<span><span>(() <span><span>=><span><span> window.<span><span>addEventListener<span><span>(<span><span>'mousemove'<span><span>, update))<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>onUnmounted<span><span>(() <span><span>=><span><span> window.<span><span>removeEventListener<span><span>(<span><span>'mousemove'<span><span>, update))<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/reusability/composables.html", "title": "组合式函数", "doc_id": "905d9404bbdd43d490e8ca4732c36d8d", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1263, "chunk_index": 6, "_doc_id": "6_7564593860135505209"}}
{"doc_id": "7_8154307333830857410", "text": "pan><span>removeEventListener<span><span>(<span><span>'mousemove'<span><span>, update))<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>script<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>template<span><span>>Mouse position is at: {{ x }}, {{ y }}</<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><div><p>但是，如果我们想在多个组件中复用这个相同的逻辑呢？", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/reusability/composables.html", "title": "组合式函数", "doc_id": "905d9404bbdd43d490e8ca4732c36d8d", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1263, "chunk_index": 7, "_doc_id": "7_8154307333830857410"}}
{"doc_id": "8_8261816011225153289", "text": "y }}</<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><div><p>但是，如果我们想在多个组件中复用这个相同的逻辑呢？我们可以把这个逻辑以一个组合式函数的形式提取到外部文件中：<p><div class=\"vp-code-block-title\"><p class=\"vp-code-block-title-bar\"><span class=\"vp-code-block-title-text\">mouse.js<span><p><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>import<span><span> { ref, onMounted, onUnmounted } <span><span>from<span><span> 'vue'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/reusability/composables.html", "title": "组合式函数", "doc_id": "905d9404bbdd43d490e8ca4732c36d8d", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1263, "chunk_index": 8, "_doc_id": "8_8261816011225153289"}}
{"doc_id": "9_7487559153795177610", "text": ", onMounted, onUnmounted } <span><span>from<span><span> 'vue'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 按照惯例，组合式函数名以“use”开头<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> function<span><span> useMouse<span><span>() {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 被组合式函数封装和管理的状态<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> const<span><span> x<span><span> =<span><span> ref<span><span>(<span><span>0<span><span>)<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/reusability/composables.html", "title": "组合式函数", "doc_id": "905d9404bbdd43d490e8ca4732c36d8d", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1263, "chunk_index": 9, "_doc_id": "9_7487559153795177610"}}
{"doc_id": "10_3298029768640642935", "text": "onst<span><span> x<span><span> =<span><span> ref<span><span>(<span><span>0<span><span>)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> const<span><span> y<span><span> =<span><span> ref<span><span>(<span><span>0<span><span>)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 组合式函数可以随时更改其状态。<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> function<span><span> update<span><span>(<span><span>event<span><span>) {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> x.value <span><span>=<span><span> event.pageX<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/reusability/composables.html", "title": "组合式函数", "doc_id": "905d9404bbdd43d490e8ca4732c36d8d", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1263, "chunk_index": 10, "_doc_id": "10_3298029768640642935"}}
{"doc_id": "11_2132808474300484907", "text": ") {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> x.value <span><span>=<span><span> event.pageX<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> y.value <span><span>=<span><span> event.pageY<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 一个组合式函数也可以挂靠在所属组件的生命周期上<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 来启动和卸载副作用<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/reusability/composables.html", "title": "组合式函数", "doc_id": "905d9404bbdd43d490e8ca4732c36d8d", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1263, "chunk_index": 11, "_doc_id": "11_2132808474300484907"}}
{"doc_id": "12_8847368680818751296", "text": "e\"><span> // 一个组合式函数也可以挂靠在所属组件的生命周期上<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 来启动和卸载副作用<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> onMounted<span><span>(() <span><span>=><span><span> window.<span><span>addEventListener<span><span>(<span><span>'mousemove'<span><span>, update))<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> onUnmounted<span><span>(() <span><span>=><span><span> window.<span><span>removeEventListener<span><span>(<span><span>'mousemove'<span><span>, update))<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/reusability/composables.html", "title": "组合式函数", "doc_id": "905d9404bbdd43d490e8ca4732c36d8d", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1263, "chunk_index": 12, "_doc_id": "12_8847368680818751296"}}
{"doc_id": "13_8741406010009240757", "text": "ner<span><span>(<span><span>'mousemove'<span><span>, update))<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 通过返回值暴露所管理的状态<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> return<span><span> { x, y }<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/reusability/composables.html", "title": "组合式函数", "doc_id": "905d9404bbdd43d490e8ca4732c36d8d", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1263, "chunk_index": 13, "_doc_id": "13_8741406010009240757"}}
{"doc_id": "14_4303720393146406975", "text": "pan> // 通过返回值暴露所管理的状态<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> return<span><span> { x, y }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span><code><pre><div><div><p>下面是它在组件中使用的方式：<p><div class=\"vp-code-block-title\"><p class=\"vp-code-block-title-bar\"><span class=\"vp-code-block-title-text\">MouseComponent.vue<span><p><div class=\"language-vue\"> <span class=\"lang\">vue<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>script<span><span> setup<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/reusability/composables.html", "title": "组合式函数", "doc_id": "905d9404bbdd43d490e8ca4732c36d8d", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1263, "chunk_index": 14, "_doc_id": "14_4303720393146406975"}}
{"doc_id": "15_6247734200711445435", "text": "code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>script<span><span> setup<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>import<span><span> { useMouse } <span><span>from<span><span> './mouse.js'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> { <span><span>x<span><span>, <span><span>y<span><span> } <span><span>=<span><span> useMouse<span><span>()<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>script<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/reusability/composables.html", "title": "组合式函数", "doc_id": "905d9404bbdd43d490e8ca4732c36d8d", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1263, "chunk_index": 15, "_doc_id": "15_6247734200711445435"}}
{"doc_id": "16_5167433084987716563", "text": "n>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>script<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>template<span><span>>Mouse position is at: {{ x }}, {{ y }}</<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><div><p class=\"demo\"> Mouse position is at: 0,", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/reusability/composables.html", "title": "组合式函数", "doc_id": "905d9404bbdd43d490e8ca4732c36d8d", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1263, "chunk_index": 16, "_doc_id": "16_5167433084987716563"}}
{"doc_id": "17_2798833982411316188", "text": "pan>template<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><div><p class=\"demo\"> Mouse position is at: 0, 0<p><p><a href=\"https://play.vuejs.org/#\" target=\"_blank\">在演练场中尝试一下<a><p><p>如你所见，", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/reusability/composables.html", "title": "组合式函数", "doc_id": "905d9404bbdd43d490e8ca4732c36d8d", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1263, "chunk_index": 17, "_doc_id": "17_2798833982411316188"}}
{"doc_id": "18_5626360320772398922", "text": "f9VOY+EtizSWfR6xKK6itgkvQ/+fyNs6v4XJXIsPwVL+WprCiL8AEUxw5s=\" target=\"_blank\">在演练场中尝试一下<a><p><p>如你所见，核心逻辑完全一致，我们做的只是把它移到一个外部函数中去，并返回需要暴露的状态。和在组件中一样，你也可以在组合式函数中使用所有的<a href=\"/api/#composition-api\">组合式 API<a>。现在，<code>useMouse()<code> 的功能可以在任何组件中轻易复用了。<p><p>更酷的是，你还可以嵌套多个组合式函数：一个组合式函数可以调用一个或多个其他的组合式函数。这使得我们可以像使用多个组件组合成整个应用一样，用多个较小且逻辑独立的单元来组合形成复杂的逻辑。实际上，这正是为什么我们决定将实现了这一设计模式的 API 集合命名为组合式 API。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/reusability/composables.html", "title": "组合式函数", "doc_id": "905d9404bbdd43d490e8ca4732c36d8d", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1263, "chunk_index": 18, "_doc_id": "18_5626360320772398922"}}
{"doc_id": "19_6162314156964341256", "text": "其他的组合式函数。这使得我们可以像使用多个组件组合成整个应用一样，用多个较小且逻辑独立的单元来组合形成复杂的逻辑。实际上，这正是为什么我们决定将实现了这一设计模式的 API 集合命名为组合式 API。<p><p>举例来说，我们可以将添加和清除 DOM 事件监听器的逻辑也封装进一个组合式函数中：<p><div class=\"vp-code-block-title\"><p class=\"vp-code-block-title-bar\"><span class=\"vp-code-block-title-text\">event.js<span><p><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>import<span><span> { onMounted, onUnmounted } <span><span>from<span><span> 'vue'<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/reusability/composables.html", "title": "组合式函数", "doc_id": "905d9404bbdd43d490e8ca4732c36d8d", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1263, "chunk_index": 19, "_doc_id": "19_6162314156964341256"}}
{"doc_id": "20_3097985034339481056", "text": "><span>import<span><span> { onMounted, onUnmounted } <span><span>from<span><span> 'vue'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> function<span><span> useEventListener<span><span>(<span><span>target<span><span>, <span><span>event<span><span>, <span><span>callback<span><span>) {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 如果你想的话，<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 也可以用字符串形式的 CSS 选择器来寻找目标 DOM 元素<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/reusability/composables.html", "title": "组合式函数", "doc_id": "905d9404bbdd43d490e8ca4732c36d8d", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1263, "chunk_index": 20, "_doc_id": "20_3097985034339481056"}}
{"doc_id": "21_2524796796479756718", "text": "pan> // 如果你想的话，<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 也可以用字符串形式的 CSS 选择器来寻找目标 DOM 元素<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> onMounted<span><span>(() <span><span>=><span><span> target.<span><span>addEventListener<span><span>(event, callback))<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> onUnmounted<span><span>(() <span><span>=><span><span> target.<span><span>removeEventListener<span><span>(event, callback))<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/reusability/composables.html", "title": "组合式函数", "doc_id": "905d9404bbdd43d490e8ca4732c36d8d", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1263, "chunk_index": 21, "_doc_id": "21_2524796796479756718"}}
{"doc_id": "22_1594024008487044451", "text": "pan>=><span><span> target.<span><span>removeEventListener<span><span>(event, callback))<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span><code><pre><div><div><p>有了它，之前的 <code>useMouse()<code> 组合式函数可以被简化为：<p><div class=\"vp-code-block-title\"><p class=\"vp-code-block-title-bar\"><span class=\"vp-code-block-title-text\">mouse.js<span><p><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>import<span><span> { ref } <span><span>from<span><span> 'vue'<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/reusability/composables.html", "title": "组合式函数", "doc_id": "905d9404bbdd43d490e8ca4732c36d8d", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1263, "chunk_index": 22, "_doc_id": "22_1594024008487044451"}}
{"doc_id": "23_8671535507407710299", "text": "><span class=\"line\"><span>import<span><span> { ref } <span><span>from<span><span> 'vue'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line highlighted\"><span>import<span><span> { useEventListener } <span><span>from<span><span> './event'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> function<span><span> useMouse<span><span>() {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> const<span><span> x<span><span> =<span><span> ref<span><span>(<span><span>0<span><span>)<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/reusability/composables.html", "title": "组合式函数", "doc_id": "905d9404bbdd43d490e8ca4732c36d8d", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1263, "chunk_index": 23, "_doc_id": "23_8671535507407710299"}}
{"doc_id": "24_566508795536774965", "text": "onst<span><span> x<span><span> =<span><span> ref<span><span>(<span><span>0<span><span>)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> const<span><span> y<span><span> =<span><span> ref<span><span>(<span><span>0<span><span>)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line highlighted\"><span> useEventListener<span><span>(window, <span><span>'mousemove'<span><span>, (<span><span>event<span><span>) <span><span>=><span><span> {<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/reusability/composables.html", "title": "组合式函数", "doc_id": "905d9404bbdd43d490e8ca4732c36d8d", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1263, "chunk_index": 24, "_doc_id": "24_566508795536774965"}}
{"doc_id": "25_2313438240796809633", "text": "n>'mousemove'<span><span>, (<span><span>event<span><span>) <span><span>=><span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line highlighted\"><span> x.value <span><span>=<span><span> event.pageX<span><span>\n<span class=\"line highlighted\"><span> y.value <span><span>=<span><span> event.pageY<span><span>\n<span class=\"line highlighted\"><span> })<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> return<span><span> { x, y }<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/reusability/composables.html", "title": "组合式函数", "doc_id": "905d9404bbdd43d490e8ca4732c36d8d", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1263, "chunk_index": 25, "_doc_id": "25_2313438240796809633"}}
{"doc_id": "26_4007485858367681583", "text": "><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> return<span><span> { x, y }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span><code><pre><div><div><div class=\"tip custom-block\"><p class=\"custom-block-title\">TIP<p><p>每一个调用 <code>useMouse()<code> 的组件实例会创建其独有的 <code>x<code>、<code>y<code> 状态拷贝，因此他们不会互相影响。如果你想要在组件之间共享状态，请阅读<a href=\"/guide/scaling-up/state-management.html\">状态管理<a>这一章。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/reusability/composables.html", "title": "组合式函数", "doc_id": "905d9404bbdd43d490e8ca4732c36d8d", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1263, "chunk_index": 26, "_doc_id": "26_4007485858367681583"}}
{"doc_id": "27_6200545864373760724", "text": "ode> 状态拷贝，因此他们不会互相影响。如果你想要在组件之间共享状态，请阅读<a href=\"/guide/scaling-up/state-management.html\">状态管理<a>这一章。<p><div><h2 id=\"async-state-example\">异步状态示例 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#async-state-example\">​<a><h2><p><code>useMouse()<code> 组合式函数没有接收任何参数，因此让我们再来看一个需要接收一个参数的组合式函数示例。在做异步数据请求时，我们常常需要处理不同的状态：加载中、加载成功和加载失败。<p><div class=\"language-vue\"> <span class=\"lang\">vue<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>script<span><span> setup<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/reusability/composables.html", "title": "组合式函数", "doc_id": "905d9404bbdd43d490e8ca4732c36d8d", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1263, "chunk_index": 27, "_doc_id": "27_6200545864373760724"}}
{"doc_id": "28_1858743436020847114", "text": "code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>script<span><span> setup<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>import<span><span> { ref } <span><span>from<span><span> 'vue'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> data<span><span> =<span><span> ref<span><span>(<span><span>null<span><span>)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> error<span><span> =<span><span> ref<span><span>(<span><span>null<span><span>)<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/reusability/composables.html", "title": "组合式函数", "doc_id": "905d9404bbdd43d490e8ca4732c36d8d", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1263, "chunk_index": 28, "_doc_id": "28_1858743436020847114"}}
