{"doc_id": "36_536465451691253714", "text": "pan><span> data<span><span> =<span><span> ref<span><span>(<span><span>null<span><span>)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> const<span><span> error<span><span> =<span><span> ref<span><span>(<span><span>null<span><span>)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> fetch<span><span>(url)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> .<span><span>then<span><span>((<span><span>res<span><span>) <span><span>=><span><span> res.<span><span>json<span><span>())<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/reusability/composables.html", "title": "组合式函数", "doc_id": "905d9404bbdd43d490e8ca4732c36d8d", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1263, "chunk_index": 36, "_doc_id": "36_536465451691253714"}}
