{"doc_id": "40_1441523871573970120", "text": "><span> } <span><span>=<span><span> useFetch<span><span>(<span><span>'...'<span><span>)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>script<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><h3 id=\"accepting-reactive-state\">接收响应式状态 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#accepting-reactive-state\">​<a><h3><p><code>useFetch()<code> 接收一个静态 URL 字符串作为输入——因此它只会执行一次 fetch 并且就此结束。如果我们想要在 URL 改变时重新 fetch 呢？为了实现这一点，我们需要将响应式状态传入组合式函数，并让它基于传入的状态来创建执行操作的侦听器。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/reusability/composables.html", "title": "组合式函数", "doc_id": "905d9404bbdd43d490e8ca4732c36d8d", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1263, "chunk_index": 40, "_doc_id": "40_1441523871573970120"}}
{"doc_id": "41_2964937317425989972", "text": "入——因此它只会执行一次 fetch 并且就此结束。如果我们想要在 URL 改变时重新 fetch 呢？为了实现这一点，我们需要将响应式状态传入组合式函数，并让它基于传入的状态来创建执行操作的侦听器。<p><p>举例来说，<code>useFetch()<code> 应该能够接收一个 ref：<p><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> url<span><span> =<span><span> ref<span><span>(<span><span>'/initial-url'<span><span>)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/reusability/composables.html", "title": "组合式函数", "doc_id": "905d9404bbdd43d490e8ca4732c36d8d", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1263, "chunk_index": 41, "_doc_id": "41_2964937317425989972"}}
{"doc_id": "42_7749112327368586537", "text": "span> ref<span><span>(<span><span>'/initial-url'<span><span>)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> { <span><span>data<span><span>, <span><span>error<span><span> } <span><span>=<span><span> useFetch<span><span>(url)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 这将会重新触发 fetch<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/reusability/composables.html", "title": "组合式函数", "doc_id": "905d9404bbdd43d490e8ca4732c36d8d", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1263, "chunk_index": 42, "_doc_id": "42_7749112327368586537"}}
{"doc_id": "43_1839466148303137266", "text": "n>(url)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 这将会重新触发 fetch<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>url.value <span><span>=<span><span> '/new-url'<span><span><code><pre><div><p>或者接收一个 <a href=\"https://developer.mozilla.org/zh-CN/docs/Web/JavaScript/Reference/Functions/get#description\" target=\"_blank\">getter 函数<a>：<p><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// 当 props.id 改变时重新 fetch<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/reusability/composables.html", "title": "组合式函数", "doc_id": "905d9404bbdd43d490e8ca4732c36d8d", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1263, "chunk_index": 43, "_doc_id": "43_1839466148303137266"}}
{"doc_id": "44_3591558657743901899", "text": "ss=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// 当 props.id 改变时重新 fetch<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> { <span><span>data<span><span>, <span><span>error<span><span> } <span><span>=<span><span> useFetch<span><span>(() <span><span>=><span><span> `/posts/${<span><span>props<span><span>.<span><span>id<span><span>}`<span><span>)<span><span><code><pre><div><p>我们可以用 <a href=\"/api/reactivity-core.", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/reusability/composables.html", "title": "组合式函数", "doc_id": "905d9404bbdd43d490e8ca4732c36d8d", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1263, "chunk_index": 44, "_doc_id": "44_3591558657743901899"}}
{"doc_id": "45_687725853132639836", "text": "pan>id<span><span>}`<span><span>)<span><span><code><pre><div><p>我们可以用 <a href=\"/api/reactivity-core.html#watcheffect\"><code>watchEffect()<code><a> 和 <a href=\"/api/reactivity-utilities.html#tovalue\"><code>toValue()<code><a> API 来重构我们现有的实现：<p><div class=\"vp-code-block-title\"><p class=\"vp-code-block-title-bar\"><span class=\"vp-code-block-title-text\">fetch.", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/reusability/composables.html", "title": "组合式函数", "doc_id": "905d9404bbdd43d490e8ca4732c36d8d", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1263, "chunk_index": 45, "_doc_id": "45_687725853132639836"}}
{"doc_id": "46_430605421353036873", "text": "p-code-block-title\"><p class=\"vp-code-block-title-bar\"><span class=\"vp-code-block-title-text\">fetch.js<span><p><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>import<span><span> { ref, watchEffect, toValue } <span><span>from<span><span> 'vue'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> function<span><span> useFetch<span><span>(<span><span>url<span><span>) {<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/reusability/composables.html", "title": "组合式函数", "doc_id": "905d9404bbdd43d490e8ca4732c36d8d", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1263, "chunk_index": 46, "_doc_id": "46_430605421353036873"}}
{"doc_id": "47_833256414604089420", "text": "rt<span><span> function<span><span> useFetch<span><span>(<span><span>url<span><span>) {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> const<span><span> data<span><span> =<span><span> ref<span><span>(<span><span>null<span><span>)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> const<span><span> error<span><span> =<span><span> ref<span><span>(<span><span>null<span><span>)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/reusability/composables.html", "title": "组合式函数", "doc_id": "905d9404bbdd43d490e8ca4732c36d8d", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1263, "chunk_index": 47, "_doc_id": "47_833256414604089420"}}
{"doc_id": "48_6532499675383463527", "text": "> =<span><span> ref<span><span>(<span><span>null<span><span>)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line highlighted\"><span> const<span><span> fetchData<span><span> =<span><span> () <span><span>=><span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // reset state before fetching..<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> data.value <span><span>=<span><span> null<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> error.value <span><span>=<span><span> null<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/reusability/composables.html", "title": "组合式函数", "doc_id": "905d9404bbdd43d490e8ca4732c36d8d", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1263, "chunk_index": 48, "_doc_id": "48_6532499675383463527"}}
{"doc_id": "49_7836961692675498431", "text": "lass=\"line\"><span> error.value <span><span>=<span><span> null<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line highlighted\"><span> fetch<span><span>(<span><span>toValue<span><span>(url))<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> .<span><span>then<span><span>((<span><span>res<span><span>) <span><span>=><span><span> res.<span><span>json<span><span>())<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/reusability/composables.html", "title": "组合式函数", "doc_id": "905d9404bbdd43d490e8ca4732c36d8d", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1263, "chunk_index": 49, "_doc_id": "49_7836961692675498431"}}
{"doc_id": "50_5307774176487255235", "text": "n><span>res<span><span>) <span><span>=><span><span> res.<span><span>json<span><span>())<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> .<span><span>then<span><span>((<span><span>json<span><span>) <span><span>=><span><span> (data.value <span><span>=<span><span> json))<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> .<span><span>catch<span><span>((<span><span>err<span><span>) <span><span>=><span><span> (error.value <span><span>=<span><span> err))<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/reusability/composables.html", "title": "组合式函数", "doc_id": "905d9404bbdd43d490e8ca4732c36d8d", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1263, "chunk_index": 50, "_doc_id": "50_5307774176487255235"}}
{"doc_id": "51_9047596840494910470", "text": "n>=<span><span> err))<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> watchEffect<span><span>(() <span><span>=><span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> fetchData<span><span>()<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> })<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> return<span><span> { data, error }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span><code><pre><div><div><p><code>toValue()<code> 是一个在 3.3 版本中新增的 API。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/reusability/composables.html", "title": "组合式函数", "doc_id": "905d9404bbdd43d490e8ca4732c36d8d", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1263, "chunk_index": 51, "_doc_id": "51_9047596840494910470"}}
{"doc_id": "52_3201825017226479740", "text": "n class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span><code><pre><div><div><p><code>toValue()<code> 是一个在 3.3 版本中新增的 API。它的设计目的是将 ref 或 getter 规范化为值。如果参数是 ref，它会返回 ref 的值；如果参数是函数，它会调用函数并返回其返回值。否则，它会原样返回参数。它的工作方式类似于 <a href=\"/api/reactivity-utilities.html#unref\"><code>unref()<code><a>，但对函数有特殊处理。<p><p>注意 <code>toValue(url)<code> 是在 <code>watchEffect<code> 回调函数的<strong>内部<strong>调用的。这确保了在 <code>toValue()<code> 规范化期间访问的任何响应式依赖项都会被侦听器跟踪。<p><p>这个版本的 <code>useFetch()<code> 现在能接收静态 URL 字符串、ref 和 getter，使其更加灵活。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/reusability/composables.html", "title": "组合式函数", "doc_id": "905d9404bbdd43d490e8ca4732c36d8d", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1263, "chunk_index": 52, "_doc_id": "52_3201825017226479740"}}
{"doc_id": "53_7981095457476285452", "text": "de> 规范化期间访问的任何响应式依赖项都会被侦听器跟踪。<p><p>这个版本的 <code>useFetch()<code> 现在能接收静态 URL 字符串、ref 和 getter，使其更加灵活。watch effect 会立即运行，并且会跟踪 <code>toValue(url)<code> 期间访问的任何依赖项。如果没有跟踪到依赖项 (例如 url 已经是字符串)，则 effect 只会运行一次；否则，它将在跟踪到的任何依赖项更改时重新运行。<p><p>这是<a href=\"https://play.vuejs.org/#eNp9Vdtu20YQ/ZUpUUA0qpAOjL4YktCbC7Rom8BN8sSHrMihtfZql9iLZEHgv2dml6SpxMiDIWkuZ+acmR2fs1+7rjgEzG6zlaut7Dw49KHbVFruO2M9nMFiu4Ta7LvgsYEeWmv2sKCkxSwoOPwTfb2b/EU5mopHR5GVro12HrbC4UerYA2Lnfeduy3LR2d0p0SNO6MatIU/dbI2DRZUtPSmMa4kgJQuG8qkjvLF28XVaAwRb2wx", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/reusability/composables.html", "title": "组合式函数", "doc_id": "905d9404bbdd43d490e8ca4732c36d8d", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1263, "chunk_index": 53, "_doc_id": "53_7981095457476285452"}}
{"doc_id": "54_2674048546848608730", "text": "", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/reusability/composables.html", "title": "组合式函数", "doc_id": "905d9404bbdd43d490e8ca4732c36d8d", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1263, "chunk_index": 54, "_doc_id": "54_2674048546848608730"}}
{"doc_id": "55_411911089811691074", "text": "", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/reusability/composables.html", "title": "组合式函数", "doc_id": "905d9404bbdd43d490e8ca4732c36d8d", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1263, "chunk_index": 55, "_doc_id": "55_411911089811691074"}}
{"doc_id": "56_2262418578848554976", "text": "JOcjTXe+obScHwaAi82lo9dC/q/wuyINjrwbuC5uZrS4WAQeyTN9ftOXIVwy537iecoX92kR4q/F1UvqIMsSbq6vo5XF6ekCeEcTauVDFJpuQESvMv53IBXadx3r4KqMrt0w0kwoZY5/R5u3AZejvd5h/fSK/dE9s63K3vN7tQesssnnhX1An9x3//+Hz/R9cu5NExRFf8d5zyIF7jGF/RZ0Q23P4mK3f8XLRmfhg7t79qjdSIobjXLE+Cqju/b7d6i/tHtT3MQ8VrH/Ahstp5A=\" target=\"_blank\">更新后的 <code>useFetch()<code><a>，为了便于演示，添加了人为延迟和随机错误。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/reusability/composables.html", "title": "组合式函数", "doc_id": "905d9404bbdd43d490e8ca4732c36d8d", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1263, "chunk_index": 56, "_doc_id": "56_2262418578848554976"}}
{"doc_id": "57_2469967445909762540", "text": "Cqju/b7d6i/tHtT3MQ8VrH/Ahstp5A=\" target=\"_blank\">更新后的 <code>useFetch()<code><a>，为了便于演示，添加了人为延迟和随机错误。<p><h2 id=\"conventions-and-best-practices\">约定和最佳实践 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#conventions-and-best-practices\">​<a><h2><h3 id=\"naming\">命名 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#naming\">​<a><h3><p>组合式函数约定用驼峰命名法命名，并以“use”作为开头。<p><h3 id=\"input-arguments\">输入参数 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#input-arguments\">​<a><h3><p>即便不依赖于 ref 或 getter 的响应性，组合式函数也可以接收它们作为参数。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/reusability/composables.html", "title": "组合式函数", "doc_id": "905d9404bbdd43d490e8ca4732c36d8d", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1263, "chunk_index": 57, "_doc_id": "57_2469967445909762540"}}
{"doc_id": "58_5131283951938799070", "text": "class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#input-arguments\">​<a><h3><p>即便不依赖于 ref 或 getter 的响应性，组合式函数也可以接收它们作为参数。如果你正在编写一个可能被其他开发者使用的组合式函数，最好处理一下输入参数是 ref 或 getter 而非原始值的情况。可以利用 <a href=\"/api/reactivity-utilities.html#tovalue\"><code>toValue()<code><a> 工具函数来实现：<p><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>import<span><span> { toValue } <span><span>from<span><span> 'vue'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/reusability/composables.html", "title": "组合式函数", "doc_id": "905d9404bbdd43d490e8ca4732c36d8d", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1263, "chunk_index": 58, "_doc_id": "58_5131283951938799070"}}
{"doc_id": "59_2395215089892064427", "text": "rt<span><span> { toValue } <span><span>from<span><span> 'vue'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>function<span><span> useFeature<span><span>(<span><span>maybeRefOrGetter<span><span>) {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 如果 maybeRefOrGetter 是一个 ref 或 getter，<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 将返回它的规范化值。<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 否则原样返回。<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/reusability/composables.html", "title": "组合式函数", "doc_id": "905d9404bbdd43d490e8ca4732c36d8d", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1263, "chunk_index": 59, "_doc_id": "59_2395215089892064427"}}
{"doc_id": "60_3919981922212827771", "text": "span class=\"line\"><span> // 将返回它的规范化值。<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 否则原样返回。<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> const<span><span> value<span><span> =<span><span> toValue<span><span>(maybeRefOrGetter)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span><code><pre><div><p>如果你的组合式函数在输入参数是 ref 或 getter 的情况下创建了响应式 effect，为了让它能够被正确追踪，请确保要么使用 <code>watch()<code> 显式地监视 ref 或 getter，要么在 <code>watchEffect()<code> 中调用 <code>toValue()<code>。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/reusability/composables.html", "title": "组合式函数", "doc_id": "905d9404bbdd43d490e8ca4732c36d8d", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1263, "chunk_index": 60, "_doc_id": "60_3919981922212827771"}}
{"doc_id": "61_5982222763182358611", "text": "要么使用 <code>watch()<code> 显式地监视 ref 或 getter，要么在 <code>watchEffect()<code> 中调用 <code>toValue()<code>。<p><p><a href=\"#accepting-reactive-state\">前面讨论过的 useFetch() 实现<a>提供了一个接受 ref、getter 或普通值作为输入参数的组合式函数的具体示例。<p><h3 id=\"return-values\">返回值 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#return-values\">​<a><h3><p>你可能已经注意到了，我们一直在组合式函数中使用 <code>ref()<code> 而不是 <code>reactive()<code>。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/reusability/composables.html", "title": "组合式函数", "doc_id": "905d9404bbdd43d490e8ca4732c36d8d", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1263, "chunk_index": 61, "_doc_id": "61_5982222763182358611"}}
{"doc_id": "62_273390955220886806", "text": "ef=\"#return-values\">​<a><h3><p>你可能已经注意到了，我们一直在组合式函数中使用 <code>ref()<code> 而不是 <code>reactive()<code>。我们推荐的约定是组合式函数始终返回一个包含多个 ref 的普通的非响应式对象，这样该对象在组件中被解构为 ref 之后仍可以保持响应性：<p><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// x 和 y 是两个 ref<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/reusability/composables.html", "title": "组合式函数", "doc_id": "905d9404bbdd43d490e8ca4732c36d8d", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1263, "chunk_index": 62, "_doc_id": "62_273390955220886806"}}
{"doc_id": "63_1330107100301496429", "text": "><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// x 和 y 是两个 ref<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> { <span><span>x<span><span>, <span><span>y<span><span> } <span><span>=<span><span> useMouse<span><span>()<span><span><code><pre><div><p>从组合式函数返回一个响应式对象会导致在对象解构过程中丢失与组合式函数内状态的响应性连接。与之相反，ref 则可以维持这一响应性连接。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/reusability/composables.html", "title": "组合式函数", "doc_id": "905d9404bbdd43d490e8ca4732c36d8d", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1263, "chunk_index": 63, "_doc_id": "63_1330107100301496429"}}
{"doc_id": "64_2546825558767937527", "text": ">()<span><span><code><pre><div><p>从组合式函数返回一个响应式对象会导致在对象解构过程中丢失与组合式函数内状态的响应性连接。与之相反，ref 则可以维持这一响应性连接。<p><p>如果你更希望以对象属性的形式来使用组合式函数中返回的状态，你可以将返回的对象用 <code>reactive()<code> 包装一次，这样其中的 ref 会被自动解包，例如：<p><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> mouse<span><span> =<span><span> reactive<span><span>(<span><span>useMouse<span><span>())<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// mouse.x 链接到了原来的 x ref<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/reusability/composables.html", "title": "组合式函数", "doc_id": "905d9404bbdd43d490e8ca4732c36d8d", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1263, "chunk_index": 64, "_doc_id": "64_2546825558767937527"}}
{"doc_id": "65_7746980827904477513", "text": "n>useMouse<span><span>())<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// mouse.x 链接到了原来的 x ref<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>console.<span><span>log<span><span>(mouse.x)<span><span><code><pre><div><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>Mouse position is at: {{ mouse.x }}, {{ mouse.y }}<span><span><code><pre><div><h3 id=\"side-effects\">副作用 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#side-effects\">​<a><h3><p>在组合式函数中的确可以执行副作用 (例如：添加 DOM 事件监听器或者请求数据)，", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/reusability/composables.html", "title": "组合式函数", "doc_id": "905d9404bbdd43d490e8ca4732c36d8d", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1263, "chunk_index": 65, "_doc_id": "65_7746980827904477513"}}
{"doc_id": "66_6343510775512791048", "text": "用 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#side-effects\">​<a><h3><p>在组合式函数中的确可以执行副作用 (例如：添加 DOM 事件监听器或者请求数据)，但请注意以下规则：<p><ul><li><p>如果你的应用用到了<a href=\"/guide/scaling-up/ssr.html\">服务端渲染<a> (SSR)，请确保在组件挂载后才调用的生命周期钩子中执行 DOM 相关的副作用，例如：<code>onMounted()<code>。这些钩子仅会在浏览器中被调用，因此可以确保能访问到 DOM。<p><li><li><p>确保在 <code>onUnmounted()<code> 时清理副作用。举例来说，如果一个组合式函数设置了一个事件监听器，它就应该在 <code>onUnmounted()<code> 中被移除 (就像我们在 <code>useMouse()<code> 示例中看到的一样)。当然也可以像之前的 <code>useEventListener()<code> 示例那样，使用一个组合式函数来自动帮你做这些事。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/reusability/composables.html", "title": "组合式函数", "doc_id": "905d9404bbdd43d490e8ca4732c36d8d", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1263, "chunk_index": 66, "_doc_id": "66_6343510775512791048"}}
{"doc_id": "67_3692173275816274969", "text": "在 <code>useMouse()<code> 示例中看到的一样)。当然也可以像之前的 <code>useEventListener()<code> 示例那样，使用一个组合式函数来自动帮你做这些事。<p><li><ul><h3 id=\"usage-restrictions\">使用限制 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#usage-restrictions\">​<a><h3><p>组合式函数只能在 <code><script setup><code> 或 <code>setup()<code> 钩子中被调用。在这些上下文中，它们也只能被<strong>同步<strong>调用。在某些情况下，你也可以在像 <code>onMounted()<code> 这样的生命周期钩子中调用它们。<p><p>这些限制很重要，因为这些是 Vue 用于确定当前活跃的组件实例的上下文。访问活跃的组件实例很有必要，这样才能：<p><ol><li><p>将生命周期钩子注册到该组件实例上<p><li><li><p>将计算属性和监听器注册到该组件实例上，以便在该组件被卸载时停止监听，避免内存泄漏。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/reusability/composables.html", "title": "组合式函数", "doc_id": "905d9404bbdd43d490e8ca4732c36d8d", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1263, "chunk_index": 67, "_doc_id": "67_3692173275816274969"}}
{"doc_id": "68_5882736219967426741", "text": "的组件实例很有必要，这样才能：<p><ol><li><p>将生命周期钩子注册到该组件实例上<p><li><li><p>将计算属性和监听器注册到该组件实例上，以便在该组件被卸载时停止监听，避免内存泄漏。<p><li><ol><div class=\"tip custom-block\"><p class=\"custom-block-title\">TIP<p><p><code><script setup><code> 是唯一在调用 <code>await<code> <strong>之后<strong>仍可调用组合式函数的地方。编译器会在异步操作之后自动为你恢复当前的组件实例。<p><div><h2 id=\"extracting-composables-for-code-organization\">通过抽取组合式函数改善代码结构 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#extracting-composables-for-code-organization\">​<a><h2><p>抽取组合式函数不仅是为了复用，也是为了代码组织。随着组件复杂度的增高，你可能会最终发现组件多得难以查询和理解。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/reusability/composables.html", "title": "组合式函数", "doc_id": "905d9404bbdd43d490e8ca4732c36d8d", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1263, "chunk_index": 68, "_doc_id": "68_5882736219967426741"}}
{"doc_id": "69_1775578702472373271", "text": "omposables-for-code-organization\">​<a><h2><p>抽取组合式函数不仅是为了复用，也是为了代码组织。随着组件复杂度的增高，你可能会最终发现组件多得难以查询和理解。组合式 API 会给予你足够的灵活性，让你可以基于逻辑问题将组件代码拆分成更小的函数：<p><div class=\"language-vue\"> <span class=\"lang\">vue<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>script<span><span> setup<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>import<span><span> { useFeatureA } <span><span>from<span><span> './featureA.js'<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/reusability/composables.html", "title": "组合式函数", "doc_id": "905d9404bbdd43d490e8ca4732c36d8d", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1263, "chunk_index": 69, "_doc_id": "69_1775578702472373271"}}
{"doc_id": "70_6269961318611715010", "text": "\"><span>import<span><span> { useFeatureA } <span><span>from<span><span> './featureA.js'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>import<span><span> { useFeatureB } <span><span>from<span><span> './featureB.js'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>import<span><span> { useFeatureC } <span><span>from<span><span> './featureC.js'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/reusability/composables.html", "title": "组合式函数", "doc_id": "905d9404bbdd43d490e8ca4732c36d8d", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1263, "chunk_index": 70, "_doc_id": "70_6269961318611715010"}}
{"doc_id": "71_4611284842490079050", "text": "{ useFeatureC } <span><span>from<span><span> './featureC.js'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> { <span><span>foo<span><span>, <span><span>bar<span><span> } <span><span>=<span><span> useFeatureA<span><span>()<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> { <span><span>baz<span><span> } <span><span>=<span><span> useFeatureB<span><span>(foo)<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/reusability/composables.html", "title": "组合式函数", "doc_id": "905d9404bbdd43d490e8ca4732c36d8d", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1263, "chunk_index": 71, "_doc_id": "71_4611284842490079050"}}
{"doc_id": "72_3625886597960807421", "text": "{ <span><span>baz<span><span> } <span><span>=<span><span> useFeatureB<span><span>(foo)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> { <span><span>qux<span><span> } <span><span>=<span><span> useFeatureC<span><span>(baz)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>script<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>在某种程度上，你可以将这些提取出的组合式函数看作是可以相互通信的组件范围内的服务。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/reusability/composables.html", "title": "组合式函数", "doc_id": "905d9404bbdd43d490e8ca4732c36d8d", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1263, "chunk_index": 72, "_doc_id": "72_3625886597960807421"}}
{"doc_id": "73_2888896990343657556", "text": "an><span>script<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>在某种程度上，你可以将这些提取出的组合式函数看作是可以相互通信的组件范围内的服务。<p><h2 id=\"using-composables-in-options-api\">在选项式 API 中使用组合式函数 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#using-composables-in-options-api\">​<a><h2><p>如果你正在使用选项式 API，组合式函数必须在 <code>setup()<code> 中调用。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/reusability/composables.html", "title": "组合式函数", "doc_id": "905d9404bbdd43d490e8ca4732c36d8d", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1263, "chunk_index": 73, "_doc_id": "73_2888896990343657556"}}
{"doc_id": "74_9175962782806008139", "text": "href=\"#using-composables-in-options-api\">​<a><h2><p>如果你正在使用选项式 API，组合式函数必须在 <code>setup()<code> 中调用。且其返回的绑定必须在 <code>setup()<code> 中返回，以便暴露给 <code>this<code> 及其模板：<p><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>import<span><span> { useMouse } <span><span>from<span><span> './mouse.js'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>import<span><span> { useFetch } <span><span>from<span><span> './fetch.js'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/reusability/composables.html", "title": "组合式函数", "doc_id": "905d9404bbdd43d490e8ca4732c36d8d", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1263, "chunk_index": 74, "_doc_id": "74_9175962782806008139"}}
{"doc_id": "75_6864817038471051148", "text": "<span> { useFetch } <span><span>from<span><span> './fetch.js'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> setup<span><span>() {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> const<span><span> { <span><span>x<span><span>, <span><span>y<span><span> } <span><span>=<span><span> useMouse<span><span>()<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/reusability/composables.html", "title": "组合式函数", "doc_id": "905d9404bbdd43d490e8ca4732c36d8d", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1263, "chunk_index": 75, "_doc_id": "75_6864817038471051148"}}
{"doc_id": "76_4099952000819616056", "text": "an><span>, <span><span>y<span><span> } <span><span>=<span><span> useMouse<span><span>()<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> const<span><span> { <span><span>data<span><span>, <span><span>error<span><span> } <span><span>=<span><span> useFetch<span><span>(<span><span>'...'<span><span>)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> return<span><span> { x, y, data, error }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> },<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> mounted<span><span>() {<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/reusability/composables.html", "title": "组合式函数", "doc_id": "905d9404bbdd43d490e8ca4732c36d8d", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1263, "chunk_index": 76, "_doc_id": "76_4099952000819616056"}}
{"doc_id": "77_38320362631925842", "text": "an class=\"line\"><span> },<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> mounted<span><span>() {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // setup() 暴露的属性可以在通过 `this` 访问到<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> console.<span><span>log<span><span>(<span><span>this<span><span>.x)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // ...其他选项<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/reusability/composables.html", "title": "组合式函数", "doc_id": "905d9404bbdd43d490e8ca4732c36d8d", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1263, "chunk_index": 77, "_doc_id": "77_38320362631925842"}}
{"doc_id": "78_5700109037037057365", "text": "pan><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // ...其他选项<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span><code><pre><div><h2 id=\"comparisons-with-other-techniques\">与其他模式的比较 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#comparisons-with-other-techniques\">​<a><h2><h3 id=\"vs-mixins\">和 Mixin 的对比 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#vs-mixins\">​<a><h3><p>Vue 2 的用户可能会对 <a href=\"/api/options-composition.html#mixins\">mixins<a> 选项比较熟悉。它也让我们能够把组件逻辑提取到可复用的单元里。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/reusability/composables.html", "title": "组合式函数", "doc_id": "905d9404bbdd43d490e8ca4732c36d8d", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1263, "chunk_index": 78, "_doc_id": "78_5700109037037057365"}}
{"doc_id": "79_5080123897646010684", "text": "ue 2 的用户可能会对 <a href=\"/api/options-composition.html#mixins\">mixins<a> 选项比较熟悉。它也让我们能够把组件逻辑提取到可复用的单元里。然而 mixins 有三个主要的短板：<p><ol><li><p><strong>不清晰的数据来源<strong>：当使用了多个 mixin 时，实例上的数据属性来自哪个 mixin 变得不清晰，这使追溯实现和理解组件行为变得困难。这也是我们推荐在组合式函数中使用 ref + 解构模式的理由：让属性的来源在消费组件时一目了然。<p><li><li><p><strong>命名空间冲突<strong>：多个来自不同作者的 mixin 可能会注册相同的属性名，造成命名冲突。若使用组合式函数，你可以通过在解构变量时对变量进行重命名来避免相同的键名。<p><li><li><p><strong>隐式的跨 mixin 交流<strong>：多个 mixin 需要依赖共享的属性名来进行相互作用，这使得它们隐性地耦合在一起。而一个组合式函数的返回值可以作为另一个组合式函数的参数被传入，像普通函数那样。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/reusability/composables.html", "title": "组合式函数", "doc_id": "905d9404bbdd43d490e8ca4732c36d8d", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1263, "chunk_index": 79, "_doc_id": "79_5080123897646010684"}}
{"doc_id": "80_4821228682190819331", "text": "的跨 mixin 交流<strong>：多个 mixin 需要依赖共享的属性名来进行相互作用，这使得它们隐性地耦合在一起。而一个组合式函数的返回值可以作为另一个组合式函数的参数被传入，像普通函数那样。<p><li><ol><p>基于上述理由，我们不再推荐在 Vue 3 中继续使用 mixin。保留该功能只是为了项目迁移的需求和照顾熟悉它的用户。<p><h3 id=\"vs-renderless-components\">和无渲染组件的对比 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#vs-renderless-components\">​<a><h3><p>在组件插槽一章中，我们讨论过了基于作用域插槽的<a href=\"/guide/components/slots.html#renderless-components\">无渲染组件<a>。我们甚至用它实现了一样的鼠标追踪器示例。<p><p>组合式函数相对于无渲染组件的主要优势是：组合式函数不会产生额外的组件实例开销。当在整个应用中使用时，由无渲染组件产生的额外组件实例会带来无法忽视的性能开销。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/reusability/composables.html", "title": "组合式函数", "doc_id": "905d9404bbdd43d490e8ca4732c36d8d", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1263, "chunk_index": 80, "_doc_id": "80_4821228682190819331"}}
{"doc_id": "81_1043122677701176133", "text": "用它实现了一样的鼠标追踪器示例。<p><p>组合式函数相对于无渲染组件的主要优势是：组合式函数不会产生额外的组件实例开销。当在整个应用中使用时，由无渲染组件产生的额外组件实例会带来无法忽视的性能开销。<p><p>我们推荐在纯逻辑复用时使用组合式函数，在需要同时复用逻辑和视图布局时使用无渲染组件。<p><h3 id=\"vs-react-hooks\">和 React Hooks 的对比 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#vs-react-hooks\">​<a><h3><p>如果你有 React 的开发经验，你可能注意到组合式函数和自定义 React hooks 非常相似。组合式 API 的一部分灵感正来自于 React hooks，Vue 的组合式函数也的确在逻辑组合能力上与 React hooks 相近。然而，Vue 的组合式函数是基于 Vue 细粒度的响应性系统，这和 React hooks 的执行模型有本质上的不同。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/reusability/composables.html", "title": "组合式函数", "doc_id": "905d9404bbdd43d490e8ca4732c36d8d", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1263, "chunk_index": 81, "_doc_id": "81_1043122677701176133"}}
{"doc_id": "82_8622037736974326919", "text": "ks，Vue 的组合式函数也的确在逻辑组合能力上与 React hooks 相近。然而，Vue 的组合式函数是基于 Vue 细粒度的响应性系统，这和 React hooks 的执行模型有本质上的不同。这一话题在<a href=\"/guide/extras/composition-api-faq.html#comparison-with-react-hooks\">组合式 API 的常见问题<a>中有更细致的讨论。<p><h2 id=\"further-reading\">延伸阅读 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#further-reading\">​<a><h2><div><div>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/reusability/composables.html", "title": "组合式函数", "doc_id": "905d9404bbdd43d490e8ca4732c36d8d", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1263, "chunk_index": 82, "_doc_id": "82_8622037736974326919"}}
{"doc_id": "0_7997277426200407516", "text": "<div><div><h1 id=\"props\">Props <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#props\">​<a><h1><blockquote><p>此章节假设你已经看过了<a href=\"/guide/essentials/component-basics.html\">组件基础<a>。若你还不了解组件是什么，请先阅读该章节。<p><blockquote><h2 id=\"props-declaration\">Props 声明 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#props-declaration\">​<a><h2><p>一个组件需要显式声明它所接受的 props，这样 Vue 才能知道外部传入的哪些是 props，哪些是透传 attribute (关于透传 attribute，我们会在<a href=\"/guide/components/attrs.html\">专门的章节<a>中讨论)。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/props.html", "title": "Props | Vue.js", "doc_id": "ebb453dcdec64a55bfea3d6e485077a7", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 2081, "chunk_index": 0, "_doc_id": "0_7997277426200407516"}}
{"doc_id": "1_4659166209906717205", "text": "入的哪些是 props，哪些是透传 attribute (关于透传 attribute，我们会在<a href=\"/guide/components/attrs.html\">专门的章节<a>中讨论)。<p><div class=\"composition-api\"><p>在使用 <code><script setup><code> 的单文件组件中，props 可以使用 <code>defineProps()<code> 宏来声明：<p><div class=\"language-vue\"> <span class=\"lang\">vue<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>script<span><span> setup<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/props.html", "title": "Props | Vue.js", "doc_id": "ebb453dcdec64a55bfea3d6e485077a7", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 2081, "chunk_index": 1, "_doc_id": "1_4659166209906717205"}}
{"doc_id": "2_4811252791999850582", "text": "code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>script<span><span> setup<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> props<span><span> =<span><span> defineProps<span><span>([<span><span>'foo'<span><span>])<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>console.<span><span>log<span><span>(props.foo)<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/props.html", "title": "Props | Vue.js", "doc_id": "ebb453dcdec64a55bfea3d6e485077a7", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 2081, "chunk_index": 2, "_doc_id": "2_4811252791999850582"}}
{"doc_id": "3_5069749877813421686", "text": "s=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>console.<span><span>log<span><span>(props.foo)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>script<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>在没有使用 <code><script setup><code> 的组件中，props 可以使用 <a href=\"/api/options-state.html#props\"><code>props<code><a> 选项来声明：<p><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/props.html", "title": "Props | Vue.js", "doc_id": "ebb453dcdec64a55bfea3d6e485077a7", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 2081, "chunk_index": 3, "_doc_id": "3_5069749877813421686"}}
{"doc_id": "4_163794263408574210", "text": "b-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> props: [<span><span>'foo'<span><span>],<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> setup<span><span>(<span><span>props<span><span>) {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // setup() 接收 props 作为第一个参数<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> console.<span><span>log<span><span>(props.foo)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/props.html", "title": "Props | Vue.js", "doc_id": "ebb453dcdec64a55bfea3d6e485077a7", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 2081, "chunk_index": 4, "_doc_id": "4_163794263408574210"}}
{"doc_id": "5_3963795509999203630", "text": "console.<span><span>log<span><span>(props.foo)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span><code><pre><div><p>注意传递给 <code>defineProps()<code> 的参数和提供给 <code>props<code> 选项的值是相同的，两种声明方式背后其实使用的都是 props 选项。<p><div><div class=\"options-api\"><p>props 需要使用 <a href=\"/api/options-state.html#props\"><code>props<code><a> 选项来定义：<p><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/props.html", "title": "Props | Vue.js", "doc_id": "ebb453dcdec64a55bfea3d6e485077a7", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 2081, "chunk_index": 5, "_doc_id": "5_3963795509999203630"}}
{"doc_id": "6_4909558168512893725", "text": "b-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> props: [<span><span>'foo'<span><span>],<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> created<span><span>() {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // props 会暴露到 `this` 上<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> console.<span><span>log<span><span>(<span><span>this<span><span>.foo)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/props.html", "title": "Props | Vue.js", "doc_id": "ebb453dcdec64a55bfea3d6e485077a7", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 2081, "chunk_index": 6, "_doc_id": "6_4909558168512893725"}}
{"doc_id": "7_263801264527123905", "text": "g<span><span>(<span><span>this<span><span>.foo)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span><code><pre><div><div><p>除了使用字符串数组来声明 props 外，还可以使用对象的形式：<p><div class=\"options-api\"><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> props: {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> title: String,<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/props.html", "title": "Props | Vue.js", "doc_id": "ebb453dcdec64a55bfea3d6e485077a7", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 2081, "chunk_index": 7, "_doc_id": "7_263801264527123905"}}
{"doc_id": "8_8220426314726599309", "text": "<span class=\"line\"><span> props: {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> title: String,<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> likes: Number<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span><code><pre><div><div><div class=\"composition-api\"><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// 使用 <script setup><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>defineProps<span><span>({<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/props.html", "title": "Props | Vue.js", "doc_id": "ebb453dcdec64a55bfea3d6e485077a7", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 2081, "chunk_index": 8, "_doc_id": "8_8220426314726599309"}}
{"doc_id": "9_2107444144207970623", "text": "pan>// 使用 <script setup><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>defineProps<span><span>({<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> title: String,<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> likes: Number<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>})<span><span><code><pre><div><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// 非 <script setup><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/props.html", "title": "Props | Vue.js", "doc_id": "ebb453dcdec64a55bfea3d6e485077a7", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 2081, "chunk_index": 9, "_doc_id": "9_2107444144207970623"}}
{"doc_id": "10_4887208757082729855", "text": "pt setup><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> props: {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> title: String,<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> likes: Number<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span><code><pre><div><div><p>对于以对象形式声明的每个属性，key 是 prop 的名称，而值则是该 prop 预期类型的构造函数。比如，如果要求一个 prop 的值是 <code>number<code> 类型，则可使用 <code>Number<code> 构造函数作为其声明的值。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/props.html", "title": "Props | Vue.js", "doc_id": "ebb453dcdec64a55bfea3d6e485077a7", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 2081, "chunk_index": 10, "_doc_id": "10_4887208757082729855"}}
{"doc_id": "11_1803987137704775905", "text": "称，而值则是该 prop 预期类型的构造函数。比如，如果要求一个 prop 的值是 <code>number<code> 类型，则可使用 <code>Number<code> 构造函数作为其声明的值。<p><p>对象形式的 props 声明不仅可以一定程度上作为组件的文档，而且如果其他开发者在使用你的组件时传递了错误的类型，也会在浏览器控制台中抛出警告。我们将在本章节稍后进一步讨论有关 <a href=\"#prop-validation\">prop 校验<a>的更多细节。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/props.html", "title": "Props | Vue.js", "doc_id": "ebb453dcdec64a55bfea3d6e485077a7", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 2081, "chunk_index": 11, "_doc_id": "11_1803987137704775905"}}
{"doc_id": "12_4622268638747681917", "text": "且如果其他开发者在使用你的组件时传递了错误的类型，也会在浏览器控制台中抛出警告。我们将在本章节稍后进一步讨论有关 <a href=\"#prop-validation\">prop 校验<a>的更多细节。<p><div class=\"composition-api\"><p>如果你正在搭配 TypeScript 使用 <code><script setup><code>，也可以使用类型标注来声明 props：<p><div class=\"language-vue\"> <span class=\"lang\">vue<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>script<span><span> setup<span><span> lang<span><span>=<span><span>\"ts\"<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>defineProps<span><span><{<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/props.html", "title": "Props | Vue.js", "doc_id": "ebb453dcdec64a55bfea3d6e485077a7", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 2081, "chunk_index": 12, "_doc_id": "12_4622268638747681917"}}
{"doc_id": "13_5661751846730669640", "text": "><span>\"ts\"<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>defineProps<span><span><{<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> title<span><span>?:<span><span> string<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> likes<span><span>?:<span><span> number<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}>()<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>script<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>更多关于基于类型的声明的细节请参考<a href=\"/guide/typescript/composition-api.html#typing-component-props\">组件 props 类型标注<a>。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/props.html", "title": "Props | Vue.js", "doc_id": "ebb453dcdec64a55bfea3d6e485077a7", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 2081, "chunk_index": 13, "_doc_id": "13_5661751846730669640"}}
{"doc_id": "14_2349806029128496365", "text": "类型的声明的细节请参考<a href=\"/guide/typescript/composition-api.html#typing-component-props\">组件 props 类型标注<a>。 <p><div><div class=\"composition-api\"><h2 id=\"reactive-props-destructure\">响应式 Props 解构 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#reactive-props-destructure\" class=\"vt-badge\">​<a><h2><p>Vue 的响应系统基于属性访问跟踪状态的使用情况。例如，在计算属性或侦听器中访问 <code>props.foo<code> 时，<code>foo<code> 属性将被跟踪为依赖项。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/props.html", "title": "Props | Vue.js", "doc_id": "ebb453dcdec64a55bfea3d6e485077a7", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 2081, "chunk_index": 14, "_doc_id": "14_2349806029128496365"}}
{"doc_id": "15_7046958154009306974", "text": "><h2><p>Vue 的响应系统基于属性访问跟踪状态的使用情况。例如，在计算属性或侦听器中访问 <code>props.foo<code> 时，<code>foo<code> 属性将被跟踪为依赖项。<p><p>因此，在以下代码的情况下：<p><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> { <span><span>foo<span><span> } <span><span>=<span><span> defineProps<span><span>([<span><span>'foo'<span><span>])<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>watchEffect<span><span>(() <span><span>=><span><span> {<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/props.html", "title": "Props | Vue.js", "doc_id": "ebb453dcdec64a55bfea3d6e485077a7", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 2081, "chunk_index": 15, "_doc_id": "15_7046958154009306974"}}
{"doc_id": "16_7863464839228601081", "text": "<span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>watchEffect<span><span>(() <span><span>=><span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 在 3.5 之前只运行一次<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 在 3.5+ 中在 \"foo\" prop 变化时重新执行<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> console.<span><span>log<span><span>(foo)<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/props.html", "title": "Props | Vue.js", "doc_id": "ebb453dcdec64a55bfea3d6e485077a7", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 2081, "chunk_index": 16, "_doc_id": "16_7863464839228601081"}}
{"doc_id": "17_6505616375189088236", "text": "变化时重新执行<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> console.<span><span>log<span><span>(foo)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>})<span><span><code><pre><div><p>在 3.4 及以下版本，<code>foo<code> 是一个实际的常量，永远不会改变。在 3.5 及以上版本，当在同一个 <code><script setup><code> 代码块中访问由 <code>defineProps<code> 解构的变量时，Vue 编译器会自动在前面添加 <code>props.<code>。因此，上面的代码等同于以下代码：<p><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> props<span><span> =<span><span> defineProps<span><span>([<span><span>'foo'<span><span>])<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/props.html", "title": "Props | Vue.js", "doc_id": "ebb453dcdec64a55bfea3d6e485077a7", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 2081, "chunk_index": 17, "_doc_id": "17_6505616375189088236"}}
{"doc_id": "18_2836336191603754990", "text": "rops<span><span> =<span><span> defineProps<span><span>([<span><span>'foo'<span><span>])<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>watchEffect<span><span>(() <span><span>=><span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // `foo` 由编译器转换为 `props.foo`<span><span>\n<span class=\"line highlighted\"><span> console.<span><span>log<span><span>(props.foo)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>})<span><span><code><pre><div><p>此外，你可以使用 JavaScript 原生的默认值语法声明 props 默认值。这在使用基于类型的 props 声明时特别有用。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/props.html", "title": "Props | Vue.js", "doc_id": "ebb453dcdec64a55bfea3d6e485077a7", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 2081, "chunk_index": 18, "_doc_id": "18_2836336191603754990"}}
{"doc_id": "19_1978996945073355891", "text": "n>})<span><span><code><pre><div><p>此外，你可以使用 JavaScript 原生的默认值语法声明 props 默认值。这在使用基于类型的 props 声明时特别有用。<p><div class=\"language-ts\"> <span class=\"lang\">ts<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> { <span><span>foo<span><span> =<span><span> 'hello'<span><span> } <span><span>=<span><span> defineProps<span><span><{ <span><span>foo<span><span>?:<span><span> string<span><span> }>()<span><span><code><pre><div><p>如果你希望在 IDE 中在解构的 props 和普通变量之间有更多视觉上的区分，Vue 的 VSCode 扩展提供了一个设置来启用解构 props 的内联提示。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/props.html", "title": "Props | Vue.js", "doc_id": "ebb453dcdec64a55bfea3d6e485077a7", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 2081, "chunk_index": 19, "_doc_id": "19_1978996945073355891"}}
{"doc_id": "20_5194110621831335949", "text": "><code><pre><div><p>如果你希望在 IDE 中在解构的 props 和普通变量之间有更多视觉上的区分，Vue 的 VSCode 扩展提供了一个设置来启用解构 props 的内联提示。<p><h3 id=\"passing-destructured-props-into-functions\">将解构的 props 传递到函数中 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#passing-destructured-props-into-functions\">​<a><h3><p>当我们将解构的 prop 传递到函数中时，例如：<p><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> { <span><span>foo<span><span> } <span><span>=<span><span> defineProps<span><span>([<span><span>'foo'<span><span>])<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/props.html", "title": "Props | Vue.js", "doc_id": "ebb453dcdec64a55bfea3d6e485077a7", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 2081, "chunk_index": 20, "_doc_id": "20_5194110621831335949"}}
{"doc_id": "21_4915098720332868545", "text": "n> } <span><span>=<span><span> defineProps<span><span>([<span><span>'foo'<span><span>])<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>watch<span><span>(foo, <span><span>/* ... */<span><span>)<span><span><code><pre><div><p>这并不会按预期工作，因为它等价于 <code>watch(props.foo, ...)<code>——我们给 <code>watch<code> 传递的是一个值而不是响应式数据源。实际上，Vue 的编译器会捕捉这种情况并发出警告。<p><p>与使用 <code>watch(() => props.foo, ...)<code> 来侦听普通 prop 类似，", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/props.html", "title": "Props | Vue.js", "doc_id": "ebb453dcdec64a55bfea3d6e485077a7", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 2081, "chunk_index": 21, "_doc_id": "21_4915098720332868545"}}
{"doc_id": "22_2174990024158954778", "text": "值而不是响应式数据源。实际上，Vue 的编译器会捕捉这种情况并发出警告。<p><p>与使用 <code>watch(() => props.foo, ...)<code> 来侦听普通 prop 类似，我们也可以通过将其包装在 getter 中来侦听解构的 prop：<p><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>watch<span><span>(() <span><span>=><span><span> foo, <span><span>/* ... */<span><span>)<span><span><code><pre><div><p>此外，当我们需要传递解构的 prop 到外部函数中并保持响应性时，", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/props.html", "title": "Props | Vue.js", "doc_id": "ebb453dcdec64a55bfea3d6e485077a7", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 2081, "chunk_index": 22, "_doc_id": "22_2174990024158954778"}}
{"doc_id": "23_4550515833432324059", "text": ", <span><span>/* ... */<span><span>)<span><span><code><pre><div><p>此外，当我们需要传递解构的 prop 到外部函数中并保持响应性时，这是推荐做法：<p><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>useComposable<span><span>(() <span><span>=><span><span> foo)<span><span><code><pre><div><p>外部函数可以调用 getter (或使用 <a href=\"/api/reactivity-utilities.html#tovalue\">toValue<a> 进行规范化) 来追踪提供的 prop 变更。例如，在计算属性或侦听器的 getter 中。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/props.html", "title": "Props | Vue.js", "doc_id": "ebb453dcdec64a55bfea3d6e485077a7", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 2081, "chunk_index": 23, "_doc_id": "23_4550515833432324059"}}
{"doc_id": "24_1708679417015848443", "text": "ef=\"/api/reactivity-utilities.html#tovalue\">toValue<a> 进行规范化) 来追踪提供的 prop 变更。例如，在计算属性或侦听器的 getter 中。<p><div><h2 id=\"prop-passing-details\">传递 prop 的细节 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#prop-passing-details\">​<a><h2><h3 id=\"prop-name-casing\">Prop 名字格式 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#prop-name-casing\">​<a><h3><p>如果一个 prop 的名字很长，应使用 camelCase 形式，因为它们是合法的 JavaScript 标识符，可以直接在模板的表达式中使用，也可以避免在作为属性 key 名时必须加上引号。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/props.html", "title": "Props | Vue.js", "doc_id": "ebb453dcdec64a55bfea3d6e485077a7", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 2081, "chunk_index": 24, "_doc_id": "24_1708679417015848443"}}
{"doc_id": "25_8318734424024361059", "text": "><p>如果一个 prop 的名字很长，应使用 camelCase 形式，因为它们是合法的 JavaScript 标识符，可以直接在模板的表达式中使用，也可以避免在作为属性 key 名时必须加上引号。<p><div class=\"composition-api\"><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>defineProps<span><span>({<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> greetingMessage: String<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/props.html", "title": "Props | Vue.js", "doc_id": "ebb453dcdec64a55bfea3d6e485077a7", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 2081, "chunk_index": 25, "_doc_id": "25_8318734424024361059"}}
{"doc_id": "26_7585280665598674252", "text": "defineProps<span><span>({<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> greetingMessage: String<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>})<span><span><code><pre><div><div><div class=\"options-api\"><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> props: {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> greetingMessage: String<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/props.html", "title": "Props | Vue.js", "doc_id": "ebb453dcdec64a55bfea3d6e485077a7", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 2081, "chunk_index": 26, "_doc_id": "26_7585280665598674252"}}
{"doc_id": "27_8659111333416015951", "text": "pan class=\"line\"><span> greetingMessage: String<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span><code><pre><div><div><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>span<span><span>>{{ greetingMessage }}</<span><span>span<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>虽然理论上你也可以在向子组件传递 props 时使用 camelCase 形式 (使用 <a href=\"/guide/essentials/component-basics.html#in-dom-template-parsing-caveats\">DOM 内模板<a>时例外)，", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/props.html", "title": "Props | Vue.js", "doc_id": "ebb453dcdec64a55bfea3d6e485077a7", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 2081, "chunk_index": 27, "_doc_id": "27_8659111333416015951"}}
{"doc_id": "28_3580301065877768917", "text": "使用 <a href=\"/guide/essentials/component-basics.html#in-dom-template-parsing-caveats\">DOM 内模板<a>时例外)，但实际上为了和 HTML attribute 对齐，", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/props.html", "title": "Props | Vue.js", "doc_id": "ebb453dcdec64a55bfea3d6e485077a7", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 2081, "chunk_index": 28, "_doc_id": "28_3580301065877768917"}}
{"doc_id": "29_2660342272239121685", "text": "als/component-basics.html#in-dom-template-parsing-caveats\">DOM 内模板<a>时例外)，但实际上为了和 HTML attribute 对齐，我们通常会将其写为 kebab-case 形式：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>MyComponent<span><span> greeting-message<span><span>=<span><span>\"hello\"<span><span> /><span><span><code><pre><div><p>对于组件名我们推荐使用 <a href=\"/guide/components/registration.html#component-name-casing\">PascalCase<a>，因为这提高了模板的可读性，", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/props.html", "title": "Props | Vue.js", "doc_id": "ebb453dcdec64a55bfea3d6e485077a7", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 2081, "chunk_index": 29, "_doc_id": "29_2660342272239121685"}}
{"doc_id": "30_7584928141687209251", "text": "推荐使用 <a href=\"/guide/components/registration.html#component-name-casing\">PascalCase<a>，因为这提高了模板的可读性，能帮助我们区分 Vue 组件和原生 HTML 元素。然而对于传递 props 来说，使用 camelCase 并没有太多优势，因此我们推荐更贴近 HTML 的书写风格。<p><h3 id=\"static-vs-dynamic-props\">静态 vs. 动态 Props <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#static-vs-dynamic-props\">​<a><h3><p>至此，", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/props.html", "title": "Props | Vue.js", "doc_id": "ebb453dcdec64a55bfea3d6e485077a7", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 2081, "chunk_index": 30, "_doc_id": "30_7584928141687209251"}}
{"doc_id": "31_7614672280641776723", "text": "namic-props\">静态 vs. 动态 Props <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#static-vs-dynamic-props\">​<a><h3><p>至此，你已经见过了很多像这样的静态值形式的 props：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>BlogPost<span><span> title<span><span>=<span><span>\"My journey with Vue\"<span><span> /><span><span><code><pre><div><p>相应地，", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/props.html", "title": "Props | Vue.js", "doc_id": "ebb453dcdec64a55bfea3d6e485077a7", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 2081, "chunk_index": 31, "_doc_id": "31_7614672280641776723"}}
{"doc_id": "32_7070257695235280248", "text": "itle<span><span>=<span><span>\"My journey with Vue\"<span><span> /><span><span><code><pre><div><p>相应地，还有使用 <code>v-bind<code> 或缩写 <code>:<code> 来进行动态绑定的 props：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><!-- 根据一个变量的值动态传入 --><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>BlogPost<span><span> :<span><span>title<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>post.title<span><span>\"<span><span> /><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/props.html", "title": "Props | Vue.js", "doc_id": "ebb453dcdec64a55bfea3d6e485077a7", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 2081, "chunk_index": 32, "_doc_id": "32_7070257695235280248"}}
{"doc_id": "33_4535813765226963238", "text": "<span>title<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>post.title<span><span>\"<span><span> /><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><!-- 根据一个更复杂表达式的值动态传入 --><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/props.html", "title": "Props | Vue.js", "doc_id": "ebb453dcdec64a55bfea3d6e485077a7", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 2081, "chunk_index": 33, "_doc_id": "33_4535813765226963238"}}
{"doc_id": "34_1564634446268682097", "text": "pan><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><!-- 根据一个更复杂表达式的值动态传入 --><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>BlogPost<span><span> :<span><span>title<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>post.title <span><span>+<span><span> ' by '<span><span> +<span><span> post.author.name<span><span>\"<span><span> /><span><span><code><pre><div><h3 id=\"passing-different-value-types\">传递不同的值类型 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#passing-different-value-types\">​<a><h3><p>在上述的两个例子中，我们只传入了字符串值，但实际上<strong>任何<strong>类型的值都可以作为 props 的值被传递。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/props.html", "title": "Props | Vue.js", "doc_id": "ebb453dcdec64a55bfea3d6e485077a7", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 2081, "chunk_index": 34, "_doc_id": "34_1564634446268682097"}}
{"doc_id": "35_6787612195849415998", "text": "-different-value-types\">​<a><h3><p>在上述的两个例子中，我们只传入了字符串值，但实际上<strong>任何<strong>类型的值都可以作为 props 的值被传递。<p><h4 id=\"number\">Number <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#number\">​<a><h4><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><!-- 虽然 `42` 是个常量，我们还是需要使用 v-bind --><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><!-- 因为这是一个 JavaScript 表达式而不是一个字符串 --><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/props.html", "title": "Props | Vue.js", "doc_id": "ebb453dcdec64a55bfea3d6e485077a7", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 2081, "chunk_index": 35, "_doc_id": "35_6787612195849415998"}}
{"doc_id": "36_520065462401553536", "text": "v-bind --><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><!-- 因为这是一个 JavaScript 表达式而不是一个字符串 --><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>BlogPost<span><span> :<span><span>likes<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>42<span><span>\"<span><span> /><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><!-- 根据一个变量的值动态传入 --><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/props.html", "title": "Props | Vue.js", "doc_id": "ebb453dcdec64a55bfea3d6e485077a7", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 2081, "chunk_index": 36, "_doc_id": "36_520065462401553536"}}
{"doc_id": "37_275972917196062007", "text": "/><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><!-- 根据一个变量的值动态传入 --><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>BlogPost<span><span> :<span><span>likes<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>post.likes<span><span>\"<span><span> /><span><span><code><pre><div><h4 id=\"boolean\">Boolean <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#boolean\">​<a><h4><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><!-- 仅写上 prop 但不传值，会隐式转换为 `true` --><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/props.html", "title": "Props | Vue.js", "doc_id": "ebb453dcdec64a55bfea3d6e485077a7", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 2081, "chunk_index": 37, "_doc_id": "37_275972917196062007"}}
{"doc_id": "38_3931468284517535968", "text": "ithub-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><!-- 仅写上 prop 但不传值，会隐式转换为 `true` --><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>BlogPost<span><span> is-published<span><span> /><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><!-- 虽然 `false` 是静态的值，我们还是需要使用 v-bind --><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><!-- 因为这是一个 JavaScript 表达式而不是一个字符串 --><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/props.html", "title": "Props | Vue.js", "doc_id": "ebb453dcdec64a55bfea3d6e485077a7", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 2081, "chunk_index": 38, "_doc_id": "38_3931468284517535968"}}
{"doc_id": "39_5528812262561389940", "text": "v-bind --><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><!-- 因为这是一个 JavaScript 表达式而不是一个字符串 --><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>BlogPost<span><span> :<span><span>is-published<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>false<span><span>\"<span><span> /><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><!-- 根据一个变量的值动态传入 --><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/props.html", "title": "Props | Vue.js", "doc_id": "ebb453dcdec64a55bfea3d6e485077a7", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 2081, "chunk_index": 39, "_doc_id": "39_5528812262561389940"}}
{"doc_id": "40_6546181014830212284", "text": "/><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><!-- 根据一个变量的值动态传入 --><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>BlogPost<span><span> :<span><span>is-published<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>post.isPublished<span><span>\"<span><span> /><span><span><code><pre><div><h4 id=\"array\">Array <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#array\">​<a><h4><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><!-- 虽然这个数组是个常量，我们还是需要使用 v-bind --><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/props.html", "title": "Props | Vue.js", "doc_id": "ebb453dcdec64a55bfea3d6e485077a7", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 2081, "chunk_index": 40, "_doc_id": "40_6546181014830212284"}}
{"doc_id": "41_8854499679550882781", "text": "github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><!-- 虽然这个数组是个常量，我们还是需要使用 v-bind --><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><!-- 因为这是一个 JavaScript 表达式而不是一个字符串 --><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>BlogPost<span><span> :<span><span>comment-ids<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>[<span><span>234<span><span>, <span><span>266<span><span>, <span><span>273<span><span>]<span><span>\"<span><span> /><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><!-- 根据一个变量的值动态传入 --><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/props.html", "title": "Props | Vue.js", "doc_id": "ebb453dcdec64a55bfea3d6e485077a7", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 2081, "chunk_index": 41, "_doc_id": "41_8854499679550882781"}}
{"doc_id": "42_7730902136426170036", "text": "/><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><!-- 根据一个变量的值动态传入 --><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>BlogPost<span><span> :<span><span>comment-ids<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>post.commentIds<span><span>\"<span><span> /><span><span><code><pre><div><h4 id=\"object\">Object <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#object\">​<a><h4><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><!-- 虽然这个对象字面量是个常量，我们还是需要使用 v-bind --><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/props.html", "title": "Props | Vue.js", "doc_id": "ebb453dcdec64a55bfea3d6e485077a7", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 2081, "chunk_index": 42, "_doc_id": "42_7730902136426170036"}}
{"doc_id": "43_5006927007237022382", "text": "hub-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><!-- 虽然这个对象字面量是个常量，我们还是需要使用 v-bind --><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><!-- 因为这是一个 JavaScript 表达式而不是一个字符串 --><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>BlogPost<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> :<span><span>author<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>{<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> name: <span><span>'Veronica'<span><span>,<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> company: <span><span>'Veridian Dynamics'<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/props.html", "title": "Props | Vue.js", "doc_id": "ebb453dcdec64a55bfea3d6e485077a7", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 2081, "chunk_index": 43, "_doc_id": "43_5006927007237022382"}}
{"doc_id": "44_1975460193188171906", "text": "><span>,<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> company: <span><span>'Veridian Dynamics'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\"<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> /><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><!-- 根据一个变量的值动态传入 --><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/props.html", "title": "Props | Vue.js", "doc_id": "ebb453dcdec64a55bfea3d6e485077a7", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 2081, "chunk_index": 44, "_doc_id": "44_1975460193188171906"}}
{"doc_id": "45_3806778936305592787", "text": "/><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><!-- 根据一个变量的值动态传入 --><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>BlogPost<span><span> :<span><span>author<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>post.author<span><span>\"<span><span> /><span><span><code><pre><div><h3 id=\"binding-multiple-properties-using-an-object\">使用一个对象绑定多个 prop <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#binding-multiple-properties-using-an-object\">​<a><h3><p>如果你想要将一个对象的所有属性都当作 props 传入，", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/props.html", "title": "Props | Vue.js", "doc_id": "ebb453dcdec64a55bfea3d6e485077a7", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 2081, "chunk_index": 45, "_doc_id": "45_3806778936305592787"}}
{"doc_id": "46_7241390891978472784", "text": "-anchor\" href=\"#binding-multiple-properties-using-an-object\">​<a><h3><p>如果你想要将一个对象的所有属性都当作 props 传入，你可以使用<a href=\"/guide/essentials/template-syntax.html#dynamically-binding-multiple-attributes\">没有参数的 <code>v-bind<code><a>，即只使用 <code>v-bind<code> 而非 <code>:prop-name<code>。例如，这里有一个 <code>post<code> 对象：<p><div class=\"options-api\"><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/props.html", "title": "Props | Vue.js", "doc_id": "ebb453dcdec64a55bfea3d6e485077a7", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 2081, "chunk_index": 46, "_doc_id": "46_7241390891978472784"}}
{"doc_id": "47_286776656105920245", "text": "b-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> data<span><span>() {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> return<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> post: {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> id: <span><span>1<span><span>,<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> title: <span><span>'My Journey with Vue'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/props.html", "title": "Props | Vue.js", "doc_id": "ebb453dcdec64a55bfea3d6e485077a7", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 2081, "chunk_index": 47, "_doc_id": "47_286776656105920245"}}
{"doc_id": "48_829726603984334557", "text": "th Vue'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span><code><pre><div><div><div class=\"composition-api\"><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> post<span><span> =<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> id: <span><span>1<span><span>,<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/props.html", "title": "Props | Vue.js", "doc_id": "ebb453dcdec64a55bfea3d6e485077a7", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 2081, "chunk_index": 48, "_doc_id": "48_829726603984334557"}}
{"doc_id": "49_7073306619629347990", "text": "n> =<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> id: <span><span>1<span><span>,<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> title: <span><span>'My Journey with Vue'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span><code><pre><div><div><p>以及下面的模板：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>BlogPost<span><span> v-bind<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>post<span><span>\"<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/props.html", "title": "Props | Vue.js", "doc_id": "ebb453dcdec64a55bfea3d6e485077a7", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 2081, "chunk_index": 49, "_doc_id": "49_7073306619629347990"}}
{"doc_id": "50_7842186109244603457", "text": "span>BlogPost<span><span> v-bind<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>post<span><span>\"<span><span> /><span><span><code><pre><div><p>而这实际上等价于：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>BlogPost<span><span> :<span><span>id<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>post.id<span><span>\"<span><span> :<span><span>title<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>post.", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/props.html", "title": "Props | Vue.js", "doc_id": "ebb453dcdec64a55bfea3d6e485077a7", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 2081, "chunk_index": 50, "_doc_id": "50_7842186109244603457"}}
{"doc_id": "51_240400299707707533", "text": "<span>post.id<span><span>\"<span><span> :<span><span>title<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>post.title<span><span>\"<span><span> /><span><span><code><pre><div><h2 id=\"one-way-data-flow\">单向数据流 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#one-way-data-flow\">​<a><h2><p>所有的 props 都遵循着<strong>单向绑定<strong>原则，props 因父组件的更新而变化，自然地将新的状态向下流往子组件，而不会逆向传递。这避免了子组件意外修改父组件的状态的情况，不然应用的数据流将很容易变得混乱而难以理解。<p><p>另外，每次父组件更新后，所有的子组件中的 props 都会被更新到最新值，这意味着你<strong>不应该<strong>在子组件中去更改一个 prop。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/props.html", "title": "Props | Vue.js", "doc_id": "ebb453dcdec64a55bfea3d6e485077a7", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 2081, "chunk_index": 51, "_doc_id": "51_240400299707707533"}}
{"doc_id": "52_4774912858492914181", "text": "数据流将很容易变得混乱而难以理解。<p><p>另外，每次父组件更新后，所有的子组件中的 props 都会被更新到最新值，这意味着你<strong>不应该<strong>在子组件中去更改一个 prop。若你这么做了，Vue 会在控制台上向你抛出警告：<p><div class=\"composition-api\"><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> props<span><span> =<span><span> defineProps<span><span>([<span><span>'foo'<span><span>])<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// ❌ 警告！prop 是只读的！<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/props.html", "title": "Props | Vue.js", "doc_id": "ebb453dcdec64a55bfea3d6e485077a7", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 2081, "chunk_index": 52, "_doc_id": "52_4774912858492914181"}}
{"doc_id": "53_3597413813655200266", "text": "an>])<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// ❌ 警告！prop 是只读的！<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>props.foo <span><span>=<span><span> 'bar'<span><span><code><pre><div><div><div class=\"options-api\"><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> props: [<span><span>'foo'<span><span>],<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/props.html", "title": "Props | Vue.js", "doc_id": "ebb453dcdec64a55bfea3d6e485077a7", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 2081, "chunk_index": 53, "_doc_id": "53_3597413813655200266"}}
{"doc_id": "54_6216908736416252476", "text": "><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> props: [<span><span>'foo'<span><span>],<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> created<span><span>() {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // ❌ 警告！prop 是只读的！<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> this<span><span>.foo <span><span>=<span><span> 'bar'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/props.html", "title": "Props | Vue.js", "doc_id": "ebb453dcdec64a55bfea3d6e485077a7", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 2081, "chunk_index": 54, "_doc_id": "54_6216908736416252476"}}
{"doc_id": "55_3223858941782546962", "text": "span><span>.foo <span><span>=<span><span> 'bar'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span><code><pre><div><div><p>导致你想要更改一个 prop 的需求通常来源于以下两种场景：<p><ol><li><p><strong>prop 被用于传入初始值；而子组件想在之后将其作为一个局部数据属性<strong>。在这种情况下，最好是新定义一个局部数据属性，从 props 上获取初始值即可：<p><div class=\"composition-api\"><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> props<span><span> =<span><span> defineProps<span><span>([<span><span>'initialCounter'<span><span>])<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/props.html", "title": "Props | Vue.js", "doc_id": "ebb453dcdec64a55bfea3d6e485077a7", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 2081, "chunk_index": 55, "_doc_id": "55_3223858941782546962"}}
{"doc_id": "56_7391863755429110718", "text": "span> =<span><span> defineProps<span><span>([<span><span>'initialCounter'<span><span>])<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 计数器只是将 props.initialCounter 作为初始值<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 像下面这样做就使 prop 和后续更新无关了<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/props.html", "title": "Props | Vue.js", "doc_id": "ebb453dcdec64a55bfea3d6e485077a7", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 2081, "chunk_index": 56, "_doc_id": "56_7391863755429110718"}}
{"doc_id": "57_4350034462246369213", "text": "ops.initialCounter 作为初始值<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 像下面这样做就使 prop 和后续更新无关了<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> counter<span><span> =<span><span> ref<span><span>(props.initialCounter)<span><span><code><pre><div><div><div class=\"options-api\"><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/props.html", "title": "Props | Vue.js", "doc_id": "ebb453dcdec64a55bfea3d6e485077a7", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 2081, "chunk_index": 57, "_doc_id": "57_4350034462246369213"}}
{"doc_id": "58_568165139559512735", "text": "b-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> props: [<span><span>'initialCounter'<span><span>],<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> data<span><span>() {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> return<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 计数器只是将 this.initialCounter 作为初始值<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 像下面这样做就使 prop 和后续更新无关了<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/props.html", "title": "Props | Vue.js", "doc_id": "ebb453dcdec64a55bfea3d6e485077a7", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 2081, "chunk_index": 58, "_doc_id": "58_568165139559512735"}}
{"doc_id": "59_1277601631029201050", "text": "is.initialCounter 作为初始值<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 像下面这样做就使 prop 和后续更新无关了<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> counter: <span><span>this<span><span>.initialCounter<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/props.html", "title": "Props | Vue.js", "doc_id": "ebb453dcdec64a55bfea3d6e485077a7", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 2081, "chunk_index": 59, "_doc_id": "59_1277601631029201050"}}
{"doc_id": "60_18187330090394074", "text": "Counter<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span><code><pre><div><div><li><li><p><strong>需要对传入的 prop 值做进一步的转换<strong>。在这种情况中，最好是基于该 prop 值定义一个计算属性：<p><div class=\"composition-api\"><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> props<span><span> =<span><span> defineProps<span><span>([<span><span>'size'<span><span>])<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/props.html", "title": "Props | Vue.js", "doc_id": "ebb453dcdec64a55bfea3d6e485077a7", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 2081, "chunk_index": 60, "_doc_id": "60_18187330090394074"}}
{"doc_id": "61_4445951951327496886", "text": "ops<span><span> =<span><span> defineProps<span><span>([<span><span>'size'<span><span>])<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 该 prop 变更时计算属性也会自动更新<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/props.html", "title": "Props | Vue.js", "doc_id": "ebb453dcdec64a55bfea3d6e485077a7", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 2081, "chunk_index": 61, "_doc_id": "61_4445951951327496886"}}
{"doc_id": "62_1825259539356337155", "text": "<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 该 prop 变更时计算属性也会自动更新<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> normalizedSize<span><span> =<span><span> computed<span><span>(() <span><span>=><span><span> props.size.<span><span>trim<span><span>().<span><span>toLowerCase<span><span>())<span><span><code><pre><div><div><div class=\"options-api\"><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/props.html", "title": "Props | Vue.js", "doc_id": "ebb453dcdec64a55bfea3d6e485077a7", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 2081, "chunk_index": 62, "_doc_id": "62_1825259539356337155"}}
{"doc_id": "63_1755962365448565878", "text": "b-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> props: [<span><span>'size'<span><span>],<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> computed: {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 该 prop 变更时计算属性也会自动更新<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> normalizedSize<span><span>() {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> return<span><span> this<span><span>.size.<span><span>trim<span><span>().<span><span>toLowerCase<span><span>()<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/props.html", "title": "Props | Vue.js", "doc_id": "ebb453dcdec64a55bfea3d6e485077a7", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 2081, "chunk_index": 63, "_doc_id": "63_1755962365448565878"}}
{"doc_id": "64_5980375204559569176", "text": "s<span><span>.size.<span><span>trim<span><span>().<span><span>toLowerCase<span><span>()<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span><code><pre><div><div><li><ol><h3 id=\"mutating-object-array-props\">更改对象 / 数组类型的 props <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#mutating-object-array-props\">​<a><h3><p>当对象或数组作为 props 被传入时，虽然子组件无法更改 props 绑定，但仍然<strong>可以<strong>更改对象或数组内部的值。这是因为 JavaScript 的对象和数组是按引用传递，对 Vue 来说，阻止这种更改需要付出的代价异常昂贵。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/props.html", "title": "Props | Vue.js", "doc_id": "ebb453dcdec64a55bfea3d6e485077a7", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 2081, "chunk_index": 64, "_doc_id": "64_5980375204559569176"}}
{"doc_id": "65_4605764562080582880", "text": "改 props 绑定，但仍然<strong>可以<strong>更改对象或数组内部的值。这是因为 JavaScript 的对象和数组是按引用传递，对 Vue 来说，阻止这种更改需要付出的代价异常昂贵。<p><p>这种更改的主要缺陷是它允许了子组件以某种不明显的方式影响父组件的状态，可能会使数据流在将来变得更难以理解。在最佳实践中，你应该尽可能避免这样的更改，除非父子组件在设计上本来就需要紧密耦合。在大多数场景下，子组件应该<a href=\"/guide/components/events.html\">抛出一个事件<a>来通知父组件做出改变。<p><h2 id=\"prop-validation\">Prop 校验 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#prop-validation\">​<a><h2><p>Vue 组件可以更细致地声明对传入的 props 的校验要求。比如我们上面已经看到过的类型声明，如果传入的值不满足类型要求，Vue 会在浏览器控制台中抛出警告来提醒使用者。这在开发给其他开发者使用的组件时非常有用。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/props.html", "title": "Props | Vue.js", "doc_id": "ebb453dcdec64a55bfea3d6e485077a7", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 2081, "chunk_index": 65, "_doc_id": "65_4605764562080582880"}}
{"doc_id": "66_870696117254813465", "text": "以更细致地声明对传入的 props 的校验要求。比如我们上面已经看到过的类型声明，如果传入的值不满足类型要求，Vue 会在浏览器控制台中抛出警告来提醒使用者。这在开发给其他开发者使用的组件时非常有用。<p><p>要声明对 props 的校验，你可以向 <span class=\"composition-api\"><code>defineProps()<code> 宏<span><span class=\"options-api\"><code>props<code> 选项<span>提供一个带有 props 校验选项的对象，例如：<p><div class=\"composition-api\"><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>defineProps<span><span>({<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 基础类型检查<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/props.html", "title": "Props | Vue.js", "doc_id": "ebb453dcdec64a55bfea3d6e485077a7", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 2081, "chunk_index": 66, "_doc_id": "66_870696117254813465"}}
{"doc_id": "67_1992983745966526303", "text": "=\"line\"><span>defineProps<span><span>({<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 基础类型检查<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // (给出 `null` 和 `undefined` 值则会跳过任何类型检查)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> propA: Number,<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 多种可能的类型<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> propB: [String, Number],<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 必传，且为 String 类型<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> propC: {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> type: String,<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/props.html", "title": "Props | Vue.js", "doc_id": "ebb453dcdec64a55bfea3d6e485077a7", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 2081, "chunk_index": 67, "_doc_id": "67_1992983745966526303"}}
{"doc_id": "68_7989532248443330754", "text": "<span class=\"line\"><span> propC: {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> type: String,<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> required: <span><span>true<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> },<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 必传但可为 null 的字符串<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> propD: {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> type: [String, <span><span>null<span><span>],<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> required: <span><span>true<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> },<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/props.html", "title": "Props | Vue.js", "doc_id": "ebb453dcdec64a55bfea3d6e485077a7", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 2081, "chunk_index": 68, "_doc_id": "68_7989532248443330754"}}
{"doc_id": "69_2539239570476485442", "text": "class=\"line\"><span> required: <span><span>true<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> },<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // Number 类型的默认值<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> propE: {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> type: Number,<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> default: <span><span>100<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> },<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 对象类型的默认值<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> propF: {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> type: Object,<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/props.html", "title": "Props | Vue.js", "doc_id": "ebb453dcdec64a55bfea3d6e485077a7", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 2081, "chunk_index": 69, "_doc_id": "69_2539239570476485442"}}
{"doc_id": "70_4765934980854582277", "text": "<span class=\"line\"><span> propF: {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> type: Object,<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 对象或数组的默认值<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 必须从一个工厂函数返回。<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 该函数接收组件所接收到的原始 prop 作为参数。<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> default<span><span>(<span><span>rawProps<span><span>) {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> return<span><span> { message: <span><span>'hello'<span><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/props.html", "title": "Props | Vue.js", "doc_id": "ebb453dcdec64a55bfea3d6e485077a7", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 2081, "chunk_index": 70, "_doc_id": "70_4765934980854582277"}}
{"doc_id": "71_8521054138371664234", "text": "n> { message: <span><span>'hello'<span><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> },<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 自定义类型校验函数<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 在 3.4+ 中完整的 props 作为第二个参数传入<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> propG: {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> validator<span><span>(<span><span>value<span><span>, <span><span>props<span><span>) {<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/props.html", "title": "Props | Vue.js", "doc_id": "ebb453dcdec64a55bfea3d6e485077a7", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 2081, "chunk_index": 71, "_doc_id": "71_8521054138371664234"}}
{"doc_id": "72_9140473634410212128", "text": "> validator<span><span>(<span><span>value<span><span>, <span><span>props<span><span>) {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // The value must match one of these strings<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> return<span><span> [<span><span>'success'<span><span>, <span><span>'warning'<span><span>, <span><span>'danger'<span><span>].<span><span>includes<span><span>(value)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> },<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/props.html", "title": "Props | Vue.js", "doc_id": "ebb453dcdec64a55bfea3d6e485077a7", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 2081, "chunk_index": 72, "_doc_id": "72_9140473634410212128"}}
{"doc_id": "73_3230279229704121596", "text": "value)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> },<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 函数类型的默认值<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> propH: {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> type: Function,<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 不像对象或数组的默认，这不是一个<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 工厂函数。这会是一个用来作为默认值的函数<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> default<span><span>() {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> return<span><span> 'Default function'<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/props.html", "title": "Props | Vue.js", "doc_id": "ebb453dcdec64a55bfea3d6e485077a7", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 2081, "chunk_index": 73, "_doc_id": "73_3230279229704121596"}}
{"doc_id": "74_4055975118569474863", "text": "><span>() {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> return<span><span> 'Default function'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/props.html", "title": "Props | Vue.js", "doc_id": "ebb453dcdec64a55bfea3d6e485077a7", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 2081, "chunk_index": 74, "_doc_id": "74_4055975118569474863"}}
{"doc_id": "75_7926562274288255371", "text": "nction'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>})<span><span><code><pre><div><div class=\"tip custom-block\"><p class=\"custom-block-title\">TIP<p><p><code>defineProps()<code> 宏中的参数<strong>不可以访问 <code><script setup><code> 中定义的其他变量<strong>，因为在编译时整个表达式都会被移到外部的函数中。<p><div><div><div class=\"options-api\"><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/props.html", "title": "Props | Vue.js", "doc_id": "ebb453dcdec64a55bfea3d6e485077a7", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 2081, "chunk_index": 75, "_doc_id": "75_7926562274288255371"}}
{"doc_id": "76_1258725036785490163", "text": "b-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> props: {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 基础类型检查<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // (给出 `null` 和 `undefined` 值则会跳过任何类型检查)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> propA: Number,<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 多种可能的类型<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> propB: [String, Number],<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 必传，且为 String 类型<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/props.html", "title": "Props | Vue.js", "doc_id": "ebb453dcdec64a55bfea3d6e485077a7", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 2081, "chunk_index": 76, "_doc_id": "76_1258725036785490163"}}
{"doc_id": "77_6555997529577072718", "text": "span> propB: [String, Number],<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 必传，且为 String 类型<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> propC: {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> type: String,<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> required: <span><span>true<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> },<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 必传但可为 null 的字符串<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> propD: {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> type: [String, <span><span>null<span><span>],<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/props.html", "title": "Props | Vue.js", "doc_id": "ebb453dcdec64a55bfea3d6e485077a7", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 2081, "chunk_index": 77, "_doc_id": "77_6555997529577072718"}}
{"doc_id": "78_5280788927469086483", "text": ": {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> type: [String, <span><span>null<span><span>],<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> required: <span><span>true<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> },<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // Number 类型的默认值<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> propE: {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> type: Number,<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> default: <span><span>100<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> },<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/props.html", "title": "Props | Vue.js", "doc_id": "ebb453dcdec64a55bfea3d6e485077a7", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 2081, "chunk_index": 78, "_doc_id": "78_5280788927469086483"}}
{"doc_id": "79_7453597373619727903", "text": "n class=\"line\"><span> default: <span><span>100<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> },<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 对象类型的默认值<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> propF: {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> type: Object,<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 对象或者数组应当用工厂函数返回。<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 工厂函数会收到组件所接收的原始 props<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 作为参数<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> default<span><span>(<span><span>rawProps<span><span>) {<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/props.html", "title": "Props | Vue.js", "doc_id": "ebb453dcdec64a55bfea3d6e485077a7", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 2081, "chunk_index": 79, "_doc_id": "79_7453597373619727903"}}
{"doc_id": "80_3924137475669948960", "text": "span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> default<span><span>(<span><span>rawProps<span><span>) {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> return<span><span> { message: <span><span>'hello'<span><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> },<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 自定义类型校验函数<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 在 3.4+ 中完整的 props 作为第二个参数传入<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> propG: {<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/props.html", "title": "Props | Vue.js", "doc_id": "ebb453dcdec64a55bfea3d6e485077a7", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 2081, "chunk_index": 80, "_doc_id": "80_3924137475669948960"}}
{"doc_id": "81_5833806378058301768", "text": "e\"><span> // 在 3.4+ 中完整的 props 作为第二个参数传入<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> propG: {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> validator<span><span>(<span><span>value<span><span>, <span><span>props<span><span>) {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // The value must match one of these strings<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> return<span><span> [<span><span>'success'<span><span>, <span><span>'warning'<span><span>, <span><span>'danger'<span><span>].<span><span>includes<span><span>(value)<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/props.html", "title": "Props | Vue.js", "doc_id": "ebb453dcdec64a55bfea3d6e485077a7", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 2081, "chunk_index": 81, "_doc_id": "81_5833806378058301768"}}
{"doc_id": "82_8413451661071107716", "text": "<span><span>, <span><span>'danger'<span><span>].<span><span>includes<span><span>(value)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> },<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 函数类型的默认值<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> propH: {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> type: Function,<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 不像对象或数组的默认，这不是一个<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 工厂函数。这会是一个用来作为默认值的函数<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/props.html", "title": "Props | Vue.js", "doc_id": "ebb453dcdec64a55bfea3d6e485077a7", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 2081, "chunk_index": 82, "_doc_id": "82_8413451661071107716"}}
{"doc_id": "83_9204418390972895934", "text": "span> // 不像对象或数组的默认，这不是一个<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 工厂函数。这会是一个用来作为默认值的函数<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> default<span><span>() {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> return<span><span> 'Default function'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span><code><pre><div><div><p>一些补充细节：<p><ul><li><p>所有 prop 默认都是可选的，除非声明了 <code>required: true<code>。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/props.html", "title": "Props | Vue.js", "doc_id": "ebb453dcdec64a55bfea3d6e485077a7", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 2081, "chunk_index": 83, "_doc_id": "83_9204418390972895934"}}
{"doc_id": "84_609627579659566045", "text": "<span><code><pre><div><div><p>一些补充细节：<p><ul><li><p>所有 prop 默认都是可选的，除非声明了 <code>required: true<code>。<p><li><li><p>除 <code>Boolean<code> 外的未传递的可选 prop 将会有一个默认值 <code>undefined<code>。<p><li><li><p><code>Boolean<code> 类型的未传递 prop 将被转换为 <code>false<code>。这可以通过为它设置 <code>default<code> 来更改——例如：设置为 <code>default: undefined<code> 将与非布尔类型的 prop 的行为保持一致。<p><li><li><p>如果声明了 <code>default<code> 值，那么在 prop 的值被解析为 <code>undefined<code> 时，无论 prop 是未被传递还是显式指明的 <code>undefined<code>，都会改为 <code>default<code> 值。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/props.html", "title": "Props | Vue.js", "doc_id": "ebb453dcdec64a55bfea3d6e485077a7", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 2081, "chunk_index": 84, "_doc_id": "84_609627579659566045"}}
{"doc_id": "85_3385435876546230539", "text": "值被解析为 <code>undefined<code> 时，无论 prop 是未被传递还是显式指明的 <code>undefined<code>，都会改为 <code>default<code> 值。<p><li><ul><p>当 prop 的校验失败后，Vue 会抛出一个控制台警告 (在开发模式下)。<p><div class=\"composition-api\"><p>如果使用了<a href=\"/api/sfc-script-setup.html#type-only-props-emit-declarations\">基于类型的 prop 声明<a> ，Vue 会尽最大努力在运行时按照 prop 的类型标注进行编译。举例来说，<code>defineProps<{ msg: string }><code> 会被编译为 <code>{ msg: { type: String, required: true }}<code>。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/props.html", "title": "Props | Vue.js", "doc_id": "ebb453dcdec64a55bfea3d6e485077a7", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 2081, "chunk_index": 85, "_doc_id": "85_3385435876546230539"}}
{"doc_id": "86_7520024200877605268", "text": "<code>defineProps<{ msg: string }><code> 会被编译为 <code>{ msg: { type: String, required: true }}<code>。<p><div><div class=\"options-api\"><div class=\"tip custom-block\"><p class=\"custom-block-title\">注意<p><p>注意 prop 的校验是在组件实例被创建<strong>之前<strong>，所以实例的属性 (比如 <code>data<code>、<code>computed<code> 等) 将在 <code>default<code> 或 <code>validator<code> 函数中不可用。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/props.html", "title": "Props | Vue.js", "doc_id": "ebb453dcdec64a55bfea3d6e485077a7", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 2081, "chunk_index": 86, "_doc_id": "86_7520024200877605268"}}
{"doc_id": "87_3208432022644435096", "text": "(比如 <code>data<code>、<code>computed<code> 等) 将在 <code>default<code> 或 <code>validator<code> 函数中不可用。<p><div><div><h3 id=\"runtime-type-checks\">运行时类型检查 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#runtime-type-checks\">​<a><h3><p>校验选项中的 <code>type<code> 可以是下列这些原生构造函数：<p><ul><li><code>String<code><li><li><code>Number<code><li><li><code>Boolean<code><li><li><code>Array<code><li><li><code>Object<code><li><li><code>Date<code><li><li><code>Function<code><li><li><code>Symbol<code><li><li><code>Error<code><li><ul><p>另外，<code>type<code> 也可以是自定义的类或构造函数，Vue 将会通过 <code>instanceof<code> 来检查类型是否匹配。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/props.html", "title": "Props | Vue.js", "doc_id": "ebb453dcdec64a55bfea3d6e485077a7", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 2081, "chunk_index": 87, "_doc_id": "87_3208432022644435096"}}
{"doc_id": "88_3547477452708246195", "text": ">Error<code><li><ul><p>另外，<code>type<code> 也可以是自定义的类或构造函数，Vue 将会通过 <code>instanceof<code> 来检查类型是否匹配。例如下面这个类：<p><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>class<span><span> Person<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> constructor<span><span>(<span><span>firstName<span><span>, <span><span>lastName<span><span>) {<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/props.html", "title": "Props | Vue.js", "doc_id": "ebb453dcdec64a55bfea3d6e485077a7", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 2081, "chunk_index": 88, "_doc_id": "88_3547477452708246195"}}
{"doc_id": "89_3013308831611300100", "text": "ctor<span><span>(<span><span>firstName<span><span>, <span><span>lastName<span><span>) {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> this<span><span>.firstName <span><span>=<span><span> firstName<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> this<span><span>.lastName <span><span>=<span><span> lastName<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/props.html", "title": "Props | Vue.js", "doc_id": "ebb453dcdec64a55bfea3d6e485077a7", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 2081, "chunk_index": 89, "_doc_id": "89_3013308831611300100"}}
{"doc_id": "90_6959519931107541151", "text": "an>.lastName <span><span>=<span><span> lastName<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span><code><pre><div><p>你可以将其作为一个 prop 的类型：<p><div class=\"composition-api\"><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>defineProps<span><span>({<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> author: Person<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/props.html", "title": "Props | Vue.js", "doc_id": "ebb453dcdec64a55bfea3d6e485077a7", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 2081, "chunk_index": 90, "_doc_id": "90_6959519931107541151"}}
{"doc_id": "91_1354775305855684364", "text": "e\"><span>defineProps<span><span>({<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> author: Person<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>})<span><span><code><pre><div><div><div class=\"options-api\"><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> props: {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> author: Person<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/props.html", "title": "Props | Vue.js", "doc_id": "ebb453dcdec64a55bfea3d6e485077a7", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 2081, "chunk_index": 91, "_doc_id": "91_1354775305855684364"}}
{"doc_id": "92_6451900920029013352", "text": "<span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> author: Person<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span><code><pre><div><div><p>Vue 会通过 <code>instanceof Person<code> 来校验 <code>author<code> prop 的值是否是 <code>Person<code> 类的一个实例。<p><h3 id=\"nullable-type\">可为 null 的类型 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#nullable-type\">​<a><h3><p>如果该类型是必传但可为 null 的，你可以用一个包含 <code>null<code> 的数组语法：<p><div class=\"composition-api\"><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>defineProps<span><span>({<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/props.html", "title": "Props | Vue.js", "doc_id": "ebb453dcdec64a55bfea3d6e485077a7", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 2081, "chunk_index": 92, "_doc_id": "92_6451900920029013352"}}
{"doc_id": "93_3947046202752426589", "text": "ss=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>defineProps<span><span>({<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> id: {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> type: [String, <span><span>null<span><span>],<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> required: <span><span>true<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/props.html", "title": "Props | Vue.js", "doc_id": "ebb453dcdec64a55bfea3d6e485077a7", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 2081, "chunk_index": 93, "_doc_id": "93_3947046202752426589"}}
{"doc_id": "94_1793160921394360438", "text": "class=\"line\"><span> required: <span><span>true<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>})<span><span><code><pre><div><div><div class=\"options-api\"><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> props: {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> id: {<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/props.html", "title": "Props | Vue.js", "doc_id": "ebb453dcdec64a55bfea3d6e485077a7", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 2081, "chunk_index": 94, "_doc_id": "94_1793160921394360438"}}
{"doc_id": "95_3263729180716651388", "text": "n><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> props: {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> id: {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> type: [String, <span><span>null<span><span>],<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> required: <span><span>true<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span><code><pre><div><div><p>注意如果 <code>type<code> 仅为 <code>null<code> 而非使用数组语法，它将允许任何类型。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/props.html", "title": "Props | Vue.js", "doc_id": "ebb453dcdec64a55bfea3d6e485077a7", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 2081, "chunk_index": 95, "_doc_id": "95_3263729180716651388"}}
{"doc_id": "96_9175642146163628682", "text": "an>}<span><span><code><pre><div><div><p>注意如果 <code>type<code> 仅为 <code>null<code> 而非使用数组语法，它将允许任何类型。<p><h2 id=\"boolean-casting\">Boolean 类型转换 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#boolean-casting\">​<a><h2><p>为了更贴近原生 boolean attributes 的行为，声明为 <code>Boolean<code> 类型的 props 有特别的类型转换规则。以带有如下声明的 <code><MyComponent><code> 组件为例：<p><div class=\"composition-api\"><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>defineProps<span><span>({<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/props.html", "title": "Props | Vue.js", "doc_id": "ebb453dcdec64a55bfea3d6e485077a7", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 2081, "chunk_index": 96, "_doc_id": "96_9175642146163628682"}}
{"doc_id": "97_5883624662489543703", "text": "ss=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>defineProps<span><span>({<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> disabled: Boolean<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>})<span><span><code><pre><div><div><div class=\"options-api\"><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> props: {<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/props.html", "title": "Props | Vue.js", "doc_id": "ebb453dcdec64a55bfea3d6e485077a7", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 2081, "chunk_index": 97, "_doc_id": "97_5883624662489543703"}}
{"doc_id": "98_5588663588887450259", "text": "export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> props: {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> disabled: Boolean<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span><code><pre><div><div><p>该组件可以被这样使用：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><!-- 等同于传入 :disabled=\"true\" --><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/props.html", "title": "Props | Vue.js", "doc_id": "ebb453dcdec64a55bfea3d6e485077a7", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 2081, "chunk_index": 98, "_doc_id": "98_5588663588887450259"}}
{"doc_id": "99_1271811863950605138", "text": "iki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><!-- 等同于传入 :disabled=\"true\" --><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>MyComponent<span><span> disabled<span><span> /><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><!-- 等同于传入 :disabled=\"false\" --><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/props.html", "title": "Props | Vue.js", "doc_id": "ebb453dcdec64a55bfea3d6e485077a7", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 2081, "chunk_index": 99, "_doc_id": "99_1271811863950605138"}}
{"doc_id": "100_6841778020582537389", "text": "an>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><!-- 等同于传入 :disabled=\"false\" --><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>MyComponent<span><span> /><span><span><code><pre><div><p>当一个 prop 被声明为允许多种类型时，<code>Boolean<code> 的转换规则也将被应用。然而，当同时允许 <code>String<code> 和 <code>Boolean<code> 时，有一种边缘情况——只有当 <code>Boolean<code> 出现在 <code>String<code> 之前时，<code>Boolean<code> 转换规则才适用：<p><div class=\"composition-api\"><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// disabled 将被转换为 true<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/props.html", "title": "Props | Vue.js", "doc_id": "ebb453dcdec64a55bfea3d6e485077a7", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 2081, "chunk_index": 100, "_doc_id": "100_6841778020582537389"}}
{"doc_id": "101_1332454273963993026", "text": "class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// disabled 将被转换为 true<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>defineProps<span><span>({<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> disabled: [Boolean, Number]<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>})<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// disabled 将被转换为 true<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>defineProps<span><span>({<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> disabled: [Boolean, String]<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/props.html", "title": "Props | Vue.js", "doc_id": "ebb453dcdec64a55bfea3d6e485077a7", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 2081, "chunk_index": 101, "_doc_id": "101_1332454273963993026"}}
{"doc_id": "102_673532601203583819", "text": "neProps<span><span>({<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> disabled: [Boolean, String]<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>})<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// disabled 将被转换为 true<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>defineProps<span><span>({<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> disabled: [Number, Boolean]<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>})<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// disabled 将被解析为空字符串 (disabled=\"\")<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/props.html", "title": "Props | Vue.js", "doc_id": "ebb453dcdec64a55bfea3d6e485077a7", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 2081, "chunk_index": 102, "_doc_id": "102_673532601203583819"}}
{"doc_id": "103_6712520169721565781", "text": "<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// disabled 将被解析为空字符串 (disabled=\"\")<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>defineProps<span><span>({<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> disabled: [String, Boolean]<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>})<span><span><code><pre><div><div><div class=\"options-api\"><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// disabled 将被转换为 true<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/props.html", "title": "Props | Vue.js", "doc_id": "ebb453dcdec64a55bfea3d6e485077a7", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 2081, "chunk_index": 103, "_doc_id": "103_6712520169721565781"}}
{"doc_id": "104_5173569795872596206", "text": "class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// disabled 将被转换为 true<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> props: {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> disabled: [Boolean, Number]<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// disabled 将被转换为 true<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/props.html", "title": "Props | Vue.js", "doc_id": "ebb453dcdec64a55bfea3d6e485077a7", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 2081, "chunk_index": 104, "_doc_id": "104_5173569795872596206"}}
{"doc_id": "105_6497465279505256804", "text": "}<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// disabled 将被转换为 true<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> props: {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> disabled: [Boolean, String]<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// disabled 将被转换为 true<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/props.html", "title": "Props | Vue.js", "doc_id": "ebb453dcdec64a55bfea3d6e485077a7", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 2081, "chunk_index": 105, "_doc_id": "105_6497465279505256804"}}
{"doc_id": "106_4270645465759558697", "text": "}<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// disabled 将被转换为 true<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> props: {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> disabled: [Number, Boolean]<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// disabled 将被解析为空字符串 (disabled=\"\")<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/props.html", "title": "Props | Vue.js", "doc_id": "ebb453dcdec64a55bfea3d6e485077a7", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 2081, "chunk_index": 106, "_doc_id": "106_4270645465759558697"}}
{"doc_id": "107_7771597026923751434", "text": "<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// disabled 将被解析为空字符串 (disabled=\"\")<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> props: {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> disabled: [String, Boolean]<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span><code><pre><div><div><div><div>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/props.html", "title": "Props | Vue.js", "doc_id": "ebb453dcdec64a55bfea3d6e485077a7", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 2081, "chunk_index": 107, "_doc_id": "107_7771597026923751434"}}
{"doc_id": "0_4900662168778154573", "text": "<div><div><h1 id=\"lifecycle-hooks\">生命周期钩子 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#lifecycle-hooks\">​<a><h1><p>每个 Vue 组件实例在创建时都需要经历一系列的初始化步骤，比如设置好数据侦听，编译模板，挂载实例到 DOM，以及在数据改变时更新 DOM。在此过程中，它也会运行被称为生命周期钩子的函数，让开发者有机会在特定阶段运行自己的代码。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/lifecycle.html", "title": "生命周期钩子", "doc_id": "7e9aec7b52f844d8b964ef9a02b198ef", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 153, "chunk_index": 0, "_doc_id": "0_4900662168778154573"}}
{"doc_id": "1_9019146722672963611", "text": "时都需要经历一系列的初始化步骤，比如设置好数据侦听，编译模板，挂载实例到 DOM，以及在数据改变时更新 DOM。在此过程中，它也会运行被称为生命周期钩子的函数，让开发者有机会在特定阶段运行自己的代码。<p><h2 id=\"registering-lifecycle-hooks\">注册周期钩子 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#registering-lifecycle-hooks\">​<a><h2><p>举例来说，<span class=\"composition-api\"><code>onMounted<code><span><span class=\"options-api\"><code>mounted<code><span> 钩子可以用来在组件完成初始渲染并创建 DOM 节点后运行代码：<p><div class=\"composition-api\"><div class=\"language-vue\"> <span class=\"lang\">vue<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>script<span><span> setup<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/lifecycle.html", "title": "生命周期钩子", "doc_id": "7e9aec7b52f844d8b964ef9a02b198ef", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 153, "chunk_index": 1, "_doc_id": "1_9019146722672963611"}}
{"doc_id": "2_6937383886353120719", "text": "code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>script<span><span> setup<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>import<span><span> { onMounted } <span><span>from<span><span> 'vue'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>onMounted<span><span>(() <span><span>=><span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> console.<span><span>log<span><span>(<span><span>`the component is now mounted.`<span><span>)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>})<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/lifecycle.html", "title": "生命周期钩子", "doc_id": "7e9aec7b52f844d8b964ef9a02b198ef", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 153, "chunk_index": 2, "_doc_id": "2_6937383886353120719"}}
{"doc_id": "3_5073452115678995636", "text": "an>`the component is now mounted.`<span><span>)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>})<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>script<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><div><div class=\"options-api\"><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> mounted<span><span>() {<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/lifecycle.html", "title": "生命周期钩子", "doc_id": "7e9aec7b52f844d8b964ef9a02b198ef", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 153, "chunk_index": 3, "_doc_id": "3_5073452115678995636"}}
{"doc_id": "4_6409164493923969919", "text": "an> default<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> mounted<span><span>() {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> console.<span><span>log<span><span>(<span><span>`the component is now mounted.`<span><span>)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/lifecycle.html", "title": "生命周期钩子", "doc_id": "7e9aec7b52f844d8b964ef9a02b198ef", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 153, "chunk_index": 4, "_doc_id": "4_6409164493923969919"}}
{"doc_id": "5_4761011013430517720", "text": "an>`the component is now mounted.`<span><span>)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span><code><pre><div><div><p>还有其他一些钩子，会在实例生命周期的不同阶段被调用，最常用的是 <span class=\"composition-api\"><a href=\"/api/composition-api-lifecycle.html#onmounted\"><code>onMounted<code><a>、<a href=\"/api/composition-api-lifecycle.html#onupdated\"><code>onUpdated<code><a> 和 <a href=\"/api/composition-api-lifecycle.html#onunmounted\"><code>onUnmounted<code><a>。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/lifecycle.html", "title": "生命周期钩子", "doc_id": "7e9aec7b52f844d8b964ef9a02b198ef", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 153, "chunk_index": 5, "_doc_id": "5_4761011013430517720"}}
{"doc_id": "6_7520661789666895625", "text": "ted<code><a> 和 <a href=\"/api/composition-api-lifecycle.html#onunmounted\"><code>onUnmounted<code><a>。所有生命周期钩子的完整参考及其用法请参考 <a href=\"/api/composition-api-lifecycle.html\">API 索引<a>。<span><span class=\"options-api\"><a href=\"/api/options-lifecycle.html#mounted\"><code>mounted<code><a>、<a href=\"/api/options-lifecycle.html#updated\"><code>updated<code><a> 和 <a href=\"/api/options-lifecycle.html#unmounted\"><code>unmounted<code><a>。<span><p><div class=\"options-api\"><p>所有生命周期钩子函数的 <code>this<code> 上下文都会自动指向当前调用它的组件实例。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/lifecycle.html", "title": "生命周期钩子", "doc_id": "7e9aec7b52f844d8b964ef9a02b198ef", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 153, "chunk_index": 6, "_doc_id": "6_7520661789666895625"}}
{"doc_id": "7_4451238153199963050", "text": "nted<code><a>。<span><p><div class=\"options-api\"><p>所有生命周期钩子函数的 <code>this<code> 上下文都会自动指向当前调用它的组件实例。注意：避免用箭头函数来定义生命周期钩子，因为如果这样的话你将无法在函数中通过 <code>this<code> 获取组件实例。<p><div><div class=\"composition-api\"><p>当调用 <code>onMounted<code> 时，Vue 会自动将回调函数注册到当前正被初始化的组件实例上。这意味着这些钩子应当在组件初始化时被<strong>同步<strong>注册。例如，请不要这样做：<p><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>setTimeout<span><span>(() <span><span>=><span><span> {<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/lifecycle.html", "title": "生命周期钩子", "doc_id": "7e9aec7b52f844d8b964ef9a02b198ef", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 153, "chunk_index": 7, "_doc_id": "7_4451238153199963050"}}
{"doc_id": "8_7537503690678890856", "text": "\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>setTimeout<span><span>(() <span><span>=><span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> onMounted<span><span>(() <span><span>=><span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 异步注册时当前组件实例已丢失<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 这将不会正常工作<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> })<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/lifecycle.html", "title": "生命周期钩子", "doc_id": "7e9aec7b52f844d8b964ef9a02b198ef", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 153, "chunk_index": 8, "_doc_id": "8_7537503690678890856"}}
{"doc_id": "9_5386048969135426807", "text": "n><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 这将不会正常工作<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> })<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}, <span><span>100<span><span>)<span><span><code><pre><div><p>注意这并不意味着对 <code>onMounted<code> 的调用必须放在 <code>setup()<code> 或 <code><script setup><code> 内的词法上下文中。<code>onMounted()<code> 也可以在一个外部函数中调用，只要调用栈是同步的，且最终起源自 <code>setup()<code> 就可以。<p><div><h2 id=\"lifecycle-diagram\">生命周期图示 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#lifecycle-diagram\">​<a><h2><p>下面是实例生命周期的图表。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/lifecycle.html", "title": "生命周期钩子", "doc_id": "7e9aec7b52f844d8b964ef9a02b198ef", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 153, "chunk_index": 9, "_doc_id": "9_5386048969135426807"}}
{"doc_id": "10_9131136729315712800", "text": "ifecycle-diagram\">生命周期图示 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#lifecycle-diagram\">​<a><h2><p>下面是实例生命周期的图表。你现在并不需要完全理解图中的所有内容，但以后它将是一个有用的参考。<p><p> <p><p>有关所有生命周期钩子及其各自用例的详细信息，请参考<span class=\"composition-api\"><a href=\"/api/composition-api-lifecycle.html\">生命周期钩子 API 索引<a><span><span class=\"options-api\"><a href=\"/api/options-lifecycle.html\">生命周期钩子 API 索引<a><span>。<p><div><div>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/lifecycle.html", "title": "生命周期钩子", "doc_id": "7e9aec7b52f844d8b964ef9a02b198ef", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 153, "chunk_index": 10, "_doc_id": "10_9131136729315712800"}}
{"doc_id": "0_7947830250089872336", "text": "<div><div><h1 id=\"component-events\">组件事件 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#component-events\">​<a><h1><blockquote><p>此章节假设你已经看过了<a href=\"/guide/essentials/component-basics.html\">组件基础<a>。若你还不了解组件是什么，请先阅读该章节。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/events.html", "title": "组件事件", "doc_id": "8ef8e549863a479987c4c5e46effb15b", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 701, "chunk_index": 0, "_doc_id": "0_7947830250089872336"}}
{"doc_id": "1_1925715789069984435", "text": "ckquote><p>此章节假设你已经看过了<a href=\"/guide/essentials/component-basics.html\">组件基础<a>。若你还不了解组件是什么，请先阅读该章节。<p><blockquote><h2 id=\"emitting-and-listening-to-events\">触发与监听事件 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#emitting-and-listening-to-events\">​<a><h2><p>在组件的模板表达式中，可以直接使用 <code>$emit<code> 方法触发自定义事件 (例如：在 <code>v-on<code> 的处理函数中)：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><!-- MyComponent --><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/events.html", "title": "组件事件", "doc_id": "8ef8e549863a479987c4c5e46effb15b", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 701, "chunk_index": 1, "_doc_id": "1_1925715789069984435"}}
{"doc_id": "2_4863483707954186379", "text": "e class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><!-- MyComponent --><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>button<span><span> @<span><span>click<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>$emit<span><span>(<span><span>'someEvent'<span><span>)<span><span>\"<span><span>>Click Me</<span><span>button<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><div class=\"options-api\"><p><code>$emit()<code> 方法在组件实例上也同样以 <code>this.", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/events.html", "title": "组件事件", "doc_id": "8ef8e549863a479987c4c5e46effb15b", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 701, "chunk_index": 2, "_doc_id": "2_4863483707954186379"}}
{"doc_id": "3_5415907077960514517", "text": "<span><span><code><pre><div><div class=\"options-api\"><p><code>$emit()<code> 方法在组件实例上也同样以 <code>this.$emit()<code> 的形式可用：<p><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> methods: {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> submit<span><span>() {<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/events.html", "title": "组件事件", "doc_id": "8ef8e549863a479987c4c5e46effb15b", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 701, "chunk_index": 3, "_doc_id": "3_5415907077960514517"}}
{"doc_id": "4_7622821171873088149", "text": "s=\"line\"><span> methods: {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> submit<span><span>() {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> this<span><span>.<span><span>$emit<span><span>(<span><span>'someEvent'<span><span>)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/events.html", "title": "组件事件", "doc_id": "8ef8e549863a479987c4c5e46effb15b", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 701, "chunk_index": 4, "_doc_id": "4_7622821171873088149"}}
{"doc_id": "5_145154535991486513", "text": "<span>)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span><code><pre><div><div><p>父组件可以通过 <code>v-on<code> (缩写为 <code>@<code>) 来监听事件：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>MyComponent<span><span> @<span><span>some-event<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>callback<span><span>\"<span><span> /><span><span><code><pre><div><p>同样，", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/events.html", "title": "组件事件", "doc_id": "8ef8e549863a479987c4c5e46effb15b", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 701, "chunk_index": 5, "_doc_id": "5_145154535991486513"}}
{"doc_id": "6_7978789133694273960", "text": "pan>=<span><span>\"<span><span>callback<span><span>\"<span><span> /><span><span><code><pre><div><p>同样，组件的事件监听器也支持 <code>.once<code> 修饰符：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>MyComponent<span><span> @<span><span>some-event<span><span>.<span><span>once<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>callback<span><span>\"<span><span> /><span><span><code><pre><div><p>像组件与 prop 一样，事件的名字也提供了自动的格式转换。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/events.html", "title": "组件事件", "doc_id": "8ef8e549863a479987c4c5e46effb15b", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 701, "chunk_index": 6, "_doc_id": "6_7978789133694273960"}}
{"doc_id": "7_8253050367132744660", "text": "an>callback<span><span>\"<span><span> /><span><span><code><pre><div><p>像组件与 prop 一样，事件的名字也提供了自动的格式转换。注意这里我们触发了一个以 camelCase 形式命名的事件，但在父组件中可以使用 kebab-case 形式来监听。与 <a href=\"/guide/components/props.html#prop-name-casing\">prop 大小写格式<a>一样，在模板中我们也推荐使用 kebab-case 形式来编写监听器。<p><div class=\"tip custom-block\"><p class=\"custom-block-title\">TIP<p><p>和原生 DOM 事件不一样，组件触发的事件<strong>没有冒泡机制<strong>。你只能监听直接子组件触发的事件。平级组件或是跨越多层嵌套的组件间通信，应使用一个外部的事件总线，或是使用一个<a href=\"/guide/scaling-up/state-management.html\">全局状态管理方案<a>。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/events.html", "title": "组件事件", "doc_id": "8ef8e549863a479987c4c5e46effb15b", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 701, "chunk_index": 7, "_doc_id": "7_8253050367132744660"}}
{"doc_id": "8_7373248019745001912", "text": "平级组件或是跨越多层嵌套的组件间通信，应使用一个外部的事件总线，或是使用一个<a href=\"/guide/scaling-up/state-management.html\">全局状态管理方案<a>。<p><div><h2 id=\"event-arguments\">事件参数 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#event-arguments\">​<a><h2><p>有时候我们会需要在触发事件时附带一个特定的值。举例来说，我们想要 <code><BlogPost><code> 组件来管理文本会缩放得多大。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/events.html", "title": "组件事件", "doc_id": "8ef8e549863a479987c4c5e46effb15b", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 701, "chunk_index": 8, "_doc_id": "8_7373248019745001912"}}
{"doc_id": "9_12775550530783540", "text": "\"#event-arguments\">​<a><h2><p>有时候我们会需要在触发事件时附带一个特定的值。举例来说，我们想要 <code><BlogPost><code> 组件来管理文本会缩放得多大。在这个场景下，我们可以给 <code>$emit<code> 提供一个额外的参数：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>button<span><span> @<span><span>click<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>$emit<span><span>(<span><span>'increaseBy'<span><span>, <span><span>1<span><span>)<span><span>\"<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/events.html", "title": "组件事件", "doc_id": "8ef8e549863a479987c4c5e46effb15b", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 701, "chunk_index": 9, "_doc_id": "9_12775550530783540"}}
{"doc_id": "10_2227048413351762146", "text": "an><span>'increaseBy'<span><span>, <span><span>1<span><span>)<span><span>\"<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> Increase by 1<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>button<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>然后我们在父组件中监听事件，我们可以先简单写一个内联的箭头函数作为监听器，", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/events.html", "title": "组件事件", "doc_id": "8ef8e549863a479987c4c5e46effb15b", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 701, "chunk_index": 10, "_doc_id": "10_2227048413351762146"}}
{"doc_id": "11_5357161121192202842", "text": "/<span><span>button<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>然后我们在父组件中监听事件，我们可以先简单写一个内联的箭头函数作为监听器，此函数会接收到事件附带的参数：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>MyButton<span><span> @<span><span>increase-by<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>(<span><span>n<span><span>) <span><span>=><span><span> count <span><span>+=<span><span> n<span><span>\"<span><span> /><span><span><code><pre><div><p>或者，", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/events.html", "title": "组件事件", "doc_id": "8ef8e549863a479987c4c5e46effb15b", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 701, "chunk_index": 11, "_doc_id": "11_5357161121192202842"}}
{"doc_id": "12_5537785689500618589", "text": "an> count <span><span>+=<span><span> n<span><span>\"<span><span> /><span><span><code><pre><div><p>或者，也可以用一个组件方法来作为事件处理函数：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>MyButton<span><span> @<span><span>increase-by<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>increaseCount<span><span>\"<span><span> /><span><span><code><pre><div><p>该方法也会接收到事件所传递的参数：<p><div class=\"options-api\"><div class=\"language-js\"> <span", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/events.html", "title": "组件事件", "doc_id": "8ef8e549863a479987c4c5e46effb15b", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 701, "chunk_index": 12, "_doc_id": "12_5537785689500618589"}}
{"doc_id": "13_4648013114658377461", "text": "pan><code><pre><div><p>该方法也会接收到事件所传递的参数：<p><div class=\"options-api\"><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>methods<span><span>: {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> increaseCount<span><span>(n) {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> this<span><span>.count <span><span>+=<span><span> n<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/events.html", "title": "组件事件", "doc_id": "8ef8e549863a479987c4c5e46effb15b", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 701, "chunk_index": 13, "_doc_id": "13_4648013114658377461"}}
{"doc_id": "14_1220008093612350568", "text": "<span><span>.count <span><span>+=<span><span> n<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span><code><pre><div><div><div class=\"composition-api\"><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>function<span><span> increaseCount<span><span>(<span><span>n<span><span>) {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> count.value <span><span>+=<span><span> n<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/events.html", "title": "组件事件", "doc_id": "8ef8e549863a479987c4c5e46effb15b", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 701, "chunk_index": 14, "_doc_id": "14_1220008093612350568"}}
{"doc_id": "15_2052206382301511491", "text": "span>) {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> count.value <span><span>+=<span><span> n<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span><code><pre><div><div><div class=\"tip custom-block\"><p class=\"custom-block-title\">TIP<p><p>所有传入 <code>$emit()<code> 的额外参数都会被直接传向监听器。举例来说，<code>$emit('foo', 1, 2, 3)<code> 触发后，监听器函数将会收到这三个参数值。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/events.html", "title": "组件事件", "doc_id": "8ef8e549863a479987c4c5e46effb15b", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 701, "chunk_index": 15, "_doc_id": "15_2052206382301511491"}}
{"doc_id": "16_1609338186950525833", "text": "所有传入 <code>$emit()<code> 的额外参数都会被直接传向监听器。举例来说，<code>$emit('foo', 1, 2, 3)<code> 触发后，监听器函数将会收到这三个参数值。<p><div><h2 id=\"declaring-emitted-events\">声明触发的事件 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#declaring-emitted-events\">​<a><h2><p>组件可以显式地通过 <span class=\"composition-api\"><a href=\"/api/sfc-script-setup.html#defineprops-defineemits\"><code>defineEmits()<code><a> 宏<span><span class=\"options-api\"><a href=\"/api/options-state.", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/events.html", "title": "组件事件", "doc_id": "8ef8e549863a479987c4c5e46effb15b", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 701, "chunk_index": 16, "_doc_id": "16_1609338186950525833"}}
{"doc_id": "17_4545276332320757040", "text": "ineemits\"><code>defineEmits()<code><a> 宏<span><span class=\"options-api\"><a href=\"/api/options-state.html#emits\"><code>emits<code><a> 选项<span>来声明它要触发的事件：<p><div class=\"composition-api\"><div class=\"language-vue\"> <span class=\"lang\">vue<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>script<span><span> setup<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>defineEmits<span><span>([<span><span>'inFocus'<span><span>, <span><span>'submit'<span><span>])<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/events.html", "title": "组件事件", "doc_id": "8ef8e549863a479987c4c5e46effb15b", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 701, "chunk_index": 17, "_doc_id": "17_4545276332320757040"}}
{"doc_id": "18_2214634513545731065", "text": "mits<span><span>([<span><span>'inFocus'<span><span>, <span><span>'submit'<span><span>])<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>script<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>我们在 <code><template><code> 中使用的 <code>$emit<code> 方法不能在组件的 <code><script setup><code> 部分中使用，但 <code>defineEmits()<code> 会返回一个相同作用的函数供我们使用：<p><div class=\"language-vue\"> <span class=\"lang\">vue<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>script<span><span> setup<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/events.html", "title": "组件事件", "doc_id": "8ef8e549863a479987c4c5e46effb15b", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 701, "chunk_index": 18, "_doc_id": "18_2214634513545731065"}}
{"doc_id": "19_6001830829379809830", "text": "code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>script<span><span> setup<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> emit<span><span> =<span><span> defineEmits<span><span>([<span><span>'inFocus'<span><span>, <span><span>'submit'<span><span>])<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>function<span><span> buttonClick<span><span>() {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> emit<span><span>(<span><span>'submit'<span><span>)<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/events.html", "title": "组件事件", "doc_id": "8ef8e549863a479987c4c5e46effb15b", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 701, "chunk_index": 19, "_doc_id": "19_6001830829379809830"}}
{"doc_id": "20_875866210064375680", "text": "pan><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> emit<span><span>(<span><span>'submit'<span><span>)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>script<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p><code>defineEmits()<code> 宏<strong>不能<strong>在子函数中使用。如上所示，它必须直接放置在 <code><script setup><code> 的顶级作用域下。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/events.html", "title": "组件事件", "doc_id": "8ef8e549863a479987c4c5e46effb15b", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 701, "chunk_index": 20, "_doc_id": "20_875866210064375680"}}
{"doc_id": "21_734417910248621867", "text": "ode>defineEmits()<code> 宏<strong>不能<strong>在子函数中使用。如上所示，它必须直接放置在 <code><script setup><code> 的顶级作用域下。<p><p>如果你显式地使用了 <code>setup<code> 函数而不是 <code><script setup><code>，则事件需要通过 <a href=\"/api/options-state.html#emits\"><code>emits<code><a> 选项来定义，<code>emit<code> 函数也被暴露在 <code>setup()<code> 的上下文对象上：<p><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/events.html", "title": "组件事件", "doc_id": "8ef8e549863a479987c4c5e46effb15b", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 701, "chunk_index": 21, "_doc_id": "21_734417910248621867"}}
{"doc_id": "22_6950238574499859797", "text": "b-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> emits: [<span><span>'inFocus'<span><span>, <span><span>'submit'<span><span>],<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> setup<span><span>(<span><span>props<span><span>, <span><span>ctx<span><span>) {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> ctx.<span><span>emit<span><span>(<span><span>'submit'<span><span>)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/events.html", "title": "组件事件", "doc_id": "8ef8e549863a479987c4c5e46effb15b", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 701, "chunk_index": 22, "_doc_id": "22_6950238574499859797"}}
{"doc_id": "23_8402321463437163834", "text": "t<span><span>(<span><span>'submit'<span><span>)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span><code><pre><div><p>与 <code>setup()<code> 上下文对象中的其他属性一样，<code>emit<code> 可以安全地被解构：<p><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/events.html", "title": "组件事件", "doc_id": "8ef8e549863a479987c4c5e46effb15b", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 701, "chunk_index": 23, "_doc_id": "23_8402321463437163834"}}
{"doc_id": "24_7904565311737105680", "text": "b-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> emits: [<span><span>'inFocus'<span><span>, <span><span>'submit'<span><span>],<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> setup<span><span>(<span><span>props<span><span>, { <span><span>emit<span><span> }) {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> emit<span><span>(<span><span>'submit'<span><span>)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/events.html", "title": "组件事件", "doc_id": "8ef8e549863a479987c4c5e46effb15b", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 701, "chunk_index": 24, "_doc_id": "24_7904565311737105680"}}
{"doc_id": "25_3967613753333422048", "text": "t<span><span>(<span><span>'submit'<span><span>)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span><code><pre><div><div><div class=\"options-api\"><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> emits: [<span><span>'inFocus'<span><span>, <span><span>'submit'<span><span>]<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/events.html", "title": "组件事件", "doc_id": "8ef8e549863a479987c4c5e46effb15b", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 701, "chunk_index": 25, "_doc_id": "25_3967613753333422048"}}
{"doc_id": "26_3547581837318075936", "text": "ne\"><span> emits: [<span><span>'inFocus'<span><span>, <span><span>'submit'<span><span>]<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span><code><pre><div><div><p>这个 <code>emits<code> 选项和 <code>defineEmits()<code> 宏还支持对象语法。通过 TypeScript 为参数指定类型，它允许我们对触发事件的参数进行验证：<p><div class=\"composition-api\"><div class=\"language-vue\"> <span class=\"lang\">vue<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>script<span><span> setup<span><span> lang<span><span>=<span><span>\"ts\"<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/events.html", "title": "组件事件", "doc_id": "8ef8e549863a479987c4c5e46effb15b", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 701, "chunk_index": 26, "_doc_id": "26_3547581837318075936"}}
{"doc_id": "27_2172347180685892412", "text": "pan>script<span><span> setup<span><span> lang<span><span>=<span><span>\"ts\"<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> emit<span><span> =<span><span> defineEmits<span><span>({<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> submit<span><span>(<span><span>payload<span><span>:<span><span> { <span><span>email<span><span>:<span><span> string<span><span>, <span><span>password<span><span>:<span><span> string<span><span> }) {<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/events.html", "title": "组件事件", "doc_id": "8ef8e549863a479987c4c5e46effb15b", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 701, "chunk_index": 27, "_doc_id": "27_2172347180685892412"}}
{"doc_id": "28_8388432751134898997", "text": "ring<span><span>, <span><span>password<span><span>:<span><span> string<span><span> }) {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 通过返回值为 `true` 还是为 `false` 来判断<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 验证是否通过<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>})<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/events.html", "title": "组件事件", "doc_id": "8ef8e549863a479987c4c5e46effb15b", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 701, "chunk_index": 28, "_doc_id": "28_8388432751134898997"}}
{"doc_id": "29_8064531861643924510", "text": "验证是否通过<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>})<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>script<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>如果你正在搭配 TypeScript 使用 <code><script setup><code>，也可以使用纯类型标注来声明触发的事件：<p><div class=\"language-vue\"> <span class=\"lang\">vue<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>script<span><span> setup<span><span> lang<span><span>=<span><span>\"ts\"<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/events.html", "title": "组件事件", "doc_id": "8ef8e549863a479987c4c5e46effb15b", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 701, "chunk_index": 29, "_doc_id": "29_8064531861643924510"}}
{"doc_id": "30_281181796724375801", "text": "pan>script<span><span> setup<span><span> lang<span><span>=<span><span>\"ts\"<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> emit<span><span> =<span><span> defineEmits<span><span><{<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> (<span><span>e<span><span>:<span><span> 'change'<span><span>, <span><span>id<span><span>:<span><span> number<span><span>)<span><span>:<span><span> void<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/events.html", "title": "组件事件", "doc_id": "8ef8e549863a479987c4c5e46effb15b", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 701, "chunk_index": 30, "_doc_id": "30_281181796724375801"}}
{"doc_id": "31_487354661756935893", "text": "pan><span>id<span><span>:<span><span> number<span><span>)<span><span>:<span><span> void<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> (<span><span>e<span><span>:<span><span> 'update'<span><span>, <span><span>value<span><span>:<span><span> string<span><span>)<span><span>:<span><span> void<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}>()<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/events.html", "title": "组件事件", "doc_id": "8ef8e549863a479987c4c5e46effb15b", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 701, "chunk_index": 31, "_doc_id": "31_487354661756935893"}}
{"doc_id": "32_1675047424101397011", "text": "ng<span><span>)<span><span>:<span><span> void<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}>()<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>script<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>TypeScript 用户请参考：<a href=\"/guide/typescript/composition-api.html#typing-component-emits\">如何为组件所抛出事件标注类型<a> <p><div><div class=\"options-api\"><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/events.html", "title": "组件事件", "doc_id": "8ef8e549863a479987c4c5e46effb15b", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 701, "chunk_index": 32, "_doc_id": "32_1675047424101397011"}}
{"doc_id": "33_8980210595037744559", "text": "b-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> emits: {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> submit<span><span>(<span><span>payload<span><span>:<span><span> { <span><span>email<span><span>:<span><span> string<span><span>, <span><span>password<span><span>:<span><span> string<span><span> }) {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 通过返回值为 `true` 还是为 `false` 来判断<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 验证是否通过<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/events.html", "title": "组件事件", "doc_id": "8ef8e549863a479987c4c5e46effb15b", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 701, "chunk_index": 33, "_doc_id": "33_8980210595037744559"}}
{"doc_id": "34_3879180586265776235", "text": "<span> // 通过返回值为 `true` 还是为 `false` 来判断<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 验证是否通过<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span><code><pre><div><p>TypeScript 用户请参考：<a href=\"/guide/typescript/options-api.html#typing-component-emits\">如何为组件所抛出的事件标注类型<a>。 <p><div><p>尽管事件声明是可选的，我们还是推荐你完整地声明所有要触发的事件，以此在代码中作为文档记录组件的用法。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/events.html", "title": "组件事件", "doc_id": "8ef8e549863a479987c4c5e46effb15b", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 701, "chunk_index": 34, "_doc_id": "34_3879180586265776235"}}
{"doc_id": "35_1996700548555534793", "text": "g-component-emits\">如何为组件所抛出的事件标注类型<a>。 <p><div><p>尽管事件声明是可选的，我们还是推荐你完整地声明所有要触发的事件，以此在代码中作为文档记录组件的用法。同时，事件声明能让 Vue 更好地将事件和<a href=\"/guide/components/attrs.html#v-on-listener-inheritance\">透传 attribute<a> 作出区分，从而避免一些由第三方代码触发的自定义 DOM 事件所导致的边界情况。<p><div class=\"tip custom-block\"><p class=\"custom-block-title\">TIP<p><p>如果一个原生事件的名字 (例如 <code>click<code>) 被定义在 <code>emits<code> 选项中，则监听器只会监听组件触发的 <code>click<code> 事件而不会再响应原生的 <code>click<code> 事件。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/events.html", "title": "组件事件", "doc_id": "8ef8e549863a479987c4c5e46effb15b", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 701, "chunk_index": 35, "_doc_id": "35_1996700548555534793"}}
{"doc_id": "36_1863216110543544776", "text": "<code>) 被定义在 <code>emits<code> 选项中，则监听器只会监听组件触发的 <code>click<code> 事件而不会再响应原生的 <code>click<code> 事件。<p><div><h2 id=\"events-validation\">事件校验 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#events-validation\">​<a><h2><p>和对 props 添加类型校验的方式类似，所有触发的事件也可以使用对象形式来描述。<p><p>要为事件添加校验，那么事件可以被赋值为一个函数，接受的参数就是抛出事件时传入 <span class=\"options-api\"><code>this.$emit<code><span><span class=\"composition-api\"><code>emit<code><span> 的内容，返回一个布尔值来表明事件是否合法。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/events.html", "title": "组件事件", "doc_id": "8ef8e549863a479987c4c5e46effb15b", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 701, "chunk_index": 36, "_doc_id": "36_1863216110543544776"}}
{"doc_id": "37_847069264854407687", "text": "ode>this.$emit<code><span><span class=\"composition-api\"><code>emit<code><span> 的内容，返回一个布尔值来表明事件是否合法。<p><div class=\"composition-api\"><div class=\"language-vue\"> <span class=\"lang\">vue<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>script<span><span> setup<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> emit<span><span> =<span><span> defineEmits<span><span>({<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 没有校验<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/events.html", "title": "组件事件", "doc_id": "8ef8e549863a479987c4c5e46effb15b", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 701, "chunk_index": 37, "_doc_id": "37_847069264854407687"}}
{"doc_id": "38_5030646408278340754", "text": "> =<span><span> defineEmits<span><span>({<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 没有校验<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> click: <span><span>null<span><span>,<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 校验 submit 事件<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> submit<span><span>: ({ <span><span>email<span><span>, <span><span>password<span><span> }) <span><span>=><span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> if<span><span> (email <span><span>&&<span><span> password) {<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/events.html", "title": "组件事件", "doc_id": "8ef8e549863a479987c4c5e46effb15b", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 701, "chunk_index": 38, "_doc_id": "38_5030646408278340754"}}
{"doc_id": "39_6068873729474119671", "text": "<span class=\"line\"><span> if<span><span> (email <span><span>&&<span><span> password) {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> return<span><span> true<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> } <span><span>else<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> console.<span><span>warn<span><span>(<span><span>'Invalid submit event payload!'<span><span>)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> return<span><span> false<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/events.html", "title": "组件事件", "doc_id": "8ef8e549863a479987c4c5e46effb15b", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 701, "chunk_index": 39, "_doc_id": "39_6068873729474119671"}}
{"doc_id": "40_2909335485730947610", "text": "> false<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>})<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>function<span><span> submitForm<span><span>(<span><span>email<span><span>, <span><span>password<span><span>) {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> emit<span><span>(<span><span>'submit'<span><span>, { email, password })<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/events.html", "title": "组件事件", "doc_id": "8ef8e549863a479987c4c5e46effb15b", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 701, "chunk_index": 40, "_doc_id": "40_2909335485730947610"}}
{"doc_id": "41_620792350015689225", "text": "<span>'submit'<span><span>, { email, password })<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>script<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><div><div class=\"options-api\"><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> emits: {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 没有校验<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/events.html", "title": "组件事件", "doc_id": "8ef8e549863a479987c4c5e46effb15b", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 701, "chunk_index": 41, "_doc_id": "41_620792350015689225"}}
{"doc_id": "42_4230916275839323949", "text": "<span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> emits: {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 没有校验<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> click: <span><span>null<span><span>,<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 校验 submit 事件<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> submit<span><span>: ({ <span><span>email<span><span>, <span><span>password<span><span> }) <span><span>=><span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> if<span><span> (email <span><span>&&<span><span> password) {<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/events.html", "title": "组件事件", "doc_id": "8ef8e549863a479987c4c5e46effb15b", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 701, "chunk_index": 42, "_doc_id": "42_4230916275839323949"}}
{"doc_id": "43_6068873729474119671", "text": "<span class=\"line\"><span> if<span><span> (email <span><span>&&<span><span> password) {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> return<span><span> true<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> } <span><span>else<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> console.<span><span>warn<span><span>(<span><span>'Invalid submit event payload!'<span><span>)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> return<span><span> false<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/events.html", "title": "组件事件", "doc_id": "8ef8e549863a479987c4c5e46effb15b", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 701, "chunk_index": 43, "_doc_id": "43_6068873729474119671"}}
{"doc_id": "44_7690283179693454634", "text": "> false<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> },<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> methods: {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> submitForm<span><span>(<span><span>email<span><span>, <span><span>password<span><span>) {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> this<span><span>.<span><span>$emit<span><span>(<span><span>'submit'<span><span>, { email, password })<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/events.html", "title": "组件事件", "doc_id": "8ef8e549863a479987c4c5e46effb15b", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 701, "chunk_index": 44, "_doc_id": "44_7690283179693454634"}}
{"doc_id": "45_3135628071287955309", "text": "span>'submit'<span><span>, { email, password })<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span><code><pre><div><div><div><div>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/events.html", "title": "组件事件", "doc_id": "8ef8e549863a479987c4c5e46effb15b", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 701, "chunk_index": 45, "_doc_id": "45_3135628071287955309"}}
{"doc_id": "0_4936996115793506973", "text": "<div><div><h1 id=\"custom-directives\">自定义指令 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#custom-directives\">​<a><h1><h2 id=\"introduction\">介绍 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#introduction\">​<a><h2><p>除了 Vue 内置的一系列指令 (比如 <code>v-model<code> 或 <code>v-show<code>) 之外，Vue 还允许你注册自定义的指令 (Custom Directives)。<p><p>我们已经介绍了两种在 Vue 中重用代码的方式：<a href=\"/guide/essentials/component-basics.html\">组件<a>和<a href=\"./composables.html\">组合式函数<a>。组件是主要的构建模块，而组合式函数则侧重于有状态的逻辑。另一方面，自定义指令主要是为了重用涉及普通元素的底层 DOM 访问的逻辑。<p><p>一个自定义指令由一个包含类似组件生命周期钩子的对象来定义。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/reusability/custom-directives.html", "title": "自定义指令", "doc_id": "02257c1bafb441cc9ed60654a8fbbb0e", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 650, "chunk_index": 0, "_doc_id": "0_4936996115793506973"}}
{"doc_id": "1_4576225682316773330", "text": "组件是主要的构建模块，而组合式函数则侧重于有状态的逻辑。另一方面，自定义指令主要是为了重用涉及普通元素的底层 DOM 访问的逻辑。<p><p>一个自定义指令由一个包含类似组件生命周期钩子的对象来定义。钩子函数会接收到指令所绑定元素作为其参数。下面是一个自定义指令的例子，当 Vue 将元素插入到 DOM 中后，该指令会将一个 class 添加到元素中：<p><div class=\"composition-api\"><div class=\"language-vue\"> <span class=\"lang\">vue<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>script<span><span> setup<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 在模板中启用 v-highlight<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/reusability/custom-directives.html", "title": "自定义指令", "doc_id": "02257c1bafb441cc9ed60654a8fbbb0e", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 650, "chunk_index": 1, "_doc_id": "1_4576225682316773330"}}
{"doc_id": "2_2265665949377366890", "text": "an><span> setup<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 在模板中启用 v-highlight<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> vHighlight<span><span> =<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> mounted<span><span>: (<span><span>el<span><span>) <span><span>=><span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> el.classList.<span><span>add<span><span>(<span><span>'is-highlight'<span><span>)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/reusability/custom-directives.html", "title": "自定义指令", "doc_id": "02257c1bafb441cc9ed60654a8fbbb0e", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 650, "chunk_index": 2, "_doc_id": "2_2265665949377366890"}}
{"doc_id": "3_3793479932205133206", "text": "><span>)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>script<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>p<span><span> v-highlight<span><span>>This sentence is important!</<span><span>p<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/reusability/custom-directives.html", "title": "自定义指令", "doc_id": "02257c1bafb441cc9ed60654a8fbbb0e", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 650, "chunk_index": 3, "_doc_id": "3_3793479932205133206"}}
{"doc_id": "4_4326071410793857437", "text": "><span> v-highlight<span><span>>This sentence is important!</<span><span>p<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><div><div class=\"options-api\"><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> highlight<span><span> =<span><span> {<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/reusability/custom-directives.html", "title": "自定义指令", "doc_id": "02257c1bafb441cc9ed60654a8fbbb0e", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 650, "chunk_index": 4, "_doc_id": "4_4326071410793857437"}}
{"doc_id": "5_300359654357300350", "text": "><code><span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> highlight<span><span> =<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> mounted<span><span>: (<span><span>el<span><span>) <span><span>=><span><span> el.classList.<span><span>add<span><span>(<span><span>'is-highlight'<span><span>)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> directives: {<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/reusability/custom-directives.html", "title": "自定义指令", "doc_id": "02257c1bafb441cc9ed60654a8fbbb0e", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 650, "chunk_index": 5, "_doc_id": "5_300359654357300350"}}
{"doc_id": "6_1397375880177926015", "text": "t<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> directives: {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 在模板中启用 v-highlight<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> highlight<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/reusability/custom-directives.html", "title": "自定义指令", "doc_id": "02257c1bafb441cc9ed60654a8fbbb0e", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 650, "chunk_index": 6, "_doc_id": "6_1397375880177926015"}}
{"doc_id": "7_4471367492866326138", "text": "span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> highlight<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span><code><pre><div><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>p<span><span> v-highlight<span><span>>This sentence is important!</<span><span>p<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><div><div class=\"demo\"><p>This sentence is important!<p><div><div class=\"composition-api\"><p>在 <code><script setup><code> 中，任何以 <code>v<code> 开头的驼峰式命名的变量都可以当作自定义指令使用。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/reusability/custom-directives.html", "title": "自定义指令", "doc_id": "02257c1bafb441cc9ed60654a8fbbb0e", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 650, "chunk_index": 7, "_doc_id": "7_4471367492866326138"}}
{"doc_id": "8_3806090618611181558", "text": "class=\"composition-api\"><p>在 <code><script setup><code> 中，任何以 <code>v<code> 开头的驼峰式命名的变量都可以当作自定义指令使用。在上述例子中，<code>vHighlight<code> 可以在模板中以 <code>v-highlight<code> 的形式使用。<p><p>在不使用 <code><script setup><code> 的情况下，自定义指令需要通过 <code>directives<code> 选项注册：<p><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> setup<span><span>() {<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/reusability/custom-directives.html", "title": "自定义指令", "doc_id": "02257c1bafb441cc9ed60654a8fbbb0e", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 650, "chunk_index": 8, "_doc_id": "8_3806090618611181558"}}
{"doc_id": "9_3864125965280497274", "text": "span> default<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> setup<span><span>() {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> /*...*/<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> },<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> directives: {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 在模板中启用 v-highlight<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> highlight: {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> /* ... */<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/reusability/custom-directives.html", "title": "自定义指令", "doc_id": "02257c1bafb441cc9ed60654a8fbbb0e", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 650, "chunk_index": 9, "_doc_id": "9_3864125965280497274"}}
{"doc_id": "10_4571149499379582031", "text": "... */<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span><code><pre><div><div><div class=\"options-api\"><p>和组件类似，自定义指令在模板中使用前必须先注册。在上面的例子中，我们使用 <code>directives<code> 选项完成了指令的局部注册。<p><div><p>将一个自定义指令全局注册到应用层级也是一种常见的做法：<p><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> app<span><span> =<span><span> createApp<span><span>({})<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/reusability/custom-directives.html", "title": "自定义指令", "doc_id": "02257c1bafb441cc9ed60654a8fbbb0e", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 650, "chunk_index": 10, "_doc_id": "10_4571149499379582031"}}
{"doc_id": "11_305538269856170579", "text": "=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> app<span><span> =<span><span> createApp<span><span>({})<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 使 v-highlight 在所有组件中都可用<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>app.<span><span>directive<span><span>(<span><span>'highlight'<span><span>, {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> /* ... */<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>})<span><span><code><pre><div><p>通过扩展 <code>vue<code> 中的 <code>ComponentCustomProperties<code> 接口，可以为自定义的全局指令添加类型。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/reusability/custom-directives.html", "title": "自定义指令", "doc_id": "02257c1bafb441cc9ed60654a8fbbb0e", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 650, "chunk_index": 11, "_doc_id": "11_305538269856170579"}}
{"doc_id": "12_1802672745088788783", "text": "<code><pre><div><p>通过扩展 <code>vue<code> 中的 <code>ComponentCustomProperties<code> 接口，可以为自定义的全局指令添加类型。<p><p>更多细节参考：<a href=\"/guide/typescript/composition-api.html#typing-global-custom-directives\">为自定义全局指令添加类型<a> <p><h2 id=\"when-to-use\">自定义指令的使用时机 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#when-to-use\">​<a><h2><p>只有当所需功能只能通过直接的 DOM 操作来实现时，才应该使用自定义指令。<p><p>一个常见例子是使元素获取焦点的 <code>v-focus<code> 指令。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/reusability/custom-directives.html", "title": "自定义指令", "doc_id": "02257c1bafb441cc9ed60654a8fbbb0e", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 650, "chunk_index": 12, "_doc_id": "12_1802672745088788783"}}
{"doc_id": "13_4595826270812293981", "text": "o-use\">​<a><h2><p>只有当所需功能只能通过直接的 DOM 操作来实现时，才应该使用自定义指令。<p><p>一个常见例子是使元素获取焦点的 <code>v-focus<code> 指令。<p><div class=\"composition-api\"><div class=\"language-vue\"> <span class=\"lang\">vue<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>script<span><span> setup<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 在模板中启用 v-focus<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> vFocus<span><span> =<span><span> {<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/reusability/custom-directives.html", "title": "自定义指令", "doc_id": "02257c1bafb441cc9ed60654a8fbbb0e", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 650, "chunk_index": 13, "_doc_id": "13_4595826270812293981"}}
{"doc_id": "14_276853647708462936", "text": "an><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> vFocus<span><span> =<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> mounted<span><span>: (<span><span>el<span><span>) <span><span>=><span><span> el.<span><span>focus<span><span>()<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>script<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/reusability/custom-directives.html", "title": "自定义指令", "doc_id": "02257c1bafb441cc9ed60654a8fbbb0e", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 650, "chunk_index": 14, "_doc_id": "14_276853647708462936"}}
{"doc_id": "15_7759366352279599518", "text": ">\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>input<span><span> v-focus<span><span> /><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><div><div class=\"options-api\"><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> focus<span><span> =<span><span> {<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/reusability/custom-directives.html", "title": "自定义指令", "doc_id": "02257c1bafb441cc9ed60654a8fbbb0e", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 650, "chunk_index": 15, "_doc_id": "15_7759366352279599518"}}
{"doc_id": "16_3134244627004408784", "text": "ode\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> focus<span><span> =<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> mounted<span><span>: (<span><span>el<span><span>) <span><span>=><span><span> el.<span><span>focus<span><span>()<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> directives: {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 在模板中启用 v-focus<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/reusability/custom-directives.html", "title": "自定义指令", "doc_id": "02257c1bafb441cc9ed60654a8fbbb0e", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 650, "chunk_index": 16, "_doc_id": "16_3134244627004408784"}}
{"doc_id": "17_6650299634259822072", "text": "ass=\"line\"><span> directives: {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 在模板中启用 v-focus<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> focus<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/reusability/custom-directives.html", "title": "自定义指令", "doc_id": "02257c1bafb441cc9ed60654a8fbbb0e", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 650, "chunk_index": 17, "_doc_id": "17_6650299634259822072"}}
{"doc_id": "18_3010723294224767608", "text": "cus<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> focus<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span><code><pre><div><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>input<span><span> v-focus<span><span> /><span><span><code><pre><div><div><p>该指令比 <code>autofocus<code> 属性更有用，因为它不仅在页面加载时有效，而且在 Vue 动态插入元素时也有效！<p><p>建议尽可能使用 <code>v-bind<code> 等内置指令声明模板，因为它们更高效，对服务端渲染也更友好。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/reusability/custom-directives.html", "title": "自定义指令", "doc_id": "02257c1bafb441cc9ed60654a8fbbb0e", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 650, "chunk_index": 18, "_doc_id": "18_3010723294224767608"}}
{"doc_id": "19_2361924872320388882", "text": "性更有用，因为它不仅在页面加载时有效，而且在 Vue 动态插入元素时也有效！<p><p>建议尽可能使用 <code>v-bind<code> 等内置指令声明模板，因为它们更高效，对服务端渲染也更友好。<p><h2 id=\"directive-hooks\">指令钩子 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#directive-hooks\">​<a><h2><p>一个指令的定义对象可以提供几种钩子函数 (都是可选的)：<p><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> myDirective<span><span> =<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 在绑定元素的 attribute 前<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/reusability/custom-directives.html", "title": "自定义指令", "doc_id": "02257c1bafb441cc9ed60654a8fbbb0e", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 650, "chunk_index": 19, "_doc_id": "19_2361924872320388882"}}
{"doc_id": "20_8471838246390527593", "text": "span><span> =<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 在绑定元素的 attribute 前<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 或事件监听器应用前调用<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> created<span><span>(<span><span>el<span><span>, <span><span>binding<span><span>, <span><span>vnode<span><span>) {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 下面会介绍各个参数的细节<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> },<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 在元素被插入到 DOM 前调用<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/reusability/custom-directives.html", "title": "自定义指令", "doc_id": "02257c1bafb441cc9ed60654a8fbbb0e", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 650, "chunk_index": 20, "_doc_id": "20_8471838246390527593"}}
{"doc_id": "21_3365889527089085230", "text": ">\n<span class=\"line\"><span> },<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 在元素被插入到 DOM 前调用<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> beforeMount<span><span>(<span><span>el<span><span>, <span><span>binding<span><span>, <span><span>vnode<span><span>) {},<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 在绑定元素的父组件<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 及他自己的所有子节点都挂载完成后调用<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/reusability/custom-directives.html", "title": "自定义指令", "doc_id": "02257c1bafb441cc9ed60654a8fbbb0e", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 650, "chunk_index": 21, "_doc_id": "21_3365889527089085230"}}
{"doc_id": "22_8842081860751451888", "text": "=\"line\"><span> // 在绑定元素的父组件<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 及他自己的所有子节点都挂载完成后调用<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> mounted<span><span>(<span><span>el<span><span>, <span><span>binding<span><span>, <span><span>vnode<span><span>) {},<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 绑定元素的父组件更新前调用<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> beforeUpdate<span><span>(<span><span>el<span><span>, <span><span>binding<span><span>, <span><span>vnode<span><span>, <span><span>prevVnode<span><span>) {},<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/reusability/custom-directives.html", "title": "自定义指令", "doc_id": "02257c1bafb441cc9ed60654a8fbbb0e", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 650, "chunk_index": 22, "_doc_id": "22_8842081860751451888"}}
{"doc_id": "23_5253205252361059428", "text": "ding<span><span>, <span><span>vnode<span><span>, <span><span>prevVnode<span><span>) {},<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 在绑定元素的父组件<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 及他自己的所有子节点都更新后调用<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> updated<span><span>(<span><span>el<span><span>, <span><span>binding<span><span>, <span><span>vnode<span><span>, <span><span>prevVnode<span><span>) {},<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 绑定元素的父组件卸载前调用<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/reusability/custom-directives.html", "title": "自定义指令", "doc_id": "02257c1bafb441cc9ed60654a8fbbb0e", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 650, "chunk_index": 23, "_doc_id": "23_5253205252361059428"}}
{"doc_id": "24_208827483997569662", "text": "<span>prevVnode<span><span>) {},<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 绑定元素的父组件卸载前调用<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> beforeUnmount<span><span>(<span><span>el<span><span>, <span><span>binding<span><span>, <span><span>vnode<span><span>) {},<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 绑定元素的父组件卸载后调用<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> unmounted<span><span>(<span><span>el<span><span>, <span><span>binding<span><span>, <span><span>vnode<span><span>) {}<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/reusability/custom-directives.html", "title": "自定义指令", "doc_id": "02257c1bafb441cc9ed60654a8fbbb0e", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 650, "chunk_index": 24, "_doc_id": "24_208827483997569662"}}
{"doc_id": "25_9030883566198232201", "text": "span>el<span><span>, <span><span>binding<span><span>, <span><span>vnode<span><span>) {}<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span><code><pre><div><h3 id=\"hook-arguments\">钩子参数 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#hook-arguments\">​<a><h3><p>指令的钩子会传递以下几种参数：<p><p>举例来说，", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/reusability/custom-directives.html", "title": "自定义指令", "doc_id": "02257c1bafb441cc9ed60654a8fbbb0e", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 650, "chunk_index": 25, "_doc_id": "25_9030883566198232201"}}
{"doc_id": "26_6749895163955012619", "text": "rguments\">钩子参数 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#hook-arguments\">​<a><h3><p>指令的钩子会传递以下几种参数：<p><p>举例来说，像下面这样使用指令：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>div<span><span> v-example<span><span>:<span><span>foo<span><span>.<span><span>bar<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>baz<span><span>\"<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p><code>binding<code> 参数会是一个这样的对象：<p><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>{<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/reusability/custom-directives.html", "title": "自定义指令", "doc_id": "02257c1bafb441cc9ed60654a8fbbb0e", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 650, "chunk_index": 26, "_doc_id": "26_6749895163955012619"}}
{"doc_id": "27_6085814655305516967", "text": "=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>{<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> arg<span><span>: <span><span>'foo'<span><span>,<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> modifiers<span><span>: { <span><span>bar<span><span>: <span><span>true<span><span> },<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> value<span><span>: <span><span>/* `baz` 的值 */<span><span>,<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> oldValue<span><span>: <span><span>/* 上一次更新时 `baz` 的值 */<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/reusability/custom-directives.html", "title": "自定义指令", "doc_id": "02257c1bafb441cc9ed60654a8fbbb0e", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 650, "chunk_index": 27, "_doc_id": "27_6085814655305516967"}}
{"doc_id": "28_47753632511962328", "text": "span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> oldValue<span><span>: <span><span>/* 上一次更新时 `baz` 的值 */<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span><code><pre><div><p>和内置指令类似，自定义指令的参数也可以是动态的。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/reusability/custom-directives.html", "title": "自定义指令", "doc_id": "02257c1bafb441cc9ed60654a8fbbb0e", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 650, "chunk_index": 28, "_doc_id": "28_47753632511962328"}}
{"doc_id": "29_4472410106953711706", "text": "的值 */<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span><code><pre><div><p>和内置指令类似，自定义指令的参数也可以是动态的。举例来说：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>div<span><span> v-example:<span><span>[<span><span>arg<span><span>]=<span><span>\"value\"<span><span>></<span><span>div<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>这里指令的参数会基于组件的 <code>arg<code> 数据属性响应式地更新。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/reusability/custom-directives.html", "title": "自定义指令", "doc_id": "02257c1bafb441cc9ed60654a8fbbb0e", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 650, "chunk_index": 29, "_doc_id": "29_4472410106953711706"}}
{"doc_id": "30_1749559985005093124", "text": "<span><span>div<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>这里指令的参数会基于组件的 <code>arg<code> 数据属性响应式地更新。<p><div class=\"tip custom-block\"><p class=\"custom-block-title\">Note<p><p>除了 <code>el<code> 外，其他参数都是只读的，不要更改它们。若你需要在不同的钩子间共享信息，推荐通过元素的 <a href=\"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/API/HTMLElement/dataset\" target=\"_blank\">dataset<a> attribute 实现。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/reusability/custom-directives.html", "title": "自定义指令", "doc_id": "02257c1bafb441cc9ed60654a8fbbb0e", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 650, "chunk_index": 30, "_doc_id": "30_1749559985005093124"}}
{"doc_id": "31_6092583910737958366", "text": "veloper.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/API/HTMLElement/dataset\" target=\"_blank\">dataset<a> attribute 实现。<p><div><h2 id=\"function-shorthand\">简化形式 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#function-shorthand\">​<a><h2><p>对于自定义指令来说，一个很常见的情况是仅仅需要在 <code>mounted<code> 和 <code>updated<code> 上实现相同的行为，除此之外并不需要其他钩子。这种情况下我们可以直接用一个函数来定义指令，", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/reusability/custom-directives.html", "title": "自定义指令", "doc_id": "02257c1bafb441cc9ed60654a8fbbb0e", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 650, "chunk_index": 31, "_doc_id": "31_6092583910737958366"}}
{"doc_id": "32_1588792238883662359", "text": "个很常见的情况是仅仅需要在 <code>mounted<code> 和 <code>updated<code> 上实现相同的行为，除此之外并不需要其他钩子。这种情况下我们可以直接用一个函数来定义指令，如下所示：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>div<span><span> v-color<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>color<span><span>\"<span><span>></<span><span>div<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>app.<span><span>directive<span><span>(<span><span>'color'<span><span>,", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/reusability/custom-directives.html", "title": "自定义指令", "doc_id": "02257c1bafb441cc9ed60654a8fbbb0e", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 650, "chunk_index": 32, "_doc_id": "32_1588792238883662359"}}
{"doc_id": "33_3162558646259435978", "text": "ode><span class=\"line\"><span>app.<span><span>directive<span><span>(<span><span>'color'<span><span>, (<span><span>el<span><span>, <span><span>binding<span><span>) <span><span>=><span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 这会在 `mounted` 和 `updated` 时都调用<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> el.style.color <span><span>=<span><span> binding.value<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/reusability/custom-directives.html", "title": "自定义指令", "doc_id": "02257c1bafb441cc9ed60654a8fbbb0e", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 650, "chunk_index": 33, "_doc_id": "33_3162558646259435978"}}
{"doc_id": "34_1739609004948198872", "text": "<span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> el.style.color <span><span>=<span><span> binding.value<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>})<span><span><code><pre><div><h2 id=\"object-literals\">对象字面量 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#object-literals\">​<a><h2><p>如果你的指令需要多个值，你可以向它传递一个 JavaScript 对象字面量。别忘了，指令也可以接收任何合法的 JavaScript 表达式。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/reusability/custom-directives.html", "title": "自定义指令", "doc_id": "02257c1bafb441cc9ed60654a8fbbb0e", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 650, "chunk_index": 34, "_doc_id": "34_1739609004948198872"}}
{"doc_id": "35_321160523916089893", "text": "#object-literals\">​<a><h2><p>如果你的指令需要多个值，你可以向它传递一个 JavaScript 对象字面量。别忘了，指令也可以接收任何合法的 JavaScript 表达式。<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>div<span><span> v-demo<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>{ color: <span><span>'white'<span><span>,", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/reusability/custom-directives.html", "title": "自定义指令", "doc_id": "02257c1bafb441cc9ed60654a8fbbb0e", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 650, "chunk_index": 35, "_doc_id": "35_321160523916089893"}}
{"doc_id": "36_2040525059463013105", "text": "v<span><span> v-demo<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>{ color: <span><span>'white'<span><span>, text: <span><span>'hello!'<span><span> }<span><span>\"<span><span>></<span><span>div<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>app.<span><span>directive<span><span>(<span><span>'demo'<span><span>, (<span><span>el<span><span>,", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/reusability/custom-directives.html", "title": "自定义指令", "doc_id": "02257c1bafb441cc9ed60654a8fbbb0e", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 650, "chunk_index": 36, "_doc_id": "36_2040525059463013105"}}
{"doc_id": "37_5807342873054669086", "text": ">app.<span><span>directive<span><span>(<span><span>'demo'<span><span>, (<span><span>el<span><span>, <span><span>binding<span><span>) <span><span>=><span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> console.<span><span>log<span><span>(binding.value.color) <span><span>// => \"white\"<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> console.<span><span>log<span><span>(binding.value.text) <span><span>// => \"hello!\"<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/reusability/custom-directives.html", "title": "自定义指令", "doc_id": "02257c1bafb441cc9ed60654a8fbbb0e", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 650, "chunk_index": 37, "_doc_id": "37_5807342873054669086"}}
{"doc_id": "38_1455251841568813712", "text": "pan> console.<span><span>log<span><span>(binding.value.text) <span><span>// => \"hello!\"<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>})<span><span><code><pre><div><h2 id=\"usage-on-components\">在组件上使用 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#usage-on-components\">​<a><h2><div class=\"warning custom-block\"><p class=\"custom-block-title\">不推荐<p><p>不推荐在组件上使用自定义指令。当组件具有多个根节点时可能会出现预期外的行为。<p><div><p>当在组件上使用自定义指令时，它会始终应用于组件的根节点，和<a href=\"/guide/components/attrs.html\">透传 attributes<a> 类似。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/reusability/custom-directives.html", "title": "自定义指令", "doc_id": "02257c1bafb441cc9ed60654a8fbbb0e", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 650, "chunk_index": 38, "_doc_id": "38_1455251841568813712"}}
{"doc_id": "39_7972617647991826527", "text": "。<p><div><p>当在组件上使用自定义指令时，它会始终应用于组件的根节点，和<a href=\"/guide/components/attrs.html\">透传 attributes<a> 类似。<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>MyComponent<span><span> v-demo<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>test<span><span>\"<span><span> /><span><span><code><pre><div><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><!-- MyComponent 的模板 --><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/reusability/custom-directives.html", "title": "自定义指令", "doc_id": "02257c1bafb441cc9ed60654a8fbbb0e", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 650, "chunk_index": 39, "_doc_id": "39_7972617647991826527"}}
{"doc_id": "40_8257586658403397699", "text": "ass=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><!-- MyComponent 的模板 --><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>div<span><span>> <span><span><!-- v-demo 指令会被应用在此处 --><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>span<span><span>>My component content</<span><span>span<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/reusability/custom-directives.html", "title": "自定义指令", "doc_id": "02257c1bafb441cc9ed60654a8fbbb0e", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 650, "chunk_index": 40, "_doc_id": "40_8257586658403397699"}}
{"doc_id": "41_1648436935771564615", "text": "span> <<span><span>span<span><span>>My component content</<span><span>span<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>div<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>需要注意的是组件可能含有多个根节点。当应用到一个多根组件时，指令将会被忽略且抛出一个警告。和 attribute 不同，指令不能通过 <code>v-bind=\"$attrs\"<code> 来传递给一个不同的元素。<p><div><div>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/reusability/custom-directives.html", "title": "自定义指令", "doc_id": "02257c1bafb441cc9ed60654a8fbbb0e", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 650, "chunk_index": 41, "_doc_id": "41_1648436935771564615"}}
{"doc_id": "0_9156409863713439776", "text": "<div><div><h1 id=\"plugins\">插件 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#plugins\">​<a><h1><h2 id=\"introduction\">介绍 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#introduction\">​<a><h2><p>插件 (Plugins) 是一种能为 Vue 添加全局功能的工具代码。下面是如何安装一个插件的示例：<p><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>import<span><span> { createApp } <span><span>from<span><span> 'vue'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/reusability/plugins.html", "title": "插件 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "dee3381f32f1454097a0028027f78670", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 378, "chunk_index": 0, "_doc_id": "0_9156409863713439776"}}
{"doc_id": "1_9085899629983010793", "text": "<span><span> { createApp } <span><span>from<span><span> 'vue'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> app<span><span> =<span><span> createApp<span><span>({})<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>app.<span><span>use<span><span>(myPlugin, {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> /* 可选的选项 */<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/reusability/plugins.html", "title": "插件 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "dee3381f32f1454097a0028027f78670", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 378, "chunk_index": 1, "_doc_id": "1_9085899629983010793"}}
{"doc_id": "2_3374929691453360183", "text": "pan><span>use<span><span>(myPlugin, {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> /* 可选的选项 */<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>})<span><span><code><pre><div><p>一个插件可以是一个拥有 <code>install()<code> 方法的对象，也可以直接是一个安装函数本身。安装函数会接收到安装它的<a href=\"/api/application.html\">应用实例<a>和传递给 <code>app.use()<code> 的额外选项作为参数：<p><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> myPlugin<span><span> =<span><span> {<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/reusability/plugins.html", "title": "插件 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "dee3381f32f1454097a0028027f78670", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 378, "chunk_index": 2, "_doc_id": "2_3374929691453360183"}}
{"doc_id": "3_416382935403796471", "text": "\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> myPlugin<span><span> =<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> install<span><span>(<span><span>app<span><span>, <span><span>options<span><span>) {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 配置此应用<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/reusability/plugins.html", "title": "插件 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "dee3381f32f1454097a0028027f78670", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 378, "chunk_index": 3, "_doc_id": "3_416382935403796471"}}
{"doc_id": "4_3544679810014737843", "text": "<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 配置此应用<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span><code><pre><div><p>插件没有严格定义的使用范围，但是插件发挥作用的常见场景主要包括以下几种：<p><ol><li><p>通过 <a href=\"/api/application.html#app-component\"><code>app.component()<code><a> 和 <a href=\"/api/application.html#app-directive\"><code>app.directive()<code><a> 注册一到多个全局组件或自定义指令。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/reusability/plugins.html", "title": "插件 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "dee3381f32f1454097a0028027f78670", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 378, "chunk_index": 4, "_doc_id": "4_3544679810014737843"}}
{"doc_id": "5_4246401145153986171", "text": "<a> 和 <a href=\"/api/application.html#app-directive\"><code>app.directive()<code><a> 注册一到多个全局组件或自定义指令。<p><li><li><p>通过 <a href=\"/api/application.html#app-provide\"><code>app.provide()<code><a> 使一个资源<a href=\"/guide/components/provide-inject.html\">可被注入<a>进整个应用。<p><li><li><p>向 <a href=\"/api/application.html#app-config-globalproperties\"><code>app.config.globalProperties<code><a> 中添加一些全局实例属性或方法<p><li><li><p>一个可能上述三种都包含了的功能库 (例如 <a href=\"https://github.com/vuejs/vue-router-next\" target=\"_blank\">vue-router<a>)。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/reusability/plugins.html", "title": "插件 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "dee3381f32f1454097a0028027f78670", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 378, "chunk_index": 5, "_doc_id": "5_4246401145153986171"}}
{"doc_id": "6_7092477495929906801", "text": "能上述三种都包含了的功能库 (例如 <a href=\"https://github.com/vuejs/vue-router-next\" target=\"_blank\">vue-router<a>)。<p><li><ol><h2 id=\"writing-a-plugin\">编写一个插件 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#writing-a-plugin\">​<a><h2><p>为了更好地理解如何构建 Vue.js 插件，我们可以试着写一个简单的 <code>i18n<code> (<a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Internationalization_and_localization\" target=\"_blank\">国际化 (Internationalization)<a> 的缩写) 插件。<p><p>让我们从设置插件对象开始。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/reusability/plugins.html", "title": "插件 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "dee3381f32f1454097a0028027f78670", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 378, "chunk_index": 6, "_doc_id": "6_7092477495929906801"}}
{"doc_id": "7_2294151971993937169", "text": "lization_and_localization\" target=\"_blank\">国际化 (Internationalization)<a> 的缩写) 插件。<p><p>让我们从设置插件对象开始。建议在一个单独的文件中创建并导出它，以保证更好地管理逻辑，如下所示：<p><div class=\"vp-code-block-title\"><p class=\"vp-code-block-title-bar\"><span class=\"vp-code-block-title-text\">plugins/i18n.js<span><p><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/reusability/plugins.html", "title": "插件 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "dee3381f32f1454097a0028027f78670", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 378, "chunk_index": 7, "_doc_id": "7_2294151971993937169"}}
{"doc_id": "8_3580437134999047433", "text": "b-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> install<span><span>: (<span><span>app<span><span>, <span><span>options<span><span>) <span><span>=><span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 在这里编写插件代码<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span><code><pre><div><div><p>我们希望有一个翻译函数，这个函数接收一个以 <code>.<code> 作为分隔符的 <code>key<code> 字符串，用来在用户提供的翻译字典中查找对应语言的文本。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/reusability/plugins.html", "title": "插件 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "dee3381f32f1454097a0028027f78670", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 378, "chunk_index": 8, "_doc_id": "8_3580437134999047433"}}
{"doc_id": "9_1122899782572828748", "text": "><div><div><p>我们希望有一个翻译函数，这个函数接收一个以 <code>.<code> 作为分隔符的 <code>key<code> 字符串，用来在用户提供的翻译字典中查找对应语言的文本。期望的使用方式如下：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>h1<span><span>>{{ <span><span>$translate<span><span>(<span><span>'greetings.hello'<span><span>) }}</<span><span>h1<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>这个函数应当能够在任意模板中被全局调用。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/reusability/plugins.html", "title": "插件 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "dee3381f32f1454097a0028027f78670", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 378, "chunk_index": 9, "_doc_id": "9_1122899782572828748"}}
{"doc_id": "10_5705557936894747324", "text": "llo'<span><span>) }}</<span><span>h1<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>这个函数应当能够在任意模板中被全局调用。这一点可以通过在插件中将它添加到 <code>app.config.globalProperties<code> 上来实现：<p><div class=\"vp-code-block-title\"><p class=\"vp-code-block-title-bar\"><span class=\"vp-code-block-title-text\">plugins/i18n.js<span><p><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/reusability/plugins.html", "title": "插件 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "dee3381f32f1454097a0028027f78670", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 378, "chunk_index": 10, "_doc_id": "10_5705557936894747324"}}
{"doc_id": "11_3536719242354412608", "text": "b-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> install<span><span>: (<span><span>app<span><span>, <span><span>options<span><span>) <span><span>=><span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line highlighted\"><span> // 注入一个全局可用的 $translate() 方法<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/reusability/plugins.html", "title": "插件 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "dee3381f32f1454097a0028027f78670", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 378, "chunk_index": 11, "_doc_id": "11_3536719242354412608"}}
{"doc_id": "12_4837349727779318903", "text": "<span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line highlighted\"><span> // 注入一个全局可用的 $translate() 方法<span><span>\n<span class=\"line highlighted\"><span> app.config.globalProperties.<span><span>$translate<span><span> =<span><span> (<span><span>key<span><span>) <span><span>=><span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line highlighted\"><span> // 获取 `options` 对象的深层属性<span><span>\n<span class=\"line highlighted\"><span> // 使用 `key` 作为索引<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/reusability/plugins.html", "title": "插件 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "dee3381f32f1454097a0028027f78670", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 378, "chunk_index": 12, "_doc_id": "12_4837349727779318903"}}
{"doc_id": "13_7261485880680994903", "text": "获取 `options` 对象的深层属性<span><span>\n<span class=\"line highlighted\"><span> // 使用 `key` 作为索引<span><span>\n<span class=\"line highlighted\"><span> return<span><span> key.<span><span>split<span><span>(<span><span>'.'<span><span>).<span><span>reduce<span><span>((<span><span>o<span><span>, <span><span>i<span><span>) <span><span>=><span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line highlighted\"><span> if<span><span> (o) <span><span>return<span><span> o[i]<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/reusability/plugins.html", "title": "插件 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "dee3381f32f1454097a0028027f78670", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 378, "chunk_index": 13, "_doc_id": "13_7261485880680994903"}}
{"doc_id": "14_8786014986502264295", "text": "class=\"line highlighted\"><span> if<span><span> (o) <span><span>return<span><span> o[i]<span><span>\n<span class=\"line highlighted\"><span> }, options)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line highlighted\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/reusability/plugins.html", "title": "插件 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "dee3381f32f1454097a0028027f78670", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 378, "chunk_index": 14, "_doc_id": "14_8786014986502264295"}}
{"doc_id": "15_5571986517150937184", "text": "><span>\n<span class=\"line highlighted\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span><code><pre><div><div><p>我们的 <code>$translate<code> 函数会接收一个例如 <code>greetings.hello<code> 的字符串，在用户提供的翻译字典中查找，并返回翻译得到的值。<p><p>用于查找的翻译字典对象则应当在插件被安装时作为 <code>app.use()<code> 的额外参数被传入：<p><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>import<span><span> i18nPlugin <span><span>from<span><span> './plugins/i18n'<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/reusability/plugins.html", "title": "插件 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "dee3381f32f1454097a0028027f78670", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 378, "chunk_index": 15, "_doc_id": "15_5571986517150937184"}}
{"doc_id": "16_1026203998712371700", "text": "line\"><span>import<span><span> i18nPlugin <span><span>from<span><span> './plugins/i18n'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>app.<span><span>use<span><span>(i18nPlugin, {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> greetings: {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> hello: <span><span>'Bonjour!'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/reusability/plugins.html", "title": "插件 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "dee3381f32f1454097a0028027f78670", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 378, "chunk_index": 16, "_doc_id": "16_1026203998712371700"}}
{"doc_id": "17_1395000501564248002", "text": "ass=\"line\"><span> hello: <span><span>'Bonjour!'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>})<span><span><code><pre><div><p>这样，我们一开始的表达式 <code>$translate('greetings.hello')<code> 就会在运行时被替换为 <code>Bonjour!<code> 了。<p><p>TypeScript 用户请参考：<a href=\"/guide/typescript/options-api.html#augmenting-global-properties\">扩展全局属性<a> <p><div class=\"tip custom-block\"><p class=\"custom-block-title\">TIP<p><p>请谨慎使用全局属性，如果在整个应用中使用不同插件注入的太多全局属性，很容易让应用变得难以理解和维护。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/reusability/plugins.html", "title": "插件 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "dee3381f32f1454097a0028027f78670", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 378, "chunk_index": 17, "_doc_id": "17_1395000501564248002"}}
{"doc_id": "18_5102605589634443041", "text": "tom-block\"><p class=\"custom-block-title\">TIP<p><p>请谨慎使用全局属性，如果在整个应用中使用不同插件注入的太多全局属性，很容易让应用变得难以理解和维护。<p><div><h3 id=\"provide-inject-with-plugins\">插件中的 Provide / Inject <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#provide-inject-with-plugins\">​<a><h3><p>在插件中，我们可以通过 <code>provide<code> 来为插件用户提供访问某个函数或属性的能力。举例来说，我们可以将插件接收到的 <code>options<code> 参数提供给整个应用，让任何组件都能使用这个翻译字典对象。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/reusability/plugins.html", "title": "插件 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "dee3381f32f1454097a0028027f78670", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 378, "chunk_index": 18, "_doc_id": "18_5102605589634443041"}}
{"doc_id": "19_7068142497550008731", "text": "provide<code> 来为插件用户提供访问某个函数或属性的能力。举例来说，我们可以将插件接收到的 <code>options<code> 参数提供给整个应用，让任何组件都能使用这个翻译字典对象。<p><div class=\"vp-code-block-title\"><p class=\"vp-code-block-title-bar\"><span class=\"vp-code-block-title-text\">plugins/i18n.js<span><p><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/reusability/plugins.html", "title": "插件 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "dee3381f32f1454097a0028027f78670", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 378, "chunk_index": 19, "_doc_id": "19_7068142497550008731"}}
{"doc_id": "20_3800879259054431984", "text": "b-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> install<span><span>: (<span><span>app<span><span>, <span><span>options<span><span>) <span><span>=><span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line highlighted\"><span> app.<span><span>provide<span><span>(<span><span>'i18n'<span><span>, options)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/reusability/plugins.html", "title": "插件 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "dee3381f32f1454097a0028027f78670", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 378, "chunk_index": 20, "_doc_id": "20_3800879259054431984"}}
{"doc_id": "21_7334704036411695462", "text": "<span>(<span><span>'i18n'<span><span>, options)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span><code><pre><div><div><p>现在，插件用户就可以在他们的组件中以 <code>i18n<code> 为 key 注入并访问插件的选项对象了。<p><div class=\"composition-api\"><div class=\"language-vue\"> <span class=\"lang\">vue<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>script<span><span> setup<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/reusability/plugins.html", "title": "插件 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "dee3381f32f1454097a0028027f78670", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 378, "chunk_index": 21, "_doc_id": "21_7334704036411695462"}}
{"doc_id": "22_6108058491823397978", "text": "code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>script<span><span> setup<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>import<span><span> { inject } <span><span>from<span><span> 'vue'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line highlighted\"><span>const<span><span> i18n<span><span> =<span><span> inject<span><span>(<span><span>'i18n'<span><span>)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>console.<span><span>log<span><span>(i18n.greetings.hello)<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/reusability/plugins.html", "title": "插件 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "dee3381f32f1454097a0028027f78670", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 378, "chunk_index": 22, "_doc_id": "22_6108058491823397978"}}
{"doc_id": "23_3829606015929164516", "text": "pan>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>console.<span><span>log<span><span>(i18n.greetings.hello)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>script<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><div><div class=\"options-api\"><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line highlighted\"><span> inject: [<span><span>'i18n'<span><span>],<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/reusability/plugins.html", "title": "插件 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "dee3381f32f1454097a0028027f78670", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 378, "chunk_index": 23, "_doc_id": "23_3829606015929164516"}}
{"doc_id": "24_3339583222648423302", "text": "><span>\n<span class=\"line highlighted\"><span> inject: [<span><span>'i18n'<span><span>],<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> created<span><span>() {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> console.<span><span>log<span><span>(<span><span>this<span><span>.i18n.greetings.hello)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/reusability/plugins.html", "title": "插件 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "dee3381f32f1454097a0028027f78670", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 378, "chunk_index": 24, "_doc_id": "24_3339583222648423302"}}
{"doc_id": "25_8578304339949412281", "text": "an><span>this<span><span>.i18n.greetings.hello)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span><code><pre><div><div><h3 id=\"为-npm-打包\">为 NPM 打包 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#%E4%B8%BA-npm-%E6%89%93%E5%8C%85\">​<a><h3><p>如果你想进一步打包并发布插件给他人使用，请参阅 <a href=\"https://vite.dev/guide/build.html#library-mode\" target=\"_blank\">Vite 库模式<a>。<p><div><div>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/reusability/plugins.html", "title": "插件 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "dee3381f32f1454097a0028027f78670", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 378, "chunk_index": 25, "_doc_id": "25_8578304339949412281"}}
{"doc_id": "0_2239228992484047734", "text": "<div><div><h1 id=\"component-registration\">组件注册 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#component-registration\">​<a><h1><blockquote><p>此章节假设你已经看过了<a href=\"/guide/essentials/component-basics.html\">组件基础<a>。若你还不了解组件是什么，请先阅读该章节。<p><blockquote><p>一个 Vue 组件在使用前需要先被“注册”，这样 Vue 才能在渲染模板时找到其对应的实现。组件注册有两种方式：全局注册和局部注册。<p><h2 id=\"global-registration\">全局注册 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#global-registration\">​<a><h2><p>我们可以使用 <a href=\"/guide/essentials/application.html\">Vue 应用实例<a>的 <code>.component()<code> 方法，让组件在当前 Vue 应用中全局可用。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/registration.html", "title": "组件注册", "doc_id": "e5195ba3869f4ca3bbcc19b20649038f", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 328, "chunk_index": 0, "_doc_id": "0_2239228992484047734"}}
{"doc_id": "1_18069431095068288", "text": "ef=\"/guide/essentials/application.html\">Vue 应用实例<a>的 <code>.component()<code> 方法，让组件在当前 Vue 应用中全局可用。<p><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>import<span><span> { createApp } <span><span>from<span><span> 'vue'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> app<span><span> =<span><span> createApp<span><span>({})<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/registration.html", "title": "组件注册", "doc_id": "e5195ba3869f4ca3bbcc19b20649038f", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 328, "chunk_index": 1, "_doc_id": "1_18069431095068288"}}
{"doc_id": "2_3480362485467260311", "text": "span> app<span><span> =<span><span> createApp<span><span>({})<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>app.<span><span>component<span><span>(<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 注册的名字<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> 'MyComponent'<span><span>,<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 组件的实现<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> /* ... */<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/registration.html", "title": "组件注册", "doc_id": "e5195ba3869f4ca3bbcc19b20649038f", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 328, "chunk_index": 2, "_doc_id": "2_3480362485467260311"}}
{"doc_id": "3_1975476251979953161", "text": "span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> /* ... */<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>)<span><span><code><pre><div><p>如果使用单文件组件，你可以注册被导入的 <code>.vue<code> 文件：<p><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>import<span><span> MyComponent <span><span>from<span><span> './App.vue'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/registration.html", "title": "组件注册", "doc_id": "e5195ba3869f4ca3bbcc19b20649038f", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 328, "chunk_index": 3, "_doc_id": "3_1975476251979953161"}}
{"doc_id": "4_3661771424110590034", "text": "n><span> MyComponent <span><span>from<span><span> './App.vue'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>app.<span><span>component<span><span>(<span><span>'MyComponent'<span><span>, MyComponent)<span><span><code><pre><div><p><code>.component()<code> 方法可以被链式调用：<p><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>app<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/registration.html", "title": "组件注册", "doc_id": "e5195ba3869f4ca3bbcc19b20649038f", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 328, "chunk_index": 4, "_doc_id": "4_3661771424110590034"}}
{"doc_id": "5_5343692204238314236", "text": "lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>app<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> .<span><span>component<span><span>(<span><span>'ComponentA'<span><span>, ComponentA)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> .<span><span>component<span><span>(<span><span>'ComponentB'<span><span>, ComponentB)<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/registration.html", "title": "组件注册", "doc_id": "e5195ba3869f4ca3bbcc19b20649038f", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 328, "chunk_index": 5, "_doc_id": "5_5343692204238314236"}}
{"doc_id": "6_3426662589542621905", "text": "n> .<span><span>component<span><span>(<span><span>'ComponentB'<span><span>, ComponentB)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> .<span><span>component<span><span>(<span><span>'ComponentC'<span><span>, ComponentC)<span><span><code><pre><div><p>全局注册的组件可以在此应用的任意组件的模板中使用：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><!-- 这在当前应用的任意组件中都可用 --><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/registration.html", "title": "组件注册", "doc_id": "e5195ba3869f4ca3bbcc19b20649038f", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 328, "chunk_index": 6, "_doc_id": "6_3426662589542621905"}}
{"doc_id": "7_2563488028626611498", "text": "ass=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><!-- 这在当前应用的任意组件中都可用 --><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>ComponentA<span><span>/><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>ComponentB<span><span>/><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>ComponentC<span><span>/><span><span><code><pre><div><p>所有的子组件也可以使用全局注册的组件，这意味着这三个组件也都可以在<em>彼此内部<em>使用。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/registration.html", "title": "组件注册", "doc_id": "e5195ba3869f4ca3bbcc19b20649038f", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 328, "chunk_index": 7, "_doc_id": "7_2563488028626611498"}}
{"doc_id": "8_3076847348273302462", "text": "ponentC<span><span>/><span><span><code><pre><div><p>所有的子组件也可以使用全局注册的组件，这意味着这三个组件也都可以在<em>彼此内部<em>使用。<p><h2 id=\"local-registration\">局部注册 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#local-registration\">​<a><h2><p>全局注册虽然很方便，但有以下几个问题：<p><ol><li><p>全局注册，但并没有被使用的组件无法在生产打包时被自动移除 (也叫“tree-shaking”)。如果你全局注册了一个组件，即使它并没有被实际使用，它仍然会出现在打包后的 JS 文件中。<p><li><li><p>全局注册在大型项目中使项目的依赖关系变得不那么明确。在父组件中使用子组件时，不太容易定位子组件的实现。和使用过多的全局变量一样，这可能会影响应用长期的可维护性。<p><li><ol><p>相比之下，局部注册的组件需要在使用它的父组件中显式导入，并且只能在该父组件中使用。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/registration.html", "title": "组件注册", "doc_id": "e5195ba3869f4ca3bbcc19b20649038f", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 328, "chunk_index": 8, "_doc_id": "8_3076847348273302462"}}
{"doc_id": "9_2481032955495198935", "text": "件时，不太容易定位子组件的实现。和使用过多的全局变量一样，这可能会影响应用长期的可维护性。<p><li><ol><p>相比之下，局部注册的组件需要在使用它的父组件中显式导入，并且只能在该父组件中使用。它的优点是使组件之间的依赖关系更加明确，并且对 tree-shaking 更加友好。<p><div class=\"composition-api\"><p>在使用 <code><script setup><code> 的单文件组件中，导入的组件可以直接在模板中使用，无需注册：<p><div class=\"language-vue\"> <span class=\"lang\">vue<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>script<span><span> setup<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/registration.html", "title": "组件注册", "doc_id": "e5195ba3869f4ca3bbcc19b20649038f", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 328, "chunk_index": 9, "_doc_id": "9_2481032955495198935"}}
{"doc_id": "10_710777954203186984", "text": "code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>script<span><span> setup<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>import<span><span> ComponentA <span><span>from<span><span> './ComponentA.vue'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>script<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>ComponentA<span><span> /><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/registration.html", "title": "组件注册", "doc_id": "e5195ba3869f4ca3bbcc19b20649038f", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 328, "chunk_index": 10, "_doc_id": "10_710777954203186984"}}
{"doc_id": "11_3949554194201488819", "text": "an><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>ComponentA<span><span> /><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>如果没有使用 <code><script setup><code>，则需要使用 <code>components<code> 选项来显式注册：<p><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>import<span><span> ComponentA <span><span>from<span><span> './ComponentA.js'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/registration.html", "title": "组件注册", "doc_id": "e5195ba3869f4ca3bbcc19b20649038f", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 328, "chunk_index": 11, "_doc_id": "11_3949554194201488819"}}
{"doc_id": "12_2546067945202640631", "text": "an> ComponentA <span><span>from<span><span> './ComponentA.js'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> components: {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> ComponentA<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> },<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> setup<span><span>() {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // ...<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/registration.html", "title": "组件注册", "doc_id": "e5195ba3869f4ca3bbcc19b20649038f", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 328, "chunk_index": 12, "_doc_id": "12_2546067945202640631"}}
{"doc_id": "13_494581805575123986", "text": "{<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // ...<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span><code><pre><div><div><div class=\"options-api\"><p>局部注册需要使用 <code>components<code> 选项：<p><div class=\"language-vue\"> <span class=\"lang\">vue<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>script<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>import<span><span> ComponentA <span><span>from<span><span> './ComponentA.vue'<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/registration.html", "title": "组件注册", "doc_id": "e5195ba3869f4ca3bbcc19b20649038f", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 328, "chunk_index": 13, "_doc_id": "13_494581805575123986"}}
{"doc_id": "14_3501886349879127989", "text": "ne\"><span>import<span><span> ComponentA <span><span>from<span><span> './ComponentA.vue'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> components: {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> ComponentA<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>script<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/registration.html", "title": "组件注册", "doc_id": "e5195ba3869f4ca3bbcc19b20649038f", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 328, "chunk_index": 14, "_doc_id": "14_3501886349879127989"}}
{"doc_id": "15_2707773816189966078", "text": "n>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>script<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>ComponentA<span><span> /><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/registration.html", "title": "组件注册", "doc_id": "e5195ba3869f4ca3bbcc19b20649038f", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 328, "chunk_index": 15, "_doc_id": "15_2707773816189966078"}}
{"doc_id": "16_5734202013123315706", "text": "an><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>ComponentA<span><span> /><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><div><p>对于每个 <code>components<code> 对象里的属性，它们的 key 名就是注册的组件名，而值就是相应组件的实现。上面的例子中使用的是 ES2015 的缩写语法，等价于：<p><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/registration.html", "title": "组件注册", "doc_id": "e5195ba3869f4ca3bbcc19b20649038f", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 328, "chunk_index": 16, "_doc_id": "16_5734202013123315706"}}
{"doc_id": "17_8304087341481418758", "text": "b-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> components: {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> ComponentA: ComponentA<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // ...<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span><code><pre><div><p>请注意：<strong>局部注册的组件在后代组件中<i>不<i>可用<strong>。在这个例子中，<code>ComponentA<code> 注册后仅在当前组件可用，而在任何的子组件或更深层的子组件中都不可用。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/registration.html", "title": "组件注册", "doc_id": "e5195ba3869f4ca3bbcc19b20649038f", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 328, "chunk_index": 17, "_doc_id": "17_8304087341481418758"}}
{"doc_id": "18_4860453493985931268", "text": "rong>局部注册的组件在后代组件中<i>不<i>可用<strong>。在这个例子中，<code>ComponentA<code> 注册后仅在当前组件可用，而在任何的子组件或更深层的子组件中都不可用。<p><h2 id=\"component-name-casing\">组件名格式 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#component-name-casing\">​<a><h2><p>在整个指引中，我们都使用 PascalCase 作为组件名的注册格式，这是因为：<p><ol><li><p>PascalCase 是合法的 JavaScript 标识符。这使得在 JavaScript 中导入和注册组件都很容易，同时 IDE 也能提供较好的自动补全。<p><li><li><p><code><PascalCase /><code> 在模板中更明显地表明了这是一个 Vue 组件，而不是原生 HTML 元素。同时也能够将 Vue 组件和自定义元素 (web components) 区分开来。<p><li><ol><p>在单文件组件和内联字符串模板中，我们都推荐这样做。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/registration.html", "title": "组件注册", "doc_id": "e5195ba3869f4ca3bbcc19b20649038f", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 328, "chunk_index": 18, "_doc_id": "18_4860453493985931268"}}
{"doc_id": "19_3827768307960617511", "text": "e 组件，而不是原生 HTML 元素。同时也能够将 Vue 组件和自定义元素 (web components) 区分开来。<p><li><ol><p>在单文件组件和内联字符串模板中，我们都推荐这样做。但是，PascalCase 的标签名在 DOM 内模板中是不可用的，详情参见 <a href=\"/guide/essentials/component-basics.html#in-dom-template-parsing-caveats\">DOM 内模板解析注意事项<a>。<p><p>为了方便，Vue 支持将模板中使用 kebab-case 的标签解析为使用 PascalCase 注册的组件。这意味着一个以 <code>MyComponent<code> 为名注册的组件，在模板 (或由 Vue 渲染的 HTML 元素) 中可以通过 <code><MyComponent><code> 或 <code><my-component><code> 引用。这让我们能够使用同样的 JavaScript 组件注册代码来配合不同来源的模板。<p><div><div>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/registration.html", "title": "组件注册", "doc_id": "e5195ba3869f4ca3bbcc19b20649038f", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 328, "chunk_index": 19, "_doc_id": "19_3827768307960617511"}}
{"doc_id": "0_1352099706014861195", "text": "<div><div><h1 id=\"component-v-model\">组件 v-model <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#component-v-model\">​<a><h1><h2 id=\"basic-usage\">基本用法 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#basic-usage\">​<a><h2><p><code>v-model<code> 可以在组件上使用以实现双向绑定。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/v-model.html", "title": "组件 v-model", "doc_id": "11d82a7634b04c539b1a902d4aa7647f", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1636, "chunk_index": 0, "_doc_id": "0_1352099706014861195"}}
{"doc_id": "1_4819123825709055420", "text": "e\">基本用法 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#basic-usage\">​<a><h2><p><code>v-model<code> 可以在组件上使用以实现双向绑定。<p><div class=\"composition-api\"><p>从 Vue 3.4 开始，推荐的实现方式是使用 <a href=\"/api/sfc-script-setup.html#definemodel\"><code>defineModel()<code><a> 宏：<p><div class=\"vp-code-block-title\"><p class=\"vp-code-block-title-bar\"><span class=\"vp-code-block-title-text\">Child.vue<span><p><div class=\"language-vue\"> <span class=\"lang\">vue<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>script<span><span> setup<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/v-model.html", "title": "组件 v-model", "doc_id": "11d82a7634b04c539b1a902d4aa7647f", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1636, "chunk_index": 1, "_doc_id": "1_4819123825709055420"}}
{"doc_id": "2_2221151063159768940", "text": "code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>script<span><span> setup<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> model<span><span> =<span><span> defineModel<span><span>()<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>function<span><span> update<span><span>() {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> model.value<span><span>++<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>script<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/v-model.html", "title": "组件 v-model", "doc_id": "11d82a7634b04c539b1a902d4aa7647f", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1636, "chunk_index": 2, "_doc_id": "2_2221151063159768940"}}
{"doc_id": "3_1360674593581183281", "text": "s=\"line\"><span>}<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>script<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>div<span><span>>Parent bound v-model is: {{ model }}</<span><span>div<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>button<span><span> @click<span><span>=<span><span>\"update\"<span><span>>Increment</<span><span>button<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/v-model.html", "title": "组件 v-model", "doc_id": "11d82a7634b04c539b1a902d4aa7647f", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1636, "chunk_index": 3, "_doc_id": "3_1360674593581183281"}}
{"doc_id": "4_3590759431245873090", "text": "span><span>=<span><span>\"update\"<span><span>>Increment</<span><span>button<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><div><p>父组件可以用 <code>v-model<code> 绑定一个值：<p><div class=\"vp-code-block-title\"><p class=\"vp-code-block-title-bar\"><span class=\"vp-code-block-title-text\">Parent.", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/v-model.html", "title": "组件 v-model", "doc_id": "11d82a7634b04c539b1a902d4aa7647f", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1636, "chunk_index": 4, "_doc_id": "4_3590759431245873090"}}
{"doc_id": "5_7178892660057327850", "text": "-code-block-title\"><p class=\"vp-code-block-title-bar\"><span class=\"vp-code-block-title-text\">Parent.vue<span><p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>Child<span><span> v-model<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>countModel<span><span>\"<span><span> /><span><span><code><pre><div><div><p><code>defineModel()<code> 返回的值是一个 ref。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/v-model.html", "title": "组件 v-model", "doc_id": "11d82a7634b04c539b1a902d4aa7647f", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1636, "chunk_index": 5, "_doc_id": "5_7178892660057327850"}}
{"doc_id": "6_5726210507438907241", "text": "pan><span>\"<span><span> /><span><span><code><pre><div><div><p><code>defineModel()<code> 返回的值是一个 ref。它可以像其他 ref 一样被访问以及修改，不过它能起到在父组件和当前变量之间的双向绑定的作用：<p><ul><li>它的 <code>.value<code> 和父组件的 <code>v-model<code> 的值同步；<li><li>当它被子组件变更了，会触发父组件绑定的值一起更新。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/v-model.html", "title": "组件 v-model", "doc_id": "11d82a7634b04c539b1a902d4aa7647f", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1636, "chunk_index": 6, "_doc_id": "6_5726210507438907241"}}
{"doc_id": "7_1702548615860652235", "text": "作用：<p><ul><li>它的 <code>.value<code> 和父组件的 <code>v-model<code> 的值同步；<li><li>当它被子组件变更了，会触发父组件绑定的值一起更新。<li><ul><p>这意味着你也可以用 <code>v-model<code> 把这个 ref 绑定到一个原生 input 元素上，在提供相同的 <code>v-model<code> 用法的同时轻松包装原生 input 元素：<p><div class=\"language-vue\"> <span class=\"lang\">vue<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>script<span><span> setup<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/v-model.html", "title": "组件 v-model", "doc_id": "11d82a7634b04c539b1a902d4aa7647f", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1636, "chunk_index": 7, "_doc_id": "7_1702548615860652235"}}
{"doc_id": "8_4342318610376376802", "text": "code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>script<span><span> setup<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> model<span><span> =<span><span> defineModel<span><span>()<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>script<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>input<span><span> v-model<span><span>=<span><span>\"model\"<span><span> /><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/v-model.html", "title": "组件 v-model", "doc_id": "11d82a7634b04c539b1a902d4aa7647f", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1636, "chunk_index": 8, "_doc_id": "8_4342318610376376802"}}
{"doc_id": "9_3183972638533790211", "text": "> <<span><span>input<span><span> v-model<span><span>=<span><span>\"model\"<span><span> /><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p><a href=\"https://play.vuejs.", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/v-model.html", "title": "组件 v-model", "doc_id": "11d82a7634b04c539b1a902d4aa7647f", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1636, "chunk_index": 9, "_doc_id": "9_3183972638533790211"}}
{"doc_id": "10_6186509784652141755", "text": "<span></<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p><a href=\"https://play.vuejs.org/#\"", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/v-model.html", "title": "组件 v-model", "doc_id": "11d82a7634b04c539b1a902d4aa7647f", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1636, "chunk_index": 10, "_doc_id": "10_6186509784652141755"}}
{"doc_id": "11_9111397891287914678", "text": "rDUt6oV3ZBzyhmsjiz+p/dSTwJfUx2+IpD1ic+xz5enwQGXEDJJaw8Gl2I1upMzlc/hEvdOBR6SNKAjqP1J6P/o6XdL11L5h4=\" target=\"_blank\">演练场示例<a><p><h3 id=\"under-the-hood\">底层机制 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#under-the-hood\">​<a><h3><p><code>defineModel<code> 是一个便利宏。编译器将其展开为以下内容：<p><ul><li>一个名为 <code>modelValue<code> 的 prop，本地 ref 的值与其同步；<li><li>一个名为 <code>update:modelValue<code> 的事件，当本地 ref 的值发生变更时触发。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/v-model.html", "title": "组件 v-model", "doc_id": "11d82a7634b04c539b1a902d4aa7647f", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1636, "chunk_index": 11, "_doc_id": "11_9111397891287914678"}}
{"doc_id": "12_7691276113591417718", "text": "elValue<code> 的 prop，本地 ref 的值与其同步；<li><li>一个名为 <code>update:modelValue<code> 的事件，当本地 ref 的值发生变更时触发。<li><ul><p>在 3.4 版本之前，你一般会按照如下的方式来实现上述相同的子组件：<p><div class=\"vp-code-block-title\"><p class=\"vp-code-block-title-bar\"><span class=\"vp-code-block-title-text\">Child.vue<span><p><div class=\"language-vue\"> <span class=\"lang\">vue<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>script<span><span> setup<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/v-model.html", "title": "组件 v-model", "doc_id": "11d82a7634b04c539b1a902d4aa7647f", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1636, "chunk_index": 12, "_doc_id": "12_7691276113591417718"}}
{"doc_id": "13_6165301866904269276", "text": "code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>script<span><span> setup<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> props<span><span> =<span><span> defineProps<span><span>([<span><span>'modelValue'<span><span>])<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> emit<span><span> =<span><span> defineEmits<span><span>([<span><span>'update:modelValue'<span><span>])<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>script<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/v-model.html", "title": "组件 v-model", "doc_id": "11d82a7634b04c539b1a902d4aa7647f", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1636, "chunk_index": 13, "_doc_id": "13_6165301866904269276"}}
{"doc_id": "14_5656907934419397786", "text": "n>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>script<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>input<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> :value<span><span>=<span><span>\"props.modelValue\"<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> @input<span><span>=<span><span>\"emit('update:modelValue', $event.target.value)\"<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> /><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/v-model.html", "title": "组件 v-model", "doc_id": "11d82a7634b04c539b1a902d4aa7647f", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1636, "chunk_index": 14, "_doc_id": "14_5656907934419397786"}}
{"doc_id": "15_7779558005356178682", "text": "mit('update:modelValue', $event.target.value)\"<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> /><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><div><p>然后，父组件中的 <code>v-model=\"foo\"<code> 将被编译为：<p><div class=\"vp-code-block-title\"><p class=\"vp-code-block-title-bar\"><span class=\"vp-code-block-title-text\">Parent.vue<span><p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>Child<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/v-model.html", "title": "组件 v-model", "doc_id": "11d82a7634b04c539b1a902d4aa7647f", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1636, "chunk_index": 15, "_doc_id": "15_7779558005356178682"}}
{"doc_id": "16_4545638817362285632", "text": "pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>Child<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> :<span><span>modelValue<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>foo<span><span>\"<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> @<span><span>update<span><span>:<span><span>modelValue<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>$event<span><span> =><span><span> (foo <span><span>=<span><span> $event)<span><span>\"<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/v-model.html", "title": "组件 v-model", "doc_id": "11d82a7634b04c539b1a902d4aa7647f", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1636, "chunk_index": 16, "_doc_id": "16_4545638817362285632"}}
{"doc_id": "17_3908077336530673344", "text": "n>$event<span><span> =><span><span> (foo <span><span>=<span><span> $event)<span><span>\"<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>/><span><span><code><pre><div><div><p>如你所见，这显得冗长得多。然而，这样写有助于理解其底层机制。<p><p>因为 <code>defineModel<code> 声明了一个 prop，你可以通过给 <code>defineModel<code> 传递选项，来声明底层 prop 的选项：<p><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// 使 v-model 必填<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/v-model.html", "title": "组件 v-model", "doc_id": "11d82a7634b04c539b1a902d4aa7647f", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1636, "chunk_index": 17, "_doc_id": "17_3908077336530673344"}}
{"doc_id": "18_1490791650023398884", "text": "n><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// 使 v-model 必填<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> model<span><span> =<span><span> defineModel<span><span>({ required: <span><span>true<span><span> })<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 提供一个默认值<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/v-model.html", "title": "组件 v-model", "doc_id": "11d82a7634b04c539b1a902d4aa7647f", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1636, "chunk_index": 18, "_doc_id": "18_1490791650023398884"}}
{"doc_id": "19_4075331755215376209", "text": "pan><span> })<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 提供一个默认值<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> model<span><span> =<span><span> defineModel<span><span>({ default: <span><span>0<span><span> })<span><span><code><pre><div><div class=\"warning custom-block\"><p class=\"custom-block-title\">WARNING<p><p>如果为 <code>defineModel<code> prop 设置了一个 <code>default<code> 值且父组件没有为该 prop 提供任何值，会导致父组件与子组件之间不同步。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/v-model.html", "title": "组件 v-model", "doc_id": "11d82a7634b04c539b1a902d4aa7647f", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1636, "chunk_index": 19, "_doc_id": "19_4075331755215376209"}}
{"doc_id": "20_1552509953060264855", "text": "><p>如果为 <code>defineModel<code> prop 设置了一个 <code>default<code> 值且父组件没有为该 prop 提供任何值，会导致父组件与子组件之间不同步。在下面的示例中，父组件的 <code>myRef<code> 是 undefined，而子组件的 <code>model<code> 是 1：<p><div class=\"vp-code-block-title\"><p class=\"vp-code-block-title-bar\"><span class=\"vp-code-block-title-text\">Child.vue<span><p><div class=\"language-vue\"> <span class=\"lang\">vue<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>script<span><span> setup<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/v-model.html", "title": "组件 v-model", "doc_id": "11d82a7634b04c539b1a902d4aa7647f", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1636, "chunk_index": 20, "_doc_id": "20_1552509953060264855"}}
{"doc_id": "21_5936348014425913771", "text": "code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>script<span><span> setup<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> model<span><span> =<span><span> defineModel<span><span>({ default: <span><span>1<span><span> })<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/v-model.html", "title": "组件 v-model", "doc_id": "11d82a7634b04c539b1a902d4aa7647f", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1636, "chunk_index": 21, "_doc_id": "21_5936348014425913771"}}
{"doc_id": "22_5948943083841676033", "text": "an><span> =<span><span> defineModel<span><span>({ default: <span><span>1<span><span> })<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>script<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><div><div class=\"vp-code-block-title\"><p class=\"vp-code-block-title-bar\"><span class=\"vp-code-block-title-text\">Parent.vue<span><p><div class=\"language-vue\"> <span class=\"lang\">vue<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>script<span><span> setup<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/v-model.html", "title": "组件 v-model", "doc_id": "11d82a7634b04c539b1a902d4aa7647f", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1636, "chunk_index": 22, "_doc_id": "22_5948943083841676033"}}
{"doc_id": "23_7491612009934290041", "text": "code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>script<span><span> setup<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> myRef<span><span> =<span><span> ref<span><span>()<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>script<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/v-model.html", "title": "组件 v-model", "doc_id": "11d82a7634b04c539b1a902d4aa7647f", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1636, "chunk_index": 23, "_doc_id": "23_7491612009934290041"}}
{"doc_id": "24_5792513578629859229", "text": ">\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>Child<span><span> v-model<span><span>=<span><span>\"myRef\"<span><span>></<span><span>Child<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/v-model.html", "title": "组件 v-model", "doc_id": "11d82a7634b04c539b1a902d4aa7647f", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1636, "chunk_index": 24, "_doc_id": "24_5792513578629859229"}}
{"doc_id": "25_2448993846054415970", "text": "n> v-model<span><span>=<span><span>\"myRef\"<span><span>></<span><span>Child<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><div><div><div><div class=\"options-api\"><p>首先让我们回忆一下 <code>v-model<code> 在原生元素上的用法：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>input<span><span> v-model<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>searchText<span><span>\"<span><span> /><span><span><code><pre><div><p>在代码背后，模板编译器会对 <code>v-model<code> 进行更冗长的等价展开。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/v-model.html", "title": "组件 v-model", "doc_id": "11d82a7634b04c539b1a902d4aa7647f", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1636, "chunk_index": 25, "_doc_id": "25_2448993846054415970"}}
{"doc_id": "26_7559460482448104024", "text": "n><span>\"<span><span> /><span><span><code><pre><div><p>在代码背后，模板编译器会对 <code>v-model<code> 进行更冗长的等价展开。因此上面的代码其实等价于下面这段：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>input<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> :<span><span>value<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>searchText<span><span>\"<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/v-model.html", "title": "组件 v-model", "doc_id": "11d82a7634b04c539b1a902d4aa7647f", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1636, "chunk_index": 26, "_doc_id": "26_7559460482448104024"}}
{"doc_id": "27_2940094935972182392", "text": "><span> :<span><span>value<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>searchText<span><span>\"<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> @<span><span>input<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>searchText <span><span>=<span><span> $event.target.value<span><span>\"<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/v-model.html", "title": "组件 v-model", "doc_id": "11d82a7634b04c539b1a902d4aa7647f", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1636, "chunk_index": 27, "_doc_id": "27_2940094935972182392"}}
{"doc_id": "28_4929668485810981061", "text": "span>\"<span><span>searchText <span><span>=<span><span> $event.target.value<span><span>\"<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>/><span><span><code><pre><div><p>而当使用在一个组件上时，<code>v-model<code> 会被展开为如下的形式：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>CustomInput<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> :<span><span>model-value<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>searchText<span><span>\"<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/v-model.html", "title": "组件 v-model", "doc_id": "11d82a7634b04c539b1a902d4aa7647f", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1636, "chunk_index": 28, "_doc_id": "28_4929668485810981061"}}
{"doc_id": "29_5143377080731297108", "text": "> :<span><span>model-value<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>searchText<span><span>\"<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> @<span><span>update<span><span>:<span><span>model-value<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>newValue<span><span> =><span><span> searchText <span><span>=<span><span> newValue<span><span>\"<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>/><span><span><code><pre><div><p>要让这个例子实际工作起来，", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/v-model.html", "title": "组件 v-model", "doc_id": "11d82a7634b04c539b1a902d4aa7647f", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1636, "chunk_index": 29, "_doc_id": "29_5143377080731297108"}}
{"doc_id": "30_2177855470511407250", "text": "lue<span><span>\"<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>/><span><span><code><pre><div><p>要让这个例子实际工作起来，<code><CustomInput><code> 组件内部需要做两件事：<p><ol><li>将内部原生 <code><input><code> 元素的 <code>value<code> attribute 绑定到 <code>modelValue<code> prop<li><li>当原生的 <code>input<code> 事件触发时，", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/v-model.html", "title": "组件 v-model", "doc_id": "11d82a7634b04c539b1a902d4aa7647f", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1636, "chunk_index": 30, "_doc_id": "30_2177855470511407250"}}
{"doc_id": "31_1811622163937630290", "text": "元素的 <code>value<code> attribute 绑定到 <code>modelValue<code> prop<li><li>当原生的 <code>input<code> 事件触发时，触发一个携带了新值的 <code>update:modelValue<code> 自定义事件<li><ol><p>这里是相应的代码：<p><div class=\"vp-code-block-title\"><p class=\"vp-code-block-title-bar\"><span class=\"vp-code-block-title-text\">CustomInput.vue<span><p><div class=\"language-vue\"> <span class=\"lang\">vue<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>script<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/v-model.html", "title": "组件 v-model", "doc_id": "11d82a7634b04c539b1a902d4aa7647f", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1636, "chunk_index": 31, "_doc_id": "31_1811622163937630290"}}
