{"doc_id": "69_2683745487046540999", "text": ">\n<span class=\"line\"><span> onLeaveCancelled<span><span>(<span><span>el<span><span>) {}<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/transition.html", "title": "Transition | Vue.js", "doc_id": "79d52d7be89743a59f98d5047518fc70", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1496, "chunk_index": 69, "_doc_id": "69_2683745487046540999"}}
{"doc_id": "70_6856853347986226359", "text": "lled<span><span>(<span><span>el<span><span>) {}<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span><code><pre><div><div><p>这些钩子可以与 CSS 过渡或动画结合使用，也可以单独使用。<p><p>在使用仅由 JavaScript 执行的动画时，最好是添加一个 <code>:css=\"false\"<code> prop。这显式地向 Vue 表明可以跳过对 CSS 过渡的自动探测。除了性能稍好一些之外，还可以防止 CSS 规则意外地干扰过渡效果：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>Transition<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/transition.html", "title": "Transition | Vue.js", "doc_id": "79d52d7be89743a59f98d5047518fc70", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1496, "chunk_index": 70, "_doc_id": "70_6856853347986226359"}}
{"doc_id": "71_1911640603527884413", "text": "lass=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>Transition<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> ...<span><span>\n<span class=\"line highlighted\"><span> :<span><span>css<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>false<span><span>\"<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> ...<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>Transition<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>在有了 <code>:css=\"false\"<code> 后，我们就自己全权负责控制什么时候过渡结束了。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/transition.html", "title": "Transition | Vue.js", "doc_id": "79d52d7be89743a59f98d5047518fc70", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1496, "chunk_index": 71, "_doc_id": "71_1911640603527884413"}}
{"doc_id": "72_4754013406803684594", "text": "tion<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>在有了 <code>:css=\"false\"<code> 后，我们就自己全权负责控制什么时候过渡结束了。这种情况下对于 <code>@enter<code> 和 <code>@leave<code> 钩子来说，回调函数 <code>done<code> 就是必须的。否则，钩子将被同步调用，过渡将立即完成。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/transition.html", "title": "Transition | Vue.js", "doc_id": "79d52d7be89743a59f98d5047518fc70", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1496, "chunk_index": 72, "_doc_id": "72_4754013406803684594"}}
{"doc_id": "73_3553428350490270845", "text": "种情况下对于 <code>@enter<code> 和 <code>@leave<code> 钩子来说，回调函数 <code>done<code> 就是必须的。否则，钩子将被同步调用，过渡将立即完成。<p><p>这里是使用 <a href=\"https://gsap.com/\" target=\"_blank\">GSAP 库<a>执行动画的一个示例，你也可以使用任何你想要的库，比如 <a href=\"https://animejs.com/\" target=\"_blank\">Anime.js<a> 或者 <a href=\"https://motion.dev/\" target=\"_blank\">Motion One<a>：<p><h2 id=\"reusable-transitions\">可复用过渡效果 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#reusable-transitions\">​<a><h2><p>得益于 Vue 的组件系统，过渡效果是可以被封装复用的。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/transition.html", "title": "Transition | Vue.js", "doc_id": "79d52d7be89743a59f98d5047518fc70", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1496, "chunk_index": 73, "_doc_id": "73_3553428350490270845"}}
{"doc_id": "74_5077162381111389146", "text": "复用过渡效果 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#reusable-transitions\">​<a><h2><p>得益于 Vue 的组件系统，过渡效果是可以被封装复用的。要创建一个可被复用的过渡，我们需要为 <code><Transition><code> 组件创建一个包装组件，并向内传入插槽内容：<p><div class=\"vp-code-block-title\"><p class=\"vp-code-block-title-bar\"><span class=\"vp-code-block-title-text\">MyTransition.vue<span><p><div class=\"language-vue\"> <span class=\"lang\">vue<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>script<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/transition.html", "title": "Transition | Vue.js", "doc_id": "79d52d7be89743a59f98d5047518fc70", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1496, "chunk_index": 74, "_doc_id": "74_5077162381111389146"}}
{"doc_id": "75_3478190894920111019", "text": "ki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>script<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// JavaScript 钩子逻辑...<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>script<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line highlighted\"><span> <!-- 包装内置的 Transition 组件 --><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>Transition<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/transition.html", "title": "Transition | Vue.js", "doc_id": "79d52d7be89743a59f98d5047518fc70", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1496, "chunk_index": 75, "_doc_id": "75_3478190894920111019"}}
{"doc_id": "76_6387094583025086564", "text": "- 包装内置的 Transition 组件 --><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>Transition<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> name<span><span>=<span><span>\"my-transition\"<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> @enter<span><span>=<span><span>\"onEnter\"<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> @leave<span><span>=<span><span>\"onLeave\"<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>slot<span><span>></<span><span>slot<span><span>> <span><span><!-- 向内传递插槽内容 --><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/transition.html", "title": "Transition | Vue.js", "doc_id": "79d52d7be89743a59f98d5047518fc70", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1496, "chunk_index": 76, "_doc_id": "76_6387094583025086564"}}
{"doc_id": "77_3820839984234778715", "text": "an><span>slot<span><span>></<span><span>slot<span><span>> <span><span><!-- 向内传递插槽内容 --><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> </<span><span>Transition<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>style<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>/*<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> 必要的 CSS...<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> 注意：避免在这里使用 <style scoped><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/transition.html", "title": "Transition | Vue.js", "doc_id": "79d52d7be89743a59f98d5047518fc70", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1496, "chunk_index": 77, "_doc_id": "77_3820839984234778715"}}
{"doc_id": "78_7674713318088926894", "text": "line\"><span> 必要的 CSS...<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> 注意：避免在这里使用 <style scoped><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> 因为那不会应用到插槽内容上<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>*/<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/transition.html", "title": "Transition | Vue.js", "doc_id": "79d52d7be89743a59f98d5047518fc70", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1496, "chunk_index": 78, "_doc_id": "78_7674713318088926894"}}
{"doc_id": "79_4177182494649088755", "text": "><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> 因为那不会应用到插槽内容上<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>*/<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>style<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><div><p>现在 <code>MyTransition<code> 可以在导入后像内置组件那样使用了：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>MyTransition<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/transition.html", "title": "Transition | Vue.js", "doc_id": "79d52d7be89743a59f98d5047518fc70", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1496, "chunk_index": 79, "_doc_id": "79_4177182494649088755"}}
{"doc_id": "80_8251730226580289699", "text": "hub-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>MyTransition<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>div<span><span> v-if<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>show<span><span>\"<span><span>>Hello</<span><span>div<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/transition.html", "title": "Transition | Vue.js", "doc_id": "79d52d7be89743a59f98d5047518fc70", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1496, "chunk_index": 80, "_doc_id": "80_8251730226580289699"}}
{"doc_id": "81_9021155498471056870", "text": "an><span>\"<span><span>show<span><span>\"<span><span>>Hello</<span><span>div<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>MyTransition<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><h2 id=\"transition-on-appear\">出现时过渡 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#transition-on-appear\">​<a><h2><p>如果你想在某个节点初次渲染时应用一个过渡效果，你可以添加 <code>appear<code> prop：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>Transition<span><span> appear<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/transition.html", "title": "Transition | Vue.js", "doc_id": "79d52d7be89743a59f98d5047518fc70", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1496, "chunk_index": 81, "_doc_id": "81_9021155498471056870"}}
{"doc_id": "82_3018034618132246983", "text": "><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>Transition<span><span> appear<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> ...<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>Transition<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><h2 id=\"transition-between-elements\">元素间过渡 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#transition-between-elements\">​<a><h2><p>除了通过 <code>v-if<code> / <code>v-show<code> 切换一个元素，我们也可以通过 <code>v-if<code> / <code>v-else<code> / <code>v-else-if<code> 在几个组件间进行切换，", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/transition.html", "title": "Transition | Vue.js", "doc_id": "79d52d7be89743a59f98d5047518fc70", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1496, "chunk_index": 82, "_doc_id": "82_3018034618132246983"}}
{"doc_id": "83_4102038940510081797", "text": "-show<code> 切换一个元素，我们也可以通过 <code>v-if<code> / <code>v-else<code> / <code>v-else-if<code> 在几个组件间进行切换，只要确保任一时刻只会有一个元素被渲染即可：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>Transition<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/transition.html", "title": "Transition | Vue.js", "doc_id": "79d52d7be89743a59f98d5047518fc70", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1496, "chunk_index": 83, "_doc_id": "83_4102038940510081797"}}
{"doc_id": "84_6311032331496635504", "text": "ithub-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>Transition<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>button<span><span> v-if<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>docState <span><span>===<span><span> 'saved'\"<span><span>>Edit</<span><span>button<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/transition.html", "title": "Transition | Vue.js", "doc_id": "79d52d7be89743a59f98d5047518fc70", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1496, "chunk_index": 84, "_doc_id": "84_6311032331496635504"}}
{"doc_id": "85_3783855597502818195", "text": "<span><span>===<span><span> 'saved'\"<span><span>>Edit</<span><span>button<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>button<span><span> v-else-if<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>docState <span><span>===<span><span> 'edited'\"<span><span>>Save</<span><span>button<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/transition.html", "title": "Transition | Vue.js", "doc_id": "79d52d7be89743a59f98d5047518fc70", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1496, "chunk_index": 85, "_doc_id": "85_3783855597502818195"}}
{"doc_id": "86_4783729213267066455", "text": "<span><span>===<span><span> 'edited'\"<span><span>>Save</<span><span>button<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>button<span><span> v-else-if<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>docState <span><span>===<span><span> 'editing'\"<span><span>>Cancel</<span><span>button<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/transition.html", "title": "Transition | Vue.js", "doc_id": "79d52d7be89743a59f98d5047518fc70", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1496, "chunk_index": 86, "_doc_id": "86_4783729213267066455"}}
{"doc_id": "87_4872768282276259771", "text": "an><span>===<span><span> 'editing'\"<span><span>>Cancel</<span><span>button<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>Transition<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><div class=\"demo transition-demo\"><span>Click to cycle through states: <span><p class=\"btn-container\"> Edit <p><div><p><a href=\"https://play.vuejs.org/#eNqdk8tu2zAQRX9loI0SoLLcFN2ostEi6BekmwLa0NTYJkKRBDkSYhj+9wxJO3ZegBGu+Lhz7syQ3Bd/nJtNIxZN0QbplSMISKNbdkYNznqCPXhcwwHW3g5QsrTsTGekNYGgt/KBBCEsouimDGLCvrztTFtnGGN4QTg4zbK4oj", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/transition.html", "title": "Transition | Vue.js", "doc_id": "79d52d7be89743a59f98d5047518fc70", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1496, "chunk_index": 87, "_doc_id": "87_4872768282276259771"}}
{"doc_id": "88_8298220698345370691", "text": "", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/transition.html", "title": "Transition | Vue.js", "doc_id": "79d52d7be89743a59f98d5047518fc70", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1496, "chunk_index": 88, "_doc_id": "88_8298220698345370691"}}
{"doc_id": "89_3080372862138271291", "text": "PTU6jQEPpKyMj8dnmgkQs+HmQcvVTIQK1hPrv7GQAFt9eO9Bk6fZ8Ub52Qiri8eUo+4dbWD02exh79v/nBP+H2PStnwz/jelJ1geKvk/peHJ4BoRZYow==\" target=\"_blank\">在演练场中尝试一下<a><p><h2 id=\"transition-modes\">过渡模式 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#transition-modes\">​<a><h2><p>在之前的例子中，进入和离开的元素都是在同时开始动画的，因此我们不得不将它们设为 <code>position: absolute<code> 以避免二者同时存在时出现的布局问题。<p><p>然而，很多情况下这可能并不符合需求。我们可能想要先执行离开动画，然后在其完成<strong>之后<strong>再执行元素的进入动画。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/transition.html", "title": "Transition | Vue.js", "doc_id": "79d52d7be89743a59f98d5047518fc70", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1496, "chunk_index": 89, "_doc_id": "89_3080372862138271291"}}
{"doc_id": "90_6730047476093643202", "text": "te<code> 以避免二者同时存在时出现的布局问题。<p><p>然而，很多情况下这可能并不符合需求。我们可能想要先执行离开动画，然后在其完成<strong>之后<strong>再执行元素的进入动画。手动编排这样的动画是非常复杂的，好在我们可以通过向 <code><Transition><code> 传入一个 <code>mode<code> prop 来实现这个行为：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>Transition<span><span> mode<span><span>=<span><span>\"out-in\"<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> ...<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/transition.html", "title": "Transition | Vue.js", "doc_id": "79d52d7be89743a59f98d5047518fc70", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1496, "chunk_index": 90, "_doc_id": "90_6730047476093643202"}}
{"doc_id": "91_7090846994262791447", "text": "span><span>=<span><span>\"out-in\"<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> ...<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>Transition<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>将之前的例子改为 <code>mode=\"out-in\"<code> 后是这样：<p><div class=\"demo transition-demo\"><span>Click to cycle through states: <span><p class=\"btn-container\"> Edit <p><div><p><code><Transition><code> 也支持 <code>mode=\"in-out\"<code>，虽然这并不常用。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/transition.html", "title": "Transition | Vue.js", "doc_id": "79d52d7be89743a59f98d5047518fc70", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1496, "chunk_index": 91, "_doc_id": "91_7090846994262791447"}}
{"doc_id": "92_1347797697686295738", "text": "ass=\"btn-container\"> Edit <p><div><p><code><Transition><code> 也支持 <code>mode=\"in-out\"<code>，虽然这并不常用。<p><h2 id=\"transition-between-components\">组件间过渡 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#transition-between-components\">​<a><h2><p><code><Transition><code> 也可以作用于<a href=\"/guide/essentials/component-basics.", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/transition.html", "title": "Transition | Vue.js", "doc_id": "79d52d7be89743a59f98d5047518fc70", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1496, "chunk_index": 92, "_doc_id": "92_1347797697686295738"}}
{"doc_id": "93_7624481364446748869", "text": "n-components\">​<a><h2><p><code><Transition><code> 也可以作用于<a href=\"/guide/essentials/component-basics.html#dynamic-components\">动态组件<a>之间的切换：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>Transition<span><span> name<span><span>=<span><span>\"fade\"<span><span> mode<span><span>=<span><span>\"out-in\"<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/transition.html", "title": "Transition | Vue.js", "doc_id": "79d52d7be89743a59f98d5047518fc70", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1496, "chunk_index": 93, "_doc_id": "93_7624481364446748869"}}
{"doc_id": "94_4040794830437958767", "text": "span>=<span><span>\"fade\"<span><span> mode<span><span>=<span><span>\"out-in\"<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>component<span><span> :<span><span>is<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>activeComponent<span><span>\"<span><span>></<span><span>component<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/transition.html", "title": "Transition | Vue.js", "doc_id": "79d52d7be89743a59f98d5047518fc70", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1496, "chunk_index": 94, "_doc_id": "94_4040794830437958767"}}
{"doc_id": "95_6529327316203247440", "text": "pan><span>activeComponent<span><span>\"<span><span>></<span><span>component<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>Transition<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><h2 id=\"dynamic-transitions\">动态过渡 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#dynamic-transitions\">​<a><h2><p><code><Transition><code> 的 props (比如 <code>name<code>) 也可以是动态的！", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/transition.html", "title": "Transition | Vue.js", "doc_id": "79d52d7be89743a59f98d5047518fc70", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1496, "chunk_index": 95, "_doc_id": "95_6529327316203247440"}}
{"doc_id": "96_4893165499726654303", "text": "ef=\"#dynamic-transitions\">​<a><h2><p><code><Transition><code> 的 props (比如 <code>name<code>) 也可以是动态的！这让我们可以根据状态变化动态地应用不同类型的过渡：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>Transition<span><span> :<span><span>name<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>transitionName<span><span>\"<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <!-- ... --><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/transition.html", "title": "Transition | Vue.js", "doc_id": "79d52d7be89743a59f98d5047518fc70", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1496, "chunk_index": 96, "_doc_id": "96_4893165499726654303"}}
{"doc_id": "97_7670066627722329196", "text": "sitionName<span><span>\"<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <!-- ... --><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>Transition<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>这个特性的用处是可以提前定义好多组 CSS 过渡或动画的 class，然后在它们之间动态切换。<p><p>你也可以根据你的组件的当前状态在 JavaScript 过渡钩子中应用不同的行为。最后，创建动态过渡的终极方式还是创建<a href=\"#reusable-transitions\">可复用的过渡组件<a>，并让这些组件根据动态的 props 来改变过渡的效果。掌握了这些技巧后，就真的只有你想不到，没有做不到的了。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/transition.html", "title": "Transition | Vue.js", "doc_id": "79d52d7be89743a59f98d5047518fc70", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1496, "chunk_index": 97, "_doc_id": "97_7670066627722329196"}}
{"doc_id": "98_6162255785426490009", "text": "创建<a href=\"#reusable-transitions\">可复用的过渡组件<a>，并让这些组件根据动态的 props 来改变过渡的效果。掌握了这些技巧后，就真的只有你想不到，没有做不到的了。<p><h2 id=\"transitions-with-the-key-attribute\">使用 Key Attribute 过渡 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#transitions-with-the-key-attribute\">​<a><h2><p>有时为了触发过渡，你需要强制重新渲染 DOM 元素。<p><p>以计数器组件为例：<p><div class=\"composition-api\"><div class=\"language-vue\"> <span class=\"lang\">vue<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>script<span><span> setup<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/transition.html", "title": "Transition | Vue.js", "doc_id": "79d52d7be89743a59f98d5047518fc70", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1496, "chunk_index": 98, "_doc_id": "98_6162255785426490009"}}
{"doc_id": "99_8202154052025057618", "text": "code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>script<span><span> setup<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>import<span><span> { ref } <span><span>from<span><span> 'vue'<span><span>;<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> count<span><span> =<span><span> ref<span><span>(<span><span>0<span><span>);<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/transition.html", "title": "Transition | Vue.js", "doc_id": "79d52d7be89743a59f98d5047518fc70", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1496, "chunk_index": 99, "_doc_id": "99_8202154052025057618"}}
{"doc_id": "100_6474532782430997103", "text": "an> =<span><span> ref<span><span>(<span><span>0<span><span>);<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>setInterval<span><span>(() <span><span>=><span><span> count.value<span><span>++<span><span>, <span><span>1000<span><span>);<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>script<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>Transition<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/transition.html", "title": "Transition | Vue.js", "doc_id": "79d52d7be89743a59f98d5047518fc70", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1496, "chunk_index": 100, "_doc_id": "100_6474532782430997103"}}
{"doc_id": "101_4457352765584183891", "text": "span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>Transition<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>span<span><span> :key<span><span>=<span><span>\"count\"<span><span>>{{ count }}</<span><span>span<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> </<span><span>Transition<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/transition.html", "title": "Transition | Vue.js", "doc_id": "79d52d7be89743a59f98d5047518fc70", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1496, "chunk_index": 101, "_doc_id": "101_4457352765584183891"}}
{"doc_id": "102_5468443059089553973", "text": "pan><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> </<span><span>Transition<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><div><div class=\"options-api\"><div class=\"language-vue\"> <span class=\"lang\">vue<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>script<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/transition.html", "title": "Transition | Vue.js", "doc_id": "79d52d7be89743a59f98d5047518fc70", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1496, "chunk_index": 102, "_doc_id": "102_5468443059089553973"}}
{"doc_id": "103_9146286879450965686", "text": "n><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> data<span><span>() {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> return<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> count: <span><span>1<span><span>,<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> interval: <span><span>null<span><span> <span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> },<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> mounted<span><span>() {<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/transition.html", "title": "Transition | Vue.js", "doc_id": "79d52d7be89743a59f98d5047518fc70", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1496, "chunk_index": 103, "_doc_id": "103_9146286879450965686"}}
{"doc_id": "104_7497629229146460101", "text": "an class=\"line\"><span> },<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> mounted<span><span>() {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> this<span><span>.interval <span><span>=<span><span> setInterval<span><span>(() <span><span>=><span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> this<span><span>.count<span><span>++<span><span>;<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }, <span><span>1000<span><span>)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> },<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/transition.html", "title": "Transition | Vue.js", "doc_id": "79d52d7be89743a59f98d5047518fc70", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1496, "chunk_index": 104, "_doc_id": "104_7497629229146460101"}}
{"doc_id": "105_8268935776809589815", "text": "\"line\"><span> }, <span><span>1000<span><span>)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> },<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> beforeDestroy<span><span>() {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> clearInterval<span><span>(<span><span>this<span><span>.interval)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>script<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/transition.html", "title": "Transition | Vue.js", "doc_id": "79d52d7be89743a59f98d5047518fc70", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1496, "chunk_index": 105, "_doc_id": "105_8268935776809589815"}}
{"doc_id": "106_6916673441267420107", "text": "n>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>script<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>Transition<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>span<span><span> :key<span><span>=<span><span>\"count\"<span><span>>{{ count }}</<span><span>span<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> </<span><span>Transition<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/transition.html", "title": "Transition | Vue.js", "doc_id": "79d52d7be89743a59f98d5047518fc70", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1496, "chunk_index": 106, "_doc_id": "106_6916673441267420107"}}
{"doc_id": "107_8481314625245442111", "text": "pan><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> </<span><span>Transition<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><div><p>如果不使用 <code>key<code> attribute，则只有文本节点会被更新，因此不会发生过渡。但是，有了 <code>key<code> 属性，Vue 就知道在 <code>count<code> 改变时创建一个新的 <code>span<code> 元素，因此 <code>Transition<code> 组件有两个不同的元素在它们之间进行过渡。<p>\n<p><strong>参考<strong><p><div><div>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/transition.html", "title": "Transition | Vue.js", "doc_id": "79d52d7be89743a59f98d5047518fc70", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1496, "chunk_index": 107, "_doc_id": "107_8481314625245442111"}}
{"doc_id": "0_7997277426200407516", "text": "<div><div><h1 id=\"props\">Props <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#props\">​<a><h1><blockquote><p>此章节假设你已经看过了<a href=\"/guide/essentials/component-basics.html\">组件基础<a>。若你还不了解组件是什么，请先阅读该章节。<p><blockquote><h2 id=\"props-declaration\">Props 声明 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#props-declaration\">​<a><h2><p>一个组件需要显式声明它所接受的 props，这样 Vue 才能知道外部传入的哪些是 props，哪些是透传 attribute (关于透传 attribute，我们会在<a href=\"/guide/components/attrs.html\">专门的章节<a>中讨论)。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/props.html", "title": "Props | Vue.js", "doc_id": "5c277ec480de43b5bed2c26fa4d7b32e", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 2081, "chunk_index": 0, "_doc_id": "0_7997277426200407516"}}
{"doc_id": "1_4659166209906717205", "text": "入的哪些是 props，哪些是透传 attribute (关于透传 attribute，我们会在<a href=\"/guide/components/attrs.html\">专门的章节<a>中讨论)。<p><div class=\"composition-api\"><p>在使用 <code><script setup><code> 的单文件组件中，props 可以使用 <code>defineProps()<code> 宏来声明：<p><div class=\"language-vue\"> <span class=\"lang\">vue<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>script<span><span> setup<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/props.html", "title": "Props | Vue.js", "doc_id": "5c277ec480de43b5bed2c26fa4d7b32e", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 2081, "chunk_index": 1, "_doc_id": "1_4659166209906717205"}}
{"doc_id": "2_4811252791999850582", "text": "code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>script<span><span> setup<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> props<span><span> =<span><span> defineProps<span><span>([<span><span>'foo'<span><span>])<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>console.<span><span>log<span><span>(props.foo)<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/props.html", "title": "Props | Vue.js", "doc_id": "5c277ec480de43b5bed2c26fa4d7b32e", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 2081, "chunk_index": 2, "_doc_id": "2_4811252791999850582"}}
{"doc_id": "3_5069749877813421686", "text": "s=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>console.<span><span>log<span><span>(props.foo)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>script<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>在没有使用 <code><script setup><code> 的组件中，props 可以使用 <a href=\"/api/options-state.html#props\"><code>props<code><a> 选项来声明：<p><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/props.html", "title": "Props | Vue.js", "doc_id": "5c277ec480de43b5bed2c26fa4d7b32e", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 2081, "chunk_index": 3, "_doc_id": "3_5069749877813421686"}}
{"doc_id": "4_163794263408574210", "text": "b-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> props: [<span><span>'foo'<span><span>],<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> setup<span><span>(<span><span>props<span><span>) {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // setup() 接收 props 作为第一个参数<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> console.<span><span>log<span><span>(props.foo)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/props.html", "title": "Props | Vue.js", "doc_id": "5c277ec480de43b5bed2c26fa4d7b32e", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 2081, "chunk_index": 4, "_doc_id": "4_163794263408574210"}}
{"doc_id": "5_3963795509999203630", "text": "console.<span><span>log<span><span>(props.foo)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span><code><pre><div><p>注意传递给 <code>defineProps()<code> 的参数和提供给 <code>props<code> 选项的值是相同的，两种声明方式背后其实使用的都是 props 选项。<p><div><div class=\"options-api\"><p>props 需要使用 <a href=\"/api/options-state.html#props\"><code>props<code><a> 选项来定义：<p><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/props.html", "title": "Props | Vue.js", "doc_id": "5c277ec480de43b5bed2c26fa4d7b32e", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 2081, "chunk_index": 5, "_doc_id": "5_3963795509999203630"}}
{"doc_id": "6_4909558168512893725", "text": "b-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> props: [<span><span>'foo'<span><span>],<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> created<span><span>() {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // props 会暴露到 `this` 上<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> console.<span><span>log<span><span>(<span><span>this<span><span>.foo)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/props.html", "title": "Props | Vue.js", "doc_id": "5c277ec480de43b5bed2c26fa4d7b32e", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 2081, "chunk_index": 6, "_doc_id": "6_4909558168512893725"}}
{"doc_id": "7_263801264527123905", "text": "g<span><span>(<span><span>this<span><span>.foo)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span><code><pre><div><div><p>除了使用字符串数组来声明 props 外，还可以使用对象的形式：<p><div class=\"options-api\"><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> props: {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> title: String,<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/props.html", "title": "Props | Vue.js", "doc_id": "5c277ec480de43b5bed2c26fa4d7b32e", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 2081, "chunk_index": 7, "_doc_id": "7_263801264527123905"}}
{"doc_id": "8_8220426314726599309", "text": "<span class=\"line\"><span> props: {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> title: String,<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> likes: Number<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span><code><pre><div><div><div class=\"composition-api\"><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// 使用 <script setup><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>defineProps<span><span>({<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/props.html", "title": "Props | Vue.js", "doc_id": "5c277ec480de43b5bed2c26fa4d7b32e", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 2081, "chunk_index": 8, "_doc_id": "8_8220426314726599309"}}
{"doc_id": "9_2107444144207970623", "text": "pan>// 使用 <script setup><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>defineProps<span><span>({<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> title: String,<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> likes: Number<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>})<span><span><code><pre><div><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// 非 <script setup><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/props.html", "title": "Props | Vue.js", "doc_id": "5c277ec480de43b5bed2c26fa4d7b32e", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 2081, "chunk_index": 9, "_doc_id": "9_2107444144207970623"}}
{"doc_id": "10_4887208757082729855", "text": "pt setup><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> props: {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> title: String,<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> likes: Number<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span><code><pre><div><div><p>对于以对象形式声明的每个属性，key 是 prop 的名称，而值则是该 prop 预期类型的构造函数。比如，如果要求一个 prop 的值是 <code>number<code> 类型，则可使用 <code>Number<code> 构造函数作为其声明的值。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/props.html", "title": "Props | Vue.js", "doc_id": "5c277ec480de43b5bed2c26fa4d7b32e", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 2081, "chunk_index": 10, "_doc_id": "10_4887208757082729855"}}
{"doc_id": "11_1803987137704775905", "text": "称，而值则是该 prop 预期类型的构造函数。比如，如果要求一个 prop 的值是 <code>number<code> 类型，则可使用 <code>Number<code> 构造函数作为其声明的值。<p><p>对象形式的 props 声明不仅可以一定程度上作为组件的文档，而且如果其他开发者在使用你的组件时传递了错误的类型，也会在浏览器控制台中抛出警告。我们将在本章节稍后进一步讨论有关 <a href=\"#prop-validation\">prop 校验<a>的更多细节。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/props.html", "title": "Props | Vue.js", "doc_id": "5c277ec480de43b5bed2c26fa4d7b32e", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 2081, "chunk_index": 11, "_doc_id": "11_1803987137704775905"}}
{"doc_id": "12_4622268638747681917", "text": "且如果其他开发者在使用你的组件时传递了错误的类型，也会在浏览器控制台中抛出警告。我们将在本章节稍后进一步讨论有关 <a href=\"#prop-validation\">prop 校验<a>的更多细节。<p><div class=\"composition-api\"><p>如果你正在搭配 TypeScript 使用 <code><script setup><code>，也可以使用类型标注来声明 props：<p><div class=\"language-vue\"> <span class=\"lang\">vue<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>script<span><span> setup<span><span> lang<span><span>=<span><span>\"ts\"<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>defineProps<span><span><{<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/props.html", "title": "Props | Vue.js", "doc_id": "5c277ec480de43b5bed2c26fa4d7b32e", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 2081, "chunk_index": 12, "_doc_id": "12_4622268638747681917"}}
{"doc_id": "13_5661751846730669640", "text": "><span>\"ts\"<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>defineProps<span><span><{<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> title<span><span>?:<span><span> string<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> likes<span><span>?:<span><span> number<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}>()<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>script<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>更多关于基于类型的声明的细节请参考<a href=\"/guide/typescript/composition-api.html#typing-component-props\">组件 props 类型标注<a>。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/props.html", "title": "Props | Vue.js", "doc_id": "5c277ec480de43b5bed2c26fa4d7b32e", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 2081, "chunk_index": 13, "_doc_id": "13_5661751846730669640"}}
{"doc_id": "14_2349806029128496365", "text": "类型的声明的细节请参考<a href=\"/guide/typescript/composition-api.html#typing-component-props\">组件 props 类型标注<a>。 <p><div><div class=\"composition-api\"><h2 id=\"reactive-props-destructure\">响应式 Props 解构 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#reactive-props-destructure\" class=\"vt-badge\">​<a><h2><p>Vue 的响应系统基于属性访问跟踪状态的使用情况。例如，在计算属性或侦听器中访问 <code>props.foo<code> 时，<code>foo<code> 属性将被跟踪为依赖项。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/props.html", "title": "Props | Vue.js", "doc_id": "5c277ec480de43b5bed2c26fa4d7b32e", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 2081, "chunk_index": 14, "_doc_id": "14_2349806029128496365"}}
{"doc_id": "15_7046958154009306974", "text": "><h2><p>Vue 的响应系统基于属性访问跟踪状态的使用情况。例如，在计算属性或侦听器中访问 <code>props.foo<code> 时，<code>foo<code> 属性将被跟踪为依赖项。<p><p>因此，在以下代码的情况下：<p><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> { <span><span>foo<span><span> } <span><span>=<span><span> defineProps<span><span>([<span><span>'foo'<span><span>])<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>watchEffect<span><span>(() <span><span>=><span><span> {<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/props.html", "title": "Props | Vue.js", "doc_id": "5c277ec480de43b5bed2c26fa4d7b32e", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 2081, "chunk_index": 15, "_doc_id": "15_7046958154009306974"}}
{"doc_id": "16_7863464839228601081", "text": "<span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>watchEffect<span><span>(() <span><span>=><span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 在 3.5 之前只运行一次<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 在 3.5+ 中在 \"foo\" prop 变化时重新执行<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> console.<span><span>log<span><span>(foo)<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/props.html", "title": "Props | Vue.js", "doc_id": "5c277ec480de43b5bed2c26fa4d7b32e", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 2081, "chunk_index": 16, "_doc_id": "16_7863464839228601081"}}
{"doc_id": "17_6505616375189088236", "text": "变化时重新执行<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> console.<span><span>log<span><span>(foo)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>})<span><span><code><pre><div><p>在 3.4 及以下版本，<code>foo<code> 是一个实际的常量，永远不会改变。在 3.5 及以上版本，当在同一个 <code><script setup><code> 代码块中访问由 <code>defineProps<code> 解构的变量时，Vue 编译器会自动在前面添加 <code>props.<code>。因此，上面的代码等同于以下代码：<p><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> props<span><span> =<span><span> defineProps<span><span>([<span><span>'foo'<span><span>])<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/props.html", "title": "Props | Vue.js", "doc_id": "5c277ec480de43b5bed2c26fa4d7b32e", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 2081, "chunk_index": 17, "_doc_id": "17_6505616375189088236"}}
{"doc_id": "18_2836336191603754990", "text": "rops<span><span> =<span><span> defineProps<span><span>([<span><span>'foo'<span><span>])<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>watchEffect<span><span>(() <span><span>=><span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // `foo` 由编译器转换为 `props.foo`<span><span>\n<span class=\"line highlighted\"><span> console.<span><span>log<span><span>(props.foo)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>})<span><span><code><pre><div><p>此外，你可以使用 JavaScript 原生的默认值语法声明 props 默认值。这在使用基于类型的 props 声明时特别有用。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/props.html", "title": "Props | Vue.js", "doc_id": "5c277ec480de43b5bed2c26fa4d7b32e", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 2081, "chunk_index": 18, "_doc_id": "18_2836336191603754990"}}
{"doc_id": "19_1978996945073355891", "text": "n>})<span><span><code><pre><div><p>此外，你可以使用 JavaScript 原生的默认值语法声明 props 默认值。这在使用基于类型的 props 声明时特别有用。<p><div class=\"language-ts\"> <span class=\"lang\">ts<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> { <span><span>foo<span><span> =<span><span> 'hello'<span><span> } <span><span>=<span><span> defineProps<span><span><{ <span><span>foo<span><span>?:<span><span> string<span><span> }>()<span><span><code><pre><div><p>如果你希望在 IDE 中在解构的 props 和普通变量之间有更多视觉上的区分，Vue 的 VSCode 扩展提供了一个设置来启用解构 props 的内联提示。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/props.html", "title": "Props | Vue.js", "doc_id": "5c277ec480de43b5bed2c26fa4d7b32e", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 2081, "chunk_index": 19, "_doc_id": "19_1978996945073355891"}}
{"doc_id": "20_5194110621831335949", "text": "><code><pre><div><p>如果你希望在 IDE 中在解构的 props 和普通变量之间有更多视觉上的区分，Vue 的 VSCode 扩展提供了一个设置来启用解构 props 的内联提示。<p><h3 id=\"passing-destructured-props-into-functions\">将解构的 props 传递到函数中 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#passing-destructured-props-into-functions\">​<a><h3><p>当我们将解构的 prop 传递到函数中时，例如：<p><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> { <span><span>foo<span><span> } <span><span>=<span><span> defineProps<span><span>([<span><span>'foo'<span><span>])<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/props.html", "title": "Props | Vue.js", "doc_id": "5c277ec480de43b5bed2c26fa4d7b32e", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 2081, "chunk_index": 20, "_doc_id": "20_5194110621831335949"}}
{"doc_id": "21_4915098720332868545", "text": "n> } <span><span>=<span><span> defineProps<span><span>([<span><span>'foo'<span><span>])<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>watch<span><span>(foo, <span><span>/* ... */<span><span>)<span><span><code><pre><div><p>这并不会按预期工作，因为它等价于 <code>watch(props.foo, ...)<code>——我们给 <code>watch<code> 传递的是一个值而不是响应式数据源。实际上，Vue 的编译器会捕捉这种情况并发出警告。<p><p>与使用 <code>watch(() => props.foo, ...)<code> 来侦听普通 prop 类似，", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/props.html", "title": "Props | Vue.js", "doc_id": "5c277ec480de43b5bed2c26fa4d7b32e", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 2081, "chunk_index": 21, "_doc_id": "21_4915098720332868545"}}
{"doc_id": "22_2174990024158954778", "text": "值而不是响应式数据源。实际上，Vue 的编译器会捕捉这种情况并发出警告。<p><p>与使用 <code>watch(() => props.foo, ...)<code> 来侦听普通 prop 类似，我们也可以通过将其包装在 getter 中来侦听解构的 prop：<p><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>watch<span><span>(() <span><span>=><span><span> foo, <span><span>/* ... */<span><span>)<span><span><code><pre><div><p>此外，当我们需要传递解构的 prop 到外部函数中并保持响应性时，", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/props.html", "title": "Props | Vue.js", "doc_id": "5c277ec480de43b5bed2c26fa4d7b32e", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 2081, "chunk_index": 22, "_doc_id": "22_2174990024158954778"}}
{"doc_id": "23_4550515833432324059", "text": ", <span><span>/* ... */<span><span>)<span><span><code><pre><div><p>此外，当我们需要传递解构的 prop 到外部函数中并保持响应性时，这是推荐做法：<p><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>useComposable<span><span>(() <span><span>=><span><span> foo)<span><span><code><pre><div><p>外部函数可以调用 getter (或使用 <a href=\"/api/reactivity-utilities.html#tovalue\">toValue<a> 进行规范化) 来追踪提供的 prop 变更。例如，在计算属性或侦听器的 getter 中。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/props.html", "title": "Props | Vue.js", "doc_id": "5c277ec480de43b5bed2c26fa4d7b32e", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 2081, "chunk_index": 23, "_doc_id": "23_4550515833432324059"}}
{"doc_id": "24_1708679417015848443", "text": "ef=\"/api/reactivity-utilities.html#tovalue\">toValue<a> 进行规范化) 来追踪提供的 prop 变更。例如，在计算属性或侦听器的 getter 中。<p><div><h2 id=\"prop-passing-details\">传递 prop 的细节 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#prop-passing-details\">​<a><h2><h3 id=\"prop-name-casing\">Prop 名字格式 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#prop-name-casing\">​<a><h3><p>如果一个 prop 的名字很长，应使用 camelCase 形式，因为它们是合法的 JavaScript 标识符，可以直接在模板的表达式中使用，也可以避免在作为属性 key 名时必须加上引号。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/props.html", "title": "Props | Vue.js", "doc_id": "5c277ec480de43b5bed2c26fa4d7b32e", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 2081, "chunk_index": 24, "_doc_id": "24_1708679417015848443"}}
{"doc_id": "25_8318734424024361059", "text": "><p>如果一个 prop 的名字很长，应使用 camelCase 形式，因为它们是合法的 JavaScript 标识符，可以直接在模板的表达式中使用，也可以避免在作为属性 key 名时必须加上引号。<p><div class=\"composition-api\"><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>defineProps<span><span>({<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> greetingMessage: String<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/props.html", "title": "Props | Vue.js", "doc_id": "5c277ec480de43b5bed2c26fa4d7b32e", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 2081, "chunk_index": 25, "_doc_id": "25_8318734424024361059"}}
{"doc_id": "26_7585280665598674252", "text": "defineProps<span><span>({<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> greetingMessage: String<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>})<span><span><code><pre><div><div><div class=\"options-api\"><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> props: {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> greetingMessage: String<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/props.html", "title": "Props | Vue.js", "doc_id": "5c277ec480de43b5bed2c26fa4d7b32e", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 2081, "chunk_index": 26, "_doc_id": "26_7585280665598674252"}}
{"doc_id": "27_8659111333416015951", "text": "pan class=\"line\"><span> greetingMessage: String<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span><code><pre><div><div><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>span<span><span>>{{ greetingMessage }}</<span><span>span<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>虽然理论上你也可以在向子组件传递 props 时使用 camelCase 形式 (使用 <a href=\"/guide/essentials/component-basics.html#in-dom-template-parsing-caveats\">DOM 内模板<a>时例外)，", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/props.html", "title": "Props | Vue.js", "doc_id": "5c277ec480de43b5bed2c26fa4d7b32e", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 2081, "chunk_index": 27, "_doc_id": "27_8659111333416015951"}}
{"doc_id": "28_3580301065877768917", "text": "使用 <a href=\"/guide/essentials/component-basics.html#in-dom-template-parsing-caveats\">DOM 内模板<a>时例外)，但实际上为了和 HTML attribute 对齐，", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/props.html", "title": "Props | Vue.js", "doc_id": "5c277ec480de43b5bed2c26fa4d7b32e", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 2081, "chunk_index": 28, "_doc_id": "28_3580301065877768917"}}
{"doc_id": "29_2660342272239121685", "text": "als/component-basics.html#in-dom-template-parsing-caveats\">DOM 内模板<a>时例外)，但实际上为了和 HTML attribute 对齐，我们通常会将其写为 kebab-case 形式：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>MyComponent<span><span> greeting-message<span><span>=<span><span>\"hello\"<span><span> /><span><span><code><pre><div><p>对于组件名我们推荐使用 <a href=\"/guide/components/registration.html#component-name-casing\">PascalCase<a>，因为这提高了模板的可读性，", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/props.html", "title": "Props | Vue.js", "doc_id": "5c277ec480de43b5bed2c26fa4d7b32e", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 2081, "chunk_index": 29, "_doc_id": "29_2660342272239121685"}}
{"doc_id": "30_7584928141687209251", "text": "推荐使用 <a href=\"/guide/components/registration.html#component-name-casing\">PascalCase<a>，因为这提高了模板的可读性，能帮助我们区分 Vue 组件和原生 HTML 元素。然而对于传递 props 来说，使用 camelCase 并没有太多优势，因此我们推荐更贴近 HTML 的书写风格。<p><h3 id=\"static-vs-dynamic-props\">静态 vs. 动态 Props <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#static-vs-dynamic-props\">​<a><h3><p>至此，", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/props.html", "title": "Props | Vue.js", "doc_id": "5c277ec480de43b5bed2c26fa4d7b32e", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 2081, "chunk_index": 30, "_doc_id": "30_7584928141687209251"}}
{"doc_id": "31_7614672280641776723", "text": "namic-props\">静态 vs. 动态 Props <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#static-vs-dynamic-props\">​<a><h3><p>至此，你已经见过了很多像这样的静态值形式的 props：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>BlogPost<span><span> title<span><span>=<span><span>\"My journey with Vue\"<span><span> /><span><span><code><pre><div><p>相应地，", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/props.html", "title": "Props | Vue.js", "doc_id": "5c277ec480de43b5bed2c26fa4d7b32e", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 2081, "chunk_index": 31, "_doc_id": "31_7614672280641776723"}}
{"doc_id": "32_7070257695235280248", "text": "itle<span><span>=<span><span>\"My journey with Vue\"<span><span> /><span><span><code><pre><div><p>相应地，还有使用 <code>v-bind<code> 或缩写 <code>:<code> 来进行动态绑定的 props：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><!-- 根据一个变量的值动态传入 --><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>BlogPost<span><span> :<span><span>title<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>post.title<span><span>\"<span><span> /><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/props.html", "title": "Props | Vue.js", "doc_id": "5c277ec480de43b5bed2c26fa4d7b32e", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 2081, "chunk_index": 32, "_doc_id": "32_7070257695235280248"}}
{"doc_id": "33_4535813765226963238", "text": "<span>title<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>post.title<span><span>\"<span><span> /><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><!-- 根据一个更复杂表达式的值动态传入 --><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/props.html", "title": "Props | Vue.js", "doc_id": "5c277ec480de43b5bed2c26fa4d7b32e", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 2081, "chunk_index": 33, "_doc_id": "33_4535813765226963238"}}
{"doc_id": "34_1564634446268682097", "text": "pan><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><!-- 根据一个更复杂表达式的值动态传入 --><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>BlogPost<span><span> :<span><span>title<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>post.title <span><span>+<span><span> ' by '<span><span> +<span><span> post.author.name<span><span>\"<span><span> /><span><span><code><pre><div><h3 id=\"passing-different-value-types\">传递不同的值类型 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#passing-different-value-types\">​<a><h3><p>在上述的两个例子中，我们只传入了字符串值，但实际上<strong>任何<strong>类型的值都可以作为 props 的值被传递。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/props.html", "title": "Props | Vue.js", "doc_id": "5c277ec480de43b5bed2c26fa4d7b32e", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 2081, "chunk_index": 34, "_doc_id": "34_1564634446268682097"}}
{"doc_id": "35_6787612195849415998", "text": "-different-value-types\">​<a><h3><p>在上述的两个例子中，我们只传入了字符串值，但实际上<strong>任何<strong>类型的值都可以作为 props 的值被传递。<p><h4 id=\"number\">Number <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#number\">​<a><h4><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><!-- 虽然 `42` 是个常量，我们还是需要使用 v-bind --><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><!-- 因为这是一个 JavaScript 表达式而不是一个字符串 --><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/props.html", "title": "Props | Vue.js", "doc_id": "5c277ec480de43b5bed2c26fa4d7b32e", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 2081, "chunk_index": 35, "_doc_id": "35_6787612195849415998"}}
{"doc_id": "36_520065462401553536", "text": "v-bind --><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><!-- 因为这是一个 JavaScript 表达式而不是一个字符串 --><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>BlogPost<span><span> :<span><span>likes<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>42<span><span>\"<span><span> /><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><!-- 根据一个变量的值动态传入 --><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/props.html", "title": "Props | Vue.js", "doc_id": "5c277ec480de43b5bed2c26fa4d7b32e", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 2081, "chunk_index": 36, "_doc_id": "36_520065462401553536"}}
{"doc_id": "37_275972917196062007", "text": "/><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><!-- 根据一个变量的值动态传入 --><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>BlogPost<span><span> :<span><span>likes<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>post.likes<span><span>\"<span><span> /><span><span><code><pre><div><h4 id=\"boolean\">Boolean <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#boolean\">​<a><h4><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><!-- 仅写上 prop 但不传值，会隐式转换为 `true` --><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/props.html", "title": "Props | Vue.js", "doc_id": "5c277ec480de43b5bed2c26fa4d7b32e", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 2081, "chunk_index": 37, "_doc_id": "37_275972917196062007"}}
{"doc_id": "38_3931468284517535968", "text": "ithub-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><!-- 仅写上 prop 但不传值，会隐式转换为 `true` --><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>BlogPost<span><span> is-published<span><span> /><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><!-- 虽然 `false` 是静态的值，我们还是需要使用 v-bind --><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><!-- 因为这是一个 JavaScript 表达式而不是一个字符串 --><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/props.html", "title": "Props | Vue.js", "doc_id": "5c277ec480de43b5bed2c26fa4d7b32e", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 2081, "chunk_index": 38, "_doc_id": "38_3931468284517535968"}}
{"doc_id": "39_5528812262561389940", "text": "v-bind --><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><!-- 因为这是一个 JavaScript 表达式而不是一个字符串 --><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>BlogPost<span><span> :<span><span>is-published<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>false<span><span>\"<span><span> /><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><!-- 根据一个变量的值动态传入 --><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/props.html", "title": "Props | Vue.js", "doc_id": "5c277ec480de43b5bed2c26fa4d7b32e", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 2081, "chunk_index": 39, "_doc_id": "39_5528812262561389940"}}
{"doc_id": "40_6546181014830212284", "text": "/><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><!-- 根据一个变量的值动态传入 --><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>BlogPost<span><span> :<span><span>is-published<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>post.isPublished<span><span>\"<span><span> /><span><span><code><pre><div><h4 id=\"array\">Array <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#array\">​<a><h4><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><!-- 虽然这个数组是个常量，我们还是需要使用 v-bind --><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/props.html", "title": "Props | Vue.js", "doc_id": "5c277ec480de43b5bed2c26fa4d7b32e", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 2081, "chunk_index": 40, "_doc_id": "40_6546181014830212284"}}
