{"doc_id": "42_7730902136426170036", "text": "/><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><!-- 根据一个变量的值动态传入 --><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>BlogPost<span><span> :<span><span>comment-ids<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>post.commentIds<span><span>\"<span><span> /><span><span><code><pre><div><h4 id=\"object\">Object <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#object\">​<a><h4><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><!-- 虽然这个对象字面量是个常量，我们还是需要使用 v-bind --><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/props.html", "title": "Props | Vue.js", "doc_id": "5c277ec480de43b5bed2c26fa4d7b32e", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 2081, "chunk_index": 42, "_doc_id": "42_7730902136426170036"}}
{"doc_id": "43_5006927007237022382", "text": "hub-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><!-- 虽然这个对象字面量是个常量，我们还是需要使用 v-bind --><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><!-- 因为这是一个 JavaScript 表达式而不是一个字符串 --><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>BlogPost<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> :<span><span>author<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>{<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> name: <span><span>'Veronica'<span><span>,<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> company: <span><span>'Veridian Dynamics'<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/props.html", "title": "Props | Vue.js", "doc_id": "5c277ec480de43b5bed2c26fa4d7b32e", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 2081, "chunk_index": 43, "_doc_id": "43_5006927007237022382"}}
{"doc_id": "44_1975460193188171906", "text": "><span>,<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> company: <span><span>'Veridian Dynamics'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\"<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> /><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><!-- 根据一个变量的值动态传入 --><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/props.html", "title": "Props | Vue.js", "doc_id": "5c277ec480de43b5bed2c26fa4d7b32e", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 2081, "chunk_index": 44, "_doc_id": "44_1975460193188171906"}}
{"doc_id": "45_3806778936305592787", "text": "/><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><!-- 根据一个变量的值动态传入 --><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>BlogPost<span><span> :<span><span>author<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>post.author<span><span>\"<span><span> /><span><span><code><pre><div><h3 id=\"binding-multiple-properties-using-an-object\">使用一个对象绑定多个 prop <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#binding-multiple-properties-using-an-object\">​<a><h3><p>如果你想要将一个对象的所有属性都当作 props 传入，", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/props.html", "title": "Props | Vue.js", "doc_id": "5c277ec480de43b5bed2c26fa4d7b32e", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 2081, "chunk_index": 45, "_doc_id": "45_3806778936305592787"}}
{"doc_id": "46_7241390891978472784", "text": "-anchor\" href=\"#binding-multiple-properties-using-an-object\">​<a><h3><p>如果你想要将一个对象的所有属性都当作 props 传入，你可以使用<a href=\"/guide/essentials/template-syntax.html#dynamically-binding-multiple-attributes\">没有参数的 <code>v-bind<code><a>，即只使用 <code>v-bind<code> 而非 <code>:prop-name<code>。例如，这里有一个 <code>post<code> 对象：<p><div class=\"options-api\"><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/props.html", "title": "Props | Vue.js", "doc_id": "5c277ec480de43b5bed2c26fa4d7b32e", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 2081, "chunk_index": 46, "_doc_id": "46_7241390891978472784"}}
{"doc_id": "47_286776656105920245", "text": "b-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> data<span><span>() {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> return<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> post: {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> id: <span><span>1<span><span>,<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> title: <span><span>'My Journey with Vue'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/props.html", "title": "Props | Vue.js", "doc_id": "5c277ec480de43b5bed2c26fa4d7b32e", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 2081, "chunk_index": 47, "_doc_id": "47_286776656105920245"}}
{"doc_id": "48_829726603984334557", "text": "th Vue'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span><code><pre><div><div><div class=\"composition-api\"><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> post<span><span> =<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> id: <span><span>1<span><span>,<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/props.html", "title": "Props | Vue.js", "doc_id": "5c277ec480de43b5bed2c26fa4d7b32e", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 2081, "chunk_index": 48, "_doc_id": "48_829726603984334557"}}
{"doc_id": "49_7073306619629347990", "text": "n> =<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> id: <span><span>1<span><span>,<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> title: <span><span>'My Journey with Vue'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span><code><pre><div><div><p>以及下面的模板：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>BlogPost<span><span> v-bind<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>post<span><span>\"<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/props.html", "title": "Props | Vue.js", "doc_id": "5c277ec480de43b5bed2c26fa4d7b32e", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 2081, "chunk_index": 49, "_doc_id": "49_7073306619629347990"}}
{"doc_id": "50_7842186109244603457", "text": "span>BlogPost<span><span> v-bind<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>post<span><span>\"<span><span> /><span><span><code><pre><div><p>而这实际上等价于：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>BlogPost<span><span> :<span><span>id<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>post.id<span><span>\"<span><span> :<span><span>title<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>post.", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/props.html", "title": "Props | Vue.js", "doc_id": "5c277ec480de43b5bed2c26fa4d7b32e", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 2081, "chunk_index": 50, "_doc_id": "50_7842186109244603457"}}
{"doc_id": "51_240400299707707533", "text": "<span>post.id<span><span>\"<span><span> :<span><span>title<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>post.title<span><span>\"<span><span> /><span><span><code><pre><div><h2 id=\"one-way-data-flow\">单向数据流 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#one-way-data-flow\">​<a><h2><p>所有的 props 都遵循着<strong>单向绑定<strong>原则，props 因父组件的更新而变化，自然地将新的状态向下流往子组件，而不会逆向传递。这避免了子组件意外修改父组件的状态的情况，不然应用的数据流将很容易变得混乱而难以理解。<p><p>另外，每次父组件更新后，所有的子组件中的 props 都会被更新到最新值，这意味着你<strong>不应该<strong>在子组件中去更改一个 prop。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/props.html", "title": "Props | Vue.js", "doc_id": "5c277ec480de43b5bed2c26fa4d7b32e", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 2081, "chunk_index": 51, "_doc_id": "51_240400299707707533"}}
{"doc_id": "52_4774912858492914181", "text": "数据流将很容易变得混乱而难以理解。<p><p>另外，每次父组件更新后，所有的子组件中的 props 都会被更新到最新值，这意味着你<strong>不应该<strong>在子组件中去更改一个 prop。若你这么做了，Vue 会在控制台上向你抛出警告：<p><div class=\"composition-api\"><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> props<span><span> =<span><span> defineProps<span><span>([<span><span>'foo'<span><span>])<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// ❌ 警告！prop 是只读的！<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/props.html", "title": "Props | Vue.js", "doc_id": "5c277ec480de43b5bed2c26fa4d7b32e", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 2081, "chunk_index": 52, "_doc_id": "52_4774912858492914181"}}
{"doc_id": "53_3597413813655200266", "text": "an>])<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// ❌ 警告！prop 是只读的！<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>props.foo <span><span>=<span><span> 'bar'<span><span><code><pre><div><div><div class=\"options-api\"><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> props: [<span><span>'foo'<span><span>],<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/props.html", "title": "Props | Vue.js", "doc_id": "5c277ec480de43b5bed2c26fa4d7b32e", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 2081, "chunk_index": 53, "_doc_id": "53_3597413813655200266"}}
{"doc_id": "54_6216908736416252476", "text": "><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> props: [<span><span>'foo'<span><span>],<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> created<span><span>() {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // ❌ 警告！prop 是只读的！<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> this<span><span>.foo <span><span>=<span><span> 'bar'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/props.html", "title": "Props | Vue.js", "doc_id": "5c277ec480de43b5bed2c26fa4d7b32e", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 2081, "chunk_index": 54, "_doc_id": "54_6216908736416252476"}}
{"doc_id": "55_3223858941782546962", "text": "span><span>.foo <span><span>=<span><span> 'bar'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span><code><pre><div><div><p>导致你想要更改一个 prop 的需求通常来源于以下两种场景：<p><ol><li><p><strong>prop 被用于传入初始值；而子组件想在之后将其作为一个局部数据属性<strong>。在这种情况下，最好是新定义一个局部数据属性，从 props 上获取初始值即可：<p><div class=\"composition-api\"><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> props<span><span> =<span><span> defineProps<span><span>([<span><span>'initialCounter'<span><span>])<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/props.html", "title": "Props | Vue.js", "doc_id": "5c277ec480de43b5bed2c26fa4d7b32e", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 2081, "chunk_index": 55, "_doc_id": "55_3223858941782546962"}}
{"doc_id": "56_7391863755429110718", "text": "span> =<span><span> defineProps<span><span>([<span><span>'initialCounter'<span><span>])<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 计数器只是将 props.initialCounter 作为初始值<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 像下面这样做就使 prop 和后续更新无关了<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/props.html", "title": "Props | Vue.js", "doc_id": "5c277ec480de43b5bed2c26fa4d7b32e", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 2081, "chunk_index": 56, "_doc_id": "56_7391863755429110718"}}
{"doc_id": "57_4350034462246369213", "text": "ops.initialCounter 作为初始值<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 像下面这样做就使 prop 和后续更新无关了<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> counter<span><span> =<span><span> ref<span><span>(props.initialCounter)<span><span><code><pre><div><div><div class=\"options-api\"><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/props.html", "title": "Props | Vue.js", "doc_id": "5c277ec480de43b5bed2c26fa4d7b32e", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 2081, "chunk_index": 57, "_doc_id": "57_4350034462246369213"}}
{"doc_id": "58_568165139559512735", "text": "b-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> props: [<span><span>'initialCounter'<span><span>],<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> data<span><span>() {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> return<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 计数器只是将 this.initialCounter 作为初始值<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 像下面这样做就使 prop 和后续更新无关了<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/props.html", "title": "Props | Vue.js", "doc_id": "5c277ec480de43b5bed2c26fa4d7b32e", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 2081, "chunk_index": 58, "_doc_id": "58_568165139559512735"}}
{"doc_id": "59_1277601631029201050", "text": "is.initialCounter 作为初始值<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 像下面这样做就使 prop 和后续更新无关了<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> counter: <span><span>this<span><span>.initialCounter<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/props.html", "title": "Props | Vue.js", "doc_id": "5c277ec480de43b5bed2c26fa4d7b32e", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 2081, "chunk_index": 59, "_doc_id": "59_1277601631029201050"}}
{"doc_id": "60_18187330090394074", "text": "Counter<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span><code><pre><div><div><li><li><p><strong>需要对传入的 prop 值做进一步的转换<strong>。在这种情况中，最好是基于该 prop 值定义一个计算属性：<p><div class=\"composition-api\"><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> props<span><span> =<span><span> defineProps<span><span>([<span><span>'size'<span><span>])<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/props.html", "title": "Props | Vue.js", "doc_id": "5c277ec480de43b5bed2c26fa4d7b32e", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 2081, "chunk_index": 60, "_doc_id": "60_18187330090394074"}}
{"doc_id": "61_4445951951327496886", "text": "ops<span><span> =<span><span> defineProps<span><span>([<span><span>'size'<span><span>])<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 该 prop 变更时计算属性也会自动更新<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/props.html", "title": "Props | Vue.js", "doc_id": "5c277ec480de43b5bed2c26fa4d7b32e", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 2081, "chunk_index": 61, "_doc_id": "61_4445951951327496886"}}
{"doc_id": "62_1825259539356337155", "text": "<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 该 prop 变更时计算属性也会自动更新<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> normalizedSize<span><span> =<span><span> computed<span><span>(() <span><span>=><span><span> props.size.<span><span>trim<span><span>().<span><span>toLowerCase<span><span>())<span><span><code><pre><div><div><div class=\"options-api\"><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/props.html", "title": "Props | Vue.js", "doc_id": "5c277ec480de43b5bed2c26fa4d7b32e", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 2081, "chunk_index": 62, "_doc_id": "62_1825259539356337155"}}
{"doc_id": "63_1755962365448565878", "text": "b-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> props: [<span><span>'size'<span><span>],<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> computed: {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 该 prop 变更时计算属性也会自动更新<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> normalizedSize<span><span>() {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> return<span><span> this<span><span>.size.<span><span>trim<span><span>().<span><span>toLowerCase<span><span>()<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/props.html", "title": "Props | Vue.js", "doc_id": "5c277ec480de43b5bed2c26fa4d7b32e", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 2081, "chunk_index": 63, "_doc_id": "63_1755962365448565878"}}
{"doc_id": "64_5980375204559569176", "text": "s<span><span>.size.<span><span>trim<span><span>().<span><span>toLowerCase<span><span>()<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span><code><pre><div><div><li><ol><h3 id=\"mutating-object-array-props\">更改对象 / 数组类型的 props <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#mutating-object-array-props\">​<a><h3><p>当对象或数组作为 props 被传入时，虽然子组件无法更改 props 绑定，但仍然<strong>可以<strong>更改对象或数组内部的值。这是因为 JavaScript 的对象和数组是按引用传递，对 Vue 来说，阻止这种更改需要付出的代价异常昂贵。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/props.html", "title": "Props | Vue.js", "doc_id": "5c277ec480de43b5bed2c26fa4d7b32e", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 2081, "chunk_index": 64, "_doc_id": "64_5980375204559569176"}}
{"doc_id": "65_4605764562080582880", "text": "改 props 绑定，但仍然<strong>可以<strong>更改对象或数组内部的值。这是因为 JavaScript 的对象和数组是按引用传递，对 Vue 来说，阻止这种更改需要付出的代价异常昂贵。<p><p>这种更改的主要缺陷是它允许了子组件以某种不明显的方式影响父组件的状态，可能会使数据流在将来变得更难以理解。在最佳实践中，你应该尽可能避免这样的更改，除非父子组件在设计上本来就需要紧密耦合。在大多数场景下，子组件应该<a href=\"/guide/components/events.html\">抛出一个事件<a>来通知父组件做出改变。<p><h2 id=\"prop-validation\">Prop 校验 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#prop-validation\">​<a><h2><p>Vue 组件可以更细致地声明对传入的 props 的校验要求。比如我们上面已经看到过的类型声明，如果传入的值不满足类型要求，Vue 会在浏览器控制台中抛出警告来提醒使用者。这在开发给其他开发者使用的组件时非常有用。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/props.html", "title": "Props | Vue.js", "doc_id": "5c277ec480de43b5bed2c26fa4d7b32e", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 2081, "chunk_index": 65, "_doc_id": "65_4605764562080582880"}}
{"doc_id": "66_870696117254813465", "text": "以更细致地声明对传入的 props 的校验要求。比如我们上面已经看到过的类型声明，如果传入的值不满足类型要求，Vue 会在浏览器控制台中抛出警告来提醒使用者。这在开发给其他开发者使用的组件时非常有用。<p><p>要声明对 props 的校验，你可以向 <span class=\"composition-api\"><code>defineProps()<code> 宏<span><span class=\"options-api\"><code>props<code> 选项<span>提供一个带有 props 校验选项的对象，例如：<p><div class=\"composition-api\"><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>defineProps<span><span>({<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 基础类型检查<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/props.html", "title": "Props | Vue.js", "doc_id": "5c277ec480de43b5bed2c26fa4d7b32e", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 2081, "chunk_index": 66, "_doc_id": "66_870696117254813465"}}
{"doc_id": "67_1992983745966526303", "text": "=\"line\"><span>defineProps<span><span>({<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 基础类型检查<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // (给出 `null` 和 `undefined` 值则会跳过任何类型检查)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> propA: Number,<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 多种可能的类型<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> propB: [String, Number],<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 必传，且为 String 类型<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> propC: {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> type: String,<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/props.html", "title": "Props | Vue.js", "doc_id": "5c277ec480de43b5bed2c26fa4d7b32e", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 2081, "chunk_index": 67, "_doc_id": "67_1992983745966526303"}}
{"doc_id": "68_7989532248443330754", "text": "<span class=\"line\"><span> propC: {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> type: String,<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> required: <span><span>true<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> },<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 必传但可为 null 的字符串<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> propD: {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> type: [String, <span><span>null<span><span>],<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> required: <span><span>true<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> },<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/props.html", "title": "Props | Vue.js", "doc_id": "5c277ec480de43b5bed2c26fa4d7b32e", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 2081, "chunk_index": 68, "_doc_id": "68_7989532248443330754"}}
{"doc_id": "69_2539239570476485442", "text": "class=\"line\"><span> required: <span><span>true<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> },<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // Number 类型的默认值<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> propE: {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> type: Number,<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> default: <span><span>100<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> },<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 对象类型的默认值<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> propF: {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> type: Object,<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/props.html", "title": "Props | Vue.js", "doc_id": "5c277ec480de43b5bed2c26fa4d7b32e", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 2081, "chunk_index": 69, "_doc_id": "69_2539239570476485442"}}
{"doc_id": "70_4765934980854582277", "text": "<span class=\"line\"><span> propF: {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> type: Object,<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 对象或数组的默认值<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 必须从一个工厂函数返回。<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 该函数接收组件所接收到的原始 prop 作为参数。<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> default<span><span>(<span><span>rawProps<span><span>) {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> return<span><span> { message: <span><span>'hello'<span><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/props.html", "title": "Props | Vue.js", "doc_id": "5c277ec480de43b5bed2c26fa4d7b32e", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 2081, "chunk_index": 70, "_doc_id": "70_4765934980854582277"}}
{"doc_id": "71_8521054138371664234", "text": "n> { message: <span><span>'hello'<span><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> },<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 自定义类型校验函数<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 在 3.4+ 中完整的 props 作为第二个参数传入<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> propG: {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> validator<span><span>(<span><span>value<span><span>, <span><span>props<span><span>) {<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/props.html", "title": "Props | Vue.js", "doc_id": "5c277ec480de43b5bed2c26fa4d7b32e", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 2081, "chunk_index": 71, "_doc_id": "71_8521054138371664234"}}
{"doc_id": "72_9140473634410212128", "text": "> validator<span><span>(<span><span>value<span><span>, <span><span>props<span><span>) {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // The value must match one of these strings<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> return<span><span> [<span><span>'success'<span><span>, <span><span>'warning'<span><span>, <span><span>'danger'<span><span>].<span><span>includes<span><span>(value)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> },<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/props.html", "title": "Props | Vue.js", "doc_id": "5c277ec480de43b5bed2c26fa4d7b32e", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 2081, "chunk_index": 72, "_doc_id": "72_9140473634410212128"}}
{"doc_id": "73_3230279229704121596", "text": "value)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> },<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 函数类型的默认值<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> propH: {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> type: Function,<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 不像对象或数组的默认，这不是一个<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 工厂函数。这会是一个用来作为默认值的函数<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> default<span><span>() {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> return<span><span> 'Default function'<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/props.html", "title": "Props | Vue.js", "doc_id": "5c277ec480de43b5bed2c26fa4d7b32e", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 2081, "chunk_index": 73, "_doc_id": "73_3230279229704121596"}}
{"doc_id": "74_4055975118569474863", "text": "><span>() {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> return<span><span> 'Default function'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/props.html", "title": "Props | Vue.js", "doc_id": "5c277ec480de43b5bed2c26fa4d7b32e", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 2081, "chunk_index": 74, "_doc_id": "74_4055975118569474863"}}
{"doc_id": "75_7926562274288255371", "text": "nction'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>})<span><span><code><pre><div><div class=\"tip custom-block\"><p class=\"custom-block-title\">TIP<p><p><code>defineProps()<code> 宏中的参数<strong>不可以访问 <code><script setup><code> 中定义的其他变量<strong>，因为在编译时整个表达式都会被移到外部的函数中。<p><div><div><div class=\"options-api\"><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/props.html", "title": "Props | Vue.js", "doc_id": "5c277ec480de43b5bed2c26fa4d7b32e", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 2081, "chunk_index": 75, "_doc_id": "75_7926562274288255371"}}
{"doc_id": "76_1258725036785490163", "text": "b-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> props: {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 基础类型检查<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // (给出 `null` 和 `undefined` 值则会跳过任何类型检查)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> propA: Number,<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 多种可能的类型<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> propB: [String, Number],<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 必传，且为 String 类型<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/props.html", "title": "Props | Vue.js", "doc_id": "5c277ec480de43b5bed2c26fa4d7b32e", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 2081, "chunk_index": 76, "_doc_id": "76_1258725036785490163"}}
{"doc_id": "77_6555997529577072718", "text": "span> propB: [String, Number],<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 必传，且为 String 类型<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> propC: {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> type: String,<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> required: <span><span>true<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> },<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 必传但可为 null 的字符串<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> propD: {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> type: [String, <span><span>null<span><span>],<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/props.html", "title": "Props | Vue.js", "doc_id": "5c277ec480de43b5bed2c26fa4d7b32e", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 2081, "chunk_index": 77, "_doc_id": "77_6555997529577072718"}}
{"doc_id": "78_5280788927469086483", "text": ": {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> type: [String, <span><span>null<span><span>],<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> required: <span><span>true<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> },<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // Number 类型的默认值<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> propE: {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> type: Number,<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> default: <span><span>100<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> },<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/props.html", "title": "Props | Vue.js", "doc_id": "5c277ec480de43b5bed2c26fa4d7b32e", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 2081, "chunk_index": 78, "_doc_id": "78_5280788927469086483"}}
{"doc_id": "79_7453597373619727903", "text": "n class=\"line\"><span> default: <span><span>100<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> },<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 对象类型的默认值<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> propF: {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> type: Object,<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 对象或者数组应当用工厂函数返回。<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 工厂函数会收到组件所接收的原始 props<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 作为参数<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> default<span><span>(<span><span>rawProps<span><span>) {<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/props.html", "title": "Props | Vue.js", "doc_id": "5c277ec480de43b5bed2c26fa4d7b32e", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 2081, "chunk_index": 79, "_doc_id": "79_7453597373619727903"}}
{"doc_id": "80_3924137475669948960", "text": "span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> default<span><span>(<span><span>rawProps<span><span>) {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> return<span><span> { message: <span><span>'hello'<span><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> },<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 自定义类型校验函数<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 在 3.4+ 中完整的 props 作为第二个参数传入<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> propG: {<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/props.html", "title": "Props | Vue.js", "doc_id": "5c277ec480de43b5bed2c26fa4d7b32e", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 2081, "chunk_index": 80, "_doc_id": "80_3924137475669948960"}}
{"doc_id": "81_5833806378058301768", "text": "e\"><span> // 在 3.4+ 中完整的 props 作为第二个参数传入<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> propG: {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> validator<span><span>(<span><span>value<span><span>, <span><span>props<span><span>) {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // The value must match one of these strings<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> return<span><span> [<span><span>'success'<span><span>, <span><span>'warning'<span><span>, <span><span>'danger'<span><span>].<span><span>includes<span><span>(value)<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/props.html", "title": "Props | Vue.js", "doc_id": "5c277ec480de43b5bed2c26fa4d7b32e", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 2081, "chunk_index": 81, "_doc_id": "81_5833806378058301768"}}
{"doc_id": "82_8413451661071107716", "text": "<span><span>, <span><span>'danger'<span><span>].<span><span>includes<span><span>(value)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> },<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 函数类型的默认值<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> propH: {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> type: Function,<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 不像对象或数组的默认，这不是一个<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 工厂函数。这会是一个用来作为默认值的函数<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/props.html", "title": "Props | Vue.js", "doc_id": "5c277ec480de43b5bed2c26fa4d7b32e", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 2081, "chunk_index": 82, "_doc_id": "82_8413451661071107716"}}
{"doc_id": "83_9204418390972895934", "text": "span> // 不像对象或数组的默认，这不是一个<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 工厂函数。这会是一个用来作为默认值的函数<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> default<span><span>() {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> return<span><span> 'Default function'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span><code><pre><div><div><p>一些补充细节：<p><ul><li><p>所有 prop 默认都是可选的，除非声明了 <code>required: true<code>。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/props.html", "title": "Props | Vue.js", "doc_id": "5c277ec480de43b5bed2c26fa4d7b32e", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 2081, "chunk_index": 83, "_doc_id": "83_9204418390972895934"}}
{"doc_id": "84_609627579659566045", "text": "<span><code><pre><div><div><p>一些补充细节：<p><ul><li><p>所有 prop 默认都是可选的，除非声明了 <code>required: true<code>。<p><li><li><p>除 <code>Boolean<code> 外的未传递的可选 prop 将会有一个默认值 <code>undefined<code>。<p><li><li><p><code>Boolean<code> 类型的未传递 prop 将被转换为 <code>false<code>。这可以通过为它设置 <code>default<code> 来更改——例如：设置为 <code>default: undefined<code> 将与非布尔类型的 prop 的行为保持一致。<p><li><li><p>如果声明了 <code>default<code> 值，那么在 prop 的值被解析为 <code>undefined<code> 时，无论 prop 是未被传递还是显式指明的 <code>undefined<code>，都会改为 <code>default<code> 值。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/props.html", "title": "Props | Vue.js", "doc_id": "5c277ec480de43b5bed2c26fa4d7b32e", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 2081, "chunk_index": 84, "_doc_id": "84_609627579659566045"}}
{"doc_id": "85_3385435876546230539", "text": "值被解析为 <code>undefined<code> 时，无论 prop 是未被传递还是显式指明的 <code>undefined<code>，都会改为 <code>default<code> 值。<p><li><ul><p>当 prop 的校验失败后，Vue 会抛出一个控制台警告 (在开发模式下)。<p><div class=\"composition-api\"><p>如果使用了<a href=\"/api/sfc-script-setup.html#type-only-props-emit-declarations\">基于类型的 prop 声明<a> ，Vue 会尽最大努力在运行时按照 prop 的类型标注进行编译。举例来说，<code>defineProps<{ msg: string }><code> 会被编译为 <code>{ msg: { type: String, required: true }}<code>。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/props.html", "title": "Props | Vue.js", "doc_id": "5c277ec480de43b5bed2c26fa4d7b32e", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 2081, "chunk_index": 85, "_doc_id": "85_3385435876546230539"}}
{"doc_id": "86_7520024200877605268", "text": "<code>defineProps<{ msg: string }><code> 会被编译为 <code>{ msg: { type: String, required: true }}<code>。<p><div><div class=\"options-api\"><div class=\"tip custom-block\"><p class=\"custom-block-title\">注意<p><p>注意 prop 的校验是在组件实例被创建<strong>之前<strong>，所以实例的属性 (比如 <code>data<code>、<code>computed<code> 等) 将在 <code>default<code> 或 <code>validator<code> 函数中不可用。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/props.html", "title": "Props | Vue.js", "doc_id": "5c277ec480de43b5bed2c26fa4d7b32e", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 2081, "chunk_index": 86, "_doc_id": "86_7520024200877605268"}}
{"doc_id": "87_3208432022644435096", "text": "(比如 <code>data<code>、<code>computed<code> 等) 将在 <code>default<code> 或 <code>validator<code> 函数中不可用。<p><div><div><h3 id=\"runtime-type-checks\">运行时类型检查 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#runtime-type-checks\">​<a><h3><p>校验选项中的 <code>type<code> 可以是下列这些原生构造函数：<p><ul><li><code>String<code><li><li><code>Number<code><li><li><code>Boolean<code><li><li><code>Array<code><li><li><code>Object<code><li><li><code>Date<code><li><li><code>Function<code><li><li><code>Symbol<code><li><li><code>Error<code><li><ul><p>另外，<code>type<code> 也可以是自定义的类或构造函数，Vue 将会通过 <code>instanceof<code> 来检查类型是否匹配。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/props.html", "title": "Props | Vue.js", "doc_id": "5c277ec480de43b5bed2c26fa4d7b32e", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 2081, "chunk_index": 87, "_doc_id": "87_3208432022644435096"}}
{"doc_id": "88_3547477452708246195", "text": ">Error<code><li><ul><p>另外，<code>type<code> 也可以是自定义的类或构造函数，Vue 将会通过 <code>instanceof<code> 来检查类型是否匹配。例如下面这个类：<p><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>class<span><span> Person<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> constructor<span><span>(<span><span>firstName<span><span>, <span><span>lastName<span><span>) {<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/props.html", "title": "Props | Vue.js", "doc_id": "5c277ec480de43b5bed2c26fa4d7b32e", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 2081, "chunk_index": 88, "_doc_id": "88_3547477452708246195"}}
{"doc_id": "89_3013308831611300100", "text": "ctor<span><span>(<span><span>firstName<span><span>, <span><span>lastName<span><span>) {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> this<span><span>.firstName <span><span>=<span><span> firstName<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> this<span><span>.lastName <span><span>=<span><span> lastName<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/props.html", "title": "Props | Vue.js", "doc_id": "5c277ec480de43b5bed2c26fa4d7b32e", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 2081, "chunk_index": 89, "_doc_id": "89_3013308831611300100"}}
{"doc_id": "90_6959519931107541151", "text": "an>.lastName <span><span>=<span><span> lastName<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span><code><pre><div><p>你可以将其作为一个 prop 的类型：<p><div class=\"composition-api\"><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>defineProps<span><span>({<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> author: Person<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/props.html", "title": "Props | Vue.js", "doc_id": "5c277ec480de43b5bed2c26fa4d7b32e", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 2081, "chunk_index": 90, "_doc_id": "90_6959519931107541151"}}
{"doc_id": "91_1354775305855684364", "text": "e\"><span>defineProps<span><span>({<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> author: Person<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>})<span><span><code><pre><div><div><div class=\"options-api\"><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> props: {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> author: Person<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/props.html", "title": "Props | Vue.js", "doc_id": "5c277ec480de43b5bed2c26fa4d7b32e", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 2081, "chunk_index": 91, "_doc_id": "91_1354775305855684364"}}
{"doc_id": "92_6451900920029013352", "text": "<span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> author: Person<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span><code><pre><div><div><p>Vue 会通过 <code>instanceof Person<code> 来校验 <code>author<code> prop 的值是否是 <code>Person<code> 类的一个实例。<p><h3 id=\"nullable-type\">可为 null 的类型 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#nullable-type\">​<a><h3><p>如果该类型是必传但可为 null 的，你可以用一个包含 <code>null<code> 的数组语法：<p><div class=\"composition-api\"><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>defineProps<span><span>({<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/props.html", "title": "Props | Vue.js", "doc_id": "5c277ec480de43b5bed2c26fa4d7b32e", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 2081, "chunk_index": 92, "_doc_id": "92_6451900920029013352"}}
{"doc_id": "93_3947046202752426589", "text": "ss=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>defineProps<span><span>({<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> id: {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> type: [String, <span><span>null<span><span>],<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> required: <span><span>true<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/props.html", "title": "Props | Vue.js", "doc_id": "5c277ec480de43b5bed2c26fa4d7b32e", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 2081, "chunk_index": 93, "_doc_id": "93_3947046202752426589"}}
{"doc_id": "94_1793160921394360438", "text": "class=\"line\"><span> required: <span><span>true<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>})<span><span><code><pre><div><div><div class=\"options-api\"><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> props: {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> id: {<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/props.html", "title": "Props | Vue.js", "doc_id": "5c277ec480de43b5bed2c26fa4d7b32e", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 2081, "chunk_index": 94, "_doc_id": "94_1793160921394360438"}}
{"doc_id": "95_3263729180716651388", "text": "n><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> props: {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> id: {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> type: [String, <span><span>null<span><span>],<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> required: <span><span>true<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span><code><pre><div><div><p>注意如果 <code>type<code> 仅为 <code>null<code> 而非使用数组语法，它将允许任何类型。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/props.html", "title": "Props | Vue.js", "doc_id": "5c277ec480de43b5bed2c26fa4d7b32e", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 2081, "chunk_index": 95, "_doc_id": "95_3263729180716651388"}}
{"doc_id": "96_9175642146163628682", "text": "an>}<span><span><code><pre><div><div><p>注意如果 <code>type<code> 仅为 <code>null<code> 而非使用数组语法，它将允许任何类型。<p><h2 id=\"boolean-casting\">Boolean 类型转换 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#boolean-casting\">​<a><h2><p>为了更贴近原生 boolean attributes 的行为，声明为 <code>Boolean<code> 类型的 props 有特别的类型转换规则。以带有如下声明的 <code><MyComponent><code> 组件为例：<p><div class=\"composition-api\"><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>defineProps<span><span>({<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/props.html", "title": "Props | Vue.js", "doc_id": "5c277ec480de43b5bed2c26fa4d7b32e", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 2081, "chunk_index": 96, "_doc_id": "96_9175642146163628682"}}
{"doc_id": "97_5883624662489543703", "text": "ss=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>defineProps<span><span>({<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> disabled: Boolean<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>})<span><span><code><pre><div><div><div class=\"options-api\"><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> props: {<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/props.html", "title": "Props | Vue.js", "doc_id": "5c277ec480de43b5bed2c26fa4d7b32e", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 2081, "chunk_index": 97, "_doc_id": "97_5883624662489543703"}}
{"doc_id": "98_5588663588887450259", "text": "export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> props: {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> disabled: Boolean<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span><code><pre><div><div><p>该组件可以被这样使用：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><!-- 等同于传入 :disabled=\"true\" --><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/props.html", "title": "Props | Vue.js", "doc_id": "5c277ec480de43b5bed2c26fa4d7b32e", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 2081, "chunk_index": 98, "_doc_id": "98_5588663588887450259"}}
{"doc_id": "99_1271811863950605138", "text": "iki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><!-- 等同于传入 :disabled=\"true\" --><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>MyComponent<span><span> disabled<span><span> /><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><!-- 等同于传入 :disabled=\"false\" --><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/props.html", "title": "Props | Vue.js", "doc_id": "5c277ec480de43b5bed2c26fa4d7b32e", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 2081, "chunk_index": 99, "_doc_id": "99_1271811863950605138"}}
{"doc_id": "100_6841778020582537389", "text": "an>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><!-- 等同于传入 :disabled=\"false\" --><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>MyComponent<span><span> /><span><span><code><pre><div><p>当一个 prop 被声明为允许多种类型时，<code>Boolean<code> 的转换规则也将被应用。然而，当同时允许 <code>String<code> 和 <code>Boolean<code> 时，有一种边缘情况——只有当 <code>Boolean<code> 出现在 <code>String<code> 之前时，<code>Boolean<code> 转换规则才适用：<p><div class=\"composition-api\"><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// disabled 将被转换为 true<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/props.html", "title": "Props | Vue.js", "doc_id": "5c277ec480de43b5bed2c26fa4d7b32e", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 2081, "chunk_index": 100, "_doc_id": "100_6841778020582537389"}}
{"doc_id": "101_1332454273963993026", "text": "class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// disabled 将被转换为 true<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>defineProps<span><span>({<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> disabled: [Boolean, Number]<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>})<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// disabled 将被转换为 true<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>defineProps<span><span>({<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> disabled: [Boolean, String]<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/props.html", "title": "Props | Vue.js", "doc_id": "5c277ec480de43b5bed2c26fa4d7b32e", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 2081, "chunk_index": 101, "_doc_id": "101_1332454273963993026"}}
{"doc_id": "102_673532601203583819", "text": "neProps<span><span>({<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> disabled: [Boolean, String]<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>})<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// disabled 将被转换为 true<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>defineProps<span><span>({<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> disabled: [Number, Boolean]<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>})<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// disabled 将被解析为空字符串 (disabled=\"\")<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/props.html", "title": "Props | Vue.js", "doc_id": "5c277ec480de43b5bed2c26fa4d7b32e", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 2081, "chunk_index": 102, "_doc_id": "102_673532601203583819"}}
{"doc_id": "103_6712520169721565781", "text": "<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// disabled 将被解析为空字符串 (disabled=\"\")<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>defineProps<span><span>({<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> disabled: [String, Boolean]<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>})<span><span><code><pre><div><div><div class=\"options-api\"><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// disabled 将被转换为 true<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/props.html", "title": "Props | Vue.js", "doc_id": "5c277ec480de43b5bed2c26fa4d7b32e", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 2081, "chunk_index": 103, "_doc_id": "103_6712520169721565781"}}
{"doc_id": "104_5173569795872596206", "text": "class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// disabled 将被转换为 true<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> props: {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> disabled: [Boolean, Number]<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// disabled 将被转换为 true<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/props.html", "title": "Props | Vue.js", "doc_id": "5c277ec480de43b5bed2c26fa4d7b32e", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 2081, "chunk_index": 104, "_doc_id": "104_5173569795872596206"}}
{"doc_id": "105_6497465279505256804", "text": "}<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// disabled 将被转换为 true<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> props: {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> disabled: [Boolean, String]<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// disabled 将被转换为 true<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/props.html", "title": "Props | Vue.js", "doc_id": "5c277ec480de43b5bed2c26fa4d7b32e", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 2081, "chunk_index": 105, "_doc_id": "105_6497465279505256804"}}
{"doc_id": "106_4270645465759558697", "text": "}<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// disabled 将被转换为 true<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> props: {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> disabled: [Number, Boolean]<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// disabled 将被解析为空字符串 (disabled=\"\")<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/props.html", "title": "Props | Vue.js", "doc_id": "5c277ec480de43b5bed2c26fa4d7b32e", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 2081, "chunk_index": 106, "_doc_id": "106_4270645465759558697"}}
{"doc_id": "107_7771597026923751434", "text": "<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// disabled 将被解析为空字符串 (disabled=\"\")<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> props: {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> disabled: [String, Boolean]<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span><code><pre><div><div><div><div>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/props.html", "title": "Props | Vue.js", "doc_id": "5c277ec480de43b5bed2c26fa4d7b32e", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 2081, "chunk_index": 107, "_doc_id": "107_7771597026923751434"}}
{"doc_id": "0_5105222090429891315", "text": "<div><div><h1 id=\"fallthrough-attributes\">透传 Attributes <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#fallthrough-attributes\">​<a><h1><blockquote><p>此章节假设你已经看过了<a href=\"/guide/essentials/component-basics.html\">组件基础<a>。若你还不了解组件是什么，请先阅读该章节。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/attrs.html", "title": "透传 Attributes", "doc_id": "3df0d897bf2e4db1bd02b8f741d5ebfc", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 473, "chunk_index": 0, "_doc_id": "0_5105222090429891315"}}
{"doc_id": "1_2271079055195421513", "text": "ckquote><p>此章节假设你已经看过了<a href=\"/guide/essentials/component-basics.html\">组件基础<a>。若你还不了解组件是什么，请先阅读该章节。<p><blockquote><h2 id=\"attribute-inheritance\">Attributes 继承 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#attribute-inheritance\">​<a><h2><p>“透传 attribute”指的是传递给一个组件，却没有被该组件声明为 <a href=\"./props.html\">props<a> 或 <a href=\"./events.html#defining-custom-events\">emits<a> 的 attribute 或者 <code>v-on<code> 事件监听器。最常见的例子就是 <code>class<code>、<code>style<code> 和 <code>id<code>。<p><p>当一个组件以单个元素为根作渲染时，透传的 attribute 会自动被添加到根元素上。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/attrs.html", "title": "透传 Attributes", "doc_id": "3df0d897bf2e4db1bd02b8f741d5ebfc", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 473, "chunk_index": 1, "_doc_id": "1_2271079055195421513"}}
{"doc_id": "2_3312899051460455927", "text": "ode>class<code>、<code>style<code> 和 <code>id<code>。<p><p>当一个组件以单个元素为根作渲染时，透传的 attribute 会自动被添加到根元素上。举例来说，假如我们有一个 <code><MyButton><code> 组件，它的模板长这样：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><!-- <MyButton> 的模板 --><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>button<span><span>>Click Me</<span><span>button<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>一个父组件使用了这个组件，并且传入了 <code>class<code>：<p><div", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/attrs.html", "title": "透传 Attributes", "doc_id": "3df0d897bf2e4db1bd02b8f741d5ebfc", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 473, "chunk_index": 2, "_doc_id": "2_3312899051460455927"}}
{"doc_id": "3_3139694658375780992", "text": "span>button<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>一个父组件使用了这个组件，并且传入了 <code>class<code>：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>MyButton<span><span> class<span><span>=<span><span>\"large\"<span><span> /><span><span><code><pre><div><p>最后渲染出的 DOM 结果是：<p><div class=\"language-html\"> <span class=\"lang\">html<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/attrs.html", "title": "透传 Attributes", "doc_id": "3df0d897bf2e4db1bd02b8f741d5ebfc", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 473, "chunk_index": 3, "_doc_id": "3_3139694658375780992"}}
{"doc_id": "4_8589871266512320090", "text": "ss=\"language-html\"> <span class=\"lang\">html<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>button<span><span> class<span><span>=<span><span>\"large\"<span><span>>Click Me</<span><span>button<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>这里，<code><MyButton><code> 并没有将 <code>class<code> 声明为一个它所接受的 prop，所以 <code>class<code> 被视作透传 attribute，自动透传到了 <code><MyButton><code> 的根元素上。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/attrs.html", "title": "透传 Attributes", "doc_id": "3df0d897bf2e4db1bd02b8f741d5ebfc", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 473, "chunk_index": 4, "_doc_id": "4_8589871266512320090"}}
{"doc_id": "5_8892247353788233203", "text": "lass<code> 声明为一个它所接受的 prop，所以 <code>class<code> 被视作透传 attribute，自动透传到了 <code><MyButton><code> 的根元素上。<p><h3 id=\"class-and-style-merging\">对 <code>class<code> 和 <code>style<code> 的合并 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#class-and-style-merging\">​<a><h3><p>如果一个子组件的根元素已经有了 <code>class<code> 或 <code>style<code> attribute，它会和从父组件上继承的值合并。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/attrs.html", "title": "透传 Attributes", "doc_id": "3df0d897bf2e4db1bd02b8f741d5ebfc", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 473, "chunk_index": 5, "_doc_id": "5_8892247353788233203"}}
{"doc_id": "6_846907709151754657", "text": "-merging\">​<a><h3><p>如果一个子组件的根元素已经有了 <code>class<code> 或 <code>style<code> attribute，它会和从父组件上继承的值合并。如果我们将之前的 <code><MyButton><code> 组件的模板改成这样：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><!-- <MyButton> 的模板 --><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>button<span><span> class<span><span>=<span><span>\"btn\"<span><span>>Click Me</<span><span>button<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>则最后渲染出的 DOM", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/attrs.html", "title": "透传 Attributes", "doc_id": "3df0d897bf2e4db1bd02b8f741d5ebfc", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 473, "chunk_index": 6, "_doc_id": "6_846907709151754657"}}
{"doc_id": "7_8365172332295209131", "text": "tn\"<span><span>>Click Me</<span><span>button<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>则最后渲染出的 DOM 结果会变成：<p><div class=\"language-html\"> <span class=\"lang\">html<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>button<span><span> class<span><span>=<span><span>\"btn large\"<span><span>>Click Me</<span><span>button<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><h3 id=\"v-on-listener-inheritance\"><code>v-on<code> 监听器继承 <a class=\"header-anchor\"", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/attrs.html", "title": "透传 Attributes", "doc_id": "3df0d897bf2e4db1bd02b8f741d5ebfc", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 473, "chunk_index": 7, "_doc_id": "7_8365172332295209131"}}
{"doc_id": "8_6679375095439147088", "text": "><code><pre><div><h3 id=\"v-on-listener-inheritance\"><code>v-on<code> 监听器继承 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#v-on-listener-inheritance\">​<a><h3><p>同样的规则也适用于 <code>v-on<code> 事件监听器：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>MyButton<span><span> @<span><span>click<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>onClick<span><span>\"<span><span> /><span><span><code><pre><div><p><code>click<code> 监听器会被添加到", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/attrs.html", "title": "透传 Attributes", "doc_id": "3df0d897bf2e4db1bd02b8f741d5ebfc", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 473, "chunk_index": 8, "_doc_id": "8_6679375095439147088"}}
{"doc_id": "9_7869079609280438397", "text": "><span>onClick<span><span>\"<span><span> /><span><span><code><pre><div><p><code>click<code> 监听器会被添加到 <code><MyButton><code> 的根元素，即那个原生的 <code><button><code> 元素之上。当原生的 <code><button><code> 被点击，会触发父组件的 <code>onClick<code> 方法。同样的，如果原生 <code>button<code> 元素自身也通过 <code>v-on<code> 绑定了一个事件监听器，则这个监听器和从父组件继承的监听器都会被触发。<p><h3 id=\"nested-component-inheritance\">深层组件继承 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#nested-component-inheritance\">​<a><h3><p>有些情况下一个组件会在根节点上渲染另一个组件。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/attrs.html", "title": "透传 Attributes", "doc_id": "3df0d897bf2e4db1bd02b8f741d5ebfc", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 473, "chunk_index": 9, "_doc_id": "9_7869079609280438397"}}
{"doc_id": "10_6544917143067507986", "text": "件继承 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#nested-component-inheritance\">​<a><h3><p>有些情况下一个组件会在根节点上渲染另一个组件。例如，我们重构一下 <code><MyButton><code>，让它在根节点上渲染 <code><BaseButton><code>：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><!-- <MyButton/> 的模板，只是渲染另一个组件 --><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/attrs.html", "title": "透传 Attributes", "doc_id": "3df0d897bf2e4db1bd02b8f741d5ebfc", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 473, "chunk_index": 10, "_doc_id": "10_6544917143067507986"}}
{"doc_id": "11_3285946623720870267", "text": "github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><!-- <MyButton/> 的模板，只是渲染另一个组件 --><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>BaseButton<span><span> /><span><span><code><pre><div><p>此时 <code><MyButton><code> 接收的透传 attribute 会直接继续传给 <code><BaseButton><code>。<p><p>请注意：<p><ol><li><p>透传的 attribute 不会包含 <code><MyButton><code> 上声明过的 props 或是针对 <code>emits<code> 声明事件的 <code>v-on<code> 侦听函数，换句话说，声明过的 props 和侦听函数被 <code><MyButton><code>“消费”了。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/attrs.html", "title": "透传 Attributes", "doc_id": "3df0d897bf2e4db1bd02b8f741d5ebfc", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 473, "chunk_index": 11, "_doc_id": "11_3285946623720870267"}}
{"doc_id": "12_7307241838565645370", "text": "针对 <code>emits<code> 声明事件的 <code>v-on<code> 侦听函数，换句话说，声明过的 props 和侦听函数被 <code><MyButton><code>“消费”了。<p><li><li><p>透传的 attribute 若符合声明，也可以作为 props 传入 <code><BaseButton><code>。<p><li><ol><h2 id=\"disabling-attribute-inheritance\">禁用 Attributes 继承 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#disabling-attribute-inheritance\">​<a><h2><p>如果你<strong>不想要<strong>一个组件自动地继承 attribute，你可以在组件选项中设置 <code>inheritAttrs: false<code>。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/attrs.html", "title": "透传 Attributes", "doc_id": "3df0d897bf2e4db1bd02b8f741d5ebfc", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 473, "chunk_index": 12, "_doc_id": "12_7307241838565645370"}}
{"doc_id": "13_8064180446144372461", "text": "e\">​<a><h2><p>如果你<strong>不想要<strong>一个组件自动地继承 attribute，你可以在组件选项中设置 <code>inheritAttrs: false<code>。<p><div class=\"composition-api\"><p>从 3.3 开始你也可以直接在 <code><script setup><code> 中使用 <a href=\"/api/sfc-script-setup.html#defineoptions\"><code>defineOptions<code><a>：<p><div class=\"language-vue\"> <span class=\"lang\">vue<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>script<span><span> setup<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/attrs.html", "title": "透传 Attributes", "doc_id": "3df0d897bf2e4db1bd02b8f741d5ebfc", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 473, "chunk_index": 13, "_doc_id": "13_8064180446144372461"}}
{"doc_id": "14_7132622456940786187", "text": "code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>script<span><span> setup<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>defineOptions<span><span>({<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> inheritAttrs: <span><span>false<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>})<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// ...setup 逻辑<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>script<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><div><p>最常见的需要禁用 attribute 继承的场景就是 attribute 需要应用在根节点以外的其他元素上。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/attrs.html", "title": "透传 Attributes", "doc_id": "3df0d897bf2e4db1bd02b8f741d5ebfc", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 473, "chunk_index": 14, "_doc_id": "14_7132622456940786187"}}
{"doc_id": "15_3253789116062425570", "text": "an><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><div><p>最常见的需要禁用 attribute 继承的场景就是 attribute 需要应用在根节点以外的其他元素上。通过设置 <code>inheritAttrs<code> 选项为 <code>false<code>，你可以完全控制透传进来的 attribute 被如何使用。<p><p>这些透传进来的 attribute 可以在模板的表达式中直接用 <code>$attrs<code> 访问到。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/attrs.html", "title": "透传 Attributes", "doc_id": "3df0d897bf2e4db1bd02b8f741d5ebfc", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 473, "chunk_index": 15, "_doc_id": "15_3253789116062425570"}}
{"doc_id": "16_4764713083967151516", "text": "lse<code>，你可以完全控制透传进来的 attribute 被如何使用。<p><p>这些透传进来的 attribute 可以在模板的表达式中直接用 <code>$attrs<code> 访问到。<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>span<span><span>>Fallthrough attribute: {{ $attrs }}</<span><span>span<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>这个 <code>$attrs<code> 对象包含了除组件所声明的 <code>props<code> 和 <code>emits<code> 之外的所有其他 attribute，例如 <code>class<code>，<code>style<code>，<code>v-on<code> 监听器等等。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/attrs.html", "title": "透传 Attributes", "doc_id": "3df0d897bf2e4db1bd02b8f741d5ebfc", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 473, "chunk_index": 16, "_doc_id": "16_4764713083967151516"}}
{"doc_id": "17_3360365578102973291", "text": "和 <code>emits<code> 之外的所有其他 attribute，例如 <code>class<code>，<code>style<code>，<code>v-on<code> 监听器等等。<p><p>有几点需要注意：<p><p>现在我们要再次使用一下<a href=\"#attribute-inheritance\">之前小节<a>中的 <code><MyButton><code> 组件例子。有时候我们可能为了样式，需要在 <code><button><code> 元素外包装一层 <code><div><code>：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>div<span><span> class<span><span>=<span><span>\"btn-wrapper\"<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/attrs.html", "title": "透传 Attributes", "doc_id": "3df0d897bf2e4db1bd02b8f741d5ebfc", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 473, "chunk_index": 17, "_doc_id": "17_3360365578102973291"}}
{"doc_id": "18_1605757601373366819", "text": "n><<span><span>div<span><span> class<span><span>=<span><span>\"btn-wrapper\"<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>button<span><span> class<span><span>=<span><span>\"btn\"<span><span>>Click Me</<span><span>button<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>div<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>我们想要所有像 <code>class<code> 和 <code>v-on<code> 监听器这样的透传 attribute 都应用在内部的 <code><button><code> 上而不是外层的 <code><div><code> 上。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/attrs.html", "title": "透传 Attributes", "doc_id": "3df0d897bf2e4db1bd02b8f741d5ebfc", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 473, "chunk_index": 18, "_doc_id": "18_1605757601373366819"}}
{"doc_id": "19_4035997978356348706", "text": "ode> 和 <code>v-on<code> 监听器这样的透传 attribute 都应用在内部的 <code><button><code> 上而不是外层的 <code><div><code> 上。我们可以通过设定 <code>inheritAttrs: false<code> 和使用 <code>v-bind=\"$attrs\"<code> 来实现：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>div<span><span> class<span><span>=<span><span>\"btn-wrapper\"<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/attrs.html", "title": "透传 Attributes", "doc_id": "3df0d897bf2e4db1bd02b8f741d5ebfc", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 473, "chunk_index": 19, "_doc_id": "19_4035997978356348706"}}
{"doc_id": "20_6918965250354788266", "text": "n><<span><span>div<span><span> class<span><span>=<span><span>\"btn-wrapper\"<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line highlighted\"><span> <<span><span>button<span><span> class<span><span>=<span><span>\"btn\"<span><span> v-bind<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>$attrs<span><span>\"<span><span>>Click Me</<span><span>button<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/attrs.html", "title": "透传 Attributes", "doc_id": "3df0d897bf2e4db1bd02b8f741d5ebfc", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 473, "chunk_index": 20, "_doc_id": "20_6918965250354788266"}}
{"doc_id": "21_1733263252071480182", "text": ">\"<span><span>$attrs<span><span>\"<span><span>>Click Me</<span><span>button<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>div<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>小提示：<a href=\"/guide/essentials/template-syntax.html#dynamically-binding-multiple-attributes\">没有参数的 <code>v-bind<code><a> 会将一个对象的所有属性都作为 attribute 应用到目标元素上。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/attrs.html", "title": "透传 Attributes", "doc_id": "3df0d897bf2e4db1bd02b8f741d5ebfc", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 473, "chunk_index": 21, "_doc_id": "21_1733263252071480182"}}
{"doc_id": "22_5589928958333438088", "text": "amically-binding-multiple-attributes\">没有参数的 <code>v-bind<code><a> 会将一个对象的所有属性都作为 attribute 应用到目标元素上。<p><h2 id=\"attribute-inheritance-on-multiple-root-nodes\">多根节点的 Attributes 继承 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#attribute-inheritance-on-multiple-root-nodes\">​<a><h2><p>和单根节点组件有所不同，有着多个根节点的组件没有自动 attribute 透传行为。如果 <code>$attrs<code> 没有被显式绑定，将会抛出一个运行时警告。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/attrs.html", "title": "透传 Attributes", "doc_id": "3df0d897bf2e4db1bd02b8f741d5ebfc", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 473, "chunk_index": 22, "_doc_id": "22_5589928958333438088"}}
{"doc_id": "23_3119916824940215524", "text": "des\">​<a><h2><p>和单根节点组件有所不同，有着多个根节点的组件没有自动 attribute 透传行为。如果 <code>$attrs<code> 没有被显式绑定，将会抛出一个运行时警告。<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>CustomLayout<span><span> id<span><span>=<span><span>\"custom-layout\"<span><span> @<span><span>click<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>changeValue<span><span>\"<span><span> /><span><span><code><pre><div><p>如果 <code><CustomLayout><code> 有下面这样的多根节点模板，由于 Vue 不知道要将 attribute 透传到哪里，所以会抛出一个警告。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/attrs.html", "title": "透传 Attributes", "doc_id": "3df0d897bf2e4db1bd02b8f741d5ebfc", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 473, "chunk_index": 23, "_doc_id": "23_3119916824940215524"}}
{"doc_id": "24_2727602922100039867", "text": "code><pre><div><p>如果 <code><CustomLayout><code> 有下面这样的多根节点模板，由于 Vue 不知道要将 attribute 透传到哪里，所以会抛出一个警告。<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>header<span><span>>...</<span><span>header<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>main<span><span>>...</<span><span>main<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/attrs.html", "title": "透传 Attributes", "doc_id": "3df0d897bf2e4db1bd02b8f741d5ebfc", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 473, "chunk_index": 24, "_doc_id": "24_2727602922100039867"}}
{"doc_id": "25_1277687099501042579", "text": "pan class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>main<span><span>>...</<span><span>main<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>footer<span><span>>...</<span><span>footer<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>如果 <code>$attrs<code> 被显式绑定，则不会有警告：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>header<span><span>>...</<span><span>header<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/attrs.html", "title": "透传 Attributes", "doc_id": "3df0d897bf2e4db1bd02b8f741d5ebfc", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 473, "chunk_index": 25, "_doc_id": "25_1277687099501042579"}}
{"doc_id": "26_478576025250697038", "text": "class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>header<span><span>>...</<span><span>header<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line highlighted\"><span><<span><span>main<span><span> v-bind<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>$attrs<span><span>\"<span><span>>...</<span><span>main<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/attrs.html", "title": "透传 Attributes", "doc_id": "3df0d897bf2e4db1bd02b8f741d5ebfc", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 473, "chunk_index": 26, "_doc_id": "26_478576025250697038"}}
{"doc_id": "27_1310929412612030375", "text": "n><span>\"<span><span>$attrs<span><span>\"<span><span>>...</<span><span>main<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>footer<span><span>>...</<span><span>footer<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><h2 id=\"accessing-fallthrough-attributes-in-javascript\">在 JavaScript 中访问透传 Attributes <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#accessing-fallthrough-attributes-in-javascript\">​<a><h2><div class=\"composition-api\"><p>如果需要，", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/attrs.html", "title": "透传 Attributes", "doc_id": "3df0d897bf2e4db1bd02b8f741d5ebfc", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 473, "chunk_index": 27, "_doc_id": "27_1310929412612030375"}}
{"doc_id": "28_2375766932655020739", "text": "href=\"#accessing-fallthrough-attributes-in-javascript\">​<a><h2><div class=\"composition-api\"><p>如果需要，你可以在 <code><script setup><code> 中使用 <code>useAttrs()<code> API 来访问一个组件的所有透传 attribute：<p><div class=\"language-vue\"> <span class=\"lang\">vue<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>script<span><span> setup<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>import<span><span> { useAttrs } <span><span>from<span><span> 'vue'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/attrs.html", "title": "透传 Attributes", "doc_id": "3df0d897bf2e4db1bd02b8f741d5ebfc", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 473, "chunk_index": 28, "_doc_id": "28_2375766932655020739"}}
{"doc_id": "29_3902334199975340889", "text": "t<span><span> { useAttrs } <span><span>from<span><span> 'vue'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> attrs<span><span> =<span><span> useAttrs<span><span>()<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/attrs.html", "title": "透传 Attributes", "doc_id": "3df0d897bf2e4db1bd02b8f741d5ebfc", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 473, "chunk_index": 29, "_doc_id": "29_3902334199975340889"}}
{"doc_id": "30_2669635146763188430", "text": "s=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> attrs<span><span> =<span><span> useAttrs<span><span>()<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>script<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>如果没有使用 <code><script setup><code>，<code>attrs<code> 会作为 <code>setup()<code> 上下文对象的一个属性暴露：<p><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/attrs.html", "title": "透传 Attributes", "doc_id": "3df0d897bf2e4db1bd02b8f741d5ebfc", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 473, "chunk_index": 30, "_doc_id": "30_2669635146763188430"}}
{"doc_id": "31_7275232369446233633", "text": "b-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> setup<span><span>(<span><span>props<span><span>, <span><span>ctx<span><span>) {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 透传 attribute 被暴露为 ctx.attrs<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> console.<span><span>log<span><span>(ctx.attrs)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/attrs.html", "title": "透传 Attributes", "doc_id": "3df0d897bf2e4db1bd02b8f741d5ebfc", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 473, "chunk_index": 31, "_doc_id": "31_7275232369446233633"}}
{"doc_id": "32_5803736118797366", "text": "console.<span><span>log<span><span>(ctx.attrs)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span><code><pre><div><p>需要注意的是，虽然这里的 <code>attrs<code> 对象总是反映为最新的透传 attribute，但它并不是响应式的 (考虑到性能因素)。你不能通过侦听器去监听它的变化。如果你需要响应性，可以使用 prop。或者你也可以使用 <code>onUpdated()<code> 使得在每次更新时结合最新的 <code>attrs<code> 执行副作用。<p><div><div class=\"options-api\"><p>如果需要，你可以通过 <code>$attrs<code> 这个实例属性来访问组件的所有透传 attribute：<p><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/attrs.html", "title": "透传 Attributes", "doc_id": "3df0d897bf2e4db1bd02b8f741d5ebfc", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 473, "chunk_index": 32, "_doc_id": "32_5803736118797366"}}
{"doc_id": "33_5152623560546120179", "text": "b-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> created<span><span>() {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> console.<span><span>log<span><span>(<span><span>this<span><span>.$attrs)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span><code><pre><div><div><div><div>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/attrs.html", "title": "透传 Attributes", "doc_id": "3df0d897bf2e4db1bd02b8f741d5ebfc", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 473, "chunk_index": 33, "_doc_id": "33_5152623560546120179"}}
{"doc_id": "0_4514014591718619665", "text": "<div><div><h1 id=\"transitiongroup\">TransitionGroup <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#transitiongroup\">​<a><h1><p><code><TransitionGroup><code> 是一个内置组件，用于对 <code>v-for<code> 列表中的元素或组件的插入、移除和顺序改变添加动画效果。<p><h2 id=\"differences-from-transition\">和 <code><Transition><code> 的区别 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#differences-from-transition\">​<a><h2><p><code><TransitionGroup><code> 支持和 <code><Transition><code> 基本相同的 props、CSS 过渡 class 和 JavaScript 钩子监听器，但有以下几点区别：<p><ul><li><p>默认情况下，它不会渲染一个容器元素。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/transition-group.html", "title": "TransitionGroup | Vue.js", "doc_id": "c35292aa6c14432ab975fe99f36f84b7", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 306, "chunk_index": 0, "_doc_id": "0_4514014591718619665"}}
{"doc_id": "1_2400070267131954004", "text": "nsition><code> 基本相同的 props、CSS 过渡 class 和 JavaScript 钩子监听器，但有以下几点区别：<p><ul><li><p>默认情况下，它不会渲染一个容器元素。但你可以通过传入 <code>tag<code> prop 来指定一个元素作为容器元素来渲染。<p><li><li><p><a href=\"./transition.html#transition-modes\">过渡模式<a>在这里不可用，因为我们不再是在互斥的元素之间进行切换。<p><li><li><p>列表中的每个元素都<strong>必须<strong>有一个独一无二的 <code>key<code> attribute。<p><li><li><p>CSS 过渡 class 会被应用在列表内的元素上，<strong>而不是<strong>容器元素上。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/transition-group.html", "title": "TransitionGroup | Vue.js", "doc_id": "c35292aa6c14432ab975fe99f36f84b7", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 306, "chunk_index": 1, "_doc_id": "1_2400070267131954004"}}
{"doc_id": "2_6904266375694332298", "text": "有一个独一无二的 <code>key<code> attribute。<p><li><li><p>CSS 过渡 class 会被应用在列表内的元素上，<strong>而不是<strong>容器元素上。<p><li><ul><div class=\"tip custom-block\"><p class=\"custom-block-title\">TIP<p><p>当在 <a href=\"/guide/essentials/component-basics.html#in-dom-template-parsing-caveats\">DOM 内模板<a>中使用时，组件名需要写为 <code><transition-group><code>。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/transition-group.html", "title": "TransitionGroup | Vue.js", "doc_id": "c35292aa6c14432ab975fe99f36f84b7", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 306, "chunk_index": 2, "_doc_id": "2_6904266375694332298"}}
{"doc_id": "3_4486852926042184865", "text": "-basics.html#in-dom-template-parsing-caveats\">DOM 内模板<a>中使用时，组件名需要写为 <code><transition-group><code>。<p><div><h2 id=\"enter-leave-transitions\">进入 / 离开动画 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#enter-leave-transitions\">​<a><h2><p>这里是 <code><TransitionGroup><code> 对一个 <code>v-for<code> 列表添加进入 / 离开动画的示例：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>TransitionGroup<span><span> name<span><span>=<span><span>\"list\"<span><span> tag<span><span>=<span><span>\"ul\"<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/transition-group.html", "title": "TransitionGroup | Vue.js", "doc_id": "c35292aa6c14432ab975fe99f36f84b7", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 306, "chunk_index": 3, "_doc_id": "3_4486852926042184865"}}
{"doc_id": "4_6057197341509128545", "text": "pan><span>=<span><span>\"list\"<span><span> tag<span><span>=<span><span>\"ul\"<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>li<span><span> v-for<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>item <span><span>in<span><span> items<span><span>\"<span><span> :<span><span>key<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>item<span><span>\"<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> {{ item }}<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> </<span><span>li<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/transition-group.html", "title": "TransitionGroup | Vue.js", "doc_id": "c35292aa6c14432ab975fe99f36f84b7", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 306, "chunk_index": 4, "_doc_id": "4_6057197341509128545"}}
{"doc_id": "5_7408484230846532430", "text": "\"><span> {{ item }}<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> </<span><span>li<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>TransitionGroup<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><div class=\"language-css\"> <span class=\"lang\">css<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>.list-enter-active<span><span>,<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>.list-leave-active<span><span> {<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/transition-group.html", "title": "TransitionGroup | Vue.js", "doc_id": "c35292aa6c14432ab975fe99f36f84b7", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 306, "chunk_index": 5, "_doc_id": "5_7408484230846532430"}}
{"doc_id": "6_7934826525312403997", "text": "tive<span><span>,<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>.list-leave-active<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> transition<span><span>: <span><span>all<span><span> 0.5<span><span>s<span><span> ease<span><span>;<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>.list-enter-from<span><span>,<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>.list-leave-to<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> opacity<span><span>: <span><span>0<span><span>;<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/transition-group.html", "title": "TransitionGroup | Vue.js", "doc_id": "c35292aa6c14432ab975fe99f36f84b7", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 306, "chunk_index": 6, "_doc_id": "6_7934826525312403997"}}
{"doc_id": "7_1855543228609076189", "text": "{<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> opacity<span><span>: <span><span>0<span><span>;<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> transform<span><span>: <span><span>translateX<span><span>(<span><span>30<span><span>px<span><span>);<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/transition-group.html", "title": "TransitionGroup | Vue.js", "doc_id": "c35292aa6c14432ab975fe99f36f84b7", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 306, "chunk_index": 7, "_doc_id": "7_1855543228609076189"}}
{"doc_id": "8_5273630262158899686", "text": "n><span>: <span><span>translateX<span><span>(<span><span>30<span><span>px<span><span>);<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span><code><pre><div><h2 id=\"move-transitions\">移动动画 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#move-transitions\">​<a><h2><p>上面的示例有一些明显的缺陷：当某一项被插入或移除时，它周围的元素会立即发生“跳跃”而不是平稳地移动。我们可以通过添加一些额外的 CSS 规则来解决这个问题：<p><div class=\"language-css\"> <span class=\"lang\">css<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line highlighted\"><span>.list-move<span><span>, <span><span>/* 对移动中的元素应用的过渡 */<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/transition-group.html", "title": "TransitionGroup | Vue.js", "doc_id": "c35292aa6c14432ab975fe99f36f84b7", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 306, "chunk_index": 8, "_doc_id": "8_5273630262158899686"}}
{"doc_id": "9_2785081120684608117", "text": "n class=\"line highlighted\"><span>.list-move<span><span>, <span><span>/* 对移动中的元素应用的过渡 */<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>.list-enter-active<span><span>,<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>.list-leave-active<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> transition<span><span>: <span><span>all<span><span> 0.5<span><span>s<span><span> ease<span><span>;<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>.list-enter-from<span><span>,<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/transition-group.html", "title": "TransitionGroup | Vue.js", "doc_id": "c35292aa6c14432ab975fe99f36f84b7", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 306, "chunk_index": 9, "_doc_id": "9_2785081120684608117"}}
{"doc_id": "10_8531640093077522828", "text": "<span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>.list-enter-from<span><span>,<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>.list-leave-to<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> opacity<span><span>: <span><span>0<span><span>;<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> transform<span><span>: <span><span>translateX<span><span>(<span><span>30<span><span>px<span><span>);<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/transition-group.html", "title": "TransitionGroup | Vue.js", "doc_id": "c35292aa6c14432ab975fe99f36f84b7", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 306, "chunk_index": 10, "_doc_id": "10_8531640093077522828"}}
{"doc_id": "11_2770781496471757691", "text": "<span>px<span><span>);<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line highlighted\"><span>/* 确保将离开的元素从布局流中删除<span><span>\n<span class=\"line highlighted\"><span> 以便能够正确地计算移动的动画。 */<span><span>\n<span class=\"line highlighted\"><span>.list-leave-active<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line highlighted\"><span> position<span><span>: <span><span>absolute<span><span>;<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/transition-group.html", "title": "TransitionGroup | Vue.js", "doc_id": "c35292aa6c14432ab975fe99f36f84b7", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 306, "chunk_index": 11, "_doc_id": "11_2770781496471757691"}}
{"doc_id": "12_2430353585370365797", "text": "class=\"line highlighted\"><span> position<span><span>: <span><span>absolute<span><span>;<span><span>\n<span class=\"line highlighted\"><span>}<span><span><code><pre><div><p>现在它看起来好多了，甚至对整个列表执行洗牌的动画也都非常流畅：<p><p><a href=\"/examples/#list-transition\">完整的示例<a><p><h3 id=\"custom-transitiongroup-classes\">自定义过渡组 class <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#custom-transitiongroup-classes\">​<a><h3><p>你还可以通过向 <code><TransitionGroup><code> 传递 <code>moveClass<code> prop 为移动元素指定自定义过渡 class，类似于<a href=\"/guide/built-ins/transition.html#custom-transition-classes\">自定义过渡 class<a>。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/transition-group.html", "title": "TransitionGroup | Vue.js", "doc_id": "c35292aa6c14432ab975fe99f36f84b7", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 306, "chunk_index": 12, "_doc_id": "12_2430353585370365797"}}
{"doc_id": "13_3206638181786586874", "text": "定自定义过渡 class，类似于<a href=\"/guide/built-ins/transition.html#custom-transition-classes\">自定义过渡 class<a>。<p><h2 id=\"staggering-list-transitions\">渐进延迟列表动画 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#staggering-list-transitions\">​<a><h2><p>通过在 JavaScript 钩子中读取元素的 data attribute，我们可以实现带渐进延迟的列表动画。首先，我们把每一个元素的索引渲染为该元素上的一个 data attribute：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>TransitionGroup<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/transition-group.html", "title": "TransitionGroup | Vue.js", "doc_id": "c35292aa6c14432ab975fe99f36f84b7", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 306, "chunk_index": 13, "_doc_id": "13_3206638181786586874"}}
{"doc_id": "14_3305835891848157904", "text": "\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>TransitionGroup<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> tag<span><span>=<span><span>\"ul\"<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> :<span><span>css<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>false<span><span>\"<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> @<span><span>before-enter<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>onBeforeEnter<span><span>\"<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/transition-group.html", "title": "TransitionGroup | Vue.js", "doc_id": "c35292aa6c14432ab975fe99f36f84b7", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 306, "chunk_index": 14, "_doc_id": "14_3305835891848157904"}}
{"doc_id": "15_4899801130297471545", "text": "span><span>before-enter<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>onBeforeEnter<span><span>\"<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> @<span><span>enter<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>onEnter<span><span>\"<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> @<span><span>leave<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>onLeave<span><span>\"<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>li<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/transition-group.html", "title": "TransitionGroup | Vue.js", "doc_id": "c35292aa6c14432ab975fe99f36f84b7", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 306, "chunk_index": 15, "_doc_id": "15_4899801130297471545"}}
{"doc_id": "16_7400260294152264680", "text": "<span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>li<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> v-for<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>(item, index) <span><span>in<span><span> computedList<span><span>\"<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> :<span><span>key<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>item.msg<span><span>\"<span><span>\n<span class=\"line highlighted\"><span> :<span><span>data-index<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>index<span><span>\"<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/transition-group.html", "title": "TransitionGroup | Vue.js", "doc_id": "c35292aa6c14432ab975fe99f36f84b7", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 306, "chunk_index": 16, "_doc_id": "16_7400260294152264680"}}
{"doc_id": "17_3642384476877518193", "text": "><span> :<span><span>data-index<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>index<span><span>\"<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> ><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> {{ item.msg }}<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> </<span><span>li<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/transition-group.html", "title": "TransitionGroup | Vue.js", "doc_id": "c35292aa6c14432ab975fe99f36f84b7", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 306, "chunk_index": 17, "_doc_id": "17_3642384476877518193"}}
{"doc_id": "18_5170250745508780354", "text": "pan> {{ item.msg }}<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> </<span><span>li<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>TransitionGroup<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>接着，在 JavaScript 钩子中，我们基于当前元素的 data attribute 对该元素的进场动画添加一个延迟。以下是一个基于 <a href=\"https://gsap.com/\" target=\"_blank\">GSAP library<a> 的动画示例：<p><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>function<span><span> onEnter<span><span>(<span><span>el<span><span>, <span><span>done<span><span>) {<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/transition-group.html", "title": "TransitionGroup | Vue.js", "doc_id": "c35292aa6c14432ab975fe99f36f84b7", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 306, "chunk_index": 18, "_doc_id": "18_5170250745508780354"}}
{"doc_id": "19_5018598575436779432", "text": "><span> onEnter<span><span>(<span><span>el<span><span>, <span><span>done<span><span>) {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> gsap.<span><span>to<span><span>(el, {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> opacity: <span><span>1<span><span>,<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> height: <span><span>'1.6em'<span><span>,<span><span>\n<span class=\"line highlighted\"><span> delay: el.dataset.index <span><span>*<span><span> 0.15<span><span>,<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> onComplete: done<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/transition-group.html", "title": "TransitionGroup | Vue.js", "doc_id": "c35292aa6c14432ab975fe99f36f84b7", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 306, "chunk_index": 19, "_doc_id": "19_5018598575436779432"}}
{"doc_id": "20_4493975790337992471", "text": ">*<span><span> 0.15<span><span>,<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> onComplete: done<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> })<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span><code><pre><div>\n<p><strong>参考<strong><p><div><div>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/transition-group.html", "title": "TransitionGroup | Vue.js", "doc_id": "c35292aa6c14432ab975fe99f36f84b7", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 306, "chunk_index": 20, "_doc_id": "20_4493975790337992471"}}
{"doc_id": "0_2612167172246208728", "text": "<div><div><h1 id=\"slots\">插槽 Slots <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#slots\">​<a><h1><blockquote><p>此章节假设你已经看过了<a href=\"/guide/essentials/component-basics.html\">组件基础<a>。若你还不了解组件是什么，请先阅读该章节。<p><blockquote><h2 id=\"slot-content-and-outlet\">插槽内容与出口 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#slot-content-and-outlet\">​<a><h2><p>在之前的章节中，我们已经了解到组件能够接收任意类型的 JavaScript 值作为 props，但组件要如何接收模板内容呢？在某些场景中，我们可能想要为子组件传递一些模板片段，让子组件在它们的组件中渲染这些片段。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/slots.html", "title": "插槽 Slots", "doc_id": "3bb48a64a0a34d1d908914c5a169e041", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1189, "chunk_index": 0, "_doc_id": "0_2612167172246208728"}}
{"doc_id": "1_1820952586860339980", "text": "中，我们已经了解到组件能够接收任意类型的 JavaScript 值作为 props，但组件要如何接收模板内容呢？在某些场景中，我们可能想要为子组件传递一些模板片段，让子组件在它们的组件中渲染这些片段。<p><p>举例来说，这里有一个 <code><FancyButton><code> 组件，可以像这样使用：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>FancyButton<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line highlighted\"><span> Click me! <span><span><!-- 插槽内容 --><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/slots.html", "title": "插槽 Slots", "doc_id": "3bb48a64a0a34d1d908914c5a169e041", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1189, "chunk_index": 1, "_doc_id": "1_1820952586860339980"}}
{"doc_id": "2_5082987607370797357", "text": "><span><span>\n<span class=\"line highlighted\"><span> Click me! <span><span><!-- 插槽内容 --><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>FancyButton<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>而 <code><FancyButton><code> 的模板是这样的：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>button<span><span> class<span><span>=<span><span>\"fancy-btn\"<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/slots.html", "title": "插槽 Slots", "doc_id": "3bb48a64a0a34d1d908914c5a169e041", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1189, "chunk_index": 2, "_doc_id": "2_5082987607370797357"}}
{"doc_id": "3_3057525729266976668", "text": "><<span><span>button<span><span> class<span><span>=<span><span>\"fancy-btn\"<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line highlighted\"><span> <<span><span>slot<span><span>></<span><span>slot<span><span>> <span><span><!-- 插槽出口 --><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>button<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p><code><slot><code> 元素是一个<strong>插槽出口<strong> (slot outlet)，标示了父元素提供的<strong>插槽内容<strong> (slot content) 将在哪里被渲染。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/slots.html", "title": "插槽 Slots", "doc_id": "3bb48a64a0a34d1d908914c5a169e041", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1189, "chunk_index": 3, "_doc_id": "3_3057525729266976668"}}
{"doc_id": "4_7256300376872166431", "text": "<code> 元素是一个<strong>插槽出口<strong> (slot outlet)，标示了父元素提供的<strong>插槽内容<strong> (slot content) 将在哪里被渲染。<p><p> <p><p>最终渲染出的 DOM 是这样：<p><div class=\"language-html\"> <span class=\"lang\">html<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>button<span><span> class<span><span>=<span><span>\"fancy-btn\"<span><span>>Click me!</<span><span>button<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>通过使用插槽，<code><FancyButton><code> 仅负责渲染外层的 <code><button><code> (以及相应的样式)，而其内部的内容由父组件提供。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/slots.html", "title": "插槽 Slots", "doc_id": "3bb48a64a0a34d1d908914c5a169e041", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1189, "chunk_index": 4, "_doc_id": "4_7256300376872166431"}}
{"doc_id": "5_4662270320587612061", "text": "<pre><div><p>通过使用插槽，<code><FancyButton><code> 仅负责渲染外层的 <code><button><code> (以及相应的样式)，而其内部的内容由父组件提供。<p><p>理解插槽的另一种方式是和下面的 JavaScript 函数作类比，其概念是类似的：<p><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// 父元素传入插槽内容<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>FancyButton<span><span>(<span><span>'Click me!'<span><span>)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// FancyButton 在自己的模板中渲染插槽内容<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/slots.html", "title": "插槽 Slots", "doc_id": "3bb48a64a0a34d1d908914c5a169e041", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1189, "chunk_index": 5, "_doc_id": "5_4662270320587612061"}}
{"doc_id": "6_441024895909192690", "text": "><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// FancyButton 在自己的模板中渲染插槽内容<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>function<span><span> FancyButton<span><span>(<span><span>slotContent<span><span>) {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> return<span><span> `<button class=\"fancy-btn\"><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> ${<span><span>slotContent<span><span>}<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> </button>`<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/slots.html", "title": "插槽 Slots", "doc_id": "3bb48a64a0a34d1d908914c5a169e041", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1189, "chunk_index": 6, "_doc_id": "6_441024895909192690"}}
{"doc_id": "7_2521013449603793169", "text": "${<span><span>slotContent<span><span>}<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> </button>`<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span><code><pre><div><p>插槽内容可以是任意合法的模板内容，不局限于文本。例如我们可以传入多个元素，甚至是组件：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>FancyButton<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/slots.html", "title": "插槽 Slots", "doc_id": "3bb48a64a0a34d1d908914c5a169e041", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1189, "chunk_index": 7, "_doc_id": "7_2521013449603793169"}}
{"doc_id": "8_8463249108659257948", "text": "thub-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>FancyButton<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>span<span><span> style<span><span>=<span><span>\"color:red\"<span><span>>Click me!</<span><span>span<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>AwesomeIcon<span><span> name<span><span>=<span><span>\"plus\"<span><span> /><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/slots.html", "title": "插槽 Slots", "doc_id": "3bb48a64a0a34d1d908914c5a169e041", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1189, "chunk_index": 8, "_doc_id": "8_8463249108659257948"}}
{"doc_id": "9_5047478743245750948", "text": "<<span><span>AwesomeIcon<span><span> name<span><span>=<span><span>\"plus\"<span><span> /><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>FancyButton<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>通过使用插槽，<code><FancyButton><code> 组件更加灵活和具有可复用性。现在组件可以用在不同的地方渲染各异的内容，但同时还保证都具有相同的样式。<p><p>Vue 组件的插槽机制是受<a href=\"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/HTML/Element/slot\" target=\"_blank\">原生 Web Component <code><slot><code> 元素<a>的启发而诞生，同时还做了一些功能拓展，这些拓展的功能我们后面会学习到。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/slots.html", "title": "插槽 Slots", "doc_id": "3bb48a64a0a34d1d908914c5a169e041", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1189, "chunk_index": 9, "_doc_id": "9_5047478743245750948"}}
{"doc_id": "10_8218686546726675249", "text": "t/slot\" target=\"_blank\">原生 Web Component <code><slot><code> 元素<a>的启发而诞生，同时还做了一些功能拓展，这些拓展的功能我们后面会学习到。<p><h2 id=\"render-scope\">渲染作用域 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#render-scope\">​<a><h2><p>插槽内容可以访问到父组件的数据作用域，因为插槽内容本身是在父组件模板中定义的。举例来说：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>span<span><span>>{{ message }}</<span><span>span<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/slots.html", "title": "插槽 Slots", "doc_id": "3bb48a64a0a34d1d908914c5a169e041", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1189, "chunk_index": 10, "_doc_id": "10_8218686546726675249"}}
{"doc_id": "11_3772340381748381098", "text": "\"line\"><span><<span><span>span<span><span>>{{ message }}</<span><span>span<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>FancyButton<span><span>>{{ message }}</<span><span>FancyButton<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>这里的两个 <span><code>{{ message }}<code><span> 插值表达式渲染的内容都是一样的。<p><p>插槽内容<strong>无法访问<strong>子组件的数据。Vue 模板中的表达式只能访问其定义时所处的作用域，这和 JavaScript 的词法作用域规则是一致的。换言之：<p><blockquote><p>父组件模板中的表达式只能访问父组件的作用域；子组件模板中的表达式只能访问子组件的作用域。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/slots.html", "title": "插槽 Slots", "doc_id": "3bb48a64a0a34d1d908914c5a169e041", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1189, "chunk_index": 11, "_doc_id": "11_3772340381748381098"}}
{"doc_id": "12_2617403192001882382", "text": "所处的作用域，这和 JavaScript 的词法作用域规则是一致的。换言之：<p><blockquote><p>父组件模板中的表达式只能访问父组件的作用域；子组件模板中的表达式只能访问子组件的作用域。<p><blockquote><h2 id=\"fallback-content\">默认内容 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#fallback-content\">​<a><h2><p>在外部没有提供任何内容的情况下，可以为插槽指定默认内容。比如有这样一个 <code><SubmitButton><code> 组件：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>button<span><span> type<span><span>=<span><span>\"submit\"<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/slots.html", "title": "插槽 Slots", "doc_id": "3bb48a64a0a34d1d908914c5a169e041", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1189, "chunk_index": 12, "_doc_id": "12_2617403192001882382"}}
{"doc_id": "13_4691609522296481674", "text": "span><<span><span>button<span><span> type<span><span>=<span><span>\"submit\"<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>slot<span><span>></<span><span>slot<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/slots.html", "title": "插槽 Slots", "doc_id": "3bb48a64a0a34d1d908914c5a169e041", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1189, "chunk_index": 13, "_doc_id": "13_4691609522296481674"}}
{"doc_id": "14_4451867424968246545", "text": "<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>slot<span><span>></<span><span>slot<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>button<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>如果我们想在父组件没有提供任何插槽内容时在 <code><button><code> 内渲染“Submit”，只需要将“Submit”写在 <code><slot><code> 标签之间来作为默认内容：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>button<span><span> type<span><span>=<span><span>\"submit\"<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/slots.html", "title": "插槽 Slots", "doc_id": "3bb48a64a0a34d1d908914c5a169e041", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1189, "chunk_index": 14, "_doc_id": "14_4451867424968246545"}}
{"doc_id": "15_5508565170476550040", "text": "span><<span><span>button<span><span> type<span><span>=<span><span>\"submit\"<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>slot<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line highlighted\"><span> Submit <span><span><!-- 默认内容 --><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> </<span><span>slot<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>button<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>现在，当我们在父组件中使用 <code><SubmitButton><code> 且没有提供任何插槽内容时：<p><p>“Submit”将会被作为默认内容渲染：<p><div", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/slots.html", "title": "插槽 Slots", "doc_id": "3bb48a64a0a34d1d908914c5a169e041", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1189, "chunk_index": 15, "_doc_id": "15_5508565170476550040"}}
{"doc_id": "16_193215304439877225", "text": "pre><div><p>现在，当我们在父组件中使用 <code><SubmitButton><code> 且没有提供任何插槽内容时：<p><p>“Submit”将会被作为默认内容渲染：<p><div class=\"language-html\"> <span class=\"lang\">html<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>button<span><span> type<span><span>=<span><span>\"submit\"<span><span>>Submit</<span><span>button<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>但如果我们提供了插槽内容：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/slots.html", "title": "插槽 Slots", "doc_id": "3bb48a64a0a34d1d908914c5a169e041", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1189, "chunk_index": 16, "_doc_id": "16_193215304439877225"}}
{"doc_id": "17_1694824141776352732", "text": "uage-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>SubmitButton<span><span>>Save</<span><span>SubmitButton<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>那么被显式提供的内容会取代默认内容：<p><div class=\"language-html\"> <span class=\"lang\">html<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>button<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/slots.html", "title": "插槽 Slots", "doc_id": "3bb48a64a0a34d1d908914c5a169e041", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1189, "chunk_index": 17, "_doc_id": "17_1694824141776352732"}}
{"doc_id": "18_8189129283479816442", "text": "re class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>button<span><span> type<span><span>=<span><span>\"submit\"<span><span>>Save</<span><span>button<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><h2 id=\"named-slots\">具名插槽 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#named-slots\">​<a><h2><p>有时在一个组件中包含多个插槽出口是很有用的。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/slots.html", "title": "插槽 Slots", "doc_id": "3bb48a64a0a34d1d908914c5a169e041", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1189, "chunk_index": 18, "_doc_id": "18_8189129283479816442"}}
{"doc_id": "19_3751714379602986259", "text": "id=\"named-slots\">具名插槽 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#named-slots\">​<a><h2><p>有时在一个组件中包含多个插槽出口是很有用的。举例来说，在一个 <code><BaseLayout><code> 组件中，有如下模板：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>div<span><span> class<span><span>=<span><span>\"container\"<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>header<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <!-- 标题内容放这里 --><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/slots.html", "title": "插槽 Slots", "doc_id": "3bb48a64a0a34d1d908914c5a169e041", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1189, "chunk_index": 19, "_doc_id": "19_3751714379602986259"}}
{"doc_id": "20_7043848162580366249", "text": "<<span><span>header<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <!-- 标题内容放这里 --><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> </<span><span>header<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>main<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <!-- 主要内容放这里 --><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> </<span><span>main<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>footer<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <!-- 底部内容放这里 --><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/slots.html", "title": "插槽 Slots", "doc_id": "3bb48a64a0a34d1d908914c5a169e041", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1189, "chunk_index": 20, "_doc_id": "20_7043848162580366249"}}
{"doc_id": "21_4758295454222331043", "text": "<<span><span>footer<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <!-- 底部内容放这里 --><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> </<span><span>footer<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/slots.html", "title": "插槽 Slots", "doc_id": "3bb48a64a0a34d1d908914c5a169e041", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1189, "chunk_index": 21, "_doc_id": "21_4758295454222331043"}}
{"doc_id": "22_6980563681549693772", "text": "!-- 底部内容放这里 --><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> </<span><span>footer<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>div<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>对于这种场景，<code><slot><code> 元素可以有一个特殊的 attribute <code>name<code>，用来给各个插槽分配唯一的 ID，以确定每一处要渲染的内容：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>div<span><span> class<span><span>=<span><span>\"container\"<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/slots.html", "title": "插槽 Slots", "doc_id": "3bb48a64a0a34d1d908914c5a169e041", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1189, "chunk_index": 22, "_doc_id": "22_6980563681549693772"}}
{"doc_id": "23_1522760028333411565", "text": "pan><<span><span>div<span><span> class<span><span>=<span><span>\"container\"<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>header<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>slot<span><span> name<span><span>=<span><span>\"header\"<span><span>></<span><span>slot<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> </<span><span>header<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>main<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/slots.html", "title": "插槽 Slots", "doc_id": "3bb48a64a0a34d1d908914c5a169e041", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1189, "chunk_index": 23, "_doc_id": "23_1522760028333411565"}}
{"doc_id": "24_3377685496559527482", "text": "eader<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>main<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>slot<span><span>></<span><span>slot<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> </<span><span>main<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>footer<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>slot<span><span> name<span><span>=<span><span>\"footer\"<span><span>></<span><span>slot<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/slots.html", "title": "插槽 Slots", "doc_id": "3bb48a64a0a34d1d908914c5a169e041", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1189, "chunk_index": 24, "_doc_id": "24_3377685496559527482"}}
{"doc_id": "25_7672024035451430087", "text": "span> name<span><span>=<span><span>\"footer\"<span><span>></<span><span>slot<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> </<span><span>footer<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>div<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>这类带 <code>name<code> 的插槽被称为具名插槽 (named slots)。没有提供 <code>name<code> 的 <code><slot><code> 出口会隐式地命名为“default”。<p><p>在父组件中使用 <code><BaseLayout><code> 时，我们需要一种方式将多个插槽内容传入到各自目标插槽的出口。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/slots.html", "title": "插槽 Slots", "doc_id": "3bb48a64a0a34d1d908914c5a169e041", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1189, "chunk_index": 25, "_doc_id": "25_7672024035451430087"}}
{"doc_id": "26_2806008495220502826", "text": "slot><code> 出口会隐式地命名为“default”。<p><p>在父组件中使用 <code><BaseLayout><code> 时，我们需要一种方式将多个插槽内容传入到各自目标插槽的出口。此时就需要用到<strong>具名插槽<strong>了：<p><p>要为具名插槽传入内容，我们需要使用一个含 <code>v-slot<code> 指令的 <code><template><code> 元素，并将目标插槽的名字传给该指令：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>BaseLayout<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>template<span><span> v-slot:header<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/slots.html", "title": "插槽 Slots", "doc_id": "3bb48a64a0a34d1d908914c5a169e041", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1189, "chunk_index": 26, "_doc_id": "26_2806008495220502826"}}
{"doc_id": "27_298618691456181575", "text": "<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>template<span><span> v-slot:header<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <!-- header 插槽的内容放这里 --><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> </<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/slots.html", "title": "插槽 Slots", "doc_id": "3bb48a64a0a34d1d908914c5a169e041", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1189, "chunk_index": 27, "_doc_id": "27_298618691456181575"}}
{"doc_id": "28_7558365644413112402", "text": "插槽的内容放这里 --><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> </<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>BaseLayout<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p><code>v-slot<code> 有对应的简写 <code>#<code>，因此 <code><template v-slot:header><code> 可以简写为 <code><template #header><code>。其意思就是“将这部分模板片段传入子组件的 header 插槽中”。<p><p> <p><p>下面我们给出完整的、向 <code><BaseLayout><code> 传递插槽内容的代码，指令均使用的是缩写形式：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>BaseLayout<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/slots.html", "title": "插槽 Slots", "doc_id": "3bb48a64a0a34d1d908914c5a169e041", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1189, "chunk_index": 28, "_doc_id": "28_7558365644413112402"}}
{"doc_id": "29_3261621805291761491", "text": "ithub-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>BaseLayout<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>template<span><span> #<span><span>header<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>h1<span><span>>Here might be a page title</<span><span>h1<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> </<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/slots.html", "title": "插槽 Slots", "doc_id": "3bb48a64a0a34d1d908914c5a169e041", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1189, "chunk_index": 29, "_doc_id": "29_3261621805291761491"}}
{"doc_id": "30_4995213617788304869", "text": "<span class=\"line\"><span> </<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>template<span><span> #<span><span>default<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>p<span><span>>A paragraph for the main content.</<span><span>p<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>p<span><span>>And another one.</<span><span>p<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/slots.html", "title": "插槽 Slots", "doc_id": "3bb48a64a0a34d1d908914c5a169e041", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1189, "chunk_index": 30, "_doc_id": "30_4995213617788304869"}}
{"doc_id": "31_8223053091218597382", "text": "s=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>p<span><span>>And another one.</<span><span>p<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> </<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>template<span><span> #<span><span>footer<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>p<span><span>>Here's some contact info</<span><span>p<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> </<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/slots.html", "title": "插槽 Slots", "doc_id": "3bb48a64a0a34d1d908914c5a169e041", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1189, "chunk_index": 31, "_doc_id": "31_8223053091218597382"}}
{"doc_id": "32_4469180609353397453", "text": "<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> </<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>BaseLayout<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>当一个组件同时接收默认插槽和具名插槽时，所有位于顶级的非 <code><template><code> 节点都被隐式地视为默认插槽的内容。所以上面也可以写成：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>BaseLayout<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/slots.html", "title": "插槽 Slots", "doc_id": "3bb48a64a0a34d1d908914c5a169e041", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1189, "chunk_index": 32, "_doc_id": "32_4469180609353397453"}}
{"doc_id": "33_5124639432426565497", "text": "ithub-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>BaseLayout<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>template<span><span> #<span><span>header<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>h1<span><span>>Here might be a page title</<span><span>h1<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> </<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <!-- 隐式的默认插槽 --><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/slots.html", "title": "插槽 Slots", "doc_id": "3bb48a64a0a34d1d908914c5a169e041", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1189, "chunk_index": 33, "_doc_id": "33_5124639432426565497"}}
{"doc_id": "34_9099971946167761219", "text": "span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <!-- 隐式的默认插槽 --><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>p<span><span>>A paragraph for the main content.</<span><span>p<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>p<span><span>>And another one.</<span><span>p<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>template<span><span> #<span><span>footer<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/slots.html", "title": "插槽 Slots", "doc_id": "3bb48a64a0a34d1d908914c5a169e041", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1189, "chunk_index": 34, "_doc_id": "34_9099971946167761219"}}
{"doc_id": "35_3800390386362704329", "text": "class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>template<span><span> #<span><span>footer<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>p<span><span>>Here's some contact info</<span><span>p<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> </<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/slots.html", "title": "插槽 Slots", "doc_id": "3bb48a64a0a34d1d908914c5a169e041", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1189, "chunk_index": 35, "_doc_id": "35_3800390386362704329"}}
{"doc_id": "36_4625231570211305035", "text": "<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> </<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>BaseLayout<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>现在 <code><template><code> 元素中的所有内容都将被传递到相应的插槽。最终渲染出的 HTML 如下：<p><div class=\"language-html\"> <span class=\"lang\">html<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>div<span><span> class<span><span>=<span><span>\"container\"<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/slots.html", "title": "插槽 Slots", "doc_id": "3bb48a64a0a34d1d908914c5a169e041", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1189, "chunk_index": 36, "_doc_id": "36_4625231570211305035"}}
{"doc_id": "37_2835503834306729370", "text": "pan><<span><span>div<span><span> class<span><span>=<span><span>\"container\"<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>header<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>h1<span><span>>Here might be a page title</<span><span>h1<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> </<span><span>header<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>main<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/slots.html", "title": "插槽 Slots", "doc_id": "3bb48a64a0a34d1d908914c5a169e041", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1189, "chunk_index": 37, "_doc_id": "37_2835503834306729370"}}
{"doc_id": "38_1421600089181449272", "text": "eader<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>main<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>p<span><span>>A paragraph for the main content.</<span><span>p<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>p<span><span>>And another one.</<span><span>p<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> </<span><span>main<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>footer<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/slots.html", "title": "插槽 Slots", "doc_id": "3bb48a64a0a34d1d908914c5a169e041", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1189, "chunk_index": 38, "_doc_id": "38_1421600089181449272"}}
{"doc_id": "39_3455904084583977695", "text": "ain<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>footer<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>p<span><span>>Here's some contact info</<span><span>p<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> </<span><span>footer<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/slots.html", "title": "插槽 Slots", "doc_id": "3bb48a64a0a34d1d908914c5a169e041", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1189, "chunk_index": 39, "_doc_id": "39_3455904084583977695"}}
{"doc_id": "40_1279466876910602776", "text": ">p<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> </<span><span>footer<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>div<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>使用 JavaScript 函数来类比可能更有助于你来理解具名插槽：<p><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// 传入不同的内容给不同名字的插槽<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>BaseLayout<span><span>({<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/slots.html", "title": "插槽 Slots", "doc_id": "3bb48a64a0a34d1d908914c5a169e041", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1189, "chunk_index": 40, "_doc_id": "40_1279466876910602776"}}
{"doc_id": "41_2712858874297428136", "text": "><span>// 传入不同的内容给不同名字的插槽<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>BaseLayout<span><span>({<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> header: <span><span>`...`<span><span>,<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> default: <span><span>`...`<span><span>,<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> footer: <span><span>`...`<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>})<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// <BaseLayout> 渲染插槽内容到对应位置<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/slots.html", "title": "插槽 Slots", "doc_id": "3bb48a64a0a34d1d908914c5a169e041", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1189, "chunk_index": 41, "_doc_id": "41_2712858874297428136"}}
{"doc_id": "42_2806044476242891823", "text": "n><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// <BaseLayout> 渲染插槽内容到对应位置<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>function<span><span> BaseLayout<span><span>(<span><span>slots<span><span>) {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> return<span><span> `<div class=\"container\"><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <header>${<span><span>slots<span><span>.<span><span>header<span><span>}</header><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/slots.html", "title": "插槽 Slots", "doc_id": "3bb48a64a0a34d1d908914c5a169e041", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1189, "chunk_index": 42, "_doc_id": "42_2806044476242891823"}}
{"doc_id": "43_6591011192919315763", "text": "<span> <header>${<span><span>slots<span><span>.<span><span>header<span><span>}</header><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <main>${<span><span>slots<span><span>.<span><span>default<span><span>}</main><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <footer>${<span><span>slots<span><span>.<span><span>footer<span><span>}</footer><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> </div>`<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/slots.html", "title": "插槽 Slots", "doc_id": "3bb48a64a0a34d1d908914c5a169e041", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1189, "chunk_index": 43, "_doc_id": "43_6591011192919315763"}}
{"doc_id": "44_3766939819233703522", "text": ".<span><span>footer<span><span>}</footer><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> </div>`<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span><code><pre><div><h2 id=\"conditional-slots\">条件插槽 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#conditional-slots\">​<a><h2><p>有时你需要根据内容是否被传入了插槽来渲染某些内容。<p><p>你可以结合使用 <a href=\"/api/component-instance.html#slots\">$slots<a> 属性与 <a href=\"/guide/essentials/conditional.html#v-if\">v-if<a> 来实现。<p><p>在下面的示例中，我们定义了一个卡片组件，它拥有三个条件插槽：<code>header<code>、<code>footer<code> 和 <code>default<code>。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/slots.html", "title": "插槽 Slots", "doc_id": "3bb48a64a0a34d1d908914c5a169e041", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1189, "chunk_index": 44, "_doc_id": "44_3766939819233703522"}}
{"doc_id": "45_6608695541065287063", "text": "来实现。<p><p>在下面的示例中，我们定义了一个卡片组件，它拥有三个条件插槽：<code>header<code>、<code>footer<code> 和 <code>default<code>。 当 header、footer 或 default 的内容存在时，我们希望包装它以提供额外的样式：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>div<span><span> class<span><span>=<span><span>\"card\"<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/slots.html", "title": "插槽 Slots", "doc_id": "3bb48a64a0a34d1d908914c5a169e041", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1189, "chunk_index": 45, "_doc_id": "45_6608695541065287063"}}
{"doc_id": "46_4589272685073683235", "text": "\"><span> <<span><span>div<span><span> class<span><span>=<span><span>\"card\"<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>div<span><span> v-if<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>$slots.header<span><span>\"<span><span> class<span><span>=<span><span>\"card-header\"<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>slot<span><span> name<span><span>=<span><span>\"header\"<span><span> /><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> </<span><span>div<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/slots.html", "title": "插槽 Slots", "doc_id": "3bb48a64a0a34d1d908914c5a169e041", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1189, "chunk_index": 46, "_doc_id": "46_4589272685073683235"}}
{"doc_id": "47_2894293287210363795", "text": "er\"<span><span> /><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> </<span><span>div<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>div<span><span> v-if<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>$slots.default<span><span>\"<span><span> class<span><span>=<span><span>\"card-content\"<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>slot<span><span> /><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> </<span><span>div<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/slots.html", "title": "插槽 Slots", "doc_id": "3bb48a64a0a34d1d908914c5a169e041", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1189, "chunk_index": 47, "_doc_id": "47_2894293287210363795"}}
{"doc_id": "48_3086395988139286957", "text": "lot<span><span> /><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> </<span><span>div<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>div<span><span> v-if<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>$slots.footer<span><span>\"<span><span> class<span><span>=<span><span>\"card-footer\"<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>slot<span><span> name<span><span>=<span><span>\"footer\"<span><span> /><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/slots.html", "title": "插槽 Slots", "doc_id": "3bb48a64a0a34d1d908914c5a169e041", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1189, "chunk_index": 48, "_doc_id": "48_3086395988139286957"}}
{"doc_id": "49_6770078743520446811", "text": "pan> <<span><span>slot<span><span> name<span><span>=<span><span>\"footer\"<span><span> /><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> </<span><span>div<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> </<span><span>div<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p><a href=\"https://play.vuejs.org/#eNqVVMtu2zAQ/BWCLZBLIjVoTq4aoA1yaA9t0eaoCy2tJcYUSZCUKyPwv2dJioplOw4C+EDuzM4+ONYT/aZ1tumBLmhhK8O1IxZcr29LyTutjCN3zNRkZVRHLrLcXzz9opRFHvnIxIuDTgvmAG+EFJ", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/slots.html", "title": "插槽 Slots", "doc_id": "3bb48a64a0a34d1d908914c5a169e041", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1189, "chunk_index": 49, "_doc_id": "49_6770078743520446811"}}
