{"doc_id": "51_3442277221299267711", "text": "qBj1YoZ7NosJLOEq5S9OXtPZtI1gFSppx8engUHs+vVhq9eVhq9ORRrXdpRyseSqfo6SmmnONK6XTw9yis24q448wXSG+0VAb3sSDXeiBoDV6TpWDV+ktENatrdMGCfAoBfL1JYNzzpINJjVFoJ9yKUKho19ul6OFQ6UYPx1rjIpPYeXIc/vXCgjetawzbni0dPnhhJ3T3DMVSruI=\" target=\"_blank\">在演练场中尝试一下<a><p><h2 id=\"dynamic-slot-names\">动态插槽名 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#dynamic-slot-names\">​<a><h2><p><a href=\"/guide/essentials/template-syntax.html#dynamic-arguments\">动态指令参数<a>在 <code>v-slot<code> 上也是有效的，", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/slots.html", "title": "插槽 Slots", "doc_id": "3bb48a64a0a34d1d908914c5a169e041", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1189, "chunk_index": 51, "_doc_id": "51_3442277221299267711"}}
{"doc_id": "52_8497716788437471883", "text": "ref=\"/guide/essentials/template-syntax.html#dynamic-arguments\">动态指令参数<a>在 <code>v-slot<code> 上也是有效的，即可以定义下面这样的动态插槽名：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>base-layout<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>template<span><span> v-slot:<span><span>[<span><span>dynamicSlotName<span><span>]><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> ...<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/slots.html", "title": "插槽 Slots", "doc_id": "3bb48a64a0a34d1d908914c5a169e041", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1189, "chunk_index": 52, "_doc_id": "52_8497716788437471883"}}
{"doc_id": "53_2109635592528369860", "text": "an>[<span><span>dynamicSlotName<span><span>]><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> ...<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> </<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <!-- 缩写为 --><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>template<span><span> #[<span><span>dynamicSlotName<span><span>]><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> ...<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> </<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/slots.html", "title": "插槽 Slots", "doc_id": "3bb48a64a0a34d1d908914c5a169e041", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1189, "chunk_index": 53, "_doc_id": "53_2109635592528369860"}}
{"doc_id": "54_2928924391463601391", "text": "e\"><span> ...<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> </<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>base-layout<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>注意这里的表达式和动态指令参数受相同的<a href=\"/guide/essentials/template-syntax.html#dynamic-argument-syntax-constraints\">语法限制<a>。<p><h2 id=\"scoped-slots\">作用域插槽 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#scoped-slots\">​<a><h2><p>在上面的<a href=\"#render-scope\">渲染作用域<a>中我们讨论到，插槽的内容无法访问到子组件的状态。<p><p>然而在某些场景下插槽的内容可能想要同时使用父组件域内和子组件域内的数据。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/slots.html", "title": "插槽 Slots", "doc_id": "3bb48a64a0a34d1d908914c5a169e041", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1189, "chunk_index": 54, "_doc_id": "54_2928924391463601391"}}
{"doc_id": "55_1292979515305606038", "text": "面的<a href=\"#render-scope\">渲染作用域<a>中我们讨论到，插槽的内容无法访问到子组件的状态。<p><p>然而在某些场景下插槽的内容可能想要同时使用父组件域内和子组件域内的数据。要做到这一点，我们需要一种方法来让子组件在渲染时将一部分数据提供给插槽。<p><p>我们也确实有办法这么做！可以像对组件传递 props 那样，向一个插槽的出口上传递 attributes：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><!-- <MyComponent> 的模板 --><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>div<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/slots.html", "title": "插槽 Slots", "doc_id": "3bb48a64a0a34d1d908914c5a169e041", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1189, "chunk_index": 55, "_doc_id": "55_1292979515305606038"}}
{"doc_id": "56_2924770071152049663", "text": "MyComponent> 的模板 --><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>div<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>slot<span><span> :<span><span>text<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>greetingMessage<span><span>\"<span><span> :<span><span>count<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>1<span><span>\"<span><span>></<span><span>slot<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/slots.html", "title": "插槽 Slots", "doc_id": "3bb48a64a0a34d1d908914c5a169e041", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1189, "chunk_index": 56, "_doc_id": "56_2924770071152049663"}}
{"doc_id": "57_4566623013946335809", "text": "an>=<span><span>\"<span><span>1<span><span>\"<span><span>></<span><span>slot<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>div<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>当需要接收插槽 props 时，默认插槽和具名插槽的使用方式有一些小区别。下面我们将先展示默认插槽如何接受 props，通过子组件标签上的 <code>v-slot<code> 指令，直接接收到了一个插槽 props 对象：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>MyComponent<span><span> v-slot<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>slotProps<span><span>\"<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/slots.html", "title": "插槽 Slots", "doc_id": "3bb48a64a0a34d1d908914c5a169e041", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1189, "chunk_index": 57, "_doc_id": "57_4566623013946335809"}}
{"doc_id": "58_8951018244585701018", "text": "><span> v-slot<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>slotProps<span><span>\"<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> {{ slotProps.text }} {{ slotProps.count }}<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/slots.html", "title": "插槽 Slots", "doc_id": "3bb48a64a0a34d1d908914c5a169e041", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1189, "chunk_index": 58, "_doc_id": "58_8951018244585701018"}}
{"doc_id": "59_5430573477658447810", "text": "span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> {{ slotProps.text }} {{ slotProps.count }}<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>MyComponent<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p> <p><p>子组件传入插槽的 props 作为了 <code>v-slot<code> 指令的值，可以在插槽内的表达式中访问。<p><p>你可以将作用域插槽类比为一个传入子组件的函数。子组件会将相应的 props 作为参数传给它：<p><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>MyComponent<span><span>({<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/slots.html", "title": "插槽 Slots", "doc_id": "3bb48a64a0a34d1d908914c5a169e041", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1189, "chunk_index": 59, "_doc_id": "59_5430573477658447810"}}
{"doc_id": "60_3273410103538245350", "text": "ss=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>MyComponent<span><span>({<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 类比默认插槽，将其想成一个函数<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> default<span><span>: (<span><span>slotProps<span><span>) <span><span>=><span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> return<span><span> `${<span><span>slotProps<span><span>.<span><span>text<span><span>} ${<span><span>slotProps<span><span>.<span><span>count<span><span>}`<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/slots.html", "title": "插槽 Slots", "doc_id": "3bb48a64a0a34d1d908914c5a169e041", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1189, "chunk_index": 60, "_doc_id": "60_3273410103538245350"}}
{"doc_id": "61_8000041002890462014", "text": "n>text<span><span>} ${<span><span>slotProps<span><span>.<span><span>count<span><span>}`<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>})<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>function<span><span> MyComponent<span><span>(<span><span>slots<span><span>) {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> const<span><span> greetingMessage<span><span> =<span><span> 'hello'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> return<span><span> `<div>${<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/slots.html", "title": "插槽 Slots", "doc_id": "3bb48a64a0a34d1d908914c5a169e041", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1189, "chunk_index": 61, "_doc_id": "61_8000041002890462014"}}
{"doc_id": "62_8118136902086794935", "text": "=<span><span> 'hello'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> return<span><span> `<div>${<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 在插槽函数调用时传入 props<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> slots<span><span>.<span><span>default<span><span>({ text: <span><span>greetingMessage<span><span>, count: <span><span>1<span><span> })<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }</div>`<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/slots.html", "title": "插槽 Slots", "doc_id": "3bb48a64a0a34d1d908914c5a169e041", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1189, "chunk_index": 62, "_doc_id": "62_8118136902086794935"}}
{"doc_id": "63_7511632171638303715", "text": "an>, count: <span><span>1<span><span> })<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }</div>`<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span><code><pre><div><p>实际上，这已经和作用域插槽的最终代码编译结果、以及手动编写<a href=\"/guide/extras/render-function.html\">渲染函数<a>时使用作用域插槽的方式非常类似了。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/slots.html", "title": "插槽 Slots", "doc_id": "3bb48a64a0a34d1d908914c5a169e041", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1189, "chunk_index": 63, "_doc_id": "63_7511632171638303715"}}
{"doc_id": "64_9097771443262379112", "text": "p>实际上，这已经和作用域插槽的最终代码编译结果、以及手动编写<a href=\"/guide/extras/render-function.html\">渲染函数<a>时使用作用域插槽的方式非常类似了。<p><p><code>v-slot=\"slotProps\"<code> 可以类比这里的函数签名，和函数的参数类似，我们也可以在 <code>v-slot<code> 中使用解构：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>MyComponent<span><span> v-slot<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>{ text, count }<span><span>\"<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/slots.html", "title": "插槽 Slots", "doc_id": "3bb48a64a0a34d1d908914c5a169e041", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1189, "chunk_index": 64, "_doc_id": "64_9097771443262379112"}}
{"doc_id": "65_1183018282829355120", "text": "> v-slot<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>{ text, count }<span><span>\"<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> {{ text }} {{ count }}<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/slots.html", "title": "插槽 Slots", "doc_id": "3bb48a64a0a34d1d908914c5a169e041", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1189, "chunk_index": 65, "_doc_id": "65_1183018282829355120"}}
{"doc_id": "66_7316452978105213620", "text": "<span><span>\"<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> {{ text }} {{ count }}<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>MyComponent<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><h3 id=\"named-scoped-slots\">具名作用域插槽 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#named-scoped-slots\">​<a><h3><p>具名作用域插槽的工作方式也是类似的，插槽 props 可以作为 <code>v-slot<code> 指令的值被访问到：<code>v-slot:name=\"slotProps\"<code>。当使用缩写时是这样：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>MyComponent<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/slots.html", "title": "插槽 Slots", "doc_id": "3bb48a64a0a34d1d908914c5a169e041", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1189, "chunk_index": 66, "_doc_id": "66_7316452978105213620"}}
{"doc_id": "67_8192390734901011593", "text": "thub-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>MyComponent<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>template<span><span> #<span><span>header<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>headerProps<span><span>\"<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> {{ headerProps }}<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> </<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/slots.html", "title": "插槽 Slots", "doc_id": "3bb48a64a0a34d1d908914c5a169e041", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1189, "chunk_index": 67, "_doc_id": "67_8192390734901011593"}}
{"doc_id": "68_7350275995834116325", "text": "<span class=\"line\"><span> </<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>template<span><span> #<span><span>default<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>defaultProps<span><span>\"<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> {{ defaultProps }}<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> </<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/slots.html", "title": "插槽 Slots", "doc_id": "3bb48a64a0a34d1d908914c5a169e041", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1189, "chunk_index": 68, "_doc_id": "68_7350275995834116325"}}
{"doc_id": "69_665753166145881720", "text": "<span class=\"line\"><span> </<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>template<span><span> #<span><span>footer<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>footerProps<span><span>\"<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> {{ footerProps }}<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> </<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/slots.html", "title": "插槽 Slots", "doc_id": "3bb48a64a0a34d1d908914c5a169e041", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1189, "chunk_index": 69, "_doc_id": "69_665753166145881720"}}
{"doc_id": "70_904290198063612116", "text": "ooterProps }}<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> </<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>MyComponent<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>向具名插槽中传入 props：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>slot<span><span> name<span><span>=<span><span>\"header\"<span><span> message<span><span>=<span><span>\"hello\"<span><span>></<span><span>slot<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>注意插槽上的 <code>name<code> 是一个 Vue 特别保留的 attribute，不会作为 props 传递给插槽。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/slots.html", "title": "插槽 Slots", "doc_id": "3bb48a64a0a34d1d908914c5a169e041", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1189, "chunk_index": 70, "_doc_id": "70_904290198063612116"}}
{"doc_id": "71_1137421186178600342", "text": "an>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>注意插槽上的 <code>name<code> 是一个 Vue 特别保留的 attribute，不会作为 props 传递给插槽。因此最终 <code>headerProps<code> 的结果是 <code>{ message: 'hello' }<code>。<p><p>如果你同时使用了具名插槽与默认插槽，则需要为默认插槽使用显式的 <code><template><code> 标签。尝试直接为组件添加 <code>v-slot<code> 指令将导致编译错误。这是为了避免因默认插槽的 props 的作用域而困惑。举例：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><!-- <MyComponent> template --><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/slots.html", "title": "插槽 Slots", "doc_id": "3bb48a64a0a34d1d908914c5a169e041", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1189, "chunk_index": 71, "_doc_id": "71_1137421186178600342"}}
{"doc_id": "72_7967322839349837051", "text": "iki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><!-- <MyComponent> template --><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>div<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>slot<span><span> :<span><span>message<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>hello<span><span>\"<span><span>></<span><span>slot<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>slot<span><span> name<span><span>=<span><span>\"footer\"<span><span> /><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/slots.html", "title": "插槽 Slots", "doc_id": "3bb48a64a0a34d1d908914c5a169e041", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1189, "chunk_index": 72, "_doc_id": "72_7967322839349837051"}}
{"doc_id": "73_8950610865472731735", "text": "pan> <<span><span>slot<span><span> name<span><span>=<span><span>\"footer\"<span><span> /><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>div<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><!-- 该模板无法编译 --><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>MyComponent<span><span> v-slot<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>{ message }<span><span>\"<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/slots.html", "title": "插槽 Slots", "doc_id": "3bb48a64a0a34d1d908914c5a169e041", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1189, "chunk_index": 73, "_doc_id": "73_8950610865472731735"}}
{"doc_id": "74_2136765512494850389", "text": "span> v-slot<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>{ message }<span><span>\"<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>p<span><span>>{{ message }}</<span><span>p<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>template<span><span> #<span><span>footer<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <!-- message 属于默认插槽，此处不可用 --><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>p<span><span>>{{ message }}</<span><span>p<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/slots.html", "title": "插槽 Slots", "doc_id": "3bb48a64a0a34d1d908914c5a169e041", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1189, "chunk_index": 74, "_doc_id": "74_2136765512494850389"}}
{"doc_id": "75_3232539912238555147", "text": "lass=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>p<span><span>>{{ message }}</<span><span>p<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> </<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/slots.html", "title": "插槽 Slots", "doc_id": "3bb48a64a0a34d1d908914c5a169e041", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1189, "chunk_index": 75, "_doc_id": "75_3232539912238555147"}}
{"doc_id": "76_1352900998794500819", "text": "<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> </<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>MyComponent<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>为默认插槽使用显式的 <code><template><code> 标签有助于更清晰地指出 <code>message<code> 属性在其他插槽中不可用：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>MyComponent<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/slots.html", "title": "插槽 Slots", "doc_id": "3bb48a64a0a34d1d908914c5a169e041", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1189, "chunk_index": 76, "_doc_id": "76_1352900998794500819"}}
{"doc_id": "77_3226184358338039712", "text": "thub-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>MyComponent<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <!-- 使用显式的默认插槽 --><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>template<span><span> #<span><span>default<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>{ message }<span><span>\"<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>p<span><span>>{{ message }}</<span><span>p<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> </<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/slots.html", "title": "插槽 Slots", "doc_id": "3bb48a64a0a34d1d908914c5a169e041", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1189, "chunk_index": 77, "_doc_id": "77_3226184358338039712"}}
{"doc_id": "78_796234962905809230", "text": "<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> </<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>template<span><span> #<span><span>footer<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>p<span><span>>Here's some contact info</<span><span>p<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> </<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/slots.html", "title": "插槽 Slots", "doc_id": "3bb48a64a0a34d1d908914c5a169e041", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1189, "chunk_index": 78, "_doc_id": "78_796234962905809230"}}
{"doc_id": "79_5435478734730536287", "text": "<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> </<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>MyComponent<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><h3 id=\"fancy-list-example\">高级列表组件示例 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#fancy-list-example\">​<a><h3><p>你可能想问什么样的场景才适合用到作用域插槽，这里我们来看一个 <code><FancyList><code> 组件的例子。它会渲染一个列表，并同时会封装一些加载远端数据的逻辑、使用数据进行列表渲染、或者是像分页或无限滚动这样更进阶的功能。然而我们希望它能够保留足够的灵活性，将对单个列表元素内容和样式的控制权留给使用它的父组件。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/slots.html", "title": "插槽 Slots", "doc_id": "3bb48a64a0a34d1d908914c5a169e041", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1189, "chunk_index": 79, "_doc_id": "79_5435478734730536287"}}
{"doc_id": "80_7108243676027170247", "text": "染一个列表，并同时会封装一些加载远端数据的逻辑、使用数据进行列表渲染、或者是像分页或无限滚动这样更进阶的功能。然而我们希望它能够保留足够的灵活性，将对单个列表元素内容和样式的控制权留给使用它的父组件。我们期望的用法可能是这样的：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>FancyList<span><span> :<span><span>api-url<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>url<span><span>\"<span><span> :<span><span>per-page<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>10<span><span>\"<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/slots.html", "title": "插槽 Slots", "doc_id": "3bb48a64a0a34d1d908914c5a169e041", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1189, "chunk_index": 80, "_doc_id": "80_7108243676027170247"}}
{"doc_id": "81_4330204458476711598", "text": ":<span><span>per-page<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>10<span><span>\"<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>template<span><span> #<span><span>item<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>{ body, username, likes }<span><span>\"<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>div<span><span> class<span><span>=<span><span>\"item\"<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>p<span><span>>{{ body }}</<span><span>p<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/slots.html", "title": "插槽 Slots", "doc_id": "3bb48a64a0a34d1d908914c5a169e041", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1189, "chunk_index": 81, "_doc_id": "81_4330204458476711598"}}
{"doc_id": "82_7471379873277379801", "text": "n class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>p<span><span>>{{ body }}</<span><span>p<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>p<span><span>>by {{ username }} | {{ likes }} likes</<span><span>p<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> </<span><span>div<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> </<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/slots.html", "title": "插槽 Slots", "doc_id": "3bb48a64a0a34d1d908914c5a169e041", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1189, "chunk_index": 82, "_doc_id": "82_7471379873277379801"}}
{"doc_id": "83_4884055315744255187", "text": "<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> </<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>FancyList<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>在 <code><FancyList><code> 之中，我们可以多次渲染 <code><slot><code> 并每次都提供不同的数据 (注意我们这里使用了 <code>v-bind<code> 来传递插槽的 props)：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>ul<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/slots.html", "title": "插槽 Slots", "doc_id": "3bb48a64a0a34d1d908914c5a169e041", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1189, "chunk_index": 83, "_doc_id": "83_4884055315744255187"}}
{"doc_id": "84_6507230389206157939", "text": "\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>ul<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>li<span><span> v-for<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>item <span><span>in<span><span> items<span><span>\"<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>slot<span><span> name<span><span>=<span><span>\"item\"<span><span> v-bind<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>item<span><span>\"<span><span>></<span><span>slot<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/slots.html", "title": "插槽 Slots", "doc_id": "3bb48a64a0a34d1d908914c5a169e041", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1189, "chunk_index": 84, "_doc_id": "84_6507230389206157939"}}
{"doc_id": "85_4120351225051841746", "text": "=<span><span>\"<span><span>item<span><span>\"<span><span>></<span><span>slot<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> </<span><span>li<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>ul<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><h3 id=\"renderless-components\">无渲染组件 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#renderless-components\">​<a><h3><p>上面的 <code><FancyList><code> 案例同时封装了可重用的逻辑 (数据获取、分页等) 和视图输出，但也将部分视图输出通过作用域插槽交给了消费者组件来管理。<p><p>如果我们将这个概念拓展一下，可以想象的是，一些组件可能只包括了逻辑而不需要自己渲染内容，视图输出通过作用域插槽全权交给了消费者组件。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/slots.html", "title": "插槽 Slots", "doc_id": "3bb48a64a0a34d1d908914c5a169e041", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1189, "chunk_index": 85, "_doc_id": "85_4120351225051841746"}}
{"doc_id": "86_8165841364465939907", "text": "但也将部分视图输出通过作用域插槽交给了消费者组件来管理。<p><p>如果我们将这个概念拓展一下，可以想象的是，一些组件可能只包括了逻辑而不需要自己渲染内容，视图输出通过作用域插槽全权交给了消费者组件。我们将这种类型的组件称为<strong>无渲染组件<strong>。<p><p>这里有一个无渲染组件的例子，一个封装了追踪当前鼠标位置逻辑的组件：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>MouseTracker<span><span> v-slot<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>{ x, y }<span><span>\"<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> Mouse is at: {{ x }}, {{ y }}<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/slots.html", "title": "插槽 Slots", "doc_id": "3bb48a64a0a34d1d908914c5a169e041", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1189, "chunk_index": 86, "_doc_id": "86_8165841364465939907"}}
{"doc_id": "87_9165839515917101886", "text": "span>\"<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> Mouse is at: {{ x }}, {{ y }}<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>MouseTracker<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>虽然这个模式很有趣，但大部分能用无渲染组件实现的功能都可以通过组合式 API 以另一种更高效的方式实现，并且还不会带来额外组件嵌套的开销。之后我们会在<a href=\"/guide/reusability/composables.html\">组合式函数<a>一章中介绍如何更高效地实现追踪鼠标位置的功能。<p><p>尽管如此，作用域插槽在需要<strong>同时<strong>封装逻辑、组合视图界面时还是很有用，就像上面的 <code><FancyList><code> 组件那样。<p><div><div>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/slots.html", "title": "插槽 Slots", "doc_id": "3bb48a64a0a34d1d908914c5a169e041", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1189, "chunk_index": 87, "_doc_id": "87_9165839515917101886"}}
{"doc_id": "0_4989804403213058759", "text": "<div><div><h1 id=\"keepalive\">KeepAlive <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#keepalive\">​<a><h1><p><code><KeepAlive><code> 是一个内置组件，它的功能是在多个组件间动态切换时缓存被移除的组件实例。<p><h2 id=\"basic-usage\">基本使用 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#basic-usage\">​<a><h2><p>在组件基础章节中，", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/keep-alive.html", "title": "KeepAlive | Vue.js", "doc_id": "0ed3eb096875473899f67dd5967f0acd", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 290, "chunk_index": 0, "_doc_id": "0_4989804403213058759"}}
{"doc_id": "1_6148776128071863362", "text": "的组件实例。<p><h2 id=\"basic-usage\">基本使用 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#basic-usage\">​<a><h2><p>在组件基础章节中，我们已经介绍了通过特殊的 <code><component><code> 元素来实现<a href=\"/guide/essentials/component-basics.html#dynamic-components\">动态组件<a>的用法：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>component<span><span> :<span><span>is<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>activeComponent<span><span>\"<span><span> /><span><span><code><pre><div><p>默认情况下，", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/keep-alive.html", "title": "KeepAlive | Vue.js", "doc_id": "0ed3eb096875473899f67dd5967f0acd", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 290, "chunk_index": 1, "_doc_id": "1_6148776128071863362"}}
{"doc_id": "2_3997623110509074729", "text": "><span>\"<span><span>activeComponent<span><span>\"<span><span> /><span><span><code><pre><div><p>默认情况下，一个组件实例在被替换掉后会被销毁。这会导致它丢失其中所有已变化的状态——当这个组件再一次被显示时，会创建一个只带有初始状态的新实例。<p><p>在下面的例子中，你会看到两个有状态的组件——A 有一个计数器，而 B 有一个通过 <code>v-model<code> 同步 input 框输入内容的文字展示。尝试先更改一下任意一个组件的状态，然后切走，再切回来：<p><p>你会发现在切回来之后，之前已更改的状态都被重置了。<p><p>在切换时创建新的组件实例通常是有意义的，但在这个例子中，我们的确想要组件能在被“切走”的时候保留它们的状态。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/keep-alive.html", "title": "KeepAlive | Vue.js", "doc_id": "0ed3eb096875473899f67dd5967f0acd", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 290, "chunk_index": 2, "_doc_id": "2_3997623110509074729"}}
{"doc_id": "3_420059748672566840", "text": "后切走，再切回来：<p><p>你会发现在切回来之后，之前已更改的状态都被重置了。<p><p>在切换时创建新的组件实例通常是有意义的，但在这个例子中，我们的确想要组件能在被“切走”的时候保留它们的状态。要解决这个问题，我们可以用 <code><KeepAlive><code> 内置组件将这些动态组件包装起来：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><!-- 非活跃的组件将会被缓存！ --><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>KeepAlive<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/keep-alive.html", "title": "KeepAlive | Vue.js", "doc_id": "0ed3eb096875473899f67dd5967f0acd", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 290, "chunk_index": 3, "_doc_id": "3_420059748672566840"}}
{"doc_id": "4_6455751273208590143", "text": "跃的组件将会被缓存！ --><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>KeepAlive<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>component<span><span> :<span><span>is<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>activeComponent<span><span>\"<span><span> /><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/keep-alive.html", "title": "KeepAlive | Vue.js", "doc_id": "0ed3eb096875473899f67dd5967f0acd", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 290, "chunk_index": 4, "_doc_id": "4_6455751273208590143"}}
{"doc_id": "5_2383290219144296124", "text": "pan>is<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>activeComponent<span><span>\"<span><span> /><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>KeepAlive<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>现在，在组件切换时状态也能被保留了：<p><div class=\"tip custom-block\"><p class=\"custom-block-title\">TIP<p><p>在 <a href=\"/guide/essentials/component-basics.html#in-dom-template-parsing-caveats\">DOM 内模板<a>中使用时，它应该被写为 <code><keep-alive><code>。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/keep-alive.html", "title": "KeepAlive | Vue.js", "doc_id": "0ed3eb096875473899f67dd5967f0acd", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 290, "chunk_index": 5, "_doc_id": "5_2383290219144296124"}}
{"doc_id": "6_7612219892049010372", "text": "mponent-basics.html#in-dom-template-parsing-caveats\">DOM 内模板<a>中使用时，它应该被写为 <code><keep-alive><code>。<p><div><h2 id=\"include-exclude\">包含/排除 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#include-exclude\">​<a><h2><p><code><KeepAlive><code> 默认会缓存内部的所有组件实例，但我们可以通过 <code>include<code> 和 <code>exclude<code> prop 来定制该行为。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/keep-alive.html", "title": "KeepAlive | Vue.js", "doc_id": "0ed3eb096875473899f67dd5967f0acd", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 290, "chunk_index": 6, "_doc_id": "6_7612219892049010372"}}
{"doc_id": "7_482111824719089712", "text": "code><KeepAlive><code> 默认会缓存内部的所有组件实例，但我们可以通过 <code>include<code> 和 <code>exclude<code> prop 来定制该行为。这两个 prop 的值都可以是一个以英文逗号分隔的字符串、一个正则表达式，或是包含这两种类型的一个数组：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><!-- 以英文逗号分隔的字符串 --><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>KeepAlive<span><span> include<span><span>=<span><span>\"a,b\"<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/keep-alive.html", "title": "KeepAlive | Vue.js", "doc_id": "0ed3eb096875473899f67dd5967f0acd", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 290, "chunk_index": 7, "_doc_id": "7_482111824719089712"}}
{"doc_id": "8_1482144287194012486", "text": "n><<span><span>KeepAlive<span><span> include<span><span>=<span><span>\"a,b\"<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>component<span><span> :<span><span>is<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>view<span><span>\"<span><span> /><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>KeepAlive<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><!-- 正则表达式 (需使用 `v-bind`) --><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/keep-alive.html", "title": "KeepAlive | Vue.js", "doc_id": "0ed3eb096875473899f67dd5967f0acd", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 290, "chunk_index": 8, "_doc_id": "8_1482144287194012486"}}
{"doc_id": "9_2687098795849672736", "text": "<span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><!-- 正则表达式 (需使用 `v-bind`) --><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>KeepAlive<span><span> :<span><span>include<span><span>=<span><span>\"/<span><span>a<span><span>|<span><span>b<span><span>/\"<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>component<span><span> :<span><span>is<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>view<span><span>\"<span><span> /><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/keep-alive.html", "title": "KeepAlive | Vue.js", "doc_id": "0ed3eb096875473899f67dd5967f0acd", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 290, "chunk_index": 9, "_doc_id": "9_2687098795849672736"}}
{"doc_id": "10_4659088121219042983", "text": "> :<span><span>is<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>view<span><span>\"<span><span> /><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>KeepAlive<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><!-- 数组 (需使用 `v-bind`) --><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>KeepAlive<span><span> :<span><span>include<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>[<span><span>'a'<span><span>, <span><span>'b'<span><span>]<span><span>\"<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/keep-alive.html", "title": "KeepAlive | Vue.js", "doc_id": "0ed3eb096875473899f67dd5967f0acd", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 290, "chunk_index": 10, "_doc_id": "10_4659088121219042983"}}
{"doc_id": "11_8697693222707296300", "text": "an>[<span><span>'a'<span><span>, <span><span>'b'<span><span>]<span><span>\"<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>component<span><span> :<span><span>is<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>view<span><span>\"<span><span> /><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>KeepAlive<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>它会根据组件的 <a href=\"/api/options-misc.html#name\"><code>name<code><a> 选项进行匹配，所以组件如果想要条件性地被 <code>KeepAlive<code> 缓存，就必须显式声明一个 <code>name<code> 选项。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/keep-alive.html", "title": "KeepAlive | Vue.js", "doc_id": "0ed3eb096875473899f67dd5967f0acd", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 290, "chunk_index": 11, "_doc_id": "11_8697693222707296300"}}
{"doc_id": "12_7499406190585333616", "text": "me\"><code>name<code><a> 选项进行匹配，所以组件如果想要条件性地被 <code>KeepAlive<code> 缓存，就必须显式声明一个 <code>name<code> 选项。<p><div class=\"tip custom-block\"><p class=\"custom-block-title\">TIP<p><p>在 3.2.34 或以上的版本中，使用 <code><script setup><code> 的单文件组件会自动根据文件名生成对应的 <code>name<code> 选项，无需再手动声明。<p><div><h2 id=\"max-cached-instances\">最大缓存实例数 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#max-cached-instances\">​<a><h2><p>我们可以通过传入 <code>max<code> prop 来限制可被缓存的最大组件实例数。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/keep-alive.html", "title": "KeepAlive | Vue.js", "doc_id": "0ed3eb096875473899f67dd5967f0acd", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 290, "chunk_index": 12, "_doc_id": "12_7499406190585333616"}}
{"doc_id": "13_2806937603747017131", "text": "eader-anchor\" href=\"#max-cached-instances\">​<a><h2><p>我们可以通过传入 <code>max<code> prop 来限制可被缓存的最大组件实例数。<code><KeepAlive><code> 的行为在指定了 <code>max<code> 后类似一个 <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Cache_replacement_policies#Least_recently_used_(LRU)\" target=\"_blank\">LRU 缓存<a>：如果缓存的实例数量即将超过指定的那个最大数量，则最久没有被访问的缓存实例将被销毁，以便为新的实例腾出空间。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/keep-alive.html", "title": "KeepAlive | Vue.js", "doc_id": "0ed3eb096875473899f67dd5967f0acd", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 290, "chunk_index": 13, "_doc_id": "13_2806937603747017131"}}
{"doc_id": "14_1877110604149465783", "text": "recently_used_(LRU)\" target=\"_blank\">LRU 缓存<a>：如果缓存的实例数量即将超过指定的那个最大数量，则最久没有被访问的缓存实例将被销毁，以便为新的实例腾出空间。<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>KeepAlive<span><span> :<span><span>max<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>10<span><span>\"<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/keep-alive.html", "title": "KeepAlive | Vue.js", "doc_id": "0ed3eb096875473899f67dd5967f0acd", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 290, "chunk_index": 14, "_doc_id": "14_1877110604149465783"}}
{"doc_id": "15_14652681894071931", "text": "pan> :<span><span>max<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>10<span><span>\"<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>component<span><span> :<span><span>is<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>activeComponent<span><span>\"<span><span> /><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/keep-alive.html", "title": "KeepAlive | Vue.js", "doc_id": "0ed3eb096875473899f67dd5967f0acd", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 290, "chunk_index": 15, "_doc_id": "15_14652681894071931"}}
{"doc_id": "16_5883685302939283313", "text": "pan>is<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>activeComponent<span><span>\"<span><span> /><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>KeepAlive<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><h2 id=\"lifecycle-of-cached-instance\">缓存实例的生命周期 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#lifecycle-of-cached-instance\">​<a><h2><p>当一个组件实例从 DOM 上移除但因为被 <code><KeepAlive><code> 缓存而仍作为组件树的一部分时，它将变为<strong>不活跃<strong>状态而不是被卸载。当一个组件实例作为缓存树的一部分插入到 DOM 中时，它将重新<strong>被激活<strong>。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/keep-alive.html", "title": "KeepAlive | Vue.js", "doc_id": "0ed3eb096875473899f67dd5967f0acd", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 290, "chunk_index": 16, "_doc_id": "16_5883685302939283313"}}
{"doc_id": "17_981361515142587378", "text": "> 缓存而仍作为组件树的一部分时，它将变为<strong>不活跃<strong>状态而不是被卸载。当一个组件实例作为缓存树的一部分插入到 DOM 中时，它将重新<strong>被激活<strong>。<p><div class=\"composition-api\"><p>一个持续存在的组件可以通过 <a href=\"/api/composition-api-lifecycle.html#onactivated\"><code>onActivated()<code><a> 和 <a href=\"/api/composition-api-lifecycle.html#ondeactivated\"><code>onDeactivated()<code><a> 注册相应的两个状态的生命周期钩子：<p><div class=\"language-vue\"> <span class=\"lang\">vue<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>script<span><span> setup<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/keep-alive.html", "title": "KeepAlive | Vue.js", "doc_id": "0ed3eb096875473899f67dd5967f0acd", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 290, "chunk_index": 17, "_doc_id": "17_981361515142587378"}}
{"doc_id": "18_3124383691955215687", "text": "code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>script<span><span> setup<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>import<span><span> { onActivated, onDeactivated } <span><span>from<span><span> 'vue'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>onActivated<span><span>(() <span><span>=><span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 调用时机为首次挂载<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 以及每次从缓存中被重新插入时<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>})<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/keep-alive.html", "title": "KeepAlive | Vue.js", "doc_id": "0ed3eb096875473899f67dd5967f0acd", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 290, "chunk_index": 18, "_doc_id": "18_3124383691955215687"}}
{"doc_id": "19_6688858546604246095", "text": "an>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 以及每次从缓存中被重新插入时<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>})<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>onDeactivated<span><span>(() <span><span>=><span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 在从 DOM 上移除、进入缓存<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 以及组件卸载时调用<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>})<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/keep-alive.html", "title": "KeepAlive | Vue.js", "doc_id": "0ed3eb096875473899f67dd5967f0acd", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 290, "chunk_index": 19, "_doc_id": "19_6688858546604246095"}}
{"doc_id": "20_119287060650951431", "text": "n><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 以及组件卸载时调用<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>})<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>script<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><div><div class=\"options-api\"><p>一个持续存在的组件可以通过 <a href=\"/api/options-lifecycle.html#activated\"><code>activated<code><a> 和 <a href=\"/api/options-lifecycle.html#deactivated\"><code>deactivated<code><a> 选项来注册相应的两个状态的生命周期钩子：<p><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/keep-alive.html", "title": "KeepAlive | Vue.js", "doc_id": "0ed3eb096875473899f67dd5967f0acd", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 290, "chunk_index": 20, "_doc_id": "20_119287060650951431"}}
{"doc_id": "21_7278274509844647179", "text": "b-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> activated<span><span>() {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 在首次挂载、<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 以及每次从缓存中被重新插入的时候调用<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> },<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> deactivated<span><span>() {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 在从 DOM 上移除、进入缓存<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 以及组件卸载时调用<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/keep-alive.html", "title": "KeepAlive | Vue.js", "doc_id": "0ed3eb096875473899f67dd5967f0acd", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 290, "chunk_index": 21, "_doc_id": "21_7278274509844647179"}}
{"doc_id": "22_4448178115110755540", "text": "ass=\"line\"><span> // 在从 DOM 上移除、进入缓存<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 以及组件卸载时调用<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span><code><pre><div><div><p>请注意：<p>\n<p><strong>参考<strong><p><div><div>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/keep-alive.html", "title": "KeepAlive | Vue.js", "doc_id": "0ed3eb096875473899f67dd5967f0acd", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 290, "chunk_index": 22, "_doc_id": "22_4448178115110755540"}}
{"doc_id": "0_7947830250089872336", "text": "<div><div><h1 id=\"component-events\">组件事件 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#component-events\">​<a><h1><blockquote><p>此章节假设你已经看过了<a href=\"/guide/essentials/component-basics.html\">组件基础<a>。若你还不了解组件是什么，请先阅读该章节。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/events.html", "title": "组件事件", "doc_id": "263cd15e64be462fa8bed43e00f898ad", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 701, "chunk_index": 0, "_doc_id": "0_7947830250089872336"}}
{"doc_id": "1_1925715789069984435", "text": "ckquote><p>此章节假设你已经看过了<a href=\"/guide/essentials/component-basics.html\">组件基础<a>。若你还不了解组件是什么，请先阅读该章节。<p><blockquote><h2 id=\"emitting-and-listening-to-events\">触发与监听事件 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#emitting-and-listening-to-events\">​<a><h2><p>在组件的模板表达式中，可以直接使用 <code>$emit<code> 方法触发自定义事件 (例如：在 <code>v-on<code> 的处理函数中)：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><!-- MyComponent --><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/events.html", "title": "组件事件", "doc_id": "263cd15e64be462fa8bed43e00f898ad", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 701, "chunk_index": 1, "_doc_id": "1_1925715789069984435"}}
{"doc_id": "2_4863483707954186379", "text": "e class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><!-- MyComponent --><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>button<span><span> @<span><span>click<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>$emit<span><span>(<span><span>'someEvent'<span><span>)<span><span>\"<span><span>>Click Me</<span><span>button<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><div class=\"options-api\"><p><code>$emit()<code> 方法在组件实例上也同样以 <code>this.", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/events.html", "title": "组件事件", "doc_id": "263cd15e64be462fa8bed43e00f898ad", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 701, "chunk_index": 2, "_doc_id": "2_4863483707954186379"}}
{"doc_id": "3_5415907077960514517", "text": "<span><span><code><pre><div><div class=\"options-api\"><p><code>$emit()<code> 方法在组件实例上也同样以 <code>this.$emit()<code> 的形式可用：<p><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> methods: {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> submit<span><span>() {<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/events.html", "title": "组件事件", "doc_id": "263cd15e64be462fa8bed43e00f898ad", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 701, "chunk_index": 3, "_doc_id": "3_5415907077960514517"}}
{"doc_id": "4_7622821171873088149", "text": "s=\"line\"><span> methods: {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> submit<span><span>() {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> this<span><span>.<span><span>$emit<span><span>(<span><span>'someEvent'<span><span>)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/events.html", "title": "组件事件", "doc_id": "263cd15e64be462fa8bed43e00f898ad", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 701, "chunk_index": 4, "_doc_id": "4_7622821171873088149"}}
{"doc_id": "5_145154535991486513", "text": "<span>)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span><code><pre><div><div><p>父组件可以通过 <code>v-on<code> (缩写为 <code>@<code>) 来监听事件：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>MyComponent<span><span> @<span><span>some-event<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>callback<span><span>\"<span><span> /><span><span><code><pre><div><p>同样，", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/events.html", "title": "组件事件", "doc_id": "263cd15e64be462fa8bed43e00f898ad", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 701, "chunk_index": 5, "_doc_id": "5_145154535991486513"}}
{"doc_id": "6_7978789133694273960", "text": "pan>=<span><span>\"<span><span>callback<span><span>\"<span><span> /><span><span><code><pre><div><p>同样，组件的事件监听器也支持 <code>.once<code> 修饰符：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>MyComponent<span><span> @<span><span>some-event<span><span>.<span><span>once<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>callback<span><span>\"<span><span> /><span><span><code><pre><div><p>像组件与 prop 一样，事件的名字也提供了自动的格式转换。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/events.html", "title": "组件事件", "doc_id": "263cd15e64be462fa8bed43e00f898ad", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 701, "chunk_index": 6, "_doc_id": "6_7978789133694273960"}}
{"doc_id": "7_8253050367132744660", "text": "an>callback<span><span>\"<span><span> /><span><span><code><pre><div><p>像组件与 prop 一样，事件的名字也提供了自动的格式转换。注意这里我们触发了一个以 camelCase 形式命名的事件，但在父组件中可以使用 kebab-case 形式来监听。与 <a href=\"/guide/components/props.html#prop-name-casing\">prop 大小写格式<a>一样，在模板中我们也推荐使用 kebab-case 形式来编写监听器。<p><div class=\"tip custom-block\"><p class=\"custom-block-title\">TIP<p><p>和原生 DOM 事件不一样，组件触发的事件<strong>没有冒泡机制<strong>。你只能监听直接子组件触发的事件。平级组件或是跨越多层嵌套的组件间通信，应使用一个外部的事件总线，或是使用一个<a href=\"/guide/scaling-up/state-management.html\">全局状态管理方案<a>。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/events.html", "title": "组件事件", "doc_id": "263cd15e64be462fa8bed43e00f898ad", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 701, "chunk_index": 7, "_doc_id": "7_8253050367132744660"}}
{"doc_id": "8_7373248019745001912", "text": "平级组件或是跨越多层嵌套的组件间通信，应使用一个外部的事件总线，或是使用一个<a href=\"/guide/scaling-up/state-management.html\">全局状态管理方案<a>。<p><div><h2 id=\"event-arguments\">事件参数 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#event-arguments\">​<a><h2><p>有时候我们会需要在触发事件时附带一个特定的值。举例来说，我们想要 <code><BlogPost><code> 组件来管理文本会缩放得多大。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/events.html", "title": "组件事件", "doc_id": "263cd15e64be462fa8bed43e00f898ad", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 701, "chunk_index": 8, "_doc_id": "8_7373248019745001912"}}
{"doc_id": "9_12775550530783540", "text": "\"#event-arguments\">​<a><h2><p>有时候我们会需要在触发事件时附带一个特定的值。举例来说，我们想要 <code><BlogPost><code> 组件来管理文本会缩放得多大。在这个场景下，我们可以给 <code>$emit<code> 提供一个额外的参数：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>button<span><span> @<span><span>click<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>$emit<span><span>(<span><span>'increaseBy'<span><span>, <span><span>1<span><span>)<span><span>\"<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/events.html", "title": "组件事件", "doc_id": "263cd15e64be462fa8bed43e00f898ad", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 701, "chunk_index": 9, "_doc_id": "9_12775550530783540"}}
{"doc_id": "10_2227048413351762146", "text": "an><span>'increaseBy'<span><span>, <span><span>1<span><span>)<span><span>\"<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> Increase by 1<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>button<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>然后我们在父组件中监听事件，我们可以先简单写一个内联的箭头函数作为监听器，", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/events.html", "title": "组件事件", "doc_id": "263cd15e64be462fa8bed43e00f898ad", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 701, "chunk_index": 10, "_doc_id": "10_2227048413351762146"}}
{"doc_id": "11_5357161121192202842", "text": "/<span><span>button<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>然后我们在父组件中监听事件，我们可以先简单写一个内联的箭头函数作为监听器，此函数会接收到事件附带的参数：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>MyButton<span><span> @<span><span>increase-by<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>(<span><span>n<span><span>) <span><span>=><span><span> count <span><span>+=<span><span> n<span><span>\"<span><span> /><span><span><code><pre><div><p>或者，", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/events.html", "title": "组件事件", "doc_id": "263cd15e64be462fa8bed43e00f898ad", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 701, "chunk_index": 11, "_doc_id": "11_5357161121192202842"}}
{"doc_id": "12_5537785689500618589", "text": "an> count <span><span>+=<span><span> n<span><span>\"<span><span> /><span><span><code><pre><div><p>或者，也可以用一个组件方法来作为事件处理函数：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>MyButton<span><span> @<span><span>increase-by<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>increaseCount<span><span>\"<span><span> /><span><span><code><pre><div><p>该方法也会接收到事件所传递的参数：<p><div class=\"options-api\"><div class=\"language-js\"> <span", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/events.html", "title": "组件事件", "doc_id": "263cd15e64be462fa8bed43e00f898ad", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 701, "chunk_index": 12, "_doc_id": "12_5537785689500618589"}}
{"doc_id": "13_4648013114658377461", "text": "pan><code><pre><div><p>该方法也会接收到事件所传递的参数：<p><div class=\"options-api\"><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>methods<span><span>: {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> increaseCount<span><span>(n) {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> this<span><span>.count <span><span>+=<span><span> n<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/events.html", "title": "组件事件", "doc_id": "263cd15e64be462fa8bed43e00f898ad", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 701, "chunk_index": 13, "_doc_id": "13_4648013114658377461"}}
{"doc_id": "14_1220008093612350568", "text": "<span><span>.count <span><span>+=<span><span> n<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span><code><pre><div><div><div class=\"composition-api\"><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>function<span><span> increaseCount<span><span>(<span><span>n<span><span>) {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> count.value <span><span>+=<span><span> n<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/events.html", "title": "组件事件", "doc_id": "263cd15e64be462fa8bed43e00f898ad", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 701, "chunk_index": 14, "_doc_id": "14_1220008093612350568"}}
{"doc_id": "15_2052206382301511491", "text": "span>) {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> count.value <span><span>+=<span><span> n<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span><code><pre><div><div><div class=\"tip custom-block\"><p class=\"custom-block-title\">TIP<p><p>所有传入 <code>$emit()<code> 的额外参数都会被直接传向监听器。举例来说，<code>$emit('foo', 1, 2, 3)<code> 触发后，监听器函数将会收到这三个参数值。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/events.html", "title": "组件事件", "doc_id": "263cd15e64be462fa8bed43e00f898ad", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 701, "chunk_index": 15, "_doc_id": "15_2052206382301511491"}}
{"doc_id": "16_1609338186950525833", "text": "所有传入 <code>$emit()<code> 的额外参数都会被直接传向监听器。举例来说，<code>$emit('foo', 1, 2, 3)<code> 触发后，监听器函数将会收到这三个参数值。<p><div><h2 id=\"declaring-emitted-events\">声明触发的事件 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#declaring-emitted-events\">​<a><h2><p>组件可以显式地通过 <span class=\"composition-api\"><a href=\"/api/sfc-script-setup.html#defineprops-defineemits\"><code>defineEmits()<code><a> 宏<span><span class=\"options-api\"><a href=\"/api/options-state.", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/events.html", "title": "组件事件", "doc_id": "263cd15e64be462fa8bed43e00f898ad", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 701, "chunk_index": 16, "_doc_id": "16_1609338186950525833"}}
{"doc_id": "17_4545276332320757040", "text": "ineemits\"><code>defineEmits()<code><a> 宏<span><span class=\"options-api\"><a href=\"/api/options-state.html#emits\"><code>emits<code><a> 选项<span>来声明它要触发的事件：<p><div class=\"composition-api\"><div class=\"language-vue\"> <span class=\"lang\">vue<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>script<span><span> setup<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>defineEmits<span><span>([<span><span>'inFocus'<span><span>, <span><span>'submit'<span><span>])<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/events.html", "title": "组件事件", "doc_id": "263cd15e64be462fa8bed43e00f898ad", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 701, "chunk_index": 17, "_doc_id": "17_4545276332320757040"}}
{"doc_id": "18_2214634513545731065", "text": "mits<span><span>([<span><span>'inFocus'<span><span>, <span><span>'submit'<span><span>])<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>script<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>我们在 <code><template><code> 中使用的 <code>$emit<code> 方法不能在组件的 <code><script setup><code> 部分中使用，但 <code>defineEmits()<code> 会返回一个相同作用的函数供我们使用：<p><div class=\"language-vue\"> <span class=\"lang\">vue<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>script<span><span> setup<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/events.html", "title": "组件事件", "doc_id": "263cd15e64be462fa8bed43e00f898ad", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 701, "chunk_index": 18, "_doc_id": "18_2214634513545731065"}}
{"doc_id": "19_6001830829379809830", "text": "code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>script<span><span> setup<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> emit<span><span> =<span><span> defineEmits<span><span>([<span><span>'inFocus'<span><span>, <span><span>'submit'<span><span>])<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>function<span><span> buttonClick<span><span>() {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> emit<span><span>(<span><span>'submit'<span><span>)<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/events.html", "title": "组件事件", "doc_id": "263cd15e64be462fa8bed43e00f898ad", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 701, "chunk_index": 19, "_doc_id": "19_6001830829379809830"}}
{"doc_id": "20_875866210064375680", "text": "pan><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> emit<span><span>(<span><span>'submit'<span><span>)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>script<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p><code>defineEmits()<code> 宏<strong>不能<strong>在子函数中使用。如上所示，它必须直接放置在 <code><script setup><code> 的顶级作用域下。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/events.html", "title": "组件事件", "doc_id": "263cd15e64be462fa8bed43e00f898ad", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 701, "chunk_index": 20, "_doc_id": "20_875866210064375680"}}
{"doc_id": "21_734417910248621867", "text": "ode>defineEmits()<code> 宏<strong>不能<strong>在子函数中使用。如上所示，它必须直接放置在 <code><script setup><code> 的顶级作用域下。<p><p>如果你显式地使用了 <code>setup<code> 函数而不是 <code><script setup><code>，则事件需要通过 <a href=\"/api/options-state.html#emits\"><code>emits<code><a> 选项来定义，<code>emit<code> 函数也被暴露在 <code>setup()<code> 的上下文对象上：<p><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/events.html", "title": "组件事件", "doc_id": "263cd15e64be462fa8bed43e00f898ad", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 701, "chunk_index": 21, "_doc_id": "21_734417910248621867"}}
{"doc_id": "22_6950238574499859797", "text": "b-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> emits: [<span><span>'inFocus'<span><span>, <span><span>'submit'<span><span>],<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> setup<span><span>(<span><span>props<span><span>, <span><span>ctx<span><span>) {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> ctx.<span><span>emit<span><span>(<span><span>'submit'<span><span>)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/events.html", "title": "组件事件", "doc_id": "263cd15e64be462fa8bed43e00f898ad", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 701, "chunk_index": 22, "_doc_id": "22_6950238574499859797"}}
{"doc_id": "23_8402321463437163834", "text": "t<span><span>(<span><span>'submit'<span><span>)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span><code><pre><div><p>与 <code>setup()<code> 上下文对象中的其他属性一样，<code>emit<code> 可以安全地被解构：<p><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/events.html", "title": "组件事件", "doc_id": "263cd15e64be462fa8bed43e00f898ad", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 701, "chunk_index": 23, "_doc_id": "23_8402321463437163834"}}
{"doc_id": "24_7904565311737105680", "text": "b-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> emits: [<span><span>'inFocus'<span><span>, <span><span>'submit'<span><span>],<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> setup<span><span>(<span><span>props<span><span>, { <span><span>emit<span><span> }) {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> emit<span><span>(<span><span>'submit'<span><span>)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/events.html", "title": "组件事件", "doc_id": "263cd15e64be462fa8bed43e00f898ad", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 701, "chunk_index": 24, "_doc_id": "24_7904565311737105680"}}
{"doc_id": "25_3967613753333422048", "text": "t<span><span>(<span><span>'submit'<span><span>)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span><code><pre><div><div><div class=\"options-api\"><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> emits: [<span><span>'inFocus'<span><span>, <span><span>'submit'<span><span>]<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/events.html", "title": "组件事件", "doc_id": "263cd15e64be462fa8bed43e00f898ad", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 701, "chunk_index": 25, "_doc_id": "25_3967613753333422048"}}
{"doc_id": "26_3547581837318075936", "text": "ne\"><span> emits: [<span><span>'inFocus'<span><span>, <span><span>'submit'<span><span>]<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span><code><pre><div><div><p>这个 <code>emits<code> 选项和 <code>defineEmits()<code> 宏还支持对象语法。通过 TypeScript 为参数指定类型，它允许我们对触发事件的参数进行验证：<p><div class=\"composition-api\"><div class=\"language-vue\"> <span class=\"lang\">vue<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>script<span><span> setup<span><span> lang<span><span>=<span><span>\"ts\"<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/events.html", "title": "组件事件", "doc_id": "263cd15e64be462fa8bed43e00f898ad", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 701, "chunk_index": 26, "_doc_id": "26_3547581837318075936"}}
{"doc_id": "27_2172347180685892412", "text": "pan>script<span><span> setup<span><span> lang<span><span>=<span><span>\"ts\"<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> emit<span><span> =<span><span> defineEmits<span><span>({<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> submit<span><span>(<span><span>payload<span><span>:<span><span> { <span><span>email<span><span>:<span><span> string<span><span>, <span><span>password<span><span>:<span><span> string<span><span> }) {<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/events.html", "title": "组件事件", "doc_id": "263cd15e64be462fa8bed43e00f898ad", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 701, "chunk_index": 27, "_doc_id": "27_2172347180685892412"}}
{"doc_id": "28_8388432751134898997", "text": "ring<span><span>, <span><span>password<span><span>:<span><span> string<span><span> }) {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 通过返回值为 `true` 还是为 `false` 来判断<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 验证是否通过<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>})<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/events.html", "title": "组件事件", "doc_id": "263cd15e64be462fa8bed43e00f898ad", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 701, "chunk_index": 28, "_doc_id": "28_8388432751134898997"}}
{"doc_id": "29_8064531861643924510", "text": "验证是否通过<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>})<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>script<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>如果你正在搭配 TypeScript 使用 <code><script setup><code>，也可以使用纯类型标注来声明触发的事件：<p><div class=\"language-vue\"> <span class=\"lang\">vue<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>script<span><span> setup<span><span> lang<span><span>=<span><span>\"ts\"<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/events.html", "title": "组件事件", "doc_id": "263cd15e64be462fa8bed43e00f898ad", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 701, "chunk_index": 29, "_doc_id": "29_8064531861643924510"}}
{"doc_id": "30_281181796724375801", "text": "pan>script<span><span> setup<span><span> lang<span><span>=<span><span>\"ts\"<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> emit<span><span> =<span><span> defineEmits<span><span><{<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> (<span><span>e<span><span>:<span><span> 'change'<span><span>, <span><span>id<span><span>:<span><span> number<span><span>)<span><span>:<span><span> void<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/events.html", "title": "组件事件", "doc_id": "263cd15e64be462fa8bed43e00f898ad", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 701, "chunk_index": 30, "_doc_id": "30_281181796724375801"}}
{"doc_id": "31_487354661756935893", "text": "pan><span>id<span><span>:<span><span> number<span><span>)<span><span>:<span><span> void<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> (<span><span>e<span><span>:<span><span> 'update'<span><span>, <span><span>value<span><span>:<span><span> string<span><span>)<span><span>:<span><span> void<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}>()<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/events.html", "title": "组件事件", "doc_id": "263cd15e64be462fa8bed43e00f898ad", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 701, "chunk_index": 31, "_doc_id": "31_487354661756935893"}}
