{"doc_id": "33_8980210595037744559", "text": "b-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> emits: {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> submit<span><span>(<span><span>payload<span><span>:<span><span> { <span><span>email<span><span>:<span><span> string<span><span>, <span><span>password<span><span>:<span><span> string<span><span> }) {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 通过返回值为 `true` 还是为 `false` 来判断<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 验证是否通过<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/events.html", "title": "组件事件", "doc_id": "263cd15e64be462fa8bed43e00f898ad", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 701, "chunk_index": 33, "_doc_id": "33_8980210595037744559"}}
{"doc_id": "34_3879180586265776235", "text": "<span> // 通过返回值为 `true` 还是为 `false` 来判断<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 验证是否通过<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span><code><pre><div><p>TypeScript 用户请参考：<a href=\"/guide/typescript/options-api.html#typing-component-emits\">如何为组件所抛出的事件标注类型<a>。 <p><div><p>尽管事件声明是可选的，我们还是推荐你完整地声明所有要触发的事件，以此在代码中作为文档记录组件的用法。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/events.html", "title": "组件事件", "doc_id": "263cd15e64be462fa8bed43e00f898ad", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 701, "chunk_index": 34, "_doc_id": "34_3879180586265776235"}}
{"doc_id": "35_1996700548555534793", "text": "g-component-emits\">如何为组件所抛出的事件标注类型<a>。 <p><div><p>尽管事件声明是可选的，我们还是推荐你完整地声明所有要触发的事件，以此在代码中作为文档记录组件的用法。同时，事件声明能让 Vue 更好地将事件和<a href=\"/guide/components/attrs.html#v-on-listener-inheritance\">透传 attribute<a> 作出区分，从而避免一些由第三方代码触发的自定义 DOM 事件所导致的边界情况。<p><div class=\"tip custom-block\"><p class=\"custom-block-title\">TIP<p><p>如果一个原生事件的名字 (例如 <code>click<code>) 被定义在 <code>emits<code> 选项中，则监听器只会监听组件触发的 <code>click<code> 事件而不会再响应原生的 <code>click<code> 事件。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/events.html", "title": "组件事件", "doc_id": "263cd15e64be462fa8bed43e00f898ad", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 701, "chunk_index": 35, "_doc_id": "35_1996700548555534793"}}
{"doc_id": "36_1863216110543544776", "text": "<code>) 被定义在 <code>emits<code> 选项中，则监听器只会监听组件触发的 <code>click<code> 事件而不会再响应原生的 <code>click<code> 事件。<p><div><h2 id=\"events-validation\">事件校验 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#events-validation\">​<a><h2><p>和对 props 添加类型校验的方式类似，所有触发的事件也可以使用对象形式来描述。<p><p>要为事件添加校验，那么事件可以被赋值为一个函数，接受的参数就是抛出事件时传入 <span class=\"options-api\"><code>this.$emit<code><span><span class=\"composition-api\"><code>emit<code><span> 的内容，返回一个布尔值来表明事件是否合法。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/events.html", "title": "组件事件", "doc_id": "263cd15e64be462fa8bed43e00f898ad", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 701, "chunk_index": 36, "_doc_id": "36_1863216110543544776"}}
{"doc_id": "37_847069264854407687", "text": "ode>this.$emit<code><span><span class=\"composition-api\"><code>emit<code><span> 的内容，返回一个布尔值来表明事件是否合法。<p><div class=\"composition-api\"><div class=\"language-vue\"> <span class=\"lang\">vue<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>script<span><span> setup<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> emit<span><span> =<span><span> defineEmits<span><span>({<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 没有校验<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/events.html", "title": "组件事件", "doc_id": "263cd15e64be462fa8bed43e00f898ad", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 701, "chunk_index": 37, "_doc_id": "37_847069264854407687"}}
{"doc_id": "38_5030646408278340754", "text": "> =<span><span> defineEmits<span><span>({<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 没有校验<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> click: <span><span>null<span><span>,<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 校验 submit 事件<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> submit<span><span>: ({ <span><span>email<span><span>, <span><span>password<span><span> }) <span><span>=><span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> if<span><span> (email <span><span>&&<span><span> password) {<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/events.html", "title": "组件事件", "doc_id": "263cd15e64be462fa8bed43e00f898ad", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 701, "chunk_index": 38, "_doc_id": "38_5030646408278340754"}}
{"doc_id": "39_6068873729474119671", "text": "<span class=\"line\"><span> if<span><span> (email <span><span>&&<span><span> password) {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> return<span><span> true<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> } <span><span>else<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> console.<span><span>warn<span><span>(<span><span>'Invalid submit event payload!'<span><span>)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> return<span><span> false<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/events.html", "title": "组件事件", "doc_id": "263cd15e64be462fa8bed43e00f898ad", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 701, "chunk_index": 39, "_doc_id": "39_6068873729474119671"}}
{"doc_id": "40_2909335485730947610", "text": "> false<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>})<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>function<span><span> submitForm<span><span>(<span><span>email<span><span>, <span><span>password<span><span>) {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> emit<span><span>(<span><span>'submit'<span><span>, { email, password })<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/events.html", "title": "组件事件", "doc_id": "263cd15e64be462fa8bed43e00f898ad", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 701, "chunk_index": 40, "_doc_id": "40_2909335485730947610"}}
{"doc_id": "41_620792350015689225", "text": "<span>'submit'<span><span>, { email, password })<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>script<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><div><div class=\"options-api\"><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> emits: {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 没有校验<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/events.html", "title": "组件事件", "doc_id": "263cd15e64be462fa8bed43e00f898ad", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 701, "chunk_index": 41, "_doc_id": "41_620792350015689225"}}
{"doc_id": "42_4230916275839323949", "text": "<span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> emits: {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 没有校验<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> click: <span><span>null<span><span>,<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 校验 submit 事件<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> submit<span><span>: ({ <span><span>email<span><span>, <span><span>password<span><span> }) <span><span>=><span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> if<span><span> (email <span><span>&&<span><span> password) {<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/events.html", "title": "组件事件", "doc_id": "263cd15e64be462fa8bed43e00f898ad", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 701, "chunk_index": 42, "_doc_id": "42_4230916275839323949"}}
{"doc_id": "43_6068873729474119671", "text": "<span class=\"line\"><span> if<span><span> (email <span><span>&&<span><span> password) {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> return<span><span> true<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> } <span><span>else<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> console.<span><span>warn<span><span>(<span><span>'Invalid submit event payload!'<span><span>)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> return<span><span> false<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/events.html", "title": "组件事件", "doc_id": "263cd15e64be462fa8bed43e00f898ad", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 701, "chunk_index": 43, "_doc_id": "43_6068873729474119671"}}
{"doc_id": "44_7690283179693454634", "text": "> false<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> },<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> methods: {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> submitForm<span><span>(<span><span>email<span><span>, <span><span>password<span><span>) {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> this<span><span>.<span><span>$emit<span><span>(<span><span>'submit'<span><span>, { email, password })<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/events.html", "title": "组件事件", "doc_id": "263cd15e64be462fa8bed43e00f898ad", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 701, "chunk_index": 44, "_doc_id": "44_7690283179693454634"}}
{"doc_id": "45_3135628071287955309", "text": "span>'submit'<span><span>, { email, password })<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span><code><pre><div><div><div><div>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/events.html", "title": "组件事件", "doc_id": "263cd15e64be462fa8bed43e00f898ad", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 701, "chunk_index": 45, "_doc_id": "45_3135628071287955309"}}
{"doc_id": "0_1872354660258675435", "text": "<div><div><h1 id=\"teleport\">Teleport <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#teleport\">​<a><h1><p><code><Teleport><code> 是一个内置组件，它可以将一个组件内部的一部分模板“传送”到该组件的 DOM 结构外层的位置去。<p><h2 id=\"basic-usage\">基本用法 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#basic-usage\">​<a><h2><p>有时我们可能会遇到这样的场景：一个组件模板的一部分在逻辑上从属于该组件，但从整个应用视图的角度来看，它在 DOM 中应该被渲染在其他地方，甚至在整个 Vue 应用外部。<p><p>这类场景最常见的例子就是全屏的模态框。理想情况下，我们希望触发模态框的按钮和模态框本身的代码是在同一个单文件组件中，因为它们都与组件的开关状态有关。但这意味着该模态框将与按钮一起渲染在应用 DOM 结构里很深的地方。这会导致该模态框的 CSS 布局代码很难写。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/teleport.html", "title": "Teleport | Vue.js", "doc_id": "55a1dbf613604e1796aa7a6215061019", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 499, "chunk_index": 0, "_doc_id": "0_1872354660258675435"}}
{"doc_id": "1_8197479905737174282", "text": "发模态框的按钮和模态框本身的代码是在同一个单文件组件中，因为它们都与组件的开关状态有关。但这意味着该模态框将与按钮一起渲染在应用 DOM 结构里很深的地方。这会导致该模态框的 CSS 布局代码很难写。<p><p>试想下面这样的 HTML 结构：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>div<span><span> class<span><span>=<span><span>\"outer\"<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>h3<span><span>>Tooltips with Vue 3 Teleport</<span><span>h3<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/teleport.html", "title": "Teleport | Vue.js", "doc_id": "55a1dbf613604e1796aa7a6215061019", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 499, "chunk_index": 1, "_doc_id": "1_8197479905737174282"}}
{"doc_id": "2_3261222381242028904", "text": "> <<span><span>h3<span><span>>Tooltips with Vue 3 Teleport</<span><span>h3<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>div<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>MyModal<span><span> /><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> </<span><span>div<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/teleport.html", "title": "Teleport | Vue.js", "doc_id": "55a1dbf613604e1796aa7a6215061019", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 499, "chunk_index": 2, "_doc_id": "2_3261222381242028904"}}
{"doc_id": "3_8579725532235724701", "text": "dal<span><span> /><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> </<span><span>div<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>div<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>接下来我们来看看 <code><MyModal><code> 的实现：<p><div class=\"composition-api\"><div class=\"language-vue\"> <span class=\"lang\">vue<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>script<span><span> setup<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/teleport.html", "title": "Teleport | Vue.js", "doc_id": "55a1dbf613604e1796aa7a6215061019", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 499, "chunk_index": 3, "_doc_id": "3_8579725532235724701"}}
{"doc_id": "4_7314357496413587111", "text": "code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>script<span><span> setup<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>import<span><span> { ref } <span><span>from<span><span> 'vue'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> open<span><span> =<span><span> ref<span><span>(<span><span>false<span><span>)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>script<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/teleport.html", "title": "Teleport | Vue.js", "doc_id": "55a1dbf613604e1796aa7a6215061019", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 499, "chunk_index": 4, "_doc_id": "4_7314357496413587111"}}
{"doc_id": "5_3803937200978341222", "text": "n>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>script<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>button<span><span> @click<span><span>=<span><span>\"open = true\"<span><span>>Open Modal</<span><span>button<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/teleport.html", "title": "Teleport | Vue.js", "doc_id": "55a1dbf613604e1796aa7a6215061019", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 499, "chunk_index": 5, "_doc_id": "5_3803937200978341222"}}
{"doc_id": "6_4030246923630153211", "text": "true\"<span><span>>Open Modal</<span><span>button<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>div<span><span> v-if<span><span>=<span><span>\"open\"<span><span> class<span><span>=<span><span>\"modal\"<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>p<span><span>>Hello from the modal!</<span><span>p<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/teleport.html", "title": "Teleport | Vue.js", "doc_id": "55a1dbf613604e1796aa7a6215061019", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 499, "chunk_index": 6, "_doc_id": "6_4030246923630153211"}}
{"doc_id": "7_8838074581535168165", "text": "ne\"><span> <<span><span>p<span><span>>Hello from the modal!</<span><span>p<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>button<span><span> @click<span><span>=<span><span>\"open = false\"<span><span>>Close</<span><span>button<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> </<span><span>div<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/teleport.html", "title": "Teleport | Vue.js", "doc_id": "55a1dbf613604e1796aa7a6215061019", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 499, "chunk_index": 7, "_doc_id": "7_8838074581535168165"}}
{"doc_id": "8_4299088596187064994", "text": "<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>style<span><span> scoped<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>.modal<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> position<span><span>: <span><span>fixed<span><span>;<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> z-index<span><span>: <span><span>999<span><span>;<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/teleport.html", "title": "Teleport | Vue.js", "doc_id": "55a1dbf613604e1796aa7a6215061019", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 499, "chunk_index": 8, "_doc_id": "8_4299088596187064994"}}
{"doc_id": "9_5276304524727516728", "text": "span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> z-index<span><span>: <span><span>999<span><span>;<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> top<span><span>: <span><span>20<span><span>%<span><span>;<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> left<span><span>: <span><span>50<span><span>%<span><span>;<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> width<span><span>: <span><span>300<span><span>px<span><span>;<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> margin-left<span><span>: <span><span>-150<span><span>px<span><span>;<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/teleport.html", "title": "Teleport | Vue.js", "doc_id": "55a1dbf613604e1796aa7a6215061019", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 499, "chunk_index": 9, "_doc_id": "9_5276304524727516728"}}
{"doc_id": "10_71348080732568545", "text": "lass=\"line\"><span> margin-left<span><span>: <span><span>-150<span><span>px<span><span>;<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>style<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><div><div class=\"options-api\"><div class=\"language-vue\"> <span class=\"lang\">vue<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>script<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/teleport.html", "title": "Teleport | Vue.js", "doc_id": "55a1dbf613604e1796aa7a6215061019", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 499, "chunk_index": 10, "_doc_id": "10_71348080732568545"}}
{"doc_id": "11_2892142143987484528", "text": "n><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> data<span><span>() {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> return<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> open: <span><span>false<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>script<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/teleport.html", "title": "Teleport | Vue.js", "doc_id": "55a1dbf613604e1796aa7a6215061019", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 499, "chunk_index": 11, "_doc_id": "11_2892142143987484528"}}
{"doc_id": "12_3803937200978341222", "text": "n>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>script<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>button<span><span> @click<span><span>=<span><span>\"open = true\"<span><span>>Open Modal</<span><span>button<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/teleport.html", "title": "Teleport | Vue.js", "doc_id": "55a1dbf613604e1796aa7a6215061019", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 499, "chunk_index": 12, "_doc_id": "12_3803937200978341222"}}
{"doc_id": "13_4030246923630153211", "text": "true\"<span><span>>Open Modal</<span><span>button<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>div<span><span> v-if<span><span>=<span><span>\"open\"<span><span> class<span><span>=<span><span>\"modal\"<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>p<span><span>>Hello from the modal!</<span><span>p<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/teleport.html", "title": "Teleport | Vue.js", "doc_id": "55a1dbf613604e1796aa7a6215061019", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 499, "chunk_index": 13, "_doc_id": "13_4030246923630153211"}}
{"doc_id": "14_8838074581535168165", "text": "ne\"><span> <<span><span>p<span><span>>Hello from the modal!</<span><span>p<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>button<span><span> @click<span><span>=<span><span>\"open = false\"<span><span>>Close</<span><span>button<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> </<span><span>div<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/teleport.html", "title": "Teleport | Vue.js", "doc_id": "55a1dbf613604e1796aa7a6215061019", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 499, "chunk_index": 14, "_doc_id": "14_8838074581535168165"}}
{"doc_id": "15_4299088596187064994", "text": "<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>style<span><span> scoped<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>.modal<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> position<span><span>: <span><span>fixed<span><span>;<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> z-index<span><span>: <span><span>999<span><span>;<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/teleport.html", "title": "Teleport | Vue.js", "doc_id": "55a1dbf613604e1796aa7a6215061019", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 499, "chunk_index": 15, "_doc_id": "15_4299088596187064994"}}
{"doc_id": "16_5276304524727516728", "text": "span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> z-index<span><span>: <span><span>999<span><span>;<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> top<span><span>: <span><span>20<span><span>%<span><span>;<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> left<span><span>: <span><span>50<span><span>%<span><span>;<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> width<span><span>: <span><span>300<span><span>px<span><span>;<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> margin-left<span><span>: <span><span>-150<span><span>px<span><span>;<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/teleport.html", "title": "Teleport | Vue.js", "doc_id": "55a1dbf613604e1796aa7a6215061019", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 499, "chunk_index": 16, "_doc_id": "16_5276304524727516728"}}
{"doc_id": "17_2138541593701655148", "text": "lass=\"line\"><span> margin-left<span><span>: <span><span>-150<span><span>px<span><span>;<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>style<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><div><p>这个组件中有一个 <code><button><code> 按钮来触发打开模态框，和一个 class 名为 <code>.modal<code> 的 <code><div><code>，它包含了模态框的内容和一个用来关闭的按钮。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/teleport.html", "title": "Teleport | Vue.js", "doc_id": "55a1dbf613604e1796aa7a6215061019", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 499, "chunk_index": 17, "_doc_id": "17_2138541593701655148"}}
{"doc_id": "18_4103088448465787159", "text": "><button><code> 按钮来触发打开模态框，和一个 class 名为 <code>.modal<code> 的 <code><div><code>，它包含了模态框的内容和一个用来关闭的按钮。<p><p>当在初始 HTML 结构中使用这个组件时，会有一些潜在的问题：<p><ul><li><p><code>position: fixed<code> 能够相对于浏览器窗口放置有一个条件，那就是不能有任何祖先元素设置了 <code>transform<code>、<code>perspective<code> 或者 <code>filter<code> 样式属性。也就是说如果我们想要用 CSS <code>transform<code> 为祖先节点 <code><div class=\"outer\"><code> 设置动画，就会不小心破坏模态框的布局！<p><li><li><p>这个模态框的 <code>z-index<code> 受限于它的容器元素。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/teleport.html", "title": "Teleport | Vue.js", "doc_id": "55a1dbf613604e1796aa7a6215061019", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 499, "chunk_index": 18, "_doc_id": "18_4103088448465787159"}}
{"doc_id": "19_7277594916299547876", "text": "ode><div class=\"outer\"><code> 设置动画，就会不小心破坏模态框的布局！<p><li><li><p>这个模态框的 <code>z-index<code> 受限于它的容器元素。如果有其他元素与 <code><div class=\"outer\"><code> 重叠并有更高的 <code>z-index<code>，则它会覆盖住我们的模态框。<p><li><ul><p><code><Teleport><code> 提供了一个更简单的方式来解决此类问题，让我们不需要再顾虑 DOM 结构的问题。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/teleport.html", "title": "Teleport | Vue.js", "doc_id": "55a1dbf613604e1796aa7a6215061019", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 499, "chunk_index": 19, "_doc_id": "19_7277594916299547876"}}
{"doc_id": "20_63204550681915483", "text": "ndex<code>，则它会覆盖住我们的模态框。<p><li><ul><p><code><Teleport><code> 提供了一个更简单的方式来解决此类问题，让我们不需要再顾虑 DOM 结构的问题。让我们用 <code><Teleport><code> 改写一下 <code><MyModal><code>：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>button<span><span> @<span><span>click<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>open <span><span>=<span><span> true<span><span>\"<span><span>>Open Modal</<span><span>button<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/teleport.html", "title": "Teleport | Vue.js", "doc_id": "55a1dbf613604e1796aa7a6215061019", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 499, "chunk_index": 20, "_doc_id": "20_63204550681915483"}}
{"doc_id": "21_6115896099899045788", "text": "=<span><span> true<span><span>\"<span><span>>Open Modal</<span><span>button<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line highlighted\"><span><<span><span>Teleport<span><span> to<span><span>=<span><span>\"body\"<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>div<span><span> v-if<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>open<span><span>\"<span><span> class<span><span>=<span><span>\"modal\"<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/teleport.html", "title": "Teleport | Vue.js", "doc_id": "55a1dbf613604e1796aa7a6215061019", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 499, "chunk_index": 21, "_doc_id": "21_6115896099899045788"}}
{"doc_id": "22_1931816876576135088", "text": "><span>open<span><span>\"<span><span> class<span><span>=<span><span>\"modal\"<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>p<span><span>>Hello from the modal!</<span><span>p<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>button<span><span> @<span><span>click<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>open <span><span>=<span><span> false<span><span>\"<span><span>>Close</<span><span>button<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> </<span><span>div<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/teleport.html", "title": "Teleport | Vue.js", "doc_id": "55a1dbf613604e1796aa7a6215061019", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 499, "chunk_index": 22, "_doc_id": "22_1931816876576135088"}}
{"doc_id": "23_2473442268127090519", "text": "utton<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> </<span><span>div<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line highlighted\"><span></<span><span>Teleport<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p><code><Teleport><code> 接收一个 <code>to<code> prop 来指定传送的目标。<code>to<code> 的值可以是一个 CSS 选择器字符串，也可以是一个 DOM 元素对象。这段代码的作用就是告诉 Vue“把以下模板片段<strong>传送到 <code>body<code><strong> 标签下”。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/teleport.html", "title": "Teleport | Vue.js", "doc_id": "55a1dbf613604e1796aa7a6215061019", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 499, "chunk_index": 23, "_doc_id": "23_2473442268127090519"}}
{"doc_id": "24_3336211715893338750", "text": "的值可以是一个 CSS 选择器字符串，也可以是一个 DOM 元素对象。这段代码的作用就是告诉 Vue“把以下模板片段<strong>传送到 <code>body<code><strong> 标签下”。<p><p>你可以点击下面这个按钮，然后通过浏览器的开发者工具，在 <code><body><code> 标签下找到模态框元素：<p><p class=\"demo\"> Open Modal <p><p>我们也可以将 <code><Teleport><code> 和 <a href=\"./transition.html\"><code><Transition><code><a> 结合使用来创建一个带动画的模态框。你可以看看<a href=\"/examples/#modal\">这个示例<a>。<p><div class=\"tip custom-block\"><p class=\"custom-block-title\">TIP<p><p><code><Teleport><code> 挂载时，传送的 <code>to<code> 目标必须已经存在于 DOM 中。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/teleport.html", "title": "Teleport | Vue.js", "doc_id": "55a1dbf613604e1796aa7a6215061019", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 499, "chunk_index": 24, "_doc_id": "24_3336211715893338750"}}
{"doc_id": "25_2760063786951050267", "text": "p class=\"custom-block-title\">TIP<p><p><code><Teleport><code> 挂载时，传送的 <code>to<code> 目标必须已经存在于 DOM 中。理想情况下，这应该是整个 Vue 应用 DOM 树外部的一个元素。如果目标元素也是由 Vue 渲染的，你需要确保在挂载 <code><Teleport><code> 之前先挂载该元素。<p><div><h2 id=\"using-with-components\">搭配组件使用 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#using-with-components\">​<a><h2><p><code><Teleport><code> 只改变了渲染的 DOM 结构，它不会影响组件间的逻辑关系。也就是说，如果 <code><Teleport><code> 包含了一个组件，那么该组件始终和这个使用了 <code><Teleport><code> 的组件保持逻辑上的父子关系。传入的 props 和触发的事件也会照常工作。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/teleport.html", "title": "Teleport | Vue.js", "doc_id": "55a1dbf613604e1796aa7a6215061019", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 499, "chunk_index": 25, "_doc_id": "25_2760063786951050267"}}
{"doc_id": "26_8311015158220981121", "text": "><Teleport><code> 包含了一个组件，那么该组件始终和这个使用了 <code><Teleport><code> 的组件保持逻辑上的父子关系。传入的 props 和触发的事件也会照常工作。<p><p>这也意味着来自父组件的注入也会按预期工作，子组件将在 Vue Devtools 中嵌套在父级组件下面，而不是放在实际内容移动到的地方。<p><h2 id=\"disabling-teleport\">禁用 Teleport <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#disabling-teleport\">​<a><h2><p>在某些场景下可能需要视情况禁用 <code><Teleport><code>。举例来说，我们想要在桌面端将一个组件当做浮层来渲染，但在移动端则当作行内组件。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/teleport.html", "title": "Teleport | Vue.js", "doc_id": "55a1dbf613604e1796aa7a6215061019", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 499, "chunk_index": 26, "_doc_id": "26_8311015158220981121"}}
{"doc_id": "27_382597706747285377", "text": "-teleport\">​<a><h2><p>在某些场景下可能需要视情况禁用 <code><Teleport><code>。举例来说，我们想要在桌面端将一个组件当做浮层来渲染，但在移动端则当作行内组件。我们可以通过对 <code><Teleport><code> 动态地传入一个 <code>disabled<code> prop 来处理这两种不同情况：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>Teleport<span><span> :<span><span>disabled<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>isMobile<span><span>\"<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> ...<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/teleport.html", "title": "Teleport | Vue.js", "doc_id": "55a1dbf613604e1796aa7a6215061019", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 499, "chunk_index": 27, "_doc_id": "27_382597706747285377"}}
{"doc_id": "28_770564375134674489", "text": "span><span>isMobile<span><span>\"<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> ...<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>Teleport<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>然后我们可以动态地更新 <code>isMobile<code>。<p><h2 id=\"multiple-teleports-on-the-same-target\">多个 Teleport 共享目标 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#multiple-teleports-on-the-same-target\">​<a><h2><p>一个可重用的 <code><Modal><code> 组件可能同时存在多个实例。对于此类场景，多个 <code><Teleport><code> 组件可以将其内容挂载在同一个目标元素上，而顺序就是简单的顺次追加，后挂载的将排在目标元素下更后面的位置上，但都在目标元素中。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/teleport.html", "title": "Teleport | Vue.js", "doc_id": "55a1dbf613604e1796aa7a6215061019", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 499, "chunk_index": 28, "_doc_id": "28_770564375134674489"}}
{"doc_id": "29_2245584490002913250", "text": "多个实例。对于此类场景，多个 <code><Teleport><code> 组件可以将其内容挂载在同一个目标元素上，而顺序就是简单的顺次追加，后挂载的将排在目标元素下更后面的位置上，但都在目标元素中。<p><p>比如下面这样的用例：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>Teleport<span><span> to<span><span>=<span><span>\"#modals\"<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>div<span><span>>A</<span><span>div<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/teleport.html", "title": "Teleport | Vue.js", "doc_id": "55a1dbf613604e1796aa7a6215061019", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 499, "chunk_index": 29, "_doc_id": "29_2245584490002913250"}}
{"doc_id": "30_2657427322557772266", "text": "<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>div<span><span>>A</<span><span>div<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>Teleport<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>Teleport<span><span> to<span><span>=<span><span>\"#modals\"<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>div<span><span>>B</<span><span>div<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/teleport.html", "title": "Teleport | Vue.js", "doc_id": "55a1dbf613604e1796aa7a6215061019", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 499, "chunk_index": 30, "_doc_id": "30_2657427322557772266"}}
{"doc_id": "31_4158406518065568770", "text": "<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>div<span><span>>B</<span><span>div<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>Teleport<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>渲染的结果为：<p><div class=\"language-html\"> <span class=\"lang\">html<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>div<span><span> id<span><span>=<span><span>\"modals\"<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/teleport.html", "title": "Teleport | Vue.js", "doc_id": "55a1dbf613604e1796aa7a6215061019", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 499, "chunk_index": 31, "_doc_id": "31_4158406518065568770"}}
{"doc_id": "32_1006782497935358832", "text": "ne\"><span><<span><span>div<span><span> id<span><span>=<span><span>\"modals\"<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>div<span><span>>A</<span><span>div<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>div<span><span>>B</<span><span>div<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/teleport.html", "title": "Teleport | Vue.js", "doc_id": "55a1dbf613604e1796aa7a6215061019", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 499, "chunk_index": 32, "_doc_id": "32_1006782497935358832"}}
{"doc_id": "33_4219797626989430887", "text": "<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>div<span><span>>B</<span><span>div<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>div<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><h2 id=\"deferred-teleport\">延迟解析的 Teleport <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#deferred-teleport\" class=\"vt-badge\">​<a><h2><p>在 Vue 3.5 及更高版本中，我们可以使用 <code>defer<code> prop 推迟 Teleport 的目标解析，直到应用的其他部分挂载。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/teleport.html", "title": "Teleport | Vue.js", "doc_id": "55a1dbf613604e1796aa7a6215061019", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 499, "chunk_index": 33, "_doc_id": "33_4219797626989430887"}}
{"doc_id": "34_5478697078731106347", "text": "=\"vt-badge\">​<a><h2><p>在 Vue 3.5 及更高版本中，我们可以使用 <code>defer<code> prop 推迟 Teleport 的目标解析，直到应用的其他部分挂载。这允许 Teleport 将由 Vue 渲染且位于组件树之后部分的容器元素作为目标：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>Teleport<span><span> defer<span><span> to<span><span>=<span><span>\"#late-div\"<span><span>>...</<span><span>Teleport<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/teleport.html", "title": "Teleport | Vue.js", "doc_id": "55a1dbf613604e1796aa7a6215061019", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 499, "chunk_index": 34, "_doc_id": "34_5478697078731106347"}}
{"doc_id": "35_7127428576923443696", "text": "#late-div\"<span><span>>...</<span><span>Teleport<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><!-- 稍后出现于模板中的某处 --><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>div<span><span> id<span><span>=<span><span>\"late-div\"<span><span>></<span><span>div<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>请注意，目标元素必须与 Teleport 在同一个挂载/更新周期内渲染，即如果 <code><div><code> 在一秒后才挂载，Teleport 仍然会报错。延迟 Teleport 的原理与 <code>mounted<code> 生命周期钩子类似。<p>\n<p><strong>参考<strong><p><div><div>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/teleport.html", "title": "Teleport | Vue.js", "doc_id": "55a1dbf613604e1796aa7a6215061019", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 499, "chunk_index": 35, "_doc_id": "35_7127428576923443696"}}
{"doc_id": "0_4556440867082369321", "text": "<div><div><h1 id=\"provide-inject\">依赖注入 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#provide-inject\">​<a><h1><blockquote><p>此章节假设你已经看过了<a href=\"/guide/essentials/component-basics.html\">组件基础<a>。若你还不了解组件是什么，请先阅读该章节。<p><blockquote><h2 id=\"prop-drilling\">Prop 逐级透传问题 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#prop-drilling\">​<a><h2><p>通常情况下，当我们需要从父组件向子组件传递数据时，会使用 <a href=\"/guide/components/props.html\">props<a>。想象一下这样的结构：有一些多层级嵌套的组件，形成了一棵巨大的组件树，而某个深层的子组件需要一个较远的祖先组件中的部分数据。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/provide-inject.html", "title": "依赖注入", "doc_id": "f09fc9f4566c4e53bc31120eddbecc41", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1007, "chunk_index": 0, "_doc_id": "0_4556440867082369321"}}
{"doc_id": "1_6607825997689216660", "text": "/guide/components/props.html\">props<a>。想象一下这样的结构：有一些多层级嵌套的组件，形成了一棵巨大的组件树，而某个深层的子组件需要一个较远的祖先组件中的部分数据。在这种情况下，如果仅使用 props 则必须将其沿着组件链逐级传递下去，这会非常麻烦：<p><p> <p><p>注意，虽然这里的 <code><Footer><code> 组件可能根本不关心这些 props，但为了使 <code><DeepChild><code> 能访问到它们，仍然需要定义并向下传递。如果组件链路非常长，可能会影响到更多这条路上的组件。这一问题被称为“prop 逐级透传”，显然是我们希望尽量避免的情况。<p><p><code>provide<code> 和 <code>inject<code> 可以帮助我们解决这一问题 <a href=\"#footnote-1\">[1]<a> 。一个父组件相对于其所有的后代组件，会作为<strong>依赖提供者<strong>。任何后代的组件树，无论层级有多深，都可以<strong>注入<strong>由父组件提供给整条链路的依赖。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/provide-inject.html", "title": "依赖注入", "doc_id": "f09fc9f4566c4e53bc31120eddbecc41", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1007, "chunk_index": 1, "_doc_id": "1_6607825997689216660"}}
{"doc_id": "2_9115300076605782602", "text": "<a> 。一个父组件相对于其所有的后代组件，会作为<strong>依赖提供者<strong>。任何后代的组件树，无论层级有多深，都可以<strong>注入<strong>由父组件提供给整条链路的依赖。<p><p> <p><h2 id=\"provide\">Provide (提供) <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#provide\">​<a><h2><div class=\"composition-api\"><p>要为组件后代提供数据，需要使用到 <a href=\"/api/composition-api-dependency-injection.html#provide\"><code>provide()<code><a> 函数：<p><div class=\"language-vue\"> <span class=\"lang\">vue<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>script<span><span> setup<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/provide-inject.html", "title": "依赖注入", "doc_id": "f09fc9f4566c4e53bc31120eddbecc41", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1007, "chunk_index": 2, "_doc_id": "2_9115300076605782602"}}
{"doc_id": "3_1321032296179199588", "text": "code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>script<span><span> setup<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>import<span><span> { provide } <span><span>from<span><span> 'vue'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>provide<span><span>(<span><span>/* 注入名 */<span><span> 'message'<span><span>, <span><span>/* 值 */<span><span> 'hello!'<span><span>)<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/provide-inject.html", "title": "依赖注入", "doc_id": "f09fc9f4566c4e53bc31120eddbecc41", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1007, "chunk_index": 3, "_doc_id": "3_1321032296179199588"}}
{"doc_id": "4_1311347232032437842", "text": "pan><span> 'message'<span><span>, <span><span>/* 值 */<span><span> 'hello!'<span><span>)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>script<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>如果不使用 <code><script setup><code>，请确保 <code>provide()<code> 是在 <code>setup()<code> 同步调用的：<p><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>import<span><span> { provide } <span><span>from<span><span> 'vue'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/provide-inject.html", "title": "依赖注入", "doc_id": "f09fc9f4566c4e53bc31120eddbecc41", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1007, "chunk_index": 4, "_doc_id": "4_1311347232032437842"}}
{"doc_id": "5_3978944963857970627", "text": "rt<span><span> { provide } <span><span>from<span><span> 'vue'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> setup<span><span>() {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> provide<span><span>(<span><span>/* 注入名 */<span><span> 'message'<span><span>, <span><span>/* 值 */<span><span> 'hello!'<span><span>)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/provide-inject.html", "title": "依赖注入", "doc_id": "f09fc9f4566c4e53bc31120eddbecc41", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1007, "chunk_index": 5, "_doc_id": "5_3978944963857970627"}}
{"doc_id": "6_9073210691122351295", "text": "<span>/* 值 */<span><span> 'hello!'<span><span>)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span><code><pre><div><p><code>provide()<code> 函数接收两个参数。第一个参数被称为<strong>注入名<strong>，可以是一个字符串或是一个 <code>Symbol<code>。后代组件会用注入名来查找期望注入的值。一个组件可以多次调用 <code>provide()<code>，使用不同的注入名，注入不同的依赖值。<p><p>第二个参数是提供的值，值可以是任意类型，包括响应式的状态，比如一个 ref：<p><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>import<span><span> { ref, provide } <span><span>from<span><span> 'vue'<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/provide-inject.html", "title": "依赖注入", "doc_id": "f09fc9f4566c4e53bc31120eddbecc41", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1007, "chunk_index": 6, "_doc_id": "6_9073210691122351295"}}
{"doc_id": "7_4049564577826970634", "text": "ass=\"line\"><span>import<span><span> { ref, provide } <span><span>from<span><span> 'vue'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> count<span><span> =<span><span> ref<span><span>(<span><span>0<span><span>)<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/provide-inject.html", "title": "依赖注入", "doc_id": "f09fc9f4566c4e53bc31120eddbecc41", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1007, "chunk_index": 7, "_doc_id": "7_4049564577826970634"}}
{"doc_id": "8_8568520239705013621", "text": "<span><span> count<span><span> =<span><span> ref<span><span>(<span><span>0<span><span>)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>provide<span><span>(<span><span>'key'<span><span>, count)<span><span><code><pre><div><p>提供的响应式状态使后代组件可以由此和提供者建立响应式的联系。<p><div><div class=\"options-api\"><p>要为组件后代提供数据，需要使用到 <a href=\"/api/options-composition.html#provide\"><code>provide<code><a> 选项：<p><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/provide-inject.html", "title": "依赖注入", "doc_id": "f09fc9f4566c4e53bc31120eddbecc41", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1007, "chunk_index": 8, "_doc_id": "8_8568520239705013621"}}
{"doc_id": "9_2470242073759825200", "text": "b-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> provide: {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> message: <span><span>'hello!'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/provide-inject.html", "title": "依赖注入", "doc_id": "f09fc9f4566c4e53bc31120eddbecc41", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1007, "chunk_index": 9, "_doc_id": "9_2470242073759825200"}}
{"doc_id": "10_2871719382001142887", "text": "ass=\"line\"><span> message: <span><span>'hello!'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span><code><pre><div><p>对于 <code>provide<code> 对象上的每一个属性，后代组件会用其 key 为注入名查找期望注入的值，属性的值就是要提供的数据。<p><p>如果我们需要提供依赖当前组件实例的状态 (比如那些由 <code>data()<code> 定义的数据属性)，那么可以以函数形式使用 <code>provide<code>：<p><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/provide-inject.html", "title": "依赖注入", "doc_id": "f09fc9f4566c4e53bc31120eddbecc41", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1007, "chunk_index": 10, "_doc_id": "10_2871719382001142887"}}
{"doc_id": "11_3724530633310163747", "text": "b-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> data<span><span>() {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> return<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> message: <span><span>'hello!'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> },<span><span>\n<span class=\"line highlighted\"><span> provide<span><span>() {<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/provide-inject.html", "title": "依赖注入", "doc_id": "f09fc9f4566c4e53bc31120eddbecc41", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1007, "chunk_index": 11, "_doc_id": "11_3724530633310163747"}}
{"doc_id": "12_8709405706441977564", "text": "ne\"><span> },<span><span>\n<span class=\"line highlighted\"><span> provide<span><span>() {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line highlighted\"><span> // 使用函数的形式，可以访问到 `this`<span><span>\n<span class=\"line highlighted\"><span> return<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line highlighted\"><span> message: <span><span>this<span><span>.message<span><span>\n<span class=\"line highlighted\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line highlighted\"><span> }<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/provide-inject.html", "title": "依赖注入", "doc_id": "f09fc9f4566c4e53bc31120eddbecc41", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1007, "chunk_index": 12, "_doc_id": "12_8709405706441977564"}}
{"doc_id": "13_3214472782456866241", "text": "n class=\"line highlighted\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line highlighted\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span><code><pre><div><p>然而，请注意这<strong>不会<strong>使注入保持响应性。我们会在后续小节中讨论如何<a href=\"#working-with-reactivity\">让注入转变为响应式<a>。<p><div><h2 id=\"app-level-provide\">应用层 Provide <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#app-level-provide\">​<a><h2><p>除了在一个组件中提供依赖，我们还可以在整个应用层面提供依赖：<p><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>import<span><span> { createApp } <span><span>from<span><span> 'vue'<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/provide-inject.html", "title": "依赖注入", "doc_id": "f09fc9f4566c4e53bc31120eddbecc41", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1007, "chunk_index": 13, "_doc_id": "13_3214472782456866241"}}
{"doc_id": "14_5262679173132022058", "text": "class=\"line\"><span>import<span><span> { createApp } <span><span>from<span><span> 'vue'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> app<span><span> =<span><span> createApp<span><span>({})<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>app.<span><span>provide<span><span>(<span><span>/* 注入名 */<span><span> 'message'<span><span>, <span><span>/* 值 */<span><span> 'hello!'<span><span>)<span><span><code><pre><div><p>在应用级别提供的数据在该应用内的所有组件中都可以注入。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/provide-inject.html", "title": "依赖注入", "doc_id": "f09fc9f4566c4e53bc31120eddbecc41", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1007, "chunk_index": 14, "_doc_id": "14_5262679173132022058"}}
{"doc_id": "15_5097924213559876301", "text": ">/* 值 */<span><span> 'hello!'<span><span>)<span><span><code><pre><div><p>在应用级别提供的数据在该应用内的所有组件中都可以注入。这在你编写<a href=\"/guide/reusability/plugins.html\">插件<a>时会特别有用，因为插件一般都不会使用组件形式来提供值。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/provide-inject.html", "title": "依赖注入", "doc_id": "f09fc9f4566c4e53bc31120eddbecc41", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1007, "chunk_index": 15, "_doc_id": "15_5097924213559876301"}}
{"doc_id": "16_5430421675657726960", "text": "供的数据在该应用内的所有组件中都可以注入。这在你编写<a href=\"/guide/reusability/plugins.html\">插件<a>时会特别有用，因为插件一般都不会使用组件形式来提供值。<p><h2 id=\"inject\">Inject (注入) <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#inject\">​<a><h2><div class=\"composition-api\"><p>要注入上层组件提供的数据，需使用 <a href=\"/api/composition-api-dependency-injection.html#inject\"><code>inject()<code><a> 函数：<p><div class=\"language-vue\"> <span class=\"lang\">vue<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>script<span><span> setup<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/provide-inject.html", "title": "依赖注入", "doc_id": "f09fc9f4566c4e53bc31120eddbecc41", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1007, "chunk_index": 16, "_doc_id": "16_5430421675657726960"}}
{"doc_id": "17_3771487207527315157", "text": "code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>script<span><span> setup<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>import<span><span> { inject } <span><span>from<span><span> 'vue'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> message<span><span> =<span><span> inject<span><span>(<span><span>'message'<span><span>)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>script<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>如果有多个父组件提供了相同键的数据，注入将解析为组件链上最近的父组件所注入的值。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/provide-inject.html", "title": "依赖注入", "doc_id": "f09fc9f4566c4e53bc31120eddbecc41", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1007, "chunk_index": 17, "_doc_id": "17_3771487207527315157"}}
{"doc_id": "18_1396250050635964792", "text": "pan><span>script<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>如果有多个父组件提供了相同键的数据，注入将解析为组件链上最近的父组件所注入的值。<p><p>如果提供的值是一个 ref，注入进来的会是该 ref 对象，而<strong>不会<strong>自动解包为其内部的值。这使得注入方组件能够通过 ref 对象保持了和供给方的响应性链接。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/provide-inject.html", "title": "依赖注入", "doc_id": "f09fc9f4566c4e53bc31120eddbecc41", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1007, "chunk_index": 18, "_doc_id": "18_1396250050635964792"}}
{"doc_id": "19_8412704328910413941", "text": "。<p><p>如果提供的值是一个 ref，注入进来的会是该 ref 对象，而<strong>不会<strong>自动解包为其内部的值。这使得注入方组件能够通过 ref 对象保持了和供给方的响应性链接。<p><p><a href=\"https://play.vuejs.org/#\" target=\"_blank\">带有响应性的 provide + inject 完整示例<a><p><p>同样的，", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/provide-inject.html", "title": "依赖注入", "doc_id": "f09fc9f4566c4e53bc31120eddbecc41", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1007, "chunk_index": 19, "_doc_id": "19_8412704328910413941"}}
{"doc_id": "20_3974292990184950658", "text": "PLECXa9NKdD/a6QTTtGnP88LgiXJtYv4BaLHhvg==\" target=\"_blank\">带有响应性的 provide + inject 完整示例<a><p><p>同样的，如果没有使用 <code><script setup><code>，<code>inject()<code> 需要在 <code>setup()<code> 内同步调用：<p><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>import<span><span> { inject } <span><span>from<span><span> 'vue'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/provide-inject.html", "title": "依赖注入", "doc_id": "f09fc9f4566c4e53bc31120eddbecc41", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1007, "chunk_index": 20, "_doc_id": "20_3974292990184950658"}}
{"doc_id": "21_732629801381522126", "text": "n class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> setup<span><span>() {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> const<span><span> message<span><span> =<span><span> inject<span><span>(<span><span>'message'<span><span>)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> return<span><span> { message }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/provide-inject.html", "title": "依赖注入", "doc_id": "f09fc9f4566c4e53bc31120eddbecc41", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1007, "chunk_index": 21, "_doc_id": "21_732629801381522126"}}
{"doc_id": "22_8852155093259070232", "text": "ss=\"line\"><span> return<span><span> { message }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span><code><pre><div><div><div class=\"options-api\"><p>要注入上层组件提供的数据，需使用 <a href=\"/api/options-composition.html#inject\"><code>inject<code><a> 选项来声明：<p><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/provide-inject.html", "title": "依赖注入", "doc_id": "f09fc9f4566c4e53bc31120eddbecc41", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1007, "chunk_index": 22, "_doc_id": "22_8852155093259070232"}}
{"doc_id": "23_6626201705543152876", "text": "b-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> inject: [<span><span>'message'<span><span>],<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> created<span><span>() {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> console.<span><span>log<span><span>(<span><span>this<span><span>.message) <span><span>// injected value<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/provide-inject.html", "title": "依赖注入", "doc_id": "f09fc9f4566c4e53bc31120eddbecc41", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1007, "chunk_index": 23, "_doc_id": "23_6626201705543152876"}}
{"doc_id": "24_1219134250480382551", "text": "n><span>.message) <span><span>// injected value<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span><code><pre><div><p>注入会在组件自身的状态<strong>之前<strong>被解析，因此你可以在 <code>data()<code> 中访问到注入的属性：<p><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> inject: [<span><span>'message'<span><span>],<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/provide-inject.html", "title": "依赖注入", "doc_id": "f09fc9f4566c4e53bc31120eddbecc41", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1007, "chunk_index": 24, "_doc_id": "24_1219134250480382551"}}
{"doc_id": "25_4928278972046649229", "text": "n> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> inject: [<span><span>'message'<span><span>],<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> data<span><span>() {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> return<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 基于注入值的初始数据<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> fullMessage: <span><span>this<span><span>.message<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/provide-inject.html", "title": "依赖注入", "doc_id": "f09fc9f4566c4e53bc31120eddbecc41", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1007, "chunk_index": 25, "_doc_id": "25_4928278972046649229"}}
{"doc_id": "26_4299621919306070629", "text": "message<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span><code><pre><div><p>如果有多个父组件提供了相同键的数据，注入将解析为组件链上最近的父组件所注入的值。<p><p><a href=\"https://play.vuejs.", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/provide-inject.html", "title": "依赖注入", "doc_id": "f09fc9f4566c4e53bc31120eddbecc41", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1007, "chunk_index": 26, "_doc_id": "26_4299621919306070629"}}
{"doc_id": "27_3458534550524434605", "text": "><span><code><pre><div><p>如果有多个父组件提供了相同键的数据，注入将解析为组件链上最近的父组件所注入的值。<p><p><a href=\"https://play.vuejs.org/#\" target=\"_blank\">完整的 provide + inject 示例<a><p><h3 id=\"injection-aliasing\">注入别名 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#injection-aliasing\">​<a><h3><p>当以数组形式使用 <code>inject<code>，", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/provide-inject.html", "title": "依赖注入", "doc_id": "f09fc9f4566c4e53bc31120eddbecc41", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1007, "chunk_index": 27, "_doc_id": "27_3458534550524434605"}}
{"doc_id": "28_6005451827706781644", "text": "ng\">注入别名 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#injection-aliasing\">​<a><h3><p>当以数组形式使用 <code>inject<code>，注入的属性会以同名的 key 暴露到组件实例上。在上面的例子中，提供的属性名为 <code>\"message\"<code>，注入后以 <code>this.message<code> 的形式暴露。访问的本地属性名和注入名是相同的。<p><p>如果我们想要用一个不同的本地属性名注入该属性，我们需要在 <code>inject<code> 选项的属性上使用对象的形式：<p><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> inject: {<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/provide-inject.html", "title": "依赖注入", "doc_id": "f09fc9f4566c4e53bc31120eddbecc41", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1007, "chunk_index": 28, "_doc_id": "28_6005451827706781644"}}
{"doc_id": "29_88300503530919134", "text": "xport<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> inject: {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> /* 本地属性名 */<span><span> localMessage: {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> from: <span><span>/* 注入来源名 */<span><span> 'message'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span><code><pre><div><p>这里，组件本地化了原注入名 <code>\"message\"<code> 所提供的属性，并将其暴露为 <code>this.localMessage<code>。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/provide-inject.html", "title": "依赖注入", "doc_id": "f09fc9f4566c4e53bc31120eddbecc41", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1007, "chunk_index": 29, "_doc_id": "29_88300503530919134"}}
{"doc_id": "30_6790039255724862007", "text": "><code><pre><div><p>这里，组件本地化了原注入名 <code>\"message\"<code> 所提供的属性，并将其暴露为 <code>this.localMessage<code>。<p><div><h3 id=\"injection-default-values\">注入默认值 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#injection-default-values\">​<a><h3><p>默认情况下，<code>inject<code> 假设传入的注入名会被某个祖先链上的组件提供。如果该注入名的确没有任何组件提供，则会抛出一个运行时警告。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/provide-inject.html", "title": "依赖注入", "doc_id": "f09fc9f4566c4e53bc31120eddbecc41", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1007, "chunk_index": 30, "_doc_id": "30_6790039255724862007"}}
{"doc_id": "31_3648808778418456906", "text": "ault-values\">​<a><h3><p>默认情况下，<code>inject<code> 假设传入的注入名会被某个祖先链上的组件提供。如果该注入名的确没有任何组件提供，则会抛出一个运行时警告。<p><p>如果在注入一个值时不要求必须有提供者，那么我们应该声明一个默认值，和 props 类似：<p><div class=\"composition-api\"><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// 如果没有祖先组件提供 \"message\"<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// `value` 会是 \"这是默认值\"<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/provide-inject.html", "title": "依赖注入", "doc_id": "f09fc9f4566c4e53bc31120eddbecc41", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1007, "chunk_index": 31, "_doc_id": "31_3648808778418456906"}}
{"doc_id": "32_3315453201895694816", "text": "span>// 如果没有祖先组件提供 \"message\"<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// `value` 会是 \"这是默认值\"<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> value<span><span> =<span><span> inject<span><span>(<span><span>'message'<span><span>, <span><span>'这是默认值'<span><span>)<span><span><code><pre><div><p>在一些场景中，默认值可能需要通过调用一个函数或初始化一个类来取得。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/provide-inject.html", "title": "依赖注入", "doc_id": "f09fc9f4566c4e53bc31120eddbecc41", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1007, "chunk_index": 32, "_doc_id": "32_3315453201895694816"}}
{"doc_id": "33_8767073895124729531", "text": "n>, <span><span>'这是默认值'<span><span>)<span><span><code><pre><div><p>在一些场景中，默认值可能需要通过调用一个函数或初始化一个类来取得。为了避免在用不到默认值的情况下进行不必要的计算或产生副作用，我们可以使用工厂函数来创建默认值：<p><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> value<span><span> =<span><span> inject<span><span>(<span><span>'key'<span><span>, () <span><span>=><span><span> new<span><span> ExpensiveClass<span><span>(), <span><span>true<span><span>)<span><span><code><pre><div><p>第三个参数表示默认值应该被当作一个工厂函数。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/provide-inject.html", "title": "依赖注入", "doc_id": "f09fc9f4566c4e53bc31120eddbecc41", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1007, "chunk_index": 33, "_doc_id": "33_8767073895124729531"}}
{"doc_id": "34_5949059911508260987", "text": "ss<span><span>(), <span><span>true<span><span>)<span><span><code><pre><div><p>第三个参数表示默认值应该被当作一个工厂函数。<p><div><div class=\"options-api\"><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 当声明注入的默认值时<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 必须使用对象形式<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> inject: {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> message: {<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/provide-inject.html", "title": "依赖注入", "doc_id": "f09fc9f4566c4e53bc31120eddbecc41", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1007, "chunk_index": 34, "_doc_id": "34_5949059911508260987"}}
{"doc_id": "35_157602532113718051", "text": "n>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> inject: {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> message: {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> from: <span><span>'message'<span><span>, <span><span>// 当与原注入名同名时，这个属性是可选的<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> default: <span><span>'default value'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> },<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> user: {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 对于非基础类型数据，如果创建开销比较大，或是需要确保每个组件实例<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 需要独立数据的，请使用工厂函数<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/provide-inject.html", "title": "依赖注入", "doc_id": "f09fc9f4566c4e53bc31120eddbecc41", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1007, "chunk_index": 35, "_doc_id": "35_157602532113718051"}}
{"doc_id": "36_739505548221506472", "text": "非基础类型数据，如果创建开销比较大，或是需要确保每个组件实例<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 需要独立数据的，请使用工厂函数<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> default<span><span>: () <span><span>=><span><span> ({ name: <span><span>'John'<span><span> })<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/provide-inject.html", "title": "依赖注入", "doc_id": "f09fc9f4566c4e53bc31120eddbecc41", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1007, "chunk_index": 36, "_doc_id": "36_739505548221506472"}}
{"doc_id": "37_3084572115727257095", "text": "pan> })<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span><code><pre><div><div><h2 id=\"working-with-reactivity\">和响应式数据配合使用 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#working-with-reactivity\">​<a><h2><div class=\"composition-api\"><p>当提供 / 注入响应式的数据时，<strong>建议尽可能将任何对响应式状态的变更都保持在供给方组件中<strong>。这样可以确保所提供状态的声明和变更操作都内聚在同一个组件内，使其更容易维护。<p><p>有的时候，我们可能需要在注入方组件中更改数据。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/provide-inject.html", "title": "依赖注入", "doc_id": "f09fc9f4566c4e53bc31120eddbecc41", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1007, "chunk_index": 37, "_doc_id": "37_3084572115727257095"}}
{"doc_id": "38_5281260873277670546", "text": "可能将任何对响应式状态的变更都保持在供给方组件中<strong>。这样可以确保所提供状态的声明和变更操作都内聚在同一个组件内，使其更容易维护。<p><p>有的时候，我们可能需要在注入方组件中更改数据。在这种情况下，我们推荐在供给方组件内声明并提供一个更改数据的方法函数：<p><div class=\"language-vue\"> <span class=\"lang\">vue<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><!-- 在供给方组件内 --><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>script<span><span> setup<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>import<span><span> { provide, ref } <span><span>from<span><span> 'vue'<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/provide-inject.html", "title": "依赖注入", "doc_id": "f09fc9f4566c4e53bc31120eddbecc41", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1007, "chunk_index": 38, "_doc_id": "38_5281260873277670546"}}
{"doc_id": "39_8810718204573910920", "text": "ass=\"line\"><span>import<span><span> { provide, ref } <span><span>from<span><span> 'vue'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> location<span><span> =<span><span> ref<span><span>(<span><span>'North Pole'<span><span>)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line highlighted\"><span>function<span><span> updateLocation<span><span>() {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line highlighted\"><span> location.value <span><span>=<span><span> 'South Pole'<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/provide-inject.html", "title": "依赖注入", "doc_id": "f09fc9f4566c4e53bc31120eddbecc41", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1007, "chunk_index": 39, "_doc_id": "39_8810718204573910920"}}
{"doc_id": "40_3814859609639290327", "text": "n class=\"line highlighted\"><span> location.value <span><span>=<span><span> 'South Pole'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line highlighted\"><span>}<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>provide<span><span>(<span><span>'location'<span><span>, {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> location,<span><span>\n<span class=\"line highlighted\"><span> updateLocation<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>})<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/provide-inject.html", "title": "依赖注入", "doc_id": "f09fc9f4566c4e53bc31120eddbecc41", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1007, "chunk_index": 40, "_doc_id": "40_3814859609639290327"}}
{"doc_id": "41_4148531814564383140", "text": "class=\"line highlighted\"><span> updateLocation<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>})<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>script<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><div class=\"language-vue\"> <span class=\"lang\">vue<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><!-- 在注入方组件 --><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>script<span><span> setup<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/provide-inject.html", "title": "依赖注入", "doc_id": "f09fc9f4566c4e53bc31120eddbecc41", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1007, "chunk_index": 41, "_doc_id": "41_4148531814564383140"}}
{"doc_id": "42_6428307337074781643", "text": "span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>script<span><span> setup<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>import<span><span> { inject } <span><span>from<span><span> 'vue'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line highlighted\"><span>const<span><span> { <span><span>location<span><span>, <span><span>updateLocation<span><span> } <span><span>=<span><span> inject<span><span>(<span><span>'location'<span><span>)<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/provide-inject.html", "title": "依赖注入", "doc_id": "f09fc9f4566c4e53bc31120eddbecc41", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1007, "chunk_index": 42, "_doc_id": "42_6428307337074781643"}}
{"doc_id": "43_5878191223136464716", "text": "pan> } <span><span>=<span><span> inject<span><span>(<span><span>'location'<span><span>)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>script<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>button<span><span> @click<span><span>=<span><span>\"updateLocation\"<span><span>>{{ location }}</<span><span>button<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/provide-inject.html", "title": "依赖注入", "doc_id": "f09fc9f4566c4e53bc31120eddbecc41", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1007, "chunk_index": 43, "_doc_id": "43_5878191223136464716"}}
{"doc_id": "44_2289143964759996723", "text": "span><span>\"updateLocation\"<span><span>>{{ location }}</<span><span>button<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>最后，如果你想确保提供的数据不能被注入方的组件更改，你可以使用 <a href=\"/api/reactivity-core.html#readonly\"><code>readonly()<code><a> 来包装提供的值。<p><div class=\"language-vue\"> <span class=\"lang\">vue<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>script<span><span> setup<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/provide-inject.html", "title": "依赖注入", "doc_id": "f09fc9f4566c4e53bc31120eddbecc41", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1007, "chunk_index": 44, "_doc_id": "44_2289143964759996723"}}
{"doc_id": "45_5259415534938173131", "text": "code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>script<span><span> setup<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>import<span><span> { ref, provide, readonly } <span><span>from<span><span> 'vue'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> count<span><span> =<span><span> ref<span><span>(<span><span>0<span><span>)<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/provide-inject.html", "title": "依赖注入", "doc_id": "f09fc9f4566c4e53bc31120eddbecc41", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1007, "chunk_index": 45, "_doc_id": "45_5259415534938173131"}}
{"doc_id": "46_5246698434832030663", "text": "<span><span> count<span><span> =<span><span> ref<span><span>(<span><span>0<span><span>)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>provide<span><span>(<span><span>'read-only-count'<span><span>, <span><span>readonly<span><span>(count))<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/provide-inject.html", "title": "依赖注入", "doc_id": "f09fc9f4566c4e53bc31120eddbecc41", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1007, "chunk_index": 46, "_doc_id": "46_5246698434832030663"}}
{"doc_id": "47_3431326965431880885", "text": "an>(<span><span>'read-only-count'<span><span>, <span><span>readonly<span><span>(count))<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>script<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><div><div class=\"options-api\"><p>为保证注入方和供给方之间的响应性链接，我们需要使用 <a href=\"/api/reactivity-core.html#computed\">computed()<a> 函数提供一个计算属性：<p><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>import<span><span> { computed } <span><span>from<span><span> 'vue'<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/provide-inject.html", "title": "依赖注入", "doc_id": "f09fc9f4566c4e53bc31120eddbecc41", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1007, "chunk_index": 47, "_doc_id": "47_3431326965431880885"}}
{"doc_id": "48_9178849029443264729", "text": "n class=\"line\"><span>import<span><span> { computed } <span><span>from<span><span> 'vue'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> data<span><span>() {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> return<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> message: <span><span>'hello!'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> },<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/provide-inject.html", "title": "依赖注入", "doc_id": "f09fc9f4566c4e53bc31120eddbecc41", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1007, "chunk_index": 48, "_doc_id": "48_9178849029443264729"}}
{"doc_id": "49_8602792018542272202", "text": "ello!'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> },<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> provide<span><span>() {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> return<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 显式提供一个计算属性<span><span>\n<span class=\"line highlighted\"><span> message: <span><span>computed<span><span>(() <span><span>=><span><span> this<span><span>.message)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/provide-inject.html", "title": "依赖注入", "doc_id": "f09fc9f4566c4e53bc31120eddbecc41", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1007, "chunk_index": 49, "_doc_id": "49_8602792018542272202"}}
{"doc_id": "50_4386275552621247416", "text": "essage)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span><code><pre><div><p><a href=\"https://play.vuejs.", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/provide-inject.html", "title": "依赖注入", "doc_id": "f09fc9f4566c4e53bc31120eddbecc41", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1007, "chunk_index": 50, "_doc_id": "50_4386275552621247416"}}
{"doc_id": "51_4693897432114759619", "text": "}<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span><code><pre><div><p><a href=\"https://play.vuejs.org/#\" target=\"_blank\">带有响应性的 provide + inject 完整示例<a><p><p><code>computed()<code> 函数常用于组合式 API 风格的组件中，", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/provide-inject.html", "title": "依赖注入", "doc_id": "f09fc9f4566c4e53bc31120eddbecc41", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1007, "chunk_index": 51, "_doc_id": "51_4693897432114759619"}}
{"doc_id": "52_6206346323614652736", "text": "==\" target=\"_blank\">带有响应性的 provide + inject 完整示例<a><p><p><code>computed()<code> 函数常用于组合式 API 风格的组件中，但它同样还可以用于补充选项式 API 风格的某些用例。你可以通过阅读<a href=\"/guide/essentials/reactivity-fundamentals.html\">响应式系统基础<a>和<a href=\"/guide/essentials/computed.html\">计算属性<a>两个章节了解更多组合式的 API 风格。<p><div><h2 id=\"working-with-symbol-keys\">使用 Symbol 作注入名 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#working-with-symbol-keys\">​<a><h2><p>至此，我们已经了解了如何使用字符串作为注入名。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/provide-inject.html", "title": "依赖注入", "doc_id": "f09fc9f4566c4e53bc31120eddbecc41", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1007, "chunk_index": 52, "_doc_id": "52_6206346323614652736"}}
{"doc_id": "53_5018960733618776890", "text": "ol 作注入名 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#working-with-symbol-keys\">​<a><h2><p>至此，我们已经了解了如何使用字符串作为注入名。但如果你正在构建大型的应用，包含非常多的依赖提供，或者你正在编写提供给其他开发者使用的组件库，建议最好使用 <a href=\"https://developer.mozilla.org/zh-CN/docs/Web/JavaScript/Reference/Global_Objects/Symbol\" target=\"_blank\">Symbol<a> 来作为注入名以避免潜在的冲突。<p><p>我们通常推荐在一个单独的文件中导出这些注入名 Symbol：<p><div class=\"vp-code-block-title\"><p class=\"vp-code-block-title-bar\"><span class=\"vp-code-block-title-text\">keys.", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/provide-inject.html", "title": "依赖注入", "doc_id": "f09fc9f4566c4e53bc31120eddbecc41", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1007, "chunk_index": 53, "_doc_id": "53_5018960733618776890"}}
{"doc_id": "54_5781269610029535337", "text": "vp-code-block-title\"><p class=\"vp-code-block-title-bar\"><span class=\"vp-code-block-title-text\">keys.js<span><p><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> const<span><span> myInjectionKey<span><span> =<span><span> Symbol<span><span>()<span><span><code><pre><div><div><div class=\"composition-api\"><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// 在供给方组件中<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/provide-inject.html", "title": "依赖注入", "doc_id": "f09fc9f4566c4e53bc31120eddbecc41", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1007, "chunk_index": 54, "_doc_id": "54_5781269610029535337"}}
{"doc_id": "55_5939687222374693748", "text": "s<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// 在供给方组件中<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>import<span><span> { provide } <span><span>from<span><span> 'vue'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>import<span><span> { myInjectionKey } <span><span>from<span><span> './keys.js'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>provide<span><span>(myInjectionKey, { <span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> /* 要提供的数据 */<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/provide-inject.html", "title": "依赖注入", "doc_id": "f09fc9f4566c4e53bc31120eddbecc41", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1007, "chunk_index": 55, "_doc_id": "55_5939687222374693748"}}
{"doc_id": "56_5324284834900174308", "text": "ovide<span><span>(myInjectionKey, { <span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> /* 要提供的数据 */<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>})<span><span><code><pre><div><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// 注入方组件<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>import<span><span> { inject } <span><span>from<span><span> 'vue'<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/provide-inject.html", "title": "依赖注入", "doc_id": "f09fc9f4566c4e53bc31120eddbecc41", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1007, "chunk_index": 56, "_doc_id": "56_5324284834900174308"}}
{"doc_id": "57_7830396158627303272", "text": "pan class=\"line\"><span>import<span><span> { inject } <span><span>from<span><span> 'vue'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>import<span><span> { myInjectionKey } <span><span>from<span><span> './keys.js'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/provide-inject.html", "title": "依赖注入", "doc_id": "f09fc9f4566c4e53bc31120eddbecc41", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1007, "chunk_index": 57, "_doc_id": "57_7830396158627303272"}}
{"doc_id": "58_7279878486791890139", "text": "> { myInjectionKey } <span><span>from<span><span> './keys.js'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> injected<span><span> =<span><span> inject<span><span>(myInjectionKey)<span><span><code><pre><div><p>TypeScript 用户请参考：<a href=\"/guide/typescript/composition-api.html#typing-provide-inject\">为 Provide / Inject 标注类型<a> <p><div><div class=\"options-api\"><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// 在供给方组件中<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/provide-inject.html", "title": "依赖注入", "doc_id": "f09fc9f4566c4e53bc31120eddbecc41", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1007, "chunk_index": 58, "_doc_id": "58_7279878486791890139"}}
{"doc_id": "59_1401697421817419671", "text": "s<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// 在供给方组件中<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>import<span><span> { myInjectionKey } <span><span>from<span><span> './keys.js'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> provide<span><span>() {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> return<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> [myInjectionKey]: {<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/provide-inject.html", "title": "依赖注入", "doc_id": "f09fc9f4566c4e53bc31120eddbecc41", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1007, "chunk_index": 59, "_doc_id": "59_1401697421817419671"}}
{"doc_id": "60_2282470967772867771", "text": "\"><span> return<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> [myInjectionKey]: {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> /* 要提供的数据 */<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span><code><pre><div><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// 注入方组件<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/provide-inject.html", "title": "依赖注入", "doc_id": "f09fc9f4566c4e53bc31120eddbecc41", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1007, "chunk_index": 60, "_doc_id": "60_2282470967772867771"}}
{"doc_id": "61_8645739802729222650", "text": ">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// 注入方组件<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>import<span><span> { myInjectionKey } <span><span>from<span><span> './keys.js'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> inject: {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> injected: { from: myInjectionKey }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/provide-inject.html", "title": "依赖注入", "doc_id": "f09fc9f4566c4e53bc31120eddbecc41", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1007, "chunk_index": 61, "_doc_id": "61_8645739802729222650"}}
{"doc_id": "62_1233900771983568542", "text": "line\"><span> injected: { from: myInjectionKey }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span><code><pre><div><div> <p><strong>译者注<strong><p><p><a id=\"footnote-1\"><a>[1] 在本章及后续章节中，“<strong>提供<strong>”将成为对应 Provide 的一个专有概念<p><div><div>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/provide-inject.html", "title": "依赖注入", "doc_id": "f09fc9f4566c4e53bc31120eddbecc41", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1007, "chunk_index": 62, "_doc_id": "62_1233900771983568542"}}
{"doc_id": "0_1352099706014861195", "text": "<div><div><h1 id=\"component-v-model\">组件 v-model <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#component-v-model\">​<a><h1><h2 id=\"basic-usage\">基本用法 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#basic-usage\">​<a><h2><p><code>v-model<code> 可以在组件上使用以实现双向绑定。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/v-model.html", "title": "组件 v-model", "doc_id": "2b06add43f9443ef86d8c579eb89ceed", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1636, "chunk_index": 0, "_doc_id": "0_1352099706014861195"}}
{"doc_id": "1_4819123825709055420", "text": "e\">基本用法 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#basic-usage\">​<a><h2><p><code>v-model<code> 可以在组件上使用以实现双向绑定。<p><div class=\"composition-api\"><p>从 Vue 3.4 开始，推荐的实现方式是使用 <a href=\"/api/sfc-script-setup.html#definemodel\"><code>defineModel()<code><a> 宏：<p><div class=\"vp-code-block-title\"><p class=\"vp-code-block-title-bar\"><span class=\"vp-code-block-title-text\">Child.vue<span><p><div class=\"language-vue\"> <span class=\"lang\">vue<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>script<span><span> setup<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/v-model.html", "title": "组件 v-model", "doc_id": "2b06add43f9443ef86d8c579eb89ceed", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1636, "chunk_index": 1, "_doc_id": "1_4819123825709055420"}}
{"doc_id": "2_2221151063159768940", "text": "code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>script<span><span> setup<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> model<span><span> =<span><span> defineModel<span><span>()<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>function<span><span> update<span><span>() {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> model.value<span><span>++<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>script<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/v-model.html", "title": "组件 v-model", "doc_id": "2b06add43f9443ef86d8c579eb89ceed", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1636, "chunk_index": 2, "_doc_id": "2_2221151063159768940"}}
{"doc_id": "3_1360674593581183281", "text": "s=\"line\"><span>}<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>script<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>div<span><span>>Parent bound v-model is: {{ model }}</<span><span>div<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>button<span><span> @click<span><span>=<span><span>\"update\"<span><span>>Increment</<span><span>button<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/v-model.html", "title": "组件 v-model", "doc_id": "2b06add43f9443ef86d8c579eb89ceed", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1636, "chunk_index": 3, "_doc_id": "3_1360674593581183281"}}
{"doc_id": "4_3590759431245873090", "text": "span><span>=<span><span>\"update\"<span><span>>Increment</<span><span>button<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><div><p>父组件可以用 <code>v-model<code> 绑定一个值：<p><div class=\"vp-code-block-title\"><p class=\"vp-code-block-title-bar\"><span class=\"vp-code-block-title-text\">Parent.", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/v-model.html", "title": "组件 v-model", "doc_id": "2b06add43f9443ef86d8c579eb89ceed", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1636, "chunk_index": 4, "_doc_id": "4_3590759431245873090"}}
{"doc_id": "5_7178892660057327850", "text": "-code-block-title\"><p class=\"vp-code-block-title-bar\"><span class=\"vp-code-block-title-text\">Parent.vue<span><p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>Child<span><span> v-model<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>countModel<span><span>\"<span><span> /><span><span><code><pre><div><div><p><code>defineModel()<code> 返回的值是一个 ref。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/v-model.html", "title": "组件 v-model", "doc_id": "2b06add43f9443ef86d8c579eb89ceed", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1636, "chunk_index": 5, "_doc_id": "5_7178892660057327850"}}
{"doc_id": "6_5726210507438907241", "text": "pan><span>\"<span><span> /><span><span><code><pre><div><div><p><code>defineModel()<code> 返回的值是一个 ref。它可以像其他 ref 一样被访问以及修改，不过它能起到在父组件和当前变量之间的双向绑定的作用：<p><ul><li>它的 <code>.value<code> 和父组件的 <code>v-model<code> 的值同步；<li><li>当它被子组件变更了，会触发父组件绑定的值一起更新。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/v-model.html", "title": "组件 v-model", "doc_id": "2b06add43f9443ef86d8c579eb89ceed", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1636, "chunk_index": 6, "_doc_id": "6_5726210507438907241"}}
{"doc_id": "7_1702548615860652235", "text": "作用：<p><ul><li>它的 <code>.value<code> 和父组件的 <code>v-model<code> 的值同步；<li><li>当它被子组件变更了，会触发父组件绑定的值一起更新。<li><ul><p>这意味着你也可以用 <code>v-model<code> 把这个 ref 绑定到一个原生 input 元素上，在提供相同的 <code>v-model<code> 用法的同时轻松包装原生 input 元素：<p><div class=\"language-vue\"> <span class=\"lang\">vue<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>script<span><span> setup<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/v-model.html", "title": "组件 v-model", "doc_id": "2b06add43f9443ef86d8c579eb89ceed", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1636, "chunk_index": 7, "_doc_id": "7_1702548615860652235"}}
{"doc_id": "8_4342318610376376802", "text": "code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>script<span><span> setup<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> model<span><span> =<span><span> defineModel<span><span>()<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>script<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>input<span><span> v-model<span><span>=<span><span>\"model\"<span><span> /><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/v-model.html", "title": "组件 v-model", "doc_id": "2b06add43f9443ef86d8c579eb89ceed", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1636, "chunk_index": 8, "_doc_id": "8_4342318610376376802"}}
{"doc_id": "9_3183972638533790211", "text": "> <<span><span>input<span><span> v-model<span><span>=<span><span>\"model\"<span><span> /><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p><a href=\"https://play.vuejs.", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/v-model.html", "title": "组件 v-model", "doc_id": "2b06add43f9443ef86d8c579eb89ceed", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1636, "chunk_index": 9, "_doc_id": "9_3183972638533790211"}}
{"doc_id": "10_6186509784652141755", "text": "<span></<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p><a href=\"https://play.vuejs.org/#\"", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/v-model.html", "title": "组件 v-model", "doc_id": "2b06add43f9443ef86d8c579eb89ceed", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1636, "chunk_index": 10, "_doc_id": "10_6186509784652141755"}}
{"doc_id": "11_9111397891287914678", "text": "rDUt6oV3ZBzyhmsjiz+p/dSTwJfUx2+IpD1ic+xz5enwQGXEDJJaw8Gl2I1upMzlc/hEvdOBR6SNKAjqP1J6P/o6XdL11L5h4=\" target=\"_blank\">演练场示例<a><p><h3 id=\"under-the-hood\">底层机制 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#under-the-hood\">​<a><h3><p><code>defineModel<code> 是一个便利宏。编译器将其展开为以下内容：<p><ul><li>一个名为 <code>modelValue<code> 的 prop，本地 ref 的值与其同步；<li><li>一个名为 <code>update:modelValue<code> 的事件，当本地 ref 的值发生变更时触发。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/v-model.html", "title": "组件 v-model", "doc_id": "2b06add43f9443ef86d8c579eb89ceed", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1636, "chunk_index": 11, "_doc_id": "11_9111397891287914678"}}
{"doc_id": "12_7691276113591417718", "text": "elValue<code> 的 prop，本地 ref 的值与其同步；<li><li>一个名为 <code>update:modelValue<code> 的事件，当本地 ref 的值发生变更时触发。<li><ul><p>在 3.4 版本之前，你一般会按照如下的方式来实现上述相同的子组件：<p><div class=\"vp-code-block-title\"><p class=\"vp-code-block-title-bar\"><span class=\"vp-code-block-title-text\">Child.vue<span><p><div class=\"language-vue\"> <span class=\"lang\">vue<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>script<span><span> setup<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/v-model.html", "title": "组件 v-model", "doc_id": "2b06add43f9443ef86d8c579eb89ceed", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1636, "chunk_index": 12, "_doc_id": "12_7691276113591417718"}}
{"doc_id": "13_6165301866904269276", "text": "code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>script<span><span> setup<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> props<span><span> =<span><span> defineProps<span><span>([<span><span>'modelValue'<span><span>])<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> emit<span><span> =<span><span> defineEmits<span><span>([<span><span>'update:modelValue'<span><span>])<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>script<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/v-model.html", "title": "组件 v-model", "doc_id": "2b06add43f9443ef86d8c579eb89ceed", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1636, "chunk_index": 13, "_doc_id": "13_6165301866904269276"}}
{"doc_id": "14_5656907934419397786", "text": "n>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>script<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>input<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> :value<span><span>=<span><span>\"props.modelValue\"<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> @input<span><span>=<span><span>\"emit('update:modelValue', $event.target.value)\"<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> /><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/v-model.html", "title": "组件 v-model", "doc_id": "2b06add43f9443ef86d8c579eb89ceed", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1636, "chunk_index": 14, "_doc_id": "14_5656907934419397786"}}
{"doc_id": "15_7779558005356178682", "text": "mit('update:modelValue', $event.target.value)\"<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> /><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><div><p>然后，父组件中的 <code>v-model=\"foo\"<code> 将被编译为：<p><div class=\"vp-code-block-title\"><p class=\"vp-code-block-title-bar\"><span class=\"vp-code-block-title-text\">Parent.vue<span><p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>Child<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/v-model.html", "title": "组件 v-model", "doc_id": "2b06add43f9443ef86d8c579eb89ceed", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1636, "chunk_index": 15, "_doc_id": "15_7779558005356178682"}}
{"doc_id": "16_4545638817362285632", "text": "pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>Child<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> :<span><span>modelValue<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>foo<span><span>\"<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> @<span><span>update<span><span>:<span><span>modelValue<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>$event<span><span> =><span><span> (foo <span><span>=<span><span> $event)<span><span>\"<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/v-model.html", "title": "组件 v-model", "doc_id": "2b06add43f9443ef86d8c579eb89ceed", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1636, "chunk_index": 16, "_doc_id": "16_4545638817362285632"}}
{"doc_id": "17_3908077336530673344", "text": "n>$event<span><span> =><span><span> (foo <span><span>=<span><span> $event)<span><span>\"<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>/><span><span><code><pre><div><div><p>如你所见，这显得冗长得多。然而，这样写有助于理解其底层机制。<p><p>因为 <code>defineModel<code> 声明了一个 prop，你可以通过给 <code>defineModel<code> 传递选项，来声明底层 prop 的选项：<p><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// 使 v-model 必填<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/v-model.html", "title": "组件 v-model", "doc_id": "2b06add43f9443ef86d8c579eb89ceed", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1636, "chunk_index": 17, "_doc_id": "17_3908077336530673344"}}
{"doc_id": "18_1490791650023398884", "text": "n><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// 使 v-model 必填<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> model<span><span> =<span><span> defineModel<span><span>({ required: <span><span>true<span><span> })<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 提供一个默认值<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/v-model.html", "title": "组件 v-model", "doc_id": "2b06add43f9443ef86d8c579eb89ceed", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1636, "chunk_index": 18, "_doc_id": "18_1490791650023398884"}}
{"doc_id": "19_4075331755215376209", "text": "pan><span> })<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 提供一个默认值<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> model<span><span> =<span><span> defineModel<span><span>({ default: <span><span>0<span><span> })<span><span><code><pre><div><div class=\"warning custom-block\"><p class=\"custom-block-title\">WARNING<p><p>如果为 <code>defineModel<code> prop 设置了一个 <code>default<code> 值且父组件没有为该 prop 提供任何值，会导致父组件与子组件之间不同步。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/v-model.html", "title": "组件 v-model", "doc_id": "2b06add43f9443ef86d8c579eb89ceed", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1636, "chunk_index": 19, "_doc_id": "19_4075331755215376209"}}
{"doc_id": "20_1552509953060264855", "text": "><p>如果为 <code>defineModel<code> prop 设置了一个 <code>default<code> 值且父组件没有为该 prop 提供任何值，会导致父组件与子组件之间不同步。在下面的示例中，父组件的 <code>myRef<code> 是 undefined，而子组件的 <code>model<code> 是 1：<p><div class=\"vp-code-block-title\"><p class=\"vp-code-block-title-bar\"><span class=\"vp-code-block-title-text\">Child.vue<span><p><div class=\"language-vue\"> <span class=\"lang\">vue<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>script<span><span> setup<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/v-model.html", "title": "组件 v-model", "doc_id": "2b06add43f9443ef86d8c579eb89ceed", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1636, "chunk_index": 20, "_doc_id": "20_1552509953060264855"}}
{"doc_id": "21_5936348014425913771", "text": "code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>script<span><span> setup<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> model<span><span> =<span><span> defineModel<span><span>({ default: <span><span>1<span><span> })<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/v-model.html", "title": "组件 v-model", "doc_id": "2b06add43f9443ef86d8c579eb89ceed", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1636, "chunk_index": 21, "_doc_id": "21_5936348014425913771"}}
{"doc_id": "22_5948943083841676033", "text": "an><span> =<span><span> defineModel<span><span>({ default: <span><span>1<span><span> })<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>script<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><div><div class=\"vp-code-block-title\"><p class=\"vp-code-block-title-bar\"><span class=\"vp-code-block-title-text\">Parent.vue<span><p><div class=\"language-vue\"> <span class=\"lang\">vue<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>script<span><span> setup<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/v-model.html", "title": "组件 v-model", "doc_id": "2b06add43f9443ef86d8c579eb89ceed", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1636, "chunk_index": 22, "_doc_id": "22_5948943083841676033"}}
{"doc_id": "23_7491612009934290041", "text": "code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>script<span><span> setup<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> myRef<span><span> =<span><span> ref<span><span>()<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>script<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/v-model.html", "title": "组件 v-model", "doc_id": "2b06add43f9443ef86d8c579eb89ceed", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1636, "chunk_index": 23, "_doc_id": "23_7491612009934290041"}}
{"doc_id": "24_5792513578629859229", "text": ">\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>Child<span><span> v-model<span><span>=<span><span>\"myRef\"<span><span>></<span><span>Child<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/v-model.html", "title": "组件 v-model", "doc_id": "2b06add43f9443ef86d8c579eb89ceed", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1636, "chunk_index": 24, "_doc_id": "24_5792513578629859229"}}
{"doc_id": "25_2448993846054415970", "text": "n> v-model<span><span>=<span><span>\"myRef\"<span><span>></<span><span>Child<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><div><div><div><div class=\"options-api\"><p>首先让我们回忆一下 <code>v-model<code> 在原生元素上的用法：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>input<span><span> v-model<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>searchText<span><span>\"<span><span> /><span><span><code><pre><div><p>在代码背后，模板编译器会对 <code>v-model<code> 进行更冗长的等价展开。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/v-model.html", "title": "组件 v-model", "doc_id": "2b06add43f9443ef86d8c579eb89ceed", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1636, "chunk_index": 25, "_doc_id": "25_2448993846054415970"}}
{"doc_id": "26_7559460482448104024", "text": "n><span>\"<span><span> /><span><span><code><pre><div><p>在代码背后，模板编译器会对 <code>v-model<code> 进行更冗长的等价展开。因此上面的代码其实等价于下面这段：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>input<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> :<span><span>value<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>searchText<span><span>\"<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/v-model.html", "title": "组件 v-model", "doc_id": "2b06add43f9443ef86d8c579eb89ceed", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1636, "chunk_index": 26, "_doc_id": "26_7559460482448104024"}}
