{"doc_id": "129_6517365676116261666", "text": "meModifiers) <span><span>// { uppercase: true }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>script<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><div><div><div>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/v-model.html", "title": "组件 v-model", "doc_id": "2b06add43f9443ef86d8c579eb89ceed", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1636, "chunk_index": 129, "_doc_id": "129_6517365676116261666"}}
{"doc_id": "0_1969936741880072315", "text": "<div><div><h1 id=\"async-components\">异步组件 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#async-components\">​<a><h1><h2 id=\"basic-usage\">基本用法 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#basic-usage\">​<a><h2><p>在大型项目中，我们可能需要拆分应用为更小的块，并仅在需要时再从服务器加载相关组件。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/async.html", "title": "异步组件", "doc_id": "fa618f43dd23401ab3eda3b07dbb16a8", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 580, "chunk_index": 0, "_doc_id": "0_1969936741880072315"}}
{"doc_id": "1_984807678331797409", "text": "用法 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#basic-usage\">​<a><h2><p>在大型项目中，我们可能需要拆分应用为更小的块，并仅在需要时再从服务器加载相关组件。Vue 提供了 <a href=\"/api/general.html#defineasynccomponent\"><code>defineAsyncComponent<code><a> 方法来实现此功能：<p><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>import<span><span> { defineAsyncComponent } <span><span>from<span><span> 'vue'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/async.html", "title": "异步组件", "doc_id": "fa618f43dd23401ab3eda3b07dbb16a8", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 580, "chunk_index": 1, "_doc_id": "1_984807678331797409"}}
{"doc_id": "2_6238201894731450304", "text": "> { defineAsyncComponent } <span><span>from<span><span> 'vue'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> AsyncComp<span><span> =<span><span> defineAsyncComponent<span><span>(() <span><span>=><span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> return<span><span> new<span><span> Promise<span><span>((<span><span>resolve<span><span>, <span><span>reject<span><span>) <span><span>=><span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // ...从服务器获取组件<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/async.html", "title": "异步组件", "doc_id": "fa618f43dd23401ab3eda3b07dbb16a8", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 580, "chunk_index": 2, "_doc_id": "2_6238201894731450304"}}
{"doc_id": "3_1806788844694558208", "text": "pan>) <span><span>=><span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // ...从服务器获取组件<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> resolve<span><span>(<span><span>/* 获取到的组件 */<span><span>)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> })<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>})<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// ... 像使用其他一般组件一样使用 `AsyncComp`<span><span><code><pre><div><p>如你所见，<code>defineAsyncComponent<code> 方法接收一个返回 Promise 的加载函数。这个 Promise 的 <code>resolve<code> 回调方法应该在从服务器获得组件定义时调用。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/async.html", "title": "异步组件", "doc_id": "fa618f43dd23401ab3eda3b07dbb16a8", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 580, "chunk_index": 3, "_doc_id": "3_1806788844694558208"}}
{"doc_id": "4_8069452222285977201", "text": "neAsyncComponent<code> 方法接收一个返回 Promise 的加载函数。这个 Promise 的 <code>resolve<code> 回调方法应该在从服务器获得组件定义时调用。你也可以调用 <code>reject(reason)<code> 表明加载失败。<p><p><a href=\"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/JavaScript/Reference/Operators/import\" target=\"_blank\">ES 模块动态导入<a>也会返回一个 Promise，所以多数情况下我们会将它和 <code>defineAsyncComponent<code> 搭配使用。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/async.html", "title": "异步组件", "doc_id": "fa618f43dd23401ab3eda3b07dbb16a8", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 580, "chunk_index": 4, "_doc_id": "4_8069452222285977201"}}
{"doc_id": "5_6671841207802540603", "text": "ort\" target=\"_blank\">ES 模块动态导入<a>也会返回一个 Promise，所以多数情况下我们会将它和 <code>defineAsyncComponent<code> 搭配使用。类似 Vite 和 Webpack 这样的构建工具也支持此语法 (并且会将它们作为打包时的代码分割点)，因此我们也可以用它来导入 Vue 单文件组件：<p><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>import<span><span> { defineAsyncComponent } <span><span>from<span><span> 'vue'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/async.html", "title": "异步组件", "doc_id": "fa618f43dd23401ab3eda3b07dbb16a8", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 580, "chunk_index": 5, "_doc_id": "5_6671841207802540603"}}
{"doc_id": "6_6592429422233407430", "text": "> { defineAsyncComponent } <span><span>from<span><span> 'vue'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> AsyncComp<span><span> =<span><span> defineAsyncComponent<span><span>(() <span><span>=><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> import<span><span>(<span><span>'./components/MyComponent.vue'<span><span>)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>)<span><span><code><pre><div><p>最后得到的 <code>AsyncComp<code> 是一个外层包装过的组件，仅在页面需要它渲染时才会调用加载内部实际组件的函数。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/async.html", "title": "异步组件", "doc_id": "fa618f43dd23401ab3eda3b07dbb16a8", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 580, "chunk_index": 6, "_doc_id": "6_6592429422233407430"}}
{"doc_id": "7_5611824015759879734", "text": "n>)<span><span><code><pre><div><p>最后得到的 <code>AsyncComp<code> 是一个外层包装过的组件，仅在页面需要它渲染时才会调用加载内部实际组件的函数。它会将接收到的 props 和插槽传给内部组件，所以你可以使用这个异步的包装组件无缝地替换原始组件，同时实现延迟加载。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/async.html", "title": "异步组件", "doc_id": "fa618f43dd23401ab3eda3b07dbb16a8", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 580, "chunk_index": 7, "_doc_id": "7_5611824015759879734"}}
{"doc_id": "8_5162095910960041318", "text": "e> 是一个外层包装过的组件，仅在页面需要它渲染时才会调用加载内部实际组件的函数。它会将接收到的 props 和插槽传给内部组件，所以你可以使用这个异步的包装组件无缝地替换原始组件，同时实现延迟加载。<p><p>与普通组件一样，异步组件可以使用 <code>app.component()<code> <a href=\"/guide/components/registration.html#global-registration\">全局注册<a>：<p><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>app.<span><span>component<span><span>(<span><span>'MyComponent'<span><span>, <span><span>defineAsyncComponent<span><span>(() <span><span>=><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/async.html", "title": "异步组件", "doc_id": "fa618f43dd23401ab3eda3b07dbb16a8", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 580, "chunk_index": 8, "_doc_id": "8_5162095910960041318"}}
{"doc_id": "9_546855582751972947", "text": "yComponent'<span><span>, <span><span>defineAsyncComponent<span><span>(() <span><span>=><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> import<span><span>(<span><span>'./components/MyComponent.vue'<span><span>)<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/async.html", "title": "异步组件", "doc_id": "fa618f43dd23401ab3eda3b07dbb16a8", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 580, "chunk_index": 9, "_doc_id": "9_546855582751972947"}}
{"doc_id": "10_316867596798766012", "text": "line\"><span> import<span><span>(<span><span>'./components/MyComponent.vue'<span><span>)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>))<span><span><code><pre><div><div class=\"options-api\"><p>你也可以在<a href=\"/guide/components/registration.html#local-registration\">局部注册组件<a>时使用 <code>defineAsyncComponent<code>：<p><div class=\"language-vue\"> <span class=\"lang\">vue<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>script<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/async.html", "title": "异步组件", "doc_id": "fa618f43dd23401ab3eda3b07dbb16a8", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 580, "chunk_index": 10, "_doc_id": "10_316867596798766012"}}
{"doc_id": "11_7549813908242681584", "text": "ki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>script<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>import<span><span> { defineAsyncComponent } <span><span>from<span><span> 'vue'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> components: {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> AdminPage: <span><span>defineAsyncComponent<span><span>(() <span><span>=><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/async.html", "title": "异步组件", "doc_id": "fa618f43dd23401ab3eda3b07dbb16a8", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 580, "chunk_index": 11, "_doc_id": "11_7549813908242681584"}}
{"doc_id": "12_4184945416539855455", "text": "\"line\"><span> AdminPage: <span><span>defineAsyncComponent<span><span>(() <span><span>=><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> import<span><span>(<span><span>'./components/AdminPageComponent.vue'<span><span>)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> )<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>script<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/async.html", "title": "异步组件", "doc_id": "fa618f43dd23401ab3eda3b07dbb16a8", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 580, "chunk_index": 12, "_doc_id": "12_4184945416539855455"}}
{"doc_id": "13_3256889195307910329", "text": ">\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>AdminPage<span><span> /><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><div><div class=\"composition-api\"><p>也可以直接在父组件中定义它们：<p><div class=\"language-vue\"> <span class=\"lang\">vue<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>script<span><span> setup<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/async.html", "title": "异步组件", "doc_id": "fa618f43dd23401ab3eda3b07dbb16a8", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 580, "chunk_index": 13, "_doc_id": "13_3256889195307910329"}}
{"doc_id": "14_1247083694481146005", "text": "code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>script<span><span> setup<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>import<span><span> { defineAsyncComponent } <span><span>from<span><span> 'vue'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> AdminPage<span><span> =<span><span> defineAsyncComponent<span><span>(() <span><span>=><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> import<span><span>(<span><span>'./components/AdminPageComponent.vue'<span><span>)<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/async.html", "title": "异步组件", "doc_id": "fa618f43dd23401ab3eda3b07dbb16a8", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 580, "chunk_index": 14, "_doc_id": "14_1247083694481146005"}}
{"doc_id": "15_3346848428176805625", "text": "span> import<span><span>(<span><span>'./components/AdminPageComponent.vue'<span><span>)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>script<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>AdminPage<span><span> /><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/async.html", "title": "异步组件", "doc_id": "fa618f43dd23401ab3eda3b07dbb16a8", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 580, "chunk_index": 15, "_doc_id": "15_3346848428176805625"}}
{"doc_id": "16_7194985206163469938", "text": "pan><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>AdminPage<span><span> /><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><div><h2 id=\"loading-and-error-states\">加载与错误状态 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#loading-and-error-states\">​<a><h2><p>异步操作不可避免地会涉及到加载和错误状态，因此 <code>defineAsyncComponent()<code> 也支持在高级选项中处理这些状态：<p><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> AsyncComp<span><span> =<span><span> defineAsyncComponent<span><span>({<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/async.html", "title": "异步组件", "doc_id": "fa618f43dd23401ab3eda3b07dbb16a8", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 580, "chunk_index": 16, "_doc_id": "16_7194985206163469938"}}
{"doc_id": "17_1787657044172563312", "text": "onst<span><span> AsyncComp<span><span> =<span><span> defineAsyncComponent<span><span>({<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 加载函数<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> loader<span><span>: () <span><span>=><span><span> import<span><span>(<span><span>'./Foo.vue'<span><span>),<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 加载异步组件时使用的组件<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> loadingComponent: LoadingComponent,<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 展示加载组件前的延迟时间，默认为 200ms<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/async.html", "title": "异步组件", "doc_id": "fa618f43dd23401ab3eda3b07dbb16a8", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 580, "chunk_index": 17, "_doc_id": "17_1787657044172563312"}}
{"doc_id": "18_7099918119423038387", "text": "nent: LoadingComponent,<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 展示加载组件前的延迟时间，默认为 200ms<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> delay: <span><span>200<span><span>,<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 加载失败后展示的组件<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> errorComponent: ErrorComponent,<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 如果提供了一个 timeout 时间限制，并超时了<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 也会显示这里配置的报错组件，默认值是：Infinity<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/async.html", "title": "异步组件", "doc_id": "fa618f43dd23401ab3eda3b07dbb16a8", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 580, "chunk_index": 18, "_doc_id": "18_7099918119423038387"}}
{"doc_id": "19_4631692882998379268", "text": "timeout 时间限制，并超时了<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 也会显示这里配置的报错组件，默认值是：Infinity<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> timeout: <span><span>3000<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>})<span><span><code><pre><div><p>如果提供了一个加载组件，它将在内部组件加载时先行显示。在加载组件显示之前有一个默认的 200ms 延迟——这是因为在网络状况较好时，加载完成得很快，加载组件和最终组件之间的替换太快可能产生闪烁，反而影响用户感受。<p><p>如果提供了一个报错组件，则它会在加载器函数返回的 Promise 抛错时被渲染。你还可以指定一个超时时间，在请求耗时超过指定时间时也会渲染报错组件。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/async.html", "title": "异步组件", "doc_id": "fa618f43dd23401ab3eda3b07dbb16a8", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 580, "chunk_index": 19, "_doc_id": "19_4631692882998379268"}}
{"doc_id": "20_2321041359925837916", "text": "替换太快可能产生闪烁，反而影响用户感受。<p><p>如果提供了一个报错组件，则它会在加载器函数返回的 Promise 抛错时被渲染。你还可以指定一个超时时间，在请求耗时超过指定时间时也会渲染报错组件。<p><h2 id=\"lazy-hydration\">惰性激活 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#lazy-hydration\" class=\"vt-badge\">​<a><h2><blockquote><p>如果你正在使用<a href=\"/guide/scaling-up/ssr.html\">服务器端渲染<a>，这一部分才会适用。<p><blockquote><p>在 Vue 3.5+ 中，异步组件可以通过提供激活策略来控制何时进行激活。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/async.html", "title": "异步组件", "doc_id": "fa618f43dd23401ab3eda3b07dbb16a8", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 580, "chunk_index": 20, "_doc_id": "20_2321041359925837916"}}
{"doc_id": "21_6218002547465597392", "text": "uide/scaling-up/ssr.html\">服务器端渲染<a>，这一部分才会适用。<p><blockquote><p>在 Vue 3.5+ 中，异步组件可以通过提供激活策略来控制何时进行激活。<p><h3 id=\"hydrate-on-idle\">在空闲时进行激活 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#hydrate-on-idle\">​<a><h3><p>通过 <code>requestIdleCallback<code> 进行激活：<p><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>import<span><span> { defineAsyncComponent, hydrateOnIdle } <span><span>from<span><span> 'vue'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/async.html", "title": "异步组件", "doc_id": "fa618f43dd23401ab3eda3b07dbb16a8", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 580, "chunk_index": 21, "_doc_id": "21_6218002547465597392"}}
{"doc_id": "22_6389481957173886323", "text": "Component, hydrateOnIdle } <span><span>from<span><span> 'vue'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> AsyncComp<span><span> =<span><span> defineAsyncComponent<span><span>({<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> loader<span><span>: () <span><span>=><span><span> import<span><span>(<span><span>'./Comp.vue'<span><span>),<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> hydrate: <span><span>hydrateOnIdle<span><span>(<span><span>/* 传递可选的最大超时 */<span><span>)<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/async.html", "title": "异步组件", "doc_id": "fa618f43dd23401ab3eda3b07dbb16a8", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 580, "chunk_index": 22, "_doc_id": "22_6389481957173886323"}}
{"doc_id": "23_4813384932142075700", "text": "hydrate: <span><span>hydrateOnIdle<span><span>(<span><span>/* 传递可选的最大超时 */<span><span>)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>})<span><span><code><pre><div><h3 id=\"hydrate-on-visible\">在可见时激活 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#hydrate-on-visible\">​<a><h3><p>通过 <code>IntersectionObserver<code> 在元素变为可见时进行激活。<p><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>import<span><span> { defineAsyncComponent, hydrateOnVisible } <span><span>from<span><span> 'vue'<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/async.html", "title": "异步组件", "doc_id": "fa618f43dd23401ab3eda3b07dbb16a8", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 580, "chunk_index": 23, "_doc_id": "23_4813384932142075700"}}
{"doc_id": "24_8941994296404670678", "text": "an><span> { defineAsyncComponent, hydrateOnVisible } <span><span>from<span><span> 'vue'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> AsyncComp<span><span> =<span><span> defineAsyncComponent<span><span>({<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> loader<span><span>: () <span><span>=><span><span> import<span><span>(<span><span>'./Comp.vue'<span><span>),<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> hydrate: <span><span>hydrateOnVisible<span><span>()<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/async.html", "title": "异步组件", "doc_id": "fa618f43dd23401ab3eda3b07dbb16a8", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 580, "chunk_index": 24, "_doc_id": "24_8941994296404670678"}}
{"doc_id": "25_7184934600613381527", "text": "an><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> hydrate: <span><span>hydrateOnVisible<span><span>()<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>})<span><span><code><pre><div><p>可以选择传递一个侦听器的选项对象值：<p><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>hydrateOnVisible<span><span>({ rootMargin: <span><span>'100px'<span><span> })<span><span><code><pre><div><p>当指定的媒体查询匹配时进行激活。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/async.html", "title": "异步组件", "doc_id": "fa618f43dd23401ab3eda3b07dbb16a8", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 580, "chunk_index": 25, "_doc_id": "25_7184934600613381527"}}
{"doc_id": "26_1690958253585381531", "text": "pan>({ rootMargin: <span><span>'100px'<span><span> })<span><span><code><pre><div><p>当指定的媒体查询匹配时进行激活。<p><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>import<span><span> { defineAsyncComponent, hydrateOnMediaQuery } <span><span>from<span><span> 'vue'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> AsyncComp<span><span> =<span><span> defineAsyncComponent<span><span>({<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/async.html", "title": "异步组件", "doc_id": "fa618f43dd23401ab3eda3b07dbb16a8", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 580, "chunk_index": 26, "_doc_id": "26_1690958253585381531"}}
{"doc_id": "27_8572833992986550340", "text": "onst<span><span> AsyncComp<span><span> =<span><span> defineAsyncComponent<span><span>({<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> loader<span><span>: () <span><span>=><span><span> import<span><span>(<span><span>'./Comp.vue'<span><span>),<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> hydrate: <span><span>hydrateOnMediaQuery<span><span>(<span><span>'(max-width:500px)'<span><span>)<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/async.html", "title": "异步组件", "doc_id": "fa618f43dd23401ab3eda3b07dbb16a8", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 580, "chunk_index": 27, "_doc_id": "27_8572833992986550340"}}
{"doc_id": "28_3519811941850580036", "text": "span><span>hydrateOnMediaQuery<span><span>(<span><span>'(max-width:500px)'<span><span>)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>})<span><span><code><pre><div><h3 id=\"hydrate-on-interaction\">交互时激活 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#hydrate-on-interaction\">​<a><h3><p>当组件元素上触发指定事件时进行激活。完成激活后，触发激活的事件也将被重放。<p><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>import<span><span> { defineAsyncComponent, hydrateOnInteraction } <span><span>from<span><span> 'vue'<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/async.html", "title": "异步组件", "doc_id": "fa618f43dd23401ab3eda3b07dbb16a8", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 580, "chunk_index": 28, "_doc_id": "28_3519811941850580036"}}
{"doc_id": "29_6381053991299095595", "text": "span> { defineAsyncComponent, hydrateOnInteraction } <span><span>from<span><span> 'vue'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> AsyncComp<span><span> =<span><span> defineAsyncComponent<span><span>({<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> loader<span><span>: () <span><span>=><span><span> import<span><span>(<span><span>'./Comp.vue'<span><span>),<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/async.html", "title": "异步组件", "doc_id": "fa618f43dd23401ab3eda3b07dbb16a8", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 580, "chunk_index": 29, "_doc_id": "29_6381053991299095595"}}
{"doc_id": "30_6235223752337554727", "text": "() <span><span>=><span><span> import<span><span>(<span><span>'./Comp.vue'<span><span>),<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> hydrate: <span><span>hydrateOnInteraction<span><span>(<span><span>'click'<span><span>)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>})<span><span><code><pre><div><p>也可以是多个事件类型的列表：<p><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>hydrateOnInteraction<span><span>([<span><span>'wheel'<span><span>,", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/async.html", "title": "异步组件", "doc_id": "fa618f43dd23401ab3eda3b07dbb16a8", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 580, "chunk_index": 30, "_doc_id": "30_6235223752337554727"}}
{"doc_id": "31_1053643826930618168", "text": "\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>hydrateOnInteraction<span><span>([<span><span>'wheel'<span><span>, <span><span>'mouseover'<span><span>])<span><span><code><pre><div><h3 id=\"custom-strategy\">自定义策略 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#custom-strategy\">​<a><h3><div class=\"language-ts\"> <span class=\"lang\">ts<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>import<span><span> { defineAsyncComponent,", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/async.html", "title": "异步组件", "doc_id": "fa618f43dd23401ab3eda3b07dbb16a8", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 580, "chunk_index": 31, "_doc_id": "31_1053643826930618168"}}
{"doc_id": "32_8042071455179106774", "text": "hiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>import<span><span> { defineAsyncComponent, <span><span>type<span><span> HydrationStrategy } <span><span>from<span><span> 'vue'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> myStrategy<span><span>:<span><span> HydrationStrategy<span><span> =<span><span> (<span><span>hydrate<span><span>, <span><span>forEachElement<span><span>) <span><span>=><span><span> {<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/async.html", "title": "异步组件", "doc_id": "fa618f43dd23401ab3eda3b07dbb16a8", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 580, "chunk_index": 32, "_doc_id": "32_8042071455179106774"}}
{"doc_id": "33_301825415560836359", "text": "drate<span><span>, <span><span>forEachElement<span><span>) <span><span>=><span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // forEachElement 是一个遍历组件未激活的 DOM 中所有根元素的辅助函数，<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 因为根元素可能是一个片段而非单个元素<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> forEachElement<span><span>(<span><span>el<span><span> =><span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // ...<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> })<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 准备好时调用 `hydrate`<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/async.html", "title": "异步组件", "doc_id": "fa618f43dd23401ab3eda3b07dbb16a8", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 580, "chunk_index": 33, "_doc_id": "33_301825415560836359"}}
{"doc_id": "34_5657911031742829856", "text": "<span class=\"line\"><span> })<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 准备好时调用 `hydrate`<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> hydrate<span><span>()<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> return<span><span> () <span><span>=><span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 如必要，返回一个销毁函数<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/async.html", "title": "异步组件", "doc_id": "fa618f43dd23401ab3eda3b07dbb16a8", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 580, "chunk_index": 34, "_doc_id": "34_5657911031742829856"}}
{"doc_id": "35_4597116728225034005", "text": "class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> AsyncComp<span><span> =<span><span> defineAsyncComponent<span><span>({<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> loader<span><span>: () <span><span>=><span><span> import<span><span>(<span><span>'./Comp.vue'<span><span>),<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> hydrate: myStrategy<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/async.html", "title": "异步组件", "doc_id": "fa618f43dd23401ab3eda3b07dbb16a8", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 580, "chunk_index": 35, "_doc_id": "35_4597116728225034005"}}
{"doc_id": "36_2395395866444149657", "text": "an>'./Comp.vue'<span><span>),<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> hydrate: myStrategy<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>})<span><span><code><pre><div><h2 id=\"using-with-suspense\">搭配 Suspense 使用 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#using-with-suspense\">​<a><h2><p>异步组件可以搭配内置的 <code><Suspense><code> 组件一起使用，若想了解 <code><Suspense><code> 和异步组件之间交互，请参阅 <a href=\"/guide/built-ins/suspense.html\"><code><Suspense><code><a> 章节。<p><div><div>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/async.html", "title": "异步组件", "doc_id": "fa618f43dd23401ab3eda3b07dbb16a8", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 580, "chunk_index": 36, "_doc_id": "36_2395395866444149657"}}
{"doc_id": "0_8930555472029035998", "text": "<div><div><h1 id=\"suspense\">Suspense <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#suspense\">​<a><h1><div class=\"warning custom-block\"><p class=\"custom-block-title\">实验性功能<p><p><code><Suspense><code> 是一项实验性功能。它不一定会最终成为稳定功能，并且在稳定之前相关 API 也可能会发生变化。<p><div><p><code><Suspense><code> 是一个内置组件，用来在组件树中协调对异步依赖的处理。它让我们可以在组件树上层等待下层的多个嵌套异步依赖项解析完成，并可以在等待时渲染一个加载状态。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/suspense.html", "title": "Suspense | Vue.js", "doc_id": "0cf5370b830342819cb356cc0b0f9b95", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 430, "chunk_index": 0, "_doc_id": "0_8930555472029035998"}}
{"doc_id": "1_5553195131892730434", "text": "><p><code><Suspense><code> 是一个内置组件，用来在组件树中协调对异步依赖的处理。它让我们可以在组件树上层等待下层的多个嵌套异步依赖项解析完成，并可以在等待时渲染一个加载状态。<p><h2 id=\"async-dependencies\">异步依赖 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#async-dependencies\">​<a><h2><p>要了解 <code><Suspense><code> 所解决的问题和它是如何与异步依赖进行交互的，我们需要想象这样一种组件层级结构：<p><div class=\"language-\"> <span class=\"lang\"><span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><Suspense><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>└─ <Dashboard><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/suspense.html", "title": "Suspense | Vue.js", "doc_id": "0cf5370b830342819cb356cc0b0f9b95", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 430, "chunk_index": 1, "_doc_id": "1_5553195131892730434"}}
{"doc_id": "2_638916597463458443", "text": "<span class=\"line\"><span><Suspense><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>└─ <Dashboard><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> ├─ <Profile><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> │ └─ <FriendStatus> (组件有异步的 setup())<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> └─ <Content><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> ├─ <ActivityFeed> (异步组件)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> └─ <Stats> (异步组件)<span><span><code><pre><div><p>在这个组件树中有多个嵌套组件，要渲染出它们，首先得解析一些异步资源。如果没有 <code><Suspense><code>，则它们每个都需要处理自己的加载、报错和完成状态。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/suspense.html", "title": "Suspense | Vue.js", "doc_id": "0cf5370b830342819cb356cc0b0f9b95", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 430, "chunk_index": 2, "_doc_id": "2_638916597463458443"}}
{"doc_id": "3_7850095938296487016", "text": "><pre><div><p>在这个组件树中有多个嵌套组件，要渲染出它们，首先得解析一些异步资源。如果没有 <code><Suspense><code>，则它们每个都需要处理自己的加载、报错和完成状态。在最坏的情况下，我们可能会在页面上看到三个旋转的加载态，在不同的时间显示出内容。<p><p>有了 <code><Suspense><code> 组件后，我们就可以在等待整个多层级组件树中的各个异步依赖获取结果时，在顶层展示出加载中或加载失败的状态。<p><p><code><Suspense><code> 可以等待的异步依赖有两种：<p><ol><li><p>带有异步 <code>setup()<code> 钩子的组件。这也包含了使用 <code><script setup><code> 时有顶层 <code>await<code> 表达式的组件。<p><li><li><p><a href=\"/guide/components/async.html\">异步组件<a>。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/suspense.html", "title": "Suspense | Vue.js", "doc_id": "0cf5370b830342819cb356cc0b0f9b95", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 430, "chunk_index": 3, "_doc_id": "3_7850095938296487016"}}
{"doc_id": "4_3768508510854132486", "text": "p><code> 时有顶层 <code>await<code> 表达式的组件。<p><li><li><p><a href=\"/guide/components/async.html\">异步组件<a>。<p><li><ol><h3 id=\"async-setup\"><code>async setup()<code> <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#async-setup\">​<a><h3><p>组合式 API 中组件的 <code>setup()<code> 钩子可以是异步的：<p><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/suspense.html", "title": "Suspense | Vue.js", "doc_id": "0cf5370b830342819cb356cc0b0f9b95", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 430, "chunk_index": 4, "_doc_id": "4_3768508510854132486"}}
{"doc_id": "5_5331231178164304227", "text": "b-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> async<span><span> setup<span><span>() {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> const<span><span> res<span><span> =<span><span> await<span><span> fetch<span><span>(<span><span>...<span><span>)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> const<span><span> posts<span><span> =<span><span> await<span><span> res.<span><span>json<span><span>()<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/suspense.html", "title": "Suspense | Vue.js", "doc_id": "0cf5370b830342819cb356cc0b0f9b95", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 430, "chunk_index": 5, "_doc_id": "5_5331231178164304227"}}
{"doc_id": "6_5373855569612234154", "text": "n> posts<span><span> =<span><span> await<span><span> res.<span><span>json<span><span>()<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> return<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> posts<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/suspense.html", "title": "Suspense | Vue.js", "doc_id": "0cf5370b830342819cb356cc0b0f9b95", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 430, "chunk_index": 6, "_doc_id": "6_5373855569612234154"}}
{"doc_id": "7_5997916386233734785", "text": "> posts<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span><code><pre><div><p>如果使用 <code><script setup><code>，那么顶层 <code>await<code> 表达式会自动让该组件成为一个异步依赖：<p><div class=\"language-vue\"> <span class=\"lang\">vue<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>script<span><span> setup<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/suspense.html", "title": "Suspense | Vue.js", "doc_id": "0cf5370b830342819cb356cc0b0f9b95", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 430, "chunk_index": 7, "_doc_id": "7_5997916386233734785"}}
{"doc_id": "8_8779417898818991954", "text": "code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>script<span><span> setup<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> res<span><span> =<span><span> await<span><span> fetch<span><span>(<span><span>...<span><span>)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> posts<span><span> =<span><span> await<span><span> res.<span><span>json<span><span>()<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>script<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/suspense.html", "title": "Suspense | Vue.js", "doc_id": "0cf5370b830342819cb356cc0b0f9b95", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 430, "chunk_index": 8, "_doc_id": "8_8779417898818991954"}}
{"doc_id": "9_259441288904318418", "text": "n>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>script<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> {{ posts }}<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><h3 id=\"async-components\">异步组件 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#async-components\">​<a><h3><p>异步组件默认就是<strong>“suspensible”<strong>的。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/suspense.html", "title": "Suspense | Vue.js", "doc_id": "0cf5370b830342819cb356cc0b0f9b95", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 430, "chunk_index": 9, "_doc_id": "9_259441288904318418"}}
{"doc_id": "10_1834606161497013657", "text": "<a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#async-components\">​<a><h3><p>异步组件默认就是<strong>“suspensible”<strong>的。这意味着如果组件关系链上有一个 <code><Suspense><code>，那么这个异步组件就会被当作这个 <code><Suspense><code> 的一个异步依赖。在这种情况下，加载状态是由 <code><Suspense><code> 控制，而该组件自己的加载、报错、延时和超时等选项都将被忽略。<p><p>异步组件也可以通过在选项中指定 <code>suspensible: false<code> 表明不用 <code>Suspense<code> 控制，并让组件始终自己控制其加载状态。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/suspense.html", "title": "Suspense | Vue.js", "doc_id": "0cf5370b830342819cb356cc0b0f9b95", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 430, "chunk_index": 10, "_doc_id": "10_1834606161497013657"}}
{"doc_id": "11_1634648598034662506", "text": "略。<p><p>异步组件也可以通过在选项中指定 <code>suspensible: false<code> 表明不用 <code>Suspense<code> 控制，并让组件始终自己控制其加载状态。<p><h2 id=\"loading-state\">加载中状态 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#loading-state\">​<a><h2><p><code><Suspense><code> 组件有两个插槽：<code>#default<code> 和 <code>#fallback<code>。两个插槽都只允许<strong>一个<strong>直接子节点。在可能的时候都将显示默认插槽中的节点。否则将显示后备插槽中的节点。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/suspense.html", "title": "Suspense | Vue.js", "doc_id": "0cf5370b830342819cb356cc0b0f9b95", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 430, "chunk_index": 11, "_doc_id": "11_1634648598034662506"}}
{"doc_id": "12_8845491060877457554", "text": "ault<code> 和 <code>#fallback<code>。两个插槽都只允许<strong>一个<strong>直接子节点。在可能的时候都将显示默认插槽中的节点。否则将显示后备插槽中的节点。<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>Suspense<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <!-- 具有深层异步依赖的组件 --><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>Dashboard<span><span> /><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/suspense.html", "title": "Suspense | Vue.js", "doc_id": "0cf5370b830342819cb356cc0b0f9b95", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 430, "chunk_index": 12, "_doc_id": "12_8845491060877457554"}}
{"doc_id": "13_2492921074030183503", "text": "pan class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>Dashboard<span><span> /><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <!-- 在 #fallback 插槽中显示 “正在加载中” --><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>template<span><span> #<span><span>fallback<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> Loading...<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> </<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/suspense.html", "title": "Suspense | Vue.js", "doc_id": "0cf5370b830342819cb356cc0b0f9b95", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 430, "chunk_index": 13, "_doc_id": "13_2492921074030183503"}}
{"doc_id": "14_5431004411272436362", "text": "n> Loading...<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> </<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>Suspense<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>在初始渲染时，<code><Suspense><code> 将在内存中渲染其默认的插槽内容。如果在这个过程中遇到任何异步依赖，则会进入<strong>挂起<strong>状态。在挂起状态期间，展示的是后备内容。当所有遇到的异步依赖都完成后，<code><Suspense><code> 会进入<strong>完成<strong>状态，并将展示出默认插槽的内容。<p><p>如果在初次渲染时没有遇到异步依赖，<code><Suspense><code> 会直接进入完成状态。<p><p>进入完成状态后，只有当默认插槽的根节点被替换时，<code><Suspense><code> 才会回到挂起状态。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/suspense.html", "title": "Suspense | Vue.js", "doc_id": "0cf5370b830342819cb356cc0b0f9b95", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 430, "chunk_index": 14, "_doc_id": "14_5431004411272436362"}}
{"doc_id": "15_2573853757167132058", "text": "异步依赖，<code><Suspense><code> 会直接进入完成状态。<p><p>进入完成状态后，只有当默认插槽的根节点被替换时，<code><Suspense><code> 才会回到挂起状态。组件树中新的更深层次的异步依赖<strong>不会<strong>造成 <code><Suspense><code> 回退到挂起状态。<p><p>发生回退时，后备内容不会立即展示出来。相反，<code><Suspense><code> 在等待新内容和异步依赖完成时，会展示之前 <code>#default<code> 插槽的内容。这个行为可以通过一个 <code>timeout<code> prop 进行配置：在等待渲染新内容耗时超过 <code>timeout<code> 毫秒之后，<code><Suspense><code> 将会切换为展示后备内容。若 <code>timeout<code> 值为 <code>0<code> 将导致在替换默认内容时立即显示后备内容。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/suspense.html", "title": "Suspense | Vue.js", "doc_id": "0cf5370b830342819cb356cc0b0f9b95", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 430, "chunk_index": 15, "_doc_id": "15_2573853757167132058"}}
{"doc_id": "16_4401841080243237907", "text": "毫秒之后，<code><Suspense><code> 将会切换为展示后备内容。若 <code>timeout<code> 值为 <code>0<code> 将导致在替换默认内容时立即显示后备内容。<p><h2 id=\"events\">事件 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#events\">​<a><h2><p><code><Suspense><code> 组件会触发三个事件：<code>pending<code>、<code>resolve<code> 和 <code>fallback<code>。<code>pending<code> 事件是在进入挂起状态时触发。<code>resolve<code> 事件是在 <code>default<code> 插槽完成获取新内容时触发。<code>fallback<code> 事件则是在 <code>fallback<code> 插槽的内容显示时触发。<p><p>例如，可以使用这些事件在加载新组件时在之前的 DOM 最上层显示一个加载指示器。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/suspense.html", "title": "Suspense | Vue.js", "doc_id": "0cf5370b830342819cb356cc0b0f9b95", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 430, "chunk_index": 16, "_doc_id": "16_4401841080243237907"}}
{"doc_id": "17_7527075774309921226", "text": ">fallback<code> 事件则是在 <code>fallback<code> 插槽的内容显示时触发。<p><p>例如，可以使用这些事件在加载新组件时在之前的 DOM 最上层显示一个加载指示器。<p><h2 id=\"error-handling\">错误处理 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#error-handling\">​<a><h2><p><code><Suspense><code> 组件自身目前还不提供错误处理，不过你可以使用 <a href=\"/api/options-lifecycle.html#errorcaptured\"><code>errorCaptured<code><a> 选项或者 <a href=\"/api/composition-api-lifecycle.html#onerrorcaptured\"><code>onErrorCaptured()<code><a> 钩子，在使用到 <code><Suspense><code> 的父组件中捕获和处理异步错误。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/suspense.html", "title": "Suspense | Vue.js", "doc_id": "0cf5370b830342819cb356cc0b0f9b95", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 430, "chunk_index": 17, "_doc_id": "17_7527075774309921226"}}
{"doc_id": "18_3867542961174262338", "text": "tml#onerrorcaptured\"><code>onErrorCaptured()<code><a> 钩子，在使用到 <code><Suspense><code> 的父组件中捕获和处理异步错误。<p><h2 id=\"combining-with-other-components\">和其他组件结合 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#combining-with-other-components\">​<a><h2><p>我们常常会将 <code><Suspense><code> 和 <a href=\"./transition.html\"><code><Transition><code><a>、<a href=\"./keep-alive.html\"><code><KeepAlive><code><a> 等组件结合。要保证这些组件都能正常工作，嵌套的顺序非常重要。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/suspense.html", "title": "Suspense | Vue.js", "doc_id": "0cf5370b830342819cb356cc0b0f9b95", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 430, "chunk_index": 18, "_doc_id": "18_3867542961174262338"}}
{"doc_id": "19_9005199285917206351", "text": "tion><code><a>、<a href=\"./keep-alive.html\"><code><KeepAlive><code><a> 等组件结合。要保证这些组件都能正常工作，嵌套的顺序非常重要。<p><p>另外，这些组件都通常与 <a href=\"https://router.vuejs.org/zh/\" target=\"_blank\">Vue Router<a> 中的 <code><RouterView><code> 组件结合使用。<p><p>下面的示例展示了如何嵌套这些组件，使它们都能按照预期的方式运行。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/suspense.html", "title": "Suspense | Vue.js", "doc_id": "0cf5370b830342819cb356cc0b0f9b95", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 430, "chunk_index": 19, "_doc_id": "19_9005199285917206351"}}
{"doc_id": "20_5858680744353374693", "text": "get=\"_blank\">Vue Router<a> 中的 <code><RouterView><code> 组件结合使用。<p><p>下面的示例展示了如何嵌套这些组件，使它们都能按照预期的方式运行。若想组合得更简单，你也可以删除一些你不需要的组件：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>RouterView<span><span> v-slot<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>{ Component }<span><span>\"<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/suspense.html", "title": "Suspense | Vue.js", "doc_id": "0cf5370b830342819cb356cc0b0f9b95", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 430, "chunk_index": 20, "_doc_id": "20_5858680744353374693"}}
{"doc_id": "21_4491328777215365149", "text": "an> v-slot<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>{ Component }<span><span>\"<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>template<span><span> v-if<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>Component<span><span>\"<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>Transition<span><span> mode<span><span>=<span><span>\"out-in\"<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>KeepAlive<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/suspense.html", "title": "Suspense | Vue.js", "doc_id": "0cf5370b830342819cb356cc0b0f9b95", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 430, "chunk_index": 21, "_doc_id": "21_4491328777215365149"}}
{"doc_id": "22_8498155406450072164", "text": "<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>KeepAlive<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>Suspense<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <!-- 主要内容 --><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>component<span><span> :<span><span>is<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>Component<span><span>\"<span><span>></<span><span>component<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <!-- 加载中状态 --><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/suspense.html", "title": "Suspense | Vue.js", "doc_id": "0cf5370b830342819cb356cc0b0f9b95", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 430, "chunk_index": 22, "_doc_id": "22_8498155406450072164"}}
{"doc_id": "23_2450593356924474126", "text": "><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <!-- 加载中状态 --><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>template<span><span> #<span><span>fallback<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> 正在加载...<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> </<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> </<span><span>Suspense<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> </<span><span>KeepAlive<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/suspense.html", "title": "Suspense | Vue.js", "doc_id": "0cf5370b830342819cb356cc0b0f9b95", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 430, "chunk_index": 23, "_doc_id": "23_2450593356924474126"}}
{"doc_id": "24_8335017539134725692", "text": "span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> </<span><span>KeepAlive<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> </<span><span>Transition<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> </<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>RouterView<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>Vue Router 使用动态导入对<a href=\"https://router.vuejs.org/zh/guide/advanced/lazy-loading.html\" target=\"_blank\">懒加载组件<a>进行了内置支持。这些与异步组件不同，目前他们不会触发 <code><Suspense><code>。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/suspense.html", "title": "Suspense | Vue.js", "doc_id": "0cf5370b830342819cb356cc0b0f9b95", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 430, "chunk_index": 24, "_doc_id": "24_8335017539134725692"}}
{"doc_id": "25_1458617164548125054", "text": "vanced/lazy-loading.html\" target=\"_blank\">懒加载组件<a>进行了内置支持。这些与异步组件不同，目前他们不会触发 <code><Suspense><code>。但是，它们仍然可以有异步组件作为后代，这些组件可以照常触发 <code><Suspense><code>。<p><h2 id=\"nested-suspense\">嵌套使用 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#nested-suspense\">​<a><h2><p>当我们有多个类似于下方的异步组件 (常见于嵌套或基于布局的路由) 时：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>Suspense<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/suspense.html", "title": "Suspense | Vue.js", "doc_id": "0cf5370b830342819cb356cc0b0f9b95", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 430, "chunk_index": 25, "_doc_id": "25_1458617164548125054"}}
{"doc_id": "26_6409602298536486847", "text": "github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>Suspense<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>component<span><span> :<span><span>is<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>DynamicAsyncOuter<span><span>\"<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>component<span><span> :<span><span>is<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>DynamicAsyncInner<span><span>\"<span><span> /><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/suspense.html", "title": "Suspense | Vue.js", "doc_id": "0cf5370b830342819cb356cc0b0f9b95", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 430, "chunk_index": 26, "_doc_id": "26_6409602298536486847"}}
{"doc_id": "27_4526948954876209293", "text": "n>is<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>DynamicAsyncInner<span><span>\"<span><span> /><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> </<span><span>component<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>Suspense<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p><code><Suspense><code> 创建了一个边界，它将如预期的那样解析树下的所有异步组件。然而，当我们更改 <code>DynamicAsyncOuter<code> 时，<code><Suspense><code> 会正确地等待它，但当我们更改 <code>DynamicAsyncInner<code> 时，嵌套的 <code>DynamicAsyncInner<code> 会呈现为一个空节点，直到它被解析为止 (而不是之前的节点或回退插槽)。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/suspense.html", "title": "Suspense | Vue.js", "doc_id": "0cf5370b830342819cb356cc0b0f9b95", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 430, "chunk_index": 27, "_doc_id": "27_4526948954876209293"}}
{"doc_id": "28_6657100692385178833", "text": "code>DynamicAsyncInner<code> 时，嵌套的 <code>DynamicAsyncInner<code> 会呈现为一个空节点，直到它被解析为止 (而不是之前的节点或回退插槽)。<p><p>为了解决这个问题，我们可以使用嵌套的方法来处理嵌套组件的补丁，就像这样：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>Suspense<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>component<span><span> :<span><span>is<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>DynamicAsyncOuter<span><span>\"<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/suspense.html", "title": "Suspense | Vue.js", "doc_id": "0cf5370b830342819cb356cc0b0f9b95", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 430, "chunk_index": 28, "_doc_id": "28_6657100692385178833"}}
{"doc_id": "29_2207064322263481129", "text": "pan>is<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>DynamicAsyncOuter<span><span>\"<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>Suspense<span><span> suspensible<span><span>> <span><span><!-- 像这样 --><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>component<span><span> :<span><span>is<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>DynamicAsyncInner<span><span>\"<span><span> /><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> </<span><span>Suspense<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/suspense.html", "title": "Suspense | Vue.js", "doc_id": "0cf5370b830342819cb356cc0b0f9b95", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 430, "chunk_index": 29, "_doc_id": "29_2207064322263481129"}}
{"doc_id": "30_2989984377426145078", "text": "pan><span> /><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> </<span><span>Suspense<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> </<span><span>component<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/suspense.html", "title": "Suspense | Vue.js", "doc_id": "0cf5370b830342819cb356cc0b0f9b95", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 430, "chunk_index": 30, "_doc_id": "30_2989984377426145078"}}
{"doc_id": "31_1325150874717698194", "text": "span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> </<span><span>component<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>Suspense<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>如果你不设置 <code>suspensible<code> 属性，内部的 <code><Suspense><code> 将被父级 <code><Suspense><code> 视为同步组件。这意味着它将会有自己的回退插槽，如果两个 <code>Dynamic<code> 组件同时被修改，则当子 <code><Suspense><code> 加载其自己的依赖关系树时，可能会出现空节点和多个修补周期，这可能不是理想情况。设置后，所有异步依赖项处理都会交给父级 <code><Suspense><code> (包括发出的事件)，而内部 <code><Suspense><code> 仅充当依赖项解析和修补的另一个边界。<p>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/suspense.html", "title": "Suspense | Vue.js", "doc_id": "0cf5370b830342819cb356cc0b0f9b95", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 430, "chunk_index": 31, "_doc_id": "31_1325150874717698194"}}
{"doc_id": "32_5513005994398883276", "text": "后，所有异步依赖项处理都会交给父级 <code><Suspense><code> (包括发出的事件)，而内部 <code><Suspense><code> 仅充当依赖项解析和修补的另一个边界。<p>\n<p><strong>参考<strong><p><div><div>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/suspense.html", "title": "Suspense | Vue.js", "doc_id": "0cf5370b830342819cb356cc0b0f9b95", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 430, "chunk_index": 32, "_doc_id": "32_5513005994398883276"}}
{"doc_id": "0_5105222090429891315", "text": "<div><div><h1 id=\"fallthrough-attributes\">透传 Attributes <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#fallthrough-attributes\">​<a><h1><blockquote><p>此章节假设你已经看过了<a href=\"/guide/essentials/component-basics.html\">组件基础<a>。若你还不了解组件是什么，请先阅读该章节。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/attrs.html", "title": "透传 Attributes", "doc_id": "acb25be281b64c798e1898a5831b267a", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 473, "chunk_index": 0, "_doc_id": "0_5105222090429891315"}}
{"doc_id": "1_2271079055195421513", "text": "ckquote><p>此章节假设你已经看过了<a href=\"/guide/essentials/component-basics.html\">组件基础<a>。若你还不了解组件是什么，请先阅读该章节。<p><blockquote><h2 id=\"attribute-inheritance\">Attributes 继承 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#attribute-inheritance\">​<a><h2><p>“透传 attribute”指的是传递给一个组件，却没有被该组件声明为 <a href=\"./props.html\">props<a> 或 <a href=\"./events.html#defining-custom-events\">emits<a> 的 attribute 或者 <code>v-on<code> 事件监听器。最常见的例子就是 <code>class<code>、<code>style<code> 和 <code>id<code>。<p><p>当一个组件以单个元素为根作渲染时，透传的 attribute 会自动被添加到根元素上。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/attrs.html", "title": "透传 Attributes", "doc_id": "acb25be281b64c798e1898a5831b267a", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 473, "chunk_index": 1, "_doc_id": "1_2271079055195421513"}}
{"doc_id": "2_3312899051460455927", "text": "ode>class<code>、<code>style<code> 和 <code>id<code>。<p><p>当一个组件以单个元素为根作渲染时，透传的 attribute 会自动被添加到根元素上。举例来说，假如我们有一个 <code><MyButton><code> 组件，它的模板长这样：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><!-- <MyButton> 的模板 --><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>button<span><span>>Click Me</<span><span>button<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>一个父组件使用了这个组件，并且传入了 <code>class<code>：<p><div", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/attrs.html", "title": "透传 Attributes", "doc_id": "acb25be281b64c798e1898a5831b267a", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 473, "chunk_index": 2, "_doc_id": "2_3312899051460455927"}}
{"doc_id": "3_3139694658375780992", "text": "span>button<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>一个父组件使用了这个组件，并且传入了 <code>class<code>：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>MyButton<span><span> class<span><span>=<span><span>\"large\"<span><span> /><span><span><code><pre><div><p>最后渲染出的 DOM 结果是：<p><div class=\"language-html\"> <span class=\"lang\">html<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/attrs.html", "title": "透传 Attributes", "doc_id": "acb25be281b64c798e1898a5831b267a", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 473, "chunk_index": 3, "_doc_id": "3_3139694658375780992"}}
{"doc_id": "4_8589871266512320090", "text": "ss=\"language-html\"> <span class=\"lang\">html<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>button<span><span> class<span><span>=<span><span>\"large\"<span><span>>Click Me</<span><span>button<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>这里，<code><MyButton><code> 并没有将 <code>class<code> 声明为一个它所接受的 prop，所以 <code>class<code> 被视作透传 attribute，自动透传到了 <code><MyButton><code> 的根元素上。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/attrs.html", "title": "透传 Attributes", "doc_id": "acb25be281b64c798e1898a5831b267a", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 473, "chunk_index": 4, "_doc_id": "4_8589871266512320090"}}
{"doc_id": "5_8892247353788233203", "text": "lass<code> 声明为一个它所接受的 prop，所以 <code>class<code> 被视作透传 attribute，自动透传到了 <code><MyButton><code> 的根元素上。<p><h3 id=\"class-and-style-merging\">对 <code>class<code> 和 <code>style<code> 的合并 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#class-and-style-merging\">​<a><h3><p>如果一个子组件的根元素已经有了 <code>class<code> 或 <code>style<code> attribute，它会和从父组件上继承的值合并。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/attrs.html", "title": "透传 Attributes", "doc_id": "acb25be281b64c798e1898a5831b267a", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 473, "chunk_index": 5, "_doc_id": "5_8892247353788233203"}}
{"doc_id": "6_846907709151754657", "text": "-merging\">​<a><h3><p>如果一个子组件的根元素已经有了 <code>class<code> 或 <code>style<code> attribute，它会和从父组件上继承的值合并。如果我们将之前的 <code><MyButton><code> 组件的模板改成这样：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><!-- <MyButton> 的模板 --><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>button<span><span> class<span><span>=<span><span>\"btn\"<span><span>>Click Me</<span><span>button<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>则最后渲染出的 DOM", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/attrs.html", "title": "透传 Attributes", "doc_id": "acb25be281b64c798e1898a5831b267a", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 473, "chunk_index": 6, "_doc_id": "6_846907709151754657"}}
{"doc_id": "7_8365172332295209131", "text": "tn\"<span><span>>Click Me</<span><span>button<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>则最后渲染出的 DOM 结果会变成：<p><div class=\"language-html\"> <span class=\"lang\">html<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>button<span><span> class<span><span>=<span><span>\"btn large\"<span><span>>Click Me</<span><span>button<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><h3 id=\"v-on-listener-inheritance\"><code>v-on<code> 监听器继承 <a class=\"header-anchor\"", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/attrs.html", "title": "透传 Attributes", "doc_id": "acb25be281b64c798e1898a5831b267a", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 473, "chunk_index": 7, "_doc_id": "7_8365172332295209131"}}
{"doc_id": "8_6679375095439147088", "text": "><code><pre><div><h3 id=\"v-on-listener-inheritance\"><code>v-on<code> 监听器继承 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#v-on-listener-inheritance\">​<a><h3><p>同样的规则也适用于 <code>v-on<code> 事件监听器：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>MyButton<span><span> @<span><span>click<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>onClick<span><span>\"<span><span> /><span><span><code><pre><div><p><code>click<code> 监听器会被添加到", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/attrs.html", "title": "透传 Attributes", "doc_id": "acb25be281b64c798e1898a5831b267a", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 473, "chunk_index": 8, "_doc_id": "8_6679375095439147088"}}
{"doc_id": "9_7869079609280438397", "text": "><span>onClick<span><span>\"<span><span> /><span><span><code><pre><div><p><code>click<code> 监听器会被添加到 <code><MyButton><code> 的根元素，即那个原生的 <code><button><code> 元素之上。当原生的 <code><button><code> 被点击，会触发父组件的 <code>onClick<code> 方法。同样的，如果原生 <code>button<code> 元素自身也通过 <code>v-on<code> 绑定了一个事件监听器，则这个监听器和从父组件继承的监听器都会被触发。<p><h3 id=\"nested-component-inheritance\">深层组件继承 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#nested-component-inheritance\">​<a><h3><p>有些情况下一个组件会在根节点上渲染另一个组件。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/attrs.html", "title": "透传 Attributes", "doc_id": "acb25be281b64c798e1898a5831b267a", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 473, "chunk_index": 9, "_doc_id": "9_7869079609280438397"}}
{"doc_id": "10_6544917143067507986", "text": "件继承 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#nested-component-inheritance\">​<a><h3><p>有些情况下一个组件会在根节点上渲染另一个组件。例如，我们重构一下 <code><MyButton><code>，让它在根节点上渲染 <code><BaseButton><code>：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><!-- <MyButton/> 的模板，只是渲染另一个组件 --><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/attrs.html", "title": "透传 Attributes", "doc_id": "acb25be281b64c798e1898a5831b267a", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 473, "chunk_index": 10, "_doc_id": "10_6544917143067507986"}}
{"doc_id": "11_3285946623720870267", "text": "github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><!-- <MyButton/> 的模板，只是渲染另一个组件 --><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>BaseButton<span><span> /><span><span><code><pre><div><p>此时 <code><MyButton><code> 接收的透传 attribute 会直接继续传给 <code><BaseButton><code>。<p><p>请注意：<p><ol><li><p>透传的 attribute 不会包含 <code><MyButton><code> 上声明过的 props 或是针对 <code>emits<code> 声明事件的 <code>v-on<code> 侦听函数，换句话说，声明过的 props 和侦听函数被 <code><MyButton><code>“消费”了。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/attrs.html", "title": "透传 Attributes", "doc_id": "acb25be281b64c798e1898a5831b267a", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 473, "chunk_index": 11, "_doc_id": "11_3285946623720870267"}}
{"doc_id": "12_7307241838565645370", "text": "针对 <code>emits<code> 声明事件的 <code>v-on<code> 侦听函数，换句话说，声明过的 props 和侦听函数被 <code><MyButton><code>“消费”了。<p><li><li><p>透传的 attribute 若符合声明，也可以作为 props 传入 <code><BaseButton><code>。<p><li><ol><h2 id=\"disabling-attribute-inheritance\">禁用 Attributes 继承 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#disabling-attribute-inheritance\">​<a><h2><p>如果你<strong>不想要<strong>一个组件自动地继承 attribute，你可以在组件选项中设置 <code>inheritAttrs: false<code>。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/attrs.html", "title": "透传 Attributes", "doc_id": "acb25be281b64c798e1898a5831b267a", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 473, "chunk_index": 12, "_doc_id": "12_7307241838565645370"}}
{"doc_id": "13_8064180446144372461", "text": "e\">​<a><h2><p>如果你<strong>不想要<strong>一个组件自动地继承 attribute，你可以在组件选项中设置 <code>inheritAttrs: false<code>。<p><div class=\"composition-api\"><p>从 3.3 开始你也可以直接在 <code><script setup><code> 中使用 <a href=\"/api/sfc-script-setup.html#defineoptions\"><code>defineOptions<code><a>：<p><div class=\"language-vue\"> <span class=\"lang\">vue<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>script<span><span> setup<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/attrs.html", "title": "透传 Attributes", "doc_id": "acb25be281b64c798e1898a5831b267a", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 473, "chunk_index": 13, "_doc_id": "13_8064180446144372461"}}
{"doc_id": "14_7132622456940786187", "text": "code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>script<span><span> setup<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>defineOptions<span><span>({<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> inheritAttrs: <span><span>false<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>})<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// ...setup 逻辑<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>script<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><div><p>最常见的需要禁用 attribute 继承的场景就是 attribute 需要应用在根节点以外的其他元素上。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/attrs.html", "title": "透传 Attributes", "doc_id": "acb25be281b64c798e1898a5831b267a", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 473, "chunk_index": 14, "_doc_id": "14_7132622456940786187"}}
{"doc_id": "15_3253789116062425570", "text": "an><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><div><p>最常见的需要禁用 attribute 继承的场景就是 attribute 需要应用在根节点以外的其他元素上。通过设置 <code>inheritAttrs<code> 选项为 <code>false<code>，你可以完全控制透传进来的 attribute 被如何使用。<p><p>这些透传进来的 attribute 可以在模板的表达式中直接用 <code>$attrs<code> 访问到。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/attrs.html", "title": "透传 Attributes", "doc_id": "acb25be281b64c798e1898a5831b267a", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 473, "chunk_index": 15, "_doc_id": "15_3253789116062425570"}}
{"doc_id": "16_4764713083967151516", "text": "lse<code>，你可以完全控制透传进来的 attribute 被如何使用。<p><p>这些透传进来的 attribute 可以在模板的表达式中直接用 <code>$attrs<code> 访问到。<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>span<span><span>>Fallthrough attribute: {{ $attrs }}</<span><span>span<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>这个 <code>$attrs<code> 对象包含了除组件所声明的 <code>props<code> 和 <code>emits<code> 之外的所有其他 attribute，例如 <code>class<code>，<code>style<code>，<code>v-on<code> 监听器等等。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/attrs.html", "title": "透传 Attributes", "doc_id": "acb25be281b64c798e1898a5831b267a", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 473, "chunk_index": 16, "_doc_id": "16_4764713083967151516"}}
{"doc_id": "17_3360365578102973291", "text": "和 <code>emits<code> 之外的所有其他 attribute，例如 <code>class<code>，<code>style<code>，<code>v-on<code> 监听器等等。<p><p>有几点需要注意：<p><p>现在我们要再次使用一下<a href=\"#attribute-inheritance\">之前小节<a>中的 <code><MyButton><code> 组件例子。有时候我们可能为了样式，需要在 <code><button><code> 元素外包装一层 <code><div><code>：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>div<span><span> class<span><span>=<span><span>\"btn-wrapper\"<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/attrs.html", "title": "透传 Attributes", "doc_id": "acb25be281b64c798e1898a5831b267a", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 473, "chunk_index": 17, "_doc_id": "17_3360365578102973291"}}
{"doc_id": "18_1605757601373366819", "text": "n><<span><span>div<span><span> class<span><span>=<span><span>\"btn-wrapper\"<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>button<span><span> class<span><span>=<span><span>\"btn\"<span><span>>Click Me</<span><span>button<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>div<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>我们想要所有像 <code>class<code> 和 <code>v-on<code> 监听器这样的透传 attribute 都应用在内部的 <code><button><code> 上而不是外层的 <code><div><code> 上。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/attrs.html", "title": "透传 Attributes", "doc_id": "acb25be281b64c798e1898a5831b267a", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 473, "chunk_index": 18, "_doc_id": "18_1605757601373366819"}}
{"doc_id": "19_4035997978356348706", "text": "ode> 和 <code>v-on<code> 监听器这样的透传 attribute 都应用在内部的 <code><button><code> 上而不是外层的 <code><div><code> 上。我们可以通过设定 <code>inheritAttrs: false<code> 和使用 <code>v-bind=\"$attrs\"<code> 来实现：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>div<span><span> class<span><span>=<span><span>\"btn-wrapper\"<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/attrs.html", "title": "透传 Attributes", "doc_id": "acb25be281b64c798e1898a5831b267a", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 473, "chunk_index": 19, "_doc_id": "19_4035997978356348706"}}
{"doc_id": "20_6918965250354788266", "text": "n><<span><span>div<span><span> class<span><span>=<span><span>\"btn-wrapper\"<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line highlighted\"><span> <<span><span>button<span><span> class<span><span>=<span><span>\"btn\"<span><span> v-bind<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>$attrs<span><span>\"<span><span>>Click Me</<span><span>button<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/attrs.html", "title": "透传 Attributes", "doc_id": "acb25be281b64c798e1898a5831b267a", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 473, "chunk_index": 20, "_doc_id": "20_6918965250354788266"}}
{"doc_id": "21_1733263252071480182", "text": ">\"<span><span>$attrs<span><span>\"<span><span>>Click Me</<span><span>button<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>div<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>小提示：<a href=\"/guide/essentials/template-syntax.html#dynamically-binding-multiple-attributes\">没有参数的 <code>v-bind<code><a> 会将一个对象的所有属性都作为 attribute 应用到目标元素上。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/attrs.html", "title": "透传 Attributes", "doc_id": "acb25be281b64c798e1898a5831b267a", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 473, "chunk_index": 21, "_doc_id": "21_1733263252071480182"}}
{"doc_id": "22_5589928958333438088", "text": "amically-binding-multiple-attributes\">没有参数的 <code>v-bind<code><a> 会将一个对象的所有属性都作为 attribute 应用到目标元素上。<p><h2 id=\"attribute-inheritance-on-multiple-root-nodes\">多根节点的 Attributes 继承 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#attribute-inheritance-on-multiple-root-nodes\">​<a><h2><p>和单根节点组件有所不同，有着多个根节点的组件没有自动 attribute 透传行为。如果 <code>$attrs<code> 没有被显式绑定，将会抛出一个运行时警告。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/attrs.html", "title": "透传 Attributes", "doc_id": "acb25be281b64c798e1898a5831b267a", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 473, "chunk_index": 22, "_doc_id": "22_5589928958333438088"}}
{"doc_id": "23_3119916824940215524", "text": "des\">​<a><h2><p>和单根节点组件有所不同，有着多个根节点的组件没有自动 attribute 透传行为。如果 <code>$attrs<code> 没有被显式绑定，将会抛出一个运行时警告。<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>CustomLayout<span><span> id<span><span>=<span><span>\"custom-layout\"<span><span> @<span><span>click<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>changeValue<span><span>\"<span><span> /><span><span><code><pre><div><p>如果 <code><CustomLayout><code> 有下面这样的多根节点模板，由于 Vue 不知道要将 attribute 透传到哪里，所以会抛出一个警告。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/attrs.html", "title": "透传 Attributes", "doc_id": "acb25be281b64c798e1898a5831b267a", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 473, "chunk_index": 23, "_doc_id": "23_3119916824940215524"}}
{"doc_id": "24_2727602922100039867", "text": "code><pre><div><p>如果 <code><CustomLayout><code> 有下面这样的多根节点模板，由于 Vue 不知道要将 attribute 透传到哪里，所以会抛出一个警告。<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>header<span><span>>...</<span><span>header<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>main<span><span>>...</<span><span>main<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/attrs.html", "title": "透传 Attributes", "doc_id": "acb25be281b64c798e1898a5831b267a", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 473, "chunk_index": 24, "_doc_id": "24_2727602922100039867"}}
{"doc_id": "25_1277687099501042579", "text": "pan class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>main<span><span>>...</<span><span>main<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>footer<span><span>>...</<span><span>footer<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>如果 <code>$attrs<code> 被显式绑定，则不会有警告：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>header<span><span>>...</<span><span>header<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/attrs.html", "title": "透传 Attributes", "doc_id": "acb25be281b64c798e1898a5831b267a", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 473, "chunk_index": 25, "_doc_id": "25_1277687099501042579"}}
{"doc_id": "26_478576025250697038", "text": "class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>header<span><span>>...</<span><span>header<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line highlighted\"><span><<span><span>main<span><span> v-bind<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>$attrs<span><span>\"<span><span>>...</<span><span>main<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/attrs.html", "title": "透传 Attributes", "doc_id": "acb25be281b64c798e1898a5831b267a", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 473, "chunk_index": 26, "_doc_id": "26_478576025250697038"}}
{"doc_id": "27_1310929412612030375", "text": "n><span>\"<span><span>$attrs<span><span>\"<span><span>>...</<span><span>main<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>footer<span><span>>...</<span><span>footer<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><h2 id=\"accessing-fallthrough-attributes-in-javascript\">在 JavaScript 中访问透传 Attributes <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#accessing-fallthrough-attributes-in-javascript\">​<a><h2><div class=\"composition-api\"><p>如果需要，", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/attrs.html", "title": "透传 Attributes", "doc_id": "acb25be281b64c798e1898a5831b267a", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 473, "chunk_index": 27, "_doc_id": "27_1310929412612030375"}}
{"doc_id": "28_2375766932655020739", "text": "href=\"#accessing-fallthrough-attributes-in-javascript\">​<a><h2><div class=\"composition-api\"><p>如果需要，你可以在 <code><script setup><code> 中使用 <code>useAttrs()<code> API 来访问一个组件的所有透传 attribute：<p><div class=\"language-vue\"> <span class=\"lang\">vue<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>script<span><span> setup<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>import<span><span> { useAttrs } <span><span>from<span><span> 'vue'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/attrs.html", "title": "透传 Attributes", "doc_id": "acb25be281b64c798e1898a5831b267a", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 473, "chunk_index": 28, "_doc_id": "28_2375766932655020739"}}
{"doc_id": "29_3902334199975340889", "text": "t<span><span> { useAttrs } <span><span>from<span><span> 'vue'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> attrs<span><span> =<span><span> useAttrs<span><span>()<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/attrs.html", "title": "透传 Attributes", "doc_id": "acb25be281b64c798e1898a5831b267a", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 473, "chunk_index": 29, "_doc_id": "29_3902334199975340889"}}
{"doc_id": "30_2669635146763188430", "text": "s=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> attrs<span><span> =<span><span> useAttrs<span><span>()<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>script<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>如果没有使用 <code><script setup><code>，<code>attrs<code> 会作为 <code>setup()<code> 上下文对象的一个属性暴露：<p><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/attrs.html", "title": "透传 Attributes", "doc_id": "acb25be281b64c798e1898a5831b267a", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 473, "chunk_index": 30, "_doc_id": "30_2669635146763188430"}}
{"doc_id": "31_7275232369446233633", "text": "b-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> setup<span><span>(<span><span>props<span><span>, <span><span>ctx<span><span>) {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 透传 attribute 被暴露为 ctx.attrs<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> console.<span><span>log<span><span>(ctx.attrs)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/attrs.html", "title": "透传 Attributes", "doc_id": "acb25be281b64c798e1898a5831b267a", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 473, "chunk_index": 31, "_doc_id": "31_7275232369446233633"}}
{"doc_id": "32_5803736118797366", "text": "console.<span><span>log<span><span>(ctx.attrs)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span><code><pre><div><p>需要注意的是，虽然这里的 <code>attrs<code> 对象总是反映为最新的透传 attribute，但它并不是响应式的 (考虑到性能因素)。你不能通过侦听器去监听它的变化。如果你需要响应性，可以使用 prop。或者你也可以使用 <code>onUpdated()<code> 使得在每次更新时结合最新的 <code>attrs<code> 执行副作用。<p><div><div class=\"options-api\"><p>如果需要，你可以通过 <code>$attrs<code> 这个实例属性来访问组件的所有透传 attribute：<p><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/attrs.html", "title": "透传 Attributes", "doc_id": "acb25be281b64c798e1898a5831b267a", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 473, "chunk_index": 32, "_doc_id": "32_5803736118797366"}}
{"doc_id": "33_5152623560546120179", "text": "b-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> created<span><span>() {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> console.<span><span>log<span><span>(<span><span>this<span><span>.$attrs)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span><code><pre><div><div><div><div>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/attrs.html", "title": "透传 Attributes", "doc_id": "acb25be281b64c798e1898a5831b267a", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 473, "chunk_index": 33, "_doc_id": "33_5152623560546120179"}}
{"doc_id": "0_5930693022822569690", "text": "<div><div><h1 id=\"composables\">组合式函数 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#composables\">​<a><h1><div class=\"tip custom-block\"><p class=\"custom-block-title\">TIP<p><p>此章节假设你已经对组合式 API 有了基本的了解。如果你只学习过选项式 API，你可以使用左侧边栏上方的切换按钮将 API 风格切换为组合式 API 后，重新阅读<a href=\"/guide/essentials/reactivity-fundamentals.html\">响应性基础<a>和<a href=\"/guide/essentials/lifecycle.html\">生命周期钩子<a>两个章节。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/reusability/composables.html", "title": "组合式函数", "doc_id": "1ab98792a7d24a33bde06065be2d1311", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1263, "chunk_index": 0, "_doc_id": "0_5930693022822569690"}}
{"doc_id": "1_8300494895423891949", "text": "als/reactivity-fundamentals.html\">响应性基础<a>和<a href=\"/guide/essentials/lifecycle.html\">生命周期钩子<a>两个章节。<p><div><h2 id=\"what-is-a-composable\">什么是“组合式函数”？ <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#what-is-a-composable\">​<a><h2><p>在 Vue 应用的概念中，“组合式函数”(Composables) 是一个利用 Vue 的组合式 API 来封装和复用<strong>有状态逻辑<strong>的函数。<p><p>当构建前端应用时，我们常常需要复用公共任务的逻辑。例如为了在不同地方格式化时间，我们可能会抽取一个可复用的日期格式化函数。这个函数封装了<strong>无状态的逻辑<strong>：它在接收一些输入后立刻返回所期望的输出。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/reusability/composables.html", "title": "组合式函数", "doc_id": "1ab98792a7d24a33bde06065be2d1311", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1263, "chunk_index": 1, "_doc_id": "1_8300494895423891949"}}
{"doc_id": "2_7104429178137707608", "text": "常常需要复用公共任务的逻辑。例如为了在不同地方格式化时间，我们可能会抽取一个可复用的日期格式化函数。这个函数封装了<strong>无状态的逻辑<strong>：它在接收一些输入后立刻返回所期望的输出。复用无状态逻辑的库有很多，比如你可能已经用过的 <a href=\"https://lodash.com/\" target=\"_blank\">lodash<a> 或是 <a href=\"https://date-fns.org/\" target=\"_blank\">date-fns<a>。<p><p>相比之下，有状态逻辑负责管理会随时间而变化的状态。一个简单的例子是跟踪当前鼠标在页面中的位置。在实际应用中，也可能是像触摸手势或与数据库的连接状态这样的更复杂的逻辑。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/reusability/composables.html", "title": "组合式函数", "doc_id": "1ab98792a7d24a33bde06065be2d1311", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1263, "chunk_index": 2, "_doc_id": "2_7104429178137707608"}}
{"doc_id": "3_699266774475478755", "text": "ate-fns<a>。<p><p>相比之下，有状态逻辑负责管理会随时间而变化的状态。一个简单的例子是跟踪当前鼠标在页面中的位置。在实际应用中，也可能是像触摸手势或与数据库的连接状态这样的更复杂的逻辑。<p><h2 id=\"mouse-tracker-example\">鼠标跟踪器示例 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#mouse-tracker-example\">​<a><h2><p>如果我们要直接在组件中使用组合式 API 实现鼠标跟踪功能，它会是这样的：<p><div class=\"vp-code-block-title\"><p class=\"vp-code-block-title-bar\"><span class=\"vp-code-block-title-text\">MouseComponent.vue<span><p><div class=\"language-vue\"> <span class=\"lang\">vue<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>script<span><span> setup<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/reusability/composables.html", "title": "组合式函数", "doc_id": "1ab98792a7d24a33bde06065be2d1311", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1263, "chunk_index": 3, "_doc_id": "3_699266774475478755"}}
{"doc_id": "4_8658540025614466989", "text": "code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>script<span><span> setup<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>import<span><span> { ref, onMounted, onUnmounted } <span><span>from<span><span> 'vue'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> x<span><span> =<span><span> ref<span><span>(<span><span>0<span><span>)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> y<span><span> =<span><span> ref<span><span>(<span><span>0<span><span>)<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/reusability/composables.html", "title": "组合式函数", "doc_id": "1ab98792a7d24a33bde06065be2d1311", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1263, "chunk_index": 4, "_doc_id": "4_8658540025614466989"}}
{"doc_id": "5_3237110903005723024", "text": "onst<span><span> y<span><span> =<span><span> ref<span><span>(<span><span>0<span><span>)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>function<span><span> update<span><span>(<span><span>event<span><span>) {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> x.value <span><span>=<span><span> event.pageX<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> y.value <span><span>=<span><span> event.pageY<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/reusability/composables.html", "title": "组合式函数", "doc_id": "1ab98792a7d24a33bde06065be2d1311", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1263, "chunk_index": 5, "_doc_id": "5_3237110903005723024"}}
{"doc_id": "6_7564593860135505209", "text": "pan><span> event.pageY<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>onMounted<span><span>(() <span><span>=><span><span> window.<span><span>addEventListener<span><span>(<span><span>'mousemove'<span><span>, update))<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>onUnmounted<span><span>(() <span><span>=><span><span> window.<span><span>removeEventListener<span><span>(<span><span>'mousemove'<span><span>, update))<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/reusability/composables.html", "title": "组合式函数", "doc_id": "1ab98792a7d24a33bde06065be2d1311", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1263, "chunk_index": 6, "_doc_id": "6_7564593860135505209"}}
{"doc_id": "7_8154307333830857410", "text": "pan><span>removeEventListener<span><span>(<span><span>'mousemove'<span><span>, update))<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>script<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>template<span><span>>Mouse position is at: {{ x }}, {{ y }}</<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><div><p>但是，如果我们想在多个组件中复用这个相同的逻辑呢？", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/reusability/composables.html", "title": "组合式函数", "doc_id": "1ab98792a7d24a33bde06065be2d1311", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1263, "chunk_index": 7, "_doc_id": "7_8154307333830857410"}}
{"doc_id": "8_8261816011225153289", "text": "y }}</<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><div><p>但是，如果我们想在多个组件中复用这个相同的逻辑呢？我们可以把这个逻辑以一个组合式函数的形式提取到外部文件中：<p><div class=\"vp-code-block-title\"><p class=\"vp-code-block-title-bar\"><span class=\"vp-code-block-title-text\">mouse.js<span><p><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>import<span><span> { ref, onMounted, onUnmounted } <span><span>from<span><span> 'vue'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/reusability/composables.html", "title": "组合式函数", "doc_id": "1ab98792a7d24a33bde06065be2d1311", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1263, "chunk_index": 8, "_doc_id": "8_8261816011225153289"}}
{"doc_id": "9_7487559153795177610", "text": ", onMounted, onUnmounted } <span><span>from<span><span> 'vue'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 按照惯例，组合式函数名以“use”开头<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> function<span><span> useMouse<span><span>() {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 被组合式函数封装和管理的状态<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> const<span><span> x<span><span> =<span><span> ref<span><span>(<span><span>0<span><span>)<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/reusability/composables.html", "title": "组合式函数", "doc_id": "1ab98792a7d24a33bde06065be2d1311", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1263, "chunk_index": 9, "_doc_id": "9_7487559153795177610"}}
{"doc_id": "10_3298029768640642935", "text": "onst<span><span> x<span><span> =<span><span> ref<span><span>(<span><span>0<span><span>)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> const<span><span> y<span><span> =<span><span> ref<span><span>(<span><span>0<span><span>)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 组合式函数可以随时更改其状态。<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> function<span><span> update<span><span>(<span><span>event<span><span>) {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> x.value <span><span>=<span><span> event.pageX<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/reusability/composables.html", "title": "组合式函数", "doc_id": "1ab98792a7d24a33bde06065be2d1311", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1263, "chunk_index": 10, "_doc_id": "10_3298029768640642935"}}
{"doc_id": "11_2132808474300484907", "text": ") {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> x.value <span><span>=<span><span> event.pageX<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> y.value <span><span>=<span><span> event.pageY<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 一个组合式函数也可以挂靠在所属组件的生命周期上<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 来启动和卸载副作用<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/reusability/composables.html", "title": "组合式函数", "doc_id": "1ab98792a7d24a33bde06065be2d1311", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1263, "chunk_index": 11, "_doc_id": "11_2132808474300484907"}}
{"doc_id": "12_8847368680818751296", "text": "e\"><span> // 一个组合式函数也可以挂靠在所属组件的生命周期上<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 来启动和卸载副作用<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> onMounted<span><span>(() <span><span>=><span><span> window.<span><span>addEventListener<span><span>(<span><span>'mousemove'<span><span>, update))<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> onUnmounted<span><span>(() <span><span>=><span><span> window.<span><span>removeEventListener<span><span>(<span><span>'mousemove'<span><span>, update))<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/reusability/composables.html", "title": "组合式函数", "doc_id": "1ab98792a7d24a33bde06065be2d1311", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1263, "chunk_index": 12, "_doc_id": "12_8847368680818751296"}}
{"doc_id": "13_8741406010009240757", "text": "ner<span><span>(<span><span>'mousemove'<span><span>, update))<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 通过返回值暴露所管理的状态<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> return<span><span> { x, y }<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/reusability/composables.html", "title": "组合式函数", "doc_id": "1ab98792a7d24a33bde06065be2d1311", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1263, "chunk_index": 13, "_doc_id": "13_8741406010009240757"}}
{"doc_id": "14_4303720393146406975", "text": "pan> // 通过返回值暴露所管理的状态<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> return<span><span> { x, y }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span><code><pre><div><div><p>下面是它在组件中使用的方式：<p><div class=\"vp-code-block-title\"><p class=\"vp-code-block-title-bar\"><span class=\"vp-code-block-title-text\">MouseComponent.vue<span><p><div class=\"language-vue\"> <span class=\"lang\">vue<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>script<span><span> setup<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/reusability/composables.html", "title": "组合式函数", "doc_id": "1ab98792a7d24a33bde06065be2d1311", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1263, "chunk_index": 14, "_doc_id": "14_4303720393146406975"}}
{"doc_id": "15_6247734200711445435", "text": "code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>script<span><span> setup<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>import<span><span> { useMouse } <span><span>from<span><span> './mouse.js'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> { <span><span>x<span><span>, <span><span>y<span><span> } <span><span>=<span><span> useMouse<span><span>()<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>script<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/reusability/composables.html", "title": "组合式函数", "doc_id": "1ab98792a7d24a33bde06065be2d1311", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1263, "chunk_index": 15, "_doc_id": "15_6247734200711445435"}}
{"doc_id": "16_5167433084987716563", "text": "n>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>script<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>template<span><span>>Mouse position is at: {{ x }}, {{ y }}</<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><div><p class=\"demo\"> Mouse position is at: 0,", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/reusability/composables.html", "title": "组合式函数", "doc_id": "1ab98792a7d24a33bde06065be2d1311", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1263, "chunk_index": 16, "_doc_id": "16_5167433084987716563"}}
{"doc_id": "17_2798833982411316188", "text": "pan>template<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><div><p class=\"demo\"> Mouse position is at: 0, 0<p><p><a href=\"https://play.vuejs.org/#\" target=\"_blank\">在演练场中尝试一下<a><p><p>如你所见，", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/reusability/composables.html", "title": "组合式函数", "doc_id": "1ab98792a7d24a33bde06065be2d1311", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1263, "chunk_index": 17, "_doc_id": "17_2798833982411316188"}}
{"doc_id": "18_5626360320772398922", "text": "f9VOY+EtizSWfR6xKK6itgkvQ/+fyNs6v4XJXIsPwVL+WprCiL8AEUxw5s=\" target=\"_blank\">在演练场中尝试一下<a><p><p>如你所见，核心逻辑完全一致，我们做的只是把它移到一个外部函数中去，并返回需要暴露的状态。和在组件中一样，你也可以在组合式函数中使用所有的<a href=\"/api/#composition-api\">组合式 API<a>。现在，<code>useMouse()<code> 的功能可以在任何组件中轻易复用了。<p><p>更酷的是，你还可以嵌套多个组合式函数：一个组合式函数可以调用一个或多个其他的组合式函数。这使得我们可以像使用多个组件组合成整个应用一样，用多个较小且逻辑独立的单元来组合形成复杂的逻辑。实际上，这正是为什么我们决定将实现了这一设计模式的 API 集合命名为组合式 API。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/reusability/composables.html", "title": "组合式函数", "doc_id": "1ab98792a7d24a33bde06065be2d1311", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1263, "chunk_index": 18, "_doc_id": "18_5626360320772398922"}}
{"doc_id": "19_6162314156964341256", "text": "其他的组合式函数。这使得我们可以像使用多个组件组合成整个应用一样，用多个较小且逻辑独立的单元来组合形成复杂的逻辑。实际上，这正是为什么我们决定将实现了这一设计模式的 API 集合命名为组合式 API。<p><p>举例来说，我们可以将添加和清除 DOM 事件监听器的逻辑也封装进一个组合式函数中：<p><div class=\"vp-code-block-title\"><p class=\"vp-code-block-title-bar\"><span class=\"vp-code-block-title-text\">event.js<span><p><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>import<span><span> { onMounted, onUnmounted } <span><span>from<span><span> 'vue'<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/reusability/composables.html", "title": "组合式函数", "doc_id": "1ab98792a7d24a33bde06065be2d1311", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1263, "chunk_index": 19, "_doc_id": "19_6162314156964341256"}}
{"doc_id": "20_3097985034339481056", "text": "><span>import<span><span> { onMounted, onUnmounted } <span><span>from<span><span> 'vue'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> function<span><span> useEventListener<span><span>(<span><span>target<span><span>, <span><span>event<span><span>, <span><span>callback<span><span>) {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 如果你想的话，<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 也可以用字符串形式的 CSS 选择器来寻找目标 DOM 元素<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/reusability/composables.html", "title": "组合式函数", "doc_id": "1ab98792a7d24a33bde06065be2d1311", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1263, "chunk_index": 20, "_doc_id": "20_3097985034339481056"}}
{"doc_id": "21_2524796796479756718", "text": "pan> // 如果你想的话，<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 也可以用字符串形式的 CSS 选择器来寻找目标 DOM 元素<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> onMounted<span><span>(() <span><span>=><span><span> target.<span><span>addEventListener<span><span>(event, callback))<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> onUnmounted<span><span>(() <span><span>=><span><span> target.<span><span>removeEventListener<span><span>(event, callback))<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/reusability/composables.html", "title": "组合式函数", "doc_id": "1ab98792a7d24a33bde06065be2d1311", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1263, "chunk_index": 21, "_doc_id": "21_2524796796479756718"}}
{"doc_id": "22_1594024008487044451", "text": "pan>=><span><span> target.<span><span>removeEventListener<span><span>(event, callback))<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span><code><pre><div><div><p>有了它，之前的 <code>useMouse()<code> 组合式函数可以被简化为：<p><div class=\"vp-code-block-title\"><p class=\"vp-code-block-title-bar\"><span class=\"vp-code-block-title-text\">mouse.js<span><p><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>import<span><span> { ref } <span><span>from<span><span> 'vue'<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/reusability/composables.html", "title": "组合式函数", "doc_id": "1ab98792a7d24a33bde06065be2d1311", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1263, "chunk_index": 22, "_doc_id": "22_1594024008487044451"}}
{"doc_id": "23_8671535507407710299", "text": "><span class=\"line\"><span>import<span><span> { ref } <span><span>from<span><span> 'vue'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line highlighted\"><span>import<span><span> { useEventListener } <span><span>from<span><span> './event'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> function<span><span> useMouse<span><span>() {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> const<span><span> x<span><span> =<span><span> ref<span><span>(<span><span>0<span><span>)<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/reusability/composables.html", "title": "组合式函数", "doc_id": "1ab98792a7d24a33bde06065be2d1311", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1263, "chunk_index": 23, "_doc_id": "23_8671535507407710299"}}
{"doc_id": "24_566508795536774965", "text": "onst<span><span> x<span><span> =<span><span> ref<span><span>(<span><span>0<span><span>)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> const<span><span> y<span><span> =<span><span> ref<span><span>(<span><span>0<span><span>)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line highlighted\"><span> useEventListener<span><span>(window, <span><span>'mousemove'<span><span>, (<span><span>event<span><span>) <span><span>=><span><span> {<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/reusability/composables.html", "title": "组合式函数", "doc_id": "1ab98792a7d24a33bde06065be2d1311", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1263, "chunk_index": 24, "_doc_id": "24_566508795536774965"}}
{"doc_id": "25_2313438240796809633", "text": "n>'mousemove'<span><span>, (<span><span>event<span><span>) <span><span>=><span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line highlighted\"><span> x.value <span><span>=<span><span> event.pageX<span><span>\n<span class=\"line highlighted\"><span> y.value <span><span>=<span><span> event.pageY<span><span>\n<span class=\"line highlighted\"><span> })<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> return<span><span> { x, y }<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/reusability/composables.html", "title": "组合式函数", "doc_id": "1ab98792a7d24a33bde06065be2d1311", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1263, "chunk_index": 25, "_doc_id": "25_2313438240796809633"}}
{"doc_id": "26_4007485858367681583", "text": "><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> return<span><span> { x, y }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span><code><pre><div><div><div class=\"tip custom-block\"><p class=\"custom-block-title\">TIP<p><p>每一个调用 <code>useMouse()<code> 的组件实例会创建其独有的 <code>x<code>、<code>y<code> 状态拷贝，因此他们不会互相影响。如果你想要在组件之间共享状态，请阅读<a href=\"/guide/scaling-up/state-management.html\">状态管理<a>这一章。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/reusability/composables.html", "title": "组合式函数", "doc_id": "1ab98792a7d24a33bde06065be2d1311", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1263, "chunk_index": 26, "_doc_id": "26_4007485858367681583"}}
{"doc_id": "27_6200545864373760724", "text": "ode> 状态拷贝，因此他们不会互相影响。如果你想要在组件之间共享状态，请阅读<a href=\"/guide/scaling-up/state-management.html\">状态管理<a>这一章。<p><div><h2 id=\"async-state-example\">异步状态示例 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#async-state-example\">​<a><h2><p><code>useMouse()<code> 组合式函数没有接收任何参数，因此让我们再来看一个需要接收一个参数的组合式函数示例。在做异步数据请求时，我们常常需要处理不同的状态：加载中、加载成功和加载失败。<p><div class=\"language-vue\"> <span class=\"lang\">vue<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>script<span><span> setup<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/reusability/composables.html", "title": "组合式函数", "doc_id": "1ab98792a7d24a33bde06065be2d1311", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1263, "chunk_index": 27, "_doc_id": "27_6200545864373760724"}}
{"doc_id": "28_1858743436020847114", "text": "code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>script<span><span> setup<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>import<span><span> { ref } <span><span>from<span><span> 'vue'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> data<span><span> =<span><span> ref<span><span>(<span><span>null<span><span>)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> error<span><span> =<span><span> ref<span><span>(<span><span>null<span><span>)<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/reusability/composables.html", "title": "组合式函数", "doc_id": "1ab98792a7d24a33bde06065be2d1311", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1263, "chunk_index": 28, "_doc_id": "28_1858743436020847114"}}
