{"doc_id": "37_5899800954868199532", "text": "n><span>res<span><span>) <span><span>=><span><span> res.<span><span>json<span><span>())<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> .<span><span>then<span><span>((<span><span>json<span><span>) <span><span>=><span><span> (data.value <span><span>=<span><span> json))<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> .<span><span>catch<span><span>((<span><span>err<span><span>) <span><span>=><span><span> (error.value <span><span>=<span><span> err))<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/reusability/composables.html", "title": "组合式函数", "doc_id": "1ab98792a7d24a33bde06065be2d1311", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1263, "chunk_index": 37, "_doc_id": "37_5899800954868199532"}}
{"doc_id": "38_3883703918587624374", "text": "n>=><span><span> (error.value <span><span>=<span><span> err))<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> return<span><span> { data, error }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span><code><pre><div><div><p>现在我们在组件里只需要：<p><div class=\"language-vue\"> <span class=\"lang\">vue<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>script<span><span> setup<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/reusability/composables.html", "title": "组合式函数", "doc_id": "1ab98792a7d24a33bde06065be2d1311", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1263, "chunk_index": 38, "_doc_id": "38_3883703918587624374"}}
