{"doc_id": "40_1441523871573970120", "text": "><span> } <span><span>=<span><span> useFetch<span><span>(<span><span>'...'<span><span>)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>script<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><h3 id=\"accepting-reactive-state\">接收响应式状态 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#accepting-reactive-state\">​<a><h3><p><code>useFetch()<code> 接收一个静态 URL 字符串作为输入——因此它只会执行一次 fetch 并且就此结束。如果我们想要在 URL 改变时重新 fetch 呢？为了实现这一点，我们需要将响应式状态传入组合式函数，并让它基于传入的状态来创建执行操作的侦听器。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/reusability/composables.html", "title": "组合式函数", "doc_id": "1ab98792a7d24a33bde06065be2d1311", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1263, "chunk_index": 40, "_doc_id": "40_1441523871573970120"}}
{"doc_id": "41_2964937317425989972", "text": "入——因此它只会执行一次 fetch 并且就此结束。如果我们想要在 URL 改变时重新 fetch 呢？为了实现这一点，我们需要将响应式状态传入组合式函数，并让它基于传入的状态来创建执行操作的侦听器。<p><p>举例来说，<code>useFetch()<code> 应该能够接收一个 ref：<p><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> url<span><span> =<span><span> ref<span><span>(<span><span>'/initial-url'<span><span>)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/reusability/composables.html", "title": "组合式函数", "doc_id": "1ab98792a7d24a33bde06065be2d1311", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1263, "chunk_index": 41, "_doc_id": "41_2964937317425989972"}}
{"doc_id": "42_7749112327368586537", "text": "span> ref<span><span>(<span><span>'/initial-url'<span><span>)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> { <span><span>data<span><span>, <span><span>error<span><span> } <span><span>=<span><span> useFetch<span><span>(url)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 这将会重新触发 fetch<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/reusability/composables.html", "title": "组合式函数", "doc_id": "1ab98792a7d24a33bde06065be2d1311", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1263, "chunk_index": 42, "_doc_id": "42_7749112327368586537"}}
{"doc_id": "43_1839466148303137266", "text": "n>(url)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 这将会重新触发 fetch<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>url.value <span><span>=<span><span> '/new-url'<span><span><code><pre><div><p>或者接收一个 <a href=\"https://developer.mozilla.org/zh-CN/docs/Web/JavaScript/Reference/Functions/get#description\" target=\"_blank\">getter 函数<a>：<p><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// 当 props.id 改变时重新 fetch<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/reusability/composables.html", "title": "组合式函数", "doc_id": "1ab98792a7d24a33bde06065be2d1311", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1263, "chunk_index": 43, "_doc_id": "43_1839466148303137266"}}
{"doc_id": "44_3591558657743901899", "text": "ss=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// 当 props.id 改变时重新 fetch<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> { <span><span>data<span><span>, <span><span>error<span><span> } <span><span>=<span><span> useFetch<span><span>(() <span><span>=><span><span> `/posts/${<span><span>props<span><span>.<span><span>id<span><span>}`<span><span>)<span><span><code><pre><div><p>我们可以用 <a href=\"/api/reactivity-core.", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/reusability/composables.html", "title": "组合式函数", "doc_id": "1ab98792a7d24a33bde06065be2d1311", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1263, "chunk_index": 44, "_doc_id": "44_3591558657743901899"}}
{"doc_id": "45_687725853132639836", "text": "pan>id<span><span>}`<span><span>)<span><span><code><pre><div><p>我们可以用 <a href=\"/api/reactivity-core.html#watcheffect\"><code>watchEffect()<code><a> 和 <a href=\"/api/reactivity-utilities.html#tovalue\"><code>toValue()<code><a> API 来重构我们现有的实现：<p><div class=\"vp-code-block-title\"><p class=\"vp-code-block-title-bar\"><span class=\"vp-code-block-title-text\">fetch.", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/reusability/composables.html", "title": "组合式函数", "doc_id": "1ab98792a7d24a33bde06065be2d1311", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1263, "chunk_index": 45, "_doc_id": "45_687725853132639836"}}
{"doc_id": "46_430605421353036873", "text": "p-code-block-title\"><p class=\"vp-code-block-title-bar\"><span class=\"vp-code-block-title-text\">fetch.js<span><p><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>import<span><span> { ref, watchEffect, toValue } <span><span>from<span><span> 'vue'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> function<span><span> useFetch<span><span>(<span><span>url<span><span>) {<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/reusability/composables.html", "title": "组合式函数", "doc_id": "1ab98792a7d24a33bde06065be2d1311", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1263, "chunk_index": 46, "_doc_id": "46_430605421353036873"}}
{"doc_id": "47_833256414604089420", "text": "rt<span><span> function<span><span> useFetch<span><span>(<span><span>url<span><span>) {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> const<span><span> data<span><span> =<span><span> ref<span><span>(<span><span>null<span><span>)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> const<span><span> error<span><span> =<span><span> ref<span><span>(<span><span>null<span><span>)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/reusability/composables.html", "title": "组合式函数", "doc_id": "1ab98792a7d24a33bde06065be2d1311", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1263, "chunk_index": 47, "_doc_id": "47_833256414604089420"}}
{"doc_id": "48_6532499675383463527", "text": "> =<span><span> ref<span><span>(<span><span>null<span><span>)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line highlighted\"><span> const<span><span> fetchData<span><span> =<span><span> () <span><span>=><span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // reset state before fetching..<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> data.value <span><span>=<span><span> null<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> error.value <span><span>=<span><span> null<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/reusability/composables.html", "title": "组合式函数", "doc_id": "1ab98792a7d24a33bde06065be2d1311", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1263, "chunk_index": 48, "_doc_id": "48_6532499675383463527"}}
{"doc_id": "49_7836961692675498431", "text": "lass=\"line\"><span> error.value <span><span>=<span><span> null<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line highlighted\"><span> fetch<span><span>(<span><span>toValue<span><span>(url))<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> .<span><span>then<span><span>((<span><span>res<span><span>) <span><span>=><span><span> res.<span><span>json<span><span>())<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/reusability/composables.html", "title": "组合式函数", "doc_id": "1ab98792a7d24a33bde06065be2d1311", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1263, "chunk_index": 49, "_doc_id": "49_7836961692675498431"}}
{"doc_id": "50_5307774176487255235", "text": "n><span>res<span><span>) <span><span>=><span><span> res.<span><span>json<span><span>())<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> .<span><span>then<span><span>((<span><span>json<span><span>) <span><span>=><span><span> (data.value <span><span>=<span><span> json))<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> .<span><span>catch<span><span>((<span><span>err<span><span>) <span><span>=><span><span> (error.value <span><span>=<span><span> err))<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/reusability/composables.html", "title": "组合式函数", "doc_id": "1ab98792a7d24a33bde06065be2d1311", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1263, "chunk_index": 50, "_doc_id": "50_5307774176487255235"}}
{"doc_id": "51_9047596840494910470", "text": "n>=<span><span> err))<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> watchEffect<span><span>(() <span><span>=><span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> fetchData<span><span>()<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> })<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> return<span><span> { data, error }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span><code><pre><div><div><p><code>toValue()<code> 是一个在 3.3 版本中新增的 API。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/reusability/composables.html", "title": "组合式函数", "doc_id": "1ab98792a7d24a33bde06065be2d1311", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1263, "chunk_index": 51, "_doc_id": "51_9047596840494910470"}}
{"doc_id": "52_3201825017226479740", "text": "n class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span><code><pre><div><div><p><code>toValue()<code> 是一个在 3.3 版本中新增的 API。它的设计目的是将 ref 或 getter 规范化为值。如果参数是 ref，它会返回 ref 的值；如果参数是函数，它会调用函数并返回其返回值。否则，它会原样返回参数。它的工作方式类似于 <a href=\"/api/reactivity-utilities.html#unref\"><code>unref()<code><a>，但对函数有特殊处理。<p><p>注意 <code>toValue(url)<code> 是在 <code>watchEffect<code> 回调函数的<strong>内部<strong>调用的。这确保了在 <code>toValue()<code> 规范化期间访问的任何响应式依赖项都会被侦听器跟踪。<p><p>这个版本的 <code>useFetch()<code> 现在能接收静态 URL 字符串、ref 和 getter，使其更加灵活。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/reusability/composables.html", "title": "组合式函数", "doc_id": "1ab98792a7d24a33bde06065be2d1311", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1263, "chunk_index": 52, "_doc_id": "52_3201825017226479740"}}
{"doc_id": "53_7981095457476285452", "text": "de> 规范化期间访问的任何响应式依赖项都会被侦听器跟踪。<p><p>这个版本的 <code>useFetch()<code> 现在能接收静态 URL 字符串、ref 和 getter，使其更加灵活。watch effect 会立即运行，并且会跟踪 <code>toValue(url)<code> 期间访问的任何依赖项。如果没有跟踪到依赖项 (例如 url 已经是字符串)，则 effect 只会运行一次；否则，它将在跟踪到的任何依赖项更改时重新运行。<p><p>这是<a href=\"https://play.vuejs.org/#eNp9Vdtu20YQ/ZUpUUA0qpAOjL4YktCbC7Rom8BN8sSHrMihtfZql9iLZEHgv2dml6SpxMiDIWkuZ+acmR2fs1+7rjgEzG6zlaut7Dw49KHbVFruO2M9nMFiu4Ta7LvgsYEeWmv2sKCkxSwoOPwTfb2b/EU5mopHR5GVro12HrbC4UerYA2Lnfeduy3LR2d0p0SNO6MatIU/dbI2DRZUtPSmMa4kgJQuG8qkjvLF28XVaAwRb2wx", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/reusability/composables.html", "title": "组合式函数", "doc_id": "1ab98792a7d24a33bde06065be2d1311", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1263, "chunk_index": 53, "_doc_id": "53_7981095457476285452"}}
{"doc_id": "54_2674048546848608730", "text": "", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/reusability/composables.html", "title": "组合式函数", "doc_id": "1ab98792a7d24a33bde06065be2d1311", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1263, "chunk_index": 54, "_doc_id": "54_2674048546848608730"}}
{"doc_id": "55_411911089811691074", "text": "", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/reusability/composables.html", "title": "组合式函数", "doc_id": "1ab98792a7d24a33bde06065be2d1311", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1263, "chunk_index": 55, "_doc_id": "55_411911089811691074"}}
{"doc_id": "56_2262418578848554976", "text": "JOcjTXe+obScHwaAi82lo9dC/q/wuyINjrwbuC5uZrS4WAQeyTN9ftOXIVwy537iecoX92kR4q/F1UvqIMsSbq6vo5XF6ekCeEcTauVDFJpuQESvMv53IBXadx3r4KqMrt0w0kwoZY5/R5u3AZejvd5h/fSK/dE9s63K3vN7tQesssnnhX1An9x3//+Hz/R9cu5NExRFf8d5zyIF7jGF/RZ0Q23P4mK3f8XLRmfhg7t79qjdSIobjXLE+Cqju/b7d6i/tHtT3MQ8VrH/Ahstp5A=\" target=\"_blank\">更新后的 <code>useFetch()<code><a>，为了便于演示，添加了人为延迟和随机错误。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/reusability/composables.html", "title": "组合式函数", "doc_id": "1ab98792a7d24a33bde06065be2d1311", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1263, "chunk_index": 56, "_doc_id": "56_2262418578848554976"}}
{"doc_id": "57_2469967445909762540", "text": "Cqju/b7d6i/tHtT3MQ8VrH/Ahstp5A=\" target=\"_blank\">更新后的 <code>useFetch()<code><a>，为了便于演示，添加了人为延迟和随机错误。<p><h2 id=\"conventions-and-best-practices\">约定和最佳实践 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#conventions-and-best-practices\">​<a><h2><h3 id=\"naming\">命名 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#naming\">​<a><h3><p>组合式函数约定用驼峰命名法命名，并以“use”作为开头。<p><h3 id=\"input-arguments\">输入参数 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#input-arguments\">​<a><h3><p>即便不依赖于 ref 或 getter 的响应性，组合式函数也可以接收它们作为参数。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/reusability/composables.html", "title": "组合式函数", "doc_id": "1ab98792a7d24a33bde06065be2d1311", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1263, "chunk_index": 57, "_doc_id": "57_2469967445909762540"}}
{"doc_id": "58_5131283951938799070", "text": "class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#input-arguments\">​<a><h3><p>即便不依赖于 ref 或 getter 的响应性，组合式函数也可以接收它们作为参数。如果你正在编写一个可能被其他开发者使用的组合式函数，最好处理一下输入参数是 ref 或 getter 而非原始值的情况。可以利用 <a href=\"/api/reactivity-utilities.html#tovalue\"><code>toValue()<code><a> 工具函数来实现：<p><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>import<span><span> { toValue } <span><span>from<span><span> 'vue'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/reusability/composables.html", "title": "组合式函数", "doc_id": "1ab98792a7d24a33bde06065be2d1311", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1263, "chunk_index": 58, "_doc_id": "58_5131283951938799070"}}
{"doc_id": "59_2395215089892064427", "text": "rt<span><span> { toValue } <span><span>from<span><span> 'vue'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>function<span><span> useFeature<span><span>(<span><span>maybeRefOrGetter<span><span>) {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 如果 maybeRefOrGetter 是一个 ref 或 getter，<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 将返回它的规范化值。<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 否则原样返回。<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/reusability/composables.html", "title": "组合式函数", "doc_id": "1ab98792a7d24a33bde06065be2d1311", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1263, "chunk_index": 59, "_doc_id": "59_2395215089892064427"}}
{"doc_id": "60_3919981922212827771", "text": "span class=\"line\"><span> // 将返回它的规范化值。<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 否则原样返回。<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> const<span><span> value<span><span> =<span><span> toValue<span><span>(maybeRefOrGetter)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span><code><pre><div><p>如果你的组合式函数在输入参数是 ref 或 getter 的情况下创建了响应式 effect，为了让它能够被正确追踪，请确保要么使用 <code>watch()<code> 显式地监视 ref 或 getter，要么在 <code>watchEffect()<code> 中调用 <code>toValue()<code>。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/reusability/composables.html", "title": "组合式函数", "doc_id": "1ab98792a7d24a33bde06065be2d1311", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1263, "chunk_index": 60, "_doc_id": "60_3919981922212827771"}}
{"doc_id": "61_5982222763182358611", "text": "要么使用 <code>watch()<code> 显式地监视 ref 或 getter，要么在 <code>watchEffect()<code> 中调用 <code>toValue()<code>。<p><p><a href=\"#accepting-reactive-state\">前面讨论过的 useFetch() 实现<a>提供了一个接受 ref、getter 或普通值作为输入参数的组合式函数的具体示例。<p><h3 id=\"return-values\">返回值 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#return-values\">​<a><h3><p>你可能已经注意到了，我们一直在组合式函数中使用 <code>ref()<code> 而不是 <code>reactive()<code>。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/reusability/composables.html", "title": "组合式函数", "doc_id": "1ab98792a7d24a33bde06065be2d1311", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1263, "chunk_index": 61, "_doc_id": "61_5982222763182358611"}}
{"doc_id": "62_273390955220886806", "text": "ef=\"#return-values\">​<a><h3><p>你可能已经注意到了，我们一直在组合式函数中使用 <code>ref()<code> 而不是 <code>reactive()<code>。我们推荐的约定是组合式函数始终返回一个包含多个 ref 的普通的非响应式对象，这样该对象在组件中被解构为 ref 之后仍可以保持响应性：<p><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// x 和 y 是两个 ref<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/reusability/composables.html", "title": "组合式函数", "doc_id": "1ab98792a7d24a33bde06065be2d1311", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1263, "chunk_index": 62, "_doc_id": "62_273390955220886806"}}
{"doc_id": "63_1330107100301496429", "text": "><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// x 和 y 是两个 ref<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> { <span><span>x<span><span>, <span><span>y<span><span> } <span><span>=<span><span> useMouse<span><span>()<span><span><code><pre><div><p>从组合式函数返回一个响应式对象会导致在对象解构过程中丢失与组合式函数内状态的响应性连接。与之相反，ref 则可以维持这一响应性连接。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/reusability/composables.html", "title": "组合式函数", "doc_id": "1ab98792a7d24a33bde06065be2d1311", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1263, "chunk_index": 63, "_doc_id": "63_1330107100301496429"}}
{"doc_id": "64_2546825558767937527", "text": ">()<span><span><code><pre><div><p>从组合式函数返回一个响应式对象会导致在对象解构过程中丢失与组合式函数内状态的响应性连接。与之相反，ref 则可以维持这一响应性连接。<p><p>如果你更希望以对象属性的形式来使用组合式函数中返回的状态，你可以将返回的对象用 <code>reactive()<code> 包装一次，这样其中的 ref 会被自动解包，例如：<p><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> mouse<span><span> =<span><span> reactive<span><span>(<span><span>useMouse<span><span>())<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// mouse.x 链接到了原来的 x ref<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/reusability/composables.html", "title": "组合式函数", "doc_id": "1ab98792a7d24a33bde06065be2d1311", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1263, "chunk_index": 64, "_doc_id": "64_2546825558767937527"}}
{"doc_id": "65_7746980827904477513", "text": "n>useMouse<span><span>())<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// mouse.x 链接到了原来的 x ref<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>console.<span><span>log<span><span>(mouse.x)<span><span><code><pre><div><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>Mouse position is at: {{ mouse.x }}, {{ mouse.y }}<span><span><code><pre><div><h3 id=\"side-effects\">副作用 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#side-effects\">​<a><h3><p>在组合式函数中的确可以执行副作用 (例如：添加 DOM 事件监听器或者请求数据)，", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/reusability/composables.html", "title": "组合式函数", "doc_id": "1ab98792a7d24a33bde06065be2d1311", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1263, "chunk_index": 65, "_doc_id": "65_7746980827904477513"}}
{"doc_id": "66_6343510775512791048", "text": "用 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#side-effects\">​<a><h3><p>在组合式函数中的确可以执行副作用 (例如：添加 DOM 事件监听器或者请求数据)，但请注意以下规则：<p><ul><li><p>如果你的应用用到了<a href=\"/guide/scaling-up/ssr.html\">服务端渲染<a> (SSR)，请确保在组件挂载后才调用的生命周期钩子中执行 DOM 相关的副作用，例如：<code>onMounted()<code>。这些钩子仅会在浏览器中被调用，因此可以确保能访问到 DOM。<p><li><li><p>确保在 <code>onUnmounted()<code> 时清理副作用。举例来说，如果一个组合式函数设置了一个事件监听器，它就应该在 <code>onUnmounted()<code> 中被移除 (就像我们在 <code>useMouse()<code> 示例中看到的一样)。当然也可以像之前的 <code>useEventListener()<code> 示例那样，使用一个组合式函数来自动帮你做这些事。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/reusability/composables.html", "title": "组合式函数", "doc_id": "1ab98792a7d24a33bde06065be2d1311", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1263, "chunk_index": 66, "_doc_id": "66_6343510775512791048"}}
{"doc_id": "67_3692173275816274969", "text": "在 <code>useMouse()<code> 示例中看到的一样)。当然也可以像之前的 <code>useEventListener()<code> 示例那样，使用一个组合式函数来自动帮你做这些事。<p><li><ul><h3 id=\"usage-restrictions\">使用限制 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#usage-restrictions\">​<a><h3><p>组合式函数只能在 <code><script setup><code> 或 <code>setup()<code> 钩子中被调用。在这些上下文中，它们也只能被<strong>同步<strong>调用。在某些情况下，你也可以在像 <code>onMounted()<code> 这样的生命周期钩子中调用它们。<p><p>这些限制很重要，因为这些是 Vue 用于确定当前活跃的组件实例的上下文。访问活跃的组件实例很有必要，这样才能：<p><ol><li><p>将生命周期钩子注册到该组件实例上<p><li><li><p>将计算属性和监听器注册到该组件实例上，以便在该组件被卸载时停止监听，避免内存泄漏。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/reusability/composables.html", "title": "组合式函数", "doc_id": "1ab98792a7d24a33bde06065be2d1311", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1263, "chunk_index": 67, "_doc_id": "67_3692173275816274969"}}
{"doc_id": "68_5882736219967426741", "text": "的组件实例很有必要，这样才能：<p><ol><li><p>将生命周期钩子注册到该组件实例上<p><li><li><p>将计算属性和监听器注册到该组件实例上，以便在该组件被卸载时停止监听，避免内存泄漏。<p><li><ol><div class=\"tip custom-block\"><p class=\"custom-block-title\">TIP<p><p><code><script setup><code> 是唯一在调用 <code>await<code> <strong>之后<strong>仍可调用组合式函数的地方。编译器会在异步操作之后自动为你恢复当前的组件实例。<p><div><h2 id=\"extracting-composables-for-code-organization\">通过抽取组合式函数改善代码结构 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#extracting-composables-for-code-organization\">​<a><h2><p>抽取组合式函数不仅是为了复用，也是为了代码组织。随着组件复杂度的增高，你可能会最终发现组件多得难以查询和理解。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/reusability/composables.html", "title": "组合式函数", "doc_id": "1ab98792a7d24a33bde06065be2d1311", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1263, "chunk_index": 68, "_doc_id": "68_5882736219967426741"}}
{"doc_id": "69_1775578702472373271", "text": "omposables-for-code-organization\">​<a><h2><p>抽取组合式函数不仅是为了复用，也是为了代码组织。随着组件复杂度的增高，你可能会最终发现组件多得难以查询和理解。组合式 API 会给予你足够的灵活性，让你可以基于逻辑问题将组件代码拆分成更小的函数：<p><div class=\"language-vue\"> <span class=\"lang\">vue<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>script<span><span> setup<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>import<span><span> { useFeatureA } <span><span>from<span><span> './featureA.js'<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/reusability/composables.html", "title": "组合式函数", "doc_id": "1ab98792a7d24a33bde06065be2d1311", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1263, "chunk_index": 69, "_doc_id": "69_1775578702472373271"}}
{"doc_id": "70_6269961318611715010", "text": "\"><span>import<span><span> { useFeatureA } <span><span>from<span><span> './featureA.js'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>import<span><span> { useFeatureB } <span><span>from<span><span> './featureB.js'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>import<span><span> { useFeatureC } <span><span>from<span><span> './featureC.js'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/reusability/composables.html", "title": "组合式函数", "doc_id": "1ab98792a7d24a33bde06065be2d1311", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1263, "chunk_index": 70, "_doc_id": "70_6269961318611715010"}}
{"doc_id": "71_4611284842490079050", "text": "{ useFeatureC } <span><span>from<span><span> './featureC.js'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> { <span><span>foo<span><span>, <span><span>bar<span><span> } <span><span>=<span><span> useFeatureA<span><span>()<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> { <span><span>baz<span><span> } <span><span>=<span><span> useFeatureB<span><span>(foo)<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/reusability/composables.html", "title": "组合式函数", "doc_id": "1ab98792a7d24a33bde06065be2d1311", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1263, "chunk_index": 71, "_doc_id": "71_4611284842490079050"}}
{"doc_id": "72_3625886597960807421", "text": "{ <span><span>baz<span><span> } <span><span>=<span><span> useFeatureB<span><span>(foo)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> { <span><span>qux<span><span> } <span><span>=<span><span> useFeatureC<span><span>(baz)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>script<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>在某种程度上，你可以将这些提取出的组合式函数看作是可以相互通信的组件范围内的服务。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/reusability/composables.html", "title": "组合式函数", "doc_id": "1ab98792a7d24a33bde06065be2d1311", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1263, "chunk_index": 72, "_doc_id": "72_3625886597960807421"}}
{"doc_id": "73_2888896990343657556", "text": "an><span>script<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>在某种程度上，你可以将这些提取出的组合式函数看作是可以相互通信的组件范围内的服务。<p><h2 id=\"using-composables-in-options-api\">在选项式 API 中使用组合式函数 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#using-composables-in-options-api\">​<a><h2><p>如果你正在使用选项式 API，组合式函数必须在 <code>setup()<code> 中调用。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/reusability/composables.html", "title": "组合式函数", "doc_id": "1ab98792a7d24a33bde06065be2d1311", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1263, "chunk_index": 73, "_doc_id": "73_2888896990343657556"}}
{"doc_id": "74_9175962782806008139", "text": "href=\"#using-composables-in-options-api\">​<a><h2><p>如果你正在使用选项式 API，组合式函数必须在 <code>setup()<code> 中调用。且其返回的绑定必须在 <code>setup()<code> 中返回，以便暴露给 <code>this<code> 及其模板：<p><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>import<span><span> { useMouse } <span><span>from<span><span> './mouse.js'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>import<span><span> { useFetch } <span><span>from<span><span> './fetch.js'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/reusability/composables.html", "title": "组合式函数", "doc_id": "1ab98792a7d24a33bde06065be2d1311", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1263, "chunk_index": 74, "_doc_id": "74_9175962782806008139"}}
{"doc_id": "75_6864817038471051148", "text": "<span> { useFetch } <span><span>from<span><span> './fetch.js'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> setup<span><span>() {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> const<span><span> { <span><span>x<span><span>, <span><span>y<span><span> } <span><span>=<span><span> useMouse<span><span>()<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/reusability/composables.html", "title": "组合式函数", "doc_id": "1ab98792a7d24a33bde06065be2d1311", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1263, "chunk_index": 75, "_doc_id": "75_6864817038471051148"}}
{"doc_id": "76_4099952000819616056", "text": "an><span>, <span><span>y<span><span> } <span><span>=<span><span> useMouse<span><span>()<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> const<span><span> { <span><span>data<span><span>, <span><span>error<span><span> } <span><span>=<span><span> useFetch<span><span>(<span><span>'...'<span><span>)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> return<span><span> { x, y, data, error }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> },<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> mounted<span><span>() {<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/reusability/composables.html", "title": "组合式函数", "doc_id": "1ab98792a7d24a33bde06065be2d1311", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1263, "chunk_index": 76, "_doc_id": "76_4099952000819616056"}}
{"doc_id": "77_38320362631925842", "text": "an class=\"line\"><span> },<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> mounted<span><span>() {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // setup() 暴露的属性可以在通过 `this` 访问到<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> console.<span><span>log<span><span>(<span><span>this<span><span>.x)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // ...其他选项<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/reusability/composables.html", "title": "组合式函数", "doc_id": "1ab98792a7d24a33bde06065be2d1311", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1263, "chunk_index": 77, "_doc_id": "77_38320362631925842"}}
{"doc_id": "78_5700109037037057365", "text": "pan><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // ...其他选项<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span><code><pre><div><h2 id=\"comparisons-with-other-techniques\">与其他模式的比较 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#comparisons-with-other-techniques\">​<a><h2><h3 id=\"vs-mixins\">和 Mixin 的对比 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#vs-mixins\">​<a><h3><p>Vue 2 的用户可能会对 <a href=\"/api/options-composition.html#mixins\">mixins<a> 选项比较熟悉。它也让我们能够把组件逻辑提取到可复用的单元里。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/reusability/composables.html", "title": "组合式函数", "doc_id": "1ab98792a7d24a33bde06065be2d1311", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1263, "chunk_index": 78, "_doc_id": "78_5700109037037057365"}}
{"doc_id": "79_5080123897646010684", "text": "ue 2 的用户可能会对 <a href=\"/api/options-composition.html#mixins\">mixins<a> 选项比较熟悉。它也让我们能够把组件逻辑提取到可复用的单元里。然而 mixins 有三个主要的短板：<p><ol><li><p><strong>不清晰的数据来源<strong>：当使用了多个 mixin 时，实例上的数据属性来自哪个 mixin 变得不清晰，这使追溯实现和理解组件行为变得困难。这也是我们推荐在组合式函数中使用 ref + 解构模式的理由：让属性的来源在消费组件时一目了然。<p><li><li><p><strong>命名空间冲突<strong>：多个来自不同作者的 mixin 可能会注册相同的属性名，造成命名冲突。若使用组合式函数，你可以通过在解构变量时对变量进行重命名来避免相同的键名。<p><li><li><p><strong>隐式的跨 mixin 交流<strong>：多个 mixin 需要依赖共享的属性名来进行相互作用，这使得它们隐性地耦合在一起。而一个组合式函数的返回值可以作为另一个组合式函数的参数被传入，像普通函数那样。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/reusability/composables.html", "title": "组合式函数", "doc_id": "1ab98792a7d24a33bde06065be2d1311", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1263, "chunk_index": 79, "_doc_id": "79_5080123897646010684"}}
{"doc_id": "80_4821228682190819331", "text": "的跨 mixin 交流<strong>：多个 mixin 需要依赖共享的属性名来进行相互作用，这使得它们隐性地耦合在一起。而一个组合式函数的返回值可以作为另一个组合式函数的参数被传入，像普通函数那样。<p><li><ol><p>基于上述理由，我们不再推荐在 Vue 3 中继续使用 mixin。保留该功能只是为了项目迁移的需求和照顾熟悉它的用户。<p><h3 id=\"vs-renderless-components\">和无渲染组件的对比 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#vs-renderless-components\">​<a><h3><p>在组件插槽一章中，我们讨论过了基于作用域插槽的<a href=\"/guide/components/slots.html#renderless-components\">无渲染组件<a>。我们甚至用它实现了一样的鼠标追踪器示例。<p><p>组合式函数相对于无渲染组件的主要优势是：组合式函数不会产生额外的组件实例开销。当在整个应用中使用时，由无渲染组件产生的额外组件实例会带来无法忽视的性能开销。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/reusability/composables.html", "title": "组合式函数", "doc_id": "1ab98792a7d24a33bde06065be2d1311", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1263, "chunk_index": 80, "_doc_id": "80_4821228682190819331"}}
{"doc_id": "81_1043122677701176133", "text": "用它实现了一样的鼠标追踪器示例。<p><p>组合式函数相对于无渲染组件的主要优势是：组合式函数不会产生额外的组件实例开销。当在整个应用中使用时，由无渲染组件产生的额外组件实例会带来无法忽视的性能开销。<p><p>我们推荐在纯逻辑复用时使用组合式函数，在需要同时复用逻辑和视图布局时使用无渲染组件。<p><h3 id=\"vs-react-hooks\">和 React Hooks 的对比 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#vs-react-hooks\">​<a><h3><p>如果你有 React 的开发经验，你可能注意到组合式函数和自定义 React hooks 非常相似。组合式 API 的一部分灵感正来自于 React hooks，Vue 的组合式函数也的确在逻辑组合能力上与 React hooks 相近。然而，Vue 的组合式函数是基于 Vue 细粒度的响应性系统，这和 React hooks 的执行模型有本质上的不同。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/reusability/composables.html", "title": "组合式函数", "doc_id": "1ab98792a7d24a33bde06065be2d1311", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1263, "chunk_index": 81, "_doc_id": "81_1043122677701176133"}}
{"doc_id": "82_8622037736974326919", "text": "ks，Vue 的组合式函数也的确在逻辑组合能力上与 React hooks 相近。然而，Vue 的组合式函数是基于 Vue 细粒度的响应性系统，这和 React hooks 的执行模型有本质上的不同。这一话题在<a href=\"/guide/extras/composition-api-faq.html#comparison-with-react-hooks\">组合式 API 的常见问题<a>中有更细致的讨论。<p><h2 id=\"further-reading\">延伸阅读 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#further-reading\">​<a><h2><div><div>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/reusability/composables.html", "title": "组合式函数", "doc_id": "1ab98792a7d24a33bde06065be2d1311", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1263, "chunk_index": 82, "_doc_id": "82_8622037736974326919"}}
{"doc_id": "0_3584387159555560064", "text": "<div><div><h1 id=\"single-file-components\">单文件组件 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#single-file-components\">​<a><h1><h2 id=\"introduction\">介绍 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#introduction\">​<a><h2><p>Vue 的单文件组件 (即 <code>*.vue<code> 文件，英文 Single-File Component，简称 <strong>SFC<strong>) 是一种特殊的文件格式，使我们能够将一个 Vue 组件的模板、逻辑与样式封装在单个文件中。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/scaling-up/sfc.html", "title": "单文件组件", "doc_id": "ceafc1ba8202445facd9231b90fbd28d", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 256, "chunk_index": 0, "_doc_id": "0_3584387159555560064"}}
{"doc_id": "1_5904563641090635914", "text": "de> 文件，英文 Single-File Component，简称 <strong>SFC<strong>) 是一种特殊的文件格式，使我们能够将一个 Vue 组件的模板、逻辑与样式封装在单个文件中。下面是一个单文件组件的示例：<p><div class=\"options-api\"><div class=\"language-vue\"> <span class=\"lang\">vue<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>script<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> data<span><span>() {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> return<span><span> {<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/scaling-up/sfc.html", "title": "单文件组件", "doc_id": "ceafc1ba8202445facd9231b90fbd28d", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 256, "chunk_index": 1, "_doc_id": "1_5904563641090635914"}}
{"doc_id": "2_676455179148210906", "text": "><span> data<span><span>() {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> return<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> greeting: <span><span>'Hello World!'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>script<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/scaling-up/sfc.html", "title": "单文件组件", "doc_id": "ceafc1ba8202445facd9231b90fbd28d", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 256, "chunk_index": 2, "_doc_id": "2_676455179148210906"}}
{"doc_id": "3_6090515951954311560", "text": ">\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>p<span><span> class<span><span>=<span><span>\"greeting\"<span><span>>{{ greeting }}</<span><span>p<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>style<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>.greeting<span><span> {<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/scaling-up/sfc.html", "title": "单文件组件", "doc_id": "ceafc1ba8202445facd9231b90fbd28d", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 256, "chunk_index": 3, "_doc_id": "3_6090515951954311560"}}
{"doc_id": "4_4212903995423187599", "text": "n><span>style<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>.greeting<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> color<span><span>: <span><span>red<span><span>;<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> font-weight<span><span>: <span><span>bold<span><span>;<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/scaling-up/sfc.html", "title": "单文件组件", "doc_id": "ceafc1ba8202445facd9231b90fbd28d", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 256, "chunk_index": 4, "_doc_id": "4_4212903995423187599"}}
{"doc_id": "5_4813006113887291885", "text": "eight<span><span>: <span><span>bold<span><span>;<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>style<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><div><div class=\"composition-api\"><div class=\"language-vue\"> <span class=\"lang\">vue<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>script<span><span> setup<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>import<span><span> { ref } <span><span>from<span><span> 'vue'<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/scaling-up/sfc.html", "title": "单文件组件", "doc_id": "ceafc1ba8202445facd9231b90fbd28d", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 256, "chunk_index": 5, "_doc_id": "5_4813006113887291885"}}
{"doc_id": "6_60222202543017870", "text": "<span class=\"line\"><span>import<span><span> { ref } <span><span>from<span><span> 'vue'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> greeting<span><span> =<span><span> ref<span><span>(<span><span>'Hello World!'<span><span>)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>script<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/scaling-up/sfc.html", "title": "单文件组件", "doc_id": "ceafc1ba8202445facd9231b90fbd28d", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 256, "chunk_index": 6, "_doc_id": "6_60222202543017870"}}
{"doc_id": "7_6090515951954311560", "text": ">\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>p<span><span> class<span><span>=<span><span>\"greeting\"<span><span>>{{ greeting }}</<span><span>p<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>style<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>.greeting<span><span> {<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/scaling-up/sfc.html", "title": "单文件组件", "doc_id": "ceafc1ba8202445facd9231b90fbd28d", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 256, "chunk_index": 7, "_doc_id": "7_6090515951954311560"}}
{"doc_id": "8_2153783516035028828", "text": "n><span>style<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>.greeting<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> color<span><span>: <span><span>red<span><span>;<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> font-weight<span><span>: <span><span>bold<span><span>;<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>style<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><div><p>如你所见，Vue 的单文件组件是网页开发中 HTML、CSS 和 JavaScript 三种语言经典组合的自然延伸。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/scaling-up/sfc.html", "title": "单文件组件", "doc_id": "ceafc1ba8202445facd9231b90fbd28d", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 256, "chunk_index": 8, "_doc_id": "8_2153783516035028828"}}
{"doc_id": "9_1504590802246030107", "text": "span>><span><span><code><pre><div><div><p>如你所见，Vue 的单文件组件是网页开发中 HTML、CSS 和 JavaScript 三种语言经典组合的自然延伸。<code><template><code>、<code><script><code> 和 <code><style><code> 三个块在同一个文件中封装、组合了组件的视图、逻辑和样式。完整的语法定义可以查阅<a href=\"/api/sfc-spec.html\">单文件组件语法说明<a>。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/scaling-up/sfc.html", "title": "单文件组件", "doc_id": "ceafc1ba8202445facd9231b90fbd28d", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 256, "chunk_index": 9, "_doc_id": "9_1504590802246030107"}}
{"doc_id": "10_7264279733046433801", "text": "code><style><code> 三个块在同一个文件中封装、组合了组件的视图、逻辑和样式。完整的语法定义可以查阅<a href=\"/api/sfc-spec.html\">单文件组件语法说明<a>。<p><h2 id=\"why-sfc\">为什么要使用单文件组件 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#why-sfc\">​<a><h2><p>使用单文件组件必须使用构建工具，但作为回报带来了以下优点：<p><p>单文件组件是 Vue 框架提供的一个功能，并且在下列场景中都是官方推荐的项目组织方式：<p><ul><li>单页面应用 (SPA)<li><li>静态站点生成 (SSG)<li><li>任何值得引入构建步骤以获得更好的开发体验 (DX) 的项目<li><ul><p>当然，在一些轻量级场景下使用单文件组件会显得有些杀鸡用牛刀。因此 Vue 同样也可以在无构建步骤的情况下以纯 JavaScript 方式使用。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/scaling-up/sfc.html", "title": "单文件组件", "doc_id": "ceafc1ba8202445facd9231b90fbd28d", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 256, "chunk_index": 10, "_doc_id": "10_7264279733046433801"}}
{"doc_id": "11_4177514796086955104", "text": "获得更好的开发体验 (DX) 的项目<li><ul><p>当然，在一些轻量级场景下使用单文件组件会显得有些杀鸡用牛刀。因此 Vue 同样也可以在无构建步骤的情况下以纯 JavaScript 方式使用。如果你的用例只需要给静态 HTML 添加一些简单的交互，你可以看看 <a href=\"https://github.com/vuejs/petite-vue\" target=\"_blank\">petite-vue<a>，它是一个 6 kB 左右、预优化过的 Vue 子集，更适合渐进式增强的需求。<p><h2 id=\"how-it-works\">单文件组件是如何工作的 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#how-it-works\">​<a><h2><p>Vue 单文件组件是一个框架指定的文件格式，因此必须交由 <a href=\"https://github.com/vuejs/core/tree/main/packages/compiler-sfc\" target=\"_blank\">@vue/compiler-sfc<a> 编译为标准的 JavaScript 和 CSS，", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/scaling-up/sfc.html", "title": "单文件组件", "doc_id": "ceafc1ba8202445facd9231b90fbd28d", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 256, "chunk_index": 11, "_doc_id": "11_4177514796086955104"}}
{"doc_id": "12_4669932154311836796", "text": "/core/tree/main/packages/compiler-sfc\" target=\"_blank\">@vue/compiler-sfc<a> 编译为标准的 JavaScript 和 CSS，一个编译后的单文件组件是一个标准的 JavaScript(ES) 模块，这也意味着在构建配置正确的前提下，你可以像导入其他 ES 模块一样导入单文件组件：<p><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>import<span><span> MyComponent <span><span>from<span><span> './MyComponent.vue'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/scaling-up/sfc.html", "title": "单文件组件", "doc_id": "ceafc1ba8202445facd9231b90fbd28d", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 256, "chunk_index": 12, "_doc_id": "12_4669932154311836796"}}
{"doc_id": "13_7593979449652273742", "text": "n class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> components: {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> MyComponent<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span><code><pre><div><p>单文件组件中的 <code><style><code> 标签一般会在开发时注入成原生的 <code><style><code> 标签以支持热更新，而生产环境下它们会被抽取、合并成单独的 CSS 文件。<p><p>你可以在 <a href=\"https://play.vuejs.org/\" target=\"_blank\">Vue 单文件组件演练场<a>中实际使用一下单文件组件，同时可以看到它们最终被编译后的样子。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/scaling-up/sfc.html", "title": "单文件组件", "doc_id": "ceafc1ba8202445facd9231b90fbd28d", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 256, "chunk_index": 13, "_doc_id": "13_7593979449652273742"}}
{"doc_id": "14_2668162872365937160", "text": "可以在 <a href=\"https://play.vuejs.org/\" target=\"_blank\">Vue 单文件组件演练场<a>中实际使用一下单文件组件，同时可以看到它们最终被编译后的样子。<p><p>在实际项目中，我们一般会使用集成了单文件组件编译器的构建工具，比如 <a href=\"https://cn.vitejs.dev/\" target=\"_blank\">Vite<a> 或者 <a href=\"https://cli.vuejs.org/zh/\" target=\"_blank\">Vue CLI<a> (基于 <a href=\"https://webpack.js.org/\" target=\"_blank\">webpack<a>)，Vue 官方也提供了脚手架工具来帮助你尽可能快速地上手开发单文件组件。更多细节请查看<a href=\"/guide/scaling-up/tooling.html\">单文件组件工具链<a>章节。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/scaling-up/sfc.html", "title": "单文件组件", "doc_id": "ceafc1ba8202445facd9231b90fbd28d", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 256, "chunk_index": 14, "_doc_id": "14_2668162872365937160"}}
{"doc_id": "15_1891549839648477526", "text": ">)，Vue 官方也提供了脚手架工具来帮助你尽可能快速地上手开发单文件组件。更多细节请查看<a href=\"/guide/scaling-up/tooling.html\">单文件组件工具链<a>章节。<p><h2 id=\"what-about-separation-of-concerns\">如何看待关注点分离？ <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#what-about-separation-of-concerns\">​<a><h2><p>一些有着传统 Web 开发背景的用户可能会因为单文件组件将不同的关注点集合在一处而有所顾虑，觉得 HTML/CSS/JS 应当是分离开的！<p><p>要回答这个问题，我们必须对这一点达成共识：<strong>前端开发的关注点不是完全基于文件类型分离的<strong>。前端工程化的最终目的都是为了能够更好地维护代码。关注点分离不应该是教条式地将其视为文件类型的区别和分离，仅仅这样并不够帮我们在日益复杂的前端应用的背景下提高开发效率。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/scaling-up/sfc.html", "title": "单文件组件", "doc_id": "ceafc1ba8202445facd9231b90fbd28d", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 256, "chunk_index": 15, "_doc_id": "15_1891549839648477526"}}
{"doc_id": "16_5012689592418377534", "text": "于文件类型分离的<strong>。前端工程化的最终目的都是为了能够更好地维护代码。关注点分离不应该是教条式地将其视为文件类型的区别和分离，仅仅这样并不够帮我们在日益复杂的前端应用的背景下提高开发效率。<p><p>在现代的 UI 开发中，我们发现与其将代码库划分为三个巨大的层，相互交织在一起，不如将它们划分为松散耦合的组件，再按需组合起来。在一个组件中，其模板、逻辑和样式本就是有内在联系的、是耦合的，将它们放在一起，实际上使组件更有内聚性和可维护性。<p><p>即使你不喜欢单文件组件这样的形式而仍然选择拆分单独的 JavaScript 和 CSS 文件，也没关系，你还是可以通过<a href=\"/api/sfc-spec.html#src-imports\">资源导入<a>功能获得热更新和预编译等功能的支持。<p><div><div>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/scaling-up/sfc.html", "title": "单文件组件", "doc_id": "ceafc1ba8202445facd9231b90fbd28d", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 256, "chunk_index": 16, "_doc_id": "16_5012689592418377534"}}
{"doc_id": "0_2612167172246208728", "text": "<div><div><h1 id=\"slots\">插槽 Slots <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#slots\">​<a><h1><blockquote><p>此章节假设你已经看过了<a href=\"/guide/essentials/component-basics.html\">组件基础<a>。若你还不了解组件是什么，请先阅读该章节。<p><blockquote><h2 id=\"slot-content-and-outlet\">插槽内容与出口 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#slot-content-and-outlet\">​<a><h2><p>在之前的章节中，我们已经了解到组件能够接收任意类型的 JavaScript 值作为 props，但组件要如何接收模板内容呢？在某些场景中，我们可能想要为子组件传递一些模板片段，让子组件在它们的组件中渲染这些片段。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/slots.html", "title": "插槽 Slots", "doc_id": "64f824bac8ce4d68be0669bdef0ce696", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1189, "chunk_index": 0, "_doc_id": "0_2612167172246208728"}}
{"doc_id": "1_1820952586860339980", "text": "中，我们已经了解到组件能够接收任意类型的 JavaScript 值作为 props，但组件要如何接收模板内容呢？在某些场景中，我们可能想要为子组件传递一些模板片段，让子组件在它们的组件中渲染这些片段。<p><p>举例来说，这里有一个 <code><FancyButton><code> 组件，可以像这样使用：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>FancyButton<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line highlighted\"><span> Click me! <span><span><!-- 插槽内容 --><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/slots.html", "title": "插槽 Slots", "doc_id": "64f824bac8ce4d68be0669bdef0ce696", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1189, "chunk_index": 1, "_doc_id": "1_1820952586860339980"}}
{"doc_id": "2_5082987607370797357", "text": "><span><span>\n<span class=\"line highlighted\"><span> Click me! <span><span><!-- 插槽内容 --><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>FancyButton<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>而 <code><FancyButton><code> 的模板是这样的：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>button<span><span> class<span><span>=<span><span>\"fancy-btn\"<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/slots.html", "title": "插槽 Slots", "doc_id": "64f824bac8ce4d68be0669bdef0ce696", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1189, "chunk_index": 2, "_doc_id": "2_5082987607370797357"}}
{"doc_id": "3_3057525729266976668", "text": "><<span><span>button<span><span> class<span><span>=<span><span>\"fancy-btn\"<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line highlighted\"><span> <<span><span>slot<span><span>></<span><span>slot<span><span>> <span><span><!-- 插槽出口 --><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>button<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p><code><slot><code> 元素是一个<strong>插槽出口<strong> (slot outlet)，标示了父元素提供的<strong>插槽内容<strong> (slot content) 将在哪里被渲染。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/slots.html", "title": "插槽 Slots", "doc_id": "64f824bac8ce4d68be0669bdef0ce696", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1189, "chunk_index": 3, "_doc_id": "3_3057525729266976668"}}
{"doc_id": "4_7256300376872166431", "text": "<code> 元素是一个<strong>插槽出口<strong> (slot outlet)，标示了父元素提供的<strong>插槽内容<strong> (slot content) 将在哪里被渲染。<p><p> <p><p>最终渲染出的 DOM 是这样：<p><div class=\"language-html\"> <span class=\"lang\">html<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>button<span><span> class<span><span>=<span><span>\"fancy-btn\"<span><span>>Click me!</<span><span>button<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>通过使用插槽，<code><FancyButton><code> 仅负责渲染外层的 <code><button><code> (以及相应的样式)，而其内部的内容由父组件提供。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/slots.html", "title": "插槽 Slots", "doc_id": "64f824bac8ce4d68be0669bdef0ce696", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1189, "chunk_index": 4, "_doc_id": "4_7256300376872166431"}}
{"doc_id": "5_4662270320587612061", "text": "<pre><div><p>通过使用插槽，<code><FancyButton><code> 仅负责渲染外层的 <code><button><code> (以及相应的样式)，而其内部的内容由父组件提供。<p><p>理解插槽的另一种方式是和下面的 JavaScript 函数作类比，其概念是类似的：<p><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// 父元素传入插槽内容<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>FancyButton<span><span>(<span><span>'Click me!'<span><span>)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// FancyButton 在自己的模板中渲染插槽内容<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/slots.html", "title": "插槽 Slots", "doc_id": "64f824bac8ce4d68be0669bdef0ce696", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1189, "chunk_index": 5, "_doc_id": "5_4662270320587612061"}}
{"doc_id": "6_441024895909192690", "text": "><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// FancyButton 在自己的模板中渲染插槽内容<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>function<span><span> FancyButton<span><span>(<span><span>slotContent<span><span>) {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> return<span><span> `<button class=\"fancy-btn\"><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> ${<span><span>slotContent<span><span>}<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> </button>`<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/slots.html", "title": "插槽 Slots", "doc_id": "64f824bac8ce4d68be0669bdef0ce696", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1189, "chunk_index": 6, "_doc_id": "6_441024895909192690"}}
{"doc_id": "7_2521013449603793169", "text": "${<span><span>slotContent<span><span>}<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> </button>`<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span><code><pre><div><p>插槽内容可以是任意合法的模板内容，不局限于文本。例如我们可以传入多个元素，甚至是组件：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>FancyButton<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/slots.html", "title": "插槽 Slots", "doc_id": "64f824bac8ce4d68be0669bdef0ce696", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1189, "chunk_index": 7, "_doc_id": "7_2521013449603793169"}}
{"doc_id": "8_8463249108659257948", "text": "thub-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>FancyButton<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>span<span><span> style<span><span>=<span><span>\"color:red\"<span><span>>Click me!</<span><span>span<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>AwesomeIcon<span><span> name<span><span>=<span><span>\"plus\"<span><span> /><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/slots.html", "title": "插槽 Slots", "doc_id": "64f824bac8ce4d68be0669bdef0ce696", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1189, "chunk_index": 8, "_doc_id": "8_8463249108659257948"}}
{"doc_id": "9_5047478743245750948", "text": "<<span><span>AwesomeIcon<span><span> name<span><span>=<span><span>\"plus\"<span><span> /><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>FancyButton<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>通过使用插槽，<code><FancyButton><code> 组件更加灵活和具有可复用性。现在组件可以用在不同的地方渲染各异的内容，但同时还保证都具有相同的样式。<p><p>Vue 组件的插槽机制是受<a href=\"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/HTML/Element/slot\" target=\"_blank\">原生 Web Component <code><slot><code> 元素<a>的启发而诞生，同时还做了一些功能拓展，这些拓展的功能我们后面会学习到。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/slots.html", "title": "插槽 Slots", "doc_id": "64f824bac8ce4d68be0669bdef0ce696", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1189, "chunk_index": 9, "_doc_id": "9_5047478743245750948"}}
{"doc_id": "10_8218686546726675249", "text": "t/slot\" target=\"_blank\">原生 Web Component <code><slot><code> 元素<a>的启发而诞生，同时还做了一些功能拓展，这些拓展的功能我们后面会学习到。<p><h2 id=\"render-scope\">渲染作用域 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#render-scope\">​<a><h2><p>插槽内容可以访问到父组件的数据作用域，因为插槽内容本身是在父组件模板中定义的。举例来说：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>span<span><span>>{{ message }}</<span><span>span<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/slots.html", "title": "插槽 Slots", "doc_id": "64f824bac8ce4d68be0669bdef0ce696", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1189, "chunk_index": 10, "_doc_id": "10_8218686546726675249"}}
{"doc_id": "11_3772340381748381098", "text": "\"line\"><span><<span><span>span<span><span>>{{ message }}</<span><span>span<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>FancyButton<span><span>>{{ message }}</<span><span>FancyButton<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>这里的两个 <span><code>{{ message }}<code><span> 插值表达式渲染的内容都是一样的。<p><p>插槽内容<strong>无法访问<strong>子组件的数据。Vue 模板中的表达式只能访问其定义时所处的作用域，这和 JavaScript 的词法作用域规则是一致的。换言之：<p><blockquote><p>父组件模板中的表达式只能访问父组件的作用域；子组件模板中的表达式只能访问子组件的作用域。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/slots.html", "title": "插槽 Slots", "doc_id": "64f824bac8ce4d68be0669bdef0ce696", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1189, "chunk_index": 11, "_doc_id": "11_3772340381748381098"}}
{"doc_id": "12_2617403192001882382", "text": "所处的作用域，这和 JavaScript 的词法作用域规则是一致的。换言之：<p><blockquote><p>父组件模板中的表达式只能访问父组件的作用域；子组件模板中的表达式只能访问子组件的作用域。<p><blockquote><h2 id=\"fallback-content\">默认内容 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#fallback-content\">​<a><h2><p>在外部没有提供任何内容的情况下，可以为插槽指定默认内容。比如有这样一个 <code><SubmitButton><code> 组件：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>button<span><span> type<span><span>=<span><span>\"submit\"<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/slots.html", "title": "插槽 Slots", "doc_id": "64f824bac8ce4d68be0669bdef0ce696", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1189, "chunk_index": 12, "_doc_id": "12_2617403192001882382"}}
{"doc_id": "13_4691609522296481674", "text": "span><<span><span>button<span><span> type<span><span>=<span><span>\"submit\"<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>slot<span><span>></<span><span>slot<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/slots.html", "title": "插槽 Slots", "doc_id": "64f824bac8ce4d68be0669bdef0ce696", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1189, "chunk_index": 13, "_doc_id": "13_4691609522296481674"}}
{"doc_id": "14_4451867424968246545", "text": "<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>slot<span><span>></<span><span>slot<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>button<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>如果我们想在父组件没有提供任何插槽内容时在 <code><button><code> 内渲染“Submit”，只需要将“Submit”写在 <code><slot><code> 标签之间来作为默认内容：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>button<span><span> type<span><span>=<span><span>\"submit\"<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/slots.html", "title": "插槽 Slots", "doc_id": "64f824bac8ce4d68be0669bdef0ce696", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1189, "chunk_index": 14, "_doc_id": "14_4451867424968246545"}}
{"doc_id": "15_5508565170476550040", "text": "span><<span><span>button<span><span> type<span><span>=<span><span>\"submit\"<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>slot<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line highlighted\"><span> Submit <span><span><!-- 默认内容 --><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> </<span><span>slot<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>button<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>现在，当我们在父组件中使用 <code><SubmitButton><code> 且没有提供任何插槽内容时：<p><p>“Submit”将会被作为默认内容渲染：<p><div", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/slots.html", "title": "插槽 Slots", "doc_id": "64f824bac8ce4d68be0669bdef0ce696", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1189, "chunk_index": 15, "_doc_id": "15_5508565170476550040"}}
{"doc_id": "16_193215304439877225", "text": "pre><div><p>现在，当我们在父组件中使用 <code><SubmitButton><code> 且没有提供任何插槽内容时：<p><p>“Submit”将会被作为默认内容渲染：<p><div class=\"language-html\"> <span class=\"lang\">html<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>button<span><span> type<span><span>=<span><span>\"submit\"<span><span>>Submit</<span><span>button<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>但如果我们提供了插槽内容：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/slots.html", "title": "插槽 Slots", "doc_id": "64f824bac8ce4d68be0669bdef0ce696", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1189, "chunk_index": 16, "_doc_id": "16_193215304439877225"}}
{"doc_id": "17_1694824141776352732", "text": "uage-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>SubmitButton<span><span>>Save</<span><span>SubmitButton<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>那么被显式提供的内容会取代默认内容：<p><div class=\"language-html\"> <span class=\"lang\">html<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>button<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/slots.html", "title": "插槽 Slots", "doc_id": "64f824bac8ce4d68be0669bdef0ce696", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1189, "chunk_index": 17, "_doc_id": "17_1694824141776352732"}}
{"doc_id": "18_8189129283479816442", "text": "re class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>button<span><span> type<span><span>=<span><span>\"submit\"<span><span>>Save</<span><span>button<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><h2 id=\"named-slots\">具名插槽 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#named-slots\">​<a><h2><p>有时在一个组件中包含多个插槽出口是很有用的。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/slots.html", "title": "插槽 Slots", "doc_id": "64f824bac8ce4d68be0669bdef0ce696", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1189, "chunk_index": 18, "_doc_id": "18_8189129283479816442"}}
{"doc_id": "19_3751714379602986259", "text": "id=\"named-slots\">具名插槽 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#named-slots\">​<a><h2><p>有时在一个组件中包含多个插槽出口是很有用的。举例来说，在一个 <code><BaseLayout><code> 组件中，有如下模板：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>div<span><span> class<span><span>=<span><span>\"container\"<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>header<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <!-- 标题内容放这里 --><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/slots.html", "title": "插槽 Slots", "doc_id": "64f824bac8ce4d68be0669bdef0ce696", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1189, "chunk_index": 19, "_doc_id": "19_3751714379602986259"}}
{"doc_id": "20_7043848162580366249", "text": "<<span><span>header<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <!-- 标题内容放这里 --><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> </<span><span>header<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>main<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <!-- 主要内容放这里 --><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> </<span><span>main<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>footer<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <!-- 底部内容放这里 --><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/slots.html", "title": "插槽 Slots", "doc_id": "64f824bac8ce4d68be0669bdef0ce696", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1189, "chunk_index": 20, "_doc_id": "20_7043848162580366249"}}
{"doc_id": "21_4758295454222331043", "text": "<<span><span>footer<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <!-- 底部内容放这里 --><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> </<span><span>footer<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/slots.html", "title": "插槽 Slots", "doc_id": "64f824bac8ce4d68be0669bdef0ce696", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1189, "chunk_index": 21, "_doc_id": "21_4758295454222331043"}}
{"doc_id": "22_6980563681549693772", "text": "!-- 底部内容放这里 --><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> </<span><span>footer<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>div<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>对于这种场景，<code><slot><code> 元素可以有一个特殊的 attribute <code>name<code>，用来给各个插槽分配唯一的 ID，以确定每一处要渲染的内容：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>div<span><span> class<span><span>=<span><span>\"container\"<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/slots.html", "title": "插槽 Slots", "doc_id": "64f824bac8ce4d68be0669bdef0ce696", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1189, "chunk_index": 22, "_doc_id": "22_6980563681549693772"}}
{"doc_id": "23_1522760028333411565", "text": "pan><<span><span>div<span><span> class<span><span>=<span><span>\"container\"<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>header<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>slot<span><span> name<span><span>=<span><span>\"header\"<span><span>></<span><span>slot<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> </<span><span>header<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>main<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/slots.html", "title": "插槽 Slots", "doc_id": "64f824bac8ce4d68be0669bdef0ce696", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1189, "chunk_index": 23, "_doc_id": "23_1522760028333411565"}}
{"doc_id": "24_3377685496559527482", "text": "eader<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>main<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>slot<span><span>></<span><span>slot<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> </<span><span>main<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>footer<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>slot<span><span> name<span><span>=<span><span>\"footer\"<span><span>></<span><span>slot<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/slots.html", "title": "插槽 Slots", "doc_id": "64f824bac8ce4d68be0669bdef0ce696", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1189, "chunk_index": 24, "_doc_id": "24_3377685496559527482"}}
{"doc_id": "25_7672024035451430087", "text": "span> name<span><span>=<span><span>\"footer\"<span><span>></<span><span>slot<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> </<span><span>footer<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>div<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>这类带 <code>name<code> 的插槽被称为具名插槽 (named slots)。没有提供 <code>name<code> 的 <code><slot><code> 出口会隐式地命名为“default”。<p><p>在父组件中使用 <code><BaseLayout><code> 时，我们需要一种方式将多个插槽内容传入到各自目标插槽的出口。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/slots.html", "title": "插槽 Slots", "doc_id": "64f824bac8ce4d68be0669bdef0ce696", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1189, "chunk_index": 25, "_doc_id": "25_7672024035451430087"}}
{"doc_id": "26_2806008495220502826", "text": "slot><code> 出口会隐式地命名为“default”。<p><p>在父组件中使用 <code><BaseLayout><code> 时，我们需要一种方式将多个插槽内容传入到各自目标插槽的出口。此时就需要用到<strong>具名插槽<strong>了：<p><p>要为具名插槽传入内容，我们需要使用一个含 <code>v-slot<code> 指令的 <code><template><code> 元素，并将目标插槽的名字传给该指令：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>BaseLayout<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>template<span><span> v-slot:header<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/slots.html", "title": "插槽 Slots", "doc_id": "64f824bac8ce4d68be0669bdef0ce696", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1189, "chunk_index": 26, "_doc_id": "26_2806008495220502826"}}
{"doc_id": "27_298618691456181575", "text": "<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>template<span><span> v-slot:header<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <!-- header 插槽的内容放这里 --><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> </<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/slots.html", "title": "插槽 Slots", "doc_id": "64f824bac8ce4d68be0669bdef0ce696", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1189, "chunk_index": 27, "_doc_id": "27_298618691456181575"}}
{"doc_id": "28_7558365644413112402", "text": "插槽的内容放这里 --><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> </<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>BaseLayout<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p><code>v-slot<code> 有对应的简写 <code>#<code>，因此 <code><template v-slot:header><code> 可以简写为 <code><template #header><code>。其意思就是“将这部分模板片段传入子组件的 header 插槽中”。<p><p> <p><p>下面我们给出完整的、向 <code><BaseLayout><code> 传递插槽内容的代码，指令均使用的是缩写形式：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>BaseLayout<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/slots.html", "title": "插槽 Slots", "doc_id": "64f824bac8ce4d68be0669bdef0ce696", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1189, "chunk_index": 28, "_doc_id": "28_7558365644413112402"}}
{"doc_id": "29_3261621805291761491", "text": "ithub-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>BaseLayout<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>template<span><span> #<span><span>header<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>h1<span><span>>Here might be a page title</<span><span>h1<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> </<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/slots.html", "title": "插槽 Slots", "doc_id": "64f824bac8ce4d68be0669bdef0ce696", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1189, "chunk_index": 29, "_doc_id": "29_3261621805291761491"}}
{"doc_id": "30_4995213617788304869", "text": "<span class=\"line\"><span> </<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>template<span><span> #<span><span>default<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>p<span><span>>A paragraph for the main content.</<span><span>p<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>p<span><span>>And another one.</<span><span>p<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/slots.html", "title": "插槽 Slots", "doc_id": "64f824bac8ce4d68be0669bdef0ce696", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1189, "chunk_index": 30, "_doc_id": "30_4995213617788304869"}}
{"doc_id": "31_8223053091218597382", "text": "s=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>p<span><span>>And another one.</<span><span>p<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> </<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>template<span><span> #<span><span>footer<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>p<span><span>>Here's some contact info</<span><span>p<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> </<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/slots.html", "title": "插槽 Slots", "doc_id": "64f824bac8ce4d68be0669bdef0ce696", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1189, "chunk_index": 31, "_doc_id": "31_8223053091218597382"}}
{"doc_id": "32_4469180609353397453", "text": "<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> </<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>BaseLayout<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>当一个组件同时接收默认插槽和具名插槽时，所有位于顶级的非 <code><template><code> 节点都被隐式地视为默认插槽的内容。所以上面也可以写成：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>BaseLayout<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/slots.html", "title": "插槽 Slots", "doc_id": "64f824bac8ce4d68be0669bdef0ce696", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1189, "chunk_index": 32, "_doc_id": "32_4469180609353397453"}}
{"doc_id": "33_5124639432426565497", "text": "ithub-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>BaseLayout<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>template<span><span> #<span><span>header<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>h1<span><span>>Here might be a page title</<span><span>h1<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> </<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <!-- 隐式的默认插槽 --><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/slots.html", "title": "插槽 Slots", "doc_id": "64f824bac8ce4d68be0669bdef0ce696", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1189, "chunk_index": 33, "_doc_id": "33_5124639432426565497"}}
{"doc_id": "34_9099971946167761219", "text": "span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <!-- 隐式的默认插槽 --><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>p<span><span>>A paragraph for the main content.</<span><span>p<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>p<span><span>>And another one.</<span><span>p<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>template<span><span> #<span><span>footer<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/slots.html", "title": "插槽 Slots", "doc_id": "64f824bac8ce4d68be0669bdef0ce696", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1189, "chunk_index": 34, "_doc_id": "34_9099971946167761219"}}
{"doc_id": "35_3800390386362704329", "text": "class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>template<span><span> #<span><span>footer<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>p<span><span>>Here's some contact info</<span><span>p<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> </<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/slots.html", "title": "插槽 Slots", "doc_id": "64f824bac8ce4d68be0669bdef0ce696", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1189, "chunk_index": 35, "_doc_id": "35_3800390386362704329"}}
{"doc_id": "36_4625231570211305035", "text": "<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> </<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>BaseLayout<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>现在 <code><template><code> 元素中的所有内容都将被传递到相应的插槽。最终渲染出的 HTML 如下：<p><div class=\"language-html\"> <span class=\"lang\">html<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>div<span><span> class<span><span>=<span><span>\"container\"<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/slots.html", "title": "插槽 Slots", "doc_id": "64f824bac8ce4d68be0669bdef0ce696", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1189, "chunk_index": 36, "_doc_id": "36_4625231570211305035"}}
{"doc_id": "37_2835503834306729370", "text": "pan><<span><span>div<span><span> class<span><span>=<span><span>\"container\"<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>header<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>h1<span><span>>Here might be a page title</<span><span>h1<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> </<span><span>header<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>main<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/slots.html", "title": "插槽 Slots", "doc_id": "64f824bac8ce4d68be0669bdef0ce696", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1189, "chunk_index": 37, "_doc_id": "37_2835503834306729370"}}
{"doc_id": "38_1421600089181449272", "text": "eader<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>main<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>p<span><span>>A paragraph for the main content.</<span><span>p<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>p<span><span>>And another one.</<span><span>p<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> </<span><span>main<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>footer<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/slots.html", "title": "插槽 Slots", "doc_id": "64f824bac8ce4d68be0669bdef0ce696", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1189, "chunk_index": 38, "_doc_id": "38_1421600089181449272"}}
{"doc_id": "39_3455904084583977695", "text": "ain<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>footer<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>p<span><span>>Here's some contact info</<span><span>p<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> </<span><span>footer<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/slots.html", "title": "插槽 Slots", "doc_id": "64f824bac8ce4d68be0669bdef0ce696", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1189, "chunk_index": 39, "_doc_id": "39_3455904084583977695"}}
{"doc_id": "40_1279466876910602776", "text": ">p<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> </<span><span>footer<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>div<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>使用 JavaScript 函数来类比可能更有助于你来理解具名插槽：<p><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// 传入不同的内容给不同名字的插槽<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>BaseLayout<span><span>({<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/slots.html", "title": "插槽 Slots", "doc_id": "64f824bac8ce4d68be0669bdef0ce696", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1189, "chunk_index": 40, "_doc_id": "40_1279466876910602776"}}
{"doc_id": "41_2712858874297428136", "text": "><span>// 传入不同的内容给不同名字的插槽<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>BaseLayout<span><span>({<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> header: <span><span>`...`<span><span>,<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> default: <span><span>`...`<span><span>,<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> footer: <span><span>`...`<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>})<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// <BaseLayout> 渲染插槽内容到对应位置<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/slots.html", "title": "插槽 Slots", "doc_id": "64f824bac8ce4d68be0669bdef0ce696", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1189, "chunk_index": 41, "_doc_id": "41_2712858874297428136"}}
{"doc_id": "42_2806044476242891823", "text": "n><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// <BaseLayout> 渲染插槽内容到对应位置<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>function<span><span> BaseLayout<span><span>(<span><span>slots<span><span>) {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> return<span><span> `<div class=\"container\"><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <header>${<span><span>slots<span><span>.<span><span>header<span><span>}</header><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/slots.html", "title": "插槽 Slots", "doc_id": "64f824bac8ce4d68be0669bdef0ce696", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1189, "chunk_index": 42, "_doc_id": "42_2806044476242891823"}}
{"doc_id": "43_6591011192919315763", "text": "<span> <header>${<span><span>slots<span><span>.<span><span>header<span><span>}</header><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <main>${<span><span>slots<span><span>.<span><span>default<span><span>}</main><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <footer>${<span><span>slots<span><span>.<span><span>footer<span><span>}</footer><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> </div>`<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/slots.html", "title": "插槽 Slots", "doc_id": "64f824bac8ce4d68be0669bdef0ce696", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1189, "chunk_index": 43, "_doc_id": "43_6591011192919315763"}}
{"doc_id": "44_3766939819233703522", "text": ".<span><span>footer<span><span>}</footer><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> </div>`<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span><code><pre><div><h2 id=\"conditional-slots\">条件插槽 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#conditional-slots\">​<a><h2><p>有时你需要根据内容是否被传入了插槽来渲染某些内容。<p><p>你可以结合使用 <a href=\"/api/component-instance.html#slots\">$slots<a> 属性与 <a href=\"/guide/essentials/conditional.html#v-if\">v-if<a> 来实现。<p><p>在下面的示例中，我们定义了一个卡片组件，它拥有三个条件插槽：<code>header<code>、<code>footer<code> 和 <code>default<code>。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/slots.html", "title": "插槽 Slots", "doc_id": "64f824bac8ce4d68be0669bdef0ce696", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1189, "chunk_index": 44, "_doc_id": "44_3766939819233703522"}}
{"doc_id": "45_6608695541065287063", "text": "来实现。<p><p>在下面的示例中，我们定义了一个卡片组件，它拥有三个条件插槽：<code>header<code>、<code>footer<code> 和 <code>default<code>。 当 header、footer 或 default 的内容存在时，我们希望包装它以提供额外的样式：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>div<span><span> class<span><span>=<span><span>\"card\"<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/slots.html", "title": "插槽 Slots", "doc_id": "64f824bac8ce4d68be0669bdef0ce696", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1189, "chunk_index": 45, "_doc_id": "45_6608695541065287063"}}
{"doc_id": "46_4589272685073683235", "text": "\"><span> <<span><span>div<span><span> class<span><span>=<span><span>\"card\"<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>div<span><span> v-if<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>$slots.header<span><span>\"<span><span> class<span><span>=<span><span>\"card-header\"<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>slot<span><span> name<span><span>=<span><span>\"header\"<span><span> /><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> </<span><span>div<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/slots.html", "title": "插槽 Slots", "doc_id": "64f824bac8ce4d68be0669bdef0ce696", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1189, "chunk_index": 46, "_doc_id": "46_4589272685073683235"}}
{"doc_id": "47_2894293287210363795", "text": "er\"<span><span> /><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> </<span><span>div<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>div<span><span> v-if<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>$slots.default<span><span>\"<span><span> class<span><span>=<span><span>\"card-content\"<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>slot<span><span> /><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> </<span><span>div<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/slots.html", "title": "插槽 Slots", "doc_id": "64f824bac8ce4d68be0669bdef0ce696", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1189, "chunk_index": 47, "_doc_id": "47_2894293287210363795"}}
{"doc_id": "48_3086395988139286957", "text": "lot<span><span> /><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> </<span><span>div<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>div<span><span> v-if<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>$slots.footer<span><span>\"<span><span> class<span><span>=<span><span>\"card-footer\"<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>slot<span><span> name<span><span>=<span><span>\"footer\"<span><span> /><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/slots.html", "title": "插槽 Slots", "doc_id": "64f824bac8ce4d68be0669bdef0ce696", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1189, "chunk_index": 48, "_doc_id": "48_3086395988139286957"}}
{"doc_id": "49_6770078743520446811", "text": "pan> <<span><span>slot<span><span> name<span><span>=<span><span>\"footer\"<span><span> /><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> </<span><span>div<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> </<span><span>div<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p><a href=\"https://play.vuejs.org/#eNqVVMtu2zAQ/BWCLZBLIjVoTq4aoA1yaA9t0eaoCy2tJcYUSZCUKyPwv2dJioplOw4C+EDuzM4+ONYT/aZ1tumBLmhhK8O1IxZcr29LyTutjCN3zNRkZVRHLrLcXzz9opRFHvnIxIuDTgvmAG+EFJ", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/slots.html", "title": "插槽 Slots", "doc_id": "64f824bac8ce4d68be0669bdef0ce696", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1189, "chunk_index": 49, "_doc_id": "49_6770078743520446811"}}
{"doc_id": "50_6807311819869698840", "text": "", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/slots.html", "title": "插槽 Slots", "doc_id": "64f824bac8ce4d68be0669bdef0ce696", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1189, "chunk_index": 50, "_doc_id": "50_6807311819869698840"}}
{"doc_id": "51_3442277221299267711", "text": "qBj1YoZ7NosJLOEq5S9OXtPZtI1gFSppx8engUHs+vVhq9eVhq9ORRrXdpRyseSqfo6SmmnONK6XTw9yis24q448wXSG+0VAb3sSDXeiBoDV6TpWDV+ktENatrdMGCfAoBfL1JYNzzpINJjVFoJ9yKUKho19ul6OFQ6UYPx1rjIpPYeXIc/vXCgjetawzbni0dPnhhJ3T3DMVSruI=\" target=\"_blank\">在演练场中尝试一下<a><p><h2 id=\"dynamic-slot-names\">动态插槽名 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#dynamic-slot-names\">​<a><h2><p><a href=\"/guide/essentials/template-syntax.html#dynamic-arguments\">动态指令参数<a>在 <code>v-slot<code> 上也是有效的，", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/slots.html", "title": "插槽 Slots", "doc_id": "64f824bac8ce4d68be0669bdef0ce696", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1189, "chunk_index": 51, "_doc_id": "51_3442277221299267711"}}
{"doc_id": "52_8497716788437471883", "text": "ref=\"/guide/essentials/template-syntax.html#dynamic-arguments\">动态指令参数<a>在 <code>v-slot<code> 上也是有效的，即可以定义下面这样的动态插槽名：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>base-layout<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>template<span><span> v-slot:<span><span>[<span><span>dynamicSlotName<span><span>]><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> ...<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/slots.html", "title": "插槽 Slots", "doc_id": "64f824bac8ce4d68be0669bdef0ce696", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1189, "chunk_index": 52, "_doc_id": "52_8497716788437471883"}}
{"doc_id": "53_2109635592528369860", "text": "an>[<span><span>dynamicSlotName<span><span>]><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> ...<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> </<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <!-- 缩写为 --><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>template<span><span> #[<span><span>dynamicSlotName<span><span>]><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> ...<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> </<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/slots.html", "title": "插槽 Slots", "doc_id": "64f824bac8ce4d68be0669bdef0ce696", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1189, "chunk_index": 53, "_doc_id": "53_2109635592528369860"}}
{"doc_id": "54_2928924391463601391", "text": "e\"><span> ...<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> </<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>base-layout<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>注意这里的表达式和动态指令参数受相同的<a href=\"/guide/essentials/template-syntax.html#dynamic-argument-syntax-constraints\">语法限制<a>。<p><h2 id=\"scoped-slots\">作用域插槽 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#scoped-slots\">​<a><h2><p>在上面的<a href=\"#render-scope\">渲染作用域<a>中我们讨论到，插槽的内容无法访问到子组件的状态。<p><p>然而在某些场景下插槽的内容可能想要同时使用父组件域内和子组件域内的数据。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/slots.html", "title": "插槽 Slots", "doc_id": "64f824bac8ce4d68be0669bdef0ce696", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1189, "chunk_index": 54, "_doc_id": "54_2928924391463601391"}}
{"doc_id": "55_1292979515305606038", "text": "面的<a href=\"#render-scope\">渲染作用域<a>中我们讨论到，插槽的内容无法访问到子组件的状态。<p><p>然而在某些场景下插槽的内容可能想要同时使用父组件域内和子组件域内的数据。要做到这一点，我们需要一种方法来让子组件在渲染时将一部分数据提供给插槽。<p><p>我们也确实有办法这么做！可以像对组件传递 props 那样，向一个插槽的出口上传递 attributes：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><!-- <MyComponent> 的模板 --><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>div<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/slots.html", "title": "插槽 Slots", "doc_id": "64f824bac8ce4d68be0669bdef0ce696", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1189, "chunk_index": 55, "_doc_id": "55_1292979515305606038"}}
{"doc_id": "56_2924770071152049663", "text": "MyComponent> 的模板 --><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>div<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>slot<span><span> :<span><span>text<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>greetingMessage<span><span>\"<span><span> :<span><span>count<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>1<span><span>\"<span><span>></<span><span>slot<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/slots.html", "title": "插槽 Slots", "doc_id": "64f824bac8ce4d68be0669bdef0ce696", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1189, "chunk_index": 56, "_doc_id": "56_2924770071152049663"}}
{"doc_id": "57_4566623013946335809", "text": "an>=<span><span>\"<span><span>1<span><span>\"<span><span>></<span><span>slot<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>div<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>当需要接收插槽 props 时，默认插槽和具名插槽的使用方式有一些小区别。下面我们将先展示默认插槽如何接受 props，通过子组件标签上的 <code>v-slot<code> 指令，直接接收到了一个插槽 props 对象：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>MyComponent<span><span> v-slot<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>slotProps<span><span>\"<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/slots.html", "title": "插槽 Slots", "doc_id": "64f824bac8ce4d68be0669bdef0ce696", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1189, "chunk_index": 57, "_doc_id": "57_4566623013946335809"}}
{"doc_id": "58_8951018244585701018", "text": "><span> v-slot<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>slotProps<span><span>\"<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> {{ slotProps.text }} {{ slotProps.count }}<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/slots.html", "title": "插槽 Slots", "doc_id": "64f824bac8ce4d68be0669bdef0ce696", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1189, "chunk_index": 58, "_doc_id": "58_8951018244585701018"}}
{"doc_id": "59_5430573477658447810", "text": "span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> {{ slotProps.text }} {{ slotProps.count }}<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>MyComponent<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p> <p><p>子组件传入插槽的 props 作为了 <code>v-slot<code> 指令的值，可以在插槽内的表达式中访问。<p><p>你可以将作用域插槽类比为一个传入子组件的函数。子组件会将相应的 props 作为参数传给它：<p><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>MyComponent<span><span>({<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/slots.html", "title": "插槽 Slots", "doc_id": "64f824bac8ce4d68be0669bdef0ce696", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1189, "chunk_index": 59, "_doc_id": "59_5430573477658447810"}}
{"doc_id": "60_3273410103538245350", "text": "ss=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>MyComponent<span><span>({<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 类比默认插槽，将其想成一个函数<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> default<span><span>: (<span><span>slotProps<span><span>) <span><span>=><span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> return<span><span> `${<span><span>slotProps<span><span>.<span><span>text<span><span>} ${<span><span>slotProps<span><span>.<span><span>count<span><span>}`<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/slots.html", "title": "插槽 Slots", "doc_id": "64f824bac8ce4d68be0669bdef0ce696", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1189, "chunk_index": 60, "_doc_id": "60_3273410103538245350"}}
{"doc_id": "61_8000041002890462014", "text": "n>text<span><span>} ${<span><span>slotProps<span><span>.<span><span>count<span><span>}`<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>})<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>function<span><span> MyComponent<span><span>(<span><span>slots<span><span>) {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> const<span><span> greetingMessage<span><span> =<span><span> 'hello'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> return<span><span> `<div>${<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/slots.html", "title": "插槽 Slots", "doc_id": "64f824bac8ce4d68be0669bdef0ce696", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1189, "chunk_index": 61, "_doc_id": "61_8000041002890462014"}}
{"doc_id": "62_8118136902086794935", "text": "=<span><span> 'hello'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> return<span><span> `<div>${<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 在插槽函数调用时传入 props<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> slots<span><span>.<span><span>default<span><span>({ text: <span><span>greetingMessage<span><span>, count: <span><span>1<span><span> })<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }</div>`<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/slots.html", "title": "插槽 Slots", "doc_id": "64f824bac8ce4d68be0669bdef0ce696", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1189, "chunk_index": 62, "_doc_id": "62_8118136902086794935"}}
{"doc_id": "63_7511632171638303715", "text": "an>, count: <span><span>1<span><span> })<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }</div>`<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span><code><pre><div><p>实际上，这已经和作用域插槽的最终代码编译结果、以及手动编写<a href=\"/guide/extras/render-function.html\">渲染函数<a>时使用作用域插槽的方式非常类似了。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/slots.html", "title": "插槽 Slots", "doc_id": "64f824bac8ce4d68be0669bdef0ce696", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1189, "chunk_index": 63, "_doc_id": "63_7511632171638303715"}}
{"doc_id": "64_9097771443262379112", "text": "p>实际上，这已经和作用域插槽的最终代码编译结果、以及手动编写<a href=\"/guide/extras/render-function.html\">渲染函数<a>时使用作用域插槽的方式非常类似了。<p><p><code>v-slot=\"slotProps\"<code> 可以类比这里的函数签名，和函数的参数类似，我们也可以在 <code>v-slot<code> 中使用解构：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>MyComponent<span><span> v-slot<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>{ text, count }<span><span>\"<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/slots.html", "title": "插槽 Slots", "doc_id": "64f824bac8ce4d68be0669bdef0ce696", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1189, "chunk_index": 64, "_doc_id": "64_9097771443262379112"}}
{"doc_id": "65_1183018282829355120", "text": "> v-slot<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>{ text, count }<span><span>\"<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> {{ text }} {{ count }}<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/slots.html", "title": "插槽 Slots", "doc_id": "64f824bac8ce4d68be0669bdef0ce696", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1189, "chunk_index": 65, "_doc_id": "65_1183018282829355120"}}
{"doc_id": "66_7316452978105213620", "text": "<span><span>\"<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> {{ text }} {{ count }}<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>MyComponent<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><h3 id=\"named-scoped-slots\">具名作用域插槽 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#named-scoped-slots\">​<a><h3><p>具名作用域插槽的工作方式也是类似的，插槽 props 可以作为 <code>v-slot<code> 指令的值被访问到：<code>v-slot:name=\"slotProps\"<code>。当使用缩写时是这样：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>MyComponent<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/slots.html", "title": "插槽 Slots", "doc_id": "64f824bac8ce4d68be0669bdef0ce696", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1189, "chunk_index": 66, "_doc_id": "66_7316452978105213620"}}
{"doc_id": "67_8192390734901011593", "text": "thub-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>MyComponent<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>template<span><span> #<span><span>header<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>headerProps<span><span>\"<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> {{ headerProps }}<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> </<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/slots.html", "title": "插槽 Slots", "doc_id": "64f824bac8ce4d68be0669bdef0ce696", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1189, "chunk_index": 67, "_doc_id": "67_8192390734901011593"}}
{"doc_id": "68_7350275995834116325", "text": "<span class=\"line\"><span> </<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>template<span><span> #<span><span>default<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>defaultProps<span><span>\"<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> {{ defaultProps }}<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> </<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/slots.html", "title": "插槽 Slots", "doc_id": "64f824bac8ce4d68be0669bdef0ce696", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1189, "chunk_index": 68, "_doc_id": "68_7350275995834116325"}}
{"doc_id": "69_665753166145881720", "text": "<span class=\"line\"><span> </<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>template<span><span> #<span><span>footer<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>footerProps<span><span>\"<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> {{ footerProps }}<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> </<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/slots.html", "title": "插槽 Slots", "doc_id": "64f824bac8ce4d68be0669bdef0ce696", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1189, "chunk_index": 69, "_doc_id": "69_665753166145881720"}}
{"doc_id": "70_904290198063612116", "text": "ooterProps }}<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> </<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>MyComponent<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>向具名插槽中传入 props：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>slot<span><span> name<span><span>=<span><span>\"header\"<span><span> message<span><span>=<span><span>\"hello\"<span><span>></<span><span>slot<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>注意插槽上的 <code>name<code> 是一个 Vue 特别保留的 attribute，不会作为 props 传递给插槽。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/slots.html", "title": "插槽 Slots", "doc_id": "64f824bac8ce4d68be0669bdef0ce696", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1189, "chunk_index": 70, "_doc_id": "70_904290198063612116"}}
{"doc_id": "71_1137421186178600342", "text": "an>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>注意插槽上的 <code>name<code> 是一个 Vue 特别保留的 attribute，不会作为 props 传递给插槽。因此最终 <code>headerProps<code> 的结果是 <code>{ message: 'hello' }<code>。<p><p>如果你同时使用了具名插槽与默认插槽，则需要为默认插槽使用显式的 <code><template><code> 标签。尝试直接为组件添加 <code>v-slot<code> 指令将导致编译错误。这是为了避免因默认插槽的 props 的作用域而困惑。举例：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><!-- <MyComponent> template --><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/slots.html", "title": "插槽 Slots", "doc_id": "64f824bac8ce4d68be0669bdef0ce696", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1189, "chunk_index": 71, "_doc_id": "71_1137421186178600342"}}
{"doc_id": "72_7967322839349837051", "text": "iki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><!-- <MyComponent> template --><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>div<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>slot<span><span> :<span><span>message<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>hello<span><span>\"<span><span>></<span><span>slot<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>slot<span><span> name<span><span>=<span><span>\"footer\"<span><span> /><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/slots.html", "title": "插槽 Slots", "doc_id": "64f824bac8ce4d68be0669bdef0ce696", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1189, "chunk_index": 72, "_doc_id": "72_7967322839349837051"}}
{"doc_id": "73_8950610865472731735", "text": "pan> <<span><span>slot<span><span> name<span><span>=<span><span>\"footer\"<span><span> /><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>div<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><!-- 该模板无法编译 --><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>MyComponent<span><span> v-slot<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>{ message }<span><span>\"<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/slots.html", "title": "插槽 Slots", "doc_id": "64f824bac8ce4d68be0669bdef0ce696", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1189, "chunk_index": 73, "_doc_id": "73_8950610865472731735"}}
{"doc_id": "74_2136765512494850389", "text": "span> v-slot<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>{ message }<span><span>\"<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>p<span><span>>{{ message }}</<span><span>p<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>template<span><span> #<span><span>footer<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <!-- message 属于默认插槽，此处不可用 --><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>p<span><span>>{{ message }}</<span><span>p<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/slots.html", "title": "插槽 Slots", "doc_id": "64f824bac8ce4d68be0669bdef0ce696", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1189, "chunk_index": 74, "_doc_id": "74_2136765512494850389"}}
{"doc_id": "75_3232539912238555147", "text": "lass=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>p<span><span>>{{ message }}</<span><span>p<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> </<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/slots.html", "title": "插槽 Slots", "doc_id": "64f824bac8ce4d68be0669bdef0ce696", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1189, "chunk_index": 75, "_doc_id": "75_3232539912238555147"}}
{"doc_id": "76_1352900998794500819", "text": "<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> </<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>MyComponent<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>为默认插槽使用显式的 <code><template><code> 标签有助于更清晰地指出 <code>message<code> 属性在其他插槽中不可用：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>MyComponent<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/slots.html", "title": "插槽 Slots", "doc_id": "64f824bac8ce4d68be0669bdef0ce696", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1189, "chunk_index": 76, "_doc_id": "76_1352900998794500819"}}
{"doc_id": "77_3226184358338039712", "text": "thub-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>MyComponent<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <!-- 使用显式的默认插槽 --><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>template<span><span> #<span><span>default<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>{ message }<span><span>\"<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>p<span><span>>{{ message }}</<span><span>p<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> </<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/slots.html", "title": "插槽 Slots", "doc_id": "64f824bac8ce4d68be0669bdef0ce696", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1189, "chunk_index": 77, "_doc_id": "77_3226184358338039712"}}
{"doc_id": "78_796234962905809230", "text": "<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> </<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>template<span><span> #<span><span>footer<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>p<span><span>>Here's some contact info</<span><span>p<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> </<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/slots.html", "title": "插槽 Slots", "doc_id": "64f824bac8ce4d68be0669bdef0ce696", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1189, "chunk_index": 78, "_doc_id": "78_796234962905809230"}}
{"doc_id": "79_5435478734730536287", "text": "<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> </<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>MyComponent<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><h3 id=\"fancy-list-example\">高级列表组件示例 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#fancy-list-example\">​<a><h3><p>你可能想问什么样的场景才适合用到作用域插槽，这里我们来看一个 <code><FancyList><code> 组件的例子。它会渲染一个列表，并同时会封装一些加载远端数据的逻辑、使用数据进行列表渲染、或者是像分页或无限滚动这样更进阶的功能。然而我们希望它能够保留足够的灵活性，将对单个列表元素内容和样式的控制权留给使用它的父组件。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/slots.html", "title": "插槽 Slots", "doc_id": "64f824bac8ce4d68be0669bdef0ce696", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1189, "chunk_index": 79, "_doc_id": "79_5435478734730536287"}}
{"doc_id": "80_7108243676027170247", "text": "染一个列表，并同时会封装一些加载远端数据的逻辑、使用数据进行列表渲染、或者是像分页或无限滚动这样更进阶的功能。然而我们希望它能够保留足够的灵活性，将对单个列表元素内容和样式的控制权留给使用它的父组件。我们期望的用法可能是这样的：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>FancyList<span><span> :<span><span>api-url<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>url<span><span>\"<span><span> :<span><span>per-page<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>10<span><span>\"<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/slots.html", "title": "插槽 Slots", "doc_id": "64f824bac8ce4d68be0669bdef0ce696", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1189, "chunk_index": 80, "_doc_id": "80_7108243676027170247"}}
{"doc_id": "81_4330204458476711598", "text": ":<span><span>per-page<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>10<span><span>\"<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>template<span><span> #<span><span>item<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>{ body, username, likes }<span><span>\"<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>div<span><span> class<span><span>=<span><span>\"item\"<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>p<span><span>>{{ body }}</<span><span>p<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/slots.html", "title": "插槽 Slots", "doc_id": "64f824bac8ce4d68be0669bdef0ce696", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1189, "chunk_index": 81, "_doc_id": "81_4330204458476711598"}}
{"doc_id": "82_7471379873277379801", "text": "n class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>p<span><span>>{{ body }}</<span><span>p<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>p<span><span>>by {{ username }} | {{ likes }} likes</<span><span>p<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> </<span><span>div<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> </<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/slots.html", "title": "插槽 Slots", "doc_id": "64f824bac8ce4d68be0669bdef0ce696", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1189, "chunk_index": 82, "_doc_id": "82_7471379873277379801"}}
{"doc_id": "83_4884055315744255187", "text": "<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> </<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>FancyList<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>在 <code><FancyList><code> 之中，我们可以多次渲染 <code><slot><code> 并每次都提供不同的数据 (注意我们这里使用了 <code>v-bind<code> 来传递插槽的 props)：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>ul<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/slots.html", "title": "插槽 Slots", "doc_id": "64f824bac8ce4d68be0669bdef0ce696", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1189, "chunk_index": 83, "_doc_id": "83_4884055315744255187"}}
{"doc_id": "84_6507230389206157939", "text": "\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>ul<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>li<span><span> v-for<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>item <span><span>in<span><span> items<span><span>\"<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>slot<span><span> name<span><span>=<span><span>\"item\"<span><span> v-bind<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>item<span><span>\"<span><span>></<span><span>slot<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/slots.html", "title": "插槽 Slots", "doc_id": "64f824bac8ce4d68be0669bdef0ce696", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1189, "chunk_index": 84, "_doc_id": "84_6507230389206157939"}}
{"doc_id": "85_4120351225051841746", "text": "=<span><span>\"<span><span>item<span><span>\"<span><span>></<span><span>slot<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> </<span><span>li<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>ul<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><h3 id=\"renderless-components\">无渲染组件 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#renderless-components\">​<a><h3><p>上面的 <code><FancyList><code> 案例同时封装了可重用的逻辑 (数据获取、分页等) 和视图输出，但也将部分视图输出通过作用域插槽交给了消费者组件来管理。<p><p>如果我们将这个概念拓展一下，可以想象的是，一些组件可能只包括了逻辑而不需要自己渲染内容，视图输出通过作用域插槽全权交给了消费者组件。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/slots.html", "title": "插槽 Slots", "doc_id": "64f824bac8ce4d68be0669bdef0ce696", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1189, "chunk_index": 85, "_doc_id": "85_4120351225051841746"}}
{"doc_id": "86_8165841364465939907", "text": "但也将部分视图输出通过作用域插槽交给了消费者组件来管理。<p><p>如果我们将这个概念拓展一下，可以想象的是，一些组件可能只包括了逻辑而不需要自己渲染内容，视图输出通过作用域插槽全权交给了消费者组件。我们将这种类型的组件称为<strong>无渲染组件<strong>。<p><p>这里有一个无渲染组件的例子，一个封装了追踪当前鼠标位置逻辑的组件：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>MouseTracker<span><span> v-slot<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>{ x, y }<span><span>\"<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> Mouse is at: {{ x }}, {{ y }}<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/slots.html", "title": "插槽 Slots", "doc_id": "64f824bac8ce4d68be0669bdef0ce696", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1189, "chunk_index": 86, "_doc_id": "86_8165841364465939907"}}
{"doc_id": "87_9165839515917101886", "text": "span>\"<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> Mouse is at: {{ x }}, {{ y }}<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>MouseTracker<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>虽然这个模式很有趣，但大部分能用无渲染组件实现的功能都可以通过组合式 API 以另一种更高效的方式实现，并且还不会带来额外组件嵌套的开销。之后我们会在<a href=\"/guide/reusability/composables.html\">组合式函数<a>一章中介绍如何更高效地实现追踪鼠标位置的功能。<p><p>尽管如此，作用域插槽在需要<strong>同时<strong>封装逻辑、组合视图界面时还是很有用，就像上面的 <code><FancyList><code> 组件那样。<p><div><div>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/slots.html", "title": "插槽 Slots", "doc_id": "64f824bac8ce4d68be0669bdef0ce696", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1189, "chunk_index": 87, "_doc_id": "87_9165839515917101886"}}
{"doc_id": "0_4556440867082369321", "text": "<div><div><h1 id=\"provide-inject\">依赖注入 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#provide-inject\">​<a><h1><blockquote><p>此章节假设你已经看过了<a href=\"/guide/essentials/component-basics.html\">组件基础<a>。若你还不了解组件是什么，请先阅读该章节。<p><blockquote><h2 id=\"prop-drilling\">Prop 逐级透传问题 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#prop-drilling\">​<a><h2><p>通常情况下，当我们需要从父组件向子组件传递数据时，会使用 <a href=\"/guide/components/props.html\">props<a>。想象一下这样的结构：有一些多层级嵌套的组件，形成了一棵巨大的组件树，而某个深层的子组件需要一个较远的祖先组件中的部分数据。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/provide-inject.html", "title": "依赖注入", "doc_id": "31f1836188394eaaae514792907333ce", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1007, "chunk_index": 0, "_doc_id": "0_4556440867082369321"}}
{"doc_id": "1_6607825997689216660", "text": "/guide/components/props.html\">props<a>。想象一下这样的结构：有一些多层级嵌套的组件，形成了一棵巨大的组件树，而某个深层的子组件需要一个较远的祖先组件中的部分数据。在这种情况下，如果仅使用 props 则必须将其沿着组件链逐级传递下去，这会非常麻烦：<p><p> <p><p>注意，虽然这里的 <code><Footer><code> 组件可能根本不关心这些 props，但为了使 <code><DeepChild><code> 能访问到它们，仍然需要定义并向下传递。如果组件链路非常长，可能会影响到更多这条路上的组件。这一问题被称为“prop 逐级透传”，显然是我们希望尽量避免的情况。<p><p><code>provide<code> 和 <code>inject<code> 可以帮助我们解决这一问题 <a href=\"#footnote-1\">[1]<a> 。一个父组件相对于其所有的后代组件，会作为<strong>依赖提供者<strong>。任何后代的组件树，无论层级有多深，都可以<strong>注入<strong>由父组件提供给整条链路的依赖。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/provide-inject.html", "title": "依赖注入", "doc_id": "31f1836188394eaaae514792907333ce", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1007, "chunk_index": 1, "_doc_id": "1_6607825997689216660"}}
{"doc_id": "2_9115300076605782602", "text": "<a> 。一个父组件相对于其所有的后代组件，会作为<strong>依赖提供者<strong>。任何后代的组件树，无论层级有多深，都可以<strong>注入<strong>由父组件提供给整条链路的依赖。<p><p> <p><h2 id=\"provide\">Provide (提供) <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#provide\">​<a><h2><div class=\"composition-api\"><p>要为组件后代提供数据，需要使用到 <a href=\"/api/composition-api-dependency-injection.html#provide\"><code>provide()<code><a> 函数：<p><div class=\"language-vue\"> <span class=\"lang\">vue<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>script<span><span> setup<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/provide-inject.html", "title": "依赖注入", "doc_id": "31f1836188394eaaae514792907333ce", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1007, "chunk_index": 2, "_doc_id": "2_9115300076605782602"}}
{"doc_id": "3_1321032296179199588", "text": "code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>script<span><span> setup<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>import<span><span> { provide } <span><span>from<span><span> 'vue'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>provide<span><span>(<span><span>/* 注入名 */<span><span> 'message'<span><span>, <span><span>/* 值 */<span><span> 'hello!'<span><span>)<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/provide-inject.html", "title": "依赖注入", "doc_id": "31f1836188394eaaae514792907333ce", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1007, "chunk_index": 3, "_doc_id": "3_1321032296179199588"}}
{"doc_id": "4_1311347232032437842", "text": "pan><span> 'message'<span><span>, <span><span>/* 值 */<span><span> 'hello!'<span><span>)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>script<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>如果不使用 <code><script setup><code>，请确保 <code>provide()<code> 是在 <code>setup()<code> 同步调用的：<p><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>import<span><span> { provide } <span><span>from<span><span> 'vue'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/provide-inject.html", "title": "依赖注入", "doc_id": "31f1836188394eaaae514792907333ce", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1007, "chunk_index": 4, "_doc_id": "4_1311347232032437842"}}
{"doc_id": "5_3978944963857970627", "text": "rt<span><span> { provide } <span><span>from<span><span> 'vue'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> setup<span><span>() {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> provide<span><span>(<span><span>/* 注入名 */<span><span> 'message'<span><span>, <span><span>/* 值 */<span><span> 'hello!'<span><span>)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/provide-inject.html", "title": "依赖注入", "doc_id": "31f1836188394eaaae514792907333ce", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1007, "chunk_index": 5, "_doc_id": "5_3978944963857970627"}}
{"doc_id": "6_9073210691122351295", "text": "<span>/* 值 */<span><span> 'hello!'<span><span>)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span><code><pre><div><p><code>provide()<code> 函数接收两个参数。第一个参数被称为<strong>注入名<strong>，可以是一个字符串或是一个 <code>Symbol<code>。后代组件会用注入名来查找期望注入的值。一个组件可以多次调用 <code>provide()<code>，使用不同的注入名，注入不同的依赖值。<p><p>第二个参数是提供的值，值可以是任意类型，包括响应式的状态，比如一个 ref：<p><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>import<span><span> { ref, provide } <span><span>from<span><span> 'vue'<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/provide-inject.html", "title": "依赖注入", "doc_id": "31f1836188394eaaae514792907333ce", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1007, "chunk_index": 6, "_doc_id": "6_9073210691122351295"}}
{"doc_id": "7_4049564577826970634", "text": "ass=\"line\"><span>import<span><span> { ref, provide } <span><span>from<span><span> 'vue'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> count<span><span> =<span><span> ref<span><span>(<span><span>0<span><span>)<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/provide-inject.html", "title": "依赖注入", "doc_id": "31f1836188394eaaae514792907333ce", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1007, "chunk_index": 7, "_doc_id": "7_4049564577826970634"}}
{"doc_id": "8_8568520239705013621", "text": "<span><span> count<span><span> =<span><span> ref<span><span>(<span><span>0<span><span>)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>provide<span><span>(<span><span>'key'<span><span>, count)<span><span><code><pre><div><p>提供的响应式状态使后代组件可以由此和提供者建立响应式的联系。<p><div><div class=\"options-api\"><p>要为组件后代提供数据，需要使用到 <a href=\"/api/options-composition.html#provide\"><code>provide<code><a> 选项：<p><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/provide-inject.html", "title": "依赖注入", "doc_id": "31f1836188394eaaae514792907333ce", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1007, "chunk_index": 8, "_doc_id": "8_8568520239705013621"}}
{"doc_id": "9_2470242073759825200", "text": "b-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> provide: {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> message: <span><span>'hello!'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/provide-inject.html", "title": "依赖注入", "doc_id": "31f1836188394eaaae514792907333ce", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1007, "chunk_index": 9, "_doc_id": "9_2470242073759825200"}}
{"doc_id": "10_2871719382001142887", "text": "ass=\"line\"><span> message: <span><span>'hello!'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span><code><pre><div><p>对于 <code>provide<code> 对象上的每一个属性，后代组件会用其 key 为注入名查找期望注入的值，属性的值就是要提供的数据。<p><p>如果我们需要提供依赖当前组件实例的状态 (比如那些由 <code>data()<code> 定义的数据属性)，那么可以以函数形式使用 <code>provide<code>：<p><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/provide-inject.html", "title": "依赖注入", "doc_id": "31f1836188394eaaae514792907333ce", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1007, "chunk_index": 10, "_doc_id": "10_2871719382001142887"}}
{"doc_id": "11_3724530633310163747", "text": "b-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> data<span><span>() {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> return<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> message: <span><span>'hello!'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> },<span><span>\n<span class=\"line highlighted\"><span> provide<span><span>() {<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/provide-inject.html", "title": "依赖注入", "doc_id": "31f1836188394eaaae514792907333ce", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1007, "chunk_index": 11, "_doc_id": "11_3724530633310163747"}}
{"doc_id": "12_8709405706441977564", "text": "ne\"><span> },<span><span>\n<span class=\"line highlighted\"><span> provide<span><span>() {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line highlighted\"><span> // 使用函数的形式，可以访问到 `this`<span><span>\n<span class=\"line highlighted\"><span> return<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line highlighted\"><span> message: <span><span>this<span><span>.message<span><span>\n<span class=\"line highlighted\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line highlighted\"><span> }<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/provide-inject.html", "title": "依赖注入", "doc_id": "31f1836188394eaaae514792907333ce", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1007, "chunk_index": 12, "_doc_id": "12_8709405706441977564"}}
{"doc_id": "13_3214472782456866241", "text": "n class=\"line highlighted\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line highlighted\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span><code><pre><div><p>然而，请注意这<strong>不会<strong>使注入保持响应性。我们会在后续小节中讨论如何<a href=\"#working-with-reactivity\">让注入转变为响应式<a>。<p><div><h2 id=\"app-level-provide\">应用层 Provide <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#app-level-provide\">​<a><h2><p>除了在一个组件中提供依赖，我们还可以在整个应用层面提供依赖：<p><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>import<span><span> { createApp } <span><span>from<span><span> 'vue'<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/provide-inject.html", "title": "依赖注入", "doc_id": "31f1836188394eaaae514792907333ce", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1007, "chunk_index": 13, "_doc_id": "13_3214472782456866241"}}
{"doc_id": "14_5262679173132022058", "text": "class=\"line\"><span>import<span><span> { createApp } <span><span>from<span><span> 'vue'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> app<span><span> =<span><span> createApp<span><span>({})<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>app.<span><span>provide<span><span>(<span><span>/* 注入名 */<span><span> 'message'<span><span>, <span><span>/* 值 */<span><span> 'hello!'<span><span>)<span><span><code><pre><div><p>在应用级别提供的数据在该应用内的所有组件中都可以注入。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/provide-inject.html", "title": "依赖注入", "doc_id": "31f1836188394eaaae514792907333ce", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1007, "chunk_index": 14, "_doc_id": "14_5262679173132022058"}}
{"doc_id": "15_5097924213559876301", "text": ">/* 值 */<span><span> 'hello!'<span><span>)<span><span><code><pre><div><p>在应用级别提供的数据在该应用内的所有组件中都可以注入。这在你编写<a href=\"/guide/reusability/plugins.html\">插件<a>时会特别有用，因为插件一般都不会使用组件形式来提供值。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/provide-inject.html", "title": "依赖注入", "doc_id": "31f1836188394eaaae514792907333ce", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1007, "chunk_index": 15, "_doc_id": "15_5097924213559876301"}}
{"doc_id": "16_5430421675657726960", "text": "供的数据在该应用内的所有组件中都可以注入。这在你编写<a href=\"/guide/reusability/plugins.html\">插件<a>时会特别有用，因为插件一般都不会使用组件形式来提供值。<p><h2 id=\"inject\">Inject (注入) <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#inject\">​<a><h2><div class=\"composition-api\"><p>要注入上层组件提供的数据，需使用 <a href=\"/api/composition-api-dependency-injection.html#inject\"><code>inject()<code><a> 函数：<p><div class=\"language-vue\"> <span class=\"lang\">vue<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>script<span><span> setup<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/provide-inject.html", "title": "依赖注入", "doc_id": "31f1836188394eaaae514792907333ce", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1007, "chunk_index": 16, "_doc_id": "16_5430421675657726960"}}
{"doc_id": "17_3771487207527315157", "text": "code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>script<span><span> setup<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>import<span><span> { inject } <span><span>from<span><span> 'vue'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> message<span><span> =<span><span> inject<span><span>(<span><span>'message'<span><span>)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>script<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>如果有多个父组件提供了相同键的数据，注入将解析为组件链上最近的父组件所注入的值。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/provide-inject.html", "title": "依赖注入", "doc_id": "31f1836188394eaaae514792907333ce", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1007, "chunk_index": 17, "_doc_id": "17_3771487207527315157"}}
{"doc_id": "18_1396250050635964792", "text": "pan><span>script<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>如果有多个父组件提供了相同键的数据，注入将解析为组件链上最近的父组件所注入的值。<p><p>如果提供的值是一个 ref，注入进来的会是该 ref 对象，而<strong>不会<strong>自动解包为其内部的值。这使得注入方组件能够通过 ref 对象保持了和供给方的响应性链接。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/provide-inject.html", "title": "依赖注入", "doc_id": "31f1836188394eaaae514792907333ce", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1007, "chunk_index": 18, "_doc_id": "18_1396250050635964792"}}
{"doc_id": "19_8412704328910413941", "text": "。<p><p>如果提供的值是一个 ref，注入进来的会是该 ref 对象，而<strong>不会<strong>自动解包为其内部的值。这使得注入方组件能够通过 ref 对象保持了和供给方的响应性链接。<p><p><a href=\"https://play.vuejs.org/#\" target=\"_blank\">带有响应性的 provide + inject 完整示例<a><p><p>同样的，", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/provide-inject.html", "title": "依赖注入", "doc_id": "31f1836188394eaaae514792907333ce", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1007, "chunk_index": 19, "_doc_id": "19_8412704328910413941"}}
{"doc_id": "20_3974292990184950658", "text": "PLECXa9NKdD/a6QTTtGnP88LgiXJtYv4BaLHhvg==\" target=\"_blank\">带有响应性的 provide + inject 完整示例<a><p><p>同样的，如果没有使用 <code><script setup><code>，<code>inject()<code> 需要在 <code>setup()<code> 内同步调用：<p><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>import<span><span> { inject } <span><span>from<span><span> 'vue'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/provide-inject.html", "title": "依赖注入", "doc_id": "31f1836188394eaaae514792907333ce", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1007, "chunk_index": 20, "_doc_id": "20_3974292990184950658"}}
{"doc_id": "21_732629801381522126", "text": "n class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> setup<span><span>() {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> const<span><span> message<span><span> =<span><span> inject<span><span>(<span><span>'message'<span><span>)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> return<span><span> { message }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/provide-inject.html", "title": "依赖注入", "doc_id": "31f1836188394eaaae514792907333ce", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1007, "chunk_index": 21, "_doc_id": "21_732629801381522126"}}
{"doc_id": "22_8852155093259070232", "text": "ss=\"line\"><span> return<span><span> { message }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span><code><pre><div><div><div class=\"options-api\"><p>要注入上层组件提供的数据，需使用 <a href=\"/api/options-composition.html#inject\"><code>inject<code><a> 选项来声明：<p><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/provide-inject.html", "title": "依赖注入", "doc_id": "31f1836188394eaaae514792907333ce", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1007, "chunk_index": 22, "_doc_id": "22_8852155093259070232"}}
{"doc_id": "23_6626201705543152876", "text": "b-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> inject: [<span><span>'message'<span><span>],<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> created<span><span>() {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> console.<span><span>log<span><span>(<span><span>this<span><span>.message) <span><span>// injected value<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/provide-inject.html", "title": "依赖注入", "doc_id": "31f1836188394eaaae514792907333ce", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1007, "chunk_index": 23, "_doc_id": "23_6626201705543152876"}}
{"doc_id": "24_1219134250480382551", "text": "n><span>.message) <span><span>// injected value<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span><code><pre><div><p>注入会在组件自身的状态<strong>之前<strong>被解析，因此你可以在 <code>data()<code> 中访问到注入的属性：<p><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> inject: [<span><span>'message'<span><span>],<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/provide-inject.html", "title": "依赖注入", "doc_id": "31f1836188394eaaae514792907333ce", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1007, "chunk_index": 24, "_doc_id": "24_1219134250480382551"}}
{"doc_id": "25_4928278972046649229", "text": "n> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> inject: [<span><span>'message'<span><span>],<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> data<span><span>() {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> return<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 基于注入值的初始数据<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> fullMessage: <span><span>this<span><span>.message<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/provide-inject.html", "title": "依赖注入", "doc_id": "31f1836188394eaaae514792907333ce", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1007, "chunk_index": 25, "_doc_id": "25_4928278972046649229"}}
{"doc_id": "26_4299621919306070629", "text": "message<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span><code><pre><div><p>如果有多个父组件提供了相同键的数据，注入将解析为组件链上最近的父组件所注入的值。<p><p><a href=\"https://play.vuejs.", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/provide-inject.html", "title": "依赖注入", "doc_id": "31f1836188394eaaae514792907333ce", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1007, "chunk_index": 26, "_doc_id": "26_4299621919306070629"}}
{"doc_id": "27_3458534550524434605", "text": "><span><code><pre><div><p>如果有多个父组件提供了相同键的数据，注入将解析为组件链上最近的父组件所注入的值。<p><p><a href=\"https://play.vuejs.org/#\" target=\"_blank\">完整的 provide + inject 示例<a><p><h3 id=\"injection-aliasing\">注入别名 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#injection-aliasing\">​<a><h3><p>当以数组形式使用 <code>inject<code>，", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/provide-inject.html", "title": "依赖注入", "doc_id": "31f1836188394eaaae514792907333ce", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1007, "chunk_index": 27, "_doc_id": "27_3458534550524434605"}}
{"doc_id": "28_6005451827706781644", "text": "ng\">注入别名 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#injection-aliasing\">​<a><h3><p>当以数组形式使用 <code>inject<code>，注入的属性会以同名的 key 暴露到组件实例上。在上面的例子中，提供的属性名为 <code>\"message\"<code>，注入后以 <code>this.message<code> 的形式暴露。访问的本地属性名和注入名是相同的。<p><p>如果我们想要用一个不同的本地属性名注入该属性，我们需要在 <code>inject<code> 选项的属性上使用对象的形式：<p><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> inject: {<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/provide-inject.html", "title": "依赖注入", "doc_id": "31f1836188394eaaae514792907333ce", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1007, "chunk_index": 28, "_doc_id": "28_6005451827706781644"}}
{"doc_id": "29_88300503530919134", "text": "xport<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> inject: {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> /* 本地属性名 */<span><span> localMessage: {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> from: <span><span>/* 注入来源名 */<span><span> 'message'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span><code><pre><div><p>这里，组件本地化了原注入名 <code>\"message\"<code> 所提供的属性，并将其暴露为 <code>this.localMessage<code>。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/provide-inject.html", "title": "依赖注入", "doc_id": "31f1836188394eaaae514792907333ce", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1007, "chunk_index": 29, "_doc_id": "29_88300503530919134"}}
{"doc_id": "30_6790039255724862007", "text": "><code><pre><div><p>这里，组件本地化了原注入名 <code>\"message\"<code> 所提供的属性，并将其暴露为 <code>this.localMessage<code>。<p><div><h3 id=\"injection-default-values\">注入默认值 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#injection-default-values\">​<a><h3><p>默认情况下，<code>inject<code> 假设传入的注入名会被某个祖先链上的组件提供。如果该注入名的确没有任何组件提供，则会抛出一个运行时警告。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/provide-inject.html", "title": "依赖注入", "doc_id": "31f1836188394eaaae514792907333ce", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1007, "chunk_index": 30, "_doc_id": "30_6790039255724862007"}}
{"doc_id": "31_3648808778418456906", "text": "ault-values\">​<a><h3><p>默认情况下，<code>inject<code> 假设传入的注入名会被某个祖先链上的组件提供。如果该注入名的确没有任何组件提供，则会抛出一个运行时警告。<p><p>如果在注入一个值时不要求必须有提供者，那么我们应该声明一个默认值，和 props 类似：<p><div class=\"composition-api\"><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// 如果没有祖先组件提供 \"message\"<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// `value` 会是 \"这是默认值\"<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/provide-inject.html", "title": "依赖注入", "doc_id": "31f1836188394eaaae514792907333ce", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1007, "chunk_index": 31, "_doc_id": "31_3648808778418456906"}}
{"doc_id": "32_3315453201895694816", "text": "span>// 如果没有祖先组件提供 \"message\"<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// `value` 会是 \"这是默认值\"<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> value<span><span> =<span><span> inject<span><span>(<span><span>'message'<span><span>, <span><span>'这是默认值'<span><span>)<span><span><code><pre><div><p>在一些场景中，默认值可能需要通过调用一个函数或初始化一个类来取得。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/provide-inject.html", "title": "依赖注入", "doc_id": "31f1836188394eaaae514792907333ce", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1007, "chunk_index": 32, "_doc_id": "32_3315453201895694816"}}
{"doc_id": "33_8767073895124729531", "text": "n>, <span><span>'这是默认值'<span><span>)<span><span><code><pre><div><p>在一些场景中，默认值可能需要通过调用一个函数或初始化一个类来取得。为了避免在用不到默认值的情况下进行不必要的计算或产生副作用，我们可以使用工厂函数来创建默认值：<p><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> value<span><span> =<span><span> inject<span><span>(<span><span>'key'<span><span>, () <span><span>=><span><span> new<span><span> ExpensiveClass<span><span>(), <span><span>true<span><span>)<span><span><code><pre><div><p>第三个参数表示默认值应该被当作一个工厂函数。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/provide-inject.html", "title": "依赖注入", "doc_id": "31f1836188394eaaae514792907333ce", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1007, "chunk_index": 33, "_doc_id": "33_8767073895124729531"}}
{"doc_id": "34_5949059911508260987", "text": "ss<span><span>(), <span><span>true<span><span>)<span><span><code><pre><div><p>第三个参数表示默认值应该被当作一个工厂函数。<p><div><div class=\"options-api\"><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 当声明注入的默认值时<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 必须使用对象形式<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> inject: {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> message: {<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/provide-inject.html", "title": "依赖注入", "doc_id": "31f1836188394eaaae514792907333ce", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1007, "chunk_index": 34, "_doc_id": "34_5949059911508260987"}}
{"doc_id": "35_157602532113718051", "text": "n>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> inject: {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> message: {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> from: <span><span>'message'<span><span>, <span><span>// 当与原注入名同名时，这个属性是可选的<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> default: <span><span>'default value'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> },<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> user: {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 对于非基础类型数据，如果创建开销比较大，或是需要确保每个组件实例<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 需要独立数据的，请使用工厂函数<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/provide-inject.html", "title": "依赖注入", "doc_id": "31f1836188394eaaae514792907333ce", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1007, "chunk_index": 35, "_doc_id": "35_157602532113718051"}}
{"doc_id": "36_739505548221506472", "text": "非基础类型数据，如果创建开销比较大，或是需要确保每个组件实例<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 需要独立数据的，请使用工厂函数<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> default<span><span>: () <span><span>=><span><span> ({ name: <span><span>'John'<span><span> })<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/provide-inject.html", "title": "依赖注入", "doc_id": "31f1836188394eaaae514792907333ce", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1007, "chunk_index": 36, "_doc_id": "36_739505548221506472"}}
{"doc_id": "37_3084572115727257095", "text": "pan> })<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span><code><pre><div><div><h2 id=\"working-with-reactivity\">和响应式数据配合使用 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#working-with-reactivity\">​<a><h2><div class=\"composition-api\"><p>当提供 / 注入响应式的数据时，<strong>建议尽可能将任何对响应式状态的变更都保持在供给方组件中<strong>。这样可以确保所提供状态的声明和变更操作都内聚在同一个组件内，使其更容易维护。<p><p>有的时候，我们可能需要在注入方组件中更改数据。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/provide-inject.html", "title": "依赖注入", "doc_id": "31f1836188394eaaae514792907333ce", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1007, "chunk_index": 37, "_doc_id": "37_3084572115727257095"}}
{"doc_id": "38_5281260873277670546", "text": "可能将任何对响应式状态的变更都保持在供给方组件中<strong>。这样可以确保所提供状态的声明和变更操作都内聚在同一个组件内，使其更容易维护。<p><p>有的时候，我们可能需要在注入方组件中更改数据。在这种情况下，我们推荐在供给方组件内声明并提供一个更改数据的方法函数：<p><div class=\"language-vue\"> <span class=\"lang\">vue<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><!-- 在供给方组件内 --><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>script<span><span> setup<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>import<span><span> { provide, ref } <span><span>from<span><span> 'vue'<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/provide-inject.html", "title": "依赖注入", "doc_id": "31f1836188394eaaae514792907333ce", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1007, "chunk_index": 38, "_doc_id": "38_5281260873277670546"}}
{"doc_id": "39_8810718204573910920", "text": "ass=\"line\"><span>import<span><span> { provide, ref } <span><span>from<span><span> 'vue'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> location<span><span> =<span><span> ref<span><span>(<span><span>'North Pole'<span><span>)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line highlighted\"><span>function<span><span> updateLocation<span><span>() {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line highlighted\"><span> location.value <span><span>=<span><span> 'South Pole'<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/provide-inject.html", "title": "依赖注入", "doc_id": "31f1836188394eaaae514792907333ce", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1007, "chunk_index": 39, "_doc_id": "39_8810718204573910920"}}
{"doc_id": "40_3814859609639290327", "text": "n class=\"line highlighted\"><span> location.value <span><span>=<span><span> 'South Pole'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line highlighted\"><span>}<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>provide<span><span>(<span><span>'location'<span><span>, {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> location,<span><span>\n<span class=\"line highlighted\"><span> updateLocation<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>})<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/provide-inject.html", "title": "依赖注入", "doc_id": "31f1836188394eaaae514792907333ce", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1007, "chunk_index": 40, "_doc_id": "40_3814859609639290327"}}
{"doc_id": "41_4148531814564383140", "text": "class=\"line highlighted\"><span> updateLocation<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>})<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>script<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><div class=\"language-vue\"> <span class=\"lang\">vue<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><!-- 在注入方组件 --><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>script<span><span> setup<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/provide-inject.html", "title": "依赖注入", "doc_id": "31f1836188394eaaae514792907333ce", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1007, "chunk_index": 41, "_doc_id": "41_4148531814564383140"}}
{"doc_id": "42_6428307337074781643", "text": "span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>script<span><span> setup<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>import<span><span> { inject } <span><span>from<span><span> 'vue'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line highlighted\"><span>const<span><span> { <span><span>location<span><span>, <span><span>updateLocation<span><span> } <span><span>=<span><span> inject<span><span>(<span><span>'location'<span><span>)<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/provide-inject.html", "title": "依赖注入", "doc_id": "31f1836188394eaaae514792907333ce", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1007, "chunk_index": 42, "_doc_id": "42_6428307337074781643"}}
{"doc_id": "43_5878191223136464716", "text": "pan> } <span><span>=<span><span> inject<span><span>(<span><span>'location'<span><span>)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>script<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>button<span><span> @click<span><span>=<span><span>\"updateLocation\"<span><span>>{{ location }}</<span><span>button<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/provide-inject.html", "title": "依赖注入", "doc_id": "31f1836188394eaaae514792907333ce", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1007, "chunk_index": 43, "_doc_id": "43_5878191223136464716"}}
{"doc_id": "44_2289143964759996723", "text": "span><span>\"updateLocation\"<span><span>>{{ location }}</<span><span>button<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>最后，如果你想确保提供的数据不能被注入方的组件更改，你可以使用 <a href=\"/api/reactivity-core.html#readonly\"><code>readonly()<code><a> 来包装提供的值。<p><div class=\"language-vue\"> <span class=\"lang\">vue<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>script<span><span> setup<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/provide-inject.html", "title": "依赖注入", "doc_id": "31f1836188394eaaae514792907333ce", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1007, "chunk_index": 44, "_doc_id": "44_2289143964759996723"}}
{"doc_id": "45_5259415534938173131", "text": "code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>script<span><span> setup<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>import<span><span> { ref, provide, readonly } <span><span>from<span><span> 'vue'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> count<span><span> =<span><span> ref<span><span>(<span><span>0<span><span>)<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/provide-inject.html", "title": "依赖注入", "doc_id": "31f1836188394eaaae514792907333ce", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1007, "chunk_index": 45, "_doc_id": "45_5259415534938173131"}}
{"doc_id": "46_5246698434832030663", "text": "<span><span> count<span><span> =<span><span> ref<span><span>(<span><span>0<span><span>)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>provide<span><span>(<span><span>'read-only-count'<span><span>, <span><span>readonly<span><span>(count))<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/provide-inject.html", "title": "依赖注入", "doc_id": "31f1836188394eaaae514792907333ce", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1007, "chunk_index": 46, "_doc_id": "46_5246698434832030663"}}
{"doc_id": "47_3431326965431880885", "text": "an>(<span><span>'read-only-count'<span><span>, <span><span>readonly<span><span>(count))<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>script<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><div><div class=\"options-api\"><p>为保证注入方和供给方之间的响应性链接，我们需要使用 <a href=\"/api/reactivity-core.html#computed\">computed()<a> 函数提供一个计算属性：<p><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>import<span><span> { computed } <span><span>from<span><span> 'vue'<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/provide-inject.html", "title": "依赖注入", "doc_id": "31f1836188394eaaae514792907333ce", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1007, "chunk_index": 47, "_doc_id": "47_3431326965431880885"}}
{"doc_id": "48_9178849029443264729", "text": "n class=\"line\"><span>import<span><span> { computed } <span><span>from<span><span> 'vue'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> data<span><span>() {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> return<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> message: <span><span>'hello!'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> },<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/provide-inject.html", "title": "依赖注入", "doc_id": "31f1836188394eaaae514792907333ce", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1007, "chunk_index": 48, "_doc_id": "48_9178849029443264729"}}
{"doc_id": "49_8602792018542272202", "text": "ello!'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> },<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> provide<span><span>() {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> return<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 显式提供一个计算属性<span><span>\n<span class=\"line highlighted\"><span> message: <span><span>computed<span><span>(() <span><span>=><span><span> this<span><span>.message)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/provide-inject.html", "title": "依赖注入", "doc_id": "31f1836188394eaaae514792907333ce", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1007, "chunk_index": 49, "_doc_id": "49_8602792018542272202"}}
