{"doc_id": "51_4693897432114759619", "text": "}<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span><code><pre><div><p><a href=\"https://play.vuejs.org/#\" target=\"_blank\">带有响应性的 provide + inject 完整示例<a><p><p><code>computed()<code> 函数常用于组合式 API 风格的组件中，", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/provide-inject.html", "title": "依赖注入", "doc_id": "31f1836188394eaaae514792907333ce", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1007, "chunk_index": 51, "_doc_id": "51_4693897432114759619"}}
{"doc_id": "52_6206346323614652736", "text": "==\" target=\"_blank\">带有响应性的 provide + inject 完整示例<a><p><p><code>computed()<code> 函数常用于组合式 API 风格的组件中，但它同样还可以用于补充选项式 API 风格的某些用例。你可以通过阅读<a href=\"/guide/essentials/reactivity-fundamentals.html\">响应式系统基础<a>和<a href=\"/guide/essentials/computed.html\">计算属性<a>两个章节了解更多组合式的 API 风格。<p><div><h2 id=\"working-with-symbol-keys\">使用 Symbol 作注入名 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#working-with-symbol-keys\">​<a><h2><p>至此，我们已经了解了如何使用字符串作为注入名。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/provide-inject.html", "title": "依赖注入", "doc_id": "31f1836188394eaaae514792907333ce", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1007, "chunk_index": 52, "_doc_id": "52_6206346323614652736"}}
{"doc_id": "53_5018960733618776890", "text": "ol 作注入名 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#working-with-symbol-keys\">​<a><h2><p>至此，我们已经了解了如何使用字符串作为注入名。但如果你正在构建大型的应用，包含非常多的依赖提供，或者你正在编写提供给其他开发者使用的组件库，建议最好使用 <a href=\"https://developer.mozilla.org/zh-CN/docs/Web/JavaScript/Reference/Global_Objects/Symbol\" target=\"_blank\">Symbol<a> 来作为注入名以避免潜在的冲突。<p><p>我们通常推荐在一个单独的文件中导出这些注入名 Symbol：<p><div class=\"vp-code-block-title\"><p class=\"vp-code-block-title-bar\"><span class=\"vp-code-block-title-text\">keys.", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/provide-inject.html", "title": "依赖注入", "doc_id": "31f1836188394eaaae514792907333ce", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1007, "chunk_index": 53, "_doc_id": "53_5018960733618776890"}}
{"doc_id": "54_5781269610029535337", "text": "vp-code-block-title\"><p class=\"vp-code-block-title-bar\"><span class=\"vp-code-block-title-text\">keys.js<span><p><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> const<span><span> myInjectionKey<span><span> =<span><span> Symbol<span><span>()<span><span><code><pre><div><div><div class=\"composition-api\"><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// 在供给方组件中<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/provide-inject.html", "title": "依赖注入", "doc_id": "31f1836188394eaaae514792907333ce", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1007, "chunk_index": 54, "_doc_id": "54_5781269610029535337"}}
{"doc_id": "55_5939687222374693748", "text": "s<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// 在供给方组件中<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>import<span><span> { provide } <span><span>from<span><span> 'vue'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>import<span><span> { myInjectionKey } <span><span>from<span><span> './keys.js'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>provide<span><span>(myInjectionKey, { <span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> /* 要提供的数据 */<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/provide-inject.html", "title": "依赖注入", "doc_id": "31f1836188394eaaae514792907333ce", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1007, "chunk_index": 55, "_doc_id": "55_5939687222374693748"}}
{"doc_id": "56_5324284834900174308", "text": "ovide<span><span>(myInjectionKey, { <span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> /* 要提供的数据 */<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>})<span><span><code><pre><div><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// 注入方组件<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>import<span><span> { inject } <span><span>from<span><span> 'vue'<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/provide-inject.html", "title": "依赖注入", "doc_id": "31f1836188394eaaae514792907333ce", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1007, "chunk_index": 56, "_doc_id": "56_5324284834900174308"}}
{"doc_id": "57_7830396158627303272", "text": "pan class=\"line\"><span>import<span><span> { inject } <span><span>from<span><span> 'vue'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>import<span><span> { myInjectionKey } <span><span>from<span><span> './keys.js'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/provide-inject.html", "title": "依赖注入", "doc_id": "31f1836188394eaaae514792907333ce", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1007, "chunk_index": 57, "_doc_id": "57_7830396158627303272"}}
{"doc_id": "58_7279878486791890139", "text": "> { myInjectionKey } <span><span>from<span><span> './keys.js'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> injected<span><span> =<span><span> inject<span><span>(myInjectionKey)<span><span><code><pre><div><p>TypeScript 用户请参考：<a href=\"/guide/typescript/composition-api.html#typing-provide-inject\">为 Provide / Inject 标注类型<a> <p><div><div class=\"options-api\"><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// 在供给方组件中<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/provide-inject.html", "title": "依赖注入", "doc_id": "31f1836188394eaaae514792907333ce", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1007, "chunk_index": 58, "_doc_id": "58_7279878486791890139"}}
{"doc_id": "59_1401697421817419671", "text": "s<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// 在供给方组件中<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>import<span><span> { myInjectionKey } <span><span>from<span><span> './keys.js'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> provide<span><span>() {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> return<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> [myInjectionKey]: {<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/provide-inject.html", "title": "依赖注入", "doc_id": "31f1836188394eaaae514792907333ce", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1007, "chunk_index": 59, "_doc_id": "59_1401697421817419671"}}
{"doc_id": "60_2282470967772867771", "text": "\"><span> return<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> [myInjectionKey]: {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> /* 要提供的数据 */<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span><code><pre><div><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// 注入方组件<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/provide-inject.html", "title": "依赖注入", "doc_id": "31f1836188394eaaae514792907333ce", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1007, "chunk_index": 60, "_doc_id": "60_2282470967772867771"}}
{"doc_id": "61_8645739802729222650", "text": ">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// 注入方组件<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>import<span><span> { myInjectionKey } <span><span>from<span><span> './keys.js'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> inject: {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> injected: { from: myInjectionKey }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/provide-inject.html", "title": "依赖注入", "doc_id": "31f1836188394eaaae514792907333ce", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1007, "chunk_index": 61, "_doc_id": "61_8645739802729222650"}}
{"doc_id": "62_1233900771983568542", "text": "line\"><span> injected: { from: myInjectionKey }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span><code><pre><div><div> <p><strong>译者注<strong><p><p><a id=\"footnote-1\"><a>[1] 在本章及后续章节中，“<strong>提供<strong>”将成为对应 Provide 的一个专有概念<p><div><div>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/provide-inject.html", "title": "依赖注入", "doc_id": "31f1836188394eaaae514792907333ce", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1007, "chunk_index": 62, "_doc_id": "62_1233900771983568542"}}
{"doc_id": "0_4936996115793506973", "text": "<div><div><h1 id=\"custom-directives\">自定义指令 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#custom-directives\">​<a><h1><h2 id=\"introduction\">介绍 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#introduction\">​<a><h2><p>除了 Vue 内置的一系列指令 (比如 <code>v-model<code> 或 <code>v-show<code>) 之外，Vue 还允许你注册自定义的指令 (Custom Directives)。<p><p>我们已经介绍了两种在 Vue 中重用代码的方式：<a href=\"/guide/essentials/component-basics.html\">组件<a>和<a href=\"./composables.html\">组合式函数<a>。组件是主要的构建模块，而组合式函数则侧重于有状态的逻辑。另一方面，自定义指令主要是为了重用涉及普通元素的底层 DOM 访问的逻辑。<p><p>一个自定义指令由一个包含类似组件生命周期钩子的对象来定义。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/reusability/custom-directives.html", "title": "自定义指令", "doc_id": "290b016094f24df3b63f036bc294ed02", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 650, "chunk_index": 0, "_doc_id": "0_4936996115793506973"}}
{"doc_id": "1_4576225682316773330", "text": "组件是主要的构建模块，而组合式函数则侧重于有状态的逻辑。另一方面，自定义指令主要是为了重用涉及普通元素的底层 DOM 访问的逻辑。<p><p>一个自定义指令由一个包含类似组件生命周期钩子的对象来定义。钩子函数会接收到指令所绑定元素作为其参数。下面是一个自定义指令的例子，当 Vue 将元素插入到 DOM 中后，该指令会将一个 class 添加到元素中：<p><div class=\"composition-api\"><div class=\"language-vue\"> <span class=\"lang\">vue<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>script<span><span> setup<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 在模板中启用 v-highlight<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/reusability/custom-directives.html", "title": "自定义指令", "doc_id": "290b016094f24df3b63f036bc294ed02", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 650, "chunk_index": 1, "_doc_id": "1_4576225682316773330"}}
{"doc_id": "2_2265665949377366890", "text": "an><span> setup<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 在模板中启用 v-highlight<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> vHighlight<span><span> =<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> mounted<span><span>: (<span><span>el<span><span>) <span><span>=><span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> el.classList.<span><span>add<span><span>(<span><span>'is-highlight'<span><span>)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/reusability/custom-directives.html", "title": "自定义指令", "doc_id": "290b016094f24df3b63f036bc294ed02", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 650, "chunk_index": 2, "_doc_id": "2_2265665949377366890"}}
{"doc_id": "3_3793479932205133206", "text": "><span>)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>script<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>p<span><span> v-highlight<span><span>>This sentence is important!</<span><span>p<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/reusability/custom-directives.html", "title": "自定义指令", "doc_id": "290b016094f24df3b63f036bc294ed02", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 650, "chunk_index": 3, "_doc_id": "3_3793479932205133206"}}
{"doc_id": "4_4326071410793857437", "text": "><span> v-highlight<span><span>>This sentence is important!</<span><span>p<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><div><div class=\"options-api\"><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> highlight<span><span> =<span><span> {<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/reusability/custom-directives.html", "title": "自定义指令", "doc_id": "290b016094f24df3b63f036bc294ed02", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 650, "chunk_index": 4, "_doc_id": "4_4326071410793857437"}}
{"doc_id": "5_300359654357300350", "text": "><code><span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> highlight<span><span> =<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> mounted<span><span>: (<span><span>el<span><span>) <span><span>=><span><span> el.classList.<span><span>add<span><span>(<span><span>'is-highlight'<span><span>)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> directives: {<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/reusability/custom-directives.html", "title": "自定义指令", "doc_id": "290b016094f24df3b63f036bc294ed02", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 650, "chunk_index": 5, "_doc_id": "5_300359654357300350"}}
{"doc_id": "6_1397375880177926015", "text": "t<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> directives: {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 在模板中启用 v-highlight<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> highlight<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/reusability/custom-directives.html", "title": "自定义指令", "doc_id": "290b016094f24df3b63f036bc294ed02", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 650, "chunk_index": 6, "_doc_id": "6_1397375880177926015"}}
{"doc_id": "7_4471367492866326138", "text": "span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> highlight<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span><code><pre><div><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>p<span><span> v-highlight<span><span>>This sentence is important!</<span><span>p<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><div><div class=\"demo\"><p>This sentence is important!<p><div><div class=\"composition-api\"><p>在 <code><script setup><code> 中，任何以 <code>v<code> 开头的驼峰式命名的变量都可以当作自定义指令使用。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/reusability/custom-directives.html", "title": "自定义指令", "doc_id": "290b016094f24df3b63f036bc294ed02", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 650, "chunk_index": 7, "_doc_id": "7_4471367492866326138"}}
{"doc_id": "8_3806090618611181558", "text": "class=\"composition-api\"><p>在 <code><script setup><code> 中，任何以 <code>v<code> 开头的驼峰式命名的变量都可以当作自定义指令使用。在上述例子中，<code>vHighlight<code> 可以在模板中以 <code>v-highlight<code> 的形式使用。<p><p>在不使用 <code><script setup><code> 的情况下，自定义指令需要通过 <code>directives<code> 选项注册：<p><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> setup<span><span>() {<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/reusability/custom-directives.html", "title": "自定义指令", "doc_id": "290b016094f24df3b63f036bc294ed02", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 650, "chunk_index": 8, "_doc_id": "8_3806090618611181558"}}
{"doc_id": "9_3864125965280497274", "text": "span> default<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> setup<span><span>() {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> /*...*/<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> },<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> directives: {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 在模板中启用 v-highlight<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> highlight: {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> /* ... */<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/reusability/custom-directives.html", "title": "自定义指令", "doc_id": "290b016094f24df3b63f036bc294ed02", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 650, "chunk_index": 9, "_doc_id": "9_3864125965280497274"}}
{"doc_id": "10_4571149499379582031", "text": "... */<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span><code><pre><div><div><div class=\"options-api\"><p>和组件类似，自定义指令在模板中使用前必须先注册。在上面的例子中，我们使用 <code>directives<code> 选项完成了指令的局部注册。<p><div><p>将一个自定义指令全局注册到应用层级也是一种常见的做法：<p><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> app<span><span> =<span><span> createApp<span><span>({})<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/reusability/custom-directives.html", "title": "自定义指令", "doc_id": "290b016094f24df3b63f036bc294ed02", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 650, "chunk_index": 10, "_doc_id": "10_4571149499379582031"}}
{"doc_id": "11_305538269856170579", "text": "=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> app<span><span> =<span><span> createApp<span><span>({})<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 使 v-highlight 在所有组件中都可用<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>app.<span><span>directive<span><span>(<span><span>'highlight'<span><span>, {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> /* ... */<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>})<span><span><code><pre><div><p>通过扩展 <code>vue<code> 中的 <code>ComponentCustomProperties<code> 接口，可以为自定义的全局指令添加类型。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/reusability/custom-directives.html", "title": "自定义指令", "doc_id": "290b016094f24df3b63f036bc294ed02", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 650, "chunk_index": 11, "_doc_id": "11_305538269856170579"}}
{"doc_id": "12_1802672745088788783", "text": "<code><pre><div><p>通过扩展 <code>vue<code> 中的 <code>ComponentCustomProperties<code> 接口，可以为自定义的全局指令添加类型。<p><p>更多细节参考：<a href=\"/guide/typescript/composition-api.html#typing-global-custom-directives\">为自定义全局指令添加类型<a> <p><h2 id=\"when-to-use\">自定义指令的使用时机 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#when-to-use\">​<a><h2><p>只有当所需功能只能通过直接的 DOM 操作来实现时，才应该使用自定义指令。<p><p>一个常见例子是使元素获取焦点的 <code>v-focus<code> 指令。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/reusability/custom-directives.html", "title": "自定义指令", "doc_id": "290b016094f24df3b63f036bc294ed02", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 650, "chunk_index": 12, "_doc_id": "12_1802672745088788783"}}
{"doc_id": "13_4595826270812293981", "text": "o-use\">​<a><h2><p>只有当所需功能只能通过直接的 DOM 操作来实现时，才应该使用自定义指令。<p><p>一个常见例子是使元素获取焦点的 <code>v-focus<code> 指令。<p><div class=\"composition-api\"><div class=\"language-vue\"> <span class=\"lang\">vue<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>script<span><span> setup<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 在模板中启用 v-focus<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> vFocus<span><span> =<span><span> {<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/reusability/custom-directives.html", "title": "自定义指令", "doc_id": "290b016094f24df3b63f036bc294ed02", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 650, "chunk_index": 13, "_doc_id": "13_4595826270812293981"}}
{"doc_id": "14_276853647708462936", "text": "an><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> vFocus<span><span> =<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> mounted<span><span>: (<span><span>el<span><span>) <span><span>=><span><span> el.<span><span>focus<span><span>()<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>script<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/reusability/custom-directives.html", "title": "自定义指令", "doc_id": "290b016094f24df3b63f036bc294ed02", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 650, "chunk_index": 14, "_doc_id": "14_276853647708462936"}}
{"doc_id": "15_7759366352279599518", "text": ">\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>input<span><span> v-focus<span><span> /><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><div><div class=\"options-api\"><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> focus<span><span> =<span><span> {<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/reusability/custom-directives.html", "title": "自定义指令", "doc_id": "290b016094f24df3b63f036bc294ed02", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 650, "chunk_index": 15, "_doc_id": "15_7759366352279599518"}}
{"doc_id": "16_3134244627004408784", "text": "ode\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> focus<span><span> =<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> mounted<span><span>: (<span><span>el<span><span>) <span><span>=><span><span> el.<span><span>focus<span><span>()<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> directives: {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 在模板中启用 v-focus<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/reusability/custom-directives.html", "title": "自定义指令", "doc_id": "290b016094f24df3b63f036bc294ed02", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 650, "chunk_index": 16, "_doc_id": "16_3134244627004408784"}}
{"doc_id": "17_6650299634259822072", "text": "ass=\"line\"><span> directives: {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 在模板中启用 v-focus<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> focus<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/reusability/custom-directives.html", "title": "自定义指令", "doc_id": "290b016094f24df3b63f036bc294ed02", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 650, "chunk_index": 17, "_doc_id": "17_6650299634259822072"}}
{"doc_id": "18_3010723294224767608", "text": "cus<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> focus<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span><code><pre><div><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>input<span><span> v-focus<span><span> /><span><span><code><pre><div><div><p>该指令比 <code>autofocus<code> 属性更有用，因为它不仅在页面加载时有效，而且在 Vue 动态插入元素时也有效！<p><p>建议尽可能使用 <code>v-bind<code> 等内置指令声明模板，因为它们更高效，对服务端渲染也更友好。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/reusability/custom-directives.html", "title": "自定义指令", "doc_id": "290b016094f24df3b63f036bc294ed02", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 650, "chunk_index": 18, "_doc_id": "18_3010723294224767608"}}
{"doc_id": "19_2361924872320388882", "text": "性更有用，因为它不仅在页面加载时有效，而且在 Vue 动态插入元素时也有效！<p><p>建议尽可能使用 <code>v-bind<code> 等内置指令声明模板，因为它们更高效，对服务端渲染也更友好。<p><h2 id=\"directive-hooks\">指令钩子 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#directive-hooks\">​<a><h2><p>一个指令的定义对象可以提供几种钩子函数 (都是可选的)：<p><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> myDirective<span><span> =<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 在绑定元素的 attribute 前<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/reusability/custom-directives.html", "title": "自定义指令", "doc_id": "290b016094f24df3b63f036bc294ed02", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 650, "chunk_index": 19, "_doc_id": "19_2361924872320388882"}}
{"doc_id": "20_8471838246390527593", "text": "span><span> =<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 在绑定元素的 attribute 前<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 或事件监听器应用前调用<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> created<span><span>(<span><span>el<span><span>, <span><span>binding<span><span>, <span><span>vnode<span><span>) {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 下面会介绍各个参数的细节<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> },<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 在元素被插入到 DOM 前调用<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/reusability/custom-directives.html", "title": "自定义指令", "doc_id": "290b016094f24df3b63f036bc294ed02", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 650, "chunk_index": 20, "_doc_id": "20_8471838246390527593"}}
{"doc_id": "21_3365889527089085230", "text": ">\n<span class=\"line\"><span> },<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 在元素被插入到 DOM 前调用<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> beforeMount<span><span>(<span><span>el<span><span>, <span><span>binding<span><span>, <span><span>vnode<span><span>) {},<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 在绑定元素的父组件<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 及他自己的所有子节点都挂载完成后调用<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/reusability/custom-directives.html", "title": "自定义指令", "doc_id": "290b016094f24df3b63f036bc294ed02", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 650, "chunk_index": 21, "_doc_id": "21_3365889527089085230"}}
{"doc_id": "22_8842081860751451888", "text": "=\"line\"><span> // 在绑定元素的父组件<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 及他自己的所有子节点都挂载完成后调用<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> mounted<span><span>(<span><span>el<span><span>, <span><span>binding<span><span>, <span><span>vnode<span><span>) {},<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 绑定元素的父组件更新前调用<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> beforeUpdate<span><span>(<span><span>el<span><span>, <span><span>binding<span><span>, <span><span>vnode<span><span>, <span><span>prevVnode<span><span>) {},<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/reusability/custom-directives.html", "title": "自定义指令", "doc_id": "290b016094f24df3b63f036bc294ed02", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 650, "chunk_index": 22, "_doc_id": "22_8842081860751451888"}}
{"doc_id": "23_5253205252361059428", "text": "ding<span><span>, <span><span>vnode<span><span>, <span><span>prevVnode<span><span>) {},<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 在绑定元素的父组件<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 及他自己的所有子节点都更新后调用<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> updated<span><span>(<span><span>el<span><span>, <span><span>binding<span><span>, <span><span>vnode<span><span>, <span><span>prevVnode<span><span>) {},<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 绑定元素的父组件卸载前调用<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/reusability/custom-directives.html", "title": "自定义指令", "doc_id": "290b016094f24df3b63f036bc294ed02", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 650, "chunk_index": 23, "_doc_id": "23_5253205252361059428"}}
{"doc_id": "24_208827483997569662", "text": "<span>prevVnode<span><span>) {},<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 绑定元素的父组件卸载前调用<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> beforeUnmount<span><span>(<span><span>el<span><span>, <span><span>binding<span><span>, <span><span>vnode<span><span>) {},<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 绑定元素的父组件卸载后调用<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> unmounted<span><span>(<span><span>el<span><span>, <span><span>binding<span><span>, <span><span>vnode<span><span>) {}<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/reusability/custom-directives.html", "title": "自定义指令", "doc_id": "290b016094f24df3b63f036bc294ed02", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 650, "chunk_index": 24, "_doc_id": "24_208827483997569662"}}
{"doc_id": "25_9030883566198232201", "text": "span>el<span><span>, <span><span>binding<span><span>, <span><span>vnode<span><span>) {}<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span><code><pre><div><h3 id=\"hook-arguments\">钩子参数 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#hook-arguments\">​<a><h3><p>指令的钩子会传递以下几种参数：<p><p>举例来说，", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/reusability/custom-directives.html", "title": "自定义指令", "doc_id": "290b016094f24df3b63f036bc294ed02", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 650, "chunk_index": 25, "_doc_id": "25_9030883566198232201"}}
{"doc_id": "26_6749895163955012619", "text": "rguments\">钩子参数 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#hook-arguments\">​<a><h3><p>指令的钩子会传递以下几种参数：<p><p>举例来说，像下面这样使用指令：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>div<span><span> v-example<span><span>:<span><span>foo<span><span>.<span><span>bar<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>baz<span><span>\"<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p><code>binding<code> 参数会是一个这样的对象：<p><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>{<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/reusability/custom-directives.html", "title": "自定义指令", "doc_id": "290b016094f24df3b63f036bc294ed02", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 650, "chunk_index": 26, "_doc_id": "26_6749895163955012619"}}
{"doc_id": "27_6085814655305516967", "text": "=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>{<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> arg<span><span>: <span><span>'foo'<span><span>,<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> modifiers<span><span>: { <span><span>bar<span><span>: <span><span>true<span><span> },<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> value<span><span>: <span><span>/* `baz` 的值 */<span><span>,<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> oldValue<span><span>: <span><span>/* 上一次更新时 `baz` 的值 */<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/reusability/custom-directives.html", "title": "自定义指令", "doc_id": "290b016094f24df3b63f036bc294ed02", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 650, "chunk_index": 27, "_doc_id": "27_6085814655305516967"}}
{"doc_id": "28_47753632511962328", "text": "span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> oldValue<span><span>: <span><span>/* 上一次更新时 `baz` 的值 */<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span><code><pre><div><p>和内置指令类似，自定义指令的参数也可以是动态的。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/reusability/custom-directives.html", "title": "自定义指令", "doc_id": "290b016094f24df3b63f036bc294ed02", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 650, "chunk_index": 28, "_doc_id": "28_47753632511962328"}}
{"doc_id": "29_4472410106953711706", "text": "的值 */<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span><code><pre><div><p>和内置指令类似，自定义指令的参数也可以是动态的。举例来说：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>div<span><span> v-example:<span><span>[<span><span>arg<span><span>]=<span><span>\"value\"<span><span>></<span><span>div<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>这里指令的参数会基于组件的 <code>arg<code> 数据属性响应式地更新。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/reusability/custom-directives.html", "title": "自定义指令", "doc_id": "290b016094f24df3b63f036bc294ed02", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 650, "chunk_index": 29, "_doc_id": "29_4472410106953711706"}}
{"doc_id": "30_1749559985005093124", "text": "<span><span>div<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>这里指令的参数会基于组件的 <code>arg<code> 数据属性响应式地更新。<p><div class=\"tip custom-block\"><p class=\"custom-block-title\">Note<p><p>除了 <code>el<code> 外，其他参数都是只读的，不要更改它们。若你需要在不同的钩子间共享信息，推荐通过元素的 <a href=\"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/API/HTMLElement/dataset\" target=\"_blank\">dataset<a> attribute 实现。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/reusability/custom-directives.html", "title": "自定义指令", "doc_id": "290b016094f24df3b63f036bc294ed02", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 650, "chunk_index": 30, "_doc_id": "30_1749559985005093124"}}
{"doc_id": "31_6092583910737958366", "text": "veloper.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/API/HTMLElement/dataset\" target=\"_blank\">dataset<a> attribute 实现。<p><div><h2 id=\"function-shorthand\">简化形式 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#function-shorthand\">​<a><h2><p>对于自定义指令来说，一个很常见的情况是仅仅需要在 <code>mounted<code> 和 <code>updated<code> 上实现相同的行为，除此之外并不需要其他钩子。这种情况下我们可以直接用一个函数来定义指令，", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/reusability/custom-directives.html", "title": "自定义指令", "doc_id": "290b016094f24df3b63f036bc294ed02", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 650, "chunk_index": 31, "_doc_id": "31_6092583910737958366"}}
{"doc_id": "32_1588792238883662359", "text": "个很常见的情况是仅仅需要在 <code>mounted<code> 和 <code>updated<code> 上实现相同的行为，除此之外并不需要其他钩子。这种情况下我们可以直接用一个函数来定义指令，如下所示：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>div<span><span> v-color<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>color<span><span>\"<span><span>></<span><span>div<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>app.<span><span>directive<span><span>(<span><span>'color'<span><span>,", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/reusability/custom-directives.html", "title": "自定义指令", "doc_id": "290b016094f24df3b63f036bc294ed02", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 650, "chunk_index": 32, "_doc_id": "32_1588792238883662359"}}
{"doc_id": "33_3162558646259435978", "text": "ode><span class=\"line\"><span>app.<span><span>directive<span><span>(<span><span>'color'<span><span>, (<span><span>el<span><span>, <span><span>binding<span><span>) <span><span>=><span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 这会在 `mounted` 和 `updated` 时都调用<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> el.style.color <span><span>=<span><span> binding.value<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/reusability/custom-directives.html", "title": "自定义指令", "doc_id": "290b016094f24df3b63f036bc294ed02", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 650, "chunk_index": 33, "_doc_id": "33_3162558646259435978"}}
{"doc_id": "34_1739609004948198872", "text": "<span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> el.style.color <span><span>=<span><span> binding.value<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>})<span><span><code><pre><div><h2 id=\"object-literals\">对象字面量 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#object-literals\">​<a><h2><p>如果你的指令需要多个值，你可以向它传递一个 JavaScript 对象字面量。别忘了，指令也可以接收任何合法的 JavaScript 表达式。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/reusability/custom-directives.html", "title": "自定义指令", "doc_id": "290b016094f24df3b63f036bc294ed02", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 650, "chunk_index": 34, "_doc_id": "34_1739609004948198872"}}
{"doc_id": "35_321160523916089893", "text": "#object-literals\">​<a><h2><p>如果你的指令需要多个值，你可以向它传递一个 JavaScript 对象字面量。别忘了，指令也可以接收任何合法的 JavaScript 表达式。<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>div<span><span> v-demo<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>{ color: <span><span>'white'<span><span>,", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/reusability/custom-directives.html", "title": "自定义指令", "doc_id": "290b016094f24df3b63f036bc294ed02", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 650, "chunk_index": 35, "_doc_id": "35_321160523916089893"}}
{"doc_id": "36_2040525059463013105", "text": "v<span><span> v-demo<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>{ color: <span><span>'white'<span><span>, text: <span><span>'hello!'<span><span> }<span><span>\"<span><span>></<span><span>div<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>app.<span><span>directive<span><span>(<span><span>'demo'<span><span>, (<span><span>el<span><span>,", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/reusability/custom-directives.html", "title": "自定义指令", "doc_id": "290b016094f24df3b63f036bc294ed02", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 650, "chunk_index": 36, "_doc_id": "36_2040525059463013105"}}
{"doc_id": "37_5807342873054669086", "text": ">app.<span><span>directive<span><span>(<span><span>'demo'<span><span>, (<span><span>el<span><span>, <span><span>binding<span><span>) <span><span>=><span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> console.<span><span>log<span><span>(binding.value.color) <span><span>// => \"white\"<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> console.<span><span>log<span><span>(binding.value.text) <span><span>// => \"hello!\"<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/reusability/custom-directives.html", "title": "自定义指令", "doc_id": "290b016094f24df3b63f036bc294ed02", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 650, "chunk_index": 37, "_doc_id": "37_5807342873054669086"}}
{"doc_id": "38_1455251841568813712", "text": "pan> console.<span><span>log<span><span>(binding.value.text) <span><span>// => \"hello!\"<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>})<span><span><code><pre><div><h2 id=\"usage-on-components\">在组件上使用 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#usage-on-components\">​<a><h2><div class=\"warning custom-block\"><p class=\"custom-block-title\">不推荐<p><p>不推荐在组件上使用自定义指令。当组件具有多个根节点时可能会出现预期外的行为。<p><div><p>当在组件上使用自定义指令时，它会始终应用于组件的根节点，和<a href=\"/guide/components/attrs.html\">透传 attributes<a> 类似。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/reusability/custom-directives.html", "title": "自定义指令", "doc_id": "290b016094f24df3b63f036bc294ed02", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 650, "chunk_index": 38, "_doc_id": "38_1455251841568813712"}}
{"doc_id": "39_7972617647991826527", "text": "。<p><div><p>当在组件上使用自定义指令时，它会始终应用于组件的根节点，和<a href=\"/guide/components/attrs.html\">透传 attributes<a> 类似。<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>MyComponent<span><span> v-demo<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>test<span><span>\"<span><span> /><span><span><code><pre><div><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><!-- MyComponent 的模板 --><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/reusability/custom-directives.html", "title": "自定义指令", "doc_id": "290b016094f24df3b63f036bc294ed02", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 650, "chunk_index": 39, "_doc_id": "39_7972617647991826527"}}
{"doc_id": "40_8257586658403397699", "text": "ass=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><!-- MyComponent 的模板 --><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>div<span><span>> <span><span><!-- v-demo 指令会被应用在此处 --><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>span<span><span>>My component content</<span><span>span<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/reusability/custom-directives.html", "title": "自定义指令", "doc_id": "290b016094f24df3b63f036bc294ed02", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 650, "chunk_index": 40, "_doc_id": "40_8257586658403397699"}}
{"doc_id": "41_1648436935771564615", "text": "span> <<span><span>span<span><span>>My component content</<span><span>span<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>div<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>需要注意的是组件可能含有多个根节点。当应用到一个多根组件时，指令将会被忽略且抛出一个警告。和 attribute 不同，指令不能通过 <code>v-bind=\"$attrs\"<code> 来传递给一个不同的元素。<p><div><div>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/reusability/custom-directives.html", "title": "自定义指令", "doc_id": "290b016094f24df3b63f036bc294ed02", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 650, "chunk_index": 41, "_doc_id": "41_1648436935771564615"}}
{"doc_id": "0_9156409863713439776", "text": "<div><div><h1 id=\"plugins\">插件 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#plugins\">​<a><h1><h2 id=\"introduction\">介绍 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#introduction\">​<a><h2><p>插件 (Plugins) 是一种能为 Vue 添加全局功能的工具代码。下面是如何安装一个插件的示例：<p><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>import<span><span> { createApp } <span><span>from<span><span> 'vue'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/reusability/plugins.html", "title": "插件 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "eb3d1144e0ec40b5b5ce15f13a5dfea9", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 378, "chunk_index": 0, "_doc_id": "0_9156409863713439776"}}
{"doc_id": "1_9085899629983010793", "text": "<span><span> { createApp } <span><span>from<span><span> 'vue'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> app<span><span> =<span><span> createApp<span><span>({})<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>app.<span><span>use<span><span>(myPlugin, {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> /* 可选的选项 */<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/reusability/plugins.html", "title": "插件 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "eb3d1144e0ec40b5b5ce15f13a5dfea9", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 378, "chunk_index": 1, "_doc_id": "1_9085899629983010793"}}
{"doc_id": "2_3374929691453360183", "text": "pan><span>use<span><span>(myPlugin, {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> /* 可选的选项 */<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>})<span><span><code><pre><div><p>一个插件可以是一个拥有 <code>install()<code> 方法的对象，也可以直接是一个安装函数本身。安装函数会接收到安装它的<a href=\"/api/application.html\">应用实例<a>和传递给 <code>app.use()<code> 的额外选项作为参数：<p><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> myPlugin<span><span> =<span><span> {<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/reusability/plugins.html", "title": "插件 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "eb3d1144e0ec40b5b5ce15f13a5dfea9", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 378, "chunk_index": 2, "_doc_id": "2_3374929691453360183"}}
{"doc_id": "3_416382935403796471", "text": "\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> myPlugin<span><span> =<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> install<span><span>(<span><span>app<span><span>, <span><span>options<span><span>) {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 配置此应用<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/reusability/plugins.html", "title": "插件 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "eb3d1144e0ec40b5b5ce15f13a5dfea9", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 378, "chunk_index": 3, "_doc_id": "3_416382935403796471"}}
{"doc_id": "4_3544679810014737843", "text": "<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 配置此应用<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span><code><pre><div><p>插件没有严格定义的使用范围，但是插件发挥作用的常见场景主要包括以下几种：<p><ol><li><p>通过 <a href=\"/api/application.html#app-component\"><code>app.component()<code><a> 和 <a href=\"/api/application.html#app-directive\"><code>app.directive()<code><a> 注册一到多个全局组件或自定义指令。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/reusability/plugins.html", "title": "插件 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "eb3d1144e0ec40b5b5ce15f13a5dfea9", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 378, "chunk_index": 4, "_doc_id": "4_3544679810014737843"}}
{"doc_id": "5_4246401145153986171", "text": "<a> 和 <a href=\"/api/application.html#app-directive\"><code>app.directive()<code><a> 注册一到多个全局组件或自定义指令。<p><li><li><p>通过 <a href=\"/api/application.html#app-provide\"><code>app.provide()<code><a> 使一个资源<a href=\"/guide/components/provide-inject.html\">可被注入<a>进整个应用。<p><li><li><p>向 <a href=\"/api/application.html#app-config-globalproperties\"><code>app.config.globalProperties<code><a> 中添加一些全局实例属性或方法<p><li><li><p>一个可能上述三种都包含了的功能库 (例如 <a href=\"https://github.com/vuejs/vue-router-next\" target=\"_blank\">vue-router<a>)。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/reusability/plugins.html", "title": "插件 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "eb3d1144e0ec40b5b5ce15f13a5dfea9", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 378, "chunk_index": 5, "_doc_id": "5_4246401145153986171"}}
{"doc_id": "6_7092477495929906801", "text": "能上述三种都包含了的功能库 (例如 <a href=\"https://github.com/vuejs/vue-router-next\" target=\"_blank\">vue-router<a>)。<p><li><ol><h2 id=\"writing-a-plugin\">编写一个插件 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#writing-a-plugin\">​<a><h2><p>为了更好地理解如何构建 Vue.js 插件，我们可以试着写一个简单的 <code>i18n<code> (<a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Internationalization_and_localization\" target=\"_blank\">国际化 (Internationalization)<a> 的缩写) 插件。<p><p>让我们从设置插件对象开始。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/reusability/plugins.html", "title": "插件 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "eb3d1144e0ec40b5b5ce15f13a5dfea9", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 378, "chunk_index": 6, "_doc_id": "6_7092477495929906801"}}
{"doc_id": "7_2294151971993937169", "text": "lization_and_localization\" target=\"_blank\">国际化 (Internationalization)<a> 的缩写) 插件。<p><p>让我们从设置插件对象开始。建议在一个单独的文件中创建并导出它，以保证更好地管理逻辑，如下所示：<p><div class=\"vp-code-block-title\"><p class=\"vp-code-block-title-bar\"><span class=\"vp-code-block-title-text\">plugins/i18n.js<span><p><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/reusability/plugins.html", "title": "插件 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "eb3d1144e0ec40b5b5ce15f13a5dfea9", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 378, "chunk_index": 7, "_doc_id": "7_2294151971993937169"}}
{"doc_id": "8_3580437134999047433", "text": "b-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> install<span><span>: (<span><span>app<span><span>, <span><span>options<span><span>) <span><span>=><span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 在这里编写插件代码<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span><code><pre><div><div><p>我们希望有一个翻译函数，这个函数接收一个以 <code>.<code> 作为分隔符的 <code>key<code> 字符串，用来在用户提供的翻译字典中查找对应语言的文本。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/reusability/plugins.html", "title": "插件 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "eb3d1144e0ec40b5b5ce15f13a5dfea9", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 378, "chunk_index": 8, "_doc_id": "8_3580437134999047433"}}
{"doc_id": "9_1122899782572828748", "text": "><div><div><p>我们希望有一个翻译函数，这个函数接收一个以 <code>.<code> 作为分隔符的 <code>key<code> 字符串，用来在用户提供的翻译字典中查找对应语言的文本。期望的使用方式如下：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>h1<span><span>>{{ <span><span>$translate<span><span>(<span><span>'greetings.hello'<span><span>) }}</<span><span>h1<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>这个函数应当能够在任意模板中被全局调用。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/reusability/plugins.html", "title": "插件 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "eb3d1144e0ec40b5b5ce15f13a5dfea9", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 378, "chunk_index": 9, "_doc_id": "9_1122899782572828748"}}
{"doc_id": "10_5705557936894747324", "text": "llo'<span><span>) }}</<span><span>h1<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>这个函数应当能够在任意模板中被全局调用。这一点可以通过在插件中将它添加到 <code>app.config.globalProperties<code> 上来实现：<p><div class=\"vp-code-block-title\"><p class=\"vp-code-block-title-bar\"><span class=\"vp-code-block-title-text\">plugins/i18n.js<span><p><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/reusability/plugins.html", "title": "插件 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "eb3d1144e0ec40b5b5ce15f13a5dfea9", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 378, "chunk_index": 10, "_doc_id": "10_5705557936894747324"}}
{"doc_id": "11_3536719242354412608", "text": "b-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> install<span><span>: (<span><span>app<span><span>, <span><span>options<span><span>) <span><span>=><span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line highlighted\"><span> // 注入一个全局可用的 $translate() 方法<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/reusability/plugins.html", "title": "插件 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "eb3d1144e0ec40b5b5ce15f13a5dfea9", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 378, "chunk_index": 11, "_doc_id": "11_3536719242354412608"}}
{"doc_id": "12_4837349727779318903", "text": "<span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line highlighted\"><span> // 注入一个全局可用的 $translate() 方法<span><span>\n<span class=\"line highlighted\"><span> app.config.globalProperties.<span><span>$translate<span><span> =<span><span> (<span><span>key<span><span>) <span><span>=><span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line highlighted\"><span> // 获取 `options` 对象的深层属性<span><span>\n<span class=\"line highlighted\"><span> // 使用 `key` 作为索引<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/reusability/plugins.html", "title": "插件 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "eb3d1144e0ec40b5b5ce15f13a5dfea9", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 378, "chunk_index": 12, "_doc_id": "12_4837349727779318903"}}
{"doc_id": "13_7261485880680994903", "text": "获取 `options` 对象的深层属性<span><span>\n<span class=\"line highlighted\"><span> // 使用 `key` 作为索引<span><span>\n<span class=\"line highlighted\"><span> return<span><span> key.<span><span>split<span><span>(<span><span>'.'<span><span>).<span><span>reduce<span><span>((<span><span>o<span><span>, <span><span>i<span><span>) <span><span>=><span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line highlighted\"><span> if<span><span> (o) <span><span>return<span><span> o[i]<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/reusability/plugins.html", "title": "插件 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "eb3d1144e0ec40b5b5ce15f13a5dfea9", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 378, "chunk_index": 13, "_doc_id": "13_7261485880680994903"}}
{"doc_id": "14_8786014986502264295", "text": "class=\"line highlighted\"><span> if<span><span> (o) <span><span>return<span><span> o[i]<span><span>\n<span class=\"line highlighted\"><span> }, options)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line highlighted\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/reusability/plugins.html", "title": "插件 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "eb3d1144e0ec40b5b5ce15f13a5dfea9", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 378, "chunk_index": 14, "_doc_id": "14_8786014986502264295"}}
{"doc_id": "15_5571986517150937184", "text": "><span>\n<span class=\"line highlighted\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span><code><pre><div><div><p>我们的 <code>$translate<code> 函数会接收一个例如 <code>greetings.hello<code> 的字符串，在用户提供的翻译字典中查找，并返回翻译得到的值。<p><p>用于查找的翻译字典对象则应当在插件被安装时作为 <code>app.use()<code> 的额外参数被传入：<p><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>import<span><span> i18nPlugin <span><span>from<span><span> './plugins/i18n'<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/reusability/plugins.html", "title": "插件 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "eb3d1144e0ec40b5b5ce15f13a5dfea9", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 378, "chunk_index": 15, "_doc_id": "15_5571986517150937184"}}
{"doc_id": "16_1026203998712371700", "text": "line\"><span>import<span><span> i18nPlugin <span><span>from<span><span> './plugins/i18n'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>app.<span><span>use<span><span>(i18nPlugin, {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> greetings: {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> hello: <span><span>'Bonjour!'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/reusability/plugins.html", "title": "插件 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "eb3d1144e0ec40b5b5ce15f13a5dfea9", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 378, "chunk_index": 16, "_doc_id": "16_1026203998712371700"}}
{"doc_id": "17_1395000501564248002", "text": "ass=\"line\"><span> hello: <span><span>'Bonjour!'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>})<span><span><code><pre><div><p>这样，我们一开始的表达式 <code>$translate('greetings.hello')<code> 就会在运行时被替换为 <code>Bonjour!<code> 了。<p><p>TypeScript 用户请参考：<a href=\"/guide/typescript/options-api.html#augmenting-global-properties\">扩展全局属性<a> <p><div class=\"tip custom-block\"><p class=\"custom-block-title\">TIP<p><p>请谨慎使用全局属性，如果在整个应用中使用不同插件注入的太多全局属性，很容易让应用变得难以理解和维护。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/reusability/plugins.html", "title": "插件 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "eb3d1144e0ec40b5b5ce15f13a5dfea9", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 378, "chunk_index": 17, "_doc_id": "17_1395000501564248002"}}
{"doc_id": "18_5102605589634443041", "text": "tom-block\"><p class=\"custom-block-title\">TIP<p><p>请谨慎使用全局属性，如果在整个应用中使用不同插件注入的太多全局属性，很容易让应用变得难以理解和维护。<p><div><h3 id=\"provide-inject-with-plugins\">插件中的 Provide / Inject <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#provide-inject-with-plugins\">​<a><h3><p>在插件中，我们可以通过 <code>provide<code> 来为插件用户提供访问某个函数或属性的能力。举例来说，我们可以将插件接收到的 <code>options<code> 参数提供给整个应用，让任何组件都能使用这个翻译字典对象。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/reusability/plugins.html", "title": "插件 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "eb3d1144e0ec40b5b5ce15f13a5dfea9", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 378, "chunk_index": 18, "_doc_id": "18_5102605589634443041"}}
{"doc_id": "19_7068142497550008731", "text": "provide<code> 来为插件用户提供访问某个函数或属性的能力。举例来说，我们可以将插件接收到的 <code>options<code> 参数提供给整个应用，让任何组件都能使用这个翻译字典对象。<p><div class=\"vp-code-block-title\"><p class=\"vp-code-block-title-bar\"><span class=\"vp-code-block-title-text\">plugins/i18n.js<span><p><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/reusability/plugins.html", "title": "插件 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "eb3d1144e0ec40b5b5ce15f13a5dfea9", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 378, "chunk_index": 19, "_doc_id": "19_7068142497550008731"}}
{"doc_id": "20_3800879259054431984", "text": "b-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> install<span><span>: (<span><span>app<span><span>, <span><span>options<span><span>) <span><span>=><span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line highlighted\"><span> app.<span><span>provide<span><span>(<span><span>'i18n'<span><span>, options)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/reusability/plugins.html", "title": "插件 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "eb3d1144e0ec40b5b5ce15f13a5dfea9", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 378, "chunk_index": 20, "_doc_id": "20_3800879259054431984"}}
{"doc_id": "21_7334704036411695462", "text": "<span>(<span><span>'i18n'<span><span>, options)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span><code><pre><div><div><p>现在，插件用户就可以在他们的组件中以 <code>i18n<code> 为 key 注入并访问插件的选项对象了。<p><div class=\"composition-api\"><div class=\"language-vue\"> <span class=\"lang\">vue<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>script<span><span> setup<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/reusability/plugins.html", "title": "插件 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "eb3d1144e0ec40b5b5ce15f13a5dfea9", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 378, "chunk_index": 21, "_doc_id": "21_7334704036411695462"}}
{"doc_id": "22_6108058491823397978", "text": "code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>script<span><span> setup<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>import<span><span> { inject } <span><span>from<span><span> 'vue'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line highlighted\"><span>const<span><span> i18n<span><span> =<span><span> inject<span><span>(<span><span>'i18n'<span><span>)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>console.<span><span>log<span><span>(i18n.greetings.hello)<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/reusability/plugins.html", "title": "插件 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "eb3d1144e0ec40b5b5ce15f13a5dfea9", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 378, "chunk_index": 22, "_doc_id": "22_6108058491823397978"}}
{"doc_id": "23_3829606015929164516", "text": "pan>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>console.<span><span>log<span><span>(i18n.greetings.hello)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>script<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><div><div class=\"options-api\"><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line highlighted\"><span> inject: [<span><span>'i18n'<span><span>],<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/reusability/plugins.html", "title": "插件 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "eb3d1144e0ec40b5b5ce15f13a5dfea9", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 378, "chunk_index": 23, "_doc_id": "23_3829606015929164516"}}
{"doc_id": "24_3339583222648423302", "text": "><span>\n<span class=\"line highlighted\"><span> inject: [<span><span>'i18n'<span><span>],<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> created<span><span>() {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> console.<span><span>log<span><span>(<span><span>this<span><span>.i18n.greetings.hello)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/reusability/plugins.html", "title": "插件 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "eb3d1144e0ec40b5b5ce15f13a5dfea9", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 378, "chunk_index": 24, "_doc_id": "24_3339583222648423302"}}
{"doc_id": "25_8578304339949412281", "text": "an><span>this<span><span>.i18n.greetings.hello)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span><code><pre><div><div><h3 id=\"为-npm-打包\">为 NPM 打包 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#%E4%B8%BA-npm-%E6%89%93%E5%8C%85\">​<a><h3><p>如果你想进一步打包并发布插件给他人使用，请参阅 <a href=\"https://vite.dev/guide/build.html#library-mode\" target=\"_blank\">Vite 库模式<a>。<p><div><div>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/reusability/plugins.html", "title": "插件 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "eb3d1144e0ec40b5b5ce15f13a5dfea9", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 378, "chunk_index": 25, "_doc_id": "25_8578304339949412281"}}
{"doc_id": "0_8467981841934067824", "text": "<div><div><h1 id=\"transition\">Transition <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#transition\">​<a><h1><p>Vue 提供了两个内置组件，可以帮助你制作基于状态变化的过渡和动画：<p><p>除了这两个组件，我们也可以通过其他技术手段来应用动画，比如切换 CSS class 或用状态绑定样式来驱动动画。这些其他的方法会在<a href=\"/guide/extras/animation.html\">动画技巧<a>章节中展开。<p><h2 id=\"the-transition-component\"><code><Transition><code> 组件 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#the-transition-component\">​<a><h2><p><code><Transition><code> 是一个内置组件，这意味着它在任意别的组件中都可以被使用，无需注册。它可以将进入和离开动画应用到通过默认插槽传递给它的元素或组件上。进入或离开可以由以下的条件之一触发：<p><ul><li>由", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/transition.html", "title": "Transition | Vue.js", "doc_id": "5c4993fc923c4a10bcf217636c8d459d", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1496, "chunk_index": 0, "_doc_id": "0_8467981841934067824"}}
{"doc_id": "1_5588558747475527668", "text": "de> 是一个内置组件，这意味着它在任意别的组件中都可以被使用，无需注册。它可以将进入和离开动画应用到通过默认插槽传递给它的元素或组件上。进入或离开可以由以下的条件之一触发：<p><ul><li>由 <code>v-if<code> 所触发的切换<li><li>由 <code>v-show<code> 所触发的切换<li><li>由特殊元素 <code><component><code> 切换的动态组件<li><li>改变特殊的 <code>key<code> 属性<li><ul><p>以下是最基本用法的示例：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>button<span><span> @<span><span>click<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>show", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/transition.html", "title": "Transition | Vue.js", "doc_id": "5c4993fc923c4a10bcf217636c8d459d", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1496, "chunk_index": 1, "_doc_id": "1_5588558747475527668"}}
{"doc_id": "2_8561560647092155725", "text": "><span><<span><span>button<span><span> @<span><span>click<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>show <span><span>=<span><span> !<span><span>show<span><span>\"<span><span>>Toggle</<span><span>button<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>Transition<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>p<span><span> v-if<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>show<span><span>\"<span><span>>hello</<span><span>p<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/transition.html", "title": "Transition | Vue.js", "doc_id": "5c4993fc923c4a10bcf217636c8d459d", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1496, "chunk_index": 2, "_doc_id": "2_8561560647092155725"}}
{"doc_id": "3_9071841483440123769", "text": "span><span>\"<span><span>show<span><span>\"<span><span>>hello</<span><span>p<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>Transition<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><div class=\"language-css\"> <span class=\"lang\">css<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>/* 下面我们会解释这些 class 是做什么的 */<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>.v-enter-active<span><span>,<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>.v-leave-active<span><span> {<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/transition.html", "title": "Transition | Vue.js", "doc_id": "5c4993fc923c4a10bcf217636c8d459d", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1496, "chunk_index": 3, "_doc_id": "3_9071841483440123769"}}
{"doc_id": "4_6347913501385113514", "text": "-active<span><span>,<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>.v-leave-active<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> transition<span><span>: opacity <span><span>0.5<span><span>s<span><span> ease<span><span>;<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>.v-enter-from<span><span>,<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>.v-leave-to<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> opacity<span><span>: <span><span>0<span><span>;<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/transition.html", "title": "Transition | Vue.js", "doc_id": "5c4993fc923c4a10bcf217636c8d459d", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1496, "chunk_index": 4, "_doc_id": "4_6347913501385113514"}}
{"doc_id": "5_6309955168331021219", "text": "{<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> opacity<span><span>: <span><span>0<span><span>;<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span><code><pre><div><div class=\"tip custom-block\"><p class=\"custom-block-title\">TIP<p><p><code><Transition><code> 仅支持单个元素或组件作为其插槽内容。如果内容是一个组件，这个组件必须仅有一个根元素。<p><div><p>当一个 <code><Transition><code> 组件中的元素被插入或移除时，会发生下面这些事情：<p><ol><li><p>Vue 会自动检测目标元素是否应用了 CSS 过渡或动画。如果是，则一些 <a href=\"#transition-classes\">CSS 过渡 class<a> 会在适当的时机被添加和移除。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/transition.html", "title": "Transition | Vue.js", "doc_id": "5c4993fc923c4a10bcf217636c8d459d", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1496, "chunk_index": 5, "_doc_id": "5_6309955168331021219"}}
{"doc_id": "6_4717575409271632678", "text": "<p>Vue 会自动检测目标元素是否应用了 CSS 过渡或动画。如果是，则一些 <a href=\"#transition-classes\">CSS 过渡 class<a> 会在适当的时机被添加和移除。<p><li><li><p>如果有作为监听器的 <a href=\"#javascript-hooks\">JavaScript 钩子<a>，这些钩子函数会在适当时机被调用。<p><li><li><p>如果没有探测到 CSS 过渡或动画、也没有提供 JavaScript 钩子，那么 DOM 的插入、删除操作将在浏览器的下一个动画帧后执行。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/transition.html", "title": "Transition | Vue.js", "doc_id": "5c4993fc923c4a10bcf217636c8d459d", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1496, "chunk_index": 6, "_doc_id": "6_4717575409271632678"}}
{"doc_id": "7_338711562849986240", "text": "，这些钩子函数会在适当时机被调用。<p><li><li><p>如果没有探测到 CSS 过渡或动画、也没有提供 JavaScript 钩子，那么 DOM 的插入、删除操作将在浏览器的下一个动画帧后执行。<p><li><ol><h2 id=\"css-based-transitions\">基于 CSS 的过渡效果 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#css-based-transitions\">​<a><h2><h3 id=\"transition-classes\">CSS 过渡 class <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#transition-classes\">​<a><h3><p>一共有 6 个应用于进入与离开过渡效果的 CSS class。<p><p> <p><ol><li><p><code>v-enter-from<code>：进入动画的起始状态。在元素插入之前添加，在元素插入完成后的下一帧移除。<p><li><li><p><code>v-enter-active<code>：进入动画的生效状态。应用于整个进入动画阶段。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/transition.html", "title": "Transition | Vue.js", "doc_id": "5c4993fc923c4a10bcf217636c8d459d", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1496, "chunk_index": 7, "_doc_id": "7_338711562849986240"}}
{"doc_id": "8_2756814679089051902", "text": ">：进入动画的起始状态。在元素插入之前添加，在元素插入完成后的下一帧移除。<p><li><li><p><code>v-enter-active<code>：进入动画的生效状态。应用于整个进入动画阶段。在元素被插入之前添加，在过渡或动画完成之后移除。这个 class 可以被用来定义进入动画的持续时间、延迟与速度曲线类型。<p><li><li><p><code>v-enter-to<code>：进入动画的结束状态。在元素插入完成后的下一帧被添加 (也就是 <code>v-enter-from<code> 被移除的同时)，在过渡或动画完成之后移除。<p><li><li><p><code>v-leave-from<code>：离开动画的起始状态。在离开过渡效果被触发时立即添加，在一帧后被移除。<p><li><li><p><code>v-leave-active<code>：离开动画的生效状态。应用于整个离开动画阶段。在离开过渡效果被触发时立即添加，在过渡或动画完成之后移除。这个 class 可以被用来定义离开动画的持续时间、延迟与速度曲线类型。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/transition.html", "title": "Transition | Vue.js", "doc_id": "5c4993fc923c4a10bcf217636c8d459d", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1496, "chunk_index": 8, "_doc_id": "8_2756814679089051902"}}
{"doc_id": "9_5827360382190076011", "text": "active<code>：离开动画的生效状态。应用于整个离开动画阶段。在离开过渡效果被触发时立即添加，在过渡或动画完成之后移除。这个 class 可以被用来定义离开动画的持续时间、延迟与速度曲线类型。<p><li><li><p><code>v-leave-to<code>：离开动画的结束状态。在一个离开动画被触发后的下一帧被添加 (也就是 <code>v-leave-from<code> 被移除的同时)，在过渡或动画完成之后移除。<p><li><ol><p><code>v-enter-active<code> 和 <code>v-leave-active<code> 给我们提供了为进入和离开动画指定不同速度曲线的能力，我们将在下面的小节中看到一个示例。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/transition.html", "title": "Transition | Vue.js", "doc_id": "5c4993fc923c4a10bcf217636c8d459d", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1496, "chunk_index": 9, "_doc_id": "9_5827360382190076011"}}
{"doc_id": "10_139603806124380782", "text": "><code>v-enter-active<code> 和 <code>v-leave-active<code> 给我们提供了为进入和离开动画指定不同速度曲线的能力，我们将在下面的小节中看到一个示例。<p><h3 id=\"named-transitions\">为过渡效果命名 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#named-transitions\">​<a><h3><p>我们可以给 <code><Transition><code> 组件传一个 <code>name<code> prop 来声明一个过渡效果名：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>Transition<span><span> name<span><span>=<span><span>\"fade\"<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/transition.html", "title": "Transition | Vue.js", "doc_id": "5c4993fc923c4a10bcf217636c8d459d", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1496, "chunk_index": 10, "_doc_id": "10_139603806124380782"}}
{"doc_id": "11_6998711790743445374", "text": "an><<span><span>Transition<span><span> name<span><span>=<span><span>\"fade\"<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> ...<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/transition.html", "title": "Transition | Vue.js", "doc_id": "5c4993fc923c4a10bcf217636c8d459d", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1496, "chunk_index": 11, "_doc_id": "11_6998711790743445374"}}
{"doc_id": "12_5202810404440570393", "text": "e<span><span>=<span><span>\"fade\"<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> ...<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>Transition<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>对于一个有名字的过渡效果，对它起作用的过渡 class 会以其名字而不是 <code>v<code> 作为前缀。比如，上方例子中被应用的 class 将会是 <code>fade-enter-active<code> 而不是 <code>v-enter-active<code>。这个“fade”过渡的 class 应该是这样：<p><div class=\"language-css\"> <span class=\"lang\">css<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>.fade-enter-active<span><span>,<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/transition.html", "title": "Transition | Vue.js", "doc_id": "5c4993fc923c4a10bcf217636c8d459d", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1496, "chunk_index": 12, "_doc_id": "12_5202810404440570393"}}
{"doc_id": "13_4513188545132730450", "text": "iki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>.fade-enter-active<span><span>,<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>.fade-leave-active<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> transition<span><span>: opacity <span><span>0.5<span><span>s<span><span> ease<span><span>;<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>.fade-enter-from<span><span>,<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>.fade-leave-to<span><span> {<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/transition.html", "title": "Transition | Vue.js", "doc_id": "5c4993fc923c4a10bcf217636c8d459d", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1496, "chunk_index": 13, "_doc_id": "13_4513188545132730450"}}
{"doc_id": "14_7768966974828748254", "text": "ter-from<span><span>,<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>.fade-leave-to<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> opacity<span><span>: <span><span>0<span><span>;<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/transition.html", "title": "Transition | Vue.js", "doc_id": "5c4993fc923c4a10bcf217636c8d459d", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1496, "chunk_index": 14, "_doc_id": "14_7768966974828748254"}}
{"doc_id": "15_8100999396790678586", "text": "{<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> opacity<span><span>: <span><span>0<span><span>;<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span><code><pre><div><h3 id=\"css-transitions\">CSS 的 transition <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#css-transitions\">​<a><h3><p><code><Transition><code> 一般都会搭配<a href=\"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/CSS/CSS_Transitions/Using_CSS_transitions\" target=\"_blank\">原生 CSS 过渡<a>一起使用，正如你在上面的例子中所看到的那样。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/transition.html", "title": "Transition | Vue.js", "doc_id": "5c4993fc923c4a10bcf217636c8d459d", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1496, "chunk_index": 15, "_doc_id": "15_8100999396790678586"}}
{"doc_id": "16_3982018251442493759", "text": "cs/Web/CSS/CSS_Transitions/Using_CSS_transitions\" target=\"_blank\">原生 CSS 过渡<a>一起使用，正如你在上面的例子中所看到的那样。这个 <code>transition<code> CSS 属性是一个简写形式，使我们可以一次定义一个过渡的各个方面，包括需要执行动画的属性、持续时间和<a href=\"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/CSS/easing-function\" target=\"_blank\">速度曲线<a>。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/transition.html", "title": "Transition | Vue.js", "doc_id": "5c4993fc923c4a10bcf217636c8d459d", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1496, "chunk_index": 16, "_doc_id": "16_3982018251442493759"}}
{"doc_id": "17_879769564371021801", "text": "和<a href=\"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/CSS/easing-function\" target=\"_blank\">速度曲线<a>。<p><p>下面是一个更高级的例子，它使用了不同的持续时间和速度曲线来过渡多个属性：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>Transition<span><span> name<span><span>=<span><span>\"slide-fade\"<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/transition.html", "title": "Transition | Vue.js", "doc_id": "5c4993fc923c4a10bcf217636c8d459d", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1496, "chunk_index": 17, "_doc_id": "17_879769564371021801"}}
{"doc_id": "18_4982099243294632273", "text": "pan><span>Transition<span><span> name<span><span>=<span><span>\"slide-fade\"<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>p<span><span> v-if<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>show<span><span>\"<span><span>>hello</<span><span>p<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>Transition<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><div class=\"language-css\"> <span class=\"lang\">css<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>/*<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/transition.html", "title": "Transition | Vue.js", "doc_id": "5c4993fc923c4a10bcf217636c8d459d", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1496, "chunk_index": 18, "_doc_id": "18_4982099243294632273"}}
{"doc_id": "19_6941440197094911466", "text": "lang\">css<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>/*<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> 进入和离开动画可以使用不同<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> 持续时间和速度曲线。<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>*/<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>.slide-fade-enter-active<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> transition<span><span>: <span><span>all<span><span> 0.3<span><span>s<span><span> ease-out<span><span>;<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/transition.html", "title": "Transition | Vue.js", "doc_id": "5c4993fc923c4a10bcf217636c8d459d", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1496, "chunk_index": 19, "_doc_id": "19_6941440197094911466"}}
{"doc_id": "20_5718532518635320734", "text": "3<span><span>s<span><span> ease-out<span><span>;<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>.slide-fade-leave-active<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> transition<span><span>: <span><span>all<span><span> 0.8<span><span>s<span><span> cubic-bezier<span><span>(<span><span>1<span><span>, <span><span>0.5<span><span>, <span><span>0.8<span><span>, <span><span>1<span><span>);<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/transition.html", "title": "Transition | Vue.js", "doc_id": "5c4993fc923c4a10bcf217636c8d459d", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1496, "chunk_index": 20, "_doc_id": "20_5718532518635320734"}}
{"doc_id": "21_3551732625177024532", "text": "pan>0.8<span><span>, <span><span>1<span><span>);<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>.slide-fade-enter-from<span><span>,<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>.slide-fade-leave-to<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> transform<span><span>: <span><span>translateX<span><span>(<span><span>20<span><span>px<span><span>);<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> opacity<span><span>: <span><span>0<span><span>;<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/transition.html", "title": "Transition | Vue.js", "doc_id": "5c4993fc923c4a10bcf217636c8d459d", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1496, "chunk_index": 21, "_doc_id": "21_3551732625177024532"}}
{"doc_id": "22_5154326489638797419", "text": ";<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> opacity<span><span>: <span><span>0<span><span>;<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span><code><pre><div><h3 id=\"css-animations\">CSS 的 animation <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#css-animations\">​<a><h3><p><a href=\"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/CSS/CSS_Animations/Using_CSS_animations\" target=\"_blank\">原生 CSS 动画<a>和 CSS transition 的应用方式基本上是相同的，只有一点不同，那就是 <code>*-enter-from<code> 不是在元素插入后立即移除，而是在一个 <code>animationend<code> 事件触发时被移除。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/transition.html", "title": "Transition | Vue.js", "doc_id": "5c4993fc923c4a10bcf217636c8d459d", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1496, "chunk_index": 22, "_doc_id": "22_5154326489638797419"}}
{"doc_id": "23_1793566606025405735", "text": "用方式基本上是相同的，只有一点不同，那就是 <code>*-enter-from<code> 不是在元素插入后立即移除，而是在一个 <code>animationend<code> 事件触发时被移除。<p><p>对于大多数的 CSS 动画，我们可以简单地在 <code>*-enter-active<code> 和 <code>*-leave-active<code> class 下声明它们。下面是一个示例：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>Transition<span><span> name<span><span>=<span><span>\"bounce\"<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/transition.html", "title": "Transition | Vue.js", "doc_id": "5c4993fc923c4a10bcf217636c8d459d", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1496, "chunk_index": 23, "_doc_id": "23_1793566606025405735"}}
{"doc_id": "24_7337011950338925813", "text": "><<span><span>Transition<span><span> name<span><span>=<span><span>\"bounce\"<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>p<span><span> v-if<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>show<span><span>\"<span><span> style<span><span>=<span><span>\"text-align: center;\"<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> Hello here is some bouncy text!<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> </<span><span>p<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/transition.html", "title": "Transition | Vue.js", "doc_id": "5c4993fc923c4a10bcf217636c8d459d", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1496, "chunk_index": 24, "_doc_id": "24_7337011950338925813"}}
{"doc_id": "25_627988197131856419", "text": "is some bouncy text!<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> </<span><span>p<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>Transition<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><div class=\"language-css\"> <span class=\"lang\">css<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>.bounce-enter-active<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> animation<span><span>: bounce-in <span><span>0.5<span><span>s<span><span>;<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/transition.html", "title": "Transition | Vue.js", "doc_id": "5c4993fc923c4a10bcf217636c8d459d", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1496, "chunk_index": 25, "_doc_id": "25_627988197131856419"}}
{"doc_id": "26_4893921542749193444", "text": "line\"><span> animation<span><span>: bounce-in <span><span>0.5<span><span>s<span><span>;<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>.bounce-leave-active<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> animation<span><span>: bounce-in <span><span>0.5<span><span>s<span><span> reverse<span><span>;<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>@keyframes<span><span> bounce-in<span><span> {<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/transition.html", "title": "Transition | Vue.js", "doc_id": "5c4993fc923c4a10bcf217636c8d459d", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1496, "chunk_index": 26, "_doc_id": "26_4893921542749193444"}}
{"doc_id": "27_8303599777005647929", "text": "n>}<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>@keyframes<span><span> bounce-in<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> 0%<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> transform<span><span>: <span><span>scale<span><span>(<span><span>0<span><span>);<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> 50%<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> transform<span><span>: <span><span>scale<span><span>(<span><span>1.25<span><span>);<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/transition.html", "title": "Transition | Vue.js", "doc_id": "5c4993fc923c4a10bcf217636c8d459d", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1496, "chunk_index": 27, "_doc_id": "27_8303599777005647929"}}
{"doc_id": "28_5297768019859005799", "text": "an> transform<span><span>: <span><span>scale<span><span>(<span><span>1.25<span><span>);<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> 100%<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> transform<span><span>: <span><span>scale<span><span>(<span><span>1<span><span>);<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span><code><pre><div><div class=\"demo\"> Toggle <p> Hello here is some bouncy text!", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/transition.html", "title": "Transition | Vue.js", "doc_id": "5c4993fc923c4a10bcf217636c8d459d", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1496, "chunk_index": 28, "_doc_id": "28_5297768019859005799"}}
{"doc_id": "29_452228200065062920", "text": "e\"><span>}<span><span><code><pre><div><div class=\"demo\"> Toggle <p> Hello here is some bouncy text! <p><div><h3 id=\"custom-transition-classes\">自定义过渡 class <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#custom-transition-classes\">​<a><h3><p>你也可以向 <code><Transition><code> 传递以下的 props 来指定自定义的过渡 class：<p><ul><li><code>enter-from-class<code><li><li><code>enter-active-class<code><li><li><code>enter-to-class<code><li><li><code>leave-from-class<code><li><li><code>leave-active-class<code><li><li><code>leave-to-class<code><li><ul><p>你传入的这些 class 会覆盖相应阶段的默认 class 名。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/transition.html", "title": "Transition | Vue.js", "doc_id": "5c4993fc923c4a10bcf217636c8d459d", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1496, "chunk_index": 29, "_doc_id": "29_452228200065062920"}}
{"doc_id": "30_1325635383846361411", "text": "eave-active-class<code><li><li><code>leave-to-class<code><li><ul><p>你传入的这些 class 会覆盖相应阶段的默认 class 名。这个功能在你想要在 Vue 的动画机制下集成其他的第三方 CSS 动画库时非常有用，比如 <a href=\"https://daneden.github.io/animate.css/\" target=\"_blank\">Animate.css<a>：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><!-- 假设你已经在页面中引入了 Animate.css --><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>Transition<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/transition.html", "title": "Transition | Vue.js", "doc_id": "5c4993fc923c4a10bcf217636c8d459d", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1496, "chunk_index": 30, "_doc_id": "30_1325635383846361411"}}
{"doc_id": "31_7361464434484588573", "text": "你已经在页面中引入了 Animate.css --><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>Transition<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> name<span><span>=<span><span>\"custom-classes\"<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> enter-active-class<span><span>=<span><span>\"animate__animated animate__tada\"<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> leave-active-class<span><span>=<span><span>\"animate__animated animate__bounceOutRight\"<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/transition.html", "title": "Transition | Vue.js", "doc_id": "5c4993fc923c4a10bcf217636c8d459d", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1496, "chunk_index": 31, "_doc_id": "31_7361464434484588573"}}
{"doc_id": "32_6938974746561698417", "text": "span>\"animate__animated animate__bounceOutRight\"<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>p<span><span> v-if<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>show<span><span>\"<span><span>>hello</<span><span>p<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/transition.html", "title": "Transition | Vue.js", "doc_id": "5c4993fc923c4a10bcf217636c8d459d", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1496, "chunk_index": 32, "_doc_id": "32_6938974746561698417"}}
{"doc_id": "33_7702468078696166829", "text": "span><span>\"<span><span>show<span><span>\"<span><span>>hello</<span><span>p<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>Transition<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><h3 id=\"using-transitions-and-animations-together\">同时使用 transition 和 animation <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#using-transitions-and-animations-together\">​<a><h3><p>Vue 需要附加事件监听器，以便知道过渡何时结束。可以是 <code>transitionend<code> 或 <code>animationend<code>，这取决于你所应用的 CSS 规则。如果你仅仅使用二者的其中之一，Vue 可以自动探测到正确的类型。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/transition.html", "title": "Transition | Vue.js", "doc_id": "5c4993fc923c4a10bcf217636c8d459d", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1496, "chunk_index": 33, "_doc_id": "33_7702468078696166829"}}
{"doc_id": "34_479159171458494971", "text": "ode>transitionend<code> 或 <code>animationend<code>，这取决于你所应用的 CSS 规则。如果你仅仅使用二者的其中之一，Vue 可以自动探测到正确的类型。<p><p>然而在某些场景中，你或许想要在同一个元素上同时使用它们两个。举例来说，Vue 触发了一个 CSS 动画，同时鼠标悬停触发另一个 CSS 过渡。此时你需要显式地传入 <code>type<code> prop 来声明，告诉 Vue 需要关心哪种类型，传入的值是 <code>animation<code> 或 <code>transition<code>：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>Transition<span><span> type<span><span>=<span><span>\"animation\"<span><span>>..", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/transition.html", "title": "Transition | Vue.js", "doc_id": "5c4993fc923c4a10bcf217636c8d459d", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1496, "chunk_index": 34, "_doc_id": "34_479159171458494971"}}
{"doc_id": "35_6701089490036599690", "text": "e\"><span><<span><span>Transition<span><span> type<span><span>=<span><span>\"animation\"<span><span>>...</<span><span>Transition<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><h3 id=\"nested-transitions-and-explicit-transition-durations\">深层级过渡与显式过渡时长 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#nested-transitions-and-explicit-transition-durations\">​<a><h3><p>尽管过渡 class 仅能应用在 <code><Transition><code> 的直接子元素上，我们还是可以使用深层级的 CSS 选择器，", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/transition.html", "title": "Transition | Vue.js", "doc_id": "5c4993fc923c4a10bcf217636c8d459d", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1496, "chunk_index": 35, "_doc_id": "35_6701089490036599690"}}
{"doc_id": "36_3573072055035230494", "text": "sition-durations\">​<a><h3><p>尽管过渡 class 仅能应用在 <code><Transition><code> 的直接子元素上，我们还是可以使用深层级的 CSS 选择器，在深层级的元素上触发过渡效果：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>Transition<span><span> name<span><span>=<span><span>\"nested\"<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/transition.html", "title": "Transition | Vue.js", "doc_id": "5c4993fc923c4a10bcf217636c8d459d", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1496, "chunk_index": 36, "_doc_id": "36_3573072055035230494"}}
{"doc_id": "37_6757668644498075124", "text": "><<span><span>Transition<span><span> name<span><span>=<span><span>\"nested\"<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>div<span><span> v-if<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>show<span><span>\"<span><span> class<span><span>=<span><span>\"outer\"<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>div<span><span> class<span><span>=<span><span>\"inner\"<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> Hello<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/transition.html", "title": "Transition | Vue.js", "doc_id": "5c4993fc923c4a10bcf217636c8d459d", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1496, "chunk_index": 37, "_doc_id": "37_6757668644498075124"}}
{"doc_id": "38_3166388456849004133", "text": "pan><span>=<span><span>\"inner\"<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> Hello<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> </<span><span>div<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> </<span><span>div<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>Transition<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><div class=\"language-css\"> <span class=\"lang\">css<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>/* 应用于嵌套元素的规则 */<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/transition.html", "title": "Transition | Vue.js", "doc_id": "5c4993fc923c4a10bcf217636c8d459d", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1496, "chunk_index": 38, "_doc_id": "38_3166388456849004133"}}
{"doc_id": "39_6672908835206104437", "text": "><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>/* 应用于嵌套元素的规则 */<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>.nested-enter-active<span><span> .inner<span><span>,<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>.nested-leave-active<span><span> .inner<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> transition<span><span>: <span><span>all<span><span> 0.3<span><span>s<span><span> ease-in-out<span><span>;<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/transition.html", "title": "Transition | Vue.js", "doc_id": "5c4993fc923c4a10bcf217636c8d459d", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1496, "chunk_index": 39, "_doc_id": "39_6672908835206104437"}}
{"doc_id": "40_8556398391727901966", "text": "se-in-out<span><span>;<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>.nested-enter-from<span><span> .inner<span><span>,<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>.nested-leave-to<span><span> .inner<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> transform<span><span>: <span><span>translateX<span><span>(<span><span>30<span><span>px<span><span>);<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> opacity<span><span>: <span><span>0<span><span>;<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/transition.html", "title": "Transition | Vue.js", "doc_id": "5c4993fc923c4a10bcf217636c8d459d", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1496, "chunk_index": 40, "_doc_id": "40_8556398391727901966"}}
{"doc_id": "41_7345047624238228354", "text": ";<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> opacity<span><span>: <span><span>0<span><span>;<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>/* ... 省略了其他必要的 CSS */<span><span><code><pre><div><p>我们甚至可以在深层元素上添加一个过渡延迟，从而创建一个带渐进延迟的动画序列：<p><div class=\"language-css\"> <span class=\"lang\">css<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>/* 延迟嵌套元素的进入以获得交错效果 */<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/transition.html", "title": "Transition | Vue.js", "doc_id": "5c4993fc923c4a10bcf217636c8d459d", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1496, "chunk_index": 41, "_doc_id": "41_7345047624238228354"}}
{"doc_id": "42_2109631079413702662", "text": "class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>/* 延迟嵌套元素的进入以获得交错效果 */<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>.nested-enter-active<span><span> .inner<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line highlighted\"><span> transition-delay<span><span>: <span><span>0.25<span><span>s<span><span>;<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span><code><pre><div><p>然而，这会带来一个小问题。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/transition.html", "title": "Transition | Vue.js", "doc_id": "5c4993fc923c4a10bcf217636c8d459d", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1496, "chunk_index": 42, "_doc_id": "42_2109631079413702662"}}
{"doc_id": "43_2574492564678331412", "text": "an>s<span><span>;<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span><code><pre><div><p>然而，这会带来一个小问题。默认情况下，<code><Transition><code> 组件会通过监听过渡根元素上的<strong>第一个<strong> <code>transitionend<code> 或者 <code>animationend<code> 事件来尝试自动判断过渡何时结束。而在嵌套的过渡中，期望的行为应该是等待所有内部元素的过渡完成。<p><p>在这种情况下，你可以通过向 <code><Transition><code> 组件传入 <code>duration<code> prop 来显式指定过渡的持续时间 (以毫秒为单位)。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/transition.html", "title": "Transition | Vue.js", "doc_id": "5c4993fc923c4a10bcf217636c8d459d", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1496, "chunk_index": 43, "_doc_id": "43_2574492564678331412"}}
{"doc_id": "44_8839576733860042666", "text": "成。<p><p>在这种情况下，你可以通过向 <code><Transition><code> 组件传入 <code>duration<code> prop 来显式指定过渡的持续时间 (以毫秒为单位)。总持续时间应该匹配延迟加上内部元素的过渡持续时间：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>Transition<span><span> :<span><span>duration<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>550<span><span>\"<span><span>>...</<span><span>Transition<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p><a href=\"https://play.vuejs.org/#eNqVVd9v0zAQ/leO8LAfr", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/transition.html", "title": "Transition | Vue.js", "doc_id": "5c4993fc923c4a10bcf217636c8d459d", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1496, "chunk_index": 44, "_doc_id": "44_8839576733860042666"}}
{"doc_id": "45_2482366750268952531", "text": "on<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p><a href=\"https://play.vuejs.org/#", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/transition.html", "title": "Transition | Vue.js", "doc_id": "5c4993fc923c4a10bcf217636c8d459d", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1496, "chunk_index": 45, "_doc_id": "45_2482366750268952531"}}
{"doc_id": "46_8581649663999166871", "text": "", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/transition.html", "title": "Transition | Vue.js", "doc_id": "5c4993fc923c4a10bcf217636c8d459d", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1496, "chunk_index": 46, "_doc_id": "46_8581649663999166871"}}
{"doc_id": "47_551354260470909958", "text": "VhiEVJ7GftHZTganUZ56EYLL3FykjhL195MlMM7qxXdmEGDPOG6boRE86UJVPMki+p4H01WLz4Fm78hSdBo5xXy+yfsd3bpbXny1SA1M8c82fgcMyW66L75/hmXtN44a120ktDPOL+h1bL1HCPsA42DaPdwge3HcO/TOCb2ZumQJtA15Yl65Crg84S+BdfPtL6lezY8C3GkZ7L6Bc1zNR0=\" target=\"_blank\">在演练场中尝试一下<a><p><p>如果有必要的话，你也可以用对象的形式传入，", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/transition.html", "title": "Transition | Vue.js", "doc_id": "5c4993fc923c4a10bcf217636c8d459d", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1496, "chunk_index": 47, "_doc_id": "47_551354260470909958"}}
{"doc_id": "48_8973442325270134574", "text": "tA15Yl65Crg84S+BdfPtL6lezY8C3GkZ7L6Bc1zNR0=\" target=\"_blank\">在演练场中尝试一下<a><p><p>如果有必要的话，你也可以用对象的形式传入，分开指定进入和离开所需的时间：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>Transition<span><span> :<span><span>duration<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>{ enter: <span><span>500<span><span>,", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/transition.html", "title": "Transition | Vue.js", "doc_id": "5c4993fc923c4a10bcf217636c8d459d", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1496, "chunk_index": 48, "_doc_id": "48_8973442325270134574"}}
{"doc_id": "49_528348088976463451", "text": "n> :<span><span>duration<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>{ enter: <span><span>500<span><span>, leave: <span><span>800<span><span> }<span><span>\"<span><span>>...</<span><span>Transition<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><h3 id=\"performance-considerations\">性能考量 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#performance-considerations\">​<a><h3><p>你可能注意到我们上面例子中展示的动画所用到的 CSS 属性大多是 <code>transform<code> 和 <code>opacity<code> 之类的。用这些属性制作动画非常高效，因为：<p><ol><li><p>他们在动画过程中不会影响到 DOM 结构，因此不会每一帧都触发昂贵的 CSS 布局重新计算。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/transition.html", "title": "Transition | Vue.js", "doc_id": "5c4993fc923c4a10bcf217636c8d459d", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1496, "chunk_index": 49, "_doc_id": "49_528348088976463451"}}
{"doc_id": "50_9034906497311894044", "text": "code>opacity<code> 之类的。用这些属性制作动画非常高效，因为：<p><ol><li><p>他们在动画过程中不会影响到 DOM 结构，因此不会每一帧都触发昂贵的 CSS 布局重新计算。<p><li><li><p>大多数的现代浏览器都可以在执行 <code>transform<code> 动画时利用 GPU 进行硬件加速。<p><li><ol><p>相比之下，像 <code>height<code> 或者 <code>margin<code> 这样的属性会触发 CSS 布局变动，因此执行它们的动画效果更昂贵，需要谨慎使用。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/transition.html", "title": "Transition | Vue.js", "doc_id": "5c4993fc923c4a10bcf217636c8d459d", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1496, "chunk_index": 50, "_doc_id": "50_9034906497311894044"}}
{"doc_id": "51_8329313472395862575", "text": "><li><ol><p>相比之下，像 <code>height<code> 或者 <code>margin<code> 这样的属性会触发 CSS 布局变动，因此执行它们的动画效果更昂贵，需要谨慎使用。<p><h2 id=\"javascript-hooks\">JavaScript 钩子 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#javascript-hooks\">​<a><h2><p>你可以通过监听 <code><Transition><code> 组件事件的方式在过渡过程中挂上钩子函数：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>Transition<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/transition.html", "title": "Transition | Vue.js", "doc_id": "5c4993fc923c4a10bcf217636c8d459d", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1496, "chunk_index": 51, "_doc_id": "51_8329313472395862575"}}
{"doc_id": "52_380478850216114742", "text": "lass=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>Transition<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> @<span><span>before-enter<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>onBeforeEnter<span><span>\"<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> @<span><span>enter<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>onEnter<span><span>\"<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> @<span><span>after-enter<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>onAfterEnter<span><span>\"<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/transition.html", "title": "Transition | Vue.js", "doc_id": "5c4993fc923c4a10bcf217636c8d459d", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1496, "chunk_index": 52, "_doc_id": "52_380478850216114742"}}
{"doc_id": "53_3198307764226648086", "text": "@<span><span>after-enter<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>onAfterEnter<span><span>\"<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> @<span><span>enter-cancelled<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>onEnterCancelled<span><span>\"<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> @<span><span>before-leave<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>onBeforeLeave<span><span>\"<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> @<span><span>leave<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>onLeave<span><span>\"<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/transition.html", "title": "Transition | Vue.js", "doc_id": "5c4993fc923c4a10bcf217636c8d459d", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1496, "chunk_index": 53, "_doc_id": "53_3198307764226648086"}}
{"doc_id": "54_2035870883246565603", "text": "ne\"><span> @<span><span>leave<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>onLeave<span><span>\"<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> @<span><span>after-leave<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>onAfterLeave<span><span>\"<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> @<span><span>leave-cancelled<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>onLeaveCancelled<span><span>\"<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <!-- ... --><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/transition.html", "title": "Transition | Vue.js", "doc_id": "5c4993fc923c4a10bcf217636c8d459d", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1496, "chunk_index": 54, "_doc_id": "54_2035870883246565603"}}
{"doc_id": "55_2643819430073256573", "text": "an><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <!-- ... --><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>Transition<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><div class=\"composition-api\"><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// 在元素被插入到 DOM 之前被调用<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 用这个来设置元素的 \"enter-from\" 状态<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/transition.html", "title": "Transition | Vue.js", "doc_id": "5c4993fc923c4a10bcf217636c8d459d", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1496, "chunk_index": 55, "_doc_id": "55_2643819430073256573"}}
{"doc_id": "56_3630484507886500990", "text": ">// 在元素被插入到 DOM 之前被调用<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 用这个来设置元素的 \"enter-from\" 状态<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>function<span><span> onBeforeEnter<span><span>(<span><span>el<span><span>) {}<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 在元素被插入到 DOM 之后的下一帧被调用<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 用这个来开始进入动画<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>function<span><span> onEnter<span><span>(<span><span>el<span><span>, <span><span>done<span><span>) {<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/transition.html", "title": "Transition | Vue.js", "doc_id": "5c4993fc923c4a10bcf217636c8d459d", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1496, "chunk_index": 56, "_doc_id": "56_3630484507886500990"}}
{"doc_id": "57_1053555267352795560", "text": "><span> onEnter<span><span>(<span><span>el<span><span>, <span><span>done<span><span>) {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 调用回调函数 done 表示过渡结束<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 如果与 CSS 结合使用，则这个回调是可选参数<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> done<span><span>()<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 当进入过渡完成时调用。<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/transition.html", "title": "Transition | Vue.js", "doc_id": "5c4993fc923c4a10bcf217636c8d459d", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1496, "chunk_index": 57, "_doc_id": "57_1053555267352795560"}}
{"doc_id": "58_5713755735495725366", "text": "\"><span>}<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 当进入过渡完成时调用。<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>function<span><span> onAfterEnter<span><span>(<span><span>el<span><span>) {}<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 当进入过渡在完成之前被取消时调用<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>function<span><span> onEnterCancelled<span><span>(<span><span>el<span><span>) {}<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 在 leave 钩子之前调用<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/transition.html", "title": "Transition | Vue.js", "doc_id": "5c4993fc923c4a10bcf217636c8d459d", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1496, "chunk_index": 58, "_doc_id": "58_5713755735495725366"}}
{"doc_id": "59_96515083574357661", "text": "n>) {}<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 在 leave 钩子之前调用<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 大多数时候，你应该只会用到 leave 钩子<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>function<span><span> onBeforeLeave<span><span>(<span><span>el<span><span>) {}<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 在离开过渡开始时调用<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 用这个来开始离开动画<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/transition.html", "title": "Transition | Vue.js", "doc_id": "5c4993fc923c4a10bcf217636c8d459d", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1496, "chunk_index": 59, "_doc_id": "59_96515083574357661"}}
{"doc_id": "60_9043737715221652740", "text": "pan class=\"line\"><span>// 在离开过渡开始时调用<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 用这个来开始离开动画<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>function<span><span> onLeave<span><span>(<span><span>el<span><span>, <span><span>done<span><span>) {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 调用回调函数 done 表示过渡结束<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 如果与 CSS 结合使用，则这个回调是可选参数<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> done<span><span>()<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/transition.html", "title": "Transition | Vue.js", "doc_id": "5c4993fc923c4a10bcf217636c8d459d", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1496, "chunk_index": 60, "_doc_id": "60_9043737715221652740"}}
{"doc_id": "61_4231121452451364329", "text": "an> done<span><span>()<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 在离开过渡完成、<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 且元素已从 DOM 中移除时调用<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>function<span><span> onAfterLeave<span><span>(<span><span>el<span><span>) {}<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 仅在 v-show 过渡中可用<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/transition.html", "title": "Transition | Vue.js", "doc_id": "5c4993fc923c4a10bcf217636c8d459d", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1496, "chunk_index": 61, "_doc_id": "61_4231121452451364329"}}
{"doc_id": "62_7198170761551146413", "text": ">) {}<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 仅在 v-show 过渡中可用<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>function<span><span> onLeaveCancelled<span><span>(<span><span>el<span><span>) {}<span><span><code><pre><div><div><div class=\"options-api\"><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // ...<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/transition.html", "title": "Transition | Vue.js", "doc_id": "5c4993fc923c4a10bcf217636c8d459d", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1496, "chunk_index": 62, "_doc_id": "62_7198170761551146413"}}
{"doc_id": "63_649695462185701123", "text": "n>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // ...<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> methods: {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 在元素被插入到 DOM 之前被调用<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 用这个来设置元素的 \"enter-from\" 状态<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> onBeforeEnter<span><span>(<span><span>el<span><span>) {},<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 在元素被插入到 DOM 之后的下一帧被调用<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 用这个来开始进入动画<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/transition.html", "title": "Transition | Vue.js", "doc_id": "5c4993fc923c4a10bcf217636c8d459d", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1496, "chunk_index": 63, "_doc_id": "63_649695462185701123"}}
{"doc_id": "64_1256747520024349801", "text": "ne\"><span> // 在元素被插入到 DOM 之后的下一帧被调用<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 用这个来开始进入动画<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> onEnter<span><span>(<span><span>el<span><span>, <span><span>done<span><span>) {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 调用回调函数 done 表示过渡结束<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 如果与 CSS 结合使用，则这个回调是可选参数<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> done<span><span>()<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> },<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/transition.html", "title": "Transition | Vue.js", "doc_id": "5c4993fc923c4a10bcf217636c8d459d", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1496, "chunk_index": 64, "_doc_id": "64_1256747520024349801"}}
{"doc_id": "65_2219497949010599797", "text": "> done<span><span>()<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> },<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 当进入过渡完成时调用。<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> onAfterEnter<span><span>(<span><span>el<span><span>) {},<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 当进入过渡在完成之前被取消时调用<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> onEnterCancelled<span><span>(<span><span>el<span><span>) {},<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/transition.html", "title": "Transition | Vue.js", "doc_id": "5c4993fc923c4a10bcf217636c8d459d", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1496, "chunk_index": 65, "_doc_id": "65_2219497949010599797"}}
{"doc_id": "66_5012233691114779506", "text": "onEnterCancelled<span><span>(<span><span>el<span><span>) {},<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 在 leave 钩子之前调用<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 大多数时候，你应该只会用到 leave 钩子<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> onBeforeLeave<span><span>(<span><span>el<span><span>) {},<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 在离开过渡开始时调用<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 用这个来开始离开动画<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/transition.html", "title": "Transition | Vue.js", "doc_id": "5c4993fc923c4a10bcf217636c8d459d", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1496, "chunk_index": 66, "_doc_id": "66_5012233691114779506"}}
{"doc_id": "67_7553999889044161850", "text": "n class=\"line\"><span> // 在离开过渡开始时调用<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 用这个来开始离开动画<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> onLeave<span><span>(<span><span>el<span><span>, <span><span>done<span><span>) {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 调用回调函数 done 表示过渡结束<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 如果与 CSS 结合使用，则这个回调是可选参数<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> done<span><span>()<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> },<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/transition.html", "title": "Transition | Vue.js", "doc_id": "5c4993fc923c4a10bcf217636c8d459d", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1496, "chunk_index": 67, "_doc_id": "67_7553999889044161850"}}
{"doc_id": "68_276330940044829109", "text": "> done<span><span>()<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> },<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 在离开过渡完成、<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 且元素已从 DOM 中移除时调用<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> onAfterLeave<span><span>(<span><span>el<span><span>) {},<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 仅在 v-show 过渡中可用<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> onLeaveCancelled<span><span>(<span><span>el<span><span>) {}<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/transition.html", "title": "Transition | Vue.js", "doc_id": "5c4993fc923c4a10bcf217636c8d459d", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1496, "chunk_index": 68, "_doc_id": "68_276330940044829109"}}
{"doc_id": "69_2683745487046540999", "text": ">\n<span class=\"line\"><span> onLeaveCancelled<span><span>(<span><span>el<span><span>) {}<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/transition.html", "title": "Transition | Vue.js", "doc_id": "5c4993fc923c4a10bcf217636c8d459d", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1496, "chunk_index": 69, "_doc_id": "69_2683745487046540999"}}
{"doc_id": "70_6856853347986226359", "text": "lled<span><span>(<span><span>el<span><span>) {}<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span><code><pre><div><div><p>这些钩子可以与 CSS 过渡或动画结合使用，也可以单独使用。<p><p>在使用仅由 JavaScript 执行的动画时，最好是添加一个 <code>:css=\"false\"<code> prop。这显式地向 Vue 表明可以跳过对 CSS 过渡的自动探测。除了性能稍好一些之外，还可以防止 CSS 规则意外地干扰过渡效果：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>Transition<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/transition.html", "title": "Transition | Vue.js", "doc_id": "5c4993fc923c4a10bcf217636c8d459d", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1496, "chunk_index": 70, "_doc_id": "70_6856853347986226359"}}
{"doc_id": "71_1911640603527884413", "text": "lass=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>Transition<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> ...<span><span>\n<span class=\"line highlighted\"><span> :<span><span>css<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>false<span><span>\"<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> ...<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>Transition<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>在有了 <code>:css=\"false\"<code> 后，我们就自己全权负责控制什么时候过渡结束了。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/transition.html", "title": "Transition | Vue.js", "doc_id": "5c4993fc923c4a10bcf217636c8d459d", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1496, "chunk_index": 71, "_doc_id": "71_1911640603527884413"}}
{"doc_id": "72_4754013406803684594", "text": "tion<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>在有了 <code>:css=\"false\"<code> 后，我们就自己全权负责控制什么时候过渡结束了。这种情况下对于 <code>@enter<code> 和 <code>@leave<code> 钩子来说，回调函数 <code>done<code> 就是必须的。否则，钩子将被同步调用，过渡将立即完成。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/transition.html", "title": "Transition | Vue.js", "doc_id": "5c4993fc923c4a10bcf217636c8d459d", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1496, "chunk_index": 72, "_doc_id": "72_4754013406803684594"}}
{"doc_id": "73_3553428350490270845", "text": "种情况下对于 <code>@enter<code> 和 <code>@leave<code> 钩子来说，回调函数 <code>done<code> 就是必须的。否则，钩子将被同步调用，过渡将立即完成。<p><p>这里是使用 <a href=\"https://gsap.com/\" target=\"_blank\">GSAP 库<a>执行动画的一个示例，你也可以使用任何你想要的库，比如 <a href=\"https://animejs.com/\" target=\"_blank\">Anime.js<a> 或者 <a href=\"https://motion.dev/\" target=\"_blank\">Motion One<a>：<p><h2 id=\"reusable-transitions\">可复用过渡效果 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#reusable-transitions\">​<a><h2><p>得益于 Vue 的组件系统，过渡效果是可以被封装复用的。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/transition.html", "title": "Transition | Vue.js", "doc_id": "5c4993fc923c4a10bcf217636c8d459d", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1496, "chunk_index": 73, "_doc_id": "73_3553428350490270845"}}
{"doc_id": "74_5077162381111389146", "text": "复用过渡效果 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#reusable-transitions\">​<a><h2><p>得益于 Vue 的组件系统，过渡效果是可以被封装复用的。要创建一个可被复用的过渡，我们需要为 <code><Transition><code> 组件创建一个包装组件，并向内传入插槽内容：<p><div class=\"vp-code-block-title\"><p class=\"vp-code-block-title-bar\"><span class=\"vp-code-block-title-text\">MyTransition.vue<span><p><div class=\"language-vue\"> <span class=\"lang\">vue<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>script<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/transition.html", "title": "Transition | Vue.js", "doc_id": "5c4993fc923c4a10bcf217636c8d459d", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1496, "chunk_index": 74, "_doc_id": "74_5077162381111389146"}}
{"doc_id": "75_3478190894920111019", "text": "ki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>script<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// JavaScript 钩子逻辑...<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>script<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line highlighted\"><span> <!-- 包装内置的 Transition 组件 --><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>Transition<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/transition.html", "title": "Transition | Vue.js", "doc_id": "5c4993fc923c4a10bcf217636c8d459d", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1496, "chunk_index": 75, "_doc_id": "75_3478190894920111019"}}
{"doc_id": "76_6387094583025086564", "text": "- 包装内置的 Transition 组件 --><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>Transition<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> name<span><span>=<span><span>\"my-transition\"<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> @enter<span><span>=<span><span>\"onEnter\"<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> @leave<span><span>=<span><span>\"onLeave\"<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>slot<span><span>></<span><span>slot<span><span>> <span><span><!-- 向内传递插槽内容 --><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/transition.html", "title": "Transition | Vue.js", "doc_id": "5c4993fc923c4a10bcf217636c8d459d", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1496, "chunk_index": 76, "_doc_id": "76_6387094583025086564"}}
{"doc_id": "77_3820839984234778715", "text": "an><span>slot<span><span>></<span><span>slot<span><span>> <span><span><!-- 向内传递插槽内容 --><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> </<span><span>Transition<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>style<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>/*<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> 必要的 CSS...<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> 注意：避免在这里使用 <style scoped><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/transition.html", "title": "Transition | Vue.js", "doc_id": "5c4993fc923c4a10bcf217636c8d459d", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1496, "chunk_index": 77, "_doc_id": "77_3820839984234778715"}}
{"doc_id": "78_7674713318088926894", "text": "line\"><span> 必要的 CSS...<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> 注意：避免在这里使用 <style scoped><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> 因为那不会应用到插槽内容上<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>*/<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/transition.html", "title": "Transition | Vue.js", "doc_id": "5c4993fc923c4a10bcf217636c8d459d", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1496, "chunk_index": 78, "_doc_id": "78_7674713318088926894"}}
{"doc_id": "79_4177182494649088755", "text": "><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> 因为那不会应用到插槽内容上<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>*/<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>style<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><div><p>现在 <code>MyTransition<code> 可以在导入后像内置组件那样使用了：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>MyTransition<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/transition.html", "title": "Transition | Vue.js", "doc_id": "5c4993fc923c4a10bcf217636c8d459d", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1496, "chunk_index": 79, "_doc_id": "79_4177182494649088755"}}
{"doc_id": "80_8251730226580289699", "text": "hub-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>MyTransition<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>div<span><span> v-if<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>show<span><span>\"<span><span>>Hello</<span><span>div<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/transition.html", "title": "Transition | Vue.js", "doc_id": "5c4993fc923c4a10bcf217636c8d459d", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1496, "chunk_index": 80, "_doc_id": "80_8251730226580289699"}}
{"doc_id": "81_9021155498471056870", "text": "an><span>\"<span><span>show<span><span>\"<span><span>>Hello</<span><span>div<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>MyTransition<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><h2 id=\"transition-on-appear\">出现时过渡 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#transition-on-appear\">​<a><h2><p>如果你想在某个节点初次渲染时应用一个过渡效果，你可以添加 <code>appear<code> prop：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>Transition<span><span> appear<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/transition.html", "title": "Transition | Vue.js", "doc_id": "5c4993fc923c4a10bcf217636c8d459d", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1496, "chunk_index": 81, "_doc_id": "81_9021155498471056870"}}
{"doc_id": "82_3018034618132246983", "text": "><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>Transition<span><span> appear<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> ...<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>Transition<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><h2 id=\"transition-between-elements\">元素间过渡 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#transition-between-elements\">​<a><h2><p>除了通过 <code>v-if<code> / <code>v-show<code> 切换一个元素，我们也可以通过 <code>v-if<code> / <code>v-else<code> / <code>v-else-if<code> 在几个组件间进行切换，", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/transition.html", "title": "Transition | Vue.js", "doc_id": "5c4993fc923c4a10bcf217636c8d459d", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1496, "chunk_index": 82, "_doc_id": "82_3018034618132246983"}}
{"doc_id": "83_4102038940510081797", "text": "-show<code> 切换一个元素，我们也可以通过 <code>v-if<code> / <code>v-else<code> / <code>v-else-if<code> 在几个组件间进行切换，只要确保任一时刻只会有一个元素被渲染即可：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>Transition<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/transition.html", "title": "Transition | Vue.js", "doc_id": "5c4993fc923c4a10bcf217636c8d459d", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1496, "chunk_index": 83, "_doc_id": "83_4102038940510081797"}}
{"doc_id": "84_6311032331496635504", "text": "ithub-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>Transition<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>button<span><span> v-if<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>docState <span><span>===<span><span> 'saved'\"<span><span>>Edit</<span><span>button<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/transition.html", "title": "Transition | Vue.js", "doc_id": "5c4993fc923c4a10bcf217636c8d459d", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1496, "chunk_index": 84, "_doc_id": "84_6311032331496635504"}}
{"doc_id": "85_3783855597502818195", "text": "<span><span>===<span><span> 'saved'\"<span><span>>Edit</<span><span>button<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>button<span><span> v-else-if<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>docState <span><span>===<span><span> 'edited'\"<span><span>>Save</<span><span>button<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/transition.html", "title": "Transition | Vue.js", "doc_id": "5c4993fc923c4a10bcf217636c8d459d", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1496, "chunk_index": 85, "_doc_id": "85_3783855597502818195"}}
{"doc_id": "86_4783729213267066455", "text": "<span><span>===<span><span> 'edited'\"<span><span>>Save</<span><span>button<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>button<span><span> v-else-if<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>docState <span><span>===<span><span> 'editing'\"<span><span>>Cancel</<span><span>button<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/transition.html", "title": "Transition | Vue.js", "doc_id": "5c4993fc923c4a10bcf217636c8d459d", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1496, "chunk_index": 86, "_doc_id": "86_4783729213267066455"}}
{"doc_id": "87_4872768282276259771", "text": "an><span>===<span><span> 'editing'\"<span><span>>Cancel</<span><span>button<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>Transition<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><div class=\"demo transition-demo\"><span>Click to cycle through states: <span><p class=\"btn-container\"> Edit <p><div><p><a href=\"https://play.vuejs.org/#eNqdk8tu2zAQRX9loI0SoLLcFN2ostEi6BekmwLa0NTYJkKRBDkSYhj+9wxJO3ZegBGu+Lhz7syQ3Bd/nJtNIxZN0QbplSMISKNbdkYNznqCPXhcwwHW3g5QsrTsTGekNYGgt/KBBCEsouimDGLCvrztTFtnGGN4QTg4zbK4oj", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/transition.html", "title": "Transition | Vue.js", "doc_id": "5c4993fc923c4a10bcf217636c8d459d", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1496, "chunk_index": 87, "_doc_id": "87_4872768282276259771"}}
{"doc_id": "88_8298220698345370691", "text": "", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/transition.html", "title": "Transition | Vue.js", "doc_id": "5c4993fc923c4a10bcf217636c8d459d", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1496, "chunk_index": 88, "_doc_id": "88_8298220698345370691"}}
{"doc_id": "89_3080372862138271291", "text": "PTU6jQEPpKyMj8dnmgkQs+HmQcvVTIQK1hPrv7GQAFt9eO9Bk6fZ8Ub52Qiri8eUo+4dbWD02exh79v/nBP+H2PStnwz/jelJ1geKvk/peHJ4BoRZYow==\" target=\"_blank\">在演练场中尝试一下<a><p><h2 id=\"transition-modes\">过渡模式 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#transition-modes\">​<a><h2><p>在之前的例子中，进入和离开的元素都是在同时开始动画的，因此我们不得不将它们设为 <code>position: absolute<code> 以避免二者同时存在时出现的布局问题。<p><p>然而，很多情况下这可能并不符合需求。我们可能想要先执行离开动画，然后在其完成<strong>之后<strong>再执行元素的进入动画。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/transition.html", "title": "Transition | Vue.js", "doc_id": "5c4993fc923c4a10bcf217636c8d459d", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1496, "chunk_index": 89, "_doc_id": "89_3080372862138271291"}}
{"doc_id": "90_6730047476093643202", "text": "te<code> 以避免二者同时存在时出现的布局问题。<p><p>然而，很多情况下这可能并不符合需求。我们可能想要先执行离开动画，然后在其完成<strong>之后<strong>再执行元素的进入动画。手动编排这样的动画是非常复杂的，好在我们可以通过向 <code><Transition><code> 传入一个 <code>mode<code> prop 来实现这个行为：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>Transition<span><span> mode<span><span>=<span><span>\"out-in\"<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> ...<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/transition.html", "title": "Transition | Vue.js", "doc_id": "5c4993fc923c4a10bcf217636c8d459d", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1496, "chunk_index": 90, "_doc_id": "90_6730047476093643202"}}
{"doc_id": "91_7090846994262791447", "text": "span><span>=<span><span>\"out-in\"<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> ...<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>Transition<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>将之前的例子改为 <code>mode=\"out-in\"<code> 后是这样：<p><div class=\"demo transition-demo\"><span>Click to cycle through states: <span><p class=\"btn-container\"> Edit <p><div><p><code><Transition><code> 也支持 <code>mode=\"in-out\"<code>，虽然这并不常用。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/transition.html", "title": "Transition | Vue.js", "doc_id": "5c4993fc923c4a10bcf217636c8d459d", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1496, "chunk_index": 91, "_doc_id": "91_7090846994262791447"}}
{"doc_id": "92_1347797697686295738", "text": "ass=\"btn-container\"> Edit <p><div><p><code><Transition><code> 也支持 <code>mode=\"in-out\"<code>，虽然这并不常用。<p><h2 id=\"transition-between-components\">组件间过渡 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#transition-between-components\">​<a><h2><p><code><Transition><code> 也可以作用于<a href=\"/guide/essentials/component-basics.", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/transition.html", "title": "Transition | Vue.js", "doc_id": "5c4993fc923c4a10bcf217636c8d459d", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1496, "chunk_index": 92, "_doc_id": "92_1347797697686295738"}}
{"doc_id": "93_7624481364446748869", "text": "n-components\">​<a><h2><p><code><Transition><code> 也可以作用于<a href=\"/guide/essentials/component-basics.html#dynamic-components\">动态组件<a>之间的切换：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>Transition<span><span> name<span><span>=<span><span>\"fade\"<span><span> mode<span><span>=<span><span>\"out-in\"<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/transition.html", "title": "Transition | Vue.js", "doc_id": "5c4993fc923c4a10bcf217636c8d459d", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1496, "chunk_index": 93, "_doc_id": "93_7624481364446748869"}}
{"doc_id": "94_4040794830437958767", "text": "span>=<span><span>\"fade\"<span><span> mode<span><span>=<span><span>\"out-in\"<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>component<span><span> :<span><span>is<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>activeComponent<span><span>\"<span><span>></<span><span>component<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/transition.html", "title": "Transition | Vue.js", "doc_id": "5c4993fc923c4a10bcf217636c8d459d", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1496, "chunk_index": 94, "_doc_id": "94_4040794830437958767"}}
{"doc_id": "95_6529327316203247440", "text": "pan><span>activeComponent<span><span>\"<span><span>></<span><span>component<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>Transition<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><h2 id=\"dynamic-transitions\">动态过渡 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#dynamic-transitions\">​<a><h2><p><code><Transition><code> 的 props (比如 <code>name<code>) 也可以是动态的！", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/transition.html", "title": "Transition | Vue.js", "doc_id": "5c4993fc923c4a10bcf217636c8d459d", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1496, "chunk_index": 95, "_doc_id": "95_6529327316203247440"}}
{"doc_id": "96_4893165499726654303", "text": "ef=\"#dynamic-transitions\">​<a><h2><p><code><Transition><code> 的 props (比如 <code>name<code>) 也可以是动态的！这让我们可以根据状态变化动态地应用不同类型的过渡：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>Transition<span><span> :<span><span>name<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>transitionName<span><span>\"<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <!-- ... --><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/transition.html", "title": "Transition | Vue.js", "doc_id": "5c4993fc923c4a10bcf217636c8d459d", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1496, "chunk_index": 96, "_doc_id": "96_4893165499726654303"}}
{"doc_id": "97_7670066627722329196", "text": "sitionName<span><span>\"<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <!-- ... --><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>Transition<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>这个特性的用处是可以提前定义好多组 CSS 过渡或动画的 class，然后在它们之间动态切换。<p><p>你也可以根据你的组件的当前状态在 JavaScript 过渡钩子中应用不同的行为。最后，创建动态过渡的终极方式还是创建<a href=\"#reusable-transitions\">可复用的过渡组件<a>，并让这些组件根据动态的 props 来改变过渡的效果。掌握了这些技巧后，就真的只有你想不到，没有做不到的了。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/transition.html", "title": "Transition | Vue.js", "doc_id": "5c4993fc923c4a10bcf217636c8d459d", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1496, "chunk_index": 97, "_doc_id": "97_7670066627722329196"}}
{"doc_id": "98_6162255785426490009", "text": "创建<a href=\"#reusable-transitions\">可复用的过渡组件<a>，并让这些组件根据动态的 props 来改变过渡的效果。掌握了这些技巧后，就真的只有你想不到，没有做不到的了。<p><h2 id=\"transitions-with-the-key-attribute\">使用 Key Attribute 过渡 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#transitions-with-the-key-attribute\">​<a><h2><p>有时为了触发过渡，你需要强制重新渲染 DOM 元素。<p><p>以计数器组件为例：<p><div class=\"composition-api\"><div class=\"language-vue\"> <span class=\"lang\">vue<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>script<span><span> setup<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/transition.html", "title": "Transition | Vue.js", "doc_id": "5c4993fc923c4a10bcf217636c8d459d", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1496, "chunk_index": 98, "_doc_id": "98_6162255785426490009"}}
{"doc_id": "99_8202154052025057618", "text": "code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>script<span><span> setup<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>import<span><span> { ref } <span><span>from<span><span> 'vue'<span><span>;<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> count<span><span> =<span><span> ref<span><span>(<span><span>0<span><span>);<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/transition.html", "title": "Transition | Vue.js", "doc_id": "5c4993fc923c4a10bcf217636c8d459d", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1496, "chunk_index": 99, "_doc_id": "99_8202154052025057618"}}
{"doc_id": "100_6474532782430997103", "text": "an> =<span><span> ref<span><span>(<span><span>0<span><span>);<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>setInterval<span><span>(() <span><span>=><span><span> count.value<span><span>++<span><span>, <span><span>1000<span><span>);<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>script<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>Transition<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/transition.html", "title": "Transition | Vue.js", "doc_id": "5c4993fc923c4a10bcf217636c8d459d", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1496, "chunk_index": 100, "_doc_id": "100_6474532782430997103"}}
{"doc_id": "101_4457352765584183891", "text": "span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>Transition<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>span<span><span> :key<span><span>=<span><span>\"count\"<span><span>>{{ count }}</<span><span>span<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> </<span><span>Transition<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/transition.html", "title": "Transition | Vue.js", "doc_id": "5c4993fc923c4a10bcf217636c8d459d", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1496, "chunk_index": 101, "_doc_id": "101_4457352765584183891"}}
{"doc_id": "102_5468443059089553973", "text": "pan><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> </<span><span>Transition<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><div><div class=\"options-api\"><div class=\"language-vue\"> <span class=\"lang\">vue<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>script<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/transition.html", "title": "Transition | Vue.js", "doc_id": "5c4993fc923c4a10bcf217636c8d459d", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1496, "chunk_index": 102, "_doc_id": "102_5468443059089553973"}}
{"doc_id": "103_9146286879450965686", "text": "n><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> data<span><span>() {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> return<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> count: <span><span>1<span><span>,<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> interval: <span><span>null<span><span> <span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> },<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> mounted<span><span>() {<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/transition.html", "title": "Transition | Vue.js", "doc_id": "5c4993fc923c4a10bcf217636c8d459d", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1496, "chunk_index": 103, "_doc_id": "103_9146286879450965686"}}
{"doc_id": "104_7497629229146460101", "text": "an class=\"line\"><span> },<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> mounted<span><span>() {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> this<span><span>.interval <span><span>=<span><span> setInterval<span><span>(() <span><span>=><span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> this<span><span>.count<span><span>++<span><span>;<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }, <span><span>1000<span><span>)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> },<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/transition.html", "title": "Transition | Vue.js", "doc_id": "5c4993fc923c4a10bcf217636c8d459d", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1496, "chunk_index": 104, "_doc_id": "104_7497629229146460101"}}
{"doc_id": "105_8268935776809589815", "text": "\"line\"><span> }, <span><span>1000<span><span>)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> },<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> beforeDestroy<span><span>() {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> clearInterval<span><span>(<span><span>this<span><span>.interval)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>script<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/transition.html", "title": "Transition | Vue.js", "doc_id": "5c4993fc923c4a10bcf217636c8d459d", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1496, "chunk_index": 105, "_doc_id": "105_8268935776809589815"}}
{"doc_id": "106_6916673441267420107", "text": "n>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>script<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>Transition<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>span<span><span> :key<span><span>=<span><span>\"count\"<span><span>>{{ count }}</<span><span>span<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> </<span><span>Transition<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/transition.html", "title": "Transition | Vue.js", "doc_id": "5c4993fc923c4a10bcf217636c8d459d", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1496, "chunk_index": 106, "_doc_id": "106_6916673441267420107"}}
{"doc_id": "107_8481314625245442111", "text": "pan><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> </<span><span>Transition<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><div><p>如果不使用 <code>key<code> attribute，则只有文本节点会被更新，因此不会发生过渡。但是，有了 <code>key<code> 属性，Vue 就知道在 <code>count<code> 改变时创建一个新的 <code>span<code> 元素，因此 <code>Transition<code> 组件有两个不同的元素在它们之间进行过渡。<p>\n<p><strong>参考<strong><p><div><div>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/transition.html", "title": "Transition | Vue.js", "doc_id": "5c4993fc923c4a10bcf217636c8d459d", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1496, "chunk_index": 107, "_doc_id": "107_8481314625245442111"}}
{"doc_id": "0_1969936741880072315", "text": "<div><div><h1 id=\"async-components\">异步组件 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#async-components\">​<a><h1><h2 id=\"basic-usage\">基本用法 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#basic-usage\">​<a><h2><p>在大型项目中，我们可能需要拆分应用为更小的块，并仅在需要时再从服务器加载相关组件。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/async.html", "title": "异步组件", "doc_id": "7a4b7032dc0c405e9524b71550ff380f", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 580, "chunk_index": 0, "_doc_id": "0_1969936741880072315"}}
{"doc_id": "1_984807678331797409", "text": "用法 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#basic-usage\">​<a><h2><p>在大型项目中，我们可能需要拆分应用为更小的块，并仅在需要时再从服务器加载相关组件。Vue 提供了 <a href=\"/api/general.html#defineasynccomponent\"><code>defineAsyncComponent<code><a> 方法来实现此功能：<p><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>import<span><span> { defineAsyncComponent } <span><span>from<span><span> 'vue'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/async.html", "title": "异步组件", "doc_id": "7a4b7032dc0c405e9524b71550ff380f", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 580, "chunk_index": 1, "_doc_id": "1_984807678331797409"}}
{"doc_id": "2_6238201894731450304", "text": "> { defineAsyncComponent } <span><span>from<span><span> 'vue'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> AsyncComp<span><span> =<span><span> defineAsyncComponent<span><span>(() <span><span>=><span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> return<span><span> new<span><span> Promise<span><span>((<span><span>resolve<span><span>, <span><span>reject<span><span>) <span><span>=><span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // ...从服务器获取组件<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/async.html", "title": "异步组件", "doc_id": "7a4b7032dc0c405e9524b71550ff380f", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 580, "chunk_index": 2, "_doc_id": "2_6238201894731450304"}}
{"doc_id": "3_1806788844694558208", "text": "pan>) <span><span>=><span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // ...从服务器获取组件<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> resolve<span><span>(<span><span>/* 获取到的组件 */<span><span>)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> })<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>})<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// ... 像使用其他一般组件一样使用 `AsyncComp`<span><span><code><pre><div><p>如你所见，<code>defineAsyncComponent<code> 方法接收一个返回 Promise 的加载函数。这个 Promise 的 <code>resolve<code> 回调方法应该在从服务器获得组件定义时调用。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/async.html", "title": "异步组件", "doc_id": "7a4b7032dc0c405e9524b71550ff380f", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 580, "chunk_index": 3, "_doc_id": "3_1806788844694558208"}}
{"doc_id": "4_8069452222285977201", "text": "neAsyncComponent<code> 方法接收一个返回 Promise 的加载函数。这个 Promise 的 <code>resolve<code> 回调方法应该在从服务器获得组件定义时调用。你也可以调用 <code>reject(reason)<code> 表明加载失败。<p><p><a href=\"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/JavaScript/Reference/Operators/import\" target=\"_blank\">ES 模块动态导入<a>也会返回一个 Promise，所以多数情况下我们会将它和 <code>defineAsyncComponent<code> 搭配使用。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/async.html", "title": "异步组件", "doc_id": "7a4b7032dc0c405e9524b71550ff380f", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 580, "chunk_index": 4, "_doc_id": "4_8069452222285977201"}}
{"doc_id": "5_6671841207802540603", "text": "ort\" target=\"_blank\">ES 模块动态导入<a>也会返回一个 Promise，所以多数情况下我们会将它和 <code>defineAsyncComponent<code> 搭配使用。类似 Vite 和 Webpack 这样的构建工具也支持此语法 (并且会将它们作为打包时的代码分割点)，因此我们也可以用它来导入 Vue 单文件组件：<p><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>import<span><span> { defineAsyncComponent } <span><span>from<span><span> 'vue'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/async.html", "title": "异步组件", "doc_id": "7a4b7032dc0c405e9524b71550ff380f", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 580, "chunk_index": 5, "_doc_id": "5_6671841207802540603"}}
{"doc_id": "6_6592429422233407430", "text": "> { defineAsyncComponent } <span><span>from<span><span> 'vue'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> AsyncComp<span><span> =<span><span> defineAsyncComponent<span><span>(() <span><span>=><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> import<span><span>(<span><span>'./components/MyComponent.vue'<span><span>)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>)<span><span><code><pre><div><p>最后得到的 <code>AsyncComp<code> 是一个外层包装过的组件，仅在页面需要它渲染时才会调用加载内部实际组件的函数。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/async.html", "title": "异步组件", "doc_id": "7a4b7032dc0c405e9524b71550ff380f", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 580, "chunk_index": 6, "_doc_id": "6_6592429422233407430"}}
{"doc_id": "7_5611824015759879734", "text": "n>)<span><span><code><pre><div><p>最后得到的 <code>AsyncComp<code> 是一个外层包装过的组件，仅在页面需要它渲染时才会调用加载内部实际组件的函数。它会将接收到的 props 和插槽传给内部组件，所以你可以使用这个异步的包装组件无缝地替换原始组件，同时实现延迟加载。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/async.html", "title": "异步组件", "doc_id": "7a4b7032dc0c405e9524b71550ff380f", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 580, "chunk_index": 7, "_doc_id": "7_5611824015759879734"}}
{"doc_id": "8_5162095910960041318", "text": "e> 是一个外层包装过的组件，仅在页面需要它渲染时才会调用加载内部实际组件的函数。它会将接收到的 props 和插槽传给内部组件，所以你可以使用这个异步的包装组件无缝地替换原始组件，同时实现延迟加载。<p><p>与普通组件一样，异步组件可以使用 <code>app.component()<code> <a href=\"/guide/components/registration.html#global-registration\">全局注册<a>：<p><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>app.<span><span>component<span><span>(<span><span>'MyComponent'<span><span>, <span><span>defineAsyncComponent<span><span>(() <span><span>=><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/async.html", "title": "异步组件", "doc_id": "7a4b7032dc0c405e9524b71550ff380f", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 580, "chunk_index": 8, "_doc_id": "8_5162095910960041318"}}
{"doc_id": "9_546855582751972947", "text": "yComponent'<span><span>, <span><span>defineAsyncComponent<span><span>(() <span><span>=><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> import<span><span>(<span><span>'./components/MyComponent.vue'<span><span>)<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/async.html", "title": "异步组件", "doc_id": "7a4b7032dc0c405e9524b71550ff380f", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 580, "chunk_index": 9, "_doc_id": "9_546855582751972947"}}
{"doc_id": "10_316867596798766012", "text": "line\"><span> import<span><span>(<span><span>'./components/MyComponent.vue'<span><span>)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>))<span><span><code><pre><div><div class=\"options-api\"><p>你也可以在<a href=\"/guide/components/registration.html#local-registration\">局部注册组件<a>时使用 <code>defineAsyncComponent<code>：<p><div class=\"language-vue\"> <span class=\"lang\">vue<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>script<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/async.html", "title": "异步组件", "doc_id": "7a4b7032dc0c405e9524b71550ff380f", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 580, "chunk_index": 10, "_doc_id": "10_316867596798766012"}}
{"doc_id": "11_7549813908242681584", "text": "ki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>script<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>import<span><span> { defineAsyncComponent } <span><span>from<span><span> 'vue'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> components: {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> AdminPage: <span><span>defineAsyncComponent<span><span>(() <span><span>=><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/async.html", "title": "异步组件", "doc_id": "7a4b7032dc0c405e9524b71550ff380f", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 580, "chunk_index": 11, "_doc_id": "11_7549813908242681584"}}
{"doc_id": "12_4184945416539855455", "text": "\"line\"><span> AdminPage: <span><span>defineAsyncComponent<span><span>(() <span><span>=><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> import<span><span>(<span><span>'./components/AdminPageComponent.vue'<span><span>)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> )<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>script<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/async.html", "title": "异步组件", "doc_id": "7a4b7032dc0c405e9524b71550ff380f", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 580, "chunk_index": 12, "_doc_id": "12_4184945416539855455"}}
{"doc_id": "13_3256889195307910329", "text": ">\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>AdminPage<span><span> /><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><div><div class=\"composition-api\"><p>也可以直接在父组件中定义它们：<p><div class=\"language-vue\"> <span class=\"lang\">vue<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>script<span><span> setup<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/async.html", "title": "异步组件", "doc_id": "7a4b7032dc0c405e9524b71550ff380f", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 580, "chunk_index": 13, "_doc_id": "13_3256889195307910329"}}
{"doc_id": "14_1247083694481146005", "text": "code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>script<span><span> setup<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>import<span><span> { defineAsyncComponent } <span><span>from<span><span> 'vue'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> AdminPage<span><span> =<span><span> defineAsyncComponent<span><span>(() <span><span>=><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> import<span><span>(<span><span>'./components/AdminPageComponent.vue'<span><span>)<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/async.html", "title": "异步组件", "doc_id": "7a4b7032dc0c405e9524b71550ff380f", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 580, "chunk_index": 14, "_doc_id": "14_1247083694481146005"}}
{"doc_id": "15_3346848428176805625", "text": "span> import<span><span>(<span><span>'./components/AdminPageComponent.vue'<span><span>)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>script<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>AdminPage<span><span> /><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/async.html", "title": "异步组件", "doc_id": "7a4b7032dc0c405e9524b71550ff380f", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 580, "chunk_index": 15, "_doc_id": "15_3346848428176805625"}}
{"doc_id": "16_7194985206163469938", "text": "pan><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>AdminPage<span><span> /><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><div><h2 id=\"loading-and-error-states\">加载与错误状态 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#loading-and-error-states\">​<a><h2><p>异步操作不可避免地会涉及到加载和错误状态，因此 <code>defineAsyncComponent()<code> 也支持在高级选项中处理这些状态：<p><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> AsyncComp<span><span> =<span><span> defineAsyncComponent<span><span>({<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/async.html", "title": "异步组件", "doc_id": "7a4b7032dc0c405e9524b71550ff380f", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 580, "chunk_index": 16, "_doc_id": "16_7194985206163469938"}}
{"doc_id": "17_1787657044172563312", "text": "onst<span><span> AsyncComp<span><span> =<span><span> defineAsyncComponent<span><span>({<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 加载函数<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> loader<span><span>: () <span><span>=><span><span> import<span><span>(<span><span>'./Foo.vue'<span><span>),<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 加载异步组件时使用的组件<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> loadingComponent: LoadingComponent,<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 展示加载组件前的延迟时间，默认为 200ms<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/async.html", "title": "异步组件", "doc_id": "7a4b7032dc0c405e9524b71550ff380f", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 580, "chunk_index": 17, "_doc_id": "17_1787657044172563312"}}
{"doc_id": "18_7099918119423038387", "text": "nent: LoadingComponent,<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 展示加载组件前的延迟时间，默认为 200ms<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> delay: <span><span>200<span><span>,<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 加载失败后展示的组件<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> errorComponent: ErrorComponent,<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 如果提供了一个 timeout 时间限制，并超时了<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 也会显示这里配置的报错组件，默认值是：Infinity<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/async.html", "title": "异步组件", "doc_id": "7a4b7032dc0c405e9524b71550ff380f", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 580, "chunk_index": 18, "_doc_id": "18_7099918119423038387"}}
{"doc_id": "19_4631692882998379268", "text": "timeout 时间限制，并超时了<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 也会显示这里配置的报错组件，默认值是：Infinity<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> timeout: <span><span>3000<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>})<span><span><code><pre><div><p>如果提供了一个加载组件，它将在内部组件加载时先行显示。在加载组件显示之前有一个默认的 200ms 延迟——这是因为在网络状况较好时，加载完成得很快，加载组件和最终组件之间的替换太快可能产生闪烁，反而影响用户感受。<p><p>如果提供了一个报错组件，则它会在加载器函数返回的 Promise 抛错时被渲染。你还可以指定一个超时时间，在请求耗时超过指定时间时也会渲染报错组件。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/async.html", "title": "异步组件", "doc_id": "7a4b7032dc0c405e9524b71550ff380f", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 580, "chunk_index": 19, "_doc_id": "19_4631692882998379268"}}
{"doc_id": "20_2321041359925837916", "text": "替换太快可能产生闪烁，反而影响用户感受。<p><p>如果提供了一个报错组件，则它会在加载器函数返回的 Promise 抛错时被渲染。你还可以指定一个超时时间，在请求耗时超过指定时间时也会渲染报错组件。<p><h2 id=\"lazy-hydration\">惰性激活 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#lazy-hydration\" class=\"vt-badge\">​<a><h2><blockquote><p>如果你正在使用<a href=\"/guide/scaling-up/ssr.html\">服务器端渲染<a>，这一部分才会适用。<p><blockquote><p>在 Vue 3.5+ 中，异步组件可以通过提供激活策略来控制何时进行激活。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/async.html", "title": "异步组件", "doc_id": "7a4b7032dc0c405e9524b71550ff380f", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 580, "chunk_index": 20, "_doc_id": "20_2321041359925837916"}}
{"doc_id": "21_6218002547465597392", "text": "uide/scaling-up/ssr.html\">服务器端渲染<a>，这一部分才会适用。<p><blockquote><p>在 Vue 3.5+ 中，异步组件可以通过提供激活策略来控制何时进行激活。<p><h3 id=\"hydrate-on-idle\">在空闲时进行激活 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#hydrate-on-idle\">​<a><h3><p>通过 <code>requestIdleCallback<code> 进行激活：<p><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>import<span><span> { defineAsyncComponent, hydrateOnIdle } <span><span>from<span><span> 'vue'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/async.html", "title": "异步组件", "doc_id": "7a4b7032dc0c405e9524b71550ff380f", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 580, "chunk_index": 21, "_doc_id": "21_6218002547465597392"}}
{"doc_id": "22_6389481957173886323", "text": "Component, hydrateOnIdle } <span><span>from<span><span> 'vue'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> AsyncComp<span><span> =<span><span> defineAsyncComponent<span><span>({<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> loader<span><span>: () <span><span>=><span><span> import<span><span>(<span><span>'./Comp.vue'<span><span>),<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> hydrate: <span><span>hydrateOnIdle<span><span>(<span><span>/* 传递可选的最大超时 */<span><span>)<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/async.html", "title": "异步组件", "doc_id": "7a4b7032dc0c405e9524b71550ff380f", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 580, "chunk_index": 22, "_doc_id": "22_6389481957173886323"}}
{"doc_id": "23_4813384932142075700", "text": "hydrate: <span><span>hydrateOnIdle<span><span>(<span><span>/* 传递可选的最大超时 */<span><span>)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>})<span><span><code><pre><div><h3 id=\"hydrate-on-visible\">在可见时激活 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#hydrate-on-visible\">​<a><h3><p>通过 <code>IntersectionObserver<code> 在元素变为可见时进行激活。<p><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>import<span><span> { defineAsyncComponent, hydrateOnVisible } <span><span>from<span><span> 'vue'<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/async.html", "title": "异步组件", "doc_id": "7a4b7032dc0c405e9524b71550ff380f", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 580, "chunk_index": 23, "_doc_id": "23_4813384932142075700"}}
{"doc_id": "24_8941994296404670678", "text": "an><span> { defineAsyncComponent, hydrateOnVisible } <span><span>from<span><span> 'vue'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> AsyncComp<span><span> =<span><span> defineAsyncComponent<span><span>({<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> loader<span><span>: () <span><span>=><span><span> import<span><span>(<span><span>'./Comp.vue'<span><span>),<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> hydrate: <span><span>hydrateOnVisible<span><span>()<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/async.html", "title": "异步组件", "doc_id": "7a4b7032dc0c405e9524b71550ff380f", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 580, "chunk_index": 24, "_doc_id": "24_8941994296404670678"}}
{"doc_id": "25_7184934600613381527", "text": "an><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> hydrate: <span><span>hydrateOnVisible<span><span>()<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>})<span><span><code><pre><div><p>可以选择传递一个侦听器的选项对象值：<p><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>hydrateOnVisible<span><span>({ rootMargin: <span><span>'100px'<span><span> })<span><span><code><pre><div><p>当指定的媒体查询匹配时进行激活。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/async.html", "title": "异步组件", "doc_id": "7a4b7032dc0c405e9524b71550ff380f", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 580, "chunk_index": 25, "_doc_id": "25_7184934600613381527"}}
{"doc_id": "26_1690958253585381531", "text": "pan>({ rootMargin: <span><span>'100px'<span><span> })<span><span><code><pre><div><p>当指定的媒体查询匹配时进行激活。<p><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>import<span><span> { defineAsyncComponent, hydrateOnMediaQuery } <span><span>from<span><span> 'vue'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> AsyncComp<span><span> =<span><span> defineAsyncComponent<span><span>({<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/async.html", "title": "异步组件", "doc_id": "7a4b7032dc0c405e9524b71550ff380f", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 580, "chunk_index": 26, "_doc_id": "26_1690958253585381531"}}
{"doc_id": "27_8572833992986550340", "text": "onst<span><span> AsyncComp<span><span> =<span><span> defineAsyncComponent<span><span>({<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> loader<span><span>: () <span><span>=><span><span> import<span><span>(<span><span>'./Comp.vue'<span><span>),<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> hydrate: <span><span>hydrateOnMediaQuery<span><span>(<span><span>'(max-width:500px)'<span><span>)<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/async.html", "title": "异步组件", "doc_id": "7a4b7032dc0c405e9524b71550ff380f", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 580, "chunk_index": 27, "_doc_id": "27_8572833992986550340"}}
{"doc_id": "28_3519811941850580036", "text": "span><span>hydrateOnMediaQuery<span><span>(<span><span>'(max-width:500px)'<span><span>)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>})<span><span><code><pre><div><h3 id=\"hydrate-on-interaction\">交互时激活 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#hydrate-on-interaction\">​<a><h3><p>当组件元素上触发指定事件时进行激活。完成激活后，触发激活的事件也将被重放。<p><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>import<span><span> { defineAsyncComponent, hydrateOnInteraction } <span><span>from<span><span> 'vue'<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/async.html", "title": "异步组件", "doc_id": "7a4b7032dc0c405e9524b71550ff380f", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 580, "chunk_index": 28, "_doc_id": "28_3519811941850580036"}}
{"doc_id": "29_6381053991299095595", "text": "span> { defineAsyncComponent, hydrateOnInteraction } <span><span>from<span><span> 'vue'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> AsyncComp<span><span> =<span><span> defineAsyncComponent<span><span>({<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> loader<span><span>: () <span><span>=><span><span> import<span><span>(<span><span>'./Comp.vue'<span><span>),<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/async.html", "title": "异步组件", "doc_id": "7a4b7032dc0c405e9524b71550ff380f", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 580, "chunk_index": 29, "_doc_id": "29_6381053991299095595"}}
{"doc_id": "30_6235223752337554727", "text": "() <span><span>=><span><span> import<span><span>(<span><span>'./Comp.vue'<span><span>),<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> hydrate: <span><span>hydrateOnInteraction<span><span>(<span><span>'click'<span><span>)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>})<span><span><code><pre><div><p>也可以是多个事件类型的列表：<p><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>hydrateOnInteraction<span><span>([<span><span>'wheel'<span><span>,", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/async.html", "title": "异步组件", "doc_id": "7a4b7032dc0c405e9524b71550ff380f", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 580, "chunk_index": 30, "_doc_id": "30_6235223752337554727"}}
{"doc_id": "31_1053643826930618168", "text": "\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>hydrateOnInteraction<span><span>([<span><span>'wheel'<span><span>, <span><span>'mouseover'<span><span>])<span><span><code><pre><div><h3 id=\"custom-strategy\">自定义策略 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#custom-strategy\">​<a><h3><div class=\"language-ts\"> <span class=\"lang\">ts<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>import<span><span> { defineAsyncComponent,", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/async.html", "title": "异步组件", "doc_id": "7a4b7032dc0c405e9524b71550ff380f", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 580, "chunk_index": 31, "_doc_id": "31_1053643826930618168"}}
{"doc_id": "32_8042071455179106774", "text": "hiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>import<span><span> { defineAsyncComponent, <span><span>type<span><span> HydrationStrategy } <span><span>from<span><span> 'vue'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> myStrategy<span><span>:<span><span> HydrationStrategy<span><span> =<span><span> (<span><span>hydrate<span><span>, <span><span>forEachElement<span><span>) <span><span>=><span><span> {<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/async.html", "title": "异步组件", "doc_id": "7a4b7032dc0c405e9524b71550ff380f", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 580, "chunk_index": 32, "_doc_id": "32_8042071455179106774"}}
{"doc_id": "33_301825415560836359", "text": "drate<span><span>, <span><span>forEachElement<span><span>) <span><span>=><span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // forEachElement 是一个遍历组件未激活的 DOM 中所有根元素的辅助函数，<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 因为根元素可能是一个片段而非单个元素<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> forEachElement<span><span>(<span><span>el<span><span> =><span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // ...<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> })<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 准备好时调用 `hydrate`<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/async.html", "title": "异步组件", "doc_id": "7a4b7032dc0c405e9524b71550ff380f", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 580, "chunk_index": 33, "_doc_id": "33_301825415560836359"}}
{"doc_id": "34_5657911031742829856", "text": "<span class=\"line\"><span> })<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 准备好时调用 `hydrate`<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> hydrate<span><span>()<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> return<span><span> () <span><span>=><span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 如必要，返回一个销毁函数<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/async.html", "title": "异步组件", "doc_id": "7a4b7032dc0c405e9524b71550ff380f", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 580, "chunk_index": 34, "_doc_id": "34_5657911031742829856"}}
{"doc_id": "35_4597116728225034005", "text": "class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> AsyncComp<span><span> =<span><span> defineAsyncComponent<span><span>({<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> loader<span><span>: () <span><span>=><span><span> import<span><span>(<span><span>'./Comp.vue'<span><span>),<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> hydrate: myStrategy<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/async.html", "title": "异步组件", "doc_id": "7a4b7032dc0c405e9524b71550ff380f", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 580, "chunk_index": 35, "_doc_id": "35_4597116728225034005"}}
{"doc_id": "36_2395395866444149657", "text": "an>'./Comp.vue'<span><span>),<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> hydrate: myStrategy<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>})<span><span><code><pre><div><h2 id=\"using-with-suspense\">搭配 Suspense 使用 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#using-with-suspense\">​<a><h2><p>异步组件可以搭配内置的 <code><Suspense><code> 组件一起使用，若想了解 <code><Suspense><code> 和异步组件之间交互，请参阅 <a href=\"/guide/built-ins/suspense.html\"><code><Suspense><code><a> 章节。<p><div><div>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/async.html", "title": "异步组件", "doc_id": "7a4b7032dc0c405e9524b71550ff380f", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 580, "chunk_index": 36, "_doc_id": "36_2395395866444149657"}}
{"doc_id": "0_4514014591718619665", "text": "<div><div><h1 id=\"transitiongroup\">TransitionGroup <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#transitiongroup\">​<a><h1><p><code><TransitionGroup><code> 是一个内置组件，用于对 <code>v-for<code> 列表中的元素或组件的插入、移除和顺序改变添加动画效果。<p><h2 id=\"differences-from-transition\">和 <code><Transition><code> 的区别 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#differences-from-transition\">​<a><h2><p><code><TransitionGroup><code> 支持和 <code><Transition><code> 基本相同的 props、CSS 过渡 class 和 JavaScript 钩子监听器，但有以下几点区别：<p><ul><li><p>默认情况下，它不会渲染一个容器元素。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/transition-group.html", "title": "TransitionGroup | Vue.js", "doc_id": "f768d56eaa7642eba854e50580f07c33", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 306, "chunk_index": 0, "_doc_id": "0_4514014591718619665"}}
{"doc_id": "1_2400070267131954004", "text": "nsition><code> 基本相同的 props、CSS 过渡 class 和 JavaScript 钩子监听器，但有以下几点区别：<p><ul><li><p>默认情况下，它不会渲染一个容器元素。但你可以通过传入 <code>tag<code> prop 来指定一个元素作为容器元素来渲染。<p><li><li><p><a href=\"./transition.html#transition-modes\">过渡模式<a>在这里不可用，因为我们不再是在互斥的元素之间进行切换。<p><li><li><p>列表中的每个元素都<strong>必须<strong>有一个独一无二的 <code>key<code> attribute。<p><li><li><p>CSS 过渡 class 会被应用在列表内的元素上，<strong>而不是<strong>容器元素上。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/transition-group.html", "title": "TransitionGroup | Vue.js", "doc_id": "f768d56eaa7642eba854e50580f07c33", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 306, "chunk_index": 1, "_doc_id": "1_2400070267131954004"}}
{"doc_id": "2_6904266375694332298", "text": "有一个独一无二的 <code>key<code> attribute。<p><li><li><p>CSS 过渡 class 会被应用在列表内的元素上，<strong>而不是<strong>容器元素上。<p><li><ul><div class=\"tip custom-block\"><p class=\"custom-block-title\">TIP<p><p>当在 <a href=\"/guide/essentials/component-basics.html#in-dom-template-parsing-caveats\">DOM 内模板<a>中使用时，组件名需要写为 <code><transition-group><code>。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/transition-group.html", "title": "TransitionGroup | Vue.js", "doc_id": "f768d56eaa7642eba854e50580f07c33", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 306, "chunk_index": 2, "_doc_id": "2_6904266375694332298"}}
{"doc_id": "3_4486852926042184865", "text": "-basics.html#in-dom-template-parsing-caveats\">DOM 内模板<a>中使用时，组件名需要写为 <code><transition-group><code>。<p><div><h2 id=\"enter-leave-transitions\">进入 / 离开动画 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#enter-leave-transitions\">​<a><h2><p>这里是 <code><TransitionGroup><code> 对一个 <code>v-for<code> 列表添加进入 / 离开动画的示例：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>TransitionGroup<span><span> name<span><span>=<span><span>\"list\"<span><span> tag<span><span>=<span><span>\"ul\"<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/transition-group.html", "title": "TransitionGroup | Vue.js", "doc_id": "f768d56eaa7642eba854e50580f07c33", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 306, "chunk_index": 3, "_doc_id": "3_4486852926042184865"}}
{"doc_id": "4_6057197341509128545", "text": "pan><span>=<span><span>\"list\"<span><span> tag<span><span>=<span><span>\"ul\"<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>li<span><span> v-for<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>item <span><span>in<span><span> items<span><span>\"<span><span> :<span><span>key<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>item<span><span>\"<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> {{ item }}<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> </<span><span>li<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/transition-group.html", "title": "TransitionGroup | Vue.js", "doc_id": "f768d56eaa7642eba854e50580f07c33", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 306, "chunk_index": 4, "_doc_id": "4_6057197341509128545"}}
{"doc_id": "5_7408484230846532430", "text": "\"><span> {{ item }}<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> </<span><span>li<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>TransitionGroup<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><div class=\"language-css\"> <span class=\"lang\">css<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>.list-enter-active<span><span>,<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>.list-leave-active<span><span> {<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/transition-group.html", "title": "TransitionGroup | Vue.js", "doc_id": "f768d56eaa7642eba854e50580f07c33", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 306, "chunk_index": 5, "_doc_id": "5_7408484230846532430"}}
{"doc_id": "6_7934826525312403997", "text": "tive<span><span>,<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>.list-leave-active<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> transition<span><span>: <span><span>all<span><span> 0.5<span><span>s<span><span> ease<span><span>;<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>.list-enter-from<span><span>,<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>.list-leave-to<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> opacity<span><span>: <span><span>0<span><span>;<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/transition-group.html", "title": "TransitionGroup | Vue.js", "doc_id": "f768d56eaa7642eba854e50580f07c33", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 306, "chunk_index": 6, "_doc_id": "6_7934826525312403997"}}
{"doc_id": "7_1855543228609076189", "text": "{<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> opacity<span><span>: <span><span>0<span><span>;<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> transform<span><span>: <span><span>translateX<span><span>(<span><span>30<span><span>px<span><span>);<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/transition-group.html", "title": "TransitionGroup | Vue.js", "doc_id": "f768d56eaa7642eba854e50580f07c33", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 306, "chunk_index": 7, "_doc_id": "7_1855543228609076189"}}
{"doc_id": "8_5273630262158899686", "text": "n><span>: <span><span>translateX<span><span>(<span><span>30<span><span>px<span><span>);<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span><code><pre><div><h2 id=\"move-transitions\">移动动画 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#move-transitions\">​<a><h2><p>上面的示例有一些明显的缺陷：当某一项被插入或移除时，它周围的元素会立即发生“跳跃”而不是平稳地移动。我们可以通过添加一些额外的 CSS 规则来解决这个问题：<p><div class=\"language-css\"> <span class=\"lang\">css<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line highlighted\"><span>.list-move<span><span>, <span><span>/* 对移动中的元素应用的过渡 */<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/transition-group.html", "title": "TransitionGroup | Vue.js", "doc_id": "f768d56eaa7642eba854e50580f07c33", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 306, "chunk_index": 8, "_doc_id": "8_5273630262158899686"}}
{"doc_id": "9_2785081120684608117", "text": "n class=\"line highlighted\"><span>.list-move<span><span>, <span><span>/* 对移动中的元素应用的过渡 */<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>.list-enter-active<span><span>,<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>.list-leave-active<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> transition<span><span>: <span><span>all<span><span> 0.5<span><span>s<span><span> ease<span><span>;<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>.list-enter-from<span><span>,<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/transition-group.html", "title": "TransitionGroup | Vue.js", "doc_id": "f768d56eaa7642eba854e50580f07c33", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 306, "chunk_index": 9, "_doc_id": "9_2785081120684608117"}}
{"doc_id": "10_8531640093077522828", "text": "<span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>.list-enter-from<span><span>,<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>.list-leave-to<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> opacity<span><span>: <span><span>0<span><span>;<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> transform<span><span>: <span><span>translateX<span><span>(<span><span>30<span><span>px<span><span>);<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/transition-group.html", "title": "TransitionGroup | Vue.js", "doc_id": "f768d56eaa7642eba854e50580f07c33", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 306, "chunk_index": 10, "_doc_id": "10_8531640093077522828"}}
{"doc_id": "11_2770781496471757691", "text": "<span>px<span><span>);<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line highlighted\"><span>/* 确保将离开的元素从布局流中删除<span><span>\n<span class=\"line highlighted\"><span> 以便能够正确地计算移动的动画。 */<span><span>\n<span class=\"line highlighted\"><span>.list-leave-active<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line highlighted\"><span> position<span><span>: <span><span>absolute<span><span>;<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/transition-group.html", "title": "TransitionGroup | Vue.js", "doc_id": "f768d56eaa7642eba854e50580f07c33", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 306, "chunk_index": 11, "_doc_id": "11_2770781496471757691"}}
{"doc_id": "12_2430353585370365797", "text": "class=\"line highlighted\"><span> position<span><span>: <span><span>absolute<span><span>;<span><span>\n<span class=\"line highlighted\"><span>}<span><span><code><pre><div><p>现在它看起来好多了，甚至对整个列表执行洗牌的动画也都非常流畅：<p><p><a href=\"/examples/#list-transition\">完整的示例<a><p><h3 id=\"custom-transitiongroup-classes\">自定义过渡组 class <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#custom-transitiongroup-classes\">​<a><h3><p>你还可以通过向 <code><TransitionGroup><code> 传递 <code>moveClass<code> prop 为移动元素指定自定义过渡 class，类似于<a href=\"/guide/built-ins/transition.html#custom-transition-classes\">自定义过渡 class<a>。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/transition-group.html", "title": "TransitionGroup | Vue.js", "doc_id": "f768d56eaa7642eba854e50580f07c33", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 306, "chunk_index": 12, "_doc_id": "12_2430353585370365797"}}
{"doc_id": "13_3206638181786586874", "text": "定自定义过渡 class，类似于<a href=\"/guide/built-ins/transition.html#custom-transition-classes\">自定义过渡 class<a>。<p><h2 id=\"staggering-list-transitions\">渐进延迟列表动画 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#staggering-list-transitions\">​<a><h2><p>通过在 JavaScript 钩子中读取元素的 data attribute，我们可以实现带渐进延迟的列表动画。首先，我们把每一个元素的索引渲染为该元素上的一个 data attribute：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>TransitionGroup<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/transition-group.html", "title": "TransitionGroup | Vue.js", "doc_id": "f768d56eaa7642eba854e50580f07c33", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 306, "chunk_index": 13, "_doc_id": "13_3206638181786586874"}}
{"doc_id": "14_3305835891848157904", "text": "\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>TransitionGroup<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> tag<span><span>=<span><span>\"ul\"<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> :<span><span>css<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>false<span><span>\"<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> @<span><span>before-enter<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>onBeforeEnter<span><span>\"<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/transition-group.html", "title": "TransitionGroup | Vue.js", "doc_id": "f768d56eaa7642eba854e50580f07c33", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 306, "chunk_index": 14, "_doc_id": "14_3305835891848157904"}}
{"doc_id": "15_4899801130297471545", "text": "span><span>before-enter<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>onBeforeEnter<span><span>\"<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> @<span><span>enter<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>onEnter<span><span>\"<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> @<span><span>leave<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>onLeave<span><span>\"<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>li<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/transition-group.html", "title": "TransitionGroup | Vue.js", "doc_id": "f768d56eaa7642eba854e50580f07c33", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 306, "chunk_index": 15, "_doc_id": "15_4899801130297471545"}}
{"doc_id": "16_7400260294152264680", "text": "<span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>li<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> v-for<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>(item, index) <span><span>in<span><span> computedList<span><span>\"<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> :<span><span>key<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>item.msg<span><span>\"<span><span>\n<span class=\"line highlighted\"><span> :<span><span>data-index<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>index<span><span>\"<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/transition-group.html", "title": "TransitionGroup | Vue.js", "doc_id": "f768d56eaa7642eba854e50580f07c33", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 306, "chunk_index": 16, "_doc_id": "16_7400260294152264680"}}
{"doc_id": "17_3642384476877518193", "text": "><span> :<span><span>data-index<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>index<span><span>\"<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> ><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> {{ item.msg }}<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> </<span><span>li<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/transition-group.html", "title": "TransitionGroup | Vue.js", "doc_id": "f768d56eaa7642eba854e50580f07c33", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 306, "chunk_index": 17, "_doc_id": "17_3642384476877518193"}}
{"doc_id": "18_5170250745508780354", "text": "pan> {{ item.msg }}<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> </<span><span>li<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>TransitionGroup<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>接着，在 JavaScript 钩子中，我们基于当前元素的 data attribute 对该元素的进场动画添加一个延迟。以下是一个基于 <a href=\"https://gsap.com/\" target=\"_blank\">GSAP library<a> 的动画示例：<p><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>function<span><span> onEnter<span><span>(<span><span>el<span><span>, <span><span>done<span><span>) {<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/transition-group.html", "title": "TransitionGroup | Vue.js", "doc_id": "f768d56eaa7642eba854e50580f07c33", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 306, "chunk_index": 18, "_doc_id": "18_5170250745508780354"}}
{"doc_id": "19_5018598575436779432", "text": "><span> onEnter<span><span>(<span><span>el<span><span>, <span><span>done<span><span>) {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> gsap.<span><span>to<span><span>(el, {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> opacity: <span><span>1<span><span>,<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> height: <span><span>'1.6em'<span><span>,<span><span>\n<span class=\"line highlighted\"><span> delay: el.dataset.index <span><span>*<span><span> 0.15<span><span>,<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> onComplete: done<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/transition-group.html", "title": "TransitionGroup | Vue.js", "doc_id": "f768d56eaa7642eba854e50580f07c33", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 306, "chunk_index": 19, "_doc_id": "19_5018598575436779432"}}
{"doc_id": "20_4493975790337992471", "text": ">*<span><span> 0.15<span><span>,<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> onComplete: done<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> })<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span><code><pre><div>\n<p><strong>参考<strong><p><div><div>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/transition-group.html", "title": "TransitionGroup | Vue.js", "doc_id": "f768d56eaa7642eba854e50580f07c33", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 306, "chunk_index": 20, "_doc_id": "20_4493975790337992471"}}
{"doc_id": "0_4989804403213058759", "text": "<div><div><h1 id=\"keepalive\">KeepAlive <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#keepalive\">​<a><h1><p><code><KeepAlive><code> 是一个内置组件，它的功能是在多个组件间动态切换时缓存被移除的组件实例。<p><h2 id=\"basic-usage\">基本使用 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#basic-usage\">​<a><h2><p>在组件基础章节中，", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/keep-alive.html", "title": "KeepAlive | Vue.js", "doc_id": "3f5dd076244b4382bc02074238732ed1", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 290, "chunk_index": 0, "_doc_id": "0_4989804403213058759"}}
{"doc_id": "1_6148776128071863362", "text": "的组件实例。<p><h2 id=\"basic-usage\">基本使用 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#basic-usage\">​<a><h2><p>在组件基础章节中，我们已经介绍了通过特殊的 <code><component><code> 元素来实现<a href=\"/guide/essentials/component-basics.html#dynamic-components\">动态组件<a>的用法：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>component<span><span> :<span><span>is<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>activeComponent<span><span>\"<span><span> /><span><span><code><pre><div><p>默认情况下，", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/keep-alive.html", "title": "KeepAlive | Vue.js", "doc_id": "3f5dd076244b4382bc02074238732ed1", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 290, "chunk_index": 1, "_doc_id": "1_6148776128071863362"}}
{"doc_id": "2_3997623110509074729", "text": "><span>\"<span><span>activeComponent<span><span>\"<span><span> /><span><span><code><pre><div><p>默认情况下，一个组件实例在被替换掉后会被销毁。这会导致它丢失其中所有已变化的状态——当这个组件再一次被显示时，会创建一个只带有初始状态的新实例。<p><p>在下面的例子中，你会看到两个有状态的组件——A 有一个计数器，而 B 有一个通过 <code>v-model<code> 同步 input 框输入内容的文字展示。尝试先更改一下任意一个组件的状态，然后切走，再切回来：<p><p>你会发现在切回来之后，之前已更改的状态都被重置了。<p><p>在切换时创建新的组件实例通常是有意义的，但在这个例子中，我们的确想要组件能在被“切走”的时候保留它们的状态。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/keep-alive.html", "title": "KeepAlive | Vue.js", "doc_id": "3f5dd076244b4382bc02074238732ed1", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 290, "chunk_index": 2, "_doc_id": "2_3997623110509074729"}}
{"doc_id": "3_420059748672566840", "text": "后切走，再切回来：<p><p>你会发现在切回来之后，之前已更改的状态都被重置了。<p><p>在切换时创建新的组件实例通常是有意义的，但在这个例子中，我们的确想要组件能在被“切走”的时候保留它们的状态。要解决这个问题，我们可以用 <code><KeepAlive><code> 内置组件将这些动态组件包装起来：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><!-- 非活跃的组件将会被缓存！ --><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>KeepAlive<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/keep-alive.html", "title": "KeepAlive | Vue.js", "doc_id": "3f5dd076244b4382bc02074238732ed1", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 290, "chunk_index": 3, "_doc_id": "3_420059748672566840"}}
{"doc_id": "4_6455751273208590143", "text": "跃的组件将会被缓存！ --><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>KeepAlive<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>component<span><span> :<span><span>is<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>activeComponent<span><span>\"<span><span> /><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/keep-alive.html", "title": "KeepAlive | Vue.js", "doc_id": "3f5dd076244b4382bc02074238732ed1", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 290, "chunk_index": 4, "_doc_id": "4_6455751273208590143"}}
{"doc_id": "5_2383290219144296124", "text": "pan>is<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>activeComponent<span><span>\"<span><span> /><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>KeepAlive<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>现在，在组件切换时状态也能被保留了：<p><div class=\"tip custom-block\"><p class=\"custom-block-title\">TIP<p><p>在 <a href=\"/guide/essentials/component-basics.html#in-dom-template-parsing-caveats\">DOM 内模板<a>中使用时，它应该被写为 <code><keep-alive><code>。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/keep-alive.html", "title": "KeepAlive | Vue.js", "doc_id": "3f5dd076244b4382bc02074238732ed1", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 290, "chunk_index": 5, "_doc_id": "5_2383290219144296124"}}
{"doc_id": "6_7612219892049010372", "text": "mponent-basics.html#in-dom-template-parsing-caveats\">DOM 内模板<a>中使用时，它应该被写为 <code><keep-alive><code>。<p><div><h2 id=\"include-exclude\">包含/排除 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#include-exclude\">​<a><h2><p><code><KeepAlive><code> 默认会缓存内部的所有组件实例，但我们可以通过 <code>include<code> 和 <code>exclude<code> prop 来定制该行为。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/keep-alive.html", "title": "KeepAlive | Vue.js", "doc_id": "3f5dd076244b4382bc02074238732ed1", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 290, "chunk_index": 6, "_doc_id": "6_7612219892049010372"}}
{"doc_id": "7_482111824719089712", "text": "code><KeepAlive><code> 默认会缓存内部的所有组件实例，但我们可以通过 <code>include<code> 和 <code>exclude<code> prop 来定制该行为。这两个 prop 的值都可以是一个以英文逗号分隔的字符串、一个正则表达式，或是包含这两种类型的一个数组：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><!-- 以英文逗号分隔的字符串 --><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>KeepAlive<span><span> include<span><span>=<span><span>\"a,b\"<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/keep-alive.html", "title": "KeepAlive | Vue.js", "doc_id": "3f5dd076244b4382bc02074238732ed1", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 290, "chunk_index": 7, "_doc_id": "7_482111824719089712"}}
{"doc_id": "8_1482144287194012486", "text": "n><<span><span>KeepAlive<span><span> include<span><span>=<span><span>\"a,b\"<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>component<span><span> :<span><span>is<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>view<span><span>\"<span><span> /><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>KeepAlive<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><!-- 正则表达式 (需使用 `v-bind`) --><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/keep-alive.html", "title": "KeepAlive | Vue.js", "doc_id": "3f5dd076244b4382bc02074238732ed1", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 290, "chunk_index": 8, "_doc_id": "8_1482144287194012486"}}
{"doc_id": "9_2687098795849672736", "text": "<span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><!-- 正则表达式 (需使用 `v-bind`) --><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>KeepAlive<span><span> :<span><span>include<span><span>=<span><span>\"/<span><span>a<span><span>|<span><span>b<span><span>/\"<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>component<span><span> :<span><span>is<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>view<span><span>\"<span><span> /><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/keep-alive.html", "title": "KeepAlive | Vue.js", "doc_id": "3f5dd076244b4382bc02074238732ed1", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 290, "chunk_index": 9, "_doc_id": "9_2687098795849672736"}}
{"doc_id": "10_4659088121219042983", "text": "> :<span><span>is<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>view<span><span>\"<span><span> /><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>KeepAlive<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><!-- 数组 (需使用 `v-bind`) --><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>KeepAlive<span><span> :<span><span>include<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>[<span><span>'a'<span><span>, <span><span>'b'<span><span>]<span><span>\"<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/keep-alive.html", "title": "KeepAlive | Vue.js", "doc_id": "3f5dd076244b4382bc02074238732ed1", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 290, "chunk_index": 10, "_doc_id": "10_4659088121219042983"}}
{"doc_id": "11_8697693222707296300", "text": "an>[<span><span>'a'<span><span>, <span><span>'b'<span><span>]<span><span>\"<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>component<span><span> :<span><span>is<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>view<span><span>\"<span><span> /><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>KeepAlive<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>它会根据组件的 <a href=\"/api/options-misc.html#name\"><code>name<code><a> 选项进行匹配，所以组件如果想要条件性地被 <code>KeepAlive<code> 缓存，就必须显式声明一个 <code>name<code> 选项。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/keep-alive.html", "title": "KeepAlive | Vue.js", "doc_id": "3f5dd076244b4382bc02074238732ed1", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 290, "chunk_index": 11, "_doc_id": "11_8697693222707296300"}}
{"doc_id": "12_7499406190585333616", "text": "me\"><code>name<code><a> 选项进行匹配，所以组件如果想要条件性地被 <code>KeepAlive<code> 缓存，就必须显式声明一个 <code>name<code> 选项。<p><div class=\"tip custom-block\"><p class=\"custom-block-title\">TIP<p><p>在 3.2.34 或以上的版本中，使用 <code><script setup><code> 的单文件组件会自动根据文件名生成对应的 <code>name<code> 选项，无需再手动声明。<p><div><h2 id=\"max-cached-instances\">最大缓存实例数 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#max-cached-instances\">​<a><h2><p>我们可以通过传入 <code>max<code> prop 来限制可被缓存的最大组件实例数。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/keep-alive.html", "title": "KeepAlive | Vue.js", "doc_id": "3f5dd076244b4382bc02074238732ed1", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 290, "chunk_index": 12, "_doc_id": "12_7499406190585333616"}}
{"doc_id": "13_2806937603747017131", "text": "eader-anchor\" href=\"#max-cached-instances\">​<a><h2><p>我们可以通过传入 <code>max<code> prop 来限制可被缓存的最大组件实例数。<code><KeepAlive><code> 的行为在指定了 <code>max<code> 后类似一个 <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Cache_replacement_policies#Least_recently_used_(LRU)\" target=\"_blank\">LRU 缓存<a>：如果缓存的实例数量即将超过指定的那个最大数量，则最久没有被访问的缓存实例将被销毁，以便为新的实例腾出空间。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/keep-alive.html", "title": "KeepAlive | Vue.js", "doc_id": "3f5dd076244b4382bc02074238732ed1", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 290, "chunk_index": 13, "_doc_id": "13_2806937603747017131"}}
{"doc_id": "14_1877110604149465783", "text": "recently_used_(LRU)\" target=\"_blank\">LRU 缓存<a>：如果缓存的实例数量即将超过指定的那个最大数量，则最久没有被访问的缓存实例将被销毁，以便为新的实例腾出空间。<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>KeepAlive<span><span> :<span><span>max<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>10<span><span>\"<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/keep-alive.html", "title": "KeepAlive | Vue.js", "doc_id": "3f5dd076244b4382bc02074238732ed1", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 290, "chunk_index": 14, "_doc_id": "14_1877110604149465783"}}
{"doc_id": "15_14652681894071931", "text": "pan> :<span><span>max<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>10<span><span>\"<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>component<span><span> :<span><span>is<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>activeComponent<span><span>\"<span><span> /><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/keep-alive.html", "title": "KeepAlive | Vue.js", "doc_id": "3f5dd076244b4382bc02074238732ed1", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 290, "chunk_index": 15, "_doc_id": "15_14652681894071931"}}
{"doc_id": "16_5883685302939283313", "text": "pan>is<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>activeComponent<span><span>\"<span><span> /><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>KeepAlive<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><h2 id=\"lifecycle-of-cached-instance\">缓存实例的生命周期 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#lifecycle-of-cached-instance\">​<a><h2><p>当一个组件实例从 DOM 上移除但因为被 <code><KeepAlive><code> 缓存而仍作为组件树的一部分时，它将变为<strong>不活跃<strong>状态而不是被卸载。当一个组件实例作为缓存树的一部分插入到 DOM 中时，它将重新<strong>被激活<strong>。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/keep-alive.html", "title": "KeepAlive | Vue.js", "doc_id": "3f5dd076244b4382bc02074238732ed1", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 290, "chunk_index": 16, "_doc_id": "16_5883685302939283313"}}
{"doc_id": "17_981361515142587378", "text": "> 缓存而仍作为组件树的一部分时，它将变为<strong>不活跃<strong>状态而不是被卸载。当一个组件实例作为缓存树的一部分插入到 DOM 中时，它将重新<strong>被激活<strong>。<p><div class=\"composition-api\"><p>一个持续存在的组件可以通过 <a href=\"/api/composition-api-lifecycle.html#onactivated\"><code>onActivated()<code><a> 和 <a href=\"/api/composition-api-lifecycle.html#ondeactivated\"><code>onDeactivated()<code><a> 注册相应的两个状态的生命周期钩子：<p><div class=\"language-vue\"> <span class=\"lang\">vue<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>script<span><span> setup<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/keep-alive.html", "title": "KeepAlive | Vue.js", "doc_id": "3f5dd076244b4382bc02074238732ed1", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 290, "chunk_index": 17, "_doc_id": "17_981361515142587378"}}
{"doc_id": "18_3124383691955215687", "text": "code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>script<span><span> setup<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>import<span><span> { onActivated, onDeactivated } <span><span>from<span><span> 'vue'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>onActivated<span><span>(() <span><span>=><span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 调用时机为首次挂载<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 以及每次从缓存中被重新插入时<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>})<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/keep-alive.html", "title": "KeepAlive | Vue.js", "doc_id": "3f5dd076244b4382bc02074238732ed1", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 290, "chunk_index": 18, "_doc_id": "18_3124383691955215687"}}
{"doc_id": "19_6688858546604246095", "text": "an>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 以及每次从缓存中被重新插入时<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>})<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>onDeactivated<span><span>(() <span><span>=><span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 在从 DOM 上移除、进入缓存<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 以及组件卸载时调用<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>})<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/keep-alive.html", "title": "KeepAlive | Vue.js", "doc_id": "3f5dd076244b4382bc02074238732ed1", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 290, "chunk_index": 19, "_doc_id": "19_6688858546604246095"}}
{"doc_id": "20_119287060650951431", "text": "n><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 以及组件卸载时调用<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>})<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>script<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><div><div class=\"options-api\"><p>一个持续存在的组件可以通过 <a href=\"/api/options-lifecycle.html#activated\"><code>activated<code><a> 和 <a href=\"/api/options-lifecycle.html#deactivated\"><code>deactivated<code><a> 选项来注册相应的两个状态的生命周期钩子：<p><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/keep-alive.html", "title": "KeepAlive | Vue.js", "doc_id": "3f5dd076244b4382bc02074238732ed1", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 290, "chunk_index": 20, "_doc_id": "20_119287060650951431"}}
{"doc_id": "21_7278274509844647179", "text": "b-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> activated<span><span>() {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 在首次挂载、<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 以及每次从缓存中被重新插入的时候调用<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> },<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> deactivated<span><span>() {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 在从 DOM 上移除、进入缓存<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 以及组件卸载时调用<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/keep-alive.html", "title": "KeepAlive | Vue.js", "doc_id": "3f5dd076244b4382bc02074238732ed1", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 290, "chunk_index": 21, "_doc_id": "21_7278274509844647179"}}
{"doc_id": "22_4448178115110755540", "text": "ass=\"line\"><span> // 在从 DOM 上移除、进入缓存<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 以及组件卸载时调用<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span><code><pre><div><div><p>请注意：<p>\n<p><strong>参考<strong><p><div><div>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/keep-alive.html", "title": "KeepAlive | Vue.js", "doc_id": "3f5dd076244b4382bc02074238732ed1", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 290, "chunk_index": 22, "_doc_id": "22_4448178115110755540"}}
{"doc_id": "0_5930693022822569690", "text": "<div><div><h1 id=\"composables\">组合式函数 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#composables\">​<a><h1><div class=\"tip custom-block\"><p class=\"custom-block-title\">TIP<p><p>此章节假设你已经对组合式 API 有了基本的了解。如果你只学习过选项式 API，你可以使用左侧边栏上方的切换按钮将 API 风格切换为组合式 API 后，重新阅读<a href=\"/guide/essentials/reactivity-fundamentals.html\">响应性基础<a>和<a href=\"/guide/essentials/lifecycle.html\">生命周期钩子<a>两个章节。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/reusability/composables.html", "title": "组合式函数", "doc_id": "0bf7a51f11074d58bdca404db75fd3df", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1263, "chunk_index": 0, "_doc_id": "0_5930693022822569690"}}
{"doc_id": "1_8300494895423891949", "text": "als/reactivity-fundamentals.html\">响应性基础<a>和<a href=\"/guide/essentials/lifecycle.html\">生命周期钩子<a>两个章节。<p><div><h2 id=\"what-is-a-composable\">什么是“组合式函数”？ <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#what-is-a-composable\">​<a><h2><p>在 Vue 应用的概念中，“组合式函数”(Composables) 是一个利用 Vue 的组合式 API 来封装和复用<strong>有状态逻辑<strong>的函数。<p><p>当构建前端应用时，我们常常需要复用公共任务的逻辑。例如为了在不同地方格式化时间，我们可能会抽取一个可复用的日期格式化函数。这个函数封装了<strong>无状态的逻辑<strong>：它在接收一些输入后立刻返回所期望的输出。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/reusability/composables.html", "title": "组合式函数", "doc_id": "0bf7a51f11074d58bdca404db75fd3df", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1263, "chunk_index": 1, "_doc_id": "1_8300494895423891949"}}
{"doc_id": "2_7104429178137707608", "text": "常常需要复用公共任务的逻辑。例如为了在不同地方格式化时间，我们可能会抽取一个可复用的日期格式化函数。这个函数封装了<strong>无状态的逻辑<strong>：它在接收一些输入后立刻返回所期望的输出。复用无状态逻辑的库有很多，比如你可能已经用过的 <a href=\"https://lodash.com/\" target=\"_blank\">lodash<a> 或是 <a href=\"https://date-fns.org/\" target=\"_blank\">date-fns<a>。<p><p>相比之下，有状态逻辑负责管理会随时间而变化的状态。一个简单的例子是跟踪当前鼠标在页面中的位置。在实际应用中，也可能是像触摸手势或与数据库的连接状态这样的更复杂的逻辑。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/reusability/composables.html", "title": "组合式函数", "doc_id": "0bf7a51f11074d58bdca404db75fd3df", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1263, "chunk_index": 2, "_doc_id": "2_7104429178137707608"}}
{"doc_id": "3_699266774475478755", "text": "ate-fns<a>。<p><p>相比之下，有状态逻辑负责管理会随时间而变化的状态。一个简单的例子是跟踪当前鼠标在页面中的位置。在实际应用中，也可能是像触摸手势或与数据库的连接状态这样的更复杂的逻辑。<p><h2 id=\"mouse-tracker-example\">鼠标跟踪器示例 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#mouse-tracker-example\">​<a><h2><p>如果我们要直接在组件中使用组合式 API 实现鼠标跟踪功能，它会是这样的：<p><div class=\"vp-code-block-title\"><p class=\"vp-code-block-title-bar\"><span class=\"vp-code-block-title-text\">MouseComponent.vue<span><p><div class=\"language-vue\"> <span class=\"lang\">vue<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>script<span><span> setup<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/reusability/composables.html", "title": "组合式函数", "doc_id": "0bf7a51f11074d58bdca404db75fd3df", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1263, "chunk_index": 3, "_doc_id": "3_699266774475478755"}}
{"doc_id": "4_8658540025614466989", "text": "code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>script<span><span> setup<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>import<span><span> { ref, onMounted, onUnmounted } <span><span>from<span><span> 'vue'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> x<span><span> =<span><span> ref<span><span>(<span><span>0<span><span>)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> y<span><span> =<span><span> ref<span><span>(<span><span>0<span><span>)<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/reusability/composables.html", "title": "组合式函数", "doc_id": "0bf7a51f11074d58bdca404db75fd3df", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1263, "chunk_index": 4, "_doc_id": "4_8658540025614466989"}}
{"doc_id": "5_3237110903005723024", "text": "onst<span><span> y<span><span> =<span><span> ref<span><span>(<span><span>0<span><span>)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>function<span><span> update<span><span>(<span><span>event<span><span>) {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> x.value <span><span>=<span><span> event.pageX<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> y.value <span><span>=<span><span> event.pageY<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/reusability/composables.html", "title": "组合式函数", "doc_id": "0bf7a51f11074d58bdca404db75fd3df", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1263, "chunk_index": 5, "_doc_id": "5_3237110903005723024"}}
{"doc_id": "6_7564593860135505209", "text": "pan><span> event.pageY<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>onMounted<span><span>(() <span><span>=><span><span> window.<span><span>addEventListener<span><span>(<span><span>'mousemove'<span><span>, update))<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>onUnmounted<span><span>(() <span><span>=><span><span> window.<span><span>removeEventListener<span><span>(<span><span>'mousemove'<span><span>, update))<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/reusability/composables.html", "title": "组合式函数", "doc_id": "0bf7a51f11074d58bdca404db75fd3df", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1263, "chunk_index": 6, "_doc_id": "6_7564593860135505209"}}
{"doc_id": "7_8154307333830857410", "text": "pan><span>removeEventListener<span><span>(<span><span>'mousemove'<span><span>, update))<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>script<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>template<span><span>>Mouse position is at: {{ x }}, {{ y }}</<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><div><p>但是，如果我们想在多个组件中复用这个相同的逻辑呢？", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/reusability/composables.html", "title": "组合式函数", "doc_id": "0bf7a51f11074d58bdca404db75fd3df", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1263, "chunk_index": 7, "_doc_id": "7_8154307333830857410"}}
{"doc_id": "8_8261816011225153289", "text": "y }}</<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><div><p>但是，如果我们想在多个组件中复用这个相同的逻辑呢？我们可以把这个逻辑以一个组合式函数的形式提取到外部文件中：<p><div class=\"vp-code-block-title\"><p class=\"vp-code-block-title-bar\"><span class=\"vp-code-block-title-text\">mouse.js<span><p><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>import<span><span> { ref, onMounted, onUnmounted } <span><span>from<span><span> 'vue'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/reusability/composables.html", "title": "组合式函数", "doc_id": "0bf7a51f11074d58bdca404db75fd3df", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1263, "chunk_index": 8, "_doc_id": "8_8261816011225153289"}}
{"doc_id": "9_7487559153795177610", "text": ", onMounted, onUnmounted } <span><span>from<span><span> 'vue'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 按照惯例，组合式函数名以“use”开头<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> function<span><span> useMouse<span><span>() {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 被组合式函数封装和管理的状态<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> const<span><span> x<span><span> =<span><span> ref<span><span>(<span><span>0<span><span>)<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/reusability/composables.html", "title": "组合式函数", "doc_id": "0bf7a51f11074d58bdca404db75fd3df", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1263, "chunk_index": 9, "_doc_id": "9_7487559153795177610"}}
{"doc_id": "10_3298029768640642935", "text": "onst<span><span> x<span><span> =<span><span> ref<span><span>(<span><span>0<span><span>)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> const<span><span> y<span><span> =<span><span> ref<span><span>(<span><span>0<span><span>)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 组合式函数可以随时更改其状态。<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> function<span><span> update<span><span>(<span><span>event<span><span>) {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> x.value <span><span>=<span><span> event.pageX<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/reusability/composables.html", "title": "组合式函数", "doc_id": "0bf7a51f11074d58bdca404db75fd3df", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1263, "chunk_index": 10, "_doc_id": "10_3298029768640642935"}}
{"doc_id": "11_2132808474300484907", "text": ") {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> x.value <span><span>=<span><span> event.pageX<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> y.value <span><span>=<span><span> event.pageY<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 一个组合式函数也可以挂靠在所属组件的生命周期上<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 来启动和卸载副作用<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/reusability/composables.html", "title": "组合式函数", "doc_id": "0bf7a51f11074d58bdca404db75fd3df", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1263, "chunk_index": 11, "_doc_id": "11_2132808474300484907"}}
{"doc_id": "12_8847368680818751296", "text": "e\"><span> // 一个组合式函数也可以挂靠在所属组件的生命周期上<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 来启动和卸载副作用<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> onMounted<span><span>(() <span><span>=><span><span> window.<span><span>addEventListener<span><span>(<span><span>'mousemove'<span><span>, update))<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> onUnmounted<span><span>(() <span><span>=><span><span> window.<span><span>removeEventListener<span><span>(<span><span>'mousemove'<span><span>, update))<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/reusability/composables.html", "title": "组合式函数", "doc_id": "0bf7a51f11074d58bdca404db75fd3df", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1263, "chunk_index": 12, "_doc_id": "12_8847368680818751296"}}
{"doc_id": "13_8741406010009240757", "text": "ner<span><span>(<span><span>'mousemove'<span><span>, update))<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 通过返回值暴露所管理的状态<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> return<span><span> { x, y }<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/reusability/composables.html", "title": "组合式函数", "doc_id": "0bf7a51f11074d58bdca404db75fd3df", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1263, "chunk_index": 13, "_doc_id": "13_8741406010009240757"}}
{"doc_id": "14_4303720393146406975", "text": "pan> // 通过返回值暴露所管理的状态<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> return<span><span> { x, y }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span><code><pre><div><div><p>下面是它在组件中使用的方式：<p><div class=\"vp-code-block-title\"><p class=\"vp-code-block-title-bar\"><span class=\"vp-code-block-title-text\">MouseComponent.vue<span><p><div class=\"language-vue\"> <span class=\"lang\">vue<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>script<span><span> setup<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/reusability/composables.html", "title": "组合式函数", "doc_id": "0bf7a51f11074d58bdca404db75fd3df", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1263, "chunk_index": 14, "_doc_id": "14_4303720393146406975"}}
{"doc_id": "15_6247734200711445435", "text": "code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>script<span><span> setup<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>import<span><span> { useMouse } <span><span>from<span><span> './mouse.js'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> { <span><span>x<span><span>, <span><span>y<span><span> } <span><span>=<span><span> useMouse<span><span>()<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>script<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/reusability/composables.html", "title": "组合式函数", "doc_id": "0bf7a51f11074d58bdca404db75fd3df", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1263, "chunk_index": 15, "_doc_id": "15_6247734200711445435"}}
{"doc_id": "16_5167433084987716563", "text": "n>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>script<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>template<span><span>>Mouse position is at: {{ x }}, {{ y }}</<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><div><p class=\"demo\"> Mouse position is at: 0,", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/reusability/composables.html", "title": "组合式函数", "doc_id": "0bf7a51f11074d58bdca404db75fd3df", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1263, "chunk_index": 16, "_doc_id": "16_5167433084987716563"}}
{"doc_id": "17_2798833982411316188", "text": "pan>template<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><div><p class=\"demo\"> Mouse position is at: 0, 0<p><p><a href=\"https://play.vuejs.org/#\" target=\"_blank\">在演练场中尝试一下<a><p><p>如你所见，", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/reusability/composables.html", "title": "组合式函数", "doc_id": "0bf7a51f11074d58bdca404db75fd3df", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1263, "chunk_index": 17, "_doc_id": "17_2798833982411316188"}}
{"doc_id": "18_5626360320772398922", "text": "f9VOY+EtizSWfR6xKK6itgkvQ/+fyNs6v4XJXIsPwVL+WprCiL8AEUxw5s=\" target=\"_blank\">在演练场中尝试一下<a><p><p>如你所见，核心逻辑完全一致，我们做的只是把它移到一个外部函数中去，并返回需要暴露的状态。和在组件中一样，你也可以在组合式函数中使用所有的<a href=\"/api/#composition-api\">组合式 API<a>。现在，<code>useMouse()<code> 的功能可以在任何组件中轻易复用了。<p><p>更酷的是，你还可以嵌套多个组合式函数：一个组合式函数可以调用一个或多个其他的组合式函数。这使得我们可以像使用多个组件组合成整个应用一样，用多个较小且逻辑独立的单元来组合形成复杂的逻辑。实际上，这正是为什么我们决定将实现了这一设计模式的 API 集合命名为组合式 API。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/reusability/composables.html", "title": "组合式函数", "doc_id": "0bf7a51f11074d58bdca404db75fd3df", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1263, "chunk_index": 18, "_doc_id": "18_5626360320772398922"}}
{"doc_id": "19_6162314156964341256", "text": "其他的组合式函数。这使得我们可以像使用多个组件组合成整个应用一样，用多个较小且逻辑独立的单元来组合形成复杂的逻辑。实际上，这正是为什么我们决定将实现了这一设计模式的 API 集合命名为组合式 API。<p><p>举例来说，我们可以将添加和清除 DOM 事件监听器的逻辑也封装进一个组合式函数中：<p><div class=\"vp-code-block-title\"><p class=\"vp-code-block-title-bar\"><span class=\"vp-code-block-title-text\">event.js<span><p><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>import<span><span> { onMounted, onUnmounted } <span><span>from<span><span> 'vue'<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/reusability/composables.html", "title": "组合式函数", "doc_id": "0bf7a51f11074d58bdca404db75fd3df", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1263, "chunk_index": 19, "_doc_id": "19_6162314156964341256"}}
{"doc_id": "20_3097985034339481056", "text": "><span>import<span><span> { onMounted, onUnmounted } <span><span>from<span><span> 'vue'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> function<span><span> useEventListener<span><span>(<span><span>target<span><span>, <span><span>event<span><span>, <span><span>callback<span><span>) {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 如果你想的话，<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 也可以用字符串形式的 CSS 选择器来寻找目标 DOM 元素<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/reusability/composables.html", "title": "组合式函数", "doc_id": "0bf7a51f11074d58bdca404db75fd3df", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1263, "chunk_index": 20, "_doc_id": "20_3097985034339481056"}}
{"doc_id": "21_2524796796479756718", "text": "pan> // 如果你想的话，<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 也可以用字符串形式的 CSS 选择器来寻找目标 DOM 元素<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> onMounted<span><span>(() <span><span>=><span><span> target.<span><span>addEventListener<span><span>(event, callback))<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> onUnmounted<span><span>(() <span><span>=><span><span> target.<span><span>removeEventListener<span><span>(event, callback))<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/reusability/composables.html", "title": "组合式函数", "doc_id": "0bf7a51f11074d58bdca404db75fd3df", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1263, "chunk_index": 21, "_doc_id": "21_2524796796479756718"}}
{"doc_id": "22_1594024008487044451", "text": "pan>=><span><span> target.<span><span>removeEventListener<span><span>(event, callback))<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span><code><pre><div><div><p>有了它，之前的 <code>useMouse()<code> 组合式函数可以被简化为：<p><div class=\"vp-code-block-title\"><p class=\"vp-code-block-title-bar\"><span class=\"vp-code-block-title-text\">mouse.js<span><p><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>import<span><span> { ref } <span><span>from<span><span> 'vue'<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/reusability/composables.html", "title": "组合式函数", "doc_id": "0bf7a51f11074d58bdca404db75fd3df", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1263, "chunk_index": 22, "_doc_id": "22_1594024008487044451"}}
{"doc_id": "23_8671535507407710299", "text": "><span class=\"line\"><span>import<span><span> { ref } <span><span>from<span><span> 'vue'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line highlighted\"><span>import<span><span> { useEventListener } <span><span>from<span><span> './event'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> function<span><span> useMouse<span><span>() {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> const<span><span> x<span><span> =<span><span> ref<span><span>(<span><span>0<span><span>)<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/reusability/composables.html", "title": "组合式函数", "doc_id": "0bf7a51f11074d58bdca404db75fd3df", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1263, "chunk_index": 23, "_doc_id": "23_8671535507407710299"}}
{"doc_id": "24_566508795536774965", "text": "onst<span><span> x<span><span> =<span><span> ref<span><span>(<span><span>0<span><span>)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> const<span><span> y<span><span> =<span><span> ref<span><span>(<span><span>0<span><span>)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line highlighted\"><span> useEventListener<span><span>(window, <span><span>'mousemove'<span><span>, (<span><span>event<span><span>) <span><span>=><span><span> {<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/reusability/composables.html", "title": "组合式函数", "doc_id": "0bf7a51f11074d58bdca404db75fd3df", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1263, "chunk_index": 24, "_doc_id": "24_566508795536774965"}}
{"doc_id": "25_2313438240796809633", "text": "n>'mousemove'<span><span>, (<span><span>event<span><span>) <span><span>=><span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line highlighted\"><span> x.value <span><span>=<span><span> event.pageX<span><span>\n<span class=\"line highlighted\"><span> y.value <span><span>=<span><span> event.pageY<span><span>\n<span class=\"line highlighted\"><span> })<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> return<span><span> { x, y }<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/reusability/composables.html", "title": "组合式函数", "doc_id": "0bf7a51f11074d58bdca404db75fd3df", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1263, "chunk_index": 25, "_doc_id": "25_2313438240796809633"}}
{"doc_id": "26_4007485858367681583", "text": "><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> return<span><span> { x, y }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span><code><pre><div><div><div class=\"tip custom-block\"><p class=\"custom-block-title\">TIP<p><p>每一个调用 <code>useMouse()<code> 的组件实例会创建其独有的 <code>x<code>、<code>y<code> 状态拷贝，因此他们不会互相影响。如果你想要在组件之间共享状态，请阅读<a href=\"/guide/scaling-up/state-management.html\">状态管理<a>这一章。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/reusability/composables.html", "title": "组合式函数", "doc_id": "0bf7a51f11074d58bdca404db75fd3df", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1263, "chunk_index": 26, "_doc_id": "26_4007485858367681583"}}
{"doc_id": "27_6200545864373760724", "text": "ode> 状态拷贝，因此他们不会互相影响。如果你想要在组件之间共享状态，请阅读<a href=\"/guide/scaling-up/state-management.html\">状态管理<a>这一章。<p><div><h2 id=\"async-state-example\">异步状态示例 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#async-state-example\">​<a><h2><p><code>useMouse()<code> 组合式函数没有接收任何参数，因此让我们再来看一个需要接收一个参数的组合式函数示例。在做异步数据请求时，我们常常需要处理不同的状态：加载中、加载成功和加载失败。<p><div class=\"language-vue\"> <span class=\"lang\">vue<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>script<span><span> setup<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/reusability/composables.html", "title": "组合式函数", "doc_id": "0bf7a51f11074d58bdca404db75fd3df", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1263, "chunk_index": 27, "_doc_id": "27_6200545864373760724"}}
{"doc_id": "28_1858743436020847114", "text": "code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>script<span><span> setup<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>import<span><span> { ref } <span><span>from<span><span> 'vue'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> data<span><span> =<span><span> ref<span><span>(<span><span>null<span><span>)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> error<span><span> =<span><span> ref<span><span>(<span><span>null<span><span>)<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/reusability/composables.html", "title": "组合式函数", "doc_id": "0bf7a51f11074d58bdca404db75fd3df", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1263, "chunk_index": 28, "_doc_id": "28_1858743436020847114"}}
{"doc_id": "29_7802778461109704674", "text": "an><span> error<span><span> =<span><span> ref<span><span>(<span><span>null<span><span>)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>fetch<span><span>(<span><span>'...'<span><span>)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> .<span><span>then<span><span>((<span><span>res<span><span>) <span><span>=><span><span> res.<span><span>json<span><span>())<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/reusability/composables.html", "title": "组合式函数", "doc_id": "0bf7a51f11074d58bdca404db75fd3df", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1263, "chunk_index": 29, "_doc_id": "29_7802778461109704674"}}
{"doc_id": "30_8709862956124504733", "text": "n><span>res<span><span>) <span><span>=><span><span> res.<span><span>json<span><span>())<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> .<span><span>then<span><span>((<span><span>json<span><span>) <span><span>=><span><span> (data.value <span><span>=<span><span> json))<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> .<span><span>catch<span><span>((<span><span>err<span><span>) <span><span>=><span><span> (error.value <span><span>=<span><span> err))<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/reusability/composables.html", "title": "组合式函数", "doc_id": "0bf7a51f11074d58bdca404db75fd3df", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1263, "chunk_index": 30, "_doc_id": "30_8709862956124504733"}}
{"doc_id": "31_6315820468744342648", "text": "rr<span><span>) <span><span>=><span><span> (error.value <span><span>=<span><span> err))<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>script<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>div<span><span> v-if<span><span>=<span><span>\"error\"<span><span>>Oops! Error encountered: {{ error.message }}</<span><span>div<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/reusability/composables.html", "title": "组合式函数", "doc_id": "0bf7a51f11074d58bdca404db75fd3df", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1263, "chunk_index": 31, "_doc_id": "31_6315820468744342648"}}
{"doc_id": "32_6427684991985213926", "text": "<span><span>>Oops! Error encountered: {{ error.message }}</<span><span>div<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>div<span><span> v-else-if<span><span>=<span><span>\"data\"<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> Data loaded:<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>pre<span><span>>{{ data }}</<span><span>pre<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> </<span><span>div<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/reusability/composables.html", "title": "组合式函数", "doc_id": "0bf7a51f11074d58bdca404db75fd3df", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1263, "chunk_index": 32, "_doc_id": "32_6427684991985213926"}}
