{"doc_id": "10_71348080732568545", "text": "lass=\"line\"><span> margin-left<span><span>: <span><span>-150<span><span>px<span><span>;<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>style<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><div><div class=\"options-api\"><div class=\"language-vue\"> <span class=\"lang\">vue<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>script<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/teleport.html", "title": "Teleport | Vue.js", "doc_id": "f94dfd8d1fb54727a89c0c1b2a041bed", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 499, "chunk_index": 10, "_doc_id": "10_71348080732568545"}}
{"doc_id": "11_2892142143987484528", "text": "n><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> data<span><span>() {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> return<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> open: <span><span>false<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>script<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/teleport.html", "title": "Teleport | Vue.js", "doc_id": "f94dfd8d1fb54727a89c0c1b2a041bed", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 499, "chunk_index": 11, "_doc_id": "11_2892142143987484528"}}
{"doc_id": "12_3803937200978341222", "text": "n>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>script<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>button<span><span> @click<span><span>=<span><span>\"open = true\"<span><span>>Open Modal</<span><span>button<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/teleport.html", "title": "Teleport | Vue.js", "doc_id": "f94dfd8d1fb54727a89c0c1b2a041bed", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 499, "chunk_index": 12, "_doc_id": "12_3803937200978341222"}}
{"doc_id": "13_4030246923630153211", "text": "true\"<span><span>>Open Modal</<span><span>button<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>div<span><span> v-if<span><span>=<span><span>\"open\"<span><span> class<span><span>=<span><span>\"modal\"<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>p<span><span>>Hello from the modal!</<span><span>p<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/teleport.html", "title": "Teleport | Vue.js", "doc_id": "f94dfd8d1fb54727a89c0c1b2a041bed", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 499, "chunk_index": 13, "_doc_id": "13_4030246923630153211"}}
{"doc_id": "14_8838074581535168165", "text": "ne\"><span> <<span><span>p<span><span>>Hello from the modal!</<span><span>p<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>button<span><span> @click<span><span>=<span><span>\"open = false\"<span><span>>Close</<span><span>button<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> </<span><span>div<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/teleport.html", "title": "Teleport | Vue.js", "doc_id": "f94dfd8d1fb54727a89c0c1b2a041bed", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 499, "chunk_index": 14, "_doc_id": "14_8838074581535168165"}}
{"doc_id": "15_4299088596187064994", "text": "<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>style<span><span> scoped<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>.modal<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> position<span><span>: <span><span>fixed<span><span>;<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> z-index<span><span>: <span><span>999<span><span>;<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/teleport.html", "title": "Teleport | Vue.js", "doc_id": "f94dfd8d1fb54727a89c0c1b2a041bed", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 499, "chunk_index": 15, "_doc_id": "15_4299088596187064994"}}
{"doc_id": "16_5276304524727516728", "text": "span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> z-index<span><span>: <span><span>999<span><span>;<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> top<span><span>: <span><span>20<span><span>%<span><span>;<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> left<span><span>: <span><span>50<span><span>%<span><span>;<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> width<span><span>: <span><span>300<span><span>px<span><span>;<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> margin-left<span><span>: <span><span>-150<span><span>px<span><span>;<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/teleport.html", "title": "Teleport | Vue.js", "doc_id": "f94dfd8d1fb54727a89c0c1b2a041bed", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 499, "chunk_index": 16, "_doc_id": "16_5276304524727516728"}}
{"doc_id": "17_2138541593701655148", "text": "lass=\"line\"><span> margin-left<span><span>: <span><span>-150<span><span>px<span><span>;<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>style<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><div><p>这个组件中有一个 <code><button><code> 按钮来触发打开模态框，和一个 class 名为 <code>.modal<code> 的 <code><div><code>，它包含了模态框的内容和一个用来关闭的按钮。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/teleport.html", "title": "Teleport | Vue.js", "doc_id": "f94dfd8d1fb54727a89c0c1b2a041bed", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 499, "chunk_index": 17, "_doc_id": "17_2138541593701655148"}}
{"doc_id": "18_4103088448465787159", "text": "><button><code> 按钮来触发打开模态框，和一个 class 名为 <code>.modal<code> 的 <code><div><code>，它包含了模态框的内容和一个用来关闭的按钮。<p><p>当在初始 HTML 结构中使用这个组件时，会有一些潜在的问题：<p><ul><li><p><code>position: fixed<code> 能够相对于浏览器窗口放置有一个条件，那就是不能有任何祖先元素设置了 <code>transform<code>、<code>perspective<code> 或者 <code>filter<code> 样式属性。也就是说如果我们想要用 CSS <code>transform<code> 为祖先节点 <code><div class=\"outer\"><code> 设置动画，就会不小心破坏模态框的布局！<p><li><li><p>这个模态框的 <code>z-index<code> 受限于它的容器元素。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/teleport.html", "title": "Teleport | Vue.js", "doc_id": "f94dfd8d1fb54727a89c0c1b2a041bed", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 499, "chunk_index": 18, "_doc_id": "18_4103088448465787159"}}
{"doc_id": "19_7277594916299547876", "text": "ode><div class=\"outer\"><code> 设置动画，就会不小心破坏模态框的布局！<p><li><li><p>这个模态框的 <code>z-index<code> 受限于它的容器元素。如果有其他元素与 <code><div class=\"outer\"><code> 重叠并有更高的 <code>z-index<code>，则它会覆盖住我们的模态框。<p><li><ul><p><code><Teleport><code> 提供了一个更简单的方式来解决此类问题，让我们不需要再顾虑 DOM 结构的问题。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/teleport.html", "title": "Teleport | Vue.js", "doc_id": "f94dfd8d1fb54727a89c0c1b2a041bed", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 499, "chunk_index": 19, "_doc_id": "19_7277594916299547876"}}
{"doc_id": "20_63204550681915483", "text": "ndex<code>，则它会覆盖住我们的模态框。<p><li><ul><p><code><Teleport><code> 提供了一个更简单的方式来解决此类问题，让我们不需要再顾虑 DOM 结构的问题。让我们用 <code><Teleport><code> 改写一下 <code><MyModal><code>：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>button<span><span> @<span><span>click<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>open <span><span>=<span><span> true<span><span>\"<span><span>>Open Modal</<span><span>button<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/teleport.html", "title": "Teleport | Vue.js", "doc_id": "f94dfd8d1fb54727a89c0c1b2a041bed", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 499, "chunk_index": 20, "_doc_id": "20_63204550681915483"}}
{"doc_id": "21_6115896099899045788", "text": "=<span><span> true<span><span>\"<span><span>>Open Modal</<span><span>button<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line highlighted\"><span><<span><span>Teleport<span><span> to<span><span>=<span><span>\"body\"<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>div<span><span> v-if<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>open<span><span>\"<span><span> class<span><span>=<span><span>\"modal\"<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/teleport.html", "title": "Teleport | Vue.js", "doc_id": "f94dfd8d1fb54727a89c0c1b2a041bed", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 499, "chunk_index": 21, "_doc_id": "21_6115896099899045788"}}
{"doc_id": "22_1931816876576135088", "text": "><span>open<span><span>\"<span><span> class<span><span>=<span><span>\"modal\"<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>p<span><span>>Hello from the modal!</<span><span>p<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>button<span><span> @<span><span>click<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>open <span><span>=<span><span> false<span><span>\"<span><span>>Close</<span><span>button<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> </<span><span>div<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/teleport.html", "title": "Teleport | Vue.js", "doc_id": "f94dfd8d1fb54727a89c0c1b2a041bed", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 499, "chunk_index": 22, "_doc_id": "22_1931816876576135088"}}
{"doc_id": "23_2473442268127090519", "text": "utton<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> </<span><span>div<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line highlighted\"><span></<span><span>Teleport<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p><code><Teleport><code> 接收一个 <code>to<code> prop 来指定传送的目标。<code>to<code> 的值可以是一个 CSS 选择器字符串，也可以是一个 DOM 元素对象。这段代码的作用就是告诉 Vue“把以下模板片段<strong>传送到 <code>body<code><strong> 标签下”。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/teleport.html", "title": "Teleport | Vue.js", "doc_id": "f94dfd8d1fb54727a89c0c1b2a041bed", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 499, "chunk_index": 23, "_doc_id": "23_2473442268127090519"}}
{"doc_id": "24_3336211715893338750", "text": "的值可以是一个 CSS 选择器字符串，也可以是一个 DOM 元素对象。这段代码的作用就是告诉 Vue“把以下模板片段<strong>传送到 <code>body<code><strong> 标签下”。<p><p>你可以点击下面这个按钮，然后通过浏览器的开发者工具，在 <code><body><code> 标签下找到模态框元素：<p><p class=\"demo\"> Open Modal <p><p>我们也可以将 <code><Teleport><code> 和 <a href=\"./transition.html\"><code><Transition><code><a> 结合使用来创建一个带动画的模态框。你可以看看<a href=\"/examples/#modal\">这个示例<a>。<p><div class=\"tip custom-block\"><p class=\"custom-block-title\">TIP<p><p><code><Teleport><code> 挂载时，传送的 <code>to<code> 目标必须已经存在于 DOM 中。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/teleport.html", "title": "Teleport | Vue.js", "doc_id": "f94dfd8d1fb54727a89c0c1b2a041bed", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 499, "chunk_index": 24, "_doc_id": "24_3336211715893338750"}}
{"doc_id": "25_2760063786951050267", "text": "p class=\"custom-block-title\">TIP<p><p><code><Teleport><code> 挂载时，传送的 <code>to<code> 目标必须已经存在于 DOM 中。理想情况下，这应该是整个 Vue 应用 DOM 树外部的一个元素。如果目标元素也是由 Vue 渲染的，你需要确保在挂载 <code><Teleport><code> 之前先挂载该元素。<p><div><h2 id=\"using-with-components\">搭配组件使用 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#using-with-components\">​<a><h2><p><code><Teleport><code> 只改变了渲染的 DOM 结构，它不会影响组件间的逻辑关系。也就是说，如果 <code><Teleport><code> 包含了一个组件，那么该组件始终和这个使用了 <code><Teleport><code> 的组件保持逻辑上的父子关系。传入的 props 和触发的事件也会照常工作。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/teleport.html", "title": "Teleport | Vue.js", "doc_id": "f94dfd8d1fb54727a89c0c1b2a041bed", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 499, "chunk_index": 25, "_doc_id": "25_2760063786951050267"}}
{"doc_id": "26_8311015158220981121", "text": "><Teleport><code> 包含了一个组件，那么该组件始终和这个使用了 <code><Teleport><code> 的组件保持逻辑上的父子关系。传入的 props 和触发的事件也会照常工作。<p><p>这也意味着来自父组件的注入也会按预期工作，子组件将在 Vue Devtools 中嵌套在父级组件下面，而不是放在实际内容移动到的地方。<p><h2 id=\"disabling-teleport\">禁用 Teleport <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#disabling-teleport\">​<a><h2><p>在某些场景下可能需要视情况禁用 <code><Teleport><code>。举例来说，我们想要在桌面端将一个组件当做浮层来渲染，但在移动端则当作行内组件。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/teleport.html", "title": "Teleport | Vue.js", "doc_id": "f94dfd8d1fb54727a89c0c1b2a041bed", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 499, "chunk_index": 26, "_doc_id": "26_8311015158220981121"}}
{"doc_id": "27_382597706747285377", "text": "-teleport\">​<a><h2><p>在某些场景下可能需要视情况禁用 <code><Teleport><code>。举例来说，我们想要在桌面端将一个组件当做浮层来渲染，但在移动端则当作行内组件。我们可以通过对 <code><Teleport><code> 动态地传入一个 <code>disabled<code> prop 来处理这两种不同情况：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>Teleport<span><span> :<span><span>disabled<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>isMobile<span><span>\"<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> ...<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/teleport.html", "title": "Teleport | Vue.js", "doc_id": "f94dfd8d1fb54727a89c0c1b2a041bed", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 499, "chunk_index": 27, "_doc_id": "27_382597706747285377"}}
{"doc_id": "28_770564375134674489", "text": "span><span>isMobile<span><span>\"<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> ...<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>Teleport<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>然后我们可以动态地更新 <code>isMobile<code>。<p><h2 id=\"multiple-teleports-on-the-same-target\">多个 Teleport 共享目标 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#multiple-teleports-on-the-same-target\">​<a><h2><p>一个可重用的 <code><Modal><code> 组件可能同时存在多个实例。对于此类场景，多个 <code><Teleport><code> 组件可以将其内容挂载在同一个目标元素上，而顺序就是简单的顺次追加，后挂载的将排在目标元素下更后面的位置上，但都在目标元素中。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/teleport.html", "title": "Teleport | Vue.js", "doc_id": "f94dfd8d1fb54727a89c0c1b2a041bed", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 499, "chunk_index": 28, "_doc_id": "28_770564375134674489"}}
{"doc_id": "29_2245584490002913250", "text": "多个实例。对于此类场景，多个 <code><Teleport><code> 组件可以将其内容挂载在同一个目标元素上，而顺序就是简单的顺次追加，后挂载的将排在目标元素下更后面的位置上，但都在目标元素中。<p><p>比如下面这样的用例：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>Teleport<span><span> to<span><span>=<span><span>\"#modals\"<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>div<span><span>>A</<span><span>div<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/teleport.html", "title": "Teleport | Vue.js", "doc_id": "f94dfd8d1fb54727a89c0c1b2a041bed", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 499, "chunk_index": 29, "_doc_id": "29_2245584490002913250"}}
{"doc_id": "30_2657427322557772266", "text": "<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>div<span><span>>A</<span><span>div<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>Teleport<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>Teleport<span><span> to<span><span>=<span><span>\"#modals\"<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>div<span><span>>B</<span><span>div<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/teleport.html", "title": "Teleport | Vue.js", "doc_id": "f94dfd8d1fb54727a89c0c1b2a041bed", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 499, "chunk_index": 30, "_doc_id": "30_2657427322557772266"}}
{"doc_id": "31_4158406518065568770", "text": "<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>div<span><span>>B</<span><span>div<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>Teleport<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>渲染的结果为：<p><div class=\"language-html\"> <span class=\"lang\">html<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>div<span><span> id<span><span>=<span><span>\"modals\"<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/teleport.html", "title": "Teleport | Vue.js", "doc_id": "f94dfd8d1fb54727a89c0c1b2a041bed", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 499, "chunk_index": 31, "_doc_id": "31_4158406518065568770"}}
{"doc_id": "32_1006782497935358832", "text": "ne\"><span><<span><span>div<span><span> id<span><span>=<span><span>\"modals\"<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>div<span><span>>A</<span><span>div<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>div<span><span>>B</<span><span>div<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/teleport.html", "title": "Teleport | Vue.js", "doc_id": "f94dfd8d1fb54727a89c0c1b2a041bed", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 499, "chunk_index": 32, "_doc_id": "32_1006782497935358832"}}
{"doc_id": "33_4219797626989430887", "text": "<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>div<span><span>>B</<span><span>div<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>div<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><h2 id=\"deferred-teleport\">延迟解析的 Teleport <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#deferred-teleport\" class=\"vt-badge\">​<a><h2><p>在 Vue 3.5 及更高版本中，我们可以使用 <code>defer<code> prop 推迟 Teleport 的目标解析，直到应用的其他部分挂载。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/teleport.html", "title": "Teleport | Vue.js", "doc_id": "f94dfd8d1fb54727a89c0c1b2a041bed", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 499, "chunk_index": 33, "_doc_id": "33_4219797626989430887"}}
{"doc_id": "34_5478697078731106347", "text": "=\"vt-badge\">​<a><h2><p>在 Vue 3.5 及更高版本中，我们可以使用 <code>defer<code> prop 推迟 Teleport 的目标解析，直到应用的其他部分挂载。这允许 Teleport 将由 Vue 渲染且位于组件树之后部分的容器元素作为目标：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>Teleport<span><span> defer<span><span> to<span><span>=<span><span>\"#late-div\"<span><span>>...</<span><span>Teleport<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/teleport.html", "title": "Teleport | Vue.js", "doc_id": "f94dfd8d1fb54727a89c0c1b2a041bed", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 499, "chunk_index": 34, "_doc_id": "34_5478697078731106347"}}
{"doc_id": "35_7127428576923443696", "text": "#late-div\"<span><span>>...</<span><span>Teleport<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><!-- 稍后出现于模板中的某处 --><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>div<span><span> id<span><span>=<span><span>\"late-div\"<span><span>></<span><span>div<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>请注意，目标元素必须与 Teleport 在同一个挂载/更新周期内渲染，即如果 <code><div><code> 在一秒后才挂载，Teleport 仍然会报错。延迟 Teleport 的原理与 <code>mounted<code> 生命周期钩子类似。<p>\n<p><strong>参考<strong><p><div><div>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/teleport.html", "title": "Teleport | Vue.js", "doc_id": "f94dfd8d1fb54727a89c0c1b2a041bed", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 499, "chunk_index": 35, "_doc_id": "35_7127428576923443696"}}
{"doc_id": "0_4936996115793506973", "text": "<div><div><h1 id=\"custom-directives\">自定义指令 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#custom-directives\">​<a><h1><h2 id=\"introduction\">介绍 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#introduction\">​<a><h2><p>除了 Vue 内置的一系列指令 (比如 <code>v-model<code> 或 <code>v-show<code>) 之外，Vue 还允许你注册自定义的指令 (Custom Directives)。<p><p>我们已经介绍了两种在 Vue 中重用代码的方式：<a href=\"/guide/essentials/component-basics.html\">组件<a>和<a href=\"./composables.html\">组合式函数<a>。组件是主要的构建模块，而组合式函数则侧重于有状态的逻辑。另一方面，自定义指令主要是为了重用涉及普通元素的底层 DOM 访问的逻辑。<p><p>一个自定义指令由一个包含类似组件生命周期钩子的对象来定义。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/reusability/custom-directives.html", "title": "自定义指令", "doc_id": "25bc6ce4853440a1a5cb79a79b2d2efa", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 650, "chunk_index": 0, "_doc_id": "0_4936996115793506973"}}
{"doc_id": "1_4576225682316773330", "text": "组件是主要的构建模块，而组合式函数则侧重于有状态的逻辑。另一方面，自定义指令主要是为了重用涉及普通元素的底层 DOM 访问的逻辑。<p><p>一个自定义指令由一个包含类似组件生命周期钩子的对象来定义。钩子函数会接收到指令所绑定元素作为其参数。下面是一个自定义指令的例子，当 Vue 将元素插入到 DOM 中后，该指令会将一个 class 添加到元素中：<p><div class=\"composition-api\"><div class=\"language-vue\"> <span class=\"lang\">vue<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>script<span><span> setup<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 在模板中启用 v-highlight<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/reusability/custom-directives.html", "title": "自定义指令", "doc_id": "25bc6ce4853440a1a5cb79a79b2d2efa", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 650, "chunk_index": 1, "_doc_id": "1_4576225682316773330"}}
{"doc_id": "2_2265665949377366890", "text": "an><span> setup<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 在模板中启用 v-highlight<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> vHighlight<span><span> =<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> mounted<span><span>: (<span><span>el<span><span>) <span><span>=><span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> el.classList.<span><span>add<span><span>(<span><span>'is-highlight'<span><span>)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/reusability/custom-directives.html", "title": "自定义指令", "doc_id": "25bc6ce4853440a1a5cb79a79b2d2efa", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 650, "chunk_index": 2, "_doc_id": "2_2265665949377366890"}}
{"doc_id": "3_3793479932205133206", "text": "><span>)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>script<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>p<span><span> v-highlight<span><span>>This sentence is important!</<span><span>p<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/reusability/custom-directives.html", "title": "自定义指令", "doc_id": "25bc6ce4853440a1a5cb79a79b2d2efa", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 650, "chunk_index": 3, "_doc_id": "3_3793479932205133206"}}
{"doc_id": "4_4326071410793857437", "text": "><span> v-highlight<span><span>>This sentence is important!</<span><span>p<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><div><div class=\"options-api\"><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> highlight<span><span> =<span><span> {<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/reusability/custom-directives.html", "title": "自定义指令", "doc_id": "25bc6ce4853440a1a5cb79a79b2d2efa", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 650, "chunk_index": 4, "_doc_id": "4_4326071410793857437"}}
{"doc_id": "5_300359654357300350", "text": "><code><span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> highlight<span><span> =<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> mounted<span><span>: (<span><span>el<span><span>) <span><span>=><span><span> el.classList.<span><span>add<span><span>(<span><span>'is-highlight'<span><span>)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> directives: {<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/reusability/custom-directives.html", "title": "自定义指令", "doc_id": "25bc6ce4853440a1a5cb79a79b2d2efa", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 650, "chunk_index": 5, "_doc_id": "5_300359654357300350"}}
{"doc_id": "6_1397375880177926015", "text": "t<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> directives: {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 在模板中启用 v-highlight<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> highlight<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/reusability/custom-directives.html", "title": "自定义指令", "doc_id": "25bc6ce4853440a1a5cb79a79b2d2efa", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 650, "chunk_index": 6, "_doc_id": "6_1397375880177926015"}}
{"doc_id": "7_4471367492866326138", "text": "span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> highlight<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span><code><pre><div><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>p<span><span> v-highlight<span><span>>This sentence is important!</<span><span>p<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><div><div class=\"demo\"><p>This sentence is important!<p><div><div class=\"composition-api\"><p>在 <code><script setup><code> 中，任何以 <code>v<code> 开头的驼峰式命名的变量都可以当作自定义指令使用。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/reusability/custom-directives.html", "title": "自定义指令", "doc_id": "25bc6ce4853440a1a5cb79a79b2d2efa", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 650, "chunk_index": 7, "_doc_id": "7_4471367492866326138"}}
{"doc_id": "8_3806090618611181558", "text": "class=\"composition-api\"><p>在 <code><script setup><code> 中，任何以 <code>v<code> 开头的驼峰式命名的变量都可以当作自定义指令使用。在上述例子中，<code>vHighlight<code> 可以在模板中以 <code>v-highlight<code> 的形式使用。<p><p>在不使用 <code><script setup><code> 的情况下，自定义指令需要通过 <code>directives<code> 选项注册：<p><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> setup<span><span>() {<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/reusability/custom-directives.html", "title": "自定义指令", "doc_id": "25bc6ce4853440a1a5cb79a79b2d2efa", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 650, "chunk_index": 8, "_doc_id": "8_3806090618611181558"}}
{"doc_id": "9_3864125965280497274", "text": "span> default<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> setup<span><span>() {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> /*...*/<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> },<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> directives: {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 在模板中启用 v-highlight<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> highlight: {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> /* ... */<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/reusability/custom-directives.html", "title": "自定义指令", "doc_id": "25bc6ce4853440a1a5cb79a79b2d2efa", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 650, "chunk_index": 9, "_doc_id": "9_3864125965280497274"}}
{"doc_id": "10_4571149499379582031", "text": "... */<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span><code><pre><div><div><div class=\"options-api\"><p>和组件类似，自定义指令在模板中使用前必须先注册。在上面的例子中，我们使用 <code>directives<code> 选项完成了指令的局部注册。<p><div><p>将一个自定义指令全局注册到应用层级也是一种常见的做法：<p><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> app<span><span> =<span><span> createApp<span><span>({})<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/reusability/custom-directives.html", "title": "自定义指令", "doc_id": "25bc6ce4853440a1a5cb79a79b2d2efa", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 650, "chunk_index": 10, "_doc_id": "10_4571149499379582031"}}
{"doc_id": "11_305538269856170579", "text": "=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> app<span><span> =<span><span> createApp<span><span>({})<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 使 v-highlight 在所有组件中都可用<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>app.<span><span>directive<span><span>(<span><span>'highlight'<span><span>, {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> /* ... */<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>})<span><span><code><pre><div><p>通过扩展 <code>vue<code> 中的 <code>ComponentCustomProperties<code> 接口，可以为自定义的全局指令添加类型。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/reusability/custom-directives.html", "title": "自定义指令", "doc_id": "25bc6ce4853440a1a5cb79a79b2d2efa", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 650, "chunk_index": 11, "_doc_id": "11_305538269856170579"}}
{"doc_id": "12_1802672745088788783", "text": "<code><pre><div><p>通过扩展 <code>vue<code> 中的 <code>ComponentCustomProperties<code> 接口，可以为自定义的全局指令添加类型。<p><p>更多细节参考：<a href=\"/guide/typescript/composition-api.html#typing-global-custom-directives\">为自定义全局指令添加类型<a> <p><h2 id=\"when-to-use\">自定义指令的使用时机 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#when-to-use\">​<a><h2><p>只有当所需功能只能通过直接的 DOM 操作来实现时，才应该使用自定义指令。<p><p>一个常见例子是使元素获取焦点的 <code>v-focus<code> 指令。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/reusability/custom-directives.html", "title": "自定义指令", "doc_id": "25bc6ce4853440a1a5cb79a79b2d2efa", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 650, "chunk_index": 12, "_doc_id": "12_1802672745088788783"}}
{"doc_id": "13_4595826270812293981", "text": "o-use\">​<a><h2><p>只有当所需功能只能通过直接的 DOM 操作来实现时，才应该使用自定义指令。<p><p>一个常见例子是使元素获取焦点的 <code>v-focus<code> 指令。<p><div class=\"composition-api\"><div class=\"language-vue\"> <span class=\"lang\">vue<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>script<span><span> setup<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 在模板中启用 v-focus<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> vFocus<span><span> =<span><span> {<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/reusability/custom-directives.html", "title": "自定义指令", "doc_id": "25bc6ce4853440a1a5cb79a79b2d2efa", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 650, "chunk_index": 13, "_doc_id": "13_4595826270812293981"}}
{"doc_id": "14_276853647708462936", "text": "an><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> vFocus<span><span> =<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> mounted<span><span>: (<span><span>el<span><span>) <span><span>=><span><span> el.<span><span>focus<span><span>()<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>script<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/reusability/custom-directives.html", "title": "自定义指令", "doc_id": "25bc6ce4853440a1a5cb79a79b2d2efa", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 650, "chunk_index": 14, "_doc_id": "14_276853647708462936"}}
{"doc_id": "15_7759366352279599518", "text": ">\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>input<span><span> v-focus<span><span> /><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><div><div class=\"options-api\"><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> focus<span><span> =<span><span> {<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/reusability/custom-directives.html", "title": "自定义指令", "doc_id": "25bc6ce4853440a1a5cb79a79b2d2efa", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 650, "chunk_index": 15, "_doc_id": "15_7759366352279599518"}}
{"doc_id": "16_3134244627004408784", "text": "ode\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> focus<span><span> =<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> mounted<span><span>: (<span><span>el<span><span>) <span><span>=><span><span> el.<span><span>focus<span><span>()<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> directives: {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 在模板中启用 v-focus<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/reusability/custom-directives.html", "title": "自定义指令", "doc_id": "25bc6ce4853440a1a5cb79a79b2d2efa", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 650, "chunk_index": 16, "_doc_id": "16_3134244627004408784"}}
{"doc_id": "17_6650299634259822072", "text": "ass=\"line\"><span> directives: {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 在模板中启用 v-focus<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> focus<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/reusability/custom-directives.html", "title": "自定义指令", "doc_id": "25bc6ce4853440a1a5cb79a79b2d2efa", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 650, "chunk_index": 17, "_doc_id": "17_6650299634259822072"}}
{"doc_id": "18_3010723294224767608", "text": "cus<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> focus<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span><code><pre><div><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>input<span><span> v-focus<span><span> /><span><span><code><pre><div><div><p>该指令比 <code>autofocus<code> 属性更有用，因为它不仅在页面加载时有效，而且在 Vue 动态插入元素时也有效！<p><p>建议尽可能使用 <code>v-bind<code> 等内置指令声明模板，因为它们更高效，对服务端渲染也更友好。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/reusability/custom-directives.html", "title": "自定义指令", "doc_id": "25bc6ce4853440a1a5cb79a79b2d2efa", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 650, "chunk_index": 18, "_doc_id": "18_3010723294224767608"}}
{"doc_id": "19_2361924872320388882", "text": "性更有用，因为它不仅在页面加载时有效，而且在 Vue 动态插入元素时也有效！<p><p>建议尽可能使用 <code>v-bind<code> 等内置指令声明模板，因为它们更高效，对服务端渲染也更友好。<p><h2 id=\"directive-hooks\">指令钩子 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#directive-hooks\">​<a><h2><p>一个指令的定义对象可以提供几种钩子函数 (都是可选的)：<p><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> myDirective<span><span> =<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 在绑定元素的 attribute 前<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/reusability/custom-directives.html", "title": "自定义指令", "doc_id": "25bc6ce4853440a1a5cb79a79b2d2efa", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 650, "chunk_index": 19, "_doc_id": "19_2361924872320388882"}}
{"doc_id": "20_8471838246390527593", "text": "span><span> =<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 在绑定元素的 attribute 前<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 或事件监听器应用前调用<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> created<span><span>(<span><span>el<span><span>, <span><span>binding<span><span>, <span><span>vnode<span><span>) {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 下面会介绍各个参数的细节<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> },<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 在元素被插入到 DOM 前调用<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/reusability/custom-directives.html", "title": "自定义指令", "doc_id": "25bc6ce4853440a1a5cb79a79b2d2efa", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 650, "chunk_index": 20, "_doc_id": "20_8471838246390527593"}}
{"doc_id": "21_3365889527089085230", "text": ">\n<span class=\"line\"><span> },<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 在元素被插入到 DOM 前调用<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> beforeMount<span><span>(<span><span>el<span><span>, <span><span>binding<span><span>, <span><span>vnode<span><span>) {},<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 在绑定元素的父组件<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 及他自己的所有子节点都挂载完成后调用<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/reusability/custom-directives.html", "title": "自定义指令", "doc_id": "25bc6ce4853440a1a5cb79a79b2d2efa", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 650, "chunk_index": 21, "_doc_id": "21_3365889527089085230"}}
{"doc_id": "22_8842081860751451888", "text": "=\"line\"><span> // 在绑定元素的父组件<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 及他自己的所有子节点都挂载完成后调用<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> mounted<span><span>(<span><span>el<span><span>, <span><span>binding<span><span>, <span><span>vnode<span><span>) {},<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 绑定元素的父组件更新前调用<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> beforeUpdate<span><span>(<span><span>el<span><span>, <span><span>binding<span><span>, <span><span>vnode<span><span>, <span><span>prevVnode<span><span>) {},<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/reusability/custom-directives.html", "title": "自定义指令", "doc_id": "25bc6ce4853440a1a5cb79a79b2d2efa", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 650, "chunk_index": 22, "_doc_id": "22_8842081860751451888"}}
{"doc_id": "23_5253205252361059428", "text": "ding<span><span>, <span><span>vnode<span><span>, <span><span>prevVnode<span><span>) {},<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 在绑定元素的父组件<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 及他自己的所有子节点都更新后调用<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> updated<span><span>(<span><span>el<span><span>, <span><span>binding<span><span>, <span><span>vnode<span><span>, <span><span>prevVnode<span><span>) {},<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 绑定元素的父组件卸载前调用<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/reusability/custom-directives.html", "title": "自定义指令", "doc_id": "25bc6ce4853440a1a5cb79a79b2d2efa", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 650, "chunk_index": 23, "_doc_id": "23_5253205252361059428"}}
{"doc_id": "24_208827483997569662", "text": "<span>prevVnode<span><span>) {},<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 绑定元素的父组件卸载前调用<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> beforeUnmount<span><span>(<span><span>el<span><span>, <span><span>binding<span><span>, <span><span>vnode<span><span>) {},<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 绑定元素的父组件卸载后调用<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> unmounted<span><span>(<span><span>el<span><span>, <span><span>binding<span><span>, <span><span>vnode<span><span>) {}<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/reusability/custom-directives.html", "title": "自定义指令", "doc_id": "25bc6ce4853440a1a5cb79a79b2d2efa", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 650, "chunk_index": 24, "_doc_id": "24_208827483997569662"}}
{"doc_id": "25_9030883566198232201", "text": "span>el<span><span>, <span><span>binding<span><span>, <span><span>vnode<span><span>) {}<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span><code><pre><div><h3 id=\"hook-arguments\">钩子参数 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#hook-arguments\">​<a><h3><p>指令的钩子会传递以下几种参数：<p><p>举例来说，", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/reusability/custom-directives.html", "title": "自定义指令", "doc_id": "25bc6ce4853440a1a5cb79a79b2d2efa", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 650, "chunk_index": 25, "_doc_id": "25_9030883566198232201"}}
{"doc_id": "26_6749895163955012619", "text": "rguments\">钩子参数 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#hook-arguments\">​<a><h3><p>指令的钩子会传递以下几种参数：<p><p>举例来说，像下面这样使用指令：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>div<span><span> v-example<span><span>:<span><span>foo<span><span>.<span><span>bar<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>baz<span><span>\"<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p><code>binding<code> 参数会是一个这样的对象：<p><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>{<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/reusability/custom-directives.html", "title": "自定义指令", "doc_id": "25bc6ce4853440a1a5cb79a79b2d2efa", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 650, "chunk_index": 26, "_doc_id": "26_6749895163955012619"}}
{"doc_id": "27_6085814655305516967", "text": "=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>{<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> arg<span><span>: <span><span>'foo'<span><span>,<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> modifiers<span><span>: { <span><span>bar<span><span>: <span><span>true<span><span> },<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> value<span><span>: <span><span>/* `baz` 的值 */<span><span>,<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> oldValue<span><span>: <span><span>/* 上一次更新时 `baz` 的值 */<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/reusability/custom-directives.html", "title": "自定义指令", "doc_id": "25bc6ce4853440a1a5cb79a79b2d2efa", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 650, "chunk_index": 27, "_doc_id": "27_6085814655305516967"}}
{"doc_id": "28_47753632511962328", "text": "span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> oldValue<span><span>: <span><span>/* 上一次更新时 `baz` 的值 */<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span><code><pre><div><p>和内置指令类似，自定义指令的参数也可以是动态的。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/reusability/custom-directives.html", "title": "自定义指令", "doc_id": "25bc6ce4853440a1a5cb79a79b2d2efa", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 650, "chunk_index": 28, "_doc_id": "28_47753632511962328"}}
{"doc_id": "29_4472410106953711706", "text": "的值 */<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span><code><pre><div><p>和内置指令类似，自定义指令的参数也可以是动态的。举例来说：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>div<span><span> v-example:<span><span>[<span><span>arg<span><span>]=<span><span>\"value\"<span><span>></<span><span>div<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>这里指令的参数会基于组件的 <code>arg<code> 数据属性响应式地更新。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/reusability/custom-directives.html", "title": "自定义指令", "doc_id": "25bc6ce4853440a1a5cb79a79b2d2efa", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 650, "chunk_index": 29, "_doc_id": "29_4472410106953711706"}}
{"doc_id": "30_1749559985005093124", "text": "<span><span>div<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>这里指令的参数会基于组件的 <code>arg<code> 数据属性响应式地更新。<p><div class=\"tip custom-block\"><p class=\"custom-block-title\">Note<p><p>除了 <code>el<code> 外，其他参数都是只读的，不要更改它们。若你需要在不同的钩子间共享信息，推荐通过元素的 <a href=\"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/API/HTMLElement/dataset\" target=\"_blank\">dataset<a> attribute 实现。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/reusability/custom-directives.html", "title": "自定义指令", "doc_id": "25bc6ce4853440a1a5cb79a79b2d2efa", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 650, "chunk_index": 30, "_doc_id": "30_1749559985005093124"}}
{"doc_id": "31_6092583910737958366", "text": "veloper.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/API/HTMLElement/dataset\" target=\"_blank\">dataset<a> attribute 实现。<p><div><h2 id=\"function-shorthand\">简化形式 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#function-shorthand\">​<a><h2><p>对于自定义指令来说，一个很常见的情况是仅仅需要在 <code>mounted<code> 和 <code>updated<code> 上实现相同的行为，除此之外并不需要其他钩子。这种情况下我们可以直接用一个函数来定义指令，", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/reusability/custom-directives.html", "title": "自定义指令", "doc_id": "25bc6ce4853440a1a5cb79a79b2d2efa", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 650, "chunk_index": 31, "_doc_id": "31_6092583910737958366"}}
{"doc_id": "32_1588792238883662359", "text": "个很常见的情况是仅仅需要在 <code>mounted<code> 和 <code>updated<code> 上实现相同的行为，除此之外并不需要其他钩子。这种情况下我们可以直接用一个函数来定义指令，如下所示：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>div<span><span> v-color<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>color<span><span>\"<span><span>></<span><span>div<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>app.<span><span>directive<span><span>(<span><span>'color'<span><span>,", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/reusability/custom-directives.html", "title": "自定义指令", "doc_id": "25bc6ce4853440a1a5cb79a79b2d2efa", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 650, "chunk_index": 32, "_doc_id": "32_1588792238883662359"}}
{"doc_id": "33_3162558646259435978", "text": "ode><span class=\"line\"><span>app.<span><span>directive<span><span>(<span><span>'color'<span><span>, (<span><span>el<span><span>, <span><span>binding<span><span>) <span><span>=><span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 这会在 `mounted` 和 `updated` 时都调用<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> el.style.color <span><span>=<span><span> binding.value<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/reusability/custom-directives.html", "title": "自定义指令", "doc_id": "25bc6ce4853440a1a5cb79a79b2d2efa", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 650, "chunk_index": 33, "_doc_id": "33_3162558646259435978"}}
{"doc_id": "34_1739609004948198872", "text": "<span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> el.style.color <span><span>=<span><span> binding.value<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>})<span><span><code><pre><div><h2 id=\"object-literals\">对象字面量 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#object-literals\">​<a><h2><p>如果你的指令需要多个值，你可以向它传递一个 JavaScript 对象字面量。别忘了，指令也可以接收任何合法的 JavaScript 表达式。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/reusability/custom-directives.html", "title": "自定义指令", "doc_id": "25bc6ce4853440a1a5cb79a79b2d2efa", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 650, "chunk_index": 34, "_doc_id": "34_1739609004948198872"}}
{"doc_id": "35_321160523916089893", "text": "#object-literals\">​<a><h2><p>如果你的指令需要多个值，你可以向它传递一个 JavaScript 对象字面量。别忘了，指令也可以接收任何合法的 JavaScript 表达式。<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>div<span><span> v-demo<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>{ color: <span><span>'white'<span><span>,", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/reusability/custom-directives.html", "title": "自定义指令", "doc_id": "25bc6ce4853440a1a5cb79a79b2d2efa", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 650, "chunk_index": 35, "_doc_id": "35_321160523916089893"}}
{"doc_id": "36_2040525059463013105", "text": "v<span><span> v-demo<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>{ color: <span><span>'white'<span><span>, text: <span><span>'hello!'<span><span> }<span><span>\"<span><span>></<span><span>div<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>app.<span><span>directive<span><span>(<span><span>'demo'<span><span>, (<span><span>el<span><span>,", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/reusability/custom-directives.html", "title": "自定义指令", "doc_id": "25bc6ce4853440a1a5cb79a79b2d2efa", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 650, "chunk_index": 36, "_doc_id": "36_2040525059463013105"}}
{"doc_id": "37_5807342873054669086", "text": ">app.<span><span>directive<span><span>(<span><span>'demo'<span><span>, (<span><span>el<span><span>, <span><span>binding<span><span>) <span><span>=><span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> console.<span><span>log<span><span>(binding.value.color) <span><span>// => \"white\"<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> console.<span><span>log<span><span>(binding.value.text) <span><span>// => \"hello!\"<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/reusability/custom-directives.html", "title": "自定义指令", "doc_id": "25bc6ce4853440a1a5cb79a79b2d2efa", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 650, "chunk_index": 37, "_doc_id": "37_5807342873054669086"}}
{"doc_id": "38_1455251841568813712", "text": "pan> console.<span><span>log<span><span>(binding.value.text) <span><span>// => \"hello!\"<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>})<span><span><code><pre><div><h2 id=\"usage-on-components\">在组件上使用 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#usage-on-components\">​<a><h2><div class=\"warning custom-block\"><p class=\"custom-block-title\">不推荐<p><p>不推荐在组件上使用自定义指令。当组件具有多个根节点时可能会出现预期外的行为。<p><div><p>当在组件上使用自定义指令时，它会始终应用于组件的根节点，和<a href=\"/guide/components/attrs.html\">透传 attributes<a> 类似。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/reusability/custom-directives.html", "title": "自定义指令", "doc_id": "25bc6ce4853440a1a5cb79a79b2d2efa", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 650, "chunk_index": 38, "_doc_id": "38_1455251841568813712"}}
{"doc_id": "39_7972617647991826527", "text": "。<p><div><p>当在组件上使用自定义指令时，它会始终应用于组件的根节点，和<a href=\"/guide/components/attrs.html\">透传 attributes<a> 类似。<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>MyComponent<span><span> v-demo<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>test<span><span>\"<span><span> /><span><span><code><pre><div><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><!-- MyComponent 的模板 --><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/reusability/custom-directives.html", "title": "自定义指令", "doc_id": "25bc6ce4853440a1a5cb79a79b2d2efa", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 650, "chunk_index": 39, "_doc_id": "39_7972617647991826527"}}
{"doc_id": "40_8257586658403397699", "text": "ass=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><!-- MyComponent 的模板 --><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>div<span><span>> <span><span><!-- v-demo 指令会被应用在此处 --><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>span<span><span>>My component content</<span><span>span<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/reusability/custom-directives.html", "title": "自定义指令", "doc_id": "25bc6ce4853440a1a5cb79a79b2d2efa", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 650, "chunk_index": 40, "_doc_id": "40_8257586658403397699"}}
{"doc_id": "41_1648436935771564615", "text": "span> <<span><span>span<span><span>>My component content</<span><span>span<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>div<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>需要注意的是组件可能含有多个根节点。当应用到一个多根组件时，指令将会被忽略且抛出一个警告。和 attribute 不同，指令不能通过 <code>v-bind=\"$attrs\"<code> 来传递给一个不同的元素。<p><div><div>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/reusability/custom-directives.html", "title": "自定义指令", "doc_id": "25bc6ce4853440a1a5cb79a79b2d2efa", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 650, "chunk_index": 41, "_doc_id": "41_1648436935771564615"}}
{"doc_id": "0_8930555472029035998", "text": "<div><div><h1 id=\"suspense\">Suspense <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#suspense\">​<a><h1><div class=\"warning custom-block\"><p class=\"custom-block-title\">实验性功能<p><p><code><Suspense><code> 是一项实验性功能。它不一定会最终成为稳定功能，并且在稳定之前相关 API 也可能会发生变化。<p><div><p><code><Suspense><code> 是一个内置组件，用来在组件树中协调对异步依赖的处理。它让我们可以在组件树上层等待下层的多个嵌套异步依赖项解析完成，并可以在等待时渲染一个加载状态。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/suspense.html", "title": "Suspense | Vue.js", "doc_id": "9ee35727b67a48c18f191daeadcdee20", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 430, "chunk_index": 0, "_doc_id": "0_8930555472029035998"}}
{"doc_id": "1_5553195131892730434", "text": "><p><code><Suspense><code> 是一个内置组件，用来在组件树中协调对异步依赖的处理。它让我们可以在组件树上层等待下层的多个嵌套异步依赖项解析完成，并可以在等待时渲染一个加载状态。<p><h2 id=\"async-dependencies\">异步依赖 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#async-dependencies\">​<a><h2><p>要了解 <code><Suspense><code> 所解决的问题和它是如何与异步依赖进行交互的，我们需要想象这样一种组件层级结构：<p><div class=\"language-\"> <span class=\"lang\"><span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><Suspense><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>└─ <Dashboard><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/suspense.html", "title": "Suspense | Vue.js", "doc_id": "9ee35727b67a48c18f191daeadcdee20", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 430, "chunk_index": 1, "_doc_id": "1_5553195131892730434"}}
{"doc_id": "2_638916597463458443", "text": "<span class=\"line\"><span><Suspense><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>└─ <Dashboard><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> ├─ <Profile><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> │ └─ <FriendStatus> (组件有异步的 setup())<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> └─ <Content><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> ├─ <ActivityFeed> (异步组件)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> └─ <Stats> (异步组件)<span><span><code><pre><div><p>在这个组件树中有多个嵌套组件，要渲染出它们，首先得解析一些异步资源。如果没有 <code><Suspense><code>，则它们每个都需要处理自己的加载、报错和完成状态。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/suspense.html", "title": "Suspense | Vue.js", "doc_id": "9ee35727b67a48c18f191daeadcdee20", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 430, "chunk_index": 2, "_doc_id": "2_638916597463458443"}}
{"doc_id": "3_7850095938296487016", "text": "><pre><div><p>在这个组件树中有多个嵌套组件，要渲染出它们，首先得解析一些异步资源。如果没有 <code><Suspense><code>，则它们每个都需要处理自己的加载、报错和完成状态。在最坏的情况下，我们可能会在页面上看到三个旋转的加载态，在不同的时间显示出内容。<p><p>有了 <code><Suspense><code> 组件后，我们就可以在等待整个多层级组件树中的各个异步依赖获取结果时，在顶层展示出加载中或加载失败的状态。<p><p><code><Suspense><code> 可以等待的异步依赖有两种：<p><ol><li><p>带有异步 <code>setup()<code> 钩子的组件。这也包含了使用 <code><script setup><code> 时有顶层 <code>await<code> 表达式的组件。<p><li><li><p><a href=\"/guide/components/async.html\">异步组件<a>。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/suspense.html", "title": "Suspense | Vue.js", "doc_id": "9ee35727b67a48c18f191daeadcdee20", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 430, "chunk_index": 3, "_doc_id": "3_7850095938296487016"}}
{"doc_id": "4_3768508510854132486", "text": "p><code> 时有顶层 <code>await<code> 表达式的组件。<p><li><li><p><a href=\"/guide/components/async.html\">异步组件<a>。<p><li><ol><h3 id=\"async-setup\"><code>async setup()<code> <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#async-setup\">​<a><h3><p>组合式 API 中组件的 <code>setup()<code> 钩子可以是异步的：<p><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/suspense.html", "title": "Suspense | Vue.js", "doc_id": "9ee35727b67a48c18f191daeadcdee20", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 430, "chunk_index": 4, "_doc_id": "4_3768508510854132486"}}
{"doc_id": "5_5331231178164304227", "text": "b-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> async<span><span> setup<span><span>() {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> const<span><span> res<span><span> =<span><span> await<span><span> fetch<span><span>(<span><span>...<span><span>)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> const<span><span> posts<span><span> =<span><span> await<span><span> res.<span><span>json<span><span>()<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/suspense.html", "title": "Suspense | Vue.js", "doc_id": "9ee35727b67a48c18f191daeadcdee20", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 430, "chunk_index": 5, "_doc_id": "5_5331231178164304227"}}
{"doc_id": "6_5373855569612234154", "text": "n> posts<span><span> =<span><span> await<span><span> res.<span><span>json<span><span>()<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> return<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> posts<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/suspense.html", "title": "Suspense | Vue.js", "doc_id": "9ee35727b67a48c18f191daeadcdee20", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 430, "chunk_index": 6, "_doc_id": "6_5373855569612234154"}}
{"doc_id": "7_5997916386233734785", "text": "> posts<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span><code><pre><div><p>如果使用 <code><script setup><code>，那么顶层 <code>await<code> 表达式会自动让该组件成为一个异步依赖：<p><div class=\"language-vue\"> <span class=\"lang\">vue<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>script<span><span> setup<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/suspense.html", "title": "Suspense | Vue.js", "doc_id": "9ee35727b67a48c18f191daeadcdee20", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 430, "chunk_index": 7, "_doc_id": "7_5997916386233734785"}}
{"doc_id": "8_8779417898818991954", "text": "code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>script<span><span> setup<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> res<span><span> =<span><span> await<span><span> fetch<span><span>(<span><span>...<span><span>)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> posts<span><span> =<span><span> await<span><span> res.<span><span>json<span><span>()<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>script<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/suspense.html", "title": "Suspense | Vue.js", "doc_id": "9ee35727b67a48c18f191daeadcdee20", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 430, "chunk_index": 8, "_doc_id": "8_8779417898818991954"}}
{"doc_id": "9_259441288904318418", "text": "n>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>script<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> {{ posts }}<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><h3 id=\"async-components\">异步组件 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#async-components\">​<a><h3><p>异步组件默认就是<strong>“suspensible”<strong>的。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/suspense.html", "title": "Suspense | Vue.js", "doc_id": "9ee35727b67a48c18f191daeadcdee20", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 430, "chunk_index": 9, "_doc_id": "9_259441288904318418"}}
{"doc_id": "10_1834606161497013657", "text": "<a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#async-components\">​<a><h3><p>异步组件默认就是<strong>“suspensible”<strong>的。这意味着如果组件关系链上有一个 <code><Suspense><code>，那么这个异步组件就会被当作这个 <code><Suspense><code> 的一个异步依赖。在这种情况下，加载状态是由 <code><Suspense><code> 控制，而该组件自己的加载、报错、延时和超时等选项都将被忽略。<p><p>异步组件也可以通过在选项中指定 <code>suspensible: false<code> 表明不用 <code>Suspense<code> 控制，并让组件始终自己控制其加载状态。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/suspense.html", "title": "Suspense | Vue.js", "doc_id": "9ee35727b67a48c18f191daeadcdee20", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 430, "chunk_index": 10, "_doc_id": "10_1834606161497013657"}}
{"doc_id": "11_1634648598034662506", "text": "略。<p><p>异步组件也可以通过在选项中指定 <code>suspensible: false<code> 表明不用 <code>Suspense<code> 控制，并让组件始终自己控制其加载状态。<p><h2 id=\"loading-state\">加载中状态 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#loading-state\">​<a><h2><p><code><Suspense><code> 组件有两个插槽：<code>#default<code> 和 <code>#fallback<code>。两个插槽都只允许<strong>一个<strong>直接子节点。在可能的时候都将显示默认插槽中的节点。否则将显示后备插槽中的节点。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/suspense.html", "title": "Suspense | Vue.js", "doc_id": "9ee35727b67a48c18f191daeadcdee20", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 430, "chunk_index": 11, "_doc_id": "11_1634648598034662506"}}
{"doc_id": "12_8845491060877457554", "text": "ault<code> 和 <code>#fallback<code>。两个插槽都只允许<strong>一个<strong>直接子节点。在可能的时候都将显示默认插槽中的节点。否则将显示后备插槽中的节点。<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>Suspense<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <!-- 具有深层异步依赖的组件 --><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>Dashboard<span><span> /><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/suspense.html", "title": "Suspense | Vue.js", "doc_id": "9ee35727b67a48c18f191daeadcdee20", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 430, "chunk_index": 12, "_doc_id": "12_8845491060877457554"}}
{"doc_id": "13_2492921074030183503", "text": "pan class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>Dashboard<span><span> /><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <!-- 在 #fallback 插槽中显示 “正在加载中” --><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>template<span><span> #<span><span>fallback<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> Loading...<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> </<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/suspense.html", "title": "Suspense | Vue.js", "doc_id": "9ee35727b67a48c18f191daeadcdee20", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 430, "chunk_index": 13, "_doc_id": "13_2492921074030183503"}}
{"doc_id": "14_5431004411272436362", "text": "n> Loading...<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> </<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>Suspense<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>在初始渲染时，<code><Suspense><code> 将在内存中渲染其默认的插槽内容。如果在这个过程中遇到任何异步依赖，则会进入<strong>挂起<strong>状态。在挂起状态期间，展示的是后备内容。当所有遇到的异步依赖都完成后，<code><Suspense><code> 会进入<strong>完成<strong>状态，并将展示出默认插槽的内容。<p><p>如果在初次渲染时没有遇到异步依赖，<code><Suspense><code> 会直接进入完成状态。<p><p>进入完成状态后，只有当默认插槽的根节点被替换时，<code><Suspense><code> 才会回到挂起状态。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/suspense.html", "title": "Suspense | Vue.js", "doc_id": "9ee35727b67a48c18f191daeadcdee20", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 430, "chunk_index": 14, "_doc_id": "14_5431004411272436362"}}
{"doc_id": "15_2573853757167132058", "text": "异步依赖，<code><Suspense><code> 会直接进入完成状态。<p><p>进入完成状态后，只有当默认插槽的根节点被替换时，<code><Suspense><code> 才会回到挂起状态。组件树中新的更深层次的异步依赖<strong>不会<strong>造成 <code><Suspense><code> 回退到挂起状态。<p><p>发生回退时，后备内容不会立即展示出来。相反，<code><Suspense><code> 在等待新内容和异步依赖完成时，会展示之前 <code>#default<code> 插槽的内容。这个行为可以通过一个 <code>timeout<code> prop 进行配置：在等待渲染新内容耗时超过 <code>timeout<code> 毫秒之后，<code><Suspense><code> 将会切换为展示后备内容。若 <code>timeout<code> 值为 <code>0<code> 将导致在替换默认内容时立即显示后备内容。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/suspense.html", "title": "Suspense | Vue.js", "doc_id": "9ee35727b67a48c18f191daeadcdee20", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 430, "chunk_index": 15, "_doc_id": "15_2573853757167132058"}}
{"doc_id": "16_4401841080243237907", "text": "毫秒之后，<code><Suspense><code> 将会切换为展示后备内容。若 <code>timeout<code> 值为 <code>0<code> 将导致在替换默认内容时立即显示后备内容。<p><h2 id=\"events\">事件 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#events\">​<a><h2><p><code><Suspense><code> 组件会触发三个事件：<code>pending<code>、<code>resolve<code> 和 <code>fallback<code>。<code>pending<code> 事件是在进入挂起状态时触发。<code>resolve<code> 事件是在 <code>default<code> 插槽完成获取新内容时触发。<code>fallback<code> 事件则是在 <code>fallback<code> 插槽的内容显示时触发。<p><p>例如，可以使用这些事件在加载新组件时在之前的 DOM 最上层显示一个加载指示器。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/suspense.html", "title": "Suspense | Vue.js", "doc_id": "9ee35727b67a48c18f191daeadcdee20", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 430, "chunk_index": 16, "_doc_id": "16_4401841080243237907"}}
{"doc_id": "17_7527075774309921226", "text": ">fallback<code> 事件则是在 <code>fallback<code> 插槽的内容显示时触发。<p><p>例如，可以使用这些事件在加载新组件时在之前的 DOM 最上层显示一个加载指示器。<p><h2 id=\"error-handling\">错误处理 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#error-handling\">​<a><h2><p><code><Suspense><code> 组件自身目前还不提供错误处理，不过你可以使用 <a href=\"/api/options-lifecycle.html#errorcaptured\"><code>errorCaptured<code><a> 选项或者 <a href=\"/api/composition-api-lifecycle.html#onerrorcaptured\"><code>onErrorCaptured()<code><a> 钩子，在使用到 <code><Suspense><code> 的父组件中捕获和处理异步错误。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/suspense.html", "title": "Suspense | Vue.js", "doc_id": "9ee35727b67a48c18f191daeadcdee20", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 430, "chunk_index": 17, "_doc_id": "17_7527075774309921226"}}
{"doc_id": "18_3867542961174262338", "text": "tml#onerrorcaptured\"><code>onErrorCaptured()<code><a> 钩子，在使用到 <code><Suspense><code> 的父组件中捕获和处理异步错误。<p><h2 id=\"combining-with-other-components\">和其他组件结合 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#combining-with-other-components\">​<a><h2><p>我们常常会将 <code><Suspense><code> 和 <a href=\"./transition.html\"><code><Transition><code><a>、<a href=\"./keep-alive.html\"><code><KeepAlive><code><a> 等组件结合。要保证这些组件都能正常工作，嵌套的顺序非常重要。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/suspense.html", "title": "Suspense | Vue.js", "doc_id": "9ee35727b67a48c18f191daeadcdee20", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 430, "chunk_index": 18, "_doc_id": "18_3867542961174262338"}}
{"doc_id": "19_9005199285917206351", "text": "tion><code><a>、<a href=\"./keep-alive.html\"><code><KeepAlive><code><a> 等组件结合。要保证这些组件都能正常工作，嵌套的顺序非常重要。<p><p>另外，这些组件都通常与 <a href=\"https://router.vuejs.org/zh/\" target=\"_blank\">Vue Router<a> 中的 <code><RouterView><code> 组件结合使用。<p><p>下面的示例展示了如何嵌套这些组件，使它们都能按照预期的方式运行。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/suspense.html", "title": "Suspense | Vue.js", "doc_id": "9ee35727b67a48c18f191daeadcdee20", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 430, "chunk_index": 19, "_doc_id": "19_9005199285917206351"}}
{"doc_id": "20_5858680744353374693", "text": "get=\"_blank\">Vue Router<a> 中的 <code><RouterView><code> 组件结合使用。<p><p>下面的示例展示了如何嵌套这些组件，使它们都能按照预期的方式运行。若想组合得更简单，你也可以删除一些你不需要的组件：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>RouterView<span><span> v-slot<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>{ Component }<span><span>\"<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/suspense.html", "title": "Suspense | Vue.js", "doc_id": "9ee35727b67a48c18f191daeadcdee20", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 430, "chunk_index": 20, "_doc_id": "20_5858680744353374693"}}
{"doc_id": "21_4491328777215365149", "text": "an> v-slot<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>{ Component }<span><span>\"<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>template<span><span> v-if<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>Component<span><span>\"<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>Transition<span><span> mode<span><span>=<span><span>\"out-in\"<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>KeepAlive<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/suspense.html", "title": "Suspense | Vue.js", "doc_id": "9ee35727b67a48c18f191daeadcdee20", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 430, "chunk_index": 21, "_doc_id": "21_4491328777215365149"}}
{"doc_id": "22_8498155406450072164", "text": "<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>KeepAlive<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>Suspense<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <!-- 主要内容 --><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>component<span><span> :<span><span>is<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>Component<span><span>\"<span><span>></<span><span>component<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <!-- 加载中状态 --><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/suspense.html", "title": "Suspense | Vue.js", "doc_id": "9ee35727b67a48c18f191daeadcdee20", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 430, "chunk_index": 22, "_doc_id": "22_8498155406450072164"}}
{"doc_id": "23_2450593356924474126", "text": "><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <!-- 加载中状态 --><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>template<span><span> #<span><span>fallback<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> 正在加载...<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> </<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> </<span><span>Suspense<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> </<span><span>KeepAlive<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/suspense.html", "title": "Suspense | Vue.js", "doc_id": "9ee35727b67a48c18f191daeadcdee20", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 430, "chunk_index": 23, "_doc_id": "23_2450593356924474126"}}
{"doc_id": "24_8335017539134725692", "text": "span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> </<span><span>KeepAlive<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> </<span><span>Transition<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> </<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>RouterView<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>Vue Router 使用动态导入对<a href=\"https://router.vuejs.org/zh/guide/advanced/lazy-loading.html\" target=\"_blank\">懒加载组件<a>进行了内置支持。这些与异步组件不同，目前他们不会触发 <code><Suspense><code>。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/suspense.html", "title": "Suspense | Vue.js", "doc_id": "9ee35727b67a48c18f191daeadcdee20", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 430, "chunk_index": 24, "_doc_id": "24_8335017539134725692"}}
{"doc_id": "25_1458617164548125054", "text": "vanced/lazy-loading.html\" target=\"_blank\">懒加载组件<a>进行了内置支持。这些与异步组件不同，目前他们不会触发 <code><Suspense><code>。但是，它们仍然可以有异步组件作为后代，这些组件可以照常触发 <code><Suspense><code>。<p><h2 id=\"nested-suspense\">嵌套使用 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#nested-suspense\">​<a><h2><p>当我们有多个类似于下方的异步组件 (常见于嵌套或基于布局的路由) 时：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>Suspense<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/suspense.html", "title": "Suspense | Vue.js", "doc_id": "9ee35727b67a48c18f191daeadcdee20", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 430, "chunk_index": 25, "_doc_id": "25_1458617164548125054"}}
{"doc_id": "26_6409602298536486847", "text": "github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>Suspense<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>component<span><span> :<span><span>is<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>DynamicAsyncOuter<span><span>\"<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>component<span><span> :<span><span>is<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>DynamicAsyncInner<span><span>\"<span><span> /><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/suspense.html", "title": "Suspense | Vue.js", "doc_id": "9ee35727b67a48c18f191daeadcdee20", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 430, "chunk_index": 26, "_doc_id": "26_6409602298536486847"}}
{"doc_id": "27_4526948954876209293", "text": "n>is<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>DynamicAsyncInner<span><span>\"<span><span> /><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> </<span><span>component<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>Suspense<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p><code><Suspense><code> 创建了一个边界，它将如预期的那样解析树下的所有异步组件。然而，当我们更改 <code>DynamicAsyncOuter<code> 时，<code><Suspense><code> 会正确地等待它，但当我们更改 <code>DynamicAsyncInner<code> 时，嵌套的 <code>DynamicAsyncInner<code> 会呈现为一个空节点，直到它被解析为止 (而不是之前的节点或回退插槽)。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/suspense.html", "title": "Suspense | Vue.js", "doc_id": "9ee35727b67a48c18f191daeadcdee20", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 430, "chunk_index": 27, "_doc_id": "27_4526948954876209293"}}
{"doc_id": "28_6657100692385178833", "text": "code>DynamicAsyncInner<code> 时，嵌套的 <code>DynamicAsyncInner<code> 会呈现为一个空节点，直到它被解析为止 (而不是之前的节点或回退插槽)。<p><p>为了解决这个问题，我们可以使用嵌套的方法来处理嵌套组件的补丁，就像这样：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>Suspense<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>component<span><span> :<span><span>is<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>DynamicAsyncOuter<span><span>\"<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/suspense.html", "title": "Suspense | Vue.js", "doc_id": "9ee35727b67a48c18f191daeadcdee20", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 430, "chunk_index": 28, "_doc_id": "28_6657100692385178833"}}
{"doc_id": "29_2207064322263481129", "text": "pan>is<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>DynamicAsyncOuter<span><span>\"<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>Suspense<span><span> suspensible<span><span>> <span><span><!-- 像这样 --><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>component<span><span> :<span><span>is<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>DynamicAsyncInner<span><span>\"<span><span> /><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> </<span><span>Suspense<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/suspense.html", "title": "Suspense | Vue.js", "doc_id": "9ee35727b67a48c18f191daeadcdee20", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 430, "chunk_index": 29, "_doc_id": "29_2207064322263481129"}}
{"doc_id": "30_2989984377426145078", "text": "pan><span> /><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> </<span><span>Suspense<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> </<span><span>component<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/suspense.html", "title": "Suspense | Vue.js", "doc_id": "9ee35727b67a48c18f191daeadcdee20", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 430, "chunk_index": 30, "_doc_id": "30_2989984377426145078"}}
{"doc_id": "31_1325150874717698194", "text": "span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> </<span><span>component<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>Suspense<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>如果你不设置 <code>suspensible<code> 属性，内部的 <code><Suspense><code> 将被父级 <code><Suspense><code> 视为同步组件。这意味着它将会有自己的回退插槽，如果两个 <code>Dynamic<code> 组件同时被修改，则当子 <code><Suspense><code> 加载其自己的依赖关系树时，可能会出现空节点和多个修补周期，这可能不是理想情况。设置后，所有异步依赖项处理都会交给父级 <code><Suspense><code> (包括发出的事件)，而内部 <code><Suspense><code> 仅充当依赖项解析和修补的另一个边界。<p>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/suspense.html", "title": "Suspense | Vue.js", "doc_id": "9ee35727b67a48c18f191daeadcdee20", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 430, "chunk_index": 31, "_doc_id": "31_1325150874717698194"}}
{"doc_id": "32_5513005994398883276", "text": "后，所有异步依赖项处理都会交给父级 <code><Suspense><code> (包括发出的事件)，而内部 <code><Suspense><code> 仅充当依赖项解析和修补的另一个边界。<p>\n<p><strong>参考<strong><p><div><div>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/suspense.html", "title": "Suspense | Vue.js", "doc_id": "9ee35727b67a48c18f191daeadcdee20", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 430, "chunk_index": 32, "_doc_id": "32_5513005994398883276"}}
{"doc_id": "0_9156409863713439776", "text": "<div><div><h1 id=\"plugins\">插件 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#plugins\">​<a><h1><h2 id=\"introduction\">介绍 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#introduction\">​<a><h2><p>插件 (Plugins) 是一种能为 Vue 添加全局功能的工具代码。下面是如何安装一个插件的示例：<p><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>import<span><span> { createApp } <span><span>from<span><span> 'vue'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/reusability/plugins.html", "title": "插件 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "c6a29413ad394233aa01fed9dbb01773", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 378, "chunk_index": 0, "_doc_id": "0_9156409863713439776"}}
{"doc_id": "1_9085899629983010793", "text": "<span><span> { createApp } <span><span>from<span><span> 'vue'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> app<span><span> =<span><span> createApp<span><span>({})<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>app.<span><span>use<span><span>(myPlugin, {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> /* 可选的选项 */<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/reusability/plugins.html", "title": "插件 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "c6a29413ad394233aa01fed9dbb01773", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 378, "chunk_index": 1, "_doc_id": "1_9085899629983010793"}}
{"doc_id": "2_3374929691453360183", "text": "pan><span>use<span><span>(myPlugin, {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> /* 可选的选项 */<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>})<span><span><code><pre><div><p>一个插件可以是一个拥有 <code>install()<code> 方法的对象，也可以直接是一个安装函数本身。安装函数会接收到安装它的<a href=\"/api/application.html\">应用实例<a>和传递给 <code>app.use()<code> 的额外选项作为参数：<p><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> myPlugin<span><span> =<span><span> {<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/reusability/plugins.html", "title": "插件 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "c6a29413ad394233aa01fed9dbb01773", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 378, "chunk_index": 2, "_doc_id": "2_3374929691453360183"}}
{"doc_id": "3_416382935403796471", "text": "\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> myPlugin<span><span> =<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> install<span><span>(<span><span>app<span><span>, <span><span>options<span><span>) {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 配置此应用<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/reusability/plugins.html", "title": "插件 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "c6a29413ad394233aa01fed9dbb01773", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 378, "chunk_index": 3, "_doc_id": "3_416382935403796471"}}
{"doc_id": "4_3544679810014737843", "text": "<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 配置此应用<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span><code><pre><div><p>插件没有严格定义的使用范围，但是插件发挥作用的常见场景主要包括以下几种：<p><ol><li><p>通过 <a href=\"/api/application.html#app-component\"><code>app.component()<code><a> 和 <a href=\"/api/application.html#app-directive\"><code>app.directive()<code><a> 注册一到多个全局组件或自定义指令。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/reusability/plugins.html", "title": "插件 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "c6a29413ad394233aa01fed9dbb01773", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 378, "chunk_index": 4, "_doc_id": "4_3544679810014737843"}}
{"doc_id": "5_4246401145153986171", "text": "<a> 和 <a href=\"/api/application.html#app-directive\"><code>app.directive()<code><a> 注册一到多个全局组件或自定义指令。<p><li><li><p>通过 <a href=\"/api/application.html#app-provide\"><code>app.provide()<code><a> 使一个资源<a href=\"/guide/components/provide-inject.html\">可被注入<a>进整个应用。<p><li><li><p>向 <a href=\"/api/application.html#app-config-globalproperties\"><code>app.config.globalProperties<code><a> 中添加一些全局实例属性或方法<p><li><li><p>一个可能上述三种都包含了的功能库 (例如 <a href=\"https://github.com/vuejs/vue-router-next\" target=\"_blank\">vue-router<a>)。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/reusability/plugins.html", "title": "插件 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "c6a29413ad394233aa01fed9dbb01773", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 378, "chunk_index": 5, "_doc_id": "5_4246401145153986171"}}
{"doc_id": "6_7092477495929906801", "text": "能上述三种都包含了的功能库 (例如 <a href=\"https://github.com/vuejs/vue-router-next\" target=\"_blank\">vue-router<a>)。<p><li><ol><h2 id=\"writing-a-plugin\">编写一个插件 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#writing-a-plugin\">​<a><h2><p>为了更好地理解如何构建 Vue.js 插件，我们可以试着写一个简单的 <code>i18n<code> (<a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Internationalization_and_localization\" target=\"_blank\">国际化 (Internationalization)<a> 的缩写) 插件。<p><p>让我们从设置插件对象开始。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/reusability/plugins.html", "title": "插件 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "c6a29413ad394233aa01fed9dbb01773", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 378, "chunk_index": 6, "_doc_id": "6_7092477495929906801"}}
{"doc_id": "7_2294151971993937169", "text": "lization_and_localization\" target=\"_blank\">国际化 (Internationalization)<a> 的缩写) 插件。<p><p>让我们从设置插件对象开始。建议在一个单独的文件中创建并导出它，以保证更好地管理逻辑，如下所示：<p><div class=\"vp-code-block-title\"><p class=\"vp-code-block-title-bar\"><span class=\"vp-code-block-title-text\">plugins/i18n.js<span><p><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/reusability/plugins.html", "title": "插件 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "c6a29413ad394233aa01fed9dbb01773", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 378, "chunk_index": 7, "_doc_id": "7_2294151971993937169"}}
{"doc_id": "8_3580437134999047433", "text": "b-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> install<span><span>: (<span><span>app<span><span>, <span><span>options<span><span>) <span><span>=><span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 在这里编写插件代码<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span><code><pre><div><div><p>我们希望有一个翻译函数，这个函数接收一个以 <code>.<code> 作为分隔符的 <code>key<code> 字符串，用来在用户提供的翻译字典中查找对应语言的文本。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/reusability/plugins.html", "title": "插件 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "c6a29413ad394233aa01fed9dbb01773", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 378, "chunk_index": 8, "_doc_id": "8_3580437134999047433"}}
{"doc_id": "9_1122899782572828748", "text": "><div><div><p>我们希望有一个翻译函数，这个函数接收一个以 <code>.<code> 作为分隔符的 <code>key<code> 字符串，用来在用户提供的翻译字典中查找对应语言的文本。期望的使用方式如下：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>h1<span><span>>{{ <span><span>$translate<span><span>(<span><span>'greetings.hello'<span><span>) }}</<span><span>h1<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>这个函数应当能够在任意模板中被全局调用。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/reusability/plugins.html", "title": "插件 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "c6a29413ad394233aa01fed9dbb01773", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 378, "chunk_index": 9, "_doc_id": "9_1122899782572828748"}}
{"doc_id": "10_5705557936894747324", "text": "llo'<span><span>) }}</<span><span>h1<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>这个函数应当能够在任意模板中被全局调用。这一点可以通过在插件中将它添加到 <code>app.config.globalProperties<code> 上来实现：<p><div class=\"vp-code-block-title\"><p class=\"vp-code-block-title-bar\"><span class=\"vp-code-block-title-text\">plugins/i18n.js<span><p><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/reusability/plugins.html", "title": "插件 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "c6a29413ad394233aa01fed9dbb01773", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 378, "chunk_index": 10, "_doc_id": "10_5705557936894747324"}}
{"doc_id": "11_3536719242354412608", "text": "b-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> install<span><span>: (<span><span>app<span><span>, <span><span>options<span><span>) <span><span>=><span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line highlighted\"><span> // 注入一个全局可用的 $translate() 方法<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/reusability/plugins.html", "title": "插件 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "c6a29413ad394233aa01fed9dbb01773", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 378, "chunk_index": 11, "_doc_id": "11_3536719242354412608"}}
{"doc_id": "12_4837349727779318903", "text": "<span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line highlighted\"><span> // 注入一个全局可用的 $translate() 方法<span><span>\n<span class=\"line highlighted\"><span> app.config.globalProperties.<span><span>$translate<span><span> =<span><span> (<span><span>key<span><span>) <span><span>=><span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line highlighted\"><span> // 获取 `options` 对象的深层属性<span><span>\n<span class=\"line highlighted\"><span> // 使用 `key` 作为索引<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/reusability/plugins.html", "title": "插件 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "c6a29413ad394233aa01fed9dbb01773", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 378, "chunk_index": 12, "_doc_id": "12_4837349727779318903"}}
{"doc_id": "13_7261485880680994903", "text": "获取 `options` 对象的深层属性<span><span>\n<span class=\"line highlighted\"><span> // 使用 `key` 作为索引<span><span>\n<span class=\"line highlighted\"><span> return<span><span> key.<span><span>split<span><span>(<span><span>'.'<span><span>).<span><span>reduce<span><span>((<span><span>o<span><span>, <span><span>i<span><span>) <span><span>=><span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line highlighted\"><span> if<span><span> (o) <span><span>return<span><span> o[i]<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/reusability/plugins.html", "title": "插件 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "c6a29413ad394233aa01fed9dbb01773", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 378, "chunk_index": 13, "_doc_id": "13_7261485880680994903"}}
{"doc_id": "14_8786014986502264295", "text": "class=\"line highlighted\"><span> if<span><span> (o) <span><span>return<span><span> o[i]<span><span>\n<span class=\"line highlighted\"><span> }, options)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line highlighted\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/reusability/plugins.html", "title": "插件 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "c6a29413ad394233aa01fed9dbb01773", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 378, "chunk_index": 14, "_doc_id": "14_8786014986502264295"}}
{"doc_id": "15_5571986517150937184", "text": "><span>\n<span class=\"line highlighted\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span><code><pre><div><div><p>我们的 <code>$translate<code> 函数会接收一个例如 <code>greetings.hello<code> 的字符串，在用户提供的翻译字典中查找，并返回翻译得到的值。<p><p>用于查找的翻译字典对象则应当在插件被安装时作为 <code>app.use()<code> 的额外参数被传入：<p><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>import<span><span> i18nPlugin <span><span>from<span><span> './plugins/i18n'<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/reusability/plugins.html", "title": "插件 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "c6a29413ad394233aa01fed9dbb01773", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 378, "chunk_index": 15, "_doc_id": "15_5571986517150937184"}}
{"doc_id": "16_1026203998712371700", "text": "line\"><span>import<span><span> i18nPlugin <span><span>from<span><span> './plugins/i18n'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>app.<span><span>use<span><span>(i18nPlugin, {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> greetings: {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> hello: <span><span>'Bonjour!'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/reusability/plugins.html", "title": "插件 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "c6a29413ad394233aa01fed9dbb01773", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 378, "chunk_index": 16, "_doc_id": "16_1026203998712371700"}}
{"doc_id": "17_1395000501564248002", "text": "ass=\"line\"><span> hello: <span><span>'Bonjour!'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>})<span><span><code><pre><div><p>这样，我们一开始的表达式 <code>$translate('greetings.hello')<code> 就会在运行时被替换为 <code>Bonjour!<code> 了。<p><p>TypeScript 用户请参考：<a href=\"/guide/typescript/options-api.html#augmenting-global-properties\">扩展全局属性<a> <p><div class=\"tip custom-block\"><p class=\"custom-block-title\">TIP<p><p>请谨慎使用全局属性，如果在整个应用中使用不同插件注入的太多全局属性，很容易让应用变得难以理解和维护。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/reusability/plugins.html", "title": "插件 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "c6a29413ad394233aa01fed9dbb01773", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 378, "chunk_index": 17, "_doc_id": "17_1395000501564248002"}}
{"doc_id": "18_5102605589634443041", "text": "tom-block\"><p class=\"custom-block-title\">TIP<p><p>请谨慎使用全局属性，如果在整个应用中使用不同插件注入的太多全局属性，很容易让应用变得难以理解和维护。<p><div><h3 id=\"provide-inject-with-plugins\">插件中的 Provide / Inject <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#provide-inject-with-plugins\">​<a><h3><p>在插件中，我们可以通过 <code>provide<code> 来为插件用户提供访问某个函数或属性的能力。举例来说，我们可以将插件接收到的 <code>options<code> 参数提供给整个应用，让任何组件都能使用这个翻译字典对象。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/reusability/plugins.html", "title": "插件 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "c6a29413ad394233aa01fed9dbb01773", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 378, "chunk_index": 18, "_doc_id": "18_5102605589634443041"}}
{"doc_id": "19_7068142497550008731", "text": "provide<code> 来为插件用户提供访问某个函数或属性的能力。举例来说，我们可以将插件接收到的 <code>options<code> 参数提供给整个应用，让任何组件都能使用这个翻译字典对象。<p><div class=\"vp-code-block-title\"><p class=\"vp-code-block-title-bar\"><span class=\"vp-code-block-title-text\">plugins/i18n.js<span><p><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/reusability/plugins.html", "title": "插件 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "c6a29413ad394233aa01fed9dbb01773", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 378, "chunk_index": 19, "_doc_id": "19_7068142497550008731"}}
{"doc_id": "20_3800879259054431984", "text": "b-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> install<span><span>: (<span><span>app<span><span>, <span><span>options<span><span>) <span><span>=><span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line highlighted\"><span> app.<span><span>provide<span><span>(<span><span>'i18n'<span><span>, options)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/reusability/plugins.html", "title": "插件 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "c6a29413ad394233aa01fed9dbb01773", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 378, "chunk_index": 20, "_doc_id": "20_3800879259054431984"}}
{"doc_id": "21_7334704036411695462", "text": "<span>(<span><span>'i18n'<span><span>, options)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span><code><pre><div><div><p>现在，插件用户就可以在他们的组件中以 <code>i18n<code> 为 key 注入并访问插件的选项对象了。<p><div class=\"composition-api\"><div class=\"language-vue\"> <span class=\"lang\">vue<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>script<span><span> setup<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/reusability/plugins.html", "title": "插件 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "c6a29413ad394233aa01fed9dbb01773", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 378, "chunk_index": 21, "_doc_id": "21_7334704036411695462"}}
{"doc_id": "22_6108058491823397978", "text": "code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>script<span><span> setup<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>import<span><span> { inject } <span><span>from<span><span> 'vue'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line highlighted\"><span>const<span><span> i18n<span><span> =<span><span> inject<span><span>(<span><span>'i18n'<span><span>)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>console.<span><span>log<span><span>(i18n.greetings.hello)<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/reusability/plugins.html", "title": "插件 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "c6a29413ad394233aa01fed9dbb01773", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 378, "chunk_index": 22, "_doc_id": "22_6108058491823397978"}}
{"doc_id": "23_3829606015929164516", "text": "pan>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>console.<span><span>log<span><span>(i18n.greetings.hello)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>script<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><div><div class=\"options-api\"><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line highlighted\"><span> inject: [<span><span>'i18n'<span><span>],<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/reusability/plugins.html", "title": "插件 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "c6a29413ad394233aa01fed9dbb01773", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 378, "chunk_index": 23, "_doc_id": "23_3829606015929164516"}}
{"doc_id": "24_3339583222648423302", "text": "><span>\n<span class=\"line highlighted\"><span> inject: [<span><span>'i18n'<span><span>],<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> created<span><span>() {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> console.<span><span>log<span><span>(<span><span>this<span><span>.i18n.greetings.hello)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/reusability/plugins.html", "title": "插件 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "c6a29413ad394233aa01fed9dbb01773", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 378, "chunk_index": 24, "_doc_id": "24_3339583222648423302"}}
{"doc_id": "25_8578304339949412281", "text": "an><span>this<span><span>.i18n.greetings.hello)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span><code><pre><div><div><h3 id=\"为-npm-打包\">为 NPM 打包 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#%E4%B8%BA-npm-%E6%89%93%E5%8C%85\">​<a><h3><p>如果你想进一步打包并发布插件给他人使用，请参阅 <a href=\"https://vite.dev/guide/build.html#library-mode\" target=\"_blank\">Vite 库模式<a>。<p><div><div>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/reusability/plugins.html", "title": "插件 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "c6a29413ad394233aa01fed9dbb01773", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 378, "chunk_index": 25, "_doc_id": "25_8578304339949412281"}}
{"doc_id": "0_3584387159555560064", "text": "<div><div><h1 id=\"single-file-components\">单文件组件 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#single-file-components\">​<a><h1><h2 id=\"introduction\">介绍 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#introduction\">​<a><h2><p>Vue 的单文件组件 (即 <code>*.vue<code> 文件，英文 Single-File Component，简称 <strong>SFC<strong>) 是一种特殊的文件格式，使我们能够将一个 Vue 组件的模板、逻辑与样式封装在单个文件中。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/scaling-up/sfc.html", "title": "单文件组件", "doc_id": "455590a3bf5549a49f01cd37e65dd529", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 256, "chunk_index": 0, "_doc_id": "0_3584387159555560064"}}
{"doc_id": "1_5904563641090635914", "text": "de> 文件，英文 Single-File Component，简称 <strong>SFC<strong>) 是一种特殊的文件格式，使我们能够将一个 Vue 组件的模板、逻辑与样式封装在单个文件中。下面是一个单文件组件的示例：<p><div class=\"options-api\"><div class=\"language-vue\"> <span class=\"lang\">vue<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>script<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> data<span><span>() {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> return<span><span> {<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/scaling-up/sfc.html", "title": "单文件组件", "doc_id": "455590a3bf5549a49f01cd37e65dd529", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 256, "chunk_index": 1, "_doc_id": "1_5904563641090635914"}}
{"doc_id": "2_676455179148210906", "text": "><span> data<span><span>() {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> return<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> greeting: <span><span>'Hello World!'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>script<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/scaling-up/sfc.html", "title": "单文件组件", "doc_id": "455590a3bf5549a49f01cd37e65dd529", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 256, "chunk_index": 2, "_doc_id": "2_676455179148210906"}}
{"doc_id": "3_6090515951954311560", "text": ">\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>p<span><span> class<span><span>=<span><span>\"greeting\"<span><span>>{{ greeting }}</<span><span>p<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>style<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>.greeting<span><span> {<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/scaling-up/sfc.html", "title": "单文件组件", "doc_id": "455590a3bf5549a49f01cd37e65dd529", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 256, "chunk_index": 3, "_doc_id": "3_6090515951954311560"}}
{"doc_id": "4_4212903995423187599", "text": "n><span>style<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>.greeting<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> color<span><span>: <span><span>red<span><span>;<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> font-weight<span><span>: <span><span>bold<span><span>;<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/scaling-up/sfc.html", "title": "单文件组件", "doc_id": "455590a3bf5549a49f01cd37e65dd529", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 256, "chunk_index": 4, "_doc_id": "4_4212903995423187599"}}
{"doc_id": "5_4813006113887291885", "text": "eight<span><span>: <span><span>bold<span><span>;<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>style<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><div><div class=\"composition-api\"><div class=\"language-vue\"> <span class=\"lang\">vue<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>script<span><span> setup<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>import<span><span> { ref } <span><span>from<span><span> 'vue'<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/scaling-up/sfc.html", "title": "单文件组件", "doc_id": "455590a3bf5549a49f01cd37e65dd529", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 256, "chunk_index": 5, "_doc_id": "5_4813006113887291885"}}
{"doc_id": "6_60222202543017870", "text": "<span class=\"line\"><span>import<span><span> { ref } <span><span>from<span><span> 'vue'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> greeting<span><span> =<span><span> ref<span><span>(<span><span>'Hello World!'<span><span>)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>script<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/scaling-up/sfc.html", "title": "单文件组件", "doc_id": "455590a3bf5549a49f01cd37e65dd529", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 256, "chunk_index": 6, "_doc_id": "6_60222202543017870"}}
{"doc_id": "7_6090515951954311560", "text": ">\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>p<span><span> class<span><span>=<span><span>\"greeting\"<span><span>>{{ greeting }}</<span><span>p<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>style<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>.greeting<span><span> {<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/scaling-up/sfc.html", "title": "单文件组件", "doc_id": "455590a3bf5549a49f01cd37e65dd529", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 256, "chunk_index": 7, "_doc_id": "7_6090515951954311560"}}
{"doc_id": "8_2153783516035028828", "text": "n><span>style<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>.greeting<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> color<span><span>: <span><span>red<span><span>;<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> font-weight<span><span>: <span><span>bold<span><span>;<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>style<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><div><p>如你所见，Vue 的单文件组件是网页开发中 HTML、CSS 和 JavaScript 三种语言经典组合的自然延伸。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/scaling-up/sfc.html", "title": "单文件组件", "doc_id": "455590a3bf5549a49f01cd37e65dd529", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 256, "chunk_index": 8, "_doc_id": "8_2153783516035028828"}}
{"doc_id": "9_1504590802246030107", "text": "span>><span><span><code><pre><div><div><p>如你所见，Vue 的单文件组件是网页开发中 HTML、CSS 和 JavaScript 三种语言经典组合的自然延伸。<code><template><code>、<code><script><code> 和 <code><style><code> 三个块在同一个文件中封装、组合了组件的视图、逻辑和样式。完整的语法定义可以查阅<a href=\"/api/sfc-spec.html\">单文件组件语法说明<a>。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/scaling-up/sfc.html", "title": "单文件组件", "doc_id": "455590a3bf5549a49f01cd37e65dd529", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 256, "chunk_index": 9, "_doc_id": "9_1504590802246030107"}}
{"doc_id": "10_7264279733046433801", "text": "code><style><code> 三个块在同一个文件中封装、组合了组件的视图、逻辑和样式。完整的语法定义可以查阅<a href=\"/api/sfc-spec.html\">单文件组件语法说明<a>。<p><h2 id=\"why-sfc\">为什么要使用单文件组件 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#why-sfc\">​<a><h2><p>使用单文件组件必须使用构建工具，但作为回报带来了以下优点：<p><p>单文件组件是 Vue 框架提供的一个功能，并且在下列场景中都是官方推荐的项目组织方式：<p><ul><li>单页面应用 (SPA)<li><li>静态站点生成 (SSG)<li><li>任何值得引入构建步骤以获得更好的开发体验 (DX) 的项目<li><ul><p>当然，在一些轻量级场景下使用单文件组件会显得有些杀鸡用牛刀。因此 Vue 同样也可以在无构建步骤的情况下以纯 JavaScript 方式使用。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/scaling-up/sfc.html", "title": "单文件组件", "doc_id": "455590a3bf5549a49f01cd37e65dd529", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 256, "chunk_index": 10, "_doc_id": "10_7264279733046433801"}}
{"doc_id": "11_4177514796086955104", "text": "获得更好的开发体验 (DX) 的项目<li><ul><p>当然，在一些轻量级场景下使用单文件组件会显得有些杀鸡用牛刀。因此 Vue 同样也可以在无构建步骤的情况下以纯 JavaScript 方式使用。如果你的用例只需要给静态 HTML 添加一些简单的交互，你可以看看 <a href=\"https://github.com/vuejs/petite-vue\" target=\"_blank\">petite-vue<a>，它是一个 6 kB 左右、预优化过的 Vue 子集，更适合渐进式增强的需求。<p><h2 id=\"how-it-works\">单文件组件是如何工作的 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#how-it-works\">​<a><h2><p>Vue 单文件组件是一个框架指定的文件格式，因此必须交由 <a href=\"https://github.com/vuejs/core/tree/main/packages/compiler-sfc\" target=\"_blank\">@vue/compiler-sfc<a> 编译为标准的 JavaScript 和 CSS，", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/scaling-up/sfc.html", "title": "单文件组件", "doc_id": "455590a3bf5549a49f01cd37e65dd529", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 256, "chunk_index": 11, "_doc_id": "11_4177514796086955104"}}
{"doc_id": "12_4669932154311836796", "text": "/core/tree/main/packages/compiler-sfc\" target=\"_blank\">@vue/compiler-sfc<a> 编译为标准的 JavaScript 和 CSS，一个编译后的单文件组件是一个标准的 JavaScript(ES) 模块，这也意味着在构建配置正确的前提下，你可以像导入其他 ES 模块一样导入单文件组件：<p><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>import<span><span> MyComponent <span><span>from<span><span> './MyComponent.vue'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/scaling-up/sfc.html", "title": "单文件组件", "doc_id": "455590a3bf5549a49f01cd37e65dd529", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 256, "chunk_index": 12, "_doc_id": "12_4669932154311836796"}}
{"doc_id": "13_7593979449652273742", "text": "n class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> components: {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> MyComponent<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span><code><pre><div><p>单文件组件中的 <code><style><code> 标签一般会在开发时注入成原生的 <code><style><code> 标签以支持热更新，而生产环境下它们会被抽取、合并成单独的 CSS 文件。<p><p>你可以在 <a href=\"https://play.vuejs.org/\" target=\"_blank\">Vue 单文件组件演练场<a>中实际使用一下单文件组件，同时可以看到它们最终被编译后的样子。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/scaling-up/sfc.html", "title": "单文件组件", "doc_id": "455590a3bf5549a49f01cd37e65dd529", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 256, "chunk_index": 13, "_doc_id": "13_7593979449652273742"}}
{"doc_id": "14_2668162872365937160", "text": "可以在 <a href=\"https://play.vuejs.org/\" target=\"_blank\">Vue 单文件组件演练场<a>中实际使用一下单文件组件，同时可以看到它们最终被编译后的样子。<p><p>在实际项目中，我们一般会使用集成了单文件组件编译器的构建工具，比如 <a href=\"https://cn.vitejs.dev/\" target=\"_blank\">Vite<a> 或者 <a href=\"https://cli.vuejs.org/zh/\" target=\"_blank\">Vue CLI<a> (基于 <a href=\"https://webpack.js.org/\" target=\"_blank\">webpack<a>)，Vue 官方也提供了脚手架工具来帮助你尽可能快速地上手开发单文件组件。更多细节请查看<a href=\"/guide/scaling-up/tooling.html\">单文件组件工具链<a>章节。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/scaling-up/sfc.html", "title": "单文件组件", "doc_id": "455590a3bf5549a49f01cd37e65dd529", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 256, "chunk_index": 14, "_doc_id": "14_2668162872365937160"}}
{"doc_id": "15_1891549839648477526", "text": ">)，Vue 官方也提供了脚手架工具来帮助你尽可能快速地上手开发单文件组件。更多细节请查看<a href=\"/guide/scaling-up/tooling.html\">单文件组件工具链<a>章节。<p><h2 id=\"what-about-separation-of-concerns\">如何看待关注点分离？ <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#what-about-separation-of-concerns\">​<a><h2><p>一些有着传统 Web 开发背景的用户可能会因为单文件组件将不同的关注点集合在一处而有所顾虑，觉得 HTML/CSS/JS 应当是分离开的！<p><p>要回答这个问题，我们必须对这一点达成共识：<strong>前端开发的关注点不是完全基于文件类型分离的<strong>。前端工程化的最终目的都是为了能够更好地维护代码。关注点分离不应该是教条式地将其视为文件类型的区别和分离，仅仅这样并不够帮我们在日益复杂的前端应用的背景下提高开发效率。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/scaling-up/sfc.html", "title": "单文件组件", "doc_id": "455590a3bf5549a49f01cd37e65dd529", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 256, "chunk_index": 15, "_doc_id": "15_1891549839648477526"}}
{"doc_id": "16_5012689592418377534", "text": "于文件类型分离的<strong>。前端工程化的最终目的都是为了能够更好地维护代码。关注点分离不应该是教条式地将其视为文件类型的区别和分离，仅仅这样并不够帮我们在日益复杂的前端应用的背景下提高开发效率。<p><p>在现代的 UI 开发中，我们发现与其将代码库划分为三个巨大的层，相互交织在一起，不如将它们划分为松散耦合的组件，再按需组合起来。在一个组件中，其模板、逻辑和样式本就是有内在联系的、是耦合的，将它们放在一起，实际上使组件更有内聚性和可维护性。<p><p>即使你不喜欢单文件组件这样的形式而仍然选择拆分单独的 JavaScript 和 CSS 文件，也没关系，你还是可以通过<a href=\"/api/sfc-spec.html#src-imports\">资源导入<a>功能获得热更新和预编译等功能的支持。<p><div><div>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/scaling-up/sfc.html", "title": "单文件组件", "doc_id": "455590a3bf5549a49f01cd37e65dd529", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 256, "chunk_index": 16, "_doc_id": "16_5012689592418377534"}}
{"doc_id": "0_8467981841934067824", "text": "<div><div><h1 id=\"transition\">Transition <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#transition\">​<a><h1><p>Vue 提供了两个内置组件，可以帮助你制作基于状态变化的过渡和动画：<p><p>除了这两个组件，我们也可以通过其他技术手段来应用动画，比如切换 CSS class 或用状态绑定样式来驱动动画。这些其他的方法会在<a href=\"/guide/extras/animation.html\">动画技巧<a>章节中展开。<p><h2 id=\"the-transition-component\"><code><Transition><code> 组件 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#the-transition-component\">​<a><h2><p><code><Transition><code> 是一个内置组件，这意味着它在任意别的组件中都可以被使用，无需注册。它可以将进入和离开动画应用到通过默认插槽传递给它的元素或组件上。进入或离开可以由以下的条件之一触发：<p><ul><li>由", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/transition.html", "title": "Transition | Vue.js", "doc_id": "f0d1774f7adb4324a70eb73c781eb507", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1496, "chunk_index": 0, "_doc_id": "0_8467981841934067824"}}
{"doc_id": "1_5588558747475527668", "text": "de> 是一个内置组件，这意味着它在任意别的组件中都可以被使用，无需注册。它可以将进入和离开动画应用到通过默认插槽传递给它的元素或组件上。进入或离开可以由以下的条件之一触发：<p><ul><li>由 <code>v-if<code> 所触发的切换<li><li>由 <code>v-show<code> 所触发的切换<li><li>由特殊元素 <code><component><code> 切换的动态组件<li><li>改变特殊的 <code>key<code> 属性<li><ul><p>以下是最基本用法的示例：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>button<span><span> @<span><span>click<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>show", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/transition.html", "title": "Transition | Vue.js", "doc_id": "f0d1774f7adb4324a70eb73c781eb507", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1496, "chunk_index": 1, "_doc_id": "1_5588558747475527668"}}
{"doc_id": "2_8561560647092155725", "text": "><span><<span><span>button<span><span> @<span><span>click<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>show <span><span>=<span><span> !<span><span>show<span><span>\"<span><span>>Toggle</<span><span>button<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>Transition<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>p<span><span> v-if<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>show<span><span>\"<span><span>>hello</<span><span>p<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/transition.html", "title": "Transition | Vue.js", "doc_id": "f0d1774f7adb4324a70eb73c781eb507", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1496, "chunk_index": 2, "_doc_id": "2_8561560647092155725"}}
{"doc_id": "3_9071841483440123769", "text": "span><span>\"<span><span>show<span><span>\"<span><span>>hello</<span><span>p<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>Transition<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><div class=\"language-css\"> <span class=\"lang\">css<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>/* 下面我们会解释这些 class 是做什么的 */<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>.v-enter-active<span><span>,<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>.v-leave-active<span><span> {<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/transition.html", "title": "Transition | Vue.js", "doc_id": "f0d1774f7adb4324a70eb73c781eb507", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1496, "chunk_index": 3, "_doc_id": "3_9071841483440123769"}}
{"doc_id": "4_6347913501385113514", "text": "-active<span><span>,<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>.v-leave-active<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> transition<span><span>: opacity <span><span>0.5<span><span>s<span><span> ease<span><span>;<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>.v-enter-from<span><span>,<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>.v-leave-to<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> opacity<span><span>: <span><span>0<span><span>;<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/transition.html", "title": "Transition | Vue.js", "doc_id": "f0d1774f7adb4324a70eb73c781eb507", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1496, "chunk_index": 4, "_doc_id": "4_6347913501385113514"}}
{"doc_id": "5_6309955168331021219", "text": "{<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> opacity<span><span>: <span><span>0<span><span>;<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span><code><pre><div><div class=\"tip custom-block\"><p class=\"custom-block-title\">TIP<p><p><code><Transition><code> 仅支持单个元素或组件作为其插槽内容。如果内容是一个组件，这个组件必须仅有一个根元素。<p><div><p>当一个 <code><Transition><code> 组件中的元素被插入或移除时，会发生下面这些事情：<p><ol><li><p>Vue 会自动检测目标元素是否应用了 CSS 过渡或动画。如果是，则一些 <a href=\"#transition-classes\">CSS 过渡 class<a> 会在适当的时机被添加和移除。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/transition.html", "title": "Transition | Vue.js", "doc_id": "f0d1774f7adb4324a70eb73c781eb507", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1496, "chunk_index": 5, "_doc_id": "5_6309955168331021219"}}
{"doc_id": "6_4717575409271632678", "text": "<p>Vue 会自动检测目标元素是否应用了 CSS 过渡或动画。如果是，则一些 <a href=\"#transition-classes\">CSS 过渡 class<a> 会在适当的时机被添加和移除。<p><li><li><p>如果有作为监听器的 <a href=\"#javascript-hooks\">JavaScript 钩子<a>，这些钩子函数会在适当时机被调用。<p><li><li><p>如果没有探测到 CSS 过渡或动画、也没有提供 JavaScript 钩子，那么 DOM 的插入、删除操作将在浏览器的下一个动画帧后执行。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/transition.html", "title": "Transition | Vue.js", "doc_id": "f0d1774f7adb4324a70eb73c781eb507", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1496, "chunk_index": 6, "_doc_id": "6_4717575409271632678"}}
{"doc_id": "7_338711562849986240", "text": "，这些钩子函数会在适当时机被调用。<p><li><li><p>如果没有探测到 CSS 过渡或动画、也没有提供 JavaScript 钩子，那么 DOM 的插入、删除操作将在浏览器的下一个动画帧后执行。<p><li><ol><h2 id=\"css-based-transitions\">基于 CSS 的过渡效果 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#css-based-transitions\">​<a><h2><h3 id=\"transition-classes\">CSS 过渡 class <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#transition-classes\">​<a><h3><p>一共有 6 个应用于进入与离开过渡效果的 CSS class。<p><p> <p><ol><li><p><code>v-enter-from<code>：进入动画的起始状态。在元素插入之前添加，在元素插入完成后的下一帧移除。<p><li><li><p><code>v-enter-active<code>：进入动画的生效状态。应用于整个进入动画阶段。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/transition.html", "title": "Transition | Vue.js", "doc_id": "f0d1774f7adb4324a70eb73c781eb507", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1496, "chunk_index": 7, "_doc_id": "7_338711562849986240"}}
{"doc_id": "8_2756814679089051902", "text": ">：进入动画的起始状态。在元素插入之前添加，在元素插入完成后的下一帧移除。<p><li><li><p><code>v-enter-active<code>：进入动画的生效状态。应用于整个进入动画阶段。在元素被插入之前添加，在过渡或动画完成之后移除。这个 class 可以被用来定义进入动画的持续时间、延迟与速度曲线类型。<p><li><li><p><code>v-enter-to<code>：进入动画的结束状态。在元素插入完成后的下一帧被添加 (也就是 <code>v-enter-from<code> 被移除的同时)，在过渡或动画完成之后移除。<p><li><li><p><code>v-leave-from<code>：离开动画的起始状态。在离开过渡效果被触发时立即添加，在一帧后被移除。<p><li><li><p><code>v-leave-active<code>：离开动画的生效状态。应用于整个离开动画阶段。在离开过渡效果被触发时立即添加，在过渡或动画完成之后移除。这个 class 可以被用来定义离开动画的持续时间、延迟与速度曲线类型。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/transition.html", "title": "Transition | Vue.js", "doc_id": "f0d1774f7adb4324a70eb73c781eb507", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1496, "chunk_index": 8, "_doc_id": "8_2756814679089051902"}}
{"doc_id": "9_5827360382190076011", "text": "active<code>：离开动画的生效状态。应用于整个离开动画阶段。在离开过渡效果被触发时立即添加，在过渡或动画完成之后移除。这个 class 可以被用来定义离开动画的持续时间、延迟与速度曲线类型。<p><li><li><p><code>v-leave-to<code>：离开动画的结束状态。在一个离开动画被触发后的下一帧被添加 (也就是 <code>v-leave-from<code> 被移除的同时)，在过渡或动画完成之后移除。<p><li><ol><p><code>v-enter-active<code> 和 <code>v-leave-active<code> 给我们提供了为进入和离开动画指定不同速度曲线的能力，我们将在下面的小节中看到一个示例。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/transition.html", "title": "Transition | Vue.js", "doc_id": "f0d1774f7adb4324a70eb73c781eb507", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1496, "chunk_index": 9, "_doc_id": "9_5827360382190076011"}}
{"doc_id": "10_139603806124380782", "text": "><code>v-enter-active<code> 和 <code>v-leave-active<code> 给我们提供了为进入和离开动画指定不同速度曲线的能力，我们将在下面的小节中看到一个示例。<p><h3 id=\"named-transitions\">为过渡效果命名 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#named-transitions\">​<a><h3><p>我们可以给 <code><Transition><code> 组件传一个 <code>name<code> prop 来声明一个过渡效果名：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>Transition<span><span> name<span><span>=<span><span>\"fade\"<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/transition.html", "title": "Transition | Vue.js", "doc_id": "f0d1774f7adb4324a70eb73c781eb507", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1496, "chunk_index": 10, "_doc_id": "10_139603806124380782"}}
{"doc_id": "11_6998711790743445374", "text": "an><<span><span>Transition<span><span> name<span><span>=<span><span>\"fade\"<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> ...<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/transition.html", "title": "Transition | Vue.js", "doc_id": "f0d1774f7adb4324a70eb73c781eb507", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1496, "chunk_index": 11, "_doc_id": "11_6998711790743445374"}}
{"doc_id": "12_5202810404440570393", "text": "e<span><span>=<span><span>\"fade\"<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> ...<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>Transition<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>对于一个有名字的过渡效果，对它起作用的过渡 class 会以其名字而不是 <code>v<code> 作为前缀。比如，上方例子中被应用的 class 将会是 <code>fade-enter-active<code> 而不是 <code>v-enter-active<code>。这个“fade”过渡的 class 应该是这样：<p><div class=\"language-css\"> <span class=\"lang\">css<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>.fade-enter-active<span><span>,<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/transition.html", "title": "Transition | Vue.js", "doc_id": "f0d1774f7adb4324a70eb73c781eb507", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1496, "chunk_index": 12, "_doc_id": "12_5202810404440570393"}}
{"doc_id": "13_4513188545132730450", "text": "iki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>.fade-enter-active<span><span>,<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>.fade-leave-active<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> transition<span><span>: opacity <span><span>0.5<span><span>s<span><span> ease<span><span>;<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>.fade-enter-from<span><span>,<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>.fade-leave-to<span><span> {<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/transition.html", "title": "Transition | Vue.js", "doc_id": "f0d1774f7adb4324a70eb73c781eb507", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1496, "chunk_index": 13, "_doc_id": "13_4513188545132730450"}}
{"doc_id": "14_7768966974828748254", "text": "ter-from<span><span>,<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>.fade-leave-to<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> opacity<span><span>: <span><span>0<span><span>;<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/transition.html", "title": "Transition | Vue.js", "doc_id": "f0d1774f7adb4324a70eb73c781eb507", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1496, "chunk_index": 14, "_doc_id": "14_7768966974828748254"}}
{"doc_id": "15_8100999396790678586", "text": "{<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> opacity<span><span>: <span><span>0<span><span>;<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span><code><pre><div><h3 id=\"css-transitions\">CSS 的 transition <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#css-transitions\">​<a><h3><p><code><Transition><code> 一般都会搭配<a href=\"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/CSS/CSS_Transitions/Using_CSS_transitions\" target=\"_blank\">原生 CSS 过渡<a>一起使用，正如你在上面的例子中所看到的那样。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/transition.html", "title": "Transition | Vue.js", "doc_id": "f0d1774f7adb4324a70eb73c781eb507", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1496, "chunk_index": 15, "_doc_id": "15_8100999396790678586"}}
{"doc_id": "16_3982018251442493759", "text": "cs/Web/CSS/CSS_Transitions/Using_CSS_transitions\" target=\"_blank\">原生 CSS 过渡<a>一起使用，正如你在上面的例子中所看到的那样。这个 <code>transition<code> CSS 属性是一个简写形式，使我们可以一次定义一个过渡的各个方面，包括需要执行动画的属性、持续时间和<a href=\"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/CSS/easing-function\" target=\"_blank\">速度曲线<a>。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/transition.html", "title": "Transition | Vue.js", "doc_id": "f0d1774f7adb4324a70eb73c781eb507", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1496, "chunk_index": 16, "_doc_id": "16_3982018251442493759"}}
{"doc_id": "17_879769564371021801", "text": "和<a href=\"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/CSS/easing-function\" target=\"_blank\">速度曲线<a>。<p><p>下面是一个更高级的例子，它使用了不同的持续时间和速度曲线来过渡多个属性：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>Transition<span><span> name<span><span>=<span><span>\"slide-fade\"<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/transition.html", "title": "Transition | Vue.js", "doc_id": "f0d1774f7adb4324a70eb73c781eb507", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1496, "chunk_index": 17, "_doc_id": "17_879769564371021801"}}
{"doc_id": "18_4982099243294632273", "text": "pan><span>Transition<span><span> name<span><span>=<span><span>\"slide-fade\"<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>p<span><span> v-if<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>show<span><span>\"<span><span>>hello</<span><span>p<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>Transition<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><div class=\"language-css\"> <span class=\"lang\">css<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>/*<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/transition.html", "title": "Transition | Vue.js", "doc_id": "f0d1774f7adb4324a70eb73c781eb507", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1496, "chunk_index": 18, "_doc_id": "18_4982099243294632273"}}
{"doc_id": "19_6941440197094911466", "text": "lang\">css<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>/*<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> 进入和离开动画可以使用不同<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> 持续时间和速度曲线。<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>*/<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>.slide-fade-enter-active<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> transition<span><span>: <span><span>all<span><span> 0.3<span><span>s<span><span> ease-out<span><span>;<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/transition.html", "title": "Transition | Vue.js", "doc_id": "f0d1774f7adb4324a70eb73c781eb507", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1496, "chunk_index": 19, "_doc_id": "19_6941440197094911466"}}
{"doc_id": "20_5718532518635320734", "text": "3<span><span>s<span><span> ease-out<span><span>;<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>.slide-fade-leave-active<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> transition<span><span>: <span><span>all<span><span> 0.8<span><span>s<span><span> cubic-bezier<span><span>(<span><span>1<span><span>, <span><span>0.5<span><span>, <span><span>0.8<span><span>, <span><span>1<span><span>);<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/transition.html", "title": "Transition | Vue.js", "doc_id": "f0d1774f7adb4324a70eb73c781eb507", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1496, "chunk_index": 20, "_doc_id": "20_5718532518635320734"}}
{"doc_id": "21_3551732625177024532", "text": "pan>0.8<span><span>, <span><span>1<span><span>);<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>.slide-fade-enter-from<span><span>,<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>.slide-fade-leave-to<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> transform<span><span>: <span><span>translateX<span><span>(<span><span>20<span><span>px<span><span>);<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> opacity<span><span>: <span><span>0<span><span>;<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/transition.html", "title": "Transition | Vue.js", "doc_id": "f0d1774f7adb4324a70eb73c781eb507", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1496, "chunk_index": 21, "_doc_id": "21_3551732625177024532"}}
{"doc_id": "22_5154326489638797419", "text": ";<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> opacity<span><span>: <span><span>0<span><span>;<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span><code><pre><div><h3 id=\"css-animations\">CSS 的 animation <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#css-animations\">​<a><h3><p><a href=\"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/CSS/CSS_Animations/Using_CSS_animations\" target=\"_blank\">原生 CSS 动画<a>和 CSS transition 的应用方式基本上是相同的，只有一点不同，那就是 <code>*-enter-from<code> 不是在元素插入后立即移除，而是在一个 <code>animationend<code> 事件触发时被移除。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/transition.html", "title": "Transition | Vue.js", "doc_id": "f0d1774f7adb4324a70eb73c781eb507", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1496, "chunk_index": 22, "_doc_id": "22_5154326489638797419"}}
{"doc_id": "23_1793566606025405735", "text": "用方式基本上是相同的，只有一点不同，那就是 <code>*-enter-from<code> 不是在元素插入后立即移除，而是在一个 <code>animationend<code> 事件触发时被移除。<p><p>对于大多数的 CSS 动画，我们可以简单地在 <code>*-enter-active<code> 和 <code>*-leave-active<code> class 下声明它们。下面是一个示例：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>Transition<span><span> name<span><span>=<span><span>\"bounce\"<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/transition.html", "title": "Transition | Vue.js", "doc_id": "f0d1774f7adb4324a70eb73c781eb507", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1496, "chunk_index": 23, "_doc_id": "23_1793566606025405735"}}
{"doc_id": "24_7337011950338925813", "text": "><<span><span>Transition<span><span> name<span><span>=<span><span>\"bounce\"<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>p<span><span> v-if<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>show<span><span>\"<span><span> style<span><span>=<span><span>\"text-align: center;\"<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> Hello here is some bouncy text!<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> </<span><span>p<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/transition.html", "title": "Transition | Vue.js", "doc_id": "f0d1774f7adb4324a70eb73c781eb507", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1496, "chunk_index": 24, "_doc_id": "24_7337011950338925813"}}
{"doc_id": "25_627988197131856419", "text": "is some bouncy text!<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> </<span><span>p<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>Transition<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><div class=\"language-css\"> <span class=\"lang\">css<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>.bounce-enter-active<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> animation<span><span>: bounce-in <span><span>0.5<span><span>s<span><span>;<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/transition.html", "title": "Transition | Vue.js", "doc_id": "f0d1774f7adb4324a70eb73c781eb507", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1496, "chunk_index": 25, "_doc_id": "25_627988197131856419"}}
{"doc_id": "26_4893921542749193444", "text": "line\"><span> animation<span><span>: bounce-in <span><span>0.5<span><span>s<span><span>;<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>.bounce-leave-active<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> animation<span><span>: bounce-in <span><span>0.5<span><span>s<span><span> reverse<span><span>;<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>@keyframes<span><span> bounce-in<span><span> {<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/transition.html", "title": "Transition | Vue.js", "doc_id": "f0d1774f7adb4324a70eb73c781eb507", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1496, "chunk_index": 26, "_doc_id": "26_4893921542749193444"}}
{"doc_id": "27_8303599777005647929", "text": "n>}<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>@keyframes<span><span> bounce-in<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> 0%<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> transform<span><span>: <span><span>scale<span><span>(<span><span>0<span><span>);<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> 50%<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> transform<span><span>: <span><span>scale<span><span>(<span><span>1.25<span><span>);<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/transition.html", "title": "Transition | Vue.js", "doc_id": "f0d1774f7adb4324a70eb73c781eb507", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1496, "chunk_index": 27, "_doc_id": "27_8303599777005647929"}}
{"doc_id": "28_5297768019859005799", "text": "an> transform<span><span>: <span><span>scale<span><span>(<span><span>1.25<span><span>);<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> 100%<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> transform<span><span>: <span><span>scale<span><span>(<span><span>1<span><span>);<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span><code><pre><div><div class=\"demo\"> Toggle <p> Hello here is some bouncy text!", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/transition.html", "title": "Transition | Vue.js", "doc_id": "f0d1774f7adb4324a70eb73c781eb507", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1496, "chunk_index": 28, "_doc_id": "28_5297768019859005799"}}
{"doc_id": "29_452228200065062920", "text": "e\"><span>}<span><span><code><pre><div><div class=\"demo\"> Toggle <p> Hello here is some bouncy text! <p><div><h3 id=\"custom-transition-classes\">自定义过渡 class <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#custom-transition-classes\">​<a><h3><p>你也可以向 <code><Transition><code> 传递以下的 props 来指定自定义的过渡 class：<p><ul><li><code>enter-from-class<code><li><li><code>enter-active-class<code><li><li><code>enter-to-class<code><li><li><code>leave-from-class<code><li><li><code>leave-active-class<code><li><li><code>leave-to-class<code><li><ul><p>你传入的这些 class 会覆盖相应阶段的默认 class 名。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/transition.html", "title": "Transition | Vue.js", "doc_id": "f0d1774f7adb4324a70eb73c781eb507", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1496, "chunk_index": 29, "_doc_id": "29_452228200065062920"}}
{"doc_id": "30_1325635383846361411", "text": "eave-active-class<code><li><li><code>leave-to-class<code><li><ul><p>你传入的这些 class 会覆盖相应阶段的默认 class 名。这个功能在你想要在 Vue 的动画机制下集成其他的第三方 CSS 动画库时非常有用，比如 <a href=\"https://daneden.github.io/animate.css/\" target=\"_blank\">Animate.css<a>：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><!-- 假设你已经在页面中引入了 Animate.css --><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>Transition<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/transition.html", "title": "Transition | Vue.js", "doc_id": "f0d1774f7adb4324a70eb73c781eb507", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1496, "chunk_index": 30, "_doc_id": "30_1325635383846361411"}}
{"doc_id": "31_7361464434484588573", "text": "你已经在页面中引入了 Animate.css --><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>Transition<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> name<span><span>=<span><span>\"custom-classes\"<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> enter-active-class<span><span>=<span><span>\"animate__animated animate__tada\"<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> leave-active-class<span><span>=<span><span>\"animate__animated animate__bounceOutRight\"<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/transition.html", "title": "Transition | Vue.js", "doc_id": "f0d1774f7adb4324a70eb73c781eb507", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1496, "chunk_index": 31, "_doc_id": "31_7361464434484588573"}}
{"doc_id": "32_6938974746561698417", "text": "span>\"animate__animated animate__bounceOutRight\"<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>p<span><span> v-if<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>show<span><span>\"<span><span>>hello</<span><span>p<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/transition.html", "title": "Transition | Vue.js", "doc_id": "f0d1774f7adb4324a70eb73c781eb507", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1496, "chunk_index": 32, "_doc_id": "32_6938974746561698417"}}
{"doc_id": "33_7702468078696166829", "text": "span><span>\"<span><span>show<span><span>\"<span><span>>hello</<span><span>p<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>Transition<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><h3 id=\"using-transitions-and-animations-together\">同时使用 transition 和 animation <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#using-transitions-and-animations-together\">​<a><h3><p>Vue 需要附加事件监听器，以便知道过渡何时结束。可以是 <code>transitionend<code> 或 <code>animationend<code>，这取决于你所应用的 CSS 规则。如果你仅仅使用二者的其中之一，Vue 可以自动探测到正确的类型。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/transition.html", "title": "Transition | Vue.js", "doc_id": "f0d1774f7adb4324a70eb73c781eb507", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1496, "chunk_index": 33, "_doc_id": "33_7702468078696166829"}}
{"doc_id": "34_479159171458494971", "text": "ode>transitionend<code> 或 <code>animationend<code>，这取决于你所应用的 CSS 规则。如果你仅仅使用二者的其中之一，Vue 可以自动探测到正确的类型。<p><p>然而在某些场景中，你或许想要在同一个元素上同时使用它们两个。举例来说，Vue 触发了一个 CSS 动画，同时鼠标悬停触发另一个 CSS 过渡。此时你需要显式地传入 <code>type<code> prop 来声明，告诉 Vue 需要关心哪种类型，传入的值是 <code>animation<code> 或 <code>transition<code>：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>Transition<span><span> type<span><span>=<span><span>\"animation\"<span><span>>..", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/transition.html", "title": "Transition | Vue.js", "doc_id": "f0d1774f7adb4324a70eb73c781eb507", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1496, "chunk_index": 34, "_doc_id": "34_479159171458494971"}}
{"doc_id": "35_6701089490036599690", "text": "e\"><span><<span><span>Transition<span><span> type<span><span>=<span><span>\"animation\"<span><span>>...</<span><span>Transition<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><h3 id=\"nested-transitions-and-explicit-transition-durations\">深层级过渡与显式过渡时长 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#nested-transitions-and-explicit-transition-durations\">​<a><h3><p>尽管过渡 class 仅能应用在 <code><Transition><code> 的直接子元素上，我们还是可以使用深层级的 CSS 选择器，", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/transition.html", "title": "Transition | Vue.js", "doc_id": "f0d1774f7adb4324a70eb73c781eb507", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1496, "chunk_index": 35, "_doc_id": "35_6701089490036599690"}}
{"doc_id": "36_3573072055035230494", "text": "sition-durations\">​<a><h3><p>尽管过渡 class 仅能应用在 <code><Transition><code> 的直接子元素上，我们还是可以使用深层级的 CSS 选择器，在深层级的元素上触发过渡效果：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>Transition<span><span> name<span><span>=<span><span>\"nested\"<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/transition.html", "title": "Transition | Vue.js", "doc_id": "f0d1774f7adb4324a70eb73c781eb507", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1496, "chunk_index": 36, "_doc_id": "36_3573072055035230494"}}
{"doc_id": "37_6757668644498075124", "text": "><<span><span>Transition<span><span> name<span><span>=<span><span>\"nested\"<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>div<span><span> v-if<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>show<span><span>\"<span><span> class<span><span>=<span><span>\"outer\"<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>div<span><span> class<span><span>=<span><span>\"inner\"<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> Hello<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/transition.html", "title": "Transition | Vue.js", "doc_id": "f0d1774f7adb4324a70eb73c781eb507", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1496, "chunk_index": 37, "_doc_id": "37_6757668644498075124"}}
{"doc_id": "38_3166388456849004133", "text": "pan><span>=<span><span>\"inner\"<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> Hello<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> </<span><span>div<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> </<span><span>div<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>Transition<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><div class=\"language-css\"> <span class=\"lang\">css<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>/* 应用于嵌套元素的规则 */<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/transition.html", "title": "Transition | Vue.js", "doc_id": "f0d1774f7adb4324a70eb73c781eb507", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1496, "chunk_index": 38, "_doc_id": "38_3166388456849004133"}}
{"doc_id": "39_6672908835206104437", "text": "><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>/* 应用于嵌套元素的规则 */<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>.nested-enter-active<span><span> .inner<span><span>,<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>.nested-leave-active<span><span> .inner<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> transition<span><span>: <span><span>all<span><span> 0.3<span><span>s<span><span> ease-in-out<span><span>;<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/transition.html", "title": "Transition | Vue.js", "doc_id": "f0d1774f7adb4324a70eb73c781eb507", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1496, "chunk_index": 39, "_doc_id": "39_6672908835206104437"}}
{"doc_id": "40_8556398391727901966", "text": "se-in-out<span><span>;<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>.nested-enter-from<span><span> .inner<span><span>,<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>.nested-leave-to<span><span> .inner<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> transform<span><span>: <span><span>translateX<span><span>(<span><span>30<span><span>px<span><span>);<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> opacity<span><span>: <span><span>0<span><span>;<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/transition.html", "title": "Transition | Vue.js", "doc_id": "f0d1774f7adb4324a70eb73c781eb507", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1496, "chunk_index": 40, "_doc_id": "40_8556398391727901966"}}
{"doc_id": "41_7345047624238228354", "text": ";<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> opacity<span><span>: <span><span>0<span><span>;<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>/* ... 省略了其他必要的 CSS */<span><span><code><pre><div><p>我们甚至可以在深层元素上添加一个过渡延迟，从而创建一个带渐进延迟的动画序列：<p><div class=\"language-css\"> <span class=\"lang\">css<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>/* 延迟嵌套元素的进入以获得交错效果 */<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/transition.html", "title": "Transition | Vue.js", "doc_id": "f0d1774f7adb4324a70eb73c781eb507", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1496, "chunk_index": 41, "_doc_id": "41_7345047624238228354"}}
{"doc_id": "42_2109631079413702662", "text": "class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>/* 延迟嵌套元素的进入以获得交错效果 */<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>.nested-enter-active<span><span> .inner<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line highlighted\"><span> transition-delay<span><span>: <span><span>0.25<span><span>s<span><span>;<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span><code><pre><div><p>然而，这会带来一个小问题。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/transition.html", "title": "Transition | Vue.js", "doc_id": "f0d1774f7adb4324a70eb73c781eb507", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1496, "chunk_index": 42, "_doc_id": "42_2109631079413702662"}}
{"doc_id": "43_2574492564678331412", "text": "an>s<span><span>;<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span><code><pre><div><p>然而，这会带来一个小问题。默认情况下，<code><Transition><code> 组件会通过监听过渡根元素上的<strong>第一个<strong> <code>transitionend<code> 或者 <code>animationend<code> 事件来尝试自动判断过渡何时结束。而在嵌套的过渡中，期望的行为应该是等待所有内部元素的过渡完成。<p><p>在这种情况下，你可以通过向 <code><Transition><code> 组件传入 <code>duration<code> prop 来显式指定过渡的持续时间 (以毫秒为单位)。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/transition.html", "title": "Transition | Vue.js", "doc_id": "f0d1774f7adb4324a70eb73c781eb507", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1496, "chunk_index": 43, "_doc_id": "43_2574492564678331412"}}
{"doc_id": "44_8839576733860042666", "text": "成。<p><p>在这种情况下，你可以通过向 <code><Transition><code> 组件传入 <code>duration<code> prop 来显式指定过渡的持续时间 (以毫秒为单位)。总持续时间应该匹配延迟加上内部元素的过渡持续时间：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>Transition<span><span> :<span><span>duration<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>550<span><span>\"<span><span>>...</<span><span>Transition<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p><a href=\"https://play.vuejs.org/#eNqVVd9v0zAQ/leO8LAfr", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/transition.html", "title": "Transition | Vue.js", "doc_id": "f0d1774f7adb4324a70eb73c781eb507", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1496, "chunk_index": 44, "_doc_id": "44_8839576733860042666"}}
{"doc_id": "45_2482366750268952531", "text": "on<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p><a href=\"https://play.vuejs.org/#", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/transition.html", "title": "Transition | Vue.js", "doc_id": "f0d1774f7adb4324a70eb73c781eb507", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1496, "chunk_index": 45, "_doc_id": "45_2482366750268952531"}}
{"doc_id": "46_8581649663999166871", "text": "", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/transition.html", "title": "Transition | Vue.js", "doc_id": "f0d1774f7adb4324a70eb73c781eb507", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1496, "chunk_index": 46, "_doc_id": "46_8581649663999166871"}}
{"doc_id": "47_551354260470909958", "text": "VhiEVJ7GftHZTganUZ56EYLL3FykjhL195MlMM7qxXdmEGDPOG6boRE86UJVPMki+p4H01WLz4Fm78hSdBo5xXy+yfsd3bpbXny1SA1M8c82fgcMyW66L75/hmXtN44a120ktDPOL+h1bL1HCPsA42DaPdwge3HcO/TOCb2ZumQJtA15Yl65Crg84S+BdfPtL6lezY8C3GkZ7L6Bc1zNR0=\" target=\"_blank\">在演练场中尝试一下<a><p><p>如果有必要的话，你也可以用对象的形式传入，", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/transition.html", "title": "Transition | Vue.js", "doc_id": "f0d1774f7adb4324a70eb73c781eb507", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1496, "chunk_index": 47, "_doc_id": "47_551354260470909958"}}
{"doc_id": "48_8973442325270134574", "text": "tA15Yl65Crg84S+BdfPtL6lezY8C3GkZ7L6Bc1zNR0=\" target=\"_blank\">在演练场中尝试一下<a><p><p>如果有必要的话，你也可以用对象的形式传入，分开指定进入和离开所需的时间：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>Transition<span><span> :<span><span>duration<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>{ enter: <span><span>500<span><span>,", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/transition.html", "title": "Transition | Vue.js", "doc_id": "f0d1774f7adb4324a70eb73c781eb507", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1496, "chunk_index": 48, "_doc_id": "48_8973442325270134574"}}
{"doc_id": "49_528348088976463451", "text": "n> :<span><span>duration<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>{ enter: <span><span>500<span><span>, leave: <span><span>800<span><span> }<span><span>\"<span><span>>...</<span><span>Transition<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><h3 id=\"performance-considerations\">性能考量 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#performance-considerations\">​<a><h3><p>你可能注意到我们上面例子中展示的动画所用到的 CSS 属性大多是 <code>transform<code> 和 <code>opacity<code> 之类的。用这些属性制作动画非常高效，因为：<p><ol><li><p>他们在动画过程中不会影响到 DOM 结构，因此不会每一帧都触发昂贵的 CSS 布局重新计算。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/transition.html", "title": "Transition | Vue.js", "doc_id": "f0d1774f7adb4324a70eb73c781eb507", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1496, "chunk_index": 49, "_doc_id": "49_528348088976463451"}}
{"doc_id": "50_9034906497311894044", "text": "code>opacity<code> 之类的。用这些属性制作动画非常高效，因为：<p><ol><li><p>他们在动画过程中不会影响到 DOM 结构，因此不会每一帧都触发昂贵的 CSS 布局重新计算。<p><li><li><p>大多数的现代浏览器都可以在执行 <code>transform<code> 动画时利用 GPU 进行硬件加速。<p><li><ol><p>相比之下，像 <code>height<code> 或者 <code>margin<code> 这样的属性会触发 CSS 布局变动，因此执行它们的动画效果更昂贵，需要谨慎使用。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/transition.html", "title": "Transition | Vue.js", "doc_id": "f0d1774f7adb4324a70eb73c781eb507", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1496, "chunk_index": 50, "_doc_id": "50_9034906497311894044"}}
{"doc_id": "51_8329313472395862575", "text": "><li><ol><p>相比之下，像 <code>height<code> 或者 <code>margin<code> 这样的属性会触发 CSS 布局变动，因此执行它们的动画效果更昂贵，需要谨慎使用。<p><h2 id=\"javascript-hooks\">JavaScript 钩子 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#javascript-hooks\">​<a><h2><p>你可以通过监听 <code><Transition><code> 组件事件的方式在过渡过程中挂上钩子函数：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>Transition<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/transition.html", "title": "Transition | Vue.js", "doc_id": "f0d1774f7adb4324a70eb73c781eb507", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1496, "chunk_index": 51, "_doc_id": "51_8329313472395862575"}}
{"doc_id": "52_380478850216114742", "text": "lass=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>Transition<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> @<span><span>before-enter<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>onBeforeEnter<span><span>\"<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> @<span><span>enter<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>onEnter<span><span>\"<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> @<span><span>after-enter<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>onAfterEnter<span><span>\"<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/transition.html", "title": "Transition | Vue.js", "doc_id": "f0d1774f7adb4324a70eb73c781eb507", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1496, "chunk_index": 52, "_doc_id": "52_380478850216114742"}}
{"doc_id": "53_3198307764226648086", "text": "@<span><span>after-enter<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>onAfterEnter<span><span>\"<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> @<span><span>enter-cancelled<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>onEnterCancelled<span><span>\"<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> @<span><span>before-leave<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>onBeforeLeave<span><span>\"<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> @<span><span>leave<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>onLeave<span><span>\"<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/transition.html", "title": "Transition | Vue.js", "doc_id": "f0d1774f7adb4324a70eb73c781eb507", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1496, "chunk_index": 53, "_doc_id": "53_3198307764226648086"}}
{"doc_id": "54_2035870883246565603", "text": "ne\"><span> @<span><span>leave<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>onLeave<span><span>\"<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> @<span><span>after-leave<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>onAfterLeave<span><span>\"<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> @<span><span>leave-cancelled<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>onLeaveCancelled<span><span>\"<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <!-- ... --><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/transition.html", "title": "Transition | Vue.js", "doc_id": "f0d1774f7adb4324a70eb73c781eb507", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1496, "chunk_index": 54, "_doc_id": "54_2035870883246565603"}}
{"doc_id": "55_2643819430073256573", "text": "an><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <!-- ... --><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>Transition<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><div class=\"composition-api\"><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// 在元素被插入到 DOM 之前被调用<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 用这个来设置元素的 \"enter-from\" 状态<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/transition.html", "title": "Transition | Vue.js", "doc_id": "f0d1774f7adb4324a70eb73c781eb507", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1496, "chunk_index": 55, "_doc_id": "55_2643819430073256573"}}
{"doc_id": "56_3630484507886500990", "text": ">// 在元素被插入到 DOM 之前被调用<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 用这个来设置元素的 \"enter-from\" 状态<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>function<span><span> onBeforeEnter<span><span>(<span><span>el<span><span>) {}<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 在元素被插入到 DOM 之后的下一帧被调用<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 用这个来开始进入动画<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>function<span><span> onEnter<span><span>(<span><span>el<span><span>, <span><span>done<span><span>) {<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/transition.html", "title": "Transition | Vue.js", "doc_id": "f0d1774f7adb4324a70eb73c781eb507", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1496, "chunk_index": 56, "_doc_id": "56_3630484507886500990"}}
{"doc_id": "57_1053555267352795560", "text": "><span> onEnter<span><span>(<span><span>el<span><span>, <span><span>done<span><span>) {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 调用回调函数 done 表示过渡结束<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 如果与 CSS 结合使用，则这个回调是可选参数<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> done<span><span>()<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 当进入过渡完成时调用。<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/transition.html", "title": "Transition | Vue.js", "doc_id": "f0d1774f7adb4324a70eb73c781eb507", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1496, "chunk_index": 57, "_doc_id": "57_1053555267352795560"}}
{"doc_id": "58_5713755735495725366", "text": "\"><span>}<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 当进入过渡完成时调用。<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>function<span><span> onAfterEnter<span><span>(<span><span>el<span><span>) {}<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 当进入过渡在完成之前被取消时调用<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>function<span><span> onEnterCancelled<span><span>(<span><span>el<span><span>) {}<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 在 leave 钩子之前调用<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/transition.html", "title": "Transition | Vue.js", "doc_id": "f0d1774f7adb4324a70eb73c781eb507", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1496, "chunk_index": 58, "_doc_id": "58_5713755735495725366"}}
{"doc_id": "59_96515083574357661", "text": "n>) {}<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 在 leave 钩子之前调用<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 大多数时候，你应该只会用到 leave 钩子<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>function<span><span> onBeforeLeave<span><span>(<span><span>el<span><span>) {}<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 在离开过渡开始时调用<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 用这个来开始离开动画<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/transition.html", "title": "Transition | Vue.js", "doc_id": "f0d1774f7adb4324a70eb73c781eb507", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1496, "chunk_index": 59, "_doc_id": "59_96515083574357661"}}
{"doc_id": "60_9043737715221652740", "text": "pan class=\"line\"><span>// 在离开过渡开始时调用<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 用这个来开始离开动画<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>function<span><span> onLeave<span><span>(<span><span>el<span><span>, <span><span>done<span><span>) {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 调用回调函数 done 表示过渡结束<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 如果与 CSS 结合使用，则这个回调是可选参数<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> done<span><span>()<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/transition.html", "title": "Transition | Vue.js", "doc_id": "f0d1774f7adb4324a70eb73c781eb507", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1496, "chunk_index": 60, "_doc_id": "60_9043737715221652740"}}
{"doc_id": "61_4231121452451364329", "text": "an> done<span><span>()<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 在离开过渡完成、<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 且元素已从 DOM 中移除时调用<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>function<span><span> onAfterLeave<span><span>(<span><span>el<span><span>) {}<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 仅在 v-show 过渡中可用<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/transition.html", "title": "Transition | Vue.js", "doc_id": "f0d1774f7adb4324a70eb73c781eb507", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1496, "chunk_index": 61, "_doc_id": "61_4231121452451364329"}}
{"doc_id": "62_7198170761551146413", "text": ">) {}<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 仅在 v-show 过渡中可用<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>function<span><span> onLeaveCancelled<span><span>(<span><span>el<span><span>) {}<span><span><code><pre><div><div><div class=\"options-api\"><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // ...<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/transition.html", "title": "Transition | Vue.js", "doc_id": "f0d1774f7adb4324a70eb73c781eb507", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1496, "chunk_index": 62, "_doc_id": "62_7198170761551146413"}}
{"doc_id": "63_649695462185701123", "text": "n>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // ...<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> methods: {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 在元素被插入到 DOM 之前被调用<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 用这个来设置元素的 \"enter-from\" 状态<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> onBeforeEnter<span><span>(<span><span>el<span><span>) {},<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 在元素被插入到 DOM 之后的下一帧被调用<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 用这个来开始进入动画<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/transition.html", "title": "Transition | Vue.js", "doc_id": "f0d1774f7adb4324a70eb73c781eb507", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1496, "chunk_index": 63, "_doc_id": "63_649695462185701123"}}
{"doc_id": "64_1256747520024349801", "text": "ne\"><span> // 在元素被插入到 DOM 之后的下一帧被调用<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 用这个来开始进入动画<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> onEnter<span><span>(<span><span>el<span><span>, <span><span>done<span><span>) {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 调用回调函数 done 表示过渡结束<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 如果与 CSS 结合使用，则这个回调是可选参数<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> done<span><span>()<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> },<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/transition.html", "title": "Transition | Vue.js", "doc_id": "f0d1774f7adb4324a70eb73c781eb507", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1496, "chunk_index": 64, "_doc_id": "64_1256747520024349801"}}
{"doc_id": "65_2219497949010599797", "text": "> done<span><span>()<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> },<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 当进入过渡完成时调用。<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> onAfterEnter<span><span>(<span><span>el<span><span>) {},<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 当进入过渡在完成之前被取消时调用<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> onEnterCancelled<span><span>(<span><span>el<span><span>) {},<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/transition.html", "title": "Transition | Vue.js", "doc_id": "f0d1774f7adb4324a70eb73c781eb507", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1496, "chunk_index": 65, "_doc_id": "65_2219497949010599797"}}
{"doc_id": "66_5012233691114779506", "text": "onEnterCancelled<span><span>(<span><span>el<span><span>) {},<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 在 leave 钩子之前调用<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 大多数时候，你应该只会用到 leave 钩子<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> onBeforeLeave<span><span>(<span><span>el<span><span>) {},<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 在离开过渡开始时调用<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 用这个来开始离开动画<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/transition.html", "title": "Transition | Vue.js", "doc_id": "f0d1774f7adb4324a70eb73c781eb507", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1496, "chunk_index": 66, "_doc_id": "66_5012233691114779506"}}
{"doc_id": "67_7553999889044161850", "text": "n class=\"line\"><span> // 在离开过渡开始时调用<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 用这个来开始离开动画<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> onLeave<span><span>(<span><span>el<span><span>, <span><span>done<span><span>) {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 调用回调函数 done 表示过渡结束<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 如果与 CSS 结合使用，则这个回调是可选参数<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> done<span><span>()<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> },<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/transition.html", "title": "Transition | Vue.js", "doc_id": "f0d1774f7adb4324a70eb73c781eb507", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1496, "chunk_index": 67, "_doc_id": "67_7553999889044161850"}}
{"doc_id": "68_276330940044829109", "text": "> done<span><span>()<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> },<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 在离开过渡完成、<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 且元素已从 DOM 中移除时调用<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> onAfterLeave<span><span>(<span><span>el<span><span>) {},<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 仅在 v-show 过渡中可用<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> onLeaveCancelled<span><span>(<span><span>el<span><span>) {}<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/transition.html", "title": "Transition | Vue.js", "doc_id": "f0d1774f7adb4324a70eb73c781eb507", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1496, "chunk_index": 68, "_doc_id": "68_276330940044829109"}}
{"doc_id": "69_2683745487046540999", "text": ">\n<span class=\"line\"><span> onLeaveCancelled<span><span>(<span><span>el<span><span>) {}<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/transition.html", "title": "Transition | Vue.js", "doc_id": "f0d1774f7adb4324a70eb73c781eb507", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1496, "chunk_index": 69, "_doc_id": "69_2683745487046540999"}}
{"doc_id": "70_6856853347986226359", "text": "lled<span><span>(<span><span>el<span><span>) {}<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span><code><pre><div><div><p>这些钩子可以与 CSS 过渡或动画结合使用，也可以单独使用。<p><p>在使用仅由 JavaScript 执行的动画时，最好是添加一个 <code>:css=\"false\"<code> prop。这显式地向 Vue 表明可以跳过对 CSS 过渡的自动探测。除了性能稍好一些之外，还可以防止 CSS 规则意外地干扰过渡效果：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>Transition<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/transition.html", "title": "Transition | Vue.js", "doc_id": "f0d1774f7adb4324a70eb73c781eb507", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1496, "chunk_index": 70, "_doc_id": "70_6856853347986226359"}}
{"doc_id": "71_1911640603527884413", "text": "lass=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>Transition<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> ...<span><span>\n<span class=\"line highlighted\"><span> :<span><span>css<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>false<span><span>\"<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> ...<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>Transition<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>在有了 <code>:css=\"false\"<code> 后，我们就自己全权负责控制什么时候过渡结束了。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/transition.html", "title": "Transition | Vue.js", "doc_id": "f0d1774f7adb4324a70eb73c781eb507", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1496, "chunk_index": 71, "_doc_id": "71_1911640603527884413"}}
{"doc_id": "72_4754013406803684594", "text": "tion<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>在有了 <code>:css=\"false\"<code> 后，我们就自己全权负责控制什么时候过渡结束了。这种情况下对于 <code>@enter<code> 和 <code>@leave<code> 钩子来说，回调函数 <code>done<code> 就是必须的。否则，钩子将被同步调用，过渡将立即完成。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/transition.html", "title": "Transition | Vue.js", "doc_id": "f0d1774f7adb4324a70eb73c781eb507", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1496, "chunk_index": 72, "_doc_id": "72_4754013406803684594"}}
{"doc_id": "73_3553428350490270845", "text": "种情况下对于 <code>@enter<code> 和 <code>@leave<code> 钩子来说，回调函数 <code>done<code> 就是必须的。否则，钩子将被同步调用，过渡将立即完成。<p><p>这里是使用 <a href=\"https://gsap.com/\" target=\"_blank\">GSAP 库<a>执行动画的一个示例，你也可以使用任何你想要的库，比如 <a href=\"https://animejs.com/\" target=\"_blank\">Anime.js<a> 或者 <a href=\"https://motion.dev/\" target=\"_blank\">Motion One<a>：<p><h2 id=\"reusable-transitions\">可复用过渡效果 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#reusable-transitions\">​<a><h2><p>得益于 Vue 的组件系统，过渡效果是可以被封装复用的。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/transition.html", "title": "Transition | Vue.js", "doc_id": "f0d1774f7adb4324a70eb73c781eb507", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1496, "chunk_index": 73, "_doc_id": "73_3553428350490270845"}}
{"doc_id": "74_5077162381111389146", "text": "复用过渡效果 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#reusable-transitions\">​<a><h2><p>得益于 Vue 的组件系统，过渡效果是可以被封装复用的。要创建一个可被复用的过渡，我们需要为 <code><Transition><code> 组件创建一个包装组件，并向内传入插槽内容：<p><div class=\"vp-code-block-title\"><p class=\"vp-code-block-title-bar\"><span class=\"vp-code-block-title-text\">MyTransition.vue<span><p><div class=\"language-vue\"> <span class=\"lang\">vue<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>script<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/transition.html", "title": "Transition | Vue.js", "doc_id": "f0d1774f7adb4324a70eb73c781eb507", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1496, "chunk_index": 74, "_doc_id": "74_5077162381111389146"}}
{"doc_id": "75_3478190894920111019", "text": "ki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>script<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// JavaScript 钩子逻辑...<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>script<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line highlighted\"><span> <!-- 包装内置的 Transition 组件 --><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>Transition<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/transition.html", "title": "Transition | Vue.js", "doc_id": "f0d1774f7adb4324a70eb73c781eb507", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1496, "chunk_index": 75, "_doc_id": "75_3478190894920111019"}}
{"doc_id": "76_6387094583025086564", "text": "- 包装内置的 Transition 组件 --><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>Transition<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> name<span><span>=<span><span>\"my-transition\"<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> @enter<span><span>=<span><span>\"onEnter\"<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> @leave<span><span>=<span><span>\"onLeave\"<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>slot<span><span>></<span><span>slot<span><span>> <span><span><!-- 向内传递插槽内容 --><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/transition.html", "title": "Transition | Vue.js", "doc_id": "f0d1774f7adb4324a70eb73c781eb507", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1496, "chunk_index": 76, "_doc_id": "76_6387094583025086564"}}
{"doc_id": "77_3820839984234778715", "text": "an><span>slot<span><span>></<span><span>slot<span><span>> <span><span><!-- 向内传递插槽内容 --><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> </<span><span>Transition<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>style<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>/*<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> 必要的 CSS...<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> 注意：避免在这里使用 <style scoped><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/transition.html", "title": "Transition | Vue.js", "doc_id": "f0d1774f7adb4324a70eb73c781eb507", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1496, "chunk_index": 77, "_doc_id": "77_3820839984234778715"}}
{"doc_id": "78_7674713318088926894", "text": "line\"><span> 必要的 CSS...<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> 注意：避免在这里使用 <style scoped><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> 因为那不会应用到插槽内容上<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>*/<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/transition.html", "title": "Transition | Vue.js", "doc_id": "f0d1774f7adb4324a70eb73c781eb507", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1496, "chunk_index": 78, "_doc_id": "78_7674713318088926894"}}
{"doc_id": "79_4177182494649088755", "text": "><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> 因为那不会应用到插槽内容上<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>*/<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>style<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><div><p>现在 <code>MyTransition<code> 可以在导入后像内置组件那样使用了：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>MyTransition<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/transition.html", "title": "Transition | Vue.js", "doc_id": "f0d1774f7adb4324a70eb73c781eb507", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1496, "chunk_index": 79, "_doc_id": "79_4177182494649088755"}}
{"doc_id": "80_8251730226580289699", "text": "hub-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>MyTransition<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>div<span><span> v-if<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>show<span><span>\"<span><span>>Hello</<span><span>div<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/transition.html", "title": "Transition | Vue.js", "doc_id": "f0d1774f7adb4324a70eb73c781eb507", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1496, "chunk_index": 80, "_doc_id": "80_8251730226580289699"}}
{"doc_id": "81_9021155498471056870", "text": "an><span>\"<span><span>show<span><span>\"<span><span>>Hello</<span><span>div<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>MyTransition<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><h2 id=\"transition-on-appear\">出现时过渡 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#transition-on-appear\">​<a><h2><p>如果你想在某个节点初次渲染时应用一个过渡效果，你可以添加 <code>appear<code> prop：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>Transition<span><span> appear<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/transition.html", "title": "Transition | Vue.js", "doc_id": "f0d1774f7adb4324a70eb73c781eb507", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1496, "chunk_index": 81, "_doc_id": "81_9021155498471056870"}}
{"doc_id": "82_3018034618132246983", "text": "><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>Transition<span><span> appear<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> ...<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>Transition<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><h2 id=\"transition-between-elements\">元素间过渡 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#transition-between-elements\">​<a><h2><p>除了通过 <code>v-if<code> / <code>v-show<code> 切换一个元素，我们也可以通过 <code>v-if<code> / <code>v-else<code> / <code>v-else-if<code> 在几个组件间进行切换，", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/transition.html", "title": "Transition | Vue.js", "doc_id": "f0d1774f7adb4324a70eb73c781eb507", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1496, "chunk_index": 82, "_doc_id": "82_3018034618132246983"}}
{"doc_id": "83_4102038940510081797", "text": "-show<code> 切换一个元素，我们也可以通过 <code>v-if<code> / <code>v-else<code> / <code>v-else-if<code> 在几个组件间进行切换，只要确保任一时刻只会有一个元素被渲染即可：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>Transition<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/transition.html", "title": "Transition | Vue.js", "doc_id": "f0d1774f7adb4324a70eb73c781eb507", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1496, "chunk_index": 83, "_doc_id": "83_4102038940510081797"}}
{"doc_id": "84_6311032331496635504", "text": "ithub-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>Transition<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>button<span><span> v-if<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>docState <span><span>===<span><span> 'saved'\"<span><span>>Edit</<span><span>button<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/transition.html", "title": "Transition | Vue.js", "doc_id": "f0d1774f7adb4324a70eb73c781eb507", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1496, "chunk_index": 84, "_doc_id": "84_6311032331496635504"}}
{"doc_id": "85_3783855597502818195", "text": "<span><span>===<span><span> 'saved'\"<span><span>>Edit</<span><span>button<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>button<span><span> v-else-if<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>docState <span><span>===<span><span> 'edited'\"<span><span>>Save</<span><span>button<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/transition.html", "title": "Transition | Vue.js", "doc_id": "f0d1774f7adb4324a70eb73c781eb507", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1496, "chunk_index": 85, "_doc_id": "85_3783855597502818195"}}
{"doc_id": "86_4783729213267066455", "text": "<span><span>===<span><span> 'edited'\"<span><span>>Save</<span><span>button<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>button<span><span> v-else-if<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>docState <span><span>===<span><span> 'editing'\"<span><span>>Cancel</<span><span>button<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/transition.html", "title": "Transition | Vue.js", "doc_id": "f0d1774f7adb4324a70eb73c781eb507", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1496, "chunk_index": 86, "_doc_id": "86_4783729213267066455"}}
{"doc_id": "87_4872768282276259771", "text": "an><span>===<span><span> 'editing'\"<span><span>>Cancel</<span><span>button<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>Transition<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><div class=\"demo transition-demo\"><span>Click to cycle through states: <span><p class=\"btn-container\"> Edit <p><div><p><a href=\"https://play.vuejs.org/#eNqdk8tu2zAQRX9loI0SoLLcFN2ostEi6BekmwLa0NTYJkKRBDkSYhj+9wxJO3ZegBGu+Lhz7syQ3Bd/nJtNIxZN0QbplSMISKNbdkYNznqCPXhcwwHW3g5QsrTsTGekNYGgt/KBBCEsouimDGLCvrztTFtnGGN4QTg4zbK4oj", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/transition.html", "title": "Transition | Vue.js", "doc_id": "f0d1774f7adb4324a70eb73c781eb507", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1496, "chunk_index": 87, "_doc_id": "87_4872768282276259771"}}
{"doc_id": "88_8298220698345370691", "text": "", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/transition.html", "title": "Transition | Vue.js", "doc_id": "f0d1774f7adb4324a70eb73c781eb507", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1496, "chunk_index": 88, "_doc_id": "88_8298220698345370691"}}
{"doc_id": "89_3080372862138271291", "text": "PTU6jQEPpKyMj8dnmgkQs+HmQcvVTIQK1hPrv7GQAFt9eO9Bk6fZ8Ub52Qiri8eUo+4dbWD02exh79v/nBP+H2PStnwz/jelJ1geKvk/peHJ4BoRZYow==\" target=\"_blank\">在演练场中尝试一下<a><p><h2 id=\"transition-modes\">过渡模式 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#transition-modes\">​<a><h2><p>在之前的例子中，进入和离开的元素都是在同时开始动画的，因此我们不得不将它们设为 <code>position: absolute<code> 以避免二者同时存在时出现的布局问题。<p><p>然而，很多情况下这可能并不符合需求。我们可能想要先执行离开动画，然后在其完成<strong>之后<strong>再执行元素的进入动画。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/transition.html", "title": "Transition | Vue.js", "doc_id": "f0d1774f7adb4324a70eb73c781eb507", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1496, "chunk_index": 89, "_doc_id": "89_3080372862138271291"}}
{"doc_id": "90_6730047476093643202", "text": "te<code> 以避免二者同时存在时出现的布局问题。<p><p>然而，很多情况下这可能并不符合需求。我们可能想要先执行离开动画，然后在其完成<strong>之后<strong>再执行元素的进入动画。手动编排这样的动画是非常复杂的，好在我们可以通过向 <code><Transition><code> 传入一个 <code>mode<code> prop 来实现这个行为：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>Transition<span><span> mode<span><span>=<span><span>\"out-in\"<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> ...<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/transition.html", "title": "Transition | Vue.js", "doc_id": "f0d1774f7adb4324a70eb73c781eb507", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1496, "chunk_index": 90, "_doc_id": "90_6730047476093643202"}}
{"doc_id": "91_7090846994262791447", "text": "span><span>=<span><span>\"out-in\"<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> ...<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>Transition<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>将之前的例子改为 <code>mode=\"out-in\"<code> 后是这样：<p><div class=\"demo transition-demo\"><span>Click to cycle through states: <span><p class=\"btn-container\"> Edit <p><div><p><code><Transition><code> 也支持 <code>mode=\"in-out\"<code>，虽然这并不常用。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/transition.html", "title": "Transition | Vue.js", "doc_id": "f0d1774f7adb4324a70eb73c781eb507", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1496, "chunk_index": 91, "_doc_id": "91_7090846994262791447"}}
{"doc_id": "92_1347797697686295738", "text": "ass=\"btn-container\"> Edit <p><div><p><code><Transition><code> 也支持 <code>mode=\"in-out\"<code>，虽然这并不常用。<p><h2 id=\"transition-between-components\">组件间过渡 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#transition-between-components\">​<a><h2><p><code><Transition><code> 也可以作用于<a href=\"/guide/essentials/component-basics.", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/transition.html", "title": "Transition | Vue.js", "doc_id": "f0d1774f7adb4324a70eb73c781eb507", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1496, "chunk_index": 92, "_doc_id": "92_1347797697686295738"}}
{"doc_id": "93_7624481364446748869", "text": "n-components\">​<a><h2><p><code><Transition><code> 也可以作用于<a href=\"/guide/essentials/component-basics.html#dynamic-components\">动态组件<a>之间的切换：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>Transition<span><span> name<span><span>=<span><span>\"fade\"<span><span> mode<span><span>=<span><span>\"out-in\"<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/transition.html", "title": "Transition | Vue.js", "doc_id": "f0d1774f7adb4324a70eb73c781eb507", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1496, "chunk_index": 93, "_doc_id": "93_7624481364446748869"}}
{"doc_id": "94_4040794830437958767", "text": "span>=<span><span>\"fade\"<span><span> mode<span><span>=<span><span>\"out-in\"<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>component<span><span> :<span><span>is<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>activeComponent<span><span>\"<span><span>></<span><span>component<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/transition.html", "title": "Transition | Vue.js", "doc_id": "f0d1774f7adb4324a70eb73c781eb507", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1496, "chunk_index": 94, "_doc_id": "94_4040794830437958767"}}
{"doc_id": "95_6529327316203247440", "text": "pan><span>activeComponent<span><span>\"<span><span>></<span><span>component<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>Transition<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><h2 id=\"dynamic-transitions\">动态过渡 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#dynamic-transitions\">​<a><h2><p><code><Transition><code> 的 props (比如 <code>name<code>) 也可以是动态的！", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/transition.html", "title": "Transition | Vue.js", "doc_id": "f0d1774f7adb4324a70eb73c781eb507", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1496, "chunk_index": 95, "_doc_id": "95_6529327316203247440"}}
{"doc_id": "96_4893165499726654303", "text": "ef=\"#dynamic-transitions\">​<a><h2><p><code><Transition><code> 的 props (比如 <code>name<code>) 也可以是动态的！这让我们可以根据状态变化动态地应用不同类型的过渡：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>Transition<span><span> :<span><span>name<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>transitionName<span><span>\"<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <!-- ... --><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/transition.html", "title": "Transition | Vue.js", "doc_id": "f0d1774f7adb4324a70eb73c781eb507", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1496, "chunk_index": 96, "_doc_id": "96_4893165499726654303"}}
{"doc_id": "97_7670066627722329196", "text": "sitionName<span><span>\"<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <!-- ... --><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>Transition<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>这个特性的用处是可以提前定义好多组 CSS 过渡或动画的 class，然后在它们之间动态切换。<p><p>你也可以根据你的组件的当前状态在 JavaScript 过渡钩子中应用不同的行为。最后，创建动态过渡的终极方式还是创建<a href=\"#reusable-transitions\">可复用的过渡组件<a>，并让这些组件根据动态的 props 来改变过渡的效果。掌握了这些技巧后，就真的只有你想不到，没有做不到的了。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/transition.html", "title": "Transition | Vue.js", "doc_id": "f0d1774f7adb4324a70eb73c781eb507", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1496, "chunk_index": 97, "_doc_id": "97_7670066627722329196"}}
{"doc_id": "98_6162255785426490009", "text": "创建<a href=\"#reusable-transitions\">可复用的过渡组件<a>，并让这些组件根据动态的 props 来改变过渡的效果。掌握了这些技巧后，就真的只有你想不到，没有做不到的了。<p><h2 id=\"transitions-with-the-key-attribute\">使用 Key Attribute 过渡 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#transitions-with-the-key-attribute\">​<a><h2><p>有时为了触发过渡，你需要强制重新渲染 DOM 元素。<p><p>以计数器组件为例：<p><div class=\"composition-api\"><div class=\"language-vue\"> <span class=\"lang\">vue<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>script<span><span> setup<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/transition.html", "title": "Transition | Vue.js", "doc_id": "f0d1774f7adb4324a70eb73c781eb507", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1496, "chunk_index": 98, "_doc_id": "98_6162255785426490009"}}
{"doc_id": "99_8202154052025057618", "text": "code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>script<span><span> setup<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>import<span><span> { ref } <span><span>from<span><span> 'vue'<span><span>;<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> count<span><span> =<span><span> ref<span><span>(<span><span>0<span><span>);<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/transition.html", "title": "Transition | Vue.js", "doc_id": "f0d1774f7adb4324a70eb73c781eb507", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1496, "chunk_index": 99, "_doc_id": "99_8202154052025057618"}}
{"doc_id": "100_6474532782430997103", "text": "an> =<span><span> ref<span><span>(<span><span>0<span><span>);<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>setInterval<span><span>(() <span><span>=><span><span> count.value<span><span>++<span><span>, <span><span>1000<span><span>);<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>script<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>Transition<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/transition.html", "title": "Transition | Vue.js", "doc_id": "f0d1774f7adb4324a70eb73c781eb507", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1496, "chunk_index": 100, "_doc_id": "100_6474532782430997103"}}
{"doc_id": "101_4457352765584183891", "text": "span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>Transition<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>span<span><span> :key<span><span>=<span><span>\"count\"<span><span>>{{ count }}</<span><span>span<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> </<span><span>Transition<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/transition.html", "title": "Transition | Vue.js", "doc_id": "f0d1774f7adb4324a70eb73c781eb507", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1496, "chunk_index": 101, "_doc_id": "101_4457352765584183891"}}
{"doc_id": "102_5468443059089553973", "text": "pan><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> </<span><span>Transition<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><div><div class=\"options-api\"><div class=\"language-vue\"> <span class=\"lang\">vue<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>script<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/transition.html", "title": "Transition | Vue.js", "doc_id": "f0d1774f7adb4324a70eb73c781eb507", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1496, "chunk_index": 102, "_doc_id": "102_5468443059089553973"}}
{"doc_id": "103_9146286879450965686", "text": "n><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> data<span><span>() {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> return<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> count: <span><span>1<span><span>,<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> interval: <span><span>null<span><span> <span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> },<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> mounted<span><span>() {<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/transition.html", "title": "Transition | Vue.js", "doc_id": "f0d1774f7adb4324a70eb73c781eb507", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1496, "chunk_index": 103, "_doc_id": "103_9146286879450965686"}}
{"doc_id": "104_7497629229146460101", "text": "an class=\"line\"><span> },<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> mounted<span><span>() {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> this<span><span>.interval <span><span>=<span><span> setInterval<span><span>(() <span><span>=><span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> this<span><span>.count<span><span>++<span><span>;<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }, <span><span>1000<span><span>)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> },<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/transition.html", "title": "Transition | Vue.js", "doc_id": "f0d1774f7adb4324a70eb73c781eb507", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1496, "chunk_index": 104, "_doc_id": "104_7497629229146460101"}}
{"doc_id": "105_8268935776809589815", "text": "\"line\"><span> }, <span><span>1000<span><span>)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> },<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> beforeDestroy<span><span>() {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> clearInterval<span><span>(<span><span>this<span><span>.interval)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>script<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/transition.html", "title": "Transition | Vue.js", "doc_id": "f0d1774f7adb4324a70eb73c781eb507", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1496, "chunk_index": 105, "_doc_id": "105_8268935776809589815"}}
{"doc_id": "106_6916673441267420107", "text": "n>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>script<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>Transition<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>span<span><span> :key<span><span>=<span><span>\"count\"<span><span>>{{ count }}</<span><span>span<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> </<span><span>Transition<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/transition.html", "title": "Transition | Vue.js", "doc_id": "f0d1774f7adb4324a70eb73c781eb507", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1496, "chunk_index": 106, "_doc_id": "106_6916673441267420107"}}
{"doc_id": "107_8481314625245442111", "text": "pan><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> </<span><span>Transition<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><div><p>如果不使用 <code>key<code> attribute，则只有文本节点会被更新，因此不会发生过渡。但是，有了 <code>key<code> 属性，Vue 就知道在 <code>count<code> 改变时创建一个新的 <code>span<code> 元素，因此 <code>Transition<code> 组件有两个不同的元素在它们之间进行过渡。<p>\n<p><strong>参考<strong><p><div><div>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/transition.html", "title": "Transition | Vue.js", "doc_id": "f0d1774f7adb4324a70eb73c781eb507", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1496, "chunk_index": 107, "_doc_id": "107_8481314625245442111"}}
{"doc_id": "0_4514014591718619665", "text": "<div><div><h1 id=\"transitiongroup\">TransitionGroup <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#transitiongroup\">​<a><h1><p><code><TransitionGroup><code> 是一个内置组件，用于对 <code>v-for<code> 列表中的元素或组件的插入、移除和顺序改变添加动画效果。<p><h2 id=\"differences-from-transition\">和 <code><Transition><code> 的区别 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#differences-from-transition\">​<a><h2><p><code><TransitionGroup><code> 支持和 <code><Transition><code> 基本相同的 props、CSS 过渡 class 和 JavaScript 钩子监听器，但有以下几点区别：<p><ul><li><p>默认情况下，它不会渲染一个容器元素。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/transition-group.html", "title": "TransitionGroup | Vue.js", "doc_id": "79d529066b914d1bb5790ef600d9f2d1", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 306, "chunk_index": 0, "_doc_id": "0_4514014591718619665"}}
{"doc_id": "1_2400070267131954004", "text": "nsition><code> 基本相同的 props、CSS 过渡 class 和 JavaScript 钩子监听器，但有以下几点区别：<p><ul><li><p>默认情况下，它不会渲染一个容器元素。但你可以通过传入 <code>tag<code> prop 来指定一个元素作为容器元素来渲染。<p><li><li><p><a href=\"./transition.html#transition-modes\">过渡模式<a>在这里不可用，因为我们不再是在互斥的元素之间进行切换。<p><li><li><p>列表中的每个元素都<strong>必须<strong>有一个独一无二的 <code>key<code> attribute。<p><li><li><p>CSS 过渡 class 会被应用在列表内的元素上，<strong>而不是<strong>容器元素上。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/transition-group.html", "title": "TransitionGroup | Vue.js", "doc_id": "79d529066b914d1bb5790ef600d9f2d1", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 306, "chunk_index": 1, "_doc_id": "1_2400070267131954004"}}
{"doc_id": "2_6904266375694332298", "text": "有一个独一无二的 <code>key<code> attribute。<p><li><li><p>CSS 过渡 class 会被应用在列表内的元素上，<strong>而不是<strong>容器元素上。<p><li><ul><div class=\"tip custom-block\"><p class=\"custom-block-title\">TIP<p><p>当在 <a href=\"/guide/essentials/component-basics.html#in-dom-template-parsing-caveats\">DOM 内模板<a>中使用时，组件名需要写为 <code><transition-group><code>。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/transition-group.html", "title": "TransitionGroup | Vue.js", "doc_id": "79d529066b914d1bb5790ef600d9f2d1", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 306, "chunk_index": 2, "_doc_id": "2_6904266375694332298"}}
{"doc_id": "3_4486852926042184865", "text": "-basics.html#in-dom-template-parsing-caveats\">DOM 内模板<a>中使用时，组件名需要写为 <code><transition-group><code>。<p><div><h2 id=\"enter-leave-transitions\">进入 / 离开动画 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#enter-leave-transitions\">​<a><h2><p>这里是 <code><TransitionGroup><code> 对一个 <code>v-for<code> 列表添加进入 / 离开动画的示例：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>TransitionGroup<span><span> name<span><span>=<span><span>\"list\"<span><span> tag<span><span>=<span><span>\"ul\"<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/transition-group.html", "title": "TransitionGroup | Vue.js", "doc_id": "79d529066b914d1bb5790ef600d9f2d1", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 306, "chunk_index": 3, "_doc_id": "3_4486852926042184865"}}
{"doc_id": "4_6057197341509128545", "text": "pan><span>=<span><span>\"list\"<span><span> tag<span><span>=<span><span>\"ul\"<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>li<span><span> v-for<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>item <span><span>in<span><span> items<span><span>\"<span><span> :<span><span>key<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>item<span><span>\"<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> {{ item }}<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> </<span><span>li<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/transition-group.html", "title": "TransitionGroup | Vue.js", "doc_id": "79d529066b914d1bb5790ef600d9f2d1", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 306, "chunk_index": 4, "_doc_id": "4_6057197341509128545"}}
{"doc_id": "5_7408484230846532430", "text": "\"><span> {{ item }}<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> </<span><span>li<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>TransitionGroup<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><div class=\"language-css\"> <span class=\"lang\">css<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>.list-enter-active<span><span>,<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>.list-leave-active<span><span> {<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/transition-group.html", "title": "TransitionGroup | Vue.js", "doc_id": "79d529066b914d1bb5790ef600d9f2d1", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 306, "chunk_index": 5, "_doc_id": "5_7408484230846532430"}}
{"doc_id": "6_7934826525312403997", "text": "tive<span><span>,<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>.list-leave-active<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> transition<span><span>: <span><span>all<span><span> 0.5<span><span>s<span><span> ease<span><span>;<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>.list-enter-from<span><span>,<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>.list-leave-to<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> opacity<span><span>: <span><span>0<span><span>;<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/transition-group.html", "title": "TransitionGroup | Vue.js", "doc_id": "79d529066b914d1bb5790ef600d9f2d1", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 306, "chunk_index": 6, "_doc_id": "6_7934826525312403997"}}
{"doc_id": "7_1855543228609076189", "text": "{<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> opacity<span><span>: <span><span>0<span><span>;<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> transform<span><span>: <span><span>translateX<span><span>(<span><span>30<span><span>px<span><span>);<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/transition-group.html", "title": "TransitionGroup | Vue.js", "doc_id": "79d529066b914d1bb5790ef600d9f2d1", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 306, "chunk_index": 7, "_doc_id": "7_1855543228609076189"}}
{"doc_id": "8_5273630262158899686", "text": "n><span>: <span><span>translateX<span><span>(<span><span>30<span><span>px<span><span>);<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span><code><pre><div><h2 id=\"move-transitions\">移动动画 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#move-transitions\">​<a><h2><p>上面的示例有一些明显的缺陷：当某一项被插入或移除时，它周围的元素会立即发生“跳跃”而不是平稳地移动。我们可以通过添加一些额外的 CSS 规则来解决这个问题：<p><div class=\"language-css\"> <span class=\"lang\">css<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line highlighted\"><span>.list-move<span><span>, <span><span>/* 对移动中的元素应用的过渡 */<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/transition-group.html", "title": "TransitionGroup | Vue.js", "doc_id": "79d529066b914d1bb5790ef600d9f2d1", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 306, "chunk_index": 8, "_doc_id": "8_5273630262158899686"}}
{"doc_id": "9_2785081120684608117", "text": "n class=\"line highlighted\"><span>.list-move<span><span>, <span><span>/* 对移动中的元素应用的过渡 */<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>.list-enter-active<span><span>,<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>.list-leave-active<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> transition<span><span>: <span><span>all<span><span> 0.5<span><span>s<span><span> ease<span><span>;<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>.list-enter-from<span><span>,<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/transition-group.html", "title": "TransitionGroup | Vue.js", "doc_id": "79d529066b914d1bb5790ef600d9f2d1", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 306, "chunk_index": 9, "_doc_id": "9_2785081120684608117"}}
{"doc_id": "10_8531640093077522828", "text": "<span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>.list-enter-from<span><span>,<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>.list-leave-to<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> opacity<span><span>: <span><span>0<span><span>;<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> transform<span><span>: <span><span>translateX<span><span>(<span><span>30<span><span>px<span><span>);<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/transition-group.html", "title": "TransitionGroup | Vue.js", "doc_id": "79d529066b914d1bb5790ef600d9f2d1", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 306, "chunk_index": 10, "_doc_id": "10_8531640093077522828"}}
{"doc_id": "11_2770781496471757691", "text": "<span>px<span><span>);<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line highlighted\"><span>/* 确保将离开的元素从布局流中删除<span><span>\n<span class=\"line highlighted\"><span> 以便能够正确地计算移动的动画。 */<span><span>\n<span class=\"line highlighted\"><span>.list-leave-active<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line highlighted\"><span> position<span><span>: <span><span>absolute<span><span>;<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/transition-group.html", "title": "TransitionGroup | Vue.js", "doc_id": "79d529066b914d1bb5790ef600d9f2d1", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 306, "chunk_index": 11, "_doc_id": "11_2770781496471757691"}}
{"doc_id": "12_2430353585370365797", "text": "class=\"line highlighted\"><span> position<span><span>: <span><span>absolute<span><span>;<span><span>\n<span class=\"line highlighted\"><span>}<span><span><code><pre><div><p>现在它看起来好多了，甚至对整个列表执行洗牌的动画也都非常流畅：<p><p><a href=\"/examples/#list-transition\">完整的示例<a><p><h3 id=\"custom-transitiongroup-classes\">自定义过渡组 class <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#custom-transitiongroup-classes\">​<a><h3><p>你还可以通过向 <code><TransitionGroup><code> 传递 <code>moveClass<code> prop 为移动元素指定自定义过渡 class，类似于<a href=\"/guide/built-ins/transition.html#custom-transition-classes\">自定义过渡 class<a>。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/transition-group.html", "title": "TransitionGroup | Vue.js", "doc_id": "79d529066b914d1bb5790ef600d9f2d1", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 306, "chunk_index": 12, "_doc_id": "12_2430353585370365797"}}
{"doc_id": "13_3206638181786586874", "text": "定自定义过渡 class，类似于<a href=\"/guide/built-ins/transition.html#custom-transition-classes\">自定义过渡 class<a>。<p><h2 id=\"staggering-list-transitions\">渐进延迟列表动画 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#staggering-list-transitions\">​<a><h2><p>通过在 JavaScript 钩子中读取元素的 data attribute，我们可以实现带渐进延迟的列表动画。首先，我们把每一个元素的索引渲染为该元素上的一个 data attribute：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>TransitionGroup<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/transition-group.html", "title": "TransitionGroup | Vue.js", "doc_id": "79d529066b914d1bb5790ef600d9f2d1", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 306, "chunk_index": 13, "_doc_id": "13_3206638181786586874"}}
{"doc_id": "14_3305835891848157904", "text": "\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>TransitionGroup<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> tag<span><span>=<span><span>\"ul\"<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> :<span><span>css<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>false<span><span>\"<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> @<span><span>before-enter<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>onBeforeEnter<span><span>\"<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/transition-group.html", "title": "TransitionGroup | Vue.js", "doc_id": "79d529066b914d1bb5790ef600d9f2d1", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 306, "chunk_index": 14, "_doc_id": "14_3305835891848157904"}}
{"doc_id": "15_4899801130297471545", "text": "span><span>before-enter<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>onBeforeEnter<span><span>\"<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> @<span><span>enter<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>onEnter<span><span>\"<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> @<span><span>leave<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>onLeave<span><span>\"<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>li<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/transition-group.html", "title": "TransitionGroup | Vue.js", "doc_id": "79d529066b914d1bb5790ef600d9f2d1", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 306, "chunk_index": 15, "_doc_id": "15_4899801130297471545"}}
{"doc_id": "16_7400260294152264680", "text": "<span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>li<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> v-for<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>(item, index) <span><span>in<span><span> computedList<span><span>\"<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> :<span><span>key<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>item.msg<span><span>\"<span><span>\n<span class=\"line highlighted\"><span> :<span><span>data-index<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>index<span><span>\"<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/transition-group.html", "title": "TransitionGroup | Vue.js", "doc_id": "79d529066b914d1bb5790ef600d9f2d1", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 306, "chunk_index": 16, "_doc_id": "16_7400260294152264680"}}
{"doc_id": "17_3642384476877518193", "text": "><span> :<span><span>data-index<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>index<span><span>\"<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> ><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> {{ item.msg }}<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> </<span><span>li<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/transition-group.html", "title": "TransitionGroup | Vue.js", "doc_id": "79d529066b914d1bb5790ef600d9f2d1", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 306, "chunk_index": 17, "_doc_id": "17_3642384476877518193"}}
{"doc_id": "18_5170250745508780354", "text": "pan> {{ item.msg }}<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> </<span><span>li<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>TransitionGroup<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>接着，在 JavaScript 钩子中，我们基于当前元素的 data attribute 对该元素的进场动画添加一个延迟。以下是一个基于 <a href=\"https://gsap.com/\" target=\"_blank\">GSAP library<a> 的动画示例：<p><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>function<span><span> onEnter<span><span>(<span><span>el<span><span>, <span><span>done<span><span>) {<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/transition-group.html", "title": "TransitionGroup | Vue.js", "doc_id": "79d529066b914d1bb5790ef600d9f2d1", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 306, "chunk_index": 18, "_doc_id": "18_5170250745508780354"}}
{"doc_id": "19_5018598575436779432", "text": "><span> onEnter<span><span>(<span><span>el<span><span>, <span><span>done<span><span>) {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> gsap.<span><span>to<span><span>(el, {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> opacity: <span><span>1<span><span>,<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> height: <span><span>'1.6em'<span><span>,<span><span>\n<span class=\"line highlighted\"><span> delay: el.dataset.index <span><span>*<span><span> 0.15<span><span>,<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> onComplete: done<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/transition-group.html", "title": "TransitionGroup | Vue.js", "doc_id": "79d529066b914d1bb5790ef600d9f2d1", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 306, "chunk_index": 19, "_doc_id": "19_5018598575436779432"}}
{"doc_id": "20_4493975790337992471", "text": ">*<span><span> 0.15<span><span>,<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> onComplete: done<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> })<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span><code><pre><div>\n<p><strong>参考<strong><p><div><div>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/transition-group.html", "title": "TransitionGroup | Vue.js", "doc_id": "79d529066b914d1bb5790ef600d9f2d1", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 306, "chunk_index": 20, "_doc_id": "20_4493975790337992471"}}
{"doc_id": "0_4989804403213058759", "text": "<div><div><h1 id=\"keepalive\">KeepAlive <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#keepalive\">​<a><h1><p><code><KeepAlive><code> 是一个内置组件，它的功能是在多个组件间动态切换时缓存被移除的组件实例。<p><h2 id=\"basic-usage\">基本使用 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#basic-usage\">​<a><h2><p>在组件基础章节中，", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/keep-alive.html", "title": "KeepAlive | Vue.js", "doc_id": "12806f0619f44872b7a6bad27d5d11d9", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 290, "chunk_index": 0, "_doc_id": "0_4989804403213058759"}}
{"doc_id": "1_6148776128071863362", "text": "的组件实例。<p><h2 id=\"basic-usage\">基本使用 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#basic-usage\">​<a><h2><p>在组件基础章节中，我们已经介绍了通过特殊的 <code><component><code> 元素来实现<a href=\"/guide/essentials/component-basics.html#dynamic-components\">动态组件<a>的用法：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>component<span><span> :<span><span>is<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>activeComponent<span><span>\"<span><span> /><span><span><code><pre><div><p>默认情况下，", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/keep-alive.html", "title": "KeepAlive | Vue.js", "doc_id": "12806f0619f44872b7a6bad27d5d11d9", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 290, "chunk_index": 1, "_doc_id": "1_6148776128071863362"}}
{"doc_id": "2_3997623110509074729", "text": "><span>\"<span><span>activeComponent<span><span>\"<span><span> /><span><span><code><pre><div><p>默认情况下，一个组件实例在被替换掉后会被销毁。这会导致它丢失其中所有已变化的状态——当这个组件再一次被显示时，会创建一个只带有初始状态的新实例。<p><p>在下面的例子中，你会看到两个有状态的组件——A 有一个计数器，而 B 有一个通过 <code>v-model<code> 同步 input 框输入内容的文字展示。尝试先更改一下任意一个组件的状态，然后切走，再切回来：<p><p>你会发现在切回来之后，之前已更改的状态都被重置了。<p><p>在切换时创建新的组件实例通常是有意义的，但在这个例子中，我们的确想要组件能在被“切走”的时候保留它们的状态。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/keep-alive.html", "title": "KeepAlive | Vue.js", "doc_id": "12806f0619f44872b7a6bad27d5d11d9", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 290, "chunk_index": 2, "_doc_id": "2_3997623110509074729"}}
{"doc_id": "3_420059748672566840", "text": "后切走，再切回来：<p><p>你会发现在切回来之后，之前已更改的状态都被重置了。<p><p>在切换时创建新的组件实例通常是有意义的，但在这个例子中，我们的确想要组件能在被“切走”的时候保留它们的状态。要解决这个问题，我们可以用 <code><KeepAlive><code> 内置组件将这些动态组件包装起来：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><!-- 非活跃的组件将会被缓存！ --><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>KeepAlive<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/keep-alive.html", "title": "KeepAlive | Vue.js", "doc_id": "12806f0619f44872b7a6bad27d5d11d9", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 290, "chunk_index": 3, "_doc_id": "3_420059748672566840"}}
{"doc_id": "4_6455751273208590143", "text": "跃的组件将会被缓存！ --><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>KeepAlive<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>component<span><span> :<span><span>is<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>activeComponent<span><span>\"<span><span> /><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/keep-alive.html", "title": "KeepAlive | Vue.js", "doc_id": "12806f0619f44872b7a6bad27d5d11d9", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 290, "chunk_index": 4, "_doc_id": "4_6455751273208590143"}}
{"doc_id": "5_2383290219144296124", "text": "pan>is<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>activeComponent<span><span>\"<span><span> /><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>KeepAlive<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>现在，在组件切换时状态也能被保留了：<p><div class=\"tip custom-block\"><p class=\"custom-block-title\">TIP<p><p>在 <a href=\"/guide/essentials/component-basics.html#in-dom-template-parsing-caveats\">DOM 内模板<a>中使用时，它应该被写为 <code><keep-alive><code>。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/keep-alive.html", "title": "KeepAlive | Vue.js", "doc_id": "12806f0619f44872b7a6bad27d5d11d9", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 290, "chunk_index": 5, "_doc_id": "5_2383290219144296124"}}
{"doc_id": "6_7612219892049010372", "text": "mponent-basics.html#in-dom-template-parsing-caveats\">DOM 内模板<a>中使用时，它应该被写为 <code><keep-alive><code>。<p><div><h2 id=\"include-exclude\">包含/排除 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#include-exclude\">​<a><h2><p><code><KeepAlive><code> 默认会缓存内部的所有组件实例，但我们可以通过 <code>include<code> 和 <code>exclude<code> prop 来定制该行为。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/keep-alive.html", "title": "KeepAlive | Vue.js", "doc_id": "12806f0619f44872b7a6bad27d5d11d9", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 290, "chunk_index": 6, "_doc_id": "6_7612219892049010372"}}
{"doc_id": "7_482111824719089712", "text": "code><KeepAlive><code> 默认会缓存内部的所有组件实例，但我们可以通过 <code>include<code> 和 <code>exclude<code> prop 来定制该行为。这两个 prop 的值都可以是一个以英文逗号分隔的字符串、一个正则表达式，或是包含这两种类型的一个数组：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><!-- 以英文逗号分隔的字符串 --><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>KeepAlive<span><span> include<span><span>=<span><span>\"a,b\"<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/keep-alive.html", "title": "KeepAlive | Vue.js", "doc_id": "12806f0619f44872b7a6bad27d5d11d9", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 290, "chunk_index": 7, "_doc_id": "7_482111824719089712"}}
{"doc_id": "8_1482144287194012486", "text": "n><<span><span>KeepAlive<span><span> include<span><span>=<span><span>\"a,b\"<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>component<span><span> :<span><span>is<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>view<span><span>\"<span><span> /><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>KeepAlive<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><!-- 正则表达式 (需使用 `v-bind`) --><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/keep-alive.html", "title": "KeepAlive | Vue.js", "doc_id": "12806f0619f44872b7a6bad27d5d11d9", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 290, "chunk_index": 8, "_doc_id": "8_1482144287194012486"}}
{"doc_id": "9_2687098795849672736", "text": "<span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><!-- 正则表达式 (需使用 `v-bind`) --><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>KeepAlive<span><span> :<span><span>include<span><span>=<span><span>\"/<span><span>a<span><span>|<span><span>b<span><span>/\"<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>component<span><span> :<span><span>is<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>view<span><span>\"<span><span> /><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/keep-alive.html", "title": "KeepAlive | Vue.js", "doc_id": "12806f0619f44872b7a6bad27d5d11d9", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 290, "chunk_index": 9, "_doc_id": "9_2687098795849672736"}}
{"doc_id": "10_4659088121219042983", "text": "> :<span><span>is<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>view<span><span>\"<span><span> /><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>KeepAlive<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><!-- 数组 (需使用 `v-bind`) --><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>KeepAlive<span><span> :<span><span>include<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>[<span><span>'a'<span><span>, <span><span>'b'<span><span>]<span><span>\"<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/keep-alive.html", "title": "KeepAlive | Vue.js", "doc_id": "12806f0619f44872b7a6bad27d5d11d9", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 290, "chunk_index": 10, "_doc_id": "10_4659088121219042983"}}
{"doc_id": "11_8697693222707296300", "text": "an>[<span><span>'a'<span><span>, <span><span>'b'<span><span>]<span><span>\"<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>component<span><span> :<span><span>is<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>view<span><span>\"<span><span> /><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>KeepAlive<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>它会根据组件的 <a href=\"/api/options-misc.html#name\"><code>name<code><a> 选项进行匹配，所以组件如果想要条件性地被 <code>KeepAlive<code> 缓存，就必须显式声明一个 <code>name<code> 选项。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/keep-alive.html", "title": "KeepAlive | Vue.js", "doc_id": "12806f0619f44872b7a6bad27d5d11d9", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 290, "chunk_index": 11, "_doc_id": "11_8697693222707296300"}}
{"doc_id": "12_7499406190585333616", "text": "me\"><code>name<code><a> 选项进行匹配，所以组件如果想要条件性地被 <code>KeepAlive<code> 缓存，就必须显式声明一个 <code>name<code> 选项。<p><div class=\"tip custom-block\"><p class=\"custom-block-title\">TIP<p><p>在 3.2.34 或以上的版本中，使用 <code><script setup><code> 的单文件组件会自动根据文件名生成对应的 <code>name<code> 选项，无需再手动声明。<p><div><h2 id=\"max-cached-instances\">最大缓存实例数 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#max-cached-instances\">​<a><h2><p>我们可以通过传入 <code>max<code> prop 来限制可被缓存的最大组件实例数。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/keep-alive.html", "title": "KeepAlive | Vue.js", "doc_id": "12806f0619f44872b7a6bad27d5d11d9", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 290, "chunk_index": 12, "_doc_id": "12_7499406190585333616"}}
{"doc_id": "13_2806937603747017131", "text": "eader-anchor\" href=\"#max-cached-instances\">​<a><h2><p>我们可以通过传入 <code>max<code> prop 来限制可被缓存的最大组件实例数。<code><KeepAlive><code> 的行为在指定了 <code>max<code> 后类似一个 <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Cache_replacement_policies#Least_recently_used_(LRU)\" target=\"_blank\">LRU 缓存<a>：如果缓存的实例数量即将超过指定的那个最大数量，则最久没有被访问的缓存实例将被销毁，以便为新的实例腾出空间。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/keep-alive.html", "title": "KeepAlive | Vue.js", "doc_id": "12806f0619f44872b7a6bad27d5d11d9", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 290, "chunk_index": 13, "_doc_id": "13_2806937603747017131"}}
{"doc_id": "14_1877110604149465783", "text": "recently_used_(LRU)\" target=\"_blank\">LRU 缓存<a>：如果缓存的实例数量即将超过指定的那个最大数量，则最久没有被访问的缓存实例将被销毁，以便为新的实例腾出空间。<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>KeepAlive<span><span> :<span><span>max<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>10<span><span>\"<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/keep-alive.html", "title": "KeepAlive | Vue.js", "doc_id": "12806f0619f44872b7a6bad27d5d11d9", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 290, "chunk_index": 14, "_doc_id": "14_1877110604149465783"}}
{"doc_id": "15_14652681894071931", "text": "pan> :<span><span>max<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>10<span><span>\"<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>component<span><span> :<span><span>is<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>activeComponent<span><span>\"<span><span> /><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/keep-alive.html", "title": "KeepAlive | Vue.js", "doc_id": "12806f0619f44872b7a6bad27d5d11d9", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 290, "chunk_index": 15, "_doc_id": "15_14652681894071931"}}
{"doc_id": "16_5883685302939283313", "text": "pan>is<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>activeComponent<span><span>\"<span><span> /><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>KeepAlive<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><h2 id=\"lifecycle-of-cached-instance\">缓存实例的生命周期 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#lifecycle-of-cached-instance\">​<a><h2><p>当一个组件实例从 DOM 上移除但因为被 <code><KeepAlive><code> 缓存而仍作为组件树的一部分时，它将变为<strong>不活跃<strong>状态而不是被卸载。当一个组件实例作为缓存树的一部分插入到 DOM 中时，它将重新<strong>被激活<strong>。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/keep-alive.html", "title": "KeepAlive | Vue.js", "doc_id": "12806f0619f44872b7a6bad27d5d11d9", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 290, "chunk_index": 16, "_doc_id": "16_5883685302939283313"}}
{"doc_id": "17_981361515142587378", "text": "> 缓存而仍作为组件树的一部分时，它将变为<strong>不活跃<strong>状态而不是被卸载。当一个组件实例作为缓存树的一部分插入到 DOM 中时，它将重新<strong>被激活<strong>。<p><div class=\"composition-api\"><p>一个持续存在的组件可以通过 <a href=\"/api/composition-api-lifecycle.html#onactivated\"><code>onActivated()<code><a> 和 <a href=\"/api/composition-api-lifecycle.html#ondeactivated\"><code>onDeactivated()<code><a> 注册相应的两个状态的生命周期钩子：<p><div class=\"language-vue\"> <span class=\"lang\">vue<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>script<span><span> setup<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/keep-alive.html", "title": "KeepAlive | Vue.js", "doc_id": "12806f0619f44872b7a6bad27d5d11d9", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 290, "chunk_index": 17, "_doc_id": "17_981361515142587378"}}
{"doc_id": "18_3124383691955215687", "text": "code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>script<span><span> setup<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>import<span><span> { onActivated, onDeactivated } <span><span>from<span><span> 'vue'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>onActivated<span><span>(() <span><span>=><span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 调用时机为首次挂载<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 以及每次从缓存中被重新插入时<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>})<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/keep-alive.html", "title": "KeepAlive | Vue.js", "doc_id": "12806f0619f44872b7a6bad27d5d11d9", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 290, "chunk_index": 18, "_doc_id": "18_3124383691955215687"}}
{"doc_id": "19_6688858546604246095", "text": "an>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 以及每次从缓存中被重新插入时<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>})<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>onDeactivated<span><span>(() <span><span>=><span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 在从 DOM 上移除、进入缓存<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 以及组件卸载时调用<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>})<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/keep-alive.html", "title": "KeepAlive | Vue.js", "doc_id": "12806f0619f44872b7a6bad27d5d11d9", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 290, "chunk_index": 19, "_doc_id": "19_6688858546604246095"}}
{"doc_id": "20_119287060650951431", "text": "n><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 以及组件卸载时调用<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>})<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>script<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><div><div class=\"options-api\"><p>一个持续存在的组件可以通过 <a href=\"/api/options-lifecycle.html#activated\"><code>activated<code><a> 和 <a href=\"/api/options-lifecycle.html#deactivated\"><code>deactivated<code><a> 选项来注册相应的两个状态的生命周期钩子：<p><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/keep-alive.html", "title": "KeepAlive | Vue.js", "doc_id": "12806f0619f44872b7a6bad27d5d11d9", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 290, "chunk_index": 20, "_doc_id": "20_119287060650951431"}}
{"doc_id": "21_7278274509844647179", "text": "b-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> activated<span><span>() {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 在首次挂载、<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 以及每次从缓存中被重新插入的时候调用<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> },<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> deactivated<span><span>() {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 在从 DOM 上移除、进入缓存<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 以及组件卸载时调用<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/keep-alive.html", "title": "KeepAlive | Vue.js", "doc_id": "12806f0619f44872b7a6bad27d5d11d9", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 290, "chunk_index": 21, "_doc_id": "21_7278274509844647179"}}
{"doc_id": "22_4448178115110755540", "text": "ass=\"line\"><span> // 在从 DOM 上移除、进入缓存<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 以及组件卸载时调用<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span><code><pre><div><div><p>请注意：<p>\n<p><strong>参考<strong><p><div><div>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/keep-alive.html", "title": "KeepAlive | Vue.js", "doc_id": "12806f0619f44872b7a6bad27d5d11d9", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 290, "chunk_index": 22, "_doc_id": "22_4448178115110755540"}}
{"doc_id": "0_1872354660258675435", "text": "<div><div><h1 id=\"teleport\">Teleport <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#teleport\">​<a><h1><p><code><Teleport><code> 是一个内置组件，它可以将一个组件内部的一部分模板“传送”到该组件的 DOM 结构外层的位置去。<p><h2 id=\"basic-usage\">基本用法 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#basic-usage\">​<a><h2><p>有时我们可能会遇到这样的场景：一个组件模板的一部分在逻辑上从属于该组件，但从整个应用视图的角度来看，它在 DOM 中应该被渲染在其他地方，甚至在整个 Vue 应用外部。<p><p>这类场景最常见的例子就是全屏的模态框。理想情况下，我们希望触发模态框的按钮和模态框本身的代码是在同一个单文件组件中，因为它们都与组件的开关状态有关。但这意味着该模态框将与按钮一起渲染在应用 DOM 结构里很深的地方。这会导致该模态框的 CSS 布局代码很难写。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/teleport.html", "title": "Teleport | Vue.js", "doc_id": "b65936dbcfc44c3bb268d62470fb6b0a", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 499, "chunk_index": 0, "_doc_id": "0_1872354660258675435"}}
{"doc_id": "1_8197479905737174282", "text": "发模态框的按钮和模态框本身的代码是在同一个单文件组件中，因为它们都与组件的开关状态有关。但这意味着该模态框将与按钮一起渲染在应用 DOM 结构里很深的地方。这会导致该模态框的 CSS 布局代码很难写。<p><p>试想下面这样的 HTML 结构：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>div<span><span> class<span><span>=<span><span>\"outer\"<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>h3<span><span>>Tooltips with Vue 3 Teleport</<span><span>h3<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/teleport.html", "title": "Teleport | Vue.js", "doc_id": "b65936dbcfc44c3bb268d62470fb6b0a", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 499, "chunk_index": 1, "_doc_id": "1_8197479905737174282"}}
{"doc_id": "2_3261222381242028904", "text": "> <<span><span>h3<span><span>>Tooltips with Vue 3 Teleport</<span><span>h3<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>div<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>MyModal<span><span> /><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> </<span><span>div<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/teleport.html", "title": "Teleport | Vue.js", "doc_id": "b65936dbcfc44c3bb268d62470fb6b0a", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 499, "chunk_index": 2, "_doc_id": "2_3261222381242028904"}}
{"doc_id": "3_8579725532235724701", "text": "dal<span><span> /><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> </<span><span>div<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>div<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>接下来我们来看看 <code><MyModal><code> 的实现：<p><div class=\"composition-api\"><div class=\"language-vue\"> <span class=\"lang\">vue<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>script<span><span> setup<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/teleport.html", "title": "Teleport | Vue.js", "doc_id": "b65936dbcfc44c3bb268d62470fb6b0a", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 499, "chunk_index": 3, "_doc_id": "3_8579725532235724701"}}
{"doc_id": "4_7314357496413587111", "text": "code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>script<span><span> setup<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>import<span><span> { ref } <span><span>from<span><span> 'vue'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> open<span><span> =<span><span> ref<span><span>(<span><span>false<span><span>)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>script<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/teleport.html", "title": "Teleport | Vue.js", "doc_id": "b65936dbcfc44c3bb268d62470fb6b0a", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 499, "chunk_index": 4, "_doc_id": "4_7314357496413587111"}}
{"doc_id": "5_3803937200978341222", "text": "n>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>script<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>button<span><span> @click<span><span>=<span><span>\"open = true\"<span><span>>Open Modal</<span><span>button<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/teleport.html", "title": "Teleport | Vue.js", "doc_id": "b65936dbcfc44c3bb268d62470fb6b0a", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 499, "chunk_index": 5, "_doc_id": "5_3803937200978341222"}}
{"doc_id": "6_4030246923630153211", "text": "true\"<span><span>>Open Modal</<span><span>button<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>div<span><span> v-if<span><span>=<span><span>\"open\"<span><span> class<span><span>=<span><span>\"modal\"<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>p<span><span>>Hello from the modal!</<span><span>p<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/teleport.html", "title": "Teleport | Vue.js", "doc_id": "b65936dbcfc44c3bb268d62470fb6b0a", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 499, "chunk_index": 6, "_doc_id": "6_4030246923630153211"}}
{"doc_id": "7_8838074581535168165", "text": "ne\"><span> <<span><span>p<span><span>>Hello from the modal!</<span><span>p<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>button<span><span> @click<span><span>=<span><span>\"open = false\"<span><span>>Close</<span><span>button<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> </<span><span>div<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/teleport.html", "title": "Teleport | Vue.js", "doc_id": "b65936dbcfc44c3bb268d62470fb6b0a", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 499, "chunk_index": 7, "_doc_id": "7_8838074581535168165"}}
{"doc_id": "8_4299088596187064994", "text": "<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>style<span><span> scoped<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>.modal<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> position<span><span>: <span><span>fixed<span><span>;<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> z-index<span><span>: <span><span>999<span><span>;<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/teleport.html", "title": "Teleport | Vue.js", "doc_id": "b65936dbcfc44c3bb268d62470fb6b0a", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 499, "chunk_index": 8, "_doc_id": "8_4299088596187064994"}}
{"doc_id": "9_5276304524727516728", "text": "span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> z-index<span><span>: <span><span>999<span><span>;<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> top<span><span>: <span><span>20<span><span>%<span><span>;<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> left<span><span>: <span><span>50<span><span>%<span><span>;<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> width<span><span>: <span><span>300<span><span>px<span><span>;<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> margin-left<span><span>: <span><span>-150<span><span>px<span><span>;<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/teleport.html", "title": "Teleport | Vue.js", "doc_id": "b65936dbcfc44c3bb268d62470fb6b0a", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 499, "chunk_index": 9, "_doc_id": "9_5276304524727516728"}}
{"doc_id": "10_71348080732568545", "text": "lass=\"line\"><span> margin-left<span><span>: <span><span>-150<span><span>px<span><span>;<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>style<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><div><div class=\"options-api\"><div class=\"language-vue\"> <span class=\"lang\">vue<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>script<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/teleport.html", "title": "Teleport | Vue.js", "doc_id": "b65936dbcfc44c3bb268d62470fb6b0a", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 499, "chunk_index": 10, "_doc_id": "10_71348080732568545"}}
{"doc_id": "11_2892142143987484528", "text": "n><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> data<span><span>() {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> return<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> open: <span><span>false<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>script<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/teleport.html", "title": "Teleport | Vue.js", "doc_id": "b65936dbcfc44c3bb268d62470fb6b0a", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 499, "chunk_index": 11, "_doc_id": "11_2892142143987484528"}}
{"doc_id": "12_3803937200978341222", "text": "n>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>script<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>button<span><span> @click<span><span>=<span><span>\"open = true\"<span><span>>Open Modal</<span><span>button<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/teleport.html", "title": "Teleport | Vue.js", "doc_id": "b65936dbcfc44c3bb268d62470fb6b0a", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 499, "chunk_index": 12, "_doc_id": "12_3803937200978341222"}}
{"doc_id": "13_4030246923630153211", "text": "true\"<span><span>>Open Modal</<span><span>button<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>div<span><span> v-if<span><span>=<span><span>\"open\"<span><span> class<span><span>=<span><span>\"modal\"<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>p<span><span>>Hello from the modal!</<span><span>p<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/teleport.html", "title": "Teleport | Vue.js", "doc_id": "b65936dbcfc44c3bb268d62470fb6b0a", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 499, "chunk_index": 13, "_doc_id": "13_4030246923630153211"}}
{"doc_id": "14_8838074581535168165", "text": "ne\"><span> <<span><span>p<span><span>>Hello from the modal!</<span><span>p<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>button<span><span> @click<span><span>=<span><span>\"open = false\"<span><span>>Close</<span><span>button<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> </<span><span>div<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/teleport.html", "title": "Teleport | Vue.js", "doc_id": "b65936dbcfc44c3bb268d62470fb6b0a", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 499, "chunk_index": 14, "_doc_id": "14_8838074581535168165"}}
{"doc_id": "15_4299088596187064994", "text": "<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>style<span><span> scoped<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>.modal<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> position<span><span>: <span><span>fixed<span><span>;<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> z-index<span><span>: <span><span>999<span><span>;<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/teleport.html", "title": "Teleport | Vue.js", "doc_id": "b65936dbcfc44c3bb268d62470fb6b0a", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 499, "chunk_index": 15, "_doc_id": "15_4299088596187064994"}}
{"doc_id": "16_5276304524727516728", "text": "span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> z-index<span><span>: <span><span>999<span><span>;<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> top<span><span>: <span><span>20<span><span>%<span><span>;<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> left<span><span>: <span><span>50<span><span>%<span><span>;<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> width<span><span>: <span><span>300<span><span>px<span><span>;<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> margin-left<span><span>: <span><span>-150<span><span>px<span><span>;<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/teleport.html", "title": "Teleport | Vue.js", "doc_id": "b65936dbcfc44c3bb268d62470fb6b0a", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 499, "chunk_index": 16, "_doc_id": "16_5276304524727516728"}}
{"doc_id": "17_2138541593701655148", "text": "lass=\"line\"><span> margin-left<span><span>: <span><span>-150<span><span>px<span><span>;<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>style<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><div><p>这个组件中有一个 <code><button><code> 按钮来触发打开模态框，和一个 class 名为 <code>.modal<code> 的 <code><div><code>，它包含了模态框的内容和一个用来关闭的按钮。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/teleport.html", "title": "Teleport | Vue.js", "doc_id": "b65936dbcfc44c3bb268d62470fb6b0a", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 499, "chunk_index": 17, "_doc_id": "17_2138541593701655148"}}
{"doc_id": "18_4103088448465787159", "text": "><button><code> 按钮来触发打开模态框，和一个 class 名为 <code>.modal<code> 的 <code><div><code>，它包含了模态框的内容和一个用来关闭的按钮。<p><p>当在初始 HTML 结构中使用这个组件时，会有一些潜在的问题：<p><ul><li><p><code>position: fixed<code> 能够相对于浏览器窗口放置有一个条件，那就是不能有任何祖先元素设置了 <code>transform<code>、<code>perspective<code> 或者 <code>filter<code> 样式属性。也就是说如果我们想要用 CSS <code>transform<code> 为祖先节点 <code><div class=\"outer\"><code> 设置动画，就会不小心破坏模态框的布局！<p><li><li><p>这个模态框的 <code>z-index<code> 受限于它的容器元素。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/teleport.html", "title": "Teleport | Vue.js", "doc_id": "b65936dbcfc44c3bb268d62470fb6b0a", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 499, "chunk_index": 18, "_doc_id": "18_4103088448465787159"}}
{"doc_id": "19_7277594916299547876", "text": "ode><div class=\"outer\"><code> 设置动画，就会不小心破坏模态框的布局！<p><li><li><p>这个模态框的 <code>z-index<code> 受限于它的容器元素。如果有其他元素与 <code><div class=\"outer\"><code> 重叠并有更高的 <code>z-index<code>，则它会覆盖住我们的模态框。<p><li><ul><p><code><Teleport><code> 提供了一个更简单的方式来解决此类问题，让我们不需要再顾虑 DOM 结构的问题。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/teleport.html", "title": "Teleport | Vue.js", "doc_id": "b65936dbcfc44c3bb268d62470fb6b0a", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 499, "chunk_index": 19, "_doc_id": "19_7277594916299547876"}}
{"doc_id": "20_63204550681915483", "text": "ndex<code>，则它会覆盖住我们的模态框。<p><li><ul><p><code><Teleport><code> 提供了一个更简单的方式来解决此类问题，让我们不需要再顾虑 DOM 结构的问题。让我们用 <code><Teleport><code> 改写一下 <code><MyModal><code>：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>button<span><span> @<span><span>click<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>open <span><span>=<span><span> true<span><span>\"<span><span>>Open Modal</<span><span>button<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/teleport.html", "title": "Teleport | Vue.js", "doc_id": "b65936dbcfc44c3bb268d62470fb6b0a", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 499, "chunk_index": 20, "_doc_id": "20_63204550681915483"}}
{"doc_id": "21_6115896099899045788", "text": "=<span><span> true<span><span>\"<span><span>>Open Modal</<span><span>button<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line highlighted\"><span><<span><span>Teleport<span><span> to<span><span>=<span><span>\"body\"<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>div<span><span> v-if<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>open<span><span>\"<span><span> class<span><span>=<span><span>\"modal\"<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/teleport.html", "title": "Teleport | Vue.js", "doc_id": "b65936dbcfc44c3bb268d62470fb6b0a", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 499, "chunk_index": 21, "_doc_id": "21_6115896099899045788"}}
{"doc_id": "22_1931816876576135088", "text": "><span>open<span><span>\"<span><span> class<span><span>=<span><span>\"modal\"<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>p<span><span>>Hello from the modal!</<span><span>p<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>button<span><span> @<span><span>click<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>open <span><span>=<span><span> false<span><span>\"<span><span>>Close</<span><span>button<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> </<span><span>div<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/teleport.html", "title": "Teleport | Vue.js", "doc_id": "b65936dbcfc44c3bb268d62470fb6b0a", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 499, "chunk_index": 22, "_doc_id": "22_1931816876576135088"}}
{"doc_id": "23_2473442268127090519", "text": "utton<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> </<span><span>div<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line highlighted\"><span></<span><span>Teleport<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p><code><Teleport><code> 接收一个 <code>to<code> prop 来指定传送的目标。<code>to<code> 的值可以是一个 CSS 选择器字符串，也可以是一个 DOM 元素对象。这段代码的作用就是告诉 Vue“把以下模板片段<strong>传送到 <code>body<code><strong> 标签下”。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/teleport.html", "title": "Teleport | Vue.js", "doc_id": "b65936dbcfc44c3bb268d62470fb6b0a", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 499, "chunk_index": 23, "_doc_id": "23_2473442268127090519"}}
{"doc_id": "24_3336211715893338750", "text": "的值可以是一个 CSS 选择器字符串，也可以是一个 DOM 元素对象。这段代码的作用就是告诉 Vue“把以下模板片段<strong>传送到 <code>body<code><strong> 标签下”。<p><p>你可以点击下面这个按钮，然后通过浏览器的开发者工具，在 <code><body><code> 标签下找到模态框元素：<p><p class=\"demo\"> Open Modal <p><p>我们也可以将 <code><Teleport><code> 和 <a href=\"./transition.html\"><code><Transition><code><a> 结合使用来创建一个带动画的模态框。你可以看看<a href=\"/examples/#modal\">这个示例<a>。<p><div class=\"tip custom-block\"><p class=\"custom-block-title\">TIP<p><p><code><Teleport><code> 挂载时，传送的 <code>to<code> 目标必须已经存在于 DOM 中。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/teleport.html", "title": "Teleport | Vue.js", "doc_id": "b65936dbcfc44c3bb268d62470fb6b0a", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 499, "chunk_index": 24, "_doc_id": "24_3336211715893338750"}}
{"doc_id": "25_2760063786951050267", "text": "p class=\"custom-block-title\">TIP<p><p><code><Teleport><code> 挂载时，传送的 <code>to<code> 目标必须已经存在于 DOM 中。理想情况下，这应该是整个 Vue 应用 DOM 树外部的一个元素。如果目标元素也是由 Vue 渲染的，你需要确保在挂载 <code><Teleport><code> 之前先挂载该元素。<p><div><h2 id=\"using-with-components\">搭配组件使用 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#using-with-components\">​<a><h2><p><code><Teleport><code> 只改变了渲染的 DOM 结构，它不会影响组件间的逻辑关系。也就是说，如果 <code><Teleport><code> 包含了一个组件，那么该组件始终和这个使用了 <code><Teleport><code> 的组件保持逻辑上的父子关系。传入的 props 和触发的事件也会照常工作。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/teleport.html", "title": "Teleport | Vue.js", "doc_id": "b65936dbcfc44c3bb268d62470fb6b0a", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 499, "chunk_index": 25, "_doc_id": "25_2760063786951050267"}}
{"doc_id": "26_8311015158220981121", "text": "><Teleport><code> 包含了一个组件，那么该组件始终和这个使用了 <code><Teleport><code> 的组件保持逻辑上的父子关系。传入的 props 和触发的事件也会照常工作。<p><p>这也意味着来自父组件的注入也会按预期工作，子组件将在 Vue Devtools 中嵌套在父级组件下面，而不是放在实际内容移动到的地方。<p><h2 id=\"disabling-teleport\">禁用 Teleport <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#disabling-teleport\">​<a><h2><p>在某些场景下可能需要视情况禁用 <code><Teleport><code>。举例来说，我们想要在桌面端将一个组件当做浮层来渲染，但在移动端则当作行内组件。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/teleport.html", "title": "Teleport | Vue.js", "doc_id": "b65936dbcfc44c3bb268d62470fb6b0a", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 499, "chunk_index": 26, "_doc_id": "26_8311015158220981121"}}
{"doc_id": "27_382597706747285377", "text": "-teleport\">​<a><h2><p>在某些场景下可能需要视情况禁用 <code><Teleport><code>。举例来说，我们想要在桌面端将一个组件当做浮层来渲染，但在移动端则当作行内组件。我们可以通过对 <code><Teleport><code> 动态地传入一个 <code>disabled<code> prop 来处理这两种不同情况：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>Teleport<span><span> :<span><span>disabled<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>isMobile<span><span>\"<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> ...<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/teleport.html", "title": "Teleport | Vue.js", "doc_id": "b65936dbcfc44c3bb268d62470fb6b0a", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 499, "chunk_index": 27, "_doc_id": "27_382597706747285377"}}
{"doc_id": "28_770564375134674489", "text": "span><span>isMobile<span><span>\"<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> ...<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>Teleport<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>然后我们可以动态地更新 <code>isMobile<code>。<p><h2 id=\"multiple-teleports-on-the-same-target\">多个 Teleport 共享目标 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#multiple-teleports-on-the-same-target\">​<a><h2><p>一个可重用的 <code><Modal><code> 组件可能同时存在多个实例。对于此类场景，多个 <code><Teleport><code> 组件可以将其内容挂载在同一个目标元素上，而顺序就是简单的顺次追加，后挂载的将排在目标元素下更后面的位置上，但都在目标元素中。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/teleport.html", "title": "Teleport | Vue.js", "doc_id": "b65936dbcfc44c3bb268d62470fb6b0a", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 499, "chunk_index": 28, "_doc_id": "28_770564375134674489"}}
{"doc_id": "29_2245584490002913250", "text": "多个实例。对于此类场景，多个 <code><Teleport><code> 组件可以将其内容挂载在同一个目标元素上，而顺序就是简单的顺次追加，后挂载的将排在目标元素下更后面的位置上，但都在目标元素中。<p><p>比如下面这样的用例：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>Teleport<span><span> to<span><span>=<span><span>\"#modals\"<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>div<span><span>>A</<span><span>div<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/teleport.html", "title": "Teleport | Vue.js", "doc_id": "b65936dbcfc44c3bb268d62470fb6b0a", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 499, "chunk_index": 29, "_doc_id": "29_2245584490002913250"}}
{"doc_id": "30_2657427322557772266", "text": "<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>div<span><span>>A</<span><span>div<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>Teleport<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>Teleport<span><span> to<span><span>=<span><span>\"#modals\"<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>div<span><span>>B</<span><span>div<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/teleport.html", "title": "Teleport | Vue.js", "doc_id": "b65936dbcfc44c3bb268d62470fb6b0a", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 499, "chunk_index": 30, "_doc_id": "30_2657427322557772266"}}
{"doc_id": "31_4158406518065568770", "text": "<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>div<span><span>>B</<span><span>div<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>Teleport<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>渲染的结果为：<p><div class=\"language-html\"> <span class=\"lang\">html<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>div<span><span> id<span><span>=<span><span>\"modals\"<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/teleport.html", "title": "Teleport | Vue.js", "doc_id": "b65936dbcfc44c3bb268d62470fb6b0a", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 499, "chunk_index": 31, "_doc_id": "31_4158406518065568770"}}
{"doc_id": "32_1006782497935358832", "text": "ne\"><span><<span><span>div<span><span> id<span><span>=<span><span>\"modals\"<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>div<span><span>>A</<span><span>div<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>div<span><span>>B</<span><span>div<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/teleport.html", "title": "Teleport | Vue.js", "doc_id": "b65936dbcfc44c3bb268d62470fb6b0a", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 499, "chunk_index": 32, "_doc_id": "32_1006782497935358832"}}
{"doc_id": "33_4219797626989430887", "text": "<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>div<span><span>>B</<span><span>div<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>div<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><h2 id=\"deferred-teleport\">延迟解析的 Teleport <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#deferred-teleport\" class=\"vt-badge\">​<a><h2><p>在 Vue 3.5 及更高版本中，我们可以使用 <code>defer<code> prop 推迟 Teleport 的目标解析，直到应用的其他部分挂载。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/teleport.html", "title": "Teleport | Vue.js", "doc_id": "b65936dbcfc44c3bb268d62470fb6b0a", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 499, "chunk_index": 33, "_doc_id": "33_4219797626989430887"}}
{"doc_id": "34_5478697078731106347", "text": "=\"vt-badge\">​<a><h2><p>在 Vue 3.5 及更高版本中，我们可以使用 <code>defer<code> prop 推迟 Teleport 的目标解析，直到应用的其他部分挂载。这允许 Teleport 将由 Vue 渲染且位于组件树之后部分的容器元素作为目标：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>Teleport<span><span> defer<span><span> to<span><span>=<span><span>\"#late-div\"<span><span>>...</<span><span>Teleport<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/teleport.html", "title": "Teleport | Vue.js", "doc_id": "b65936dbcfc44c3bb268d62470fb6b0a", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 499, "chunk_index": 34, "_doc_id": "34_5478697078731106347"}}
{"doc_id": "35_7127428576923443696", "text": "#late-div\"<span><span>>...</<span><span>Teleport<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><!-- 稍后出现于模板中的某处 --><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>div<span><span> id<span><span>=<span><span>\"late-div\"<span><span>></<span><span>div<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>请注意，目标元素必须与 Teleport 在同一个挂载/更新周期内渲染，即如果 <code><div><code> 在一秒后才挂载，Teleport 仍然会报错。延迟 Teleport 的原理与 <code>mounted<code> 生命周期钩子类似。<p>\n<p><strong>参考<strong><p><div><div>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/teleport.html", "title": "Teleport | Vue.js", "doc_id": "b65936dbcfc44c3bb268d62470fb6b0a", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 499, "chunk_index": 35, "_doc_id": "35_7127428576923443696"}}
{"doc_id": "0_8930555472029035998", "text": "<div><div><h1 id=\"suspense\">Suspense <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#suspense\">​<a><h1><div class=\"warning custom-block\"><p class=\"custom-block-title\">实验性功能<p><p><code><Suspense><code> 是一项实验性功能。它不一定会最终成为稳定功能，并且在稳定之前相关 API 也可能会发生变化。<p><div><p><code><Suspense><code> 是一个内置组件，用来在组件树中协调对异步依赖的处理。它让我们可以在组件树上层等待下层的多个嵌套异步依赖项解析完成，并可以在等待时渲染一个加载状态。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/suspense.html", "title": "Suspense | Vue.js", "doc_id": "78f2c9a404ff420da71621cd13044e9e", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 430, "chunk_index": 0, "_doc_id": "0_8930555472029035998"}}
{"doc_id": "1_5553195131892730434", "text": "><p><code><Suspense><code> 是一个内置组件，用来在组件树中协调对异步依赖的处理。它让我们可以在组件树上层等待下层的多个嵌套异步依赖项解析完成，并可以在等待时渲染一个加载状态。<p><h2 id=\"async-dependencies\">异步依赖 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#async-dependencies\">​<a><h2><p>要了解 <code><Suspense><code> 所解决的问题和它是如何与异步依赖进行交互的，我们需要想象这样一种组件层级结构：<p><div class=\"language-\"> <span class=\"lang\"><span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><Suspense><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>└─ <Dashboard><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/suspense.html", "title": "Suspense | Vue.js", "doc_id": "78f2c9a404ff420da71621cd13044e9e", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 430, "chunk_index": 1, "_doc_id": "1_5553195131892730434"}}
{"doc_id": "2_638916597463458443", "text": "<span class=\"line\"><span><Suspense><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>└─ <Dashboard><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> ├─ <Profile><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> │ └─ <FriendStatus> (组件有异步的 setup())<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> └─ <Content><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> ├─ <ActivityFeed> (异步组件)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> └─ <Stats> (异步组件)<span><span><code><pre><div><p>在这个组件树中有多个嵌套组件，要渲染出它们，首先得解析一些异步资源。如果没有 <code><Suspense><code>，则它们每个都需要处理自己的加载、报错和完成状态。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/suspense.html", "title": "Suspense | Vue.js", "doc_id": "78f2c9a404ff420da71621cd13044e9e", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 430, "chunk_index": 2, "_doc_id": "2_638916597463458443"}}
{"doc_id": "3_7850095938296487016", "text": "><pre><div><p>在这个组件树中有多个嵌套组件，要渲染出它们，首先得解析一些异步资源。如果没有 <code><Suspense><code>，则它们每个都需要处理自己的加载、报错和完成状态。在最坏的情况下，我们可能会在页面上看到三个旋转的加载态，在不同的时间显示出内容。<p><p>有了 <code><Suspense><code> 组件后，我们就可以在等待整个多层级组件树中的各个异步依赖获取结果时，在顶层展示出加载中或加载失败的状态。<p><p><code><Suspense><code> 可以等待的异步依赖有两种：<p><ol><li><p>带有异步 <code>setup()<code> 钩子的组件。这也包含了使用 <code><script setup><code> 时有顶层 <code>await<code> 表达式的组件。<p><li><li><p><a href=\"/guide/components/async.html\">异步组件<a>。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/suspense.html", "title": "Suspense | Vue.js", "doc_id": "78f2c9a404ff420da71621cd13044e9e", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 430, "chunk_index": 3, "_doc_id": "3_7850095938296487016"}}
{"doc_id": "4_3768508510854132486", "text": "p><code> 时有顶层 <code>await<code> 表达式的组件。<p><li><li><p><a href=\"/guide/components/async.html\">异步组件<a>。<p><li><ol><h3 id=\"async-setup\"><code>async setup()<code> <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#async-setup\">​<a><h3><p>组合式 API 中组件的 <code>setup()<code> 钩子可以是异步的：<p><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/suspense.html", "title": "Suspense | Vue.js", "doc_id": "78f2c9a404ff420da71621cd13044e9e", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 430, "chunk_index": 4, "_doc_id": "4_3768508510854132486"}}
{"doc_id": "5_5331231178164304227", "text": "b-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> async<span><span> setup<span><span>() {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> const<span><span> res<span><span> =<span><span> await<span><span> fetch<span><span>(<span><span>...<span><span>)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> const<span><span> posts<span><span> =<span><span> await<span><span> res.<span><span>json<span><span>()<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/suspense.html", "title": "Suspense | Vue.js", "doc_id": "78f2c9a404ff420da71621cd13044e9e", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 430, "chunk_index": 5, "_doc_id": "5_5331231178164304227"}}
{"doc_id": "6_5373855569612234154", "text": "n> posts<span><span> =<span><span> await<span><span> res.<span><span>json<span><span>()<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> return<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> posts<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/suspense.html", "title": "Suspense | Vue.js", "doc_id": "78f2c9a404ff420da71621cd13044e9e", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 430, "chunk_index": 6, "_doc_id": "6_5373855569612234154"}}
{"doc_id": "7_5997916386233734785", "text": "> posts<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span><code><pre><div><p>如果使用 <code><script setup><code>，那么顶层 <code>await<code> 表达式会自动让该组件成为一个异步依赖：<p><div class=\"language-vue\"> <span class=\"lang\">vue<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>script<span><span> setup<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/suspense.html", "title": "Suspense | Vue.js", "doc_id": "78f2c9a404ff420da71621cd13044e9e", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 430, "chunk_index": 7, "_doc_id": "7_5997916386233734785"}}
{"doc_id": "8_8779417898818991954", "text": "code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>script<span><span> setup<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> res<span><span> =<span><span> await<span><span> fetch<span><span>(<span><span>...<span><span>)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> posts<span><span> =<span><span> await<span><span> res.<span><span>json<span><span>()<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>script<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/suspense.html", "title": "Suspense | Vue.js", "doc_id": "78f2c9a404ff420da71621cd13044e9e", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 430, "chunk_index": 8, "_doc_id": "8_8779417898818991954"}}
{"doc_id": "9_259441288904318418", "text": "n>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>script<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> {{ posts }}<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><h3 id=\"async-components\">异步组件 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#async-components\">​<a><h3><p>异步组件默认就是<strong>“suspensible”<strong>的。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/suspense.html", "title": "Suspense | Vue.js", "doc_id": "78f2c9a404ff420da71621cd13044e9e", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 430, "chunk_index": 9, "_doc_id": "9_259441288904318418"}}
{"doc_id": "10_1834606161497013657", "text": "<a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#async-components\">​<a><h3><p>异步组件默认就是<strong>“suspensible”<strong>的。这意味着如果组件关系链上有一个 <code><Suspense><code>，那么这个异步组件就会被当作这个 <code><Suspense><code> 的一个异步依赖。在这种情况下，加载状态是由 <code><Suspense><code> 控制，而该组件自己的加载、报错、延时和超时等选项都将被忽略。<p><p>异步组件也可以通过在选项中指定 <code>suspensible: false<code> 表明不用 <code>Suspense<code> 控制，并让组件始终自己控制其加载状态。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/suspense.html", "title": "Suspense | Vue.js", "doc_id": "78f2c9a404ff420da71621cd13044e9e", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 430, "chunk_index": 10, "_doc_id": "10_1834606161497013657"}}
{"doc_id": "11_1634648598034662506", "text": "略。<p><p>异步组件也可以通过在选项中指定 <code>suspensible: false<code> 表明不用 <code>Suspense<code> 控制，并让组件始终自己控制其加载状态。<p><h2 id=\"loading-state\">加载中状态 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#loading-state\">​<a><h2><p><code><Suspense><code> 组件有两个插槽：<code>#default<code> 和 <code>#fallback<code>。两个插槽都只允许<strong>一个<strong>直接子节点。在可能的时候都将显示默认插槽中的节点。否则将显示后备插槽中的节点。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/suspense.html", "title": "Suspense | Vue.js", "doc_id": "78f2c9a404ff420da71621cd13044e9e", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 430, "chunk_index": 11, "_doc_id": "11_1634648598034662506"}}
{"doc_id": "12_8845491060877457554", "text": "ault<code> 和 <code>#fallback<code>。两个插槽都只允许<strong>一个<strong>直接子节点。在可能的时候都将显示默认插槽中的节点。否则将显示后备插槽中的节点。<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>Suspense<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <!-- 具有深层异步依赖的组件 --><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>Dashboard<span><span> /><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/suspense.html", "title": "Suspense | Vue.js", "doc_id": "78f2c9a404ff420da71621cd13044e9e", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 430, "chunk_index": 12, "_doc_id": "12_8845491060877457554"}}
{"doc_id": "13_2492921074030183503", "text": "pan class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>Dashboard<span><span> /><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <!-- 在 #fallback 插槽中显示 “正在加载中” --><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>template<span><span> #<span><span>fallback<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> Loading...<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> </<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/suspense.html", "title": "Suspense | Vue.js", "doc_id": "78f2c9a404ff420da71621cd13044e9e", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 430, "chunk_index": 13, "_doc_id": "13_2492921074030183503"}}
{"doc_id": "14_5431004411272436362", "text": "n> Loading...<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> </<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>Suspense<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>在初始渲染时，<code><Suspense><code> 将在内存中渲染其默认的插槽内容。如果在这个过程中遇到任何异步依赖，则会进入<strong>挂起<strong>状态。在挂起状态期间，展示的是后备内容。当所有遇到的异步依赖都完成后，<code><Suspense><code> 会进入<strong>完成<strong>状态，并将展示出默认插槽的内容。<p><p>如果在初次渲染时没有遇到异步依赖，<code><Suspense><code> 会直接进入完成状态。<p><p>进入完成状态后，只有当默认插槽的根节点被替换时，<code><Suspense><code> 才会回到挂起状态。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/suspense.html", "title": "Suspense | Vue.js", "doc_id": "78f2c9a404ff420da71621cd13044e9e", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 430, "chunk_index": 14, "_doc_id": "14_5431004411272436362"}}
{"doc_id": "15_2573853757167132058", "text": "异步依赖，<code><Suspense><code> 会直接进入完成状态。<p><p>进入完成状态后，只有当默认插槽的根节点被替换时，<code><Suspense><code> 才会回到挂起状态。组件树中新的更深层次的异步依赖<strong>不会<strong>造成 <code><Suspense><code> 回退到挂起状态。<p><p>发生回退时，后备内容不会立即展示出来。相反，<code><Suspense><code> 在等待新内容和异步依赖完成时，会展示之前 <code>#default<code> 插槽的内容。这个行为可以通过一个 <code>timeout<code> prop 进行配置：在等待渲染新内容耗时超过 <code>timeout<code> 毫秒之后，<code><Suspense><code> 将会切换为展示后备内容。若 <code>timeout<code> 值为 <code>0<code> 将导致在替换默认内容时立即显示后备内容。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/suspense.html", "title": "Suspense | Vue.js", "doc_id": "78f2c9a404ff420da71621cd13044e9e", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 430, "chunk_index": 15, "_doc_id": "15_2573853757167132058"}}
{"doc_id": "16_4401841080243237907", "text": "毫秒之后，<code><Suspense><code> 将会切换为展示后备内容。若 <code>timeout<code> 值为 <code>0<code> 将导致在替换默认内容时立即显示后备内容。<p><h2 id=\"events\">事件 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#events\">​<a><h2><p><code><Suspense><code> 组件会触发三个事件：<code>pending<code>、<code>resolve<code> 和 <code>fallback<code>。<code>pending<code> 事件是在进入挂起状态时触发。<code>resolve<code> 事件是在 <code>default<code> 插槽完成获取新内容时触发。<code>fallback<code> 事件则是在 <code>fallback<code> 插槽的内容显示时触发。<p><p>例如，可以使用这些事件在加载新组件时在之前的 DOM 最上层显示一个加载指示器。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/suspense.html", "title": "Suspense | Vue.js", "doc_id": "78f2c9a404ff420da71621cd13044e9e", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 430, "chunk_index": 16, "_doc_id": "16_4401841080243237907"}}
{"doc_id": "17_7527075774309921226", "text": ">fallback<code> 事件则是在 <code>fallback<code> 插槽的内容显示时触发。<p><p>例如，可以使用这些事件在加载新组件时在之前的 DOM 最上层显示一个加载指示器。<p><h2 id=\"error-handling\">错误处理 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#error-handling\">​<a><h2><p><code><Suspense><code> 组件自身目前还不提供错误处理，不过你可以使用 <a href=\"/api/options-lifecycle.html#errorcaptured\"><code>errorCaptured<code><a> 选项或者 <a href=\"/api/composition-api-lifecycle.html#onerrorcaptured\"><code>onErrorCaptured()<code><a> 钩子，在使用到 <code><Suspense><code> 的父组件中捕获和处理异步错误。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/suspense.html", "title": "Suspense | Vue.js", "doc_id": "78f2c9a404ff420da71621cd13044e9e", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 430, "chunk_index": 17, "_doc_id": "17_7527075774309921226"}}
{"doc_id": "18_3867542961174262338", "text": "tml#onerrorcaptured\"><code>onErrorCaptured()<code><a> 钩子，在使用到 <code><Suspense><code> 的父组件中捕获和处理异步错误。<p><h2 id=\"combining-with-other-components\">和其他组件结合 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#combining-with-other-components\">​<a><h2><p>我们常常会将 <code><Suspense><code> 和 <a href=\"./transition.html\"><code><Transition><code><a>、<a href=\"./keep-alive.html\"><code><KeepAlive><code><a> 等组件结合。要保证这些组件都能正常工作，嵌套的顺序非常重要。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/suspense.html", "title": "Suspense | Vue.js", "doc_id": "78f2c9a404ff420da71621cd13044e9e", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 430, "chunk_index": 18, "_doc_id": "18_3867542961174262338"}}
{"doc_id": "19_9005199285917206351", "text": "tion><code><a>、<a href=\"./keep-alive.html\"><code><KeepAlive><code><a> 等组件结合。要保证这些组件都能正常工作，嵌套的顺序非常重要。<p><p>另外，这些组件都通常与 <a href=\"https://router.vuejs.org/zh/\" target=\"_blank\">Vue Router<a> 中的 <code><RouterView><code> 组件结合使用。<p><p>下面的示例展示了如何嵌套这些组件，使它们都能按照预期的方式运行。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/suspense.html", "title": "Suspense | Vue.js", "doc_id": "78f2c9a404ff420da71621cd13044e9e", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 430, "chunk_index": 19, "_doc_id": "19_9005199285917206351"}}
{"doc_id": "20_5858680744353374693", "text": "get=\"_blank\">Vue Router<a> 中的 <code><RouterView><code> 组件结合使用。<p><p>下面的示例展示了如何嵌套这些组件，使它们都能按照预期的方式运行。若想组合得更简单，你也可以删除一些你不需要的组件：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>RouterView<span><span> v-slot<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>{ Component }<span><span>\"<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/suspense.html", "title": "Suspense | Vue.js", "doc_id": "78f2c9a404ff420da71621cd13044e9e", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 430, "chunk_index": 20, "_doc_id": "20_5858680744353374693"}}
{"doc_id": "21_4491328777215365149", "text": "an> v-slot<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>{ Component }<span><span>\"<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>template<span><span> v-if<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>Component<span><span>\"<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>Transition<span><span> mode<span><span>=<span><span>\"out-in\"<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>KeepAlive<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/suspense.html", "title": "Suspense | Vue.js", "doc_id": "78f2c9a404ff420da71621cd13044e9e", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 430, "chunk_index": 21, "_doc_id": "21_4491328777215365149"}}
{"doc_id": "22_8498155406450072164", "text": "<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>KeepAlive<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>Suspense<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <!-- 主要内容 --><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>component<span><span> :<span><span>is<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>Component<span><span>\"<span><span>></<span><span>component<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <!-- 加载中状态 --><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/suspense.html", "title": "Suspense | Vue.js", "doc_id": "78f2c9a404ff420da71621cd13044e9e", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 430, "chunk_index": 22, "_doc_id": "22_8498155406450072164"}}
{"doc_id": "23_2450593356924474126", "text": "><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <!-- 加载中状态 --><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>template<span><span> #<span><span>fallback<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> 正在加载...<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> </<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> </<span><span>Suspense<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> </<span><span>KeepAlive<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/suspense.html", "title": "Suspense | Vue.js", "doc_id": "78f2c9a404ff420da71621cd13044e9e", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 430, "chunk_index": 23, "_doc_id": "23_2450593356924474126"}}
{"doc_id": "24_8335017539134725692", "text": "span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> </<span><span>KeepAlive<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> </<span><span>Transition<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> </<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>RouterView<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>Vue Router 使用动态导入对<a href=\"https://router.vuejs.org/zh/guide/advanced/lazy-loading.html\" target=\"_blank\">懒加载组件<a>进行了内置支持。这些与异步组件不同，目前他们不会触发 <code><Suspense><code>。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/suspense.html", "title": "Suspense | Vue.js", "doc_id": "78f2c9a404ff420da71621cd13044e9e", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 430, "chunk_index": 24, "_doc_id": "24_8335017539134725692"}}
{"doc_id": "25_1458617164548125054", "text": "vanced/lazy-loading.html\" target=\"_blank\">懒加载组件<a>进行了内置支持。这些与异步组件不同，目前他们不会触发 <code><Suspense><code>。但是，它们仍然可以有异步组件作为后代，这些组件可以照常触发 <code><Suspense><code>。<p><h2 id=\"nested-suspense\">嵌套使用 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#nested-suspense\">​<a><h2><p>当我们有多个类似于下方的异步组件 (常见于嵌套或基于布局的路由) 时：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>Suspense<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/suspense.html", "title": "Suspense | Vue.js", "doc_id": "78f2c9a404ff420da71621cd13044e9e", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 430, "chunk_index": 25, "_doc_id": "25_1458617164548125054"}}
{"doc_id": "26_6409602298536486847", "text": "github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>Suspense<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>component<span><span> :<span><span>is<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>DynamicAsyncOuter<span><span>\"<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>component<span><span> :<span><span>is<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>DynamicAsyncInner<span><span>\"<span><span> /><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/suspense.html", "title": "Suspense | Vue.js", "doc_id": "78f2c9a404ff420da71621cd13044e9e", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 430, "chunk_index": 26, "_doc_id": "26_6409602298536486847"}}
{"doc_id": "27_4526948954876209293", "text": "n>is<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>DynamicAsyncInner<span><span>\"<span><span> /><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> </<span><span>component<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>Suspense<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p><code><Suspense><code> 创建了一个边界，它将如预期的那样解析树下的所有异步组件。然而，当我们更改 <code>DynamicAsyncOuter<code> 时，<code><Suspense><code> 会正确地等待它，但当我们更改 <code>DynamicAsyncInner<code> 时，嵌套的 <code>DynamicAsyncInner<code> 会呈现为一个空节点，直到它被解析为止 (而不是之前的节点或回退插槽)。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/suspense.html", "title": "Suspense | Vue.js", "doc_id": "78f2c9a404ff420da71621cd13044e9e", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 430, "chunk_index": 27, "_doc_id": "27_4526948954876209293"}}
{"doc_id": "28_6657100692385178833", "text": "code>DynamicAsyncInner<code> 时，嵌套的 <code>DynamicAsyncInner<code> 会呈现为一个空节点，直到它被解析为止 (而不是之前的节点或回退插槽)。<p><p>为了解决这个问题，我们可以使用嵌套的方法来处理嵌套组件的补丁，就像这样：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>Suspense<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>component<span><span> :<span><span>is<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>DynamicAsyncOuter<span><span>\"<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/suspense.html", "title": "Suspense | Vue.js", "doc_id": "78f2c9a404ff420da71621cd13044e9e", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 430, "chunk_index": 28, "_doc_id": "28_6657100692385178833"}}
{"doc_id": "29_2207064322263481129", "text": "pan>is<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>DynamicAsyncOuter<span><span>\"<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>Suspense<span><span> suspensible<span><span>> <span><span><!-- 像这样 --><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>component<span><span> :<span><span>is<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>DynamicAsyncInner<span><span>\"<span><span> /><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> </<span><span>Suspense<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/suspense.html", "title": "Suspense | Vue.js", "doc_id": "78f2c9a404ff420da71621cd13044e9e", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 430, "chunk_index": 29, "_doc_id": "29_2207064322263481129"}}
{"doc_id": "30_2989984377426145078", "text": "pan><span> /><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> </<span><span>Suspense<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> </<span><span>component<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/suspense.html", "title": "Suspense | Vue.js", "doc_id": "78f2c9a404ff420da71621cd13044e9e", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 430, "chunk_index": 30, "_doc_id": "30_2989984377426145078"}}
{"doc_id": "31_1325150874717698194", "text": "span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> </<span><span>component<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>Suspense<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>如果你不设置 <code>suspensible<code> 属性，内部的 <code><Suspense><code> 将被父级 <code><Suspense><code> 视为同步组件。这意味着它将会有自己的回退插槽，如果两个 <code>Dynamic<code> 组件同时被修改，则当子 <code><Suspense><code> 加载其自己的依赖关系树时，可能会出现空节点和多个修补周期，这可能不是理想情况。设置后，所有异步依赖项处理都会交给父级 <code><Suspense><code> (包括发出的事件)，而内部 <code><Suspense><code> 仅充当依赖项解析和修补的另一个边界。<p>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/suspense.html", "title": "Suspense | Vue.js", "doc_id": "78f2c9a404ff420da71621cd13044e9e", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 430, "chunk_index": 31, "_doc_id": "31_1325150874717698194"}}
{"doc_id": "32_5513005994398883276", "text": "后，所有异步依赖项处理都会交给父级 <code><Suspense><code> (包括发出的事件)，而内部 <code><Suspense><code> 仅充当依赖项解析和修补的另一个边界。<p>\n<p><strong>参考<strong><p><div><div>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/suspense.html", "title": "Suspense | Vue.js", "doc_id": "78f2c9a404ff420da71621cd13044e9e", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 430, "chunk_index": 32, "_doc_id": "32_5513005994398883276"}}
{"doc_id": "0_3584387159555560064", "text": "<div><div><h1 id=\"single-file-components\">单文件组件 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#single-file-components\">​<a><h1><h2 id=\"introduction\">介绍 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#introduction\">​<a><h2><p>Vue 的单文件组件 (即 <code>*.vue<code> 文件，英文 Single-File Component，简称 <strong>SFC<strong>) 是一种特殊的文件格式，使我们能够将一个 Vue 组件的模板、逻辑与样式封装在单个文件中。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/scaling-up/sfc.html", "title": "单文件组件", "doc_id": "4b75c5febe4f4f049b568b54400d5e62", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 256, "chunk_index": 0, "_doc_id": "0_3584387159555560064"}}
{"doc_id": "1_5904563641090635914", "text": "de> 文件，英文 Single-File Component，简称 <strong>SFC<strong>) 是一种特殊的文件格式，使我们能够将一个 Vue 组件的模板、逻辑与样式封装在单个文件中。下面是一个单文件组件的示例：<p><div class=\"options-api\"><div class=\"language-vue\"> <span class=\"lang\">vue<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>script<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> data<span><span>() {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> return<span><span> {<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/scaling-up/sfc.html", "title": "单文件组件", "doc_id": "4b75c5febe4f4f049b568b54400d5e62", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 256, "chunk_index": 1, "_doc_id": "1_5904563641090635914"}}
{"doc_id": "2_676455179148210906", "text": "><span> data<span><span>() {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> return<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> greeting: <span><span>'Hello World!'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>script<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/scaling-up/sfc.html", "title": "单文件组件", "doc_id": "4b75c5febe4f4f049b568b54400d5e62", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 256, "chunk_index": 2, "_doc_id": "2_676455179148210906"}}
{"doc_id": "3_6090515951954311560", "text": ">\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>p<span><span> class<span><span>=<span><span>\"greeting\"<span><span>>{{ greeting }}</<span><span>p<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>style<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>.greeting<span><span> {<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/scaling-up/sfc.html", "title": "单文件组件", "doc_id": "4b75c5febe4f4f049b568b54400d5e62", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 256, "chunk_index": 3, "_doc_id": "3_6090515951954311560"}}
{"doc_id": "4_4212903995423187599", "text": "n><span>style<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>.greeting<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> color<span><span>: <span><span>red<span><span>;<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> font-weight<span><span>: <span><span>bold<span><span>;<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/scaling-up/sfc.html", "title": "单文件组件", "doc_id": "4b75c5febe4f4f049b568b54400d5e62", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 256, "chunk_index": 4, "_doc_id": "4_4212903995423187599"}}
{"doc_id": "5_4813006113887291885", "text": "eight<span><span>: <span><span>bold<span><span>;<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>style<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><div><div class=\"composition-api\"><div class=\"language-vue\"> <span class=\"lang\">vue<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>script<span><span> setup<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>import<span><span> { ref } <span><span>from<span><span> 'vue'<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/scaling-up/sfc.html", "title": "单文件组件", "doc_id": "4b75c5febe4f4f049b568b54400d5e62", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 256, "chunk_index": 5, "_doc_id": "5_4813006113887291885"}}
{"doc_id": "6_60222202543017870", "text": "<span class=\"line\"><span>import<span><span> { ref } <span><span>from<span><span> 'vue'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> greeting<span><span> =<span><span> ref<span><span>(<span><span>'Hello World!'<span><span>)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>script<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/scaling-up/sfc.html", "title": "单文件组件", "doc_id": "4b75c5febe4f4f049b568b54400d5e62", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 256, "chunk_index": 6, "_doc_id": "6_60222202543017870"}}
{"doc_id": "7_6090515951954311560", "text": ">\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>p<span><span> class<span><span>=<span><span>\"greeting\"<span><span>>{{ greeting }}</<span><span>p<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>style<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>.greeting<span><span> {<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/scaling-up/sfc.html", "title": "单文件组件", "doc_id": "4b75c5febe4f4f049b568b54400d5e62", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 256, "chunk_index": 7, "_doc_id": "7_6090515951954311560"}}
{"doc_id": "8_2153783516035028828", "text": "n><span>style<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>.greeting<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> color<span><span>: <span><span>red<span><span>;<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> font-weight<span><span>: <span><span>bold<span><span>;<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>style<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><div><p>如你所见，Vue 的单文件组件是网页开发中 HTML、CSS 和 JavaScript 三种语言经典组合的自然延伸。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/scaling-up/sfc.html", "title": "单文件组件", "doc_id": "4b75c5febe4f4f049b568b54400d5e62", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 256, "chunk_index": 8, "_doc_id": "8_2153783516035028828"}}
{"doc_id": "9_1504590802246030107", "text": "span>><span><span><code><pre><div><div><p>如你所见，Vue 的单文件组件是网页开发中 HTML、CSS 和 JavaScript 三种语言经典组合的自然延伸。<code><template><code>、<code><script><code> 和 <code><style><code> 三个块在同一个文件中封装、组合了组件的视图、逻辑和样式。完整的语法定义可以查阅<a href=\"/api/sfc-spec.html\">单文件组件语法说明<a>。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/scaling-up/sfc.html", "title": "单文件组件", "doc_id": "4b75c5febe4f4f049b568b54400d5e62", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 256, "chunk_index": 9, "_doc_id": "9_1504590802246030107"}}
{"doc_id": "10_7264279733046433801", "text": "code><style><code> 三个块在同一个文件中封装、组合了组件的视图、逻辑和样式。完整的语法定义可以查阅<a href=\"/api/sfc-spec.html\">单文件组件语法说明<a>。<p><h2 id=\"why-sfc\">为什么要使用单文件组件 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#why-sfc\">​<a><h2><p>使用单文件组件必须使用构建工具，但作为回报带来了以下优点：<p><p>单文件组件是 Vue 框架提供的一个功能，并且在下列场景中都是官方推荐的项目组织方式：<p><ul><li>单页面应用 (SPA)<li><li>静态站点生成 (SSG)<li><li>任何值得引入构建步骤以获得更好的开发体验 (DX) 的项目<li><ul><p>当然，在一些轻量级场景下使用单文件组件会显得有些杀鸡用牛刀。因此 Vue 同样也可以在无构建步骤的情况下以纯 JavaScript 方式使用。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/scaling-up/sfc.html", "title": "单文件组件", "doc_id": "4b75c5febe4f4f049b568b54400d5e62", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 256, "chunk_index": 10, "_doc_id": "10_7264279733046433801"}}
{"doc_id": "11_4177514796086955104", "text": "获得更好的开发体验 (DX) 的项目<li><ul><p>当然，在一些轻量级场景下使用单文件组件会显得有些杀鸡用牛刀。因此 Vue 同样也可以在无构建步骤的情况下以纯 JavaScript 方式使用。如果你的用例只需要给静态 HTML 添加一些简单的交互，你可以看看 <a href=\"https://github.com/vuejs/petite-vue\" target=\"_blank\">petite-vue<a>，它是一个 6 kB 左右、预优化过的 Vue 子集，更适合渐进式增强的需求。<p><h2 id=\"how-it-works\">单文件组件是如何工作的 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#how-it-works\">​<a><h2><p>Vue 单文件组件是一个框架指定的文件格式，因此必须交由 <a href=\"https://github.com/vuejs/core/tree/main/packages/compiler-sfc\" target=\"_blank\">@vue/compiler-sfc<a> 编译为标准的 JavaScript 和 CSS，", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/scaling-up/sfc.html", "title": "单文件组件", "doc_id": "4b75c5febe4f4f049b568b54400d5e62", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 256, "chunk_index": 11, "_doc_id": "11_4177514796086955104"}}
{"doc_id": "12_4669932154311836796", "text": "/core/tree/main/packages/compiler-sfc\" target=\"_blank\">@vue/compiler-sfc<a> 编译为标准的 JavaScript 和 CSS，一个编译后的单文件组件是一个标准的 JavaScript(ES) 模块，这也意味着在构建配置正确的前提下，你可以像导入其他 ES 模块一样导入单文件组件：<p><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>import<span><span> MyComponent <span><span>from<span><span> './MyComponent.vue'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/scaling-up/sfc.html", "title": "单文件组件", "doc_id": "4b75c5febe4f4f049b568b54400d5e62", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 256, "chunk_index": 12, "_doc_id": "12_4669932154311836796"}}
{"doc_id": "13_7593979449652273742", "text": "n class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> components: {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> MyComponent<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span><code><pre><div><p>单文件组件中的 <code><style><code> 标签一般会在开发时注入成原生的 <code><style><code> 标签以支持热更新，而生产环境下它们会被抽取、合并成单独的 CSS 文件。<p><p>你可以在 <a href=\"https://play.vuejs.org/\" target=\"_blank\">Vue 单文件组件演练场<a>中实际使用一下单文件组件，同时可以看到它们最终被编译后的样子。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/scaling-up/sfc.html", "title": "单文件组件", "doc_id": "4b75c5febe4f4f049b568b54400d5e62", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 256, "chunk_index": 13, "_doc_id": "13_7593979449652273742"}}
{"doc_id": "14_2668162872365937160", "text": "可以在 <a href=\"https://play.vuejs.org/\" target=\"_blank\">Vue 单文件组件演练场<a>中实际使用一下单文件组件，同时可以看到它们最终被编译后的样子。<p><p>在实际项目中，我们一般会使用集成了单文件组件编译器的构建工具，比如 <a href=\"https://cn.vitejs.dev/\" target=\"_blank\">Vite<a> 或者 <a href=\"https://cli.vuejs.org/zh/\" target=\"_blank\">Vue CLI<a> (基于 <a href=\"https://webpack.js.org/\" target=\"_blank\">webpack<a>)，Vue 官方也提供了脚手架工具来帮助你尽可能快速地上手开发单文件组件。更多细节请查看<a href=\"/guide/scaling-up/tooling.html\">单文件组件工具链<a>章节。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/scaling-up/sfc.html", "title": "单文件组件", "doc_id": "4b75c5febe4f4f049b568b54400d5e62", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 256, "chunk_index": 14, "_doc_id": "14_2668162872365937160"}}
{"doc_id": "15_1891549839648477526", "text": ">)，Vue 官方也提供了脚手架工具来帮助你尽可能快速地上手开发单文件组件。更多细节请查看<a href=\"/guide/scaling-up/tooling.html\">单文件组件工具链<a>章节。<p><h2 id=\"what-about-separation-of-concerns\">如何看待关注点分离？ <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#what-about-separation-of-concerns\">​<a><h2><p>一些有着传统 Web 开发背景的用户可能会因为单文件组件将不同的关注点集合在一处而有所顾虑，觉得 HTML/CSS/JS 应当是分离开的！<p><p>要回答这个问题，我们必须对这一点达成共识：<strong>前端开发的关注点不是完全基于文件类型分离的<strong>。前端工程化的最终目的都是为了能够更好地维护代码。关注点分离不应该是教条式地将其视为文件类型的区别和分离，仅仅这样并不够帮我们在日益复杂的前端应用的背景下提高开发效率。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/scaling-up/sfc.html", "title": "单文件组件", "doc_id": "4b75c5febe4f4f049b568b54400d5e62", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 256, "chunk_index": 15, "_doc_id": "15_1891549839648477526"}}
{"doc_id": "16_5012689592418377534", "text": "于文件类型分离的<strong>。前端工程化的最终目的都是为了能够更好地维护代码。关注点分离不应该是教条式地将其视为文件类型的区别和分离，仅仅这样并不够帮我们在日益复杂的前端应用的背景下提高开发效率。<p><p>在现代的 UI 开发中，我们发现与其将代码库划分为三个巨大的层，相互交织在一起，不如将它们划分为松散耦合的组件，再按需组合起来。在一个组件中，其模板、逻辑和样式本就是有内在联系的、是耦合的，将它们放在一起，实际上使组件更有内聚性和可维护性。<p><p>即使你不喜欢单文件组件这样的形式而仍然选择拆分单独的 JavaScript 和 CSS 文件，也没关系，你还是可以通过<a href=\"/api/sfc-spec.html#src-imports\">资源导入<a>功能获得热更新和预编译等功能的支持。<p><div><div>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/scaling-up/sfc.html", "title": "单文件组件", "doc_id": "4b75c5febe4f4f049b568b54400d5e62", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 256, "chunk_index": 16, "_doc_id": "16_5012689592418377534"}}
{"doc_id": "0_6219279512744696546", "text": "<div><div class=\"VPContentPage\"><main><div><div><section id=\"highlights\" class=\"vt-box-container\"><div class=\"vt-box\"><h2>易学易用<h2><p> 基于标准 HTML、CSS 和 JavaScript 构建，提供容易上手的 API 和一流的文档。 <p><div><div class=\"vt-box\"><h2>性能出色<h2><p>经过编译器优化、完全响应式的渲染系统，几乎不需要手动优化。<p><div><div class=\"vt-box\"><h2>灵活多变<h2><p> 丰富的、可渐进式集成的生态系统，可以根据应用规模在库和框架间切换自如。 <p><div><section><section id=\"spsrs\"><h2>Platinum Sponsors<h2><h2>Gold Sponsors<h2><section><div><div><main><div><div>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/", "title": "Vue.js - 渐进式 JavaScript 框架", "doc_id": "f0ed4511eacc4a03aae41efe7ec7293a", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 20, "chunk_index": 0, "_doc_id": "0_6219279512744696546"}}
{"doc_id": "0_6195690396277888618", "text": "<div><div><h1 id=\"introduction\">简介 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#introduction\">​<a><h1><h2 id=\"what-is-vue\">什么是 Vue？ <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#what-is-vue\">​<a><h2><p>Vue (发音为 /vjuː/，类似 <strong>view<strong>) 是一款用于构建用户界面的 JavaScript 框架。它基于标准 HTML、CSS 和 JavaScript 构建，并提供了一套声明式的、组件化的编程模型，帮助你高效地开发用户界面。无论是简单还是复杂的界面，Vue 都可以胜任。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/introduction.html", "title": "简介 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "1a5bbf7a0a6f4ff48e4aaf5d535f42a3", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 608, "chunk_index": 0, "_doc_id": "0_6195690396277888618"}}
{"doc_id": "1_2310898484692219515", "text": "avaScript 框架。它基于标准 HTML、CSS 和 JavaScript 构建，并提供了一套声明式的、组件化的编程模型，帮助你高效地开发用户界面。无论是简单还是复杂的界面，Vue 都可以胜任。<p><p>下面是一个最基本的示例：<p><div class=\"options-api\"><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>import<span><span> { createApp } <span><span>from<span><span> 'vue'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>createApp<span><span>({<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> data<span><span>() {<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/introduction.html", "title": "简介 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "1a5bbf7a0a6f4ff48e4aaf5d535f42a3", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 608, "chunk_index": 1, "_doc_id": "1_2310898484692219515"}}
{"doc_id": "2_9088306374990737604", "text": "span>createApp<span><span>({<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> data<span><span>() {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> return<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> count: <span><span>0<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/introduction.html", "title": "简介 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "1a5bbf7a0a6f4ff48e4aaf5d535f42a3", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 608, "chunk_index": 2, "_doc_id": "2_9088306374990737604"}}
{"doc_id": "3_4137586470103774591", "text": "<span>0<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}).<span><span>mount<span><span>(<span><span>'#app'<span><span>)<span><span><code><pre><div><div><div class=\"composition-api\"><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>import<span><span> { createApp, ref } <span><span>from<span><span> 'vue'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/introduction.html", "title": "简介 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "1a5bbf7a0a6f4ff48e4aaf5d535f42a3", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 608, "chunk_index": 3, "_doc_id": "3_4137586470103774591"}}
{"doc_id": "4_6823495640349235277", "text": "><span> { createApp, ref } <span><span>from<span><span> 'vue'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>createApp<span><span>({<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> setup<span><span>() {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> return<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> count: <span><span>ref<span><span>(<span><span>0<span><span>)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/introduction.html", "title": "简介 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "1a5bbf7a0a6f4ff48e4aaf5d535f42a3", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 608, "chunk_index": 4, "_doc_id": "4_6823495640349235277"}}
{"doc_id": "5_7663912033941130300", "text": "<span>)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}).<span><span>mount<span><span>(<span><span>'#app'<span><span>)<span><span><code><pre><div><div><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>div<span><span> id<span><span>=<span><span>\"app\"<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/introduction.html", "title": "简介 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "1a5bbf7a0a6f4ff48e4aaf5d535f42a3", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 608, "chunk_index": 5, "_doc_id": "5_7663912033941130300"}}
{"doc_id": "6_2778405578743970960", "text": "\"line\"><span><<span><span>div<span><span> id<span><span>=<span><span>\"app\"<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>button<span><span> @<span><span>click<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>count<span><span>++<span><span>\"<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> Count is: {{ count }}<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> </<span><span>button<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/introduction.html", "title": "简介 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "1a5bbf7a0a6f4ff48e4aaf5d535f42a3", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 608, "chunk_index": 6, "_doc_id": "6_2778405578743970960"}}
{"doc_id": "7_1884745853012702980", "text": "is: {{ count }}<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> </<span><span>button<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>div<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p><strong>结果展示<strong><p><p class=\"demo\"> Count is: 0 <p><p>上面的示例展示了 Vue 的两个核心功能：<p><p>你可能已经有了些疑问——先别急，在后续的文档中我们会详细介绍每一个细节。现在，请继续看下去，以确保你对 Vue 作为一个框架到底提供了什么有一个宏观的了解。<p><div class=\"tip custom-block\"><p class=\"custom-block-title\">预备知识<p><p>文档接下来的内容会假设你对 HTML、CSS 和 JavaScript 已经基本熟悉。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/introduction.html", "title": "简介 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "1a5bbf7a0a6f4ff48e4aaf5d535f42a3", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 608, "chunk_index": 7, "_doc_id": "7_1884745853012702980"}}
{"doc_id": "8_7395723620062868592", "text": "ip custom-block\"><p class=\"custom-block-title\">预备知识<p><p>文档接下来的内容会假设你对 HTML、CSS 和 JavaScript 已经基本熟悉。如果你对前端开发完全陌生，最好不要直接从一个框架开始进行入门学习——最好是掌握了基础知识再回到这里。如有需要，你可以通过这些 <a href=\"https://developer.mozilla.org/zh-CN/docs/Web/JavaScript/A_re-introduction_to_JavaScript\" target=\"_blank\">JavaScript<a>、<a href=\"https://developer.mozilla.org/zh-CN/docs/Learn/HTML/Introduction_to_HTML\" target=\"_blank\">HTML<a> 和 <a href=\"https://developer.mozilla.org/zh-CN/docs/Learn/CSS/First_steps\" target=\"_blank\">CSS<a> 概述来检验你的知识水平。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/introduction.html", "title": "简介 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "1a5bbf7a0a6f4ff48e4aaf5d535f42a3", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 608, "chunk_index": 8, "_doc_id": "8_7395723620062868592"}}
{"doc_id": "9_4378384526126207920", "text": "\"https://developer.mozilla.org/zh-CN/docs/Learn/CSS/First_steps\" target=\"_blank\">CSS<a> 概述来检验你的知识水平。如果之前有其他框架的经验会很有帮助，但也不是必须的。<p><div><h2 id=\"the-progressive-framework\">渐进式框架 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#the-progressive-framework\">​<a><h2><p>Vue 是一个框架，也是一个生态。其功能覆盖了大部分前端开发常见的需求。但 Web 世界是十分多样化的，不同的开发者在 Web 上构建的东西可能在形式和规模上会有很大的不同。考虑到这一点，Vue 的设计非常注重灵活性和“可以被逐步集成”这个特点。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/introduction.html", "title": "简介 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "1a5bbf7a0a6f4ff48e4aaf5d535f42a3", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 608, "chunk_index": 9, "_doc_id": "9_4378384526126207920"}}
{"doc_id": "10_6469574026980243246", "text": "大部分前端开发常见的需求。但 Web 世界是十分多样化的，不同的开发者在 Web 上构建的东西可能在形式和规模上会有很大的不同。考虑到这一点，Vue 的设计非常注重灵活性和“可以被逐步集成”这个特点。根据你的需求场景，你可以用不同的方式使用 Vue：<p><ul><li>无需构建步骤，渐进式增强静态的 HTML<li><li>在任何页面中作为 Web Components 嵌入<li><li>单页应用 (SPA)<li><li>全栈 / 服务端渲染 (SSR)<li><li>Jamstack / 静态站点生成 (SSG)<li><li>开发桌面端、移动端、WebGL，甚至是命令行终端中的界面<li><ul><p>如果你是初学者，可能会觉得这些概念有些复杂。别担心！理解教程和指南的内容只需要具备基础的 HTML 和 JavaScript 知识。即使你不是这些方面的专家，也能够跟得上。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/introduction.html", "title": "简介 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "1a5bbf7a0a6f4ff48e4aaf5d535f42a3", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 608, "chunk_index": 10, "_doc_id": "10_6469574026980243246"}}
{"doc_id": "11_4640243842580244956", "text": "的界面<li><ul><p>如果你是初学者，可能会觉得这些概念有些复杂。别担心！理解教程和指南的内容只需要具备基础的 HTML 和 JavaScript 知识。即使你不是这些方面的专家，也能够跟得上。<p><p>如果你是有经验的开发者，希望了解如何以最合适的方式在项目中引入 Vue，或者是对上述的这些概念感到好奇，我们在<a href=\"/guide/extras/ways-of-using-vue.html\">使用 Vue 的多种方式<a>中讨论了有关它们的更多细节。<p><p>无论再怎么灵活，Vue 的核心知识在所有这些用例中都是通用的。即使你现在只是一个初学者，随着你的不断成长，到未来有能力实现更复杂的项目时，这一路上获得的知识依然会适用。如果你已经是一个老手，你可以根据实际场景来选择使用 Vue 的最佳方式，在各种场景下都可以保持同样的开发效率。这就是为什么我们将 Vue 称为“渐进式框架”：它是一个可以与你共同成长、适应你不同需求的框架。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/introduction.html", "title": "简介 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "1a5bbf7a0a6f4ff48e4aaf5d535f42a3", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 608, "chunk_index": 11, "_doc_id": "11_4640243842580244956"}}
{"doc_id": "12_2529682173667876941", "text": "已经是一个老手，你可以根据实际场景来选择使用 Vue 的最佳方式，在各种场景下都可以保持同样的开发效率。这就是为什么我们将 Vue 称为“渐进式框架”：它是一个可以与你共同成长、适应你不同需求的框架。<p><h2 id=\"single-file-components\">单文件组件 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#single-file-components\">​<a><h2><p>在大多数启用了构建工具的 Vue 项目中，我们可以使用一种类似 HTML 格式的文件来书写 Vue 组件，它被称为<strong>单文件组件<strong> (也被称为 <code>*.vue<code> 文件，英文 Single-File Components，缩写为 <strong>SFC<strong>)。顾名思义，Vue 的单文件组件会将一个组件的逻辑 (JavaScript)，模板 (HTML) 和样式 (CSS) 封装在同一个文件里。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/introduction.html", "title": "简介 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "1a5bbf7a0a6f4ff48e4aaf5d535f42a3", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 608, "chunk_index": 12, "_doc_id": "12_2529682173667876941"}}
{"doc_id": "13_5617914003319960098", "text": "onents，缩写为 <strong>SFC<strong>)。顾名思义，Vue 的单文件组件会将一个组件的逻辑 (JavaScript)，模板 (HTML) 和样式 (CSS) 封装在同一个文件里。下面我们将用单文件组件的格式重写上面的计数器示例：<p><div class=\"options-api\"><div class=\"language-vue\"> <span class=\"lang\">vue<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>script<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> data<span><span>() {<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/introduction.html", "title": "简介 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "1a5bbf7a0a6f4ff48e4aaf5d535f42a3", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 608, "chunk_index": 13, "_doc_id": "13_5617914003319960098"}}
{"doc_id": "14_8565640116576850227", "text": "<span> default<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> data<span><span>() {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> return<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> count: <span><span>0<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>script<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/introduction.html", "title": "简介 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "1a5bbf7a0a6f4ff48e4aaf5d535f42a3", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 608, "chunk_index": 14, "_doc_id": "14_8565640116576850227"}}
{"doc_id": "15_6260419395909631856", "text": ">\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>button<span><span> @click<span><span>=<span><span>\"count++\"<span><span>>Count is: {{ count }}</<span><span>button<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>style<span><span> scoped<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/introduction.html", "title": "简介 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "1a5bbf7a0a6f4ff48e4aaf5d535f42a3", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 608, "chunk_index": 15, "_doc_id": "15_6260419395909631856"}}
{"doc_id": "16_4175312891501675067", "text": "ine\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>style<span><span> scoped<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>button<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> font-weight<span><span>: <span><span>bold<span><span>;<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/introduction.html", "title": "简介 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "1a5bbf7a0a6f4ff48e4aaf5d535f42a3", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 608, "chunk_index": 16, "_doc_id": "16_4175312891501675067"}}
{"doc_id": "17_4813006113887291885", "text": "eight<span><span>: <span><span>bold<span><span>;<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>style<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><div><div class=\"composition-api\"><div class=\"language-vue\"> <span class=\"lang\">vue<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>script<span><span> setup<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>import<span><span> { ref } <span><span>from<span><span> 'vue'<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/introduction.html", "title": "简介 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "1a5bbf7a0a6f4ff48e4aaf5d535f42a3", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 608, "chunk_index": 17, "_doc_id": "17_4813006113887291885"}}
{"doc_id": "18_1836124839863404144", "text": "<span class=\"line\"><span>import<span><span> { ref } <span><span>from<span><span> 'vue'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> count<span><span> =<span><span> ref<span><span>(<span><span>0<span><span>)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>script<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/introduction.html", "title": "简介 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "1a5bbf7a0a6f4ff48e4aaf5d535f42a3", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 608, "chunk_index": 18, "_doc_id": "18_1836124839863404144"}}
{"doc_id": "19_6260419395909631856", "text": ">\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>button<span><span> @click<span><span>=<span><span>\"count++\"<span><span>>Count is: {{ count }}</<span><span>button<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>style<span><span> scoped<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/introduction.html", "title": "简介 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "1a5bbf7a0a6f4ff48e4aaf5d535f42a3", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 608, "chunk_index": 19, "_doc_id": "19_6260419395909631856"}}
{"doc_id": "20_8949425938603497908", "text": "ine\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>style<span><span> scoped<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>button<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> font-weight<span><span>: <span><span>bold<span><span>;<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>style<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><div><p>单文件组件是 Vue 的标志性功能。如果你的用例需要进行构建，我们推荐用它来编写 Vue 组件。你可以在后续相关章节里了解更多关于<a href=\"/guide/scaling-up/sfc.html\">单文件组件的用法及用途<a>。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/introduction.html", "title": "简介 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "1a5bbf7a0a6f4ff48e4aaf5d535f42a3", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 608, "chunk_index": 20, "_doc_id": "20_8949425938603497908"}}
{"doc_id": "21_5674691541579578437", "text": "。如果你的用例需要进行构建，我们推荐用它来编写 Vue 组件。你可以在后续相关章节里了解更多关于<a href=\"/guide/scaling-up/sfc.html\">单文件组件的用法及用途<a>。但你暂时只需要知道 Vue 会帮忙处理所有这些构建工具的配置就好。<p><h2 id=\"api-styles\">API 风格 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#api-styles\">​<a><h2><p>Vue 的组件可以按两种不同的风格书写：<strong>选项式 API<strong> 和<strong>组合式 API<strong>。<p><h3 id=\"options-api\">选项式 API (Options API) <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#options-api\">​<a><h3><p>使用选项式 API，我们可以用包含多个选项的对象来描述组件的逻辑，例如 <code>data<code>、<code>methods<code> 和 <code>mounted<code>。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/introduction.html", "title": "简介 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "1a5bbf7a0a6f4ff48e4aaf5d535f42a3", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 608, "chunk_index": 21, "_doc_id": "21_5674691541579578437"}}
{"doc_id": "22_2215028053069610680", "text": "3><p>使用选项式 API，我们可以用包含多个选项的对象来描述组件的逻辑，例如 <code>data<code>、<code>methods<code> 和 <code>mounted<code>。选项所定义的属性都会暴露在函数内部的 <code>this<code> 上，它会指向当前的组件实例。<p><div class=\"language-vue\"> <span class=\"lang\">vue<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>script<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // data() 返回的属性将会成为响应式的状态<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/introduction.html", "title": "简介 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "1a5bbf7a0a6f4ff48e4aaf5d535f42a3", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 608, "chunk_index": 22, "_doc_id": "22_2215028053069610680"}}
{"doc_id": "23_7683725257088490179", "text": "> default<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // data() 返回的属性将会成为响应式的状态<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 并且暴露在 `this` 上<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> data<span><span>() {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> return<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> count: <span><span>0<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> },<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // methods 是一些用来更改状态与触发更新的函数<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/introduction.html", "title": "简介 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "1a5bbf7a0a6f4ff48e4aaf5d535f42a3", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 608, "chunk_index": 23, "_doc_id": "23_7683725257088490179"}}
{"doc_id": "24_8301187445160809254", "text": "<span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // methods 是一些用来更改状态与触发更新的函数<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 它们可以在模板中作为事件处理器绑定<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> methods: {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> increment<span><span>() {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> this<span><span>.count<span><span>++<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> },<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/introduction.html", "title": "简介 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "1a5bbf7a0a6f4ff48e4aaf5d535f42a3", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 608, "chunk_index": 24, "_doc_id": "24_8301187445160809254"}}
{"doc_id": "25_3637227316009041358", "text": "lass=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> },<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 生命周期钩子会在组件生命周期的各个不同阶段被调用<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 例如这个函数就会在组件挂载完成后被调用<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> mounted<span><span>() {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> console.<span><span>log<span><span>(<span><span>`The initial count is ${<span><span>this<span><span>.<span><span>count<span><span>}.`<span><span>)<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/introduction.html", "title": "简介 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "1a5bbf7a0a6f4ff48e4aaf5d535f42a3", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 608, "chunk_index": 25, "_doc_id": "25_3637227316009041358"}}
{"doc_id": "26_8069774467973902824", "text": "l count is ${<span><span>this<span><span>.<span><span>count<span><span>}.`<span><span>)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>script<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/introduction.html", "title": "简介 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "1a5bbf7a0a6f4ff48e4aaf5d535f42a3", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 608, "chunk_index": 26, "_doc_id": "26_8069774467973902824"}}
{"doc_id": "27_4142232790080792802", "text": ">\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>button<span><span> @click<span><span>=<span><span>\"increment\"<span><span>>Count is: {{ count }}</<span><span>button<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p><a href=\"https://play.vuejs.", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/introduction.html", "title": "简介 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "1a5bbf7a0a6f4ff48e4aaf5d535f42a3", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 608, "chunk_index": 27, "_doc_id": "27_4142232790080792802"}}
{"doc_id": "28_2213952547221158404", "text": "<span></<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p><a href=\"https://play.vuejs.org/#\" target=\"_blank\">在演练场中尝试一下<a><p><h3 id=\"composition-api\">组合式 API (Composition API) <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#composition-api\">​<a><h3><p>通过组合式 API，", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/introduction.html", "title": "简介 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "1a5bbf7a0a6f4ff48e4aaf5d535f42a3", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 608, "chunk_index": 28, "_doc_id": "28_2213952547221158404"}}
{"doc_id": "29_1651189994659790155", "text": "pi\">组合式 API (Composition API) <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#composition-api\">​<a><h3><p>通过组合式 API，我们可以使用导入的 API 函数来描述组件逻辑。在单文件组件中，组合式 API 通常会与 <a href=\"/api/sfc-script-setup.html\"><code><script setup><code><a> 搭配使用。这个 <code>setup<code> attribute 是一个标识，告诉 Vue 需要在编译时进行一些处理，让我们可以更简洁地使用组合式 API。比如，<code><script setup><code> 中的导入和顶层变量/函数都能够在模板中直接使用。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/introduction.html", "title": "简介 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "1a5bbf7a0a6f4ff48e4aaf5d535f42a3", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 608, "chunk_index": 29, "_doc_id": "29_1651189994659790155"}}
{"doc_id": "30_5612223095310491903", "text": "是一个标识，告诉 Vue 需要在编译时进行一些处理，让我们可以更简洁地使用组合式 API。比如，<code><script setup><code> 中的导入和顶层变量/函数都能够在模板中直接使用。<p><p>下面是使用了组合式 API 与 <code><script setup><code> 改造后和上面的模板完全一样的组件：<p><div class=\"language-vue\"> <span class=\"lang\">vue<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>script<span><span> setup<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>import<span><span> { ref, onMounted } <span><span>from<span><span> 'vue'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/introduction.html", "title": "简介 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "1a5bbf7a0a6f4ff48e4aaf5d535f42a3", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 608, "chunk_index": 30, "_doc_id": "30_5612223095310491903"}}
{"doc_id": "31_7884051637221108308", "text": "><span> { ref, onMounted } <span><span>from<span><span> 'vue'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 响应式状态<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> count<span><span> =<span><span> ref<span><span>(<span><span>0<span><span>)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 用来修改状态、触发更新的函数<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>function<span><span> increment<span><span>() {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> count.value<span><span>++<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/introduction.html", "title": "简介 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "1a5bbf7a0a6f4ff48e4aaf5d535f42a3", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 608, "chunk_index": 31, "_doc_id": "31_7884051637221108308"}}
{"doc_id": "32_348882740248355580", "text": "crement<span><span>() {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> count.value<span><span>++<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 生命周期钩子<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>onMounted<span><span>(() <span><span>=><span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> console.<span><span>log<span><span>(<span><span>`The initial count is ${<span><span>count<span><span>.<span><span>value<span><span>}.`<span><span>)<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/introduction.html", "title": "简介 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "1a5bbf7a0a6f4ff48e4aaf5d535f42a3", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 608, "chunk_index": 32, "_doc_id": "32_348882740248355580"}}
{"doc_id": "33_5907192768914987514", "text": "count is ${<span><span>count<span><span>.<span><span>value<span><span>}.`<span><span>)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>})<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>script<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>button<span><span> @click<span><span>=<span><span>\"increment\"<span><span>>Count is: {{ count }}</<span><span>button<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/introduction.html", "title": "简介 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "1a5bbf7a0a6f4ff48e4aaf5d535f42a3", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 608, "chunk_index": 33, "_doc_id": "33_5907192768914987514"}}
{"doc_id": "34_6320785963014803155", "text": "an><span>\"increment\"<span><span>>Count is: {{ count }}</<span><span>button<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p><a href=\"https://play.vuejs.", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/introduction.html", "title": "简介 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "1a5bbf7a0a6f4ff48e4aaf5d535f42a3", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 608, "chunk_index": 34, "_doc_id": "34_6320785963014803155"}}
{"doc_id": "35_7956677031619130184", "text": "<span></<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p><a href=\"https://play.vuejs.org/#\" target=\"_blank\">在演练场中尝试一下<a><p><h3 id=\"which-to-choose\">该选哪一个？", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/introduction.html", "title": "简介 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "1a5bbf7a0a6f4ff48e4aaf5d535f42a3", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 608, "chunk_index": 35, "_doc_id": "35_7956677031619130184"}}
{"doc_id": "36_4418537480255177406", "text": "rIrr5+Z7hnneQnJu6hURvKl3ryL/ARrVkuI=\" target=\"_blank\">在演练场中尝试一下<a><p><h3 id=\"which-to-choose\">该选哪一个？ <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#which-to-choose\">​<a><h3><p>两种 API 风格都能够覆盖大部分的应用场景。它们只是同一个底层系统所提供的两套不同的接口。实际上，选项式 API 是在组合式 API 的基础上实现的！关于 Vue 的基础概念和知识在它们之间都是通用的。<p><p>选项式 API 以“组件实例”的概念为中心 (即上述例子中的 <code>this<code>)，对于有面向对象语言背景的用户来说，这通常与基于类的心智模型更为一致。同时，它将响应性相关的细节抽象出来，并强制按照选项来组织代码，从而对初学者而言更为友好。<p><p>组合式 API 的核心思想是直接在函数作用域内定义响应式状态变量，并将从多个函数中得到的状态组合起来处理复杂问题。这种形式更加自由，也需要你对 Vue 的响应式系统有更深的理解才能高效使用。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/introduction.html", "title": "简介 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "1a5bbf7a0a6f4ff48e4aaf5d535f42a3", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 608, "chunk_index": 36, "_doc_id": "36_4418537480255177406"}}
{"doc_id": "37_6591830192225633564", "text": "p><p>组合式 API 的核心思想是直接在函数作用域内定义响应式状态变量，并将从多个函数中得到的状态组合起来处理复杂问题。这种形式更加自由，也需要你对 Vue 的响应式系统有更深的理解才能高效使用。相应的，它的灵活性也使得组织和重用逻辑的模式变得更加强大。<p><p>在<a href=\"/guide/extras/composition-api-faq.html\">组合式 API FAQ<a> 章节中，你可以了解更多关于这两种 API 风格的对比以及组合式 API 所带来的潜在收益。<p><p>如果你是使用 Vue 的新手，这里是我们的大致建议：<p><p>在学习阶段，你不必只固守一种风格。在接下来的文档中我们会为你提供一系列两种风格的代码供你参考，你可以随时通过左上角的 <strong>API 风格偏好<strong>来做切换。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/introduction.html", "title": "简介 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "1a5bbf7a0a6f4ff48e4aaf5d535f42a3", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 608, "chunk_index": 37, "_doc_id": "37_6591830192225633564"}}
{"doc_id": "38_8922799502895209953", "text": "的大致建议：<p><p>在学习阶段，你不必只固守一种风格。在接下来的文档中我们会为你提供一系列两种风格的代码供你参考，你可以随时通过左上角的 <strong>API 风格偏好<strong>来做切换。<p><h2 id=\"still-got-questions\">还有其他问题？ <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#still-got-questions\">​<a><h2><p>请查看我们的 <a href=\"/about/faq.html\">FAQ<a>。<p><h2 id=\"pick-your-learning-path\">选择你的学习路径 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#pick-your-learning-path\">​<a><h2><p>不同的开发者有不同的学习方式。尽管在可能的情况下，我们推荐你通读所有内容，但你还是可以自由地选择一种自己喜欢的学习路径！<p><div><div>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/introduction.html", "title": "简介 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "1a5bbf7a0a6f4ff48e4aaf5d535f42a3", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 608, "chunk_index": 38, "_doc_id": "38_8922799502895209953"}}
{"doc_id": "0_6462269543149645913", "text": "[Failed to extract content from: https://cn.vuejs.org/tutorial/]", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/tutorial/", "title": "教程 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "3115fa394b794928bec2b37332cfc7b2", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 6, "chunk_index": 0, "_doc_id": "0_6462269543149645913"}}
{"doc_id": "0_5839064835071171507", "text": "[Failed to extract content from: https://cn.vuejs.org/examples/]", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/examples/", "title": "Examples | Vue.js", "doc_id": "5378a1e450b0439b829693bef9a1224f", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 6, "chunk_index": 0, "_doc_id": "0_5839064835071171507"}}
{"doc_id": "0_1615485368175932531", "text": "<div><div><h1 id=\"quick-start\">快速上手 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#quick-start\">​<a><h1><h2 id=\"try-vue-online\">线上尝试 Vue <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#try-vue-online\">​<a><h2><ul><li><p>想要快速体验 Vue，你可以直接试试我们的<a href=\"https://play.vuejs.org/#eNo9jcEKwjAMhl/lt5fpQYfXUQfefAMvvRQbddC1pUuHUPrudg4HIcmXjyRZXEM4zYlEJ+T0iEPgXjn6BB8Zhp46WUZWDjCa9f6w9kAkTtH9CRinV4fmRtZ63H20Ztesqiylphqy3R5UYBqD1UyVAPk+9zkvV1CKbCv9poMLiTEfR2/IXpSoXomqZLtti/IFwVtA9A==\" target=\"_blank\">演练场<a>。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/quick-start.html", "title": "快速上手", "doc_id": "59da9a6a0d63458d824757435bde6942", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 917, "chunk_index": 0, "_doc_id": "0_1615485368175932531"}}
{"doc_id": "1_448578590276352887", "text": "tesqiylphqy3R5UYBqD1UyVAPk+9zkvV1CKbCv9poMLiTEfR2/IXpSoXomqZLtti/IFwVtA9A==\" target=\"_blank\">演练场<a>。<p><li><li><p>如果你更喜欢不用任何构建的原始 HTML，可以使用 <a href=\"https://jsfiddle.net/yyx990803/2ke1ab0z/\" target=\"_blank\">JSFiddle<a> 入门。<p><li><li><p>如果你已经比较熟悉 Node.js 和构建工具等概念，还可以直接在浏览器中打开 <a href=\"https://vite.new/vue\" target=\"_blank\">StackBlitz<a> 来尝试完整的构建设置。<p><li><li><p>要了解推荐的设置流程，请观看这个互动式 <a href=\"http://scrimba.com/links/vue-quickstart\" target=\"_blank\">Scrimba<a> 教程，它将向你展示如何运行、编辑和部署你的第一个 Vue 应用程序。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/quick-start.html", "title": "快速上手", "doc_id": "59da9a6a0d63458d824757435bde6942", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 917, "chunk_index": 1, "_doc_id": "1_448578590276352887"}}
{"doc_id": "2_5635796089350598128", "text": "tp://scrimba.com/links/vue-quickstart\" target=\"_blank\">Scrimba<a> 教程，它将向你展示如何运行、编辑和部署你的第一个 Vue 应用程序。<p><li><ul><h2 id=\"creating-a-vue-application\">创建一个 Vue 应用 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#creating-a-vue-application\">​<a><h2><div class=\"tip custom-block\"><p class=\"custom-block-title\">前提条件<p><ul><li>熟悉命令行<li><li>已安装 <code>^20.19.0 || >=22.12.0<code> 版本的 <a href=\"https://nodejs.org/\" target=\"_blank\">Node.js<a><li><ul><div><p>在本节中，我们将介绍如何在本地搭建 Vue <a href=\"/guide/extras/ways-of-using-vue.html#single-page-application-spa\">单页应用<a>。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/quick-start.html", "title": "快速上手", "doc_id": "59da9a6a0d63458d824757435bde6942", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 917, "chunk_index": 2, "_doc_id": "2_5635796089350598128"}}
{"doc_id": "3_8819010006553855707", "text": "我们将介绍如何在本地搭建 Vue <a href=\"/guide/extras/ways-of-using-vue.html#single-page-application-spa\">单页应用<a>。创建的项目将使用基于 <a href=\"https://vite.dev\" target=\"_blank\">Vite<a> 的构建设置，并允许我们使用 Vue 的<a href=\"/guide/scaling-up/sfc.html\">单文件组件<a> (SFC)。<p><p>确保你安装了最新版本的 <a href=\"https://nodejs.org/\" target=\"_blank\">Node.js<a>，并且你的当前工作目录正是打算创建项目的目录。在命令行中运行以下命令 (不要带上 <code>$<code> 符号)：<p><p>这一指令将会安装并执行 <a href=\"https://github.com/vuejs/create-vue\" target=\"_blank\">create-vue<a>，它是 Vue 官方的项目脚手架工具。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/quick-start.html", "title": "快速上手", "doc_id": "59da9a6a0d63458d824757435bde6942", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 917, "chunk_index": 3, "_doc_id": "3_8819010006553855707"}}
{"doc_id": "4_1151913700091246665", "text": "安装并执行 <a href=\"https://github.com/vuejs/create-vue\" target=\"_blank\">create-vue<a>，它是 Vue 官方的项目脚手架工具。你将会看到一些诸如 TypeScript 和测试支持之类的可选功能提示：<p><div class=\"language-sh\"><pre><code><span>✔<span> <span>Project name: <span>… <span><<span><span>your-project-name<span><span>><span><span><span>\n<span>✔<span> <span>Add TypeScript? <span>… <span>No<span> / Yes<span><span>\n<span>✔<span> <span>Add JSX Support? <span>… <span>No<span> / Yes<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/quick-start.html", "title": "快速上手", "doc_id": "59da9a6a0d63458d824757435bde6942", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 917, "chunk_index": 4, "_doc_id": "4_1151913700091246665"}}
{"doc_id": "5_4677394688286456913", "text": "an> / Yes<span><span>\n<span>✔<span> <span>Add JSX Support? <span>… <span>No<span> / Yes<span><span>\n<span>✔<span> <span>Add Vue Router for Single Page Application development? <span>… <span>No<span> / Yes<span><span>\n<span>✔<span> <span>Add Pinia for state management? <span>… <span>No<span> / Yes<span><span>\n<span>✔<span> <span>Add Vitest for Unit testing? <span>… <span>No<span> / Yes<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/quick-start.html", "title": "快速上手", "doc_id": "59da9a6a0d63458d824757435bde6942", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 917, "chunk_index": 5, "_doc_id": "5_4677394688286456913"}}
{"doc_id": "6_7551395008439014245", "text": "an><span>\n<span>✔<span> <span>Add Vitest for Unit testing? <span>… <span>No<span> / Yes<span><span>\n<span>✔<span> <span>Add an End-to-End Testing Solution? <span>… <span>No<span> / Cypress / Nightwatch / Playwright<span><span>\n<span>✔<span> <span>Add ESLint for code quality? <span>… No / <span>Yes<span><span><span>\n<span>✔<span> <span>Add Prettier for code formatting? <span>… <span>No<span> / Yes<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/quick-start.html", "title": "快速上手", "doc_id": "59da9a6a0d63458d824757435bde6942", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 917, "chunk_index": 6, "_doc_id": "6_7551395008439014245"}}
{"doc_id": "7_3121314937454500942", "text": "pan>\n<span>✔<span> <span>Add Prettier for code formatting? <span>… <span>No<span> / Yes<span><span>\n<span>✔<span> <span>Add Vue DevTools 7 extension for debugging? (experimental) <span>… <span>No<span> / Yes<span><span>\n<span><span>\n<span>Scaffolding project in ./<span><<span><span>your-project-name<span><span>><span>...<span>\n<span>Done.<span><code><pre><div><p>如果不确定是否要开启某个功能，你可以直接按下回车键选择 <code>No<code>。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/quick-start.html", "title": "快速上手", "doc_id": "59da9a6a0d63458d824757435bde6942", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 917, "chunk_index": 7, "_doc_id": "7_3121314937454500942"}}
{"doc_id": "8_5532841595297298484", "text": "pan>><span>...<span>\n<span>Done.<span><code><pre><div><p>如果不确定是否要开启某个功能，你可以直接按下回车键选择 <code>No<code>。在项目被创建后，通过以下步骤安装依赖并启动开发服务器：<p><p>你现在应该已经运行起来了你的第一个 Vue 项目！请注意，生成的项目中的示例组件使用的是<a href=\"/guide/introduction.html#composition-api\">组合式 API<a> 和 <code><script setup><code>，而非<a href=\"/guide/introduction.html#options-api\">选项式 API<a>。下面是一些补充提示：<p><p>当你准备将应用发布到生产环境时，请运行：<p><p>此命令会在 <code>./dist<code> 文件夹中为你的应用创建一个生产环境的构建版本。关于将应用上线生产环境的更多内容，请阅读<a href=\"/guide/best-practices/production-deployment.html\">生产环境部署指南<a>。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/quick-start.html", "title": "快速上手", "doc_id": "59da9a6a0d63458d824757435bde6942", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 917, "chunk_index": 8, "_doc_id": "8_5532841595297298484"}}
{"doc_id": "9_4107737519557241609", "text": "产环境的构建版本。关于将应用上线生产环境的更多内容，请阅读<a href=\"/guide/best-practices/production-deployment.html\">生产环境部署指南<a>。<p><p><a href=\"#next-steps\">下一步><a><p><h2 id=\"using-vue-from-cdn\">通过 CDN 使用 Vue <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#using-vue-from-cdn\">​<a><h2><p>你可以借助 script 标签直接通过 CDN 来使用 Vue：<p><div class=\"language-html\"> <span class=\"lang\">html<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>script<span><span> src<span><span>=<span><span>\"https://unpkg.com/vue@3/dist/vue.global.", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/quick-start.html", "title": "快速上手", "doc_id": "59da9a6a0d63458d824757435bde6942", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 917, "chunk_index": 9, "_doc_id": "9_4107737519557241609"}}
{"doc_id": "10_1787829703463142628", "text": "<span><span>script<span><span> src<span><span>=<span><span>\"https://unpkg.com/vue@3/dist/vue.global.js\"<span><span>></<span><span>script<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>这里我们使用了 <a href=\"https://unpkg.com/\" target=\"_blank\">unpkg<a>，但你也可以使用任何提供 npm 包服务的 CDN，例如 <a href=\"https://www.jsdelivr.com/package/npm/vue\" target=\"_blank\">jsdelivr<a> 或 <a href=\"https://cdnjs.com/libraries/vue\" target=\"_blank\">cdnjs<a>。当然，你也可以下载此文件并自行提供服务。<p><p>通过 CDN 使用 Vue 时，不涉及“构建步骤”。这使得设置更加简单，并且可以用于增强静态的 HTML 或与后端框架集成。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/quick-start.html", "title": "快速上手", "doc_id": "59da9a6a0d63458d824757435bde6942", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 917, "chunk_index": 10, "_doc_id": "10_1787829703463142628"}}
{"doc_id": "11_3921725347614218745", "text": "k\">cdnjs<a>。当然，你也可以下载此文件并自行提供服务。<p><p>通过 CDN 使用 Vue 时，不涉及“构建步骤”。这使得设置更加简单，并且可以用于增强静态的 HTML 或与后端框架集成。但是，你将无法使用单文件组件 (SFC) 语法。<p><h3 id=\"using-the-global-build\">使用全局构建版本 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#using-the-global-build\">​<a><h3><p>上面的链接使用了<em>全局构建版本<em>的 Vue，该版本的所有顶层 API 都以属性的形式暴露在了全局的 <code>Vue<code> 对象上。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/quick-start.html", "title": "快速上手", "doc_id": "59da9a6a0d63458d824757435bde6942", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 917, "chunk_index": 11, "_doc_id": "11_3921725347614218745"}}
{"doc_id": "12_7262445848462746567", "text": "lobal-build\">​<a><h3><p>上面的链接使用了<em>全局构建版本<em>的 Vue，该版本的所有顶层 API 都以属性的形式暴露在了全局的 <code>Vue<code> 对象上。这里有一个使用全局构建版本的例子：<p><div class=\"options-api\"><div class=\"language-html\"> <span class=\"lang\">html<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>script<span><span> src<span><span>=<span><span>\"https://unpkg.com/vue@3/dist/vue.global.js\"<span><span>></<span><span>script<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/quick-start.html", "title": "快速上手", "doc_id": "59da9a6a0d63458d824757435bde6942", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 917, "chunk_index": 12, "_doc_id": "12_7262445848462746567"}}
{"doc_id": "13_6977244499331648746", "text": "/vue.global.js\"<span><span>></<span><span>script<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>div<span><span> id<span><span>=<span><span>\"app\"<span><span>>{{ message }}</<span><span>div<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>script<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> const<span><span> { <span><span>createApp<span><span> } <span><span>=<span><span> Vue<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/quick-start.html", "title": "快速上手", "doc_id": "59da9a6a0d63458d824757435bde6942", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 917, "chunk_index": 13, "_doc_id": "13_6977244499331648746"}}
{"doc_id": "14_5906626825420196658", "text": "> const<span><span> { <span><span>createApp<span><span> } <span><span>=<span><span> Vue<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> createApp<span><span>({<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> data<span><span>() {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> return<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> message: <span><span>'Hello Vue!'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/quick-start.html", "title": "快速上手", "doc_id": "59da9a6a0d63458d824757435bde6942", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 917, "chunk_index": 14, "_doc_id": "14_5906626825420196658"}}
