{"doc_id": "50_1250944529414622753", "text": "ss=\"line\"><span> return<span><span> count.value<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> return<span><span> previous<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>})<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/computed.html", "title": "计算属性", "doc_id": "5adbf603501244e7b0a7e6fb4ed2b338", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1092, "chunk_index": 50, "_doc_id": "50_1250944529414622753"}}
