{"doc_id": "56_7162133922029801000", "text": "code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>script<span><span> setup<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>import<span><span> { ref, computed } <span><span>from<span><span> 'vue'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> count<span><span> =<span><span> ref<span><span>(<span><span>2<span><span>)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> alwaysSmall<span><span> =<span><span> computed<span><span>({<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/computed.html", "title": "计算属性", "doc_id": "5adbf603501244e7b0a7e6fb4ed2b338", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1092, "chunk_index": 56, "_doc_id": "56_7162133922029801000"}}
{"doc_id": "57_8307880236792320205", "text": "e\"><span>const<span><span> alwaysSmall<span><span> =<span><span> computed<span><span>({<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> get<span><span>(<span><span>previous<span><span>) {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> if<span><span> (count.value <span><span><=<span><span> 3<span><span>) {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> return<span><span> count.value<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> return<span><span> previous<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/computed.html", "title": "计算属性", "doc_id": "5adbf603501244e7b0a7e6fb4ed2b338", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1092, "chunk_index": 57, "_doc_id": "57_8307880236792320205"}}
{"doc_id": "58_7585717756248239196", "text": "><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> return<span><span> previous<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> },<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> set<span><span>(<span><span>newValue<span><span>) {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> count.value <span><span>=<span><span> newValue <span><span>*<span><span> 2<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>})<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/computed.html", "title": "计算属性", "doc_id": "5adbf603501244e7b0a7e6fb4ed2b338", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1092, "chunk_index": 58, "_doc_id": "58_7585717756248239196"}}
{"doc_id": "59_6836656599464056615", "text": "span> 2<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>})<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>script<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><div><h2 id=\"best-practices\">最佳实践 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#best-practices\">​<a><h2><h3 id=\"getters-should-be-side-effect-free\">Getter 不应有副作用 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#getters-should-be-side-effect-free\">​<a><h3><p>计算属性的 getter 应只做计算而没有任何其他的副作用，这一点非常重要，请务必牢记。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/computed.html", "title": "计算属性", "doc_id": "5adbf603501244e7b0a7e6fb4ed2b338", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1092, "chunk_index": 59, "_doc_id": "59_6836656599464056615"}}
{"doc_id": "60_2745072022843477912", "text": "\" href=\"#getters-should-be-side-effect-free\">​<a><h3><p>计算属性的 getter 应只做计算而没有任何其他的副作用，这一点非常重要，请务必牢记。举例来说，<strong>不要改变其他状态、在 getter 中做异步请求或者更改 DOM<strong>！一个计算属性的声明中描述的是如何根据其他值派生一个值。因此 getter 的职责应该仅为计算和返回该值。在之后的指引中我们会讨论如何使用<a href=\"./watchers.html\">侦听器<a>根据其他响应式状态的变更来创建副作用。<p><h3 id=\"avoid-mutating-computed-value\">避免直接修改计算属性值 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#avoid-mutating-computed-value\">​<a><h3><p>从计算属性返回的值是派生状态。可以把它看作是一个“临时快照”，每当源状态发生变化时，就会创建一个新的快照。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/computed.html", "title": "计算属性", "doc_id": "5adbf603501244e7b0a7e6fb4ed2b338", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1092, "chunk_index": 60, "_doc_id": "60_2745072022843477912"}}
{"doc_id": "61_2184661166779394966", "text": "ef=\"#avoid-mutating-computed-value\">​<a><h3><p>从计算属性返回的值是派生状态。可以把它看作是一个“临时快照”，每当源状态发生变化时，就会创建一个新的快照。更改快照是没有意义的，因此计算属性的返回值应该被视为只读的，并且永远不应该被更改——应该更新它所依赖的源状态以触发新的计算。<p><div><div>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/computed.html", "title": "计算属性", "doc_id": "5adbf603501244e7b0a7e6fb4ed2b338", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1092, "chunk_index": 61, "_doc_id": "61_2184661166779394966"}}
{"doc_id": "0_734584512330508212", "text": "<div><div><h1 id=\"class-and-style-bindings\">Class 与 Style 绑定 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#class-and-style-bindings\">​<a><h1><p>数据绑定的一个常见需求场景是操纵元素的 CSS class 列表和内联样式。因为 <code>class<code> 和 <code>style<code> 都是 attribute，我们可以和其他 attribute 一样使用 <code>v-bind<code> 将它们和动态的字符串绑定。但是，在处理比较复杂的绑定时，通过拼接生成字符串是麻烦且易出错的。因此，Vue 专门为 <code>class<code> 和 <code>style<code> 的 <code>v-bind<code> 用法提供了特殊的功能增强。除了字符串外，表达式的值也可以是对象或数组。<p><h2 id=\"binding-html-classes\">绑定 HTML class <a class=\"header-anchor\"", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/class-and-style.html", "title": "Class 与 Style 绑定", "doc_id": "26247605a5eb4446ba48c63fe43ee9a3", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 797, "chunk_index": 0, "_doc_id": "0_734584512330508212"}}
{"doc_id": "1_597954815941686560", "text": "的功能增强。除了字符串外，表达式的值也可以是对象或数组。<p><h2 id=\"binding-html-classes\">绑定 HTML class <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#binding-html-classes\">​<a><h2><h3 id=\"binding-to-objects\">绑定对象 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#binding-to-objects\">​<a><h3><p>我们可以给 <code>:class<code> (<code>v-bind:class<code> 的缩写) 传递一个对象来动态切换 class：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>div<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/class-and-style.html", "title": "Class 与 Style 绑定", "doc_id": "26247605a5eb4446ba48c63fe43ee9a3", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 797, "chunk_index": 1, "_doc_id": "1_597954815941686560"}}
{"doc_id": "2_2666086225288142162", "text": "><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>div<span><span> :<span><span>class<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>{ active: isActive }<span><span>\"<span><span>></<span><span>div<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>上面的语法表示 <code>active<code> 是否存在取决于数据属性 <code>isActive<code> 的<a href=\"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Glossary/Truthy\" target=\"_blank\">真假值<a>。<p><p>你可以在对象中写多个字段来操作多个 class。此外，<code>:class<code> 指令也可以和一般的 <code>class<code> attribute 共存。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/class-and-style.html", "title": "Class 与 Style 绑定", "doc_id": "26247605a5eb4446ba48c63fe43ee9a3", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 797, "chunk_index": 2, "_doc_id": "2_2666086225288142162"}}
{"doc_id": "3_5964135936635237841", "text": "真假值<a>。<p><p>你可以在对象中写多个字段来操作多个 class。此外，<code>:class<code> 指令也可以和一般的 <code>class<code> attribute 共存。举例来说，下面这样的状态：<p><div class=\"composition-api\"><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> isActive<span><span> =<span><span> ref<span><span>(<span><span>true<span><span>)<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/class-and-style.html", "title": "Class 与 Style 绑定", "doc_id": "26247605a5eb4446ba48c63fe43ee9a3", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 797, "chunk_index": 3, "_doc_id": "3_5964135936635237841"}}
{"doc_id": "4_7412097866390408402", "text": "<span> isActive<span><span> =<span><span> ref<span><span>(<span><span>true<span><span>)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> hasError<span><span> =<span><span> ref<span><span>(<span><span>false<span><span>)<span><span><code><pre><div><div><div class=\"options-api\"><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>data<span><span>() {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> return<span><span> {<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/class-and-style.html", "title": "Class 与 Style 绑定", "doc_id": "26247605a5eb4446ba48c63fe43ee9a3", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 797, "chunk_index": 4, "_doc_id": "4_7412097866390408402"}}
{"doc_id": "5_1274288942395957713", "text": "\"><span>data<span><span>() {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> return<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> isActive: <span><span>true<span><span>,<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> hasError: <span><span>false<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/class-and-style.html", "title": "Class 与 Style 绑定", "doc_id": "26247605a5eb4446ba48c63fe43ee9a3", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 797, "chunk_index": 5, "_doc_id": "5_1274288942395957713"}}
{"doc_id": "6_5479003255530477579", "text": "class=\"line\"><span> hasError: <span><span>false<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span><code><pre><div><div><p>配合以下模板：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>div<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> class<span><span>=<span><span>\"static\"<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/class-and-style.html", "title": "Class 与 Style 绑定", "doc_id": "26247605a5eb4446ba48c63fe43ee9a3", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 797, "chunk_index": 6, "_doc_id": "6_5479003255530477579"}}
{"doc_id": "7_3855693260378572675", "text": "><span>div<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> class<span><span>=<span><span>\"static\"<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> :<span><span>class<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>{ active: isActive, <span><span>'text-danger'<span><span>: hasError }<span><span>\"<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/class-and-style.html", "title": "Class 与 Style 绑定", "doc_id": "26247605a5eb4446ba48c63fe43ee9a3", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 797, "chunk_index": 7, "_doc_id": "7_3855693260378572675"}}
{"doc_id": "8_2731515688531594353", "text": "span>{ active: isActive, <span><span>'text-danger'<span><span>: hasError }<span><span>\"<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>></<span><span>div<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>渲染的结果会是：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>div<span><span> class<span><span>=<span><span>\"static active\"<span><span>></<span><span>div<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>当 <code>isActive<code> 或者 <code>hasError<code> 改变时，class 列表会随之更新。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/class-and-style.html", "title": "Class 与 Style 绑定", "doc_id": "26247605a5eb4446ba48c63fe43ee9a3", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 797, "chunk_index": 8, "_doc_id": "8_2731515688531594353"}}
{"doc_id": "9_2586728573003327069", "text": "an>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>当 <code>isActive<code> 或者 <code>hasError<code> 改变时，class 列表会随之更新。举例来说，如果 <code>hasError<code> 变为 <code>true<code>，class 列表也会变成 <code>\"static active text-danger\"<code>。<p><p>绑定的对象并不一定需要写成内联字面量的形式，也可以直接绑定一个对象：<p><div class=\"composition-api\"><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> classObject<span><span> =<span><span> reactive<span><span>({<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/class-and-style.html", "title": "Class 与 Style 绑定", "doc_id": "26247605a5eb4446ba48c63fe43ee9a3", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 797, "chunk_index": 9, "_doc_id": "9_2586728573003327069"}}
{"doc_id": "10_4286768172945305159", "text": "e\"><span>const<span><span> classObject<span><span> =<span><span> reactive<span><span>({<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> active: <span><span>true<span><span>,<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> 'text-danger'<span><span>: <span><span>false<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>})<span><span><code><pre><div><div><div class=\"options-api\"><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>data<span><span>() {<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/class-and-style.html", "title": "Class 与 Style 绑定", "doc_id": "26247605a5eb4446ba48c63fe43ee9a3", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 797, "chunk_index": 10, "_doc_id": "10_4286768172945305159"}}
{"doc_id": "11_1192037600641513214", "text": "e class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>data<span><span>() {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> return<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> classObject: {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> active: <span><span>true<span><span>,<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> 'text-danger'<span><span>: <span><span>false<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/class-and-style.html", "title": "Class 与 Style 绑定", "doc_id": "26247605a5eb4446ba48c63fe43ee9a3", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 797, "chunk_index": 11, "_doc_id": "11_1192037600641513214"}}
{"doc_id": "12_8342958628446440982", "text": "e<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span><code><pre><div><div><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>div<span><span> :<span><span>class<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>classObject<span><span>\"<span><span>></<span><span>div<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>这将渲染：<p><div class=\"language-template\">", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/class-and-style.html", "title": "Class 与 Style 绑定", "doc_id": "26247605a5eb4446ba48c63fe43ee9a3", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 797, "chunk_index": 12, "_doc_id": "12_8342958628446440982"}}
{"doc_id": "13_8154212720220780270", "text": "/<span><span>div<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>这将渲染：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>div<span><span> class<span><span>=<span><span>\"active\"<span><span>></<span><span>div<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>我们也可以绑定一个返回对象的<a href=\"./computed.html\">计算属性<a>。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/class-and-style.html", "title": "Class 与 Style 绑定", "doc_id": "26247605a5eb4446ba48c63fe43ee9a3", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 797, "chunk_index": 13, "_doc_id": "13_8154212720220780270"}}
{"doc_id": "14_4654599013032898902", "text": "span>div<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>我们也可以绑定一个返回对象的<a href=\"./computed.html\">计算属性<a>。这是一个常见且很有用的技巧：<p><div class=\"composition-api\"><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> isActive<span><span> =<span><span> ref<span><span>(<span><span>true<span><span>)<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/class-and-style.html", "title": "Class 与 Style 绑定", "doc_id": "26247605a5eb4446ba48c63fe43ee9a3", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 797, "chunk_index": 14, "_doc_id": "14_4654599013032898902"}}
{"doc_id": "15_6358137045676942847", "text": "<span> isActive<span><span> =<span><span> ref<span><span>(<span><span>true<span><span>)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> error<span><span> =<span><span> ref<span><span>(<span><span>null<span><span>)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> classObject<span><span> =<span><span> computed<span><span>(() <span><span>=><span><span> ({<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/class-and-style.html", "title": "Class 与 Style 绑定", "doc_id": "26247605a5eb4446ba48c63fe43ee9a3", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 797, "chunk_index": 15, "_doc_id": "15_6358137045676942847"}}
{"doc_id": "16_4211912236033078460", "text": "sObject<span><span> =<span><span> computed<span><span>(() <span><span>=><span><span> ({<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> active: isActive.value <span><span>&&<span><span> !<span><span>error.value,<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> 'text-danger'<span><span>: error.value <span><span>&&<span><span> error.value.type <span><span>===<span><span> 'fatal'<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/class-and-style.html", "title": "Class 与 Style 绑定", "doc_id": "26247605a5eb4446ba48c63fe43ee9a3", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 797, "chunk_index": 16, "_doc_id": "16_4211912236033078460"}}
{"doc_id": "17_960792549217306255", "text": "r.value <span><span>&&<span><span> error.value.type <span><span>===<span><span> 'fatal'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}))<span><span><code><pre><div><div><div class=\"options-api\"><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>data<span><span>() {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> return<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> isActive: <span><span>true<span><span>,<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/class-and-style.html", "title": "Class 与 Style 绑定", "doc_id": "26247605a5eb4446ba48c63fe43ee9a3", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 797, "chunk_index": 17, "_doc_id": "17_960792549217306255"}}
{"doc_id": "18_8482317064880965559", "text": "><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> isActive: <span><span>true<span><span>,<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> error: <span><span>null<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>},<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>computed<span><span>: {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> classObject<span><span>() {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> return<span><span> {<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/class-and-style.html", "title": "Class 与 Style 绑定", "doc_id": "26247605a5eb4446ba48c63fe43ee9a3", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 797, "chunk_index": 18, "_doc_id": "18_8482317064880965559"}}
{"doc_id": "19_823767893372535896", "text": "classObject<span><span>() {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> return<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> active: <span><span>this<span><span>.isActive <span><span>&&<span><span> !<span><span>this<span><span>.error,<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> 'text-danger'<span><span>: <span><span>this<span><span>.error <span><span>&&<span><span> this<span><span>.error.type <span><span>===<span><span> 'fatal'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/class-and-style.html", "title": "Class 与 Style 绑定", "doc_id": "26247605a5eb4446ba48c63fe43ee9a3", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 797, "chunk_index": 19, "_doc_id": "19_823767893372535896"}}
{"doc_id": "20_8051720489398980755", "text": ".error.type <span><span>===<span><span> 'fatal'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span><code><pre><div><div><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>div<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/class-and-style.html", "title": "Class 与 Style 绑定", "doc_id": "26247605a5eb4446ba48c63fe43ee9a3", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 797, "chunk_index": 20, "_doc_id": "20_8051720489398980755"}}
{"doc_id": "21_8434144400046515134", "text": "><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>div<span><span> :<span><span>class<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>classObject<span><span>\"<span><span>></<span><span>div<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><h3 id=\"binding-to-arrays\">绑定数组 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#binding-to-arrays\">​<a><h3><p>我们可以给 <code>:class<code> 绑定一个数组来渲染多个 CSS class：<p><div class=\"composition-api\"><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/class-and-style.html", "title": "Class 与 Style 绑定", "doc_id": "26247605a5eb4446ba48c63fe43ee9a3", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 797, "chunk_index": 21, "_doc_id": "21_8434144400046515134"}}
{"doc_id": "22_5943950127970187529", "text": "composition-api\"><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> activeClass<span><span> =<span><span> ref<span><span>(<span><span>'active'<span><span>)<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/class-and-style.html", "title": "Class 与 Style 绑定", "doc_id": "26247605a5eb4446ba48c63fe43ee9a3", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 797, "chunk_index": 22, "_doc_id": "22_5943950127970187529"}}
{"doc_id": "23_7287691733638758215", "text": "activeClass<span><span> =<span><span> ref<span><span>(<span><span>'active'<span><span>)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> errorClass<span><span> =<span><span> ref<span><span>(<span><span>'text-danger'<span><span>)<span><span><code><pre><div><div><div class=\"options-api\"><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>data<span><span>() {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> return<span><span> {<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/class-and-style.html", "title": "Class 与 Style 绑定", "doc_id": "26247605a5eb4446ba48c63fe43ee9a3", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 797, "chunk_index": 23, "_doc_id": "23_7287691733638758215"}}
{"doc_id": "24_4438104151729184136", "text": "\"><span>data<span><span>() {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> return<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> activeClass: <span><span>'active'<span><span>,<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> errorClass: <span><span>'text-danger'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/class-and-style.html", "title": "Class 与 Style 绑定", "doc_id": "26247605a5eb4446ba48c63fe43ee9a3", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 797, "chunk_index": 24, "_doc_id": "24_4438104151729184136"}}
{"doc_id": "25_5138323413347777076", "text": "e\"><span> errorClass: <span><span>'text-danger'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span><code><pre><div><div><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>div<span><span> :<span><span>class<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>[activeClass,", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/class-and-style.html", "title": "Class 与 Style 绑定", "doc_id": "26247605a5eb4446ba48c63fe43ee9a3", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 797, "chunk_index": 25, "_doc_id": "25_5138323413347777076"}}
{"doc_id": "26_8526737577481860483", "text": "><<span><span>div<span><span> :<span><span>class<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>[activeClass, errorClass]<span><span>\"<span><span>></<span><span>div<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>渲染的结果是：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>div<span><span> class<span><span>=<span><span>\"active text-danger\"<span><span>></<span><span>div<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>如果你也想在数组中有条件地渲染某个 class，", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/class-and-style.html", "title": "Class 与 Style 绑定", "doc_id": "26247605a5eb4446ba48c63fe43ee9a3", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 797, "chunk_index": 26, "_doc_id": "26_8526737577481860483"}}
{"doc_id": "27_6798443481203740739", "text": "r\"<span><span>></<span><span>div<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>如果你也想在数组中有条件地渲染某个 class，你可以使用三元表达式：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>div<span><span> :<span><span>class<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>[isActive <span><span>?<span><span> activeClass <span><span>:<span><span> ''<span><span>, errorClass]<span><span>\"<span><span>></<span><span>div<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p><code>errorClass<code> 会一直存在，", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/class-and-style.html", "title": "Class 与 Style 绑定", "doc_id": "26247605a5eb4446ba48c63fe43ee9a3", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 797, "chunk_index": 27, "_doc_id": "27_6798443481203740739"}}
{"doc_id": "28_6874941333466007874", "text": "an><span>></<span><span>div<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p><code>errorClass<code> 会一直存在，但 <code>activeClass<code> 只会在 <code>isActive<code> 为真时才存在。<p><p>然而，这可能在有多个依赖条件的 class 时会有些冗长。因此也可以在数组中嵌套对象：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>div<span><span> :<span><span>class<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>[{ [activeClass]: isActive },", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/class-and-style.html", "title": "Class 与 Style 绑定", "doc_id": "26247605a5eb4446ba48c63fe43ee9a3", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 797, "chunk_index": 28, "_doc_id": "28_6874941333466007874"}}
{"doc_id": "29_3031917037273478688", "text": "v<span><span> :<span><span>class<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>[{ [activeClass]: isActive }, errorClass]<span><span>\"<span><span>></<span><span>div<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><h3 id=\"with-components\">在组件上使用 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#with-components\">​<a><h3><blockquote><p>本节假设你已经有 <a href=\"/guide/essentials/component-basics.html\">Vue 组件<a>的知识基础。如果没有，你也可以暂时跳过，以后再阅读。<p><blockquote><p>对于只有一个根元素的组件，当你使用了 <code>class<code> attribute 时，这些 class 会被添加到根元素上并与该元素上已有的 class 合并。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/class-and-style.html", "title": "Class 与 Style 绑定", "doc_id": "26247605a5eb4446ba48c63fe43ee9a3", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 797, "chunk_index": 29, "_doc_id": "29_3031917037273478688"}}
{"doc_id": "30_8561396916958397278", "text": "blockquote><p>对于只有一个根元素的组件，当你使用了 <code>class<code> attribute 时，这些 class 会被添加到根元素上并与该元素上已有的 class 合并。<p><p>举例来说，如果你声明了一个组件名叫 <code>MyComponent<code>，模板如下：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><!-- 子组件模板 --><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/class-and-style.html", "title": "Class 与 Style 绑定", "doc_id": "26247605a5eb4446ba48c63fe43ee9a3", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 797, "chunk_index": 30, "_doc_id": "30_8561396916958397278"}}
{"doc_id": "31_777931860666390824", "text": "an><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><!-- 子组件模板 --><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>p<span><span> class<span><span>=<span><span>\"foo bar\"<span><span>>Hi!</<span><span>p<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>在使用时添加一些 class：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><!-- 在使用组件时 --><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>MyComponent<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/class-and-style.html", "title": "Class 与 Style 绑定", "doc_id": "26247605a5eb4446ba48c63fe43ee9a3", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 797, "chunk_index": 31, "_doc_id": "31_777931860666390824"}}
{"doc_id": "32_7606014377440295118", "text": "ne\"><span><!-- 在使用组件时 --><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>MyComponent<span><span> class<span><span>=<span><span>\"baz boo\"<span><span> /><span><span><code><pre><div><p>渲染出的 HTML 为：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>p<span><span> class<span><span>=<span><span>\"foo bar baz boo\"<span><span>>Hi!</<span><span>p<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>Class 的绑定也是同样的：<p><div", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/class-and-style.html", "title": "Class 与 Style 绑定", "doc_id": "26247605a5eb4446ba48c63fe43ee9a3", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 797, "chunk_index": 32, "_doc_id": "32_7606014377440295118"}}
{"doc_id": "33_6119239768524189975", "text": "o\"<span><span>>Hi!</<span><span>p<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>Class 的绑定也是同样的：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>MyComponent<span><span> :<span><span>class<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>{ active: isActive }<span><span>\"<span><span> /><span><span><code><pre><div><p>当 <code>isActive<code> 为真时，", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/class-and-style.html", "title": "Class 与 Style 绑定", "doc_id": "26247605a5eb4446ba48c63fe43ee9a3", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 797, "chunk_index": 33, "_doc_id": "33_6119239768524189975"}}
{"doc_id": "34_7647309463507760555", "text": "ve: isActive }<span><span>\"<span><span> /><span><span><code><pre><div><p>当 <code>isActive<code> 为真时，被渲染的 HTML 会是：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>p<span><span> class<span><span>=<span><span>\"foo bar active\"<span><span>>Hi!</<span><span>p<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>如果你的组件有多个根元素，你将需要指定哪个根元素来接收这个 class。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/class-and-style.html", "title": "Class 与 Style 绑定", "doc_id": "26247605a5eb4446ba48c63fe43ee9a3", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 797, "chunk_index": 34, "_doc_id": "34_7647309463507760555"}}
{"doc_id": "35_8228835671453466807", "text": ">>Hi!</<span><span>p<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>如果你的组件有多个根元素，你将需要指定哪个根元素来接收这个 class。你可以通过组件的 <code>$attrs<code> 属性来指定接收的元素：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><!-- MyComponent 模板使用 $attrs 时 --><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/class-and-style.html", "title": "Class 与 Style 绑定", "doc_id": "26247605a5eb4446ba48c63fe43ee9a3", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 797, "chunk_index": 35, "_doc_id": "35_8228835671453466807"}}
{"doc_id": "36_4787616788578513299", "text": "github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><!-- MyComponent 模板使用 $attrs 时 --><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>p<span><span> :<span><span>class<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>$attrs.class<span><span>\"<span><span>>Hi!</<span><span>p<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>span<span><span>>This is a child component</<span><span>span<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/class-and-style.html", "title": "Class 与 Style 绑定", "doc_id": "26247605a5eb4446ba48c63fe43ee9a3", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 797, "chunk_index": 36, "_doc_id": "36_4787616788578513299"}}
{"doc_id": "37_2399916889092090752", "text": "><code><pre><div><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>MyComponent<span><span> class<span><span>=<span><span>\"baz\"<span><span> /><span><span><code><pre><div><p>这将被渲染为：<p><div class=\"language-html\"> <span class=\"lang\">html<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>p<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/class-and-style.html", "title": "Class 与 Style 绑定", "doc_id": "26247605a5eb4446ba48c63fe43ee9a3", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 797, "chunk_index": 37, "_doc_id": "37_2399916889092090752"}}
{"doc_id": "38_6152022432917372082", "text": "an><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>p<span><span> class<span><span>=<span><span>\"baz\"<span><span>>Hi!</<span><span>p<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>span<span><span>>This is a child component</<span><span>span<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>你可以在<a href=\"/guide/components/attrs.html\">透传 Attribute<a> 一章中了解更多组件的 attribute 继承的细节。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/class-and-style.html", "title": "Class 与 Style 绑定", "doc_id": "26247605a5eb4446ba48c63fe43ee9a3", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 797, "chunk_index": 38, "_doc_id": "38_6152022432917372082"}}
{"doc_id": "39_215732399877045740", "text": "><pre><div><p>你可以在<a href=\"/guide/components/attrs.html\">透传 Attribute<a> 一章中了解更多组件的 attribute 继承的细节。<p><h2 id=\"binding-inline-styles\">绑定内联样式 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#binding-inline-styles\">​<a><h2><h3 id=\"binding-to-objects-1\">绑定对象 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#binding-to-objects-1\">​<a><h3><p><code>:style<code> 支持绑定 JavaScript 对象值，", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/class-and-style.html", "title": "Class 与 Style 绑定", "doc_id": "26247605a5eb4446ba48c63fe43ee9a3", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 797, "chunk_index": 39, "_doc_id": "39_215732399877045740"}}
{"doc_id": "40_5839872693455214831", "text": "lass=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#binding-to-objects-1\">​<a><h3><p><code>:style<code> 支持绑定 JavaScript 对象值，对应的是 <a href=\"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/API/HTMLElement/style\" target=\"_blank\">HTML 元素的 <code>style<code> 属性<a>：<p><div class=\"composition-api\"><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> activeColor<span><span> =<span><span> ref<span><span>(<span><span>'red'<span><span>)<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/class-and-style.html", "title": "Class 与 Style 绑定", "doc_id": "26247605a5eb4446ba48c63fe43ee9a3", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 797, "chunk_index": 40, "_doc_id": "40_5839872693455214831"}}
{"doc_id": "41_4137301156453646092", "text": "n> activeColor<span><span> =<span><span> ref<span><span>(<span><span>'red'<span><span>)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> fontSize<span><span> =<span><span> ref<span><span>(<span><span>30<span><span>)<span><span><code><pre><div><div><div class=\"options-api\"><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>data<span><span>() {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> return<span><span> {<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/class-and-style.html", "title": "Class 与 Style 绑定", "doc_id": "26247605a5eb4446ba48c63fe43ee9a3", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 797, "chunk_index": 41, "_doc_id": "41_4137301156453646092"}}
{"doc_id": "42_1235746389411099524", "text": "\"><span>data<span><span>() {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> return<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> activeColor: <span><span>'red'<span><span>,<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> fontSize: <span><span>30<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/class-and-style.html", "title": "Class 与 Style 绑定", "doc_id": "26247605a5eb4446ba48c63fe43ee9a3", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 797, "chunk_index": 42, "_doc_id": "42_1235746389411099524"}}
{"doc_id": "43_1527930713507664282", "text": "an class=\"line\"><span> fontSize: <span><span>30<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span><code><pre><div><div><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>div<span><span> :<span><span>style<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>{ color: activeColor, fontSize: fontSize <span><span>+<span><span> 'px'<span><span> }<span><span>\"<span><span>></<span><span>div<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>尽管推荐使用 camelCase，", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/class-and-style.html", "title": "Class 与 Style 绑定", "doc_id": "26247605a5eb4446ba48c63fe43ee9a3", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 797, "chunk_index": 43, "_doc_id": "43_1527930713507664282"}}
{"doc_id": "44_591768097653500798", "text": "n><span>\"<span><span>></<span><span>div<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>尽管推荐使用 camelCase，但 <code>:style<code> 也支持 kebab-cased 形式的 CSS 属性 key (对应其 CSS 中的实际名称)，", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/class-and-style.html", "title": "Class 与 Style 绑定", "doc_id": "26247605a5eb4446ba48c63fe43ee9a3", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 797, "chunk_index": 44, "_doc_id": "44_591768097653500798"}}
{"doc_id": "45_7124227357941255259", "text": "><pre><div><p>尽管推荐使用 camelCase，但 <code>:style<code> 也支持 kebab-cased 形式的 CSS 属性 key (对应其 CSS 中的实际名称)，例如：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>div<span><span> :<span><span>style<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>{ <span><span>'font-size'<span><span>: fontSize <span><span>+<span><span> 'px'<span><span> }<span><span>\"<span><span>></<span><span>div<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>直接绑定一个样式对象通常是一个好主意，", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/class-and-style.html", "title": "Class 与 Style 绑定", "doc_id": "26247605a5eb4446ba48c63fe43ee9a3", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 797, "chunk_index": 45, "_doc_id": "45_7124227357941255259"}}
{"doc_id": "46_4403408135385569849", "text": "<span>\"<span><span>></<span><span>div<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>直接绑定一个样式对象通常是一个好主意，这样可以使模板更加简洁：<p><div class=\"composition-api\"><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> styleObject<span><span> =<span><span> reactive<span><span>({<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> color: <span><span>'red'<span><span>,<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> fontSize: <span><span>'30px'<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/class-and-style.html", "title": "Class 与 Style 绑定", "doc_id": "26247605a5eb4446ba48c63fe43ee9a3", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 797, "chunk_index": 46, "_doc_id": "46_4403408135385569849"}}
{"doc_id": "47_4200919410927391099", "text": "n>'red'<span><span>,<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> fontSize: <span><span>'30px'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>})<span><span><code><pre><div><div><div class=\"options-api\"><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>data<span><span>() {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> return<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> styleObject: {<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/class-and-style.html", "title": "Class 与 Style 绑定", "doc_id": "26247605a5eb4446ba48c63fe43ee9a3", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 797, "chunk_index": 47, "_doc_id": "47_4200919410927391099"}}
{"doc_id": "48_6388811846662402740", "text": "\"line\"><span> return<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> styleObject: {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> color: <span><span>'red'<span><span>,<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> fontSize: <span><span>'13px'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/class-and-style.html", "title": "Class 与 Style 绑定", "doc_id": "26247605a5eb4446ba48c63fe43ee9a3", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 797, "chunk_index": 48, "_doc_id": "48_6388811846662402740"}}
{"doc_id": "49_8733296471935972324", "text": ">'13px'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span><code><pre><div><div><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>div<span><span> :<span><span>style<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>styleObject<span><span>\"<span><span>></<span><span>div<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>同样的，如果样式对象需要更复杂的逻辑，也可以使用返回样式对象的计算属性。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/class-and-style.html", "title": "Class 与 Style 绑定", "doc_id": "26247605a5eb4446ba48c63fe43ee9a3", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 797, "chunk_index": 49, "_doc_id": "49_8733296471935972324"}}
{"doc_id": "50_7446600006379060854", "text": "n>></<span><span>div<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>同样的，如果样式对象需要更复杂的逻辑，也可以使用返回样式对象的计算属性。<p><p><code>:style<code> 指令也可以和常规的 style attribute 共存，就像 <code>:class<code>。<p><p>模板：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>h1<span><span> style<span><span>=<span><span>\"color: red\"<span><span> :<span><span>style<span><span>=<span><span>\"'font-size:", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/class-and-style.html", "title": "Class 与 Style 绑定", "doc_id": "26247605a5eb4446ba48c63fe43ee9a3", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 797, "chunk_index": 50, "_doc_id": "50_7446600006379060854"}}
{"doc_id": "51_3256130759419466465", "text": "<span>=<span><span>\"color: red\"<span><span> :<span><span>style<span><span>=<span><span>\"'font-size: 1em'\"<span><span>>hello</<span><span>h1<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>这将被渲染为：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>h1<span><span> style<span><span>=<span><span>\"color: red;", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/class-and-style.html", "title": "Class 与 Style 绑定", "doc_id": "26247605a5eb4446ba48c63fe43ee9a3", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 797, "chunk_index": 51, "_doc_id": "51_3256130759419466465"}}
{"doc_id": "52_7114089730802803478", "text": "ode><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>h1<span><span> style<span><span>=<span><span>\"color: red; font-size: 1em;\"<span><span>>hello</<span><span>h1<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><h3 id=\"binding-to-arrays-1\">绑定数组 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#binding-to-arrays-1\">​<a><h3><p>我们还可以给 <code>:style<code> 绑定一个包含多个样式对象的数组。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/class-and-style.html", "title": "Class 与 Style 绑定", "doc_id": "26247605a5eb4446ba48c63fe43ee9a3", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 797, "chunk_index": 52, "_doc_id": "52_7114089730802803478"}}
{"doc_id": "53_900614173093508062", "text": "ss=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#binding-to-arrays-1\">​<a><h3><p>我们还可以给 <code>:style<code> 绑定一个包含多个样式对象的数组。这些对象会被合并后渲染到同一元素上：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>div<span><span> :<span><span>style<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>[baseStyles,", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/class-and-style.html", "title": "Class 与 Style 绑定", "doc_id": "26247605a5eb4446ba48c63fe43ee9a3", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 797, "chunk_index": 53, "_doc_id": "53_900614173093508062"}}
{"doc_id": "54_6675886093697233482", "text": "n><<span><span>div<span><span> :<span><span>style<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>[baseStyles, overridingStyles]<span><span>\"<span><span>></<span><span>div<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><h3 id=\"auto-prefixing\">自动前缀 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#auto-prefixing\">​<a><h3><p>当你在 <code>:style<code> 中使用了需要<a href=\"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Glossary/Vendor_Prefix\" target=\"_blank\">浏览器特殊前缀<a>的 CSS 属性时，Vue 会自动为他们加上相应的前缀。Vue 是在运行时检查该属性是否支持在当前浏览器中使用。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/class-and-style.html", "title": "Class 与 Style 绑定", "doc_id": "26247605a5eb4446ba48c63fe43ee9a3", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 797, "chunk_index": 54, "_doc_id": "54_6675886093697233482"}}
{"doc_id": "55_5845254834841211503", "text": "ry/Vendor_Prefix\" target=\"_blank\">浏览器特殊前缀<a>的 CSS 属性时，Vue 会自动为他们加上相应的前缀。Vue 是在运行时检查该属性是否支持在当前浏览器中使用。如果浏览器不支持某个属性，那么将尝试加上各个浏览器特殊前缀，以找到哪一个是被支持的。<p><h3 id=\"multiple-values\">样式多值 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#multiple-values\">​<a><h3><p>你可以对一个样式属性提供多个 (不同前缀的) 值，", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/class-and-style.html", "title": "Class 与 Style 绑定", "doc_id": "26247605a5eb4446ba48c63fe43ee9a3", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 797, "chunk_index": 55, "_doc_id": "55_5845254834841211503"}}
{"doc_id": "56_661221664167252707", "text": "e-values\">样式多值 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#multiple-values\">​<a><h3><p>你可以对一个样式属性提供多个 (不同前缀的) 值，举例来说：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>div<span><span> :<span><span>style<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>{ display: [<span><span>'-webkit-box'<span><span>, <span><span>'-ms-flexbox'<span><span>, <span><span>'flex'<span><span>] }<span><span>\"<span><span>></<span><span>div<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>数组仅会渲染浏览器支持的最后一个值。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/class-and-style.html", "title": "Class 与 Style 绑定", "doc_id": "26247605a5eb4446ba48c63fe43ee9a3", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 797, "chunk_index": 56, "_doc_id": "56_661221664167252707"}}
{"doc_id": "57_7676311235780596640", "text": "><span>\"<span><span>></<span><span>div<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>数组仅会渲染浏览器支持的最后一个值。在这个示例中，在支持不需要特别前缀的浏览器中都会渲染为 <code>display: flex<code>。<p><div><div>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/class-and-style.html", "title": "Class 与 Style 绑定", "doc_id": "26247605a5eb4446ba48c63fe43ee9a3", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 797, "chunk_index": 57, "_doc_id": "57_7676311235780596640"}}
{"doc_id": "0_5709068416316787050", "text": "<div><div><h1 id=\"conditional-rendering\">条件渲染 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#conditional-rendering\">​<a><h1><h2 id=\"v-if\"><code>v-if<code> <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#v-if\">​<a><h2><p><code>v-if<code> 指令用于条件性地渲染一块内容。这块内容只会在指令的表达式返回真值时才被渲染。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/conditional.html", "title": "条件渲染", "doc_id": "39f7a1cd9e8048a8b8c2b2a12a9056ad", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 231, "chunk_index": 0, "_doc_id": "0_5709068416316787050"}}
{"doc_id": "1_6077545550877399793", "text": "lass=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#v-if\">​<a><h2><p><code>v-if<code> 指令用于条件性地渲染一块内容。这块内容只会在指令的表达式返回真值时才被渲染。<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>h1<span><span> v-if<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>awesome<span><span>\"<span><span>>Vue is awesome!</<span><span>h1<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><h2 id=\"v-else\"><code>v-else<code> <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#v-else\">​<a><h2><p>你也可以使用 <code>v-else<code> 为 <code>v-if<code> 添加一个“else 区块”。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/conditional.html", "title": "条件渲染", "doc_id": "39f7a1cd9e8048a8b8c2b2a12a9056ad", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 231, "chunk_index": 1, "_doc_id": "1_6077545550877399793"}}
{"doc_id": "2_1086228263200433639", "text": "header-anchor\" href=\"#v-else\">​<a><h2><p>你也可以使用 <code>v-else<code> 为 <code>v-if<code> 添加一个“else 区块”。<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>button<span><span> @<span><span>click<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>awesome <span><span>=<span><span> !<span><span>awesome<span><span>\"<span><span>>Toggle</<span><span>button<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/conditional.html", "title": "条件渲染", "doc_id": "39f7a1cd9e8048a8b8c2b2a12a9056ad", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 231, "chunk_index": 2, "_doc_id": "2_1086228263200433639"}}
{"doc_id": "3_5463399280063786632", "text": "n><span>\"<span><span>>Toggle</<span><span>button<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>h1<span><span> v-if<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>awesome<span><span>\"<span><span>>Vue is awesome!</<span><span>h1<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/conditional.html", "title": "条件渲染", "doc_id": "39f7a1cd9e8048a8b8c2b2a12a9056ad", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 231, "chunk_index": 3, "_doc_id": "3_5463399280063786632"}}
{"doc_id": "4_5036282556521064136", "text": "pan><span>awesome<span><span>\"<span><span>>Vue is awesome!</<span><span>h1<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>h1<span><span> v-else<span><span>>Oh no 😢</<span><span>h1<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p class=\"demo\"> Toggle <h1>Vue is awesome!<h1><p><p>一个 <code>v-else<code> 元素必须跟在一个 <code>v-if<code> 或者 <code>v-else-if<code> 元素后面，否则它将不会被识别。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/conditional.html", "title": "条件渲染", "doc_id": "39f7a1cd9e8048a8b8c2b2a12a9056ad", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 231, "chunk_index": 4, "_doc_id": "4_5036282556521064136"}}
{"doc_id": "5_6470065671902392547", "text": "e!<h1><p><p>一个 <code>v-else<code> 元素必须跟在一个 <code>v-if<code> 或者 <code>v-else-if<code> 元素后面，否则它将不会被识别。<p><h2 id=\"v-else-if\"><code>v-else-if<code> <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#v-else-if\">​<a><h2><p>顾名思义，<code>v-else-if<code> 提供的是相应于 <code>v-if<code> 的“else if 区块”。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/conditional.html", "title": "条件渲染", "doc_id": "39f7a1cd9e8048a8b8c2b2a12a9056ad", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 231, "chunk_index": 5, "_doc_id": "5_6470065671902392547"}}
{"doc_id": "6_4456437635671843967", "text": "hor\" href=\"#v-else-if\">​<a><h2><p>顾名思义，<code>v-else-if<code> 提供的是相应于 <code>v-if<code> 的“else if 区块”。它可以连续多次重复使用：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>div<span><span> v-if<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>type <span><span>===<span><span> 'A'\"<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> A<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>div<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/conditional.html", "title": "条件渲染", "doc_id": "39f7a1cd9e8048a8b8c2b2a12a9056ad", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 231, "chunk_index": 6, "_doc_id": "6_4456437635671843967"}}
{"doc_id": "7_8417354723302496740", "text": "ass=\"line\"><span> A<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>div<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>div<span><span> v-else-if<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>type <span><span>===<span><span> 'B'\"<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> B<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>div<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/conditional.html", "title": "条件渲染", "doc_id": "39f7a1cd9e8048a8b8c2b2a12a9056ad", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 231, "chunk_index": 7, "_doc_id": "7_8417354723302496740"}}
{"doc_id": "8_8793500316179075104", "text": "ass=\"line\"><span> B<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>div<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>div<span><span> v-else-if<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>type <span><span>===<span><span> 'C'\"<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> C<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>div<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>div<span><span> v-else<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> Not A/B/C<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/conditional.html", "title": "条件渲染", "doc_id": "39f7a1cd9e8048a8b8c2b2a12a9056ad", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 231, "chunk_index": 8, "_doc_id": "8_8793500316179075104"}}
{"doc_id": "9_1198233870396478108", "text": "pan>div<span><span> v-else<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> Not A/B/C<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>div<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>和 <code>v-else<code> 类似，一个使用 <code>v-else-if<code> 的元素必须紧跟在一个 <code>v-if<code> 或一个 <code>v-else-if<code> 元素后面。<p><h2 id=\"v-if-on-template\"><code><template><code> 上的 <code>v-if<code> <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#v-if-on-template\">​<a><h2><p>因为 <code>v-if<code> 是一个指令，他必须依附于某个元素。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/conditional.html", "title": "条件渲染", "doc_id": "39f7a1cd9e8048a8b8c2b2a12a9056ad", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 231, "chunk_index": 9, "_doc_id": "9_1198233870396478108"}}
{"doc_id": "10_4238284237479212331", "text": "> <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#v-if-on-template\">​<a><h2><p>因为 <code>v-if<code> 是一个指令，他必须依附于某个元素。但如果我们想要切换不止一个元素呢？在这种情况下我们可以在一个 <code><template><code> 元素上使用 <code>v-if<code>，这只是一个不可见的包装器元素，最后渲染的结果并不会包含这个 <code><template><code> 元素。<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>template<span><span> v-if<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>ok<span><span>\"<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/conditional.html", "title": "条件渲染", "doc_id": "39f7a1cd9e8048a8b8c2b2a12a9056ad", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 231, "chunk_index": 10, "_doc_id": "10_4238284237479212331"}}
{"doc_id": "11_4783379719535182023", "text": "late<span><span> v-if<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>ok<span><span>\"<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>h1<span><span>>Title</<span><span>h1<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>p<span><span>>Paragraph 1</<span><span>p<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>p<span><span>>Paragraph 2</<span><span>p<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/conditional.html", "title": "条件渲染", "doc_id": "39f7a1cd9e8048a8b8c2b2a12a9056ad", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 231, "chunk_index": 11, "_doc_id": "11_4783379719535182023"}}
{"doc_id": "12_2268172886026471772", "text": "class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>p<span><span>>Paragraph 2</<span><span>p<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p><code>v-else<code> 和 <code>v-else-if<code> 也可以在 <code><template><code> 上使用。<p><h2 id=\"v-show\"><code>v-show<code> <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#v-show\">​<a><h2><p>另一个可以用来按条件显示一个元素的指令是 <code>v-show<code>。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/conditional.html", "title": "条件渲染", "doc_id": "39f7a1cd9e8048a8b8c2b2a12a9056ad", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 231, "chunk_index": 12, "_doc_id": "12_2268172886026471772"}}
{"doc_id": "13_7784539620027266283", "text": "ow<code> <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#v-show\">​<a><h2><p>另一个可以用来按条件显示一个元素的指令是 <code>v-show<code>。其用法基本一样：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>h1<span><span> v-show<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>ok<span><span>\"<span><span>>Hello!</<span><span>h1<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>不同之处在于 <code>v-show<code> 会在 DOM 渲染中保留该元素；<code>v-show<code> 仅切换了该元素上名为 <code>display<code> 的 CSS 属性。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/conditional.html", "title": "条件渲染", "doc_id": "39f7a1cd9e8048a8b8c2b2a12a9056ad", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 231, "chunk_index": 13, "_doc_id": "13_7784539620027266283"}}
{"doc_id": "14_8492667857483605534", "text": "同之处在于 <code>v-show<code> 会在 DOM 渲染中保留该元素；<code>v-show<code> 仅切换了该元素上名为 <code>display<code> 的 CSS 属性。<p><p><code>v-show<code> 不支持在 <code><template><code> 元素上使用，也不能和 <code>v-else<code> 搭配使用。<p><h2 id=\"v-if-vs-v-show\"><code>v-if<code> vs. <code>v-show<code> <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#v-if-vs-v-show\">​<a><h2><p><code>v-if<code> 是“真实的”按条件渲染，因为它确保了在切换时，条件区块内的事件监听器和子组件都会被销毁与重建。<p><p><code>v-if<code> 也是<strong>惰性<strong>的：如果在初次渲染时条件值为 false，则不会做任何事。条件区块只有当条件首次变为 true 时才被渲染。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/conditional.html", "title": "条件渲染", "doc_id": "39f7a1cd9e8048a8b8c2b2a12a9056ad", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 231, "chunk_index": 14, "_doc_id": "14_8492667857483605534"}}
{"doc_id": "15_2906025087616906978", "text": "重建。<p><p><code>v-if<code> 也是<strong>惰性<strong>的：如果在初次渲染时条件值为 false，则不会做任何事。条件区块只有当条件首次变为 true 时才被渲染。<p><p>相比之下，<code>v-show<code> 简单许多，元素无论初始条件如何，始终会被渲染，只有 CSS <code>display<code> 属性会被切换。<p><p>总的来说，<code>v-if<code> 有更高的切换开销，而 <code>v-show<code> 有更高的初始渲染开销。因此，如果需要频繁切换，则使用 <code>v-show<code> 较好；如果在运行时绑定条件很少改变，则 <code>v-if<code> 会更合适。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/conditional.html", "title": "条件渲染", "doc_id": "39f7a1cd9e8048a8b8c2b2a12a9056ad", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 231, "chunk_index": 15, "_doc_id": "15_2906025087616906978"}}
{"doc_id": "16_9202055278129823482", "text": "-show<code> 有更高的初始渲染开销。因此，如果需要频繁切换，则使用 <code>v-show<code> 较好；如果在运行时绑定条件很少改变，则 <code>v-if<code> 会更合适。<p><h2 id=\"v-if-with-v-for\"><code>v-if<code> 和 <code>v-for<code> <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#v-if-with-v-for\">​<a><h2><p>当 <code>v-if<code> 和 <code>v-for<code> 同时存在于一个元素上的时候，<code>v-if<code> 会首先被执行。请查看<a href=\"./list.html#v-for-with-v-if\">列表渲染指南<a>获取更多细节。<p><div class=\"warning custom-block\"><p class=\"custom-block-title\">警告<p><p>同时使用 <code>v-if<code> 和 <code>v-for<code> 是<strong>不推荐的<strong>，因为这样二者的优先级不明显。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/conditional.html", "title": "条件渲染", "doc_id": "39f7a1cd9e8048a8b8c2b2a12a9056ad", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 231, "chunk_index": 16, "_doc_id": "16_9202055278129823482"}}
{"doc_id": "17_3140912694476409958", "text": "-block-title\">警告<p><p>同时使用 <code>v-if<code> 和 <code>v-for<code> 是<strong>不推荐的<strong>，因为这样二者的优先级不明显。请查看<a href=\"./list.html#v-for-with-v-if\">列表渲染指南<a>获得更多信息。<p><div><div><div>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/conditional.html", "title": "条件渲染", "doc_id": "39f7a1cd9e8048a8b8c2b2a12a9056ad", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 231, "chunk_index": 17, "_doc_id": "17_3140912694476409958"}}
{"doc_id": "0_3072679641340775823", "text": "<div><div><h1 id=\"list-rendering\">列表渲染 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#list-rendering\">​<a><h1><h2 id=\"v-for\"><code>v-for<code> <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#v-for\">​<a><h2><p>我们可以使用 <code>v-for<code> 指令基于一个数组来渲染一个列表。<code>v-for<code> 指令的值需要使用 <code>item in items<code> 形式的特殊语法，其中 <code>items<code> 是源数据的数组，", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/list.html", "title": "列表渲染", "doc_id": "80e5ae33e4794d28872968ac0ed43795", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1081, "chunk_index": 0, "_doc_id": "0_3072679641340775823"}}
{"doc_id": "1_4149579802439068151", "text": "数组来渲染一个列表。<code>v-for<code> 指令的值需要使用 <code>item in items<code> 形式的特殊语法，其中 <code>items<code> 是源数据的数组，而 <code>item<code> 是迭代项的<strong>别名<strong>：<p><div class=\"composition-api\"><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> items<span><span> =<span><span> ref<span><span>([{ message: <span><span>'Foo'<span><span> },", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/list.html", "title": "列表渲染", "doc_id": "80e5ae33e4794d28872968ac0ed43795", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1081, "chunk_index": 1, "_doc_id": "1_4149579802439068151"}}
{"doc_id": "2_858280215110150292", "text": "<span> items<span><span> =<span><span> ref<span><span>([{ message: <span><span>'Foo'<span><span> }, { message: <span><span>'Bar'<span><span> }])<span><span><code><pre><div><div><div class=\"options-api\"><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>data<span><span>() {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> return<span><span> {<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/list.html", "title": "列表渲染", "doc_id": "80e5ae33e4794d28872968ac0ed43795", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1081, "chunk_index": 2, "_doc_id": "2_858280215110150292"}}
{"doc_id": "3_3782369628291117566", "text": "\"><span>data<span><span>() {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> return<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> items: [{ message: <span><span>'Foo'<span><span> }, { message: <span><span>'Bar'<span><span> }]<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/list.html", "title": "列表渲染", "doc_id": "80e5ae33e4794d28872968ac0ed43795", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1081, "chunk_index": 3, "_doc_id": "3_3782369628291117566"}}
{"doc_id": "4_80806306319906152", "text": "}, { message: <span><span>'Bar'<span><span> }]<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span><code><pre><div><div><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>li<span><span> v-for<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>item <span><span>in<span><span> items<span><span>\"<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> {{ item.message }}<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/list.html", "title": "列表渲染", "doc_id": "80e5ae33e4794d28872968ac0ed43795", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1081, "chunk_index": 4, "_doc_id": "4_80806306319906152"}}
{"doc_id": "5_8508559986526172759", "text": "tems<span><span>\"<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> {{ item.message }}<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>li<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>在 <code>v-for<code> 块中可以完整地访问父作用域内的属性和变量。<code>v-for<code> 也支持使用可选的第二个参数表示当前项的位置索引。<p><div class=\"composition-api\"><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> parentMessage<span><span> =<span><span> ref<span><span>(<span><span>'Parent'<span><span>)<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/list.html", "title": "列表渲染", "doc_id": "80e5ae33e4794d28872968ac0ed43795", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1081, "chunk_index": 5, "_doc_id": "5_8508559986526172759"}}
{"doc_id": "6_3427846991771477673", "text": "rentMessage<span><span> =<span><span> ref<span><span>(<span><span>'Parent'<span><span>)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> items<span><span> =<span><span> ref<span><span>([{ message: <span><span>'Foo'<span><span> }, { message: <span><span>'Bar'<span><span> }])<span><span><code><pre><div><div><div class=\"options-api\"><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>data<span><span>() {<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/list.html", "title": "列表渲染", "doc_id": "80e5ae33e4794d28872968ac0ed43795", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1081, "chunk_index": 6, "_doc_id": "6_3427846991771477673"}}
{"doc_id": "7_445428890234722628", "text": "e class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>data<span><span>() {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> return<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> parentMessage: <span><span>'Parent'<span><span>,<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> items: [{ message: <span><span>'Foo'<span><span> }, { message: <span><span>'Bar'<span><span> }]<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/list.html", "title": "列表渲染", "doc_id": "80e5ae33e4794d28872968ac0ed43795", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1081, "chunk_index": 7, "_doc_id": "7_445428890234722628"}}
{"doc_id": "8_5843566149035610580", "text": "}, { message: <span><span>'Bar'<span><span> }]<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span><code><pre><div><div><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>li<span><span> v-for<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>(item, index) <span><span>in<span><span> items<span><span>\"<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/list.html", "title": "列表渲染", "doc_id": "80e5ae33e4794d28872968ac0ed43795", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1081, "chunk_index": 8, "_doc_id": "8_5843566149035610580"}}
{"doc_id": "9_360996519395507707", "text": "n>\"<span><span>(item, index) <span><span>in<span><span> items<span><span>\"<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> {{ parentMessage }} - {{ index }} - {{ item.message }}<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/list.html", "title": "列表渲染", "doc_id": "80e5ae33e4794d28872968ac0ed43795", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1081, "chunk_index": 9, "_doc_id": "9_360996519395507707"}}
{"doc_id": "10_7166796884677831795", "text": "<span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> {{ parentMessage }} - {{ index }} - {{ item.message }}<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>li<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p class=\"demo\"><li>Parent - 0 - Foo<li><li>Parent - 1 - Bar<li><p><p><code>v-for<code> 变量的作用域和下面的 JavaScript 代码很类似：<p><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> parentMessage<span><span> =<span><span> 'Parent'<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/list.html", "title": "列表渲染", "doc_id": "80e5ae33e4794d28872968ac0ed43795", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1081, "chunk_index": 10, "_doc_id": "10_7166796884677831795"}}
{"doc_id": "11_998431837198565884", "text": "n class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> parentMessage<span><span> =<span><span> 'Parent'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> items<span><span> =<span><span> [<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> /* ... */<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>]<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>items.<span><span>forEach<span><span>((<span><span>item<span><span>, <span><span>index<span><span>) <span><span>=><span><span> {<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/list.html", "title": "列表渲染", "doc_id": "80e5ae33e4794d28872968ac0ed43795", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1081, "chunk_index": 11, "_doc_id": "11_998431837198565884"}}
{"doc_id": "12_5699276968677539448", "text": "pan><span>item<span><span>, <span><span>index<span><span>) <span><span>=><span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 可以访问外层的 `parentMessage`<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 而 `item` 和 `index` 只在这个作用域可用<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> console.<span><span>log<span><span>(parentMessage, item.message, index)<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/list.html", "title": "列表渲染", "doc_id": "80e5ae33e4794d28872968ac0ed43795", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1081, "chunk_index": 12, "_doc_id": "12_5699276968677539448"}}
{"doc_id": "13_3548138506715827095", "text": "s=\"line\"><span> console.<span><span>log<span><span>(parentMessage, item.message, index)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>})<span><span><code><pre><div><p>注意 <code>v-for<code> 是如何对应 <code>forEach<code> 回调的函数签名的。实际上，你也可以在定义 <code>v-for<code> 的变量别名时使用解构，和解构函数参数类似：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>li<span><span> v-for<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>{ message } <span><span>in<span><span> items<span><span>\"<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/list.html", "title": "列表渲染", "doc_id": "80e5ae33e4794d28872968ac0ed43795", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1081, "chunk_index": 13, "_doc_id": "13_3548138506715827095"}}
{"doc_id": "14_5618518134042812887", "text": "pan>\"<span><span>{ message } <span><span>in<span><span> items<span><span>\"<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> {{ message }}<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>li<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><!-- 有 index 索引时 --><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>li<span><span> v-for<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>({ message }, index) <span><span>in<span><span> items<span><span>\"<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/list.html", "title": "列表渲染", "doc_id": "80e5ae33e4794d28872968ac0ed43795", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1081, "chunk_index": 14, "_doc_id": "14_5618518134042812887"}}
{"doc_id": "15_3114274721571004863", "text": "n><span>({ message }, index) <span><span>in<span><span> items<span><span>\"<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> {{ message }} {{ index }}<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/list.html", "title": "列表渲染", "doc_id": "80e5ae33e4794d28872968ac0ed43795", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1081, "chunk_index": 15, "_doc_id": "15_3114274721571004863"}}
{"doc_id": "16_5712246263470078173", "text": "an><span>\"<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> {{ message }} {{ index }}<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>li<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>对于多层嵌套的 <code>v-for<code>，作用域的工作方式和函数的作用域很类似。每个 <code>v-for<code> 作用域都可以访问到父级作用域：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>li<span><span> v-for<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>item <span><span>in<span><span> items<span><span>\"<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/list.html", "title": "列表渲染", "doc_id": "80e5ae33e4794d28872968ac0ed43795", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1081, "chunk_index": 16, "_doc_id": "16_5712246263470078173"}}
{"doc_id": "17_5113483378012140865", "text": "span><span>\"<span><span>item <span><span>in<span><span> items<span><span>\"<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>span<span><span> v-for<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>childItem <span><span>in<span><span> item.children<span><span>\"<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> {{ item.message }} {{ childItem }}<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> </<span><span>span<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/list.html", "title": "列表渲染", "doc_id": "80e5ae33e4794d28872968ac0ed43795", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1081, "chunk_index": 17, "_doc_id": "17_5113483378012140865"}}
{"doc_id": "18_941578455867656155", "text": "} {{ childItem }}<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> </<span><span>span<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>li<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>你也可以使用 <code>of<code> 作为分隔符来替代 <code>in<code>，", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/list.html", "title": "列表渲染", "doc_id": "80e5ae33e4794d28872968ac0ed43795", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1081, "chunk_index": 18, "_doc_id": "18_941578455867656155"}}
{"doc_id": "19_9175506693507729472", "text": "n><span>li<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>你也可以使用 <code>of<code> 作为分隔符来替代 <code>in<code>，这更接近 JavaScript 的迭代器语法：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>div<span><span> v-for<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>item <span><span>of<span><span> items<span><span>\"<span><span>></<span><span>div<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><h2 id=\"v-for-with-an-object\"><code>v-for<code> 与对象 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#v-for-with-an-object\">​<a><h2><p>你也可以使用 <code>v-for<code> 来遍历一个对象的所有属性。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/list.html", "title": "列表渲染", "doc_id": "80e5ae33e4794d28872968ac0ed43795", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1081, "chunk_index": 19, "_doc_id": "19_9175506693507729472"}}
{"doc_id": "20_5936744382061686823", "text": "class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#v-for-with-an-object\">​<a><h2><p>你也可以使用 <code>v-for<code> 来遍历一个对象的所有属性。遍历的顺序会基于对该对象调用 <code>Object.values()<code> 的返回值来决定。<p><div class=\"composition-api\"><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> myObject<span><span> =<span><span> reactive<span><span>({<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> title: <span><span>'How to do lists in Vue'<span><span>,<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/list.html", "title": "列表渲染", "doc_id": "80e5ae33e4794d28872968ac0ed43795", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1081, "chunk_index": 20, "_doc_id": "20_5936744382061686823"}}
{"doc_id": "21_3888548522560820303", "text": "pan>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> title: <span><span>'How to do lists in Vue'<span><span>,<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> author: <span><span>'Jane Doe'<span><span>,<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> publishedAt: <span><span>'2016-04-10'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>})<span><span><code><pre><div><div><div class=\"options-api\"><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>data<span><span>() {<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/list.html", "title": "列表渲染", "doc_id": "80e5ae33e4794d28872968ac0ed43795", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1081, "chunk_index": 21, "_doc_id": "21_3888548522560820303"}}
{"doc_id": "22_6416051267749310384", "text": "e class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>data<span><span>() {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> return<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> myObject: {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> title: <span><span>'How to do lists in Vue'<span><span>,<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> author: <span><span>'Jane Doe'<span><span>,<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> publishedAt: <span><span>'2016-04-10'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/list.html", "title": "列表渲染", "doc_id": "80e5ae33e4794d28872968ac0ed43795", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1081, "chunk_index": 22, "_doc_id": "22_6416051267749310384"}}
{"doc_id": "23_8998204434595556630", "text": "e\"><span> publishedAt: <span><span>'2016-04-10'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span><code><pre><div><div><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>ul<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/list.html", "title": "列表渲染", "doc_id": "80e5ae33e4794d28872968ac0ed43795", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1081, "chunk_index": 23, "_doc_id": "23_8998204434595556630"}}
{"doc_id": "24_2593659276415360107", "text": "\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>ul<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>li<span><span> v-for<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>value <span><span>in<span><span> myObject<span><span>\"<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> {{ value }}<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> </<span><span>li<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/list.html", "title": "列表渲染", "doc_id": "80e5ae33e4794d28872968ac0ed43795", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1081, "chunk_index": 24, "_doc_id": "24_2593659276415360107"}}
{"doc_id": "25_1578959659384977566", "text": "><span> {{ value }}<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> </<span><span>li<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>ul<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>可以通过提供第二个参数表示属性名 (例如 key)：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>li<span><span> v-for<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>(value, key) <span><span>in<span><span> myObject<span><span>\"<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/list.html", "title": "列表渲染", "doc_id": "80e5ae33e4794d28872968ac0ed43795", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1081, "chunk_index": 25, "_doc_id": "25_1578959659384977566"}}
{"doc_id": "26_7856196709673289790", "text": "\"<span><span>(value, key) <span><span>in<span><span> myObject<span><span>\"<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> {{ key }}: {{ value }}<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/list.html", "title": "列表渲染", "doc_id": "80e5ae33e4794d28872968ac0ed43795", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1081, "chunk_index": 26, "_doc_id": "26_7856196709673289790"}}
{"doc_id": "27_8247810116344950158", "text": "<span><span>\"<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> {{ key }}: {{ value }}<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>li<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>第三个参数表示位置索引：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>li<span><span> v-for<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>(value, key, index) <span><span>in<span><span> myObject<span><span>\"<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/list.html", "title": "列表渲染", "doc_id": "80e5ae33e4794d28872968ac0ed43795", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1081, "chunk_index": 27, "_doc_id": "27_8247810116344950158"}}
{"doc_id": "28_5405897897078972039", "text": "<span>(value, key, index) <span><span>in<span><span> myObject<span><span>\"<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> {{ index }}. {{ key }}: {{ value }}<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>li<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><h2 id=\"v-for-with-a-range\">在 <code>v-for<code> 里使用范围值 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#v-for-with-a-range\">​<a><h2><p><code>v-for<code> 可以直接接受一个整数值。在这种用例中，会将该模板基于 <code>1...n<code> 的取值范围重复多次。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/list.html", "title": "列表渲染", "doc_id": "80e5ae33e4794d28872968ac0ed43795", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1081, "chunk_index": 28, "_doc_id": "28_5405897897078972039"}}
{"doc_id": "29_122979931438768994", "text": "r-with-a-range\">​<a><h2><p><code>v-for<code> 可以直接接受一个整数值。在这种用例中，会将该模板基于 <code>1...n<code> 的取值范围重复多次。<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>span<span><span> v-for<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>n <span><span>in<span><span> 10<span><span>\"<span><span>>{{ n }}</<span><span>span<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>注意此处 <code>n<code> 的初值是从 <code>1<code> 开始而非 <code>0<code>。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/list.html", "title": "列表渲染", "doc_id": "80e5ae33e4794d28872968ac0ed43795", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1081, "chunk_index": 29, "_doc_id": "29_122979931438768994"}}
{"doc_id": "30_8297424535503083900", "text": "pan><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>注意此处 <code>n<code> 的初值是从 <code>1<code> 开始而非 <code>0<code>。<p><h2 id=\"v-for-on-template\"><code><template><code> 上的 <code>v-for<code> <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#v-for-on-template\">​<a><h2><p>与模板上的 <code>v-if<code> 类似，你也可以在 <code><template><code> 标签上使用 <code>v-for<code> 来渲染一个包含多个元素的块。例如：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>ul<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/list.html", "title": "列表渲染", "doc_id": "80e5ae33e4794d28872968ac0ed43795", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1081, "chunk_index": 30, "_doc_id": "30_8297424535503083900"}}
{"doc_id": "31_8990344387774517892", "text": "\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>ul<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>template<span><span> v-for<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>item <span><span>in<span><span> items<span><span>\"<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>li<span><span>>{{ item.msg }}</<span><span>li<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/list.html", "title": "列表渲染", "doc_id": "80e5ae33e4794d28872968ac0ed43795", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1081, "chunk_index": 31, "_doc_id": "31_8990344387774517892"}}
{"doc_id": "32_9048055427486653072", "text": "s=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>li<span><span>>{{ item.msg }}</<span><span>li<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>li<span><span> class<span><span>=<span><span>\"divider\"<span><span> role<span><span>=<span><span>\"presentation\"<span><span>></<span><span>li<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> </<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/list.html", "title": "列表渲染", "doc_id": "80e5ae33e4794d28872968ac0ed43795", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1081, "chunk_index": 32, "_doc_id": "32_9048055427486653072"}}
{"doc_id": "33_3315895061020911663", "text": "<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> </<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>ul<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><h2 id=\"v-for-with-v-if\"><code>v-for<code> 与 <code>v-if<code> <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#v-for-with-v-if\">​<a><h2><p>当它们同时存在于一个节点上时，<code>v-if<code> 比 <code>v-for<code> 的优先级更高。这意味着 <code>v-if<code> 的条件将无法访问到 <code>v-for<code> 作用域内定义的变量别名：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><!--<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/list.html", "title": "列表渲染", "doc_id": "80e5ae33e4794d28872968ac0ed43795", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1081, "chunk_index": 33, "_doc_id": "33_3315895061020911663"}}
{"doc_id": "34_8901542421981009322", "text": "emplate<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><!--<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> 这会抛出一个错误，因为属性 todo 此时<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> 没有在该实例上定义<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>--><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/list.html", "title": "列表渲染", "doc_id": "80e5ae33e4794d28872968ac0ed43795", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1081, "chunk_index": 34, "_doc_id": "34_8901542421981009322"}}
{"doc_id": "35_4318384051605757628", "text": "pan><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> 没有在该实例上定义<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>--><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>li<span><span> v-for<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>todo <span><span>in<span><span> todos<span><span>\"<span><span> v-if<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>!<span><span>todo.isComplete<span><span>\"<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> {{ todo.name }}<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/list.html", "title": "列表渲染", "doc_id": "80e5ae33e4794d28872968ac0ed43795", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1081, "chunk_index": 35, "_doc_id": "35_4318384051605757628"}}
{"doc_id": "36_51222554576565688", "text": "omplete<span><span>\"<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> {{ todo.name }}<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>li<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>在外先包装一层 <code><template><code> 再在其上使用 <code>v-for<code> 可以解决这个问题 (这也更加明显易读)：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>template<span><span> v-for<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>todo <span><span>in<span><span> todos<span><span>\"<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/list.html", "title": "列表渲染", "doc_id": "80e5ae33e4794d28872968ac0ed43795", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1081, "chunk_index": 36, "_doc_id": "36_51222554576565688"}}
{"doc_id": "37_3292393375933010403", "text": "span><span>\"<span><span>todo <span><span>in<span><span> todos<span><span>\"<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>li<span><span> v-if<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>!<span><span>todo.isComplete<span><span>\"<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> {{ todo.name }}<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> </<span><span>li<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/list.html", "title": "列表渲染", "doc_id": "80e5ae33e4794d28872968ac0ed43795", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1081, "chunk_index": 37, "_doc_id": "37_3292393375933010403"}}
{"doc_id": "38_3106612263747189113", "text": "an> {{ todo.name }}<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> </<span><span>li<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><div class=\"warning custom-block\"><p class=\"custom-block-title\">注意<p><p>同时使用 <code>v-if<code> 和 <code>v-for<code> 是<strong>不推荐的<strong>，因为这样二者的优先级不明显。<p><p>两种常见的情况可能导致这种用法：<p><ul><li><p>过滤列表中的项目 (例如，<code>v-for=\"user in users\" v-if=\"user.isActive\"<code>)。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/list.html", "title": "列表渲染", "doc_id": "80e5ae33e4794d28872968ac0ed43795", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1081, "chunk_index": 38, "_doc_id": "38_3106612263747189113"}}
{"doc_id": "39_7476720183816587270", "text": ">两种常见的情况可能导致这种用法：<p><ul><li><p>过滤列表中的项目 (例如，<code>v-for=\"user in users\" v-if=\"user.isActive\"<code>)。在这种情况下，可以用一个新的计算属性来替换 <code>users<code>，该属性返回过滤后的列表 (例如 <code>activeUsers<code>)。<p><li><li><p>避免渲染应该隐藏的列表 (例如 <code>v-for=\"user in users\" v-if=\"shouldShowUsers\"<code>)。在这种情况下，将 <code>v-if<code> 移至容器元素 (如 <code>ul<code>、<code>ol<code>)。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/list.html", "title": "列表渲染", "doc_id": "80e5ae33e4794d28872968ac0ed43795", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1081, "chunk_index": 39, "_doc_id": "39_7476720183816587270"}}
{"doc_id": "40_6403766015559181351", "text": "s\" v-if=\"shouldShowUsers\"<code>)。在这种情况下，将 <code>v-if<code> 移至容器元素 (如 <code>ul<code>、<code>ol<code>)。<p><li><ul><div><h2 id=\"maintaining-state-with-key\">通过 key 管理状态 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#maintaining-state-with-key\">​<a><h2><p>Vue 默认按照“就地更新”的策略来更新通过 <code>v-for<code> 渲染的元素列表。当数据项的顺序改变时，Vue 不会随之移动 DOM 元素的顺序，而是就地更新每个元素，确保它们在原本指定的索引位置上渲染。<p><p>默认模式是高效的，但<strong>只适用于列表渲染输出的结果不依赖子组件状态或者临时 DOM 状态 (例如表单输入值) 的情况<strong>。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/list.html", "title": "列表渲染", "doc_id": "80e5ae33e4794d28872968ac0ed43795", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1081, "chunk_index": 40, "_doc_id": "40_6403766015559181351"}}
{"doc_id": "41_6632030842751464029", "text": "元素，确保它们在原本指定的索引位置上渲染。<p><p>默认模式是高效的，但<strong>只适用于列表渲染输出的结果不依赖子组件状态或者临时 DOM 状态 (例如表单输入值) 的情况<strong>。<p><p>为了给 Vue 一个提示，以便它可以跟踪每个节点的标识，从而重用和重新排序现有的元素，你需要为每个元素对应的块提供一个唯一的 <code>key<code> attribute：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>div<span><span> v-for<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>item <span><span>in<span><span> items<span><span>\"<span><span> :<span><span>key<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>item.id<span><span>\"<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/list.html", "title": "列表渲染", "doc_id": "80e5ae33e4794d28872968ac0ed43795", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1081, "chunk_index": 41, "_doc_id": "41_6632030842751464029"}}
{"doc_id": "42_3535023705084569588", "text": ":<span><span>key<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>item.id<span><span>\"<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <!-- 内容 --><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>div<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>当你使用 <code><template v-for><code> 时，", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/list.html", "title": "列表渲染", "doc_id": "80e5ae33e4794d28872968ac0ed43795", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1081, "chunk_index": 42, "_doc_id": "42_3535023705084569588"}}
{"doc_id": "43_249893855415273396", "text": "an></<span><span>div<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>当你使用 <code><template v-for><code> 时，<code>key<code> 应该被放置在这个 <code><template><code> 容器上：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>template<span><span> v-for<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>todo <span><span>in<span><span> todos<span><span>\"<span><span> :<span><span>key<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>todo.name<span><span>\"<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/list.html", "title": "列表渲染", "doc_id": "80e5ae33e4794d28872968ac0ed43795", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1081, "chunk_index": 43, "_doc_id": "43_249893855415273396"}}
{"doc_id": "44_944499345712292499", "text": "span><span>key<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>todo.name<span><span>\"<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>li<span><span>>{{ todo.name }}</<span><span>li<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><div class=\"tip custom-block\"><p class=\"custom-block-title\">注意<p><p><code>key<code> 在这里是一个通过 <code>v-bind<code> 绑定的特殊 attribute。请不要和<a href=\"#v-for-with-an-object\">在 <code>v-for<code> 中使用对象<a>里所提到的对象属性名相混淆。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/list.html", "title": "列表渲染", "doc_id": "80e5ae33e4794d28872968ac0ed43795", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1081, "chunk_index": 44, "_doc_id": "44_944499345712292499"}}
{"doc_id": "45_834672940450070321", "text": "code> 绑定的特殊 attribute。请不要和<a href=\"#v-for-with-an-object\">在 <code>v-for<code> 中使用对象<a>里所提到的对象属性名相混淆。<p><div><p>推荐在任何可行的时候为 <code>v-for<code> 提供一个 <code>key<code> attribute，除非所迭代的 DOM 内容非常简单 (例如：不包含组件或有状态的 DOM 元素)，或者你想有意采用默认行为来提高性能。<p><p><code>key<code> 绑定的值期望是一个基础类型的值，例如字符串或 number 类型。不要用对象作为 <code>v-for<code> 的 key。关于 <code>key<code> attribute 的更多用途细节，请参阅 <a href=\"/api/built-in-special-attributes.html#key\"><code>key<code> API 文档<a>。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/list.html", "title": "列表渲染", "doc_id": "80e5ae33e4794d28872968ac0ed43795", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1081, "chunk_index": 45, "_doc_id": "45_834672940450070321"}}
{"doc_id": "46_5542745675091959510", "text": "attribute 的更多用途细节，请参阅 <a href=\"/api/built-in-special-attributes.html#key\"><code>key<code> API 文档<a>。<p><h2 id=\"v-for-with-a-component\">组件上使用 <code>v-for<code> <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#v-for-with-a-component\">​<a><h2><blockquote><p>这一小节假设你已了解<a href=\"/guide/essentials/component-basics.html\">组件<a>的相关知识，或者你也可以先跳过这里，之后再回来看。<p><blockquote><p>我们可以直接在组件上使用 <code>v-for<code>，", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/list.html", "title": "列表渲染", "doc_id": "80e5ae33e4794d28872968ac0ed43795", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1081, "chunk_index": 46, "_doc_id": "46_5542745675091959510"}}
{"doc_id": "47_3094216998978268528", "text": "mponent-basics.html\">组件<a>的相关知识，或者你也可以先跳过这里，之后再回来看。<p><blockquote><p>我们可以直接在组件上使用 <code>v-for<code>，和在一般的元素上使用没有区别 (别忘记提供一个 <code>key<code>)：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>MyComponent<span><span> v-for<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>item <span><span>in<span><span> items<span><span>\"<span><span> :<span><span>key<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>item.id<span><span>\"<span><span> /><span><span><code><pre><div><p>但是，", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/list.html", "title": "列表渲染", "doc_id": "80e5ae33e4794d28872968ac0ed43795", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1081, "chunk_index": 47, "_doc_id": "47_3094216998978268528"}}
{"doc_id": "48_3216765180830790387", "text": "span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>item.id<span><span>\"<span><span> /><span><span><code><pre><div><p>但是，这不会自动将任何数据传递给组件，因为组件有自己独立的作用域。为了将迭代后的数据传递到组件中，我们还需要传递 props：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>MyComponent<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> v-for<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>(item, index) <span><span>in<span><span> items<span><span>\"<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/list.html", "title": "列表渲染", "doc_id": "80e5ae33e4794d28872968ac0ed43795", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1081, "chunk_index": 48, "_doc_id": "48_3216765180830790387"}}
{"doc_id": "49_4160086158230333895", "text": "n>=<span><span>\"<span><span>(item, index) <span><span>in<span><span> items<span><span>\"<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> :<span><span>item<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>item<span><span>\"<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> :<span><span>index<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>index<span><span>\"<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> :<span><span>key<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>item.id<span><span>\"<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/list.html", "title": "列表渲染", "doc_id": "80e5ae33e4794d28872968ac0ed43795", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1081, "chunk_index": 49, "_doc_id": "49_4160086158230333895"}}
{"doc_id": "50_4684799687285183493", "text": "line\"><span> :<span><span>key<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>item.id<span><span>\"<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>/><span><span><code><pre><div><p>不自动将 <code>item<code> 注入组件的原因是，这会使组件与 <code>v-for<code> 的工作方式紧密耦合。明确其数据的来源可以使组件在其他情况下重用。<p><h2 id=\"array-change-detection\">数组变化侦测 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#array-change-detection\">​<a><h2><h3 id=\"mutation-methods\">变更方法 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#mutation-methods\">​<a><h3><p>Vue 能够侦听响应式数组的变更方法，并在它们被调用时触发相关的更新。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/list.html", "title": "列表渲染", "doc_id": "80e5ae33e4794d28872968ac0ed43795", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1081, "chunk_index": 50, "_doc_id": "50_4684799687285183493"}}
{"doc_id": "51_92971715435898199", "text": "更方法 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#mutation-methods\">​<a><h3><p>Vue 能够侦听响应式数组的变更方法，并在它们被调用时触发相关的更新。这些变更方法包括：<p><ul><li><code>push()<code><li><li><code>pop()<code><li><li><code>shift()<code><li><li><code>unshift()<code><li><li><code>splice()<code><li><li><code>sort()<code><li><li><code>reverse()<code><li><ul><h3 id=\"replacing-an-array\">替换一个数组 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#replacing-an-array\">​<a><h3><p>变更方法，顾名思义，就是会对调用它们的原数组进行变更。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/list.html", "title": "列表渲染", "doc_id": "80e5ae33e4794d28872968ac0ed43795", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1081, "chunk_index": 51, "_doc_id": "51_92971715435898199"}}
{"doc_id": "52_366520456277389969", "text": "y\">替换一个数组 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#replacing-an-array\">​<a><h3><p>变更方法，顾名思义，就是会对调用它们的原数组进行变更。相对地，也有一些不可变 (immutable) 方法，例如 <code>filter()<code>，<code>concat()<code> 和 <code>slice()<code>，这些都不会更改原数组，而总是<strong>返回一个新数组<strong>。当遇到的是非变更方法时，我们需要将旧的数组替换为新的：<p><div class=\"composition-api\"><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// `items` 是一个数组的 ref<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>items.", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/list.html", "title": "列表渲染", "doc_id": "80e5ae33e4794d28872968ac0ed43795", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1081, "chunk_index": 52, "_doc_id": "52_366520456277389969"}}
{"doc_id": "53_2153976052235849609", "text": "de\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// `items` 是一个数组的 ref<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>items.value <span><span>=<span><span> items.value.<span><span>filter<span><span>((<span><span>item<span><span>) <span><span>=><span><span> item.message.", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/list.html", "title": "列表渲染", "doc_id": "80e5ae33e4794d28872968ac0ed43795", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1081, "chunk_index": 53, "_doc_id": "53_2153976052235849609"}}
{"doc_id": "54_3862304535606709888", "text": "pan><span>filter<span><span>((<span><span>item<span><span>) <span><span>=><span><span> item.message.<span><span>match<span><span>(<span><span>/<span><span>Foo<span><span>/<span><span>))<span><span><code><pre><div><div><div class=\"options-api\"><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>this<span><span>.items <span><span>=<span><span> this<span><span>.items.", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/list.html", "title": "列表渲染", "doc_id": "80e5ae33e4794d28872968ac0ed43795", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1081, "chunk_index": 54, "_doc_id": "54_3862304535606709888"}}
{"doc_id": "55_8353381481391440595", "text": "de><span class=\"line\"><span>this<span><span>.items <span><span>=<span><span> this<span><span>.items.<span><span>filter<span><span>((<span><span>item<span><span>) <span><span>=><span><span> item.message.<span><span>match<span><span>(<span><span>/<span><span>Foo<span><span>/<span><span>))<span><span><code><pre><div><div><p>你可能认为这将导致 Vue 丢弃现有的 DOM 并重新渲染整个列表——幸运的是，情况并非如此。Vue 实现了一些巧妙的方法来最大化对 DOM 元素的重用，因此用另一个包含部分重叠对象的数组来做替换，仍会是一种非常高效的操作。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/list.html", "title": "列表渲染", "doc_id": "80e5ae33e4794d28872968ac0ed43795", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1081, "chunk_index": 55, "_doc_id": "55_8353381481391440595"}}
{"doc_id": "56_200815129242512938", "text": "e 丢弃现有的 DOM 并重新渲染整个列表——幸运的是，情况并非如此。Vue 实现了一些巧妙的方法来最大化对 DOM 元素的重用，因此用另一个包含部分重叠对象的数组来做替换，仍会是一种非常高效的操作。<p><h2 id=\"displaying-filtered-sorted-results\">展示过滤或排序后的结果 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#displaying-filtered-sorted-results\">​<a><h2><p>有时，我们希望显示数组经过过滤或排序后的内容，而不实际变更或重置原始数据。在这种情况下，你可以创建返回已过滤或已排序数组的计算属性。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/list.html", "title": "列表渲染", "doc_id": "80e5ae33e4794d28872968ac0ed43795", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1081, "chunk_index": 56, "_doc_id": "56_200815129242512938"}}
{"doc_id": "57_4185326367753878505", "text": "ltered-sorted-results\">​<a><h2><p>有时，我们希望显示数组经过过滤或排序后的内容，而不实际变更或重置原始数据。在这种情况下，你可以创建返回已过滤或已排序数组的计算属性。<p><p>举例来说：<p><div class=\"composition-api\"><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> numbers<span><span> =<span><span> ref<span><span>([<span><span>1<span><span>, <span><span>2<span><span>, <span><span>3<span><span>, <span><span>4<span><span>, <span><span>5<span><span>])<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/list.html", "title": "列表渲染", "doc_id": "80e5ae33e4794d28872968ac0ed43795", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1081, "chunk_index": 57, "_doc_id": "57_4185326367753878505"}}
{"doc_id": "58_8332200226057013641", "text": "span>, <span><span>4<span><span>, <span><span>5<span><span>])<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> evenNumbers<span><span> =<span><span> computed<span><span>(() <span><span>=><span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> return<span><span> numbers.value.<span><span>filter<span><span>((<span><span>n<span><span>) <span><span>=><span><span> n <span><span>%<span><span> 2<span><span> ===<span><span> 0<span><span>)<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/list.html", "title": "列表渲染", "doc_id": "80e5ae33e4794d28872968ac0ed43795", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1081, "chunk_index": 58, "_doc_id": "58_8332200226057013641"}}
{"doc_id": "59_6125212641823832747", "text": "=><span><span> n <span><span>%<span><span> 2<span><span> ===<span><span> 0<span><span>)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>})<span><span><code><pre><div><div><div class=\"options-api\"><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>data<span><span>() {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> return<span><span> {<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/list.html", "title": "列表渲染", "doc_id": "80e5ae33e4794d28872968ac0ed43795", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1081, "chunk_index": 59, "_doc_id": "59_6125212641823832747"}}
{"doc_id": "60_5943186744650127021", "text": "\"><span>data<span><span>() {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> return<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> numbers: [<span><span>1<span><span>, <span><span>2<span><span>, <span><span>3<span><span>, <span><span>4<span><span>, <span><span>5<span><span>]<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>},<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>computed<span><span>: {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> evenNumbers<span><span>() {<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/list.html", "title": "列表渲染", "doc_id": "80e5ae33e4794d28872968ac0ed43795", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1081, "chunk_index": 60, "_doc_id": "60_5943186744650127021"}}
