{"doc_id": "43_6966802927717523347", "text": "<span>>Selected: {{ selected }}</<span><span>div<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>select<span><span> v-model<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>selected<span><span>\"<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/forms.html", "title": "表单输入绑定", "doc_id": "bb4159050f3b46369a3eeb07c8cae898", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 829, "chunk_index": 43, "_doc_id": "43_6966802927717523347"}}
{"doc_id": "44_2160236185762131872", "text": "><span> v-model<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>selected<span><span>\"<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>option<span><span> v-for<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>option <span><span>in<span><span> options<span><span>\"<span><span> :<span><span>value<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>option.value<span><span>\"<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> {{ option.text }}<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> </<span><span>option<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/forms.html", "title": "表单输入绑定", "doc_id": "bb4159050f3b46369a3eeb07c8cae898", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 829, "chunk_index": 44, "_doc_id": "44_2160236185762131872"}}
{"doc_id": "45_4625663533342611307", "text": "option.text }}<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> </<span><span>option<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>select<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><h2 id=\"value-bindings\">值绑定 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#value-bindings\">​<a><h2><p>对于单选按钮，复选框和选择器选项，<code>v-model<code> 绑定的值通常是静态的字符串 (或者对复选框是布尔值)：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><!-- `picked` 在被选择时是字符串 \"a\" --><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/forms.html", "title": "表单输入绑定", "doc_id": "bb4159050f3b46369a3eeb07c8cae898", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 829, "chunk_index": 45, "_doc_id": "45_4625663533342611307"}}
{"doc_id": "46_1491958996088587702", "text": "iki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><!-- `picked` 在被选择时是字符串 \"a\" --><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>input<span><span> type<span><span>=<span><span>\"radio\"<span><span> v-model<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>picked<span><span>\"<span><span> value<span><span>=<span><span>\"a\"<span><span> /><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><!-- `toggle` 只会为 true 或 false --><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/forms.html", "title": "表单输入绑定", "doc_id": "bb4159050f3b46369a3eeb07c8cae898", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 829, "chunk_index": 46, "_doc_id": "46_1491958996088587702"}}
{"doc_id": "47_1599337092932424995", "text": ">\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><!-- `toggle` 只会为 true 或 false --><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>input<span><span> type<span><span>=<span><span>\"checkbox\"<span><span> v-model<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>toggle<span><span>\"<span><span> /><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><!-- `selected` 在第一项被选中时为字符串 \"abc\" --><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/forms.html", "title": "表单输入绑定", "doc_id": "bb4159050f3b46369a3eeb07c8cae898", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 829, "chunk_index": 47, "_doc_id": "47_1599337092932424995"}}
{"doc_id": "48_4516899933937185165", "text": "pan class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><!-- `selected` 在第一项被选中时为字符串 \"abc\" --><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>select<span><span> v-model<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>selected<span><span>\"<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>option<span><span> value<span><span>=<span><span>\"abc\"<span><span>>ABC</<span><span>option<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/forms.html", "title": "表单输入绑定", "doc_id": "bb4159050f3b46369a3eeb07c8cae898", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 829, "chunk_index": 48, "_doc_id": "48_4516899933937185165"}}
{"doc_id": "49_4804816261872586231", "text": "n> value<span><span>=<span><span>\"abc\"<span><span>>ABC</<span><span>option<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>select<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>但有时我们可能希望将该值绑定到当前组件实例上的动态数据。这可以通过使用 <code>v-bind<code> 来实现。此外，使用 <code>v-bind<code> 还使我们可以将选项值绑定为非字符串的数据类型。<p><h3 id=\"checkbox-1\">复选框 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#checkbox-1\">​<a><h3><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>input<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/forms.html", "title": "表单输入绑定", "doc_id": "bb4159050f3b46369a3eeb07c8cae898", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 829, "chunk_index": 49, "_doc_id": "49_4804816261872586231"}}
{"doc_id": "50_5872471772621411940", "text": "pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>input<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> type<span><span>=<span><span>\"checkbox\"<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> v-model<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>toggle<span><span>\"<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> true-value<span><span>=<span><span>\"yes\"<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/forms.html", "title": "表单输入绑定", "doc_id": "bb4159050f3b46369a3eeb07c8cae898", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 829, "chunk_index": 50, "_doc_id": "50_5872471772621411940"}}
{"doc_id": "51_9038177686909214517", "text": "><span>\"<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> true-value<span><span>=<span><span>\"yes\"<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> false-value<span><span>=<span><span>\"no\"<span><span> /><span><span><code><pre><div><p><code>true-value<code> 和 <code>false-value<code> 是 Vue 特有的 attributes，仅支持和 <code>v-model<code> 配套使用。这里 <code>toggle<code> 属性的值会在选中时被设为 <code>'yes'<code>，取消选择时设为 <code>'no'<code>。你同样可以通过 <code>v-bind<code> 将其绑定为其他动态值：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>input<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/forms.html", "title": "表单输入绑定", "doc_id": "bb4159050f3b46369a3eeb07c8cae898", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 829, "chunk_index": 51, "_doc_id": "51_9038177686909214517"}}
{"doc_id": "52_8243531881666867414", "text": "pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>input<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> type<span><span>=<span><span>\"checkbox\"<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> v-model<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>toggle<span><span>\"<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> :<span><span>true-value<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>dynamicTrueValue<span><span>\"<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/forms.html", "title": "表单输入绑定", "doc_id": "bb4159050f3b46369a3eeb07c8cae898", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 829, "chunk_index": 52, "_doc_id": "52_8243531881666867414"}}
{"doc_id": "53_8392675714700886106", "text": "pan><span>true-value<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>dynamicTrueValue<span><span>\"<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> :<span><span>false-value<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>dynamicFalseValue<span><span>\"<span><span> /><span><span><code><pre><div><div class=\"tip custom-block\"><p class=\"custom-block-title\">提示<p><p><code>true-value<code> 和 <code>false-value<code> attributes 不会影响 <code>value<code> attribute，因为浏览器在表单提交时，并不会包含未选择的复选框。为了保证这两个值 (例如：“yes”和“no”) 的其中之一被表单提交，请使用单选按钮作为替代。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/forms.html", "title": "表单输入绑定", "doc_id": "bb4159050f3b46369a3eeb07c8cae898", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 829, "chunk_index": 53, "_doc_id": "53_8392675714700886106"}}
{"doc_id": "54_8599543601462879905", "text": "code>value<code> attribute，因为浏览器在表单提交时，并不会包含未选择的复选框。为了保证这两个值 (例如：“yes”和“no”) 的其中之一被表单提交，请使用单选按钮作为替代。<p><div><h3 id=\"radio-1\">单选按钮 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#radio-1\">​<a><h3><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>input<span><span> type<span><span>=<span><span>\"radio\"<span><span> v-model<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>pick<span><span>\"<span><span> :<span><span>value<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>first<span><span>\"<span><span> /><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/forms.html", "title": "表单输入绑定", "doc_id": "bb4159050f3b46369a3eeb07c8cae898", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 829, "chunk_index": 54, "_doc_id": "54_8599543601462879905"}}
{"doc_id": "55_8852398809463960548", "text": "span><span>value<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>first<span><span>\"<span><span> /><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>input<span><span> type<span><span>=<span><span>\"radio\"<span><span> v-model<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>pick<span><span>\"<span><span> :<span><span>value<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>second<span><span>\"<span><span> /><span><span><code><pre><div><p><code>pick<code> 会在第一个按钮选中时被设为 <code>first<code>，在第二个按钮选中时被设为 <code>second<code>。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/forms.html", "title": "表单输入绑定", "doc_id": "bb4159050f3b46369a3eeb07c8cae898", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 829, "chunk_index": 55, "_doc_id": "55_8852398809463960548"}}
{"doc_id": "56_6837825606629661804", "text": "<code><pre><div><p><code>pick<code> 会在第一个按钮选中时被设为 <code>first<code>，在第二个按钮选中时被设为 <code>second<code>。<p><h3 id=\"select-options-2\">选择器选项 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#select-options-2\">​<a><h3><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>select<span><span> v-model<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>selected<span><span>\"<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <!-- 内联对象字面量 --><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/forms.html", "title": "表单输入绑定", "doc_id": "bb4159050f3b46369a3eeb07c8cae898", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 829, "chunk_index": 56, "_doc_id": "56_6837825606629661804"}}
{"doc_id": "57_4187504005458726436", "text": "lected<span><span>\"<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <!-- 内联对象字面量 --><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>option<span><span> :<span><span>value<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>{ number: <span><span>123<span><span> }<span><span>\"<span><span>>123</<span><span>option<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/forms.html", "title": "表单输入绑定", "doc_id": "bb4159050f3b46369a3eeb07c8cae898", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 829, "chunk_index": 57, "_doc_id": "57_4187504005458726436"}}
{"doc_id": "58_4363163013300137991", "text": "n><span>123<span><span> }<span><span>\"<span><span>>123</<span><span>option<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>select<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p><code>v-model<code> 同样也支持非字符串类型的值绑定！在上面这个例子中，当某个选项被选中，<code>selected<code> 会被设为该对象字面量值 <code>{ number: 123 }<code>。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/forms.html", "title": "表单输入绑定", "doc_id": "bb4159050f3b46369a3eeb07c8cae898", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 829, "chunk_index": 58, "_doc_id": "58_4363163013300137991"}}
{"doc_id": "59_9222603496018571749", "text": "ode> 同样也支持非字符串类型的值绑定！在上面这个例子中，当某个选项被选中，<code>selected<code> 会被设为该对象字面量值 <code>{ number: 123 }<code>。<p><h2 id=\"modifiers\">修饰符 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#modifiers\">​<a><h2><h3 id=\"lazy\"><code>.lazy<code> <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#lazy\">​<a><h3><p>默认情况下，<code>v-model<code> 会在每次 <code>input<code> 事件后更新数据 (<a href=\"#vmodel-ime-tip\">IME 拼字阶段的状态<a>例外)。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/forms.html", "title": "表单输入绑定", "doc_id": "bb4159050f3b46369a3eeb07c8cae898", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 829, "chunk_index": 59, "_doc_id": "59_9222603496018571749"}}
{"doc_id": "60_9023995752819755318", "text": "情况下，<code>v-model<code> 会在每次 <code>input<code> 事件后更新数据 (<a href=\"#vmodel-ime-tip\">IME 拼字阶段的状态<a>例外)。你可以添加 <code>lazy<code> 修饰符来改为在每次 <code>change<code> 事件后更新数据：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><!-- 在 \"change\" 事件后同步更新而不是 \"input\" --><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/forms.html", "title": "表单输入绑定", "doc_id": "bb4159050f3b46369a3eeb07c8cae898", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 829, "chunk_index": 60, "_doc_id": "60_9023995752819755318"}}
{"doc_id": "61_5916603584711563678", "text": "hub-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><!-- 在 \"change\" 事件后同步更新而不是 \"input\" --><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>input<span><span> v-model<span><span>.<span><span>lazy<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>msg<span><span>\"<span><span> /><span><span><code><pre><div><h3 id=\"number\"><code>.number<code> <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#number\">​<a><h3><p>如果你想让用户输入自动转换为数字，", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/forms.html", "title": "表单输入绑定", "doc_id": "bb4159050f3b46369a3eeb07c8cae898", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 829, "chunk_index": 61, "_doc_id": "61_5916603584711563678"}}
{"doc_id": "62_1225263467570232425", "text": "id=\"number\"><code>.number<code> <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#number\">​<a><h3><p>如果你想让用户输入自动转换为数字，你可以在 <code>v-model<code> 后添加 <code>.number<code> 修饰符来管理输入：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>input<span><span> v-model<span><span>.<span><span>number<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>age<span><span>\"<span><span> /><span><span><code><pre><div><p>如果该值无法被 <code>parseFloat()<code> 处理，那么将返回原始值。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/forms.html", "title": "表单输入绑定", "doc_id": "bb4159050f3b46369a3eeb07c8cae898", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 829, "chunk_index": 62, "_doc_id": "62_1225263467570232425"}}
{"doc_id": "63_6944292010025734005", "text": "n><span>\"<span><span> /><span><span><code><pre><div><p>如果该值无法被 <code>parseFloat()<code> 处理，那么将返回原始值。特别是当输入为空时 (例如用户清空输入字段之后)，会返回一个空字符串。这种行为与 <a href=\"https://developer.mozilla.org/zh-CN/docs/Web/API/HTMLInputElement#valueasnumber\" target=\"_blank\">DOM 属性 valueAsNumber<a> 有所不同。<p><p><code>number<code> 修饰符会在输入框有 <code>type=\"number\"<code> 时自动启用。<p><h3 id=\"trim\"><code>.trim<code> <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#trim\">​<a><h3><p>如果你想要默认自动去除用户输入内容中两端的空格，", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/forms.html", "title": "表单输入绑定", "doc_id": "bb4159050f3b46369a3eeb07c8cae898", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 829, "chunk_index": 63, "_doc_id": "63_6944292010025734005"}}
{"doc_id": "64_1761929301982348985", "text": "d=\"trim\"><code>.trim<code> <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#trim\">​<a><h3><p>如果你想要默认自动去除用户输入内容中两端的空格，你可以在 <code>v-model<code> 后添加 <code>.trim<code> 修饰符：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>input<span><span> v-model<span><span>.<span><span>trim<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>msg<span><span>\"<span><span> /><span><span><code><pre><div><h2 id=\"v-model-with-components\">组件上的 <code>v-model<code> <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#v-model-with-components\">​<a><h2><blockquote><p>如果你还不熟悉 Vue 的组件，", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/forms.html", "title": "表单输入绑定", "doc_id": "bb4159050f3b46369a3eeb07c8cae898", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 829, "chunk_index": 64, "_doc_id": "64_1761929301982348985"}}
{"doc_id": "65_4759932296835725111", "text": "de> <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#v-model-with-components\">​<a><h2><blockquote><p>如果你还不熟悉 Vue 的组件，那么现在可以跳过这个部分。<p><blockquote><p>HTML 的内置表单输入类型并不总能满足所有需求。幸运的是，我们可以使用 Vue 构建具有自定义行为的可复用输入组件，并且这些输入组件也支持 <code>v-model<code>！要了解更多关于此的内容，请在组件指引中阅读<a href=\"/guide/components/v-model.html\">配合 <code>v-model<code> 使用<a>。<p><div><div>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/forms.html", "title": "表单输入绑定", "doc_id": "bb4159050f3b46369a3eeb07c8cae898", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 829, "chunk_index": 65, "_doc_id": "65_4759932296835725111"}}
{"doc_id": "0_2171539062694586745", "text": "<div><div><h1 id=\"watchers\">侦听器 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#watchers\">​<a><h1><h2 id=\"basic-example\">基本示例 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#basic-example\">​<a><h2><p>计算属性允许我们声明性地计算衍生值。然而在有些情况下，我们需要在状态变化时执行一些“副作用”：例如更改 DOM，或是根据异步操作的结果去修改另一处的状态。<p><div class=\"options-api\"><p>在选项式 API 中，我们可以使用 <a href=\"/api/options-state.html#watch\"><code>watch<code> 选项<a>在每次响应式属性发生变化时触发一个函数。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/watchers.html", "title": "侦听器 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "d948f51ea4684ffbb098c7df3f332e81", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1820, "chunk_index": 0, "_doc_id": "0_2171539062694586745"}}
{"doc_id": "1_5184651458687588984", "text": "选项式 API 中，我们可以使用 <a href=\"/api/options-state.html#watch\"><code>watch<code> 选项<a>在每次响应式属性发生变化时触发一个函数。<p><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> data<span><span>() {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> return<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> question: <span><span>''<span><span>,<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/watchers.html", "title": "侦听器 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "d948f51ea4684ffbb098c7df3f332e81", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1820, "chunk_index": 1, "_doc_id": "1_5184651458687588984"}}
{"doc_id": "2_8865211840363752122", "text": "an><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> question: <span><span>''<span><span>,<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> answer: <span><span>'Questions usually contain a question mark. ;-)'<span><span>,<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> loading: <span><span>false<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> },<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> watch: {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 每当 question 改变时，这个函数就会执行<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/watchers.html", "title": "侦听器 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "d948f51ea4684ffbb098c7df3f332e81", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1820, "chunk_index": 2, "_doc_id": "2_8865211840363752122"}}
{"doc_id": "3_8636084091898279834", "text": "line\"><span> watch: {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 每当 question 改变时，这个函数就会执行<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> question<span><span>(<span><span>newQuestion<span><span>, <span><span>oldQuestion<span><span>) {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> if<span><span> (newQuestion.<span><span>includes<span><span>(<span><span>'?'<span><span>)) {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> this<span><span>.<span><span>getAnswer<span><span>()<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/watchers.html", "title": "侦听器 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "d948f51ea4684ffbb098c7df3f332e81", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1820, "chunk_index": 3, "_doc_id": "3_8636084091898279834"}}
{"doc_id": "4_2912662949712064574", "text": "span><span>.<span><span>getAnswer<span><span>()<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> },<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> methods: {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> async<span><span> getAnswer<span><span>() {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> this<span><span>.loading <span><span>=<span><span> true<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> this<span><span>.answer <span><span>=<span><span> 'Thinking...'<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/watchers.html", "title": "侦听器 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "d948f51ea4684ffbb098c7df3f332e81", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1820, "chunk_index": 4, "_doc_id": "4_2912662949712064574"}}
{"doc_id": "5_6992163455167036790", "text": "pan class=\"line\"><span> this<span><span>.answer <span><span>=<span><span> 'Thinking...'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> try<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> const<span><span> res<span><span> =<span><span> await<span><span> fetch<span><span>(<span><span>'https://yesno.wtf/api'<span><span>)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> this<span><span>.answer <span><span>=<span><span> (<span><span>await<span><span> res.<span><span>json<span><span>()).answer<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/watchers.html", "title": "侦听器 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "d948f51ea4684ffbb098c7df3f332e81", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1820, "chunk_index": 5, "_doc_id": "5_6992163455167036790"}}
{"doc_id": "6_2571001493427023568", "text": "=<span><span> (<span><span>await<span><span> res.<span><span>json<span><span>()).answer<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> } <span><span>catch<span><span> (error) {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> this<span><span>.answer <span><span>=<span><span> 'Error! Could not reach the API. '<span><span> +<span><span> error<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> } <span><span>finally<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> this<span><span>.loading <span><span>=<span><span> false<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/watchers.html", "title": "侦听器 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "d948f51ea4684ffbb098c7df3f332e81", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1820, "chunk_index": 6, "_doc_id": "6_2571001493427023568"}}
{"doc_id": "7_2531908382505042553", "text": "pan>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> this<span><span>.loading <span><span>=<span><span> false<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span><code><pre><div><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>p<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> Ask a yes/no question:<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/watchers.html", "title": "侦听器 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "d948f51ea4684ffbb098c7df3f332e81", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1820, "chunk_index": 7, "_doc_id": "7_2531908382505042553"}}
