{"doc_id": "13_3031559898429940310", "text": "// ...<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span><code><pre><div><div><div class=\"composition-api\"><p>在组合式 API 中，我们可以使用 <a href=\"/api/reactivity-core.html#watch\"><code>watch<code> 函数<a>在每次响应式状态发生变化时触发回调函数：<p><div class=\"language-vue\"> <span class=\"lang\">vue<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>script<span><span> setup<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/watchers.html", "title": "侦听器 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "d948f51ea4684ffbb098c7df3f332e81", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1820, "chunk_index": 13, "_doc_id": "13_3031559898429940310"}}
{"doc_id": "14_1707493344978012813", "text": "code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>script<span><span> setup<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>import<span><span> { ref, watch } <span><span>from<span><span> 'vue'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> question<span><span> =<span><span> ref<span><span>(<span><span>''<span><span>)<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/watchers.html", "title": "侦听器 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "d948f51ea4684ffbb098c7df3f332e81", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1820, "chunk_index": 14, "_doc_id": "14_1707493344978012813"}}
{"doc_id": "15_5372916019945446127", "text": "n><span> question<span><span> =<span><span> ref<span><span>(<span><span>''<span><span>)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> answer<span><span> =<span><span> ref<span><span>(<span><span>'Questions usually contain a question mark. ;-)'<span><span>)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> loading<span><span> =<span><span> ref<span><span>(<span><span>false<span><span>)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 可以直接侦听一个 ref<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/watchers.html", "title": "侦听器 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "d948f51ea4684ffbb098c7df3f332e81", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1820, "chunk_index": 15, "_doc_id": "15_5372916019945446127"}}
{"doc_id": "16_8955633663511496842", "text": "><span>)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 可以直接侦听一个 ref<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>watch<span><span>(question, <span><span>async<span><span> (<span><span>newQuestion<span><span>, <span><span>oldQuestion<span><span>) <span><span>=><span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> if<span><span> (newQuestion.<span><span>includes<span><span>(<span><span>'?'<span><span>)) {<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/watchers.html", "title": "侦听器 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "d948f51ea4684ffbb098c7df3f332e81", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1820, "chunk_index": 16, "_doc_id": "16_8955633663511496842"}}
{"doc_id": "17_796122701408544749", "text": "an><span> (newQuestion.<span><span>includes<span><span>(<span><span>'?'<span><span>)) {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> loading.value <span><span>=<span><span> true<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> answer.value <span><span>=<span><span> 'Thinking...'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> try<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> const<span><span> res<span><span> =<span><span> await<span><span> fetch<span><span>(<span><span>'https://yesno.wtf/api'<span><span>)<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/watchers.html", "title": "侦听器 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "d948f51ea4684ffbb098c7df3f332e81", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1820, "chunk_index": 17, "_doc_id": "17_796122701408544749"}}
{"doc_id": "18_2443159904191170312", "text": "n> await<span><span> fetch<span><span>(<span><span>'https://yesno.wtf/api'<span><span>)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> answer.value <span><span>=<span><span> (<span><span>await<span><span> res.<span><span>json<span><span>()).answer<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> } <span><span>catch<span><span> (error) {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> answer.value <span><span>=<span><span> 'Error! Could not reach the API. '<span><span> +<span><span> error<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/watchers.html", "title": "侦听器 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "d948f51ea4684ffbb098c7df3f332e81", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1820, "chunk_index": 18, "_doc_id": "18_2443159904191170312"}}
{"doc_id": "19_6963412528939797850", "text": "><span>=<span><span> 'Error! Could not reach the API. '<span><span> +<span><span> error<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> } <span><span>finally<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> loading.value <span><span>=<span><span> false<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>})<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>script<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/watchers.html", "title": "侦听器 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "d948f51ea4684ffbb098c7df3f332e81", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1820, "chunk_index": 19, "_doc_id": "19_6963412528939797850"}}
{"doc_id": "20_8599609696575368297", "text": "n>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>script<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>p<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> Ask a yes/no question:<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>input<span><span> v-model<span><span>=<span><span>\"question\"<span><span> :disabled<span><span>=<span><span>\"loading\"<span><span> /><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/watchers.html", "title": "侦听器 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "d948f51ea4684ffbb098c7df3f332e81", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1820, "chunk_index": 20, "_doc_id": "20_8599609696575368297"}}
