{"doc_id": "23_6578053514897795774", "text": "\" target=\"_blank\">在演练场中尝试一下<a><p><h3 id=\"watch-source-types\">侦听数据源类型 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#watch-source-types\">​<a><h3><p><code>watch<code> 的第一个参数可以是不同形式的“数据源”：它可以是一个 ref", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/watchers.html", "title": "侦听器 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "d948f51ea4684ffbb098c7df3f332e81", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1820, "chunk_index": 23, "_doc_id": "23_6578053514897795774"}}
{"doc_id": "24_1909357720500918148", "text": "ader-anchor\" href=\"#watch-source-types\">​<a><h3><p><code>watch<code> 的第一个参数可以是不同形式的“数据源”：它可以是一个 ref (包括计算属性)、一个响应式对象、一个 <a href=\"https://developer.mozilla.org/zh-CN/docs/Web/JavaScript/Reference/Functions/get#description\" target=\"_blank\">getter 函数<a>、或多个数据源组成的数组：<p><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> x<span><span> =<span><span> ref<span><span>(<span><span>0<span><span>)<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/watchers.html", "title": "侦听器 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "d948f51ea4684ffbb098c7df3f332e81", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1820, "chunk_index": 24, "_doc_id": "24_1909357720500918148"}}
{"doc_id": "25_8891439728184004739", "text": "onst<span><span> x<span><span> =<span><span> ref<span><span>(<span><span>0<span><span>)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> y<span><span> =<span><span> ref<span><span>(<span><span>0<span><span>)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 单个 ref<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>watch<span><span>(x, (<span><span>newX<span><span>) <span><span>=><span><span> {<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/watchers.html", "title": "侦听器 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "d948f51ea4684ffbb098c7df3f332e81", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1820, "chunk_index": 25, "_doc_id": "25_8891439728184004739"}}
{"doc_id": "26_4567949394954771242", "text": "><span>watch<span><span>(x, (<span><span>newX<span><span>) <span><span>=><span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> console.<span><span>log<span><span>(<span><span>`x is ${<span><span>newX<span><span>}`<span><span>)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>})<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// getter 函数<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>watch<span><span>(<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/watchers.html", "title": "侦听器 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "d948f51ea4684ffbb098c7df3f332e81", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1820, "chunk_index": 26, "_doc_id": "26_4567949394954771242"}}
{"doc_id": "27_7836676015730953735", "text": "class=\"line\"><span>// getter 函数<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>watch<span><span>(<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> () <span><span>=><span><span> x.value <span><span>+<span><span> y.value,<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> (<span><span>sum<span><span>) <span><span>=><span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> console.<span><span>log<span><span>(<span><span>`sum of x + y is: ${<span><span>sum<span><span>}`<span><span>)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/watchers.html", "title": "侦听器 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "d948f51ea4684ffbb098c7df3f332e81", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1820, "chunk_index": 27, "_doc_id": "27_7836676015730953735"}}
{"doc_id": "28_3211753319774349639", "text": "s: ${<span><span>sum<span><span>}`<span><span>)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 多个来源组成的数组<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>watch<span><span>([x, () <span><span>=><span><span> y.value], ([<span><span>newX<span><span>, <span><span>newY<span><span>]) <span><span>=><span><span> {<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/watchers.html", "title": "侦听器 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "d948f51ea4684ffbb098c7df3f332e81", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1820, "chunk_index": 28, "_doc_id": "28_3211753319774349639"}}
{"doc_id": "29_7214526515774269905", "text": "pan><span>newX<span><span>, <span><span>newY<span><span>]) <span><span>=><span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> console.<span><span>log<span><span>(<span><span>`x is ${<span><span>newX<span><span>} and y is ${<span><span>newY<span><span>}`<span><span>)<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/watchers.html", "title": "侦听器 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "d948f51ea4684ffbb098c7df3f332e81", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1820, "chunk_index": 29, "_doc_id": "29_7214526515774269905"}}
{"doc_id": "30_3849014012127706421", "text": "${<span><span>newX<span><span>} and y is ${<span><span>newY<span><span>}`<span><span>)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>})<span><span><code><pre><div><p>注意，你不能直接侦听响应式对象的属性值，例如：<p><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> obj<span><span> =<span><span> reactive<span><span>({ count: <span><span>0<span><span> })<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/watchers.html", "title": "侦听器 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "d948f51ea4684ffbb098c7df3f332e81", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1820, "chunk_index": 30, "_doc_id": "30_3849014012127706421"}}
{"doc_id": "31_8853504006961949092", "text": "n> reactive<span><span>({ count: <span><span>0<span><span> })<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 错误，因为 watch() 得到的参数是一个 number<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>watch<span><span>(obj.count, (<span><span>count<span><span>) <span><span>=><span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> console.<span><span>log<span><span>(<span><span>`Count is: ${<span><span>count<span><span>}`<span><span>)<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/watchers.html", "title": "侦听器 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "d948f51ea4684ffbb098c7df3f332e81", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1820, "chunk_index": 31, "_doc_id": "31_8853504006961949092"}}
{"doc_id": "32_3658945002680791961", "text": "n>log<span><span>(<span><span>`Count is: ${<span><span>count<span><span>}`<span><span>)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>})<span><span><code><pre><div><p>这里需要用一个返回该属性的 getter 函数：<p><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// 提供一个 getter 函数<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>watch<span><span>(<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> () <span><span>=><span><span> obj.count,<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/watchers.html", "title": "侦听器 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "d948f51ea4684ffbb098c7df3f332e81", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1820, "chunk_index": 32, "_doc_id": "32_3658945002680791961"}}
{"doc_id": "33_5798298488735506221", "text": "><span>(<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> () <span><span>=><span><span> obj.count,<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> (<span><span>count<span><span>) <span><span>=><span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> console.<span><span>log<span><span>(<span><span>`Count is: ${<span><span>count<span><span>}`<span><span>)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/watchers.html", "title": "侦听器 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "d948f51ea4684ffbb098c7df3f332e81", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1820, "chunk_index": 33, "_doc_id": "33_5798298488735506221"}}
{"doc_id": "34_2798997806214040529", "text": "${<span><span>count<span><span>}`<span><span>)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>)<span><span><code><pre><div><div><h2 id=\"deep-watchers\">深层侦听器 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#deep-watchers\">​<a><h2><div class=\"options-api\"><p><code>watch<code> 默认是浅层的：被侦听的属性，仅在被赋新值时，才会触发回调函数——而嵌套属性的变化不会触发。如果想侦听所有嵌套的变更，你需要深层侦听器：<p><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/watchers.html", "title": "侦听器 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "d948f51ea4684ffbb098c7df3f332e81", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1820, "chunk_index": 34, "_doc_id": "34_2798997806214040529"}}
{"doc_id": "35_1152367199937532017", "text": "b-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> watch: {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> someObject: {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> handler<span><span>(<span><span>newValue<span><span>, <span><span>oldValue<span><span>) {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 注意：在嵌套的变更中，<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 只要没有替换对象本身，<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 那么这里的 `newValue` 和 `oldValue` 相同<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/watchers.html", "title": "侦听器 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "d948f51ea4684ffbb098c7df3f332e81", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1820, "chunk_index": 35, "_doc_id": "35_1152367199937532017"}}
{"doc_id": "36_2397623612538685010", "text": "/ 只要没有替换对象本身，<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 那么这里的 `newValue` 和 `oldValue` 相同<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> },<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> deep: <span><span>true<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/watchers.html", "title": "侦听器 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "d948f51ea4684ffbb098c7df3f332e81", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1820, "chunk_index": 36, "_doc_id": "36_2397623612538685010"}}
{"doc_id": "37_6857828643343298254", "text": "an>true<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span><code><pre><div><div><div class=\"composition-api\"><p>直接给 <code>watch()<code> 传入一个响应式对象，会隐式地创建一个深层侦听器——该回调函数在所有嵌套的变更时都会被触发：<p><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> obj<span><span> =<span><span> reactive<span><span>({ count: <span><span>0<span><span> })<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/watchers.html", "title": "侦听器 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "d948f51ea4684ffbb098c7df3f332e81", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1820, "chunk_index": 37, "_doc_id": "37_6857828643343298254"}}
{"doc_id": "38_4522773388915061910", "text": "bj<span><span> =<span><span> reactive<span><span>({ count: <span><span>0<span><span> })<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>watch<span><span>(obj, (<span><span>newValue<span><span>, <span><span>oldValue<span><span>) <span><span>=><span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 在嵌套的属性变更时触发<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 注意：`newValue` 此处和 `oldValue` 是相等的<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 因为它们是同一个对象！<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>})<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/watchers.html", "title": "侦听器 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "d948f51ea4684ffbb098c7df3f332e81", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1820, "chunk_index": 38, "_doc_id": "38_4522773388915061910"}}
{"doc_id": "39_2777806298371155408", "text": "<span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 因为它们是同一个对象！<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>})<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>obj.count<span><span>++<span><span><code><pre><div><p>相比之下，一个返回响应式对象的 getter 函数，只有在返回不同的对象时，才会触发回调：<p><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>watch<span><span>(<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> () <span><span>=><span><span> state.someObject,<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/watchers.html", "title": "侦听器 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "d948f51ea4684ffbb098c7df3f332e81", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1820, "chunk_index": 39, "_doc_id": "39_2777806298371155408"}}
{"doc_id": "40_3777574565671472393", "text": "(<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> () <span><span>=><span><span> state.someObject,<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> () <span><span>=><span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 仅当 state.someObject 被替换时触发<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/watchers.html", "title": "侦听器 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "d948f51ea4684ffbb098c7df3f332e81", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1820, "chunk_index": 40, "_doc_id": "40_3777574565671472393"}}
{"doc_id": "41_9141698069410931465", "text": "ass=\"line\"><span> // 仅当 state.someObject 被替换时触发<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>)<span><span><code><pre><div><p>你也可以给上面这个例子显式地加上 <code>deep<code> 选项，强制转成深层侦听器：<p><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>watch<span><span>(<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> () <span><span>=><span><span> state.someObject,<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/watchers.html", "title": "侦听器 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "d948f51ea4684ffbb098c7df3f332e81", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1820, "chunk_index": 41, "_doc_id": "41_9141698069410931465"}}
{"doc_id": "42_5897992014657464451", "text": "(<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> () <span><span>=><span><span> state.someObject,<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> (<span><span>newValue<span><span>, <span><span>oldValue<span><span>) <span><span>=><span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 注意：`newValue` 此处和 `oldValue` 是相等的<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // *除非* state.someObject 被整个替换了<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> },<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> { deep: <span><span>true<span><span> }<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/watchers.html", "title": "侦听器 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "d948f51ea4684ffbb098c7df3f332e81", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1820, "chunk_index": 42, "_doc_id": "42_5897992014657464451"}}
{"doc_id": "43_1769075039248640285", "text": "><span> },<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> { deep: <span><span>true<span><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>)<span><span><code><pre><div><div><p>在 Vue 3.5+ 中，<code>deep<code> 选项还可以是一个数字，表示最大遍历深度——即 Vue 应该遍历对象嵌套属性的级数。<p><div class=\"warning custom-block\"><p class=\"custom-block-title\">谨慎使用<p><p>深度侦听需要遍历被侦听对象中的所有嵌套的属性，当用于大型数据结构时，开销很大。因此请只在必要时才使用它，并且要留意性能。<p><div><h2 id=\"eager-watchers\">即时回调的侦听器 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#eager-watchers\">​<a><h2><p><code>watch<code> 默认是懒执行的：仅当数据源变化时，才会执行回调。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/watchers.html", "title": "侦听器 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "d948f51ea4684ffbb098c7df3f332e81", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1820, "chunk_index": 43, "_doc_id": "43_1769075039248640285"}}
{"doc_id": "44_4019140683698758883", "text": "a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#eager-watchers\">​<a><h2><p><code>watch<code> 默认是懒执行的：仅当数据源变化时，才会执行回调。但在某些场景中，我们希望在创建侦听器时，立即执行一遍回调。举例来说，我们想请求一些初始数据，然后在相关状态更改时重新请求数据。<p><div class=\"options-api\"><p>我们可以用一个对象来声明侦听器，这个对象有 <code>handler<code> 方法和 <code>immediate: true<code> 选项，这样便能强制回调函数立即执行：<p><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // ...<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/watchers.html", "title": "侦听器 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "d948f51ea4684ffbb098c7df3f332e81", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1820, "chunk_index": 44, "_doc_id": "44_4019140683698758883"}}
{"doc_id": "45_5747345442646270526", "text": "n>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // ...<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> watch: {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> question: {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> handler<span><span>(<span><span>newQuestion<span><span>) {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 在组件实例创建时会立即调用<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> },<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 强制立即执行回调<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> immediate: <span><span>true<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/watchers.html", "title": "侦听器 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "d948f51ea4684ffbb098c7df3f332e81", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1820, "chunk_index": 45, "_doc_id": "45_5747345442646270526"}}
{"doc_id": "46_8564558153401602292", "text": "e\"><span> // 强制立即执行回调<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> immediate: <span><span>true<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // ...<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/watchers.html", "title": "侦听器 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "d948f51ea4684ffbb098c7df3f332e81", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1820, "chunk_index": 46, "_doc_id": "46_8564558153401602292"}}
{"doc_id": "47_1545849120251054355", "text": "}<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // ...<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span><code><pre><div><p>回调函数的初次执行就发生在 <code>created<code> 钩子之前。Vue 此时已经处理了 <code>data<code>、<code>computed<code> 和 <code>methods<code> 选项，所以这些属性在第一次调用时就是可用的。<p><div><div class=\"composition-api\"><p>我们可以通过传入 <code>immediate: true<code> 选项来强制侦听器的回调立即执行：<p><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>watch<span><span>(<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/watchers.html", "title": "侦听器 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "d948f51ea4684ffbb098c7df3f332e81", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1820, "chunk_index": 47, "_doc_id": "47_1545849120251054355"}}
{"doc_id": "48_3957520166291810022", "text": "pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>watch<span><span>(<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> source,<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> (<span><span>newValue<span><span>, <span><span>oldValue<span><span>) <span><span>=><span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 立即执行，且当 `source` 改变时再次执行<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> },<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> { immediate: <span><span>true<span><span> }<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/watchers.html", "title": "侦听器 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "d948f51ea4684ffbb098c7df3f332e81", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1820, "chunk_index": 48, "_doc_id": "48_3957520166291810022"}}
{"doc_id": "49_8220832634195808445", "text": "n> },<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> { immediate: <span><span>true<span><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>)<span><span><code><pre><div><div><h2 id=\"once-watchers\">一次性侦听器 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#once-watchers\">​<a><h2><p>每当被侦听源发生变化时，侦听器的回调就会执行。如果希望回调只在源变化时触发一次，请使用 <code>once: true<code> 选项。<p><div class=\"options-api\"><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/watchers.html", "title": "侦听器 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "d948f51ea4684ffbb098c7df3f332e81", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1820, "chunk_index": 49, "_doc_id": "49_8220832634195808445"}}
{"doc_id": "50_4318331708477905234", "text": "b-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> watch: {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> source: {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> handler<span><span>(<span><span>newValue<span><span>, <span><span>oldValue<span><span>) {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 当 `source` 变化时，仅触发一次<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> },<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> once: <span><span>true<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/watchers.html", "title": "侦听器 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "d948f51ea4684ffbb098c7df3f332e81", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1820, "chunk_index": 50, "_doc_id": "50_4318331708477905234"}}
{"doc_id": "51_328317829937907065", "text": "pan class=\"line\"><span> },<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> once: <span><span>true<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span><code><pre><div><div><div class=\"composition-api\"><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>watch<span><span>(<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> source,<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/watchers.html", "title": "侦听器 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "d948f51ea4684ffbb098c7df3f332e81", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1820, "chunk_index": 51, "_doc_id": "51_328317829937907065"}}
{"doc_id": "52_48937465598348270", "text": "pan class=\"line\"><span>watch<span><span>(<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> source,<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> (<span><span>newValue<span><span>, <span><span>oldValue<span><span>) <span><span>=><span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 当 `source` 变化时，仅触发一次<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> },<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> { once: <span><span>true<span><span> }<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/watchers.html", "title": "侦听器 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "d948f51ea4684ffbb098c7df3f332e81", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1820, "chunk_index": 52, "_doc_id": "52_48937465598348270"}}
{"doc_id": "53_5080847436467298711", "text": "><span> },<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> { once: <span><span>true<span><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>)<span><span><code><pre><div><div><div class=\"composition-api\"><h2 id=\"watcheffect\"><code>watchEffect()<code> <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#watcheffect\">​<a><h2><p>侦听器的回调使用与源完全相同的响应式状态是很常见的。例如下面的代码，在每当 <code>todoId<code> 的引用发生变化时使用侦听器来加载一个远程资源：<p><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> todoId<span><span> =<span><span> ref<span><span>(<span><span>1<span><span>)<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/watchers.html", "title": "侦听器 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "d948f51ea4684ffbb098c7df3f332e81", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1820, "chunk_index": 53, "_doc_id": "53_5080847436467298711"}}
{"doc_id": "54_7592479502924910826", "text": "span><span> todoId<span><span> =<span><span> ref<span><span>(<span><span>1<span><span>)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> data<span><span> =<span><span> ref<span><span>(<span><span>null<span><span>)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>watch<span><span>(<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> todoId,<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> async<span><span> () <span><span>=><span><span> {<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/watchers.html", "title": "侦听器 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "d948f51ea4684ffbb098c7df3f332e81", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1820, "chunk_index": 54, "_doc_id": "54_7592479502924910826"}}
{"doc_id": "55_6340384974445393993", "text": "span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> async<span><span> () <span><span>=><span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> const<span><span> response<span><span> =<span><span> await<span><span> fetch<span><span>(<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> `https://jsonplaceholder.typicode.com/todos/${<span><span>todoId<span><span>.<span><span>value<span><span>}`<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> )<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/watchers.html", "title": "侦听器 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "d948f51ea4684ffbb098c7df3f332e81", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1820, "chunk_index": 55, "_doc_id": "55_6340384974445393993"}}
{"doc_id": "56_2093498830043228334", "text": "oId<span><span>.<span><span>value<span><span>}`<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> )<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> data.value <span><span>=<span><span> await<span><span> response.<span><span>json<span><span>()<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> },<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> { immediate: <span><span>true<span><span> }<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/watchers.html", "title": "侦听器 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "d948f51ea4684ffbb098c7df3f332e81", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1820, "chunk_index": 56, "_doc_id": "56_2093498830043228334"}}
{"doc_id": "57_2045434011371297471", "text": "n> },<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> { immediate: <span><span>true<span><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>)<span><span><code><pre><div><p>特别是注意侦听器是如何两次使用 <code>todoId<code> 的，一次是作为源，另一次是在回调中。<p><p>我们可以用 <a href=\"/api/reactivity-core.html#watcheffect\"><code>watchEffect<code> 函数<a> 来简化上面的代码。<code>watchEffect()<code> 允许我们自动跟踪回调的响应式依赖。上面的侦听器可以重写为：<p><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>watchEffect<span><span>(<span><span>async<span><span> () <span><span>=><span><span> {<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/watchers.html", "title": "侦听器 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "d948f51ea4684ffbb098c7df3f332e81", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1820, "chunk_index": 57, "_doc_id": "57_2045434011371297471"}}
{"doc_id": "58_7395994246640953491", "text": "n>watchEffect<span><span>(<span><span>async<span><span> () <span><span>=><span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> const<span><span> response<span><span> =<span><span> await<span><span> fetch<span><span>(<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> `https://jsonplaceholder.typicode.com/todos/${<span><span>todoId<span><span>.<span><span>value<span><span>}`<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> )<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/watchers.html", "title": "侦听器 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "d948f51ea4684ffbb098c7df3f332e81", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1820, "chunk_index": 58, "_doc_id": "58_7395994246640953491"}}
{"doc_id": "59_79715792621714725", "text": "oId<span><span>.<span><span>value<span><span>}`<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> )<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> data.value <span><span>=<span><span> await<span><span> response.<span><span>json<span><span>()<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>})<span><span><code><pre><div><p>这个例子中，回调会立即执行，不需要指定 <code>immediate: true<code>。在执行期间，它会自动追踪 <code>todoId.value<code> 作为依赖(和计算属性类似)。每当 <code>todoId.value<code> 变化时，回调会再次执行。有了 <code>watchEffect()<code>，我们不再需要明确传递 <code>todoId<code> 作为源值。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/watchers.html", "title": "侦听器 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "d948f51ea4684ffbb098c7df3f332e81", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1820, "chunk_index": 59, "_doc_id": "59_79715792621714725"}}
{"doc_id": "60_5559104143076591121", "text": "code>todoId.value<code> 变化时，回调会再次执行。有了 <code>watchEffect()<code>，我们不再需要明确传递 <code>todoId<code> 作为源值。<p><p>你可以参考一下<a href=\"/examples/#fetching-data\">这个例子<a>的 <code>watchEffect<code> 和响应式的数据请求的操作。<p><p>对于这种只有一个依赖项的例子来说，<code>watchEffect()<code> 的好处相对较小。但是对于有多个依赖项的侦听器来说，使用 <code>watchEffect()<code> 可以消除手动维护依赖列表的负担。此外，如果你需要侦听一个嵌套数据结构中的几个属性，<code>watchEffect()<code> 可能会比深度侦听器更有效，因为它将只跟踪回调中被使用到的属性，而不是递归地跟踪所有的属性。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/watchers.html", "title": "侦听器 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "d948f51ea4684ffbb098c7df3f332e81", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1820, "chunk_index": 60, "_doc_id": "60_5559104143076591121"}}
{"doc_id": "61_8411423936281700376", "text": "的负担。此外，如果你需要侦听一个嵌套数据结构中的几个属性，<code>watchEffect()<code> 可能会比深度侦听器更有效，因为它将只跟踪回调中被使用到的属性，而不是递归地跟踪所有的属性。<p><div class=\"tip custom-block\"><p class=\"custom-block-title\">TIP<p><p><code>watchEffect<code> 仅会在其<strong>同步<strong>执行期间，才追踪依赖。在使用异步回调时，只有在第一个 <code>await<code> 正常工作前访问到的属性才会被追踪。<p><div><h3 id=\"watch-vs-watcheffect\"><code>watch<code> vs. <code>watchEffect<code> <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#watch-vs-watcheffect\">​<a><h3><p><code>watch<code> 和 <code>watchEffect<code> 都能响应式地执行有副作用的回调。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/watchers.html", "title": "侦听器 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "d948f51ea4684ffbb098c7df3f332e81", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1820, "chunk_index": 61, "_doc_id": "61_8411423936281700376"}}
{"doc_id": "62_319600699713013996", "text": "href=\"#watch-vs-watcheffect\">​<a><h3><p><code>watch<code> 和 <code>watchEffect<code> 都能响应式地执行有副作用的回调。它们之间的主要区别是追踪响应式依赖的方式：<p><div><h2 id=\"side-effect-cleanup\">副作用清理 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#side-effect-cleanup\">​<a><h2><p>有时我们可能会在侦听器中执行副作用，例如异步请求：<p><div class=\"composition-api\"><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>watch<span><span>(id, (<span><span>newId<span><span>) <span><span>=><span><span> {<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/watchers.html", "title": "侦听器 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "d948f51ea4684ffbb098c7df3f332e81", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1820, "chunk_index": 62, "_doc_id": "62_319600699713013996"}}
{"doc_id": "63_1147443347125482733", "text": "span>watch<span><span>(id, (<span><span>newId<span><span>) <span><span>=><span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> fetch<span><span>(<span><span>`/api/${<span><span>newId<span><span>}`<span><span>).<span><span>then<span><span>(() <span><span>=><span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 回调逻辑<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> })<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/watchers.html", "title": "侦听器 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "d948f51ea4684ffbb098c7df3f332e81", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1820, "chunk_index": 63, "_doc_id": "63_1147443347125482733"}}
{"doc_id": "64_3531903688353201806", "text": "<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 回调逻辑<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> })<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>})<span><span><code><pre><div><div><div class=\"options-api\"><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> watch: {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> id<span><span>(<span><span>newId<span><span>) {<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/watchers.html", "title": "侦听器 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "d948f51ea4684ffbb098c7df3f332e81", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1820, "chunk_index": 64, "_doc_id": "64_3531903688353201806"}}
{"doc_id": "65_1960723313339711806", "text": "{<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> id<span><span>(<span><span>newId<span><span>) {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> fetch<span><span>(<span><span>`/api/${<span><span>newId<span><span>}`<span><span>).<span><span>then<span><span>(() <span><span>=><span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 回调逻辑<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> })<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/watchers.html", "title": "侦听器 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "d948f51ea4684ffbb098c7df3f332e81", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1820, "chunk_index": 65, "_doc_id": "65_1960723313339711806"}}
{"doc_id": "66_4044592271574484810", "text": "pan> })<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span><code><pre><div><div><p>但是如果在请求完成之前 <code>id<code> 发生了变化怎么办？当上一个请求完成时，它仍会使用已经过时的 ID 值触发回调。理想情况下，我们希望能够在 <code>id<code> 变为新值时取消过时的请求。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/watchers.html", "title": "侦听器 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "d948f51ea4684ffbb098c7df3f332e81", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1820, "chunk_index": 66, "_doc_id": "66_4044592271574484810"}}
{"doc_id": "67_4770553798620790268", "text": "成之前 <code>id<code> 发生了变化怎么办？当上一个请求完成时，它仍会使用已经过时的 ID 值触发回调。理想情况下，我们希望能够在 <code>id<code> 变为新值时取消过时的请求。<p><p>我们可以使用 <a href=\"/api/reactivity-core.html#onwatchercleanup\"><code>onWatcherCleanup()<code><a> API 来注册一个清理函数，当侦听器失效并准备重新运行时会被调用：<p><div class=\"composition-api\"><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>import<span><span> { watch, onWatcherCleanup } <span><span>from<span><span> 'vue'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/watchers.html", "title": "侦听器 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "d948f51ea4684ffbb098c7df3f332e81", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1820, "chunk_index": 67, "_doc_id": "67_4770553798620790268"}}
{"doc_id": "68_253675431819225757", "text": "watch, onWatcherCleanup } <span><span>from<span><span> 'vue'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>watch<span><span>(id, (<span><span>newId<span><span>) <span><span>=><span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> const<span><span> controller<span><span> =<span><span> new<span><span> AbortController<span><span>()<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/watchers.html", "title": "侦听器 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "d948f51ea4684ffbb098c7df3f332e81", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1820, "chunk_index": 68, "_doc_id": "68_253675431819225757"}}
{"doc_id": "69_7462608890993303187", "text": "> =<span><span> new<span><span> AbortController<span><span>()<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> fetch<span><span>(<span><span>`/api/${<span><span>newId<span><span>}`<span><span>, { signal: controller.signal }).<span><span>then<span><span>(() <span><span>=><span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 回调逻辑<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> })<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/watchers.html", "title": "侦听器 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "d948f51ea4684ffbb098c7df3f332e81", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1820, "chunk_index": 69, "_doc_id": "69_7462608890993303187"}}
{"doc_id": "70_3237211259504055582", "text": "line\"><span> // 回调逻辑<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> })<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line highlighted\"><span> onWatcherCleanup<span><span>(() <span><span>=><span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line highlighted\"><span> // 终止过期请求<span><span>\n<span class=\"line highlighted\"><span> controller.<span><span>abort<span><span>()<span><span>\n<span class=\"line highlighted\"><span> })<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/watchers.html", "title": "侦听器 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "d948f51ea4684ffbb098c7df3f332e81", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1820, "chunk_index": 70, "_doc_id": "70_3237211259504055582"}}
{"doc_id": "71_6868327485054999163", "text": "er.<span><span>abort<span><span>()<span><span>\n<span class=\"line highlighted\"><span> })<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>})<span><span><code><pre><div><div><div class=\"options-api\"><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>import<span><span> { onWatcherCleanup } <span><span>from<span><span> 'vue'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/watchers.html", "title": "侦听器 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "d948f51ea4684ffbb098c7df3f332e81", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1820, "chunk_index": 71, "_doc_id": "71_6868327485054999163"}}
{"doc_id": "72_2096462738787425099", "text": "n class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> watch: {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> id<span><span>(<span><span>newId<span><span>) {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> const<span><span> controller<span><span> =<span><span> new<span><span> AbortController<span><span>()<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/watchers.html", "title": "侦听器 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "d948f51ea4684ffbb098c7df3f332e81", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1820, "chunk_index": 72, "_doc_id": "72_2096462738787425099"}}
{"doc_id": "73_7462608890993303187", "text": "> =<span><span> new<span><span> AbortController<span><span>()<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> fetch<span><span>(<span><span>`/api/${<span><span>newId<span><span>}`<span><span>, { signal: controller.signal }).<span><span>then<span><span>(() <span><span>=><span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 回调逻辑<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> })<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/watchers.html", "title": "侦听器 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "d948f51ea4684ffbb098c7df3f332e81", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1820, "chunk_index": 73, "_doc_id": "73_7462608890993303187"}}
{"doc_id": "74_164430920211200094", "text": "line\"><span> // 回调逻辑<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> })<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line highlighted\"><span> onWatcherCleanup<span><span>(() <span><span>=><span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line highlighted\"><span> // 终止过期请求<span><span>\n<span class=\"line highlighted\"><span> controller.<span><span>abort<span><span>()<span><span>\n<span class=\"line highlighted\"><span> })<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/watchers.html", "title": "侦听器 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "d948f51ea4684ffbb098c7df3f332e81", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1820, "chunk_index": 74, "_doc_id": "74_164430920211200094"}}
{"doc_id": "75_7554906955318418559", "text": "pan> })<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span><code><pre><div><div><p>请注意，<code>onWatcherCleanup<code> 仅在 Vue 3.5+ 中支持，并且必须在 <code>watchEffect<code> 效果函数或 <code>watch<code> 回调函数的同步执行期间调用：你不能在异步函数的 <code>await<code> 语句之后调用它。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/watchers.html", "title": "侦听器 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "d948f51ea4684ffbb098c7df3f332e81", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1820, "chunk_index": 75, "_doc_id": "75_7554906955318418559"}}
{"doc_id": "76_2198995105051314504", "text": "在 <code>watchEffect<code> 效果函数或 <code>watch<code> 回调函数的同步执行期间调用：你不能在异步函数的 <code>await<code> 语句之后调用它。<p><p>作为替代，<code>onCleanup<code> 函数还作为第三个参数传递给侦听器回调<span class=\"composition-api\">，以及 <code>watchEffect<code> 作用函数的第一个参数<span>：<p><div class=\"composition-api\"><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>watch<span><span>(id, (<span><span>newId<span><span>, <span><span>oldId<span><span>, <span><span>onCleanup<span><span>) <span><span>=><span><span> {<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/watchers.html", "title": "侦听器 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "d948f51ea4684ffbb098c7df3f332e81", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1820, "chunk_index": 76, "_doc_id": "76_2198995105051314504"}}
{"doc_id": "77_6932612367383586915", "text": "span>oldId<span><span>, <span><span>onCleanup<span><span>) <span><span>=><span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // ...<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> onCleanup<span><span>(() <span><span>=><span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 清理逻辑<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> })<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>})<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/watchers.html", "title": "侦听器 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "d948f51ea4684ffbb098c7df3f332e81", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1820, "chunk_index": 77, "_doc_id": "77_6932612367383586915"}}
{"doc_id": "78_3446881452870931283", "text": "lass=\"line\"><span> })<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>})<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>watchEffect<span><span>((<span><span>onCleanup<span><span>) <span><span>=><span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // ...<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> onCleanup<span><span>(() <span><span>=><span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 清理逻辑<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> })<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/watchers.html", "title": "侦听器 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "d948f51ea4684ffbb098c7df3f332e81", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1820, "chunk_index": 78, "_doc_id": "78_3446881452870931283"}}
{"doc_id": "79_1891032223929022819", "text": "<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 清理逻辑<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> })<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>})<span><span><code><pre><div><div><div class=\"options-api\"><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> watch: {<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/watchers.html", "title": "侦听器 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "d948f51ea4684ffbb098c7df3f332e81", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1820, "chunk_index": 79, "_doc_id": "79_1891032223929022819"}}
{"doc_id": "80_1181742276617776411", "text": "export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> watch: {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> id<span><span>(<span><span>newId<span><span>, <span><span>oldId<span><span>, <span><span>onCleanup<span><span>) {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // ...<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> onCleanup<span><span>(() <span><span>=><span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 清理逻辑<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> })<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/watchers.html", "title": "侦听器 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "d948f51ea4684ffbb098c7df3f332e81", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1820, "chunk_index": 80, "_doc_id": "80_1181742276617776411"}}
{"doc_id": "81_5808367013752199774", "text": "<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 清理逻辑<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> })<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span><code><pre><div><div><p>这在 3.5 之前的版本有效。此外，通过函数参数传递的 <code>onCleanup<code> 与侦听器实例相绑定，因此不受 <code>onWatcherCleanup<code> 的同步限制。<p><h2 id=\"callback-flush-timing\">回调的触发时机 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#callback-flush-timing\">​<a><h2><p>当你更改了响应式状态，它可能会同时触发 Vue 组件更新和侦听器回调。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/watchers.html", "title": "侦听器 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "d948f51ea4684ffbb098c7df3f332e81", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1820, "chunk_index": 81, "_doc_id": "81_5808367013752199774"}}
{"doc_id": "82_8358062641383275831", "text": "a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#callback-flush-timing\">​<a><h2><p>当你更改了响应式状态，它可能会同时触发 Vue 组件更新和侦听器回调。<p><p>类似于组件更新，用户创建的侦听器回调函数也会被批量处理以避免重复调用。例如，如果我们同步将一千个项目推入被侦听的数组中，我们可能不希望侦听器触发一千次。<p><p>默认情况下，侦听器回调会在父组件更新 (如有) <strong>之后<strong>、所属组件的 DOM 更新<strong>之前<strong>被调用。这意味着如果你尝试在侦听器回调中访问所属组件的 DOM，那么 DOM 将处于更新前的状态。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/watchers.html", "title": "侦听器 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "d948f51ea4684ffbb098c7df3f332e81", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1820, "chunk_index": 82, "_doc_id": "82_8358062641383275831"}}
{"doc_id": "83_1536190336104091774", "text": ") <strong>之后<strong>、所属组件的 DOM 更新<strong>之前<strong>被调用。这意味着如果你尝试在侦听器回调中访问所属组件的 DOM，那么 DOM 将处于更新前的状态。<p><h3 id=\"post-watchers\">Post Watchers <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#post-watchers\">​<a><h3><p>如果想在侦听器回调中能访问被 Vue 更新<strong>之后<strong>的所属组件的 DOM，你需要指明 <code>flush: 'post'<code> 选项：<p><div class=\"options-api\"><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/watchers.html", "title": "侦听器 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "d948f51ea4684ffbb098c7df3f332e81", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1820, "chunk_index": 83, "_doc_id": "83_1536190336104091774"}}
{"doc_id": "84_8006828121545592015", "text": "b-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // ...<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> watch: {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> key: {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> handler<span><span>() {},<span><span>\n<span class=\"line highlighted\"><span> flush: <span><span>'post'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/watchers.html", "title": "侦听器 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "d948f51ea4684ffbb098c7df3f332e81", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1820, "chunk_index": 84, "_doc_id": "84_8006828121545592015"}}
{"doc_id": "85_1802022835735837482", "text": ">'post'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span><code><pre><div><div><div class=\"composition-api\"><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>watch<span><span>(source, callback, {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line highlighted\"><span> flush: <span><span>'post'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>})<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/watchers.html", "title": "侦听器 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "d948f51ea4684ffbb098c7df3f332e81", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1820, "chunk_index": 85, "_doc_id": "85_1802022835735837482"}}
{"doc_id": "86_5501546182149804475", "text": "h: <span><span>'post'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>})<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>watchEffect<span><span>(callback, {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line highlighted\"><span> flush: <span><span>'post'<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/watchers.html", "title": "侦听器 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "d948f51ea4684ffbb098c7df3f332e81", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1820, "chunk_index": 86, "_doc_id": "86_5501546182149804475"}}
{"doc_id": "87_6780530212959671565", "text": "callback, {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line highlighted\"><span> flush: <span><span>'post'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>})<span><span><code><pre><div><p>后置刷新的 <code>watchEffect()<code> 有个更方便的别名 <code>watchPostEffect()<code>：<p><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>import<span><span> { watchPostEffect } <span><span>from<span><span> 'vue'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/watchers.html", "title": "侦听器 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "d948f51ea4684ffbb098c7df3f332e81", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1820, "chunk_index": 87, "_doc_id": "87_6780530212959671565"}}
{"doc_id": "88_899334560268360838", "text": "<span> { watchPostEffect } <span><span>from<span><span> 'vue'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>watchPostEffect<span><span>(() <span><span>=><span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> /* 在 Vue 更新后执行 */<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/watchers.html", "title": "侦听器 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "d948f51ea4684ffbb098c7df3f332e81", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1820, "chunk_index": 88, "_doc_id": "88_899334560268360838"}}
{"doc_id": "89_8138877855785850917", "text": "() <span><span>=><span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> /* 在 Vue 更新后执行 */<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>})<span><span><code><pre><div><div><h3 id=\"sync-watchers\">同步侦听器 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#sync-watchers\">​<a><h3><p>你还可以创建一个同步触发的侦听器，它会在 Vue 进行任何更新之前触发：<p><div class=\"options-api\"><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/watchers.html", "title": "侦听器 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "d948f51ea4684ffbb098c7df3f332e81", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1820, "chunk_index": 89, "_doc_id": "89_8138877855785850917"}}
{"doc_id": "90_2933458754176453616", "text": "b-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // ...<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> watch: {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> key: {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> handler<span><span>() {},<span><span>\n<span class=\"line highlighted\"><span> flush: <span><span>'sync'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/watchers.html", "title": "侦听器 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "d948f51ea4684ffbb098c7df3f332e81", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1820, "chunk_index": 90, "_doc_id": "90_2933458754176453616"}}
{"doc_id": "91_2997442349802652199", "text": ">'sync'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span><code><pre><div><div><div class=\"composition-api\"><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>watch<span><span>(source, callback, {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line highlighted\"><span> flush: <span><span>'sync'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>})<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/watchers.html", "title": "侦听器 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "d948f51ea4684ffbb098c7df3f332e81", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1820, "chunk_index": 91, "_doc_id": "91_2997442349802652199"}}
{"doc_id": "92_1617987064689747149", "text": "h: <span><span>'sync'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>})<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>watchEffect<span><span>(callback, {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line highlighted\"><span> flush: <span><span>'sync'<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/watchers.html", "title": "侦听器 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "d948f51ea4684ffbb098c7df3f332e81", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1820, "chunk_index": 92, "_doc_id": "92_1617987064689747149"}}
{"doc_id": "93_5094062509747875878", "text": "callback, {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line highlighted\"><span> flush: <span><span>'sync'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>})<span><span><code><pre><div><p>同步触发的 <code>watchEffect()<code> 有个更方便的别名 <code>watchSyncEffect()<code>：<p><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>import<span><span> { watchSyncEffect } <span><span>from<span><span> 'vue'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/watchers.html", "title": "侦听器 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "d948f51ea4684ffbb098c7df3f332e81", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1820, "chunk_index": 93, "_doc_id": "93_5094062509747875878"}}
{"doc_id": "94_6408632620688581904", "text": "<span> { watchSyncEffect } <span><span>from<span><span> 'vue'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>watchSyncEffect<span><span>(() <span><span>=><span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> /* 在响应式数据变化时同步执行 */<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>})<span><span><code><pre><div><div><div class=\"warning custom-block\"><p class=\"custom-block-title\">谨慎使用<p><p>同步侦听器不会进行批处理，每当检测到响应式数据发生变化时就会触发。可以使用它来监视简单的布尔值，但应避免在可能多次同步修改的数据源 (如数组) 上使用。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/watchers.html", "title": "侦听器 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "d948f51ea4684ffbb098c7df3f332e81", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1820, "chunk_index": 94, "_doc_id": "94_6408632620688581904"}}
{"doc_id": "95_3213905673039209187", "text": "-block-title\">谨慎使用<p><p>同步侦听器不会进行批处理，每当检测到响应式数据发生变化时就会触发。可以使用它来监视简单的布尔值，但应避免在可能多次同步修改的数据源 (如数组) 上使用。<p><div><div class=\"options-api\"><h2 id=\"this-watch\"><code>this.$watch()<code> <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#this-watch\">​<a><h2><p>我们也可以使用组件实例的 <a href=\"/api/component-instance.html#watch\"><code>$watch()<code> 方法<a>来命令式地创建一个侦听器：<p><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/watchers.html", "title": "侦听器 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "d948f51ea4684ffbb098c7df3f332e81", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1820, "chunk_index": 95, "_doc_id": "95_3213905673039209187"}}
{"doc_id": "96_546344134481696260", "text": "b-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> created<span><span>() {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> this<span><span>.<span><span>$watch<span><span>(<span><span>'question'<span><span>, (<span><span>newQuestion<span><span>) <span><span>=><span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // ...<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> })<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/watchers.html", "title": "侦听器 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "d948f51ea4684ffbb098c7df3f332e81", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1820, "chunk_index": 96, "_doc_id": "96_546344134481696260"}}
{"doc_id": "97_8733308854000909257", "text": "// ...<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> })<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span><code><pre><div><p>如果要在特定条件下设置一个侦听器，或者只侦听响应用户交互的内容，这方法很有用。它还允许你提前停止该侦听器。<p><div><h2 id=\"stopping-a-watcher\">停止侦听器 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#stopping-a-watcher\">​<a><h2><div class=\"options-api\"><p>用 <code>watch<code> 选项或者 <code>$watch()<code> 实例方法声明的侦听器，会在宿主组件卸载时自动停止。因此，在大多数场景下，你无需关心怎么停止它。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/watchers.html", "title": "侦听器 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "d948f51ea4684ffbb098c7df3f332e81", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1820, "chunk_index": 97, "_doc_id": "97_8733308854000909257"}}
{"doc_id": "98_1526768805369131764", "text": "pi\"><p>用 <code>watch<code> 选项或者 <code>$watch()<code> 实例方法声明的侦听器，会在宿主组件卸载时自动停止。因此，在大多数场景下，你无需关心怎么停止它。<p><p>在少数情况下，你的确需要在组件卸载之前就停止一个侦听器，这时可以调用 <code>$watch()<code> API 返回的函数：<p><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> unwatch<span><span> =<span><span> this<span><span>.<span><span>$watch<span><span>(<span><span>'foo'<span><span>, callback)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/watchers.html", "title": "侦听器 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "d948f51ea4684ffbb098c7df3f332e81", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1820, "chunk_index": 98, "_doc_id": "98_1526768805369131764"}}
{"doc_id": "99_4008092854334555178", "text": "n>$watch<span><span>(<span><span>'foo'<span><span>, callback)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// ...当该侦听器不再需要时<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>unwatch<span><span>()<span><span><code><pre><div><div><div class=\"composition-api\"><p>在 <code>setup()<code> 或 <code><script setup><code> 中用同步语句创建的侦听器，会自动绑定到宿主组件实例上，并且会在宿主组件卸载时自动停止。因此，在大多数情况下，你无需关心怎么停止一个侦听器。<p><p>一个关键点是，侦听器必须用<strong>同步<strong>语句创建：如果用异步回调创建一个侦听器，那么它不会绑定到当前组件上，你必须手动停止它，以防内存泄漏。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/watchers.html", "title": "侦听器 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "d948f51ea4684ffbb098c7df3f332e81", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1820, "chunk_index": 99, "_doc_id": "99_4008092854334555178"}}
{"doc_id": "100_3925187799078654362", "text": "需关心怎么停止一个侦听器。<p><p>一个关键点是，侦听器必须用<strong>同步<strong>语句创建：如果用异步回调创建一个侦听器，那么它不会绑定到当前组件上，你必须手动停止它，以防内存泄漏。如下方这个例子：<p><div class=\"language-vue\"> <span class=\"lang\">vue<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>script<span><span> setup<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>import<span><span> { watchEffect } <span><span>from<span><span> 'vue'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 它会自动停止<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/watchers.html", "title": "侦听器 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "d948f51ea4684ffbb098c7df3f332e81", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1820, "chunk_index": 100, "_doc_id": "100_3925187799078654362"}}
{"doc_id": "101_3694847225004817914", "text": "n><span> 'vue'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 它会自动停止<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>watchEffect<span><span>(() <span><span>=><span><span> {})<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// ...这个则不会！<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>setTimeout<span><span>(() <span><span>=><span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> watchEffect<span><span>(() <span><span>=><span><span> {})<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/watchers.html", "title": "侦听器 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "d948f51ea4684ffbb098c7df3f332e81", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1820, "chunk_index": 101, "_doc_id": "101_3694847225004817914"}}
{"doc_id": "102_308465451608052874", "text": "an>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> watchEffect<span><span>(() <span><span>=><span><span> {})<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}, <span><span>100<span><span>)<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/watchers.html", "title": "侦听器 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "d948f51ea4684ffbb098c7df3f332e81", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1820, "chunk_index": 102, "_doc_id": "102_308465451608052874"}}
{"doc_id": "103_620384722685676509", "text": "=><span><span> {})<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}, <span><span>100<span><span>)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>script<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>要手动停止一个侦听器，请调用 <code>watch<code> 或 <code>watchEffect<code> 返回的函数：<p><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> unwatch<span><span> =<span><span> watchEffect<span><span>(() <span><span>=><span><span> {})<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/watchers.html", "title": "侦听器 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "d948f51ea4684ffbb098c7df3f332e81", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1820, "chunk_index": 103, "_doc_id": "103_620384722685676509"}}
{"doc_id": "104_2592888737714626437", "text": "tch<span><span> =<span><span> watchEffect<span><span>(() <span><span>=><span><span> {})<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// ...当该侦听器不再需要时<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>unwatch<span><span>()<span><span><code><pre><div><p>注意，需要异步创建侦听器的情况很少，请尽可能选择同步创建。如果需要等待一些异步数据，你可以使用条件式的侦听逻辑：<p><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// 需要异步请求得到的数据<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/watchers.html", "title": "侦听器 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "d948f51ea4684ffbb098c7df3f332e81", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1820, "chunk_index": 104, "_doc_id": "104_2592888737714626437"}}
{"doc_id": "105_2665131544803171949", "text": "an><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// 需要异步请求得到的数据<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> data<span><span> =<span><span> ref<span><span>(<span><span>null<span><span>)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>watchEffect<span><span>(() <span><span>=><span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> if<span><span> (data.value) {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 数据加载后执行某些操作...<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/watchers.html", "title": "侦听器 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "d948f51ea4684ffbb098c7df3f332e81", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1820, "chunk_index": 105, "_doc_id": "105_2665131544803171949"}}
{"doc_id": "106_7701807181527845407", "text": "> if<span><span> (data.value) {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 数据加载后执行某些操作...<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>})<span><span><code><pre><div><div><div><div>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/watchers.html", "title": "侦听器 | Vue.js", "doc_id": "d948f51ea4684ffbb098c7df3f332e81", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1820, "chunk_index": 106, "_doc_id": "106_7701807181527845407"}}
{"doc_id": "0_187890297484196346", "text": "<div><div><h1 id=\"template-refs\">模板引用 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#template-refs\">​<a><h1><p>虽然 Vue 的声明性渲染模型为你抽象了大部分对 DOM 的直接操作，但在某些情况下，我们仍然需要直接访问底层 DOM 元素。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/template-refs.html", "title": "模板引用", "doc_id": "b0c23bddf7b549de9f938a851591b7fa", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 925, "chunk_index": 0, "_doc_id": "0_187890297484196346"}}
{"doc_id": "1_1050504288609067005", "text": "or\" href=\"#template-refs\">​<a><h1><p>虽然 Vue 的声明性渲染模型为你抽象了大部分对 DOM 的直接操作，但在某些情况下，我们仍然需要直接访问底层 DOM 元素。要实现这一点，我们可以使用特殊的 <code>ref<code> attribute：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>input<span><span> ref<span><span>=<span><span>\"input\"<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p><code>ref<code> 是一个特殊的 attribute，和 <code>v-for<code> 章节中提到的 <code>key<code> 类似。它允许我们在一个特定的 DOM 元素或子组件实例被挂载后，获得对它的直接引用。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/template-refs.html", "title": "模板引用", "doc_id": "b0c23bddf7b549de9f938a851591b7fa", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 925, "chunk_index": 1, "_doc_id": "1_1050504288609067005"}}
{"doc_id": "2_6804180024460934227", "text": "个特殊的 attribute，和 <code>v-for<code> 章节中提到的 <code>key<code> 类似。它允许我们在一个特定的 DOM 元素或子组件实例被挂载后，获得对它的直接引用。这可能很有用，比如说在组件挂载时将焦点设置到一个 input 元素上，或在一个元素上初始化一个第三方库。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/template-refs.html", "title": "模板引用", "doc_id": "b0c23bddf7b549de9f938a851591b7fa", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 925, "chunk_index": 2, "_doc_id": "2_6804180024460934227"}}
{"doc_id": "3_5493128099699721937", "text": "code> 类似。它允许我们在一个特定的 DOM 元素或子组件实例被挂载后，获得对它的直接引用。这可能很有用，比如说在组件挂载时将焦点设置到一个 input 元素上，或在一个元素上初始化一个第三方库。<p><h2 id=\"accessing-the-refs\">访问模板引用 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#accessing-the-refs\">​<a><h2><div class=\"composition-api\"><p>要在组合式 API 中获取引用，我们可以使用辅助函数 <a href=\"/api/composition-api-helpers.html#usetemplateref\"><code>useTemplateRef()<code><a> ：<p><div class=\"language-vue\"> <span class=\"lang\">vue<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>script<span><span> setup<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/template-refs.html", "title": "模板引用", "doc_id": "b0c23bddf7b549de9f938a851591b7fa", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 925, "chunk_index": 3, "_doc_id": "3_5493128099699721937"}}
{"doc_id": "4_6790361041967877804", "text": "code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>script<span><span> setup<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>import<span><span> { useTemplateRef, onMounted } <span><span>from<span><span> 'vue'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 第一个参数必须与模板中的 ref 值匹配<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> input<span><span> =<span><span> useTemplateRef<span><span>(<span><span>'my-input'<span><span>)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/template-refs.html", "title": "模板引用", "doc_id": "b0c23bddf7b549de9f938a851591b7fa", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 925, "chunk_index": 4, "_doc_id": "4_6790361041967877804"}}
{"doc_id": "5_3278264099824832226", "text": "seTemplateRef<span><span>(<span><span>'my-input'<span><span>)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>onMounted<span><span>(() <span><span>=><span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> input.value.<span><span>focus<span><span>()<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>})<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>script<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/template-refs.html", "title": "模板引用", "doc_id": "b0c23bddf7b549de9f938a851591b7fa", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 925, "chunk_index": 5, "_doc_id": "5_3278264099824832226"}}
{"doc_id": "6_8109240510946639597", "text": ">\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>input<span><span> ref<span><span>=<span><span>\"my-input\"<span><span> /><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/template-refs.html", "title": "模板引用", "doc_id": "b0c23bddf7b549de9f938a851591b7fa", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 925, "chunk_index": 6, "_doc_id": "6_8109240510946639597"}}
{"doc_id": "7_6276000136437298225", "text": "n> <<span><span>input<span><span> ref<span><span>=<span><span>\"my-input\"<span><span> /><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>在使用 TypeScript 时，Vue 的 IDE 支持和 <code>vue-tsc<code> 将根据匹配的 <code>ref<code> attribute 所用的元素或组件自动推断 <code>input.value<code> 的类型。<p> 3.5 前的用法 <p>在 3.5 之前的版本尚未引入 <code>useTemplateRef()<code>，我们需要声明一个与模板里 ref attribute 匹配的引用：<p><div class=\"language-vue\"> <span class=\"lang\">vue<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>script<span><span> setup<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/template-refs.html", "title": "模板引用", "doc_id": "b0c23bddf7b549de9f938a851591b7fa", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 925, "chunk_index": 7, "_doc_id": "7_6276000136437298225"}}
{"doc_id": "8_675599828964256704", "text": "code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>script<span><span> setup<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>import<span><span> { ref, onMounted } <span><span>from<span><span> 'vue'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 声明一个 ref 来存放该元素的引用<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 必须和模板里的 ref 同名<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> input<span><span> =<span><span> ref<span><span>(<span><span>null<span><span>)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/template-refs.html", "title": "模板引用", "doc_id": "b0c23bddf7b549de9f938a851591b7fa", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 925, "chunk_index": 8, "_doc_id": "8_675599828964256704"}}
{"doc_id": "9_6516844369771447664", "text": "> =<span><span> ref<span><span>(<span><span>null<span><span>)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>onMounted<span><span>(() <span><span>=><span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> input.value.<span><span>focus<span><span>()<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>})<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>script<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/template-refs.html", "title": "模板引用", "doc_id": "b0c23bddf7b549de9f938a851591b7fa", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 925, "chunk_index": 9, "_doc_id": "9_6516844369771447664"}}
{"doc_id": "10_8040204268809912146", "text": ">\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>input<span><span> ref<span><span>=<span><span>\"input\"<span><span> /><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/template-refs.html", "title": "模板引用", "doc_id": "b0c23bddf7b549de9f938a851591b7fa", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 925, "chunk_index": 10, "_doc_id": "10_8040204268809912146"}}
{"doc_id": "11_3433679233904899655", "text": "span> <<span><span>input<span><span> ref<span><span>=<span><span>\"input\"<span><span> /><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>如果不使用 <code><script setup><code>，需确保从 <code>setup()<code> 返回 ref：<p><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> setup<span><span>() {<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/template-refs.html", "title": "模板引用", "doc_id": "b0c23bddf7b549de9f938a851591b7fa", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 925, "chunk_index": 11, "_doc_id": "11_3433679233904899655"}}
{"doc_id": "12_3386666652778040315", "text": "span> default<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> setup<span><span>() {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> const<span><span> input<span><span> =<span><span> ref<span><span>(<span><span>null<span><span>)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // ...<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> return<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line highlighted\"><span> input<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/template-refs.html", "title": "模板引用", "doc_id": "b0c23bddf7b549de9f938a851591b7fa", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 925, "chunk_index": 12, "_doc_id": "12_3386666652778040315"}}
{"doc_id": "13_7053555309571768166", "text": "> input<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span><code><pre><div> <div><div class=\"options-api\"><p>挂载结束后引用都会被暴露在 <code>this.$refs<code> 之上：<p><div class=\"language-vue\"> <span class=\"lang\">vue<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>script<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/template-refs.html", "title": "模板引用", "doc_id": "b0c23bddf7b549de9f938a851591b7fa", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 925, "chunk_index": 13, "_doc_id": "13_7053555309571768166"}}
{"doc_id": "14_6732932019664810102", "text": "n><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> mounted<span><span>() {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> this<span><span>.$refs.input.<span><span>focus<span><span>()<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>script<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/template-refs.html", "title": "模板引用", "doc_id": "b0c23bddf7b549de9f938a851591b7fa", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 925, "chunk_index": 14, "_doc_id": "14_6732932019664810102"}}
{"doc_id": "15_2014190967801356245", "text": ">\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>input<span><span> ref<span><span>=<span><span>\"input\"<span><span> /><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><div><p>注意，你只可以<strong>在组件挂载后<strong>才能访问模板引用。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/template-refs.html", "title": "模板引用", "doc_id": "b0c23bddf7b549de9f938a851591b7fa", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 925, "chunk_index": 15, "_doc_id": "15_2014190967801356245"}}
{"doc_id": "16_409642800014804795", "text": "span>template<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><div><p>注意，你只可以<strong>在组件挂载后<strong>才能访问模板引用。如果你想在模板中的表达式上访问 <span class=\"options-api\"><code>$refs.input<code><span><span class=\"composition-api\"><code>input<code><span>，在初次渲染时会是 <span class=\"options-api\"><code>undefined<code><span><span class=\"composition-api\"><code>null<code><span>。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/template-refs.html", "title": "模板引用", "doc_id": "b0c23bddf7b549de9f938a851591b7fa", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 925, "chunk_index": 16, "_doc_id": "16_409642800014804795"}}
{"doc_id": "17_6485920035257473827", "text": "class=\"options-api\"><code>undefined<code><span><span class=\"composition-api\"><code>null<code><span>。这是因为在初次渲染前这个元素还不存在呢！<p><div class=\"composition-api\"><p>如果你需要侦听一个模板引用 ref 的变化，确保考虑到其值为 <code>null<code> 的情况：<p><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>watchEffect<span><span>(() <span><span>=><span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> if<span><span> (input.value) {<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/template-refs.html", "title": "模板引用", "doc_id": "b0c23bddf7b549de9f938a851591b7fa", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 925, "chunk_index": 17, "_doc_id": "17_6485920035257473827"}}
{"doc_id": "18_2251686832121083177", "text": "n>=><span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> if<span><span> (input.value) {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> input.value.<span><span>focus<span><span>()<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> } <span><span>else<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 此时还未挂载，或此元素已经被卸载(例如通过 v-if 控制)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/template-refs.html", "title": "模板引用", "doc_id": "b0c23bddf7b549de9f938a851591b7fa", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 925, "chunk_index": 18, "_doc_id": "18_2251686832121083177"}}
{"doc_id": "19_8877713329814903092", "text": "\"line\"><span> // 此时还未挂载，或此元素已经被卸载(例如通过 v-if 控制)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>})<span><span><code><pre><div><p>也可参考：<a href=\"/guide/typescript/composition-api.html#typing-template-refs\">为模板引用标注类型<a> <p><div><h2 id=\"ref-on-component\">组件上的 ref <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#ref-on-component\">​<a><h2><blockquote><p>这一小节假设你已了解<a href=\"/guide/essentials/component-basics.html\">组件<a>的相关知识，或者你也可以先跳过这里，之后再回来看。<p><blockquote><p>模板引用也可以被用在一个子组件上。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/template-refs.html", "title": "模板引用", "doc_id": "b0c23bddf7b549de9f938a851591b7fa", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 925, "chunk_index": 19, "_doc_id": "19_8877713329814903092"}}
{"doc_id": "20_7393005561386737394", "text": "/essentials/component-basics.html\">组件<a>的相关知识，或者你也可以先跳过这里，之后再回来看。<p><blockquote><p>模板引用也可以被用在一个子组件上。这种情况下引用中获得的值是组件实例：<p><div class=\"composition-api\"><div class=\"language-vue\"> <span class=\"lang\">vue<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>script<span><span> setup<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>import<span><span> { useTemplateRef, onMounted } <span><span>from<span><span> 'vue'<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/template-refs.html", "title": "模板引用", "doc_id": "b0c23bddf7b549de9f938a851591b7fa", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 925, "chunk_index": 20, "_doc_id": "20_7393005561386737394"}}
{"doc_id": "21_2944999607223077702", "text": "pan>import<span><span> { useTemplateRef, onMounted } <span><span>from<span><span> 'vue'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>import<span><span> Child <span><span>from<span><span> './Child.vue'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> childRef<span><span> =<span><span> useTemplateRef<span><span>(<span><span>'child'<span><span>)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>onMounted<span><span>(() <span><span>=><span><span> {<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/template-refs.html", "title": "模板引用", "doc_id": "b0c23bddf7b549de9f938a851591b7fa", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 925, "chunk_index": 21, "_doc_id": "21_2944999607223077702"}}
{"doc_id": "22_1228885406994679395", "text": "\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>onMounted<span><span>(() <span><span>=><span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // childRef.value 将持有 <Child /> 的实例<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>})<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>script<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>Child<span><span> ref<span><span>=<span><span>\"child\"<span><span> /><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/template-refs.html", "title": "模板引用", "doc_id": "b0c23bddf7b549de9f938a851591b7fa", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 925, "chunk_index": 22, "_doc_id": "22_1228885406994679395"}}
{"doc_id": "23_6305521678126847044", "text": "span> <<span><span>Child<span><span> ref<span><span>=<span><span>\"child\"<span><span> /><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div> 3.5 前的用法 <div class=\"language-vue\"> <span class=\"lang\">vue<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>script<span><span> setup<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>import<span><span> { ref, onMounted } <span><span>from<span><span> 'vue'<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/template-refs.html", "title": "模板引用", "doc_id": "b0c23bddf7b549de9f938a851591b7fa", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 925, "chunk_index": 23, "_doc_id": "23_6305521678126847044"}}
{"doc_id": "24_1608721402355882770", "text": "s=\"line\"><span>import<span><span> { ref, onMounted } <span><span>from<span><span> 'vue'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>import<span><span> Child <span><span>from<span><span> './Child.vue'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> child<span><span> =<span><span> ref<span><span>(<span><span>null<span><span>)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>onMounted<span><span>(() <span><span>=><span><span> {<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/template-refs.html", "title": "模板引用", "doc_id": "b0c23bddf7b549de9f938a851591b7fa", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 925, "chunk_index": 24, "_doc_id": "24_1608721402355882770"}}
{"doc_id": "25_8528033438982621577", "text": "\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>onMounted<span><span>(() <span><span>=><span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // child.value 是 <Child /> 组件的实例<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>})<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>script<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>Child<span><span> ref<span><span>=<span><span>\"child\"<span><span> /><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/template-refs.html", "title": "模板引用", "doc_id": "b0c23bddf7b549de9f938a851591b7fa", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 925, "chunk_index": 25, "_doc_id": "25_8528033438982621577"}}
{"doc_id": "26_7555544021447752757", "text": "span> <<span><span>Child<span><span> ref<span><span>=<span><span>\"child\"<span><span> /><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div> <div><div class=\"options-api\"><div class=\"language-vue\"> <span class=\"lang\">vue<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>script<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>import<span><span> Child <span><span>from<span><span> './Child.vue'<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/template-refs.html", "title": "模板引用", "doc_id": "b0c23bddf7b549de9f938a851591b7fa", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 925, "chunk_index": 26, "_doc_id": "26_7555544021447752757"}}
{"doc_id": "27_190338742469244308", "text": "class=\"line\"><span>import<span><span> Child <span><span>from<span><span> './Child.vue'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> components: {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> Child<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> },<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> mounted<span><span>() {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // this.$refs.child 是 <Child /> 组件的实例<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/template-refs.html", "title": "模板引用", "doc_id": "b0c23bddf7b549de9f938a851591b7fa", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 925, "chunk_index": 27, "_doc_id": "27_190338742469244308"}}
{"doc_id": "28_2345784413418720738", "text": "><span>() {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // this.$refs.child 是 <Child /> 组件的实例<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>script<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>Child<span><span> ref<span><span>=<span><span>\"child\"<span><span> /><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/template-refs.html", "title": "模板引用", "doc_id": "b0c23bddf7b549de9f938a851591b7fa", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 925, "chunk_index": 28, "_doc_id": "28_2345784413418720738"}}
{"doc_id": "29_6567584932432339805", "text": "span> <<span><span>Child<span><span> ref<span><span>=<span><span>\"child\"<span><span> /><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><div><p>如果一个子组件使用的是选项式 API <span class=\"composition-api\">或没有使用 <code><script setup><code><span>，被引用的组件实例和该子组件的 <code>this<code> 完全一致，这意味着父组件对子组件的每一个属性和方法都有完全的访问权。这使得在父组件和子组件之间创建紧密耦合的实现细节变得很容易，当然也因此，应该只在绝对需要时才使用组件引用。大多数情况下，你应该首先使用标准的 props 和 emit 接口来实现父子组件交互。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/template-refs.html", "title": "模板引用", "doc_id": "b0c23bddf7b549de9f938a851591b7fa", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 925, "chunk_index": 29, "_doc_id": "29_6567584932432339805"}}
{"doc_id": "30_5136024892768308137", "text": "访问权。这使得在父组件和子组件之间创建紧密耦合的实现细节变得很容易，当然也因此，应该只在绝对需要时才使用组件引用。大多数情况下，你应该首先使用标准的 props 和 emit 接口来实现父子组件交互。<p><div class=\"composition-api\"><p>有一个例外的情况，使用了 <code><script setup><code> 的组件是<strong>默认私有<strong>的：一个父组件无法访问到一个使用了 <code><script setup><code> 的子组件中的任何东西，除非子组件在其中通过 <code>defineExpose<code> 宏显式暴露：<p><div class=\"language-vue\"> <span class=\"lang\">vue<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>script<span><span> setup<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/template-refs.html", "title": "模板引用", "doc_id": "b0c23bddf7b549de9f938a851591b7fa", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 925, "chunk_index": 30, "_doc_id": "30_5136024892768308137"}}
{"doc_id": "31_4850490497595138759", "text": "code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>script<span><span> setup<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>import<span><span> { ref } <span><span>from<span><span> 'vue'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> a<span><span> =<span><span> 1<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> b<span><span> =<span><span> ref<span><span>(<span><span>2<span><span>)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/template-refs.html", "title": "模板引用", "doc_id": "b0c23bddf7b549de9f938a851591b7fa", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 925, "chunk_index": 31, "_doc_id": "31_4850490497595138759"}}
{"doc_id": "32_1497452430151904097", "text": "pan> =<span><span> ref<span><span>(<span><span>2<span><span>)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 像 defineExpose 这样的编译器宏不需要导入<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>defineExpose<span><span>({<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> a,<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> b<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>})<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/template-refs.html", "title": "模板引用", "doc_id": "b0c23bddf7b549de9f938a851591b7fa", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 925, "chunk_index": 32, "_doc_id": "32_1497452430151904097"}}
{"doc_id": "33_2772685774520691488", "text": "pan> a,<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> b<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>})<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>script<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>当父组件通过模板引用获取到了该组件的实例时，得到的实例类型为 <code>{ a: number, b: number }<code> (ref 都会自动解包，和一般的实例一样)。<p><p>请注意，defineExpose 必须在任何 await 操作之前调用。否则，在 await 操作后暴露的属性和方法将无法访问。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/template-refs.html", "title": "模板引用", "doc_id": "b0c23bddf7b549de9f938a851591b7fa", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 925, "chunk_index": 33, "_doc_id": "33_2772685774520691488"}}
{"doc_id": "34_4220225756000211027", "text": "}<code> (ref 都会自动解包，和一般的实例一样)。<p><p>请注意，defineExpose 必须在任何 await 操作之前调用。否则，在 await 操作后暴露的属性和方法将无法访问。<p><p>TypeScript 用户请参考：<a href=\"/guide/typescript/composition-api.html#typing-component-template-refs\">为组件的模板引用标注类型<a> <p><div><div class=\"options-api\"><p><code>expose<code> 选项可以用于限制对子组件实例的访问：<p><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/template-refs.html", "title": "模板引用", "doc_id": "b0c23bddf7b549de9f938a851591b7fa", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 925, "chunk_index": 34, "_doc_id": "34_4220225756000211027"}}
{"doc_id": "35_5602341708941451104", "text": "b-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> expose: [<span><span>'publicData'<span><span>, <span><span>'publicMethod'<span><span>],<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> data<span><span>() {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> return<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> publicData: <span><span>'foo'<span><span>,<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> privateData: <span><span>'bar'<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/template-refs.html", "title": "模板引用", "doc_id": "b0c23bddf7b549de9f938a851591b7fa", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 925, "chunk_index": 35, "_doc_id": "35_5602341708941451104"}}
{"doc_id": "36_6708111039339802615", "text": "'foo'<span><span>,<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> privateData: <span><span>'bar'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> },<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> methods: {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> publicMethod<span><span>() {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> /* ... */<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> },<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> privateMethod<span><span>() {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> /* ... */<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/template-refs.html", "title": "模板引用", "doc_id": "b0c23bddf7b549de9f938a851591b7fa", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 925, "chunk_index": 36, "_doc_id": "36_6708111039339802615"}}
{"doc_id": "37_1770938288881547423", "text": "e\"><span> privateMethod<span><span>() {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> /* ... */<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span><code><pre><div><p>在上面这个例子中，父组件通过模板引用访问到子组件实例后，仅能访问 <code>publicData<code> 和 <code>publicMethod<code>。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/template-refs.html", "title": "模板引用", "doc_id": "b0c23bddf7b549de9f938a851591b7fa", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 925, "chunk_index": 37, "_doc_id": "37_1770938288881547423"}}
{"doc_id": "38_7484938618139072895", "text": "ode><pre><div><p>在上面这个例子中，父组件通过模板引用访问到子组件实例后，仅能访问 <code>publicData<code> 和 <code>publicMethod<code>。<p><div><h2 id=\"refs-inside-v-for\"><code>v-for<code> 中的模板引用 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#refs-inside-v-for\">​<a><h2><blockquote><p>需要 v3.5 及以上版本<p><blockquote><div class=\"composition-api\"><p>当在 <code>v-for<code> 中使用模板引用时，对应的 ref 中包含的值是一个数组，它将在元素被挂载后包含对应整个列表的所有元素：<p><div class=\"language-vue\"> <span class=\"lang\">vue<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>script<span><span> setup<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/template-refs.html", "title": "模板引用", "doc_id": "b0c23bddf7b549de9f938a851591b7fa", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 925, "chunk_index": 38, "_doc_id": "38_7484938618139072895"}}
{"doc_id": "39_3903938335479349421", "text": "code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>script<span><span> setup<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>import<span><span> { ref, useTemplateRef, onMounted } <span><span>from<span><span> 'vue'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> list<span><span> =<span><span> ref<span><span>([<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> /* ... */<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>])<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/template-refs.html", "title": "模板引用", "doc_id": "b0c23bddf7b549de9f938a851591b7fa", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 925, "chunk_index": 39, "_doc_id": "39_3903938335479349421"}}
{"doc_id": "40_3519094215605743630", "text": "ine\"><span> /* ... */<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>])<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> itemRefs<span><span> =<span><span> useTemplateRef<span><span>(<span><span>'items'<span><span>)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>onMounted<span><span>(() <span><span>=><span><span> console.<span><span>log<span><span>(itemRefs.value))<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>script<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/template-refs.html", "title": "模板引用", "doc_id": "b0c23bddf7b549de9f938a851591b7fa", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 925, "chunk_index": 40, "_doc_id": "40_3519094215605743630"}}
