{"doc_id": "54_1405660041175631961", "text": "pan>li<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> </<span><span>ul<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p><a href=\"https://play.vuejs.org/#eNpFjk0KwjAQha/yCC4Uaou6kyp4DuOi2KkGYhKSiQildzdNa4WQmTc/37xeXJwr35HEUdTh7pXjszT0cdYzWuqaqBm9NEDbcLPeTDngiaM3PwVoFfiI667AvsDhNpWHMQzF+L9sNEztH3C3JlhNpbaPNT9VKFeeulAqplfY5D1p0qurxVQSqel0w5QUUEedY8q0wnvbWX+SYgRAmWxIiuSzm4tBinkc6HvkuSE7TIBKq4lZZWhdLZfE8AWp4l3T\" target=\"_blank\">在演练场中尝试一下<a><p><div><p>应该注意的是，ref 数组<strong>并不<strong>保证与源数组相同的顺序。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/template-refs.html", "title": "模板引用", "doc_id": "b0c23bddf7b549de9f938a851591b7fa", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 925, "chunk_index": 54, "_doc_id": "54_1405660041175631961"}}
{"doc_id": "55_2727669934334012265", "text": "ZWhdLZfE8AWp4l3T\" target=\"_blank\">在演练场中尝试一下<a><p><div><p>应该注意的是，ref 数组<strong>并不<strong>保证与源数组相同的顺序。<p><h2 id=\"function-refs\">函数模板引用 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#function-refs\">​<a><h2><p>除了使用字符串值作名字，<code>ref<code> attribute 还可以绑定为一个函数，会在每次组件更新时都被调用。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/template-refs.html", "title": "模板引用", "doc_id": "b0c23bddf7b549de9f938a851591b7fa", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 925, "chunk_index": 55, "_doc_id": "55_2727669934334012265"}}
{"doc_id": "56_1638871132634877798", "text": "or\" href=\"#function-refs\">​<a><h2><p>除了使用字符串值作名字，<code>ref<code> attribute 还可以绑定为一个函数，会在每次组件更新时都被调用。该函数会收到元素引用作为其第一个参数：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>input<span><span> :<span><span>ref<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>(<span><span>el<span><span>) <span><span>=><span><span> { <span><span>/* 将 el 赋值给一个数据属性或 ref 变量 */<span><span> }<span><span>\"<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>注意我们这里需要使用动态的 <code>:ref<code> 绑定才能够传入一个函数。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/template-refs.html", "title": "模板引用", "doc_id": "b0c23bddf7b549de9f938a851591b7fa", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 925, "chunk_index": 56, "_doc_id": "56_1638871132634877798"}}
{"doc_id": "57_47437118997647339", "text": "<span><span>\"<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>注意我们这里需要使用动态的 <code>:ref<code> 绑定才能够传入一个函数。当绑定的元素被卸载时，函数也会被调用一次，此时的 <code>el<code> 参数会是 <code>null<code>。你当然也可以绑定一个组件方法而不是内联函数。<p><div><div>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/template-refs.html", "title": "模板引用", "doc_id": "b0c23bddf7b549de9f938a851591b7fa", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 925, "chunk_index": 57, "_doc_id": "57_47437118997647339"}}
{"doc_id": "0_3713259517114822140", "text": "<div><div><h1 id=\"components-basics\">组件基础 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#components-basics\">​<a><h1><p>组件允许我们将 UI 划分为独立的、可重用的部分，并且可以对每个部分进行单独的思考。在实际应用中，组件常常被组织成一个层层嵌套的树状结构：<p><p> <p><p>这和我们嵌套 HTML 元素的方式类似，Vue 实现了自己的组件模型，使我们可以在每个组件内封装自定义内容与逻辑。Vue 同样也能很好地配合原生 Web Component。如果你想知道 Vue 组件与原生 Web Components 之间的关系，可以<a href=\"/guide/extras/web-components.html\">阅读此章节<a>。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/component-basics.html", "title": "组件基础", "doc_id": "2dcb03cb5073419b8577ea0ac52020a8", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1435, "chunk_index": 0, "_doc_id": "0_3713259517114822140"}}
{"doc_id": "1_6284815017684631539", "text": "ponent。如果你想知道 Vue 组件与原生 Web Components 之间的关系，可以<a href=\"/guide/extras/web-components.html\">阅读此章节<a>。<p><h2 id=\"defining-a-component\">定义一个组件 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#defining-a-component\">​<a><h2><p>当使用构建步骤时，我们一般会将 Vue 组件定义在一个单独的 <code>.vue<code> 文件中，这被叫做<a href=\"/guide/scaling-up/sfc.html\">单文件组件<a> (简称 SFC)：<p><div class=\"options-api\"><div class=\"language-vue\"> <span class=\"lang\">vue<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>script<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/component-basics.html", "title": "组件基础", "doc_id": "2dcb03cb5073419b8577ea0ac52020a8", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1435, "chunk_index": 1, "_doc_id": "1_6284815017684631539"}}
{"doc_id": "2_4617379097410737872", "text": "ki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>script<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> data<span><span>() {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> return<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> count: <span><span>0<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/component-basics.html", "title": "组件基础", "doc_id": "2dcb03cb5073419b8577ea0ac52020a8", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1435, "chunk_index": 2, "_doc_id": "2_4617379097410737872"}}
{"doc_id": "3_3129532914414393979", "text": "<span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>script<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>button<span><span> @click<span><span>=<span><span>\"count++\"<span><span>>You clicked me {{ count }} times.</<span><span>button<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/component-basics.html", "title": "组件基础", "doc_id": "2dcb03cb5073419b8577ea0ac52020a8", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1435, "chunk_index": 3, "_doc_id": "3_3129532914414393979"}}
{"doc_id": "4_4259816410561271182", "text": "count++\"<span><span>>You clicked me {{ count }} times.</<span><span>button<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><div><div class=\"composition-api\"><div class=\"language-vue\"> <span class=\"lang\">vue<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>script<span><span> setup<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>import<span><span> { ref } <span><span>from<span><span> 'vue'<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/component-basics.html", "title": "组件基础", "doc_id": "2dcb03cb5073419b8577ea0ac52020a8", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1435, "chunk_index": 4, "_doc_id": "4_4259816410561271182"}}
{"doc_id": "5_8816981913887874702", "text": "<span class=\"line\"><span>import<span><span> { ref } <span><span>from<span><span> 'vue'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> count<span><span> =<span><span> ref<span><span>(<span><span>0<span><span>)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>script<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/component-basics.html", "title": "组件基础", "doc_id": "2dcb03cb5073419b8577ea0ac52020a8", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1435, "chunk_index": 5, "_doc_id": "5_8816981913887874702"}}
{"doc_id": "6_1191324694857929144", "text": ">\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>button<span><span> @click<span><span>=<span><span>\"count++\"<span><span>>You clicked me {{ count }} times.</<span><span>button<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/component-basics.html", "title": "组件基础", "doc_id": "2dcb03cb5073419b8577ea0ac52020a8", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1435, "chunk_index": 6, "_doc_id": "6_1191324694857929144"}}
{"doc_id": "7_5933427822755982883", "text": "count++\"<span><span>>You clicked me {{ count }} times.</<span><span>button<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><div><p>当不使用构建步骤时，一个 Vue 组件以一个包含 Vue 特定选项的 JavaScript 对象来定义：<p><div class=\"options-api\"><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> data<span><span>() {<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/component-basics.html", "title": "组件基础", "doc_id": "2dcb03cb5073419b8577ea0ac52020a8", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1435, "chunk_index": 7, "_doc_id": "7_5933427822755982883"}}
{"doc_id": "8_4063953995865814007", "text": "<span> default<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> data<span><span>() {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> return<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> count: <span><span>0<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> },<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> template: <span><span>`<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <button @click=\"count++\"><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> You clicked me {{ count }} times.<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/component-basics.html", "title": "组件基础", "doc_id": "2dcb03cb5073419b8577ea0ac52020a8", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1435, "chunk_index": 8, "_doc_id": "8_4063953995865814007"}}
{"doc_id": "9_7056088093854843241", "text": "lick=\"count++\"><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> You clicked me {{ count }} times.<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> </button>`<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span><code><pre><div><div><div class=\"composition-api\"><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>import<span><span> { ref } <span><span>from<span><span> 'vue'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/component-basics.html", "title": "组件基础", "doc_id": "2dcb03cb5073419b8577ea0ac52020a8", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1435, "chunk_index": 9, "_doc_id": "9_7056088093854843241"}}
{"doc_id": "10_3773177717714026811", "text": "import<span><span> { ref } <span><span>from<span><span> 'vue'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> setup<span><span>() {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> const<span><span> count<span><span> =<span><span> ref<span><span>(<span><span>0<span><span>)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> return<span><span> { count }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> },<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/component-basics.html", "title": "组件基础", "doc_id": "2dcb03cb5073419b8577ea0ac52020a8", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1435, "chunk_index": 10, "_doc_id": "10_3773177717714026811"}}
{"doc_id": "11_4664258254777225551", "text": "ass=\"line\"><span> return<span><span> { count }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> },<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> template: <span><span>`<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <button @click=\"count++\"><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> You clicked me {{ count }} times.<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> </button>`<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 也可以针对一个 DOM 内联模板：<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // template: '#my-template-element'<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/component-basics.html", "title": "组件基础", "doc_id": "2dcb03cb5073419b8577ea0ac52020a8", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1435, "chunk_index": 11, "_doc_id": "11_4664258254777225551"}}
{"doc_id": "12_7039703080006858912", "text": "对一个 DOM 内联模板：<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // template: '#my-template-element'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span><code><pre><div><div><p>这里的模板是一个内联的 JavaScript 字符串，Vue 将会在运行时编译它。你也可以使用 ID 选择器来指向一个元素 (通常是原生的 <code><template><code> 元素)，Vue 将会使用其内容作为模板来源。<p><p>上面的例子中定义了一个组件，并在一个 <code>.js<code> 文件里默认导出了它自己，但你也可以通过具名导出在一个文件中导出多个组件。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/component-basics.html", "title": "组件基础", "doc_id": "2dcb03cb5073419b8577ea0ac52020a8", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1435, "chunk_index": 12, "_doc_id": "12_7039703080006858912"}}
{"doc_id": "13_2662119555982128925", "text": "元素)，Vue 将会使用其内容作为模板来源。<p><p>上面的例子中定义了一个组件，并在一个 <code>.js<code> 文件里默认导出了它自己，但你也可以通过具名导出在一个文件中导出多个组件。<p><h2 id=\"using-a-component\">使用组件 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#using-a-component\">​<a><h2><div class=\"tip custom-block\"><p class=\"custom-block-title\">TIP<p><p>我们会在接下来的指引中使用单文件组件语法，无论你是否使用构建步骤，组件相关的概念都是相同的。<a href=\"/examples/\">示例<a>一节中展示了两种场景中的组件使用情况。<p><div><p>要使用一个子组件，我们需要在父组件中导入它。假设我们把计数器组件放在了一个叫做 <code>ButtonCounter.vue<code> 的文件中，这个组件将会以默认导出的形式被暴露给外部。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/component-basics.html", "title": "组件基础", "doc_id": "2dcb03cb5073419b8577ea0ac52020a8", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1435, "chunk_index": 13, "_doc_id": "13_2662119555982128925"}}
{"doc_id": "14_4141765333058076843", "text": "><p>要使用一个子组件，我们需要在父组件中导入它。假设我们把计数器组件放在了一个叫做 <code>ButtonCounter.vue<code> 的文件中，这个组件将会以默认导出的形式被暴露给外部。<p><div class=\"options-api\"><div class=\"language-vue\"> <span class=\"lang\">vue<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>script<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>import<span><span> ButtonCounter <span><span>from<span><span> './ButtonCounter.vue'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/component-basics.html", "title": "组件基础", "doc_id": "2dcb03cb5073419b8577ea0ac52020a8", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1435, "chunk_index": 14, "_doc_id": "14_4141765333058076843"}}
{"doc_id": "15_419600292116660626", "text": "tonCounter <span><span>from<span><span> './ButtonCounter.vue'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> components: {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> ButtonCounter<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>script<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/component-basics.html", "title": "组件基础", "doc_id": "2dcb03cb5073419b8577ea0ac52020a8", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1435, "chunk_index": 15, "_doc_id": "15_419600292116660626"}}
{"doc_id": "16_7022152230913962120", "text": "n>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>script<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>h1<span><span>>Here is a child component!</<span><span>h1<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>ButtonCounter<span><span> /><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/component-basics.html", "title": "组件基础", "doc_id": "2dcb03cb5073419b8577ea0ac52020a8", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1435, "chunk_index": 16, "_doc_id": "16_7022152230913962120"}}
{"doc_id": "17_1907070346582364381", "text": "<span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>ButtonCounter<span><span> /><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>若要将导入的组件暴露给模板，我们需要在 <code>components<code> 选项上<a href=\"/guide/components/registration.html\">注册<a>它。这个组件将会以其注册时的名字作为模板中的标签名。<p><div><div class=\"composition-api\"><div class=\"language-vue\"> <span class=\"lang\">vue<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>script<span><span> setup<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/component-basics.html", "title": "组件基础", "doc_id": "2dcb03cb5073419b8577ea0ac52020a8", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1435, "chunk_index": 17, "_doc_id": "17_1907070346582364381"}}
{"doc_id": "18_4193899361286922782", "text": "code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>script<span><span> setup<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>import<span><span> ButtonCounter <span><span>from<span><span> './ButtonCounter.vue'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>script<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>h1<span><span>>Here is a child component!</<span><span>h1<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/component-basics.html", "title": "组件基础", "doc_id": "2dcb03cb5073419b8577ea0ac52020a8", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1435, "chunk_index": 18, "_doc_id": "18_4193899361286922782"}}
{"doc_id": "19_3865294576953144475", "text": "an> <<span><span>h1<span><span>>Here is a child component!</<span><span>h1<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>ButtonCounter<span><span> /><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>通过 <code><script setup><code>，导入的组件都在模板中直接可用。<p><div><p>当然，你也可以全局地注册一个组件，使得它在当前应用中的任何组件上都可以使用，而不需要额外再导入。关于组件的全局注册和局部注册两种方式的利弊，我们放在了<a href=\"/guide/components/registration.html\">组件注册<a>这一章节中专门讨论。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/component-basics.html", "title": "组件基础", "doc_id": "2dcb03cb5073419b8577ea0ac52020a8", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1435, "chunk_index": 19, "_doc_id": "19_3865294576953144475"}}
{"doc_id": "20_7473601379751430048", "text": "而不需要额外再导入。关于组件的全局注册和局部注册两种方式的利弊，我们放在了<a href=\"/guide/components/registration.html\">组件注册<a>这一章节中专门讨论。<p><p>组件可以被重用任意多次：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>h1<span><span>>Here is a child component!</<span><span>h1<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>ButtonCounter<span><span> /><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>ButtonCounter<span><span> /><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/component-basics.html", "title": "组件基础", "doc_id": "2dcb03cb5073419b8577ea0ac52020a8", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1435, "chunk_index": 20, "_doc_id": "20_7473601379751430048"}}
{"doc_id": "21_7377893093567560848", "text": "span> /><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>ButtonCounter<span><span> /><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>ButtonCounter<span><span> /><span><span><code><pre><div><p>你会注意到，每当点击这些按钮时，每一个组件都维护着自己的状态，是不同的 <code>count<code>。这是因为每当你使用一个组件，就创建了一个新的<strong>实例<strong>。<p><p>在单文件组件中，推荐为子组件使用 <code>PascalCase<code> 的标签名，以此来和原生的 HTML 元素作区分。虽然原生 HTML 标签名是不区分大小写的，但 Vue 单文件组件是可以在编译中区分大小写的。我们也可以使用 <code>/><code> 来关闭一个标签。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/component-basics.html", "title": "组件基础", "doc_id": "2dcb03cb5073419b8577ea0ac52020a8", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1435, "chunk_index": 21, "_doc_id": "21_7377893093567560848"}}
{"doc_id": "22_9010891216010930595", "text": "签名，以此来和原生的 HTML 元素作区分。虽然原生 HTML 标签名是不区分大小写的，但 Vue 单文件组件是可以在编译中区分大小写的。我们也可以使用 <code>/><code> 来关闭一个标签。<p><p>如果你是直接在 DOM 中书写模板 (例如原生 <code><template><code> 元素的内容)，模板的编译需要遵从浏览器中 HTML 的解析行为。在这种情况下，你应该需要使用 <code>kebab-case<code> 形式并显式地关闭这些组件的标签。<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><!-- 如果是在 DOM 中书写该模板 --><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/component-basics.html", "title": "组件基础", "doc_id": "2dcb03cb5073419b8577ea0ac52020a8", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1435, "chunk_index": 22, "_doc_id": "22_9010891216010930595"}}
{"doc_id": "23_4828732774945675342", "text": "ass=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><!-- 如果是在 DOM 中书写该模板 --><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>button-counter<span><span>></<span><span>button-counter<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>button-counter<span><span>></<span><span>button-counter<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/component-basics.html", "title": "组件基础", "doc_id": "2dcb03cb5073419b8577ea0ac52020a8", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1435, "chunk_index": 23, "_doc_id": "23_4828732774945675342"}}
{"doc_id": "24_7804097522884838698", "text": "<span><<span><span>button-counter<span><span>></<span><span>button-counter<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>button-counter<span><span>></<span><span>button-counter<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>请看 <a href=\"#in-dom-template-parsing-caveats\">DOM 内模板解析注意事项<a>了解更多细节。<p><h2 id=\"passing-props\">传递 props <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#passing-props\">​<a><h2><p>如果我们正在构建一个博客，我们可能需要一个表示博客文章的组件。我们希望所有的博客文章分享相同的视觉布局，但有不同的内容。要实现这样的效果自然必须向组件中传递数据，例如每篇文章标题和内容，这就会使用到 props。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/component-basics.html", "title": "组件基础", "doc_id": "2dcb03cb5073419b8577ea0ac52020a8", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1435, "chunk_index": 24, "_doc_id": "24_7804097522884838698"}}
{"doc_id": "25_7273789052243300590", "text": "构建一个博客，我们可能需要一个表示博客文章的组件。我们希望所有的博客文章分享相同的视觉布局，但有不同的内容。要实现这样的效果自然必须向组件中传递数据，例如每篇文章标题和内容，这就会使用到 props。<p><p>Props 是一种特别的 attributes，你可以在组件上声明注册。要传递给博客文章组件一个标题，我们必须在组件的 props 列表上声明它。这里要用到 <span class=\"options-api\"><a href=\"/api/options-state.html#props\"><code>props<code><a> 选项<span><span class=\"composition-api\"><a href=\"/api/sfc-script-setup.", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/component-basics.html", "title": "组件基础", "doc_id": "2dcb03cb5073419b8577ea0ac52020a8", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1435, "chunk_index": 25, "_doc_id": "25_7273789052243300590"}}
{"doc_id": "26_7803946508752830967", "text": "ml#props\"><code>props<code><a> 选项<span><span class=\"composition-api\"><a href=\"/api/sfc-script-setup.html#defineprops-defineemits\"><code>defineProps<code><a> 宏<span>：<p><div class=\"options-api\"><div class=\"vp-code-block-title\"><p class=\"vp-code-block-title-bar\"><span class=\"vp-code-block-title-text\">BlogPost.vue<span><p><div class=\"language-vue\"> <span class=\"lang\">vue<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>script<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/component-basics.html", "title": "组件基础", "doc_id": "2dcb03cb5073419b8577ea0ac52020a8", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1435, "chunk_index": 26, "_doc_id": "26_7803946508752830967"}}
{"doc_id": "27_2185265040857532172", "text": "ki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>script<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> props: [<span><span>'title'<span><span>]<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>script<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/component-basics.html", "title": "组件基础", "doc_id": "2dcb03cb5073419b8577ea0ac52020a8", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1435, "chunk_index": 27, "_doc_id": "27_2185265040857532172"}}
{"doc_id": "28_9108013908168160902", "text": ">\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>h4<span><span>>{{ title }}</<span><span>h4<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><div><p>当一个值被传递给 prop 时，它将成为该组件实例上的一个属性。该属性的值可以像其他组件属性一样，在模板和组件的 <code>this<code> 上下文中访问。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/component-basics.html", "title": "组件基础", "doc_id": "2dcb03cb5073419b8577ea0ac52020a8", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1435, "chunk_index": 28, "_doc_id": "28_9108013908168160902"}}
{"doc_id": "29_415531984362324350", "text": "><pre><div><div><p>当一个值被传递给 prop 时，它将成为该组件实例上的一个属性。该属性的值可以像其他组件属性一样，在模板和组件的 <code>this<code> 上下文中访问。<p><div><div class=\"composition-api\"><div class=\"vp-code-block-title\"><p class=\"vp-code-block-title-bar\"><span class=\"vp-code-block-title-text\">BlogPost.vue<span><p><div class=\"language-vue\"> <span class=\"lang\">vue<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>script<span><span> setup<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/component-basics.html", "title": "组件基础", "doc_id": "2dcb03cb5073419b8577ea0ac52020a8", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1435, "chunk_index": 29, "_doc_id": "29_415531984362324350"}}
{"doc_id": "30_297661772757306367", "text": "code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>script<span><span> setup<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>defineProps<span><span>([<span><span>'title'<span><span>])<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>script<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>h4<span><span>>{{ title }}</<span><span>h4<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/component-basics.html", "title": "组件基础", "doc_id": "2dcb03cb5073419b8577ea0ac52020a8", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1435, "chunk_index": 30, "_doc_id": "30_297661772757306367"}}
{"doc_id": "31_8599394007695676799", "text": "lass=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>h4<span><span>>{{ title }}</<span><span>h4<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><div><p><code>defineProps<code> 是一个仅 <code><script setup><code> 中可用的编译宏命令，并不需要显式地导入。声明的 props 会自动暴露给模板。<code>defineProps<code> 会返回一个对象，其中包含了可以传递给组件的所有 props：<p><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> props<span><span> =<span><span> defineProps<span><span>([<span><span>'title'<span><span>])<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/component-basics.html", "title": "组件基础", "doc_id": "2dcb03cb5073419b8577ea0ac52020a8", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1435, "chunk_index": 31, "_doc_id": "31_8599394007695676799"}}
{"doc_id": "32_8527659523179110117", "text": "ps<span><span> =<span><span> defineProps<span><span>([<span><span>'title'<span><span>])<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>console.<span><span>log<span><span>(props.title)<span><span><code><pre><div><p>TypeScript 用户请参考：<a href=\"/guide/typescript/composition-api.html#typing-component-props\">为组件 props 标注类型<a> <p><p>如果你没有使用 <code><script setup><code>，props 必须以 <code>props<code> 选项的方式声明，props 对象会作为 <code>setup()<code> 函数的第一个参数被传入：<p><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/component-basics.html", "title": "组件基础", "doc_id": "2dcb03cb5073419b8577ea0ac52020a8", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1435, "chunk_index": 32, "_doc_id": "32_8527659523179110117"}}
{"doc_id": "33_8856813710888891957", "text": "b-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> props: [<span><span>'title'<span><span>],<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> setup<span><span>(<span><span>props<span><span>) {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> console.<span><span>log<span><span>(props.title)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/component-basics.html", "title": "组件基础", "doc_id": "2dcb03cb5073419b8577ea0ac52020a8", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1435, "chunk_index": 33, "_doc_id": "33_8856813710888891957"}}
{"doc_id": "34_6126711510278272372", "text": "onsole.<span><span>log<span><span>(props.title)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span><code><pre><div><div><p>一个组件可以有任意多的 props，默认情况下，所有 prop 都接受任意类型的值。<p><p>当一个 prop 被注册后，可以像这样以自定义 attribute 的形式传递数据给它：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>BlogPost<span><span> title<span><span>=<span><span>\"My journey with Vue\"<span><span> /><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/component-basics.html", "title": "组件基础", "doc_id": "2dcb03cb5073419b8577ea0ac52020a8", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1435, "chunk_index": 34, "_doc_id": "34_6126711510278272372"}}
{"doc_id": "35_1233891982407990411", "text": "BlogPost<span><span> title<span><span>=<span><span>\"My journey with Vue\"<span><span> /><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>BlogPost<span><span> title<span><span>=<span><span>\"Blogging with Vue\"<span><span> /><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/component-basics.html", "title": "组件基础", "doc_id": "2dcb03cb5073419b8577ea0ac52020a8", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1435, "chunk_index": 35, "_doc_id": "35_1233891982407990411"}}
{"doc_id": "36_6705566671977642545", "text": "n>BlogPost<span><span> title<span><span>=<span><span>\"Blogging with Vue\"<span><span> /><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>BlogPost<span><span> title<span><span>=<span><span>\"Why Vue is so fun\"<span><span> /><span><span><code><pre><div><p>在实际应用中，我们可能在父组件中会有如下的一个博客文章数组：<p><div class=\"options-api\"><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/component-basics.html", "title": "组件基础", "doc_id": "2dcb03cb5073419b8577ea0ac52020a8", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1435, "chunk_index": 36, "_doc_id": "36_6705566671977642545"}}
{"doc_id": "37_4368696462873126566", "text": "b-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // ...<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> data<span><span>() {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> return<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> posts: [<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> { id: <span><span>1<span><span>, title: <span><span>'My journey with Vue'<span><span> },<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/component-basics.html", "title": "组件基础", "doc_id": "2dcb03cb5073419b8577ea0ac52020a8", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1435, "chunk_index": 37, "_doc_id": "37_4368696462873126566"}}
{"doc_id": "38_3234580353625028797", "text": "id: <span><span>1<span><span>, title: <span><span>'My journey with Vue'<span><span> },<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> { id: <span><span>2<span><span>, title: <span><span>'Blogging with Vue'<span><span> },<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> { id: <span><span>3<span><span>, title: <span><span>'Why Vue is so fun'<span><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> ]<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/component-basics.html", "title": "组件基础", "doc_id": "2dcb03cb5073419b8577ea0ac52020a8", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1435, "chunk_index": 38, "_doc_id": "38_3234580353625028797"}}
{"doc_id": "39_3014007383978163159", "text": "span> ]<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span><code><pre><div><div><div class=\"composition-api\"><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> posts<span><span> =<span><span> ref<span><span>([<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/component-basics.html", "title": "组件基础", "doc_id": "2dcb03cb5073419b8577ea0ac52020a8", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1435, "chunk_index": 39, "_doc_id": "39_3014007383978163159"}}
{"doc_id": "40_2249535254723281207", "text": "class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> posts<span><span> =<span><span> ref<span><span>([<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> { id: <span><span>1<span><span>, title: <span><span>'My journey with Vue'<span><span> },<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> { id: <span><span>2<span><span>, title: <span><span>'Blogging with Vue'<span><span> },<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> { id: <span><span>3<span><span>, title: <span><span>'Why Vue is so fun'<span><span> }<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/component-basics.html", "title": "组件基础", "doc_id": "2dcb03cb5073419b8577ea0ac52020a8", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1435, "chunk_index": 40, "_doc_id": "40_2249535254723281207"}}
{"doc_id": "41_4320875518489605436", "text": "> { id: <span><span>3<span><span>, title: <span><span>'Why Vue is so fun'<span><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>])<span><span><code><pre><div><div><p>这种情况下，我们可以使用 <code>v-for<code> 来渲染它们：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>BlogPost<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> v-for<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>post <span><span>in<span><span> posts<span><span>\"<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/component-basics.html", "title": "组件基础", "doc_id": "2dcb03cb5073419b8577ea0ac52020a8", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1435, "chunk_index": 41, "_doc_id": "41_4320875518489605436"}}
{"doc_id": "42_735018821129067657", "text": "span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>post <span><span>in<span><span> posts<span><span>\"<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> :<span><span>key<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>post.id<span><span>\"<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> :<span><span>title<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>post.title<span><span>\"<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/component-basics.html", "title": "组件基础", "doc_id": "2dcb03cb5073419b8577ea0ac52020a8", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1435, "chunk_index": 42, "_doc_id": "42_735018821129067657"}}
{"doc_id": "43_8537707308323488440", "text": "><span> :<span><span>title<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>post.title<span><span>\"<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> /><span><span><code><pre><div><p>留意我们是如何使用 <a href=\"/api/built-in-directives.html#v-bind\"><code>v-bind<code> 语法<a> (<code>:title=\"post.title\"<code>) 来传递动态 prop 值的。当事先不知道要渲染的确切内容时，这一点特别有用。<p><p>以上就是目前你需要了解的关于 props 的全部了。如果你看完本章节后还想知道更多细节，我们推荐你深入阅读关于 props 的<a href=\"/guide/components/props.html\">完整指引<a>。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/component-basics.html", "title": "组件基础", "doc_id": "2dcb03cb5073419b8577ea0ac52020a8", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1435, "chunk_index": 43, "_doc_id": "43_8537707308323488440"}}
{"doc_id": "44_1653513873841317272", "text": "解的关于 props 的全部了。如果你看完本章节后还想知道更多细节，我们推荐你深入阅读关于 props 的<a href=\"/guide/components/props.html\">完整指引<a>。<p><h2 id=\"listening-to-events\">监听事件 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#listening-to-events\">​<a><h2><p>让我们继续关注我们的 <code><BlogPost><code> 组件。我们会发现有时候它需要与父组件进行交互。例如，要在此处实现无障碍访问的需求，将博客文章的文字能够放大，而页面的其余部分仍使用默认字号。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/component-basics.html", "title": "组件基础", "doc_id": "2dcb03cb5073419b8577ea0ac52020a8", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1435, "chunk_index": 44, "_doc_id": "44_1653513873841317272"}}
{"doc_id": "45_840213051266511487", "text": "续关注我们的 <code><BlogPost><code> 组件。我们会发现有时候它需要与父组件进行交互。例如，要在此处实现无障碍访问的需求，将博客文章的文字能够放大，而页面的其余部分仍使用默认字号。<p><p>在父组件中，我们可以添加一个 <code>postFontSize<code> <span class=\"options-api\">数据属性<span><span class=\"composition-api\">ref <span>来实现这个效果：<p><div class=\"options-api\"><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>data<span><span>() {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> return<span><span> {<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/component-basics.html", "title": "组件基础", "doc_id": "2dcb03cb5073419b8577ea0ac52020a8", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1435, "chunk_index": 45, "_doc_id": "45_840213051266511487"}}
{"doc_id": "46_6077250483810574807", "text": "\"><span>data<span><span>() {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> return<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> posts: [<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> /* ... */<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> ],<span><span>\n<span class=\"line highlighted\"><span> postFontSize: <span><span>1<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/component-basics.html", "title": "组件基础", "doc_id": "2dcb03cb5073419b8577ea0ac52020a8", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1435, "chunk_index": 46, "_doc_id": "46_6077250483810574807"}}
{"doc_id": "47_8863474327405219380", "text": "highlighted\"><span> postFontSize: <span><span>1<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span><code><pre><div><div><div class=\"composition-api\"><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> posts<span><span> =<span><span> ref<span><span>([<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> /* ... */<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>])<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/component-basics.html", "title": "组件基础", "doc_id": "2dcb03cb5073419b8577ea0ac52020a8", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1435, "chunk_index": 47, "_doc_id": "47_8863474327405219380"}}
{"doc_id": "48_3084288025436882878", "text": "span> /* ... */<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>])<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line highlighted\"><span>const<span><span> postFontSize<span><span> =<span><span> ref<span><span>(<span><span>1<span><span>)<span><span><code><pre><div><div><p>在模板中用它来控制所有博客文章的字体大小：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line highlighted\"><span><<span><span>div<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/component-basics.html", "title": "组件基础", "doc_id": "2dcb03cb5073419b8577ea0ac52020a8", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1435, "chunk_index": 48, "_doc_id": "48_3084288025436882878"}}
