{"doc_id": "51_5131497947858440188", "text": "pan><span>\"<span><span>post.title<span><span>\"<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> /><span><span>\n<span class=\"line highlighted\"><span></<span><span>div<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>然后，给 <code><BlogPost><code> 组件添加一个按钮：<p><div class=\"vp-code-block-title\"><p class=\"vp-code-block-title-bar\"><span class=\"vp-code-block-title-text\">BlogPost.vue<span><p><div class=\"language-vue\"> <span class=\"lang\">vue<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><!-- 省略了 <script> --><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/component-basics.html", "title": "组件基础", "doc_id": "2dcb03cb5073419b8577ea0ac52020a8", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1435, "chunk_index": 51, "_doc_id": "51_5131497947858440188"}}
{"doc_id": "52_1830894505447308718", "text": "class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><!-- 省略了 <script> --><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>div<span><span> class<span><span>=<span><span>\"blog-post\"<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>h4<span><span>>{{ title }}</<span><span>h4<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/component-basics.html", "title": "组件基础", "doc_id": "2dcb03cb5073419b8577ea0ac52020a8", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1435, "chunk_index": 52, "_doc_id": "52_1830894505447308718"}}
{"doc_id": "53_4588144800660941234", "text": "lass=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>h4<span><span>>{{ title }}</<span><span>h4<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line highlighted\"><span> <<span><span>button<span><span>>Enlarge text</<span><span>button<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> </<span><span>div<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/component-basics.html", "title": "组件基础", "doc_id": "2dcb03cb5073419b8577ea0ac52020a8", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1435, "chunk_index": 53, "_doc_id": "53_4588144800660941234"}}
{"doc_id": "54_5115322977801746863", "text": "utton<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> </<span><span>div<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><div><p>这个按钮目前还没有做任何事情，我们想要点击这个按钮来告诉父组件它应该放大所有博客文章的文字。要解决这个问题，组件实例提供了一个自定义事件系统。父组件可以通过 <code>v-on<code> 或 <code>@<code> 来选择性地监听子组件上抛的事件，就像监听原生 DOM 事件那样：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>BlogPost<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/component-basics.html", "title": "组件基础", "doc_id": "2dcb03cb5073419b8577ea0ac52020a8", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1435, "chunk_index": 54, "_doc_id": "54_5115322977801746863"}}
{"doc_id": "55_7634635464983469315", "text": "class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>BlogPost<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> ...<span><span>\n<span class=\"line highlighted\"><span> @<span><span>enlarge-text<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>postFontSize <span><span>+=<span><span> 0.1<span><span>\"<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/component-basics.html", "title": "组件基础", "doc_id": "2dcb03cb5073419b8577ea0ac52020a8", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1435, "chunk_index": 55, "_doc_id": "55_7634635464983469315"}}
{"doc_id": "56_1334278889825208294", "text": "span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>postFontSize <span><span>+=<span><span> 0.1<span><span>\"<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> /><span><span><code><pre><div><p>子组件可以通过调用内置的 <a href=\"/api/component-instance.html#emit\"><strong><code>$emit<code><strong> 方法<a>，通过传入事件名称来抛出一个事件：<p><div class=\"vp-code-block-title\"><p class=\"vp-code-block-title-bar\"><span class=\"vp-code-block-title-text\">BlogPost.vue<span><p><div class=\"language-vue\"> <span class=\"lang\">vue<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><!-- 省略了 <script> --><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/component-basics.html", "title": "组件基础", "doc_id": "2dcb03cb5073419b8577ea0ac52020a8", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1435, "chunk_index": 56, "_doc_id": "56_1334278889825208294"}}
{"doc_id": "57_1830894505447308718", "text": "class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><!-- 省略了 <script> --><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>div<span><span> class<span><span>=<span><span>\"blog-post\"<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>h4<span><span>>{{ title }}</<span><span>h4<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/component-basics.html", "title": "组件基础", "doc_id": "2dcb03cb5073419b8577ea0ac52020a8", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1435, "chunk_index": 57, "_doc_id": "57_1830894505447308718"}}
{"doc_id": "58_4189937234693658504", "text": "lass=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>h4<span><span>>{{ title }}</<span><span>h4<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line highlighted\"><span> <<span><span>button<span><span> @click<span><span>=<span><span>\"$emit('enlarge-text')\"<span><span>>Enlarge text</<span><span>button<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> </<span><span>div<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/component-basics.html", "title": "组件基础", "doc_id": "2dcb03cb5073419b8577ea0ac52020a8", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1435, "chunk_index": 58, "_doc_id": "58_4189937234693658504"}}
{"doc_id": "59_2944750298167801831", "text": "utton<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> </<span><span>div<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><div><p>因为有了 <code>@enlarge-text=\"postFontSize += 0.1\"<code> 的监听，父组件会接收这一事件，从而更新 <code>postFontSize<code> 的值。<p><p>我们可以通过 <span class=\"options-api\"><a href=\"/api/options-state.html#emits\"><code>emits<code><a> 选项<span><span class=\"composition-api\"><a href=\"/api/sfc-script-setup.", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/component-basics.html", "title": "组件基础", "doc_id": "2dcb03cb5073419b8577ea0ac52020a8", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1435, "chunk_index": 59, "_doc_id": "59_2944750298167801831"}}
{"doc_id": "60_2904071814620765212", "text": "ml#emits\"><code>emits<code><a> 选项<span><span class=\"composition-api\"><a href=\"/api/sfc-script-setup.html#defineprops-defineemits\"><code>defineEmits<code><a> 宏<span>来声明需要抛出的事件：<p><div class=\"options-api\"><div class=\"vp-code-block-title\"><p class=\"vp-code-block-title-bar\"><span class=\"vp-code-block-title-text\">BlogPost.vue<span><p><div class=\"language-vue\"> <span class=\"lang\">vue<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>script<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/component-basics.html", "title": "组件基础", "doc_id": "2dcb03cb5073419b8577ea0ac52020a8", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1435, "chunk_index": 60, "_doc_id": "60_2904071814620765212"}}
{"doc_id": "61_846357132676306352", "text": "ki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>script<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> props: [<span><span>'title'<span><span>],<span><span>\n<span class=\"line highlighted\"><span> emits: [<span><span>'enlarge-text'<span><span>]<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/component-basics.html", "title": "组件基础", "doc_id": "2dcb03cb5073419b8577ea0ac52020a8", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1435, "chunk_index": 61, "_doc_id": "61_846357132676306352"}}
{"doc_id": "62_5415216629725432731", "text": "emits: [<span><span>'enlarge-text'<span><span>]<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>script<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><div><div><div class=\"composition-api\"><div class=\"vp-code-block-title\"><p class=\"vp-code-block-title-bar\"><span class=\"vp-code-block-title-text\">BlogPost.vue<span><p><div class=\"language-vue\"> <span class=\"lang\">vue<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>script<span><span> setup<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/component-basics.html", "title": "组件基础", "doc_id": "2dcb03cb5073419b8577ea0ac52020a8", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1435, "chunk_index": 62, "_doc_id": "62_5415216629725432731"}}
{"doc_id": "63_5055258167843542940", "text": "code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>script<span><span> setup<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>defineProps<span><span>([<span><span>'title'<span><span>])<span><span>\n<span class=\"line highlighted\"><span>defineEmits<span><span>([<span><span>'enlarge-text'<span><span>])<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>script<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><div><div><p>这声明了一个组件可能触发的所有事件，还可以对事件的参数进行<a href=\"/guide/components/events.html#validate-emitted-events\">验证<a>。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/component-basics.html", "title": "组件基础", "doc_id": "2dcb03cb5073419b8577ea0ac52020a8", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1435, "chunk_index": 63, "_doc_id": "63_5055258167843542940"}}
{"doc_id": "64_2012779471362824303", "text": ">这声明了一个组件可能触发的所有事件，还可以对事件的参数进行<a href=\"/guide/components/events.html#validate-emitted-events\">验证<a>。同时，这还可以让 Vue 避免将它们作为原生事件监听器隐式地应用于子组件的根元素。<p><div class=\"composition-api\"><p>和 <code>defineProps<code> 类似，<code>defineEmits<code> 仅可用于 <code><script setup><code> 之中，并且不需要导入，它返回一个等同于 <code>$emit<code> 方法的 <code>emit<code> 函数。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/component-basics.html", "title": "组件基础", "doc_id": "2dcb03cb5073419b8577ea0ac52020a8", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1435, "chunk_index": 64, "_doc_id": "64_2012779471362824303"}}
{"doc_id": "65_7454451474091135967", "text": "code> 仅可用于 <code><script setup><code> 之中，并且不需要导入，它返回一个等同于 <code>$emit<code> 方法的 <code>emit<code> 函数。它可以被用于在组件的 <code><script setup><code> 中抛出事件，因为此处无法直接访问 <code>$emit<code>：<p><div class=\"language-vue\"> <span class=\"lang\">vue<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>script<span><span> setup<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/component-basics.html", "title": "组件基础", "doc_id": "2dcb03cb5073419b8577ea0ac52020a8", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1435, "chunk_index": 65, "_doc_id": "65_7454451474091135967"}}
{"doc_id": "66_895597275714869903", "text": "code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>script<span><span> setup<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> emit<span><span> =<span><span> defineEmits<span><span>([<span><span>'enlarge-text'<span><span>])<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>emit<span><span>(<span><span>'enlarge-text'<span><span>)<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/component-basics.html", "title": "组件基础", "doc_id": "2dcb03cb5073419b8577ea0ac52020a8", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1435, "chunk_index": 66, "_doc_id": "66_895597275714869903"}}
{"doc_id": "67_2916839797218528927", "text": "span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>emit<span><span>(<span><span>'enlarge-text'<span><span>)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>script<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>TypeScript 用户请参考：<a href=\"/guide/typescript/composition-api.html#typing-component-emits\">为组件 emits 标注类型<a> <p><p>如果你没有在使用 <code><script setup><code>，你可以通过 <code>emits<code> 选项定义组件会抛出的事件。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/component-basics.html", "title": "组件基础", "doc_id": "2dcb03cb5073419b8577ea0ac52020a8", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1435, "chunk_index": 67, "_doc_id": "67_2916839797218528927"}}
{"doc_id": "68_1084301207989934139", "text": "s\">为组件 emits 标注类型<a> <p><p>如果你没有在使用 <code><script setup><code>，你可以通过 <code>emits<code> 选项定义组件会抛出的事件。你可以从 <code>setup()<code> 函数的第二个参数，即 setup 上下文对象上访问到 <code>emit<code> 函数：<p><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> emits: [<span><span>'enlarge-text'<span><span>],<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/component-basics.html", "title": "组件基础", "doc_id": "2dcb03cb5073419b8577ea0ac52020a8", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1435, "chunk_index": 68, "_doc_id": "68_1084301207989934139"}}
{"doc_id": "69_64886790489052851", "text": "<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> emits: [<span><span>'enlarge-text'<span><span>],<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> setup<span><span>(<span><span>props<span><span>, <span><span>ctx<span><span>) {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> ctx.<span><span>emit<span><span>(<span><span>'enlarge-text'<span><span>)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/component-basics.html", "title": "组件基础", "doc_id": "2dcb03cb5073419b8577ea0ac52020a8", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1435, "chunk_index": 69, "_doc_id": "69_64886790489052851"}}
{"doc_id": "70_1124196023492883761", "text": "><span>(<span><span>'enlarge-text'<span><span>)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span><code><pre><div><div><p>以上就是目前你需要了解的关于组件自定义事件的所有知识了。如果你看完本章节后还想知道更多细节，请深入阅读<a href=\"/guide/components/events.html\">组件事件<a>章节。<p><h2 id=\"content-distribution-with-slots\">通过插槽来分配内容 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#content-distribution-with-slots\">​<a><h2><p>一些情况下我们会希望能和 HTML 元素一样向组件中传递内容：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>AlertBox<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/component-basics.html", "title": "组件基础", "doc_id": "2dcb03cb5073419b8577ea0ac52020a8", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1435, "chunk_index": 70, "_doc_id": "70_1124196023492883761"}}
{"doc_id": "71_5848407321557977732", "text": "github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>AlertBox<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> Something bad happened.<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>AlertBox<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>我们期望能渲染成这样：<p><div class=\"danger custom-block\"><p class=\"custom-block-title\">This is an Error for Demo Purposes<p><p>Something bad happened.", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/component-basics.html", "title": "组件基础", "doc_id": "2dcb03cb5073419b8577ea0ac52020a8", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1435, "chunk_index": 71, "_doc_id": "71_5848407321557977732"}}
{"doc_id": "72_410841216913856208", "text": "block\"><p class=\"custom-block-title\">This is an Error for Demo Purposes<p><p>Something bad happened.<p><div><p>这可以通过 Vue 的自定义 <code><slot><code> 元素来实现：<p><div class=\"vp-code-block-title\"><p class=\"vp-code-block-title-bar\"><span class=\"vp-code-block-title-text\">AlertBox.vue<span><p><div class=\"language-vue\"> <span class=\"lang\">vue<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/component-basics.html", "title": "组件基础", "doc_id": "2dcb03cb5073419b8577ea0ac52020a8", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1435, "chunk_index": 72, "_doc_id": "72_410841216913856208"}}
{"doc_id": "73_7037824732067798750", "text": "github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>div<span><span> class<span><span>=<span><span>\"alert-box\"<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>strong<span><span>>This is an Error for Demo Purposes</<span><span>strong<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line highlighted\"><span> <<span><span>slot<span><span> /<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/component-basics.html", "title": "组件基础", "doc_id": "2dcb03cb5073419b8577ea0ac52020a8", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1435, "chunk_index": 73, "_doc_id": "73_7037824732067798750"}}
{"doc_id": "74_39301280316074890", "text": "pan>\n<span class=\"line highlighted\"><span> <<span><span>slot<span><span> /<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> </<span><span>div<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>style<span><span> scoped<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>.alert-box<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> /* ... */<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/component-basics.html", "title": "组件基础", "doc_id": "2dcb03cb5073419b8577ea0ac52020a8", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1435, "chunk_index": 74, "_doc_id": "74_39301280316074890"}}
{"doc_id": "75_5613159957567655404", "text": "<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> /* ... */<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>style<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><div><p>如上所示，我们使用 <code><slot><code> 作为一个占位符，父组件传递进来的内容就会渲染在这里。<p><p>以上就是目前你需要了解的关于插槽的所有知识了。如果你看完本章节后还想知道更多细节，请深入阅读<a href=\"/guide/components/slots.html\">组件插槽<a>章节。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/component-basics.html", "title": "组件基础", "doc_id": "2dcb03cb5073419b8577ea0ac52020a8", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1435, "chunk_index": 75, "_doc_id": "75_5613159957567655404"}}
{"doc_id": "76_115521361159954599", "text": "p><p>以上就是目前你需要了解的关于插槽的所有知识了。如果你看完本章节后还想知道更多细节，请深入阅读<a href=\"/guide/components/slots.html\">组件插槽<a>章节。<p><h2 id=\"dynamic-components\">动态组件 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#dynamic-components\">​<a><h2><p>有些场景会需要在两个组件间来回切换，比如 Tab 界面：<p><p>上面的例子是通过 Vue 的 <code><component><code> 元素和特殊的 <code>is<code> attribute 实现的：<p><div class=\"options-api\"><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><!-- currentTab 改变时组件也改变 --><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/component-basics.html", "title": "组件基础", "doc_id": "2dcb03cb5073419b8577ea0ac52020a8", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1435, "chunk_index": 76, "_doc_id": "76_115521361159954599"}}
{"doc_id": "77_6980704853883007538", "text": "\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><!-- currentTab 改变时组件也改变 --><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>component<span><span> :<span><span>is<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>currentTab<span><span>\"<span><span>></<span><span>component<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><div><div class=\"composition-api\"><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><!-- currentTab 改变时组件也改变 --><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/component-basics.html", "title": "组件基础", "doc_id": "2dcb03cb5073419b8577ea0ac52020a8", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1435, "chunk_index": 77, "_doc_id": "77_6980704853883007538"}}
{"doc_id": "78_7934639976932658510", "text": "\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><!-- currentTab 改变时组件也改变 --><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>component<span><span> :<span><span>is<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>tabs[currentTab]<span><span>\"<span><span>></<span><span>component<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><div><p>在上面的例子中，被传给 <code>:is<code> 的值可以是以下几种：<p><p>你也可以使用 <code>is<code> attribute 来创建一般的 HTML 元素。<p><p>当使用 <code><component :is=\"...\"><code> 来在多个组件间作切换时，被切换掉的组件会被卸载。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/component-basics.html", "title": "组件基础", "doc_id": "2dcb03cb5073419b8577ea0ac52020a8", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1435, "chunk_index": 78, "_doc_id": "78_7934639976932658510"}}
{"doc_id": "79_8872940003232371718", "text": "<code> attribute 来创建一般的 HTML 元素。<p><p>当使用 <code><component :is=\"...\"><code> 来在多个组件间作切换时，被切换掉的组件会被卸载。我们可以通过 <a href=\"/guide/built-ins/keep-alive.html\"><code><KeepAlive><code> 组件<a>强制被切换掉的组件仍然保持“存活”的状态。<p><h2 id=\"in-dom-template-parsing-caveats\">DOM 内模板解析注意事项 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#in-dom-template-parsing-caveats\">​<a><h2><p>如果你想在 DOM 中直接书写 Vue 模板，Vue 则必须从 DOM 中获取模板字符串。由于浏览器的原生 HTML 解析行为限制，有一些需要注意的事项。<p><div class=\"tip custom-block\"><p class=\"custom-block-title\">TIP<p><p>请注意下面讨论只适用于直接在 DOM 中编写模板的情况。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/component-basics.html", "title": "组件基础", "doc_id": "2dcb03cb5073419b8577ea0ac52020a8", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1435, "chunk_index": 79, "_doc_id": "79_8872940003232371718"}}
{"doc_id": "80_8490540526196780692", "text": "<p><div class=\"tip custom-block\"><p class=\"custom-block-title\">TIP<p><p>请注意下面讨论只适用于直接在 DOM 中编写模板的情况。如果你使用来自以下来源的字符串模板，就不需要顾虑这些限制了：<p><ul><li>单文件组件<li><li>内联模板字符串 (例如 <code>template: '...'<code>)<li><li><code><script type=\"text/x-template\"><code><li><ul><div><h3 id=\"case-insensitivity\">大小写区分 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#case-insensitivity\">​<a><h3><p>HTML 标签和属性名称是不分大小写的，所以浏览器会把任何大写的字符解释为小写。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/component-basics.html", "title": "组件基础", "doc_id": "2dcb03cb5073419b8577ea0ac52020a8", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1435, "chunk_index": 80, "_doc_id": "80_8490540526196780692"}}
{"doc_id": "81_8087412739666951047", "text": "class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#case-insensitivity\">​<a><h3><p>HTML 标签和属性名称是不分大小写的，所以浏览器会把任何大写的字符解释为小写。这意味着当你使用 DOM 内的模板时，无论是 PascalCase 形式的组件名称、camelCase 形式的 prop 名称还是 v-on 的事件名称，都需要转换为相应等价的 kebab-case (短横线连字符) 形式：<p><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// JavaScript 中的 camelCase<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> BlogPost<span><span> =<span><span> {<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/component-basics.html", "title": "组件基础", "doc_id": "2dcb03cb5073419b8577ea0ac52020a8", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1435, "chunk_index": 81, "_doc_id": "81_8087412739666951047"}}
{"doc_id": "82_2339012852910950682", "text": "><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> BlogPost<span><span> =<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> props: [<span><span>'postTitle'<span><span>],<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> emits: [<span><span>'updatePost'<span><span>],<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> template: <span><span>`<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <h3>{{ postTitle }}</h3><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> `<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/component-basics.html", "title": "组件基础", "doc_id": "2dcb03cb5073419b8577ea0ac52020a8", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1435, "chunk_index": 82, "_doc_id": "82_2339012852910950682"}}
{"doc_id": "83_3234111217219660227", "text": "an class=\"line\"><span> <h3>{{ postTitle }}</h3><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> `<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span><code><pre><div><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><!-- HTML 中的 kebab-case --><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/component-basics.html", "title": "组件基础", "doc_id": "2dcb03cb5073419b8577ea0ac52020a8", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1435, "chunk_index": 83, "_doc_id": "83_3234111217219660227"}}
{"doc_id": "84_3679637824018350728", "text": "=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><!-- HTML 中的 kebab-case --><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>blog-post<span><span> post-title<span><span>=<span><span>\"hello!\"<span><span> @<span><span>update-post<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>onUpdatePost<span><span>\"<span><span>></<span><span>blog-post<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>我们在上面的例子中已经使用过了闭合标签 (self-closing tag)：<p><p>这是因为 Vue 的模板解析器支持任意标签使用 <code>/><code> 作为标签关闭的标志。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/component-basics.html", "title": "组件基础", "doc_id": "2dcb03cb5073419b8577ea0ac52020a8", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1435, "chunk_index": 84, "_doc_id": "84_3679637824018350728"}}
{"doc_id": "85_9046405471586444940", "text": "iv><p>我们在上面的例子中已经使用过了闭合标签 (self-closing tag)：<p><p>这是因为 Vue 的模板解析器支持任意标签使用 <code>/><code> 作为标签关闭的标志。<p><p>然而在 DOM 内模板中，我们必须显式地写出关闭标签：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>my-component<span><span>></<span><span>my-component<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>这是由于 HTML 只允许<a href=\"https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/syntax.html#void-elements\" target=\"_blank\">一小部分特殊的元素<a>省略其关闭标签，最常见的就是 <code><input><code> 和 <code><img><code>。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/component-basics.html", "title": "组件基础", "doc_id": "2dcb03cb5073419b8577ea0ac52020a8", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1435, "chunk_index": 85, "_doc_id": "85_9046405471586444940"}}
{"doc_id": "86_4303025886443299219", "text": "l#void-elements\" target=\"_blank\">一小部分特殊的元素<a>省略其关闭标签，最常见的就是 <code><input><code> 和 <code><img><code>。对于其他的元素来说，如果你省略了关闭标签，原生的 HTML 解析器会认为开启的标签永远没有结束，用下面这个代码片段举例来说：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>my-component<span><span> /> <span><span><!-- 我们想要在这里关闭标签... --><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/component-basics.html", "title": "组件基础", "doc_id": "2dcb03cb5073419b8577ea0ac52020a8", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1435, "chunk_index": 86, "_doc_id": "86_4303025886443299219"}}
{"doc_id": "87_444288545757701199", "text": "ine\"><span><<span><span>my-component<span><span> /> <span><span><!-- 我们想要在这里关闭标签... --><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>span<span><span>>hello</<span><span>span<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>将被解析为：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>my-component<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/component-basics.html", "title": "组件基础", "doc_id": "2dcb03cb5073419b8577ea0ac52020a8", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1435, "chunk_index": 87, "_doc_id": "87_444288545757701199"}}
{"doc_id": "88_4629246629012381135", "text": "hub-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>my-component<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>span<span><span>>hello</<span><span>span<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/component-basics.html", "title": "组件基础", "doc_id": "2dcb03cb5073419b8577ea0ac52020a8", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1435, "chunk_index": 88, "_doc_id": "88_4629246629012381135"}}
{"doc_id": "89_2272758310792882561", "text": "class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>span<span><span>>hello</<span><span>span<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>my-component<span><span>> <span><span><!-- 但浏览器会在这里关闭标签 --><span><span><code><pre><div><h3 id=\"element-placement-restrictions\">元素位置限制 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#element-placement-restrictions\">​<a><h3><p>某些 HTML 元素对于放在其中的元素类型有限制，例如 <code><ul><code>，<code><ol><code>，<code><table><code> 和 <code><select><code>，相应的，某些元素仅在放置于特定元素中时才会显示，例如 <code><li><code>，<code><tr><code> 和 <code><option><code>。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/component-basics.html", "title": "组件基础", "doc_id": "2dcb03cb5073419b8577ea0ac52020a8", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1435, "chunk_index": 89, "_doc_id": "89_2272758310792882561"}}
{"doc_id": "90_4977133338642509741", "text": "><select><code>，相应的，某些元素仅在放置于特定元素中时才会显示，例如 <code><li><code>，<code><tr><code> 和 <code><option><code>。<p><p>这将导致在使用带有此类限制元素的组件时出现问题。例如：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>table<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>blog-post-row<span><span>></<span><span>blog-post-row<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/component-basics.html", "title": "组件基础", "doc_id": "2dcb03cb5073419b8577ea0ac52020a8", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1435, "chunk_index": 90, "_doc_id": "90_4977133338642509741"}}
{"doc_id": "91_199856941044699415", "text": "><span> <<span><span>blog-post-row<span><span>></<span><span>blog-post-row<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>table<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>自定义的组件 <code><blog-post-row><code> 将作为无效的内容被忽略，因而在最终呈现的输出中造成错误。我们可以使用特殊的 <a href=\"/api/built-in-special-attributes.html#is\"><code>is<code> attribute<a> 作为一种解决方案：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>table<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/component-basics.html", "title": "组件基础", "doc_id": "2dcb03cb5073419b8577ea0ac52020a8", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1435, "chunk_index": 91, "_doc_id": "91_199856941044699415"}}
{"doc_id": "92_7426894886658306101", "text": "iki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>table<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>tr<span><span> is<span><span>=<span><span>\"vue:blog-post-row\"<span><span>></<span><span>tr<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>table<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><div class=\"tip custom-block\"><p class=\"custom-block-title\">TIP<p><p>当使用在原生 HTML 元素上时，<code>is<code> 的值必须加上前缀 <code>vue:<code> 才可以被解析为一个 Vue 组件。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/component-basics.html", "title": "组件基础", "doc_id": "2dcb03cb5073419b8577ea0ac52020a8", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1435, "chunk_index": 92, "_doc_id": "92_7426894886658306101"}}
{"doc_id": "93_5539160818341189434", "text": "om-block-title\">TIP<p><p>当使用在原生 HTML 元素上时，<code>is<code> 的值必须加上前缀 <code>vue:<code> 才可以被解析为一个 Vue 组件。这一点是必要的，为了避免和原生的<a href=\"https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/custom-elements.html#custom-elements-customized-builtin-example\" target=\"_blank\">自定义内置元素<a>相混淆。<p><div><p>以上就是你需要了解的关于 DOM 内模板解析的所有注意事项，同时也是 Vue <em>基础<em>部分的所有内容。祝贺你！虽然还有很多需要学习的，但你可以先暂停一下，去用 Vue 做一些有趣的东西，或者研究一些<a href=\"/examples/\">示例<a>。<p><p>完成了本页的阅读后，回顾一下你刚才所学到的知识，如果还想知道更多细节，我们推荐你继续阅读关于组件的完整指引。<p><div><div>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/component-basics.html", "title": "组件基础", "doc_id": "2dcb03cb5073419b8577ea0ac52020a8", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1435, "chunk_index": 93, "_doc_id": "93_5539160818341189434"}}
{"doc_id": "0_4900662168778154573", "text": "<div><div><h1 id=\"lifecycle-hooks\">生命周期钩子 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#lifecycle-hooks\">​<a><h1><p>每个 Vue 组件实例在创建时都需要经历一系列的初始化步骤，比如设置好数据侦听，编译模板，挂载实例到 DOM，以及在数据改变时更新 DOM。在此过程中，它也会运行被称为生命周期钩子的函数，让开发者有机会在特定阶段运行自己的代码。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/lifecycle.html", "title": "生命周期钩子", "doc_id": "945a2255a7b04b0e9a0ae87d2995b512", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 153, "chunk_index": 0, "_doc_id": "0_4900662168778154573"}}
{"doc_id": "1_9019146722672963611", "text": "时都需要经历一系列的初始化步骤，比如设置好数据侦听，编译模板，挂载实例到 DOM，以及在数据改变时更新 DOM。在此过程中，它也会运行被称为生命周期钩子的函数，让开发者有机会在特定阶段运行自己的代码。<p><h2 id=\"registering-lifecycle-hooks\">注册周期钩子 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#registering-lifecycle-hooks\">​<a><h2><p>举例来说，<span class=\"composition-api\"><code>onMounted<code><span><span class=\"options-api\"><code>mounted<code><span> 钩子可以用来在组件完成初始渲染并创建 DOM 节点后运行代码：<p><div class=\"composition-api\"><div class=\"language-vue\"> <span class=\"lang\">vue<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>script<span><span> setup<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/lifecycle.html", "title": "生命周期钩子", "doc_id": "945a2255a7b04b0e9a0ae87d2995b512", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 153, "chunk_index": 1, "_doc_id": "1_9019146722672963611"}}
{"doc_id": "2_6937383886353120719", "text": "code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>script<span><span> setup<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>import<span><span> { onMounted } <span><span>from<span><span> 'vue'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>onMounted<span><span>(() <span><span>=><span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> console.<span><span>log<span><span>(<span><span>`the component is now mounted.`<span><span>)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>})<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/lifecycle.html", "title": "生命周期钩子", "doc_id": "945a2255a7b04b0e9a0ae87d2995b512", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 153, "chunk_index": 2, "_doc_id": "2_6937383886353120719"}}
{"doc_id": "3_5073452115678995636", "text": "an>`the component is now mounted.`<span><span>)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>})<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>script<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><div><div class=\"options-api\"><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> mounted<span><span>() {<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/lifecycle.html", "title": "生命周期钩子", "doc_id": "945a2255a7b04b0e9a0ae87d2995b512", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 153, "chunk_index": 3, "_doc_id": "3_5073452115678995636"}}
{"doc_id": "4_6409164493923969919", "text": "an> default<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> mounted<span><span>() {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> console.<span><span>log<span><span>(<span><span>`the component is now mounted.`<span><span>)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/lifecycle.html", "title": "生命周期钩子", "doc_id": "945a2255a7b04b0e9a0ae87d2995b512", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 153, "chunk_index": 4, "_doc_id": "4_6409164493923969919"}}
{"doc_id": "5_4761011013430517720", "text": "an>`the component is now mounted.`<span><span>)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span><code><pre><div><div><p>还有其他一些钩子，会在实例生命周期的不同阶段被调用，最常用的是 <span class=\"composition-api\"><a href=\"/api/composition-api-lifecycle.html#onmounted\"><code>onMounted<code><a>、<a href=\"/api/composition-api-lifecycle.html#onupdated\"><code>onUpdated<code><a> 和 <a href=\"/api/composition-api-lifecycle.html#onunmounted\"><code>onUnmounted<code><a>。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/lifecycle.html", "title": "生命周期钩子", "doc_id": "945a2255a7b04b0e9a0ae87d2995b512", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 153, "chunk_index": 5, "_doc_id": "5_4761011013430517720"}}
{"doc_id": "6_7520661789666895625", "text": "ted<code><a> 和 <a href=\"/api/composition-api-lifecycle.html#onunmounted\"><code>onUnmounted<code><a>。所有生命周期钩子的完整参考及其用法请参考 <a href=\"/api/composition-api-lifecycle.html\">API 索引<a>。<span><span class=\"options-api\"><a href=\"/api/options-lifecycle.html#mounted\"><code>mounted<code><a>、<a href=\"/api/options-lifecycle.html#updated\"><code>updated<code><a> 和 <a href=\"/api/options-lifecycle.html#unmounted\"><code>unmounted<code><a>。<span><p><div class=\"options-api\"><p>所有生命周期钩子函数的 <code>this<code> 上下文都会自动指向当前调用它的组件实例。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/lifecycle.html", "title": "生命周期钩子", "doc_id": "945a2255a7b04b0e9a0ae87d2995b512", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 153, "chunk_index": 6, "_doc_id": "6_7520661789666895625"}}
{"doc_id": "7_4451238153199963050", "text": "nted<code><a>。<span><p><div class=\"options-api\"><p>所有生命周期钩子函数的 <code>this<code> 上下文都会自动指向当前调用它的组件实例。注意：避免用箭头函数来定义生命周期钩子，因为如果这样的话你将无法在函数中通过 <code>this<code> 获取组件实例。<p><div><div class=\"composition-api\"><p>当调用 <code>onMounted<code> 时，Vue 会自动将回调函数注册到当前正被初始化的组件实例上。这意味着这些钩子应当在组件初始化时被<strong>同步<strong>注册。例如，请不要这样做：<p><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>setTimeout<span><span>(() <span><span>=><span><span> {<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/lifecycle.html", "title": "生命周期钩子", "doc_id": "945a2255a7b04b0e9a0ae87d2995b512", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 153, "chunk_index": 7, "_doc_id": "7_4451238153199963050"}}
{"doc_id": "8_7537503690678890856", "text": "\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>setTimeout<span><span>(() <span><span>=><span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> onMounted<span><span>(() <span><span>=><span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 异步注册时当前组件实例已丢失<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 这将不会正常工作<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> })<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/lifecycle.html", "title": "生命周期钩子", "doc_id": "945a2255a7b04b0e9a0ae87d2995b512", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 153, "chunk_index": 8, "_doc_id": "8_7537503690678890856"}}
{"doc_id": "9_5386048969135426807", "text": "n><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 这将不会正常工作<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> })<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}, <span><span>100<span><span>)<span><span><code><pre><div><p>注意这并不意味着对 <code>onMounted<code> 的调用必须放在 <code>setup()<code> 或 <code><script setup><code> 内的词法上下文中。<code>onMounted()<code> 也可以在一个外部函数中调用，只要调用栈是同步的，且最终起源自 <code>setup()<code> 就可以。<p><div><h2 id=\"lifecycle-diagram\">生命周期图示 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#lifecycle-diagram\">​<a><h2><p>下面是实例生命周期的图表。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/lifecycle.html", "title": "生命周期钩子", "doc_id": "945a2255a7b04b0e9a0ae87d2995b512", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 153, "chunk_index": 9, "_doc_id": "9_5386048969135426807"}}
{"doc_id": "10_9131136729315712800", "text": "ifecycle-diagram\">生命周期图示 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#lifecycle-diagram\">​<a><h2><p>下面是实例生命周期的图表。你现在并不需要完全理解图中的所有内容，但以后它将是一个有用的参考。<p><p> <p><p>有关所有生命周期钩子及其各自用例的详细信息，请参考<span class=\"composition-api\"><a href=\"/api/composition-api-lifecycle.html\">生命周期钩子 API 索引<a><span><span class=\"options-api\"><a href=\"/api/options-lifecycle.html\">生命周期钩子 API 索引<a><span>。<p><div><div>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/essentials/lifecycle.html", "title": "生命周期钩子", "doc_id": "945a2255a7b04b0e9a0ae87d2995b512", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 153, "chunk_index": 10, "_doc_id": "10_9131136729315712800"}}
{"doc_id": "0_2239228992484047734", "text": "<div><div><h1 id=\"component-registration\">组件注册 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#component-registration\">​<a><h1><blockquote><p>此章节假设你已经看过了<a href=\"/guide/essentials/component-basics.html\">组件基础<a>。若你还不了解组件是什么，请先阅读该章节。<p><blockquote><p>一个 Vue 组件在使用前需要先被“注册”，这样 Vue 才能在渲染模板时找到其对应的实现。组件注册有两种方式：全局注册和局部注册。<p><h2 id=\"global-registration\">全局注册 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#global-registration\">​<a><h2><p>我们可以使用 <a href=\"/guide/essentials/application.html\">Vue 应用实例<a>的 <code>.component()<code> 方法，让组件在当前 Vue 应用中全局可用。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/registration.html", "title": "组件注册", "doc_id": "72a117f71f1e4001b98fa4f34090be81", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 328, "chunk_index": 0, "_doc_id": "0_2239228992484047734"}}
{"doc_id": "1_18069431095068288", "text": "ef=\"/guide/essentials/application.html\">Vue 应用实例<a>的 <code>.component()<code> 方法，让组件在当前 Vue 应用中全局可用。<p><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>import<span><span> { createApp } <span><span>from<span><span> 'vue'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> app<span><span> =<span><span> createApp<span><span>({})<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/registration.html", "title": "组件注册", "doc_id": "72a117f71f1e4001b98fa4f34090be81", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 328, "chunk_index": 1, "_doc_id": "1_18069431095068288"}}
{"doc_id": "2_3480362485467260311", "text": "span> app<span><span> =<span><span> createApp<span><span>({})<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>app.<span><span>component<span><span>(<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 注册的名字<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> 'MyComponent'<span><span>,<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 组件的实现<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> /* ... */<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/registration.html", "title": "组件注册", "doc_id": "72a117f71f1e4001b98fa4f34090be81", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 328, "chunk_index": 2, "_doc_id": "2_3480362485467260311"}}
{"doc_id": "3_1975476251979953161", "text": "span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> /* ... */<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>)<span><span><code><pre><div><p>如果使用单文件组件，你可以注册被导入的 <code>.vue<code> 文件：<p><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>import<span><span> MyComponent <span><span>from<span><span> './App.vue'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/registration.html", "title": "组件注册", "doc_id": "72a117f71f1e4001b98fa4f34090be81", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 328, "chunk_index": 3, "_doc_id": "3_1975476251979953161"}}
{"doc_id": "4_3661771424110590034", "text": "n><span> MyComponent <span><span>from<span><span> './App.vue'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>app.<span><span>component<span><span>(<span><span>'MyComponent'<span><span>, MyComponent)<span><span><code><pre><div><p><code>.component()<code> 方法可以被链式调用：<p><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>app<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/registration.html", "title": "组件注册", "doc_id": "72a117f71f1e4001b98fa4f34090be81", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 328, "chunk_index": 4, "_doc_id": "4_3661771424110590034"}}
{"doc_id": "5_5343692204238314236", "text": "lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>app<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> .<span><span>component<span><span>(<span><span>'ComponentA'<span><span>, ComponentA)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> .<span><span>component<span><span>(<span><span>'ComponentB'<span><span>, ComponentB)<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/registration.html", "title": "组件注册", "doc_id": "72a117f71f1e4001b98fa4f34090be81", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 328, "chunk_index": 5, "_doc_id": "5_5343692204238314236"}}
{"doc_id": "6_3426662589542621905", "text": "n> .<span><span>component<span><span>(<span><span>'ComponentB'<span><span>, ComponentB)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> .<span><span>component<span><span>(<span><span>'ComponentC'<span><span>, ComponentC)<span><span><code><pre><div><p>全局注册的组件可以在此应用的任意组件的模板中使用：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><!-- 这在当前应用的任意组件中都可用 --><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/registration.html", "title": "组件注册", "doc_id": "72a117f71f1e4001b98fa4f34090be81", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 328, "chunk_index": 6, "_doc_id": "6_3426662589542621905"}}
{"doc_id": "7_2563488028626611498", "text": "ass=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><!-- 这在当前应用的任意组件中都可用 --><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>ComponentA<span><span>/><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>ComponentB<span><span>/><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>ComponentC<span><span>/><span><span><code><pre><div><p>所有的子组件也可以使用全局注册的组件，这意味着这三个组件也都可以在<em>彼此内部<em>使用。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/registration.html", "title": "组件注册", "doc_id": "72a117f71f1e4001b98fa4f34090be81", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 328, "chunk_index": 7, "_doc_id": "7_2563488028626611498"}}
{"doc_id": "8_3076847348273302462", "text": "ponentC<span><span>/><span><span><code><pre><div><p>所有的子组件也可以使用全局注册的组件，这意味着这三个组件也都可以在<em>彼此内部<em>使用。<p><h2 id=\"local-registration\">局部注册 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#local-registration\">​<a><h2><p>全局注册虽然很方便，但有以下几个问题：<p><ol><li><p>全局注册，但并没有被使用的组件无法在生产打包时被自动移除 (也叫“tree-shaking”)。如果你全局注册了一个组件，即使它并没有被实际使用，它仍然会出现在打包后的 JS 文件中。<p><li><li><p>全局注册在大型项目中使项目的依赖关系变得不那么明确。在父组件中使用子组件时，不太容易定位子组件的实现。和使用过多的全局变量一样，这可能会影响应用长期的可维护性。<p><li><ol><p>相比之下，局部注册的组件需要在使用它的父组件中显式导入，并且只能在该父组件中使用。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/registration.html", "title": "组件注册", "doc_id": "72a117f71f1e4001b98fa4f34090be81", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 328, "chunk_index": 8, "_doc_id": "8_3076847348273302462"}}
{"doc_id": "9_2481032955495198935", "text": "件时，不太容易定位子组件的实现。和使用过多的全局变量一样，这可能会影响应用长期的可维护性。<p><li><ol><p>相比之下，局部注册的组件需要在使用它的父组件中显式导入，并且只能在该父组件中使用。它的优点是使组件之间的依赖关系更加明确，并且对 tree-shaking 更加友好。<p><div class=\"composition-api\"><p>在使用 <code><script setup><code> 的单文件组件中，导入的组件可以直接在模板中使用，无需注册：<p><div class=\"language-vue\"> <span class=\"lang\">vue<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>script<span><span> setup<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/registration.html", "title": "组件注册", "doc_id": "72a117f71f1e4001b98fa4f34090be81", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 328, "chunk_index": 9, "_doc_id": "9_2481032955495198935"}}
{"doc_id": "10_710777954203186984", "text": "code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>script<span><span> setup<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>import<span><span> ComponentA <span><span>from<span><span> './ComponentA.vue'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>script<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>ComponentA<span><span> /><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/registration.html", "title": "组件注册", "doc_id": "72a117f71f1e4001b98fa4f34090be81", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 328, "chunk_index": 10, "_doc_id": "10_710777954203186984"}}
{"doc_id": "11_3949554194201488819", "text": "an><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>ComponentA<span><span> /><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>如果没有使用 <code><script setup><code>，则需要使用 <code>components<code> 选项来显式注册：<p><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>import<span><span> ComponentA <span><span>from<span><span> './ComponentA.js'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/registration.html", "title": "组件注册", "doc_id": "72a117f71f1e4001b98fa4f34090be81", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 328, "chunk_index": 11, "_doc_id": "11_3949554194201488819"}}
{"doc_id": "12_2546067945202640631", "text": "an> ComponentA <span><span>from<span><span> './ComponentA.js'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> components: {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> ComponentA<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> },<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> setup<span><span>() {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // ...<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/registration.html", "title": "组件注册", "doc_id": "72a117f71f1e4001b98fa4f34090be81", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 328, "chunk_index": 12, "_doc_id": "12_2546067945202640631"}}
{"doc_id": "13_494581805575123986", "text": "{<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // ...<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span><code><pre><div><div><div class=\"options-api\"><p>局部注册需要使用 <code>components<code> 选项：<p><div class=\"language-vue\"> <span class=\"lang\">vue<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>script<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>import<span><span> ComponentA <span><span>from<span><span> './ComponentA.vue'<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/registration.html", "title": "组件注册", "doc_id": "72a117f71f1e4001b98fa4f34090be81", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 328, "chunk_index": 13, "_doc_id": "13_494581805575123986"}}
{"doc_id": "14_3501886349879127989", "text": "ne\"><span>import<span><span> ComponentA <span><span>from<span><span> './ComponentA.vue'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> components: {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> ComponentA<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>script<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/registration.html", "title": "组件注册", "doc_id": "72a117f71f1e4001b98fa4f34090be81", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 328, "chunk_index": 14, "_doc_id": "14_3501886349879127989"}}
{"doc_id": "15_2707773816189966078", "text": "n>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>script<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>ComponentA<span><span> /><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/registration.html", "title": "组件注册", "doc_id": "72a117f71f1e4001b98fa4f34090be81", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 328, "chunk_index": 15, "_doc_id": "15_2707773816189966078"}}
{"doc_id": "16_5734202013123315706", "text": "an><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>ComponentA<span><span> /><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><div><p>对于每个 <code>components<code> 对象里的属性，它们的 key 名就是注册的组件名，而值就是相应组件的实现。上面的例子中使用的是 ES2015 的缩写语法，等价于：<p><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/registration.html", "title": "组件注册", "doc_id": "72a117f71f1e4001b98fa4f34090be81", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 328, "chunk_index": 16, "_doc_id": "16_5734202013123315706"}}
{"doc_id": "17_8304087341481418758", "text": "b-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> components: {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> ComponentA: ComponentA<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // ...<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span><code><pre><div><p>请注意：<strong>局部注册的组件在后代组件中<i>不<i>可用<strong>。在这个例子中，<code>ComponentA<code> 注册后仅在当前组件可用，而在任何的子组件或更深层的子组件中都不可用。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/registration.html", "title": "组件注册", "doc_id": "72a117f71f1e4001b98fa4f34090be81", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 328, "chunk_index": 17, "_doc_id": "17_8304087341481418758"}}
{"doc_id": "18_4860453493985931268", "text": "rong>局部注册的组件在后代组件中<i>不<i>可用<strong>。在这个例子中，<code>ComponentA<code> 注册后仅在当前组件可用，而在任何的子组件或更深层的子组件中都不可用。<p><h2 id=\"component-name-casing\">组件名格式 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#component-name-casing\">​<a><h2><p>在整个指引中，我们都使用 PascalCase 作为组件名的注册格式，这是因为：<p><ol><li><p>PascalCase 是合法的 JavaScript 标识符。这使得在 JavaScript 中导入和注册组件都很容易，同时 IDE 也能提供较好的自动补全。<p><li><li><p><code><PascalCase /><code> 在模板中更明显地表明了这是一个 Vue 组件，而不是原生 HTML 元素。同时也能够将 Vue 组件和自定义元素 (web components) 区分开来。<p><li><ol><p>在单文件组件和内联字符串模板中，我们都推荐这样做。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/registration.html", "title": "组件注册", "doc_id": "72a117f71f1e4001b98fa4f34090be81", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 328, "chunk_index": 18, "_doc_id": "18_4860453493985931268"}}
{"doc_id": "19_3827768307960617511", "text": "e 组件，而不是原生 HTML 元素。同时也能够将 Vue 组件和自定义元素 (web components) 区分开来。<p><li><ol><p>在单文件组件和内联字符串模板中，我们都推荐这样做。但是，PascalCase 的标签名在 DOM 内模板中是不可用的，详情参见 <a href=\"/guide/essentials/component-basics.html#in-dom-template-parsing-caveats\">DOM 内模板解析注意事项<a>。<p><p>为了方便，Vue 支持将模板中使用 kebab-case 的标签解析为使用 PascalCase 注册的组件。这意味着一个以 <code>MyComponent<code> 为名注册的组件，在模板 (或由 Vue 渲染的 HTML 元素) 中可以通过 <code><MyComponent><code> 或 <code><my-component><code> 引用。这让我们能够使用同样的 JavaScript 组件注册代码来配合不同来源的模板。<p><div><div>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/registration.html", "title": "组件注册", "doc_id": "72a117f71f1e4001b98fa4f34090be81", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 328, "chunk_index": 19, "_doc_id": "19_3827768307960617511"}}
{"doc_id": "0_7997277426200407516", "text": "<div><div><h1 id=\"props\">Props <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#props\">​<a><h1><blockquote><p>此章节假设你已经看过了<a href=\"/guide/essentials/component-basics.html\">组件基础<a>。若你还不了解组件是什么，请先阅读该章节。<p><blockquote><h2 id=\"props-declaration\">Props 声明 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#props-declaration\">​<a><h2><p>一个组件需要显式声明它所接受的 props，这样 Vue 才能知道外部传入的哪些是 props，哪些是透传 attribute (关于透传 attribute，我们会在<a href=\"/guide/components/attrs.html\">专门的章节<a>中讨论)。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/props.html", "title": "Props | Vue.js", "doc_id": "792ac0654a484b16963d45feb1eabb9a", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 2081, "chunk_index": 0, "_doc_id": "0_7997277426200407516"}}
{"doc_id": "1_4659166209906717205", "text": "入的哪些是 props，哪些是透传 attribute (关于透传 attribute，我们会在<a href=\"/guide/components/attrs.html\">专门的章节<a>中讨论)。<p><div class=\"composition-api\"><p>在使用 <code><script setup><code> 的单文件组件中，props 可以使用 <code>defineProps()<code> 宏来声明：<p><div class=\"language-vue\"> <span class=\"lang\">vue<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>script<span><span> setup<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/props.html", "title": "Props | Vue.js", "doc_id": "792ac0654a484b16963d45feb1eabb9a", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 2081, "chunk_index": 1, "_doc_id": "1_4659166209906717205"}}
{"doc_id": "2_4811252791999850582", "text": "code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>script<span><span> setup<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> props<span><span> =<span><span> defineProps<span><span>([<span><span>'foo'<span><span>])<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>console.<span><span>log<span><span>(props.foo)<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/props.html", "title": "Props | Vue.js", "doc_id": "792ac0654a484b16963d45feb1eabb9a", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 2081, "chunk_index": 2, "_doc_id": "2_4811252791999850582"}}
{"doc_id": "3_5069749877813421686", "text": "s=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>console.<span><span>log<span><span>(props.foo)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>script<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>在没有使用 <code><script setup><code> 的组件中，props 可以使用 <a href=\"/api/options-state.html#props\"><code>props<code><a> 选项来声明：<p><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/props.html", "title": "Props | Vue.js", "doc_id": "792ac0654a484b16963d45feb1eabb9a", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 2081, "chunk_index": 3, "_doc_id": "3_5069749877813421686"}}
{"doc_id": "4_163794263408574210", "text": "b-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> props: [<span><span>'foo'<span><span>],<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> setup<span><span>(<span><span>props<span><span>) {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // setup() 接收 props 作为第一个参数<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> console.<span><span>log<span><span>(props.foo)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/props.html", "title": "Props | Vue.js", "doc_id": "792ac0654a484b16963d45feb1eabb9a", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 2081, "chunk_index": 4, "_doc_id": "4_163794263408574210"}}
{"doc_id": "5_3963795509999203630", "text": "console.<span><span>log<span><span>(props.foo)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span><code><pre><div><p>注意传递给 <code>defineProps()<code> 的参数和提供给 <code>props<code> 选项的值是相同的，两种声明方式背后其实使用的都是 props 选项。<p><div><div class=\"options-api\"><p>props 需要使用 <a href=\"/api/options-state.html#props\"><code>props<code><a> 选项来定义：<p><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/props.html", "title": "Props | Vue.js", "doc_id": "792ac0654a484b16963d45feb1eabb9a", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 2081, "chunk_index": 5, "_doc_id": "5_3963795509999203630"}}
{"doc_id": "6_4909558168512893725", "text": "b-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> props: [<span><span>'foo'<span><span>],<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> created<span><span>() {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // props 会暴露到 `this` 上<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> console.<span><span>log<span><span>(<span><span>this<span><span>.foo)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/props.html", "title": "Props | Vue.js", "doc_id": "792ac0654a484b16963d45feb1eabb9a", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 2081, "chunk_index": 6, "_doc_id": "6_4909558168512893725"}}
{"doc_id": "7_263801264527123905", "text": "g<span><span>(<span><span>this<span><span>.foo)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span><code><pre><div><div><p>除了使用字符串数组来声明 props 外，还可以使用对象的形式：<p><div class=\"options-api\"><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> props: {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> title: String,<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/props.html", "title": "Props | Vue.js", "doc_id": "792ac0654a484b16963d45feb1eabb9a", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 2081, "chunk_index": 7, "_doc_id": "7_263801264527123905"}}
{"doc_id": "8_8220426314726599309", "text": "<span class=\"line\"><span> props: {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> title: String,<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> likes: Number<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span><code><pre><div><div><div class=\"composition-api\"><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// 使用 <script setup><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>defineProps<span><span>({<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/props.html", "title": "Props | Vue.js", "doc_id": "792ac0654a484b16963d45feb1eabb9a", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 2081, "chunk_index": 8, "_doc_id": "8_8220426314726599309"}}
{"doc_id": "9_2107444144207970623", "text": "pan>// 使用 <script setup><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>defineProps<span><span>({<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> title: String,<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> likes: Number<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>})<span><span><code><pre><div><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// 非 <script setup><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/props.html", "title": "Props | Vue.js", "doc_id": "792ac0654a484b16963d45feb1eabb9a", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 2081, "chunk_index": 9, "_doc_id": "9_2107444144207970623"}}
{"doc_id": "10_4887208757082729855", "text": "pt setup><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> props: {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> title: String,<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> likes: Number<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span><code><pre><div><div><p>对于以对象形式声明的每个属性，key 是 prop 的名称，而值则是该 prop 预期类型的构造函数。比如，如果要求一个 prop 的值是 <code>number<code> 类型，则可使用 <code>Number<code> 构造函数作为其声明的值。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/props.html", "title": "Props | Vue.js", "doc_id": "792ac0654a484b16963d45feb1eabb9a", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 2081, "chunk_index": 10, "_doc_id": "10_4887208757082729855"}}
{"doc_id": "11_1803987137704775905", "text": "称，而值则是该 prop 预期类型的构造函数。比如，如果要求一个 prop 的值是 <code>number<code> 类型，则可使用 <code>Number<code> 构造函数作为其声明的值。<p><p>对象形式的 props 声明不仅可以一定程度上作为组件的文档，而且如果其他开发者在使用你的组件时传递了错误的类型，也会在浏览器控制台中抛出警告。我们将在本章节稍后进一步讨论有关 <a href=\"#prop-validation\">prop 校验<a>的更多细节。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/props.html", "title": "Props | Vue.js", "doc_id": "792ac0654a484b16963d45feb1eabb9a", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 2081, "chunk_index": 11, "_doc_id": "11_1803987137704775905"}}
{"doc_id": "12_4622268638747681917", "text": "且如果其他开发者在使用你的组件时传递了错误的类型，也会在浏览器控制台中抛出警告。我们将在本章节稍后进一步讨论有关 <a href=\"#prop-validation\">prop 校验<a>的更多细节。<p><div class=\"composition-api\"><p>如果你正在搭配 TypeScript 使用 <code><script setup><code>，也可以使用类型标注来声明 props：<p><div class=\"language-vue\"> <span class=\"lang\">vue<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>script<span><span> setup<span><span> lang<span><span>=<span><span>\"ts\"<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>defineProps<span><span><{<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/props.html", "title": "Props | Vue.js", "doc_id": "792ac0654a484b16963d45feb1eabb9a", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 2081, "chunk_index": 12, "_doc_id": "12_4622268638747681917"}}
{"doc_id": "13_5661751846730669640", "text": "><span>\"ts\"<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>defineProps<span><span><{<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> title<span><span>?:<span><span> string<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> likes<span><span>?:<span><span> number<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}>()<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>script<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>更多关于基于类型的声明的细节请参考<a href=\"/guide/typescript/composition-api.html#typing-component-props\">组件 props 类型标注<a>。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/props.html", "title": "Props | Vue.js", "doc_id": "792ac0654a484b16963d45feb1eabb9a", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 2081, "chunk_index": 13, "_doc_id": "13_5661751846730669640"}}
{"doc_id": "14_2349806029128496365", "text": "类型的声明的细节请参考<a href=\"/guide/typescript/composition-api.html#typing-component-props\">组件 props 类型标注<a>。 <p><div><div class=\"composition-api\"><h2 id=\"reactive-props-destructure\">响应式 Props 解构 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#reactive-props-destructure\" class=\"vt-badge\">​<a><h2><p>Vue 的响应系统基于属性访问跟踪状态的使用情况。例如，在计算属性或侦听器中访问 <code>props.foo<code> 时，<code>foo<code> 属性将被跟踪为依赖项。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/props.html", "title": "Props | Vue.js", "doc_id": "792ac0654a484b16963d45feb1eabb9a", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 2081, "chunk_index": 14, "_doc_id": "14_2349806029128496365"}}
{"doc_id": "15_7046958154009306974", "text": "><h2><p>Vue 的响应系统基于属性访问跟踪状态的使用情况。例如，在计算属性或侦听器中访问 <code>props.foo<code> 时，<code>foo<code> 属性将被跟踪为依赖项。<p><p>因此，在以下代码的情况下：<p><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> { <span><span>foo<span><span> } <span><span>=<span><span> defineProps<span><span>([<span><span>'foo'<span><span>])<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>watchEffect<span><span>(() <span><span>=><span><span> {<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/props.html", "title": "Props | Vue.js", "doc_id": "792ac0654a484b16963d45feb1eabb9a", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 2081, "chunk_index": 15, "_doc_id": "15_7046958154009306974"}}
{"doc_id": "16_7863464839228601081", "text": "<span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>watchEffect<span><span>(() <span><span>=><span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 在 3.5 之前只运行一次<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 在 3.5+ 中在 \"foo\" prop 变化时重新执行<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> console.<span><span>log<span><span>(foo)<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/props.html", "title": "Props | Vue.js", "doc_id": "792ac0654a484b16963d45feb1eabb9a", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 2081, "chunk_index": 16, "_doc_id": "16_7863464839228601081"}}
{"doc_id": "17_6505616375189088236", "text": "变化时重新执行<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> console.<span><span>log<span><span>(foo)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>})<span><span><code><pre><div><p>在 3.4 及以下版本，<code>foo<code> 是一个实际的常量，永远不会改变。在 3.5 及以上版本，当在同一个 <code><script setup><code> 代码块中访问由 <code>defineProps<code> 解构的变量时，Vue 编译器会自动在前面添加 <code>props.<code>。因此，上面的代码等同于以下代码：<p><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> props<span><span> =<span><span> defineProps<span><span>([<span><span>'foo'<span><span>])<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/props.html", "title": "Props | Vue.js", "doc_id": "792ac0654a484b16963d45feb1eabb9a", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 2081, "chunk_index": 17, "_doc_id": "17_6505616375189088236"}}
{"doc_id": "18_2836336191603754990", "text": "rops<span><span> =<span><span> defineProps<span><span>([<span><span>'foo'<span><span>])<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>watchEffect<span><span>(() <span><span>=><span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // `foo` 由编译器转换为 `props.foo`<span><span>\n<span class=\"line highlighted\"><span> console.<span><span>log<span><span>(props.foo)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>})<span><span><code><pre><div><p>此外，你可以使用 JavaScript 原生的默认值语法声明 props 默认值。这在使用基于类型的 props 声明时特别有用。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/props.html", "title": "Props | Vue.js", "doc_id": "792ac0654a484b16963d45feb1eabb9a", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 2081, "chunk_index": 18, "_doc_id": "18_2836336191603754990"}}
{"doc_id": "19_1978996945073355891", "text": "n>})<span><span><code><pre><div><p>此外，你可以使用 JavaScript 原生的默认值语法声明 props 默认值。这在使用基于类型的 props 声明时特别有用。<p><div class=\"language-ts\"> <span class=\"lang\">ts<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> { <span><span>foo<span><span> =<span><span> 'hello'<span><span> } <span><span>=<span><span> defineProps<span><span><{ <span><span>foo<span><span>?:<span><span> string<span><span> }>()<span><span><code><pre><div><p>如果你希望在 IDE 中在解构的 props 和普通变量之间有更多视觉上的区分，Vue 的 VSCode 扩展提供了一个设置来启用解构 props 的内联提示。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/props.html", "title": "Props | Vue.js", "doc_id": "792ac0654a484b16963d45feb1eabb9a", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 2081, "chunk_index": 19, "_doc_id": "19_1978996945073355891"}}
{"doc_id": "20_5194110621831335949", "text": "><code><pre><div><p>如果你希望在 IDE 中在解构的 props 和普通变量之间有更多视觉上的区分，Vue 的 VSCode 扩展提供了一个设置来启用解构 props 的内联提示。<p><h3 id=\"passing-destructured-props-into-functions\">将解构的 props 传递到函数中 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#passing-destructured-props-into-functions\">​<a><h3><p>当我们将解构的 prop 传递到函数中时，例如：<p><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> { <span><span>foo<span><span> } <span><span>=<span><span> defineProps<span><span>([<span><span>'foo'<span><span>])<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/props.html", "title": "Props | Vue.js", "doc_id": "792ac0654a484b16963d45feb1eabb9a", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 2081, "chunk_index": 20, "_doc_id": "20_5194110621831335949"}}
{"doc_id": "21_4915098720332868545", "text": "n> } <span><span>=<span><span> defineProps<span><span>([<span><span>'foo'<span><span>])<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>watch<span><span>(foo, <span><span>/* ... */<span><span>)<span><span><code><pre><div><p>这并不会按预期工作，因为它等价于 <code>watch(props.foo, ...)<code>——我们给 <code>watch<code> 传递的是一个值而不是响应式数据源。实际上，Vue 的编译器会捕捉这种情况并发出警告。<p><p>与使用 <code>watch(() => props.foo, ...)<code> 来侦听普通 prop 类似，", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/props.html", "title": "Props | Vue.js", "doc_id": "792ac0654a484b16963d45feb1eabb9a", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 2081, "chunk_index": 21, "_doc_id": "21_4915098720332868545"}}
{"doc_id": "22_2174990024158954778", "text": "值而不是响应式数据源。实际上，Vue 的编译器会捕捉这种情况并发出警告。<p><p>与使用 <code>watch(() => props.foo, ...)<code> 来侦听普通 prop 类似，我们也可以通过将其包装在 getter 中来侦听解构的 prop：<p><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>watch<span><span>(() <span><span>=><span><span> foo, <span><span>/* ... */<span><span>)<span><span><code><pre><div><p>此外，当我们需要传递解构的 prop 到外部函数中并保持响应性时，", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/props.html", "title": "Props | Vue.js", "doc_id": "792ac0654a484b16963d45feb1eabb9a", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 2081, "chunk_index": 22, "_doc_id": "22_2174990024158954778"}}
{"doc_id": "23_4550515833432324059", "text": ", <span><span>/* ... */<span><span>)<span><span><code><pre><div><p>此外，当我们需要传递解构的 prop 到外部函数中并保持响应性时，这是推荐做法：<p><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>useComposable<span><span>(() <span><span>=><span><span> foo)<span><span><code><pre><div><p>外部函数可以调用 getter (或使用 <a href=\"/api/reactivity-utilities.html#tovalue\">toValue<a> 进行规范化) 来追踪提供的 prop 变更。例如，在计算属性或侦听器的 getter 中。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/props.html", "title": "Props | Vue.js", "doc_id": "792ac0654a484b16963d45feb1eabb9a", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 2081, "chunk_index": 23, "_doc_id": "23_4550515833432324059"}}
{"doc_id": "24_1708679417015848443", "text": "ef=\"/api/reactivity-utilities.html#tovalue\">toValue<a> 进行规范化) 来追踪提供的 prop 变更。例如，在计算属性或侦听器的 getter 中。<p><div><h2 id=\"prop-passing-details\">传递 prop 的细节 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#prop-passing-details\">​<a><h2><h3 id=\"prop-name-casing\">Prop 名字格式 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#prop-name-casing\">​<a><h3><p>如果一个 prop 的名字很长，应使用 camelCase 形式，因为它们是合法的 JavaScript 标识符，可以直接在模板的表达式中使用，也可以避免在作为属性 key 名时必须加上引号。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/props.html", "title": "Props | Vue.js", "doc_id": "792ac0654a484b16963d45feb1eabb9a", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 2081, "chunk_index": 24, "_doc_id": "24_1708679417015848443"}}
{"doc_id": "25_8318734424024361059", "text": "><p>如果一个 prop 的名字很长，应使用 camelCase 形式，因为它们是合法的 JavaScript 标识符，可以直接在模板的表达式中使用，也可以避免在作为属性 key 名时必须加上引号。<p><div class=\"composition-api\"><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>defineProps<span><span>({<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> greetingMessage: String<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/props.html", "title": "Props | Vue.js", "doc_id": "792ac0654a484b16963d45feb1eabb9a", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 2081, "chunk_index": 25, "_doc_id": "25_8318734424024361059"}}
{"doc_id": "26_7585280665598674252", "text": "defineProps<span><span>({<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> greetingMessage: String<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>})<span><span><code><pre><div><div><div class=\"options-api\"><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> props: {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> greetingMessage: String<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/props.html", "title": "Props | Vue.js", "doc_id": "792ac0654a484b16963d45feb1eabb9a", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 2081, "chunk_index": 26, "_doc_id": "26_7585280665598674252"}}
{"doc_id": "27_8659111333416015951", "text": "pan class=\"line\"><span> greetingMessage: String<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span><code><pre><div><div><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>span<span><span>>{{ greetingMessage }}</<span><span>span<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>虽然理论上你也可以在向子组件传递 props 时使用 camelCase 形式 (使用 <a href=\"/guide/essentials/component-basics.html#in-dom-template-parsing-caveats\">DOM 内模板<a>时例外)，", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/props.html", "title": "Props | Vue.js", "doc_id": "792ac0654a484b16963d45feb1eabb9a", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 2081, "chunk_index": 27, "_doc_id": "27_8659111333416015951"}}
{"doc_id": "28_3580301065877768917", "text": "使用 <a href=\"/guide/essentials/component-basics.html#in-dom-template-parsing-caveats\">DOM 内模板<a>时例外)，但实际上为了和 HTML attribute 对齐，", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/props.html", "title": "Props | Vue.js", "doc_id": "792ac0654a484b16963d45feb1eabb9a", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 2081, "chunk_index": 28, "_doc_id": "28_3580301065877768917"}}
{"doc_id": "29_2660342272239121685", "text": "als/component-basics.html#in-dom-template-parsing-caveats\">DOM 内模板<a>时例外)，但实际上为了和 HTML attribute 对齐，我们通常会将其写为 kebab-case 形式：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>MyComponent<span><span> greeting-message<span><span>=<span><span>\"hello\"<span><span> /><span><span><code><pre><div><p>对于组件名我们推荐使用 <a href=\"/guide/components/registration.html#component-name-casing\">PascalCase<a>，因为这提高了模板的可读性，", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/props.html", "title": "Props | Vue.js", "doc_id": "792ac0654a484b16963d45feb1eabb9a", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 2081, "chunk_index": 29, "_doc_id": "29_2660342272239121685"}}
{"doc_id": "30_7584928141687209251", "text": "推荐使用 <a href=\"/guide/components/registration.html#component-name-casing\">PascalCase<a>，因为这提高了模板的可读性，能帮助我们区分 Vue 组件和原生 HTML 元素。然而对于传递 props 来说，使用 camelCase 并没有太多优势，因此我们推荐更贴近 HTML 的书写风格。<p><h3 id=\"static-vs-dynamic-props\">静态 vs. 动态 Props <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#static-vs-dynamic-props\">​<a><h3><p>至此，", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/props.html", "title": "Props | Vue.js", "doc_id": "792ac0654a484b16963d45feb1eabb9a", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 2081, "chunk_index": 30, "_doc_id": "30_7584928141687209251"}}
{"doc_id": "31_7614672280641776723", "text": "namic-props\">静态 vs. 动态 Props <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#static-vs-dynamic-props\">​<a><h3><p>至此，你已经见过了很多像这样的静态值形式的 props：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>BlogPost<span><span> title<span><span>=<span><span>\"My journey with Vue\"<span><span> /><span><span><code><pre><div><p>相应地，", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/props.html", "title": "Props | Vue.js", "doc_id": "792ac0654a484b16963d45feb1eabb9a", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 2081, "chunk_index": 31, "_doc_id": "31_7614672280641776723"}}
{"doc_id": "32_7070257695235280248", "text": "itle<span><span>=<span><span>\"My journey with Vue\"<span><span> /><span><span><code><pre><div><p>相应地，还有使用 <code>v-bind<code> 或缩写 <code>:<code> 来进行动态绑定的 props：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><!-- 根据一个变量的值动态传入 --><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>BlogPost<span><span> :<span><span>title<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>post.title<span><span>\"<span><span> /><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/props.html", "title": "Props | Vue.js", "doc_id": "792ac0654a484b16963d45feb1eabb9a", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 2081, "chunk_index": 32, "_doc_id": "32_7070257695235280248"}}
{"doc_id": "33_4535813765226963238", "text": "<span>title<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>post.title<span><span>\"<span><span> /><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><!-- 根据一个更复杂表达式的值动态传入 --><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/props.html", "title": "Props | Vue.js", "doc_id": "792ac0654a484b16963d45feb1eabb9a", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 2081, "chunk_index": 33, "_doc_id": "33_4535813765226963238"}}
{"doc_id": "34_1564634446268682097", "text": "pan><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><!-- 根据一个更复杂表达式的值动态传入 --><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>BlogPost<span><span> :<span><span>title<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>post.title <span><span>+<span><span> ' by '<span><span> +<span><span> post.author.name<span><span>\"<span><span> /><span><span><code><pre><div><h3 id=\"passing-different-value-types\">传递不同的值类型 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#passing-different-value-types\">​<a><h3><p>在上述的两个例子中，我们只传入了字符串值，但实际上<strong>任何<strong>类型的值都可以作为 props 的值被传递。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/props.html", "title": "Props | Vue.js", "doc_id": "792ac0654a484b16963d45feb1eabb9a", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 2081, "chunk_index": 34, "_doc_id": "34_1564634446268682097"}}
{"doc_id": "35_6787612195849415998", "text": "-different-value-types\">​<a><h3><p>在上述的两个例子中，我们只传入了字符串值，但实际上<strong>任何<strong>类型的值都可以作为 props 的值被传递。<p><h4 id=\"number\">Number <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#number\">​<a><h4><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><!-- 虽然 `42` 是个常量，我们还是需要使用 v-bind --><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><!-- 因为这是一个 JavaScript 表达式而不是一个字符串 --><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/props.html", "title": "Props | Vue.js", "doc_id": "792ac0654a484b16963d45feb1eabb9a", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 2081, "chunk_index": 35, "_doc_id": "35_6787612195849415998"}}
{"doc_id": "36_520065462401553536", "text": "v-bind --><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><!-- 因为这是一个 JavaScript 表达式而不是一个字符串 --><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>BlogPost<span><span> :<span><span>likes<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>42<span><span>\"<span><span> /><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><!-- 根据一个变量的值动态传入 --><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/props.html", "title": "Props | Vue.js", "doc_id": "792ac0654a484b16963d45feb1eabb9a", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 2081, "chunk_index": 36, "_doc_id": "36_520065462401553536"}}
{"doc_id": "37_275972917196062007", "text": "/><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><!-- 根据一个变量的值动态传入 --><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>BlogPost<span><span> :<span><span>likes<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>post.likes<span><span>\"<span><span> /><span><span><code><pre><div><h4 id=\"boolean\">Boolean <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#boolean\">​<a><h4><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><!-- 仅写上 prop 但不传值，会隐式转换为 `true` --><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/props.html", "title": "Props | Vue.js", "doc_id": "792ac0654a484b16963d45feb1eabb9a", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 2081, "chunk_index": 37, "_doc_id": "37_275972917196062007"}}
{"doc_id": "38_3931468284517535968", "text": "ithub-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><!-- 仅写上 prop 但不传值，会隐式转换为 `true` --><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>BlogPost<span><span> is-published<span><span> /><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><!-- 虽然 `false` 是静态的值，我们还是需要使用 v-bind --><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><!-- 因为这是一个 JavaScript 表达式而不是一个字符串 --><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/props.html", "title": "Props | Vue.js", "doc_id": "792ac0654a484b16963d45feb1eabb9a", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 2081, "chunk_index": 38, "_doc_id": "38_3931468284517535968"}}
{"doc_id": "39_5528812262561389940", "text": "v-bind --><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><!-- 因为这是一个 JavaScript 表达式而不是一个字符串 --><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>BlogPost<span><span> :<span><span>is-published<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>false<span><span>\"<span><span> /><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><!-- 根据一个变量的值动态传入 --><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/props.html", "title": "Props | Vue.js", "doc_id": "792ac0654a484b16963d45feb1eabb9a", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 2081, "chunk_index": 39, "_doc_id": "39_5528812262561389940"}}
{"doc_id": "40_6546181014830212284", "text": "/><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><!-- 根据一个变量的值动态传入 --><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>BlogPost<span><span> :<span><span>is-published<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>post.isPublished<span><span>\"<span><span> /><span><span><code><pre><div><h4 id=\"array\">Array <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#array\">​<a><h4><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><!-- 虽然这个数组是个常量，我们还是需要使用 v-bind --><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/props.html", "title": "Props | Vue.js", "doc_id": "792ac0654a484b16963d45feb1eabb9a", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 2081, "chunk_index": 40, "_doc_id": "40_6546181014830212284"}}
{"doc_id": "41_8854499679550882781", "text": "github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><!-- 虽然这个数组是个常量，我们还是需要使用 v-bind --><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><!-- 因为这是一个 JavaScript 表达式而不是一个字符串 --><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>BlogPost<span><span> :<span><span>comment-ids<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>[<span><span>234<span><span>, <span><span>266<span><span>, <span><span>273<span><span>]<span><span>\"<span><span> /><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><!-- 根据一个变量的值动态传入 --><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/props.html", "title": "Props | Vue.js", "doc_id": "792ac0654a484b16963d45feb1eabb9a", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 2081, "chunk_index": 41, "_doc_id": "41_8854499679550882781"}}
{"doc_id": "42_7730902136426170036", "text": "/><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><!-- 根据一个变量的值动态传入 --><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>BlogPost<span><span> :<span><span>comment-ids<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>post.commentIds<span><span>\"<span><span> /><span><span><code><pre><div><h4 id=\"object\">Object <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#object\">​<a><h4><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><!-- 虽然这个对象字面量是个常量，我们还是需要使用 v-bind --><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/props.html", "title": "Props | Vue.js", "doc_id": "792ac0654a484b16963d45feb1eabb9a", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 2081, "chunk_index": 42, "_doc_id": "42_7730902136426170036"}}
{"doc_id": "43_5006927007237022382", "text": "hub-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><!-- 虽然这个对象字面量是个常量，我们还是需要使用 v-bind --><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><!-- 因为这是一个 JavaScript 表达式而不是一个字符串 --><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>BlogPost<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> :<span><span>author<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>{<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> name: <span><span>'Veronica'<span><span>,<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> company: <span><span>'Veridian Dynamics'<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/props.html", "title": "Props | Vue.js", "doc_id": "792ac0654a484b16963d45feb1eabb9a", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 2081, "chunk_index": 43, "_doc_id": "43_5006927007237022382"}}
{"doc_id": "44_1975460193188171906", "text": "><span>,<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> company: <span><span>'Veridian Dynamics'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\"<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> /><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><!-- 根据一个变量的值动态传入 --><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/props.html", "title": "Props | Vue.js", "doc_id": "792ac0654a484b16963d45feb1eabb9a", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 2081, "chunk_index": 44, "_doc_id": "44_1975460193188171906"}}
{"doc_id": "45_3806778936305592787", "text": "/><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><!-- 根据一个变量的值动态传入 --><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>BlogPost<span><span> :<span><span>author<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>post.author<span><span>\"<span><span> /><span><span><code><pre><div><h3 id=\"binding-multiple-properties-using-an-object\">使用一个对象绑定多个 prop <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#binding-multiple-properties-using-an-object\">​<a><h3><p>如果你想要将一个对象的所有属性都当作 props 传入，", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/props.html", "title": "Props | Vue.js", "doc_id": "792ac0654a484b16963d45feb1eabb9a", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 2081, "chunk_index": 45, "_doc_id": "45_3806778936305592787"}}
{"doc_id": "46_7241390891978472784", "text": "-anchor\" href=\"#binding-multiple-properties-using-an-object\">​<a><h3><p>如果你想要将一个对象的所有属性都当作 props 传入，你可以使用<a href=\"/guide/essentials/template-syntax.html#dynamically-binding-multiple-attributes\">没有参数的 <code>v-bind<code><a>，即只使用 <code>v-bind<code> 而非 <code>:prop-name<code>。例如，这里有一个 <code>post<code> 对象：<p><div class=\"options-api\"><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/props.html", "title": "Props | Vue.js", "doc_id": "792ac0654a484b16963d45feb1eabb9a", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 2081, "chunk_index": 46, "_doc_id": "46_7241390891978472784"}}
{"doc_id": "47_286776656105920245", "text": "b-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> data<span><span>() {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> return<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> post: {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> id: <span><span>1<span><span>,<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> title: <span><span>'My Journey with Vue'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/props.html", "title": "Props | Vue.js", "doc_id": "792ac0654a484b16963d45feb1eabb9a", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 2081, "chunk_index": 47, "_doc_id": "47_286776656105920245"}}
{"doc_id": "48_829726603984334557", "text": "th Vue'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span><code><pre><div><div><div class=\"composition-api\"><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> post<span><span> =<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> id: <span><span>1<span><span>,<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/props.html", "title": "Props | Vue.js", "doc_id": "792ac0654a484b16963d45feb1eabb9a", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 2081, "chunk_index": 48, "_doc_id": "48_829726603984334557"}}
{"doc_id": "49_7073306619629347990", "text": "n> =<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> id: <span><span>1<span><span>,<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> title: <span><span>'My Journey with Vue'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span><code><pre><div><div><p>以及下面的模板：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>BlogPost<span><span> v-bind<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>post<span><span>\"<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/props.html", "title": "Props | Vue.js", "doc_id": "792ac0654a484b16963d45feb1eabb9a", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 2081, "chunk_index": 49, "_doc_id": "49_7073306619629347990"}}
{"doc_id": "50_7842186109244603457", "text": "span>BlogPost<span><span> v-bind<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>post<span><span>\"<span><span> /><span><span><code><pre><div><p>而这实际上等价于：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>BlogPost<span><span> :<span><span>id<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>post.id<span><span>\"<span><span> :<span><span>title<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>post.", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/props.html", "title": "Props | Vue.js", "doc_id": "792ac0654a484b16963d45feb1eabb9a", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 2081, "chunk_index": 50, "_doc_id": "50_7842186109244603457"}}
{"doc_id": "51_240400299707707533", "text": "<span>post.id<span><span>\"<span><span> :<span><span>title<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>post.title<span><span>\"<span><span> /><span><span><code><pre><div><h2 id=\"one-way-data-flow\">单向数据流 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#one-way-data-flow\">​<a><h2><p>所有的 props 都遵循着<strong>单向绑定<strong>原则，props 因父组件的更新而变化，自然地将新的状态向下流往子组件，而不会逆向传递。这避免了子组件意外修改父组件的状态的情况，不然应用的数据流将很容易变得混乱而难以理解。<p><p>另外，每次父组件更新后，所有的子组件中的 props 都会被更新到最新值，这意味着你<strong>不应该<strong>在子组件中去更改一个 prop。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/props.html", "title": "Props | Vue.js", "doc_id": "792ac0654a484b16963d45feb1eabb9a", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 2081, "chunk_index": 51, "_doc_id": "51_240400299707707533"}}
{"doc_id": "52_4774912858492914181", "text": "数据流将很容易变得混乱而难以理解。<p><p>另外，每次父组件更新后，所有的子组件中的 props 都会被更新到最新值，这意味着你<strong>不应该<strong>在子组件中去更改一个 prop。若你这么做了，Vue 会在控制台上向你抛出警告：<p><div class=\"composition-api\"><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> props<span><span> =<span><span> defineProps<span><span>([<span><span>'foo'<span><span>])<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// ❌ 警告！prop 是只读的！<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/props.html", "title": "Props | Vue.js", "doc_id": "792ac0654a484b16963d45feb1eabb9a", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 2081, "chunk_index": 52, "_doc_id": "52_4774912858492914181"}}
{"doc_id": "53_3597413813655200266", "text": "an>])<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// ❌ 警告！prop 是只读的！<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>props.foo <span><span>=<span><span> 'bar'<span><span><code><pre><div><div><div class=\"options-api\"><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> props: [<span><span>'foo'<span><span>],<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/props.html", "title": "Props | Vue.js", "doc_id": "792ac0654a484b16963d45feb1eabb9a", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 2081, "chunk_index": 53, "_doc_id": "53_3597413813655200266"}}
{"doc_id": "54_6216908736416252476", "text": "><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> props: [<span><span>'foo'<span><span>],<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> created<span><span>() {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // ❌ 警告！prop 是只读的！<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> this<span><span>.foo <span><span>=<span><span> 'bar'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/props.html", "title": "Props | Vue.js", "doc_id": "792ac0654a484b16963d45feb1eabb9a", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 2081, "chunk_index": 54, "_doc_id": "54_6216908736416252476"}}
{"doc_id": "55_3223858941782546962", "text": "span><span>.foo <span><span>=<span><span> 'bar'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span><code><pre><div><div><p>导致你想要更改一个 prop 的需求通常来源于以下两种场景：<p><ol><li><p><strong>prop 被用于传入初始值；而子组件想在之后将其作为一个局部数据属性<strong>。在这种情况下，最好是新定义一个局部数据属性，从 props 上获取初始值即可：<p><div class=\"composition-api\"><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> props<span><span> =<span><span> defineProps<span><span>([<span><span>'initialCounter'<span><span>])<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/props.html", "title": "Props | Vue.js", "doc_id": "792ac0654a484b16963d45feb1eabb9a", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 2081, "chunk_index": 55, "_doc_id": "55_3223858941782546962"}}
{"doc_id": "56_7391863755429110718", "text": "span> =<span><span> defineProps<span><span>([<span><span>'initialCounter'<span><span>])<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 计数器只是将 props.initialCounter 作为初始值<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 像下面这样做就使 prop 和后续更新无关了<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/props.html", "title": "Props | Vue.js", "doc_id": "792ac0654a484b16963d45feb1eabb9a", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 2081, "chunk_index": 56, "_doc_id": "56_7391863755429110718"}}
{"doc_id": "57_4350034462246369213", "text": "ops.initialCounter 作为初始值<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 像下面这样做就使 prop 和后续更新无关了<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> counter<span><span> =<span><span> ref<span><span>(props.initialCounter)<span><span><code><pre><div><div><div class=\"options-api\"><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/props.html", "title": "Props | Vue.js", "doc_id": "792ac0654a484b16963d45feb1eabb9a", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 2081, "chunk_index": 57, "_doc_id": "57_4350034462246369213"}}
{"doc_id": "58_568165139559512735", "text": "b-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> props: [<span><span>'initialCounter'<span><span>],<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> data<span><span>() {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> return<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 计数器只是将 this.initialCounter 作为初始值<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 像下面这样做就使 prop 和后续更新无关了<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/props.html", "title": "Props | Vue.js", "doc_id": "792ac0654a484b16963d45feb1eabb9a", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 2081, "chunk_index": 58, "_doc_id": "58_568165139559512735"}}
{"doc_id": "59_1277601631029201050", "text": "is.initialCounter 作为初始值<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 像下面这样做就使 prop 和后续更新无关了<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> counter: <span><span>this<span><span>.initialCounter<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/props.html", "title": "Props | Vue.js", "doc_id": "792ac0654a484b16963d45feb1eabb9a", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 2081, "chunk_index": 59, "_doc_id": "59_1277601631029201050"}}
{"doc_id": "60_18187330090394074", "text": "Counter<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span><code><pre><div><div><li><li><p><strong>需要对传入的 prop 值做进一步的转换<strong>。在这种情况中，最好是基于该 prop 值定义一个计算属性：<p><div class=\"composition-api\"><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> props<span><span> =<span><span> defineProps<span><span>([<span><span>'size'<span><span>])<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/props.html", "title": "Props | Vue.js", "doc_id": "792ac0654a484b16963d45feb1eabb9a", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 2081, "chunk_index": 60, "_doc_id": "60_18187330090394074"}}
{"doc_id": "61_4445951951327496886", "text": "ops<span><span> =<span><span> defineProps<span><span>([<span><span>'size'<span><span>])<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 该 prop 变更时计算属性也会自动更新<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/props.html", "title": "Props | Vue.js", "doc_id": "792ac0654a484b16963d45feb1eabb9a", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 2081, "chunk_index": 61, "_doc_id": "61_4445951951327496886"}}
{"doc_id": "62_1825259539356337155", "text": "<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 该 prop 变更时计算属性也会自动更新<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> normalizedSize<span><span> =<span><span> computed<span><span>(() <span><span>=><span><span> props.size.<span><span>trim<span><span>().<span><span>toLowerCase<span><span>())<span><span><code><pre><div><div><div class=\"options-api\"><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/props.html", "title": "Props | Vue.js", "doc_id": "792ac0654a484b16963d45feb1eabb9a", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 2081, "chunk_index": 62, "_doc_id": "62_1825259539356337155"}}
{"doc_id": "63_1755962365448565878", "text": "b-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> props: [<span><span>'size'<span><span>],<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> computed: {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 该 prop 变更时计算属性也会自动更新<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> normalizedSize<span><span>() {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> return<span><span> this<span><span>.size.<span><span>trim<span><span>().<span><span>toLowerCase<span><span>()<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/props.html", "title": "Props | Vue.js", "doc_id": "792ac0654a484b16963d45feb1eabb9a", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 2081, "chunk_index": 63, "_doc_id": "63_1755962365448565878"}}
{"doc_id": "64_5980375204559569176", "text": "s<span><span>.size.<span><span>trim<span><span>().<span><span>toLowerCase<span><span>()<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span><code><pre><div><div><li><ol><h3 id=\"mutating-object-array-props\">更改对象 / 数组类型的 props <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#mutating-object-array-props\">​<a><h3><p>当对象或数组作为 props 被传入时，虽然子组件无法更改 props 绑定，但仍然<strong>可以<strong>更改对象或数组内部的值。这是因为 JavaScript 的对象和数组是按引用传递，对 Vue 来说，阻止这种更改需要付出的代价异常昂贵。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/props.html", "title": "Props | Vue.js", "doc_id": "792ac0654a484b16963d45feb1eabb9a", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 2081, "chunk_index": 64, "_doc_id": "64_5980375204559569176"}}
{"doc_id": "65_4605764562080582880", "text": "改 props 绑定，但仍然<strong>可以<strong>更改对象或数组内部的值。这是因为 JavaScript 的对象和数组是按引用传递，对 Vue 来说，阻止这种更改需要付出的代价异常昂贵。<p><p>这种更改的主要缺陷是它允许了子组件以某种不明显的方式影响父组件的状态，可能会使数据流在将来变得更难以理解。在最佳实践中，你应该尽可能避免这样的更改，除非父子组件在设计上本来就需要紧密耦合。在大多数场景下，子组件应该<a href=\"/guide/components/events.html\">抛出一个事件<a>来通知父组件做出改变。<p><h2 id=\"prop-validation\">Prop 校验 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#prop-validation\">​<a><h2><p>Vue 组件可以更细致地声明对传入的 props 的校验要求。比如我们上面已经看到过的类型声明，如果传入的值不满足类型要求，Vue 会在浏览器控制台中抛出警告来提醒使用者。这在开发给其他开发者使用的组件时非常有用。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/props.html", "title": "Props | Vue.js", "doc_id": "792ac0654a484b16963d45feb1eabb9a", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 2081, "chunk_index": 65, "_doc_id": "65_4605764562080582880"}}
{"doc_id": "66_870696117254813465", "text": "以更细致地声明对传入的 props 的校验要求。比如我们上面已经看到过的类型声明，如果传入的值不满足类型要求，Vue 会在浏览器控制台中抛出警告来提醒使用者。这在开发给其他开发者使用的组件时非常有用。<p><p>要声明对 props 的校验，你可以向 <span class=\"composition-api\"><code>defineProps()<code> 宏<span><span class=\"options-api\"><code>props<code> 选项<span>提供一个带有 props 校验选项的对象，例如：<p><div class=\"composition-api\"><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>defineProps<span><span>({<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 基础类型检查<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/props.html", "title": "Props | Vue.js", "doc_id": "792ac0654a484b16963d45feb1eabb9a", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 2081, "chunk_index": 66, "_doc_id": "66_870696117254813465"}}
{"doc_id": "67_1992983745966526303", "text": "=\"line\"><span>defineProps<span><span>({<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 基础类型检查<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // (给出 `null` 和 `undefined` 值则会跳过任何类型检查)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> propA: Number,<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 多种可能的类型<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> propB: [String, Number],<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 必传，且为 String 类型<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> propC: {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> type: String,<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/props.html", "title": "Props | Vue.js", "doc_id": "792ac0654a484b16963d45feb1eabb9a", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 2081, "chunk_index": 67, "_doc_id": "67_1992983745966526303"}}
{"doc_id": "68_7989532248443330754", "text": "<span class=\"line\"><span> propC: {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> type: String,<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> required: <span><span>true<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> },<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 必传但可为 null 的字符串<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> propD: {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> type: [String, <span><span>null<span><span>],<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> required: <span><span>true<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> },<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/props.html", "title": "Props | Vue.js", "doc_id": "792ac0654a484b16963d45feb1eabb9a", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 2081, "chunk_index": 68, "_doc_id": "68_7989532248443330754"}}
{"doc_id": "69_2539239570476485442", "text": "class=\"line\"><span> required: <span><span>true<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> },<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // Number 类型的默认值<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> propE: {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> type: Number,<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> default: <span><span>100<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> },<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 对象类型的默认值<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> propF: {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> type: Object,<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/props.html", "title": "Props | Vue.js", "doc_id": "792ac0654a484b16963d45feb1eabb9a", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 2081, "chunk_index": 69, "_doc_id": "69_2539239570476485442"}}
{"doc_id": "70_4765934980854582277", "text": "<span class=\"line\"><span> propF: {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> type: Object,<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 对象或数组的默认值<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 必须从一个工厂函数返回。<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 该函数接收组件所接收到的原始 prop 作为参数。<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> default<span><span>(<span><span>rawProps<span><span>) {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> return<span><span> { message: <span><span>'hello'<span><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/props.html", "title": "Props | Vue.js", "doc_id": "792ac0654a484b16963d45feb1eabb9a", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 2081, "chunk_index": 70, "_doc_id": "70_4765934980854582277"}}
{"doc_id": "71_8521054138371664234", "text": "n> { message: <span><span>'hello'<span><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> },<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 自定义类型校验函数<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 在 3.4+ 中完整的 props 作为第二个参数传入<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> propG: {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> validator<span><span>(<span><span>value<span><span>, <span><span>props<span><span>) {<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/props.html", "title": "Props | Vue.js", "doc_id": "792ac0654a484b16963d45feb1eabb9a", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 2081, "chunk_index": 71, "_doc_id": "71_8521054138371664234"}}
{"doc_id": "72_9140473634410212128", "text": "> validator<span><span>(<span><span>value<span><span>, <span><span>props<span><span>) {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // The value must match one of these strings<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> return<span><span> [<span><span>'success'<span><span>, <span><span>'warning'<span><span>, <span><span>'danger'<span><span>].<span><span>includes<span><span>(value)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> },<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/props.html", "title": "Props | Vue.js", "doc_id": "792ac0654a484b16963d45feb1eabb9a", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 2081, "chunk_index": 72, "_doc_id": "72_9140473634410212128"}}
{"doc_id": "73_3230279229704121596", "text": "value)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> },<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 函数类型的默认值<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> propH: {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> type: Function,<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 不像对象或数组的默认，这不是一个<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 工厂函数。这会是一个用来作为默认值的函数<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> default<span><span>() {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> return<span><span> 'Default function'<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/props.html", "title": "Props | Vue.js", "doc_id": "792ac0654a484b16963d45feb1eabb9a", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 2081, "chunk_index": 73, "_doc_id": "73_3230279229704121596"}}
{"doc_id": "74_4055975118569474863", "text": "><span>() {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> return<span><span> 'Default function'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/props.html", "title": "Props | Vue.js", "doc_id": "792ac0654a484b16963d45feb1eabb9a", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 2081, "chunk_index": 74, "_doc_id": "74_4055975118569474863"}}
{"doc_id": "75_7926562274288255371", "text": "nction'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>})<span><span><code><pre><div><div class=\"tip custom-block\"><p class=\"custom-block-title\">TIP<p><p><code>defineProps()<code> 宏中的参数<strong>不可以访问 <code><script setup><code> 中定义的其他变量<strong>，因为在编译时整个表达式都会被移到外部的函数中。<p><div><div><div class=\"options-api\"><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/props.html", "title": "Props | Vue.js", "doc_id": "792ac0654a484b16963d45feb1eabb9a", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 2081, "chunk_index": 75, "_doc_id": "75_7926562274288255371"}}
{"doc_id": "76_1258725036785490163", "text": "b-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> props: {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 基础类型检查<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // (给出 `null` 和 `undefined` 值则会跳过任何类型检查)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> propA: Number,<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 多种可能的类型<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> propB: [String, Number],<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 必传，且为 String 类型<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/props.html", "title": "Props | Vue.js", "doc_id": "792ac0654a484b16963d45feb1eabb9a", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 2081, "chunk_index": 76, "_doc_id": "76_1258725036785490163"}}
{"doc_id": "77_6555997529577072718", "text": "span> propB: [String, Number],<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 必传，且为 String 类型<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> propC: {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> type: String,<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> required: <span><span>true<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> },<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 必传但可为 null 的字符串<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> propD: {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> type: [String, <span><span>null<span><span>],<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/props.html", "title": "Props | Vue.js", "doc_id": "792ac0654a484b16963d45feb1eabb9a", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 2081, "chunk_index": 77, "_doc_id": "77_6555997529577072718"}}
{"doc_id": "78_5280788927469086483", "text": ": {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> type: [String, <span><span>null<span><span>],<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> required: <span><span>true<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> },<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // Number 类型的默认值<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> propE: {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> type: Number,<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> default: <span><span>100<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> },<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/props.html", "title": "Props | Vue.js", "doc_id": "792ac0654a484b16963d45feb1eabb9a", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 2081, "chunk_index": 78, "_doc_id": "78_5280788927469086483"}}
{"doc_id": "79_7453597373619727903", "text": "n class=\"line\"><span> default: <span><span>100<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> },<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 对象类型的默认值<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> propF: {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> type: Object,<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 对象或者数组应当用工厂函数返回。<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 工厂函数会收到组件所接收的原始 props<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 作为参数<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> default<span><span>(<span><span>rawProps<span><span>) {<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/props.html", "title": "Props | Vue.js", "doc_id": "792ac0654a484b16963d45feb1eabb9a", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 2081, "chunk_index": 79, "_doc_id": "79_7453597373619727903"}}
{"doc_id": "80_3924137475669948960", "text": "span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> default<span><span>(<span><span>rawProps<span><span>) {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> return<span><span> { message: <span><span>'hello'<span><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> },<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 自定义类型校验函数<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 在 3.4+ 中完整的 props 作为第二个参数传入<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> propG: {<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/props.html", "title": "Props | Vue.js", "doc_id": "792ac0654a484b16963d45feb1eabb9a", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 2081, "chunk_index": 80, "_doc_id": "80_3924137475669948960"}}
{"doc_id": "81_5833806378058301768", "text": "e\"><span> // 在 3.4+ 中完整的 props 作为第二个参数传入<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> propG: {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> validator<span><span>(<span><span>value<span><span>, <span><span>props<span><span>) {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // The value must match one of these strings<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> return<span><span> [<span><span>'success'<span><span>, <span><span>'warning'<span><span>, <span><span>'danger'<span><span>].<span><span>includes<span><span>(value)<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/props.html", "title": "Props | Vue.js", "doc_id": "792ac0654a484b16963d45feb1eabb9a", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 2081, "chunk_index": 81, "_doc_id": "81_5833806378058301768"}}
{"doc_id": "82_8413451661071107716", "text": "<span><span>, <span><span>'danger'<span><span>].<span><span>includes<span><span>(value)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> },<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 函数类型的默认值<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> propH: {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> type: Function,<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 不像对象或数组的默认，这不是一个<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 工厂函数。这会是一个用来作为默认值的函数<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/props.html", "title": "Props | Vue.js", "doc_id": "792ac0654a484b16963d45feb1eabb9a", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 2081, "chunk_index": 82, "_doc_id": "82_8413451661071107716"}}
{"doc_id": "83_9204418390972895934", "text": "span> // 不像对象或数组的默认，这不是一个<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 工厂函数。这会是一个用来作为默认值的函数<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> default<span><span>() {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> return<span><span> 'Default function'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span><code><pre><div><div><p>一些补充细节：<p><ul><li><p>所有 prop 默认都是可选的，除非声明了 <code>required: true<code>。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/props.html", "title": "Props | Vue.js", "doc_id": "792ac0654a484b16963d45feb1eabb9a", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 2081, "chunk_index": 83, "_doc_id": "83_9204418390972895934"}}
{"doc_id": "84_609627579659566045", "text": "<span><code><pre><div><div><p>一些补充细节：<p><ul><li><p>所有 prop 默认都是可选的，除非声明了 <code>required: true<code>。<p><li><li><p>除 <code>Boolean<code> 外的未传递的可选 prop 将会有一个默认值 <code>undefined<code>。<p><li><li><p><code>Boolean<code> 类型的未传递 prop 将被转换为 <code>false<code>。这可以通过为它设置 <code>default<code> 来更改——例如：设置为 <code>default: undefined<code> 将与非布尔类型的 prop 的行为保持一致。<p><li><li><p>如果声明了 <code>default<code> 值，那么在 prop 的值被解析为 <code>undefined<code> 时，无论 prop 是未被传递还是显式指明的 <code>undefined<code>，都会改为 <code>default<code> 值。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/props.html", "title": "Props | Vue.js", "doc_id": "792ac0654a484b16963d45feb1eabb9a", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 2081, "chunk_index": 84, "_doc_id": "84_609627579659566045"}}
{"doc_id": "85_3385435876546230539", "text": "值被解析为 <code>undefined<code> 时，无论 prop 是未被传递还是显式指明的 <code>undefined<code>，都会改为 <code>default<code> 值。<p><li><ul><p>当 prop 的校验失败后，Vue 会抛出一个控制台警告 (在开发模式下)。<p><div class=\"composition-api\"><p>如果使用了<a href=\"/api/sfc-script-setup.html#type-only-props-emit-declarations\">基于类型的 prop 声明<a> ，Vue 会尽最大努力在运行时按照 prop 的类型标注进行编译。举例来说，<code>defineProps<{ msg: string }><code> 会被编译为 <code>{ msg: { type: String, required: true }}<code>。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/props.html", "title": "Props | Vue.js", "doc_id": "792ac0654a484b16963d45feb1eabb9a", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 2081, "chunk_index": 85, "_doc_id": "85_3385435876546230539"}}
{"doc_id": "86_7520024200877605268", "text": "<code>defineProps<{ msg: string }><code> 会被编译为 <code>{ msg: { type: String, required: true }}<code>。<p><div><div class=\"options-api\"><div class=\"tip custom-block\"><p class=\"custom-block-title\">注意<p><p>注意 prop 的校验是在组件实例被创建<strong>之前<strong>，所以实例的属性 (比如 <code>data<code>、<code>computed<code> 等) 将在 <code>default<code> 或 <code>validator<code> 函数中不可用。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/props.html", "title": "Props | Vue.js", "doc_id": "792ac0654a484b16963d45feb1eabb9a", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 2081, "chunk_index": 86, "_doc_id": "86_7520024200877605268"}}
{"doc_id": "87_3208432022644435096", "text": "(比如 <code>data<code>、<code>computed<code> 等) 将在 <code>default<code> 或 <code>validator<code> 函数中不可用。<p><div><div><h3 id=\"runtime-type-checks\">运行时类型检查 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#runtime-type-checks\">​<a><h3><p>校验选项中的 <code>type<code> 可以是下列这些原生构造函数：<p><ul><li><code>String<code><li><li><code>Number<code><li><li><code>Boolean<code><li><li><code>Array<code><li><li><code>Object<code><li><li><code>Date<code><li><li><code>Function<code><li><li><code>Symbol<code><li><li><code>Error<code><li><ul><p>另外，<code>type<code> 也可以是自定义的类或构造函数，Vue 将会通过 <code>instanceof<code> 来检查类型是否匹配。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/props.html", "title": "Props | Vue.js", "doc_id": "792ac0654a484b16963d45feb1eabb9a", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 2081, "chunk_index": 87, "_doc_id": "87_3208432022644435096"}}
{"doc_id": "88_3547477452708246195", "text": ">Error<code><li><ul><p>另外，<code>type<code> 也可以是自定义的类或构造函数，Vue 将会通过 <code>instanceof<code> 来检查类型是否匹配。例如下面这个类：<p><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>class<span><span> Person<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> constructor<span><span>(<span><span>firstName<span><span>, <span><span>lastName<span><span>) {<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/props.html", "title": "Props | Vue.js", "doc_id": "792ac0654a484b16963d45feb1eabb9a", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 2081, "chunk_index": 88, "_doc_id": "88_3547477452708246195"}}
{"doc_id": "89_3013308831611300100", "text": "ctor<span><span>(<span><span>firstName<span><span>, <span><span>lastName<span><span>) {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> this<span><span>.firstName <span><span>=<span><span> firstName<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> this<span><span>.lastName <span><span>=<span><span> lastName<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/props.html", "title": "Props | Vue.js", "doc_id": "792ac0654a484b16963d45feb1eabb9a", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 2081, "chunk_index": 89, "_doc_id": "89_3013308831611300100"}}
{"doc_id": "90_6959519931107541151", "text": "an>.lastName <span><span>=<span><span> lastName<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span><code><pre><div><p>你可以将其作为一个 prop 的类型：<p><div class=\"composition-api\"><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>defineProps<span><span>({<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> author: Person<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/props.html", "title": "Props | Vue.js", "doc_id": "792ac0654a484b16963d45feb1eabb9a", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 2081, "chunk_index": 90, "_doc_id": "90_6959519931107541151"}}
{"doc_id": "91_1354775305855684364", "text": "e\"><span>defineProps<span><span>({<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> author: Person<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>})<span><span><code><pre><div><div><div class=\"options-api\"><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> props: {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> author: Person<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/props.html", "title": "Props | Vue.js", "doc_id": "792ac0654a484b16963d45feb1eabb9a", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 2081, "chunk_index": 91, "_doc_id": "91_1354775305855684364"}}
{"doc_id": "92_6451900920029013352", "text": "<span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> author: Person<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span><code><pre><div><div><p>Vue 会通过 <code>instanceof Person<code> 来校验 <code>author<code> prop 的值是否是 <code>Person<code> 类的一个实例。<p><h3 id=\"nullable-type\">可为 null 的类型 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#nullable-type\">​<a><h3><p>如果该类型是必传但可为 null 的，你可以用一个包含 <code>null<code> 的数组语法：<p><div class=\"composition-api\"><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>defineProps<span><span>({<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/props.html", "title": "Props | Vue.js", "doc_id": "792ac0654a484b16963d45feb1eabb9a", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 2081, "chunk_index": 92, "_doc_id": "92_6451900920029013352"}}
{"doc_id": "93_3947046202752426589", "text": "ss=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>defineProps<span><span>({<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> id: {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> type: [String, <span><span>null<span><span>],<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> required: <span><span>true<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/props.html", "title": "Props | Vue.js", "doc_id": "792ac0654a484b16963d45feb1eabb9a", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 2081, "chunk_index": 93, "_doc_id": "93_3947046202752426589"}}
{"doc_id": "94_1793160921394360438", "text": "class=\"line\"><span> required: <span><span>true<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>})<span><span><code><pre><div><div><div class=\"options-api\"><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> props: {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> id: {<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/props.html", "title": "Props | Vue.js", "doc_id": "792ac0654a484b16963d45feb1eabb9a", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 2081, "chunk_index": 94, "_doc_id": "94_1793160921394360438"}}
{"doc_id": "95_3263729180716651388", "text": "n><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> props: {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> id: {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> type: [String, <span><span>null<span><span>],<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> required: <span><span>true<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span><code><pre><div><div><p>注意如果 <code>type<code> 仅为 <code>null<code> 而非使用数组语法，它将允许任何类型。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/props.html", "title": "Props | Vue.js", "doc_id": "792ac0654a484b16963d45feb1eabb9a", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 2081, "chunk_index": 95, "_doc_id": "95_3263729180716651388"}}
{"doc_id": "96_9175642146163628682", "text": "an>}<span><span><code><pre><div><div><p>注意如果 <code>type<code> 仅为 <code>null<code> 而非使用数组语法，它将允许任何类型。<p><h2 id=\"boolean-casting\">Boolean 类型转换 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#boolean-casting\">​<a><h2><p>为了更贴近原生 boolean attributes 的行为，声明为 <code>Boolean<code> 类型的 props 有特别的类型转换规则。以带有如下声明的 <code><MyComponent><code> 组件为例：<p><div class=\"composition-api\"><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>defineProps<span><span>({<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/props.html", "title": "Props | Vue.js", "doc_id": "792ac0654a484b16963d45feb1eabb9a", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 2081, "chunk_index": 96, "_doc_id": "96_9175642146163628682"}}
{"doc_id": "97_5883624662489543703", "text": "ss=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>defineProps<span><span>({<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> disabled: Boolean<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>})<span><span><code><pre><div><div><div class=\"options-api\"><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> props: {<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/props.html", "title": "Props | Vue.js", "doc_id": "792ac0654a484b16963d45feb1eabb9a", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 2081, "chunk_index": 97, "_doc_id": "97_5883624662489543703"}}
{"doc_id": "98_5588663588887450259", "text": "export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> props: {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> disabled: Boolean<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span><code><pre><div><div><p>该组件可以被这样使用：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><!-- 等同于传入 :disabled=\"true\" --><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/props.html", "title": "Props | Vue.js", "doc_id": "792ac0654a484b16963d45feb1eabb9a", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 2081, "chunk_index": 98, "_doc_id": "98_5588663588887450259"}}
{"doc_id": "99_1271811863950605138", "text": "iki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><!-- 等同于传入 :disabled=\"true\" --><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>MyComponent<span><span> disabled<span><span> /><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><!-- 等同于传入 :disabled=\"false\" --><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/props.html", "title": "Props | Vue.js", "doc_id": "792ac0654a484b16963d45feb1eabb9a", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 2081, "chunk_index": 99, "_doc_id": "99_1271811863950605138"}}
{"doc_id": "100_6841778020582537389", "text": "an>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><!-- 等同于传入 :disabled=\"false\" --><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>MyComponent<span><span> /><span><span><code><pre><div><p>当一个 prop 被声明为允许多种类型时，<code>Boolean<code> 的转换规则也将被应用。然而，当同时允许 <code>String<code> 和 <code>Boolean<code> 时，有一种边缘情况——只有当 <code>Boolean<code> 出现在 <code>String<code> 之前时，<code>Boolean<code> 转换规则才适用：<p><div class=\"composition-api\"><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// disabled 将被转换为 true<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/props.html", "title": "Props | Vue.js", "doc_id": "792ac0654a484b16963d45feb1eabb9a", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 2081, "chunk_index": 100, "_doc_id": "100_6841778020582537389"}}
{"doc_id": "101_1332454273963993026", "text": "class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// disabled 将被转换为 true<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>defineProps<span><span>({<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> disabled: [Boolean, Number]<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>})<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// disabled 将被转换为 true<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>defineProps<span><span>({<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> disabled: [Boolean, String]<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/props.html", "title": "Props | Vue.js", "doc_id": "792ac0654a484b16963d45feb1eabb9a", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 2081, "chunk_index": 101, "_doc_id": "101_1332454273963993026"}}
{"doc_id": "102_673532601203583819", "text": "neProps<span><span>({<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> disabled: [Boolean, String]<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>})<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// disabled 将被转换为 true<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>defineProps<span><span>({<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> disabled: [Number, Boolean]<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>})<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// disabled 将被解析为空字符串 (disabled=\"\")<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/props.html", "title": "Props | Vue.js", "doc_id": "792ac0654a484b16963d45feb1eabb9a", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 2081, "chunk_index": 102, "_doc_id": "102_673532601203583819"}}
