{"doc_id": "104_5173569795872596206", "text": "class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// disabled 将被转换为 true<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> props: {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> disabled: [Boolean, Number]<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// disabled 将被转换为 true<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/props.html", "title": "Props | Vue.js", "doc_id": "792ac0654a484b16963d45feb1eabb9a", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 2081, "chunk_index": 104, "_doc_id": "104_5173569795872596206"}}
{"doc_id": "105_6497465279505256804", "text": "}<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// disabled 将被转换为 true<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> props: {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> disabled: [Boolean, String]<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// disabled 将被转换为 true<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/props.html", "title": "Props | Vue.js", "doc_id": "792ac0654a484b16963d45feb1eabb9a", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 2081, "chunk_index": 105, "_doc_id": "105_6497465279505256804"}}
{"doc_id": "106_4270645465759558697", "text": "}<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// disabled 将被转换为 true<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> props: {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> disabled: [Number, Boolean]<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// disabled 将被解析为空字符串 (disabled=\"\")<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/props.html", "title": "Props | Vue.js", "doc_id": "792ac0654a484b16963d45feb1eabb9a", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 2081, "chunk_index": 106, "_doc_id": "106_4270645465759558697"}}
{"doc_id": "107_7771597026923751434", "text": "<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// disabled 将被解析为空字符串 (disabled=\"\")<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> props: {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> disabled: [String, Boolean]<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span><code><pre><div><div><div><div>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/props.html", "title": "Props | Vue.js", "doc_id": "792ac0654a484b16963d45feb1eabb9a", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 2081, "chunk_index": 107, "_doc_id": "107_7771597026923751434"}}
{"doc_id": "0_7947830250089872336", "text": "<div><div><h1 id=\"component-events\">组件事件 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#component-events\">​<a><h1><blockquote><p>此章节假设你已经看过了<a href=\"/guide/essentials/component-basics.html\">组件基础<a>。若你还不了解组件是什么，请先阅读该章节。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/events.html", "title": "组件事件", "doc_id": "987360e5dc5b4272aa1d49749a303410", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 701, "chunk_index": 0, "_doc_id": "0_7947830250089872336"}}
{"doc_id": "1_1925715789069984435", "text": "ckquote><p>此章节假设你已经看过了<a href=\"/guide/essentials/component-basics.html\">组件基础<a>。若你还不了解组件是什么，请先阅读该章节。<p><blockquote><h2 id=\"emitting-and-listening-to-events\">触发与监听事件 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#emitting-and-listening-to-events\">​<a><h2><p>在组件的模板表达式中，可以直接使用 <code>$emit<code> 方法触发自定义事件 (例如：在 <code>v-on<code> 的处理函数中)：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><!-- MyComponent --><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/events.html", "title": "组件事件", "doc_id": "987360e5dc5b4272aa1d49749a303410", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 701, "chunk_index": 1, "_doc_id": "1_1925715789069984435"}}
{"doc_id": "2_4863483707954186379", "text": "e class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><!-- MyComponent --><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>button<span><span> @<span><span>click<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>$emit<span><span>(<span><span>'someEvent'<span><span>)<span><span>\"<span><span>>Click Me</<span><span>button<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><div class=\"options-api\"><p><code>$emit()<code> 方法在组件实例上也同样以 <code>this.", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/events.html", "title": "组件事件", "doc_id": "987360e5dc5b4272aa1d49749a303410", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 701, "chunk_index": 2, "_doc_id": "2_4863483707954186379"}}
{"doc_id": "3_5415907077960514517", "text": "<span><span><code><pre><div><div class=\"options-api\"><p><code>$emit()<code> 方法在组件实例上也同样以 <code>this.$emit()<code> 的形式可用：<p><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> methods: {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> submit<span><span>() {<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/events.html", "title": "组件事件", "doc_id": "987360e5dc5b4272aa1d49749a303410", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 701, "chunk_index": 3, "_doc_id": "3_5415907077960514517"}}
{"doc_id": "4_7622821171873088149", "text": "s=\"line\"><span> methods: {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> submit<span><span>() {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> this<span><span>.<span><span>$emit<span><span>(<span><span>'someEvent'<span><span>)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/events.html", "title": "组件事件", "doc_id": "987360e5dc5b4272aa1d49749a303410", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 701, "chunk_index": 4, "_doc_id": "4_7622821171873088149"}}
{"doc_id": "5_145154535991486513", "text": "<span>)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span><code><pre><div><div><p>父组件可以通过 <code>v-on<code> (缩写为 <code>@<code>) 来监听事件：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>MyComponent<span><span> @<span><span>some-event<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>callback<span><span>\"<span><span> /><span><span><code><pre><div><p>同样，", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/events.html", "title": "组件事件", "doc_id": "987360e5dc5b4272aa1d49749a303410", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 701, "chunk_index": 5, "_doc_id": "5_145154535991486513"}}
{"doc_id": "6_7978789133694273960", "text": "pan>=<span><span>\"<span><span>callback<span><span>\"<span><span> /><span><span><code><pre><div><p>同样，组件的事件监听器也支持 <code>.once<code> 修饰符：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>MyComponent<span><span> @<span><span>some-event<span><span>.<span><span>once<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>callback<span><span>\"<span><span> /><span><span><code><pre><div><p>像组件与 prop 一样，事件的名字也提供了自动的格式转换。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/events.html", "title": "组件事件", "doc_id": "987360e5dc5b4272aa1d49749a303410", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 701, "chunk_index": 6, "_doc_id": "6_7978789133694273960"}}
{"doc_id": "7_8253050367132744660", "text": "an>callback<span><span>\"<span><span> /><span><span><code><pre><div><p>像组件与 prop 一样，事件的名字也提供了自动的格式转换。注意这里我们触发了一个以 camelCase 形式命名的事件，但在父组件中可以使用 kebab-case 形式来监听。与 <a href=\"/guide/components/props.html#prop-name-casing\">prop 大小写格式<a>一样，在模板中我们也推荐使用 kebab-case 形式来编写监听器。<p><div class=\"tip custom-block\"><p class=\"custom-block-title\">TIP<p><p>和原生 DOM 事件不一样，组件触发的事件<strong>没有冒泡机制<strong>。你只能监听直接子组件触发的事件。平级组件或是跨越多层嵌套的组件间通信，应使用一个外部的事件总线，或是使用一个<a href=\"/guide/scaling-up/state-management.html\">全局状态管理方案<a>。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/events.html", "title": "组件事件", "doc_id": "987360e5dc5b4272aa1d49749a303410", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 701, "chunk_index": 7, "_doc_id": "7_8253050367132744660"}}
{"doc_id": "8_7373248019745001912", "text": "平级组件或是跨越多层嵌套的组件间通信，应使用一个外部的事件总线，或是使用一个<a href=\"/guide/scaling-up/state-management.html\">全局状态管理方案<a>。<p><div><h2 id=\"event-arguments\">事件参数 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#event-arguments\">​<a><h2><p>有时候我们会需要在触发事件时附带一个特定的值。举例来说，我们想要 <code><BlogPost><code> 组件来管理文本会缩放得多大。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/events.html", "title": "组件事件", "doc_id": "987360e5dc5b4272aa1d49749a303410", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 701, "chunk_index": 8, "_doc_id": "8_7373248019745001912"}}
{"doc_id": "9_12775550530783540", "text": "\"#event-arguments\">​<a><h2><p>有时候我们会需要在触发事件时附带一个特定的值。举例来说，我们想要 <code><BlogPost><code> 组件来管理文本会缩放得多大。在这个场景下，我们可以给 <code>$emit<code> 提供一个额外的参数：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>button<span><span> @<span><span>click<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>$emit<span><span>(<span><span>'increaseBy'<span><span>, <span><span>1<span><span>)<span><span>\"<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/events.html", "title": "组件事件", "doc_id": "987360e5dc5b4272aa1d49749a303410", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 701, "chunk_index": 9, "_doc_id": "9_12775550530783540"}}
{"doc_id": "10_2227048413351762146", "text": "an><span>'increaseBy'<span><span>, <span><span>1<span><span>)<span><span>\"<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> Increase by 1<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>button<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>然后我们在父组件中监听事件，我们可以先简单写一个内联的箭头函数作为监听器，", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/events.html", "title": "组件事件", "doc_id": "987360e5dc5b4272aa1d49749a303410", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 701, "chunk_index": 10, "_doc_id": "10_2227048413351762146"}}
{"doc_id": "11_5357161121192202842", "text": "/<span><span>button<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>然后我们在父组件中监听事件，我们可以先简单写一个内联的箭头函数作为监听器，此函数会接收到事件附带的参数：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>MyButton<span><span> @<span><span>increase-by<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>(<span><span>n<span><span>) <span><span>=><span><span> count <span><span>+=<span><span> n<span><span>\"<span><span> /><span><span><code><pre><div><p>或者，", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/events.html", "title": "组件事件", "doc_id": "987360e5dc5b4272aa1d49749a303410", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 701, "chunk_index": 11, "_doc_id": "11_5357161121192202842"}}
{"doc_id": "12_5537785689500618589", "text": "an> count <span><span>+=<span><span> n<span><span>\"<span><span> /><span><span><code><pre><div><p>或者，也可以用一个组件方法来作为事件处理函数：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>MyButton<span><span> @<span><span>increase-by<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>increaseCount<span><span>\"<span><span> /><span><span><code><pre><div><p>该方法也会接收到事件所传递的参数：<p><div class=\"options-api\"><div class=\"language-js\"> <span", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/events.html", "title": "组件事件", "doc_id": "987360e5dc5b4272aa1d49749a303410", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 701, "chunk_index": 12, "_doc_id": "12_5537785689500618589"}}
{"doc_id": "13_4648013114658377461", "text": "pan><code><pre><div><p>该方法也会接收到事件所传递的参数：<p><div class=\"options-api\"><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>methods<span><span>: {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> increaseCount<span><span>(n) {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> this<span><span>.count <span><span>+=<span><span> n<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/events.html", "title": "组件事件", "doc_id": "987360e5dc5b4272aa1d49749a303410", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 701, "chunk_index": 13, "_doc_id": "13_4648013114658377461"}}
{"doc_id": "14_1220008093612350568", "text": "<span><span>.count <span><span>+=<span><span> n<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span><code><pre><div><div><div class=\"composition-api\"><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>function<span><span> increaseCount<span><span>(<span><span>n<span><span>) {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> count.value <span><span>+=<span><span> n<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/events.html", "title": "组件事件", "doc_id": "987360e5dc5b4272aa1d49749a303410", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 701, "chunk_index": 14, "_doc_id": "14_1220008093612350568"}}
{"doc_id": "15_2052206382301511491", "text": "span>) {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> count.value <span><span>+=<span><span> n<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span><code><pre><div><div><div class=\"tip custom-block\"><p class=\"custom-block-title\">TIP<p><p>所有传入 <code>$emit()<code> 的额外参数都会被直接传向监听器。举例来说，<code>$emit('foo', 1, 2, 3)<code> 触发后，监听器函数将会收到这三个参数值。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/events.html", "title": "组件事件", "doc_id": "987360e5dc5b4272aa1d49749a303410", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 701, "chunk_index": 15, "_doc_id": "15_2052206382301511491"}}
{"doc_id": "16_1609338186950525833", "text": "所有传入 <code>$emit()<code> 的额外参数都会被直接传向监听器。举例来说，<code>$emit('foo', 1, 2, 3)<code> 触发后，监听器函数将会收到这三个参数值。<p><div><h2 id=\"declaring-emitted-events\">声明触发的事件 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#declaring-emitted-events\">​<a><h2><p>组件可以显式地通过 <span class=\"composition-api\"><a href=\"/api/sfc-script-setup.html#defineprops-defineemits\"><code>defineEmits()<code><a> 宏<span><span class=\"options-api\"><a href=\"/api/options-state.", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/events.html", "title": "组件事件", "doc_id": "987360e5dc5b4272aa1d49749a303410", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 701, "chunk_index": 16, "_doc_id": "16_1609338186950525833"}}
{"doc_id": "17_4545276332320757040", "text": "ineemits\"><code>defineEmits()<code><a> 宏<span><span class=\"options-api\"><a href=\"/api/options-state.html#emits\"><code>emits<code><a> 选项<span>来声明它要触发的事件：<p><div class=\"composition-api\"><div class=\"language-vue\"> <span class=\"lang\">vue<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>script<span><span> setup<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>defineEmits<span><span>([<span><span>'inFocus'<span><span>, <span><span>'submit'<span><span>])<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/events.html", "title": "组件事件", "doc_id": "987360e5dc5b4272aa1d49749a303410", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 701, "chunk_index": 17, "_doc_id": "17_4545276332320757040"}}
{"doc_id": "18_2214634513545731065", "text": "mits<span><span>([<span><span>'inFocus'<span><span>, <span><span>'submit'<span><span>])<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>script<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>我们在 <code><template><code> 中使用的 <code>$emit<code> 方法不能在组件的 <code><script setup><code> 部分中使用，但 <code>defineEmits()<code> 会返回一个相同作用的函数供我们使用：<p><div class=\"language-vue\"> <span class=\"lang\">vue<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>script<span><span> setup<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/events.html", "title": "组件事件", "doc_id": "987360e5dc5b4272aa1d49749a303410", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 701, "chunk_index": 18, "_doc_id": "18_2214634513545731065"}}
{"doc_id": "19_6001830829379809830", "text": "code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>script<span><span> setup<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> emit<span><span> =<span><span> defineEmits<span><span>([<span><span>'inFocus'<span><span>, <span><span>'submit'<span><span>])<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>function<span><span> buttonClick<span><span>() {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> emit<span><span>(<span><span>'submit'<span><span>)<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/events.html", "title": "组件事件", "doc_id": "987360e5dc5b4272aa1d49749a303410", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 701, "chunk_index": 19, "_doc_id": "19_6001830829379809830"}}
{"doc_id": "20_875866210064375680", "text": "pan><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> emit<span><span>(<span><span>'submit'<span><span>)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>script<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p><code>defineEmits()<code> 宏<strong>不能<strong>在子函数中使用。如上所示，它必须直接放置在 <code><script setup><code> 的顶级作用域下。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/events.html", "title": "组件事件", "doc_id": "987360e5dc5b4272aa1d49749a303410", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 701, "chunk_index": 20, "_doc_id": "20_875866210064375680"}}
{"doc_id": "21_734417910248621867", "text": "ode>defineEmits()<code> 宏<strong>不能<strong>在子函数中使用。如上所示，它必须直接放置在 <code><script setup><code> 的顶级作用域下。<p><p>如果你显式地使用了 <code>setup<code> 函数而不是 <code><script setup><code>，则事件需要通过 <a href=\"/api/options-state.html#emits\"><code>emits<code><a> 选项来定义，<code>emit<code> 函数也被暴露在 <code>setup()<code> 的上下文对象上：<p><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/events.html", "title": "组件事件", "doc_id": "987360e5dc5b4272aa1d49749a303410", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 701, "chunk_index": 21, "_doc_id": "21_734417910248621867"}}
{"doc_id": "22_6950238574499859797", "text": "b-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> emits: [<span><span>'inFocus'<span><span>, <span><span>'submit'<span><span>],<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> setup<span><span>(<span><span>props<span><span>, <span><span>ctx<span><span>) {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> ctx.<span><span>emit<span><span>(<span><span>'submit'<span><span>)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/events.html", "title": "组件事件", "doc_id": "987360e5dc5b4272aa1d49749a303410", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 701, "chunk_index": 22, "_doc_id": "22_6950238574499859797"}}
{"doc_id": "23_8402321463437163834", "text": "t<span><span>(<span><span>'submit'<span><span>)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span><code><pre><div><p>与 <code>setup()<code> 上下文对象中的其他属性一样，<code>emit<code> 可以安全地被解构：<p><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/events.html", "title": "组件事件", "doc_id": "987360e5dc5b4272aa1d49749a303410", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 701, "chunk_index": 23, "_doc_id": "23_8402321463437163834"}}
