{"doc_id": "26_3547581837318075936", "text": "ne\"><span> emits: [<span><span>'inFocus'<span><span>, <span><span>'submit'<span><span>]<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span><code><pre><div><div><p>这个 <code>emits<code> 选项和 <code>defineEmits()<code> 宏还支持对象语法。通过 TypeScript 为参数指定类型，它允许我们对触发事件的参数进行验证：<p><div class=\"composition-api\"><div class=\"language-vue\"> <span class=\"lang\">vue<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>script<span><span> setup<span><span> lang<span><span>=<span><span>\"ts\"<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/events.html", "title": "组件事件", "doc_id": "987360e5dc5b4272aa1d49749a303410", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 701, "chunk_index": 26, "_doc_id": "26_3547581837318075936"}}
{"doc_id": "27_2172347180685892412", "text": "pan>script<span><span> setup<span><span> lang<span><span>=<span><span>\"ts\"<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> emit<span><span> =<span><span> defineEmits<span><span>({<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> submit<span><span>(<span><span>payload<span><span>:<span><span> { <span><span>email<span><span>:<span><span> string<span><span>, <span><span>password<span><span>:<span><span> string<span><span> }) {<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/events.html", "title": "组件事件", "doc_id": "987360e5dc5b4272aa1d49749a303410", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 701, "chunk_index": 27, "_doc_id": "27_2172347180685892412"}}
{"doc_id": "28_8388432751134898997", "text": "ring<span><span>, <span><span>password<span><span>:<span><span> string<span><span> }) {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 通过返回值为 `true` 还是为 `false` 来判断<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 验证是否通过<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>})<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/events.html", "title": "组件事件", "doc_id": "987360e5dc5b4272aa1d49749a303410", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 701, "chunk_index": 28, "_doc_id": "28_8388432751134898997"}}
{"doc_id": "29_8064531861643924510", "text": "验证是否通过<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>})<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>script<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>如果你正在搭配 TypeScript 使用 <code><script setup><code>，也可以使用纯类型标注来声明触发的事件：<p><div class=\"language-vue\"> <span class=\"lang\">vue<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>script<span><span> setup<span><span> lang<span><span>=<span><span>\"ts\"<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/events.html", "title": "组件事件", "doc_id": "987360e5dc5b4272aa1d49749a303410", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 701, "chunk_index": 29, "_doc_id": "29_8064531861643924510"}}
{"doc_id": "30_281181796724375801", "text": "pan>script<span><span> setup<span><span> lang<span><span>=<span><span>\"ts\"<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> emit<span><span> =<span><span> defineEmits<span><span><{<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> (<span><span>e<span><span>:<span><span> 'change'<span><span>, <span><span>id<span><span>:<span><span> number<span><span>)<span><span>:<span><span> void<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/events.html", "title": "组件事件", "doc_id": "987360e5dc5b4272aa1d49749a303410", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 701, "chunk_index": 30, "_doc_id": "30_281181796724375801"}}
{"doc_id": "31_487354661756935893", "text": "pan><span>id<span><span>:<span><span> number<span><span>)<span><span>:<span><span> void<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> (<span><span>e<span><span>:<span><span> 'update'<span><span>, <span><span>value<span><span>:<span><span> string<span><span>)<span><span>:<span><span> void<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}>()<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/events.html", "title": "组件事件", "doc_id": "987360e5dc5b4272aa1d49749a303410", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 701, "chunk_index": 31, "_doc_id": "31_487354661756935893"}}
{"doc_id": "32_1675047424101397011", "text": "ng<span><span>)<span><span>:<span><span> void<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}>()<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>script<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>TypeScript 用户请参考：<a href=\"/guide/typescript/composition-api.html#typing-component-emits\">如何为组件所抛出事件标注类型<a> <p><div><div class=\"options-api\"><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/events.html", "title": "组件事件", "doc_id": "987360e5dc5b4272aa1d49749a303410", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 701, "chunk_index": 32, "_doc_id": "32_1675047424101397011"}}
{"doc_id": "33_8980210595037744559", "text": "b-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> emits: {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> submit<span><span>(<span><span>payload<span><span>:<span><span> { <span><span>email<span><span>:<span><span> string<span><span>, <span><span>password<span><span>:<span><span> string<span><span> }) {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 通过返回值为 `true` 还是为 `false` 来判断<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 验证是否通过<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/events.html", "title": "组件事件", "doc_id": "987360e5dc5b4272aa1d49749a303410", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 701, "chunk_index": 33, "_doc_id": "33_8980210595037744559"}}
{"doc_id": "34_3879180586265776235", "text": "<span> // 通过返回值为 `true` 还是为 `false` 来判断<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 验证是否通过<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span><code><pre><div><p>TypeScript 用户请参考：<a href=\"/guide/typescript/options-api.html#typing-component-emits\">如何为组件所抛出的事件标注类型<a>。 <p><div><p>尽管事件声明是可选的，我们还是推荐你完整地声明所有要触发的事件，以此在代码中作为文档记录组件的用法。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/events.html", "title": "组件事件", "doc_id": "987360e5dc5b4272aa1d49749a303410", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 701, "chunk_index": 34, "_doc_id": "34_3879180586265776235"}}
{"doc_id": "35_1996700548555534793", "text": "g-component-emits\">如何为组件所抛出的事件标注类型<a>。 <p><div><p>尽管事件声明是可选的，我们还是推荐你完整地声明所有要触发的事件，以此在代码中作为文档记录组件的用法。同时，事件声明能让 Vue 更好地将事件和<a href=\"/guide/components/attrs.html#v-on-listener-inheritance\">透传 attribute<a> 作出区分，从而避免一些由第三方代码触发的自定义 DOM 事件所导致的边界情况。<p><div class=\"tip custom-block\"><p class=\"custom-block-title\">TIP<p><p>如果一个原生事件的名字 (例如 <code>click<code>) 被定义在 <code>emits<code> 选项中，则监听器只会监听组件触发的 <code>click<code> 事件而不会再响应原生的 <code>click<code> 事件。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/events.html", "title": "组件事件", "doc_id": "987360e5dc5b4272aa1d49749a303410", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 701, "chunk_index": 35, "_doc_id": "35_1996700548555534793"}}
{"doc_id": "36_1863216110543544776", "text": "<code>) 被定义在 <code>emits<code> 选项中，则监听器只会监听组件触发的 <code>click<code> 事件而不会再响应原生的 <code>click<code> 事件。<p><div><h2 id=\"events-validation\">事件校验 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#events-validation\">​<a><h2><p>和对 props 添加类型校验的方式类似，所有触发的事件也可以使用对象形式来描述。<p><p>要为事件添加校验，那么事件可以被赋值为一个函数，接受的参数就是抛出事件时传入 <span class=\"options-api\"><code>this.$emit<code><span><span class=\"composition-api\"><code>emit<code><span> 的内容，返回一个布尔值来表明事件是否合法。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/events.html", "title": "组件事件", "doc_id": "987360e5dc5b4272aa1d49749a303410", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 701, "chunk_index": 36, "_doc_id": "36_1863216110543544776"}}
{"doc_id": "37_847069264854407687", "text": "ode>this.$emit<code><span><span class=\"composition-api\"><code>emit<code><span> 的内容，返回一个布尔值来表明事件是否合法。<p><div class=\"composition-api\"><div class=\"language-vue\"> <span class=\"lang\">vue<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>script<span><span> setup<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> emit<span><span> =<span><span> defineEmits<span><span>({<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 没有校验<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/events.html", "title": "组件事件", "doc_id": "987360e5dc5b4272aa1d49749a303410", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 701, "chunk_index": 37, "_doc_id": "37_847069264854407687"}}
{"doc_id": "38_5030646408278340754", "text": "> =<span><span> defineEmits<span><span>({<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 没有校验<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> click: <span><span>null<span><span>,<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> // 校验 submit 事件<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> submit<span><span>: ({ <span><span>email<span><span>, <span><span>password<span><span> }) <span><span>=><span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> if<span><span> (email <span><span>&&<span><span> password) {<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/events.html", "title": "组件事件", "doc_id": "987360e5dc5b4272aa1d49749a303410", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 701, "chunk_index": 38, "_doc_id": "38_5030646408278340754"}}
{"doc_id": "39_6068873729474119671", "text": "<span class=\"line\"><span> if<span><span> (email <span><span>&&<span><span> password) {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> return<span><span> true<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> } <span><span>else<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> console.<span><span>warn<span><span>(<span><span>'Invalid submit event payload!'<span><span>)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> return<span><span> false<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/events.html", "title": "组件事件", "doc_id": "987360e5dc5b4272aa1d49749a303410", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 701, "chunk_index": 39, "_doc_id": "39_6068873729474119671"}}
