{"doc_id": "0_1352099706014861195", "text": "<div><div><h1 id=\"component-v-model\">组件 v-model <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#component-v-model\">​<a><h1><h2 id=\"basic-usage\">基本用法 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#basic-usage\">​<a><h2><p><code>v-model<code> 可以在组件上使用以实现双向绑定。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/v-model.html", "title": "组件 v-model", "doc_id": "749d024c41bc4d7281978acfb8b13e02", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1636, "chunk_index": 0, "_doc_id": "0_1352099706014861195"}}
{"doc_id": "1_4819123825709055420", "text": "e\">基本用法 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#basic-usage\">​<a><h2><p><code>v-model<code> 可以在组件上使用以实现双向绑定。<p><div class=\"composition-api\"><p>从 Vue 3.4 开始，推荐的实现方式是使用 <a href=\"/api/sfc-script-setup.html#definemodel\"><code>defineModel()<code><a> 宏：<p><div class=\"vp-code-block-title\"><p class=\"vp-code-block-title-bar\"><span class=\"vp-code-block-title-text\">Child.vue<span><p><div class=\"language-vue\"> <span class=\"lang\">vue<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>script<span><span> setup<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/v-model.html", "title": "组件 v-model", "doc_id": "749d024c41bc4d7281978acfb8b13e02", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1636, "chunk_index": 1, "_doc_id": "1_4819123825709055420"}}
{"doc_id": "2_2221151063159768940", "text": "code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>script<span><span> setup<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> model<span><span> =<span><span> defineModel<span><span>()<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>function<span><span> update<span><span>() {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> model.value<span><span>++<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>script<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/v-model.html", "title": "组件 v-model", "doc_id": "749d024c41bc4d7281978acfb8b13e02", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1636, "chunk_index": 2, "_doc_id": "2_2221151063159768940"}}
{"doc_id": "3_1360674593581183281", "text": "s=\"line\"><span>}<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>script<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>div<span><span>>Parent bound v-model is: {{ model }}</<span><span>div<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>button<span><span> @click<span><span>=<span><span>\"update\"<span><span>>Increment</<span><span>button<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/v-model.html", "title": "组件 v-model", "doc_id": "749d024c41bc4d7281978acfb8b13e02", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1636, "chunk_index": 3, "_doc_id": "3_1360674593581183281"}}
{"doc_id": "4_3590759431245873090", "text": "span><span>=<span><span>\"update\"<span><span>>Increment</<span><span>button<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><div><p>父组件可以用 <code>v-model<code> 绑定一个值：<p><div class=\"vp-code-block-title\"><p class=\"vp-code-block-title-bar\"><span class=\"vp-code-block-title-text\">Parent.", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/v-model.html", "title": "组件 v-model", "doc_id": "749d024c41bc4d7281978acfb8b13e02", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1636, "chunk_index": 4, "_doc_id": "4_3590759431245873090"}}
{"doc_id": "5_7178892660057327850", "text": "-code-block-title\"><p class=\"vp-code-block-title-bar\"><span class=\"vp-code-block-title-text\">Parent.vue<span><p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>Child<span><span> v-model<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>countModel<span><span>\"<span><span> /><span><span><code><pre><div><div><p><code>defineModel()<code> 返回的值是一个 ref。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/v-model.html", "title": "组件 v-model", "doc_id": "749d024c41bc4d7281978acfb8b13e02", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1636, "chunk_index": 5, "_doc_id": "5_7178892660057327850"}}
{"doc_id": "6_5726210507438907241", "text": "pan><span>\"<span><span> /><span><span><code><pre><div><div><p><code>defineModel()<code> 返回的值是一个 ref。它可以像其他 ref 一样被访问以及修改，不过它能起到在父组件和当前变量之间的双向绑定的作用：<p><ul><li>它的 <code>.value<code> 和父组件的 <code>v-model<code> 的值同步；<li><li>当它被子组件变更了，会触发父组件绑定的值一起更新。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/v-model.html", "title": "组件 v-model", "doc_id": "749d024c41bc4d7281978acfb8b13e02", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1636, "chunk_index": 6, "_doc_id": "6_5726210507438907241"}}
{"doc_id": "7_1702548615860652235", "text": "作用：<p><ul><li>它的 <code>.value<code> 和父组件的 <code>v-model<code> 的值同步；<li><li>当它被子组件变更了，会触发父组件绑定的值一起更新。<li><ul><p>这意味着你也可以用 <code>v-model<code> 把这个 ref 绑定到一个原生 input 元素上，在提供相同的 <code>v-model<code> 用法的同时轻松包装原生 input 元素：<p><div class=\"language-vue\"> <span class=\"lang\">vue<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>script<span><span> setup<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/v-model.html", "title": "组件 v-model", "doc_id": "749d024c41bc4d7281978acfb8b13e02", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1636, "chunk_index": 7, "_doc_id": "7_1702548615860652235"}}
{"doc_id": "8_4342318610376376802", "text": "code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>script<span><span> setup<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> model<span><span> =<span><span> defineModel<span><span>()<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>script<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>input<span><span> v-model<span><span>=<span><span>\"model\"<span><span> /><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/v-model.html", "title": "组件 v-model", "doc_id": "749d024c41bc4d7281978acfb8b13e02", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1636, "chunk_index": 8, "_doc_id": "8_4342318610376376802"}}
{"doc_id": "9_3183972638533790211", "text": "> <<span><span>input<span><span> v-model<span><span>=<span><span>\"model\"<span><span> /><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p><a href=\"https://play.vuejs.", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/v-model.html", "title": "组件 v-model", "doc_id": "749d024c41bc4d7281978acfb8b13e02", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1636, "chunk_index": 9, "_doc_id": "9_3183972638533790211"}}
{"doc_id": "10_6186509784652141755", "text": "<span></<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p><a href=\"https://play.vuejs.org/#\"", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/v-model.html", "title": "组件 v-model", "doc_id": "749d024c41bc4d7281978acfb8b13e02", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1636, "chunk_index": 10, "_doc_id": "10_6186509784652141755"}}
{"doc_id": "11_9111397891287914678", "text": "rDUt6oV3ZBzyhmsjiz+p/dSTwJfUx2+IpD1ic+xz5enwQGXEDJJaw8Gl2I1upMzlc/hEvdOBR6SNKAjqP1J6P/o6XdL11L5h4=\" target=\"_blank\">演练场示例<a><p><h3 id=\"under-the-hood\">底层机制 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#under-the-hood\">​<a><h3><p><code>defineModel<code> 是一个便利宏。编译器将其展开为以下内容：<p><ul><li>一个名为 <code>modelValue<code> 的 prop，本地 ref 的值与其同步；<li><li>一个名为 <code>update:modelValue<code> 的事件，当本地 ref 的值发生变更时触发。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/v-model.html", "title": "组件 v-model", "doc_id": "749d024c41bc4d7281978acfb8b13e02", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1636, "chunk_index": 11, "_doc_id": "11_9111397891287914678"}}
{"doc_id": "12_7691276113591417718", "text": "elValue<code> 的 prop，本地 ref 的值与其同步；<li><li>一个名为 <code>update:modelValue<code> 的事件，当本地 ref 的值发生变更时触发。<li><ul><p>在 3.4 版本之前，你一般会按照如下的方式来实现上述相同的子组件：<p><div class=\"vp-code-block-title\"><p class=\"vp-code-block-title-bar\"><span class=\"vp-code-block-title-text\">Child.vue<span><p><div class=\"language-vue\"> <span class=\"lang\">vue<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>script<span><span> setup<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/v-model.html", "title": "组件 v-model", "doc_id": "749d024c41bc4d7281978acfb8b13e02", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1636, "chunk_index": 12, "_doc_id": "12_7691276113591417718"}}
{"doc_id": "13_6165301866904269276", "text": "code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>script<span><span> setup<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> props<span><span> =<span><span> defineProps<span><span>([<span><span>'modelValue'<span><span>])<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> emit<span><span> =<span><span> defineEmits<span><span>([<span><span>'update:modelValue'<span><span>])<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>script<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/v-model.html", "title": "组件 v-model", "doc_id": "749d024c41bc4d7281978acfb8b13e02", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1636, "chunk_index": 13, "_doc_id": "13_6165301866904269276"}}
{"doc_id": "14_5656907934419397786", "text": "n>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>script<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>input<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> :value<span><span>=<span><span>\"props.modelValue\"<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> @input<span><span>=<span><span>\"emit('update:modelValue', $event.target.value)\"<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> /><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/v-model.html", "title": "组件 v-model", "doc_id": "749d024c41bc4d7281978acfb8b13e02", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1636, "chunk_index": 14, "_doc_id": "14_5656907934419397786"}}
{"doc_id": "15_7779558005356178682", "text": "mit('update:modelValue', $event.target.value)\"<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> /><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><div><p>然后，父组件中的 <code>v-model=\"foo\"<code> 将被编译为：<p><div class=\"vp-code-block-title\"><p class=\"vp-code-block-title-bar\"><span class=\"vp-code-block-title-text\">Parent.vue<span><p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>Child<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/v-model.html", "title": "组件 v-model", "doc_id": "749d024c41bc4d7281978acfb8b13e02", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1636, "chunk_index": 15, "_doc_id": "15_7779558005356178682"}}
{"doc_id": "16_4545638817362285632", "text": "pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>Child<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> :<span><span>modelValue<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>foo<span><span>\"<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> @<span><span>update<span><span>:<span><span>modelValue<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>$event<span><span> =><span><span> (foo <span><span>=<span><span> $event)<span><span>\"<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/v-model.html", "title": "组件 v-model", "doc_id": "749d024c41bc4d7281978acfb8b13e02", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1636, "chunk_index": 16, "_doc_id": "16_4545638817362285632"}}
{"doc_id": "17_3908077336530673344", "text": "n>$event<span><span> =><span><span> (foo <span><span>=<span><span> $event)<span><span>\"<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>/><span><span><code><pre><div><div><p>如你所见，这显得冗长得多。然而，这样写有助于理解其底层机制。<p><p>因为 <code>defineModel<code> 声明了一个 prop，你可以通过给 <code>defineModel<code> 传递选项，来声明底层 prop 的选项：<p><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// 使 v-model 必填<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/v-model.html", "title": "组件 v-model", "doc_id": "749d024c41bc4d7281978acfb8b13e02", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1636, "chunk_index": 17, "_doc_id": "17_3908077336530673344"}}
{"doc_id": "18_1490791650023398884", "text": "n><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// 使 v-model 必填<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> model<span><span> =<span><span> defineModel<span><span>({ required: <span><span>true<span><span> })<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 提供一个默认值<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/v-model.html", "title": "组件 v-model", "doc_id": "749d024c41bc4d7281978acfb8b13e02", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1636, "chunk_index": 18, "_doc_id": "18_1490791650023398884"}}
{"doc_id": "19_4075331755215376209", "text": "pan><span> })<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 提供一个默认值<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> model<span><span> =<span><span> defineModel<span><span>({ default: <span><span>0<span><span> })<span><span><code><pre><div><div class=\"warning custom-block\"><p class=\"custom-block-title\">WARNING<p><p>如果为 <code>defineModel<code> prop 设置了一个 <code>default<code> 值且父组件没有为该 prop 提供任何值，会导致父组件与子组件之间不同步。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/v-model.html", "title": "组件 v-model", "doc_id": "749d024c41bc4d7281978acfb8b13e02", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1636, "chunk_index": 19, "_doc_id": "19_4075331755215376209"}}
{"doc_id": "20_1552509953060264855", "text": "><p>如果为 <code>defineModel<code> prop 设置了一个 <code>default<code> 值且父组件没有为该 prop 提供任何值，会导致父组件与子组件之间不同步。在下面的示例中，父组件的 <code>myRef<code> 是 undefined，而子组件的 <code>model<code> 是 1：<p><div class=\"vp-code-block-title\"><p class=\"vp-code-block-title-bar\"><span class=\"vp-code-block-title-text\">Child.vue<span><p><div class=\"language-vue\"> <span class=\"lang\">vue<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>script<span><span> setup<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/v-model.html", "title": "组件 v-model", "doc_id": "749d024c41bc4d7281978acfb8b13e02", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1636, "chunk_index": 20, "_doc_id": "20_1552509953060264855"}}
{"doc_id": "21_5936348014425913771", "text": "code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>script<span><span> setup<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> model<span><span> =<span><span> defineModel<span><span>({ default: <span><span>1<span><span> })<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/v-model.html", "title": "组件 v-model", "doc_id": "749d024c41bc4d7281978acfb8b13e02", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1636, "chunk_index": 21, "_doc_id": "21_5936348014425913771"}}
{"doc_id": "22_5948943083841676033", "text": "an><span> =<span><span> defineModel<span><span>({ default: <span><span>1<span><span> })<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>script<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><div><div class=\"vp-code-block-title\"><p class=\"vp-code-block-title-bar\"><span class=\"vp-code-block-title-text\">Parent.vue<span><p><div class=\"language-vue\"> <span class=\"lang\">vue<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>script<span><span> setup<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/v-model.html", "title": "组件 v-model", "doc_id": "749d024c41bc4d7281978acfb8b13e02", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1636, "chunk_index": 22, "_doc_id": "22_5948943083841676033"}}
{"doc_id": "23_7491612009934290041", "text": "code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>script<span><span> setup<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> myRef<span><span> =<span><span> ref<span><span>()<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>script<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/v-model.html", "title": "组件 v-model", "doc_id": "749d024c41bc4d7281978acfb8b13e02", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1636, "chunk_index": 23, "_doc_id": "23_7491612009934290041"}}
{"doc_id": "24_5792513578629859229", "text": ">\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>Child<span><span> v-model<span><span>=<span><span>\"myRef\"<span><span>></<span><span>Child<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/v-model.html", "title": "组件 v-model", "doc_id": "749d024c41bc4d7281978acfb8b13e02", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1636, "chunk_index": 24, "_doc_id": "24_5792513578629859229"}}
{"doc_id": "25_2448993846054415970", "text": "n> v-model<span><span>=<span><span>\"myRef\"<span><span>></<span><span>Child<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><div><div><div><div class=\"options-api\"><p>首先让我们回忆一下 <code>v-model<code> 在原生元素上的用法：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>input<span><span> v-model<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>searchText<span><span>\"<span><span> /><span><span><code><pre><div><p>在代码背后，模板编译器会对 <code>v-model<code> 进行更冗长的等价展开。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/v-model.html", "title": "组件 v-model", "doc_id": "749d024c41bc4d7281978acfb8b13e02", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1636, "chunk_index": 25, "_doc_id": "25_2448993846054415970"}}
{"doc_id": "26_7559460482448104024", "text": "n><span>\"<span><span> /><span><span><code><pre><div><p>在代码背后，模板编译器会对 <code>v-model<code> 进行更冗长的等价展开。因此上面的代码其实等价于下面这段：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>input<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> :<span><span>value<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>searchText<span><span>\"<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/v-model.html", "title": "组件 v-model", "doc_id": "749d024c41bc4d7281978acfb8b13e02", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1636, "chunk_index": 26, "_doc_id": "26_7559460482448104024"}}
{"doc_id": "27_2940094935972182392", "text": "><span> :<span><span>value<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>searchText<span><span>\"<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> @<span><span>input<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>searchText <span><span>=<span><span> $event.target.value<span><span>\"<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/v-model.html", "title": "组件 v-model", "doc_id": "749d024c41bc4d7281978acfb8b13e02", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1636, "chunk_index": 27, "_doc_id": "27_2940094935972182392"}}
{"doc_id": "28_4929668485810981061", "text": "span>\"<span><span>searchText <span><span>=<span><span> $event.target.value<span><span>\"<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>/><span><span><code><pre><div><p>而当使用在一个组件上时，<code>v-model<code> 会被展开为如下的形式：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>CustomInput<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> :<span><span>model-value<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>searchText<span><span>\"<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/v-model.html", "title": "组件 v-model", "doc_id": "749d024c41bc4d7281978acfb8b13e02", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1636, "chunk_index": 28, "_doc_id": "28_4929668485810981061"}}
{"doc_id": "29_5143377080731297108", "text": "> :<span><span>model-value<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>searchText<span><span>\"<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> @<span><span>update<span><span>:<span><span>model-value<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>newValue<span><span> =><span><span> searchText <span><span>=<span><span> newValue<span><span>\"<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>/><span><span><code><pre><div><p>要让这个例子实际工作起来，", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/v-model.html", "title": "组件 v-model", "doc_id": "749d024c41bc4d7281978acfb8b13e02", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1636, "chunk_index": 29, "_doc_id": "29_5143377080731297108"}}
{"doc_id": "30_2177855470511407250", "text": "lue<span><span>\"<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>/><span><span><code><pre><div><p>要让这个例子实际工作起来，<code><CustomInput><code> 组件内部需要做两件事：<p><ol><li>将内部原生 <code><input><code> 元素的 <code>value<code> attribute 绑定到 <code>modelValue<code> prop<li><li>当原生的 <code>input<code> 事件触发时，", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/v-model.html", "title": "组件 v-model", "doc_id": "749d024c41bc4d7281978acfb8b13e02", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1636, "chunk_index": 30, "_doc_id": "30_2177855470511407250"}}
{"doc_id": "31_1811622163937630290", "text": "元素的 <code>value<code> attribute 绑定到 <code>modelValue<code> prop<li><li>当原生的 <code>input<code> 事件触发时，触发一个携带了新值的 <code>update:modelValue<code> 自定义事件<li><ol><p>这里是相应的代码：<p><div class=\"vp-code-block-title\"><p class=\"vp-code-block-title-bar\"><span class=\"vp-code-block-title-text\">CustomInput.vue<span><p><div class=\"language-vue\"> <span class=\"lang\">vue<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>script<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/v-model.html", "title": "组件 v-model", "doc_id": "749d024c41bc4d7281978acfb8b13e02", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1636, "chunk_index": 31, "_doc_id": "31_1811622163937630290"}}
{"doc_id": "32_8700951186344400980", "text": "ki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>script<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> props: [<span><span>'modelValue'<span><span>],<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> emits: [<span><span>'update:modelValue'<span><span>]<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>script<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/v-model.html", "title": "组件 v-model", "doc_id": "749d024c41bc4d7281978acfb8b13e02", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1636, "chunk_index": 32, "_doc_id": "32_8700951186344400980"}}
{"doc_id": "33_971662296529178219", "text": "n>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>script<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>input<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> :value<span><span>=<span><span>\"modelValue\"<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> @input<span><span>=<span><span>\"$emit('update:modelValue', $event.target.value)\"<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> /><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/v-model.html", "title": "组件 v-model", "doc_id": "749d024c41bc4d7281978acfb8b13e02", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1636, "chunk_index": 33, "_doc_id": "33_971662296529178219"}}
{"doc_id": "34_7244520487164813457", "text": "mit('update:modelValue', $event.target.value)\"<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> /><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><div><p>现在 <code>v-model<code> 可以在这个组件上正常工作了：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>CustomInput<span><span> v-model<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>searchText<span><span>\"<span><span> /><span><span><code><pre><div><p><a href=\"https://play.", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/v-model.html", "title": "组件 v-model", "doc_id": "749d024c41bc4d7281978acfb8b13e02", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1636, "chunk_index": 34, "_doc_id": "34_7244520487164813457"}}
{"doc_id": "35_2228166340378643764", "text": "an><span>searchText<span><span>\"<span><span> /><span><span><code><pre><div><p><a href=\"https://play.vuejs.", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/v-model.html", "title": "组件 v-model", "doc_id": "749d024c41bc4d7281978acfb8b13e02", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1636, "chunk_index": 35, "_doc_id": "35_2228166340378643764"}}
{"doc_id": "36_6424516577756671806", "text": "an>searchText<span><span>\"<span><span> /><span><span><code><pre><div><p><a href=\"https://play.vuejs.org/#\" target=\"_blank\">在演练场中尝试一下<a><p><p>另一种在组件内实现 <code>v-model<code> 的方式是使用一个可写的，", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/v-model.html", "title": "组件 v-model", "doc_id": "749d024c41bc4d7281978acfb8b13e02", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1636, "chunk_index": 36, "_doc_id": "36_6424516577756671806"}}
{"doc_id": "37_3530739402764213748", "text": "llD8t8zVZb+PkHqPG4iw==\" target=\"_blank\">在演练场中尝试一下<a><p><p>另一种在组件内实现 <code>v-model<code> 的方式是使用一个可写的，同时具有 getter 和 setter 的 <code>computed<code> 属性。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/v-model.html", "title": "组件 v-model", "doc_id": "749d024c41bc4d7281978acfb8b13e02", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1636, "chunk_index": 37, "_doc_id": "37_3530739402764213748"}}
{"doc_id": "38_3517094631765273209", "text": "一下<a><p><p>另一种在组件内实现 <code>v-model<code> 的方式是使用一个可写的，同时具有 getter 和 setter 的 <code>computed<code> 属性。<code>get<code> 方法需返回 <code>modelValue<code> prop，而 <code>set<code> 方法需触发相应的事件：<p><div class=\"vp-code-block-title\"><p class=\"vp-code-block-title-bar\"><span class=\"vp-code-block-title-text\">CustomInput.vue<span><p><div class=\"language-vue\"> <span class=\"lang\">vue<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>script<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/v-model.html", "title": "组件 v-model", "doc_id": "749d024c41bc4d7281978acfb8b13e02", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1636, "chunk_index": 38, "_doc_id": "38_3517094631765273209"}}
{"doc_id": "39_8591221623460223466", "text": "ki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>script<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> props: [<span><span>'modelValue'<span><span>],<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> emits: [<span><span>'update:modelValue'<span><span>],<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> computed: {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> value: {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> get<span><span>() {<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/v-model.html", "title": "组件 v-model", "doc_id": "749d024c41bc4d7281978acfb8b13e02", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1636, "chunk_index": 39, "_doc_id": "39_8591221623460223466"}}
{"doc_id": "40_147899765994492122", "text": "class=\"line\"><span> value: {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> get<span><span>() {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> return<span><span> this<span><span>.modelValue<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> },<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> set<span><span>(<span><span>value<span><span>) {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> this<span><span>.<span><span>$emit<span><span>(<span><span>'update:modelValue'<span><span>, value)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/v-model.html", "title": "组件 v-model", "doc_id": "749d024c41bc4d7281978acfb8b13e02", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1636, "chunk_index": 40, "_doc_id": "40_147899765994492122"}}
{"doc_id": "41_7062037124901246787", "text": "n><span>'update:modelValue'<span><span>, value)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>script<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>input<span><span> v-model<span><span>=<span><span>\"value\"<span><span> /><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/v-model.html", "title": "组件 v-model", "doc_id": "749d024c41bc4d7281978acfb8b13e02", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1636, "chunk_index": 41, "_doc_id": "41_7062037124901246787"}}
{"doc_id": "42_6595121005889751563", "text": "> <<span><span>input<span><span> v-model<span><span>=<span><span>\"value\"<span><span> /><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><div><div><h2 id=\"v-model-arguments\"><code>v-model<code> 的参数 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#v-model-arguments\">​<a><h2><p>组件上的 <code>v-model<code> 也可以接受一个参数：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/components/v-model.html", "title": "组件 v-model", "doc_id": "749d024c41bc4d7281978acfb8b13e02", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 1636, "chunk_index": 42, "_doc_id": "42_6595121005889751563"}}
