{"doc_id": "10_71348080732568545", "text": "lass=\"line\"><span> margin-left<span><span>: <span><span>-150<span><span>px<span><span>;<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>style<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><div><div class=\"options-api\"><div class=\"language-vue\"> <span class=\"lang\">vue<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>script<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/teleport.html", "title": "Teleport | Vue.js", "doc_id": "2b897bdcb43448898ecbf09f53100229", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 499, "chunk_index": 10, "_doc_id": "10_71348080732568545"}}
{"doc_id": "11_2892142143987484528", "text": "n><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> data<span><span>() {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> return<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> open: <span><span>false<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>script<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/teleport.html", "title": "Teleport | Vue.js", "doc_id": "2b897bdcb43448898ecbf09f53100229", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 499, "chunk_index": 11, "_doc_id": "11_2892142143987484528"}}
{"doc_id": "12_3803937200978341222", "text": "n>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>script<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>button<span><span> @click<span><span>=<span><span>\"open = true\"<span><span>>Open Modal</<span><span>button<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/teleport.html", "title": "Teleport | Vue.js", "doc_id": "2b897bdcb43448898ecbf09f53100229", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 499, "chunk_index": 12, "_doc_id": "12_3803937200978341222"}}
{"doc_id": "13_4030246923630153211", "text": "true\"<span><span>>Open Modal</<span><span>button<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>div<span><span> v-if<span><span>=<span><span>\"open\"<span><span> class<span><span>=<span><span>\"modal\"<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>p<span><span>>Hello from the modal!</<span><span>p<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/teleport.html", "title": "Teleport | Vue.js", "doc_id": "2b897bdcb43448898ecbf09f53100229", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 499, "chunk_index": 13, "_doc_id": "13_4030246923630153211"}}
{"doc_id": "14_8838074581535168165", "text": "ne\"><span> <<span><span>p<span><span>>Hello from the modal!</<span><span>p<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>button<span><span> @click<span><span>=<span><span>\"open = false\"<span><span>>Close</<span><span>button<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> </<span><span>div<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/teleport.html", "title": "Teleport | Vue.js", "doc_id": "2b897bdcb43448898ecbf09f53100229", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 499, "chunk_index": 14, "_doc_id": "14_8838074581535168165"}}
{"doc_id": "15_4299088596187064994", "text": "<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>style<span><span> scoped<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>.modal<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> position<span><span>: <span><span>fixed<span><span>;<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> z-index<span><span>: <span><span>999<span><span>;<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/teleport.html", "title": "Teleport | Vue.js", "doc_id": "2b897bdcb43448898ecbf09f53100229", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 499, "chunk_index": 15, "_doc_id": "15_4299088596187064994"}}
{"doc_id": "16_5276304524727516728", "text": "span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> z-index<span><span>: <span><span>999<span><span>;<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> top<span><span>: <span><span>20<span><span>%<span><span>;<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> left<span><span>: <span><span>50<span><span>%<span><span>;<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> width<span><span>: <span><span>300<span><span>px<span><span>;<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> margin-left<span><span>: <span><span>-150<span><span>px<span><span>;<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/teleport.html", "title": "Teleport | Vue.js", "doc_id": "2b897bdcb43448898ecbf09f53100229", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 499, "chunk_index": 16, "_doc_id": "16_5276304524727516728"}}
{"doc_id": "17_2138541593701655148", "text": "lass=\"line\"><span> margin-left<span><span>: <span><span>-150<span><span>px<span><span>;<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>style<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><div><p>这个组件中有一个 <code><button><code> 按钮来触发打开模态框，和一个 class 名为 <code>.modal<code> 的 <code><div><code>，它包含了模态框的内容和一个用来关闭的按钮。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/teleport.html", "title": "Teleport | Vue.js", "doc_id": "2b897bdcb43448898ecbf09f53100229", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 499, "chunk_index": 17, "_doc_id": "17_2138541593701655148"}}
{"doc_id": "18_4103088448465787159", "text": "><button><code> 按钮来触发打开模态框，和一个 class 名为 <code>.modal<code> 的 <code><div><code>，它包含了模态框的内容和一个用来关闭的按钮。<p><p>当在初始 HTML 结构中使用这个组件时，会有一些潜在的问题：<p><ul><li><p><code>position: fixed<code> 能够相对于浏览器窗口放置有一个条件，那就是不能有任何祖先元素设置了 <code>transform<code>、<code>perspective<code> 或者 <code>filter<code> 样式属性。也就是说如果我们想要用 CSS <code>transform<code> 为祖先节点 <code><div class=\"outer\"><code> 设置动画，就会不小心破坏模态框的布局！<p><li><li><p>这个模态框的 <code>z-index<code> 受限于它的容器元素。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/teleport.html", "title": "Teleport | Vue.js", "doc_id": "2b897bdcb43448898ecbf09f53100229", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 499, "chunk_index": 18, "_doc_id": "18_4103088448465787159"}}
{"doc_id": "19_7277594916299547876", "text": "ode><div class=\"outer\"><code> 设置动画，就会不小心破坏模态框的布局！<p><li><li><p>这个模态框的 <code>z-index<code> 受限于它的容器元素。如果有其他元素与 <code><div class=\"outer\"><code> 重叠并有更高的 <code>z-index<code>，则它会覆盖住我们的模态框。<p><li><ul><p><code><Teleport><code> 提供了一个更简单的方式来解决此类问题，让我们不需要再顾虑 DOM 结构的问题。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/teleport.html", "title": "Teleport | Vue.js", "doc_id": "2b897bdcb43448898ecbf09f53100229", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 499, "chunk_index": 19, "_doc_id": "19_7277594916299547876"}}
{"doc_id": "20_63204550681915483", "text": "ndex<code>，则它会覆盖住我们的模态框。<p><li><ul><p><code><Teleport><code> 提供了一个更简单的方式来解决此类问题，让我们不需要再顾虑 DOM 结构的问题。让我们用 <code><Teleport><code> 改写一下 <code><MyModal><code>：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>button<span><span> @<span><span>click<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>open <span><span>=<span><span> true<span><span>\"<span><span>>Open Modal</<span><span>button<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/teleport.html", "title": "Teleport | Vue.js", "doc_id": "2b897bdcb43448898ecbf09f53100229", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 499, "chunk_index": 20, "_doc_id": "20_63204550681915483"}}
{"doc_id": "21_6115896099899045788", "text": "=<span><span> true<span><span>\"<span><span>>Open Modal</<span><span>button<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line highlighted\"><span><<span><span>Teleport<span><span> to<span><span>=<span><span>\"body\"<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>div<span><span> v-if<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>open<span><span>\"<span><span> class<span><span>=<span><span>\"modal\"<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/teleport.html", "title": "Teleport | Vue.js", "doc_id": "2b897bdcb43448898ecbf09f53100229", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 499, "chunk_index": 21, "_doc_id": "21_6115896099899045788"}}
{"doc_id": "22_1931816876576135088", "text": "><span>open<span><span>\"<span><span> class<span><span>=<span><span>\"modal\"<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>p<span><span>>Hello from the modal!</<span><span>p<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>button<span><span> @<span><span>click<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>open <span><span>=<span><span> false<span><span>\"<span><span>>Close</<span><span>button<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> </<span><span>div<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/teleport.html", "title": "Teleport | Vue.js", "doc_id": "2b897bdcb43448898ecbf09f53100229", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 499, "chunk_index": 22, "_doc_id": "22_1931816876576135088"}}
{"doc_id": "23_2473442268127090519", "text": "utton<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> </<span><span>div<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line highlighted\"><span></<span><span>Teleport<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p><code><Teleport><code> 接收一个 <code>to<code> prop 来指定传送的目标。<code>to<code> 的值可以是一个 CSS 选择器字符串，也可以是一个 DOM 元素对象。这段代码的作用就是告诉 Vue“把以下模板片段<strong>传送到 <code>body<code><strong> 标签下”。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/teleport.html", "title": "Teleport | Vue.js", "doc_id": "2b897bdcb43448898ecbf09f53100229", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 499, "chunk_index": 23, "_doc_id": "23_2473442268127090519"}}
{"doc_id": "24_3336211715893338750", "text": "的值可以是一个 CSS 选择器字符串，也可以是一个 DOM 元素对象。这段代码的作用就是告诉 Vue“把以下模板片段<strong>传送到 <code>body<code><strong> 标签下”。<p><p>你可以点击下面这个按钮，然后通过浏览器的开发者工具，在 <code><body><code> 标签下找到模态框元素：<p><p class=\"demo\"> Open Modal <p><p>我们也可以将 <code><Teleport><code> 和 <a href=\"./transition.html\"><code><Transition><code><a> 结合使用来创建一个带动画的模态框。你可以看看<a href=\"/examples/#modal\">这个示例<a>。<p><div class=\"tip custom-block\"><p class=\"custom-block-title\">TIP<p><p><code><Teleport><code> 挂载时，传送的 <code>to<code> 目标必须已经存在于 DOM 中。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/teleport.html", "title": "Teleport | Vue.js", "doc_id": "2b897bdcb43448898ecbf09f53100229", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 499, "chunk_index": 24, "_doc_id": "24_3336211715893338750"}}
{"doc_id": "25_2760063786951050267", "text": "p class=\"custom-block-title\">TIP<p><p><code><Teleport><code> 挂载时，传送的 <code>to<code> 目标必须已经存在于 DOM 中。理想情况下，这应该是整个 Vue 应用 DOM 树外部的一个元素。如果目标元素也是由 Vue 渲染的，你需要确保在挂载 <code><Teleport><code> 之前先挂载该元素。<p><div><h2 id=\"using-with-components\">搭配组件使用 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#using-with-components\">​<a><h2><p><code><Teleport><code> 只改变了渲染的 DOM 结构，它不会影响组件间的逻辑关系。也就是说，如果 <code><Teleport><code> 包含了一个组件，那么该组件始终和这个使用了 <code><Teleport><code> 的组件保持逻辑上的父子关系。传入的 props 和触发的事件也会照常工作。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/teleport.html", "title": "Teleport | Vue.js", "doc_id": "2b897bdcb43448898ecbf09f53100229", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 499, "chunk_index": 25, "_doc_id": "25_2760063786951050267"}}
{"doc_id": "26_8311015158220981121", "text": "><Teleport><code> 包含了一个组件，那么该组件始终和这个使用了 <code><Teleport><code> 的组件保持逻辑上的父子关系。传入的 props 和触发的事件也会照常工作。<p><p>这也意味着来自父组件的注入也会按预期工作，子组件将在 Vue Devtools 中嵌套在父级组件下面，而不是放在实际内容移动到的地方。<p><h2 id=\"disabling-teleport\">禁用 Teleport <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#disabling-teleport\">​<a><h2><p>在某些场景下可能需要视情况禁用 <code><Teleport><code>。举例来说，我们想要在桌面端将一个组件当做浮层来渲染，但在移动端则当作行内组件。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/teleport.html", "title": "Teleport | Vue.js", "doc_id": "2b897bdcb43448898ecbf09f53100229", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 499, "chunk_index": 26, "_doc_id": "26_8311015158220981121"}}
{"doc_id": "27_382597706747285377", "text": "-teleport\">​<a><h2><p>在某些场景下可能需要视情况禁用 <code><Teleport><code>。举例来说，我们想要在桌面端将一个组件当做浮层来渲染，但在移动端则当作行内组件。我们可以通过对 <code><Teleport><code> 动态地传入一个 <code>disabled<code> prop 来处理这两种不同情况：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>Teleport<span><span> :<span><span>disabled<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>isMobile<span><span>\"<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> ...<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/teleport.html", "title": "Teleport | Vue.js", "doc_id": "2b897bdcb43448898ecbf09f53100229", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 499, "chunk_index": 27, "_doc_id": "27_382597706747285377"}}
{"doc_id": "28_770564375134674489", "text": "span><span>isMobile<span><span>\"<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> ...<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>Teleport<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>然后我们可以动态地更新 <code>isMobile<code>。<p><h2 id=\"multiple-teleports-on-the-same-target\">多个 Teleport 共享目标 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#multiple-teleports-on-the-same-target\">​<a><h2><p>一个可重用的 <code><Modal><code> 组件可能同时存在多个实例。对于此类场景，多个 <code><Teleport><code> 组件可以将其内容挂载在同一个目标元素上，而顺序就是简单的顺次追加，后挂载的将排在目标元素下更后面的位置上，但都在目标元素中。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/teleport.html", "title": "Teleport | Vue.js", "doc_id": "2b897bdcb43448898ecbf09f53100229", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 499, "chunk_index": 28, "_doc_id": "28_770564375134674489"}}
{"doc_id": "29_2245584490002913250", "text": "多个实例。对于此类场景，多个 <code><Teleport><code> 组件可以将其内容挂载在同一个目标元素上，而顺序就是简单的顺次追加，后挂载的将排在目标元素下更后面的位置上，但都在目标元素中。<p><p>比如下面这样的用例：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>Teleport<span><span> to<span><span>=<span><span>\"#modals\"<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>div<span><span>>A</<span><span>div<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/teleport.html", "title": "Teleport | Vue.js", "doc_id": "2b897bdcb43448898ecbf09f53100229", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 499, "chunk_index": 29, "_doc_id": "29_2245584490002913250"}}
{"doc_id": "30_2657427322557772266", "text": "<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>div<span><span>>A</<span><span>div<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>Teleport<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>Teleport<span><span> to<span><span>=<span><span>\"#modals\"<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>div<span><span>>B</<span><span>div<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/teleport.html", "title": "Teleport | Vue.js", "doc_id": "2b897bdcb43448898ecbf09f53100229", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 499, "chunk_index": 30, "_doc_id": "30_2657427322557772266"}}
{"doc_id": "31_4158406518065568770", "text": "<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>div<span><span>>B</<span><span>div<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>Teleport<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>渲染的结果为：<p><div class=\"language-html\"> <span class=\"lang\">html<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>div<span><span> id<span><span>=<span><span>\"modals\"<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/teleport.html", "title": "Teleport | Vue.js", "doc_id": "2b897bdcb43448898ecbf09f53100229", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 499, "chunk_index": 31, "_doc_id": "31_4158406518065568770"}}
{"doc_id": "32_1006782497935358832", "text": "ne\"><span><<span><span>div<span><span> id<span><span>=<span><span>\"modals\"<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>div<span><span>>A</<span><span>div<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>div<span><span>>B</<span><span>div<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/teleport.html", "title": "Teleport | Vue.js", "doc_id": "2b897bdcb43448898ecbf09f53100229", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 499, "chunk_index": 32, "_doc_id": "32_1006782497935358832"}}
{"doc_id": "33_4219797626989430887", "text": "<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>div<span><span>>B</<span><span>div<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>div<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><h2 id=\"deferred-teleport\">延迟解析的 Teleport <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#deferred-teleport\" class=\"vt-badge\">​<a><h2><p>在 Vue 3.5 及更高版本中，我们可以使用 <code>defer<code> prop 推迟 Teleport 的目标解析，直到应用的其他部分挂载。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/teleport.html", "title": "Teleport | Vue.js", "doc_id": "2b897bdcb43448898ecbf09f53100229", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 499, "chunk_index": 33, "_doc_id": "33_4219797626989430887"}}
{"doc_id": "34_5478697078731106347", "text": "=\"vt-badge\">​<a><h2><p>在 Vue 3.5 及更高版本中，我们可以使用 <code>defer<code> prop 推迟 Teleport 的目标解析，直到应用的其他部分挂载。这允许 Teleport 将由 Vue 渲染且位于组件树之后部分的容器元素作为目标：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>Teleport<span><span> defer<span><span> to<span><span>=<span><span>\"#late-div\"<span><span>>...</<span><span>Teleport<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/teleport.html", "title": "Teleport | Vue.js", "doc_id": "2b897bdcb43448898ecbf09f53100229", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 499, "chunk_index": 34, "_doc_id": "34_5478697078731106347"}}
{"doc_id": "35_7127428576923443696", "text": "#late-div\"<span><span>>...</<span><span>Teleport<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><!-- 稍后出现于模板中的某处 --><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>div<span><span> id<span><span>=<span><span>\"late-div\"<span><span>></<span><span>div<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>请注意，目标元素必须与 Teleport 在同一个挂载/更新周期内渲染，即如果 <code><div><code> 在一秒后才挂载，Teleport 仍然会报错。延迟 Teleport 的原理与 <code>mounted<code> 生命周期钩子类似。<p>\n<p><strong>参考<strong><p><div><div>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/teleport.html", "title": "Teleport | Vue.js", "doc_id": "2b897bdcb43448898ecbf09f53100229", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 499, "chunk_index": 35, "_doc_id": "35_7127428576923443696"}}
{"doc_id": "0_8930555472029035998", "text": "<div><div><h1 id=\"suspense\">Suspense <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#suspense\">​<a><h1><div class=\"warning custom-block\"><p class=\"custom-block-title\">实验性功能<p><p><code><Suspense><code> 是一项实验性功能。它不一定会最终成为稳定功能，并且在稳定之前相关 API 也可能会发生变化。<p><div><p><code><Suspense><code> 是一个内置组件，用来在组件树中协调对异步依赖的处理。它让我们可以在组件树上层等待下层的多个嵌套异步依赖项解析完成，并可以在等待时渲染一个加载状态。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/suspense.html", "title": "Suspense | Vue.js", "doc_id": "2d9a2cbfc02d42f987f37980afd8ce23", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 430, "chunk_index": 0, "_doc_id": "0_8930555472029035998"}}
{"doc_id": "1_5553195131892730434", "text": "><p><code><Suspense><code> 是一个内置组件，用来在组件树中协调对异步依赖的处理。它让我们可以在组件树上层等待下层的多个嵌套异步依赖项解析完成，并可以在等待时渲染一个加载状态。<p><h2 id=\"async-dependencies\">异步依赖 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#async-dependencies\">​<a><h2><p>要了解 <code><Suspense><code> 所解决的问题和它是如何与异步依赖进行交互的，我们需要想象这样一种组件层级结构：<p><div class=\"language-\"> <span class=\"lang\"><span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><Suspense><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>└─ <Dashboard><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/suspense.html", "title": "Suspense | Vue.js", "doc_id": "2d9a2cbfc02d42f987f37980afd8ce23", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 430, "chunk_index": 1, "_doc_id": "1_5553195131892730434"}}
{"doc_id": "2_638916597463458443", "text": "<span class=\"line\"><span><Suspense><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>└─ <Dashboard><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> ├─ <Profile><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> │ └─ <FriendStatus> (组件有异步的 setup())<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> └─ <Content><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> ├─ <ActivityFeed> (异步组件)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> └─ <Stats> (异步组件)<span><span><code><pre><div><p>在这个组件树中有多个嵌套组件，要渲染出它们，首先得解析一些异步资源。如果没有 <code><Suspense><code>，则它们每个都需要处理自己的加载、报错和完成状态。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/suspense.html", "title": "Suspense | Vue.js", "doc_id": "2d9a2cbfc02d42f987f37980afd8ce23", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 430, "chunk_index": 2, "_doc_id": "2_638916597463458443"}}
{"doc_id": "3_7850095938296487016", "text": "><pre><div><p>在这个组件树中有多个嵌套组件，要渲染出它们，首先得解析一些异步资源。如果没有 <code><Suspense><code>，则它们每个都需要处理自己的加载、报错和完成状态。在最坏的情况下，我们可能会在页面上看到三个旋转的加载态，在不同的时间显示出内容。<p><p>有了 <code><Suspense><code> 组件后，我们就可以在等待整个多层级组件树中的各个异步依赖获取结果时，在顶层展示出加载中或加载失败的状态。<p><p><code><Suspense><code> 可以等待的异步依赖有两种：<p><ol><li><p>带有异步 <code>setup()<code> 钩子的组件。这也包含了使用 <code><script setup><code> 时有顶层 <code>await<code> 表达式的组件。<p><li><li><p><a href=\"/guide/components/async.html\">异步组件<a>。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/suspense.html", "title": "Suspense | Vue.js", "doc_id": "2d9a2cbfc02d42f987f37980afd8ce23", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 430, "chunk_index": 3, "_doc_id": "3_7850095938296487016"}}
{"doc_id": "4_3768508510854132486", "text": "p><code> 时有顶层 <code>await<code> 表达式的组件。<p><li><li><p><a href=\"/guide/components/async.html\">异步组件<a>。<p><li><ol><h3 id=\"async-setup\"><code>async setup()<code> <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#async-setup\">​<a><h3><p>组合式 API 中组件的 <code>setup()<code> 钩子可以是异步的：<p><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/suspense.html", "title": "Suspense | Vue.js", "doc_id": "2d9a2cbfc02d42f987f37980afd8ce23", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 430, "chunk_index": 4, "_doc_id": "4_3768508510854132486"}}
{"doc_id": "5_5331231178164304227", "text": "b-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> async<span><span> setup<span><span>() {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> const<span><span> res<span><span> =<span><span> await<span><span> fetch<span><span>(<span><span>...<span><span>)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> const<span><span> posts<span><span> =<span><span> await<span><span> res.<span><span>json<span><span>()<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/suspense.html", "title": "Suspense | Vue.js", "doc_id": "2d9a2cbfc02d42f987f37980afd8ce23", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 430, "chunk_index": 5, "_doc_id": "5_5331231178164304227"}}
{"doc_id": "6_5373855569612234154", "text": "n> posts<span><span> =<span><span> await<span><span> res.<span><span>json<span><span>()<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> return<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> posts<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/suspense.html", "title": "Suspense | Vue.js", "doc_id": "2d9a2cbfc02d42f987f37980afd8ce23", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 430, "chunk_index": 6, "_doc_id": "6_5373855569612234154"}}
{"doc_id": "7_5997916386233734785", "text": "> posts<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span><code><pre><div><p>如果使用 <code><script setup><code>，那么顶层 <code>await<code> 表达式会自动让该组件成为一个异步依赖：<p><div class=\"language-vue\"> <span class=\"lang\">vue<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>script<span><span> setup<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/suspense.html", "title": "Suspense | Vue.js", "doc_id": "2d9a2cbfc02d42f987f37980afd8ce23", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 430, "chunk_index": 7, "_doc_id": "7_5997916386233734785"}}
{"doc_id": "8_8779417898818991954", "text": "code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>script<span><span> setup<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> res<span><span> =<span><span> await<span><span> fetch<span><span>(<span><span>...<span><span>)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> posts<span><span> =<span><span> await<span><span> res.<span><span>json<span><span>()<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>script<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/suspense.html", "title": "Suspense | Vue.js", "doc_id": "2d9a2cbfc02d42f987f37980afd8ce23", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 430, "chunk_index": 8, "_doc_id": "8_8779417898818991954"}}
{"doc_id": "9_259441288904318418", "text": "n>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>script<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> {{ posts }}<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><h3 id=\"async-components\">异步组件 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#async-components\">​<a><h3><p>异步组件默认就是<strong>“suspensible”<strong>的。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/suspense.html", "title": "Suspense | Vue.js", "doc_id": "2d9a2cbfc02d42f987f37980afd8ce23", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 430, "chunk_index": 9, "_doc_id": "9_259441288904318418"}}
{"doc_id": "10_1834606161497013657", "text": "<a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#async-components\">​<a><h3><p>异步组件默认就是<strong>“suspensible”<strong>的。这意味着如果组件关系链上有一个 <code><Suspense><code>，那么这个异步组件就会被当作这个 <code><Suspense><code> 的一个异步依赖。在这种情况下，加载状态是由 <code><Suspense><code> 控制，而该组件自己的加载、报错、延时和超时等选项都将被忽略。<p><p>异步组件也可以通过在选项中指定 <code>suspensible: false<code> 表明不用 <code>Suspense<code> 控制，并让组件始终自己控制其加载状态。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/suspense.html", "title": "Suspense | Vue.js", "doc_id": "2d9a2cbfc02d42f987f37980afd8ce23", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 430, "chunk_index": 10, "_doc_id": "10_1834606161497013657"}}
{"doc_id": "11_1634648598034662506", "text": "略。<p><p>异步组件也可以通过在选项中指定 <code>suspensible: false<code> 表明不用 <code>Suspense<code> 控制，并让组件始终自己控制其加载状态。<p><h2 id=\"loading-state\">加载中状态 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#loading-state\">​<a><h2><p><code><Suspense><code> 组件有两个插槽：<code>#default<code> 和 <code>#fallback<code>。两个插槽都只允许<strong>一个<strong>直接子节点。在可能的时候都将显示默认插槽中的节点。否则将显示后备插槽中的节点。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/suspense.html", "title": "Suspense | Vue.js", "doc_id": "2d9a2cbfc02d42f987f37980afd8ce23", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 430, "chunk_index": 11, "_doc_id": "11_1634648598034662506"}}
{"doc_id": "12_8845491060877457554", "text": "ault<code> 和 <code>#fallback<code>。两个插槽都只允许<strong>一个<strong>直接子节点。在可能的时候都将显示默认插槽中的节点。否则将显示后备插槽中的节点。<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>Suspense<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <!-- 具有深层异步依赖的组件 --><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>Dashboard<span><span> /><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/suspense.html", "title": "Suspense | Vue.js", "doc_id": "2d9a2cbfc02d42f987f37980afd8ce23", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 430, "chunk_index": 12, "_doc_id": "12_8845491060877457554"}}
{"doc_id": "13_2492921074030183503", "text": "pan class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>Dashboard<span><span> /><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <!-- 在 #fallback 插槽中显示 “正在加载中” --><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>template<span><span> #<span><span>fallback<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> Loading...<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> </<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/suspense.html", "title": "Suspense | Vue.js", "doc_id": "2d9a2cbfc02d42f987f37980afd8ce23", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 430, "chunk_index": 13, "_doc_id": "13_2492921074030183503"}}
{"doc_id": "14_5431004411272436362", "text": "n> Loading...<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> </<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>Suspense<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>在初始渲染时，<code><Suspense><code> 将在内存中渲染其默认的插槽内容。如果在这个过程中遇到任何异步依赖，则会进入<strong>挂起<strong>状态。在挂起状态期间，展示的是后备内容。当所有遇到的异步依赖都完成后，<code><Suspense><code> 会进入<strong>完成<strong>状态，并将展示出默认插槽的内容。<p><p>如果在初次渲染时没有遇到异步依赖，<code><Suspense><code> 会直接进入完成状态。<p><p>进入完成状态后，只有当默认插槽的根节点被替换时，<code><Suspense><code> 才会回到挂起状态。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/suspense.html", "title": "Suspense | Vue.js", "doc_id": "2d9a2cbfc02d42f987f37980afd8ce23", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 430, "chunk_index": 14, "_doc_id": "14_5431004411272436362"}}
{"doc_id": "15_2573853757167132058", "text": "异步依赖，<code><Suspense><code> 会直接进入完成状态。<p><p>进入完成状态后，只有当默认插槽的根节点被替换时，<code><Suspense><code> 才会回到挂起状态。组件树中新的更深层次的异步依赖<strong>不会<strong>造成 <code><Suspense><code> 回退到挂起状态。<p><p>发生回退时，后备内容不会立即展示出来。相反，<code><Suspense><code> 在等待新内容和异步依赖完成时，会展示之前 <code>#default<code> 插槽的内容。这个行为可以通过一个 <code>timeout<code> prop 进行配置：在等待渲染新内容耗时超过 <code>timeout<code> 毫秒之后，<code><Suspense><code> 将会切换为展示后备内容。若 <code>timeout<code> 值为 <code>0<code> 将导致在替换默认内容时立即显示后备内容。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/suspense.html", "title": "Suspense | Vue.js", "doc_id": "2d9a2cbfc02d42f987f37980afd8ce23", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 430, "chunk_index": 15, "_doc_id": "15_2573853757167132058"}}
{"doc_id": "16_4401841080243237907", "text": "毫秒之后，<code><Suspense><code> 将会切换为展示后备内容。若 <code>timeout<code> 值为 <code>0<code> 将导致在替换默认内容时立即显示后备内容。<p><h2 id=\"events\">事件 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#events\">​<a><h2><p><code><Suspense><code> 组件会触发三个事件：<code>pending<code>、<code>resolve<code> 和 <code>fallback<code>。<code>pending<code> 事件是在进入挂起状态时触发。<code>resolve<code> 事件是在 <code>default<code> 插槽完成获取新内容时触发。<code>fallback<code> 事件则是在 <code>fallback<code> 插槽的内容显示时触发。<p><p>例如，可以使用这些事件在加载新组件时在之前的 DOM 最上层显示一个加载指示器。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/suspense.html", "title": "Suspense | Vue.js", "doc_id": "2d9a2cbfc02d42f987f37980afd8ce23", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 430, "chunk_index": 16, "_doc_id": "16_4401841080243237907"}}
{"doc_id": "17_7527075774309921226", "text": ">fallback<code> 事件则是在 <code>fallback<code> 插槽的内容显示时触发。<p><p>例如，可以使用这些事件在加载新组件时在之前的 DOM 最上层显示一个加载指示器。<p><h2 id=\"error-handling\">错误处理 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#error-handling\">​<a><h2><p><code><Suspense><code> 组件自身目前还不提供错误处理，不过你可以使用 <a href=\"/api/options-lifecycle.html#errorcaptured\"><code>errorCaptured<code><a> 选项或者 <a href=\"/api/composition-api-lifecycle.html#onerrorcaptured\"><code>onErrorCaptured()<code><a> 钩子，在使用到 <code><Suspense><code> 的父组件中捕获和处理异步错误。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/suspense.html", "title": "Suspense | Vue.js", "doc_id": "2d9a2cbfc02d42f987f37980afd8ce23", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 430, "chunk_index": 17, "_doc_id": "17_7527075774309921226"}}
{"doc_id": "18_3867542961174262338", "text": "tml#onerrorcaptured\"><code>onErrorCaptured()<code><a> 钩子，在使用到 <code><Suspense><code> 的父组件中捕获和处理异步错误。<p><h2 id=\"combining-with-other-components\">和其他组件结合 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#combining-with-other-components\">​<a><h2><p>我们常常会将 <code><Suspense><code> 和 <a href=\"./transition.html\"><code><Transition><code><a>、<a href=\"./keep-alive.html\"><code><KeepAlive><code><a> 等组件结合。要保证这些组件都能正常工作，嵌套的顺序非常重要。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/suspense.html", "title": "Suspense | Vue.js", "doc_id": "2d9a2cbfc02d42f987f37980afd8ce23", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 430, "chunk_index": 18, "_doc_id": "18_3867542961174262338"}}
{"doc_id": "19_9005199285917206351", "text": "tion><code><a>、<a href=\"./keep-alive.html\"><code><KeepAlive><code><a> 等组件结合。要保证这些组件都能正常工作，嵌套的顺序非常重要。<p><p>另外，这些组件都通常与 <a href=\"https://router.vuejs.org/zh/\" target=\"_blank\">Vue Router<a> 中的 <code><RouterView><code> 组件结合使用。<p><p>下面的示例展示了如何嵌套这些组件，使它们都能按照预期的方式运行。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/suspense.html", "title": "Suspense | Vue.js", "doc_id": "2d9a2cbfc02d42f987f37980afd8ce23", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 430, "chunk_index": 19, "_doc_id": "19_9005199285917206351"}}
{"doc_id": "20_5858680744353374693", "text": "get=\"_blank\">Vue Router<a> 中的 <code><RouterView><code> 组件结合使用。<p><p>下面的示例展示了如何嵌套这些组件，使它们都能按照预期的方式运行。若想组合得更简单，你也可以删除一些你不需要的组件：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>RouterView<span><span> v-slot<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>{ Component }<span><span>\"<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/suspense.html", "title": "Suspense | Vue.js", "doc_id": "2d9a2cbfc02d42f987f37980afd8ce23", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 430, "chunk_index": 20, "_doc_id": "20_5858680744353374693"}}
{"doc_id": "21_4491328777215365149", "text": "an> v-slot<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>{ Component }<span><span>\"<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>template<span><span> v-if<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>Component<span><span>\"<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>Transition<span><span> mode<span><span>=<span><span>\"out-in\"<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>KeepAlive<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/suspense.html", "title": "Suspense | Vue.js", "doc_id": "2d9a2cbfc02d42f987f37980afd8ce23", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 430, "chunk_index": 21, "_doc_id": "21_4491328777215365149"}}
{"doc_id": "22_8498155406450072164", "text": "<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>KeepAlive<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>Suspense<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <!-- 主要内容 --><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>component<span><span> :<span><span>is<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>Component<span><span>\"<span><span>></<span><span>component<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <!-- 加载中状态 --><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/suspense.html", "title": "Suspense | Vue.js", "doc_id": "2d9a2cbfc02d42f987f37980afd8ce23", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 430, "chunk_index": 22, "_doc_id": "22_8498155406450072164"}}
{"doc_id": "23_2450593356924474126", "text": "><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <!-- 加载中状态 --><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>template<span><span> #<span><span>fallback<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> 正在加载...<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> </<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> </<span><span>Suspense<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> </<span><span>KeepAlive<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/suspense.html", "title": "Suspense | Vue.js", "doc_id": "2d9a2cbfc02d42f987f37980afd8ce23", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 430, "chunk_index": 23, "_doc_id": "23_2450593356924474126"}}
{"doc_id": "24_8335017539134725692", "text": "span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> </<span><span>KeepAlive<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> </<span><span>Transition<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> </<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>RouterView<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>Vue Router 使用动态导入对<a href=\"https://router.vuejs.org/zh/guide/advanced/lazy-loading.html\" target=\"_blank\">懒加载组件<a>进行了内置支持。这些与异步组件不同，目前他们不会触发 <code><Suspense><code>。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/suspense.html", "title": "Suspense | Vue.js", "doc_id": "2d9a2cbfc02d42f987f37980afd8ce23", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 430, "chunk_index": 24, "_doc_id": "24_8335017539134725692"}}
{"doc_id": "25_1458617164548125054", "text": "vanced/lazy-loading.html\" target=\"_blank\">懒加载组件<a>进行了内置支持。这些与异步组件不同，目前他们不会触发 <code><Suspense><code>。但是，它们仍然可以有异步组件作为后代，这些组件可以照常触发 <code><Suspense><code>。<p><h2 id=\"nested-suspense\">嵌套使用 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#nested-suspense\">​<a><h2><p>当我们有多个类似于下方的异步组件 (常见于嵌套或基于布局的路由) 时：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>Suspense<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/suspense.html", "title": "Suspense | Vue.js", "doc_id": "2d9a2cbfc02d42f987f37980afd8ce23", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 430, "chunk_index": 25, "_doc_id": "25_1458617164548125054"}}
{"doc_id": "26_6409602298536486847", "text": "github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>Suspense<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>component<span><span> :<span><span>is<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>DynamicAsyncOuter<span><span>\"<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>component<span><span> :<span><span>is<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>DynamicAsyncInner<span><span>\"<span><span> /><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/suspense.html", "title": "Suspense | Vue.js", "doc_id": "2d9a2cbfc02d42f987f37980afd8ce23", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 430, "chunk_index": 26, "_doc_id": "26_6409602298536486847"}}
{"doc_id": "27_4526948954876209293", "text": "n>is<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>DynamicAsyncInner<span><span>\"<span><span> /><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> </<span><span>component<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>Suspense<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p><code><Suspense><code> 创建了一个边界，它将如预期的那样解析树下的所有异步组件。然而，当我们更改 <code>DynamicAsyncOuter<code> 时，<code><Suspense><code> 会正确地等待它，但当我们更改 <code>DynamicAsyncInner<code> 时，嵌套的 <code>DynamicAsyncInner<code> 会呈现为一个空节点，直到它被解析为止 (而不是之前的节点或回退插槽)。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/suspense.html", "title": "Suspense | Vue.js", "doc_id": "2d9a2cbfc02d42f987f37980afd8ce23", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 430, "chunk_index": 27, "_doc_id": "27_4526948954876209293"}}
{"doc_id": "28_6657100692385178833", "text": "code>DynamicAsyncInner<code> 时，嵌套的 <code>DynamicAsyncInner<code> 会呈现为一个空节点，直到它被解析为止 (而不是之前的节点或回退插槽)。<p><p>为了解决这个问题，我们可以使用嵌套的方法来处理嵌套组件的补丁，就像这样：<p><div class=\"language-template\"> <span class=\"lang\">template<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>Suspense<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>component<span><span> :<span><span>is<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>DynamicAsyncOuter<span><span>\"<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/suspense.html", "title": "Suspense | Vue.js", "doc_id": "2d9a2cbfc02d42f987f37980afd8ce23", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 430, "chunk_index": 28, "_doc_id": "28_6657100692385178833"}}
{"doc_id": "29_2207064322263481129", "text": "pan>is<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>DynamicAsyncOuter<span><span>\"<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>Suspense<span><span> suspensible<span><span>> <span><span><!-- 像这样 --><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>component<span><span> :<span><span>is<span><span>=<span><span>\"<span><span>DynamicAsyncInner<span><span>\"<span><span> /><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> </<span><span>Suspense<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/suspense.html", "title": "Suspense | Vue.js", "doc_id": "2d9a2cbfc02d42f987f37980afd8ce23", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 430, "chunk_index": 29, "_doc_id": "29_2207064322263481129"}}
{"doc_id": "30_2989984377426145078", "text": "pan><span> /><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> </<span><span>Suspense<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> </<span><span>component<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/suspense.html", "title": "Suspense | Vue.js", "doc_id": "2d9a2cbfc02d42f987f37980afd8ce23", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 430, "chunk_index": 30, "_doc_id": "30_2989984377426145078"}}
{"doc_id": "31_1325150874717698194", "text": "span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> </<span><span>component<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>Suspense<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><p>如果你不设置 <code>suspensible<code> 属性，内部的 <code><Suspense><code> 将被父级 <code><Suspense><code> 视为同步组件。这意味着它将会有自己的回退插槽，如果两个 <code>Dynamic<code> 组件同时被修改，则当子 <code><Suspense><code> 加载其自己的依赖关系树时，可能会出现空节点和多个修补周期，这可能不是理想情况。设置后，所有异步依赖项处理都会交给父级 <code><Suspense><code> (包括发出的事件)，而内部 <code><Suspense><code> 仅充当依赖项解析和修补的另一个边界。<p>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/suspense.html", "title": "Suspense | Vue.js", "doc_id": "2d9a2cbfc02d42f987f37980afd8ce23", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 430, "chunk_index": 31, "_doc_id": "31_1325150874717698194"}}
{"doc_id": "32_5513005994398883276", "text": "后，所有异步依赖项处理都会交给父级 <code><Suspense><code> (包括发出的事件)，而内部 <code><Suspense><code> 仅充当依赖项解析和修补的另一个边界。<p>\n<p><strong>参考<strong><p><div><div>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/built-ins/suspense.html", "title": "Suspense | Vue.js", "doc_id": "2d9a2cbfc02d42f987f37980afd8ce23", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 430, "chunk_index": 32, "_doc_id": "32_5513005994398883276"}}
{"doc_id": "0_3584387159555560064", "text": "<div><div><h1 id=\"single-file-components\">单文件组件 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#single-file-components\">​<a><h1><h2 id=\"introduction\">介绍 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#introduction\">​<a><h2><p>Vue 的单文件组件 (即 <code>*.vue<code> 文件，英文 Single-File Component，简称 <strong>SFC<strong>) 是一种特殊的文件格式，使我们能够将一个 Vue 组件的模板、逻辑与样式封装在单个文件中。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/scaling-up/sfc.html", "title": "单文件组件", "doc_id": "21f4c6afcdca4b85bd908f656cc6f8cb", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 256, "chunk_index": 0, "_doc_id": "0_3584387159555560064"}}
{"doc_id": "1_5904563641090635914", "text": "de> 文件，英文 Single-File Component，简称 <strong>SFC<strong>) 是一种特殊的文件格式，使我们能够将一个 Vue 组件的模板、逻辑与样式封装在单个文件中。下面是一个单文件组件的示例：<p><div class=\"options-api\"><div class=\"language-vue\"> <span class=\"lang\">vue<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>script<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> data<span><span>() {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> return<span><span> {<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/scaling-up/sfc.html", "title": "单文件组件", "doc_id": "21f4c6afcdca4b85bd908f656cc6f8cb", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 256, "chunk_index": 1, "_doc_id": "1_5904563641090635914"}}
{"doc_id": "2_676455179148210906", "text": "><span> data<span><span>() {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> return<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> greeting: <span><span>'Hello World!'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>script<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/scaling-up/sfc.html", "title": "单文件组件", "doc_id": "21f4c6afcdca4b85bd908f656cc6f8cb", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 256, "chunk_index": 2, "_doc_id": "2_676455179148210906"}}
{"doc_id": "3_6090515951954311560", "text": ">\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>p<span><span> class<span><span>=<span><span>\"greeting\"<span><span>>{{ greeting }}</<span><span>p<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>style<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>.greeting<span><span> {<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/scaling-up/sfc.html", "title": "单文件组件", "doc_id": "21f4c6afcdca4b85bd908f656cc6f8cb", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 256, "chunk_index": 3, "_doc_id": "3_6090515951954311560"}}
{"doc_id": "4_4212903995423187599", "text": "n><span>style<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>.greeting<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> color<span><span>: <span><span>red<span><span>;<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> font-weight<span><span>: <span><span>bold<span><span>;<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/scaling-up/sfc.html", "title": "单文件组件", "doc_id": "21f4c6afcdca4b85bd908f656cc6f8cb", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 256, "chunk_index": 4, "_doc_id": "4_4212903995423187599"}}
{"doc_id": "5_4813006113887291885", "text": "eight<span><span>: <span><span>bold<span><span>;<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>style<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><div><div class=\"composition-api\"><div class=\"language-vue\"> <span class=\"lang\">vue<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>script<span><span> setup<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>import<span><span> { ref } <span><span>from<span><span> 'vue'<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/scaling-up/sfc.html", "title": "单文件组件", "doc_id": "21f4c6afcdca4b85bd908f656cc6f8cb", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 256, "chunk_index": 5, "_doc_id": "5_4813006113887291885"}}
{"doc_id": "6_60222202543017870", "text": "<span class=\"line\"><span>import<span><span> { ref } <span><span>from<span><span> 'vue'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const<span><span> greeting<span><span> =<span><span> ref<span><span>(<span><span>'Hello World!'<span><span>)<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>script<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/scaling-up/sfc.html", "title": "单文件组件", "doc_id": "21f4c6afcdca4b85bd908f656cc6f8cb", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 256, "chunk_index": 6, "_doc_id": "6_60222202543017870"}}
{"doc_id": "7_6090515951954311560", "text": ">\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> <<span><span>p<span><span> class<span><span>=<span><span>\"greeting\"<span><span>>{{ greeting }}</<span><span>p<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>template<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span><<span><span>style<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>.greeting<span><span> {<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/scaling-up/sfc.html", "title": "单文件组件", "doc_id": "21f4c6afcdca4b85bd908f656cc6f8cb", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 256, "chunk_index": 7, "_doc_id": "7_6090515951954311560"}}
{"doc_id": "8_2153783516035028828", "text": "n><span>style<span><span>><span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>.greeting<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> color<span><span>: <span><span>red<span><span>;<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> font-weight<span><span>: <span><span>bold<span><span>;<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></<span><span>style<span><span>><span><span><code><pre><div><div><p>如你所见，Vue 的单文件组件是网页开发中 HTML、CSS 和 JavaScript 三种语言经典组合的自然延伸。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/scaling-up/sfc.html", "title": "单文件组件", "doc_id": "21f4c6afcdca4b85bd908f656cc6f8cb", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 256, "chunk_index": 8, "_doc_id": "8_2153783516035028828"}}
{"doc_id": "9_1504590802246030107", "text": "span>><span><span><code><pre><div><div><p>如你所见，Vue 的单文件组件是网页开发中 HTML、CSS 和 JavaScript 三种语言经典组合的自然延伸。<code><template><code>、<code><script><code> 和 <code><style><code> 三个块在同一个文件中封装、组合了组件的视图、逻辑和样式。完整的语法定义可以查阅<a href=\"/api/sfc-spec.html\">单文件组件语法说明<a>。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/scaling-up/sfc.html", "title": "单文件组件", "doc_id": "21f4c6afcdca4b85bd908f656cc6f8cb", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 256, "chunk_index": 9, "_doc_id": "9_1504590802246030107"}}
{"doc_id": "10_7264279733046433801", "text": "code><style><code> 三个块在同一个文件中封装、组合了组件的视图、逻辑和样式。完整的语法定义可以查阅<a href=\"/api/sfc-spec.html\">单文件组件语法说明<a>。<p><h2 id=\"why-sfc\">为什么要使用单文件组件 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#why-sfc\">​<a><h2><p>使用单文件组件必须使用构建工具，但作为回报带来了以下优点：<p><p>单文件组件是 Vue 框架提供的一个功能，并且在下列场景中都是官方推荐的项目组织方式：<p><ul><li>单页面应用 (SPA)<li><li>静态站点生成 (SSG)<li><li>任何值得引入构建步骤以获得更好的开发体验 (DX) 的项目<li><ul><p>当然，在一些轻量级场景下使用单文件组件会显得有些杀鸡用牛刀。因此 Vue 同样也可以在无构建步骤的情况下以纯 JavaScript 方式使用。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/scaling-up/sfc.html", "title": "单文件组件", "doc_id": "21f4c6afcdca4b85bd908f656cc6f8cb", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 256, "chunk_index": 10, "_doc_id": "10_7264279733046433801"}}
{"doc_id": "11_4177514796086955104", "text": "获得更好的开发体验 (DX) 的项目<li><ul><p>当然，在一些轻量级场景下使用单文件组件会显得有些杀鸡用牛刀。因此 Vue 同样也可以在无构建步骤的情况下以纯 JavaScript 方式使用。如果你的用例只需要给静态 HTML 添加一些简单的交互，你可以看看 <a href=\"https://github.com/vuejs/petite-vue\" target=\"_blank\">petite-vue<a>，它是一个 6 kB 左右、预优化过的 Vue 子集，更适合渐进式增强的需求。<p><h2 id=\"how-it-works\">单文件组件是如何工作的 <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#how-it-works\">​<a><h2><p>Vue 单文件组件是一个框架指定的文件格式，因此必须交由 <a href=\"https://github.com/vuejs/core/tree/main/packages/compiler-sfc\" target=\"_blank\">@vue/compiler-sfc<a> 编译为标准的 JavaScript 和 CSS，", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/scaling-up/sfc.html", "title": "单文件组件", "doc_id": "21f4c6afcdca4b85bd908f656cc6f8cb", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 256, "chunk_index": 11, "_doc_id": "11_4177514796086955104"}}
{"doc_id": "12_4669932154311836796", "text": "/core/tree/main/packages/compiler-sfc\" target=\"_blank\">@vue/compiler-sfc<a> 编译为标准的 JavaScript 和 CSS，一个编译后的单文件组件是一个标准的 JavaScript(ES) 模块，这也意味着在构建配置正确的前提下，你可以像导入其他 ES 模块一样导入单文件组件：<p><div class=\"language-js\"> <span class=\"lang\">js<span><pre class=\"shiki github-dark vp-code\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>import<span><span> MyComponent <span><span>from<span><span> './MyComponent.vue'<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/scaling-up/sfc.html", "title": "单文件组件", "doc_id": "21f4c6afcdca4b85bd908f656cc6f8cb", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 256, "chunk_index": 12, "_doc_id": "12_4669932154311836796"}}
{"doc_id": "13_7593979449652273742", "text": "n class=\"line\"><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>export<span><span> default<span><span> {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> components: {<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> MyComponent<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> }<span><span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}<span><span><code><pre><div><p>单文件组件中的 <code><style><code> 标签一般会在开发时注入成原生的 <code><style><code> 标签以支持热更新，而生产环境下它们会被抽取、合并成单独的 CSS 文件。<p><p>你可以在 <a href=\"https://play.vuejs.org/\" target=\"_blank\">Vue 单文件组件演练场<a>中实际使用一下单文件组件，同时可以看到它们最终被编译后的样子。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/scaling-up/sfc.html", "title": "单文件组件", "doc_id": "21f4c6afcdca4b85bd908f656cc6f8cb", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 256, "chunk_index": 13, "_doc_id": "13_7593979449652273742"}}
{"doc_id": "14_2668162872365937160", "text": "可以在 <a href=\"https://play.vuejs.org/\" target=\"_blank\">Vue 单文件组件演练场<a>中实际使用一下单文件组件，同时可以看到它们最终被编译后的样子。<p><p>在实际项目中，我们一般会使用集成了单文件组件编译器的构建工具，比如 <a href=\"https://cn.vitejs.dev/\" target=\"_blank\">Vite<a> 或者 <a href=\"https://cli.vuejs.org/zh/\" target=\"_blank\">Vue CLI<a> (基于 <a href=\"https://webpack.js.org/\" target=\"_blank\">webpack<a>)，Vue 官方也提供了脚手架工具来帮助你尽可能快速地上手开发单文件组件。更多细节请查看<a href=\"/guide/scaling-up/tooling.html\">单文件组件工具链<a>章节。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/scaling-up/sfc.html", "title": "单文件组件", "doc_id": "21f4c6afcdca4b85bd908f656cc6f8cb", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 256, "chunk_index": 14, "_doc_id": "14_2668162872365937160"}}
{"doc_id": "15_1891549839648477526", "text": ">)，Vue 官方也提供了脚手架工具来帮助你尽可能快速地上手开发单文件组件。更多细节请查看<a href=\"/guide/scaling-up/tooling.html\">单文件组件工具链<a>章节。<p><h2 id=\"what-about-separation-of-concerns\">如何看待关注点分离？ <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#what-about-separation-of-concerns\">​<a><h2><p>一些有着传统 Web 开发背景的用户可能会因为单文件组件将不同的关注点集合在一处而有所顾虑，觉得 HTML/CSS/JS 应当是分离开的！<p><p>要回答这个问题，我们必须对这一点达成共识：<strong>前端开发的关注点不是完全基于文件类型分离的<strong>。前端工程化的最终目的都是为了能够更好地维护代码。关注点分离不应该是教条式地将其视为文件类型的区别和分离，仅仅这样并不够帮我们在日益复杂的前端应用的背景下提高开发效率。", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/scaling-up/sfc.html", "title": "单文件组件", "doc_id": "21f4c6afcdca4b85bd908f656cc6f8cb", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 256, "chunk_index": 15, "_doc_id": "15_1891549839648477526"}}
{"doc_id": "16_5012689592418377534", "text": "于文件类型分离的<strong>。前端工程化的最终目的都是为了能够更好地维护代码。关注点分离不应该是教条式地将其视为文件类型的区别和分离，仅仅这样并不够帮我们在日益复杂的前端应用的背景下提高开发效率。<p><p>在现代的 UI 开发中，我们发现与其将代码库划分为三个巨大的层，相互交织在一起，不如将它们划分为松散耦合的组件，再按需组合起来。在一个组件中，其模板、逻辑和样式本就是有内在联系的、是耦合的，将它们放在一起，实际上使组件更有内聚性和可维护性。<p><p>即使你不喜欢单文件组件这样的形式而仍然选择拆分单独的 JavaScript 和 CSS 文件，也没关系，你还是可以通过<a href=\"/api/sfc-spec.html#src-imports\">资源导入<a>功能获得热更新和预编译等功能的支持。<p><div><div>", "metadata": {"source": "https://cn.vuejs.org/guide/scaling-up/sfc.html", "title": "单文件组件", "doc_id": "21f4c6afcdca4b85bd908f656cc6f8cb", "content_type": "web_page", "word_count": 256, "chunk_index": 16, "_doc_id": "16_5012689592418377534"}}
